(32, 'Foster Pethard', 'pethard.foster@msn.com', '08397028193', 'Web Development', 'Most builders don’t chase peak specs, they optimize for FPS per dollar. FPSBench tracks GPU price-to-performance ratios across the full market, including latest-gen GPUs like RX 9000 series and NVIDIA RTX 5000.\r\n\r\nhttps://fpsbench.com\r\n\r\nhttps://fpsbench.com/gpu/price-performance\r\n\r\nIf your audience makes buying decisions based on value, this is a highly shareable resource for current PC hardware buyers. Open to a placement, link exchange, or broader content partnership.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nIn case you wish to stop getting further communications from me, kindly fill the form at brnd .li/delist url with your domain address (URL).\r\nWilhelminastraat 128, Binghamton, CA, USA, 94831', NULL, 0, 0, '2026-07-08 10:56:09', '2026-07-08 10:56:09'),
