(5, 'AMD Ryzen 3 2200G Desktop PC', 'The AMD Ryzen 3 2200G Desktop PC features a quad-core Ryzen processor with integrated Radeon Vega 8 graphics, offering reliable performance for daily tasks, multitasking, and casual gaming. It is an affordable all-in-one solution for home, office, and basic entertainment use.', 'amd-ryzen-3-2200g-desktop-pc-1778731191', '<p>The AMD Ryzen 3 2200G Desktop PC is a smart and budget-friendly computing solution built for smooth performance, everyday productivity, and entry-level gaming. Powered by the AMD Ryzen 3 2200G Quad-Core Processor with integrated Radeon Vega 8 Graphics, this desktop delivers reliable speed, responsive multitasking, and impressive visuals without requiring a dedicated graphics card.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Key Specifications- Processor: AMD Ryzen 3 2200G with Radeon Vega 8 Graphics</p><p>Motherboard: ASRock B450M-HDV R4.0</p><p>RAM: Colorful Battle-AX 8GB DDR4 3200MHz</p><p>Storage: Colorful CN600 PRO 256GB M.2 NVMe SSD</p><p>Casing &amp; PSU: MaxGreen H6 M-ATX Case with 200W Standard PSU</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Basic Information</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>AMD Ryzen 3 2200G Quad-Core Processor With Radeon Vega 8 Graphics<br>3 Years Warranty (No Warranty - Fan )</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>ASRock B450M-HDV R4.0 AMD Motherboard<br>3 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Colorful Battle-AX DDR4 8GB 3200MHz Desktop RAM<br>Lifetime Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Colorful CN600 PRO 256GB M.2 NVMe SSD<br>3 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Casing</td><td>MaxGreen H6 M-ATX Case with 200W Standard PSU<br>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Desktop AMD Ryzen', 28600.00, 28700.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/A9eXHWDgu4UOwSc6SdL22osR0WCftvqMzuA9ew6A.webp', 'products/videos/0RITKKDncTLaTyfb7XXbgFh0EioQgeTkLAluwdlY.mp4', 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-14 03:59:51', '2026-05-15 06:00:24', 'Office Work , Study & Onl