(6, 'MaxGreen H6 M-ATX Case with 200W Standard PSU', 'The AMD Ryzen 5 2400G Desktop PC is a powerful and efficient system designed for smooth multitasking and everyday performance. Featuring a quad-core Ryzen 5 processor with integrated Radeon Vega graphics, it delivers excellent speed for office work, study, freelancing, and light gaming without needing a dedicated GPU. With fast RAM and SSD support, this PC ensures quick boot time and responsive performance, making it a perfect budget-friendly desktop solution in Bangladesh.', 'maxgreen-h6-m-atx-case-with-200w-standard-psu-1778734199', '<p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 5 2400G Desktop PC</strong> is a powerful and efficient system designed for smooth performance, multitasking, and everyday productivity. Powered by the AMD Ryzen 5 2400G Quad-Core Processor with Radeon RX Vega 11 Graphics, this desktop delivers impressive visuals, stable speed, and reliable computing without requiring a dedicated graphics card.</p><p>Built with the <strong>ASRock B450M-HDV R4.0 AMD Motherboard</strong>, it ensures strong connectivity, durability, and future upgrade support. The <strong>Colorful Battle-AX DDR4 8GB 3200MHz RAM</strong> provides fast data processing and smooth multitasking performance, while the <strong>Colorful CN600 PRO 256GB M.2 NVMe SSD</strong> offers ultra-fast boot time and quick application loading.</p><p>The system is housed in the MaxGreen H6 M-ATX Case with 200W Standard PSU, ensuring proper airflow, stability, and expansion flexibility for future upgrades.</p><p>Key Features</p><p>AMD Ryzen 5 2400G Quad-Core Processor</p><p>Radeon RX Vega 11 Integrated Graphics</p><p>ASRock B450M-HDV R4.0 Motherboard</p><p>8GB DDR4 3200MHz High-Speed RAM</p><p>256GB M.2 NVMe SSD Storage</p><p>MaxGreen H6 M-ATX Casing with 200W PSU</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Basic Information</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>AMD Ryzen 5 2400G Desktop Processor with Radeon RX Vega 11 Graphics<br>3 Years Warranty (No Warranty -Fan )</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>ASRock B450M-HDV R4.0 AMD Motherboard<br>3 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Colorful Battle-AX DDR4 8GB 3200MHz Desktop RAM<br>Lifetime Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Colorful CN600 PRO 256GB M.2 NVMe SSD<br>3 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Casing</td><td>MaxGreen H6 M-ATX Case with 200W Standard PSU<br>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Desktop MaxGreen', 30600.00, 30700.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/I5b80b8BeR9XBlGynNNqebgNbJ213K47hYrQKTbo.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-14 04:49:59', '2026-05-15 06:00:09', 'AMD Ryzen 5 2400G Desktop PC Price & Specification BD,AMD Ryzen 5 2400G Desktop PC Price in Bangladesh,AMD Ryzen 5 2400G Desktop PC – Full Specs & Price in BD,Buy AMD Ryzen 5 2400G Desktop PC at Best Price in Bangladesh', 'The AMD Ryzen 5 2400G Desktop PC delivers powerful performance with Radeon Vega graphics, ideal for gaming, office work, and multitasking. Check the latest price, full specifications, and best deals in Bangladesh from International Office Solution.', 'MD Ryzen 5 2400G Desktop PC, Ryzen 5 2400G PC, AMD Ryzen Desktop PC, Ryzen 5 2400G Price in Bangladesh, Gaming Desktop PC BD, Budget Desktop PC BD, AMD Vega Graphics PC, Office Desktop PC, Ryzen 5 PC Build, Best Desktop PC BD, Affordable PC Bangladesh', NULL, 7, NULL, NULL),
(7, 'Chuwi HeroBook Pro Intel Celeron N4020 14.1 inch Full HD Laptop with Windows 11', 'The Chuwi HeroBook Pro is a slim and lightweight 14.1-inch laptop designed for students, office work, and everyday use. It features a Full HD anti-glare display, Intel Celeron N4020 processor, 8GB RAM, and 256GB SSD for smooth multitasking and fast performance. With Intel HD Graphics, long-lasting 38Wh battery with fast charging, full-size comfortable keyboard, multiple connectivity ports, and Windows 11 pre-installed, it’s a reliable and budget-friendly productivity laptop.', 'chuwi-herobook-pro-intel-celeron-n4020-141-inch-full-hd-laptop-with-windows-11-1778823351', '<p>Chuwi HeroBook Pro Intel Celeron N4020 14.1\" Full HD Laptop with Windows 11 The Chuwi HeroBook Pro 14.1-inch Laptop is a lightweight, budget-friendly device designed for students, office users, and everyday computing. With a Full HD anti-glare display, efficient Intel processor, and long battery life, this laptop is perfect for productivity, online classes, browsing, and entertainment.</p><p>Stunning 14.1\" Full HD Anti-Glare Display Enjoy a wider and clearer viewing experience with the 14.1-inch Full HD screen. The glare-proof panel keeps the display visible even in bright outdoor light. Night mode and color adjustment help reduce eye strain during long work sessions.</p><p>Efficient Intel Processor Performance Powered by the Intel Celeron N4020 processor, the HeroBook Pro delivers smooth everyday performance with turbo boost up to 2.0GHz. The built-in Intel HD Graphics ensures smooth video playback and supports 4K video decoding.</p><p>Smooth Multitasking with SSD Storage This laptop comes with 8GB RAM and 256GB SSD storage, allowing you to run multiple apps smoothly and enjoy faster boot times, quick file access, and responsive performance.</p><p>Long-Lasting Battery with Fast Charging The 38Wh polymer lithium battery provides hours of work and entertainment on a single charge. Fast-charging technology keeps you powered up and ready to go.</p><p>Comfortable Full-Size Keyboard The borderless C-side keyboard design is compact and stylish. With 17mm keycaps and 3mm key pitch, typing becomes comfortable and efficient for long working hours.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Multiple Connectivity Options&nbsp;</strong></p><p>Stay connected with versatile ports and expansion options:</p><p>High-speed M.2 SSD support</p><p>USB 3.0 port</p><p>Micro-HDMI</p><p>Fast charging DC port</p><p>Headphone jack</p><p>Micro-SD card slot</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Key Features&nbsp;</strong></p><p>14.1\" Full HD Anti-Glare Display</p><p>Intel Celeron N4020 Processor</p><p>8GB RAM &amp; 256GB SSD</p><p>Intel HD Graphics (4K video decoding)</p><p>38Wh Battery with Fast Charging</p><p>Windows 11 Pre-Installed</p><p>Lightweight &amp; Portable Design</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Buy Original Chuwi HeroBook Pro Intel Celeron N4020 14.1\" Full HD Laptop from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>The <strong>original Chuwi HeroBook Pro Intel Celeron N4020 14.1\" Full HD Laptop with Windows 11</strong> is a perfect choice for students, office users, and everyday computing. Designed for smooth daily performance and portability, this laptop delivers excellent value at an affordable price in Bangladesh.</p><p>If you’re looking for a dependable and budget-friendly laptop for everyday use, the original Chuwi HeroBook Pro Intel Celeron N4020 14.1\" Full HD Laptop with Windows 11 is a great choice. International Office Solution brings this model to you at the best price in Bangladesh with genuine products, warranty support, and nationwide delivery.</p><p>Perfect for office work, online classes, browsing, and daily productivity, the Chuwi HeroBook Pro offers a smooth performance, clear Full HD display, and a sleek, modern design. Get the latest deal today from International Office Solution and enjoy a reliable and hassle-free shopping experience.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead