(8, 'MSI PRO MP223 E2 21.45\" 100Hz Full HD Monitor', 'The MSI PRO MP223 E2 21.45\" Business Monitor is designed for productivity, comfort, and everyday efficiency. It features a Full HD 1920×1080 display with a smooth 100Hz refresh rate for clear and fluid visuals. MSI EyesErgo technology with Anti-Flicker and Less Blue Light helps reduce eye strain during long working hours. With HDMI and DisplayPort connectivity, anti-glare panel, and a sleek borderless design, this monitor is perfect for office work, study, meetings, and multitasking.', 'msi-pro-mp223-e2-2145-100hz-full-hd-monitor-1778850524', '<p>The MSI PRO MP223 E2 21.45-inch Full HD Business Monitor is designed to boost productivity, comfort, and efficiency in both office and home workspaces. Featuring a 21.45-inch Full HD (1920 × 1080) display, this professional monitor delivers sharp visuals, vibrant colors, and excellent clarity for everyday computing tasks.</p><p>With a 100Hz refresh rate, the display provides smoother motion and reduced screen flickering, making it perfect for long working hours, multitasking, document editing, coding, and online meetings.</p><p>EyesErgo Technology for Eye Comfort This MSI business monitor comes equipped with MSI EyesErgo technology, including:</p><p>Anti-Flicker technology</p><p>Less Blue Light feature</p><p>These features help reduce eye strain and fatigue, ensuring comfortable viewing during extended work sessions.</p><p>Enhanced Viewing Experience The monitor offers a 3000:1 contrast ratio, producing deeper blacks and brighter whites for improved visual depth. Its anti-glare panel minimizes reflections, allowing you to work comfortably in various lighting environments.</p><p>Ergonomic &amp; Modern Design The MSI PRO MP223 E2 features a tilt-adjustable ergonomic stand, enabling you to set the screen at the most comfortable viewing angle. The sleek borderless design adds a modern look while maximizing screen space for a more immersive workspace.</p><p>Easy Connectivity This monitor includes multiple connectivity options:</p><p>HDMI</p><p>DisplayPort</p><p>These ports ensure easy connection with desktops, laptops, and other devices.</p><p>Perfect for Work &amp; Productivity Whether you\'re working on spreadsheets, attending virtual meetings, browsing, or studying, the MSI PRO MP223 E2 21.45\" 100Hz Monitor delivers reliable performance, eye comfort, and modern style in one affordable package.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>21.45 inch</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>Panel Type</td><td>VA</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>Full HD (1920 x 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Pixel pitch(MM)</td><td>0.2493 (H) x 0.241 (V)</td></tr><tr><td>Display Surface</td><td>Anti-glare</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>Viewing Angle</td><td>178°(H) / 178°(V)</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>250 nits</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>3000:1 (TYP)</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>100Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Color Support</td><td>16.7M</td></tr><tr><td>Color Gamut</td><td>SRGB: 99% (CIE 1976)</td></tr><tr><td>Response Time</td><td>1ms (MPRT) / 4ms (GtG)</td></tr><tr><td>Curvature</td><td>Flat</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Video Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>G-Sync Support</td><td>Adaptive Sync</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connectivity</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Display Port</td><td>1x DisplayPort 1.2a</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>1x HDMI 1.4b (FHD@100Hz)<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Audio Jack</td><td>1x Headphone-out</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Mechanical Design</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Tilt</td><td>-5° ~ 20°<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Vesa Wall Mount</td><td>75 x 75 mm</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>494.7 x 385.5 x182 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>2.4 kg (5.29 lbs) / 4.1 kg (9.04 lbs)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>External Adaptor 12V 2.5A</td></tr><tr><td>Voltage</td><td>100~240V, 50~60Hz<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Monitor', 11100.00, 11200.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/nWozJOxgnf2V4DNNHobA5TPt3XAkptVgUKs9yFpM.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-15 13:08:44', '2026-05-15 17:24:18', 'MSI PRO MP223 E2 21.45\" 100Hz Full HD Business Monitor Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy the MSI PRO MP223 E2 21.45\" 100Hz Full HD Business Monitor with EyesErgo, Anti-Flicker, Less Blue Light, HDMI & DisplayPort. Perfect for office work, study, and productivity. Check the latest price in Bangladesh at International Office Solution.', 'MSI PRO MP223 E2 monitor, MSI 21.45 inch monitor, 100Hz business monitor, Full HD office monitor, MSI EyesErgo display, budget office monitor Bangladesh, HDMI DisplayPort monitor, anti flicker monitor, less blue light monitor', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(9, 'HP P204v 19.5 Inch HD LED Monitor (HDMI, VGA)', 'The HP P204v 19.5\" HD LED Monitor is a reliable and affordable display designed for everyday office work, study, and business use. Featuring a 1600×900 HD resolution, HDMI and VGA connectivity, and VESA mount support, it offers clear visuals, easy setup, and a clean workspace with built-in cable management', 'hp-p204v-195-inch-hd-led-monitor-hdmi-vga-1778851606', '<p><strong>HP P204v 19.5\" HD LED Monitor (HDMI, VGA)&nbsp;</strong></p><p>The HP P204v 19.5-inch HD LED Monitor is designed to deliver reliable performance, clear visuals, and a clean workspace setup for office, business, and everyday computing. With its compact widescreen design and essential connectivity, this monitor is perfect for productivity tasks like documents, spreadsheets, browsing, and business applications.</p><p><strong>Clear &amp; Comfortable Viewing&nbsp;</strong></p><p>Enjoy sharp and vibrant visuals on the 19.5-inch HD display featuring 1600 × 900 resolution and a widescreen aspect ratio. The compact size makes it ideal for desks with limited space while still providing enough screen area for efficient multitasking.</p><p>Flexible &amp; Space-Saving Design The monitor includes an adjustable stand that allows you to tilt the display for comfortable viewing throughout the day. It also supports VESA mounting, so you can easily mount it on a wall or monitor arm for a clutter-free workspace.</p><p><strong>Easy Connectivity&nbsp;</strong></p><p>The HP P204v offers essential connectivity options:</p><p>HDMI port for modern PCs and laptops</p><p>VGA port for legacy devices This makes it easy to connect to multiple systems without adapters or dongles.</p><p><strong>Clean &amp; Organized Workspace&nbsp;</strong></p><p>With an integrated power supply and smart cable management, the monitor helps keep your desk neat and organized. It also supports mounting compatible HP Mini PCs or Thin Clients behind the display for an all-in-one style setup.</p><p><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p>&nbsp;19.5-inch HD LED display (1600 × 900 resolution)</p><p>Widescreen aspect ratio for productivity</p><p>HDMI and VGA connectivity</p><p>Adjustable tilt stand</p><p>VESA mount compatible</p><p>Integrated power supply and cable management</p><p>Ideal for office, business, and everyday use</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>19.5 Inch</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>Panel Type</td><td>TN</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>HD+ ( WxH) 1600x900</td></tr><tr><td>Pixel pitch(MM)</td><td>0.27 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Display Surface</td><td>Anti-glare</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>Viewing Angle</td><td>50° vertical<br>90° horizontal</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>200 cd/m²</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>10000000:1 dynamic<br>600:1 static<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Color Support</td><td>Up to 16.7 million</td></tr><tr><td>Response Time</td><td>5 ms gray to gray</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Video Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color Temperature Selection</td><td>5 to 35°C</td></tr><tr><td>Low Blue Light</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>HDCP</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Audio Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Speaker (Built In)</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connectivity</strong></td></tr><tr><td>VGA</td><td>VGA x 1</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>HDMI 1.4 x 1</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Resolutions Supported: 1024 x 768; 1280 x 1024; 1280 x 800; 1366 x 768; 1440 x 900; 1600 x 900; 640 x 480; 720 x 400; 800 x 600</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Mechanical Design</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Tilt</td><td>Stand</td></tr><tr><td>Vesa Wall Mount</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Security Locker</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>Dimensions Without Stand (W X D X H): 46.26 x 4.87 x 27.87 cm<br>Dimensions With Stand (W X D X H): 46.26 x 19 x 35.36 cm</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>2.81 kg</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>16 W (maximum)<br>15 W (typical)<br>0.3 W (standby)</td></tr><tr><td>Voltage</td><td>100 to 240 VAC</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Energy Efficiency Class: A+</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'HP', 12400.00, 12500.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/kYRavBckFoitqrpITFsDvRUj2O294m5BA44I2Wic.jpg', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-15 13:26:46', '2026-05-15 14:35:49', 'HP P204v 19.5\" HD LED Monitor with HDMI & VGA | VESA Mount Office Display', 'Buy HP P204v 19.5 inch HD LED Monitor with HDMI & VGA ports, VESA mount support, adjustable stand and 1600×900 resolution. Ideal budget office monitor for work, study and business use.', 'HP P204v Monitor, HP 19.5 inch Monitor, HP HD LED Monitor, Office Monitor, Business Monitor, HDMI VGA Monitor, Budget Monitor Bangladesh, HP Monitor Price BD, VESA Mount Monitor, Desktop Monitor, Work From Home Monitor', NULL, 1, NULL, NULL);
