(10, 'HP Series 3 Pro 322pe 21.45\" 100Hz FHD IPS Monitor', 'Buy HP Series 3 Pro 322pe Monitor from International Office Solution\r\n\r\nIn Bangladesh, you can purchase the original HP Series 3 Pro 322pe 21.45\" 100Hz FHD IPS Monitor from International Office Solution. We offer a wide collection of the latest HP monitors for desktop users. Order online or visit our showroom to get the best price in Bangladesh. This monitor comes with a 3-year warranty for complete peace of mind', 'hp-series-3-pro-322pe-2145-100hz-fhd-ips-monitor-1778853343', '<h2><strong>HP Series 3 Pro 322pe 21.45\" 100Hz FHD IPS Monitor</strong></h2><p>The HP Series 3 Pro 322pe 21.45-inch Monitor is a sleek, modern, and reliable display designed to enhance everyday productivity, study, and entertainment. Featuring a 21.45-inch Full HD IPS panel with a 1920 × 1080 resolution, this monitor delivers sharp visuals, vibrant colors, and wide 178° viewing angles for a comfortable viewing experience from almost any position.</p><p>With a smooth 100Hz refresh rate and 5ms GtG response time with overdrive, the monitor ensures fluid motion, reduced blur, and improved clarity during video playback, multitasking, and casual gaming. The 72% NTSC color gamut provides accurate and consistent color reproduction, making it suitable for office tasks, content consumption, and daily computing.</p><p>The monitor features a modern 3-sided micro-edge design that maximizes screen space while maintaining a compact footprint. Its anti-glare coating and Low Blue Light mode help reduce eye strain, making it ideal for long working or study sessions.</p><p>Connectivity is simple and flexible with HDMI 1.4 and VGA ports, allowing easy connection to both modern and legacy devices. The energy-efficient design consumes only 14.5W (typical), helping reduce power usage and operating costs.</p><p>Built with sustainability in mind, the monitor uses 85% post-consumer recycled plastic, halogen-reduced components, and 100% recyclable packaging, making it an eco-friendly choice for your workspace.</p><p>With dimensions of 49.28 × 20.99 × 37.44 cm (with stand) and a lightweight build of only 2.6 kg, the HP Series 3 Pro 322pe fits perfectly into any home or office setup.</p><h2><strong>Buy HP Series 3 Pro 322pe Monitor from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p><strong>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original HP Series 3 Pro 322pe 21.45\" 100Hz FHD IPS Monitor from International Office</strong> <strong>Solution</strong>. We offer a wide collection of the latest HP monitors for desktop users. Order online or visit our showroom to get the best price in Bangladesh. This monitor comes with a 3-year warranty for complete peace of mind.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>21.45 Inch</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>LCD</td></tr><tr><td>Panel Type</td><td>IPS</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>FHD (1920 x 1080)<br>Resolutions supported:<br>Resolutions supported<br>640 x 480 @ 60 Hz; 640 x 480 @ 75 Hz; 800 x 600 @ 60 Hz; 800 x 600 @ 75 Hz; 1024 x 768 @ 60 Hz; 1280 x 720 @ 60 Hz; 1280 x 1024 @ 60 Hz; 1440 x 900 @ 60 Hz; 1600 x 900 @ 60 Hz; 1680 x 1050 @ 60 Hz; 1920 x 1080 @ 60 Hz; 1920 x 1080 @ 100 Hz; 1280 x 1024 @ 75 Hz; 1024 x 768 @ 75 Hz; 1280 x 800 @ 60 Hz; 720 x 400 @ 70 Hz (VGA only); 720 x 400 @ 70 Hz (HDMI only)</td></tr><tr><td>Pixel pitch(MM)</td><td>0.25 x 0.24 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Display Surface</td><td>Anti-glare</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>Viewing Angle</td><td>178° Horizontal viewing angle<br>178° Vertical viewing angle</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>250 nits (typical)<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1000:1 (static)</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>100Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Color Gamut</td><td>72% NTSC</td></tr><tr><td>Response Time</td><td>5ms GtG (with overdrive)</td></tr><tr><td>Curvature</td><td>Flat</td></tr><tr><td>Others Features</td><td>Hardness: 3H</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Video Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Flicker Free</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Low Blue Light</td><td>Yes, HP Eye Ease (TÜV Low Blue Light Hardware Solution certified)</td></tr><tr><td>HDCP</td><td>Yes, DisplayPort and HDMI</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Audio Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Speaker (Built In)</td><td>N/A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connectivity</strong></td></tr><tr><td>VGA</td><td>1 x VGA</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>1 x HDMI 1.4</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Mechanical Design</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Tilt</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Security Locker</td><td>Security lock-ready</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>49.28 x 4.30 x 28.65 cm (without stand)<br>49.28 x 20.99 x 37.44 cm (With Stand)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>2.6 kg (wih stand); 2.2 kg (without stand)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>Internal</td></tr><tr><td>Voltage</td><td>90 – 264 VAC 50/60 Hz</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>3 years</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Monitor', 135400.00, 13500.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/5DkDUStwauF0A402hXmKVtVpcttTej36vqpZK3Jf.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-15 13:55:43', '2026-05-15 13:58:45', 'HP Series 3 Pro 322pe 21.45\" 100Hz FHD IPS Monitor', 'Buy HP Series 3 Pro 322pe 21.45\" 100Hz FHD IPS Monitor with vibrant IPS display, 1920×1080 resolution, 100Hz refresh rate, and HDMI & VGA connectivity. Perfect for office work, study, and entertainment. Available in Bangladesh from International Office Solution with 3-year warranty.', 'HP Series 3 Pro 322pe Monitor, HP 322pe Monitor, HP 21.45 inch Monitor, HP 100Hz Monitor, HP FHD IPS Monitor, HP Office Monitor, HP Monitor Price Bangladesh, Budget FHD Monitor, HDMI VGA Monitor, Business Monitor BD', NULL, 1, NULL, NULL),
(11, 'HP Series 524SF 23.8\" 100Hz FHD IPS Monitor', 'The HP Series 524SF 23.8\" FHD IPS Monitor is a stylish and versatile display built for both productivity and entertainment. With a 23.8-inch Full HD (1920 × 1080) IPS panel and a smooth 100Hz refresh rate, this monitor delivers vibrant colors, deep contrast, and fluid, stutter-free visuals. Its flat IPS screen with edge-lit backlighting ensures consistent picture quality from every angle.', 'hp-series-524sf-238-100hz-fhd-ips-monitor-1778854032', '<h2>HP Series 524SF 23.8\" FHD IPS Monitor</h2><p>The HP Series 524SF 23.8\" FHD IPS Monitor is a stylish and versatile display built for both productivity and entertainment. With a 23.8-inch Full HD (1920 × 1080) IPS panel and a smooth 100Hz refresh rate, this monitor delivers vibrant colors, deep contrast, and fluid, stutter-free visuals. Its flat IPS screen with edge-lit backlighting ensures consistent picture quality from every angle.</p><h3>Enjoy More in Rich, Colorful Detail</h3><p>Experience your favorite content with impressive clarity and color accuracy. With 300 nits brightness, 99% sRGB color coverage, and a 1500:1 contrast ratio, the HP Series 524SF produces vivid images and lifelike detail. The 100Hz refresh rate provides smooth scrolling and a more enjoyable viewing experience for work, study, and entertainment.</p><h3>Designed for Comfort and Eye Care</h3><p>Stay focused and comfortable throughout the day with features designed for long hours of use. The HP Display Center Ergonomic Setup Guide and tilt-adjustable stand help you customize your viewing position. HP Eye Ease with Eyesafe certification reduces blue light exposure while maintaining accurate color, helping minimize eye strain.</p><h3>Thin, Lightweight &amp; Borderless Design</h3><p>The ultra-thin 3-sided borderless design makes this monitor perfect for modern workspaces and dual-screen setups. Its slim and lightweight build blends seamlessly into any environment, while built-in cable management helps keep your desk neat and organized. Connectivity is simple with HDMI 1.4 and VGA ports for both modern and legacy devices.</p><h3>Built for a Better Tomorrow</h3><p>HP designed the Series 5 monitors with sustainability in mind. The monitor uses 85% recycled materials and 5% ocean-bound plastics to reduce environmental impact. It also comes in 100% sustainable packaging and is ENERGY STAR and EPEAT Silver registered, making it an eco-friendly choice for your workspace.</p><h3>Compact and Powerful Performance</h3><p>Enjoy crisp visuals, smooth performance, and comfortable viewing in one elegant display. With 99% sRGB color, 300 nits brightness, 1500:1 contrast ratio, and a 100Hz refresh rate, this monitor offers an excellent balance of performance and style for everyday use.</p><h2>Buy HP Series 524SF 23.8\" 100Hz FHD IPS Monitor from International Office Solution</h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original HP Series 524SF 23.8\" 100Hz FHD IPS Monitor from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>. We offer a wide collection of the latest HP monitors for your desktop PC. Order online or visit our showroom to get the best price in Bangladesh. This monitor comes with a <strong>3-year warranty</strong> for peace of mind.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>23.8-inch</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>Panel Type</td><td>IPS<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>FHD (1920 x 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Pixel pitch(MM)</td><td>0.28 x 0.28 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Display Surface</td><td>Anti-glare</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>Viewing Angle</td><td>178 Degree</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>300 nits</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1500:1</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>100Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Color Support</td><td>Up to 16.7 million colors supported</td></tr><tr><td>Color Gamut</td><td>99% sRGB Color Gamut</td></tr><tr><td>Response Time</td><td>5ms GtG (with overdrive)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Video Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Flicker Free</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Low Blue Light</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connectivity</strong></td></tr><tr><td>VGA</td><td>1x VGA</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>1 x HDMI 1.4</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Mechanical Design</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Tilt</td><td>-5 to +25°</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>Dimensions without stand (W x D x H): 53.58 x 3.4 x 31.56 cm<br>Dimensions with stand (W x D x H): 53.58 x 17.72 x 39.68 cm</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>2.5 kg</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>Internal</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>20 W (maximum), 16 W (typical), 0.5 W (standby)</td></tr><tr><td>Voltage</td><td>Input voltage 100 to 240 VAC, 50/60 Hz</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>03 years warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Monitor', 18500.00, 18500.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/aNmzQGS8yD59Mu0WgctWyWffNR3l6Yb07tJDLiyk.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-15 14:07:12', '2026-05-15 14:34:05', 'HP Series 524SF 23.8\" 100Hz FHD IPS Monitor Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy HP Series 524SF 23.8\" FHD IPS Monitor with 100Hz refresh rate, 1920×1080 resolution, 99% sRGB color, and 300 nits brightness. Enjoy smooth visuals, eye comfort features, and a modern borderless design. Perfect for office, study, and entertainment. Available in Bangladesh from International Office Solution with 3-year warranty.', 'HP Series 524SF Monitor, HP 23.8 inch Monitor, HP FHD IPS Monitor, HP 100Hz Monitor, HP Office Monitor, HP Monitor Price Bangladesh, 23.8 inch IPS Display, HDMI VGA Monitor, Business Monitor BD, Budget FHD Monitor, HP Series 5 Monitor', NULL, 1, NULL, NULL),
(12, 'HP Vision Pro S24e 23.8\" 100Hz FHD IPS Monitor', 'uy HP Vision Pro S24e 23.8\" 100Hz FHD IPS Monitor from International Office Solution\r\n\r\nIn Bangladesh, you can purchase the original HP Vision Pro S24e 23.8\" 100Hz FHD IPS Monitor from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of HP monitors for office, study, and professional use. Order online or visit our showroom to get the best price in Bangladesh. This monitor comes with a 3-year warranty for peace of mind.', 'hp-vision-pro-s24e-238-100hz-fhd-ips-monitor-1778854200', '<h2>HP Vision Pro S24e 23.8\" 100Hz FHD IPS Monitor</h2><p>The HP Vision Pro S24e 23.8-inch Monitor is a stylish and high-performance display designed for smooth everyday computing, work, and entertainment. Featuring a Full HD (1920 × 1080) IPS panel, it delivers sharp visuals, vibrant colors, and a comfortable 16:9 widescreen viewing experience.</p><p>With its IPS technology, the monitor provides consistent color accuracy and wide 178° viewing angles, making it ideal for office work, collaborative tasks, and multimedia viewing from different positions. The 100Hz refresh rate ensures smoother scrolling, fluid video playback, and an improved experience compared to standard 60Hz displays.</p><p>Offering up to 300 nits brightness and a 1000:1 contrast ratio, the display maintains clear and balanced visuals even in bright environments. It supports 16.7 million colors and a 99% sRGB color gamut, delivering rich and accurate color reproduction suitable for productivity, content creation, and entertainment.</p><p>The anti-glare coating helps reduce reflections and eye strain during long usage sessions. Eye comfort features such as Low Blue Light mode and flicker-free technology further enhance viewing comfort for extended working hours.</p><p>Designed with a modern borderless aesthetic, the HP Vision Pro S24e is perfect for multi-monitor setups and professional workspaces. Connectivity is simple with HDMI and DisplayPort options, allowing easy connection to PCs, laptops, and other devices. The ergonomic tilt adjustment also helps users achieve a more comfortable viewing angle.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>23.8 Inch</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>FHD LED</td></tr><tr><td>Panel Type</td><td>IPS</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>FHD (1920 x 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Display Surface</td><td>Anti-glare</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Viewing Angle</td><td>178 degrees ultra-wide viewing angles</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>300 nits<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>100 Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Color Gamut</td><td>99% sRGB</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Video Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Flicker Free</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Low Blue Light</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Audio Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Speaker (Built In)</td><td>N/A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connectivity</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Display Port</td><td>1x DisplayPort</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>1x HDMI</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Mechanical Design</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Tilt</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Vesa Wall Mount</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Security Locker</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td><br><br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>3 years</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Monitor', 16170.00, 16170.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/opXPgLcauvxb0xF8BSvmkVpRNcxKQdabS5E71TFb.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-15 14:10:00', '2026-05-15 14:33:56', 'HP Vision Pro S24e 23.8\" 100Hz FHD IPS Monitor P', 'Buy HP Vision Pro S24e 23.8\" FHD IPS Monitor with 100Hz refresh rate, 99% sRGB, 300 nits brightness, and wide viewing angles. Enjoy smooth performance, eye comfort features, and modern borderless design. Ideal for office, study, and entertainment. Available in Bangladesh from International Office Solution with 3-year warranty.', 'HP Vision Pro S24e Monitor, HP 23.8 inch Monitor, HP FHD IPS Monitor, HP 100Hz Monitor, HP Office Monitor, HP Monitor Price Bangladesh, 23.8 inch IPS Display, HDMI DisplayPort Monitor, Business Monitor BD, Budget FHD Monitor, HP Vision Pro Monitor', NULL, 1, NULL, NULL),
(13, 'HP M22f 22\" FHD IPS Monitor', 'The HP M22f 22\" FHD IPS Monitor offers crisp Full HD visuals with 99% sRGB color accuracy and wide 178° viewing angles for vibrant, lifelike images. It features AMD FreeSync for smooth, tear-free performance and HP EyeSafe technology to reduce blue light for comfortable long use. With a slim eco-friendly design made from recycled materials, HDMI/VGA connectivity, and HP Display Center support, it’s a reliable choice for office, study, and everyday use, backed by a 3-year warranty.', 'hp-m22f-22-fhd-ips-monitor-1778854391', '<h2>HP Vision Pro S24e 23.8\" 100Hz FHD IPS Monitor</h2><p>The HP Vision Pro S24e 23.8-inch Monitor is a stylish and high-performance display designed for smooth everyday computing, work, and entertainment. Featuring a Full HD (1920 × 1080) IPS panel, it delivers sharp visuals, vibrant colors, and a comfortable 16:9 widescreen viewing experience.</p><p>With its IPS technology, the monitor provides consistent color accuracy and wide 178° viewing angles, making it ideal for office work, collaborative tasks, and multimedia viewing from different positions. The 100Hz refresh rate ensures smoother scrolling, fluid video playback, and an improved experience compared to standard 60Hz displays.</p><p>Offering up to 300 nits brightness and a 1000:1 contrast ratio, the display maintains clear and balanced visuals even in bright environments. It supports 16.7 million colors and a 99% sRGB color gamut, delivering rich and accurate color reproduction suitable for productivity, content creation, and entertainment.</p><p>The anti-glare coating helps reduce reflections and eye strain during long usage sessions. Eye comfort features such as Low Blue Light mode and flicker-free technology further enhance viewing comfort for extended working hours.</p><p>Designed with a modern borderless aesthetic, the HP Vision Pro S24e is perfect for multi-monitor setups and professional workspaces. Connectivity is simple with HDMI and Displ