(18, 'HP Series 5 524sa 23.8\" 100Hz FHD IPS Professional Monitor', 'The HP Series 5 524sa 23.8-inch 100Hz IPS FHD Monitor delivers crisp Full HD visuals with 99% sRGB accuracy and smooth 100Hz performance for work, entertainment, and light gaming. Its IPS panel ensures wide viewing angles, while HP Eye Ease with Eyesafe reduces blue light for comfortable long-hour use. With built-in speakers, HDMI/VGA connectivity, and an adjustable anti-glare design, it’s a reliable all-round monitor for home and office productivity.', 'hp-series-5-524sa-238-100hz-fhd-ips-professional-monitor-1778858843', '<p>The HP Series 5 524sa 23.8-inch 100Hz IPS FHD Monitor is designed for productivity, entertainment, and eye comfort. Featuring a Full HD (1920×1080) IPS display with 93 PPI, it delivers sharp visuals, vibrant colors, and wide 178° viewing angles for an immersive experience. With a 100Hz refresh rate and 5ms response time, it ensures smooth motion for video playback, casual gaming, and daily tasks.</p><p>It offers 300 nits brightness, 99% sRGB color accuracy, and a 10,000,000:1 dynamic contrast ratio for rich and lifelike visuals. HP Eye Ease with Eyesafe certification reduces blue light for comfortable long-hour use without affecting color quality.</p><p>This monitor includes built-in 2×2W speakers, HDMI and VGA connectivity, and a headphone jack for flexible audio options. The anti-glare screen, tilt adjustment (-5° to +25°), and energy-efficient design make it ideal for home and office use. Backed by a 3-year warranty, it is a reliable and stylish display solution available from International Office Solution.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>23.8-inch</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>Panel Type</td><td>IPS<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>FHD (1920 x 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Pixels Per Inch (PPI)</td><td>93</td></tr><tr><td>Pixel pitch(MM)</td><td>0.28 x 0.28 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Display Surface</td><td>Anti-glare</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>Viewing Angle</td><td>178 Degree</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>300 nits</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1500:1</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>100Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Color Support</td><td>Up to 16.7 million colors supported</td></tr><tr><td>Color Gamut</td><td>99% sRGB Color Gamut<br>8 bit (6 bit + FRC)<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Response Time</td><td>5ms GtG</td></tr><tr><td>Curvature</td><td>Flat</td></tr><tr><td>Others Features</td><td>Eyesafe Certified<br>Borderless Design<br>Widescreen<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Video Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Flicker Free</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Low Blue Light</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Audio Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Speaker (Built In)</td><td>yes</td></tr><tr><td>Speaker Details</td><td>2 x 2 W<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connectivity</strong></td></tr><tr><td>VGA</td><td>1x VGA</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>1 x HDMI</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Mechanical Design</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Tilt</td><td>-5 to +25°</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>white</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>535.68 x 177.03 x 396.74mm<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>2.58 kg<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>Internal</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>30W (Maximum), 21W (Typical), 0.5W (Standby)<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>5 Degree C to 35 Degree C<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>03 years warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 19300.00, 19400.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/e90hxA4ytds1YI8DOqPqBJr86RqkwgcSb3lZMe9t.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-15 15:27:23', '2026-05-15 15:27:23', 'HP Series 5 524sa 23.8\" 100Hz IPS FHD Monitor | Eye Comfort Display', 'Buy HP Series 5 524sa 23.8-inch IPS FHD Monitor with 100Hz refresh rate, 99% sRGB, Eye Ease technology, built-in speakers, and HDMI/VGA connectivity. Ideal for work and entertainment.', 'HP 524sa monitor, HP Series 5 23.8 inch, 100Hz IPS monitor, FHD office monitor, HP Eye Ease display, 99% sRGB monitor, HDMI VGA monitor, eye comfort monitor, home office monitor, HP 23.8 inch display', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
