(19, 'HP Series 5 524sw 23.8\" 100Hz FHD IPS Monitor White', 'In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original HP Series 5 524sw 23.8\" 100Hz FHD IPS Monitor White from International Office Solution. Order online or visit your nearest showroom to get the best price and genuine product assurance.', 'hp-series-5-524sw-238-100hz-fhd-ips-monitor-white-1778859597', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>HP Series 5 524sw 23.8-inch Monitor</strong> is a premium blend of modern design, smooth performance, and everyday comfort, making it an excellent choice for professionals, students, and home users. Designed with a sleek white finish and ultra-thin 3-sided micro-edge bezels, this monitor brings a clean, contemporary aesthetic that fits perfectly into any workspace or entertainment setup.</p><p>Equipped with a <strong>23.8-inch Full HD IPS display (1920×1080 resolution)</strong>, it delivers sharp, detailed visuals with consistent color accuracy and clarity from almost any angle. The <strong>178° wide viewing angle</strong> ensures a comfortable viewing experience whether you are working alone or sharing your screen with others. With <strong>99% sRGB color coverage</strong>, it produces rich, vibrant, and true-to-life colors, making it suitable for content creation, office productivity, multimedia consumption, and casual creative work.</p><p>The <strong>100Hz refresh rate</strong> combined with a <strong>5ms (GtG) response time</strong> ensures smoother motion and reduced screen tearing compared to standard 60Hz monitors. This makes scrolling, video playback, and casual gaming noticeably more fluid and responsive. Whether you\'re working on documents, watching videos, or enjoying light gaming sessions, the display remains consistently smooth and visually stable.</p><p>For long hours of usage, HP Eye Ease with <strong>Eyesafe® certification</strong> reduces harmful blue light emissions while maintaining accurate color performance. This helps reduce eye strain and fatigue, making it ideal for extended work or study sessions. The monitor also features an <strong>anti-glare coating</strong>, ensuring comfortable viewing even in bright environments.</p><p>Connectivity is simple and versatile with <strong>HDMI 1.4 and VGA ports</strong>, allowing easy connection to laptops, desktops, and other devices. The built-in <strong>HP Display Center software</strong> provides intuitive on-screen control for quick adjustments to brightness, color, and display settings.</p><p>Built with sustainability in mind, the monitor incorporates <strong>85% post-consumer recycled plastics, 5% ocean-bound plastics, and 100% recyclable packaging</strong>, making it an environmentally responsible choice without compromising quality or performance.</p><p>With a brightness level of <strong>300 nits</strong> and a <strong>1500:1 contrast ratio</strong>, the display delivers clear visuals with good depth and detail in both bright and dim environments. Its <strong>energy-efficient design</strong> further helps reduce power consumption while maintaining consistent performance.</p><h3><strong>Key Highlights:</strong></h3><ul><li>23.8-inch Full HD IPS Display (1920×1080)</li><li>100Hz refresh rate for smooth visuals</li><li>99% sRGB color accuracy</li><li>178° wide viewing angles</li><li>5ms GtG response time</li><li>HP Eye Ease with Eyesafe® certification</li><li>HDMI 1.4 and VGA connectivity</li><li>Anti-glare screen with tilt adjustment</li><li>Ultra-slim 3-sided micro-edge design</li><li>Eco-friendly build with recycled materials</li><li>300 nits brightness, 1500:1 contrast ratio</li></ul><h3><strong>Availability</strong></h3><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original <strong>HP Series 5 524sw 23.8\" 100Hz FHD IPS Monitor White</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>. Order online or visit your nearest showroom to get the best price and genuine product assurance.</p><p>The monitor comes with a <strong>3-year official warranty</strong>, ensuring peace of mind and reliable after-sales support.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>23.8-inch</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>Panel Type</td><td>IPS<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>FHD (1920 x 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Pixel pitch(MM)</td><td>0.28 x 0.28 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Display Surface</td><td>Anti-glare</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>Viewing Angle</td><td>178 Degree</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>300 nits</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1500:1</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>100Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Color Support</td><td>Up to 16.7 million colors supported</td></tr><tr><td>Color Gamut</td><td>99% sRGB Color Gamut</td></tr><tr><td>Response Time</td><td>5ms GtG (with overdrive)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Video Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Flicker Free</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Low Blue Light</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connectivity</strong></td></tr><tr><td>VGA</td><td>1x VGA</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>1 x HDMI 1.4</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Mechanical Design</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Tilt</td><td>-5 to +25°</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>Dimensions without stand (W x D x H): 53.58 x 3.4 x 31.56 cm<br>Dimensions with stand (W x D x H): 53.58 x 17.72 x 39.68 cm</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>2.49 kg</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>Internal</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>20 W (maximum), 16 W (typical), 0.5 W (standby)</td></tr><tr><td>Voltage</td><td>Input voltage 100 to 240 VAC, 50/60 Hz</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>03 years warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 19500.00, 19600.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/BloTPTou8tqt5k5hF4mSP4ucy6fV9sGOnbSKhjO3.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-15 15:39:57', '2026-05-15 15:42:35', 'HP Series 5 524sw 23.8\" 100Hz FHD IPS White Monitor | 99% sRGB Eye Comfort Display', 'Buy HP Series 5 524sw 23.8-inch 100Hz FHD IPS White Monitor with 99% sRGB, Eye Ease technology, 300 nits brightness, HDMI & VGA ports, and eco-friendly design. Perfect for work and entertainment.', 'HP 524sw monitor, HP Series 5 white monitor, 23.8 inch IPS monitor, 100Hz FHD monitor, HP white bezel monitor, 99% sRGB display, eye comfort monitor, HDMI VGA monitor, HP Eye Ease white monitor, home office monitor Bangladesh, HP 24 inch monitor white', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(20, 'HP E22 G5 21.5\" FHD IPS Monitor', 'In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original HP E22 G5 21.5\" FHD IPS Monitor from International Office Solution. Order online or visit your nearest showroom to get the best price and genuine product assurance.\r\nThis monitor comes with a 3-year official warranty, ensuring reliable long-term support and peace of mind.', 'hp-e22-g5-215-fhd-ips-monitor-1778860254', '<p>HP E22 G5 21.5\" FHD IPS Monitor</p><p>The HP E22 G5 21.5-inch FHD IPS Monitor is a professional-grade display designed to deliver clarity, comfort, and productivity for both office and home users. With its compact yet efficient design, it is an excellent choice for users who need reliable performance in everyday computing tasks such as document work, browsing, meetings, and multimedia use.</p><p>Featuring a 21.5-inch Full HD IPS panel (1920 × 1080 resolution), this monitor produces sharp, detailed, and consistent visuals with accurate color reproduction. The IPS technology ensures wide 178° viewing angles, allowing clear image quality from almost any position—ideal for collaborative work environments and multi-monitor setups.</p><p>With a 75Hz refresh rate and 5ms response time (GtG), the HP E22 G5 offers smoother motion compared to standard 60Hz displays. This results in improved scrolling, better video playback, and reduced motion blur, enhancing overall visual comfort during long working hours or casual entertainment.</p><p>For ergonomics, the monitor is designed with a fully adjustable stand that supports height adjustment, tilt, swivel, and pivot rotation, allowing users to customize their viewing position for maximum comfort and productivity. The inclusion of HP Eye Ease technology helps reduce harmful blue light exposure without compromising color accuracy, making it suitable for extended screen usage with reduced eye strain.</p><p>The display also comes with an anti-glare coating, which minimizes reflections and ensures clear visibility even in brightly lit environments. Built-in on-screen controls provide easy access to brightness, contrast, and display settings for a more personalized experience.</p><p>Connectivity is highly versatile, featuring HDMI, DisplayPort, USB-A, USB-B, and HDCP support, enabling seamless connection with desktops, laptops, and peripheral devices. This makes the monitor a strong hub for productivity-focused setups, especially in professional environments.</p><p>Environmentally conscious users will appreciate its eco-friendly design, which includes low-halogen materials and recyclable components, contributing to a more sustainable and responsible product lifecycle.</p><p>Compact yet sturdy, the monitor features a sleek black finish with dimensions designed to fit modern workspaces efficiently. It offers a balanced combination of performance, durability, and ergonomic flexibility.</p><p>Key Features: 21.5-inch Full HD IPS Display (1920 × 1080)</p><p>75Hz refresh rate for smoother visuals</p><p>5ms response time for reduced motion blur</p><p>Wide 178° viewing angles</p><p>Fully ergonomic stand (height, tilt, swivel, pivot)</p><p>HP Eye Ease with reduced blue light emission</p><p>Anti-glare coating for comfortable viewing</p><p>HDMI, DisplayPort, USB-A, USB-B connectivity</p><p>Eco-friendly low-halogen and recyclable design</p><p>Professional and space-saving compact build</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>21.5\"</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>IPS</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>FHD (1920 x 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Viewing Angle</td><td>178°</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>250 nits</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>75Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Color Gamut</td><td>99% sRGB</td></tr><tr><td>Response Time</td><td>5ms</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Video Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Flicker Free</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Low Blue Light</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>HDCP</td><td>Yes, DisplayPort and HDMI</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connectivity</strong></td></tr><tr><td>VGA</td><td>1x VGA;</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>1x HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>USB Port(s)</td><td>4x USB-A, USB-B</td></tr><tr><td>Audio Jack</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Mechanical Design</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Tilt</td><td>-5 to +23°</td></tr><tr><td>Swivel</td><td>±45°</td></tr><tr><td>Pivot</td><td>±90°</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>19.24 x 1.81 x 11.57 in (without hinge); 19.24 x 2.96 x 11.57 in (with hinge)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>10.8 lb</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>Input voltage 100 to 240 VAC</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>50 W (maximum), 20 W (typical), 0.5 W (standby</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>3 yea</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Monitor', 23300.00, 23400.00, NULL, 9, 'products/thumbnails/aE9M61VLlXwmDUyaUsMteEjF83xx772v9CT0oMce.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-15 15:50:54', '2026-05-15 16:17:44', 'HP E22 G5 21.5\" FHD IPS Monitor Price in Bangladesh | 75Hz Business Monitor', 'Buy HP E22 G5 21.5\" FHD IPS Monitor in Bangladesh. Enjoy Full HD IPS display, 75Hz refresh rate, ergonomic stand, Eye Ease technology & USB hub. Best price from International Office Solution with 3-year warranty.', 'HP E22 G5 monitor price in Bangladesh, HP 21.5 inch FHD IPS monitor, HP business monitor 75Hz, HP E22 G5 specs, ergonomic office monitor Bangladesh, HP Eye Ease monitor, HP IPS display monitor, International Office Solution HP monitor', NULL, 1, NULL, NULL),
(21, 'HP OMEN 24 23.8\" 165Hz FHD IPS Gaming Monitor', 'The HP OMEN 24 23.8\" Gaming Monitor delivers smooth 165Hz performance with a 1ms response time for fast, competitive gameplay. Its FHD IPS display ensures sharp visuals and vibrant colors, while FreeSync/Adaptive Sync removes screen tearing. With HDMI/DisplayPort support and Low Blue Light technology, it offers a clear, comfortable, and responsive gaming experience.', 'hp-omen-24-238-165hz-fhd-ips-gaming-monitor-1778860769', '<p><strong>HP OMEN 24 23.8\" 165Hz FHD IPS Gaming Monitor</strong></p><p>The <strong>HP OMEN 24 23.8-inch Gaming Monitor</strong> is built for smooth, competitive, and immersive gaming performance. Featuring a <strong>Full HD IPS display (1920×1080 resolution)</strong>, it delivers sharp visuals, vibrant colors, and wide 178° viewing angles for a consistent and immersive gaming experience from any position.</p><p>With an ultra-fast <strong>165Hz refresh rate</strong> and <strong>1ms GTG response time</strong>, the OMEN 24 ensures ultra-smooth motion, minimal input lag, and reduced motion blur—giving gamers a clear advantage in fast-paced FPS, racing, and action games. Every frame appears fluid and responsive, helping you react instantly in competitive gameplay.</p><p>The monitor supports <strong>AMD FreeSync and Adaptive Sync technology</strong>, which synchronizes the display refresh rate with your GPU to eliminate screen tearing and stuttering. This results in a smoother, more stable gaming experience whether you are playing high-speed esports titles or cinematic AAA games.</p><p>Designed for versatility, it includes <strong>DisplayPort, HDMI, and audio output</strong>, allowing easy connection to gaming PCs, consoles, and external audio devices. This makes switching between gaming setups quick and convenient.</p><p>For long gaming sessions, the <strong>Low Blue Light mode</strong> helps reduce eye strain while maintaining display clarity, allowing you to play comfortably for longer periods. The IPS panel also ensures accurate color reproduction, making games look more realistic and visually rich.</p><h3><strong>Key Features:</strong></h3><ul><li>23.8-inch Full HD IPS Display (1920×1080)</li><li>165Hz refresh rate for ultra-smooth gameplay</li><li>1ms GTG response time for fast reaction</li><li>AMD FreeSync &amp; Adaptive Sync support</li><li>Wide 178° viewing angles</li><li>HDMI, DisplayPort &amp; audio connectivity</li><li>Low Blue Light technology for eye comfort</li><li>Sleek gaming-focused OMEN design</li><li>n Bangladesh, you can purchase the original <strong>HP OMEN 24 23.8\" 165Hz FHD IPS Gaming Monitor</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>. Order online or visit your nearest showroom for the best price and genuine product guarantee.</li><li>This monitor comes with a <strong>3-year official warranty</strong>, ensuring reliable performance and peace of mind.</li></ul>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>23.8 Inch</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>Panel Type</td><td>IPS<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>FHD (1920 x 1080)<br><br>Resolutions supported: 640 x 480, 720 x 400, 800 x 600, 1024 x 768, 1280 x 720, 1280 x 800, 1280 x 1024, 1440 x 900, 1600 x 900, 1680 x 1050, 1920 x 1080</td></tr><tr><td>Pixels Per Inch (PPI)</td><td>93 ppi</td></tr><tr><td>Pixel pitch(MM)</td><td>0.28 x 0.28 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Display Surface</td><td>Anti-glare</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>Viewing Angle</td><td>178 Degree</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>300 nits</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1000:1 static; 10000000:1 dynamic<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>165Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Response Time</td><td>1ms GtG (with overdrive)</td></tr><tr><td>HDR</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Curvature</td><td>Flat</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Video Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Flicker Free</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Low Blue Light</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>G-Sync Support</td><td>Adaptive Sync</td></tr><tr><td>Free Sync Support</td><td>AMD Freesync Premium</td></tr><tr><td>HDCP</td><td>Yes, DisplayPort™ and HDMI</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Audio Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Speaker (Built In)</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connectivity</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Display Port</td><td>1 x DisplayPort 1.4</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>2 x HDMI 2.0</td></tr><tr><td>Audio Jack</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Mechanical Design</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Tilt</td><td>-5 to +23°</td></tr><tr><td>Pivot</td><td>±90°</td></tr><tr><td>Height Adjustment</td><td>100 mm</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>53.94 x 5.2 x 32.15 cm</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>6.35 kg</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>Internal</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>Maximum: 35 W<br>Typical: 25.0 W<br>Standby: 0.5 W</td></tr><tr><td>Voltage</td><td>100 to 240 VAC, 50 / 60 Hz</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>03 years warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Monitor', 24000.00, 25000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/LUapI6stfV4FnkkNdyRQLQccX6GkjhgNrshLoqc2.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-15 15:59:29', '2026-05-15 16:31:02', 'HP OMEN 24 23.8\" 165Hz Gaming Monitor Price in Bangladesh | 1ms IPS Display', 'Buy HP OMEN 24 23.8\" 165Hz FHD IPS Gaming Monitor in Bangladesh. Enjoy 1ms response time, AMD FreeSync, Full HD clarity & smooth gameplay. Best price from International Office Solution with 3 years warranty.', 'HP OMEN 24 gaming monitor price in Bangladesh, HP 165Hz monitor, HP OMEN 23.8 inch IPS monitor, 1ms gaming monitor Bangladesh, FHD gaming monitor HP OMEN, AMD FreeSync monitor, HP OMEN monitor specs, International Office Solution gaming monitor', NULL, 1, NULL, NULL),
(22, 'HP Series 5 Pro 524pf 23.8\" FHD 100Hz IPS Monitor', '*The HP Series 5 Pro 524pf 23.8\" FHD IPS Monitor delivers sharp visuals and smooth 100Hz performance with 100% sRGB color accuracy and wide viewing angles. Its IPS panel, Eye Ease low blue light, anti-glare, and flicker-free tech ensure comfortable long-hour use. With ergonomic adjustability (height, tilt, swivel, pivot) and versatile HDMI, DisplayPort, and USB hub connectivity, it’s a reliable choice for productive professional setups.', 'hp-series-5-pro-524pf-238-fhd-100hz-ips-monitor-1778862335', '<h2><strong>HP Series 5 Pro 524pf 23.8\" FHD 100Hz IPS Monitor</strong></h2><p>The <strong>HP Series 5 Pro 524pf 23.8-inch FHD 100Hz IPS Monitor</strong> is designed for professionals who need sharp visuals, smooth performance, and ergonomic comfort in one reliable display. With a <strong>23.8-inch Full HD (1920 × 1080) resolution</strong> and <strong>93 PPI pixel density</strong>, it delivers crisp, detailed images ideal for office work, content creation, and everyday use.</p><p>Built with an advanced <strong>IPS panel</strong>, the monitor ensures consistent color accuracy and wide <strong>178° viewing angles</strong>, making visuals clear from almost any position. With <strong>100% sRGB color gamut</strong>, it produces rich and true-to-life colors, suitable for design tasks and multimedia viewing.</p><p>The <strong>100Hz refresh rate</strong> provides noticeably smoother motion compared to standard displays, reducing lag and improving responsiveness during scrolling, video playback, and light gaming. A <strong>5ms GTG response time with overdrive</strong> helps minimize motion blur for a more fluid visual experience.</p><p>For enhanced viewing comfort, the monitor includes <strong>HP Eye Ease with TÜV Low Blue Light certification</strong>, along with <strong>flicker-free technology</strong> and an <strong>anti-glare panel</strong> to reduce eye strain during long working hours. The <strong>350 nits brightness</strong> and high contrast ratios ensure clear visibility in different lighting environments.</p><p>Connectivity is highly versatile with <strong>HDMI 1.4, DisplayPort 1.2 (HDCP), and a USB hub featuring 4 USB-A ports and a USB-B upstream port</strong>, allowing seamless connection with multiple devices and accessories.</p><p>Ergonomics is a strong highlight of this model, offering <strong>height adjustment up to 150mm, tilt (-5° to +23°), swivel (±45°), and pivot rotation (±90°)</strong> for maximum comfort and productivity. The <strong>3-sided micro-edge design</strong> gives it a modern, borderless look, while <strong>VESA mount support (100 × 100mm)</strong> allows flexible installation.</p><p>Environmentally conscious users will appreciate its <strong>sustainable design</strong>, featuring recycled plastics, ocean-bound plastics, and low-halogen materials. It also includes <strong>security lock support</strong> for added protection in office environments.</p><p>With built-in software support such as <strong>HP Display Center and HP Client Management Script Library</strong>, users can easily customize display settings for an optimized experience.</p><h3><strong>Buy HP Series 5 Pro 524pf in Bangladesh</strong></h3><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original <strong>HP Series 5 Pro 524pf 23.8\" FHD 100Hz IPS Monitor</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>. Order online or visit your nearest showroom to get the best price and genuine product assurance.</p><p>This monitor comes with a <strong>3-year official warranty</strong>, ensuring long-term reliability and peace of mind.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>23.8 Inch</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>LCD</td></tr><tr><td>Panel Type</td><td>IPS</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>FHD (1920 x 1080)<br>Resolutions supported: 640 x 480 @ 60 Hz; 640 x 480 