td>Security lock-ready</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>(W x D x H) 53.94 x 4.72 x 31.43 cm (without stand)<br>(W x D x H) 53.94 x 18.95 x 50.32 cm (with stand)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>4.9 kg (with stand); 3.4 kg (without stand)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>Internal</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>58 W (maximum), 22 W (typical), 0.5 W (standby)</td></tr><tr><td>Voltage</td><td>100 - 240 VAC 50/60 Hz</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>3 years</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Monitor', 25799.00, 25899.00, NULL, 6, 'products/thumbnails/stIU4OMGGJ58gdK45ocC7oujQzYAPhVzg5RhON7b.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-15 16:25:35', '2026-05-15 16:29:24', 'HP Series 5 Pro 524pf 23.8\" 100Hz IPS Monitor Price in Bangladesh | Pro Display', 'Meta Description:\r\nBuy HP Series 5 Pro 524pf 23.8\" FHD 100Hz IPS Monitor in Bangladesh. Enjoy 100% sRGB IPS display, 100Hz smooth refresh, ergonomic stand, USB hub & Eye Ease. Best price from International Office Solution with 3-year warranty.', 'HP Series 5 Pro 524pf price in Bangladesh, HP 23.8 inch 100Hz IPS monitor, HP professional monitor Bangladesh, HP Pro 524pf specs, ergonomic office monitor HP, HP USB hub monitor, 100% sRGB IPS monitor, International Office Solution HP monitor', NULL, 1, NULL, NULL),
(23, 'HP Series 5 527sh 27\" 100Hz FHD IPS Monitor', 'Overall, the HP Series 5 527sh 27-inch Monitor combines a large immersive screen, smooth performance, accurate color reproduction, and essential eye-care features—making it a reliable and versatile choice for both work and entertainment setups.', 'hp-series-5-527sh-27-100hz-fhd-ips-monitor-1778863649', '<p>The HP Series 5 527sh 27\" 100Hz FHD IPS Monitor is designed to deliver a perfect balance of productivity, entertainment, and visual comfort on a spacious 27-inch Full HD display. With a 1920 × 1080 IPS panel, it produces sharp, detailed visuals and consistent color accuracy across wide 178° viewing angles, making it ideal for both solo use and collaborative viewing.</p><p>With a 100Hz refresh rate and 5ms GTG response time with overdrive, the monitor ensures smooth and responsive performance, reducing motion blur and screen stutter during fast-paced videos, casual gaming, or everyday scrolling. Its 99% sRGB color gamut support and ability to display 16.7 million colors deliver rich, vibrant, and accurate visuals, making it suitable for light creative tasks, office work, and multimedia consumption.</p><p>The display features 300 nits brightness and a 1500:1 contrast ratio, ensuring clear visibility with good depth and detail even in bright or mixed lighting environments. An anti-glare coating further improves comfort by reducing reflections, allowing extended use without distraction.</p><p>For eye comfort, the monitor includes Low Blue Light mode and Flicker-Free technology, helping reduce eye strain during long working or viewing sessions. This makes it a strong choice for professionals, students, and home users who spend extended hours in front of the screen.</p><p>Connectivity is flexible with dual HDMI 1.4 ports and a VGA port, allowing easy connection to laptops, desktops, and other devices. The monitor also features a simple ergonomic stand with tilt and height adjustment, enabling users to find a comfortable viewing position and reduce neck or eye fatigue.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>27-inch</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>Panel Type</td><td>IPS<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>FHD (1920 x 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Pixel pitch(MM)</td><td>0.28 x 0.28 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Display Surface</td><td>Anti-glare</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>Viewing Angle</td><td>178 Degree</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>300 nits</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1500:1</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>100Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Color Gamut</td><td>99% sRGB Color Gamut</td></tr><tr><td>Response Time</td><td>5ms GtG (with overdrive)</td></tr><tr><td>Curvature</td><td>Flat</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Video Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Flicker Free</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Low Blue Light</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Audio Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Speaker (Built In)</td><td>N/A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connectivity</strong></td></tr><tr><td>VGA</td><td>1x VGA</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>2 x HDMI 1.4</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Mechanical Design</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Tilt</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Height Adjustment</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>23.93 x 1.35 x 14.02 in</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>9.15 lb</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>Internal</td></tr><tr><td>Voltage</td><td>Input voltage 100 to 240 VAC, 50/60 Hz</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>03 years warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Monitor', 26500.00, 26600.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/5Ww80VFxtamVsKxPq6xOf6K45WnTicYtF8zG8Pc5.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-15 16:47:29', '2026-05-15 16:47:29', 'HP Series 5 527sh 27\" 100Hz FHD IPS Monitor Price in Bangladesh | 27 Inch IPS Display', 'Buy HP Series 5 527sh 27\" FHD 100Hz IPS Monitor in Bangladesh. Enjoy 27-inch Full HD display, 100Hz smooth refresh, 99% sRGB color, anti-glare, eye care features & ergonomic design. Best price from International Office Solution with 3-year warranty.', 'HP Series 5 527sh price in Bangladesh, HP 27 inch 100Hz monitor, HP FHD IPS monitor 27 inch, HP Series 5 527sh specs, 100Hz office monitor Bangladesh, HP 27 inch IPS display monitor, ergonomic HP monitor, International Office Solution HP monitor', NULL, 1, NULL, NULL),
(24, 'HP Series 5 527sa 27\" 100Hz FHD IPS Monitor', 'The HP Series 5 527sa 27\" 100Hz FHD IPS Monitor offers a large Full HD IPS display with smooth 100Hz performance and accurate colors for work and entertainment. It features wide viewing angles, HDMI/VGA connectivity, and tilt adjustment for comfort. Built with eco-friendly materials, it’s a reliable and sustainable 27-inch monitor.', 'hp-series-5-527sa-27-100hz-fhd-ips-monitor-1778864175', '<h2><strong>HP Series 5 527sa 27\" 100Hz FHD IPS Monitor</strong></h2><p>The <strong>HP Series 5 527sa 27-inch 100Hz FHD IPS Monitor</strong> delivers a large, immersive display experience with smooth performance and accurate colors, making it ideal for work, study, and entertainment. With a <strong>27-inch Full HD (1920 × 1080) resolution</strong>, it provides ample screen space for multitasking, improved productivity, and comfortable content viewing.</p><p>Its advanced <strong>IPS panel technology</strong> ensures consistent color accuracy and wide <strong>178° viewing angles</strong>, allowing clear and vibrant visuals from almost any position. Whether used for office tasks, media consumption, or light creative work, the display maintains reliable image quality and color consistency.</p><p>With a <strong>100Hz refresh rate</strong> and <strong>5ms response time</strong>, the monitor delivers smoother motion and reduced blur, making scrolling, video playback, and casual gaming more fluid and enjoyable. The <strong>1500:1 contrast ratio</strong> and <strong>300 nits brightness</strong> ensure bright, well-balanced visuals with good detail in both light and dark scenes. A fine <strong>0.31 mm pixel pitch</strong> keeps text sharp and easy to read for long working sessions.</p><p>The monitor supports a wide range of display modes and resolutions, ensuring compatibility with various devices and systems. Connectivity options include <strong>dual HDMI 1.4 ports, one VGA port, and audio input/output</strong>, allowing easy connection to PCs, laptops, consoles, and external audio devices. It also supports <strong>HDCP via HDMI</strong> for secure playback of protected content.</p><p>Designed for user comfort, the HP Series 5 527sa includes <strong>tilt adjustment and intuitive on-screen controls</strong> for quick customization of brightness, color settings, and input sources. This makes it easy to tailor the display to different usage needs.</p><p>Sustainability is also a key focus, with construction using <strong>85% post-consumer recycled plastics, 5% ocean-bound materials, and recyclable packaging</strong>. It is also <strong>EPEAT Silver certified</strong>, reflecting energy-efficient and environmentally responsible design.</p><h3><strong>Buy HP Series 5 527sa in Bangladesh</strong></h3><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original <strong>HP Series 5 527sa 27\" 100Hz FHD IPS Monitor</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>. Order online or visit your nearest showroom to get the best price and authentic product assurance.</p><p>This monitor comes with a <strong>3-year official warranty</strong>, ensuring reliable long-term support and peace of mind.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>27-inch</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>Panel Type</td><td>IPS<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>FHD (1920 x 1080)<br>Resolutions supported:<br>640 x 480; 720 x 400; 800 x 600; 1024 x 768; 1280 x 720; 1280 x 800; 1280 x 1024; 1440 x 900; 1600 x 900; 1680 x 1050; 1920 x 1080</td></tr><tr><td>Pixel pitch(MM)</td><td>0.31 x 0.31 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Display Surface</td><td>Anti-glare</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>300 nits</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1500:1</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>100Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Response Time</td><td>5ms GtG (with overdrive)</td></tr><tr><td>Curvature</td><td>Flat</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Video Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Low Blue Light</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Audio Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Speaker (Built In)</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Speaker Details</td><td>2W Speaker</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connectivity</strong></td></tr><tr><td>VGA</td><td>1x VGA</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>2 x HDMI 1.4</td></tr><tr><td>Audio Jack</td><td>1 x 3.5 mm Audio Jack (Audio Out)<br>1 x 3.5 mm Audio Jack (Audio In)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Mechanical Design</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Tilt</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>23.93 x 1.35 x 14.01 in</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>7.23 lb</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Voltage</td><td>Input voltage 100 to 240 VAC, 50/60 Hz</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>03 years warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Monitor', 26600.00, 26700.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/wK7Uu7sR3QxrZAHjru2zSNsYzoIoHGeQl15oraWC.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-15 16:56:15', '2026-05-15 16:56:15', 'HP Series 5 527sa 27\" 100Hz FHD IPS Monitor Price in Bangladesh | 27 Inch IPS Display', 'Buy HP Series 5 527sa 27\" FHD 100Hz IPS Monitor in Bangladesh. Enjoy large 27-inch display, smooth 100Hz refresh, accurate IPS colors, HDMI/VGA connectivity & eco-friendly design. Best price from International Office Solution with 3-year warranty.', 'HP Series 5 527sa price in Bangladesh, HP 27 inch 100Hz IPS monitor, HP FHD IPS monitor 27 inch, HP 27 inch office monitor, HP Series 5 527sa specs, 100Hz monitor Bangladesh, ergonomic IPS display HP, International Office Solution HP monitor', NULL, 1, NULL, NULL),
(25, 'HP Series 527SF 27\" 100Hz FHD IPS Monitor', 'The HP Series 527SF 27\" 100Hz FHD IPS Monitor features a large 27-inch Full HD IPS display with smooth 100Hz performance, wide viewing angles, and 99% sRGB color accuracy. Its anti-glare panel, 300 nits brightness, and eye-care technologies ensure comfortable long-hour use. With HDMI/VGA connectivity and tilt adjustment, it’s a reliable choice for work, study, and entertainment.', 'hp-series-527sf-27-100hz-fhd-ips-monitor-1778864607', '<h2><strong>HP Series 527SF 27\" 100Hz FHD IPS Monitor</strong></h2><p>The <strong>HP Series 527SF 27-inch 100Hz FHD IPS Monitor</strong> delivers a perfect balance of clarity, smooth performance, and viewing comfort for both work and entertainment. With a <strong>27-inch Full HD (1920 × 1080) IPS display</strong> and a fine <strong>0.28 mm pixel pitch</strong>, it produces sharp, detailed visuals with consistent color accuracy across wide <strong>178° viewing angles</strong>.</p><p>Its <strong>anti-glare screen</strong> reduces reflections, ensuring comfortable viewing in different lighting conditions. With a <strong>300 nits brightness level</strong> and a <strong>1500:1 contrast ratio</strong>, it delivers bright, vivid images with excellent depth and detail.</p><p>Designed for smooth performance, the monitor features a <strong>100Hz refresh rate</strong> and <strong>5ms GTG response time with overdrive</strong>, reducing motion blur and providing fluid visuals for gaming, streaming, and everyday use.</p><p>Color performance is enhanced with <strong>99% sRGB coverage</strong> and support for <strong>16.7 million colors</strong>, making it suitable for creative work, media consumption, and general productivity.</p><p>For eye comfort, it includes <strong>Low Blue Light mode and Flicker-Free technology</strong>, helping reduce eye strain during long hours of use. Connectivity is flexible with <strong>two HDMI 1.4 ports and one VGA port</strong>, supporting multiple devices easily.</p><p>The ergonomic design allows <strong>tilt adjustment from -5° to +25°</strong>, helping users achieve a comfortable viewing position for extended use.</p><h3><strong>Buy HP Series 527SF 27\" 100Hz FHD IPS Monitor in Bangladesh</strong></h3><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original <strong>HP Series 527SF 27\" 100Hz FHD IPS Monitor</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>. Order online or visit your nearest showroom for the best price and genuine product assurance.</p><p>This monitor comes with a <strong>3-year official warranty</strong>, ensuring reliable long-term support and peace of mind.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>27-inch</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>Panel Type</td><td>IPS<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>FHD (1920 x 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Pixel pitch(MM)</td><td>0.28 x 0.28 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Display Surface</td><td>Anti-glare</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>Viewing Angle</td><td>178 Degree</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>300 nits</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1500:1</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>100Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Color Support</td><td>Up to 16.7 million colors supported</td></tr><tr><td>Color Gamut</td><td>99% sRGB Color Gamut</td></tr><tr><td>Response Time</td><td>5ms GtG (with overdrive)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Video Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Flicker Free</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Low Blue Light</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connectivity</strong></td></tr><tr><td>VGA</td><td>1x VGA</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>2 x HDMI 1.4</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Mechanical Design</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Tilt</td><td>-5 to +25°</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>Internal</td></tr><tr><td>Voltage</td><td>Input voltage 100 to 240 VAC, 50/60 Hz</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>03 years warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Monitor', 27300.00, 27400.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/iTjfnbjJ8fR5sCYXPf2tobE0zwusj2eHpTJvMqwk.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-15 17:03:27', '2026-05-15 17:03:27', 'HP Series 527SF 27\" 100Hz FHD IPS Monitor Price in Bangladesh | 27 Inch IPS Display', 'Buy HP Series 527SF 27\" FHD 100Hz IPS Monitor in Bangladesh. Enjoy 27-inch Full HD display, 100Hz smooth refresh rate, 99% sRGB color, anti-glare screen & eye comfort features. Best price from International Office Solution with 3-year warranty.', 'HP Series 527SF price in Bangladesh, HP 27 inch 100Hz IPS monitor, HP FHD IPS monitor 27 inch, HP 527SF specs, 100Hz monitor Bangladesh, HP office monitor 27 inch, ergonomic IPS display HP, International Office Solution HP monitor', NULL, 1, NULL, NULL),
(26, 'HP E24t G5 23.8\" FHD Touch Monitor', 'The HP E24t G5 23.8\" FHD Touch Monitor features a crisp Full HD IPS display with 10-point responsive touch control for smooth interaction and productivity. It offers 99% sRGB color accuracy, wide viewing angles, and 75Hz refresh rate for clear and fluid visuals. With HP Eye Ease, flicker-free technology, and an ergonomic fully adjustable stand, it ensures comfortable long-hour use. HDMI, DisplayPort, and USB ports provide versatile connectivity, making it ideal for office, business, and interactive work setups.', 'hp-e24t-g5-238-fhd-touch-monitor-1778864989', '<h2><strong>HP E24t G5 23.8\" FHD Touch Monitor</strong></h2><p>The <strong>HP E24t G5 23.8-inch FHD Touch Monitor</strong> delivers interactive performance, sharp visuals, and ergonomic comfort, making it ideal for office, business, and home productivity use. Featuring a <strong>Full HD (1920×1080) IPS display</strong>, it ensures crisp image quality, vibrant colors, and wide <strong>178° viewing angles</strong> for consistent clarity from any position.</p><p>With <strong>10-point in-cell multi-touch technology</strong>, the display offers smooth and responsive touch interaction, enhancing productivity and intuitive control for tasks like navigation, presentations, and collaboration. The IPS panel supports <strong>99% sRGB color accuracy</strong>, ensuring rich and natural color reproduction.</p><p>It features a <strong>75Hz refresh rate</strong> and <strong>5ms response time (GtG with Overdrive)</strong> for smooth visuals with reduced blur, while <strong>300 nits brightness</strong> and a <strong>1000:1 contrast ratio</strong> provide balanced, clear output in different lighting conditions.</p><p>For eye comfort, the monitor includes <strong>HP Eye Ease low blue light technology and flicker-free display</strong>, helping reduce eye strain during long working hours. Its <strong>anti-glare screen</strong> further improves visibility in bright environments.</p><p>Connectivity is highly flexible with <strong>HDMI 1.4, DisplayPort 1.2, and four USB-A 3.2 ports (including one charging port)</strong>, allowing easy integration with multiple devices and accessories.</p><p>Designed for comfort and flexibility, it offers a <strong>fully ergonomic stand with tilt, swivel, pivot, and height adjustment</strong>, plus <strong>VESA mount support (100×100mm)</strong> for versatile setup options.</p><h3><strong>Buy HP E24t G5 23.8\" FHD Touch Monitor in Bangladesh</strong></h3><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original <strong>HP E24t G5 23.8\" FHD Touch Monitor</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>. Order online or visit your nearest showroom for the best price and genuine product assurance.</p><p>This monitor comes with a <strong>3-year official warranty</strong>, ensuring reliable long-term support and peace of mind.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>23.8 Inch</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>Panel Type</td><td>IPS<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>FHD (1920 x 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Pixels Per Inch (PPI)</td><td>93 ppi</td></tr><tr><td>Pixel pitch(MM)</td><td>0.27 x 0.27 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Display Surface</td><td>Anti-glare</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>Viewing Angle</td><td>178 Degree</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>300 nits</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1000:1 static; 8000000:1 dynamic<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>75Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Response Time</td><td>5ms GtG (with overdrive)</td></tr><tr><td>Others Features</td><td>Resolutions supported: 640 x 480, 720 x 400, 800 x 600, 1024 x 768, 1280 x 720, 1280 x 800, 1280 x 1024, 1440 x 900, 1600 x 900, 1680 x 1050, 1920 x 1080</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Video Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Flicker Free</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Low Blue Light</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Audio Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Speaker (Built In)</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connectivity</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Display Port</td><td>1 x DisplayPort 1.2</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>1 x HDMI 1.4</td></tr><tr><td>USB Port(s)</td><td>4x SuperSpeed USB Type-A 5Gbps signaling rate (1 charging)<br>1x USB-B<br><br><br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Mechanical Design</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Tilt</td><td>-5 to +23°</td></tr><tr><td>Swivel</td><td>±45°</td></tr><tr><td>Pivot</td><td>±90°</td></tr><tr><td>Height Adjustment</td><td>150 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Vesa Wall Mount</td><td>100 mm x 100 mm</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black &amp; Silver</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>53.94 x 4.7 x 32.26 cm (without hinge)<br>53.94 x 7.5 x 32.26 cm (with hinge)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>12.72 lb / 5.77 kg (with Stand)<br>9.08 lb / 4.12 kg (without Stand)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>Internal</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>Maximum: 53.0 W<br>Typical: 25.0 W<br>Standby: 0.5 W</td></tr><tr><td>Voltage</td><td>100 to 240 VAC, 50 / 60 Hz</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>03 years warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 41700.00, 41800.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/MF2vKc5NyNuoNuKCq61TVdiXWaRq3WddPl2LwagI.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-15 17:09:49', '2026-05-15 17:09:49', 'HP E24t G5 23.8\" FHD Touch Monitor Price in Bangladesh | 10-Point Touch IPS Display', 'Buy HP E24t G5 23.8\" FHD IPS Touch Monitor in Bangladesh. Enjoy 10-point touch screen, Full HD clarity, 99% sRGB color, ergonomic stand & Eye Ease comfort. Best price from International Office Solution with 3-year