(27, 'HP E27K G5 27\" 4K UHD IPS Type-C Monitor', 'The HP E27K G5 27\" 4K UHD IPS Type-C Monitor delivers ultra-sharp 4K resolution with rich 99% sRGB colors and wide viewing angles for professional clarity. It features USB-C with 65W Power Delivery, HDMI, DisplayPort, and RJ-45 Ethernet, making it a powerful all-in-one productivity hub. With HP Eye Ease, anti-glare screen, and ergonomic adjustments, it ensures comfortable long-hour use, ideal for modern office and creative workflows.', 'hp-e27k-g5-27-4k-uhd-ips-type-c-monitor-1778865427', '<h2><strong>HP E27K G5 27\" 4K UHD IPS Type-C Monitor</strong></h2><p>The <strong>HP E27K G5 27-inch 4K UHD IPS Type-C Monitor</strong> delivers ultra-sharp visuals, advanced connectivity, and professional-grade ergonomics, making it ideal for productivity, creative work, and modern office setups. With a <strong>27-inch 4K UHD resolution (3840 × 2160)</strong> and <strong>163 PPI pixel density</strong>, it produces incredibly detailed and crisp images with exceptional clarity.</p><p>Its <strong>IPS panel</strong> ensures consistent color accuracy and wide <strong>178° viewing angles</strong>, while <strong>99% sRGB color coverage</strong> delivers rich, natural, and precise color reproduction suitable for design, editing, and professional tasks. The display also includes <strong>350 nits brightness</strong> and strong contrast performance for clear visibility in different lighting environments.</p><p>For comfort, the monitor features <strong>HP Eye Ease with TÜV Low Blue Light certification</strong>, along with <strong>anti-glare coating and flicker-free technology</strong>, reducing eye strain during long working hours.</p><p>Connectivity is a key strength, offering <strong>USB-C with up to 65W Power Delivery</strong>, <strong>DisplayPort 1.4, HDMI 2.0, RJ-45 Ethernet (Gigabit LAN)</strong>, and multiple <strong>USB-A and USB-C ports</strong> for seamless docking, data transfer, and device charging—making it a true productivity hub.</p><p>The ergonomic stand supports <strong>height adjustment (150mm), tilt (-5° to +20°), swivel (±45°), and pivot (±90°)</strong>, while the <strong>3-sided micro-edge design</strong> offers a modern and clean workspace look. It also supports <strong>VESA mounting (100×100mm)</strong> for flexible setup options.</p><p>Additional features include <strong>built-in 2×3W speakers</strong>, HDCP support across inputs, and energy-efficient operation with optimized power consumption for professional environments.</p><h3><strong>Buy HP E27K G5 27\" 4K UHD IPS Type-C Monitor in Bangladesh</strong></h3><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original <strong>HP E27K G5 27\" 4K UHD IPS Type-C Monitor</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>. Order online or visit your nearest showroom for the best price and genuine product assurance.</p><p>This monitor comes with a <strong>3-year official warranty</strong>, ensuring reliable long-term support and peace of mind.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>27 Inch</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>Panel Type</td><td>IPS<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>4K UHD (3840 x 2160)<br>Resolutions supported: 640 x 480; 720 x 400; 800 x 600; 1024 x 768; 1280 x 720; 1280 x 1024; 1440 x 900; 1600 x 900; 1600 x 1200; 1680 x 1050; 1920 x 1080; 1920 x 1200; 2560 x 1440; 3840 x 2160; 720 x 480</td></tr><tr><td>Pixels Per Inch (PPI)</td><td>163 ppi</td></tr><tr><td>Pixel pitch(MM)</td><td>0.15 x 0.15 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Display Surface</td><td>Anti-glare</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>Viewing Angle</td><td>178° Horizontal viewing angle<br>178° Vertical viewing angle</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>350 nits</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1000:1 static; 8000000:1 dynamic<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Color Gamut</td><td>99% sRGB</td></tr><tr><td>Response Time</td><td>5ms GtG (with overdrive)</td></tr><tr><td>Curvature</td><td>Flat</td></tr><tr><td>Others Features</td><td>Hardness: 3H</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Video Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Flicker Free</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Low Blue Light</td><td>Yes, HP Eye Ease (TÜV Low Blue Light Hardware Solution certified)</td></tr><tr><td>HDCP</td><td>Yes, DisplayPort, HDMI and USB Type-C</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Audio Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Speaker (Built In)</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Speaker Details</td><td>2 x 3 W</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connectivity</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Display Port</td><td>1 x DisplayPort 1.4</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>1 x HDMI 2.0</td></tr><tr><td>USB Port(s)</td><td>3x SuperSpeed USB Type-A 5Gbps signaling rate (1 charging)</td></tr><tr><td>USB Type-C</td><td>1x SuperSpeed USB Type-C 5Gbps signaling rate (up to 65W USB Power Delivery, Alt Mode DisplayPort 1.4)</td></tr><tr><td>Audio Jack</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>1x RJ-45 (10/100/1000 Mbps)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Mechanical Design</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Tilt</td><td>-5 to +20°</td></tr><tr><td>Swivel</td><td>±45°</td></tr><tr><td>Pivot</td><td>±90°</td></tr><tr><td>Height Adjustment</td><td>150 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Vesa Wall Mount</td><td>100 mm x 100 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Security Locker</td><td>Security lock-ready</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>(W x D x H) 61.34 x 22.73 x 54.7 cm</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>10 kg (with stand)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>Internal</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>190 W (maximum), 29 W (typical), 0.5 W (standby)</td></tr><tr><td>Voltage</td><td>100 - 240 VAC 50/60 Hz</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>3 years</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Monitor', 66000.00, 66100.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/5vW2EVnRgTKXjypaP0Hav0yYsCbdQOlgqj1Eupew.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-15 17:17:07', '2026-05-15 17:17:07', 'HP E27K G5 27\" 4K UHD IPS Type-C Monitor Price in Bangladesh | USB-C 65W Docking Display', 'Buy HP E27K G5 27\" 4K UHD IPS Type-C Monitor in Bangladesh. Enjoy 4K clarity, USB-C 65W Power Delivery, RJ-45 LAN, 99% sRGB color & ergonomic design. Best price from International Office Solution with 3-year warranty.', 'HP E27K G5 price in Bangladesh, HP 27 inch 4K USB-C monitor, HP 4K IPS monitor Bangladesh, HP E27K G5 specs, USB-C 65W monitor HP, HP docking monitor 27 inch, 4K professional monitor HP, International Office Solution HP monitor', NULL, 1, NULL, NULL),
(28, 'HP V22v G5 21.5 Inch FHD Monitor', 'The HP V22v G5 21.5\" FHD Monitor features a crisp Full HD VA display with strong contrast and wide viewing angles for everyday use. With a 75Hz refresh rate and AMD FreeSync, it delivers smoother, tear-free visuals. Its anti-glare screen, HDMI/VGA connectivity, and tilt/VESA support make it a reliable and affordable choice for home and office use.', 'hp-v22v-g5-215-inch-fhd-monitor-1778865762', '<h2><strong>HP V22v G5 21.5\" FHD Monitor</strong></h2><p>The <strong>HP V22v G5 21.5-inch FHD Monitor</strong> delivers clear, sharp, and vibrant visuals for everyday computing needs, making it a reliable choice for home, office, and study use. With a <strong>Full HD (1920×1080) VA panel</strong>, it provides deep contrast, rich details, and wide viewing angles for a comfortable viewing experience.</p><p>Its <strong>75Hz refresh rate</strong> ensures smoother visuals compared to standard displays, while <strong>AMD FreeSync support</strong> reduces screen tearing and stuttering for more stable performance during video playback and casual use. The <strong>anti-glare screen coating</strong> helps minimize reflections and eye strain, even in bright environments.</p><p>Designed with a sleek narrow-bezel finish, the monitor offers a modern look that fits easily into any workspace. It includes <strong>HDMI, VGA, and headphone jack connectivity</strong>, ensuring compatibility with a wide range of devices.</p><p>For comfort, it supports <strong>tilt adjustment and VESA mount compatibility</strong>, allowing flexible setup options and better ergonomic positioning.</p><h3><strong>Buy HP V22v G5 21.5\" FHD Monitor in Bangladesh</strong></h3><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original <strong>HP V22v G5 21.5\" FHD Monitor</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>. Order online or visit your nearest showroom for the best price and genuine product assurance.</p><p>This monitor comes with a <strong>3-year official warranty