(33, 'MSI PRO MP275 E14L 27\" 144Hz IPS FHD Gaming Monitor', '**MSI PRO MP275 E14L 27\" 144Hz IPS FHD Gaming Monitor** delivers smooth performance for both work and gaming. It features a 27-inch Full HD IPS panel with a 144Hz refresh rate, 1ms MPRT response time, and Adaptive-Sync technology for fluid, tear-free visuals. The four-side slim bezel design offers an immersive viewing experience and is perfect for multi-monitor setups. With HDMI, DisplayPort, built-in speakers, VESA mount support, and HDR Ready, this monitor provides comfort, connectivity, and vibrant picture quality for everyday productivity and entertainment.', 'msi-pro-mp275-e14l-27-144hz-ips-fhd-gaming-monitor-1778951046', '<p>MSI PRO MP275 E14L 27\" 144Hz IPS FHD Gaming Monitor The MSI PRO MP275 E14L 27\" 144Hz IPS FHD Gaming Monitor blends professional productivity with smooth gaming performance. Featuring a Full HD IPS panel, a 144Hz refresh rate, and a 1ms MPRT response time, this 27-inch monitor delivers sharp visuals, fluid motion, and wide viewing angles. Its ergonomic design, slim bezels, and HDR Ready support make it a versatile display for both work and entertainment.</p><p>144Hz Refresh Rate &amp; Adaptive-Sync The MSI PRO MP275 E14L offers a 144Hz refresh rate with Adaptive-Sync technology, reducing screen tearing and stuttering. Fast-paced games feel smoother and more responsive, while the 1ms MPRT response time minimizes motion blur and ghosting—ideal for competitive gaming.</p><p>IPS Panel &amp; Full HD Clarity Equipped with a Full HD (1920 × 1080) IPS panel, this monitor provides accurate color reproduction and wide 178° viewing angles. Whether used for office work, multimedia, or gaming, it ensures consistent image quality across all applications.</p><p>Slim Bezel &amp; Modern Design The four-side slim bezel design offers a 92% screen-to-body ratio, creating a more immersive viewing experience. It is perfect for multi-monitor setups, delivering a clean and modern workspace.</p><p>Connectivity &amp; Comfort This monitor includes HDMI and DisplayPort inputs, built-in speakers, and VESA mount support for flexible installation. The ergonomic design enhances comfort during long working or gaming sessions, while HDR Ready support improves brightness and color depth.</p><p>Built for Work &amp; Play Efficiency by day and performance by night—the MSI PRO MP275 E14L is designed to balance productivity and gaming. Its combination of high refresh rate, IPS clarity, and sleek design makes it a dependable choice for professionals and gamers alike.</p><p>Buy MSI PRO MP275 E14L 27\" Monitor from International Office Solution In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original MSI PRO MP275 E14L 27\" 144Hz IPS FHD Monitor from International Office Solution. Order online or visit your nearest showroom to get it at the best price. The monitor comes with a 3-year warranty.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>27\"</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>Panel Type</td><td>IPS</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>1920 x 1080 (FHD)</td></tr><tr><td>Pixel pitch(MM)</td><td>0.3114(H) x 0.3114(V)</td></tr><tr><td>Display Surface</td><td>Anti-glare</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>Viewing Angle</td><td>178°(H) / 178°(V)</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>300 cd/m²</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1500:1<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>144Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Color Support</td><td>16.7M, 8 bits (6 bits + FRC)</td></tr><tr><td>Color Gamut</td><td>ADOBE RGB / DCI-P3 / SRGB: 80% / 85% / 110% (CIE 1976)</td></tr><tr><td>Response Time</td><td>1ms (MPRT) / 4ms (GtG)</td></tr><tr><td>HDR</td><td>HDR Ready</td></tr><tr><td>Curvature</td><td>Flat</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Video Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Low Blue Light</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>G-Sync Support</td><td>Adaptive-Sync<