(34, 'MSI MAG 255F E20 24.5\" 200Hz 0.5ms Rapid IPS FHD Gaming Monitor', 'MSI MAG 255F E20 24.5\" 200Hz Rapid IPS FHD Gaming Monitor delivers ultra-smooth and responsive gameplay with a 200Hz refresh rate and 0.5ms response time. It features a Rapid IPS Full HD display, AI Vision, HDR support, AMD FreeSync, wide color gamut, and eye-care technology—perfect for competitive gaming and content creation.', 'msi-mag-255f-e20-245-200hz-05ms-rapid-ips-fhd-gaming-monitor-1778951467', '<p>MSI MAG 255F E20 24.5\" 200Hz 0.5ms Rapid IPS FHD Gaming Monitor The MSI MAG 255F E20 24.5\" 200Hz Rapid IPS Gaming Monitor delivers exceptional gaming performance with stunning visual clarity. Featuring a Rapid IPS panel, ultra-fast 0.5ms (GtG, Min.) response time, and a blazing 200Hz refresh rate, this monitor ensures ultra-smooth gameplay with minimal motion blur and screen tearing.</p><p>200Hz Refresh Rate &amp; 0.5ms Response Time Experience incredibly fluid gameplay with the 200Hz refresh rate, allowing faster reaction times and smoother motion. The 0.5ms response time minimizes ghosting and motion blur, making it ideal for competitive and fast-paced gaming.</p><p>Rapid IPS Panel &amp; Full HD Visuals The 24.5-inch Full HD (1920 × 1080) Rapid IPS panel offers wide viewing angles, accurate colors, and consistent brightness. The flat, borderless design and anti-glare coating provide a distraction-free and immersive viewing experience.</p><p>AI Vision &amp; HDR Support MSI AI Vision technology enhances brightness, enriches colors, and reveals details in darker scenes. Combined with HDR support, the monitor delivers improved contrast and vibrant image quality for both gaming and multimedia.</p><p>Accurate Colors &amp; Wide Color Gamut Enjoy lifelike visuals with 100% sRGB, 83% Adobe RGB, and 79% DCI-P3 coverage. The 10-bit color depth and 1.07 billion colors ensure rich and accurate color reproduction for gaming and content creation.</p><p>AMD FreeSync &amp; Eye Care Technology With AMD Radeon FreeSync, the monitor eliminates screen tearing and stuttering for smooth gameplay. Eye-care features such as Anti-Flicker and Less Blue Light help reduce eye strain during long gaming sessions.</p><p>Designed for Comfort &amp; Security The ergonomic design enhances comfort during extended use, while the Kensington Lock slot adds extra security. The MSI MAG 255F E20 is an excellent choice for gamers and creators seeking high performance, stunning visuals, and long-lasting comfort.</p><p>Buy MSI MAG 255F E20 24.5\" 200Hz Gaming Monitor from International Office Solution In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original MSI MAG 255F E20 24.5\" 200Hz Gaming Monitor from International Office Solution. We offer a wide collection of the latest MSI monitors for your desktop PC. Order online or visit your nearest showroom to get yours at the best price. The MSI MAG 255F E20 24.5\" 200Hz Gaming Monitor comes with a 3-year warranty.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>24.5”</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>Panel Type</td><td>Rapid IPS</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>1920 x 1080 (FHD)</td></tr><tr><td>Pixel pitch(MM)</td><td>0.2832 (H) x 0.2802 (V)</td></tr><tr><td>Display Surface</td><td>Anti-glare</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>Viewing Angle</td><td>178°(H) / 178°(V)</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>SDR: 300 cd/m2</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>200Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Color Support</td><td>1.07B, 10 bits (8 bits + FRC)</td></tr><tr><td>Response Time</td><td>0.5ms (GtG, Min)</td></tr><tr><td>HDR</td><td>HDR Ready</td></tr><tr><td>Curvature</td><td>Flat</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Video Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Flicker Free</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Low Blue Light</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Free Sync Support</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Audio Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Speaker (Built In)</td><td>N/A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connectivity</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Display Port</td><td>1x DisplayPort 1.2a (HBR2)</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>2x HDMI 2.0b (FHD@200Hz)</td></tr><tr><td>Audio Jack</td><td>1x Headphone out</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Mechanical Design</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Tilt</td><td>-5° ~ 20°</td></tr><tr><td>Vesa Wall Mount</td><td>100 x 100mm</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>557.1 x 220.1 x 418.5mm (21.9 x 8.6 x 16.4 inch)<br>557.1 x 66.4 x 326.9mm (21.9 x 2.6 x 12.8 inch) (without stand)<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>3.24 kg (7.1 lbs)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>Internal Power Board</td></tr><tr><td>Voltage</td><td>100~240V, 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 20600.00, 20700.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/AFCOHn6sappqpfcT8dTgJNG6tFOat5L6Ey97nT3v.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-16 17:11:07', '2026-05-16 17:11:07', 'MSI MAG 255F E20 24.5\" 200Hz Rapid IPS Gaming Monitor Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy MSI MAG 255F E20 24.5\" 200Hz Rapid IPS FHD Gaming Monitor with 0.5ms response, HDR, AI Vision & FreeSync. Available at International Office Solution with 3-year warranty.', 'MSI MAG 255F E20, MSI 200Hz monitor, MSI 24.5 inch gaming monitor, Rapid IPS monitor, 0.5ms gaming monitor, MSI FreeSync monitor, FHD gaming monitor BD, MSI monitor price Bangladesh', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL);
