(35, 'MSI MAG 255F X24 24.5\" 240Hz Rapid IPS FHD Gaming Monitor', '**MSI MAG 255F X24 24.5\" 240Hz Rapid IPS FHD Gaming Monitor** delivers esports-level performance with a 240Hz refresh rate and Rapid IPS panel for ultra-smooth, responsive gameplay. Featuring Full HD resolution, wide viewing angles, HDMI and DisplayPort connectivity, and a sleek slim-bezel design, it’s perfect for competitive gaming setups.', 'msi-mag-255f-x24-245-240hz-rapid-ips-fhd-gaming-monitor-1778951870', '<p>MSI MAG 255F X24 24.5\" 240Hz Rapid IPS FHD Gaming Monitor The MSI MAG 255F X24 24.5\" 240Hz Rapid IPS FHD Gaming Monitor is built for speed, clarity, and competitive performance. With Full HD resolution, a Rapid IPS panel, and an ultra-fast 240Hz refresh rate, this 24.5-inch gaming monitor delivers smooth visuals, accurate colors, and responsive gameplay—perfect for esports players and gaming enthusiasts.</p><p>240Hz Refresh Rate &amp; Rapid IPS Panel The 240Hz refresh rate ensures ultra-fluid motion, reducing screen tearing and stuttering in fast-paced games. The Rapid IPS panel provides quick response times and vibrant color accuracy, making this monitor ideal for competitive gaming and immersive experiences.</p><p>Full HD Resolution &amp; Wide Viewing Angles With 1920 × 1080 Full HD resolution and a 16:9 aspect ratio, the MSI MAG 255F X24 delivers sharp visuals and detailed clarity. The IPS technology offers 178° wide viewing angles, ensuring consistent image quality for gaming, streaming, and productivity.</p><p>Esports-Ready Performance Designed for precision and consistency, the MSI MAG 255F X24 is tailored for esports players who demand speed and accuracy. Its fast response time and smooth refresh rate make it a reliable gaming monitor for competitive setups.</p><p>Connectivity &amp; Comfort Equipped with HDMI and DisplayPort inputs, this monitor provides versatile connectivity for PCs and gaming consoles. The anti-glare display enhances comfort during long sessions, while the sturdy ergonomic design ensures stability.</p><p>Stylish &amp; Functional Design Featuring a sleek design with slim bezels, the MSI MAG 255F X24 is perfect for multi-monitor setups and modern gaming environments.</p><p>Buy MSI MAG 255F X24 24.5\" 240Hz Monitor from International Office Solution In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original MSI MAG 255F X24 24.5\" 240Hz Rapid IPS FHD Gaming Monitor from International Office Solution. Order online or visit your nearest showroom to get it at the best price. The monitor comes with a 3-year warranty.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>24.5”</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>Panel Type</td><td>Rapid IPS</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>1920 x 1080 (FHD)</td></tr><tr><td>Pixel pitch(MM)</td><td>0.2832(H) x 0.2802(V)</td></tr><tr><td>Display Surface</td><td>Anti-glare</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>Viewing Angle</td><td>178°(H) / 178°(V)</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>SDR: 300 cd/m2</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>240Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Color Support</td><td>1.07B, 10 bits (8 bits + FRC)</td></tr><tr><td>Response Time</td><td>0.5ms (GtG, Min)</td></tr><tr><td>HDR</td><td>HDR Ready</td></tr><tr><td>Curvature</td><td>Flat</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Video Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Flicker Free</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Low Blue Light</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>G-Sync Support</td><td>Adaptive Sync</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Audio Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Speaker (Built In)</td><td>N/A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connectivity</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Display Port</td><td>1x DisplayPort 1.2a</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>2x HDMI 2.0b (FHD@240Hz)</td></tr><tr><td>Audio Jack</td><td>1x Headphone out</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Mechanic