(36, 'MSI PRO MP161 E2 15.6\" IPS FHD Portable Monitor', '**MSI PRO MP161 E2 15.6\" IPS FHD Portable Monitor** is an ultra-slim and lightweight second screen designed for productivity on the go. It features a Full HD IPS display, USB-C and Mini HDMI connectivity, built-in speakers, adjustable kickstand, and eye-care technology—perfect for travel, work, and entertainment.', 'msi-pro-mp161-e2-156-ips-fhd-portable-monitor-1778952181', '<p>MSI PRO MP161 E2 15.6\" IPS FHD Portable Monitor The MSI PRO MP161 E2 15.6\" IPS FHD Portable Monitor is a versatile and ultra-slim display designed for productivity on the go. Weighing only 1.65 lbs and measuring just 0.4 inches thin, this portable monitor delivers crisp and vibrant visuals with a 1920 × 1080 Full HD IPS panel and a smooth 60Hz refresh rate.</p><p>Portable Productivity Anywhere With USB Type-C and Mini HDMI connectivity, the MSI PRO MP161 E2 easily connects to laptops, smartphones, tablets, and gaming consoles. It’s the perfect second screen for work, travel, presentations, or entertainment.</p><p>Ultra-Slim &amp; Ergonomic Design The monitor features an adjustable kickstand for flexible viewing angles and a 1/4-inch tripod mount for versatile placement, making it ideal for mobile professionals and remote workers.</p><p>Built-in Speakers &amp; Eye Care Enjoy convenient audio with built-in speakers and reduce eye strain using Anti-Flicker, Less Blue Light, and Anti-Glare technologies—perfect for long working sessions.</p><p>Lightweight &amp; Reliable Whether for business travel, remote work, or entertainment, the MSI PRO MP161 E2 offers a reliable and portable display solution that boosts productivity wherever you go.</p><p>Buy MSI PRO MP161 E2 Portable Monitor from International Office Solution In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original MSI PRO MP161 E2 15.6\" IPS FHD Portable Monitor from International Office Solution. Order online or visit your nearest showroom to get it at the best price. The monitor comes with 