(39, 'MSI G244F E2 23.8 inch FHD Rapid IPS 180Hz Gaming Monitor', 'MSI G244F E2 23.8\" FHD Rapid IPS 180Hz Gaming Monitor delivers ultra-smooth esports performance with a 180Hz refresh rate and 1ms response time. Featuring a Rapid IPS Full HD display, Adaptive-Sync, wide color gamut, and TÜV-certified eye care technologies, it ensures sharp visuals, fast response, and comfortable long gaming sessions.', 'msi-g244f-e2-238-inch-fhd-rapid-ips-180hz-gaming-monitor-1778953049', '<p>MSI G244F E2 23.8\" FHD Rapid IPS 180Hz Gaming Monitor The MSI G244F E2 23.8\" FHD Rapid IPS 180Hz Gaming Monitor is designed for fast-paced competitive gaming and smooth visual performance. Featuring a Full HD (1920 × 1080) Rapid IPS panel, it delivers sharp image quality, vibrant colors, and wide viewing angles for both gaming and productivity.</p><p>180Hz Refresh Rate &amp; 1ms Response Time With a 180Hz refresh rate and 1ms (GTG) response time, this monitor ensures ultra-smooth gameplay with minimal motion blur. It is ideal for FPS, racing, and esports titles where speed and precision matter.</p><p>Rapid IPS Panel &amp; Color Accuracy The Rapid IPS panel provides excellent color performance with 94.4% Adobe RGB, 92.05% DCI-P3, and 122.88% sRGB coverage, making it suitable for both gaming and creative work. The 178° viewing angles ensure consistent visuals from any position.</p><p>Adaptive-Sync &amp; Smooth Gameplay Adaptive-Sync technology synchronizes the monitor with your GPU to eliminate screen tearing and stuttering, delivering fluid and lag-free gaming performance.</p><p>Eye Care &amp; Comfort Features Built with Anti-Flicker and Less Blue Light technologies (TÜV certified), the monitor reduces eye strain during long gaming or working sessions. Night Vision mode enhances visibility in dark scenes.</p><p>Connectivity &amp; Design Equipped with DisplayPort, dual HDMI ports, and headphone output, the MSI G244F E2 offers versatile connectivity. It also supports VESA mounting and includes 