(40, 'MSI PRO MP275Q 27\" 100Hz IPS WQHD Monitor', 'The MSI PRO MP275Q 27-inch 100Hz IPS WQHD Monitor is a professional-grade 27-inch WQHD monitor designed for productivity, programming, and creative work. Featuring a sharp 2560×1440 IPS display, 100Hz refresh rate, and 1ms MPRT response time, it delivers smooth visuals and excellent clarity. With TÜV-certified eye care technology, Anti-Flicker support, built-in speakers, and versatile HDMI & DisplayPort connectivity, this monitor ensures a comfortable and efficient working experience for long hours of use. Available at International Office Solution', 'msi-pro-mp275q-27-100hz-ips-wqhd-monitor-1778996207', '<p>The MSI PRO MP275Q 27-inch 100Hz IPS WQHD Monitor is thoughtfully designed for professionals involved in programming, coding, web design, and other productivity-focused tasks. Featuring a spacious 27-inch display with WQHD resolution (2560 x 1440), this monitor delivers exceptional clarity and ample screen space for multitasking, detailed editing, and efficient workflow management. Whether you are writing code, designing websites, or handling creative projects, the higher resolution improves readability and provides sharper visuals for enhanced productivity.</p><p>One of the standout features of the MSI PRO MP275Q is its strong focus on eye comfort and user well-being. The monitor is TÜV certified for eye safety and comes equipped with MSI EyesErgo technology along with Anti-Flicker support, helping to reduce eye strain and fatigue during extended working hours. Additionally, the MSI Eye-Q Check function encourages users to take regular breaks, promoting healthier screen habits and long-term comfort.</p><p>With a 100Hz refresh rate and 1ms MPRT response time, the monitor ensures smooth and fluid visuals, minimizing motion blur and screen stuttering. This creates a more enjoyable experience for professional work, video playback, presentations, and daily multitasking.</p><p>The monitor also offers versatile connectivity options, including HDMI and DisplayPort inputs, making it easy to connect multiple devices such as laptops, desktops, and other peripherals. A built-in cable management system helps maintain a neat and organized workspace, while integrated speakers provide convenient audio output without requiring external speakers. The monitor is also VESA mount compatible, giving users flexible mounting and setup options.</p><p>Its WQHD IPS panel enhances overall image quality with vibrant colors, wider viewing angles, and improved text sharpness. The increased pixel density makes documents, spreadsheets, and creative projects appear more detailed and visually appealing, contributing to a comfortable and productive working environment.</p><p>Designed with ergonomics and user comfort in mind, the MSI PRO MP275Q combines modern display technology with eye-care features to support long hours of productive work. It is an excellent choice for professionals seeking a reliable, high-resolution monitor that balances performance, comfort, and practicality.</p><p>Buy the MSI PRO MP275Q 27-inch 100Hz IPS WQHD Monitor from International Office Solution in Bangladesh. We offer a wide collection of the latest MSI monitors at competitive prices. Order online or visit our showroom to get your preferred monitor with official warranty support.</p><p>The latest price of the MSI PRO MP275Q 27-inch 100Hz IPS WQHD Monitor in Bangladesh is 30,000৳. The monitor comes with a 3-year warranty.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>27 inch</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>Panel Type</td><td>IPS</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>WQHD (2560 x 1440)</td></tr><tr><td>Pixel pitch(MM)</td><td>0.2331(H) x 0.2331(V)</td></tr><tr><td>Display Surface</td><td>Anti-glare</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>Viewing Angle</td><td>178°(H) / 178°(V)</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>300 cd/m2</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1300:1</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>100Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Color Gamut</td><td>COLOR BIT: 10 bits (8 bits + FRC)<br>sRGB: 100% (CIE 1976)</td></tr><tr><td>Response Time</td><td>1ms (MPRT) / 4ms (GTG)</td></tr><tr><td>Curvature</td><td>Flat</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Video Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Flicker Free</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Low Blue Light</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Free Sync Support</td><td>Adaptive Sync</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Audio Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Speaker (Built In)</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Speaker Output</td><td>2x 2W</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connectivity</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Display Port</td><td>1x DP (1.2a)</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>2x HDMI (2.0b)</td></tr><tr><td>Audio Jack</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Mechanical Design</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Tilt</td><td>-5° ~ 20°<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Vesa Wall Mount</td><td>100 x 100 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Security Locker</td><td>Kensington Lock</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>614.0 x 456.7 x 207.2 mm<br>(24.17 x 17.98 x 8.16 inch)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>4.10 kg (9.04 lbs) / 5.54 kg (12.21 lbs)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>Internal Power</td></tr><tr><td>Voltage</td><td>Power Input : 100~240V , 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Monitor', 30000.00, 30000.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/pnksWs5myyIvmPcmXFpufPK15sHwCgLS8Dsc4p0x.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-17 05:36:47', '2026-05-17 05:37:39', 'MSI PRO MP275Q 27\" 100Hz IPS WQHD Monitor Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy MSI PRO MP275Q 27-inch 100Hz IPS WQHD Monitor in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features WQHD IPS display, 100Hz refresh rate, eye-care technology, HDMI & DP connectivity, and 3-year warranty at the best price.', 'MSI PRO MP275Q MSI PRO MP275Q Price in Bangladesh MSI 27 Inch WQHD Monitor MSI 100Hz IPS Monitor MSI WQHD Monitor Bangladesh 27 Inch IPS Monitor MSI Professional Monitor MSI Monitor Price BD WQHD Monitor Bangladesh MSI PRO MP275Q 27 Inch Monitor', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(41, 'MSI PRO MP275Q E14 27\" 144Hz IPS 2K WQHD Gaming Monitor', 'he MSI PRO MP275Q E14 27-inch 144Hz IPS 2K WQHD Gaming Monitor is a high-performance display built for both gaming and professional productivity. Featuring a 27-inch WQHD (2560 × 1440) IPS panel with a fast 144Hz refresh rate and 1ms MPRT response time, this monitor delivers sharp visuals, smooth motion, and vibrant color accuracy. Whether you\'re gaming, streaming, editing, or multitasking, the MSI PRO MP275Q E14 offers an immersive and responsive viewing experience', 'msi-pro-mp275q-e14-27-144hz-ips-2k-wqhd-gaming-monitor-1778996546', '<h3>44Hz Refresh Rate &amp; Adaptive-Sync</h3><p>Enjoy ultra-smooth gameplay and reduced screen tearing with the 144Hz refresh rate and Adaptive-Sync technology. The fast 1ms MPRT response time minimizes motion blur and ghosting, making this monitor ideal for competitive gaming and fast-paced entertainment.</p><h3>2K WQHD IPS Display</h3><p>The WQHD resolution provides sharper image quality and more screen space compared to standard Full HD monitors. Combined with the IPS panel and 178° wide viewing angles, the MSI PRO MP275Q E14 ensures consistent colors and excellent clarity from virtually any angle.</p><h3>Slim Bezel &amp; Modern Design</h3><p>Designed with a sleek four-side slim bezel, the monitor maximizes display space while giving your setup a modern and minimalist appearance. It is perfect for multi-monitor setups, enhancing immersion and productivity.</p><h3>Connectivity &amp; Convenience</h3><p>The monitor includes HDMI and DisplayPort connectivity options for flexible device support. Built-in speakers provide convenient audio output, while VESA mount compatibility allows easy wall mounting or monitor arm installation. HDR Ready support further improves brightness and contrast for richer visuals.</p><h3>Perfect for Work &amp; Gaming</h3><p>The MSI PRO MP275Q E14 balances productivity and entertainment with its combination of 2K resolution, IPS color performance, and high refresh rate. From office tasks and creative projects to immersive gaming sessions, this monitor is built to handle it all comfortably and efficiently.</p><p>Buy the MSI PRO MP275Q E14 27-inch 144Hz IPS 2K WQHD Gaming Monitor from International Office Solution in Bangladesh. We offer the latest MSI monitors at competitive prices with official warranty support.</p><h3>Short Description</h3><p>The MSI PRO MP275Q E14 27-inch 144Hz IPS 2K WQHD Gaming Monitor features a stunning 27-inch WQHD IPS display with a 144Hz refresh rate and 1ms MPRT response time for ultra-smooth visuals and sharp image quality. Equipped with Adaptive-Sync, HDR Ready support, built-in speakers, and multiple connectivity options, this monitor is ideal for gaming, content creation, and professional productivity.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>27\"</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>Panel Type</td><td>IPS</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>2560x1440 (WQHD)</td></tr><tr><td>Pixel pitch(MM)</td><td>0.2331(H)x0.2331(V)</td></tr><tr><td>Display Surface</td><td>Anti-glare</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>Viewing Angle</td><td>178°(H) / 178°(V)</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>300 cd/m²</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1500:1<br>DCR: 100000000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>144Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Color Support</td><td>16.7M, 10 bits (8 bits + FRC)</td></tr><tr><td>Color Gamut</td><td>NTSC (CIE1976 area percentage/overlap): 100%/78%<br>NTSC (CIE1931 area percentage/overlap): 78%/70%<br>sRGB (CIE1976 area percentage/overlap): 115%/95%<br>sRGB (CIE1931 area percentage/overlap): 110%/95%<br>Adobe RGB (CIE1976 area percentage/overlap): 95%/82%<br>Adobe RGB (CIE1931 area percentage/overlap): 80%/72%<br>DCI-P3 (CIE1976 area percentage/overlap): 90%/85%<br>DCI-P3 (CIE1931 area percentage/overlap): 80%/78%<br>Rec.709 (CIE1976 area percentage/overlap): 115%/95%<br>Rec.709 (CIE1931 area percentage/overlap): 110%/95%<br>Rec.2020 (CIE1976 area percentage/overlap): 65%/65%<br>Rec.2020 (CIE1931 area percentage/overlap): 58%/58%</td></tr><tr><td>Response Time</td><td>1ms (MPRT) / 4ms (GtG)</td></tr><tr><td>HDR</td><td>HDR Ready</td></tr><tr><td>Curvature</td><td>Flat</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Video Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Low Blue Light</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>G-Sync Support</td><td>Adaptive-Sync<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>HDCP</td><td>2.3</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Audio Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Speaker (Built In)</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Speaker Details</td><td>2x 2W</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connectivity</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Display Port</td><td>1 x Display Port 1.2a</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>1x HDMI 2.0b<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Audio Jack</td><td>1 x Headphone Out<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Mechanical Design</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Tilt</td><td>-5° ~ 20°</td></tr><tr><td>Vesa Wall Mount</td><td>100 x 100 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Security Locker</td><td>Kensington Lock</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>68.8 x 12.8 x 45 cm</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>Internal Power Board</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>Standby-mode Power Consumption (W) 0.5<br>Off-mode Power Consumption (W) 0.3</td></tr><tr><td>Voltage</td><td>100~240V, 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Monitor', 31000.00, 31000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/nyM9gnUPUxIRA7QJ1Xz5kybXD8YpqwFAuA1VNwhu.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-17 05:42:26', '2026-05-17 05:42:46', 'MSI PRO MP275Q E14 27\" 144Hz IPS 2K WQHD Gaming Monitor