(42, 'MSI MAG 275QF 27\" 180Hz IPS WQHD Gaming Monitor', 'The MSI MAG 275QF 27-inch 180Hz IPS WQHD Gaming Monitor is a premium gaming monitor designed for competitive gamers and multimedia enthusiasts who demand speed, clarity, and immersive visuals. Featuring a 27-inch Rapid IPS panel with WQHD (2560 × 1440) resolution, this monitor delivers sharp image quality, vibrant colors, and wide viewing angles for an exceptional viewing experience.', 'msi-mag-275qf-27-180hz-ips-wqhd-gaming-monitor-1778996827', '<h3>Ultra-Smooth 180Hz Performance</h3><p>Built for high-speed gaming, the MSI MAG 275QF offers an ultra-fast 180Hz refresh rate and 0.5ms response time, ensuring fluid motion and minimal input lag. Whether you\'re playing FPS, racing, or esports titles, the monitor provides highly responsive gameplay with reduced ghosting and motion blur.</p><h3>WQHD Rapid IPS Display</h3><p>The 2K WQHD resolution delivers significantly more detail and screen space compared to Full HD monitors. Its Rapid IPS panel ensures accurate color reproduction and consistent image quality from wide viewing angles, making it suitable for gaming, streaming, editing, and everyday productivity.</p><h3>Adaptive Sync &amp; HDR Ready</h3><p>Equipped with Adaptive Sync technology, the MSI MAG 275QF eliminates screen tearing and stuttering for smooth gaming performance. HDR Ready support</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>27\" (68.58cm)<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>Panel Type</td><td>Rapid IPS</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>2560x1440 (WQHD)</td></tr><tr><td>Pixel pitch(MM)</td><td>0.2331(H)x0.2331(V)</td></tr><tr><td>Display Surface</td><td>Anti-glare</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>Viewing Angle</td><td>178°(H) / 178°(V)</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>300 (Typ.)</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1000:1<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>180Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Color Support</td><td>1.07B, 10 bits (8 bits + FRC)<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Color Gamut</td><td>Adobe RGB / DCI-P3 / sRGB: 75% / 80% / 115%</td></tr><tr><td>Response Time</td><td>0.5ms (GtG, Min.)</td></tr><tr><td>HDR</td><td>HDR Ready</td></tr><tr><td>Curvature</td><td>Flat</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Video Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Low Blue Light</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>G-Sync Support</td><td>Adaptive-Sync<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Audio Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Speaker (Built In)</td><td>N/A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connectivity</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Display Port</td><td>1 x DisplayPort (1.4)</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>2 x HDMI (2.0b)<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Audio Jack</td><td>1 x Headphone Out<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Mechanical Design</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Tilt</td><td>-5° ~ 20°</td></tr><tr><td>Vesa Wall Mount</td><td>100 x 100 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Security Locker</td><td>Kensington Lock</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>611.3×220.1×454.3 mm<br>611.3×56.6×362.6mm (without stand)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>3.95 kg / 6.35 kg<br>3.57kg (without stand)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Voltage</td><td>100~240V, 50/60Hz<br><br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Monitor', 33800.00, 33800.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/Nu4eWLb8eReiKZpWf3UJuNSX9RLgKglUnKoOtiBk.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-17 05:47:07', '2026-05-17 05:47:54', 'MSI MAG 275QF 27\" 180Hz IPS WQHD Gaming Monitor Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy MSI MAG 275QF 27-inch 180Hz IPS WQHD Gaming Monitor in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features Rapid IPS panel, 2K WQHD resolution, 180Hz refresh rate, Adaptive Sync, HDR Ready, and ultra-smooth gaming performance.', 'MSI MAG 275QF, MSI MAG 275QF Price in Bangladesh, MSI 180Hz Gaming Monitor, MSI WQHD IPS Monitor, MSI 27 Inch Gaming Monitor, MSI Rapid IPS Monitor, 2K Gaming Monitor BD, MSI Gaming Monitor Price, MSI HDR Ready Monitor Bangladesh', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(43, 'MSI MAG 274QPF E20 27\" 200Hz Rapid IPS WQHD Gaming Monitor', 'The MSI MAG 274QPF E20 27-inch 200Hz Rapid IPS WQHD Gaming Monitor features a stunning 27-inch WQHD Rapid IPS display with a 200Hz refresh rate and 0.5ms response time for ultra-smooth gaming performance. With HDR 400 support, Adaptive-Sync technology, and esports-ready speed, this monitor is perfect for competitive gamers and immersive entertainment.', 'msi-mag-274qpf-e20-27-200hz-rapid-ips-wqhd-gaming-monitor-1778997276', '<p>The MSI MAG 274QPF E20 27-inch 200Hz Rapid IPS WQHD Gaming Monitor is built for gamers who demand exceptional speed, crystal-clear visuals, and immersive gameplay. Featuring a 27-inch WQHD (2560 × 1440) Rapid IPS display, ultra-fast 200Hz refresh rate, and 0.5ms (GtG) response time, this monitor delivers smooth performance and stunning image quality for competitive gaming and entertainment.</p><h3>200Hz Refresh Rate &amp; Rapid IPS Technology</h3><p>Experience ultra-fluid gameplay with the blazing-fast 200Hz refresh rate that reduces motion blur and improves responsiveness. The Rapid IPS panel combines fast response times with accurate colors and wide viewing angles, making this monitor ideal for esports and fast-paced gaming.</p><h3>WQHD Resolution &amp; HDR Support</h3><p>The 2560 × 1440 WQHD resolution provides sharp details and enhanced clarity compared to standard Full HD displays. With VESA DisplayHDR 400 certification, the monitor delivers improved brightness, contrast, and realistic visuals for a more immersive gaming experience.</p><h3>Competitive Gaming Performance</h3><p>Designed for esports enthusiasts, the MSI MAG 274QPF E20 features a 0.5ms (GtG) response time to minimize ghosting and input lag. Adaptive-Sync technology ensures smooth and tear-free gameplay for a responsive and enjoyable gaming experience.</p><h3>Connectivity &amp; Convenience</h3><p>The monitor comes equipped with HDMI, DisplayPort, and audio-out connectivity options for easy connection with gaming PCs, consoles, and multimedia devices. Its anti-glare display surface helps reduce reflections and eye strain during long gaming sessions.</p><h3>Modern &amp; Durable Design</h3><p>Part of MSI’s premium MAG series, the MSI MAG 274QPF E20 features slim bezels and a stylish modern design that fits perfectly into gaming and professional setups. Its durable build quality and efficient heat management ensure long-lasting reliability and performance.</p><p>Buy the MSI MAG 274QPF E20 27-inch 200Hz Rapid IPS WQHD Gaming Monitor from International Office Solution in Bangladesh with official warranty support and competitive pricing.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>27\"</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>Panel Type</td><td>Rapid IPS</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>2560 x 1440 (WQHD)</td></tr><tr><td>Pixel pitch(MM)</td><td>0.2331(H) x 0.2331(V)</td></tr><tr><td>Display Surface</td><td>Anti-glare</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>Viewing Angle</td><td>178°(H) / 178°(V)</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>SDR: 300 cd/m²<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1000:1 (Typ.)</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>200Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Color Support</td><td>1.07B, 10 bits (8 bits + FRC)</td></tr><tr><td>Color Gamut</td><td>Adobe RGB / DCI-P3 / sRGB: 92% / 95% / 124% (CIE1976 Standard)</td></tr><tr><td>Response Time</td><td>0.5ms (GtG, Min.)<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>HDR</td><td>VESA DisplayHDR 400<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Curvature</td><td>Flat</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Video Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Free Sync Support</td><td>AMD FreeSync Premium</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Audio Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Speaker (Built In)</td><td>N/A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connectivity</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Display Port</td><td>1 x DisplayPort 1.4a (HBR3)</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>2x HDMI 2.0b (WQHD@144Hz)</td></tr><tr><td>USB Type-C</td><td>1x Type-C (DP alt.) w/ 15W PD</td></tr><tr><td>Audio Jack</td><td>1x Headphone out</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Mechanical Design</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Tilt</td><td>-5° ~ 20°</td></tr><tr><td>Swivel</td><td>-30° ~ 30°</td></tr><tr><td>Pivot</td><td>-90° ~ 90°</td></tr><tr><td>Height Adjustment</td><td>0 ~ 130 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Vesa Wall Mount</td><td>100 x 100 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Security Locker</td><td>Kensington Lock</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>with Stand:<br>613.3 x 227.9 x 404.8 mm<br>(24.1 x 8.9 x 15.9 inch)<br>without Stand:<br>613.3 x 57 x 365.4 mm<br>(24.1 x 2.2 x 14.3 inch)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>NW / GW: 6.8 kg (14.9 lbs) / 9.2 kg (20.2 lbs)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>Internal Power Board<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Voltage</td><td>100 ~ 240V, 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Monitor', 39000.00, 39000.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/f2oj5kuu0N4bjEv7i3jUuuD4NO3YgdSmnGldFugh.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-17 05:54:36', '2026-05-17 05:55:07', 'MSI MAG 274QPF E20 27\" 200Hz Rapid IPS WQHD Gaming Monitor Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy MSI MAG 274QPF E20 27-inch 200Hz Rapid IPS WQHD Gaming Monitor in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features 200Hz refresh rate, Rapid IPS panel, WQHD resolution, HDR 400, Adaptive-Sync, and esports-level gaming performance.', '\\MSI MAG 274QPF E20, MSI MAG 274QPF E20 Price in Bangladesh, MSI 200Hz Gaming Monitor, MSI Rapid IPS Monitor, MSI WQHD Gaming Monitor, MSI 27 Inch Monitor, 2K Gaming Monitor BD, MSI HDR400 Monitor, MSI Gaming Monitor Price BD', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL);
