(44, 'MSI MAG 274QRFW E20 27\" 200Hz Rapid IPS WQHD Gaming Monitor', 'The MSI MAG 274QRFW E20 27-inch 200Hz Rapid IPS WQHD Gaming Monitor is a premium 27-inch gaming display designed for gamers, content creators, and professionals who demand high accuracy, speed, and visual clarity. Featuring a flat Rapid IPS panel with WQHD (2560 × 1440) resolution, it delivers sharp details, vibrant colors, and immersive visuals with 1.07 billion colors and 10-bit (8-bit + FRC) depth.', 'msi-mag-274qrfw-e20-27-200hz-rapid-ips-wqhd-gaming-monitor-1778997808', '<h3>Ultra-Smooth 200Hz Performance</h3><p>With a blazing 200Hz refresh rate and 0.5ms (GtG) response time, this monitor ensures ultra-fluid gameplay with minimal motion blur and input lag. Adaptive-Sync technology eliminates screen tearing and stuttering, making it ideal for competitive gaming and fast-paced action titles.</p><h3>WQHD Rapid IPS Display</h3><p>The 27-inch WQHD panel provides excellent clarity and more screen space than standard Full HD monitors. Combined with wide viewing angles (178°) and strong color accuracy across sRGB, AdobeRGB, and DCI-P3, the MSI MAG 274QRFW E20 is perfect for gaming, design, editing, and streaming.</p><h3>HDR &amp; Console Ready Experience</h3><p>With VESA DisplayHDR 400 support, the monitor delivers improved brightness, contrast, and more realistic visuals. It also supports VRR for PlayStation 5 and Xbox, ensuring smooth console gaming performance with consistent frame rates.</p><h3>Flexible Connectivity &amp; Ergonomics</h3><p>Equipped with DisplayPort 1.4a and dual HDMI 2.0b ports, the monitor supports high refresh rates across multiple devices. Its ergonomic stand allows tilt, swivel, pivot, and height adjustment, while VESA mount support offers flexible installation options for any setup.</p><h3>Modern Design &amp; Color Accuracy</h3><p>Featuring a sleek design with anti-glare coating, the MSI MAG 274QRFW E20 combines style and functionality. Its wide color gamut coverage ensures accurate and vibrant visuals, making it suitable for both professional and gaming environments.</p><p>Buy the MSI MAG 274QRFW E20 27-inch 200Hz Rapid IPS WQHD Gaming Monitor from International Office Solution in Bangladesh with official 3-year warranty and competitive pricing.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>27\"</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>Panel Type</td><td>Rapid IPS</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>2560 x 1440 (WQHD)</td></tr><tr><td>Pixel pitch(MM)</td><td>0.2331(H) x 0.2331(V)</td></tr><tr><td>Display Surface</td><td>Anti-glare</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>Viewing Angle</td><td>178°(H) / 178°(V)</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>SDR: 300 cd/m²<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1000:1 (Typ.)</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>200Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Color Support</td><td>1.07B , 10 bits (8 bits + FRC)</td></tr><tr><td>Color Gamut</td><td>92% / 95% / 124% (CIE1976 Standard)<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Response Time</td><td>0.5ms (GtG, Min.)<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>HDR</td><td>VESA DisplayHDR 400<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Curvature</td><td>Flat</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Video Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Flicker Free</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Low Blue Light</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Free Sync Support</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Audio Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Speaker (Built In)</td><td>N/A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connectivity</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Display Port</td><td>1 x DisplayPort (1.4a)</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>2x HDMI (2.0b)</td></tr><tr><td>Audio Jack</td><td>1x Headphone out</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Mechanical Design</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Tilt</td><td>-5° ~ 20°</td></tr><tr><td>Swivel</td><td>-30° ~ 30°</td></tr><tr><td>Pivot</td><td>-90° ~ 90°</td></tr><tr><td>Height Adjustment</td><td>0 ~ 130 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Vesa Wall Mount</td><td>100 x 100 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Security Locker</td><td>Kensington Lock</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>613.5 x 227.9 x 406.3 mm<br>(24.1 x 8.9 x 16 inch)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>6.9 kg (15.2 lbs) / 9.3 kg (20.5 lbs)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>Internal Power Board<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Voltage</td><td>100 ~ 240V, 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Monitor', 41000.00, 41000.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/qCEZ1oKTU7MS7iYVVbOSOTcgNiJaeSsTaibDdjrq.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-17 06:03:28', '2026-05-17 06:03:28', 'MSI MAG 274QRFW E20 27\" 200Hz Rapid IPS WQHD Gaming Monitor Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy MSI MAG 274QRFW E20 27-inch 200Hz Rapid IPS WQHD Gaming Monitor in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features 200Hz refresh rate, WQHD IPS panel, HDR 400, Adaptive-Sync, VRR support, and ergonomic design with official warranty.', 'MSI MAG 274QRFW E20, MSI MAG 274QRFW E20 Price in Bangladesh, MSI 200Hz Gaming Monitor, MSI WQHD IPS Monitor, MSI 27 Inch Gaming Monitor, MSI Rapid IPS Monitor, 2K Gaming Monitor BD, MSI HDR400 Monitor, MSI Gaming Monitor Price BD', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(45, 'MSI MAG 342CQRF E20 34\" UWQHD 200Hz VA Curved Gaming Monitor', 'The MSI MAG 342CQRF E20 34-inch UWQHD 200Hz VA Curved Gaming Monitor features a 34-inch curved UWQHD VA display with 200Hz refresh rate and 1ms response time for ultra-smooth and immersive gaming. With Adaptive Sync, HDR support, deep contrast VA panel, and ultrawide design, it is ideal for gaming, productivity, and entertainment.', 'msi-mag-342cqrf-e20-34-uwqhd-200hz-va-curved-gaming-monitor-1778997994', '<p>The MSI MAG 342CQRF E20 34-inch UWQHD 200Hz VA Curved Gaming Monitor is a premium ultrawide gaming display designed to deliver immersive visuals, smooth performance, and enhanced productivity. Featuring a 34-inch 1500R curved VA panel with UWQHD resolution (3440 × 1440), it provides a wide field of view, sharp details, and an engaging panoramic experience ideal for both gaming and multitasking.</p><h3>Ultra-Wide Immersive Display</h3><p>The 1500R curvature enhances immersion by naturally wrapping the display around your field of vision. The UWQHD resolution offers significantly more screen space than standard monitors, making it perfect for gaming, content creation, streaming, and multitasking workflows.</p><h3>Smooth 200Hz Gaming Performance</h3><p>With a high 200Hz refresh rate and fast 1ms response time, the MSI MAG 342CQRF E20 ensures fluid motion with minimal blur and input lag. Adaptive Sync technology further eliminates screen tearing, delivering a smooth and responsive experience in fast-paced games like FPS, racing, and esports titles.</p><h3>Vibrant Visuals &amp; HDR Support</h3><p>The VA panel produces deep blacks and strong contrast, while HDR support enhances brightness and color depth for more realistic visuals. This makes games and multimedia content appear more dynamic and visually rich.</p><h3>Eye Comfort for Long Sessions</h3><p>Equipped with Flicker-Free and Less Blue Light technologies, the monitor helps reduce eye strain during extended gaming or work sessions, making it suitable for both professionals and hardcore gamers.</p><h3>Connectivity &amp; Flexible Design</h3><p>The monitor includes HDMI, DisplayPort, and USB connectivity options for versatile device compatibility. Its slim three-sided bezel design maximizes screen space, while the ergonomic stand allows tilt adjustment and VESA mount support for flexible setups.</p><p>Buy the MSI MAG 342CQRF E20 34-inch UWQHD 200Hz VA Curved Gaming Monitor from International Office Solution in Bangladesh with official 3-year warranty and competitive pricing.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>34\"</td></tr><tr><td>Panel Type</td><td>Rapid VA</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>3440 X1440 (UWQHD)</td></tr><tr><td>Pixel pitch(MM)</td><td>0.23175(H) x 0.23175(V)</td></tr><tr><td>Display Surface</td><td>Anti-glare</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>21:9</td></tr><tr><td>Viewing Angle</td><td>178°(H) / 178°(V)</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>SDR: 300 cd/m²</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>3500:1<br>100000000:1(DCR)</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>200Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Color Support</td><td>1.07B, 10 bits (8 bits + FRC)</td></tr><tr><td>Color Gamut</td><td>88% / 90% / 110% (CIE1976 Standard)</td></tr><tr><td>Response Time</td><td>0.5ms (GtG, Min.)</td></tr><tr><td>HDR</td><td>HDR Ready</td></tr><tr><td>Curvature</td><td>Curve 1500R</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Video Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Free Sync Support</td><td>Adaptive-Sync</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Audio Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Speaker (Built In)</td><td>N/A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connectivity</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Display Port</td><td>1 x DisplayPort (1.4a)</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>2 x HDMI 2.0b(UWQHD@100Hz)</td></tr><tr><td>Audio Jack</td><td>1x Headphone out</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Mechanical Design</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Tilt</td><td>-5° ~ 20°</td></tr><tr><td>Swivel</td><td>-30° ~ 30°</td></tr><tr><td>Pivot</td><td>-5° ~ 5°</td></tr><tr><td>Height Adjustment</td><td>0 ~ 90 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Vesa Wall Mount</td><td>75 x 75 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Security Locker</td><td>Kensington Lock</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>808.60 x 269.97 x 423.97mm<br>808.60 x 119.67 x 363.95 mm (without stand)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>NW / GW : 6.95 kg (15.3 lbs) / 10.75 kg (23.7 lbs)<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>External Adopter 19V 3.42A</td></tr><tr><td>Voltage</td><td>100~240V, 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Monitor', 61400.00, 61400.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/rR4TKhERf03HHYd6tTNGmBfDJ9a5z9ud2XNrVHqU.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-17 06:06:34', '2026-05-17 06:06:34', 'MSI MAG 342CQRF E20 34\" UWQHD 200Hz Curved Gaming Monitor Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy MSI MAG 342CQRF E20 34-inch UWQHD 200Hz VA Curved Gaming Monitor in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features ultrawide curved display, 200Hz refresh rate, 1ms response time, HDR support, and immersive gaming performance.', 'MSI MAG 342CQRF E20, MSI MAG 342CQRF E20 Price in Bangladesh, MSI 34 Inch Ultrawide Monitor, MSI Curved Gaming Monitor, MSI 200Hz Monitor, MSI UWQHD Monitor BD, MSI VA Panel Monitor, MSI Gaming Monitor Price BD, Ultrawide Gaming Monitor BD', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(46, 'MSI MAG 275UPD E14 27\" 288Hz Dual Mode 4K UHD Gaming Monitor', 'The MSI MAG 275UPD E14 27-inch 288Hz Dual Mode 4K UHD Gaming Monitor features a 27-inch 4K IPS display with Dual Mode support (4K 144Hz / FHD 288Hz), delivering ultra-sharp visuals and extreme gaming performance. With HDR support, 1ms response time, Adaptive-Sync, and HDMI 2.1 connectivity, it is perfect for both competitive gaming and cinematic experiences.', 'msi-mag-275upd-e14-27-288hz-dual-mode-4k-uhd-gaming-monitor-1778998219', '<p>The MSI MAG 275UPD E14 27-inch 288Hz Dual Mode 4K UHD Gaming Monitor is a high-end gaming display designed for users who want both ultra-sharp 4K visuals and extreme refresh-rate performance. Featuring a 27-inch IPS panel with 3840 × 2160 UHD resolution, it delivers stunning clarity, vibrant colors, and excellent detail for gaming, content creation, and multimedia use.</p><h3>Dual Mode Performance (4K 144Hz / FHD 288Hz)</h3><p>One of its standout features is the Dual Mode system, allowing users to switch between 4K at 144Hz for cinematic visual quality and Full HD at 288Hz for ultra-competitive esports performance. This flexibility makes it suitable for both immersive gaming and high-speed competitive play.</p><h3>Ultra-Smooth &amp; Responsive Gameplay</h3><p>With a 1ms MPRT response time and Adaptive-Sync support, the monitor ensures minimal motion blur, reduced input lag, and tear-free gameplay. Fast-paced titles feel incredibly responsive and smooth, especially in esports mode.</p><h3>Stunning 4K IPS Visuals</h3><p>The UHD IPS panel delivers 1.07 billion colors with wide color gamut coverage, ensuring accurate and lifelike visuals. HDR Ready support enhances contrast and brightness, making games and movies more immersive and visually rich.</p><h3>Advanced Connectivity &amp; Console Support</h3><p>Equipped with HDMI 2.1 and DisplayPort 1.4a, the MSI MAG 275UPD E14 supports next-gen consoles like PS5 and Xbox Series X|S with VRR and high refresh-rate gaming. This ensures smooth performance across both PC and console setups.</p><h3>Ergonomic &amp; User-Friendly Design</h3><p>The monitor features full ergonomic adjustability including height, tilt, swivel, and pivot. A 5-way joystick and one-click Dual Mode switch make navigation and mode switching quick and effortless, enhancing usability.</p><h3>Modern Design &amp; Professional Build</h3><p>With a durable MAG-series build, anti-glare coating, and slim bezels, the monitor fits perfectly into gaming or professional setups. It also includes VESA mount support for flexible installation.</p><p>Buy the MSI MAG 275UPD E14 27-inch 288Hz Dual Mode 4K UHD Gaming Monitor from International Office Solution in Bangladesh with official 3-year warranty and competitive pricing.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>27\"</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>Panel Type</td><td>IPS</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>Normal: 3840 x 2160 (UHD)<br>Dual Mode: 1920 x 1080 (FHD)</td></tr><tr><td>Pixel pitch(MM)</td><td>0.1554 (H) x 0.1554 (V)</td></tr><tr><td>Display Surface</td><td>Anti-glare</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>Viewing Angle</td><td>178°(H) / 178°(V)</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>SDR: 250 cd/m²</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1500:1 (Typ.)</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>Normal: 144Hz<br>Dual Mode: 288Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Color Support</td><td>1.07B, 10 bits (8 bits + FRC)</td></tr><tr><td>Color Gamut</td><td>Adobe RGB / DCI-P3 / sRGB: 84% / 90% / 130% (CIE1976 Standard)</td></tr><tr><td>Response Time</td><td>1ms MPRT</td></tr><tr><td>HDR</td><td>HDR Ready</td></tr><tr><td>Curvature</td><td>Flat</td></tr><tr><td>Others Features</td><td>Signal Frequency:<br>UHD: 106.1~318.2KHz (H) / 48~144Hz (V)<br>FHD: 106.1~318.2KHz (H) / 48~288Hz (V)<br>DCR: 100000000:1<br>Supported Resolution &amp; Refresh Rate:<br>1080p: 60Hz and 120Hz<br>1440p: 60Hz and 120Hz<br>2160p: 60Hz and 120Hz<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Video Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Low Blue Light</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>G-Sync Support</td><td>Adaptive-Sync<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Audio Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Speaker (Built In)</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Speaker Output</td><td>2W x2</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connectivity</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Display Port</td><td>1x DisplayPort 1.4a (HBR3)</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>2x HDMI 2.1 (4K@144Hz)</td></tr><tr><td>Audio Jack</td><td>1x Headphone Out<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Mechanical Design</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Tilt</td><td>-5° ~ 20°</td></tr><tr><td>Swivel</td><td>-30° ~ 30°</td></tr><tr><td>Pivot</td><td>-90° ~ 90°</td></tr><tr><td>Height Adjustment</td><td>0~130 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Vesa Wall Mount</td><td>100 x 100 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Security Locker</td><td>Kensington Lock</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>With Stand: 613.3 x 227.9 x 534.2mm (24.1 x 8.9 x 21.1 inch)<br>Without Stand: 613.3 x 57.9 x 360.7mm (24.1 x 2.2 x 14.3 inch)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>6.1 kg (13.4lbs) / 8.7 kg (19.1 lbs)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>Internal Power Board</td></tr><tr><td>Voltage</td><td>100~240V, 50/60Hz<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Monitor', 62800.00, 62800.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/tWfuuriPzCudQu25gWy7Kod1r78HnRMgMmOmO6dp.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-17 06:10:19', '2026-05-17 06:10:41', 'MSI MAG 275UPD E14 27\" 4K 288Hz Dual Mode Gaming Monitor Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy MSI MAG 275UPD E14 27-inch 4K UHD Dual Mode Gaming Monitor in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features 4K 144Hz / FHD 288Hz Dual Mode, IPS panel, HDR support, HDMI 2.1, and ultra-smooth gaming performance.', 'MSI MAG 275UPD E14, MSI MAG 275UPD E14 Price in Bangladesh, MSI 4K Gaming Monitor, MSI Dual Mode Monitor, MSI 288Hz Monitor, MSI 27 Inch 4K Monitor, MSI UHD IPS Monitor BD, MSI Gaming Monitor Price BD, MSI HDR Gaming Monitor', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(47, 'MSI Modern MD272UPSW 27\" 60Hz 4K UHD Smart Monitor', 'The MSI Modern MD272UPSW 27-inch 60Hz 4K UHD Smart Monitor features a 27-inch 4K IPS display with stunning clarity, wide color gamut support, and smart connectivity options including USB-C, LAN, Wi-Fi, and Bluetooth. With HDR support, built-in Dolby Audio, and ergonomic design, it is perfect for professionals, creators, and multitasking setups.', 'msi-modern-md272upsw-27-60hz-4k-uhd-smart-monitor-1778998439', '<p>he MSI Modern MD272UPSW 27-inch 60Hz 4K UHD Smart Monitor is a premium professional-grade display designed for creators, designers, and multitasking professionals who need both high-resolution visuals and smart connectivity features. With a 27-inch IPS panel and 4K UHD (3840 × 2160) resolution, it delivers exceptional clarity, sharp detail, and vibrant color reproduction for productivity and creative workflows.</p><h3>Stunning 4K UHD IPS Display</h3><p>The 4K IPS panel ensures crystal-clear image quality with wide 178° viewing angles and accurate color reproduction. Whether you\'re editing photos, designing graphics, or working on detailed documents, the display provides sharp and consistent visuals from any angle.</p><h3>Professional Color Accuracy</h3><p>With support for 1.07 billion colors and wide color gamut coverage including sRGB, DCI-P3, and AdobeRGB ranges, the monitor is ideal for color-critical tasks such as video editing, photo retouching, and design work. HDR Ready support further enhances contrast and brightness for more realistic visuals.</p><h3>Smart Connectivity &amp; USB-C Power Delivery</h3><p>The MSI Modern MD272UPSW features versatile connectivity including HDMI, DisplayPort, USB Type-C with 65W Power Delivery, USB ports, LAN, Wi-Fi 5, and Bluetooth 5.0. This makes it a true smart monitor capable of replacing multiple workspace devices and simplifying cable management.</p><h3>Built-in Audio &amp; Smart Features</h3><p>Integrated Dolby Audio dual speakers deliver clear and immersive sound without the need for external speakers. Combined with smart connectivity features, it creates a complete all-in-one workstation experience.</p><h3>Ergonomic &amp; Flexible Design</h3><p>The monitor supports full ergonomic adjustments including tilt, swivel, pivot, and height adjustment for maximum comfort. It is also VESA mount compatible, allowing flexible setup options for any workspace.</p><p>Buy the MSI Modern MD272UPSW 27-inch 60Hz 4K UHD Smart Monitor from International Office Solution in Bangladesh with official 3-year warranty and competitive pricing.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"3\"><strong>Display Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>27\"</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>LED</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Panel Type</td><td>IPS</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>3840 x 2160 (UHD)</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Pixel pitch(MM)</td><td>596.736 (H) x 335.664 (V)</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Display Surface</td><td>Anti-glare</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Viewing Angle</td><td>178°(H) / 178°(V)</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>SDR: 300 cd/m²</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1000:1</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>60Hz</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Color Support</td><td>1.07B, 10 bits (8 bits + FRC)</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Color Gamut</td><td>Adobe RGB / DCI-P3 / sRGB: 94% / 98% / 127% (CIE1976 Standard)</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Response Time</td><td>4ms (GtG)</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>HDR</td><td>HDR Ready</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Curvature</td><td>Flat</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\"><strong>Video Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Low Blue Light</td><td>Yes</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>G-Sync Support</td><td>Adaptive-Sync<br>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\