(51, 'MSI MPG 346CQRF X24 34\" UWQHD 240Hz Curved Gaming Monitor', 'The MSI MPG 346CQRF X24 34-inch UWQHD 240Hz Curved Gaming Monitor features a 34-inch curved UWQHD display with a 240Hz refresh rate and 0.5ms response time for ultra-smooth, immersive gaming. With wide color gamut support, HDR, AI Vision, and AI Crosshair, it is perfect for competitive gamers and multitasking professionals.', 'msi-mpg-346cqrf-x24-34-uwqhd-240hz-curved-gaming-monitor-1778998622', '<p>The MSI MPG 346CQRF X24 34-inch UWQHD 240Hz Curved Gaming Monitor is a high-end ultrawide gaming display built for immersive visuals, ultra-smooth performance, and competitive gameplay. Featuring a 34-inch curved VA panel with UWQHD (3440 × 1440) resolution, it delivers sharp detail, vibrant colors, and an expansive field of view ideal for both gaming and productivity.</p><h3>Ultra-Wide 1500R Immersion</h3><p>The 1500R curved ultrawide screen wraps around your vision, creating a more natural and immersive viewing experience. The UWQHD resolution provides extra horizontal space, making it perfect for multitasking, streaming, and cinematic gaming.</p><h3>Ultra-Fast 240Hz Performance</h3><p>With a blazing 240Hz refresh rate and 0.5ms GTG response time, this monitor ensures ultra-smooth motion with minimal blur and input lag. It is optimized for competitive gaming, including FPS, racing, and esports titles where speed matters most.</p><h3>Vibrant Colors &amp; HDR Support</h3><p>Covering wide color gamuts such as DCI-P3, AdobeRGB, and sRGB, the MSI MPG 346CQRF X24 delivers rich and accurate colors. HDR support enhances contrast and brightness, making visuals more realistic and immersive in both games and creative work.</p><h3>AI-Powered Gaming Features</h3><p>Built-in AI Vision improves visibility in dark scenes, while AI Crosshair enhances aiming accuracy by dynamically adjusting the on-screen reticle. These smart features give gamers a competitive edge in fast-paced gameplay.</p><h3>Flexible Connectivity &amp; Design</h3><p>The monitor includes HDMI and DisplayPort connectivity for high-refresh-rate gaming setups and multi-device compatibility. Its slim bezel design is perfect for multi-monitor configurations, while ergonomic tilt and VESA mount support ensure flexible positioning.</p><p>Buy the MSI MPG 346CQRF X24 34-inch UWQHD 240Hz Curved Gaming Monitor from International Office Solution in Bangladesh with official 3-year warranty and competitive pricing.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>34 Inch</td></tr><tr><td>Panel Type</td><td>Rapid VA</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>UWQHD (3440 x 1440)</td></tr><tr><td>Pixel pitch(MM)</td><td>0.23175 (H) x 0.23175 (V)</td></tr><tr><td>Display Surface</td><td>Anti-Reflection</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>21:9</td></tr><tr><td>Viewing Angle</td><td>178° (H) / 178° (V)</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>SDR: 400 cd/m²<br>HDR: 400 cd/m² (Peak)</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>4000:1<br>DCR: 100000000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>240Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Color Support</td><td>1.07B, 10 bits (8 bits + FRC)</td></tr><tr><td>Color Gamut</td><td>85% / 85% / 110% (CIE1976 Standard)</td></tr><tr><td>Response Time</td><td>0.5ms (GtG, Min.)</td></tr><tr><td>HDR</td><td>DisplayHDR True Black 400</td></tr><tr><td>Curvature</td><td>1500R</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Video Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Free Sync Support</td><td>Adaptive Sync</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Audio Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Speaker (Built In)</td><td>N/A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connectivity</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Display Port</td><td>1x DisplayPort 1.4a (HBR3)</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>2x HDMI 2.1 (UWQHD@240Hz)</td></tr><tr><td>USB Port(s)</td><td>2x USB 2.0 Type-A<br>1x USB 2.0 Type-B</td></tr><tr><td>Audio Jack</td><td>1 x Headphone-out</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Mechanical Design</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Tilt</td><td>-5° ~ 20°</td></tr><tr><td>Swivel</td><td>-30° ~ 30°</td></tr><tr><td>Height Adjustment</td><td>0 ~ 110mm</td></tr><tr><td>Vesa Wall Mount</td><td>100 x 100 mm</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>808 x 278.3 x 537.9 mm<br>(31.8 x 10.9 x 21.1 inch)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>NW/GW: 7.9 kg (17.4 lbs) / 12 kg (26.4 lbs)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>Power Cable</td></tr><tr><td>Voltage</td><td>100~240V, 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>03 years Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Monitor', 73400.00, 73400.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/eZgD11FhU6T6xczDTyuPmLtCro5sFMzQFuK65yNe.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-17 06:17:02', '2026-05-17 07:02:38', 'MSI MPG 346CQRF X24 34\" UWQHD 240Hz Curved Gaming Monitor Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy MSI MPG 346CQRF X24 34-inch UWQHD 240Hz Curved Gaming Monitor in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features 240Hz refresh rate, curved ultrawide display, HDR support, AI Vision, and esports-level performanc', 'MSI MPG 346CQRF X24, MSI MPG 346CQRF X24 Price in Bangladesh, MSI 34 Inch Curved Monitor, MSI 240Hz Gaming Monitor, MSI Ultrawide Monitor BD, MSI UWQHD Monitor, MSI Gaming Monitor Price BD, MSI Curved Gaming Monitor, MSI AI Vision Monitor', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(52, 'MSI MAG 321CUPDF 31.5\" Dual Mode 4K Gaming Monitor', 'The MSI MAG 321CUPDF 31.5-inch Dual Mode 4K Gaming Monitor features a 31.5-inch curved Rapid VA display with Dual Mode (4K 160Hz / FHD 320Hz), 0.5ms response time, HDR 400, and FreeSync Premium. It delivers ultra-smooth performance, immersive visuals, and flexible gaming options for both esports and AAA titles.', 'msi-mag-321cupdf-315-dual-mode-4k-gaming-monitor-1778999122', '<p>The MSI MAG 321CUPDF 31.5-inch Dual Mode 4K Gaming Monitor is a premium high-performance display built for gamers who want both ultra-sharp 4K visuals and extreme refresh-rate performance. Featuring a 31.5-inch Rapid VA curved panel (1500R), it delivers immersive viewing, deep contrast, and smooth gameplay for both competitive and cinematic experiences.</p><h3>Dual Mode Performance (4K 160Hz / FHD 320Hz)</h3><p>This monitor’s standout feature is its Dual Mode functionality, allowing you to switch between 4K UHD at 160Hz for stunning clarity or Full HD at 320Hz for ultra-fast esports performance. This flexibility makes it ideal for both immersive AAA gaming and competitive titles.</p><h3>Ultra-Smooth Gaming Experience</h3><p>With a 0.5ms (GtG) response time and AMD FreeSync Premium support, the MSI MAG 321CUPDF ensures minimal motion blur, reduced input lag, and tear-free gameplay. Fast-paced action remains smooth and highly responsive at all times.</p><h3>Vibrant HDR Visuals &amp; Color Accuracy</h3><p>Supporting VESA DisplayHDR 400 and wide color gamuts (DCI-P3, AdobeRGB, and sRGB), this monitor delivers rich, lifelike colors with excellent contrast and brightness. It is equally suitable for gaming and creative content work.</p><h3>Immersive Curved Display</h3><p>The 1500R curvature enhances immersion by wrapping the display naturally around your field of vision. Combined with a 31.5-inch screen size, it creates a more engaging and cinematic gaming experience.</p><h3>Advanced Connectivity &amp; Design</h3><p>Equipped with HDMI 2.1, DisplayPort 1.4a, and USB Type-C with DisplayPort Alt Mode, it supports modern PCs and consoles with ease. The ergonomic stand offers height, tilt, and VESA mounting support for flexible setups.</p><p>Buy the MSI MAG 321CUPDF 31.5-inch Dual Mode 4K Gaming Monitor from International Office Solution in Bangladesh with official 3-year warranty and competitive pricing.</p><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>31.5 inch</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>Panel Type</td><td>Rapid VA</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>Normal: 3840 x 2160 (UHD)<br>Dual Mode: 1920 x 1080 (FHD)</td></tr><tr><td>Pixel pitch(MM)</td><td>0.18159(H) x 0.18159(V)</td></tr><tr><td>Display Surface</td><td>Anti-glare</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>Viewing Angle</td><td>178°(H) / 178°(V)</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>SDR: 350 cd/m2</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>3000:1 (Typ.)</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>Normal: 160Hz<br>Dual Mode: 320Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Color Support</td><td>1.07B, 10 bits (8 bits + FRC)</td></tr><tr><td>Color Gamut</td><td>Adobe RGB / DCI-P3 / sRGB: 93% / 97% / 136% (CIE1976 Standard)</td></tr><tr><td>Response Time</td><td>0.5ms (GtG, Min.)</td></tr><tr><td>HDR</td><td>VESA DisplayHDR 400</td></tr><tr><td>Curvature</td><td>Curve 1500R</td></tr><tr><td>Others Features</td><td>Dcr: 100000000:1<br>Activated Range: Normal(UHD) : 60~160hz<br>Dual (FHD) : 60~320hz</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Video Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Free Sync Support</td><td>AMD FreeSync™ Premium</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connectivity</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Display Port</td><td>1x DisplayPort 1.4a (HBR3)</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>2x HDMI 2.1 (4K@160Hz)<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>USB Type-C</td><td>1x Type-C (DP alt.) w/ PD 15W</td></tr><tr><td>Audio Jack</td><td>1 x Headphone-out</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Mechanical Design</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Tilt</td><td>-5° ~ 20°</td></tr><tr><td>Height Adjustment</td><td>0~130 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Vesa Wall Mount</td><td>100 x 100 mm</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>With stand: 710.5 x 266.6 x 643.7 mm<br>Without stand: 710.5 x 96.8 x 423.3 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>6.65 kg (14.7 lbs) / 9.62 kg (21.2 lbs)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>External Adaptor</td></tr><tr><td>Voltage</td><td>100~240V, 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>03 years Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Monitor', 88400.00, 88400.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/wnq1Oiz2v9VLCmhE4ZClSEa98cEaxAZfhjxS2rd3.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-17 06:25:22', '2026-05-17 06:53:07', 'MSI MAG 321CUPDF 31.5\" Dual Mode 4K 320Hz Gaming Monitor Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy MSI MAG 321CUPDF 31.5-inch Dual Mode 4K Gaming Monitor in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features 4K 160Hz / FHD 320Hz Dual Mode, Rapid VA panel, HDR 400, FreeSync Premium, and ultra-smooth gaming performance.', 'MSI MAG 321CUPDF, MSI MAG 321CUPDF Price in Bangladesh, MSI Dual Mode Gaming Monitor, MSI 4K 320Hz Monitor, MSI 31.5 Inch Curved Monitor, MSI VA Gaming Monitor BD, MSI Gaming Monitor Price BD, MSI HDR 400 Monitor, MSI Ultrawide Gaming Monitor', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL);
