(53, 'MSI MAG 321CUPDF, MSI MAG 321CUPDF Price in Bangladesh, MSI Dual Mode Gaming Monitor, MSI 4K 320Hz Monitor, MSI 31.5 Inch Curved Monitor, MSI VA Gaming Monitor BD, MSI Gaming Monitor Price BD, MSI HDR 400 Monitor, MSI Ultrawide Gaming Monitor', 'The MSI MPG 271QRX 26.5-inch QD-OLED 360Hz Gaming Monitor features a 26.5-inch QD-OLED WQHD display with a 360Hz refresh rate and 0.03ms response time for ultra-fast, competitive gaming. With HDR True Black 400, Quantum Dot color accuracy, and Adaptive-Sync, it delivers unmatched speed, contrast, and visual clarity.', 'msi-mag-321cupdf-msi-mag-321cupdf-price-in-bangladesh-msi-dual-mode-gaming-monitor-msi-4k-320hz-monitor-msi-315-inch-curved-monitor-msi-va-gaming-monitor-bd-msi-gaming-monitor-price-bd-msi-hdr-400-monitor-msi-ultrawide-gaming-monitor-1778999317', '<p>The MSI MPG 271QRX 26.5-inch QD-OLED 360Hz Gaming Monitor is a premium next-generation gaming display designed for esports professionals and enthusiasts who demand extreme speed, perfect contrast, and stunning visual quality. Featuring a 26.5-inch WQHD (2560 × 1440) QD-OLED panel, it delivers unmatched clarity, true blacks, and vibrant colors powered by Quantum Dot technology.</p><h3>Ultra-Fast 360Hz Performance</h3><p>With an incredible 360Hz refresh rate and ultra-low 0.03ms GTG response time, this monitor ensures lightning-fast responsiveness and near-instant pixel transitions. It provides a serious competitive advantage in fast-paced esports titles such as FPS, racing, and fighting games.</p><h3>Stunning QD-OLED Visual Quality</h3><p>The QD-OLED panel combines OLED deep blacks with Quantum Dot color enhancement, producing over a billion rich colors and exceptional contrast. DisplayHDR True Black 400 further enhances shadow detail and brightness precision for a more realistic gaming experience.</p><h3>Smooth &amp; Tear-Free Gameplay</h3><p>Adaptive-Sync technology synchronizes the monitor with your GPU, eliminating screen tearing and stuttering. Combined with the ultra-fast refresh rate, gameplay remains fluid and visually consistent even in intense action scenes.</p><h3>Premium Connectivity &amp; Design</h3><p>Equipped with HDMI 2.1, DisplayPort 1.4a, and headphone-out support, the MSI MPG 271QRX ensures compatibility with modern PCs and consoles. Its anti-reflection coating reduces glare, while the sleek design enhances immersion.</p><h3>Next-Level Gaming Experience</h3><p>Quantum Dot enhancement and intelligent processing deliver over one billion colors with exceptional accuracy and clarity. Every frame appears sharper, smoother, and more immersive, making it ideal for both competitive gaming and cinematic experiences.</p><p>Buy the MSI MPG 271QRX 26.5-inch QD-OLED 360Hz Gaming Monitor from International Office Solution in Bangladesh with official 3-year warranty and competitive pricing.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>26.5 inch</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>Panel Type</td><td>QD-OLED</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>2560x1440 (WQHD)</td></tr><tr><td>Pixel pitch(MM)</td><td>0.2292(H) x 0.2292(V)</td></tr><tr><td>Display Surface</td><td>Anti-Reflection</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>Viewing Angle</td><td>178°(H) / 178°(V)</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>250 (Typ.)</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1500000:1 (Typ.)</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>360Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Color Support</td><td>1.07B ,10 bits</td></tr><tr><td>Color Gamut</td><td>ADOBE RGB / DCI-P3 / SRGB: 98% / 99% / 138%</td></tr><tr><td>Response Time</td><td>0.03ms (GtG)</td></tr><tr><td>HDR</td><td>DisplayHDR True Black 400</td></tr><tr><td>Curvature</td><td>Flat</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Video Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Low Blue Light</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>G-Sync Support</td><td>Adaptive Sync</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Audio Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Speaker (Built In)</td><td>N/A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connectivity</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Display Port</td><td>1 x DisplayPort 1.4a</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>2 x HDMI™ 2.1 (WQHD@360Hz)</td></tr><tr><td>USB Port(s)</td><td>2 x USB 2.0 Type-A<br>1 x USB 2.0 Type-B</td></tr><tr><td>USB Type-C</td><td>1 x Type-c (DP alt.) w/PD 90W</td></tr><tr><td>Audio Jack</td><td>1 x Headphone-out</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Mechanical Design</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Tilt</td><td>-5° ~ 15°</td></tr><tr><td>Swivel</td><td>-30° ~ 30°</td></tr><tr><td>Pivot</td><td>-90° ~ 90°</td></tr><tr><td>Height Adjustment</td><td>0 ~ 110mm</td></tr><tr><td>Vesa Wall Mount</td><td>100 x 100 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Security Locker</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>With stand: 610 x 242 x 422 mm<br>Without stand: 610 x 69 x 356 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>8.3 / 10.9 kg</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>Power Cable</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>POWER INPUT: 50~60Hz<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Voltage</td><td>100~240V</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>03 years</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Monitor', 132000.00, 132000.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/erpCbcVGm32yVNhdd5xN58KCeqZnLb4fggiAof2m.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-17 06:28:37', '2026-05-17 06:28:37', 'MSI MPG 271QRX 26.5\" QD-OLED 360Hz Gaming Monitor Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy MSI MPG 271QRX 26.5-inch QD-OLED 360Hz Gaming Monitor in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features QD-OLED panel, 360Hz refresh rate, 0.03ms response time, HDR True Black 400, and ultra-smooth esports performance.', 'MSI MPG 271QRX, MSI MPG 271QRX Price in Bangladesh, MSI QD-OLED Monitor, MSI 360Hz Gaming Monitor, MSI 27 Inch Gaming Monitor, MSI WQHD OLED Monitor BD, MSI Esports Monitor, MSI HDR Gaming Monitor, MSI Ultra Fast Gaming Monitor', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(54, 'MSI MPG 271QR QD-OLED X50 26.5\" 2K WQHD 500Hz 0.03ms Gaming Monitor With AI Sensor', 'The MSI MPG 271QR QD-OLED X50 26.5-inch WQHD 500Hz Gaming Monitor features a 26.5-inch QD-OLED WQHD display with an extreme 500Hz refresh rate and 0.03ms response time for unmatched esports performance. With DisplayHDR True Black 500, AI Care Sensor, ClearMR 21000, and next-gen connectivity, it delivers elite-level speed and visual clarity.', 'msi-mpg-271qr-qd-oled-x50-265-2k-wqhd-500hz-003ms-gaming-monitor-with-ai-sensor-1778999498', '<p>he MSI MPG 271QR QD-OLED X50 26.5-inch WQHD 500Hz Gaming Monitor is a cutting-edge esports-grade display designed for extreme performance, ultra-high refresh rates, and elite visual clarity. Featuring a 26.5-inch QD-OLED panel with WQHD (2560 × 1440) resolution, it delivers exceptional contrast, true blacks, and incredibly vibrant colors for next-level gaming immersion.</p><h3>Extreme 500Hz Esports Performance</h3><p>With an industry-leading 500Hz refresh rate and ultra-fast 0.03ms GTG response time, this monitor provides unmatched motion clarity and near-instant responsiveness. It is built for competitive players who demand maximum speed and precision in fast-paced esports titles.</p><h3>QD-OLED Visual Excellence</h3><p>The QD-OLED panel combines OLED’s perfect blacks with Quantum Dot color enhancement, delivering ultra-rich colors, 99% DCI-P3 coverage, and Delta E ≤ 2 accuracy. DisplayHDR True Black 500 ensures deep contrast, bright highlights, and cinematic realism.</p><h3>Advanced Motion Clarity &amp; AI Features</h3><p>VESA ClearMR 21000 certification and OLED Care 3.0 help reduce motion blur and prevent burn-in for long-term durability. The AI Care Sensor intelligently detects user presence to optimize power usage and panel protection automatically.</p><h3>Next-Gen Connectivity</h3><p>Equipped with HDMI 2.1, DisplayPort 2.1a, and USB Type-C with high power delivery, the monitor supports next-generation PCs and consoles with ultra-high bandwidth and low-latency performance. It is also Adaptive-Sync and G-Sync compatible for tear-free gameplay.</p><h3>Smart &amp; Future-Ready Design</h3><p>Windows Dynamic Lighting certification allows synchronized RGB control across devices, while ergonomic adjustments and modern design ensure comfort and flexibility for long gaming sessions.</p><p>Buy the MSI MPG 271QR QD-OLED X50 26.5-inch WQHD 500Hz Gaming Monitor from International Office Solution in Bangladesh with official 3-year warranty and competitive pricing.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>26.5\"</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>Panel Type</td><td>QD-OLED</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>2560 x 1440 (WQHD)</td></tr><tr><td>Pixel pitch(MM)</td><td>0.2292 (H) x 0.2292 (V)</td></tr><tr><td>Display Surface</td><td>Anti-Reflection</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>Viewing Angle</td><td>178°(H) / 178°(V)</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>SDR: 300<br>HDR: 515 (Typ.) (True Black 500 with 10% APL)<br>1000 (Typ.) (Peak 1000 with 3% APL)</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1500000:1 (Typ.)</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>500Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Color Support</td><td>1.07B ,10 bits</td></tr><tr><td>Response Time</td><td>0.03ms (GtG)</td></tr><tr><td>HDR</td><td>DisplayHDR True Black 500</td></tr><tr><td>Curvature</td><td>Flat</td></tr><tr><td>Others Features</td><td>Adobe RGB / DCI-P3 / sRGB: 98% / 99% / 138% (CIE1976 Standard)<br>Signal Frequency: 832.5~835 KHz(H) / 48~500 Hz(V)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Video Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>G-Sync Support</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Free Sync Support</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Audio Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Speaker (Built In)</td><td>N/A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connectivity</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Display Port</td><td>1x DisplayPort 2.1a (UHBR20)</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>2x HDMI 2.1 (WQHD@500Hz)</td></tr><tr><td>USB Port(s)</td><td>2x USB 5Gbps Type-A<br>1x USB 5Gbps Type-B</td></tr><tr><td>USB Type-C</td><td>1x Type-C (DP alt.) w/ 98W PD</td></tr><tr><td>Audio Jack</td><td>1 x Headphone-out</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Mechanical Design</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Tilt</td><td>-5° ~ 15°</td></tr><tr><td>Swivel</td><td>-30° ~ 30°</td></tr><tr><td>Pivot</td><td>-90° ~ 90°</td></tr><tr><td>Height Adjustment</td><td>0 ~ 110mm</td></tr><tr><td>Vesa Wall Mount</td><td>100 x 100 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Security Locker</td><td>Kensington Lock</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>With stand: 609.3 x 241.9 x 416.1 mm (23.9 x 9.52 x 16.38 inch)<br>Without stand: 609.3 x 72.3 x 373.9 mm (23.9 x 2.84 x 14.7 inch)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>(NW / GW) 8.4kg (18.5 lbs) / 12.9kg (28.4 lbs)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>Internal Power Board</td></tr><tr><td>Voltage</td><td>100~240V, 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>03 years Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Monitor', 153900.00, 153900.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/8V7emsLEOeVtvlPs68balUaghyKg4nLvjvZ8rvEv.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-17 06:31:38', '2026-05-17 06:50:38', 'MSI MPG 271QR QD-OLED X50 26.5\" 500Hz Gaming Monitor Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy MSI MPG 271QR QD-OLED X50 26.5-inch WQHD 500Hz Gaming Monitor in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features QD-OLED panel, 500Hz refresh rate, 0.03ms response time, HDR True Black 500, AI Care Sensor, and esports-level performance.', 'MSI MPG 271QR X50, MSI MPG 271QR X50 Price in Bangladesh, MSI 500Hz Gaming Monitor, MSI QD-OLED Monitor, MSI WQHD Gaming Monitor BD, MSI 27 Inch Esports Monitor, MSI Ultra Fas