(55, 'MSI MPG 272URX QD-OLED 27\" 240Hz UHD 4K Gaming Monitor', 'The MSI MPG 272URX QD-OLED 27-inch 240Hz 4K Gaming Monitor features a 27-inch QD-OLED 4K UHD display with a 240Hz refresh rate and 0.03ms response time for elite-level gaming performance. With HDR True Black 400, wide color gamut accuracy, HDMI 2.1, and DisplayPort 2.1a, it delivers unmatched clarity, speed, and immersion.', 'msi-mpg-272urx-qd-oled-27-240hz-uhd-4k-gaming-monitor-1778999739', '<p>The MSI MPG 272URX QD-OLED 27-inch 240Hz 4K Gaming Monitor is a premium next-generation gaming display built for enthusiasts who demand ultra-sharp 4K resolution, extreme refresh rates, and exceptional QD-OLED visual quality. Featuring a 27-inch UHD (3840 × 2160) QD-OLED panel, it delivers stunning clarity, perfect blacks, and vibrant colors for both competitive gaming and creative workflows.</p><h3>Ultra-Crisp 4K QD-OLED Visuals</h3><p>The QD-OLED panel combines OLED’s perfect black levels with Quantum Dot color enhancement, offering 99% DCI-P3 and 98% AdobeRGB coverage. With DisplayHDR True Black 400 and up to 1000 nits peak brightness, visuals appear lifelike, detailed, and highly immersive.</p><h3>Ultra-Smooth 240Hz Performance</h3><p>With a 240Hz refresh rate and ultra-fast 0.03ms GTG response time, this monitor ensures incredibly fluid motion with near-instant pixel response. It is ideal for fast-paced esports gaming as well as high-fidelity AAA experiences.</p><h3>Tear-Free &amp; Responsive Gameplay</h3><p>G-Sync Compatible and Adaptive-Sync support ensure smooth, stutter-free gameplay by synchronizing refresh rates with the GPU. This eliminates screen tearing and enhances overall responsiveness during intense gaming sessions.</p><h3>Next-Gen Connectivity</h3><p>Equipped with HDMI 2.1 (4K 240Hz support), DisplayPort 2.1a (UHBR20), and USB Type-C with 98W Power Delivery, the MSI MPG 272URX is fully prepared for modern gaming PCs, laptops, and next-gen consoles.</p><h3>Ergonomic &amp; Premium Design</h3><p>The monitor features full ergonomic adjustability including height, tilt, swivel, and pivot, along with VESA mount compatibility. Its anti-glare coating ensures comfortable viewing in various lighting conditions.</p><p>Buy the MSI MPG 272URX QD-OLED 27-inch 240Hz 4K Gaming Monitor from International Office Solution in Bangladesh with official 3-year warranty and competitive pricing.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>27 Inch</td></tr><tr><td>Panel Type</td><td>QD-OLED</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>3840x2160 (UHD)</td></tr><tr><td>Pixel pitch(MM)</td><td>0.153 (H) x 0.153 (V)</td></tr><tr><td>Display Surface</td><td>Anti-glare</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>Viewing Angle</td><td>178°(H) / 178°(V)</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>SDR: 250<br>HDR: 450 (Typ.) (True Black 400 with 10% APL)<br>1000 (Typ.) (Peak 1000 with 3% APL)</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1500000:1 (Typ.)</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>240Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Color Support</td><td>1.07B, 10 bits (8 bits + FRC)</td></tr><tr><td>Color Gamut</td><td>Adobe RGB / DCI-P3 / sRGB: 98% / 99% / 138% (CIE1976 Standard)</td></tr><tr><td>Response Time</td><td>0.03ms (GtG)</td></tr><tr><td>HDR</td><td>DisplayHDR True Black 400</td></tr><tr><td>Curvature</td><td>Flat</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Video Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Low Blue Light</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>G-Sync Support</td><td>G-Sync Compatible</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Audio Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Speaker (Built In)</td><td>N/A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connectivity</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Display Port</td><td>1x DisplayPort 2.1a (UHBR20)</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>2x HDMI 2.1 (UHD@240Hz)</td></tr><tr><td>USB Port(s)</td><td>2x USB 5Gbps Type-A<br>1x USB 5Gbps Type-B</td></tr><tr><td>USB Type-C</td><td>1x Type-C (DP al