(56, 'MSI MPG 321URX 31.5\" QD-OLED 4K UHD 240Hz Gaming Monitor', 'The MSI MPG 321URX 31.5-inch QD-OLED 4K UHD 240Hz Gaming Monitor features a 31.5-inch QD-OLED 4K UHD display with a 240Hz refresh rate and 0.03ms response time for elite gaming performance. With HDR True Black 400, Adaptive-Sync, HDMI 2.1, and Quantum Dot color accuracy, it delivers unmatched clarity, speed, and immersion.', 'msi-mpg-321urx-315-qd-oled-4k-uhd-240hz-gaming-monitor-1778999895', '<p>The MSI MPG 321URX 31.5-inch QD-OLED 4K UHD 240Hz Gaming Monitor is a flagship-level gaming display designed for enthusiasts who demand the highest level of visual clarity, speed, and immersion. Featuring a 31.5-inch QD-OLED panel with 4K UHD (3840 × 2160) resolution, it delivers breathtaking detail, perfect blacks, and ultra-vibrant colors powered by Quantum Dot technology.</p><h3>Stunning 4K QD-OLED Visuals</h3><p>The QD-OLED panel combines OLED’s perfect black levels with Quantum Dot color enhancement, delivering over a billion colors with exceptional accuracy and depth. With DisplayHDR True Black 400 support, it produces deep contrast, bright highlights, and cinematic realism.</p><h3>Ultra-Smooth 240Hz Performance</h3><p>With a 240Hz refresh rate and ultra-fast 0.03ms GTG response time, the MSI MPG 321URX ensures buttery-smooth motion and near-instant responsiveness. It is ideal for fast-paced esports titles as well as immersive AAA gaming experiences.</p><h3>Tear-Free &amp; Responsive Gameplay</h3><p>Adaptive-Sync technology synchronizes the display with your GPU to eliminate screen tearing and stuttering, ensuring fluid and consistent gameplay even during intense action sequences.</p><h3>Premium Connectivity Options</h3><p>The monitor includes HDMI 2.1 ports, DisplayPort 1.4a, and a headphone-out jack, offering wide compatibility with gaming PCs, laptops, and next-gen consoles.</p><h3>Immersive Gaming Experience</h3><p>Anti-reflection coating, ultra-wide color gamut, and Quantum Dot enhancement ensure 