etups.</p><h3>OLED Protection &amp; Smart Features</h3><p>OLED Care 2.0 helps reduce burn-in risk through pixel shifting and brightness optimization, extending panel lifespan. AI Navigator provides intelligent on-screen controls for quick adjustments and optimized viewing settings.</p><h3>Premium Design &amp; Build Quality</h3><p>A CNC aluminum frame adds durability and a premium aesthetic, while the ergonomic stand allows height, tilt, swivel, and pivot adjustments for maximum comfort.</p><p>Buy the MSI MPG 322URX QD-OLED 31.5-inch 4K UHD 240Hz Gaming Monitor from International Office Solution in Bangladesh with official 3-year warranty and competitive pricing.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>31.5 inch</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>Panel Type</td><td>QD-OLED</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>4K UHD (3840x2160)</td></tr><tr><td>Pixel pitch(MM)</td><td>0.1814 (H) x 0.1814 (V)</td></tr><tr><td>Display Surface</td><td>Anti-Reflection</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>Viewing Angle</td><td>178°(H) / 178°(V)</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>SDR: 250<br>HDR: 450 (Typ.) (True Black 400 with 10% APL)<br>1000 (Typ.) (Peak 1000 with 3% APL)</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1500000:1 (Typ.)<br>Dynamic Contrast Ratio: (100000000:1)</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>240Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Color Support</td><td>1.07B ,10 bits</td></tr><tr><td>Color Gamut</td><td>ADOBE RGB / DCI-P3 / SRGB: 98% / 99% / 138% (CIE1976 Standard)</td></tr><tr><td>Response Time</td><td>0.03ms (GtG)</td></tr><tr><td>HDR</td><td>DisplayHDR True Black 400</td></tr><tr><td>Curvature</td><td>Flat</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Video Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Low Blue Light</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>G-Sync Support</td><td>G-Sync Compatible</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Audio Features</strong