></td></tr><tr><td>Speaker (Built In)</td><td>N/A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connectivity</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Display Port</td><td>1 x DisplayPort 2.1a (UHBR200)</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>2 x HDMI 2.1 (UHD@240Hz)</td></tr><tr><td>USB Port(s)</td><td>2x USB 5Gbps Type-A<br>1x USB 5Gbps Type-B</td></tr><tr><td>USB Type-C</td><td>1x Type-C (DP alt.) w/ 98W PD</td></tr><tr><td>Audio Jack</td><td>1 x Headphone-out</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Mechanical Design</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Tilt</td><td>-5° ~ 15°</td></tr><tr><td>Swivel</td><td>-30° ~ 30°</td></tr><tr><td>Pivot</td><td>-10° ~ 10°</td></tr><tr><td>Height Adjustment</td><td>0 ~ 110mm</td></tr><tr><td>Vesa Wall Mount</td><td>100 x 100 mm</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>With stand: 718 x 242 x 483mm, 28.2 x 9.5 x 19.0 inch<br>Without stand: 718 x 69 x 418 mm, (28.2 x 2.7 x 16.4 inch)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>9.6 kg ( 21.1 lbs) / 12.9 kg ( 28.4 lbs)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>Power Cable</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>POWER INPUT: 50~60Hz<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Voltage</td><td>100~240V</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>03 years Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Monitor', 182900.00, 182900.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/pLT8T4X9zHIDJT9UkaXcPf0rAGwMnjxg4HCpzTLL.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-17 06:41:20', '2026-05-17 06:41:20', 'MSI MPG 322URX QD-OLED 31.5\" 4K 240Hz Gaming Monitor Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy MSI MPG 322URX QD-OLED 31.5-inch 4K UHD 240Hz Gaming Monitor in Bangladesh from International Office Solution.', 'MSI MPG 322URX, MSI MPG 322URX Price in Bangladesh, MSI 31.5 Inch 4K Monitor, MSI QD-OLED Gaming Monitor, MSI 240Hz Gaming Monitor, MSI UHD OLED Monitor BD, MSI HDR True Black Monitor, MSI