 Gaming Monitor Price BD, MSI Esports Monitor', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(60, 'Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRH8 Core i5 13th Gen 8GB RAM 15.6\" FHD Military Grade Laptop With FreeDOS', 'Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRH8 Core i5 13th Gen 15.6\" FHD Laptop features an Intel Core i5-13420H processor, 8GB LPDDR5 RAM, and 512GB SSD for fast and smooth performance. The 15.6\" Full HD display, Dolby Audio speakers, Wi-Fi 6 connectivity, and military-grade durable design make it ideal for office work, study, and everyday multitasking. Comes with a 2-year warranty (Battery & Adapter 1 Year) from International Office Solution.', 'lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15irh8-core-i5-13th-gen-8gb-ram-156-fhd-military-grade-laptop-with-freedos-1779003749', '<p>Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRH8 Core i5 13th Gen 15.6\" FHD Military Grade Laptop</p><p>The Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRH8 laptop, powered by a 13th Gen Intel Core i5 processor, delivers an excellent balance of performance, reliability, and portability in a sleek and modern design. It features an Intel Core i5-13420H processor with 8 cores (4 performance + 4 efficiency) and boost speeds up to 4.6GHz, ensuring smooth multitasking and efficient everyday computing. Integrated Intel UHD Graphics and 8GB LPDDR5-4800 RAM further enhance productivity for office work, study, and entertainment.</p><p>This laptop includes a fast 512GB SSD, providing ample storage for files and applications, with upgrade support up to 1TB. The 15.6-inch Full HD TN display offers sharp visuals at 1920×1080 resolution, while dual front-facing speakers with Dolby Audio deliver immersive sound for work and entertainment.</p><p>Built with a lightweight PC-ABS body and military-grade durability, the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 is designed for portability and long-term reliability. Connectivity options include Wi-Fi 6, Bluetooth 5.2, USB-C, USB 3.2 Gen 1, HDMI, and a card reader for versatile usage. Security features like firmware TPM 2.0 and a camera privacy shutter help protect your data and privacy.</p><p>Buy Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRH8 Core i5 13th Gen Laptop from International Office Solution In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRH8 Core i5 13th Gen 15.6\" FHD Military Grade Laptop from International Office Solution. We offer a wide collection of the latest Lenovo laptops. Order online or visit your nearest International Office Solution shop to get the best price. This laptop comes with a 2-year warranty (Battery &amp; Adapter 1 Year).</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Processor</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor Brand</td><td>Intel</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Model</td><td>Core i5-13420H<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Generation</td><td>13th Generation</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Frequency</td><td>P-core 2.1 / 4.6GHz, E-core 1.5 / 3.4GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Core</td><td>8 (4 Performance cores, 4 Efficient cores)</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Thread</td><td>12</td></tr><tr><td>CPU Cache</td><td>12MB</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Chipset</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Chipset Model</td><td>Intel SoC Platform</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>15.6\"</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>TN</td></tr><tr><td>Display Resolution</td><td>FHD (1920x1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Display Features</td><td>250nits Anti-glare</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Memory</strong></td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>8GB soldered<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>RAM Type</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td>Removable</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Bus Speed</td><td>4800 MHz</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Storage</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Storage Type</td><td>M.2 2242 PCIe 4.0x4 NVMe SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Storage Capacity</td><td>512GB</td></tr><tr><td>Extra M.2 Slot</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Supported SSD Type</td><td>M.2 2242 SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Storage Upgrade</td><td>Up to 1TB</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Graphics</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Model</td><td>Intel UHD Graphics</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Memory</td><td>Shared</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Type</td><td>Integrated</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Keyboard &amp; TouchPad</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Keyboard Type</td><td>Non-backlit, English (EU)</td></tr><tr><td>TouchPad</td><td>Buttonless Mylar surface multi-touch touchpad, supports Precision TouchPad (PTP), 69 x 104 mm (2.72 x 4.09 inches)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Camera &amp; Audio</strong></td></tr><tr><td>WebCam</td><td>FHD 1080p</td></tr><tr><td>Speaker</td><td>User-facing stereo speakers, 1.5W x2</td></tr><tr><td>Microphone</td><td>2x, Array Microphone</td></tr><tr><td>Audio Features</td><td>Optimized with Dolby Audio</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Ports &amp; Slots</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Optical Drive</td><td>N/A</td></tr><tr><td>Card Reader</td><td>SD Card Reader</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI Port</td><td>1x HDMI 1.4</td></tr><tr><td>USB 3 Port</td><td>2x USB 3.2 Gen 1</td></tr><tr><td>USB Type-C / Thunderbolt Port</td><td>1x USB-C 3.2 Gen 1 (support data transfer, Power Delivery and DisplayPort 1.2)</td></tr><tr><td>Headphone &amp; Microphone Port</td><td>1x Headphone / microphone combo jack (3.5mm)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Network &amp; Connectivity</strong></td></tr><tr><td>LAN</td><td>N/A</td></tr><tr><td>WiFi</td><td>Wi-Fi 6, 11ax 2x2</td></tr><tr><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Bluetooth 5.2</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Security</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Fingerprint Sensor</td><td>N/A</td></tr><tr><td>Camera Privacy Shutter</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Security Chip</td><td>Firmware TPM 2.0 Enabled</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Software</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Operating System</td><td>Free DOS</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Battery Type</td><td>Integrated</td></tr><tr><td>Battery Capacity</td><td>47Wh</td></tr><tr><td>Adapter Type</td><td>65W Round Tip (3-pin)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Arctic Grey</td></tr><tr><td>Dimensions</td><td>359.3 x 235 x 17.9 mm (14.15 x 9.25 x 0.70 inches)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>Starting at 1.62 kg (3.57 lbs)</td></tr><tr><td>Body Material</td><td>PC-ABS (Top), PC-ABS (Bottom)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Other Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Other Features</td><td>MIL-STD-810H military test passed (21 test items)<br>TÜV Rheinland Low Blue Light (Software Solution)<br>Green Certifications:<br>ENERGY STAR 8.0<br>EPEAT Silver Registered<br>ErP Lot 6<br>ErP Lot 26<br>RoHS compliant</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty Details</td><td>02 years Limited Warranty (Terms &amp; Conditions Apply As Per Lenovo)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Laptop', 73900.00, 74000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/DwVpgrBnKN0gKdOTDWxZL2JD1NMFHtJc4FF41oaC.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-17 07:42:29', '2026-05-17 07:42:29', 'Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRH8 Core i5 13th Gen 15.6\" FHD Laptop Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRH8 Core i5 13th Gen 15.6\" FHD Military Grade Laptop at best price in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features 8GB RAM, 512GB SSD, Wi-Fi 6, Dolby Audio & 2-Year Warranty.', 'Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRH8 Lenovo Core i5 13th Gen Laptop Lenovo 15.6 inch FHD Laptop Lenovo Laptop Price in Bangladesh Lenovo Slim 3 i5 13420H Laptop', NULL, 13, NULL, NULL);
