(61, 'Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 14ARP10 Ryzen 5 7535HS 14\" WUXGA Laptop With FreeDos', 'Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 14ARP10 Ryzen 5 7535HS 14\" WUXGA Laptop features an AMD Ryzen 5 7535HS processor, 8GB DDR5 RAM (expandable), and 512GB PCIe 4.0 SSD for fast performance. The 14\" WUXGA IPS display, Wi-Fi 6, Bluetooth 5.3, Dolby Audio, and MIL-STD-810H durability make it perfect for work, study, and daily multitasking. Comes with a 2-year warranty (Battery & Adapter 1 Year) from International Office Solution.', 'lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-14arp10-ryzen-5-7535hs-14-wuxga-laptop-with-freedos-1779004250', '<p><strong>Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 14ARP10 Ryzen 5 7535HS 14\" WUXGA Laptop With FreeDOS</strong></p><p>The Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 14ARP10 laptop is powered by the AMD Ryzen 5 7535HS processor with 6 cores and 12 threads, delivering smooth multitasking, fast application loading, and dependable performance with boost speeds up to 4.55GHz. Integrated AMD Radeon 660M Graphics handle everyday visuals, streaming, and light creative tasks with ease, making this laptop ideal for both work and entertainment.</p><p>This Lenovo laptop features 8GB DDR5-4800 soldered RAM along with an extra DDR5 SODIMM slot that supports expansion up to 24GB, ensuring long-term flexibility. The fast 512GB PCIe 4.0 NVMe SSD provides quick boot times and fast file access, while dual M.2 PCIe 4.0 slots support future storage expansion up to 1TB per slot.</p><p>The 14-inch WUXGA IPS display offers a 1920×1200 resolution, 300 nits brightness, anti-glare coating, and a 90.1% screen-to-body ratio for sharp visuals and comfortable viewing. Dolby Audio optimized stereo speakers, dual-array microphones, and an HD 720p webcam with privacy shutter enhance communication and entertainment experiences.</p><p>Connectivity includes Wi-Fi 6, Bluetooth 5.3, USB-A, USB-C with Power Delivery &amp; DisplayPort, HDMI, and an SD card reader. With an aluminum top cover, MIL-STD-810H durability, Microsoft Pluton TPM 2.0 security, ENERGY S