(63, 'Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15ARP10 Ryzen 5 7535HS 15.3\" WUXGA Laptop', 'Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15ARP10 Ryzen 5 7535HS 15.3\" WUXGA Laptop comes with an AMD Ryzen 5 7535HS processor, 8GB DDR5 RAM (expandable up to 24GB), and 512GB PCIe 4.0 SSD for fast and smooth performance. The 15.3\" WUXGA IPS display, Wi-Fi 6, Bluetooth 5.3, Dolby Audio, MIL-STD-810H durability, and modern connectivity make it ideal for work, study, and everyday multitasking. Includes a 2-year warranty (Battery & Adapter 1 Year) from International Office Solution.', 'lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15arp10-ryzen-5-7535hs-153-wuxga-laptop-1779005049', '<p><strong>Description</strong><br><strong>Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15ARP10 Ryzen 5 7535HS 15.3\" WUXGA Laptop</strong></p><p>The Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15ARP10 laptop is powered by the AMD Ryzen 5 7535HS processor with 6 cores and 12 threads, delivering fast and responsive performance with boost speeds up to 4.55GHz. It is designed for smooth multitasking, productivity tasks, light content creation, and everyday computing. Integrated AMD Radeon 660M Graphics ensures clear visuals for streaming, presentations, and creative work, while the AMD SoC platform enhances efficiency and system stability.</p><p>This laptop comes with 8GB DDR5-4800 RAM in dual-channel configuration (8GB soldered + 8GB SODIMM) and supports memory expansion up to 24GB, offering flexibility for future upgrades. Storage is handled by a fast 512GB PCIe 4.0 NVMe SSD with support for dual M.2 slots, enabling additional SSD upgrades for more storage capacity and faster performance.</p><p>The 15.3-inch WUXGA IPS display features a 1920×1200 resolution, 300 nits brightness, anti-glare coating, and a 90.7% screen-to-body ratio, providing an immersive and comfortable viewing experience. Dolby Audio stereo speakers, dual-array microphones, and an HD webcam with privacy shutter improve communication and entertainment.</p><p>Connectivity options include Wi-Fi 6, Bluetooth 5.3, USB-A, USB-C with Power De