(66, 'Asus Vivobook Go 15 E1504TA Intel N150 15.6\" FHD Laptop', 'he Asus Vivobook Go 15 E1504TA combines reliable performance, modern design, and essential productivity features for everyday users. Powered by the Intel Processor N150 with 8GB LPDDR5 RAM and a fast 512GB PCIe 4.0 SSD, this laptop ensures smooth multitasking and quick responsiveness. Its 15.6-inch Full HD anti-glare display delivers clear visuals, while Wi-Fi 6, Bluetooth 5.2, and multiple connectivity ports provide seamless connectivity. With military-grade durability, AI noise cancelation, and Windows 11 Home, it is an ideal choice for work, study, and entertainment.', 'asus-vivobook-go-15-e1504ta-intel-n150-156-fhd-laptop-1779030888', '<p>The Asus Vivobook Go 15 E1504TA is a reliable and modern laptop designed for students, professionals, and everyday users who need smooth performance, stylish portability, and dependable efficiency. Powered by the latest Intel Processor N150 with integrated Intel UHD Graphics, this laptop delivers excellent everyday computing performance for browsing, office work, online classes, entertainment, and multitasking.</p><p>Featuring a 15.6-inch Full HD display with a 1920 x 1080 resolution, the Asus Vivobook Go 15 offers crisp visuals and immersive viewing quality. The IPS-level panel with LED backlighting ensures wide viewing angles and consistent color reproduction, while the anti-glare coating reduces eye strain during long working hours. With TÜV Rheinland-certified eye care technology and 250 nits brightness, users can enjoy comfortable viewing whether working indoors or streaming content.</p><p>The laptop is equipped with 8GB LPDDR5 onboard RAM that ensures responsive multitasking and efficient performance for daily workloads. Combined with a high-speed 512GB M.2 NVMe PCIe 4.0 SSD, the system provides ultra-fast boot times, quick file transfers, and smooth application loading. Additional M.2 expansion slots also offer future storage flexibility.</p><p>Designed with portability and durability in mind, the Asus Vivobook Go 15 features a slim and lightweight chassis that is ideal for users on the move. It meets US MIL-STD 810H military-grade durability standards, ensuring dependable reliability for daily use. The backlit chiclet keyboard enhances typing comfort in low-light environments, while the precision touchpad improves navigation and productivity.</p><p>For connectivity, the laptop includes USB Type-C, USB Type-A, HDMI 1.4, DC-in, and a 3.5mm audio combo jack, allowing users to connect multiple devices with ease. Advanced wireless connectivity is supported through Wi-Fi 6 and Bluetooth 5.2 for faster and more stable networking.</p><p>The integrated 720p HD webcam with privacy shutter, built-in microphone, AI noise cancelation, and SonicMaster audio technology make this laptop ideal for online meetings, virtual learning, and video calls. Smart ASUS features like TaskFirst, Splendid, and WiFi SmartConnect further optimize system performance and user experience.</p><p>Running on Windows 11 Home, the Asus Vivobook Go 15 E1504TA provides a modern and secure computing environment with TPM security support and enhanced productivity tools.</p><p>Buy the original Asus Vivobook Go 15 E1504TA from International Office Solution in Bangladesh at a competitive price. Explore the latest ASUS laptops and enjoy reliable customer service, genuine products, and official warranty support. Order online or visit the nearest showroom today.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Processor</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor Brand</td><td>Intel</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Model</td><td>N150</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Frequency</td><td>up to 3.6 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Core</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Thread</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>CPU Cache</td><td>6MB</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>15.6-inch</td></tr><tr><td>Displ