(67, 'Asus Vivobook Go 15 E1504TA Intel N150 15.6\" FHD Laptop Cool Silver', 'The Asus Vivobook Go 15 E1504TA Cool Silver delivers dependable everyday performance with Intel Processor N150, 8GB LPDDR5 RAM, and a fast 512GB PCIe 4.0 SSD. Featuring a 15.6-inch Full HD anti-glare display, Wi-Fi 6 connectivity, backlit keyboard, and military-grade durability, this stylish Cool Silver laptop is perfect for work, study, and entertainment.', 'asus-vivobook-go-15-e1504ta-intel-n150-156-fhd-laptop-cool-silver-1779031542', '<p>The Asus Vivobook Go 15 E1504TA Cool Silver is designed to deliver reliable everyday performance with a stylish and lightweight design. Powered by the efficient Intel Processor N150 and integrated Intel UHD Graphics, this laptop is ideal for students, professionals, and home users who need smooth multitasking, entertainment, and productivity.</p><p>Featuring a sleek Cool Silver finish, the Asus Vivobook Go 15 combines modern aesthetics with practical functionality. It comes with a 15.6-inch Full HD display offering a 1920 x 1080 resolution and a 16:9 aspect ratio for sharp and vibrant visuals. The IPS-level panel with LED backlighting ensures wider viewing angles and enhanced image clarity, while the anti-glare coating helps reduce reflections for comfortable viewing during long working hours. TÜV Rheinland-certified eye care technology and 250 nits brightness further enhance visual comfort.</p><p>The laptop is equipped with 8GB LPDDR5 onboard RAM, enabling smooth multitasking and efficient daily computing performance. Its high-speed 512GB M.2 NVMe PCIe 4.0 SSD provides fast boot times, quick application loading, and ample storage for files, documents, and multimedia content. Additional M.2 expansion options allow future storage upgrades for added flexibility.</p><p>Powered by Intel Processor N150, the laptop operates with a 0.8GHz base frequency and can boost up to 3.6GHz. With 4 cores, 4 threads, and 6MB cache memory, it delivers dependable performance for office tasks, web browsing, video streaming, and online learning.</p><p>For connectivity, the Asus Vivobook Go 15 includes versatile ports such as USB Type-C, USB Type-A, HDMI 1.4, DC-in, and a 3.5mm combo audio jack. Wireless connectivity is enhanced with Wi-Fi 6 and Bluetooth 5.2 for faster and more stable internet and device connections.</p><p>The laptop also features a backlit chiclet keyboard for comfortable typing in low-light environments, along with a precision touchpad for improved navigation. A built-in 720p HD webcam with privacy shutter, integrated microphone, AI noise cancelation, and SonicMaster audio technology make it an excellent choice for video conferencing, online classes, and virtual meetings.</p><p>Built to withstand daily usage, the Asus Vivobook Go 15 meets US MIL-STD 810H military-grade durability standards and includes TPM security support for enhanced data protection. Running on Windows 11 Home, the laptop provides a modern, secure, and user-friendly computing experience.</p><p>Buy the original Asus Vivobook Go 15 E1504TA Cool Silver from International Office Solution in Bangladesh. We offer a wide collection of the latest ASUS laptops at competitive prices. Order online or visit our showroom to get genuine products with official warranty support.</p><p><strong>Warranty:</strong> 2 Years International Limited Warranty (Battery 1 Year)</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Processor</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor Brand</td><td>Intel</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Model</td><td>N150</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Frequency</td><td>up to 3.6 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Core</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Thread</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>CPU Cache</td><td>6MB</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>15.6-inch</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>IPS</td></tr><tr><td>Display Resolution</td><td>FHD (1920 x 1080)</td></tr><tr><td