y></table></figure>', 'Lqaptop', 60599.99, 60700.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/SK965qqTEmbW85H1eIH1BQJuAD3ZGkWRRXmLbTs7.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-17 15:25:42', '2026-05-17 15:25:42', 'Asus Vivobook Go 15 E1504TA Cool Silver Intel N150 15.6” FHD Laptop Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy Asus Vivobook Go 15 E1504TA Cool Silver Intel N150 15.6-inch FHD Laptop in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features 8GB RAM, 512GB SSD, Full HD display, Wi-Fi 6, Windows 11 Home, and 2 years warranty.', 'Asus Vivobook Go 15 E1504TA, Asus Vivobook Cool Silver, Intel N150 Laptop, ASUS Laptop Bangladesh, 8GB RAM 512GB SSD Laptop, Asus Vivobook Go 15 Price, Windows 11 ASUS Laptop,', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(68, 'Asus Vivobook 15 A1504VA CORE 3 100U 15.6\" FHD Laptop', 'The Asus Vivobook 15 A1504VA combines performance and portability with an Intel Core 3 100U processor, 8GB DDR5 RAM, and 512GB PCIe 4.0 SSD. Featuring a 15.6-inch Full HD anti-glare display, Wi-Fi 6, Bluetooth 5.4, Windows 11 Home, and military-grade durability, it is an excellent choice for work, study, and entertainment.', 'asus-vivobook-15-a1504va-core-3-100u-156-fhd-laptop-1779031970', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Asus Vivobook 15 A1504VA is a modern and reliable laptop built for everyday productivity, multitasking, entertainment, and professional use. Powered by the latest Intel Core 3 100U processor, this laptop delivers responsive performance and power efficiency for students, office users, freelancers, and business professionals.</p><p>Equipped with a powerful Intel Core 3 100U processor featuring up to 5.0GHz turbo frequency, 10 cores, 12 threads, and 12MB cache memory, the Asus Vivobook 15 ensures smooth operation across multiple applications. The hybrid architecture with performance and efficiency cores enhances productivity while maintaining optimized power consumption.</p><p>The laptop comes with 8GB DDR5 RAM, including onboard and removable memory support for future upgrades, allowing users to enjoy seamless multitasking and improved system responsiveness. A fast 512GB M.2 NVMe PCIe 4.0 SSD provides quick boot times, faster data access, and ample storage space for files, software, and multimedia content.</p><p>The Asus Vivobook 15 features a 15.6-inch Full HD display with 1920 × 1080 resolution, delivering sharp visuals and vibrant picture quality. The IPS-level panel ensures wider viewing angles, while the anti-glare coating minimizes reflections for comfortable viewing during extended work sessions. With 250 nits brightness, 45% NTSC color gamut, TÜV Rheinland eye-care certification, LED backlighting, and a 60Hz refresh rate, users can enjoy a comfortable and immersive viewing experience.</p><p>Integrated Intel Graphics provides smooth everyday graphics performance for streaming, office work, web browsing, and multimedia tasks. The laptop also features advanced wireless connectivity with Wi-Fi 6 and Bluetooth 5.4 for stable and high-speed connections.</p><p>For enhanced usability, the Asus Vivobook 15 includes multiple connectivity ports such as USB Type-A, USB Type-C, HDMI, and a 3.5mm audio combo jack. The chiclet keyboard and precision touchpad provide comfortable typing and accurate navigation, while the 720p HD webcam with built-in microphone supports online meetings and virtual communication.</p><p>The laptop runs on Windows 11 Home and features SonicMaster audio technology for improved sound quality during entertainment and communication. Its 42WHrs battery combined with a 45W adapter ensures reliable daily usage, while the MIL-STD 810H military-grade durability offers dependable long-term performance.</p><p>Buy the original Asus Vivobook 15 A1504VA from International Office Solution in Bangladesh. We offer genuine ASUS laptops with official warranty support at competitive prices. Order online or visit our showroom to explore the latest ASUS laptop collection.</p><p><strong>Warranty:</strong> 2 Years Brand Warranty (Battery 1 Year)</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Processor</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor Brand</td><td>Intel</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Model</td><td>CORE 3 100U</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Frequency</td><td>Up to 4.7 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Core</td><td>6 (Performance-cores-2 Efficient-cores-4)</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Thread</td><td>8</td></tr><tr><td>CPU Cache</td><td>10MB</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>15.6-Inch</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>FHD</td></tr><tr><td>Display Resolution</td><td>FHD (1920 x 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Touch Screen</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>60Hz</td><