(69, 'Asus Vivobook 15 A1504VA Core 3 100U 15.6\" FHD Laptop Cool Silver', 'The Asus Vivobook 15 A1504VA Cool Silver features an Intel Core 3 100U processor, 8GB DDR5 RAM, and 512GB PCIe 4.0 SSD for fast and efficient performance. With a 15.6-inch Full HD anti-glare display, Wi-Fi 6, Bluetooth 5.4, Windows 11 Home, and military-grade durability, it is perfect for work, study, and entertainment.', 'asus-vivobook-15-a1504va-core-3-100u-156-fhd-laptop-cool-silver-1779032529', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Asus Vivobook 15 A1504VA Cool Silver is a stylish and powerful everyday laptop designed for productivity, multitasking, online learning, and entertainment. Featuring a premium Cool Silver finish, this laptop combines elegant design with dependable performance, making it ideal for students, professionals, and home users.</p><p>Powered by the Intel Core 3 100U processor, the laptop delivers efficient and responsive computing performance with up to 5.0GHz turbo frequency. It features 10 cores, including 2 performance cores and 8 efficiency cores, along with 12 threads and 12MB cache memory, ensuring smooth multitasking and optimized power efficiency for daily workloads.</p><p>The Asus Vivobook 15 comes equipped with 8GB DDR5 RAM, including onboard memory and an additional removable memory slot for future upgrade flexibility. Combined with a high-speed 512GB M.2 NVMe PCIe 4.0 SSD, users can experience fast boot times, quicker application launches, and reliable storage performance for files, documents, and multimedia content.</p><p>Its 15.6-inch Full HD display with 1920 × 1080 resolution delivers clear and vibrant visuals for work and entertainment. The IPS-level panel offers wider viewing angles, while the anti-glare coating minimizes reflections for comfortable long-term usage. The display also features TÜV Rheinland eye-care certification, LED backlighting, 250 nits brightness, a 60Hz refresh rate, and an 82% screen-to-body ratio for an immersive viewing experience.</p><p>Integ