(70, 'Asus VivoBook 15 OLED A1505VA Core i3 13th Gen 15.6 Inch FHD Laptop', 'The Asus VivoBook 15 OLED A1505VA combines powerful 13th Gen Intel Core i3 performance with a stunning 15.6-inch Full HD OLED display. Featuring 8GB DDR4 RAM, 512GB PCIe 4.0 SSD, Wi-Fi 6E, SonicMaster audio, and military-grade durability, this stylish laptop is ideal for productivity, entertainment, and everyday computing.', 'asus-vivobook-15-oled-a1505va-core-i3-13th-gen-156-inch-fhd-laptop-1779033208', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Asus VivoBook 15 OLED A1505VA is a premium productivity and entertainment laptop designed to deliver powerful performance, stunning OLED visuals, and modern connectivity in a sleek and lightweight design. Built for students, professionals, creators, and everyday users, this laptop combines efficiency, portability, and immersive display technology for an exceptional computing experience.</p><p>Powered by the Intel Core i3-1315U 13th Generation processor, the laptop delivers reliable and responsive performance for multitasking, office applications, online learning, and multimedia usage. Featuring 6 cores with 2 performance cores and 4 efficiency cores, 8 threads, up to 4.5GHz turbo frequency, and 10MB cache memory, the processor ensures smooth operation and efficient power management for daily computing tasks.</p><p>The Asus VivoBook 15 OLED A1505VA comes with 8GB DDR4 onboard memory, which can be expanded up to 16GB using the additional memory slot, providing flexibility for future performance upgrades. A fast 512GB M.2 NVMe PCIe 4.0 SSD offers high-speed storage performance, quicker boot times, rapid application loading, and ample space for documents, software, and multimedia files.</p><p>One of the standout features of this laptop is its stunning 15.6-inch Full HD OLED display with a 1920 × 1080 resolution. The OLED panel delivers vibrant colors, deep blacks, and superior contrast for an immersive visual experience. With up to 600 nits brightness, anti-glare coating, LED backlighting, TÜV Rheinland eye-care certification, and an 84% screen-to-body ratio, users can enjoy exceptional picture quality and comfortable viewing in various lighting conditions. Whether streaming videos, editing photos, or browsing content, the OLED display enhances every visual detail.</p><p>For connectivity, the laptop supports the latest Wi-Fi 6E (802.11ax) technology for faster and more stable internet connections, along with Bluetooth 5.3 for seamless wireless device pairing. The device also includes a versatile selection of ports, including HDMI, USB 2.0 Type-A, USB 3.2 Gen 1 Type-A, USB 3.2 Gen 1 Type-C, and a 3.5mm combo audio jack for convenient peripheral connectivity.</p><p>The Asus VivoBook 15 OLED features a comfortable chiclet keyboard and precision touchpad for efficient typing and navigation. A built-in 720p HD webcam with privacy shutter ensures secure and clear video conferencing, while SonicMaster audio technology and built-in array microphones deliver enhanced sound quality and voice clarity for online communication and entertainment.</p><p>The laptop comes with Free DOS, allowing users the flexibility to install their preferred operating system. Powered by a 3-cell 50Wh battery and a compact 45W AC adapter, the laptop offers dependable portability for everyday usage. Its lightweight 1.70kg design and stylish Indie Black finish make it easy to carry for work, study, or travel.</p><p>Built with US MIL-STD 810H military-grade durability and certified by Energy Star 8.0, RoHS, and REACH standards, the Asus VivoBook 15 OLED A1505VA ensures long-lasting reliability, energy efficiency, and environmental compliance.</p><p>Buy the original Asus VivoBook 15 OLED A1505VA from International Office Solution in Bangladesh. We offer genuine ASUS laptops with official warranty support and competitive pricing. Order online or visit our showroom to explore the latest ASUS laptop collection.</p><p><strong>Warranty:</strong> 2 Years Limited Warranty (Batt