o3raBAYGf0Ms6MDRTvYz.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-17 15:53:28', '2026-05-17 15:53:28', 'Asus VivoBook 15 OLED A1505VA Core i3 13th Gen Laptop Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy Asus VivoBook 15 OLED A1505VA Core i3 13th Gen 15.6-inch FHD Laptop in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features OLED display, 8GB RAM, 512GB SSD, Wi-Fi 6E, and 2 years warranty.', 'Asus VivoBook 15 OLED A1505VA, Asus OLED Laptop Bangladesh, Core i3 13th Gen Laptop, ASUS VivoBook OLED, 8GB RAM 512GB SSD Laptop, Asus VivoBook 15 Price, OLED FHD Laptop, International Office Solution', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(71, 'Asus Vivobook 14 X1404VA Core 5 120U 14\" FHD Laptop', 'The Asus Vivobook 14 X1404VA Core 5 120U 14\" FHD Laptop combines powerful performance, portability, and modern features for everyday productivity. Powered by the Intel Core 5 120U processor with 10 cores and 12 threads, it delivers smooth multitasking and fast responsiveness. The 14-inch Full HD IPS-level anti-glare display ensures comfortable viewing, while 8GB RAM and a 512GB NVMe SSD provide quick performance and storage efficiency. Featuring Wi-Fi 6, a fingerprint sensor, backlit keyboard, and Windows 11 Home, this laptop is ideal for students, professionals, and home users.', 'asus-vivobook-14-x1404va-core-5-120u-14-fhd-laptop-1779033733', '<p>The Asus Vivobook 14 X1404VA Core 5 120U 14\" FHD Laptop is a modern and versatile device built for productivity, entertainment, and everyday multitasking. Equipped with the latest Intel Core 5 120U processor, this laptop delivers exceptional performance with speeds of up to 5.0 GHz, featuring 10 cores and 12 threads for smooth and responsive computing. Whether you are working on office projects, attending online classes, browsing the web, or streaming content, the Vivobook 14 ensures reliable and efficient performance throughout the day.</p><p>Designed with portability and comfort in mind, the laptop features a stunning 14-inch Full HD IPS-level display with a 1920 x 1080 resolution. The anti-glare panel and TÜV Rheinland-certified eye-care technology reduce eye strain during long working hours, while the LED-backlit display provides clear visuals and vibrant colors. Its slim and lightweight design makes it easy to carry, making it a perfect companion for students, professionals, and remote workers.</p><p>The Asus Vivobook 14 X1404VA comes with 8GB DDR4 RAM and a high-speed 512GB M.2 NVMe PCIe 4.0 SSD, ensuring fast boot times, quick file access, and seamless multitasking. The additional SO-DIMM slot allows future memory upgrades for enhanced performance. Integrated Intel Graphics handles daily graphics tasks smoothly, supporting video streaming, presentations, and casual creative work.</p><p>For connectivity, the laptop includes Wi-Fi 6 and Bluetooth 5.2 for faster wireless performance and stable connections. It also offers multiple ports, including USB 3.2 Gen 1 Type-A, USB Type-C, HDMI 1.4, and a 3.5mm audio combo jack, ensuring compatibility with various devices and accessories. The backlit chiclet keyboard provides comfortable typing even in low-light environments, while the fingerprint sensor integrated into the touchpad offers quick and secure login access.</p><p>Additional features such as SonicMaster audio technology, a 720p HD webcam with privacy shutter, and Windows 11 Home operating system enhance the overall user experience. Combining stylish design, dependable performance, and modern features, the Asus Vivobook 14 X1404VA is an excellent choice for users looking for a high-value laptop in Bangladesh.</p><h2><strong>Blazing Fast Performance with Intel Core 5</strong></h2><p>Powered by the Intel Core 5 120U processor, the Asus Vivobook 14 X1404VA offers impressive speed and efficiency for multitasking and demanding workloads. With up to 5.0 GHz clock speed, 10 cores, and 12 threads, users can enjoy smoother application performance, faster responsiveness, and improved productivity. From office applications to entertainment and web browsing, this laptop handles everyday computing with ease.</p><h2><strong>Stunning 14\" Full HD Display</strong></h2><p>Experience crisp visuals and immersive viewing on the 14-inch Full HD IPS-level display. Featuring a 1920 x 1080 resolution, anti-glare coating, and TÜV Rheinland eye-care certification, the screen delivers comfortable viewing for long hours. The LED-backlit panel with 250 nits brightness and a 45% NTSC color gamut ensures clear images and vibrant colors, making it ideal for work, study, and entertainment.</p><h2><strong>Buy Asus Vivobook 14 X1404VA Core 5 120U 14\" FHD Laptop from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Asus Vivobook 14 X1404VA Core 5 120U 14\" FHD Laptop from International Office Solution. We offer a wide collection of the latest Asus laptops at competitive prices. Order online or visit your nearest International Office Solution outlet to get the best deal. The Asus Vivobook 14 X1404VA comes with a 2-year brand warranty, including 1 year warranty for the battery.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Processor</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor Brand</td><td>Intel</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Model</td><td>Core 5 120U</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Frequency</td><td>Up to 5.0 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Core</td><td>10 (Performance-cores-2 Efficient-cores-8)</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Thread</td><td>12</td></tr><tr><td>CPU Cache</td><td>12MB</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>14-Inch</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>FHD</td></tr><tr><td>Display Resolution</td><td>FHD (1920 x 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Touch Screen</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Display Features</td><td>Anti-glare display<br>TÜV Rheinland-certified<br>Screen-to-body ratio: 82%<br>16:9 aspect ratio<br>LED Backlit<br>45% NTSC color gamut<br>IPS-level Panel<br>250nits</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Memory</strong></td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>8GB (on board)<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>RAM Type</td><td>DDR4 (*Dual-channel memory support requires at least one SO-DIMM module.)</td></tr><tr><td>Removable</td><td>Upgradable; Need to remove the bottom/top case<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Total RAM Slot</td><td>1x DDR4 SO-DIMM slot<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Storage</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Storage Type</td><td>M.2 NVMe PCIe 4.0 SSD<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Storage Capacity</td><td>512GB</td></tr><tr><td>Supported SSD Type</td><td>1x M.2 2280 PCIe 4.0x4<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Graphics</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Model</td><td>Intel Graphics</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Memory</td><td>Shared</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Keyboard &amp; TouchPad</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Keyboard Type</td><td>Backlit Chiclet Keyboard</td></tr><tr><td>TouchPad</td><td>Yes, Precision touchpad</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Camera &amp; Audio</strong></td></tr><tr><td>WebCam</td><td>720p HD camera</td></tr><tr><td>Speaker</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Microphone</td><td>Yes, Built-in array microphone</td></tr><tr><td>Audio Features</td><td>SonicMaster</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Ports &amp; Slots</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Optical Drive</td><td>N/A</td></tr><tr><td>Card Reader</td><td>N/A</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI Port</td><td>1x HDMI 1.4</td></tr><tr><td>USB 2 Port</td><td>1x USB 2.0 Type-A(data speed up to 480Mbps)</td></tr><tr><td>USB 3 Port</td><td>2x USB 3.2 Gen 1 Type-A (data speed up to 5Gbps)</td></tr><tr><td>USB Type-C / Thunderbolt Port</td><td>1x USB 3.2 Gen 1 Type-C (data speed up to 5Gbps)</td></tr><tr><td>Headphone &amp; Microphone Port</td><td>1x 3.5mm Combo Audio Jack</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Network &amp; Connectivity</strong></td></tr><tr><td>LAN</td><td>N/A</td></tr><tr><td>WiFi</td><td>Wi-Fi 6(802.11ax) (Dual band) 1*1</td></tr><tr><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Bluetooth 5.2 Wireless Card (*Bluetooth version may change with OS version different.)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Security</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Fingerprint Sensor</td><td>Yes (Fingerprint sensor integrated with Touchpad)</td></tr><tr><td>Camera Privacy Shutter</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Security Chip</td><td>Trusted Platform Module (Firmware TPM)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Software</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Operating System</td><td>Windows 11 Home</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Battery Type</td><td>3-cell Li-ion</td></tr><tr><td>Battery Capacity</td><td>42WHrs, 3S1P</td></tr><tr><td>Adapter Type</td><td>ø4.5, 45W AC Adapter, Output: 19V DC, 2.37A, 45W, Input: 100~240V AC 50/60Hz universal</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Quiet Blue</td></tr><tr><td>Dimensions</td><td>32.49 x 21.39 x 1.79 ~ 1.79 cm (12.79\" x 8.42\" x 0.70\" ~ 0.70\")</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>Weight (with Battery): 1.40 kg (3.09 lbs)<br>Weight (without Battery): 1.23 kg (2.71 lbs)<br><br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Body Material</td><td>LCD cover-material: Plastic<br>Top case-material: Plastic<br>Bottom case-material: Plastic</td></tr><tr><td>Part Number / MPN</td><td>X1404VA-EB262W</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Other Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Other Features</td><td>US MIL-STD 810H military-grade standard<br>System diagnosis<br>Battery health charging<br>Fan Profile<br>Splendid<br>Tru2Life<br>Function key lock<br>WiFi SmartConnect<br>Link to MyASUS<br>TaskFirst<br>Live update<br>AI Noise Canceling</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty Details</td><td>02 years International Limited Warranty (Battery 1 year)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Lqaptop', 774000.00, 77500.00, NULL, 6, 'products/thumbnails/qPho3x5l92uj4T8d6W2d4PQYr9W32P7N0sL6yoc4.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-17 16:02:13', '2026-05-17 16:02:13', 'Asus Vivobook 14 X1404VA Core 5 120U 14\" FHD Laptop Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Asus Vivobook 14 X1404VA Core 5 120U 14\" FHD Laptop from International Office Solution in Bangladesh. Powered by Intel Core 5 120U processor, 14\" FHD IPS display, 8GB RAM, and 512GB NVMe SSD for smooth multitasking, productivity, and entertainment.', 'Asus Vivobook 14 X1404VA, Asus Vivobook 14 price in Bangladesh, Core 5 120U laptop, Asus laptop Bangladesh, 14 inch FHD laptop, Intel Core 5 laptop, Asus Vivobook X1404VA, business laptop Bangladesh, student laptop, International Office Solution', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL);
