(72, 'ASUS Vivobook Go 15 L1504FA Ryzen 5 7520U 16GB RAM 15.6\" FHD Laptop With Windows 11 Home', 'The ASUS Vivobook Go 15 L1504FA Ryzen 5 7520U Laptop features 16GB LPDDR5 RAM, 512GB SSD, and a 15.6-inch Full HD display for smooth multitasking and everyday productivity. Powered by AMD Ryzen 5 processing and Windows 11 Home, it is ideal for students, professionals, and business users.', 'asus-vivobook-go-15-l1504fa-ryzen-5-7520u-16gb-ram-156-fhd-laptop-with-windows-11-home-1779108013', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>ASUS Vivobook Go 15 L1504FA Ryzen 5 7520U 16GB RAM 15.6\" FHD Laptop</strong></h2><p>The ASUS Vivobook Go 15 L1504FA Ryzen 5 7520U 16GB RAM Laptop is a modern and reliable laptop built to handle everyday productivity, entertainment, online learning, and multitasking with ease. Combining powerful AMD processing performance, fast LPDDR5 memory, and high-speed SSD storage, this laptop is an excellent solution for students, professionals, freelancers, and home users looking for a dependable device at an affordable price.</p><p>Powered by the AMD Ryzen 5 7520U processor, the laptop features 4 cores and 8 threads with a maximum boost clock speed of up to 4.3GHz. This efficient processor ensures smooth performance during multitasking, office applications, web browsing, video conferencing, and media consumption. Whether you are working on documents, attending online meetings, streaming content, or managing multiple applications simultaneously, the ASUS Vivobook Go 15 delivers responsive and stable performance.</p><p>The laptop comes equipped with 16GB LPDDR5 RAM, offering faster data processing speeds and improved power efficiency compared to previous-generation memory. This large memory capacity enables users to run multiple applications smoothly without experiencing lag or slowdown. Additionally, the 512GB M.2 NVMe PCIe 3.0 SSD provides ultra-fast boot times, quick application launches, and ample storage space for files, documents, software, and multimedia content.</p><p>The ASUS Vivobook Go 15 features a 15.6-inch Full HD (1920 x 1080) anti-glare display that delivers clear visuals and comfortable viewing for extended work or entertainment sessions. The anti-glare panel reduces reflections and eye strain, while TÜV Rheinland certification ensures lower blue light emissions for better eye comfort. With its slim-bezel design and 16:9 aspect ratio, users can enjoy an immersive viewing experience while watching videos, browsing the web, or working on creative projects.</p><p>For graphics performance, the laptop includes integrated AMD Radeon Graphics, capable of handling everyday graphics tasks, multimedia editing, casual gaming, and HD video streaming. The laptop also offers excellent connectivity features, including Wi-Fi 6E and Bluetooth 5.3, ensuring fast wireless internet connectivity and stable device pairing.</p><p>In terms of ports and expansion, the ASUS Vivobook Go 15 L1504FA includes USB Type-C, USB 3.2 Gen 1 Type-A, USB 2.0 Type-A, HDMI 1.4, and a 3.5mm audio combo jack, allowing users to connect external displays, storage devices, accessories, and peripherals conveniently.</p><p>The laptop is designed with user comfort and security in mind. It features a comfortable chiclet keyboard, precision touchpad, AI noise-canceling microphone, SonicMaster audio technology, and a 720p HD webcam with a physical privacy shutter for secure video conferencing. Firmware TPM security protection and Windows 11 Home further enhance system security and user experience.</p><p>Built to meet US MIL-STD-810H military-grade durability standards, the ASUS Vivobook Go 15 is designed to withstand daily wear and challenging conditions. Despite its durable construction, the laptop remains lightweight at approximately 1.63 kg, making it easy to carry for work, travel, or study.</p><p>The 42WHrs 3-cell Li-ion battery provides dependable battery backup for daily usage, while eco-friendly certifications such as Energy Star 8.0, RoHS, REACH, and TÜV 