(73, 'ASUS Vivobook Go 15 L1504FA Ryzen 5 7520U 15.6\" FHD Mixed Black Laptop', 'The ASUS Vivobook Go 15 L1504FA Ryzen 5 7520U 15.6\" FHD Laptop is a lightweight and powerful laptop designed for students, professionals, and everyday users. Powered by the AMD Ryzen 5 7520U processor with 16GB LPDDR5 RAM and a fast 512GB NVMe SSD, it delivers smooth multitasking and reliable performance for work, study, and entertainment. The 15.6-inch Full HD IPS-level anti-glare display provides sharp visuals and comfortable viewing, while Wi-Fi 6E, USB Type-C connectivity, and Windows 11 Home ensure a modern computing experience. With integrated AMD Radeon Graphics, a durable lightweight design, and long battery life, the ASUS Vivobook Go 15 is an excellent choice for productivity on the go.', 'asus-vivobook-go-15-l1504fa-ryzen-5-7520u-156-fhd-mixed-black-laptop-1779108416', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>ASUS Vivobook Go 15 L1504FA Ryzen 5 7520U 15.6\" FHD Laptop</strong></h2><p>The ASUS Vivobook Go 15 L1504FA Ryzen 5 7520U is a stylish and lightweight 15.6-inch Full HD laptop designed for students, professionals, freelancers, and everyday users who need dependable performance with modern features. Powered by the latest AMD Ryzen 5 7520U processor with 4 cores, 8 threads, and boost speeds up to 4.3GHz, this laptop delivers smooth multitasking, responsive computing, and efficient performance for office work, online classes, browsing, streaming, and productivity tasks.</p><p>Featuring a vibrant 15.6-inch Full HD IPS-level display with a 1920 x 1080 resolution, the laptop offers sharp visuals and comfortable viewing. The anti-glare panel, TÜV Rheinland-certified eye-care technology, LED backlighting, and 250nits brightness help reduce eye strain during extended usage. With a 16:9 aspect ratio and slim bezels, users can enjoy an immersive viewing experience whether working, studying, or watching entertainment content.</p><p>The ASUS Vivobook Go 15 L1504FA comes equipped with 16GB LPDDR5 RA