(74, 'ASUS Vivobook Go 15 L1504FA Ryzen 5 7520U 16GB RAM 15.6\" FHD Laptop', '# Short Description\r\n\r\nThe ASUS Vivobook Go 15 L1504FA Ryzen 5 7520U 16GB RAM 15.6\" FHD Laptop is a stylish and high-performance laptop designed for students, professionals, and everyday users. Powered by the AMD Ryzen 5 7520U processor with 16GB LPDDR5 RAM and a fast 512GB NVMe SSD, it delivers smooth multitasking, fast responsiveness, and reliable productivity. The 15.6-inch Full HD IPS-level anti-glare display ensures clear visuals and comfortable viewing, while integrated AMD Radeon Graphics support entertainment and casual creative tasks. Featuring Wi-Fi 6E, Bluetooth 5.3, USB Type-C connectivity, Windows 11 Home, and a lightweight portable design, the ASUS Vivobook Go 15 is an excellent choice for work, study, and everyday computing.', 'asus-vivobook-go-15-l1504fa-ryzen-5-7520u-16gb-ram-156-fhd-laptop-1779108810', '<h2>ASUS Vivobook Go 15 L1504FA Ryzen 5 7520U 16GB RAM 15.6\" FHD Laptop</h2><p>The ASUS Vivobook Go 15 L1504FA-BQ2549W laptop is designed for modern multitaskers, students, professionals, and everyday users who demand reliable performance, portability, and stylish design. Powered by the AMD Ryzen 5 7520U processor featuring 4 cores, 8 threads, and boost speeds up to 4.3GHz, this ASUS laptop delivers smooth and efficient performance for productivity, entertainment, browsing, online classes, and multitasking.</p><p>Equipped with 16GB LPDDR5 RAM and a fast 512GB M.2 NVMe PCIe 3.0 SSD, the ASUS Vivobook Go 15 ensures seamless multitasking, faster boot times, and responsive application performance. Users can easily handle office work, media streaming, light creative tasks, and daily computing without slowdown.</p><p>The laptop features a vibrant 15.6-inch Full HD IPS-level display with a 1920 x 1080 resolution, LED backlighting, anti-glare coating, and TÜV Rheinland-certified eye-care technology for comfortable long-hour usage. With 250nits brightness, 60Hz refresh rate, and a 45% NTSC color gamut, the display provides clear visuals and balanced color reproduction for work, entertainment, and casual content creation.</p><p>Powered by integrated AMD Radeon Graphics, the Vivobook Go 15 delivers reliable graphics performance for HD streaming, casual gaming, multimedia tasks, and light editing work. The slim and lightweight design makes it highly portable, ideal for users who need productivity on the go.</p><p>For enhanced convenience and connectivity, the laptop includes Wi-Fi 6E, Bluetooth 5.3, USB 3.2 Gen 1 Type-C, USB Type-A ports, HDMI 1.4, and a 3.5mm combo audio jack. The precision touchpad with ASUS NumberPad support, comfortable chiclet keyboard, and 720p HD webcam with privacy shutter further improve usability for work, online meetings, and communication.</p><p>The ASUS Vivobook Go 15 also features SonicMaster audio technology, AI noise-canceling support, TPM security, and Windows 11 Home for a modern and secure user experience. ASUS also recommends Windows 11 Pro for business users requiring advanced productivity and security features.</p><p>Combining performance, portability, and everyday usability, the ASUS Vivobook Go 15 L1504FA Ryzen 5 7520U 16GB RAM 15.6\" FHD Laptop is an excellent choice for students, professionals, freelancers, and home users looking for a dependable and stylish laptop.</p><h2>Next-Level Speed with AMD Ryzen 5</h2><p>The ASUS Vivobook Go 15 L1504FA is powered by the efficient AMD Ryzen 5 7520U processor with 4 cores, 8 threads, and speeds up to 4.3GHz. Combined with 16GB LPDDR5 RAM, the laptop delivers smooth multitasking, faster responsiveness, and dependable performance for office applications, browsing, streaming, and productivity tasks. The integrated AMD Radeon Graphics ensure clear visuals and smooth multimedia performance for everyday use.</p><h2>Brilliant FHD Visuals</h2><p>Enjoy immersive visuals on the 15.6-inch Full HD IPS-level display featuring a 1920 x 1080 resolution, anti-glare coating