(75, 'ASUS Vivobook Go 14 EB595W Ryzen 5 7520U 14\" FHD Laptop', 'The ASUS Vivobook Go 14 EB595W Ryzen 5 7520U 14\" FHD Laptop is a compact and lightweight laptop designed for students, professionals, and everyday users. Powered by the AMD Ryzen 5 7520U processor with 16GB LPDDR5 RAM and a fast 512GB NVMe SSD, it delivers smooth multitasking, fast performance, and reliable productivity. The 14-inch Full HD IPS-level anti-glare display provides clear visuals and comfortable viewing, while integrated AMD Radeon Graphics handle daily multimedia tasks with ease. With Wi-Fi 6E, Bluetooth 5.3, USB Type-C connectivity, Windows 11 Home, and military-grade durability, this ASUS laptop is a perfect balance of portability, performance, and reliability for work, study, and entertainment.', 'asus-vivobook-go-14-eb595w-ryzen-5-7520u-14-fhd-laptop-1779109235', '<h2>ASUS Vivobook Go 14 EB595W Ryzen 5 7520U 14\" FHD Laptop</h2><p>The ASUS Vivobook Go 14 EB595W Ryzen 5 7520U 14\" FHD Laptop is a compact, lightweight, and high-performance laptop designed for students, professionals, and everyday users who need reliable computing power and portability. Powered by the AMD Ryzen 5 7520U processor with 4 cores, 8 threads, and boost speeds up to 4.3GHz, this ASUS laptop delivers smooth multitasking and efficient performance for office work, online learning, entertainment, and daily productivity tasks.</p><p>Equipped with 16GB onboard LPDDR5 RAM and a fast 512GB M.2 NVMe PCIe 3.0 SSD, the ASUS Vivobook Go 14 ensures quick boot times, responsive performance, and seamless multitasking. Users can easily run multiple applications, store important files, and enjoy faster access to software and media content.</p><p>The laptop features a vibrant 14-inch Full HD IPS-level display with a 1920 x 1080 resolution, anti-glare coating, LED backlighting, and TÜV Rheinland-certified eye-care technology for comfortable long-term viewing. With 250nits brightness, a 60Hz refresh rate, and a 45% NTSC color gamut, the display offers sharp visuals and balanced colors for work, streaming, video conferencing, and entertainment.</p><p>Integrated AMD Radeon Graphics provide smooth visuals for everyday multimedia tasks, web browsing, casual gaming, and content consumption. The precision touchpad with ASUS NumberPad support and ergonomic chiclet keyboard enhance productivity and user comfort during extended work sessions.</p><p>For connectivity, the ASUS Vivobook Go 14 EB595W includes USB 3.2 Gen 1 Type-C, USB Type-A ports, HDMI 1.4, a 3.5mm audio combo jack, Wi-Fi 6E, and Bluetooth 5.3, ensuring fast wireless performance and flexible peripheral support. SonicMaster speakers, Cortana voice recognition, and an array microphone further improve communication and entertainment experiences.</p><p>Security features include firmware TPM, BIOS password protection, McAfee security support, and a webcam privacy shutter, helping protect user data and privacy. Running on Windows 11 Home, the laptop also includes ASUS MyASUS software features such as AI noise cancellation, system diagnosis, battery health charging, and fan mode optimization for a smarter computing experience.</p><p>Built with military-grade durability standards, eco-friendly certifications, and a lightweight portable design, the ASUS Vivobook Go 14 EB595W Ryzen 5 7520U Laptop is an excellent balance of performance, reliability, and mobility for modern users.</p><h2>Buy ASUS Vivobook Go 14 EB595W Ryzen 5 7520U 14\" FHD Laptop from International Office Solution</h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original ASUS Vivobook Go 14 EB595W Ryzen 5 7520U 14\" FHD Laptop from International Office Solution. We offer a wide collection of the latest ASUS laptops at competitive prices. Order online or visit International Office Solution to get genuine ASUS products with official warranty support and reliable customer service.</p><p>The ASUS Vivobook Go 14 EB595W Ryzen 5 7520U 14\" FHD Laptop comes with 2 Years Warranty (Battery 1 Yea