(77, 'ASUS Vivobook 15 A1504VA Core 5 120U 16GB RAM 15.6\" FHD Laptop', 'The ASUS Vivobook 15 A1504VA Core 5 120U 15.6\" FHD Laptop is a powerful and reliable everyday laptop designed for students, professionals, and home users. Powered by the Intel Core 5 120U processor with 16GB DDR4 RAM and a fast 512GB PCIe 4.0 NVMe SSD, it delivers smooth multitasking, fast responsiveness, and efficient performance for work, study, and entertainment. The 15.6-inch Full HD IPS-level anti-glare display with TÜV Rheinland certification ensures comfortable viewing, while Wi-Fi 6, USB Type-C, and a fingerprint sensor add modern convenience and security. With a lightweight design, durable build, and Windows 11 experience, this ASUS Vivobook is ideal for daily productivity and entertainment needs.', 'asus-vivobook-15-a1504va-core-5-120u-16gb-ram-156-fhd-laptop-1779111053', '<h2>ASUS Vivobook 15 A1504VA Core 5 120U 15.6\" FHD Laptop</h2><p>The ASUS Vivobook 15 A1504VA Core 5 120U 15.6\" FHD Laptop is a modern, reliable, and performance-focused notebook designed for students, professionals, and everyday users. Powered by the latest Intel Core 5 120U processor with 10 cores, 12 threads, and turbo speeds up to 5.0GHz, this ASUS laptop delivers smooth and efficient performance for multitasking, office applications, web browsing, streaming, and light creative workloads.</p><p>Equipped with 16GB DDR4 dual-channel RAM and a fast 512GB PCIe 4.0 NVMe SSD, the ASUS Vivobook 15 ensures quick boot times, responsive system performance, and ample storage for documents, software, and multimedia files. Users can easily switch between multiple applications without lag, making it ideal for productivity and daily computing needs.</p><p>The laptop features a 15.6-inch Full HD IPS-level display with 1920 x 1080 resolution, anti-glare coating, 250 nits brightness, and TÜV Rheinland certification for reduced eye strain. With an 84% screen-to-body ratio and slim bezels, it delivers an immersive viewing experience for movies, work, and entertainment.</p><p>Integrated graphics support smooth visuals for everyday use, while SonicMaster audio technology, built-in speakers, and an array microphone provide clear and balanced sound for video calls, meetings, and entertainment. A 720p HD webcam with a privacy shutter ensures secure and professional video conferencing.</p><p>The ASUS Vivobook 15 A1504VA also offers modern connectivity options including Wi-Fi 6, Bluetooth 5.2, USB 3.2 Gen 1 Type-C, USB Type-A ports, HDMI 1.4, and a 3.5mm audio jack, ensuring compatibility with a wide range of devices and peripherals.</p><p>For security, this laptop includes a fingerprint sensor integrated into the touchpad, Firmware TPM, and BIOS password protection, keeping your data safe and secure. The lightweight 1.70kg design, Cool Silver finish, and MIL-STD 810H military-grade durability make it both stylish and reliable for everyday use.</p><h2>Vibrant Display</h2><p>Enjoy clear and immersive visuals on the 15.6-inch Full HD IPS-level display with anti-glare technology and TÜV Rheinland-certified eye comfort. The 84% screen-to-body ratio enhances viewing space, making it ideal for productivity, entertainment, and online meetings.</p><h2>Connectivity and Security</h2><p>Stay connected with Wi-Fi 6 and Bluetooth 5.2 for fast and stable wireless performance. The laptop includes essential ports such as USB 2.0 Type-A, USB 3.2 Gen 1 Type-A, USB Type-C, HDMI 1.4, and a 3.5mm audio jack. Security features like a fingerprint sensor, Firmware TPM, and BIOS protection ensure safe and reliable usage.</p><h2>Buy ASUS Vivobook 15 A1504VA Core 5 120U 15.6\" FHD Laptop from International Office Solution</h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original ASUS Vivobook 15 A1504VA Core 5 120U 15.6\" FHD Laptop from International Office Solution. We offer a wide collection of the latest ASUS laptops at competitive prices. Order online or visit International Office Solution to get genuine ASUS products with official warranty support and trusted customer service.</p><p>The ASUS Vivobook 15 A1504VA Core 5 120U 15.6\" FHD Laptop comes with 2 Years Limited Warranty (Battery 1 Year).</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Processor</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor Brand</td><td>Intel</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Model</td><td>Core 5-120U</td></tr><tr><td>Generation</td><td>Core Series 1</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Frequency</td><td>up to 5.0 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Core</td><td>10C (2 Performance cores, 8 Efficient cores)</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Thread</td><td>12</td></tr><tr><td>CPU Cache</td><td>12MB</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>15.6-inch</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>IPS Level</td></tr><tr><td>Display Resolution</td><td>FHD (1920x1080) LED Display<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Touch Screen</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Display Features</td><td>LED Backlit<br>Glossy display<br>TÜV Rheinland-certified<br>70% less harmful blue light<br>Screen-to-Body Ratio: 86%<br>250nits Brightness<br>PANTONE Validated<br>SGS Eye Care Display</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Memory</strong></td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td>RAM Type</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td>Removable</td><td>1 x 8GB Non-Removable,<br>1 x 8GB Removable</td></tr><tr><td>Total RAM Slot</td><td>2 x DDR4 SO-DIMM Slot</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Storage</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Storage Type</td><td>M.2 NVMe PCIe 4.0 SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Storage Capacity</td><td>512GB</td></tr><tr><td>Supported SSD Type</td><td>M.2 NVMe PCIe 4.0 SSD</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Graphics</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Model</td><td>Intel UHD Graphics</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Memory</td><td>Shared</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Type</td><td>Integrated</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Keyboard &amp; TouchPad</str