(78, 'Asus Vivobook 14 A1404VA Core 5 120U 14\" FHD Laptop', 'The Asus Vivobook 14 A1404VA Core 5 120U 14\" FHD Laptop features an Intel Core 5 120U processor, 16GB DDR5 RAM, 512GB PCIe SSD, and a stunning Full HD display for smooth multitasking and everyday productivity. Its lightweight design, modern connectivity, and reliable performance make it ideal for students, professionals, and business users.', 'asus-vivobook-14-a1404va-core-5-120u-14-fhd-laptop-1779112779', '<p>The Asus Vivobook 14 A1404VA Core 5 120U 14\" FHD Laptop is built to deliver exceptional performance, portability, and modern functionality for both personal and professional use. Featuring the advanced Intel Core 5 120U processor, this laptop provides efficient multitasking and smooth computing for office applications, browsing, content streaming, online meetings, and everyday productivity.</p><p>With its 10-core hybrid architecture, including 2 performance cores and 8 efficient cores, the processor is optimized to handle demanding workloads while maintaining excellent power efficiency. The 12-thread performance and 12MB cache allow faster processing speeds and improved responsiveness for modern applications.</p><p>The laptop includes 16GB DDR5 RAM with a combination of onboard and removable memory, allowing users to upgrade easily while enjoying smooth performance during multitasking. Whether working with spreadsheets, editing documents, attending virtual classes, or managing business tasks, the system performs efficiently without lag.</p><p>Storage performance is enhanced by the 512GB NVMe PCIe 4.0 SSD, offering faster data access, quicker startup times, and seamless application performance. Users can store essential files, software, multimedia content, and documents with ease.</p><p>The 14-inch Full HD display delivers crisp image quality and vibrant visuals with anti-glare technology for comfortable viewing. The IPS-level panel enhances viewing angles while TÜV Rheinland certification helps reduce eye strain during prolonged usage.</p><p>The Asus Vivobook 14 is designed with modern connectivity features including WiFi 6, Bluetooth 5.4, USB Type-C, HDMI, and multiple USB ports for enhanced flexibility. The lightweight and durable design makes it suitable for users who need portability for work, study, or travel.</p><p>International Office Solution offers the genuine Asus Vivobook 14 A1404VA Core 5 120U 14\" FHD Laptop with reliable customer support, authentic products, and competitive pricing in Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Processor</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor Brand</td><td>Intel</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Model</td><td>Core 5 120U</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Frequency</td><td>Up to 5.0 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Core</td><td>10 (Performance-cores-2 Efficient-cores-8)</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Thread</td><td>12</td></tr><tr><td>CPU Cache</td><td>12MB</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>14-Inch</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>FHD</td></tr><tr><td>Display Resolution</td><td>FHD (1920 x 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Touch Screen</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Display Features</td><td>Anti-glare display<br>TÜV Rheinland-certified<br>Screen-to-body ratio: 82%<br>16:9 aspect ratio<br>LED Backlit<br>45% NTSC color gamut<br>IPS-level Panel<br>250nits</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Memory</strong></td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>16GB (8GB On Board + 8GB Removable)<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>RAM Type</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td>Removable</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Total RAM Slot</td><td>2<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Max RAM Capacity</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Storage</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Storage Type</td><td>M.2 NVMe PCIe 4.0 SSD<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Storage Capacity</td><td>512GB</td></tr><tr><td>Supported SSD Type</td><td>1x M.