(79, 'Asus VivoBook 15 X1504VA Core 5 120U 16GB RAM 15.6\" FHD Laptop', 'The Asus VivoBook 15 X1504VA Core 5 120U Laptop features 16GB DDR4 RAM, 512GB PCIe 4.0 SSD, and a 15.6-inch Full HD IPS-level display for smooth multitasking and everyday productivity. Powered by Intel Core 5 processing, it is ideal for students, professionals, and business users.', 'asus-vivobook-15-x1504va-core-5-120u-16gb-ram-156-fhd-laptop-1779113799', '<p>The Asus VivoBook 15 X1504VA Core 5 120U 15.6\" FHD Laptop is engineered to provide powerful everyday performance, modern features, and reliable portability for users seeking a dependable computing solution. Combining Intel’s latest Core 5 processor technology with high-speed storage and immersive display quality, this laptop is ideal for office productivity, education, entertainment, and multitasking.</p><p>Powered by the Intel Core 5 120U processor with 10 cores and 12 threads, the laptop delivers excellent speed and efficiency for demanding workloads. Turbo frequencies up to 5.0 GHz allow smooth operation during multitasking, web browsing, office applications, online meetings, and content consumption. The advanced hybrid architecture improves both performance and power efficiency for modern users.</p><p>Equipped with 16GB DDR4 RAM, including 8GB onboard memory and additional upgrade capability, the VivoBook 15 ensures lag-free multitasking and efficient application management. The 512GB NVMe PCIe 4.0 SSD enhances system responsiveness by delivering faster startup speeds, quick software loading, and high-speed data transfer performance.</p><p>The 15.6-inch Full HD IPS-level display offers clear visuals, vibrant image quality, and wide viewing angles. Anti-glare technology reduces reflections for comfortable viewing during long work sessions, while TÜV Rheinland certification helps minimize eye strain. The slim-bezel design further enhances the visual experience for productivity and entertainment.</p><p>Integrated Intel graphics provide smooth multimedia performance, casual creative capabilities, and reliable video playback. Modern connectivity technologies such as Wi-Fi 6 and Bluetooth 5.2 ensure fast and stable wireless connections for online communication and device pairing.</p><p>The ASUS VivoBook 15 includes versatile connectivity options including USB Type-C, USB 3.2 Type-A, HDMI, and audio ports for connecting external monitors, storage devices, and accessories conveniently. Additional intelligent features such as AI noise-canceling technology, MyASUS software integration, and SonicMaster audio improve the overall user experience.</p><p>With a lightweight design, military-grade durability, ergonomic keyboard with NumPad, and HD webcam privacy shutter, the ASUS VivoBook 15 X1504VA is an excellent choice for students, professionals, remote workers, and business users who need reliable performance and portability.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Processor</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor Brand</td><td>Intel</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Model</td><td>Core 5 120U</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Frequency</td><td>up to 5.0 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Core</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Thread</td><td>12</td></tr><tr><td>CPU Cache</td><td>12MB</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>15.6-inch</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>IPS</td></tr><tr><td>Display Resolution</td><td>FHD (1920 x 1080) 16:9 aspect ratio</td></tr><tr><td>Touch Screen</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Display Features</td><td>45% NTSC color gamut<br>250nits<br>LED Backlit<br>Anti-glare display<br>TÜV Rheinland-certified</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Memory</strong></td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>16GB (8GB onboard)<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>RAM Type</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td>Removable</td><td>Upgradable; Need to remove bottom/top case<br>&nbsp;</td>