(80, 'Asus Vivobook 14 A1404VA Core 5 120U 14\" FHD Laptop', 'The Asus Vivobook 14 A1404VA Core 5 120U Laptop features 16GB DDR5 RAM, 512GB PCIe 4.0 SSD, and a 14-inch Full HD display for smooth multitasking and everyday productivity. Powered by Intel Core 5 processing, it is ideal for students, professionals, and business users.', 'asus-vivobook-14-a1404va-core-5-120u-14-fhd-laptop-1779114216', '<p>The Asus Vivobook 14 A1404VA Core 5 120U 14\" FHD Laptop combines modern performance, lightweight portability, and reliable functionality for users who need a dependable laptop for daily computing tasks. Designed for students, professionals, remote workers, and business users, this laptop delivers smooth multitasking, efficient performance, and immersive viewing in a compact form factor.</p><p>Powered by the Intel Core 5 120U processor with 10 cores and 12 threads, the laptop ensures responsive computing for multitasking, productivity applications, web browsing, and media consumption. With turbo boost speeds up to 5.0 GHz and 12MB cache memory, users can experience fast application performance and efficient workload handling.</p><p>The laptop comes equipped with 16GB DDR5 RAM, including 8GB onboard memory and an additional removable memory slot for future upgrades. This configuration allows seamless multitasking and stable performance while running multiple applications simultaneously.</p><p>Storage performance is enhanced by the 512GB NVMe PCIe 4.0 SSD, which provides ultra-fast boot times, quick file transfers, and smooth software loading. Users can store documents, multimedia files, and applications efficiently while benefiting from improved system responsiveness.</p><p>The 14-inch Full HD IPS-level display delivers crisp image quality, wide viewing angles, and reduced reflections through its anti-glare coating. TÜV Rheinland certification helps minimize eye strain during long working hours, while the slim bezel design enhances the overall viewing experience.</p><p>In