(81, 'Asus Vivobook 14 A1404VA Core 5 120U 14\" FHD Laptop Cool Silver', 'The Asus Vivobook 14 A1404VA Core 5 120U Laptop Cool Silver features 16GB DDR5 RAM, 512GB PCIe 4.0 SSD, and a 14-inch Full HD display for smooth multitasking and productivity. Powered by Intel Core 5 processing, it is ideal for students, professionals, and business users.', 'asus-vivobook-14-a1404va-core-5-120u-14-fhd-laptop-cool-silver-1779114662', '<p>The Asus Vivobook 14 A1404VA Core 5 120U 14\" FHD Laptop Cool Silver is a stylish and high-performance laptop designed for students, professionals, freelancers, and business users who require reliable computing power for daily productivity and multitasking. Powered by the latest Intel Core 5 120U processor with speeds up to 5.0 GHz, this laptop delivers fast and efficient performance for office work, online meetings, browsing, streaming, and entertainment.</p><p>The Intel Core 5 120U processor features 10 cores, including 2 performance cores and 8 efficient cores, along with 12 threads and 12MB cache to ensure smooth multitasking and responsive computing. Paired with 16GB DDR5 RAM, including 8GB onboard and 8GB removable memory, the laptop provides seamless performance and convenient upgrade flexibility for future needs.</p><p>The Asus Vivobook 14 A1404VA includes a fast 512GB M.2 NVMe PCIe 4.0 SSD, allowing quicker boot times, faster application loading, and enhanced overall system responsiveness. Its 14-inch Full HD display with 1920 x 1080 resolution delivers clear visuals and immersive viewing quality. The IPS-level anti-glare panel with 250 nits brightness and TÜV Rheinland certification ensures comfortable viewing for long hours of work or entertainment.</p><p>Integrated Intel graphics provide dependable performance for everyday multimedia tasks, HD streaming, presentations, and casual creative work. The laptop also features modern connectivity options including WiFi 6, Bluetooth 5.4, USB Type-C, HDMI, and multiple USB ports for convenien