(82, 'Asus VivoBook 15 A1504VA Intel Core 5 120U 15.6\" FHD Laptop', 'The Asus VivoBook 15 A1504VA Intel Core 5 120U Laptop features 16GB DDR5 RAM, 512GB PCIe 4.0 SSD, and a 15.6-inch Full HD display for smooth multitasking and everyday productivity. Powered by Intel Core 5 processing, it is ideal for students, professionals, and business users.', 'asus-vivobook-15-a1504va-intel-core-5-120u-156-fhd-laptop-1779114962', '<p>The Asus VivoBook 15 A1504VA Intel Core 5 120U 15.6\" FHD Laptop is a modern and powerful laptop designed for students, professionals, freelancers, and business users who need reliable performance for productivity, multitasking, and entertainment. Powered by the latest Intel Core 5 120U processor with 10 cores and 12 threads, this laptop delivers smooth and responsive performance for office applications, online meetings, browsing, content streaming, and daily workloads.</p><p>With turbo boost speeds up to 5.0 GHz and 12MB CPU cache, the Intel Core 5 processor ensures fast processing and efficient multitasking. The laptop comes equipped with 16GB DDR5 RAM, including 8GB onboard memory and an additional 8GB via a DDR5 SO-DIMM slot, allowing smooth multitasking and future upgrade flexibility.</p><p>The Asus VivoBook 15 A1504VA features a high-speed 512GB M.2 NVMe PCIe 4.0 SSD that provides rapid boot times, quick file access, and enhanced system responsiveness. Its 15.6-inch Full HD display with 1920 x 1080 resolution delivers sharp visuals and immersive viewing quality. The anti-glare panel, 250 nits brightness, and TÜV Rheinland eye-care certification ensure comfortable viewing during extended usage.</p><p>Integrated Intel UHD Graphics supports everyday multimedia tasks, HD video playback, office applications, and light creative work. The laptop also includes advanced connectivity features such as Wi-Fi 6E, Bluetooth 5.2, USB Type-C, HDMI, and multiple USB ports for flexible connectivity with peripherals and accessories.</p><p>Designed for comfort and productivity, the laptop includes a full-size chiclet keyboard with numeric keypad, precision touchpad, HD webcam with privacy shutter, AI noise-canceling technology, and SonicMaster audio for enhanced communication and multimedia experiences. Built with US MIL-STD 810H military-grade durability standards, the VivoBook 15 ensures reliable performance and long-lasting durability.</p><p>International Office Solution offers the genuine Asus VivoBook 15 A1504VA Intel Core 5 120U Laptop at competitive prices with trusted customer support in Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"3\"><strong>Processor</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor Brand</td><td>Intel</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Model</td><td>Core 5 120U</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Frequency</td><td>up to 5.0 GHz</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Core</td><td>10</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Thread</td><td>12</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>CPU Cache</td><td>12MB</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\"><strong>Display</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>15.6-inch</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>IPS</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Display Resolution</td><td>FHD (1920 x 1080) 16:9 aspect ratio</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Touch Screen</td><td>No</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>60Hz</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Display Features</td><td>TUV Rheinland-certified, Non-touch screen, (Screen-to-body ratio)84%, 250nits Brightness</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\"><strong>Memory</strong></td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>8GB Onboard + 8GB</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>RAM Type</td><td>DDR5</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Removable</td><td>Non-Removable</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Total RAM Slot</td><td>1x DDR5 SO-DIMM slot<br>*Dual-channel memory support requires at least one SO-DIMM module.<br>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colsp