(83, 'ASUS Vivobook 15 A1504VA Core 5 120U 16GB DDR5 RAM 15.6\" FHD Laptop', 'The ASUS Vivobook 15 A1504VA Core 5 120U Laptop features 16GB DDR5 RAM, 512GB PCIe 4.0 SSD, and a 15.6-inch Full HD IPS-level display for smooth multitasking and productivity. Powered by Intel Core 5 processing, it is ideal for students, professionals, and business users.', 'asus-vivobook-15-a1504va-core-5-120u-16gb-ddr5-ram-156-fhd-laptop-1779115330', '<p>The ASUS Vivobook 15 A1504VA Core 5 120U 16GB DDR5 RAM 15.6\" FHD Laptop is a powerful and stylish laptop designed for students, professionals, freelancers, and home users who need smooth performance for productivity, multitasking, and entertainment. Powered by the latest Intel Core 5 120U processor with 10 cores and 12 threads, this laptop delivers responsive computing performance with turbo speeds up to 5.0GHz for office tasks, browsing, content streaming, and light creative workloads.</p><p>Equipped with 16GB DDR5 dual-channel memory, the laptop ensures seamless multitasking and faster performance while running multiple applications simultaneously. The high-speed 512GB PCIe 4.0 NVMe SSD provides rapid boot times, fast application loading, and ample storage space for documents, multimedia files, and software.</p><p>The ASUS Vivobook 15 A1504VA features a 15.6-inch Full HD IPS-level display with 1920 x 1080 resolution, anti-glare coating, and 250 nits brightness for clear visuals and comfortable viewing. TÜV Rheinland certification helps reduce eye strain during extended usage, while the 84% screen-to-body ratio creates a more immersive viewing experience for work and entertainment.</p><p>Integrated Intel graphics support everyday multimedia tasks, HD streaming, presentations, and light creative applications. The laptop also includes Wi-Fi 6 and Bluetooth 5.2 for fast and stable wireless connectivity.</p><p>For enhanced productivity and security, the ASUS Vivobook 15 includes a precision touchpad with integrated fingerprint sensor, Firmware TPM, BIOS password protection, HD webcam with privacy shutter, and SonicMaster audio technology for clear communication and multimedia experiences.</p><p>Built with a premium Cool Silver finish and US MIL-STD 810H military-grade durability, the laptop combines portability, reliability, and modern design in a lightweight 1.70kg chassis.</p><p>International Office Solution offers the genuine ASUS Vivobook 15 A1504VA Core 5 120U 16GB DDR5 RAM Laptop with competitive pricing and trusted customer support in Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Processor</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor Brand</td><td>Intel</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Model</td><td>Core 5-120U</td></tr><tr><td>Generation</td><td>Core Series 1</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Frequency</td><td>up to 5.0 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Core</td><td>10C (2 Performance cores, 8 Efficient cores)</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Thread</td><td>12</td></tr><tr><td>CPU Cache</td><td>12MB</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>15.6-inch</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>IPS Level</td></tr><tr><td>Display Resolution</td><td>FHD (1920x1080) LED Display<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Touch Screen</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Display Features</td><td>LED Backlit<br>Glossy display<br>TÜV Rheinland-certified<br>70% less harmful blue light<br>Screen-to-Body Ratio: 86%<br>250nits Brightness<br>PANTONE Validated<br>SGS Eye Care Display</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Memory</strong></td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>16GB (8GB On board + 8GB Removable)</td></tr><tr><td>RAM Type</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td>Removable</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Total RAM Slot</td><td>2 x DDR4 SO-DIMM Slot</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Storage</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Storage Type</td><td>M.2 NVMe PCIe 4.0 SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Storage Capacity</td><td>512GB</td></