(84, 'Asus ExpertBook B1 B1503CVA Core 5 120U 15.6\" FHD Laptop', 'Asus ExpertBook B1 B1503CVA Core 5 120U 15.6\" FHD Laptop\r\nThe Asus ExpertBook B1 B1503CVA is a reliable and performance-driven business laptop designed for professionals, students, and office users. Powered by the Intel Core 5-120U processor with 10 cores and 12 threads, it delivers smooth multitasking performance for productivity tasks, online meetings, office applications, and daily computing.\r\n\r\nIt features a 15.6-inch Full HD IPS anti-glare display with 300 nits brightness for clear and comfortable viewing. With 8GB DDR5 RAM and a fast 512GB NVMe PCIe 4.0 SSD, users can enjoy responsive performance and quick data access. The laptop also includes Wi-Fi 6E, Bluetooth 5.4, a backlit keyboard, HD webcam with privacy shutter, and MIL-STD 810H military-grade durability for enhanced reliability.\r\n\r\nBuy the original Asus ExpertBook B1 B1503CVA from International Office Solution with official warranty support in Bangladesh.', 'asus-expertbook-b1-b1503cva-core-5-120u-156-fhd-laptop-1779192585', '<p>The Asus ExpertBook B1 B1503CVA Core 5 120U 15.6 Inch FHD Laptop is a modern business-class laptop engineered for professionals, corporate users, freelancers, and students who require reliable performance and long-term durability. Combining powerful hardware, a premium display, enterprise-grade security, and military-standard durability, this laptop is designed to handle demanding workloads with ease.</p><p>Powered by the latest Intel Core 5-120U processor, the ASUS ExpertBook B1 delivers fast and responsive computing performance for multitasking, productivity applications, remote collaboration, and day-to-day business operations. Its efficient hybrid architecture with 10 cores and 12 threads ensures smooth performance while maintaining power efficiency for longer battery life.</p><h2>Powerful Intel Core 5-120U Processor</h2><p>The ASUS ExpertBook B1 B1503CVA features an Intel Core 5-120U processor with up to 5.00GHz turbo frequency and 12MB cache memory. This advanced processor enables users to run multiple applications simultaneously without lag, making it ideal for office software, cloud-based applications, video conferencing, data management, and web browsing.</p><p>Whether you are working with spreadsheets, preparing presentations, attending online meetings, or managing daily workloads, the ExpertBook B1 provides a seamless and efficient user experience.</p><h2>Smooth Multitasking with DDR5 RAM and PCIe 4.0 SSD</h2><p>This laptop comes equipped with 8GB DDR5 RAM, offering faster data transfer speeds and improved power efficiency compared to previous-generation memory. The memory is also expandable, allowing users to upgrade according to future requirements.</p><p>For storage, the laptop includes a 512GB NVMe PCIe 4.0 SSD that ensures ultra-fast boot times, quick application loading, and responsive file access. The SSD technology significantly improves overall system performance and productivity.</p><h2>Immersive 15.6-Inch Full HD IPS Display</h2><p>The ASUS ExpertBook B1 features a 15.6-inch Full HD IPS display with a resolution of 1920×1080 pixels. Its anti-glare coating minimizes reflections and reduces eye strain, making it suitable for long working sessions in office or home environments.</p><p>With 300 nits brightness and wide viewing angles, users can enjoy clear visuals, vibrant colors, and sharp details whether they are working on documents, watching videos, or attending virtual meetings. The slim bezel design also gives the laptop a modern and professional appearance.</p><h2>Advanced Connectivity and Wireless Performance</h2><p>Designed for modern workplaces, the ASUS ExpertBook B1 supports the latest Wi-Fi 6E and Bluetooth 5.4 technologies for faster wireless networking and stable device connectivity.</p><p>The laptop also includes multiple connectivity options for enhanced productivity and compatibility with modern accessories and peripherals.</p><h2>Business-Focused Security and Durability</h2><p>Security and durability are key highlights of the ExpertBook B1 series. The built-in HD webcam privacy shutter helps protect user privacy during remote work and online meetings. Additionally, the backlit keyboard improves usability in low-light environments.</p><p>The laptop is tested to US MIL-STD 810H military-grade standards, ensuring superior durability and reliability under demanding conditions. This makes it an excellent choice for business professionals who travel frequently or work in dynamic environments.</p><h2>Long-Lasting Battery with USB Type-C Charging</h2><p>The ASUS ExpertBook B1 comes with a 3-cell 42Wh battery paired with a 65W USB Type-C power adapter for efficient charging and dependable battery backup throughout the workday.</p><p>Its lightweight and portable design further enhances mobility, allowing users to stay productive from anywhere.</p><h2>Ideal For</h2><ul><li>Business Professionals</li><li>Corporate Users</li><li>Students and Teachers</li><li>Freelancers</li><li>Remote Workers</li><li>Office Productivity</li><li>Online Meetings and Classes</li></ul><h2>Key Features of Asus ExpertBook B1 B1503CVA</h2><ul><li>Intel Core 5-120U Processor</li><li>10 Cores &amp; 12 Threads</li><li>Up to 5.00GHz Turbo Frequency</li><li>15.6-inch Full HD IPS Anti-Glare Display</li><li>8GB DDR5 RAM</li><li>512GB NVMe PCIe Gen4 SSD</li><li>Intel UHD Graphics</li><li>Wi-Fi 6E &amp; Bluetooth 5.4</li><li>Backlit Keyboard</li><li>HD Webcam with Privacy Shutter</li><li>MIL-STD 810H Military-Grade Durability</li><li>USB Type-C Charging Support</li><li>Free DOS Operating System</li></ul><h2>Buy Asus ExpertBook B1 B1503CVA from International Office Solution</h2><p>Purchase the original ASUS ExpertBook B1 B1503CVA Core 5 120U laptop from International Office Solution in Bangladesh at a competitive price. Enjoy official warranty support, authentic products, and professional customer service for your business and personal computing needs.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Processor</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor Brand</td><td>Intel</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Model</td><td>Core 5-120U</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Frequency</td><td>Up to 5.0GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Core</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Thread</td><td>12</td></tr><tr><td>CPU Cache</td><td>12MB</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>15.6-inch<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>IPS</td></tr><tr><td>Display Resolution</td><td>FHD (1920 x 1080)<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Display Features</td><td>Anti-glare display<br>LED Backlit<br>Aspect Ratio: 16:9<br>Screen-to-body ratio:87 %<br>300Nits</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Memory</strong></td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>8GB (SO-DIMM)</td></tr><tr><td>RAM Type</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td>Removable</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Bus Speed</td><td>5600 MT/s</td></tr><tr><td>Total RAM Slot</td><td>2 x DDR5 SO-DIMM slots</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Storage</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Storage Type</td><td>M.2 2280 NVMe PCIe 4.0 SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Storage Capacity</td><td>512GB</td></tr><tr><td>Extra M.2 Slot</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Supported SSD Type</td><td>M.2 2230 PCIe 4.0x4<br>M.2 2280 PCIe 4.0x4</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Graphics</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Model</td><td>Intel Iris Xᵉ Graphics</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Memory</td><td>Shared</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Keyboard &amp; TouchPad</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Keyboard Type</td><td>1.35mm Key-travel Backlit Keyboard</td></tr><tr><td>TouchPad</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Camera &amp; Audio</strong></td></tr><tr><td>WebCam</td><td>720p FHD camera</td></tr><tr><td>Speaker</td><td>Built-in speaker<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Microphone</td><td>Built-in array 