e>', 'Lqaptop', 87300.00, 87500.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/H6H4jolqHQ4ojxxLTErtB0DoptMchhY58CJJd97v.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-19 12:09:45', '2026-05-19 12:09:45', 'Asus ExpertBook B1 B1503CVA Core 5 120U 15.6\" FHD Business Laptop in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Asus ExpertBook B1 B1503CVA Core 5 120U 15.6-inch FHD business laptop in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features Intel Core 5-120U processor, 8GB DDR5 RAM, 512GB SSD, Wi-Fi 6E, military-grade durability, and 3 years warranty.', 'Asus ExpertBook B1 B1503CVA, Asus ExpertBook B1 price in Bangladesh, Core 5 120U laptop, Asus business laptop, 15.6 inch FHD laptop, DDR5 laptop Bangladesh, Asus ExpertBook Bangladesh, business laptop BD, Intel Core 5 laptop, International Office Solution', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(85, 'HP 15-fc0660au Ryzen 5 7520U 15.6\" FHD Laptop', 'HP 15-fc0660AU Ryzen 5 7520U 15.6\" FHD Laptop\r\nThe HP 15-fc0660AU Ryzen 5 7520U 15.6 Inch FHD Laptop is a stylish and efficient laptop designed for everyday productivity, online classes, office work, and entertainment. Powered by the AMD Ryzen 5 7520U processor with up to 4.3GHz boost clock, it delivers smooth multitasking performance for modern users.\r\n\r\nFeaturing a 15.6-inch Full HD anti-glare display, 16GB LPDDR5 RAM, and a fast 512GB PCIe NVMe SSD, this laptop ensures responsive performance and clear visuals. Integrated AMD Radeon Graphics supports daily multimedia tasks, while Wi-Fi 6, Bluetooth 5.4, a backlit keyboard, and Windows 11 Home enhance overall usability and convenience.\r\n\r\nBuy the original HP 15-fc0660AU Ryzen 5 laptop from International Office Solution with official warranty support in Bangladesh.', 'hp-15-fc0660au-ryzen-5-7520u-156-fhd-laptop-1779193168', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>HP 15-fc0660AU Ryzen 5 7520U 15.6\" FHD Laptop</strong></h2><p>The HP 15-fc0660AU Ryzen 5 7520U Laptop is a modern and reliable laptop designed for students, professionals, freelancers, and home users who need dependable performance for daily computing tasks. Combining powerful AMD Ryzen processing, fast LPDDR5 memory, a vibrant Full HD display, and sleek portability, this laptop offers an excellent balance of productivity and entertainment features.</p><p>Powered by the AMD Ryzen 5 7520U processor, the HP 15-fc0660AU delivers efficient multitasking performance for office applications, online meetings, web browsing, content streaming, and everyday workloads. Its lightweight design and long battery life make it ideal for users who need productivity on the go.</p><h2><strong>Powerful AMD Ryzen 5 7520U Performance</strong></h2><p>The HP 15-fc0660AU laptop is equipped with an AMD Ryzen 5 7520U processor featuring 4 cores, 8 threads, and up to 4.3GHz boost frequency. Combined with AMD integrated SoC architectu