includes multiple connectivity ports for enhanced productivity and compatibility with external devices.</p><h3><strong>Available Ports:</strong></h3><ul><li>USB Type-C</li><li>2 × USB Type-A</li><li>HDMI 1.4b</li><li>Headphone/Microphone Combo Jack</li><li>AC Smart Pin</li></ul><p>The laptop also features:</p><ul><li>Full-size Backlit Keyboard with Numeric Keypad</li><li>HP Imagepad Precision Touchpad</li><li>Dual Speakers</li><li>HP True Vision 720p HD Webcam</li><li>Dual Array Microphones</li></ul><p>These features ensure a comfortable user experience for office work, online communication, and virtual meetings.</p><h2><strong>Long Battery Life with Fast Charging</strong></h2><p>The HP 15-fc0660AU is powered by a 3-cell 41Wh Li-ion polymer battery that provides up to 10 hours and 30 minutes of battery backup depending on usage conditions.</p><p>With HP Fast Charge technology, the laptop can charge up to 50% in approximately 45 minutes using the included 45W Smart AC Adapter, helping users stay productive throughout the day.</p><h2><strong>Ideal For</strong></h2><ul><li>Students</li><li>Office Users</li><li>Freelancers</li><li>Online Classes and Meetings</li><li>Home and Remote Work</li><li>Everyday Productivity</li><li>Entertainment and Streaming</li></ul><h2><strong>Key Features of HP 15-fc0660AU</strong></h2><ul><li>AMD Ryzen 5 7520U Processor</li><li>Up to 4.3GHz Boost Clock</li><li>4 Cores &amp; 8 Threads</li><li>16GB LPDDR5 5500MHz RAM</li><li>512GB PCIe NVMe SSD</li><li>15.6-inch Full HD Anti-Glare Display</li><li>AMD Radeon Graphics</li><li>Wi-Fi 6 &amp; Bluetooth 5.4</li><li>Backlit Keyboard with Numpad</li><li>HP True Vision HD Webcam</li><li>Windows 11 Home</li><li>Lightweight 1.59kg Design</li><li>Fast Charging Support</li></ul><h2><strong>Buy HP 15-fc0660AU Ryzen 5 Laptop from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>Get the original HP 15-fc0660AU Ryzen 5 7520U 15.6-inch FHD laptop from International Office Solution in Bangladesh at a competitive 