(86, 'HP 15-fc0659au Ryzen 5 7520U 15.6\" FHD Laptop', 'HP 15-fc0659au Ryzen 5 7520U 15.6\" FHD Laptop\r\nThe HP 15-fc0659au Ryzen 5 7520U 15.6 Inch FHD Laptop is a stylish and dependable laptop designed for productivity, study, and entertainment. Powered by the AMD Ryzen 5 7520U processor with 4 cores and 8 threads, it delivers smooth performance for multitasking, office applications, web browsing, and online meetings.\r\n\r\nFeaturing a 15.6-inch Full HD anti-glare display, 16GB LPDDR5 RAM, and a fast 512GB PCIe NVMe SSD, the laptop ensures responsive performance and comfortable viewing. Integrated AMD Radeon Graphics, Wi-Fi 6, Bluetooth 5.4, Windows 11 Home, and a lightweight 1.59kg design make it an ideal choice for students, professionals, and home users.\r\n\r\nBuy the original HP 15-fc0659au Ryzen 5 laptop from International Office Solution with official warranty support in Bangladesh.', 'hp-15-fc0659au-ryzen-5-7520u-156-fhd-laptop-1779193538', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>HP 15-fc0659au Ryzen 5 7520U 15.6\" FHD Laptop</strong></h2><p>The HP 15-fc0659au Ryzen 5 7520U Laptop is a modern and efficient laptop built for users who need reliable everyday computing performance for work, study, entertainment, and multitasking. Combining powerful AMD Ryzen processing, fast LPDDR5 memory, responsive SSD storage, and a sleek lightweight design, this laptop offers an excellent balance of performance and portability.</p><p>Powered by the AMD Ryzen 5 7520U processor from the Ryzen 7000 Series, the HP 15-fc0659au ensures smooth performance for office tasks, online classes, web browsing, video conferencing, and entertainment. Its modern features and premium build quality make it a great choice for students, freelancers, remote workers, and professionals.</p><h2><strong>Powerful AMD Ryzen 5 7520U Processor</strong></h2><p>The HP 15-fc0659au is equipped with an AMD Ryzen 5 7520U processor featuring 4 cores, 8 threads, and up to 4.3GHz boost clock speed. With AMD integrated SoC architecture and 4MB L3 cache, the laptop delivers efficient multitasking and smooth responsiveness for daily workloads.</p><p>Whether you are creating documents, attending virtual meetings, streaming videos, or managing multiple browser tabs, the laptop provides stable and reliable performance throughout the day.</p><h2><strong>Fast LPDDR5 Memory and PCIe SSD Storage</strong></h2><p>This HP laptop comes with 16GB onboard LPDDR5 RAM running at 5500MHz, ensuring faster data transfer speeds and seamless multitasking performance. Users can switch between applications quickly and efficiently without noticeable lag.</p><p>The 512GB PCIe NVMe M.2 SSD provides fast system boot times, rapid application launches, and ample storage space for documents, software, media files, and other important data.</p><h2><strong>Immersive 15.6-Inch Full HD Display</strong></h2><p>The HP 15-fc0659au features a 15.6-inch Full HD LED display with 1920×1080 resolution for clear and detailed visuals. The anti-glare micro-edge panel reduces reflections and improves viewing comfort during long working or study sessions.</p><p>With 250 nits brightness and 45% NTSC color coverage, users can enjoy comfortable visuals for productivity, entertainment, and everyday multimedia tasks.</p><h2><strong>Elegant and Lightweight Design</strong></h2><p>Designed with portability in mind, the HP 15-fc0659au features a stylish warm gold cover with a natural silver base for a premium modern appearance. Weighing only 1.59kg, the laptop is lightweight and easy to carry for students and professionals who frequently work on the move.</p><p>Its slim profile makes it convenient for office use, classrooms, remote work environments, and travel.</p><h2><strong>Enhanced Features for Productivity and Communication</strong></h2><p>The HP 15-fc0659au includes several productivity-focused features designed to improve the user experience.</p><h3><strong>Key Features Include:</strong></h3><ul><li>Full-size Soft Gray Keyboard with Numeric Keypad</li><li>HP Imagepad with Precision Touchpad Support</li><li>HP True Vision 720p HD Webcam</li><li>Dual Array Digital Microphones</li><li>Dual Speakers</li><li>Camera Privacy Shutter</li><li>Microphone Mute Function</li></ul><p>These features make the laptop ideal for online meetings, virtual classes, communication, and daily office tasks.</p><h2><strong>Modern Connectivity Options</strong></h2><p>The laptop supports modern wireless and wired connectivity options for seamless productivity and compatibility with external devices.</p><h3><strong>Connectivity Features:</strong></h3><ul><li>Realtek Wi-Fi 6</li><li>Bluetooth 5.4</li><li>2 × USB Type-A 5Gbps Ports</li><li>1 × USB Type-C 5Gbps Data Port</li><li>HDMI 1.4b</li><li>Headphone/Microphone Combo Jack</li></ul><p>These ports and wireless technologies ensure stable internet connectivity and easy device integration.</p><h2><strong>Long Battery Backup with Fast Charging</strong></h2><p>The HP 15-fc0659au is powered by a 3-cell 41Wh Li-ion polymer battery designed to provide dependable battery life for daily computing tasks.</p><p>The included 45W Smart AC Adapter supports fast charging technology, helping users quickly recharge and stay productive throughout the day.</p><h2><strong>Ideal For</strong></h2><ul><li>Students</li><li>Office Users</li><li>Freelancers</li><li>Remote Workers</li><li>Online Classes and Meetings</li><li>Everyday Productivity</li><li>Multimedia and Entertainment</li></ul><h2><strong>Key Features of HP 15-fc0659au</strong></h2><ul><li>AMD Ryzen 5 7520U Processor</li><li>Up to 4.3GHz Boost Clock</li><li>4 Cores &amp; 8 Threads</li><li>16GB LPDDR5 5500MHz RAM</li><li>512GB PCIe NVMe SSD</li><li>15.6-inch Full HD Anti-Glare Display</li><li>AMD Radeon Graphics</li><li>Wi-Fi 6 &amp; Bluetooth 5.4</li><li>Windows 11 Home</li><li>Full-size Keyboard with Numpad</li><li>HD Webcam with Privacy Shutter</li><li>Lightweight 1.59kg Design</li><li>Fast Charging Support</li></ul><h2><strong>Buy HP 15-fc0659au Ryzen 5 Laptop from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>Purchase the original HP 15-fc0659au Ryzen 5 7520U 15.6-inch FHD laptop from International Office Solution in Bangladesh at a competitive price. Enjoy genuine products, official warranty support, and reliable customer service for your personal and professional computing needs.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Processor</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor Brand</td><td>AMD</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Model</td><td>Ryzen 5 7520U</td></tr><tr><td>Generation</td><td>7000 Series</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Frequency</td><td>Up to 4.3 GHz with Intel Turbo Boost Technology</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Core</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Thread</td><td>8</td></tr><tr><td>CPU Cache</td><td>4 MB L3 cache</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Chipset</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Chipset Model</td><td>AMD integrated SoC</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>15.6-Inch</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>Display Resolution</td><td>FHD (1920 x 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Touch Screen</td><td>N/A</td></tr><tr><td>Display Features</td><td>micro-edge, anti-glare, 250 nits, 45% NTSC</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Memory</strong></td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>16GB (onboard)</td></tr><tr><td>RAM Type</td><td>LPDDR5</td></tr><tr><td>Bus Speed</td><td>5500 MHz</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Storage</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Storage Type</td><td>PCIe NVMe M.2 SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Storage Capacity</td><td>512GB</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Graphics</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Model</td><td>AMD Radeon Graphics</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Memory</td><td>Shared</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Type</td><td>Integrated</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Keyboard &amp; TouchPad</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Keyboard Type</td><td>Full-size backlit keyboard</td></tr><tr><td>Keyboard Features</td><td>Full-size, soft gray keyboard with numeric keypad</td></tr><tr><td>TouchPad</td><td>HP Imagepad; Precision Touchpad support</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Camera &amp; Audio</strong></td></tr><tr><td>WebCam</td><td>HP True Vision 720p HD camera with temporal noise reduction</td></tr><tr><td>Speaker</td><td>Dual speakers</td></tr><tr><td>Microphone</td><td>integrated dual array digital microphones</td></tr><tr><td>Audio Features</td><td>Mic mute key</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Ports &amp; Slots</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Card Reader</td><td>N/A</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI Port</td><td>1x HDMI 1.4b</td></tr><tr><td>USB 3 Port</td><td>2x USB Type-A 5Gbps signaling rate</td></tr><tr><td>USB Type-C / Thunderbolt Port</td><td>1x USB Type-C 5Gbps signaling rate (supports data transfer only and does not support charging or external monitors)</td></tr><tr><td>Headphone &amp; Microphone Port</td><td>1x headphone/microphone combo</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Network &amp; Connectivity</strong></td></tr><tr><td>LAN</td><td>N/A</td></tr><tr><td>WiFi</td><td>Realtek Wi-Fi 6 (2×2)</td></tr><tr><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Bluetooth 5.4 Wireless Card</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Security</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Camera Privacy Shutter</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Security Chip</td><td>Trusted Platform Module (Firmware TPM) support</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Software</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Operating System</td><td>Windows 11 Home</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Battery Type</td><td>3-cell, Li-ion polymer</td></tr><tr><td>Battery Capacity</td><td>41 Wh</td></tr><tr><td>Adapter Type</td><td>45 W Smart AC power adapter</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Warm Gold cover, natural silver base and keyboard frame</td></tr><tr><td>Dimensions</td><td>35.98 x 23.6 x 1.86 cm</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>1.59 kg</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty Details</td><td>2 years Limited Warranty (Terms &amp; Conditions Apply As Per HP, Battery Adapter 1 year).</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Lqaptop', 74800.00, 74900.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/vhRPIxmPABAbH2QWidSVxMdr7lyZg7clplUhXnbJ.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-19 12:25:38', '2026-05-19 12:25:38', 'HP 15-fc0659au Ryzen 5 7520U 15.6\" FHD Laptop Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy HP 15-fc0659au Ryzen 5 7520U 15.6-inch FHD Laptop in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features 16GB LPDDR5 RAM, 512GB SSD, AMD Radeon Graphics, Wi-Fi 6, Windows 11 Home, and lightweight design.', 'HP 15-fc0659au, HP Ryzen 5 laptop Bangladesh, HP 15 laptop price in BD, Ryzen 5 7520U laptop, HP 15-fc0659au price in Bangladesh, HP FHD laptop, 16GB RAM laptop BD, HP laptop Bangladesh, International Office Solution, HP Ryzen laptop', NULL, 1, NULL, NULL);
