(87, 'HP 15-fc0658au Ryzen 5 7520U 15.6\" FHD Laptop', 'HP 15-fc0658au Ryzen 5 7520U 15.6\" FHD Laptop\r\nThe HP 15-fc0658au Ryzen 5 7520U 15.6 Inch FHD Laptop is a stylish and high-performance laptop designed for productivity, entertainment, and everyday computing. Powered by the AMD Ryzen 5 7520U processor with 4 cores and 8 threads, it delivers smooth multitasking performance for office work, online classes, browsing, and streaming.\r\n\r\nFeaturing a 15.6-inch Full HD anti-glare display, 16GB LPDDR5 RAM, and a fast 512GB PCIe NVMe SSD, this laptop ensures responsive performance and comfortable viewing. Integrated AMD Radeon Graphics, Wi-Fi 6, Bluetooth 5.4, Windows 11 Home, and a lightweight 1.59kg design make it ideal for students, professionals, and home users.\r\n\r\nBuy the original HP 15-fc0658au Ryzen 5 laptop from International Office Solution with official warranty support in Bangladesh.', 'hp-15-fc0658au-ryzen-5-7520u-156-fhd-laptop-1779194408', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>HP 15-fc0658au Ryzen 5 7520U 15.6\" FHD Laptop</strong></h2><p>The HP 15-fc0658au Ryzen 5 7520U Laptop is a modern and reliable laptop built to deliver efficient everyday performance for work, study, entertainment, and multitasking. Combining AMD Ryzen 7000 Series processing power, high-speed LPDDR5 memory, fast SSD storage, and a sleek lightweight design, this laptop offers an excellent balance of productivity and portability for modern users.</p><p>Powered by the AMD Ryzen 5 7520U processor, the HP 15-fc0658au ensures smooth performance for office applications, virtual meetings, online classes, content streaming, and daily computing tasks. Its elegant Moonlight Blue finish and lightweight design make it suitable for both professional and personal use.</p><h2><strong>Powerful AMD Ryzen 5 7520U Performance</strong></h2><p>The HP 15-fc0658au is equipped with an AMD Ryzen 5 7520U processor from the Ryzen 7000 Series featuring 4 cores, 8 threads, and up to 4.3GHz boost frequency. The processor is optimized for efficient multitasking and responsive everyday computing performance.</p><p>Whether you are managing office workloads, browsing multiple tabs, attending online meetings, or streaming content, the laptop provides smooth and dependable performance throughout the day.</p><h2><strong>Fast LPDDR5 RAM and SSD Storage</strong></h2><p>This HP laptop comes with 16GB onboard LPDDR5 RAM running at 5500MHz, enabling faster multitasking and improved system responsiveness. Users can easily run multiple applications simultaneously without interruptions.</p><p>The 512GB PCIe NVMe M.2 SSD offers fast boot times, rapid application launches, and sufficient storage space for documents, media files, software, and personal data.</p><h2><strong>15.6-Inch Full HD Anti-Glare Display</strong></h2><p>The HP 15-fc0658au features a 15.6-inch Full HD display with a 1920×1080 resolution that delivers clear and detailed visuals for work and entertainment.</p><p>The micro-edge anti-glare panel helps reduce reflections and eye strain, while 250 nits brightness and 45% NTSC color gamut ensure comfortable viewing for extended periods. The slim bezel design also enhances the laptop’s modern appearance.</p><h2><strong>Elegant Lightweight Design</strong></h2><p>Designed for portability and style, the HP 15-fc0658au comes in an attractive Moonlight Blue finish with a Natural Silver base. Weighing approximately 1.59kg, the laptop is easy to carry for students, office workers, and professionals who work on the go.</p><p>Its slim and modern design makes it suitable for office environments, classrooms, remote work, and travel.</p><h2><strong>Productivity and Communication Features</strong></h2><p>The HP 15-fc0658au includes several user-friendly features to improve productivity and communication.</p><h3><strong>Key Features Include:</strong></h3><ul><li>Full-size Soft Gray Keyboard with Numeric Keypad</li><li>HP Imagepad with Precision Touchpad Support</li><li>HP True Vision 720p HD Webcam</li><li>Dual Array Digital Microphones</li><li>Dual Speakers</li><li>Camera Privacy Shutter</li><li>Microphone Mute Function</li></ul><p>These features provide a comfortable experience for online meetings, virtual classes, communication, and daily work.</p><h2><strong>Modern Connectivity Options</strong></h2><p>The laptop supports modern connectivity technologies for seamless networking and device compatibility.</p><h3><strong>Connectivity Features:</strong></h3><ul><li>Realtek Wi-Fi 6</li><li>Bluetooth 5.4</li><li>2 × USB Type-A 5Gbps Ports</li><li>1 × USB Type-C Data Port</li><li>HDMI 1.4b</li><li>Headphone/Microphone Combo Jack</li></ul><p>These options ensure reliable connectivity for accessories, external displays, and wireless devices.</p><h2><strong>Long Battery Life with Fast Charging</strong></h2><p>The HP 15-fc0658au is powered by a 3-cell 41Wh Li-ion polymer battery designed for dependable everyday battery performance.</p><p>The included 45W Smart AC Adapter supports fast charging technology, helping users quickly recharge the device and stay productive for longer periods.</p><h2><strong>Ideal For</strong></h2><ul><li>Students</li><li>Office Users</li><li>Freelancers</li><li>Remote Workers</li><li>Online Meetings and Classes</li><li>Everyday Productivity</li><li>Multimedia Entertainment</li></ul><h2><strong>Key Features of HP 15-fc0658au</strong></h2><ul><li>AMD Ryzen 5 7520U Processor</li><li>Up to 4.3GHz Boost Clock</li><li>4 Cores &amp; 8 Threads</li><li>16GB LPDDR5 5500MHz RAM</li><li>512GB PCIe NVMe SSD</li><li>15.6-inch Full HD Anti-Glare Display</li><li>AMD Radeon Graphics</li><li>Wi-Fi 6 &amp; Bluetooth 5.4</li><li>Windows 11 Home</li><li>Full-size Keyboard with Numpad</li><li>HD Webcam with Privacy Shutter</li><li>Lightweight 1.59kg Design</li><li>Fast Charging Support</li></ul><h2><strong>Buy HP 15-fc0658au Ryzen 5 Laptop from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>Purchase the original HP 15-fc0658au Ryzen 5 7520U 15.6-inch FHD laptop