(88, 'HP 15-fd0268TU Core i5 13th Gen 15.6\" FHD Laptop with Original Windows & Office', 'HP 15-fd0268TU Core i5 13th Gen 15.6\" FHD Laptop\r\nThe HP 15-fd0268TU Core i5 13th Gen 15.6 Inch FHD Laptop is a reliable and modern laptop designed for productivity, multitasking, and entertainment. Powered by the 13th Gen Intel Core i5-1334U processor with 10 cores and 12 threads, it delivers smooth performance for office tasks, online meetings, web browsing, and daily computing.\r\n\r\nFeaturing a 15.6-inch Full HD anti-glare display, 8GB DDR4 RAM, and a fast 512GB PCIe NVMe SSD, the laptop offers responsive performance and comfortable viewing. With Intel UHD Graphics, Wi-Fi 6, Bluetooth 5.3, Windows 11 Home, and Microsoft Office pre-installed, it is an ideal choice for students, professionals, and home users.\r\n\r\nBuy the original HP 15-fd0268TU Core i5 laptop from International Office Solution with official warranty support in Bangladesh.', 'hp-15-fd0268tu-core-i5-13th-gen-156-fhd-laptop-with-original-windows-office-1779194839', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>HP 15-fd0268TU Core i5 13th Gen 15.6\" FHD Laptop</strong></h2><p>The HP 15-fd0268TU Core i5 13th Gen Laptop is a powerful and versatile laptop designed to meet the needs of students, professionals, office users, and everyday multitaskers. Combining 13th Generation Intel Core processing power, responsive SSD storage, Full HD visuals, and modern connectivity features, this laptop provides a dependable computing experience for both work and entertainment.</p><p>Powered by the Intel Core i5-1334U processor, the HP 15-fd0268TU delivers smooth multitasking performance, responsive application handling, and energy-efficient computing for modern users. Whether you are working on documents, attending online meetings, browsing the web, or streaming content, this laptop is designed to handle daily tasks efficiently.</p><h2><strong>Powerful 13th Gen Intel Core i5 Performance</strong></h2><p>The HP 15-fd0268TU is equipped with the 13th Generation Intel Core i5-1334U processor featuring 10 cores, 12 threads, and up to 4.6GHz turbo boost frequency. Combined with 12MB L3 cache and Intel Turbo Boost Technology, the processor ensures fast responsiveness and efficient multitasking performance.</p><p>Users can comfortably run office applications, online collaboration tools, web browsers, and multimedia content without experiencing slowdowns.</p><h2><strong>Fast Storage and Expandable Memory</strong></h2><p>This HP laptop comes with 8GB DDR4 RAM, which supports smooth multitasking and efficient everyday computing. The memory is expandable up to 16GB, allowing users to upgrade the system according to future performance needs.</p><p>The 512GB PCIe NVMe M.2 SSD ensures quick boot times, fast application launches, and ample storage capacity for documents, media files, software, and important data.</p><h2><strong>Immersive 15.6-Inch Full HD Display</strong></h2><p>The HP 15-fd0268TU features a 15.6-inch Full HD display with 1920×1080 resolution for clear and detailed visuals. The micro-edge anti-glare panel minimizes reflections and enhances viewing comfort during extended usage.</p><p>With 250 nits brightness and 45% NTSC color support, users can enjoy comfortable visuals for office work, streaming, browsing, and everyday multimedia entertainment.</p><h2><strong>Comfortable Design for Everyday Use</strong></h2><p>Designed for productivity and convenience, the HP 15-fd0268TU comes with a full-size soft gray keyboard featuring a dedicated numeric keypad for comfortable typing and faster data entry.</p><p>The lightweight and slim design makes the laptop easy to carry for students, office professionals, and users who need portability for daily work and study.</p><h2><strong>Enhanced Audio and Video Communication</strong></h2><p>The HP 15-fd0268TU includes modern communication features to improve virtual meetings and online collaboration.</p><h3><strong>Communication Features:</strong></h3><ul><li>HP True Vis