(89, 'HP 15-fd0333TU Core 5 120U 15.6\" FHD Laptop', 'HP 15-fd0333TU Core 5 120U 15.6\" FHD Laptop\r\nThe HP 15-fd0333TU Core 5 120U 15.6 Inch FHD Laptop is a modern and efficient laptop designed for students, professionals, and everyday users. Powered by the Intel Core 5 120U processor with 10 cores and 12 threads, it delivers smooth multitasking performance for office work, online meetings, browsing, and entertainment.\r\n\r\nFeaturing a 15.6-inch Full HD anti-glare display with 300 nits brightness, 8GB DDR4 RAM, and a fast 512GB PCIe NVMe SSD, the laptop ensures responsive performance and vibrant visuals. With Wi-Fi 6E, Bluetooth 5.3, Intel UHD Graphics, fast charging support, and modern security features, it is ideal for productivity and daily computing tasks.\r\n\r\nBuy the original HP 15-fd0333TU Core 5 laptop from International Office Solution with official warranty support in Bangladesh.', 'hp-15-fd0333tu-core-5-120u-156-fhd-laptop-1779195696', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>HP 15-fd0333TU Core 5 120U 15.6\" FHD Laptop</strong></h2><p>The HP 15-fd0333TU Core 5 120U Laptop is a reliable and performance-oriented laptop designed to meet the needs of modern professionals, students, freelancers, and home users. Combining the latest Intel Core processing technology, a vibrant Full HD display, fast SSD storage, and advanced connectivity features, this laptop delivers smooth and efficient computing for everyday productivity and entertainment.</p><p>Powered by the Intel Core 5 120U processor, the HP 15-fd0333TU offers responsive performance for multitasking, office applications, online meetings, content streaming, and daily workloads. Its sleek design and modern hardware make it an excellent choice for users seeking dependable performance and portability.</p><h2><strong>Powerful Intel Core 5 120U Performance</strong></h2><p>The HP 15-fd0333TU is powered by the Intel Core 5 120U processor featuring 10 cores, 12 threads, and up to 4.6GHz turbo boost frequency. With Intel Tu