(91, 'AMD Ryzen 3 2200G Quad-Core Processor With Radeon Vega 8 Graphics', 'AMD Ryzen 3 2200G Processor is a powerful quad-core processor with built-in Radeon Vega 8 Graphics, delivering smooth performance for everyday computing, multitasking, and casual gaming. Featuring AMD SenseMI technology, AM4 socket support, and overclocking capability, it offers excellent speed, efficiency, and value for budget PC builds.', 'amd-ryzen-3-2200g-quad-core-processor-with-radeon-vega-8-graphics-1779339871', '<p>The AMD Ryzen 3 2200G Processor is a powerful quad-core desktop processor designed for smooth everyday computing and casual gaming performance. Built with advanced AMD Ryzen technology, this processor delivers fast multitasking, responsive performance, and energy efficiency for both work and entertainment.</p><p>Featuring integrated Radeon Vega 8 Graphics, the AMD Ryzen 3 2200G allows users to enjoy HD gaming, multimedia streaming, and creative tasks without needing a dedicated graphics card. Its multi-threaded processing technology ensures smooth operation while running multiple applications simultaneously.</p><p>The processor supports the AMD AM4 socket platform and comes equipped with AMD SenseMI technology for intelligent performance optimization. It also supports overclocking, giving users the flexibility to unlock additional performance when needed.</p><p>Ideal for budget-friendly gaming PCs and productivity systems, the AMD Ryzen 3 2200G offers an excellent balance of performance, graphics capability, and value.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul><li>Quad-Core processing performance</li><li>Integrated Radeon Vega 8 Graphics</li><li>Smooth HD gaming and multimedia experience</li><li>AMD SenseMI intelligent technology</li><li>Supports AMD AM4 Socket motherboards</li><li>Overclocking support for enhanced performance</li><li>Efficient multitasking and fast responsiveness</li></ul><h3>Specifications</h3><ul><li>Processor Model: Ryzen 3 2200G</li><li>Cores: 4</li><li>Threads: 4</li><li>Graphics: Radeon Vega 8 Graphics</li><li>Socket Support: AM4</li><li>Architecture: AMD Ryzen™</li><li>Overclocking Support: Yes</li></ul>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Information</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Base Frequency</td><td>3.5GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum Turbo Frequency</td><td>3.7GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Cache</td><td>Total L2 Cache 2MB ,<br>Total L3 Cache 4MB</td></tr><tr><td>Cores</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>Threads</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>Default TDP</td><td>65W</td></tr><tr><td>cTDP</td><td>46-65W</td></tr><tr><td>Supported Technologies</td><td>AMD SenseMI Technology ,<br>AMD Ryzen™ Master Utility ,<br>Enmotus FuzeDrive™ for AMD Ryzen™ ,<br>Radeon™ Software ,<br>Radeon™ FreeSync Technology</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Graphics&nbsp;</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Processor Graphics</td><td>Radeon™ Vega 8 Processor Graphics</td></tr><tr><td>Base Frequency</td><td>1100 MHz<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Core Count</td><td>8</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty I</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>03 years (No Warranty for Fan or Cooler)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 4100.00, 4200.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/le1bKGwsUhcMS5nrhiuNTeaDdl468htNykd0h3Z6.jpg', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-21 05:04:31', '2026-05-21 05:04:31', 'Buy AMD Ryzen 3 2200G Processor with Radeon Vega 8 Graphics', 'Get the AMD Ryzen 3 2200G Quad-Core Processor with Radeon Vega 8 Graphics. Enjoy smooth multitasking, fast performance, HD gaming, and AM4 socket support for budget desktop PC builds.', 'AMD Ryzen 3 2200G, Ryzen 3 Processor, Radeon Vega 8 Graphics, AMD AM4 Processor, Quad Core Processor, Budget Gaming CPU, AMD Ryzen Desktop Processor, Ryzen 2200G Price, AMD Vega Graphics, AMD Processor Bangladesh', NULL, 4, NULL, NULL),
(92, 'REMAX RP3 Digital Voice Recorder', 'The REMAX RP3 Digital Voice Recorder is a compact and professional audio recording device designed for meetings, lectures, interviews, and voice notes. Featuring 64GB built-in storage, high-quality 1536Kbps recording, intelligent DSP noise reduction, and a long-lasting rechargeable battery, the REMAX RP3 ensures crystal-clear sound recording anytime, anywhere. Its portable design, large display, and simple controls make it ideal for students, journalists, professionals, and content creators.', 'remax-rp3-digital-voice-recorder-1779432306', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>REMAX RP3 Digital Voice Recorder</strong></h2><p>The REMAX RP3 Digital Voice Recorder is a premium portable recording device built for users who demand clear, reliable, and professional-quality audio recording. Whether you are a student recording lectures, a journalist conducting interviews, a business professional documenting meetings, or a content creator capturing ideas on the go, the REMAX RP3 is designed to deliver exceptional performance with convenience and portability.</p><p>Equipped with a massive 64GB built-in storage capacity, the recorder can store hundreds of hours of recordings without worrying about running out of space. It supports high-bitrate 1536Kbps recording, ensuring every conversation, lecture, or voice note is captured with remarkable clarity and detail.</p><p>One of the standout features of the REMAX RP3 is its intelligent DSP noise reduction technology. This advanced system minimizes unwanted background noise and enhances voice clarity, making recordings cleaner and more professional even in crowded or noisy environments.</p><p>The recorder is designed with a modern and user-friendly interface, featuring a large display screen and intuitive button controls for easy navigation. Users can quickly access recording, playback, and file management functions without complications.</p><p>Its lightweight and compact body makes it easy to carry in your pocket, backpack, or office bag, making it the perfect companion for travel, office work, classrooms, and field recording. The long-lasting rechargeable battery provides extended recording sessions, ensuring uninterrupted performance throughout the day.</p><p>The REMAX RP3 also supports convenient file transfer via USB connection, allowing users to easily move recordings to a PC or laptop for backup, editing, or sharing. Additionally, the built-in speaker and headphone jack provide instant playback support for quick review of recorded audio.</p><p>If you are searching for a dependable and stylish digital voice recorder with excellent sound quality, portability, and smart features, the REMAX RP3 Digital Voice Recorder is an outstanding choice for both personal and professional use.&nbsp;</p><p>REMAX RP3 Digital Voice Recorder Price in Bangladesh Buy the original REMAX RP3 Digital Voice Recorder at the best price in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. We offer authentic gadgets and accessories with reliable customer service, competitive pricing, and fast delivery across Bangladesh. Shop confidently for premium tech accessories, digital gadgets, office electronics, and smart devices from a trusted online gadget store.</p><p>Why Choose International Office Solution Looking for a trusted gadget shop in Bangladesh? International Office Solution is your reliable destination for genuine gadgets, office accessories, and premium technology products at affordable prices.</p><p>We provide a smooth and secure online shopping experience with fast nationwide delivery and excellent customer support. Whether you need digital voice recorders, wireless earbuds, smart gadgets, computer accessories, or office electronics, International Office Solution ensures quality, authenticity, and value in every purchase.</p><p>Our commitment to customer satisfaction, authentic products, competitive pricing, and dependable after-sales support has made us a trusted choice for gadget lovers and professionals throughout Bangladesh.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Details</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Brand</td><td>REMAX</td></tr><tr><td>Model</td><td>RP3 Digital Voice Recorder</td></tr><tr><td>Storage Capacity</td><td>64GB Built-in Memory</td></tr><tr><td>Recording Quality</td><td>Up to 1536Kbps High-Quality Recording</td></tr><tr><td>Noise Reduction</td><td>Intelligent DSP Noise Reduction Technology</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Large Digital Display Screen</td></tr><tr><td>Controls</td><td>Easy Button Navigation</td></tr><tr><td>Battery Type</td><td>Rechargeable Battery</td></tr><tr><td>Battery Backup</td><td>Long-lasting Recording Support</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB Data Transfer</td></tr><tr><td>Playback</td><td>Built-in Speaker &amp; Headphone Support</td></tr><tr><td>File Transfer</td><td>Supports PC/Laptop File Management</td></tr><tr><td>Design</td><td>Compact, Portable &amp; Lightweight</td></tr><tr><td>Build Quality</td><td>Premium Durable Finish</td></tr><tr><td>Usage</td><td>Meetings, Interviews, Lectures, Voice Notes, Class Recording</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black (Depending on Availability)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 2700.00, 3000.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/Cz7r6gDeAucm6n5taX969dnJ5QayQRew2wWs8c7e.jpg', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-22 06:45:06', '2026-05-22 06:45:23', 'REMAX RP3 Digital Voice Recorder Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the original REMAX RP3 Digital Voice Recorder in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features 64GB storage, 1536Kbps HD recording, DSP noise reduction, rechargeable battery, and portable design for meetings, lectures, and interviews.', 'REMAX RP3 Digital Voice Recorder, REMAX Voice Recorder, 64GB Audio Recorder, Portable Voice Recorder, Noise Reduction Recorder, Professional Sound Recorder, Lecture Recorder, Meeting Recorder, USB Rechargeable Recorder, High Quality Recorder', NUL