(93, 'GoPro HERO13 27MP Waterproof Touch Screen 5.3K Action Camera', 'The GoPro HERO13 Black is a premium 27MP action camera designed for adventure lovers and content creators. It supports stunning 5.3K60 video recording, HyperSmooth 6.0 stabilization, HDR video, and advanced slow-motion capture for professional-quality footage. Waterproof up to 33 feet without housing, the HERO13 is perfect for underwater and outdoor adventures. With Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, lens mod support, and a long-lasting Enduro battery, it delivers powerful performance for every adventure.', 'gopro-hero13-27mp-waterproof-touch-screen-53k-action-camera-1779464474', '<h3>GoPro HERO13 Black 27MP Waterproof Touch Screen 5.3K Action Camera</h3><p>The GoPro HERO13 is the latest flagship action camera engineered for creators, adventurers, athletes, vloggers, and travelers who want to capture every moment with professional-level quality. Featuring an advanced 27.6MP image sensor and ultra-high-resolution 5.3K video recording at 60fps, the HERO13 delivers stunning visuals with exceptional sharpness, vibrant colors, and cinematic clarity.</p><p>Built for extreme environments, the GoPro HERO13 is waterproof up to 33 feet (10 meters) without requiring additional housing, making it the perfect companion for underwater adventures, travel vlogging, biking, hiking, surfing, diving, and outdoor sports. Whether you are exploring mountain trails or diving deep underwater, the HERO13 is designed to withstand rugged conditions while maintaining outstanding performance.</p><p>One of the standout features of the GoPro HERO13 is its Emmy® Award-winning HyperSmooth 6.0 video stabilization technology. This advanced stabilization system ensures ultra-smooth, shake-free footage even during intense action scenes, fast movement, or handheld recording. The camera also supports HLG HDR video recording, offering richer contrast, enhanced highlights, and more realistic color reproduction for cinematic content creation.</p><p>The HERO13 takes slow-motion recording to the next level with incredible frame rate options, including:</p><ul><li>5.3K at 120fps</li><li>900p at 360fps</li><li>720p at 400fps</li></ul><p>These modes allow users to capture dramatic slow-motion footage with exceptional detail and smooth playback, ideal for sports and action-packed moments.</p><p>For professional creators and filmmakers, the GoPro HERO13 includes 10-bit color support along with GP-Log encoding and LUT compatibility. This enables greater flexibility in color grading and post-production editing, helping users create more cinematic and visually refined content.</p><p>The camera also supports a range of creative lens mods including:</p><ul><li>Macro Lens Mod for detailed close-up photography</li><li>Ultra Wide Lens Mod for immersive landscapes and action shots</li><li>Anamorphic Lens Mod for cinematic widescreen visuals</li></ul><p>With built-in Wi-Fi and Bluetooth connectivity, users can instantly transfer files, remotely control the camera, and connect wireless accessories such as Apple AirPods and external wireless microphones for enhanced audio recording.</p><p>Powered by the upgraded Enduro Battery, the HERO13 provides up to 2.5 hours of continuous recording, ensuring longer shooting sessions without interruption.</p><h3>Key Features of GoPro HERO13</h3><ul><li>27.6MP high-resolution sensor</li><li>5.3K video recording at 60fps</li><li>HyperSmooth 6.0 stabilization</li><li>Waterproof up to 10 meters (33 feet)</li><li>HDR and 10-bit color support</li><li>Advanced slow-motion video modes</li><li>GP-Log and LUT support</li><li>Wi-Fi and Bluetooth connectivity</li><li>Lens mod compatibility</li><li>Long-lasting Enduro battery</li><li><h2>Buy GoPro HERO13 from International Office Solution</h2></li><li>Buy the original GoPro HERO13 Black 27MP Waterproof Touch Screen 5.3K Action Camera from International Office Solution in Bangladesh. We offer a wide collection of the latest GoPro action cameras at competitive prices. Order online or visit International Office Solution to get genuine products with reliable customer support and excellent service.</li></ul>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Image Sensor</td><td>1/1.9\" CMOS</td></tr><tr><td>Sensor Resolution</td><td>5599x4927</td></tr><tr><td>Image</td><td>27.6MP</td></tr><tr><td>Video</td><td>5.3K (8:7) 30/25/24 fps<br>5.3K (16:9) 60/50/30/25/24 fps<br>4K (8:7) 60/50/30/25 fps<br>4K (9:16) 60/50/30/25<br>4K (16:9) 120/100/60/50/30/25/24 fps<br>2.7K (4:3) 120/100 fps<br>2.7K (16:9) 240/200 fps<br>1080 (9:16) 60/50/30/25<br>1080p (16:9) 240/200/120/100/60/50/30/25/24 fps</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Rear: 2.27\" Touch Display<br>Front: 1.4\" Color Display</td></tr><tr><td>USB Port</td><td>1x USB Type C<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>1 microSD with at least V30 or higher UHS-3 rating<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Battery Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Removable</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>type</td><td>Rechargeable Battery</td></tr><tr><td>Capacity</td><td>1900mAh Enduro Battery</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Special Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Wi-Fi</td><td>Wi-Fi 6; 2.4GHZ; 5GHz<br>802.11 a/b/g/n/ac<br><br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Water Resistant</td><td>10m (33ft)<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Tripod/Monopod Mountable</td><td>Built-in mounting with Folding Fingers<br>¼-20 Mount</td></tr><tr><td>HDR Mode</td><td>Yes,<br>HDR Video<br>5.3K (16:9) 30/25/24 fps<br>4K (8:7) 30/25/24 fps<br>4K (16:9) 60/50/30/25/24 fps</td></tr><tr><td>Slow Motion Recording</td><td>Burst Slo-Mo:<br>13x (400fps) - 720p for 15s<br>12x (360fps) - 900p for 15s<br>4x - 5.3K for 5s</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Looping Video<br>HindSight<br>Scheduled Capture<br>Duration Capture<br>Live Streaming (1080p60 w/HyperSmooth 4.0 )<br>Webcam Mode up to 1080p30<br>TimeWarp Video<br>Star Trails<br>Light Painting<br>Vehicle Light Trails<br>Bluetooth - 5.3<br><br>In The Box:<br>GoPro HERO13 Black, Folding Fingers, 1/4-20 Mounting Threads, Magnetic Latch Mount, Enduro Battery, USB-C Cable, Carrying Case &amp; 64GB SD Card<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>No warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 41299.00, 41399.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/2kPSQv9j71PIH5ufKVrHJUMDWPtKT1sOwiEPLKMJ.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-22 15:41:14', '2026-05-22 15:41:14', 'GoPro HERO13 27MP Waterproof 5.3K Action Camera Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy GoPro HERO13 27MP Waterproof Touch Screen 5.3K Action Camera from International Office Solution in Bangladesh. Features HyperSmooth 6.0, HDR video, 5.3K60 recording, waterproof design, advanced slow motion, and long battery life.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(94, 'Galaxy Tab A11', 'Samsung Galaxy Tab A11 features an 8.7-inch WXGA+ 90Hz display, MediaTek Helio G99 processor, up to 8GB RAM, and 128GB storage expandable up to 2TB. Running on Android 15 with One UI 8, it offers Dolby Atmos stereo speakers, 5100mAh battery with 15W fast charging, and Wi-Fi + Cellular connectivity for smooth entertainment and productivity on the go.', 'galaxy-tab-a11-1779507141', '<p>Samsung Galaxy Tab A11</p><p>The Samsung Galaxy Tab A11 is a stylish and feature-packed tablet designed for users who want reliable performance, immersive entertainment, and long-lasting usability in a compact form factor. With its sleek body, vibrant display, powerful processor, and modern connectivity options, this tablet is ideal for students, professionals, travelers, and entertainment lovers alike.</p><p>Featuring an 8.7-inch TFT LCD WXGA+ display with a resolution of 800 × 1340 pixels, the Samsung Galaxy Tab A11 delivers bright colors, sharp visuals, and smooth viewing performance. Its 90Hz refresh rate ensures fluid scrolling and responsive touch interaction, making web browsing, social media usage, video streaming, and gaming feel faster and more enjoyable. The slim bezels and 81.7% screen-to-body ratio create a more immersive viewing experience while keeping the device compact and lightweight for easy portability.</p><p>Powered by the efficient MediaTek Helio G99 (6nm) chipset, the Galaxy Tab A11 offers excellent day-to-day performance with improved power efficiency. Its octa-core CPU combined with the Mali-G57 MC2 GPU allows smooth multitasking, stable gaming, and seamless app performance. Whether you\'re attending online classes, working on documents, watching movies, or browsing the web, the tablet handles tasks effortlessly.</p><p>The Samsung Galaxy Tab A11 comes in multiple memory and storage configurations, including up to 8GB RAM and 128GB internal storage. This ensures faster app loading, smoother multitasking, and enough space for your photos, videos, apps, and files. For users who need additional storage, the tablet supports expandable memory up to 2TB via a dedicated microSDXC card slot, giving you the freedom to store more content without worry.</p><p>Running on Android 15 with Samsung’s latest One UI 8, the tablet provides a clean, user-friendly interface with advanced customization features and enhanced security. Samsung also promises up to 7 major Android upgrades, making the Galaxy Tab A11 a future-ready device that will continue receiving software improvements and security updates for years to come.</p><p>For photography and communication, the tablet features an 8MP autofocus rear camera capable of capturing clear images and videos, while the 5MP front camera delivers crisp video calling performance with support for 1080p video recording at 30fps. Whether attending virtual meetings, online classes, or connecting with friends and family, users can enjoy clearer and more natural face-to-face communication.</p><p>Entertainment becomes more immersive with Dolby Atmos-powered stereo speakers that provide rich, balanced, and multidimensional sound. From movies and music to games and online content, the audio quality enhances every experience. The inclusion of a 3.5mm headphone jack also offers convenient wired audio connectivity for users who prefer traditional headphones.</p><p>Despite weighing only 335 grams, the Samsung Galaxy Tab A11 packs a dependable 5100mAh battery that delivers long-lasting usage throughout the day. With 15W fast charging support, users can quickly recharge and stay productive without long interruptions.</p><p>Connectivity options include dual-band Wi-Fi, Bluetooth 5.3, GPS support, USB Type-C 2.0, and Nano-SIM support in the Wi-Fi + Cellular variant, ensuring flexible connectivity whether at home, school, office, or on the go.</p><p>The Samsung Galaxy Tab A11 is a perfect combination of portability, performance, entertainment, and long-term software support, making it an excellent choice for modern users seeking a dependable Android tablet experience.</p><h2>Buy Samsung Galaxy Tab A11 from International Office Solution</h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Samsung Galaxy Tab A11 from International Office Solution. We offer the latest Samsung tablets at competitive prices with trusted customer support and fast delivery service. Order online or visit your nearest International Office Solution showroom to get your desired Samsung Galaxy Tab A11 at the best price in Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Brand</td><td><strong>SAMSUNG</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Body</td><td><strong>Dimensions: 211 x 124.7 x 8 mm | Weight: 335 g or 337 g | SIM: Nano-SIM (cellular model only)</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Platform</td><td><strong>OS: Android 15, One UI 7 | Chipset: Mediatek Helio G99 (6 nm) | CPU Octa-core | GPU: Mali-G57 MC2</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Model</td><td><strong>Galaxy Tab A11</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Network</td><td><strong>GSM / HSPA / LTE</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td><strong>Type: TFT LCD, 90Hz | Size: 8.7 inches, (~81.7% screen-to-body ratio) | Resolution: 800 x 1340 pixels, 5:3 ratio (~179 ppi density)</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td><strong>64GB 4GB RAM, 128GB 8GB RAM</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Main Camera</td><td><strong>8 MP, AF | Video: 1080p@30fps</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Selfie Camera</td><td><strong>Single: 5 MP | Video: Yes</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Sound</td><td><strong>Loudspeaker: Yes, with stereo speakers (with Dolby Atmos) | 3.5mm jack: Yes</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Battery Info</td><td><strong>5100 mAh | Charging 15W wired</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td><strong>Wi-Fi 802.11 a/b/g/n/ac, dual-band, Wi-Fi Direct | Bluetooth 5.3, A2DP, LE</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Other Features / Info</td><td><strong>Sensors: Accelerometer, proximity, compass</strong></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 18400.00, 18500.00, NULL, 100, 'products/thumbnails/6jwT8BNpQPTRAaaLL77aHUxl73OYnWnwrKrAtv2Z.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-23 03:32:22', '2026-05-23 03:32:22', 'Samsung Galaxy Tab A11 Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Samsung Galaxy Tab A11 in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features 8.7-inch 90Hz display, Helio G99 processor, Android 15, Dolby Atmos speakers, 5100mAh battery, and expandable storage up to 2TB.', 'Samsung Galaxy Tab A11, Galaxy Tab A11 price in Bangladesh, Samsung tablet, Android 15 tablet, Helio G99 tablet, Samsung Tab A11 8GB RAM, Samsung Galaxy Tab A11 128GB, WiFi Cellular tablet, International Office Solution', NULL, 44, NULL, NULL),
(95, 'Lenovo IdeaPad 5 2-in-1 14IAL10 Core Ultra 7 255H 14\" WUXGA IPS Touch Laptop', 'The Lenovo IdeaPad 5 2-in-1 14IAL10 is a premium convertible laptop powered by the Intel Core Ultra 7 255H processor, featuring a 14-inch WUXGA IPS touchscreen display, 16GB LPDDR5x RAM, and a 1TB PCIe Gen4 SSD. Designed for productivity, creativity, and portability, this sleek 2-in-1 laptop delivers powerful performance, immersive visuals, advanced connectivity, and long battery life in a lightweight and durable design.', 'lenovo-ideapad-5-2-in-1-14ial10-core-ultra-7-255h-14-wuxga-ips-touch-laptop-1779552888', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Lenovo IdeaPad 5 2-in-1 14IAL10 Core Ultra 7 255H 14\" Touch Laptop</strong></h3><p>The Lenovo IdeaPad 5 2-in-1 14IAL10 Core Ultra 7 255H 14\" WUXGA IPS Touch Laptop is a modern, high-performance convertible laptop built for professionals, students, creators, and multitaskers who demand flexibility, speed, and reliability. Combining premium craftsmanship with cutting-edge hardware, this laptop seamlessly transforms between laptop and tablet modes, making it ideal for work, study, entertainment, and creative tasks.</p><p>Powered by the latest Intel Core Ultra 7 255H processor, the laptop delivers outstanding processing power with 16 cores and 16 threads, reaching turbo frequencies up to 5.1GHz. Whether you are handling demanding office workloads, multitasking between applications, editing content, attending virtual meetings, or streaming media, the Lenovo IdeaPad 5 2-in-1 ensures smooth and responsive performance throughout the day.</p><p>The laptop is equipped with 16GB LPDDR5x RAM running at an ultra-fast 8000MHz frequency, allowing efficient multitasking and improved responsiveness. Its massive 1TB PCIe 4.0 NVMe SSD provides lightning-fast boot times, rapid file access, and ample storage space for documents, software, multimedia files, and professional projects.</p><p>Featuring a stunning 14-inch WUXGA (1920x1200) IPS touchscreen display, the Lenovo IdeaPad 5 2-in-1 offers vibrant visuals, wide viewing angles, and excellent touch responsiveness. The glossy display supports 10-point multi-touch functionality, making navigation intuitive and convenient. With 300 nits brightness and TÜV Low Blue Light certification, users can enjoy comfortable viewing during long working sessions while reducing eye strain.</p><p>The integrated Intel Arc 140T Graphics delivers enhanced visual performance for casual gaming, content creation, video playback, and graphics-intensive tasks. Combined with Dolby Audio stereo speakers, the laptop provides an immersive multimedia experience with rich and clear sound quality.</p><p>For video conferencing and online collaboration, the device includes a Full HD 1080p webcam with a privacy shutter and dual-array microphones, ensuring crystal-clear communication and enhanced privacy protection. The backlit keyboard and large Precision TouchPad provide comfortable typing and precise navigation, improving overall productivity.</p><p>Connectivity options are extensive, featuring Wi-Fi 6 and Bluetooth 5.2 for fast wireless performance. The laptop includes two USB-C 3.2 Gen 2 ports with Power Delivery and DisplayPort support, two USB-A ports, HDMI 1.4b, an SD card reader, and a 3.5mm combo audio jack, allowing users to connect multiple devices and accessories with ease.</p><p>The Lenovo IdeaPad 5 2-in-1 is powered by a 57Wh battery supported by a 65W USB-C fast charger, delivering reliable battery backup for all-day productivity. Built with an aluminum top cover and durable PC-ABS materials, the device meets MIL-STD-810H military-grade durability standards while maintaining a slim and lightweight profile at only 1.6kg.</p><p>Its elegant Luna Grey finish, eco-friendly certifications including ENERGY STAR 8.0, EPEAT Gold, and RoHS compliance make it a smart and sustainable choice for modern users. Overall, the Lenovo IdeaPad 5 2-in-1 14IAL10 Core Ultra 7 255H Touch Laptop offers a perfect balance of power, portability, premium design, and touchscreen versatility.</p><h2><strong>Buy Lenovo IdeaPad 5 2-in-1 14IAL10 Core Ultra 7 255H 14\" WUXGA IPS Touch Laptop from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Lenovo IdeaPad 5 2-in-1 14IAL10 Core Ultra 7 255H 14\" WUXGA IPS Touch Laptop from International Office Solution. We offer a wide collection of the latest Lenovo laptops at competitive prices for professionals, students, freelancers, and business users. Order online or contact International Office Solution to get genuine products with official warranty support and reliable customer service.</p><p>The Lenovo IdeaPad 5 2-in-1 14IAL10 Core Ultra 7 255H 14\" WUXGA IPS Touch Laptop comes with a 2-year warranty (Battery &amp; Adapter 1 Year).</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Processor</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor Brand</td><td>Intel</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Model</td><td>Core 7 255H</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Frequency</td><td>Max Turbo up to 5.1GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Core</td><td>16C (6P + 8E + 2LPE)</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Thread</td><td>16T</td></tr><tr><td>CPU Cache</td><td>24MB</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Chipset</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Chipset Model</td><td>Intel SoC Platform</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Display</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Display Size</td><td>14\"</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>IPS</td></tr><tr><td>Display Resolution</td><td>WUXGA (1920x1200)</td></tr><tr><td>Touch Screen</td><td>N/A</td></tr><tr><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Display Features</td><td>IPS 300nits Glossy, 45% NTSC, 60Hz, TÜV Low Blue Light, Glass,<br>TouchScreen<br>10-point Multi-Touch</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Memory</strong></td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>16GB<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>RAM Type</td><td>LPDDR5x</td></tr><tr><td>Removable</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Bus Speed</td><td>8000MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Total RAM Slot</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Storage</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Storage Type</td><td>M.2 2242 PCIe 4.0x4 NVMe SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Storage Capacity</td><td>1TB</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Graphics</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Model</td><td>Integrated Intel Arc 140T GPU</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Memory</td><td>Shared</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Type</td><td>Integrated</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Keyboard &amp; TouchPad</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Keyboard Type</td><td>Backlit, English (EU)</td></tr><tr><td>TouchPad</td><td>Buttonless Mylar surface multi-touch touchpad, supports Precision TouchPad (PTP), 75 x 120 mm (2.95 x 4.72 inches)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Camera &amp; Audio</strong></td></tr><tr><td>WebCam</td><td>FHD 1080p</td></tr><tr><td>Speaker</td><td>Stereo speakers, 2W x2</td></tr><tr><td>Microphone</td><td>2x, Array Microphone</td></tr><tr><td>Audio Features</td><td>Optimized with Dolby Audio</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Ports &amp; Slots</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Optical Drive</td><td>N/A</td></tr><tr><td>Card Reader</td><td>1x SD Card Reader</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI Port</td><td>1x HDMI 1.4b</td></tr><tr><td>USB 3 Port</td><td>1x USB-A (USB 5Gbps / USB 3.2 Gen 1)<br>1x USB-A (USB 5Gbps / USB 3.2 Gen 1), Always On</td></tr><tr><td>USB Type-C / Thunderbolt Port</td><td>2x USB-C (USB 10 Gbps / USB 3.2 Gen 2), with USB PD 3.1 and DisplayPort 1.4</td></tr><tr><td>Headphone &amp; Microphone Port</td><td>1x Headphone / microphone combo jack (3.5mm)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Network &amp; Connectivity</strong></td></tr><tr><td>LAN</td><td>N/A</td></tr><tr><td>WiFi</td><td>Wi-Fi 6, 802.11ax 2x2</td></tr><tr><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Bluetooth 5.2</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Security</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Camera Privacy Shutter</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Security Chip</td><td>Firmware TPM 2.0 Enabled</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><s