(96, 'EcoFlow River 3 UPS & Portable Power Station', 'EcoFlow River 3 UPS & Portable Power Station\r\n\r\nThe EcoFlow River 3 Portable Power Station is a compact and reliable backup power solution designed for home, office, travel, and outdoor use. With a 245Wh battery capacity and 300W rated output, it can efficiently power laptops, smartphones, routers, cameras, mini appliances, and other essential devices. Featuring advanced X-Boost technology, it supports devices up to 600W while maintaining stable performance.\r\n\r\nThis portable power station comes with a 10ms UPS function for uninterrupted backup during sudden power outages. Its ultra-quiet operation, lightweight design, fast charging capability, and IP54-rated durability make it an ideal power companion for both indoor and outdoor environments.\r\n\r\nBuy the EcoFlow River 3 UPS & Portable Power Station from International Office Solution at the best price in Bangladesh.', 'ecoflow-river-3-ups-portable-power-station-1779633805', '<h2>EcoFlow River 3 UPS &amp; Portable Power Station</h2><p>The EcoFlow River 3 UPS &amp; Portable Power Station is an advanced and compact energy backup solution designed for modern users who require reliable portable power anytime and anywhere. Whether you need emergency backup for your home, uninterrupted power for office equipment, or a dependable energy source during travel and outdoor adventures, the EcoFlow River 3 delivers exceptional performance in a lightweight and highly portable design.</p><p>With a powerful 245Wh battery capacity and 300W continuous output, the EcoFlow River 3 can efficiently run multiple electronic devices including laptops, WiFi routers, smartphones, tablets, cameras, mini fans, LED lights, CPAP machines, gaming consoles, and small household appliances. The advanced X-Boost technology allows the power station to support appliances up to 600W, making it more versatile than traditional portable battery systems.</p><p>One of the standout features of the EcoFlow River 3 Portable Power Station is its ultra-fast charging capability. Thanks to the 320W AC fast charging input, the device can recharge from 0% to 100% in approximately 60 minutes without compromising battery health. For users on the move, the built-in car charging option allows convenient charging through a vehicle power outlet within around 2.8 hours.</p><p>The integrated 10ms UPS (Uninterruptible Power Supply) functionality provides seamless backup power during sudden electricity failures. This feature is particularly useful for protecting sensitive electronics such as desktop PCs, networking devices, surveillance systems, and workstations from unexpected shutdowns and data loss.</p><p>Designed for silent operation, the EcoFlow River 3 operates at less than 30dB, ensuring a quiet environment whether used at home, in the office, or during nighttime camping. Its compact body is nearly 30% smaller than many traditional power stations, making transportation and storage extremely convenient.</p><p>Durability is another major advantage of the EcoFlow River 3. The device features an IP54-rated water and dust-resistant battery pack, helping protect it against splashes, dust particles, and rough outdoor conditions. This makes it an excellent power solution for camping, travel, outdoor photography, fieldwork, and emergency preparedness.</p><p>The EcoFlow River 3 supports simultaneous charging for up to six devices through multiple output options, including:</p><ul><li>2 x AC Output Ports</li><li>USB-C 100W Fast Charging Port</li><li>USB-A Ports</li><li>DC Output Options</li></ul><p>Its USB-C port supports multiple voltage profiles, enabling fast charging for compatible laptops, smartphones, tablets, and other modern USB-C devices.</p><p>Key Features of EcoFlow River 3 Portable Power Station:</p><ul><li>245Wh battery capacity</li><li>300W rated output with 600W X-Boost support</li><li>Ultra-fast 60-minute charging</li><li>10ms UPS functionality</li><li>Quiet operation below 30dB</li><li>Compact and lightweight portable design</li><li>IP54-rated water and dust resistance</li><li>Multiple charging and output ports</li><li>Simultaneous charging for up to six devices</li></ul><p>The EcoFlow River 3 UPS &amp; Portable Power Station is an excellent choice for professionals, travelers, content creators, outdoor enthusiasts, and home users looking for a dependable, fast-charging, and portable backup power solution.</p><p>Purchase the original EcoFlow River 3 UPS &amp; Portable Power Station from International Office Solution and enjoy reliable performance, official warranty support, and competitive pricing in Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>General Information</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Battery Type</td><td>LiFePO4</td></tr><tr><td>Battery Capacity</td><td>245Wh</td></tr><tr><td>Battery Cycle Life</td><td>3000 cycles to 80% capacity</td></tr><tr><td>Rated AC Output Power</td><td>300W</td></tr><tr><td>AC Peak/ Surge Output Power</td><td>Surge 600W, X-Boost 600W</td></tr><tr><td>UPS Transfer Time</td><td>&lt;20 ms</td></tr><tr><td>Chargeing Methods</td><td>AC, Solar, Car, Generator</td></tr><tr><td>Fast Chargeing</td><td>1-hr Fast Charge</td></tr><tr><td>Protection</td><td>IP54 battery protection<br>X-Guard battery protection technology</td></tr><tr><td>Noise Level</td><td>&lt;30 dB</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Output</strong></td></tr><tr><td>AC Output</td><td>2 outlets, 300W total (Surge 600W, X-Boost 600W)</td></tr><tr><td>USB Output</td><td>2 ports, 5V=2.4A, 12W max per port, total 24W</td></tr><tr><td>Type-C Output</td><td>1 port, 5/9/12/15⎓3A Max, 20V⎓5A Max,100W Max per port</td></tr><tr><td>Car Power Output</td><td>1 outlet, 12.6V, 10A, 126W max</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Input (Charging)</strong></td></tr><tr><td>AC Input</td><td>320W, 0-100% in 60 min</td></tr><tr><td>Solar Input</td><td>110W, 0-100% in as fast as 2.6 hr</td></tr><tr><td>Car Input</td><td>100W, 11~30V, 0-100% in 2.8 hr</td></tr><tr><td>Generator Input</td><td>320W, 0-100% in 60 min</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Environment</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Operating Temperature</td><td>68°F-86°F</td></tr><tr><td>Storage Temperature</td><td>68°F-86°F</td></tr><tr><td>Charging Temperature</td><td>32°F-113°F</td></tr><tr><td>Discharge Temperature</td><td>14°F-113°F</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>10×8.3×4.4 in</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>7.8 lb</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>2 Years Warranty.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 27100.00, 27200.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/ThSaOY86G8l7qTA0Ri2rUoLPtBvyWmgwjRiorIhu.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-24 14:43:25', '2026-05-24 14:43:25', 'EcoFlow River 3 UPS & Portable Power Station Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the EcoFlow River 3 UPS & Portable Power Station in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features 245Wh capacity, 300W output, fast charging, UPS support, quiet operation, and portable design for home, office, and outdoor use.', 'EcoFlow River 3 price in Bangladesh, EcoFlow UPS BD, Portable Power Station BD, EcoFlow River 3 UPS, EcoFlow Bangladesh, Portable Backup Power, UPS Power Station, International Office Solution', NULL, 77, NULL, NULL),
(97, 'ASUS TUF Gaming BE6500 Dual Band WiFi 7 Gaming Router', 'The ASUS TUF Gaming BE6500 WiFi 7 Gaming Router delivers ultra-fast speeds up to 5764 Mbps, advanced gaming optimization, strong security with AiProtection Pro, and wide coverage up to 3000 sq ft. Powered by a quad-core processor and equipped with 2.5GbE ports, it ensures lag-free gaming, smooth streaming, and reliable multi-device performance. Available from International Office Solution (IOS).', 'asus-tuf-gaming-be6500-dual-band-wifi-7-gaming-router-1779636132', '<p>The <strong>ASUS TUF Gaming BE6500 Dual Band WiFi 7 Gaming Router</strong> is a cutting-edge networking powerhouse designed for next-generation gaming, ultra-fast streaming, and heavy multi-device environments. Built with the latest <strong>WiFi 7 (802.11be) technology</strong>, it delivers blazing-fast combined wireless speeds of up to <strong>5764 Mbps</strong>, ensuring smooth, lag-free connectivity for all your digital needs.</p><p>With speeds reaching up to <strong>688 Mbps on the 2.4GHz band</strong> and <strong>5764 Mbps on the 5GHz band</strong>, this router provides exceptional performance for competitive online gaming, 4K/8K streaming, and smart home ecosystems. It is capable of covering an extensive area of <strong>2500–3000 sq ft</strong>, making it ideal for large homes, offices, and gaming setups.</p><p>Powered by a <strong>1.5GHz quad-core processor</strong>, paired with <strong>1GB RAM and 256MB flash memory</strong>, the ASUS TUF Gaming BE6500 ensures stable performance even under heavy network load. Advanced technologies like <strong>MU-MIMO, OFDMA, 4096-QAM, and beamforming</strong> enhance signal strength, reduce latency, and optimize multi-device connections.</p><p>For gamers, this router includes dedicated features such as <strong>Game Boost, OpenNAT, Gear Accelerator, and Gaming Port prioritization</strong>, ensuring ultra-low latency and maximum bandwidth for gaming devices.</p><p>Security is a top priority with <strong>AiProtection Pro</strong>, WPA3 encryption, DNS-over-TLS, firewall protection, and Let’s Encrypt support. It also offers advanced <strong>parental controls for up to 64 profiles</strong>, allowing complete control over internet usage and web filtering.</p><p>Connectivity is highly versatile with <strong>one 2.5GbE WAN port, three 2.5GbE LAN ports, and a USB 3.2 Gen1 port</strong>, making it suitable for high-speed wired networks and external storage sharing. It also supports multiple VPN protocols including <strong>OpenVPN, WireGuard, IPSec, PPTP, L2TP</strong>, along with popular services like NordVPN and Surfshark via VPN Fusion.</p><p>With intelligent tools like <strong>Adaptive QoS, traffic monitoring, bandwidth analytics, and auto firmware updates</strong>, users get full control and easy management of their network.</p><p>Whether you\'re a competitive gamer, content creator, or smart home user, the <strong>ASUS TUF Gaming BE6500 WiFi 7 Router</strong> delivers unmatched speed, security, and stability for modern digital lifestyles.</p><p>👉 Available in Bangladesh from <strong>International Office Solution (IOS)</strong> with official warranty and best pricing.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>WiFi 7 (802.11be) (2.4GHz): up to 688 Mbps<br>WiFi 7 (802.11be) (5GHz): up to 5764 Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>External fixed antenna x 6</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS Button, Reset Button, Power Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4 GHz<br>5 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>MU-MIMO<br>UTF-8 SSID<br>WiFi MAC Address Filter<br>• Maximum MAC Filters : 64<br>Wireless Scheduler<br>Airtime Fairness<br>RADIUS Client<br>Universal Beamforming</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>• HFS+<br>• NTFS<br>• vFAT<br>• ext2<br>• ext3<br>• ext4<br>• FAT32<br>Safely Remove Disk<br>AiCloud<br>Download Master<br>AiDisk<br>Media Server<br>Time Machine<br>Samba Server<br>FTP Server<br>Shared Folder Privileges</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11a<br>IEEE 802.11b<br>IEEE 802.11g<br>WiFi 4 (802.11n)<br>WiFi 5 (802.11ac)<br>WiFi 6 (802.11ax)<br>WiFi 7 (802.11be)<br>IPv4<br>IPv6</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>AiProtection<br>VPN<br>WPA/WPA2/WPA3 Personal<br>WPA/WPA2/WPA3 Enterprise<br>Open System &amp; OWE<br>WPS<br>Let\'s Encrypt<br>DNS-over-TLS<br>SSH<br>Security Scan<br>Firewall<br>• Maximum Firewall Keyword Filter : 64<br>• Maximum Firewall Network Service Filter : 32<br>• Maximum Firewall URL Filter : 64</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>1 x 2.5GbE for WAN<br>3 x 2.5GbE for LAN<br>1 x USB 3.2 Gen1</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Processor:<br>1.5GHz Quad-core Processor<br>Memory:<br>256 MB Flash and 1 GB RAM<br>Boosts Speed:<br>OFDMA (Orthogonal Frequency Division Multiple Access)<br>Beamforming: standard-based and universal<br>4096-QAM high data rate<br>20/40/80/160 MHz bandwidth<br>AiMesh:<br>AiMesh<br>• Primary AiMesh Router<br>• AiMesh Node<br>Game:<br>Game Boost / Acceleration<br>Gear Accelerator<br>OpenNAT (Game Profile)<br>Gaming Port<br>Parental Control:<br>\"Allow you to block access to unwanted websites and apps.\"<br>Web &amp; Apps Filters<br>Time Scheduling<br>Safe Browsing<br>Customized Internet Schedule<br>• Maximum Parental Control Profile : 64<br>• Maximum Parental Control Content Cilter Rule : 64<br>Guest Network:<br>\"The Guest Network provides Internet connection for guests but restricts access to your local network.\"<br>Support Guest Network<br>• Maximum Guest Network Rule : 2.4 GHz + 5 GHz : 3<br>Guest Network Connection Time Limit<br>Guest Network Encryption : Open system, WPA/WPA2/WPA3 Personal<br>AiProtection:<br>AiProtection Pro<br>• Router Security Assessment<br>• Malicious Site Blocking<br>• Two-Way IPS<br>• Infected Device Prevention and Blocking<br>VPN:<br>Instant Guard<br>VPN Client L2TP<br>VPN Client Open VPN<br>VPN Client PPTP<br>VPN Client WireGuar