 Ultra Fast 5764 Mbps | IOS Bangladesh', 'Buy ASUS TUF Gaming BE6500 Dual Band WiFi 7 Gaming Router in Bangladesh from International Office Solution (IOS). Get ultra-fast 5764 Mbps speed, advanced gaming features, 2.5GbE ports, AiProtection Pro security, and up to 3000 sq ft coverage with official warranty.', 'ASUS TUF Gaming BE6500 router, WiFi 7 router Bangladesh, gaming router price BD, ASUS router price Bangladesh, high speed router Bangladesh, 2.5GbE router, best gaming router Bangladesh, dual band WiFi 7 router, ASUS BE6500, online gaming router', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(98, 'ASUS RT-BE58U BE3600 Dual Band WiFi 7 Gaming Router', 'The ASUS RT-BE58U WiFi 7 Gaming Router delivers up to 3600Mbps speed with AiMesh support, quad-core performance, and advanced security features. Ideal for gaming, streaming, and smart homes, it ensures stable, high-speed connectivity with full coverage and low latency. Available from International Office Solution (IOS).', 'asus-rt-be58u-be3600-dual-band-wifi-7-gaming-router-1779638029', '<p>The <strong>ASUS RT-BE58U 3600Mbps Dual Band WiFi 7 Smart AiMesh Gaming Router</strong> is a next-generation networking solution designed for high-performance gaming, 8K streaming, and smart home connectivity. Powered by the latest <strong>WiFi 7 (802.11be) technology</strong>, it delivers ultra-fast wireless speeds of up to <strong>3600 Mbps</strong>, ensuring smooth and stable internet performance across multiple devices.</p><p>Equipped with a powerful <strong>2.0 GHz quad-core processor</strong>, <strong>1GB RAM</strong>, and <strong>256MB flash storage</strong>, the ASUS RT-BE58U ensures seamless multitasking and ultra-low latency performance. Advanced technologies such as <strong>OFDMA, 4096-QAM, and 160 MHz bandwidth support</strong> enhance speed, efficiency, and network stability.</p><p>With <strong>AI-powered Smart AiMesh technology</strong>, this router provides extended coverage and seamless roaming throughout your home or office. It supports multiple operating modes including <strong>Wireless Router, Access Point, and Media Bridge</strong>, making it highly flexible for different networking setups.</p><p>For gamers and power users, the ASUS RT-BE58U delivers optimized performance for lag-free gaming, HDR streaming, cloud computing, and content creation. Its <strong>2x2 MU-MIMO antennas with universal beamforming</strong> ensure stable and strong signal distribution across both frequency bands.</p><p>Connectivity is highly versatile with <strong>1× 2.5G WAN/LAN port, 1× Gigabit WAN/LAN port, 3× Gigabit LAN ports, and USB 3.2 Gen 1 port</strong>, enabling fast wired connections and external storage sharing.</p><p>Security is top-tier with <strong>AiProtection Pro</strong>, offering malware protection, malicious site blocking, and infected device prevention. It also supports advanced VPN services like <strong>OpenVPN and WireGuard</strong>, ensuring secure remote access.</p><p>Additional features include <strong>AiMesh compatibility, parental controls, multiple guest networks, IPv4/IPv6 support, DDNS, port forwarding, NAT passthrough, AiCloud, and Time Machine backup support</strong>.</p><p>Whether for gaming, streaming, or smart home networking, the <strong>ASUS RT-BE58U WiFi 7 Gaming Router</strong> delivers unmatched speed, stability, and security.</p><p>👉 Available in Bangladesh from <strong>International Office Solution (IOS)</strong> with official warranty and best pricing.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>802.11a : up to 54 Mbps<br>802.11b : up to 11 Mbps<br>802.11g : up to 54 Mbps<br>WiFi 7 (802.11be) (2.4GHz): up to 688 Mbps<br>WiFi 7 (802.11be) (5GHz): up to 2882 Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>External antenna x 4</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS Button, Reset Button, Power Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4 GHz<br>5 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>MU-MIMO<br>UTF-8 SSID<br>WiFi MAC Address Filter<br>• Maximum MAC Filters : 64<br>Wireless Scheduler<br>Airtime Fairness<br>RADIUS Client<br>Universal Beamforming<br>Explicit Beamforming</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>USB 3.2 Gen 1 x 1<br>USB application:<br>4G / 5G Auto Mobile Tethering<br>File System : HFS+, NTFS, vFAT, ext2, ext3, ext4<br>Safely Remove Disk<br>AiCloud<br>Download Master<br>AiDisk<br>Media Server<br>Time Machine<br>Samba Server<br>FTP Server<br>Shared Folder Privileges</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11a<br>IEEE 802.11b<br>IEEE 802.11g<br>WiFi 4 (802.11n)<br>WiFi 5 (802.11ac)<br>WiFi 6 (802.11ax)<br>WiFi 7 (802.11be)<br>IPv4<br>IPv6</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>AiProtection<br>VPN<br>WPS support, WPA/WPA2/WPA3-Personal, WPA/WPA2-Enterprise<br>WPS<br>Let\'s Encrypt<br>DNS-over-TLS<br>SSH<br>Security Scan<br>Firewall<br>• Maximum Firewall Keyword Filter : 64<br>• Maximum Firewall Network Service Filter : 32<br>• Maximum Firewall URL Filter : 64</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>1x 2.5G for WAN/LAN<br>1x 1G for WAN/LAN<br>3 x 1G LAN</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Boosts Speed:<br>OFDMA (Orthogonal Frequency Division Multiple Access)<br>Beamforming: standard-based and universal<br>4096-QAM high data rate<br>20/40/80/160 MHz bandwidth<br>OFDMA (Orthogonal Frequency Division Multiple Access)<br>Beamforming: standard-based and universal<br>4096-QAM high data rate<br>20/40/80/160 MHz bandwidth<br>AiMesh<br>AiMesh<br>• Primary AiMesh Router<br>• AiMesh Node<br>Parental Control<br>\"Allow you to block access to unwanted websites and apps.\"<br>Web &amp; Apps Filters<br>Time Scheduling<br>Safe Browsing<br>Customized Internet Schedule<br>Guest Network<br>\"The Guest Network provides Internet connection for guests but restricts access to your local network.\"<br>Support Guest Network<br>• Maximum Guest Network Rule : 2.4GHz x3, 5GHz x3<br>Guest Network Connection Time Limit<br>AiProtection<br>AiProtection Pro<br>• Router Security Assessment<br>• Malicious Site Blocking<br>• Two-Way IPS<br>• Infected Device Prevention and Blocking<br>VPN<br>Instant Guard<br>VPN Client L2TP<br>VPN Client Open VPN<br>VPN Client PPTP<br>VPN Client WireGuard<br>VPN Server IPSec<br>VPN Server Open VPN<br>VPN Server PPTP<br>VPN Server WireGuard<br>Traffic Control<br>Adaptive QoS<br>• Bandwidth Monitor<br>• Bandwidth Limiter<br>-- Maximum Bandwidth Limiter Rule : 32<br>Traditional QoS<br>-- Maximum Traditional QoS Rule : 32<br>Traffic Monitor<br>• Real-time Traffic Monitor<br>• Wired Traffic Monitor<br>• Wireless Traffic Monitor<br>Traffic Analyzer<br>• Traffic Analysis Period : Daily, Weekly, Monthly<br>• Website History<br>WAN<br>Internet connection Type : PPPoE, PPTP, L2TP, Automatic IP, Static IP<br>Dual WAN<br>3G / 4G LTE dongle<br>4G / 5G Auto Mobile Tethering<br>Port forwarding<br>• Maximum Port Forwarding Rule : 64<br>Port triggering<br>• Maximum Port Triggering Rule : 32<br>DMZ<br>DDNS<br>NAT Passthrough : PPTP Pass-Through, L2TP Pass-Through, IPSec Pass-Through, RTSP Pass-Through, H.323 Pass-Through, SIP Pass-Through, PPPoE relay<br>LAN<br>DHCP Server<br>IGMP Snooping<br>IPTV<br>Manually Assign IP Address<br>• Maximum Manually Assign IP Address Rule : 64<br>Wake on LAN (WOL)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>AC Input : 100V~240V (50~60Hz)<br>DC Output : 12 V with max. 2 A current</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>238 x 193 x 59 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>461g</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>2 Year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Router', 17300.00, 17400.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/0dF8DTLNotVk7jIcLY1vCmovTRL6fCEknKHk7FNE.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-24 15:53:49', '2026-05-24 15:53:49', 'ASUS RT-BE58U WiFi 7 Gaming Router 3600Mbps AiMesh | IOS Bangladesh', 'Buy ASUS RT-BE58U Dual Band WiFi 7 Gaming Router in Bangladesh from International Office Solution (IOS). Get 3600Mbps speed, AiMesh support, 2.5G port, advanced security, and ultra-low latency performance with official warranty.', 'ASUS RT-BE58U, WiFi 7 router Bangladesh, gaming router 3600Mbps, ASUS router price BD, AiMesh router Bangladesh, high speed router BD, dual band WiFi 7 router, ASUS gaming router IOS, 2.5G router Bangladesh, best router for gaming BD, RT-BE58U router', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL);
