(99, 'ASUS RT-AX82U AX5400 Dual-Band WiFi Gaming Router', 'The ASUS RT-AX82U AX5400 WiFi 6 Gaming Router delivers up to 5400Mbps speed, Aura RGB lighting, AiMesh support, and advanced gaming optimization. With WPA3 security and Adaptive QoS, it ensures fast, stable, and secure connectivity for gaming and streaming. Available from IOS Bangladesh.', 'asus-rt-ax82u-ax5400-dual-band-wifi-gaming-router-1779638368', '<p>The <strong>ASUS RT-AX82U AX5400 Wireless Dual-Band WiFi 6 Gigabit Gaming Router</strong> is a high-performance networking solution designed for gamers, streamers, and smart home users. Delivering ultra-fast speeds of up to <strong>5400 Mbps</strong> with advanced <strong>WiFi 6 (802.11ax)</strong> technology and 160MHz channels, it ensures smooth, lag-free connectivity for all online activities.</p><p>This gaming router features a <strong>dedicated mobile gaming mode</strong> via the ASUS Router App, allowing users to reduce latency instantly for competitive gaming. The stylish design includes <strong>customizable ASUS Aura RGB lighting effects</strong>, enabling users to personalize their setup with dynamic lighting modes.</p><p>With <strong>ASUS AiMesh support</strong>, the RT-AX82U can be combined with other compatible ASUS routers to create a seamless whole-home mesh network, eliminating WiFi dead zones and ensuring consistent coverage.</p><p>Security is strengthened with <strong>ASUS AiProtection Pro (powered by Trend Micro)</strong>, offering lifetime free protection, WPA3 encryption, malicious site blocking, and advanced parental controls for complete network safety.</p><p>For gamers, the <strong>dedicated gaming port</strong> automatically prioritizes connected devices such as PCs or consoles, ensuring stable and low-latency performance without complex setup. Additionally, <strong>Adaptive QoS (Quality of Service)</strong> allows prioritization of gaming, streaming, or browsing traffic for optimized performance.</p><p>The router also supports <strong>multiple operating modes</strong>, including wireless router and AiMesh networking, and provides full control through the ASUS mobile app for real-time monitoring and management.</p><p>With a powerful combination of performance, security, and gaming optimization, the <strong>ASUS RT-AX82U AX5400 WiFi 6 Gaming Router</strong> is the perfect choice for high-speed modern networks.</p><p>👉 Available in Bangladesh from <strong>International Office Solution (IOS)</strong> with official 2-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>1024-QAM high data rate<br>802.11a : 6,9,12,18,24,36,48,54 Mbps<br>802.11b : 1, 2, 5.5, 11 Mbps<br>802.11g : 6,9,12,18,24,36,48,54 Mbps<br>802.11n : up to 300 Mbps<br>802.11n (1024 QAM) : up to 500 Mbps<br>802.11ac (1024 QAM) : up to 4333 Mbps<br>802.11ax (2.4GHz) : up to 574 Mbps<br>802.11ax (5GHz) : up to 4804 Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>External antenna x 4</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS Button, Reset Button, Power Switch, LED on/off Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4 GHz / 5 GHz<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11a, IEEE 802.11b, IEEE 802.11g, IEEE 802.11n, IEEE 802.11ac, IEEE 802.11ax, IPv4, IPv6</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA3-Personal, WPA2-Personal, WPA-Personal, WPA-Enterprise , WPA2-Enterprise , WPS support</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>RJ45 for 10/100/1000 BaseT for WAN x 1, RJ45 for 10/100/1000 BaseT for LAN x 4<br>USB 3.2 Gen 1 x 1</td></tr><tr><td>Operating System Support</td><td>Windows 10<br>Windows 8<br>Windows 7<br>Mac OS X 10.6<br>Mac OS X 10.7<br>Mac OS X 10.8</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>AC Input : 110V~240V(50~60Hz)<br>DC Output : 19 V with max. 1.75 A current</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>275.5 x 184.4 x 165 mm (WxDxH) with antenna<br>275.5 x 184.4 x 65 mm (WxDxH) without antenna</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>740 g</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>02 years warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Router', 17090.00, 17189.99, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/0zTbkEYCV7nFiGuDP0NajQ9nLoxYD7lDM8Ukkgce.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-24 15:59:28', '2026-05-24 15:59:28', 'ASUS RT-AX82U AX5400 WiFi 6 Gaming Router | RGB Gaming Router BD IOS', 'Buy ASUS RT-AX82U AX5400 WiFi 6 Gaming Router in Bangladesh from International Office Solution (IOS). Get 5400Mbps speed, RGB lighting, AiMesh support, gaming port, and advanced security with WPA3 protection and 2-year warranty.', 'ASUS RT-AX82U, AX5400 gaming router Bangladesh, WiFi 6 router BD, ASUS gaming router price, RGB gaming router, AiMesh router Bangladesh, high speed router BD, ASUS router IOS, 5400Mbps router, best gaming router Bangladesh, RT-AX82U router', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(100, 'ASUS TUF Gaming BE3600 Dual Band WiFi 7 Gaming Router', 'The ASUS TUF Gaming BE3600 WiFi 7 Router delivers ultra-fast dual-band speeds, advanced gaming features, AiMesh support, and strong security with AiProtection Pro. Ideal for gaming, streaming, and large home networks with up to 2500 sq. ft. coverage. Available from IOS Bangladesh.', 'asus-tuf-gaming-be3600-dual-band-wifi-7-gaming-router-1779638622', '<p>The <strong>ASUS TUF Gaming BE3600 Dual Band WiFi 7 Gaming Router</strong> is a powerful next-generation networking solution designed for gamers, streamers, and high-performance users who demand ultra-fast speed, low latency, and stable connectivity. Built with the latest <strong>WiFi 7 (802.11be) technology</strong>, it delivers blazing speeds of up to <strong>2882 Mbps on 5GHz</strong> and <strong>688 Mbps on 2.4GHz</strong>, ensuring smooth 4K streaming, competitive gaming, and heavy multitasking.</p><p>Powered by a <strong>2.0 GHz quad-core processor</strong>, <strong>1GB RAM</strong>, and <strong>256MB flash storage</strong>, this router ensures efficient performance even under heavy network loads. Advanced technologies like <strong>OFDMA, 4096-QAM, and 160 MHz bandwidth</strong> significantly improve speed, reduce latency, and enhance overall network efficiency.</p><p>The ASUS TUF Gaming BE3600 features <strong>four external antennas</strong> with beamforming technology, providing wide coverage of up to <strong>2500 sq. ft.</strong> and ensuring stable connections across multiple devices. It supports multiple operating modes including <strong>AiMesh Node Mode, Access Point Mode, and Media Bridge Mode</strong>, making it ideal for expanding home or office networks.</p><p>For connectivity, it includes <strong>1× 2.5G WAN/LAN port, 1× Gigabit WAN/LAN port, 3× Gigabit LAN ports, and a USB 3.2 Gen 1 port</strong>, allowing fast wired performance and external storage sharing.</p><p>Security is enhanced with <strong>AiProtection Pro</strong>, offering malware protection, two-way IPS, and infected device prevention. It also supports advanced VPN protocols like <strong>OpenVPN, WireGuard, IPSec, and PPTP</strong> with VPN Fusion for secure browsing.</p><p>Gamers benefit from features like <strong>Game Boost, Gear Accelerator, OpenNAT, and a dedicated Gaming Port</strong>, ensuring priority traffic and reduced lag during gameplay. Additional tools such as <strong>Adaptive QoS, bandwidth control, and traffic monitoring</strong> optimize network performance for all users.</p><p>Parental controls allow management of up to <strong>64 user profiles</strong>, with scheduling and content filtering for safe internet usage.</p><p>With support for <strong>WiFi 4/5/6/7, WPA3 security, DNS-over-TLS, and IPv6</strong>, the ASUS TUF Gaming BE3600 delivers both cutting-edge performance and strong security in a durable TUF-designed chassis.</p><p>👉 Available in Bangladesh from <strong>International Office Solution (IOS)</strong> with official 2-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>WiFi 6 (802.11ax) (5GHz) : up to 2402 Mbps<br>WiFi 7 (802.11be) (2.4GHz): up to 688 Mbps<br>WiFi 7 (802.11be) (5GHz): up to 2882 Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>External fixed antenna x4</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS Button, Reset Button, Power Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4 GHz<br>5 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>UTF-8 SSID<br>WiFi MAC Address Filter<br>Maximum MAC Filters: 64<br>Wireless Scheduler<br>Airtime Fairness<br>RADIUS Client<br>Universal Beamforming<br>Explicit Beamforming</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>File System : HFS+, NTFS, vFAT, ext2, ext3, ext4<br>Safely Remove Disk<br>Download Master<br>Media Server<br>Time Machine<br>Samba Server<br>FTP Server<br>Shared Folder Privileges</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11a<br>IEEE 802.11b<br>IEEE 802.11g<br>WiFi 4