(101, 'TP-Link Archer GXE75 AXE5400 Tri-Band Wi-Fi 6E Gaming Router', 'The TP-Link Archer GXE75 AXE5400 Tri-Band Wi-Fi 6E Gaming Router delivers up to 5400Mbps speed with a dedicated 6GHz band, powerful quad-core CPU, and advanced gaming optimization. With HomeShield security and OneMesh support, it ensures fast, stable, and secure connectivity. Available from IOS Bangladesh.', 'tp-link-archer-gxe75-axe5400-tri-band-wi-fi-6e-gaming-router-1779638943', '<p>The <strong>TP-Link Archer GXE75 AXE5400 Tri-Band Wi-Fi 6E Gaming Router</strong> is a high-performance networking solution designed for gamers, streamers, and modern smart homes. Featuring the latest <strong>Wi-Fi 6E technology</strong>, it introduces a dedicated <strong>6 GHz band</strong>, delivering ultra-low latency, reduced congestion, and significantly faster wireless performance.</p><p>With combined speeds of up to <strong>5400 Mbps</strong>, this tri-band router ensures smooth <strong>4K/8K streaming, AR/VR gaming, and high-speed downloads</strong> without interruption. Powered by a <strong>1.7 GHz Quad-Core processor</strong> and <strong>512 MB RAM</strong>, it delivers stable performance even under heavy network loads and multiple connected devices.</p><p>The tri-band architecture (6 GHz, 5 GHz, and 2.4 GHz) efficiently distributes traffic, reducing congestion and optimizing performance across all devices. The <strong>6 GHz band</strong> is ideal for next-gen devices, while the 5 GHz and 2.4 GHz bands ensure compatibility with older devices and everyday usage.</p><p>Advanced technologies like <strong>OFDMA, MU-MIMO, and Beamforming</strong> enhance coverage and connection stability throughout your home. With four high-performance antennas, the router ensures strong and consistent WiFi signals in every corner.</p><p>For gamers, the <strong>Game Boost feature</strong> prioritizes gaming traffic for ultra-low latency and smoother gameplay. A dedicated gaming panel provides real-time network insights for performance optimization.</p><p>Security is strengthened with <strong>TP-Link HomeShield</strong>, offering protection against cyber threats, parental controls, and device-level security management.</p><p>The router also supports <strong>TP-Link OneMesh technology</strong>, allowing seamless integration with compatible extenders for whole-home coverage without signal drops.</p><p>👉 Available in Bangladesh from <strong>International Office Solution (IOS)</strong> with official warranty support.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>6 GHz: 2402 Mbps (802.11ax)<br>5 GHz: 2402 Mbps (802.11ax)<br>2.4 GHz: 574 Mbps (802.11ax)</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>6 GHz<br>5 GHz<br>2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>802.11ax</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA<br>WPA2<br>WPA3<br>WPA/WPA2-Enterprise (802.1x)</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>1× 2.5Gbps WAN/LAN<br>1× 1Gbps WAN/LAN<br>3× 1Gbps LAN<br>1× USB 3.0</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Access Point Mode<br>EasyMesh-Compatible<br>Works with Alexa and Google Assistant<br>SPI Firewall<br>Access Control<br>IP &amp; MAC Binding<br>Application Layer Gateway<br>1.Game Acceleration:<br>• Accelerate Game Applications with QoS<br>• Accelerate Game Devices with Gaming Port<br>• Game Servers Acceleration by GPN<br>• One-Click Acceleration Button<br>2. Game Panel:<br>• Network Status<br>• Router Performance<br>• RGB Settings<br>• Accelerated Games and Gears<br>3.Game Statistics:<br>Comprehensive Gaming Traffic Reports<br>4. Dedicated Gaming Band<br>5 GHz Gaming Band<br>Cloud Service<br>NAT Forwarding</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Router', 20000.00, 20100.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/nA8NEsdRmePkovls17eJ0Zd5onYrf16qTS9CtjqF.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-24 16:09:03', '2026-05-24 16:09:03', 'TP-Link Archer GXE75 AXE5400 WiFi 6E Gaming Router | Tri-Band Router BD IOS', 'Buy TP-Link Archer GXE75 AXE5400 Tri-Band Wi-Fi 6E Gaming Router in Bangladesh from International Office Solution (IOS). Get 5400Mbps speed, 6GHz band, Game Boost, HomeShield security, and OneMesh support with official warranty.', 'TP-Link GXE75, AXE5400 gaming router Bangladesh, WiFi 6E router BD, tri band gaming router, 5400Mbps router Bangladesh, TP-Link router price BD, gaming router IOS, high speed router BD, 6GHz WiFi router, TP-Link Archer GXE75 router, best gaming router BD', NULL, 206, NULL, NULL),
(102, 'ASUS TUF Gaming AX6000 Dual Band WiFi Gaming Router', 'The Asus TUF Gaming AX6000 WiFi 6 Dual Band Gaming Router delivers up to 6000Mbps speed, dual 2.5G ports, AiMesh support, and advanced AiProtection Pro security. Designed for gamers, it ensures ultra-fast, stable, and secure connectivity for all devices. Available from IOS Bangladesh.', 'asus-tuf-gaming-ax6000-dual-band-wifi-gaming-router-1779639192', '<p>The <strong>Asus TUF Gaming AX6000 6000Mbps Dual Band Gaming Router</strong> is a high-performance WiFi 6 networking solution built for gamers, streamers, and heavy internet users who demand ultra-fast speed, stability, and security. Powered by the latest <strong>WiFi 6 (802.11ax) technology</strong>, it delivers blazing speeds of up to <strong>6000 Mbps</strong>, ensuring smooth online gaming, 4K/8K streaming, and lag-free browsing.</p><p>This dual-band gaming router operates on both <strong>2.4GHz and 5GHz frequencies</strong> with a powerful <strong>4x4 MIMO configuration</strong> and six external antennas, providing wide coverage and strong signal stability throughout your home or office.</p><p>Equipped with a <strong>2.0 GHz quad-core processor</strong> and <strong>512MB RAM</strong>, the AX6000 handles multiple devices effortlessly, making it ideal for high-density networks and competitive gaming environments. It also includes <strong>dual 2.5G Ethernet ports</strong>, ensuring ultra-fast wired connections for gaming PCs and consoles.</p><p>With <strong>ASUS AiMesh support</strong>, users can create a seamless whole-home mesh network by connecting multiple compatible ASUS routers, eliminating dead zones and improving coverage.</p><p>Security is enhanced with <strong>AiProtection Pro</strong>, powered by Trend Micro, offering advanced protection such as malicious site blocking, intrusion prevention, and real-time network monitoring.</p><p>For gamers, the router features <strong>customizable ASUS Aura RGB lighting</strong>, allowing you to personalize your setup with dynamic lighting effects. Advanced technologies like <strong>OFDMA, MU-MIMO, and beamforming</strong> ensure efficient bandwidth usage and stable connections across multiple devices.</p><p>The <strong>ASUS Router App</strong> provides easy setup, real-time monitoring, and full network control, making it user-friendly for both beginners and advanced users.</p><p>Whether for competitive gaming, streaming, or smart home connectivity, the <strong>Asus TUF Gaming AX6000 WiFi 6 Gaming Router</strong> delivers unmatched performance, speed, and reliability.</p><p>👉 Available in Bangladesh from <strong>International Office Solution (IOS)</strong> with official 2-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>802.11a: up to 54 Mbps<br>802.11b: up to 11 Mbps<br>802.11g: up to 54 Mbps<br>WiFi 6 (802.11ax) (2.4GHz): up to 1148 Mbps<br>WiFi 6 (802.11ax) (5GHz): up to 4804 Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>External antenna x 6</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS Button, Reset Button, Power Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4 GHz / 5 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>UTF-8 SSID<br>WiFi MAC Address Filter<br>• Maximum MAC Filters : 64<br>Wireless Scheduler<br>Airtime Fairness<br>RADIUS Client<br>Universal Beamforming<br>Explicit Beamforming</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11a<br>IEEE 802.11b<br>IEEE 802.11g<br>WiFi 4 (802.11n)<br>WiFi 5 (802.11ac)<br>WiFi 6 (802.11ax)<br>IPv4<br>IPv6</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>RJ45 for 2.5 Gigabits BaseT for WAN x 1,<br>RJ45 for 2.5 Gigabits BaseT for LAN x 1,<br>RJ45 for Gigabits BaseT for LAN x 4,<br>USB 3.2 Gen 1 x 1,</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>VPN Client L2TP<br>VPN Client Open VPN<br>VPN Client PPTP<br>VPN Client WireGuard<br>VPN Server IPSec<br>VPN Server Open VPN<br>VPN Server PPTP<br>VPN Server WireGuard<br>VPN Fusion<br><br>LAN:<br>DHCP Server<br>IGMP Snooping<br>IPTV<br>LAN Link Aggregation<br>Manually Assign IP Address<br>• Maximum Manually Assign IP Address Rule : 64<br>Wake on LAN (WOL)<br><br>USB application:<br>File System: HFS+, NTFS, vFAT, ext2, ext3, ext4<br>Safely Remove Disk<br>AiCloud<br>Download Master<br>AiDisk<br>Media Server<br>Time Machine<br>Samba Server<br>FTP Server<br>Shared Folder Privileges</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>AC Input : 100V~240V (50~60Hz)<br>DC Output : 12 V with max. 2.5 A current</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>301.02 x 174 x 216 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>696g</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>2 Years</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Router', 20500.00, 20580.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/S0LxT9iJ9omfEDJHBxVZBTIqtZIGW2qbX6md2xTf.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-24 16:13:12', '2026-05-24 16:13:12', 'Asus TUF Gaming AX6000 6000Mbps WiFi 6 Gaming Router | Dual 2.5G Router BD IOS', 'Buy Asus TUF Gaming AX6000 Dual Band WiFi 6 Gaming Router in Bangladesh from International Office Solution (IOS). Get 6000Mbps speed, dual 2.5G ports, AiMesh support, Aura RGB, and AiProtection Pro with 2-year warranty.', 'Asus TUF AX6000, 6000Mbps gaming router Bangladesh, WiFi 6 router BD, Asus router price Bangladesh, dual band gaming router, 2.5G router BD, AiMesh router Bangladesh, ASUS gaming router IOS, high speed router BD, best gaming router Bangladesh', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(103, 'Tenda Nova MW3 AC1200 Dual Band Mesh Router (1 Pack)', 'Tenda Nova MW3 AC1200 Dual Band Mesh Router\r\n\r\nThe Tenda Nova MW3 AC1200 Dual Band Mesh Router provides seamless whole-home WiFi coverage with dual-band speeds up to 1200Mbps. Powered by a 1GHz CPU with 128MB RAM, it ensures smooth streaming, gaming, and smart device connectivity. Featuring Beamforming, MU-MIMO, Smart QoS, parental controls, and WPA/WPA2 security, the router delivers stable and secure wireless performance. It also supports app-based management, guest networking, and both IPv4 & IPv6 compatibility.', 'tenda-nova-mw3-ac1200-dual-band-mesh-router-1-pack-1779640831', '<h2><strong>Tenda Nova MW3 AC1200 Dual Band Mesh Router (1 Pack)</strong></h2><p>The Tenda <strong>Nova MW3</strong> AC1200 Dual Band <a href=\"https://www.startech.com.bd/mesh-router\">Mesh Router</a> delivers stable whole-home WiFi coverage. The Tenda Mesh Router supports IEEE 802.3, 802.3u, and 802.3ab standards, ensuring reliable wired connectivity. Powered by a 1GHz CPU and 128MB RAM, Tenda Nova MW3 Mesh Router handles streaming, browsing, and smart devices smoothly. Each node includes two 10/100Mbps RJ45 ports, dual internal antennas, and a reset button for quick configuration. The Tenda Mesh Router features a tri-color LED indicator showing green, yellow, or red for network status clarity. It supports IEEE 802.11a/b/g/n/ac Wave 2 with dual-band speeds up to 300Mbps on 2.4GHz and 867Mbps on 5GHz. With transmission power under 20dBm on 2.4GHz and 23dBm on 5GHz, it meets CE requirements. Tenda Nova MW3 AC1200 Dual Band Mesh Router includes Beamforming, MU-MIMO, AP Steering, and Band Steering for optimized device connections. WPA-PSK and WPA2-PSK encryption protect your wireless network from unauthorized access. The router supports PPPoE, Dynamic IP, Static IP, PPTP, and L2TP connections for flexible ISP compatibility. IPv4 and IPv6 protocols ensure modern network support in router or bridge mode. Parental controls with client filtering help manage children’s internet usage effectively. Port forwarding, UPnP, and TCP or UDP flood protection strengthen security and performance. Smart QoS prioritizes gaming, video, audio, and downloads for smoother online experiences. Tenda Nova MW3 Mesh Router supports manual DNS settings, auto-sensing internet detection, and convenient app-based remote management. Users can create a guest network and perform firmware upgrades online easily. The Router operates between 0℃ and 40℃ with humidity tolerance from 10% to 90% non-condensing. Certified by CE, FCC, RoHS, EAC, and IC, Tenda Nova MW3 AC1200 Dual Band Mesh Router ensures dependable performance and safety compliance.</p><h2><strong>Buy Tenda Nova MW3 AC1200 Dual Band Mesh Router from Star Tech</strong></h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can get original <strong>Tenda Nova MW3 AC1200 Dual Band Mesh Router</strong> From Star Tech. We have a large collection of latest <a href=\"https://www.startech.com.bd/tenda-router\">Tenda Router</a> to purchase. Order Online Or Visit your Nearest <a href=\"https://www.startech.com.bd/\">Star Tech Shop</a> to get yours at lowest price. The Tenda Nova MW3 AC1200 Dual Band Mesh Router comes with 1 year warranty.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>2.4GHz: 300Mbps<br>5GHz: 867Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2 x Internal antenna</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1 x Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>Dual Band (2.4GHz &amp; 5GHz)</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.3, IEEE 802.3u, IEEE 802.4ab<br>IEEE802.11a/b/g/n/ac (WiFi 5 wave 2)</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK(default)</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>2 x 10/100Mbps RJ45 ports per node</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Smart QoS (Gaming, Video &amp; Audio, Download)<br>Auto-sensing internet connection<br>Support App management and Remote management<br>Guest Network<br>Firmware upgrade online<br>SSID Broadcast<br>Beam Forming<br>MU-MIMO<br>AP Steering<br>Band Steering</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Input: 100-240V—50/60Hz, 0.3A<br>Output: 12V 1A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>90 x 90x 90mm (3.54 x 3.54 x 3.54 in.)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Mesh', 2154.00, 2154.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/5FGHRQDqioBZ2i6gLuaYjH2BnifNiS30BHbImIg3.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-24 16:40:31', '2026-05-24 17:39:31', 'Tenda Nova MW3 AC1200 Dual Band Mesh Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Tenda Nova MW3, Tenda MW3 AC1200, Mesh Router Bangladesh, Dual Band Mesh Router, Tenda WiFi Router, Whole Home WiFi, Tenda Nova MW3 Price BD, AC1200 Mesh WiFi, International Office Solution, Tenda Router', 'Tenda Nova MW3, Tenda MW3 AC1200, Mesh Router Bangladesh, Dual Band Mesh Router, Tenda WiFi Router, Whole Home WiFi, Tenda Nova MW3 Price BD, AC1200 Mesh WiFi, International Office Solution, Tenda Router', NULL, 207, NULL, NULL),
(104, 'Cudy M1200 AC1200 Dual Band Mesh Router (1 Pack)', 'Cudy M1200 AC1200 Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router delivers fast and stable dual-band WiFi speeds up to 1200Mbps with seamless whole-home mesh coverage. Featuring Gigabit ports, VPN support, Router/AP modes, and strong wall penetration, it is ideal for streaming, gaming, and smart home connectivity. Comes with a 1-year warranty.', 'cudy-m1200-ac1200-dual-band-mesh-router-1-pack-1779641284', '<h2>Cudy M1200 AC1200 Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router (1 Pack)</h2><p>The Cudy M1200 AC1200 Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router is a reliable and affordable mesh networking solution designed to deliver seamless WiFi coverage throughout your home. Equipped with 16MB Flash memory and 128MB DDR3 RAM, this router ensures stable performance for everyday internet usage, streaming, gaming, and smart home connectivity.</p><p>Featuring dual-band AC1200 WiFi technology, the router delivers up to 300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band and 867Mbps on the 5GHz band. The 2.4GHz frequency offers wider coverage and better wall penetration, making it ideal for browsing and smart devices, while the 5GHz band provides high-speed performance perfect for online gaming, 4K video streaming, and heavy downloads.</p><p>The Cudy M1200 includes 2 Gigabit Ethernet ports for high-speed wired connections and dual internal omni-directional antennas that help extend wireless coverage across multiple rooms. Its mesh networking capability allows you to expand coverage easily by adding additional mesh units, ensuring uninterrupted connectivity throughout your home.</p><p>This router supports both Router Mode and Access Point Mode. In Router Mode, it establishes a direct internet connection and distributes high-speed internet to connected devices. In Access Point Mode, it works alongside an existing modem or router to extend network coverage efficiently.</p><p>For enhanced online security and remote connectivity, the router comes with built-in PPTP and L2TP VPN client support, enabling secure connections to office or school networks. The DDNS feature also allows remote network management by linking your changing IP address to a fixed custom domain name.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul><li>Dual-Band AC1200 WiFi Speed</li><li>Mesh WiFi Coverage Expansion</li><li>2 x Gigabit Ethernet Ports</li><li>Internal Omni-Directional Antennas</li><li>Router &amp; Access Point Modes</li><li>PPTP/L2TP VPN Client Support</li><li>DDNS Remote Management</li><li>Strong Wall Penetration Performance</li></ul><p>The Cudy M1200 AC1200 Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router comes with a 1-year warranty, making it a dependable networking solution for homes and small offices.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>867Mbps (5GHz), 300Mbps (2.4GHz)<br>Compatible with 802.11a/b/g/n/ac Wi-Fi standards</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2 × Internal Omni-Directional Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Pair Button, Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>5 GHz, 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Wireless Modes: Enable/Disable Wireless Radio, WMM<br>Wireless Security: WEP, WPA/WPA2, WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1 × 100/10Mbps WAN Port<br>1 × 100/10Mbps LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11/ac/n/a 5GHz<br>IEEE 802.11/n/b/g 2.4GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Flash: 128Mbit (16MB)<br>DDR: 1Gbit (128MB)</td></tr><tr><td>Operating System Support</td><td>Microsoft Windows 98SE/ NT/ 2000/ XP/ Vista/ 7/ 8/ 8.1/ 10, MAC OS, NetWare, UNIX or Linux</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>12V/1A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'router', 2374.00, 2373.98, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/JWnnASRV4tOghT7uulw6UZTgmxDTwk250wiC92yt.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-24 16:48:04', '2026-05-24 17:39:12', 'Cudy M1200 AC1200 Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router with Gigabit Ports & VPN Support in Bangladesh', 'Buy the Cudy M1200 AC1200 Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router with dual-band AC1200 WiFi, mesh coverage, Gigabit ports, VPN support, and Router/AP modes. Ideal for gaming, streaming, and whole-home connectivity.', 'Cudy M1200, Cudy AC1200 Router, Mesh WiFi Router, Whole Home Mesh WiFi, Dual Band Router, Gigabit WiFi Router, Cudy Router Bangladesh, AC1200 Mesh Router, VPN WiFi Router, Home WiFi System', NULL, 114, NULL, NULL),
(105, 'TP-Link Deco E4 AC1200 Dual-band Mesh Router (1 Pack)', 'The TP-Link Deco E4 Whole Home Mesh Wi‑Fi System AC1200 Dual‑Band Router is an advanced whole-home mesh Wi-Fi solution designed to eliminate weak signal areas and deliver seamless internet coverage throughout your home or office. Featuring dual-band AC1200 wireless technology, the Deco E4 provides speeds up to 1167Mbps and supports connectivity for up to 100 devices simultaneously. Its intelligent mesh system automatically connects your devices to the fastest Deco unit for uninterrupted browsing, streaming, gaming, and video calls. With easy setup, parental controls, access point mode, and range extender functionality, the Deco E4 is an ideal networking solution from International Office Solution for modern connected lifestyles.', 'tp-link-deco-e4-ac1200-dual-band-mesh-router-1-pack-1779644047', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>TP-Link Deco E4 Whole Home Mesh Wi-Fi System AC1200 Dual-Band Router</strong></h2><p>The TP-Link Deco E4 Whole Home Mesh Wi‑Fi System AC1200 Dual‑Band Router from International Office Solution is the perfect networking solution for homes and small offices seeking stable, seamless, and high-speed wireless coverage. Designed with advanced Mesh Wi-Fi technology, the Deco E4 system eliminates dead zones and ensures uninterrupted internet connectivity across every corner of your space.</p><p>This dual-pack mesh system can cover up to 1500 square feet, making it ideal for apartments, medium-sized homes, and office environments. Unlike traditional routers and range extenders, Deco units work together to create a single unified Wi-Fi network. Your smartphone, tablet, laptop, or smart device automatically connects to the nearest and fastest Deco unit as you move around, ensuring a smooth and uninterrupted online experience without signal drops.</p><p>Powered by IEEE 802.11ac wireless technology, the Deco E4 delivers combined wireless speeds of up to 1167Mbps on dual bands, providing fast and reliable internet for HD streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, and heavy browsing. The system is capable of handling connections for up to 100 devices simultaneously, making it suitable for modern smart homes filled with smartphones, smart TVs, gaming consoles, IP cameras, and IoT devices.</p><p>The Deco E4 supports multiple operating modes including Router Mode, Access Point Mode, and Range Extender Mode, giving users the flexibility to customize their network setup according to their requirements. Its intelligent adaptive routing technology continuously selects the best path for faster performance and stronger connectivity.</p><p>For families, the built-in Parental Control feature offers enhanced online safety by allowing parents to create unique profiles, set internet usage schedules, filter inappropriate content, and manage online time for each family member. This ensures a secure and healthy digital environment for children and teenagers.</p><p>Setting up the Deco E4 is extremely simple using the TP-Link Deco mobile app, which guides users through the entire installation process step by step. The modern compact design also blends beautifully with any home or office décor.</p><p>Whether you need strong Wi-Fi coverage for work, entertainment, online classes, or smart home devices, the TP-Link Deco E4 AC1200 Mesh Wi-Fi System from International Office Solution provides reliable performance, wider coverage, and seamless connectivity for everyday digital life.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>300 Mbps on 2.4 GHz<br>867 Mbps on 5 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2 internal dual-band antennas per Deco unit</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1 Reset button on the underside</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4 GHz and 5 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>2 Internal dual-band antennas per Deco unit</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11 ac/n/a 5GHz, 300 Mbps at 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>2 10/100Mbps, WAN/LAN Ports, 1 Power Port</td></tr><tr><td>Operating System Support</td><td>iOS 9.0 or later<br>Android 4.3 or later</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>AC adapter input : 100-240V/50-60Hz 0.3A<br>AC adapter output : 12 ⎓ 1A<br>Transmit Power : FCC: &lt;30 dBm<br>CE: &lt;20 dBm (2.4 GHz)<br>&lt;23 dBm (5 GHz)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>7.5 x 3.6 x 3.6 in (190.5 x 90.7 x 90.7 mm)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01 Year warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'router', 2635.00, 2635.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/DlBs3q0ucbzRdyJUhuXi3tlo5cOvuIlYXZfEttLh.jpg', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-24 17:34:07', '2026-05-24 17:38:01', 'TP-Link Deco E4 AC1200 Dual-Band Mesh Wi-Fi Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy TP-Link Deco E4 AC1200 Dual-Band Mesh Wi-Fi Router from International Office Solution. Enjoy seamless whole-home coverage, mesh technology, speeds up to 1167Mbps, parental controls, and support for up to 100 devices.', 'TP-Link Deco E4, Deco E4 AC1200, Mesh WiFi Router, TP-Link Mesh Router, Dual Band Router, Whole Home WiFi, AC1200 Router, Wireless Router, Smart Home WiFi, International Office Solution, TP-Link Bangladesh, Mesh Network System', NULL, 206, NULL, NULL),
(106, 'TP-Link TL-WR841N 300Mbps Wireless Router', 'The TP-Link TL-WR841N 300Mbps Wireless Router is a reliable and affordable networking solution designed for smooth internet connectivity at home or small offices. Featuring wireless speeds up to 300Mbps with advanced 802.11n technology, this router is ideal for HD streaming, online gaming, video calls, and everyday browsing. With MIMO technology, strong security encryption, parental controls, and guest network support, the TL-WR841N ensures stable and secure wireless performance for multiple connected devices.', 'tp-link-tl-wr841n-300mbps-wireless-router-1779644758', '<p>TP-Link TL-WR841N 300Mbps Wireless Router The TP-Link TL-WR841N 300Mbps Wireless Router from International Office Solution is a dependable and high-performance wireless router designed to deliver fast, stable, and secure internet connectivity for homes and small businesses. Powered by advanced IEEE 802.11n wireless technology, this router provides wireless speeds of up to 300Mbps, making it ideal for HD video streaming, online gaming, VoIP calls, video conferencing, and large file downloads.</p><p>Equipped with 2T2R MIMO (Multiple Input Multiple Output) technology, the TP-Link TL-WR841N enhances wireless coverage and signal stability by improving data transmission efficiency. This ensures smoother performance and stronger connectivity across multiple rooms and devices.</p><p>The router supports multiple wireless modes and offers easy setup through an intuitive web interface and the TP-Link Tether App, allowing users to manage network settings conveniently from smartphones or computers. Whether you are setting up a new network or managing existing connections, the user-friendly interface simplifies the process.</p><p>For improved online security, the TP-Link TL-WR841N includes advanced WPA/WPA2-PSK encryption protocols to protect your network against unauthorized access and cyber threats. It also features Guest Network support, enabling visitors to access the internet without compromising your private network security.</p><p>The built-in Parental Control function allows users to manage and monitor internet access for family members, helping parents create a safer online environment for children. Additionally, Bandwidth Control ensures fair and efficient distribution of internet speed across connected devices, reducing lag and improving overall network performance.</p><p>With its compact design, stable wireless performance, and practical networking features, the TP-Link TL-WR841N is an excellent choice for users looking for an affordable yet efficient wireless router solution for daily internet activities.</p><p>International Office Solution offers genuine TP-Link networking products with trusted customer support and competitive pricing, ensuring reliable connectivity solutions for homes and offices across Bangladesh.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Wireless N Router</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Signal Rate</td><td>11n: Up to 300Mbps(dynamic)<br>11g: Up to 54Mbps(dynamic)<br>11b: Up to 11Mbps(dynamic)</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01 Year Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>4 10/100Mbps LAN PORTS<br>1 10/100Mbps WAN PORT</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS/Reset Button<br>Wireless On/Off Switch<br>Power On/Off Button</td></tr><tr><td>External Power Supply</td><td>9VDC / 0.6A</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless Standards</td><td>IEEE 802.11n, IEEE 802.11g, IEEE 802.11b</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4-2.4835GHz</td></tr><tr><td>EIRP</td><td>&lt;20dBm(EIRP)</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless Security</td><td>64/128/152-bit WEP / WPA / WPA2,WPA-PSK / WPA2-PSK</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Router', 1500.00, 1600.00, NULL, 10, 'products/thumbnails/dkjVCr0LOYmNkO7xmLQtGFAhNrSFrVz1V0eBVJYU.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-24 17:45:58', '2026-05-24 17:45:58', 'TP-Link TL-WR841N 300Mbps Wireless Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy TP-Link TL-WR841N 300Mbps Wireless Router from International Office Solution. Enjoy stable WiFi connectivity, advanced security, parental controls, and smooth streaming for home and office use.', 'TP-Link TL-WR841N, TP-Link Router, 300Mbps Wireless Router, WiFi Router, TP-Link WiFi Router, Wireless N Router, Home Router, TP-Link Bangladesh, International Office Solution, Secure Wireless Router, Budget WiFi Router', NULL, 206, NULL, NULL),
(107, 'TP-Link Archer C24 AC750 Dual-Band WiFi Router', 'The TP-Link Archer C24 AC750 Dual-Band WiFi Router is a compact and high-performance wireless router designed to provide fast, stable, and reliable internet connectivity for homes and small offices. Featuring dual-band AC750 technology, the router delivers speeds up to 433Mbps on 5GHz and 300Mbps on 2.4GHz for smooth HD streaming, online gaming, and multitasking. With four external antennas, parental controls, guest network support, and multi-mode functionality, the Archer C24 offers excellent coverage and flexible networking performance for modern digital lifestyles.', 'tp-link-archer-c24-ac750-dual-band-wifi-router-1779645070', '<h2>TP-Link Archer C24 AC750 Dual-Band WiFi Router</h2><p>The TP-Link Archer C24 AC750 Dual-Band WiFi Router from International Office Solution is a reliable and feature-rich networking solution built to meet the demands of modern homes and offices. Combining speed, stability, and versatile functionality in a compact design, this router ensures seamless internet access for streaming, gaming, remote work, and smart home connectivity.</p><p>Powered by advanced dual-band wireless technology, the Archer C24 operates on both 2.4GHz and 5GHz frequency bands. The 2.4GHz band delivers speeds up to 300Mbps, ideal for everyday browsing, emails, and social media, while the 5GHz band offers speeds up to 433Mbps for high-bandwidth tasks such as HD video streaming, online gaming, and video conferencing. This dual-band capability reduces network congestion and provides a smoother online experience for multiple connected devices.</p><p>The router is equipped with four high-performance fixed external antennas that significantly improve wireless coverage and signal stability throughout your home or office. These antennas help minimize dead zones and ensure stronger connectivity across different rooms and floors.</p><p>Designed for flexibility, the TP-Link Archer C24 supports multiple operating modes including Router Mode, Access Point Mode, and Range Extender Mode. This allows users to customize the network setup according to their environment and connectivity needs. Whether expanding an existing network or creating a new wireless setup, the Archer C24 adapts efficiently.</p><p>For enhanced online safety and network management, the router includes advanced Parental Controls, enabling users to manage internet access and restrict inappropriate content for children and family members. The dedicated Guest Network feature allows visitors to access the internet securely without affecting the privacy of the main network.</p><p>The Archer C24 also supports modern networking technologies such as IGMP Proxy/Snooping, IPTV, and IPv6 compatibility, making it a future-ready solution for evolving internet and multimedia requirements. Additionally, the router has undergone extensive stability testing to ensure long-term reliable performance.</p><p>Its sleek and compact design allows easy placement in any room without occupying much space, while the intuitive TP-Link setup interface makes installation and management simple even for first-time users.</p><p>International Office Solution offers authentic TP-Link networking products with dependable customer support and competitive pricing, making the TP-Link Archer C24 AC750 Dual-Band WiFi Router an excellent choice for reliable and efficient wireless networking.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>5 GHz: 433 Mbps (802.11ac)<br>2.4 GHz: 300 Mbps (802.11n)</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4× Fixed Antennas<br>Multiple antennas form a signal-boosting array to cover more directions and large areas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS/Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>5 GHz, 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Wi-Fi 5 (AC750)</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1× 5 GHz Guest Network<br>1× 2.4 GHz Guest Network</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11ac/n/a 5 GHz<br>IEEE 802.11n/b/g 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WEP<br>WPA<br>WPA2<br>WPA/WPA2-Enterprise (802.1x)</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>Ethernet Ports<br>1× 10/100 Mbps WAN Port<br>4× 10/100 Mbps LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Network Security:<br>SPI Firewall<br>Access Control<br>IP &amp; MAC Binding<br>Application Layer Gateway<br><br>WiFi Encryption:<br>WEP<br>WPA<br>WPA2<br>WPA/WPA2-Enterprise (802.1x)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Router Mode<br>Access Point Mode<br>Range Extender Mode</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>4.5 × 4.2 × 1.0 in<br>(115 × 106.7 × 24.3 mm)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01 year warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band', 1849.00, 1800.00, NULL, 19, 'products/thumbnails/os6gISu1TVYL5Wfn2JuiFvL83HFDs0gliX8VInUK.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-24 17:51:10', '2026-05-24 17:51:10', 'TP-Link Archer C24 AC750 Dual-Band WiFi Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy TP-Link Archer C24 AC750 Dual-Band WiFi Router from International Office Solution. Enjoy fast dual-band WiFi, wider coverage, parental controls, guest network support, and stable internet connectivity for home and office use.', 'TP-Link Archer C24, Archer C24 Router, AC750 WiFi Router, Dual-Band Router, TP-Link WiFi Router, Wireless Router, Home WiFi Router, TP-Link Bangladesh, International Office Solution, Guest Network Router, IPTV Router, IPv6 Router', NULL, 206, NULL, NULL);
