(108, 'TP-Link Archer C54 AC1200 Dual Band Wi-Fi Router', 'The TP-Link Archer C54 AC1200 Dual Band Wi‑Fi Router is a high-speed wireless router designed for smooth 4K streaming, online gaming, and fast downloads. Featuring AC1200 dual-band technology, MU-MIMO support, Beamforming, and four powerful antennas, the Archer C54 delivers stable connectivity and wider Wi-Fi coverage for homes and small offices. With Router, Access Point, and Range Extender modes, along with parental controls and guest network features, it offers flexible and secure networking performance for modern users.', 'tp-link-archer-c54-ac1200-dual-band-wi-fi-router-1779645282', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>TP-Link Archer C54 AC1200 Dual Band Wi-Fi Router</strong></h2><p>The TP-Link Archer C54 AC1200 Dual Band Wi‑Fi Router from International Office Solution is an advanced networking solution designed to provide fast, stable, and efficient wireless connectivity for modern homes and offices. Built with AC1200 dual-band Wi-Fi technology, this router ensures seamless internet performance for streaming, gaming, video conferencing, and heavy online activities.</p><p>The Archer C54 operates on both 2.4GHz and 5GHz frequency bands, delivering combined wireless speeds of up to 1200Mbps. The 2.4GHz band provides stable and wide-reaching connectivity for everyday browsing and smart devices, while the faster 5GHz band is ideal for bandwidth-intensive tasks such as 4K video streaming, online gaming, and high-speed downloading.</p><p>Equipped with four high-performance external antennas and advanced Beamforming technology, the Archer C54 enhances Wi-Fi signal strength and coverage throughout your home or office. Beamforming intelligently focuses wireless signals toward connected devices, improving connection stability and reducing dead zones.</p><p>The router also features MU-MIMO technology, allowing multiple devices to communicate with the router simultaneously without causing network congestion. This results in smoother streaming, lower latency, and better overall network efficiency, even when several devices are connected at the same time.</p><p>Designed for flexibility, the Archer C54 supports Multi-Mode 3-in-1 functionality, enabling users to operate it as a Router, Access Point, or Range Extender according to their networking requirements. Whether creating a new network or expanding existing coverage, this router adapts easily to different environments.</p><p>For enhanced security and user management, the router includes advanced Parental Controls that allow parents to monitor and manage internet access for connected devices. It also provides a separate Guest Network feature to keep the main network secure while allowing visitors convenient internet access.</p><p>The TP-Link Archer C54 is optimized for IPTV streaming with support for IGMP Proxy, IGMP Snooping, Bridge Mode, and Tag VLAN, ensuring smoother HD content delivery. Additionally, IPv6 compatibility makes the router future-ready for modern internet standards.</p><p>Its compact and wall-mountable design saves space while blending easily with home or office décor. Users can quickly set up and manage the router through the intuitive web interface or the powerful TP-Link Tether App available for Android and iOS devices.</p><p>International Office Solution offers genuine TP-Link networking products with dependable customer support and competitive pricing, making the Archer C54 an excellent choice for reliable high-speed wireless connectivity.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4× Fixed Antennas<br>(Cover more area with more antennas)<br><br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS/Rest Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>5 GHz: 867 Mbps (802.11ac)<br>2.4 GHz: 300 Mbps (802.11n)</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>web interface</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>Wi-Fi 5<br>IEEE 802.11ac/n/a 5 GHz<br>IEEE 802.11n/b/g 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WEP<br>WPA<br>WPA2<br>WPA/WPA2-Enterprise (802.1x)</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>1× 10/100 Mbps WAN Port<br>4× 10/100 Mbps LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>1200 sq ft to 1500 sq ft Maximum Area Open Space Coverage</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Power Adapter</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>5.6 in(141.2 mm) x 1.0 in (24.3 mm) x 4.5 in (115 mm) x 4.2 in (106.7 mm)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01 year warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 2000.00, 2100.00, NULL, 6, 'products/thumbnails/eKmAkwbPNYaDirfVFfdLs8W3kwypEaZFWmETDMZG.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-24 17:54:42', '2026-05-24 17:54:42', 'TP-Link Archer C54 AC1200 Dual Band Wi-Fi Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy TP-Link Archer C54 AC1200 Dual Band Wi-Fi Router from International Office Solution. Enjoy fast dual-band speeds, MU-MIMO, Beamforming, IPTV support, and secure wireless connectivity for home and office use.', 'TP-Link Archer C54, Archer C54 Router, AC1200 Router, Dual Band WiFi Router, TP-Link WiFi Router, MU-MIMO Router, Beamforming Router, Home WiFi Router, TP-Link Bangladesh, International Office Solution, IPTV Router, IPv6 Router', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(109, 'TP-Link Archer C50 AC1200 Dual Band Wi-Fi Router', 'The TP-Link Archer C50 AC1200 Dual Band Wi‑Fi Router is a powerful and reliable wireless router designed for smooth HD streaming, online gaming, video calls, and multitasking. Featuring AC1200 dual-band technology with speeds up to 1200Mbps, four external antennas, IPTV support, parental controls, and guest network functionality, the Archer C50 delivers stable coverage and secure internet connectivity for homes and offices.', 'tp-link-archer-c50-ac1200-dual-band-wi-fi-router-1779645581', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>TP-Link Archer C50 AC1200 Dual Band Wi-Fi Router</strong></h2><p>The TP-Link Archer C50 AC1200 Dual Band Wi‑Fi Router from International Office Solution is an advanced wireless networking solution built to deliver fast, stable, and uninterrupted internet connectivity for modern homes and workplaces. Powered by the latest IEEE 802.11ac Wi-Fi standard, the Archer C50 is designed to handle multiple connected devices and demanding online activities with ease.</p><p>This AC1200 dual-band router provides combined wireless speeds of up to 1200Mbps, offering 300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band and 867Mbps on the faster 5GHz band. The 2.4GHz frequency is perfect for daily internet tasks such as browsing, social media, and emails, while the 5GHz band ensures smoother HD streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, and large file downloads with reduced interference and improved performance.</p><p>Equipped with four powerful external antennas, the Archer C50 delivers strong and stable Wi-Fi coverage across your home or office. These antennas help eliminate dead zones and maintain reliable signal strength even in multiple rooms or larger spaces.</p><p>The TP-Link Archer C50 includes advanced features designed for convenience, flexibility, and security. Users can easily configure and manage network settings using the intuitive TP-Link Tether App available for Android and iOS devices. The router also supports Guest Network functionality, allowing visitors to access the internet securely without compromising the privacy of the main network.</p><p>For families, the built-in Parental Controls feature enables users to manage internet access schedules and restrict inappropriate content for children, creating a safer online environment. Additionally, Bandwidth Control and custom access management help optimize network performance by prioritizing internet usage across connected devices.</p><p>The Archer C50 is also optimized for IPTV services with support for IGMP Proxy, IGMP Snooping, Bridge Mode, and Tag VLAN, ensuring smooth and buffer-free video streaming experiences. With Access Point Mode support, the router can also be used to extend and enhance wireless coverage in different network environments.</p><p>To ensure enhanced security and modern compatibility, the router supports WPA/WPA2 encryption, IPv6 protocol, and VPN pass-through functionality. It is compatible with major operating systems including Windows, Mac, and Linux, making it a versatile networking solution for both personal and professional use.</p><p>Compact, efficient, and easy to manage, the TP-Link Archer C50 AC1200 Dual Band Wi-Fi Router is an ideal choice for users seeking reliable high-speed internet connectivity with advanced networking features at an affordable value.</p><p>International Office Solution offers authentic TP-Link networking products with dependable customer support and competitive pricing across Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>2.4GHz: Up to 300Mbps<br>5GHz: Up to 867Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4 External Antennas<br><br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Reset Button<br>WPS/Wi-Fi On/Off Button<br>Power On/Off Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4GHz and 5GHz<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>IEEE 802.11n/g/b 2.4GHz<br>IEEE 802.11ac/n/a 5GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>4 10/100Mbps LAN Ports<br>1 10/100Mbps WAN Port</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>5GHz:<br>11a 54M: -73dBm<br>11ac VHT20 MCS8: -68dBm<br>11ac VHT40 MCS9: -64dBm<br>11ac VHT80 MCS9: -60dBm<br>2.4GHz:<br>11g 54M: -76dBm<br>11n HT20 MCS7: -74dBm<br>11n HT40 MCS7: -71d</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>64/128-bit WEP, WPA / WPA2, WPA-PSK/ WPA2-PSK encryption<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>1× 10/100 Mbps WAN Port<br>4× 10/100 Mbps LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>1200 sq ft to 1500 sq ft Maximum Area Open Space Coverage<br>Operating Temperature: 0℃~40 ℃ (32 ℉~104℉)<br>Storage Temperature: -40℃~70 ℃ (-40 ℉~158℉)<br>Operating Humidity: 10%~90% non-condensing<br>Storage Humidity: 5%~90% non-condensing<br>CE, FCC, RoHS<br>2.4GHz guest network × 1<br>5GHz guest network × 1<br>Supports IPv4 and IPv6<br>DoS, SPI Firewall<br>IP Address Filter/MAC Address Filter/Domain Filter<br>IP and MAC Address Binding<br>Parental Control, Local Management Control, Host List, Access<br>Schedule, Rule Management<br>PPTP, L2TP, IPSec<br>DynDns, Comex, NO-IP<br>Virtual Server, Port Triggering, UPnP, DMZ<br>Server, Client, DHCP Client List,<br>Address Reservation<br>Access Control<br>Local Management<br>Remote Management<br>Dynamic IP/Static IP/PPPoE/<br>BigPond/ /L2TP(Dual Access) /PPTP(Dual Access)</td></tr><tr><td>Operating System Support</td><td>Enable/Disable Wireless Radio, WDS Bridge, WMM, Wireless Statistics<br>Microsoft Windows 98SE, NT, 2000, XP, Vista™ or Windows 7, Windows 8/8.1/10<br>MAC OS, NetWare, UNIX or Linux</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>CE:<br>&lt;20dBm(2.4GHz)<br>&lt;23dBm(5GHz)<br>FCC:<br>&lt;30dBm<br>External Power Supply-9VDC / 0.85A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>9.1 x 5.7 x 1.5 in. (229.87 x 144.19 x 36.85 mm)<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01 year warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band', 2032.00, 2132.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/AC7eLFW1qpmA5f0aWjWeSuKbNRyyVSHGYWf5gjtf.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-24 17:59:41', '2026-05-24 17:59:41', 'TP-Link Archer C50 AC1200 Dual Band Wi-Fi Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy TP-Link Archer C50 AC1200 Dual Band Wi-Fi Router from International Office Solution. Enjoy fast dual-band Wi-Fi, strong coverage, IPTV support, parental controls, and secure internet connectivity for home and office use.', 'TP-Link Archer C50, Archer C50 Router, AC1200 WiFi Router, Dual Band Router, TP-Link WiFi Router, Wireless Router, Home WiFi Router, IPTV Router, TP-Link Bangladesh, International Office Solution, Secure WiFi Router', NULL, 206, NULL, NULL),
(110, 'TP-Link Archer C64 AC1200 Dual-Band Gigabit WiFi Router', 'The TP-Link Archer C64 AC1200 Dual-Band MU-MIMO Gigabit WiFi Router is a high-performance dual-band wireless router designed for fast, stable, and seamless internet connectivity. Featuring AC1200 Wi-Fi speeds, MU-MIMO technology, Beamforming, and full Gigabit Ethernet ports, the Archer C64 ensures smooth HD streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, and multi-device connectivity for homes and offices.', 'tp-link-archer-c64-ac1200-dual-band-gigabit-wifi-router-1779645854', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>TP-Link Archer C64 AC1200 Dual-Band MU-MIMO Gigabit WiFi Router</strong></h2><p>The TP-Link Archer C64 AC1200 Dual-Band MU-MIMO Gigabit WiFi Router from International Office Solution is a powerful and modern networking solution built to deliver high-speed internet performance for homes, offices, and smart environments. Combining dual-band wireless technology, MU-MIMO support, Beamforming, and full Gigabit Ethernet connectivity, the Archer C64 offers reliable and uninterrupted network performance for demanding online activities.</p><p>Powered by advanced AC1200 dual-band Wi-Fi technology, the router operates on both 2.4GHz and 5GHz frequency bands. The 2.4GHz band provides stable and wide-reaching connectivity for basic internet tasks such as browsing, emailing, and social networking, while the faster 5GHz band delivers speeds up to 867Mbps for bandwidth-intensive applications including HD video streaming, online gaming, cloud storage access, and video conferencing.</p><p>The Archer C64 is equipped with four high-performance external antennas that help extend Wi-Fi coverage throughout your home or workspace. Integrated Beamforming technology intelligently detects connected devices and focuses wireless signals directly toward them, ensuring stronger and more reliable connections even in hard-to-reach areas.</p><p>With MU-MIMO technology, the router can communicate with multiple devices simultaneously rather than sequentially. This significantly improves network efficiency, reduces latency, and ensures smoother performance for multiple users streaming, gaming, or downloading at the same time.</p><p>For ultra-fast wired connectivity, the Archer C64 features full Gigabit Ethernet ports including 1 WAN port and 4 LAN ports. These ports deliver speeds up to ten times faster than standard Ethernet connections, making them ideal for connecting gaming consoles, desktop PCs, smart TVs, NAS storage devices, and other high-bandwidth equipment.</p><p>The router is designed for users seeking a balance between performance, reliability, and affordability. Whether used for work-from-home setups, online classes, entertainment streaming, or smart home connectivity, the Archer C64 provides dependable high-speed networking with minimal interruptions.</p><p>Its modern compact design allows easy placement in any room, while TP-Link’s intuitive setup process makes installation quick and hassle-free. Users can also manage their network efficiently using the TP-Link Tether App from Android or iOS devices.</p><p>International Office Solution provides authentic TP-Link networking products with trusted customer support and competitive pricing, making the TP-Link Archer C64 AC1200 MU-MIMO Gigabit WiFi Router an excellent choice for stable and future-ready wireless networking.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>General</td><td>Model</td><td>TP-Link Archer C64</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless Standard</td><td>Wi-Fi Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11ac Wave 2 (Wi-Fi 5), IEEE 802.11a/n/ac (5GHz), IEEE 802.11b/g/n (2.4GHz) (<a href=\"https://www.tp-link.com/bd/home-networking/wifi-router/archer-c64/?utm_source=chatgpt.com\">TP-Link</a>)</td></tr><tr><td>Wi-Fi Speed</td><td>2.4GHz</td><td>Up to 400 Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Wi-Fi Speed</td><td>5GHz</td><td>Up to 867 Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Total Wireless Speed</td><td>AC1200</td><td>Up to 1200 Mbps Combined</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>Bands</td><td>Dual-Band (2.4GHz &amp; 5GHz)</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>External Antennas</td><td>4 × Fixed High-Performance Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless Features</td><td>Technologies</td><td>MU-MIMO, Beamforming, Smart Connect, Airtime Fairness</td></tr><tr><td>Mesh Support</td><td>EasyMesh</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Operating Modes</td><td>Modes</td><td>Router Mode, Access Point (AP) Mode</td></tr><tr><td>Ethernet Ports</td><td>WAN</td><td>1 × Gigabit WAN Port</td></tr><tr><td>Ethernet Ports</td><td>LAN</td><td>4 × Gigabit LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Security</td><td>Wi-Fi Security</td><td>WPA, WPA2, WPA3, WPA/WPA2-Enterprise</td></tr><tr><td>Firewall</td><td>Security</td><td>SPI Firewall, Access Control, IP &amp; MAC Binding</td></tr><tr><td>Guest Network</td><td>Support</td><td>Separate Guest Network for 2.4GHz &amp; 5GHz</td></tr><tr><td>IPv6</td><td>Support</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>IPTV</td><td>Features</td><td>IGMP Proxy, IGMP Snooping, Bridge, Tag VLAN</td></tr><tr><td>QoS</td><td>Quality of Service</td><td>QoS by Device</td></tr><tr><td>Parental Control</td><td>Features</td><td>URL Filtering, Time Controls</td></tr><tr><td>Management</td><td>App</td><td>TP-Link Tether App, Web Interface</td></tr><tr><td>DDNS</td><td>Support</td><td>TP-Link DDNS, NO-IP, DynDNS</td></tr><tr><td>NAT Features</td><td>Support</td><td>Port Forwarding, Port Triggering, UPnP, DMZ</td></tr><tr><td>DHCP</td><td>Features</td><td>DHCP Server, Client List, Address Reservation</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Physical</td><td>WPS/Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Power Supply</td><td>Adapter</td><td>12V / 1A</td></tr><tr><td>Dimensions</td><td>Size</td><td>120 × 120 × 27.9 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Package Contents</td><td>Included</td><td>Archer C64 Router, Power Adapter, RJ45 Ethernet Cable, Quick Installation Guide</td></tr><tr><td>Ideal For</td><td><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Usage</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Warranty</p></td><td><p>HD/4K Streaming, Online Gaming, Smart Home, Small Office, 3-Bedroom Homes (<a href=\"https://www.tp-link.com/bd/home-networking/wifi-router/archer-c64/?utm_source=chatgpt.com\">TP-Link</a>)</p><p>1 year</p></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'tp-link, tp link, tp-link archer c64, archer c64, ac1200 router, dual band router, gigabit router, wifi 5 router, wireless router, home router, office router,', 2729.00, 2828.97, NULL, 10, 'products/thumbnails/aYZ5sQtjQrtUZ1MLM4SIYB7LQJrH8ILsWIhuSIH9.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-24 18:04:14', '2026-07-20 04:27:57', 'TP-Link Archer C64 AC1200 MU-MIMO Gigabit WiFi Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy TP-Link Archer C64 AC1200 Dual-Band MU-MIMO Gigabit WiFi Router from International Office Solution. Enjoy high-speed Wi-Fi, Beamforming, Gigabit ports, and stable connectivity for streaming, gaming, and office use.', 'TP-Link Archer C64, Archer C64 Router, AC1200 Gigabit Router, MU-MIMO Router, Dual Band WiFi Router, TP-Link WiFi Router, Gigabit Wireless Router, Beamforming Router, TP-Link Bangladesh, International Office Solution', NULL, 206, NULL, NULL),
(111, 'TP-Link XC220-G3 AC1200 Wireless XPON Router', 'The TP-Link XC220-G3 AC1200 Wireless XPON Router is a high-speed dual-band XPON router designed for fiber-optic and wired internet connectivity. Featuring AC1200 Wi-Fi speeds, Gigabit LAN ports, EasyMesh support, WPA3 security, and advanced management features, the XC220-G3 delivers stable and secure internet performance for homes and offices with seamless roaming and reliable coverage.', 'tp-link-xc220-g3-ac1200-wireless-xpon-router-1779646131', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>TP-Link XC220-G3 AC1200 1200Mbps Wireless XPON Router</strong></h2><p>The TP-Link XC220-G3 AC1200 Wireless XPON Router from International Office Solution is a modern and powerful networking solution built to provide high-speed fiber-optic internet connectivity with advanced wireless performance. Designed for both home and office environments, this XPON router combines Gigabit wired networking, dual-band wireless technology, advanced security, and smart management capabilities for a reliable and future-ready internet experience.</p><p>The router features dual-band AC1200 wireless technology, supporting speeds up to 300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band and up to 867Mbps on the faster 5GHz band. The 2.4GHz frequency provides stable and wide-range connectivity for daily internet activities such as browsing and social networking, while the 5GHz band delivers faster and smoother performance for HD streaming, online gaming, cloud applications, and video conferencing.</p><p>Equipped with two high-performance external dual-band antennas, the TP-Link XC220-G3 ensures broader wireless coverage and stable signal strength throughout your home or office. The router also supports advanced wireless technologies including WDS Bridge, WMM, and wireless statistics for optimized performance and improved network efficiency.</p><p>For wired and fiber-optic connectivity, the router includes two 10/100/1000 Mbps Gigabit LAN ports along with a PON interface, making it suitable for modern fiber broadband connections. Full Gigabit connectivity ensures faster and more stable wired network performance for PCs, gaming consoles, smart TVs, and other bandwidth-intensive devices.</p><p>The TP-Link XC220-G3 is built with advanced security protocols including WPA, WPA2, and WPA3 encryption standards, along with NAT firewall protection to secure the network from unauthorized access and online threats. The inclusion of parental controls allows users to manage internet access and create safer online experiences for family members.</p><p>With EasyMesh support and compatibility with 802.11k/v/r roaming standards, the router provides seamless roaming and extended wireless coverage by integrating with compatible mesh devices. This ensures uninterrupted connectivity as users move throughout different areas of the home or office.</p><p>The router also offers flexible and convenient network management options including local, remote, and cloud-based administration. Additional features such as hardware QoS, VPN pass-through, IPv4/IPv6 support, and advanced routing capabilities make the XC220-G3 a highly versatile networking device suitable for modern connectivity requirements.</p><p>Its compact and efficient design allows easy installation while maintaining reliable long-term performance. Whether for fiber broadband networking, online entertainment, smart home setups, or office connectivity, the TP-Link XC220-G3 AC1200 Wireless XPON Router provides dependable high-speed networking with enhanced security and management flexibility.</p><p>International Office Solution offers genuine TP-Link networking products with reliable customer support and competitive pricing across Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>Downstream Speeds: 2.488 Gbps (GPON), 1.25 Gbps (EPON)<br>Upstream Speeds: 1.244 Gbps (GPON), 1.25 Gbps (EPON)<br>Signal Rate: 867 Mbps on 5 GHz, 300 Mbps on 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2 External Dual Band Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS/Wi-Fi Button, RESET Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4 GHz and 5 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>2x 10/100/1000 Mbps RJ45 LAN Ports<br>1x PON Port</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11ac/n/a 5 GHz, IEEE 802.11b/g/n 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA/WPA2/WPA3 encryptions</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Mesh Technology: EasyMesh is Compatible, and supports 802.11k/v/r<br>Protocols: IPv4, IPv6</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>12V/1.0A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'XPON', 3119.00, 3219.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/JZkEbQrvVBLNfEajAQJsAvTTgW6wRJNPWMuux028.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-24 18:08:51', '2026-05-24 18:08:51', 'TP-Link XC220-G3 AC1200 Wireless XPON Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy TP-Link XC220-G3 AC1200 Wireless XPON Router from International Office Solution. Enjoy high-speed fiber connectivity, dual-band Wi-Fi, EasyMesh support, WPA3 security, and Gigabit networking for home and office use', 'TP-Link XC220-G3, XPON Router, AC1200 Router, Dual Band WiFi Router, Fiber Optic Router, Gigabit XPON Router, TP-Link WiFi Router, EasyMesh Router, TP-Link Bangladesh, International Office Solution', NULL, 206, NULL, NULL),
(112, 'TP-Link Archer C6 AC1200 Gigabit Router', 'The TP-Link Archer C6 AC1200 MU-MIMO Gigabit Router is a powerful dual-band wireless router designed for fast, stable, and efficient internet connectivity. Featuring AC1200 Wi-Fi speeds, MU-MIMO technology, Gigabit Ethernet ports, and wide wireless coverage with multiple antennas, the Archer C6 is ideal for HD streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, and multi-device networking at home or in the office.', 'tp-link-archer-c6-ac1200-gigabit-router-1779646372', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>TP-Link Archer C6 AC1200 MU-MIMO Gigabit Router</strong></h2><p>The TP-Link Archer C6 AC1200 MU-MIMO Gigabit Router from International Office Solution is a high-performance networking solution designed to deliver reliable, high-speed wireless connectivity for modern digital lifestyles. Combining advanced AC1200 dual-band Wi-Fi technology, MU-MIMO support, and Gigabit Ethernet connectivity, the Archer C6 provides seamless internet performance for homes, offices, and smart environments.</p><p>Powered by the latest IEEE 802.11ac wireless standard, the Archer C6 offers simultaneous dual-band connectivity with speeds up to 400Mbps on the 2.4GHz band and up to 867Mbps on the 5GHz band, delivering a combined speed of 1200Mbps. The 2.4GHz frequency is ideal for everyday internet tasks such as browsing, social networking, and emailing, while the faster 5GHz band supports bandwidth-intensive activities including HD streaming, online gaming, and video conferencing.</p><p>The router is equipped with four high-performance external antennas and one internal antenna that work together to create strong and stable wireless coverage across large areas and multi-room environments. Advanced signal optimization technology ensures improved connectivity and reduced dead zones throughout your home or office.</p><p>With built-in MU-MIMO technology, the Archer C6 communicates with multiple devices simultaneously, significantly improving network efficiency and reducing lag. This enables smoother streaming, faster downloads, and stable online gaming even when several users are connected at the same time.</p><p>The Archer C6 also supports Access Point Mode, allowing users to convert a wired network into a wireless access point for extended Wi-Fi coverage. Full Gigabit Ethernet ports provide ultra-fast wired connections for desktop PCs, gaming consoles, smart TVs, and other high-bandwidth devices.</p><p>For enhanced security and network management, the router includes advanced parental controls with URL filtering and time scheduling features. Additional security functions include SPI firewall protection, IP and MAC address binding, access control management, and support for white list and black list configurations.</p><p>The router supports multiple WAN connection types including Dynamic IP, Static IP, PPPoE, PPTP, and L2TP, ensuring broad compatibility with various internet service providers. It also includes advanced networking features such as Virtual Server, Port Triggering, UPnP, DMZ, Dynamic DNS, QoS by device, and IPv4/IPv6 protocol support.</p><p>Users can easily configure and manage the Archer C6 through the intuitive TP-Link Tether App available for Android and iOS devices. The app allows convenient network setup, monitoring, and parental control management directly from smartphones or tablets.</p><p>Compatible with Windows, Mac OS, Linux, and other operating systems, the TP-Link Archer C6 AC1200 MU-MIMO Gigabit Router is an ideal solution for users seeking fast, reliable, and feature-rich wireless networking for modern internet usage.</p><p>International Office Solution offers authentic TP-Link networking products with trusted customer support and competitive pricing across Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Button</td><td>Reset Button,<br>Power On/Off Button,<br>WPS/Wi-Fi On/Off Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4GHz and 5GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Wireless Standards : IEEE 802.11ac/n/a 5GHz, IEEE 802.11b/g/n 2.4GHz<br>Wireless Functions : Enable/Disable Wireless Radio, WDS Bridge, WMM,Wireless Statistics<br>Wireless Security : 64/128-bit WEP,WPA / WPA2,WPA-PSK/ WPA2-PSK encryption</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>4*10/100/1000Mbps LAN Ports,<br>1*10/100/1000Mbps WAN Port</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>2.4GHz guest network,<br>5GHz guest network</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA / WPA2,WPA-PSK/ WPA2-PSK encryption</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>12V/1A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>9.1 × 5.7 × 1.4 in (230 × 144 × 35 mm)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01 year warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Gigabit', 3042.00, 3142.00, NULL, 6, 'products/thumbnails/YjTr5I62hfDoHTR36m3NVFJBntZgJtQ3uYTn71lQ.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-24 18:12:52', '2026-05-24 18:12:52', 'TP-Link Archer C6 AC1200 MU-MIMO Gigabit Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy TP-Link Archer C6 AC1200 MU-MIMO Gigabit Router from International Office Solution. Enjoy fast dual-band Wi-Fi, Gigabit ports, MU-MIMO technology, parental controls, and reliable coverage for home and office networking.', 'TP-Link Archer C6, Archer C6 Router, AC1200 Router, MU-MIMO Router, Gigabit WiFi Router, Dual Band Router, TP-Link WiFi Router, Home Router, TP-Link Bangladesh, International Office Solution, Gaming Router', NULL, 206, NULL, NULL),
(113, 'TP-Link Archer AX12 AX1500 Dual-Band WiFi Router', 'The TP-Link Archer AX12 AX1500 WiFi 6 Router is a high-speed next-generation wireless router built with advanced Wi-Fi 6 technology for faster, smoother, and more efficient internet connectivity. Delivering speeds up to 1500Mbps, the Archer AX12 supports multiple connected devices simultaneously, making it ideal for streaming, gaming, smart home setups, and office networking with improved coverage and reduced latency.', 'tp-link-archer-ax12-ax1500-dual-band-wifi-router-1779646568', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>TP-Link Archer AX12 AX1500 1500Mbps WiFi 6 Router</strong></h2><p>The TP-Link Archer AX12 AX1500 WiFi 6 Router from International Office Solution is a modern high-performance networking solution designed to meet the growing demands of today’s connected homes and offices. Powered by advanced Wi-Fi 6 (802.11ax) technology, this router delivers faster speeds, higher efficiency, improved device capacity, and stronger wireless coverage compared to previous Wi-Fi generations.</p><p>With combined wireless speeds of up to 1500Mbps, the Archer AX12 provides smooth and reliable internet performance for bandwidth-intensive activities such as 4K video streaming, cloud gaming, video conferencing, online learning, and high-speed downloading. The router intelligently distributes bandwidth across multiple connected devices, ensuring stable and responsive connectivity even in busy network environments.</p><p>The Archer AX12 is specifically designed for modern smart homes where multiple devices such as smartphones, laptops, smart TVs, gaming consoles, IP cameras, and IoT devices operate simultaneously. Thanks to Wi-Fi 6 technology, the router efficiently handles multiple connections without sacrificing speed or performance, significantly reducing latency and network congestion.</p><p>Its enhanced wireless coverage ensures strong and stable signals across different rooms and larger areas, minimizing dead zones and improving overall network reliability. Whether you are working from home, attending online classes, or streaming entertainment content, the Archer AX12 provides consistent connectivity throughout your space.</p><p>One of the key advantages of Wi-Fi 6 is improved power efficiency. The Archer AX12 helps extend the battery life of connected mobile devices through advanced power-saving technologies, making it an energy-efficient networking solution for smartphones, tablets, and wireless gadgets.</p><p>The router also offers a simple and user-friendly setup experience. With TP-Link’s intuitive web interface and Tether App support, users can quickly configure and manage their network settings without advanced technical knowledge. Features such as parental controls, guest network management, and network monitoring make the router easy to customize according to individual needs.</p><p>Built with reliability, speed, and affordability in mind, the TP-Link Archer AX12 combines advanced networking technologies with practical everyday usability. It is an ideal choice for users seeking future-ready wireless performance at an excellent value.</p><p>International Office Solution offers genuine TP-Link networking products with trusted customer support and competitive pricing across Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>5 GHz: 4804 Mbps (802.11ax, HE160)<br>2.4 GHz: 574 Mbps (802.11ax)</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4× Fixed High-Performance Antennas<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS/Wi-Fi Button<br>Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>5 GHz<br>2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Beamforming<br>High-Power FEM</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11ax/ac/n/a 5 GHz<br>IEEE 802.11ax/n/b/g 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA2-PSK<br>WPA2-PSK/WPA-PSK<br>WPA3-Personal<br>WPA3-Personal/WPA2-PSK<br>WPA2-Enterprise<br>WPA/WPA2-Enterprise encryptions</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>1× Gigabit WAN Port<br>3× Gigabit LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Network Security:<br>SPI Firewall<br>Access Control<br>IP &amp; MAC Binding<br>Application Layer Gateway<br><br>HomeShield Security<br>Real-Time IoT Protection<br>Malicious Site Blocker<br>Intrusion Prevention System<br>DDoS Attack Prevention<br>Home Network Scanner</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>12 V ⎓ 1 A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>(215 × 117 × 32 mm)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>670 g</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year Warrant</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 3139.00, 3239.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/ca4yQt5rQ7Jg2PRBFarAKFPAbDHHOBfr8NHf79Ra.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-24 18:16:08', '2026-05-24 18:16:08', 'TP-Link Archer AX12 AX1500 WiFi 6 Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy TP-Link Archer AX12 AX1500 WiFi 6 Router from International Office Solution. Enjoy faster Wi-Fi 6 speeds, smooth streaming, gaming, multi-device connectivity, and reliable wireless coverage for home and office use.', 'TP-Link Archer AX12, AX1500 Router, WiFi 6 Router, TP-Link WiFi Router, Wireless Router, Dual Band Router, Gaming Router, Smart Home Router, TP-Link Bangladesh, International Office Solution, AX Router', NULL, 206, NULL, NULL),
(114, 'TP-Link M7000 150Mbps 4G LTE Mobile Wi-Fi Router', 'The TP-Link M7000 150Mbps 4G LTE Mobile Wi‑Fi Router is a compact and portable mobile hotspot device designed for fast and reliable internet connectivity on the go. Supporting 4G LTE networks with speeds up to 150Mbps, the M7000 allows users to share internet access with up to 10 devices simultaneously. With a powerful 2000mAh battery, easy app management, and compact travel-friendly design, it is an ideal solution for travel, remote work, and everyday mobile connectivity.', 'tp-link-m7000-150mbps-4g-lte-mobile-wi-fi-router-1779646812', '<h2>TP-Link M7000 150Mbps 4G LTE Mobile Wi-Fi Router</h2><p>The TP-Link M7000 150Mbps 4G LTE Mobile Wi‑Fi Router from International Office Solution is a compact and high-performance portable networking device designed to provide stable internet connectivity anytime and anywhere. Supporting the latest 4G FDD/TDD-LTE network technology, the M7000 delivers fast wireless internet access across a wide range of countries and regions, making it an excellent companion for travelers, students, professionals, and remote workers.</p><p>With download speeds of up to 150Mbps, the TP-Link M7000 ensures smooth web browsing, video streaming, online meetings, social media access, and file downloads while on the move. Whether you are traveling, working remotely, attending online classes, or simply need backup internet connectivity, this portable mobile router provides dependable performance with minimal setup requirements.</p><p>The M7000 allows users to share a 4G or 3G mobile connection with up to 10 wireless devices simultaneously, including smartphones, tablets, laptops, smart TVs, and gaming devices. This makes it ideal for family travel, small group connectivity, or mobile office environments.</p><p>Equipped with internal high-performance antennas, the router delivers stable signal reception and consistent wireless coverage. The built-in 2000mAh rechargeable battery provides up to 8 hours of continuous wireless connectivity on a single charge, ensuring reliable internet access throughout the day.</p><p>Its lightweight and pocket-sized design makes it highly portable and easy to carry in a bag or pocket. The simple and elegant design also ensures convenient operation for users of all experience levels.</p><p>The TP-Link M7000 can be easily configured and managed using the tpMiFi App, available for Android and iOS devices. Through the app, users can monitor data usage, manage connected devices, control network settings, and check battery status directly from their smartphones.</p><p>Designed for convenience, portability, and dependable performance, the TP-Link M7000 4G LTE Mobile Wi-Fi Router is a perfect solution for users who require secure and fast mobile internet connectivity wherever they go.</p><p>International Office Solution offers authentic TP-Link networking products with trusted customer support and competitive pricing across Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>DL: 150 Mbps, UL: 50 Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>Internal Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Power Button, Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Up to 300 Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1x micro USB port for power supply<br>1x SIM card slot</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11b/g/n</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>Support WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK, Wireless MAC Filtering, Enable/Disable SSID Broadcast</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>LED Display: Wi-Fi status, Internet connection status, Battery status</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Internal 2000 mAh Rechargeable Battery<br>External 5V/1A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>3.7×2.2×0.8 in. (94×56.7×19.8 mm)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'mobile Wifi', 3697.00, 3796.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/YYN4fztqK14a0AVMAN9mEZYe8BbSSGLusnitRt2J.jpg', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-24 18:20:12', '2026-05-24 18:20:12', 'TP-Link M7000 150Mbps 4G LTE Mobile Wi-Fi Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy TP-Link M7000 150Mbps 4G LTE Mobile Wi-Fi Router from International Office Solution. Enjoy portable high-speed internet, 4G LTE connectivity, up to 10 device sharing, and long battery backup for travel and daily use.', 'TP-Link M7000, 4G LTE Router, Mobile WiFi Router, Portable WiFi Router, TP-Link Mobile Router, 150Mbps Router, Pocket WiFi, Travel Router, TP-Link Bangladesh, International Office Solution, LTE Hotspot Router', NULL, 206, NULL, NULL),
(115, 'TP-Link Archer AX15 AX1500 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi Router', 'The TP-Link Archer AX15 AX1500 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi 6 Router is a high-performance WiFi 6 router designed for ultra-fast, stable, and efficient internet connectivity. Featuring AX1500 dual-band speeds, OFDMA, MU-MIMO, Beamforming, and Gigabit Ethernet ports, the Archer AX15 delivers smooth streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, and reliable multi-device performance for modern homes and offices.', 'tp-link-archer-ax15-ax1500-dual-band-gigabit-wifi-router-1779647081', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>TP-Link Archer AX15 AX1500 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi 6 Router</strong></h2><p>The TP-Link Archer AX15 AX1500 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi 6 Router from International Office Solution is a next-generation networking solution built to deliver faster speeds, stronger coverage, and improved efficiency for modern digital lifestyles. Powered by advanced WiFi 6 (802.11ax) technology, the Archer AX15 is designed to handle high-bandwidth activities and multiple connected devices with exceptional performance and reliability.</p><p>This dual-band router delivers combined wireless speeds of up to 1500Mbps, including up to 1201Mbps on the 5GHz band and 300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band. The 5GHz frequency ensures smooth 4K streaming, cloud gaming, and ultra-fast downloads, while the 2.4GHz band provides stable connectivity for everyday browsing, smart home devices, and online communication.</p><p>The Archer AX15 is equipped with advanced OFDMA and MU-MIMO technologies that significantly improve network capacity and efficiency. These technologies allow the router to communicate with multiple devices simultaneously, reducing latency and maintaining smooth connectivity even in busy network environments. This makes the router ideal for smart homes, remote work setups, online classes, and offices with multiple active users.</p><p>Four high-performance external antennas combined with Beamforming technology provide wider WiFi coverage and stronger signal stability throughout your home or office. Beamforming intelligently directs wireless signals toward connected devices, minimizing dead zones and ensuring more reliable performance across larger spaces.</p><p>The router also features Target Wake Time (TWT) technology, which improves power efficiency by reducing unnecessary communication between connected devices and the router. This helps extend the battery life of smartphones, tablets, and IoT devices connected to the network.</p><p>For secure and high-speed wired connectivity, the Archer AX15 includes Gigabit Ethernet ports, enabling ultra-fast connections for gaming PCs, smart TVs, desktop computers, and NAS devices. The router also supports the latest WPA3 security protocol, providing enhanced protection against cyber threats and unauthorized access.</p><p>Users can quickly configure and manage the network using the TP-Link Tether App, available for Android and iOS devices. The app allows easy setup, parental control management, guest network configuration, and real-time network monitoring directly from a smartphone.</p><p>Backward compatibility with previous WiFi standards ensures seamless support for older wireless devices while preparing your network for future technologies. Whether for entertainment, productivity, gaming, or smart home applications, the TP-Link Archer AX15 delivers powerful, future-ready networking performance.</p><p>International Office Solution provides authentic TP-Link networking products with trusted customer support and competitive pricing across Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>5 GHz: 1201 Mbps (802.11ax)<br>2.4 GHz: 300 Mbps (802.11n)</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4× Fixed High-Performance Antennas<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS/Wi-Fi Button<br>Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>5 GHz<br>2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Beamforming<br>High-Power FEM</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11ax/ac/n/a 5 GHz<br>IEEE 802.11ax/n/b/g 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA<br>WPA2<br>WPA3<br>WPA/WPA2-Enterprise (802.1x)</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>1× Gigabit WAN Port<br>4× Gigabit LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>WiFi Transmission Power FCC: &lt;30dBm(2.4 GHz &amp; 5.15 GHz~5.825 GHz)<br><br>Network Security:<br>SPI Firewall<br>Access Control<br>IP &amp; MAC Binding<br>Application Layer Gateway<br><br>VPN Server:<br>OpenVPN<br>PPTP<br><br>NAT Forwarding:<br>Port Forwarding<br>Port Triggering<br>DMZ<br>UPnP<br><br>IPTV:<br>IGMP Proxy<br>IGMP Snooping<br>Bridge<br>Tag VLAN<br><br>Coverage: 1500-1800 Sq. feet<br><br>Processor: 1.25GHz Dual-Core CPU, 256MB RAM</td></tr><tr><td>Operating System Support</td><td>System Requirements : Internet Explorer 11+, Firefox 12.0+, Chrome 20.0+, Safari 4.0+, or other JavaScript-enabled browser</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>12 V ⎓ 1 A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>10.2 × 5.3 ×1.5 in<br>(260.2 × 135.0 × 38.6 mm)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dul Band', 3781.00, 3881.00, NULL, 6, 'products/thumbnails/yKZOwdC6lbQwaBE160GcAO5ZXiJVv3uqe1MD6P31.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-24 18:24:41', '2026-05-24 18:24:41', 'TP-Link Archer AX15 AX1500 WiFi 6 Gigabit Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy TP-Link Archer AX15 AX1500 WiFi 6 Gigabit Router from International Office Solution. Enjoy faster WiFi 6 speeds, MU-MIMO, OFDMA, Beamforming, and reliable connectivity for streaming, gaming, and office use.', 'TP-Link Archer AX15, AX1500 Router, WiFi 6 Router, Gigabit WiFi Router, Dual Band Router, TP-Link Router, MU-MIMO Router, Beamforming Router, TP-Link Bangladesh, International Office Solution, Gaming Router', NULL, 206, NULL, NULL);
