(116, 'TP-Link Deco X60 AX5400 Dual-Band Mesh Router (3-pack)', 'The TP-Link Deco X60 AX5400 Wi‑Fi 6 Mesh Router (3‑Pack) is a premium whole-home mesh Wi-Fi system designed to deliver ultra-fast AX5400 speeds, seamless roaming, and exceptional coverage for modern smart homes. Powered by advanced Wi-Fi 6 technology, the Deco X60 provides faster connectivity, lower latency, improved device capacity, and smooth 8K streaming, gaming, and multi-device performance throughout your entire home.', 'tp-link-deco-x60-ax5400-dual-band-mesh-router-3-pack-1779647355', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>TP-Link Deco X60 AX5400 Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router (3-Pack)</strong></h2><p>The TP-Link Deco X60 AX5400 Wi‑Fi 6 Mesh Router (3‑Pack) from International Office Solution is a next-generation whole-home mesh networking solution engineered to deliver blazing-fast wireless connectivity, seamless roaming, and extensive Wi-Fi coverage for modern households and smart environments. Built with advanced Wi-Fi 6 (802.11ax) technology, the Deco X60 offers exceptional speed, capacity, and efficiency for bandwidth-intensive activities and multiple connected devices.</p><p>Designed to eliminate weak signal areas and dead zones, the Deco X60 creates a unified mesh network where all Deco units work together under a single Wi-Fi name. As you move throughout your home, your smartphone, tablet, or laptop automatically connects to the fastest Deco unit, ensuring uninterrupted streaming, gaming, video calls, and browsing without signal drops or reconnections.</p><p>The AX5400 dual-band Wi-Fi system delivers ultra-fast wireless speeds capable of handling demanding applications such as 8K video streaming, cloud gaming, online meetings, large file transfers, and smart home automation. With six simultaneous data streams, the Deco X60 provides higher bandwidth and lower latency, ensuring smooth and responsive connectivity even when numerous devices are connected at the same time.</p><p>Powered by Wi-Fi 6 technology, the Deco X60 significantly improves network efficiency and device capacity compared to previous Wi-Fi generations. It delivers up to four times greater throughput in dense environments, making it ideal for modern homes filled with smartphones, smart TVs, gaming consoles, IP cameras, laptops, and IoT devices.</p><p>For enhanced security and complete network management, the Deco X60 includes TP-Link HomeCare™ features with advanced parental controls, built-in antivirus protection, device prioritization, and Quality of Service (QoS). Parents can block inappropriate content, set online time limits, and monitor internet activity, while network administrators can prioritize devices and applications for optimized performance.</p><p>Setup and management are simple using the TP-Link Deco App, which guides users through installation step by step. Through the app, users can manage connected devices, create guest networks, monitor usage, and control Wi-Fi settings from anywhere. The system is also compatible with Amazon Alexa, allowing convenient voice control for selected networking functions.</p><p>The Deco X60 is fully compatible with other TP-Link Deco models, enabling users to expand their mesh network coverage anytime by adding additional Deco units. Its elegant minimalist white design blends seamlessly with modern home décor, making it both a high-performance networking device and a stylish addition to your living space.</p><p>Whether for smart homes, remote work, entertainment, or large family usage, the TP-Link Deco X60 AX5400 Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router delivers reliable, high-speed, and future-ready wireless networking performance.</p><p>International Office Solution offers genuine TP-Link networking products with dependable customer support and competitive pricing across Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>5 GHz: 4804 Mbps (802.11ax)<br>2.4 GHz: 574 Mbps (802.11ax)</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4× Antennas (Internal)</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4 GHz, 5 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Router Mode<br>Access Point Mode</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>2× Gigabit Ports: Per Deco Unit</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11ax/ac/n/a 5 GHz<br>IEEE 802.11ax/n/b/g 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WiFi Encryption:<br>WPA<br>WPA2<br>WPA3<br><br>Network Security:<br>SPI Firewall<br>Access Control</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>6× Gigabit Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Operating System Support</td><td>Android 4.4 or later<br>iOS 9.0 or later</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>12 V ⎓ 2 A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>110 × 110 × 114 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 Year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual-Band Mesh', 31790.00, 31890.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/eovWDZ6nC92bkhIqKRhmMssa6o6vA4wmCxsYa0tg.jpg', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-24 18:29:15', '2026-05-24 18:29:15', 'TP-Link Deco X60 AX5400 Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router (3-Pack) | International Office Solution', 'Buy TP-Link Deco X60 AX5400 Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router (3-Pack) from International Office Solution. Enjoy seamless whole-home coverage, ultra-fast Wi-Fi 6 speeds, mesh roaming, advanced security, and smooth streaming for smart homes.', 'TP-Link Deco X60, AX5400 Mesh Router, WiFi 6 Mesh System, TP-Link Deco, Whole Home WiFi, Mesh WiFi Router, Dual Band Router, Smart Home Router, TP-Link Bangladesh, International Office Solution, Deco WiFi 6', NULL, 206, NULL, NULL),
(117, 'TP-Link Deco S7 AC1900 Dual Band Mesh Router (1-Pack)', 'The TP-Link Deco S7 AC1900 Dual Band Wi-Fi 5 Mesh Router is a high-performance mesh networking solution designed to provide fast, stable, and seamless Wi-Fi coverage for homes and offices. Featuring AC1900 dual-band Wi-Fi 5 technology, MU-MIMO support, Beamforming, Gigabit Ethernet ports, and advanced parental controls, the Deco S7 ensures smooth streaming, gaming, browsing, and multi-device connectivity without dead zones.', 'tp-link-deco-s7-ac1900-dual-band-mesh-router-1-pack-1779647543', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>TP-Link Deco S7 (1-Pack) AC1900 Dual Band Wi-Fi 5 Mesh Router</strong></h2><p>The TP-Link Deco S7 AC1900 Dual Band Wi-Fi 5 Mesh Router from International Office Solution is a reliable and powerful whole-home mesh networking solution designed to deliver seamless wireless coverage, fast internet speeds, and stable connectivity for modern homes and small offices. Powered by advanced Wi-Fi 5 (802.11ac) technology, the Deco S7 provides high-speed dual-band performance for streaming, gaming, remote work, online learning, and smart home connectivity.</p><p>The Deco S7 delivers combined wireless speeds of up to 1900Mbps, including up to 1300Mbps on the 5GHz band and 600Mbps on the 2.4GHz band. The 5GHz frequency is ideal for high-bandwidth activities such as HD streaming, cloud gaming, and large file transfers, while the 2.4GHz band provides stable and broader coverage for daily browsing and smart devices.</p><p>Built with TP-Link Mesh technology, Deco units work together to create one unified wireless network with seamless roaming support. As users move around the home, connected devices automatically switch to the strongest Deco signal without interruptions, ensuring smooth and uninterrupted connectivity in every room.</p><p>The Deco S7 is equipped with three internal antennas and advanced Beamforming technology that intelligently strengthens wireless signals toward connected devices. This improves coverage, reduces dead zones, and ensures stable performance across wider areas and multiple rooms.</p><p>MU-MIMO technology enables the router to communicate with several devices simultaneously, improving network efficiency and reducing lag during heavy internet usage. This makes the Deco S7 ideal for households with multiple connected smartphones, laptops, smart TVs, gaming consoles, and IoT devices.</p><p>For enhanced security and network control, the router supports WPA/WPA2-Personal encryption, SPI firewall protection, access control management, and separate guest networks for both 2.4GHz and 5GHz bands. These features help maintain network privacy while allowing secure internet access for visitors.</p><p>The Deco S7 also includes advanced parental controls with URL filtering and time management options, enabling parents to create a safer online experience for children and family members. Quality of Service (QoS) by device allows users to prioritize bandwidth for specific applications or devices to ensure optimal performance.</p><p>Each Deco unit includes three Gigabit Ethernet ports for high-speed wired connectivity, making it suitable for connecting gaming PCs, smart TVs, desktop computers, and NAS devices. The system also supports IPv4 and IPv6 protocols, NAT forwarding, UPnP, and port forwarding for flexible networking compatibility.</p><p>Users can easily configure, monitor, and manage the entire mesh network using the TP-Link Deco App, which also supports OTA firmware updates for convenient maintenance and performance optimization.</p><p>International Office Solution offers authentic TP-Link networking products with dependable customer support and competitive pricing across Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>5 GHz: 1300 Mbps (802.11ac)<br>2.4 GHz: 600 Mbps (802.11n)</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>3× Antennas (Internal)</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>Dual Band (2.4GHz &amp; 5GHz)</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>3× Gigabit Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11ac/n/a 5 GHz<br>IEEE 802.11n/b/g 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>SPI Firewall<br>Access Control<br>WPA-Personal<br>WPA2-Personal</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>TP-Link Mesh Technology<br>Beamforming<br>MU-MIMO<br>Working Modes:<br>Router Mode<br>Access Point Mode</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>6.4 × 3.6 × 3.6 in<br>(162.3 × 90.7 × 90.7 mm)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 Year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 4309.00, 4409.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/QpzV24fa0wiTC2m3rXsqV5zwARGgzrDnCbxUulwi.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-24 18:32:23', '2026-05-24 18:32:23', 'TP-Link Deco S7 AC1900 Dual Band Mesh Wi-Fi Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy TP-Link Deco S7 AC1900 Dual Band Mesh Wi-Fi Router from International Office Solution. Enjoy seamless mesh coverage, fast AC1900 speeds, MU-MIMO technology, Gigabit ports, and stable wireless connectivity.', 'TP-Link Deco S7, AC1900 Mesh Router, Dual Band Mesh WiFi, TP-Link Mesh Router, WiFi 5 Router, Whole Home WiFi, MU-MIMO Router, Gigabit Mesh Router, TP-Link Bangladesh, International Office Solution', NULL, 206, NULL, NULL),
(118, 'TP-Link Deco X10 AX1500 Dual-Band Mesh Router (1 Pack)', 'The TP-Link Deco X10 AX1500 Dual-Band WiFi 6 Mesh Router is a high-speed mesh networking solution designed to deliver seamless whole-home WiFi coverage with advanced WiFi 6 technology. Featuring AX1500 dual-band speeds, Beamforming, OFDMA, MU-MIMO, and TP-Link Mesh technology, the Deco X10 provides stable, low-latency, and efficient connectivity for streaming, gaming, smart homes, and multi-device networking.', 'tp-link-deco-x10-ax1500-dual-band-mesh-router-1-pack-1779647754', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>TP-Link Deco X10 AX1500 Dual-Band WiFi 6 Mesh Router (1 Pack)</strong></h2><p>The TP-Link Deco X10 AX1500 Dual-Band WiFi 6 Mesh Router from International Office Solution is a modern whole-home mesh networking solution built to provide fast, reliable, and seamless wireless connectivity for homes and offices. Powered by the latest WiFi 6 (802.11ax) technology, the Deco X10 delivers improved speed, lower latency, greater device capacity, and stronger wireless coverage for today’s connected environments.</p><p>The Deco X10 offers AX1500 dual-band wireless speeds with up to 1201Mbps on the 5GHz band and 300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band. The 5GHz frequency supports bandwidth-intensive tasks such as HD streaming, cloud gaming, online meetings, and large file transfers, while the 2.4GHz band provides stable and broader coverage for everyday internet browsing and smart devices.</p><p>Using advanced TP-Link Mesh Technology, Deco units work together to create one unified WiFi network with seamless roaming support. Devices automatically connect to the fastest and strongest Deco unit while moving around your home, ensuring uninterrupted connectivity without signal drops or manual switching.</p><p>The Deco X10 is equipped with two high-performance internal antennas enhanced by Beamforming technology. This intelligently directs wireless signals toward connected devices, improving coverage strength, reducing dead zones, and delivering more stable network performance across multiple rooms.</p><p>Advanced WiFi 6 technologies such as OFDMA and 2x2 MU-MIMO significantly improve network efficiency by allowing simultaneous communication with multiple devices. This ensures lower latency, smoother streaming, and better performance in homes with numerous connected devices including smartphones, laptops, smart TVs, gaming consoles, and IoT products.</p><p>The mesh router supports flexible operating modes including Router Mode and Access Point Mode, allowing users to adapt the network setup according to different connectivity requirements. It also includes two Gigabit Ethernet ports for ultra-fast wired connections to desktop computers, gaming consoles, smart TVs, and other high-bandwidth devices.</p><p>The Deco X10 supports both IPv4 and IPv6 protocols, ensuring compatibility with modern internet standards and future-ready networking performance. Its compact and minimalist design blends naturally with modern home décor while occupying minimal space.</p><p>Users can quickly configure and manage the mesh network through the intuitive TP-Link Deco App, which provides easy access to network settings, device management, parental controls, guest network configuration, and firmware updates.</p><p>Whether for smart homes, online learning, remote work, streaming, or gaming, the TP-Link Deco X10 AX1500 WiFi 6 Mesh Router offers dependable high-speed wireless networking with smooth and uninterrupted coverage.</p><p>International Office Solution offers genuine TP-Link networking products with reliable customer support and competitive pricing across Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>AX1500<br>5 GHz: 1201 Mbps (802.11ax)<br>2.4 GHz: 300 Mbps (802.11n)</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2× Antennas (Internal)</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1x Reset button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4 GHz and 5 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>2× Gigabit Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>Wi-Fi 6<br>IEEE 802.11ax/ac/n/a 5 GHz<br>IEEE 802.11n/b/g 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA-Personal<br>WPA2-Personal<br>WPA3-Personal</td></tr><tr><td>Operating System Support</td><td>Android 5.0 or later<br>iOS 9.0 or later</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>4.33 × 4.33 × 4.49 in<br>(110 × 110 × 114 mm)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 Year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 4590.00, 4689.98, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/XksQyeSxJuQkJBLppbEvFHzAaGD3hiGUIEC5Kdbk.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-24 18:35:54', '2026-05-24 18:35:54', 'TP-Link Deco X10 AX1500 WiFi 6 Mesh Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy TP-Link Deco X10 AX1500 WiFi 6 Mesh Router from International Office Solution. Enjoy seamless mesh coverage, fast WiFi 6 speeds, OFDMA, MU-MIMO, and reliable connectivity for home and office use.', 'TP-Link Deco X10, AX1500 Mesh Router, WiFi 6 Mesh Router, TP-Link Mesh WiFi, Dual Band Router, Whole Home WiFi, MU-MIMO Router, OFDMA Router, TP-Link Bangladesh, International Office Solution', NULL, 206, NULL, NULL),
(119, 'TP-Link TL-WR820N 300Mbps WiFi Router', 'The TP-Link TL-WR820N 300Mbps Wireless N Speed Router is an affordable and reliable wireless router designed for smooth everyday internet connectivity. With wireless speeds up to 300Mbps, IPTV support, guest network access, parental controls, and advanced security features, the TL-WR820N is ideal for home users seeking stable browsing, streaming, online classes, and basic networking performance.', 'tp-link-tl-wr820n-300mbps-wifi-router-1779679901', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>TP-Link TL-WR820N 300Mbps Wireless N Speed Router</strong></h2><p>The TP-Link TL-WR820N 300Mbps Wireless N Speed Router from International Office Solution is a compact and dependable wireless networking solution designed for everyday internet usage at home or in small office environments. Delivering wireless speeds of up to 300Mbps, this router provides stable and efficient connectivity for web browsing, HD streaming, online classes, social media, and basic online gaming.</p><p>Powered by Wireless N technology, the TL-WR820N offers reliable wireless performance suitable for bandwidth-sensitive tasks and multiple connected devices. Its stable connection quality ensures smoother internet experiences for smartphones, laptops, smart TVs, and other wireless devices used in daily activities.</p><p>The router supports IPTV optimization features including IGMP Proxy, IGMP Snooping, Bridge Mode, and Tag VLAN, helping improve video streaming quality and ensuring smoother playback for IPTV services and online entertainment platforms.</p><p>For better network flexibility and security, the TP-Link TL-WR820N includes a dedicated Guest Network feature that allows visitors to access the internet separately from the main network. This helps maintain the privacy and security of personal devices and sensitive data while offering convenient internet access for guests.</p><p>Built-in Parental Controls allow users to manage and monitor internet access for connected devices. Parents can control online time and restrict internet access for children, creating a safer and more controlled online environment at home.</p><p>The router also provides advanced security features including wireless encryption protocols and firewall protection to safeguard the network against unauthorized access and online threats. Support for IPv6 ensures compatibility with modern internet standards and future-ready networking capabilities.</p><p>Its compact and minimalist design allows easy placement anywhere in the home or office, while the user-friendly setup process makes installation simple even for first-time users.</p><p>Whether for daily browsing, streaming, online education, or general home networking, the TP-Link TL-WR820N 300Mbps Wireless N Speed Router offers reliable wireless performance, useful management features, and secure connectivity at an affordable value.</p><p>International Office Solution provides genuine TP-Link networking products with trusted customer support and competitive pricing across Bangladesh.</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"3\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>Up to 300Mbps</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2 Fixed 5dBi Omni Directional Antennas</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS/Reset Button</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.412~2.472GHz</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Wireless Functions Enable/Disable Wireless Radio, WMM, Wireless Statistics</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>2 10/100Mbps LAN Ports<br>1 10/100Mbps WAN Port</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11n, IEEE 802.11g, IEEE 802.11b</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>Wireless Security WEP, WPA / WPA2, WPA / WPA2-PSK</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>5VDC / 0.6A</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>6.1 x 4.5 x 1.4 in. (154 x 114 x 36mm)</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01 Year</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h2><strong>Description</strong></h2>', NULL, 1300.00, 1300.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/I3iUcLjRI7kdAUb0as7pO9gID5CiuLRvGIFOMxqt.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 03:31:41', '2026-05-25 03:31:41', 'TP-Link TL-WR820N 300Mbps Wireless N Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy TP-Link TL-WR820N 300Mbps Wireless N Router from International Office Solution. Enjoy stable WiFi connectivity, IPTV support, parental controls, guest network access, and secure internet performance for home use.', 'TP-Link TL-WR820N, 300Mbps Router, Wireless N Router, TP-Link WiFi Router, Home WiFi Router, IPTV Router, Guest Network Router, Budget Router, TP-Link Bangladesh, International Office Solution', NULL, 206, NULL, NULL),
(120, 'TP-Link Deco X50 AX3000 Dual Band Mesh Router (1-Pack)', 'The TP-Link Deco X50 AX3000 Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router System is a high-performance whole-home mesh Wi-Fi solution designed for ultra-fast connectivity, seamless roaming, and extensive wireless coverage. Featuring AX3000 Wi-Fi 6 speeds, AI-driven mesh technology, OFDMA, MU-MIMO, and TP-Link HomeShield security, the Deco X50 delivers smooth streaming, gaming, smart home connectivity, and reliable multi-device performance.', 'tp-link-deco-x50-ax3000-dual-band-mesh-router-1-pack-1779682462', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>TP-Link Deco X50 AX3000 Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router System</strong></h2><p>The TP-Link Deco X50 AX3000 Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router System from International Office Solution is a premium whole-home networking solution built to provide ultra-fast wireless performance, seamless mesh coverage, and advanced security for modern homes and offices. Powered by the latest Wi-Fi 6 (802.11ax) technology, the Deco X50 delivers exceptional speed, efficiency, and reliability for streaming, gaming, video conferencing, smart home systems, and heavy multi-device usage.</p><p>The AX3000 dual-band Wi-Fi system offers combined wireless speeds of up to 3000Mbps, including up to 2402Mbps on the 5GHz band and 574Mbps on the 2.4GHz band. The high-speed 5GHz frequency ensures smooth 4K and 8K streaming, online gaming, and large file transfers, while the 2.4GHz band provides wider and more stable coverage for smart devices and everyday internet activities.</p><p>Built with AI-driven TP-Link Mesh technology, the Deco X50 creates one unified wireless network that intelligently adapts to your environment for optimized performance and seamless roaming. Devices automatically connect to the fastest and strongest Deco unit as users move around the home, eliminating dead zones and connection interruptions.</p><p>The Deco X50 is designed to cover large areas with reliable wireless signals, providing seamless Wi-Fi coverage for homes up to approximately 4,500 square feet. Internal high-performance antennas combined with Beamforming technology focus wireless signals directly toward connected devices, enhancing stability, signal strength, and overall coverage.</p><p>Advanced Wi-Fi 6 features including OFDMA and 2×2 MU-MIMO technology significantly improve network efficiency by allowing simultaneous communication with multiple devices. This reduces network congestion and ensures smoother connectivity for smartphones, laptops, smart TVs, gaming consoles, security cameras, and IoT devices.</p><p>For high-speed wired performance, the router includes three Gigabit Ethernet ports that support ultra-fast connections for gaming PCs, desktop computers, smart TVs, NAS storage, and other bandwidth-intensive devices.</p><p>The Deco X50 also includes TP-Link HomeShield security features, offering real-time IoT protection, malicious site blocking, intrusion prevention, DDoS attack prevention, and continuous network monitoring through the Home Network Scanner. Advanced parental controls allow users to manage screen time, filter inappropriate content, and create safer online experiences for family members.</p><p>Flexible operating modes including Router Mode and Access Point Mode provide versatile network deployment options based on user requirements. The intuitive Deco App simplifies setup and network management, allowing users to monitor connected devices, configure guest networks, update firmware, and manage security settings from anywhere.</p><p>Its sleek and modern design blends naturally into any home or office environment while delivering powerful and future-ready wireless networking performance.</p><p>International Office Solution offers genuine TP-Link networking products with reliable customer support and competitive pricing across Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>5 GHz: 2402 Mbps (802.11ax, HE160)<br>2.4 GHz: 574 Mbps (802.11ax</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2× Antennas (Internal)</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>Dual Band (2.4GHz &amp; 5GHz)</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>3× Gigabit Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11ax/ac/n/a 5 GHz<br>IEEE 802.11ax/n/b/g 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA-Personal<br>WPA2-Personal<br>WPA3-Personal</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>TP-Link Mesh Technology<br>AI-Driven Mesh<br>Beamforming<br>2×2 MU-MIMO<br>OFDMA<br>4 Streams<br>Working Modes:<br>Router Mode<br>Access Point Mode</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>4.33 × 4.33 × 4.49 in<br>(110 × 110 × 114 mm)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band Mesh', 6290.00, 6390.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/YW88XKIfTX9GPlXc7InjocLPCIx1sOxKRJ2b78mW.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 04:14:22', '2026-05-25 04:14:22', 'TP-Link Deco X50 AX3000 Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy TP-Link Deco X50 AX3000 Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router from International Office Solution. Enjoy ultra-fast mesh Wi-Fi, seamless roaming, HomeShield security, OFDMA, and reliable whole-home coverage.', 'TP-Link Deco X50, AX3000 Mesh Router, WiFi 6 Mesh System, TP-Link Mesh WiFi, Dual Band Router, Whole Home WiFi, OFDMA Router, MU-MIMO Router, TP-Link Bangladesh, International Office Solution', NULL, 206, NULL, NULL),
(121, 'TP-Link TL-WR840N 300Mbps Wireless Router', 'The TP-Link TL-WR840N 300Mbps Wireless Router is a reliable and high-performance wireless networking solution designed for home and small office use. Offering wireless speeds up to 300Mbps, multiple operating modes, parental controls, guest network access, and advanced security features, the TL-WR840N delivers stable and secure internet connectivity for streaming, gaming, browsing, and daily online activities.', 'tp-link-tl-wr840n-300mbps-wireless-router-1779682731', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>TP-Link TL-WR840N 300Mbps Wireless Router</strong></h2><p>The TP-Link TL-WR840N 300Mbps Wireless Router from International Office Solution is a versatile and efficient wireless router designed to provide stable, fast, and secure internet connectivity for homes and small office environments. With wireless transmission speeds of up to 300Mbps, this router is ideal for HD video streaming, online gaming, video calls, file downloads, and everyday web browsing.</p><p>Powered by advanced wireless N technology, the TP-Link TL-WR840N ensures dependable performance and broader wireless coverage for multiple connected devices. Its optimized wireless signal stability makes it suitable for smartphones, laptops, smart TVs, tablets, and smart home devices.</p><p>The router supports multiple operating modes including Router Mode, Access Point Mode, Range Extender Mode, and WISP Mode. These flexible configuration options allow users to customize the network according to their connectivity needs, whether creating a new wireless network, extending existing coverage, or sharing internet access wirelessly.</p><p>For enhanced network management and family safety, the TP-Link TL-WR840N includes advanced parental control features that allow users to manage internet access schedules and restrict online content for connected devices. The Guest Network feature provides separate internet access for visitors while keeping the primary network secure and private.</p><p>Security is further strengthened through WPA/WPA2 wireless encryption protocols, helping protect the network against unauthorized access and cyber threats. The router also supports IPv6 compatibility, ensuring future-ready networking support and improved connectivity with modern internet services.</p><p>To maintain smooth and balanced internet performance, the router includes IP-based bandwidth control, allowing users to allocate bandwidth efficiently across connected devices. This helps reduce network congestion and ensures stable internet performance for streaming, gaming, and other online tasks.</p><p>The TP-Link TL-WR840N can be quickly configured and managed using the TP-Link Tether App, available for Android and iOS devices. The intuitive app simplifies setup, network monitoring, parental controls, and wireless management directly from a smartphone or tablet.</p><p>With its sleek and compact design, dependable wireless performance, and flexible networking features, the TP-Link TL-WR840N 300Mbps Wireless Router is an excellent solution for users seeking affordable and reliable wireless networking.</p><p>International Office Solution offers genuine TP-Link networking products with trusted customer support and competitive pricing across Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>Up to 300 Mbps 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2× Fixed Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1× 10/100 Mbps WAN Port<br>4× 10/100 Mbps LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11n/b/g 2.4 GHz (Wi-Fi 4)</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WEP<br>WPA<br>WPA2<br>WPA/WPA2-Enterprise (802.1x)</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>1× WAN Port<br>4× LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Single-Core CPU<br>SPI Firewall<br>Access Control<br>IP &amp; MAC Binding<br>Application Layer Gateway<br>Router Mode<br>Access Point Mode<br>Range Extender Mode<br>WISP Mode</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>9 V ⎓ 0.6 A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>7.2 × 5.0 × 1.4 in<br>(182 × 128 × 35 mm)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'router', 1300.00, 1380.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/EUkFQZspLpsgqQLR6CV3525ebITrY5KiwmMGNic6.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 04:18:51', '2026-05-25 04:19:06', 'TP-Link TL-WR840N 300Mbps Wireless Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy TP-Link TL-WR840N 300Mbps Wireless Router from International Office Solution. Enjoy stable WiFi connectivity, multiple operating modes, parental controls, and secure wireless networking for home and office use.', 'TP-Link TL-WR840N, 300Mbps Router, Wireless Router, TP-Link WiFi Router, Home Router, Wireless N Router, Guest Network Router, IPv6 Router, TP-Link Bangladesh, International Office Solution', NULL, 206, NULL, NULL),
(122, 'Tp-link TL-WR845N 300Mbps Wireless Router', 'The TP-Link TL-WR845N 300Mbps Wireless Router is a reliable and high-performance wireless router designed for home and small office networking. Featuring wireless speeds up to 300Mbps, three high-gain antennas, multiple operating modes, bandwidth control, and advanced security features, the TL-WR845N delivers stable and secure internet connectivity for streaming, gaming, browsing, and everyday online activities.', 'tp-link-tl-wr845n-300mbps-wireless-router-1779683087', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>TP-Link TL-WR845N 300Mbps Wireless Router</strong></h2><p>The TP-Link TL-WR845N 300Mbps Wireless Router from International Office Solution is a dependable and feature-rich networking solution designed to provide fast, stable, and secure wireless connectivity for homes and small offices. With wireless transmission speeds of up to 300Mbps, this router is ideal for HD video streaming, online gaming, web browsing, video calls, and large file downloads.</p><p>Built with advanced Wireless N technology, the TP-Link TL-WR845N ensures reliable wireless performance and smooth internet access for multiple connected devices. The router is equipped with three high-performance 5dBi external antennas that significantly improve wireless coverage, signal strength, and network stability across wider areas and multiple rooms.</p><p>The TL-WR845N supports multiple operating modes including Router Mode, Access Point Mode, Range Extender Mode, and WISP Mode. These flexible networking options allow users to configure the router according to various internet and coverage requirements, whether creating a new wireless network or extending an existing one.</p><p>To optimize network efficiency, the router includes IP-based bandwidth control, enabling administrators to allocate specific bandwidth limits for connected devices. This helps ensure balanced internet performance and reduces network congestion during heavy usage.</p><p>The router also supports IPv6, the latest internet protocol version, ensuring compatibility with modern internet services and future-ready connectivity. Advanced wireless security features including WPA/WPA2 encryption help protect the network from unauthorized access and cyber threats.</p><p>For easy setup and convenient network management, the TP-Link TL-WR845N offers an intuitive web interface and compatibility with the TP-Link Tether App for Android and iOS devices. Users can quickly configure network settings, monitor connected devices, manage parental controls, and optimize WiFi performance directly from their smartphones.</p><p>Its elegant design with a stylish textured surface blends easily into modern home and office environments while delivering dependable networking performance.</p><p>Whether for entertainment, remote work, online learning, or general internet use, the TP-Link TL-WR845N 300Mbps Wireless Router offers a balanced combination of speed, coverage, flexibility, and security.</p><p>International Office Solution provides authentic TP-Link networking products with trusted customer support and competitive pricing across Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>up to 300 Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>3× Fixed Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS Button<br>Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4 GHz: (802.11n)</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1× 10/100 Mbps WAN Port<br>4× 10/100 Mbps LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11n/b/g 2.4 GHz (Wi-Fi 4)</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WEP<br>WPA<br>WPA2<br>WPA/WPA2-Enterprise (802.1x)</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>1 x WAN, 3x LAN</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Router Mode<br>Access Point Mode<br>Range Extender Mode<br>WISP Mode<br>IPv4<br>IPv6</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>9 V ⎓ 0.6 A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>9.1 × 5.7 × 1.4 in<br>(230 × 144 × 35 mm)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'router', 1500.00, 1600.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/5o0QGuksGrtmKPEXjHtGrmYlipwRnIkwyzIROxpT.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 04:24:47', '2026-05-25 04:24:47', 'TP-Link TL-WR845N 300Mbps Wireless Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy TP-Link TL-WR845N 300Mbps Wireless Router from International Office Solution. Enjoy stable WiFi coverage, high-gain antennas, bandwidth control, and secure wireless networking for home and office use.', 'TP-Link TL-WR845N, 300Mbps Router, Wireless Router, TP-Link WiFi Router, Wireless N Router, Home Router, Bandwidth Control Router, IPv6 Router, TP-Link Bangladesh, International Office Solution', NULL, 206, NULL, NULL),
(123, 'TP-Link TD-W8961N 300Mbps ADSL2+ Modem Router', 'The TP-Link TD-W8961N 300Mbps Wireless N ADSL2+ Modem Router is an all-in-one networking solution that combines an ADSL2+ modem, wireless router, 4-port switch, and wireless access point in a single device. With wireless speeds up to 300Mbps, advanced security, QoS support, and easy setup features, it is ideal for home and small office internet connectivity.', 'tp-link-td-w8961n-300mbps-adsl2-modem-router-1779683436', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>TP-Link TD-W8961N 300Mbps Wireless N ADSL2+ Modem Router</strong></h2><p>The TP-Link TD-W8961N 300Mbps Wireless N ADSL2+ Modem Router from International Office Solution is a versatile and efficient all-in-one networking device designed to deliver stable internet connectivity for homes and small offices. Combining an ADSL2+ modem, NAT router, 4-port Ethernet switch, and wireless N access point into a single compact unit, the TD-W8961N simplifies network setup while providing reliable wired and wireless connectivity.</p><p>Powered by Wireless N technology, the router offers wireless speeds of up to 300Mbps, making it suitable for HD video streaming, online gaming, internet calling, file sharing, and smooth everyday browsing. Its stable wireless performance supports multiple connected devices simultaneously, ensuring dependable internet access across your network.</p><p>The TP-Link TD-W8961N supports a wide range of ADSL standards including ITU-T G.992.5 and ANSI T1.413 Issue 2, ensuring compatibility with various internet service providers and broadband connections. This flexibility makes it an ideal networking solution for users requiring integrated ADSL connectivity.</p><p>The router features one RJ11 DSL port and four 10/100Mbps RJ45 LAN ports for wired connectivity, allowing users to connect desktop PCs, smart TVs, printers, gaming consoles, and other Ethernet-enabled devices. Its compact design helps save space while maintaining excellent networking performance.</p><p>Equipped with two fixed omnidirectional 5dBi antennas, the TD-W8961N delivers improved wireless coverage and stable signal strength throughout homes and small offices. The device also includes a convenient Wi-Fi On/Off button and a one-touch WPS button for quick and secure wireless connections.</p><p>For enhanced network security, the router incorporates NAT and SPI firewall protection along with advanced wireless encryption standards to safeguard against unauthorized access and cyber threats. Additional filtering features further improve network safety and control.</p><p>Advanced software features such as Quality of Service (QoS) allow users to prioritize bandwidth-intensive applications like streaming, gaming, and video conferencing for smoother network performance. The router also supports VPN pass-through for PPTP, L2TP, and IPSec protocols, enabling secure remote connectivity.</p><p>Users can easily configure and manage the router through a user-friendly web-based management interface with multilingual setup assistance. Remote management functionality further simplifies network administration and monitoring.</p><p>Whether for home entertainment, remote work, online education, or small office networking, the TP-Link TD-W8961N 300Mbps Wireless N ADSL2+ Modem Router offers reliable performance, flexible connectivity, and advanced networking features in one convenient device.</p><p>International Office Solution provides genuine TP-Link networking products with dependable customer support and competitive pricing across Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2x5dBi<br>Omni directional, Fixed</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1 Power On/Off Switch<br>1 WPS Button<br>1 Wi-Fi On/Off Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.400-2.4835GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Support 64/128 bit WEP, WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK,<br>Wireless MAC Filtering</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11n, 802.11g, 802.11b</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>NAT Firewall,<br>SPI Firewall,<br>MAC / IP / Packet / Application / URL Filtering,<br>Denial of Service(DoS),<br>SYN Flooding,<br>Ping of Death</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>4 10/100Mbps RJ45 Ports<br>1 RJ11 Port</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>9VDC/0.85A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>7.7 * 5.1 * 1.4 in. (195 * 130 * 35 mm )</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 Year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'router', 1800.00, 1840.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/eN5EULIbRgutk1mino8r0IY7Cb1F4xBnrXVww6fC.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 04:30:36', '2026-05-25 04:30:36', 'TP-Link TD-W8961N 300Mbps ADSL2+ Modem Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy TP-Link TD-W8961N 300Mbps Wireless N ADSL2+ Modem Router from International Office Solution. Enjoy stable wireless connectivity, integrated ADSL modem support, QoS, advanced security, and easy network management.', 'TP-Link TD-W8961N, ADSL2+ Modem Router, 300Mbps Router, Wireless N Router, TP-Link Modem Router, Home Networking Router, QoS Router, TP-Link Bangladesh, International Office Solution', NULL, 206, NULL, NULL),
(124, 'TP-Link XN020-G3V N300 Wireless VoIP GPON router', 'The TP-Link XN020-G3V 300Mbps Wireless N Gigabit VoIP GPON Router is an advanced Fiber-to-the-Home (FTTH) networking solution that combines a GPON modem, wireless access point, Gigabit router, VoIP support, and Ethernet switch into a single device. With 300Mbps wireless speed, GPON technology, VoIP calling support, and high-speed Gigabit connectivity, it is ideal for home and office fiber internet networks.', 'tp-link-xn020-g3v-n300-wireless-voip-gpon-router-1779683724', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>TP-Link XN020-G3V 300Mbps Wireless N Gigabit VoIP GPON Router</strong></h2><p>The TP-Link XN020-G3V 300Mbps Wireless N Gigabit VoIP GPON Router from International Office Solution is a powerful all-in-one Fiber-to-the-Home (FTTH) networking device designed to deliver fast internet connectivity, stable wireless networking, and reliable VoIP communication for homes and offices. Combining a GPON modem, wireless access point, Gigabit router, Ethernet switch, and VoIP functionality into a single compact solution, the XN020-G3V offers efficient and future-ready network performance.</p><p>Built according to ITU-T G.984 GPON standards, the TP-Link XN020-G3V supports high-speed GPON connectivity with downstream data rates up to 2.488Gbps and upstream speeds up to 1.244Gbps. This ensures smooth access to high-bandwidth internet services, making it suitable for HD streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, cloud applications, and real-time multimedia communication.</p><p>The router delivers wireless speeds of up to 300Mbps through Wireless N technology, providing stable and reliable WiFi coverage for smartphones, laptops, smart TVs, tablets, and other wireless devices. Its integrated wireless access point allows multiple devices to connect simultaneously for smooth internet access throughout the home or office.</p><p>The TP-Link XN020-G3V features one Gigabit LAN port and one Fast Ethernet LAN port, enabling high-speed wired connectivity for desktop computers, smart TVs, gaming consoles, printers, and other network devices. The integrated 2-port switch enhances wired networking flexibility and performance.</p><p>For communication services, the router includes one FXS port with VoIP support, allowing users to connect telephones and enjoy internet-based voice calling services. Support for the TR-069 management protocol enables internet service providers and network operators to remotely configure, monitor, and manage end-user devices efficiently.</p><p>Designed specifically for FTTH deployment environments, the XN020-G3V offers a complete and future-oriented fiber networking solution with reliable performance and simplified installation. It combines internet access, wireless networking, wired connectivity, and voice communication into one compact device, reducing hardware complexity and improving overall network management.</p><p>The router is ideal for modern homes, apartments, and office environments requiring high-speed fiber internet access, dependable wireless connectivity, and VoIP communication support.</p><p>International Office Solution provides genuine TP-Link networking products with reliable customer support and competitive pricing across Bangladesh.</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Wireless N Router</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Signal Rate</td><td>300Mbps at 2.4GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01 Year Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1* SC/APC port<br>1* 10/100/1000Mbps LAN Port<br>1* 10/100Mbps LAN Port<br>1 FXS Port</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Power On/Off Button<br>Reset Button<br>WPS/Wi-Fi Buttion</td></tr><tr><td>External Power Supply</td><td>12V/0.6A</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless Standards</td><td>IEEE 802.11g, 802.11b,802.11n</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless Security</td><td>64/128-bit WEP, WPA/WPA2, WPA-PSK/WPA-PSK2 encryptions</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'router', 1880.00, 1890.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/YHcQ8Ou7CdxxJgbpYPQtM2MzwW3ZsygVPvDdxj8G.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 04:35:24', '2026-05-25 04:35:24', 'TP-Link XN020-G3V 300Mbps GPON VoIP Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy TP-Link XN020-G3V 300Mbps Wireless N Gigabit GPON VoIP Router from International Office Solution. Enjoy high-speed FTTH connectivity, VoIP support, wireless networking, and Gigabit performance.', 'TP-Link XN020-G3V, GPON Router, VoIP Router, FTTH Router, Wireless N Router, Gigabit GPON Router, Fiber Router, TP-Link Bangladesh, International Office Solution', NULL, 206, NULL, NULL);
