(125, 'TP-Link TL-WR940N 450Mbps Wireless N Router', 'The TP-Link TL-WR940N Wireless Router is a high-performance wireless networking solution designed for smooth internet connectivity at home and small offices. Featuring Wireless N technology, fast wireless speeds, three external antennas, advanced WPA/WPA2 security, and stable coverage, the TL-WR940N is ideal for streaming, online gaming, browsing, and daily networking needs.', 'tp-link-tl-wr940n-450mbps-wireless-n-router-1779684057', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>TP-Link TL-WR940N Wireless Router</strong></h2><p>The TP-Link TL-WR940N Wireless Router from International Office Solution is a dependable and efficient wireless networking device designed to provide stable internet access and broad wireless coverage for home and small office environments. Built with IEEE 802.11n wireless technology, the router delivers reliable performance for HD streaming, online gaming, video calls, web browsing, and file sharing.</p><p>The router supports IEEE 802.11n, IEEE 802.11g, and IEEE 802.11b wireless standards, ensuring compatibility with a wide range of wireless devices including laptops, smartphones, tablets, smart TVs, and gaming consoles. Its enhanced wireless performance helps maintain stable connectivity for multiple users simultaneously.</p><p>Equipped with three external antennas, the TP-Link TL-WR940N improves wireless signal strength, coverage range, and connection stability across multiple rooms and larger spaces. The advanced antenna system helps reduce dead zones and ensures stronger wireless performance for connected devices.</p><p>The router includes advanced wireless security features with WPA/WPA2 and WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK authentication protocols to protect the network from unauthorized access and potential cyber threats. These security technologies help keep personal data and connected devices safe while maintaining secure internet connectivity.</p><p>Designed for ease of use, the TP-Link TL-WR940N offers a simple setup process and user-friendly management options for configuring wireless settings, security, and network controls. Its compact and practical design allows convenient placement in homes, apartments, and office spaces.</p><p>With stable wireless networking performance, reliable security, and wider signal coverage, the TP-Link TL-WR940N is suitable for users looking for an affordable and dependable wireless router solution for everyday internet usage.</p><p>International Office Solution offers genuine TP-Link networking products with reliable customer support and competitive pricing across Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Wireless N Router</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Interface</td><td>4 10/100Mbps LAN PORTS II<br>1 10/100Mbps WAN PORT</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Wireless On/Off Button,WPS/Reset Button,<br>Power On/Off Button</td></tr><tr><td>External Power Supply</td><td>12VDC / 1A external power adapter</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless Standards</td><td>IEEE 802.11n, IEEE 802.11g, IEEE 802.11b</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4-2.4835GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless Security</td><td>64/128/152-bit WEP / WPA / WPA2,WPA-PSK / WPA2-PSK</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'router', 1930.00, 1940.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/8XBCFBPstzKwIESS1ZtMgzBdyfrHNOEiCJhJy6jc.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 04:40:57', '2026-05-25 04:40:57', 'TP-Link TL-WR940N Wireless Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy TP-Link TL-WR940N Wireless Router from International Office Solution. Enjoy stable WiFi connectivity, strong wireless coverage, advanced security features, and reliable performance for home and office use.', 'TP-Link TL-WR940N, Wireless Router, TP-Link WiFi Router, Wireless N Router, Home Router, 3 Antenna Router, Secure WiFi Router, TP-Link Bangladesh, International Office Solution', NULL, 206, NULL, NULL),
(126, 'TP-Link Archer C20 AC750 Dual Band Router', 'The TP-Link Archer C20 AC750 Dual Band Router is a versatile and reliable wireless router designed for smooth internet connectivity at home and office environments. Featuring AC750 dual-band speeds, three external antennas, WPA3 security, IPTV optimization, parental controls, and multiple operating modes, the Archer C20 delivers stable and secure networking for streaming, gaming, browsing, and daily online activities.', 'tp-link-archer-c20-ac750-dual-band-router-1779684429', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>TP-Link Archer C20 AC750 Dual Band Router</strong></h2><p>The TP-Link Archer C20 AC750 Dual Band Router from International Office Solution is a high-performance dual-band wireless router designed to provide fast, stable, and secure internet connectivity for homes and small offices. Combining advanced wireless technology with flexible networking features, the Archer C20 ensures smooth online experiences for streaming, gaming, video calls, and multitasking across multiple connected devices.</p><p>The router delivers combined wireless speeds of up to 733Mbps, including up to 300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band and 433Mbps on the 5GHz band. The 2.4GHz frequency provides reliable connectivity for everyday browsing, emails, and smart devices, while the 5GHz band supports bandwidth-intensive applications such as HD video streaming, online gaming, and large file downloads with reduced interference and faster performance.</p><p>Equipped with three external high-performance antennas, the Archer C20 provides stable wireless coverage and strong signal transmission throughout homes and office spaces. The omnidirectional antenna design helps minimize dead zones and improves wireless stability across multiple rooms.</p><p>The TP-Link Archer C20 supports three flexible operating modes including Router Mode, Access Point Mode, and Range Extender Mode. These multiple configuration options allow users to customize the network setup according to their specific internet and coverage requirements.</p><p>For enhanced security, the router features the latest WPA3 wireless encryption standard, providing stronger protection against unauthorized access and cyber threats while keeping personal data and connected devices secure.</p><p>The router also includes IPTV optimization support with IGMP Proxy, IGMP Snooping, Bridge Mode, and Tag VLAN features to improve HD streaming quality and ensure smoother multimedia experiences for IPTV services and online entertainment platforms.</p><p>Parental Control functionality enables users to manage internet access schedules and monitor online activities for connected devices, making it easier to create a safer online environment for children and family members.</p><p>The Archer C20 also includes a dedicated Guest Network feature, allowing visitors to access the internet securely without exposing the primary network or connected personal devices.</p><p>With its user-friendly setup process, reliable wireless performance, modern security features, and flexible networking modes, the TP-Link Archer C20 AC750 Dual Band Router is an excellent solution for users seeking efficient and secure wireless networking.</p><p>International Office Solution offers authentic TP-Link networking products with dependable customer support and competitive pricing across Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>5GHz: Up to 433Mbps<br>2.4GHz: Up to 300Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>3× Fixed Antennas<br>Multiple antennas form a signal-boosting array to cover more directions and large areas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS/Wi-Fi Button<br>Power On/Off Button<br>Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4GHz and 5GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Wireless Functions: Enable/Disable Wireless Radio, WDS Bridge, WMM, Wireless Statistics</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1× 10/100 Mbps WAN Port<br>4× 10/100 Mbps LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11ac/n/a 5 GHz<br>IEEE 802.11n/b/g 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WEP<br>WPA<br>WPA2<br>WPA/WPA2-Enterprise (802.1x)<br>WPA3-Personal</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>4 x LAN ports<br>1 x WAN port</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Firewall Security:<br>DoS, SPI Firewall<br>IP Address Filtering/MAC Address Filtering/Domain Filtering<br>IP and MAC Address Binding<br>Guest Network:<br>2.4GHz guest network × 1<br>5GHz guest network × 1<br>Access Control:<br>Parental Control, Local Management<br>Control, Host List,<br>Access Schedule, Rule Management</td></tr><tr><td>Operating System Support</td><td>Windows 10/8.1/8/7/Vista/XP, Mac OS or Linux-based operating system</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>9V/0.6A(EU), 9V/0.85A(US)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Shell Color</td><td>9.1 x 5.7 x 1.4 in. (230 x 144 x 35mm)</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>9.1 x 5.7 x 1.4 in. (230 x 144 x 35mm)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01-year warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'router', 2000.00, 2100.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/qXIgJ2nHAmkH5eVttAs1fkdHzdgeoloxvR1cSuUc.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 04:47:09', '2026-05-25 04:47:09', 'TP-Link Archer C20 AC750 Dual Band Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy TP-Link Archer C20 AC750 Dual Band Router from International Office Solution. Enjoy fast dual-band WiFi, WPA3 security, IPTV support, parental controls, and reliable wireless connectivity.', 'TP-Link Archer C20, AC750 Router, Dual Band Router, TP-Link WiFi Router, Wireless Router, IPTV Router, WPA3 Router, Home WiFi Router, TP-Link Bangladesh, International Office Solution', NULL, 206, NULL, NULL),
(127, 'TP-Link Archer A6 V3 AC1200 Dual-Band WiFi Router', 'The TP-Link Archer A6 AC1200 Dual-Band Gigabit MU-MIMO Mesh WiFi Router is a high-performance WiFi router designed for fast and stable internet connectivity. Featuring AC1200 dual-band speeds, Gigabit ports, MU-MIMO technology, Beamforming, WPA3 security, and OneMesh support, the Archer A6 delivers seamless streaming, gaming, browsing, and multi-device connectivity for modern homes and offices.', 'tp-link-archer-a6-v3-ac1200-dual-band-wifi-router-1779684818', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>TP-Link Archer A6 AC1200 Dual-Band Gigabit MU-MIMO Mesh WiFi Router</strong></h2><p>The TP-Link Archer A6 AC1200 Dual-Band Gigabit MU-MIMO Mesh WiFi Router from International Office Solution is a powerful and feature-rich wireless networking solution designed to provide high-speed, stable, and secure internet connectivity for homes and small offices. Combining dual-band WiFi technology, Gigabit Ethernet ports, MU-MIMO support, and OneMesh compatibility, the Archer A6 delivers smooth online experiences for streaming, gaming, video conferencing, and multitasking across multiple connected devices.</p><p>The router offers combined wireless speeds of up to 1200Mbps, including up to 300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band and 900Mbps on the 5GHz band. The 2.4GHz frequency provides reliable connectivity for web browsing, emails, and smart home devices, while the 5GHz band supports high-bandwidth applications such as 4K video streaming, cloud gaming, and fast downloads with reduced latency and interference.</p><p>Equipped with four external high-performance antennas and Beamforming technology, the Archer A6 enhances wireless coverage by directing WiFi signals toward connected devices. This improves signal strength, stability, and coverage throughout the home or office while reducing dead zones.</p><p>The router supports advanced MU-MIMO technology on the 5GHz band, allowing simultaneous communication with multiple devices. This significantly improves network efficiency and ensures smoother internet performance even when several users are streaming, gaming, or downloading at the same time.</p><p>For high-speed wired connectivity, the TP-Link Archer A6 includes four Gigabit LAN ports, making it suitable for connecting gaming consoles, desktop PCs, smart TVs, NAS storage, and other bandwidth-intensive devices. The Gigabit ports ensure maximum wired network performance compatible with high-speed internet plans.</p><p>The Archer A6 also supports Access Point Mode, allowing users to convert a wired network connection into a wireless access point for expanded WiFi coverage and flexible networking configurations.</p><p>Security is enhanced with the latest WPA3 encryption standard, providing improved protection against cyber threats and unauthorized access while safeguarding personal data and connected devices.</p><p>With TP-Link OneMesh support, users can create a seamless whole-home mesh WiFi system by pairing the router with compatible TP-Link OneMesh extenders. This creates unified wireless coverage under a single WiFi name for uninterrupted connectivity throughout the home.</p><p>The TP-Link Archer A6 is compatible with major internet service providers and can easily integrate into existing home or office network setups. Its user-friendly management interface simplifies installation, configuration, and network monitoring.</p><p>Whether for 4K streaming, online gaming, smart home connectivity, or remote work, the TP-Link Archer A6 AC1200 Dual-Band Gigabit MU-MIMO Mesh WiFi Router offers reliable, high-speed, and future-ready networking performance.</p><p>International Office Solution provides authentic TP-Link networking products with dependable customer support and competitive pricing across Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4× Fixed High-Performance Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS/Wi-Fi Button<br>Power On/Off Button<br>Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4GHz and 5GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Wi-Fi 5<br>IEEE 802.11ac/n/a 5 GHz<br>IEEE 802.11n/b/g 2.4 GHz<br>AC1200<br>5 GHz: 867 Mbps (802.11ac)<br>2.4 GHz: 300 Mbps (802.11n)</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>1× 5 GHz Guest Network<br>1× 2.4 GHz Guest Network</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA<br>WPA2<br>WPA3<br>WPA/WPA2-Enterprise (802.1x)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>12V/1A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>8.5 × 4.6 × 1.2 in<br>(215 × 117 × 32 mm)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01 year warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'router', 3400.00, 3420.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/A6GnLFAQujYD4Cl4UrnKfTgyjnNfPu87KnVh65gc.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 04:53:38', '2026-05-25 04:53:38', 'TP-Link Archer A6 AC1200 Gigabit MU-MIMO Mesh WiFi Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy TP-Link Archer A6 AC1200 Dual-Band Gigabit WiFi Router from International Office Solution. Enjoy fast mesh WiFi, MU-MIMO technology, Beamforming, WPA3 security, and Gigabit connectivity.', 'TP-Link Archer A6, AC1200 Router, Gigabit WiFi Router, MU-MIMO Router, Dual Band Router, OneMesh Router, TP-Link WiFi Router, WPA3 Router, TP-Link Bangladesh, International Office Solution', NULL, 206, NULL, NULL),
(128, 'TP-Link TL-MR3420 300Mbps 3G Wireless Router', 'The TP-Link TL-MR3420 300Mbps 3G/4G Wireless Router is a flexible wireless networking solution designed to share 3G/4G mobile broadband connections with multiple devices. With wireless speeds up to 300Mbps, USB modem support, stable wireless connectivity, and easy hotspot creation, the TL-MR3420 is ideal for homes, offices, and portable internet sharing.', 'tp-link-tl-mr3420-300mbps-3g-wireless-router-1779685343', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>TP-Link TL-MR3420 300Mbps 3G/4G Wireless Router</strong></h2><p>The TP-Link TL-MR3420 300Mbps 3G/4G Wireless Router from International Office Solution is a reliable and versatile wireless router designed to provide flexible internet connectivity using 3G or 4G mobile broadband networks. This router allows users to instantly create a wireless hotspot by connecting a compatible USB 3G/4G modem, enabling multiple devices to share internet access simultaneously.</p><p>With wireless speeds of up to 300Mbps, the TP-Link TL-MR3420 delivers stable and smooth internet performance suitable for web browsing, HD video streaming, online meetings, file sharing, social media usage, and basic online gaming. Its dependable Wireless N technology ensures reliable connectivity for smartphones, laptops, tablets, smart TVs, and other WiFi-enabled devices.</p><p>The router is designed for users who require portable and flexible internet solutions, especially in areas where traditional broadband connections may be limited or unavailable. By simply plugging a compatible 3G/4G USB modem into the router, users can instantly establish a secure WiFi hotspot for homes, offices, temporary workspaces, shops, or travel environments.</p><p>The TP-Link TL-MR3420 supports both wired and wireless internet sharing, allowing users to connect devices through Ethernet ports as well as WiFi connections. This flexibility makes it suitable for mixed networking environments where both wired and wireless devices are used.</p><p>Its intelligent wireless management system ensures stable data transmission and consistent performance while supporting multiple simultaneous users. The router also includes advanced security features to help protect the network and connected devices from unauthorized access.</p><p>Easy setup and user-friendly configuration options make the TL-MR3420 convenient for both beginners and experienced users. The compact and practical design allows easy placement in homes, offices, or portable work environments.</p><p>Whether for backup internet connectivity, remote work, travel, or everyday internet sharing, the TP-Link TL-MR3420 300Mbps 3G/4G Wireless Router offers a practical and dependable networking solution.</p><p>International Office Solution provides genuine TP-Link networking products with trusted customer support and competitive pricing across Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Wireless N Router</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1 USB 2.0 Port for LTE/HSPA+/HSUPA/HSDPA/UMTS/EVDO USB Modem<br>1 10/100Mbps WAN Port, 4 10/100Mbps LAN Ports, support the auto-Negotiation and auto-MDI/MDIX</td></tr><tr><td>External Power Supply</td><td>9VDC/0.85A</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna Type</td><td>Omni directional, Detachable, Reverse SMA</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless Standards</td><td>IEEE 802.11b, IEEE 802.11g, IEEE 802.11n</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4-2.4835GHz</td></tr><tr><td>EIRP</td><td>&lt;20dBm</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless Security</td><td>Support 64/128 bit WEP, WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK,<br>Wireless MAC Filtering</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'router', 2200.00, 2300.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/LC2w59PSubSA2jsnaEqDp69yh4OPESJyELvANKlU.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 05:02:23', '2026-05-25 05:02:23', 'TP-Link TL-MR3420 300Mbps 3G/4G Wireless Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy TP-Link TL-MR3420 300Mbps 3G/4G Wireless Router from International Office So