evices are used.</p><p>Its intelligent wireless management system ensures stable data transmission and consistent performance while supporting multiple simultaneous users. The router also includes advanced security features to help protect the network and connected devices from unauthorized access.</p><p>Easy setup and user-friendly configuration options make the TL-MR3420 convenient for both beginners and experienced users. The compact and practical design allows easy placement in homes, offices, or portable work environments.</p><p>Whether for backup internet connectivity, remote work, travel, or everyday internet sharing, the TP-Link TL-MR3420 300Mbps 3G/4G Wireless Router offers a practical and dependable networking solution.</p><p>International Office Solution provides genuine TP-Link networking products with trusted customer support and competitive pricing across Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>300 Mbps on 2.4 GHz<br>867 Mbps on 5 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2 internal dual-band antennas per Deco unit</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1 Reset button on the underside</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4 GHz and 5 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>2 Gigabit Ethernet Ports (WAN/LAN auto-sensing) per Deco unit</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11 ac/n/a 5 GHz, IEEE 802.11 b/g/n 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>2 Deco units<br>1 RJ45 Ethernet Cable<br>2 power adapters</td></tr><tr><td>Operating System Support</td><td>iOS 9.0 or later<br>Android 4.3 or later</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>AC adapter input : 100-240V ~ 50/60Hz 0.4A<br>AC adapter output : 12V ⎓ 1.2A<br>External Power Supply : 12 V/1.2 A<br>Transmit Power : FCC: &lt;30 dBm<br>CE: &lt;20 dBm (2.4 GHz)<br>&lt;23 dBm (5 GHz)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>Φ3.6 in. x 7.5 in. (Φ90.7 mm x 190 mm)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01 Year warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'router', 7200.00, 7299.99, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/kJKbTdKFpz0t9AhZ7MChSf0IutXiiZJSPAocOpEo.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 05:07:52', '2026-05-25 05:07:52', 'TP-Link TL-MR3420 300Mbps 3G/4G Wireless Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy TP-Link TL-MR3420 300Mbps 3G/4G Wireless Router from International Office Solution. Share mobile broadband easily with fast WiFi connectivity, USB modem support, and reliable wireless networking.', 'TP-Link TL-MR3420, 3G Router, 4G Router, Wireless N Router, Mobile Broadband Router, TP-Link WiFi Router, Portable WiFi Router, USB Modem Router, TP-Link Bangladesh, International Office Solution', NULL, 206, NULL, NULL),
(130, 'TP-Link Archer C86 AC1900 Dual-Band Wi-Fi Router', 'The TP-Link Archer C86 AC1900 Wireless MU-MIMO Wi-Fi Router is a powerful dual-band wireless router designed for high-speed internet connectivity and seamless multi-device performance. Featuring AC1900 speeds, MU-MIMO technology, 3x3 MIMO support, Beamforming, Smart Connect, and six external antennas, the Archer C86 delivers reliable coverage and smooth networking for streaming, gaming, remote work, and smart home connectivity.', 'tp-link-archer-c86-ac1900-dual-band-wi-fi-router-1779685983', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>TP-Link Archer C86 AC1900 Wireless MU-MIMO Wi-Fi Router</strong></h2><p>The TP-Link Archer C86 AC1900 Wireless MU-MIMO Wi-Fi Router from International Office Solution is a high-performance wireless networking solution engineered to provide fast, stable, and efficient internet connectivity for modern homes and offices. Equipped with advanced 802.11ac Wave2 WiFi technology, the Archer C86 offers exceptional wireless speeds and reliable coverage for bandwidth-intensive online activities.</p><p>The router delivers combined dual-band speeds of up to 1900Mbps, including up to 1300Mbps on the 5GHz band and 600Mbps on the 2.4GHz band. The high-speed 5GHz band is ideal for HD streaming, online gaming, cloud applications, and large file downloads, while the 2.4GHz band provides stable connectivity for everyday browsing, smart devices, and general internet usage.</p><p>The TP-Link Archer C86 supports advanced 3x3 MIMO (Multiple Input, Multiple Output) technology, enabling simultaneous transmission and reception of data across three streams. This significantly improves wireless efficiency, speed, and compatibility with high-performance client devices, resulting in smoother and faster network performance.</p><p>With six high-performance external antennas and Beamforming technology, the Archer C86 enhances wireless coverage by focusing WiFi signals directly toward connected devices. This provides stronger signal strength, wider coverage, and reduced dead zones throughout homes and office spaces.</p><p>The integration of MU-MIMO (Multi-User Multiple Input Multiple Output) technology allows multiple devices to communicate with the router simultaneously without reducing overall network performance. This makes the Archer C86 ideal for households or workplaces with numerous connected devices requiring stable and uninterrupted internet access.</p><p>The router includes intelligent networking features such as Smart Connect and Airtime Fairness. Smart Connect automatically directs devices to the least congested frequency band for optimized performance, while Airtime Fairness ensures balanced network resource distribution among connected devices, improving overall efficiency and user experience.</p><p>For enhanced network management and security, the TP-Link Archer C86 includes advanced features such as Parental Controls, Guest Network access, and Access Control settings. These features allow users to monitor internet activity, create separate guest access, and manage device permissions for a safer and more organized network environment.</p><p>The router is designed for easy setup and convenient management, making it suitable for both home users and office environments seeking reliable high-speed wireless networking.</p><p>Whether for 4K streaming, competitive online gaming, video conferencing, remote work, or smart home integration, the TP-Link Archer C86 AC1900 Wireless MU-MIMO Wi-Fi Router delivers powerful performance and dependable connectivity.</p><p>International Office Solution offers authentic TP-Link networking products with reliable customer support and competitive pricing across Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>5 GHz: 1300 Mbps (802.11ac)<br>2.4 GHz: 600 Mbps (802.11n)</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>6× Fixed High-Performance Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS/Wi-Fi Button<br>Power On/Off Button<br>Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>5 GHz<br>2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Beamforming<br>High-Power FEM</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>Wi-Fi 5<br>IEEE 802.11ac/n/a 5 GHz<br>IEEE 802.11n/b/g 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA<br>WPA2<br>WPA3<br>WPA/WPA2-Enterprise (802.1x)</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>1× Gigabit WAN Port<br>4× Gigabit LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Network Security:<br>SPI Firewall<br>Access Control<br>IP &amp; MAC Binding<br>Application Layer Gateway</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>12 V ⎓ 1 A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>9.1 × 5.1 × 1.5 in<br>(229.9 × 144.2 × 37.2 mm)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>‎370 g</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'router', 4000.00, 4100.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/HDgsYcsqQPS3giiKR5nxFRfNFl0Gyl2I1ElilDMb.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 05:13:03', '2026-05-25 05:13:03', 'TP-Link Archer C86 AC1900 MU-MIMO Wi-Fi Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy TP-Link Archer C86 AC1900 Wireless MU-MIMO Wi-Fi Router from International Office Solution. Enjoy fast dual-band speeds, Beamforming coverage, Smart Connect, and reliable multi-device performance.', 'TP-Link Archer C86, AC1900 Router, MU-MIMO Router, Dual Band WiFi Router, Beamforming Router, TP-Link Wireless Router, Smart Connect Router, Home WiFi Router, TP-Link Bangladesh, International Office Solution', NULL, 206, NULL, NULL),
(131, 'AC1200 Whole Home Mesh Wi-Fi System', 'The TP-Link Deco E4 Whole Home Mesh Wi-Fi System AC1200 Dual-Band Router is a complete whole-home mesh networking solution designed to eliminate dead zones and provide seamless WiFi coverage throughout large homes. Featuring AC1200 dual-band speeds, TP-Link Mesh technology, support for up to 100 devices, multiple operation modes, and Alexa compatibility, the Deco E4 delivers reliable and uninterrupted wireless connectivity for modern smart homes.', 'ac1200-whole-home-mesh-wi-fi-system-1779686503', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>TP-Link Deco E4 (3 Pack) Whole Home Mesh Wi-Fi System AC1200 Dual-Band Router</strong></h2><p>The TP-Link Deco E4 Whole Home Mesh Wi-Fi System AC1200 Dual-Band Router from International Office Solution is an advanced whole-home mesh networking system designed to provide strong, stable, and seamless wireless internet coverage across large homes and office spaces. Using TP-Link Mesh technology and high-speed dual-band WiFi performance, the Deco E4 eliminates weak signal areas and ensures uninterrupted internet access for streaming, gaming, remote work, and smart home devices.</p><p>The Deco E4 (3 Pack) system provides reliable WiFi coverage for areas up to approximately 4,000 square feet, making it ideal for medium to large homes with multiple rooms and connected devices. The Deco units work together to form one unified wireless network under a single WiFi name, allowing smartphones, tablets, and laptops to automatically connect to the fastest Deco unit as users move throughout the home. This seamless roaming technology delivers uninterrupted connectivity without manual network switching.</p><p>Powered by advanced 802.11ac wireless technology, the Deco E4 offers network speeds up to three times faster than previous-generation routers. The AC1200 dual-band system ensures smooth HD video streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, and fast downloads while supporting up to 100 connected devices simultaneously.</p><p>The router supports flexible 3-in-1 operation modes including Router Mode, Access Point Mode, and Range Extender Mode. This versatility allows users to configure the network according to their home or office requirements, whether setting up a new WiFi network or extending an existing one.</p><p>Setting up the Deco E4 is simple and convenient using the TP-Link Deco App. Users can quickly install and manage the system, monitor connected devices, create guest networks, apply parental controls, and optimize network performance directly from their smartphones through an intuitive interface.</p><p>For additional convenience, the Deco E4 supports Amazon Alexa voice control, enabling users to manage selected networking functions using simple voice commands for a smarter home networking experience.</p><p>The Deco E4 also features a sleek and modern design that blends easily into any home or office décor while delivering dependable whole-home WiFi coverage and stable internet performance.</p><p>Whether for smart homes, online classes, 4K streaming, gaming, or multi-device networking, the TP-Link Deco E4 Whole Home Mesh WiFi System offers powerful coverage, seamless roaming, and reliable wireless performance.</p><p>International Office Solution provides authentic TP-Link networking products with trusted customer support and competitive pricing across Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>300 Mbps on 2.4 GHz<br>867 Mbps on 5 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2 internal dual-band antennas per Deco unit</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1 Reset button on the underside</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4 GHz and 5 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>2 Gigabit Ethernet Ports (WAN/LAN auto-sensing) per Deco unit</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11 ac/n/a 5 GHz, IEEE 802.11 b/g/n 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>2 10/100Mbps WAN/LAN Ports, 1 Power Port</td></tr><tr><td>Operating System Support</td><td>iOS 9.0 or later<br>Android 4.3 or later</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>AC adapter input : 100-240V ~ 50/60Hz 0.4A<br>AC adapter output : 12V ⎓ 1.2A<br>External Power Supply : 12 V/1.2 A<br>Transmit Power : FCC: &lt;30 dBm<br>CE: &lt;20 dBm (2.4 GHz)<br>&lt;23 dBm (5 GHz)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>7.5 × 3.6 × 3.6 in. (190.5 × 90.7 × 90.7 mm)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>2.42 Kg</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01 Year warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'router', 8190.00, 8190.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/jRuvQDcuUglTl6YceXReAkIjyMqMDoN6JfMbCYSx.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 05:21:43', '2026-05-25 05:44:17', 'TP-Link Deco E4 AC1200 Whole Home Mesh WiFi System (3 Pack) | International Office Solution', 'Buy TP-Link Deco E4 AC1200 Whole Home Mesh WiFi System (3 Pack) from International Office Solution. Enjoy seamless mesh coverage, dual-band speeds, Alexa support, and reliable WiFi for up to 100 devices.', 'TP-Link Deco E4, AC1200 Mesh WiFi, Whole Home Mesh Router, Dual Band Router, TP-Link Mesh WiFi, Smart Home Router, Alexa Compatible Router, Home WiFi System, TP-Link Bangladesh, International Office Solution', NULL, 206, NULL, NULL),
(132, 'TP-Link TL-MR105 300Mbps 4G LTE Route', 'The TP-Link TL-MR105 300 Mbps Wireless N 4G LTE Router is a reliable and flexible 4G LTE router designed to provide fast internet connectivity anytime and anywhere. With 4G LTE download speeds up to 150Mbps, wireless speeds up to 300Mbps, SIM card plug-and-play support, and connectivity for up to 32 devices, the TL-MR105 is ideal for home, office, travel, and remote work environments.', 'tp-link-tl-mr105-300mbps-4g-lte-route-1779686836', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>P-Link TL-MR105 300 Mbps Wireless N 4G LTE Router</strong></h2><p>The TP-Link TL-MR105 300 Mbps Wireless N 4G LTE Router from International Office Solution is a versatile and dependable networking solution designed to deliver stable high-speed internet connectivity using 4G LTE mobile networks. Whether at home, in small offices, remote locations, or while traveling, the TL-MR105 provides convenient wireless internet access with fast setup and reliable performance.</p><p>Powered by advanced 4G LTE technology, the router supports download speeds of up to 150Mbps, allowing users to enjoy smooth HD streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, social media browsing, and fast downloads. The Wireless N technology delivers WiFi speeds of up to 300Mbps, ensuring stable wireless connectivity for multiple connected devices.</p><p>The TP-Link TL-MR105 supports simultaneous connections for up to 32 wireless devices, making it ideal for families, offices, small businesses, temporary workstations, and group internet sharing. Smartphones, tablets, laptops, smart TVs, and other WiFi-enabled devices can connect easily for uninterrupted online access.</p><p>One of the key advantages of the TL-MR105 is its plug-and-play functionality. Users simply need to insert a compatible SIM card, and the router automatically configures the network settings for immediate internet access. Extensive compatibility testing with SIM cards from over 100 countries ensures stable operation with a wide range of mobile network providers.</p><p>The router also features a flexible LAN/WAN port, allowing users to switch between 4G LTE internet and wired broadband connections when needed. This provides added flexibility for users who require backup internet connectivity or mixed networking environments.</p><p>For network security and stability, the TP-Link TL-MR105 includes built-in firewall protection and advanced wireless encryption protocols to safeguard connected devices and personal data from unauthorized access and online threats.</p><p>Its compact and stylish design makes it suitable for modern homes, offices, and portable networking setups. The easy-to-use web management interface simplifies network setup, monitoring, and customization for both beginners and advanced users.</p><p>Whether for remote work, business operations, online classes, entertainment, or portable internet access, the TP-Link TL-MR105 300 Mbps Wireless N 4G LTE Router delivers dependable performance, strong wireless coverage, and convenient connectivity.</p><p>International Office Solution provides authentic TP-Link networking products with trusted customer support and competitive pricing across Bangladesh.</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>Wireless Speed: 300 Mbps<br>LAN/WAN: 10/100 Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2× Internal 4G/3G Antennas<br>2× Internal Wi-Fi Antennas<br>2× External 4G/3G Antenna Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Reset/WPS Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Wireless Speed: 300 Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1 10/100Mbps LAN Port<br>1 10/100Mbps LAN/WAN Port<br>1 Nano SIM Card Slot</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11b/g/n</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>64/128-bit WEP, WPA/WPA2, WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK encryptions</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>9V/0.85A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>6.85×5.12×2.36 in (174×130×60 mm)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>240 g</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'router', 3550.00, 3750.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/ZdbUM7MY05mXFP4N2YFyj7vQU2FjSbuVThAO8SPa.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 05:27:16', '2026-05-25 05:27:16', 'TP-Link TL-MR105 300Mbps 4G LTE Wireless Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy TP-Link TL-MR105 300Mbps Wireless N 4G LTE Router from International Office Solution. Enjoy fast 4G internet, SIM card plug-and-play setup, and reliable WiFi connectivity for up to 32 devices.', 'TP-Link TL-MR105, 4G LTE Router, Wireless N Router, SIM Router, Portable WiFi Router, TP-Link WiFi Router, 300Mbps Router, Mobile Broadband Router, TP-Link Bangladesh, International Office Solution', NULL, 206, NULL, NULL),
(133, 'TL-R470T+ 5-Port Multi Wan Load Balance Broadband Router TP-Link', 'The TP-Link TL-R470T+ 5-Port Multi WAN Load Balance Broadband Router is a professional broadband router designed for small business and office networking. Featuring multi-WAN support, advanced load balancing, QoS management, firewall protection, and reliable Ethernet connectivity, the TL-R470T+ ensures stable internet performance and efficient network management for business environment', 'tl-r470t-5-port-multi-wan-load-balance-broadband-router-tp-link-1779687268', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>TP-Link TL-R470T+ 5-Port Multi WAN Load Balance Broadband Router</strong></h2><p>The TP-Link TL-R470T+ 5-Port Multi WAN Load Balance Broadband Router from International Office Solution is a reliable and efficient networking solution designed specifically for small businesses, offices, cyber cafés, and professional environments requiring stable and uninterrupted internet connectivity. With multi-WAN capability, intelligent load balancing, and advanced network management features, the TL-R470T+ delivers dependable network performance with high operational efficiency.</p><p>The router is equipped with five Ethernet ports, including multiple configurable WAN/LAN ports, allowing support for up to four WAN connections simultaneously. This flexible WAN configuration enables businesses to combine multiple internet connections for improved bandwidth utilization, backup redundancy, and stable internet access across the network.</p><p>The TP-Link TL-R470T+ features intelligent load balancing technology that automatically distributes traffic across multiple WAN ports according to bandwidth and network conditions. This helps optimize internet performance, reduce network congestion, and ensure continuous connectivity even if one internet connection fails.</p><p>Designed to maximize network uptime, the router includes multiple advanced load balancing strategies that improve reliability for business-critical applications such as video conferencing, cloud services, online transactions, remote work, and VoIP communications.</p><p>Advanced Quality of Service (QoS) functionality allows administrators to prioritize network traffic for important applications and devices. This ensures smoother performance for bandwidth-sensitive tasks and helps maintain stable internet access during peak usage periods.</p><p>For network security, the TP-Link TL-R470T+ includes a robust firewall system designed to protect the network against unauthorized access, malicious attacks, and security threats. The router helps create a safer and more secure networking environment for office and business operations.</p><p>The router offers convenient web-based management, allowing users to easily configure, monitor, and manage the network through an intuitive browser-based interface. This simplifies setup and ongoing network administration for both IT professionals and business users.</p><p>With reliable wired connectivity, intelligent traffic management, and flexible multi-WAN support, the TP-Link TL-R470T+ is an ideal solution for organizations seeking cost-effective and stable broadband networking performance.</p><p>International Office Solution provides authentic TP-Link networking products with dependable customer support and competitive pricing across Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Button</td><td>Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1 Fixed 10/100 Ethernet WAN Port<br>1 Fixed 10/100 Ethernet LAN Port<br>3 Changeable 10/100 Ethernet WAN/LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.3, 802.3u, 802.3x, TCP/IP, DHCP, ICMP, NAT, PPPoE, SNTP, HTTP, DDNS</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WEP<br>WPA<br>WPA2<br>WPA/WPA2-Enterprise (802.1x)</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>1× Gigabit WAN Port<br>4× Gigabit LAN Ports<br>Static Link Aggregation (LAG) available with 2× LAN ports</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Flash 16MB<br>DRAM 128MB<br>WAN Connection Type - Static/Dynamic IP, PPPoE, PPTP, L2TP, Dual Access, Bigpond Cable<br>DHCP - DHCP Server/Client, DHCP Address Reservation<br>MAC Clone - Modify WAN/LAN MAC Address<br>Switch Setting - Rate Control, Port Configuration, Port VLAN<br>CL - IP/MAC/URL/WEB Filtering<br>IGMP - IGMP Proxy/IGMP Snooping<br>Forwarding - Virtual Server, Port Triggering, DMZ<br>Load Balance - Policy Routing, Link Backup<br>Routing - Static Routing<br>Security - FTP/SIP/PPTP/IPsec/H.323 ALG, DoS Defence, Ping of Death, IP/MAC Binding<br>Traffic Control Bandwidth Control, Session Limit</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>6.2 × 4.0 × 1.0 in.<br>(158 × 101 × 25mm)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>02 year warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'router', 4390.00, 4400.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/eVUXhSwd9YmJ262qSUIKnyC99ZisnrE5PQv3HY0q.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 05:34:28', '2026-05-25 05:34:28', 'TP-Link TL-R470T+ Multi WAN Load Balance Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy TP-Link TL-R470T+ 5-Port Multi WAN Load Balance Broadband Router from International Office Solution. Enjoy stable business networking, intelligent load balancing, advanced QoS, and secure connectivity.', 'TP-Link TL-R470T+, Load Balance Router, Multi WAN Router, Broadband Router, Business Router, TP-Link Office Router, QoS Router, Ethernet Router, TP-Link Bangladesh, International Office Solution', NULL, 206, NULL, NULL);
