(134, 'AC1900 Wireless MU-MIMO Wi-Fi Router', 'The TP-Link Archer C80 AC1900 Wireless Gigabit Dual-Band MU-MIMO Wi-Fi Router is a high-performance wireless router designed for fast, stable, and efficient home networking. Featuring AC1900 dual-band speeds, 3x3 MIMO, MU-MIMO technology, Beamforming, and Gigabit Ethernet ports, the Archer C80 delivers seamless streaming, gaming, and multi-device connectivity for modern digital lifestyles.', 'ac1900-wireless-mu-mimo-wi-fi-router-1779688600', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>TP-Link Archer C80 AC1900 Wireless Gigabit Dual-Band MU-MIMO Wi-Fi Router</strong></h2><p>The TP-Link Archer C80 AC1900 Wireless Gigabit Dual-Band MU-MIMO Wi-Fi Router from International Office Solution is a powerful and advanced wireless networking solution designed to provide high-speed internet connectivity, strong wireless coverage, and smooth multi-device performance for homes and offices. Built with 802.11ac Wave2 WiFi technology, the Archer C80 delivers reliable and efficient wireless networking for streaming, gaming, video conferencing, smart devices, and daily internet activities.</p><p>The router offers combined dual-band wireless speeds of up to 1900Mbps, including up to 1300Mbps on the 5GHz band and 600Mbps on the 2.4GHz band. The 5GHz frequency is ideal for bandwidth-intensive tasks such as 4K and 8K UHD streaming, cloud gaming, and high-speed downloads, while the 2.4GHz band provides stable connectivity for web browsing, emails, and smart home devices.</p><p>The TP-Link Archer C80 features advanced 3x3 MIMO technology, enabling simultaneous transmission and reception of data across three streams. This significantly improves wireless efficiency and allows compatible 3x3 client devices, including high-performance laptops and computers, to achieve faster and more stable wireless performance compared to standard 2x2 routers.</p><p>Integrated MU-MIMO technology enhances network efficiency by allowing multiple connected devices to communicate with the router simultaneously. This ensures smoother performance, reduced latency, and improved internet stability for households and offices with multiple users and devices connected at the same time.</p><p>Equipped with Beamforming technology, the Archer C80 intelligently detects connected devices and focuses wireless signal strength directly toward them. This improves coverage, signal reliability, and wireless stability, even for devices located farther away from the router.</p><p>For high-speed wired networking, the router includes one Gigabit WAN port and four Gigabit LAN ports, allowing fast and reliable Ethernet connections for desktop computers, gaming consoles, smart TVs, NAS storage, and other wired devices.</p><p>The TP-Link Archer C80 is designed to provide uninterrupted online experiences, enabling lag-free streaming, responsive online gaming, and stable multi-device internet connectivity. Its advanced wireless technologies help optimize overall network performance while supporting demanding modern networking environments.</p><p>The router also offers easy setup and management options, making network configuration and monitoring convenient for both beginner and advanced users.</p><p>Whether for smart homes, multimedia streaming, online learning, remote work, or competitive gaming, the TP-Link Archer C80 AC1900 Wireless Gigabit Dual-Band MU-MIMO Wi-Fi Router provides dependable, high-speed, and future-ready networking performance.</p><p>International Office Solution offers authentic TP-Link networking products with reliable customer support and competitive pricing across Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>1900 Mbps (WiFi):<br>5 GHz: 1300 Mbps (802.11ac)<br>2.4 GHz: 600 Mbps (802.11n)</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4× Fixed High-Performance Antennas<br>Note: Multiple antennas form a signal-boosting array to cover more directions and large areas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS/Wi-Fi Button<br>Power On/Off Button<br>Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Standards - Wi-Fi 5:<br>IEEE 802.11ac/n/a 5 GHz<br>IEEE 802.11n/b/g 2.4 GHz<br><br>WiFi Speeds - AC1900:<br>5 GHz: 1300 Mbps (802.11ac)<br>2.4 GHz: 600 Mbps (802.11n)</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1 x Gigabit WAN, 4 x Gigabit LAN</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11ac, n, a, b, g (WiFi)</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WEP<br>WPA<br>WPA2<br>WPA/WPA2-Enterprise (802.1x)</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>1× Gigabit WAN Port<br>4× Gigabit LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Network Security:<br>SPI Firewall<br>Access Control<br>IP &amp; MAC Binding<br>Application Layer Gateway<br><br>Working Modes: Router Mode, Access Point Mode<br>Processor: 1.2 GHz CPU</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Adapter&nbsp;12V - 1.5A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>8.5 × 4.6 × 1.26 in<br>(215 × 117 × 32 mm)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01 year warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'router', 3650.00, 3750.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/RslSPCgrU6AMnTYIRze7OFEIwh83QgKMC52QvnL5.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 05:56:40', '2026-05-25 05:56:40', 'TP-Link Archer C80 AC1900 MU-MIMO Gigabit WiFi Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy TP-Link Archer C80 AC1900 Dual-Band MU-MIMO WiFi Router from International Office Solution. Enjoy fast wireless speeds, Beamforming coverage, Gigabit ports, and seamless multi-device performance.', 'TP-Link Archer C80, AC1900 Router, MU-MIMO Router, Gigabit WiFi Router, Dual Band Router, Beamforming Router, TP-Link Wireless Router, Home WiFi Router, TP-Link Bangladesh, International Office Solution', NULL, 206, NULL, NULL),
(135, 'BE3600 Whole Home Mesh WiFi 7 System Tp-Link', 'The TP-Link Deco BE22 BE3600 Dual-Band WiFi 7 Mesh Router is a next-generation mesh networking solution designed to deliver ultra-fast, seamless, and reliable wireless connectivity. Featuring advanced WiFi 7 technology, BE3600 dual-band speeds, intelligent mesh networking, TP-Link HomeShield security, and Alexa support, the Deco BE22 ensures smooth streaming, low-latency gaming, and stable connectivity for modern smart homes and offices.', 'be3600-whole-home-mesh-wifi-7-system-tp-link-1779688960', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>TP-Link Deco BE22 BE3600 Dual-Band WiFi 7 Mesh Router (1-Pack)</strong></h2><p>The TP-Link Deco BE22 BE3600 Dual-Band WiFi 7 Mesh Router from International Office Solution is a powerful next-generation mesh networking solution engineered to provide ultra-fast wireless performance, seamless whole-home coverage, and reliable multi-device connectivity for modern digital lifestyles. Built with advanced WiFi 7 technology, the Deco BE22 delivers enhanced speed, reduced latency, and improved network efficiency for demanding applications such as 4K streaming, cloud gaming, video conferencing, and smart home integration.</p><p>Powered by cutting-edge WiFi 7 technology, the TP-Link Deco BE22 offers combined wireless speeds of up to 3600Mbps. Its advanced dual-band architecture intelligently distributes network traffic to optimize overall performance, ensuring smooth internet experiences even in environments with multiple connected devices. Whether streaming ultra-high-definition content, participating in online meetings, or downloading large files, the Deco BE22 delivers responsive and stable connectivity.</p><p>The Deco BE22 utilizes TP-Link Mesh technology to create a unified wireless network with seamless roaming capabilities. Devices automatically connect to the strongest available signal while moving throughout the home or office, eliminating dead zones, buffering, and dropped connections. This mesh networking system is ideal for larger homes, apartments, and multi-room office environments requiring consistent wireless coverage.</p><p>Designed to support multiple connected devices simultaneously, the router ensures reliable performance for smartphones, laptops, gaming consoles, smart TVs, security cameras, IoT devices, and other smart home equipment. Enhanced bandwidth capacity and lower latency make the Deco BE22 suitable for modern high-demand networking environments.</p><p>The TP-Link Deco BE22 also supports TP-Link HomeShield, offering advanced security and network management features including parental controls, Quality of Service (QoS), network monitoring, and protection against online threats. These intelligent features help users maintain a safer and more controlled networking environment.</p><p>Setup and network management are simplified through the TP-Link Deco App, which guides users through installation and allows remote monitoring and management of connected devices, network performance, and security settings. The router also supports Amazon Alexa voice control for added convenience and smart home integration.</p><p>With its sleek and compact design, the Deco BE22 blends naturally into modern home and office setups while delivering powerful next-generation wireless networking performance.</p><p>Whether for smart homes, remote work, entertainment streaming, online gaming, or future-ready wireless networking, the TP-Link Deco BE22 BE3600 Dual-Band WiFi 7 Mesh Router provides high-speed, secure, and dependable connectivity.</p><p>International Office Solution provides authentic TP-Link networking products with trusted customer support and competitive pricing across Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>5 GHz: 2882 Mbps (802.11be)<br>2.4 GHz: 688 Mbps (802.11be)</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4× High-Performance Antennas (Internal)</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1× Reset Button<br>1× WPS</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>Dual-Band (2.4GHz &amp; 5GHz)</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>Wi-Fi 7<br>IEEE 802.11be/ax/ac/n/a 5 GHz<br>IEEE 802.11be/ax/n/b/g 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA-Personal<br>WPA2-Personal<br>WPA3-Personal</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>2× 1.0 Gbps<br><br>*Per Deco Unit<br>Supports WAN/LAN auto-sensing</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>5.91 × 5.91 × 2.44 in (150 × 150 × 62 mm)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 Year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'router', 9190.00, 9290.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/PXkPQQ0jiNuyGiieItdrvGcqC55S03WJPYqcrrrJ.jpg', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 06:02:40', '2026-05-25 06:02:40', 'TP-Link Deco BE22 BE3600 WiFi 7 Mesh Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy TP-Link Deco BE22 BE3600 Dual-Band WiFi 7 Mesh Router from International Office Solution. Enjoy ultra-fast WiFi 7 speeds, seamless mesh coverage, HomeShield security, and smart home connectivity.', 'TP-Link Deco BE22, WiFi 7 Router, BE3600 Mesh Router, TP-Link Mesh WiFi, Dual Band Router, Smart Home Router, TP-Link Deco Router, WiFi 7 Mesh System, TP-Link Bangladesh, International Office Solution', NULL, 206, NULL, NULL),
(136, 'Tp-Link Deco BE22  BE3600 Whole Home Mesh WiFi 7 System (2Pck)', 'The TP-Link Deco BE22 BE3600 Dual-Band WiFi 7 Mesh Router (2-Pack) is a next-generation mesh WiFi system designed to provide ultra-fast wireless performance, wider coverage, and seamless connectivity throughout homes and offices. Featuring WiFi 7 technology, BE3600 dual-band speeds, TP-Link Mesh networking, HomeShield security, and Alexa support, this 2-pack system ensures stable and uninterrupted internet for modern multi-device environments.', 'tp-link-deco-be22-be3600-whole-home-mesh-wifi-7-system-2pck-1779689411', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>TP-Link Deco BE22 BE3600 Dual-Band WiFi 7 Mesh Router (2-Pack)</strong></h2><p>The TP-Link Deco BE22 BE3600 Dual-Band WiFi 7 Mesh Router (2-Pack) from International Office Solution is a powerful whole-home mesh networking solution designed to deliver next-generation wireless connectivity with expanded coverage, ultra-fast speeds, and intelligent network management. Built with advanced WiFi 7 technology, the Deco BE22 2-Pack system ensures reliable internet performance for modern homes, smart offices, and high-demand networking environments.</p><p>Powered by WiFi 7 technology, the Deco BE22 provides combined wireless speeds of up to 3600Mbps, delivering faster data transmission, reduced latency, and enhanced network efficiency. This high-performance dual-band mesh router system is ideal for bandwidth-intensive tasks such as 4K and 8K streaming, online gaming, cloud applications, remote work, video conferencing, and large file transfers.</p><p>The dual-pack mesh system creates a unified wireless network using TP-Link Mesh technology, allowing devices to automatically connect to the strongest available signal as users move throughout the home or office. This seamless roaming capability eliminates dead zones, weak signal areas, and connection interruptions, ensuring uninterrupted internet access across multiple rooms and larger spaces.</p><p>The TP-Link Deco BE22 supports multiple connected devices simultaneously while maintaining stable and efficient wireless performance. Smartphones, laptops, tablets, gaming consoles, smart TVs, security systems, and smart home devices can all operate smoothly without compromising network speed or stability.</p><p>Integrated TP-Link HomeShield technology provides advanced network security and intelligent management features including parental controls, Quality of Service (QoS), network monitoring, and protection against online threats. These tools help users create a safer, smarter, and more controlled networking environment for families and businesses.</p><p>The system is easy to install and manage using the TP-Link Deco App, which offers guided setup, remote device management, network monitoring, and security configuration directly from a smartphone. Support for Amazon Alexa voice control adds extra convenience for smart home integration and hands-free network management.</p><p>With its sleek, modern, and compact design, the Deco BE22 blends seamlessly into any home or office setup while providing future-ready WiFi performance and reliable whole-home wireless coverage.</p><p>Whether for smart homes, high-speed entertainment, online learning, remote work, or gaming, the TP-Link Deco BE22 BE3600 Dual-Band WiFi 7 Mesh Router (2-Pack) delivers secure, powerful, and uninterrupted networking performance.</p><p>International Office Solution provides authentic TP-Link networking products with reliable customer support and competitive pricing across Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>5 GHz: 2882 Mbps (802.11be)<br>2.4 GHz: 688 Mbps (802.11be)</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4× High-Performance Antennas (Internal)</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1× Reset Button<br>1× WPS</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>Dual-Band (2.4GHz &amp; 5GHz)</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>Wi-Fi 7<br>IEEE 802.11be/ax/ac/n/a 5 GHz<br>IEEE 802.11be/ax/n/b/g 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA-Personal<br>WPA2-Personal<br>WPA3-Personal</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>2× 1.0 Gbps<br><br>*Per Deco Unit<br>Supports WAN/LAN auto-sensing</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>5.91 × 5.91 × 2.44 in (150 × 150 × 62 mm)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 Year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'router', 18249.00, 18349.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/iFyS3Z15B5ebaW81Mzdi11SH1QJjunv4TbJ3OZeI.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 06:10:11', '2026-05-25 06:10:11', 'TP-Link Deco BE22 BE3600 WiFi 7 Mesh Router (2-Pack) | International Office Solution', 'Buy TP-Link Deco BE22 BE3600 Dual-Band WiFi 7 Mesh Router (2-Pack) from International Office Solution. Enjoy ultra-fast WiFi 7 speeds, seamless mesh coverage, HomeShield security, and reliable whole-home connectivity.', 'TP-Link Deco BE22, WiFi 7 Mesh Router, BE3600 Router, TP-Link Mesh WiFi, Dual Band Router, Whole Home WiFi, Smart Home Router, TP-Link Deco System, TP-Link Bangladesh, International Office Solution', NULL, 206, NULL, NULL),
(137, 'Tenda F3 300mbps Wireless Router', 'The Tenda F3 300Mbps Wireless Router is an affordable and reliable home networking solution designed for smooth internet browsing, HD streaming, and basic online gaming. With 300Mbps speed, 3 high-gain 5dBi antennas, and multiple operating modes, it ensures stable WiFi coverage for small homes, shops, and office environments.', 'tenda-f3-300mbps-wireless-router-1779690135', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Tenda F3 300Mbps Wireless Router</strong> is a simple yet powerful networking device built for users who need stable and fast internet connectivity at home or in small business environments. Designed with user-friendly features and strong wireless performance, it delivers a smooth online experience for everyday tasks such as web browsing, video streaming, social media usage, and light gaming.</p><p>Equipped with 802.11b/g/n wireless technology, the router provides wireless speeds of up to 300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band. This ensures consistent connectivity for multiple devices including smartphones, laptops, smart TVs, and IoT devices.</p><p>The Tenda F3 features three 5dBi high-gain omnidirectional antennas that significantly enhance wireless coverage and signal strength. These antennas help reduce dead zones and ensure stable WiFi performance across different rooms or floors, making it suitable for small homes, apartments, and retail shops.</p><p>This router is designed for easy installation and management, allowing users to set up their network within minutes without technical expertise. It also supports WPA/WPA2-PSK encryption, ensuring secure wireless communication and protection from unauthorized access.</p><p>The Tenda F3 includes smart WiFi scheduling and bandwidth control features, allowing users to manage internet usage efficiently. Parents or administrators can control when devices can access the internet and allocate bandwidth to ensure smooth performance across all connected devices.</p><p>For added flexibility, the router supports multiple working modes such as Router Mode, Access Point (AP) Mode, WISP Mode, and Universal Repeater Mode. These options make it easy to expand or extend existing networks depending on user requirements.</p><p>With its compact, lightweight, and minimalist design, the Tenda F3 blends easily into any environment while delivering reliable wireless performance at an affordable price point.</p><p>Overall, the Tenda F3 is an excellent choice for users looking for a budget-friendly router that provides stable coverage, easy setup, and essential networking features for daily internet usage.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>Up to 300Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>3*5dBi external antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1*RST</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1*10/100Mbps WAN port<br>3*10/100Mbps LAN ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE802.3, IEEE802.3u,IEEE802.3ab</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA/WPA2, WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>1 x WAN<br>3 x LAN</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Wireless Router Mode<br>Universal Repeater Mode<br>WISP Mode<br>AP Mode<br>Port Forwarding<br>DMZ Host<br>UPnP<br>IPsec pass through<br>PPTP pass through<br>L2TP pass through</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Input：AC 100-240V~50/60Hz 0.6A<br>Output：DC 9V0.6A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>185.6*118.4*31.2mm</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 1300.00, 1350.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/M38fZrWuY62Rm0lTXMvNHX3eZZhX79hWZJDyeF2O.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 0