(138, 'Tenda F6 300Mbps WiFi Router', 'The Tenda F6 300Mbps WiFi Router is a reliable home and small business networking device designed for stable internet performance, wider coverage, and easy setup. With 4 high-gain antennas, 300Mbps wireless speed, and multiple operation modes, it ensures smooth browsing, streaming, and everyday connectivity.', 'tenda-f6-300mbps-wifi-router-1779690394', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Tenda F6 300Mbps WiFi Router</strong> is a practical and efficient networking solution designed for users who need stable and consistent internet access in homes, small offices, and shops. Built with simplicity and performance in mind, it delivers reliable wireless coverage for everyday internet activities such as HD video streaming, online gaming, video calling, and general browsing.</p><p>Operating on the 2.4GHz frequency band and supporting IEEE 802.11b/g/n standards, the router provides wireless speeds of up to 300Mbps. This ensures smooth connectivity for multiple devices, including smartphones, laptops, smart TVs, and other WiFi-enabled gadgets.</p><p>One of the key strengths of the Tenda F6 is its four 5dBi high-gain omnidirectional antennas. These antennas significantly enhance wireless signal strength and coverage, helping reduce dead zones and ensuring stable connectivity across multiple rooms or small office spaces.</p><p>The router is designed for easy installation and user-friendly operation, allowing users to set up their network quickly without technical expertise. It also includes WPA/WPA2-PSK encryption to ensure secure wireless communication and protect the network from unauthorized access.</p><p>For better network control, the Tenda F6 offers smart WiFi scheduling and bandwidth management features. These tools allow users to control internet access time and distribute bandwidth efficiently among connected devices, ensuring a balanced and stable network experience for all users.</p><p>The router also supports multiple working modes, including Router Mode, Access Point (AP) Mode, WISP Mode, and Universal Repeater Mode. This flexibility allows users to extend existing networks or configure the router based on specific networking needs.</p><p>With its compact and modern design, the Tenda F6 easily fits into any home or office environment while providing strong and stable wireless performance.</p><p>Overall, the Tenda F6 is a cost-effective and dependable choice for users who want improved coverage, easy setup, and essential networking features for daily internet use.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>300Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4 antenna</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1*RESET button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA/WPA2, WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>1*10/100Mbps WAN port<br>3*10/100Mbps LAN ports</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Bandwidth Control<br>MAC Clone<br>System Log<br>Backup &amp; Restore configurations<br>Firmware upgradeable via browser<br>IPv6 Features Supported（just in Bangladesh</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Input：AC 100-240V~50/60Hz 0.6A<br>Output：DC 9V0.6A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>204*147.5*211mm</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 1400.00, 1449.98, NULL, 10, 'products/thumbnails/mRiB9tZBgPEOLHmOiyOPLiinaHICAidxdQLuvxKs.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 06:26:34', '2026-05-25 06:26:34', 'Tenda F6 300Mbps WiFi Router | High Coverage Home Router BD', 'Buy Tenda F6 300Mbps WiFi Router in Bangladesh. Enjoy strong coverage with 4 antennas, stable internet speed, easy setup, and reliable performance for home and office use.', 'Tenda F6, 300Mbps Router, Tenda WiFi Router, Wireless N Router, Home Router Bangladesh, Small Business Router, 2.4GHz Router, Tenda Router BD, Budget WiFi Router, Wireless Internet Router', NULL, 207, NULL, NULL),
(139, 'Tenda AC3 AC750 Dual-Band Wi-Fi Router', 'The Tenda AC3 AC750 Dual-Band Wi-Fi Router is a compact and efficient networking solution designed for smooth internet performance at home and small offices. With dual-band speeds up to 750Mbps, Beamforming, MU-MIMO support, and strong 5dBi antennas, it ensures stable coverage for streaming, browsing, and online gaming.', 'tenda-ac3-ac750-dual-band-wi-fi-router-1779690593', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Tenda AC3 AC750 Dual-Band Wi-Fi Router</strong> is a reliable and feature-rich wireless router designed to deliver stable, fast, and secure internet connectivity for modern households and small office environments. Built with 802.11ac technology, it supports both 2.4GHz and 5GHz frequency bands, offering a combined wireless speed of up to 750Mbps—300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band for everyday tasks and 433Mbps on the 5GHz band for high-speed applications like HD streaming, video conferencing, and online gaming.</p><p>Equipped with three high-performance 5dBi external omnidirectional antennas, the Tenda AC3 provides strong signal strength and wide coverage across multiple rooms and floors. These antennas help reduce dead zones and ensure a more stable wireless experience even in environments with walls and obstacles.</p><p>The router supports modern networking technologies including MU-MIMO and Beamforming, which improve overall network efficiency by allowing multiple devices to connect simultaneously while maintaining strong and stable performance. Beamforming intelligently directs the WiFi signal toward connected devices for better speed and reliability.</p><p>Designed for compatibility, the AC3 works with both legacy and modern devices using IEEE 802.11a/b/g/n/ac standards, ensuring seamless connectivity for smartphones, laptops, smart TVs, gaming consoles, and IoT devices.</p><p>For wired connections, the router includes multiple 10/100Mbps LAN/WAN ports, offering flexible connectivity options for desktops and other wired devices. Security is strengthened with WPA/WPA2 encryption, firewall protection, and WPS setup, ensuring a safe browsing environment for all users.</p><p>The Tenda WiFi App provides easy setup and management, allowing users to control bandwidth, manage parental restrictions, configure VPN access, and monitor connected devices directly from a smartphone. This makes network management simple and convenient even for non-technical users.</p><p>With its compact design, energy-efficient operation, and compliance with global safety standards (CE, FCC, RoHS), the Tenda AC3 fits easily into any home or office setup while maintaining reliable performance.</p><p>Overall, the Tenda AC3 AC750 Dual-Band Router is an excellent choice for users seeking a balance of affordability, speed, coverage, and ease of use.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>750Mbps (300Mbps @2.4GHz + 433Mbps @5GHz)<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>3 x 5dBi external omnidirectional antennas<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>Dual-core 1GHz CPU with 64MB RAM for smooth performance</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11ac/a/n (5GHz), IEEE 802.11b/g/n (2.4GHz)<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA/WPA2, WPS, Parental Control, Firewall (Ping/Flood Attack Defense)</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>4 x 10/100Mbps LAN/WAN ports<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>MU-MIMO, Beamforming, Bandwidth Control, Tenda WiFi App, VPN Support</td></tr><tr><td>Operating System Support</td><td>IPv4 &amp; IPv6 support with PPPoE, Dynamic IP &amp; Static IP connections<br>Supports Router, AP &amp; Universal Repeater (Client+AP, WISP) modes</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Input: AC 100-240V, 50/60Hz; Output: DC 12V, 1A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>185.6 x 118.4 x 31.2mm<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>white</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'router', 1710.00, 1720.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/9eHmJw4HXPYxbWLqJ46t3aswITS3tyDXeAvBVA25.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 06:29:53', '2026-05-25 06:29:53', 'Tenda AC3 AC750 Dual-Band Wi-Fi Router | Stable Home Router BD', 'Buy Tenda AC3 AC750 Dual-Band Wi-Fi Router in Bangladesh. Enjoy 750Mbps speed, Beamforming, MU-MIMO, strong coverage, and secure home networking performance.', 'Tenda AC3, AC750 Router, Dual Band WiFi Router, Tenda WiFi Router, Home Router Bangladesh, MU-MIMO Router, Wireless Router BD, 5GHz Router, Tenda Router AC3, Small Office Router', NULL, 207, NULL, NULL),
(140, 'Tenda AC5 AC1200 Dual-Band WiFi Router', 'The Tenda AC5 AC1200 Smart Dual-Band WiFi Router is a powerful home networking device designed for fast, stable, and seamless internet performance. With AC1200 dual-band speed, a 1GHz high-performance CPU, MU-MIMO, Beamforming+, and four 5dBi antennas, it ensures smooth 4K streaming, gaming, and multi-device connectivity.', 'tenda-ac5-ac1200-dual-band-wifi-router-1779690817', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Tenda AC5 AC1200 Smart Dual-Band WiFi Router</strong> is a high-performance networking solution built to deliver fast, stable, and intelligent internet connectivity for modern homes and small office environments. Designed with advanced hardware and smart software features, it provides a smooth online experience for streaming, gaming, video conferencing, and everyday browsing.</p><p>Powered by dual-band AC1200 WiFi technology, the Tenda AC5 delivers combined wireless speeds of up to 1200Mbps—300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band for basic tasks like browsing and email, and 867Mbps on the 5GHz band for high-bandwidth activities such as 4K HD streaming and online gaming. This ensures optimal performance across multiple devices simultaneously.</p><p>At its core, the router is equipped with a 1GHz high-frequency CPU built using a 28nm process, offering significantly improved processing power compared to standard routers. This powerful chipset enhances data handling efficiency, reduces latency, and ensures stable performance even under heavy network load.</p><p>The Tenda AC5 features four 5dBi high-gain dual-band omnidirectional antennas, providing wide coverage and strong signal penetration through walls and obstacles. This helps eliminate dead zones and ensures consistent connectivity throughout homes, apartments, and small office spaces.</p><p>Advanced technologies such as MU-MIMO and Beamforming+ further improve network efficiency by allowing multiple devices to connect simultaneously while directing stronger signals toward connected devices. This results in smoother performance for multiple users, even in high-traffic environments.</p><p>One of the standout features of the AC5 is ISP user name and password migration, which allows users to easily transfer existing broadband credentials without complicated setup processes. This makes installation quick and hassle-free.</p><p>The router also supports remote management through the Tenda WiFi App, enabling users to monitor, configure, and control their network from anywhere using a smartphone. Features like parental controls, bandwidth management, and device monitoring make it easy to maintain a secure and well-organized network.</p><p>With its modern design, energy-efficient performance, and reliable hardware, the Tenda AC5 is an excellent choice for users looking to upgrade their home network with speed, stability, and smart management features.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>5 GHz: Up to 867 Mbps<br>2.4 GHz: Up to 300 Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4x 6dBi external high-gain antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS/Reset button x1, WiFi on/off button x1</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>Concurrent dual band 2.4 GHz &amp; 5 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>10/100 Mbps WAN port*1<br>10/100 Mbps LAN port*3</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE802.3, IEEE802.3u</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK, WPA/WPA2<br>Wireless Security: Enable/Disable<br>WPS (WiFi Protected Set-up) quick encryption</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>PPPoE Username/Password Clone<br>Smart WiFi Schedule<br>Smart Sleeping Mode<br>Smart LED on/off<br>Tenda WiFi App</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>AC input: 100-240V-50/60Hz, 0.2A<br>DC output: 9V 1A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'router', 2010.00, 2020.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/TpYfrShQJ5SKf5nhZxcJGvy5SPuNPdOGYzipTJG3.png', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 06:33:37', '2026-05-25 06:33:37', 'Tenda AC5 AC1200 Smart Dual-Band WiFi Router | High-Speed Home Router BD', 'Buy Tenda AC5 AC1200 Smart Dual-Band WiFi Router in Bangladesh. Enjoy 1GHz CPU performance, MU-MIMO, Beamforming+, strong coverage, and smooth 4K streaming.', 'Tenda AC5, AC1200 Router, Dual Band WiFi Router, Smart WiFi Router, Tenda Router BD, Home WiFi Router, MU-MIMO Router, Beamforming Router, 5GHz Router, Tenda AC5 Bangladesh', NULL, 207, NULL, NULL),
(141, 'Tenda AC7 AC1200 Dual-Band Wi-Fi Router', 'The Tenda AC7 AC1200 Dual-Band Wi-Fi Router is a high-performance home and office router designed for fast, stable, and wide wireless coverage. With AC1200 dual-band speeds, a 600MHz processor, MU-MIMO technology, and five high-gain antennas, it ensures smooth 4K streaming, online gaming, and reliable multi-device connectivity.', 'tenda-ac7-ac1200-dual-band-wi-fi-router-1779691812', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Tenda AC7 AC1200 Dual-Band Wi-Fi Router</strong> is a powerful and feature-rich networking solution built to deliver fast, stable, and secure internet connectivity for modern homes and small office environments. Designed with advanced hardware and intelligent software features, it ensures a smooth online experience for streaming, gaming, video conferencing, and multitasking across multiple devices.</p><p>Powered by dual-band AC1200 WiFi technology, the Tenda AC7 delivers combined wireless speeds of up to 1200Mbps—867Mbps on the 5GHz band for high-bandwidth applications like 4K streaming and online gaming, and 300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band for everyday tasks such as browsing, emailing, and social media usage. This dual-band structure helps reduce congestion and improves overall network efficiency.</p><p>At its core, the router features a 28nm high-performance 600MHz CPU, which enhances data processing speed and ensures stable performance even under heavy network usage. This allows multiple users and devices to stay connected without experiencing lag or interruptions.</p><p>The Tenda AC7 is equipped with five 5dBi high-gain external antennas that significantly improve signal strength and coverage. These antennas provide better wall penetration and extended range, making the router suitable for larger homes, multi-room apartments, and small offices.</p><p>With MU-MIMO technology, the AC7 can communicate with multiple devices simultaneously, improving efficiency and reducing latency when several users are connected at the same time. This makes it ideal for busy households with smartphones, laptops, smart TVs, and IoT devices.</p><p>The router also includes advanced security features such as WPA2-PSK encryption and firewall protection against ICMP, TCP, and UDP flood attacks. Additional parental control options allow users to manage internet access with URL filtering, time scheduling, and device limitations for a safer online environment.</p><p>The Tenda AC7 supports multiple internet connection types, including PPPoE, Dynamic IP, Static IP, PPTP, and L2TP, and is fully compatible with both IPv4 and IPv6 protocols. It also offers useful features such as VPN pass-through, IPTV support, bandwidth control, DDNS, virtual server settings, DMZ, port forwarding, and UPnP.</p><p>For flexible deployment, the router supports multiple working modes including Router Mode, Access Point Mode, and Universal Repeater Mode, allowing users to adapt it to different networking requirements.</p><p>The Tenda WiFi App provides convenient remote management, enabling users to configure settings, update firmware, control LED indicators, and manage connected devices easily from a smartphone.</p><p>With its sleek black design, strong hardware performance, and intelligent features, the Tenda AC7 AC1200 Dual-Band Router is a reliable and efficient solution for users seeking stable, high-speed internet with advanced control and security.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>5GHz: 867Mbps<br>2.4GHz: 300Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>5*5dBi external antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1* Wi-Fi / Reset button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>CE:<br>2.4G: 2412-2472MHz(CH1-CH13)<br>5G: 5150-5250MHz(CH36-CH64)<br>FCC:<br>2.4G: 2412-2462MHz(CH1-CH11)<br>5G: 5150-5250MHz(CH36-CH64)<br>5725-5825MHz(CH149-CH165)</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>WAN, LAN</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11ac/a/n @5GHz<br>IEEE 802.11b/g/n @2.4GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA2-PSK<br>Wireless Security: Enable /Disable</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>1*10/100Mbps WAN port<br>3*10/100Mbps LAN ports</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>28nm high-performance chip<br>MU-MIMO, Bandwidth Control, Tenda WiFi App, VPN Support<br>Internet Connection Type<br>PPPoE, Dynamic IP, Static IP<br>PPPoE(Russia), PPTP(Russia), L2TP(Russia)<br><br>Network Protocol<br>IPv4&amp;IPv6<br><br>Operating Mode<br>Router Mode<br>AP Mode<br>Universal Repeater Mode（Client+AP,WISP）<br><br>Parental Control<br>Client Filter<br>URL Filter<br>Time Limit<br><br>DHCP<br>DHCP Server<br>DHCP Client List<br>DHCP Static IP Address Reservation and Allocation<br><br>Virtual Server<br>Port Forwarding, DMZ Host, UPnP<br><br>Firewall<br>ICMP Flood Attack Defense<br>TCP Flood Attack Defense<br>UDP Flood Attack Defense<br>Block Ping From WAN<br><br>DDNS<br>DynDNS, no-ip, oray, 88ip<br><br>VPN<br>IPsec pass through<br>PPTP pass through<br>L2TP pass through<br><br>Special Features<br>Guest Network<br>IPTV<br>Signal Adjustment<br><br>Basic Functions<br>PPPoE Username/password Clone<br>Smart WiFi Schedule<br>Smart Power Saving<br>Smart LED on/off<br>Tenda App<br>Dual-band in One<br>IPv6 Features Supported<br>Broadband management<br>MAC address clone<br>Backup &amp; Restore configurations<br>Firmware upgrade from local</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Input: 100-240V—50/60Hz 0.4A<br>Output: DC 9V1A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>220mm*141.5mm*49mm(L*W*H)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual-Band', 2100.00, 2200.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/P4oBfSMrelq2byEYnU1A6sgEZYnD795cCGwjIKUK.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 06:50:12', '2026-05-25 06:50:12', 'Tenda AC7 AC1200 Dual-Band WiFi Router | High Coverage Home Router BD', 'Buy Tenda AC7 AC1200 Dual-Band Wi-Fi Router in Bangladesh. Enjoy strong coverage, MU-MIMO performance, 600MHz CPU, advanced security, and smooth 4K streaming.', 'Tenda AC7, AC1200 Router, Dual Band WiFi Router, Tenda WiFi Router, Home Router Bangladesh, MU-MIMO Router, 5 Antenna Router, 2.4GHz 5GHz Router, Tenda Router BD, Wireless Router Bangladesh', NULL, 207, NULL, NULL),
(142, 'Tenda HG6 N300 Wi-Fi GPON ONT Router', 'The Tenda HG6 N300 2-Antenna Wi-Fi GPON ONT Router is a reliable fiber broadband solution designed for FTTH connections. With 300Mbps WiFi speed, GPON support, 2 high-gain antennas, VoIP voice port, and IPTV capability, it ensures stable internet, voice, and multimedia services for home and office users.', 'tenda-hg6-n300-wi-fi-gpon-ont-router-1779692061', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Tenda HG6 N300 2-Antenna Wi-Fi GPON ONT Router</strong> is an advanced fiber-optic networking device designed for FTTH (Fiber to the Home) solutions, offering stable, high-speed, and multi-service internet connectivity. As an intelligent GPON ONT router, it integrates modem, router, WiFi access point, and VoIP functionality into a single compact device, making it an ideal choice for modern home and business internet setups.</p><p>Supporting the IEEE 802.11n wireless standard, the HG6 delivers WiFi speeds of up to 300Mbps, ensuring smooth browsing, HD streaming, online communication, and IPTV usage. This makes it suitable for everyday internet needs in households and small offices.</p><p>The router is equipped with two high-performance 6dBi external antennas, which significantly enhance wireless signal strength, coverage range, and stability. These antennas ensure better wall penetration and consistent connectivity across multiple rooms.</p><p>On the wired side, the Tenda HG6 features four LAN ports (1 Gigabit Ethernet port and 3 Fast Ethernet ports), enabling flexible connectivity for PCs, smart TVs, set-top boxes, and other network devices. It also includes a dedicated voice port, allowing users to connect VoIP services for internet-based telephone communication.</p><p>Designed for triple-play services, the HG6 supports Internet access, HD IPTV streaming, and VoIP voice services simultaneously, making it a complete networking solution for fiber broadband users.</p><p>The device is widely compatible with major global OLT systems and supports plug-and-play installation, simplifying setup for users. It also includes OMCI and TR-069 remote management capabilities, allowing service providers to configure and maintain the device remotely for improved efficiency and reliability.</p><p>With its intelligent FTTH design, stable performance, and multi-service support, the Tenda HG6 ensures a seamless digital experience for modern users requiring high-speed fiber connectivity.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>300Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2 antenna</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1* Power On/Off Button<br>1*WPS Button<br>1*WLAN Button<br>1*RESET Button<br>1*LED Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1*SC/APC GPON Port<br>1*1000Mbps RJ45 LAN Port<br>3*100Mbps RJ45 LAN Ports<br>1*USB Port<br>1*VoIP Port<br>1*DC Port</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA / WPA2, WPA-PSK/ WPA2-PSK Encryption, Wireless MAC Filtering</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>GPON Port, 2 LAN Port, USB Port, VoIP Port, DC Port</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Power Consumption: ≤12w<br>External Power Supply: DC 12V /1.0A<br>TX Power: 0.5~5dBm<br>RX Power: -28~-8dBm</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>163*115*28 mm (W * D * H)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Router', 2099.99, 2200.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/ckISD9uOMUYXDFRYRnFOOLJWhqptg8dI7QhSmGIZ.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 06:54:21', '2026-05-25 06:54:21', 'Tenda HG6 N300 GPON ONT WiFi Router | Fiber Internet Router BD', 'Buy Tenda HG6 N300 GPON ONT WiFi Router in Bangladesh. Enjoy fiber broadband support, 300Mbps WiFi, VoIP, IPTV, and stable FTTH internet connectivity.', 'Tenda HG6, GPON ONT Router, Fiber Router, N300 WiFi Router, FTTH Router Bangladesh, Tenda GPON Router, VoIP Router, IPTV Router, Home Fiber Router, Tenda Router BD', NULL, 207, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `name`, `short_description`, `slug`, `description`, `specifications_text`, `tags`, `buy_price`, `price`, `discount_price`, `stock`, `thumbnail`, `video`, `is_featured`, `status`, `is_coming_soon`, `is_tba`, `is_call_for_price`, `is_out_of_stock`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`, `meta_keywords`, `meta_image`, `brand_id`, `supplier_id`, `laptop_purpose_id`) VALUES
(143, 'Tenda Nova MW3 AC1200 Dual Band Mesh Router (1 Pack)', 'The Tenda Nova MW3 AC1200 Dual Band Mesh Router (1 Pack) is a compact mesh networking solution designed to deliver stable, seamless WiFi coverage across your home. With AC1200 dual-band speeds, Beamforming, MU-MIMO, Band Steering, and easy app control, it ensures smooth streaming, gaming, and reliable multi-device connectivity.', 'tenda-nova-mw3-ac1200-dual-band-mesh-router-1-pack-1779692430', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Tenda Nova MW3 AC1200 Dual Band Mesh Router (1 Pack)</strong> is a reliable whole-home WiFi solution designed to eliminate dead zones and deliver consistent wireless coverage for modern homes and small offices. Built with advanced mesh networking technology, it ensures seamless roaming and stable internet performance across multiple rooms.</p><p>Powered by AC1200 dual-band WiFi technology, the MW3 delivers combined speeds of up to 1200Mbps—300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band for everyday browsing and smart home devices, and 867Mbps on the 5GHz band for high-bandwidth activities such as HD streaming, video conferencing, and online gaming. This ensures balanced performance across multiple connected devices.</p><p>The device is equipped with a 1GHz high-performance CPU and 128MB RAM, enabling smooth data handling and stable performance even when multiple devices are connected. It supports IEEE 802.11a/b/g/n/ac Wave 2 standards for wide compatibility and efficient wireless communication.</p><p>The Tenda Nova MW3 features advanced mesh networking capabilities, including AP Steering and Band Steering, which automatically connect devices to the best available node and frequency band. This ensures uninterrupted connectivity as users move throughout the home, creating a seamless roaming experience.</p><p>With MU-MIMO and Beamforming technologies, the router efficiently communicates with multiple devices at the same time while focusing wireless signals for stronger and more stable connections. This improves overall network efficiency, especially in environments with heavy device usage.</p><p>For wired connectivity, each node includes dual 10/100Mbps Ethernet ports, allowing users to connect smart TVs, PCs, gaming consoles, and other wired devices with stable performance. The device also supports multiple internet connection types including PPPoE, Dynamic IP, Static IP, PPTP, and L2TP, ensuring compatibility with most ISPs.</p><p>Security is enhanced with WPA-PSK and WPA2-PSK encryption, along with firewall protections against network threats such as TCP/UDP flood attacks. Additional features like parental controls, guest networks, and QoS (Quality of Service) allow users to manage bandwidth and control internet access effectively.</p><p>The Tenda WiFi App provides simple installation and remote management, allowing users to configure settings, monitor devices, update firmware, and control their network from anywhere. Auto internet detection and smart setup features make installation quick and user-friendly.</p><p>With its compact design, intelligent mesh technology, and reliable performance, the Tenda Nova MW3 AC1200 Mesh Router is an ideal choice for users looking to upgrade to seamless whole-home WiFi coverage.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>2.4GHz: 300Mbps<br>5GHz: 867Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2 x Internal antenna</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1 x Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>Dual Band (2.4GHz &amp; 5GHz)</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.3, IEEE 802.3u, IEEE 802.4ab<br>IEEE802.11a/b/g/n/ac (WiFi 5 wave 2)</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK(default)</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>2 x 10/100Mbps RJ45 ports per node</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Smart QoS (Gaming, Video &amp; Audio, Download)<br>Auto-sensing internet connection<br>Support App management and Remote management<br>Guest Network<br>Firmware upgrade online<br>SSID Broadcast<br>Beam Forming<br>MU-MIMO<br>AP Steering<br>Band Steering</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Input: 100-240V—50/60Hz, 0.3A<br>Output: 12V 1A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>90 x 90x 90mm (3.54 x 3.54 x 3.54 in.)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band Mesh', 2250.00, 2350.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/EMxdTSA4OjstjToLDktPH4HchCrA8MoouevG6dYD.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 07:00:30', '2026-05-25 07:00:59', 'Tenda Nova MW3 AC1200 Dual Band Mesh Router (1 Pack) | Home WiFi Mesh BD', 'Buy Tenda Nova MW3 AC1200 Dual Band Mesh Router (1 Pack) in Bangladesh. Enjoy seamless mesh coverage, AC1200 speed, MU-MIMO, Beamforming, and stable whole-home WiFi.', 'Tenda Nova MW3, AC1200 Mesh Router, Dual Band Mesh WiFi, Tenda Mesh System, Home WiFi Mesh, WiFi Router BD, Seamless Roaming Router, MU-MIMO Mesh Router, Tenda Router Bangladesh, Smart WiFi Mesh', NULL, 207, NULL, NULL),
(144, 'AC8 AC1200 Dual-Band Gigabit Wi-Fi Router Tenda', 'The Tenda AC8 AC1200 Dual-Band Gigabit Smart Wi-Fi Router is a high-performance home networking device designed for fiber broadband users. With AC1200 dual-band speed, full Gigabit ports, Beamforming technology, and smart optimization features, it delivers fast, stable, and efficient internet for streaming, gaming, and multi-device use.', 'ac8-ac1200-dual-band-gigabit-wi-fi-router-tenda-1779692779', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Tenda AC8 AC1200 Dual-Band Gigabit Smart Wi-Fi Router</strong> is engineered to provide high-speed, stable, and intelligent wireless connectivity for modern homes and small offices. Designed with full Gigabit Ethernet ports and dual-band WiFi technology, it is ideal for users with high-speed fiber internet connections who demand maximum performance and reliability.</p><p>This router delivers combined wireless speeds of up to 1167Mbps, utilizing both 2.4GHz and 5GHz bands. The 2.4GHz band ensures wider coverage for basic tasks such as browsing and social media, while the 5GHz band provides faster speeds for HD/4K streaming, online gaming, and large file downloads. The system intelligently prioritizes the 5GHz band for optimal performance when needed.</p><p>Equipped with four high-gain 6dBi external antennas, the Tenda AC8 significantly enhances signal strength and coverage. Combined with Beamforming technology, it focuses wireless signals directly toward connected devices, ensuring stronger connections, reduced interference, and improved stability across your home or office.</p><p>The router features full Gigabit WAN and LAN ports, allowing support for up to 1000Mbps internet speeds. This makes it fully compatible with high-speed fiber broadband connections, ensuring no bandwidth bottlenecks during heavy usage.</p><p>One of the standout features of the AC8 is its intelligent network optimization system. It continuously analyzes the surrounding wireless environment and automatically adjusts WiFi channels and bandwidth settings to reduce interference and maintain stable performance at all times.</p><p>For ease of setup, the router includes an innovative broadband account migration feature. This allows users to automatically copy login credentials from an old router simply by connecting it, eliminating the need for manual configuration and making installation quick and hassle-free.</p><p>The Tenda AC8 also integrates smart dual-band management, combining both frequencies under a single WiFi name. Devices are automatically directed to the most suitable band for optimal speed and performance without user intervention.</p><p>With its powerful hardware, smart optimization features, and high-speed connectivity, the Tenda AC8 AC1200 Gigabit Router is a reliable and future-ready solution for users who need fast and stable internet for multiple devices and demanding applications.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>2.4GHz: 300Mbps<br>5GHz: 867Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4*6dBi external dual-band antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1*WPS/ Reset button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4GHz &amp; 5GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>IEEE 802.11ac/a/n @5GHz<br>IEEE 802.11b/g/n @2.4GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1*10/100/1000Mbps WAN port<br>3*10/100/1000Mbps LAN ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE802.3, IEEE802.3u, IEEE802.3ab</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK, WPA/WPA2<br>Wireless Security : Enable/ Disable</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Operating ModeWireless:<br>-Router Mode<br>-AP Mode<br>-Universal Repeater mode<br>-WISP Mode</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Input：AC 100-240V—50/60Hz<br>Output：DC 9V 1A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>200x127x33.6mm</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 Year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual-Band Gigabit', 2599.97, 2700.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/24GkETtzSELIgBS5TZiolg0EX8lpbcDH6wLbdjNP.png', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 07:06:19', '2026-05-25 07:06:19', 'Tenda AC8 AC1200 Gigabit Dual-Band WiFi Router | Smart Home Router BD', 'Buy Tenda AC8 AC1200 Dual-Band Gigabit Smart WiFi Router in Bangladesh. Enjoy fast 1167Mbps speed, Gigabit ports, Beamforming, and smart auto-optimization features.', 'Tenda AC8, AC1200 Gigabit Router, Dual Band WiFi Router, Smart WiFi Router BD, Tenda Gigabit Router, Beamforming Router, Home WiFi Router Bangladesh, 1167Mbps Router, Fiber Internet Router, Tenda Router BD', NULL, 207, NULL, NULL),
(145, 'AC10 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi Router Tenda', 'The Tenda AC10 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi Router is a high-performance home router featuring 802.11ac Wave 2 technology, a powerful 1GHz processor, and Gigabit ports. With speeds up to 1200Mbps, it delivers smooth HD streaming, online gaming, and stable multi-device connectivity.', 'ac10-ac1200-dual-band-gigabit-wifi-router-tenda-1779693008', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Tenda AC10 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi Router</strong> is a next-generation networking solution designed for high-speed internet users who demand stable performance, wide coverage, and efficient multi-device handling. Built with 802.11ac Wave 2.0 WiFi technology, it ensures fast and reliable wireless connectivity for modern homes and small offices.</p><p>Powered by a 1GHz high-performance CPU and 128MB DDR3 memory, the AC10 is capable of handling heavy network traffic with ease. This powerful hardware combination ensures smooth data processing, reduced latency, and stable performance even when multiple devices are connected simultaneously.</p><p>The router delivers dual-band WiFi speeds of up to 1167Mbps in total. The 2.4GHz band provides up to 300Mbps for everyday activities such as browsing, social media, and email, while the 5GHz band delivers up to 867Mbps for bandwidth-intensive tasks like HD/4K streaming, online gaming, and large file downloads. This dual-band structure ensures optimized performance for all connected devices.</p><p>Equipped with four high-gain external antennas, the Tenda AC10 significantly improves wireless signal strength and coverage. These antennas help reduce dead zones and ensure stable connectivity throughout your home or office, even through walls and obstacles.</p><p>The AC10 also features Gigabit Ethernet ports, allowing users to take full advantage of high-speed fiber broadband connections without bottlenecks. This makes it an ideal choice for users with high-speed internet plans who want maximum wired and wireless performance.</p><p>With support for 802.11ac Wave 2 MU-MIMO technology, the router can communicate with multiple devices simultaneously, improving network efficiency and reducing congestion. This ensures smooth performance even in environments with many connected smartphones, laptops, smart TVs, and IoT devices.</p><p>Designed with user convenience in mind, the Tenda AC10 is easy to set up and manage through a simple web interface or mobile app. It provides stable, secure, and high-speed connectivity suitable for both work and entertainment environments.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4*6dBi External Dual Band Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1*WiFi On/Off button<br>1*Reset/WPS button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>5GHz: Up to 867Mbps<br>2.4GHz: Up to 300Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Wireless Standards:IEEE 802.11ac/n/a 5GHz<br>IEEE 802.11n/g/b 2.4GHz<br>Wired Standards:IEEE 802.3, IEEE 802.3u</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>3*GE LAN Ports<br>1*GE WAN Port</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA-PSK, WPA2-PSK, WPA/WPA2<br>Wireless Security: Enable/Disable<br>WPS Fast Encryption</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Bandwidth Control<br>MAC Address Filter<br>IP and MAC Address Binding<br>IPTV<br>Black/White List<br>MAC Clone<br>Static Routing<br>System Log<br>Network Time<br>Backup/Restore Settings<br>System Upgrade Online</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Power Input: 100-240V—50/60Hz<br>Power Output: DC 12V==2A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>Package Box: 390*198*70mm（L*W*H)<br>Device: 220*141.5*49mm（L*W*H)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>Gross Weight: 810g<br>Net Weight: 350g</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band Gigabit', 3100.00, 3050.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/4zmTBFz827gF9iuwyBH2DR52Tr2AIvq65yWS7uMF.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 07:10:08', '2026-05-25 07:10:08', 'Tenda AC10 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi Router | High Speed Home Router BD', 'Buy Tenda AC10 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi Router in Bangladesh. Enjoy 1167Mbps speed, Gigabit ports, MU-MIMO support, and stable high-performance wireless coverage.', 'Tenda AC10, AC1200 Router, Gigabit WiFi Router, Dual Band Router BD, Tenda AC10 Router Bangladesh, 1167Mbps WiFi Router, Home WiFi Router, MU-MIMO Router, Tenda Gigabit Router, Wireless Router BD', NULL, 207, NULL, NULL),
(146, 'Nova MX3 AX1500 Dual Band WiFi 6 Mesh Router Tenda (1 Pack)', 'The Tenda Nova MX3 AX1500 Dual Band WiFi 6 Mesh Router (1 Pack) is a powerful WiFi 6 mesh solution designed for seamless whole-home coverage. With AX1500 speeds, OFDMA, MU-MIMO, Beamforming, and Gigabit ports, it delivers fast, stable, and low-latency connectivity for multiple smart devices.', 'nova-mx3-ax1500-dual-band-wifi-6-mesh-router-tenda-1-pack-1779693269', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Tenda Nova MX3 AX1500 Dual Band WiFi 6 Mesh Router (1 Pack)</strong> is a next-generation mesh networking solution designed to provide fast, stable, and uninterrupted wireless coverage throughout your home or office. Powered by WiFi 6 technology, it ensures improved speed, capacity, and efficiency for modern connected environments.</p><p>This router delivers dual-band speeds of up to 1500Mbps, with 300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band for everyday browsing and IoT devices, and 1201Mbps on the 5GHz band for high-performance tasks such as 4K streaming, online gaming, and video conferencing. With support for IEEE 802.11ax/ac/n/a/b/g standards, it ensures broad compatibility with both old and new devices.</p><p>Equipped with a 1GHz processor and 128MB RAM, the MX3 provides smooth multitasking and stable performance even under heavy network load. It supports up to 30 connected devices, making it suitable for smart homes filled with smartphones, laptops, smart TVs, and IoT devices.</p><p>The Tenda Nova MX3 features advanced WiFi 6 technologies including OFDMA and MU-MIMO, which allow multiple devices to communicate simultaneously with reduced latency and improved efficiency. Beamforming technology further enhances signal strength by directing WiFi signals toward connected devices for stronger and more reliable coverage.</p><p>For wired connectivity, the router includes one Gigabit WAN port and one Gigabit LAN port, ensuring high-speed wired performance for devices like gaming consoles, PCs, and smart TVs.</p><p>Security is strengthened with WPA3-SAE and WPA2-PSK encryption standards, offering advanced protection against unauthorized access. Additional security features include firewall protection, VPN support (IPsec, PPTP, L2TP pass-through), and parental controls for managing internet access and content filtering.</p><p>The MX3 supports multiple internet connection types such as PPPoE, Dynamic IP, Static IP, PPTP, and L2TP, ensuring compatibility with most ISPs. It also offers flexible operating modes including Router Mode and Access Point Mode.</p><p>With Tenda’s EasyMesh technology, the MX3 can easily integrate into a larger mesh system, providing seamless roaming with a single unified network name. This ensures uninterrupted connectivity as users move between rooms.</p><p>The router also includes smart features such as Alexa support, smart LED control, remote management via the Tenda app, speed testing, guest network creation, and firmware auto-updates. Advanced network tools like DHCP management, port forwarding, UPnP, DMZ, and IPTV support further enhance usability and customization.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>5GHz:1201Mbps<br>2.4GHz:300Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2 x 3dBi Internal antenna</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1 x Reset Button<br>1 x MESH Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>Dual Band (2.4GHz &amp; 5GHz)</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.3, IEEE 802.3u, IEEE 802.4ab<br>2.4GHz：IEEE 802.11n/b/g<br>5GHz：IEEE 802.11ax/ac/n/a</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA2-PSK<br>WPA3-SAE/WPA2-PSK<br>Wireless Encryption Disable and Enable<br>WPS Fast Connection</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>10/100/1000Mbps WAN port*1<br>10/100/1000Mbps LAN port*1</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>OFDMA<br>MU-MIMO<br>Beamforming<br>Network Protocol: IPv4&amp;IPv6<br>Operating Mode: Router Mode,AP Mode<br>Parental Control: URL Filter, Time Limit<br>DHCP: DHCP Server, DHCP Client List, DHCP Reservation<br>Virtual Server: Port Forwarding, DMZ Host, UPnP<br>Firewall:<br>Forbid UDP Flood Attack<br>Forbid TCP Flood Attack<br>Forbid ICMP Flood Attack<br>Forbid WAN Ping from Internet<br>VPN:<br>IPsec Pass Through<br>PPTP Pass Through<br>L2TP Pass Through<br>PPTP VPN Server<br>PPTP VPN Client<br>L2TP VPN Client<br>DNS: DynDNS, no-ip, oray, 88ip<br>Special Features:<br>WPA3<br>TR069<br>Tenda EasyMesh<br>Unify 2.4 GHz &amp; 5 GHz<br>Smart LED on/off<br>Amazon Alexa<br>One-button Fault Diagnosis<br>Broadband Account Migration<br>Tenda App: Local and Remote ManagementSpeed Test<br>Monthly Report<br>Other Function:<br>IPTV<br>IPv6<br>Guest Network<br>System Log<br>Remote Web Management<br>MAC Clone<br>Backup &amp; Restore configurations<br>Support automatic access detection<br>Firmware upgrade online</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Input: AC 100-240V~50/60Hz<br>Output:DC 12V⎓1A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>90*90*93 mm (3.54*3.54*3.65 in.)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band', 3000.00, 3100.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/4X40UwyEgkMBWnSiDY2RtEWYNwrYfxRxZ04RNJW5.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 07:14:29', '2026-05-25 07:14:29', 'Tenda Nova MX3 AX1500 WiFi 6 Mesh Router (1 Pack) | Dual Band Smart Mesh BD', 'Buy Tenda Nova MX3 AX1500 WiFi 6 Mesh Router (1 Pack) in Bangladesh. Enjoy fast AX1500 speed, WPA3 security, OFDMA, MU-MIMO, and seamless whole-home mesh coverage.', 'Tenda Nova MX3, AX1500 Mesh Router, WiFi 6 Mesh System, Dual Band Mesh Router BD, Tenda Mesh Router Bangladesh, Smart WiFi 6 Router, Home Mesh WiFi, Gigabit Mesh Router, OFDMA MU-MIMO Router, Tenda Router BD', NULL, 207, NULL, NULL),
(147, 'TX2L Pro AX1500 Dual-Band Gigabit Wi-Fi 6 Tenda  Router', 'The Tenda TX2L Pro AX1500 Dual-Band WiFi 6 Gigabit Router is an entry-level WiFi 6 router designed for fast, stable, and efficient home internet. With AX1500 speeds, OFDMA, MU-MIMO, and 5 high-gain antennas, it delivers strong coverage and smooth performance for streaming, gaming, and multi-device usage.', 'tx2l-pro-ax1500-dual-band-gigabit-wi-fi-6-tenda-router-1779693518', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Tenda TX2L Pro AX1500 Dual-Band Gigabit WiFi 6 Router</strong> is a modern entry-level networking solution built to deliver faster, more stable, and more efficient wireless performance for home users. Powered by WiFi 6 (802.11ax) technology, it significantly improves speed, capacity, and responsiveness compared to previous WiFi generations.</p><p>This router offers a combined wireless speed of up to 1501Mbps, with 1201Mbps on the 5GHz band for high-bandwidth activities like 4K streaming, online gaming, and video conferencing, and 300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band for everyday tasks such as browsing, social media, and smart home device connectivity. This dual-band setup ensures balanced performance across all connected devices.</p><p>Equipped with five high-gain antennas and dual signal enhancement modules, the TX2L Pro provides expanded wireless coverage and stronger signal penetration through walls and obstacles. This helps maintain stable connectivity across larger homes or multi-room environments.</p><p>The router integrates advanced WiFi 6 technologies such as OFDMA and MU-MIMO, allowing multiple devices to communicate simultaneously without congestion. This improves overall network efficiency, reduces latency, and ensures smoother performance even in busy network environments.</p><p>With Tenda Wi-Fi+ technology, the TX2L Pro can work seamlessly with other compatible Tenda devices to form a unified network, ensuring smooth roaming and uninterrupted connectivity across multiple access points.</p><p>The Gigabit Ethernet ports ensure high-speed wired connections for devices like PCs, smart TVs, and gaming consoles, making full use of high-speed broadband connections without bottlenecks.</p><p>Designed for modern smart homes, the Tenda TX2L Pro delivers a stable, efficient, and future-ready networking experience with improved coverage, faster speeds, and enhanced multi-device support.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>5GHz: Up to 1201Mbps<br>2.4GHz: Up to 300Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>5x External Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS/Reset Button x1</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4 GHz &amp; 5 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1x 10/100/1000Mbps WAN Port<br>3x 10/100/1000Mbps LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE802.3, IEEE802.3u, IEEE802.3ab<br>Protocol: IPv4&amp;IPv6</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA2-PSK,WPA3-SAE,WPA3-SAE/WPA2-PSK<br>Wireless Encryption Disable and Enable<br>WPS Fast Connection</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>1x WAN Port<br>3x LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Smart Power Saving<br>Bandwidth Control<br>Guest Network<br>System Log<br>MAC Clone<br>Broadband Account Migration<br>Tenda App（Parental Control）<br>Backup &amp; Restore Configurations<br>Support Automatic Access Detection<br>Upgrade Online<br>OFDMA+MU-MIMO<br>Beamforming Signal Directional Transmission Technology</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Input: AC 100-240V~50/60Hz<br>Output: DC 12V1A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual-Band Gigabit', 3200.00, 3300.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/tYbHuhVaK9vhAEOGKnMBvegTfQf7y9OMA68gHCfU.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 07:18:38', '2026-05-25 07:18:38', 'Tenda TX2L Pro AX1500 WiFi 6 Gigabit Router | Dual Band Home Router BD', 'Buy Tenda TX2L Pro AX1500 Dual-Band WiFi 6 Router in Bangladesh. Enjoy fast 1501Mbps speed, Gigabit ports, OFDMA, MU-MIMO, and wide coverage for stable home internet.', 'Tenda TX2L Pro, AX1500 Router, WiFi 6 Router BD, Dual Band Gigabit Router, Tenda WiFi Router Bangladesh, Home WiFi Router, OFDMA MU-MIMO Router, 1500Mbps Router, Tenda Gigabit Router, Wireless Router BD', NULL, 207, NULL, NULL),
(148, 'TX12 Pro v2.0 AX3000 Dual Band Gigabit Wi-Fi 6  Tenda Router', 'The Tenda TX12 Pro v2.0 AX3000 Dual Band Gigabit Wi-Fi 6 Router is a powerful next-generation networking solution designed to meet the demands of modern high-speed internet users. Built with the latest WiFi 6 (802.11ax) technology, it significantly improves speed, capacity, and efficiency for homes and small offices with multiple connected devices.', 'tx12-pro-v20-ax3000-dual-band-gigabit-wi-fi-6-tenda-router-1779693787', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>This router delivers combined wireless speeds of up to 3000Mbps, offering 2402Mbps on the 5GHz band for high-bandwidth activities such as 4K/8K streaming, online gaming, and video conferencing, and 574Mbps on the 2.4GHz band for everyday browsing and smart home device connectivity. This dual-band system ensures optimized performance and reduced network congestion.</p><p>Equipped with five high-gain external antennas, the TX12 Pro v2.0 provides wide wireless coverage and strong signal penetration through walls and obstacles. Beamforming technology further enhances performance by directing WiFi signals toward connected devices, ensuring stable and efficient connections across your home.</p><p>Advanced WiFi 6 technologies such as MU-MIMO, OFDMA, and 1024-QAM modulation allow multiple devices to communicate simultaneously with minimal latency. The inclusion of 160MHz bandwidth support further boosts data throughput, making it ideal for high-speed fiber internet connections.</p><p>For wired connectivity, the router features three Gigabit LAN ports and one Gigabit WAN port, ensuring full-speed wired performance for gaming consoles, PCs, and smart TVs without bottlenecks.</p><p>Security is enhanced with WPA3-SAE, WPA2-PSK, and WPS encryption methods, along with advanced firewall protection against ICMP, TCP, and UDP flood attacks. Additional security and control features include parental controls, guest networks, SSID hiding, and client filtering.</p><p>The TX12 Pro v2.0 supports multiple internet connection types including PPPoE, Dynamic IP, Static IP, PPTP, and L2TP, ensuring compatibility with most ISPs. It also supports IPv6 for future-ready networking.</p><p>Advanced features include IPTV support, VPN compatibility (PPTP, L2TP, IPSec), mesh WiFi support, bandwidth control, smart diagnosis, static routing, and remote web/app management. Users can also enjoy features like port forwarding, DMZ hosting, and online firmware upgrades.</p><p>With its sleek design, intelligent LED controls, and powerful performance capabilities, the Tenda TX12 Pro v2.0 is an excellent choice for users who need fast, secure, and reliable wireless connectivity for demanding digital environments.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>5 GHz: 2402 Mbps (802.11ax, HE160)<br>2.4 GHz: 574 Mbps (802.11ax)</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>5*6dbi external antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1*WPS/Mesh button<br>1*Reset button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>Dual Band (2.4GHz &amp; 5GHz)</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1× Gigabit WAN Port<br>3× Gigabit LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE802.3, IEEE802.3u, IEEE802.3ab</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA2-PSK<br>WPA3-SAE/WPA2-PSK<br>Wireless Security: Enable/Disable<br>WPS(WiFi Protected Set-up) fast encryption</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Internet Connection Type:<br>PPPoE, Dynamic IP, Static IP<br>PPPoE(Russia), PPTP(Russia), L2TP(Russia)<br>Unify,Maxis,Maxis-special,Celcom,Digi<br>Network Protocol: IPv4&amp;IPv6<br>Operating Mode:<br>Router Mode<br>AP Mode<br>Universal Repeater Mode（Client+AP,WISP）<br>Parental Control:<br>Client Filter<br>URL Filter<br>Time Limit<br>DHCP:<br>DHCP Server<br>DHCP Client List<br>DHCP Static IP Address Reservation and Allocation<br>Virtual Server: Port Forwarding, DMZ Host, UPnP<br>Firewall:<br>ICMP Flood Attack Defense<br>TCP Flood Attack Defense<br>UDP Flood Attack Defense<br>Block Ping From WAN<br>DDNS: DynDNS, no-ip, oray, 88ip<br>VPN:<br>IPSec Transparent Transmission<br>PPTP Transparent Transmission<br>L2TP Transparent Transmission<br>PPTP VPN Server<br>PPTP VPN Client<br>L2TP VPN Client<br>Special Features:<br>Wi-Fi+(Mesh System)<br>Smart diagnosis<br>IPTV<br>IPv6<br>Smart LED on/off<br>Other Function:<br>Support App and web management<br>Bandwidth Control<br>Guest Network<br>MAC Address Clone<br>Supports black list and white list<br>Unify 2.4 GHz &amp; 5 GHz<br>Static Routing<br>Remote Web Management<br>Backup &amp; Restore configurations<br>Firmware upgrade online</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>(L*W*H)267*166*222 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01 Year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band Gigabit', 4100.00, 4100.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/CfgOHk9OfPxEWgLMQLaeU4aPkVJlnRKkB97fr3Uo.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 07:23:07', '2026-05-25 07:24:11', 'Tenda TX12 Pro v2.0 AX3000 WiFi 6 Gigabit Router | High Speed Router BD', 'Buy Tenda TX12 Pro v2.0 AX3000 Dual Band WiFi 6 Router in Bangladesh. Enjoy 3000Mbps speed, Gigabit ports, MU-MIMO, OFDMA, WPA3 security, and strong coverage.', 'Tenda TX12 Pro, AX3000 Router, WiFi 6 Gigabit Router, Dual Band Router BD, Tenda Router Bangladesh, High Speed WiFi Router, MU-MIMO OFDMA Router, 3000Mbps Router, Home WiFi Router BD, Tenda Gigabit Router', NULL, 207, NULL, NULL),
(149, 'TX3000 Pro AX3000 Dual Band Gigabit Wi-Fi 6Tenda Router', 'The Tenda TX3000 Pro AX3000 Dual Band Gigabit Wi-Fi 6 Router is a high-performance networking device designed for ultra-fast and stable internet. With AX3000 speeds, WiFi 6 technology, six high-gain antennas, MU-MIMO, Beamforming, and OFDMA, it ensures smooth 4K streaming, gaming, and multi-device connectivity.', 'tx3000-pro-ax3000-dual-band-gigabit-wi-fi-6tenda-router-1779694086', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Tenda TX3000 Pro AX3000 Dual Band Gigabit Wi-Fi 6 Router</strong> is a powerful next-generation router built to deliver high-speed, stable, and efficient wireless performance for modern homes and small office environments. Powered by WiFi 6 (802.11ax) technology, it significantly improves network capacity, speed, and responsiveness, making it ideal for heavy internet usage.</p><p>This router offers a combined wireless speed of up to 3000Mbps, with 2402Mbps on the 5GHz band for high-bandwidth tasks such as 4K/8K streaming, online gaming, and video conferencing, and 574Mbps on the 2.4GHz band for everyday browsing and smart device connectivity. This dual-band structure ensures balanced performance and reduced congestion across all connected devices.</p><p>Equipped with six external 6dBi high-gain antennas, the TX3000 Pro provides extended wireless coverage and stronger signal penetration through walls and obstacles. Beamforming technology further enhances performance by directing WiFi signals toward connected devices for improved stability and range.</p><p>Advanced WiFi 6 features such as MU-MIMO, OFDMA, and 1024-QAM modulation significantly increase efficiency by allowing multiple devices to communicate simultaneously with reduced latency. The inclusion of 160MHz bandwidth support ensures faster data transmission and improved overall network performance.</p><p>For wired connectivity, the router includes three Gigabit LAN ports and one Gigabit WAN port, enabling full-speed connections for gaming consoles, PCs, and smart TVs without bottlenecks. This makes it suitable for high-speed fiber broadband environments.</p><p>The TX3000 Pro supports multiple internet connection types, including Dynamic IP, Static IP, PPPoE, PPTP, and L2TP, ensuring compatibility with a wide range of ISPs. It also supports IPv6 for future-ready networking.</p><p>Security is enhanced with WPA3-SAE and WPA2-PSK encryption, along with WPS fast encryption and the ability to enable or disable wireless security as needed. Additional protection includes firewall defenses against ICMP, TCP, and UDP flood attacks.</p><p>Advanced networking features include parental controls (URL filtering, time scheduling, and client filtering), guest network support, bandwidth control, port forwarding, DMZ hosting, UPnP, DHCP management, and DDNS support (DynDNS and No-IP).</p><p>The router also supports mesh networking, smart diagnosis, remote management, and both app-based and web-based control for easy configuration. Online firmware upgrades and static routing ensure long-term performance and flexibility.</p><p>With its powerful hardware, advanced WiFi 6 features, and comprehensive control options, the Tenda TX3000 Pro is an excellent choice for users seeking a reliable, high-speed, and future-ready networking solution.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>5 GHz: 2402 Mbps (802.11ax, HE160)<br>2.4 GHz: 574 Mbps (802.11ax)</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>6*6dbi external antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1*WPS/Mesh button<br>1*Reset button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>Dual Band (2.4GHz &amp; 5GHz)</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1*10/100/1000Mbps WAN port<br>3*10/100/1000Mbps LAN ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE802.3, IEEE802.3u, IEEE802.3ab</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA2-PSK<br>WPA3-SAE/WPA2-PSK<br>Wireless Security: Enable/Disable<br>WPS(WiFi Protected Set-up) fast encryption</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Internet Connection Type:<br>PPPoE, Dynamic IP, Static IP<br>PPPoE(Russia), PPTP(Russia), L2TP(Russia)<br>Unify,Maxis,Maxis-special,Celcom,Digi<br>Network Protocol: IPv4&amp;IPv6<br>Operating Mode:<br>Router Mode<br>AP Mode<br>Universal Repeater Mode（Client+AP,WISP）<br>Parental Control:<br>Client Filter<br>URL Filter<br>Time Limit<br>DHCP:<br>DHCP Server<br>DHCP Client List<br>DHCP Static IP Address Reservation and Allocation<br>Virtual Server: Port Forwarding, DMZ Host, UPnP<br>Firewall:<br>ICMP Flood Attack Defense<br>TCP Flood Attack Defense<br>UDP Flood Attack Defense<br>Block Ping From WAN<br>DDNS: DynDNS, no-ip, oray, 88ip<br>VPN:<br>IPSec Transparent Transmission<br>PPTP Transparent Transmission<br>L2TP Transparent Transmission<br>PPTP VPN Server<br>PPTP VPN Client<br>L2TP VPN Client<br>Special Features:<br>Wi-Fi+(Mesh System)<br>Smart diagnosis<br>IPTV<br>IPv6<br>Smart LED on/off<br>Other Function:<br>Support App and web management<br>Bandwidth Control<br>Guest Network<br>MAC Address Clone<br>Supports black list and white list<br>Unify 2.4 GHz &amp; 5 GHz<br>Static Routing<br>Remote Web Management<br>Backup &amp; Restore configurations<br>Firmware upgrade online</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Input：AC 100-240V~50/60Hz<br>Output:DC 12V⎓1A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>(L*W*H)272.44*162.85*43.71</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01 Year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band Gigabit', 4100.00, 4200.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/A72QodLRL3OnoNC4pe3hSJWaIigcGw7HuRAITD69.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 07:28:07', '2026-05-25 07:28:07', 'Tenda TX3000 Pro AX3000 WiFi 6 Gigabit Router | Dual Band High Speed Router BD', 'Buy Tenda TX3000 Pro AX3000 Dual Band WiFi 6 Router in Bangladesh. Enjoy 3000Mbps speed, 6 antennas, MU-MIMO, OFDMA, WPA3 security, and strong coverage.', 'Tenda TX3000 Pro, AX3000 Router, WiFi 6 Gigabit Router, Dual Band Router BD, Tenda Router Bangladesh, High Speed WiFi Router, MU-MIMO OFDMA Router, 3000Mbps Router, Mesh WiFi Router, Tenda Gigabit Router', NULL, 207, NULL, NULL),
(150, 'Nova MW3 AC1200 Dual Band Mesh Tenda  Router (2 Pack)', 'The Tenda Nova MW3 AC1200 is a dual-band mesh WiFi system delivering up to 1200Mbps speed with seamless whole-home coverage. Designed for homes up to 300m², it eliminates dead zones using intelligent mesh technology, MU-MIMO, and smart roaming for stable, uninterrupted internet.', 'nova-mw3-ac1200-dual-band-mesh-tenda-router-2-pack-1779694383', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Tenda Nova MW3 AC1200 Home Mesh WiFi System is a powerful and reliable networking solution designed to deliver seamless wireless coverage across medium to large homes ranging from 100 to 300 square meters. With a combined speed of up to 1200Mbps, this dual-band system ensures smooth browsing, 4K streaming, online gaming, and video conferencing without interruption.</p><p>Built with advanced mesh technology, MW3 creates a unified WiFi network that eliminates dead zones and provides consistent connectivity in every corner of your home. Whether you choose a 2-pack (up to 200m² coverage) or a 3-pack (up to 300m² coverage), the system ensures strong and stable internet throughout your space.</p><p>The device supports IEEE 802.11v and IEEE 802.11r standards for seamless roaming, allowing your devices to automatically switch between nodes without disconnecting. Thanks to MU-MIMO technology, multiple devices can connect simultaneously without reducing speed or performance.</p><p>Smart QoS (Quality of Service) intelligently prioritizes bandwidth for streaming, gaming, downloading, and video calls, ensuring optimal performance for all users. A single SSID and password allow smooth handover between nodes, while the Tenda WiFi App provides easy setup, network control, parental controls, guest network options, and the ability to block unwanted users instantly.</p><p>The system comes pre-paired from the factory, making installation quick and hassle-free—no complex wiring required.</p><p>Available at <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted source for reliable networking and IT products.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Main Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2*3dBi internal dual band antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1 x reset button</td></tr><tr><td>CPU</td><td>IEEE802.3, IEEE802.3u</td></tr><tr><td>Temperature</td><td>Operating Temperature: 0℃ ~ 40℃<br>Storage Temperature: -40℃ ~ 70℃</td></tr><tr><td>Dimensions</td><td>90 x 90 x 90mm</td></tr><tr><td>Architecture</td><td>2 Ethernet ports per mesh node<br>WAN and LAN on primary mesh node<br>Both act as LAN ports on additional mesh nodes</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power consumption</td><td>Input：100-240V—50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Network</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Wireless Rate</td><td>5GHz: Up to 867Mbps<br>2.4GHz: Up to 300Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless frequency</td><td>Simultaneous dual band 2.4GHz &amp; 5GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless standards</td><td>IEEE 802.11ac/a/n 5GHz<br>IEEE 802.11b/g/n 2.4GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Ethernet</td><td>2 Ethernet ports per mesh node</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless Security</td><td>Mixed WPA/WPA2-PSK(default)</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Parental Control<br>Guest Network<br>Firmware upgrade online<br>Reset to factory settings</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band Mesh', 4100.00, 4200.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/TKVZgreTM7n74U4OnY8j7cnPTXmektJ8t6Q2HHgl.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 07:33:03', '2026-05-25 07:33:03', 'Tenda Nova MW3 AC1200 Mesh WiFi System | 1200Mbps Whole Home Coverage – International Office Solution', 'Buy Tenda Nova MW3 AC1200 Mesh WiFi System for seamless whole-home coverage up to 300m². Enjoy 1200Mbps speed, MU-MIMO, and easy setup. Available at International Office Solution.', 'Tenda Nova MW3, MW3 AC1200, mesh WiFi system, dual band router, 1200Mbps router, whole home WiFi, WiFi mesh system Bangladesh, International Office Solution router, best mesh WiFi, Tenda mesh router, home WiFi coverage, WiFi dead zone remover', NULL, 207, NULL, NULL),
(151, 'Nova MX12 AX3000 Dual Band WiFi 6 Mesh Tenda  Router (1 Pack)', 'The Tenda Nova MX12 AX3000 WiFi 6 Mesh Router delivers ultra-fast dual-band speeds up to 2976Mbps, supporting 40+ devices with stable, seamless connectivity. Ideal for smart homes and offices, it features WPA3 security, MU-MIMO, OFDMA, and Gigabit ports for high-performance networking.', 'nova-mx12-ax3000-dual-band-wifi-6-mesh-tenda-router-1-pack-1779694708', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Tenda Nova MX12 AX3000 Dual Band WiFi 6 Mesh Router is a next-generation networking solution designed to deliver ultra-fast, stable, and intelligent wireless coverage for modern homes and offices. With advanced WiFi 6 technology, it provides combined wireless speeds of up to 2976Mbps—574Mbps on the 2.4GHz band and 2402Mbps on the 5GHz band—ensuring smoother streaming, lag-free gaming, and efficient multitasking.</p><p>Engineered to support more than 40 connected devices simultaneously, the MX12 is powered by a 1.7GHz quad-core processor and 256MB RAM, allowing it to handle heavy network traffic with ease while maintaining low latency performance.</p><p>With coverage of up to 1200–1500 square feet per node, the system uses four high-performance internal antennas, beamforming technology, MU-MIMO, and OFDMA to enhance signal strength and ensure consistent coverage in every corner of your space. Seamless roaming technologies like AP Steering, Band Steering, and Fast Roaming automatically connect devices to the strongest signal without interruption.</p><p>For wired performance, each node is equipped with three Gigabit Ethernet ports supporting high-speed connections and Ethernet backhaul for maximum stability. The router also ensures top-level protection with WPA3-SAE and WPA2-PSK encryption, along with firewall protection against TCP/UDP flood attacks.</p><p>It supports multiple internet connection types including PPPoE, Dynamic IP, Static IP, PPTP, and L2TP, as well as IPv4 and IPv6 protocols. Additional features include parental controls (URL filtering, time scheduling), guest network setup, VPN support, IPTV compatibility, firmware upgrades, and full app/web-based management.</p><p>Built with reliability in mind, the Tenda Nova MX12 operates efficiently between 0℃ to 40℃ and holds CE, FCC, and RoHS certifications.</p><p>&nbsp;Available now at <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted destination for high-quality networking products in Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>2.4GHz: 574Mbps (802.11ax)<br>5GHz: 2402Mbps (802.11ax)</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4 x 3dBi Internal antenna</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1 x Reset Button<br>1 x MESH Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>Dual Band (2.4GHz &amp; 5GHz)</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.3, IEEE 802.3u, IEEE 802.3ab<br>5GHz: IEEE 802.11ax/ac/n/a<br>2.4GHz: IEEE 802.11ax/n/b/g</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA3-SAE/WPA2-PSK</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>3 x 10/100/1000Mbps RJ45 ports</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>LED Indicator: 1 x Tri-color LED Indicator(Green,Yellow,Red)<br>Basic Functions: Beam Forming, MU-MIMO, AP Steering, Band Steering, OFDMA, 1024-QAM<br>Internet Connection Type: PPPoE, Dynamic IP, Static IP, PPPoE(Russia), PPTP(Russia), L2TP(Russia)<br>Network Protocol: IPv4&amp;IPv6<br>Operating Mode: Router Mode,AP Mode<br>Parental Control: Client Filter, URL Filter, Time Limit<br>DHCP: DHCP Server, DHCP Client List<br>Virtual Server: Port Forwarding, DMZ Host, UPnP<br>Firewall: Forbid TCP/UDP flood attack<br>VPN: PPTP Server, PPTP/L2TP Client<br>DNS: Support manually setting DNS server<br>Special Features: Ethernet Backhaul, IPv6, IPTV<br>Other Function: Support App and web management, Guest Network, Firmware upgrade online</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Input: AC 100-240V, 50/60Hz<br>Output: DC 12 V ⎓ 1.5 A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>86x86x190mm (3.39 x3.39 x 7.48 in)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band', 5100.00, 5100.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/Z2rTEKO9jLjcUsFcmbcIugmozTsN2KTcivcjITYT.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 07:38:28', '2026-05-25 07:38:28', 'Tenda Nova MX12 AX3000 WiFi 6 Mesh Router | Dual Band Gigabit Router – International Office Solution', 'Buy Tenda Nova MX12 AX3000 WiFi 6 Mesh Router with speeds up to 2976Mbps, WPA3 security, MU-MIMO & seamless mesh coverage. Available at International Office Solution Bangladesh.', 'Tenda Nova MX12, AX3000 mesh router, WiFi 6 router, dual band mesh system, 2976Mbps router, gigabit mesh WiFi, WPA3 router, MU-MIMO router, home WiFi system, mesh WiFi Bangladesh, International Office Solution, Tenda router MX12', NULL, 207, NULL, NULL);
