(152, 'Tenda Nova MX3 AX1500 Dual Band WiFi 6 Mesh Router (2 Pack)', 'The Tenda Nova MX3 AX1500 WiFi 6 Mesh Router (2 Pack) delivers up to 1501Mbps combined speed with support for 30+ devices. Designed for smart homes, it ensures stable coverage using MU-MIMO, OFDMA, Beamforming, and seamless roaming technology.', 'tenda-nova-mx3-ax1500-dual-band-wifi-6-mesh-router-2-pack-1779694893', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Tenda Nova MX3 AX1500 Dual Band WiFi 6 Mesh Router (2 Pack) is a reliable and high-performance networking solution designed for modern smart homes. Powered by WiFi 6 technology, it delivers combined speeds of up to 1501Mbps—300Mbps on 2.4GHz and 1201Mbps on 5GHz—ensuring smooth streaming, gaming, and browsing experiences across multiple devices.</p><p>Equipped with a 1GHz processor and 128MB RAM, the MX3 efficiently manages network traffic while maintaining stable performance. It supports up to 30 connected devices simultaneously, making it ideal for families and small offices.</p><p>Each unit includes one Gigabit WAN port and one Gigabit LAN port for high-speed wired connections. The dual internal 3dBi antennas provide strong and stable wireless coverage across both frequency bands.</p><p>Advanced technologies such as MU-MIMO, OFDMA, and Beamforming enhance efficiency by reducing latency and improving overall network performance. The system also supports seamless roaming, ensuring uninterrupted connectivity as users move between rooms.</p><p>Security is strengthened with WPA3-SAE and WPA2-PSK encryption, along with firewall protection, parental controls, and guest network management. It supports multiple internet connection types including PPPoE, Dynamic IP, Static IP, PPTP, and L2TP, as well as IPv4/IPv6 compatibility.</p><p>Additional smart features include EasyMesh support, Smart LED control, Alexa compatibility, IPTV support, remote management, speed testing, firmware updates, and one-click network diagnostics.</p><p>Available now at <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted source for reliable networking products in Bangladesh.</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>5GHz:1201Mbps<br>2.4GHz:300Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2 x 3dBi Internal antenna</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1 x Reset Button<br>1 x MESH Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>Dual Band (2.4GHz &amp; 5GHz)</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.3, IEEE 802.3u, IEEE 802.4ab<br>2.4GHz：IEEE 802.11n/b/g<br>5GHz：IEEE 802.11ax/ac/n/a</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA2-PSK<br>WPA3-SAE/WPA2-PSK<br>Wireless Encryption Disable and Enable<br>WPS Fast Connection</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>10/100/1000Mbps WAN port*1<br>10/100/1000Mbps LAN port*1</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>OFDMA<br>MU-MIMO<br>Beamforming<br>Network Protocol: IPv4&amp;IPv6<br>Operating Mode: Router Mode,AP Mode<br>Parental Control: URL Filter, Time Limit<br>DHCP: DHCP Server, DHCP Client List, DHCP Reservation<br>Virtual Server: Port Forwarding, DMZ Host, UPnP<br>Firewall:<br>Forbid UDP Flood Attack<br>Forbid TCP Flood Attack<br>Forbid ICMP Flood Attack<br>Forbid WAN Ping from Internet<br>VPN:<br>IPsec Pass Through<br>PPTP Pass Through<br>L2TP Pass Through<br>PPTP VPN Server<br>PPTP VPN Client<br>L2TP VPN Client<br>DNS: DynDNS, no-ip, oray, 88ip<br>Special Features:<br>WPA3<br>TR069<br>Tenda EasyMesh<br>Unify 2.4 GHz &amp; 5 GHz<br>Smart LED on/off<br>Amazon Alexa<br>One-button Fault Diagnosis<br>Broadband Account Migration<br>Tenda App: Local and Remote ManagementSpeed Test<br>Monthly Report<br>Other Function:<br>IPTV<br>IPv6<br>Guest Network<br>System Log<br>Remote Web Management<br>MAC Clone<br>Backup &amp; Restore configurations<br>Support automatic access detection<br>Firmware upgrade online</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Input: AC 100-240V~50/60Hz<br>Output:DC 12V⎓1A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>90*90*93 mm (3.54*3.54*3.65 in.)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band', 5575.00, 5675.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/MRX1Qu0iIEQ8jou1F5wB8F40DdeCPht87fFiDqK9.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 07:41:33', '2026-05-25 07:41:33', 'Tenda Nova MX3 AX1500 WiFi 6 Mesh Router (2 Pack) | Dual Band Smart Mesh System – International Office Solution', 'Buy Tenda Nova MX3 AX1500 WiFi 6 Mesh Router (2 Pack) with 1501Mbps speed, MU-MIMO, OFDMA & seamless coverage. Ideal for smart homes. Available at International Office Solution Bangladesh.', 'Tenda Nova MX3, AX1500 mesh router, WiFi 6 router 2 pack, dual band mesh system, 1501Mbps router, home WiFi system, MU-MIMO router, OFDMA WiFi router, mesh WiFi Bangladesh, International Office Solution, smart home router, Tenda mesh system', NULL, 207, NULL, NULL),
(153, 'Tenda TX9 Pro AX3000 Dual-band Gigabit Wi-Fi 6 Router', 'The Tenda TX9 Pro AX3000 WiFi 6 Router delivers ultra-fast speeds up to 2976Mbps with a powerful 1.6GHz dual-core processor. Featuring OFDMA, MU-MIMO, 160MHz bandwidth, and high-gain antennas, it ensures stable, high-capacity performance for modern homes and offices', 'tenda-tx9-pro-ax3000-dual-band-gigabit-wi-fi-6-router-1779695132', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Tenda TX9 Pro AX3000 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi 6 Router is a high-performance networking device designed to deliver ultra-fast, stable, and efficient wireless connectivity for demanding home and office environments. Powered by a 1.6GHz high-performance dual-core processor with up to 3000 DMIPS processing capability and NPU speeds reaching 2220MHz, it ensures smooth multitasking and optimized network performance.</p><p>With support for WiFi 6 (802.11ax) technology, the TX9 Pro delivers a combined wireless speed of up to 2976Mbps, including 574Mbps on 2.4GHz and 2402Mbps on 5GHz. It supports advanced 160MHz bandwidth and 1024-QAM modulation, enabling significantly faster and more efficient data transmission compared to WiFi 5 routers.</p><p>Equipped with OFDMA and MU-MIMO technologies, the router improves network capacity and reduces congestion, allowing multiple devices to connect simultaneously without performance loss. This makes it ideal for smart homes, gaming, 4K streaming, and heavy internet usage.</p><p>For extended coverage, the TX9 Pro features four 6dBi high-gain external antennas along with high-performance FEM signal enhancement modules on both frequency bands. This ensures stronger signal penetration and wider WiFi coverage across large spaces.</p><p>Advanced technologies like BSS Coloring help reduce co-channel interference, improving stability in dense network environments. The router also supports IPv6, ensuring faster and more efficient communication between internet services and connected devices.</p><p>Designed for reliability and performance, the Tenda TX9 Pro is an excellent choice for users seeking next-generation wireless speed, stability, and coverage. It comes with a 1-year warranty for peace of mind.</p><p>Available at <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted destination for premium networking products in Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>5GHz: Up to 2402Mbps<br>2.4GHz: Up to 574Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4x 6dBi external antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1x WPS/Reset button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>Simultaneous dual-band 2.4</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>IEEE 802.11ac/a/n/ax 5GHz<br>IEEE 802.11b/g/n/ax 2.4GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1x 10/100/1000Mbps WAN port<br>3x 10/100/1000Mbps LAN ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE802.3, IEEE802.3u,IEEE802.3ab</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA-PSK,WPA2-PSK, WPA/WPA2-PSK<br>WPA3-SAE/WPA2-PSK<br>Wireless Security: Enable/Disable<br>WPS(WiFi Protected Set-up) fast encryption</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>SSID Broadcast: Enable/Disable<br>Transmission Power: high, medium, low<br>Beamforming<br>MU-MIMO<br>Wireless Router Mode<br>AP Mode</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Input: AC 100-240V~50/60Hz 0.6A<br>Output: DC 12V⎓1.5A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>272.44 x 162.85 x 43.71mm</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01 Year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual-band Gigabit', 6050.00, 6090.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/XUdw9FUjcLMRvNebGrX7ktErb3d77qDp59OrOkjV.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 07:45:32', '2026-05-25 07:45:32', 'Tenda TX9 Pro AX3000 WiFi 6 Router | Gigabit Dual Band High-Speed Router – International Office Solution', 'Buy Tenda TX9 Pro AX3000 WiFi 6 Router with 2976Mbps speed, 160MHz bandwidth, MU-MIMO & OFDMA. Ideal for gaming and streaming. Available at International Office Solution Bangladesh.', 'Tenda TX9 Pro, AX3000 router, WiFi 6 gigabit router, dual band router, 2976Mbps WiFi router, MU-MIMO router, OFDMA router, 160MHz bandwidth router, gaming router Bangladesh, International Office Solution, high speed WiFi router, Tenda WiFi 6', NULL, 207, NULL, NULL),
(154, 'Tenda RX9 Pro AX3000 Dual Band Gigabit Wi-Fi 6 Router', 'The Tenda RX9 Pro AX3000 WiFi 6 Router delivers ultra-fast speeds up to 2976Mbps with a powerful 1.6GHz dual-core processor. Featuring MU-MIMO, OFDMA, 160MHz bandwidth, WPA3 security, and high-gain antennas, it ensures stable, high-performance connectivity for modern homes and offices.', 'tenda-rx9-pro-ax3000-dual-band-gigabit-wi-fi-6-router-1779695368', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Tenda RX9 Pro AX3000 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi 6 Router is a high-performance networking solution designed for ultra-fast, stable, and efficient wireless connectivity. With dual-band WiFi 6 technology, it delivers a combined speed of up to 2976Mbps—574Mbps on 2.4GHz and 2402Mbps on 5GHz—ensuring smooth streaming, gaming, and multitasking across multiple devices.</p><p>Powered by a 1.6GHz dual-core processor with up to 3000 DMIPS performance and a high-speed NPU reaching 2220MHz, the RX9 Pro provides strong processing power for stable and responsive network performance even under heavy load.</p><p>The router supports advanced 160MHz bandwidth and 1024-QAM modulation, significantly improving data transmission efficiency and speed. With OFDMA and MU-MIMO technologies, it enhances network capacity, reduces latency, and allows multiple devices to connect simultaneously without performance loss.</p><p>For extended coverage and stronger signal stability, the RX9 Pro features four 6dBi high-gain omnidirectional antennas along with independent FEM signal amplification modules on both 2.4GHz and 5GHz bands. This ensures wider coverage and better penetration through walls and obstacles.</p><p>Security is strengthened with WPA3 encryption, making the network more resistant to password cracking and unauthorized access. Additionally, IPv6 support enables faster and more efficient communication between devices and internet servers.</p><p>Designed for modern smart homes, gaming, and office environments, the Tenda RX9 Pro delivers powerful performance, enhanced stability, and wide coverage. It comes with a 1-year warranty for peace of mind.</p><p>&nbsp;Available now at <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted networking product provider in Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>5GHz: Up to 2402Mbps<br>2.4GHz: Up to 574Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4x 6dBi external antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1x WPS/Reset button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>Simultaneous dual-band 2.4</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>IEEE 802.11ac/a/n/ax 5GHz<br>IEEE 802.11b/g/n/ax 2.4GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1x 10/100/1000Mbps WAN port<br>3x 10/100/1000Mbps LAN ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE802.3, IEEE802.3u,IEEE802.3ab</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA-PSK,WPA2-PSK, WPA/WPA2-PSK<br>WPA3-SAE/WPA2-PSK<br>Wireless Security: Enable/Disable<br>WPS(WiFi Protected Set-up) fast encryption</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>SSID Broadcast: Enable/Disable<br>Transmission Power: high, medium, low<br>Beamforming<br>MU-MIMO</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Input：AC 100-240V~50/60Hz 0.6A<br>Output：DC 12V⎓1.5A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>272.44x162.85x43.71mm</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01 Year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band Gigabit', 6049.00, 6100.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/1i9tZRypOaY3ZkpC2GAjLJshp1VcvrCiGhdAuFDQ.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 07:49:28', '2026-05-25 07:49:28', 'Tenda RX9 Pro AX3000 WiFi 6 Router | Dual Band Gigabit High-Speed Router – International Office Solution', 'Buy Tenda RX9 Pro AX3000 WiFi 6 Router with 2976Mbps speed, MU-MIMO, OFDMA, WPA3 security & 160MHz bandwidth. Best for home & office use. Available at International Office Solution Bangladesh.', 'Tenda RX9 Pro, AX3000 router, WiFi 6 router Bangladesh, dual band gigabit router, 2976Mbps router, MU-MIMO OFDMA router, WPA3 router, gaming WiFi router, high speed router, International Office Solution, Tenda WiFi 6 router, 160MHz router', NULL, 207, NULL, NULL),
(155, 'Tenda AC15 AC1900 Dual-Band Gigabit WiFi Router', 'The Tenda AC15 AC1900 Smart Dual-Band Gigabit WiFi Router delivers up to 1900Mbps speed with Beamforming+, high-power amplifiers, and external antennas. Ideal for smooth gaming, HD streaming, and smart home connectivity with stable and wide coverage.', 'tenda-ac15-ac1900-dual-band-gigabit-wifi-router-1779695573', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Tenda AC15 AC1900 Smart Dual-Band Gigabit WiFi Router is designed to enhance your smart home networking experience with powerful performance and intelligent features. Offering a combined wireless speed of up to 1900Mbps, it ensures ultra-fast and stable connectivity for all your online activities including gaming, streaming, and browsing.</p><p>Equipped with advanced Beamforming+ technology, the AC15 focuses WiFi signals directly toward connected devices, improving coverage, stability, and performance even at longer distances. Built-in high-powered signal amplifiers combined with external antennas further enhance wireless range and penetration, ensuring strong connectivity throughout your home.</p><p>The dual-band system allows you to enjoy smooth performance by separating traffic between 2.4GHz and 5GHz bands, reducing interference and improving overall network efficiency. Whether you\'re watching HD videos, playing online games, or managing multiple smart devices, the AC15 ensures lag-free and uninterrupted performance.</p><p>One of its standout features is the Smart WiFi Schedule, which allows users to automatically turn WiFi on or off based on preset times. This helps reduce power consumption and supports a smarter, more energy-efficient home environment.</p><p>Designed for modern smart homes, the Tenda AC15 combines speed, stability, and intelligent control in one powerful router, making it an excellent choice for families and heavy internet users.</p><p>Available at <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted provider of networking solutions in Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Wireless N Router</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Wireless Speed</td><td>1900Mbps(5GHz: Up to 1300Mbps, 2.4GHz: Up to 600Mbps)</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1*Power on/off, 1*WiFi on/off, 1* Reset button,1* WPS button</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna Type</td><td>3*3dBi external dual band antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless Standards</td><td>IEEE 802.11ac/a/n 5GHz, IEEE 802.11b/g/n 2.4GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>Works over 2.4G and 5G concurrently</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless Security</td><td>WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK, WPA/WPA2, Wireless Security: Enable/Disable, WPS fast encryption</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual-Band Gigabit', 7350.00, 7450.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/dvahk6pGVodnICU5EarYupo4cdMaCguukyEJODSM.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 07:52:53', '2026-05-25 07:52:53', 'Tenda AC15 AC1900 Smart Dual-Band Gigabit WiFi Router | High Speed Home Router – International Office Solution', 'Buy Tenda AC15 AC1900 Smart Dual-Band Gigabit WiFi Router with 1900Mbps speed, Beamforming+, Smart WiFi Schedule & stable coverage. Best for home use. Available at International Office Solution Bangladesh.', 'Tenda AC15, AC1900 router, dual band gigabit router, smart WiFi router, Beamforming plus router, high speed WiFi router, home WiFi router Bangladesh, gaming router, International Office Solution, Tenda AC15 router, smart WiFi schedule router', NULL, 207, NULL, NULL),
(156, 'Tenda Nova MX3 AX1500 Dual Band WiFi 6 Mesh Router (3 Pack)', 'The Tenda Nova MX3 AX1500 WiFi 6 Mesh Router (3 Pack) delivers seamless whole-home coverage with speeds up to 1501Mbps. Supporting up to 30 devices, it features MU-MIMO, OFDMA, Beamforming, WPA3 security, and fast roaming for stable and uninterrupted connectivity.', 'tenda-nova-mx3-ax1500-dual-band-wifi-6-mesh-router-3-pack-1779695783', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Tenda Nova MX3 AX1500 Dual Band WiFi 6 Mesh Router (3 Pack) is a powerful whole-home networking solution designed to deliver seamless, high-speed, and stable wireless coverage across large spaces. Built with advanced WiFi 6 technology, it ensures smooth performance for streaming, gaming, video calls, and smart home devices.</p><p>Delivering combined speeds of up to 1501Mbps—300Mbps on 2.4GHz and 1201Mbps on 5GHz—the MX3 ensures efficient data transmission and reduced latency. Each unit is powered by a 1GHz processor and 128MB RAM, allowing smooth multitasking and stable performance even with multiple connected devices.</p><p>The system supports up to 30 connected devices, making it ideal for modern smart homes and small offices. Each node includes one Gigabit WAN port and one Gigabit LAN port for high-speed wired connectivity, ensuring stable performance for bandwidth-heavy applications.</p><p>Advanced technologies such as MU-MIMO, OFDMA, and Beamforming significantly improve network efficiency by optimizing bandwidth distribution and minimizing interference. Features like AP Steering, Band Steering, Auto Path Selection, and Fast Roaming ensure that devices always connect to the strongest available signal without interruption.</p><p>Security is enhanced with WPA3-SAE encryption, WPA2-PSK support, firewall protection, and WPS fast connection. The router also supports multiple internet connection types including PPPoE, Dynamic IP, Static IP, PPTP, and L2TP, along with IPv4/IPv6 compatibility.</p><p>Additional smart features include EasyMesh support, TR069 remote management, IPTV support, parental controls, guest network, Smart LED control, Alexa integration, firmware upgrades, speed testing, and detailed monthly reports.</p><p>Built for durability and reliability, the MX3 operates within 0℃ to 40℃ and holds CE, FCC, and RoHS certifications.</p><p>Available at <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted networking solutions provider in Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>5GHz:1201Mbps<br>2.4GHz:300Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2 x 3dBi Internal antenna</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1 x Reset Button<br>1 x MESH Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>Dual Band (2.4GHz &amp; 5GHz)</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.3, IEEE 802.3u, IEEE 802.4ab<br>2.4GHz：IEEE 802.11n/b/g<br>5GHz：IEEE 802.11ax/ac/n/a</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA2-PSK<br>WPA3-SAE/WPA2-PSK<br>Wireless Encryption Disable and Enable<br>WPS Fast Connection</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>10/100/1000Mbps WAN port*1<br>10/100/1000Mbps LAN port*1</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>OFDMA<br>MU-MIMO<br>Beamforming<br>Network Protocol: IPv4&amp;IPv6<br>Operating Mode: Router Mode,AP Mode<br>Parental Control: URL Filter, Time Limit<br>DHCP: DHCP Server, DHCP Client List, DHCP Reservation<br>Virtual Server: Port Forwarding, DMZ Host, UPnP<br>Firewall:<br>Forbid UDP Flood Attack<br>Forbid TCP Flood Attack<br>Forbid ICMP Flood Attack<br>Forbid WAN Ping from Internet<br>VPN:<br>IPsec Pass Through<br>PPTP Pass Through<br>L2TP Pass Through<br>PPTP VPN Server<br>PPTP VPN Client<br>L2TP VPN Client<br>DNS: DynDNS, no-ip, oray, 88ip<br>Special Features:<br>WPA3<br>TR069<br>Tenda EasyMesh<br>Unify 2.4 GHz &amp; 5 GHz<br>Smart LED on/off<br>Amazon Alexa<br>One-button Fault Diagnosis<br>Broadband Account Migration<br>Tenda App: Local and Remote ManagementSpeed Test<br>Monthly Report<br>Other Function:<br>IPTV<br>IPv6<br>Guest Network<br>System Log<br>Remote Web Management<br>MAC Clone<br>Backup &amp; Restore configurations<br>Support automatic access detection<br>Firmware upgrade online</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Input: AC 100-240V~50/60Hz<br>Output:DC 12V⎓1A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>90*90*93 mm (3.54*3.54*3.65 in.)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band', 9156.00, 9256.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/rcL2i2WqUS48ckKN2PYQJ3O09b0KgieZTelBB0a9.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 07:56:23', '2026-05-25 07:56:23', 'Tenda Nova MX3 AX1500 WiFi 6 Mesh Router (3 Pack) | Whole Home Coverage – International Office Solution', 'Buy Tenda Nova MX3 AX1500 WiFi 6 Mesh Router (3 Pack) with 1501Mbps speed, WPA3 security, MU-MIMO, OFDMA & seamless roaming. Best for smart homes. Available at International Office Solution Bangladesh.', 'Tenda Nova MX3, AX1500 mesh router 3 pack, WiFi 6 mesh system, dual band router, 1501Mbps router, home WiFi system, MU-MIMO OFDMA router, smart home WiFi, mesh WiFi Bangladesh, International Office Solution, Tenda mesh router, fast roaming router', NULL, 207, NULL, NULL),
(157, 'Tenda Nova MW6 AC1200 Dual Band Mesh Router (3 pack)', 'The Tenda Nova MW6 AC1200 Mesh WiFi System (3 Packs) provides seamless whole-home coverage up to 6,000 sq. ft. Featuring Wave2 MU-MIMO, Beamforming, smart roaming, and app-based management, it delivers stable and fast connectivity for modern smart homes.', 'tenda-nova-mw6-ac1200-dual-band-mesh-router-3-pack-1779696458', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Tenda Nova MW6 AC1200 Home Mesh WiFi System (3 Packs) is a powerful whole-home networking solution designed to eliminate WiFi dead zones and deliver seamless high-speed internet coverage throughout your home. Covering up to 6,000 square feet, the MW6 ensures strong and reliable wireless connectivity in every corner of your space.</p><p>Powered by advanced Wave2 MU-MIMO technology, the MW6 can communicate with multiple devices simultaneously, significantly improving network efficiency and reducing lag compared to traditional routers. Whether you\'re streaming HD videos, gaming online, attending video meetings, or browsing on multiple devices, the system ensures smooth and uninterrupted performance.</p><p>The integrated Beamforming technology intelligently directs wireless signals toward connected devices, enhancing signal strength, speed, and overall stability. Seamless roaming allows users to move from room to room without disconnecting, ensuring uninterrupted video calls, gaming sessions, and streaming experiences.</p><p>Unlike traditional routers, the Tenda Nova MW6 automatically maintains network connectivity. If one unit disconnects, it intelligently reconnects through another available node, ensuring continuous internet access without interruption.</p><p>The Tenda WiFi App provides convenient remote network management, allowing users to monitor network status, control connected devices, manage parental controls, and customize settings from anywhere. The system also supports multiple simultaneous device connections and integrates with Alexa for smart voice control compatibility.</p><p>Designed for modern smart homes, the Tenda Nova MW6 combines strong coverage, intelligent mesh technology, and user-friendly controls to deliver a reliable and efficient networking experience.</p><p>Available at <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted source for premium networking products in Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Main Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Button</td><td>1 x reset button</td></tr><tr><td>CPU</td><td>IEEE802.3, IEEE802.3ab</td></tr><tr><td>Temperature</td><td>Operating Temperature: 0℃ ~ 40℃<br>Storage Temperature: -40℃ ~ 70℃</td></tr><tr><td>Dimensions</td><td>100 x 100 x 100mm</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>410g</td></tr><tr><td>Architecture</td><td>2 Gigabit Ethernet ports per mesh point<br>WAN and LAN on primary mesh point<br>both act as LAN ports on additional mesh points</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power consumption</td><td>Input：100-240V—50/60Hz, 0.6A<br>Output：DC 12V==1.5A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Network</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Wireless Rate</td><td>5GHz: Up to 867Mbps<br>2.4GHz: Up to 300Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless frequency</td><td>Simultaneous dual band 2.4GHz &amp; 5GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless standards</td><td>IEEE 802.11ac/a/n 5GHz<br>IEEE 802.11b/g/n 2.4GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Ethernet</td><td>2 Gigabit Ethernet ports per mesh point</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless Security</td><td>WPA2-PSK(default)<br>WPA2-PSK(default)</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Parental Control<br>Guest Network<br>Firmware upgrade online<br>Reset to factory settings</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band Mesh', 10100.00, 10500.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/4V1WXsxJhyIhAP5w2PkqUGnShssvT2KCpDa9pZJK.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 08:07:38', '2026-05-25 08:07:38', 'Tenda Nova MW6 AC1200 Mesh WiFi System (3 Packs) | Whole Home Coverage – International Office Solution', 'Buy Tenda Nova MW6 AC1200 Mesh WiFi System (3 Packs) with seamless roaming, MU-MIMO, Beamforming & coverage up to 6,000 sq. ft. Available at International Office Solution Bangladesh.', 'Tenda Nova MW6, AC1200 mesh WiFi system, home mesh router, dual band mesh WiFi, whole home WiFi coverage, MU-MIMO router, Beamforming WiFi, smart home mesh system, mesh WiFi Bangladesh, International Office Solution, Tenda MW6 router', NULL, 207, NULL, NULL),
(158, 'Tenda Nova MX12 AX3000 Dual Band WiFi 6 Mesh Router (2 Pack)', 'The Tenda Nova MX12 AX3000 WiFi 6 Mesh Router (2 Pack) delivers ultra-fast dual-band speeds up to 2976Mbps with seamless whole-home coverage. Supporting up to 60 devices, it features MU-MIMO, OFDMA, Beamforming, WPA3 security, and Gigabit ports for high-performance networking.', 'tenda-nova-mx12-ax3000-dual-band-wifi-6-mesh-router-2-pack-1779696676', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Tenda Nova MX12 AX3000 Dual Band WiFi 6 Mesh Router (2 Pack) is a premium whole-home networking solution designed to deliver high-speed, stable, and seamless wireless connectivity for modern homes and offices. Powered by advanced WiFi 6 technology, it provides combined dual-band speeds of up to 2976Mbps, including 574Mbps on the 2.4GHz band and 2402Mbps on the 5GHz band.</p><p>Designed to support up to 60 connected devices simultaneously, the MX12 ensures smooth streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, VR applications, and smart home connectivity without lag or interruptions. Compared to AX1800 WiFi 6 systems, the MX12 improves overall network performance by up to 66%.</p><p>Each node is powered by a high-performance 1.7GHz quad-core processor paired with 256MB RAM, enabling fast data processing and stable performance even under heavy network loads. The system covers approximately 2000 to 2500 square feet using four independent wireless amplifiers and advanced Beamforming technology for stronger and more reliable signal coverage.</p><p>The MX12 includes three Gigabit RJ45 ports per node, supporting high-speed broadband access and Ethernet backhaul for enhanced wired performance. Advanced technologies such as OFDMA, MU-MIMO, 1024-QAM, AP Steering, Band Steering, Fast Roaming, Auto Path Selection, and WiFi+ ensure efficient bandwidth management and uninterrupted connectivity across all connected devices.</p><p>Security is enhanced with WPA3-SAE and WPA2-PSK encryption protocols, protecting the network from unauthorized access. The router supports multiple connection types including PPPoE, Dynamic IP, Static IP, PPTP, and L2TP, along with IPv4 and IPv6 compatibility.</p><p>Additional smart features include IPTV support, parental controls, guest network management, firewall protection against TCP/UDP flood attacks, VPN support, firmware upgrades, manual DNS configuration, and app/web-based management for convenient control.</p><p>Built for reliability, the MX12 operates efficiently within temperatures of 0℃ to 40℃ and is certified with CE, FCC, and RoHS standards.</p><p>Available now at <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted provider of networking products in Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>2.4GHz: 574Mbps (802.11ax)<br>5GHz: 2402Mbps (802.11ax)</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4 x 3dBi Internal antenna Per Node</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1 x Reset Button<br>1 x MESH Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>Dual Band (2.4GHz &amp; 5GHz)</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.3, IEEE 802.3u, IEEE 802.3ab<br>5GHz: IEEE 802.11ax/ac/n/a<br>2.4GHz: IEEE 802.11ax/n/b/g</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA3-SAE/WPA2-PSK</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>3 x 10/100/1000Mbps RJ45 ports</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>LED Indicator: 1 x Tri-color LED Indicator(Green,Yellow,Red)<br>Basic Functions: Beam Forming, MU-MIMO, AP Steering, Band Steering, OFDMA, 1024-QAM<br>Internet Connection Type: PPPoE, Dynamic IP, Static IP, PPPoE(Russia), PPTP(Russia), L2TP(Russia)<br>Network Protocol: IPv4&amp;IPv6<br>Operating Mode: Router Mode,AP Mode<br>Parental Control: Client Filter, URL Filter, Time Limit<br>DHCP: DHCP Server, DHCP Client List<br>Virtual Server: Port Forwarding, DMZ Host, UPnP<br>Firewall: Forbid TCP/UDP flood attack<br>VPN: PPTP Server, PPTP/L2TP Client<br>DNS: Support manually setting DNS server<br>Special Features: Ethernet Backhaul, IPv6, IPTV<br>Other Function: Support App and web management, Guest Network, Firmware upgrade online</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Input: AC 100-240V, 50/60Hz<br>Output: DC 12 V ⎓ 1.5 A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>86x86x190mm (3.39 x3.39 x 7.48 in) Per Node</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band Mesh', 10100.00, 10200.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/Nv2ndkJNVLkN1mpKG2RCFzddI0PipjjqfBRefCwa.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 08:11:16', '2026-05-25 08:11:16', 'Tenda Nova MX12 AX3000 WiFi 6 Mesh Router (2 Pack) | High-Speed Mesh System – International Office Solution', 'Buy Tenda Nova MX12 AX3000 WiFi 6 Mesh Router (2 Pack) with 2976Mbps speed, MU-MIMO, OFDMA, WPA3 security & seamless coverage. Available at International Office Solution Bangladesh.', 'Tenda Nova MX12, AX3000 mesh router, WiFi 6 mesh system, dual band mesh router, 2976Mbps WiFi router, MU-MIMO router, OFDMA mesh WiFi, WPA3 router, mesh WiFi Bangladesh, International Office Solution, Tenda MX12 router, Gigabit mesh system', NULL, 207, NULL, NULL),
