office.</p><p>Security is enhanced with WPA3-SAE and WPA2-PSK encryption protocols, ensuring strong wireless protection against unauthorized access. The router also supports multiple connection types including PPPoE, Dynamic IP, Static IP, PPTP, and L2TP, along with IPv4 and IPv6 compatibility for flexible networking.</p><p>Additional features include IPTV support, parental controls, guest network management, firewall protection against TCP/UDP flood attacks, VPN support, firmware upgrades, manual DNS configuration, and app/web-based management for convenient control and monitoring.</p><p>Built with reliability in mind, the MX12 operates efficiently between 0℃ to 40℃ and holds CE, FCC, and RoHS certifications.</p><p>Available now at <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted provider of networking solutions in Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>2.4GHz: 574Mbps (802.11ax)<br>5GHz: 2402Mbps (802.11ax)</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4 x 3dBi Internal antenna Per Node</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1 x Reset Button<br>1 x MESH Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>Dual Band (2.4GHz &amp; 5GHz)</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.3, IEEE 802.3u, IEEE 802.3ab<br>5GHz: IEEE 802.11ax/ac/n/a<br>2.4GHz: IEEE 802.11ax/n/b/g</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA3-SAE/WPA2-PSK</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>3 x 10/100/1000Mbps RJ45 ports Per Node</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>LED Indicator: 1 x Tri-color LED Indicator(Green,Yellow,Red)<br>Basic Functions: Beam Forming, MU-MIMO, AP Steering, Band Steering, OFDMA, 1024-QAM<br>Internet Connection Type: PPPoE, Dynamic IP, Static IP, PPPoE(Russia), PPTP(Russia), L2TP(Russia)<br>Network Protocol: IPv4&amp;IPv6<br>Operating Mode: Router Mode,AP Mode<br>Parental Control: Client Filter, URL Filter, Time Limit<br>DHCP: DHCP Server, DHCP Client List<br>Virtual Server: Port Forwarding, DMZ Host, UPnP<br>Firewall: Forbid TCP/UDP flood attack<br>VPN: PPTP Server, PPTP/L2TP Client<br>DNS: Support manually setting DNS server<br>Special Features: Ethernet Backhaul, IPv6, IPTV<br>Other Function: Support App and web management, Guest Network, Firmware upgrade online</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Input: AC 100-240V, 50/60Hz<br>Output: DC 12 V ⎓ 1.5 A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>86x86x190mm (3.39 x3.39 x 7.48 in) Per Node</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual BandMesh', 14200.00, 14300.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/h9bTKuH4ZvmbXKeL2OSRUZZY9bpPBuCEsbCgzDST.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 08:14:28', '2026-05-25 08:14:28', 'Tenda Nova MX12 AX3000 WiFi 6 Mesh Router (3 Pack) | Whole Home Mesh System – International Office Solution', 'Buy Tenda Nova MX12 AX3000 WiFi 6 Mesh Router (3 Pack) with 2976Mbps speed, MU-MIMO, OFDMA, WPA3 security & seamless coverage up to 3500 sq. ft. Available at International Office Solution Bangladesh.', 'Tenda Nova MX12, AX3000 mesh router 3 pack, WiFi 6 mesh system, dual band mesh WiFi, 2976Mbps router, MU-MIMO router, OFDMA mesh router, WPA3 WiFi router, whole home mesh system, International Office Solution, Tenda MX12 Bangladesh', NULL, 207, NULL, NULL),
(160, 'Tenda Nova MW12 AC2100 Tri-band Mesh Router (3 Pack)', 'The Tenda Nova MW12 AC2100 Tri-Band Mesh WiFi System (3 Pack) delivers seamless whole-home coverage with tri-band technology, MU-MIMO support, and Gigabit connectivity. Designed for over 100 devices, it ensures stable, high-speed performance for smart homes and offices.', 'tenda-nova-mw12-ac2100-tri-band-mesh-router-3-pack-1779697045', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Tenda Nova MW12 AC2100 Tri-Band Whole Home Mesh WiFi System (3 Pack) is a premium mesh networking solution designed to provide powerful, seamless, and stable wireless coverage across large homes and office environments. Featuring advanced tri-band technology with one 2.4GHz band and two 5GHz bands, the MW12 ensures optimized traffic distribution and faster wireless performance for multiple connected devices.</p><p>Powered by a high-performance dual-core 900MHz processor and 256MB DDR3 memory, the MW12 efficiently handles heavy network traffic while supporting over 100 connected devices simultaneously. This makes it ideal for smart homes, 4K streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, and IoT device connectivity.</p><p>The system supports advanced MU-MIMO technology, allowing multiple devices to communicate with the router at the same time for smoother and more responsive network performance. Each node is equipped with three Gigabit RJ45 ports, enabling high-speed wired connectivity and stable Ethernet backhaul support.</p><p>The Tenda Nova MW12 operates under a unified mesh network using 802.11k/v/r seamless roaming protocols, ensuring uninterrupted connectivity as users move throughout the home or office. Devices automatically connect to the strongest available signal without manual switching.</p><p>Designed with four internal antennas per node, the MW12 provides strong signal coverage and stable wireless performance throughout large spaces. The system also includes a tri-color LED indicator for easy network status monitoring and a reset button for convenient troubleshooting.</p><p>One of the key advantages of the MW12 is its compatibility with all Nova-series mesh products, including MW3, MW5, MW5S, MW5G, MW6, and other MW12 units. This allows users to easily expand their existing mesh network based on coverage requirements.</p><p>The MW12 supports both Router Mode and Bridge Mode, providing flexible deployment options for different networking environments.</p><p>&nbsp;Available now at <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted provider of advanced networking solutions in Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Main Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4 x Internal antenna</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1 x Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>CPU</td><td>Dual-core 900MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Ram</td><td>256M DDR3 RAM</td></tr><tr><td>Temperature</td><td>Operating Humidity: 10%~90% RH non-condensing<br>Storage Humidity: 5%~90% RH non-condensing</td></tr><tr><td>Dimensions</td><td>100 x 100 x 100mm (3.94 x 3.94 x 3.94in)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Number of DC inputs</td><td>Input: 100-240V—50/60Hz, 0.6A<br>Output: 12V1.5A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Network</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Wireless Rate</td><td>2.4GHz: 300Mbps<br>5GHz-1: 867Mbps<br>5GHz-2: 867Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless frequency</td><td>2.4~2.4835GHz<br>5.15~5.25GHz<br>5.47~5.725GHz (for EU countries)<br>5.725~5.85GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless standards</td><td>IEEE802.11a/b/g/n/ac (WiFi 5 wave 2)</td></tr><tr><td>Ethernet</td><td>3 x 10/100/1000Mbps RJ45 ports per node</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless Security</td><td>WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK(default)</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>SSID Broadcast<br>Beam Forming<br>MU-MIMO<br>AP Steering<br>Band Steering</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacture Warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 Year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Tri-band Mesh', 16700.00, 16800.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/EYwGuhXwr91wiDS0fnbYsf3FelMREtHWh2gtrru7.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-25 08:17:25', '2026-05-25 08:17:25', 'Tenda Nova MW12 AC2100 Tri-Band Mesh WiFi System (3 Pack) – International Office Solution', 'Buy Tenda Nova MW12 AC2100 Tri-Band Mesh WiFi System (3 Pack) with seamless roaming, MU-MIMO, Gigabit ports & support for 100+ devices. Available at International Office Solution Bangladesh.', 'Tenda Nova MW12, AC2100 mesh WiFi, tri-band mesh router, whole home WiFi system, MU-MIMO router, Gigabit mesh WiFi, smart home router, Nova mesh system, Tenda MW12 Bangladesh, International Office Solution, seamless roaming router', NULL, 207, NULL, NULL),
(161, 'Cudy WR300S 300mbps WiFi Router', 'The Cudy WR300S 300Mbps WiFi Router is an affordable and reliable networking solution designed for smooth everyday internet usage at home or in small offices. Featuring wireless speeds up to 300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band, this router is ideal for web browsing, online classes, HD video streaming, social media usage, and light online gaming. The router supports multiple connected devices simultaneously while maintaining stable and consistent wireless coverage. Equipped with multiple LAN ports for wired connectivity, easy setup options, and advanced wireless security features, the Cudy WR300S ensures a secure and hassle-free networking experience. Its compact design and user-friendly interface make it a practical choice for users seeking dependable performance at an affordable price.', 'cudy-wr300s-300mbps-wifi-router-1779793471', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Cudy WR300S 300Mbps WiFi Router</strong></h2><p>The Cudy WR300S 300Mbps WiFi Router is a reliable and cost-effective networking device built to meet the daily internet demands of modern homes and small offices. Designed with simplicity, stability, and performance in mind, this Cudy wireless router provides seamless 2.4GHz wireless connectivity with speeds of up to 300Mbps, ensuring smooth browsing, online learning, HD video streaming, video calls, and light gaming experiences.</p><p>As a dependable networking solution, the Cudy WR300S Router supports multiple wireless devices simultaneously, allowing smartphones, laptops, smart TVs, tablets, and smart home devices to stay connected without interruption. Its enhanced wireless coverage helps eliminate weak signal areas, delivering a stable internet experience throughout your home or workspace.</p><p>The router comes equipped with multiple LAN ports, enabling high-speed wired connections for desktop PCs, gaming consoles, IPTV, or network printers. With built-in wireless security protocols, the Cudy WR300S helps protect your network from unauthorized access while ensuring secure internet usage for all connected devices.</p><p>Easy setup and a user-friendly web management interface make the Cudy WR300S suitable for both beginners and experienced users. Its compact and lightweight design allows flexible placement anywhere in your home or office without occupying much space.</p><p>Whether you need a basic router for regular internet activities or a budget-friendly networking upgrade, the Cudy WR300S 300Mbps WiFi Router offers dependable performance, easy management, and excellent value for everyday connectivity needs.</p><h2><strong>Buy Cudy WR300S 300Mbps WiFi Router from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Cudy WR300S 300Mbps WiFi Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide collection of the latest Cudy routers and networking devices at competitive prices. Order online or visit International Office Solution to get authentic products with reliable customer support and after-sales service. The Cudy WR300S 300Mbps WiFi Router comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>300 Mbps (2.4 GHz)</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4× Fixed Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS Button, Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1× 10/100 Mbps WAN Port<br>4× 10/100 Mbps LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11n/g/b</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>220×135×30 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>249.8 g</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Router', 1600.00, 1750.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/5IHQFqxDPevczQq