(162, 'Cudy M1200 AC1200 Dual Band Mesh Router (1 Pack)', 'The Cudy M1200 AC1200 Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router (1 Pack) is a high-performance dual-band mesh networking solution designed to provide seamless WiFi coverage for homes and small offices. Featuring combined wireless speeds up to 1200Mbps, Gigabit Ethernet ports, dual-band connectivity, and mesh technology, this router ensures stable internet access for streaming, gaming, video calls, and smart home connectivity. With VPN support, Access Point mode, and easy setup, the Cudy M1200 offers reliable and secure whole-home wireless networking.', 'cudy-m1200-ac1200-dual-band-mesh-router-1-pack-1779793754', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Cudy M1200 AC1200 Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router (1 Pack)</strong></h2><p>The Cudy M1200 AC1200 Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router is a powerful and versatile networking solution designed to eliminate dead zones and provide fast, stable internet coverage throughout your home or office. Built with advanced mesh technology, this router creates a seamless wireless network that ensures uninterrupted connectivity while moving between rooms, making it ideal for modern smart homes and multi-device environments.</p><p>Powered by 16MB Flash memory and 128MB DDR3 RAM, the Cudy M1200 delivers smooth and efficient network performance even with multiple connected devices. It supports dual-band WiFi technology with combined wireless speeds of up to 1200Mbps. The 2.4GHz band provides wider coverage and stable connectivity for regular tasks such as web browsing, social media, emails, and smart home devices, while the 5GHz band offers speeds up to 867Mbps, perfect for bandwidth-intensive activities including online gaming, 4K video streaming, HD video conferencing, and fast downloads.</p><p>The router is equipped with 2 x Gigabit Ethernet ports for ultra-fast wired connectivity, allowing stable connections for desktop PCs, gaming consoles, smart TVs, NAS storage, and IPTV devices. Its internal omni-directional antennas enhance signal strength and improve wall penetration, ensuring broader and more reliable wireless coverage across different areas.</p><p>The Cudy M1200 supports both Router Mode and Access Point Mode, offering flexible networking options depending on your setup requirements. In Router Mode, it directly connects to your ISP and distributes internet access to all connected devices. In Access Point Mode, it works alongside an existing modem or router to extend wireless coverage while handling data forwarding efficiently.</p><p>For enhanced online privacy and security, the router includes built-in PPTP and L2TP VPN Client support, allowing secure connections to remote VPN servers for protected internet browsing and remote work environments. Additionally, Dynamic DNS (DDNS) functionality enables users to bind their changing home IP address to a fixed domain name, making remote access and network management easier and more convenient.</p><p>With a user-friendly setup process, reliable mesh performance, advanced security features, and modern wireless technology, the Cudy M1200 AC1200 Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router is an excellent choice for users seeking affordable whole-home WiFi coverage and dependable internet performance.</p><h2><strong>Buy Cudy M1200 AC1200 Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Cudy M1200 AC1200 Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of genuine Cudy networking devices and mesh WiFi systems at competitive prices. Order online or visit International Office Solution to get authentic products with reliable customer support and after-sales service. The Cudy M1200 AC1200 Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>867Mbps (5GHz), 300Mbps (2.4GHz)<br>Compatible with 802.11a/b/g/n/ac Wi-Fi standards</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2 × Internal Omni-Directional Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Pair Button, Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>5 GHz, 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Wireless Modes: Enable/Disable Wireless Radio, WMM<br>Wireless Security: WEP, WPA/WPA2, WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1 × 100/10Mbps WAN Port<br>1 × 100/10Mbps LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11/ac/n/a 5GHz<br>IEEE 802.11/n/b/g 2.4GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Flash: 128Mbit (16MB)<br>DDR: 1Gbit (128MB)</td></tr><tr><td>Operating System Support</td><td>Microsoft Windows 98SE/ NT/ 2000/ XP/ Vista/ 7/ 8/ 8.1/ 10, MAC OS, NetWare, UNIX or Linux</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>12V/1A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band Mesh', 2550.00, 2650.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/qkCunGR22550jsz8ZQjt2AijngXEE7cGqSS9uqnA.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 11:09:14', '2026-05-26 11:09:14', 'Cudy M1200 AC1200 Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Cudy M1200 AC1200 Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy dual-band mesh WiFi, Gigabit ports, VPN support, seamless coverage, and stable high-speed internet for home and office use.', 'Cudy M1200, Cudy M1200 Router, Cudy Mesh WiFi, AC1200 Mesh Router, Whole Home Mesh WiFi, Cudy AC1200 Router, Dual Band WiFi Router, Gigabit Mesh Router, Cudy Router Price in Bangladesh, Mesh WiFi Bangladesh, Wireless Router, International Office Solution', NULL, 208, NULL, NULL),
(163, 'Cudy WR1500 AX1500 Dual Band WiFi 6 Mesh Router', 'The Cudy WR1500 AX1500 Gigabit Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router is a high-speed networking solution designed for modern homes and offices. Featuring advanced Wi-Fi 6 technology, dual-band connectivity, Gigabit Ethernet ports, and smart mesh capability, this router delivers fast, stable, and seamless internet performance for streaming, gaming, video conferencing, and smart home connectivity. With support for OFDMA, MU-MIMO, Beamforming, and 160MHz channel width, the Cudy WR1500 ensures efficient data transmission and wider wireless coverage for multiple connected devices.', 'cudy-wr1500-ax1500-dual-band-wifi-6-mesh-router-1779794026', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Cudy WR1500 AX1500 1500Mbps Gigabit Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router</strong></h2><p>The Cudy WR1500 AX1500 Gigabit Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router is a powerful next-generation networking device built to deliver ultra-fast wireless performance, wider coverage, and enhanced network efficiency for modern digital lifestyles. Equipped with the latest Wi-Fi 6 (802.11ax) technology, this router provides combined wireless speeds of up to 1500Mbps, making it ideal for 4K streaming, competitive online gaming, remote work, video conferencing, cloud applications, and smart home environments.</p><p>Designed for high-performance networking, the Cudy WR1500 features dual-band wireless connectivity with both 2.4GHz and 5GHz frequencies. The 2.4GHz band offers extended coverage and reliable connectivity for everyday internet activities such as browsing, emailing, and smart device connections, while the 5GHz band delivers high-speed performance for bandwidth-intensive applications including HD streaming, online gaming, and large file transfers.</p><p>The router includes three Gigabit LAN ports that provide ultra-fast wired connections for gaming consoles, desktop PCs, smart TVs, NAS devices, and other high-speed networking equipment. With support for a 160MHz channel width, the Cudy WR1500 significantly increases data throughput and reduces network congestion, ensuring smoother and faster wireless performance across connected devices.</p><p>To enhance wireless efficiency and network stability, the Cudy WR1500 integrates advanced technologies such as OFDMA (Orthogonal Frequency Division Multiple Access), MU-MIMO (Multi-User Multiple Input Multiple Output), and Beamforming. These intelligent networking features optimize data delivery, improve signal strength, reduce latency, and allow multiple devices to communicate with the router simultaneously without performance drops.</p><p>The Smart Mesh functionality of the Cudy WR1500 enables seamless whole-home WiFi coverage by connecting multiple compatible mesh devices into a unified wireless network. This eliminates dead zones and ensures uninterrupted internet connectivity as users move throughout the home or office.</p><p>Supporting a wide range of wireless standards including IEEE 802.11a/b/g/n/ac/ax, the router ensures excellent compatibility with both older and newer wireless devices, making it a future-ready networking solution. Its modern design, easy setup process, and user-friendly management interface make installation and network customization simple for all users.</p><p>Whether you need stable high-speed internet for entertainment, professional work, online learning, or smart home integration, the Cudy WR1500 AX1500 Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router offers reliable performance, advanced features, and exceptional wireless coverage for demanding networking environments.</p><h2><strong>Buy Cudy WR1500 AX1500 1500Mbps Gigabit Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Cudy WR1500 AX1500 1500Mbps Gigabit Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide collection of genuine Cudy networking devices and Wi-Fi 6 routers at competitive prices. Order online or visit International Office Solution to get authentic products with dependable customer support and after-sales service. The Cudy WR1500 AX1500 Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>1201 Mbps (5 GHz), 300 Mbps (2.4 GHz)</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4× Fixed Omni-Directional Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS Button, Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>5 GHz, 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Enable/Disable Wireless Radio, WMM</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1 × 10/100/1000 Mbps WAN Port<br>3 × 10/100/1000 Mbps LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11ax/ac/n/a 5 GHz<br>IEEE 802.11n/b/g 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>OFDMA, Beamforming and MU-MIMO</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>180*107*35 mm (Not Include Antennas)<br>200*117*35 mm (Include Antennas)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band WiFi 6 Mesh', 2650.00, 2750.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/yUQgSromHmSEiun3fmjtgo5kCTdGnHjSUAMc32Qi.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 11:13:46', '2026-05-26 11:13:46', 'Cudy WR1500 AX1500 Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Cudy WR1500 AX1500 Gigabit Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy fast 1500Mbps speed, Wi-Fi 6 technology, smart mesh coverage, Gigabit ports, and stable high-performance connectivity.', 'Cudy WR1500, Cudy AX1500 Router, Cudy WiFi 6 Router, AX1500 Mesh Router, Dual Band WiFi Router, Gigabit WiFi Router, Smart Mesh Router, Cudy WR1500 Price in Bangladesh, WiFi 6 Router Bangladesh, Mesh WiFi Router, Cudy Router, International Office Solution', NULL, 208, NULL, NULL),
(164, 'Cudy M1300 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Mesh Router (1 Pack)', 'The Cudy M1300 AC1200 Gigabit Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router (1 Pack) is a reliable dual-band mesh networking solution designed for seamless internet coverage across homes and offices. With combined wireless speeds up to 1200Mbps, Gigabit Ethernet ports, mesh technology, VPN support, and dual operating modes, this router delivers stable and high-speed connectivity for streaming, gaming, online learning, and smart home applications.', 'cudy-m1300-ac1200-dual-band-gigabit-mesh-router-1-pack-1779794285', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Cudy M1300 AC1200 1200Mbps Gigabit Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router (1 Pack)</strong></h2><p>The Cudy M1300 AC1200 Gigabit Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router is an advanced and efficient networking solution built to provide seamless wireless coverage, stable connectivity, and high-speed internet performance throughout your home or office. Designed with intelligent mesh technology, the Cudy M1300 creates a unified wireless network that helps eliminate dead zones and ensures uninterrupted connectivity as you move between rooms.</p><p>Powered by 16MB Flash memory and 128MB DDR3 RAM, this mesh router is capable of handling multiple connected devices smoothly and efficiently. It offers dual-band wireless connectivity with combined speeds of up to 1200Mbps, delivering fast and stable internet performance for modern digital activities. The 2.4GHz frequency band provides wider coverage and reliable connections for daily internet tasks such as web browsing, emails, social media usage, and smart home devices, while the 5GHz band delivers speeds up to 867Mbps, ideal for online gaming, 4K UHD streaming, HD video conferencing, and large file downloads.</p><p>The Cudy M1300 comes equipped with 2 x Gigabit Ethernet ports that provide ultra-fast wired connectivity for desktop computers, gaming consoles, smart TVs, NAS storage devices, and IPTV systems. Its built-in omni-directional antennas improve signal penetration through walls and obstacles, ensuring strong and stable WiFi coverage across larger areas.</p><p>This router supports both Router Mode and Access Point Mode, offering flexible networking options based on your requirements. In Router Mode, it directly connects to your internet service provider and distributes high-speed internet access to all connected devices. In Access Point Mode, the router works alongside an existing modem or primary router to extend wireless coverage while managing data forwarding efficiently.</p><p>For enhanced security and remote connectivity, the Cudy M1300 includes built-in PPTP and L2TP VPN Client support, allowing users to securely connect to VPN servers and encrypt online traffic for safer browsing and remote work access. The integrated Dynamic DNS (DDNS) functionality enables users to link their changing IP address to a custom domain name, making remote network management easier and more convenient.</p><p>With easy setup, modern mesh networking technology, strong wireless performance, and advanced security features, the Cudy M1300 AC1200 Gigabit Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router is an excellent choice for users looking for dependable whole-home WiFi coverage and smooth internet connectivity.</p><h2><strong>Buy Cudy M1300 AC1200 Gigabit Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Cudy M1300 AC1200 Gigabit Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of genuine Cudy routers and mesh networking solutions at competitive prices. Order online or visit International Office Solution to get authentic products with reliable customer support and after-sales service. The Cudy M1300 AC1200 Mesh WiFi Router comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>867Mbps (5GHz), 300Mbps (2.4GHz)<br>Compatible with 802.11a/b/g/n/ac Wi-Fi standards</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2 × Internal Omni-Directional Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Pair Button, Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>5 GHz, 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Wireless Modes: Enable/Disable Wireless Radio, WMM</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1 × 1000/100/10 Mbps WAN Port<br>1 × 1000/100/10 Mbps LAN Port</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11/ac/n/a 5GHz<br>IEEE 802.11/n/b/g 2.4GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WEP, WPA/WPA2, WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Flash: 128Mbit (16MB)<br>DDR: 1Gbit (128MB)</td></tr><tr><td>Operating System Support</td><td>Microsoft Windows 98SE/ NT/ 2000/ XP/ Vista/ 7/ 8/ 8.1/ 10, MAC OS, NetWare, UNIX or Linux</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>12V/1A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band Gigabit Mesh', 3000.00, 3100.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/0WmBXSS6NYWCaWQLICOC4yBOkROlI7raYN7gGBmi.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 11:18:05', '2026-05-26 11:18:05', 'Cudy M1300 AC1200 Gigabit Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Cudy M1300 AC1200 Gigabit Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy dual-band mesh WiFi, Gigabit ports, VPN support, seamless coverage, and stable high-speed internet performance.', 'Cudy M1300, Cudy M1300 Router, AC1200 Mesh Router, Whole Home Mesh WiFi, Cudy Gigabit Router, Dual Band WiFi Router, Mesh WiFi Bangladesh, Cudy Router Price in Bangladesh, VPN WiFi Router, Gigabit Mesh WiFi, Wireless Router, International Office Solution', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(165, 'Cudy LT400E 4G 300 Mbps Sim Supported Wireless Router', 'The Cudy LT400E 4G 300 Mbps SIM Supported Router is a reliable and flexible wireless networking solution designed for homes, offices, shops, and remote locations without fixed broadband connectivity. Featuring 4G LTE Cat.4 support, SIM card compatibility, wireless speeds up to 300Mbps, multiple Ethernet ports, VPN support, and easy setup, this router delivers stable internet connectivity for browsing, streaming, online meetings, and everyday networking needs.', 'cudy-lt400e-4g-300-mbps-sim-supported-wireless-router-1779794543', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Cudy LT400E 4G 300 Mbps SIM Supported Wireless Router</strong></h2><p>The Cudy LT400E 4G 300 Mbps SIM Supported Wireless Router is a compact, efficient, and user-friendly networking device built to provide stable internet connectivity through mobile networks. Designed for users who require flexible internet access without relying on traditional broadband services, this router allows you to simply insert a 4G SIM card and instantly create a secure wireless network for your home, office, shop, or remote workspace.</p><p>Powered by advanced 4G LTE Cat.4 technology, the Cudy LT400E supports download speeds of up to 150 Mbps and upload speeds of up to 50 Mbps, ensuring smooth online experiences for web browsing, HD video streaming, video calls, social media usage, and remote work. The router’s built-in wireless functionality delivers Wi-Fi speeds of up to 300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band, providing stable and reliable wireless coverage for smartphones, laptops, tablets, smart TVs, and other connected devices.</p><p>The Cudy LT400E also features multiple Ethernet ports, enabling wired connections for desktop computers, printers, IP cameras, switches, or gaming consoles. This combination of wireless and wired connectivity makes it a versatile solution for both personal and professional networking environments.</p><p>For enhanced online privacy and network security, the router includes advanced Wi-Fi security protocols and VPN support, helping users protect sensitive data and establish secure remote connections. The simple web-based management interface allows easy setup, configuration, and network monitoring, making it suitable for both beginner and experienced users.</p><p>Its compact design and portable nature make the Cudy LT400E an ideal networking solution for rural areas, temporary workstations, travel, backup internet setups, and locations where fixed broadband services are unavailable or unreliable.</p><p>Whether you need internet connectivity for home entertainment, online education, remote work, or business operations, the Cudy LT400E 4G 300 Mbps SIM Supported Wireless Router offers dependable performance, flexible connectivity, and hassle-free setup in a cost-effective package.</p><h2><strong>Buy Cudy LT400E 4G 300 Mbps SIM Supported Wireless Router from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Cudy LT400E 4G 300 Mbps SIM Supported Wireless Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide collection of genuine Cudy routers and networking devices at competitive prices. Order online or visit International Office Solution to get authentic products with reliable customer support and after-sales service. The Cudy LT400E 4G 300 Mbps SIM Supported Wireless Router comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>4G LTE:<br>Max DL Speed: 150 Mbps<br>Max UL Speed: 50 Mbps<br>Wireless 2.4GHz: 300 Mbps<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2× Internal Antenna</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Power On/Off Button<br>WPS Button<br>Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>4 x 10/100 Mbps RJ45 Ports<br>(1× RJ45 port is WAN/LAN configurable, and the rest are LAN ports)</td></tr><tr><t