(166, 'Cudy M1500 AX1500 Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router (1 Pack)', 'The Cudy M1500 AX1500 Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router (1 Pack) is a high-performance mesh networking solution designed for modern homes and offices. Featuring Wi-Fi 6 technology, dual-band speeds up to 1500Mbps, Gigabit ports, WPA3 security, VPN support, and seamless mesh coverage, this router delivers fast, stable, and secure connectivity for streaming, gaming, video conferencing, and smart home devices.', 'cudy-m1500-ax1500-dual-band-wi-fi-6-mesh-router-1-pack-1779794800', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Cudy M1500 AX1500 Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router (1 Pack)</strong></h2><p>The Cudy M1500 AX1500 Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router is an advanced networking solution built to provide ultra-fast wireless performance, seamless coverage, and reliable connectivity for today’s connected lifestyle. Designed with the latest Wi-Fi 6 technology, this mesh router ensures higher network efficiency, reduced latency, and improved stability for multiple connected devices in homes, apartments, and small offices.</p><p>Powered by a 1GHz single-core processor, the Cudy M1500 delivers smooth and stable performance even under heavy network usage. It offers combined dual-band wireless speeds of up to 1500Mbps, including up to 1201Mbps on the 5GHz band and 300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band. The 2.4GHz frequency provides broader wireless coverage and dependable connectivity for everyday internet activities, while the 5GHz band offers high-speed performance for online gaming, 4K streaming, video conferencing, and large file transfers.</p><p>The router features advanced Wi-Fi 6 technologies such as 1024-QAM modulation and Beamforming, which improve wireless efficiency, enhance signal strength, and optimize data transmission to connected devices. Its powerful internal antennas with high-gain design ensure strong signal penetration and coverage of up to 1600 square feet per unit, reducing dead zones and maintaining consistent wireless performance throughout the area.</p><p>Designed for modern multi-device environments, the Cudy M1500 supports up to 60 connected devices simultaneously, making it ideal for busy households, smart homes, and office networks. The router also supports mesh networking with both wireless and wired backhaul options, enabling users to expand coverage seamlessly by adding additional compatible mesh units.</p><p>For wired networking, the router includes 3 Gigabit RJ45 ports consisting of 1 WAN port and 2 LAN ports, providing high-speed connections for desktop computers, gaming consoles, NAS devices, IPTV systems, and smart TVs.</p><p>The Cudy M1500 also includes advanced networking and management features such as per-user QoS, DHCP management, IPv4 and IPv6 compatibility, VLAN configuration, IPTV support, guest network functionality, parental controls, and LED management. Security is enhanced with WPA3 wireless encryption and built-in VPN client support including PPTP, L2TP, and WireGuard protocols for secure and private internet access.</p><p>Users can easily manage and monitor the network through the intuitive web interface or mobile application, allowing both local and remote access for convenient configuration and troubleshooting.</p><p>With its combination of Wi-Fi 6 performance, mesh networking capabilities, strong security, and modern management tools, the Cudy M1500 AX1500 Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router is an excellent choice for users seeking fast, stable, and scalable wireless networking.</p><h2><strong>Buy Cudy M1500 AX1500 Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Cudy M1500 AX1500 Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide collection of genuine Cudy networking products and mesh Wi-Fi solutions at competitive prices. Order online or visit International Office Solution to get authentic products with dependable customer support and after-sales service. T