er, WPA3 Router, VPN Router, International Office Solution', NULL, 208, NULL, NULL),
(167, 'Cudy LT400 4G 300 Mbps Sim Supported Wireless Router', 'The Cudy LT400 4G 300 Mbps SIM Supported Wireless Router is a reliable and high-performance networking solution designed for homes, offices, and remote locations. Featuring 4G LTE connectivity, four high-gain antennas, 300Mbps WiFi speed, VPN support, and dual WAN functionality, this router provides stable internet access for browsing, streaming, online meetings, and everyday connectivity needs.', 'cudy-lt400-4g-300-mbps-sim-supported-wireless-router-1779795079', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Cudy LT400 4G 300 Mbps 4 Antenna SIM Supported Wireless Router</strong></h2><p>The Cudy LT400 4G 300 Mbps SIM Supported Wireless Router is a powerful and flexible networking device designed to deliver fast and stable internet connectivity through mobile networks. Built for users who require dependable internet access without traditional broadband services, this router allows you to simply insert a SIM card and instantly create a wireless network for your home, office, shop, or remote workspace.</p><p>Powered by advanced 4G LTE technology, the Cudy LT400 supports download speeds of up to 150Mbps and upload speeds of up to 50Mbps, ensuring smooth online experiences for web browsing, HD video streaming, online classes, social media, remote work, and video conferencing. The router also provides wireless speeds of up to 300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band, allowing multiple devices to stay connected with stable performance.</p><p>Equipped with 4 high-gain external antennas, the Cudy LT400 enhances signal strength, improves wireless coverage, and increases network stability. These antennas help establish stronger connections over longer distances while improving signal penetration through walls and obstacles, making the router suitable for larger spaces and areas with weaker mobile signals.</p><p>The router includes built-in PPTP and L2TP VPN Client support, enabling users to establish secure and encrypted internet connections for safer browsing, remote office access, and protected online communication. This feature is particularly useful for remote workers and businesses requiring secure network access.</p><p>The Cudy LT400 also supports multiple DDNS providers, allowing users to remotely manage and access their network even when the public IP address changes. With Dynamic DNS functionality, users can connect to the router administration interface through a custom domain name for convenient remote monitoring and management.</p><p>One of the key advantages of the Cudy LT400 is its dual connectivity capability, allowing the router to maintain both 4G LTE and WAN connections simultaneously. The router can prioritize wired internet access while automatically switching to the mobile network for backup connectivity, ensuring uninterrupted internet service during broadband outages.</p><p>Designed for simplicity and convenience, the router offers an easy setup process and user-friendly management interface suitable for both beginner and advanced users. Whether for home entertainment, remote work, online learning, or business operations, the Cudy LT400 4G SIM Supported Wireless Router provides dependable performance, flexible connectivity, and secure networking in one compact solution.</p><h2><strong>Buy Cudy LT400 4G 300 Mbps SIM Supported Wireless Router from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Cudy LT400 4G 300 Mbps SIM Supported Wireless Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide collection of genuine Cudy networking products and wireless routers at competitive prices. Order online or visit International Office Solution to get authentic products with reliable customer support and after-sales service. The Cudy LT400 Wireless Router comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>11b：1/2/5.5/11Mbps<br>11g：6/9/12/18/24/36/48/54Mbps<br>11n： 300Mbps（MAX）</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>Antenna: 2.4G（802.11N）：2T2R 4G ：2T2R<br>Gain: 5dBi<br>Range: 2.4-2.4835GHZ</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>3x RJ45 10M/100M LAN Ethernet interfaces<br>1 x RJ45 10M/100M WAN Ethernet interfaces<br>1 x Reset<br>1 x Power jack 12V 1A<br>1 x SIM (Standard)</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK、WPA/WPA2</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>CPU: MT7628DA/580MHz<br>DRAM/FLASH: 64MB DDR2/8M SPI</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>12V/1A European Standard</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Mbps Sim Supported', 4150.00, 4250.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/deIUsQLr6eH0ixb2R06aaeZ4dehVDvGtDJt49ix8.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 11:31:19', '2026-05-26 11:31:19', 'Cudy LT400 4G 300Mbps SIM Supported Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Cudy LT400 4G 300Mbps SIM Supported Wireless Router in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy fast 4G LTE connectivity, 4 high-gain antennas, VPN support, backup WAN, and stable wireless networking.', 'Cudy LT400, 4G SIM Router, Cudy LTE Router, 300Mbps Wireless Router, SIM Supported Router, Cudy 4G Router, LTE WiFi Router, VPN Wireless Router, Mobile Network Router, Cudy Router Bangladesh, International Office Solution', NULL, 208, NULL, NULL),
(168, 'Cudy WR3000 AX3000 Gigabit Dual Band Smart Wi-Fi 6 Router', 'The Cudy WR3000 AX3000 Gigabit Dual Band Smart Wi-Fi 6 Router is a high-performance networking solution designed for ultra-fast wireless connectivity, low latency, and seamless coverage. Featuring advanced Wi-Fi 6 technology, AX3000 dual-band speed, Gigabit ports, MU-MIMO, OFDMA, WPA3 security, VPN support, and Cudy Mesh compatibility, this router is ideal for gaming, 4K streaming, smart homes, and high-density device environments.', 'cudy-wr3000-ax3000-gigabit-dual-band-smart-wi-fi-6-router-1779795700', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Cudy WR3000 AX3000 Gigabit Dual Band Smart Wi-Fi 6 Router</strong></h2><p>The Cudy WR3000 AX3000 Gigabit Dual Band Smart Wi-Fi 6 Router is a next-generation networking device engineered to deliver exceptional wireless performance, wider coverage, and enhanced network efficiency for modern homes and offices. Equipped with the latest Wi-Fi 6 (802.11ax) technology, this router offers ultra-fast dual-band connectivity with combined wireless speeds of up to AX3000, ensuring smooth online gaming, 4K/8K streaming, cloud applications, video conferencing, and high-speed downloads.</p><p>Powered by a Dual-Core ARM Cortex-A53 processor running at 1.3GHz, the Cudy WR3000 provides stable and responsive network performance even when multiple devices are connected simultaneously. The router delivers speeds of up to 2402Mbps on the 5GHz band and up to 574Mbps on the 2.4GHz band, enabling users to enjoy lag-free performance across bandwidth-intensive applications while maintaining reliable coverage for everyday internet tasks.</p><p>The advanced Wi-Fi 6 architecture incorporates OFDMA and MU-MIMO technologies, significantly improving network capacity and allowing multiple devices to communicate efficiently with the router at the same time. These technologies reduce congestion, improve responsiveness, and deliver smoother connectivity in high-density environments such as smart homes and busy offices.</p><p>To further enhance wireless coverage and signal stability, the Cudy WR3000 features Beamforming technology and four fixed high-performance omnidirectional antennas. Beamforming intelligently detects connected devices and directs wireless signals toward them, improving coverage, signal strength, and overall network efficiency while minimizing dead zones.</p><p>The router includes multiple Gigabit WAN and LAN ports for ultra-fast wired connectivity, making it suitable for gaming consoles, desktop PCs, NAS systems, IPTV devices, and smart TVs. Its Gigabit networking capability ensures faster data transfer speeds and stable wired performance for demanding tasks.</p><p>For advanced security and remote networking functionality, the Cudy WR3000 supports WPA3 wireless encryption, providing stronger protection against unauthorized access and brute-force attacks. The router also includes built-in VPN server and VPN client support, enabling secure remote access and encrypted internet connections for improved privacy and safe online communication.</p><p>The Cudy WR3000 is compatible with Cudy Mesh technology, allowing users to expand wireless coverage by connecting additional compatible mesh devices for seamless roaming throughout the home or office. This ensures uninterrupted internet connectivity while moving between different areas.</p><p>Additional advanced features such as DNS encryption, easy web-based management, parental controls, and intelligent networking tools make the Cudy WR3000 a versatile and future-ready solution for modern networking needs.</p><p>Whether for online gaming, remote work, smart home integration, or high-speed streaming, the Cudy WR3000 AX3000 Gigabit Dual Band Smart Wi-Fi 6 Router delivers powerful performance, advanced security, and dependable connectivity.</p><p>Buy Cudy WR3000 AX3000 Gigabit Dual Band Smart Wi-Fi 6 Router from International Office Solution In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Cudy WR3000 AX3000 Gigabit Dual Band Smart Wi-Fi 6 Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of genuine Cudy networking devices and Wi-Fi 6 routers at competitive prices. Order online or visit International Office Solution to get authentic products with reliable customer support and after-sales service. The Cudy WR3000 AX3000 Smart Wi-Fi 6 Router comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>2402 Mbps (5 GHz), 574 Mbps (2.4 GHz)<br>Compatible with 802.11a/b/g/n/ac Wi-Fi standards</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4 × Fixed Omnidirectional Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS Button, Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>5 GHz, 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Enable/Disable Wireless Radio, WMM</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1 × 10/100/1000 Mbps WAN Port<br>3 × 10/100/1000 Mbps LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11ax/ac/n/a 5 GHz<br>IEEE 802.11ax/n/b/g 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WEP, WPA/WPA2, WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK, WPA3</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>MU-MIMO, Beamforming<br>Converge : Open Area Covers Up to 2500ft</td></tr><tr><td>Operating System Support</td><td>Microsoft Windows, macOS, NetWare, UNIX or Linux</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>200 × 117 × 35 mm<br>7.87 × 4.61 × 1.38 inch<br>(Antennas not included)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Gigabit Dual Band Smart', 4650.00, 4750.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/eaAwT2mR0IkanR9imQdykkdSvCvmgjuCiya0FyvB.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 11:41:40', '2026-05-26 11:41:40', 'Cudy WR3000 AX3000 Wi-Fi 6 Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Cudy WR3000 AX3000 Gigabit Dual Band Smart Wi-Fi 6 Router in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy ultra-fast Wi-Fi 6 speed, mesh support, Gigabit ports, VPN features, WPA3 security, and seamless coverage.', 'Cudy WR3000, AX3000 WiFi 6 Router, Cudy WiFi Router, Dual Band Gigabit Router, Smart WiFi Router, WiFi 6 Router Bangladesh, Cudy Mesh Router, VPN Router, WPA3 Router, Cudy Router Price, International Office Solution', NULL, 208, NULL, NULL),
(169, 'Cudy M1200 AC1200 Dual Band Mesh Router (2 Pack)', 'The Cudy M1200 AC1200 Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router (2 Pack) is a reliable dual-band mesh networking system designed to provide seamless WiFi coverage across larger homes and offices. Featuring combined wireless speeds up to 1200Mbps, Gigabit Ethernet ports, mesh technology, VPN support, and dual operating modes, this router system delivers stable and high-speed connectivity for streaming, gaming, online classes, and smart home applications.', 'cudy-m1200-ac1200-dual-band-mesh-router-2-pack-1779796050', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Cudy M1200 AC1200 Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router (2 Pack)</strong></h2><p>The Cudy M1200 AC1200 Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router (2 Pack) is a powerful mesh networking solution designed to eliminate dead zones and provide stable, high-speed wireless coverage throughout your home or office. Built with advanced mesh technology, the two-pack system creates a unified wireless network that ensures seamless roaming and uninterrupted internet connectivity as users move between rooms and floors.</p><p>Powered by 16MB Flash memory and 128MB DDR3 RAM, each Cudy M1200 unit delivers efficient and stable network performance even when multiple devices are connected simultaneously. The router supports dual-band WiFi with combined wireless speeds of up to 1200Mbps. The 2.4GHz band provides wider wireless coverage and reliable connectivity for everyday internet activities such as browsing, email, and smart home devices, while the 5GHz band delivers speeds up to 867Mbps, ideal for online gaming, 4K streaming, HD video conferencing, and large file downloads.</p><p>Each unit is equipped with 2 x Gigabit Ethernet ports, allowing ultra-fast wired connections for desktop computers, gaming consoles, smart TVs, NAS devices, IPTV systems, and other network-enabled devices. The built-in internal omni-directional antennas enhance wireless signal penetration through walls and obstacles, ensuring broader coverage and stable performance across larger spaces.</p><p>The Cudy M1200 functions as both a WiFi Router and an Access Point, offering flexible networking options for different environments. In Router Mode, it directly connects to your internet service provider and distributes internet access to all connected devices. In Access Point Mode, it works with an existing modem or router to extend wireless coverage while handling efficient data forwarding.</p><p>For enhanced online security and remote networking, the Cudy M1200 includes built-in PPTP and L2TP VPN Client support, allowing users to establish encrypted and secure connections to remote VPN servers. This feature is especially useful for remote work, business connectivity, and secure internet access.</p><p>The router system also supports Dynamic DNS (DDNS), enabling users to bind their changing public IP address to a custom domain name for easier remote access and network management. Even if the IP address changes, users can still remotely access their network conveniently.</p><p>With easy installation, stable mesh performance, dual-band connectivity, and advanced networking features, the Cudy M1200 AC1200 Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router (2 Pack) is an ideal choice for users seeking reliable whole-home wireless coverage and uninterrupted internet connectivity.</p><h2><strong>Buy Cudy M1200 AC1200 Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router (2 Pack) from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Cudy M1200 AC1200 Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router (2 Pack) from International Office Solution. We offer a wide collection of genuine Cudy networking devices and mesh WiFi systems at competitive prices. Order online or visit International Office Solution to get authentic products with dependable customer support and after-sales service. The Cudy M1200 AC1200 Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router (2 Pack) comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>867Mbps (5GHz), 300Mbps (2.4GHz)<br>Compatible with 802.11a/b/g/n/ac Wi-Fi standards</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2 × Internal Omni-Directional Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Pair Button, Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>5 GHz, 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Wireless Modes: Enable/Disable Wireless Radio, WMM<br>Wireless Security: WEP, WPA/WPA2, WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1 × 100/10Mbps WAN Port<br>1 × 100/10Mbps LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11/ac/n/a 5GHz<br>IEEE 802.11/n/b/g 2.4GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Flash: 128Mbit (16MB)<br>DDR: 1Gbit (128MB)</td></tr><tr><td>Operating System Support</td><td>Microsoft Windows 98SE/ NT/ 2000/ XP/ Vista/ 7/ 8/ 8.1/ 10, MAC OS, NetWare, UNIX or Linux</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>12V/1A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 4800.00, 4900.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/PWfRnnRqzTKre7x0MfMd5ysNnui7Ziqe3Es1Mvzy.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 11:47:31', '2026-05-26 11:47:31', 'Cudy M1200 AC1200 Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router (2 Pack) Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Cudy M1200 AC1200 Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router (2 Pack) in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy seamless mesh WiFi coverage, dual-band speed, Gigabit ports, VPN support, and stable high-speed connectivity.', 'Cudy M1200, AC1200 Mesh Router, Whole Home Mesh WiFi, Cudy Mesh WiFi, Dual Band Router, Gigabit WiFi Router, Mesh Router Bangladesh, VPN WiFi Router, Cudy Router Price, Wireless Mesh System, International Office Solution', NULL, 208, NULL, NULL);
