(170, 'Cudy WR3000S AX3000 Dual Band Gigabit Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router', 'The Cudy WR3000S AX3000 Dual Band Gigabit Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router is a high-performance networking solution designed for modern homes and businesses. Featuring ultra-fast AX3000 Wi-Fi 6 speed, dual-band connectivity, Gigabit Ethernet ports, mesh support, beamforming technology, and powerful signal coverage, this router ensures smooth streaming, gaming, video conferencing, and stable multi-device connectivity.', 'cudy-wr3000s-ax3000-dual-band-gigabit-wi-fi-6-mesh-router-1779797138', '<h2>Cudy WR3000S AX3000 Dual Band Gigabit Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router</h2><p>The Cudy WR3000S AX3000 Dual Band Gigabit Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router is an advanced wireless networking solution built to deliver ultra-fast internet performance, reliable connectivity, and extended wireless coverage for modern digital environments. Designed with the latest Wi-Fi 6 technology, this router provides improved speed, lower latency, higher device capacity, and enhanced network efficiency, making it ideal for smart homes, gaming setups, offices, and high-density wireless environments.</p><p>Powered by a 1.3GHz dual-core ARM Cortex-A53 processor, along with 256MB DDR3 RAM and 128MB NAND storage, the Cudy WR3000S delivers smooth multitasking and stable network performance even under heavy workloads. It supports dual-band wireless connectivity with combined speeds of up to 3000Mbps, including up to 2402Mbps on the 5GHz band and 574Mbps on the 2.4GHz band. This allows users to enjoy seamless 4K/8K streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, large file transfers, and uninterrupted browsing experiences.</p><p>The router features four fixed high-gain antennas with up to 5.3dBi gain, ensuring strong signal transmission and broad wireless coverage. Advanced Beamforming technology intelligently directs wireless signals toward connected devices for improved signal strength and network stability. Integrated FEM and PA/LNA components further enhance wireless performance and help maintain stable connectivity even through walls and obstacles.</p><p>With an outdoor coverage range of up to 220 meters, the Cudy WR3000S is designed to provide dependable Wi-Fi performance across large homes, offices, and multi-room environments. It can efficiently penetrate multiple wooden walls or concrete barriers while minimizing signal loss.</p><p>The router includes five Gigabit Ethernet ports, consisting of one WAN port and four LAN ports, enabling high-speed wired connections for gaming consoles, desktop PCs, NAS devices, IPTV systems, and smart TVs. These Gigabit ports ensure stable and ultra-fast wired networking performance for bandwidth-intensive applications.</p><p>The Cudy WR3000S supports mesh networking technology, allowing users to connect multiple compatible Cudy mesh devices to create a seamless whole-home Wi-Fi system with uninterrupted roaming and extended coverage. This makes it an ideal networking solution for larger spaces requiring stable connectivity in every corner.</p><p>Additional convenient features include a WPS button for quick wireless pairing, a reset button for easy troubleshooting, and LED indicators for system, internet, WPS, and wireless status monitoring. The router operates with low power consumption of up to 7.5W, making it both energy-efficient and reliable for long-term use.</p><p>Whether for remote work, smart home integration, online gaming, streaming, or professional networking needs, the Cudy WR3000S AX3000 Dual Band Gigabit Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router delivers powerful performance, strong coverage, and dependable connectivity with the latest wireless technology.</p><h2>Buy Cudy WR3000S AX3000 Dual Band Gigabit Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router from International Office Solution</h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Cudy WR3000S AX3000 Dual Band Gigabit Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide collection of genuine Cudy networking products and Wi-Fi 6 routers at competitive prices. Order online or visit International Office Solution to get authentic products with dependable customer support and after-sales service. The Cudy WR3000S AX3000 Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>5 GHz Wi-Fi Speed: 2402 Mbps<br>2.4 GHz Wi-Fi Speed: 574 Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4 × Fixed Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS Button, Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>5 GHz, 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>Gigabit RJ45 Ports: 5<br>Ethernet Notes: 1× WAN port, the rest are LAN ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>Wi-Fi 6</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>4-Stream Dual-Band Wi-Fi 6<br>200 Connected Devices<br>Covers 130 m² (1,400 ft²)<br>Cudy Mesh, VPN Server and Client<br>Cudy App, Cloud Control<br>Converge : Open Area Covers Up to 2500ft</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>304×268×54 mm<br>11.97×10.55×2.13 inches</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band Gigabit Wi-Fi 6 Mesh', 4800.00, 4900.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/DHjXyxxo0iEf1CsX9ajpEUmCb1OoqfQ6C9aCd5fw.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 12:05:38', '2026-05-26 12:05:38', 'Cudy WR3000S AX3000 Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Cudy WR3000S AX3000 Dual Band Gigabit Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy ultra-fast AX3000 speed, mesh coverage, Gigabit ports, beamforming, and reliable Wi-Fi 6 connectivity.', 'Cudy WR3000S, AX3000 WiFi 6 Router, Dual Band Mesh Router, Gigabit WiFi Router, Cudy Mesh WiFi, WiFi 6 Router Bangladesh, Smart WiFi Router, Beamforming Router, Cudy Router Price, International Office Solution', NULL, 208, NULL, NULL),
(171, 'Cudy M3000 AX3000 2.5G Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router (1 Pack)', 'The Cudy M3000 AX3000 2.5G Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router (1 Pack) is a high-performance mesh networking solution designed for ultra-fast internet connectivity, seamless coverage, and modern smart networking. Featuring AX3000 Wi-Fi 6 speed, a powerful dual-core processor, 2.5Gbps WAN port, advanced security, VPN support, and mesh technology, this router is ideal for gaming, 4K streaming, remote work, and multi-device environments.', 'cudy-m3000-ax3000-25g-dual-band-wi-fi-6-mesh-router-1-pack-1779797722', '<h2>Cudy M3000 AX3000 2.5G Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router (1 Pack)</h2><p>The Cudy M3000 AX3000 2.5G Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router is a powerful and future-ready networking device built to deliver exceptional wireless speed, stable connectivity, and seamless whole-home coverage. Designed with advanced Wi-Fi 6 technology, this mesh router provides enhanced network efficiency, reduced latency, and superior multi-device performance, making it perfect for modern homes, smart offices, and demanding online applications.</p><p>Powered by a 1.3GHz Dual-Core ARM Cortex-A53 processor, along with 128MB Flash memory and 256MB DDR RAM, the Cudy M3000 delivers smooth multitasking and reliable network management even under heavy workloads. The router supports dual-band wireless connectivity with combined speeds of up to AX3000, including up to 2402Mbps on the 5GHz band and up to 574Mbps on the 2.4GHz band. This ensures fast and stable performance for online gaming, 4K/8K video streaming, cloud applications, large file transfers, video conferencing, and smart home connectivity.</p><p>The Cudy M3000 features five internal omnidirectional antennas designed to maximize wireless coverage and signal stability throughout your home or office. Support for multiple channel bandwidths including 20MHz, 40MHz, 80MHz, and 160MHz further enhances wireless throughput and network efficiency for high-speed devices.</p><p>For high-speed wired networking, the router includes a 2.5Gbps WAN port and a Gigabit LAN port, enabling ultra-fast internet access and reliable wired connections for gaming PCs, NAS storage, IPTV systems, desktop computers, and other high-bandwidth devices.</p><p>To improve wireless performance and connectivity in crowded network environments, the Cudy M3000 incorporates advanced technologies such as OFDMA, MU-MIMO, and Beamforming. These technologies optimize data transmission, reduce latency, improve signal targeting, and allow multiple devices to communicate efficiently with the router simultaneously.</p><p>Security is a key strength of the Cudy M3000, offering comprehensive wireless protection through WEP, WPA/WPA2, WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK, and the latest WPA3 encryption standards. These security protocols help protect the network from unauthorized access and cyber threats while ensuring safe internet usage.</p><p>The router also supports multiple VPN client protocols including PPTP, L2TP, OpenVPN, WireGuard, and IPsec, allowing users to establish secure remote connections, protect online privacy, and safely access remote networks.</p><p>With mesh networking capability, the Cudy M3000 can work with compatible mesh devices to create a seamless whole-home Wi-Fi system with uninterrupted roaming and extended wireless coverage. Its modern design, efficient cooling, and user-friendly management interface make installation and network control simple for all users.</p><p>Whether for smart home networking, remote work, gaming, or business use, the Cudy M3000 AX3000 2.5G Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router delivers outstanding speed, reliable performance, advanced security, and flexible connectivity for demanding networking environments.</p><h2>Buy Cudy M3000 AX3000 2.5G Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router from International Office Solution</h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Cudy M3000 AX3000 2.5G Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of genuine Cudy networking devices and Wi-Fi 6 mesh routers at competitive prices. Order online or visit International Office Solution to get authentic products with reliable customer support and after-sales service. The Cudy M3000 AX3000 Mesh Router comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>1201 Mbps (5 GHz), 574 Mbps (2.4 GHz)<br>Compatible with 802.11a/b/g/n/ac/ax Wi-Fi standards</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>5 × Internal Omnidirectional Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Pair Button, Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>5 GHz, 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1 × 2.5Gbps WAN Port<br>1 × 10/100/1000Mbps LAN Port</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11ax/ac/n/a 5GHz<br>IEEE 802.11ax/n/b/g 2.4GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Processor: 1.3GHz Dual Core Cortex-A53 Processor<br>Flash: 1Gbit (128MB)<br>DDR: 2Gbit (256MB)</td></tr><tr><td>Operating System Support</td><td>Microsoft Windows 98SE/NT/2000/XP/Vista/7/8/8.1/10, MAC OS, NetWare, UNIX or Linux</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>12V/1A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh', 5400.00, 5500.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/uXGnljOtMEYgjRecSage9hVAqDVhsGPwGRVTjpAA.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 12:15:22', '2026-05-26 12:15:22', 'Cudy M3000 AX3000 2.5G Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Cudy M3000 AX3000 2.5G Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy ultra-fast AX3000 speed, 2.5G WAN, mesh coverage, VPN support, and advanced Wi-Fi 6 connectivity.', 'Cudy M3000, AX3000 Mesh Router, WiFi 6 Router, 2.5G Router, Dual Band Mesh WiFi, Gigabit Router, Cudy Mesh Router, VPN WiFi Router, WiFi 6 Bangladesh, Cudy Router Price, International Office Solution', NULL, 208, NULL, NULL),
(172, 'Cudy LT400 Outdoor 300Mbps 4G WiFi Router (SIM Supported)', 'The Cudy LT400 Outdoor 300Mbps 4G WiFi Router is a weatherproof SIM-supported networking solution designed for stable outdoor internet connectivity. Featuring 4G LTE support, IP65 protection, 300Mbps WiFi speed, beamforming antennas, PoE support, and long-range wireless coverage, this router is ideal for outdoor surveillance, farms, parks, construction sites, and remote locations.', 'cudy-lt400-outdoor-300mbps-4g-wifi-router-sim-supported-1779797934', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Cudy LT400 Outdoor 300Mbps 4G WiFi Router (SIM Supported)</strong></h2><p>The Cudy LT400 Outdoor 300Mbps 4G WiFi Router is a durable and high-performance outdoor networking device built to provide stable wireless internet connectivity in challenging environments. Designed for outdoor deployment, this router combines 4G LTE mobile networking, weather-resistant construction, and long-range wireless coverage to deliver dependable internet access in remote areas, outdoor workplaces, farms, parks, surveillance systems, and business environments.</p><p>Built with an IP65-rated weatherproof enclosure, the Cudy LT400 Outdoor Router is engineered to withstand dust, rain, heat, and harsh outdoor conditions. It operates efficiently in extreme temperatures ranging from -40°C to 65°C and includes 4kV surge protection for enhanced durability and protection against electrical surges, making it suitable for long-term outdoor installation.</p><p>Powered by advanced 4G LTE Cat.4 technology, the router supports download speeds of up to 150Mbps and upload speeds of up to 50Mbps, ensuring fast and reliable internet connectivity wherever mobile network coverage is available. Simply insert a Nano SIM card to create a stable wireless network without requiring traditional broadband infrastructure.</p><p>The Cudy LT400 Outdoor Router delivers wireless speeds of up to 300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band and utilizes 2×2 MIMO technology along with built-in beamforming antennas to improve signal strength, wireless stability, and network coverage. With a maximum wireless range of up to 170 meters, the router is ideal for wide outdoor spaces where consistent connectivity is required.</p><p>Supporting multiple cellular frequency bands including LTE-FDD, LTE-TDD, and WCDMA, the router ensures broad compatibility across different mobile networks and regions. The device is available in regional variants optimized for Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and North America.</p><p>The router includes a Fast Ethernet port with passive PoE support, allowing both power and data transmission through a single Ethernet cable for easier outdoor installation and flexible deployment options.</p><p>For enhanced wireless security, the Cudy LT400 Outdoor supports WPA, WPA2, and WPA3 encryption protocols to protect the network from unauthorized access and ensure secure internet usage. It can support up to 30 connected devices simultaneously, making it suitable for homes, outdoor offices, security systems, temporary setups, and remote monitoring applications.</p><p>With rugged outdoor protection, reliable 4G connectivity, long-range wireless coverage, and easy SIM-based internet access, the Cudy LT400 Outdoor 300Mbps 4G WiFi Router is an excellent solution for users requiring dependable outdoor networking performance.</p><h2><strong>Buy Cudy LT400 Outdoor 300Mbps 4G WiFi Router from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Cudy LT400 Outdoor 300Mbps 4G WiFi Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide collection of genuine Cudy networking devices and outdoor wireless solutions at competitive prices. Order online or visit International Office Solution to get authentic products with reliable customer support and after-sales service. The Cudy LT400 Outdoor 4G WiFi Router comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>300 Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2× Internal Wi-Fi Antennas<br>2× External Detachable 4G Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1× Fast Ethernet Port (PoE In)<br>1× Nano SIM Slot</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>Wi-Fi 4</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>IP65, -40~65°C (-40~149°F), 4kV Surge<br>4G Cat. 4 with Max 150 Mbps DL<br>30 Connected Devices<br>24V Passive PoE<br>VPN Server and Client</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>Device Body:<br>240×100×53.7 mm<br>9.45×3.94×2.11 inches<br>Each Antenna:<br>197.5×21.6×15.5 mm<br>7.78×0.85×0.61 inches</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>420 g (14.82 oz.)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Outdoor SIM Supported', 5600.00, 5700.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/MVYowfNa2SHgdRc2ZaXsuVnDmpTXnE58Iz20IHnH.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 12:18:54', '2026-05-26 12:18:54', 'Cudy LT400 Outdoor 300Mbps 4G WiFi Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Cudy LT400 Outdoor 300Mbps 4G WiFi Router in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy IP65 weatherproof protection, 4G LTE connectivity, long-range WiFi coverage, PoE support, and SIM-based internet access.', 'Cudy LT400 Outdoor, Outdoor 4G Router, SIM Supported Router, 4G WiFi Router, Outdoor WiFi Router, LTE Outdoor Router, 300Mbps Router, PoE Router, Weatherproof Router, Cudy Router Bangladesh, International Office Solution', NULL, 208, NULL, NULL),
(173, 'Cudy M1300 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Mesh Router (2 Pack)', 'The Cudy M1300 AC1200 Gigabit Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router (2 Pack) is a dual-band mesh networking solution designed to provide seamless wireless coverage for homes and offices. Featuring combined wireless speeds up to 1200Mbps, Gigabit Ethernet ports, mesh technology, VPN support, and flexible router/access point modes, this system ensures stable and high-speed internet connectivity for streaming, gaming, online meetings, and smart home devices.', 'cudy-m1300-ac1200-dual-band-gigabit-mesh-router-2-pack-1779798130', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Cudy M1300 AC1200 1200Mbps Gigabit Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router (2 Pack)</strong></h2><p>The Cudy M1300 AC1200 Gigabit Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router (2 Pack) is an advanced wireless networking solution designed to deliver seamless WiFi coverage, reliable connectivity, and high-speed internet performance throughout your home or office. Utilizing intelligent mesh technology, the two-pack system creates a unified wireless network that eliminates dead zones and provides uninterrupted internet access while moving between rooms and floors.</p><p>Powered by 16MB Flash memory and 128MB DDR3 RAM, each Cudy M1300 unit ensures stable network performance and smooth multi-device connectivity. The router supports dual-band wireless networking with combined speeds of up to 1200Mbps. The 2.4GHz frequency band offers broader coverage and stable connections for daily internet activities such as web browsing, social media, email communication, and smart home devices, while the 5GHz band delivers speeds up to 867Mbps for bandwidth-intensive tasks including online gaming, 4K UHD streaming, HD video conferencing, and fast downloads.</p><p>Each router unit comes equipped with 2 x Gigabit Ethernet ports, providing ultra-fast wired connections for desktop computers, gaming consoles, smart TVs, IPTV systems, and NAS storage devices. The built-in internal omni-directional antennas improve wireless signal penetration through walls and obstacles, ensuring stronger and more reliable coverage across larger areas.</p><p>The Cudy M1300 supports both Router Mode and Access Point Mode, giving users flexible networking options based on their requirements. In Router Mode, the system directly connects to the internet and distributes high-speed wireless connectivity to all connected devices. In Access Point Mode, it works with an existing modem or router to extend wireless coverage while efficiently forwarding network traffic.</p><p>For enhanced online security and remote access, the Cudy M1300 includes built-in PPTP and L2TP VPN Client support, allowing secure encrypted connections to remote VPN servers. This feature is useful for remote work, business communication, and secure browsing environments.</p><p>The router system also supports Dynamic DNS (DDNS), enabling users to bind their changing public IP address to a custom domain name for easier remote management and network access. Even if the IP address changes, users can still conveniently access their home or office network remotely.</p><p>With easy installation, seamless mesh roaming, dual-band connectivity, advanced security features, and stable wireless performance, the Cudy M1300 AC1200 Gigabit Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router (2 Pack) is an excellent choice for users seeking dependable whole-home WiFi coverage and uninterrupted internet access.</p><h2><strong>Buy Cudy M1300 AC1200 Gigabit Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router (2 Pack) from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Cudy M1300 AC1200 Gigabit Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router (2 Pack) from International Office Solution. We offer a wide collection of genuine Cudy routers and mesh networking solutions at competitive prices. Order online or visit International Office Solution to get authentic products with reliable customer support and after-sales service. The Cudy M1300 AC1200 Mesh Router (2 Pack) comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>867Mbps (5GHz), 300Mbps (2.4GHz)<br>Compatible with 802.11a/b/g/n/ac Wi-Fi standards</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2 × Internal Omni-Directional Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Pair Button, Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>5 GHz, 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Wireless Modes: Enable/Disable Wireless Radio, WMM</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1 × 1000/100/10Mbps WAN Port<br>1 × 1000/100/10Mbps LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11/ac/n/a 5GHz<br>IEEE 802.11/n/b/g 2.4GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WEP, WPA/WPA2, WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Flash: 128Mbit (16MB)<br>DDR: 1Gbit (128MB)</td></tr><tr><td>Operating System Support</td><td>Microsoft Windows 98SE/ NT/ 2000/ XP/ Vista/ 7/ 8/ 8.1/ 10, MAC OS, NetWare, UNIX or Linux</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>12V/1A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band Gigabit Mesh', 6060.00, 6060.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/0Mp9h2Ekq8QgxthiIxUXiDR2S2uTnLI0Tn8Dk5V0.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 12:22:10', '2026-05-26 12:22:10', 'Cudy M1300 AC1200 Mesh WiFi Router (2 Pack) Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Cudy M1300 AC1200 Gigabit Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router (2 Pack) in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy seamless mesh coverage, dual-band speed, Gigabit ports, VPN support, and reliable connectivity.', 'Cudy M1300, AC1200 Mesh Router, Whole Home Mesh WiFi, Dual Band Router, Gigabit Mesh WiFi, Cudy Mesh Router, VPN WiFi Router, Me