(174, 'Cudy LT500E AC1200 1200Mbps Dual Band SIM Router', 'The Cudy LT500E AC1200 Dual Band SIM Router is a high-speed 4G LTE networking solution designed for reliable mobile internet connectivity. Featuring dual-band Wi-Fi 5 technology, AC1200 wireless speed, SIM card support, beamforming, VPN functionality, and mesh compatibility, this router is ideal for streaming, gaming, remote work, and smart home networking.', 'cudy-lt500e-ac1200-1200mbps-dual-band-sim-router-1779798338', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Cudy LT500E AC1200 1200Mbps Dual Band SIM Router</strong></h2><p>The Cudy LT500E AC1200 Dual Band SIM Router is a powerful and versatile wireless networking solution built to deliver stable 4G LTE internet connectivity with fast dual-band Wi-Fi performance. Designed for homes, offices, remote workspaces, and areas without fixed broadband access, this router allows users to insert a Nano SIM card and instantly create a secure and high-speed wireless network.</p><p>Powered by advanced 4G LTE Cat.4 technology, the Cudy LT500E supports download speeds of up to 150Mbps on LTE-FDD networks and up to 130Mbps on LTE-TDD networks. It also supports upload speeds of up to 50Mbps and 30Mbps respectively, ensuring smooth internet performance for web browsing, HD streaming, online meetings, video calls, cloud applications, and remote work.</p><p>The router features advanced dual-band Wi-Fi 5 technology with combined wireless speeds of up to AC1200. It delivers up to 867Mbps on the 5GHz band for high-bandwidth activities such as online gaming, 4K streaming, and fast downloads, while the 2.4GHz band provides up to 300Mbps for broader wireless coverage and stable connectivity for daily internet usage and smart home devices.</p><p>Equipped with dual internal high-gain antennas for both frequency bands, the Cudy LT500E enhances signal strength, wireless stability, and coverage. Integrated Beamforming technology intelligently directs signals toward connected devices to improve wireless performance and reduce dead zones. The router offers a maximum wireless range of up to 170 meters and can effectively penetrate wooden and concrete walls for stable indoor coverage.</p><p>The Cudy LT500E includes four Fast Ethernet ports, including one configurable WAN/LAN port, allowing flexible wired networking options for desktop computers, smart TVs, gaming consoles, IPTV systems, and additional networking equipment.</p><p>For advanced network management and security, the router supports Cudy Mesh technology, enabling seamless whole-home Wi-Fi coverage when paired with compatible mesh devices. It also features built-in VPN server and VPN client functionality, providing secure remote access and encrypted internet connections for safer browsing and remote office connectivity.</p><p>Users can easily manage the network through the Cudy mobile application with cloud control support, enabling convenient remote monitoring, configuration, and troubleshooting. The router also includes practical hardware controls such as Power, WPS, and Reset buttons, along with LED indicators for internet status, Wi-Fi bands, LAN activity, WAN/LAN status, WPS activity, and cellular signal strength.</p><p>With advanced 2×2 MIMO technology, reliable LTE connectivity, dual-band wireless performance, and modern networking features, the Cudy LT500E AC1200 Dual Band SIM Router is an ideal solution for users seeking flexible, secure, and high-speed internet connectivity through mobile networks.</p><h2><strong>Buy Cudy LT500E AC1200 Dual Band SIM Router from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Cudy LT500E AC1200 Dual Band SIM Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of genuine Cudy networking products and SIM-supported routers at competitive prices. Order online or visit International Office Solution to get authentic products with reliable customer support and after-sales service. The Cudy LT500E AC1200 SIM Router co