(175, 'Cudy LT500 AC1200 Dual Band 4G WiFi Router With Sim Supported', 'The Cudy LT500 AC1200 Dual Band 4G WiFi Router with SIM Support is a versatile networking solution designed for fast mobile internet connectivity. Featuring 4G LTE Cat.4 technology, dual-band AC1200 WiFi, MU-MIMO, VPN support, beamforming, and cloud management, this router delivers stable and secure internet access for homes, offices, remote work, and travel.', 'cudy-lt500-ac1200-dual-band-4g-wifi-router-with-sim-supported-1779798620', '<h2><strong>Cudy LT500 AC1200 Dual Band 4G WiFi Router With SIM Supported</strong></h2><p>The Cudy LT500 AC1200 Dual Band 4G WiFi Router with SIM Supported is a high-performance wireless networking device designed to provide reliable internet connectivity through mobile networks. Ideal for homes, small offices, temporary workspaces, travel, surveillance systems, and remote locations, this router combines advanced 4G LTE technology with fast dual-band WiFi performance for smooth and uninterrupted online experiences.</p><p>Powered by 4G LTE Cat.4 technology, the Cudy LT500 supports download speeds of up to 150Mbps, allowing users to enjoy fast web browsing, HD video streaming, online meetings, gaming, and cloud applications without requiring fixed broadband connections. Simply insert a Nano SIM card to instantly create a stable wireless network wherever mobile network coverage is available.</p><p>The router features dual-band WiFi 5 technology with combined wireless speeds of up to AC1200, delivering up to 867Mbps on the 5GHz band and 300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band. The 5GHz band is ideal for high-bandwidth activities such as online gaming, 4K streaming, and large file transfers, while the 2.4GHz band provides wider coverage and stable connectivity for smart home devices and everyday internet tasks.</p><p>The Cudy LT500 incorporates advanced 4-stream MU-MIMO technology with two spatial streams per band, improving wireless efficiency, reducing network congestion, and ensuring stable connections for multiple devices simultaneously. It supports up to 128 connected devices, with optimal performance recommended for up to 40 active users.</p><p>Powered by a 580MHz single-core MIPS24KEC processor along with 128MB DDR2 RAM and 16MB NOR Flash storage, the router delivers reliable performance and stable system operation for daily networking tasks.</p><p>For enhanced mobile network reception, the router includes two fixed high-performance cellular antennas that help maintain stable 4G connectivity. Beamforming technology further improves signal direction and wireless coverage, offering a maximum range of up to 130 meters.</p><p>The Cudy LT500 features four Fast Ethernet ports, including one configurable WAN/LAN port, providing flexible wired connectivity for desktop PCs, gaming consoles, smart TVs, IPTV devices, and network storage systems. It also supports multiple operating modes including Cellular Router Mode, WiFi Router Mode, and WISP Mode, allowing flexible deployment based on user requirements.</p><p>Security and privacy are enhanced through support for WPA, WPA2, and WPA3 wireless encryption standards, as well as guest network functionality on both frequency bands. The router also supports advanced VPN protocols including OpenVPN, WireGuard, IPSec, L2TP, PPTP, and ZeroTier for secure remote access and protected internet usage.</p><p>Users can conveniently manage the network through cloud control and the Cudy mobile app, enabling features such as parental controls, device management, blacklist domains, usage monitoring, and scheduling. Additional physical controls include WPS and Reset buttons, along with LED indicators for system and network status.</p><p>With dependable 4G LTE connectivity, advanced wireless technology, flexible deployment options, and strong security features, the Cudy LT500 AC1200 Dual Band 4G WiFi Router with SIM Support is an ideal networking solution for users seeking fast, stable, and portable internet access.</p><h2><strong>Buy Cudy LT500 AC1200 Dual Band 4G WiFi Router With SIM Supported from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Cudy LT500 AC1200 Dual Band 4G WiFi Router with SIM Supported from International Office Solution. We offer a wide collection of genuine Cudy networking products and SIM-supported routers at competitive prices. Order online or visit International Office Solution to get authentic products with reliable customer support and after-sales service. The Cudy LT500 AC1200 Dual Band 4G WiFi Router comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"3\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>867 Mbps + 300 Mbps Wi-Fi<br>4G Cat. 4 with Max 150 Mbps DL</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2× Fixed</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS Button<br>Reset Button</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>5 GHz, 2.4 GHz</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>4x 10/100 Mbps RJ45 Ports</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>Wi-Fi 5</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>CPU: 580 MHZ Single-Core, MIPS24KEC<br>Flash/ROM: 16 MB (128 Mbit) NOR<br>DDR/RAM: 128 MB (1 Gbit) DDR2<br>1× Nano SIM Slot<br>Cudy Mesh, VPN Server and Client<br>Cudy App, Cloud Control</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>204.8×133.2×38.3 mm<br>8.06×5.24×1.51 inches</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>300.5 g (10.6 oz.)</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band 4G', 7000.00, 7100.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/JAPoGbAOt9wuYTkqIy9KObigQ82zpMyMGdfyJd1x.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 12: