(176, 'Cudy WR1200 AC1200 Dual Band WiFi Router', 'The Cudy WR1200 AC1200 Dual-Band Smart Wi-Fi Router is a reliable and high-speed networking solution designed for homes and small offices. Featuring dual-band AC1200 wireless speed, high-gain antennas, VPN support, Access Point mode, and strong signal coverage, this router delivers stable connectivity for streaming, gaming, online meetings, and everyday internet use.', 'cudy-wr1200-ac1200-dual-band-wifi-router-1779798946', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Cudy WR1200 AC1200 Dual-Band Smart Wi-Fi Router</strong></h2><p>The Cudy WR1200 AC1200 Dual-Band Smart Wi-Fi Router is a powerful and efficient wireless networking solution built to provide stable internet connectivity, wide wireless coverage, and smooth performance for modern homes and offices. Equipped with advanced dual-band Wi-Fi technology and a high-performance dual-core processor, this router ensures fast and reliable network performance for multiple connected devices.</p><p>Powered by a high-performance dual-core CPU along with 16MB Flash memory and 128MB DDR3 RAM, the Cudy WR1200 delivers stable operation and efficient data processing for daily networking tasks. The router supports dual-band wireless connectivity with combined speeds of up to AC1200, offering improved wireless performance for both regular and high-bandwidth applications.</p><p>The 2.4GHz frequency band provides extended wireless coverage and reliable connectivity for everyday internet activities such as browsing, social media, emails, and smart home devices. The 5GHz band delivers speeds of up to 867Mbps, making it ideal for online gaming, 4K video streaming, HD video conferencing, and large file downloads.</p><p>Equipped with four 5dBi high-gain external antennas, the Cudy WR1200 significantly improves wireless signal strength, network stability, and wall penetration. These antennas help establish stronger and more stable connections over greater distances, reducing dead zones and ensuring better Wi-Fi coverage throughout the home or office.</p><p>The router supports both Router Mode and Access Point Mode, providing flexible networking configurations based on user requirements. In Router Mode, it connects directly to the internet and distributes wireless access to connected devices. In Access Point Mode, it works alongside an existing modem or router to extend network coverage while forwarding data efficiently.</p><p>For enhanced online privacy and secure remote access, the Cudy WR1200 includes built-in PPTP and L2TP VPN Client support. This allows users to establish encrypted VPN connections for secure browsing, remote work access, and protected data transmission.</p><p>The router also supports Dynamic DNS (DDNS), enabling users to bind their changing public IP address to a custom domain name for easier remote access and network management. This feature makes it convenient to monitor and manage the network remotely even when the IP address changes.</p><p>Designed with user convenience in mind, the Cudy WR1200 offers an easy setup process, intuitive web-based management interface, and stable wireless performance for multiple connected devices. Whether for home entertainment, online learning, remote work, or everyday internet use, this router provides dependable connectivity and efficient network management.</p><h2><strong>Buy Cudy WR1200 AC1200 Dual-Band Smart Wi-Fi Router from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Cudy WR1200 AC1200 Dual-Band Smart Wi-Fi Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide collection of genuine Cudy networking products and wireless routers at competitive prices. Order online or visit International Office Solution to get authentic products with reliable customer support and after-sales service. The Cudy WR1200 AC1200 Router comes with a 1-year warrant</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>2.4 GHz: 300 Mbps<br>5 GHz: 867 Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4× 5dBi Fixed High Gain Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS Button, Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4 GHz, 5 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Transmission Distance: Indoor up to 100m, outdoor up to 300m (it is limited in an environment)</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>LAN 4x 10/100/ Auto MDI/MDIX RJ45 port<br>WAN 1x 10/100/ Auto MDI/MDIX RJ45 port</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>2.4GHz: IEEE802.11n, IEEE802.11g, IEEE 802.11b<br>5.0GHz: 802.11ac, IEEE 802.11n, IEEE 802.11a, IEEE802.3. IEEE802.3u, IEEE802.3ab</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>64/128-bits WEP, WPA/WPA2</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Modulation:<br>BPSK, QPSK, CCK and OFDM (BPSK/QPSK/16-QAM/ 64-QAM)<br><br>Receive Sensitivity@PER:<br>11ac: -68dBm@10% PER; 11a: -68dBm@10% PER; 11n: -70dBm@10% PER 11g: -72dBm@10% PER; 11b: -85dBm@8% PER</td></tr><tr><td>Operating System Support</td><td>Microsoft Windows 8 SE/ NT/ 2000/ XP/ Vista/ 7/ 8/ 8.1/ 10, MAC OS, NetWare, UNIX or Linux</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>204.8 x 137. 5 x 38. 3mm</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band', 2050.00, 2150.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/0DU8yMZvxb12Tn28tGOSpqshdbVeauza5Imv2hqy.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 12:35:46', '2026-05-26 12:36:34', 'Cudy WR1200 AC1200 Dual-Band Smart Wi-Fi Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Cudy WR1200 AC1200 Dual-Band Smart Wi-Fi Router in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy fast dual-band WiFi, high-gain antennas, VPN support, strong coverage, and stable wireless performance.', 'Cudy WR1200, AC1200 WiFi Router, Dual Band Router, Smart WiFi Router, Cudy