(177, 'Cudy M1200 AC1200 Dual Band Mesh Router (3 Pack)', 'The Cudy M1200 AC1200 Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router (3 Pack) is a reliable dual-band mesh networking system designed to provide seamless WiFi coverage across large homes and offices. Featuring AC1200 wireless speed, Gigabit Ethernet ports, mesh technology, VPN support, and flexible router/access point modes, this 3-pack system ensures stable and high-speed internet connectivity for streaming, gaming, online classes, and smart home devices.', 'cudy-m1200-ac1200-dual-band-mesh-router-3-pack-1779799184', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Cudy M1200 AC1200 Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router (3 Pack)</strong></h2><p>The Cudy M1200 AC1200 Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router (3 Pack) is an advanced mesh networking solution designed to eliminate dead zones and provide strong, uninterrupted wireless coverage throughout large homes, apartments, and office spaces. With intelligent mesh technology, the three-unit system creates a unified wireless network that allows seamless roaming and stable connectivity while moving between rooms and floors.</p><p>Each Cudy M1200 unit is powered by 16MB Flash memory and 128MB DDR3 RAM, ensuring smooth network performance and reliable connectivity for multiple devices simultaneously. The router system supports dual-band wireless networking with combined speeds of up to AC1200, making it ideal for modern internet usage including HD streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, remote work, and smart home connectivity.</p><p>The 2.4GHz frequency band provides wider coverage and stable performance for everyday internet activities such as web browsing, email communication, and smart device connectivity. The 5GHz band delivers speeds of up to 867Mbps, enabling smooth 4K streaming, online gaming, large file transfers, and bandwidth-intensive applications.</p><p>Each router unit comes equipped with 2 x Gigabit Ethernet ports for ultra-fast wired connectivity. These ports are ideal for desktop PCs, gaming consoles, smart TVs, NAS storage devices, IPTV systems, and other wired networking equipment requiring stable high-speed performance.</p><p>The built-in internal omni-directional antennas enhance signal penetration through walls and obstacles, helping extend wireless coverage across larger areas. The mesh networking capability ensures that all units work together as a single network, automatically connecting devices to the strongest available signal for uninterrupted connectivity.</p><p>The Cudy M1200 supports both Router Mode and Access Point Mode for flexible deployment. In Router Mode, the system directly connects to the internet and distributes wireless connectivity to all devices. In Access Point Mode, it works alongside an existing modem or router to expand WiFi coverage while efficiently forwarding network traffic.</p><p>For enhanced online security and remote networking, the router system includes built-in PPTP and L2TP VPN Client support, enabling secure encrypted connections to remote VPN servers for safer browsing, remote work access, and secure communication.</p><p>The integrated Dynamic DNS (DDNS) feature allows users to bind their changing public IP address to a custom domain name, making remote network access and management more convenient even when the IP address changes.</p><p>With easy installation, seamless whole-home coverage, dual-band wireless performance, advanced networking features, and secure connectivity, the Cudy M1200 AC1200 Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router (3 Pack) is an excellent choice for users looking for dependable and scalable wireless networking.</p><h2><strong>Buy Cudy M1200 AC1200 Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router (3 Pack) from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Cudy M1200 AC1200 Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router (3 Pack) from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of genuine Cudy networking products and mesh WiFi systems at competitive prices. Order online or visit International Office Solution to get authentic products with dependable customer support and after-sales service. The Cudy M1200 AC1200 Mesh WiFi Router (3 Pack) comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>867Mbps (5GHz), 300Mbps (2.4GHz)<br>Compatible with 802.11a/b/g/n/ac Wi-Fi standards</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2 × Internal Omni-Directional Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Pair Button, Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>5 GHz, 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Wireless Modes: Enable/Disable Wireless Radio, WMM<br>Wireless Security: WEP, WPA/WPA2, WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1 × 100/10Mbps WAN Port<br>1 × 100/10Mbps LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11/ac/n/a 5GHz<br>IEEE 802.11/n/b/g 2.4GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Flash: 128Mbit (16MB)<br>DDR: 1Gbit (128MB)</td></tr><tr><td>Operating System Support</td><td>Microsoft Windows 98SE/ NT/ 2000/ XP/ Vista/ 7/ 8/ 8.1/ 10, MAC OS, NetWare, UNIX or Linux</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>12V/1A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band Mesh', 6799.99, 6900.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/RxgUwP52hksaGB92vRARUeEZAVyzXJZpfbU07GxM.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 12:39:44', '2026-05-26 12:39:44', 'Cudy M1200 AC1200 Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router (3 Pack) Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Cudy M1200 AC1200 Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router (3 Pack) in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy seamless mesh coverage, dual-band speed, Gigabit ports, VPN support, and stable wireless connectivity.', 'Cudy M1200, AC1200 Mesh Router, Whole Home Mesh WiFi, Dual Band Router, Mesh WiFi System, Gigabit WiFi Router, Cudy Mesh Router, VPN Router, Mesh Router Bangladesh, International Office Solution', NULL, 208, NULL, NULL);
