(178, 'Cudy WR1300 AC1200 Gigabit Dual Band Wi-Fi Router', 'The Cudy WR1300 AC1200 Gigabit Dual-Band Wi-Fi Router is a high-speed networking solution designed for homes and offices. Featuring dual-band AC1200 wireless performance, Gigabit Ethernet ports, high-gain antennas, VPN support, and Access Point mode, this router delivers stable and fast internet connectivity for streaming, gaming, online meetings, and smart home networking.', 'cudy-wr1300-ac1200-gigabit-dual-band-wi-fi-router-1779799392', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Cudy WR1300 AC1200 Gigabit Dual-Band Wi-Fi Router</strong></h2><p>The Cudy WR1300 AC1200 Gigabit Dual-Band Wi-Fi Router is a powerful and reliable wireless networking device built to deliver fast internet connectivity, strong wireless coverage, and smooth multi-device performance for modern homes and office environments. Designed with advanced dual-band Wi-Fi technology and Gigabit networking capability, this router ensures stable and high-speed internet access for streaming, gaming, remote work, and everyday online activities.</p><p>Powered by a high-performance dual-core processor with 16MB Flash memory and 128MB DDR3 RAM, the Cudy WR1300 provides efficient data processing and reliable networking performance even when multiple devices are connected simultaneously. The router supports dual-band wireless networking with combined speeds of up to AC1200, ensuring smooth wireless performance across different applications.</p><p>The 2.4GHz band provides extended wireless coverage and dependable connectivity for basic internet tasks such as browsing, email communication, and smart home devices. The 5GHz frequency band delivers speeds of up to 867Mbps, making it ideal for bandwidth-intensive activities including online gaming, HD and 4K video streaming, video conferencing, and fast file downloads.</p><p>Equipped with four 5dBi high-gain external antennas, the Cudy WR1300 significantly enhances wireless signal strength, sensitivity, and wall penetration. These antennas help create stable long-distance connections and improve Wi-Fi coverage throughout the home or office, reducing dead zones and ensuring consistent connectivity.</p><p>The router includes five Gigabit Ethernet ports, providing ultra-fast wired connections for desktop computers, gaming consoles, smart TVs, IPTV devices, NAS storage systems, and other wired networking equipment. Gigabit connectivity ensures faster data transfer speeds and stable wired network performance for demanding applications.</p><p>The Cudy WR1300 supports both Router Mode and Access Point Mode, allowing flexible deployment options based on user requirements. In Router Mode, it directly connects to the internet and distributes high-speed wireless connectivity to all devices. In Access Point Mode, the router works with an existing modem or router to extend wireless network coverage while forwarding data traffic efficiently.</p><p>For secure internet usage and remote access, the router features built-in PPTP and L2TP VPN Client support. This enables users to establish secure VPN connections for protected browsing, encrypted communication, and remote office access.</p><p>The router also includes Dynamic DNS (DDNS) support, allowing users to bind their changing public IP address to a custom domain name for easier remote management and network access. Even when the IP address changes, users can still access their network remotely using the assigned domain name.</p><p>With easy setup, stable wireless performance, advanced security features, and flexible networking options, the Cudy WR1300 AC1200 Gigabit Dual-Band Wi-Fi Router is an excellent choice for users seeking dependable high-speed internet connectivity and strong wireless coverage.</p><h2><strong>Buy Cudy WR1300 AC1200 Gigabit Dual-Band Wi-Fi Router from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Cudy WR1300 AC1200 Gigabit Dual-Band Wi-Fi Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide collection of genuine Cudy networking products and wireless routers at competitive prices. Order online or visit International Office Solution to get authentic products with reliable customer support and after-sales service. The Cudy WR1300 AC1200 Gigabit Router comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>867 Mbps (5 GHz), 300 Mbps (2.4 GHz)<br>Compatible with 802.11a/b/g/n/ac Wi-Fi standards</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4× Fixed Omni-Directional Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS Button, Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>5 GHz, 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Wireless Modes:<br>Enable/Disable Wireless Radio, WMM<br>WEP, WPA/WPA2,<br><br>Wireless Functions:<br>WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1× 1000/100/10 Mbps WAN Port<br>4× 1000/100/10 Mbps LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11ac/n/a 5 GHz<br>IEEE 802.11n/b/g 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Processor: Dual-Core CPU<br>Flash: 16MB<br>DDR: 128MB</td></tr><tr><td>Operating System Support</td><td>Microsoft Windows 8 SE/ NT/ 2000/ XP/ Vista/ 7/ 8/ 8.1/ 10, MAC OS, NetWare, UNIX or Linux</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>12 V / 1 A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>204.8 x 137. 5 x 38. 3mm</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Gigabit Dual Band', 2800.00, 2900.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/IS1rJctepU7qUN2l8mcGXej0E0rdGcOGSYsOOaZx.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 12:43:12', '2026-05-26 12:43:12', 'Cudy WR1300 AC1200 Gigabit Dual-Band Wi-Fi Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Cudy WR1300 AC1200 Gigabit Dual-Band Wi-Fi Router in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy fast dual-band WiFi, Gigabit ports, high-gain antennas, VPN support, and reliable wireless performance.', 'Cudy WR1300, AC1200 Gigabit Router, Dual Band WiFi Router, Cudy Wireless Router, Gigabit WiFi Router, VPN Router, High Gain Antenna Router, Cudy Router Bangladesh, Wireless Router Price, International Office Solution', NULL, 208, NULL, NULL),
(179, 'Cudy M3600 BE3600 Dual Band Wi-Fi 7 Mesh Router (1 Pack)', 'The Cudy M3600 BE3600 Dual Band Wi-Fi 7 Mesh Router (1 Pack) is a next-generation mesh networking solution designed for ultra-fast wireless performance, seamless coverage, and advanced security. Featuring Wi-Fi 7 technology, BE3600 dual-band speed, a quad-core processor, mesh networking, VPN support, and smart management features, this router is ideal for gaming, 8K streaming, smart homes, and high-density device environments.', 'cudy-m3600-be3600-dual-band-wi-fi-7-mesh-router-1-pack-1779799568', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Cudy M3600 BE3600 Dual Band Wi-Fi 7 Mesh Router (1 Pack)</strong></h2><p>The Cudy M3600 BE3600 Dual Band Wi-Fi 7 Mesh Router (1 Pack) is a high-performance networking device engineered to deliver next-generation wireless connectivity, exceptional speed, and stable whole-home coverage for modern digital lifestyles. Designed with advanced Wi-Fi 7 technology, this mesh router provides superior network efficiency, ultra-low latency, and seamless connectivity for homes, offices, and smart environments with multiple connected devices.</p><p>Powered by a robust 2.0 GHz Quad-Core ARM Cortex-A7 processor, combined with 512MB DDR3L RAM and 128MB NAND Flash storage, the Cudy M3600 ensures smooth multitasking, fast data processing, and reliable network performance even under heavy workloads. This powerful hardware configuration allows the router to efficiently manage bandwidth-intensive applications, simultaneous device connections, and high-speed data transmission.</p><p>The router supports advanced 4-Stream Dual-Band Wi-Fi 7 technology, delivering combined wireless speeds of up to BE3600. It offers blazing-fast speeds of up to 2882Mbps on the 5GHz band and up to 688Mbps on the 2.4GHz band, making it ideal for 8K video streaming, online gaming, cloud computing, video conferencing, VR applications, and large file transfers.</p><p>To maximize wireless efficiency and performance, the Cudy M3600 incorporates cutting-edge technologies such as MU-MIMO, OFDMA, Beamforming, and BSS Color. These advanced features improve data transmission efficiency, reduce network congestion, minimize interference, and ensure stable connections for multiple devices simultaneously.</p><p>Equipped with four internal high-performance antennas, the router delivers broad wireless coverage of up to 1900 square feet per unit, ensuring strong and stable signals throughout homes and office environments. The system supports up to 200 connected devices, making it highly suitable for smart homes, offices, IoT devices, and high-density networking environments.</p><p>The Cudy Mesh technology allows seamless whole-home networking with support for both wireless and wired backhaul connections. Users can expand coverage easily by adding compatible mesh units while maintaining a unified wireless network with uninterrupted roaming.</p><p>For wired networking, the router includes three Gigabit Ethernet ports consisting of one WAN port and two LAN ports, providing stable high-speed wired connectivity for gaming PCs, smart TVs, NAS systems, IPTV devices, and desktop computers.</p><p>Security and advanced networking management are key strengths of the Cudy M3600. It includes built-in VPN Server and VPN Client support for WireGuard, OpenVPN, and IPsec protocols, enabling secure remote access and encrypted internet connections. Additional security and management features include parental controls, QoS per-user bandwidth management, domain and IP filtering, advanced firewall protection, DNS-over-TLS encryption, IPv4/IPv6 compatibility, and IPTV VLAN support.</p><p>Users can easily manage and monitor the network through the intuitive Cudy mobile app or web management interface, allowing convenient remote control, device monitoring, security configuration, and network optimization.</p><p>Compact, energy-efficient, and feature-rich, the Cudy M3600 BE3600 Dual Band Wi-Fi 7 Mesh Router (1 Pack) is an ideal networking solution for users seeking ultra-fast wireless performance, advanced security, and reliable mesh coverage for demanding modern connectivity needs.</p><h2><strong>Buy Cudy M3600 BE3600 Dual Band Wi-Fi 7 Mesh Router (1 Pack) from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Cudy M3600 BE3600 Dual Band Wi-Fi 7 Mesh Router (1 Pack) from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of genuine Cudy networking products and Wi-Fi 7 mesh routers at competitive prices. Order online or visit International Office Solution to get authentic products with dependable customer support and after-sales service. The Cudy M3600 BE3600 Wi-Fi 7 Mesh Router comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>5 GHz Wi-Fi Speed: 2882 Mbps<br>2.4 GHz Wi-Fi Speed: 688 Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>Wi-Fi Antennas: 4× Internal<br>5 GHz Antenna Gain Max: 5.5dBi<br>2.4 GHz Antenna Gain Max: 5.4dBi</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS Button, Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>5 GHz, 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Wi-Fi Standards: Wi-Fi 7<br>Max Wi-Fi Modulation: 4K-QAM<br>Wi-Fi Efficiency:<br>- MLO<br>- MRU<br>- 4Puncturing<br>- OFDMA<br>- MU-MIMO<br>- BSS Color<br>Max Capacity: 512<br>Recommended Client Upper Limit: 200<br>Max Wi-Fi Channel Width: 160 MHz<br>Wi-Fi Security: WPA/WPA2/WPA3<br>Guest Network: 2.4 GHz, 5 GHz<br>WPS: True</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>Gigabit RJ45 Ports: 3<br>Ethernet Notes: 1× WAN port, the rest are LAN ports<br>Uplink Ethernet Ports:<br>1-Pack: 57×56×26 cm<br>22.44×22.05×10.24 inches<br>2-Pack: 55×54.5×35.3 cm<br>21.65×21.46×13.9 inches<br>3-Pack: 53.6×40×28.7 cm<br>21.1×15.75×11.3 inches<br>LED:<br>- System<br>- Speed/Link/ACT of Ethernet Port<br>Physical Buttons:<br>- WPS Button<br>- Reset Button<br>Power Input: DC Jack</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>QoS: Per-User Rate Limiting<br>DHCP:<br>- Address Reservation<br>- DHCP Client List<br>- Server<br>IP Versions: IPv4/IPv6<br>IPv6 Protocols:<br>- Relay<br>- Dynamic (SLAAC/DHCPv6)<br>- Static (Fixed IP)<br>- Passthrough<br>- 464XLAT<br>- MAP-E<br>- DS-Lite<br>IPTV/VLAN:<br>- Bridge<br>- Tag VLAN<br>- VoIP VLAN<br>- IPTV VLAN<br>TTL Customization:<br>- Extend<br>- Spoof<br>- Custom<br>IGMP:<br>- IGMP Proxy<br>- IGMP Snooping<br>Forwarding:<br>- Port Forwarding<br>- Port Triggering<br>- UPnP<br>- DMZ<br>Firewall:<br>- SPI Firewall<br>- DoS Protection<br>- Block PING<br>Application Layer Gateway:<br>- IPSec Passthrough<br>- L2TP Passthrough<br>- PPTP Passthrough<br>- FTP Passthrough<br>- TFTP Passthrough<br>- H323 Passthrough<br>- SIP Passthrough<br>- RTSP Passthrough</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>Gigabit RJ45 Ports: 3<br>Ethernet Notes: 1× WAN port, the rest are LAN ports</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Coverage Up to 1900 Sq ft<br>Processor: CPU Details: 2.0 GHz Quad-Core, ARM Cortex-A7<br>Memory/Storage<br>Flash/ROM: 128 MB (1 Gbit) NAND<br>DDR/RAM: 512 MB (4 Gbit) DDR3L<br><br>Operation Modes:<br>- Wi-Fi Router<br>- Access Point<br>- Range Extender<br>- WISP<br>- Client<br>Mesh: Cudy Mesh<br>Mesh Backhaul:<br>- Wireless Backhaul<br>- Wired Backhaul<br>Multi-Band Backhaul: True<br>WAN Mode:<br>- DHCP<br>- Static IP<br>- PPPOE<br>- PPTP<br>- L2TP<br>Internet Failover Sequence:<br>- WAN<br>- WISP<br><br>System:<br>LED Control: True<br>Local Control Method:<br>- Config Web Page<br>- App Control<br>Remote Control Method:<br>- Config Page via HTTPS<br>- App Control<br>- TR069/TR098/TR111/TR143/TR181<br>Firmware Upgrade:<br>- Local Update<br>- App (Over the Air)<br>- Online Update<br>Reliability:<br>- Timed Reboot<br>- Backup and Restore<br>Diagnostic Tools:<br>- Diagnosis<br>- Ping<br>- Traceroute<br>- NSLookup<br>- System Log<br>Languages:<br>- English<br>- Bengali<br>- Catalan<br>- Czech<br>- German<br>- Greek<br>- Spanish<br>- French<br>- Hebrew<br>- Croatian<br>- Hungarian<br>- Italian<br>- Japanese<br>- Khmer<br>- Korean<br>- Dutch<br>- Norwegian<br>- Polish<br>- Portuguese<br>- Romanian<br>- Russian<br>- Slovak<br>- Swedish<br>- Thai<br>- Turkish<br>- Ukrainian<br>- Vietnamese<br>- Simplified Chinese<br>- Traditional Chinese<br><br>Utilities:<br>VPN Server:<br>- WireGuard<br>- OpenVPN<br>- IPsec<br>- Zerotier<br>- PPTP<br>- L2TP<br>VPN Client:<br>- WireGuard<br>- OpenVPN<br>- IPsec<br>- Zerotier<br>- PPTP<br>- L2TP<br>DNS Options:<br>- DNS over TLS<br>- Manual DNS<br>- Rebind Protection<br>- Override Clients\' DNS<br>DNS over TLS Providers:<br>- Cloudflare<br>- Google<br>- Quad9<br>- Custom<br>Wake on LAN: True<br>Online Detection: True<br><br>Reliability<br>Environment:<br>- Operating Temperature: 0 ℃ ~ 40 ℃ (32 ℉ ~104 ℉)<br>- Storage Temperature: -40 ℃ ~ 70 ℃ (-40 ℉ ~ 158 ℉)<br>- Humidity: 10% ~ 90% non-condensing<br>- Storage Humidity: 5% ~ 95% non-condensing<br><br>Parental Controls: URL Blacklist, Time Schedule, Profiles, Client Management<br>Cudy Mesh, VPN Client, Cudy App, Cloud Control</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Power Methods: DC<br>DC Input: 12V 1A<br>Power Adapter:<br>- Input: 100 ~ 240 V, 50/60 Hz AC<br>- Output: 12V 1A DC<br>Max Power Consumption (W): 9W</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>Φ110×154.5 mm<br>Φ4.33×6.08 inches</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band Mesh', 7300.00, 7400.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/1DovWnXmaGWqfInd6sSVSN7gMG5a6IoFU3lryznI.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 12:46:08', '2026-05-26 12:46:08', 'Cudy M3600 BE3600 Dual Band Wi-Fi 7 Mesh Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Cudy M3600 BE3600 Dual Band Wi-Fi 7 Mesh Router in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy ultra-fast Wi-Fi 7 speed, mesh coverage, VPN support, advanced security, and seamless multi-device connectivity.', 'Cudy M3600, BE3600 Router, WiFi 7 Mesh Router, Dual Band Mesh WiFi, Cudy WiFi 7 Router, Mesh Router Bangladesh, VPN Mesh Router, Smart Home Router, High Speed WiFi Router, International Office Solution', NULL, 208, NULL, NULL),
(180, 'Cudy WR3600E BE3600 Gigabit Mesh Wi-Fi 7 Router', 'The Cudy WR3600E BE3600 Gigabit Mesh Wi-Fi 7 Router is a next-generation networking device designed for ultra-fast speeds, stable connections, and seamless mesh coverage. Featuring Wi-Fi 7 technology, BE3600 dual-band performance, a quad-core processor, Gigabit ports, advanced VPN support, and strong security features, this router is ideal for high-performance home and office networking.', 'cudy-wr3600e-be3600-gigabit-mesh-wi-fi-7-router-1779799725', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Cudy WR3600E BE3600 Gigabit Mesh Wi-Fi 7 Router</strong></h2><p>The Cudy WR3600E BE3600 Gigabit Mesh Wi-Fi 7 Router is a powerful and advanced networking solution built to deliver cutting-edge wireless performance, ultra-low latency, and stable connectivity for modern homes and businesses. Equipped with the latest Wi-Fi 7 technology and a high-performance hardware platform, this router ensures smooth operation even under heavy network usage and multiple connected devices.</p><p>At its core, the router is powered by a 2.0 GHz Quad-Core ARM Cortex-A7 processor with the Broadcom BCM6764 chipset, ensuring efficient data processing, stable performance, and reliable multitasking capabilities. This allows the router to handle high-bandwidth applications, simultaneous device connections, and advanced networking tasks with ease.</p><p>The Cudy WR3600E supports BE3600 dual-band Wi-Fi 7 technology, delivering impressive wireless speeds of up to 2882 Mbps on the 5GHz band and up to 688 Mbps on the 2.4GHz band. With support for 4K-QAM modulation, 160 MHz channel bandwidth, and Multi-Link Operation (MLO), the router significantly improves wireless efficiency, reduces latency, and enhances overall network responsiveness.</p><p>To ensure strong and stable coverage, the router features four high-gain fixed antennas along with advanced beamforming technology. This setup provides reliable wireless coverage of up to 130 square meters (approximately 1,400 square feet), making it suitable for apartments, homes, and small office environments.</p><p>The Cudy WR3600E includes four Gigabit Ethernet ports (one WAN and three LAN), allowing ultra-fast wired connections for gaming consoles, desktop PCs, smart TVs, NAS systems, and other high-speed network devices. These Gigabit ports ensure stable and high-performance wired networking for demanding applications.</p><p>Security and network protection are key strengths of the WR3600E. It includes a robust SPI firewall, DoS attack protection, VPN passthrough, and support for advanced VPN protocols such as WireGuard, OpenVPN, IPsec, and ZeroTier. These features provide secure remote access, encrypted communication, and safe internet usage.</p><p>The router also offers advanced network management features such as QoS per-user bandwidth control, MAC filtering, Wi-Fi scheduling, parental controls, and HTTPS remote management. Users can easily configure and monitor their network through a web-based interface or the Cudy mobile application.</p><p>Designed for efficiency and reliability, the Cudy WR3600E operates with low power consumption and is FCC and CE certified for safety and performance standards. Its compact desktop design makes it easy to install in any environment while maintaining strong wireless performance.</p><p>With next-generation Wi-Fi 7 technology, powerful hardware, advanced security, and seamless mesh capabilities, the Cudy WR3600E BE3600 Gigabit Mesh Wi-Fi 7 Router is an excellent choice for users who demand high-speed, stable, and future-ready internet connectivity.</p><h2><strong>Buy Cudy WR3600E BE3600 Gigabit Mesh Wi-Fi 7 Router from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Cudy WR3600E BE3600 Gigabit Mesh Wi-Fi 7 Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of genuine Cudy networking products and Wi-Fi 7 routers at competitive prices. Order online or visit International Office Solution to get authentic products with reliable customer support and after-sales service. The Cudy WR3600E Wi-Fi 7 Router comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>5 GHz Wi-Fi Speed: 2882 Mbps<br>2.4 GHz Wi-Fi Speed: 688 Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4 × Fixed Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS Button, Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>5 GHz, 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>5 GHz Wi-Fi Speed: 2882 Mbps<br>2.4 GHz Wi-Fi Speed: 688 Mbps<br>5 GHz Wi-Fi Streams: 2T2R (2×2 MIMO)<br>2.4 GHz Wi-Fi Streams: 2T2R (2×2 MIMO)<br>Wi-Fi Antennas: 4× Fixed<br>5 GHz Antenna Gain Max: 7.8dBi<br>2.4 GHz Antenna Gain Max: 5.2dBi<br><br>FEM or PA/LNA:<br>5 GHz: 2× External<br>2.4 GHz: 2× External<br><br>Beamforming: True<br><br>Range Performance:<br>Max: 220 m (722 ft)<br>Indoor WiFi range varies depending on the layout and wall materials. See Wall Performance spec for placement suggestions.<br><br>Wall Performance:<br>Two wooden walls with thickness &lt; 10 cm (4\'\')<br>One concrete wall with thickness &lt; 20 cm (7\'\') or two concrete walls with thickness &lt; 10 cm (4\'\')</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>Gigabit RJ45 Ports: 4<br>Ethernet Notes: 1× WAN port, the rest are LAN ports<br><br>LED:<br>System<br>Internet<br>2.4 GHz Wi-Fi<br>5 GHz Wi-Fi<br>WAN<br>LAN<br><br>Physical Buttons:<br>WPS Button<br>Reset Button<br><br>Power Input: DC Jack</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>QoS: Per-User Rate Limiting<br><br>DHCP:<br>Address Reservation<br>DHCP Client List<br>Server<br><br>IP Versions: IPv4/IPv6<br><br>IPv6 Protocols:<br>Relay<br>Dynamic (SLAAC/DHCPv6)<br>Static (Fixed IP)<br>Passthrough<br>464XLAT<br>MAP-E<br>DS-Lite<br><br>IPTV/VLAN:<br>Bridge<br>Tag VLAN<br>VoIP VLAN<br>IPTV VLAN<br><br>TTL Customization:<br>Extend<br>Spoof<br>Custom<br><br>IGMP:<br>IGMP Proxy<br>IGMP Snooping<br><br>Forwarding: