(181, 'Cudy WR3600 BE3600 Gigabit Wi-Fi 7 Mesh Router', 'The Cudy WR3600 BE3600 Gigabit Wi-Fi 7 Mesh Router is a next-generation dual-band networking device designed for ultra-fast wireless performance, stable connectivity, and wide coverage. Featuring Wi-Fi 7 technology, BE3600 speed, Gigabit Ethernet ports, mesh support, VPN features, and advanced security controls, it is ideal for high-density homes, offices, and gaming environments.', 'cudy-wr3600-be3600-gigabit-wi-fi-7-mesh-router-1779800100', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Cudy WR3600 BE3600 Gigabit Wi-Fi 7 Mesh Router</strong></h2><p>The Cudy WR3600 BE3600 Gigabit Wi-Fi 7 Mesh Router, also known as the Cudy WR3600 Router, is a powerful next-generation wireless networking solution built to deliver ultra-fast speeds, seamless connectivity, and stable performance for modern digital environments. Designed with advanced Wi-Fi 7 technology, this router ensures improved efficiency, reduced latency, and strong multi-device support for homes, offices, and smart environments.</p><p>This Cudy WR3600 Router delivers dual-band wireless speeds of up to 2882 Mbps on the 5GHz band and up to 688 Mbps on the 2.4GHz band. With support for 2×2 MIMO streams, beamforming technology, and advanced wireless optimization, it ensures strong signal strength, stable connections, and improved coverage across larger spaces. It is well-suited for gaming, 4K/8K streaming, video conferencing, and heavy internet usage across multiple devices.</p><p>Powered by a 2.0 GHz Quad-Core ARM Cortex-A7 processor and the Broadcom BCM6764 chipset, the router delivers reliable performance and smooth data handling even under heavy network loads. This hardware combination ensures efficient multitasking and stable operation for high-demand networking tasks.</p><p>The Cudy WR3600 includes five Gigabit Ethernet ports, providing high-speed wired connectivity for desktops, gaming consoles, smart TVs, NAS storage devices, and other wired network equipment. These ports ensure consistent and ultra-fast data transfer performance for critical applications.</p><p>To enhance wireless coverage, the router is equipped with four high-gain fixed antennas along with an external FEM module, ensuring strong and stable signal transmission across wide areas. This design helps eliminate dead zones and maintain consistent connectivity even in multi-room environments.</p><p>The Cudy WR3600 Mesh Router includes advanced networking features such as VPN Server and VPN Client support, allowing secure remote access through protocols like WireGuard, OpenVPN, and IPsec. It also offers QoS per-user bandwidth control, SPI firewall protection, and DoS attack prevention to ensure network security and stability.</p><p>For easy management, the router supports the Cudy mobile app and cloud-based control system, allowing users to configure settings, monitor connected devices, and manage network activity remotely. Additional features such as parental controls, MAC filtering, and traffic scheduling provide greater control over internet usage.</p><p>With its Wi-Fi 7 technology, powerful hardware, Gigabit connectivity, advanced security features, and seamless mesh capabilities, the Cudy WR3600 BE3600 Gigabit Wi-Fi 7 Mesh Router is an excellent choice for users seeking next-generation wireless performance, reliability, and scalability.</p><h2><strong>Buy Cudy WR3600 BE3600 Gigabit Wi-Fi 7 Mesh Router from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Cudy WR3600 BE3600 Gigabit Wi-Fi 7 Mesh Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of genuine Cudy networking products and Wi-Fi 7 routers at competitive prices. Order online or visit International Office Solution to get authentic products with reliable customer support and after-sales service. The Cudy WR3600 Wi-Fi 7 Mesh Router comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Featu