(182, 'Cudy MF4 4G LTE Sim Supported Mobile Wi-Fi Router', 'The Cudy MF4 4G LTE SIM Supported Mobile Wi-Fi Router is a compact and portable hotspot device designed for fast and reliable internet on the go. Featuring 4G LTE speeds up to 150Mbps, support for up to 10 connected devices, and a built-in rechargeable 2000mAh battery, it is ideal for travel, outdoor use, and backup internet connectivity.', 'cudy-mf4-4g-lte-sim-supported-mobile-wi-fi-router-1779800307', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Cudy MF4 4G LTE SIM Supported Mobile Wi-Fi Router</strong></h2><p>The Cudy MF4 4G LTE SIM Supported Mobile Wi-Fi Router is a portable and efficient networking device designed to provide stable internet access anywhere you go. Its compact and lightweight design makes it easy to carry in your pocket, bag, or travel kit, making it an excellent choice for users who need reliable internet connectivity while traveling, working remotely, or using backup internet solutions.</p><p>Powered by advanced 4G LTE technology, the Cudy MF4 delivers download and upload speeds of up to 150Mbps, ensuring smooth browsing, HD video streaming, online communication, and basic cloud usage. By simply inserting a SIM card, users can instantly create a personal Wi-Fi hotspot without the need for fixed broadband connections.</p><p>The device supports Wi-Fi hotspot sharing for up to 10 connected devices simultaneously, including smartphones, laptops, tablets, gaming consoles, and smart devices. This makes it highly versatile for personal use, small group sharing, or mobile office setups.</p><p>Equipped with a built-in rechargeable 2000mAh battery, the Cudy MF4 Mobile Wi-Fi Router offers up to 7 hours of continuous usage on a single charge. This long battery life ensures uninterrupted connectivity during travel, outdoor activities, meetings, or emergency situations where power supply may be limited.</p><p>Designed for ease of use, the router requires no complex setup—users can simply insert a SIM card and power on the device to start sharing internet instantly. Its portable design and reliable LTE performance make it a practical solution for users who need internet access beyond traditional Wi-Fi coverage areas.</p><p>With stable 4G connectivity, portable design, multi-device support, and long battery life, the Cudy MF4 4G LTE SIM Supported Mobile Wi-Fi Router is an ideal companion for mobile users who require flexible and dependable internet access anywhere.</p><h2><strong>Buy Cudy MF4 4G LTE SIM Supported Mobile Wi-Fi Router from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Cudy MF4 4G LTE SIM Supported Mobile Wi-Fi Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of genuine Cudy networking devices and portable Wi-Fi solutions at competitive prices. Order online or visit International Office Solution to get authentic products with reliable customer support and after-sales service. The Cudy MF4 Mobile Wi-Fi Router comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>4G: 3GPP R10, Cat. 4, Downlink/Uplink up to 150Mbps/50Mbps<br>3G: 3GPP R7 Downlink/Uplink up to 42Mbps/5.76Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>Primary: Internal<br>Diversity: Internal, UMTS Optional</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>USB: USB2.0<br>USIM: Single, 4FF</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>4G/3G/2G Network Status Indicator</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Chipset: Qualcomm MDM9x07 / MDM9x25<br>Frequency Bands:<br>LTE: B1/B3/B7/B8/B20/B38/B40/B41<br>UMTS: B1/B3/B8<br>LTE Band: 1.4/3/5/10/15/20 MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Operating System Support</td><td>Windows: XP/7/8/10<br>MAC OS: 10.7+<br>Linux: Ubuntu 13.04+<br>Browser: IE9+, Firefox, Google Chrome, Safari, Opera<br>Modulation:<br>Downlink: QPSK/16-QAM/64-QAM<br>Uplink: QPSK/16-QAM<br>RF Power Level:<br>LTE FDD: Power Class 3 (23 +/-2dBm)<br>UMTS: Power Class 3 (24 +1.7/-3.7dBm)<br>EDGE: Power Class E2 (GSM850/900: 27dBm; DCS/PCS: 26dBm)<br>Chipset: RealTek 8192ES<br>Protocol: 802.11b/g/n<br>Channel: 1~13<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Power Supply: USB, 5V1A<br>Working Temperature: 0°C to 35°C<br>Storage Temperature: -20°C to 60°C<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>9.7 x 6.1 x 1.6 cm</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>92g</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'LTE Sim Supported Mobile', 4049.97, 4050.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/Lc7TFN7VQGIP8MIDNgJ8AhnejIwKZX0X4tpli11g.jpg', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 12:58:27', '2026-05-26 12:58:27', 'Cudy MF4 4G LTE Mobile Wi-Fi Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Cudy MF4 4G LTE SIM Supported Mobile Wi-Fi Router in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy portable internet, 4G LTE speed up to 150Mbps, 10-device support, and long battery life.', 'Cudy MF4, 4G LTE Mobile WiFi Router, SIM Supported Router, Portable WiFi Router, Pocket WiFi, Cudy 4G Router, Mobile Hotspot Router, Battery WiFi Router, Travel WiFi Router, International Office Solution', NULL, 208, NULL, NULL),
(183, 'Cudy X6 AX1800 Dual Band Smart WiFi Router', 'The Cudy X6 AX1800 Dual-Band Smart Wi-Fi 6 Router is a high-performance networking device designed for fast, stable, and efficient wireless connectivity. Featuring Wi-Fi 6 technology, AX1800 speeds, Gigabit Ethernet ports, high-gain antennas, VPN support, and Access Point mode, it is ideal for gaming, streaming, smart homes, and multi-device environments.', 'cudy-x6-ax1800-dual-band-smart-wifi-router-1779800592', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Cudy X6 AX1800 1800Mbps Dual-Band Smart Wi-Fi 6 Router</strong></h2><p>The Cudy X6 AX1800 Dual-Band Wi-Fi 6 Router is a powerful and modern networking solution designed to deliver high-speed internet, stable connectivity, and improved wireless efficiency for homes and offices. Built with next-generation Wi-Fi 6 technology, this router ensures smoother performance, lower latency, and better handling of multiple connected devices at the same time.</p><p>Powered by a high-performance dual-core processor, along with 32MB Flash memory and 256MB DDR3 RAM, the Cudy X6 ensures stable system performance and efficient data processing. It is designed to handle demanding network environments, including streaming, gaming, video conferencing, and smart home automation.</p><p>The router supports AX1800 dual-band Wi-Fi 6 speeds, delivering up to 1201Mbps on the 5GHz band and up to 574Mbps on the 2.4GHz band. The 5GHz band is ideal for high-bandwidth tasks such as 4K streaming, online gaming, and large file downloads, while the 2.4GHz band provides wide coverage for everyday browsing, IoT devices, and basic internet usage.</p><p>Equipped with four 5dBi high-gain external antennas, the Cudy X6 significantly improves wireless signal strength, coverage, and wall penetration. This ensures stable connectivity across multiple rooms and reduces dead zones in larger homes or office spaces.</p><p>The router includes five Gigabit Ethernet ports, offering high-speed wired connectivity for gaming consoles, desktop PCs, smart TVs, NAS storage devices, and other wired network equipment. These ports ensure stable and fast data transfer for high-performance applications.</p><p>The Cudy X6 supports both Router Mode and Access Point Mode, allowing flexible deployment depending on network needs. In Router Mode, it connects directly to the internet and distributes wireless access to all devices. In Access Point Mode, it works with an existing modem or router to extend Wi-Fi coverage and improve network reach.</p><p>For secure networking and remote access, the router includes built-in PPTP and L2TP VPN Client support. This allows users to establish encrypted VPN connections for safe browsing, remote office access, and secure data transmission.</p><p>It also supports Dynamic DNS (DDNS), enabling users to bind their changing IP address to a custom domain name for easier remote access and network management.</p><p>With advanced Wi-Fi 6 performance, strong coverage, Gigabit connectivity, VPN support, and flexible operating modes, the Cudy X6 AX1800 Dual-Band Smart Wi-Fi 6 Router is an excellent choice for users seeking reliable and high-speed internet performance.</p><h2><strong>Buy Cudy X6 AX1800 Dual-Band Smart Wi-Fi 6 Router from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Cudy X6 AX1800 Dual-Band Smart Wi-Fi 6 Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of genuine Cudy networking products and Wi-Fi 6 routers at competitive prices. Order online or visit International Office Solution to get authentic products with reliable customer support and after-sales service. The Cudy X6 AX1800 Router comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>1201 Mbps (5 GHz), 574 Mbps (2.4 GHz)<br>Compatible with 802.11a/b/g/n/ac Wi-Fi standards</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4× Fixed Omni-Directional Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS Button, Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>5 GHz, 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Wireless Modes:<br>Enable/Disable Wireless Radio, WMM<br>WEP, WPA/WPA2,<br><br>Wireless Functions:<br>WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK,WPA3</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1× 1000/100/10 Mbps WAN Port<br>4× 1000/100/10 Mbps LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11ax/ac/n/a 5 GHz<br>IEEE 802.11ax/n/b/g 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Processor: Dual-Core CPU<br>Flash: 32MB<br>DDR: 256MB</td></tr><tr><td>Operating System Support</td><td>Microsoft Windows 98SE /NT /2000 /XP /Vista /7 /8 /8.1 / 10, MAC OS, NetWare, UNIX or Linux</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>12 V / 1.5 A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>204.8 x 137. 5 x 38. 3mm</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band Smart', 4450.00, 4500.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/lujNIGHFACUr1EM3ATwHHxZ28JyPZutQFP0LU9jN.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 13:03:12', '2026-05-26 13:03:12', 'Cudy X6 AX1800 Wi-Fi 6 Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Cudy X6 AX1800 Dual-Band Wi-Fi 6 Router in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy fast AX1800 speed, Gigabit ports, strong coverage, VPN support, and reliable Wi-Fi 6 performance.', 'Cudy X6, AX1800 WiFi 6 Router, Dual Band Router, Gigabit WiFi Router, Cudy Wireless Router, VPN Router, High Gain Antenna Router, Mesh Compatible Router, Cudy Router Bangladesh, International Office Solution', NULL, 208, NULL, NULL);
