(184, 'Cudy M1800 AX1800 Dual Band Mesh Router (1 Pack)', 'The Cudy M1800 AX1800 Whole Home Mesh WiFi 6 Router (1 Pack) is a powerful dual-band mesh networking solution designed for fast, stable, and seamless wireless coverage. Featuring Wi-Fi 6 technology, AX1800 speeds, Gigabit ports, high-gain antennas, VPN support, and mesh capability, it is ideal for large homes, offices, gaming, and 4K streaming.', 'cudy-m1800-ax1800-dual-band-mesh-router-1-pack-1779800818', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Cudy M1800 AX1800 Whole Home Mesh WiFi 6 Router (1 Pack)</strong></h2><p>The Cudy M1800 AX1800 Whole Home Mesh WiFi 6 Router is a high-performance networking device designed to deliver fast wireless speeds, stable connectivity, and seamless whole-home coverage. Built with modern Wi-Fi 6 technology, this router improves network efficiency, reduces latency, and supports multiple devices simultaneously, making it suitable for homes, offices, and smart environments.</p><p>Powered by a high-performance dual-core processor, along with 32MB Flash memory and 256MB DDR3 RAM, the Cudy M1800 ensures smooth data processing and reliable performance under heavy network usage. It is engineered to handle multiple connected devices while maintaining stable and consistent internet performance.</p><p>The router supports AX1800 dual-band Wi-Fi 6 speeds, delivering up to 1201Mbps on the 5GHz band and up to 574Mbps on the 2.4GHz band. The 5GHz band is ideal for high-speed activities such as online gaming, 4K streaming, and large downloads, while the 2.4GHz band provides wider coverage for everyday browsing, IoT devices, and basic internet usage.</p><p>Equipped with four 5dBi high-gain external antennas, the Cudy M1800 significantly enhances wireless coverage, signal strength, and wall penetration. This ensures stable connectivity throughout large homes and office environments, reducing dead zones and improving overall network reliability.</p><p>The router includes five Gigabit Ethernet ports, offering ultra-fast wired connections for desktop computers, gaming consoles, smart TVs, NAS devices, and other wired network equipment. These ports ensure stable and high-speed data transfer for demanding applications.</p><p>The Cudy M1800 supports both Router Mode and Access Point Mode, allowing flexible deployment depending on network requirements. In Router Mode, it connects directly to the internet and distributes wireless connectivity to all devices. In Access Point Mode, it extends an existing network to improve coverage and performance.</p><p>For secure connectivity, the router includes built-in PPTP and L2TP VPN Client support, allowing users to create encrypted VPN connections for safe browsing, remote work, and secure data transfer. It also supports Dynamic DNS (DDNS), enabling users to bind changing IP addresses to a custom domain name for easy remote access and network management.</p><p>With advanced Wi-Fi 6 performance, mesh capability, strong coverage, Gigabit connectivity, VPN support, and flexible operation modes, the Cudy M1800 AX1800 Whole Home Mesh WiFi 6 Router is an excellent solution for users who need reliable and high-speed internet across multiple devices and large spaces.</p><h2><strong>Buy Cudy M1800 AX1800 Whole Home Mesh WiFi 6 Router from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Cudy M1800 AX1800 Whole Home Mesh WiFi 6 Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of genuine Cudy networking products and mesh WiFi solutions at competitive prices. Order online or visit International Office Solution to get authentic products with reliable customer support and after-sales service. The Cudy M1800 AX1800 Mesh Router comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>1201 Mbps (5 GHz), 574 Mbps (2.4 GHz)<br>Compatible with 802.11a/b/g/n/ac/ax Wi-Fi standards</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4× Fixed Omni-Directional Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Pair Button, Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>5 GHz, 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Wireless Modes:<br>Enable/Disable Wireless Radio, WMM<br>WEP, WPA/WPA2,<br><br>Wireless Functions:<br>WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK,WPA3</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1× 1000/100/10 Mbps WAN Port<br>1× 1000/100/10 Mbps LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11ax/ac/n/a 5 GHz<br>IEEE 802.11ax/n/b/g 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Processor: Dual-Core Processors<br>Flash: 256Mbit (32MB)<br>DDR: 2Gbit (256MB)</td></tr><tr><td>Operating System Support</td><td>Microsoft Windows 98SE /NT /2000 /XP /Vista /7 /8 /8.1 / 10, MAC OS, NetWare, UNIX or Linux</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>12 V / 1.5 A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band Mesh', 4600.00, 4700.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/jkc9vEvRiPSNOQaQ3SNGN29DWNuOno0fRLEhNlWQ.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 13:06:58', '2026-05-26 13:06:58', 'Cudy M1800 AX1800 Mesh WiFi 6 Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Cudy M1800 AX1800 Whole Home Mesh WiFi 6 Router in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy fast AX1800 speed, mesh coverage, Gigabit ports, VPN support, and stable Wi-Fi 6 performanc', 'Cudy M1800, AX1800 Mesh Router, WiFi 6 Mesh System, Dual Band Router, Gigabit Mesh WiFi, Cudy Router Bangladesh, VPN Router, Mesh WiFi 6, High Speed Router, International Office Solution', NULL, 208, NULL, NULL),
(185, 'Cudy M1500 AX1500 Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router (2 Pack)', 'The Cudy M1500 AX1500 Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router (2 Pack) is a powerful whole-home networking solution designed to deliver seamless coverage, stable connectivity, and fast dual-band speeds. Featuring Wi-Fi 6 technology, AX1500 performance, mesh networking, Gigabit ports, WPA3 security, and advanced control features, it is ideal for large homes, offices, and multi-device environments.', 'cudy-m1500-ax1500-dual-band-wi-fi-6-mesh-router-2-pack-1779801002', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Cudy M1500 AX1500 Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router (2 Pack)</strong></h2><p>The Cudy M1500 AX1500 Dual Band Mesh Router (2 Pack) is a high-performance mesh networking system designed to provide fast, stable, and uninterrupted wireless coverage across large homes and office spaces. Built with advanced Wi-Fi 6 technology, this system enhances network efficiency, reduces latency, and ensures smooth connectivity for multiple devices at the same time.</p><p>The router delivers combined dual-band speeds of up to 1201Mbps on the 5GHz band and 300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band. With support for 1024-QAM modulation and beamforming technology, the Cudy M1500 ensures stronger signal focus, improved coverage, and more reliable connections even in crowded network environments.</p><p>Powered by a 1GHz single-core processor, along with efficient hardware optimization, the system is designed to handle up to 60 connected devices simultaneously without performance drops. Each unit includes internal high-gain antennas with up to 5.56 dBi gain on 5GHz and 4.41 dBi on 2.4GHz, delivering strong and stable wireless coverage.</p><p>Each router unit provides up to 3200 square feet of coverage, and the 2-pack mesh configuration extends seamless connectivity across even larger spaces. The mesh system automatically ensures smooth roaming between units, eliminating dead zones and maintaining consistent internet performance throughout the coverage area.</p><p>For wired connectivity, the Cudy M1500 includes 3 Gigabit Ethernet ports per unit (1 WAN + 2 LAN), allowing ultra-fast and stable wired connections for gaming consoles, desktop PCs, smart TVs, and other network devices.</p><p>The router supports advanced networking features including per-user QoS, DHCP management, IPv4/IPv6 compatibility, VLAN configuration, and IPTV support. These features allow users to optimize bandwidth usage and manage network traffic efficiently.</p><p>Security is enhanced with WPA3 encryption, guest networks, and VPN client support including PPTP, L2TP, and WireGuard protocols. These features ensure safe browsing, secure remote access, and protected network communication.</p><p>The Cudy M1500 mesh system supports both wireless and wired backhaul, allowing flexible installation and optimized performance based on user requirements. Users can manage the network easily through a web interface or mobile app, with additional features such as parental controls, LED control, firmware updates, and diagnostic tools.</p><p>With compact design, efficient power usage, advanced Wi-Fi 6 performance, and strong mesh capabilities, the Cudy M1500 AX1500 Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router (2 Pack) is an excellent solution for users seeking reliable whole-home coverage and high-speed connectivity.</p><h2><strong>Buy Cudy M1500 AX1500 Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router (2 Pack) from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Cudy M1500 AX1500 Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router (2 Pack) from International Office Solution. We offer a wide collection of genuine Cudy networking products and mesh Wi-Fi systems at competitive prices. Order online or visit International Office Solution to get authentic products with reliable customer support and after-sales service. The Cudy M1500 Mesh Router (2 Pack) comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>5 GHz Wi-Fi Speed: 1201 Mbps<br>2.4 GHz Wi-Fi Speed: 300 Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>Wi-Fi Antennas: 2× Internal<br>5 GHz Antenna Gain Max: 5.56dBi<br>2.4 GHz Antenna Gain Max: 4.41dBi</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS Button, Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>5 GHz, 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Wi-Fi Standards: Wi-Fi 6<br>Max Wi-Fi Modulation: 1024-QAM<br>Wi-Fi Efficiency: Beamforming<br>Max Capacity: 128<br>Recommended Client Upper Limit: 60<br>Max Wi-Fi Channel Width: 80 MHz<br>Wi-Fi Security: WPA/WPA2/WPA3<br>Guest Network: 2.4 GHz, 5 GHz<br>WPS: True</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>Gigabit RJ45 Ports: 3<br>Ethernet Notes: 1× WAN port, the rest are LAN ports<br>Uplink Ethernet Ports:<br>1-Pack: 57×56×26 cm<br>22.44×22.05×10.24 inches<br>LED: System<br>Physical Buttons:<br>- WPS Button<br>- Reset Button<br>Power Input: DC Jack</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>QoS: Per-User Rate Limiting<br>DHCP:<br>- Address Reservation<br>- DHCP Client List<br>- Server<br>IP Versions: IPv4/IPv6<br>IPv6 Protocols:<br>- Relay<br>- Dynamic (SLAAC/DHCPv6)<br>- Static (Fixed IP)<br>- Passthrough<br>- 464XLAT<br>- MAP-E<br>- DS-Lite<br>IPTV/VLAN:<br>- Bridge<br>- Tag VLAN<br>- VoIP VLAN<br>- IPTV VLAN<br>IGMP:<br>- IGMP Proxy<br>- IGMP Snooping<br>Forwarding:<br>- Port Forwarding<br>- UPnP<br>- DMZ<br>Firewall:<br>- SPI Firewall<br>- Block PING</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>Gigabit RJ45 Ports: 3<br>Ethernet Notes: 1× WAN port, the rest are LAN ports</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Coverage Up to 3200 Sq ft<br>Processor: 1 GHz Single-Core CPU<br>Memory/Storage<br>Flash/ROM: 16 MB (128 Mbit) NOR<br>DDR/RAM: 128 MB (1 Gbit) DDR3<br><br>System:<br>LED Control: True<br>Local Control Method:<br>- Config Web Page<br>- App Control<br>Remote Control Method:<br>- Config Page via HTTPS<br>- App Control<br>- TR069/TR098/TR111/TR143/TR181<br>Firmware Upgrade:<br>- Local Update<br>- App (Over the Air)<br>- Online Update<br>Reliability:<br>- Timed Reboot<br>- Backup and Restore<br>Diagnostic Tools:<br>- Diagnosis<br>- Ping<br>- Traceroute<br>- NSLookup<br>- System Log<br>Languages:<br>- English<br>- Portuguese<br>- Russian<br>- Spanish<br>- Ukrainian<br>- French<br>- Simplified Chinese<br><br>Utilities:<br>VPN Client:<br>- PPTP<br>- L2TP<br>- Wireguard<br>DNS Options:<br>- Manual DNS<br>- Rebind Protection<br>- Override Clients\' DNS<br>Wake on LAN: True<br>Online Detection: True<br>Parental Controls: URL Blacklist, Time Schedule, Profiles, Client Management<br>Cudy Mesh, VPN Client, Cudy App, Cloud Control</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Power Methods: DC<br>DC Input: 12V 1A<br>Power Adapter:<br>- Input: 100 ~ 240 V, 50/60 Hz AC<br>- Output: 12V 1A DC<br>Max Power Consumption (W): 10W</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>110×154.5 mm<br>4.33×6.08 inches</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual BandMesh', 8200.00, 8300.00, NULL, 6, 'products/thumbnails/XoBLtdbyCwKibx90CO7qANzeWXh6v8pEUBamivPG.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 13:10:02', '2026-05-26 13:10:02', 'Cudy M1500 AX1500 Mesh WiFi 6 Router (2 Pack) Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Cudy M1500 AX1500 Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router (2 Pack) in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy seamless mesh coverage, AX1500 speed, WPA3 security, Gigabit ports, and stable Wi-Fi 6 performance.', 'Cudy M1500, AX1500 Mesh Router 2 Pack, WiFi 6 Mesh System, Dual Band Mesh Router, Cudy Mesh WiFi, Gigabit Router, WPA3 Router, Mesh Router Bangladesh, High Speed WiFi System, International Office Solution', NULL, 208, NULL, NULL),
(186, 'Cudy M1300 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Mesh Router (3 Pack)', 'The Cudy M1300 AC1200 Gigabit Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router (3 Pack) is a powerful mesh networking system designed for seamless coverage, stable connectivity, and smooth dual-band performance. With AC1200 speeds, Gigabit ports, VPN support, and mesh functionality, it is ideal for large homes, multi-floor buildings, and office environments.', 'cudy-m1300-ac1200-dual-band-gigabit-mesh-router-3-pack-1779801213', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Cudy M1300 AC1200 1200Mbps Gigabit Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router (3 Pack)</strong></h2><p>The Cudy M1300 AC1200 Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router (3 Pack) is a high-performance mesh networking solution designed to deliver strong, stable, and uninterrupted wireless coverage across large homes, offices, and multi-room environments. With advanced mesh technology, it ensures seamless roaming between units, eliminating dead zones and providing a consistent internet experience throughout the coverage area.</p><p>Each unit of the Cudy M1300 is built with 16MB Flash memory and 128MB DDR3 RAM, ensuring stable performance and efficient data handling. It features 2× Gigabit Ethernet ports and 2× internal omnidirectional antennas, which help deliver reliable wired connectivity and improved wireless signal distribution.</p><p>The router supports dual-band AC1200 WiFi, offering speeds of up to 867Mbps on the 5GHz band and strong long-range performance on the 2.4GHz band. The 5GHz band is ideal for high-bandwidth activities such as online gaming, 4K streaming, and large downloads, while the 2.4GHz band provides extended coverage for everyday browsing and IoT devices.</p><p>Designed for strong signal penetration, the Cudy M1300 ensures stable connectivity even through walls and across multiple rooms. With mesh networking capability, multiple units work together to create a unified Wi-Fi system, allowing devices to automatically connect to the strongest signal as users move around.</p><p>The router also functions as a 2-in-1 device, supporting both Router Mode and Access Point Mode. In Router Mode, it connects directly to the internet and distributes wireless access to all connected devices. In Access Point Mode, it extends an existing network, making it ideal for expanding coverage in larger setups.</p><p>Advanced features include built-in PPTP and L2TP VPN client support, allowing secure encrypted connections for remote work, school networks, or private browsing. It also supports DDNS functionality, enabling users to bind a dynamic IP address to a custom domain name for easier remote access and management.</p><p>With stable AC1200 performance, Gigabit connectivity, mesh scalability, VPN support, and flexible deployment options, the Cudy M1300 AC1200 Gigabit Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router (3 Pack) is a reliable solution for users who need strong, scalable, and high-performance wireless networking.</p><h2><strong>Buy Cudy M1300 AC1200 Gigabit Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router (3 Pack) from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Cudy M1300 AC1200 Gigabit Whole Home Mesh WiFi Router (3 Pack) from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of genuine Cudy mesh WiFi systems and networking products at competitive prices. Order online or visit International Office Solution to get authentic products with reliable customer support and after-sales service. The Cudy M1300 Mesh WiFi Router (3 Pack) comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>867Mbps (5GHz), 300Mbps (2.4GHz)<br>Compatible with 802.11a/b/g/n/ac Wi-Fi standards</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2 × Internal Omni-Directional Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Pair Button, Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>5 GHz, 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Wireless Modes: Enable/Disable Wireles