(187, 'Cudy M1800 AX1800 Dual Band Mesh Router (2 Pack)', 'The Cudy M1800 AX1800 Whole Home Mesh WiFi 6 Router (2 Pack) is a high-performance mesh system designed for fast, stable, and seamless home or office connectivity. Featuring Wi-Fi 6 technology, AX1800 speeds, Gigabit ports, strong coverage antennas, VPN support, and mesh networking, it is ideal for large homes, gaming, and 4K streaming.', 'cudy-m1800-ax1800-dual-band-mesh-router-2-pack-1779801503', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Cudy M1800 AX1800 Whole Home Mesh WiFi 6 Router (2 Pack)</strong></h2><p>The Cudy M1800 AX1800 Whole Home Mesh WiFi 6 Router (2 Pack) is a powerful networking solution designed to deliver fast, reliable, and uninterrupted wireless connectivity across large homes, offices, and multi-room environments. Built with advanced Wi-Fi 6 technology, it significantly improves network efficiency, reduces latency, and supports multiple connected devices simultaneously without performance drops.</p><p>Each unit of the Cudy M1800 is powered by a high-performance dual-core processor, supported by 32MB Flash memory and 256MB DDR3 RAM. This ensures smooth data handling, stable system performance, and efficient multitasking even under heavy network usage conditions.</p><p>The router supports AX1800 dual-band Wi-Fi 6 speeds, delivering up to 1201Mbps on the 5GHz band and strong performance on the 2.4GHz band for extended coverage. The 5GHz band is ideal for high-bandwidth tasks such as online gaming, 4K streaming, and large file downloads, while the 2.4GHz band provides wide-range connectivity for everyday browsing and smart devices.</p><p>Equipped with four 5dBi high-gain external antennas, the Cudy M1800 ensures strong signal strength, improved coverage, and excellent wall penetration. This allows users to enjoy stable connectivity throughout large homes and office spaces with fewer dead zones.</p><p>The system includes five Gigabit Ethernet ports per unit, offering ultra-fast wired connectivity for deskto