(188, 'Cudy M3000 AX3000 2.5G Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router (2 Pack)', 'The Cudy M3000 AX3000 2.5G Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router (2 Pack) is a high-performance mesh networking system designed for ultra-fast internet, stable coverage, and advanced connectivity. Featuring Wi-Fi 6, AX3000 speeds, 2.5G WAN support, Gigabit LAN, VPN compatibility, and mesh capability, it is ideal for large homes, offices, and high-bandwidth usage.', 'cudy-m3000-ax3000-25g-dual-band-wi-fi-6-mesh-router-2-pack-1779801716', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Cudy M3000 AX3000 2.5G Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router (2 Pack)</strong></h2><p>The Cudy M3000 AX3000 2.5G Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router (2 Pack) is a powerful next-generation mesh networking solution designed to deliver ultra-fast speeds, stable connectivity, and wide coverage across modern homes and office environments. Built with Wi-Fi 6 technology and high-performance hardware, it ensures smooth performance even under heavy multi-device usage.</p><p>Each unit of the Cudy M3000 is powered by a 1.3GHz Dual-Core ARM Cortex-A53 processor, supported by 128MB Flash and 256MB DDR memory. This combination provides strong processing capability, efficient multitasking, and reliable network performance for demanding applications.</p><p>The router supports AX3000 dual-band Wi-Fi 6 performance, delivering up to 2402Mbps on the 5GHz band and up to 574Mbps on the 2.4GHz band. With support for 20/40/80/160MHz channel bandwidth, it ensures high-speed wireless transmission for gaming, 4K/8K streaming, video conferencing, and large file transfers.</p><p>To enhance performance and coverage, the Cudy M3000 includes five internal omnidirectional antennas per unit, ensuring strong signal distribution and stable connectivity across multiple rooms. Advanced technologies such as OFDMA, MU-MIMO, and Beamforming further improve efficiency, reduce latency, and optimize multi-device connections.</p><p>A key highlight of this model is its 2.5Gbps WAN port, which enables ultra-high-speed internet access, making it ideal for fiber connections and future-proof networking. It also includes a 10/100/1000Mbps Gigabit LAN port for stable wired connections to PCs, gaming consoles, and smart devices.</p><p>The Cudy M3000 supports multiple wireless security standards, including WPA3, WPA2, WPA/WPA2-PSK, and WEP, ensuring a secure and protected network environment. It also offers advanced VPN support with protocols such as PPTP, L2TP, OpenVPN, WireGuard, and IPsec, allowing secure remote access and encrypted communication.</p><p>With mesh networking capability, the 2-pack system works together to create a unified wireless network, ensuring seamless roaming and eliminating dead zones across large spaces. This makes it ideal for multi-floor buildings and high-density environments.</p><p>The router also supports advanced networking features such as DHCP management, VLAN configuration, IPv6 support, IPTV setup, and per-user QoS for better bandwidth control and optimization.</p><p>With its powerful hardware, Wi-Fi 6 performance, 2.5G WAN support, advanced security features, and seamless mesh technology, the Cudy M3000 AX3000 2.5G Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router (2 Pack) is an excellent choice for users who demand high-speed, stable, and future-ready networking.</p><h2><strong>Buy Cudy M3000 AX3000 2.5G Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router (2 Pack) from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Cudy M3000 AX3000 2.5G Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router (2 Pack) from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of genuine Cudy networking products and mesh Wi-Fi systems at competitive prices. Order online or visit International Office Solution to get authentic products with reliable customer support and after-sales service. The Cudy M3000 Mesh Router (2 Pack) comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thea