(189, 'Cudy M11000 BE11000 Tri Band Wi-Fi 7 Mesh Router (1 Pack)', 'The Cudy M11000 BE11000 Tri-Band Wi-Fi 7 Mesh Router (1 Pack) is a flagship next-generation networking device designed for ultra-high-speed performance, low latency, and wide mesh coverage. Featuring Wi-Fi 7 technology, tri-band BE11000 speeds, 2.5G Ethernet ports, mesh expandability, and advanced multi-device support, it is ideal for gaming, 8K streaming, and enterprise-grade home networks.', 'cudy-m11000-be11000-tri-band-wi-fi-7-mesh-router-1-pack-1779801877', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Cudy M11000 BE11000 Tri-Band Wi-Fi 7 Mesh Router (1 Pack)</strong></h2><p>The Cudy M11000 BE11000 Tri-Band Wi-Fi 7 Mesh Router (1 Pack) is a premium next-generation networking solution built to deliver extreme speed, ultra-low latency, and seamless whole-home or office coverage. Powered by the latest Wi-Fi 7 standard, it provides a significant upgrade in efficiency, capacity, and performance compared to previous Wi-Fi generations, making it suitable for high-demand digital environments.</p><p>This Cudy Wi-Fi 7 Mesh Router features a tri-band architecture that delivers blazing-fast wireless speeds across multiple frequency bands. It offers up to 5.7Gbps on the 6GHz band, 4.3Gbps on the 5GHz band, and 688Mbps on the 2.4GHz band, achieving a combined throughput of up to 11Gbps. This ensures smooth performance for 4K/8K streaming, cloud gaming, AR/VR applications, and heavy multi-device usage.</p><p>Powered by a high-performance Qualcomm quad-core processor, the router is designed to handle intensive network workloads with ease. It also supports up to 200 connected devices simultaneously, making it ideal for smart homes, offices, and high-density environments where multiple users require stable connectivity at the same time.</p><p>The Cudy M11000 incorporates advanced Wi-Fi 7 technologies such as Multi-Link Operation (MLO), MU-MIMO, and OFDMA, which significantly improve network efficiency, reduce congestion, and enhance overall responsiveness. These technologies ensure stable and consistent performance even in crowded wireless environments.</p><p>For wired connectivity, the router includes multiple 2.5G Ethernet ports, enabling ultra-fast wired connections for gaming PCs, NAS storage systems, workstations, and high-speed internet backhaul. This ensures that both wireless and wired devices benefit from maximum performance.</p><p>The mesh capability of the Cudy M11000 allows users to expand their network easily by adding additional units. This creates a unified Wi-Fi system that eliminates dead zones and provides seamless roaming across large areas, ensuring uninterrupted connectivity as users move around.</p><p>Managed through the intuitive Cudy App, users can easily configure, monitor, and control their network both locally and remotely. The system also supports advanced features such as VPN connectivity, parental controls, QoS traffic management, and device prioritization for optimized performance.</p><p>With its tri-band Wi-Fi 7 performance, powerful hardware, mesh scalability, and advanced networking features, the Cudy M11000 BE11000 Tri-Band Wi-Fi 7 Mesh Router (1 Pack) is a future-ready solution for users who demand the highest level of speed, stability, and network control.</p><h2><strong>Buy Cudy M11000 BE11000 Tri-Band Wi-Fi 7 Mesh Router (1 Pack) from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Cudy M11000 BE11000 Tri-Band Wi-Fi 7 Mesh Router (1 Pack) from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of genuine Cudy networking products and Wi-Fi 7 mesh systems at competitive prices. Order online or visit International Office Solution to get authentic products with reliable customer support and after-sales service. The Cudy M11000 Mesh Router comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>6 GHz Wi-Fi Speed: 5765 Mbps<br>5 GHz Wi-Fi Speed: 4324 Mbps (240 MHz)<br>5 GHz Wi-Fi Speed: 2882 Mbps (160 MHz)<br>2.4 GHz Wi-Fi Speed: 688 Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>6× Fixed Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS Button, Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>6GHz, 5GHz, 2.4GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Wi-Fi Standards: Wi-Fi 7<br>Max Wi-Fi Modulation: 4K-QAM<br>Wi-Fi Efficiency: Beamforming<br>Max Capacity: 384<br>Recommended Client Upper Limit: 200<br>Max Wi-Fi Channel Width: 320 MHz<br>Wi-Fi Security: WPA/WPA2/WPA3<br>Guest Network: 2.4 GHz, 5 GHz, 6 GHz<br>WPS: True</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>Gigabit RJ45 Ports: 3<br>Ethernet Notes: 1× WAN port, the rest are LAN ports<br>Uplink Ethernet Ports:<br>1-Pack: 57×56×26 cm<br>22.44×22.05×10.24 inches<br>LED: System<br>Physical Buttons:<br>- WPS Button<br>- Reset Button<br>Power Input: DC Jack</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>QoS: Per-User Rate Limiting<br><br>DHCP:<br>- Address Reservation<br>- DHCP Client List<br>- Server<br><br>IP Versions: IPv4/IPv6<br><br>IPv6 Protocols:<br>- Relay<br>- Dynamic (SLAAC/DHCPv6)<br>- Static (Fixed IP)<br>- Passthrough<br>- 464XLAT<br>- MAP-E<br>- DS-Lite<br><br>IPTV/VLAN:<br>- Bridge<br>- Tag VLAN<br>- VoIP VLAN<br>- IPTV VLAN<br><br>TTL Customization:<br>- Extend<br>- Spoof<br>- Custom<br><br>IGMP:<br>- IGMP Proxy<br>- IGMP Snooping<br><br>Forwarding:<br>- Port Forwarding<br>- Port Triggering<br>- UPnP<br>- DMZ<br><br>Firewall:<br>- SPI Firewall<br>- DoS Protection<br>- Block PING<br><br>Application Layer Gateway:<br>- IPSec Passthrough<br>- L2TP Passthrough<br>- PPTP Passthrough<br>- FTP Passthrough<br>- TFTP Passthrough<br>- H323 Passthrough<br>- SIP Passthrough<br>- RTSP Passthrough</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>2.5G RJ45 Ports: 4<br>Ethernet Notes: 1× WAN port, the rest are LAN ports</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Coverage Up to 2000 Sq ft<br>Processor: 1.5 GHz Quad-Core CPU<br>Memory/Storage<br>Flash/ROM: 128 MB