(190, 'Cudy WR6500 BE6500 6500Mbps Dual Band Gigabit WiFi 7 Router', 'The Cudy WR6500 BE6500 Dual Band Gigabit Wi-Fi 7 Router is a high-performance networking device designed for ultra-fast speeds, stable connectivity, and wide coverage. Powered by Wi-Fi 7 technology, BE6500 speeds, powerful hardware, Gigabit ports, and advanced antenna design, it is ideal for gaming, 4K/8K streaming, and multi-device smart home environments.', 'cudy-wr6500-be6500-6500mbps-dual-band-gigabit-wifi-7-router-1779802077', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Cudy WR6500 BE6500 6500Mbps Dual Band Gigabit Wi-Fi 7 Router</strong></h2><p>The Cudy WR6500 BE6500 Dual Band Gigabit Wi-Fi 7 Router is a next-generation networking solution built to deliver exceptional speed, stability, and efficiency for modern homes and high-demand digital environments. Powered by the Broadcom BCM6766 chipset and a 2.0 GHz quad-core ARM Cortex-A7 processor, this router ensures smooth performance even under heavy network loads such as gaming, streaming, and smart home usage.</p><p>It is equipped with 512MB DDR4 RAM and 128MB NAND flash storage, allowing efficient multitasking and reliable system performance. This hardware combination ensures stable operation across multiple connected devices without performance degradation.</p><p>The router supports Wi-Fi 7 technology with dual-band BE6500 performance, delivering up to 5765 Mbps on the 5GHz band and up to 688 Mbps on the 2.4GHz band. With 4×4 MIMO on 5GHz and 2×2 MIMO on 2.4GHz, it ensures strong signal strength, high throughput, and stable connectivity across multiple devices.</p><p>Equipped with six high-performance external antennas, the Cudy WR6500 significantly improves wireless coverage and signal penetration. The antennas provide a maximum gain of up to 5.27 dBi on 5GHz and 5.19 dBi on 2.4GHz, ensuring reliable performance across large homes and multi-room environments.</p><p>Advanced technologies such as beamforming and FEM/PA/LNA signal amplifiers further enhance signal direction, reduce interference, and extend coverage up to 240 meters in open space. This makes it suitable for large houses, offices, and multi-floor setups.</p><p>The Cudy WR6500 supports up to 200 connected devices simultaneously, making it ideal for smart homes with multiple users, IoT devices, and high-bandwidth applications such as streaming, video conferencing, and online gaming.</p><p>For wired connectivity, the router includes five Gigabit Ethernet ports (1 WAN + 4 LAN), providing ultra-fast and stable connections for gaming consoles, desktop PCs, smart TVs, and NAS devices.</p><p>User-friendly controls such as power on/off, WPS, and reset buttons make operation simple and convenient. The router is designed to provide both high performance and ease of use in everyday networking environments.</p><p>With Wi-Fi 7 speed, BE6500 performance class, powerful hardware, extensive coverage, and advanced connectivity features, the Cudy WR6500 BE6500 Dual Band Gigabit Wi-Fi 7 Router is an excellent choice for users who need high-speed, reliable, and future-ready internet performance.</p><h2><strong>Buy Cudy WR6500 BE6500 Dual Band Gigabit Wi-Fi 7 Router from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Cudy WR6500 BE6500 Dual Band Gigabit Wi-Fi 7 Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of genuine Cudy networking products and Wi-Fi 7 routers at competitive prices. Order online or visit International Office Solution to get authentic products with reliable customer support and after-sales service. The Cudy WR6500 Wi-Fi 7 Router comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>5 GHz Wi-Fi Speed: 5765 Mbps<br>2.4 GHz Wi-Fi Speed: 688 Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>6× Fixed Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Power On/Off Button<br>WPS Button<br>Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>5 GHz, 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>5x Gigabit RJ45 Ports<br>1× WAN port, the rest are LAN ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>Wi-Fi 7</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA/WPA2/WPA3</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>CPU Chipset BCM6766<br>CPU Details 2.0 GHz Quad-core, ARM Cortex-A7<br>Memory/Storage Flash/ROM 128 MB (1 Gbit) NAND<br>DDR/RAM 512 MB (4 Gbit) DDR4</td></tr><tr><td>Operating System Support</td><td>Microsoft Windows 98SE/NT/2000/XP/Vista/7/8/8.1/10, MAC OS, NetWare, UNIX or Linux</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Input: 100 ~ 240 V, 50/60 Hz AC<br>Output: 12V 1.5A DC</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>253×152.5×48.2 mm<br>9.96×6×1.9 inches</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>580.0 g (20.46 oz.)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band Gigabit', 12800.00, 12900.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/6LZ6Y6waFLAdUaN4GFDP73pplvdKEx7vznHNhZox.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 13:27:57', '2026-05-26 13:27:57', 'Cudy WR6500 BE6500 Wi-Fi 7 Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Cudy WR6500 BE6500 Dual Band Gigabit Wi-Fi 7 Router in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy ultra-fast BE6500 Wi-Fi 7 speed, Gigabit ports, wide coverage, and stable multi-device performance.', 'Cudy WR6500, BE6500 WiFi 7 Router, Gigabit WiFi 7 Router, Dual Band Router, High Speed Router, Cudy Router Bangladesh, Mesh Compatible Router, Gaming WiFi Router, Smart Home Router, International Office Solution', NULL, 208, NULL, NULL);
