(191, 'Cudy M1500 AX1500 Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router (3 Pack)', 'The Cudy M1500 AX1500 Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router (3 Pack) is a powerful whole-home mesh system designed to deliver seamless coverage, stable connectivity, and high-speed Wi-Fi 6 performance. With AX1500 speeds, mesh roaming, Gigabit ports, and advanced security features, it is ideal for large homes, offices, and multi-device environments.', 'cudy-m1500-ax1500-dual-band-wi-fi-6-mesh-router-3-pack-1779802219', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Cudy M1500 AX1500 Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router (3 Pack)</strong></h2><p>The Cudy M1500 AX1500 Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router (3 Pack) is a high-performance whole-home networking solution designed to provide fast, stable, and uninterrupted wireless connectivity across large residential and office spaces. Built with advanced Wi-Fi 6 technology, this mesh system improves speed, efficiency, and device handling while ensuring smooth internet performance across all connected devices.</p><p>The system delivers combined AX1500 dual-band speeds, supporting up to 1201Mbps on the 5GHz band and 300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band. This allows users to enjoy high-bandwidth activities such as 4K streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, and smart home automation without lag or interruptions.</p><p>Designed for full-home coverage, the Cudy M1500 3 Pack Mesh System eliminates dead zones by creating a unified wireless network. As users move between rooms or floors, devices automatically connect to the strongest signal, ensuring seamless roaming and consistent performance throughout the entire coverage area.</p><p>Each node in the system supports dual-band operation, efficiently managing multiple devices simultaneously while maintaining stable performance. The use of Wi-Fi 6 technologies such as MU-MIMO and beamforming further enhances network efficiency, reduces congestion, and improves overall connection quality in busy environments.</p><p>Every unit includes Gigabit Ethernet ports, provi