br>Max Capacity: 128<br>Recommended Client Upper Limit: 60<br>Max Wi-Fi Channel Width: 80 MHz<br>Wi-Fi Security: WPA/WPA2/WPA3<br>Guest Network: 2.4 GHz, 5 GHz<br>WPS: True</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>Gigabit RJ45 Ports: 3<br>Ethernet Notes: 1× WAN port, the rest are LAN ports<br>Uplink Ethernet Ports:<br>1-Pack: 57×56×26 cm<br>22.44×22.05×10.24 inches<br>LED: System<br>Physical Buttons:<br>- WPS Button<br>- Reset Button<br>Power Input: DC Jack</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>QoS: Per-User Rate Limiting<br>DHCP:<br>- Address Reservation<br>- DHCP Client List<br>- Server<br>IP Versions: IPv4/IPv6<br>IPv6 Protocols:<br>- Relay<br>- Dynamic (SLAAC/DHCPv6)<br>- Static (Fixed IP)<br>- Passthrough<br>- 464XLAT<br>- MAP-E<br>- DS-Lite<br>IPTV/VLAN:<br>- Bridge<br>- Tag VLAN<br>- VoIP VLAN<br>- IPTV VLAN<br>IGMP:<br>- IGMP Proxy<br>- IGMP Snooping<br>Forwarding:<br>- Port Forwarding<br>- UPnP<br>- DMZ<br>Firewall:<br>- SPI Firewall<br>- Block PING</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>Gigabit RJ45 Ports: 3<br>Ethernet Notes: 1× WAN port, the rest are LAN ports</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Coverage Up to 3200 Sq ft<br>Processor: 1 GHz Single-Core CPU<br>Memory/Storage<br>Flash/ROM: 16 MB (128 Mbit) NOR<br>DDR/RAM: 128 MB (1 Gbit) DDR3<br><br>System:<br>LED Control: True<br>Local Control Method:<br>- Config Web Page<br>- App Control<br>Remote Control Method:<br>- Config Page via HTTPS<br>- App Control<br>- TR069/TR098/TR111/TR143/TR181<br>Firmware Upgrade:<br>- Local Update<br>- App (Over the Air)<br>- Online Update<br>Reliability:<br>- Timed Reboot<br>- Backup and Restore<br>Diagnostic Tools:<br>- Diagnosis<br>- Ping<br>- Traceroute<br>- NSLookup<br>- System Log<br>Languages:<br>- English<br>- Portuguese<br>- Russian<br>- Spanish<br>- Ukrainian<br>- French<br>- Simplified Chinese<br><br>Utilities:<br>VPN Client:<br>- PPTP<br>- L2TP<br>- Wireguard<br>DNS Options:<br>- Manual DNS<br>- Rebind Protection<br>- Override Clients\' DNS<br>Wake on LAN: True<br>Online Detection: True<br>Parental Controls: URL Blacklist, Time Schedule, Profiles, Client Management<br>Cudy Mesh, VPN Client, Cudy App, Cloud Control</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Power Methods: DC<br>DC Input: 12V 1A<br>Power Adapter:<br>- Input: 100 ~ 240 V, 50/60 Hz AC<br>- Output: 12V 1A DC<br>Max Power Consumption (W): 10W</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>110×154.5 mm<br>4.33×6.08 inches</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh', 12200.00, 12300.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/6OmiugwwwOL6CH6ycwlDL1g4EyqHBU5ZkSwOWoWs.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 13:30:19', '2026-05-26 13:30:19', 'Cudy M1500 AX1500 Mesh WiFi 6 Router (3 Pack) Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Cudy M1500 AX1500 Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router (3 Pack) in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy seamless mesh coverage, AX1500 speed, Gigabit ports, VPN support, and stable Wi-Fi 6 performance.', 'Cudy M1500, AX1500 Mesh Router 3 Pack, WiFi 6 Mesh System, Dual Band Mesh WiFi, Gigabit Mesh Router, Cudy Mesh System Bangladesh, Whole Home WiFi System, VPN Router, High Speed Mesh WiFi, International Office Solution', NULL, 208, NULL, NULL),
(192, 'Cudy M1800 AX1800 Dual Band Mesh Router (3 Pack)', 'The Cudy M1800 AX1800 Whole Home Mesh Wi-Fi 6 Router (3 Pack) is a powerful mesh networking system designed for large homes and offices. With AX1800 Wi-Fi 6 speeds, Gigabit ports, strong antenna design, and seamless roaming, it ensures stable, high-speed connectivity across every corner of your space.', 'cudy-m1800-ax1800-dual-band-mesh-router-3-pack-1779802465', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Cudy M1800 AX1800 Whole Home Mesh Wi-Fi 6 Router (3 Pack)</strong></h2><p>The Cudy M1800 AX1800 Whole Home Mesh Wi-Fi 6 Router (3 Pack) is a high-performance mesh networking solution built to deliver fast, stable, and wide-area wireless coverage for modern homes and offices. Powered by a dual-core high-performance CPU with 32MB flash and 256MB DDR3 memory, this system ensures smooth multitasking and reliable network performance even under heavy usage.</p><p>This mesh system delivers dual-band AX1800 Wi-Fi 6 speeds, offering up to 1201Mbps on the 5GHz band and 574Mbps on the 2.4GHz band. It is optimized for high-demand activities such as 4K streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, and smart home device connectivity, ensuring lag-free performance across all devices.</p><p>The Cudy M1800 3 Pack system is designed to eliminate Wi-Fi dead zones by creating a unified mesh network. As users move around the home or office, devices automatically connect to the strongest node, ensuring seamless roaming without interruptions or manual switching.</p><p>Each unit is equipped with four high-gain 5dBi antennas that significantly improve signal strength, range, and wall penetration. This allows stable connectivity even through multiple rooms and obstacles, making it ideal for multi-floor buildings and large spaces.</p><p>With support for both router and access point modes, the Cudy M1800 offers flexible deployment options. In router mode, it connects directly to the internet, while in access point mode, it works with an existing modem or router to extend coverage and improve network distribution.</p><p>The system includes advanced features such as PPTP and L2TP VPN client support, allowing secure remote connections to work or school networks. It also supports DDNS, enabling remote access to your home network using a custom domain name even when IP addresses change.</p><p>Each unit comes with multiple Gigabit Ethernet ports, providing high-speed wired connections for gaming consoles, PCs, smart TVs, and other devices that require stable and fast connectivity.</p><p>With features like Wi-Fi 6 efficiency, mesh roaming, VPN support, strong hardware performance, and wide coverage, the Cudy M1800 AX1800 Whole Home Mesh Wi-Fi 6 Router (3 Pack) is an excellent choice for users who need reliable, scalable, and high-speed internet throughout large areas.</p><h2><strong>Buy Cudy M1800 AX1800 Whole Home Mesh Wi-Fi 6 Router (3 Pack) from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Cudy M1800 AX1800 Whole Home Mesh Wi-Fi 6 Router (3 Pack) from International Office Solution. We provide authentic Cudy networking products at competitive prices with dependable customer support and warranty service. Order online or visit International Office Solution to get your product. The Cudy M1800 Mesh Router (3 Pack) comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>1201 Mbps (5 GHz), 574 Mbps (2.4 GHz)<br>Compatible with 802.11a/b/g/n/ac/ax Wi-Fi standards</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4× Fixed Omni-Directional Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Pair Button, Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>5 GHz, 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Wireless Modes:<br>Enable/Disable Wireless Radio, WMM<br>WEP, WPA/WPA2,<br><br>Wireless Functions:<br>WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK,WPA3</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1× 1000/100/10 Mbps WAN Port<br>1× 1000/100/10 Mbps LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11ax/ac/n/a 5 GHz<br>IEEE 802.11ax/n/b/g 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Processor: Dual-Core Processors<br>Flash: 256Mbit (32MB)<br>DDR: 2Gbit (256MB)</td></tr><tr><td>Operating System Support</td><td>Microsoft Windows 98SE /NT /2000 /XP /Vista /7 /8 /8.1 / 10, MAC OS, NetWare, UNIX or Linux</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>12 V / 1.5 A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band Mesh', 13800.00, 13900.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/Sk4A6ZOkyxyq85uGh41IMB2nuUrUMhAzqvkGhFCW.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 13:34:25', '2026-05-26 13:34:59', 'Cudy M1800 AX1800 Mesh WiFi 6 Router (3 Pack) Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Cudy M1800 AX1800 Whole Home Mesh Wi-Fi 6 Router (3 Pack) in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy AX1800 speed, mesh roaming, Gigabit ports, VPN support, and full-home coverage.', 'Cudy M1800, AX1800 Mesh Router 3 Pack, WiFi 6 Mesh System, Dual Band Mesh Router, Whole Home WiFi System, Gigabit Mesh Router, Cudy Mesh Bangladesh, VPN Mesh Router, High Speed Mesh WiFi, International Office Solution', NULL, 208, NULL, NULL),
(193, 'Cudy M11000 BE11000 Tri Band Wi-Fi 7 Mesh Router (2 Pack)', 'The Cudy M11000 BE11000 Tri-Band Wi-Fi 7 Mesh Router (2 Pack) is a next-generation mesh system built for ultra-fast speeds, wide coverage, and stable connectivity. With Wi-Fi 7 technology, BE11000 tri-band performance, 2.5G ports, and support for up to 200 devices, it is ideal for 4K/8K streaming, gaming, and heavy multi-device usage.', 'cudy-m11000-be11000-tri-band-wi-fi-7-mesh-router-2-pack-1779802685', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Cudy M11000 BE11000 Tri-Band Wi-Fi 7 Mesh Router (2 Pack)</strong></h2><p>The Cudy M11000 BE11000 Tri-Band Wi-Fi 7 Mesh Router (2 Pack) is a high-end networking solution designed to deliver exceptional speed, stability, and seamless whole-home coverage for modern smart homes and offices. Powered by the latest Wi-Fi 7 technology, it significantly improves latency, throughput, and efficiency compared to previous Wi-Fi generations, making it ideal for demanding tasks such as 4K/8K streaming, cloud gaming, video conferencing, and heavy multitasking.</p><p>This mesh system features a tri-band design, delivering combined speeds of up to 11Gbps. It offers up to 5.7Gbps on the 6GHz band, 4.3Gbps on the 5GHz band, and 688Mbps on the 2.4GHz band. This ensures optimized traffic distribution, reduced congestion, and consistently high-speed connectivity across all connected devices.</p><p>The system is powered by a high-performance Qualcomm quad-core processor and supports advanced Wi-Fi 7 technologies such as Multi-Link Operation (MLO), MU-MIMO, and OFDMA. These features enhance efficiency, reduce latency, and allow smooth performance even in environments with up to 200 connected devices.</p><p>Designed for full-home mesh coverage, the Cudy M11000 eliminates dead zones by creating a unified wireless network. Users can move freely throughout their home or office while maintaining uninterrupted connectivity, as devices automatically switch to the strongest node.</p><p>For wired connecti