(194, 'Cudy M3600 BE3600 Dual Band Wi-Fi 7 Mesh Router (2 Pack)', 'The Cudy M3600 BE3600 Dual Band Wi-Fi 7 Mesh Router (2 Pack) is a next-generation mesh system designed for ultra-fast speeds, stable connectivity, and whole-home coverage. With Wi-Fi 7 technology, BE3600 performance, Gigabit ports, and support for up to 200 devices, it ensures smooth internet for streaming, gaming, and smart home use.', 'cudy-m3600-be3600-dual-band-wi-fi-7-mesh-router-2-pack-1779803193', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Cudy M3600 BE3600 Dual Band Wi-Fi 7 Mesh Router (2 Pack)</strong> is a premium next-generation networking solution designed for high-speed, stable, and wide-area internet coverage in homes, offices, and smart environments.</p><p>Powered by a <strong>2.0 GHz Quad-Core ARM Cortex-A7 processor</strong>, along with <strong>512 MB DDR3L RAM and 128 MB NAND flash storage</strong>, this mesh system ensures smooth performance even under heavy network usage and multiple connected devices.</p><p>With advanced <strong>Wi-Fi 7 technology</strong>, the Cudy M3600 delivers blazing speeds of up to <strong>2882 Mbps on the 5 GHz band</strong> and <strong>688 Mbps on the 2.4 GHz band</strong>, making it ideal for 4K streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, and smart home connectivity.</p><p>It integrates modern wireless technologies such as <strong>MU-MIMO, OFDMA, Beamforming, and BSS Color</strong>, which significantly improve efficiency, reduce interference, and optimize signal distribution across all connected devices.</p><p>Each unit features <strong>4 internal high-performance antennas</strong> and <strong>3 Gigabit Ethernet ports (1 WAN + 2 LAN)</strong>, ensuring flexible wired and wireless connectivity options. A single unit can cover up to <strong>2100 square feet</strong>, and the 2-pack mesh system allows seamless whole-home or office coverage while supporting up to <strong>200 devices simultaneously</strong>.</p><p>The system supports both <strong>wireless and wired backh