(195, 'Cudy M3000 AX3000 2.5G Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router (3 Pack)', 'The Cudy M3000 AX3000 2.5G Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router (3 Pack) delivers powerful whole-home coverage with ultra-fast AX3000 speeds. Featuring Wi-Fi 6 technology, 2.5G WAN port, advanced mesh connectivity, and support for up to 160MHz bandwidth, it ensures stable, high-speed internet for homes and offices.', 'cudy-m3000-ax3000-25g-dual-band-wi-fi-6-mesh-router-3-pack-1779803414', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Cudy M3000 AX3000 2.5G Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router (3 Pack)</strong> is a high-performance networking solution designed for seamless whole-home or office Wi-Fi coverage. With three mesh units working together, it eliminates dead zones and ensures smooth, uninterrupted connectivity across large areas.</p><p>Each unit is powered by a <strong>1.3GHz Dual-Core Cortex-A53 processor</strong>, combined with <strong>256MB DDR RAM and 128MB flash storage</strong>, ensuring stable performance for multiple connected devices and heavy network usage.</p><p>Supporting <strong>Wi-Fi 6 (802.11ax) technology</strong>, the Cudy M3000 delivers blazing-fast speeds of up to <strong>2402Mbps on the 5GHz band</strong> and <strong>574Mbps on the 2.4GHz band</strong>, making it ideal for streaming, online gaming, video calls, and smart home applications.</p><p>With support for <strong>20/40/80/160MHz channel bandwidth</strong>, it maximizes throughput efficiency while reducing network congestion. The inclusion of <strong>OFDMA, MU-MIMO, and Beamforming technologies</strong> further enhances performance by optimizing signal distribution and minimizing latency.</p><p>The router is equipped with a <strong>2.5Gbps WAN port</strong> and a <strong>Gigabit LAN port (10/100/1000Mbps)</strong>, providing ultra-fast wired connectivity options for high-demand devices such as gaming PCs, servers, and smart TVs.</p><p>Each unit features <strong>five internal omnidirectional antennas</strong>, ensuring strong and stable wireless coverage throughout your environment. The mesh system allows seamless roaming, so users can move freely without losing connection.</p><p>Security is a key focus, with support for <strong>WEP, WPA/WPA2, WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK, and WPA3 encryption standards</strong>, ensuring a secure browsing experience. Advanced VPN support includes <strong>PPTP, L2TP, OpenVPN, WireGuard, and IPsec</strong>, making it suitable for secure remote access and business use.</p><p>The system also supports intelligent features such as <strong>parental controls, QoS management, firewall protection, and easy setup via the Cudy mobile app or web interface</strong>.</p><p>Compact, efficient, and powerful, the Cudy M3000 Mesh System is an excellent choice for modern households and offices that require fast, reliable, and secure internet connectivity.</p><p>Available from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted provider of original networking products in Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>1201 Mbps (5 GHz), 574 Mbps (2.4 GHz)<br>Compatible with 802.11a/b/g/n/ac/ax Wi-Fi standards</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>5 × Internal Omnidirectional Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Pair Button, Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>5 GHz, 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1 × 2.5Gbps WAN Port<br>1 × 10/100/1000Mbps LAN Port</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11ax/ac/n/a 5GHz<br>IEEE 802.11ax/n/b/g 2.4GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Processor: 1.3GHz Dual Core Cortex-A53 Processor<br>Flash: 1Gbit (128MB)<br>DDR: 2Gbit (256MB)</td></tr><tr><td>Operating System Support</td><td>Microsoft Windows 98SE/NT/2000/XP/Vista/7/8/8.1/10, MAC OS, NetWare, UNIX or Linux</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>12V/1A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh', 15100.00, 15200.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/51LK4nGwWeDM7qPv2OzvTK98a5G1wkPueaTDaJTY.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 13:50:14', '2026-05-26 13:50:14', 'Cudy M3000 AX3000 Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router (3 Pack) Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Cudy M3000 AX3000 2.5G Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Mesh Router (3 Pack) in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy AX3000 speed, Wi-Fi 6 technology, 2.5G WAN port, strong mesh coverage, and secure high-performance networking for home and office use.', 'Cudy M3000, Cudy M3000 AX3000, WiFi 6 mesh router, 2.5G mesh router, dual band mesh WiFi, Cudy mesh system 3 pack, WiFi 6 router Bangladesh, best mesh router BD, AX3000 router, high speed mesh WiFi, International Office Solution router', NULL, 208, NULL, NULL),
(196, 'Cudy WR300 N300 300mbps WiFi Router', 'The Cudy WR300 N300 300Mbps WiFi Router delivers stable and reliable wireless connectivity for homes and small offices. With speeds up to 300Mbps, VPN support, multiple operation modes, and mesh expandability, it ensures smooth browsing, streaming, and secure internet access for up to 30 devices.', 'cudy-wr300-n300-300mbps-wifi-router-1779803606', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Cudy WR300 N300 300Mbps WiFi Router</strong> is a compact and efficient networking solution designed to provide stable, secure, and high-speed internet connectivity for homes, apartments, and small business environments.</p><p>With wireless speeds of up to <strong>300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band</strong>, this router ensures smooth performance for everyday internet activities such as browsing, video streaming, social media usage, and online communication.</p><p>It comes equipped with <strong>four 10/100Mbps Ethernet ports</strong>, allowing users to connect wired devices like desktop computers, smart TVs, gaming consoles, and printers for a more stable and consistent connection.</p><p>The Cudy WR300 supports advanced <strong>VPN Client protocols including WireGuard, L2TP, and PPTP</strong>, enabling secure remote access to private or business networks while ensuring strong data protection and privacy.</p><p>One of its standout features is <strong>Cudy Mesh Satellite support</strong>, which allows users to extend Wi-Fi coverage by integrating with other Cudy mesh devices, eliminating dead zones and improving whole-home connectivity.</p><p>The router offers multiple operating modes including <strong>Router Mode, Access Point (AP), Repeater (RE), WISP, and Mesh Satellite Mode</strong>, making it highly versatile for different networking setups.</p><p>For better network control and safety, it includes features such as <strong>Wi-Fi scheduling, parental controls, domain blacklists, and an easy-to-use setup wizard</strong>, making installation and management simple even for beginners.</p><p>With support for connecting up to <strong>30 wireless devices simultaneously</strong>, the Cudy WR300 ensures smooth and stable performance across multiple users.</p><p>Compact, energy-efficient, and easy to configure, the Cudy WR300 is an ideal choice for users looking for a budget-friendly yet powerful Wi-Fi solution.</p><p>👉 Available now from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted provider of original networking products in Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>300 Mbps (2.4 GHz)</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2× Fixed Wi-Fi Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS Button, Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1× 10/100 Mbps WAN Port<br>3× 10/100 Mbps LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11n/g/b</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Transmit Power<br>CE: &lt;20 dBm (2.4 GHz)<br>FCC: &lt;30 dBm (2.4 GHz)<br>WAN Type: Dynamic IP/Static IP/PPPoE<br>Management:<br>Parental Control (Domain/IP/MAC Filter)<br>Device Management Panel<br>Guest Network<br><br>Software<br>DHCP: Server, DHCP Client List, Address Reservation<br>Dynamic DNS: Compatible with 15 more DDNS providers<br>Guest Network: 2.4 GHz Guest Network × 1<br>NAT: Port Forwarding, Port Triggering, UPnP, DMZ<br>VPN:<br>Protocols: Wireguard/L2TP/PPTP<br>Performance (TBD): 43 Mbps Uplink / 49 Mbps Downlink (Wireguard Client)<br>Firewall: SPI, DoS, Ping<br>Fast Roaming: Cudy Mesh Satellite (Pair with a Main Cudy Mesh Router)<br>IP Protocols: IPv4 / IPv6</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>118×80×27.5 mm<br>4.65×3.15×1.08 inches</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', '300mbps', 1600.00, 1600.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/OITKPmN1EmRjQUBDxITLa7aJaOlFuW4TZuJNqEgL.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 13:53:26', '2026-05-26 13:53:26', 'Cudy WR300 N300 300Mbps WiFi Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Cudy WR300 N300 300Mbps WiFi Router in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy stable 300Mbps speed, VPN support, mesh expansion, multiple operation modes, and secure connectivity for home and small office use.', 'Cudy WR300, WR300 router, N300 WiFi router, 300Mbps router, Cudy WiFi router Bangladesh, budget WiFi router BD, mesh satellite router, VPN router Cudy, best home router BD, small office router, International Office Solution router', NULL, 208, NULL, NULL),
(197, 'D-Link COVR-C1202 AC1200 Dual-Band Mesh Router (2 Pack)', 'The D-Link COVR-C1202 AC1200 Whole Home WiFi System (2 Pack) delivers seamless mesh coverage up to 465m² with stable dual-band performance. Featuring Smart Roaming, MU-MIMO, and Gigabit LAN ports, it ensures fast, uninterrupted internet across your entire home.', 'd-link-covr-c1202-ac1200-dual-band-mesh-router-2-pack-1779804233', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>D-Link COVR-C1202 AC1200 Whole Home WiFi System (2 Pack)</strong> is a powerful mesh networking solution designed to eliminate Wi-Fi dead zones and deliver seamless wireless connectivity throughout your home or small office.</p><p>With coverage of up to <strong>465 square meters</strong>, this dual-unit mesh system ensures stable and consistent internet access in every corner of your space. It is available in both <strong>2-pack (COVR-C1202)</strong> and <strong>3-pack (COVR-C1203)</strong> configurations, allowing users to choose based on their coverage needs.</p><p>The system uses <strong>dual-band AC1200 Wi-Fi technology</strong>, providing reliable speeds for streaming, browsing, online gaming, and smart home devices. It intelligently optimizes network performance through <strong>Smart Steering</strong>, which automatically directs devices to the best available frequency band for maximum speed and stability.</p><p>With <strong>Smart Roaming technology</strong>, users can move freely throughout the home while maintaining a strong and uninterrupted connection, as devices automatically switch to the strongest signal node.</p><p>The inclusion of <strong>MU-MIMO technology</strong> allows multiple devices to receive data simultaneously, improving overall network efficiency and reducing congestion in high-traffic environments.</p><p>Each unit is equipped with <strong>two Gigabit Ethernet LAN ports</strong>, enabling high-speed wired connections for devices such as gaming consoles, smart TVs, and desktop computers.</p><p>The D-Link COVR-C1202 system is designed for simplicity and performance, offering easy setup and reliable whole-home coverage without complex configuration.</p><p>Compact and antenna-free design ensures a clean and modern look, blending seamlessly into any home environment.</p><p>&nbsp;Available from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted source for original networking products in Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>•2.4 GHz: Up to 300 Mbps1<br>•5 GHz: Up to 866 Mbps1#<br>• Ethernet: 10/100/1000 Mbps (auto-negotiation)</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>Embedded omni-directional antennas<br>3 x internal antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Single button Wi-Fi Protected Setup (WPS)</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Wireless AC Wave 2<br>Wireless AC</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>Wired interface: 2 x Gigabit Ethernet LAN<br><br>Device Interfaces (per unit):<br>IEEE 802.11 ac/n/g/a wireless WAN<br>2 x Gigabit LAN ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>Seamless Wi-Fi network<br>Highly Efficient Wi-Fi Network<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>128-bit AES data encryption,<br>WPA/WPA2 wireless encryption</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>Ethernet Ports: 2 x Gigabit (Auto WAN/LAN)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Power Input: 100 V to 240 V/AC, 50/60 Hz,<br>Power Consumption: 8.7 W<br>Power Consumption (per unit): 3.5 W</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>109 x 117 x 51 mm (4.29 x 4.61 x 2.01 in)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>250 g (0.55 lbs) (per unit)<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01 year warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual-Band Mesh', 3300.00, 3300.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/NYQpQePYu8qyDQDcnBl3EHKTfoj8r2Ze1qePaBwV.jpg', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 14:03:53', '2026-05-26 14:03:53', 'D-Link COVR-C1202 AC1200 Mesh WiFi System (2 Pack) Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy D-Link COVR-C1202 AC1200 Whole Home WiFi System (2 Pack) in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy seamless mesh coverage up to 465m², Smart Roaming, MU-MIMO technology, and stable dual-band performance for home and office use.', 'D-Link COVR-C1202, COVR C1202 mesh WiFi, AC1200 mesh router, D-Link mesh system Bangladesh, whole home WiFi system, 2 pack mesh WiFi, best mesh router BD, D-Link router price, smart roaming WiFi, International Office Solution router', NULL, 210, NULL, NULL),
(198, 'Ruijie RG-EW300 Pro 300Mbps Smart WiFi Router', 'The Ruijie RG-EW300 Pro 300Mbps Smart WiFi Router is a budget-friendly Wi-Fi 4 router designed for stable home and small office internet use. With four antennas, WISP mode, and app-based management via Reyee Router App, it ensures simple, reliable, and efficient connectivity.', 'ruijie-rg-ew300-pro-300mbps-smart-wifi-router-1779804615', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Ruijie RG-EW300 Pro 300Mbps Smart WiFi Router</strong> is an affordable and easy-to-use networking solution designed for homes, small offices, and basic internet users who need stable and reliable wireless performance.</p><p>Supporting the <strong>Wi-Fi 4 (802.11n) standard</strong>, this router delivers speeds of up to <strong>300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band</strong>, making it suitable for browsing, social media, video streaming, and light online work.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>four high-performance external antennas</strong>, the RG-EW300 Pro provides improved signal coverage and stability, ensuring better connectivity across small to medium-sized spaces.</p><p>It supports <strong>WISP mode</strong>, allowing users to connect to an existing wireless ISP network and share the internet connection with multiple devices, making it highly flexible for different usage scenarios.</p><p>The router is designed to support up to <strong>8 recommended users</strong>, making it ideal for small households, shops, or small business environments with light to moderate internet usage.</p><p>With <strong>MIMO (Multiple Input Multiple Output) technology</strong>, the device improves wireless efficiency, reduces interference, and enhances overall network performance.</p><p>For wired connectivity, it includes <strong>one 10/100Mbps WAN port and three 10/100Mbps LAN ports</strong>, ensuring stable connections for desktops, smart TVs, and other wired devices.</p><p>A standout feature of this router is its <strong>smart management via the Reyee Router App</strong>, which allows users to easily configure, monitor, and control their network directly from a smartphone or tablet.</p><p>The router features a <strong>compact, modern design</strong> that fits seamlessly into any home or office setup, along with a <strong>12V/1A power supply</strong> for efficient operation.</p><p>Simple, reliable, and user-friendly, the Ruijie RG-EW300 Pro is an excellent choice for users looking for a cost-effective Wi-Fi solution.</p><p>Available from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted provider of original networking devices in Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>300Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4 Antenna</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Wi-Fi 4</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1x 10/100 Base-T WAN Port<br>3x 10/100 Base-T LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>Wi-Fi 4 (802.11n)<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>210 mm × 180 mm × 33 mm<br><br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>0.26 kg</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Pro 300Mbps Smart', 2100.00, 2100.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/FhySIpJoVUJ0ZnM4X2kYRtYHioH5s7zS2jqOyjyc.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 14:10:15', '2026-05-26 14:10:15', 'Ruijie RG-EW300 Pro 300Mbps Smart WiFi Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Ruijie RG-EW300 Pro 300Mbps Smart WiFi Router in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy stable 300Mbps Wi-Fi, four antennas, WISP mode, MIMO technology, and easy mobile app management for home and small office use.', 'Ruijie RG-EW300 Pro, EW300 Pro router, 300Mbps WiFi router, WiFi 4 router Bangladesh, Ruijie router BD, budget WiFi router, WISP router, smart WiFi router, small office router, Reyee app router, International Office Solution router', NULL, 211, NULL, NULL);
