(199, 'Ruijie RG-EW1300G 1300M Dual-Band Gigabit WiFi Router', 'The Ruijie RG-EW1300G 1300Mbps Dual Band Gigabit Mesh WiFi 5 Router delivers fast and stable wireless performance with dual-band speeds up to 1300Mbps. Featuring MU-MIMO, mesh support, and Gigabit ports, it ensures seamless connectivity for homes and small offices with up to 96 devices.', 'ruijie-rg-ew1300g-1300m-dual-band-gigabit-wifi-router-1779804801', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Ruijie RG-EW1300G 1300Mbps Dual Band Gigabit Mesh WiFi 5 Router</strong> is a high-performance networking solution designed for modern homes, offices, and smart environments that require fast, stable, and wide Wi-Fi coverage.</p><p>Built on <strong>Wi-Fi 5 (802.11ac) technology</strong>, this router delivers combined dual-band speeds of up to <strong>1300Mbps</strong>, with <strong>400Mbps on the 2.4GHz band</strong> and <strong>867Mbps on the 5GHz band</strong>. This ensures smooth performance for streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, and daily browsing.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>five external high-gain antennas</strong>, the RG-EW1300G provides strong signal strength and extended coverage of up to <strong>2500 square feet</strong>, minimizing dead zones and ensuring consistent connectivity across your space.</p><p>The router supports up to <strong>96 connected devices</strong>, making it suitable for busy households, offices, and smart homes with multiple users and IoT devices.</p><p>For wired connections, it includes <strong>one Gigabit WAN port and three Gigabit LAN ports</strong>, enabling high-speed and stable connections for PCs, gaming consoles, and other bandwidth-intensive devices.</p><p>With <strong>MU-MIMO technology</strong>, the router can communicate with multiple devices simultaneously, improving network efficiency and reducing lag even in high-traffic environments.</p><p>One of its key features is <strong>mesh networking support</strong>, allowing users to expand coverage easily by adding compatible Ruijie devices to create a unified, seamless Wi-Fi system throughout larger spaces.</p><p>It also supports <strong>Ruijie DDNS and VPN functionality</strong>, enabling secure remote access and enhanced privacy for users who require safe internet communication.</p><p>The router is also <strong>IPv6 compatible</strong>, ensuring future-ready networking for evolving internet standards.</p><p>Designed with simplicity in mind, the RG-EW1300G offers easy setup and management through a <strong>web interface or mobile app</strong>, allowing users to control guest networks, manage devices, and optimize performance effortlessly.</p><p>With its sleek design, strong performance, and advanced features, the Ruijie RG-EW1300G is an excellent choice for users seeking reliable, high-speed internet for both home and office use.</p><p>&nbsp;Available from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted source for original networking products in Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>1300Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>5 external antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4 GHz: 4.5 dBi<br>5 GHz: 5.5 dBi</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Wi-Fi 5</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1 x 10/100/1000 Base-T WAN port<br>3 x 10/100/1000 Base-T LAN ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>Wi-Fi 5 (802.11ac)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>230 mm × 130 mm × 30 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>0.29 kg (excluding package)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 3450.00, 3550.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/wX7Hk8bOselVVHGdsM95NtvzQso7u5tmqBCs0hGg.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 14:13:21', '2026-05-26 14:13:21', 'Ruijie RG-EW1300G 1300Mbps Dual Band Mesh WiFi Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Ruijie RG-EW1300G 1300Mbps Dual Band Gigabit Mesh WiFi 5 Router in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy high-speed 1300Mbps dual-band Wi-Fi, mesh support, MU-MIMO technology, and Gigabit ports for stable home and office connectivity.', 'Ruijie RG-EW1300G, EW1300G router, 1300Mbps WiFi router, dual band mesh router, WiFi 5 router Bangladesh, Ruijie mesh router BD, Gigabit WiFi router, MU-MIMO router, home office router, best router BD, International Office Solution router', NULL, 211, NULL, NULL),
(200, 'Ruijie RG-EW300N 300Mbps Smart Wi-Fi Router', 'The Ruijie RG-EW300N 300Mbps Smart Wi-Fi Router is a budget-friendly Wi-Fi 4 router designed for stable and reliable internet performance. With dual external antennas, 2x2 MIMO technology, and multiple LAN ports, it ensures smooth browsing, streaming, and basic office connectivity.', 'ruijie-rg-ew300n-300mbps-smart-wi-fi-router-1779805056', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Ruijie RG-EW300N 300Mbps Smart Wi-Fi Router</strong> is an affordable and efficient networking solution designed for homes, small offices, and everyday internet users who need stable wireless performance.</p><p>Built with <strong>Wi-Fi 4 (IEEE 802.11b/g/n) technology</strong>, this router delivers speeds of up to <strong>300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band</strong>, ensuring smooth browsing, HD video streaming, online communication, and light gaming.</p><p>It features <strong>two high-performance 4.5 dBi external antennas</strong>, which significantly enhance wireless signal strength and coverage, allowing stable connectivity across multiple rooms in small to medium-sized spaces.</p><p>For wired connectivity, the router includes <strong>one 10/100BASE-T WAN port and three 10/100BASE-T LAN ports</strong>, making it easy to connect devices such as desktop PCs, smart TVs, printers, and CCTV systems.</p><p>With <strong>2x2 MIMO technology</strong>, the RG-EW300N improves data transmission efficiency and reduces network congestion, ensuring more stable and reliable performance even when multiple devices are connected.</p><p>The router also supports <strong>DDNS (Dynamic Domain Name System)</strong>, enabling users to access their network remotely with ease, which is useful for monitoring or remote management applications.</p><p>Compact and energy-efficient, the device operates on a <strong>DC 5V/1A power supply</strong>, making it suitable for continuous use with low power consumption.</p><p>Its sleek black design, compact body, and lightweight build make it easy to install in any environment without occupying much space.</p><p>Simple, reliable, and cost-effective, the Ruijie RG-EW300N is an ideal choice for users looking for a dependable Wi-Fi solution for daily internet usage.</p><p>&nbsp;Available from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted provider of original networking products in Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>2.4 GHz, 300 Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2 x External Antennas<br>4.5 dBi</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Wi-Fi 4</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1x 10/100BASE-T port, 3x 10/100BASE-T ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>Wi-Fi 4 (IEEE 802.11b/g/n)</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>MIMO: 2,4 GHz: 2×2<br>DDNS</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>DC 5 V/1,0 A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>140 mm x 105 mm x 24.7 mm (7.08 in. × 7.08 in. × 1.18 in.) (excluding antennas)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>0.8 kg (1.76 lbs) (with packaging materials)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 1700.00, 1700.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/gTDo51zyXkXUhKBSAnCjWDQoPswL45klME158TbP.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 14:17:36', '2026-05-26 14:17:36', 'Ruijie RG-EW300N 300Mbps Smart Wi-Fi Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Ruijie RG-EW300N 300Mbps Smart Wi-Fi Router in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy stable 300Mbps Wi-Fi, dual antennas, MIMO technology, multiple LAN ports, and reliable performance for home and office use.', 'Ruijie RG-EW300N, EW300N router, 300Mbps WiFi router, WiFi 4 router Bangladesh, Ruijie budget router, smart WiFi router BD, home router Bangladesh, dual antenna router, MIMO router, affordable WiFi router, International Office Solution router', NULL, 211, NULL, NULL),
(201, 'Ruijie RG-EW3200GX PRO 3200Mbps Gigabit WiFi Router', 'The Ruijie RG-EW3200GX PRO 3200Mbps Gigabit WiFi 6 Router delivers ultra-fast dual-band wireless performance with advanced mesh support. Featuring 10 antennas, Gigabit ports, and WiFi 6 technology, it ensures smooth connectivity for homes and offices with heavy device usage.', 'ruijie-rg-ew3200gx-pro-3200mbps-gigabit-wifi-router-1779805230', '<p>The <strong>Ruijie RG-EW3200GX PRO 3200Mbps Gigabit WiFi Router</strong> is a high-performance next-generation networking solution designed to deliver ultra-fast, stable, and efficient wireless connectivity for modern homes, offices, and smart environments.</p><p>Powered by <strong>Wi-Fi 6 (802.11ax) technology</strong>, this router provides combined dual-band speeds of up to <strong>3200Mbps</strong>, including <strong>800Mbps on the 2.4GHz band</strong> and <strong>2402Mbps on the 5GHz band</strong>. This ensures seamless performance for 4K/8K streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, and heavy multi-device usage.</p><p>One of its standout features is <strong>Reyee Mesh technology</strong>, allowing multiple compatible routers to be connected together to create a unified whole-home or office Wi-Fi system. This eliminates dead zones and ensures smooth roaming across large spaces.</p><p>The router is equipped with <strong>10 high-performance antennas</strong>, delivering strong signal strength, wider coverage, and improved stability even in high-density environments.</p><p>With support for <strong>heavy network loads</strong>, the RG-EW3200GX PRO ensures stable performance even when multiple users and applications are running simultaneously.</p><p>For wired connectivity, it includes a <strong>Gigabit WAN port and four Gigabit LAN ports</strong>, providing ultra-fast and reliable connections for gaming consoles, PCs, servers, and smart devices.</p><p>Users can easily manage the network through the <strong>Reyee mobile app</strong>, which allows remote setup, monitoring, and control of the entire network from a smartphone or tablet.</p><p>The router is designed to handle <strong>multiple devices efficiently</strong>, making it ideal for smart homes, offices, and environments with high bandwidth demand.</p><p>With its powerful hardware, advanced Wi-Fi 6 capabilities, and intelligent mesh system, the Ruijie RG-EW3200GX PRO delivers a premium networking experience with maximum speed, coverage, and reliability.</p><p>&nbsp;Available from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted provider of original networking products in Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>3200Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>10 Antenna</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4 GHz<br>5 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Wi-Fi 6 (802.11ax)</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1x 10/100/1000 Base-T WAN Port<br>4x 10/100/1000 Base-T LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>190 mm x 190 mm x 41 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>0.8 kg</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Gigabit', 12200.00, 12300.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/k1XpeIFdLW4bmAY1FbhCP2npYLeYaXL9ShnXgFPp.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 14:20:30', '2026-05-26 14:20:30', 'Ruijie RG-EW3200GX PRO 3200Mbps WiFi 6 Gigabit Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Ruijie RG-EW3200GX PRO 3200Mbps Gigabit WiFi 6 Router in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy ultra-fast dual-band speeds, 10 antennas, mesh support, Gigabit ports, and stable high-performance connectivity for home and office use.', 'Ruijie RG-EW3200GX PRO, EW3200GX PRO router, 3200Mbps WiFi 6 router, dual band gigabit router, Ruijie mesh router BD, high speed WiFi router, gaming router Bangladesh, WiFi 6 mesh system, Reyee router, International Office Solution ro', NULL, 211, NULL, NULL),
(202, 'Mercusys MW325R 300Mbps Wifi Router', 'The Mercusys MW325R 300Mbps WiFi Router delivers stable and extended wireless coverage for homes and small offices. With four high-gain antennas, multiple operating modes, and strong security features, it ensures smooth browsing, streaming, and reliable connectivity.', 'mercusys-mw325r-300mbps-wifi-router-1779805592', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Mercusys MW325R 300Mbps WiFi Router</strong> is a dependable and cost-effective networking solution designed to deliver strong wireless performance and wide coverage for homes and small office environments.</p><p>With wireless speeds of up to <strong>300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band</strong>, this router is ideal for everyday internet activities such as HD video streaming, online gaming, social media browsing, and file downloads.</p><p>It is equipped with <strong>four high-gain 5dBi external antennas</strong>, which significantly enhance signal strength, stability, and coverage, ensuring better connectivity across multiple rooms and reducing dead zones.</p><p>The MW325R supports multiple operating modes, including <strong>Router Mode, Access Point Mode, and Range Extender Mode</strong>, allowing users to adapt the device based on their network requirements.</p><p>For enhanced network control and safety, it includes features such as <strong>parental controls, guest network support, and advanced wireless encryption</strong>, ensuring a secure and controlled internet environment for all users.</p><p>The router is designed with a <strong>simple and user-friendly web interface</strong>, making installation and network management quick and easy even for beginners.</p><p>Compact, efficient, and reliable, the Mercusys MW325R is an excellent choice for users looking to improve WiFi coverage and overall internet performance at an affordable price.</p><p>&nbsp;Available from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted source for original networking products in Bangladesh.</p>', 