(204, 'Mercusys MW330HP 300Mbps WiFi Router', 'The Mercusys MW330HP 300Mbps High Power Wireless N Router delivers strong and extended WiFi coverage with three high-gain antennas and Turbo Boost technology. Ideal for streaming, gaming, and large home coverage, it ensures stable and powerful wireless performance.', 'mercusys-mw330hp-300mbps-wifi-router-1779805958', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Mercusys MW330HP 300Mbps High Power Wireless N Router</strong> is designed to deliver strong, stable, and extended WiFi coverage for homes and small offices that require better signal penetration and wider wireless range.</p><p>With wireless speeds of up to <strong>300Mbps</strong>, this router is ideal for <strong>HD video streaming, online gaming, web browsing, and file downloads</strong>, ensuring smooth and uninterrupted internet performance.</p><p>It is equipped with <strong>three high-gain 7dBi external antennas</strong>, which significantly enhance signal strength and coverage, allowing WiFi to reach every corner of your home, including through walls and obstacles.</p><p>A key highlight of this router is its <strong>stand-alone Power Amplifier (PA) chip</strong>, which increases transmission power by up to <strong>2 times</strong>, ensuring a stronger and more stable wireless signal.</p><p>The <strong>Turbo Button feature</strong> allows users to instantly boost WiFi performance and extend coverage with a single press, making it easy to optimize network strength whenever needed.</p><p>The MW330HP is built to provide <strong>expanded coverage and stable connections</strong>, reducing dead zones and ensuring reliable connectivity across multiple rooms.</p><p>Compact, efficient, and powerful, this router is an excellent solution for users who need <strong>high-power WiFi performance at an affordable price</strong>.</p><p>Available from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted provider of original networking products in Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><fig