(205, 'Mercusys AC10 AC1200 Dual Band WiFi Router', 'The Mercusys AC10 AC1200 Dual Band WiFi Router delivers fast and stable internet speeds up to 1200Mbps. With 4 high-gain antennas, dual-band support, and advanced IPTV and IPv6 features, it ensures smooth streaming, gaming, and reliable home or office connectivity.', 'mercusys-ac10-ac1200-dual-band-wifi-router-1779806114', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Mercusys AC10 AC1200 1200Mbps Dual Band WiFi Router</strong> is a high-performance networking solution designed to deliver fast, stable, and efficient wireless connectivity for modern homes and small offices.</p><p>Supporting the <strong>802.11ac (Wi-Fi 5) standard</strong>, the AC10 provides total wireless speeds of up to <strong>1167Mbps</strong>, including <strong>300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band</strong> and <strong>867Mbps on the 5GHz band</strong>, offering significantly faster performance compared to older Wi-Fi standards.</p><p>With <strong>dual-band simultaneous connectivity</strong>, users can enjoy smooth multitasking across devices. The <strong>2.4GHz band</strong> is ideal for everyday tasks like browsing and email, while the <strong>5GHz band</strong> ensures lag-free performance for HD streaming, online gaming, and video conferencing.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>four high-gain 5dBi external antennas</strong>, the Mercusys AC10 provides strong signal strength, wider coverage, and improved stability, ensuring consistent connectivity throughout larger homes and office spaces.</p><p>The router also includes <strong>Guest Network Access</strong>, allowing users to provide secure internet access for visitors without compromising the main network security.</p><p>Advanced networking features such as <strong>IPv6 support</strong> ensure compatibility with modern internet standards, while <strong>IPTV support (IGMP Proxy/Snooping, Bridge, and Tag VLAN)</strong> optimizes streaming performance for a smooth and high-quality viewing experience.</p><p>Both frequency bands operate simultaneously, enabling multiple devices to perform different tasks without interference or slowdown.</p><p>With its powerful hardware, dual-band efficiency, and wide coverage design, the Mercusys AC10 is an excellent choice for users seeking reliable and high-speed WiFi performance.</p><p>Available from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted provider of original networking products in Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>Up to 300 Mbps on 2.4 GHz, 867 Mbps on 5 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4× 5 dBi Fixed Omni-Directional Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Reset/WPS Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4 GHz, 5 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Enable/Disable Wireless Radio, WMM</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1× 10/100 Mbps WAN Port<br>2× 10/100 Mbps LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11ac/n/a 5 GHz, IEEE 802.11b/g/n 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WEP<br>WPA / WPA2-Personal<br>WPA2 / WPA3-Personal</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>DHCP: Server, DHCP Client List<br>NAT Forwarding: Port Forwarding, Port Triggering, UPnP, DMZ<br>Firewall Security: SPI Firewall, IP and MAC Address Binding<br>Guest Network: 2.4 GHz Guest Network, 5 GHz Guest Network</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>9V/0.85A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>4.5 × 3.7 × 1.0 in (114 × 94 × 26 mm)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01-year warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band', 1690.00, 1690.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/g3laHlWw6Y82Hd9JF2sbQ1WDWm1KzPCuBPICN3u6.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 14:35:14', '2026-05