(206, 'Mercusys AC12 AC1200 Dual Band WiFi Router', 'The Mercusys AC12 1200Mbps Dual Band WiFi Router delivers fast and stable internet with dual-band performance up to 1200Mbps. Featuring 4 high-gain antennas, IPv6 support, and IPTV optimization, it ensures smooth streaming, gaming, and reliable home or office connectivity.', 'mercusys-ac12-ac1200-dual-band-wifi-router-1779806308', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Mercusys AC12 (EU) 1200Mbps Dual Band Wireless Router</strong> is a powerful and efficient networking solution designed for homes and small offices that require fast, stable, and reliable internet performance.</p><p>Built on the <strong>802.11ac (Wi-Fi 5) standard</strong>, the AC12 delivers combined wireless speeds of up to <strong>1200Mbps</strong>, offering a significant performance boost over traditional Wi-Fi 4 routers.</p><p>It operates on <strong>dual-band technology</strong>, providing <strong>300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band</strong> for everyday tasks like browsing and emailing, and <strong>867Mbps on the 5GHz band</strong> for high-demand activities such as HD streaming, online gaming, and video conferencing.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>four high-gain 5dBi external antennas</strong>, the router ensures strong signal strength, wider coverage, and improved stability across larger homes and office environments, reducing dead zones and connection drops.</p><p>The AC12 includes <strong>Guest Network Access</strong>, allowing users to securely share internet access with visitors without compromising the main network’s security.</p><p>Advanced features such as <strong>IPv6 compatibility</strong> ensure future-ready internet support, while <strong>IPTV optimization (IGMP Proxy/Snooping, Bridge, and Tag VLAN)</strong> enhances streaming performance for smooth and uninterrupted viewing experiences.</p><p>Both frequency bands operate simultaneously, enabling multiple devices to perform different tasks efficiently without slowing down the network.</p><p>With its com