(207, 'Mercusys MR30G AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Router', 'The Mercusys MR30G AC1200 Gigabit Dual Band Router delivers fast and stable internet with speeds up to 1.2Gbps. Featuring MU-MIMO, Beamforming, full Gigabit ports, and 4 high-gain antennas, it ensures strong coverage and smooth performance for multiple devices.', 'mercusys-mr30g-ac1200-dual-band-gigabit-router-1779806556', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Mercusys MR30G AC1200 Wireless Dual Band Gigabit Router</strong> is a powerful networking solution designed for homes and small offices that require fast, stable, and efficient internet connectivity.</p><p>With combined wireless speeds of up to <strong>1200Mbps</strong>, including <strong>867Mbps on the 5GHz band</strong> and <strong>300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band</strong>, the MR30G ensures smooth performance for HD streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, and everyday browsing.</p><p>The router is equipped with <strong>four high-gain 5dBi external antennas</strong>, combined with <strong>Beamforming technology</strong>, which enhances signal strength and direction, ensuring wider coverage and stable connectivity throughout your home or office.</p><p>It also supports <strong>MU-MIMO technology</strong>, allowing multiple devices to communicate simultaneously with the router. This reduces network congestion and improves overall efficiency, especially in environments with many connected devices.</p><p>With <strong>full Gigabit Ethernet ports</strong>, the MR30G provides wired speeds up to 10 times faster than standard Fast Ethernet, ensuring ultra-stable connections for PCs, gaming consoles, IPTV devices, and other high-demand applications.</p><p>The router supports advanced features such as <strong>IPTV optimization and IPv6 compatibility</strong>, making it future-ready and suitable for modern internet services.</p><p>Built for reliability, the MR30G has undergone extensive testing, including <strong>long-duration stability tests, power cycling tests, vibration tests, drop tests, and memory stress tests</strong>, ensuring long-lasting performance even in demanding environments.</p><p>With its strong hardware, advanced wireless technologies, and Gigabit performance, the Mercusys MR30G is an excellent choice for users who need a reliable, high-speed internet experience.</p><p>&nbsp;Available from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted provider of original networking products in Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>867 Mbps (5 GHz) + 300 Mbps (2.4 GHz), compatible<br>with 11ac/a/b/g/n Wi-Fi standards</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4× 5 dBi Fixed Omni-Directional Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS/Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4 GHz, 5 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1× Gigabit WAN Port + 2× Gigabit LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11ac/n/a 5 GHz, IEEE 802.11b/g/n 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA-PSK / WPA2-PSK</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>External Power Supply: 5V/0.6A<br>Transmission Power: &lt;20dBm (EIRP)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>6.3 × 5.0 × 1.5 in (159.7 × 125.9 × 37.1 mm)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 Year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band Gigabit', 2239.00, 2240.00, NULL, 6, 'products/thumbnails/NBOCyycLrVWWS6S9uYMdiNftDjNs1Ddy1buvicFv.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 14:42:36', '2026-05-26 14:46:25', 'Mercusys MR30G AC1200 Gigabit Dual Band Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Mercusys MR30G AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Router in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy 1.2Gbps speed, MU-MIMO, Beamforming, Gigabit ports, and strong WiFi coverage for home and office use.', 'Mercusys MR30G, MR30G router, AC1200 Gigabit router, dual band WiFi router Bangladesh, Mercusys router BD, Gigabit WiFi router, MU-MIMO router, Beamforming router, home office router, Mercusys MR30G price BD, International Office Solution router', NULL, 212, NULL, NULL),
(208, 'Mercusys AC12G AC1300 1300Mbps Dual Band Gigabit Router', 'The Mercusys AC12G AC1300 Dual Band Gigabit Router delivers fast and stable internet with speeds up to 1300Mbps. Featuring Gigabit ports, MU-MIMO, Beamforming, WPA3 security, and dual-band support, it ensures smooth streaming, gaming, and reliable home connectivity.', 'mercusys-ac12g-ac1300-1300mbps-dual-band-gigabit-router-1779806763', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Mercusys AC12G AC1300 Dual Band Gigabit Router</strong> is a powerful and reliable networking solution designed for modern homes and small offices that require high-speed and stable internet performance.</p><p>It delivers combined wireless speeds of up to <strong>1300Mbps</strong>, including <strong>400Mbps on the 2.4GHz band</strong> and <strong>867Mbps on the 5GHz band</strong>, ensuring smooth HD streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, and everyday browsing.</p><p>The router supports <strong>dual-band Wi-Fi (IEEE 802.11a/n/ac for 5GHz and IEEE 802.11b/g/n for 2.4GHz)</strong>, allowing users to balance speed and range depending on their needs.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>four high-gain 5dBi external antennas</strong> and <strong>Beamforming technology</strong>, the AC12G provides wider coverage and stronger, more stable connections throughout the home or office.</p><p>With <strong>full Gigabit ports (1 WAN + 3 LAN)</strong>, it delivers ultra-fast wired connectivity for devices such as smart TVs, desktop PCs, gaming consoles, and IPTV setups.</p><p>Advanced <strong>MU-MIMO technology</strong> allows multiple devices to communicate simultaneously, improving network efficiency and reducing congestion in busy environments. The <strong>Smart Connect feature</strong> automatically assigns devices to the best available band for optimal performance.</p><p>For security, the router supports modern encryption standards including <strong>WPA-PSK, WPA2-PSK, and WPA3-Personal</strong>, along with features such as firewall protection, access control, IP/MAC binding, and guest networks.</p><p>It also includes advanced networking functions like <strong>port forwarding (Virtual Server, UPnP, DMZ), IPTV support, and IPv6 compatibility</strong>, making it future-ready for modern internet services.</p><p>User-friendly management features allow both local and remote control, while the <strong>WPS/Reset button</strong> ensures quick and secure setup.</p><p>With strong performance, advanced security, and Gigabit-speed connectivity, the Mercusys AC12G is an excellent choice for users who want a stable and high-performance WiFi experience.</p><p>&nbsp;Available from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted provider of original networking products in Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>400 Mbps at 2.4GHz, 867 Mbps at 5 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4× 5 dBi Fixed Omni-Directional Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Reset/WPS Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4GHz and 5GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Enable/Disable Wireless Radio, Wireless Statistics</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1× Gigabit WAN Port<br>3× Gigabit LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11a/n/ac 5 GHz, IEEE 802.11b/g/n 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA-PSK / WPA2-PSK / WPA3-Personal</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Management: Access Control, Local Management, Remote Management<br>Port Forwarding: Virtual Server, UPnP, DMZ<br>Firewall Security: IP and MAC Address Binding<br>Guest Network: 2.4 GHz Guest Network, 5 GHz Guest Network<br>IPTV and IPv6 supported<br>MU-MIMO technology</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>12V/1A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>8.7 × 5.5 × 1.3 in (222 × 140 × 32 mm)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band Gigabit', 2290.00, 2390.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/oUG0gEnFuPwxX4I4QcSOJviHuOCPEI9mQW4lfzeR.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 14:46:03', '2026-05-26 14:46:03', 'Mercusys AC12G AC1300 Dual Band Gigabit Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Mercusys AC12G AC1300 Dual Band Gigabit Router in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy 1300Mbps speed, Gigabit ports, MU-MIMO, WPA3 security, Beamforming, and stable high-performance WiFi.', 'Mercusys AC12G, AC12G router, AC1300 Gigabit router, dual band router Bangladesh, Mercusys router BD, WPA3 router, Gigabit WiFi router, MU-MIMO router, Beamforming router, home office router, Mercusys AC12G price BD, International Office Solution router', NULL, 212, NULL, NULL),
(209, 'Mercusys MR60X AX1500 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi 6 Router', 'The Mercusys MR60X AX1500 Dual Band WiFi 6 Gigabit Router delivers fast and stable internet with speeds up to 1.5Gbps. Featuring WiFi 6 technology, MU-MIMO, OFDMA, WPA3 security, and Gigabit ports, it ensures smooth streaming, gaming, and high-performance connectivity.', 'mercusys-mr60x-ax1500-dual-band-gigabit-wifi-6-router-1779806972', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Mercusys MR60X AX1500 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi 6 Router</strong> is a next-generation networking solution designed to deliver ultra-fast, stable, and efficient wireless performance for modern homes and offices.</p><p>With combined speeds of up to <strong>1.5Gbps</strong>, including <strong>1201Mbps on the 5GHz band</strong> and <strong>300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band</strong>, it ensures smooth performance for HD streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, and everyday browsing.</p><p>Built with <strong>WiFi 6 (802.11ax) technology</strong>, the MR60X significantly improves network efficiency using advanced features such as <strong>OFDMA and MU-MIMO</strong>, allowing multiple devices to send and receive data simultaneously without lag or congestion.</p><p>The router is equipped with <strong>four high-gain 5dBi antennas</strong> and <strong>Beamforming technology</strong>, providing wider coverage, stronger signal strength, and reduced dead zones throughout your home or office.</p><p>For wired connections, it includes a <strong>Gigabit WAN port and two Gigabit LAN ports</strong>, ensuring ultra-fast and stable performance for gaming consoles, PCs, IPTV devices, and 4K streaming setups.</p><p>Security is enhanced with the latest <strong>WPA3 encryption protocol</strong>, along with firewall protection, IP/MAC binding, and guest network support, ensuring a safe and controlled internet environment.</p><p>The MR60X also features <strong>BSS Color technology</strong>, which reduces interference from nearby networks and improves overall wireless efficiency.</p><p>With support for multiple WiFi standards (802.11ax/ac/a/b/g/n), the router ensures broad compatibility with all modern and legacy devices.</p><p>Simple to set up and manage, the Mercusys MR60X is an excellent choice for users seeking high-speed WiFi 6 performance with strong security and reliable coverage.</p><p>Available from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted provider of original networking products in Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>1201 Mbps (5 GHz) + 300 Mbps (2.4 GHz)</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4× 5 dBi Fixed Omni-Directional Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Reset/WPS Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.5GHz, 5GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Reception Sensitivity:<br>11g 6Mbps: -97dBm<br>11g 54Mbps: -79dBm<br>11n HT40 MCS7:-74dBm<br>11n HT20 MCS7:-78dBm<br>11a 6Mbps:-94dBm<br>11a 54Mbps:-78dBm<br>11ac VHT20 MCS8:-74dBm<br>11ac VHT40 MCS8:-70dBm<br>11ac VHT80 MCS8:-65dBm</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1× Gigabit WAN Port<br>2× Gigabit LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>Compatible with 802.11ax/ac/a/b/g/n Wi-Fi standards</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA / WPA2-Personal<br>WPA2 / WPA3-Personal</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>WAN Type: Dynamic IP/Static IP/PPPoE/L2TP/PPTP<br>Management: Access Control, Local Management, Remote Management<br>NAT Forwarding: Port Forwarding, Port Triggering, UPnP, DMZ<br>Firewall Security: SPI Firewall, IP and MAC Address Binding<br>Guest Network: 2.4 GHz Guest Network, 5 GHz Guest Network<br>DHCP: Server, DHCP Client List</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 2690.00, 2790.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/JYWJlC6fqNjiXlyaYqA7Mq2mpt0hWeSr7JSuaIiS.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 14:49:32', '2026-05-26 14:49:32', 'Mercusys MR60X AX1500 WiFi 6 Gigabit Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Mercusys MR60X AX1500 Dual Band WiFi 6 Router in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy 1.5Gbps speed, WiFi 6 technology, MU-MIMO, OFDMA, WPA3 security, and Gigabit performance for home and office use.', 'Mercusys MR60X, MR60X AX1500 router, WiFi 6 router Bangladesh, dual band Gigabit router, Mercusys router BD, WPA3 router, MU-MIMO OFDMA router, gaming router BD, home office router, Mercusys MR60X price BD, International Office Solution router', NULL, 212, NULL, NULL);
