(210, 'Mercusys MR80X AX3000 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi 6 Router', 'The Mercusys MR80X AX3000 Dual Band WiFi 6 Gigabit Router delivers ultra-fast speeds up to 3Gbps. With WiFi 6 technology, MU-MIMO, OFDMA, WPA3 security, and Gigabit ports, it ensures powerful, stable, and future-ready connectivity for homes and offices.', 'mercusys-mr80x-ax3000-dual-band-gigabit-wifi-6-router-1779807227', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Mercusys MR80X AX3000 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi 6 Router</strong> is a high-performance networking solution designed for modern homes and offices that demand ultra-fast, stable, and secure internet connectivity.</p><p>With combined wireless speeds of up to <strong>3Gbps</strong>, including <strong>2402Mbps on the 5GHz band</strong> and <strong>574Mbps on the 2.4GHz band</strong>, it ensures seamless performance for 4K/8K streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, and heavy multi-device usage.</p><p>Powered by <strong>WiFi 6 (802.11ax) technology</strong>, the MR80X significantly improves network efficiency through advanced features such as <strong>MU-MIMO and OFDMA</strong>, allowing multiple devices to transmit and receive data simultaneously without lag or congestion.</p><p>The router is equipped with <strong>four high-gain omni-directional antennas</strong> and <strong>Beamforming technology</strong>, which enhances signal strength and extends stable WiFi coverage throughout large homes or office spaces.</p><p>For wired performance, it includes <strong>Gigabit WAN and LAN ports</strong>, ensuring ultra-fast and stable connections for PCs, gaming consoles, IPTV devices, and other bandwidth-intensive applications.</p><p>Security is strengthened with the latest <strong>WPA3 encryption protocol</strong>, providing advanced protection against unauthorized access and cyber threats.</p><p>Additional smart features include <strong>Target Wake Time (TWT)</strong> for improved power efficiency, <strong>BSS Coloring</strong> to reduce interference from neighboring networks, and <strong>Smart Connect</strong>, which automatically assigns devices to the best available band for optimal performance.</p><p>The MR80X also supports multiple WAN connection types including <strong>Dynamic IP, Static IP, PPPoE, L2TP, and PPTP</strong>, along with firewall protection, VPN server options, and guest network access for secure sharing.</p><p>With easy setup and management via web interface or mobile app, the Mercusys MR80X combines powerful performance with user-friendly control.</p><p>Available from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted provider of original networking products in Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>2402 Mbps (5 GHz) + 574 Mbps (2.4 GHz)</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4× 5 dBi Fixed Omni-Directional Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Reset/WPS Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4 GHz &lt; 20dBm (EIRP)<br>5 GHz &lt; 23dBm (band1、 band2)<br>5 GHz &lt; 30dBm (band3)</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Enable/Disable Wireless Radio, WMM<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1× Gigabit WAN Port + 3× Gigabit LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>Compatible with 802.11ax/ac/a/b/g/n Wi-Fi standards</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WEP, WPA / WPA2-Personal, WPA2 / WPA3-Personal<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>Network Services Enabled by Default<br>Web Server<br><br>Manage and configure device through web (HTTP/HTTPS)<br>Port: 80/443; Protocol: TCP<br><br>DHCP Server<br>IP address assignment (DHCP)<br>Port: 67; Protocol: UDP<br><br>DNS<br>Port: 53; Protocol: TCP &amp; UDP<br><br>App management<br>Manage and configure device through app<br>Port: 20001; Protocol: TCP<br>Port: 20002; Protocol: UDP</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Reception Sensitivity<br>11g 6Mbps: -97dBm<br>11g 54Mbps: -79dBm<br>11n HT40 MCS7:-74dBm<br>11n HT20 MCS7:-77dBm<br>11a 6Mbps: -97dBm<br>11a 54Mbps: -79dBm<br>11ac VHT20 MCS8:-75dBm<br>11ac VHT40 MCS9:-71dBm<br>11ac VHT80 MCS9:-67dBm<br>11ax VHT20 MCS11:-67dBm<br>11ax VHT40 MCS11:-64dBm<br>11ax VHT80 MCS11:-61dBm</td></tr><tr><td>Operating System Support</td><td>WAN Type<br>Dynamic IP/Static IP/PPPoE/L2TP/PPTP<br><br>Management<br>Access Control<br>Local Management<br>Remote Management<br><br>NAT Forwarding<br>Port Forwarding, Port Triggering, UPnP, DMZ<br><br>Firewall Security<br>SPI Firewall, IP and MAC Address Binding<br><br>Guest Network<br>2.4 GHz Guest Network, 5 GHz Guest Network<br><br>DHCP<br>Server, DHCP Client List<br><br>VPN Server<br>OpenVPN, PPTP supported</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Operating Temperature: 0°C~40°C (32°F~104°F)<br>Operating Humidity: 10%~90% Non-Condensing<br>Storage Humidity: 5%~90% Non-Condensing</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>8.2 × 6.8 × 1.6 in<br>(208.8 × 171.6 × 41.7 mm)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01-Year warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band Gigabit', 3800.00, 3900.00, NULL, 6, 'products/thumbnails/fNUQ9AhgNesexs65rFKpNzoL4uIDvznkAlOTvvYV.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 14:53:47', '2026-05-26 14:53:47', 'Mercusys MR80X AX3000 WiFi 6 Gigabit Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Mercusys MR80X AX3000 Dual Band WiFi 6 Router in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy 3Gbps speed, WiFi 6 technology, MU-MIMO, OFDMA, WPA3 security, and Gigabit performance.', 'Mercusys MR80X, MR80X AX3000 router, WiFi 6 Gigabit router, dual band router Bangladesh, Mercusys router BD, WPA3 router, MU-MIMO OFDMA router, gaming router BD, high speed WiFi router, Mercusys MR80X price BD, International Office Solution router', NULL, 212, NULL, NULL),
(211, 'Mercusys MW306R 300Mbps WiFi Router', 'The Mercusys MW306R 300Mbps Multi-Mode Wireless N Router delivers stable and reliable WiFi performance for everyday use. With 3 high-gain antennas, multiple operation modes, parental controls, and guest network support, it ensures smooth browsing and secure connectivity.', 'mercusys-mw306r-300mbps-wifi-router-1779807427', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Mercusys MW306R 300Mbps Multi-Mode Wireless N Router</strong> is a reliable and easy-to-use networking solution designed for homes and small offices that need stable internet connectivity for daily activities.</p><p>With wireless speeds of up to <strong>300Mbps</strong>, it is ideal for <strong>HD video streaming, online gaming, social media browsing, and fast file downloads</strong>, ensuring smooth and consistent performance across all connected devices.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>three high-gain 5dBi external antennas</strong>, the MW306R significantly improves signal strength, coverage, and stability, providing strong WiFi connectivity across every corner of your home.</p><p>The router supports <strong>four different operation modes</strong>, allowing users to customize the device according to their network needs and usage scenarios for maximum flexibility.</p><p>For better network management, it includes <strong>Parental Controls</strong>, enabling users to monitor and restrict internet access for children or employees, ensuring safe and controlled usage.</p><p>The <strong>Guest Network feature</strong> allows visitors to access WiFi securely without compromising your main network privacy, while <strong>QoS (Quality of Service)</strong> prioritizes important devices for better performance during high usage.</p><p>Setup is quick and simple with an intuitive web interface that guides users through installation in just a few minutes, making it beginner-friendly.</p><p>Additional features include support for <strong>IGMP Proxy/Snooping, Bridge Mode, and Tag VLAN</strong>, which optimize IPTV streaming for a smoother viewing experience, along with <strong>IPv6 compatibility</strong> for future-ready internet connectivity.</p><p>Compact, efficient, and user-friendly, the Mercusys MW306R is a perfect choice for users looking for affordable and stable WiFi performance.</p><p>Available from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted provider of original networking products in Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>11n: Up to 300Mbps (Dynamic)<br>11g: Up to 54Mbps (Dynamic)<br>11b: Up to 11Mbps (Dynamic)</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>3* Fixed Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>RESET/WPS Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4-2.5 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK<br>Enable/Disable Wireless Radio<br>WDS Bridging</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11 b/g/n</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>1 x 10/100Mbps WAN Port<br>3 x 10/100Mbps LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Operating System Support</td><td>Operating Temperature: 0°C~40°C (32°F~104°F)<br>Operating Humidity: 10%~90% Non-Condensing</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>External Power Supply: 5V/0.6A<br>Transmission Power: &lt;20dBm (EIRP)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>5.8 × 4.5 × 1.3 in (147 × 115 × 34 mm)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 1100.00, 1150.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/kAo1BypVFnv4PCVH6bwgUj2GYFHJjFQR6E5jKDtp.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 14:57:07', '2026-05-26 14:57:07', 'Mercusys MW306R 300Mbps Wireless N Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Mercusys MW306R 300Mbps Multi-Mode Wireless N Router in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy stable WiFi, 3 antennas, parental controls, guest network, IPTV support, and easy setup.', 'Mercusys MW306R, MW306R router, 300Mbps WiFi router, Mercusys router Bangladesh, budget WiFi router BD, multi mode router, parental control router, guest network router, IPTV router, home WiFi router, International Office Solution router', NULL, 212, NULL, NULL),
(212, 'Mercusys Halo H30G AC1300 Dual Band Gigabit Mesh Router (2 Pack)', 'The Mercusys Halo H30G AC1300 Dual Band Mesh Router (2 Pack) delivers seamless whole-home WiFi coverage with speeds up to 1300Mbps. Featuring mesh technology, roaming support, Gigabit ports, and easy app management, it ensures stable and fast internet across your entire home.', 'mercusys-halo-h30g-ac1300-dual-band-gigabit-mesh-router-2-pack-1779807600', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Mercusys Halo H30G AC1300 Dual Band Mesh Router (2 Pack)</strong> is a powerful whole-home networking solution designed to eliminate WiFi dead zones and provide smooth, high-speed connectivity across large spaces.</p><p>With advanced <strong>mesh technology</strong>, multiple Halo units work together to create a single unified WiFi network with one name and password, ensuring seamless connectivity throughout your home or office.</p><p>It delivers combined dual-band speeds of up to <strong>1300Mbps</strong>, including <strong>867Mbps on the 5GHz band</strong> and <strong>400Mbps on the 2.4GHz band</strong>, making it ideal for HD streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, and multiple device usage.</p><p>The system provides coverage of up to <strong>2800 square feet</strong>, ensuring strong and stable signals in every corner of your home without interruptions or dead zones.</p><p>With <strong>seamless roaming (802.11k/v/r support)</strong>, the Halo H30G automatically switches your device to the strongest unit as you move around, ensuring uninterrupted connectivity at all times.</p><p>It supports up to <strong>100 connected devices</strong>, making it suitable for smart homes with multiple users, smartphones, laptops, smart TVs, and IoT devices.</p><p>For wired performance, it includes <strong>full Gigabit Ethernet ports</strong>, enabling ultra-fast and stable connections for gaming consoles, PCs, and IPTV devices.</p><p>The system is easy to install and manage using the <strong>MERCUSYS mobile app</strong>, allowing users to set up, monitor, and control their entire network effortlessly.</p><p>Security features include <strong>WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK encryption, firewall protection, guest network support, and parental controls</strong>, ensuring a safe and secure internet experience.</p><p>With support for both <strong>IPv4 and IPv6 protocols</strong>, the Halo H30G is future-ready and compatible with modern internet standards.</p><p>&nbsp;Available from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted provider of original networking products in Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>867 Mbps on 5 GHz, 400 Mbps on 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Reset button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4 G Hz / 5 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>2× Gigabit Ports per Halo Unit<br>(WAN/LAN auto-sensing)</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11 a/n/ac 5 GHz, IEEE 802.11 b/g/n 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Operation Modes: Router, Access Point<br>Mesh protocol: 802.11k/v/r<br>Protocols: Supports IPv4 and IPv6</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>3.5 × 3.5 × 3.5 in (88 × 88 × 88 mm)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 Year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 5390.00, 5390.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/98sO6vSPQgsW8SbNH9a7mUtNZN4kuVBQrh3078nJ.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 15:00:00', '2026-05-26 15:00:00', 'Mercusys Halo H30G AC1300 Mesh WiFi Router (2 Pack) Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Mercusys Halo H30G AC1300 Dual Band Mesh Router (2 Pack) in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy seamless mesh coverage, 1300Mbps speed, roa