(213, 'Mercusys Halo H50G AC1900 Dual Band Gigabit Mesh Router (2 Pack)', 'The Mercusys Halo H50G AC1900 Dual Band Gigabit Mesh Router (2 Pack) delivers ultra-fast whole-home WiFi coverage up to 1.9Gbps. With seamless roaming, mesh technology, Gigabit ports, and easy app control, it ensures stable and high-speed internet in every corner of your home.', 'mercusys-halo-h50g-ac1900-dual-band-gigabit-mesh-router-2-pack-1779807749', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Mercusys Halo H50G AC1900 Dual Band Gigabit Mesh Router (2 Pack)</strong> is a powerful whole-home networking solution designed to eliminate WiFi dead zones and provide smooth, high-speed connectivity across large spaces.</p><p>Using advanced <strong>mesh technology</strong>, multiple Halo units work together to create a single unified WiFi network with one name and password. As you move around your home, the system automatically switches your device to the strongest Halo unit, ensuring uninterrupted connectivity through seamless roaming.</p><p>It delivers combined dual-band speeds of up to <strong>1900Mbps</strong>, including <strong>1300Mbps on the 5GHz band</strong> and <strong>600Mbps on the 2.4GHz band</strong>, making it ideal for 4K streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, and heavy multi-device usage.</p><p>Designed to support <strong>100+ connected devices</strong>, the Halo H50G ensures stable performance even in smart homes with multiple users and IoT devices.</p><p>Each Halo unit comes with <strong>three Gigabit Ethernet ports</strong>, providing ultra-fast wired connections for gaming consoles, PCs, smart TVs, and IPTV devices.</p><p>Setup and management are simple through the <strong>MERCUSYS mobile app</strong>, allowing users to configure, monitor, and control the entire network with ease.</p><p>Security is strengthened with <strong>WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK encryption and SPI firewall protection</strong>, ensuring a safe and protected internet environment for all users.</p><p>The system also supports 