(215, 'Mercusys Halo H70X AX1800 Dual Band WiFi Mesh Router (2 Pack)', 'The Mercusys Halo H70X AX1800 Dual Band WiFi 6 Mesh Router (2 Pack) delivers fast and stable whole-home coverage up to 4000 ft². With WiFi 6 technology, seamless roaming, Gigabit ports, and WPA3 security, it ensures smooth performance for multiple devices.', 'mercusys-halo-h70x-ax1800-dual-band-wifi-mesh-router-2-pack-1779808209', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Mercusys Halo H70X AX1800 Dual Band WiFi 6 Mesh Router (2 Pack)</strong> is a powerful whole-home networking solution designed to eliminate WiFi dead zones and provide fast, stable, and uninterrupted internet coverage.</p><p>Powered by <strong>WiFi 6 (802.11ax) technology</strong>, it delivers combined speeds of up to <strong>1800Mbps</strong>, including <strong>1201Mbps on the 5GHz band</strong> and <strong>574Mbps on the 2.4GHz band</strong>, ensuring smooth performance for HD/4K streaming, online gaming, video calls, and heavy multi-device usage.</p><p>Using advanced <strong>mesh technology</strong>, multiple Halo units work together to create a single unified WiFi network with one SSID and password. As you move around your home, the system automatically connects your device to the strongest Halo unit, ensuring seamless roaming and uninterrupted connectivity.</p><p>It provides coverage of up to <strong>4000 ft² (350 m²)</strong>, making it ideal for medium to large homes or offices, while supporting over <strong>150 connected devices simultaneously</strong> without performance drops.</p><p>Each Halo unit comes with <strong>three Gigabit Ethernet ports</strong>, enabling ultra-fast wired connections for gaming consoles, PCs, smart TVs, and IPTV devices.</p><p>Setup and management are simple with the <strong>MERCUSYS mobile app</strong>, allowing users to quickly configure the network, monitor devices, and apply parental controls for safe internet usage.</p><p>Security is enhanced with <strong>WPA3 encryption and SPI firewall protection</s