(216, 'Zyxel NBG-418N V2 300 Mbps Wireless Router', 'The Zyxel NBG-418N V2 300Mbps Wireless Router delivers stable and reliable WiFi performance for home use. With 802.11n technology, 2 high-gain antennas, and easy setup features, it ensures smooth browsing, streaming, and everyday internet activities.', 'zyxel-nbg-418n-v2-300-mbps-wireless-router-1779808799', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Zyxel NBG-418N V2 300Mbps Wireless N Router</strong> is a reliable and cost-effective networking solution designed for homes and small environments that require stable wireless connectivity.</p><p>With support for <strong>802.11n technology</strong>, it delivers wireless speeds of up to <strong>300Mbps</strong>, making it suitable for everyday tasks such as web browsing, HD streaming, online communication, and file sharing.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>two high-gain 5dBi Omni antennas</strong>, the router provides extended wireless coverage and improved signal strength, ensuring stable connectivity throughout your home and even outdoor areas like the backyard.</p><p>The Zyxel NBG-418N V2 also includes <strong>bandwidth management features</strong>, allowing users to prioritize network traffic for smoother performance during streaming, gaming, or multiple device usage.</p><p>For added convenience, the router supports <strong>WPS (Wi-Fi Protected Setup)</strong>, enabling quick and secure network connection with a simple button press, without complex configuration.</p><p>It also includes <strong>power-saving and interference reduction features</strong>, helping reduce unnecessary power consumption and minimizing wireless interference in high-density environments.</p><p>With its simple setup, stable performance, and user-friendly design, the Zyxel NBG-418N V2 is an excellent choice for users seeking an affordable and dependable wireless router for everyday internet use.</p><p>&nbsp;Available from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted provider of original networking products in Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>Transmit: 300 Mbps<br>Receive: 300 Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>Two 5 dBi fixed external antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Power on/off button<br>WPS/Reset button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4G frequency band: 2.400 – 2.4835 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>WAN: One 10/100 Mbps Ethernet RJ-45 port<br>LAN: Four 10/100 Mbps Ethernet RJ-45 ports with auto MDI/MDIX support</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE Standard 802.11 b/g/n</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>64/128 bit WEP, WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK<br>Firewall: Denial of service (DoS) prevention</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>5 Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>WLAN Features:<br>Access point mode<br>Universal repeater mode<br>WiFi Protected Setup (WPS)<br>WiFi Multimedia (WMM)<br>Wireless scheduling<br>Wireless output power management<br>Auto channel selection<br>MAC address filtering<br><br>Routing:<br>Network Address Translation (NAT)<br>Connection type: Static IP, DHCP, PPPoE, PPTP<br>DHCP server/client<br>Dynamic DNS<br>Bandwidth management<br>Auto-IP change<br>IPv6<br>UPnP<br><br>VPN Pass-through:<br>IPSec<br>PPTP<br>L2TP</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>142 x 102 x 23 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>148 g</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', '300 Mbps', 1050.00, 1050.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/rEvV2iph34wbFFiAnhloJktFczs5Zqtrt8xoIKYS.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 15:19:59', '2026-05-26 15:19:59', 'Zyxel NBG-418N V2 300Mbps Wireless Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Zyxel NBG-418N V2 300Mbps Wireless Router in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy stable WiFi, 802.11n performance, dual antennas, easy setup, and reliable home connectivity.', 'Zyxel NBG-418N V2, Zyxel 300Mbps router, wireless N router Bangladesh, budget WiFi router BD, home router 300Mbps, Zyxel router price BD, 2 antenna router, stable WiFi router, International Office Solution router, Zyxel router Bangladesh', NULL, 213, NULL, NULL),
(217, 'Zyxel NBG6604 AC1200 Dual-Band WiFi Router', 'The Zyxel NBG6604 AC1200 Dual Band Wireless Router delivers fast and stable WiFi up to 1200Mbps. With 4 high-gain antennas, dual-band technology, and easy mobile app setup, it ensures smooth streaming, gaming, and reliable home connectivity.', 'zyxel-nbg6604-ac1200-dual-band-wifi-router-1779808965', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Zyxel NBG6604 AC1200 Dual Band Wireless Router</strong> is a powerful and user-friendly networking solution designed for modern homes and small offices that require fast, stable, and wide WiFi coverage.</p><p>Built on <strong>802.11ac (WiFi 5) technology</strong>, it delivers combined wireless speeds of up to <strong>1200Mbps</strong>, offering significantly faster performance compared to traditional 802.11n routers.</p><p>The router features <strong>four high-gain external antennas</strong>, with dedicated antennas for both the <strong>2.4GHz and 5GHz bands</strong>, ensuring strong signal strength, improved coverage, and stable connections across your home.</p><p>With support for up to <strong>64 connected devices</strong>, the NBG6604 is ideal for households with multiple smartphones, laptops, smart TVs, and IoT devices, ensuring smooth performance even under heavy usage.</p><p>The <strong>dual-band functionality</strong> allows users to enjoy the 2.4GHz band for everyday tasks like browsing and email, while the 5GHz band provides interference-free high-speed performance for HD streaming, gaming, and large file transfers.</p><p>Setup and management are made extremely easy with the <strong>ONE Connect mobile app</strong>, allowing users to install, configure, and control their router in just a few minutes without needing a desktop PC.</p><p>The router includes <strong>four Ethernet LAN ports</strong>, enabling fast and stable wired connections for PCs, gaming consoles, printers, and smart TVs.</p><p>Its <strong>wall-mount design option</strong> offers flexible installation, allowing users to place the router in an optimal position for maximum WiFi coverage.</p><p>With strong antennas, dual-band performance, and smart app control, the Zyxel NBG6604 is a reliable choice for users who want stable and high-speed internet performance throughout their home.</p><p>&nbsp;Available from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted provider of original networking products in Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>Transmit: 300 Mbps for 2.4 GHz and 867 Mbps* for 5 GHz<br>Receive: 300 Mbps for 2.4 GHz and 867 Mbps* for 5 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4 External Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Reset and WPS</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>CE:<br>20dBm (2.4G frequency band: 2.400 – 2.4835 GHz)<br>23dBm (5G frequency band: 5.150 – 5.350 GHz)<br>28dBm (5G frequency band: 5.470 – 5.725 GHz)</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Wireless Standard<br>IEEE 802.11 b/g/n 2.4 GHz<br>IEEE 802.11 a/n/ac 5 GHz<br>Wireless Speed<br>Transmit:<br>300 Mbps* for 2.4 GHz<br>867 Mbps* for 5 GHz<br>Receive:<br>300 Mbps* for 2.4 GHz<br>867 Mbps* for 5 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1x RJ-45 WAN<br>4x RJ-45 LAN</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11 b/g/n 2.4 GHz<br>IEEE 802.11 a/n/ac 5 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK, WPS<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>4 port Fast Ethernet</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Power: 12V DC, 1A<br>Power consumption: 5W</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>(WxDxH): 202 x 133 x 29 mm (7.95\" x 5.24\" x 1.14\")</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>238 g (0.52 lb.)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01 Year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual-Band', 2000.00, 2000.00, NULL, 7, 'products/thumbnails/vXkvMppVfLWY5QEvKA8fSENePP4u6qYjbOSwCJCt.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 15:22:45', '2026-05-26 15:22:45', 'Zyxel NBG6604 AC1200 Dual Band WiFi Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Zyxel NBG6604 AC1200 Dual Band Wireless Router in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy 1200Mbps speed, 4 antennas, dual-band WiFi, mobile app setup, and stable home connectivity.', 'Zyxel NBG6604, AC1200 router, dual band WiFi router Bangladesh, Zyxel router BD, 1200Mbps router, home WiFi router, 4 antenna router, mobile app router setup, wireless router BD, International Office Solution router', NULL, 213, NULL, NULL),
(218, 'Zyxel Armor G5 AX6000 Multi-Gigabit WiFi Router', 'The Zyxel Armor G5 AX6000 WiFi 6 Router delivers ultra-fast speeds up to 6000Mbps with 12-stream performance and multi-gig ports. Designed for heavy usage, it ensures ultra-low latency, strong coverage, and smooth connectivity for gaming, streaming, and smart homes.', 'zyxel-armor-g5-ax6000-multi-gigabit-wifi-router-1779809144', '<p>The <strong>Zyxel Armor G5 AX6000 12-Stream Multi-Gigabit WiFi 6 Router</strong> is a high-performance networking solution built for demanding homes and offices that require ultra-fast speed, stability, and advanced connectivity.</p><p>Powered by <strong>WiFi 6 (802.11ax) technology</strong>, it delivers combined wireless speeds of up to <strong>6000Mbps</strong>, ensuring exceptional performance for 4K/8K streaming, online gaming, AR/VR applications, and heavy multi-device environments.</p><p>With <strong>12 simultaneous WiFi streams</strong>, the Armor G5 significantly increases network capacity, allowing more devices to connect efficiently while reducing congestion and improving overall performance compared to traditional WiFi 5 routers.</p><p>It is equipped with a <strong>multi-gig Ethernet port supporting 10G/5G/2.5G/1G speeds</strong>, enabling ultra-fast wired connections for NAS devices, servers, gaming systems, and high-performance networking setups.</p><p>A powerful <strong>2.2GHz 64-bit quad-core processor</strong> ensures smooth data handling, low latency, and stable performance even under heavy network load.</p><p>The router uses a <strong>high-power antenna system (8x8 on 5GHz and 4x4 on 2.4GHz)</strong>, delivering stronger signals, wider coverage, and reduced interference for consistent connectivity throughout large spaces.</p><p>For security and privacy, the Armor G5 supports <strong>OpenVPN</strong>, allowing users to create encrypted tunnels for secure remote access and safe browsing on public WiFi networks.</p><p>With support for <strong>multiple high-bandwidth applications</strong>, the router is ideal for smart homes, offices, and environments with many connected devices such as IoT systems, smart TVs, and surveillance devices.</p><p>Its advanced architecture ensures <strong>low latency, high throughput, and stable performance</strong>, making it a future-ready solution for modern digital lifestyles.</p><p>&nbsp;Available from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted provider of original networking products in Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>Transmit:<br>1200Mbps for 2.4 GHz<br>4800Mbps for 5 GHz<br>Receive:<br>1200Mbps for 2.4 GHz<br>4800Mbps for 5 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>13 Internal Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Guest WiFi<br>WiFi Protected Setup (WPS)<br>WiFi Multimedia (WMM)<br>Auto channel selection<br>Wireless scheduling<br>MAC address filtering</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>One 2.5G/1G WAN port<br>One 10G/5G/2.5G/1G LAN port<br>Four 1000/100/10 Mbps Gigabit Ethernet ports<br>One USB 3.1 Gen 1 port (5V/900mA)</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11 b/g/n/ax 2.4 GHz<br>IEEE 802.11 a/n/ac/ax 5 GHz<br>2.4GHz AX: 4x4 (Tx/Rx) 1024 QAM 20/40 MHz, up to 1.2 Gbps<br>5GHz AX: 8x8 (Tx/Rx) 1024 QAM 20/40/80/160 MHz, up to 4.8 Gbps<br>Compatible with 802.11a/b/g/n/ac WiFi standards</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>IPSec Pass-Through<br>PPTP Pass-Through<br>L2TP Pass-Through<br>VPN Support (OpenVPN)<br>VPN Client Support<br>WPA3-PSK<br>WPS Support<br>Guest Network<br>Automatic Firmware Update</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>WAN: One 100M/1000M/2.5Gbps Ethernet RJ-45 port with auto MDI/MDIX support<br>LAN: One 100M/1000M/2.5G/5G/10Gbps Ethernet RJ-45 port with auto MDI/MDIX support<br>LAN: Four 10M/100M/1000Mbps Ethernet RJ-45 ports with auto MDI/MDIX Support</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>CPU: 64 bit quad-core 2.2 GHz<br>Memory: 4GB Flash/ 1GB RAM</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Power: 19V/2.1A<br>Power consumption: 39W max.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>248 x 182 x 66 mm (9.8 x 7.2 x 2.6 inch)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>1kg (2.2 lb.)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 Year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Multi-Gigabit', 24500.00, 24500.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/wRb6E6rNamW8rOQ01WHQogx8MqwCABCfXiSDeLYy.jpg', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 15:25:44', '2026-05-26 15:25:44', 'Zyxel Armor G5 AX6000 WiFi 6 Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Zyxel Armor G5 AX6000 WiFi 6 Router in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy 6000Mbps speed, 12-stream WiFi 6, multi-gig ports, ultra-low latency, and powerful coverage for gaming and streaming.', 'Zyxel Armor G5, AX6000 WiFi 6 router, multi gig router Bangladesh, gaming router BD, high speed WiFi 6 router, Zyxel router BD, 10G port router, low latency router, smart home router, International Office Solution router', NULL, 213, NULL, NULL),
(219, 'Zyxel NBG7510 AX1800 Dual-Band WiFi Gigabit Router', 'The Zyxel NBG7510 AX1800 Dual Band WiFi 6 Gigabit Router delivers fast and stable internet up to 1.8Gbps. With WiFi 6 technology, MU-MIMO, OFDMA, Beamforming, and WPA3 security, it ensures smooth performance, wide coverage, and reliable connectivity for modern homes.', 'zyxel-nbg7510-ax1800-dual-band-wifi-gigabit-router-1779809365', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Zyxel NBG7510 AX1800 Dual Band WiFi 6 Gigabit Router</strong> is a next-generation networking solution designed to deliver fast, stable, and efficient wireless performance for modern homes and small offices.</p><p>Powered by <strong>WiFi 6 (802.11ax) technology</strong>, it provides combined speeds of up to <strong>1.8Gbps</strong>, ensuring smooth performance for HD streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, and multiple device usage.</p><p>With up to <strong>4× higher network capacity</strong> than previous WiFi 5 routers, the NBG7510 efficiently handles more devices simultaneously while reducing congestion and improving overall network performance.</p><p>The router features <strong>Beamforming technology</strong>, which focuses WiFi signals directly toward connected devices, eliminating dead zones and ensuring stronger, more stable connections throughout your home.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>four high-performance external antennas</strong>, it significantly enhances wireless coverage, allowing users to move freely without losing signal strength or speed.</p><p>Advanced <strong>MU-MIMO and OFDMA technologies</strong> enable the router to communicate with multiple devices at the same time, improving efficiency and reducing latency in busy network environments.</p><p>For enhanced security, it supports the latest <strong>WPA3 encryption standard</strong>, providing stronger protection against unauthorized access and ensuring a safer home network.</p><p>The <strong>Smart Parental Control feature</strong> allows users to manage internet access by setting schedules, time limits, and device-based restrictions, giving better control over family internet usage.</p><p>With its combination of speed, coverage, security, and smart control features, the Zyxel NBG7510 is an excellent choice for users seeking a reliable and future-ready WiFi 6 router.</p><p>Available from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted provider of original networking products in Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>AX1800 (600+1200Mbps)</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4 External Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>LED On/Off<br>WPS<br>Reset</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4GHz AX: 2x2 (Tx/Rx) 1024 QAM 20/40MHz, up to 574 Mbps<br>5GHz AX: 2x2 (Tx/Rx) 1024 QAM 20/40/80MHz, up to 1201 Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Guest WiFi<br>WiFi Protected Setup (WPS)<br>QoS: WiFi Multimedia (WMM)<br>Auto channel selection<br>4 SSIDs for multiple purpose<br>Multicast-Unicast Conversion<br>Traffic separation from host network<br>Band Steering<br>AP Steering</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11 ax/n/b/g 2.4 GHz<br>IEEE 802.11 ax/ac/n/a 5 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>IPSec Pass-Through<br>PPTP Pass-Through<br>WPA3-PSK/WPA3-SAE with AES<br>WPS Support<br>Guest Network<br>Automatic Firmware Update</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>One WAN 10/100/1000 Mbps Ethernet RJ-45 port with auto MDI/MDIX support<br>Three LAN 10/100/1000 Mbps Ethernet RJ-45 ports with auto MDI/MDIX support<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>CPU: 900 MHz Dual-Core<br>Memory: DDR256MB RAM<br>Flash: NAND Flash 128MB</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>12 V DC, 1A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>225 x 157 x 196 mm (8.9” x 6.2” x 7.7”)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>331 g (0.73 lb.)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 Year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Gigabit', 7200.00, 7300.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/lAqjEgFbid8kflZre7EZWzAUU110rzzLdnEC0fpg.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 15:29:25', '2026-05-26 15:29:25', 'Zyxel NBG7510 AX1800 WiFi 6 Gigabit Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Zyxel NBG7510 AX1800 Dual Band WiFi 6 Gigabit Router in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy 1.8Gbps speed, WiFi 6 technology, MU-MIMO, OFDMA, WPA3 security, and strong home coverage.', 'Zyxel NBG7510, AX1800 WiFi 6 router, Gigabit router Bangladesh, dual band router BD, Zyxel router price BD, MU-MIMO OFDMA router, WPA3 router, home WiFi router, gaming router BD, International Office Solution router', NULL, 213, NULL, NULL);
