(220, 'Zyxel Armor G1 AC2600 Multi-Gigabit WiFi Router', 'The Zyxel Armor G1 NBG6818 AC2600 Multi-Gigabit WiFi Router delivers ultra-fast and stable internet performance with multi-stream WiFi, strong coverage, and advanced security features. Ideal for gaming, 8K streaming, and heavy multi-device usage.', 'zyxel-armor-g1-ac2600-multi-gigabit-wifi-router-1779809568', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Zyxel Armor G1 NBG6818 AC2600 Multi-Gigabit WiFi Router</strong> is a high-performance networking solution designed for users who demand ultra-fast speed, strong coverage, and reliable connectivity for modern smart homes and offices.</p><p>With <strong>AC2600 dual-band WiFi technology</strong>, it delivers powerful wireless performance suitable for <strong>4K/8K streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, and large file transfers</strong>, ensuring a smooth and uninterrupted experience.</p><p>The router features a <strong>multi-stream WiFi architecture</strong> supported by high-powered amplifiers and <strong>13 advanced internal antennas</strong>, which significantly enhance coverage, reduce interference, and improve overall network stability across large spaces.</p><p>It supports <strong>multi-gig internet connectivity up to 2.5Gbps</strong>, allowing users to fully utilize high-speed internet plans and experience ultra-fast wired and wireless performance.</p><p>With its high-capacity design, the Armor G1 is ideal for <strong>intensive applications such as 8K video streaming, competitive gaming, and smart home ecosystems</strong>, ensuring consistent performance even under heavy network load.</p><p>For security and privacy, it includes <strong>OpenVPN support</strong>, allowing users to create encrypted tunnels for secure remote access and safe browsing, even on public WiFi networks.</p><p>The router also supports <strong>Alexa voice control</strong>, enabling users to easily manage key functions such as turning WiFi on/off, controlling guest networks, checking internet speed, and monitoring network security status using simple voice commands.</p><p>With its combination of speed, intelligent features, and advanced security, the Zyxel Armor G1 is a premium choice for users who need a future-ready and powerful networking solution.</p><p>Available from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted provider of original networking products in Bangladesh.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>Transmit:<br>800Mbps for 2.4 GHz<br>1733Mbps for 5 GHz<br>Receive:<br>800Mbps for 2.4 GHz<br>1733Mbps for 5 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>13 Internal Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>MU-MIMO<br>Guest WiFi<br>WiFi Protected Setup (WPS)<br>Auto channel selection<br>Wireless scheduling<br>MAC address filtering</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>One 2.5 Gbps WAN port<br>Four Gigabit Ethernet ports<br>One USB 3.1 Gen 2 port</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11 b/g/n 2.4 GHz<br>IEEE 802.11 a/n/ac 5 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA2-PSK/WPA3-PSK<br>WPS support<br>VPN support (OpenVPN)<br>VPN client support<br>IPSec pass-through<br>PPTP pass-through<br>L2TP pass-through<br>Guest network<br>Automatic firmware update</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>WAN: One 100/1000/2500 Mbps Ethernet RJ-45 port with auto MDI/MDIX support<br>LAN: Four 10/100/1000 Mbps Ethernet RJ-45 ports with auto MDI/MDIX support</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>CPU: 1 GHz processor<br>Memory: 256MB Flash and 512MB RAM</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Power: 12V/3A<br>Power consumption: 25W max.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>248 x 182 x 66 mm (9.8 x 7.2 x 2.6 inch)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>1kg (2.2 lb.)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 Year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Gigabit', 14999.00, 14999.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/UIKg2eHnHaMpJfn54pUZBi6fkT0OneLpEf3NqNqU.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-26 15:32:48', '2026-05-26 15:32:48', 'Zyxel Armor G1 NBG6818 AC2600 Multi-Gigabit WiFi Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Zyxel Armor G1 NBG6818 AC2600 Multi-Gigabit WiFi Router in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Enjoy ultra-fast speed, multi-gig connectivity, 8K streaming support, OpenVPN security, and strong coverage.', 'Zyxel Armor G1, NBG6818 router, AC2600 WiFi router Bangladesh, multi gig router BD, high speed gaming router, Zyxel router price BD, 8K streaming router, OpenVPN router, smart home router, International Office Solution router', NULL, 213, NULL, NULL),
(221, 'Totolink A302R Dual Band Gigabit Router', 'The TOTOLINK A302R AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Router is a high-performance networking solution designed for smooth online gaming, HD streaming, video conferencing, and high-speed internet browsing. Featuring dual-band Wi-Fi technology with speeds up to 1167Mbps, this router ensures stable connectivity and wider wireless coverage for homes and small offices. Equipped with Gigabit WAN and LAN ports, the TOTOLINK A302R delivers ultra-fast wired connections for bandwidth-intensive tasks.', 'totolink-a302r-dual-band-gigabit-router-1780061412', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2>TOTOLINK A302R AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Router Full Description</h2><p>The TOTOLINK A302R AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Router is a powerful and reliable wireless networking device built to deliver stable internet performance for modern homes, apartments, and office environments. Designed with advanced dual-band Wi-Fi technology, the router combines 300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band and 867Mbps on the 5GHz band, providing a total wireless speed of up to 1167Mbps. This dual-band performance ensures smooth HD streaming, lag-free gaming, faster downloads, and seamless video calls across multiple connected devices.</p><p>The TOTOLINK A302R features four high-gain external antennas that significantly improve wireless signal strength and coverage throughout your space. Whether you are working from home, attending online classes, streaming 4K content, or connecting multiple smart devices, the router maintains stable and efficient connectivity.</p><p>For users who require high-speed wired networking, the router comes equipped with Gigabit WAN and LAN ports. These ports offer significantly faster data transfer speeds compared to standard Fast Ethernet ports, making the router ideal for gaming PCs, smart TVs, NAS systems, desktop computers, and other bandwidth-demanding devices.</p><p>The router supports advanced wireless standards and technologies that help optimize network efficiency and performance. Intelligent bandwidth allocation ensures smoother internet usage for multiple users simultaneously, while advanced security features help protect your network from unauthorized access.</p><p>The TOTOLINK A302R also supports easy setup and management through its user-friendly interface. Users can quickly configure internet settings, parental controls, guest networks, and wireless security options without complicated installation processes.</p><p>Built with a compact and modern design, the router fits perfectly in both home and office setups. Its efficient cooling design and stable hardware platform ensure long-lasting and reliable operation even during heavy internet usage.</p><p>International Office Solution recommends the TOTOLINK A302R AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Router for users looking for an affordable yet powerful networking solution with fast wireless speeds, Gigabit wired connectivity, and reliable performance for everyday internet activities.</p><h2>Why Buy TOTOLINK A302R from International Office Solution?</h2><p>International Office Solution offers genuine networking products with reliable customer support and competitive pricing. The TOTOLINK A302R router is an excellent choice for users who need stable internet coverage, faster wired networking, and dual-band Wi-Fi performance for daily work, entertainment, and smart home connectivity.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>2.4GHz: Up to 300Mbps<br>5GHz: Up to 867Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2 * 5dBi detachable antennas (2.4GHz)<br>2 * 5dBi detachable antennas (5GHz)</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1 *RST/WPS Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4GHz/5GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>- Basic Settings<br>- Multiple SSID1<br>- Multiple SSID2<br>- Multiple SSID3<br>- Multiple SSID4<br>- Advanced Settings<br>- Access Control<br>- WDS Settings<br>- WPS Settings<br>- Wireless Schedule<br>- Band Steering</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>4 *1000Mbps Adaptive LAN Ports<br>1 *1000Mbps Adaptive WAN Port</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>- IEEE 802.11ac,<br>- IEEE 802.11a,<br>- IEEE 802.11b,<br>- IEEE 802.11g,<br>- IEEE 802.11n</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>4 x LAN Ports<br>1 x WAN Port</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Firewall<br>- MAC Filtering<br>- IP/Port Filtering<br>- Virtual Server(Port Forwarding)<br>- URL Filtering<br>- DMZ<br><br>System<br>- Upgrade Firmware<br>- Save/Reload Settings<br>- Time Zone Settings<br>- DDNS<br>- Denial-of-Service<br>- TR-069 Config<br>- Password Settings<br>- Reboot Schedule<br>- System Log<br>- Statistics<br>- Run Command<br>- Logout</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>DC 9V /0.8A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>210 x 120 x 40mm</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band Gigabit', 2075.00, 2130.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/Qop4o5M9VlaRysckyjyRClswIJUyCNJ0Hz1AZlWG.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-29 13:30:12', '2026-05-29 13:30:12', 'TOTOLINK A302R AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the TOTOLINK A302R AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Router from International Office Solution in Bangladesh. Enjoy fast dual-band Wi-Fi speeds up to 1167Mbps, Gigabit LAN/WAN ports, wide coverage, and stable internet performance for home and office use.', 'TOTOLINK A302R, TOTOLINK Router, AC1200 Router, Dual Band Router, Gigabit Router, WiFi Router BD, TOTOLINK A302R Bangladesh, Wireless Router, Home Router, Office Router, International Office Solution, AC1200 WiFi', NULL, 214, NULL, NULL),
(222, 'Totolink A3002R V4 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Router', 'The TOTOLINK A3002R V4 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Router is a reliable high-speed networking solution designed for smooth streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, and stable internet connectivity. With dual-band Wi-Fi speeds up to 1167Mbps, Gigabit WAN/LAN ports, and four high-gain antennas, this router delivers excellent coverage and strong performance for both home and office users.', 'totolink-a3002r-v4-ac1200-dual-band-gigabit-router-1780061766', '<p>TOTOLINK A3002R V4 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Router Full Description The TOTOLINK A3002R V4 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Router is built to provide fast, stable, and secure wireless connectivity for modern homes, apartments, and office environments. Powered by advanced IEEE 802.11ac Wi-Fi technology, this router delivers combined wireless speeds of up to 1167Mbps, including 300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band and 867Mbps on the 5GHz band. This dual-band performance ensures seamless HD streaming, faster downloads, smooth online gaming, and uninterrupted video calls across multiple connected devices.</p><p>Designed for both wireless and wired performance, the TOTOLINK A3002R V4 features 3 adaptive Gigabit LAN ports and 1 adaptive Gigabit WAN port. These Gigabit ports provide significantly faster and more stable wired networking compared to standard Ethernet ports, making the router ideal for gaming PCs, smart TVs, desktop computers, NAS systems, and office workstations.</p><p>The router comes equipped with four fixed high-gain 5dBi antennas, including two dedicated antennas for the 2.4GHz band and two for the 5GHz band. These antennas enhance wireless coverage and improve signal stability throughout your home or office, helping eliminate weak signal areas and ensuring consistent internet performance.</p><p>The TOTOLINK A3002R V4 supports multiple operating modes including Gateway Mode and Repeater Mode, allowing users to customize their network setup based on different connectivity requirements. Whether you need a primary router for broadband internet or a repeater to extend existing Wi-Fi coverage, this router offers flexible networking solutions.</p><p>For enhanced user convenience and network management, the router includes features such as QoS bandwidth control, IPTV support, Guest Network, DDNS configuration, IPv6 compatibility, firewall protection, and WPA/WPA2 mixed wireless encryption. These advanced networking features help optimize bandwidth usage, improve security, and support modern internet services.</p><p>The router also includes a dedicated RST/WPS button for quick setup and secure device pairing. LED indicators provide real-time system and connection status updates, making network monitoring simple and user-friendly.</p><p>Compact and stylish in design, the TOTOLINK A3002R V4 fits easily into any home or office setup. Its stable hardware platform and efficient thermal design ensure reliable long-term operation even during heavy internet usage.</p><p>International Office Solution recommends the TOTOLINK A3002R V4 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Router for users looking for a dependable and affordable networking solution with strong wireless coverage, Gigabit wired connectivity, and advanced management features.</p><p>Buy TOTOLINK A3002R V4 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Router from International Office Solution In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original TOTOLINK A3002R V4 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of latest TOTOLINK routers at competitive prices for home and office networking solutions. Order online or visit International Office Solution to get genuine products with official warranty support and reliable customer service.</p><p>The TOTOLINK A3002R V4 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Router comes with a 01-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>2.4GHz: Up to 300Mbps<br>5GHz: Up to 867Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2 * 2.4GHz fixed antennas(5dBi)<br>2 * 5GHz fixed antennas(5dBi)</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1 *RST/WPS Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4GHz/5GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>- Basic Settings<br>- Guest network<br>- Schedule<br>- Access Control<br>- Advanced</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>3 *1000Mbps Adaptive LAN Ports<br>1 *1000Mbps Adaptive WAN Port</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11ac<br>IEEE 802.11a<br>IEEE 802.11b<br>IEEE 802.11g<br>IEEE 802.11n</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>3 x LAN Ports<br>1 x WAN Port</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Firewall<br>- MAC Filtering<br>- IP/Port Filtering<br>- Virtual Server(Port Forwarding)<br>- URL Filtering<br>- DMZ<br><br>System<br>- Upgrade Firmware<br>- Save/Reload Settings<br>- Time Zone Settings<br>- DDNS<br>- Denial-of-Service<br>- TR-069 Config<br>- Password Settings<br>- Reboot Schedule<br>- System Log<br>- Statistics<br>- Run Command<br>- Logout</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>206*121*41mm</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 2794.00, 2894.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/a3Lx2vlpivPrtQQrE6ITncRyQjWMyzSuddsm4Ip1.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-29 13:36:06', '2026-05-29 13:36:06', 'TOTOLINK A3002R V4 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the TOTOLINK A3002R V4 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Router from International Office Solution in Bangladesh. Enjoy fast dual-band Wi-Fi, Gigabit ports, strong coverage, advanced security, and stable internet performance for home and office use.', 'TOTOLINK A3002R V4, TOTOLINK Router, AC1200 Router, Dual Band Gigabit Router, WiFi Router Bangladesh, TOTOLINK A3002R Price BD, Gigabit WiFi Router, Home Router, Office Router, International Office Solution', NULL, 214, NULL, NULL),
(223, 'TOTOLINK X2000R AX1500 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi Router', 'The TOTOLINK X2000R AX1500 Wireless Dual Band Gigabit Router delivers high-speed Wi-Fi 6 performance with combined wireless speeds up to 1501Mbps. Featuring OFDMA, MU-MIMO, Beamforming technology, and Gigabit ports, it ensures stable, fast, and efficient internet connectivity for homes and offices. Ideal for gaming, streaming, and multi-device usage.', 'totolink-x2000r-ax1500-dual-band-gigabit-wifi-router-1780062086', '<p>TOTOLINK X2000R AX1500 Wireless Dual Band Gigabit Router Long Description The TOTOLINK X2000R AX1500 Wireless Dual Band Gigabit Router is a next-generation Wi-Fi 6 router designed to provide ultra-fast internet connectivity, wider coverage, and improved network efficiency for homes and offices. Built with the latest IEEE 802.11ax (Wi-Fi 6) technology, the X2000R ensures faster data transmission, lower latency, and stable performance even when multiple devices are connected simultaneously.</p><p>This powerful dual-band router supports combined wireless speeds of up to 1501Mbps, including 1201Mbps on the 5GHz band and 300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band. With backward compatibility for IEEE 802.11a/b/g/n/ac standards, the router works seamlessly with both modern and older wireless devices.</p><p>The TOTOLINK X2000R is equipped with advanced technologies such as OFDMA, MU-MIMO, and Beamforming to optimize wireless performance and maximize coverage. OFDMA technology divides a single wireless channel into multiple sub-channels, allowing multiple devices to communicate simultaneously with reduced latency and improved efficiency. MU-MIMO technology enables multiple devices to enjoy high-speed internet at the same time without slowing down the network, making it ideal for gaming, streaming, video conferencing, and smart home applications.</p><p>Beamforming technology intelligently directs Wi-Fi signals toward connected devices, ensuring stronger and more stable connections throughout your home or office. The Gigabit LAN and WAN ports provide high-speed wired connectivity for PCs, gaming consoles, smart TVs, and NAS devices.</p><p>With its sleek design, powerful hardware, and easy setup process, the TOTOLINK X2000R AX1500 Router is a reliable networking solution for users seeking high-speed and uninterrupted internet connectivity.</p><p>Buy TOTOLINK X2000R AX1500 Wireless Dual Band Gigabit Router from International Office Solution In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original TOTOLINK X2000R AX1500 Wireless Dual Band Gigabit Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of the latest TOTOLINK routers at competitive prices. Order online or visit your nearest International Office Solution outlet to get the best deal. The TOTOLINK X2000R AX1500 Wireless Dual Band Gigabit Router comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>2.4GHz: Up to 300Mbps<br>5GHz: Up to 1201Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2 * 2.4GHz fixed antennas(5dBi)<br>2 * 5GHz fixed antennas(5dBi)</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1 * RST/WPS Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4GHz/5GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>4 * 10/100/1000Mbps LAN Ports<br>1 * 10/100/1000Mbps WAN Port</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11ax, IEEE 802.11ac, IEEE 802.11n,<br>IEEE 802.11g, IEEE 802.11b, IEEE 802.11a</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>64/128-bit WEP, WPA, WPA2 and WPA-Mixed<br>WPA3</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>12V DC/1A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>206 x 121 x 41mm</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 Year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band Gigabit', 3390.00, 3490.00, NU