(224, 'TOTOLINK X30 SE AX3000 Dual Band WiFi 6 Mesh Router (1 Pack)', 'The TOTOLINK X30 SE AX3000 Dual Band WiFi 6 Mesh Router delivers ultra-fast wireless speeds up to 3000Mbps with advanced WiFi 6 technology. Featuring OFDMA, MU-MIMO, WPA3 security, adaptive Gigabit ports, and seamless mesh networking, it ensures reliable whole-home coverage and smooth connectivity for gaming, streaming, and smart devices.', 'totolink-x30-se-ax3000-dual-band-wifi-6-mesh-router-1-pack-1780062356', '<p>The TOTOLINK X30 SE AX3000 Dual Band WiFi 6 Mesh Router (1 Pack) is a high-performance next-generation networking solution designed to provide ultra-fast internet connectivity, seamless whole-home coverage, and stable performance for modern households and offices. Powered by the latest WiFi 6 (IEEE 802.11ax) technology, this advanced mesh router delivers enhanced speed, greater capacity, and lower latency, making it ideal for high-bandwidth activities such as 4K/8K streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, and smart home integration.</p><p>The TOTOLINK X30 SE offers combined wireless speeds of up to 3000Mbps, including 574Mbps on the 2.4GHz band and an impressive 2402Mbps on the 5GHz band. Its dual-band architecture ensures smoother connectivity and optimized performance across multiple connected devices. Equipped with OFDMA and MU-MIMO technologies, the router efficiently distributes data to several devices simultaneously, minimizing network congestion and ensuring faster, more responsive internet performance.</p><p>As a powerful TOTOLINK Mesh Router, the X30 SE is designed to eliminate WiFi dead zones and provide uninterrupted wireless coverage throughout your home or office. Users can easily expand their network by adding additional mesh units, creating a seamless whole-home WiFi system with a single network name and automatic roaming support.</p><p>The router features adaptive Gigabit LAN/WAN ports for high-speed wired connections, making it perfect for gaming PCs, smart TVs, 