(225, 'TOTOLINK X6000R AX3000 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi Router', 'The TOTOLINK X6000R AX3000 WiFi 6 Router delivers ultra-fast speeds up to 3000Mbps with a powerful dual-core processor. Featuring OFDMA, MU-MIMO, TWT, WPA3 security, Gigabit ports, and Easy Mesh support, it ensures stable, high-performance connectivity for gaming, streaming, and multi-device environments.', 'totolink-x6000r-ax3000-dual-band-gigabit-wifi-router-1780062618', '<p>TOTOLINK X6000R AX3000 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi 6 Router</p><p>The TOTOLINK X6000R AX3000 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi 6 Router is a powerful next-generation networking device designed to deliver ultra-fast wireless performance, stable connectivity, and advanced smart features for modern homes and offices. Compliant with the latest WiFi 6 (IEEE 802.11ax) standard, this high-performance router provides a combined wireless speed of up to 3000Mbps, offering 2402Mbps on the 5GHz band and 574Mbps on the 2.4GHz band. It is ideal for high-definition streaming, online gaming, large file transfers, and seamless multi-device usage.</p><p>At its core, the TOTOLINK X6000R is powered by a 1.3GHz dual-core processor, ensuring fast and efficient data processing without lag or interruption. This strong hardware foundation allows the router to handle heavy network traffic effortlessly, making it suitable for smart homes, offices, and business environments.</p><p>The router incorporates advanced technologies such as OFDMA and MU-MIMO, which significantly improve network efficiency by allowing multiple devices to communicate simultaneously without congestion. OFDMA divides channels into smaller sub-channels for better bandwidth utilization, while MU-MIMO ensures that multiple users can enjoy stable high-speed connections at the same time.</p><p>To further enhance performance, the TOTOLINK X6000R features Target Wake Time (TWT) technology, which helps reduce power consumption on connected devices, extending battery life for smartphones, tablets, and IoT devices. Beamforming technology improves signal direction and strength, ensuring stable coverage throughout your home or office.</p><p>Equipped with multiple high-gain antennas (2.4GHz 2T2R and 5GHz 3T3R), the router ensures strong signal penetration and wide coverage. Full Gigabit Ethernet ports provide ultra-fast wired connections for gaming consoles, PCs, smart TVs, and NAS systems.</p><p>The TOTOLINK X6000R supports multiple internet connection types including DHCP, Static IP, PPPoE, PPTP, and L2TP, offering maximum compatibility with various ISPs. For enhanced security, it features WPA3 encryption to protect your network from unauthorized access.</p><p>Additional advanced features include VPN server support, Universal Repeater mode, Guest Network, Smart QoS, WiFi Scheduler, Parental Control, and Easy Mesh functionality for seamless network expansion. Users can easily configure and manage the router through the TOTOLINK mobile app or web-based interface, ensuring simple installation and smart network control.</p><p>With its powerful hardware, advanced WiFi 6 capabilities, and intelligent management features, the TOTOLINK X6000R AX3000 is an ideal choice for users seeking a reliable, high-speed, and future-ready internet solution.</p><p>Buy TOTOLINK X6000R AX3000 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi 6 Router from International Office Solution In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original TOTOLINK X6000R AX3000 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi 6 Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide selection of the latest TOTOLINK routers at competitive prices. Order online or visit your nearest International Office Solution outlet to get the best deal. The TOTOLINK X6000R AX3000 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi 6 Router comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>2.4GHz: Up to 574Mbps<br>5GHz: Up to 2402Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4x external d