(226, 'TOTOLINK A702R_V4 1200Mbps Dual Band WiFi Router', 'The TOTOLINK A702R_V4 Dual Band Router delivers speeds up to 1167Mbps with four high-gain antennas for wider coverage. Featuring beamforming, band steering, multiple security filters, IPTV support, and easy mobile management, it ensures stable and secure internet performance for home and office use.', 'totolink-a702r-v4-1200mbps-dual-band-wifi-router-1780062981', '<p>TOTOLINK A702R_V4 1200Mbps Dual Band Router</p><p>The TOTOLINK A702R_V4 1200Mbps Dual Band Router is a reliable and high-performance networking solution designed to deliver stable wireless connectivity, wider coverage, and smooth internet performance for homes and small offices. Built with the latest IEEE 802.11ac WiFi standard, this router offers combined wireless speeds of up to 1167Mbps, including 867Mbps on the 5GHz band and 300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band, ensuring fast and efficient data transmission for everyday internet activities such as streaming, browsing, gaming, and video conferencing.</p><p>Equipped with four high-gain external antennas, the TOTOLINK A702R_V4 provides enhanced signal strength and wider WiFi coverage, reducing dead zones and ensuring consistent connectivity across multiple rooms. The advanced beamforming technology intelligently directs wireless signals toward connected devices, improving signal stability and overall network efficiency.</p><p>This dual-band router features intelligent band steering technology, which automatically directs devices to the most suitable frequency band for optimized performance. It also includes adaptive WAN/LAN ports that allow flexible network configuration, making setup easier and more convenient for users.</p><p>The TOTOLINK A702R_V4 supports multiple internet connection types including DHCP, Static IP, and PPPoE, ensuring compatibility with various ISP networks. It also provides robust security features such as WPA/WPA2 mixed encryption, IP address filtering, MAC filtering, URL filtering, port filtering, and port forwarding to protect your network from unauthorized access.</p><p>For better network management, the router supports multiple SSIDs, allowing users to create separate networks for guests or different usage needs. Its user-friendly smart interface and TOTOLINK mobile app enable easy setup and remote management directly from smartphones.</p><p>Additional features include IPTV support for smooth television streaming, a security lock function to prevent unauthorized WiFi access, and auto-detection of WAN/LAN ports, which ensures all Ethernet ports can function flexibly as WAN ports if needed.</p><p>With its powerful hardware, advanced features, and easy configuration options, the TOTOLINK A702R_V4 1200Mbps Dual Band Router is an excellent choice for users seeking stable performance, strong coverage, and secure internet connectivity.</p><p>Buy TOTOLINK A702R_V4 1200Mbps Dual Band Router from International Office Solution In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original TOTOLINK A702R_V4 1200Mbps 4 Antenna Dual Band Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide collection of the latest TOTOLINK routers at competitive prices. Order online or visit your nearest International Office Solution outlet to get the best deal. The TOTOLINK A702R_V4 comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>2.4GHz: Up to 300Mbps<br>5GHz: Up to 867Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2 * 2.4GHz fixed antennas(5dBi)<br>2 * 5GHz fixed antennas(5dBi)</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1 *RST Button<br>1*Key for Security Lock Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4GHz/5GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>5 *100Mbps Auto-identied WAN/LAN Port</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11ac,<br>IEEE 802.11a,<br>IEEE 802.11b,<br>IEEE 802.11g,<br>IEEE 802.11n</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA/WPA2 Mixed</t