(227, 'TOTOLINK X5000R AX1800 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi Router', 'The TOTOLINK X5000R AX1800 WiFi 6 Router delivers up to 1800Mbps speed with a powerful dual-core processor. Featuring OFDMA, MU-MIMO, TWT, WPA3 security, Gigabit ports, and Easy Mesh support, it ensures stable, high-performance connectivity for gaming, streaming, and multi-device environments.', 'totolink-x5000r-ax1800-dual-band-gigabit-wifi-router-1780063217', '<p>TOTOLINK X5000R AX1800 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi 6 Router</p><p>The TOTOLINK X5000R AX1800 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi 6 Router is a powerful next-generation networking device designed to deliver fast, stable, and efficient wireless connectivity for modern homes and offices. Built with the latest WiFi 6 (IEEE 802.11ax) technology, this high-performance router provides a total wireless speed of up to 1800Mbps, including 1201Mbps on the 5GHz band and 573.5Mbps on the 2.4GHz band, making it ideal for smooth HD/4K streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, and high-speed downloads.</p><p>Powered by a 1.3GHz dual-core processor, the TOTOLINK X5000R ensures fast data processing and stable performance even under heavy network load. This powerful hardware allows the router to handle multiple connected devices without lag or interruption, making it suitable for smart homes, offices, and business environments.</p><p>The router integrates advanced WiFi 6 technologies such as OFDMA and MU-MIMO, which significantly enhance network efficiency by allowing multiple devices to communicate simultaneously. OFDMA improves bandwidth utilization by dividing channels into smaller sub-channels, while MU-MIMO ensures simultaneous data transmission to multiple devices, reducing congestion and improving overall speed.</p><p>With Target Wake Time (TWT) technology, the TOTOLINK X5000R helps reduce power consumption on connected devices, extending battery life for smartphones, tablets, and IoT devices. Beamforming technology further enhances signal strength by directing WiFi signals toward connected devices, ensuring stronger and more stable coverage throughout your space.</p><p>The router features a multi-antenna design with 2.4GHz 2T2R and 5GHz 3T3R antennas, providing improved signal coverage and stability. Full Gigabit Ethernet ports offer ultra-fast wired connections, making it ideal for gaming consoles, PCs, smart TVs, and NAS systems.</p><p>For maximum compatibility, the TOTOLINK X5000R supports multiple broadband connection types including DHCP, Static IP, PPPoE, PPTP, and L2TP. It also ensures strong security with WPA3 encryption, protecting your network from unauthorized access and cyber threats.</p><p>Additional smart features include VPN server support, Universal Repeater mode, Guest Network, Smart QoS, WiFi Scheduler, Parental Control, and Easy Mesh functionality for seamless network expansion. Users can easily manage and configure the router using the TOTOLINK mobile app or web interface, ensuring simple setup and full control over network settings.</p><p>With its powerful performance, advanced features, and user-friendly design, the TOTOLINK X5000R AX1800 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi 6 Router is an excellent choice for anyone seeking a reliable, high-speed, and future-ready networking solution.</p><p>Buy TOTOLINK X5000R AX1800 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi 6 Router from International Office Solution In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original TOTOLINK X5000R AX1800 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi 6 Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide collection of the latest TOTOLINK routers at competitive prices. Order online or visit your nearest International Office Solution outlet to get the best deal. The TOTOLINK X5000R comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>2.4GHz: Up to 573.5Mbps (2*2 40MHz)<br>5GHz: Up to 1201Mbps (2*2 80MHz)</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4 x 5dBi fixed external