(228, 'TOTOLINK X30 AX3000 Dual Band WiFi 6 Mesh Router (2 Pack)', 'The TOTOLINK X30 AX3000 Mesh Router (2 Pack) delivers up to 3000Mbps WiFi 6 speed with OFDMA, MU-MIMO, and Beamforming technology. Featuring Easy Mesh roaming, Gigabit ports, WPA3 security, VPN support, and smart management tools, it ensures seamless whole-home coverage and high-performance connectivity.', 'totolink-x30-ax3000-dual-band-wifi-6-mesh-router-2-pack-1780063427', '<p>TOTOLINK X30 AX3000 Dual Band WiFi 6 Mesh Router</p><p>The TOTOLINK X30 AX3000 Dual Band WiFi 6 Mesh Router (2 Pack) is a powerful next-generation networking solution designed to deliver ultra-fast, stable, and seamless wireless connectivity for large homes, offices, and multi-floor environments. Built on the latest IEEE 802.11ax (WiFi 6) standard, this advanced mesh system provides a combined wireless speed of up to 3000Mbps, including 2402Mbps on the 5GHz band and 574Mbps on the 2.4GHz band, ensuring smooth performance for 4K/8K streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, and smart home applications.</p><p>Powered by a 1.3GHz dual-core processor, the TOTOLINK X30 ensures efficient data processing and lag-free performance even under heavy network usage. It integrates advanced WiFi 6 technologies such as OFDMA and MU-MIMO, allowing multiple devices to connect simultaneously without congestion or speed loss. This makes it ideal for environments with a high number of connected devices.</p><p>Beamforming technology enhances signal direction by focusing WiFi strength toward connected devices, ensuring stronger coverage and improved stability. Target Wake Time (TWT) technology reduces power consumption on connected devices, helping extend battery life for smartphones, tablets, and IoT devices.</p><p>The TOTOLINK X30 Mesh system features four internal high-performance antennas and supports Easy Mesh technology, enabling seamless roaming across multiple units. This eliminates WiFi dead zones and ensures uninterrupted connectivity as users move throughout their space.</p><p>For wired connectivity, the router includes full Gigabit ports with one 1000Mbps WAN port and four 1000Mbps LAN ports, providing ultra-fast and stable wired connections for gaming PCs, smart TVs, and other high-bandwidth devices.</p><p>The device supports multiple broadband connection types including DHCP, Static IP, PPPoE, PPTP, and L2TP, ensuring compatibility with most internet service providers. Security is enhanced with WPA3 encryption along with WPA2/WPA mixed modes, protecting your network from unauthorized access and cyber threats.</p><p>Advanced features include built-in VPN server support, VPN passthrough, account-based management, guest network, parental control, Smart QoS for bandwidth management, WiFi scheduler, access control, and universal repeater mode. The router also supports multiple operating modes such as Gateway, Bridge, Repeater, and WISP, offering flexible deployment options.</p><p>Additional management features include IPTV support, IPv6 compatibility, DDNS, IP/MAC binding, TR-069 remote management, firmware upgrades, system logs, and remote administration. Physical design elements include dedicated reset, mesh, and power buttons, LED status indicators, and a stable 12V DC power supply for reliable operation.</p><p>With its powerful hardware, advanced WiFi 6 technology, and flexible mesh networking capabilities, the TOTOLINK X30 AX3000 Dual Band WiFi 6 Mesh Router (2 Pack) is an ideal choice for users seeking high-speed, secure, and whole-home wireless coverage.</p><p>Buy TOTOLINK X30 AX3000 Dual Band WiFi 6 Mesh Router (2 Pack) from International Office Solution In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original TOTOLINK X30 AX3000 Dual Band WiFi 6 Mesh Router (2 Pack) from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of the latest TOTOLINK networking products at competitive prices. Order online or visit your nearest International Office Solution outlet to get the best deal. The TOTOLINK X30 Mesh Router comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>2.4GHz: Up to 574Mbps(2*2 40MHz)<br>5GHz: Up to 2402Mbps(2*2 160MHz)</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4 * Internal Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1 * RST Button, 1 * MESH Button，1 *Power On/Off Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4GHz/5GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Basic setup<br>Guest Network(Multiple SSID)<br>Wireless Schedule<br>Access Control<br>Advanced setup</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1 * 1000Mbps WAN Port<br>4 * 1000Mbps LAN Port</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11ax<br>IEEE 802.11ac<br>IEEE 802.11n<br>IEEE 802.11g<br>IEEE 802.11b<br>IEEE 802.11a</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA2/WPA Mixed<br>WPA3</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>12V DC/1A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>127 * 142 * 216MM</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 Year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band WiFi 6 Mesh', 12290.00, 12390.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/s7IZG1dhvSRlL75ho94twBzhh3MGT4JwEk44VoRN.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-29 14:03:47', '2026-05-29 14:03:47', 'TOTOLINK X30 AX3000 WiFi 6 Mesh Router (2 Pack) | International Office Solution', 'Buy TOTOLINK X30 AX3000 Dual Band WiFi 6 Mesh Router (2 Pack) from International Office Solution in Bangladesh. Enjoy 3000Mbps speed, Easy Mesh roaming, WPA3 security, Gigabit ports, OFDMA, MU-MIMO, and smart network control.', 'TOTOLINK X30, AX3000 Mesh Router, WiFi 6 Mesh Router Bangladesh, Dual Band Mesh System, TOTOLINK Mesh Router, Gigabit Mesh Router, OFDMA WiFi 6, MU-MIMO Router, WPA3 Security Router, Whole Home WiFi System, International Office Solution', NULL, 214, NULL, NULL);
