(229, 'TOTOLINK T8 AC1200 Smart Home Mesh Router (2 Pack)', 'The TOTOLINK T8 AC1200 Mesh WiFi Router (2 Pack) delivers up to 1200Mbps dual-band speed with MU-MIMO, Beamforming, and seamless mesh roaming. Featuring Gigabit ports, IPTV support, parental control, and mobile app management, it ensures stable whole-home WiFi coverage and easy control.', 'totolink-t8-ac1200-smart-home-mesh-router-2-pack-1780063751', '<p>TOTOLINK T8 Dual Band AC1200 Smart Home Mesh Wi-Fi Router (2 Pack</p><p>The TOTOLINK T8 Dual Band AC1200 Smart Home Mesh Wi-Fi Router (2 Pack) is a reliable and efficient networking solution designed to provide seamless whole-home WiFi coverage, stable connectivity, and smooth internet performance for modern households. Compliant with IEEE 802.11ac Wave 2 standard, this mesh system delivers combined wireless speeds of up to 1200Mbps, including 867Mbps on the 5GHz band and 300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band, ensuring fast and stable connectivity for browsing, streaming, gaming, and smart home usage.</p><p>Designed with advanced mesh networking technology, the TOTOLINK T8 allows multiple units to work together under a single network name, eliminating WiFi dead zones and enabling seamless roaming as users move throughout the home. This ensures uninterrupted internet access without manual switching between routers.</p><p>The router is equipped with MU-MIMO technology, allowing multiple devices to connect and communicate simultaneously without reducing performance. Beamforming technology enhances signal strength by focusing WiFi signals directly toward connected devices, resulting in improved coverage, stability, and efficiency.</p><p>For wired connectivity, the TOTOLINK T8 features Gigabit Ethernet ports including 1x 1000Mbps WAN port and 2x 1000Mbps LAN ports, ensuring fast and stable wired connections for gaming consoles, smart TVs, and PCs.</p><p>It supports multiple internet connection types including DHCP, Static IP, PPPoE, PPTP, and L2TP, making it compatible with a wide range of ISPs. Security is ensured through WPA/WPA2 mixed encryption, protecting your network from unauthorized access.</p><p>Additional features include IPTV support for smooth online streaming, IPv6 compatibility for improved speed and security, parental control for safe internet usage, and guest network functionality for secure sharing with visitors. The TOTOLINK mobile app enables easy setup, remote management, and real-time network control directly from your smartphone.</p><p>With its easy mesh setup, strong performance, and user-friendly management features, the TOTOLINK T8 AC1200 Mesh Wi-Fi Router (2 Pack) is an excellent choice for users seeking affordable, stable, and whole-home wireless coverage.</p><h2>Buy TOTOLINK T8 Dual Band AC1200 Mesh Wi-Fi Router (2 Pack) from International Office Solution</h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original TOTOLINK T8 Dual Band AC1200 Smart Home Mesh Wi-Fi Router (2 Pack) from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of the latest TOTOLINK networking products at competitive prices. Order online or visit your nearest International Office Solution outlet to get the best deal. The TOTOLINK T8 comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>2.4GHz: Up to 300Mbps<br>5GHz: Up to 867Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2x Internal Dual Band Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1x Mesh/RST Button<br>1x Power Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4GHz/5GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>2x 1000Mbps LAN Ports<br>1x 1000Mbps WAN Port</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11ac<br>IEEE 802.11a<br>IEEE 802.11b<br>IEEE 802.11g<br>IEEE 802.11n<br>IEEE 802.11s</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>64/128-bit WEP, WPA, WPA2 and WPA-Mixed</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>89 x 89 x 68.5mm</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 Year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Smart Home Mesh Router', 3200.00, 3400.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/mAS6OBPjtZnA5p6T4Q6b8x7wCB0SDmXtXML6x9U6.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-29 14:09:11', '2026-05-29 14:09:11', 'TOTOLINK T8 AC1200 Mesh WiFi Router (2 Pack) | International Office Solution', 'Buy TOTOLINK T8 Dual Band AC1200 Mesh WiFi Router (2 Pack) from International Office Solution in Bangladesh. Enjoy 1200Mbps speed, seamless mesh roaming, MU-MIMO, Beamforming, Gigabit ports, IPTV, and app control.', 'TOTOLINK T8, AC1200 Mesh Router, Dual Band Mesh WiFi, TOTOLINK Mesh System, WiFi Router Bangladesh, Gigabit Mesh Router, MU-MIMO Router, Beamforming WiFi Router, Home Mesh WiFi, International Office Solution', NULL, 214, NULL, NULL),
(230, 'Huawei eKitEngine S380-S8P2T 8 Port Gigabit PoE Router', 'The Huawei eKitEngine S380-S8P2T is a high-performance 8-port Gigabit PoE router designed for enterprise networks. It supports up to 64 APs and 400 users, offers 16Gbps switching capacity, PoE+ up to 124W, dual WAN ports, and fanless silent operation for stable and scalable business networking.', 'huawei-ekitengine-s380-s8p2t-8-port-gigabit-poe-router-1780065219', '<p>Huawei eKitEngine S380-S8P2T 8 Port Gigabit PoE Router</p><p>The Huawei eKitEngine S380-S8P2T 8 Port Gigabit PoE Router is a powerful enterprise-grade multi-service gateway designed to deliver high-performance networking for large-scale environments such as corporate offices, hotels, campuses, and managed IT infrastructures. Built with advanced Huawei networking technology, this device ensures stable, secure, and efficient data transmission for demanding business applications.</p><p>This high-capacity router supports up to 64 managed access points (APs) and can handle up to 400 concurrent users, making it ideal for dense network deployments. With a switching capacity of 16 Gbps and packet forwarding rates of 500 Kpps for uploads and 420 Kpps for downloads, it guarantees smooth, uninterrupted traffic flow even under heavy workloads.</p><p>The device is equipped with 8 × 10/100/1000BASE-T Gigabit LAN ports and 2 × 10/100/1000BASE-T Gigabit WAN ports, providing flexible and high-speed wired connectivity options. The LAN ports support PoE+ functionality with a total power budget of up to 124W, enabling seamless power delivery to IP cameras, access points, VoIP phones, and other network devices without requiring separate power adapters.</p><p>Powered by 512MB DDR4 RAM and 512MB NAND Flash storage, the Huawei S380-S8P2T ensures fast processing, reliable performance, and stable operation even in high-demand environments. Its efficient power system supports a maximum power consumption of 145.8W (including PoE) and a typical consumption of only 12.4W, ensuring optimized energy usage.</p><p>The router is designed with advanced thermal efficiency, featuring natural heat dissipation and a fanless structure for silent operation. With noise levels as low as 20 dB(A), it is suitable for noise-sensitive environments such as offices, libraries, and professional workspaces.</p><p>It operates using a 56V DC power supply with an input range of 90–290V AC at 47–63 Hz, ensuring stable and reliable power delivery across different environments. The fanless design enhances durability, reduces maintenance requirements, and ensures long-term stability.</p><p>Overall, the Huawei eKitEngine S380-S8P2T is a robust, scalable, and highly efficient PoE router designed for professional networking environments requiring centralized control, high user capacity, and uninterrupted connectivity.</p><p>Buy Huawei eKitEngine S380-S8P2T 8 Port Gigabit PoE Router from International Office Solution In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Huawei eKitEngine S380-S8P2T 8 Port Gigabit PoE Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of enterprise networking solutions at competitive prices. Order online or visit your nearest International Office Solution outlet to get the best deal. The Huawei eKitEngine S380-S8P2T comes with a 3-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>Capacity: 16Gbps<br>Packet forwarding rate:<br>Upload:500 Kpps, download:420 Kpps<br>Egress bandwidth: 2Gbps</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>Uplink ports 2 x GE WAN<br>Downlink ports 8 x GE LAN (124 W PoE+)</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Multi-Service Gateway<br>Number of managed Aps: 64<br>Maximum user: 400</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Input voltage range [V]: Power adapter input: 90–290 V AC; 47–63 Hz<br>Maximum power consumption [W]: 145.8 W (PoE: 124 W)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>Height [mm]: 35.0 mm<br>Depth [mm]: 130.0 mm<br>Wide [mm]: 210.0 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>1.5 (3.31) [kg(lb)]</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>Housing Material</td><td>Metal</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', '8 Port Gigabit PoE Router', 62800.00, 62900.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/ws5TVo9YWQoKltMZMgWoLpfqX2x1i9yMCrlgQRZe.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-29 14:33:39', '2026-05-29 14:33:39', 'Huawei eKitEngine S380-S8P2T 8 Port Gigabit PoE Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy Huawei eKitEngine S380-S8P2T 8 Port Gigabit PoE Router from International Office Solution in Bangladesh. Supports 64 APs, 400 users, 16Gbps switching, PoE+, dual WAN, and silent fanless design.', 'Huawei S380-S8P2T, Huawei PoE Router, 8 Port Gigabit Router, Enterprise Network Router, Managed PoE Router, Gigabit Gateway Router, Huawei eKitEngine, Business Router Bangladesh, PoE+ Router, International Office Solution', NULL, 215, NULL, NULL),
(231, 'Huawei WA8021V5 AC1200 Mbps Gigabit Dual-Band Wi-Fi Mesh Router', 'The Huawei WA8021V5 AC1200 Dual-Band Gigabit Mesh Router delivers up to 1200Mbps speed with stable mesh connectivity. Featuring Gigabit ports, 4 internal antennas, remote management, and energy-efficient design, it ensures seamless coverage for homes and small offices.', 'huawei-wa8021v5-ac1200-mbps-gigabit-dual-band-wi-fi-mesh-router-1780065452', '<p>The Huawei WA8021V5 AC1200 Mbps Gigabit Dual-Band WiFi Mesh Router is a compact and efficient networking solution designed to deliver fast, stable, and seamless wireless connectivity for modern homes and small office environments. Built with dual-band WiFi technology, it provides combined wireless speeds of up to 1200Mbps, including 300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band and 867Mbps on the 5GHz band, ensuring smooth performance for streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, and multi-device usage.</p><p>Equipped with 4 internal high-performance antennas, the Huawei WA8021V5 ensures strong signal strength, improved coverage, and stable connectivity throughout your space. Its advanced mesh networking capability allows multiple units to work together under a single network, eliminating dead zones and providing uninterrupted roaming as users move between rooms or floors.</p><p>The router includes 1 Gigabit WAN port and 2 Gigabit LAN ports (10/100/1000 Mbps), enabling high-speed wired connections for devices such as PCs, smart TVs, and gaming consoles. Built on IEEE 802.11 b/g/n (2.4GHz) and IEEE 802.11 a/n/ac (5GHz) standards, it ensures wide compatibility with modern and legacy devices.</p><p>A key advantage of the Huawei WA8021V5 is its remote management and maintenance capability, allowing users to monitor, configure, and control the network remotely for improved convenience and efficiency. This makes it especially suitable for both home users and small business environments that require easy network administration.</p><p>Designed with energy efficiency in mind, the router operates on a 100–240V AC input with a 12V DC 1A output and consumes only 7.8W at maximum load and 3.4W in idle mode. Its compact design (65.5mm × 105mm × 105mm) and lightweight build (195g) make it easy to place anywhere while maintaining a clean and modern appearance.</p><p>Overall, the Huawei WA8021V5 AC1200 Gigabit Mesh Router combines reliable performance, wide coverage, and intelligent mesh technology, making it an excellent choice for users seeking stable and hassle-free wireless connectivity.</p><p>Buy Huawei WA8021V5 AC1200 Mbps Gigabit Mesh Router from International Office Solution In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Huawei WA8021V5 AC1200 Mbps Gigabit Dual-Band Mesh Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of Huawei networking products at competitive prices. Order online or visit your nearest International Office Solution outlet to get the best deal. The Huawei WA8021V5 comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>300 Mbps (2.4GHz), 867 Mbps (5GHz)</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4 x Internal Antenna</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4 GHz, 5 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>RJ45</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11 b/g/n (2.4GHz), IEEE 802.11 a/n/ac (5GHz)</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>LAN ports: 10/100/1000<br>WAN ports: 10/100/1000</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>100 - 240 V AC, 50/60 Hz, 12V DC, 1 A<br>Power consumption: 7.8W (Max.), 3.4W (Static)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>65.5mm×105mm×105mm (without pads)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>195 g</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 Year (Without Adapter)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Gigabit Mesh', 2413.00, 2513.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/d961uR2os434fAxrtr8WGLKgDL5yu0mEFOA0n8yM.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-29 14:37:32', '2026-05-29 14:37:32', 'Huawei WA8021V5 AC1200 Gigabit Mesh WiFi Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy Huawei WA8021V5 AC1200 Mbps Gigabit Dual-Band Mesh Router from International Office Solution in Bangladesh. Enjoy 1200Mbps speed, mesh coverage, Gigabit ports, remote management, and energy-efficient performance.', 'Huawei WA8021V5, AC1200 Mesh Router, Gigabit WiFi Router, Dual Band Mesh Router, Huawei Mesh WiFi, Home WiFi Router Bangladesh, Wireless Mesh System, Smart WiFi Router, Gigabit Router Bangladesh, International Office Solution', NULL, 215, NULL, NULL),
(232, 'Huawei eKitEngine S380-S8T2T 8 Port Gigabit Router', 'The Huawei eKitEngine S380-S8T2T is a powerful 8-port Gigabit enterprise router supporting up to 64 APs and 400 users. It features 16Gbps switching capacity, dual WAN ports, ultra-low power consumption, surge protection, and fanless silent operation for reliable business networking.', 'huawei-ekitengine-s380-s8t2t-8-port-gigabit-router-1780065659', '<p>The Huawei eKitEngine S380-S8T2T 8 Port Gigabit Router is a high-performance enterprise-grade multi-service gateway designed for reliable and scalable networking in business environments such as offices, campuses, hotels, and large organizations. Built to handle demanding network loads, this router supports up to 64 managed access points and can accommodate up to 400 users, making it ideal for centralized and high-density deployments.</p><p>With a powerful switching capacity of 16 Gbps and packet forwarding rates of 500 Kpps for uploads and 420 Kpps for downloads, the Huawei S380-S8T2T ensures smooth, stable, and efficient data transmission even under heavy network traffic. Its dual WAN architecture, featuring 2 × 10/100/1000BASE-T ports along with 8 × 10/100/1000BASE-T LAN ports, provides flexible and high-speed wired connectivity for multiple network configurations.</p><p>The device is powered by 512MB DDR4 RAM and 512MB NAND Flash memory, enabling fast processing, stable operation, and efficient handling of network tasks. It also delivers excellent reliability with an uptime availability of over 99.999%, an MTBF of 67.79 years, and an MTTR of less than 2 hours, ensuring minimal downtime and quick recovery in case of faults.</p><p>Designed for energy efficiency, the router operates at a low average power consumption of 10.4W and a maximum of 10.55W, with static consumption at just 5.82W. Its heat dissipation remains minimal, producing approximately 35.5 BTU/hour on average and up to 36 BTU/hour at maximum load.</p><p>The Huawei S380-S8T2T features a fanles