(234, 'Huawei eKitEngine S380-H8T3ST 8 Port Gigabit Router', 'The Huawei eKitEngine S380-H8T3ST is a high-performance 8-port Gigabit enterprise router featuring 2 GE WAN ports and 1 SFP WAN port, 1GB RAM, fanless silent design, and strong surge protection, making it ideal for reliable business networking.', 'huawei-ekitengine-s380-h8t3st-8-port-gigabit-router-1780066256', '<p>Huawei eKitEngine S380-H8T3ST 8 Port Gigabit Router</p><p>The Huawei eKitEngine S380-H8T3ST 8 Port Gigabit Router is a powerful enterprise-grade networking solution designed to deliver stable, secure, and high-performance connectivity for business environments such as offices, institutions, hotels, and enterprise networks. Built with advanced Huawei engineering, this router provides flexible connectivity options, strong processing capability, and reliable performance for demanding network infrastructures.</p><p>The device features 8 × Gigabit Ethernet (GE) LAN downlink ports, offering ample connectivity for multiple local devices such as PCs, IP phones, printers, and access points. For uplink flexibility, it includes 2 × GE WAN ports along with 1 × GE SFP WAN port, allowing fiber and Ethernet-based network integration for diverse deployment scenarios.</p><p>Powered by 1GB DDR4 RAM and 512MB NAND Flash storage, the Huawei S380-H8T3ST ensures smooth data processing, fast response times, and reliable multitasking performance even under heavy network loads. Its high memory capacity supports efficient handling of complex network services and large numbers of connected devices.</p><p>The router is designed with an advanced passive heat dissipation architecture, eliminating the need for active cooling fans. This ensures silent operation, reduced power consumption, and lower maintenance requirements, making it suitable for quiet office and professional environments.</p><p>It supports a wide input voltage range of 90V AC to 264V AC and operating frequencies from 45Hz to 65Hz, ensuring compatibility with