(235, 'Huawei NetEngine AR720 8 Port Gigabit Router', 'The Huawei NetEngine AR720 is a powerful 8-port Gigabit enterprise router supporting up to 700 terminals, delivering 9–25 Mpps forwarding performance, dual WAN combo ports, USB 2.0 support, and flexible 1U mounting for SMB and branch networking.', 'huawei-netengine-ar720-8-port-gigabit-router-1780066472', '<p>Huawei NetEngine AR720 8 Port Gigabit Router</p><p>The Huawei NetEngine AR720 8 Port Gigabit Router is a high-performance enterprise networking solution designed to meet the demands of modern small and medium-sized business environments. Built with advanced routing capabilities, it delivers stable, secure, and efficient connectivity with flexible deployment options and strong forwarding performance.</p><p>The router features 8 × Gigabit Ethernet (GE) electrical LAN interfaces along with a flexible GE combo interface and 2 × GE combo WAN ports, providing versatile connectivity options for both internal and external network configurations. This allows businesses to build scalable and reliable network infrastructures tailored to their operational needs.</p><p>With a forwarding performance ranging from 9 Mpps to 25 Mpps and support for up to 700 connected terminals, the Huawei NetEngine AR720 ensures smooth and efficient data handling even in high-traffic environments. It is well-suited for offices, branch networks, and enterprise-level deployments requiring consistent performance and stability.</p><p>The device is equipped with 2 × USB 2.0 ports, enabling support for additional features, storage devices, and peripheral connectivity. Its compact 1U chassis design allows flexible installation options, including wall mounting, desktop placement, or rack mounting, making it adaptable to different infrastructure setups.</p><p>For system monitoring and troubleshooting, the router provides clear LED indicators including PWR, SYS, iNET, CTRL, LAN/WAN GE electrical and optical status, and ACT indicators for USB activity. This ensures easy real-time status visibility and maintenance.</p><p>Powered by a built-in AC power supply supporting a wide input range of 100V–240V at 50/60Hz, the AR720 ensures global compatibility. It consumes a maximum power of only 33W, making it an energy-efficient enterprise solution. The device includes a single power module and a reset button for quick system recovery.</p><p>Designed for reliable thermal performance, the Huawei NetEngine AR720 operates with an efficient cooling system using built-in fans that direct airflow from left to right. It maintains a controlled noise level of 52.3 dB(A) under normal operating conditions.</p><p>Overall, the Huawei NetEngine AR720 is a robust, scalable, and efficient 8-port Gigabit router ideal for SMEs and enterprise branch networks requiring high performance, flexible deployment, and reliable connectivity.</p><p>Buy Huawei NetEngine AR720 8 Port Gigabit Router from International Office Solution In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Huawei NetEngine AR720 8 Port Gigabit Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of enterprise networking products at competitive prices. Order online or visit your nearest International Office Solution outlet to get the best deal. The Huawei AR720 comes with a 3-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>Forwarding performance: 9 Mpps to 25 Mpps</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>LAN ports 8 x GE electrical interfaces<br>WAN ports 2 x GE combo</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Number of connected terminals: 700</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>100 V to 240 V, 50 Hz/60 Hz</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>90 mm x 390 mm x 570 mm (3.54 in. x 15.35 in. x 22.44 in.)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>3.2 kg (