(236, 'Huawei NetEngine AR730 8 Port Gigabit Router', 'The Huawei NetEngine AR730 is a high-performance 8-port Gigabit enterprise router supporting up to 1200 terminals, featuring 10GE SFP+ uplink, dual WAN ports, USB support, and 9–25 Mpps forwarding performance for scalable business networking.', 'huawei-netengine-ar730-8-port-gigabit-router-1780066740', '<p>Huawei NetEngine AR730 8 Port Gigabit Router</p><p>The Huawei NetEngine AR730 8 Port Gigabit Router is a high-performance enterprise-grade networking solution designed to meet the growing demands of modern small and medium-sized business environments. Engineered for reliability, scalability, and high-speed connectivity, this router delivers advanced routing capabilities suitable for branch offices, corporate networks, and enterprise deployments.</p><p>The device features 8 × Gigabit Ethernet (GE) electrical LAN ports along with a flexible GE combo interface, 2 × GE combo WAN ports, and an additional 10GE optical WAN interface (SFP+), providing extensive connectivity options for both copper and fiber-based network infrastructures. This makes the AR730 highly adaptable for complex and high-speed network environments.</p><p>With a forwarding performance ranging from 9 Mpps to 25 Mpps and support for up to 1200 connected terminals, the Huawei NetEngine AR730 ensures stable and efficient data processing even under heavy network traffic. It is designed to deliver consistent performance in high-density user environments.</p><p>The router also includes 2 × USB 2.0 interfaces, enabling support for external devices, storage expansion, and additional functionality. Its compact 1U chassis design allows flexible installation options including wall mounting, desktop placement, and rack mounting, making it suitable for various deployment scenarios.</p><p>For system monitoring and maintenance, the AR730 provides clear status indicators including PWR, SYS, iNET, CTRL, LAN/WAN GE electrical and optical interfaces, and USB ACT indicators, allowing easy troubleshooting and real-time system visibility.</p><p>Powered by a built-in AC power supply supporting a wide voltage range of 100V–240V at 50/60Hz, the device ensures global compatibility. It consumes a maximum power of only 33W, making it energy efficient while maintaining strong enterprise-grade performance. A reset button is included for quick system recovery and maintenance.</p><p>The router uses an efficient cooling system with built-in fans that direct airflow from left to right, ensuring stable thermal management. It operates at a controlled noise level of approximately 52.3 dB(A), making it suitable for office environments where moderate noise levels are acceptable.</p><p>Overall, the Huawei NetEngine AR730 is a powerful, flexible, and scalable 8-port Gigabit enterprise router designed for organizations that require high-speed connectivity, fiber uplink support, and support for up to 1200 users.</p><h2>Buy Huawei NetEngine AR730 8 Port Gigabit Router from International Office Solution</h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Huawei NetEngine AR730 8 Port Gigabit Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of enterprise networking solutions at competitive prices. Order online or visit your nearest International Office Solution outlet to get the best deal. The Huawei AR730 comes with a 3-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>Forwarding performance: 9 Mpps to 25 Mpps</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>LAN ports 8 x GE electrical interfaces, 1 x GE combo interface<br>WAN ports 2 x GE combo interfaces, 1 x 10GE optical interface (SFP+)</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Number of connected terminals: 1200</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>100 V to 240 V, 50 Hz/60 Hz</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Di