(237, 'Huawei WS318n N300 WiFi Router', 'The Huawei WS318n N300 Wireless Router delivers up to 300Mbps speed with stable performance for everyday use. Featuring dual external antennas, LDPC signal optimization, Link+ extension support, and a compact design, it ensures reliable home WiFi coverage.', 'huawei-ws318n-n300-wifi-router-1780066942', '<p>The Huawei WS318n N300 Wireless Router is a compact and reliable home networking solution designed to deliver stable and efficient internet connectivity for everyday use. With wireless speeds of up to 300Mbps, this router is ideal for browsing, online streaming, video calls, social media, and light gaming, making it a practical choice for home users and small offices.</p><p>Equipped with two external antennas, the Huawei WS318n ensures improved signal strength, wider coverage, and better wall penetration for consistent wireless performance throughout your home. The router intelligently optimizes network performance by automatically selecting the least congested channel, ensuring a smoother and more stable internet experience.</p><p>Built with Huawei’s advanced wireless optimization technologies, including the LDPC algorithm, the WS318n enhances signal stability and reduces interference, allowing for faster and more reliable connectivity even in environments with multiple obstacles such as walls and furniture.</p><p>The router features 1 × WAN port and 2 × LAN ports, providing flexible wired connectivity for devices such as desktop computers, smart TVs, and gaming consoles. Its Link+ feature allows easy connection and synchronization with another compatible router, enabling extended WiFi coverage across larger areas without complex configuration.</p><p>Designed with simplicity and elegance in mind, the Huawei WS318n features a minimalist white matte finish and compact design that blends seamlessly into any interior space. Its lightweight structure and efficient power system (12V, 1A power adapter included) ensure low energy consumption and stable operation.</p><p>With its combination of stable performance, intelligent signal optimization, and user-friendly setup, the Huawei WS318n N300 Wireless Router is an excellent choice for users seeking an affordable and dependable WiFi solution for daily internet needs.</p><p>Buy Huawei WS318n N300 Wireless Router from International Office Solution In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Huawei WS318n N300 Wireless Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of Huawei networking products at competitive prices. Order online or visit your nearest International Office Solution outlet to get the best deal. The Huawei WS318n comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>300Mbps to 599Mbpls</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2 x Antena</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>It creates a 2.4Ghz WiFi network</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11b,g,n</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Elegant and reliable, Its classic design will adapt to any interior, Functionality goes hand in hand with attractive appearance, fast Wi-Fi connectivity allows to stream movies, play online games and quickly download large files, The router constantly opt</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>POWER: 12 V 1 A AC</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>169 x 115 x 27.6mm</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'N300 WiFi', 2500.00, 2500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/kbq0B6q9iBe6UWXL2aU6xG0NkcXeQpTSh9V8y8NZ.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-29 15:02:22', '2026-05-29 15:02:22', 'Huawei WS318n N300 Wireless Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy Huawei WS318n N300 Wireless Router from International Office Solution in Bangladesh. Enjoy 300Mbps speed, stable WiFi, dual antennas, LDPC technology, and easy setup for home and small office use.', 'Huawei WS318n, N300 Router, Wireless Router Bangladesh, Huawei Home Router, 300Mbps Router, Dual Antenna Router, WiFi Router for Home, Budget Wireless Router, Link+ Router, International Office Solution', NULL, 215, NULL, NULL),
(238, 'BDCOM WAP2100-WR1200G Dual-Band Gigabit WiFi Router', 'The BDCOM WAP2100-WR1200G Dual Band Gigabit Router delivers up to 1200Mbps WiFi speed with 2.4GHz and 5GHz dual-band support. Featuring four external antennas and Gigabit Ethernet ports, it ensures fast, stable, and wide wireless coverage for home and office use.', 'bdcom-wap2100-wr1200g-dual-band-gigabit-wifi-router-1780067174', '<p>BDCOM WAP2100-WR1200G 1200Mbps Dual Band Gigabit WiFi Router</p><p>The BDCOM WAP2100-WR1200G 1200Mbps Dual Band Gigabit WiFi Router is a high-performance networking solution designed to deliver fast, stable, and reliable wireless connectivity for homes, apartments, and small office environments. Supporting the latest IEEE 802.11b/g/n and IEEE 802.11a/n/ac wireless standards, this router provides seamless dual-band performance for modern internet usage.</p><p>The router delivers combined wireless speeds of up to 1200Mbps, including up to 300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band and up to 867Mbps on the 5GHz band. This dual-band capability ensures smoother online gaming, HD video streaming, video conferencing, and high-speed browsing while reducing network congestion and interference.</p><p>Equipped with four high-gain external antennas, the BDCOM WAP2100-WR1200G offers enhanced signal strength, improved stability, and wider wireless coverage throughout your home or office. The optimized antenna design helps maintain strong connectivity even across multiple rooms.</p><p>For wired connectivity, the router features four Gigabit Ethernet ports, including 1 × WAN port and 3 × LAN ports, enabling ultra-fast wired connections for PCs, gaming consoles, smart TVs, and other network devices. The Gigabit ports ensure faster and more stable data transmission compared to standard Fast Ethernet connections.</p><p>The BDCOM WAP2100-WR1200G features a sleek, compact, and modern design that easily fits into any workspace or home setup. Measuring 200 × 110 × 24mm, it offers space-saving installation while maintaining efficient performance. It operates using an AC 220V power adapter for stable and reliable power delivery.</p><p>With its strong dual-band performance, Gigabit connectivity, and wide coverage capabilities, the BDCOM WAP2100-WR1200G is an excellent choice for users seeking a reliable and affordable high-speed wireless router.</p><p>Buy BDCOM WAP2100-WR1200G 1200Mbps Dual Band Gigabit WiFi Router from International Office Solution In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original BDCOM WAP2100-WR1200G 1200Mbps Dual Band Gigabit WiFi Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of BDCOM networking products at competitive prices. Order online or visit your nearest International Office Solution outlet to get the best deal. The BDCOM WAP2100-WR1200G comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>2.4GHz: Up to 300Mbps<br>5GHz: Up to 867Mbps<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1x Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4GHz and 5GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1x WAN and 3x LAN</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE802.11b/g/n, IEEE802.11a/n/ac<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>WEP, WPA/WPA2, WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK encryption<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>200x110x24(mm)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>210(g)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band Router', 1833.00, 1833.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/nHIcr6bQaNaw3tVdLNeqVxXEcrMwkHCC2ySqFSoT.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-29 15:06:14', '2026-06-04 03:49:33', 'BDCOM WAP2100-WR1200G 1200Mbps Dual Band Gigabit WiFi Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy BDCOM WAP2100-WR1200G 1200Mbps Dual Band Gigabit WiFi Router from International Office Solution in Bangladesh. Enjoy fast dual-band WiFi, Gigabit ports, four antennas, and stable wireless performance.', 'BDCOM WAP2100-WR1200G, BDCOM Dual Band Router, 1200Mbps WiFi Router, Gigabit Wireless Router, BDCOM Router Bangladesh, AC1200 Router, Dual Band Gigabit Router, Home WiFi Router, Office Wireless Router, International Office Solution', NULL, 216, NULL, NULL);
