(239, 'Planet WDRT-1202AC Dual Band Gigabit WiFi Router', 'The Planet WDRT-1202AC Dual Band Gigabit Router delivers up to 1200Mbps wireless speed with simultaneous 2.4GHz and 5GHz connectivity. Featuring Gigabit LAN/WAN ports, advanced firewall protection, NAT, and MAC-based access control, it ensures stable and secure high-speed networking.', 'planet-wdrt-1202ac-dual-band-gigabit-wifi-router-1780067400', '<p>Planet WDRT-1202AC 1200Mbps Dual Band Gigabit Wireless Router</p><p>The Planet WDRT-1202AC 1200Mbps Dual Band Gigabit Wireless Router is a high-performance networking solution designed to provide fast, stable, and reliable wireless connectivity for homes, offices, and multimedia environments. Supporting IEEE 802.11a/b/g/n/ac wireless standards, this advanced dual-band router delivers seamless internet performance with improved speed, coverage, and efficiency.</p><p>The router offers combined wireless speeds of up to 1200Mbps, including 867Mbps on the 5GHz band and 300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band. This dual-band functionality allows users to separate bandwidth-intensive tasks such as HD streaming and online gaming onto the 5GHz frequency while using the 2.4GHz band for everyday browsing and general internet usage. By reducing wireless interference between the two bands, the WDRT-1202AC ensures smoother and more stable network performance.</p><p>Designed for high-speed multimedia applications, the Planet WDRT-1202AC provides excellent wireless stability and reliable data transmission, making it ideal for streaming HD videos, online gaming, video conferencing, and connecting multiple smart devices simultaneously.</p><p>The router features Gigabit LAN and WAN ports, delivering throughput speeds up to 10 times faster than traditional Fast Ethernet connections. This high-speed wired connectivity allows users to connect devices such as desktop PCs, NAS storage systems, gaming consoles, and media players while maintaining exceptional signal quality and network efficiency.</p><p>For enhanced security and network management, the WDRT-1202AC includes advanced NAT functionality, allowing multiple users to share a single public IP address. It also supports Port Forwarding, enabling specific LAN devices to function as application servers accessible from the internet.</p><p>The built-in firewall system protects connected devices from unauthorized access and various forms of cyber threats, including DoS attacks. Additionally, MAC-based access control allows administrators to permit or restrict device connections, enhancing network security and preventing unauthorized access attempts.</p><p>With its powerful dual-band performance, Gigabit connectivity, advanced firewall protection, and reliable multimedia support, the Planet WDRT-1202AC is an excellent choice for users seeking a secure and high-speed wireless networking solution.</p><p>Buy Planet WDRT-1202AC 1200Mbps Dual Band Gigabit Wireless Router from International Office Solution In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Planet WDRT-1202AC 1200Mbps Dual Band Gigabit Wireless Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of Planet networking products at competitive prices. Order online or visit your nearest International Office Solution outlet to get the best deal. The Planet WDRT-1202AC comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>1733 Mbps (5 GHz), 300 Mbps (2.4 GHz)<br>Compatible with 802.11a/b/g/n/ac Wi-Fi standards</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4× Fixed Omni-Directional Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS Button, Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>5 GHz, 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Wireless Modes:<br>Enable/Disable Wireless Radio, WMM<br>WEP, WPA/WPA2,<br><br>Wireless Functions:<br>WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1× 1000/100/10 Mbps WAN Port<br>4× 1000/100/10 Mbps LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11ac/n/a 5 GHz<br>IEEE 802.11n/b/g 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Processor: Dual-Core CPU<br>Flash: 16MB<br>DDR: 128MB</td></tr><tr><td>Operating System Support</td><td>Microsoft Windows 98SE /NT /2000 /XP /Vista /7 /8 /8.1 / 10, MAC OS, NetWare, UNIX or Linux</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>12 V / 1.5 A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Shell Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>204.8 x 137. 5 x 38. 3mm</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01-year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band Gigabit', 2050.00, 2050.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/lxSJ8bNHJ1f77PknmlJFaDJim4shRkfeuJydxsRM.jpg', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-29 15:10:00', '2026-05-29 15:10:00', 'Planet WDRT-1202AC 1200Mbps Dual Band Gigabit Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy Planet WDRT-1202AC 1200Mbps Dual Band Gigabit Wireless Router from International Office Solution in Bangladesh. Enjoy dual-band WiFi, Gigabit ports, advanced firewall security, and smooth HD streaming.', 'Planet WDRT-1202AC, Planet Dual Band Router, 1200Mbps Wireless Router, Gigabit WiFi Router, Planet Router Bangladesh, AC1200 Router, Dual Band Gigabit Router, Secure Wireless Router, Home Office Router, International Office Solution', NULL, 217, NULL, NULL),
(240, 'Grandstream GWN7002 4-Port WAN Gigabit VPN Router', 'The Grandstream GWN7002 is a high-performance 4-port WAN Gigabit VPN router featuring a dual-core ARM processor, 2.2Gbps NAT throughput, 530Mbps VPN throughput, 2.5G SFP ports, and support for up to 50 VPN tunnels for secure enterprise networking.', 'grandstream-gwn7002-4-port-wan-gigabit-vpn-router-1780067840', '<p>Grandstream GWN7002 4-Port WAN Gigabit VPN Router</p><p>The Grandstream GWN7002 4-Port WAN Gigabit VPN Router is a high-performance enterprise networking solution designed for demanding business environments that require secure, stable, and high-speed connectivity. Engineered with advanced routing capabilities and enterprise-grade security features, this router is ideal for offices, branch networks, retail environments, and multi-site business deployments.</p><p>Powered by a dual-core ARM Cortex-A53 1GHz processor, the Grandstream GWN7002 delivers fast and efficient network performance capable of handling intensive networking tasks, high traffic loads, and secure remote communication. The router features 4 × Gigabit Ethernet WAN/LAN ports along with 2 × 2.5 Gigabit SFP ports, providing flexible connectivity options for high-speed wired networking and fiber uplink expansion.</p><p>With NAT throughput up to 2.2Gbps and IPsec VPN throughput up to 530Mbps, the router ensures fast and reliable data transmission between remote offices, cloud services, and connected users. Its advanced VPN functionality supports secure communication with multiple VPN protocols including IPsec, PPTP, L2TP, OpenVPN, and WireGuard, making it suitable for modern remote access and site-to-site networking requirements.</p><p>The Grandstream GWN7002 supports up to 50 simultaneous VPN tunnels, enabling businesses to create secure and scalable remote networking infrastructures. It also includes comprehensive security features such as firewall protection, DDNS, content filtering, and port forwarding to protect the network against unauthorized access and cyber threats.</p><p>For flexible ISP compatibility, the router supports multiple internet connection types including DHCP, Static IP, and PPPoE. LED status indicators provide convenient real-time monitoring of device activity and network status for easier troubleshooting and maintenance.</p><p>With its powerful processing performance, enterprise-grade security, flexible VPN support, and high-speed connectivity, the Grandstream GWN7002 is an excellent choice for businesses seeking a reliable and scalable VPN router solution.</p><p>Buy Grandstream GWN7002 4-Port WAN Gigabit VPN Router from International Office Solution In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Grandstream GWN7002 4-Port WAN Gigabit VPN Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of Grandstream networking products at competitive prices. Order online or visit your nearest International Office Solution outlet to get the best deal. The Grandstream GWN7002 comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>2.2Gbps NAT routing<br>530Mbps IPSec VPN performance<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>2x 2.5 Gigabit SFP ports<br>4x Gigabit Ethernet ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IPv4, IPv6, IEEE802.1Q, IEEE 802.1p, IEEE802.1X, IEEE802.3, IEEE 802.3u, IEEE 802.3x,IEEE802.3ab</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>1x USB 2.0 port<br>1x Reset Pinhole</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>QoS: VLAN, TOS, Support multiple traffic classes, filter by port, IP address, DSCP, and policing, App Qos, VolP<br>Prioritization<br>Firewall: DDNS, Port Forwarding, DMZ, UPnP, Anti-DoS, traffic rules, NAT, ALG, TURN Service<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Universal power adaptor included: Input: 100-240VAC 50-60Hz Output: 24V DC 1A (24W)<br>PoE Standard: IEEE 802.3af/at<br>PoE Output: 2x PoE out ports Passive 48V or IEEE802.3af<br>PoE Power Budget: Universal power adaptor included: Input: 100-240VAC 50-60Hz Output: 24V DC 1A (24W)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>210mm(L)x130mm(W)x35mm(H)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>505g</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Gigabit VPN', 11000.00, 11000.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/1CapTl169sx71GS9nS1d0lpjekQkB9eC6TpLvrLm.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-29 15:17:20', '2026-05-29 15:22:58', 'Grandstream GWN7002 4-Port WAN Gigabit VPN Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy Grandstream GWN7002 4-Port WAN Gigabit VPN Router from International Office Solution in Bangladesh. Features 2.2Gbps NAT throughput, 530Mbps VPN speed, 2.5G SFP ports, and advanced enterprise security.', 'Grandstream GWN7002, VPN Router Bangladesh, Gigabit VPN Router, Enterprise VPN Router, Grandstream Router, Multi WAN Router, IPsec VPN Router, WireGuard Router, Business Network Router, International Office Solution', NULL, 218, NULL, NULL),
(241, 'Grandstream GWN7052 1270Mbps Dual Band Gigabit WiFi Router', 'The Grandstream GWN7052 is a high-performance 1270Mbps dual-band Gigabit WiFi router featuring MU-MIMO technology, mesh networking support, enterprise-grade security, cloud management, and VPN support for up to 100 connected devices.', 'grandstream-gwn7052-1270mbps-dual-band-gigabit-wifi-router-1780068079', '<p>Grandstream GWN7052 1270Mbps Dual Band Gigabit WiFi Router</p><p>The Grandstream GWN7052 1270Mbps Dual Band Gigabit WiFi Router is a powerful and secure networking solution designed for modern business environments, offices, retail spaces, and professional users who require stable wireless performance and advanced network management. Combining high-speed dual-band connectivity with enterprise-grade security features, this router delivers reliable and efficient networking for both wired and wireless devices.</p><p>The router provides a combined wireless speed of up to 1270Mbps, ensuring smooth HD streaming, video conferencing, cloud access, online collaboration, and fast data transfer. Equipped with dual-band 2×2:2 MU-MIMO technology, the Grandstream GWN7052 improves network efficiency by allowing multiple devices to communicate simultaneously without reducing overall performance.</p><p>Designed to support up to 100 concurrent WiFi client devices, this router is ideal for environments with multiple connected users and smart devices. Its advanced mesh networking support enables seamless integration with Grandstream access points for expanded wireless coverage and uninterrupted roaming throughout larger spaces.</p><p>For wired networking, the router includes 1 × Gigabit Ethernet WAN port and 4 × Gigabit Ethernet LAN ports, delivering fast and stable wired connectivity for desktops, servers, IP phones, and network storage devices.</p><p>The Grandstream GWN7052 includes built-in VPN support with compatibility for multiple VPN protocols including IPsec, OpenVPN, PPTP, and L2TP, allowing secure remote access and safe communication between branch offices and remote employees.</p><p>Security is a major highlight of the router, featuring advanced firewall protection with Anti-DoS, NAT, ALG, traffic rules, guest network support, network blacklist management, and anti-hacking secure boot technology. These features help protect business networks from unauthorized access and cyber threats.</p><p>Powered by 128MB RAM with support for up to 30K NAT sessions, the router ensures smooth network operation and efficient traffic management. It also supports centralized cloud management through GWN.Cloud, allowing administrators to configure, monitor, and manage the network remotely with ease.</p><p>Additional management features such as SSH, TR-069, SNMP, and Telnet provide advanced network administration and monitoring capabilities for professional IT environments.</p><p>Overall, the Grandstream GWN7052 is a secure, scalable, and high-performance dual-band Gigabit WiFi router designed for businesses seeking stable wireless networking, secure VPN connectivity, and advanced cloud-based management.</p><h2>Buy Grandstream GWN7052 1270Mbps Dual Band Gigabit WiFi Router from International Office Solution</h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Grandstream GWN7052 1270Mbps Dual Band Gigabit WiFi Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of Grandstream networking products at competitive prices. Order online or visit your nearest International Office Solution outlet to get the best deal. The Grandstream GWN7052 comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>1Gbps NAT routing<br>300Mbps IPSec VPN performance<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4 individual external antennas, 2 per band<br>2.4GHz, gain 5.0dBi<br>5 GHz, gain 5.0dBi</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4GHz radio: 2400 – 2483.5MHz<br>5GHz radio: 5150 - 5850MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1x Gigabit Ethernet WAN port<br>4x Gigabit Ethernet LAN ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>5G:<br>IEEE 802.11ac: 6.5 Mbps to 867 Mbps IEEE 802.11n: 6.5 Mbps to 300 Mbps IEEE 802.11a: 6, 9, 12, 18, 24, 36, 48, 54 Mbps<br>2.4G:<br>IEEE 802.11n: 6.5 Mbps to 300 Mbps IEEE 802.11b: 1, 2, 5.5, 11 Mbps IEEE 802.11g: 6, 9, 12, 18, 24, 36, 48, 54 Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>1x USB 2.0 port<br>1x Reset Pinhole</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Universal power adaptor included: Input 100-240VAC 50-60Hz Output: 12VDC 1A (12W);</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>235.5mm(L)x145mm(W)x192mm(H)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>375g</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band Gigabit', 7000.00, 7000.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/bB4fcNZbc7lpuyc8SuvqagyWBWDx95Zm3bgJyPBC.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-29 15:21:19', '2026-05-29 15:21:19', 'Grandstream GWN7052 1270Mbps Dual Band Gigabit WiFi Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy Grandstream GWN7052 1270Mbps Dual Band Gigabit WiFi Router from International Office Solution in Bangladesh. Features MU-MIMO, VPN support, cloud management, mesh networking, and Gigabit connectivity.', 'Grandstream GWN7052, Dual Band WiFi Router, Gigabit WiFi Router, Grandstream Router Bangladesh, Business WiFi Router, VPN WiFi Router, Mesh Router, MU-MIMO Router, Cloud Managed Router, International Office Solution', NULL, 218, NULL, NULL),
(242, 'Grandstream GWN7001 6-Port WAN Gigabit VPN Router', 'The Grandstream GWN7001 is a powerful 6-port WAN Gigabit VPN router featuring 2.2Gbps NAT throughput, 530Mbps VPN performance, support for 50 VPN tunnels, VLAN, QoS, firewall protection, and enterprise-grade security for business networking.', 'grandstream-gwn7001-6-port-wan-gigabit-vpn-router-1780068427', '<p>Grandstream GWN7001 6-Port WAN Gigabit VPN Router</p><p>The Grandstream GWN7001 6-Port WAN Gigabit VPN Router is a high-performance enterprise networking solution designed to provide secure, reliable, and scalable connectivity for modern business environments. Built to support demanding commercial applications, this advanced VPN router delivers exceptional routing performance, robust security, and flexible network management for offices, branch networks, and remote work infrastructures.</p><p>Equipped with 6 × Gigabit Ethernet WAN/LAN ports, the Grandstream GWN7001 offers versatile connectivity options for high-speed wired networking and efficient network expansion. Its flexible port configuration allows businesses to customize network setups according to operational requirements while ensuring stable and fast data communication.</p><p>The router delivers impressive NAT routing throughput of up to 2.2Gbps, enabling smooth traffic handling for bandwidth-intensive applications such as cloud services, video conferencing, VoIP communication, and enterprise data transfer. With VPN throughput up to 530Mbps and support for up to 50 simultaneous VPN tunnels, the GWN7001 ensures secure and efficient communication between branch offices, remote employees, and centralized corporate networks.</p><p>Powered by 256MB RAM and 256MB Flash memory, the router provides reliable system performance, efficient traffic processing, and stable operation. It also supports up to 30,000 NAT sessions, making it capable of handling large numbers of concurrent connections without compromising network performance.</p><p>The Grandstream GWN7001 supports a wide range of networking protocols including IPv4, IPv6, IEEE 802.1Q, and IEEE 802.3, ensuring compatibility with modern networking infrastructures and future-ready deployments.</p><p>Advanced networking and security features include Quality of Service (QoS), VLAN support, traffic prioritization, firewall protection, and enhanced network management capabilities. These features help optimize bandwidth usage, improve network stability, and protect the system from unauthorized access and cyber threats.</p><p>For secure remote access and site-to-site communication, the router supports multiple VPN protocols including PPTP, L2TP, SSL VPN, IPsec, and upcoming WireGuard support, providing flexible encryption and authentication options for different business requirements.</p><p>With its combination of high-speed routing, enterprise-grade VPN security, advanced management tools, and scalable connectivity, the Grandstream GWN7001 is an ideal networking solution for businesses seeking secure and reliable WAN connectivity.</p><p>Buy Grandstream GWN7001 6-Port WAN Gigabit VPN Router from International Office Solution In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Grandstream GWN7001 6-Port WAN Gigabit VPN Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of Grandstream networking products at competitive prices. Order online or visit your nearest International Office Solution outlet to get the best deal. The Grandstream GWN7001 comes with a 3-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>2.2Gbps NAT routing<br>530Mbps IPSec VPN performance<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>6x WAN/LAN Gigabit Ethernet ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IPv4, IPv6, IEEE802.1Q, IEEE 802.1p, IEEE802.1X, IEEE802.3, IEEE 802.3u, IEEE 802.3x,IEEE802.3ab</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>1x USB 2.0 port<br>1x Reset Pinhol