(243, 'Grandstream GWN7052F 1270Mbps Dual Band Gigabit WiFi Router', 'The Grandstream GWN7052F is a high-performance 1270Mbps dual-band Gigabit WiFi router featuring MU-MIMO technology, SFP WAN support, enterprise VPN security, mesh networking, and cloud management for modern business networking.', 'grandstream-gwn7052f-1270mbps-dual-band-gigabit-wifi-router-1780068687', '<p>Grandstream GWN7052F 1270Mbps Dual Band Gigabit WiFi Router</p><p>The Grandstream GWN7052F 1270Mbps Dual Band Gigabit WiFi Router is a high-performance enterprise networking solution designed to provide fast, stable, and secure wireless connectivity for modern businesses, offices, retail spaces, and professional environments. Combining advanced wireless technology with enterprise-grade security and cloud management features, this router ensures reliable networking for both wired and wireless devices.</p><p>The router delivers a combined wireless speed of up to 1270Mbps, enabling smooth HD streaming, cloud access, online collaboration, video conferencing, and high-speed data transfer. Equipped with dual-band 2×2:2 MU-MIMO technology, the Grandstream GWN7052F efficiently manages multiple wireless connections simultaneously, ensuring stable and high-speed performance for up to 100 connected WiFi devices.</p><p>Designed for flexible deployment and network expansion, the router supports mesh networking with Grandstream access points, allowing users to extend wireless coverage seamlessly across larger spaces without complicated configurations.</p><p>The Grandstream GWN7052F includes 1 × Gigabit SFP Ethernet WAN port and 4 × Gigabit Ethernet LAN ports with selectable WAN/LAN functionality, offering versatile wired connectivity options and fiber uplink support for enterprise networking environments.</p><p>Powered by 256MB RAM and supporting up to 60,000 NAT sessions, the router delivers efficient NAT routing and strong IPsec VPN performance for secure communication and optimized network traffic management. It supports multiple VPN protocols including IPsec, OpenVPN, PPTP, and L2TP, enabling secure remote access and reliable site-to-site connectivity for remote employees and branch offices.</p><p>Advanced security features include anti-DoS protection, traffic rules, NAT, ALG, guest network support, network blacklist management, and anti-hacking secure boot technology to help safeguard the network from unauthorized access and cyber threats.</p><p>For simplified management, the Grandstream GWN7052F supports centralized cloud provisioning and monitoring through GWN.Cloud, allowing administrators to configure and manage the network remotely with ease. Additional management tools such as SSH, TR-069, SNMP, and Telnet provide enhanced monitoring and administrative control for IT professionals.</p><p>With its high-speed wireless performance, flexible SFP connectivity, enterprise-grade VPN support, advanced security, and cloud-based management, the Grandstream GWN7052F is an excellent choice for businesses seeking a scalable and secure dual-band Gigabit WiFi router.</p><p>Buy Grandstream GWN7052F 1270Mbps Dual Band Gigabit WiFi Router from International Office Solution In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Grandstream GWN7052F 1270Mbps Dual Band Gigabit WiFi Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of Grandstream networking products at competitive prices. Order online or visit your nearest International Office Solution outlet to get the best deal. The Grandstream GWN7052F comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>1Gbps NAT routing<br>300Mbps IPSec VPN performance<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4 individual external antennas, 2 per band<br>2.4GHz, gain 5.0dBi<br>5 GHz, gain 5.0dBi</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4GHz radio: 2400 – 2483.5MHz<br>5GHz radio: 5150 - 5850MHz</td></tr><t