(244, 'Grandstream GWN7003 9-Port WAN Gigabit VPN Router', 'The Grandstream GWN7003 is a high-performance 9-port WAN Gigabit VPN router featuring dual ARM Cortex-A53 processors, 2.2Gbps NAT throughput, 530Mbps VPN performance, 2.5G SFP ports, and support for up to 100 VPN tunnels.', 'grandstream-gwn7003-9-port-wan-gigabit-vpn-router-1780068903', '<p>Grandstream GWN7003 9-Port WAN Gigabit VPN Router</p><p>The Grandstream GWN7003 9-Port WAN Gigabit VPN Router is a high-performance enterprise networking solution designed for businesses that require secure, scalable, and reliable connectivity. Built to handle demanding network environments, this advanced VPN router combines powerful hardware performance, flexible connectivity, and enterprise-grade security features to support modern business operations.</p><p>Powered by a dual-core ARM Cortex-A53 1GHz processor along with 512MB RAM and 256MB Flash memory, the Grandstream GWN7003 delivers efficient data processing and stable network performance even during high traffic loads and intensive networking tasks. It is designed to support enterprise applications, remote work infrastructures, and secure multi-site networking.</p><p>The router features 9 × Gigabit Ethernet ports and 2 × 2.5 Gigabit SFP ports, offering versatile connectivity options for high-speed wired networking and fiber uplink integration. This flexible configuration makes the GWN7003 suitable for various network topologies and scalable business deployments.</p><p>With NAT throughput up to 2.2Gbps and IPsec VPN throughput up to 530Mbps, the router ensures fast and secure data communication between remote offices, cloud services, and connected users. It supports up to 100 simultaneous VPN tunnels, making it ideal for businesses requiring secure remote access and site-to-site VPN connectivity.</p><p>The Grandstream GWN7003 supports multiple VPN protocols including IPsec, OpenVPN, PPTP, and L2TP, providing flexible encryption and authentication options for secure