tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>1x USB 2.0 port<br>1x Reset Pinhole</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>QoS: VLAN, TOS, Support multiple traffic classes, filter by port, IP address, DSCP, and policing, App Qos, VolP<br>Prioritization<br>Firewall: DDNS, Port Forwarding, DMZ, UPnP, Anti-DoS, traffic rules, NAT, ALG, TURN Service<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Universal power adaptor included: Input: 100-240VAC 50-60Hz Output: 24V DC 1A (24W)<br>PoE Standard: IEEE 802.3af/at<br>PoE Output: 2x PoE out ports Passive 48V or IEEE802.3af<br>PoE Power Budget: Universal power adaptor included: Input: 100-240VAC 50-60Hz Output: 24V DC 1A (24W)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>260mm(L)x149.35mm(W)*35mm(H)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>1096g</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'WAN Gigabit VPN', 14300.00, 14300.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/QwhL1xQaeCbgoTGU8Me33FKiSHOZEWOfBxdjlBE7.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-29 15:35:03', '2026-05-29 15:35:03', 'Grandstream GWN7003 9-Port WAN Gigabit VPN Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy Grandstream GWN7003 9-Port WAN Gigabit VPN Router from International Office Solution in Bangladesh. Features 2.2Gbps NAT throughput, 100 VPN tunnels, 2.5G SFP ports, and enterprise-grade security.', 'Grandstream GWN7003, WAN Gigabit VPN Router, Enterprise VPN Router, Grandstream Router Bangladesh, Multi WAN Router, 2.5G SFP Router, IPsec VPN Router, Business Network Router, Secure VPN Gateway, International Office Solution', NULL, 218, NULL, NULL),
(245, 'Cisco C891F Integrated Service Router', 'The Cisco C891F Integrated Services Router features 8 Gigabit Ethernet ports, 4 PoE ports, 1 SFP uplink, 1GB DRAM, fanless operation, and advanced IP services, making it ideal for secure and scalable enterprise networking.', 'cisco-c891f-integrated-service-router-1780070585', '<p>The Cisco C891F Integrated Services Router is a powerful and enterprise-grade networking solution designed to provide secure, reliable, and high-performance connectivity for branch offices, small businesses, and professional network environments. Built with Cisco’s trusted networking technology, this router combines advanced routing capabilities, integrated security, and flexible connectivity options in a compact rack-mountable design.</p><p>The Cisco C891F features 8 × RJ-45 Gigabit Ethernet ports, enabling high-speed wired connectivity for desktops, servers, IP phones, wireless access points, and other network devices. It also includes 4 PoE-enabled ports, allowing direct power delivery to compatible devices such as IP cameras, VoIP phones, and wireless access points without requiring separate power adapters.</p><p>For fiber connectivity and network expansion, the router is equipped with 1 × SFP port, providing flexible uplink options for high-speed enterprise networking environments. Its support for Advanced IP Services ensures enhanced routing functionality and improved network management capabilities for modern business infrastructures.</p><p>Powered by 1024MB onboard DRAM and 256MB Flash memory, the Cisco C891F delivers stable performance, efficient data processing, and reliable operation for bandwidth-intensive applications and multi-user environments. The router supports Cisco IOS starting from version 15.4(1)T / 15.3(3)M2, enabling access to enterprise-level networking features and security enhancements.</p><p>The device also includes 1 × USB 2.0 port for external storage and additional functionality. Backup connectivity options include 1 × V.92 port and 1 × ISDN BRI (DATA) interface, ensuring reliable communication and failover support when primary network connections are unavailable.</p><p>Designed for silent and efficient operation, the Cisco C891F features a fanless architecture, reducing noise levels while improving energy efficiency and long-term reliability. Its compact dimensions of 4.6 × 32.3 × 24.9 cm and lightweight 2.5kg design make it suitable for rack-mounted or desktop deployment in professional environments.</p><p>The router is also RoHS 6 compliant, ensuring environmentally responsible manufacturing standards and improved sustainability.</p><p>Overall, the Cisco C891F Integrated Services Router is an ideal choice for organizations seeking secure, scalable, and enterprise-class networking with Gigabit performance, PoE support, fiber connectivity, and advanced routing capabilities.</p><p>Buy Cisco C891F Integrated Services Router from International Office Solution In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Cisco C891F Integrated Services Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of Cisco enterprise networking products at competitive prices. Order online or visit your nearest International Office Solution outlet to get the best deal. The Cisco C891F comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<h2>Cisco C891F Integrated Services Router Specifications</h2><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>&nbsp;</th><th>&nbsp;</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Brand</strong></td><td>Cisco</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Model</strong></td><td>Cisco C891F</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Product Type</strong></td><td>Integrated Services Router</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Rack Mount Support</strong></td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interfaces</strong></td><td>8 × RJ-45 10/100/1000 Gigabit Ethernet Ports</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PoE Ports</strong></td><td>4 Ports</td></tr><tr><td><strong>SFP Port</strong></td><td>1 × SFP</td></tr><tr><td><strong>USB Ports</strong></td><td>1 × USB 2.0</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Flash Memory</strong></td><td>256 MB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Onboard DRAM</strong></td><td>1024 MB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>IP Base</strong></td><td>N/A</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced IP Services</strong></td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Security</strong></td><td>N/A</td></tr><tr><td><strong>First IOS Support</strong></td><td>15.4(1)T / 15.3(3)M2</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Backup Interfaces</strong></td><td>1 × V.92, 1 × ISDN (DATA) BRI</td></tr><tr><td><strong>DSL Chipset</strong></td><td>N/A</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling System</strong></td><td>Fanless</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>4.6 × 32.3 × 24.9 cm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Weight</strong></td><td>2.5 kg</td></tr><tr><td><strong>RoHS Compliance</strong></td><td>RoHS 6 Compliant</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>1 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Integrated Service', 56500.00, 56500.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/yzk3U98tzGunPableQORJtZfX9JQ1PtCk4Z1PvVP.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-29 16:03:05', '2026-05-29 16:03:05', 'Cisco C891F Integrated Services Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy Cisco C891F Integrated Services Router from International Office Solution in Bangladesh. Features 8 Gigabit ports, 4 PoE ports, SFP uplink, 1GB DRAM, and enterprise-grade networking performance.', 'Cisco C891F, Cisco Integrated Services Router, Gigabit Enterprise Router, Cisco Router Bangladesh, PoE Router, SFP Router, Business Network Router, Cisco ISR Router, Secure Enterprise Router, International Office Solution', NULL, 219, NULL, NULL),
(246, 'Cisco C1111-8P Integrated Services Router', 'The Cisco C1111-8P Integrated Services Router features 8 Gigabit LAN ports, PoE/PoE+ support, VPN security, USB 3.0 connectivity, and compact enterprise-grade performance for secure and efficient business networking', 'cisco-c1111-8p-integrated-services-router-1780070757', '<p>Cisco C1111-8P Integrated Services Router</p><p>The Cisco C1111-8P Integrated Services Router is a compact, high-performance enterprise networking solution designed to deliver secure, reliable, and energy-efficient connectivity for modern businesses and branch offices. Built with Cisco’s advanced integrated services architecture, this router offers outstanding performance while supporting multiple concurrent services with low power consumption.</p><p>Designed for business continuity and operational efficiency, the Cisco C1111-8P provides high application performance, advanced security, and centralized network management capabilities. It enables unified control of both wired and wireless networks from a single management platform, simplifying deployment and reducing operational complexity for IT administrators.</p><p>The router features 1 × Gigabit WAN port and 8 × Gigabit LAN ports supporting 10/100/1000 network standards for both WAN and LAN connectivity. With a data transfer rate of up to 1000Mbps, the Cisco C1111-8P ensures smooth communication, fast data transmission, and stable connectivity for business-critical applications.</p><p>One of the key highlights of the Cisco C1111-8P is its integrated Power over Ethernet (PoE) support. The router supports both IEEE 802.3af PoE and IEEE 802.3at PoE+ standards, allowing direct power delivery to compatible devices such as IP phones, wireless access points, surveillance cameras, and other PoE-enabled equipment without requiring additional power sources.</p><p>The router also includes a USB 3.0 interface for enhanced external connectivity and additional functionality. Built-in VPN support ensures secure remote access and encrypted communication between branch offices and remote workers, helping businesses maintain secure networking environments.</p><p>Its compact and lightweight design makes it ideal for IT consolidation, space-saving deployments, and reducing Total Cost of Ownership (TCO). The router supports wall mounting for flexible installation and comes in a professional silver finish suitable for modern office environments.</p><p>For convenient operation and monitoring, the Cisco C1111-8P includes LED status indicators, a power switch, and a reset button. It operates on a universal input voltage range of 100–240VAC and performs reliably within an operating temperature range of 0°C to 40°C and humidity levels of 5% to 85% relative humidity.</p><p>With its enterprise-grade performance, advanced security, PoE capabilities, compact design, and reliable Cisco networking technology, the Cisco C1111-8P Integrated Services Router is an excellent solution for businesses seeking secure and scalable network infrastructure.</p><p>Buy Cisco C1111-8P Integrated Services Router from International Office Solution In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Cisco C1111-8P Integrated Services Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of Cisco networking products at competitive prices. Order online or visit your nearest International Office Solution outlet to get the best deal. The Cisco C1111-8P comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>50-60 Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>32 (encrypted and non-encrypted VLANs)<br>2x2 .11ac Wave 2<br><br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>Micro USB Port: One RJ-45: Separate console port<br>USB port: USB 3.0 Type-A host port<br>USB devices supported: USB flash memory<br>Console port: One USB 5-pin micro Type B: Console management connectivity<br>10/100/1000 Gigabit Ethernet;<br>Two GE ports allocated among RJ45 and SFP as:<br>One combo port with 10/100/1000RJ-45 Ethernet port or SFP Ethernet port (labeled GE0/0/0)<br>One dedicated 10/100/1000RJ-45 Ethernet port (labeled GE0/0/1)<br>Wireless VLANs: 32 (encrypted and non-encrypted VLANs)<br>Inline PoE: 4 ports for -8P PIDs, 2 ports for -4P PIDs<br>802.3af-compliant PoE or 802.3at-compliant PoE+</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>H x W X D = 1.75 x 12.7 x 9.03 in. (42 x 323 x 230mm) (includes rubber feet)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>5.5 Lbs. (2.5 kg) maximum</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01-Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Integrated Services', 98000.00, 98000.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/C84vs1QqsWMFccbe6WoBACY9QeYCoNhzcIGKcQ2W.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-29 16:05:57', '2026-05-29 16:05:57', 'Cisco C1111-8P Integrated Services Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy Cisco C1111-8P Integrated Services Router from International Office Solution in Bangladesh. Features 8 Gigabit LAN ports, PoE+, VPN support, USB 3.0, and enterprise-grade security.', 'Cisco C1111-8P, Cisco Integrated Services Router, PoE Router Bangladesh, Cisco Gigabit Router, Enterprise VPN Router, Cisco ISR Router, Business Network Router, Cisco PoE Router, Secure Enterprise Router, International Office Solution', NULL, 219, NULL, NULL),
(247, 'Cisco ISR4331/K9 Integrated Service Router With SEC license', 'The Cisco ISR4331/K9 is a high-performance enterprise router with up to 300Mbps throughput, modular expansion slots, 4GB RAM, SFP support, and SEC license enabling VPN, firewall, IPS, and advanced security features.', 'cisco-isr4331k9-integrated-service-router-with-sec-license-1780070968', '<p>The Cisco ISR4331/K9 Integrated Services Router with SEC License is a high-performance enterprise networking solution designed for small to medium-sized businesses and branch office deployments. It delivers secure, scalable, and reliable connectivity for modern business applications including voice, video, data, cloud services, and IoT environments.</p><p>This router provides an aggregate throughput of up to 300 Mbps, making it suitable for handling multiple concurrent services while maintaining stable network performance. It features a flexible and modular interface architecture that includes 3 × onboard Gigabit Ethernet (10/100/1000) ports, 2 × RJ-45-based ports, and 2 × SFP-based ports for fiber connectivity, enabling versatile WAN and LAN deployment options.</p><p>For future scalability, the Cisco ISR4331/K9 includes 1 × enhanced service module slot, 2 × Network Interface Module (NIM) slots, and an ISC expansion slot. These modular options allow businesses to expand functionality and adapt the router to evolving network requirements.</p><p>The device supports Online Insertion and Removal (OIR) for all I/O modules, ensuring uninterrupted upgrades and maintenance without affecting network uptime. This makes it ideal for mission-critical environments where continuous availability is essential.</p><p>The router is equipped with 4GB default RAM and 4GB default flash memory, both of which can be upgraded up to 16GB for enhanced performance and storage capacity. It also includes multiple management interfaces such as USB 2.0, USB console port, serial console port, and auxiliary port for easy configuration and monitoring.</p><p>For power and expansion support, the Cisco ISR4331/K9 includes an internal AC power supply and an optional PoE power supply capable of delivering up to 250W of PoE power to connected devices such as IP phones, wireless access points, and surveillance systems.</p><p>With the SEC license, the router enables advanced security features including VPN support, firewall protection, intrusion prevention system (IPS), content filtering, and encryption technologies. These features ensure secure communication, protection against cyber threats, and safe remote access for enterprise environments.</p><p>Designed for scalability and reliability, the Cisco ISR4331/K9 provides a robust platform for organizations that require secure WAN connectivity, modular expansion, and high-performance routing for multiple business applications.</p><p>Buy Cisco ISR4331/K9 Integrated Services Router with SEC License from International Office Solution In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Cisco ISR4331/K9 Integrated Services Router with SEC License from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of Cisco enterprise networking products at competitive prices. Order online or visit your nearest International Office Solution outlet to get the best deal. The Cisco ISR4331/K9 comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>47 to 63 Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>3x WAN/LAN<br>2x SFP<br>2x RJ-45-based ports</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>1.75 x 17.25 x 17.25 in (44.45 x 438.15 x 438.15 mm)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>16.1 lb (7.3 kg)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01-Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Integrated Service Router', 215000.00, 215000.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/Et8bwNlyfLmJPVk8h6klghKPER7P1rkubhlt3ry6.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-29 16:09:28', '2026-05-29 16:09:28', 'Cisco ISR4331/K9 Integrated Services Router with SEC License | International Office Solution', 'Buy Cisco ISR4331/K9 Integrated Services Router with SEC License from International Office Solution in Bangladesh. Features 300Mbps throughput, modular slots, SFP ports, VPN, firewall, IPS, and enterprise security.', 'Cisco ISR4331, ISR4331/K9, Cisco Enterprise Router, SEC License Router, Cisco VPN Router, ISR Router Bangladesh, Modular Cisco Router, Cisco SFP Router, Enterprise Network Router, International Office Solution', NULL, 219, NULL, NULL);
