(248, 'Dahua DH-AC12 AC1200 Mbps Gigabit Dual-Band Wi-Fi Router', 'The Dahua AC12 AC1200 Dual-Band Router delivers up to 1200 Mbps speed, Gigabit ports, MU-MIMO, beamforming, WPA3 security, and stable performance for home and small office use.', 'dahua-dh-ac12-ac1200-mbps-gigabit-dual-band-wi-fi-router-1780071330', '<p>The Dahua DH-AC12 AC1200 Dual-Band Wi-Fi Router is a reliable and high-performance networking solution designed for homes and small office environments. It delivers fast, stable, and secure wireless connectivity, making it ideal for users who require smooth streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, and efficient file transfers.</p><p>With dual-band AC1200 performance, the router provides combined wireless speeds of up to 1200 Mbps—offering 300 Mbps on the 2.4 GHz band and 867 Mbps on the 5 GHz band. This ensures balanced performance for both long-range connectivity and high-speed data-intensive tasks. Its support for IEEE 802.11 b/g/n/ac standards ensures compatibility with a wide range of modern and legacy devices.</p><p>The Dahua AC12 is equipped with beamforming technology, which intelligently focuses the wireless signal toward connected devices, improving coverage, stability, and overall network efficiency. Additionally, bi-directional MU-MIMO technology allows the router to communicate with multiple devices simultaneously, reducing congestion and enhancing performance in busy network environments.</p><p>For wired connectivity, the router features 1 × Gigabit WAN port and 3 × Gigabit LAN ports, enabling high-speed and stable connections for desktops, smart TVs, gaming consoles, and other Ethernet-enabled devices.</p><p>Security is a key highlight of the Dahua AC12 router. It supports WPA, WPA2, and WPA3 encryption protocols along with MAC address filtering to protect against unauthorized access and ensure secure wireless communication. Additional features such as guest Wi-Fi and parental controls make it a suitable choice for families and shared networks, allowing controlled and safe internet usage.</p><p>The router includes 64MB DDR memory and is powered by a stable 12V DC power supply, ensuring efficient and consistent performance. It also supports advanced wireless channel widths (20/40/80 MHz), along with OFDMA and MU-MIMO technologies for optimized data handling and reduced latency.</p><p>With a compact design and effective coverage range suitable for apartments and medium-sized rooms, the Dahua DH-AC12 AC1200 Router provides a balanced combination of speed, stability, security, and ease of use.</p><p>Buy Dahua DH-AC12 AC1200 Dual-Band Wi-Fi Router from International Office Solution In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Dahua DH-AC12 AC1200 Dual-Band Wi-Fi Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of networking products at competitive prices. Order online or visit your nearest International Office Solution outlet to get the best deal. The Dahua AC12 comes with a 2-year replacement warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>2.4 GHz: 300 Mbps<br>5 GHz: 867 Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1 × eSync Button<br>1 × Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>Dual Band (2.4 GHz and 5 GHz)</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>2.4 GHz: IEEE 802.11b/g/n<br>5 GHz: IEEE 802.11a/n/ac</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA; WPA2; WPA3; WPA/WPA2; WPA2/WPA3</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>1×10/100/1000 Mbps WAN Port<br>3×10/100/1000Mbps LAN Port</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Full load: 10.5 W<br>Idling: 2.1 W</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>220 mm × 144 mm × 179 mm (8.66\" × 5.67\" × 7.05\") (L × W × H)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td><br>0.26 kg (0.57 lb)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>2-years replacement warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Gigabit Dual-Band', 2265.00, 2365.00, NULL, 6, 'products/thumbnails/8SJbDhYZHoANnlCeZIlCKluLjZBy71OTT5eFurKH.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-29 16:15:30', '2026-05-29 16:15:30', 'Dahua DH-AC12 AC1200 Dual-Band Gigabit WiFi Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy Dahua DH-AC12 AC1200 Dual-Band WiFi Router from International Office Solution in Bangladesh. Features 1200 Mbps speed, Gigabit ports, MU-MIMO, WPA3 security, and stable performance.', 'Dahua AC12, DH-AC12 router, AC1200 WiFi router, Dahua dual band router, Gigabit WiFi router Bangladesh, MU-MIMO router, WPA3 router, home WiFi router, small office router, International Office Solution', NULL, 46, NULL, NULL),
(249, 'Dahua DH-AX15M AX1500 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi 6 Router', 'The Dahua AX15M AX1500 WiFi 6 Router delivers up to 1500 Mbps speed, Gigabit ports, OFDMA, MU-MIMO, WPA3 security, and strong coverage for modern home and office networks.', 'dahua-dh-ax15m-ax1500-dual-band-gigabit-wifi-6-router-1780071588', '<p>Dahua DH-AX15M AX1500 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi 6 Router</p><p>The Dahua DH-AX15M AX1500 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi 6 Router is a next-generation networking solution designed to deliver fast, stable, and efficient wireless performance for modern homes and small offices. Powered by WiFi 6 (IEEE 802.11ax) technology, it offers improved speed, capacity, and reliability for environments with multiple connected devices.</p><p>With a combined wireless speed of up to 1500 Mbps, the router delivers 300 Mbps on the 2.4 GHz band and 1201 Mbps on the 5 GHz band. This makes it ideal for high-bandwidth activities such as 4K streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, cloud computing, and smart home device management.</p><p>The Dahua AX15M supports multiple wireless standards including IEEE 802.11 b/g/n/ac/ax, ensuring backward compatibility with older devices while delivering optimized performance for WiFi 6-enabled devices. Beamforming technology enhances coverage by focusing signal strength directly toward connected devices, improving stability and range.</p><p>Advanced wireless technologies such as OFDMA, 1024-QAM, and bi-directional MU-MIMO significantly improve network efficiency, allowing multiple devices to communicate simultaneously without congestion or speed drops. This ensures smooth performance even in busy households with many connected users.</p><p>For wired connectivity, the router includes 1 × Gigabit WAN port and 2 × Gigabit LAN ports, providing stable and high-speed connections for desktops, gaming consoles, and smart TVs.</p><p>Security is a key focus of the Dahua AX15M, supporting WPA, WPA2, and WPA3 encryption protocols to ensure strong protection against unauthorized access and cyber threats. Additional features like guest WiFi and parental controls allow users to manage network access safely and efficiently.</p><p>The router is equipped with 128MB Flash and 128MB RAM, enabling smooth operation and efficient handling of network processes. It supports advanced network management functions such as DHCP, NAT, DDNS, QoS, system logs, and NTP, accessible via a user-friendly web interface or mobile app.</p><p>With 5 dBi antennas, WPS support, reset functionality, LED indicators, and high receiver sensitivity, the Dahua AX15M ensures reliable long-range connectivity and easy operation. It supports up to 48 connected wireless devices, making it suitable for modern smart homes.</p><p>Overall, the Dahua AX15M AX1500 WiFi 6 Router is a powerful, secure, and future-ready networking solution designed to meet the demands of high-speed digital lifestyles.</p><p>Buy Dahua DH-AX15M AX1500 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi 6 Router from International Office Solution In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Dahua DH-AX15M AX1500 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi 6 Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of networking products at competitive prices. Order online or visit your nearest International Office Solution outlet to get the best deal. The Dahua AX15M comes with a 2-year replacement warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>2.4 GHz: 300 Mbps<br>5 GHz: 1201 Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2.4 GHz: 5dBi (±0.5)<br>5 GHz: 5dBi (±0.5)</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1 × Reset/WPS button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>Dual Band (2.4 GHz and 5 GHz)</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>2.4 GHz: 802.11 b/g/n<br>5 GHz: 802.11 a/n/a/ac/ax</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA-PSK<br>WPA2-PSK<br>WPA3-AES<br>WPA/WPA2-PSK<br>WPA2-PSK/WPA3-AES</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>1 × 10/100/1000Mbps WAN<br>2 × 10/100/1000Mbps LAN</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>6th Gen Wireless Technology<br>Beamforming for better Coverage<br>OFDMA and 1024-QAM<br>Bi-directional MU-MIMO<br>Guest Wi-Fi<br>Parental Control</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>12 VDC,1 A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>215 mm × 119 mm × 173 mm (8.46\" × 4.67\" × 6.81\")(L × W × H)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>0.26 kg (0.57 lb)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>2 Years Replacement warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'WiFi 6 Router', 2900.00, 3000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/SD3siQlNuAy44cxFcZpG07nZhJIVVFaYgngvmY6I.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-29 16:19:48', '2026-05-29 16:19:48', 'Dahua DH-AX15M AX1500 WiFi 6 Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy Dahua DH-AX15M AX1500 Dual Band WiFi 6 Router from International Office Solution in Bangladesh. Features WiFi 6 speed up to 1500 Mbps, Gigabit ports, WPA3 security, OFDMA, and MU-MIMO.', 'Dahua AX15M, AX1500 WiFi 6 router, Dahua WiFi router Bangladesh, Gigabit WiFi 6 router, dual band router, OFDMA MU-MIMO router, WPA3 router, home router Bangladesh, smart router Dahua, International Office Solution', NULL, 46, NULL, NULL),
(250, 'Dahua DH-AX30 AX3000 Dual Band Gigabit Wi-Fi 6 Router', 'The Dahua AX30 AX3000 Wi-Fi 6 Router delivers up to 3000 Mbps speed, Gigabit ports, OFDMA, MU-MIMO, WPA3 security, and strong multi-device performance for home and office use.', 'dahua-dh-ax30-ax3000-dual-band-gigabit-wi-fi-6-router-1780071810', '<p>The Dahua DH-AX30 AX3000 Dual Band Gigabit Wi-Fi 6 Router is a powerful next-generation networking solution designed to deliver ultra-fast, stable, and efficient internet connectivity for modern homes, offices, and smart environments. Built with Wi-Fi 6 (IEEE 802.11ax) technology, it provides improved speed, reduced latency, and enhanced capacity for multiple connected devices.</p><p>With a combined wireless speed of up to 3000 Mbps, the router delivers 574 Mbps on the 2.4 GHz band and 2402 Mbps on the 5 GHz band. This makes it highly suitable for bandwidth-intensive tasks such as 4K/8K streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, cloud applications, and smart home device management.</p><p>The Dahua AX30 features advanced dual-band support with IEEE 802.11 b/g/n/ax on 2.4 GHz and IEEE 802.11 a/b/g/n/ac/ax on 5 GHz, ensuring compatibility with both legacy and modern devices. It operates across a wide frequency range from 2.412 GHz to 5.835 GHz and supports flexible channel bandwidths of 20/40/80/160 MHz for optimized performance.</p><p>For wired connectivity, the router is equipped with 1 × Gigabit WAN port and 3 × Gigabit LAN ports, enabling high-speed and stable wired connections for gaming consoles, PCs, smart TVs, and NAS devices.</p><p>The router uses 256MB memory to ensure smooth multitasking and stable network performance under heavy loads. It also supports up to 128 simultaneous wireless devices, making it ideal for smart homes and busy office environments.</p><p>Advanced wireless technologies such as OFDMA and 2×2 MU-MIMO improve efficiency, reduce network congestion, and ensure smooth communication between multiple devices. Four high-gain 5 dBi antennas provide strong signal coverage and improved range across different environments.</p><p>For security, the Dahua AX30 supports WPA, WPA2, and WPA3 encryption protocols, ensuring secure wireless communication and protection against unauthorized access. Additional features include parental controls, guest network support, and robust firewall protection.</p><p>The router offers multiple operating modes, including Router Mode and Repeater Mode, allowing flexible deployment based on user needs. Network management is simplified through a user-friendly web interface and WiLynk mobile app, which also supports firmware updates and remote configuration.</p><p>Additional networking features include DHCP, NAT, QoS, and DDNS, allowing efficient traffic management and customization. The device includes essential physical controls such as a reset button, WPS button, and power indicator.</p><p>With low power consumption (under 18W), compact design, and reliable performance, the Dahua DH-AX30 is built for efficiency and long-term durability. It also includes lightning and static protection for added hardware safety.</p><p>Overall, the Dahua AX30 AX3000 Wi-Fi 6 Router is a future-ready networking solution that combines high speed, wide coverage, strong security, and advanced Wi-Fi 6 technology.</p><p>Buy Dahua DH-AX30 AX3000 Dual Band Gigabit Wi-Fi 6 Router from International Office Solution In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Dahua DH-AX30 AX3000 Dual Band Gigabit Wi-Fi 6 Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of networking products at competitive prices. Order online or visit your nearest International Office Solution outlet to get the best deal. The Dahua AX30 comes with a 2-year replacement warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>2.4 GHz: 574 Mbps<br>5 GHz: 2402 Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2.4 GHz: 5dBi (±0.5)<br>5 GHz: 5dBi (±0.5)</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1 × Reset/WPS button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.412GHz – 2.472 GHz<br>5.170GHz – 5.330 GHz<br>5.735GHz – 5.835 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>2.4 GHz: 802.11 b/g/n/ax<br>5 GHz: 802.11 a/b/g/n/ac/ax</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA-PSK; WPA2-PSK; WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK; WPA3-PSK; WPA2-PSK/WPA3-PSK</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>1×10/100/1000 Mbps(WAN)<br>3×10/100/1000 Mbps(LAN)</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>6th Gen Wireless Technology<br>Beamforming for better Coverage<br>OFDMA and 1024-QAM<br>Bi-directional MU-MIMO<br>Guest Wi-Fi<br>Parental Control</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>12 VDC,1.5 A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>262.2 mm × 150.1 mm × 184.5 mm(L × W × H)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>0.36 kg (0.79 lb)</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>2 Year Replacement warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band Gigabit Wi-Fi 6', 3790.00, 3890.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/XWXcl2KqvH8BVnnbJisKrBoED90xMe3hOVrhQz2Z.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-29 16:23:30', '2026-05-29 16:23:30', 'Dahua DH-AX30 AX3000 Wi-Fi 6 Router | International Office Solution', 'Buy Dahua DH-AX30 AX3000 Dual Band Wi-Fi 6 Router from International Office Solution in Bangladesh. Features 3000 Mbps speed, Gigabit ports, OFDMA, MU-MIMO, WPA3 security, and strong coverage.', 'Dahua AX30, AX3000 WiFi 6 router, Dahua Gigabit router Bangladesh, dual band WiFi router, OFDMA MU-MIMO router, WPA3 router, high speed router Bangladesh, smart home router, gaming router, International Office Solution', NULL, 46, NULL, NULL),
(251, 'Hikvision DS-3WR12C AC1200 1200Mbps Dual Band WiFi Router', 'The Hikvision DS-3WR12C AC1200 Router delivers up to 1200 Mbps speed, dual-band connectivity, MU-MIMO, beamforming, 4 antennas, and multiple operating modes for stable home and office networking.', 'hikvision-ds-3wr12c-ac1200-1200mbps-dual-band-wifi-router-1780071990', '<p>Hikvision DS-3WR12C AC1200 Dual Band WiFi Router</p><p>The Hikvision DS-3WR12C AC1200 Dual Band WiFi Router is a reliable and high-performance networking solution designed for homes and small office environments. It delivers stable wireless connectivity, strong coverage, and smooth performance for everyday internet activities such as streaming, gaming, video calls, and browsing.</p><p>This router supports dual-band WiFi with a combined speed of up to 1200 Mbps—offering 300 Mbps on the 2.4 GHz band and 867 Mbps on the 5 GHz band. The intelligent dual-band switching ensures optimal performance by automatically selecting the most efficient frequency for connected devices.</p><p>Equipped with four high-gain 5 dBi antennas, the Hikvision DS-3WR12C enhances signal strength and coverage across larger areas. Beamforming technology further improves performance by directing WiFi signals toward connected devices, reducing dead zones and improving overall stability.</p><p>The router supports IEEE 802.11 b/g/n standards on 2.4 GHz and IEEE 802.11 a/n/ac Wave 2 standards on 5 GHz, ensuring broad compatibility with modern and legacy wireless devices. Its 4×4 MU-MIMO technology allows multiple devices to communicate simultaneously, improving network efficiency and reducing congestion in multi-device environments.</p><p>For wired connectivity, the device includes 1 × 10/100 Mbps WAN port and 3 × 10/100 Mbps LAN ports, providing stable connections for desktops, smart TVs, and other wired devices.</p><p>The Hikvision DS-3WR12C operates across multiple frequency ranges, including 2.4 GHz (2412–2472 MHz) and 5 GHz (5180–5240 MHz and 5740–5805 MHz), with optimized transmission power for stable wireless communication. It is powered by a 9V DC, 1A adapter ensuring consistent performance.</p><p>This router supports multiple operating modes including Wireless Router Mode, Access Point (AP) Mode, Repeater Mode, WISP Mode, and Client + AP Mode, making it highly flexible for different networking scenarios.</p><p>Advanced network features include DHCP server, guest network support, WiFi scheduling, and signal adjustment options. Security is ensured through WPA-PSK, WPA2-PSK, WPA, and WPA2 encryption protocols, protecting the network from unauthorized access.</p><p>With its strong performance, flexible operating modes, and enhanced wireless technologies, the Hikvision DS-3WR12C AC1200 Router is a practical choice for users seeking stable and secure internet connectivity.</p><p>Buy Hikvision DS-3WR12C AC1200 Dual Band WiFi Router from International Office Solution In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Hikvision DS-3WR12C AC1200 Dual Band WiFi Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of networking products at competitive prices. Order online or visit your nearest International Office Solution outlet to get the best deal. The Hikvision DS-3WR12C comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>≤ 1167 Mbps<br>2.4 GHz: 300 Mbps<br>5 GHz: 867 Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4 high gain antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>Dual Band (5 GHz &amp; 2.4 GHz)</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>4 × 4 MU-MIMO supported<br>Beamforming supported</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11/a/n/ac wave 2 @5GHz<br>IEEE 802.11b/g/n @2.4GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA-PSK, WPA2-PSK, WPA and WPA2 supported</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>1*10/100Mbps WAN port<br>3*10/100Mbps LAN ports</td></tr><tr>