(252, 'Hikvision DS-3WR15X 1500Mbps Dual Band WiFi 6 Router', 'The Hikvision DS-3WR15X WiFi 6 Router delivers up to 1500 Mbps speed, Gigabit ports, MU-MIMO, beamforming, WPA3 security, and stable dual-band performance for home and office use.', 'hikvision-ds-3wr15x-1500mbps-dual-band-wifi-6-router-1780072200', '<p>Hikvision DS-3WR15X 1500Mbps Dual Band WiFi 6 Router</p><p>The Hikvision DS-3WR15X 1500Mbps Dual Band WiFi 6 Router is a modern high-performance networking device designed to deliver fast, stable, and efficient wireless connectivity for homes, offices, and smart environments. Powered by WiFi 6 (IEEE 802.11ax) technology, it provides improved speed, lower latency, and better multi-device handling compared to traditional WiFi routers.</p><p>With a total wireless speed of up to 1500 Mbps, the router delivers 1201 Mbps on the 5 GHz band and 300 Mbps on the 2.4 GHz band. This ensures smooth performance for bandwidth-intensive tasks such as 4K streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, and smart device connectivity.</p><p>The dual-band system supports intelligent band prioritization, automatically assigning devices to the optimal frequency for maximum efficiency and stability. The 5 GHz band is optimized for high-speed applications, while the 2.4 GHz band provides wider coverage for general usage.</p><p>Equipped with WiFi 6 enhancements, the Hikvision DS-3WR15X supports IEEE 802.11 b/g/n on 2.4 GHz and IEEE 802.11 a/n/ac/ax on 5 GHz, ensuring compatibility with both legacy and modern devices. Advanced technologies such as MU-MIMO and Tx Beamforming allow multiple devices to connect simultaneously while maintaining strong signal quality and reduced interference.</p><p>For wired connectivity, the router includes 1 × Gigabit WAN port and 3 × Gigabit LAN ports (10/100/1000 Mbps adaptive), providing stable high-speed wired connections for desktops, gaming consoles, and smart TVs.</p><p>The router is powered by a DC 12V/1A adapter and includes a reset button for easy troubleshooting and maintenance. Its four high-gain antennas ensure wide coverage and strong signal penetration across walls and obstacles.</p><p>The Hikvision DS-3WR15X offers multiple network modes including Router Mode, Wireless Relay Mode, and Wired Bridge Mode, making it flexible for various installation scenarios. It also includes a built-in DHCP server, guest network support, WiFi scheduling, and signal adjustment features for better control and customization.</p><p>Security is strengthened with WPA2-PSK, WPA/WPA2-PSK, and WPA3-SAE encryption, along with firewall protection, WPS support, network name hiding, and device access control. These features help ensure a secure and reliable networking environment.</p><p>Overall, the Hikvision DS-3WR15X WiFi 6 Router is a powerful, secure, and future-ready solution designed for users who need fast speeds, stable connections, and advanced wireless performance.</p><p>Buy Hikvision DS-3WR15X WiFi 6 Router from International Office Solution In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Hikvision DS-3WR15X 1500Mbps Dual Band WiFi 6 Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of networking products at competitive prices. Order online or visit your nearest International Office Solution outlet to get the best deal. The Hikvision DS-3WR15X comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>≤ 1501 Mbps<br>5GHz: 1201Mbps<br>2.4GHz: 300Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4 high gain antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Reset Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>Dual Band (5 GHz &amp; 2.4 GHz)</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>MU-MIMO supported<br>TxBeamforming supported</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11a/n/ac/ax @5GHz<br>IEEE 802.11b/g/n @2.4GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA2-PSK,WPA/WPA2-PSK,WPA2-PSK/WPA3-SAE supported</td></tr><