(253, 'Netis N6 AX1800 Dual Band Gigabit Wi-Fi 6 Router', 'The Netis N6 AX1800 Dual Band Gigabit Wi-Fi 6 Router delivers next-generation wireless performance with combined speeds of up to 1800Mbps. Featuring Wi-Fi 6 technology, dual-band connectivity, four high-gain antennas, Gigabit Ethernet ports, and multiple operating modes, it provides fast, stable, and secure internet access for homes and offices. Available at International Office Solution.', 'netis-n6-ax1800-dual-band-gigabit-wi-fi-6-router-1780116117', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Netis N6 AX1800 Dual Band Gigabit Wi-Fi 6 Router is a powerful networking solution designed to meet the growing demands of modern homes and businesses. Powered by the latest Wi-Fi 6 (802.11ax) technology, this router delivers enhanced speed, greater network efficiency, lower latency, and improved connectivity for multiple devices simultaneously.</p><p>With a combined wireless speed of up to 1800Mbps, the Netis N6 provides 574Mbps on the 2.4GHz band and 1201Mbps on the 5GHz band. This dual-band architecture ensures seamless online gaming, 4K video streaming, video conferencing, cloud applications, and high-speed downloads without interruptions. Whether you\'re working remotely, attending online classes, or enjoying entertainment, the Netis N6 delivers reliable and responsive performance.</p><p>The router is equipped with four powerful 5dBi high-gain external antennas that significantly improve signal strength and coverage. These antennas help eliminate dead zones and provide stable wireless connectivity across large homes, apartments, and office environments. The advanced Wi-Fi 6 technology further enhances coverage and allows more connected devices to operate efficiently at the same time.</p><p>For wired networking, the Netis N6 features five Gigabit Ethernet ports, including one WAN port and multiple LAN ports. These ports support ultra-fast 10/100/1000Mbps data transmission, enabling high-speed connections for desktop PCs, gaming consoles, smart TVs, network storage devices, printers, and other wired equipment. Gigabit connectivity delivers up to ten times faster performance compared to traditional Fast Ethernet connections.</p><p>The router supports multiple operating modes, including Router Mode, Access Point (AP) Mode, Repeater Mode, and Client Mode. This flexibility allows users to configure the device according to their network requirements, whether creating a new wireless network, extending existing coverage, or connecting wired devices wirelessly.</p><p>Security is another key strength of the Netis N6. It incorporates advanced access control features such as IP Filtering, MAC Filtering, and Domain Filtering, helping users manage internet access effectively. The built-in WPS button enables quick and secure wireless connections with compatible devices, while intelligent bandwidth control ensures fair bandwidth distribution among connected users for a smoother network experience.</p><p>Managing the router is simple thanks to its user-friendly web interface and multilingual setup wizard. Even first-time users can quickly configure and optimize their network settings without technical expertise.</p><p>Whether you need a reliable router for gaming, streaming, remote work, smart home devices, or business applications, the Netis N6 AX1800 Dual Band Gigabit Wi-Fi 6 Router offers excellent performance, strong coverage, enhanced security, and versatile networking capabilities. International Office Solution proudly offers this high-performance networking device with a 1-Year Warranty for complete peace of mind.</p><p><strong>Why Buy from International Office Solution?</strong></p><p>International Office Solution offers genuine networking products, competitive pricing, reliable customer support, and warranty-backed services. Get the Netis N6 AX1800 Dual Band Gigabit Wi-Fi 6 Router from International Office Solution and enjoy fast, secure, and uninterrupted connectivity for your home or office.</p>', '<p>