n antennas, advanced security, and multiple operating modes for home and office networking.', 'Netis N6, Netis N6 AX1800, WiFi 6 Router Bangladesh, Gigabit Router, Dual Band Router, Netis Router Price, AX1800 Router, Wireless Router, Home WiFi Router, Office Network Router, International Office Solution, Netis N6 Price Bangladesh', NULL, 220, NULL, NULL),
(254, 'Netis N3 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi Router', 'The Netis N3 AC1200 Wireless Dual Band Gigabit Router is a high-performance networking solution designed for modern homes and offices. Featuring dual-band Wi-Fi speeds up to 1200Mbps, Gigabit Ethernet ports, four high-gain antennas, multiple operating modes, and advanced security features, it ensures stable and reliable internet connectivity for all your devices.', 'netis-n3-ac1200-dual-band-gigabit-wifi-router-1780116381', '<p>Netis N3 AC1200 Wireless Dual Band Gigabit Router</p><p>The Netis N3 AC1200 Wireless Dual Band Gigabit Router is designed to provide fast, stable, and secure wireless connectivity for homes, apartments, and small office environments. Combining advanced dual-band technology with Gigabit networking capabilities, this router delivers smooth online experiences for streaming, gaming, video conferencing, and everyday internet usage.</p><p>Featuring simultaneous dual-band wireless connectivity, the Netis N3 offers speeds of up to 300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band and 867Mbps on the 5GHz band, providing a combined wireless performance of up to 1200Mbps. The 2.4GHz band is ideal for everyday browsing and smart home devices, while the 5GHz band delivers faster speeds and lower interference for bandwidth-intensive applications such as HD video streaming, online gaming, and large file downloads.</p><p>The router is compatible with all major IEEE 802.11a/b/g/n/ac wireless standards, ensuring seamless connectivity with a wide range of wireless devices, including laptops, smartphones, tablets, smart TVs, gaming consoles, and IoT devices.</p><p>Equipped with four powerful 5dBi high-gain external antennas, the Netis N3 provides enhanced signal strength and wider wireless coverage. These antennas help reduce dead zones and maintain stable connections throughout larger homes and office spaces, ensuring consistent internet access in every corner.</p><p>The Netis N3 supports a variety of WAN connection types in AP Router Mode, including DHCP, Static IP, PPPoE, L2TP, PPTP, Dual Access, and WISP. This extensive compatibility makes it suitable for different internet service providers and network environments.</p><p>For greater flexibility, the router supports multiple operating modes, including Router Mode, Access Point (AP) Mode, Repeater Mode, and Client Mode. Whether you need to establish a new network, extend wireless coverage, or connect wired devices wirelessly, the Netis N3 adapts to your networking needs.</p><p>The Multi-SSID feature allows users to create up to six additional wireless networks for guests, visitors, or specific devices. This helps improve network organization, security, and bandwidth management while keeping the primary network separate from guest access.</p><p>Security is enhanced through comprehensive Internet Access Control features, including IP Filtering, MAC Filtering, and Domain Filtering based on time schedules. These controls allow administrators and parents to manage internet usage effectively and maintain a safer online environment.</p><p>The built-in WPS button enables quick and secure wireless connections without requiring complex password configurations. Intelligent Bandwidth Control ensures fair bandwidth allocation among connected devices, preventing network congestion and delivering a smoother browsing experience.</p><p>The router also comes with full Gigabit Ethernet ports, enabling ultra-fast wired connections for desktop computers, NAS devices, gaming consoles, printers, and smart TVs. Gigabit networking ensures faster data transfers and more reliable performance compared to traditional Fast Ethernet connections.</p><p>With its intuitive multilingual management interface and quick setup wizard, the Netis N3 makes network installation and management simple for both beginners and experienced users.</p><p>Whether for home entertainment, online learning, remote work, or small business networking, the Netis N3 AC1200 Wireless Dual Band Gigabit Router delivers dependable performance, broad coverage, advanced security, and exceptional value.</p><h3><strong>Buy Netis N3 AC1200 Wireless Dual Band Gigabit Router from International Office Solution</strong></h3><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Netis N3 AC1200 Wireless Dual Band Gigabit Router from International Office Solution. We offer a wide range of genuine Netis networking products at competitive prices. Order online or contact International Office Solution to get the best deal on your networking solution. The Netis N3 AC1200 Wireless Dual Band Gigabit Router comes with a 1-Year Warranty for complete peace of mind.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>802.11ac:<br>80MHZ(433Mbps, 867Mbps)<br>802.11n: 40MHz(300Mbps, 270Mbps, 240Mbps, 180Mbps, 120Mbps, 90Mbps, 60Mbps, 30Mbps)<br>20MHz (144Mbps, 130Mbps, 115Mbps, 86Mbps, 57Mbps, 43Mbps, 28Mbps, 14Mbps) (Auto-Sense)<br>802.11g:<br>(54Mbps, 48Mbps, 36Mbps, 24Mbps, 18Mbps, 12Mbps, 11Mbps, 9Mbps, 6Mbps)<br>802.11b:<br>(11Mbps,9Mbps, 6Mbps, 5.5Mbps, 2Mbps, 1Mbps)</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4 x external fixed 5dBi antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Reset</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4-2.4835GHz;5.180-5.825GHZ</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>AP, Repeater, Client, Multi-SSID</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1*10/100/1000Mbps Auto MDI/MDIX RJ45 WAN port<br>3*10/100/1000Mbps Auto MDI/MDIX RJ45 LAN port</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11b/g/n 2.4GHz<br>IEEE 802.11a/n/ac 5GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WEP/WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK Encryption<br>Wireless MAC Filtering</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Power Supply: DC 12V/1.5A(Output)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>182 x 108 x 25mm</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band Gigabit', 3730.00, 3730.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/VScVrixlSdNYNgusGQ7RJBfCP8lpmSF7M5PCzH6j.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-30 04:46:21', '2026-05-30 04:46:21', 'Netis N3 AC1200 Wireless Dual Band Gigabit Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Netis N3 AC1200 Wireless Dual Band Gigabit Router from International Office Solution. Enjoy dual-band Wi-Fi speeds up to 1200Mbps, Gigabit ports, four high-gain antennas, advanced security features, and seamless connectivity for home and office use.', 'Netis N3, Netis N3 AC1200, Netis Router Bangladesh, AC1200 Router, Dual Band Router, Gigabit Router, Wireless Router, Netis N3 Price Bangladesh, Home WiFi Router, Office Router, International Office Solution, Netis AC1200 Router', NULL, 220, NULL, NULL),
(255, 'Netis N2 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi Router', 'The Netis N2 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Router is a high-speed networking solution designed for modern homes and offices. Featuring dual-band wireless connectivity, full Gigabit Ethernet ports, four high-gain antennas, and multiple operating modes, it provides seamless internet access for streaming, gaming, video conferencing, and everyday online activities.', 'netis-n2-ac1200-dual-band-gigabit-wifi-router-1780116602', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Netis N2 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Router combines advanced wireless technology, powerful coverage, and high-speed wired connectivity to deliver a superior networking experience. Built on next-generation IEEE 802.11ac Wi-Fi technology, the router offers fast and reliable internet access for homes, apartments, and small office environments.</p><p>With simultaneous dual-band operation, the Netis N2 delivers wireless speeds of up to 300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band and up to 867Mbps on the 5GHz band, providing a combined wireless speed of up to 1200Mbps. This allows users to enjoy smoother HD video streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, cloud applications, and large file downloads with minimal lag and interference.</p><p>Powered by 802.11ac technology, the Netis N2 offers wireless performance up to three times faster than traditional 802.11n routers. The dual-band design helps optimize network traffic by allowing routine activities such as web browsing, emailing, and file sharing on the 2.4GHz band, while bandwidth-intensive applications such as online gaming, HD media streaming, and VoIP calls benefit from the faster and less congested 5GHz band.</p><p>The router is equipped with four high-performance 5dBi external antennas, including dedicated antennas for both 2.4GHz and 5GHz frequencies. These high-gain antennas enhance wireless coverage, improve signal strength, and minimize dead zones, ensuring stable connectivity throughout larger homes and office spaces.</p><p>For users who require fast wired networking, the Netis N2 features five Gigabit Ethernet ports supporting speeds of up to 1000Mbps. These ports provide ultra-fast and stable connections for desktop computers, gaming consoles, smart TVs, printers, network storage devices, and other wired equipment. Gigabit Ethernet delivers up to ten times the speed of conventional Fast Ethernet connections, making it ideal for demanding network applications.</p><p>The Netis N2 offers flexible deployment options through multiple operating modes, including Router Mode, Access Point (AP) Mode, Repeater Mode, and Client Mode. Whether creating a new wireless network, extending an existing network\'s coverage, or connecting wired devices to a wireless network, the router adapts easily to different networking requirements.</p><p>Network management is made simple through an intuitive web-based management interface that allows users to configure settings quickly and efficiently. The router also supports advanced security features to help protect your network and connected devices from unauthorized access.</p><p>Whether you need dependable internet for work, study, entertainment, or business operations, the Netis N2 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Router delivers excellent wireless performance, broad coverage, and reliable connectivity for all your networking needs.<strong>Buy Netis N2 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Router from International Office Solution</strong></p><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Netis N2 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Router from International Office Solution. We offer genuine networking products with competitive pricing, professional support, and reliable warranty service. Whether for home or office use, the Netis N2 provides the speed, coverage, and stability needed for today\'s connected world.</p><h3><strong>Warranty</strong></h3><p><strong>1 Year Official Warranty</strong> provided by International Office Solution.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>Data Transfer Rate (Wifi): 1200 Mbps<br>Data Transfer Rate (Lan): 1000 Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4 x external fixed 5dBi antenna<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Default, WPS<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4-2.4835GHz;<br>5.180-5.825GHZ<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Wireless Modes: AP, Repeater, Client, Multi-SSID<br>Wireless Security: WEP/WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK Encryption<br>Wireless MAC Filtering</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1 x 10/100/1000Mbps Auto MDI/MDIX RJ45 WAN port<br>4 x 10/100/1000Mbps Auto MDI/MDIX RJ45 LAN port<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>WiFi Network Standards: IEEE 802.11b,g,n, IEEE 802.11a,n,ac, IEEE 802.3,3u,3ab<br>LAN Network Standard: 10/100/1000</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WEP/WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK Encryption<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>Number of WAN Port: 1<br>Number of Lan Port: 4</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Operating Temperature: 0℃~40℃<br>Storage Temperature: -40℃~70℃<br>Operating Humidity: 10%~90% non-condensing<br>Storage Humidity: 5%~90% non-condensing<br>Standards: IEEE 802.3 10Base-T, IEEE 802.3u 100Base-TX, IEEE 802.3ab 1000Base-T<br>LED Indicators: SYS, WPS, 5G, 2.4G, WAN, LAN1~LAN4</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Transmit Power: 20dBm(MAX)<br>Power Supply: DC 12V/1.0A(Output)<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>(L x W x H ): 212 x 145 x 40 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>1.70 lbs</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01 year warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band Gigabit', 3400.00, 3400.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/cYMwDe0gGcsI4bHRgch3aGnTFYW0YNaEALx21ev4.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0,