(256, 'Netis N3D AC1200 Dual Band WiFi Router', 'The Netis N3D AC1200 Wireless Dual Band Router is a high-performance networking solution designed to deliver fast, stable, and secure internet connectivity. Featuring dual-band wireless speeds up to 1200Mbps, Gigabit Ethernet ports, four high-gain antennas, Multi-SSID support, and advanced security features, it is ideal for homes, apartments, and small offices.', 'netis-n3d-ac1200-dual-band-wifi-router-1780116821', '<p><strong>Netis N3D AC1200 Wireless Dual Band Router</strong></p><p>The Netis N3D AC1200 Wireless Dual Band Router is engineered to provide reliable, high-speed wireless networking for modern households and office environments. Powered by advanced IEEE 802.11ac Wi-Fi technology, the router delivers enhanced performance, broader coverage, and greater network efficiency, making it an ideal solution for streaming, gaming, video conferencing, online learning, and everyday internet use.</p><p>With simultaneous dual-band connectivity, the Netis N3D offers wireless speeds of up to 300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band and up to 867Mbps on the 5GHz band, delivering a combined wireless speed of up to 1200Mbps. The 2.4GHz band provides stable connectivity for routine tasks such as web browsing, emailing, and social media, while the high-speed 5GHz band is optimized for bandwidth-intensive activities including HD video streaming, online gaming, VoIP calls, and large file transfers.</p><p>The router is fully compatible with IEEE 802.11a/b/g/n/ac wireless standards, ensuring seamless connectivity with a wide range of devices such as laptops, smartphones, tablets, smart TVs, gaming consoles, IP cameras, and other smart home products.</p><p>Equipped with four powerful 5dBi high-gain external antennas, the Netis N3D significantly improves wireless signal strength and coverage. These antennas help eliminate dead zones and provide stable wireless connectivity throughout larger homes and office spaces, ensuring a strong and reliable network experience.</p><p>The Netis N3D supports a variety of WAN connection types in AP Router mode, including DHCP, Static IP, PPPoE, L2TP, PPTP, and Dual Access (Russia PPPoE/PPTP/L2TP). This extensive compatibility allows the router to work efficiently with different internet service providers and network infrastructures.</p><p>For flexible network deployment, the router supports multiple operating modes including Router Mode, Access Point (AP) Mode, and Client Mode. These options allow users to build a new wireless network, extend an existing one, or connect wired devices to a wireless network based on their specific requirements.</p><p>The Multi-SSID feature enables users to create up to six additional wireless networks for guests, visitors, employees, or specific devices. This functionality improves network organization, enhances security, and allows better management of bandwidth resources without compromising the primary network.</p><p>For wired connectivity, the Netis N3D is equipped with five Gigabit Ethernet ports supporting speeds up to 1000Mbps. These ports provide ultra-fast and reliable wired connections for desktop computers, gaming consoles, network-attached storage (NAS), printers, and smart TVs. Gigabit networking delivers significantly faster data transfer rates compared to conventional Fast Ethernet solutions.</p><p>Security and network management are enhanced through features such as WPS one-touch wireless setup, intelligent bandwidth control, and advanced Internet Access Control. Users can manage network access using IP Filtering, MAC Filtering, and Domain Filtering based on time schedules, helping create a safer and more controlled online environment.</p><p>The built-in multilingual management interface and quick setup wizard simplify installation and configuration, making the router easy to use for both beginners and experienced network administrators.</p><p>Whether you need dependable connectivity for home entertainment, remote work, online education, or small business operations, the Netis N3D AC1200 Wireless Dual Band Router delivers excellent speed, strong coverage, flexible deployment options, and robust security features</p><p>.<strong>Buy Netis N3D AC1200 Wireless Dual Band Router from International Office Solution</strong></p><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Netis N3D AC1200 Wireless Dual Band Router from International Office Solution. We provide genuine networking products, competitive pricing, reliable customer service, and warranty-backed support. Order today and experience fast, secure, and uninterrupted wireless connectivity for your home or office.</p><h3><strong>Warranty</strong></h3><p><strong>1 Year Official Warranty</strong> from International Office Solution.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>802.11ac:80MHZ(433Mbps, 867Mbps)<br>802.11n: 40MHz(300Mbps, 270Mbps, 240Mbps, 180Mbps, 120Mbps, 90Mbps, 60Mbps, 30Mbps)<br>20MHz (144Mbps, 130Mbps, 115Mbps, 86Mbps, 57Mbps, 43Mbps, 28Mbps, 14Mbps) (Auto- Sense)<br>802.11g:(54Mbps, 48Mbps, 36Mbps, 24Mbps, 18Mbps, 12Mbps, 11Mbps, 9Mbps, 6Mbps)<br>802.11b:(11Mbps,9Mbps, 6Mbps, 5.5Mbps, 2Mbps, 1Mbps)</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4 x external fixed 5dBi antenna<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Default, WPS<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4-2.4835GHz<br>5.180-5.825GHZ<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Wireless Modes: AP, Client, Multi-SSID<br>Wireless Security: WEP/WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK Encryption<br>Wireless MAC Filtering</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1x 10/100Mbps Auto MDI/MDIX RJ45 WAN port<br>3x 10/100Mbps Auto MDI/MDIX RJ45 LAN port</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>WiFi Network Standards: IEEE 802.11b,g,n, IEEE 802.11a,n,ac, IEEE 802.3,3u,3ab<br>LAN Network Standard: 10/100/1000</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WEP/WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK Encryption<br>Wireless MAC Filtering<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>Number of WAN Port: 1<br>Number of Lan Port: 3</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Operating Temperature: 0℃~40℃<br>Storage Temperature: -40℃~70℃<br>Operating Humidity: 10%~90% non-condensing<br>Storage Humidity: 5%~90% non-condensing<br>Standards: IEEE 802.3 10Base-T, IEEE 802.3u 100Base-TX, IEEE 802.3ab 1000Base-T<br>LED Indicators: SYS, WPS, 5G, 2.4G, WAN, LAN1~LAN4</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Transmit Power: 20dBm(MAX)<br>Power Supply: DC 12V/1.0A(Output)<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>(L x W x H ): 212 x 145 x 40 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>1.70 lbs</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01 year warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band', 2650.00, 2650.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/zfWxUaGgvcXIq09id5yIWBoWCmmqbDzbMHN80G7o.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-30 04:53:41', '2026-05-30 04:53:41', 'Netis N3D AC1200 Wireless Dual Band Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Netis N3D AC1200 Wireless Dual Band Router from International Office Solution. Enjoy dual-band Wi-Fi speeds up to 1200Mbps, Gigabit Ethernet ports, four high-gain antennas, Multi-SSID support, advanced security features, and reliable coverage for home and office networking.', 'Netis N3D, Netis N3D AC1200, Netis Router Bangladesh, AC1200 Wireless Router, Dual Band Router, Gigabit Router, Netis N3D Price Bangladesh, Home WiFi Router, Office Router, Wireless Networking, International Office Solution, Netis AC1200 Router', NULL, 220, NULL, NULL),
(257, 'Netis N5 AC1200 Dual Band WiFi Router', 'The Netis N5 AC1200 Wireless Dual Band Router offers dual-band Wi-Fi speeds of up to 1200Mbps, with 300Mbps on 2.4GHz and 867Mbps on 5GHz. Featuring four 5dBi high-gain antennas, multiple SSID support, advanced security controls, intelligent bandwidth management, and a USB 2.0 port, it provides stable, secure, and high-speed wireless connectivity for homes and small offices.', 'netis-n5-ac1200-dual-band-wifi-router-1780117431', '<p><strong>Netis N5 AC1200 Wireless Dual Band Router</strong></p><p>The <strong>Netis N5 AC1200 Wireless Dual Band Router</strong> is a reliable and high-performance networking solution designed to meet the internet demands of modern homes and small offices. Featuring advanced <strong>IEEE 802.11ac Wi-Fi technology</strong>, the router delivers combined wireless speeds of up to <strong>1200Mbps</strong>, offering <strong>300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band</strong> and <strong>867Mbps on the 5GHz band</strong>. This dual-band capability ensures smooth online gaming, HD video streaming, video conferencing, web browsing, and fast file transfers without interruption.</p><p>The Netis N5 supports multiple wireless standards, including <strong>802.11a/b/g/n/ac</strong>, ensuring compatibility with a wide range of Wi-Fi-enabled devices such as smartphones, laptops, tablets, smart TVs, IP cameras, and gaming consoles. Equipped with <strong>four high-gain 5dBi external antennas</strong>, it provides enhanced wireless coverage and stable signal strength across multiple rooms, reducing dead zones and maintaining a strong connection throughout your home or workplace.</p><p>Designed for flexible network deployment, the router supports various WAN connection types, including <strong>DHCP, Static IP, PPPoE, L2TP, PPTP</strong>, and Dual Access modes. Users can easily create separate guest networks with support for multiple SSIDs, allowing visitors to access the internet without compromising the security of the primary network.</p><p>The Netis N5 also features intelligent bandwidth management, enabling fair distribution of network resources among connected devices. Advanced security functions such as <strong>WPA/WPA2 encryption</strong>, WPS quick setup, IP filtering, MAC filtering, domain filtering, and time-based access control help protect your network from unauthorized access and provide greater control over internet usage.</p><p>Additionally, the built-in <strong>USB 2.0 port</strong> allows users to share files, media, and storage devices conveniently across the network. The router\'s user-friendly, multilingual web management interface simplifies setup and network administration, making it suitable for both beginners and experienced users.</p><p>Whether you\'re streaming 4K content, working remotely, attending online classes, or connecting multiple smart devices, the Netis N5 AC1200 Wireless Dual Band Router delivers dependable performance, enhanced coverage, and secure connectivity for everyday networking needs.</p><p><strong>Buy Netis N5 AC1200 Wireless Dual Band Router from International Office Solution</strong></p><p>Purchase the original <strong>Netis N5 AC1200 Wireless Dual Band Router</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> at a competitive price in Bangladesh. We offer a wide range of genuine Netis networking products backed by reliable customer service and professional support. Order online or visit International Office Solution to get the best networking solutions for your home or office. The router comes with a <strong>1-year official warranty</strong> for complete peace of mind.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>802.11ac:80MHZ(433Mbps, 867Mbps)<br>802.11n: 40MHz(300Mbps, 270Mbps, 240Mbps, 180Mbps, 120Mbps, 90Mbps, 60Mbps, 30Mbps)<br>20MHz (144Mbps, 130Mbps, 115Mbps, 86Mbps, 57Mbps, 43Mbps, 28Mbps, 14Mbps) (Auto- Sense)<br>802.11g:(54Mbps, 48Mbps, 36Mbps, 24Mbps, 18Mbps, 12Mbps, 11Mbps, 9Mbps, 6Mbps)<br>802.11b:(11Mbps,9Mbps, 6Mbps, 5.5Mbps, 2Mbps, 1Mbps)</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4 x external fixed 5dBi antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS,Reset</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4-2.4835GHz;5.180-5.825GHZ</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>AP, ARP, Multi-SSID</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1x 10/100Mbps Auto MDI/MDIX RJ45 WAN port<br>2x 10/100Mbps Auto MDI/MDIX RJ45 LAN port</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11b/g/n 2.4GHz<br>IEEE 802.11a/n/ac 5GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WEP/WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK Encryption<br>Wireless MAC Filtering</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>Power Supply: DC 12V/1.5A(Output)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>118 x 86 x 22 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band', 2450.00, 2450.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/O7HtTSdPn2TJHZhDLsNWZ1w1UQ6gcLrSxZxaWMWK.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-30 05:03:51', '2026-05-30 05:03:51', 'Netis N5 AC1200 Wireless Dual Band Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Netis N5 AC1200 Wireless Dual Band Router from International Office Solution in Bangladesh. Enjoy dual-band Wi-Fi speeds up to 1200Mbps, four high-gain antennas, USB sharing, advanced security, and reliable coverage with a 1-year warranty.', 'Netis N5, Netis N5 AC1200, AC1200 Router, Dual Band Router, Netis Router, WiFi Router Bangladesh, Wireless Router, Netis N5 Price BD, Home Router, Office Router, 5GHz Router, 2.4GHz Router, Network Router, International Office Solution', NULL, 220, NULL, NULL),
(258, 'Netis W4 300Mbps WiFi Router', 'The Netis W4 300Mbps 4 Antenna Router White offers wireless speeds of up to 300Mbps and features four high-gain 5dBi antennas for enhanced coverage and stable connectivity. Ideal for web browsing, HD streaming, online classes, and everyday internet use, it delivers reliable performance for homes and small offices.', 'netis-w4-300mbps-wifi-router-1780117735', '<p><strong>Netis W4 300Mbps 4 Antenna Router</strong></p><p>The Netis W4 300Mbps 4 Antenna Router White is a reliable and affordable wireless networking solution designed for homes, apartments, and small offices. Built with advanced wireless technology, this router delivers stable internet connectivity with wireless speeds of up to <strong>300Mbps</strong>, making it ideal for everyday online activities such as web browsing, social media, video streaming, online classes, and internet calling.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>four high-gain 5dBi external antennas</strong>, the Netis W4 provides enhanced wireless coverage and improved signal stability throughout your home or workspace. The powerful antenna design helps minimize dead zones and ensures a strong Wi-Fi connection even in rooms farther away from the router.</p><p>The router supports multiple Wi-Fi-enabled devices simultaneously, including smartphones, laptops, tablets, smart TVs, IP cameras, and gaming consoles. Its efficient wireless performance allows users to enjoy smooth HD video streaming, fast downloads, and uninterrupted communication without compromising network stability.</p><p>Featuring an intuitive setup process and a user-friendly management interface, the Netis W4 can be configured quickly and easily. Advanced security features help protect your wireless network from unauthorized access, ensuring safe and secure internet usage for your family or business.</p><p>With its elegant white design, dependable performance, and wide wireless coverage, the Netis W4 300Mbps Router is an excellent choice for users seeking a cost-effective networking solution that delivers consistent and reliable Wi-Fi connectivity.</p><p><strong>Buy Netis W4 300Mbps 4 Antenna Router White from International Office Solution</strong></p><p>Get the original <strong>Netis W4 300Mbps 4 Antenna Router White</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> at the best price in Bangladesh. We offer genuine networking products with dependable after-sales support and competitive pricing. Order online or visit International Office Solution to upgrade your home or office network with reliable wireless connectivity.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>Up to 300Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4 * 5dBi Fixed Antenna</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS, Default</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4-2.4835GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>IEEE 802.11b, IEEE 802.11g, IEEE 802.11n</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1 * 10/100Mbps Auto MDI/MDIX RJ45 WAN port<br>2 * 10/100Mbps Auto MDI/MDIX RJ45 LAN port</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.3 10Base-T, IEEE 802.3u 100Base-TX</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>64/128-bit WEP,<br>WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK (TKIP/AES)<br>SSID Broadcast Enable/Disable<br>Wireless MAC Filtering</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>3x RJ45 Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>WAN Type: DHCP, Static IP, PPPoE, L2TP, PPTP, Dual Access, WISP<br>Port Forwarding: Virtual Servers, Port Triggering, UPnP, DMZ, FTP Private Port<br>QoS: WMM, Bandwidth Control<br>Access Control: IP/MAC/Domain Filtering<br>VPN Pass-through: PPTP, L2TP, IPSec<br>Others: IPTV, Dynamic DNS, Static Routing, WOL, Backup &amp; Restore, Firmware Upgrade</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>DC 9V/500mA (Output)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01 year warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', '300Mbps', 1560.00, 1570.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/0TzNXyo16HrjIz9MIkDn5tOZDKhX35SGNLcl8Kgb.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-30 05:08:55', '2026-05-30 05:08:55', 'Netis W4 300Mbps 4 Antenna Router White Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Netis W4 300Mbps 4 Antenna Router White from International Office Solution. Features four 5dBi high-gain antennas, wide wireless coverage, stable connectivity, and 300Mbps Wi-Fi speed for home and office use.', 'Netis W4, Netis W4 Router, Netis 300Mbps Router, Wireless Router Bangladesh, WiFi Router BD, 4 Antenna Router, Netis Router Price, Home WiFi Router, Office Router, Netis W4 Price BD, Networking Device, International Office Solution', NULL, 220, NULL, NULL),
(259, 'Netis Wf2419E 300Mbps Wireless N Router', 'The Netis WF2419E 300Mbps Wireless N Router offers stable 300Mbps Wi-Fi speed with two 5dBi high-gain antennas for improved coverage. Ideal for browsing, HD streaming, online classes, and everyday internet use in home and small office environments.', 'netis-wf2419e-300mbps-wireless-n-router-1780118118', '<p>Netis WF2419E 300Mbps Wireless N Router</p><p>The <strong>Netis WF2419E 300Mbps Wireless N Router</strong> is a cost-effective and reliable networking solution designed for home and small office use. It delivers wireless speeds of up to <strong>300Mbps</strong>, making it suitable for everyday internet activities such as web browsing, online learning, social media, HD video streaming, and internet calling.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>two high-gain 5dBi external antennas</strong>, the Netis WF2419E ensures improved wireless coverage and stronger signal penetration, helping reduce dead zones and maintain stable connectivity across different rooms. This allows users to enjoy smooth and uninterrupted internet access throughout their home or workspace.</p><p>The router supports multiple devices simultaneously, including smartphones, laptops, desktops, smart TVs, and wireless cameras. Its stable performance ensures efficient bandwidth distribution, making it a practical choice for families and small office environments.</p><p>With an easy setup process and user-friendly interface, the Netis WF2419E can be quickly configured even by non-technical users. It also includes essential security features to protect your network and maintain safe internet usage.</p><p>Compact in design and efficient in performance, the Netis WF2419E is an ideal solution for users seeking a budget-friendly router with dependable speed and wide coverage.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Buy Netis WF2419E Router from International Office Solution</strong></p><p>Purchase the original <strong>Netis WF2419E 300Mbps Wireless N Router</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> at the best price in Bangladesh. We provide authentic networking products with reliable service and customer support. Order online or visit International Office Solution to get a dependable Wi-Fi solution for your home or office. The router comes with a <strong>1-year warranty</strong>.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li>Model: WF2419E</li><li>Wireless Standard: IEEE 802.11b/g/n</li><li>Frequency: 2.4GHz</li><li>Wireless Speed: Up to 300Mbps</li><li>Antennas: 2 × 5dBi external antennas</li><li>Ports: 1 WAN + 3 LAN ports (Fast Ethernet)</li><li>Security: WPA/WPA2 encryption support</li><li>Operation Modes: Router / AP / Repeater (varies by firmware)</li></ul><p><br>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, 1400.00, 1400.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/G2WnJiBphMTX0EVyAxHmttNADcUokAbqtTVspuYD.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-30 05:15:18', '2026-05-30 05:15:18', 'Netis WF2419E 300Mbps Wireless N Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Netis WF2419E 300Mbps Wireless N Router from International Office Solution. Features 300Mbps speed, two 5dBi antennas, strong coverage, stable performance, and 1-year warranty for home and office use.', 'Netis WF2419E, Netis WF2419E Router, Netis 300Mbps Router, Wireless N Router Bangladesh, WiFi Router BD, Netis Router Price, Home Router, Office Router, 300Mbps WiFi Router, Netis Wireless Router, Internet Router BD, International Office Solution', NULL, 220, NULL, NULL),
(260, 'Netis NX10 AX1500 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi 6 Router', 'The Netis NX10 AX1500 WiFi 6 Router delivers up to 1500Mbps dual-band speed, powered by WiFi 6 technology, MU-MIMO, OFDMA, and Beamforming. With four 5dBi antennas, Gigabit ports, and EASY MESH support, it provides fast, stable, and wide coverage for homes and small offices.', 'netis-nx10-ax1500-dual-band-gigabit-wifi-6-router-1780118428', '<p><strong>Netis NX10 AX1500 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi 6 Router</strong></p><p>The <strong>Netis NX10 AX1500 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi 6 Router</strong> is a next-generation networking solution designed for modern homes, gaming setups, and small office environments. Powered by <strong>WiFi 6 (802.11ax) technology</strong>, it delivers faster speeds, greater capacity, and improved efficiency for multiple connected devices at the same time.</p><p>With combined wireless speeds of up to <strong>1500Mbps</strong>—including <strong>1201Mbps on the 5GHz band</strong> and <strong>300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band</strong>—the Netis NX10 ensures smooth 4K streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, and fast file downloads without lag or interruption.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>four high-gain 5dBi external antennas</strong> and a high-power FEM (Front-End Module), the router provides strong and stable Wi-Fi coverage across large areas, making it suitable for multi-room or three-bedroom homes. Advanced technologies such as <strong>MU-MIMO, Beamforming, OFDMA, and Airtime Fairness</strong> ensure efficient data distribution and stable performance even when many devices are connected simultaneously.</p><p>The Netis NX10 also features a powerful hardware configuration, including a <strong>1GHz CPU, 128MB DDR memory, and 16MB flash storage</strong>, ensuring smooth system performance and quick response times. With <strong>Gigabit WAN and three Gigabit LAN ports</strong>, it supports ultra-fast wired connections for gaming consoles, smart TVs, desktops, and NAS devices.</p><p>For flexible networking, the router supports multiple modes such as <strong>Router Mode, Repeater Mode, and EASY MESH</strong>, allowing users to expand coverage seamlessly across larger spaces. It also supports guest networks on both bands, enabling secure internet access for visitors without compromising the main network.</p><p>Security is enhanced with support for <strong>WPA3 encryption</strong>, along with WPA/WPA2 options, ensuring a safe and protected wireless environment. Additional features include <strong>parental controls, bandwidth management, Dynamic DNS, remote access, TR069 support, and FOTA firmware updates</strong>, making it a smart and future-ready device.</p><p>Easy setup through <strong>WPS one-touch configuration</strong> and app-based management further simplifies network control, making the Netis NX10 AX1500 an ideal choice for users seeking high-speed, stable, and secure internet connectivity.</p><p><br><strong>Buy Netis NX10 AX1500 WiFi 6 Router from International Office Solution</strong></p><p>Get the original <strong>Netis NX10 AX1500 Dual Band Gigabit WiFi 6 Router</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> at the best price in Bangladesh. We offer genuine networking products with reliable support and competitive pricing. Order online or visit International Office Solution to upgrade your network with next-generation WiFi 6 performance. The router comes with a <strong>1-year warranty</strong>.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>AX1500<br>5 GHz: 1201Mbps (802.11ax)<br>2.4 GHz: 300Mbps (802.11n)</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4x Fixed High-Performance Antennas<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS/MESH, RESET</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>5 GHz<br>2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1* Gigabit WAN Port<br>3* Gigabit LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>Wi-Fi 6<br>IEEE 802.11ax/ac/n/