(261, 'Netis NC63 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Router', 'The Netis NC63 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Router offers up to 1200Mbps speed, six 5dBi antennas, MU-MIMO, Beamforming, and Gigabit ports for fast and stable internet. Ideal for homes and offices with multiple devices and high-bandwidth usage.', 'netis-nc63-ac1200-dual-band-gigabit-router-1780118884', '<p><strong>Netis NC63 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Router</strong></p><p>The <strong>Netis NC63 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Router</strong> is a powerful and high-performance networking solution designed for modern homes, offices, and multi-device environments. It delivers fast, stable, and reliable internet connectivity with combined wireless speeds of up to <strong>1200Mbps</strong>, offering <strong>300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band</strong> and <strong>867Mbps on the 5GHz band</strong> for smooth HD streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, and fast browsing.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>six high-gain 5dBi external antennas</strong> and an integrated signal power amplifier, the Netis NC63 provides extended Wi-Fi coverage and strong signal penetration, effectively eliminating dead zones across large areas. This makes it ideal for multi-room homes, apartments, and office environments where stable connectivity is essential.</p><p>The router utilizes advanced technologies such as <strong>MU-MIMO and Beamforming</strong>, allowing multiple devices to connect simultaneously while maintaining strong and stable performance. This ensures efficient data transmission, reduced latency, and improved overall network experience even in high-traffic usage scenarios.</p><p>For wired connections, the Netis NC63 is equipped with <strong>Gigabit WAN and LAN ports</strong>, enabling ultra-fast data transfer speeds for gaming consoles, smart TVs, PCs, and NAS devices. It also supports multiple WAN connection types including <strong>DHCP, Static IP, PPPoE, L2TP, PPTP, Dual Access, and WISP</strong>, providing excellent flexibility for different ISP requirements.</p><p>The router supports <strong>Multi-SSID functionality</strong>, allowing up to eight separate wireless networks. This enables secure guest access without compromising the main network. Additional features include <strong>IPTV support, VPN pass-through, intelligent bandwidth control, MAC filtering, and advanced wireless security with WPA/WPA2 encryption</strong>.</p><p>With multiple operating modes such as <strong>AP Router, Repeater, and Client Mode</strong>, the Netis NC63 offers versatile deployment options. Advanced management features like <strong>Dynamic DNS, DMZ, access control, and backup/restore settings</strong> ensure complete control over your network.</p><p>Overall, the Netis NC63 AC1200 Gigabit Router is a reliable, feature-rich, and high-speed networking device built for seamless connectivity and long-term performance.</p><p><strong>Buy Netis NC63 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Router from International Office Solution</strong></p><p>Get the original <strong>Netis NC63 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Router</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> at the best price in Bangladesh. We provide authentic networking products with reliable service and customer support. Order online or visit International Office Solution to enjoy fast, stable, and secure internet connectivity for your home or office. The router comes with a <strong>1-year warranty</strong>.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>Up to 300Mbps2.4GHz<br>UP to 867Mbps 5GHz<br>802.11ac:80MHZ(433Mbps, 867Mbps)<br>802.11n:<br>40MHz(300Mbps, 270Mbps, 240Mbps, 180Mbps, 120Mbps, 90Mbps, 60Mbps, 30Mbps)<br>20MHz (144Mbps, 130Mbps, 115Mbps, 86Mbps, 57Mbps, 43Mbps, 28Mbps, 14Mbps) (Auto-Sense)<br>803.11g: (54Mbps, 48Mbps, 36Mbps, 24Mbps, 18Mbps, 12Mbps, 11Mbps, 9Mbps, 6Mbps)<br>802.11b: (11Mbps,9Mbps, 6Mbps, 5.5Mbps, 2Mbps, 1Mbps)</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>6* external fixed 5dBi antenna<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Reset<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4-2.4835GHz<br>5.180-5.825GHZ<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Wireless Modes: AP Router, Repeater, Client, Multi-SSID</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1*10/100/1000Mbps Auto MDI/MDIX RJ45 WAN port<br>3*10/100/1000Mbps Auto MDI/MDIX RJ45 LAN port</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11b/g/n 2.4GHz<br>IEEE 802.11a/n/ac 5GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WEP/WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK/WPA/WPA2-PSK Encryption<br>Wireless MAC Filtering<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Transmit Power: 20dBm(MAX)<br>WAN Type: DHCP, Static IP, PPPoE,（Russia PPPoE）, L2TP, PPTP,<br>Bandwidth Control, Access Control, IPTV, Virtual Server, DMZ,<br>VPN Pass-through, Dynamic DNS, Static Routing, Backup &amp; Restore<br>MU-MIMO, beamforming technology.<br>Multi-SSID providing up to 8 additional separate networks for guests and friends<br>Built-in signal power amplifier in chip for higher WiFi coverage<br>Intelligent bandwidth control.<br>Support EASY MESH networking<br>Complete Gigabit ports.<br>Easy setup and support App management conveniently.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>DC 12V/1.0A(Output)<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>182mm*108mm*35mm</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01 year warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band Gigabit', 2795.00, 2895.00, NULL, 6, 'products/thumbnails/dYoMmWZRUsAsQG9R8HftVItKobHmu766LmypRTr7.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-30 05:28:04', '2026-05-30 05:28:04', 'Netis NC63 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Netis NC63 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Router from International Office Solut