(262, 'Netis NC65 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Router', 'The Netis NC65 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Router delivers up to 1200Mbps speed, powered by MU-MIMO, Beamforming, and Gigabit ports. With four 5dBi antennas, Easy Mesh support, and advanced security features, it ensures stable, fast, and wide wireless coverage for home and office use.', 'netis-nc65-ac1200-dual-band-gigabit-router-1780119219', '<p><strong>Netis NC65 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Router</strong></p><p>The <strong>Netis NC65 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Router</strong> is a high-performance networking solution designed for smooth, stable, and efficient internet connectivity in homes and small offices. Supporting next-generation wireless performance, it delivers combined speeds of up to <strong>1200Mbps</strong>, with <strong>300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band</strong> and <strong>867Mbps on the 5GHz band</strong>, ensuring lag-free streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, and fast downloads.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>four high-gain 5dBi external antennas</strong>, the Netis NC65 provides wide wireless coverage and strong signal penetration across multi-room environments. Advanced technologies such as <strong>MU-MIMO and Beamforming</strong> enhance signal strength and allow multiple devices to connect simultaneously without performance drops, making it ideal for households with heavy internet usage.</p><p>Powered by a <strong>1GHz processor with 128MB DDR memory</strong>, the router ensures fast processing and stable multitasking even under heavy network load. It comes with <strong>Gigabit WAN and LAN ports (1 WAN + 3 LAN)</strong>, delivering ultra-fast wired connectivity for gaming consoles, smart TVs, desktop PCs, and NAS storage devices.</p><p>The Netis NC65 supports multiple operating modes, including <strong>AP Router, AP Mode, Repeater, Client, and WISP</strong>, giving users flexible deployment options based on their networking needs. It also includes intelligent features such as <strong>QoS (Quality of Service), bandwidth control, airtime fairness, and device-based traffic management</strong> for optimized performance across all connected devices.</p><p>For compatibility, the router supports multiple wireless standards, including <strong>802.11ac/n (5GHz)</strong> and <strong>802.11b/g/n (2.4GHz)</strong>. It also integrates modern technologies like <strong>OFDMA</strong>, allowing efficient communication with multiple devices simultaneously for improved network performance.</p><p>Security is enhanced with <strong>WPA2-PSK, WPA/WPA2 encryption, IP &amp; MAC filtering, access control, guest networks, and VPN pass-through</strong>, ensuring a safe and controlled browsing environment. Additional features like <strong>Dynamic DNS, IGMP proxy, IPTV support with VLAN tagging, and parental controls</strong> further enhance usability and customization.</p><p>With <strong>Easy Mesh support</strong>, WPS one-touch setup, and app-based management, the Netis NC65 offers a user-friendly experience while maintaining advanced networking capabilities. It is a reliable and future-ready router built to meet the growing demands of modern internet users.<br><strong>Buy Netis NC65 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Router from International Office Solution</strong></p><p>Get the original <strong>Netis NC65 AC1200 Dual Band Gigabit Router</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> at the best price in Bangladesh. We provide genuine networking products with reliable service and customer support. Order online or visit International Office Solution to enjoy fast, secure, and stable internet connectivity. The router comes with a <strong>1-year warranty</strong>.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>AC1200<br>5 GHz: 867Mbps (802.11ac)<br>2.4 GHz: 300Mbps (802.11n)</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4* Fixed High-Performance Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS/MESH, RESET<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>Dual-Band<br>2.4GHz &amp; 5GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>AP Router Mode, AP Mode, WISP Mode, Client Mode, Repeater Mode</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1* Gigabit WAN Port<br>3* Gigabit LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>Wi-Fi 5<br>IEEE 802.11ac/n 5 GHz<br>IEEE 802.11b/g/n 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WEP, WPA-PSK, WPA2-PSK, WPA/WPA2-PSK</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>WiFi Range: 3 Bedroom Houses<br>Multiple antennas form a signal-boosting array to cover more directions and large areas<br>Beamforming Concentrates wireless signal strength towards clients to expand WiFi range<br>High-Power FEM Improves transmission power to strengthen signal coverage<br>Protocols: IPv4, IPv6<br>WAN Types: DHCP, Static IP, PPPoE, L2TP, PPTP<br>Quality of Service: QoS by Device<br>Forwarding: Virtual Server, DMZ,UPnP<br>IPTV: Bridge, Tag VLAN<br>DHCP: Address Reservation, DHCP Client List, DHC Server<br>Access Control: IP Filtering, MAC Filtering, Domain Filtering, IPv6 Filtering<br>Dynamic DNS: DynDns, no-ip<br>IGMP: IGMP Proxy, IGMP Snooping<br>VPN: PPTP Pass-through,L2TP Pass-through,IPSEC Pass-through,SIP Pass-through<br>Others: Bandwidth Control, Multiple SSID, FOTA, TR069, WOL, ARP List, Static Routing, Port Setting, Remote Access, Backup &amp; Restore<br>Processor: 1GHz CPU<br>DDR/FLASH: 128MB/8MB</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>12V1A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>228*134*188mm</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01 year warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual Band Gigabit', 2650.00, 2750.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/5KpKmHkHmS5frCrZzBxSxgtqfMNAIUYu4nwPzFdU.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-30 05:33:39', '2026-05-30 