(263, 'Netis NC21 AC1200 Dual Band Router', 'The Netis NC21 AC1200 Dual Band Router delivers up to 1200Mbps speed, powered by MU-MIMO, OFDMA, Beamforming, and a 1GHz processor. With four 5dBi antennas, multiple operating modes, and advanced security features, it ensures stable, fast, and wide Wi-Fi coverage for home and office use.', 'netis-nc21-ac1200-dual-band-router-1780119603', '<p><strong>Netis NC21 AC1200 Dual Band Router</strong></p><p>The <strong>Netis NC21 AC1200 Dual Band Router</strong> is a powerful and reliable networking device designed to deliver fast, stable, and efficient internet connectivity for both home and office environments. Supporting dual-band wireless technology, it provides speeds of up to <strong>300Mbps on the 2.4GHz band</strong> and <strong>867Mbps on the 5GHz band</strong>, offering a combined <strong>AC1200 performance</strong> for smooth HD streaming, online gaming, video calls, and fast downloads.</p><p>Powered by a <strong>1GHz processor</strong> along with the <strong>RTL8197FH-VG5 + RTL8812FR chipset</strong>, and equipped with <strong>128MB DDR memory and 8MB flash storage</strong>, the Netis NC21 ensures efficient handling of multiple connected devices without performance drops. It is designed to maintain stable connectivity even under heavy network usage.</p><p>The router features <strong>four high-gain 5dBi external antennas</strong>, enhanced with <strong>beamforming and high-power FEM technology</strong>, which significantly improves signal strength and expands wireless coverage. This makes it suitable for large apartments, multi-room homes, and office spaces by minimizing dead zones and ensuring consistent connectivity.</p><p>Advanced technologies such as <strong>MU-MIMO, OFDMA, and Airtime Fairness</strong> allow multiple devices to communicate simultaneously with improved efficiency, reducing congestion and optimizing bandwidth usage for all connected users.</p><p>For wired connectivity, the Netis NC21 includes <strong>one WAN port and three LAN ports</strong>, ensuring fast and stable connections for PCs, gaming consoles, and smart devices. It also supports multiple working modes including <strong>AP Router, AP Mode, WISP, Client, and Repeater</strong>, offering flexible network configuration options.</p><p>Security is strengthened with support for <strong>WEP, WPA, WPA2, WPA/WPA2 encryption</strong>, along with <strong>IP and MAC filtering, access control, and multi-SSID guest networks</strong> for both frequency bands. Additional features include <strong>IPv4/IPv6 support, QoS (Quality of Service), NAT forwarding (DMZ, Virtual Server, UPnP), VPN pass-through, Dynamic DNS (DynDNS, No-IP), and bandwidth management</strong>.</p><p>For multimedia and streaming users, the router supports <strong>IPTV with VLAN tagging, IGMP proxy, and IGMP snooping</strong>, ensuring smooth and uninterrupted video playback. It also includes <strong>remote management, backup/restore options, WPS one-touch setup, and OTA firmware updates</strong>, making it easy to maintain and operate.</p><p>With its strong performance, wide coverage, and advanced feature set, the Netis NC21 AC1200 Dual Band Router is an excellent choice for users seeking a secure, flexible, and high-performance networking solution.</p><p>Buy Netis NC21 AC1200 Dual Band Router from International Office Solution Get the original Netis NC21 AC1200 Dual Band Router from International Office Solution at the best price in Bangladesh. We offer genuine networking products with reliable service and customer support. Order online or visit International Office Solution to enjoy fast, secure, and stable internet connectivity. The router comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>AC1200<br>5 GHz: 867Mbps (802.11ac)<br>2.4 GHz: 300Mbps (802.11n)</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4* Fixed High-Performan