(264, 'Netis WF2409E 300Mbps Wireless N Router', 'The Netis WF2409E 300Mbps Wireless N Router offers stable 300Mbps Wi-Fi speed with 5dBi MIMO antennas for strong coverage. It supports multiple modes, guest networks, bandwidth control, and advanced security for home and office use.', 'netis-wf2409e-300mbps-wireless-n-router-1780119773', '<p>Netis WF2409E 300Mbps Wireless N Router</p><p>The <strong>Netis WF2409E 300Mbps Wireless N Router</strong> is a reliable and budget-friendly networking solution designed for home and small office users who need stable and efficient internet connectivity. With wireless speeds of up to <strong>300Mbps</strong>, it is ideal for everyday online activities such as HD video streaming, internet calling, online learning, browsing, and fast file downloads.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>high-gain 5dBi MIMO antennas</strong>, the Netis WF2409E delivers improved signal strength, wider coverage, and stable wireless performance across multiple rooms. This ensures a smoother and more consistent internet experience even in areas far from the router.</p><p>The router supports multiple operating modes, including <strong>Router Mode and Bridge (Access Point) Mode</strong>, offering flexible usage based on different network requirements. In AP Router mode, it supports various WAN connection types such as <strong>DHCP, Static IP, PPPoE, L2TP, PPTP, Dual Access, and WISP</strong>, making it compatible with a wide range of internet service providers.</p><p>For wireless flexibility, it supports multiple modes including <strong>AP, Repeater, AP+WDS, WDS, and Client mode</strong>, allowing users to extend or customize their network easily. The <strong>Multi-SSID feature</strong> enables up to three additional networks, making it convenient to create separate guest access without compromising the main network.</p><p>Security and control features include <strong>WPS one-touch setup</strong>, <strong>IP filtering, MAC filtering, and domain filtering based on schedule</strong>, ensuring safe and controlled internet usage. The router also includes <strong>intelligent bandwidth control</strong>, allowing fair distribution of internet speed among connected devices.</p><p>With a <strong>quick setup process and multilingual web interface</strong>, the Netis WF2409E is easy to configure even for non-technical users. Its stable performance, wide compatibility, and user-friendly design make it a practical choice for everyday networking needs.</p><h3><strong>Buy Netis WF2409E Router from International Office Solution</strong></h3><p>Get the original <strong>Netis WF2409E 300Mbps Wireless N Router</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> at the best price in Bangladesh. We provide genuine networking products with reliable service and support. Order online or visit International Office Solution to enjoy stable and secure internet connectivity. The router comes with a <strong>1-year warranty</strong>.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Wireless N Router</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1 * 10/100Mbps Auto MDI/MDIX RJ45 WAN port<br>4 * 10/100Mbps Auto MDI/MDIX RJ45 LAN port</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>WPS, Default</td></tr><tr><td>External Power Supply</td><td>DC 9V/500mA (Output)</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless Standards</td><td>IEEE 802.11b, IEEE 802.11g, IEEE 802.11n</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.4-2.4835GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless Security</td><td>64/128-bit WEP,<br>WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK (TKIP/AES)<br>SSID Broadcast Enable/Disable<br>Wireless MAC Filtering</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', '300Mbps', 1488.00, 1488.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/sc13gTRdDBYI6TcoMpJt80yhE7rcHXYmjqxMEfcU.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-30 05:42:53', '2026-05-30 05:42:53', 'Netis WF2409E 300Mbps Wireless N Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Netis WF2409E 300Mbps Wireless N Router from International Office Solution. Features 300Mbps speed, 5dBi antennas, multiple modes, guest network, and stable Wi-Fi performance.', 'Netis WF2409E, WF2409E router, Netis 300Mbps router, wireless N router BD, WiFi router Bangladesh, Netis router price, home router, office router, 300Mbps WiFi router, 5dBi antenna router, WPS router, guest network router, International Office Solution', NULL, 220, NULL, NULL),
(265, 'COMFAST CF-E314N V2 2.4GHz Outdoor Wireless CPE Bridge', 'The COMFAST CPE CF-E314N V2 Outdoor Wireless Router offers up to 300Mbps speed, powered by a Qualcomm 650MHz CPU and dual 14dBi antennas for long-range coverage. With PoE support and weatherproof design, it is ideal for outdoor and point-to-point networking.', 'comfast-cf-e314n-v2-24ghz-outdoor-wireless-cpe-bridge-1780120126', '<p><strong>COMFAST CPE CF-E314N V2 Outdoor Wireless Router</strong></p><p>The <strong>COMFAST CPE CF-E314N V2 Outdoor Wireless Router</strong> is a durable and high-performance outdoor networking solution designed for long-range wireless connectivity in challenging environments. Powered by a <strong>Qualcomm QCA9531 650MHz processor</strong>, it delivers stable performance with wireless speeds of up to <strong>300Mbps</strong>, making it suitable for outdoor surveillance systems, point-to-point connections, remote buildings, and extended network coverage.</p><p>This outdoor CPE device is equipped with <strong>dual 14dBi high-gain directional antennas</strong>, which provide strong signal transmission and reception over long distances. It ensures stable connectivity even in areas with obstacles or weak signal conditions, making it ideal for rural connectivity, campus networks, and industrial applications.</p><p>The COMFAST CPE CF-E314N V2 features a built-in <strong>PoE (Power over Ethernet) support</strong>, allowing both power and data transmission through a single Ethernet cable. This simplifies installation by eliminating the need for a separate power outlet, especially in outdoor or hard-to-reach locations.</p><p>It includes <strong>one WAN port and one LAN port</strong>, offering flexible connectivity options for networking devices such as IP cameras, access points, or other routers. The reset button allows quick configuration and easy troubleshooting when needed.</p><p>Built with a weather-resistant design, this outdoor router is engineered to withstand harsh environmental conditions such as rain, heat, and dust. It ensures stable operation in various outdoor scenarios, making it highly reliable for continuous use.</p><p>Overall, the COMFAST CPE CF-E314N V2 is an efficient and cost-effective solution for long-range wireless networking, offering stable performance, easy installation, and robust outdoor durability.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>300Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>Dual 2x 14 Intelligent antenna</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1x POE Switch, 1x RESET Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.3GHz - 2.7GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1*10/100Mbps Wan<br>1*10/100m LAN</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE802.11a/an/ac<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>320g</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Outdoor Wireless CPE Bridge', 12767.00, 13500.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/4OolYqYRiInzPTQw9ACn60BITqI2TT8KfOy1e9CA.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-30 05:48:46', '2026-05-30 05:48:46', 'COMFAST CPE CF-E314N V2 Outdoor Wireless Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy COMFAST CPE CF-E314N V2 Outdoor Wireless Router from International Office Solution. Features 300Mbps speed, Qualcomm CPU, 14dBi antennas, PoE support, and weatherproof outdoor design.', 'COMFAST CF-E314N V2, COMFAST CPE router, outdoor wireless router BD, 300Mbps outdoor CPE, PoE router Bangladesh, long range WiFi, outdoor access point, point to point device, wireless network device, COMFAST router price, International Office Solution', NULL, 221, NULL, NULL),
(266, 'COMFAST CF-E314N V2 2.4GHz Outdoor Wireless CPE Bridge', 'The COMFAST CPE CF-E314N V2 Outdoor Wireless Router delivers up to 300Mbps speed with a Qualcomm 650MHz CPU and dual 14dBi antennas for long-range coverage. It supports PoE power and weatherproof design, making it ideal for outdoor networking and point-to-point connections.', 'comfast-cf-e314n-v2-24ghz-outdoor-wireless-cpe-bridge-1780120363', '<p><strong>COMFAST CPE CF-E314N V2 Outdoor Wireless Router</strong></p><p>The <strong>COMFAST CPE CF-E314N V2 Outdoor Wireless Router</strong> is a high-performance outdoor networking device designed to deliver stable and long-range wireless connectivity in challenging environments. Powered by a <strong>Qualcomm QCA9531 650MHz processor</strong>, it provides wireless speeds of up to <strong>300Mbps</strong>, making it suitable for outdoor internet distribution, surveillance systems, and point-to-point connectivity.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>dual high-gain 14dBi directional antennas</strong>, this device ensures strong signal transmission and reception over long distances. It is ideal for connecting remote buildings, outdoor CCTV systems, campuses, farms, and industrial areas where stable wireless coverage is required.</p><p>The built-in <strong>PoE (Power over Ethernet) support</strong> allows both power and data to be delivered through a single Ethernet cable, simplifying installation and eliminating the need for a nearby power outlet. This makes it especially convenient for outdoor or elevated installations such as rooftops and poles.</p><p>The COMFAST CPE CF-E314N V2 includes <strong>one WAN port and one LAN port</strong>, offering flexible connectivity for networking devices. A reset button is also included for quick recovery and easy configuration when needed.</p><p>Built with a <strong>weather-resistant and durable housing</strong>, this outdoor router is designed to withstand harsh environmental conditions such as rain, heat, dust, and wind. It ensures continuous and stable operation in outdoor deployments.</p><p>Overall, the COMFAST CPE CF-E314N V2 is a reliable and cost-effective solution for long-distance wireless networking, offering strong performance, easy installation, and rugged outdoor durability.</p><p>Buy COMFAST CPE CF-E314N V2 Outdoor Wireless Router from International Office Solution Get the original COMFAST CPE CF-E314N V2 Outdoor Wireless Router from International Office Solution at the best price in Bangladesh. We provide authentic networking products with reliable service and support. Order online or visit International Office Solution for stable outdoor wireless connectivity. The product comes with a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>300Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>Dual 2x 14 Intelligent antenna</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>1x POE Switch, 1x RESET Button</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>2.3GHz - 2.7GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1*10/100Mbps Wan<br>1*10/100m LAN</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE802.11a/an/ac<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>320g</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Outdoor Wireless CPE Bridge', 12767.00, 13000.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/Fxojn75KteGcNnGRV147NcASuaAjnQM8pEgS1c5C.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-30 05:52:43', '2026-05-30 05:52:43', 'COMFAST CPE CF-E314N V2 Outdoor Wireless Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy COMFAST CPE CF-E314N V2 Outdoor Wireless Router from International Office Solution. Features 300Mbps speed, Qualcomm CPU, 14dBi antennas, PoE support, and weatherproof outdoor design.', 'COMFAST CF-E314N V2, COMFAST outdoor CPE, outdoor wireless router BD, 300Mbps outdoor router, PoE router BD, long range WiFi device, point to point router, outdoor access point, wireless CPE device, COMFAST router price, network device BD', NULL, 221, NULL, NULL),
(267, 'VSOL HG3610AC-1G3F AC1200 Dual-Band Gigabit WiFi 5 Router', 'The VSOL HG3610AC-1G3F AC1200 Dual-Band Gigabit Router delivers up to 1200Mbps combined speed, Gigabit WAN support, Easy Mesh technology, and advanced security features, making it ideal for home and office use with multiple devices.', 'vsol-hg3610ac-1g3f-ac1200-dual-band-gigabit-wifi-5-router-1780120566', '<p><strong>VSOL HG3610AC-1G3F AC1200 Dual-Band Gigabit WiFi 5 Router</strong></p><p>The <strong>VSOL HG3610AC-1G3F AC1200 Dual-Band Gigabit WiFi 5 Router</strong> is a powerful networking device designed for stable, high-speed internet performance in homes and small office environments. It supports <strong>IEEE 802.11b/g/n/ac (WiFi 5)</strong> standards, ensuring broad compatibility with modern wireless devices.</p><p>With dual-band performance, the router delivers speeds of up to <strong>300Mbps on 2.4GHz</strong> and <strong>867Mbps on 5GHz</strong>, allowing smooth HD streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, and fast downloads with minimal lag. This makes it an ideal choice for multi-device households and office setups.</p><p>The VSOL HG3610AC-1G3F is equipped with <strong>one Gigabit WAN port and three Fast Ethernet LAN ports</strong>, providing stable wired connections for desktops, smart TVs, gaming consoles, and other network devices. Its dual external antennas enhance signal strength and improve wireless coverage across different rooms.</p><p>Designed to support up to <strong>96 connected devices</strong>, it efficiently handles multiple simultaneous connections—64 devices on 5GHz and 32 devices on 2.4GHz—ensuring stable performance even under heavy usage.</p><p>For extended coverage, the router supports <strong>Easy Mesh technology</strong>, allowing users to expand their wireless network seamlessly across larger areas. It also includes <strong>multi-SSID functionality</strong>, enabling separate networks for guests, employees, or family members.</p><p>Security features include <strong>WPA/WPA2 encryption, parental controls, URL filtering, Anti-DDoS protection, Anti-ARP attack prevention, and port scanning protection</strong>, ensuring a secure and controlled browsing environment.</p><p>The router supports advanced networking protocols such as <strong>IPv4/IPv6 dual stack, DHCP, PPPoE, NAT, DMZ, and virtual server configuration</strong>, offering flexibility for different ISP setups and advanced users.</p><p>For management, it includes multiple access methods like <strong>Web interface, Telnet, TR-069, CLI, and VST tools</strong>, making configuration and monitoring easy and efficient.</p><p>Overall, the VSOL HG3610AC-1G3F is a reliable and feature-rich AC1200 Gigabit router designed for high-performance wireless connectivity and strong network security.</p><h3><strong>Buy VSOL HG3610AC-1G3F Router from International Office Solution</strong></h3><p>Get the original <strong>VSOL HG3610AC-1G3F AC1200 Dual-Band Gigabit WiFi 5 Router</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> at the best price in Bangladesh. We offer genuine networking products with reliable service and support. Order online or visit International Office Solution for fast and secure internet connectivity. The product comes with a <strong>1-year warranty</strong>.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>5GHz: 867Mbps, 2.4GHz: 300Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2.4GHz: 2*2, 5GHz: 2*2; external antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Reset / WPS</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>5 GHz, 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Wi-Fi 5: 802.11a/n/ac 5GHz &amp; 802.11b/g/n 2.4GHz<br>Support multiple SSIDs<br>Authentication: WAP-PSK (TKIP)/WAP2-PSK (AES)<br>Modulation types: DSSS, CCK, and OFDM<br>Encoding schemes: BPSK, QPSK, 16QAM, and 64QAM<br>Support WIFI Easy-mesh function</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>1*10/100/1000Mbps and 3*10/100Mbps, RJ45 connectors (1*GE WAN, 3*FE LAN)</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>Wi-Fi 5: 802.11a/n/ac 5GHz &amp; 802.11b/g/n 2.4GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WAP-PSK (TKIP)/WAP2-PSK (AES)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>DC 12V/1A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>179.9mm×104.1mm×30.8mm (L*W*H)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>200g</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual-Band Gigabit', 2300.00, 2399.97, NULL, 11, 'products/thumbnails/Ve7ZLjnLKCbE8JFSyxf7nuu2WVcexhTL7lecARNi.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-30 05:56:06', '2026-05-30 06:12:00', 'VSOL HG3610AC-1G3F AC1200 Dual-Band Gigabit WiFi 5 Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy VSOL HG3610AC-1G3F AC1200 Dual-Band Gigabit WiFi 5 Router from International Office Solution. Features 1200Mbps speed, Gigabit WAN, Easy Mesh, multi-device support, and strong security.', 'VSOL HG3610AC-1G3F, VSOL AC1200 router, dual band router BD, gigabit WiFi router, WiFi 5 router Bangladesh, VSOL router price BD, home router, office router, Easy Mesh router, AC1200 router BD, network router BD, Gigabit WAN router', NULL, 222, NULL, NULL),
(268, 'VSOL HG5013-4G AX3000 Dual-Band Gigabit WiFi 6 Router', 'The VSOL HG5013-4G AX3000 WiFi 6 Router delivers up to 2976Mbps speed, WiFi 6 technology, Gigabit ports, MU-MIMO, OFDMA, WPA3 security, and support for up to 128 devices, making it ideal for smart homes and offices.', 'vsol-hg5013-4g-ax3000-dual-band-gigabit-wifi-6-router-1780120792', '<p><strong>VSOL HG5013-4G AX3000 Dual-Band WiFi 6 Router</strong></p><p>The <strong>VSOL HG5013-4G AX3000 Dual-Band WiFi 6 Router</strong> is a next-generation high-performance networking device designed for ultra-fast, stable, and efficient wireless connectivity in modern homes, offices, and high-density environments. Built with <strong>WiFi 6 (802.11ax) technology</strong>, it ensures improved speed, capacity, and overall network efficiency.</p><p>This router delivers combined wireless speeds of up to <strong>2976Mbps</strong>, offering <strong>2402Mbps on the 5GHz band</strong> and <strong>574Mbps on the 2.4GHz band</strong>, making it ideal for 4K/8K streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, and large file transfers without lag.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>four Gigabit Ethernet ports (1 WAN + 3 LAN)</strong>, the VSOL HG5013-4G ensures ultra-fast wired connections for PCs, gaming consoles, NAS devices, and smart TVs. Its <strong>external 2x2 high-gain antennas</strong> provide enhanced signal strength and wider wireless coverage for multi-room environments.</p><p>The router supports up to <strong>128 simultaneous connected devices</strong>, making it highly suitable for smart homes, offices, and IoT-heavy environments where multiple devices require stable internet access at the same time.</p><p>Advanced WiFi 6 technologies such as <strong>MU-MIMO, OFDMA, 1024-QAM, Beamforming, Beamsteering, BSS Coloring, Dynamic QoS, WMM, and Easy Mesh support</strong> ensure optimized bandwidth distribution, reduced latency, and seamless roaming across extended networks.</p><p>For security, the VSOL HG5013-4G supports <strong>WEP, WPA, WPA2, and WPA3 encryption standards</strong>, along with advanced protections such as <strong>Anti-DDoS, URL filtering, IP filtering, parental controls, and Anti-ARP attack prevention</strong>, ensuring a safe and controlled browsing experience.</p><p>It also supports modern networking protocols including <strong>IPv4/IPv6 dual-stack, DHCP, PPPoE, NAT, static routing, and virtual server configurations</strong>, providing flexibility for various ISP environments and advanced users.</p><p>Additional features like <strong>IGMP Snooping, IGMP Proxy, MLD Snooping, and fast leave support</strong> ensure smooth IPTV and multicast streaming performance.</p><p>For management and configuration, the router offers multiple access options including <strong>Web UI, Telnet, TR-069, SSH, and CLI</strong>, making it suitable for both home users and professional network administrators.</p><p>Overall, the VSOL HG5013-4G AX3000 WiFi 6 Router delivers powerful performance, advanced security, and future-ready connectivity for demanding network environments.</p><h3><strong>Buy VSOL HG5013-4G AX3000 WiFi 6 Router from International Office Solution</strong></h3><p>Get the original <strong>VSOL HG5013-4G AX3000 Dual-Band Gigabit WiFi 6 Router</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> at the best price in Bangladesh. We offer genuine networking products with reliable service and support. Order online or visit International Office Solution for high-speed and secure internet connectivity. The product comes with a <strong>1-year warranty</strong>.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>2402 Mbps on 5GHz and 574Mbps on 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>4× Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Reset / WPS</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>5 GHz, 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Support MU-MIMO &amp; OFDMA<br>Support Dynamic QoS<br>Support 1024-QAM<br>Support WMM<br>BSS-Coloring &amp; Beamforming &amp; Beamsteering<br>Support Wi-Fi Easy-mesh function</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>4*10/100/1000Mbps auto adaptive Ethernet interface,<br>RJ45 connectors (1*WAN, 3*LAN)</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>Wi-Fi 6: 802.11a/n/ac/ax 5GHz &amp; 802.11b/g/n/ax 2.4GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>Wi-Fi Encryption: WEP-64/WEP-128/ WPA/WPA2/WPA3</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>DC 12V/1A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>179.9mm×104.1mm×30.8mm(L*W*H)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>185g</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 3300.00, 3400.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/GhvPMf19rv3ml1K8qE4aJrGcyopR1zorTCtIX2HS.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, '2026-05-30 05:59:52', '2026-06-03 08:31:18', 'VSOL HG5013-4G AX3000 WiFi 6 Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy VSOL HG5013-4G AX3000 Dual-Band Gigabit WiFi 6 Router from International Office Solution. Features 2976Mbps speed, WiFi 6, Gigabit ports, WPA3 security, MU-MIMO, and Easy Mesh support.', 'VSOL HG5013-4G, VSOL AX3000 router, WiFi 6 router BD, dual band gigabit router, VSOL router price Bangladesh, home router, office router, Gigabit WiFi router, MU-MIMO router, OFDMA router, WPA3 router, mesh router BD, network router BD', NULL, 222, NULL, NULL),
(269, 'VSOL HG5033-AX30-4G AX3000 Dual-Band Gigabit WiFi 6 Router', 'The VSOL HG5033-AX30-4G AX3000 WiFi 6 Router offers up to 2976Mbps speed, WiFi 6 technology, Gigabit ports, MU-MIMO, OFDMA, WPA3 security, and Easy Mesh support for high-performance home and office networking.', 'vsol-hg5033-ax30-4g-ax3000-dual-band-gigabit-wifi-6-router-1780121212', '<p><strong>VSOL HG5033-AX30-4G AX3000 Dual-Band Gigabit WiFi 6 Router</strong></p><p>The <strong>VSOL HG5033-AX30-4G AX3000 Dual-Band Gigabit WiFi 6 Router</strong> is a high-performance next-generation networking device designed for ultra-fast, stable, and efficient wireless connectivity in homes, offices, and multi-device environments. Built with <strong>WiFi 6 (802.11ax) technology</strong>, it ensures improved speed, capacity, and reduced latency for modern internet usage.</p><p>It delivers combined wireless speeds of up to <strong>2976Mbps</strong>, with <strong>2402Mbps on the 5GHz band</strong> and <strong>574Mbps on the 2.4GHz band</strong>, making it ideal for 4K/8K streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, and large file transfers.</p><p>The router includes <strong>one Gigabit WAN port and three Gigabit LAN ports</strong>, ensuring high-speed wired connectivity for desktops, gaming consoles, smart TVs, and NAS systems. With <strong>five external 4dBi antennas and 2x2 + 3x3 wireless architecture</strong>, it provides strong signal coverage and stable performance across large homes and office spaces.</p><p>It supports up to <strong>128 connected devices</strong>, with optimized bandwidth distribution across both frequency bands, making it suitable for smart homes, IoT environments, and business networks.</p><p>Advanced WiFi 6 technologies such as <strong>MU-MIMO, OFDMA, Beamforming, and Beamsteering</strong> enhance network efficiency, reduce congestion, and ensure smooth performance even under heavy usage.</p><p>For security, the router supports <strong>WPA, WPA2, WPA3 encryption and WPS 2.0</strong>, along with advanced protection features including <strong>anti-DoS, anti-port scanning, anti-ARP attack, URL filtering, IP filtering, and parental controls</strong>, ensuring a secure browsing environment.</p><p>It also supports <strong>Easy-Mesh networking</strong>, allowing seamless expansion of wireless coverage across larger areas without performance loss. Management options include <strong>Web UI, Telnet, TR-069, and cloud-based control</strong>, making configuration simple for both home and professional users.</p><p>The router supports <strong>IPv4/IPv6 dual-stack, DHCP, PPPoE, static routing, NAT, DMZ, UPnP, DNS proxy, and NTP services</strong>, ensuring full compatibility with modern ISP requirements.</p><p>For multimedia optimization, it includes <strong>IGMP Proxy, IGMP Snooping, and multicast support</strong>, improving IPTV and streaming performance.</p><p>Overall, the VSOL HG5033-AX30-4G AX3000 WiFi 6 Router delivers powerful performance, advanced security, and scalable connectivity for demanding network environments.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Key Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Data Rate</td><td>2402 Mbps on 5GHz and 574Mbps on 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>2.4GHz: 2*2, 5GHz: 3*3; 5*4dBi External antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Button</td><td>Reset / WPS</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>5 GHz, 2.4 GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Wi-Fi 6: 802.11a/n/ac/ax 5GHz &amp; 802.11b/g/n/ax 2.4GHz<br>Wi-Fi Encryption: WPA/WPA2/WPA3 personal, WPS2.0<br>Support MU-MIMO &amp; OFDMA<br>Support Beamforming<br>Support Beamsteering<br>Support WIFI Easy-mesh function</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>4*10/100/1000Mbps auto adaptive Ethernet interface , RJ45 connectors(1*WAN, 3*LAN)</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>Wi-Fi 6: 802.11a/n/ac/ax 5GHz &amp; 802.11b/g/n/ax 2.4GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Encryption</td><td>WPA/WPA2/WPA3 personal, WPS2.0</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Power Source</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Power Mode</td><td>DC 12V/1A</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimension</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>200mm*143mm*30mm(L*W*H)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>0.394kg</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacturer warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Dual-Band Gigabit', 4300.00, 4400.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/iVD8PFmgRCEvOdzutfnJd34ltTEbhDogUOIZp5FL.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-30 06:06:52', '2026-06-04 03:48:11', 'VSOL HG5033-AX30-4G AX3000 WiFi 6 Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Get the original VSOL HG5033-AX30-4G AX3000 Dual-Band Gigabit WiFi 6 Router from International Office Solution at the best price in Bangladesh. We provide genuine networking products with reliable service and support. Order online or visit International Office Solution for fast, stable, and secure internet connectivity. The product comes with a 1-year warranty.', 'VSOL HG5033-AX30-4G, VSOL AX3000 router, WiFi 6 router BD, dual band gigabit router, VSOL router price Bangladesh, home router, office router, Gigabit WiFi router, MU-MIMO router, OFDMA router, WPA3 router, mesh router BD, network router BD, iosBD', NULL, 222, NULL, NULL),
(270, 'Acer K202Q BI 19.5 Inch HD+ Monitor', 'The Acer K202Q BI 19.5 Inch HD+ Monitor features a 1600 x 900 resolution, 75Hz refresh rate, and 6ms response time for smooth and clear visuals. Equipped with HDMI and VGA ports, VESA mount support, and a dynamic contrast ratio of 100,000,000:1, it is an ideal monitor for office work, online learning, and everyday computing. Buy the original Acer K202Q BI Monitor from International Office Solution at the best price in Bangladesh.', 'acer-k202q-bi-195-inch-hd-monitor-1780493071', '<p>Acer K202Q BI 19.5 Inch HD+ Monitor The Acer K202Q BI 19.5 Inch HD+ Monitor is a reliable and budget-friendly display solution designed for both home and office environments. Featuring a 19.5-inch screen with an HD+ resolution of 1600 x 900 pixels, this monitor delivers crisp visuals, sharp text, and vibrant colors for everyday computing tasks. Whether you are working on documents, browsing the web, attending online meetings, or enjoying multimedia content, the Acer K202Q BI ensures a comfortable and productive viewing experience.</p><p>Equipped with a Twisted Nematic (TN) panel, the monitor offers a fast 6ms response time, reducing motion blur and ghosting during video playback and casual gaming. The 75Hz refresh rate provides smoother visuals compared to conventional 60Hz monitors, enhancing overall screen performance and reducing image stuttering.</p><p>The Acer K202Q BI comes with both HDMI and VGA connectivity options, making it compatible with a wide range of devices, including desktop PCs, laptops, DVRs, gaming consoles, and media players. Its VESA mount compatibility allows users to mount the monitor on a wall or monitor arm, helping maximize desk space and create a cleaner workstation setup.</p><p>With Acer\'s advanced display technology and a dynamic contrast ratio of 100,000,000:1, the monitor delivers deeper blacks, brighter whites, and enhanced image clarity for an immersive viewing experience. The slim and elegant design blends 