(271, 'HP LaserJet Pro MFP 4103fdn Multifunction Laser Printer', 'The HP LaserJet Pro MFP 4103fdn Multifunction Laser Printer is a powerful monochrome laser printer designed for business productivity. Featuring print, scan, copy, and fax functions, it delivers speeds of up to 42 ppm, automatic duplex printing, a 50-sheet ADF, and reliable USB and Ethernet connectivity. Ideal for busy offices, it combines high performance, professional-quality output, and efficient workflow management in a compact design. Available at International Office Solution (IOSBD) with official warranty support.', 'hp-laserjet-pro-mfp-4103fdn-multifunction-laser-printer-1780568814', '<h2><strong>HP LaserJet Pro MFP 4103fdn Multifunction Laser Printer</strong></h2><h2><strong>Long Description</strong></h2><p>The <strong>HP LaserJet Pro MFP 4103fdn Multifunction Laser Printer</strong></p><p>&nbsp;is a high-performance monochrome laser printer designed to meet the demanding needs of modern businesses and professional work environments. Combining printing, scanning, copying, and faxing capabilities in a single compact device, this multifunction printer delivers exceptional productivity, reliability, and cost-efficiency for small, medium, and large organizations.</p><p>Powered by HP\'s advanced laser printing technology, the HP LaserJet Pro MFP 4103fdn offers impressive print speeds of up to <strong>42 pages per minute (ppm)</strong>,</p><p>&nbsp;allowing businesses to complete large print jobs quickly and efficiently. Its automatic duplex printing feature enables double-sided printing, helping organizations reduce paper consumption and operating costs while maintaining environmentally responsible practices.</p><p>Equipped with a <strong>50-sheet Automatic Document Feeder (ADF)</strong>,&nbsp;</p><p>the printer streamlines scanning, copying, and faxing tasks by eliminating the need for manual page handling. This hands-free functionality significantly improves workflow efficiency and saves valuable time in busy office environments.</p><p>The HP LaserJet Pro MFP 4103fdn supports multiple connectivity options including <strong>High-Speed USB 2.0, Gigabit Ethernet, and advanced networking features</strong>,</p><p>&nbsp;making integration into existing office infrastructures seamless and hassle-free. With robust security and remote management capabilities, IT administrators can easily monitor and manage printer operations from a centralized dashboard.</p><p>Designed for professional-quality monochrome output, the printer consistently produces sharp text, crisp graphics, and clear business documents. Its compact footprint allows it to fit comfortably in various office spaces while delivering enterprise-level performance.</p><h2>Smart Setup and Easy Management</h2><p>The HP LaserJet Pro MFP 4103fdn features intelligent printer management solutions that simplify deployment and maintenance. Through HP Smart Admin tools, businesses can easily configure, monitor, and manage their printer fleet remotely from a centralized web-based interface. Enhanced networking capabilities ensure secure connectivity and seamless operation across office environments.</p><h2>Why Choose HP LaserJet Pro MFP 4103fdn?</h2><p>Whether you need to print large reports, scan multiple documents, create copies, or send important faxes, the HP LaserJet Pro MFP 4103fdn provides the speed, reliability, and functionality required for modern business operations. Its powerful performance and user-friendly features make it a valuable addition to any professional workspace.</p><h2>Buy HP LaserJet Pro MFP 4103fdn Multifunction Laser Printer from International Office Solution (IOSBD)</h2><p>Purchase the genuine&nbsp;</p><p><strong>HP LaserJet Pro MFP 4103fdn Multifunction Laser Printer</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution (IOSBD)</strong>, one of Bangladesh\'s trusted sources for office automation and printing solutions. We offer competitive prices, authentic HP products, professional consultation, and reliable after-sales support to help businesses achieve maximum productivity.</p><p>Order online today or contact International Office Solution (IOSBD) to get the best price and expert assistance for your office printing requirements.</p><h3>Warranty Information</h3><ul><li>1 Year Limited Warranty</li><li>Adapter/Power Cable: No Warranty</li><li>Original Box Required for Warranty Claim</li></ul>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>General</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Functions</td><td>Print, copy, scan, Fax</td></tr><tr><td>Printer Type</td><td>Multi-Function Laser Printer</td></tr><tr><td>Output Color</td><td>Black &amp; White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Print</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Technology</td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td>Print Speed</td><td>Print speed black (ISO, letter): Up to 42 ppm<br>Print speed black (ISO, A4): Up to 40 ppm</td></tr><tr><td>Print Resolution</td><td>600 x 600 dpi (Normal)<br>1200 x 1200 dpi (Best)</td></tr><tr><td>First Print Out Time</td><td>6.3 Sec.</td></tr><tr><td>Duty Cycle up to (Yield)</td><td>Up to 80000 Pages</td></tr><tr><td>Duplex</td><td>Autometic</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Copy</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Copy Speed</td><td>40cpm</td></tr><tr><td>Copy Resolution</td><td>Up to 600 x 600 dpi</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Scan</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Scan Type</td><td>Flatbed, ADF</td></tr><tr><td>Scan Resolution</td><td>Up to 1200 x 1200 dpi</td></tr><tr><td>Duplex Scan</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Fax</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Transmission Speed (kbps)</td><td>33.6 kbps (maximum); 14.4 kbps (default)</td></tr><tr><td>Max Resolution</td><td>Up to 300 x 300 dpi</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Paper Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Paper Size</td><td>Tray 1: A4; A5; A6; B5 (JIS); Oficio (216 x 340 mm); 16K (195 x 270 mm); 16K (184 x 260 mm); 16K (197 x 273 mm); Japanese Postcard; Double Japan P