(272, 'HP Laser 108A Single Function Mono Laser Printer', 'The HP Laser 108A Single Function Mono Laser Printer is a compact and reliable monochrome laser printer designed for home and office use. Featuring print speeds of up to 21 ppm, 1200 x 1200 dpi resolution, a 150-sheet input tray, USB 2.0 connectivity, and support for manual duplex printing, it delivers professional-quality documents with excellent efficiency. Available at International Office Solution (IOSBD) with official warranty support.', 'hp-laser-108a-single-function-mono-laser-printer-1780571761', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>HP Laser 108A Single Function Mono Laser Printer</strong></h2><h2><strong>Long Description</strong></h2><p>The <strong>HP Laser 108A Single Function Mono Laser Printer</strong> is a compact, efficient, and cost-effective printing solution designed for home users, small businesses, and office environments. Built with HP\'s reliable laser printing technology, this printer delivers professional-quality monochrome documents with exceptional clarity and consistency, making it an ideal choice for invoices, reports, contracts, and everyday business printing needs.</p><p>Featuring a print resolution of up to <strong>1200 x 1200 dpi</strong>, the HP Laser 108A produces crisp text, sharp graphics, and clear documents that maintain a professional appearance. Whether printing important business documents or personal paperwork, users can expect consistent output quality with every print job.</p><p>Designed to enhance productivity, the HP Laser 108A offers print speeds of up to <strong>21 pages per minute (ppm)</strong>, helping users complete tasks quickly and efficiently. Its first-page-out performance minimizes waiting time, allowing businesses to maintain smooth workflows and improve overall productivity.</p><p>The printer supports a monthly duty cycle of up to <strong>10,000 pages</strong>, while the recommended monthly print volume of <strong>100 to 1,500 pages</strong> makes it perfectly suited for individual professionals, home offices, and small workgroups of up to five users.</p><p>For convenient paper handling, the HP Laser 108A includes a <strong>150-sheet input tray</strong> and a <strong>100-sheet output bin</strong>, reducing the need for frequent paper refills. It supports a wide range of media types, including A4, A5, envelopes, labels, cardstock, and other specialty papers with media weights ranging from 60 to 163 g/m².</p><p>The printer also supports <strong>manual duplex printing</strong> through the printer driver, enabling users to print on both sides of the paper and reduce overall paper consumption. This feature is particularly useful for businesses seeking to lower printing costs and support environmentally responsible practices.</p><p>Connectivity is simple and reliable with the built-in <strong>Hi-Speed USB 2.0 interface</strong>, ensuring quick installation and stable communication between the printer and connected devices. The HP Laser 108A is compatible with multiple operating systems, including Windows, macOS, Linux, Android, and iOS, providing flexibility across various work environments.</p><p>Powered by the <strong>HP 110A Original Black Toner Cartridge</strong>, the printer delivers an estimated yield of up to <strong>1,500 pages</strong>, helping users achieve cost-efficient printing with dependable performance. User-friendly controls include dedicated power and cancel buttons, along with clear LED indicators for power status, toner levels, and attention notifications.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>64MB of built-in memory</strong>, the HP Laser 108A efficiently handles everyday printing tasks while maintaining smooth performance, even when connected to entry-level computers and laptops.<strong>Reliable Printing Performance</strong></p><p>The HP Laser 108A is designed to provide dependable everyday printing with minimal maintenance requirements. Its compact footprint makes it easy to place on desks, counters, or workstations, while its durable design ensures long-lasting operation for both personal and professional use.</p><p>Whether you need to print business reports, school assignments, invoices, or office documents, the HP Laser 108A offers excellent value, reliability, and performance at an affordable cost.</p><h2><strong>Buy HP Laser 108A Single Function Mono Laser Printer from International Office Solution (IOSBD)</strong></h2><p>Purchase the genuine <strong>HP Laser 108A Single Function Mono Laser Printer</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution (IOSBD)</strong> and enjoy authentic HP products, competitive pricing, professional consultation, and dependable after-sales support. We provide reliable printing solutions for homes, offices, educational institutions, and businesses across Bangladesh.</p><p>Contact us today or place your order online to get the best deal on the HP Laser 108A Laser Printer.</p><h3><strong>Warranty Information</strong></h3><ul><li>1 Year Limited Warranty</li><li>Adapter/Power Cable: No Warranty</li><li>Original Box Required for Warranty Claims</li></ul>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>General</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Functions</td><td>Print Only</td></tr><tr><td>Printer Type</td><td>Single Function Mono laser Printer</td></tr><tr><td>Output Color</td><td>Black &amp; White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Print</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Technology</td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td>Print Speed</td><td>up to 21 ppm (black)</td></tr><tr><td>Print Resolution</td><td>Up to 1,200 x 1,200 dpi</td></tr><tr><td>Duty Cycle up to (Yield)</td><td>Up to 10,000 pages</td></tr><tr><td>Duplex</td><td>Manual</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Paper Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Paper Size</td><td>A4; A5; A5(LEF); B5 (JIS); Oficio; Envelope (DL, C5); 76 x 127 to 216 x 356mm</td></tr><tr><td>Paper Type</td><td>Plain, Thick, Thin, Cotton, Color, Preprinted, Recycled, Labels, CardStoc