(273, 'HP Laser 108A Single Function Mono Laser Printer', 'The HP Laser 108A Single Function Mono Laser Printer is a compact and reliable printing solution designed for home offices, small businesses, and professional workspaces. Featuring print speeds of up to 21 pages per minute, 1200 x 1200 dpi print resolution, and a monthly duty cycle of up to 10,000 pages, this printer delivers sharp text, consistent performance, and cost-effective monochrome printing.', 'hp-laser-108a-single-function-mono-laser-printer-1780577148', '<h2>HP Laser 108A Single Function Mono Laser Printer</h2><p>The HP Laser 108A Single Function Mono Laser Printer is built to deliver fast, efficient, and professional-quality monochrome printing for everyday business and personal use. Combining HP’s trusted laser technology with a compact design, this printer provides crisp text, clear graphics, and dependable performance for reports, invoices, contracts, and office documents.</p><h3>Exceptional Print Quality</h3><p>Powered by advanced laser printing technology, the HP Laser 108A produces sharp and professional documents with a print resolution of up to 1200 x 1200 dpi. Whether you\'re printing business reports, financial statements, or educational materials, every page appears clear and easy to read.</p><h3>Fast and Efficient Performance</h3><p>With print speeds of up to 21 pages per minute (A4), the HP Laser 108A helps improve productivity by reducing waiting times. Its efficient performance makes it an excellent choice for small offices, home offices, and businesses that require reliable daily printing.</p><h3>Designed for Everyday Workloads</h3><p>The printer supports a monthly duty cycle of up to 10,000 pages and a recommended monthly print volume of 100 to 1,500 pages. This makes it suitable for small teams and users who need consistent performance throughout the month.</p><h3>Convenient Paper Handling</h3><p>The HP Laser 108A comes equipped with a 150-sheet input tray and a 100-sheet output bin, allowing smooth and uninterrupted printing. It supports a variety of media types including:</p><ul><li>A4</li><li>A5</li><li>Letter</li><li>Envelopes</li><li>Labels</li><li>Cardstock</li><li>Custom Media Sizes</li></ul><p>The printer also supports media weights ranging from 60 to 163 g/m².</p><h3>Manual Duplex Printing</h3><p>To help reduce paper consumption and printing costs, the HP Laser 108A supports manual duplex printing through the printer driver, enabling users to print on both sides of the paper when needed.</p><h3>Simple Connectivity</h3><p>The printer features a Hi-Speed USB 2.0 interface for quick and stable connections. It is compatible with:</p><ul><li>Windows</li><li>macOS</li><li>Linux</li><li>Android</li><li>iOS</li></ul><p>This broad compatibility ensures easy integration into existing work environments.</p><h3>Cost-Effective Toner Performance</h3><p>The HP Laser 108A uses the HP 110A Original Black Toner Cartridge, which delivers an estimated yield of up to 1,500 pages. This helps reduce operating costs while maintaining consistent print quality.</p><h3>User-Friendly Design</h3><p>Designed for ease of use, the printer includes simple controls with dedicated Power and Cancel buttons. LED indicators provide clear status updates for power, toner levels, and printer alerts. With 64MB of built-in memory, it delivers reliable performance even when connected to entry-level computers.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul><li>Single Function Mono Laser Printer</li><li>Up to 21 ppm Print Speed</li><li>Up to 1200 x 1200 dpi Resolution</li><li>150-Sheet Input Tray</li><li>100-Sheet Output Bin</li><li>Manual Duplex Printing Support</li><li>Hi-Speed USB 2.0 Connectivity</li><li>HP 110A Toner Compatibility</li><li>Monthly Duty Cycle Up to 10,000 Pages</li><li>Compact Space-Saving Design</li></ul><h2>Why Choose the HP Laser 108A?</h2><p>The HP Laser 108A is an ideal choice for professionals, small businesses, educational institutions, and home users seeking affordab