(274, 'HP LaserJet 108w Single Function Mono Laser Printer', 'The HP LaserJet 108w Single Function Mono Laser Printer is a compact and reliable monochrome printer designed for home offices and small businesses. Featuring print speeds of up to 21 ppm, 1200 x 1200 dpi resolution, built-in Wi-Fi, Wi-Fi Direct, and mobile printing support, it delivers professional-quality documents with seamless wireless connectivity and cost-effective performance.', 'hp-laserjet-108w-single-function-mono-laser-printer-1780577672', '<h2>HP LaserJet 108w Single Function Mono Laser Printer</h2><p>The HP LaserJet 108w Single Function Mono Laser Printer is an ideal printing solution for users seeking fast, high-quality monochrome printing with the convenience of wireless connectivity. Designed for home users, professionals, and small businesses, this compact laser printer combines reliable performance, sharp print quality, and versatile connectivity options to enhance everyday productivity.</p><h2>Professional Print Quality</h2><p>The HP LaserJet 108w delivers crisp black text and sharp graphics with a print resolution of up to 1200 x 1200 dpi. Whether printing invoices, reports, contracts, or business documents, users can expect professional-quality output on every page.</p><h2>Fast and Efficient Printing</h2><p>With print speeds of up to 21 pages per minute (A4), the HP LaserJet 108w helps users complete printing tasks quickly and efficiently. Its monthly duty cycle of up to 10,000 pages ensures dependable performance for regular office and business workloads.</p><h2>Wireless and Mobile Printing Convenience</h2><p>One of the standout features of the HP LaserJet 108w is its comprehensive wireless connectivity. It includes:</p><ul><li>Built-in Wi-Fi 802.11 b/g/n</li><li>Wi-Fi Direct</li><li>Hi-Speed USB 2.0</li><li>HP Smart App Support</li><li>Apple AirPrint</li><li>Google Cloud Print</li><li>Mopria Certified Mobile Printing</li></ul><p>These connectivity options allow users to print directly from laptops, desktops, smartphones, and tablets without requiring a wired network connection.</p><h2>Flexible Media Handling</h2><p>The HP LaserJet 108w supports a wide variety of paper sizes and media types, making it suitable for diverse printing needs.</p><h3>Supported Paper Sizes</h3><ul><li>A4</li><li>A5</li><li>B5</li><li>Oficio</li><li>Executive</li><li>Envelopes (DL, C5)</li><li>Custom Sizes</li></ul><h3>Supported Media Types</h3><ul><li>Plain Paper</li><li>Thick Paper</li><li>Thin Paper</li><li>Cotton Paper</li><li>Colored Paper</li><li>Preprinted Paper</li><li>Recycled Paper</li><li>Labels</li><li>Cardstock</li><li>Bond Paper</li><li>Archive Paper</li></ul><p>The printer supports media weights ranging from 60 to 163 g/m².</p><h2>Efficient Paper Capacity</h2><p>The HP LaserJet 108w features:</p><ul><li>150-Sheet Input Tray</li><li>100-Sheet Output Bin</li><li>Up to 10 Envelopes Capacity</li></ul><p>This paper handling capability reduces interruptions and improves workflow efficiency.</p><h2>Manual Duplex Printing</h2><p>The printer supports manual duplex printing through the driver settings, enabling users to print on both sides of the paper while reducing paper consumption and operating costs.</p><h2>Energy-Efficient Design</h2><p>Designed with energy efficiency in mind, the HP LaserJet 108w minimizes power consumption while maintaining excellent performance.</p><ul><li>320W During Printing</li><li>33W Ready Mode</li><li>Ultra-Low Power Usage in Sleep and Off Modes</li></ul><p>This helps reduce electricity costs for businesses and home users alike.</p><h2>HP 110A Toner Compatibility</h2><p>The printer uses HP 110A Original Black Laser Toner Cartridges (W1110A/W1112A), offering an approximate yield of up to 1,500 pages. This ensures consistent print quality and cost-effective operation.</p><h2>Simple and User-Friendly Operation</h2><p>The sleek white design features an intuitive control panel with:</p><ul><li>Power Button</li><li>Cancel Button</li><li>Wireless Button</li><li>LED Status Indicators</li></ul><p>The LED indicators provide quick updates on power, wireless connection status, toner levels, and printer alerts.</p><h2>Key Features</h2><ul><li>Single Function Mono Laser Printer</li><li>Up to 21 ppm Print Speed</li><li>Up to 1200 x 1200 dpi Print Resolution</li><li>Built-in Wi-Fi and Wi-Fi Direct</li><li>HP Smart App Mobile Printing</li><li>Apple AirPrint &amp; Mopria Support</li><li>150-Sheet Input Capacity</li><li>100-Sheet Output Capacity</li><li>Manual Duplex Printing</li><li>HP 110A Toner Compatible</li><li>Monthly Duty Cycle Up to 10,000 Pages</li><li>Compact Space-Saving Design</li></ul><h2>Why Choose the HP LaserJet 108w?</h2><p>The HP LaserJet 108w is an excellent choice for users who need fast, reliable, and wireless monochrome printing. Its combination of professional print quality, mobile printing capabilities, compact design, and low operating costs makes it one of the best entry-level laser printers for home offices and small businesses.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Buy HP LaserJet 108w Single Function Mono Laser Printer from International Office Solution (IOSBD)</h2><p>Purchase the original HP LaserJet 108w Single Function Mono Laser Printer from International Office Solution (IOSBD), your trusted source for genuine HP printers and office equipment in Bangladesh. We offer competitive pricing, reliable support, and authentic products for businesses, educational institutions, and home users.</p><p>Order online today or contact International Office Solution (IOSBD) to get the best deal on the HP LaserJet 108w Mono Laser Printer.</p><h3>Warranty</h3><p>1-Year Limited Warranty (Adapter/Power Cable Warranty Not Included)</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>General</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Functions</td><td>Print Only</td></tr><tr><td>Printer Type</td><td>Single Function Mono laser Printer</td></tr><tr><td>Output Color</td><td>Black &amp; Whi