(275, 'HP Laser 1008w Single Function Mono Laser Printer', 'The HP Laser 1008w Single Function Mono Laser Printer is a compact and efficient wireless laser printer designed for home users, professionals, and small businesses. Featuring print speeds of up to 20 pages per minute, built-in Wi-Fi, USB connectivity, and HP\'s trusted laser technology, it delivers sharp black-and-white documents with reliable performance and effortless wireless printing.', 'hp-laser-1008w-single-function-mono-laser-printer-1780578086', '<h2>HP Laser 1008w Single Function Mono Laser Printer</h2><p>The HP Laser 1008w Single Function Mono Laser Printer is an excellent printing solution for users seeking fast, dependable, and cost-effective monochrome printing. Designed with simplicity and efficiency in mind, this compact printer provides high-quality black-and-white output while offering wireless connectivity for modern work environments.</p><p>Whether you\'re printing business reports, invoices, contracts, educational materials, or everyday documents, the HP Laser 1008w delivers professional results with consistent performance.</p><h2>High-Quality Monochrome Printing</h2><p>Powered by HP\'s advanced laser printing technology, the HP Laser 1008w produces crisp text, sharp graphics, and professional-quality documents. Every page is printed with exceptional clarity, making it ideal for office documents, presentations, forms, and official paperwork.</p><h2>Fast Printing Performance</h2><p>The HP Laser 1008w offers print speeds of up to 20 pages per minute (ISO), helping users complete printing tasks quickly and efficiently. Its responsive performance minimizes waiting time, allowing you to stay productive throughout the day.</p><h3>Benefits of Fast Printing</h3><ul><li>Quick document output</li><li>Increased workplace productivity</li><li>Efficient handling of daily print jobs</li><li>Reduced waiting time for multi-page documents</li></ul><h2>Wireless and USB Connectivity</h2><p>The HP Laser 1008w is equipped with built-in Wi-Fi and USB connectivity, providing flexible printing options for both personal and business users.</p><h3>Connectivity Features</h3><ul><li>Built-in Wi-Fi</li><li>USB Interface</li><li>Wireless Printing from PCs and Laptops</li><li>Mobile Printing Support</li><li>Network-Based Printing Convenience</li></ul><p>With wireless functionality, users can print from multiple devices without the need for complicated cable setups.</p><h2>Supports Multiple Paper Sizes</h2><p>The HP Laser 1008w is designed to handle a variety of document types and paper formats.</p><h3>Supported Paper Sizes</h3><ul><li>A4</li><li>A5</li><li>Letter</li><li>Legal</li><li>Custom Sizes</li></ul><p>Its ability to support paper sizes up to Legal makes it suitable for printing contracts, business forms, legal documents, and professional reports.</p><h2>Compact and Space-Saving Design</h2><p>The sleek and modern design of the HP Laser 1008w allows it to fit comfortably on office desks, home workstations, and small business environments.</p><h3>Ideal For</h3><ul><li>Home Offices</li><li>Small Businesses</li><li>Educational Institutions</li><li>Remote Workers</li><li>Professional Workspaces</li></ul><p>Its compact footprint ensures maximum productivity without occupying excessive desk space.</p><h2>Reliable Everyday Performance</h2><p>Built for consistent daily use, the HP Laser 1008w offers dependable printing performance for users who require a reliable monochrome printer. Whether handling occasional print jobs or daily workloads, this printer delivers smooth and uninterrupted operation.</p><h2>Environmentally Conscious Printing</h2><p>HP\'s commitment to sustainability is reflected in the HP Laser 1008w\'s energy-efficient design. The printer helps reduce energy consumption while maintaining excellent print quality and operational efficiency.</p><h3>Sustainability Benefits</h3><ul><li>Reduced Power Consumption</li><li>Lower Environmental Impact</li><li>Efficient Toner Usage</li><li>Responsible Printing Solution</li></ul><h2>Key Features</h2><ul><li>Single Function Mono Laser Printer</li><li>Up to 20 Pages Per Minute Print Speed</li><li>Built-in Wi-Fi Connectivity</li><li>USB Connectivity</li><li>High-Quality Black-and-White Printing</li><li>Supports Paper Sizes up to Legal</li><li>Compact and Lightweight Design</li><li>Professional Print Output</li><li>Energy-Efficient Operation</li><li>Ideal for Home and Office Use</li></ul><h2>Why Choose the HP Laser 1008w?</h2><p>The HP Laser 1008w is the perfect choice for users looking for a compact, wireless, and affordable laser printer. Its combination of reliable performance, fast print speeds, wireless convenience, and professional-quality output makes it an excellent solution for home offices, remote workers, students, and small businesses.</p><p>With HP\'s trusted laser technology and user-friendly operation, the HP Laser 1008w delivers dependable printing whenever you need it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Buy HP Laser 1008w Single Function Mono Laser Printer from International Office Solution (IOSBD)</h2><p>Purchase the original HP Laser 1008w Single Function Mono Laser Printer from International Office Solution (IOSBD), a trusted supplier of genuine HP printers and office equipment in Bangladesh.</p><p>We offer authentic products, competitive pricing, and professional support for businesses, educational institutions, and home users. Order online today or contact International Office Solution (IOSBD) to get the best deal on the HP Laser 1008w Wireless Mono Laser Printer.</p><h3>Warranty</h3><p>1-Year Limited Warranty (Adapter/Power Cable Warranty Not Included)</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>General</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Functions</td><td>Print Only</td></tr><tr><td>Printer Type</td><td>Single Function Mono laser Printer</td></tr><tr><td>Output Color</td><td>Black &amp; White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Prin