<td>128 MB</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>LED display</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Interface (Built-in): USB</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>Power Source/ Power Consumption: 300W</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>406 x 359.6 x 253mm</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>7.46 kg</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Support</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Toner/ Cartridge/ Refill</td><td>HP 166A Black Toner (1500 Pages)<br>(Please make sure your existing &amp; mentioned toner/cartridge/ink bottle models are the same before buying a new one)</td></tr><tr><td>Software</td><td>Windows 11 : 64-bit, Windows 10, 7: 32-bit or 64-bit, Intel Pentium IV 1 GHz or higher, 1 GB RAM, 16 GB HDD. OS X v10.11 or newer, AirPrint 1.8 compatible with MacOS 10.11, 1.5 GB HD, Internet, USB.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1-year Limited warranty, an Adapter/Power Cable with no warranty, and also a Box Mandatory While Claiming.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 19000.00, 189000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/etmjHI6PeUc5G6eiTDzXwrhXUlkhXaDbUwLkvd2B.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-04 13:27:53', '2026-06-04 13:27:53', 'HP LaserJet MFP 1188a Multifunction Mono Laser Printer Price in Bangladesh | IOSBD', 'Buy HP LaserJet MFP 1188a Multifunction Mono Laser Printer from IOSBD. Enjoy print, scan, copy functions, 21ppm print speed, compact design, and professional monochrome printing for home and office use.', 'HP LaserJet MFP 1188a, HP 1188a Printer, HP Multifunction Printer, HP Mono Laser Printer, Print Scan Copy Printer, HP Printer Bangladesh, HP LaserJet Price BD, Office Printer, Business Printer, IOSBD, International Office Solution', NULL, 1, NULL, NULL);
