(277, 'HP LaserJet MFP M141a Multifunctional Laser Printer', 'The HP LaserJet MFP M141a Multifunctional Laser Printer is a compact all-in-one monochrome laser printer designed for home offices and small businesses. Featuring print, copy, and scan functions, print speeds of up to 20 ppm, a high-resolution flatbed scanner, and HP Auto-On/Auto-Off technology, it delivers professional-quality documents with reliable performance and energy-efficient operation.', 'hp-laserjet-mfp-m141a-multifunctional-laser-printer-1780579997', '<h2>HP LaserJet MFP M141a Multifunctional Laser Printer</h2><p>The HP LaserJet MFP M141a Multifunctional Laser Printer is an efficient and space-saving all-in-one printing solution built for modern workplaces. Combining printing, scanning, and copying capabilities into a compact device, it offers exceptional performance, professional-quality output, and user-friendly operation for small businesses, home offices, educational institutions, and professional users.</p><p>Designed with HP’s trusted laser technology, the M141a delivers fast printing, high-quality scanning, and dependable everyday productivity while maintaining a compact footprint that fits comfortably into any workspace.</p><h2>All-in-One Productivity</h2><p>The HP LaserJet MFP M141a combines three essential office functions in one device:</p><ul><li>Print</li><li>Copy</li><li>Scan</li></ul><p>This multifunction capability helps reduce equipment costs, save workspace, and improve productivity by handling multiple document tasks from a single machine.</p><h2>Fast and Reliable Printing Performance</h2><p>The printer delivers impressive monochrome printing speeds of:</p><ul><li>Up to 20 Pages Per Minute (A4)</li><li>Up to 21 Pages Per Minute (Letter)</li></ul><p>The first page can be printed in as little as 8.3 seconds, helping users complete tasks quickly and efficiently.</p><h3>Monthly Duty Cycle</h3><ul><li>Up to 8,000 Pages Monthly</li></ul><p>This makes the HP LaserJet MFP M141a ideal for users with moderate to heavy document printing requirements.</p><h2>Professional Laser Print Quality</h2><p>Powered by HP LaserJet technology, the M141a produces sharp black text and clear graphics suitable for:</p><ul><li>Business Reports</li><li>Invoices</li><li>Contracts</li><li>Forms</li><li>Educational Materials</li><li>Office Documents</li><li>Professional Correspondence</li></ul><p>The printer uses the HP 150A Black Original Laser Toner Cartridge, offering an approximate page yield of up to 975 pages.</p><h2>High-Quality Flatbed Scanning</h2><p>The integrated flatbed scanner allows users to scan documents and images with excellent clarity.</p><h3>Scanner Features</h3><ul><li>Optical Resolution Up to 600 ppi</li><li>Color Scanning Support</li><li>Flatbed Scan Design</li><li>Accurate Document Reproduction</li></ul><h3>Supported Scan File Formats</h3><ul><li>JPG</li><li>PNG</li><li>TIFF</li><li>PDF</li><li>RAW (BMP)</li></ul><p>The scanner is compatible with HP LaserJet Scan Software and TWAIN/WIA-compliant applications, ensuring broad compatibility across different operating systems and workflows.</p><h2>Efficient Copying Functionality</h2><p>The HP LaserJet MFP M141a includes a convenient copy function for everyday document duplication.</p><h3>Copy Features</h3><ul><li>Up to 99 Copies</li><li>Lighter/Darker Adjustment</li><li>Paper Optimization Settings</li><li>Fast Copy Performance</li></ul><p>This allows users to efficiently reproduce business documents, forms, and reports without requiring additional equipment.</p><h2>Flexible Paper Handling</h2><p>The printer supports multiple paper sizes and media types, making it suitable for a wide variety of printing needs.</p><h3>Supported Media Sizes</h3><ul><li>A4</li><li>A5</li><li>A6</li><li>Envelopes</li><li>Custom Sizes</li></ul><h3>Paper Capacity</h3><ul><li>150-Sheet Input Tray</li><li>100-Sheet Output Bin</li><li>Up to 10 Envelopes Capacity</li></ul><p>These capacities help maintain smooth workflows and reduce interruptions during printing.</p><h2>Easy-to-Use Control Panel</h2><p>The HP LaserJet MFP M141a features a simple LED display and intuitive control panel for effortless operation.</p><h3>Control Buttons</h3><ul><li>Power</li><li>Copy</li><li>Cancel</li></ul><p>Its user-friendly interface makes daily operation straightforward for both experienced and first-time users.</p><h2>Advanced Performance and Connectivity</h2><p>The printer is powered by:</p><ul><li>500 MHz Processor</li><li>64 MB Memory</li></ul><p>Connectivity is provided through a High-Speed USB interface, ensuring stable and reliable communication with connected devices.</p><h3>Supported Print Languages</h3><ul><li>PCLm</li><li>PCLmS</li><li>URF</li><li>PWG</li></ul><p>These technologies ensure smooth print processing and compatibility with modern operating systems.</p><h2>Energy-Efficient and Environmentally Responsible</h2><p>The HP LaserJet MFP M141a incorporates HP Auto-On/Auto-Off Technology, helping reduce energy consumption without compromising productivity.</p><h3>Environmental Certifications</h3><ul><li>Blue Angel Certified</li><li>EPEAT® Silver Registered</li></ul><p>These certifications demonstrate HP\'s commitment to sustainability and environmentally responsible printing solutions.</p><h2>Key Features</h2><ul><li>Multifunction Laser Printer (Print, Copy, Scan)</li><li>Up to 20 ppm Print Speed</li><li>First Page Out in 8.3 Seconds</li><li>Flatbed Color Scanner</li><li>Optical Scan Resolution Up to 600 ppi</li><li>Up to 99 Copies</li><li>150-Sheet Input Tray</li><li>100-Sheet Output Bin</li><li>HP 150A Toner Cartridge Support</li><li>500 MHz Processor</li><li>64 MB Memory</li><li>High-Speed USB Connectivity</li><li>HP Auto-On/Auto-Off Technology</li><li>Compact and Space-Saving Design</li></ul><h2>Why Choose the HP LaserJet MFP M141a?</h2><p>The HP LaserJet MFP M141a is an excellent choice for professionals and businesses seeking a reliable, compact, and affordable multifunction laser printer. Its combination of printing, scanning, and copying capabilities, along with fast performance and energy-efficient operation, makes it an ideal solution for modern work environments.</p><p>Whether you need to print reports, scan documents, or make quick copies, the HP LaserJet MFP M141a delivers dependable performance and exceptional value.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Buy HP LaserJet MFP M141a Multifunctional Laser Printer from International Office Solution (IOSBD)</h2><p>Purchase the original HP LaserJet MFP M141a Multifunctional Laser Printer from International Office Solution (IOSBD), your trusted source for genuine HP printers and office automation products in Bangladesh.</p><p>We offer authentic HP products, competitive pricing, and dedicated customer support for businesses, educational institutions, and home offices. Order online today or contact International Office Solution (IOSBD) to get the best deal on the HP LaserJet MFP M141a.</p><h3>Warranty</h3><p>1-Year Official Warranty</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>General</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Functions</td><td>Print, copy, scan</td></tr><tr><td>Printer Type</td><td>Multifunction Laser</td></tr><tr><td>Output Color</td><td>Black &amp; White<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Print</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Technology</td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td>Print Speed</td><td>Up to 21 ppm (black)</td></tr><tr><td>Print Resolution</td><td>Up to 600 x 600 dpi</td></tr><tr><td>Duty Cycle up to (Yield)</td><td>Up to 8,000 pages</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Copy</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Copy Speed</td><td>Copy Speed (Black, Normal Quality, A4): Up to 20 cpm<br>Copy Speed Black (Normal, Letter): Up to 21 cpm</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Scan</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Scan Type</td><td>Flatbed</td></tr><tr><td>Scan Resolution</td><td>Up to 600 ppi</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum Scan Size</td><td>216 to 297 mm</td></tr><tr><td c