(279, 'HP Laser MFP 136a Multifunction Laser Printer', 'The HP Laser MFP 136a Multifunction Laser Printer is a compact and efficient all-in-one monochrome laser printer designed for home offices and businesses. Featuring print, scan, and copy functionality, up to 21 ppm print speed, 1200 x 1200 dpi print resolution, and a high-resolution flatbed scanner, it delivers professional-quality documents with reliable performance and cost-effective operation.', 'hp-laser-mfp-136a-multifunction-laser-printer-1780580870', '<h2>HP Laser MFP 136a Multifunction Laser Printer</h2><p>The HP Laser MFP 136a Multifunction Laser Printer is an all-in-one monochrome printing solution that combines printing, scanning, and copying capabilities in a compact and user-friendly design. Built for productivity, this multifunction laser printer offers fast performance, high-quality output, and dependable operation, making it an ideal choice for small businesses, home offices, educational institutions, and professional users.</p><p>With HP’s trusted laser technology, the HP Laser MFP 136a delivers crisp text, sharp graphics, and efficient document management for everyday business and personal tasks.</p><h2>All-in-One Productivity</h2><p>The HP Laser MFP 136a combines three essential office functions into a single device:</p><ul><li>Print</li><li>Copy</li><li>Scan</li></ul><p>This multifunction design helps save space, reduce equipment costs, and streamline office workflows by eliminating the need for separate devices.</p><h2>Professional-Quality Laser Printing</h2><p>The HP Laser MFP 136a produces sharp black-and-white documents with a print resolution of up to 1200 x 1200 dpi, ensuring professional-quality output for every task.</p><h3>Ideal For Printing</h3><ul><li>Business Reports</li><li>Contracts</li><li>Invoices</li><li>Forms</li><li>Office Documents</li><li>Educational Materials</li><li>Professional Correspondence</li></ul><p>Its advanced laser technology guarantees consistent and reliable results on every page.</p><h2>Fast Printing Performance</h2><p>Designed to improve workplace productivity, the HP Laser MFP 136a offers:</p><ul><li>Up to 21 Pages Per Minute (A4)</li><li>First Page Out in as Fast as 8.3 Seconds</li></ul><p>This fast output allows users to handle daily printing tasks efficiently while reducing wait times.</p><h2>Reliable Monthly Duty Cycle</h2><p>The HP Laser MFP 136a is built for consistent workloads with a monthly duty cycle of up to:</p><ul><li>10,000 Pages</li></ul><p>This makes it a dependable solution for businesses and offices with regular printing requirements.</p><h2>Advanced Flatbed Scanning</h2><p>The integrated flatbed scanner uses Contact Image Sensor (CIS) technology to capture documents and images with excellent clarity and accuracy.</p><h3>Scanner Features</h3><ul><li>Optical Resolution: Up to 600 x 600 dpi</li><li>Enhanced Resolution: Up to 4800 x 4800 dpi</li><li>Maximum Scan Size: A4</li><li>High-Quality Image Reproduction</li></ul><h3>Supported Scan File Formats</h3><ul><li>PDF</li><li>JPG</li><li>TIFF</li></ul><p>This flexibility makes document archiving, sharing, and digital storage easier than ever.</p><h2>Efficient Copying Functionality</h2><p>The HP Laser MFP 136a offers fast and reliable copying performance.</p><h3>Copy Features</h3><ul><li>Up to 20 Copies Per Minute</li><li>Copy Resolution: 600 x 600 dpi</li><li>Sharp and Accurate Reproduction</li><li>Ideal for Office and Business Use</li></ul><p>Users can quickly duplicate documents without compromising quality.</p><h2>Flexible Paper Handling</h2><p>The printer supports a variety of media types and sizes, providing flexibility for different printing requirements.</p><h3>Supported Media Types</h3><ul><li>Plain Paper</li><li>Recycled Paper</li><li>Labels</li><li>Envelopes</li></ul><h3>Paper Capacity</h3><ul><li>150-Sheet Input Tray</li><li>100-Sheet Output Bin</li></ul><p>This efficient paper handling system helps reduce interruptions and improve workflow.</p><h2>Powerful Performance</h2><p>The HP Laser MFP 136a is powered by:</p><ul><li>600 MHz Processor</li><li>128 MB Memory</li></ul><p>These specifications ensure smooth print processing, efficient multitasking, and reliable operation during demanding workloads.</p><h2>Manual Duplex Printing</h2><p>Manual duplex printing support allows users to print on both sides of the paper, helping reduce paper consumption and operational costs.</p><h3>Benefits</h3><ul><li>Lower Paper Usage</li><li>Reduced Printing Costs</li><li>Environmentally Friendly Operation</li></ul><h2>User-Friendly Design</h2><p>The printer features an intuitive 2-line LCD display and easy-to-use control panel for simplified operation.</p><h3>User Experience Features</h3><ul><li>Clear LCD Display</li><li>Simple Navigation Controls</li><li>Easy Job Management</li><li>Quick Access to Printer Functions</li></ul><p>This makes the printer suitable for users of all experience levels.</p><h2>Energy-Efficient Operation</h2><p>HP Auto-Off Technology helps reduce power consumption by automatically turning off the printer during periods of inactivity.</p><h3>Sustainability Benefits</h3><ul><li>Lower Energy Consumption</li><li>Reduced Operating Costs</li><li>Environmentally Responsible Printing</li></ul><p>The printer also meets various eco-label certifications that support sustainable business practices.</p><h2>Compatibility and Connectivity</h2><p>The HP Laser MFP 136a integrates easily into different work environments through its reliable USB connectivity.</p><h3>Supported Platforms</h3><ul><li>Windows</li><li>macOS</li></ul><h3>Connectivity</h3><ul><li>High-Speed USB Interface</li></ul><p>This ensures stable communication and seamless integration with modern computer systems.</p><h2>Key Features</h2><ul><li>Multifunction Laser Printer (Print, Scan, Copy)</li><li>Up to 21 ppm Print Speed</li><li>1200 x 1200 dpi Print Resolution</li><li>Flatbed CIS Scanner</li><li>Up to 4800 x 4800 dpi Enhanced Scan Resolution</li