(280, 'HP Laser MFP 136w Multifunction Laser Printer', 'The HP Laser MFP 136w Multifunction Laser Printer is a compact all-in-one monochrome laser printer designed for home offices, small businesses, and professional users. Featuring print, scan, and copy functions, wireless connectivity, print speeds of up to 21 ppm, and high', 'hp-laser-mfp-136w-multifunction-laser-printer-1780581576', '<h2>HP Laser MFP 136w Multifunction Laser Printer</h2><p>The HP Laser MFP 136w Multifunction Laser Printer is a powerful and efficient all-in-one printing solution that combines printing, scanning, and copying capabilities in a single compact device. Designed to meet the demands of modern offices and home workspaces, this multifunction laser printer delivers professional-quality monochrome output, advanced connectivity options, and dependable performance for everyday document management.</p><p>With built-in Wi-Fi, fast print speeds, and high-resolution scanning, the HP Laser MFP 136w provides everything needed to streamline workflow and improve productivity.</p><h2>All-in-One Functionality</h2><p>The HP Laser MFP 136w combines three essential office functions into one compact machine:</p><ul><li>Print</li><li>Scan</li><li>Copy</li></ul><p>This multifunction capability reduces equipment costs, saves workspace, and enhances efficiency by allowing users to manage all document-related tasks from a single device.</p><h2>Professional Laser Printing Performance</h2><p>The HP Laser MFP 136w utilizes advanced laser technology to produce crisp text, sharp graphics, and professional-quality black-and-white documents.</p><h3>Print Performance</h3><ul><li>Up to 21 Pages Per Minute (Letter)</li><li>Up to 20 Pages Per Minute (A4)</li><li>First Page Out in as Fast as 8.3 Seconds</li><li>Print Resolution Up to 1200 x 1200 dpi</li></ul><p>This high-speed performance ensures smooth handling of business reports, contracts, invoices, forms, and everyday office documents.</p><h2>Advanced Flatbed Scanning</h2><p>The integrated flatbed scanner uses Contact Image Sensor (CIS) technology to capture documents and images with remarkable clarity.</p><h3>Scanner Features</h3><ul><li>Optical Scan Resolution: 600 x 600 dpi</li><li>Enhanced Scan Resolution: Up to 4800 x 4800 dpi</li><li>Maximum Scan Size: 216 x 297 mm</li><li>Color and Monochrome Scanning Support</li></ul><h3>Supported Scan Formats</h3><ul><li>PDF</li><li>JPG</li><li>TIFF</li><li>PNG</li><li>BMP</li></ul><p>This flexibility allows users to easily archive, share, and manage digital documents.</p><h2>Fast and Accurate Copying</h2><p>The HP Laser MFP 136w provides reliable copy performance for everyday office requirements.</p><h3>Copy Features</h3><ul><li>Up to 20 Copies Per Minute</li><li>Copy Resolution: 600 x 600 dpi</li><li>Clear Text and Sharp Details</li><li>Efficient Multi-Page Copying</li></ul><p>The copier delivers consistent quality for reports, forms, contracts, and other business documents.</p><h2>Wireless and USB Connectivity</h2><p>One of the standout features of the HP Laser MFP 136w is its versatile connectivity options.</p><h3>Connectivity Features</h3><ul><li>Built-in Wi-Fi</li><li>High-Speed USB Interface</li><li>Wireless Network Printing</li><li>Shared Office Printing</li><li>Easy Device Integration</li></ul><p>Wireless connectivity allows multiple users to print conveniently from computers and compatible devices without requiring a direct cable connection.</p><h2>Flexible Paper Handling</h2><p>The HP Laser MFP 136w supports a wide variety of paper types and sizes to accommodate diverse business needs.</p><h3>Supported Media Types</h3><ul><li>Plain Paper</li><li>Thick Paper</li><li>Thin Paper</li><li>Cotton Paper</li><li>Colored Paper</li><li>Preprinted Paper</li><li>Recycled Paper</li><li>Cardstock</li><li>Bond Paper</li><li>Archive Paper</li><li>Envelopes</li></ul><h3>Paper Capacity</h3><ul><li>150-Sheet Input Tray</li><li>100-Sheet Output Tray</li></ul><p>This efficient paper handling system minimizes interruptions and improves workflow productivity.</p><h2>Manual Duplex Printing</h2><p>Manual duplex printing support enables users to print on both sides of the paper, helping reduce paper consumption and operational costs.</p><h3>Benefits</h3><ul><li>Reduced Paper Usage</li><li>Lower Printing Expenses</li><li>Eco-Friendly Operation</li></ul><h2>Powerful Processing Performance</h2><p>The HP Laser MFP 136w is equipped with:</p><ul><li>600 MHz Processor</li><li>128 MB Memory</li></ul><p>This hardware configuration ensures smooth operation, fast document processing, and efficient multitasking.</p><h2>Enhanced Security Features</h2><p>The printer includes multiple security technologies designed to protect sensitive business information.</p><h3>Security Features</h3><ul><li>Password-Protected Network Management</li><li>SNMP v1/v2/v3 Support</li><li>IPSec Security</li><li>IPv4 Filtering</li><li>IPv6 Filtering</li><li>MAC Address Filtering</li></ul><p>These advanced protections help secure network communications and document workflows.</p><h2>User-Friendly Operation</h2><p>The HP Laser MFP 136w features a simple and intuitive control panel with a clear 2-line LCD display.</p><h3>User Experience Features</h3><ul><li>Easy Navigation</li><li>Quick Access Controls</li><li>Clear Status Monitoring</li><li>Simplified Printer Management</li></ul><p>This intuitive design makes the printer suitable for both beginners and experienced office users.</p><h2>Energy-Efficient Design</h2><p>HP Auto-Off Technology automatically reduces power consumption during periods of inactivity, helping businesses lower operating costs.</p><h3>Sustainability Benefits</h3><ul><li>Reduced Energy Usage</li><li>Lower Electricity Costs</li><li>Environmentally Responsible Printing</li></ul><p>The HP Laser MFP 136w is designed to balance productivity with sustainability.</p><h2>Compact and Space-Saving Design</h2><p>With dimensions of just 406 x 359.6 x 253 mm and a weight of approximately 7.46 kg, the HP Laser MFP 136w fits easily into small office environments and home workspaces without sacrificing functionality.</p><h2>Key Features</h2><ul><li>Multifunction Laser Printer (Print, Scan, Copy)</li><li>Up to 21 ppm Print Speed</li><li>1200 x 1200 dpi Print Resolution</li><li>CIS Flatbed Scanner</li><li>Up to 4800 x 4800 dpi Enhanced Scan Resolution</li><li>Wireless Wi-Fi Connectivity</li><li>USB Connectivity</li><li>150-Sheet Input Tray</li><li>100-Sheet Output Tray</li><li>Manual Duplex Printing</li><li>600 MHz Processor</li><li>128 MB Memory</li><li>Advanced Security Features</li><li>HP Auto-Off Technology</li><li>Compact and Lightweight Design</li></ul><h2>Why Choose the HP Laser MFP 136w?</h2><p>The HP Laser MFP 136w is an excellent choice for users seeking a compact, reliable, and wireless multifunction laser printer. Its combination of professional-quality printing, high-resolution scanning, fast copying, wireless networking, and advanced security features makes it an ideal solution for home offices, small businesses, and professional environments.</p><p>Whether you need to print reports, scan important documents, or share resources across a network, the HP Laser MFP 136w delivers dependable performance and exceptional value.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Buy HP Laser MFP 136w Multifunction Laser Printer from International Office Solution (IOSBD)</h2><p>Purchase the original HP Laser MFP 136w Multifunction Laser Printer from International Office Solution (IOSBD), your trusted source for genuine HP printers and office automation products in Bangladesh.</p><p>We offer authentic HP products, competitive prices, and professional support for businesses, educational institutions, and home users. Order online today or contact International Office Solution (IOSBD) to get the best deal on the HP Laser MFP 136w.</p><h3>Warranty</h3><p>1-Year Limited Warranty (Adapter/Power Cable Warranty Not Included)</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th col