(282, 'HP LaserJet Pro 4003dn Single Function Mono Laser Printer', 'The HP LaserJet Pro 4003dn Single Function Mono Laser Printer is a high-performance business printer designed for demanding office environments. Featuring print speeds of up to 40 pages per minute, automatic duplex printing, Gigabit Ethernet connectivity, a powerful 1200 MHz processor, and a monthly duty cycle of up to 80,000 pages, it delivers exceptional productivity, reliability, and professional-quality monochrome printing.', 'hp-laserjet-pro-4003dn-single-function-mono-laser-printer-1780582397', '<h2>HP LaserJet Pro 4003dn Single Function Mono Laser Printer</h2><p>The HP LaserJet Pro 4003dn Single Function Mono Laser Printer is engineered to meet the needs of busy offices and workgroups that require fast, secure, and reliable monochrome printing. Combining high-speed performance, robust paper handling, automatic duplex printing, and network connectivity, this printer is designed to maximize productivity while maintaining exceptional print quality.</p><p>Whether you\'re printing reports, invoices, contracts, business forms, or large document volumes, the HP LaserJet Pro 4003dn delivers consistent results and dependable performance.</p><h2>High-Speed Business Printing</h2><p>The HP LaserJet Pro 4003dn is built for efficiency, offering print speeds of up to:</p><ul><li>40 Pages Per Minute (PPM)</li></ul><p>Its rapid output helps businesses reduce waiting times and improve workflow efficiency, making it ideal for high-volume printing environments.</p><h3>Productivity Benefits</h3><ul><li>Faster Document Processing</li><li>Reduced Waiting Time</li><li>Increased Workplace Efficiency</li><li>Improved Team Productivity</li></ul><h2>Professional Monochrome Print Quality</h2><p>Using advanced HP laser technology, the printer produces sharp text, deep blacks, and clear graphics for professional-looking documents.</p><h3>Ideal For Printing</h3><ul><li>Business Reports</li><li>Contracts</li><li>Invoices</li><li>Financial Documents</li><li>Office Forms</li><li>Corporate Correspondence</li><li>Administrative Documents</li></ul><p>Every page is printed with precision, ensuring professional presentation and readability.</p><h2>Powerful Performance</h2><p>At the heart of the HP LaserJet Pro 4003dn is a high-performance:</p><ul><li>1200 MHz Processor</li><li>256 MB Memory</li></ul><p>This powerful combination allows the printer to process large print jobs efficiently while maintaining smooth and responsive performance.</p><h3>Performance Advantages</h3><ul><li>Faster Job Processing</li><li>Improved Workflow Management</li><li>Efficient Multitasking</li><li>Consistent High-Speed Operation</li></ul><h2>Automatic Duplex Printing</h2><p>The HP LaserJet Pro 4003dn supports automatic duplex printing, allowing users to print on both sides of the paper automatically.</p><h3>Benefits</h3><ul><li>Reduced Paper Consumption</li><li>Lower Printing Costs</li><li>Improved Sustainability</li><li>Professional Double-Sided Documents</li></ul><p>This feature is especially valuable for businesses looking to reduce operational expenses and support environmentally responsible printing.</p><h2>Flexible Paper Handling</h2><p>The printer is equipped with multiple paper input options to support demanding workloads.</p><h3>Paper Capacity</h3><ul><li>100-Sheet Input Tray</li><li>250-Sheet Multipurpose/Input Tray</li></ul><p>The flexible paper handling system helps reduce interruptions and improve productivity during large print jobs.</p><h2>Network and USB Connectivity</h2><p>The HP LaserJet Pro 4003dn provides versatile connectivity options for seamless integration into office environments.</p><h3>Connectivity Features</h3><ul><li>High-Speed USB</li><li>Gigabit Ethernet (LAN)</li><li>Network Printing Support</li><li>Shared Office Access</li></ul><p>The built-in LAN connection allows multiple users to access the printer across the office network, improving collaboration and workflow efficiency.</p><h2