(284, 'HP Laser MFP 137fnw Multifunction Mono Laser Printer', 'The HP Laser MFP 137fnw Multifunction Mono Laser Printer is a versatile all-in-one solution designed for home offices and small businesses. Featuring print, copy, scan, and fax capabilities, wireless connectivity, a 40-sheet Automatic Document Feeder (ADF), and print speeds of up to 21 pages per minute, it delivers professional-quality monochrome printing and seamless productivity in a compact design.', 'hp-laser-mfp-137fnw-multifunction-mono-laser-printer-1780583052', '<h2>HP Laser MFP 137fnw Multifunction Mono Laser Printer</h2><p>The HP Laser MFP 137fnw Multifunction Mono Laser Printer is a powerful and affordable all-in-one laser printer that combines printing, copying, scanning, and faxing into a single compact device. Designed for professionals, home offices, and small businesses, it delivers reliable performance, exceptional print quality, and convenient connectivity options to streamline everyday document management.</p><p>Built with HP’s trusted laser technology, the HP Laser MFP 137fnw produces crisp text, sharp graphics, and professional-quality monochrome documents while helping users stay productive and organized.</p><h2>4-in-1 Multifunction Productivity</h2><p>The HP Laser MFP 137fnw offers four essential office functions in one device:</p><ul><li>Print</li><li>Copy</li><li>Scan</li><li>Fax</li></ul><p>This multifunction capability helps reduce equipment costs, save office space, and simplify workflow management by eliminating the need for separate machines.</p><h2>Fast and Professional Printing</h2><p>Designed to handle everyday business and personal printing tasks efficiently, the HP Laser MFP 137fnw delivers:</p><h3>Print Performance</h3><ul><li>Up to 21 Pages Per Minute (PPM)</li><li>Sharp Black Text</li><li>Professional-Quality Documents</li><li>Consistent Laser Output</li></ul><p>Whether printing reports, invoices, contracts, or forms, users can rely on clear and professional results every time.</p><h2>High Monthly Duty Cycle</h2><p>The HP Laser MFP 137fnw is built to support demanding workloads with a monthly duty cycle of:</p><ul><li>Up to 10,000 Pages</li></ul><p>This makes it suitable for small offices and workgroups that require dependable day-to-day printing performance.</p><h2>Automatic Document Feeder (ADF)</h2><p>The integrated 40-sheet Automatic Document Feeder improves efficiency by allowing users to scan, copy, or fax multiple pages automatically.</p><h3>ADF Benefits</h3><ul><li>Faster Multi-Page Scanning</li><li>Convenient Batch Copying</li><li>Efficient Fax Transmission</li><li>Reduced Manual Handling</li></ul><p>This feature significantly boosts productivity for offices handling larger document volumes.</p><h2>High-Quality Scanning and Copying</h2><p>The flatbed scanner delivers accurate document reproduction, making it easy to digitize important paperwork and archive records electronically.</p><h3>Scanning Features</h3><ul><li>Clear Document Capture</li><li>High-Resolution Scanning</li><li>Digital File Creation</li><li>Easy Document Sharing</li></ul><p>The copier function ensures sharp and accurate duplicates for everyday office tasks.</p><h2>Built-In Fax Functionality</h2><p>The HP Laser MFP 137fnw includes an integrated fax feature, allowing businesses to send and receive documents quickly and securely.</p><h3>Fax Benefits</h3><ul><li>Reliable Communication</li><li>Quick Document Transmission</li><li>Professional Office Functionality</li><li>Improved Business Workflow</li></ul><h2>Wireless and Network Connectivity</h2><p>The HP Laser MFP 137fnw offers multiple connectivity options for flexible deployment in home and office environments.</p><h3>Connectivity Features</h3><ul><li>Built-In Wi-Fi</li><li>Ethernet Network Connectivity</li><li>USB Connectivity</li><li>Wireless Printing Support</li></ul><p>Users can print and manage documents from multiple devices without relying solely on wired connections.</p><h2>Mobile Printing with HP Smart App</h2><p>The HP Smart App provides a convenient way to manage printing tasks directly from smartphones and tablets.</p><h3>HP Smart App Features</h3><ul><li>Mobile Printing</li><li>Mobile Scanning</li><li>Printer Setup Assistance</li><li>Remote Printer Management</li><li>Easy Document Sharing</li></ul><p>This allows users to stay productive from virtually anywhere.</p><h2>Compact and Space-Saving Design</h2><p>The HP Laser MFP 137fnw features a compact footprint that fits easily into small offices, home workspaces, retail environments, and professional settings.</p><h3>Ideal For</h3><ul><li>Home Offices</li><li>Small Businesses</li><li>Retail Shops</li><li>Educational Institutions</li><li>Professional Workspaces</li></ul><p>Its sleek design helps maximize workspace efficiency without sacrificing functionality.</p><h2>Dynamic Security Features</h2><p>HP Dynamic Security technology helps maintain printer integrity and supports the use of genuine HP toner cartridges for consistent performance and print quality.</p><h3>Security Benefits</h3><ul><li>Enhanced Cartridge Authentication</li><li>Reliable Printer Performance</li><li>Improved Device Protection</li><li>Consistent Output Quality</li></ul><h2>Key Features</h2><ul><li>Multifunction Printer (Print, Copy, Scan, Fax)</li><li>Monochrome Laser Printing</li><li>Up to 21 Pages Per Minute</li><li>40-Sheet Automatic Document Feeder (ADF)</li><li>Built-In Wi-Fi Connectivity</li><li>Ethernet Networking Support</li><li>USB Connectivity</li><li>Mobile Printing via HP Smart App</li><li>High Monthly Duty Cycle of 10,000 Pages</li><li>Compact and Space-Saving Design</li><li>Dynamic Security Features</li><li>Professional-Quality Black-and-White Printing</li></ul><h2>Why Choose the HP Laser MFP 137fnw?</h2><p>The HP Laser MFP 137fnw is an ideal choice for users seeking an affordable and feature-rich multifunction laser printer. Its combination of printing, scanning, copying, faxing, wireless connectivity, and ADF functionality makes it a complete office solution for businesses and professionals.</p><p>Whether managing daily office documents, scanning contracts, sending faxes, or printing business reports, the HP Laser MFP 137fnw delivers dependable performance and exceptional value.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Buy HP Laser MFP 137fnw Multifunction Mono Laser Printer from International Office Solution (IOSBD)</h2><p>Purchase the original HP Laser MFP 137fnw Multifunction Mono Laser Printer from International Office Solution (IOSBD), your trusted source for genuine HP printers and office automation solutions in Bangladesh.</p><p>We provide authentic HP products, competitive prices, and professional support for businesses, educational institutions, and home users. Order online today or contact International Office Solution (IOSBD) for the best deal on the HP Laser MFP 137fnw.</p><h3>Warranty</h3><p>1-Year Official HP Warranty</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>General</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Functions</td><td>Print, Scan, Copy, Fax</td></tr><tr><td>Printer Type</td><td>Multi Function Mono Laser Printer</td></tr><tr><td>Output Color</td><td>Black &amp; White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Print</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Technology</td><td>Mono Laser</td></tr><tr><td>Print Speed</td><td>20ppm</td></tr><tr><td>Print Resolution</td><td>1200 x 1200dpi</td></tr><tr><td>First Print Out Time</td><td>8.3sec</td></tr><tr><td>Duty Cycle up to (Yield)</td><td>10000 Pages</td></tr><tr><td>Duplex</td><td>Manual</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Copy</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Copy Speed</td><td>20cpm<br><br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Copy Resolution</td><td>600 x 600dpi</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Scan</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Scan Resolution</td><td>600 x 600dpi</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum Scan Size</td><td>Legal (216 x 356mm)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Fax</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Transmission Speed (kbps)</td><td>33.6Kbps<br><br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Max Resolution</td><td>300 x 300dpi</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Paper Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Paper Size</td><td>A4 / Legal / Executive / Letter / A5 / A6 / Envelopes</td></tr><tr><td>Paper Type</td><td>Plain, Thick, Thin, Cotton, Color, Preprinted, Recycled, Labels, CardStock, Bond, Archive, Envelope</td></tr><tr><td>Paper Weight</td><td>60 to 163 g/m2</td></tr><tr><td>Input Capacity</td><td>150 Sheets Input<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Output Capacity</td><td>100 Sheets Output</td></tr><tr><td>ADF</td><td>Yes (40 Sheets)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Technical Specs</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>600MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>128MB<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>2 Line LCD Display</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB, LAN, WiFi</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>110 to 127 VAC, 50/60Hz and 220 to 240 VAC, 50/60Hz, 300 watts (Active Printing), 38 watts (Ready), 1.9 watts (Sleep)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White<br><br><br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>406 x 308.7 x 359.6mm</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>8.58Kg</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Support</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Toner/ Cartridge/ Refill</td><td>107A<br>(Please make sure your existing &amp; mentioned toner/cartridge/ink bottle models are the same before buying a new one)</td></tr><tr><td>Software</td><td>Windows 7, 8, 8.1, 10, Server 2008 R2, 2012, 2016, macOS v10.14 Mojave, macOS v10.13 High Sierra, macOS v10.12 Sierra, OS X v10.11 El Capitan</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1-year Limited warranty, an Adapter/Power Cable with no warranty, and also a Box Mandatory While Claiming.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 38800.00, 38700.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/4LWkinROlJW0zIigjm7rtmdCeQ5hlaG7TC3rusmt.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-04 14:24:12', '2026-06-04 14:24:12', 'HP Laser MFP 137fnw Multifunction Mono Laser Printer Price in Bangladesh | IOSBD', 'Buy HP Laser MFP 137fnw Multifunction Mono Laser Printer from IOSBD. Print, scan, copy, and fax with Wi-Fi, Ethernet, 40-sheet ADF, HP Smart App support, and 21ppm monochrome laser printing.', 'HP Laser MFP 137fnw, HP 137fnw Printer, HP Multifunction Laser Printer, Print Scan Copy Fax Printer, Wireless Laser Printer, HP Mono Laser Printer, HP Printer Bangladesh, Office Printer, Business Printer, HP Smart App, IOSBD, International Office Solution', NULL, 1, NULL, NULL);
