(285, 'HP LaserJet Pro M406dn Single Function Monochrome Printer', 'The HP LaserJet Pro M406dn Single Function Monochrome Printer is a high-performance business printer designed for demanding office environments. Featuring print speeds of up to 42 pages per minute, automatic duplex printing, advanced HP security technologies, a 2.7-inch color touchscreen display, and enterprise-level management tools, it delivers exceptional productivity, reliability, and document', 'hp-laserjet-pro-m406dn-single-function-monochrome-printer-1780585317', '<h2>HP LaserJet Pro M406dn Single Function Monochrome Printer</h2><p>The HP LaserJet Pro M406dn Single Function Monochrome Printer is built to meet the needs of modern businesses that require fast, secure, and reliable document printing. Designed for medium to large workgroups, this powerful monochrome laser printer combines enterprise-level security, advanced management capabilities, and high-speed performance to ensure seamless operation in demanding office environments.</p><p>With automatic duplex printing, a large color display, robust paper handling, and industry-leading security features, the HP LaserJet Pro M406dn helps businesses maximize productivity while protecting sensitive information.</p><h2>High-Speed Printing Performance</h2><p>The HP LaserJet Pro M406dn delivers exceptional print speeds of up to:</p><ul><li>42 Pages Per Minute (PPM)</li></ul><p>Its rapid printing capability allows businesses to handle large workloads efficiently while minimizing downtime and improving overall workflow.</p><h3>Productivity Benefits</h3><ul><li>Faster Document Processing</li><li>Reduced Waiting Times</li><li>Improved Team Efficiency</li><li>High-Volume Printing Support</li></ul><p>Whether printing invoices, reports, contracts, or administrative documents, the printer maintains consistent performance throughout the workday.</p><h2>Professional Monochrome Print Quality</h2><p>Powered by HP\'s advanced laser technology, the HP LaserJet Pro M406dn produces sharp text, deep blacks, and professional-quality output.</p><h3>Ideal For Printing</h3><ul><li>Business Reports</li><li>Contracts</li><li>Financial Documents</li><li>Legal Documents</li><li>Invoices</li><li>Office Forms</li><li>Corporate Communications</li></ul><p>Every document is printed with exceptional clarity and precision.</p><h2>Automatic Duplex Printing</h2><p>The built-in automatic duplex printing feature enables users to print on both sides of the page automatically.</p><h3>Benefits</h3><ul><li>Reduced Paper Consumption</li><li>Lower Printing Costs</li><li>Environmentally Friendly Printing</li><li>Professional Double-Sided Documents</li></ul><p>This feature helps businesses improve efficiency while supporting sustainability initiatives.</p><h2>Advanced Security Features</h2><p>The HP LaserJet Pro M406dn is recognized as one of the most secure printers in its class, providing comprehensive protection against cyber threats and unauthorized access.</p><h3>Security Highlights</h3><ul><li>HP Dynamic Security Technology</li><li>BIOS Self-Healing Protection</li><li>Firmware Integrity Validation</li><li>Real-Time Threat Detection</li><li>Continuous Memory Monitoring</li><li>Network Threat Prevention</li><li>Digitally Signed Firmware Verification</li></ul><p>These advanced security capabilities help safeguard sensitive business information and protect network infrastructure.</p><h2>HP FutureSmart Firmware</h2><p>HP FutureSmart Firmware ensures your printer remains current with the latest features and security enhancements.</p><h3>Benefits</h3><ul><li>Future-Proof Investment</li><li>Regular Feature Updates</li><li>Improved Security Protection</li><li>Enhanced Device Functionality</li></ul><p>Organizations can easily adapt to changing business requirements without replacing hardware.</p><h2>Simplified Fleet Management</h2><p>The HP LaserJet Pro M406dn supports HP Web Jetadmin, allowing centralized management of printers across the organization.</p><h3>Management Features</h3><ul><li>Remote Device Monitoring</li><li>Centralized Configuration</li><li>Usage Tracking</li><li>Security Policy Management</li><li>Workflow Optimization</li></ul><p>These capabilities help IT administrators maintain efficient printer operations across multiple locations.</p><h2>Intuitive 2.7-Inch Color Display</h2><p>The printer features a vibrant 2.7-inch (6.9 cm) color graphics display with tablet-like navigation.</p><h3>User Experience Benefits</h3><ul><li>Easy Menu Navigation</li><li>Real-Time Status Monitoring</li><li>Simplified Printer Configuration</li><li>Quick Access to Functions</li></ul><p>The intuitive interface improves usability and reduces training requirements.</p><h2>Flexible Paper Handling</h2><p>The HP LaserJet Pro M406dn includes multiple paper trays to support various paper sizes and media types.</p><h3>Paper Handling Features</h3><ul><li>Multiple Input Trays</li><li>Support for Diverse Media Types</li><li>Efficient Large Print Job Management</li><li>Reduced Paper Reload Frequency</li></ul><p>This flexibility helps businesses manage diverse printing needs with ease.</p><h2>Enterprise Productivity Features</h2><p>Designed to empower workgroups, the HP LaserJet Pro M406dn supports a wide range of productivity-enhancing solutions.</p><h3>Business Features</h3><ul><li>PIN/Pull Printing Support</li><li>Secure Job Release</li><li>Third-Party Application Integration</li><li>Card Reader Compatibility</li><li>Workflow Automation Capabilities</li></ul><p>These advanced tools help improve operational efficiency and document security.</p><h2>Optional Advanced Connectivity</h2><p>The HP LaserJet Pro M406dn supports optional accessories that add:</p><ul><li>Wireless Connectivity</li><li>Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE)</li><li>NFC Touch-to-Print Functionality</li></ul><p>These options provide additional flexibility for modern workplaces.</p><h2>Reliable Business-Class Performance</h2><p>The HP LaserJet Pro M406dn is designed to deliver dependable operation under heavy workloads, making it suitable for:</p><ul><li>Corporate Offices</li><li>Government Organizations</li><li>Educational Institutions</li><li>Financial Firms</li><li>Healthcare Facilities</li><li>Professional Service Providers</li></ul><p>Its robust design ensures long-term reliability and consistent performance.</p><h2>Key Features</h2><ul><li>Single Function Monochrome Laser Printer</li><li>Up to 42 Pages Per Minute Print Speed</li><li>Automatic Duplex Printing</li><li>2.7-Inch Color Graphics Display</li><li>HP Dynamic Security Technology</li><li>BIOS Self-Healing Protection</li><li>Firmware Integrity Validation</li><li>HP FutureSmart Firmware Support</li><li>HP Web Jetadmin Management</li><li>PIN/Pull Printing Support</li><li>Multiple Paper Input Trays</li><li>Enterprise-Level Security Features</li><li>Optional Wireless, Bluetooth, and NFC Support</li><li>Designed for High-Volume Office Printing</li></ul><h2>Why Choose the HP LaserJet Pro M406dn?</h2><p>The HP LaserJet Pro M406dn is an ideal choice for businesses that require high-speed, secure, and efficient monochrome printing. Its advanced security architecture, enterprise management tools, fast printing speeds, and automatic duplex functionality make it a reliable solution for modern workplaces.</p><p>Whether managing large print volumes, protecting confidential documents, or streamlining office workflows, the HP LaserJet Pro M406dn delivers outstanding performance and long-term value.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Buy HP LaserJet Pro M406dn Single Function Monochrome Printer from International Office Solution (IOSBD)</h2><p>Purchase the original HP LaserJet Pro M406dn Single Function Monochrome Printer from International Office Solution (IOSBD), your trusted source for genuine HP printers and office automation solutions in Bangladesh.</p><p>We provide authentic HP products, competitive pricing, and professional support for businesses, educational institutions, government offices, and corporate organizations. Order online today or contact International Office Solution (IOSBD) for the best deal on the HP LaserJet Pro M406dn.</p><h3>Warranty</h3><p>1-Year Limited Warranty (Adapter/Power Cable Warranty Not Included)</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>General</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Functions</td><td>Print Only</td></tr><tr><td>Printer Type</td><td>Single Function Mono laser Printer</td></tr><tr><td>Output Color</td><td>Black &amp; White</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Print</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Technology</td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td>Print Speed</td><td>Print speed black (ISO, letter)<br>Up to 40 ppm (default); Up to 42 ppm (HP high speed mode) 1<br>Print speed black (ISO, A4)<br>Up to 38 ppm (default); Up to 40 ppm (HP high speed mode)</td></tr><tr><td>Duty Cycle up to (Yield)</td><td>Duty cycle (monthly, letter)<br>Up to 100,000 pages<br><br>Duty cycle (monthly, A4)<br>Up to 100,000 pages</td></tr><tr><td>Duplex</td><td>Automatic</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Paper Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Paper Size</td><td>Legal, Letter, A4, A5, A5(LEF), B5 (JIS), Oficio, Envelope (DL, C5)</td></tr><tr><td>Paper Type</td><td>Tray 1: A4, RA4, A5, B5 (JIS), B6 (JIS), 10 x 15 cm, A6, 16K, envelopes (B5, C5 ISO, C6, DL ISO); Custom: 76 x 127 to 216 x 356 mm; Tray 2: A4; RA4; A5; B5 (JIS); B6 (JIS); A6; 16K; 105 x 148 to 216 x 356 mm; Optional Tray 3: A4; RA4; A5; B5 (JIS); B6 (JIS); A6; 16K; 105 x 148 to 216 x 356 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Input Capacity</td><td>100-sheet tray 1, 250-sheet input tray 2<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Output Capacity</td><td>150-sheet output bin</td></tr><tr><td>ADF</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Technical Specs</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>800 MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>1 GB</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>LED display</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB, LAN</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>531 watts (active printing), 8.1 watts (ready), 1.2 watts (sleep), 0.07 watts (auto-off/manual-on), 0.07 watts (manual off)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>381 x 781 x 241 mm (printer fully opened)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>381 x 781 x 241 mm (printer fully opened)<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Support</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Toner/ Cartridge/ Refill</td><td>HP 76A Original LaserJet&nbsp;Black&nbsp;Toner<br>(Please make sure your existing &amp; mentioned toner/cartridge/ink bottle models are the same before buying a new one)</td></tr><tr><td>Software</td><td>Windows 11; Windows 10; Windows 8; Windows 8.1; Windows 7; Windows Client OS; Android; iOS; Mobile OS; macOS 10.12 Sierra; macOS 10.13 High Sierra; macOS 10.14 Mojave; macOS 10.15 Catalina</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1-year Limited warranty, an Adapter/Power Cable with no warranty, and also a Box Mandatory While Claiming.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 45000.00, 44400.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/ZHPBLWbQgWcR4pVowOmCauv5IwxvHExYJZwpHPKM.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-04 15:01:57', '2026-06-04 15:01:57', 'HP LaserJet Pro M406dn Single Function Monochrome Printer Price in Bangladesh | IOSBD', 'Buy HP LaserJet Pro M406dn Single Function Monochrome Printer from IOSBD. Enjoy 42ppm printing, automatic duplex, enterprise security, HP FutureSmart firmware, and advanced office productivity features.', 'HP LaserJet Pro M406dn, HP M406dn Printer, Monochrome Laser Printer, Single Function Printer, Duplex Printing, Network Printer, Office Printer, HP Laser Printer, Business Printer, A4 Printer, Fast Printing, HP Bangladesh', NULL, 1, NULL, NULL),
(286, 'HP LaserJet Pro M501DN Single Function Mono Laser Printer', 'HP LaserJet Pro M501dn Single Function Mono Laser Printer delivers fast, reliable, and secure monochrome printing for business environments. Featuring automatic duplex printing, Gigabit Ethernet connectivity, HP JetIntelligence toner technology, up to 1,200-sheet paper capacity, and a fast first-page-out time of 7.3 seconds, it is an ideal solution for offices with high-volume printing requirements.', 'hp-laserjet-pro-m501dn-single-function-mono-laser-printer-1780585781', '<h2>HP LaserJet Pro M501dn Single Function Mono Laser Printer</h2><h2>Long Description</h2><p>The HP LaserJet Pro M501dn Single Function Mono Laser Printer is a high-performance monochrome laser printer designed for businesses and offices that require fast, secure, and reliable printing. Built to handle demanding workloads, the HP M501dn delivers exceptional print speeds, professional-quality output, and advanced security features while maintaining energy efficiency.</p><p>With its powerful printing engine, the HP LaserJet Pro M501dn produces the first page in as fast as 7.3 seconds from energy-saving sleep mode, helping teams stay productive without unnecessary waiting. The printer supports automatic duplex printing, allowing users to print on both sides of the paper and reduce paper consumption while maintaining workflow efficiency.</p><p>This printer features a user-friendly 2-line LCD control panel with a numeric keypad for easy operation and quick access to printer functions. It is designed for busy work environments and offers a maximum paper capacity of up to 1,200 sheets, minimizing interruptions caused by frequent paper refills.</p><p>The HP LaserJet Pro M501dn utilizes Original HP Toner cartridges with JetIntelligence technology, delivering more pages per cartridge, sharp black text, crisp graphics, and consistent print quality. A pre-installed toner cartridge allows users to start printing immediately after setup, while optional high-yield toner cartridges help lower operating costs and increase productivity.</p><p>Connectivity options include Gigabit Ethernet networking, High-Speed USB 2.0, and USB-based job storage with PIN printing, enabling secure document handling and seamless integration into office networks. Advanced security features help protect sensitive business information and defend against potential threats.</p><p>The compact and quiet design makes the HP LaserJet Pro M501dn an excellent choice for small offices, corporate departments, educational institutions, and professional workgroups that require dependable monochrome printing with enterprise-level performance.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul><li>Fast monochrome laser printing performance</li><li>First page out in as little as 7.3 seconds</li><li>Automatic duplex (double-sided) printing</li><li>Print speeds up to 65 ppm on A5 paper</li><li>Original HP Toner with JetIntelligence technology</li><li>Sharp text and professional-quality graphics</li><li>2-line LCD display with numeric keypad</li><li>Gigabit Ethernet networking support</li><li>High-Speed USB 2.0 connectivity</li><li>USB port for secure PIN printing and job storage</li><li>Up to 1,200-sheet paper capacity</li><li>Energy-efficient design with low power consumption</li><li>Compact and quiet office-friendly operation</li></ul><h3>Why Buy from International Office Solution?</h3><p>Purchase the HP LaserJet Pro M501dn Single Function Mono Laser Printer from International Office Solution and enjoy genuine products, competitive pricing, professional consultation, and reliable after-sales support. We provide business-grade printing solutions tailored for offices, organizations, and enterprise environments throughout Bangladesh.</p><h3>Warranty Information</h3><ul><li>Printer Warranty: 1 Year Limited Warranty</li><li>Adapter/Power Cable: No Warranty</li><li>Box Mandatory While Claiming Warranty</li></ul>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th 