(287, 'HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP M182n Multifunction A4 Color Laser Printer', 'HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP M182n is a multifunction A4 color laser printer that offers print, copy, and scan capabilities in one compact device. Featuring 600 x 600 dpi printing, 1200 dpi scanning, Ethernet connectivity, manual duplex printing, and a monthly duty cycle of up to 30,000 pages, it is ideal for small offices and business environments.', 'hp-color-laserjet-pro-mfp-m182n-multifunction-a4-color-laser-printer-1780586314', '<p>HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP M182n Multifunction A4 Color Laser Printer</p><p>The HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP M182n Multifunction A4 Color Laser Printer is a reliable and efficient all-in-one printing solution designed for small businesses, corporate offices, and professional workgroups. Combining print, copy, and scan capabilities in a single compact device, this multifunction color laser printer helps streamline office productivity while delivering consistent, high-quality results.</p><p>Featuring a print resolution of up to 600 x 600 dpi, the HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP M182n produces sharp text, vibrant colors, and professional-looking documents suitable for reports, presentations, marketing materials, and everyday office tasks. Its robust design supports a monthly duty cycle of up to 30,000 pages, making it a dependable choice for businesses with moderate to high-volume printing requirements.</p><p>The printer includes a high-quality flatbed scanner with up to 1200 dpi optical resolution, allowing users to digitize documents and images with excellent clarity and detail. Its intuitive 7-segment icon LCD display provides quick access to essential functions, making operation simple and efficient.</p><p>Powered by an 800 MHz processor, the HP M182n ensures smooth document processing and reliable performance. It supports a wide range of printer languages, including HP PCL 6, HP PCL 5c, HP PostScript Level 3 Emulation, PCLm, PDF, and URF, ensuring compatibility across various business applications and operating systems.</p><p>Connectivity options include High-Speed USB and Ethernet LAN, allowing seamless integration into office networks and shared work environments. The printer supports PDF and JPG file formats and is compatible with Windows 7, Windows 8, Windows 8.1, Windows 10, Windows XP, Windows Vista, Windows Server 2008 R2 and later versions, as well as Apple macOS Sierra, El Capitan, and Yosemite.</p><p>The HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP M182n features manual duplex printing, helping businesses reduce paper usage and operating costs when producing double-sided documents. Its energy-efficient design minimizes power consumption while maintaining reliable performance for everyday business operations.</p><p>Whether you need to print colorful business documents, copy important records, or scan contracts and reports, the HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP M182n offers the versatility and performance needed to keep your office running efficiently.</p><h2>Key Features</h2><ul><li>Print, Copy, and Scan functionality</li><li>Color Laser Printing Technology</li><li>Up to 600 x 600 dpi print resolution</li><li>Up to 1200 dpi scan resolution</li><li>Monthly duty cycle up to 30,000 pages</li><li>7-segment Icon LCD display</li><li>Manual duplex printing support</li><li>USB and Ethernet LAN connectivity</li><li>800 MHz processor for efficient performance</li><li>Supports PDF and JPG file formats</li><li>Compatible with Windows and macOS operating systems</li><li>Compact design suitable for office environments</li><li>Energy-efficient operation</li></ul><h2>Why Buy from International Office Solution?</h2><p>Get the original HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP M182n Multifunction A4 Color Laser Printer from International Office Solution. We provide genuine HP products, competitive pricing, expert consultation, and reliable after-sales support for businesses, educational institutions, and professional organizations throughout Bangladesh.</p><h2>Warranty Informati