(288, 'HP Color LaserJet Pro 3203dw Single Function Color Laser Printer', 'The HP Color LaserJet Pro 3203dw Single Function Color Laser Printer delivers fast 25 ppm color and monochrome printing with professional-quality output. Featuring automatic duplex printing, dual-band Wi-Fi, Gigabit Ethernet, 600 x 600 dpi resolution, and a monthly duty cycle of up to 40,000 pages, it is ideal for modern business environments.', 'hp-color-laserjet-pro-3203dw-single-function-color-laser-printer-1780586618', '<p>HP Color LaserJet Pro 3203dw Single Function Color Laser Printer</p><p>The HP Color LaserJet Pro 3203dw Single Function Color Laser Printer is a powerful and efficient printing solution designed for modern businesses, corporate offices, and professional workgroups. Combining exceptional print quality, fast performance, advanced connectivity, and energy-efficient operation, this printer is ideal for organizations that require reliable color printing with professional-grade results.</p><p>Designed to boost workplace productivity, the HP Color LaserJet Pro 3203dw delivers print speeds of up to 25 pages per minute for both black-and-white and color documents. Whether you\'re producing reports, presentations, invoices, brochures, or marketing materials, this printer ensures sharp text, vibrant colors, and consistent output quality every time.</p><p>With a print resolution of up to 600 x 600 dpi, the HP 3203dw produces clear, detailed documents and vivid graphics that help businesses maintain a professional image. Its robust monthly duty cycle of up to 40,000 pages makes it suitable for high-volume office environments where reliability and performance are essential.</p><p>The HP Color LaserJet Pro 3203dw features automatic duplex printing, allowing users to print on both sides of the paper automatically. This helps reduce paper consumption, lower operating costs, and support environmentally responsible printing practices.</p><p>Flexible media handling enables support for various paper sizes, including A4, A5, Letter, Legal, B5, and Oficio. The printer also accommodates multiple media types such as plain paper, glossy paper, recycled paper, labels, envelopes, cardstock, and more, making it suitable for a wide range of business printing applications.</p><p>For seamless workplace integration, the HP Color LaserJet Pro 3203dw offers multiple connectivity options, including Gigabit Ethernet, High-Speed USB 2.0, and dual-band Wi-Fi 802.11ac. These features allow users to print conveniently from desktops, laptops, and network-connected devices across the office. The intuitive 2-inch MGD display provides easy navigation and printer management, while 256MB memory ensures smooth processing of complex print jobs.</p><p>Energy efficiency is another key advantage of this printer. It consumes only 415W during active printing, 6.1W in ready mode, and just 0.63W in sleep mode, helping businesses reduce electricity costs without sacrificing performance.</p><p>Built for durability and consistent operation, the HP Color LaserJet Pro 3203dw Single Function Color Laser Printer offers a perfect balance of speed, quality, reliability, and sustainability, making it an excellent choice for professional environments seeking dependable color printing solutions.</p><h2>Key Features</h2><ul><li>Single Function Color Laser Printer</li><li>Print speeds up to 25 ppm (Black &amp; Color)</li><li>Up to 600 x 600 dpi print resolution</li><li>Automatic duplex printing</li><li>Monthly duty cycle up to 40,000 pages</li><li>250-sheet input tray</li><li>100-sheet output capacity</li><li>Supports A4, A5, Legal, Letter, B5, and Oficio paper sizes</li><li>Supports glossy paper, envelopes, labels, cardstock, and recycled paper</li><li>Gigabit Ethernet connectivity</li><li>High-Speed USB 2.0 interface</li><li>Dual-band Wi-Fi 802.11ac support</li><li>2-inch MGD display</li><li>256MB memory</li><li>Energy-efficient operation</li><li>Professional-quality color output</li></ul><h2>Why 