(289, 'HP LaserJet Pro M706n A3 Single Function Mono Laser Printer', 'The HP LaserJet Pro M706n A3 Single Function Mono Laser Printer delivers professional monochrome printing with support for A3 and A4 paper sizes. Featuring up to 18 ppm print speed, 1200 x 1200 dpi resolution, Fast Ethernet connectivity, 750 MHz processor, and 256 MB memory, it is ideal for business and technical printing applications.', 'hp-laserjet-pro-m706n-a3-single-function-mono-laser-printer-1780586918', '<p>HP LaserJet Pro M706n A3 Single Function Mono Laser Printer</p><p>The HP LaserJet Pro M706n A3 Single Function Mono Laser Printer is a powerful and dependable printing solution designed for businesses, engineering firms, educational institutions, and professional offices that require high-quality A3 monochrome printing. Combining robust performance, excellent print quality, and flexible paper handling, this printer is ideal for producing large-format documents, technical drawings, reports, spreadsheets, and business materials.</p><p>Powered by advanced HP laser printing technology, the HP LaserJet Pro M706n delivers crisp black text and sharp graphics with a print resolution of up to 1200 x 1200 dpi. Whether printing detailed architectural plans, business reports, or everyday office documents, users can expect professional-quality output with every print.</p><p>The printer offers print speeds of up to 18 pages per minute, helping businesses maintain productivity while handling routine and large-format printing tasks efficiently. Equipped with a powerful 750 MHz processor and 256 MB of memory, the HP M706n processes print jobs smoothly and ensures reliable performance in demanding office environments.</p><p>Designed to support a wide range of media sizes, the printer accommodates A3, A4, A5, B4 (JIS), B5 (JIS), and 16K paper formats, providing flexibility for diverse printing requirements. This makes it particularly suitable for organizations that need both standard and oversized document printing capabilities.</p><p>The HP LaserJet Pro M706n features a user-friendly 2-line LCD text display that allows easy printer management and status monitoring. Connectivity options include High-Speed USB 2.0 and Fast Ethernet 10/100 networking, enabling seamless integration into shared office environments and network printing setups.</p><p>Built for durability and consistent performance, this monochrome laser printer offers reliable operation while maintaining professional print quality. Its sturdy design and enterprise-level functionality make it an excellent investment for businesses seeking efficient and cost-effective A3 printing solutions.</p><p>Whether you\'re printing technical documents, presentations, engineering drawings, invoices, or office reports, the HP LaserJet Pro M706n A3 Single Function Mono Laser Printer delivers the reliability, performance, and quality required for professional environments.</p><h2>Key Features</h2><ul><li>Single Function Monochrome Laser Printer</li><li>Supports A3 and A4 printing</li><li>Up to 18 ppm print speed</li><li>Up to 1200 x 1200 dpi print resolution</li><li>2-line LCD text display</li><li>750 MHz processor</li><li>256 MB memory</li><li>High-Speed USB 2.0 connectivity</li><li>Fast Ethernet 10/100 networking</li><li>Supports A3, A4, A5, B4, B5, and 16K paper sizes</li><li>Sharp text and professional-quality output</li><li>Ideal for technical drawings and business documents</li><li>Reliable performance for office environments</li></ul><h2>Why Buy from International Office Solution?</h2><p>Purchase the original HP LaserJet Pro M706n A3 Single Function Mono Laser Printer from International Office Solution and enjoy genuine HP products, competitive pricing, expert support, and dependable after-sales service. We provide professional printing solutions for businesses, educational institutions, architects, engineers, and corporate offices throughout Bangladesh.</p><h2>Warranty Information</h2><ul><li>Printer Warranty: 1 Year Limited Warranty</li><li>Adapter/Power Cable: No Warranty</li><li>Box Mandatory While Claiming Warranty</li></ul>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>General</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Functions</td><td>Print Only</td></tr><tr><td>Printer Type</td><td>Single Function Mono Laser</td></tr><tr><td>Output Color</td><td>Black &amp; White<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Print</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Technology</td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td>Print Speed</td><td>Print: Up to 35 ppm, A4/letter; Up to 18 ppm, A3; Optional duplex: Up to 24 ipm, A4/letter</td></tr><tr><td>Print Resolution</td><td>1200 x 1200dpi</td></tr><tr><td>First Print Out Time</td><td>Black (A4, letter): As fast as 9 seconds from ready</td></tr><tr><td>Duty Cycle up to (Yield)</td><td>65000 Pages</td></tr><tr><td>Duplex</td><td>Manual (driver support provided) Optional Duplexer accessory</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Paper Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Paper Size</td><td>Tray 1: A4, A3, B4 (JIS), B5 (JIS), A5, 16K; letter, legal, executive, 11 x 17, 8.5 x 13; envelopes(B5, C5, DL, No. 10, Monarch); postcard (JIS), DPostcard (JIS); Custom media sizes: 76.2 x 127 mmto 312 x 470 mm (3 x 5 in to 12.28 x 18.5 in); Tray 2: A4</td></tr><tr><td>Paper Type</td><td>Paper (colored, letterhead, light, plain, preprinted, pre punched, recycled, rough, heavy), bond, cardstock, envelope, labels, transparency, vellum</td></tr><tr><td>Paper Weight</td><td>Tray 1: 60 to 199 g/m²; Tray 2: 60 to 120 g/m²; Optional tray 3, optional duplexer: 60 to 120 g/m2</td></tr><tr><td>Input Capacity</td><td>Input Capacity: Up to 350 sheets Standard: Tray 1: 100-sheet multipurpose tray, Tray 2: 250-sheet input tray; Up to 850 sheets with optional 500-sheet input tray 3; Optional duplexer for two-sided printing<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Output Capacity</td><td>250-sheet output bin</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Technical Specs</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>750MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>256MB</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>2 Line LCD Display</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB, LAN</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>220-volt input voltage: 220 to 240 VAC (+/- 10%), 50/60 Hz (+/- 3 Hz)<br>Power Consumption<br>680 watts (printing), 11 watts (ready), 2.5 watts (sleep), 0.2 watts (off)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>500 x 295 x 425mm<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>17Kg</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Support</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Toner/ Cartridge/ Refill</td><td>HP 93A Black (12,000 Pages)<br>(Please make sure your existing &amp; mentioned toner/cartridge/ink bottle models are the same before buying a new one)</td></tr><tr><td>Software</td><td>Windows 7, 8, 8.1, 10, Vista, XP, Server 2003, 2003 R2, 2008, 2008 R2 Mac OS X v10.6, OS X Lion, OS X Mountain Lion, Linux/Unix support</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1-year Limited warranty, an Adapter/Power Cable with no warranty, and also a Box Mandatory While Claiming.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 60500.00, 60500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/CfLrpWmObYixPIBfry08pUamL4ikNXQi3MrmrSYt.jpg', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-04 15:28:38', '2026-06-04 15:28:38', 'HP LaserJet Pro M706n A3 Single Function Mono Laser Printer | International Office Solution', 'Buy HP LaserJet Pro M706n A3 Single Function Mono Laser Printer from International Office Solution. Enjoy A3 printing, 1200 x 1200 dpi resolution, Ethernet networking, and reliable monochrome performance for business and professional use.', 'HP LaserJet Pro M706n, HP M706n Printer, A3 Laser Printer, Mono Laser Printer, Monochrome Printer, Single Function Printer, HP Office Printer, Network Printer, Business Printer, HP A3 Printer, HP Printer Banglad