(290, 'HP LaserJet Pro MFP M227fdw Multifunction Mono Laser Printer', 'HP LaserJet Pro MFP M227fdw is a fast and reliable multifunction mono laser printer offering print, copy, scan, and fax features. With up to 28 ppm speed, 1200 dpi resolution, automatic duplex printing, Wi-Fi and Ethernet connectivity, it is ideal for modern office productivity.', 'hp-laserjet-pro-mfp-m227fdw-multifunction-mono-laser-printer-1780587175', '<p>HP LaserJet Pro MFP M227fdw Multifunction Mono Laser Printer</p><p>The HP LaserJet Pro MFP M227fdw Multifunction Mono Laser Printer is a compact, high-performance all-in-one printing solution designed for modern offices, small businesses, and professional environments. Combining print, copy, scan, and fax functionality, this multifunction laser printer delivers fast, reliable, and high-quality monochrome output while optimizing office productivity.</p><p>Engineered for efficiency, the HP M227fdw offers print speeds of up to 28 pages per minute, allowing users to handle high-volume printing tasks with ease. With a print resolution of up to 1200 x 1200 dpi, it produces sharp text, clear graphics, and professional-quality documents suitable for reports, contracts, invoices, and business communications.</p><p>This HP LaserJet Pro MFP is equipped with automatic duplex printing, enabling double-sided printing to reduce paper usage and operational costs. Its 250-sheet input tray and 100-sheet output bin ensure smooth workflow with fewer interruptions, making it ideal for busy office environments.</p><p>The built-in flatbed scanner with automatic document feeder (ADF) supports efficient scanning and copying of multi-page documents, improving productivity in document management tasks. Integrated fax functionality further enhances its versatility for business communication needs.</p><p>Powered by a robust processor and optimized memory, the HP M227fdw ensures smooth performance across multiple tasks. It supports wireless connectivity, Ethernet LAN, and Hi-Speed USB 2.0, allowing flexible integration into office networks and enabling mobile printing from smartphones and tablets.</p><p>Advanced connectivity options such as Wi-Fi Direct and mobile printing support (HP Smart App, Apple AirPrint, and Google Cloud Print) make it easy to print from virtually anywhere in the office or remotely.</p><p>Designed with energy efficiency in mind, the printer minimizes power consumption while maintaining consistent performance, making it a cost-effective solution for long-term use.</p><p>The HP LaserJet Pro MFP M227fdw is a reliable, space-saving multifunction printer that combines speed, quality, and connectivity—making it an excellent choice for businesses that demand efficient monochrome printing solutions.</p><h2>Key Features</h2><ul><li>Print, Copy, Scan, and Fax functionality</li><li>Print speed up to 28 ppm</li><li>Up to 1200 x 1200 dpi print resolution</li><li>Automatic duplex (double-sided) printing</li><li>250-sheet input tray + 100-sheet output bin</li><li>Built-in ADF (Automatic Document Feeder)</li><li>Wireless, Ethernet, and USB connectivity</li><li>Wi-Fi Direct and mobile printing support</li><li>HP Smart App, AirPrint, Google Cloud Print compatible</li><li>Compact and space-saving design</li><li>Energy-efficient operation</li><li>Ideal for office and business use</li></ul><h2>Why Buy from International Office Solution?</h2><p>Get the original HP LaserJet Pro MFP M227fdw Multifunction Mono Laser Printer from International Office Solution. We ensure genuine HP products, competitive pricing, expert consultation, and reliable after-sales service for businesses, corporate offices, and institutions across Bangladesh.</p><h2>Warranty Information</h2><ul><li>Printer Warranty: 1 Year Limited Warranty</li><li>Adapter/Power Cable: No Warranty</li><li>Box Mandatory While Claiming Warranty</li></ul>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>General</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><t