nting), 4.5 watts (ready), 1.0 watts (sleep), 0.8 watts (Auto Off/Wake on USB, enabled at shipment)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>403 x 311.5 x 407.4mm<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>9.4Kg</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Support</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Toner/ Cartridge/ Refill</td><td>HP 30A Original Black LaserJet Toner Cartridge CF230A (1600 pages), HP 30X Original Black LaserJet Toner Cartridge CF230X (3500 pages), HP 32A Original LaserJet Imaging Drum CF232A (23000 pages)<br>(Please make sure your existing &amp; mentioned toner/cartridge/ink bottle models are the same before buying a new one)</td></tr><tr><td>Software</td><td>Windows 7, 8, 8.1, 10, XP, Vista, Apple OS X Sierra (v10.12), OS X El Capitan (v10.11), OS X Yosemite (v10.10)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1-year Limited warranty, an Adapter/Power Cable with no warranty, and also a Box Mandatory While Claiming.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 665400.00, 66400.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/IspPmv2aJImQh6KUsmZMnIv8gc8VPJRrzLL6mteD.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-04 15:32:55', '2026-06-04 15:32:55', 'HP LaserJet Pro MFP M227fdw Multifunction Mono Laser Printer | International Office Solution', 'Buy HP LaserJet Pro MFP M227fdw Multifunction Mono Laser Printer from International Office Solution. Fast 28 ppm printing, print copy scan fax, Wi-Fi, Ethernet, duplex printing, and professional office performance.', 'HP LaserJet Pro MFP M227fdw, HP M227fdw Printer, Multifunction Mono Laser Printer, LaserJet MFP Printer, Wireless Laser Printer, Duplex Printer, Office Printer, Network Printer, HP Printer Bangladesh, Business Printer, HP Mono Printer', NULL, 1, NULL, NULL),
(291, 'HP LaserJet Enterprise MFP M430F Multifunctional Laser Printer', 'HP LaserJet Enterprise MFP M430f is a high-performance multifunction monochrome laser printer offering print, copy, scan, and fax functions. With up to 42 ppm speed, 1200 dpi resolution, duplex printing, Gigabit Ethernet, and enterprise-grade security, it is ideal for business and corporate environments.', 'hp-laserjet-enterprise-mfp-m430f-multifunctional-laser-printer-1780587398', '<p>HP LaserJet Enterprise MFP M430f Multifunctional Laser Printer</p><p>The HP LaserJet Enterprise MFP M430f Multifunctional Laser Printer is a high-performance enterprise-grade monochrome laser printer designed for medium to large business environments that demand speed, security, and reliability. Combining print, copy, scan, and fax capabilities, this all-in-one device is built to handle heavy workloads while delivering consistent, professional-quality output.</p><p>Engineered for enterprise productivity, the HP M430f delivers fast print speeds of up to 42 pages per minute, ensuring efficient document processing for busy offices. With a print resolution of up to 1200 x 1200 dpi, it produces sharp text, crisp lines, and clear monochrome graphics suitable for reports, contracts, invoices, and corporate documentation.</p><p>The printer features automatic duplex printing, allowing double-sided printing to reduce paper usage and operational costs while improving workflow efficiency. A 250-sheet input tray and 100-sheet output bin support continuous printing with minimal interruptions, making it ideal for high-volume environments.</p><p>Equipped with a flatbed scanner and automatic document feeder (ADF), the HP LaserJet Enterprise MFP M430f enables fast and accurate scanning and copying of multi-page documents. Integrated fax functionality further enhances communication capabilities for business operations.</p><p>Powered by a robust processor and enterprise-level memory, the printer ensures smooth multitasking and fast processing of complex print jobs. It supports Hi-Speed USB 2.0 and Gigabit Ethernet connectivity, enabling secure and stable network integration across office environments.</p><p>As part of the HP Enterprise series, the M430f includes advanced security features designed to protect sensitive business data and prevent unauthorized access, making it a reliable choice for organizations with strict data security requirements.</p><p>The printer also supports mobile and network printing solutions, enabling users to print conveniently from computers, smartphones, and tablets within the office network.</p><p>Built for durability and long-term performance, the HP LaserJet Enterprise MFP M430f is designed to meet the demands of growing businesses, corporate departments, and institutions requiring dependable high-volume monochrome printing.</p><h2>Key Features</h2><ul><li>Print, Copy, Scan, and Fax functionality</li><li>Enterprise-grade monochrome laser printing</li><li>Print speed up to 42 ppm</li><li>Up to 1200 x 1200 dpi print resolution</li><li>Automatic duplex printing</li><li>250-sheet input tray + 100-sheet output bin</li><li>Built-in ADF (Automatic Document Feeder)</li><li>Gigabit Ethernet and USB connectivity</li><li>Enterprise-level security features</li><li>High-performance processor for fast processing</li><li>Designed for high-volume office printing</li><li>Professional-quality sharp black text output</li><li>Ideal for corporate and enterprise environments</li></ul><h2>Why Buy from International Office Solution?</h2><p>Purchase the original HP LaserJet Enterprise MFP M430f Multifunction Laser Printer from International Office Solution and get authentic HP products, competitive pricing, expert consultation, and reliable after-sales service. We provide enterprise printing solutions tailored for corporate offices, government organizations, and business institutions across Bangladesh.</p><h2>Warranty Information</h2><ul><li>Printer Warranty: 1 Year Limited Warranty</li><li>Adapter/Power Cable: No Warranty</li><li>Box Mandatory While Claiming Warranty</li></ul>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>General</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Functions</td><td>Print, Scan, Copy, Fax</td></tr><tr><td>Printer Type</td><td>Multifunctional</td></tr><tr><td>Output Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Print</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Technology</td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td>Print Speed</td><td>Up to 40 ppm (default)<br>Up to 42 ppm (HP high speed mode)</td></tr><tr><td>Print Resolution</td><td>Up to 1200 x 1200 dpi</td></tr><tr><td>First Print Out Time</td><td>As fast as 6.3 sec</td></tr><tr><td>Duty Cycle up to (Yield)</td><td>Monthly Duty Cycle: 100,000 Pages<br>Recommended monthly page volume: 900 to 4,800 Pages</td></tr><tr><td>Duplex</td><td>Automatic (default)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Scan</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Scan Type</td><td>Contact Image Sensor (CIS)</td></tr><tr><td>Scan Resolution</td><td>Enhanced scanning resolution: Up to 600 dpi<br>Scan Resolution, Hardware: Up to 600 x 600 dpi<br>Scan Resolution, Optical:m Up to 600 dpi</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Fax</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Transmission Speed (kbps)</td><td>3 sec per page</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Paper Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Paper Size</td><td>Media sizes supported, key: 10 x 15 cm; A4; Envelopes<br>Media sizes supported: Tray 1: A4, RA4, A5, B5 (JIS), B6 (JIS), 10 x 15 cm, A6, 16K, envelopes (B5, C5 ISO, C6, DL ISO); Custom: 76 x 127 to 216 x 356 mm; Tray 2:A4; RA4;A5; B5 (JIS); B6 (JIS); A6; 16K; 105 x 148 to 216 x 356 mm; Optional Tray 3:A4; RA4;A5; B5 (JIS); B6 (JIS); A6; 16K; 105 x 148 to 216 x 356 mm<br>Media sizes, custom: Tray 1: 76 x 127 to 216 x 356 mm; Tray 2: 105 x 148 to 216 x 356mm; Optional Tray: 105x 148 to 216 x 356 mm<br>Standard media sizes (duplex): A4; RA4; Oficio (216 x 340 mm)<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Paper Type</t