(292, 'HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP 3303sdw Multifunction Laser Printer', 'HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP 3303sdw is a multifunction color laser printer offering print, copy, and scan functions with up to 25 ppm speed, 600 dpi resolution, duplex printing, Wi-Fi, Ethernet, and mobile printing support—ideal for modern business environments.', 'hp-color-laserjet-pro-mfp-3303sdw-multifunction-laser-printer-1780587823', '<p>HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP 3303sdw Multifunction Laser Printer</p><p>The HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP 3303sdw Multifunction Laser Printer is a modern, high-performance all-in-one printing solution designed for small to medium-sized businesses and professional office environments. Combining print, copy, and scan functionality, this multifunction color laser printer delivers fast output, vibrant color quality, and reliable performance for daily business operations.</p><p>With print speeds of up to 25 pages per minute for both black and color documents, the HP 3303sdw ensures smooth workflow and increased productivity in busy office settings. Its advanced laser printing technology produces sharp text and vivid graphics with a resolution of up to 600 x 600 dpi, making it ideal for reports, presentations, marketing materials, and professional documents.</p><p>The printer features automatic duplex printing, allowing users to print on both sides of the paper effortlessly. This helps reduce paper consumption, lower printing costs, and support environmentally friendly office practices. A 250-sheet input tray and additional handling capacity ensure uninterrupted printing for high-demand environments.</p><p>Equipped with a flatbed scanner and automatic document feeder (ADF), the HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP 3303sdw enables fast and efficient scanning and copying of multi-page documents. This enhances productivity in document-heavy workflows such as administration, finance, and business operations.</p><p>Powered by a reliable processor and optimized memory, the printer ensures 