(296, 'HP Color LaserJet Pro M454dn Single Function Color Laser Printer', 'HP Color LaserJet Pro M454dn is a business-grade single-function color laser printer offering up to 27 ppm speed, duplex printing, 600 dpi resolution, Gigabit Ethernet connectivity, and advanced security features—ideal for office and corporate use.', 'hp-color-laserjet-pro-m454dn-single-function-color-laser-printer-1780588668', '<p>HP Color LaserJet Pro M454dn Single Function Color Laser Printer</p><p>The HP Color LaserJet Pro M454dn Single Function Color Laser Printer is a high-performance business-class printing solution designed for offices that require speed, security, and professional-quality color output. Built with advanced laser printing technology, this printer delivers sharp text, vibrant graphics, and consistent results for all types of business documents.</p><p>With print speeds of up to 27 pages per minute for both black and color documents, the HP M454dn ensures efficient workflow and high productivity in busy office environments. Whether printing reports, presentations, marketing materials, or internal documents, it consistently produces high-quality output suitable for professional use.</p><p>The printer supports automatic duplex printing, enabling double-sided printing to reduce paper consumption and operational costs. Its robust monthly duty cycle makes it suitable for medium-sized business environments that require reliable and continuous printing performance.</p><p>With a print resolution of up to 600 x 600 dpi, the HP Color LaserJet Pro M454dn produces crisp text and vivid color graphics, ensuring professional presentation quality for all business communications.</p><p>The HP M454dn is equipped with Gigabit Ethernet connectivity, enabling fast and secure integration into office networks. It is designed for shared office environments where multiple users need reliable access to a high-speed color laser printer.</p><p>Powered by an efficient processor and optimized memory, the printer handles complex print jobs smoothly and maintains consistent performance under heavy workloads. Its energy-efficient design helps reduce operational costs while maintaining productivity.</p><p>Security is a key feature of the HP Color LaserJet Pro M454dn, offering built-in protection features that help safeguard sensitive business data and prevent unauthorized access.</p><p>The HP Color LaserJet Pro M454dn is a reliable, compact, and efficient printing solution for businesses that demand professional color output, fast performance, and secure network printing capabilities.</p><h2>Key Features</h2><ul><li>Single Function Color Laser Printer</li><li>Print speed up to 27 ppm (Black &amp; Color)</li><li>Up to 600 x 600 dpi print resolution</li><li>Automatic duplex printing (dn model)</li><li>Gigabit Ethernet connectivity</li><li>Business-class security features</li><li>Professional color and sharp text output</li><li>Medium-office printing performance</li><li>Energy-efficient operation</li><li>Reliable and durable design</li><li>Ideal for corporate and office use</li></ul><h2>Why Buy from International Office Solution?</h2><p>Get the original HP Color LaserJet Pro M454dn Single Function Color Laser Printer from International Office Solution. We provide genuine HP products, competitive pricing, expert consultation, and dependable after-sales support for corporate offices, businesses, and institutions across Bangladesh.</p><h2>Warranty Information</h2><ul><li>Printer Warranty: 1 Year Limited Warranty</li><li>Adapter/Power Cable: No Warranty</li><li>Box Mandatory While Claiming Warranty</li></ul>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>General</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Functions</td><td>Print Only</td></tr><tr><td>Printer Type</td><td>Single Function Color Laser Printer</td></tr><tr><td>Output Color</td><td>Color</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Print</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Technology</td><td>L