(297, 'HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP 4303fdn Multifunction Laser Printer', 'HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP 4303fdn is a high-performance multifunction color laser printer offering print, copy, scan, and fax functions with up to 33 ppm speed, duplex printing, 600 dpi resolution, and Gigabit Ethernet connectivity—ideal for business and office use.', 'hp-color-laserjet-pro-mfp-4303fdn-multifunction-laser-printer-1780588868', '<p>HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP 4303fdn Multifunction Printer</p><p>The HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP 4303fdn Multifunction Printer is a powerful business-class all-in-one printing solution designed for medium to large offices that require fast, secure, and high-quality color output. Combining print, copy, scan, and fax functionality, this enterprise-ready device delivers exceptional productivity and reliable performance for demanding office environments.</p><p>Built with advanced laser printing technology, the HP 4303fdn produces sharp text, vivid color graphics, and consistent professional-quality documents suitable for reports, presentations, marketing materials, and business communications. With high-speed performance of up to 33 pages per minute, it ensures smooth workflow and reduced waiting time in busy workplaces.</p><p>The printer supports automatic duplex printing (fdn model), enabling double-sided printing to reduce paper usage and lower operational costs while maintaining efficient document handling. Its high monthly duty cycle is designed for continuous business operation, making it suitable for high-volume printing environments.</p><p>Equipped with a flatbed scanner and automatic document feeder (ADF), the HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP 4303fdn enables fast and efficient scanning and copying of multi-page documents. Integrated fax functionality enhances communication capabilities for office operations.</p><p>With a print resolution of up to 600 x 600 dpi, the printer delivers crisp text and detailed graphics that ensure professional output for all business needs. A high-capacity input tray reduces interruptions and supports continuous printing workflows.</p><p>The HP 4303fdn features Gigabit Ethernet connectivity for secure and stable network integration in shared office environments. It is designed for multiple users, ensuring reliable access to printing, scanning, and copying functions across departments.</p><p>Powered by a robust processor and optimized memory, the printer handles complex print jobs efficiently while maintaining consistent performance. Its energy-efficient design helps reduce operational costs while supporting sustainable business practices.</p><p>The HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP 4303fdn is built for reliability, speed, and versatility, making it an ideal choice for organizations that require a complete multifunction color printing solution for professional environments.</p><h2>Key Features</h2><ul><li>Print, Copy, Scan, and Fax functionality</li><li>Color Laser Printing Technology</li><li>Print speed up to 33 ppm</li><li>Up to 600 x 600 dpi print resolution</li><li>Automatic duplex printing (fdn model)</li><li>Gigabit Ethernet connectivity</li><li>High-capacity business printing</li><li>Flatbed scanner with ADF support</li><li>Professional color output quality</li><li>Energy-efficient performance</li><li>Designed for medium to large offices</li><li>Reliable enterprise-grade build</li></ul><h2>Why Buy from International Office Solution?</h2><p>Purchase the original HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP 4303fdn Multifunction Printer from International Office Solution. We offer genuine HP products, competitive pricing, expert consultation, and dependable after-sales support for corporate offices, businesses, and institutions across Bangladesh.</p><h2>Warranty Information</h2><ul><li>Printer Warranty: 1 Year Limited Warranty</li><li>Adapter/Power Cable: No Warranty</li><li>Box Mandatory While Claiming Warranty</li></ul>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>General</s