(302, 'HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP M479fnw Multifunction Color Laser Printer', 'The HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP M479fnw is a versatile all-in-one color laser printer ideal for small and medium businesses. It prints, copies, scans, faxes, and emails at speeds of up to 28 ppm with a print resolution of up to 38,400 x 600 dpi. Featuring dual-band Wi-Fi, Gigabit Ethernet, USB 2.0, and mobile printing support via HP Smart App, AirPrint, and Google Cloud Print, it connects seamlessly to any workflow. With a 250-sheet input tray, 50-sheet ADF, a 4.3-inch touchscreen, and best-in-class security features, the M479fnw delivers efficiency, reliability, and professional quality — all backed by a 1-year warranty.', 'hp-color-laserjet-pro-mfp-m479fnw-multifunction-color-laser-printer-1780755153', '<p><strong>HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP M479fnw</strong></p><p>The <strong>HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP M479fnw</strong> is a high-performance multifunction color laser printer engineered to meet the dynamic demands of small and medium-sized businesses. Combining five essential office functions — printing, copying, scanning, faxing, and emailing — into a single compact device, the M479fnw eliminates the need for multiple machines and significantly reduces workspace clutter while increasing overall productivity.</p><h3>Exceptional Print Performance</h3><p>At the heart of this machine is a powerful laser print engine capable of delivering both black-and-white and color prints at speeds of up to 28 pages per minute (ppm). Whether you are producing client-facing color brochures, internal reports, or everyday correspondence, the M479fnw delivers crisp, professional-quality output at a native resolution of 600 x 600 dpi — enhanced further to an impressive 38,400 x 600 dpi using HP\'s intelligent resolution enhancement technology. The result is razor-sharp text, smooth gradients, and vivid color reproduction on every page.</p><h3>Versatile Paper Handling</h3><p>The M479fnw is designed for busy office environments where a wide variety of document types and sizes are handled daily. It comes equipped with a 250-sheet main input tray for standard paper stock, a 50-sheet multipurpose tray for envelopes, labels, and specialty media, and a 50-sheet automatic document feeder (ADF) for fast, hands-free scanning, copying, and faxing of multi-page originals. The output tray holds up to 150 sheets, keeping printed documents neatly organized even during long print runs.</p><h3>Comprehensive Connectivity</h3><p>Staying connected is effortless with the M479fnw\'s broad range of connectivity options. It supports Hi-Speed USB 2.0 for direct wired connections, Gigabit Ethernet for fast and stable network integration, and dual-band Wi-Fi (2.4 GHz and 5 GHz) for flexible wireless printing throughout the office. Mobile users can print wirelessly using the HP Smart App, Apple AirPrint, Google Cloud Print, Mopria Print Service, and HP ePrint — ensuring that documents reach the printer from any smartphone, tablet, or laptop, regardless of operating system.</p><h3>Advanced Security Features</h3><p>In an era where data breaches are a growing concern, the HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP M479fnw prioritizes document and network security. It features HP\'s best-in-class security suite, including real-time threat detection, continuous automated monitoring, and built-in safeguards that help prevent unauthorized access to your device and sensitive documents. These enterprise-grade security features provide businesses with the confidence that their information remains protected at all times.</p><h3>Smart and Intuitive Operation</h3><p>The M479fnw features a 4.3-inch (10.92 cm) intuitive color touchscreen display that makes navigation simple and straightforward. Users can easily access print, scan, copy, fax, and email functions from the home screen, customize workflows, and manage device settings without the need for extensive training. A 1,200 MHz processor and 512 MB of DRAM ensure that jobs are processed quickly and efficiently, even during periods of high demand.</p><h3>Sustainability and Energy Efficiency</h3><p>HP designed the M479fnw with environmental responsibility in mind. It meets ENERGY STAR® certification requirements and employs automatic power-down features to minimize energy consumption during idle periods. Businesses can reduce their carbon footprint without sacrificing the performance and reliability they depend on day to day.</p><h3>Reliable and Cost-Effective Printing</h3><p>Compatible with HP 415A standard-yield and HP 415X high-yield toner cartridges in Black, Cyan, Magenta, and Yellow, the M479fnw offers flexible running cost management. The high-yield 415X black cartridge delivers up to 7,500 pages, making it an economical choice for high-volume printing environments. Original HP toners ensure consistent print quality and reliable performance across the life of each cartridge.</p><p>The HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP M479fnw is the definitive all-in-one solution for businesses that demand professional output, seamless connectivity, robust security, and dependable day-to-day performance — all in a single device.</p><p><strong>Buy HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP M479fnw from International Office Solution In Bangladesh,</strong> you can purchase the original HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP M479fnw Multifunction Color Laser Printer from International Office Solution — your trusted source for genuine HP office equipment and accessories. We carry a wide range of the latest HP laser printers to suit every business need and budget.</p><p>Order online through our website or visit your nearest International Office Solution branch to get yours at the best price. Our knowledgeable team is always ready to assist you in selecting the right printer and consumables for your office.</p><p>The HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP M479fnw comes with a 1-year limited warranty.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>General</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Functions</td><td>Print, Scan, Copy, Fax</td></tr><tr><td>Printer Type</td><td>Multi function Color Laser Printer</td></tr><tr><td>Output Color</td><td>Color</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Print</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Technology</td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td>Print Speed</td><td>Black/color: Up to 27 ppm</td></tr><tr><td>Print Resolution</td><td>black: 600 x 600 dpi, Up to 38,400 x 600 enhanced dpi<br>color: 600 x 600 dpi, Up to 38,400 x 600 enhanced dpi</td></tr><tr><td>First Print Out Time</td><td>As fast as 9.5 sec<br>As fast as 11.0 sec</td></tr><tr><td>Duty Cycle up to (Yield)</td><td>Up to 50000 Pages</td></tr><tr><td>Duplex</td><td>Manual</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Copy</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Copy Speed</td><td>27cpm (B &amp; C)<br><br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Copy Resolution</td><td>600 x 600dpi</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Scan</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Scan Type</td><td>Flatbed, ADF</td></tr><tr><td>Scan Resolution</td><td>1200 x 1200dpi</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum Scan Size</td><td>A4</td></tr><tr><td>Duplex Scan</td><td>Duplex ADF scanning</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Fax</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Transmission Speed (kbps)</td><td>33.6Kbps<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Max Resolution</td><td>300 x 300dpi ((halftone enabled))</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Paper Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Paper Size</td><td>A4; A5; A6; B5 (JIS); B6 (JIS); 16K (195 x 270 mm, 184 x 260 mm, 197 x 273 mm); 10 x 15 cm; Oficio (216 x 340 mm); Postcards (JIS single, JIS double); Envelopes (DL, C5, B5); Optional Tray 3: A4; A5; A6; B5 (JIS); B6 (JIS); 16K (195 x 270 mm, 184 x 260 mm, 197 x 273 mm); 10 x 15 cm; Oficio (216 x 340 mm); Postcards (JIS single, JIS double)</td></tr><tr><td>Paper Type</td><td>Paper (bond, brochure, coloured, glossy, photo, plain, preprinted, prepunched, recycled, rough), postcards, labels, envelopes</td></tr><tr><td>Input Capacity</td><td>50 sheet multipurpose tray, 250 sheet input tray, 50 sheet Automatic Document Feeder (ADF)</td></tr><tr><td>Output Capacity</td><td>150 Sheets</td></tr><tr><td>ADF</td><td>Yes, 50 sheets</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Technical Specs</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>1200MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>512 MB NAND Flash, 512 MB DRAM</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>10.92 cm (4.3 in) intuitive touchscreen Colour Graphic Display (CGD)</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB, LAN, WiFi</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>550 watts (Active Printing), 20 watts (Ready), 0.7 watts (Sleep), 0.7 watts (Auto-Off/Auto-On), 0.06 watts (Auto-off/Manual On), 0.06 watts (Off) 7</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>416 x 461 x 400 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>22.6 kg</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Support</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Toner/ Cartridge/ Refill</td><td>HP 415A Black LaserJet Toner Cartridge (2,400 pages) W2030A; HP 415A Cyan LaserJet Toner Cartridge (2,100 pages) W2031A; HP 415A Yellow LaserJet Toner Cartridge (2,100 pages) W2032A; HP 415A Magenta LaserJet Toner Cartridge (2,100 pages) W2033A; HP 415x Black LaserJet Toner Cartridge (7,500 pages) W2030X; HP 415x Cyan LaserJet Toner Cartridge (6,000 pages) W2031X; HP 415x Yellow LaserJet Toner Cartridge (6,000 pages) W2032X; HP 415x Magenta LaserJet Toner Cartridge (6,000 pages) W2033X (Please make sure your existing &amp; mentioned toner/cartridge model are same before buying new one)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1-year Limited warranty, an Adapter/Power Cable with no warranty, and also a Box Mandatory While Claiming.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PRINTER', 141000.00, 141500.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/UVnMomCc4fMOkZ6wma19yDWCjpA3EFkJoRMAxd5W.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-06 14:12:33', '2026-06-06 14:12:33', 'HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP M479fnw Multifunction Color Laser Printer | International Office Solution', 'Buy the HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP M479fnw Multifunction Color Laser Printer in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Print, scan, copy, fax & email at up to 28 ppm with Wi-Fi, Ethernet & mobile printing. 1-year warranty. Order online or visit your nearest branch.', 'HP multifunction color laser printer, HP laser printer Bangladesh, HP M479fnw price Bangladesh, buy HP printer Bangladesh, HP 415A toner, HP wireless color printer', NULL, 1, NULL, NULL),
(303, 'HP Color LaserJet Professional CP5225dn Single Function Color Laser Printer', 'The HP Color LaserJet Professional CP5225dn, proudly offered by International Office Solution, is an affordable and versatile A3 color laser printer designed for optimal business performance. Delivering consistent, high-quality output on various media types at speeds up to 20 ppm, this printer is perfectly equipped to handle everyday documents, wide-format projects, and in-house marketing materials with ease.', 'hp-color-laserjet-professional-cp5225dn-single-function-color-laser-printer-1780755718', '<p><strong>HP Color LaserJet Professional CP5225dn</strong></p><p>The <strong>HP Color LaserJet Professional CP5225dn</strong>, proudly offered by <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, is an affordable and versatile A3 color laser printer designed for optimal business performance. Delivering consistent, high-quality output on various media types at speeds up to 20 ppm, this printer is perfectly equipped to handle everyday documents, wide-format projects, and in-house marketing materials with ease.</p><h2>Comprehensive Product Description</h2><h3>Elevate Your Workflow with International Office Solution</h3><p>Handle all your demanding business printing needs with the <strong>HP Color LaserJet Professional CP5225dn Single Function Color Laser Printer</strong>. This highly versatile, affordable A3 color printer empowers your team to produce everyday business documents, wide-format projects, and vibrant marketing materials entirely in-house.</p><h3>Unmatched Versatility and Media Handling</h3><p>Whether you are operating in a bustling corporate environment or setting up a high-end home office, this printer adapts to your requirements. With expandable paper trays, you can seamlessly transition between different types of media, including plain, premium, and glossy paper, ensuring that every project is presented on the ideal canvas.</p><h3>Superior Speed and Print Quality</h3><p>Experience consistently exceptional output powered by advanced printing technology.</p><ul><li><strong>Precision Quality:</strong> Achieve vibrant colors and sharp text thanks to <strong>HP ColorSphere toner</strong> and <strong>HP ImageREt 3600</strong> technology.</li><li><strong>Rapid Performance:</strong> Maintain productivity with print speeds of up to <strong>20 ppm</strong> (pages per minute) for both black and color A4 documents.</li><li><strong>Instant-On Technology:</strong> Minimize wait times with a first page out in under <strong>18 seconds</strong> directly from low-power mode.</li></ul><h3>Intuitive Operation and Connectivity</h3><p>Designed for seamless integration into your workspace, this printer is remarkably simple to use, share, and maintain. It features an intuitive control panel for straightforward navigation and utilizes simple-to-replace supplies. Furthermore, it offers versatile <strong>High-speed USB 2.0 connectivity</strong>, allowing for effortless work-team sharing and integration.</p><h2>Specifications &amp; Supplies</h2><p><strong>Compatible Toner Cartridges:</strong> Ensure peak performance and longevity by utilizing the specified HP 307A series toners.</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Color</th><th>Toner Model Number</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Black</strong></td><td>TONER # 307A-BLACK</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cyan</strong></td><td>TONER # 307A-CYAN</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Yellow</strong></td><td>TONER # 307A-YELLOW</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Magenta</strong></td><td>TONER # 307A-MAGENTA</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h2>Warranty Information</h2><p><strong>International Office Solution</strong> stands behind the reliability of your purchase with the following warranty terms:</p><ul><li><strong>Hardware Warranty:</strong> 1-Year Limited Warranty.</li><li><strong>Accessories:</strong> Adapter/Power Cable is provided with no warranty.</li><li><strong>Claim Requirement:</strong> The original product box is strictly mandatory when submitting a warranty claim.</li></ul>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>General</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Functions</td><td>Print Only</td></tr><tr><td>Printer Type</td><td>Single Function Color Laser Printer</td></tr><tr><td>Output Color</td><td>Color</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Print</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Technology</td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td>Print Speed</td><td>Up to 20 ppm, letter/A4 and black-and-white/color</td></tr><tr><td>Print Resolution</td><td>Up to 600 x 600 dpi</td></tr><tr><td>First Print Out Time</td><td>Black-and-white: as fast as 14.5 seconds, letter (as fast as 16 seconds, A4); Color: as fast as 15.5 seconds, letter (as fast as 17 seconds, A4)</td></tr><tr><td>Duty Cycle up to (Yield)</td><td>75000 Pages</td></tr><tr><td>Duplex</td><td>Automatic; Built-in Fast Ethernet 10/100 Base-T networking; built-in automatic two-sided printing</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Paper Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Paper Size</td><td>Tray 1: A3, A4, A5, A6, RA3, SRA3, B4, B5, 8k, 16k, 10x15 cm, post cards (JIS single and double); letter, legal, executive, 11 x 17 in, 12 x 18 in, 4 x 6 in, 5 x 8 in, 8.5 x 13 in; envelopes (DL, C5, B5, No. 10, Monarch); custom: 76 x 127 mm (3 x 5 in) to 320 x 457 mm (12.6 x 18 in) Tray 2: A3, A4, A5, B4, B5, 8k, 16k, double postcard; letter, legal, executive, 11 x 17 in, 8.5 x 13 in; custom: 148 x 182 mm (5.8 x 7.2 in) to 297 x 432 mm (11.7 x 17 in); Optional tray 3: A3, A4, B4, B5, 8k; letter, legal, executive, 11 x 17 in, 8.5 x 13 in; custom: 148 x 210 mm (5.8 x 8.3 in) to 297 x 432 mm (11.7 x 17 in) Automatic two-sided printing: A3, A4, A5, RA3, SRA3, B4, B5, 8k, 16k, double postcard; letter, legal, executive, 11 x 17 in, 12 x 18 in, 8.5 x 13 in</td></tr><tr><td>Paper Type</td><td>Paper (bond, brochure, colored, glossy, letterhead, photo, plain, preprinted, pre-punched, recycled, rough); cardstock; glossy film;