(304, 'HP LaserJet Enterprise M751DN Single Function Color Laser Printer', 'The HP LaserJet Enterprise M751DN Single Function Color Laser Printer is a high-performance A3 color laser printer designed for enterprise and business environments. It delivers professional-quality prints with a resolution of up to 1200 x 1200 dpi and speeds of up to 41 pages per minute. Featuring automatic duplex printing, advanced security features, a 2.7-inch color display, and USB & Gigabit Ethernet connectivity, the M751DN ensures reliable, secure, and efficient printing for high-volume office workloads. Its support for various media types and paper sizes up to A3 makes it an ideal solution for businesses requiring exceptional color printing performance.', 'hp-laserjet-enterprise-m751dn-single-function-color-laser-printer-1780756576', '<p>HP LaserJet Enterprise M751DN A3 Color Laser Printer The HP LaserJet Enterprise M751DN Single Function Color Laser Printer is a powerful enterprise-grade printing solution designed for businesses, corporate offices, educational institutions, and professional work environments that demand high-speed, high-volume, and premium-quality color printing. Featuring advanced laser printing technology, this printer delivers sharp text, vibrant graphics, and professional-quality documents with a print resolution of up to 1200 x 1200 dpi.</p><p>With an impressive print speed of up to 41 pages per minute (ppm) for both black and color prints, the HP LaserJet Enterprise M751DN ensures maximum productivity and efficiency. The printer also offers a fast first-page-out time of just 5.7 seconds for black and 6.1 seconds for color, helping businesses reduce waiting time and increase workflow performance.</p><p>Designed to support a wide range of media types, the HP M751DN can print on plain paper, glossy paper, recycled paper, envelopes, labels, cardstock, and more. It supports paper sizes from A6 to A3, making it ideal for marketing materials, presentations, posters, b