(305, 'HP LaserJet Enterprise M806dn Single Function Laser Printer', 'The HP LaserJet Enterprise M806dn Single Function Laser Printer is a powerful A3 monochrome laser printer designed for high-volume business and enterprise printing. It delivers sharp, professional-quality documents with a print resolution of up to 1200 x 1200 dpi and print speeds of up to 56 pages per minute. Featuring automatic duplex printing, robust security features, USB and Gigabit Ethernet connectivity, and support for multiple paper sizes up to A3, the HP M806dn is ideal for offices that require fast, reliable, and cost-effective black-and-white printing performance.', 'hp-laserjet-enterprise-m806dn-single-function-laser-printer-1780756954', '<p>HP LaserJet Enterprise M806dn Single Function Laser Printer HP LaserJet Enterprise M806dn A3 Monochrome Laser Printer The HP LaserJet Enterprise M806dn Single Function Laser Printer is a high-performance A3 monochrome laser printer designed for large enterprises, government offices, educational institutions, and businesses with demanding printing requirements. Built to handle heavy workloads, this enterprise-class printer delivers exceptional speed, reliability, and professional-quality output for high-volume document production.</p><p>With a print speed of up to 56 pages per minute (ppm) and a sharp print resolution of 1200 x 1200 dpi, the HP M806dn produces crisp text, detailed graphics, and professional-quality business documents. The printer\'s fast first-page-out time of just 8.5 seconds ensures minimal waiting time and improved office productivity.</p><p>Designed for continuous operation, the HP LaserJet Enterprise M806dn offers a massive monthly duty cycle of up to 300,000 pages, with a recommended monthly print volume of 10,000 to 50,000 pages, making it ideal for busy work environments. The built-in automatic duplex printing feature helps reduce paper consumption and operating costs while supporting environmentally responsible printing prac