(306, 'HP Neverstop Laser MFP 1200a Multifunction Mono Laser Printer', 'The HP Neverstop Laser MFP 1200a is a high-performance monochrome multifunction laser printer designed for efficient, low-cost, high-volume printing. It delivers sharp black text, bold prints, and reliable everyday performance. With USB 2.0 connectivity, it supports printing, scanning, and copying, making it ideal for home offices and small businesses. Its innovative toner reload system reduces printing costs and downtime, offering a smooth and hassle-free printing experience.', 'hp-neverstop-laser-mfp-1200a-multifunction-mono-laser-printer-1780759217', '<p>The HP Neverstop Laser MFP 1200a is designed for users who need efficient, economical, and high-volume printing without compromising quality. Powered by HP’s innovative toner reload technology, it allows users to easily refill toner in a clean and hassle-free way, significantly reducing printing costs over time.</p><p>This multifunction printer supports printing, scanning, and copying, making it a complete office solution. It delivers fast print speeds of up to 21/20 pages per minute (Letter/A4), helping users complete tasks quickly and efficiently. With a 150-sheet input tray and 100-sheet output capacity, it is ideal for continuous daily workloads in offices, institutions, and home environments.</p><p>The printer supports multiple media types including A4, A5, A6, Letter, envelopes, labels, and heavy paper, offering flexibility for various printing needs. Its compact and space-saving design ensures it fits easily on any desk while still supporting a duty cycle of up to 20,000 pages.</p><p>Built with HP’s trusted laser technology, the Neverstop 1200a produces crisp text, bold blacks, and professional-quality documents every time. It is an excellent choice for students, small businesses, and office users looking for long-term value and reliability.</p><h2>Why Buy from International Office Solution?</h2><p>International Office Solution is a tr