(309, 'Canon Color imageCLASS LBP633Cdw Laser Printer', 'The Canon Color imageCLASS LBP633Cdw is a high-performance wireless color laser printer designed for small businesses and home offices. It delivers fast printing speeds up to 22 ppm with sharp 1200 x 1200 dpi resolution for professional-quality color documents. With Wi-Fi, Ethernet, and mobile printing support, it ensures flexible and efficient workflow.', 'canon-color-imageclass-lbp633cdw-laser-printer-1780761415', '<p><strong>Canon Color imageCLASS LBP633Cdw Laser Printer</strong></p><p>The Canon Color imageCLASS LBP633Cdw is a reliable and efficient wireless color laser printer built for modern workplaces, home offices, and small businesses. It delivers fast printing speeds of up to 22 pages per minute (Letter), helping users complete tasks quickly and efficiently. With a first printout time of just 10.3 seconds, it reduces waiting time and improves productivity.</p><p>This printer offers high-quality output with up to 1200 x 1200 dpi resolution, producing sharp text and vibrant color graphics suitable for business reports, marketing materials, and everyday documents. It supports multiple printer languages including UFR II, PCL, and PS for smooth compatibility with various systems and workflows.</p><p>For connectivity, it includes USB 2.0, Gigabit Ethernet, Wi-Fi, and Wi-Fi Direct, allowing users to print easily from laptops, smartphones, and tablets without needing a wired connection. It also supports mobile printing for added convenience in flexible working environments.</p><p>The printer comes with a 250-sheet input tray and manual feed slot, supporting different paper sizes and media types. It also features a user-friendly 5-line LCD display for easy navigation and control.</p><p>Built with advanced security features such as TLS 1.3, IPSec, SNMPv3, and IP/MAC filtering, it ensures safe and secure printing for business environments. Energy-efficient performance and ENERGY STAR certification make it cost-