ets</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Technical Specs</strong></td><td>Memory</td><td>1 GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Display</td><td>5-line LCD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB 2.0 High‐Speed, 10/100/1000Base‐T/TX Ethernet (Network), Wi‐Fi 802.11b/g/n, Wi‐Fi® Direct Connection</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td><p>Maximum: Approx. 900 W</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>Standby: Approx. 7.9 W</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>Sleep Mode: Approx. 0.7 W</p></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimension</td><td>21.5\" (W) x 21.9\" (D) x 14.8\" (H)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>41.9 lbs.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Special Features</strong></td><td>Mobile Printing</td><td>Canon PRINT Business, Canon Print Service, Google Cloud Print, Apple AirPrint, Mopria Print Service</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Support &amp; Warranty</strong></td><td>Toner/ Cartridge</td><td><p>Cartridge 054 BK: 1,500 pages (bundled: 910 pages)</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>Cartridge 054 CMY: 1,200 pages (bundled: 680 pages)</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p><i>(Ensure exact models match before replacing)</i></p></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Software Support</td><td><p>Windows 11, 10, 8.1, Server 2012 / 2012 R2 / 2016 / 2019 / 2022</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>Mac OS X (10.11 or later)</p></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>1-year Limited warranty (Adapter/Power Cable not covered). Original Box Mandatory While Claiming.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p>', 'PRINTER', 42699.99, 42700.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/OCLMSnhIEFRYrFqzjUHCeskQkcLkm5db68VCEZxT.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-06 15:56:55', '2026-06-06 15:56:55', 'Canon Color imageCLASS LBP633Cdw Printer Price in Bangladesh | Color Laser Printer', 'Buy Canon Color imageCLASS LBP633Cdw Laser Printer in Bangladesh at best price. Fast color printing, Wi-Fi, Ethernet, mobile printing, and high-quality output. Available at International Office Solution.', 'office color printer,