(310, 'Canon i-SENSYS LBP633CDW Color Laser Printer', 'The Canon i-SENSYS LBP633CDW is a high-performance color laser printer designed for modern offices and business environments. It delivers fast printing speeds up to 21 ppm (A4) with sharp 1200 x 1200 dpi resolution. With Wi-Fi, LAN, USB, and mobile printing support, it ensures flexible and efficient workflow for professional users.', 'canon-i-sensys-lbp633cdw-color-laser-printer-1780762039', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Canon i-SENSYS LBP633CDW Color Laser Printer is a powerful and reliable printing solution designed for contemporary workplaces, small businesses, and professional users. It combines speed, quality, and flexibility, offering printing speeds of up to 21 pages per minute (A4) and up to 38 ppm for A5 landscape documents, making it ideal for high-volume printing tasks.</p><p>Using advanced Color Laser Beam Printing technology, it delivers vibrant, sharp, and high-quality output with a resolution of up to 1200 x 1200 dpi. This makes it suitable for business reports, marketing materials, presentations, and everyday office documents.</p><p>The printer features a user-friendly 5-line LCD panel with a numeric keypad for easy operation and navigation. It supports multiple connectivity options including USB 2.0, LAN, Wi-Fi, and Wireless Direct, ensuring seamless integration with desktops, laptops, and mobile devices.</p><p>With automatic duplex printing and a 251-sheet input tray, it supports efficient paper handling for various media types including plain paper, envelopes, labels, and coated paper. It also offers fast first-page-out times of around 10.4–10.5 seconds, improving productivity in busy environments.</p><p>Powered by a dual-core 800MHz processor and 1GB memory, it handles complex print jobs smoothly and supports a monthly duty cycle of up to 30,000 pages. It is compatible with Windows, macOS, and Linux systems, making it highly versatile.</p><p>Energy-efficient design, high-yield toner support (Cartridge