(311, 'Canon i-SENSYS LBP631Cw Color Laser Printer', 'The Canon i-SENSYS LBP631Cw is a compact and efficient color laser printer designed for small and medium businesses. It delivers high-quality prints up to 1200 x 1200 dpi with fast speeds of 18 ppm (A4). With Wi-Fi, Ethernet, USB, and mobile printing support, it ensures flexible and modern printing performance.', 'canon-i-sensys-lbp631cw-color-laser-printer-1780762339', '<p>Canon i-SENSYS LBP631Cw Color Laser Printer</p><p>The Canon i-SENSYS LBP631Cw Color Laser Printer is a reliable and efficient printing solution designed for small and medium-sized businesses. It utilizes advanced color laser beam technology to deliver sharp, vibrant prints with a resolution of up to 1200 x 1200 dpi, ensuring professional-quality documents every time.</p><p>It offers fast performance with print speeds of up to 18 pages per minute (A4) and up to 38 ppm for A5 landscape printing. With a quick first print-out time of approximately 10.5 seconds for color and 10.4 seconds for mono, it helps improve productivity in busy office environments.</p><p>This printer supports a wide range of connectivity options including USB 2.0, Ethernet, Wi-Fi, and Wi-Fi Direct. It also supports mobile printing through AirPrint, Mopria, and the Canon PRINT Business app, making printing easy from smartphones and tablets.</p><p>The LBP631Cw features a 250-sheet input cassette and a manual feed slot, supporting various media types and paper weights up to 200 g/m². It is compatible with Windows, macOS, and Linux, ensuring smooth integration across different systems.</p><p>With strong security features such as TLS 1.3, WPA2-PSK, and IP/MAC filtering, it ensures secure document handling. Its compact design, low noise operation, and energy-efficient performance (TEC 0.19 kWh/week) make it ideal for modern office spaces.</p><h2><strong>🔹 Why Buy from International Office Solution?</strong></h2><p>International Office Solution is a trusted provider of IT and offic