(313, 'Canon i-SENSYS MF754Cdw All-In-One Multifunction Color Laser Printer', 'The Canon i-SENSYS MF754Cdw is a powerful all-in-one color laser printer designed for modern office environments. It supports printing, copying, scanning, and faxing with fast speeds up to 33 ppm and high-quality 1200 x 1200 dpi output. With Wi-Fi, Ethernet, USB, and cloud connectivity, it ensures maximum productivity and flexibility.', 'canon-i-sensys-mf754cdw-all-in-one-multifunction-color-laser-printer-1780762838', '<h2><strong>Canon i-SENSYS MF754Cdw All-In-One Multifunction Color Laser Printer</strong></h2><p>The Canon i-SENSYS MF754Cdw Multifunction Color Laser Printer is a high-performance all-in-one solution designed for small to medium-sized business environments. It combines printing, copying, scanning, and faxing into a single compact device, delivering speed, accuracy, and reliability for demanding office workflows.</p><p>It offers fast print speeds of up to 33 pages per minute with high-resolution output up to 1200 x 1200 dpi, ensuring sharp text and vibrant color documents. With a quick first print-out time of just 7.1 seconds and a warm-up time of 14 seconds, it minimizes waiting time and boosts productivity.</p><p>This printer supports advanced printing languages including UFRII, PCL, and Adobe PostScript, making it compatible with a wide range of business applications. It also includes Secure Print, Encrypted Print, and cloud integration with Google Drive, Dropbox, and OneDrive for modern hybrid work environments.</p><p>The scanning system is highly efficient, offering duplex scan speeds up to 100 ipm and supporting scan-to-email, USB, FTP, PC, and cloud storage. Copying features include ID card copy, 2-on-1, and 4-on-1 functions for improved workflow efficiency. The built-in fax system supports high-speed transmission with memory backup.</p><p>With a large paper capacity of up to 850 sheets, 50-sheet ADF, and support for multiple paper sizes, it is built for high-volume office use. Connectivity options include USB 2.0, Gigabit Ethernet, Wi-Fi, and Wireless Direct for seamless integration into any network.</p><p>It also features a 12.7 cm touchscreen display, dual 1200 MHz processors, and 1GB memory for smooth operation. Designed for efficiency, it supports a monthly duty cycle of up to 50,000 pages while maintaining low power consumption.</p><h2><strong>🔹 Why Buy from International Office Solution?</strong></h2><p>International Office Solution is a trusted provider of IT and office equipment solutions in Bangladesh. We offer genuine products, competitive pricing, expert consultation, and professional after-sales support to ensure maximum customer satisfaction.</p><p>Purchase the <strong>Canon i-SENSYS MF754Cdw Multifunction Color Laser Printer</strong> from International Office Solution and experience fast, secure, and professional-quality printing backed by reliable service and technical expertise.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Functions</td><td>Print, Copy, Scan, and Fax</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Printer Type</td><td>Color Laser All-In-One</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Output Color</td><td>Color</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Print</strong></td><td>Technology</td><td>Colour laser beam printing</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Print Speed</td><td>Up to 33 ppm (Color/Black)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Print Resolution</td><td>Up to 1200 x 1200 dpi</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warm-Up Time</td><td>Approx. 14 seconds or less from power on</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>First Print Out Time</td><td>Colour &amp; Mono: Approx. 7.1 seconds or less</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Duty Cycle</td><td>Max. 50,000 pages per month</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Duplex</td><td>Automatic</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Copy</strong></td><td>Copy S