(315, 'Canon i-SENSYS LBP246dw Single Function Laser Printer', 'The Canon i-SENSYS LBP246dw is a high-performance mono laser printer designed for fast, reliable, and professional office printing. It delivers up to 40 ppm print speed with automatic duplex printing and sharp 1200 x 1200 dpi resolution. With Wi-Fi, LAN, and USB connectivity, it ensures seamless productivity for modern workplaces.', 'canon-i-sensys-lbp246dw-single-function-laser-printer-1780763540', '<p>🖨️ Canon i-SENSYS LBP246dw Single Function Laser Printer</p><p>The Canon i-SENSYS LBP246dw Single Function Laser Printer is a powerful and efficient printing solution designed for modern offices, professionals, and small to medium-sized businesses. It delivers fast print speeds of up to 40 pages per minute (A4), ensuring high productivity and reduced waiting time for large print jobs.</p><p>With automatic duplex printing, it helps reduce paper usage and operational costs while maintaining efficiency. The printer delivers sharp print quality with a resolution of up to 1200 x 1200 dpi, producing clear text and detailed graphics suitable for legal documents, invoices, and business reports.</p><p>It supports a wide range of paper sizes from A6 to Legal, along with multiple media types including plain, recycled, coated paper, and envelopes. With a 250-sheet cassette, 100-sheet multipurpose tray, and 150-sheet output capacity, it is built for continuous office workloads.</p><p>The LBP246dw offers flexible connectivity options including USB, LAN, and Wi-Fi, allowing easy printing from desktops, laptops, smartphones, and tablets. Mobile printing is supported via AirPrint, Mopria, and Canon PRINT Business app.</p><p>For enhanced security, it includes TLS 1.3, IPSec, WPA2-PSK, and IP/MAC filtering, making it ideal for businesses handling sensitive documents. Powered by a 1200MHz processor, 1GB RAM, and 4GB eMMC storage, it ensures smooth and fast processing of complex print jobs.</p><p>With support for UFRII, PCL, and Adobe PostScript, along with Canon 070/070H high-yield toner compatibility, it offers low running costs and long-term reliability. Designed for demanding workloads, it supports up to 80,000 pages monthly duty cycle, making it a dependable choice for busy offices.</p><h2><strong>🔹 Why Buy from International Office Solution?</strong></h2><p>International Office Solution is a trusted provider of IT and office equipment solutions in Bangladesh. We offer genuine products, competitive pricing, expert consultation, and professional after-sales support to ensure maximum customer satisfaction.</p><p>Purchase the <strong>Canon i-SENSYS LBP246dw Single Function Laser Printer</strong> from International Office Solution and enjoy fast, secure, and high-quality printing backed by reliable service and technical expertise.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Functions</td><td>Print Only</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Printer Type</td><td>Single Function</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Output Color</td><td>Black &amp; White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Print</strong></td><td>Technology</td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Print Speed</td><td><p>40 ppm (A4)</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>65.4 ppm (A5-Landscape)</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>33.6 ipm (A4) Double sided</p></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Print Resolution</td><td>Up to 1200 x 1200 dpi</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>First Print Out Time</td><td>5 sec</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Duty Cycle</td><td>Up to 3,000 Pages</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Duplex</td><td>Automatic</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Paper Information</strong></td><td>Paper Size</td><td><p>Legal, Letter, A4, A5, A5 (Landscape), A6, B5, Executive, Statement, OFFICIO, B-OFFICIO, M-OFFICIO, GLTR, GLGL, Foolscap, 16K</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Custom sizes:</strong> Min. 105 x 148 m