><td>Output Capacity</td><td>250 sheets</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Technical Specs</strong></td><td>Memory</td><td>1 GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Display</td><td>5-line LCD display</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB, LAN</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td><p>AC 220 - 240V (+/-10%), 50/60 Hz (+/-2Hz)</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>1380 W (max)</p></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimension</td><td>417 x 376 x 275 mm</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>11.5 kg (without cartridge)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Special Features</strong></td><td>Environmental &amp; Operating</td><td><p>Noise: Sound Pressure Level 54 dB, Sound Power Level 6.9 B</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>Operating Temperature: 10 - 30°C</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>Humidity: 20% - 80% RH (no condensation)</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>Warm-up Time: 30 sec</p></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Mobile Printing</td><td>Canon PRINT Business, Canon Print Service, Google Cloud Print, Apple AirPrint, Mopria Print Service</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Support &amp; Warranty</strong></td><td>Toner/ Cartridge</td><td><p>Cartridge 056L</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>Cartridge 056</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>Cartridge 056H</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p><i>(Ensure exact models match before replacing)</i></p></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Software Support</td><td><p>Windows 10, 8.1, 7, Server 2019 / 2016 / 2012 R2 / 2012 / 2008 R2 / 2008</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>Mac OS X 10.9.5 &amp; up, Linux</p></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>1-year Limited warranty (Adapter/Power Cable not covered). Original Box Mandatory While Claiming.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PRINTER', 87000.00, 87000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/Mt5QQ9QZpL7JHDkg8yvoXsyvTDybjHs9pzwhj4SZ.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-06 16:37:14', '2026-06-06 16:37:14', 'Canon LBP-325X Mono Laser Printer Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy Canon LBP-325X Single-Functi