(317, 'Canon i-SENSYS MF752Cdw All-In-One Multifunction Color Laser Printer', 'The Canon i-SENSYS MF752Cdw is a high-performance all-in-one color laser printer designed for modern offices. It delivers fast print speeds up to 33 ppm, sharp 1200 x 1200 dpi quality, and supports print, copy, scan, and fax functions. With Wi-Fi, LAN, USB, and mobile printing support, it ensures maximum productivity and flexibility.', 'canon-i-sensys-mf752cdw-all-in-one-multifunction-color-laser-printer-1780764199', '<p>🖨️ Canon i-SENSYS MF752Cdw All-In-One Multifunction Color Laser Printer</p><p>The Canon i-SENSYS MF752Cdw Multifunction Color Laser Printer is a powerful and reliable office solution built for small to medium-sized businesses and professional work environments. It combines printing, copying, scanning, and faxing in one compact device, making it ideal for high-efficiency office workflows.</p><p>It delivers fast print speeds of up to 33 pages per minute (A4) with a high-resolution output of up to 1200 x 1200 dpi, ensuring sharp text, clear graphics, and professional-quality documents. With a quick first print-out time of around 7.1 seconds, it minimizes waiting time and improves productivity.</p><p>The printer supports advanced connectivity options including USB 2.0, Gigabit Ethernet, Wi-Fi, and Wireless Direct. It also supports mobile printing through AirPrint, Mopria, and Canon PRINT Business, allowing seamless printing from smartphones, tablets, and laptops.</p><p>For scanning, it offers high-speed duplex scanning up to 100 ipm, along with scan-to-email, PC, USB, FTP, and cloud services like Google Drive, Dropbox, and OneDrive. Copying features include ID card copy, 2-on-1, 4-on-1, and duplex copying for improved efficiency.</p><p>It is powered by a 1200MHz dual-core processor with 1GB memory, ensuring smooth handling of complex print jobs. With a recommended monthly volume of 750–4,000 pages and a duty cycle of up to 50,000 pages, it is built for demanding office use.</p><p>Strong security features such as TLS 1.3, IPSec, WPA2, and IP/MAC filtering ensure safe document handling. Its compact design, energy efficiency, and enterprise-level performance make it a dependable choice for modern workplaces.</p><h2><strong>🔹 Why Buy from International Office Solution?</strong></h2><p>International Office Solution is a trusted provider of IT and office equipment solutions in Bangladesh. We offer genuine products, competitive pricing, expert consultation, and professional after-sales support to ensure maximum customer satisfaction.</p><p>Purchase the <strong>Canon i-SENSYS MF752Cdw Multifunction Color Laser Printer</strong> from International Office Solution and enjoy fast, secure, and professional-quality printing backed by reliable service and technical expertise.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Functions</td><td>Print, Copy, and Scan</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Printer Type</td><td>Color Laser All-In-One</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Output Color</td><td>Color</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Print</strong></td><td>Technology</td><td>Colour laser beam printing</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Print Speed</td><td>Up to 33 ppm (Color/Black)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Print Resolution</td><td>Up to 1200 x 1200 dpi</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warm-Up Time</td><td>Approx. 14 seconds or less from power on</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>First Print Out Time</td><td>Colour &amp; Mono: Approx. 7.1 seconds or less</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Duty Cycle</td><td>Max. 50,000 pages per month</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Duplex</td><td>Automatic</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Copy</strong></td><td>Copy Speed</td><td><p>33 ppm Single sided (A4)</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>29 ipm Double sided (A4)</p></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Copy Resolution</td><td>Up to 600 x 600 dpi</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Copy Color</td><td>Color</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Scan</strong></td><td>Scan Type</td><td>Colour</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Scan Resolution</td><td><p>Optical: Up to 600 x 600 dpi</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>Enhanced: Up to 9600 x 9600 dpi</p></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Scan Speed</td><td><p>Single-sided mono: 50 ipm (300 x 300dpi)</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>Single-sided colour: 40 ipm (300 x 300dpi)</p></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Duplex Scan</td><td>Automatic</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Paper Information</strong></td><td>Paper Size</td><td><p><strong>Cassette:</strong> A4, A5, A5 (Landscape), A6, B5, Legal, Letter, Executive, Statement, OFFICIO, B-OFFICIO, M-OFFICIO, GLTR, GLGL, Foolscap, 16K, Post card, Envelopes (COM10, DL, C5, Monarch).</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Custom:</strong> Min. 98 x 148 mm to Max. 216.0 x 356.0 mm.</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Multi-purpose tray:</strong> A4, A5, A5 (Landscape), A6, B5, Legal, Letter, Executive, Statement, OFFICIO, B-OFFICIO, M-OFFICIO, GLTR, GLGL, Foolscap, 16K, Post card, Indexcard, Envelopes.</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Custom:</strong> Min 76.0 x 127 mm to Max. 216.0 x 356.0 mm.</p></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Paper Type</td><td>Plain paper, Recycled paper, Heavy Paper, Thin paper, Colour paper, Coated paper, Pre-punched, Label, Post card, Envelope</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Paper Weight</td><td><p><strong>Cassette (Standard/Optional):</strong> 60 to 163 g/m² (Up to 200 g/m² with Coated paper)</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Multi-purpose tray:</strong> 60 to 176 g/m² (Up to 200 g/m² with Coated paper)</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>ADF:</strong> 50 to 105 g/m²</p></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Input Capacity</td><td>850-sheet cassette</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Output Capacity</td><td>150-sheet</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Technical Specs</strong></td><td>Processor</td><td>1200MHz x 2</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Memory</td><td>1 GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp