><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Paper Type</td><td>Plain Paper, Recycled Paper, Label, Postcard, Envelope</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Paper Weight</td><td><p>60 - 163 g/m² (gsm)</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>2-Sided Printing:</strong> 60 - 105 g/m²</p></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Input Capacity</td><td><p>250-sheet cassette</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>100-sheet multi-purpose tray</p></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Output Capacity</td><td>150 Sheet</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Technical Specs</strong></td><td>Memory</td><td>256 MB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Connectivity</td><td><p>USB 2.0 High Speed, 10Base-T/100Base-TX</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>Wi-Fi 802.11b/g/n (Infrastructure Mode, WPS, Direct Connection)</p></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td><p>Operation: 530 W (max. 1,300 W)</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>Standby: 3.5 W</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>Sleep: 1.0 W</p></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimension</td><td>356 x 283 x 213 mm</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>6.0 kg</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Support &amp; Warranty</strong></td><td>Toner/ Cartridge</td><td><p><strong>Standard:</strong> Cartridge 071: 1,200 pages (Bundled: 700 pages)</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>High:</strong> Cartridge 071H : 2,500 pages</p></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Software Support</td><td>Windows, Windows Server, Mac OS, Linux, Chrome OS</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>1-year Limited warranty (Adapter/Power Cable not covered). Original Box Mandatory While Claiming.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PRINTER', 22900.00, 22900.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/0fWwSaIiBFhAqZhOzn43u2oPEtIBFbPhbK9nIkQK.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-06 17:01:42', '2026-06-06 17:01:42', 'Canon imageCLASS LBP122dw Duplex Mono Laser Printer Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy Canon imageCLASS LBP122dw Duplex Mono Laser Printer in Bangladesh at best price. Fast 29ppm printing, Wi-Fi, LAN, USB, a