(322, 'Canon imageCLASS LBP6030W Wi-Fi Mono Laser Printer', 'The Canon imageCLASS LBP6030W is a compact Wi-Fi mono laser printer designed for simple, fast, and reliable everyday printing. It delivers up to 19 ppm print speed with sharp 600 x 600 dpi quality and built-in wireless connectivity, making it ideal for home and small office use.', 'canon-imageclass-lbp6030w-wi-fi-mono-laser-printer-1780765491', '<h2><strong>🖨️ Canon imageCLASS LBP6030W Wi-Fi Mono Laser Printer</strong></h2><p>The Canon imageCLASS LBP6030W Wi-Fi Mono Laser Printer is a compact and efficient printing solution designed for personal users, home offices, and small business environments. It combines simplicity, speed, and wireless convenience in a space-saving design.</p><p>It offers print speeds of up to 19 pages per minute (A4), allowing users to complete everyday printing tasks quickly and efficiently. With a print resolution of up to 600 x 600 dpi (enhanced quality up to 2400 x 600 dpi), it produces sharp, clear, and professional black-and-white documents suitable for reports, invoices, and office paperwork.</p><p>The built-in Wi-Fi connectivity allows easy wireless printing from laptops, smartphones, and tablets without needing direct cables. It also supports USB 2.0 connection for stable direct printing from a single device, ensuring flexible usage options.</p><p>With a 150-sheet input tray and 100-sheet output capacity, it is well-suited for light to moderate daily printing workloads. Its compact and lightweight design makes it perfect for tight spaces such as home desks and small offices.</p><p>The printer uses Canon’s energy-efficient laser technology, offering low power consumption and minimal maintenance. It is designed for users who want a simple, affordable, and reliable monochrome printer for everyday document printing.</p><h2><strong>🔹 Why Buy from International Office Solution?</strong></h2><p>International Office Solution is a trusted provider of IT and office equipment solutions in Bangladesh. We offer genuine products, competitive pricing, expert consultation, and professional after-sales support to ensure maximum customer satisfaction.</p><p>Purchase the <strong>Canon imageCLASS LBP6030W Wi-Fi Mono Laser Printer</strong> from International Office Solution and enjoy fast, reliable, and high-quality printing backed by trusted service and technical expertise.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Functions</td><td>Print Only</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Printer Type</td><td>Single Function Mono Laser</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Output Color</td><td>Black &amp; White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Print</strong></td><td>Technology</td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Print Speed</td><td><p>A4: Up to 18 ppm</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>Letter: Up to 19 ppm</p></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Print Resolution</td><td>600 x 600 dpi</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>First Print Out Time</td><td>7.8 sec</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Duty Cycle</td><td>Up to 5,000 Pages</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Paper Information</strong></td><td>Paper Size</td><td><p>A4, B5, A5, Legal, Letter, Executive, 16K, Envelopes (COM10, Monarch, C5, DL)</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Custom:</strong> Width 76.2 to 216 mm x Length 188 to 356 mm</p></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Paper Type</td><td>Plain paper, Heavy Paper, Transparency, Label, Envelope</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Input Capacity</td><td>150 Sheets</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Output Capacity</td><td>100 Sheets</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Technical Specs</strong></td><td>Memory</td><td>32 MB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Connectivity</td><td><p>USB 2.0 Hi-Speed</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>Wi-Fi 802.11b/g/n (WPS Easy Set Up)</p></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>870W (Max)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical