(324, 'Pantum P2500 Single Function Mono Laser Printer', 'The Pantum P2500 Single Function Mono Laser Printer is a compact and efficient monochrome printer designed for home and office use. It delivers print speeds of up to 23 ppm, a high resolution of 1200 x 1200 dpi, and a first printout time of less than 7.8 seconds. Equipped with a 600 MHz processor, 128MB memory, manual duplex printing, and USB 2.0 connectivity, the P2500 ensures reliable and cost-effective performance. Its sleek design, energy-saving sleep mode, and support for multiple operating systems make it an ideal choice for everyday business and personal printing needs.', 'pantum-p2500-single-function-mono-laser-printer-1780835204', '<h2>Pantum P2500 Single Function Mono Laser Printer</h2><p>The Pantum P2500 Single Function Mono Laser Printer is a compact, efficient, and cost-effective printing solution designed for home users, small offices, and business environments. Featuring advanced laser printing technology, this monochrome printer delivers sharp text, professional-quality documents, and reliable performance for everyday printing tasks.</p><p>With a print speed of up to 23 pages per minute (Letter) and 22 pages per minute (A4), the Pantum P2500 ensures fast and efficient document output, helping users improve productivity and reduce waiting times. The printer supports a high print resolution of up to 1200 x 1200 dpi, producing crisp text and clear graphics suitable for reports, invoices, contracts, and other business documents.</p><p>Powered by a 600 MHz processor and 128MB memory, the Pantum P2500 handles print jobs quickly and efficiently. Its first printout time of less than 7.8 seconds minimizes delays, making it an excellent choice for busy workplaces. The printer also supports manual duplex printing, enabling users to print on both sides of the paper and reduce paper consumption.</p><p>The Pantum P2500 comes with a 150-sheet input tray and a 100-sheet output capacity, allowing uninterrupted printing for medium-volume workloads. It supports a wide range of media sizes and paper types, including A4, A5, A6, Letter, Legal, envelopes, labels, cardstock, and transparencies, providing flexibility for different printing requirements.</p><p>Designed with a sleek and compact footprint, the printer easily fits into limited workspace environments while maintaining professional performance. Its automatic sleep mode helps conserve energy and reduce operational costs, making it an environmentally friendly printing solution.</p><p>The printer supports multiple operating systems, including Microsoft Windows Server 2003/2008/2012, Windows XP, Vista, Windows 7, Windows 8, Windows 8.1, Windows 10 (32-bit and 64-bit), Mac OS 10.6 to 10.10, and Linux, ensuring broad compatibility across various devices and office environments.</p><p>With a recommended monthly print volume of up to 15,000 pages and support for the Pantum P(A/B/C)-210 Series consumables, the Pantum P2500 offers dependable performance and economical printing for long-term use.</p><h2>Buy Pantum P2500 Single Function Mono Laser Printer from International Office Solution</h2><p>Purchase the original Pantum P2500 Single Function Mono Laser Printer from International Office Solution at a competitive price in Bangladesh. We offer a wide collection of genuine Pantum printers suitable for home, office, and commercial use. Order online or visit International Office Solution to get authentic products, professional service, and reliable after-sales support.</p><p>The Pantum P2500 Single Function Mono Laser Printer comes with a 1-year limited warranty. Please note that the adapter/power cable carries no warranty, and the original product box is required for warranty claims.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Output Color</strong></td><td>Black &amp; White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Technology</strong></td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td><