(325, 'Pantum M6506NW Multifunction Mono Laser Printer iosbd', 'The Pantum M6506NW Multifunction Mono Laser Printer is an all-in-one solution that combines printing, copying, and scanning in a compact design. Featuring built-in Wi-Fi, mobile printing support, a 600MHz processor, 128MB memory, and a high-yield 1,600-page toner cartridge, it delivers reliable performance and cost-effective operation for home and office users.', 'pantum-m6506nw-multifunction-mono-laser-printer-iosbd-1782965676', '<p>The Pantum M6506NW Multifunction Mono Laser Printer is a powerful and cost-effective all-in-one printing solution designed for home offices, small businesses, and professional work environments. Combining printing, copying, and scanning capabilities in a single compact device, this multifunction laser printer delivers reliable performance, efficient operation, and excellent print quality for everyday business needs.</p><p>Built with a robust metal frame structure, the Pantum M6506NW is engineered for durability and long-term performance. Powered by a high-speed 600MHz processor and 128MB memory, the printer handles multiple tasks efficiently, ensuring smooth operation and faster document processing. Whether you need to print reports, scan documents, or make copies, the M6506NW delivers consistent results with minimal waiting time.</p><p>The printer supports wireless connectivity through built-in Wi-Fi, allowing users to print and scan conveniently from laptops, desktops, smartphones, and tablets. Mobile printing functionality enhances productivity by enabling seamless document management without the need for wired connections. Network printing support makes the device an ideal choice for shared office environments.</p><p>Designed with environmental responsibility in mind, the Pantum M6506NW features an energy-saving sleep mode that reduces power consumption and operating costs. It also produces lower noise levels during operation, creating a quieter workspace. The printer i