(326, 'Pantum P3020D Mono Laser Printer With Duplex', 'The Pantum P3020D Mono Laser Printer is a high-speed monochrome printer featuring automatic duplex printing, up to 30 ppm print speed, 1200 × 1200 dpi resolution, a 500MHz processor, and a monthly duty cycle of up to 60,000 pages. It is an ideal printing solution for businesses and offices requiring reliable and cost-effective document printing.', 'pantum-p3020d-mono-laser-printer-with-duplex-1780837754', '<h2>Pantum P3020D Mono Laser Printer with Auto Duplex (30 PPM)</h2><p>The Pantum P3020D Mono Laser Printer is a high-performance monochrome laser printer designed for businesses, offices, and professional workgroups that require fast, reliable, and cost-effective printing. Combining impressive print speeds, automatic duplex printing, and a robust monthly duty cycle, the Pantum P3020D delivers exceptional productivity for demanding office environments.</p><p>Equipped with advanced mono laser technology, the Pantum P3020D produces sharp text and professional-quality documents with a maximum print resolution of 1200 × 1200 dpi. Its high-speed printing capability of up to 30 pages per minute (A4) and 32 pages per minute (Letter) ensures quick completion of large print jobs, helping businesses improve workflow efficiency.</p><p>The built-in automatic duplex printing feature allows users to print on both sides of the paper automatically, reducing paper consumption and lowering operational costs. This makes the printer an environmentally friendly solution for organizations looking to improve sustainability while maintaining productivity.</p><p>Powered by a 500MHz processor, the Pantum P3020D handles print tasks efficiently and delivers a first printout in less than 7.8 seconds. With a monthly duty cycle of up to 60,000 pages, this printer is capable of supporting high-volume printing environments with consistent performance and reliability.</p><p>The Pantum P3020D utilizes a separate toner cartridge and photoconductor design, helping reduce consumable costs and minimizing waste. This innovative design contributes to lower total ownership costs while supporting environmentally responsible printing practices.</p><p>Designed for small and medium-sized businesses as well as large workgroups, the Pantum P3020D offers simple operation, dependable performance, and long-term durability. Its compact footprint allows it to fit comfortably into various office settings without compromising functionality.</p><h2>Buy Pantum P3020D Mono Laser Printer from International Office Solution</h2><p>Purchase the original Pantum P3020D Mono Laser Printer from International Office Solution at the best price in Bangladesh. We offer genuine Pantum printers, competitive pricing, and dependable customer support to help meet your business printing requirements.</p><p>The Pantum P3020D Mono Laser Printer comes with a 1-year limited warranty. Please note that the adapter/power cable carries no warranty, and the original product box is required for warranty claims.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Auto Duplex Printing</td><td>Automatic Two-Sided Printing</td><td>Printing</td></tr><tr><td>Print Speed</td><td>30 ppm (A4) / 32 ppm (Letter)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>Print Resolution</td><td>1200 × 1200 dpi (Max)</td><td>Printing</td></tr><tr><td>First Print Out Time</td><td>Less than 7.8 Seconds</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>Monthly Duty Cycle</td><td>Up to 60,000 Pages</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>Functions</td><td>Print Only</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Printer Type</td><td>Single Function Mono Laser</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Output Color</td><td>Black &amp; White</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Input Capacity</td><td>250 Sheets</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Output Capacity</td><td>150 Sheets</td><td>Pape