(327, 'Pantum BM2300AW Multifunction Mono Laser Printer-IOSBD', 'The Pantum BM2300AW Multifunction Mono Laser Printer combines printing, copying, and scanning capabilities with Wi-Fi and Bluetooth connectivity. Featuring a 50-sheet ADF, 22ppm print speed, 800MHz processor, 256MB memory, and advanced copy and scan functions, it delivers efficient performance for home offices and business environments.', 'pantum-bm2300aw-multifunction-mono-laser-printer-iosbd-1782965593', '<h2>Pantum BM2300AW Multifunction Mono Laser Printer</h2><p>The Pantum BM2300AW Multifunction Mono Laser Printer is a powerful all-in-one printing solution designed for home offices, small businesses, and professional work environments. Combining printing, copying, and scanning capabilities in a single compact device, this multifunction laser printer delivers reliable performance, wireless connectivity, and advanced document management features.</p><p>With a print speed of up to 22 pages per minute (A4) and 23 pages per minute (Letter), the Pantum BM2300AW ensures efficient workflow and productivity. The printer produces sharp black-and-white documents with professional-quality output and a first print-out time of less than 7.8 seconds, helping users complete tasks quickly and efficiently.</p><p>The BM2300AW supports manual duplex printing and offers multiple printing functions, including watermark printing, N-up printing, poster printing, and booklet printing. These advanced features provide greater flexibility for business documents, reports, educational materials, and office paperwork.</p><p>For copying tasks, the printer delivers speeds of up to 22 copies per minute (A4) and 23 copies per minute (Letter). Users can produce up to 99 copies in a single job and utilize zoom settings ranging from 20% to 400%. Additional copy functions include ID card copy, bill copy, multi-page copy, clone copy, poster copy, and manual duplex copying, making it a versatile office companion.</p><p>The integrated flatbed scanner and 50-sheet Automatic Document Feeder (ADF) enable fast and efficient document digitization. Users can scan documents directly to a PC, email, FTP server, SMB folder, iOS device, or Android device. The scanner supports multiple file formats, including PDF, TIFF, JPG, BMP, PNG, and OFD, ensuring compatibility with various workflows and document management systems.</p><p>Powered by an 800MHz processor and 256MB memory, the Pantum BM2300AW handles multitasking smoothly and efficiently. It supports a recommended monthly print volume of 250 to 2,000 pages and a maximum monthly duty cycle of up to 20,000 pages, making it suitable for demanding office environments.</p><p>Connectivity options include High-Speed USB 2.0, 2.4GHz Wi-Fi, and Bluetooth, allowing seamless printing and scanning from desktops, laptops, smartphones, and tablets. The intuitive 2-line LCD display simplifies operation and provides easy access to printer settings and functions.</p><p>The Pantum BM2300AW supports a wide range of paper types and sizes, including plain paper, thick paper, labels, envelopes, transparencies, A4, A5, Legal, and custom-sized media. Its compact design, powerful features, and wireless capabilities make it an excellent choice for businesses seeking a reliable and cost-effective multifunction printer.</p><h2>Buy Pantum BM2300AW Multifunction Mono Laser Printer from International Office Solution</h2><p>Get the original Pantum BM2300AW Multifunction Mono Laser Printer from International Office Solution at the best price in Bangladesh. We offer genuine Pantum printers, competitive pricing, and reliable customer support to meet all your printing requirements.</p><p>The Pantum BM2300AW comes with a 1-year limited warranty. Please note that the adapter/power cable carries no warranty, and the original product box is required for warranty claims.</p>', '<p>General<br>Functions<br>Print, Copy, Scan<br>Printer Type<br>Mono Laser Multifunction Printer<br>Output Color<br>Black &amp; White<br>Print<br>Print Speed<br>22ppm (A4)<br>23ppm (Letter)<br>First Print Out Time<br>＜7.8s<br>Duty Cycle up to (Yield)<br>20,000 pages<br>Duplex<br>Manual<br>Copy<br>Copy Speed<br>22cpm(A4)<br>23cpm(Letter)<br>Scan<br>Scan Type<br>Flatbed + ADF<br>Maximum Scan Size<br>FB：Max. 216×297mm<br>ADF：Max. 216 x 356 mm<br>Duplex Scan<br>Manual<br>Paper Information<br>Paper Size<br>A4,A5,A6,JIS B5,ISO B5,B6, Letter, Legal, Executive,Statement, Monarch envelope, DL envelope,C5 envelope,C6 envelope,NO.10 envelope, Japanese Postcard,Folio,Oficio,Big 16k, 32k,16k,Big 32k,ZL,Yougata4, Postcard, Younaga3, Nagagata3, Yougata2<br>Paper Type<br>plain paper, thick paper, transparency, cardstock, labels, envelopes, thin paper<br>Paper Weight<br>60~163g/m²<br>Input Capacity<br>150 pages<br>Output Capacity<br>100 pages<br>ADF<br>Yes<br>Technical Specs<br>Processor<br>800MHz<br>Memory<br>256M<br>Display<br>2 Line LCD<br>Connectivity<br>USB＋2.4G WiFi＋Bluetooth<br>Power Consumption<br>printing：≤370W<br>ready：＜45W<br>sleep：＜2.5W<br>Physical Specs<br>Dimension<br>415mm×327.5mm×293.7mm<br>Weight<br>8.6 kg with cartridge<br>Support<br>Software<br>Windows： Server 2012/2016/2019/XP/Win7/Win8.1/Win10/Win11（32/64 bit）<br>Mac OS 10.10/10.11/10.12/10.13/10.15/11.6/12.0/12.1/12.2/12.3/12.4/12.5/12.6/13.0/13.1/13.2<br>Linux：Ubuntu 16.04/18.04/20.04/22.04<br>iOS：iOS 11.0~16.0<br>Android：Android 6.0~12.0<br>Warranty Information<br>Warranty<br>1-year Limited warranty, an Adapter/Power Cable with no warranty, and also a Box Mandatory While Claiming.</p>', 'PANTER', 18000.00, 18000.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/h5QPzCgKMHE3xgTuoP0cYoWYmKOtzAo1BrJBvjMx.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-07 13:33:44', '2026-07-02 04:13:13', 'Pantum BM2300AW Multifunction Mono Laser Printer Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Pantum BM2300AW Multifunction Mono Laser Printer at the best price in Bangladesh. Features print, copy, scan functions, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, 50-sheet ADF, 22ppm printing speed, and 256MB memory. Available at International Office Solution.', 'Office Printer Bangladesh, Business Printer, Home Office Printer, Pantum Printer Price BD, International Office Solution, ADF Laser Printer, Multifunction Printer Bangladesh, Black and White Laser Printer', NULL, 259, NULL, NULL),
(328, 'Pantum P3500DW Mono Laser Printer With Duplex & Network (33 PPM)', 'The Pantum P3500DW Mono Laser Printer delivers high-speed printing up to 35ppm, automatic duplex printing, Wi-Fi, Ethernet, and USB connectivity. Featuring a 1200 × 1200 dpi resolution, low paper jam rate, and an 80,000-page monthly duty cycle, it is an ideal solution for offices and business workgroups.', 'pantum-p3500dw-mono-laser-printer-with-duplex-network-33-ppm-1780841727', '<p>The Pantum P3500DW Mono Laser Printer is a high-performance monochrome laser printer designed for businesses, offices, and professional workgroups that require fast, reliable, and cost-effective printing. Featuring automatic duplex printing, network connectivity, and wireless printing support, the P3500DW is built to handle demanding workloads while maintaining exceptional print quality.</p><p>With impressive print speeds of up to 33 pages per minute (A4) and 35 pages per minute (Letter), the Pantum P3500DW helps maximize workplace productivity by reducing waiting times and improving document workflow. Its professional print resolution of up to 1200 × 1200 dpi ensures sharp text, crisp graphics, and high-quality black-and-white output suitable for reports, contracts, invoices, and business documents.</p><p>The printer delivers a first printout in less than 8.5 seconds, allowing users to complete urgent print jobs quickly and efficiently. Designed for high-volume environments, the P3500DW supports a monthly duty cycle of up to 80,000 pages, making it an ideal solution for growing businesses and busy office workgroups.</p><p>Equipped with built-in Ethernet, Wi-Fi, and High-Speed USB 2.0 connectivity, the Pantum P3500DW offers flexible installation and seamless integration into office networks. Its one-step driver installation simplifies setup, enabling users to start printing quickly with minimal technical effort.</p><p>For efficient paper handling, the printer includes a standard 250-sheet input tray and a 60-sheet multipurpose tray, supporting various media types and sizes. Users can further expand paper capacity with up to two optional 550-sheet paper trays, making the printer suitable for larger print volumes and reducing the need for frequent paper refills.</p><p>The Pantum P3500DW features automatic duplex printing, helping businesses reduce paper consumption and operating costs while supporting environmentally friendly printing practices. Combined with its low paper jam rate and durable design, this printer provides dependable performance and long-term reliability.</p><p>Whether you need a dependable printer for daily office tasks, departmental printing, or high-volume document production, the Pantum P3500DW offers speed, efficiency, and professional-quality results in a compact and easy-to-manage device.</p><h2>Buy Pantum P3500DW Mono Laser Printer from International Office Solution</h2><p>Purchase the original Pantum P3500DW Mono Laser Printer with Duplex &amp; Network from International Office Solution at the best price in Bangladesh. We provide genuine Pantum printers, competitive pricing, and professional after-sales support for businesses and individuals.</p><p>The Pantum P3500DW comes with a 1-year limited warranty. Please note that the adapter/power cable carries no warranty, and the original product box is required for warranty claims.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th><th>Category</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Functions</td><td>Print Only</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Printer Type</td><td>Single Function Mono Laser</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Output Color</td><td>Black &amp; White</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Print Technology</td><td>Laser</td><td>Printing</td></tr><tr><td>Print Speed</td><td>33 ppm (A4) / 35 ppm (Letter)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>Print Resolution</td><td>Up to 1200 × 1200 dpi</td><td>Printing</td></tr><tr><td>First Print Out Time</td><td>Less than 8.2 Seconds</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>Monthly Duty Cycle</td><td>Up to 80,000 Pages</td><td>Productivity</td></tr><tr><td>Duplex Printing</td><td>Automatic Duplex</td><td>Printing</td></tr><tr><td>Paper Size</td><td>A4, A5, JIS B5, ISO B5, A6, Letter, Legal, Executive, Folio, Oficio, Statement, Japanese Postcard, ZL, Big 16K, Big 32K, 16K, 32K, B6, Yougata4, Postcard, Younaga3, Nagagata3, Yougata2</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Paper Type</td><td>Plain, Thick, Thin, Transparency, Cardstock, Label</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Paper Weight (Input Tray)</td><td>60-105 g/m²</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Paper Weight (Multipurpose Tray)</td><td>60-200 g/m²</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Input Capacity</td><td>250 Sheets</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Output Capacity</td><td>150 Sheets</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>600 MHz</td><td>Hardware</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>256 MB (Expandable up to 512 MB)</td><td>Hardware</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB, LAN, WiFi</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>LAN Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11b/g/n</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>USB Interface</td><td>High-Speed USB 2.0</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>Mobile Printing</td><td>Apple AirPrint, Mopria Certified</td><td>Mobile Printing</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption (Printing)</td><td>495W</td><td>Power</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption (Ready)</td><td>50W</td><td>Power</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption (Sleep)</td><td>2W</td><td>Power</td></tr><tr><td>Power Supply</td><td>AC100-127V, 50/60Hz, 9A / AC220-240V, 50/60Hz, 4.5A</td><td>Power</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td>Dimensions</td><td>370 × 370 × 286 mm</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>9.4 kg</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td>Toner Cartridge</td><td>P-310 (3,000 Pages), P-310H (6,000 Pages)</td><td>Consumables</td></tr><tr><td>Operating System Support</td><td>Windows 7/8/8.1/10, Vista,