(329, 'Pantum M6550N Mono Laser Multifunction Printer With ADF', 'The Pantum M6550N Mono Laser Multifunction Printer combines print, copy, and scan functions in one compact device. Featuring a 35-sheet Automatic Document Feeder (ADF), 22ppm print speed, fast 7.8-second first-page output, and advanced ID card copy functions, it is an ideal solution for home and office productivity.', 'pantum-m6550n-mono-laser-multifunction-printer-with-adf-1780842173', '<p>The Pantum M6550N Mono Laser Multifunction Printer is a reliable and efficient all-in-one printing solution designed for home offices, small businesses, and professional work environments. Combining printing, copying, and scanning capabilities in a compact device, the M6550N helps improve productivity while delivering professional-quality monochrome output.</p><p>Featuring a print speed of up to 22 pages per minute (A4), the Pantum M6550N efficiently handles daily printing tasks with ease. Its fast first-page output time of only 7.8 seconds minimizes waiting time and allows users to complete jobs quickly and efficiently. The printer delivers crisp text and sharp graphics, making it ideal for reports, invoices, business documents, and everyday office printing.</p><p>One of the key highlights of the Pantum M6550N is its built-in 35-sheet Automatic Document Feeder (ADF), which enables users to scan and copy multiple pages automatically without manually feeding each sheet. This feature significantly improves workflow efficiency and saves valuable time in busy office environments.</p><p>The printer offers advanced copying features, including one-key multi-format ID card copying with four different layout options. It also incorporates automatic skew correction and copy enhancement technology to ensure accurate and professional-looking copies. Bill-copy mode automatically increases toner density, making copied receipts and financial documents clearer and easier to read.</p><p>Equipped with print, copy, and scan functions, the Pantum M6550N serves as a complete document management solution. Users can efficiently digitize, reproduce, and print documents from a single machine, reducing equipment costs and saving workspace.</p><p>The compact design allows the printer to fit easily into home offices, retail shops, educational institutions, and small business environments. Built for reliability and ease of use, the M6550N delivers consistent performance while maintaining low operating costs.</p><p>Whether you need to print contracts, scan documents, copy ID cards, or process multi-page paperwork, the Pantum M6550N Mono Laser Multifunction Printer offers the functionality, speed, and convenience required for modern office tasks.</p><h2>Buy Pantum M6550N Mono Laser Multifunction Printer from International Office Solution</h2><p>Get the original Pantum M6550N Mono Laser Multifunction Printer with ADF from International Office Solution at the best price in Bangladesh. We offer genuine Pantum printers, competitive pricing, and reliable after-sales support for individuals, professionals, and businesses.</p><p>The Pantum M6550N comes with a 1-year limited warranty. Please note that the adapter/power cable carries no warranty, and the original product box is required for warranty claims.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th><th>Category</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Functions</td><td>Print, Copy, Scan</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Printer Type</td><td>Mono Laser Multifunction Printer</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Output Color</td><td>Black &amp; White</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Print Technology</td><td>Electrophotographic Monochrome Laser</td><td>Printing</td></tr><tr><td>Print Speed</td><td>22 ppm (A4) / 23 ppm (Letter)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>Print Resolution</td><td>1200 × 1200 dpi</td><td>Printing</td></tr><tr><td>First Print Out Time</td><td>Less than 7.8 Seconds</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>Monthly Duty Cyc