mpatibility</td></tr><tr><td>macOS Support</td><td>macOS 10.7 - 10.13</td><td>Compatibility</td></tr><tr><td>Linux Support</td><td>Ubuntu 12.04, 14.04, 16.04, 18.04</td><td>Compatibility</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1-Year Limited Warranty</td><td>Support</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty Note</td><td>Adapter/Power Cable has no warranty. Original box required for warranty claims.</td><td>Support</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PANTER', 17500.00, 17500.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/4g0LbD5DYmiz9vaCCWdacMAhplLCbEnNyl3Avswv.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-07 14:22:53', '2026-07-02 04:03:07', 'Pantum M6550N Mono Laser Multifunction Printer With ADF Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Pantum M6550N Mono Laser Multifunction Printer with ADF at the best price in Bangladesh. Features print, copy, scan functions, 22ppm print speed, 35-sheet ADF, fast first-page output, and advanced ID card copying. Available at International Office Solution.', 'Office Printer Bangladesh, Home Office Printer, Pantum M6550N Toner, Black and White Laser Printer, ADF Laser Printer, International Office Solution, Pantum Multifunction Laser Printer', NULL, 259, NULL, NULL),
(330, 'Pantum CM1100ADW Multifunction Color Laser Printer', 'The Pantum CM1100ADW Multifunction Color Laser Printer is an all-in-one printing solution offering print, copy, and scan functions with up to 18 ppm speed, automatic duplex printing, Wi-Fi/LAN/USB connectivity, and a 30,000-page duty cycle. It is ideal for home and office use with vibrant color output and reliable performance.', 'pantum-cm1100adw-multifunction-color-laser-printer-1780842624', '<p>The Pantum CM1100ADW Multifunction Color Laser Printer is a high-performance all-in-one printing solution designed to meet the demands of modern homes, offices, and business environments. Combining printing, copying, and scanning functions in a single compact device, it delivers exceptional efficiency, vibrant color output, and reliable performance for everyday document handling.</p><p>With a print speed of up to 18 pages per minute, the Pantum CM1100ADW ensures fast and consistent output whether you are printing business reports, colorful presentations, or detailed graphics. Its advanced color laser technology produces sharp text and vivid images with excellent clarity, making it suitable for professional-quality documents.</p><p>Designed for productivity, this multifunction printer supports automatic duplex printing, allowing users to print on both sides of the paper effortlessly. This feature helps reduce paper consumption, lower printing costs, and promote environmentally friendly printing practices.</p><p>The CM1100ADW offers flexible connectivity options, including USB, Ethernet (LAN), and Wi-Fi, ensuring seamless integration into any working environment. Users can easily print and scan from multiple devices such as desktops, laptops, tablets, and smartphones, making it ideal for shared office setups and remote printing needs.</p><p>Built for durability, the printer supports a monthly duty cycle of up to 30,000 pages, making it capable of handling heavy workloads with ease. Whether used in a small business or a busy office environment, it delivers stable and reliable performance throughout continuous operation.</p><p>Its compact design ensures it fits comfortably into limited workspace areas without compromising functionality. Despite its small footprint, the Pantum CM1100ADW provides powerful performance and professional-grade output, making it an excellent choice for users who require both quality and efficiency.</p><p>The printer is engineered to support a wide range of printing needs—from everyday documents and invoices to high-quality color graphics and marketing materials—making it a versatile solution for any office setup.</p><h2>Buy Pantum CM1100ADW Multifunction Color Laser Printer from International Office Solution</h2><p>Get the original Pantum CM1100ADW Multifunction Color Laser Printer at the best price in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. We offer genuine products, competitive pricing, and reliable after-sales support for both personal and business users.</p><p>The Pantum CM1100ADW comes with a 1-year limited warranty. Please note that the adapter/power cable carries no warranty, and the original box is required for warranty claims.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th><th>Category</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Functions</td><td>Print, Copy, Scan, Fax</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Printer Type</td><td>Mono Laser Multifunction</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Output Color</td><td>Black &amp; White</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Print Technology</td><td>Laser</td><td>Printing</td></tr><tr><td>Print Speed (Black)</td><td>Up to 18 ppm</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>Print Speed (Color)*</td><td>Up to 18 ppm</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>Print Resolution</td><td>600 × 600 dpi</td><td>Printing</td></tr><tr><td>Monthly Duty Cycle</td><td>Up to 30,000 Pages</td><td>Productivity</td></tr><tr><td>Duplex Printing</td><td>Automatic</td><td>Printing</td></tr><tr><td>Copy Speed</td><td>Up to 18 ppm</td><td>Copy</td></tr><tr><td>Copy Resolution</td><td>Up to 600 × 600 dpi</td><td>Copy</td></tr><tr><td>Scan Type</td><td>CIS (Contact Image Sensor)</td><td>Scanning</td></tr><tr><td>Scan Resolution</td><td>300 × 300 dpi</td><td>Scanning</td></tr><tr><td>Duplex Scan</td><td>No</td><td>Scanning</td></tr><tr><td>ADF (Automatic Document Feeder)</td><td>Yes</td><td>Scanning</td></tr><tr><td>Paper Size</td><td>A4, Letter, Legal, Folio, Oficio, JIS B5, ISO B5, Executive, Statement, A5, A6, Big 16K, 16K, Big 32K, 32K, Envelopes (DL, C5, C6, No.10, Monarch), Postcard, Japanese Postcard, Custom (96×148mm – 216×356mm)</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Paper Weight (Input Tray)</td><td>60–120 g/m²</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Paper Weight (Multipurpose Tray)</td><td>60–200 g/m²</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Input Capacity</td><td>250 Sheets</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Output Capacity</td><td>100 Sheets (A4/70g)</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>1.2 GHz</td><td>Hardware</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>512 MB</td><td>Hardware</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>3.5-inch Touch Screen</td><td>Hardware</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB, LAN, WiFi</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>Network Support</td><td>Wired &amp; Wireless Networking</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>380W</td><td>Power</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td>Dimensions</td><td>401 × 411 × 358 mm</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>19.4 kg</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td>Starter Consumables</td><td>CTL-1100K (1000 pages), CTL-1100C/M/Y (700 pages each)</td><td>Consumables</td></tr><tr><td>Standard Consumables</td><td>CTL-1100K (1000 pages), CTL-1100C/M/Y (700 pages each)</td><td>Consumables</td></tr><tr><td>Operating System Support</td><td>Windows XP to Windows 11, Windows Server 2012/2016, macOS 10.9–12, Ubuntu 16.04–22.04</td><td>Compatibility</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1-Year Limited Warranty</td><td>Support</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty Note</td><td>Adapter/Power Cable has no warranty. Original box required for warranty claims.</td><td>Support</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PANTER', 64000.00, 63500.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/UOZpgCvxXZN0yg4QkPLQEHulrqhnQTZmNQAUBaic.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-07 14:30:24', '2026-06-07 14:30:24', 'Pantum CM1100ADW Color Laser Multifunction Printer Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Pantum CM1100ADW Multifunction Color Laser Printer at the best price in Bangladesh. Features print, copy, scan, 18ppm speed, Wi-Fi, LAN, USB connectivity, automatic duplex printing, and 30,000-page duty cycle. Available at International Office Solution.', 'Office Color Printer, Wireless Laser Printer, LAN Printer, USB Printer, Automatic Duplex Printer, Pantum Scanner Copier Printer, Business Color Printer, International Office Solution, Pantum Printer Price BD, CM1100ADW Toner', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(331, 'Pantum CM2100ADW Multifunction Color Laser Printer', 'The Pantum CM2100ADW Multifunction Color Laser Printer is an all-in-one printing solution with print, scan, and copy functions. It offers automatic duplex printing, Wi-Fi/LAN/USB connectivity, fast performance, and high-quality color output, making it ideal for office and business use.', 'pantum-cm2100adw-multifunction-color-laser-printer-1780843117', '<p>The Pantum CM2100ADW Multifunction Color Laser Printer is a powerful all-in-one office solution designed for modern businesses, home offices, and professional work environments. Combining printing, scanning, copying, and automatic duplex functionality, this printer delivers high-quality color output with reliable performance, making it an excellent choice for productivity-focused users.</p><h3>High-Quality Color Laser Printing</h3><p>The Pantum CM2100ADW produces sharp text and vibrant color prints, ensuring professional-quality documents for reports, presentations, invoices, and marketing materials. Its advanced laser technology provides consistent output with excellent clarity and detail, making it suitable for business-grade printing needs.</p><h3>All-in-One Multifunction Efficiency</h3><p>With integrated print, scan, and copy functions, this device eliminates the need for multiple machines, saving both space and cost. The automatic duplex printing feature allows users to print on both sides of the paper effortlessly, helping reduce paper consumption and improve workflow efficiency.</p><h3>Flexible Connectivity for Modern Workspaces</h3><p>The CM2100ADW supports USB, LAN (Ethernet), and Wi-Fi connectivity, enabling seamless integration into any office network. Users can print wirelessly from laptops, desktops, smartphones, and tablets, making it ideal for shared office environments and remote printing needs.</p><h3>Fast and Reliable Performance</h3><p>Designed for productivity, the Pantum CM2100ADW delivers fast printing speeds and stable performance to handle daily office workloads with ease. Its efficient processing ensures smooth operation even during high-volume printing tasks, reducing downtime and improving workflow efficiency.</p><h3>User-Friendly and Compact Design</h3><p>The printer features a compact and modern design that fits easily into office spaces without occupying too much room. Its simple setup and intuitive operation make it suitable for both beginners and experienced users, ensuring hassle-free use in any environment.</p><h3>Ideal for Business and Office Use</h3><p>Whether used in small businesses, corporate offices, or home workspaces, the Pantum CM2100ADW is built to support demanding daily printing needs. It offers a perfect balance of performance, print quality, and operational convenience.</p><h2>Buy Pantum CM2100ADW Multifunction Color Laser Printer from International Office Solution</h2><p>Get the original Pantum CM2100ADW Multifunction Color Laser Printer at the best price in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. We provide genuine products, competitive pricing, and reliable after-sales support for all types of users.</p><p>The Pantum CM2100ADW comes with a 1-year limited warranty. Please note that the adapter/power cable carries no warranty, and the original box is required for warranty claims.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th><th>Category</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Functions</td><td>Print, Scan, Copy</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Printer Type</td><td>Color Laser Multifunction</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Output Color</td><td>Color &amp; Black/White</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Print Technology</td><td>Laser</td><td>Printing</td></tr><tr><td>Print Speed (A4)</td><td>20 ppm</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>Print Speed (Letter)</td><td>21 ppm</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>Duplex Print Speed</td><td>6 ppm</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>Print Resolution</td><td>600 × 600 dpi</td><td>Printing</t