(332, 'Pantum BM5100ADW MultiFunction Mono Laser Printer', 'The Pantum BM5100ADW Multifunction Mono Laser Printer is a high-speed office printer with print, copy, and scan functions. It delivers up to 40 ppm printing speed, automatic duplex printing, USB/LAN/WiFi connectivity, and a 100,000-page duty cycle, making it ideal for business and corporate use.', 'pantum-bm5100adw-multifunction-mono-laser-printer-1780845109', '<p>The Pantum BM5100ADW Multifunction Mono Laser Printer is a high-performance office printing solution designed for businesses, corporate environments, and high-volume users. Built to handle demanding workloads, this all-in-one device combines printing, copying, and scanning functions with exceptional speed, reliability, and efficiency.</p><h3>High-Speed Professional Printing</h3><p>With an impressive print speed of up to 40 pages per minute, the Pantum BM5100ADW ensures fast and efficient document processing. It is ideal for busy offices that require continuous printing of reports, invoices, contracts, and other business documents without delays.</p><h3>Powerful Multifunction Performance</h3><p>This printer integrates print, copy, and scan functions into a single compact device, reducing the need for multiple machines and saving valuable workspace. Its multifunction capability improves workflow efficiency and helps streamline daily office operations.</p><h3>Automatic Duplex Printing</h3><p>The built-in automatic duplex printing feature allows the printer to print on both sides of the paper automatically. This not only reduces paper usage but also lowers printing costs and supports environmentally friendly office practices.</p><h3>Flexible Connectivity Options</h3><p>The Pantum BM5100ADW supports USB, LAN (Ethernet), and WiFi connectivity, making it easy to integrate into any office network. Users can print seamlessly from desktops, laptops, and mobile devices, ensuring maximum convenience and flexibility in shared office environments.</p><h3>Designed for Heavy Workloads</h3><p>With a robust monthly duty cycle of up to 100,000 pages, this printer is engineered for high-volume printing environments. It delivers stable and consistent performance even under continuous use, making it suitable for large offices and business organizations.</p><h3>Efficient and Reliable Office Solution</h3><p>The BM5100ADW combines speed, durability, and high-quality output in one compact device. Its efficient performance ensures minimal downtime, while its strong build quality guarantees long-term reliability for professional use.</p><h2>Buy Pantum BM5100ADW Multifunction Mono Laser Printer from International Office Solution</h2><p>Get the original Pantum BM5100ADW Multifunction Mono Laser Printer at the best price in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. We offer genuine products, competitive pricing, and trusted after-sales support for businesses and professionals.</p><p>The Pantum BM5100ADW comes with a 1-year limited warranty. Please note that the adapter/power cable carries no warranty, and the original box is required for warranty claims.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th><th>Category</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Functions</td><td>Print, Copy, Scan, Fax</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Printer Type</td><td>Mono Laser Multifunction Printer</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Output Color</td><td>Black &amp; White</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Print Technology</td><td>Laser</td><td>Printing</td></tr><tr><td>Print Speed</td><td>Up to 42 ppm</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>Print Resolution</td><td>600 × 600 dpi</td><td>Printing</td></tr><tr><td>First Print Out Time</td><td>≤ 6.9 Seconds</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>Monthly Duty Cycle</td><td>Up to 100,000 Pages</td><td>Productivity</td></tr><tr><td>Duplex Printing</td><td>Automatic</td><td>Printing</td></tr><tr><td>Copy Speed</td><td>40–42 ppm</td><td>Copy</td></tr><tr><td>Copy Resolution</td><td>Up to 600 × 600 dpi</td><td>Copy</td></tr><tr><td>Scan Type</td><td>Flatbed + DADF</td><td>Scanning</td></tr><tr><td>Color Scanning</td><td>Supported</td><td>Scanning</td></tr><tr><td>Scan Resolution (Flatbed)</td><td>75 / 150 / 300 / 600 / 1200 dpi</td><td>Scanning</td></tr><tr><td>Scan Resolution (ADF)</td><td>75 / 150 / 300 / 600 dpi</td><td>Scanning</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum Scan Size</td><td>Flatbed: 216 × 297 mm, ADF: 216 × 356 mm</td><td>Scanning</td></tr><tr><td>Duplex Scanning</td><td>Yes</td><td>Scanning</td></tr><tr><td>ADF</td><td>Yes (DADF)</td><td>Scanning</td></tr><tr><td>Paper Size</td><td>A4, A5, B5, Letter, Legal, Folio, Oficio, Statement, Envelope sizes, Postcard, Custom sizes</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Paper Weight</td><td>60–200 g/m²</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Input Capacity</td><td>250 Sheets</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Output Capacity</td><td>150 Sheets</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>1.2 GHz</td><td>Hardware</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>512 MB</td><td>Hardware</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>3.5-inch Touch Screen</td><td>Interface</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB, LAN, WiFi</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless Features</td><td>Wi-Fi Direct, NFC Touch Connection</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>Printing ≤650W, Ready ≤60W, Sleep ≤1W</td><td>Power</td></tr><tr><td>Noise Level</td><td>30–54 dB(A)</td><td>Environment</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td>Dimensions</td><td>415 × 365 × 370 mm</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>12.5 kg</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td>Toner Cartridge</td><td>TL-5120 (3000 pages), TL-5120H (6000 pages), TL-5120X (15000 pages)</td><td>Consumables</td></tr><tr><td>Drum Unit</td><td>DL-5120 (30000 pages)</td><td>Consumables</td></tr><tr><td>OS Support</td><td>Windows XP–11, Server 2008–2016, macOS 10.8–12, Linux, Ubuntu, Debian, CentOS, RedHat</td><td>Compatibility