(333, 'Pantum CP2100DW Color Laser Printer', 'The Pantum CP2100DW Color Laser Printer is a reliable and high-performance single-function printing solution designed for both home users and professional office environments. Built to deliver consistent output quality, fast performance, and flexible connectivity, it is an ideal choice for users who require efficient color printing for daily business operations.\r\n\r\nHigh-Speed Color Printing Performance\r\n\r\nWith a printing speed of up to 20 pages per minute for A4 documents and 21 pages per minute for Letter size, the Pantum CP2100DW ensures smooth and efficient workflow in high-volume environments. Whether printing reports, presentations, or marketing materials, it delivers fast and dependable performance.\r\n\r\nProfessional-Quality Output\r\n\r\nFeaturing a high resolution of 1200 × 1200 dpi, this printer produces sharp text and vibrant color graphics. It ensures that every document maintains professional clarity, making it suitable for business presentations, office documentation, and creative printing needs.\r\n\r\nAutomatic Duplex Printing\r\n\r\nThe built-in automatic duplex printing feature allows users to print on both sides of the paper effortlessly. This not only helps reduce paper consumption but also lowers operational costs while maintaining professional output quality.\r\n\r\nAdvanced Connectivity Options\r\n\r\nThe Pantum CP2100DW offers multiple connectivity options, including USB, LAN, Wi-Fi, and Bluetooth, making it highly flexible for modern office environments. It also supports mobile printing through AirPrint, Mopria, and the Pantum mobile application, allowing users to print directly from smartphones and tablets with ease.\r\n\r\nEfficient Paper Handling\r\n\r\nEquipped with a 250-sheet input tray and a 100-sheet output tray, the printer reduces the need for frequent paper refills and supports uninterrupted printing sessions. This makes it suitable for busy offices and high-demand printing ta