(334, 'Pantum CP1100DW Color Laser Printer', 'The Pantum CP1100DW Color Laser Printer (18 ppm) is a single-function printer offering 18 ppm speed, 1GHz processor, 1GB RAM, USB/LAN/WiFi connectivity, and a 30,000-page duty cycle. It supports booklet, poster, and watermark printing but does not support duplex printing.', 'pantum-cp1100dw-color-laser-printer-1780846030', '<p>The Pantum CP1100DW Color Laser Printer is a reliable single-function printing solution designed for home offices, small businesses, and professional environments that require consistent and high-quality color document output. Built with efficient performance and user-friendly features, this printer delivers stable operation for everyday printing needs.</p><h3>Stable Color Laser Printing Performance</h3><p>Powered by a 1.0GHz processor and 1GB RAM, the Pantum CP1100DW ensures smooth and responsive printing performance. With a print speed of up to 18 pages per minute, it efficiently handles daily office workloads including reports, presentations, invoices, and marketing materials.</p><h3>Professional Print Quality</h3><p>This color laser printer produces sharp text and clear graphics, making it suitable for professional business documents. It supports advanced printing functions such as booklet printing, poster printing, multi-page printing, and watermark printing, allowing users to customize their documents according to business requirements.</p><h3>Flexible Connectivity Options</h3><p>The CP1100DW supports USB, LAN (Ethernet), and WiFi connectivity, making it easy to integrate into any office or home network. Users can print from desktops, laptops, and mobile devices with ease, ensuring maximum convenience in modern work environments.</p><h3>Quiet and Efficient Operation</h3><p>Designed for a comfortable office environment, the printer operates with reduced noise levels, allowing users to maintain productivity without disturbance. Its efficient engine ensures stable performance during continuous use.</p><h3>Efficient Paper Handling</h3><p>The printer comes with a 250-sheet input tray and a 100-sheet output tray, reducing the need for frequent paper loading. This makes it suitable for moderate office workloads and daily printing tasks.</p><h3>Duty Cycle for Office Use</h3><p>With a maximum monthly duty cycle of up to 30,000 pages and a recommended monthly volume of 300–1500 pages, the Pantum CP1100DW is ideal for consistent office printing while maintaining long-term durability.</p><h3>No Duplex Printing Support</h3><p>This model is designed as a single-sided printing device and does not support automatic duplex printing, making it a straightforward and cost-effective solution for users who primarily require single-page output.</p><h2>Buy Pantum CP1100DW Color Laser Printer (18 ppm) from International Office Solution</h2><p>Get the original Pantum CP1100DW Color Laser Printer at the best price in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. We provide genuine products, competitive pricing, and trusted after-sales support for home and office users.</p><p>The Pantum CP1100DW comes with a 1-year limited warranty. Please note that the adapter/power cable is not covered under warranty, and the original box is required for warranty claims.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th><th>Category</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Functions</td><td>Print Only</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Printer Type</td><td>Color Laser Printer</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Output Color</td><td>Color &amp; Black/White</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Print Technology</td><td>Color Laser Printing</td><td>Printing</td></tr><tr><td>Print Speed (A4/LTR)</td><td>18 ppm / 19 ppm</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>Duplex Print Speed</td><td>6ppm(A4)/6ppm(LTR)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>Print Resolution</td><td>600 × 600 dpi (Optical), 1200 × 600 dpi (Max)</td><td>Printing</td></tr><tr><td>First Print Out Time</td><td>Mono: 10 sec / Color: 11 sec</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>Monthly Duty Cycle</td><td>Up to 30,000 Pages</td><td>Productivity</td></tr><tr><td>Duplex Printing</td><td>Supported</td><td>Printing</td></tr><tr><td>Input Capacity</td><td>250 Sheets</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Output Capacity</td><td>150 Sheets</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>1 GHz</td><td>Hardware</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>1 GB</td><td>Hardware</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>LED Indicator</td><td>Interface</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB, LAN (NET), WiFi</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>Network Support</td><td>Wired &amp; Wireless Printing</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>Paper Size Support</td><td>A4, Letter, Legal, Folio, Envelope, Postcard, Custom sizes</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Paper Weight</td><td>60–200 g/m²</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>330W (Print), 12W (Standby), 0.95W (Sleep), 0.15W (Off)</td><td>Power</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td>Dimensions</td><td>401 × 411 × 241 mm</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>16.3 kg</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td>Toner Support</td><td>CTL-1100 Series (1000–3000 pages, color/black variants)</td><td>Consumables</td></tr><tr><td>Noise Level</td><td>≤52 dB (Normal), ≤47 dB (Mute Mode)</td><td>Environment</td></tr><tr><td>OS Support</td><td>Windows, macOS, Linux (various versions)</td><td>Compatibility</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1-Year Limited Warranty</td><td>Support</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty Note</td><td>Adapter/Power Cable not covered; box required for claim</td><td>Support</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PANTER', 39000.00, 38499.98, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/QPtDtRLUULE7SCzjWZxT5rLYwSTg7sUiDjNzJd4n.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-07 15:27:10', '2026-06-07 15:27:10', 'Pantum CP1100DW Color Laser Printer 18ppm Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Pantum CP1100DW Color Laser Printer (18 ppm) in Bangladesh. Features 18ppm speed, 1GHz processor, 1GB RAM, USB/LAN/WiFi connectivity, and professional printing functions. Best price at International Office Solution.', 'Office Printer Bangladesh, Single Function Laser Printer, USB LAN WiFi Printer, Business Color Printer, Pantum Printer BD, CP1100DW Toner, International Office Solution', NULL, 259, NULL, NULL);
