(335, 'Pantum M7100DW Multifunction Mono Laser Printer', 'The Pantum M7100DW Multifunction Mono Laser Printer is a high-speed office printer with print, copy, and scan functions. It offers up to 33–35 ppm speed, automatic duplex printing, WiFi/LAN/USB/NFC connectivity, and up to 60,000-page duty cycle, making it ideal for business use.', 'pantum-m7100dw-multifunction-mono-laser-printer-1780846371', '<p>The Pantum M7100DW Multifunction Mono Laser Printer is a high-performance office printing solution designed for small, medium, and large business environments. Built for speed, reliability, and efficiency, this all-in-one device supports printing, copying, and scanning with advanced connectivity features and strong productivity output.</p><h3>High-Speed Professional Printing</h3><p>With print speeds of up to 33 pages per minute (A4) and 35 pages per minute (Letter), the Pantum M7100DW delivers fast and consistent black-and-white output. It also features a quick first print time of ≤8.2 seconds, ensuring minimal waiting time and improved workflow efficiency.</p><h3>Powerful Multifunction Capability</h3><p>This printer integrates print, copy, and scan functions into a single compact machine, reducing the need for multiple devices. It is ideal for busy office environments where efficiency and space-saving are important.</p><h3>Automatic Duplex Printing</h3><p>The built-in automatic duplex printing function allows users to print on both sides of the page automatically. This helps reduce paper usage, lower printing costs, and improve productivity in daily office operations.</p><h3>Advanced Connectivity Options</h3><p>The Pantum M7100DW offers multiple connectivity options including WiFi, Ethernet (LAN), USB, and NFC support for Android devices. It also supports mobile printing technologies such as AirPrint, Mopria, and the Pantum App, allowing users to print directly from smartphones, tablets, and laptops.</p><h3>Efficient Scanning and Copying</h3><p>Equipped with a 50-page Automatic Document Feeder (ADF), the printer enables fast multi-page scanning and copying. It supports advanced copy functions such as ID copy, N-up copy, poster copy, and manual duplex copy. Scanning speeds reach up to 24 ppm (A4), with support for scan-to-PC, email, FTP, USB, and mobile devices.</p><h3>Cost-Effective Toner System</h3><p>The Pantum M7100DW uses separate toner cartridge and drum unit technology, helping reduce long-term operating costs. The toner supports 1,500 to 6,000 pages, while the drum unit lasts up to 12,000 pages, ensuring efficient and economical printing.</p><h3>Energy Efficient and Quiet Operation</h3><p>Designed for modern office environments, this printer consumes only 50W in ready mode and less than 2W in sleep mode. It also operates quietly with low noise levels, making it suitable for shared workspaces.</p><h3>High Paper Handling Capacity</h3><p>With a 250-sheet input tray and 150-sheet output tray, the printer supports uninterrupted printing for daily office tasks. It is compatible with a wide range of paper sizes and weights, offering flexibility for various document types.</p><h3>Ideal for Office Productivity</h3><p>The Pantum M7100DW is built for demanding office environments that require speed, durability, and multifunction performance. Its robust design ensures reliable long-term use for business workflows.</p><h2>Buy Pantum M7100DW Multifunction Mono Laser Printer from International Office Solution</h2><p>Get the original Pantum M7100DW Multifunction Mono Laser Printer at the best price in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. We offer genuine products, competitive pricing, and trusted after-sales support.</p><p>The Pantum M7100DW comes with a 1-year limited warranty. Please note that the adapter/power cable is not covered under warranty, and the original box is required for warranty claims.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th><th>Category</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Functions</td><td>Print, Scan, Copy</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Printer Type</td><td>Mono Laser Printer</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Output Color</td><td>Black &amp; White</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Print Technology</td><td>Laser</td><td>Printing</td></tr><tr><td>Print Speed</td><td>33 ppm (A4), 35 ppm (Letter)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>Print Resolution</td><td>1200 × 1200 dpi</td><td>Printing</td></tr><tr><td>Monthly Duty Cycle</td><td>Up to 60,000 Pages</td><td>Productivity</td></tr><tr><td>Duplex Printing</td><td>Automatic</td><td>Printing</td></tr><tr><td>Copy Speed</td><td>33 cpm (A4), 35 cpm (Letter)</td><td>Copy</td></tr><tr><td>Copy Resolution</td><td>1200 × 1200 dpi</td><td>Copy</td></tr><tr><td>Scan Type</td><td>Flatbed + ADF</td><td>Scanning</td></tr><tr><td>Scan Resolution</td><td>1200 × 1200 dpi</td><td>Scanning</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum Scan Size</td><td>Flatbed: 216 × 297 mm, ADF: 216 × 356 mm</td><td>Scanning</td></tr><tr><td>ADF Support</td><td>Yes</td><td>Scanning</td></tr><tr><td>Paper Size Support</td><td>A4, Letter, Legal, Folio, Envelope, Postcard, Custom sizes</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Paper Weight</td><td>60–200 g/m²</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Input Capacity</td><td>250 Sheets</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Output Capacity</td><td>150 Sheets</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>525 MHz</td><td>Hardware</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>256 MB</td><td>Hardware</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB 2.0, LAN (Ethernet), WiFi</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>Network Support</td><td>Wired &amp; Wireless Printing</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>Mobile Printing</td><td>AirPrint, Mopria, Pantum App</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td>Dimensions</td><td>415 × 365 × 350 mm</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>11.29 kg</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td>Toner Support</td><td>TL-410 (1500–6000 pages)</td><td>Consumables</td></tr><tr><td>Drum Unit</td><td>DL-410 (12000 pages)</td><td>Consumables</td></tr><tr><td>OS Support</td><td>Windows, macOS, Linux, AirPrint, Mopria</td><td>Compatibility</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1-Year Limited Warranty</td><td>Support</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty Note</td><td>Adapter/Power Cable not covered; box required for claim</td><td>Support</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PANTER', 29000.00, 29000.00, NULL, 6, 'products/thumbnails/eSfLOejWDhU0ts3cOk8SusJ9CAF652FsA6rUnLWT.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-07 15:32:51', '2026-06-07 15:32:51', 'Pantum M7100DW Mono Laser Multifunction Printer Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Pantum M7100DW Multifunction Mono Laser Printer in Bangladesh. Features 33–35 ppm speed, auto duplex, WiFi, LAN, NFC, USB connectivity, ADF scanning, and 60,000-page duty cycle. Best price at International Office Solution.', 'WiFi Printer Bangladesh, NFC Printer, Duplex Laser Printer, ADF Scanner Printer, Business Printer BD, Pantum Printer Price, International Office Solution, M7100DW Toner, Laser Printer Office Use', NULL, 259, NULL, NULL),
(336, 'Pantum BP5100DW Mono(40 PPM) Laser Printer with Duplex & Wi-Fi', 'The Pantum BP5100DW Mono Laser Printer offers fast printing speeds of 33–35 ppm, a 256 MB memory, 350 MHz processor, direct network connectivity, and a monthly duty cycle of up to 60,000 pages. It is a compact and efficient single-function printer ideal for office use.', 'pantum-bp5100dw-mono40-ppm-laser-printer-with-duplex-wi-fi-1780846671', '<p>The <strong>Pantum BP5100DW Single Function Mono Laser Printer</strong> is a compact, high-speed printing solution designed for offices and professional environments that require reliable, fast, and efficient monochrome printing. With strong performance, easy connectivity, and a space-saving design, this printer is ideal for modern workplaces.</p><h3>High-Speed Printing Performance</h3><p>The Pantum BP5100DW delivers impressive print speeds of up to <strong>33 pages per minute (A4)</strong> and <strong>35 pages per minute (Letter)</strong>, ensuring fast document output for busy office environments. Its efficient engine minimizes paper jams and supports continuous printing for improved productivity.</p><h3>Powerful Processing for Smooth Workflow</h3><p>Equipped with a <strong>350 MHz processor</strong> and <strong>256 MB memory</strong>, this printer handles multiple print jobs smoothly and accurately. It ensures stable performance even during high-volume printing tasks.</p><h3>Direct Network Connectivity</h3><p>The BP5100DW features direct network connectivity for faster and more stable printer access. With easy one-step installation, users can quickly connect the printer to any PC or office network without complicated setup procedures.</p><h3>Compact and Space-Saving Design</h3><p>Designed with a compact footprint, the Pantum BP5100DW easily fits into small office spaces or home office setups. It helps maximize workspace efficiency while maintaining powerful performance.</p><h3>High Monthly Duty Cycle</h3><p>With a monthly duty cycle of up to <strong>60,000 pages</strong>, this printer is built for heavy workloads, making it suitable for businesses that require consistent and reliable printing output.</p><h3>Flexible Media Handling</h3><p>The printer supports multiple paper sizes and types, allowing users to complete a wide range of printing tasks including documents, reports, and business materials with ease.</p><h3>Reliable and Efficient Printing Solution</h3><p>The Pantum BP5100DW is engineered for durability, efficiency, and long-term performance, making it a dependable choice for professional environments.</p><h2>Buy Pantum BP5100DW Mono Laser Printer from International Office Solution</h2><p>Get the original <strong>Pantum BP5100DW Single Function Mono Laser Printer</strong> at the best price in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. We provide genuine products, competitive pricing, and reliable customer support.</p><p>This printer comes with a <strong>1-year limited warranty</strong>. Please note that the adapter/power cable is not covered under warranty, and the original box is required for warranty claims.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th><th>Category</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Functions</td><td>Print Only</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Printer Type</td><td>Mono Laser Printer</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Output Color</td><td>Black &amp; White</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Print Technology</td><td>Mono Laser</td><td>Printing</td></tr><tr><td>Print Speed</td><td>40 ppm (A4), 42 ppm (Letter)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>Print Resolution</td><td>1200 × 1200 dpi (Max)</td><td>Printing</td></tr><tr><td>First Print Out Time</td><td>Less than 6.9 seconds</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>Monthly Duty Cycle</td><td>Up to 100,000 pages</td><td>Reliability</td></tr><tr><td>Duplex Printing</td><td>Automatic</td><td>Printing</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>1200 MHz</td><td>Hardware</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>512 MB</td><td>Hardware</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>2-Line LCD</td><td>UI</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>LAN (Gigabit), WiFi 2.4G/5G, USB 2.0</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>Network Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.3 / 802.11 a/b/g/n</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>Paper Input Capacity</td><td>250 Sheets</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Output Capacity</td><td>150 Sheets</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Optional Tray</td><td>60–120 g/m² support</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Paper Weight</td><td>60–200 g/m²</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Paper Size Support</td><td>A4, Letter, Legal, Envelope, Postcard &amp; more</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Supported Media</td><td>Plain, Thick, Thin, Recycled, Labels, Transparency</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>364 × 344 × 257 mm</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>9.3 kg</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td>Toner Support</td><td>TL-5120 (3K–15K pages), DL-5120 (30K drum)</td><td>Consumables</td></tr><tr><td>OS Support</td><td>Windows, macOS, Linux, Astra, CentOS</td><td>Compatibility</td></tr><tr><td>Mobile Printing</td><td>AirPrint, Mopria, Android/iOS App</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1-Year Limited Warranty</td><td>Support</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty Note</td><td>Adapter/power cable not covered; box required</td><td>Support</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PANTER', 26500.00, 26400.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/WSqiZRADqlMDLUZaBcLH4QQmFmmTRUNlq4n2fsnc.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-07 15:37:51', '2026-06-07 15:37:51', 'Pantum BP5100DW Mono Laser Printer Price in Bangladesh | 33–35 ppm High Speed Printer', 'Buy Pantum BP5100DW Single Function Mono Laser Printer in Bangladesh. Features 33–35 ppm speed, 256 MB memory, 350 MHz processor, direct network connection, and 60,000-page duty cycle. Best price at International Office Solution.', 'office printer Bangladesh, Pantum laser printer, high speed mono printer, network laser printer, BP5100DW specifications, business printer BD, International Office Solution', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(337, 'Pantum BP5130DN Single Function Mono Laser Printer(40ppm)', 'The Pantum BP5130DN Mono Laser Printer offers fast 40–42 ppm printing, automatic duplex, 512 MB memory, 1.2 GHz processor, and optional high-capacity paper tray support, making it ideal for office and business use.', 'pantum-bp5130dn-single-function-mono-laser-printer40ppm-1780846965', '<p>The <strong>Pantum BP5130DN Single Function Mono Laser Printer</strong> is a high-performance printing solution designed for offices and professional environments that require fast, reliable, and cost-efficient monochrome printing. With advanced hardware, automatic duplex printing, and expandable paper handling, this printer is ideal for high-volume business use.</p><h3>High-Speed Professional Printing</h3><p>The Pantum BP5130DN delivers impressive print speeds of up to <strong>40 pages per minute (A4)</strong> and <strong>42 pages per minute (Letter)</strong>, ensuring fast document processing for busy office workflows. It is designed to handle large workloads with consistent quality and efficiency.</p><h3>Automatic Duplex Printing</h3><p>This printer supports <strong>automatic double-sided printing</strong>, helping reduce paper usage and printing costs while improving productivity. It is ideal for businesses focused on efficiency and sustainability.</p><h3>Powerful Hardware Performance</h3><p>Equipped with a <strong>1.2 GHz processor</strong> and <strong>512 MB memory</strong>, the BP5130DN ensures smooth handling of multiple print jobs. This allows fast processing of complex documents without delays.</p><h3>Large Paper Handling Capacity</h3><p>The printer includes a <strong>250-sheet input tray</strong> and a <strong>150-sheet output tray</strong>, along with support for an optional <strong>550-sheet tray</strong> for extended printing capacity. This makes it suitable for continuous office operations.</p><h3>Flexible Media Support</h3><p>The Pantum BP5130DN supports a wide range of media types including plain paper, cardstock, labels, and envelopes. This flexibility allows users to print different business documents easily.</p><h3>Compact &amp; Easy Installation</h3><p>Designed with a compact footprint, this printer fits easily into office setups. Its simple installation process ensures quick deployment without technical difficulty.</p><h3>User-Friendly LCD Display</h3><p>The built-in <strong>2-line LCD display</strong> provides easy navigation and printer status monitoring, making daily operation simple and efficient.</p><h2>Buy Pantum BP5130DN Mono Laser Printer from International Office Solution</h2><p>Get the original <strong>Pantum BP5130DN Single Function Mono Laser Printer</strong> at the best price in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. We provide genuine products, competitive pricing, and reliable after-sales support.</p><p>This printer comes with a <strong>1-year warranty</strong>. Please note that the adapter/power cable is not covered under warranty, and the original box is required for warranty claims.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th><th>Category</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Functions</td><td>Print Only</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Printer Type</td><td>Single Function Mono Laser Printer</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Output Color</td><td>Black &amp; White</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Print Technology</td><td>Mono Laser</td><td>Printing</td></tr><tr><td>Print Speed</td><td>40 ppm (A4), 42 ppm (Letter)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>Print Resolution</td><td>1200 × 1200 dpi (Max)</td><td>Printing</td></tr><tr><td>First Print Out Time</td><td>Less than 6.9 seconds</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>Monthly Duty Cycle</td><td>Up to 100,000 pages</td><td>Reliability</td></tr><tr><td>Duplex Printing</td><td>Automatic</td><td>Printing</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>1.2 GHz</td><td>Hardware</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>512 MB</td><td>Hardware</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</t