(338, 'Pantum P3500DN Single Function Mono (33 PPM) Laser Printer', 'The Pantum P3500DN Mono Laser Printer offers fast 33–35 ppm printing, automatic duplex, 1200 × 1200 dpi resolution, 256 MB RAM, 600 MHz processor, and an 80,000-page duty cycle, making it ideal for high-volume office printing.', 'pantum-p3500dn-single-function-mono-33-ppm-laser-printer-1780847274', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Pantum P3500DN Mono Laser Single Function Printer</strong> is a high-performance office printing solution designed for small, medium, and large business environments. Built for speed, reliability, and high-volume printing, this printer delivers consistent black-and-white output with strong durability and efficient operation.</p><h3><strong>High-Speed Professional Printing</strong></h3><p>The Pantum P3500DN delivers fast printing speeds of up to <strong>33 pages per minute (A4)</strong> and <strong>35 pages per minute (Letter)</strong>. With a quick first print time of <strong>less than 8.5 seconds</strong>, it ensures smooth workflow and reduced waiting time in busy office environments.</p><h3><strong>High-Resolution Output</strong></h3><p>This printer supports <strong>1200 × 1200 dpi high-resolution printing</strong>, ensuring sharp text and clear document output. It is ideal for reports, invoices, business documents, and professional office printing needs.</p><h3><strong>Automatic Duplex Printing</strong></h3><p>With built-in <strong>automatic duplex printing</strong>, the P3500DN helps reduce paper usage and operational costs while improving productivity and environmental efficiency.</p><h3><strong>Powerful Performance Hardware</strong></h3><p>Equipped with a <strong>600 MHz processor</strong> and <strong>256 MB RAM</strong>, the printer efficiently handles multiple print jobs with accuracy and stability, making it suitable for continuous office workloads.</p><h3><strong>High Monthly Duty Cycle</strong></h3><p>Designed for heavy workloads, the Pantum P3500DN supports a mon