res 33–35 ppm speed, auto duplex printing, 600 MHz processor, 256 MB RAM, and 80,000-page duty cycle. Best price at International Office Solution.', 'duplex laser printer Bangladesh, office printer BD, high volume laser printer, Pantum printer price, business printer Bangladesh, P3500DN specifications, International Office Solution', NULL, 259, NULL, NULL),
(339, 'Pantum BM2310AW Multifunction Mono Laser Printer', 'The Pantum BM2310AW Multifunction Mono Laser Printer is a fast and reliable 3-in-1 device designed for printing, copying, and scanning. With speeds up to 22ppm (A4), ADF support (50 pages), and a quick first print time under 7.8 seconds, it ensures efficient workflow for office and home use. It features USB, LAN, dual-band WiFi (2.4G/5G), and Bluetooth connectivity, along with mobile printing support via AirPrint and Mopria. Powered by an 800MHz processor and 256MB memory, it delivers smooth performance for everyday document handling.', 'pantum-bm2310aw-multifunction-mono-laser-printer-1780847561', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Pantum BM2310AW Multifunction Mono Laser Printer</strong> is a high-performance 3-in-1 printing solution designed for both office and home use. It supports <strong>printing, copying, and scanning</strong> with fast output speeds and reliable performance, making it ideal for productivity-focused environments.</p><p>With a print speed of <strong>22ppm (A4) and 23ppm (Letter)</strong>, along with a <strong>first print time of under 7.8 seconds</strong>, it ensures quick document handling and reduced waiting time. The printer is built for consistent workloads, supporting a <strong>monthly duty cycle of up to 20,000 pages</strong> with a recommended volume of 250–2,000 pages.</p><p>Its <strong>50-sheet Automatic Document Feeder (ADF)</strong> enables smooth multi-page scanning and copying at up to 22ppm, while the flatbed + ADF scanner supports a maximum size of <strong>216×356mm</strong>. It also supports multiple file formats including PDF, TIFF, JPG, BMP, PNG, and OFD.</p><p>Powered by an <strong>800MHz processor and 256MB memory</strong>, the printer delivers stable performance even during heavy tasks. It comes with a <strong>150-sheet input tray</strong> and <strong>100-sheet output capacity</strong>, supporting a wide range of paper sizes and types from A4, Letter, Legal, envelopes, and postcards with weights from <strong>60–163g/m²</strong>.</p><h3><strong>🔗 Advanced Connectivity</strong></h3><p>The printer offers flexible connectivity options including:</p><ul><li>USB 2.0</li><li>Dual-band WiFi (2.4G/5G)</li><li>Bluetooth</li><li>LAN (Ethernet)</li></ul><p>It also supports mobile printing via <strong>AirPrint, Mopria, Wi-Fi Direct, and Pantum App</strong>, ensuring seamless printing from smartphones and tablets.</p><h3><strong>⚙️ Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li>Watermark printing</li><li>N-up printing</li><li>Booklet printing</li><li>ID card copy</li><li>Energy-efficient operation (&lt;2.5W sleep mode)</li><li>Low noise printing (≤52dBA)</li><li>Wide OS support (Windows, macOS, Linux, Android, iOS)</li></ul><h2><strong>🛒 Buy Pantum BM2310AW Laser Printer in Bangladesh</strong></h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can get the original <strong>Pantum BM2310AW Multifunction Mono Laser Printer</strong> from trusted retailers. We offer a wide collection of the latest Pantum printers. Order online or visit your nearest store to get the best price in Bangladesh.</p><p>The <strong>Pantum BM2310AW Laser Printer</strong> comes with a <strong>1-year limited warranty</strong>, along with an adapter/power cable (no warranty) and box mandatory for warranty claims.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Product Type</td><td>Mono Laser Multifunction Printer</td><td>Printer</td></tr><tr><td>Functions</td><td>Print, Copy, Scan</td><td>All-in-One</td></tr><tr><td>Print Speed</td><td>22ppm (A4), 23ppm (Letter)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>First Print Out Time</td><td>≤ 7.8 seconds</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>Print Resolution</td><td>1200 × 1200 dpi</td><td>Print Quality</td></tr><tr><td>Duty Cycle</td><td>Up to 20,000 pages/month</td><td>Usage Capacity</td></tr><tr><td>Duplex</td><td>Manual</td><td>Feature</td></t