(340, 'Pantum BM2310NW Multifunction Mono Laser Printer( 22ppm)', 'The Pantum BM2310NW Multifunction Mono Laser Printer is a reliable 3-in-1 device designed for printing, copying, and scanning in home and office environments. It delivers fast performance with 22ppm (A4) printing speed and a first print time under 7.8 seconds, ensuring efficient workflow. With support for USB, LAN, dual-band WiFi (2.4G/5G), and Bluetooth, it offers flexible connectivity across multiple devices. Featuring an 800MHz processor, 256MB memory, and 20,000-page duty cycle, this printer is ideal for consistent daily office productivity.', 'pantum-bm2310nw-multifunction-mono-laser-printer-22ppm-1780847894', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Pantum BM2310NW Multifunction Mono Laser Printer</strong> is a versatile and efficient 3-in-1 printing solution designed for modern offices, businesses, and home users who need reliable performance for daily document handling. Combining <strong>printing, copying, and scanning</strong> in a single compact device, it helps improve productivity while saving workspace and operational costs.</p><p>This printer delivers fast and consistent output with a printing speed of <strong>22 pages per minute (A4) and 23 pages per minute (Letter)</strong>. With a <strong>first print time of less than 7.8 seconds</strong>, users can quickly access documents without unnecessary delays, making it highly suitable for busy office environments. It supports a <strong>monthly duty cycle of up to 20,000 pages</strong>, with a recommended volume of 250–2,000 pages, ensuring durability for both light and heavy workloads.</p><p>The copying function is equally efficient, offering speeds of <strong>22 copies per minute (A4)</strong> with advanced features such as <strong>ID card copy, receipt copy, multi-page copy, clone copy, and up to 99-copy batch processing</strong>. These features make it ideal for administrative tasks and office documentation.</p><p>For scanning, the Pantum BM2310NW includes a <strong>flatbed scanner supporting up to 216×297mm size</strong> and multiple file formats including <strong>PDF, TIFF, JPG, BMP, PNG, and OFD</strong>. It also supports multiple scan destinations such as <strong>PC, email, FTP, SMB, and mobile devices (iOS/Android)</strong>, ensuring flexible document management across platforms.</p><p>Connectivity is one of its strongest advantages. The device supports <strong>USB 2.0, LAN (Ethernet), dual-band Wi-Fi (2.4G/5G), and Bluetooth</strong>, allowing seamless integration into wired and wireless office networks. Mobile printing and scanning are fully supported, enabling users to print directly from smartphones and tablets with ease.</p><p>The printer is powered by an <strong>800MHz processor and 256MB memory</strong>, ensuring smooth handling of complex print jobs without lag. It comes with a <strong>150-sheet input tray and a 100-sheet output tray</strong>, making it suitable for continuous printing tasks. It supports a wide range of paper sizes including <strong>A4, Letter, Legal, envelopes, postcards, and more</strong>, with paper weight support from <strong>60–163g/m²</strong>.</p><p>The Pantum BM2310NW also includes a <strong>2-line LCD display</strong>, making operation simple and user-friendly. It is compatible with major operating systems including <strong>Windows, macOS, Linux, iOS, and Android</strong>, ensuring broad usability across different devices and environments.</p><p>Designed with energy efficiency in mind, the printer consumes <strong>≤370W during printing and less than 2.5W in sleep mode</strong>, helping reduce electricity usage. It also operates at a low noise level of <strong>≤52dBA</strong>, providing a quieter and more comfortable working environment.</p><p>Supporting starter toner (700 pages) and standard toner (1,600 pages), the Pantum BM2310NW offers cost-effective printing with long-lasting consumables. Its compact design, strong performance, and modern connectivity features make it an ideal choice for offices that require efficiency, reliability, and flexibility.</p><p>Overall, the <strong>Pantum BM2310NW Multifunction Mono Laser Printer</strong> is a powerful, durable, and feature-rich printing solution that delivers excellent value for professional and everyday use.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Product Type</td><td>Mono Laser Multifunction Printer</td><td>Printer</td></tr><tr><td>Functions</td><td>Print, Copy, Scan</td><td>All-in-One</td></tr><tr><td>Print Speed</td><td>22ppm (A4), 23ppm (Letter)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>First Print Out Time</td><td>&lt; 7.8 seconds</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>Duty Cycle</td><td>20,000 pages/month (Max)</td><td>Usage</td></tr><tr><td>Recommended Volume</td><td>250–2,000 pages/month</td><td>Usage</td></tr><tr><td>Duplex</td><td>Manual</td><td>Feature</td></tr><tr><td>Print Resolution</td><td>1200 × 1200 dpi (via engine)</td><td>Print Quality</td></tr><tr><td>Scanner Type</td><td>Flatbed (FB)</td><td>Scanning</td></tr><tr><td>Scan Formats</td><td>PDF, TIFF, JPG, BMP, PNG, OFD</td><td>File Support</td></tr><tr><td>Scan Destinations</td><td>PC, Email, FTP, SMB, iOS/Android</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>Scan Resolution</td><td>Up to 1200 dpi (system dependent)</td><td>Scanning</td></tr><tr><td>Copy Speed</td><td>22 cpm (A4), 23 cpm (Letter)</td><td>Copying</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>800 MHz</td><td>Hardware</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>256 MB</td><td>Hardware</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>2-Line LCD</td><td>UI</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB 2.0, Dual-band WiFi (2.4G/5G), Bluetooth</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>Paper Input</td><td>150 pages</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Output Capacity</td><td>100 pages</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Paper Weight</td><td>60–163 g/m²</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Supported Paper Sizes</td><td>A4, Letter, Legal, Envelope, Postcard, etc.</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Supported OS</td><td>Windows / Mac / Linux / Android / iOS</td><td>Compatibility</td></tr><tr><td>Noise Level</td><td>≤ 52 dBA (Print)</td><td>Environment</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>≤ 370W (Print), &lt;2.5W (Sleep)</td><td>Energy</td></tr><tr><td>Toner</td><td>TL-2310E (700 pages), TL-2310H (1600 pages)</td><td>Consumable</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 Year Limited Warranty</td><td>Service</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PANTER', 20300.00, 20400.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/qoUk1P6AfsfomgG0PkAfjSjCEH91f5clqAzmb7aJ.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-07 15:58:14', '2026-06-07 15:58:14', 'Pantum BM2310NW Multifunction Mono Laser Printer – Price in Bangladesh, Specs & Features', 'Buy Pantum BM2310NW Multifunction Mono Laser Printer with 22ppm speed, Print/Copy/Scan, WiFi (2.4G/5G), LAN, Bluetooth, and 800MHz processor. Best office printer in Bangladesh.', 'Pantum BM2310NW, mono laser printer Bangladesh, multifunction laser printer BD, Pantum printer price, WiFi laser printer, office printer Bangladesh, 3 in 1 printer, ADF laser printer alternative, Pantum scanner printer', NULL, 259, NULL, NULL),
(341, 'Pantum BP2310W Single Function Mono Laser Printer', 'The Pantum BP2310W Single Function Mono Laser Printer is a compact and efficient printing solution for home and office use. It delivers fast print speeds of up to 22ppm (A4) with sharp 1200 x 600 dpi resolution for clear text documents. Featuring WiFi, Bluetooth, and USB connectivity, this printer supports convenient wireless printing from PCs, smartphones, and tablets. Powered by an 800MHz processor and 256MB memory, it ensures smooth performance for everyday printing tasks. With a 150-sheet input tray, support for multiple media types, and a monthly duty cycle of up to 10,000 pages, the Pantum BP2310W offers reliable and cost-effective monochrome printing in a space-saving design.', 'pantum-bp2310w-single-function-mono-laser-printer-1781010583', '<p>The Pantum BP2310W Single Function Mono Laser Printer is a compact, efficient, and reliable printing solution designed for home users, students, and small offices. With fast printing speeds, wireless connectivity, and sharp monochrome output, this printer delivers excellent performance for everyday document printing while maintaining low operating costs.</p><h2>Fast and Reliable Monochrome Printing</h2><p>The Pantum BP2310W Laser Printer offers print speeds of up to 22 pages per minute (A4) and 23 pages per minute (Letter), helping users complete printing tasks quickly and efficiently. Its first print-out time of less than 7.8 seconds reduces waiting time, making it ideal for busy work environments where productivity matters.</p><h2>Crisp Print Quality for Professional Documents</h2><p>Featuring a print resolution of 1200 x 600 dpi, the Pantum BP2310W produces sharp text and clear graphics for reports, invoices, assignments, and office documents. Whether printing business paperwork or educational materials, users can expect consistent and professional-quality results.</p><h2>Wireless Printing with WiFi and Bluetooth</h2><p>Designed for modern workspaces, the Pantum BP2310W supports 2.4GHz WiFi and Bluetooth connectivity, allowing users to print wirelessly from laptops, desktops, smartphones, and tablets. The printer is compatible with AirPrint, Mopria Print Service, and the Pantum App, enabling seamless mobile printing without complicated setup procedures.</p><h2>Compact Design for Home and Office Use</h2><p>With a lightweight design weighing only 4.8kg and compact dimensions of 337 x 220 x 179 mm, the Pantum BP2310W fits comfortably on desks, shelves, and small office workstations. Its space-saving design makes it an excellent choice for users with limited workspace.</p><h2>Efficient Paper Handling</h2><p>The Pantum BP2310W Mono Laser Printer comes with a 150-sheet input tray and a 100-sheet output tray, supporting a variety of media types including plain paper, thick paper, transparency sheets, cardstock, labels, envelopes, and thin paper. It supports paper weights ranging from 60 to 163g/m², providing flexibility for different printing requirements.</p><h2>Powerful Performance and Easy Operation</h2><p>Powered by an 800MHz processor and 256MB memory, the printer delivers smooth and stable performance even when handling multiple print jobs. Manual duplex printing support allows users to print on both sides of the paper, helping reduce paper consumption and operational costs.</p><h2>Broad Operating System Compatibility</h2><p>The Pantum BP2310W supports a wide range of operating systems including Windows, macOS, Linux, Android, and iOS. Its easy installation process and broad compatibility make it suitable for diverse working environments and multi-device setups.</p><h2>Energy-Efficient and Cost-Effective</h2><p>Built with energy-saving technology, the printer consumes approximately 370W during printing and less than 2W in sleep mode, helping reduce electricity usage. Combined with its durable construction and reliable performance, the Pantum BP2310W offers excellent long-term value for both personal and professional users.</p><h2>Why Choose the Pantum BP2310W?</h2><ul><li>Fast printing speed up to 22ppm</li><li>High-quality 1200 x 600 dpi output</li><li>Wireless printing via WiFi and Bluetooth</li><li>AirPrint, Mopria, and Pantum App support</li><li>Compact and lightweight design</li><li>150-sheet input capacity</li><li>Supports multiple paper types and sizes</li><li>Compatible with Windows, macOS, Linux, Android, and iOS</li><li>Energy-efficient operation</li><li>Ideal for home offices, students, and small businesses</li></ul><p>The Pantum BP2310W Single Function Mono Laser Printer combines speed, wireless convenience, and dependable performance in a compact design. Whether you need a printer for home use, educational purposes, or daily office tasks, this printer delivers excellent print quality and productivity at an affordable cost.</p><h2>Buy Pantum BP2310W Single Function Mono Laser Printer in Bangladesh</h2><p>Buy the original Pantum BP2310W Single Function Mono Laser Printer from IOS BD at the best price in Bangladesh. Order online or visit your nearest IOS BD store to enjoy genuine products, competitive pricing, and reliable customer support. The Pantum BP2310W comes with a 1-year warranty for added peace of mind.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th><th>Category</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Functions</td><td>Print Only</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Printer Type</td><td>Single Function Mono Laser Printer</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Output Color</td><td>Black &amp; White</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Print Technology</td><td>Mono Laser</td><td>Print</td></tr><tr><td>Print Speed</td><td>22 ppm (A4), 23 ppm (Letter)</td><td>Print</td></tr><tr><td>Print Resolution</td><td>1200 x 600 dpi</td><td>Print</td></tr><tr><td>First Print Out Time</td><td>Less than 7.8 Seconds</td><td>Print</td></tr><tr><td>Monthly Duty Cycle</td><td>Up to 10,000 Pages</td><td>Print</td></tr><tr><td>Duplex Printing</td><td>Manual</td><td>Print</td></tr><tr><td>Supported Paper Size</td><td>A4, A5</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Supported Paper Type</td><td>Plain Paper, Thick Paper, Transparent, Cardboard, Label, Envelope, Thin Paper</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Paper Weight</td><td>60~163 g/m²</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Input Capacity</td><td>150 Sheets</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Output Capacity</td><td>100 Sheets</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>800 MHz</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>256 MB</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>USB Connectivity</td><td>Hi-Speed USB 2.0</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless Connectivity</td><td>2.4GHz Wi-Fi (IEEE 802.11 b/g/n)</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Yes</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>Print Mode Power Consumption</td><td>Average 370W</td><td>Power</td></tr><tr><td>Standby Power Consumption</td><td>38W</td><td>Power</td></tr><tr><td>Sleep Mode Power Consumption</td><td>Less than 2W</td><td>Power</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td><td>Physical Specification</td></tr><tr><td>Dimensions</td><td>337 × 220 × 179 mm</td><td>Physical Specification</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>4.8 kg</td><td>Physical Specification</td></tr><tr><td>Compatible Toner</td><td>Pantum TL-C2310H Black Toner</td><td>Consumables</td></tr><tr><td>Windows Support</td><td>Windows XP, 7, 8.1, 10, 11, Server 2012/2016/2019</td><td>Software Support</td></tr><tr><td>Mac Support</td><td>macOS 10.10 to 13.2</td><td>Software Support</td></tr><tr><td>Linux Support</td><td>Ubuntu 16.04, 18.04, 20.04, 22.04</td><td>Software Support</td></tr><tr><td>Mobile OS Support</td><td>iOS 11.0~16.0, Android 6.0~12.0</td><td>Software Support</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1-Year Limited Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty Note</td><td>Adapter/Power Cable Warranty Not Included, Box Required for Claim</td><td>Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PANTER', 13300.00, 13400.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/wo1DVzh0Tm8AouRiOpW0dUF5Gm2lH7DVYcwAeso7.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-09 13:09:43', '2026-06-09 13:09:43', 'Pantum BP2310W Single Function Mono Laser Printer with WiFi & Bluetooth', 'Buy Pantum BP2310W Single Function Mono Laser Printer in Bangladesh. Enjoy 22ppm print speed, WiFi & Bluetooth connectivity, 1200 x 600 dpi resolution, 150-sheet input capacity, and reliable monochrome printing for home and office use.', 'Pantum Wireless Printer, Pantum WiFi Printer, Black and White Laser Printer, Pantum Printer Price in Bangladesh, Office Laser Printer, Home Laser Printer, Pantum Bluetooth Printer, Pantum Printer BD', NULL, 259, NULL, NULL);
