(342, 'Pantum BP2310 Single Function Mono Laser Printer', 'The Pantum BP2310 Single Function Mono Laser Printer is a fast and reliable printing solution designed for home and office use. It delivers print speeds of up to 22ppm (A4) with sharp 1200 x 600 dpi resolution for clear black-and-white documents. Powered by a 500MHz processor and 32MB memory, it ensures smooth performance for daily printing tasks. With a 150-sheet input tray, 100-sheet output capacity, and support for multiple paper types, it offers flexible and efficient printing. Compact, energy-efficient, and durable, the Pantum BP2310 is ideal for users seeking a cost-effective mono laser printer for professional-quality output.', 'pantum-bp2310-single-function-mono-laser-printer-1781010950', '<p>The <strong>Pantum BP2310 Single Function Mono Laser Printer</strong> is a compact and high-performance printing solution designed for users who need fast, reliable, and cost-efficient black-and-white document printing. Built for home offices, small businesses, and everyday professional use, this printer delivers consistent output quality with strong durability and smooth operation.</p><p>With a print speed of <strong>22 pages per minute (A4) and 23 pages per minute (Letter)</strong>, the Pantum BP2310 ensures quick document processing, helping users complete tasks efficiently even during high workloads. Its <strong>first print-out time of under 7.8 seconds</strong> reduces waiting time, making it ideal for busy environments where speed matters.</p><p>The printer supports a <strong>maximum monthly duty cycle of up to 15,000 pages</strong>, with a recommended monthly volume of <strong>250–2,000 pages</strong>, ensuring long-term stability and optimal performance. This makes it suitable for regular office documentation, academic work, reports, invoices, and everyday printing needs.</p><p>Designed for versatility, the BP2310 supports multiple media types including <strong>plain paper, thick paper, thin paper, labels, envelopes, and cardboard</strong>, with paper sizes ranging from <strong>A4 to A5</strong> and weights between <strong>60–163 g/m²</strong>. It comes with a <strong>150-sheet input tray</strong> and a <strong>100-sheet output tray</strong>, allowing smooth handling of medium-volume print jobs without frequent reloading.</p><p>Powered by a <strong>500MHz processor and 32MB memory</strong>, the printer efficiently processes print commands while maintaining stable performance. It connects via <strong>Hi-Speed USB 2.0</strong>, ensuring simple plug-and-play installation with wide compatibility across devices and operating systems.</p><p>The compact design of the Pantum BP2310 (337 × 220 × 179 mm, 4.8 kg) makes it easy to fit into small workspaces without compromising productivity. It is also energy efficient, consuming <strong>around 370W during printing, 38W in ready mode, and less than 2W in sleep mode</strong>, helping reduce electricity costs.</p><p>Compatible with <strong>Windows, macOS, Linux, Android, and iOS</strong>, the printer ensures flexible usage across multiple platforms. It also supports the <strong>TL-2310H toner cartridge</strong>, offering cost-effective printing with consistent quality output.</p><p>Overall, the <strong>Pantum BP2310 Mono Laser Printer</strong> is a dependable choice for users looking for a fast, durable, and budget-friendly monochrome printer that delivers professional results in a compact form factor.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th><th>Category</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Functions</td><td>Print Only</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Printer Type</td><td>Single Function Mono Laser Printer</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Output Color</td><td>Black &amp; White</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Print Technology</td><td>Laser</td><td>Print</td></tr><tr><td>Print Speed</td><td>22 ppm (A4) / 23 ppm (Letter)</td><td>Print</td></tr><tr><td>First Print Out Time</td><td>Less than 7.8 seconds</td><td>Print</td></tr><tr><td>Monthly Duty Cycle</td><td>Up to 15,000 pages</td><td>Print</td></tr><tr><td>Recommended Monthly Volume</td><td>250 – 2,000 pages</td><td>Print</td></tr><tr><td>Duplex Printing</td><td>Manual</td><td>Print</td></tr><tr><td>Supported Paper Size</td><td>A4, A5</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Supported Paper Type</td><td>Plain, Thick, Transparent, Cardboard, Label, Envelope, Thin Paper</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Paper Weight</td><td>60 – 163 g/m²</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Input Capacity</td><td>150 sheets</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Output Capacity</td><td>100 sheets</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>500 MHz</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>32 MB</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB 2.0 (Hi-Speed)</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption (Print)</td><td>~370W</td><td>Power</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption (Ready)</td><td>38W</td><td>Power</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption (Sleep)</td><td>&lt; 2W</td><td>Power</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td><td>Physical Specification</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>337 × 220 × 179 mm</td><td>Physical Specification</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>4.8 kg</td><td>Physical Specification</td></tr><tr><td>Supported OS</td><td>Windows, macOS, Linux, Android, iOS</td><td>Software Support</td></tr><tr><td>Toner Model</td><td>Pantum TL-C2310H Black Toner</td><td>Consumables</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1-Year Limited Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PANTER', 12800.00, 12900.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/ItrhBRQaKf6Dtacbqsh6BGtQuz06cOKrqXsSZu8H.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-09 13:15:50', '2026-06-09 13:15:50', 'Pantum BP2310 Single Function Mono Laser Printer – 22ppm High Speed Laser Printer', 'Buy Pantum BP2310 Single Function Mono Laser Printer in Bangladesh. Enjoy 22ppm fast printing, 1200 x 600 dpi quality, 500MHz processor, 32MB memory, USB connectivity, 150-sheet input tray, and reliable mono laser performance for office and home use.', 'Single Function Laser Printer, Black and White Laser Printer, Pantum Printer Price BD, Office Laser Printer, Home Laser Printer, USB Laser Printer, High Speed Laser Printer, Pantum Laser Printer BD', NULL, 259, NULL, NULL),
(343, 'Pantum P2505W Single Function Mono Laser Printer (22 PPM)', 'The Pantum P2505W is a compact single-function mono laser printer offering fast 22 ppm printing, 1200×1200 dpi resolution, and built-in WiFi connectivity. Designed for home and small office use, it delivers sharp black-and-white documents with quick setup and efficient performance.', 'pantum-p2505w-single-function-mono-laser-printer-22-ppm-1781013548', '<p>The <strong>Pantum P2505W Single Function Mono Laser Printer</strong> is a high-performance and cost-efficient printing solution designed for modern home offices, students, freelancers, and small businesses who require fast, reliable, and high-quality monochrome printing.</p><p>Delivering print speeds of up to <strong>22 pages per minute (A4)</strong> and a <strong>first printout time of less than 7.8 seconds</strong>, this printer ensures quick document processing and improved workflow efficiency. Whether you are printing reports, invoices, assignments, or business documents, the Pantum P2505W guarantees smooth and uninterrupted performance.</p><p>With a professional <strong>1200 × 1200 dpi high-resolution output</strong>, every print delivers sharp text and clear graphics, ensuring a polished and professional appearance for all documents. Built for durability and consistent usage, the printer supports a <strong>monthly duty cycle of up to 15,000 pages</strong>, making it suitable for both personal and light business workloads.</p><p>A key advantage of the Pantum P2505W is its <strong>built-in WiFi connectivity</strong>, enabling seamless wireless printing from laptops, smartphones, and tablets without requiring direct cable connections. This enhances flexibility in modern office environments and supports efficient multi-device usage.</p><p>Its <strong>compact and space-saving design</strong> allows it to fit easily into any workstation, while its user-friendly installation process ensures quick setup even for non-technical users. The printer also operates with low noise and energy-efficient performance, making it ideal for quiet and shared environments.</p><p>Supported across multiple platforms including Windows, macOS, Linux, Android, and iOS, the Pantum P2505W ensures maximum compatibility for diverse users. Combined with Pantum’s reliable toner system, it offers cost-effective printing with consistent output quality.</p><p>Now available at <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, the Pantum P2505W stands as a dependable choice for users seeking speed, wireless convenience, durability, and affordability in a compact mono laser printer.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th><th>Category</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Print Speed</td><td>22 ppm (A4) / 23 ppm (Letter)</td><td>Printing</td></tr><tr><td>Print Resolution</td><td>1200 x 1200 dpi</td><td>Printing</td></tr><tr><td>First Print Output Time</td><td>Less than 7.8 seconds</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>Duplex Printing</td><td>Manual</td><td>Printing</td></tr><tr><td>Output Color</td><td>Black &amp; White</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Paper Size Support</td><td>A4, A5, A6, Letter, Legal, Envelope, etc.</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Paper Capacity</td><td>Input: 150 pages / Output: 100 pages</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>600 MHz</td><td>Hardware</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>128 MB</td><td>Hardware</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB 2.0, WiFi</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>370W (Printing), 38W (Ready)</td><td>Power</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>337 x 220 x 178 mm</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>4.75 kg</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td>Supported Toner</td><td>Pantum PC-211KEV</td><td>Consumable</td></tr><tr><td>Function</td><td>Print, Copy</td><td>Function</td></tr><tr><td>Printer Type</td><td>Mono Laser Printer</td><td>Category</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 Year Limited Warranty</td><td>Support</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PANTER', 12500.00, 12400.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/J2bOUA0yXKVdtOOp7fGGzyH2q02FIGE3i2XOXWG3.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-09 13:59:08', '2026-06-09 13:59:08', 'Pantum P2505W Mono Laser Printer Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Pantum P2505W Single Function Mono Laser Printer with 22 ppm speed, WiFi connectivity, and 1200×1200 dpi output. Ideal for home and office use. Available at International Office Solution in Bangladesh.', 'WiFi laser printer, Pantum printer BD, black and white printer, office laser printer, home printer Bangladesh, International Office Solution printer, Pantum WiFi printer', NULL, 259, NULL, NULL),
(344, 'Fujifilm Apeos C325dw Color Laser Printer', 'This high-performance Color Laser Printer delivers fast 31 ppm printing, sharp 600×2400 dpi resolution, and advanced LED xerography technology. With duplex printing, wireless connectivity, and a 52,000-page duty cycle, it is designed for efficient, professional, and high-volume office printing in both color and black & white.', 'fujifilm-apeos-c325dw-color-laser-printer-1781014622', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Color Laser Printer (LED Xerography Technology)</strong> is a powerful and reliable printing solution built for modern offices, corporate environments, and high-volume business operations. Designed to deliver exceptional speed, precision, and productivity, this printer supports both <strong>color and monochrome printing</strong>, making it ideal for reports, presentations, marketing materials, and everyday office documents.</p><p>With a blazing print speed of up to <strong>31 pages per minute (A4, simplex)</strong> and <strong>19 pages per minute (A4, duplex)</strong>, this printer ensures fast and efficient workflow handling even during heavy workloads. It also supports A5 printing at up to 41 ppm, making it highly versatile for different business requirements.</p><p>The printer offers a professional <strong>600 × 2400 dpi resolution</strong>, delivering sharp text, smooth gradients, and vibrant color output suitable for business-grade documents. Its <strong>LED Xerography technology</strong> ensures consistent print quality with reduced energy consumption and enhanced reliability over time.</p><p>Engineered for performance, it features a <strong>maximum duty cycle of up to 52,000 pages</strong>, making it suitable for medium to large-scale office environments. The fast <strong>warm-up time of 35 seconds or less</strong> and <strong>first print-out time of just 10–11 seconds</strong> help reduce waiting time and improve productivity.</p><p>The printer supports a wide range of paper sizes including <strong>A4, A5, Letter, Legal, Executive, Folio, envelopes, and custom sizes</strong>, along with duplex printing support for double-sided output. Its flexible paper handling system includes tray, bypass tray, and optional feeder support, ensuring smooth operation for diverse printing tasks.</p><p>Powered by an <strong>ARM single-core 667 MHz processor and 512 MB memory</strong>, the printer efficiently handles complex print jobs with ease. Connectivity options include <strong>USB 2.0, Ethernet (Gigabit LAN), and WiFi (802.11 b/g/n)</strong>, allowing seamless integration into office networks and shared environments.</p><p>With a compact yet durable design (410 × 430 × 255 mm), this printer fits well into professional workspaces while maintaining strong performance. It also features low power consumption in sleep mode (0.5W), making it energy efficient and cost-effective.</p><p>Compatible with Windows Server, Windows OS versions, and macOS, this printer ensures wide system support for business flexibility. It uses <strong>CT203 series toner cartridges (CMYK)</strong> for consistent, high-quality output.</p><p>Now available at <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, this Color Laser Printer is the perfect choice for businesses seeking speed, reliability, advanced connectivity, and professional-grade color printing performance.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th><th>Category</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Print Technology</td><td>LED Xerography</td><td>Printing</td></tr><tr><td>Print Speed</td><td>31 ppm (A4), 41 ppm (A5)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>Duplex Speed</td><td>19 ppm (A4)</td><td>Printing</td></tr><tr><td>Print Resolution</td><td>600 × 2400 dpi</td><td>Quality</td></tr><tr><td>Output</td><td>Color &amp; Black/White</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Duty Cycle</td><td>Up to 52,000 pages</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>Warm-up Time</td><td>≤ 35 seconds</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>First Print Time</td><td>10–11 seconds</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>512 MB</td><td>Hardware</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>ARM 667 MHz</td><td>Hardware</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB 2.0, LAN, WiFi</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>Paper Sizes</td><td>A4, A5, Legal, Envelope, Custom</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Duplex Printing</td><td>Yes</td><td>Function</td></tr><tr><td>Tray Capacity</td><td>Standard + Optional Feeder</td><td>Paper Handling</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>17.4 kg</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td>Printer Type</td><td>Color Laser Printer</td><td>Category</td></tr><tr><td>Toner Type</td><td>CT203490–CT203493 (CMYK)</td><td>Consumable</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PANTER', 54000.00, 54000.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/FEcN4jCFkaL02Vum55L5aXn3ZxbxhNyw1OZppH6o.jpg', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-09 14:17:02', '2026-06-09 14:17:02', 'Color Laser Printer Price in Bangladesh | 31 PPM LED Laser Printer | International Office Solution', 'Buy high-speed Color Laser Printer with 31 PPM printing, 600×2400 dpi resolution, duplex support, WiFi & LAN connectivity. Ideal for office use in Bangladesh. Available at International Office Solution.', 'duplex laser printer, 31 ppm printer, high speed laser printer BD, business printer Bangladesh, Pantum alternative printer, network laser printer, International Office Solution printer', NULL, 260, NULL, NULL),
(345, 'Netgear GS724TP 24 Port Prosafe Gigabit POE Manage Switch', 'The Netgear GS724TP is a high-performance 24-Port ProSAFE Gigabit PoE Managed Switch designed for business networks, IP surveillance systems, VoIP deployments, and enterprise environments. Featuring 24 Gigabit PoE ports, 2 SFP uplink ports, and advanced management capabilities, it delivers reliable connectivity, power, and network control for growing organizations.', 'netgear-gs724tp-24-port-prosafe-gigabit-poe-manage-switch-1781024270', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Netgear GS724TP 24-Port ProSAFE Gigabit PoE Managed Switch</strong> is a powerful networking solution designed to meet the demands of modern businesses, educational institutions, surveillance systems, and enterprise environments. With 24 Gigabit Ethernet PoE ports and 2 dedicated SFP uplink ports, this managed switch provides high-speed connectivity, flexible deployment options, and centralized network management.</p><p>Equipped with 24 x 10/100/1000 Mbps RJ-45 PoE ports, the GS724TP allows network administrators to connect and power devices such as IP cameras, wireless access points, VoIP phones, and other PoE-enabled equipment through a single Ethernet cable. This simplifies installation, reduces infrastructure costs, and improves network efficiency.</p><p>The switch delivers a non-blocking switching capacity of up to 52 Gbps, ensuring smooth data transmission and optimal performance even in high-traffic network environments. Its 16K MAC address table supports a large number of connected devices, making it suitable for expanding business networks.</p><p>Advanced Layer 2 management features provide greater control over network traffic, security, and performance. Administrators can configure VLANs, Quality of Service (QoS), link aggregation, traffic monitoring, and other essential network functions to optimize operations and improve reliability.</p><p>Built with a durable rack-mountable metal chassis, the GS724TP measures 440 x 257 x 43.2 mm and weighs approximately 3.15 kg. Its professional design makes it ideal for server rooms, data centers, and enterprise networking installations.</p><p>Whether you are deploying a business network, surveillance infrastructure, or VoIP system, the Netgear GS724TP offers the performance, scalability, and management capabilities required for dependable network operations.</p><h2><strong>🔹 Why Buy from International Office Solution?</strong></h2><p>International Office Solution is a trusted provider of networking, IT infrastructure, and office technology solutions in Bangladesh. We offer genuine products, competitive pricing, expert consultation, and professional after-sales support to ensure your network operates efficiently and reliably.</p><p>Purchase the <strong>Netgear GS724TP 24-Port ProSAFE Gigabit PoE Managed Switch</strong> from International Office Solution and benefit from enterprise-grade networking performance backed by dedicated technical expertise and customer service.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Product Type</td><td>PoE Managed Switch</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>24 x 10/100/1000 Base-T RJ-45 Copper Ports</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>Uplink Ports</td><td>2 x 1G SFP Uplink Ports</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>Switching Capacity</td><td>Non-blocking Switching with 52 Gbps</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>MAC Address Table</td><td>16K Entries</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>Network Management</td><td>Managed Switch</td><td>Management</td></tr><tr><td>PoE Support</td><td>Yes</td><td>Power</td></tr><tr><td>Form Factor</td><td>Rack Mountable</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td>Dimensions</td><td>440 x 257 x 43.2 mm (17.3 x 10.1 x 1.7 in)</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>3.15 kg (6.96 lb)</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Lifetime Manufacturer Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Switch', 40500.00, 40500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/AYQoODPyex1olQFU4A0tuV3ouhHBkNEo5fmayPtR.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-09 16:57:50', '2026-06-09 16:57:50', 'Netgear GS724TP 24 Port Gigabit PoE Managed Switch Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy Netgear GS724TP 24 Port ProSAFE Gigabit PoE Managed Switch in Bangladesh. Features 24 Gigabit PoE ports, 2 SFP uplinks, 52Gbps switching capacity, and lifetime warranty. Available at International Office Solution.', 'Netgear GS724TP, Netgear PoE switch Bangladesh, 24 port managed switch, Gigabit PoE switch BD, network switch price Bangladesh, enterprise switch, SFP uplink switch, Netgear switch, International Office Solution', NULL, 271, NULL, NULL),
(346, 'Optoma Projector Price in Bangladesh', 'The Optoma X400LVe XGA 4000 Lumens Professional Projector is designed for classrooms, meeting rooms, and business environments, delivering bright and clear presentations with 4,000 lumens brightness and XGA (1024 x 768) resolution. Featuring a high 25,000:1 contrast ratio, Full 3D support, a powerful built-in 10W speaker, and Eco+ energy-saving technology, it provides exceptional image quality and low operating costs. With versatile connectivity options including HDMI, VGA, Composite Video, and RS232 control, the Optoma X400LVe is an ideal projection solution for professional and educational use.', 'optoma-projector-price-in-bangladesh-1781099048', '<p>The Optoma X400LVe XGA 4000 Lumens Professional Projector is a high-performance projection solution designed for classrooms, meeting rooms, training centers, conference halls, and business environments. Delivering an impressive 4,000 lumens of brightness and a sharp XGA (1024 x 768) resolution, this projector ensures crystal-clear visuals even in brightly lit environments. Whether you\'re presenting business reports, educational content, multimedia presentations, or training materials, the Optoma X400LVe offers reliable performance and exceptional image quality.</p><h3>Bright and Vivid Projection</h3><p>Designed to perform in various lighting conditions, the Optoma X400LVe provides bright and vibrant images throughout the day. Its 4,000-lumen brightness output allows presentations to remain visible and impactful without the need to dim room lights. This makes it an ideal choice for offices, educational institutions, and professional presentation environments.</p><h3>Outstanding Color Performance</h3><p>Optoma\'s advanced color technology delivers accurate and vibrant colors, ensuring presentations, graphics, charts, and videos appear vivid and engaging. The projector supports multiple display modes, including sRGB color settings for realistic image reproduction, making it suitable for educational, business, and multimedia applications.</p><h3>High Contrast for Enhanced Clarity</h3><p>Featuring a remarkable 25,000:1 contrast ratio, the Optoma X400LVe produces deeper blacks and brighter whites for enhanced image depth and detail. Text appears sharper and more readable, while images and videos gain greater visual impact, making it perfect for presentations requiring clear content visibility.</p><h3>Full 3D Compatibility</h3><p>The projector supports Full 3D technology, enabling users to display immersive 3D content from compatible sources such as 3D Blu-ray players, gaming consoles, and 3D broadcasts. This feature makes the projector versatile for educational demonstrations, simulations, and entertainment applications.</p><h3>Powerful Built-in Audio</h3><p>The integrated 10W speaker delivers clear and powerful audio without requiring external sound systems. This simplifies installation and setup while providing sufficient sound output for classrooms, meeting rooms, and conference spaces.</p><h3>Eco+ Energy Saving Technology</h3><p>Optoma\'s Eco+ technology combines energy efficiency, enhanced contrast performance, and extended lamp life. Multiple lamp modes help reduce power consumption by up to 70%, lowering operating costs and minimizing environmental impact while maximizing projector lifespan.</p><h3>Long Lamp Life and Reduced Maintenance</h3><p>The projector\'s lamp offers up to 15,000 hours of life in Eco+ mode, significantly reducing maintenance requirements and replacement costs. This long-lasting performance ensures dependable operation for years of regular use.</p><h3>Smart Power Management Features</h3><p>The Optoma X400LVe includes several intelligent power-saving functions:</p><ul><li>Quick Resume for instant restart after accidental shutdown.</li><li>Eco AV Mute to blank the screen and save power during presentations.</li><li>Direct Power On for automatic startup when power is supplied.</li><li>Direct Power Off for immediate shutdown without waiting for cooling.</li><li>Auto Power Off to conserve energy when the projector remains idle.</li></ul><h3>Flexible Connectivity</h3><p>The projector provides comprehensive connectivity options, including HDMI, VGA, Composite Video, Audio In/Out, USB-A Power, and RS232 control, allowing seamless integration with laptops, PCs, media players, document cameras, and control systems.</p><h3>Why Buy from International Office Solution (IOS)?</h3><p>International Office Solution (IOS) offers genuine Optoma projectors with reliable after-sales support and competitive pricing. Whether for corporate, educational, or professional applications, the Optoma X400LVe delivers dependable performance, excellent image quality, and cost-effective operation. Contact International Office Solution today to get the best price and professional support for your projection needs.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>DLP</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>XGA (1024 x 768)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>4,000 Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>25,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>39.37\" - 472.44\"</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>27.78\" ~ 304.4\" Diagonal</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Type</td><td>Lamp</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Power</td><td>203W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life (Bright)</td><td>6,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life (Dynamic)</td><td>12,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life (Eco)</td><td>10,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life (Eco+)</td><td>15,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Input</td><td>1 x HDMI 1.4a (3D Support)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>VGA Input</td><td>1 x VGA (YPbPr/RGB)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Composite Video Input</td><td>1 x Composite Video</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Input</td><td>1 x 3.5mm Audio</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>VGA Output</td><td>1 x VGA</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>1 x 3.5mm Audio</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB Port</td><td>1 x USB-A Power (1A)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Control Port</td><td>1 x RS232</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Supply</td><td>100 ~ 240V, 50 ~ 60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption (Standby)</td><td>0.5W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption (Min)</td><td>187W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption (Max)</td><td>225W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Information</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>12.44\" x 9.61\" x 4.25\"</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>6.72 lbs</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Service Warranty</td><td>2 Years</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Warranty</td><td>1 Year or 1000 Hours (Whichever Comes First)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 37900.00, 37900.00, NULL, 6, 'products/thumbnails/y855GNFtxzN28yHBkFmkUd9K7MHBUVZ7v8YCbggO.jpg', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-10 13:44:08', '2026-06-10 13:44:08', 'Optoma X400LVe XGA 4000 Lumens Professional Projector Price in Bangladesh | IOS', 'Buy the Optoma X400LVe XGA 4000 Lumens Professional Projector from International Office Solution (IOS) in Bangladesh. Features XGA resolution, 25,000:1 contrast ratio, Full 3D support, Eco+ technology, 10W speaker, and long lamp life for business and education.', 'Full 3D Projector, Optoma X400LVe Price Bangladesh, Optoma Professional Projector, International Office Solution, IOS Bangladesh, Presentation Projector, Education Projector, HDMI Projector, High Brightness Projector, Optoma X400LVe IOS', NULL, 261, NULL, NULL),
(347, 'Optoma ZU500USTe 5000 lumens Ultra Short Throw WUXGA Laser Projector', 'The Optoma ZU500USTe 5000 Lumens Ultra Short Throw WUXGA Laser Projector delivers exceptional image quality with native WUXGA (1920 × 1200) resolution, 5,000 lumens brightness, and a 100,000:1 contrast ratio. Featuring ultra short throw projection, DuraCore laser technology with up to 30,000 hours lifespan, IP5X dust-resistant optical engine, 24/7 operation capability, and flexible connectivity options, it is an ideal solution for classrooms, meeting rooms, digital signage, and professional presentation environments.', 'optoma-zu500uste-5000-lumens-ultra-short-throw-wuxga-laser-projector-1781099654', '<p>The Optoma ZU500USTe 5000 Lumens Ultra Short Throw WUXGA Laser Projector is an advanced laser projection solution designed for classrooms, corporate meeting rooms, training facilities, museums, digital signage, and professional presentation environments. Combining powerful 5,000 lumens brightness, WUXGA resolution, and ultra short throw technology, this projector delivers outstanding image quality while maximizing installation flexibility.</p><h3>Brilliant WUXGA Resolution</h3><p>Featuring native WUXGA (1920 × 1200) resolution, the Optoma ZU500USTe produces sharp, detailed, and vibrant visuals. The 16:10 aspect ratio provides additional vertical screen space, making it ideal for business presentations, educational content, spreadsheets, engineering drawings, and multimedia applications.</p><h3>Powerful 5,000 Lumens Brightness</h3><p>With an impressive brightness output of 5,000 lumens, the projector delivers crystal-clear images even in brightly lit environments. Whether installed in classrooms, conference rooms, training centers, or public venues, content remains visible, engaging, and professional without requiring significant ambient light control.</p><h3>Ultra Short Throw Technology</h3><p>The Optoma ZU500USTe features an ultra short throw lens capable of projecting large images from a very short distance. It can display screen sizes ranging from 80 inches to 130 inches diagonally while being positioned close to the projection surface. This design eliminates shadows, minimizes glare, and provides a cleaner installation, making it particularly suitable for interactive presentations and compact spaces.</p><h3>Exceptional Contrast Performance</h3><p>With a high contrast ratio of 100,000:1, the projector produces deep blacks, bright whites, and enhanced image depth. Text appears sharper and graphics become more detailed, ensuring excellent readability and visual impact for presentations, videos, and educational content.</p><h3>Advanced DuraCore Laser Technology</h3><p>Powered by Optoma’s DuraCore laser light source, the ZU500USTe offers up to 30,000 hours of virtually maintenance-free operation. Unlike traditional lamp-based projectors, the laser system delivers consistent brightness and color performance while significantly reducing maintenance costs and downtime.</p><h3>IP5X Dust-Resistant Optical Engine</h3><p>The projector incorporates an IP5X-certified dust-resistant optical engine that protects critical components from dust contamination. This ensures long-term reliability, stable performance, and reduced maintenance requirements, even in demanding environments.</p><h3>Flexible Screen Size Options</h3><p>The projector supports image sizes from 80\" to 130\" diagonal, allowing users to adapt the display according to room dimensions and presentation requirements. This flexibility makes it suitable for classrooms, boardrooms, auditoriums, and collaborative workspaces.</p><h3>Built-in Audio Performance</h3><p>A powerful 10W integrated speaker provides clear audio output for presentations, lectures, training sessions, and multimedia content. For larger venues, external audio systems can also be connected to enhance sound performance.</p><h3>Extensive Connectivity</h3><p>The Optoma ZU500USTe offers a wide range of connectivity options for seamless integration with modern devices:</p><ul><li>2 × HDMI Inputs</li><li>VGA Input</li><li>USB Connectivity</li><li>RJ-45 Network Port</li><li>Audio Connections</li><li>RS232 Control Interface</li></ul><p>These options allow easy connection to laptops, desktop computers, media players, conferencing systems, interactive devices, and network management solutions.</p><h3>Easy Installation and Adjustment</h3><p>The projector includes advanced image correction features that simplify setup and ensure perfect image alignment:</p><ul><li>Horizontal Keystone Correction</li><li>Vertical Keystone Correction</li><li>Four-Corner Image Adjustment</li><li>Flexible Installation Options</li><li>Ultra Short Throw Placement</li></ul><p>These features enable quick installation while maintaining professional image quality.</p><h3>Designed for Continuous Operation</h3><p>Built for demanding professional environments, the Optoma ZU500USTe supports 24/7 operation, making it ideal for digital signage, control rooms, educational facilities, and commercial display applications where continuous performance is required.</p><h3>Why Buy from International Office Solution (IOS)?</h3><p>International Office Solution (IOS) offers genuine Optoma projectors with professional consultation, installation assistance, warranty support, and competitive pricing throughout Bangladesh. The Optoma ZU500USTe combines ultra short throw convenience, laser reliability, high brightness, and outstanding image quality, making it an ideal projection solution for professional, educational, and commercial environments.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>DLP</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>WUXGA (1920 × 1200)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>5,000 Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>0.727m – 0.84m</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Native Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:10</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Compatible Aspect Ratios</td><td>16:9, 16:10</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>100,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dynamic Contrast Ratio</td><td>3,000,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Additional Feature</td><td>IP5X Dust-Resistant Optical Engine</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Light Source Details</strong></td><td>Light Source Type</td><td>DuraCore Laser</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Laser Life</td><td>Up to 30,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>1 × 10W Speaker</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI</td><td>1 × HDMI 2.0</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB Port</td><td>1 × USB-A Power (1.5A)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>1 × 3.5mm Audio Out</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>3D Sync</td><td>1 × 3D Sync Port</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>RS232</td><td>1 × RS232 Control Port</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Network Port</td><td>1 × RJ45</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Supply</td><td>90 ~ 264V, 50 ~ 60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Standby Power Consumption</td><td>0.5W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Minimum Power Consumption</td><td>260W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Maximum Power Consumption</td><td>328W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Information</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Net Weight</td><td>5.7 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Gross Weight</td><td>7.8 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions (W × D × H)</td><td>383 × 318 × 88 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Service Warranty</td><td>3 Years Parts &amp; Service Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Light Source Warranty</td><td>24 Months or 10,000 Hours (Whichever Comes First)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 334500.00, 334500.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/f4AHiKXmgEPEKCgc6gMyIz0dt3J9ScFkFtMCbv7k.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-10 13:54:14', '2026-06-10 13:54:14', 'Optoma ZU500USTe 5000 Lumens Ultra Short Throw WUXGA Laser Projector Price in Bangladesh | IOS', 'Buy the Optoma ZU500USTe 5000 Lumens Ultra Short Throw WUXGA Laser Projector from International Office Solution (IOS). Features WUXGA resolution, 5,000 lumens brightness, DuraCore laser technology, ultra short throw lens, IP5X dust resistance, and up to 30,000 hours laser life.', 'IP5X Dust Resistant Projector, Professional Display Solution, Optoma Bangladesh, Laser Presentation Projector, Ultra Short Throw Laser Projector, International Office Solution, IOS Bangladesh, Optoma Projector Price, Commercial Laser Projector', NULL, 261, NULL, NULL),
(348, 'Optoma CinemaX D2 3000 Lumens 4K Ultra Short Throw DLP Laser Projector', 'The Optoma CinemaX D2 3000 Lumens 4K Ultra Short Throw DLP Laser Projector delivers stunning 4K UHD resolution, 3,000 lumens brightness, and ultra-short throw projection for a true home cinema experience. Featuring DuraCore laser technology with up to 30,000 hours lifespan, a 1,000,000:1 dynamic contrast ratio, dual 10W speakers, low-latency gaming mode, and flexible HDMI connectivity, it is the perfect projector for movies, gaming, and premium home entertainment.', 'optoma-cinemax-d2-3000-lumens-4k-ultra-short-throw-dlp-laser-projector-1781100125', '<p>The Optoma CinemaX D2 3000 Lumens 4K Ultra Short Throw DLP Laser Projector is a premium home entertainment solution designed to deliver a true cinematic experience with stunning 4K UHD visuals, vibrant colors, and immersive audio. Featuring advanced DuraCore laser technology, ultra-short throw projection, and gaming-focused enhancements, the CinemaX D2 transforms any living room, media room, or entertainment space into a spectacular home theater.</p><h3>True 4K UHD Resolution</h3><p>Experience breathtaking image quality with native 4K UHD (3840 × 2160) resolution. The Optoma CinemaX D2 delivers over 8.3 million pixels on screen, producing exceptional sharpness, clarity, and detail for movies, sports, streaming content, and gaming. Every scene appears more realistic and immersive, bringing entertainment to life.</p><h3>Ultra Short Throw Convenience</h3><p>The CinemaX D2 can project a massive 100-inch image from less than one foot away from the wall or screen. Its ultra-short throw design eliminates the need for ceiling mounts or long cable runs while maximizing room space. Users can enjoy a large-screen viewing experience without the installation complexity of traditional projectors.</p><h3>Powerful 3000 Lumens Brightness</h3><p>With 3,000 lumens of brightness, the projector delivers vibrant and detailed images in dimly lit and moderately bright rooms. Whether watching movies during the day or gaming at night, the CinemaX D2 maintains impressive visual performance with rich colors and excellent clarity.</p><h3>DuraCore Laser Technology</h3><p>Optoma\'s advanced DuraCore laser light source offers up to 30,000 hours of maintenance-free operation. Unlike conventional lamp projectors, laser technology provides consistent brightness, stable color performance, faster startup times, and significantly reduced maintenance costs.</p><h3>Incredible Dynamic Contrast</h3><p>Featuring a dynamic contrast ratio of 1,000,000:1, the CinemaX D2 delivers deep blacks, bright highlights, and exceptional image depth. Dark movie scenes appear more detailed while bright scenes maintain excellent color accuracy and realism.</p><h3>Cinematic Color Performance</h3><p>The projector supports a wide Rec.709 color gamut, ensuring accurate and vibrant color reproduction. Movies, TV shows, sports broadcasts, and games display lifelike colors and enhanced realism, creating a premium home cinema experience.</p><h3>Enhanced Gaming Mode</h3><p>The Optoma CinemaX D2 is designed for gamers who demand speed and responsiveness. The enhanced gaming mode significantly reduces input lag, providing:</p><ul><li>16ms response time at 4K UHD 60Hz</li><li>4ms response time at 1080p 240Hz</li></ul><p>This ultra-low latency ensures smooth gameplay, quick reactions, and a competitive advantage in fast-paced gaming environments.</p><h3>Immersive Built-In Audio</h3><p>The projector includes dual 10W built-in speakers that deliver clear and balanced audio performance. The integrated sound system provides a convenient entertainment solution without requiring external speakers for everyday use.</p><h3>Flexible Connectivity</h3><p>The CinemaX D2 offers multiple connectivity options for modern entertainment devices:</p><ul><li>3 × HDMI 2.0 Inputs</li><li>USB-A Power Output (1.5A)</li><li>Optical S/PDIF Audio Output</li><li>3.5mm Audio Output</li><li>RS232 Control Port</li></ul><p>These interfaces allow seamless connection to gaming consoles, streaming devices, Blu-ray players, sound systems, and home automation solutions.</p><h3>Quiet and Efficient Operation</h3><p>Operating at only 26dB to 28dB noise levels, the CinemaX D2 ensures a distraction-free viewing experience. The energy-efficient laser light source also helps reduce power consumption while maintaining exceptional performance.</p><h3>Perfect for Home Entertainment</h3><p>The Optoma CinemaX D2 is ideal for:</p><ul><li>Home Theater Systems</li><li>Living Room Entertainment</li><li>4K Movie Viewing</li><li>Sports Broadcasting</li><li>Next-Generation Console Gaming</li><li>Streaming Platforms</li><li>Family Entertainment Spaces</li></ul><h3>Why Buy from International Office Solution (IOS)?</h3><p>International Office Solution (IOS) offers genuine Optoma projectors with manufacturer warranty, professional consultation, installation support, and competitive pricing in Bangladesh. The Optoma CinemaX D2 combines 4K UHD resolution, ultra-short throw convenience, laser reliability, and gaming performance, making it one of the best premium home entertainment projectors available today.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>DLP</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>4K UHD (3840 × 2160)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>3,000 Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>0.47m – 0.66m</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Native Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Supported Aspect Ratio</td><td>4:3</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dynamic Contrast Ratio</td><td>1,000,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Maximum Image Size</td><td>Up to 120-inch</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Laser Light Source</strong></td><td>Light Source Type</td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Light Source Life</td><td>Up to 30,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speakers</td><td>2 × 10W Speakers</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Input</td><td>3 × HDMI 2.0</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>RS232 Control</td><td>1 × RS232</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>S/PDIF Output</td><td>1 × S/PDIF</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB Port</td><td>1 × USB-A Power (1.5A)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>1 × 3.5mm Audio Out</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Supply</td><td>100 ~ 240V, 50 ~ 60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Standby Power Consumption</td><td>0.5W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Minimum Power Consumption</td><td>190W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Maximum Power Consumption</td><td>230W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Additional Information</strong></td><td>Noise Level (Min)</td><td>26dB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Noise Level (Max)</td><td>28dB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Information</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>8.4 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions (W × D × H)</td><td>576 × 383 × 130 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Service Warranty</td><td>3 Years Parts &amp; Service Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 266500.00, 266500.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/BZGFc2rHEhb0fp3k1gUJWE34bffzTUc0mHYdHZGA.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-10 14:02:05', '2026-06-10 14:02:05', 'Optoma CinemaX D2 4K Ultra Short Throw Laser Projector Price in Bangladesh | IOS', 'Buy the Optoma CinemaX D2 3000 Lumens 4K Ultra Short Throw Laser Projector from International Office Solution (IOS). Features 4K UHD resolution, DuraCore laser technology, 100-inch ultra-short throw projection, low-latency gaming mode, and 30,000-hour laser life.', 'DuraCore Laser Projector, Optoma Bangladesh, Premium Home Entertainment Projector, International Office Solution, IOS Bangladesh, 4K UHD Projector, Ultra Short Throw 4K Projector', NULL, 261, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `name`, `short_description`, `slug`, `description`, `specifications_text`, `tags`, `buy_price`, `price`, `discount_price`, `stock`, `thumbnail`, `video`, `is_featured`, `status`, `is_coming_soon`, `is_tba`, `is_call_for_price`, `is_out_of_stock`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`, `meta_keywords`, `meta_image`, `brand_id`, `supplier_id`, `laptop_purpose_id`) VALUES
(349, 'Optoma L1 Plus 2500 lumens Ultra Short Throw 4K LED Home Projector', 'The Optoma L1 Plus 2500 Lumens Ultra Short Throw 4K LED Home Projector delivers stunning 4K UHD resolution, ultra short throw projection, and advanced 4LED technology with up to 30,000 hours lifespan. Featuring HDR and HLG compatibility, Enhanced Gaming Mode, VRR support, Eye Protection Sensor, Android TV streaming capabilities, and a high 1,800,000:1 contrast ratio, it offers an exceptional home cinema and gaming experience.', 'optoma-l1-plus-2500-lumens-ultra-short-throw-4k-led-home-projector-1781100652', '<p>The Optoma L1 Plus 2500 Lumens Ultra Short Throw 4K LED Home Projector is a premium entertainment solution engineered to deliver immersive cinematic experiences, next-generation gaming performance, and stunning visual quality. Combining true 4K UHD resolution, advanced 4LED technology, ultra short throw projection, and smart streaming capabilities, the Optoma L1 Plus transforms any room into a high-performance home theater.</p><h3>Stunning 4K UHD Resolution</h3><p>Experience exceptional clarity with native 4K UHD (3840 × 2160) resolution, delivering over 8.3 million pixels for incredible detail and sharpness. Whether you\'re watching blockbuster movies, sports events, TV shows, or gaming content, the Optoma L1 Plus reproduces every scene with lifelike realism, vibrant colors, and enhanced depth.</p><h3>Ultra Short Throw Projection</h3><p>The Optoma L1 Plus features an ultra short throw lens that can project a large screen image from a very short distance. Capable of displaying screen sizes from 80 inches to 130 inches, it allows users to enjoy a true cinematic experience without requiring extensive installation space. The ultra short throw design also minimizes shadows and glare, making it perfect for modern living rooms and media spaces.</p><h3>Advanced 4LED Light Source Technology</h3><p>Powered by innovative 4LED technology, the projector delivers outstanding color accuracy, improved brightness efficiency, and exceptional reliability. The LED light source offers up to 30,000 hours of maintenance-free operation, eliminating the need for frequent lamp replacements while ensuring consistent image quality over time.</p><h3>Incredible Dynamic Contrast</h3><p>Featuring an impressive 1,800,000:1 contrast ratio, the Optoma L1 Plus produces deeper blacks, brighter highlights, and enhanced image depth. This creates more realistic visuals with improved shadow detail and vibrant color reproduction for a truly immersive viewing experience.</p><h3>HDR and HLG Compatibility</h3><p>The projector supports both HDR (High Dynamic Range) and HLG (Hybrid Log-Gamma) technologies, providing richer colors, higher contrast levels, and enhanced image realism. HDR content appears more vibrant and detailed, while HLG compatibility ensures superior performance for live broadcasts and streaming services.</p><h3>Enhanced Gaming Mode</h3><p>Designed for gaming enthusiasts, the Optoma L1 Plus includes an Enhanced Gaming Mode that minimizes input lag and optimizes response times. This feature delivers smoother gameplay, faster reactions, and greater precision during fast-paced gaming sessions, making it ideal for both casual and competitive gamers.</p><h3>Smooth Motion with VRR Support</h3><p>Variable Refresh Rate (VRR) compatibility synchronizes the projector\'s refresh rate with gaming consoles and compatible devices. This technology helps eliminate screen tearing, stuttering, and motion blur, ensuring fluid gameplay and seamless action sequences.</p><h3>Smart Streaming Entertainment</h3><p>The included Android TV dongle gives users instant access to popular streaming platforms and entertainment apps. Enjoy movies, TV shows, sports, and online content directly from the projector without requiring additional media players.</p><h3>Precision Geometric and Four-Corner Correction</h3><p>Advanced image adjustment technologies ensure perfect screen alignment in virtually any installation environment.</p><p>Features include:</p><ul><li>Geometric Correction</li><li>Four-Corner Adjustment</li><li>Flexible Screen Positioning</li><li>Easy Installation Setup</li></ul><p>These capabilities allow users to achieve a perfectly rectangular image even when the projector cannot be placed directly in front of the screen.</p><h3>Eye Protection Sensor</h3><p>The integrated Eye Protection Sensor enhances user safety by automatically detecting when someone approaches the projection beam. The system instantly reduces brightness to protect eyesight and provide a safer viewing environment, especially for families with children.</p><h3>Built-In Audio System</h3><p>The projector features a powerful built-in speaker system that delivers clear and balanced sound for movies, games, and streaming content. Users can also connect external audio systems through the available audio outputs for a more immersive home theater experience.</p><h3>Flexible Connectivity</h3><p>The Optoma L1 Plus offers comprehensive connectivity options for modern entertainment devices:</p><ul><li>HDMI 2.0 Connectivity</li><li>USB-A Power Output (1.5A)</li><li>3.5mm Audio Output</li><li>S/PDIF Digital Audio Output</li><li>Micro-USB Service Port</li></ul><p>These interfaces support gaming consoles, streaming devices, Blu-ray players, sound systems, and smart home integrations.</p><h3>Energy-Efficient and Reliable</h3><p>With power consumption ranging from only 145W to 165W and a long-lasting LED light source, the projector provides energy-efficient operation while maintaining outstanding performance and reliability.</p><h3>Ideal Applications</h3><ul><li>Home Theater Systems</li><li>4K Movie Viewing</li><li>Console Gaming</li><li>Streaming Entertainment</li><li>Living Room Cinema</li><li>Family Entertainment Spaces</li><li>Sports Viewing</li><li>Smart Home Integration</li></ul><h3>Why Buy from International Office Solution (IOS)?</h3><p>International Office Solution (IOS) offers genuine Optoma projectors with official warranty coverage, professional consultation, installation support, and competitive pricing across Bangladesh. The Optoma L1 Plus combines 4K UHD image quality, ultra short throw convenience, advanced gaming features, and smart entertainment capabilities, making it an excellent choice for modern home entertainment.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>DLP</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>4K UHD (3840 × 2160)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>2,500 Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>0.47m – 0.59m</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1,800,000:1</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Laser Light Source</strong></td><td>Light Source Life</td><td>Up to 30,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>1 × 15W Speaker</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI</td><td>HDMI 2.0</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>1 × 3.5mm Audio Out</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB Port</td><td>1 × USB-A Power (1.5A)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Digital Audio Output</td><td>1 × S/PDIF</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Service Port</td><td>1 × Micro-USB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Supply</td><td>100V ~ 240V, 50 ~ 60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Minimum Power Consumption</td><td>145W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Maximum Power Consumption</td><td>165W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Information</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Net Weight</td><td>5.1 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Gross Weight</td><td>7.8 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions (W × D × H)</td><td>400 × 316 × 112.8 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Service Warranty</td><td>2 Years Service Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Light Source / Lamp Warranty</td><td>1 Year or 1000 Hours (Whichever Comes First)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 186500.00, 186500.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/BILI2Wc83Z8MbES7SHxuDw0gYm4jJGvFcuOSpT7V.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-10 14:10:52', '2026-06-10 14:12:47', 'Optoma L1 Plus 2500 Lumens Ultra Short Throw 4K LED Home Projector Price in Bangladesh | IOS', 'Buy the Optoma L1 Plus 2500 Lumens Ultra Short Throw 4K LED Home Projector from International Office Solution (IOS). Features 4K UHD resolution, 4LED technology, HDR support, VRR gaming mode, Android TV, Eye Protection Sensor, and up to 30,000 hours LED life.', 'Optoma Bangladesh, Ultra Short Throw 4K Projector, Home Entertainment Projector, International Office Solution, IOS Bangladesh, 4K UHD Home Projector, Premium LED Projector', NULL, 261, NULL, NULL),
(350, 'Optoma Projector AZH430UST 4000 lumens Ultra Short Throw Laser', 'The Optoma AZH430UST 4000 Lumens Ultra Short Throw Laser Projector delivers Full HD 1080p resolution, 4000 lumens brightness, and ultra short throw projection for compact spaces. Featuring DuraCore laser technology with up to 30,000 hours lifespan, IP6X dust resistance, 300,000:1 contrast ratio, multiple HDMI inputs, RJ45 LAN support, and a powerful 15W built-in speaker, it is ideal for classrooms, offices, and home entertainment.', 'optoma-projector-azh430ust-4000-lumens-ultra-short-throw-laser-1781102260', '<p>The Optoma AZH430UST 4000 Lumens Ultra Short Throw Laser Projector is a high-performance projection solution designed for modern classrooms, corporate meeting rooms, training centers, digital signage, and home entertainment setups. With Full HD 1080p resolution, powerful laser brightness, and ultra short throw capability, this projector delivers stunning visuals in compact environments without compromising image quality.</p><h3>Full HD 1080p Crystal-Clear Image Quality</h3><p>Featuring native Full HD 1080p (1920 × 1080) resolution, the Optoma AZH430UST ensures sharp, detailed, and vibrant visuals. It is ideal for presentations, videos, educational content, and multimedia applications, delivering professional-grade clarity in every frame.</p><h3>Powerful 4000 Lumens Brightness</h3><p>With 4000 lumens of brightness, this projector produces clear and vivid images even in well-lit environments. Whether used in a classroom, conference room, or home setup, it maintains excellent visibility without requiring complete darkness.</p><h3>Ultra Short Throw Convenience</h3><p>The ultra short throw lens allows the projector to display large screen sizes (80\" to 130\") from a very short distance. This eliminates shadows from presenters and reduces space requirements, making it perfect for compact rooms and interactive environments.</p><h3>Advanced DuraCore Laser Technology</h3><p>Equipped with Optoma’s DuraCore laser engine, the AZH430UST delivers up to 30,000 hours of maintenance-free operation. This ensures long-term reliability, stable brightness, and consistent color performance with minimal upkeep costs.</p><h3>Exceptional Contrast Performance</h3><p>With a native contrast ratio of 300,000:1 and a dynamic contrast ratio of up to 2,000,000:1, the projector delivers deep blacks, bright whites, and enhanced image depth for a more immersive viewing experience.</p><h3>IP6X Dust Resistance</h3><p>Built with a highly durable IP6X-rated sealed optical engine, the projector is protected against dust ingress, ensuring long-lasting performance and reduced maintenance requirements even in challenging environments.</p><h3>Flexible Installation &amp; 360° Projection</h3><p>The Optoma AZH430UST supports 360-degree installation, allowing flexible mounting in any orientation. It is also designed for 24/7 continuous operation, making it suitable for professional display and digital signage applications.</p><h3>Advanced Connectivity Options</h3><p>This projector offers a wide range of connectivity for modern devices:</p><ul><li>2 × HDMI 2.0 Inputs</li><li>USB-A Power Output (1.5A)</li><li>3.5mm Audio Output</li><li>3D Sync Port</li><li>RS232 Control Port</li><li>RJ45 LAN Network Port</li></ul><p>These connections allow seamless integration with laptops, PCs, media players, control systems, and network environments.</p><h3>Powerful Built-in Audio</h3><p>A built-in 15W speaker provides clear and powerful sound output for presentations, videos, and classroom use. External audio systems can also be easily connected for enhanced sound performance.</p><h3>Ideal Applications</h3><ul><li>Corporate Meeting Rooms</li><li>Educational Classrooms</li><li>Interactive Learning Spaces</li><li>Digital Signage Displays</li><li>Home Entertainment Systems</li><li>Training Centers</li><li>Exhibition &amp; Museum Displays</li></ul><h3>Why Buy from International Office Solution (IOS)?</h3><p>International Office Solution (IOS) provides genuine Optoma projectors with official warranty, expert consultation, installation support, and competitive pricing in Bangladesh. The Optoma AZH430UST combines ultra short throw convenience, laser durability, Full HD clarity, and high brightness, making it an excellent choice for professional and educational environments.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>DLP</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>Full HD 1080p (1920 × 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>4,000 Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>0.17m – 0.45m</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Native Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Compatible Aspect Ratios</td><td>4:3, 16:9</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Native Contrast Ratio</td><td>300,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dynamic Contrast Ratio</td><td>2,000,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Water Resistance</td><td>IP67 Rated</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>3D Support</td><td>DLP 3D</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>PC 3D Support</td><td>PC Frame Sequential 120Hz 3D</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Blu-ray 3D Support</td><td>Blu-ray DVD 3D</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Security Features</td><td>Security Bar, Kensington Lock, Password-Protected Interface</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Laser Light Source</strong></td><td>Light Source Type</td><td>DuraCore Laser</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Light Source Life</td><td>Up to 30,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>1 × 15W Speaker</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI</td><td>HDMI 2.0</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB Port</td><td>1 × USB-A Power (1.5A)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>1 × 3.5mm Audio Out</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>3D Sync Port</td><td>1 × 3D Sync</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>RS232</td><td>1 × RS232</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Network Port</td><td>1 × RJ45</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>External Power Supply</td><td>180W DC, 19.5V, 9.23A</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Standby Power Consumption</td><td>&lt; 0.5W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Minimum Power Consumption</td><td>139.15W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Maximum Power Consumption</td><td>202.4W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Information</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Net Weight</td><td>3.9 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Gross Weight</td><td>6.08 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions (W × D × H)</td><td>327 × 327 × 109.6 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>1 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 180500.00, 180400.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/rxHtCAUVRJXVYZm2rD36B2kZYCx8AT9Vkc557gzV.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-10 14:37:40', '2026-06-10 14:37:40', 'Optoma AZH430UST Ultra Short Throw 4000 Lumens Laser Projector Price in Bangladesh | IOS', 'Buy Optoma AZH430UST 4000 Lumens Ultra Short Throw Laser Projector from International Office Solution (IOS). Features Full HD 1080p resolution, DuraCore laser technology, IP6X dust resistance, 2,000,000:1 contrast ratio, and 24/7 operation support.', 'IP6X Dust Resistant Projector, 1080p Projector, Conference Room Projector, Digital Signage Projector, International Office Solution, IOS Bangladesh, High Brightness Projector, Professional Laser Projector, Ultra Short Throw 1080p Projector', NULL, 261, NULL, NULL),
(351, 'Optoma  Projector AZW500 5200 Lumens WXGA DLP Laser', 'The Optoma AZW500 5200 Lumens WXGA DLP Laser Projector delivers powerful brightness, WXGA resolution, and DuraCore laser technology with up to 30,000 hours lifespan. Designed for boardrooms and conference rooms, it features eco-friendly construction, 1.3x zoom flexibility, 300,000:1 contrast ratio, low noise operation, and advanced connectivity including HDMI, RS232, and RJ45 for professional use.', 'optoma-projector-azw500-5200-lumens-wxga-dlp-laser-1781102551', '<p>The Optoma AZW500 5200 Lumens WXGA DLP Laser Projector is a high-performance, maintenance-free projection solution designed for modern boardrooms, conference rooms, classrooms, and professional presentation environments. Built with advanced DuraCore laser technology, eco-friendly materials, and powerful brightness output, this projector delivers reliable and long-lasting visual performance for continuous business use.</p><h3>Powerful 5200 Lumens Brightness</h3><p>With an impressive 5200 lumens brightness, the Optoma AZW500 ensures clear, vivid, and highly visible images even in well-lit environments. It is ideal for medium to large meeting spaces where presentations must remain sharp and readable without dimming the lights.</p><h3>WXGA Resolution for Professional Presentations</h3><p>The projector features WXGA (1280 × 800) resolution, providing crisp visuals, improved clarity, and enhanced detail for business documents, spreadsheets, graphics, and multimedia content. It is optimized for professional productivity and corporate communication.</p><h3>Advanced DuraCore Laser Technology</h3><p>Equipped with Optoma’s DuraCore laser light source, the AZW500 delivers up to 30,000 hours of maintenance-free operation. This eliminates the need for lamp replacements, reduces downtime, and ensures consistent brightness and color stability over time.</p><h3>Eco-Friendly and Sustainable Design</h3><p>The Optoma AZW500 is designed with sustainability in mind:</p><ul><li>Up to 45% lower power consumption compared to lamp-based projectors</li><li>Up to 50% post-consumer recycled (PCR) plastics used in chassis</li><li>Up to 97% recyclable packaging materials</li><li>Mercury-free laser light source</li><li>Compact design for efficient transportation and reduced carbon emissions</li></ul><p>These features make it an environmentally responsible choice for modern organizations.</p><h3>Flexible Installation Options</h3><p>With a 1.3x optical zoom, the projector offers flexible installation in various room sizes and layouts. Whether ceiling-mounted or placed on a table, the AZW500 adapts easily to different environments while maintaining optimal image quality.</p><h3>Strong Contrast and Image Performance</h3><p>The projector delivers a high contrast ratio of 300,000:1, producing deep blacks, bright whites, and enhanced image depth. This ensures sharp text clarity and vibrant visuals for professional presentations and multimedia content.</p><h3>Reliable Connectivity</h3><p>The Optoma AZW500 offers essential connectivity options for business environments:</p><ul><li>2 × HDMI 1.4a Inputs (with 3D support)</li><li>RS232 Control Port for remote management</li><li>RJ45 Network Port for LAN control</li><li>USB-A Power Output (1.5A)</li><li>3.5mm Audio Output</li></ul><p>These interfaces allow seamless integration with laptops, PCs, AV systems, and network-based control solutions.</p><h3>Built-in Audio Support</h3><p>A built-in 15W speaker provides clear audio output for meetings, training sessions, and presentations, eliminating the need for external speakers in smaller to medium-sized rooms.</p><h3>Low Noise Operation</h3><p>With a noise level of only 29–31 dB, the projector ensures a quiet and distraction-free environment, making it suitable for professional meeting spaces and classrooms.</p><h3>Ideal Applications</h3><ul><li>Corporate Meeting Rooms</li><li>Boardrooms and Conference Halls</li><li>Educational Institutions</li><li>Training Centers</li><li>Business Presentations</li><li>Medium-Sized Venues</li></ul><h3>Why Buy from International Office Solution (IOS)?</h3><p>International Office Solution (IOS) provides genuine Optoma projectors with official warranty support, professional installation services, and competitive pricing in Bangladesh. The Optoma AZW500 combines high brightness, laser durability, eco-friendly design, and maintenance-free operation, making it a smart long-term investment for business environments.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>DLP</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>WXGA (1280 × 800)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>5,200 Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>1.2m – 7.7m</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Aspect Ratios</td><td>4:3, 16:9, 16:10</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>300,000:1</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Laser Light Source</strong></td><td>Light Source Type</td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Light Source Life</td><td>Up to 30,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>1 × 15W Speaker</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Input</td><td>2 × HDMI 1.4a (3D Support)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>1 × 3.5mm Audio Out</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB Port</td><td>1 × USB-A Power (1.5A)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Control Ports</td><td>RS232, RJ45 (LAN)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Supply</td><td>External Power Supply, 100–240V, 50–60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Standby Power Consumption</td><td>&lt; 0.5W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Minimum Power Consumption</td><td>160W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Maximum Power Consumption</td><td>258.75W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Additional Information</strong></td><td>Noise Level</td><td>29–31 dB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>IP Rating</td><td>IP6X Dust Resistant</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Information</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>2.9 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions (W × D × H)</td><td>274 × 216 × 114 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Service Warranty</td><td>3 Years Parts &amp; Service Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 105000.00, 105000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/yjvaDDQKLuMAnBOS0yH6x8VoysAepCtwJvSHksHO.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-10 14:42:31', '2026-06-10 14:52:12', 'Optoma  Projector AZW500 5200 Lumens WXGA DLP Laser', 'Buy Optoma AZW500 5200 Lumens WXGA DLP Laser Projector from International Office Solution (IOS). Features DuraCore laser technology, eco-friendly design, 30,000-hour lifespan, HDMI connectivity, RS232 control, and high brightness for business presentations.', 'High Brightness Projector, 300000:1 Contrast Projector, HDMI Projector, RJ45 Projector, RS232 Projector, International Office Solution, IOS Bangladesh, Laser Business Projector', NULL, 261, NULL, NULL),
(352, 'Optoma Projector UHD55 3600 Lumens 4K UHD Gaming', 'The Optoma UHD 4K DLP Laser Projector with 3600 lumens delivers stunning Ultra HD resolution, ultra-low 4.40ms input lag, and advanced wireless connectivity. Featuring HDMI 2.0 support, Full 3D compatibility, 240W lamp system, and multiple installation options, it is ideal for home theater, gaming, and professional presentations.', 'optoma-projector-uhd55-3600-lumens-4k-uhd-gaming-1781103465', '<p>The Optoma UHD 4K DLP Laser Projector with 3600 lumens brightness is a high-performance projection solution designed for home theater, gaming, business presentations, and professional multimedia environments. Combining true 4K UHD resolution, ultra-low input lag, and advanced connectivity options, this projector delivers exceptional image quality and smooth performance for both entertainment and productivity.</p><h3>Stunning 4K UHD Image Quality</h3><p>With native 4K UHD (3840 × 2160) resolution, the projector delivers ultra-sharp visuals with over 8.3 million pixels. It ensures crystal-clear detail, enhanced depth, and lifelike clarity, making it ideal for movies, gaming, sports, and high-resolution presentations.</p><h3>Bright and Vibrant Display</h3><p>Featuring 3,600 lumens brightness, the projector provides clear and vivid visuals in both dark and moderately lit environments. It ensures consistent color accuracy and brightness for a wide range of content types.</p><h3>Ultra-Fast 4.40ms Input Lag for Gaming</h3><p>Designed for gamers, the projector offers an ultra-low input lag of just 4.40ms, ensuring extremely responsive gameplay. Fast motion scenes remain smooth and precise, giving players a competitive advantage in action and competitive games.</p><h3>Advanced 3D &amp; Multimedia Compatibility</h3><p>The projector supports Full 3D viewing with multiple formats including frame-pack 1080p24 and 720p 50/60Hz. It is also compatible with a wide range of video formats including UHD, WQHD, WUXGA, FHD, and more, ensuring maximum flexibility for different devices and media sources.</p><h3>Flexible Projection &amp; Wide Compatibility</h3><p>The projector supports projection distances from 47.24 inches to 318.9 inches, making it suitable for both small and large spaces. It is compatible with multiple aspect ratios including 16:9 and 4:3, and supports a wide range of resolutions from VGA to 4K UHD.</p><h3>Low Noise Operation</h3><p>With noise levels as low as 26dB and a maximum of 28dB, the projector ensures a quiet and distraction-free viewing experience, ideal for home theaters, classrooms, and meeting rooms.</p><h3>Advanced Security Features</h3><p>Built-in security features include a security bar, Kensington lock, and password-protected interface, ensuring safe usage in public or shared environments.</p><h3>Powerful Lamp Performance</h3><p>The projector uses a 240W lamp system with multiple lifespan modes:</p><ul><li>Bright Mode: 4,000 hours</li><li>Eco Mode: 10,000 hours</li><li>Dynamic Mode: 15,000 hours</li></ul><p>This ensures long-term durability and reliable performance.</p><h3>Extensive Connectivity Options</h3><p>The projector offers a wide range of connectivity features:</p><ul><li>2 × HDMI 2.0 Inputs</li><li>VGA Input (YPbPr/RGB)</li><li>Audio In/Out (3.5mm)</li><li>S/PDIF Digital Audio Output</li><li>USB-A Power Output (1.5A)</li><li>RS232 Control Port</li><li>RJ45 LAN Connectivity</li><li>Wireless IEEE 802.11 a/b/g/n Support</li><li>12V Trigger Port</li></ul><p>This makes it compatible with gaming consoles, PCs, laptops, media players, and smart devices.</p><h3>Wireless Streaming Support</h3><p>Built-in wireless connectivity allows easy streaming and device pairing using secure protocols including WPA2, AES, TKIP, and WEP, providing convenient cable-free operation.</p><h3>Smart Installation &amp; Control</h3><p>The projector includes a backlit remote control, multiple OSD languages, and advanced installation flexibility for both home and professional environments. It also supports 24/7 operating conditions for continuous use.</p><h3>Ideal Applications</h3><ul><li>Home Theater Systems</li><li>4K Gaming Setup</li><li>Business Presentations</li><li>Conference Rooms</li><li>Training Centers</li><li>Multimedia Installations</li><li>Educational Institutions</li></ul><h3>Why Buy from International Office Solution (IOS)?</h3><p>International Office Solution (IOS) provides genuine Optoma projectors with official warranty, expert consultation, installation support, and competitive pricing in Bangladesh. This Optoma UHD 4K Laser Projector is a premium choice for users who demand high brightness, ultra-fast performance, and true 4K cinematic quality.</p>', '<p>Projection Features<br>Display Type<br>DLP<br>Resolution<br>UHD (3840x2160)<br>Brightness<br>3,600 lumens<br>Projection Distance<br>47.24\" - 318.9\"<br>Contrast Ratio<br>Native aspect ratio: 16:9<br>Aspect ratio - compatible: 4:3<br>Others<br>Noise level (typical): 26dB<br>Noise level (max): 28dB<br>PC compatibility: UHD, WQHD, WUXGA, FHD, UXGA, SXGA, WXGA, HD, XGA, SVGA, VGA, Mac<br>2D compatibility: 480i/p, 576i/p, 720p(50/60Hz), 1080i(50/60Hz), 1080p(50/60Hz), 2160p(50/60Hz)<br>3D compatibility: Frame-pack: 1080p24, 720p50 / 60<br>3D: Full 3D<br>Security: Security bar, Kensington Lock, Password protected interface<br>OSD / display languages: 10 languages: English, French, German, Italian, Japanese, Portuguese, Russian, Chinese (simplified), Spanish, Chinese (traditional)<br>Operating conditions: 5°C ~ 40°C, Max. Humidity 85%, Max. Altitude 3000m<br>Remote control: Backlit home remote<br>In the box: AC power cord, Remote control with CR2025 battery, Quick start user manual<br>WUSB wireless adapter<br>Input lag: 4.40ms</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Lamp Details<br>Lamp Power<br>240W<br>Lamp Life<br>4000 (Bright), 15000 (Dynamic), 10000 (Eco)<br>Connectivity<br>Interface<br>Connections: Inputs 2 x HDMI 2.0, 1 x VGA (YPbPr/RGB), 1 x Audio 3.5mm<br>Outputs 1 x Audio 3.5mm, 1 x S/PDIF, 1 x USB-A power 1.5A<br>Control 2 x USB-A reader/wireless, 1 x RS232, 1 x 12V trigger, 1 x RJ45<br>Wireless - technology: IEEE 802.11 a/b/g/n<br>Wireless - security: WEP, TKIP, AES, WPA, WPA2<br>Wireless - antenna: Omnidirectional<br>Wireless - operating frequency: 2.4GHz<br>Power<br>Power supply: 100 ~ 240V, 50 ~ 60Hz<br>Power consumption (standby): 0.5W<br>Power consumption (min): 220W<br>Power consumption (max): 320W<br>External Features<br>Weight<br>Gross weight: 11.24 lbs<br>Net weight: 8.6 lbs<br>Dimension<br>12.4\" x 10.63\" x 4.65\" (W x D x H)<br>Warranty<br>Manufacturing Warranty<br>2 Year Service (1 Year Lamp 12 Month/1000 Hours Which One Comes First)Category&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Feature&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Specification</p>', 'PROJECTOR', 158000.00, 157000.00, NULL, 6, 'products/thumbnails/SugSLFbKBcpkV3x3KwZCyQMx2gIELimnmAUBDhcz.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-10 14:57:45', '2026-06-10 14:57:45', 'Optoma UHD 4K 3600 Lumens Laser Projector Price in Bangladesh | IO', 'Buy Optoma UHD 4K DLP Laser Projector from International Office Solution (IOS). Features 4K UHD resolution, 3,600 lumens brightness, 4.40ms input lag, HDMI 2.0, Full 3D support, wireless connectivity, and advanced installation options.', 'Optoma UHD 4K Projector, Optoma 3600 Lumens Projector, 4K Laser Projector Bangladesh, Gaming Projector 4K, Home Theater Projector, Ultra HD Projector, Optoma DLP Projector, Low Input Lag Projector, 4.40ms Gaming Projector, Wireless Projector Bangladesh, HDMI 2.0 Projector, Full 3D Projector, Business Projector Bangladesh, Conference Room Projector, High Performance Projector, International Office Solution, IOS Bangladesh, Optoma Bangladesh, Professional 4K Projector, Multimedia Projector Bangladesh', NULL, 261, NULL, NULL),
(353, 'Optoma Projector X309ST 3700 Lumens Short Throw XGA DLP', 'The Optoma X309ST 3700 Lumens Short Throw XGA DLP Projector delivers bright and clear presentations with 3700 lumens brightness, XGA resolution, and a 0.62:1 short throw ratio. Featuring a 25,000:1 contrast ratio, long lamp life up to 15,000 hours, and HDMI/VGA connectivity, it is ideal for classrooms, small offices, and training rooms.', 'optoma-projector-x309st-3700-lumens-short-throw-xga-dlp-1781104052', '<p>The Optoma X309ST 3700 Lumens Short Throw XGA DLP Projector is a compact and powerful projection solution designed for classrooms, small meeting rooms, training centers, and space-constrained environments. With its short throw capability, high brightness output, and strong contrast performance, it delivers clear and vibrant visuals even in tight installation spaces.</p><h3>Bright and Clear 3700 Lumens Output</h3><p>With 3700 ANSI lumens of brightness, the Optoma X309ST ensures sharp, visible, and vibrant projections even in well-lit environments. It is ideal for educational and corporate use where consistent image clarity is essential throughout the day.</p><h3>Short Throw Projection for Small Spaces</h3><p>Featuring a 0.62:1 short throw ratio, the projector can display large images (up to 100 inches or more) from a short distance. This reduces shadows caused by presenters and makes it perfect for small classrooms and compact meeting rooms.</p><h3>XGA Resolution for Professional Use</h3><p>The native XGA (1024 × 768) resolution delivers clear text, readable charts, and detailed presentations. It is optimized for business documents, spreadsheets, and educational content.</p><h3>High Contrast for Better Image Depth</h3><p>With a 25,000:1 contrast ratio, the Optoma X309ST delivers deeper blacks, brighter whites, and improved image depth. This enhances readability and ensures visuals remain sharp and engaging for presentations and training sessions.</p><h3>Reliable Lamp Performance</h3><p>The projector features a long-lasting lamp system with up to 15,000 hours of life in Eco+ mode, reducing maintenance requirements and ensuring long-term reliability for daily use.</p><h3>Flexible Connectivity Options</h3><p>The Optoma X309ST supports a wide range of devices through multiple input options:</p><ul><li>HDMI Input for modern devices</li><li>VGA Input for legacy systems</li><li>Composite Video Input</li><li>3.5mm Audio Input/Output</li></ul><p>This ensures compatibility with laptops, desktops, media players, and older AV equipment.</p><h3>Crisp and Clear Visual Performance</h3><p>Optoma DLP technology enhances image quality by delivering brighter whites, deeper blacks, and sharper text. This makes it ideal for corporate presentations and educational environments where clarity is critical.</p><h3>Ideal Applications</h3><ul><li>Classrooms and Educational Institutions</li><li>Small Meeting Rooms</li><li>Training Centers</li><li>Corporate Presentations</li><li>Space-Constrained Installations</li><li>Interactive Learning Environments</li></ul><h3>Why Buy from International Office Solution (IOS)?</h3><p>International Office Solution (IOS) provides genuine Optoma projectors with official warranty, competitive pricing, and professional support in Bangladesh. The Optoma X309ST is a reliable short throw projector designed for everyday business and educational needs, offering excellent performance in compact spaces.</p>', '<p>Projection Features<br>Display Type<br>DLP<br>Resolution<br>XGA (1024x768)<br>Brightness<br>3,700 lumens<br>Contrast Ratio<br>25,000:1<br>Lamp Details<br>Lamp Power<br>203W<br>Lamp Life<br>6000 (Bright), 12000 (Dynamic), 10000 (Eco), 15000 (Eco+)<br>Audio<br>Built-in Speaker<br>Yes<br>Connectivity<br>Interface<br>Inputs 1 x HDMI 1.4a 3D support, 1 x VGA (YPbPr/RGB), 1 x Composite video, 1 x Audio 3.5mm<br>Outputs 1 x VGA, 1 x Audio 3.5mm, 1 x USB-A power 1A<br>Control 1 x RS232<br>Power<br>Power supply: 100 ~ 240V, 50 ~ 60Hz<br>Power consumption (standby): 0.5W<br>Power consumption (min): 187W<br>Power consumption (max): 225W<br>External Features<br>Weight<br>Gross weight: 8.53 lbs<br>Net weight: 7.25 lbs<br>Dimension<br>12.44\" x 9.61\" x 4.25\" (W x D x H)<br>Warranty<br>Manufacturing Warranty<br>2 Year Service (1 Year Lamp 12 Month/1000 Hours Which One Comes First)Category<br>Feature<br>Specification</p>', 'PROJECTOR', 55000.00, 55000.00, NULL, 6, 'products/thumbnails/70pZtZkbSCSzfYFderCXdjMvxdljdOigEyCRU69z.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-10 15:07:32', '2026-06-10 15:07:32', 'Optoma X309ST 3700 Lumens Short Throw XGA Projector Price in Bangladesh | IOS', 'Buy Optoma X309ST 3700 Lumens Short Throw XGA DLP Projector from International Office Solution (IOS). Features 0.62:1 short throw, 25,000:1 contrast ratio, HDMI/VGA connectivity, and up to 15,000-hour lamp life for classrooms and offices.', 'Optoma X309ST, Optoma X309ST Price Bangladesh, Short Throw Projector, 3700 Lumens Projector, XGA Projector Bangladesh, Classroom Projector, Office Projector, DLP Projector, Optoma Projector Bangladesh, Training Room Projector, Education Projector, Small Room Projector, HDMI Projector, VGA Projector, Business Projector Bangladesh, Optoma Short Throw Projector, International Office Solution, IOS Bangladesh, Presentation Projector, Budget Projector Bangladesh', NULL, 261, NULL, NULL),
(354, 'Optoma Projector ZX350e 3700 Lumens XGA DLP Laser', NULL, 'optoma-projector-zx350e-3700-lumens-xga-dlp-laser-1781105182', '<p>The Optoma ZX350e 3700 Lumens XGA DLP Laser Projector is a compact, energy-efficient, and maintenance-free projection solution designed for modern business environments. Built with advanced DuraCore laser technology, this projector delivers reliable performance, long lifespan, and exceptional image quality in a sleek and lightweight design.</p><h3>Compact and Space-Saving Design</h3><p>The ZX350e is up to 34% smaller than previous Optoma models, making it highly suitable for space-constrained installations. Its compact design allows easy placement in conference rooms, classrooms, and boardrooms without compromising performance.</p><h3>Bright 3700 Lumens Performance</h3><p>With 3700 lumens brightness, the projector delivers clear and vibrant visuals even in well-lit environments. It ensures consistent image quality for presentations, documents, charts, and multimedia content in professional settings.</p><h3>Advanced DuraCore Laser Technology</h3><p>Powered by DuraCore laser technology, the ZX350e offers up to 30,000 hours of maintenance-free operation. This eliminates the need for lamp replacements, reduces downtime, and ensures stable brightness and color performance throughout its lifespan.</p><h3>Eco-Friendly and Sustainable Design</h3><p>The Optoma ZX350e is engineered with sustainability in mind:</p><ul><li>Up to 45% lower power consumption compared to lamp-based projectors</li><li>Mercury-free laser light source</li><li>Up to 97% recyclable packaging materials</li><li>Compact design enabling efficient transportation and reduced carbon emissions</li></ul><p>These features make it an environmentally responsible choice for modern organizations.</p><h3>Reliable Performance for Business Use</h3><p>Designed for conference rooms, boardrooms, and corporate environments, the ZX350e delivers dependable performance for daily presentations, training sessions, and collaborative meetings.</p><h3>Strong Connectivity Options</h3><p>The projector includes essential connectivity features for professional use:</p><ul><li>HDMI input for modern devices</li><li>VGA support for legacy systems</li><li>RS232 control port for remote monitoring and management</li><li>USB-A power output</li><li>3.5mm audio output</li></ul><p>These options ensure compatibility with a wide range of business devices and AV systems.</p><h3>Built-in Audio Convenience</h3><p>A built-in speaker provides clear sound output for presentations and meetings, eliminating the need for external speakers in small to medium-sized rooms.</p><h3>External Power Supply for Efficiency</h3><p>The external power supply improves portability, reliability, and energy efficiency, making installation and maintenance easier for IT administrators.</p><h3>Ideal Applications</h3><ul><li>Corporate Meeting Rooms</li><li>Boardrooms</li><li>Training Centers</li><li>Educational Institutions</li><li>Business Presentations</li><li>Conference Environments</li></ul><h3>Why Buy from International Office Solution (IOS)?</h3><p>International Office Solution (IOS) provides genuine Optoma projectors with official warranty, expert installation support, and competitive pricing in Bangladesh. The Optoma ZX350e is a cost-effective, eco-friendly, and maintenance-free laser projector designed for long-term business use.</p>', '<p>Projection Features<br>Display Type<br>DLP<br>Resolution<br>XGA (1024x768)<br>Brightness<br>3,700 lumens<br>Contrast Ratio<br>Contrast ratio: 300,000:1<br>Contrast ratio - dynamic: 2,000,000:1<br>Lamp Details<br>Type<br>Light source type: Laser<br>Lamp Life<br>30,000 hours<br>Audio<br>Built-in Speaker<br>Yes<br>Connectivity<br>Interface<br>Inputs 2 x HDMI 1.4a 3D support<br>Outputs 1 x Audio 3.5mm, 1 x USB-A power 1.5A<br>Control 1 x RS232<br>Power<br>Power supply: External power supply, 100V ~ 240V, 50-60Hz<br>Power consumption (standby): &lt;0.5W<br>Power consumption (min): 88W<br>Power consumption (max): 139W<br>External Features<br>Color<br>White<br>Weight<br>4.2 Kg<br>Dimension<br>10.79\" x 8.5\" x 4.49\"<br>Warranty<br>Manufacturing Warranty<br>3 years Warranty</p>', 'PROJECTOR', 71000.00, 71000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/S3ihvCtdtQyDfwfgn6kuc7QjDuR6KmFajuLnfzRJ.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-10 15:26:22', '2026-06-10 15:26:22', 'Optoma ZX350e 3700 Lumens XGA Laser Projector Price in Bangladesh | IOS', 'Buy Optoma ZX350e 3700 Lumens XGA DLP Laser Projector from International Office Solution (IOS). Features DuraCore laser technology, 30,000-hour lifespan, eco-friendly design, HDMI connectivity, RS232 control, and compact business-ready performance.', 'Optoma ZX350e, Optoma ZX350e Price Bangladesh, XGA Laser Projector, 3700 Lumens Projector, Business Projector Bangladesh, Conference Room Projector, DLP Laser Projector, Optoma Projector Bangladesh, Eco Friendly Projector, DuraCore Laser Projector, Office Projector, Boardroom Projector, Maintenance Free Projector, HDMI Projector Bangladesh, RS232 Projector, Compact Laser Projector, International Office Solution, IOS Bangladesh, Professional Business Projector, Energy Efficient Projector', NULL, 261, NULL, NULL);
