(355, 'Optoma Projector X400LVe XGA 4000 Lumens Professional', 'The Optoma X400LVe XGA 4000 Lumens Professional Projector delivers bright, vibrant visuals with XGA resolution, Eco+ energy-saving technology, Full 3D support, and a built-in 10W speaker. Designed for classrooms and meeting rooms, it offers HDMI/VGA connectivity, high contrast performance, and low total cost of ownership.', 'optoma-projector-x400lve-xga-4000-lumens-professional-1781106051', '<p>The Optoma X400LVe XGA 4000 Lumens Professional Projector is a high-performance display solution designed for classrooms, meeting rooms, and corporate environments. With powerful brightness, advanced color technology, and energy-efficient features, it delivers clear, vibrant, and reliable projection for everyday professional use.</p><h3>Bright and Clear 4000 Lumens Performance</h3><p>With 4000 lumens brightness, the Optoma X400LVe produces sharp and vivid images even in well-lit environments. It ensures excellent visibility for presentations, training sessions, and educational content without requiring a dark room.</p><h3>XGA Resolution for Business and Education</h3><p>The native XGA (1024 × 768) resolution is optimized for documents, spreadsheets, charts, and presentation slides. It provides clear text readability and balanced image quality for professional communication.</p><h3>Amazing Color Performance</h3><p>Optoma’s advanced color technology delivers accurate sRGB tones and vibrant color reproduction. Whether used for educational lessons or business presentations, the projector ensures lifelike visuals with consistent color accuracy across different content types.</p><h3>High Contrast for Better Clarity</h3><p>With enhanced contrast performance, the X400LVe delivers brighter whites and deeper blacks. This improves image depth, making text sharper and visuals more engaging for audiences.</p><h3>Full 3D Support</h3><p>The projector supports Full 3D content from various sources including Blu-ray players and gaming consoles, offering an immersive viewing experience for entertainment and educational use.</p><h3>Integrated 10W Speaker</h3><p>A built-in 10W speaker provides clear and powerful audio output, eliminating the need for external speakers in small to medium-sized rooms.</p><h3>Energy Efficient Eco+ Technology</h3><p>The Optoma X400LVe is designed with Eco+ technology to reduce power consumption and extend lamp life. Key benefits include:</p><ul><li>Up to 70% energy savings in Eco mode</li><li>Longer lamp lifespan through optimized usage</li><li>Reduced maintenance costs</li><li>Lower total cost of ownership</li></ul><h3>Smart Power Management Features</h3><p>The projector includes several intelligent features for convenience and efficiency:</p><ul><li>Quick Resume for instant restart</li><li>Eco AV Mute to reduce power usage and extend lamp life</li><li>Direct Power On for automatic startup</li><li>Direct Power Off for immediate shutdown</li><li>Auto Power Off to save energy when not in use</li></ul><h3>Flexible Connectivity Options</h3><p>The projector supports a wide range of devices with multiple connectivity options:</p><ul><li>HDMI input for modern devices</li><li>VGA input for legacy systems</li><li>Composite video input</li><li>3.5mm audio input/output</li></ul><p>This ensures compatibility with laptops, PCs, media players, and other AV equipment.</p><h3>Ideal Applications</h3><ul><li>Classrooms and Educational Institutions</li><li>Corporate Meeting Rooms</li><li>Training Centers</li><li>Business Presentations</li><li>Small to Medium Conference Rooms</li><li>Multimedia Presentations</li></ul><h3>Why Buy from International Office Solution (IOS)?</h3><p>International Office Solution (IOS) offers genuine Optoma projectors with official warranty, competitive pricing, and professional support in Bangladesh. The Optoma X400LVe is a reliable and cost-effective solution for daily business and educational projection needs.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>DLP</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>XGA (1024 × 768)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>4,000 Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>39.37\" – 472.44\"</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>27.78\" – 304.4\" (diagonal)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Native Contrast Ratio</td><td>25,000:1</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Type</td><td>Lamp</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Power</td><td>203W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>6,000 hrs (Bright), 10,000 hrs (Eco), 12,000 hrs (Dynamic), 15,000 hrs (Eco+)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Input</td><td>1 × HDMI 1.4a (3D Support)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>VGA Input</td><td>1 × VGA (YPbPr/RGB)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Composite Video</td><td>1 × Composite Video</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Input</td><td>1 × 3.5mm Audio In</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>VGA Output</td><td>1 × VGA</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>1 × 3.5mm Audio Out</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB Port</td><td>1 × USB-A Power (1A)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Control Port</td><td>1 × RS232</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Supply</td><td>100–240V, 50–60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Standby Power Consumption</td><td>0.5W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Minimum Power Consumption</td><td>187W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Maximum Power Consumption</td><td>225W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Information</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>6.72 lbs</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions (W × D × H)</td><td>12.44\" × 9.61\" × 4.25\"</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Service Warranty</td><td>2 Years Service Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Warranty</td><td>1 Year or 1000 Hours (Whichever Comes First)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 37800.00, 37900.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/hyROJJ9laMJGtfSg9voskgiqusrMzaCqAERNp4g2.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-10 15:40:51', '2026-06-10 15:40:51', 'Optoma X400LVe 4000 Lumens XGA Professional Projector Price in Bangladesh | IOS', 'Buy Optoma X400LVe XGA 4000 Lumens Professional Projector from International Office Solution (IOS). Features Eco+ technology, Full 3D support, HDMI/VGA connectivity, built-in 10W speaker, and energy-saving smart functions for classrooms and offices.', 'Here is the **structured SEO-optimized content package** for the:\r\n\r\n## Optoma X400LVe XGA 4000 Lumens Professional Projector (International Office Solution – IOS)\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Long Description\r\n\r\n# Optoma X400LVe XGA 4000 Lumens Professional Projector\r\n\r\nThe Optoma X400LVe XGA 4000 Lumens Professional Projector is a high-performance display solution designed for classrooms, meeting rooms, and corporate environments. With powerful brightness, advanced color technology, and energy-efficient features, it delivers clear, vibrant, and reliable projection for everyday professional use.\r\n\r\n### Bright and Clear 4000 Lumens Performance\r\n\r\nWith 4000 lumens brightness, the Optoma X400LVe produces sharp and vivid images even in well-lit environments. It ensures excellent visibility for presentations, training sessions, and educational content without requiring a dark room.\r\n\r\n### XGA Resolution for Business and Education\r\n\r\nThe native XGA (1024 × 768) resolution is optimized for documents, spreadsheets, charts, and presentation slides. It provides clear text readability and balanced image quality for professional communication.\r\n\r\n### Amazing Color Performance\r\n\r\nOptoma’s advanced color technology delivers accurate sRGB tones and vibrant color reproduction. Whether used for educational lessons or business presentations, the projector ensures lifelike visuals with consistent color accuracy across different content types.\r\n\r\n### High Contrast for Better Clarity\r\n\r\nWith enhanced contrast performance, the X400LVe delivers brighter whites and deeper blacks. This improves image depth, making text sharper and visuals more engaging for audiences.\r\n\r\n### Full 3D Support\r\n\r\nThe projector supports Full 3D content from various sources including Blu-ray players and gaming consoles, offering an immersive viewing experience for entertainment and educational use.\r\n\r\n### Integrated 10W Speaker\r\n\r\nA built-in 10W speaker provides clear and powerful audio output, eliminating the need for external speakers in small to medium-sized rooms.\r\n\r\n### Energy Efficient Eco+ Technology\r\n\r\nThe Optoma X400LVe is designed with Eco+ technology to reduce power consumption and extend lamp life. Key benefits include:\r\n\r\n* Up to 70% energy savings in Eco mode\r\n* Longer lamp lifespan through optimized usage\r\n* Reduced maintenance costs\r\n* Lower total cost of ownership\r\n\r\n### Smart Power Management Features\r\n\r\nThe projector includes several intelligent features for convenience and efficiency:\r\n\r\n* Quick Resume for instant restart\r\n* Eco AV Mute to reduce power usage and extend lamp life\r\n* Direct Power On for automatic startup\r\n* Direct Power Off for immediate shutdown\r\n* Auto Power Off to save energy when not in use\r\n\r\n### Flexible Connectivity Options\r\n\r\nThe projector supports a wide range of devices with multiple connectivity options:\r\n\r\n* HDMI input for modern devices\r\n* VGA input for legacy systems\r\n* Composite video input\r\n* 3.5mm audio input/output\r\n\r\nThis ensures compatibility with laptops, PCs, media players, and other AV equipment.\r\n\r\n### Ideal Applications\r\n\r\n* Classrooms and Educational Institutions\r\n* Corporate Meeting Rooms\r\n* Training Centers\r\n* Business Presentations\r\n* Small to Medium Conference Rooms\r\n* Multimedia Presentations\r\n\r\n### Why Buy from International Office Solution (IOS)?\r\n\r\nInternational Office Solution (IOS) offers genuine Optoma projectors with official warranty, competitive pricing, and professional support in Bangladesh. The Optoma X400LVe is a reliable and cost-effective solution for daily business and educational projection needs.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Short Description\r\n\r\nThe Optoma X400LVe XGA 4000 Lumens Professional Projector delivers bright, vibrant visuals with XGA resolution, Eco+ energy-saving technology, Full 3D support, and a built-in 10W speaker. Designed for classrooms and meeting rooms, it offers HDMI/VGA connectivity, high contrast performance, and low total cost of ownership.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## SEO Meta Title\r\n\r\n**Optoma X400LVe 4000 Lumens XGA Professional Projector Price in Bangladesh | IOS**\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## SEO Meta Description\r\n\r\n**Buy Optoma X400LVe XGA 4000 Lumens Professional Projector from International Office Solution (IOS). Features Eco+ technology, Full 3D support, HDMI/VGA connectivity, built-in 10W speaker, and energy-saving smart functions for classrooms and offices.**\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## SEO Meta Keywords\r\n\r\nOptoma X400LVe, Optoma X400LVe Price Bangladesh, XGA Projector 4000 Lumens, Business Projector Bangladesh, Classroom Projector, Professional Projector, Optoma Projector Bangladesh, Eco+ Projector, Energy Saving Projector, HDMI Projector, VGA Projector, Full 3D Projector, Office Projector Bangladesh, Training Room Projector, Conference Room Projector, DLP Projector, International Office Solution, IOS Bangladesh, Educational Projector, High Brightness Projector', NULL, 261, NULL, NULL),
(356, 'Optoma W400LVe 4000 Lumens WXGA DLP', 'The Optoma W400LVe 4000 Lumens WXGA DLP Projector delivers bright and clear visuals with WXGA resolution, 25,000:1 contrast ratio, and flexible installation features. With HDMI/VGA connectivity, built-in speaker, USB power support, and long lamp life, it is ideal for classrooms and business presentations.', 'optoma-w400lve-4000-lumens-wxga-dlp-1781106364', '<p>The Optoma W400LVe 4000 Lumens WXGA DLP Projector is a powerful and cost-effective display solution designed for business presentations, classrooms, and professional training environments. It combines high brightness, reliable WXGA resolution, and flexible connectivity options to deliver clear, vibrant visuals at any time of the day.</p><h3>Bright 4000 Lumens Performance</h3><p>With 4000 lumens of brightness, the Optoma W400LVe ensures sharp and vivid images even in well-lit rooms. This makes it ideal for meeting rooms, classrooms, and office environments where ambient lighting cannot always be controlled.</p><h3>WXGA Resolution for Clear Visuals</h3><p>The native WXGA (1280 × 800) resolution provides crisp text clarity and detailed image reproduction. It is perfect for displaying spreadsheets, presentations, documents, and multimedia content with excellent readability.</p><h3>High Contrast for Better Detail</h3><p>Featuring a 25,000:1 contrast ratio, the projector delivers deeper blacks and brighter whites, enhancing image depth and making visuals more engaging and professional.</p><h3>Flexible Installation with Adjustable Throw Ratio</h3><p>The W400LVe offers a 1.55–1.73:1 throw ratio, allowing flexible installation distances. This makes it easy to position the projector in different room sizes while maintaining optimal image scaling.</p><h3>Long Lamp Life and Low Maintenance</h3><p>Designed for long-term use, the projector offers extended lamp life with energy-saving modes. This reduces maintenance costs and ensures reliable performance for everyday business and educational use.</p><h3>Easy Connectivity Options</h3><p>The Optoma W400LVe supports a wide range of devices through multiple inputs:</p><ul><li>HDMI input for laptops, media players, and streaming devices</li><li>VGA input for legacy systems</li><li>Composite video input for older AV equipment</li><li>USB power output for streaming devices</li></ul><p>It is fully compatible with devices like laptops, PCs, Blu-ray players, gaming consoles, Chromecast, and Optoma HDCast Pro.</p><h3>Built-in Audio Convenience</h3><p>A built-in speaker eliminates the need for external audio equipment in small to medium-sized rooms, making setup quick and simple.</p><h3>Simple Installation &amp; Control</h3><p>The projector includes vertical keystone correction for easy image alignment and comes with an infrared remote control for convenient operation.</p><h3>Ideal Applications</h3><ul><li>Corporate Meeting Rooms</li><li>Educational Classrooms</li><li>Training Centers</li><li>Business Presentations</li><li>Conference Rooms</li><li>Multimedia Display Environments</li></ul><h3>Why Buy from International Office Solution (IOS)?</h3><p>International Office Solution (IOS) provides genuine Optoma projectors with official warranty, competitive pricing, and professional installation support in Bangladesh. The Optoma W400LVe is a reliable, bright, and energy-efficient projector designed for everyday professional use.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>DLP (1-chip)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>WXGA (1280 × 800)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>4000 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>1.2 – 10 m</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Native Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:10 (WXGA)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>25,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>75 cm – 764 cm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Type</td><td>203W Metal Halide Bulb</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>6000 / 10000 / 12000 / 15000 hours (Bright / Eco / Dynamic / ECO+)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>10W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Input</td><td>1 × HDMI 1.4a (Audio/Video)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>VGA Input</td><td>1 × VGA (DE-15 / DB-15)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>VGA Output</td><td>1 × VGA (DE-15 / DB-15)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Composite Video Input</td><td>1 × RCA</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Input</td><td>1 × 3.5mm Mini Jack</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>1 × 3.5mm Mini Jack</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB Port</td><td>1 × USB 2.0 Type-A (Power Output)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Control Port</td><td>1 × RS-232 (DE-9 / DB-9)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Supply</td><td>100–240V, 50–60Hz (Auto-switching)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Information</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>3.0 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions (W × D × H)</td><td>316 × 243.5 × 98 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Service Warranty</td><td>2 Years Service Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Warranty</td><td>1 Year or 1000 Hours (Whichever Comes First)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 48000.00, 48000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/3twLiiJz8z9Pg3iN3ImH59p3meJLqbS0ozwplh7C.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-10 15:46:04', '2026-06-10 15:51:25', 'Optoma W400LVe 4000 Lumens WXGA DLP Projector Price in Bangladesh | IOS', 'Buy Optoma W400LVe 4000 Lumens WXGA DLP Projector from International Office Solution (IOS). Features WXGA resolution, 25,000:1 contrast, HDMI/VGA connectivity, USB power, built-in speaker, and long lamp life for office and education use.', 'Optoma W400LVe, Optoma W400LVe Price Bangladesh, WXGA Projector 4000 Lumens, Business Projector Bangladesh, Classroom Projector, DLP Projector, Optoma Projector Bangladesh, Office Projector, Training Projector, Education Projector, HDMI Projector Bangladesh, VGA Projector, Multimedia Projector, Conference Room Projector, High Brightness Projector, Optoma WXGA Projector, International Office Solution, IOS Bangladesh, Presentation Projector, Budget Office Projector', NULL, 261, NULL, NULL),
(357, 'Acer Projector V60S 4000 lumens', 'The Optoma SVGA 4000 Lumens Projector delivers bright and reliable performance with 4000 lumens brightness, SVGA resolution, 20,000:1 contrast ratio, HDMI/VGA connectivity, and up to 7000-hour lamp life. It is ideal for classrooms, small offices, and basic presentation needs.', 'acer-projector-v60s-4000-lumens-1781107336', '<p>The Optoma SVGA 4000 Lumens Projector is a budget-friendly and reliable projection solution designed for classrooms, small offices, training rooms, and basic presentation environments. With high brightness output and simple installation features, it delivers clear and visible projections even in well-lit spaces.</p><h3>Bright 4000 Lumens Performance</h3><p>With 4000 lumens brightness, the projector ensures clear visibility of presentations, documents, and images in both dark and moderately lit environments. This makes it suitable for everyday educational and business use.</p><h3>SVGA Resolution for Basic Applications</h3><p>The native SVGA (800 × 600) resolution is ideal for simple presentations, text-based content, and basic visual displays. It is a cost-effective solution for users who need reliable performance without requiring high-definition resolution.</p><h3>High Contrast for Better Clarity</h3><p>With a 20,000:1 contrast ratio, the projector delivers improved depth between light and dark areas, ensuring readable text and clearer visuals during presentations.</p><h3>Flexible Aspect Ratio Support</h3><p>The projector supports both 16:9 and 4:3 aspect ratios, making it compatible with a wide range of content formats including older presentation materials and modern widescreen content.</p><h3>Easy Installation with Keystone Correction</h3><p>Manual and automatic vertical keystone correction (±40°) ensures easy image alignment, allowing users to quickly adjust the projection for a properly shaped display.</p><h3>Quiet and Efficient Operation</h3><p>With a noise level as low as 24dB in economic mode, the projector operates quietly, making it suitable for classrooms and meeting rooms where minimal distraction is important.</p><h3>Long Lamp Life</h3><p>The lamp offers up to 6000 hours in normal mode and up to 7000 hours in eco mode, reducing maintenance costs and ensuring long-term usability.</p><h3>Simple Connectivity Options</h3><p>The projector supports essential connectivity for various devices:</p><ul><li>HDMI input (video + audio, HDCP support)</li><li>VGA (Analog RGB/Component Video)</li><li>Composite Video (RCA)</li><li>3.5mm Audio Input</li></ul><p>This ensures compatibility with laptops, PCs, DVD players, and older multimedia devices.</p><h3>Lightweight and Compact Design</h3><p>Weighing only 2.8 kg, the projector is lightweight and easy to install or move between rooms. Its compact design makes it suitable for portable and fixed installations.</p><h3>Ideal Applications</h3><ul><li>Classroom Teaching</li><li>Small Office Presentations</li><li>Training Sessions</li><li>Basic Business Use</li><li>Budget Home Use</li><li>Conference Rooms</li></ul><h3>Why Buy from International Office Solution (IOS)?</h3><p>International Office Solution (IOS) offers genuine Optoma projectors with official warranty, competitive pricing, and reliable support in Bangladesh. The Optoma SVGA projector is a cost-effective solution for users who need simple, bright, and dependable projection performance.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Resolution</td><td>SVGA (800 × 600)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>4000 Lumens (550 ANSI Lumens)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9 / 4:3</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>20,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Focus Technology</td><td>Manual Focus</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Keystone Correction</td><td>Manual &amp; Auto (Vertical ±40°)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Noise Level</td><td>32 dB (Normal Mode), 24 dB (Eco Mode)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>6000 hours (Normal), 7000 hours (Eco Mode)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI</td><td>1 × HDMI (Video, Audio, HDCP)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>VGA</td><td>1 × Analog RGB / Component Video (D-Sub)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Input</td><td>1 × 3.5mm PC Audio (Stereo Mini Jack)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Composite Video</td><td>1 × RCA</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Information</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>2.8 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions (W × D × H)</td><td>313 × 240 × 113.7 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Warranty</td><td>1 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 44800.00, 44900.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/pkvQ3hJ9AQsVmg5UQoUOXONWBVMImShJV7OvozAs.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-10 16:02:16', '2026-06-10 16:02:16', 'Optoma SVGA 4000 Lumens Projector Price in Bangladesh | IOS', 'Buy Optoma SVGA 4000 Lumens Projector from International Office Solution (IOS). Features SVGA resolution, 20,000:1 contrast ratio, HDMI/VGA connectivity, keystone correction, and long lamp life for classrooms and offices.', 'Optoma SVGA Projector, 4000 Lumens Projector Bangladesh, Budget Projector Bangladesh, Classroom Projector, Office Projector, Optoma Projector Bangladesh, SVGA Projector Price, HDMI Projector, VGA Projector, Basic Projector Bangladesh, Training Projector, Small Office Projector, Conference Room Projector, Low Cost Projector, Education Projector, International Office Solution, IOS Bangladesh, Presentation Projector, Entry Level Projector', NULL, 8, NULL, NULL),
(358, 'BenQ Projector  MW560 4000 ANSI Lumens WXGA Business', 'The BenQ MW560 4000 ANSI Lumens WXGA Business Projector delivers bright and sharp visuals with WXGA resolution, 20,000:1 contrast ratio, SmartEco energy-saving mode, dual HDMI ports, auto keystone correction, and up to 15,000-hour lamp life, making it ideal for offices and classrooms.', 'benq-projector-mw560-4000-ansi-lumens-wxga-business-1781108045', '<p>The BenQ MW560 WXGA Business Projector is a powerful and energy-efficient projection solution designed for corporate meetings, classrooms, and professional presentations. With 4000 ANSI lumens brightness, WXGA resolution, and advanced smart features, it delivers sharp visuals, reliable performance, and low maintenance operation for everyday business use.</p><h3>Bright 4000 ANSI Lumens Performance</h3><p>With 4000 ANSI lumens brightness, the BenQ MW560 ensures clear and vibrant projections even in well-lit environments. It is ideal for meeting rooms, training sessions, and classrooms where ambient lighting cannot always be controlled.</p><h3>WXGA Resolution for Clear Business Content</h3><p>The native WXGA (1280 × 800) resolution provides crisp text clarity and detailed visuals for spreadsheets, presentations, charts, and documents. It ensures professional-quality image reproduction for business communication.</p><h3>High Contrast for Better Detail</h3><p>With a 20,000:1 contrast ratio, the projector delivers deep blacks and bright whites, improving readability and enhancing image depth for both text and multimedia content.</p><h3>SmartEco Technology for Energy Efficiency</h3><p>BenQ’s SmartEco Mode reduces lamp power consumption by up to 70%, extending lamp life up to 15,000 hours. This significantly reduces operating costs while maintaining optimal brightness performance.</p><h3>Exclusive Viewing Modes</h3><p>The projector includes specialized display modes for different business needs:</p><ul><li><strong>Presentation Mode</strong> – Enhanced brightness for vivid slides</li><li><strong>Infographic Mode</strong> – Optimized for charts, graphics, and detailed visuals</li><li><strong>Data Review Mode</strong> – Improves contrast and clarity for reports and documents</li></ul><p>These modes ensure optimized viewing for different types of content.</p><h3>Advanced Connectivity Options</h3><p>The BenQ MW560 offers flexible connectivity for modern office environments:</p><ul><li>2 × HDMI ports for multiple digital devices</li><li>USB Type-A for power and accessories</li><li>USB Mini-B for service use</li><li>RS-232 control port for system integration</li></ul><p>It also supports automatic signal detection for instant startup when HDMI input is connected.</p><h3>Easy Installation &amp; Auto Alignment</h3><p>Designed for convenience, the projector includes:</p><ul><li>Auto Vertical Keystone Correction</li><li>Triple adjustable feet for flexible positioning</li><li>Fast startup with quick resume functionality</li></ul><p>These features ensure easy setup and perfectly aligned projection from different angles.</p><h3>Enhanced Security &amp; Durability</h3><p>For secure installation in public or shared spaces, the MW560 includes a Kensington Lock slot for physical security. It also features dust-resistant design improvements to enhance durability and reduce maintenance needs.</p><h3>Crystal-Clear Optical Performance</h3><p>BenQ uses high-quality all-glass lens systems to reduce chromatic aberration and ensure sharp, distortion-free image quality over long-term use.</p><h3>Smart Power Management</h3><p>The projector includes intelligent power-saving features:</p><ul><li>Auto Power Off after 20 minutes of inactivity</li><li>SmartEco Mode for energy reduction</li><li>Instant power-on via HDMI signal detection</li></ul><p>These features improve efficiency and reduce operational costs.</p><h3>Ideal Applications</h3><ul><li>Corporate Meeting Rooms</li><li>Business Presentations</li><li>Educational Classrooms</li><li>Training Centers</li><li>Conference Rooms</li><li>Data and Report Presentations</li></ul><h3>Why Buy from International Office Solution (IOS)?</h3><p>International Office Solution (IOS) provides genuine BenQ projectors with official warranty, expert consultation, and competitive pricing in Bangladesh. The BenQ MW560 is a reliable, high-brightness business projector designed for professional productivity and long-term performance.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>DLP Single 0.65\" WXGA</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>1280 × 800 (WXGA)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution Support</td><td>VGA (640 × 480) to WUXGA-RB (1920 × 1200)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>4000 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Size</td><td>60\" – 150\"</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>20,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Video Formats</td><td>NTSC, PAL, SECAM, SDTV (480i/576i), EDTV (480p/576p), HDTV (720p, 1080i/p 60Hz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Power</td><td>Up to 70% efficiency</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>6000 hrs (Normal), 10000 hrs (Eco / SmartEco), 15000 hrs (LampSave)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>10W × 1</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI</td><td>2 × HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>PC Input</td><td>1 × D-Sub 15-pin</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Monitor Output</td><td>1 × D-Sub 15-pin (Female)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Input</td><td>1 × 3.5mm Mini Jack</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>1 × 3.5mm Mini Jack</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>RS232</td><td>1 × D-Sub 9-pin (Male)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB Type-A</td><td>1 × (1.5A Power)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB Type Mini-B</td><td>1 ×</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>S-Video</td><td>1 ×</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Composite Video</td><td>1 × RCA</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>IR Receiver</td><td>Front + Top (2 units)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>280W (Max), 260W (Normal), 215W (Eco)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Standby Power</td><td>&lt; 0.5W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Supply</td><td>100–240V AC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Information</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>2.3 kg ± 200g</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions (W × D × H)</td><td>296 × 120 × 221 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Service Warranty</td><td>2 Years Parts &amp; Service</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Warranty</td><td>1000 Hours</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 54000.00, 54000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/InEpSF2jjpYi2ct44WxkKjXW71LQuCtQ1WRG8wot.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-10 16:14:05', '2026-06-10 16:14:05', 'BenQ MW560 4000 ANSI Lumens WXGA Business Projector Price in Bangladesh | IOS', 'Buy BenQ MW560 4000 ANSI Lumens WXGA Business Projector from International Office Solution (IOS). Features SmartEco mode, dual HDMI, auto keystone correction, 20,000:1 contrast, and long lamp life for office and education use.', 'BenQ MW560, BenQ MW560 Price Bangladesh, WXGA Business Projector, 4000 ANSI Lumens Projector, Office Projector Bangladesh, Classroom Projector, BenQ Projector Bangladesh, SmartEco Projector, Energy Saving Projector, HDMI Projector Bangladesh, Dual HDMI Projector, Business Presentation Projector, Data Review Projector, Infographic Projector, Conference Room Projector, High Brightness Projector, BenQ WXGA Projector, International Office Solution, IOS Bangladesh, Professional Projector Bangladesh', NULL, 41, NULL, NULL),
(359, 'BenQ Projector   MS560 4000 ANSI Lumens SVGA Business', 'The BenQ MS560 SVGA 4000 ANSI Lumens Business Projector delivers bright visuals, 20,000:1 contrast, SmartEco energy saving, dual HDMI connectivity, auto keystone correction, and up to 15,000-hour lamp life—ideal for offices and classrooms.', 'benq-projector-ms560-4000-ansi-lumens-svga-business-1781109523', '<h2>BenQ MS560 SVGA Business Projector</h2><p>The BenQ MS560 SVGA Business Projector is a powerful and cost-efficient projection solution designed for business meetings, classrooms, and everyday presentations. With 4000 ANSI lumens brightness and a 20,000:1 high contrast ratio, it delivers clear, sharp visuals even in brightly lit environments.</p><h3>Bright 4000 ANSI Lumens Performance</h3><p>With 4000 ANSI lumens, the MS560 ensures bright and visible projection in meeting rooms and classrooms without requiring a dark environment. It is ideal for professional presentations, training sessions, and educational content delivery.</p><h3>SVGA Resolution for Essential Business Use</h3><p>The native SVGA (800 × 600) resolution is optimized for basic presentations, text documents, and charts. It ensures clear readability for business reports and classroom materials.</p><h3>High Contrast for Clear Visuals</h3><p>A 20,000:1 contrast ratio enhances image depth, producing sharper text and more defined graphics for improved communication and presentation clarity.</p><h3>SmartEco Energy Saving Technology</h3><p>BenQ SmartEco Mode reduces lamp power consumption by up to 70%, extending lamp life up to 15,000 hours. This significantly lowers maintenance costs and improves long-term efficiency.</p><h3>Exclusive Viewing Modes</h3><p>The projector includes specialized modes for different presentation needs:</p><ul><li><strong>Presentation Mode</strong> – Optimized brightness for slides and meetings</li><li><strong>Infographic Mode</strong> – Enhanced clarity for charts and visual data</li><li><strong>Data Review Mode</strong> – Improved contrast for reports and spreadsheets</li></ul><p>These modes ensure optimized viewing for all types of business content.</p><h3>Advanced Connectivity Options</h3><p>The BenQ MS560 supports flexible connectivity for modern offices:</p><ul><li>2 × HDMI ports for multiple devices</li><li>USB Type-A port for power output</li><li>USB Mini-B for service use</li><li>RS-232 control port for system integration</li></ul><p>Dual HDMI enables easy switching between devices and instant connectivity.</p><h3>Smart Startup &amp; Auto Features</h3><p>Designed for convenience, the projector includes:</p><ul><li>Auto Power On via HDMI signal detection</li><li>Auto Power Off after 20 minutes of inactivity</li><li>Fast restart within 90 seconds after shutdown</li><li>Auto Vertical Keystone correction for perfect alignment</li></ul><p>These features ensure smooth operation and quick setup.</p><h3>Durable Optical Performance</h3><p>High-quality glass lenses reduce chromatic aberration, ensuring long-lasting sharp image quality and consistent projection performance.</p><h3>Enhanced Security &amp; Dust Protection</h3><p>For safe and durable usage, the MS560 includes:</p><ul><li>Kensington Lock for physical security</li><li>Anti-dust accumulation protection to improve lifespan and reduce maintenance</li></ul><h3>Easy Installation Design</h3><p>Triple adjustable feet and retractable support allow flexible positioning in different room setups, making installation simple and efficient.</p><h3>Ideal Applications</h3><ul><li>Corporate Meetings</li><li>Office Presentations</li><li>Educational Classrooms</li><li>Training Centers</li><li>Business Reports &amp; Data Reviews</li><li>Conference Rooms</li></ul><h3>Why Buy from International Office Solution (IOS)?</h3><p>International Office Solution (IOS) provides genuine BenQ projectors with official warranty, competitive pricing, and reliable after-sales support in Bangladesh. The BenQ MS560 is a reliable choice for daily business and educational projection needs.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>DLP Single 0.55\" SVGA</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>800 × 600 (SVGA)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution Support</td><td>VGA (640 × 480) to WUXGA-RB (1920 × 1200)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>4000 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Size</td><td>60\" – 150\"</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>20,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Video Formats</td><td>NTSC, PAL, SECAM, SDTV (480i/576i), EDTV (480p/576p), HDTV (720p, 1080i/p 60Hz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Power</td><td>Up to 70% efficiency</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Normal: 6000 hrs / Eco &amp; SmartEco: 10000 hrs / LampSave: 15000 hrs</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>10W × 1</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI</td><td>2 × HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>PC Input</td><td>1 × D-Sub 15-pin</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Monitor Output</td><td>1 × D-Sub 15-pin (Female)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Input</td><td>1 × 3.5mm Mini Jack</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>1 × 3.5mm Mini Jack</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>RS232</td><td>1 × D-Sub 9-pin</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB Type-A</td><td>1 × (1.5A Power)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB Mini-B</td><td>1 ×</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>S-Video</td><td>1 ×</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Composite Video</td><td>1 × RCA</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>IR Receiver</td><td>Front + Top (2 units)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>280W (Max), 260W (Normal), 215W (Eco)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Standby Power</td><td>&lt; 0.5W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Supply</td><td>100–240V AC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Information</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>2.3 kg ± 200g</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions (W × D × H)</td><td>296 × 120 × 221 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Warranty</td><td>1 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 44500.00, 44000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/egWkMvpJC9o0qIwQN42Zr3x6DFFWJcqH582JEm8v.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-10 16:38:43', '2026-06-10 16:38:43', 'BenQ MS560 4000 ANSI Lumens SVGA Business Projector Price in Bangladesh | IOS', 'Buy BenQ MS560 SVGA 4000 ANSI Lumens Business Projector from International Office Solution (IOS). Features SmartEco mode, dual HDMI, auto keystone correction, 20,000:1 contrast, and long lamp life for office and classroom use.', 'BenQ MS560, BenQ MS560 Price Bangladesh, SVGA Business Projector, 4000 ANSI Lumens Projector, Office Projector Bangladesh, Classroom Projector, BenQ Projector Bangladesh, SmartEco Projector, Energy Saving Projector, Dual HDMI Projector, Business Presentation Projector, Data Review Projector, Infographic Projector, Conference Room Projector, Budget Projector Bangladesh, High Brightness Projector, BenQ SVGA Projector, International Office Solution, IOS Bangladesh, Entry Level Business Projector', NULL, 41, NULL, NULL),
(360, 'Netgear GS324 24-Port Gigabit Rackmount Switch', 'The Netgear GS324 24-Port Gigabit Rackmount Switch is a reliable unmanaged network switch featuring 24 Gigabit Ethernet ports, plug-and-play installation, fanless silent operation, and energy-efficient technology. Ideal for offices, businesses, and enterprise network expansion, it provides high-speed connectivity with dependable performance and a durable metal design.', 'netgear-gs324-24-port-gigabit-rackmount-switch-1781149993', '<p>The Netgear GS324 24-Port Gigabit Rackmount Switch is designed to deliver fast, dependable, and hassle-free network connectivity for businesses of all sizes. Equipped with 24 Gigabit Ethernet ports, this unmanaged switch enables organizations to connect multiple devices such as desktop computers, printers, IP cameras, wireless access points, servers, and storage systems while maintaining excellent network performance.</p><p>Available through International Office Solution, the GS324 offers true plug-and-play functionality, allowing users to deploy the switch without any technical configuration. Its non-blocking switching architecture ensures that all connected devices receive maximum bandwidth and smooth data transfer, even during peak network activity.</p><p>The switch features a robust metal housing that provides durability for continuous operation in demanding environments. Its fanless design guarantees quiet performance, making it suitable for offices, conference rooms, schools, healthcare facilities, and other professional settings where noise reduction is important.</p><p>Additionally, the GS324 incorporates advanced energy-saving technologies that automatically adjust power consumption based on network activity and cable length. This not only reduces energy costs but also supports environmentally friendly operations.</p><p>Whether you are upgrading an existing network or building a new infrastructure, the Netgear GS324 offers the performance, reliability, and scalability needed to support modern networking requirements. Backed by a 3-year warranty and supported by International Office Solution, it is an excellent choice for organizations seeking cost-effective Gigabit networking solutions.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Main Feature</strong></td><td>Number of Ports</td><td>24 x Gigabit Ethernet Ports</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Main Feature</strong></td><td>Data Transmission Rate</td><td>10/100/1000 Mbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Main Feature</strong></td><td>Switching Type</td><td>Unmanaged Switch</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Main Feature</strong></td><td>MAC Address Table</td><td>8K</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Features</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L × W × H)</td><td>252 × 180 × 44 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Features</strong></td><td>Enclosure Type</td><td>Durable Metal Housing</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Features</strong></td><td>Cooling System</td><td>Fanless Design</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Features</strong></td><td>Installation</td><td>Desktop, Wall-Mount, and Rack-Mount</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Network Features</strong></td><td>Auto Negotiation</td><td>Supported</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Network Features</strong></td><td>Auto MDI/MDIX</td><td>Supported</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Network Features</strong></td><td>Switching Architecture</td><td>Non-Blocking</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Network Features</strong></td><td>Energy Efficiency</td><td>Energy-Efficient Ethernet Technology</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Manufacturer Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p>', 'NETWORKING', 12000.00, 12000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/SttW2omH4arcSjYFIRltiQsgDQnIslEloQM3gH7B.png', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-11 03:53:13', '2026-06-11 03:53:13', 'Netgear GS324 24-Port Gigabit Rackmount Switch Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Netgear GS324 24-Port Gigabit Rackmount Switch from International Office Solution in Bangladesh. Featuring 24 Gigabit Ethernet ports, plug-and-play setup, fanless operation, energy-efficient technology, and reliable network performance for offices and businesses.', 'Netgear GS324, Netgear GS324 Price in Bangladesh, 24 Port Gigabit Switch, Gigabit Rackmount Switch, Network Switch Bangladesh, Ethernet Switch, Office Network Switch, Netgear Switch, Unmanaged Switch, International Office Solution, Rackmount Network Switch, Business Networking Solutions', NULL, 271, NULL, NULL);
