(361, 'Benq Projector  MX550 3600 Lumens XGA Multimedia', 'The BenQ MX560 XGA Business Projector features 3,600 ANSI lumens of brightness, delivering clear and vibrant presentations even in brightly lit meeting rooms and classrooms. Its XGA resolution, 20,000:1 contrast ratio, and advanced DLP technology ensure sharp text, vivid colors, and detailed visuals for professional presentations. With dual HDMI connectivity, long lamp life of up to 15,000 hours, and energy-saving SmartEco technology, the BenQ MX560 is an ideal projection solution for businesses, educational institutions, and training environments. Available at International Office Solution (IOS) with genuine warranty and professional support.', 'benq-projector-mx550-3600-lumens-xga-multimedia-1781156692', '<h2>Clear High Brightness for Small Well-Lit Meeting Rooms</h2><p>The BenQ MX560 XGA Business Projector is designed to deliver outstanding presentation performance in meeting rooms, classrooms, training centers, and corporate environments. Featuring 3,600 ANSI lumens of high brightness, this projector ensures crystal-clear image projection even in well-lit rooms where lights remain on for collaboration and note-taking.</p><p>The powerful brightness output allows presentations to remain highly visible for audiences of up to 20 participants, making it ideal for business meetings, educational sessions, and professional training programs. Whether displaying spreadsheets, reports, charts, videos, or multimedia content, the projector delivers exceptional clarity and readability from every viewing angle.</p><p>Its high luminance performance ensures that participants seated at the back of the room can clearly view presentation slides without loss of detail. Combined with BenQ\'s advanced DLP technology, the MX560 produces vibrant colors, sharper text, and enhanced image quality, creating a more engaging viewing experience for both presenters and audiences.</p><p>The projector\'s 20,000:1 high contrast ratio further improves image depth by delivering brighter whites and deeper blacks. Fine text, detailed graphics, and presentation visuals remain crisp and easy to read, helping businesses and educators communicate information more effectively.</p><p>With dual HDMI connectivity, VGA input, RS232 control, and multiple audio interfaces, the BenQ MX560 offers flexible integration with laptops, desktop PCs, media players, and conferencing systems. Its SmartEco technology extends lamp life up to 15,000 hours while reducing power consumption and maintenance costs, making it a cost-effective solution for long-term professional use.</p><p>International Office Solution (IOS) offers the genuine BenQ MX560 Business Projector in Bangladesh with professional consultation, competitive pricing, and reliable after-sales support. Whether for office presentations, classroom teaching, or training sessions, the BenQ MX560 provides dependable performance, bright visuals, and excellent value for money.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Display Type</td><td>DLP</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Resolution</td><td>XGA (1024 × 768)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Brightness</td><td>3600 Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>20,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Image Size</td><td>30\" ~ 300\"</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Video Formats</td><td>NTSC, PAL, SECAM</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Details</td><td>Lamp Power</td><td>200W</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Details</td><td>Lamp Life (Normal)</td><td>5,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Details</td><td>Lamp Life (Eco)</td><td>10,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Details</td><td>Lamp Life (SmartEco)</td><td>10,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Details</td><td>Lamp Life (LampSave)</td><td>15,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>2W</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>PC Input</td><td>D-Sub x 1</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Monitor Output</td><td>D-Sub (15-pin) x 1</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>S-Video Input</td><td>Mini DIN 4-pin x 1</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Composite Video Input</td><td>RCA x 1</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>HDMI</td><td>HDMI x 2</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB</td><td>USB Mini-B x 1</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Audio Input</td><td>3.5mm Mini Jack x 1</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>3.5mm Mini Jack x 1</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>RS232</td><td>DB-9 Pin x 1</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>IR Receiver</td><td>x 2</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Security Bar</td><td>x 1</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Supply</td><td>AC 100-240V, 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Typical Power Consumption</td><td>270W</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Standby Power Consumption</td><td>&lt; 0.5W</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Specification</td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Specification</td><td>Weight</td><td>2.3 kg</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Specification</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>296 × 120 × 221 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>1 Year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 44500.00, 44000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/nvWpwhwRD5FothMZF3JYTu8UuPqR9t5gqGzvNibo.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-11 05:44:52', '2026-06-11 05:44:52', 'BenQ MX560 XGA 3600 Lumens Business Projector Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy BenQ MX560 XGA 3600 Lumens Business Projector in Bangladesh from International Office Solution (IOS). Features XGA resolution, 20,000:1 contrast ratio, dual HDMI ports, SmartEco technology, and up to 15,000 hours lamp life.', 'BenQ MX560 Price in Bangladesh, BenQ MX560 Projector, BenQ Business Projector, XGA Projector Bangladesh, 3600 Lumens Projector, BenQ MX560 XGA Projector, Meeting Room Projector, Classroom Projector, DLP Projector Bangladesh, BenQ Projector Price, Office Projector Bangladesh, Business Presentation Projector, BenQ MX560 Bangladesh, International Office Solution, IOS Bangladesh Projector, HDMI Projector Bangladesh, Conference Room Projector, Training Room Projector, Professional Projector Bangladesh, BenQ Projector Distributor Bangladesh.', NULL, 41, NULL, NULL),
(362, 'BenQ Projector  MS560 4000 ANSI Lumens SVGA Business', 'The BenQ MS560 SVGA Business Projector features 4,000 ANSI lumens of brightness, SVGA resolution, and a high 20,000:1 contrast ratio for clear and impactful presentations in classrooms and meeting rooms. Equipped with a powerful 10W speaker, dual HDMI ports, SmartEco technology, and lamp life up to 15,000 hours, it offers reliable performance and cost-effective operation for business and educational environments. Available from International Office Solution (IOS) with genuine warranty and professional support.', 'benq-projector-ms560-4000-ansi-lumens-svga-business-1781157426', '<p>The BenQ MS560 SVGA Business Projector is a powerful and cost-effective projection solution designed for classrooms, meeting rooms, training centers, conference spaces, and business environments. Featuring an impressive 4,000 ANSI lumens of brightness, SVGA (800 x 600) resolution, and a high 20,000:1 contrast ratio, this projector delivers clear, bright, and impactful presentations even in well-lit environments.</p><p>Whether you are displaying business reports, spreadsheets, educational materials, presentations, or multimedia content, the BenQ MS560 provides reliable performance and excellent image quality to keep your audience engaged.</p><h2>Bright and Clear Projection in Any Environment</h2><p>With 4,000 ANSI lumens of brightness, the BenQ MS560 produces vibrant and highly visible images throughout the day. Presentations remain sharp and readable without dimming room lights, making it ideal for classrooms, office meeting rooms, and training facilities where visibility is essential.</p><p>The high brightness level allows participants seated at the back of the room to view content comfortably while maintaining excellent image clarity and detail.</p><h2>High Contrast for Better Readability</h2><p>The projector features a 20,000:1 contrast ratio, delivering deeper blacks and brighter whites for enhanced image depth. Text, charts, graphs, and presentation materials appear sharper and easier to read, helping presenters communicate information more effectively.</p><h2>Accurate and Vibrant Color Performance</h2><p>Powered by BenQ\'s advanced DLP projection technology, the MS560 produces vivid colors and consistent image quality over time. Business presentations, educational content, and video materials appear more engaging and professional, ensuring an improved viewing experience.</p><h2>Powerful Built-in 10W Speaker</h2><p>The integrated 10W speaker delivers clear and powerful audio without requiring external sound equipment. This built-in audio solution simplifies installation and is suitable for classrooms, meeting rooms, and small conference environments.</p><h2>Long Lamp Life and Energy Saving Technology</h2><p>The BenQ MS560 incorporates SmartEco technology to reduce power consumption while extending lamp life. Multiple lamp modes help lower operating costs and minimize maintenance requirements.</p><p>Lamp Life Performance:</p><ul><li>Normal Mode: Up to 6,000 Hours</li><li>Economic Mode: Up to 10,000 Hours</li><li>SmartEco Mode: Up to 10,000 Hours</li><li>LampSave Mode: Up to 15,000 Hours</li></ul><p>This extended lamp lifespan provides excellent long-term value and reduces replacement frequency.</p><h2>Flexible Connectivity Options</h2><p>The projector offers comprehensive connectivity for seamless integration with modern devices:</p><ul><li>HDMI x 2</li><li>VGA Input x 1</li><li>VGA Monitor Output x 1</li><li>Audio Input and Output</li><li>USB Type-A Power Output</li><li>USB Mini-B</li><li>RS232 Control Port</li><li>S-Video Input</li><li>Composite Video Input</li></ul><p>These versatile connectivity options allow easy connection to laptops, desktop computers, media players, document cameras, and presentation systems.</p><h2>Energy-Efficient Operation</h2><p>The BenQ MS560 is engineered for efficient performance with low standby power consumption of less than 0.5W and SmartEco technology that can reduce lamp power usage by up to 70%. This helps organizations lower electricity costs while supporting environmentally friendly operations.</p><h2>Why Buy from International Office Solution (IOS)?</h2><p>International Office Solution (IOS) offers genuine BenQ projectors with competitive pricing, professional consultation, and reliable after-sales support throughout Bangladesh. Whether you need a projector for education, business presentations, training programs, or conference applications, the BenQ MS560 provides dependable performance, bright projection, and outstanding value for money. Contact International Office Solution today for the latest price and expert support.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Display Type</td><td>DLP Single 0.55\" SVGA</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>800 × 600 (SVGA)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Supported Resolution</td><td>VGA (640 × 480) to WUXGA_RB (1920 × 1200)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Brightness</td><td>4000 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Projection Size</td><td>60\" ~ 150\"</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>20,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Video Formats</td><td>NTSC, PAL, SECAM, SDTV (480i/576i), EDTV (480p/576p), HDTV (720p, 1080i/p 60Hz)</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Details</td><td>Lamp Power Saving</td><td>Up to 70%</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Details</td><td>Lamp Life (Normal Mode)</td><td>6,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Details</td><td>Lamp Life (Economic Mode)</td><td>10,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Details</td><td>Lamp Life (SmartEco Mode)</td><td>10,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Details</td><td>Lamp Life (LampSave Mode)</td><td>15,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>10W × 1</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>HDMI</td><td>HDMI-1 × 1, HDMI-2 × 1</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>VGA Input</td><td>PC (D-Sub 15-pin) × 1</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>VGA Output</td><td>Monitor Out (D-Sub 15-pin Female) × 1</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Audio Input</td><td>Mini Jack × 1</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>Mini Jack × 1</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>RS232</td><td>D-Sub 9-pin (Male) × 1</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB Type-A</td><td>× 1 (1.5A Power Supply)</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB Mini-B</td><td>× 1</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>IR Receiver</td><td>Front + Top × 2</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>S-Video</td><td>× 1</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Composite Video</td><td>RCA × 1</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Maximum Power Consumption</td><td>280W</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Normal Power Consumption</td><td>260W</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Eco Mode Power Consumption</td><td>215W</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Standby Power Consumption</td><td>&lt; 0.5W</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Supply</td><td>100 ~ 240V AC</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Specification</td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Specification</td><td>Weight</td><td>2.3 kg (±200g)</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Specification</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>296 × 120 × 221 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>1 Year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 44500.00, 44000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/5S2q72EhZ0z5yPr9nTppLZTPFzJdYZeqLRa4WRiD.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-11 05:57:06', '2026-06-11 05:57:06', 'BenQ MS560 SVGA 4000 ANSI Lumens Business Projector Price in Bangladesh | IOS', 'Buy BenQ MS560 SVGA 4000 ANSI Lumens Business Projector in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features 20,000:1 contrast ratio, dual HDMI, 10W speaker, SmartEco technology, and up to 15,000 hours lamp life.', 'BenQ MS560 Price in Bangladesh, BenQ MS560 Projector, BenQ SVGA Projector, 4000 ANSI Lumens Projector, BenQ Business Projector, Classroom Projector Bangladesh, Meeting Room Projector, DLP Projector Bangladesh, BenQ Projector Price, Conference Room Projector, Training Center Projector, HDMI Projector Bangladesh, Professional Projector Bangladesh, BenQ MS560 Bangladesh, Business Presentation Projector, International Office Solution, IOS Bangladesh, BenQ Projector Distributor Bangladesh, Multimedia Projector Bangladesh, Office Projector Price Bangladesh.', NULL, 41, NULL, NULL),
(363, 'BenQ Projector LH750 5000 ANSI Lumens 1080p Conference Room', 'The BenQ LH750 Conference Room Projector delivers 5,000 ANSI lumens brightness and native Full HD 1080p resolution for clear and impactful presentations in business and educational environments. Featuring advanced LED technology, up to 30,000 hours light source life, a powerful 20W speaker, flexible installation features, and energy-efficient operation, the LH750 is an ideal projection solution for conference rooms, boardrooms, and training facilities. Available from International Office Solution (IOS) with genuine warranty and professional support.', 'benq-projector-lh750-5000-ansi-lumens-1080p-conference-room-1781158940', '<p>The BenQ LH750 1080p Conference Room Projector is a professional-grade display solution designed for conference rooms, boardrooms, meeting spaces, educational institutions, and corporate environments. Featuring an impressive 5,000 ANSI lumens of brightness, native Full HD 1080p resolution, and advanced LED light source technology, this projector delivers exceptional image clarity, vibrant colors, and reliable long-term performance.</p><p>Whether you\'re conducting business presentations, training sessions, video conferences, or educational demonstrations, the BenQ LH750 ensures crystal-clear visuals even in brightly lit environments, making it the perfect choice for modern professional workplaces.</p><h2>Ultra-Bright 5000 ANSI Lumens Performance</h2><p>With 5,000 ANSI lumens of brightness, the BenQ LH750 produces vivid and highly visible images without requiring room lights to be dimmed. This high brightness output enables comfortable collaboration, note-taking, and discussions while maintaining excellent presentation visibility for everyone in the room.</p><p>The projector is ideal for medium to large conference rooms where image clarity and audience engagement are essential.</p><h2>Native Full HD 1080p Resolution</h2><p>The BenQ LH750 features native Full HD (1920 × 1080) resolution, ensuring sharp text, detailed charts, and high-quality video playback. Presentations, spreadsheets, graphics, and multimedia content appear crisp and professional, helping organizations communicate more effectively.</p><p>Its support for high-resolution input signals further enhances compatibility with modern laptops, PCs, and digital media devices.</p><h2>Exceptional Contrast and Color Accuracy</h2><p>Advanced DLP projection technology combined with an ultra-high contrast ratio delivers deeper blacks, brighter whites, and enhanced image depth. BenQ\'s color optimization technology ensures accurate color reproduction, making presentations, images, and videos appear more natural and engaging.</p><h2>Long-Life LED Light Source</h2><p>Unlike traditional lamp-based projectors, the BenQ LH750 utilizes a maintenance-free LED light source that offers exceptional durability and long-term reliability.</p><ul><li>Up to 20,000 hours light source life in Normal Mode</li><li>Up to 30,000 hours light source life in Eco Mode</li></ul><p>This significantly reduces maintenance costs and eliminates the hassle of frequent lamp replacements.</p><h2>Flexible Installation for Conference Rooms</h2><p>The projector is equipped with advanced installation features that simplify setup in various room configurations, including:</p><ul><li>1.62x Zoom Ratio</li><li>Vertical and Horizontal Keystone Correction</li><li>Corner Fit Adjustment</li><li>Projection Size up to 200 inches</li><li>LAN Control Support</li><li>Optional Wireless Presentation Capability</li><li>USB Firmware Upgrade</li></ul><p>These features provide maximum flexibility for professional installations and conference room deployments.</p><h2>Powerful 20W Built-in Speaker</h2><p>The integrated 20W speaker delivers clear and powerful audio for presentations, video conferencing, and multimedia playback. This reduces the need for external speakers in many meeting room environments, simplifying installation and reducing overall system costs.</p><h2>Energy-Efficient and 24/7 Operation</h2><p>The BenQ LH750 is engineered for continuous professional use with support for 24/7 operation. Its energy-efficient LED light source reduces power consumption while maintaining consistent image quality throughout its lifespan.</p><p>Low standby power consumption further helps organizations minimize operating costs and environmental impact.</p><h2>Why Buy from International Office Solution (IOS)?</h2><p>International Office Solution (IOS) is a trusted supplier of genuine BenQ projectors in Bangladesh. We provide competitive pricing, professional consultation, installation support, and reliable after-sales service. Whether you need a projector for corporate presentations, conference rooms, educational institutions, or training facilities, the BenQ LH750 offers outstanding performance, long-term reliability, and excellent value for investment.</p><p>Contact International Office Solution (IOS) today to get the latest price and professional support for the BenQ LH750 Conference Room Projector.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Display Type</td><td>DLP</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>Full HD 1080P (1920 × 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Brightness</td><td>5000 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>5,000,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Display Color</td><td>30-bit (1.07 Billion Colors)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Native Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9 (4 Selectable Aspect Ratios)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Noise Level</td><td>34 dBA (Normal), 29 dBA (Eco)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Horizontal Frequency</td><td>15K ~ 135KHz</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Vertical Scan Rate</td><td>23 ~ 120Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>HDTV Compatibility</td><td>720p, 1080i, 1080p</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Throw Ratio</td><td>1.16 ~ 1.88</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Zoom Ratio</td><td>1.62x</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Keystone Correction</td><td>2D Vertical &amp; Horizontal (±30°)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Projection Offset</td><td>100% ± 4.5%</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Projection Size</td><td>60\" ~ 200\"</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Security</td><td>Security Bar, Kensington Lock</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Additional Features</td><td>Optional Wireless Display, Corner Fit, LAN Control, Firmware Upgrade via USB, 24/7 Operation</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Details</td><td>Light Source Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Details</td><td>Light Source Life (Normal Mode)</td><td>20,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Details</td><td>Light Source Life (Eco Mode)</td><td>30,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>1 × 20W</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Supported Input Resolution</td><td>VGA (640 × 480) to 4K UHD (3840 × 2160)</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Maximum Power Consumption</td><td>415W</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Normal Power Consumption</td><td>360W</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Eco Power Consumption</td><td>220W</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Standby Power Consumption</td><td>&lt; 0.5W</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Supply</td><td>100 ~ 240V AC</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Specification</td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Specification</td><td>Weight</td><td>5.9 kg (±100g)</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Specification</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>420.7 × 286.1 × 131.7 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>3 Years</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 185500.00, 185000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/WShTD4uccwUTKhlEQL0Ch9T67kZ4e0TouD5meyB6.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-11 06:22:20', '2026-06-11 06:22:20', 'BenQ LH750 5000 ANSI Lumens 1080p Conference Room Projector Price in Bangladesh | IOS', 'Buy BenQ LH750 5000 ANSI Lumens Full HD Conference Room Projector in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features LED light source, 1080p resolution, 20W speaker, up to 30,000 hours lifespan, and professional installation features.', 'BenQ LH750 Price in Bangladesh, BenQ LH750 Projector, BenQ Conference Room Projector, 5000 ANSI Lumens Projector, BenQ Full HD Projector, 1080p Business Projector, LED Projector Bangladesh, Conference Room Display Solution, Corporate Projector Bangladesh, Boardroom Projector, Professional Projector Bangladesh, BenQ LED Projector, Training Room Projector, Classroom Projector Bangladesh, High Brightness Projector, BenQ Projector Price Bangladesh, International Office Solution, IOS Bangladesh, Full HD Conference Projector, BenQ LH750 Bangladesh.', NULL, 41, NULL, NULL),
(364, 'BenQ Projector  MH550 3500 Lumens DLP Full Hd Business', 'The BenQ MH550 3500 ANSI Lumens Full HD Business Projector delivers bright and sharp visuals with 1080p resolution, making it ideal for meeting rooms and classrooms. It features Dual HDMI connectivity, SmartEco energy-saving technology, Infographic Mode for clear presentations, and up to 15,000 hours lamp life. With 3,500 lumens brightness and advanced DLP performance, it ensures clear visibility even in well-lit environments. Available at International Office Solution (IOS) with genuine warranty and support.', 'benq-projector-mh550-3500-lumens-dlp-full-hd-business-1781160123', '<p>The BenQ MH550 3500 ANSI Lumens Full HD Business Projector is a powerful and reliable projection solution designed for meeting rooms, classrooms, training centers, and professional business environments. With 3,500 ANSI lumens of brightness and Full HD 1080p resolution, this projector delivers sharp, bright, and highly detailed visuals even in well-lit rooms.</p><p>Whether you are presenting business reports, spreadsheets, multimedia content, or educational materials, the BenQ MH550 ensures excellent clarity, color accuracy, and smooth performance for professional presentations.</p><h2>Bright and Clear Visual Performance</h2><p>The BenQ MH550 delivers high brightness output that ensures clear visibility in bright meeting environments without the need to dim lights. This makes it ideal for collaborative meetings, discussions, and training sessions where audience engagement is important.</p><p>Even viewers sitting at the back of the room can easily see sharp and readable content thanks to its strong brightness and high contrast performance.</p><h2>Full HD Resolution with Sharp Details</h2><p>Featuring native Full HD 1080p resolution (1920 × 1080), the MH550 provides crisp text, detailed charts, and high-quality visuals. This makes it perfect for data presentations, financial reports, educational slides, and multimedia playback.</p><h2>SmartEco Energy Saving Technology</h2><p>The projector comes with BenQ’s SmartEco technology, designed to reduce power consumption while extending lamp life. It also operates with ultra-low standby power consumption of just 0.5W, making it highly energy efficient.</p><p>Lamp life performance:</p><ul><li>Up to 15,000 hours (LampSave Mode)</li><li>Extended lamp durability with SmartEco power optimization</li><li>Up to 70% lamp power saving in Eco Mode</li></ul><h2>Dual HDMI Connectivity &amp; Smart Auto Features</h2><p>The BenQ MH550 features Dual HDMI ports for flexible connectivity with laptops, PCs, and multimedia devices. It also supports auto power-on when HDMI signal is detected, making it more convenient for business use.</p><p>Other key connectivity options include VGA, audio in/out, RS232 control, and more for professional integration.</p><h2>Infographic Mode for Better Presentations</h2><p>The Exclusive Infographic Mode enhances text and graphics visibility, making charts, diagrams, and business content clearer and more impactful. This ensures better communication during meetings and presentations.</p><h2>Easy Installation &amp; User-Friendly Design</h2><p>The projector includes an ergonomic retractable foot for quick and easy setup, allowing users to adjust projection height effortlessly. Its all-glass lens system ensures sharp and stable image quality for long-term use.</p><h2>Why Buy from International Office Solution (IOS)?</h2><p>International Office Solution (IOS) provides genuine BenQ projectors in Bangladesh with competitive pricing, professional guidance, and reliable after-sales support. Whether for corporate, educational, or training environments, the BenQ MH550 offers excellent performance, durability, and value for money.</p><p>Contact International Office Solution today to get the best price and expert support for your projector needs.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Display Type</td><td>DLP</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Resolution</td><td>Full HD 1080p (1920 × 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Brightness</td><td>3,500 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>20,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Display Color</td><td>30-bit</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Throw Ratio</td><td>1.49 ~ 1.64</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Zoom Ratio</td><td>1.1x</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Horizontal Frequency</td><td>15K ~ 102KHz</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Vertical Scan Rate</td><td>23 ~ 120Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Details</td><td>Lamp Type</td><td>200W Metal Halide Bulb</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Details</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Up to 15,000 Hours (LampSave Mode)</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>2W</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>PC Input</td><td>D-Sub 15-pin × 1</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Monitor Output</td><td>D-Sub 15-pin × 1</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Composite Video Input</td><td>RCA × 1</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>S-Video Input</td><td>Mini DIN 4-pin × 1</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>HDMI</td><td>HDMI × 2 (HDMI 1.4a / HDCP 1.4)</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB</td><td>USB Type Mini-B × 1</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>RS232</td><td>DB-9 Pin × 1</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Supply</td><td>AC 100–240V, 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Typical Power Consumption</td><td>~260W</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Specification</td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Specification</td><td>Weight</td><td>2.3 kg</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Specification</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>296 × 120 × 221 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Parts Warranty</td><td>2 Years</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Lamp Warranty</td><td>12 Months or 1000 Hours</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 78500.00, 78000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/TZMK4KdQltGLAeY9Z3oQ4YZklF2iAQcXVsv62UPz.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-11 06:42:03', '2026-06-11 06:42:03', 'BenQ MH550 3500 ANSI Lumens Full HD Business Projector Price in Bangladesh | IOS', 'Buy BenQ MH550 3500 ANSI Lumens Full HD Business Projector in Bangladesh from International Office Solution (IOS). Features 1080p resolution, Dual HDMI, SmartEco technology, 15,000 hours lamp life, and high brightness for meeting rooms and classrooms.', 'BenQ MH550 Price in Bangladesh, BenQ MH550 Projector, BenQ Full HD Projector, 3500 ANSI Lumens Projector, Business Projector Bangladesh, Meeting Room Projector, Classroom Projector Bangladesh, BenQ DLP Projector, SmartEco Projector, Dual HDMI Projector, Full HD 1080p Projector, BenQ MH550 Bangladesh, Office Projector Bangladesh, Conference Projector Bangladesh, High Brightness Projector, BenQ Projector Price Bangladesh, International Office Solution, IOS Bangladesh, Multimedia Projector Bangladesh, Professional Projector Bangladesh', NULL, 41, NULL, NULL),
(365, 'BenQ Projector TK710STi 3200 ANSI Lumens 4K UHD DLP', 'The BenQ TK710STi is a premium 4K UHD laser projector featuring 3,200 ANSI lumens brightness, a 600,000:1 contrast ratio, and 95% Rec.709 color coverage for stunning home cinema and gaming experiences. Its short-throw design projects up to a 300-inch screen from a short distance, while built-in Google TV with official Netflix support provides seamless entertainment. Equipped with HDMI 2.1, USB-C, laser light source technology, and up to 20,000 hours lifespan, the TK710STi delivers powerful performance for movies, sports, and next-generation gaming. Available from International Office Solution (IOS) with genuine warranty and professional support.', 'benq-projector-tk710sti-3200-ansi-lumens-4k-uhd-dlp-1781170013', '<p>The BenQ TK710STi 3200 ANSI Lumens 4K UHD Laser Projector is a premium entertainment and gaming solution designed to deliver breathtaking visuals, immersive gameplay, and true cinematic experiences. Featuring native 4K UHD (3840 × 2160) resolution, 3,200 ANSI lumens brightness, and an advanced laser light source, this projector produces stunning image quality with exceptional clarity, color accuracy, and long-term reliability.</p><p>Designed for gamers, movie enthusiasts, and home entertainment users, the BenQ TK710STi combines powerful performance, smart streaming capabilities, and flexible installation features to create a truly immersive viewing experience.</p><h2>Stunning Native 4K UHD Resolution</h2><p>Experience incredible image detail with native 4K UHD resolution (3840 × 2160), delivering over 8 million pixels for ultra-sharp visuals. Whether you\'re watching blockbuster movies, streaming 4K content, or enjoying next-generation gaming, every image appears crisp, realistic, and highly detailed.</p><p>The projector supports a wide range of input resolutions from VGA up to 4K UHD, ensuring compatibility with modern gaming consoles, streaming devices, media players, and PCs.</p><h2>Bright 3200 ANSI Lumens Performance</h2><p>With 3,200 ANSI lumens of brightness, the BenQ TK710STi produces vivid and vibrant visuals even in rooms with ambient lighting. This high brightness level ensures excellent image visibility during daytime viewing, gaming sessions, sports broadcasts, and home theater entertainment.</p><p>Combined with a remarkable 600,000:1 contrast ratio, the projector delivers deeper blacks, brighter highlights, and enhanced image depth for a more immersive viewing experience.</p><h2>Cinematic Color Accuracy</h2><p>The projector covers 95% of the Rec.709 color gamut and displays up to 1.07 billion colors, ensuring lifelike color reproduction and cinematic image quality. Movies, games, and HDR content appear rich, vibrant, and true to life.</p><p>Multiple picture modes optimize viewing performance for different content types, including:</p><ul><li>Bright Mode</li><li>Cinema Mode</li><li>Living Room Mode</li><li>RPG Mode</li><li>FPS Mode</li><li>HDR10 Mode</li><li>HDR-RPG Mode</li><li>HDR-FPS Mode</li><li>HLG Mode</li><li>User Custom Modes</li></ul><h2>Short Throw Design for Flexible Installation</h2><p>The BenQ TK710STi features a short-throw ratio of 0.69–0.83, allowing users to project large-screen images from a relatively short distance. This makes it ideal for apartments, gaming rooms, living rooms, and dedicated home theaters.</p><p>Additional installation features include:</p><ul><li>1.2x Zoom Ratio</li><li>3D Keystone Correction</li><li>Vertical, Horizontal &amp; Rotation Adjustment (±30°)</li><li>Corner Alignment Support</li><li>102.5% Projection Offset</li><li>Screen Sizes from 60\" to 300\"</li></ul><p>These tools help users achieve perfectly aligned images in various room layouts.</p><h2>Built-In Google TV with Official Netflix Support</h2><p>The integrated Google TV platform provides direct access to popular streaming services and entertainment apps without requiring additional streaming devices.</p><p>Enjoy:</p><ul><li>Official Netflix Support</li><li>YouTube</li><li>Disney+</li><li>Prime Video</li><li>Google Play Applications</li><li>Voice-Control Compatible Features</li></ul><p>This all-in-one smart entertainment solution simplifies home theater setup and content access.</p><h2>Optimized for Gaming</h2><p>The BenQ TK710STi is engineered for modern gaming with support for high refresh rates up to 240Hz. Fast response performance and dedicated gaming picture modes help create smoother gameplay and improved visual responsiveness.</p><p>Whether playing action, racing, sports, or RPG titles, gamers benefit from enhanced image clarity and immersive visuals.</p><h2>Long-Life Laser Light Source</h2><p>The advanced laser light source delivers consistent brightness and color performance while significantly reducing maintenance requirements.</p><p>Light Source Life:</p><ul><li>Up to 20,000 Hours (Normal Mode)</li><li>Up to 20,000 Hours (Eco Mode)</li></ul><p>Laser technology eliminates frequent lamp replacements and provides long-term reliability for years of entertainment.</p><h2>Advanced Connectivity Options</h2><p>The BenQ TK710STi offers extensive connectivity for gaming, streaming, and multimedia applications:</p><ul><li>HDMI 2.1 × 2</li><li>Hidden HDMI (HDCP 2.2) × 1</li><li>USB-C × 1</li><li>USB-A × 2</li><li>Micro USB × 1</li><li>RS232 × 1</li><li>Audio Output × 1</li></ul><p>These versatile connectivity options ensure seamless integration with gaming consoles, PCs, laptops, streaming devices, and home entertainment systems.</p><h2>Premium Audio Performance</h2><p>The built-in 5W treVolo speaker delivers clear and immersive audio performance, making it suitable for casual entertainment without requiring external speakers.</p><h2>Why Buy from International Office Solution (IOS)?</h2><p>International Office Solution (IOS) offers genuine BenQ projectors with competitive pricing, professional consultation, installation support, and reliable after-sales service across Bangladesh. Whether you\'re building a home cinema, upgrading your gaming setup, or creating a premium entertainment space, the BenQ TK710STi delivers exceptional image quality, smart functionality, and long-lasting performance.</p><p>Contact International Office Solution today to get the latest price and expert support for the BenQ TK710STi 4K UHD Laser Projector.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Display Type</td><td>DLP</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>4K UHD (3840 × 2160)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Brightness</td><td>3200 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>600,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Display Color</td><td>30-bit (1.07 Billion Colors)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Noise Level</td><td>31 dBA (Normal), 28 dBA (Eco)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Operating Temperature</td><td>0°C ~ 40°C</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Rec.709 Coverage</td><td>95%</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Throw Ratio</td><td>0.69 ~ 0.83</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Zoom Ratio</td><td>1.2x</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Lens</td><td>F/# 2.53 ~ 2.73, f = 10.2 ~ 12.24 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Keystone Adjustment</td><td>3D Keystone, Vertical, Horizontal &amp; Rotation ±30°</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Projection Offset</td><td>102.5%</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Projection Size</td><td>60\" ~ 120\" / Up to 300\"</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Picture Modes</td><td>Bright, Living Room, RPG, FPS, Cinema, User, 3D, HDR-RPG, HDR-FPS, HDR10, HDR-User, HLG</td></tr><tr><td>Smart Features</td><td>Operating System</td><td>Google TV</td></tr><tr><td>Smart Features</td><td>Streaming Support</td><td>Official Netflix Support</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>Resolution Support</td><td>VGA (640 × 480) to 4K UHD (3840 × 2160)</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>Horizontal Frequency</td><td>15K ~ 135KHz</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>Vertical Scan Rate</td><td>23 ~ 240Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>HDTV Compatibility</td><td>480i, 480p, 576i, 576p, 720p, 1080i, 1080p, 2160p</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Details</td><td>Light Source Type</td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Details</td><td>Light Source Life</td><td>Up to 20,000 Hours (Normal/Eco)</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>5W treVolo × 1</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>HDMI</td><td>HDMI 2.1 × 2, Hidden HDMI (HDCP 2.2) × 1</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB-C</td><td>USB-C × 1</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB-A</td><td>USB-A 2.0 × 2, USB Type-A (1A Power Supply) × 1</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Micro USB</td><td>× 1 (Hidden)</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>RS232</td><td>× 1</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>× 1</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Maximum Power Consumption</td><td>275W</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Standby Power Consumption</td><td>&lt; 0.5W</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Supply</td><td>AC 100 ~ 240V, 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Specification</td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Specification</td><td>Weight</td><td>3.1 kg (±100g)</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Specification</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>304.2 × 253.5 × 112.4 mm (Including Adjustable Foot)</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>3 Years</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 255500.00, 255000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/blynFiSiL9rOeCclfotTrNfmhyAjFT02KUdHGcyf.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-11 09:26:53', '2026-06-11 09:26:53', 'BenQ TK710STi 3200 ANSI Lumens 4K UHD Laser Projector Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy BenQ TK710STi 4K UHD Laser Projector in Bangladesh from International Office Solution (IOS). Features 3200 ANSI Lumens brightness, Google TV, Netflix support, HDMI 2.1, short throw lens, 95% Rec.709 coverage, and up to 20,000 hours laser lifespan.', 'BenQ TK710STi Price in Bangladesh, BenQ TK710STi Projector, BenQ 4K Projector, 4K UHD Laser Projector Bangladesh, BenQ Gaming Projector, Home Cinema Projector Bangladesh, 3200 ANSI Lumens Projector, Short Throw Projector, BenQ Google TV Projector, Netflix Projector Bangladesh, HDMI 2.1 Projector, Laser Projector Bangladesh, BenQ Home Theater Projector, 4K Gaming Projector, HDR Projector Bangladesh, BenQ Projector Price Bangladesh, International Office Solution, IOS Bangladesh, Smart Projector Bangladesh, BenQ TK710STi Bangladesh.', NULL, 41, NULL, NULL),
(366, 'BenQ Projector GV50 500 ANSI Lumens 1080p DLP', 'The BenQ GV50 is a premium portable Full HD smart laser projector featuring 500 ANSI lumens brightness, native 1080p resolution, and Google TV with built-in Google Assistant, AirPlay, and Google Cast support. Equipped with CinematicColor™ technology, HDR10 support, an 18W 2.1-channel speaker system, and up to 30,000 hours laser lifespan, it delivers an immersive home cinema and gaming experience. Its compact design, auto screen fit, obstacle avoidance, and ultra-low 17.9ms input lag make it ideal for entertainment anywhere. Available from International Office Solution (IOS) with genuine warranty and professional support.', 'benq-projector-gv50-500-ansi-lumens-1080p-dlp-1781171188', '<p>The BenQ GV50 is a premium portable Full HD smart laser projector featuring 500 ANSI lumens brightness, native 1080p resolution, and Google TV with built-in Google Assistant, AirPlay, and Google Cast support. Equipped with CinematicColor™ technology, HDR10 support, an 18W 2.1-channel speaker system, and up to 30,000 hours laser lifespan, it delivers an immersive home cinema and gaming experience. Its compact design, auto screen fit, obstacle avoidance, and ultra-low 17.9ms input lag make it ideal for entertainment anywhere. Available from International Office Solution (IOS) with genuine warranty and professional support.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Display Type</td><td>DLP</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>Full HD (1920 × 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Brightness</td><td>500 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Native Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>100,000:1 (Native FoFo 500:1 Typical)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Display Color</td><td>24-bit (16.7 Million Colors)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Noise Level</td><td>28 dBA (Normal), 26 dBA (Eco)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Operating Temperature</td><td>0°C ~ 40°C</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>OSD Language</td><td>22 Languages</td></tr><tr><td>Optical Features</td><td>Throw Ratio</td><td>1.2:1</td></tr><tr><td>Optical Features</td><td>Zoom Ratio</td><td>Fixed</td></tr><tr><td>Optical Features</td><td>Keystone Correction</td><td>2D Auto Vertical ±20°, Horizontal ±30°, Rotation ±30°</td></tr><tr><td>Optical Features</td><td>Projection Offset</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>Optical Features</td><td>Projection Size</td><td>30\" ~ 120\"</td></tr><tr><td>Smart Features</td><td>Operating System</td><td>Google TV (Android 11)</td></tr><tr><td>Smart Features</td><td>Voice Assistant</td><td>Google Assistant</td></tr><tr><td>Smart Features</td><td>Wireless Streaming</td><td>AirPlay, Google Cast</td></tr><tr><td>Smart Features</td><td>Intelligent Features</td><td>Auto Screen Fit, Auto Obstacle Avoidance, Digital Zoom</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>Input Lag</td><td>17.9ms (1080p 60Hz), 17.9ms (4K 60Hz)</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>Resolution Support</td><td>VGA (640 × 480) to 4K UHD (3840 × 2160)</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Details</td><td>Light Source Life (Normal Mode)</td><td>Up to 20,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Details</td><td>Light Source Life (Eco Mode)</td><td>Up to 30,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>18W 2.1-Channel Speaker System</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>HDMI</td><td>HDMI 2.0b / HDCP 2.3 × 1</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB Type-A</td><td>USB 2.0 × 1 (Power Supply, Reader, Firmware Upgrade)</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB-C / DisplayPort</td><td>DisplayPort with PD Input (20V 2.25A–5A), PD Output (5V/2A, 9V/2A, 12V/1.5A, 15V/1.2A), Reader Support</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Maximum Power Consumption</td><td>90W</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Normal Power Consumption</td><td>85W</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Eco Power Consumption</td><td>60W</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Specification</td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Specification</td><td>Weight (With Base)</td><td>2.1 kg (4.6 lb)</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Specification</td><td>Weight (Without Base)</td><td>1.8 kg (4.0 lb)</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Specification</td><td>Dimensions (With Base)</td><td>130 × 211.2 × 191.4 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Specification</td><td>Dimensions (Without Base)</td><td>107 × 193.3 × 191.4 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>3 Years</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 82500.00, 82000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/vRVkYKn6KPoso8qd8msjsv154UCTjNbeZJuUN8yi.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-11 09:46:28', '2026-06-11 09:46:28', 'BenQ GV50 500 ANSI Lumens Full HD Smart Laser Projector Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy BenQ GV50 Full HD Smart Laser Projector in Bangladesh from International Office Solution (IOS). Features Google TV, HDR10, 500 ANSI Lumens brightness, 18W 2.1-channel speakers, AirPlay, Google Cast, and up to 30,000 hours laser lifespan.', 'BenQ GV50 Price in Bangladesh, BenQ GV50 Projector, BenQ Portable Projector, Full HD Smart Projector, 500 ANSI Lumens Projector, BenQ Laser Projector Bangladesh, Google TV Projector, Android 11 Projector, AirPlay Projector Bangladesh, Google Cast Projector, Home Cinema Projector Bangladesh, Portable Home Theater Projector, BenQ DLP Projector, HDR10 Projector, Gaming Projector Bangladesh, Smart Portable Projector, BenQ Projector Price Bangladesh, International Office Solution, IOS Bangladesh, BenQ GV50 Bangladesh.', NULL, 41, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `name`, `short_description`, `slug`, `description`, `specifications_text`, `tags`, `buy_price`, `price`, `discount_price`, `stock`, `thumbnail`, `video`, `is_featured`, `status`, `is_coming_soon`, `is_tba`, `is_call_for_price`, `is_out_of_stock`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`, `meta_keywords`, `meta_image`, `brand_id`, `supplier_id`, `laptop_purpose_id`) VALUES
(367, 'BenQ  Projector GP520 2600 ANSI Lumens 4K UHD DLP', 'The BenQ GP520 is a premium 4K UHD DLP Smart Projector featuring 3840 x 2160 resolution, 2600 ANSI lumens brightness, and 98% Rec.709 CinematicColor™ technology. Equipped with a long-lasting 4-LED light source, 200,000:1 contrast ratio, MEMC motion enhancement, Google TV, Dolby Audio speakers, and intelligent auto setup features, it delivers an immersive cinematic experience for home entertainment, gaming, and professional use. Available in Bangladesh from International Office Solution (IOS).', 'benq-projector-gp520-2600-ansi-lumens-4k-uhd-dlp-1781173682', '<p>The BenQ GP520 4K UHD Smart Home Entertainment Projector is a premium projection solution designed to transform your living room, office, or entertainment space into a true cinematic environment. Featuring advanced DLP technology and a stunning 4K UHD (3840 x 2160) resolution, the GP520 delivers exceptional image clarity, sharp details, and vibrant colors that bring movies, sports, gaming, and presentations to life.</p><p>Powered by 2600 ANSI lumens brightness, the projector ensures clear and vivid visuals even in moderately lit environments. BenQ’s exclusive CinematicColor™ technology covers 98% of the Rec.709 color gamut and supports 30-bit color depth, producing over 1.07 billion colors for incredibly realistic and immersive viewing experiences. Whether you are watching blockbuster movies, streaming content, or playing games, every scene appears rich, vibrant, and true to life.</p><p>The GP520 utilizes an advanced 4-LED light source that offers an impressive lifespan of up to 30,000 hours, significantly reducing maintenance requirements while maintaining consistent brightness and color performance throughout its lifetime. Its outstanding 200,000:1 contrast ratio enhances dark scenes and highlights fine details, creating deeper blacks and brighter whites for superior image quality.</p><p>For smooth and fluid motion, the projector incorporates MEMC (Motion Estimation and Motion Compensation) technology, minimizing blur and motion artifacts during fast-paced action scenes, sports broadcasts, and gaming sessions. Intelligent installation features such as Auto Focus, Auto Keystone Correction, Screen Fit, Obstacle Avoidance, and Digital Zoom make setup effortless, allowing users to enjoy the perfect image from virtually any location.</p><p>The BenQ GP520 supports projection sizes ranging from 50 inches to an immersive 180 inches, making it suitable for both compact rooms and large entertainment areas. Connectivity options include dual HDMI 2.1 ports, USB-C with audio, video, and power delivery support, USB-A ports, and a 3.5mm audio output, ensuring seamless compatibility with gaming consoles, laptops, streaming devices, and external audio systems.</p><p>Audio performance is equally impressive with built-in dual 12W stereo speakers enhanced by Dolby Audio technology, delivering powerful and immersive sound without requiring external speakers. The integrated Google TV platform provides direct access to popular streaming services such as Netflix, Prime Video, Disney+, YouTube, and more. With built-in Google Assistant, users can easily search content, control playback, and manage smart home devices using voice commands.</p><p>One of the projector’s standout features is its Intelligent Ambient Adaptation technology, which automatically adjusts brightness, color balance, and image settings according to room lighting conditions and wall colors. This ensures optimal picture quality without the need for manual calibration.</p><p>With its elegant black finish, compact design, and lightweight 3.7 kg construction, the BenQ GP520 combines premium performance, smart functionality, and exceptional convenience. Whether for home theater entertainment, gaming, business presentations, or family movie nights, the BenQ GP520 4K UHD Projector delivers an unparalleled viewing experience.</p>', '<p>The BenQ GP520 4K Smart Home Cinema Projector is a premium entertainment solution designed for movie lovers, gamers, and home theater enthusiasts who demand exceptional picture quality and immersive audio performance. Featuring true 4K UHD (3840 × 2160) resolution, 2,600 ANSI lumens brightness, HDR10+ support, and Google TV integration, the GP520 transforms any living room into a cinematic entertainment hub.</p><p>Powered by advanced DLP projection technology and a long-lasting 4-LED light source, the BenQ GP520 delivers stunning visual clarity, vibrant colors, and intelligent smart features that provide an exceptional viewing experience for movies, sports, streaming, and gaming.</p><h2>Stunning 4K UHD Resolution with HDR10+</h2><p>Experience breathtaking image quality with native 4K UHD (3840 × 2160) resolution that delivers over 8 million pixels for incredible detail and sharpness. Combined with HDR10+ technology, the projector enhances brightness, contrast, and color depth scene-by-scene, creating a more realistic and immersive viewing experience.</p><p>Whether watching blockbuster movies, live sports, or high-definition streaming content, every image appears crisp and lifelike.</p><h2>Brilliant Color Accuracy and High Contrast</h2><p>The BenQ GP520 covers 98% of the Rec.709 color gamut and supports 1.07 billion colors, ensuring rich and accurate color reproduction. Its 200,000:1 contrast ratio delivers deeper blacks and brighter highlights, enhancing image depth and realism.</p><p>This combination creates a true cinematic experience with vibrant visuals and outstanding detail in both bright and dark scenes.</p><h2>Smart Home Entertainment with Google TV</h2><p>The projector comes equipped with Google TV, providing access to thousands of entertainment apps and streaming services without requiring external devices.</p><p>Smart features include:</p><ul><li>Google TV Platform</li><li>Official Netflix Support</li><li>YouTube</li><li>Prime Video</li><li>Disney+</li><li>Google Assistant Voice Control</li><li>Google Cast Built-In</li></ul><p>Users can enjoy seamless streaming directly from the projector with a simple and intuitive interface.</p><h2>Intelligent Auto Setup Features</h2><p>The BenQ GP520 is designed for effortless installation with advanced AI-powered image adjustment technologies.</p><p>Key setup features include:</p><ul><li>Auto Focus</li><li>Auto 2D Keystone Correction</li><li>Auto Screen Fit</li><li>Auto Rotation Adjustment</li><li>Obstacle Avoidance</li><li>Digital Zoom</li><li>Image Reposition</li></ul><p>These smart technologies automatically optimize image alignment, making setup quick and convenient in virtually any room.</p><h2>Smooth Motion with MEMC Technology</h2><p>MEMC (Motion Estimation Motion Compensation) technology reduces motion blur and improves image smoothness during fast-moving scenes. Sports broadcasts, action movies, and gaming content appear more fluid and natural for enhanced viewing comfort.</p><h2>Immersive Dolby Audio Sound System</h2><p>The BenQ GP520 features dual 12W stereo speakers with Dolby Audio support, delivering powerful and immersive sound without requiring external speakers.</p><p>Audio benefits include:</p><ul><li>24W Total Output</li><li>Dolby Audio Support</li><li>Clear Dialogue Reproduction</li><li>Enhanced Bass Performance</li><li>Cinematic Sound Experience</li></ul><p>This premium audio system complements the projector\'s outstanding visual performance.</p><h2>Optimized for Gaming</h2><p>The GP520 supports refresh rates up to 240Hz and offers a low input lag of just 17.9ms at both 1080p and 4K 60Hz, providing responsive gameplay and smooth visual performance.</p><p>Its dedicated gaming compatibility makes it suitable for console gaming, sports titles, racing games, and action-packed adventures.</p><h2>Long-Life 4-LED Light Source</h2><p>The advanced 4-LED light source delivers consistent brightness and color accuracy while significantly reducing maintenance requirements.</p><p>Light Source Life:</p><ul><li>Up to 20,000 Hours (Normal Mode)</li><li>Up to 30,000 Hours (Eco Mode)</li></ul><p>This ensures years of reliable entertainment without frequent lamp replacements.</p><h2>Flexible Connectivity Options</h2><p>The BenQ GP520 offers modern connectivity options for gaming consoles, streaming devices, laptops, and mobile devices.</p><p>Connectivity includes:</p><ul><li>HDMI 2.1 × 2</li><li>USB-C (Audio, Power &amp; Video)</li><li>USB-A 2.0 × 2</li><li>3.5mm Audio Output</li></ul><p>These versatile ports provide seamless compatibility with today\'s entertainment ecosystem.</p><h2>Why Buy from International Office Solution (IOS)?</h2><p>International Office Solution (IOS) offers genuine BenQ projectors with competitive pricing, expert consultation, installation assistance, and dependable after-sales service throughout Bangladesh. Whether you are creating a home theater, upgrading your gaming setup, or building a smart entertainment room, the BenQ GP520 delivers exceptional performance, smart functionality, and long-term value.</p><p>Contact International Office Solution today to get the latest price and professional support for the BenQ GP520 4K Smart Home Cinema Projector.</p>', 'PROJECTOR', 38500.00, 38000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/I6Kq9vvDYpTgsFY8auoAjdT6I1c98Covpgxwk0mG.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-11 10:28:02', '2026-06-11 10:28:02', 'BenQ GP520 4K UHD Smart Projector Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the BenQ GP520 4K UHD Smart Projector from International Office Solution (IOS) in Bangladesh. Features 2600 ANSI lumens, Google TV, Dolby Audio, 98% Rec.709 color accuracy, MEMC technology, and up to 180-inch projection for an immersive home theater experience.', 'BenQ GP520,\r\nBenQ GP520 Projector,\r\nBenQ GP520 4K UHD Projector,\r\nBenQ GP520 Smart Projector,\r\nBenQ GP520 Price in Bangladesh,\r\nBenQ GP520 DLP Projector,\r\n4K Home Theater Projector,\r\n2600 ANSI Lumens Projector,\r\nGoogle TV Projector,\r\nDolby Audio Projector,\r\nBenQ Home Entertainment Projector,\r\nSmart Projector Bangladesh,\r\nBenQ Projector Bangladesh,\r\n4K UHD DLP Projector,\r\nInternational Office Solution,\r\nIOS Bangladesh,\r\nHome Cinema Projector,\r\nGaming Projector 4K,\r\nBenQ GP520 Features,\r\nBenQ GP520 Specifications', NULL, 41, NULL, NULL),
(368, 'BenQ  Projector LU9715 8000 ANSI Lumens WUXGA Large-Venue BlueCore Laser', 'The BenQ LU9715 is a professional WUXGA large venue laser projector featuring 8000 ANSI lumens brightness, BlueCore Laser Technology, and a 3,000,000:1 contrast ratio. Designed for auditoriums, conference rooms, museums, and commercial installations, it offers up to 20,000 hours of laser life, 24/7 operation, HDBaseT connectivity, 360° installation flexibility, and support for interchangeable lenses. Available in Bangladesh from International Office Solution (IOS).', 'benq-projector-lu9715-8000-ansi-lumens-wuxga-large-venue-bluecore-laser-1781177805', '<p>The BenQ LU9715 is a professional-grade large venue laser projector engineered to deliver exceptional brightness, outstanding image quality, and unmatched installation flexibility for demanding commercial and professional applications. Powered by BenQ’s advanced BlueCore Laser Technology, this high-performance projector provides 8000 ANSI lumens of brightness and WUXGA (1920 × 1200) native resolution, making it an ideal solution for auditoriums, conference halls, museums, educational institutions, houses of worship, simulation environments, and large-scale public displays.</p><p>At the heart of the LU9715 is BenQ\'s revolutionary BlueCore Laser Light Source, which utilizes dual-color laser systems to generate highly accurate RGBY color reproduction. By eliminating the white segment found in conventional color wheels, the projector delivers richer colors, higher brightness efficiency, and a significantly wider color gamut than traditional lamp-based projectors. This advanced laser technology ensures stunning image performance with vibrant colors, enhanced visual depth, and exceptional clarity.</p><p>The projector features an ultra-high contrast ratio of 3,000,000:1, allowing it to reproduce deep blacks and bright highlights with incredible precision. Automatic brightness adjustment technology intelligently optimizes image output, preserving subtle details in darker scenes while maintaining balance and visibility in brighter environments. Whether displaying presentations, videos, digital signage, or immersive visual experiences, the LU9715 consistently delivers sharp and realistic visuals.</p><p>With a native WUXGA resolution of 1920 × 1200, the BenQ LU9715 offers greater detail and image sharpness than standard Full HD projectors. The additional screen real estate provided by the 16:10 aspect ratio makes it especially suitable for business presentations, engineering applications, and professional content creation.</p><p>Designed for long-term reliability, the BlueCore laser light source offers up to 20,000 hours of maintenance-free operation while maintaining consistent brightness and color accuracy throughout its lifespan. Unlike traditional lamp projectors that experience gradual brightness degradation, the laser light source resists color decay over time, making it ideal for multi-projector blending and edge-blending installations where image consistency is critical.</p><p>The LU9715 supports continuous 24/7 operation, making it perfectly suited for museums, public exhibitions, command centers, digital signage networks, and mission-critical installations. BenQ’s renowned single-chip DLP architecture ensures superior reliability, with the DLP chip rated for over 100,000 hours of operation without image degradation. This guarantees long-lasting color accuracy, crisp text rendering, and dependable performance.</p><p>To ensure maximum durability, the projector incorporates sealed laser modules and an enclosed optical engine that protect sensitive internal components, including the DMD chip, color wheel sensor, and laser bank, from dust contamination and environmental factors. An advanced liquid cooling system efficiently dissipates heat while maintaining low acoustic noise levels, ensuring quiet and stable operation even in ambient temperatures up to 40°C.</p><p>The projector offers exceptional installation flexibility with support for 360-degree rotation, portrait projection, and projection at virtually any angle. This enables creative display solutions on walls, ceilings, floors, curved surfaces, and custom signage installations. The LU9715 is compatible with eight interchangeable optional lenses, allowing users to customize projection distances and screen sizes according to specific installation requirements. Manufactured in Japan, these premium all-glass lenses minimize chromatic aberration and color fringing while delivering superior image sharpness across the entire screen.</p><p>Connectivity is equally impressive, featuring HDMI, DisplayPort, DVI-D, VGA, 3G-SDI, HDBaseT, RS-232, and multiple professional control interfaces. The integrated HDBaseT technology allows uncompressed video, audio, and control signals to be transmitted through a single CAT5e/6 cable over distances of up to 100 meters, simplifying installation and reducing infrastructure costs.</p><p>Combining powerful brightness, long-lasting laser performance, professional-grade connectivity, and flexible installation options, the BenQ LU9715 stands out as one of the most capable large venue laser projectors available today.</p><h2>Buy BenQ LU9715 Laser Projector from International Office Solution (IOS)</h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original BenQ LU9715 8000 ANSI Lumens WUXGA Large Venue BlueCore Laser Projector from International Office Solution (IOS). We provide genuine BenQ projection solutions, competitive pricing, professional consultation, and reliable after-sales support. Contact International Office Solution today to bring world-class laser projection performance to your organization.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Display Technology</td><td>DLP Single 0.67\" WUXGA DC3 DMD Chip</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Native Resolution</td