ork Standby Power</td><td>&lt; 6W</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Specification</td><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Specification</td><td>Weight</td><td>28 kg (Without Lens)</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Specification</td><td>Dimensions (W × H × D)</td><td>500 × 211 × 583 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty Coverage</td><td>3 Years Parts &amp; Service Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Light Source Warranty</td><td>Included with Manufacturer Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 1450500.00, 1450000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/AZiAfVElRcAJ0GxGPKlUMAQ2G3zMhNnnwwBRQGt5.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-11 11:36:45', '2026-06-11 11:36:45', 'BenQ LU9715 8000 ANSI Lumens WUXGA Laser Projector Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the BenQ LU9715 BlueCore Laser Projector from International Office Solution (IOS). Featuring 8000 ANSI lumens brightness, WUXGA resolution, 3,000,000:1 contrast ratio, HDBaseT connectivity, 24/7 operation, and up to 20,000 hours laser lifespan for professional large venue applications.', 'BenQ LU9715,\r\nBenQ LU9715 Projector,\r\nBenQ LU9715 Laser Projector,\r\nBenQ LU9715 WUXGA Projector,\r\nBenQ LU9715 Price in Bangladesh,\r\nBenQ BlueCore Laser Projector,\r\n8000 ANSI Lumens Projector,\r\nLarge Venue Projector,\r\nProfessional Laser Projector,\r\nWUXGA Laser Projector,\r\nHDBaseT Projector,\r\nDLP Laser Projector,\r\nAuditorium Projector,\r\nConference Hall Projector,\r\nMuseum Projection System,\r\nCommercial Projector Bangladesh,\r\nBenQ Projector Bangladesh,\r\nInternational Office Solution,\r\nIOS Bangladesh,\r\nHigh Brightness Laser Projector', NULL, 41, NULL, NULL),
(369, 'BenQ Projector LU9245 7000 Lumens BlueCore Large-Venue Laser', 'The BenQ LU9245 is a professional large-venue laser projector featuring 7,000 ANSI lumens brightness, WUXGA resolution, and a 3,000,000:1 contrast ratio. Powered by BlueCore Laser Technology, it supports 24/7 operation, 360° and portrait installation, interchangeable lenses, and up to 20,000 hours of maintenance-free performance. Ideal for auditoriums, museums, conference halls, educational institutions, and corporate environments. Available in Bangladesh from International Office Solution (IOS).', 'benq-projector-lu9245-7000-lumens-bluecore-large-venue-laser-1781178234', '<p>The BenQ LU9245 BlueCore Laser Projector is a powerful large-venue projection solution designed to deliver exceptional brightness, outstanding image quality, and flexible installation options for professional environments. Featuring 7,000 ANSI lumens of brightness and a remarkable 3,000,000:1 contrast ratio, the LU9245 ensures crystal-clear visuals, vivid colors, and impressive detail even in brightly lit venues. Whether used in auditoriums, conference halls, museums, houses of worship, higher education institutions, entertainment venues, or corporate environments, this projector provides reliable and immersive visual performance.</p><p>Powered by BenQ’s advanced BlueCore Laser Technology, the LU9245 utilizes a high-efficiency laser light source that delivers consistent brightness, enhanced color accuracy, and long-term reliability. The innovative dual color wheel system significantly improves color performance, producing richer, more vibrant images while maintaining exceptional brightness levels. This technology ensures stunning visual presentations, high-impact digital signage, and immersive multimedia experiences.</p><p>With a native WUXGA (1920 × 1200) resolution, the projector offers sharp image reproduction and detailed content display that exceeds traditional Full HD resolution. The 16:10 aspect ratio provides additional screen space, making it ideal for professional presentations, engineering applications, educational content, and large-format visual displays.</p><p>The BenQ LU9245 is engineered for demanding professional installations and supports continuous 24/7 operation. Its laser light source offers up to 20,000 hours of maintenance-free performance, significantly reducing operational costs compared to traditional lamp-based projectors. The sealed optical engine protects critical internal components from dust contamination, ensuring long-term image stability and reliability.</p><p>One of the projector’s most valuable features is its exceptional installation flexibility. It supports full 360-degree rotation and portrait mode projection, allowing users to project content on walls, ceilings, floors, angled surfaces, and creative digital signage installations. This versatility makes the LU9245 ideal for museums, simulation centers, immersive exhibitions, and large commercial display environments.</p><p>The projector is compatible with seven interchangeable optional lenses, enabling customized projection distances and screen sizes for virtually any venue requirement. These premium all-glass lenses are designed to minimize chromatic aberration and color fringing, ensuring superior image sharpness and accuracy across the entire screen. A convenient one-button lens release mechanism allows fast, secure, and hassle-free lens replacement, simplifying installation and maintenance.</p><p>Advanced connectivity options and professional control capabilities ensure seamless integration into modern AV systems. Combined with its high brightness, long-lasting laser performance, and versatile installation features, the BenQ LU9245 delivers exceptional value for professional projection applications.</p><h2>Buy BenQ LU9245 Laser Projector from International Office Solution (IOS)</h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original BenQ LU9245 7000 ANSI Lumens BlueCore Large Venue Laser Projector from International Office Solution (IOS). We offer genuine BenQ projection solutions, competitive pricing, expert consultation, and dependable after-sales support. Contact International Office Solution today to upgrade your venue with professional-grade laser projection technology.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Display Technology</td><td>DLP Single 0.67\" WUXGA</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>1920 × 1200 (WUXGA)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Supported Resolution</td><td>VGA (640 × 480) to WUXGA (1920 × 1200)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Brightness</td><td>7000 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>3,000,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Video Formats</td><td>Supported Video Formats</td><td>NTSC, PAL, SECAM</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Details</td><td>Light Source Life (Normal Mode)</td><td>20,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Details</td><td>Light Source Life (Eco Mode)</td><td>38,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Details</td><td>Light Source Life (Dimming Mode)</td><td>70,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>20W Stereo Speaker (10W × 2)</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Maximum Power Consumption</td><td>650W</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Normal Power Consumption</td><td>600W</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Eco Power Consumption</td><td>400W</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Standby Power Consumption</td><td>&lt; 0.5W</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Network Standby Consumption</td><td>&lt; 2W</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Specification</td><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Specification</td><td>Weight</td><td>24 kg (Without Lens)</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Specification</td><td>Dimensions (W × H × D)</td><td>525 × 216 × 470 mm (With Feet)</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Parts &amp; Service Warranty</td><td>3 Years<