(370, 'BenQ Projector LU930 5000 Lumens WUXGA Laser', 'The BenQ LU930 is a professional WUXGA laser projector featuring 5000 ANSI lumens brightness, 20,000-hour laser life, IP5X dustproof design, and flexible installation options including lens shift and 360° projection. With HDMI, VGA, LAN, and RS-232 connectivity, it is ideal for conference rooms, auditoriums, and corporate presentations. Available in Bangladesh from International Office Solution (IOS).', 'benq-projector-lu930-5000-lumens-wuxga-laser-1781178660', '<h2>BenQ LU930 WUXGA Laser Projector</h2><p>The BenQ LU930 WUXGA Laser Projector is a powerful and reliable projection system engineered for professional environments where image quality, brightness, and durability are essential. Designed for conference rooms, corporate boardrooms, auditoriums, educational institutions, and large presentation spaces, this projector delivers outstanding visual performance backed by advanced laser technology.</p><p>With 5000 ANSI lumens of brightness, the LU930 ensures clear and vibrant images even in bright ambient lighting conditions. Whether presenting business reports, educational content, or multimedia videos, it maintains excellent visibility and sharpness across all content types.</p><p>The projector features WUXGA (1920 × 1200) native resolution, offering enhanced detail and clarity compared to standard Full HD projectors. This makes it especially suitable for data-heavy presentations, spreadsheets, engineering designs, and high-definition video playback. Combined with DLP technology and a strong contrast ratio, it produces deep blacks, bright whites, and realistic color reproduction.</p><p>The advanced laser light source provides up to 20,000 hours of maintenance-free operation, significantly reducing replacement costs and downtime. Unlike traditional lamp projectors, the LU930 maintains consistent brightness and color stability throughout its lifespan. Its IP5X-rated dustproof sealed optical engine further enhances durability by preventing dust contamination and ensuring long-term reliability.</p><p>For installation flexibility, the LU930 supports 1.6x optical zoom, vertical and horizontal lens shift, and 360-degree projection capability. These features allow easy adaptation to various installation environments, whether ceiling-mounted, table-mounted, or angled projection setups.</p><p>Connectivity options include HDMI, VGA, LAN, and RS-232, enabling seamless integration with a wide range of devices and control systems. This ensures compatibility with modern AV infrastructure used in corporate and institutional environments.</p><p>The BenQ LU930 is a perfect combination of brightness, reliability, flexibility, and long-lasting laser performance, making it a top choice for professional-grade projection applications.</p><h2>Buy BenQ LU930 Projector from International Office Solution (IOS)</h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original BenQ LU930 WUXGA Laser Projector from International Office Solution (IOS). We provide genuine products, expert consultation, and reliable after-sales service for corporate and institutional clients.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Display Technology</td><td>DLP</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>WUXGA (1920 × 1200)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Brightness</td><td>5000 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:10</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>3,000,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Color Depth</td><td>30-bit (1.07 Billion Colors)</td></tr><tr><td>Light Source</td><td>Type</td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td>Environment</td><td>Operating Temperature</td><td>0°C to 40°C</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Supply</td><td>AC 100–240V, 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Typical Consumption 