(371, 'BenQ  Projector LW650 4000 Lumens WXGA Laser', 'The BenQ LW650 is a high-brightness WXGA laser projector with 4000 ANSI lumens, 20,000-hour laser life, 3,000,000:1 contrast ratio, and 90% Rec.709 color accuracy. It supports 1.3x zoom, keystone correction, USB-C connectivity, dual HDMI ports, and SmartEco power-saving features. Ideal for offices, classrooms, and meeting rooms. Available in Bangladesh from International Office Solution (IOS).', 'benq-projector-lw650-4000-lumens-wxga-laser-1781179122', '<p>The BenQ LW650 Laser Projector is a powerful and efficient projection solution designed for modern business, education, and professional environments. Built to deliver superior image quality and long-lasting performance, it combines advanced laser technology with intelligent features for a seamless visual experience.</p><p>With 4000 ANSI lumens brightness, the LW650 ensures clear and vibrant visuals even in brightly lit rooms. This makes it highly suitable for conference rooms, classrooms, training centers, and corporate presentations where ambient lighting cannot always be controlled.</p><p>The projector features WXGA (1280 × 800) native resolution with a 16:10 aspect ratio, offering a balanced display area ideal for presentations, spreadsheets, and multimedia content. Combined with a high 3,000,000:1 contrast ratio, it delivers deep blacks, bright whites, and excellent image depth.</p><p>Its 30-bit color processing supports over 1.07 billion colors, ensuring highly accurate and lifelike visuals. With 90% Rec.709 color coverage, the LW650 produces professional-grade color reproduction suitable for business and educational content.</p><p>The laser light source offers up to 20,000 hours of operation across Normal, Eco, and SmartEco modes, significantly reducing maintenance costs and downtime. This makes it a cost-effective and environmentally friendly projection solution.</p><p>Installation flexibility is enhanced through 1.3x zoom, 1.21–1.57 throw ratio, 2D keystone correction, and corner fit adjustment, allowing easy setup in different room configurations. It can project large images exceeding 100 inches from just 2–3 meters, making it ideal for compact environments.</p><p>Connectivity options include dual HDMI 2.0b ports, USB Type-C with DisplayPort support, and USB Type-A, ensuring compatibility with modern devices and AV systems. A built-in 10W speaker provides clear audio output for presentations and meetings.</p><p>Energy-saving features such as SmartEco Mode and Eco Blank Mode reduce power consumption by up to 70%, while Auto Power-Off ensures efficient operation when not in use.</p><h2>Buy BenQ LW650 Projector from International Office Solution (IOS)</h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original BenQ LW650 Laser Projector from International Office Solution (IOS). We offer genuine products, expert guidance, and reliable after-sales support for corporate and educational clients.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Display Technology</td><td>DLP</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>WXGA (1280 × 800)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Brightness</td><td>4000 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:10</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>3,000,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Color Depth</td><td>30-bit (1.07 Billion Colors)</td></tr><tr><td>Light Source</td><td>Type</td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td>Smart Features</td><td>USB Type-C</td><td>Supports Alt Mode (DisplayPort over USB-C)</td></tr><tr><td>Smart Features</td><td>Wireless Display</td><td>Optional WiFi dongle support</td></tr><tr><td>Smart Features</td><td>Power Saving</td><td>SmartEco Mode (up to 70% energy saving)</td></tr><tr><td>Environment</td><td>Operating Temperature</td><td>0°C to 40°C</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Supply</td><td>AC 100–240V, 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Typical Power Consumption</td><td>200W (100VAC) / 191W (220VAC)</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Standby Power Consumption</td><td>&lt; 0.5W</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Acoustic Noise</td><td>34 dB (Normal) / 28 dB (Eco)</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>Input Lag</td><td>8.3 ms (1080P 120Hz)</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>Supported Resolution</td><td>VGA (640×480) to 4K UHD (3840×2160)</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>Horizontal Frequency</td><td>15K–135KHz</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>Vertical Scan Rate</td><td>23–120Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Optical</td><td>Throw Ratio</td><td>1.21–1.57</td></tr><tr><td>Optical</td><td>Zoom Ratio</td><td>1.3x</td></tr><tr><td>Optical</td><td>Lens Specification</td><td>F/# 2.59–2.87, f = 16.88–21.88 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Optical</td><td>Projection Offset</td><td>102.5%</td></tr><tr><td>Optical</td><td>Keystone Correction</td><td>2D Auto (Vertical ±30°, Horizontal ±30°)</td></tr><tr><td>Picture</td><td>Color Gamut</td><td>Rec.709 (90%)</td></tr><tr><td>Picture</td><td>Picture Modes</td><td>Bright, HDR10, HLG, Infographic, Presentation, Spreadsheet, User 1, User 2, Video Conference</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp</td><td>Type</td><td>Lamp</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>20,000 Hours (Normal / ECO / SmartEco)</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>10W × 1</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>HDMI</td><td>2 × HDMI (2.0b / HDCP 2.2)</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB Type-A</td><td>2 × USB (Power + Service + Wireless Dongle support)</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB Type-C</td><td>1 × DisplayPort Alt Mode (5V/1A PD Out)</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>RS232</td><td>1 × DB-9 Pin</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Specification</td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Specification</td><td>Weight</td><td>2.9 kg ±100g</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Specification</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>303.5 × 112.4 × 224.7 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Coverage</td><td>2 Years Parts + 1 Year Lamp Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 110500.00, 110000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/hrMmDF1d1BTCNd98gt1OgqxbyGiU7Y1JdCpTLZbJ.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-11 11:58:42', '2026-06-11 12:04:07', 'BenQ LW650 WXGA Laser Projector Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution (IOS)', 'Buy BenQ LW650 Laser Projector from International Office Solution (IOS). Features 4000 ANSI lumens brightness, WXGA resolution, 20,000-hour laser life, 3,000,000:1 contrast ratio, USB-C, dual HDMI, and SmartEco energy saving technology.', 'BenQ LW650,\r\nBenQ LW650 Projector,\r\nBenQ LW650 Laser Projector,\r\nBenQ LW650 Price in Bangladesh,\r\nWXGA Laser Projector,\r\n4000 ANSI Lumens Projector,\r\nBenQ Business Projector,\r\nOffice Projector Bangladesh,\r\nClassroom Projector,\r\nLaser Projector Bangladesh,\r\nBenQ SmartEco Projector,\r\nUSB-C Projector,\r\nDual HDMI Projector,\r\nCorporate Projector,\r\nTraining Room Projector,\r\nInternational Office Solution,\r\nIOS Bangladesh,\r\nEnergy Saving Projector,\r\nShort Throw Laser Projector', NULL, 41, NULL, NULL),
(372, 'BenQ Projector  EW805ST 3600lms Short Throw Smart', 'The BenQ EW805ST is a 3600 ANSI lumens smart short throw projector with WXGA resolution, Android 9.0 OS, wireless projection (AirPlay, Google Cast, Miracast), WiFi & Bluetooth support, and up to 15,000 hours lamp life. Ideal for classrooms, offices, and small meeting rooms. Available in Bangladesh from International Office Solution (IOS).', 'benq-projector-ew805st-3600lms-short-throw-smart-1781180592', '<h2>BenQ EW805ST 3600 ANSI Lumens Smart Short Throw Projector</h2><p>The BenQ EW805ST Smart Short Throw Projector is a versatile and efficient projection system designed for modern classrooms, business environments, and home entertainment setups. Combining smart features, strong brightness, and short-throw capability, it delivers an exceptional viewing experience in compact spaces.</p><p>With 3600 ANSI lumens brightness, the EW805ST ensures bright and clear visuals even in well-lit rooms. This makes it ideal for educational institutions, training centers, and corporate meeting rooms where lighting conditions are not always controlled.</p><p>It features WXGA (1280 × 800) resolution with a 16:10 aspect ratio, offering a wide and detailed display area perfect for presentations, spreadsheets, and multimedia content. The 20,000:1 contrast ratio enhances image depth, delivering sharper details and better visual clarity.</p><p>Using advanced DLP technology and a 30-bit color system, the projector supports up to 1.07 billion colors, producing vibrant, natural, and realistic images suitable for both professional and entertainment use.</p><p>The short-throw design allows large images to be projected from a very close distance, making it perfect for small classrooms and meeting spaces where space is limited. The fixed lens and 1D vertical keystone correction (±40°) make installation quick and easy.</p><p>Powered by Android 9.0, the projector offers smart features including app access, wireless connectivity, and smart education tools. Built-in WiFi and Bluetooth support enable seamless wireless projection through AirPlay, Google Cast, and Miracast.</p><p>For audio, the EW805ST includes a built-in 5W speaker suitable for basic sound needs. The projector also operates quietly with noise levels of 33dB (normal) and 29dB (eco), ensuring a distraction-free environment.</p><p>With a long lamp life of up to 15,000 hours in LampSave mode, it offers a cost-effective and durable solution for long-term usage.</p><h2>Buy BenQ EW805ST Projector from International Office Solution (IOS)</h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original BenQ EW805ST Smart Short Throw Projector from International Office Solution (IOS). We provide genuine products, expert consultation, and reliable after-sales service for education and business customers.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Display Technology</td><td>DLP</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>WXGA (1280 × 800)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Brightness</td><td>3600 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:10</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>20,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Smart System</td><td>Operating System</td><td>Android 9.0 (Built-in OS)</td></tr><tr><td>Smart System</td><td>Launcher</td><td>Smart Education</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Color Depth</td><td>30-bit (1.07 Billion Colors)</td></tr><tr><td>Light Source</td><td>Type</td><td>Lamp</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Wireless Support</td><td>WiFi &amp; Bluetooth</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>Input Lag</td><td>33.4 ms (1080P 60Hz)</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>Supported Resolution</td><td>VGA (640×480) to WUXGA_RB (1920×1200)</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>Horizontal Frequency</td><td>15K–102KHz</td></tr><tr><td>Optical<