(373, 'BenQ Projector  MH560 3800 Lumen DLP Full Hd Business', 'The BenQ MH560 is a 3800 ANSI lumens Full HD business projector with 20,000:1 contrast ratio, SmartEco mode (up to 70% power saving), Data Review and Infographic modes, dual HDMI connectivity, and Kensington security lock. Ideal for offices, meetings, and presentations. Available in Bangladesh from International Office Solution (IOS).', 'benq-projector-mh560-3800-lumen-dlp-full-hd-business-1781180998', '<h2>BenQ MH560 Full HD Business Projector</h2><p>The BenQ MH560 Business Projector is a reliable and efficient projection solution designed for corporate offices, meeting rooms, and educational environments. Built to enhance productivity and presentation quality, it delivers exceptional brightness, clarity, and usability for professional applications.</p><p>With 3800 ANSI lumens brightness, the MH560 ensures clear and vibrant visuals even in well-lit environments. Combined with a 20,000:1 high contrast ratio, it produces sharp details, deep blacks, and bright whites for improved readability and visual impact.</p><p>The projector features advanced display optimization modes such as Data Review Mode and Infographic Mode, which enhance text clarity and highlight charts and graphics for professional presentations. This makes it especially suitable for business reports, financial data, and analytical content.</p><p>SmartEco Technology reduces lamp power consumption by up to 70%, helping extend lamp life while lowering operating costs. The Auto Power Off feature further improves energy efficiency by shutting down the projector when no input signal is detected for 20 minutes.</p><p>For connectivity, the MH560 includes dual HDMI ports, USB Type-A, RS-232, and USB Mini-B, ensuring compatibility with a wide range of devices. HDMI auto signal detection allows the projector to power on automatically when a connected device is activated.</p><p>The projector is equipped with high-quality all-glass lenses that ensure superior image sharpness and clarity. Security features such as Kensington Lock provide physical protection in shared or public environments.</p><h2>Buy BenQ MH560 Projector from International Office Solution (IOS)</h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original BenQ MH560 Business Projector from International Office Solution (IOS). We offer genuine products, expert guidance, and dependable after-sales support for corporate and institutional clients.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Display Technology</td><td>DLP Single 0.65\" 1080P</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>Full HD (1920 × 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Supported Resolution</td><td>VGA (640×480) to WUXGA_RB (1920×1200)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Brightness</td><td>3800 Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>20,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Image Size</td><td>70\" – 150\"</td></tr><tr><td>Video Formats</td><td>Supported Formats</td><td>NTSC, PAL, SECAM, SDTV (480i/576i), EDTV (480p/576p), HDTV (720p, 1080i/p 60Hz)</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp</td><td>Lamp Life (Normal)</td><td>6000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp</td><td>Lamp Life (Eco)</td><td>10,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp</td><td>Lamp Life (SmartEco)</td><td>10,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp</td><td>Lamp Life (LampSave)</td><td>15,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Noise Level</td><td>34 dB (Normal) / 29 dB (Eco)</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>10W × 1</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>HDMI</td><td>2 × HDMI (HDMI-1 / HDMI-2)</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>PC Input</td><td>D-Sub 15-pin (x1)</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Monitor Output</td><td>D-Sub 15-pin (x1)</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Audio Input</td><td>1 × Mini Jack</td></tr><tr><td>Connectiv