(374, 'BenQ Projector EX605 4000lms Android Smart', 'The BenQ EX605 is a 4000 ANSI lumens Android smart projector with XGA resolution, 20,000:1 contrast ratio, WiFi & Bluetooth connectivity, and wireless casting support (AirPlay, Google Cast, Miracast). It features up to 15,000 hours lamp life, HDMI/USB/RS232 connectivity, and a built-in 5W speaker. Ideal for classrooms, offices, and presentations in Bangladesh, available from International Office Solution (IOS).', 'benq-projector-ex605-4000lms-android-smart-1781181495', '<p>The BenQ EX605 Android Smart Projector is a powerful and flexible projection system designed for professional, educational, and home entertainment environments. It combines high brightness, smart features, and reliable performance to deliver an exceptional viewing experience.</p><p>With 4000 ANSI lumens brightness, the EX605 ensures clear and vibrant images even in well-lit rooms. This makes it ideal for classrooms, conference rooms, and training environments where lighting conditions cannot always be controlled.</p><p>It features XGA (1024 × 768) resolution and a 4:3 aspect ratio, making it well-suited for presentations, academic materials, and office documents. The projector also includes a 20,000:1 contrast ratio and 30-bit color depth, producing detailed visuals with rich and accurate color reproduction.</p><p>The lamp-based light source offers flexible usage life options, including up to 15,000 hours in LampSave mode, making it cost-effective and suitable for long-term use.</p><p>Installation flexibility is provided through a 1.96–2.15 throw ratio, 1.1x zoom, and 110% projection offset. The projector also includes vertical keystone correction up to ±40°, ensuring properly aligned images in various setups.</p><p>Powered by Android 9.0, the EX605 supports smart functionality, app access, and wireless projection. With Bluetooth 4.0 and WiFi connectivity (802.11 a/b/g/n/ac), users can easily share content via AirPlay, Google Cast, and Miracast.</p><p>Connectivity options include HDMI, USB (x5), and RS232, along with a built-in 5W speaker for basic audio output. Its energy-efficient design consumes only 275W during operation and less than 0.5W in standby mode.</p><p>Compact and lightweight at 2.6 kg with dimensions of 296 × 120 × 232 mm, the EX605 is portable and easy to install, making it suitable for both fixed and mobile use.</p><h2>Buy BenQ EX605 Projector from International Office Solution (IOS)</h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original BenQ EX605 Android Smart Projector from International Office Solution (IOS). We provide authentic products, competitive pricing, and professional after-sales support for corporate and educational clients.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Display Technology</td><td>DLP</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>XGA (1024 × 768)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Brightness</td><td>4000 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>4:3</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>20,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Smart System</td><td>Operating System</td><td>Android 9.0 (Built-in OS)</td></tr><tr><td>Smart System</td><td>Launcher</td><td>Smart Education</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Color Depth</td><td>30-bit (1.07 Billion Colors)</td></tr><tr><td>Light Source</td><td>Type</td><td>Lamp</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>Input Lag</td><td>33.4 ms (1080P 60Hz)</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>Supported Resolution</td><td>VGA (640×480) to WUXGA_RB (1920×1200)</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>Horizontal Frequency</td><td>15K–102KHz</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>Vertical Scan Rate</td><td>23–120Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Optical</td><td>Throw Ratio</td><td>1.96–2.15</td></tr><tr><td>Optical</td><td>Zoom Ratio</td><td>1.1x</td></tr><tr><t