(375, 'BenQ Projector MW560C WXGA 4000 ANSI Lumens Business', 'The BenQ MW560C is a 4000 ANSI lumens WXGA business projector with 20,000:1 contrast ratio, 16:10 aspect ratio, HDMI/VGA/USB connectivity, SmartEco energy saving, and up to 15,000 hours lamp life. Ideal for offices, classrooms, and presentations in Bangladesh, available from International Office Solution (IOS).', 'benq-projector-mw560c-wxga-4000-ansi-lumens-business-1781181875', '<h2>BenQ MW560C WXGA 4000 ANSI Lumens Business Projector</h2><p>The BenQ MW560C Business Projector is a high-performance projection system designed for professional environments such as offices, classrooms, and meeting rooms. It combines high brightness, strong connectivity, and reliable performance to deliver excellent visual experiences.</p><p>With 4000 ANSI lumens brightness, the MW560C ensures clear and vibrant images even in bright lighting conditions. The 20,000:1 contrast ratio enhances image depth, producing sharp text, detailed graphics, and well-balanced visuals suitable for business and educational use.</p><p>It features WXGA (1280 × 800) resolution with a 16:10 aspect ratio, making it ideal for presentations, spreadsheets, and multimedia content. The DLP Single 0.65\" WXGA technology ensures consistent image quality and color accuracy.</p><p>The projector supports a projection size of 60\" to 150\", with a throw ratio of 1.55–1.7 and 110% projection offset, allowing flexible installation in various room layouts.</p><p>It supports multiple video formats including NTSC, PAL, SECAM, SDTV, EDTV, and HDTV up to 1080p at 60Hz, ensuring compatibility with a wide range of devices and media sources.</p><p>Connectivity options include HDMI, VGA, USB Type-A (x2), USB Mini-B (for firmware updates), RS232, Audio In, Audio Out, and dual IR receivers. A built-in 10W speaker provides clear audio output for presentations without external sound systems.</p><p>SmartEco technology helps reduce power consumption by adjusting lamp brightness intelligently, while LampSave mode extends lamp life up to 15,000 hours, making it cost-effective for long-term use.</p><p>The projector is compact and lightweight at 2.3 kg, with dimensions of 296 × 221 × 129 mm, and includes a Kensington lock slot for added security.</p><h2>Buy BenQ MW560C Projector from International Office Solution (IOS)</h2><p>In Bangladesh, the original BenQ MW560C Business Projector is available from International Office Solution (IOS). We ensure genuine products, expert consultation, and reliable after-sales service for corporate and educational clients.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Display Technology</td><td>DLP Single 0.65\" WXGA</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>1280 × 800 pixels</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Brightness</td><td>4000 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>60\" – 150\"</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>Native 16:10 (5 selectable ratios)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>20,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Video Formats</td><td>Supported Formats</td><td>NTSC, PAL, SECAM, SDTV (480i/576i), EDTV (480p/576p), HDTV (720p, 1080i/p 60Hz)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Color Depth</td><td>30-bit (1.07 Billion Colors)</td></tr><tr><td>Optical</td><td>Projection Offset</td><td>110%</td></tr><tr><td>Optical</td><td>Throw Ratio</td><td>1.55 – 1.7</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>HDTV Support</td><td>480i/p, 576i/p, 720p, 1080i/p</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp</td><td>Lamp Life (Normal)</td><td>6000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp</td><td>Lamp Life (Eco)</td><td>10,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp</td><td>Lamp Life (SmartEco)</td><td>10,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp</td><td>Lamp Life (LampSave)</td><td>15,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Built-in Sp