(376, 'Benq Projector with HDMI  Mx528 3300 Lumens Xga Multimedia DLP', 'The BenQ MX528 is a 3300 ANSI lumens XGA DLP multimedia projector with 13,000:1 contrast ratio, HDMI and VGA connectivity, 1.07 billion colors, and up to 10,000 hours lamp life. It supports 36\"–300\" screen size and is ideal for classrooms, offices, and presentations in Bangladesh, available from International Office Solution (IOS).', 'benq-projector-with-hdmi-mx528-3300-lumens-xga-multimedia-dlp-1781182363', '<h2>BenQ MX528 3300 ANSI Lumens XGA Multimedia DLP Projector</h2><p>The BenQ MX528 Multimedia Projector is a powerful and affordable projection solution designed for educational institutions, offices, and small business environments. It delivers high-quality visuals, strong brightness, and flexible connectivity options for everyday presentation needs.</p><p>With 3300 ANSI lumens brightness and a 13,000:1 contrast ratio, the MX528 ensures clear and detailed images even in environments with ambient light. Its XGA (1024 × 768) native resolution and 4:3 aspect ratio make it ideal for presentations, spreadsheets, and classroom materials.</p><p>The projector uses advanced DLP technology, supporting up to 1.07 billion colors for rich and realistic image reproduction. It also supports HDTV resolutions up to 1080p, ensuring compatibility with modern media devices.</p><p>For installation flexibility, the MX528 supports a projection size of 36\" to 300\", a throw ratio of 1.96–2.15, and a 1.1x zoom ratio. A projection offset of 120% helps ensure proper image positioning in standard installations.</p><p>The lamp system includes multiple modes: Normal (4500 hours), Eco (6000 hours), SmartEco (6500 hours), and LampSave (up to 10,000 hours), providing long-term usage with reduced maintenance costs.</p><p>Connectivity options include HDMI, dual VGA inputs, audio in/out ports, USB Mini-B, RS232, and IR receiver, ensuring compatibility with a wide range of devices. A built-in 2W speaker provides basic audio output for small meeting setups.</p><p>The projector supports multiple video formats including NTSC, PAL, SECAM, and offers 3D projection capability for enhanced visual experiences. It operates with low noise levels of 33/28 dB for distraction-free use.</p><h2>Buy BenQ MX528 Projector from International Office Solution (IOS)</h2><p>In Bangladesh, the original BenQ MX528 Multimedia Projector is available from International Office Solution (IOS). We provide genuine products, competitive pricing, and trusted after-sales support for education and business customers.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Brightness</td><td>3300 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Resolution</td><td>XGA (1024 × 768)</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp</td><td>Lamp Life (Normal)</td><td>4500 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp</td><td>Lamp Life (Economic)</td><td>6000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp</td><td>Lamp Life (SmartEco)</td><td>6500 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp</td><td>Lamp Life (LampSave)</td><td>10000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Specification</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>283 × 95 × 222 mm (with feet)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 42000.00, 42000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/61idbMETXFL9BPxK9bSk7hyk8H6DQGMcWFWM0WVB.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-11 12:52:43', '2026-06-11 16:25:06', 'BenQ MX528 Projector Price in Bangladesh | 3300 ANSI Lumens XGA | IOS', 'Buy BenQ MX528 Multimedia Projector from International Office Solution (IOS). Features 3300 ANSI lumens brightness, XGA resolution, 13,000:1 contrast ratio, HDMI/VGA connectivity, and up to 10,000 hours lamp life for education and office use.', 'BenQ MX528,\r\nBenQ MX528 Projector,\r\nBenQ MX528 Price in Bangladesh,\r\n3300 ANSI Lumens Projector,\r\nXGA Projector Bangladesh,\r\nBenQ Multimedia Projector,\r\nOffice Projector Bangladesh,\r\nClassroom Projector Bangladesh,\r\nHDMI V