(377, 'BenQ  Projector MX560C XGA 4000 ANSI Lumens Business', 'The BenQ MX560C is a 4000 ANSI lumens XGA business projector with 20,000:1 contrast ratio, HDMI/VGA/USB connectivity, 10W speaker, and up to 15,000 hours lamp life. Ideal for offices, classrooms, and presentations in Bangladesh, available from International Office Solution (IOS).', 'benq-projector-mx560c-xga-4000-ansi-lumens-business-1781183025', '<h2>BenQ MX560C XGA 4000 ANSI Lumens Business Projector</h2><p>The BenQ MX560C Business Projector is a powerful and versatile projection solution designed for professional environments such as offices, boardrooms, classrooms, and training centers. It combines high brightness, reliable performance, and flexible connectivity to deliver an excellent visual experience.</p><p>With 4000 ANSI lumens brightness, the MX560C ensures clear and vibrant visuals even in well-lit environments. The 20,000:1 contrast ratio enhances image depth, making text, charts, and graphics easy to read and visually appealing.</p><p>It features XGA (1024 × 768) native resolution with a 4:3 aspect ratio, supporting multiple display modes for different content types. The 0.55\" DLP projection system ensures consistent image quality and long-term reliability.</p><p>The projector supports projection sizes from 60\" to 150\", making it suitable for small to medium-sized rooms. It also includes 1D auto keystone correction and multiple image modes such as Bright Mode, Spreadsheet Mode, and Presentation Mode for optimized viewing.</p><p>The MX560C supports multiple video formats including NTSC, PAL, SECAM, SDTV, EDTV, and HDTV up to 1080p at 60Hz, ensuring compatibility with a wide range of devices.</p><p>Connectivity options include HDMI, VGA, USB Type-A (1.5A power), USB Mini-B (firmware updates), RS232, audio in/out, dual IR receivers, and a Kensington security lock slot. A built-in 10W speaker provides convenient audio output without external systems.</p><p>Energy-efficient operation reduces power consumption to 215W in Eco mode and 280W in normal mode, while standby power remains below 0.5W. The lamp life extends up to 15,000 hours in LampSave mode, reducing maintenance costs significantly.</p><p>Compact and lightweight at just 2.3 kg with dimensions of 296 × 221 × 129 mm, the MX560C is easy to install and transport.</p><h2>Buy BenQ MX560C Projector from International Office Solution (IOS)</h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original BenQ MX560C Business Projector from International Office Solution (IOS). We offer genuine products, competitive pricing, and professional after-sales support for corporate and educational clients.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Display Technology</td><td>DLP Single 0.55\" XGA</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>1024 × 768 pixels</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Brightness</td><td>4000 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>60\" – 150\"</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>Native 4:3 (5 selectable ratios)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>20,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Video Formats</td><td>Supported Formats</td><td>NTSC, PAL, SECAM, SDTV (480i/576i), EDTV (480p/576p), HDTV (720p, 1080i/p 60Hz)</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp</td><td>Lamp Life (Normal)</td><td>6000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp</td><td>Lamp Life (Eco)</td><td>10,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp</td><td>Lamp Life (SmartEco)</td><td>10,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp</td><td>Lamp Life (LampSave)</td><td>15,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>10W × 1</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>HDMI</td><td>1 × HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB Type-A</td><td>1 × (1.5A Power)</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB Mini-B</td><td>1 × (Firmware Upgrade)</td