(378, 'BenQ Projector MX560 4000 ANSI Lumens XGA Business', 'The BenQ MX560 is a 4000 ANSI lumens XGA business projector with 20,000:1 contrast ratio, dual HDMI, SmartEco energy saving, Data Review Mode, and up to 15,000 hours lamp life. Ideal for offices, classrooms, and presentations in Bangladesh, available from International Office Solution (IOS).', 'benq-projector-mx560-4000-ansi-lumens-xga-business-1781183403', '<p>The BenQ MX560 Business Projector is engineered for high-performance corporate and educational use, offering exceptional brightness, flexible connectivity, and smart energy-saving features.</p><p>With 4000 ANSI lumens brightness and a 20,000:1 contrast ratio, the MX560 delivers sharp and vibrant images even in well-lit meeting rooms. Its XGA (1024 × 768) resolution ensures clear text and detailed visuals, making it ideal for presentations, reports, and business meetings.</p><p>The projector uses advanced DLP technology combined with high-quality glass lenses to minimize chromatic aberration and ensure long-lasting image clarity.</p><h3>Smart Display Modes</h3><ul><li><strong>Presentation Mode:</strong> Enhances brightness and color accuracy for business presentations</li><li><strong>Infographic Mode:</strong> Optimized for charts, graphs, and detailed visuals</li><li><strong>Data Review Mode:</strong> Improves clarity for spreadsheets and numerical content</li></ul><h3>Connectivity &amp; Smart Features</h3><p>The MX560 includes dual HDMI ports, VGA, USB Type-A, RS232, USB Mini-B, and audio connections, allowing seamless integration with laptops, PCs, and media devices. HDMI auto-detection enables instant startup when a signal is detected.</p><h3>Installation Flexibility</h3><ul><li>Auto Vertical Keystone Correction for perfect image alignment</li><li>Triple adjustable feet for flexible positioning</li><li>Quick restart within 90 seconds after shutdown</li></ul><h3>Energy Efficiency &amp; Protection</h3><p>SmartEco Mode reduces power consumption by u