(379, 'BenQ Projector LH650 4000 Lumens FHD Business', 'The BenQ LH650 is a 4000 ANSI lumens Full HD laser business projector with 3,000,000:1 contrast ratio, 92% Rec.709 color, dual HDMI, USB-C, wireless support, and up to 20,000 hours lamp life. Ideal for offices and presentations in Bangladesh, available from International Office Solution (IOS).', 'benq-projector-lh650-4000-lumens-fhd-business-1781184264', '<p>The BenQ LH650 Business Projector is a high-performance laser projection system designed for modern business environments, classrooms, and multimedia presentations. It combines brightness, clarity, and advanced connectivity for professional-grade performance.</p><p>With 4000 ANSI lumens brightness and Full HD (1920 × 1080) resolution, the LH650 delivers sharp and detailed visuals even in brightly lit environments. Its 16:9 aspect ratio ensures a cinematic viewing experience suitable for presentations and multimedia content.</p><p>The projector uses advanced laser technology with a lifespan of up to 20,000 hours in Normal, ECO, and SmartEco modes, ensuring long-lasting performance with minimal maintenance.</p><h3>Superior Image Quality</h3><ul><li>3,000,000:1 ultra-high contrast ratio</li><li>92% Rec.709 color coverage</li><li>30-bit color depth supporting 1.07 billion colors</li></ul><p>These features ensure accurate color reproduction and deep image clarity, making it suitable for professional presentations and creative content.</p><h3>Flexible Installation</h3><p>The LH650 supports:</p><ul><li>1.15–1.5 throw ratio</li><li>1.3x zoom</li><li>2D keystone correction</li><li>Corner fit adjustment</li></ul><p>These features allow easy setup in various room configurations.</p><h3>Advanced Connectivity</h3><ul><li>2 × HDMI 2.0b (HDCP 2.2)</li><li>3 × USB Type-A ports</li><li>1 × USB Type-C (DisplayPort support)</li><li>Wireless projection support</li></ul><h3>Performance &amp; Efficiency</h3><p>With support for resolutions up to 4K UHD and ultra-low input lag of 8.3 ms at 1080P 120Hz, the LH650 ensures smooth and responsive performance.</p><p>It is also IP5X dust-resistant, ensuring long-term durability and reduced maintenance requirements.</p><h2>Buy BenQ LH650 Projector from International Office Solution (IOS)</h2><p>In Bangladesh, the original BenQ LH650 Business Projector is available from International Office Solution (IOS), offering genuine products, competitive pricing, and trusted after-sales support.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Display Technology</td><td>DLP</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>1080P (1920 × 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Brightness</td><td>4000 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>3,000,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Light Source</td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Color Depth</td><td>30-bit (1.07 Billion Colors)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Color Gamut</td><td>Wide Color Gamut</td></tr><tr><td>Optical</td><td>Throw Ratio</td><td>1.15 – 1.5</td></tr><tr><td>Optical</td><td>Zoom Ratio</td><td>1.3x</td></tr><tr><td>Optical</td><td>Lens</td><td>F/# 2.59 – 2.87, f = 16.88 – 21.88 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Optical</td><td>Projection Offset</td><td>105.5%</td></tr><tr><td>Optical</td><td>Keystone Correction</td><td>2D Auto, Vertical ±30°, Horizontal ±30°</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>Resolution Support</td><td>VGA (640×480) to 4K UHD (3840×2160)</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>Input Lag</td><td>8.3 ms (1080P 120Hz)</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>Horizontal Frequency</td><td>15K – 135KHz</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>Vertical Scan Rate</td><td>23 – 120Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Picture</td><td>Rec.709 Coverage</td><td>92%</td></tr><