H650 Projector,BenQ LH650 Business Projector,BenQ LH650 Price in Bangladesh,Full HD Laser Projector,4000 ANSI Lumens Projector,Business Projector Bangladesh,Office Projector Bangladesh,BenQ Laser Projector,USB-C Projector,Wireless Projector,Dual HDMI Projector,Presentation Projector,High Brightness Projector,IOS Bangladesh,International Office Solution,Corporate Projector Bangladesh', NULL, 41, NULL, NULL),
(380, 'BENQ Projector TK700STi 4K UHD 3000 Lumens Android Built-in Wi-Fi Short Throw Smart Gaming', 'The BenQ TK700STi is a True 4K UHD short throw gaming projector with 3000 ANSI lumens brightness, ultra-low 16ms input lag, HDR support, Android TV, and up to 150-inch projection. Perfect for gaming, movies, and streaming in Bangladesh, available from IOS.', 'benq-projector-tk700sti-4k-uhd-3000-lumens-android-built-in-wi-fi-short-throw-smart-gaming-1781184886', '<p>The BenQ TK700STi is a premium short throw smart gaming projector designed for immersive entertainment, gaming, and home cinema experiences. It combines True 4K UHD resolution, ultra-low latency, and smart streaming features into a single powerful device.</p><p>With 3000 ANSI lumens brightness and 4K UHD resolution (3840 × 2160), it delivers bright, sharp, and highly detailed images even in ambient light conditions. The projector supports HDR gaming and 96% Rec.709 color accuracy, ensuring realistic and vibrant visuals.</p><h3>🎮 Ultra-Fast Gaming Performance</h3><ul><li>Industry-leading 16ms input lag</li><li>Optimized FPS, RPG, and Sports gaming modes</li><li>Smooth and responsive gameplay for competitive gaming</li><li>Compatible with PS5, PS4, Xbox Series X, and Nintendo Switch</li></ul><h3>🎬 Short Throw Immersive Display</h3><p>The TK700STi can project up to a 150-inch 4K screen from a short distance (around 6.5 feet), making it ideal for small rooms. This eliminates space limitations while delivering a cinematic experience.</p><h3>📺 Smart Android TV Integration</h3><p>Powered by Google-certified Android TV, it offers:</p><ul><li>Access to Google Play Store</li><li>Streaming apps like YouTube, Netflix, Prime Video</li><li>Voice control support</li><li>Easy navigation interface</li></ul><h3>🔧 Flexible Installation</h3><ul><li>2D Keystone correction</li><li>Digital rotation adjustment</li><li>Flexible placement on uneven surfaces</li></ul><h3>🔊 Immersive Audio Experience</h3><p>Built-in 5W speaker with multiple sound modes:</p><ul><li>Cinema Mode</li><li>Game Mode</li><li>Music Mode</li><li>Sports Mode</li></ul><h3>🔌 Connectivity &amp; Compatibility</h3><ul><li>Dual HDMI 2.0 ports</li><li>Support for gaming consoles and media devices</li><li>Fast source switching for uninterrupted entertainment</li></ul><h3>🏠 Home Entertainment Excellence</h3><p>Whether gaming, streaming movies, or watching sports, the TK700STi delivers a complete cinematic experience with vivid visuals and powerful sound in a large-screen format.</p><h2>Buy BenQ TK700STi in Bangladesh from International Office Solution (IOS)</h2><p>The original BenQ TK700STi True 4K Gaming Projector is available at International Office Solution (IOS) with official warranty and trusted service support.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>3840 × 2160 (4K UHD)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Brightness</td><td>3000 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>0.75m – 9.76m (100\" @ 2.5m)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>10,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Image Size</td><td>30\" – 300\"</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>Resolution Support</td><td>VGA (640×480) to True 4K (3840×2160)</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>HDTV Support</td><td>480i/p, 576i/p, 720p, 1080i/p, 2160p</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp</td><td>Lamp Type</td><td>Short Throw DLP Lamp</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp</td><td>Lamp Power</td><td>240W</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp</td><td>Lamp Life (Normal)</td><td>3000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp</td><td>Lamp Life (SuperEco)</td><td>15000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Noise Level (Normal)</td><td>33 dB</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Noise Level (Eco)</td><td>28 dB</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>5W</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>HDMI</td><td>2 × HDMI 2.0b (HDCP 2.2) + Internal HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB Type-A</td><td>1 × USB 2.0 (1.5A Power)</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>RS232</td><td>1 × DB-9 Pin</td></tr><tr><td>Smart System</td><td>Operating System</td><td>Android 9.0</td></tr><tr><td>Smart System</td><td>RAM/ROM</td><td>2GB / 16GB</td></tr><tr><td>Smart System</td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>4.2</td></tr><tr><td>Smart System</td><td>Wi-Fi</td><td>802.11 a/b/g/n/ac (2.4G/5G)</td></tr><tr><td>Smart System</td><td>Wireless Projection</td><td>Google Cast</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Supply</td><td>100–240V ±10%, 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>305W (Normal)</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Standby Power</td><td>&lt;0.5W</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Specification</td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Specification</td><td>Weight</td><td>3.1 kg</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Specification</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>312 × 110 × 246 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Coverage</td><td>2 Years</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Lamp Warranty</td><td>1 Year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 170000.00, 169800.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/gWI9YOjTfzhGBGMLtLFRjswjPtcBL3mSxTTcrCkc.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-11 13:34:46', '2026-06-11 13:34:46', 'BenQ TK700STi 4K Gaming Projector Price in Bangladesh | 16ms Input Lag | IOS', 'Buy BenQ TK700STi True 4K UHD Gaming Projector from International Office Solution (IOS). Features 3000 ANSI lumens brightness, 16ms ultra-low input lag, HDR, Android TV, dual HDMI, and short throw 150-inch projection for gaming and home entertainment.', 'BenQ TK700STi,\r\nBenQ TK700STi Projector,\r\n4K Gaming Projector,\r\nBenQ Gaming Projector Bangladesh,\r\nTrue 4K UHD Projector,\r\n16ms Input Lag Projector,\r\nShort Throw 4K Projector,\r\nHDR Gaming Projector,\r\nAndroid TV Projector,\r\nPS5 Projector,\r\nXbox Series X Projector,\r\nHome Cinema Projector Bangladesh,\r\nBenQ 4K Projector,\r\nGaming Entertainment Projector,\r\nInternational Office Solution,\r\nIOS Bangladesh,\r\nSmart Gaming Projector', NULL, 41, NULL, NULL);
