(381, 'BenQ Projector EH700 1080P Laser Smart', 'The BenQ EH700 is a Full HD 1080p laser smart projector with 4000 ANSI lumens brightness, Android 9 OS, wireless casting (AirPlay/Google Cast/Miracast), 30,000-hour laser life, and advanced business-class connectivity. Available in Bangladesh from IOS.', 'benq-projector-eh700-1080p-laser-smart-1781185415', '<p>The BenQ EH700 is a premium Full HD laser smart projector designed for education, business, and hybrid collaboration environments. It combines high brightness, smart OS features, wireless connectivity, and long-lasting laser performance into one powerful device.</p><h3>🎯 Stunning Visual Performance</h3><ul><li>4000 ANSI Lumens brightness for clear viewing in any lighting condition</li><li>Full HD 1080p (1920×1080) resolution</li><li>3,000,000:1 contrast ratio for deep blacks and bright highlights</li><li>30-bit color depth with 1.07 billion colors</li><li>92% Rec.709 color accuracy</li></ul><h3>🔆 Long-Lasting Laser Technology</h3><ul><li>Up to 30,000 hours laser life (ECO mode)</li><li>Stable brightness and low maintenance</li><li>SmartEco power-saving technology (up to 60% energy saving)</li></ul><h3>📡 Smart Android 9.0 System</h3><ul><li>Built-in Android OS for smart apps and tools</li><li>Supports Google Classroom, Kahoot, and cloud apps</li><li>Video conferencing support for hybrid meetings</li></ul><h3>📲 Wireless Connectivity</h3><ul><li>AirPlay, Google Cast, Miracast support</li><li>Wi-Fi (802.11 a/b/g/n/ac)</li><li>Bluetooth peripheral support</li></ul><h3>🔌 Advanced Connectivity Options</h3><ul><li>Dual HDMI 2.0b ports</li><li>USB-C with DisplayPort Alt Mode</li><li>Multiple USB-A ports</li><li>LAN network support</li></ul><h3>🎥 Flexible Installation</h3><ul><li>1.15–1.5 throw ratio</li><li>1.3x optical zoom</li><li>2D keystone correction (±40° vertical &amp; horizontal)</li><li>Corner fit alignment</li></ul><h3>🔊 Audio &amp; Integration</h3><ul><li>Built-in 10W speaker</li><li>Compatible with BenQ IAM, DMS, AMS centralized management systems</li><li>Supports USB cameras and plug-and-play devices</li></ul><h3>🏫 Ideal Applications</h3><ul><li>Schools and universities</li><li>Corporate boardrooms</li><li>Hybrid meeting environments</li><li>Training centers and classrooms</li></ul><p>The BenQ EH700 delivers a perfect balance of smart features, long-term reliability, and professional-grade projection quality.</p><h3>🇧🇩 Availability in Bangladesh</h3><p>Buy the original BenQ EH700 Laser Smart Projector from International Office Solution (IOS) with official warranty and dependable service support.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Display Type</td><td>DLP</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Resolution</td><td>1080P (1920 × 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Brightness</td><td>4000 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>3,000,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Smart System</td><td>Operating System</td><td>Android 9.0 Built-in</td></tr><tr><td>Smart System</td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Bluetooth 4.0</td></tr><tr><td>Smart System</td><td>Wi-Fi</td><td>802.11 a/b/g/n/ac (2.4G/5G)</td></tr><tr><td>Smart System</td><td>Wireless Projection</td><td>AirPlay, Google Cast, Miracast</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Color Depth</td><td>30-bit (1.07 Billion Colors)</td></tr><tr><td>Light Source</td><td>Type</td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>Input Lag</td><td>8.3 ms (1080P 120Hz)</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>Resolution Support</td><td>VGA (640×480) to 4K UHD (3840×2160)</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>Horizontal Frequency</td><td>15K–135KHz</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>Vertical Scan Rate</td><td>23–120Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Optical</td><td>Throw Ratio</td><td>1.15 – 1.5</td></tr><tr><td>Optical</td><td>Zoom Ratio</td><td>1.3x</td></tr><tr><td>Optical</td><td>Lens</td><td>F/# 2.59 – 2.87, f = 16.88 – 21.88 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Optical</td><td>Keystone Correction</td><td>2D Auto, Vertical ±40°, Horizontal ±40°</td></tr><tr><td>Optical</td><td>Projection Offset</td><td>105.5%</td></tr><tr><td>Picture</td><td>Rec.709 Coverage</td><td>92%</td></tr><tr><td>Picture</td><td>Picture Modes</td><td>3D, Bright, HDR10, HLG, Presentation, Spreadsheet, sRGB, Video Conference</td></tr><tr><td>Environment</td><td>Operating Temperature</td><td>0°C – 40°C</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Supply</td><td>AC 100–240V, 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>200W (Typical @100VAC)</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Standby Power</td><td>&lt;0.5W</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Network Standby</td><td>&lt;2W</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>1 × 10W</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Noise Level</td><td>34dB (Normal) / 28dB (Eco)</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>HDMI</td><td>2 × HDMI 2.0b (HDCP 2.2)</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>LAN</td><td>1 × RJ45</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB Type-A</td><td>3 × USB 2.0 (Power/Service/Wireless)</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB Type-C</td><td>1 × DisplayPort Alt Mode</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>RS232</td><td>1 × DB-9</td></tr><tr><td>External Features</td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>External Features</td><td>Weight</td><td>3.0 Kg ±100g</td></tr><tr><td>External Features</td><td>Dimension</td><td>11.9\" × 4.42\" × 9.49\"</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Coverage</td><td>2 Years Parts</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Lamp Warranty</td><td>1 Year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 160000.00, 160000.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/A9eUjpOESIFV11h3CIQETUP9CUh4hooSEHTNeECb.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-11 13:43:35', '2026-06-11 13:43:35', 'BenQ EH700 1080p Laser Smart Projector Price in Bangladesh | 4000 Lumens | IOS', 'Buy BenQ EH700 Full HD 1080p Laser Smart Projector from International Office Solution (IOS). Features 4000 ANSI lumens brightness, Android 9 OS, wireless projection, 30,000-hour laser life, dual HDMI, USB-C, and smart education & business features.', 'BenQ EH700,\r\nBenQ EH700 Projector,\r\nFull HD Laser Projector,\r\nSmart Projector Bangladesh,\r\n4000 ANSI Lumens Projector,\r\nAndroid Smart Projector,\r\nEducation Projector BenQ,\r\nBusiness Projector Bangladesh,\r\nWireless Projection Projector,\r\nGoogle Cast Projector,\r\nAirPlay Miracast Projector,\r\nLaser Smart Projector,\r\nBenQ Smart Education Projector,\r\nIOS Bangladesh Projector,\r\nInternational Office Solution', NULL, 41, NULL, NULL),
(382, 'BenQ Projector TK700 3200 ANSI Lumens DLP 4K HDR Console Gaming', 'The BenQ TK700 is a 4K UHD gaming projector with 3200 ANSI lumens brightness and ultra-low 16ms input lag, designed for fast, immersive gaming and home entertainment. Available in Bangladesh from IOS.', 'benq-projector-tk700-3200-ansi-lumens-dlp-4k-hdr-console-gaming-1781186046', '<p>The BenQ TK700 is a premium DLP 4K gaming projector designed to deliver an unmatched combination of performance, clarity, and responsiveness. Built for serious gamers, it offers XPR 4K UHD resolution with ultra-fast processing and low latency for competitive gameplay.</p><h3>🎮 Gaming Performance</h3><ul><li>Ultra-low input lag of 16ms</li><li>Optimized Game Mode for FPS, RPG, and action games</li><li>Enhanced shadow and black detail visibility</li><li>Smooth motion rendering for fast gameplay</li></ul><h3>🎬 Stunning Visual Quality</h3><ul><li>3200 ANSI lumens brightness for clear visuals in different lighting</li><li>XPR 4K UHD resolution for ultra-sharp detail</li><li>HDR support for enhanced contrast and color depth</li><li>Reduced motion blur for immersive viewing</li></ul><h3>🕹️ Competitive Advantage</h3><p>The TK700 is engineered to give gamers an edge by improving reaction time, visibility, and clarity in critical gaming moments. It allows players to see hidden enemies in dark environments and react faster during intense gameplay.</p><h3>🎥 Entertainment Beyond Gaming</h3><p>Apart from gaming, the TK700 is ideal for:</p><ul><li>Movies and cinematic viewing</li><li>Sports broadcasting</li><li>Streaming content on large screens</li></ul><h3>🏠 Versatile Usage</h3><p>Its high brightness and flexible projection capability make it suitable for:</p><ul><li>Living rooms</li><li>Gaming setups</li><li>Home entertainment systems</li></ul><h2>🇧🇩 Availability in Bangladesh</h2><p>The original BenQ TK700 4K Gaming Projector is available from International Office Solution (IOS) with official warranty and reliable service support.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Display Type</td><td>DLP</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Resolution</td><td>4K UHD (3840 × 2160)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Brightness</td><td>3200 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>10,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Picture</td><td>Picture Modes</td><td>3D, Bright, Cinema, Game, HDR, HDR Game, HDR10, HLG, Living Room, Sport, User</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp</td><td>Lamp Type</td><td>Lamp</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Normal: 4000 hrs, ECO: 10000 hrs, SmartEco: 8000 hrs, LampSave: 15000 hrs</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Audio Support</td><td>eARC, Dolby Atmos</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>1 × 5W Chamber</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>HDMI</td><td>2 × HDMI 2.0b (HDCP 2.2)</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB Type-A</td><td>1 × USB 2.0 (1.5A Power Supply)</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>RS232</td><td>1 × DB-9 Pin</td></tr><tr><td>External Features</td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>External Features</td><td>Weight</td><td>3.1 Kg</td></tr><tr><td>External Features</td><td>Dimension</td><td>312 × 110 × 246 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td><td>2 Years Parts &amp; Service Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Lamp Warranty</td><td>12 Months or 1000 Hours</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 159500.00, 159500.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/zk8iN1TgHAz2lIBMIXplFLs1EwbXdXqyerJVcBhu.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-11 13:54:06', '2026-06-11 13:54:46', 'BenQ TK700 4K Gaming Projector Price in Bangladesh | 16ms Input Lag | IOS', 'Buy BenQ TK700 4K UHD Gaming Projector from International Office Solution (IOS). Features 3200 ANSI lumens brightness, ultra-low 16ms input lag, HDR support, XPR 4K resolution, and optimized Game Mode for immersive gaming experience.', 'BenQ TK700,\r\nBenQ TK700 Projector,\r\n4K Gaming Projector Bangladesh,\r\nDLP Gaming Projector,\r\n3200 ANSI Lumens Projector,\r\nUltra Low Input Lag Projector,\r\n16ms Gaming Projector,\r\nXPR 4K Projector,\r\nHDR Gaming Projector,\r\nBenQ 4K Projector Bangladesh,\r\nHome Gaming Projector,\r\nGaming Entertainment Projector,\r\nPS5 Xbox Projector,\r\nInternational Office Solution,\r\nIOS Bangladesh Projector', NULL, 41, NULL, NULL),
(383, 'BenQ Projector EX800ST 3300 Lumens XGA Wireless Smart Android', 'The BenQ EX800ST is a 3300 ANSI lumens XGA wireless smart projector with short throw capability, built-in Android tools, cloud connectivity, and collaboration features for modern business meetings. Available in Bangladesh from IOS.', 'benq-projector-ex800st-3300-lumens-xga-wireless-smart-android-1781187445', '<p>The BenQ EX800ST is an advanced wireless smart projector built for modern business collaboration, hybrid meetings, and interactive presentations. It combines high brightness, smart connectivity, and built-in collaboration tools to improve workplace productivity.</p><h3>📡 Wireless Collaboration Made Easy</h3><ul><li>Wireless projection from laptops and smartphones</li><li>Cloud access via Google Drive, OneDrive, Dropbox</li><li>Built-in AMS system for document management</li><li>No cable dependency for presentations</li></ul><h3>💼 Smart Business Tools</h3><ul><li>TeamViewer Meeting for remote conferencing</li><li>WPS Office for editing Microsoft Office files</li><li>Built-in web browser for instant online access</li><li>X-Sign Broadcast for announcements</li></ul><h3>📊 Superior Visual Performance</h3><ul><li>3300 ANSI lumens brightness</li><li>XGA resolution for clear text and visuals</li><li>Short throw lens for compact meeting rooms</li><li>Large screen projection in small spaces</li></ul><h3>📱 Smart Control &amp; Management</h3><ul><li>Smartphone control via BenQ Smart Control app</li><li>Instant note-taking capability</li><li>Easy meeting management tools</li></ul><h3>🏢 Designed for Modern Workplaces</h3><p>The EX800ST is designed to support:</p><ul><li>Corporate boardrooms</li><li>Remote team collaboration</li><li>Training sessions</li><li>Hybrid office environments</li></ul><p>It ensures smooth communication, better engagement, and efficient meeting management.</p><h2>🇧🇩 Availability in Bangladesh</h2><p>The original BenQ EX800ST Wireless Smart Android Projector is available from International Office Solution (IOS) with official warranty and reliable support.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Display Type</td><td>DLP</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Resolution</td><td>XGA (1024 × 768)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Brightness</td><td>3300 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>4:3</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>20,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp</td><td>Lamp Type</td><td>Lamp</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Normal: 5000 hrs, ECO: 10000 hrs, SmartEco: 15000 hrs, LampSave: 15000 hrs</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>1 × 2W</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>D-sub</td><td>1 × D-sub 15pin</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>HDMI</td><td>1 × HDMI 1.4a (HDCP 1.4)</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>LAN</td><td>1 × RJ45</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB Type-A</td><td>3 × USB Type-A</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB Mini-B</td><td>1 × USB Mini-B</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>RS232</td><td>1 × DB-9 Pin</td></tr><tr><td>Smart Features</td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Bluetooth 4.0</td></tr><tr><td>External Features</td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>External Features</td><td>Weight</td><td>2.6 kg</td></tr><tr><td>External Features</td><td>Dimension</td><td>296 × 120 × 250 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td><td>2 Years Parts &amp; Service Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Lamp Warranty</td><td>1 Year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 92500.00, 92500.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/cgvalX9jq6UdTPtHKaddHqkrZL1IXLx5uztdrLoq.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-11 14:17:25', '2026-06-11 14:17:25', 'BenQ EX800ST Wireless Smart Projector Price in Bangladesh | 3300 Lumens | IOS', 'Buy BenQ EX800ST Wireless Smart Android Projector from International Office Solution (IOS). Features 3300 ANSI lumens brightness, XGA resolution, short throw projection, cloud connectivity, TeamViewer Meeting, and smart collaboration tools for business use.', 'BenQ EX800ST,\r\nBenQ EX800ST Projector,\r\nWireless Smart Projector Bangladesh,\r\nBusiness Projector BenQ,\r\nXGA Smart Projector,\r\nShort Throw Business Projector,\r\n3300 ANSI Lumens Projector,\r\nAndroid Smart Projector,\r\nMeeting Room Projector,\r\nCorporate Projector Bangladesh,\r\nCloud Projection Projector,\r\nTeam Collaboration Projector,\r\nBenQ Business Projector,\r\nInternational Office Solution,\r\nIOS Bangladesh Projector', NULL, 41, NULL, NULL),
(384, 'BenQ Projector EW600 3600 Lumens WXGA Wireless Android Smart', 'The BenQ EW600 3600 Lumens WXGA Smart Android Projector delivers bright, clear visuals with wireless projection and built-in Android OS. Featuring TeamViewer Meeting, cloud access, and laptop-free operation, it is ideal for modern offices and classrooms. Offered by International Office Solution with reliable warranty support.', 'benq-projector-ew600-3600-lumens-wxga-wireless-android-smart-1781187878', '<p>The <strong>BenQ EW600 3600 Lumens WXGA Wireless Android Smart Projector</strong> is a powerful and modern projection solution designed to transform any workspace into a fully functional smart meeting environment. Built for today’s hybrid offices and digital collaboration needs, this projector delivers high performance, flexibility, and ease of use in one compact system.</p><p>With a brightness level of <strong>3600 ANSI lumens</strong>, the EW600 produces clear, bright, and professional-quality visuals even in well-lit rooms. Its <strong>WXGA (1280 x 800) resolution</strong> ensures sharp text clarity and smooth image rendering, making it ideal for business presentations, video conferencing, training sessions, and educational use.</p><p>The projector is powered by an <strong>Android-based smart system</strong>, allowing users to operate without a laptop or external PC. It provides direct access to cloud storage platforms such as Google Drive, OneDrive, and Dropbox, enabling seamless preparation and presentation of meeting materials.</p><p>The EW600 supports <strong>driver-free wireless projection</strong>, making it compatible with laptops, smartphones, and tablets without complicated setup. With built-in <strong>TeamViewer Meeting integration</strong>, users can conduct remote meetings effortlessly, ensuring real-time collaboration across global teams.</p><p>Its intelligent broadcast system allows administrators to send instant announcements—such as meeting reminders or time alerts—helping maintain smooth workflow transitions in corporate environments. This makes the EW600 an excellent choice for meeting rooms, classrooms, and collaborative workspaces.</p><p>Designed for productivity and convenience, the projector ensures quick setup, intuitive controls, and flexible connectivity options. Whether used for office meetings, training, or presentations, the BenQ EW600 delivers a complete smart collaboration experience.</p><p>Offered by <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, the EW600 comes with <strong>2 Years Parts &amp; Service Warranty</strong>, and its lamp is supported for up to <strong>6000 hours</strong>, ensuring long-term reliability and cost efficiency.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Display Type</td><td>DLP</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Resolution</td><td>1024 × 768 pixels</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Resolution Support</td><td>VGA (640×480) to WUXGA_RB (1920×1200)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Brightness</td><td>3600 Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Image Size</td><td>60\" – 180\"</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp</td><td>Lamp Power</td><td>200W</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Normal: 5000 hrs, ECO: 10000 hrs, SmartEco: 15000 hrs, LampSave: 15000 hrs</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>2W × 1</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>HDMI</td><td>1 × HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>PC Input</td><td>1 × D-sub 15pin</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Monitor Out</td><td>1 × D-sub 15pin (Female)</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Audio In</td><td>1 × Mini Jack</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Audio Out</td><td>1 × Mini Jack</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>RS232</td><td>1 × D-sub 9pin (Male)</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB Type-A</td><td>3 × USB Type-A (including 5V/1.5A port)</td></tr><tr><td>