(385, 'Buy BenQ Projector EW600 3600 Lumens WXGA Wireless Android Smart Projector from International Office Solution. Enjoy wireless projection, Android OS, cloud access, and TeamViewer integration for smart meetings and collaboration.', 'The BenQ EX600 Wireless Android Smart Projector features 3600 lumens brightness, XGA resolution, built-in Android OS, TeamViewer Meeting, wireless screen sharing, WPS Office, and PC-free USB presentations. Ideal for business meetings, classrooms, and collaborative workspaces, it delivers bright visuals, smart functionality, and seamless connectivity.', 'buy-benq-projector-ew600-3600-lumens-wxga-wireless-android-smart-projector-from-international-office-solution-enjoy-wireless-projection-android-os-cloud-access-and-teamviewer-integration-for-smart-meetings-and-collaboration-1781188201', '<p>The BenQ EX600 3600 Lumens Wireless Android Smart Projector is a powerful all-in-one business and education projection solution designed to simplify collaboration, presentations, and remote meetings. Equipped with advanced wireless connectivity, Android smart features, and high-brightness projection, the EX600 enables organizations to create productive meeting environments without relying on external PCs or complicated cabling.</p><p>Featuring 3600 lumens of brightness and native XGA (1024 x 768) resolution, the projector delivers clear, sharp, and vibrant visuals suitable for conference rooms, classrooms, training centers, and collaborative workspaces. BenQ\'s DLP projection technology ensures long-lasting image quality with zero color decay, maintaining vivid colors and crisp text for years of reliable operation.</p><p>The built-in Android operating system transforms the EX600 into a standalone smart collaboration hub. With integrated TeamViewer Meeting software, users can launch video conferences instantly and connect with remote teams from virtually anywhere. TeamViewer QuickSupport allows IT administrators to remotely access and troubleshoot the projector, minimizing downtime and simplifying maintenance.</p><p>For enhanced productivity, the projector comes preloaded with WPS Office, enabling users to create, edit, and present Word documents, spreadsheets, and presentations directly from the projector. The integrated Firefox browser provides quick internet access, allowing teams to search online resources during meetings without requiring a connected computer.</p><p>The BenQ EX600 supports true PC-free presentations through its USB Type-A ports. Users can directly display PDF files, Microsoft Office documents, images, and other supported file formats from USB storage devices. This feature streamlines presentations and reduces setup time significantly.</p><p>Wireless projection capabilities allow users to mirror content from smartphones, tablets, and laptops instantly. This cable-free solution promotes seamless collaboration, reduces desktop clutter, and improves meeting efficiency. The projector supports dual-band Wi-Fi connectivity and Bluetooth technology, ensuring stable wireless performance across modern devices.</p><p>BenQ Smart Control further enhances convenience by turning a smartphone into a fully functional remote control. Presenters can manage presentations, adjust settings, and navigate content directly from their mobile devices.</p><p>The EX600 incorporates a premium all-glass lens array that minimizes chromatic aberration and delivers superior image clarity. Exclusive Infographic Mode optimizes brightness and color gradation, making charts, graphics, and business data easier to read and understand. High brightness combined with XGA resolution ensures excellent readability even in brightly lit environments.</p><p>Installation flexibility is enhanced with dual adjustment feet, including a retractable foot, allowing easy positioning in different room layouts. Vertical Keystone Correction automatically adjusts image alignment, ensuring perfectly squared projections from various angles. Wall Color Correction optimizes projected colors on non-white surfaces, maintaining accurate image reproduction regardless of the projection surface.</p><p>With support for projection sizes ranging from 60 to 180 inches, the BenQ EX600 adapts easily to small huddle rooms, classrooms, and larger meeting spaces. Its combination of smart functionality, wireless collaboration, and reliable image performance makes it an ideal solution for modern businesses and educational institutions.</p><p>Available from International Office Solution, the BenQ EX600 Wireless Android Smart Projector includes a 1-Year Manufacturing Warranty, ensuring dependable performance and professional support.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>DLP</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>1024 x 768 (XGA)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution Support</td><td>VGA (640 x 480) to WUXGA_RB (1920 x 1200)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>3,600 Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>60\" ~ 180\"</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Power</td><td>200W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life (Normal)</td><td>5,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life (Economic)</td><td>10,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life (SmartEco)</td><td>15,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life (LampSave)</td><td>15,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>2W x 1</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI</td><td>1 x HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>PC Input</td><td>1 x D-sub 15-pin</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Monitor Output</td><td>1 x D-sub 15-pin (Female)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Input</td><td>1 x Mini Jack</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>1 x Mini Jack</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>RS232</td><td>1 x D-sub 9-pin (Male)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB Type-A</td><td>1 x USB Type-A</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB Type-A (Power)</td><td>1 x USB Type-A (5V, 1.5A)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB Type-A (Wireless Dongle)</td><td>1 x Hidden Wireless Dongle Port</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB Mini-B</td><td>1 x USB Mini-B</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>IR Receiver</td><td>Front + Top (2 Receivers)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Wireless Features</strong></td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Bluetooth 4.0</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Wi-Fi</td><td>Dual Band 802.11ac/b/g/n (2.4GHz / 5GHz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Smart System</strong></td><td>Operating System</td><td>Android 6.0</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>ROM/RAM</td><td>16GB / 2GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Supply</td><td>100 ~ 240V AC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption (Max)</td><td>320W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption (Normal)</td><td>280W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption (Eco)</td><td>235W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Standby Power Consumption</td><td>&lt; 0.5W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specifications</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>2.5 Kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>296 x 120 x 232 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>1 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 73500.00, 73500.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/lIGdY8oVLixG32AfhCO1SkaEVvEqJ09LJChd35p6.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-11 14:30:01', '2026-06-11 14:30:01', 'BenQ EX600 3600 Lumens Wireless Android Smart Projector | International Office Solution', 'Buy BenQ EX600 Wireless Android Smart Projector from International Office Solution. Featuring 3600 lumens brightness, Android OS, TeamViewer Meeting, wireless projection, WPS Office, and PC-free presentations.', 'BenQ EX600, BenQ EX600 Projector, Wireless Android Projector, Smart Projector Bangladesh, 3600 Lumens Projector, XGA Projector, Business Projector, Wireless Presentation Projector, TeamViewer Meeting Projector, Android Projector, Office Projector, Classroom Projector, BenQ Smart Projector, International Office Solution', NULL, 41, NULL, NULL),
(386, 'BenQ Projector MX808STH 3600 Lumens XGA Short Throw', 'The BenQ MX808STH is a 3600 ANSI Lumens XGA Short Throw Projector designed for interactive classrooms and collaborative workspaces. Featuring short-throw projection, DLP technology, anti-dust sensor protection, multi-touch support, and excellent image clarity, it delivers engaging presentations and long-lasting performance for educational and professional applications.', 'benq-projector-mx808sth-3600-lumens-xga-short-throw-1781188551', '<p>The BenQ MX808STH 3600 Lumens XGA Short Throw Projector is a powerful and versatile projection solution designed specifically for classrooms, training centers, and collaborative learning environments. Combining high brightness, interactive functionality, and short-throw technology, this projector delivers exceptional image quality while maximizing classroom space and minimizing installation challenges.</p><p>Featuring <strong>3600 ANSI lumens brightness</strong> and <strong>XGA (1024 x 768) resolution</strong>, the MX808STH ensures crystal-clear visuals, sharp text, and vibrant presentations even in brightly lit environments. Its advanced short-throw ratio of <strong>0.61:1</strong> allows users to project large images from a very short distance, eliminating shadows and glare while enabling teachers and presenters to interact freely in front of the screen.</p><p>Designed for modern education, the projector supports interactive teaching with enhanced multi-touch functionality. Combined with optional PointWrite technology, users can write, draw, and collaborate directly on the projected image using pens or fingers. Two PointWrite-enabled projectors can even be paired to create an expanded interactive workspace, opening new possibilities for collaborative learning and digital classrooms.</p><p>The BenQ MX808STH incorporates an innovative <strong>Anti-Dust Accumulation Sensor</strong> that protects critical components from dust buildup. This intelligent feature helps prevent image flickering, color distortion, and unexpected shutdowns, ensuring reliable performance and reducing maintenance requirements.</p><p>Powered by industry-leading DLP technology, the projector maintains long-lasting image quality without color degradation. Its sealed optical engine protects internal components from dust intrusion, preserving image clarity and color accuracy throughout years of operation. Even after lamp replacement, the projector continues to deliver picture quality comparable to a brand-new device.</p><p>The projector’s high DLP pixel fill factor minimizes visible pixel gaps and eliminates the \"screen door effect\" commonly found in other projection technologies. As a result, users enjoy superior text readability, smoother graphics, and enhanced image detail, making it ideal for educational content, presentations, and interactive lessons.</p><p>Installation is fast and convenient thanks to BenQ\'s intuitive setup tools. The Quick Install feature allows users to adjust image size and alignment directly through the on-screen display menu, reducing setup time and simplifying projector positioning. The dedicated Quick Install hotkey on the remote control further streamlines deployment in classrooms and meeting spaces.</p><p>For wireless presentations, the MX808STH supports optional wireless dongles, enabling seamless content sharing from laptops and mobile devices. This cable-free solution enhances collaboration while maintaining a clean and organized learning environment.</p><p>Whether used in schools, universities, training facilities, or corporate meeting rooms, the BenQ MX808STH delivers outstanding brightness, interactive capabilities, and long-term reliability, making it a smart investment for modern educational and professional environments.</p><p>Available from International Office Solution, the BenQ MX808STH comes with a <strong>2-Year Parts &amp; Service Warranty</strong> and <strong>1000-Hour Lamp Warranty</strong>, ensuring dependable performance and peace of mind.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>DLP</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>XGA (1024 x 768)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution Support</td><td>VGA (640 x 480) to WUXGA_RB (1920 x 1200)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>3600 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>20,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>60\" ~ 120\"</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>10W x 1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Acoustic Noise</td><td>34 dBA (Normal), 29 dBA (Economic Mode)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI</td><td>2 x HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>PC Input</td><td>1 x D-Sub 15-pin</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Monitor Output</td><td>1 x D-Sub 15-pin (Female)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Input</td><td>2 x Mini Jack</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>1 x Mini Jack</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>RS232</td><td>1 x D-Sub 9-pin (Male)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB Type-A</td><td>1 x USB Type-A (5V/1.5A Power Supply)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB Mini-B</td><td>1 x USB Mini-B</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Supply</td><td>AC 100 ~ 240V, 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>260W (Typical)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Standby Power Consumption</td><td>&lt; 0.5W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specifications</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>2.6 Kg (5.7 lbs)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>296 (W) × 239 (D) × 120 (H) mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>2 Years Parts &amp; Service Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Warranty</td><td>1000 Hours Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 66000.00, 66000.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/DocPL2e4ipdR68sIj13s6Q63Ry2zf2KslmeveBBX.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-11 14:35:51', '2026-06-11 14:35:51', 'BenQ MX808STH 3600 Lumens XGA Short Throw Interactive Projector | International Office Solution', 'Buy BenQ MX808STH 3600 Lumens XGA Short Throw Projector from International Office Solution. Features interactive learning support, DLP technology, anti-dust sensor, short-throw projection, and superior classroom performance.', 'BenQ MX808STH, BenQ MX808STH Projector, XGA Projector, Short Throw Projector, Interactive Classroom Projector, Education Projector Bangladesh, 3600 Lumens Projector, DLP Projector, PointWrite Projector, BenQ Education Projector, Interactive Learning Projector, Classroom Projector, International Office Solution', NULL, 41, NULL, NULL),
(387, 'Mercusys MT110 SIM Supported 4G LTE Mobile Wi-Fi Pocket Router', 'The Mercusys MT110 SIM Supported 4G LTE Mobile Wi-Fi Pocket Router is a compact and portable networking solution designed for users who need reliable internet access anytime, anywhere. Featuring 4G LTE download speeds of up to 150Mbps and upload speeds of up to 50Mbps, this pocket router creates a secure Wi-Fi hotspot for up to 10 devices simultaneously. Equipped with a 2200mAh battery, Nano SIM support, and advanced wireless security, the MT110 is ideal for travel, remote work, online learning, and everyday mobile connectivity.', 'mercusys-mt110-sim-supported-4g-lte-mobile-wi-fi-pocket-router-1781197911', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Mercusys MT110 SIM Supported 4G LTE Mobile Wi-Fi Pocket Router</strong></h3><p>The Mercusys MT110 SIM Supported 4G LTE Mobile Wi-Fi Pocket Router is an efficient and portable wireless networking device designed to deliver high-speed internet connectivity wherever you go. Whether you are traveling, working remotely, attending online classes, or simply need a backup internet connection, the MT110 offers reliable 4G LTE performance in a compact and lightweight design.</p><p>Powered by advanced 4G LTE technology, the Mercusys MT110 provides download speeds of up to 150Mbps and upload speeds of up to 50Mbps, ensuring smooth web browsing, HD video streaming, video conferencing, and social media access. With support for both FDD-LTE and TDD-LTE networks, along with 3G HSPA+/UMTS compatibility, the device works seamlessly with a wide range of mobile operators across different regions.</p><p>The router operates on the 2.4GHz wireless band and supports IEEE 802.11a/b/g/n standards, delivering Wi-Fi speeds of up to 150Mbps. It can share a single mobile internet connection with up to 10 wireless devices simultaneously, making it ideal for families, small teams, and travelers who need multiple connected devices.</p><p>For enhanced portability, the Mercusys MT110 is equipped with a powerful 2200mAh rechargeable battery that provides up to 10 hours of continuous operation on a single charge. The integrated Nano SIM card slot enables quick plug-and-play installation without complicated configuration procedures. Simply insert a SIM card and enjoy instant internet access.</p><p>Security remains a priority with support for WPA-PSK and WPA2-PSK encryption protocols, wireless MAC filtering, and SSID broadcast control. These features help protect your network from unauthorized access while maintaining stable and secure connections.</p><p>The device also includes intuitive LED indicators for Wi-Fi status, internet connectivity, and battery level, allowing users to monitor network performance at a glance. Through the dedicated MERCUSYS mobile application, users can easily manage network settings, connected devices, and data usage from their smartphone.</p><p>Combining portability, reliable connectivity, long battery life, and user-friendly management, the Mercusys MT110 SIM Supported 4G LTE Mobile Wi-Fi Pocket Router is an excellent solution for users seeking fast and secure internet access on the move.</p><h2><strong>Why Choose Mercusys MT110?</strong></h2><ul><li>High-Speed 4G LTE connectivity up to 150Mbps</li><li>Supports Nano SIM card for instant internet access</li><li>Share internet with up to 10 devices simultaneously</li><li>Portable design with built-in 2200mAh battery</li><li>Up to 10 hours of continuous usage</li><li>Advanced WPA/WPA2 wireless security</li><li>Easy management via MERCUSYS mobile app</li><li>Compact and travel-friendly design</li></ul><h2><strong>Buy Mercusys MT110 SIM Supported 4G LTE Mobile Wi-Fi Pocket Router from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>Purchase the original Mercusys MT110 SIM Supported 4G LTE Mobile Wi-Fi Pocket Router from International Office Solution, a trusted supplier of genuine networking products in Bangladesh. We offer competitive pricing, authentic products, professional customer support,