(388, 'TP-Link M7000 150Mbps 4G LTE Mobile Wi-Fi Router', 'The TP-Link M7000 150Mbps 4G LTE Mobile Wi-Fi Router is a compact and portable wireless hotspot device that delivers fast 4G LTE internet connectivity wherever you go. Supporting download speeds of up to 150Mbps and sharing internet access with up to 10 devices simultaneously, the M7000 is ideal for travel, business trips, remote work, and everyday mobile connectivity. Its built-in 2000mAh rechargeable battery provides up to 8 hours of continuous usage, while the tpMiFi App enables easy network management.', 'tp-link-m7000-150mbps-4g-lte-mobile-wi-fi-router-1781198433', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The TP-Link M7000 150Mbps 4G LTE Mobile Wi-Fi Router is designed to provide reliable, high-speed internet access on the move. Featuring support for the latest 4G FDD-LTE and TDD-LTE networks, this portable router ensures seamless connectivity across a wide range of countries and mobile operators, making it an excellent companion for travelers, remote workers, and mobile professionals.</p><p>With download speeds of up to 150Mbps and upload speeds of up to 50Mbps, the TP-Link M7000 enables smooth web browsing, HD video streaming, video conferencing, online learning, and social networking. Simply insert a compatible SIM card and instantly create your own personal wireless hotspot without requiring complex setup procedures.</p><p>Equipped with powerful internal antennas, the router delivers stable wireless coverage and reliable signal performance. The M7000 can simultaneously connect and share internet access with up to 10 Wi-Fi-enabled devices, including smartphones, tablets, laptops, smart TVs, and other wireless devices.</p><p>The integrated 2000mAh rechargeable battery provides up to 8 hours of uninterrupted wireless connectivity, allowing users to stay connected throughout the day without constantly searching for a power source. Its lightweight and pocket-sized design makes it easy to carry in a bag, backpack, or pocket.</p>