(389, 'TP-Link M7200 150MBPS 4G LTE Sim Supported Portable Hotspot Pocket Router', 'The TP-Link M7200 4G LTE SIM Supported Portable Mobile Wi-Fi Hotspot Router is a compact and travel-friendly networking solution that provides fast 4G LTE internet access wherever you go. Supporting download speeds of up to 150Mbps and sharing connectivity with up to 10 devices simultaneously, the M7200 is ideal for travel, business trips, outdoor activities, and remote work. Its built-in 2000mAh rechargeable battery delivers up to 8 hours of continuous usage, ensuring reliable connectivity throughout the day.', 'tp-link-m7200-150mbps-4g-lte-sim-supported-portable-hotspot-pocket-router-1781199037', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>TP-Link M7200 4G LTE SIM Supported Portable Mobile Wi-Fi Hotspot Router</strong></h3><p>The TP-Link M7200 4G LTE SIM Supported Portable Mobile Wi-Fi Hotspot Router is designed to deliver high-speed internet connectivity on the move. With support for the latest 4G FDD-LTE and TDD-LTE networks, the M7200 provides stable and reliable wireless internet access in most countries and regions, making it an excellent companion for travelers, professionals, students, and outdoor enthusiasts.</p><p>Featuring download speeds of up to 150Mbps and upload speeds of up to 50Mbps, the TP-Link M7200 enables smooth HD video streaming, web browsing, online meetings, social networking, and file downloads. Simply insert a compatible SIM card and press the power button to create a personal Wi-Fi hotspot within seconds—no complicated setup or technical expertise required.</p><p>The router can share a single 4G/3G internet connection with up to 10 wireless devices simultaneously, including smartphones, tablets, laptops, gaming devices, and smart gadgets. This makes it ideal for families, small teams, and groups traveling together.</p><p>Powered by a built-in 2000mAh rechargeable battery, the TP-Link M7200 provides up to 8 hours of uninterrupted wireless connectivity on a single charge. It