(390, 'Cudy MF4 4G LTE Sim Supported Mobile Wi-Fi Router', 'The Cudy MF4 4G LTE SIM Supported Mobile Wi-Fi Router is a compact and portable hotspot device designed to provide fast and reliable internet access anywhere. Supporting 4G LTE speeds up to 150Mbps, it allows users to connect up to 10 devices simultaneously. With a built-in 2000mAh rechargeable battery offering up to 7 hours of usage, it is an ideal solution for travel, remote work, and mobile connectivity needs.', 'cudy-mf4-4g-lte-sim-supported-mobile-wi-fi-router-1781199287', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Cudy MF4 4G LTE SIM Supported Mobile Wi-Fi Router is a lightweight and travel-friendly networking device designed to keep you connected wherever you go. With its compact design, it easily fits into your pocket or bag, making it highly convenient for users who need internet access on the move.</p><p>Powered by advanced 4G LTE technology, the Cudy MF4 delivers download and upload speeds of up to 150Mbps, ensuring smooth browsing, video streaming, online meetings, and social media access. It supports a wide range of mobile network operators through SIM card integration, allowing flexible connectivity in different regions.</p><p>The device enables users to create a personal Wi-Fi hotspot and share internet access with up to 10 devices simultaneously, including smartphones, tablets, laptops, gaming consoles, and other Wi-Fi-enabled devices. This makes it suitable for both personal and small group usage.</p><p>Equipped with a powerful 2000mAh rechargeable battery, the Cudy MF4 provides up to 7 hours of continuous operation, ensuring stable connectivity throughout the day. Its efficient power management makes it reliable for travel, outdoor activities, and emergency internet backup.</p><p>Setup is simple and user-friendly—just insert a SIM card and power on the device to start enjoying high-speed internet within seconds. With stable performance, portability, and ease of use, the Cudy MF4 is an excellent companion for mo