(391, 'Jio MF680s SIM Supported 4G LTE Mobile Wi-Fi Pocket Router', 'The Jio MF680s SIM Supported 4G LTE Mobile Wi-Fi Pocket Router is a high-speed portable hotspot designed for reliable internet connectivity on the go. Supporting download speeds of up to 300Mbps, it allows seamless streaming, browsing, and gaming. With a 2100mAh battery and support for up to 10+1 users simultaneously, it is ideal for travel, small offices, students, and professionals. Its compact design and dual antenna system ensure strong and stable connectivity anywhere.', 'jio-mf680s-sim-supported-4g-lte-mobile-wi-fi-pocket-router-1781199619', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Jio MF680s SIM Supported 4G LTE Mobile Wi-Fi Pocket Router is a powerful and portable networking solution built for fast, stable, and convenient internet access. Designed for modern digital lifestyles, it supports both 3G and 4G LTE networks, making it compatible with a wide range of SIM cards across different regions.</p><p>With blazing-fast download speeds of up to 300Mbps, the Jio MF680s ensures smooth HD streaming, online gaming, video conferencing, and fast file downloads. The device operates on a 2.4GHz frequency band, delivering stable Wi-Fi performance for multiple connected devices.</p><p>This pocket router supports simultaneous connectivity for up to 10+1 users, making it ideal for families, small offices, group travel, and shared internet usage. It features essential controls including Power, Reset, and WPS buttons for quick setup and easy management.</p><p>Equipped with a powerful 2100mAh rechargeable battery, the Jio MF680s provides extended wireless usage without frequent charging, making it highly suitable for outdoor activities and travel. Its dual 4G antennas combined with 2x2 Wi-Fi antennas enhance signal strength, coverage, and overall network stability even in challenging environments.</p><p>The device’s compact and lightweight design ensures maximum portability, allowing users to carry it easily in pockets, bags, 