(392, 'Zyxel WAH7601 4G LTE Portable Router', 'The Zyxel WAH7601 4G LTE Portable Router is a compact and reliable mobile hotspot designed to deliver stable internet connectivity anywhere. Supporting download speeds up to 150Mbps, it allows seamless browsing, streaming, and communication. With support for 4G/3G/2G multi-mode networks and up to 10 connected devices, it is an ideal travel companion for personal and shared internet access. Its lithium polymer battery ensures safer and longer-lasting performance compared to typical smartphone hotspots.', 'zyxel-wah7601-4g-lte-portable-router-1781199927', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Zyxel WAH7601 4G LTE Portable Router is designed to provide instant, stable, and efficient internet connectivity on the go. Unlike smartphone hotspots that consume battery and resources, this dedicated portable router focuses entirely on delivering strong Wi-Fi performance, ensuring better speed, stability, and battery efficiency.</p><p>With support for 4G LTE networks offering download speeds of up to 150Mbps, the Zyxel WAH7601 ensures smooth online experiences including HD video streaming, web browsing, online meetings, and social media usage. It also supports 3G and 2G fallback, making it suitable for regions with varying network coverage and operator compatibility.</p><p>The device supports multi-band LTE frequencies, including TDD Band 38 and 40, ensuring broader network support across different countries and telecom operators. Simply insert a mini SIM card, and the plug-and-play design allows users to establish a secure internet connection within seconds.</p><p>The Zyxel WAH7601 can connect up to 10 Wi-Fi devices simultaneously, including smartphones, tablets, laptops, and other wireless gadgets. This makes it ideal for families, small groups, and business users who need shared connectivity.</p><p>Equipped with a lithium polymer battery, the device offers longer and safer operation compared to standard lithium-ion batteries, with improved heat resistance and stable performance. Its compact design makes it highly portable, fitting easily into pockets or bags for travel and outdoor use.</p><p>By freeing up your smartphone from hotspot duties, the Zyxel WAH7601 improves efficiency, saves phone battery life, and provides a more stable and dedicated internet connection for all connected devices.</p><h2><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul><li>4G LTE download speed up to 150Mbps</li><li>Supports 4G / 3G / 2G multi-mode networks</li><li>Plug-and-play SIM card setup</li><li>Supports up to 10 connected Wi-Fi devices</li><li>Compact and travel-friendly design</li><li>Stable and dedicated hotspot performance</li><li>Lithium polymer battery for safer operation</li><li>Improved battery life compared to smartphone hotspots</li><li>Multi-band LTE support including TDD Band 38 &amp; 40</li><li>Ideal for travel, business, and outdoor use</li><li>1-year manufacturer warranty</li></ul><h2><strong>Buy Zyxel WAH7601 4G LTE Portable Router from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>Get the original Zyxel WAH7601 4G LTE Portable Router from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, a trusted supplier of networking devices in Bangladesh. We provide authentic products, competitive pricing, and reliable customer support with nationwide delivery services.</p><p>The Zyxel WAH7601 comes with a <strong>1-Year Manufacturer Warranty</strong>.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Network &amp; Connectivity</strong></td><td>4G LTE Standard</td><td>3GPP Release 9, Category 4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Network &amp; Connectivity</strong></td><td>4G Download Speed</td><td>Up to 150 Mbps (20 MHz bandwidth)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Network &amp; Connectivity</strong></td><td>4G Upload Speed</td><td>Up to 50 Mbps (20 MHz bandwidth)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Network &amp; Connectivi