(393, 'Intel Core i3-12100 12th Gen Budget Desktop PC', 'The Intel Core i3-12100 12th Gen Budget Desktop PC from International Office Solution is an affordable and reliable computing solution designed for everyday office work, online classes, business applications, and multitasking. Powered by the Intel Core i3-12100 processor, 8GB DDR4 RAM, and a fast 256GB NVMe SSD, this desktop delivers smooth performance, quick boot times, and efficient productivity in a compact and budget-friendly package.', 'intel-core-i3-12100-12th-gen-budget-desktop-pc-1781258971', '<p>The <strong>Intel Core i3-12100 12th Gen Budget Desktop PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a cost-effective yet powerful desktop solution built for students, professionals, small businesses, and home users. Combining modern hardware with dependable performance, this desktop PC is designed to handle everyday computing tasks efficiently while maintaining excellent value for money.</p><p>At the heart of the system is the <strong>Intel Core i3-12100 12th Generation Alder Lake Processor</strong>, featuring 4 cores and 8 threads with a base clock speed of 3.3GHz and a turbo boost frequency of up to 4.3GHz. Built on Intel\'s advanced architecture, the processor delivers responsive performance for office applications, web browsing, online meetings, content consumption, and light productivity workloads.</p><p>The system is powered by the <strong>MSI PRO H610M-S DDR4 m-ATX Motherboard</strong>, providing a stable and reliable platform for the latest Intel 12th Generation processors. Its compact micro-ATX design offers essential connectivity and expansion options while ensuring long-term reliability.</p><p>For smooth multitasking and responsive system performance, the desktop comes equipped with <strong>8GB Corsair Vengeance LPX DDR4 3200MHz RAM</strong>. This high-quality memory module allows users to work efficiently across multiple applications while maintaining stable performance.</p><p>Storage is handled by the <strong>Colorful CN600 PRO 256GB M.2 NVMe SSD</strong>, which offers significantly faster read and write speeds compared to traditional hard drives. The SSD enables rapid system boot-up, quick application launches, and improved overall responsiveness, helping users stay productive throughout the day.</p><p>The components are housed inside the <strong>T-Wolf SHADOWCORE OFFICE mATX Mid Tower Casing</strong>, which includes a built-in <strong>200W Power Supply Unit</strong>. The casing features a modern design with efficient airflow support and multiple fan mounting options, helping maintain optimal operating temperatures during daily use.</p><p>Whether you need a dependable office workstation, an educational computer for online learning, or a budget-friendly desktop for home use, the <strong>Intel Core i3-12100 12th Gen Budget Desktop PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> provides an excellent balance of performance, reliability, and affordability.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Processor</strong></td><td>Model</td><td>Intel Core i3-12100 12th Gen Alder Lake Processor (Tray Box)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>03 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Motherboard</strong></td><td>Model</td><td>MSI PRO H610M-S DDR4 m-ATX Motherboard</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>03 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory &amp; Storage</strong></td><td>RAM</td><td>Corsair Vengeance LPX 8GB 3200MHz DDR4 Desktop RAM</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>RAM Warranty</td><td>Lifetime Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>SSD</td><td>Colorful CN600 PRO 256GB M.2 NVMe SSD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>SSD Warranty</td><td>03 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Casing &amp; Power</strong></td><td>Casing</td><td>T-Wolf SHADOWCORE OFFICE mATX Mid Tower Casing</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><