(394, 'Intel 10th Gen Core i5-10400 Desktop PC', 'The Intel Core i5-10400 Budget Desktop PC from International Office Solution is a reliable and affordable computing solution for office work, business applications, online learning, and everyday multitasking. Equipped with a 10th Gen Intel Core i5 processor, 8GB DDR4 RAM, and a fast 256GB NVMe SSD, this desktop delivers responsive performance and dependable productivity for home and office users.', 'intel-10th-gen-core-i5-10400-desktop-pc-1781259251', '<p>The <strong>Intel Core i5-10400 Budget Desktop PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is designed to provide excellent performance, reliability, and value for professionals, students, and home users. Powered by the <strong>Intel Core i5-10400 10th Generation Processor</strong>, this desktop is capable of handling office productivity, business applications, web browsing, online meetings, and multitasking with ease.</p><p>At the core of the system is the <strong>Intel Core i5-10400 Processor</strong>, featuring 6 cores and 12 threads with Intel Turbo Boost Technology for enhanced performance during demanding tasks. Its efficient architecture ensures smooth operation across a wide range of applications while maintaining excellent power efficiency.</p><p>The desktop is built on the <strong>ASUS PRIME H510M-F R3.0 Micro-ATX Motherboard</strong>, offering stable performance, reliable connectivity, and support for essential modern computing requirements. The motherboard provides a solid foundation for long-term everyday use.</p><p>For memory, the system includes <strong>8GB Corsair Vengeance LPX DDR4 3200MHz RAM</strong>, ensuring smooth multitasking and efficient application performance. Users can comfortably run multiple programs simultaneously without experiencing significant slowdowns.</p><p>Storage is provided by the <strong>Colorful CN600 PRO 256GB M.2 NVMe SSD</strong>, which delivers high-speed data access, fast system boot times, and quick application loading. Compared to traditional hard drives, the NVMe SSD significantly improves overall system responsiveness.</p><p>The components are housed inside the <strong>T-Wolf Phantom X4 RGB M-ATX Mid Tower Gaming Case</strong>, featuring an attractive RGB design and a built-in <strong>200W Power Supply Unit</strong>. The case offers adequate airflow and a modern appearance suitable for both office and home environments.</p><p>Whether you need a dependable office workstation, an educational desktop, or a budget-friendly computer for daily computing tasks, the <strong>Intel Core i5-10400 Budget Desktop PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> provides a practical combination of performance, efficiency, and affordability.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Model</td><td>Intel Core i5-10400 10th Gen Processor</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Warranty</td><td>03 Years Warranty (No Warranty for Fan/Cooler)</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Model</td><td>ASUS PRIME H510M-F R3.0 LGA1200 Micro-ATX Motherboard</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Warranty</td><td>03 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Capacity &amp; Speed</td><td>Corsair Vengeance LPX 8GB 3200MHz DDR4 Desktop RAM</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Lifetime Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Type &amp; Capacity</td><td>Colorful CN600 PRO 256GB M.2 NVMe SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Warranty</td><td>03 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Casing</td><td>Model</td><td>T-Wolf Phantom X4 RGB M-ATX Mid Tower Gaming Case</td></tr><tr><td>Power Supply</td><td>PSU</td><td>Built-in 200W Power Supply</td></tr><tr><td>Casing</td><td>Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Desktop', 42200.00, 42200.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/UzU2HmVUd7NQ59e7p8HXhMiZNZMtlBJqQu518xNW.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 10:14:11', '2026-06-12 10:14:11', 'Intel Core i5-10400 Budget Desktop PC | 8GB RAM 256GB NVMe SSD | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Intel Core i5-10400 Budget Desktop PC from International Office Solution. Featuring a 10th Gen Intel Core i5 processor, ASUS H510M motherboard, 8GB DDR4 RAM, and 256GB NVMe SSD for reliable everyday computing and office productivity.', 'Intel Core i5-10400 Desktop PC, Intel i5 Budget PC, 10th Gen Intel Desktop, ASUS H510M Desktop, Office Desktop PC Bangladesh, Business Computer, Student Desktop PC, 8GB DDR4 RAM PC, NVMe SSD Desktop, Budget Gaming PC, Home Desktop Computer, Productivity Desktop, Intel Core i5 Computer, Desktop PC Bangladesh, Affordable Desktop PC, International Office Solution, Intel Office PC, Workstation PC, Entry Level Business PC, Desktop Computer Package', NULL, 5, NULL, NULL);
