(395, 'Intel 12th Gen Core i5-12400 Desktop PC', 'The Intel Core i5-12400 12th Gen Budget Desktop PC from International Office Solution delivers exceptional performance for office work, business applications, online learning, and multitasking. Featuring the powerful Intel Core i5-12400 Alder Lake processor, 8GB DDR4 RAM, and a fast 256GB NVMe SSD, this desktop provides responsive performance and reliable productivity at an affordable price.', 'intel-12th-gen-core-i5-12400-desktop-pc-1781259408', '<p>The <strong>Intel Core i5-12400 12th Gen Budget Desktop PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a powerful and cost-effective desktop solution designed for professionals, students, freelancers, and home users. Built with modern components and Intel\'s advanced Alder Lake architecture, this desktop delivers outstanding performance for everyday productivity, office applications, online meetings, content consumption, and multitasking.</p><p>At the heart of the system is the <strong>Intel Core i5-12400 12th Generation Alder Lake Processor</strong>, featuring 6 cores and 12 threads with impressive clock speeds for smooth and efficient computing. Whether you\'re handling spreadsheets, presentations, web-based applications, or multiple tasks simultaneously, the processor ensures fast and reliable performance.</p><p>The desktop is powered by the <strong>MSI PRO H610M-S DDR4 m-ATX Motherboard</strong>, providing a stable platform with support for Intel 12th Generation processors. Its dependable design and essential connectivity options make it ideal for long-term productivity and business use.</p><p>For memory, the system includes <strong>Colorful Battle-AX 8GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM</strong>, delivering smooth multitasking and responsive system performance. The high-speed memory allows users to efficiently run multiple applications and browser tabs without significant slowdowns.</p><p>Storage is provided by the <strong>Colorful CN600 PRO 256GB M.2 NVMe SSD</strong>, which offers fast boot times, quick application launches, and rapid file access. The NVMe technology significantly improves system responsiveness compared to traditional storage solutions.</p><p>The components are housed inside the stylish <strong>T-Wolf Phantom X4 RGB M-ATX Mid Tower Gaming Case</strong>, complete with a built-in <strong>200W Power Supply Unit</strong>. The RGB lighting enhances the overall appearance, while the spacious interior supports proper airflow for stable operation.</p><p>Whether you need a reliable office workstation, a home productivity computer, or a budget-friendly desktop with modern performance, the <strong>Intel Core i5-12400 12th Gen Budget Desktop PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> offers an excellent combination of speed, reliability, and value.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Model</td><td>Intel Core i5-12400 12th Gen Alder Lake Processor</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Warranty</td><td>03 Years Warranty (No Warranty for Fan/Cooler)</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Model</td><td>MSI PRO H610M-S DDR4 m-ATX Motherboard</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Warranty</td><td>03 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Capacity &amp; Speed</td><td>Colorful Battle-AX 8GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Lifetime Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Type &amp; Capacity</td><td>Colorful CN600 PRO 256GB M.2 NVMe SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Warranty</td><td>03 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Casing</td><td>Model</td><td>T-Wolf Phantom X4 RGB M-ATX Mid Tower Gaming Case</td></tr><tr><td>Power Supply</td><td>PSU</td><td>Built-in 200W Power Supply</td></tr><tr><td>Casing</td><td>Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Desktop', 50100.00, 50100.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/x5dOJW7QjPTVLPoJNqv3c4mZEbnrnw1KJGPiZ7KY.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 10:16:48', '2026-06-12 10:17:03', 'Intel Core i5-12400 12th Gen Budget Desktop PC | 8GB RAM 256GB NVMe SSD | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Intel Core i5-12400 12th Gen Budget Desktop PC from International Office Solution. Featuring Intel Alder Lake Core i5 processor, MSI H610M motherboard, 8GB DDR4 RAM, and 256GB NVMe SSD for fast and reliable everyday computing.', 'Intel Core i5-12400 Desktop PC, Intel 12th Gen Desktop, Alder Lake Desktop PC, Budget Desktop PC Bangladesh, MSI PRO H610M-S, Colorful Battle AX RAM, Colorful CN600 PRO SSD, Office Desktop PC, Business Computer, Student Desktop PC, Home Computer, Productivity Desktop, NVMe SSD Desktop, Intel Core i5 Computer, Desktop Computer Bangladesh, Affordable Desktop PC, International Office Solution, Office Workstation, Entry Level Business PC, Intel 12th Gen Computer', NULL, 5, NULL, NULL),
(396, 'MSI BZ09 Core i5-14400 H610M DDR4 Mini Tower PC With MAG A500N-H Power Supply', 'The Intel Core i5-14400 14th Gen Desktop PC from International Office Solution is a powerful and future-ready computing solution designed for business, office productivity, multitasking, and everyday computing. Equipped with a 14th Gen Intel Core i5 processor, 8GB DDR4 RAM, 256GB NVMe SSD, MSI H610 motherboard, and a reliable 500W power supply, this desktop delivers excellent performance and stability for modern workloads.', 'msi-bz09-core-i5-14400-h610m-ddr4-mini-tower-pc-with-mag-a500n-h-power-supply-1781259580', '<h3>Intel Core i5-14400 14th Gen Desktop PC</h3><p>The <strong>Intel Core i5-14400 14th Gen Desktop PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is designed to provide outstanding performance, efficiency, and reliability for professionals, businesses, students, and home users. Built with the latest Intel 14th Generation processor technology, this desktop offers the power required for multitasking, office applications, online collaboration, content creation, and everyday computing tasks.</p><p>At the heart of the system is the <strong>Intel Core i5-14400 14th Gen Processor</strong>, featuring advanced hybrid architecture and turbo boost speeds of up to <strong>4.70GHz</strong>. The processor delivers smooth responsiveness, faster application performance, and efficient multitasking, making it an excellent choice for modern productivity requirements.</p><p>The system is built on the <strong>MSI PRO H610M-S DDR4 Motherboard</strong>, powered by the Intel H610 chipset. This reliable platform supports Intel\'s latest processors and offers stable performance, essential connectivity, and future upgrade possibilities for business and home users.</p><p>For memory, the desktop includes <strong>8GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM</strong> operating in a dual-channel capable platform. The high-speed memory ensures smooth multitasking, responsive application performance, and efficient workflow management.</p><p>Storage is handled by a <strong>256GB M.2 NVMe SSD</strong>, delivering rapid boot times, fast file transfers, and quick application loading speeds. Compared to conventional storage devices, the NVMe SSD significantly improves overall system responsiveness and user experience.</p><p>The desktop is housed in the <strong>MSI PRO SHIELD M100P Mini Tower Case</strong>, offering a compact and professional design with excellent airflow support. The case includes convenient front I/O ports, expansion options, and support for future hardware upgrades.</p><p>Power is supplied by the <strong>MSI MAG A500N-H 500W Power Supply</strong>, featuring Active PFC and multiple protection mechanisms including OVP, SCP, OPP, and UVP to ensure stable and reliable system operation. The 120mm hydraulic bearing fan helps maintain efficient cooling while reducing noise.</p><p>Additional features include <strong>Realtek RTL8111H Gigabit LAN</strong>, 7.1 Channel HD Audio with Audio Boost technology, HDMI output supporting up to 4K resolution, and PCIe expansion slots for future upgrades.</p><p>Whether you\'re building a professional workstation, office desktop, educational system, or reliable home computer, the <strong>Intel Core i5-14400 14th Gen Desktop PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> delivers exceptional value, modern performance, and dependable reliability.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Model</td><td>Intel Core i5-14400 14th Gen Processor</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Speed</td><td>Up to 4.70GHz Turbo Boost</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Model</td><td>MSI PRO H610M-S DDR4, Intel H610 Chipset</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Capacity</td><td>8GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Memory Support</td><td>2 DIMMs, Dual Channel DDR4-3200MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>SSD</td><td>256GB M.2 NVMe SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Expansion</td><td>1 x M.2 Gen3 x4 Slot, 2 x SATA 6Gbps Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics</td><td>Expansion Slot</td><td>1 x PCIe 4.0 x16, 1 x PCIe 3.0 x1</td></tr><tr><td>Monitor Support</td><td>Display Output</td><td>HDMI with up to 4K@30Hz Support</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Audio System</td><td>7.1 Channel HD Audio with Audio Boost</td></tr><tr><td>Network</td><td>LAN</td><td>Realtek RTL8111H Gigabit LAN</td></tr><tr><td>Casing</td><td>Model</td><td>MSI PRO SHIELD M100P Mini Tower</td></tr><tr><td>Casing</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>290 x 166 x 352 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Power Supply</td><td>Model</td><td>MSI MAG A500N-H</td></tr><tr><td>Power Supply</td><td>Capacity</td><td>500W</td></tr><tr><td>Power Supply</td><td>Protection</td><td>OVP / SCP / OPP / UVP</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Chassis Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Coverage</td><td>3-Year Limited Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Desktop', 56500.00, 56500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/Y2qt1GecTRiI9IvH04fwVA2EybaRKmOZERSgFsZ6.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 10:19:40', '2026-06-12 10:19:50', 'Intel Core i5-14400 14th Gen Desktop PC | 8GB RAM 256GB NVMe SSD | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Intel Core i5-14400 14th Gen Desktop PC from International Office Solution. Features Intel Core i5-14400 processor, MSI H610 motherboard, 8GB DDR4 RAM, 256GB NVMe SSD, and 500W PSU for powerful and reliable computing.', 'Intel Core i5-14400 Desktop PC, Intel 14th Gen Desktop, Intel Core i5 14400 PC, MSI H610 Desktop PC, Business Desktop Computer, Office Desktop PC Bangladesh, Productivity Desktop, 8GB DDR4 Desktop, 256GB NVMe SSD PC, MSI PRO SHIELD M100P, MSI MAG A500N-H, Intel Desktop Bangladesh, Home Computer, Professional Workstation, Affordable Desktop PC, International Office Solution, Intel Business PC, Office Workstation Bangladesh, Desktop Computer Package, 14th Gen Intel PC', NULL, 5, NULL, NULL),
(397, 'Intel Core i5 14500 14th Gen Desktop PC', 'Intel Core i5-14500 14th Gen Desktop PC\r\n\r\nThe Intel Core i5-14500 14th Gen Desktop PC from International Office Solution is built to provide exceptional performance, efficiency, and reliability for professionals, businesses, students, and advanced home users. Featuring Intel\'s latest Raptor Lake architecture, this desktop is capable of handling demanding office applications, multitasking, business software, content creation, online collaboration, and everyday computing with ease.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the system is the Intel Core i5-14500 14th Generation Raptor Lake Processor, delivering excellent processing power with advanced multi-core performance and intelligent workload management. Whether you\'re working on large spreadsheets, attending virtual meetings, running business applications, or handling multiple tasks simultaneously, the processor ensures smooth and responsive performance.\r\n\r\nThe system is built around the MSI PRO H610M-S DDR4 m-ATX Motherboard, providing a stable and dependable platform for Intel\'s latest processors. The motherboard offers essential connectivity, durability, and upgrade flexibility, making it ideal for long-term productivity and professional use.\r\n\r\nFor memory, the desktop comes equipped with 16GB Corsair Vengeance LPX DDR4 3200MHz RAM, ensuring smooth multitasking and efficient performance across demanding applications. The increased memory capacity allows users to work with multiple programs, browser tabs, and productivity tools without performance bottlenecks.\r\n\r\nStorage is powered by the Colorful CN600 PRO 256GB M.2 NVMe SSD, providing rapid boot times, fast application loading, and responsive file access. NVMe technology significantly enhances system speed and overall user experience compared to traditional storage solutions.\r\n\r\nThe components are housed inside the stylish MSI MAG PANO M110A Micro-ATX Mid Tower Gaming Casing, featuring a modern panoramic design that combines aesthetics with practical airflow management. The spacious interior allows for efficient cooling and future component upgrades.\r\n\r\nPower is supplied by the reliable Gamdias AURA GP300 300W Power Supply, designed to provide stable power delivery for everyday computing tasks while ensuring system reliability and protection.\r\n\r\nThe Intel Core i5-14500 14th Gen Desktop PC from International Office Solution is an excellent choice for businesses, professionals, educational institutions, and home users seeking a powerful, efficient, and future-ready desktop computer.', 'intel-core-i5-14500-14th-gen-desktop-pc-1781259765', '<h3>Intel Core i5-14500 14th Gen Desktop PC</h3><p>The <strong>Intel Core i5-14500 14th Gen Desktop PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is built to provide exceptional performance, efficiency, and reliability for professionals, businesses, students, and advanced home users. Featuring Intel\'s latest Raptor Lake architecture, this desktop is capable of handling demanding office applications, multitasking, business software, content creation, online collaboration, and everyday computing with ease.</p><p>At the heart of the system is the <strong>Intel Core i5-14500 14th Generation Raptor Lake Processor</strong>, delivering excellent processing power with advanced multi-core performance and intelligent workload management. Whether you\'re working on large spreadsheets, attending virtual meetings, running business applications, or handling multiple tasks simultaneously, the processor ensures smooth and responsive performance.</p><p>The system is built around the <strong>MSI PRO H610M-S DDR4 m-ATX Motherboard</strong>, providing a stable and dependable platform for Intel\'s latest processors. The motherboard offers essential connectivity, durability, and upgrade flexibility, making it ideal for long-term productivity and professional use.</p><p>For memory, the desktop comes equipped with <strong>16GB Corsair Vengeance LPX DDR4 3200MHz RAM</strong>, ensuring smooth multitasking and efficient performance across demanding applications. The increased memory capacity allows users to work with multiple programs, browser tabs, and productivity tools without performance bottlenecks.</p><p>Storage is powered by the <strong>Colorful CN600 PRO 256GB M.2 NVMe SSD</strong>, providing rapid boot times, fast application loading, and responsive file access. NVMe technology significantly enhances system speed and overall user experience compared to traditional storage solutions.</p><p>The components are housed inside the stylish <strong>MSI MAG PANO M110A Micro-ATX Mid Tower Gaming Casing</strong>, featuring a modern panoramic design that combines aesthetics with practical airflow management. The spacious interior allows for efficient cooling and future component upgrades.</p><p>Power is supplied by the reliable <strong>Gamdias AURA GP300 300W Power Supply</strong>, designed to provide stable power delivery for everyday computing tasks while ensuring system reliability and protection.</p><p>The <strong>Intel Core i5-14500 14th Gen Desktop PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is an excellent choice for businesses, professionals, educational institutions, and home users seeking a powerful, efficient, and future-ready desktop computer.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Model</td><td>Intel Core i5-14500 14th Gen Raptor Lake Processor (Tray with Fan)</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Warranty</td><td>03 Years Warranty (No Warranty for Fan/Cooler)</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Model</td><td>MSI PRO H610M-S DDR4 m-ATX Motherboard</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Warranty</td><td>03 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Capacity &amp; Speed</td><td>Corsair Vengeance LPX 16GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Lifetime Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Type &amp; Capacity</td><td>Colorful CN600 PRO 256GB M.2 NVMe SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Warranty</td><td>03 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Casing</td><td>Model</td><td>MSI MAG PANO M110A Micro-ATX Mid Tower Gaming Casing</td></tr><tr><td>Casing</td><td>Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Power Supply</td><td>Model</td><td>Gamdias AURA GP300 Power Supply</td></tr><tr><td>Power Supply</td><td>Capacity</td><td>300W</td></tr><tr><td>Power Supply</td><td>Warranty</td><td>03 Years Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', 'Desktop', 64200.00, 64200.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/crVBdGI6wygzuyE81smAKO4Qj2TKpg7hbOpptlKr.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 10:22:45', '2026-06-12 10:22:45', 'Intel Core i5-14500 14th Gen Desktop PC | 16GB RAM 256GB NVMe SSD | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Intel Core i5-14500 14th Gen Desktop PC from International Office Solution. Featuring Intel Core i5-14500 processor, 16GB DDR4 RAM, 256GB NVMe SSD, MSI H610 motherboard, and Gamdias 300W PSU for powerful everyday computing.', 'Buy the Intel Core i5-14500 14th Gen Desktop PC from International Office Solution. Featuring Intel Core i5-14500 processor, 16GB DDR4 RAM, 256GB NVMe SSD, MSI H610 motherboard, and Gamdias 300W PSU for powerful everyday computing.', NULL, 5, NULL, NULL),
(398, 'Intel 13th Gen Core i5 13400 Budget Desktop PC with Monitor', 'The Intel Core i5-13400 13th Gen Desktop PC from International Office Solution is a complete productivity package featuring a powerful Intel Core i5 processor, 8GB DDR4 RAM, 512GB NVMe SSD, and an MSI 21.5-inch Full HD IPS monitor. Designed for office work, business applications, online meetings, and multitasking, this desktop bundle delivers excellent performance and reliability for professional users.', 'intel-13th-gen-core-i5-13400-budget-desktop-pc-with-monitor-1781259907', '<h3>Intel Core i5-13400 13th Gen Desktop PC with MSI 21.5\" Monitor</h3><p>The <strong>Intel Core i5-13400 13th Gen Desktop PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a complete desktop computing solution designed for businesses, offices, educational institutions, and professionals who require reliable performance and modern features. Combining Intel\'s advanced Raptor Lake architecture with quality components and a Full HD IPS monitor, this package provides everything needed for a productive computing experience.</p><p>At the heart of the system is the <strong>Intel Core i5-13400 13th Generation Raptor Lake Processor</strong>, delivering exceptional performance with a hybrid core architecture designed to handle multitasking, office applications, web browsing, online collaboration, and demanding productivity workloads. The processor ensures smooth and efficient operation even when running multiple applications simultaneously.</p><p>The desktop is powered by the <strong>MSI PRO H610M-S DDR4 mATX Motherboard</strong>, providing a stable and dependable platform with support for Intel\'s latest technologies. Its durable design and essential connectivity options make it an excellent choice for long-term business and office use.</p><p>For memory, the system includes <strong>8GB Corsair Vengeance LPX DDR4 3200MHz RAM</strong>, delivering smooth multitasking and responsive system performance. The high-quality memory module ensures efficient handling of daily workloads and productivity tasks.</p><p>Storage is provided by the <strong>OSCOO ON901 512GB PCIe NVMe M.2 SSD</strong>, offering high-speed data transfer, rapid system boot-up, and fast application loading. With 512GB capacity, users have ample space for operating systems, business applications, and important files while enjoying superior SSD performance.</p><p>The package also includes the <strong>MSI PRO MP225 21.5-inch Full HD IPS Monitor</strong> featuring a <strong>100Hz refresh rate</strong>, Full HD resolution, and IPS panel technology. The monitor delivers sharp visuals, accurate colors, and a comfortable viewing experience for office work, presentations, and multimedia content.</p><p>All components are housed inside the stylish <strong>MSI MAG PANO M110A Micro-ATX Mid Tower Gaming Casing</strong>, which offers a modern panoramic design and efficient airflow. Power is supplied by the highly reliable <strong>Corsair CX550 550W 80 PLUS Bronze Power Supply</strong>, ensuring stable power delivery, energy efficiency, and long-term reliability.</p><p>Whether you\'re setting up a business workstation, office desktop, educational computer lab, or professional productivity system, the <strong>Intel Core i5-13400 13th Gen Desktop PC with MSI Monitor</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> offers outstanding value, performance, and dependability.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Model</td><td>Intel Core i5-13400 13th Gen Raptor Lake Processor</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Warranty</td><td>03 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Model</td><td>MSI PRO H610M-S DDR4 mATX Motherboard</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Warranty</td><td>03 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Capacity &amp; Speed</td><td>Corsair Vengeance LPX 8GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Lifetime Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Type &amp; Capacity</td><td>OSCOO ON901 512GB PCIe NVMe M.2 SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Warranty</td><td>05 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Monitor</td><td>Model</td><td>MSI PRO MP225 21.5\" IPS Full HD Monitor</td></tr><tr><td>Monitor</td><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>100Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Monitor</td><td>Warranty</td><td>03 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Casing</td><td>Model</td><td>MSI MAG PANO M110A Micro-ATX Mid Tower Gaming Casing</td></tr><tr><td>Casing</td><td>Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Power Supply</td><td>Model</td><td>Corsair CX550 550W 80 PLUS Bronze Power Supply</td></tr><tr><td>Power Supply</td><td>Warranty</td><td>06 Years Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Desktop', 76500.00, 76500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/RWZNtA3rvaPRwOdk5pHznnI69x8944CQJP0WZI91.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 10:25:07', '2026-06-12 10:25:07', 'Intel Core i5-13400 13th Gen Desktop PC with 21.5\" Monitor | 8GB RAM 512GB NVMe SSD | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Intel Core i5-13400 13th Gen Desktop PC with MSI 21.5-inch Full HD IPS Monitor from International Office Solution. Features 8GB DDR4 RAM, 512GB NVMe SSD, and Corsair 550W PSU for business and productivity needs.', 'Intel Core i5-13400 Desktop PC, Intel 13th Gen Desktop PC, Intel Core i5 13400 Computer, MSI PRO MP225 Monitor, 21.5 Inch IPS Monitor, 100Hz Monitor PC Package, OSCOO ON901 SSD, Corsair CX550 Power Supply, Business Desktop Computer, Office Desktop PC Bangladesh, Productivity Desktop, Full HD Monitor Bundle, NVMe SSD Desktop, Professional Workstation, International Office Solution, Desktop Computer Bangladesh, Intel Business PC, Office Workstation Package, Complete Desktop Bundle, Raptor Lake Desktop PC', NULL, 5, NULL, NULL),
(399, 'Intel Core Ultra 9 285K Gaming PC', 'The Intel Core Ultra 9 285K Ultimate Gaming PC from International Office Solution is a flagship high-performance workstation built for extreme gaming, content creation, AI workloads, and professional rendering. Featuring the latest Intel Core Ultra 9 processor, RTX 5090 32GB GPU, 128GB DDR5 RAM, and blazing-fast Gen5 NVMe storage, this premium setup delivers unmatched power, speed, and future-ready performance.', 'intel-core-ultra-9-285k-gaming-pc-1781260050', '<h3>Intel Core Ultra 9 285K Extreme Performance Gaming &amp; Workstation PC</h3><p>The <strong>Intel Core Ultra 9 285K Arrow Lake Gaming PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a top-tier enthusiast system designed for users who demand the absolute best in computing performance. Built with cutting-edge next-generation components, this system is engineered for 4K/8K gaming, high-end content creation, 3D rendering, AI workloads, and professional-level multitasking.</p><p>At the core of this powerhouse is the <strong>Intel Core Ultra 9 285K Arrow Lake Processor</strong>, delivering elite-level performance with advanced hybrid architecture. It ensures ultra-fast processing speeds, exceptional multitasking capability, and superior efficiency for the most demanding applications.</p><p>The system is built on the <strong>ASUS ROG MAXIMUS Z890 HERO BTF LGA1851 ATX Motherboard</strong>, a premium-grade motherboard designed for stability, overclocking, and next-gen connectivity. It offers cutting-edge features and long-term upgrade potential, making it ideal for extreme performance builds.</p><p>For memory, the system includes a massive <strong>128GB (4x32GB) Kingston FURY Beast DDR5 6000MHz CL30 RGB RAM</strong>, providing extraordinary bandwidth for heavy workloads such as 3D rendering, simulation, video production, and advanced gaming. The RGB design also enhances the aesthetic appeal of the build.</p><p>Graphics performance is handled by the <strong>ASUS ROG Astral GeForce RTX 5090 32GB GDDR7 OC Edition</strong>, delivering next-generation GPU performance for ultra-high-resolution gaming, real-time ray tracing, AI acceleration, and professional creative workloads. This GPU is built for uncompromised visual fidelity and extreme performance.</p><p>Storage is powered by a <strong>Team T-FORCE GE PRO 2TB PCIe Gen 5 NVMe SSD with AirFlow Heatsink</strong>, ensuring ultra-fast load times, instant data access, and maximum system responsiveness. Gen5 technology provides breakthrough storage speeds for demanding applications and large file handling.</p><p>The visual experience is delivered through the <strong>ASUS ROG Strix XG27ACG 27\" WQHD Fast IPS Gaming Monitor</strong>, featuring a 180Hz refresh rate, ultra-smooth gameplay, and vibrant color accuracy for competitive gaming and creative work.</p><p>All components are housed inside the premium <strong>ASUS ROG Hyperion GR701 BTF Edition ARGB E-ATX Gaming Case</strong>, offering exceptional airflow, futuristic design, and support for high-end components. Power is supplied by the <strong>ASUS TUF Gaming 1200G 1200W 80 Plus Gold Full Modular Power Supply</strong>, ensuring stable and efficient power delivery even under extreme loads.</p><p>Cooling is handled by the <strong>ASUS ROG STRIX LC III 360 ARGB Liquid CPU Cooler</strong>, providing advanced thermal performance and maintaining optimal CPU temperatures during heavy workloads and gaming sessions.</p><p>This <strong>Intel Core Ultra 9 285K RTX 5090 Gaming PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> represents the pinnacle of modern desktop performance, designed for enthusiasts, professionals, and creators who demand nothing less than extreme power and reliability.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Model</td><td>Intel Core Ultra 9 285K Arrow Lake Processor</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Model</td><td>ASUS ROG MAXIMUS Z890 HERO BTF LGA1851 ATX</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Capacity &amp; Speed</td><td>128GB (4x32GB) Kingston FURY Beast DDR5 6000MHz CL30 RGB</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Card</td><td>Model</td><td>ASUS ROG Astral GeForce RTX 5090 32GB GDDR7 OC Edition</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Card</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Type</td><td>2TB Team T-FORCE GE PRO PCIe Gen5 NVMe SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Warranty</td><td>5 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Monitor</td><td>Model</td><td>ASUS ROG Strix XG27ACG 27\" WQHD IPS 180Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Casing</td><td>Model</td><td>ASUS ROG Hyperion GR701 BTF Edition ARGB E-ATX</td></tr><tr><td>Power Supply</td><td>Model</td><td>ASUS TUF Gaming 1200G 1200W 80+ Gold</td></tr><tr><td>Power Supply</td><td>Warranty</td><td>10 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>CPU Cooler</td><td>Model</td><td>ASUS ROG STRIX LC III 360 ARGB</td></tr><tr><td>CPU Cooler</td><td>Warranty</td><td>6 Years Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Desktop', 943000.00, 943000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/jp8QMS9cxJv3cXkXa8WyaXODahd9IcduLLIBoEIG.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 10:27:30', '2026-06-12 10:27:56', 'Intel Core Ultra 9 285K RTX 5090 Gaming PC | 128GB DDR5 2TB Gen5 SSD | ROG High-End Build', 'Buy the Intel Core Ultra 9 285K RTX 5090 Gaming PC from International Office Solution. Features 128GB DDR5 RAM, 2TB Gen5 SSD, ASUS ROG Z890 motherboard, and 27” 180Hz monitor for ultimate gaming and performance.', 'Intel Core Ultra 9 285K PC, RTX 5090 Gaming PC, High End Gaming PC Bangladesh, ASUS ROG Desktop PC, Z890 Motherboard PC, DDR5 128GB Gaming PC, Gen5 NVMe SSD PC, Ultimate Gaming PC Build, 4K Gaming Desktop, 8K Gaming PC, Content Creation PC, Professional Workstation PC, ASUS ROG Hyperion GR701, ASUS TUF 1200W PSU