(400, 'AMD Ryzen 3 2200G Desktop PC', 'The AMD Ryzen 3 2200G Budget Desktop PC from International Office Solution is an affordable all-in-one computing solution featuring built-in Radeon Vega 8 graphics, 8GB DDR4 RAM, and a fast 256GB NVMe SSD. Ideal for office work, online classes, browsing, and light multimedia use, this desktop delivers reliable everyday performance at a budget-friendly price.', 'amd-ryzen-3-2200g-desktop-pc-1781260245', '<p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 3 2200G Budget Desktop PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is designed for users who need a cost-effective yet capable desktop for daily computing tasks. Powered by AMD’s integrated graphics technology, this system is suitable for office applications, education, entertainment, and light productivity workloads.</p><p>At the core of this system is the <strong>AMD Ryzen 3 2200G Quad-Core Processor</strong>, featuring integrated <strong>Radeon Vega 8 Graphics</strong>. This built-in GPU eliminates the need for a dedicated graphics card, making it a great choice for budget users while still supporting smooth visuals for everyday tasks, HD video playback, and light gaming.</p><p>The system is built on the <strong>ASRock B450M-HDV R4.0 AMD Motherboard</strong>, providing a stable and reliable platform with essential connectivity and upgrade options. Its durable design ensures long-term performance for home and office use.</p><p>For memory, the PC includes <strong>8GB Colorful Battle-AX DDR4 3200MHz RAM</strong>, ensuring smooth multitasking and responsive performance when running multiple applications such as browsers, office software, and communication tools.</p><p>Storage is handled by the <strong>Colorful CN600 PRO 256GB M.2 NVMe SSD</strong>, delivering fast boot times, quick file access, and improved overall system responsiveness compared to traditional hard drives.</p><p>All components are housed inside the <strong>MaxGreen H6 M-ATX Case with 200W Standard Power Supply</strong>, offering a compact design suitable for basic computing needs. The casing provides essential airflow and a simple, functional layout for everyday users.</p><p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 3 2200G Budget Desktop PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is an excellent choice for students, home users, and office environments who require a dependable system for daily tasks at an affordable cost.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Model</td><td>AMD Ryzen 3 2200G Quad-Core Processor</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Graphics</td><td>Radeon Vega 8 Integrated Graphics</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty (No Warranty for Fan/Cooler)</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Model</td><td>ASRock B450M-HDV R4.0 AMD Motherboard</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Capacity &amp; Speed</td><td>Colorful Battle-AX 8GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Lifetime Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Type &amp; Capacity</td><td>Colorful CN600 PRO 256GB M.2 NVMe SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Casing</td><td>Model</td><td>MaxGreen H6 M-ATX Case with 200W PSU</td></tr><tr><td>Casing</td><td>Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Desktop', 28800.00, 28800.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/qT6N27EjJ5mppApeepGidIPNDdphv3YvVt5YeKJb.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 10:30:45', '2026-06-12 10:30:45', 'AMD Ryzen 3 2200G Budget Desktop PC | Vega 8 Graphics | 8GB RAM 256GB NVMe SSD | International Office Solution', 'Buy AMD Ryzen 3 2200G Budget Desktop PC from International Office Solution. Features Vega 8 graphics, 8GB DDR4 RAM, 256GB NVMe SSD, and ASRock B450 motherboard for smooth everyday computing.', 'AMD Ryzen 3 2200G Desktop PC, Ryzen 3 Budget