(402, 'AMD Ryzen 5 3400G Processor Gaming Desktop PC', 'The AMD Ryzen 5 3400G Budget Desktop PC from International Office Solution is a reliable all-in-one system featuring Radeon Vega 11 graphics, 8GB DDR4 RAM, and a fast 256GB NVMe SSD. Designed for office work, online learning, multimedia use, and light gaming, this desktop delivers smooth everyday performance at an affordable price.', 'amd-ryzen-5-3400g-processor-gaming-desktop-pc-1781260448', '<h3>AMD Ryzen 5 3400G Budget Desktop PC</h3><p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 5 3400G Budget Desktop PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a well-balanced desktop solution built for students, professionals, and home users who need dependable performance for daily computing tasks. With integrated graphics and efficient processing power, this system is suitable for office applications, online classes, entertainment, and light gaming.</p><p>At the core of the system is the <strong>AMD Ryzen 5 3400G Processor</strong>, featuring four cores and eight threads along with <strong>Radeon RX Vega 11 Graphics</strong>. This powerful integrated GPU allows users to enjoy smooth visuals, HD video playback, and casual gaming without requiring a dedicated graphics card, making it a cost-effective all-in-one solution.</p><p>The system is built on the <strong>MSI A520M-A Pro AM4 Micro-ATX Motherboard</strong>, offering stable performance, essential connectivity, and support for AMD processors. Its reliable design ensures smooth operation and long-term durability for everyday use.</p><p>For memory, the desktop includes <strong>Corsair Vengeance LPX 8GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM</strong>, ensuring responsive multitasking and smooth handling of multiple applications such as web browsing, office software, and communication tools.</p><p>Storage is powered by the <strong>Colorful CN600 PRO 256GB M.2 NVMe SSD</strong>, delivering fast boot times, quick application loading, and improved overall system responsiveness compared to traditio