(403, 'AMD Ryzen 7 5700G Custom Desktop PC', 'The AMD Ryzen 7 5700G Desktop PC from International Office Solution is a powerful all-in-one computing solution featuring Radeon integrated graphics, 8GB DDR4 RAM, and a fast 256GB NVMe SSD. Ideal for office work, business tasks, content consumption, online learning, and light gaming, this system delivers strong performance and smooth multitasking at an affordable price.', 'amd-ryzen-7-5700g-custom-desktop-pc-1781260694', '<h3>AMD Ryzen 7 5700G Desktop PC</h3><p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 7 5700G Desktop PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a high-performance budget workstation designed for users who need strong processing power without a dedicated graphics card. Built with AMD’s advanced Zen architecture, this system is ideal for office productivity, multitasking, content creation, online meetings, and light gaming.</p><p>At the core of the system is the <strong>AMD Ryzen 7 5700G Processor</strong>, featuring 8 cores and 16 threads along with integrated Radeon Graphics. This powerful APU delivers excellent performance for demanding workloads, smooth multitasking, and efficient handling of multiple applications at once, while also supporting casual gaming and multimedia tasks without requiring a dedicated GPU.</p><p>The system is built on the <strong>MSI A520M-A Pro AM4 Micro-ATX Motherboard</strong>, providing a stable and reliable platform with essential connectivity options and long-term durability. It ensures consistent performance for both home and office environments.</p><p>For memory, the desktop includes <strong>Corsair Vengeance LPX 8GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM</strong>, offering smooth multitasking and responsive performance for everyday applications, office software, and web-based tasks. The system can also be upgraded for enhanced performance if needed.</p><p>Storage is handled by the <strong>Colorful CN600 PRO 256GB M.2 NVMe SSD</strong>, which provides fast boot times, quick application loading, and improved system responsiveness compared to traditional hard drives.</p><p>All components are housed inside the <strong>T-Wolf SHADOWCORE OFFICE mATX Mid Tower Casing</strong>, featuring a built-in <strong>200W power supply unit</strong> and a compact, functional design suitable for office and home use. The casing offers decent airflow and a clean, professional appearance.</p><p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 7 5700G Desktop PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is an excellent choice for users seeking a powerful, efficient, and cost-effective desktop solution for productivity, entertainment, and everyday computing.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Model</td><td>AMD Ryzen 7 5700G Processor</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Cores/Threads</td><td>8 Cores / 16 Threads</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Graphics</td><td>Radeon Integrated Graphics</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty (No Warranty for Fan/Cooler)</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Model</td><td>MSI A520M-A Pro AM4 Micro-ATX Motherboard</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Capacity &amp; Speed</td><td>Corsair Vengeance LPX 8GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Lifetime Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Type &amp; Capacity</td><td>Colorful CN600 PRO 256GB M.2 NVMe SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Casing</td><td>Model</td><td>T-Wolf SHADOWCORE OFFICE mATX Mid Tower Casing</td></tr><tr><td>Power Supply</td><td>PSU</td><td>Built-in 200W Power Supply</td></tr><tr><td>Casing</td><td>Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Desktop', 46500.00, 46500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/vrFy1hGNAr9MI7JKXmX8N4iA4DjbZ1FQCwGifOKk.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-0