(405, 'AMD Ryzen 5 8500G Gaming Desktop PC', 'The AMD Ryzen 5 8500G DDR5 Desktop PC from International Office Solution is a modern and powerful computing solution designed for office work, gaming, content creation, and multitasking. Featuring the Ryzen 5 8500G processor with Radeon graphics, 16GB DDR5 6000MHz RGB RAM, and a 512GB NVMe SSD, this desktop delivers fast, smooth, and future-ready performance.', 'amd-ryzen-5-8500g-gaming-desktop-pc-1781260931', '<p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 5 8500G DDR5 Desktop PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a next-generation desktop system built for users who demand speed, efficiency, and modern platform technology. Powered by AMD’s latest AM5 architecture, this PC is ideal for office productivity, online learning, multitasking, creative work, and light gaming.</p><p>At the core of the system is the <strong>AMD Ryzen 5 8500G Processor</strong>, featuring advanced performance cores along with integrated Radeon Graphics. This allows users to enjoy smooth everyday computing, multimedia playback, and light gaming without the need for a dedicated graphics card, making it a cost-effective yet powerful solution.</p><p>The system is built on the <strong>MSI PRO B650M-P DDR5 AM5 Micro-ATX Motherboard</strong>, providing a stable and future-ready platform with support for AMD Ryzen processors. It ensures strong reliability, modern connectivity options, and upgrade flexibility for long-term use.</p><p>For memory, the PC includes <strong>Kingston FURY Beast RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz EXPO RAM</strong>, delivering ultra-fast performance and excellent multitasking capability. The high-speed DDR5 memory ensures smooth system responsiveness and enhanced overall performance for demanding applications.</p><p>Storage is handled by the <strong>Colorful CN600 PRO 512GB M.2 NVMe SSD</strong>, offering fast boot times, quick application loading, and ample storage capacity for operating systems, software, and personal data. The NVMe i