(406, 'AMD Ryzen 5 7500F Gaming PC', 'The AMD Ryzen 5 7500F RTX 3050 Gaming PC from International Office Solution is a powerful AM5-based desktop built for gaming, streaming, and productivity. Featuring Ryzen 5 7500F processor, RTX 3050 8GB graphics, 16GB DDR5 6000MHz RAM, and a fast 512GB NVMe SSD, this system delivers smooth performance and excellent value for modern gamers and creators.', 'amd-ryzen-5-7500f-gaming-pc-1781261042', '<h3>AMD Ryzen 5 7500F RTX 3050 Gaming PC</h3><p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 5 7500F RTX 3050 Gaming PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a high-performance gaming and productivity system designed for users who want modern architecture, fast memory, and dedicated graphics power. Built on AMD’s AM5 platform, this PC is optimized for smooth gaming, content creation, streaming, and multitasking.</p><p>At the core of the system is the <strong>AMD Ryzen 5 7500F Processor</strong>, offering strong multi-core performance and high efficiency for gaming and professional workloads. With its modern Zen architecture, it ensures fast responsiveness and stable performance in demanding applications.</p><p>The system is powered by the <strong>ASUS PRIME A620M-K AM5 Micro-ATX Motherboard</strong>, providing a reliable and stable foundation for AMD’s latest processors. It supports future upgrades and ensures long-term system reliability for gaming and productivity use.</p><p>For memory, the PC includes <strong>Kingston FURY Beast RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz EXPO RAM</strong>, delivering ultra-fast speeds and smooth multitasking performance. The high-frequency DDR5 memory enhances gaming responsiveness and system efficiency.</p><p>Graphics performance is handled by the <strong>ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 3050 V2 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong>, providing excellent 1080p gaming performance, ray tracing support, and enhanced visuals for modern games and creative workloads. The GPU includes an extended warranty after online registration, offering long-term peace of mind.</p><p>Storage is powered by the <strong>Colorful CN600 PRO 512GB M.2 NVMe SSD</strong>, ensuring fast boot times, quick game loading, and smooth system responsiveness for daily use and gaming applications.</p><p>The system is housed in the <strong>MSI MAG FORGE M100A Micro ATX Gaming Case</strong>, designed for airflow and gaming aesthetics. Cooling is supported by the <strong>MSI MAG COREFROZR AA13 ARGB Air CPU Cooler</strong>, ensuring stable thermal performance during heavy workloads.</p><p>Power is supplied by the reliable <strong>Corsair CX550 550W 80 PLUS Bronze Power Supply</strong>, delivering stable and efficient power with a long 6-year warranty, ensuring system safety and durability.</p><p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 5 7500F RTX 3050 Gaming PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is an ideal choice for gamers, students, and professionals looking for a balanced system that delivers performance, reliability, and future-ready AM5 platform support.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Model</td><td>AMD Ryzen 5 7500F Processor</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty (No Warranty for Fan/Cooler)</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Model</td><td>ASUS PRIME A620M-K AM5 mATX Motherboard</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Capacity &amp; Speed</td><td>Kingston FURY Beast RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz EXPO</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Card</td><td>Model</td><td>ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 3050 V2 8GB GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Card</td><td>Warranty</td><td>5 Years Total Warranty (After Registration)</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Type &amp; Capacity</td><td>Colorful CN600 PRO 512GB M.2 NVMe SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Limited Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Casing</td><td>Model</td><td>MSI MAG FORGE M1