(407, 'AMD Ryzen 5 8400F Gaming Desktop PC', 'The AMD Ryzen 5 8400F RTX 5050 Gaming PC from International Office Solution is a next-generation AM5 gaming desktop built for high-performance gaming, streaming, and productivity. Featuring Ryzen 5 8400F processor, RTX 5050 8GB graphics, 16GB DDR5 6000MHz RAM, and a fast 512GB Gen4 NVMe SSD, this PC delivers smooth, responsive, and future-ready performance.', 'amd-ryzen-5-8400f-gaming-desktop-pc-1781261131', '<h3>AMD Ryzen 5 8400F RTX 5050 Gaming PC</h3><p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 5 8400F RTX 5050 Gaming PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a powerful and modern desktop system designed for gamers, creators, and professionals who demand high-speed performance and upgrade-ready architecture. Built on AMD’s latest AM5 platform, this system ensures excellent efficiency, stability, and long-term usability.</p><p>At the core of the system is the <strong>AMD Ryzen 5 8400F Processor</strong>, delivering strong multi-core performance for gaming, productivity, and multitasking. Designed for modern workloads, it ensures smooth frame rates, fast application response, and reliable performance in demanding environments.</p><p>The system is powered by the <strong>MSI PRO B650M-P DDR5 AM5 Micro-ATX Motherboard</strong>, offering a stable and future-proof platform with support for the latest AMD Ryzen processors. It provides excellent connectivity, durability, and upgrade flexibility for long-term use.</p><p>For memory, the PC includes <strong>Corsair Vengeance RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL36 RAM</strong>, ensuring ultra-fast system responsiveness and smooth multitasking. The high-speed DDR5 memory enhances gaming performance and supports demanding creative workloads with ease.</p><p>Graphics performance is handled by the <strong>ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5050 Twin Edge 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong>, delivering powerful next-generation gaming performance, real-time ray tracing, and AI-enhanced visuals. With extend