(408, 'AMD Ryzen 5 7500F Processor Gaming PC', 'The AMD Ryzen 5 7500F RTX 5060 Gaming PC from International Office Solution is a high-performance AM5 gaming desktop built for next-gen gaming, streaming, and productivity. Featuring Ryzen 5 7500F processor, RTX 5060 8GB GDDR7 graphics, 32GB DDR5 RAM, and a fast 512GB Gen4 NVMe SSD, this system delivers smooth, powerful, and future-ready performance.', 'amd-ryzen-5-7500f-processor-gaming-pc-1781261240', '<p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 5 7500F RTX 5060 Gaming PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a modern, high-performance desktop designed for gamers, content creators, and professionals who demand speed, stability, and upgrade potential. Built on AMD’s latest AM5 platform, this system offers excellent efficiency, strong gaming performance, and long-term reliability.</p><p>At the core of this system is the <strong>AMD Ryzen 5 7500F Processor</strong>, delivering strong multi-core performance optimized for gaming, multitasking, and productivity workloads. It ensures smooth frame rates, fast responsiveness, and reliable performance across modern applications.</p><p>The system is powered by the <strong>MSI B850M GAMING PLUS WIFI AM5 Micro-ATX Motherboard</strong>, offering advanced connectivity, built-in WiFi, and a stable platform for next-generation AMD processors. It provides excellent durability and upgrade flexibility for future expansion.</p><p>For memory, the PC includes <strong>32GB (2x16GB) Corsair Vengeance RGB DDR5 5200MHz CL40 RAM</strong>, delivering high bandwidth and smooth multitasking performance. The RGB lighting enhances system aesthetics while ensuring stable performance for gaming and creative workloads.</p><p>Graphics are handled by the <strong>MSI GeForce RTX 5060 8GB GDDR7 SHADOW 2X OC Graphics Card</strong>, offering next-generation gaming performance, real-time ray tracing, and AI-enhanced graphics. It is ideal for high-FPS gaming, streaming, and content creation with excellent visual quality.</p><p>Storage is powered by the <strong>Team T-FORCE G50 512GB M.2 PCIe Gen4x4 NVMe SSD</strong>, ensuring fast boot times, rapid game loading, and smooth system responsiveness. The Gen4 interface provides high-speed data transfer for demanding applications.</p><p>The system is housed in the <strong>Gamdias ATHENA M3 ARGB E-ATX Mid-Tower Gaming Casing</strong>, designed for excellent airflow, modern aesthetics, and ARGB lighting effects. Cooling is handled by the <strong>Gamdias ST-BOREAS E1-411 SE CPU Air Cooler</strong>, ensuring stable CPU temperatures during heavy workloads.</p><p>Power is supplied by the <strong>MSI MAG A650BN 650W 80 Plus Bronze Power Supply</strong>, delivering efficient and stable power output with reliable protection features and a 5-year warranty.</p><p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 5 7500F RTX 5060 Gaming PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is an excellent choice for gamers and creators looking for a powerful, future-ready AM5 system with strong performance and upgrade potential.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Model</td><td>AMD Ryzen 5 7500F Processor</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty (No Warranty for Fan/Cooler)</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Model</td><td>MSI B850M GAMING PLUS WIFI AM5 mATX Motherboard</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Capacity &amp; Configuration</td><td>32GB (2x16GB) Corsair Vengeance RGB DDR5</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Speed</td><td>5200MHz CL40</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Lifetime Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Card</td><td>Model</td><td>MSI GeForce RTX 5060 8GB GDDR7 SHADOW 2X OC</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Card</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Type &amp; Capacity</td><td>Team T-FORCE G50 512