(409, 'AMD Ryzen 3 3200G Desktop PC', 'The AMD Ryzen 3 3200G Budget Desktop PC from International Office Solution is an affordable all-in-one system designed for office work, online classes, browsing, and multimedia use. Featuring Radeon Vega 8 graphics, 8GB DDR4 RAM, and a fast 256GB NVMe SSD, this desktop delivers smooth everyday performance at a budget-friendly price.', 'amd-ryzen-3-3200g-desktop-pc-1781261351', '<p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 3 3200G Budget Desktop PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a practical and cost-effective computing solution designed for students, home users, and office environments. Built with integrated graphics and efficient processing power, this system is ideal for daily productivity tasks, web browsing, online learning, and light entertainment.</p><p>At the core of the system is the <strong>AMD Ryzen 3 3200G Processor</strong>, featuring <strong>Radeon RX Vega 8 Graphics</strong>. This integrated GPU allows users to enjoy smooth visuals, HD video playback, and basic gaming without requiring a dedicated graphics card, making it a reliable and budget-friendly all-in-one solution.</p><p>The system is built on the <strong>ASRock B450M-HDV R4.0 AMD Motherboard</strong>, offering stable performance, essential connectivity, and long-term durability for everyday computing needs. It ensures reliable operation for office and home use.</p><p>For memory, the PC includes <strong>Colorful Battle-AX 8GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM</strong>, providing smooth multitasking and responsive performance for common applications such as office software, browsers, and communication tools.</p><p>Storage is powered by the <strong>Colorful CN600 PRO 256GB M.2 NVMe SSD</strong>, delivering fast boot times, quick application loading, and improved overall system responsiveness compared to traditional hard drives.</p><p>All components are housed inside the <strong>T-Wolf SHADOWCORE OFFICE mATX Mid Tower Casing</strong>, which includes a built-in <st