(410, 'Buy AMD Ryzen 3 3200G Budget Desktop PC from International Office Solution. Features Vega 8 graphics, 8GB DDR4 RAM, 256GB NVMe SSD, and ASRock B450 motherboard for smooth everyday performance.', 'The Intel Core Ultra 5 245K Desktop PC from International Office Solution is a modern high-performance system designed for productivity, gaming, and content creation. Featuring the latest Intel Core Ultra 5 processor, DDR5 6000MHz RAM, and a fast Gen4 NVMe SSD, this PC delivers smooth, efficient, and future-ready computing performance.', 'buy-amd-ryzen-3-3200g-budget-desktop-pc-from-international-office-solution-features-vega-8-graphics-8gb-ddr4-ram-256gb-nvme-ssd-and-asrock-b450-motherboard-for-smooth-everyday-performance-1781261566', '<p>he <strong>Intel Core Ultra 5 245K Desktop PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a next-generation computing solution built for users who demand strong performance, efficiency, and modern platform technology. Designed on Intel’s latest Arrow Lake architecture, this system is ideal for office workloads, multitasking, creative applications, and gaming.</p><p>At the core of the system is the <strong>Intel Core Ultra 5 245K Processor</strong>, delivering advanced multi-core performance for fast computing, smooth multitasking, and efficient handling of demanding applications. It is designed to provide a balance of power and efficiency for modern workloads.</p><p>The system is powered by the <strong>MSI MAG B860M MORTAR WIFI LGA 1851 Micro-ATX Motherboard</strong>, offering excellent stability, built-in WiFi connectivity, and advanced features for future upgrades. It ensures a strong foundation for high-performance computing with modern expansion support.</p><p>For memory, the PC includes <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL36 RAM</strong>, delivering ultra-fast responsiveness and smooth multitasking performance. The high-speed DDR5 memory ensures efficient performance across productivity, gaming, a