(411, 'Intel Core i5 14400 14th Gen Gaming Desktop PC', 'The Intel Core i5-14400 RTX 5060 Gaming PC from International Office Solution is a powerful 14th Gen desktop built for gaming, streaming, and productivity. Featuring RTX 5060 8GB graphics, DDR5 6000MHz RAM, and a 1TB Gen4 NVMe SSD, this system delivers smooth performance, fast loading, and excellent multitasking for modern users.', 'intel-core-i5-14400-14th-gen-gaming-desktop-pc-1781261647', '<h3>Intel Core i5-14400 RTX 5060 Gaming PC</h3><p>The <strong>Intel Core i5-14400 RTX 5060 Gaming PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a balanced high-performance system designed for gamers, creators, and professionals who need speed, stability, and modern graphics power. Built on Intel’s 14th Gen Raptor Lake architecture, this PC ensures excellent responsiveness and efficiency across gaming and productivity workloads.</p><p>At the core of the system is the <strong>Intel Core i5-14400 Processor</strong>, offering strong multi-core performance for gaming, multitasking, office applications, and content creation. It delivers smooth and reliable performance for both everyday use and demanding workloads.</p><p>The system is powered by the <strong>MSI B760 GAMING PLUS WIFI ATX Motherboard</strong>, providing a stable platform with built-in WiFi connectivity, strong VRM design, and support for high-performance Intel processors. It ensures long-term reliability and upgrade flexibility.</p><p>For memory, the PC includes <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL36 RAM</strong>, delivering ultra-fast responsiveness and smooth multitasking performance. The high-speed DDR5 memory ensures excellent system efficiency for gaming and creative applications.</p><p>Graphics are handled by the <strong>PNY GeForce RTX 5060 8GB OC Dual Fan GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong>, delivering next-generation gaming performance, real-time ray tracing, and AI-enhanced graphics. It is ideal for high-FPS gaming, streaming, and modern AAA titles.</p><p>Storage is powered by the <strong>Kingston NV3 1TB M.2 PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD</strong>, providing fast boot times, quick game loading, and ample space for large files, applications, and media content.</p><p>The system is housed in the <strong>Antec VX320 ARGB Mid Tower Gaming Case</strong>, designed with airflow optimization and stylish ARGB lighting. Cooling is managed by the <strong>Gamdias BOREAS M2-51D Digital Display CPU Cooler</strong>, ensuring stable thermal performance with a modern display feature.</p><p>Power is supplied by the <strong>Antec G750 750W 80 Plus Gold Semi Modular Power Supply</strong>, delivering efficient, stable, and reliable power for high-performance components with excellent energy efficiency.</p><p>The <strong>Intel Core i5-14400 RTX 5060 Gaming PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is an ideal choice for gamers and professionals looking for a powerful, future-ready system with strong performance and upgrade potential.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Model</td><td>Intel Core i5-14400 14th Gen Raptor Lake</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty (No Warranty for Fan/Cooler)</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Model</td><td>MSI B760 GAMING PLUS WIFI ATX Motherboard</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Capacity &amp; Speed</td><td>Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL36</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Card</td><td>Model</td><td>PNY GeForce RTX 5060 8GB OC GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Card</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Type &amp; Capacity</td><td>Kingston NV3 1TB M.2 PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Casing</td><td>Model</td><td>Antec VX320 ARGB Mid Tower Gaming Case</td></tr>