(412, 'Intel Core i7 14700K 14th Gen Gaming Desktop PC', 'The Intel Core i7-14700K Gaming PC from International Office Solution is a high-performance 14th Gen desktop built for gaming, streaming, and professional workloads. Featuring RTX 3060 12GB graphics, DDR5 6000MHz RAM, and a 1TB Gen4 NVMe SSD, this system delivers strong multitasking, fast performance, and reliable power for modern users.', 'intel-core-i7-14700k-14th-gen-gaming-desktop-pc-1781261746', '<h3>Intel Core i7-14700K RTX 3060 Gaming &amp; Productivity PC</h3><p>The <strong>Intel Core i7-14700K Gaming PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a powerful high-end desktop designed for gamers, creators, and professionals who demand strong processing power and stable performance. Built on Intel’s 14th Gen Raptor Lake architecture, this system delivers excellent multi-core performance for gaming, streaming, editing, and productivity tasks.</p><p>At the core of the system is the <strong>Intel Core i7-14700K Processor</strong>, offering exceptional performance with high core and thread counts for demanding workloads. It is ideal for AAA gaming, video editing, 3D rendering, and multitasking-heavy environments.</p><p>The system is powered by the <strong>GIGABYTE Z790 AORUS ELITE AX ATX Motherboard</strong>, providing a premium platform with advanced power delivery, built-in WiFi, and extensive connectivity options. It ensures long-term stability and excellent upgrade potential for high-performance builds.</p><p>For memory, the PC includes <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL36 RAM</strong>, delivering ultra-fast responsiveness and smooth multitasking. The DDR5 platform ensures improved bandwidth and efficiency for gaming and creative workloads.</p><p>Graphics are handled by the <strong>MSI GeForce RTX 3060 VENTUS 2X OC 12GB GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong>, offering solid 1080p and 1440p gaming performance, ray tracing support, and reliable performance for modern titles and creative applications.</p><p>Storage is powered by the <strong>Kingston NV3 1TB M.2 PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD</strong>, delivering fast boot speeds, quick game loading, and ample storage capacity for large files, software, and multimedia content.</p><p>The system is housed inside the <strong>Antec VX320 ARGB Mid Tower Gaming Case</strong>, designed for airflow optimization and modern aesthetics with ARGB lighting support. Cooling is managed by the <strong>Arctic Liquid Freezer III 280MM ARGB Liquid CPU Cooler</strong>, ensuring excellent thermal performance even under heavy workloads.</p><p>Power is supplied by the <strong>Antec CSK 650DC 650W 80+ Bronze Non-Modular Power Supply</strong>, providing stable and efficient power delivery for reliable system operation.</p><p>The <strong>Intel Core i7-14700K RTX 3060 Gaming PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is an excellent choice for users who want a powerful, balanced, and future-ready desktop for gaming, content creation, and professional use.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Model</td><td>Intel Core i7-14700K 14th Gen Raptor Lake</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty (No Warranty for Fan/Cooler)</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Model</td><td>GIGABYTE Z790 AORUS ELITE AX ATX</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Capacity &amp; Speed</td><td>Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL36</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Card</td><td>Model</td><td>MSI GeForce RTX 3060 VENTUS 2X OC 12GB</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Card</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Type &amp; Capacity</td><td>Kingston NV3 1TB M.2 PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Casing</td><td>Model</td><td>Antec VX320 ARGB Mid Tower Gaming Case</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling</td><td>Model</td><td>Arctic Liquid Freezer III 280MM ARGB Liquid Cooler</td></tr><tr><td>Power Supply</td><td>Model</td><td>Antec CSK 650DC 650W 80+ Bronze</td></tr><tr><td>Power Supply</td><td>Warranty</td><td>6 Years Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Desktop', 199999.00, 199999.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/iEO7SdPyO6SPVH86P0KIkT88ioIfpS0HSV8LBxAD.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 10:55:46', '2026-06-12 10:55:46', 'Intel Core i7-14700K RTX 3060 Gaming PC | 16GB DDR5 1TB NVMe SSD | International Office Solution', 'Buy Intel Core i7-14700K RTX 3060 Gaming PC from International Office Solution. Features DDR5 RAM, 1TB NVMe SSD, Z790 motherboard, and liquid cooling for high-performance gaming and productivity.', 'Intel Core i7-14700K Gaming PC, RTX 3060 Gaming PC Bangladesh, 14th Gen High End Desktop PC, DDR5 6000MHz Gaming PC, Z790 AORUS ELITE PC, 1TB NVMe SSD Gaming PC, Liquid Cooled Gaming PC, Gaming PC Bangladesh 2026, High Performance Desktop PC, Streaming Gaming PC, Content Creation PC Bangladesh, RTX 3060 12GB Desktop, Arctic Liquid Freezer PC, Antec VX320 ARGB Case PC, Corsair VENGEANCE DDR5 RAM, International Office Solution, Intel High End Gaming Build, Editing PC Bangladesh, Custom Gaming PC, Professional Workstation PC', NULL, 5, NULL, NULL);
