(413, 'Intel Core Ultra 7 265K Gaming Desktop PC', 'The Intel Core Ultra 7 265K Gaming PC from International Office Solution is a premium next-gen desktop built for high-performance gaming, streaming, and professional workloads. Featuring RTX 3060 12GB graphics, 32GB DDR5 6000MHz RGB RAM, and a fast 1TB Gen4 NVMe SSD, this system delivers smooth, powerful, and future-ready computing.', 'intel-core-ultra-7-265k-gaming-desktop-pc-1781261839', '<h3>Intel Core Ultra 7 265K RTX 3060 High-End Desktop PC</h3><p>The <strong>Intel Core Ultra 7 265K Gaming PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a premium-class desktop designed for users who demand top-tier performance, stability, and modern architecture. Built on Intel’s latest Arrow Lake platform with LGA 1851 support, this system is ideal for gaming, content creation, multitasking, and professional workloads.</p><p>At the core of the system is the <strong>Intel Core Ultra 7 265K Processor</strong>, delivering exceptional multi-core and single-core performance for demanding applications. It ensures smooth gameplay, fast rendering, and efficient productivity across modern software environments.</p><p>The system is powered by the <strong>MSI MPG Z890 CARBON WIFI ATX Motherboard</strong>, a premium-grade platform featuring advanced power delivery, built-in WiFi, high-speed connectivity, and excellent upgrade potential for future high-performance components.</p><p>For memory, the PC includes <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 32GB DDR5 6000MHz CL30 RAM</strong>, delivering extremely fast performance, low latency, and excellent multitasking capability. The RGB lighting enhances aesthetics while maintaining top-tier system responsiveness for gaming and creative workloads.</p><p>Graphics are handled by the <strong>MSI GeForce RTX 3060 VENTUS 2X OC 12GB Graphics Card</strong>, offering reliable 1080p and 1440p gaming performance, ray tracing support, and solid performance for creative applications such as video editing and 3D design.</p><p>Storage is powered by the <strong>Corsair MP600 PRO NH 1TB PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD with DRAM Cache</strong>, delivering ultra-fast read/write speeds, quick boot times, and excellent performance for heavy workloads and large file handling.</p><p>The system is housed in the <strong>Antec VX320 ARGB Mid Tower Gaming Case</strong>, designed for airflow optimization and modern ARGB aesthetics, ensuring both performance and visual appeal.</p><p>Cooling is handled by the <strong>DeepCool LE360 V2 360mm ARGB All-in-One Liquid CPU Cooler</strong>, providing superior thermal performance for high-end processors while maintaining low noise and stable temperatures under load.</p><p>Power is supplied by the <strong>Corsair CX650 650W 80 PLUS Bronze Power Supply</strong>, ensuring stable, efficient, and reliable power delivery for all system components.</p><p>The <strong>Intel Core Ultra 7 265K RTX 3060 Gaming PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is an excellent choice for professionals, gamers, and creators looking for a balanced premium system with modern platform support and strong long-term performance.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Model</td><td>Intel Core Ultra 7 265K Arrow Lake</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Model</td><td>MSI MPG Z890 CARBON WIFI LGA 1851 ATX</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Capacity &amp; Speed</td><td>Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 32GB DDR5 6000MHz CL30</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Lifetime Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Card</td><td>Model</td><td>MSI GeForce RTX 3060 VENTUS 2X OC 12GB</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Card</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Type &amp; Capacity</td><td>Corsair MP600 PRO NH 1TB Gen4 NVMe SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Warranty</td><td>5 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Casing</td><td>Model</td><td>Antec VX320 ARGB Mid Tower Gaming Case</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling</td><td>Model</td><td>DeepCool LE360 V2 360mm ARGB Liquid Cooler</td></tr><tr><td>Power Supply</td><td>Model</td><td>Corsair CX650 650W 80 PLUS Bronze</td></tr><tr><td>Power Supply</td><td>Warranty</td><td>6 Years Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'des', 263500.00, 263500.00, NULL, 3, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 10:57:19', '2026-06-12 10:57:19', 'Intel Core Ultra 7 265K RTX 3060 Gaming PC | 32GB DDR5 1TB Gen4 SSD | International Office Solution', 'Buy Intel Core Ultra 7 265K RTX 3060 Gaming PC from International Office Solution. Features 32GB DDR5 RAM, 1TB Gen4 NVMe SSD, Z890 motherboard, and liquid cooling for premium performance.', 'Intel Core Ultra 7 265K PC, RTX 3060 Gaming PC Bangladesh, Arrow Lake High End Desktop, DDR5 6000MHz 32GB PC, MSI Z890 Carbon WiFi PC, Gen4 NVMe SSD Gaming PC, Liquid Cooled Gaming PC, High Performance Desktop Bangladesh, Gaming PC 2026 Bangladesh, Streaming PC Build, Content Creation PC, Corsair VENGEANCE RGB RAM PC, Corsair MP600 PRO SSD PC, DeepCool 360mm Liquid Cooler PC, Antec VX320 ARGB Case PC, International Office Solution, Premium Gaming Desktop, Intel LGA1851 PC Build, Workstation Gaming PC, High End Custom PC Bangladesh', NULL, 5, NULL, NULL),
(414, 'Gigabyte AI TOP 100 Z890 Core Ultra 9 128GB DDR5 RAM 2TB SSD RTX 5090 Gaming Desktop PC', 'The Intel Core Ultra 9 285K RTX 5090 Workstation PC from International Office Solution is an extreme high-end desktop built for AI workloads, 3D rendering, gaming, and professional production. Featuring RTX 5090 graphics, 128GB DDR5 RAM, dual storage system, and advanced connectivity, this flagship PC delivers unmatched performance and future-ready power.', 'gigabyte-ai-top-100-z890-core-ultra-9-128gb-ddr5-ram-2tb-ssd-rtx-5090-gaming-desktop-pc-1781262070', '<h3>Intel Core Ultra 9 285K RTX 5090 Extreme Workstation PC</h3><p>The <strong>Intel Core Ultra 9 285K Workstation PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a flagship-grade system engineered for professionals, creators, and power users who require maximum performance, scalability, and next-generation technology. Built on Intel’s latest platform with Z890 AI TOP architecture, this system is designed for AI computing, ultra-high-end gaming, 3D rendering, simulation, and enterprise workloads.</p><p>At the core of the system is the <strong>Intel Core Ultra 9 285K Processor</strong>, delivering elite-level multi-core performance optimized for intensive workloads, parallel processing, and AI-accelerated tasks. It is designed for extreme productivity and next-generation computing demands.</p><p>The system is powered by the <strong>Z890 AI TOP Motherboard</strong>, providing cutting-edge connectivity, AI-enhanced performance features, and extensive expansion support. It includes PCIe 5.0 lanes, multiple M.2 slots, and enterprise-grade stability for demanding environments.</p><p>For memory, the system includes a massive <strong>128GB (4x32GB) DDR5 U-DIMM RAM configuration</strong>, ensuring ultra-smooth multitasking, heavy workload processing, and seamless performance for AI, virtualization, and professional applications.</p><p>Graphics are handled by the <strong>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090</strong>, a flagship-level GPU built for extreme gaming performance, AI workloads, 3D rendering, and advanced simulation tasks. It delivers next-generation ray tracing, AI acceleration, and unmatched graphical power.</p><p>Storage is designed for speed and scalability with a <strong>2TB AORUS Gen4 NVMe SSD</strong> paired with a <strong>320GB AI TOP high-speed drive</strong>, along with extensive SATA expansion support (8 x SATA 6Gb/s ports), making it ideal for large-scale data handling and professional storage needs.</p><p>Cooling is managed by the <strong>AORUS 360mm AIO Liquid Cooler</strong>, ensuring optimal thermal performance under extreme workloads while maintaining system stability and efficiency.</p><p>Power is supplied by a <strong>1600W 80 Plus Platinum ATX 3.1 Power Supply</strong>, delivering ultra-stable, high-efficiency power for next-generation components, including high-end GPUs and multi-device workloads.</p><p>The system also features advanced connectivity including <strong>Dual 10GbE Ethernet, Wi-Fi 7, Bluetooth 5.3, and Thunderbolt 5 ports</strong>, ensuring ultra-fast networking and modern device compatibility.</p><p>The <strong>Intel Core Ultra 9 285K RTX 5090 Workstation PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a true flagship system built for professionals who demand uncompromising performance, scalability, and future-ready computing power.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Model</td><td>Intel Core Ultra 9 285K</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Model</td><td>Z890 AI TOP</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Capacity</td><td>128GB (4x32GB) DDR5 U-DIMM</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Card</td><td>Model</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Primary</td><td>AORUS Gen4 7300 2TB NVMe SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Secondary</td><td>AI TOP 320GB SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Expansion</td><td>8 x SATA 6Gb/s Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Power Supply</td><td>Model</td><td>1600W 80 Plus Platinum ATX 3.1 PSU</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling</td><td>Model</td><td>AORUS 360 AIO Liquid Cooler</td></tr><tr><td>Network</td><td>Connectivity</td><td>Dual 10GbE, Wi-Fi 7, Bluetooth 5.3</td></tr><tr><td>OS</td><td>Supported</td><td>Windows 11 Pro / Linux</td></tr><tr><td>Form Factor</td><td>Type</td><td>ATX</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Duration</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Desktop', 799900.00, 799900.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/LrNl4UCG1lV4gz9ewgKsOxwdSF3AceGAkZzr0jFk.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 11:01:10', '2026-06-12 11:01:10', 'Intel Core Ultra 9 285K RTX 5090 Workstation PC | 128GB DDR5 2TB Gen4 SSD | International Office Solution', 'Buy Intel Core Ultra 9 285K RTX 5090 Workstation PC from International Office Solution. Features 128GB DDR5 RAM, 2TB Gen4 SSD, Z890 motherboard, AI-ready performance, and extreme computing power.', 'Intel Core Ultra 9 285K PC, RTX 5090 Workstation PC Bangladesh, Extreme Gaming PC, AI Workstation Desktop, 128GB DDR5 Desktop PC, Z890 AI TOP Motherboard PC, High End Rendering PC, 3D Design Workstation PC, Gaming PC Bangladesh 2026, Ultra Performance Desktop, Dual 10GbE Workstation PC, WiFi 7 Desktop PC, Thunderbolt 5 PC, AORUS Gen4 SSD PC, 1600W Platinum PSU PC, Liquid Cooled Workstation, International Office Solution, Professional AI PC, Content Creation Workstation, Flagship Gaming PC', NULL, 5, NULL, NULL),
(415, 'Intel Core Ultra 9 285K Gaming PC', 'The Intel Core Ultra 9 285K RTX 5090 Gaming PC from International Office Solution is a flagship ROG-powered extreme performance desktop built for 4K gaming, AI workloads, and professional content creation. Featuring RTX 5090 graphics, 128GB DDR5 RGB RAM, Gen5 SSD storage, and premium ROG cooling and casing, this system delivers unmatched next-generation performance.', 'intel-core-ultra-9-285k-gaming-pc-1781262173', '<p>The <strong>Intel Core Ultra 9 285K RTX 5090 Gaming PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a top-tier flagship desktop designed for enthusiasts, professionals, and gamers who demand the highest level of performance, aesthetics, and future-ready technology. Built on Intel’s latest Arrow Lake architecture and paired with ASUS ROG’s premium ecosystem, this system represents the pinnacle of modern computing.</p><p>At the core of the system is the <strong>Intel Core Ultra 9 285K Processor</strong>, delivering elite-level multi-core performance for demanding workloads such as 4K/8K content creation, AI processing, advanced simulation, and extreme gaming performance.</p><p>The system is powered by the <strong>ASUS ROG MAXIMUS Z890 HERO BTF LGA1851 ATX Motherboard</strong>, offering cutting-edge connectivity, hidden cable design (BTF), extreme power delivery, and advanced tuning capabilities. It ensures maximum stability and overclocking potential for high-end components.</p><p>For memory, the PC includes a massive <strong>128GB (4x32GB) Kingston FURY Beast RGB DDR5 6000MHz CL30 RAM configuration</strong>, delivering ultra-fast bandwidth, extreme multitasking capability, and seamless performance for professional workloads, rendering, and gaming.</p><p>Graphics are handled by the <strong>ASUS ROG Astral GeForce RTX 5090 32GB GDDR7 OC Edition</strong>, a flagship GPU designed for next-generation 4K/8K gaming, AI acceleration, ray tracing, and professional rendering. It delivers unmatched graphical performance and efficiency for extreme workloads.</p><p>Storage is powered by the <strong>Team T-FORCE GE PRO 2TB M.2 PCIe Gen5 NVMe SSD with AirFlow Heatsink</strong>, ensuring ultra-fast data transfer speeds, instant boot times, and smooth handling of large projects, games, and media files.</p><p>The system is housed in the <strong>ASUS ROG Hyperion GR701 BTF Edition ARGB E-ATX Gaming Casing</strong>, a premium full-tower chassis designed for maximum airflow, cable management, and visual impact with ARGB lighting and ROG aesthetics.</p><p>Cooling is handled by the <strong>ASUS ROG STRIX LC III 360 ARGB All-in-One Liquid CPU Cooler</strong>, ensuring excellent thermal performance, silent operation, and stable CPU temperatures even under extreme workloads.</p><p>Power is supplied by the <strong>ASUS TUF Gaming 1200G 1200W 80 Plus Gold Full Modular Power Supply</strong>, delivering highly efficient, stable, and reliable power for high-end components with long-term durability and safety protection.</p><p>The system also includes the <strong>ASUS ROG Strix XG27ACG 27\" 180Hz WQHD Fast IPS Gaming Monitor</strong>, offering ultra-smooth visuals, high refresh rate performance, and vibrant color accuracy for competitive gaming and professional use.</p><p>The <strong>Intel Core Ultra 9 285K RTX 5090 ROG Gaming PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is the ultimate high-end desktop solution for users who demand absolute performance, premium build quality, and future-ready technology.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Model</td><td>Intel Core Ultra 9 285K Arrow Lake</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Model</td><td>ASUS ROG MAXIMUS Z890 HERO BTF LGA1851 ATX</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Capac