(416, 'Intel 13th Gen Core i5 13400F Gaming Desktop PC', 'The Intel Core i5-13400F RTX 3050 Gaming PC from International Office Solution is a budget-friendly 13th Gen gaming desktop built for smooth 1080p gaming, streaming, and productivity. Featuring RTX 3050 graphics, DDR5 6000MHz RAM, and a 1TB Gen4 NVMe SSD, this system delivers reliable performance and fast responsiveness.', 'intel-13th-gen-core-i5-13400f-gaming-desktop-pc-1781262257', '<h3>Intel Core i5-13400F RTX 3050 Gaming PC</h3><p>The <strong>Intel Core i5-13400F RTX 3050 Gaming PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a balanced and efficient desktop system designed for gamers, students, and professionals who need strong performance at an affordable price point. Built on Intel’s 13th Gen Raptor Lake architecture, this system ensures smooth multitasking, stable performance, and dependable gaming capability.</p><p>At the core of the system is the <strong>Intel Core i5-13400F Processor</strong>, offering excellent multi-core performance for gaming, office tasks, content consumption, and light creative workloads. It is optimized for efficiency and consistent performance across modern applications.</p><p>The system is powered by the <strong>MSI PRO B760M-E DDR5 Micro-ATX Motherboard</strong>, providing a stable and upgrade-friendly platform with support for DDR5 memory and modern connectivity options for long-term reliability.</p><p>For memory, the PC includes <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL36 RAM</strong>, delivering fast system responsiveness, smooth multitasking, and enhanced gaming performance with stylish RGB lighting.</p><p>Graphics are handled by the <strong>MSI GeForce RTX 3050 VENTUS 2X E 6G OC GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong>, offering solid 1080p gaming performance, ray tracing support, and efficient performance for popular modern titles and creative applications.</p><p>Storage is powered by the <strong>Kingston NV3 1TB M.2 PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD</strong>, deliv