(418, 'AMD Ryzen 5 3400G Processor Gaming Desktop PC', 'The AMD Ryzen 5 3400G Desktop PC from International Office Solution is a budget-friendly all-in-one system designed for office work, online learning, browsing, and light entertainment. Featuring Radeon Vega 11 graphics, 8GB DDR4 RAM, and a fast 256GB NVMe SSD, it delivers smooth everyday performance at an affordable price.', 'amd-ryzen-5-3400g-processor-gaming-desktop-pc-1781262406', '<h3>AMD Ryzen 5 3400G Vega 11 Budget Desktop PC</h3><p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 5 3400G Desktop PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a practical and cost-effective computing solution designed for students, home users, and office environments. With integrated graphics and balanced processing power, this system is ideal for daily productivity tasks, online classes, web browsing, and multimedia usage.</p><p>At the core of the system is the <strong>AMD Ryzen 5 3400G Processor</strong>, featuring <strong>Radeon RX Vega 11 Graphics</strong>. This integrated graphics solution allows users to enjoy smooth HD video playback, light gaming, and basic creative tasks without requiring a dedicated graphics card, making it a reliable entry-level PC.</p><p>The system is powered by the <strong>MSI A520M-A Pro AM4 Micro-ATX Motherboard</strong>, providing stable performance, essential connectivity, and long-term reliability for everyday computing needs.</p><p>For memory, the PC includes <strong>Corsair Vengeance LPX 8GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM</strong>, ensuring smooth multitasking and responsive performance for common applications such as office software, web browsing, and communication tools.</p><p>Storage is handled by the <strong>Colorful CN600 PRO 256GB M.2 NVMe SSD</strong>, delivering fast boot times, quick application loading, and improved system responsiveness compared to traditional hard drives.</p><p>The system is housed in the <strong>T-Wolf Phantom X4 RGB M-ATX Mid Tower Gaming Case</strong>, which includes a built-in 200W power supply. The casing offers a compact design, basic airflow support, and a simple setup suitable for everyday use.</p><p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 5 3400G Desktop PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is an excellent choice for users looking for an affordable, reliable, and efficient desktop for basic computing and light multimedia tasks.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Model</td><td>AMD Ryzen 5 3400G Processor</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Graphics</td><td>Radeon RX Vega 11 Graphics</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty (No Warranty for Fan/Cooler)</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Model</td><td>MSI A520M-A Pro AM4 Micro-ATX</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Capacity &amp; Speed</td><td>Corsair Vengeance LPX 8GB DDR4 3200MHz</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Lifetime Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Type &amp; Capacity</td><td>Colorful CN600 PRO 256GB M.2 NVMe SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Casing</td><td>Model</td><td>T-Wolf Phantom X4 RGB Mid Tower Case</td></tr><tr><td>Casing</td><td>Power Supply</td><td>Built-in 200W PSU</td></tr><tr><td>Casing</td><td>Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Desktop', 34100.00, 34100.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/GnB5r68xXLyn1Ip75zLNf7ZBTJwmhk2Op4ci6IAh.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 11:06:46', '2026-06-12 11:06:46', 'AMD Ryzen 5 3400G Vega 11 Desktop PC | 8GB RAM 256GB NVMe SSD | International Office Solution', 'Buy AMD Ryzen 5 3400G Desktop PC from International Office Solution. Features Vega 11 graphics, 8GB DDR4 RAM, 256GB NVMe SSD, and MSI A520 motherboard for smooth everyday performance.', 'AMD Ryzen 5 3400G Desktop PC, Ryzen 5 Vega 11 PC Bangladesh, 