(421, 'AMD Ryzen 7 7700 Budget Gaming Desktop PC', 'The AMD Ryzen 7 7700 Gaming PC from International Office Solution is a powerful AM5-based desktop designed for smooth gaming, productivity, and multitasking. Featuring Ryzen 7 7700 processor, DDR5 6000MHz RAM, and a fast 512GB NVMe SSD, it delivers strong next-generation performance for modern users.', 'amd-ryzen-7-7700-budget-gaming-desktop-pc-1781262731', '<h3>AMD Ryzen 7 7700 AM5 Gaming &amp; Productivity PC</h3><p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 7 7700 Gaming PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a modern high-performance desktop built for gamers, creators, and professionals who need fast and efficient computing power. With AMD’s latest AM5 platform, this system offers excellent upgrade potential and strong performance for gaming, editing, and multitasking workloads.</p><p>At the core of the system is the <strong>AMD Ryzen 7 7700 Gaming Processor</strong>, delivering high multi-core and single-core performance for demanding applications. It ensures smooth gameplay, fast responsiveness, and efficient handling of productivity tasks such as editing, streaming, and software development.</p><p>The system is powered by the <strong>MSI PRO B650M-P DDR5 AM5 Micro-ATX Motherboard</strong>, providing a stable and future-ready platform with support for DDR5 memory, modern connectivity, and long-term upgrade flexibility.</p><p>For memory, the PC includes <strong>Team T-Force VULCAN RED 8GB DDR5 6000MHz RAM</strong>, offering fast data transfer speeds and improved system responsiveness for gaming and everyday tasks.</p><p>Storage is handled by the <strong>OSCOO ON901 512GB PCIe NVMe M.2 SSD</strong>, ensuring fast boot times, quick application loading, and smooth overall system performance.</p><p>The system is housed in the <strong>MSI PAG PANO M110A Micro-ATX Mid Tower Gaming Casing</strong>, designed with modern airflow support and a compact gaming-focused design.</p><p>Power is supplied by the <strong>