(422, 'AMD Ryzen 5 8600G Desktop PC', 'The AMD Ryzen 5 8600G Desktop PC from International Office Solution is a modern AM5-based all-in-one system designed for smooth everyday performance, light gaming, and productivity. Featuring Radeon integrated graphics, 16GB DDR5 RAM, and a fast NVMe SSD, it delivers efficient and responsive computing.', 'amd-ryzen-5-8600g-desktop-pc-1781262860', '<h3>AMD Ryzen 5 8600G AM5 Desktop PC with Radeon Graphics</h3><p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 5 8600G Desktop PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a powerful and efficient all-in-one computing solution built on AMD’s latest AM5 platform. It is designed for users who need strong performance for office work, study, multimedia, and light gaming without requiring a dedicated graphics card.</p><p>At the core of the system is the <strong>AMD Ryzen 5 8600G Processor with Radeon Integrated Graphics</strong>, delivering excellent CPU performance along with capable onboard graphics. This allows users to enjoy smooth HD/Full HD multimedia playback, light gaming, and everyday productivity tasks with ease.</p><p>The system is powered by the <strong>MSI PRO A620M-E AM5 Micro-ATX Motherboard</strong>, offering stable performance, essential connectivity, and support for the latest AMD AM5 processors and DDR5 memory.</p><p>For memory, the PC includes <strong>Kingston FURY Beast RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz EXPO RAM</strong>, ensuring fast system responsiveness, smooth multitasking, and improved performance across modern applications, games, and productivity tools.</p><p>Storage is handled by the <strong>Colorful CN600 PRO 256GB M.2 NVMe SSD</strong>, providing fast boot times, quick application loading, and overall improved system speed compared to traditional hard drives.</p><p>The system is housed in the <strong>Antec VX320 ARGB Mid Tower Gaming Casing</strong>, designed with modern airflow support and RGB aesthetics for a clean and attractive build.</p><p>Power is supplied by the <s