(425, 'AMD Ryzen 5 9600X Gaming Desktop PC', 'The AMD Ryzen 5 9600X Gaming PC from International Office Solution is a powerful AM5 desktop built for high-performance gaming, streaming, and productivity. Featuring DDR5 6000MHz RAM, fast NVMe SSD storage, and a B650 WiFi motherboard, it delivers smooth and responsive next-gen computing.', 'amd-ryzen-5-9600x-gaming-desktop-pc-1781263169', '<h3>AMD Ryzen 5 9600X AM5 Gaming Desktop PC</h3><p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 5 9600X Gaming PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a modern high-performance desktop designed for gamers, content creators, and professionals who need strong CPU power and future-ready platform support. Built on AMD’s latest AM5 architecture, this system ensures excellent speed, efficiency, and upgrade potential.</p><p>At the core of the system is the <strong>AMD Ryzen 5 9600X AM5 Desktop Gaming Processor</strong>, delivering outstanding single-core performance for gaming and strong multi-core capability for productivity tasks such as editing, multitasking, and software development.</p><p>The system is powered by the <strong>MSI B650M GAMING WIFI AM5 Micro-ATX Motherboard</strong>, offering stable performance, built-in WiFi connectivity, and full support for next-generation AMD AM5 processors and DDR5 memory.</p><p>For memory, the PC includes <strong>Kingston FURY Beast RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz EXPO RAM</strong>, ensuring ultra-fast system responsiveness, smooth multitasking, and enhanced gaming performance with stylish RGB lighting.</p><p>Storage is handled by the <strong>Team MP44L 500GB M.2 PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD</strong>, providing fast boot speeds, quick game loading, and efficient system performance for everyday use and gaming.</p><p>The system is housed in the <strong>MSI MAG FORGE M100A Micro-ATX Gaming Case</strong>, designed with airflow optimization and a clean gaming aesthetic for stable long-term performance.</p><p>Cooling is managed by the <strong>Gamdias ST-BOREAS E1-411 SE