(427, 'AMD Ryzen 5 8400F Gaming Desktop PC', 'The AMD Ryzen 5 8400F RTX 5050 Gaming PC from International Office Solution is a modern AM5 gaming desktop built for smooth 1080p and 1440p performance. Featuring RTX 5050 8GB graphics, 16GB DDR5 RGB RAM, and fast Gen4 NVMe storage, it delivers powerful next-gen gaming and productivity performance.', 'amd-ryzen-5-8400f-gaming-desktop-pc-1781263351', '<h3>MD Ryzen 5 8400F RTX 5050 AM5 Gaming PC</h3><p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 5 8400F Gaming PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a powerful and efficient desktop designed for gamers, streamers, and professionals who want strong performance on the latest AM5 platform. It delivers a balanced combination of speed, efficiency, and upgrade potential for modern computing needs.</p><p>At the core of the system is the <strong>AMD Ryzen 5 8400F Processor</strong>, offering strong multi-core and single-core performance for gaming, multitasking, and productivity applications. It ensures smooth gameplay and fast responsiveness across modern software and titles.</p><p>The system is powered by the <strong>MSI PRO B650M-P DDR5 AM5 Micro-ATX Motherboard</strong>, providing a stable and future-ready platform with support for DDR5 memory and advanced AMD AM5 processors.</p><p>For memory, the PC includes <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL36 RAM</strong>, delivering high-speed performance, smooth multitasking, and enhanced gaming experience with RGB lighting aesthetics.</p><p>Graphics are handled by the <strong>ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5050 Twin Edge 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong>, offering strong 1080p and entry-level 1440p gaming performance, ray tracing support, and efficient modern GPU architecture.</p><p>Storage is powered by the <strong>Team T-FORCE G50 512GB M.2 PCIe Gen4x4 NVMe SSD</strong>, ensuring fast boot times, quick loading speeds, and responsive system performance.</p><p>The system is housed in the <strong>T-Wolf City Ranger X7 ARGB Mi