(429, 'Gigabyte AORUS PRIME 3 AP351 Ryzen 5 9500F 16GB DDR5 RAM 1TB SSD RTX 5060 8GB Gaming PC', 'The AMD Ryzen 5 9500F RTX 5060 Gaming PC from International Office Solution is a next-gen AM5 desktop built for high-performance gaming and productivity. Featuring RTX 5060 WINDFORCE MAX 8GB graphics, DDR5 memory, 1TB Gen4 SSD, and WiFi 7 support, it delivers ultra-fast and smooth computing.', 'gigabyte-aorus-prime-3-ap351-ryzen-5-9500f-16gb-ddr5-ram-1tb-ssd-rtx-5060-8gb-gaming-pc-1781263546', '<h3>AMD Ryzen 5 9500F RTX 5060 High-End Gaming PC</h3><p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 5 9500F Gaming PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a powerful next-generation desktop designed for gamers, creators, and professionals who demand high speed, stability, and future-ready technology. Built on the AMD B850 chipset platform, it offers excellent performance, advanced connectivity, and long-term upgrade potential.</p><p>At the core of the system is the <strong>AMD Ryzen 5 9500F Processor</strong>, delivering high boost speeds up to 5GHz for smooth gaming, fast application response, and efficient multitasking performance.</p><p>The system is powered by an <strong>AMD B850 Chipset Motherboard</strong>, supporting advanced DDR5 memory, high-speed storage, and next-gen connectivity features including WiFi 7 and Bluetooth 5.4.</p><p>For memory, the PC includes <strong>16GB DDR5 5600MT/s RAM</strong>, expandable up to 256GB across 4 DIMM slots, ensuring fast multitasking and future upgrade flexibility.</p><p>Graphics are handled by the <strong>GeForce RTX 5060 WINDFORCE MAX OC 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong>, offering strong performance for 1080p ultra and 1440p gaming with ray tracing and modern GPU acceleration.</p><p>Storage is powered by a <strong>1TB PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD</strong>, providing ultra-fast boot times, quick game loading, and smooth system responsiveness. Additional SATA ports are available for expanded storage options.</p><p>The system includes a <strong>650W 80 PLUS Gold Power Supply</strong>, ensuring high efficiency, stable power delivery, and long-term reliability for demanding components.</p><p>Cooling is managed by an <strong>ARGB Air CPU Cooler</strong>, providing effective thermal performance with a stylish lighting design.</p><p>The system supports <strong>WiFi 7 and Bluetooth 5.4</strong>, along with a <strong>2.5GbE LAN port</strong>, ensuring ultra-fast wired and wireless connectivity for gaming and streaming.</p><p>The PC runs on <strong>Windows 11 Home</strong>, offering a modern, secure, and optimized user experience.</p><p>The system is housed in a compact <strong>M-ATX chassis (H400 × W205 × D410 mm)</strong> with multiple front and rear I/O ports for enhanced connectivity and usability.</p><p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 5 9500F RTX 5060 Gaming PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a premium choice for users seeking cutting-edge performance, fast storage, advanced connectivity, and smooth high-FPS gaming.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Model</td><td>AMD Ryzen 5 9500F (Up to 5GHz, 6MB Cache)</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Chipset</td><td>AMD B850</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Capacity &amp; Speed</td><td>16GB DDR5 5600MT/s (4 Slots, up to 256GB)</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Card</td><td>Model</td><td>GeForce RTX 5060 WINDFORCE MAX OC 8GB</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Type &amp; Capacity</td><td>1TB PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Storage Expansion</td><td>Ports</td><td>4 x SATA 6Gb/s</td></tr><tr><td>Power Supply</td><td>Rating</td><td>650W 80 PLUS Gold</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling</td><td>Type</td><td>ARGB Air CPU Cooler</td></tr><tr><td>Network</td><td>LAN</td><td>Realtek 2.5GbE</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Connectivity</td><td>WiFi 7, Bluetooth 5.4</td></tr><tr><td>OS</td><td>System</td><td>Windows 11 Home</td></tr><tr><td>Form Factor</td><td>C