(430, 'AMD Ryzen 7 7700 Gaming PC', 'The AMD Ryzen 7 7700 RTX 5060 Gaming PC from International Office Solution is a high-performance AM5 desktop built for smooth 1440p gaming, streaming, and productivity. Featuring RTX 5060 8GB GDDR7 graphics, 32GB DDR5 RGB RAM, and fast Gen4 NVMe storage, it delivers premium next-gen performance.', 'amd-ryzen-7-7700-gaming-pc-1781263618', '<h3>AMD Ryzen 7 7700 RTX 5060 High-End Gaming PC</h3><p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 7 7700 Gaming PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a powerful and future-ready desktop designed for gamers, content creators, and professionals who demand high speed, stability, and efficiency. Built on AMD’s AM5 platform, it offers excellent upgrade potential and strong real-world performance across gaming and productivity workloads.</p><p>At the core of the system is the <strong>AMD Ryzen 7 7700 Gaming Processor</strong>, delivering strong multi-core performance for demanding applications and high single-core speed for smooth gaming and responsive system performance.</p><p>The system is powered by the <strong>MSI PRO B850M-A WIFI AM5 Micro-ATX Motherboard</strong>, offering advanced stability, built-in WiFi connectivity, and support for next-generation DDR5 memory and AM5 processors.</p><p>For memory, the PC includes <strong>32GB (2x16GB) Kingston FURY Beast RGB DDR5 6000MHz EXPO RAM</strong>, ensuring ultra-smooth multitasking, fast application response, and excellent gaming performance with vibrant RGB lighting.</p><p>Graphics are handled by the <strong>MSI GeForce RTX 5060 8GB SHADOW 2X OC GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong>, delivering strong performance for 1080p ultra and 1440p high settings gaming, along with ray tracing and modern GPU features.</p><p>Storage is powered by the <strong>Corsair MP600 PRO NH 1TB PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD with DRAM Cache</strong>, offering extremely fast boot speeds, quick game loading, and stable high-performance storage for heavy workloads.</p><p>The system is ho