(431, 'Gigabyte AORUS PRIME 3 AP351 Ryzen 5 9500F 32GB DDR5 RAM 1TB SSD RTX 5060 Ti 16GB Gaming PC', 'The AMD Ryzen 5 9500F RTX 5060 Ti Gaming PC from International Office Solution is a high-end AM5 gaming desktop built for ultra-smooth 1440p performance. Featuring RTX 5060 Ti 16GB graphics, 32GB DDR5 RAM, 1TB Gen4 SSD, and WiFi 7 connectivity, it delivers next-level speed and efficiency.', 'gigabyte-aorus-prime-3-ap351-ryzen-5-9500f-32gb-ddr5-ram-1tb-ssd-rtx-5060-ti-16gb-gaming-pc-1781263791', '<h3>AMD Ryzen 5 9500F RTX 5060 Ti High-Performance Gaming PC</h3><p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 5 9500F Gaming PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a powerful next-generation desktop designed for gamers, streamers, and creators who demand maximum performance, stability, and future-ready technology. Built on the AMD B850 chipset platform, it provides advanced connectivity and excellent upgrade potential.</p><p>At the core of the system is the <strong>AMD Ryzen 5 9500F Processor</strong>, featuring high boost speeds up to 5GHz and strong multi-core performance, making it ideal for gaming, productivity, and heavy multitasking workloads.</p><p>The system is powered by an <strong>AMD B850 Chipset Motherboard</strong>, supporting DDR5 memory, high-speed storage, and advanced connectivity options including WiFi 7 and Bluetooth 5.4 for ultra-fast wireless performance.</p><p>For memory, the PC includes <strong>32GB (2x16GB) DDR5 5600MT/s RAM</strong>, offering smooth multitasking, fast system responsiveness, and excellent gaming performance with future upgrade support up to 256GB.</p><p>Graphics are handled by the <strong>GeForce RTX 5060 Ti WINDFORCE MAX OC 16GB GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong>, delivering outstanding performance for 1440p ultra and entry-level 4K gaming, with advanced ray tracing and AI-powered features.</p><p>Storage is powered by a <strong>1TB PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD</strong>, ensuring ultra-fast boot times, rapid game loading, and smooth system responsiveness. Additional SATA ports are available for expanded storage options.</p><p>The system includes a <strong>650W 80 PLUS Gold Power Supply</strong>, ensuring high efficiency, stable power delivery, and reliable long-term performance for demanding gaming components.</p><p>Cooling is managed by an <strong>ARGB Air CPU Cooler</strong>, providing efficient thermal performance while maintaining a stylish gaming aesthetic.</p><p>Connectivity is enhanced with <strong>Realtek 2.5GbE LAN, WiFi 7, and Bluetooth 5.4</strong>, ensuring ultra-fast wired and wireless networking for gaming, streaming, and downloads.</p><p>The system runs on <strong>Windows 11 Home</strong>, providing a modern, secure, and optimized operating environment.</p><p>The PC is housed in a compact <strong>M-ATX chassis (H400 × W205 × D410 mm)</strong> with a well-designed layout for airflow and expansion, supported by multiple front and rear I/O ports for maximum usability.</p><p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 5 9500F RTX 5060 Ti Gaming PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a premium choice for users seeking top-tier gaming performance, fast connectivity, and a future-ready AM5 platform.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Model</td><td>AMD Ryzen 5 9500F (Up to 5GHz, 6MB Cache)</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Chipset</td><td>AMD B850</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Capacity</td><td>32GB (2x16GB) DDR5 5600MT/s</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Card</td><td>Model</td><td>RTX 5060 Ti WINDFORCE MAX OC 16GB</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Type &amp; Capacity</td><td>1TB PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Storage Expansion</td><td>Ports</td><td>4 x SATA 6Gb/s</td></tr><tr><td>Power Supply</td><td>Rating</td><td>650W 80 PLUS Gold</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling</td><td>Type</td><td>ARGB Air CPU Cooler</td></tr><tr><td>Network</td><td>LAN</td><td>Realtek 2.5GbE</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Connectivity</td><td>WiFi 7, Bluetooth 5.4</td></tr><tr><td>OS</td><td>System</td><td>Windows 11 Home</td></tr><tr><td>Form Factor</td><td>Case</td><td>M-ATX (H400 × W205 × D410 mm)</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Coverage</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Desktop', 245000.00, 245000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/cArZhZsilsLwNrQ16Rd1C7gMTF8oohMIgvuRvpfK.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 11:29:51', '2026-06-12 11:29:51', 'AMD Ryzen 5 9500F RTX 5060 Ti Gaming PC | 32GB DDR5 1TB Gen4 WiFi 7 | International Office Solution', 'Buy AMD Ryzen 5 9500F RTX 5060 Ti Gaming PC from International Office Solution. Features 32GB DDR5 RAM, 1TB Gen4 SSD, WiFi 7, and 16GB GPU for ultra-smooth 1440p gaming.', 'AMD Ryzen 5 9500F Gaming PC, RTX 5060 Ti Gaming PC Bangladesh, B850 Gaming Desktop PC, 32GB DDR5 Gaming PC, 16GB GPU Gaming Computer, WiFi 7 Gaming PC, High End Gaming PC AMD, 1TB NVMe SSD Gaming PC, 1440p Ultra Gaming PC, Future Proof Gaming Desktop, Gaming PC Bangladesh 2026, International Office Solution, Custom High Performance PC, Next Gen Gaming Build, Fast SSD Gaming Computer, RGB Gaming Setup PC, Premium AMD Gaming PC, RTX 5060 Ti Build, Advanced Gaming Desktop, Professional Gaming PC', NULL, 6, NULL, NULL);
