(432, 'Gigabyte AORUS PRIME 5 AP551 Ryzen 7 9700X 32GB DDR5 RAM 2TB SSD RTX 5070 Ti OC 16GB Gaming PC', 'The AMD Ryzen 7 9700X RTX 5070 Ti Gaming PC from International Office Solution is a premium AM5 high-end desktop built for ultra 1440p and 4K gaming, streaming, and content creation. Featuring RTX 5070 Ti 16GB graphics, 32GB DDR5 RAM, 2TB Gen4 SSD, and WiFi 7, it delivers elite performance.', 'gigabyte-aorus-prime-5-ap551-ryzen-7-9700x-32gb-ddr5-ram-2tb-ssd-rtx-5070-ti-oc-16gb-gaming-pc-1781263902', '<h3>AMD Ryzen 7 9700X RTX 5070 Ti Premium Gaming PC</h3><p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 7 9700X Gaming PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a high-performance flagship desktop designed for gamers, streamers, and professionals who demand extreme speed, efficiency, and future-ready technology. Built on the AMD B850 chipset platform, it delivers cutting-edge performance and advanced connectivity.</p><p>At the core of the system is the <strong>AMD Ryzen 7 9700X Processor</strong>, featuring high boost speeds up to 5.5GHz and strong 8-core performance. It is optimized for high-FPS gaming, heavy multitasking, and demanding productivity workloads such as video editing, 3D rendering, and streaming.</p><p>The system is powered by an <strong>AMD B850 Chipset Motherboard</strong>, offering advanced stability, DDR5 support, high-speed I/O, and next-generation connectivity including WiFi 7 and Bluetooth 5.4.</p><p>For memory, the PC includes <strong>32GB (2x16GB) DDR5 RAM</strong>, ensuring smooth multitasking, fast responsiveness, and excellent performance for modern AAA gaming and professional workloads.</p><p>Graphics are handled by the <strong>GeForce RTX 5070 Ti WINDFORCE OC SFF 16GB GDDR6X Graphics Card</strong>, delivering elite performance for 1440p ultra and 4K high settings gaming with advanced ray tracing, DLSS support, and next-generation GPU efficiency.</p><p>Storage is powered by a <strong>2TB PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD</strong>, offering extremely fast boot times, rapid game loading, and large capacity for games, software, and creative projects.</p><p>The system includes an <strong>850W 80 PLUS Gold Power Supply</strong>, ensuring stable and efficient power delivery for high-end components and future upgrades.</p><p>Cooling is handled by a <strong>240mm AIO Liquid Cooler</strong>, providing excellent thermal control, quiet operation, and consistent performance under heavy loads.</p><p>Connectivity includes <strong>Realtek 2.5GbE LAN, WiFi 7, and Bluetooth 5.4</strong>, ensuring ultra-fast wired and wireless networking for gaming, streaming, and downloads.</p><p>The system runs on <strong>Windows 11</strong>, offering a modern, secure, and optimized computing experience.</p><p>The PC is housed in a premium full-size chassis (H469 × W211 × D458 mm) with optimized airflow, multiple I/O ports, and a clean high-performance layout designed for enthusiasts.</p><p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 7 9700X RTX 5070 Ti Gaming PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a top-tier solution for users who want extreme gaming performance, professional-grade productivity, and long-term upgrade potential.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Model</td><td>AMD Ryzen 7 9700X (Up to 5.5GHz, 8MB Cache)</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Chipset</td><td>AMD B850</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Capacity</td><td>32GB (2x16GB) DDR5</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Card</td><td>Model</td><td>RTX 5070 Ti WINDFORCE OC SFF 16GB</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Type &amp; Capacity</td><td>2TB PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Storage Expansion</td><td>Ports</td><td>4 x SATA 6Gb/s</td></tr><tr><td>Power Supply</td><td>Rating</td><td>850W 80 PLUS Gold</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling</td><td>Type</td><td>240mm AIO Liquid Cooler</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>System</td><td>7.1 Channel HD Audio</td></tr><tr><td>Network</td><td>LAN</td><td>Realtek 2.5GbE</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Connectivity</td><td>WiFi 7, Bluetooth 5.4</td></tr><tr><td>OS</td><td>System</td><td>Windows 11</td></tr><tr><td>Form Factor</td><td>Case</td><td>H469 × W211 × D458 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Coverage</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Desktop', 360000.00, 360000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/CdtVmHswtwZLT4X4j8x19q8lcthE4ApPxxe48DBq.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 11:31:42', '2026-06-12 11:31:42', 'AMD Ryzen 7 9700X RTX 5070 Ti Gaming PC | 32GB DDR5 2TB Gen4 AIO WiFi 7 | International Office Solution', 'Buy AMD Ryzen 7 9700X RTX 5070 Ti Gaming PC from International Office Solution. Features 32GB DDR5 RAM, 2TB NVMe SSD, AIO cooling, WiFi 7, and elite 4K gaming performance.', 'AMD Ryzen 7 9700X Gaming PC, RTX 5070 Ti Gaming PC Bangladesh, Flagship Gaming PC AM5, 32GB DDR5 Gaming Desktop, 2TB NVMe SSD Gaming PC, WiFi 7 Gaming PC, High End Gaming PC Bangladesh, 4K Gaming PC Build, Premium AMD Gaming PC, RTX 5070 Ti Build, AIO Liquid Cooling PC, Elite Gaming Desktop 2026, International Office Solution, Custom High Performance PC, Future Proof Gaming PC AM5, Next Gen Gaming Build, RGB Gaming Setup Premium, Professional Gaming PC, Ultra Gaming Desktop, High FPS Gaming Computer', NULL, 6, NULL, NULL),
(433, 'Gigabyte AORUS PRIME 5 B850 Ryzen 7 9700X 32GB DDR5 RAM 2TB SSD RTX 5080 16GB Graphics Gaming PC', 'The AMD Ryzen 7 9700X RTX 5080 Gaming PC from International Office Solution is an ultra high-end desktop built for 4K gaming, content creation, and professional workloads. Featuring RTX 5080 16GB GDDR7 graphics, 32GB DDR5 RAM, and a blazing-fast AORUS 2TB Gen4 SSD, it delivers elite-level performance.', 'gigabyte-aorus-prime-5-b850-ryzen-7-9700x-32gb-ddr5-ram-2tb-ssd-rtx-5080-16gb-graphics-gaming-pc-1781264042', '<h3>AMD Ryzen 7 9700X RTX 5080 Ultra High-End Gaming PC</h3><p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 7 9700X Gaming PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a flagship-class desktop designed for enthusiasts, gamers, and professionals who demand maximum performance, reliability, and cutting-edge technology. Built on the AMD B850 platform, it provides exceptional speed, stability, and expandability.</p><p>At its core is the <strong>AMD Ryzen 7 9700X Processor</strong>, featuring 32MB L3 cache and boost speeds up to 5.5GHz. It delivers outstanding single-core performance for gaming and powerful multi-core capability for demanding workloads such as 4K video editing, rendering, and multitasking.</p><p>The system is powered by a <strong>B850 Gaming WIFI6 Motherboard</strong>, offering advanced stability, PCIe Gen5 support, high-speed connectivity, and modern expansion options.</p><p>For memory, it includes <strong>32GB (2x16GB) DDR5 5600MHz RAM</strong>, ensuring smooth multitasking, fast application loading, and stable performance under heavy workloads.</p><p>Graphics are driven by the <strong>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5080 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong>, delivering extreme performance for 4K ultra gaming, real-time ray tracing, AI acceleration, and next-generation graphical workloads.</p><p>Storage is handled by a <strong>2TB AORUS GEN4 7300 NVMe SSD</strong>, providing extremely fast read/write speeds, near-instant boot times, and massive storage capacity for games, software, and creative projects.</p><p>The system includes a <strong>7.1-channel HD Audio system</strong>, delivering immersive sound quality for gaming and multimedia.</p><p>Connectivity is strong with <strong>1Gbps LAN, Wi-Fi 6, and Bluetooth 5.3</strong>, ensuring stable wired and wireless networking performance.</p><p>The PC runs on <strong>Windows 11 Home</strong>, offering a secure and modern operating environment optimized for gaming and productivity.</p><p>The system is housed in a large high-airflow chassis (H562 × W301 × D510 mm), designed for premium cooling support, multiple expansion options, and strong thermal performance. It also supports multiple USB ports, SATA expansion, and PCIe 5.0 slots for future upgrades.</p><p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 7 9700X RTX 5080 Gaming PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a true flagship system designed for users who want uncompromising 4K gaming performance, professional-grade computing power, and long-term future readiness.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Model</td><td>AMD Ryzen 7 9700X (Up to 5.5GHz, 32MB L3 Cache)</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Chipset</td><td>B850 Gaming WIFI6</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Capacity</td><td>32GB (2x16GB) DDR5 5600MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Card</td><td>Model</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5080 16GB GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Type &amp; Capacity</td><td>AORUS GEN4 7300 2TB NVMe SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>System</td><td>High Definition 7.1 Channel Audio</td></tr><tr><td>Network</td><td>LAN</td><td>1Gbps Ethernet</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Connectivity</td><td>Wi-Fi 6, Bluetooth 5.3</td></tr><tr><td>OS</td><td>System</td><td>Windows 11 Home</td></tr><tr><td>Expansion</td><td>Storage Ports</td><td>4 x SATA 6Gb/s</td></tr><tr><td>Form Factor</td><td>Case</td><td>H562 × W301 × D510 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Coverage</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Desktop', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/9PL40izOMkFJ9op8eyO9LDJVLF3zuZ039sgJjTdK.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 11:34:02', '2026-06-12 11:34:02', 'AMD Ryzen 7 9700X RTX 5080 Gaming PC | 32GB DDR5 2TB Gen4 AORUS SSD WiFi 6 | International Office Solution', 'Buy AMD Ryzen 7 9700X RTX 5080 Gaming PC from International Office Solution. Features 32GB DDR5 RAM, 2TB AORUS Gen4 SSD, WiFi 6, and ultra 4K gaming performance.', 'Buy AMD Ryzen 7 9700X RTX 5080 Gaming PC from International Office Solution. Features 32GB DDR5 RAM, 2TB AORUS Gen4 SSD, WiFi 6, and ultra 4K gaming performance.', NULL, 6, NULL, NULL),
(434, 'AMD Ryzen 7 5700X Gaming Desktop PC', 'The AMD Ryzen 7 5700X RX 580 Gaming PC from International Office Solution is a budget-friendly AM4 desktop built for smooth 1080p gaming and everyday performance. Featuring RX 580 8GB graphics, 8GB DDR4 RAM, and a 512GB NVMe SSD, it delivers solid performance at an affordable price.', 'amd-ryzen-7-5700x-gaming-desktop-pc-1781264135', '<h3>AMD Ryzen 7 5700X RX 580 Budget Gaming PC</h3><p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 7 5700X Gaming PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a reliable and cost-effective desktop designed for entry-level gamers, students, and general users who want strong performance on a budget. Built on the proven AM4 platform, it offers a balance of gaming capability and productivity efficiency.</p><p>At the core of the system is the <strong>AMD Ryzen 7 5700X Processor</strong>, delivering strong 8-core performance for multitasking, productivity workloads, and smooth system responsiveness. It is well-suited for gaming, office tasks, and content consumption.</p><p>The system is powered by the <strong>MSI B450M-A PRO MAX AM4 Motherboard</strong>, providing stable performance, upgrade support, and compatibility with AMD Ryzen processors.</p><p>For memory, the PC includes <strong>8GB Corsair Vengeance LPX DDR4 3200MHz RAM</strong>, ensuring basic multitasking performance and smooth everyday computing. The system can be upgraded further for improved performance.</p><p>Graphics are handled by the <strong>PELADN RX 580 8GB 256-bit Gaming Graphics Card</strong>, delivering reliable performance for 1080p gaming in popular titles, esports games, and older AAA games at medium to high settings.</p><p>Storage is powered by a <strong>512GB Colorful CN600 PRO M.2 NVMe SSD</strong>, offering fast boot times, quick application loading, and responsive system performance.</p><p>The system is housed in the <strong>Antec VX310 ARGB Mid Tower Gaming Casing</strong>, featuring airflow-focused design and ARGB aesthetics for a modern gaming look.</p><p>Cooling is managed by the <strong>Gamdias BOREAS M2-51D Digital Display Air Cooler</strong>, ensuring stable temperatures and efficient heat dissipation during gaming and daily use.</p><p>Power is supplied by the <strong>Gamdias AURA GP450 450W Power Supply</strong>, providing sufficient and stable power for the system’s components.</p><p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 7 5700X RX 580 Gaming PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a budget-friendly gaming solution designed for smooth 1080p gaming, productivity, and everyday computing needs.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Model</td><td>AMD Ryzen 7 5700X</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty (No Fan/Cooler Warranty)</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Model</td><td>MSI B450M-A PRO MAX AM4</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Capacity &amp; Speed</td><td>8GB Corsair Vengeance LPX DDR4 3200MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Card</td><td>Model</td><td>PELADN RX 580 8GB 256-bit</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Type &amp; Capacity</td><td>512GB Colorful CN600 PRO NVMe SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling</td><td>Model</td><td>Gamdias BOREAS M2-51D Air Cooler</td></tr><tr><td>Casing</td><td>Model</td><td>Antec VX310 ARGB Mid Tower Case</td></tr><tr><td>Power Supply</td><td>Model</td><td>Gamdias AURA GP450 450W</td></tr><tr><td>Power Supply</td><td>Warranty</td><td>2 Years Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Desktop', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/mZ8If1GhZj3jdWyI8q6hnPgXJ7C3XntWjmEqff6h.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 11:35:35', '2026-06-12 11:35:35', 'Basic Information\r\nProcessor\r\nAMD Ryzen 7 5700X Processor\r\n3 Years Warranty (No Warranty for Fan or Cooler)\r\nMotherboard\r\nMSI B450M-A PRO MAX AMD AM4 Motherboard\r\n3 Years Warr