(435, 'AMD Ryzen 7 9700X Gaming Desktop PC', 'Basic Information\r\nProcessor\r\nAMD Ryzen 7 9700X AM5 Desktop Gaming Processor\r\n3 Years Warranty (No Warranty for Fan or Cooler)\r\nMotherboard\r\nMSI B650M GAMING WIFI AM5 mATX Motherboard\r\n3 Years Warranty\r\nRAM\r\nCorsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL36 Desktop RAM\r\nLifetime Warranty\r\nGraphics Card\r\nMSI GeForce RTX 3060 VENTUS 2X OC 12GB GDDR6 Graphics Card\r\n3 Years Warranty\r\nStorage\r\nCorsair MP600 PRO NH 1TB PCIe Gen4 NVMe M.2 SSD With DRAM Cache\r\n06 Years Warranty\r\nCasing\r\nGamdias AURA GC12 ARGB Mid-Tower ATX Gaming Casing\r\nNo Warranty\r\nPower Supply\r\nCorsair RM850e 850W 80 Plus Gold Fully Modular ATX 3.1 Power Supply (UK)\r\n10 Years Warranty\r\nCPU Cooler\r\nCorsair NAUTILUS 240 RS ARGB 240mm Liquid CPU Cooler\r\n5 Years Warranty', 'amd-ryzen-7-9700x-gaming-desktop-pc-1781264211', '<h3>AMD Ryzen 7 9700X RTX 3060 Balanced Gaming PC</h3><p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 7 9700X Gaming PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a powerful and efficient desktop designed for gamers, creators, and professionals who need strong performance with excellent stability. Built on the AMD B650 AM5 platform, it offers modern features, upgrade flexibility, and long-term reliability.</p><p>At the core of the system is the <strong>AMD Ryzen 7 9700X AM5 Gaming Processor</strong>, delivering high clock speeds up to 5.5GHz and strong multi-core performance, making it ideal for gaming, streaming, and productivity tasks such as editing and multitasking.</p><p>The system is powered by the <strong>MSI B650M GAMING WIFI AM5 Motherboard</strong>, providing excellent stability, built-in WiFi connectivity, and full support for DDR5 memory and next-generation AM5 processors.</p><p>For memory, the PC includes <strong>16GB Corsair VENGEANCE DDR5 6000MHz CL36 RAM</strong>, ensuring fast system responsiveness, smooth multitasking, and strong gaming performance with future upgrade potential.</p><p>Graph