(437, 'AMD Ryzen 7 9800X3D Gaming Desktop PC', 'The AMD Ryzen 7 9800X3D Gaming PC from International Office Solution is a high-end AM5 gaming desktop built for extreme FPS performance and smooth 1440p/4K gaming. Featuring 3D V-Cache CPU, 32GB DDR5 RGB RAM, Gen4 NVMe SSD, and advanced liquid cooling, it delivers elite gaming power.', 'amd-ryzen-7-9800x3d-gaming-desktop-pc-1781264370', '<h3>AMD Ryzen 7 9800X3D High-End Gaming PC</h3><p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 7 9800X3D Gaming PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a premium next-generation gaming system designed for enthusiasts who demand maximum gaming performance, ultra-low latency, and cutting-edge AM5 platform technology. Built on the MSI PRO X870-P WIFI motherboard, it delivers exceptional stability and future-ready expandability.</p><p>At the core of the system is the <strong>AMD Ryzen 7 9800X3D Gaming Processor</strong>, featuring advanced 3D V-Cache technology for dramatically improved gaming performance, higher frame rates, and ultra-smooth responsiveness in CPU-intensive titles.</p><p>The system is powered by the <strong>MSI PRO X870-P WIFI AM5 ATX Motherboard</strong>, offering next-generation connectivity, PCIe support, enhanced stability, and integrated WiFi for seamless high-speed networking.</p><p>For memory, it includes <strong>32GB Kingston FURY Beast DDR5 6000MHz CL30 RGB RAM</strong>, delivering ultra-fast performance, low latency, and smooth multitasking for gaming, streaming, and content creation.</p><p>Storage is handled by the <strong>Corsair MP600 PRO NH 1TB PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD with DRAM Cache</strong>, ensuring lightning-fast boot times, rapid game loading, and consistent high-speed performance under heavy workloads.</p><p>Graphics performance is supported through high-end GPU compatibility via PCIe architecture, making it suitable for modern AAA gaming and GPU-intensive workloads.</p><p>The system is housed in the <strong>MSI MAG FORGE 120A AIRFLOW Mid-Tower Gaming Case</strong>, designed for high airflow efficiency, stable thermals, and optimized cooling performance.</p><p>Cooling is managed by the <strong>MSI MAG CORELIQUID A15 240 ARGB Liquid CPU Cooler</strong>, providing excellent thermal control, quiet operation, and stable boost performance even under heavy gaming loads.</p><p>Power is supplied by the <strong>MSI MAG A750GL PCIe5 750W 80 PLUS Gold Fully Modular Power Supply</strong>, ensuring reliable, efficient, and future-ready power delivery for high-performance components.</p><p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 7 9800X3D Gaming PC from International Office Solution</strong> is an elite AM5 system engineered for gamers who want maximum FPS, top-tier responsiveness, and a future-proof high-performance platform.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Model</td><td>AMD Ryzen 7 9800X3D Gaming Processor</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty (No Fan/Cooler Warranty)</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Model</td><td>MSI PRO X870-P WIFI AM5 ATX</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Capacity &amp; Speed</td><td>32GB Kingston FURY Beast DDR5 6000MHz CL30 RGB</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Type &amp; Capacity</td><td>Corsair MP600 PRO NH 1TB Gen4 NVMe SSD (DRAM Cache)</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Warranty</td><td>5 Years Limited Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling</td><td>Model</td><td>MSI MAG CORELIQUID A15 240 ARGB Liquid Cooler</td></tr><tr><td>Casing</td><td>Model</td><td>MSI MAG FORGE 120A AIRFLOW Case</td></tr><tr><td>Power Supply</td><td>Model</td><td>MSI MAG A750GL 750W 80+ Gold Fully Modular</td></tr><tr><td>Power Supply</td><td>Warranty</td><td>10 Years Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Desktop', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/tRapBrYemgJXh0xRS4ZigHdBQKuR9cOOo1q9QIL7.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '202