(438, 'AMD Ryzen 9 9900X Gaming PC', 'The AMD Ryzen 9 9900X RTX 5080 Gaming PC from International Office Solution is an ultra high-end AM5 desktop built for extreme 4K gaming, streaming, and professional workloads. Featuring RTX 5080 16GB GDDR7 graphics, DDR5 6000MHz RAM, Gen5 NVMe SSD, and 360mm liquid cooling, it delivers flagship performance.', 'amd-ryzen-9-9900x-gaming-pc-1781264479', '<h3>AMD Ryzen 9 9900X RTX 5080 Ultra High-End Gaming PC</h3><p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 9 9900X Gaming PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a flagship-class desktop designed for enthusiasts, gamers, and creators who demand maximum performance, stability, and next-generation technology. Built on the MSI MAG X870 TOMAHAWK WIFI AM5 platform, it delivers cutting-edge connectivity and strong upgrade potential.</p><p>At the core of the system is the <strong>AMD Ryzen 9 9900X Processor</strong>, delivering exceptional multi-core performance for heavy workloads such as 4K/8K video editing, 3D rendering, streaming, and high-FPS competitive gaming.</p><p>The system is powered by the <strong>MSI MAG X870 TOMAHAWK WIFI AM5 Motherboard</strong>, offering premium stability, advanced power delivery, PCIe Gen5 support, and integrated WiFi for ultra-fast connectivity.</p><p>For memory, the PC includes <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL36 RAM</strong>, ensuring fast responsiveness, stable multitasking, and efficient performance for gaming and productivity workloads.</p><p>Graphics are handled by the <strong>Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 5080 Ultra W OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong>, delivering elite performance for 4K ultra gaming, ray tracing, AI acceleration, and demanding creative applications.</p><p>Storage is powered by the <strong>Corsair MP700 PRO XT 1TB PCIe Gen5 NVMe SSD</strong>, offering extreme read/write speeds, near-instant boot times, and next-generation storage performance for professional workloads and gaming.</p><p>The system is housed in th