(439, 'AMD Ryzen 5 5600 Desktop PC', 'The AMD Ryzen 5 5600 Budget PC from International Office Solution is an affordable AM4 desktop built for everyday use, office work, and light multimedia tasks. Featuring Ryzen 5 5600 CPU, GT 710 graphics, DDR4 RAM, and NVMe SSD, it delivers stable basic performance.', 'amd-ryzen-5-5600-desktop-pc-1781264569', '<h3>AMD Ryzen 5 5600 Budget Desktop PC</h3><p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 5 5600 Budget PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a cost-effective computing solution designed for office users, students, and general home use. Built on the AM4 platform, it offers reliable performance for productivity tasks, browsing, media consumption, and light workloads.</p><p>At the core of the system is the <strong>AMD Ryzen 5 5600 Processor</strong>, a 6-core, 12-thread CPU known for its strong efficiency and stable multitasking performance. It is suitable for office applications, online classes, and day-to-day computing tasks.</p><p>The system is powered by the <strong>MSI B450M-A PRO MAX II AM4 Motherboard</strong>, providing stable performance, essential connectivity, and upgrade support within the AM4 ecosystem.</p><p>For memory, it includes <strong>8GB Team T-Force Vulcan Z DDR4 3200MHz RAM</strong>, ensuring smooth operation for basic multitasking and everyday applications.</p><p>Graphics are handled by the <strong>Colorful GeForce GT 710 2GB Graphics Card</strong>, designed for display output, multimedia playback, and light graphical tasks.</p><p>Storage is powered by the <strong>Colorful CN600 PRO 256GB M.2 NVMe SSD</strong>, offering fast boot times, quick application loading, and improved system responsiveness compared to traditional hard drives.</p><p>The system is housed in the <strong>MSI MAG FORGE M100A Micro-ATX Gaming Case</strong>, designed for airflow efficiency and compact build structure.</p><p>Power is supplied by the <strong>Antec META V450 450W Power Supply</strong>, providing stable and efficie