(440, 'MSI MEG Vision X AI 2nd Z890 Core Ultra 9 285K RTX 5080 16GB Graphics AI Gaming PC', 'The Intel Core Ultra 9 285K RTX 5080 Gaming PC from International Office Solution is an extreme high-end workstation built for 4K/8K gaming, AI workloads, and professional rendering. Featuring RTX 5080 16GB GDDR7, 128GB DDR5 RAM, Gen5 SSD, and 360mm liquid cooling, it delivers flagship performance.', 'msi-meg-vision-x-ai-2nd-z890-core-ultra-9-285k-rtx-5080-16gb-graphics-ai-gaming-pc-1781264711', '<h3>Intel Core Ultra 9 285K RTX 5080 Extreme Performance PC</h3><p>The <strong>Intel Core Ultra 9 285K Gaming PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a next-generation flagship desktop engineered for professionals, gamers, and creators who demand maximum computing power. Built on the Intel Z890 platform, it combines cutting-edge performance, advanced connectivity, and massive upgrade capability.</p><p>At the core of the system is the <strong>Intel Core Ultra 9 285K Processor</strong>, featuring up to 5.70GHz turbo frequency and large cache design for extreme performance in gaming, AI workloads, 3D rendering, and heavy multitasking.</p><p>The system is powered by a <strong>Z890 high-end motherboard platform</strong>, offering PCIe Gen5 support, Thunderbolt 4 connectivity, ultra-fast I/O ports, and next-generation system stability.</p><p>For memory, it includes an ultra-large <strong>128GB DDR5 5600MHz RAM configuration</strong>, enabling seamless multitasking, heavy content creation, virtualization, and professional-grade workloads.</p><p>Graphics are handled by the <strong>MSI GeForce RTX 5080 16GB VENTUS 3X GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong>, delivering elite-level 4K and 8K gaming performance, real-time ray tracing, and advanced AI acceleration for creative applications.</p><p>Storage is powered by a <strong>2TB PCIe Gen5 NVMe SSD</strong>, offering ultra-fast read/write speeds for instant booting, rapid file transfers, and professional data handling.</p><p>The system supports multiple expansion storage options including M.2 Gen5 and Gen4 slots, SATA connectivity, and additional drive bays for maximum flexibility.</p><p>Cooling is handled by a <strong>360mm high-performance liquid cooling system</strong>, ensuring stable temperatures under extreme workloads and long gaming sessions.</p><p>Power is supplied by a <strong>1200W 80 PLUS Gold Certified Power Supply</strong>, delivering stable, efficient, and future-proof energy for high-end components.</p><p>The system includes advanced connectivity options such as <strong>Intel Killer E5000 Ethernet, WiFi BE1750, Bluetooth 5.4, and Thunderbolt 4 ports</strong>, ensuring ultra-fast networking and professional-grade data transfer capabilities.</p><p>The <strong>Intel Core Ultra 9 285K RTX 5080 PC from International Office Solution</strong> is a flagship-class machine designed for users who want no-compromise performance for gaming, AI, and professional workloads.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Model</td><td>Intel Core Ultra 9 285K</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Cache/Speed</td><td>36MB Cache, up to 5.70GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Platform</td><td>Intel Z890</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Capacity</td><td>128GB DDR5 5600MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Card</td><td>Model</td><td>MSI RTX 5080 16GB VENTUS 3X GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Type</td><td>2TB PCIe Gen5 NVMe SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling</td><td>Type</td><td>360mm Liquid Cooler</td></tr><tr><td>Power Supply</td><td>Rating</td><td>1200W 80+ Gold Certified</td></tr><tr><td>Networking</td><td>Connectivity</td><td>WiFi 7 / Bluetooth 5.4 / 2.5G LAN</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>High-Speed</td><td>Thunderbolt 4, USB 3.2 Gen2x2</td></tr><tr><td>OS</td><td>System</td><td>Windows 11 Home</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Desktop', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/WJwuGx5lyaRWRpBO8UgG5jsQmxeqIX8FeauhGmO7.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 11:45:11', '2026-06-12 11:45:11', 'Intel Core Ultra 9 285K RTX 5080 128GB DDR5 Gaming PC | Z890 2TB Gen5 SSD 1200W PSU | International Office Solution', 'Intel Core Ultra 9 285K PC, RTX 5080 Gaming PC Bangladesh, 128GB DDR5 Workstation PC, Z890 Gaming Desktop PC, 2TB Gen5 SSD PC, High End Gaming PC Bangladesh, AI Workstation PC Build, 4K 8K Gaming PC, Extreme Gaming Desktop, MSI RTX 5080 PC, Thunderbolt 4 Gaming PC, WiFi 7 Desktop PC, International Office Solution, Flagship Gaming PC Build, Professional Editing PC, Rendering Workstation PC, Ultra High Performance PC, Next Gen Intel PC Build, Premium Gaming Computer, Heavy Duty PC Build', 'Intel Core Ultra 9 285K PC, RTX 5080 Gaming PC Bangladesh, 128GB DDR5 Workstation PC, Z890 Gaming Desktop PC, 2TB Gen5 SSD PC, High End Gaming PC Bangladesh, AI Workstation PC Build, 4K 8K Gaming PC, Extreme Gaming Desktop, MSI RTX 5080 PC, Thunderbolt 4 Gaming PC, WiFi 7 Desktop PC, International Office Solution, Flagship Gaming PC Build, Professional Editing PC, Rendering Workstation PC, Ultra High Performance PC, Next Gen Intel PC Build, Premium Gaming Computer, Heavy Duty PC Build', NULL, 6, NULL, NULL);
