(441, 'AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D Gaming PC', 'The AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D RTX 5090 Gaming PC from International Office Solution is an ultimate flagship AM5 system designed for extreme 4K/8K gaming, AI workloads, and professional rendering. Featuring RTX 5090 32GB GDDR7, X3D gaming CPU, DDR5 6000MHz RAM, Gen5 SSD, and premium cooling, it delivers unmatched performance.', 'amd-ryzen-9-9950x3d-gaming-pc-1781264817', '<h3>MD Ryzen 9 9950X3D RTX 5090 Ultra Flagship Gaming PC</h3><p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D Gaming PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> represents the highest tier of consumer computing performance, engineered for elite gamers, content creators, AI developers, and professionals who demand absolute maximum power. Built on the AMD X870E GODLIKE WiFi 7 platform, it delivers cutting-edge connectivity, extreme stability, and next-generation performance.</p><p>At the core of the system is the <strong>AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D Processor</strong>, featuring advanced 3D V-Cache technology that significantly boosts gaming performance, delivering exceptional FPS, ultra-low latency, and superior responsiveness in CPU-intensive workloads.</p><p>The system is powered by the <strong>MSI MEG X870E GODLIKE WiFi 7 E-ATX Motherboard</strong>, a flagship-class platform offering PCIe Gen5 support, premium power delivery, WiFi 7 connectivity, and extensive expansion capabilities for extreme high-end builds.</p><p>For memory, it includes <strong>64GB (2x32GB) Kingston FURY Beast DDR5 6000MHz CL30 RGB RAM</strong>, providing massive bandwidth, ultra-fast performance, and seamless multitasking for gaming, rendering, streaming, and professional workloads.</p><p>Graphics are handled by the <strong>GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5090 GAMING OC 32GB GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong>, delivering unparalleled 4K and 8K gaming performance, AI acceleration, real-time ray tracing, and extreme creative computing power.</p><p>Storage is powered by the <strong>Team T-FORCE GE PRO 2TB PCIe Gen5 NVMe SSD with AirFlow Heatsink</strong>, ensuring extreme read/write speeds, instant load times, and professional-grade data handling performance.</p><p>The system is housed in the <strong>Antec C8 CURVE WOOD Full Tower E-ATX Gaming Case</strong>, combining premium airflow design with a modern wood-accent aesthetic and full panoramic display support.</p><p>Cooling is enhanced with <strong>DeepCool FC120 ARGB Performance Case Fans</strong>, ensuring optimized airflow and stable thermal performance during heavy workloads.</p><p>CPU cooling is managed by the <strong>ASUS ROG RYUJIN III 360 ARGB AIO Liquid Cooler with LCD Display</strong>, offering elite thermal control, silent operation, and real-time system monitoring via its display panel.</p><p>Power is supplied by the <strong>MSI MEG Ai1600T 1600W 80 PLUS Titanium Fully Modular Power Supply</strong>, ensuring maximum efficiency, rock-solid stability, and future-proof power delivery for ultra-high-end components.</p><p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D RTX 5090 Gaming PC from International Office Solution</strong> is a true no-compromise flagship system built for users who demand the absolute best performance available in modern computing.</p>', '<ul><li>GIGABYTE RTX 5090 32GB GDDR7 Ultra GPU</li><li>Massive 64GB DDR5 6000MHz CL30 RGB RAM</li><li>MSI X870E GODLIKE WiFi 7 Premium Motherboard</li><li>2TB PCIe Gen5 NVMe Ultra-Speed SSD</li><li>ASUS ROG Ryujin III 360mm LCD AIO Cooling</li><li>1600W 80+ Titanium Flagship PSU</li><li>Full Tower E-ATX Premium Gaming Case</li><li>WiFi 7 + PCIe Gen5 Next-Gen Platform</li><li>Ultimate 4K/8K Gaming &amp; AI Workstation</li></ul><h2>Specifications</h2><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Model</td><td>AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty (No Fan/Cooler Warranty)</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Model</td><td>MSI MEG X870E GODLIKE WiFi 7 E-ATX</td></tr><tr><td>Motherboard</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Capacity</td><td>64GB (2x32GB) DDR5 6000MHz CL30 RGB</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Card</td><td>Model</td><td>GIGABYTE RTX 5090 GAMING OC 32GB GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Type</td><td>Team T-FORCE GE PRO 2TB PCIe Gen5 NVMe SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling</td><td>CPU Cooler</td><td>ASUS ROG RYUJIN III 360 ARGB LCD AIO</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling</td><td>Case Fans</td><td>DeepCool FC120 ARGB 3-in-1 Fans</td></tr><tr><td>Casing</td><td>Model</td><td>Antec C8 CURVE WOOD Full Tower</td></tr><tr><td>Power Supply</td><td>Model</td><td>MSI MEG Ai1600T 1600W 80+ Titanium</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Desktop', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/B9qEUjyTSdwUBCFykHEB98BuDnSPPzrR4pn4P3uc.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 11:46:57', '2026-06-12 11:46:57', 'AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D Gaming PC, RTX 5090 Gaming PC Bangladesh, Flagship Gaming Desktop PC, 64GB DDR5 RGB PC Build, X870E GODLIKE Gaming PC, 2TB Gen5 SSD PC, Ultra High End Gaming PC, 4K 8K Gaming PC Build, AI Workstation PC Bangladesh, Premium AMD Gaming Build, WiFi 7 Gaming PC, MSI GODLIKE Motherboard PC, RTX 5090 32GB GDDR7 PC, Liquid Cooled Gaming PC, International Office Solution, Extreme Performance PC Build, Next Gen Flagship PC, High End Rendering PC, Ultimate Gaming Computer, Professional Creator PC Build', 'Buy AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D RTX 5090 Gaming PC from International Office Solution. Features 64GB DDR5 CL30 RAM, 2TB Gen5 SSD, WiFi 7 X870E motherboard, and 360mm LCD liquid cooling for ultimate performance.', 'AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D Gaming PC, RTX 5090 Gaming PC Bangladesh, Flagship Gaming Desktop PC, 64GB DDR5 RGB PC Build, X870E GODLIKE Gaming PC, 2TB Gen5 SSD PC, Ultra High End Gaming PC, 4K 8K Gaming PC Build, AI Workstation PC Bangladesh, Premium AMD Gaming Build, WiFi 7 Gaming PC, MSI GODLIKE Motherboard PC, RTX 5090 32GB GDDR7 PC, Liquid Cooled Gaming PC, International Office Solution, Extreme Performance PC Build, Next Gen Flagship PC, High End Rendering PC, Ultimate Gaming Computer, Professional Creator PC Build', NULL, 6, NULL, NULL),
(442, 'Dell EC24250 Intel Core i5 1334U 23.8\" FHD All-in-One PC', 'The Intel Core i5 1334U All-in-One PC from International Office Solution is a compact and efficient AIO desktop designed for office, study, and everyday use. Featuring 23.8” FHD display, 8GB DDR5 RAM, 512GB NVMe SSD, WiFi 6E, and wireless peripherals, it delivers a clean and space-saving computing experience.', 'dell-ec24250-intel-core-i5-1334u-238-fhd-all-in-one-pc-1781265147', '<h3>Intel Core i5 1334U All-in-One Desktop PC</h3><p>The <strong>Intel Core i5 1334U All-in-One PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a modern, space-saving desktop solution designed for home users, office environments, students, and business professionals. With its integrated design and wireless setup, it provides a clean workspace without sacrificing performance or usability.</p><p>At the core of the system is the <strong>Intel Core i5 1334U Processor</strong>, featuring 10 cores and up to 4.60GHz turbo frequency, delivering efficient performance for multitasking, office applications, web browsing, video conferencing, and daily computing tasks.</p><p>The system includes <strong>8GB DDR5 RAM</strong>, ensuring smooth multitasking and responsive performance for everyday workloads.</p><p>Storage is handled by a <strong>512GB NVMe SSD</strong>, offering fast boot times, quick application loading, and reliable system responsiveness.</p><p>Graphics are powered by <strong>Intel Integrated Graphics</strong>, suitable for office work, multimedia playback, online meetings, and light creative tasks.</p><p>The centerpiece of the system is the <strong>23.8-inch Full HD (1920×1080) Anti-Glare Display</strong>, providing clear visuals, comfortable viewing, and a professional workspace experience.</p><p>Audio is delivered through <strong>stereo speakers with Realtek ALC3289 (5W x 2)</strong>, ensuring clear sound for meetings, media, and daily use.</p><p>The system includes a <strong>2.07MP FHD RGB tilt camera</strong>, ideal for video conferencing and online communication.</p><p>For connectivity, it supports <strong>Intel Wi-Fi 6E and Bluetooth</strong>, ensuring fast and stable wireless performance.</p><p>The package includes a <strong>wireless keyboard and wireless mouse</strong>, creating a clutter-free and modern desktop setup.</p><p>Storage expansion and connectivity are supported through multiple USB ports, HDMI-in/out, RJ45 Ethernet, and headset jack, making it versatile for office and home environments.</p><p>The <strong>Intel Core i5 1334U All-in-One PC from International Office Solution</strong> is a perfect choice for users who want a clean, compact, and efficient desktop solution for everyday productivity.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Model</td><td>Intel Core i5 1334U</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Cores/Threads</td><td>10 Cores, 12 Threads</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Memory</td><td>8GB DDR5</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics</td><td>Type</td><td>Intel Integrated Graphics</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Capacity</td><td>512GB NVMe SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Size</td><td>23.8 Inch FHD (1920×1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Type</td><td>Anti-Glare Panel</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>System</td><td>Stereo Speakers (5W x 2)</td></tr><tr><td>Camera</td><td>Resolution</td><td>2.07MP FHD Tilt Camera</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Wireless</td><td>WiFi 6E + Bluetooth</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>I/O</td><td>USB 3.2, HDMI-in/out, RJ45</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Adapter</td><td>90W AC Adapter</td></tr><tr><td>OS</td><td>System</td><td>Windows 11 Home</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Coverage</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Desktop, All In One PC', 105000.00, 105000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/Rpchquc48sRPdBVmPC59JSMLrRnwv2yc7qToeKPJ.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 11:52:27', '2026-06-12 11:52:27', 'Intel Core i5 1334U All-in-One PC | 8GB DDR5 512GB NVMe 23.8\" FHD WiFi 6E AIO Desktop | International Office Solution', 'Buy Intel Core i5 1334U All-in-One PC from International Office Solution. Features 23.8” FHD display, 8GB DDR5 RAM, 512GB NVMe SSD, WiFi 6E, and wireless keyboard & mouse.', 'Intel Core i5 All in One PC, AIO Desktop PC Bangladesh, 23.8 inch FHD All in One Computer, 8GB DDR5 AIO PC, 512GB NVMe All in One PC, WiFi 6E Desktop PC, Office All in One PC Bangladesh, Home Use AIO Computer, Intel i5 1334U Desktop, Space Saving PC Bangladesh, Wireless Keyboard Mouse PC, International Office Solution, Business All in One PC, Student Desktop PC, Modern AIO Computer, FHD All in One PC, Compact Office PC, Budget AIO Desktop, Everyday Use Computer, Slim Desktop PC', NULL, 10, NULL, NULL),
(443, 'Dell Inspiron 5430 Intel Core 5 120U 23.8\" FHD All-in-One PC', 'The Intel Core 5 120U All-in-One PC from International Office Solution is a sleek and space-saving desktop designed for office, study, and everyday use. Featuring a 23.8” FHD anti-glare display, 8GB DDR5 RAM, 512GB SSD, WiFi 6E, and wireless peripherals, it offers a clean and efficient computing experience.', 'dell-inspiron-5430-intel-core-5-120u-238-fhd-all-in-one-pc-1781265279', '<h3>Intel Core 5 120U All-in-One Desktop PC</h3><p>The <strong>Intel Core 5 120U All-in-One PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a modern compact desktop solution built for productivity, education, and everyday computing. With its integrated design and wireless setup, it helps reduce desk clutter while delivering reliable performance for daily tasks.</p><p>At the core of the system is the <strong>Intel Core 5 120U Processor</strong>, featuring 10 cores and up to 5.0GHz turbo frequency, designed for efficient multitasking, office applications, web browsing, online meetings, and general productivity workloads.</p><p>The system includes <strong>8GB DDR5 memory</strong>, providing smooth performance for everyday multitasking and standard applications.</p><p>Storage is powered by a <strong>512GB SSD</strong>, ensuring fast boot times, quick file access, and responsive system performance.</p><p>Graphics are handled by <strong>Intel Integrated Graphics</strong>, suitable for office work, multimedia playback, presentations, and light creative use.</p><p>The centerpiece of the system is the <strong>23.8-inch Full HD (1920×1080) Anti-Glare Narrow Border AIT Infinity Display</strong>, offering sharp visuals, comfortable viewing angles, and a modern workspace experience.</p><p>Audio is delivered through <strong>stereo speakers with Realtek ALC3289 (5W x 2)</strong>, providing clear sound for meetings, videos, and daily use.</p><p>For communication, the system includes a <strong>2.07MP FHD RGB tilt camera</strong>, ideal for video conferencing and online collaboration.</p><p>Connectivity is enhanced with <strong>WiFi 6E and Bluetooth support</strong>, ensuring fast and stable wireless performance.</p><p>The system comes bundled with a <strong>wireless keyboard and mouse</strong>, offering a clean, cable-free desktop setup.</p><p>Multiple I/O ports including USB Type-C, HDMI-in/out, RJ45 Ethernet, and SD card support provide flexible connectivity for office and home environments.</p><p>The <strong>Intel Core 5 120U All-in-One PC from International Office Solution</strong> is an excellent choice for users who want a modern, minimal, and efficient desktop system for everyday productivity.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Model</td><td>Intel Core 5 120U</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Cores/Threads</td><td>10 Cores, 12 Threads</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Memory</td><td>8GB DDR5 3200MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics</td><td>Type</td><td>Intel Integrated Graphics</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Capacity</td><td>512GB SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Size</td><td>23.8 Inch FHD (1920×1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Type</td><td>Anti-Glare Narrow Border AIT Infinity</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>System</td><td>Stereo Speakers (5W x 2)</td></tr><tr><td>Camera</td><td>Resolution</td><td>2.07MP FHD RGB Tilt Camera</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Wireless</td><td>WiFi 6E + Bluetooth</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>I/O</td><td>USB 3.2, HDMI-in/out, RJ45, SD Card</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Adapter</td><td>90W AC Adapter</td></tr><tr><td>OS</td><td>System</td><td>Windows 11</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Coverage</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Desktop, All In One PC', 110000.00, 110000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/bSh8vsI4PzVRk8PwlnqLbxe0uuy5JR3z61HEFquy.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 11:54