(444, 'Dell EC24250 Intel Core 7 150U 23.8\" FHD Display All-in-One PC', 'The Intel Core 7 150U All-in-One PC from International Office Solution is a powerful and elegant AIO desktop designed for smooth office work, multitasking, and daily productivity. Featuring a 23.8” FHD anti-glare display, 16GB DDR5 RAM, 512GB NVMe SSD, WiFi 6E, and wireless peripherals, it delivers a premium all-in-one experience.', 'dell-ec24250-intel-core-7-150u-238-fhd-display-all-in-one-pc-1781265409', '<h3>ntel Core 7 150U All-in-One Desktop PC</h3><p>The <strong>Intel Core 7 150U All-in-One PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a premium compact desktop solution designed for professionals, office users, and home productivity. With its sleek integrated design, it reduces cable clutter while delivering strong performance for multitasking and daily computing needs.</p><p>At the core of the system is the <strong>Intel Core 7 150U Processor</strong>, featuring 10 cores and up to 5.4GHz turbo frequency, providing efficient performance for office applications, multitasking, browsing, presentations, and video conferencing.</p><p>The system comes with <strong>16GB DDR5 (8x2) dual-channel memory</strong>, ensuring smooth multitasking and faster response times compared to single-channel configurations.</p><p>Storage is powered by a <strong>512GB NVMe SSD</strong>, offering fast boot speeds, quick application loading, and reliable system responsiveness.</p><p>Graphics are handled by <strong>Intel Integrated Graphics</strong>, suitable for office work, multimedia playback, and light creative tasks.</p><p>The centerpiece of the system is the <strong>23.8-inch Full HD (1920×1080) Anti-Glare Display</strong>, delivering clear visuals, wide viewing comfort, and a modern professional workspace experience.</p><p>Audio is provided through <strong>stereo speakers with Realtek ALC3289 (5W x 2)</strong> for clear sound output during meetings, media playback, and daily use.</p><p>A <strong>2.07MP FHD RGB tilt camera</strong> is included, making it ideal for video conferencing and online communication.</p><p>Connectivity includes <strong>Intel WiFi 6E and Bluetooth</strong>, ensuring fast and stable wireless performance for modern office environments.</p><p>The system comes with a <strong>wireless keyboard and mouse</strong>, giving users a clean, cable-free workspace setup.</p><p>Multiple connectivity options including USB 3.2 ports, HDMI input/output, RJ45 LAN, and headset support provide flexible usage for both office and home environments.</p><p>The <strong>Intel Core 7 150U All-in-One PC from International Office Solution</strong> is a strong, elegant, and efficient solution for users who need reliable performance in a minimal space-saving design.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Model</td><td>Intel Core 7 150U</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Cores/Threads</td><td>10 Cores, 12 Threads</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Memory</td><td>16GB DDR5 (8x2)</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics</td><td>Type</td><td>Intel Integrated Graphics</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Capacity</td><td>512GB NVMe SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Size</td><td>23.8 Inch FHD (1920×1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Type</td><td>Anti-Glare IPS Panel</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>System</td><td>Stereo Speakers (5W x 2)</td></tr><tr><td>Camera</td><td>Resolution</td><td>2.07MP FHD RGB Tilt Camera</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Wireless</td><td>WiFi 6E + Bluetooth</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>I/O</td><td>USB 3.2, HDMI-in/out, RJ45</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Adapter</td><td>90W AC Adapter</td></tr><tr><td>OS</td><td>System</td><td>Windows 11 Home</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Coverage</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Desktop, All In One PC', 130000.00, 130000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/Aj7jKDUOq8CPuxZ2LvGW