(445, 'Dell EC24250 Intel Core 7 150U 1TB SSD 23.8\" FHD Touch Display All-in-One PC', 'The Intel Core 7 150U Touch All-in-One PC from International Office Solution is a premium touchscreen AIO desktop designed for smooth productivity, office tasks, and multimedia use. Featuring a 23.8” FHD anti-glare touch display, 16GB DDR5 RAM, 1TB NVMe SSD, WiFi 6E, and wireless peripherals, it delivers a powerful and interactive computing experience.', 'dell-ec24250-intel-core-7-150u-1tb-ssd-238-fhd-touch-display-all-in-one-pc-1781265517', '<h3>Intel Core 7 150U Touch All-in-One Desktop PC</h3><p>The <strong>Intel Core 7 150U Touch All-in-One PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a modern premium desktop solution designed for professionals, business users, and home productivity. With its elegant integrated design and touchscreen capability, it offers a clean workspace with enhanced usability.</p><p>At its core is the <strong>Intel Core 7 150U Processor</strong>, featuring 10 cores and up to 5.4GHz turbo frequency, delivering efficient performance for multitasking, office applications, browsing, presentations, and video conferencing.</p><p>The system includes <strong>16GB DDR5 (8x2) dual-channel memory</strong>, ensuring smooth multitasking and improved system responsiveness for professional workloads.</p><p>Storage is upgraded to a <strong>1TB NVMe SSD</strong>, providing fast boot times, large storage capacity, and quick access to files and applications.</p><p>Graphics are powered by <strong>Intel Integrated Graphics</strong>, suitable for office productivity, media consumption, and light creative work.</p><p>The highlight of this model is the <strong>23.8-inch Full HD (1920×1080) Anti-Glare Touch Display</strong>, offering interactive control, sharp visuals, and a more intuitive user experience for work and presentations.</p><p>Audio is delivered through <strong>stereo speakers with Realtek ALC3289 (5W x 2)</strong>, ensuring clear sound for meetings, entertainment, and communication.</p><p>A <strong>2.07MP FHD RGB tilt camera</strong> is included for smooth video conferencing and online collaboration.</p><p>Connectivity is supported by <strong>Intel WiFi 6E and Bluetooth</strong>, ensuring fast, stable, and modern wireless performance.</p><p>The system includes a <strong>wireless keyboard and mouse</strong>, keeping the workspace clean and clutter-free.</p><p>With multiple ports including USB 3.2, HDMI-in/out, RJ45 Ethernet, and headset support, it offers strong connectivity for office and home environments.</p><p>The <strong>Intel Core 7 150U Touch All-in-One PC from International Office Solution</strong> is ideal for users who want a premium touchscreen desktop that combines performance, elegance, and productivity in one compact design.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Model</td><td>Intel Core 7 150U</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Cores/Threads</td><td>10 Cores, 12 Threads</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Memory</td><td>16GB DDR5 (8x2)</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics</td><td>Type</td><td>Intel Integrated Graphics</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Capacity</td><td>1TB NVMe SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Size</td><td>23.8 Inch FHD (1920×1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Type</td><td>Anti-Glare Touch Panel</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>System</td><td>Stereo Speakers (5W x 2)</td></tr><tr><td>Camera</td><td>Resolution</td><td>2.07MP FHD RGB Tilt Camera</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Wireless</td><td>WiFi 6E + Bluetooth</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>I/O</td><td>USB 3.2, HDMI-in/out, RJ45</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Adapter</td><td>90W AC Adapter</td></tr><tr><td>OS</td><td>System</td><td>Windows 11 Home</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Coverage</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Desktop, All In One PC', 160000.00, 160000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbna