(446, 'Dell EC24250 Core 7 150U 1TB SSD 23.8\" FHD All-in-One PC', 'The Intel Core 7 150U All-in-One PC from International Office Solution is a powerful and minimalist AIO desktop designed for office productivity, study, and everyday computing. Featuring a 23.8” FHD anti-glare display, 16GB DDR5 RAM, 1TB NVMe SSD, WiFi 6E, and wireless peripherals, it delivers smooth and reliable performance in a clean, space-saving design.', 'dell-ec24250-core-7-150u-1tb-ssd-238-fhd-all-in-one-pc-1781265612', '<h3>Intel Core 7 150U All-in-One Desktop PC (Non-Touch Display)</h3><p>The <strong>Intel Core 7 150U All-in-One PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a modern and efficient desktop solution built for professionals, students, and home users who need strong performance in a compact form factor. Its integrated design eliminates cable clutter while maintaining a clean and organized workspace.</p><p>Powered by the <strong>Intel Core 7 150U Processor</strong>, featuring 10 cores and up to 5.4GHz turbo frequency, this system delivers efficient performance for multitasking, office applications, browsing, presentations, and video conferencing.</p><p>The system comes with <strong>16GB DDR5 (8GBx2) dual-channel memory</strong>, ensuring smooth multitasking and improved system responsiveness for daily workloads and productivity tasks.</p><p>Storage is handled by a <strong>1TB NVMe SSD</strong>, offering fast boot times, quick file access, and ample space for documents, software, and media.</p><p>Graphics are powered by <strong>Intel Integrated Graphics</strong>, suitable for office work, multimedia playback, and light creative tasks.</p><p>The centerpiece is the <strong>23.8-inch Full HD (1920×1080) Anti-Glare Non-Touch Display</strong>, delivering sharp visuals, comfortable viewing angles, and a professional-grade workspace experience.</p><p>Audio is supported by <strong>stereo speakers with Realtek ALC3289 (5W x 2)</strong>, providing clear sound for meetings, videos, and everyday use.</p><p>A <strong>2.07MP FHD RGB tilt camera</strong> is included for smooth video conferencing and online communication.</p><p>Connectivity is enhanced with <strong>Intel WiFi 6E and Bluetooth</strong>, ensuring fast and stable wireless performance.</p><p>The system also includes a <strong>wireless keyboard and mouse</strong>, helping maintain a clean and cable-free desktop environment.</p><p>With multiple I/O options such as USB 3.2 ports, HDMI input/output, RJ45 LAN, and headset jack, it supports flexible connectivity for office and home usage.</p><p>The <strong>Intel Core 7 150U All-in-One PC from International Office Solution</strong> is an excellent choice for users seeking a reliable, high-performance, and space-saving desktop solution without a touchscreen requirement.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Model</td><td>Intel Core 7 150U</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Cores/Threads</td><td>10 Cores, 12 Threads</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Memory</td><td>16GB DDR5 (8GBx2)</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics</td><td>Type</td><td>Intel Integrated Graphics</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Capacity</td><td>1TB NVMe SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Size</td><td>23.8 Inch FHD (1920×1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Type</td><td>Anti-Glare Non-Touch Panel</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>System</td><td>Stereo Speakers (5W x 2)</td></tr><tr><td>Camera</td><td>Resolution</td><td>2.07MP FHD RGB Tilt Camera</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Wireless</td><td>WiFi 6E + Bluetooth</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>I/O</td><td>USB 3.2, HDMI-in/out, RJ45</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Adapter</td><td>90W AC Adapter</td></tr><tr><td>OS</td><td>System</td><td>FreeDOS</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Coverage</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 160000.00, 160000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/ERtiGmXm6xQ