(447, 'HP All-in-One 24-cr0085d Core i5 13th Gen FHD Touch Desktop PC', 'The Intel Core i5-1335U All-in-One PC from International Office Solution is a premium touchscreen AIO desktop designed for smooth office work, study, and everyday productivity. Featuring a 23.8” FHD IPS touch display, 8GB RAM, 512GB SSD, WiFi 6, and wireless keyboard & mouse, it delivers reliable performance in a sleek design.', 'hp-all-in-one-24-cr0085d-core-i5-13th-gen-fhd-touch-desktop-pc-1781265746', '<h3>Intel Core i5-1335U All-in-One Touch Desktop PC</h3><p>The <strong>Intel Core i5-1335U All-in-One PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a modern and efficient desktop solution built for professionals, students, and home users. Its integrated all-in-one design reduces cable clutter while providing a clean, elegant workspace with strong everyday performance.</p><p>Powered by the <strong>Intel Core i5-1335U processor</strong>, featuring 10 cores, 12 threads, and up to 4.6GHz turbo frequency, this system delivers efficient multitasking performance for office applications, web browsing, video conferencing, and daily productivity tasks.</p><p>The system includes <strong>8GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM</strong>, ensuring smooth operation for common workloads and multitasking needs.</p><p>Storage is handled by a <strong>512GB SSD</strong>, providing fast boot times, quick application loading, and reliable system responsiveness.</p><p>Graphics are powered by <strong>Intel Iris Xe Graphics</strong>, offering enhanced visual performance for office tasks, media playback, and light creative work.</p><p>The centerpiece is the <strong>23.8-inch Full HD (1920×1080) IPS Anti-Glare Touch Display</strong>, featuring 300 nits brightness and 99% sRGB color accuracy for vibrant visuals and an interactive user experience.</p><p>Audio is delivered through <strong>dual 2W speakers</strong>, ensuring clear sound for meetings, videos, and general use.</p><p>For communication, the system features an <strong>HP True Vision 1080p FHD IR tilt privacy camera with dual microphones</strong>, making it ideal for professional video conferencing.</p><p>Connectivity includes <strong>WiFi 6 (Realtek RTL8852BE) and Bluetooth 5.3</strong>, ensuring fast and stable wireless performance.</p><p>The system comes with an <strong>HP 510SP wireless keyboard and mouse combo</strong>, keeping the workspace clean and cable-free.</p><p>Multiple I/O ports including USB Type-C, USB Type-A, HDMI, and RJ45 Ethernet provide flexible connectivity options.</p><p>The <strong>Intel Core i5-1335U All-in-One PC from International Office Solution</strong> is a perfect choice for users who want a reliable, stylish, and interactive touchscreen desktop for everyday productivity.</p>', NULL, 'Desktop, All In One PC', 115000.00, 115000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/PrkAYfqbZpHocLB8IsTZ50whDNRmEU9zOtpiMHig.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 12:02:26', '2026-06-12 12:07:39', 'Intel Core i5-1335U All-in-One PC | 8GB RAM 512GB SSD 23.8” FHD Touch IPS WiFi 6 Desktop | International Office Solution', 'Buy Intel Core i5-1335U All-in-One Touch PC from International Office Solution. Features 23.8” FHD IPS display, 8GB RAM, 512GB SSD, Intel Iris Xe, WiFi 6, and wireless keyboard & mouse.', 'Intel Core i5 All in One PC, Touch AIO Desktop Bangladesh, 23.8 inch FHD Touch PC, 8GB RAM AIO Computer, 512GB SSD All in One PC, WiFi 6 Desktop PC, Office AIO PC Bangladesh, Intel Iris Xe Desktop, HP AIO Touch PC, Business All in One Computer, Student Desktop Bangladesh, Wireless Keyboard Mouse PC, International Office Solution, Slim AIO PC, Modern Office Computer, Home Office Desktop, Interactive Touch PC, FHD IPS AIO Desktop, Productivity PC Bangladesh, Premium All in One PC', NULL, 1, NULL, NULL),
(448, 'HP All-in-One 24-cr0179d Core i5 13th Gen Desktop PC', 'The Intel Core i5-1335U All-in-One PC from International Office Solution is a compact and reliable desktop designed for office, study, and everyday productivity. It features a 23.8” FHD IPS anti-glare display, 8GB DDR4 RAM, 512GB NVMe SSD, Intel Iris Xe Graphics, WiFi 6, and wired keyboard & mouse for stable performance.', 'hp-all-in-one-24-cr0179d-core-i5-13th-gen-desktop-pc-1781265901', '<h3>Intel Core i5-1335U All-in-One Desktop PC</h3><p>The <strong>Intel Core i5-1335U All-in-One PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a modern productivity-focused desktop solution built for professionals, students, and home users. Its integrated design reduces cable clutter and provides a clean, space-saving workspace suitable for everyday computing.</p><p>Powered by the <strong>Intel Core i5-1335U processor</strong>, featuring 10 cores, 12 threads, and up to 4.6GHz turbo frequency, this system delivers efficient performance for multitasking, office applications, browsing, and video conferencing.</p><p>The system includes <strong>8GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM (1×8GB)</strong> with dual SODIMM slots for future upgrade flexibility.</p><p>Storage is handled by a <strong>512GB PCIe NVMe M.2 SSD</strong>, ensuring fast boot times, quick file access, and smooth system responsiveness.</p><p>Graphics are powered by <strong>Intel Iris Xe Graphics</strong>, providing efficient performance for office work, multimedia, presentations, and light creative tasks.</p><p>The display is a <strong>23.8-inch Full HD (1920×1080) IPS panel</strong>, featuring anti-glare coating, 250 nits brightness, and 99% sRGB color accuracy for sharp and vibrant visuals.</p><p>Audio is delivered through <strong>dual 2W speakers</strong>, suitable for meetings, media playback, and daily use.</p><p>For communication, it includes an <strong>HP True Vision 1080p FHD IR tilt privacy camera with dual microphones</strong>, making it ideal for professional video calls and online meetings.</p><p>Connectivity includes <strong>WiFi 6 (2x2), Bluetooth 5.4, and Gigabit Ethernet LAN</strong>, ensuring stable and fast network performance in any environment.</p><p>The system comes with an <strong>HP 125 USB wired keyboard and mouse</strong>, offering reliable and consistent input performance.</p><p>Multiple connectivity options including USB Type-C, USB Type-A, HDMI-out, and RJ45 LAN ensure flexible integration with office peripherals.</p><p>The <strong>Intel Core i5-1335U All-in-One PC from International Office Solution</strong> is a dependable and efficient solution for users who need a clean, stable, and performance-oriented desktop for everyday tasks.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Model</td><td>Intel Core i5-1335U</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Cores/Threads</td><td>10 Cores, 12 Threads</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Memory</td><td>8GB DDR4 3200MHz (1×8GB)</td></tr><tr><td>RAM Slots</td><td>Upgrade</td><td>2 SODIMM Slots</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics</td><td>Type</td><td>Intel Iris Xe Graphics</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Capacity</td><td>512GB PCIe NVMe SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Size</td><td>23.8\" FHD (1920×1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Type</td><td>IPS Anti-Glare</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Brightness</td><td>250 nits</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Color</td><td>99% sRGB</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>System</td><td>Dual 2W Speakers</td></tr><tr><td>Camera</td><td>Type</td><td>1080p FHD IR Privacy Camera</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Wireless</td><td>WiFi 6 + Bluetooth 5.4</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>LAN</td><td>Gigabit Ethernet</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>I/O</td><td>USB-C, USB-A, HDMI-out, RJ45</td></tr><tr><td>Input Devices</td><td>Type</td><td>HP 125 Wired Keyboard &amp; Mouse</td></tr><tr><td>OS</td><td>System</td><td>Windows 11 Home</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Coverage</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Desktop, All In One PC', 120000.00, 120000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/NWo9aFZnb4JoKyxnrI7Ka2pidOyllbUGBtbYOuzd.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 12:05:01', '2026-06-12 12:07:28', 'Intel Core i5-1335U All-in-One PC | 8GB RAM 512GB NVMe SSD 23.8” FHD IPS WiFi 6 Desktop | International Office Solution', 'Buy Intel Core i5-1335U All-in-One PC from International Office Solution. Features 23.8” FHD IPS display, 8GB RAM, 512GB NVMe SSD, Intel Iris Xe, WiFi 6, and wired keyboard & mouse.', 'Buy Intel Core i5-1335U All-in-One PC from International Office Solution. Features 23.8” FHD IPS display, 8GB RAM, 512GB NVMe SSD, Intel Iris Xe, WiFi 6, and wired keyboard & mouse.', NULL, 1, NULL, NULL),
(449, 'HP All-in-One 27-cr0051d Core i7 13th Gen FHD Desktop PC', 'The Intel Core i7-1355U All-in-One PC from International Office Solution is a premium 27-inch AIO desktop built for high-performance productivity, office work, and multitasking. Featuring a large FHD IPS display, 16GB RAM, 1TB NVMe SSD, Intel Iris Xe Graphics, WiFi 6, and wireless keyboard & mouse, it delivers smooth and powerful computing.', 'hp-all-in-one-27-cr0051d-core-i7-13th-gen-fhd-desktop-pc-1781266033', '<h3>ntel Core i7-1355U All-in-One Desktop PC (27” Display)</h3><p>The <strong>Intel Core i7-1355U All-in-One PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a powerful and elegant desktop solution designed for professionals, corporate users, and advanced home users. Its all-in-one design helps reduce cable clutter while offering a large immersive display and strong everyday performance.</p><p>Powered by the <strong>Intel Core i7-1355U processor</strong>, featuring 10 cores, 12 threads, and up to 5.0GHz turbo frequency, this system delivers excellent performance for multitasking, office applications, presentations, browsing, and video conferencing.</p><p>The system includes <strong>16GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM (2×8GB dual-channel)</strong>, ensuring smooth multitasking and improved responsiveness for demanding productivity workloads.</p><p>Storage is provided by a <strong>1TB PCIe NVMe M.2 SSD</strong>, offering fast boot times, quick file access, and ample space for documents, media, and applications.</p><p>Graphics are powered by <strong>Intel Iris Xe Graphics</strong>, delivering efficient performance for office tasks, multimedia playback, and light creative workloads.</p><p>The highlight of this system is the <strong>27-inch Full HD (1920×1080) IPS anti-glare display</strong>, featuring 300 nits brightness and 99% sRGB color accuracy for sharp, vibrant, and comfortable viewing.</p><p>Audio is handled by <strong>dual 2W speakers</strong>, suitable for meetings, media playback, and daily communication needs.</p><p>For video conferencing, it includes an <strong>HP True Vision 1080p FHD IR tilt privacy camera with dual microphones</strong>, ensuring clear and professional communication.</p><p>Connectivity is supported by <strong>WiFi 6 (Realtek RTL8852BE) and Bluetooth 5.3</strong>, ensuring fast and stable wireless performance.</p><p>The system comes with an <strong>HP 510SP wireless keyboard and mouse combo</strong>, providing a clean and cable-free workspace setup.</p><p>With multiple ports including USB Type-C, USB Type-A, HDMI, and RJ45 Ethernet, it supports flexible connectivity for office environments and peripherals.</p><p>The <strong>Intel Core i7-1355U All-in-One PC from International Office Solution</strong> is an excellent choice for users who need a large display, strong multitasking performance, and a premium space-saving desktop solution.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Model</td><td>Intel Core i7-1355U</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Cores/Threads</td><td>10 Cores, 12 Threads</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Memory</td><td>16GB DDR4 3200MHz (2×8GB)</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics</td><td>Type</td><td>Intel Iris Xe Graphics</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Capacity</td><td>1TB PCIe NVMe SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Size</td><td>27\" FHD (1920×1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Type</td><td>IPS Anti-Glare</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Brightness</td><td>300 nits</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Color</td><td>99% sRGB</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>System</td><td>Dual 2W Speakers</td></tr><tr><td>Camera</td><td>Type</td><td>1080p FHD IR Privacy Camera</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Wireless</td><td>WiFi 6 + Bluetooth 5.3</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>I/O</td><td>USB-C, USB-A, HDMI, RJ45</td></tr><tr><td>Input Devices</td><td>Type</td><td>HP 510SP Wireless Keyboard &amp; Mouse</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Adapter</td><td>90W Smart AC Adapter</td></tr><tr><td>OS</td><td>System</td><td>Windows 11 Home</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Coverage</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Desktop, All In One PC', 160000.00, 160000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/rdAHQonaJxBnxItjp1wy7qVzUE3eevgIWn39vUp5.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 12:07:13', '2026-06-12 12:07:13', 'Intel Core i7-1355U All-in-One PC | 16GB RAM 1TB SSD 27” FHD IPS WiFi 6 Desktop AIO | International Office Solution', 'Buy Intel Core i7-1355U All-in-One PC from International Office Solution. Features 27” FHD IPS display, 16GB RAM, 1TB SSD, Intel Iris Xe, WiFi 6, and wireless keyboard & mouse combo.', 'Intel Core i7 All in One PC, 27 inch AIO Desktop Bangladesh, 16GB RAM All in One Computer, 1TB SSD AIO PC, WiFi 6 Desktop PC, Intel Iris Xe Desktop, Office All in One PC Bangladesh, HP AIO Desktop PC, Business AIO Computer, Large Screen All in One PC, Student Desktop Bangladesh, Wireless Keyboard Mouse PC, International Office Solution, Premium AIO Desktop, Home Office PC, Productivity Computer Bangladesh, FHD IPS AIO PC, Modern Office Desktop, Space Saving PC, High Performance AIO PC', NULL, 1, NULL, NULL);
