(450, 'HP Pro 240 G9 Core i5 12th Gen All-in-One Desktop PC', 'The Intel Core i5-1235U All-in-One PC from International Office Solution is a reliable and compact desktop designed for office, study, and everyday use. It features a 23.8” FHD anti-glare display, 8GB RAM, 512GB SSD, Intel UHD Graphics, built-in camera, WiFi, and USB keyboard & mouse for a complete workstation setup.', 'hp-pro-240-g9-core-i5-12th-gen-all-in-one-desktop-pc-1781266191', '<h3>Intel Core i5-1235U All-in-One Desktop PC</h3><p>The <strong>Intel Core i5-1235U All-in-One PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a practical and space-saving desktop solution designed for users who need stable performance for daily computing tasks, office work, and home use.</p><p>Powered by the <strong>Intel Core i5-1235U processor</strong>, featuring multiple cores and turbo boost up to 4.40GHz, this system delivers efficient performance for multitasking, document handling, browsing, and communication tasks.</p><p>The system includes <strong>8GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM</strong>, ensuring smooth performance for everyday applications and general productivity.</p><p>Storage is provided by a <strong>512GB SSD</strong>, offering fast boot times, quick file access, and improved overall system responsiveness.</p><p>Graphics are handled by <strong>Intel UHD Graphics</strong>, suitable for office applications, video playback, presentations, and basic multimedia use.</p><p>The display is a <strong>23.8-inch Full HD (1920×1080) anti-glare LED-backlit panel</strong>, offering clear visuals with 250 nits brightness and 72% NTSC color coverage for comfortable viewing.</p><p>Audio is delivered through <strong>high-performance internal speakers</strong>, suitable for meetings, media playback, and daily use.</p><p>For communication, the system includes a <strong>5MP pull-up camera with dual array microphones</strong>, making it ideal for video conferencing and online meetings.</p><p>Connectivity includes <strong>Realtek Gigabit Ethernet, WiFi (802.11ac), and Bluetooth 5.2</strong>, ensuring stable wired and wireless connections.</p><p>The system comes with a <strong>USB keyboard and USB mouse</strong>, providing a complete ready-to-use desktop setup.</p><p>Additional features include a <strong>DVD RW optical drive</strong>, multiple USB ports, HDMI 1.4 ports, and headphone/microphone combo jack for flexible connectivity.</p><p>The <strong>Intel Core i5-1235U All-in-One PC from International Office Solution</strong> is an excellent choice for users seeking a dependable, affordable, and space-efficient desktop for everyday computing.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Model</td><td>Intel Core i5-1235U</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Cache</td><td>12MB</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Memory</td><td>8GB DDR4 3200MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics</td><td>Type</td><td>Intel UHD Graphics</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Capacity</td><td>512GB SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Size</td><td>23.8\" FHD (1920×1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Type</td><td>Anti-Glare WLED Backlit</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Brightness</td><td>250 nits</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Color</td><td>72% NTSC</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>System</td><td>Internal High Performance Speaker</td></tr><tr><td>Camera</td><td>Type</td><td>5MP Pop-up Camera</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Wireless</td><td>WiFi + Bluetooth 5.2</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>LAN</td><td>Gigabit Ethernet</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>I/O</td><td>USB, HDMI 1.4, RJ45, Audio Jack</td></tr><tr><td>Optical Drive</td><td>Type</td><td>DVD RW</td></tr><tr><td>Input Devices</td><td>Type</td><td>USB Keyboard &amp; Mouse</td></tr><tr><td>OS</td><td>System</td><td>FreeDOS</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Coverage</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Desktop, All In One PC', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/bWd0MUtW3cahoURLLdRGeLGNvUL5DxHHd2jbKmoP.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 12:09:51', '2026-06-12 12:09:51', 'Intel Core i5-1235U All-in-One PC | 8GB RAM 512GB SSD 23.8” FHD Anti-Glare Desktop | International Office Solution', 'Intel Core i5 All in One PC, AIO Desktop Bangladesh, 23.8 inch FHD PC, 8GB RAM AIO Computer, 512GB SSD Desktop PC, Office All in One PC Bangladesh, Intel UHD Graphics PC, WiFi Bluetooth AIO PC, DVD RW Desktop Computer, Business AIO PC Bangladesh, Student Desktop PC, International Office Solution, Budget All in One PC, Home Office Desktop, Compact AIO Computer, FHD Anti Glare PC, Reliable Office Computer, Productivity Desktop Bangladesh, Everyday Use PC, All in One Desktop PC Bangladesh', 'Intel Core i5 All in One PC, AIO Desktop Bangladesh, 23.8 inch FHD PC, 8GB RAM AIO Computer, 512GB SSD Desktop PC, Office All in One PC Bangladesh, Intel UHD Graphics PC, WiFi Bluetooth AIO PC, DVD RW Desktop Computer, Business AIO PC Bangladesh, Student Desktop PC, International Office Solution, Budget All in One PC, Home Office Desktop, Compact AIO Computer, FHD Anti Glare PC, Reliable Office Computer, Productivity Desktop Bangladesh, Everyday Use PC, All in One Desktop PC Bangladesh', NULL, 1, NULL, NULL),
(451, 'ASUS ExpertCenter P400 CORE 5 210H 23.8\" FHD All-in-One PC', 'The Core 5 210H All-in-One Touch Screen PC from International Office Solution delivers modern performance with a 23.8-inch Full HD 100Hz touchscreen display, Intel Core 5 processor, 16GB DDR5 RAM, and fast 512GB NVMe SSD. With WiFi 7, Bluetooth 5.4, and built-in camera and speakers, it is ideal for office, business, and smart home use.', 'asus-expertcenter-p400-core-5-210h-238-fhd-all-in-one-pc-1781266503', '<h3>Core 5 210H All-in-One Touch Screen Desktop PC</h3><p>The <strong>Core 5 210H All-in-One Touch Screen PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a powerful and modern desktop solution designed for productivity, business environments, and advanced everyday computing.</p><p>It is powered by the <strong>Intel Core 5 processor 210H</strong>, offering up to 4.80GHz turbo frequency with 8 cores and 12 threads. This ensures smooth performance for multitasking, office applications, web-based work, and light creative tasks.</p><p>The system is equipped with <strong>16GB DDR5 5600MHz high-speed memory</strong>, delivering fast responsiveness and efficient multitasking performance across applications.</p><p>Storage is handled by a <strong>512GB M.2 NVMe PCIe 4.0 SSD</strong>, providing fast boot times, quick file transfers, and overall system responsiveness.</p><p>The integrated <strong>Intel UHD Graphics</strong> supports smooth display output for office work, multimedia playback, presentations, and general use.</p><p>A major highlight is the <strong>23.8-inch Full HD (1920×1080) touchscreen display</strong>, featuring a 100Hz refresh rate, 100% sRGB color accuracy, anti-glare coating, and a 93% screen-to-body ratio for a premium viewing experience.</p><p>For communication, it includes a <strong>1080p Full HD camera with privacy shutter</strong>, built-in microphone array, and stereo speakers—making it ideal for video conferencing and remote meetings.</p><p>Connectivity is future-ready with <strong>Intel WiFi 7 (BE200) and Bluetooth 5.4</strong>, ensuring ultra-fast wireless performance and stable connections.</p><p>Security features include <strong>TPM 2.0, BIOS password protection, Kensington lock support, and HDD security options</strong>, making it suitable for business and professional environments.</p><p>The system also includes multiple I/O ports such as USB Type-C, USB 3.2, HDMI in/out, and RJ45 Gigabit Ethernet for flexible connectivity.</p><p>This All-in-One PC is energy efficient and certified with <strong>EPEAT Gold, Energy Star 8.0, RoHS, and REACH standards</strong>, ensuring eco-friendly performance.</p><p>With its modern design, touchscreen capability, and strong performance, the <strong>Core 5 210H All-in-One PC from International Office Solution</strong> is perfect for offices, professionals, and smart digital workspaces.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Model</td><td>Intel Core i5-1235U</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Cache</td><td>12MB</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Memory</td><td>8GB DDR4 3200MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics</td><td>Type</td><td>Intel UHD Graphics</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Capacity</td><td>512GB SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Size</td><td>23.8\" FHD (1920×1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Type</td><td>Anti-Glare WLED Backlit</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Brightness</td><td>250 nits</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Color</td><td>72% NTSC</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>System</td><td>Internal High Performance Speaker</td></tr><tr><td>Camera</td><td>Type</td><td>5MP Pop-up Camera</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Wireless</td><td>WiFi + Bluetooth 5.2</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>LAN</td><td>Gigabit Ethernet</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>I/O</td><td>USB, HDMI 1.4, RJ45, Audio Jack</td></tr><tr><td>Optical Drive</td><td>Type</td><td>DVD RW</td></tr><tr><td>Input Devices</td><td>Type</td><td>USB Keyboard &amp; Mouse</td></tr><tr><td>OS</td><td>System</td><td>FreeDOS</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Coverage</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Desktop, All In One PC', 120000.00, 120000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/DQu8F89ew7jk1VE5TcwhkgM0bPpnSzhAFkuOTOuU.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 12:15:03', '2026-06-12 12:15:49', 'Intel Core i5-1235U All-in-One PC | 8GB RAM 512GB SSD 23.8” FHD Anti-Glare Desktop | International Office Solution', 'Buy Intel Core i5-1235U All-in-One PC from International Office Solution. Features 23.8” FHD display, 8GB RAM, 512GB SSD, WiFi, Bluetooth 5.2, and USB keyboard & mouse for office use.', 'Intel Core i5 All in One PC, AIO Desktop Bangladesh, 23.8 inch FHD PC, 8GB RAM AIO Computer, 512GB SSD Desktop PC, Office All in One PC Bangladesh, Intel UHD Graphics PC, WiFi Bluetooth AIO PC, DVD RW Desktop Computer, Business AIO PC Bangladesh, Student Desktop PC, International Office Solution, Budget All in One PC, Home Office Desktop, Compact AIO Computer, FHD Anti Glare PC, Reliable Office Computer, Productivity Desktop Bangladesh, Everyday Use PC, All in One Desktop PC Bangladesh', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(452, 'ASUS ExpertCenter P400 Core i7 13th Gen 27\" FHD All-in-One PC', 'The Intel Core i7-13620H All-in-One PC from International Office Solution is a powerful 27-inch FHD desktop designed for professional and business use. It features a 10-core processor, 16GB DDR5 RAM, 1TB NVMe SSD, 100Hz display, WiFi 6E, and Windows Hello IR camera for secure and smooth performance.', 'asus-expertcenter-p400-core-i7-13th-gen-27-fhd-all-in-one-pc-1781266674', '<h3>Intel Core i7-13620H All-in-One Desktop PC</h3><p>The <strong>Intel Core i7-13620H All-in-One PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a high-performance business-grade desktop designed for professionals, offices, and productivity-focused users who require speed, reliability, and modern features in a compact form.</p><p>It is powered by the <strong>Intel Core i7-13620H processor</strong>, featuring 10 cores, 16 threads, and turbo boost up to 4.9GHz, delivering strong multitasking performance for office workloads, business applications, web services, and multimedia tasks.</p><p>The system comes with <strong>16GB DDR5 SO-DIMM RAM</strong>, expandable via dual memory slots, ensuring smooth multitasking and efficient performance for demanding workloads.</p><p>For storage, it includes a <strong>1TB M.2 NVMe PCIe 4.0 SSD</strong>, providing fast boot times, quick application loading, and large storage capacity for business files and software.</p><p>Graphics are powered by <strong>Intel UHD Graphics</strong>, suitable for office work, presentations, video playback, and general productivity tasks.</p><p>The highlight of this system is its <strong>27-inch Full HD (1920×1080) anti-glare display</strong> with 100Hz refresh rate, 300 nits brightness, and 100% sRGB color accuracy. The height-adjustable stand (HAS) ensures ergonomic comfort for long working hours.</p><p>For communication and security, it features a <strong>1080p Full HD IR camera with Windows Hello support</strong>, enabling secure facial recognition login along with built-in microphones and speakers for video conferencing.</p><p>Connectivity is advanced with <strong>WiFi 6E (802.11ax), Bluetooth 5.3, and Gigabit LAN</strong>, ensuring fast and stable network performance in both wired and wireless environments.</p><p>Security features include <strong>TPM 2.0, BIOS and HDD password protection, and Kensington lock support</strong>, making it suitable for corporate and enterprise environments.</p><p>The system also includes multiple I/O ports such as USB Type-C, USB 3.2, HDMI output, RJ45 Ethernet, and audio combo jack for flexible connectivity.</p><p>With EPEAT Silver and Energy Star 8.0 certification, this All-in-One PC is also energy efficient and environmentally friendly.</p><p>The <strong>Intel Core i7-13620H All-in-One PC from International Office Solution</strong> is a premium solution for businesses, offices, and professionals seeking performance, security, and modern design in one system</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Model</td><td>Intel Core i7-13620H</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Cores/Threads</td><td>10 Cores / 16 Threads</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Memory</td><td>16GB DDR5 SO-DIMM</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Capacity</td><td>1TB NVMe PCIe 4.0 SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics</td><td>Type</td><td>Intel UHD Graphics</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Size</td><td>27.0” FHD (1920×1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Type</td><td>Anti-Glare LED Backlit</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>100Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Brightness</td><td>300 nits</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Color</td><td>100% sRGB</td></tr><tr><td>Camera</td><td>Type</td><td>1080p IR Camera (Windows Hello)</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Wireless</td><td>WiFi 6E, Bluetooth 5.3</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>LAN</td><td>Gigabit Ethernet</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>I/O</td><td>USB 3.2, USB-C, HDMI, RJ45, Audio Jack</td></tr><tr><td>Security</td><td>Features</td><td>TPM 2.0, BIOS/HDD Password, Kensington Lock</td></tr><tr><td>Stand</td><td>Type</td><td>Height Adjustable Stand (HAS)</td></tr><tr><td>OS</td><td>System</td><td>FreeDOS</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Coverage</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Desktop, All In One PC', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/6yq0RdxSzCQSINomBVwF8EkvjDqBO4zd4Of0XIt7.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 12:17:54', '2026-06-12 12:17:54', 'Intel Core i7-13620H 27” FHD All-in-One PC | 16GB DDR5 1TB SSD 100Hz Business Desktop | International Office Solution', 'Buy Intel Core i7-13620H All-in-One PC with 27” FHD 100Hz display, 16GB DDR5 RAM, 1TB SSD, WiFi 6E, IR camera with Windows Hello, and business-grade security features.', 'Intel Core i7 AIO PC, 27 inch All in One Desktop Bangladesh, 16GB DDR5 AIO PC, 1TB NVMe SSD Computer, Business All in One PC, Office Desktop Bangladesh, i7-13620H PC, FHD 100Hz AIO Computer, WiFi 6E Desktop PC, Windows Hello AIO PC, IR Camera Desktop, Enterprise AIO Computer, International Office Solution PC, Professional All in One PC, Height Adjustable Monitor PC, Secure Business Desktop, TPM 2.0 PC Bangladesh, Intel UHD Graphics AIO, High Performance Office PC, Modern All in One Computer', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(453, 'Lenovo IdeaCentre AIO 24IRH9 Core i5 13th Gen 23.8\" FHD All-in-One Desktop PC', 'The Intel Core i5-13420H All-in-One PC from International Office Solution is a compact and efficient desktop designed for office and everyday use. It features a 23.8-inch FHD IPS 100Hz display, 16GB DDR5 RAM, 512GB SSD, WiFi 6, IR camera, and wireless keyboard & mouse for a complete modern workspace.', 'lenovo-ideacentre-aio-24irh9-core-i5-13th-gen-238-fhd-all-in-one-desktop-pc-1781266835', '<h3>Intel Core i5-13420H All-in-One Desktop PC</h3><p>The <strong>Intel Core i5-13420H All-in-One PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a reliable and modern computing solution built for professionals, students, and business users who need stable performance in a compact design.</p><p>It is powered by the <strong>Intel Core i5-13420H processor</strong>, featuring 8 cores (4 Performance + 4 Efficiency cores) and 12 threads, delivering smooth multitasking and efficient performance for office work, browsing, online meetings, and daily productivity tasks.</p><p>The system comes with <strong>16GB DDR5-5200 SO-DIMM RAM</strong>, with dual-channel support for improved performance and responsiveness across applications.</p><p>Storage is handled by a <strong>512GB M.2 PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD</strong>, ensuring fast boot times, quick application loading, and efficient file management.</p><p>Graphics are powered by <strong>Intel UHD Graphics</strong>, suitable for office applications, multimedia playback, and general usage.</p><p>The display is a <strong>23.8-inch Full HD (1920×1080) IPS anti-glare panel</strong>, offering 100Hz refresh rate, 99% sRGB color accuracy, and low blue light technology for comfortable long-hour usage.</p><p>For communication, it includes a <strong>5.0MP + IR camera</strong>, allowing high-quality video conferencing and secure facial recognition features.</p><p>Connectivity includes <strong>WiFi 6 (802.11ax), Bluetooth 5.2, and Gigabit Ethernet</strong>, ensuring stable and fast network performance for both wired and wireless environments.</p><p>Security features include <strong>firmware TPM 2.0 integration</strong>, helping protect system data and improve device security.</p><p>The system includes multiple connectivity options such as USB 3.2 Gen2, USB 2.0, HDMI input/output, Ethernet, and audio combo jack for flexible usage in office setups.</p><p>The device comes with <strong>wireless keyboard and mouse (Luna Grey)</strong>, making it a complete ready-to-use workstation.</p><p>With a lightweight design and modern aesthetics, the <strong>Intel Core i5-13420H All-in-One PC from International Office Solution</strong> is ideal for offices, educational institutions, and home users who want performance, simplicity, and reliability in one system.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Model</td><td>Intel Core i5-13420H</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Cores/Threads</td><td>8 Cores / 12 Threads</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Memory</td><td>16GB DDR5-5200 SO-DIMM</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Capacity</td><td>512GB NVMe PCIe 4.0 SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics</td><td>Type</td><td>Intel UHD Graphics</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Size</td><td>23.8” FHD IPS</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>100Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Color</td><td>99% sRGB</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Brightness</td><td>250 nits</td></tr><tr><td>Camera</td><td>Type</td><td>5.0MP + IR Camera</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Wireless</td><td>WiFi 6, Bluetooth 5.2</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>LAN</td><td>Gigabit Ethernet</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>I/O</td><td>USB-C, USB 3.2, USB 2.0, HDMI In/Out, RJ45</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>System</td><td>Realtek HD Audio</td></tr><tr><td>OS</td><td>System</td><td>FreeDOS</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Coverage</td><td>1 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Desktop, All In One PC', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/phykFwKSRaQr8stL5ZhoLxVlrJdHzPKq1evNgpsO.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 12:20:35', '2026-06-12 12:20:35', 'Intel Core i5-13420H All-in-One PC | 23.8” FHD 100Hz IPS Display 16GB DDR5 512GB SSD Business Desktop | International Office Solution', 'Category	Feature	Specification\r\nProcessor	Model	Intel Core i5-13420H\r\nProcessor	Cores/Threads	8 Cores / 12 Threads\r\nRAM	Memory	16GB DDR5-5200 SO-DIMM\r\nStorage	Capacity	512GB NVMe PCIe 4.0 SSD\r\nGraphics	Type	Intel UHD Graphics\r\nDisplay	Size	23.8” FHD IPS\r\nDisplay	Refresh Rate	100Hz\r\nDisplay	Color	99% sRGB\r\nDisplay	Brightness	250 nits\r\nCamera	Type	5.0MP + IR Camera\r\nConnectivity	Wireless	WiFi 6, Bluetooth 5.2\r\nConnectivity	LAN	Gigabit Ethernet\r\nPorts	I/O	USB-C, USB 3.2, USB 2.0, HDMI In/Out, RJ45\r\nAudio	System	Realtek HD Audio\r\nOS	System	FreeDOS\r\nWarranty	Coverage	1 Year Warranty', 'Intel Core i5 AIO PC, 23.8 inch All in One Desktop, 16GB DDR5 AIO Computer, 512GB SSD Desktop PC Bangladesh, Business All in One PC, Office Desktop Computer, i5-13420H AIO PC, FHD IPS 100Hz PC, WiFi 6 Desktop PC, IR Camera AIO Computer, Video Conferencing Desktop, International Office Solution PC, Modern Office PC Bangladesh, Compact All in One PC, Student Desktop Computer, Home Office AIO PC, USB C All in One PC, HDMI AIO Desktop, Secure Business Computer, Fast SSD Desktop PC', NULL, 13, NULL, NULL),
(454, 'Lenovo IdeaCentre AIO 27IRH9 Core i7 13th Gen 27\" FHD All-in-One Desktop PC', 'The Intel Core i7-13620H All-in-One PC from International Office Solution features a 27-inch FHD IPS anti-glare display, 10-core performance processor, 16GB DDR5 RAM, and 512GB NVMe SSD. With WiFi 6, Bluetooth 5.2, 5MP camera, and HARMAN speakers, it is ideal for professional and office use.', 'lenovo-ideacentre-aio-27irh9-core-i7-13th-gen-27-fhd-all-in-one-desktop-pc-1781266999', '<h3>Intel Core i7-13620H All-in-One Desktop PC (27-inch)</h3><p>The <strong>Intel Core i7-13620H All-in-One PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a high-performance business desktop designed for productivity, collaboration, and modern workplace environments.</p><p>It is powered by the <strong>Intel Core i7-13620H processor</strong>, featuring 10 cores (6 Performance + 4 Efficiency cores), 16 threads, and up to 4.9GHz turbo frequency. This ensures smooth performance for multitasking, office applications, presentations, and professional workloads.</p><p>The system comes with <strong>16GB DDR5-5200 (2×8GB) dual-channel memory</strong>, supporting efficient multitasking with upgrade potential up to 32GB.</p><p>Storage is handled by a <strong>512GB M.2 PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD</strong>, delivering fast boot times, quick file access, and smooth application performance.</p><p>Graphics are powered by <strong>Intel UHD Graphics</strong>, suitable for office tasks, multimedia, browsing, and business presentations.</p><p>The highlight is the <strong>27-inch Full HD (1920×1080) IPS display</strong>, offering 300 nits brightness, 99% sRGB color accuracy, anti-glare coating, and a 3-side borderless design. This provides a wide and comfortable viewing experience, ideal for long working hours.</p><p>For audio and communication, it includes <strong>HARMAN dual 3W speakers</strong>, dual microphones, and a <strong>5MP camera</strong>, ensuring clear video conferencing and professional communication quality.</p><p>Connectivity is modern with <strong>WiFi 6 (802.11ax), Bluetooth 5.2, and Gigabit Ethernet</strong>, providing stable and fast network performance.</p><p>Security features include <strong>Firmware TPM 2.0</strong>, protecting sensitive data and enhancing system security for business environments.</p><p>The system also includes a variety of I/O ports such as USB 3.2 Gen 2, USB 2.0, USB-C, HDMI input/output, and RJ45 Ethernet for flexible connectivity options.</p><p>It comes with a <strong>USB Calliope keyboard and mouse</strong>, making it a complete ready-to-use workstation.</p><p>The <strong>Intel Core i7-13620H All-in-One PC from International Office Solution</strong> is an excellent choice for offices, professionals, and enterprises looking for performance, reliability, and a large immersive display in a single device.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Model</td><td>Intel Core i7-13620H</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Cores/Threads</td><td>10 Cores / 16 Threads</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Memory</td><td>16GB DDR5-5200 (2×8GB)</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Capacity</td><td>512GB NVMe PCIe 4.0 SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics</td><td>Type</td><td>Intel UHD Graphics</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Size</td><td>27” FHD IPS</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Brightness</td><td>300 nits</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Color</td><td>99% sRGB</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Design</td><td>3-Side Borderless, Anti-Glare</td></tr><tr><td>Camera</td><td>Type</td><td>5.0MP HD Camera</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>System</td><td>HARMAN 3W × 2 Speakers</td></tr><tr><td>Microphone</td><td>Type</td><td>Dual Microphone</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Wireless</td><td>WiFi 6, Bluetooth 5.2</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>LAN</td><td>Gigabit Ethernet</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>I/O</td><td>USB-C, USB 3.2, USB 2.0, HDMI In/Out, RJ45</td></tr><tr><td>Security</td><td>Features</td><td>Firmware TPM 2.0</td></tr><tr><td>OS</td><td>System</td><td>FreeDOS</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Coverage</td><td>1 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Desktop, All In One PC', 162000.00, 162000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/qETfiHxJfKZ3995xkRA1ukfAIf4ykIxWJDpB1M3y.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 12:23:19', '2026-06-12 12:23:19', 'Intel Core i7-13620H 27” FHD All-in-One PC | 16GB DDR5 512GB SSD 300nits IPS Business Desktop | International Office Solution', 'Buy Intel Core i7-13620H 27” All-in-One PC with FHD IPS display, 16GB DDR5 RAM, 512GB NVMe SSD, WiFi 6, 5MP camera, and HARMAN speakers for office and business use.', 'Intel Core i7 AIO PC, 27 inch All in One Desktop Bangladesh, 16GB DDR5 AIO PC, 512GB NVMe SSD Computer, Business All in One Desktop, Office PC Bangladesh, i7-13620H Desktop, FHD IPS AIO PC, WiFi 6 Desktop Computer, HARMAN Speaker PC, 5MP Camera All in One, Corporate Desktop PC, International Office Solution PC, Professional AIO Computer, Secure Business PC TPM 2.0, Modern Office Desktop, High Performance AIO PC, USB C All in One PC, HDMI AIO Desktop, Fast SSD Business PC', NULL, 13, NULL, NULL),
(455, 'Value-Top GS40UW Intel Celeron N95 23.8\" FHD All in One PC', 'The Intel Celeron N95 All-in-One PC from International Office Solution is a compact and budget-friendly desktop featuring a 23.8-inch Full HD IPS display, 8GB RAM, 256GB NVMe SSD, and Windows 11 Pro. Ideal for office work, study, and everyday computing needs.', 'value-top-gs40uw-intel-celeron-n95-238-fhd-all-in-one-pc-1781267154', '<h3>Intel Celeron N95 All-in-One Desktop PC</h3><p>The <strong>Intel Celeron N95 All-in-One PC</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> is a practical and affordable computing solution designed for students, home users, and office environments that require basic yet reliable performance.</p><p>Powered by the <strong>Intel Celeron N95 processor</strong>, this system delivers efficient performance for everyday tasks such as web browsing, document editing, online meetings, and media playback.</p><p>It comes with <strong>8GB DDR4 2666MHz RAM</strong>, ensuring smooth multitasking for basic productivity applications and light workloads.</p><p>Storage is handled by a <strong>256GB M.2 NVMe SSD</strong>, providing fast boot times, quick system responsiveness, and sufficient space for essential files and applications.</p><p>Graphics are powered by <strong>Intel UHD Graphics</strong>, suitable for HD video playback, office applications, and general use.</p><p>The system features a <strong>23.8-inch Full HD (1920×1080) IPS display</strong>, offering clear visuals, wide viewing angles, and an immersive experience for daily computing tasks.</p><p>For audio, it includes <strong>built-in dual-channel speakers</strong>, suitable for meetings, online classes, and multimedia usage.</p><p>Connectivity options include a <strong>Gigabit LAN port, Realtek wireless card, and Bluetooth 5.0</strong>, ensuring stable wired and wireless connections.</p><p>The system comes with a <strong>wireless keyboard and mouse</strong>, providing a complete ready-to-use desktop setup.</p><p>Additional connectivity includes multiple USB ports (USB 2.0, USB 3.0, and Type-C), HDMI, VGA, audio in/out, and RJ45 LAN for flexible usage.</p><p>This All-in-One PC is an excellent choice for users looking for a <strong>budget-friendly, space-saving, and reliable desktop solution</strong> for daily computing tasks.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Model</td><td>Intel Celeron N95</td></tr><tr><td>RAM</td><td>Memory</td><td>8GB DDR4 2666MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>Capacity</td><td>256GB NVMe SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics</td><td>Type</td><td>Intel UHD Graphics</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Size</td><td>23.8” FHD IPS (1920×1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>System</td><td>Built-in Dual Channel Speakers</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Wireless</td><td>WiFi (Realtek 8822), Bluetooth 5.0</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>LAN</td><td>Gigabit Ethernet</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>I/O</td><td>HDMI, VGA, USB 2.0, USB 3.0, Type-C, RJ45</td></tr><tr><td>Input Devices</td><td>Type</td><td>Wireless Keyboard &amp; Mouse</td></tr><tr><td>OS</td><td>System</td><td>Windows 11 Pro</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Supply</td><td>60W Adapter</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Coverage</td><td>3 Years (1 Year Accessories)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 43000.00, 43000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/YTfwpm7dMtJYwOFUtt37aeuqggiNiIJUVZU5cn9Z.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 12:25:54', '2026-06-12 12:25:54', 'Intel Celeron N95 All-in-One PC | 23.8” FHD IPS 8GB RAM 256GB SSD Windows 11 Pro Desktop | International Office Solution', 'Buy Intel Celeron N95 All-in-One PC with 23.8” FHD IPS display, 8GB RAM, 256GB SSD, Windows 11 Pro, WiFi, Bluetooth, and wireless keyboard & mouse for office and home use.', 'Intel Celeron N95 AIO PC, Budget All in One Desktop Bangladesh, 23.8 inch FHD IPS PC, 8GB RAM Desktop PC, 256GB SSD AIO Computer, Windows 11 Pro Desktop, Office All in One PC, Home Desktop Computer Bangladesh, Low Cost AIO PC, Wireless Keyboard Mouse PC, HDMI VGA Desktop PC, USB Type C AIO Computer, International Office Solution PC, Student Desktop PC, Entry Level All in One PC, Compact Desktop Computer, Everyday Use PC Bangladesh, Business Basic PC, Cheap AIO Desktop, Reliable Office Computer', NULL, 18, NULL, NULL),
(456, 'Value-Top GS40UB Intel Celeron N95 23.8\" FHD All in One PC', 'Intel Celeron N95 All-in-One PC with 23.8\" Full HD IPS display, 8GB RAM, and 256GB NVMe SSD. Ideal for office work, browsing, and daily basic computing tasks with a clean space-saving design.', 'value-top-gs40ub-intel-celeron-n95-238-fhd-all-in-one-pc-1781267570', '<p>This All-in-One PC is powered by the Intel Celeron N95 processor, designed for basic computing efficiency and low power consumption. It comes with 8GB DDR4 RAM and a fast 256GB NVMe SSD for smooth booting and everyday productivity tasks.</p><p>The 23.8-inch Full HD IPS display delivers clear visuals, making it suitable for office work, online classes, and media viewing. With built-in Wi-Fi, Bluetooth 5.0, and Gigabit LAN, it ensures stable connectivity for home and office use.</p><p>This system is not designed for gaming or heavy workloads but is perfect for users who need a reliable, compact, and budget-friendly desktop solution for everyday tasks.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>CPU</td><td>Intel Celeron N95</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>RAM</td><td>8GB DDR4 2666MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics</td><td>GPU</td><td>Intel UHD Graphics (Integrated)</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>SSD</td><td>256GB M.2 NVMe SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Monitor</td><td>23.8\" Full HD IPS (1920×1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>PSU</td><td>60W Power Supply</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Network</td><td>Gigabit LAN + WiFi + Bluetooth 5.0</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>I/O</td><td>HDMI, VGA, USB 2.0/3.0, USB-C, RJ45</td></tr><tr><td>OS</td><td>System</td><td>Windows 11 Pro</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Desktop, All In One PC', 43000.00, 43000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/weUZ8siBYlBZzIcHc9CGJuDLrHdS0OYL8njsuB5x.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 12:32:50', '2026-06-12 12:32:50', 'Intel Celeron N95 23.