(457, 'Value-Top GS40UW-i31215U Core i3 12th Gen 23.8\" FHD All-in-One PC', 'The Intel Core i3-1215U All-in-One PC features a 23.8-inch Full HD IPS display, 8GB DDR4 RAM, and a 256GB NVMe SSD, delivering smooth performance for office work, browsing, online classes, and everyday productivity in a clean, space-saving design.', 'value-top-gs40uw-i31215u-core-i3-12th-gen-238-fhd-all-in-one-pc-1781267738', '<p>The Intel Core i3-1215U All-in-One Desktop PC is designed to deliver efficient performance for home, office, and educational use. Powered by a 12th Gen Intel Core i3-1215U processor with up to 4.40 GHz turbo frequency, it provides reliable speed for everyday computing tasks such as document editing, web browsing, video conferencing, and multimedia playback.</p><p>It comes equipped with 8GB DDR4 3200MHz memory, ensuring smooth multitasking performance for standard workloads. The 256GB M.2 NVMe SSD offers fast boot times, quick application loading, and improved system responsiveness compared to traditional storage drives.</p><p>The 23.8-inch Full HD IPS display delivers sharp visuals, accurate colors, and wide 178° viewing angles, making it ideal for long working hours and shared viewing environments. With a 60Hz refresh rate and 250-nit brightness, it ensures clear and comfortable visual performance for daily use.</p><p>Connectivity is well covered with multiple USB 3.0, USB 2.0, USB Type-C ports, HDMI, DisplayPort, RJ45 LAN, and audio input/output, allowing seamless connection with external devices. Built-in Wi-Fi and Bluetooth ensure stable wireless communication for modern workflows.</p><p>This All-in-One system is ideal for office environments, schools, reception desks, and home users looking for a reliable, compact, and low-maintenance desktop solution.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>CPU</td><td>Intel Core i3-1215U (Up to 4.40 GHz, 10MB Cache)</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Type</td><td>Architecture</td><td>12th Gen Hybrid Architecture</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>RAM</td><td>8GB DDR4 3200MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics</td><td>GPU</td><td>Intel UHD Graphics (Integrated)</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>SSD</td><td>256GB M.2 NVMe SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Screen Size</td><td>23.8 Inch</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Resolution</td><td>Full HD (1920 × 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Panel Type</td><td>IPS</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Brightness</td><td>250 ± 50 nits</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Color Gamut</td><td>NTSC 73%</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Viewing Angle</td><td>178° Horizontal / 178° Vertical</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Speakers</td><td>2CH Stereo (3W × 2)</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Adapter</td><td>120W External Power Adapter</td></tr><tr><td>Networking</td><td>WiFi</td><td>Intel AC9265NGW Wireless Module</td></tr><tr><td>Networking</td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Built-in Bluetooth Support</td></tr><tr><td>Operating System</td><td>OS</td><td>Windows 11 Pro</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>Rear I/O</td><td>USB 3.0 ×3, USB 2.0 ×3, USB-C ×1</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>Display</td><td>HDMI ×1, DisplayPort ×1</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>Network</td><td>RJ45 LAN</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>Audio</td><td>Audio In/Out</td></tr><tr><td>Input Devices</td><td>Keyboard</td><td>Value-Top Wireless Keyboard</td></tr><tr><td>Input Devices</td><td>Mouse</td><td>Value-Top Wireless Mouse</td></tr><tr><td>Physical</td><td>Dimension</td><td>608 × 168 × 475 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Finish</td><td>White</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Desktop, All In One PC', 56000.00, 56000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/bg2U58ChjOtk5fJCivOsrnLgm3EdrYgKBfDi842M.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 12:35:38', '2026-06-12 12:35:38', 'Intel Core i3-1215U 23.8\" All-in-One PC | 8GB RAM 256GB NVMe SSD Windows 11 Pro Desktop', 'Buy Intel Core i3-1215U All-in-One PC with 23.8 inch Full HD IPS display, 8GB RAM, and 256GB NVMe SSD. Perfect for office, education, and home use with Windows 11 Pro.', 'Buy Intel Core i3-1215U All-in-One PC with 23.8 inch Full HD IPS display, 8GB RAM, and 256GB NVMe SSD. Perfect for office, education, and home use with Windows 11 Pro.', NULL, 18, NULL, NULL),
(458, 'Value-Top GS40GB-i31215U-16 Core i3 12th Gen 24\" FHD All-in-One PC With Webcam', 'Basic Information\r\nProcessor\r\nIntel Core i3-1215U (10M Cache, up to 4.40 GHz)\r\nRAM\r\n16GB DDR4 3200MHz\r\nGraphics Card\r\nIntel UHD Graphics\r\nStorage\r\n256GB M.2 NVME SSD\r\nMonitor\r\nSize: 23.8 inch\r\nResolution: FHD 1920x 1080@60Hz\r\nPanel Type: IPS\r\nAspect Ratio: 16:9\r\nBrightness (TYP): 250 ± 50\r\nDefault Color Management: 6500K\r\nContrast Ratio: 1000:1\r\nDisplay Color: 16.78M\r\nColor Gamut: NTSC 73%\r\nViewing Angle: H 178°/ V 178°(Min)\r\nResponse Time: 14ms\r\nRefresh Rate: 60Hz\r\nDot Pitch (mm): 0.2745(H) x 0.2745(V)\r\nAudio\r\nSpeaker: 2CH Stereo (4Ω 3W)\r\nDual MIC\r\nCamera\r\n5MP\r\nPower Supply\r\n120W External Power Adapter\r\nNetwork & Wireless Connectivity\r\nInternal WIFI + Bluetooth (Intel AC9265NGW)\r\nOperating System\r\nWindows 11 Pro\r\nInput Devices\r\nKeyboard\r\nValue-Top Wireless Keyboard\r\nMouse\r\nValue-Top Wireless Mouse\r\nExternal I/O Ports\r\n3*USB3.0, 3*USB2.0, 1*Type C(USB3.0), DC IN, RJ45 LAN, Audio IN/OUT\r\n1*HDMI, 1*DP\r\nPhysical Details\r\nDimension\r\n608*168*475mm\r\nColor\r\nBlack\r\nWarranty Information\r\nWarranty\r\n3 Years Warranty\r\n1 Year Warranty for Keyboard, Mouse and Power Adapter', 'value-top-gs40gb-i31215u-16-core-i3-12th-gen-24-fhd-all-in-one-pc-with-webcam-1781267928', '<p>The Intel Core i3-1215U All-in-One Desktop PC is a reliable and efficient computing solution designed for home, office, and educational environments. Powered by a 12th Gen Intel Core i3-1215U processor with up to 4.40 GHz turbo boost, it delivers stable performance for daily workloads such as document processing, web browsing, video conferencing, and multimedia usage.</p><p>This upgraded configuration includes 16GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM, allowing significantly improved multitasking performance compared to standard 8GB systems. Users can run multiple applications simultaneously with smoother responsiveness and reduced lag.</p><p>The 256GB M.2 NVMe SSD ensures fast boot times, quick application loading, and improved system efficiency. Combined with Intel integrated UHD Graphics, the system is optimized for everyday computing tasks rather than gaming or heavy graphical workloads.</p><p>The 23.8-inch Full HD IPS display provides sharp visuals, accurate colors, and wide 178° viewing angles. With 250-nit brightness, 60Hz refresh rate, and NTSC 73% color coverage, it delivers a comfortable viewing experience suitable for long working hours.</p><p>Connectivity options include multiple USB 3.0, USB 2.0, USB Type-C, HDMI, DisplayPort, RJ45 LAN, and audio ports, ensuring compatibility with a wide range of peripherals and external devices. Built-in Wi-Fi and Bluetooth provide stable wireless connectivity for modern office setups.</p><p>This All-in-One PC is ideal for business users, office environments, educational institutions, and home users who need a clean, efficient, and dependable desktop solution.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Processor</td><td>CPU</td><td>Intel Core i3-1215U (Up to 4.40 GHz, 10M Cache)</td></tr><tr><td>Processor Type</td><td>Architecture</td><td>12th Gen Hybrid Architecture</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>RAM</td><td>16GB DDR4 3200MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics</td><td>GPU</td><td>Intel UHD Graphics (Integrated)</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>SSD</td><td>256GB M.2 NVMe SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Screen Size</td><td>23.8 Inch</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Resolution</td><td>Full HD (1920 × 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Panel Type</td><td>IPS</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Brightness</td><td>250 ± 50 nits</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Color Gamut</td><td>NTSC 73%</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Viewing Angle</td><td>178° Horizontal / 178° Vertical</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Speakers</td><td>2CH Stereo (3W × 2)</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Microphone</td><td>Dual Microphone (MIC)</td></tr><tr><td>Camera</td><td>Webcam</td><td>5MP HD Camera</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Adapter</td><td>120W External Power Adapter</td></tr><tr><td>Networking</td><td>WiFi</td><td>Intel AC9265NGW Wireless Module</td></tr><tr><td>Networking</td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Built-in Bluetooth Support</td></tr><tr><td>Operating System</td><td>OS</td><td>Windows 11 Pro</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>USB</td><td>USB 3.0 ×3, USB 2.0 ×3, USB-C ×1</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>Display</td><td>HDMI ×1, DisplayPort ×1</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>Network</td><td>RJ45 LAN</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>Audio</td><td>Audio In/Out</td></tr><tr><td>Input Devices</td><td>Keyboard</td><td>Value-Top Wireless Keyboard</td></tr><tr><td>Input Devices</td><td>Mouse</td><td>Value-Top Wireless Mouse</td></tr><tr><td>Physical</td><td>Dimension</td><td>608 × 168 × 475 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Finish</td><td>Black</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Desktop, All In One PC', 63000.00, 63000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/v06D2UKW94njAofME3yiecGWRQvuZ18nTDKGeyiM.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 12:38:48', '2026-06-12 12:38:48', 'Intel Core i3-1215U 23.8\" All-in-One PC | 16GB RAM 256GB NVMe SSD Windows 11 Pro Desktop', 'Buy Intel Core i3-1215U All-in-One PC with 23.8 inch Full HD IPS display, 16GB DDR4 RAM, and 256GB NVMe SSD. Perfect for office, education, and home use with Windows 11 Pro.', 'Intel Core i3-1215U AIO PC, 23.8 inch All in One Desktop, 16GB RAM 256GB SSD PC, Windows 11 Pro AIO Computer, Office Desktop PC Bangladesh, Full HD IPS All in One PC, Business PC Bangladesh, Home Office Computer, Wireless Keyboard Mouse PC, Budget AIO Desktop', NULL, 18, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `name`, `short_description`, `slug`, `description`, `specifications_text`, `tags`, `buy_price`, `price`, `discount_price`, `stock`, `thumbnail`, `video`, `is_featured`, `status`, `is_coming_soon`, `is_tba`, `is_call_for_price`, `is_out_of_stock`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`, `meta_keywords`, `meta_image`, `brand_id`, `supplier_id`, `laptop_purpose_id`) VALUES
(459, 'Value-Top GS70HW-i31215U Core i3 12th Gen 27\" FHD All-in-One PC', 'This is a compact All-in-One (AIO) desktop PC powered by the Intel Core i3-1215U processor, designed for smooth everyday computing such as office work, browsing, online classes, and light multimedia use. With a large 27-inch Full HD IPS display, 16GB RAM, and fast NVMe SSD storage, it delivers a clean, space-saving setup ideal for home and office environments.', 'value-top-gs70hw-i31215u-core-i3-12th-gen-27-fhd-all-in-one-pc-1781268432', '<p>The Intel Core i3-1215U All-in-One PC combines performance efficiency with a minimalist design, making it suitable for users who want a clutter-free workspace without sacrificing usability. Powered by a 12th Gen hybrid architecture processor, it efficiently handles multitasking, document processing, web browsing, and video playback.</p><p>The system features 16GB DDR4 RAM, which ensures smooth multitasking even with multiple applications open. Storage is handled by a 256GB M.2 NVMe SSD, providing fast boot times, quick file access, and responsive overall performance.</p><p>The highlight of this system is its 27-inch Full HD IPS display, offering wide viewing angles (178°/178°), accurate color reproduction (NTSC 73%), and a comfortable 60Hz refresh rate. This makes it suitable for long working hours, media viewing, and basic design tasks.</p><p>Connectivity is modern and versatile, including USB 3.0 ports, USB Type-C, HDMI, DisplayPort, LAN, Wi-Fi, and Bluetooth. The inclusion of both HDMI and DP input/output options makes it flexible for external display or multi-device setups.</p><p>With a built-in stereo speaker system, wireless keyboard and mouse, and integrated camera and audio setup, this AIO system is ready for plug-and-play usage right out of the box.</p>', '<h3><strong>Short Description</strong></h3><p>The <strong>International Office Solution</strong> 23.8\" All-in-One PC delivers seamless performance and a clutter-free workspace. Powered by a 12th Gen Intel Core i3-1215U processor, 16GB DDR4 RAM, and a ultra-fast 256GB NVMe SSD, it handles daily multitasking, office applications, and video conferencing with ease. Featuring a stunning FHD IPS display, a built-in 5MP webcam, and a wireless keyboard and mouse combo, it is the ultimate out-of-the-box desktop solution for modern professionals.</p><h3><strong>Long Description</strong></h3><p>Upgrade your workspace efficiency with the <strong>International Office Solution</strong> 23.8-inch All-in-One Desktop PC. Meticulously designed for modern corporate environments, remote workstations, and academic tasks, this sleek, all-in-one system eliminates tower clutter while maximizing productivity. At its heart lies the Intel Core i3-1215U processor (featuring 10M Cache and speeds up to 4.40 GHz), paired with a generous 16GB of DDR4 RAM. This combination ensures smooth multitasking across web browsers, spreadsheet software, and accounting programs. The 256GB M.2 NVMe SSD provides near-instant boot times and rapid file access.</p><p>The centerpiece is a brilliant 23.8-inch Full HD (1920x1080) IPS display with a wide 178° viewing angle, rendering crisp text and vibrant colors (73% NTSC gamut) ideal for long working hours. Designed for seamless virtual collaboration, the system integrates a high-definition 5MP webcam, dual microphones, and built-in stereo speakers, eliminating the need for external accessories. It comes fully equipped with Windows 11 Pro for robust enterprise security and arrives complete with a premium wireless keyboard and mouse set.</p><h3><strong>Technical Breakdown</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Computing Performance</strong></td><td>Intel Core i3-1215U (Up to 4.40 GHz), 16GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM, Intel UHD Graphics</td><td>12th Gen architecture and high memory capacity ensure lag-free multitasking and fast processing.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display &amp; Visuals</strong></td><td>23.8\" FHD IPS Panel, 1920x1080 Resolution, 60Hz, 73% NTSC Color Gamut</td><td>Anti-glare wide-angle display provides vibrant, color-accurate visuals that reduce eye strain during long shifts.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; OS</strong></td><td>256GB M.2 NVMe SSD, Pre-installed Windows 11 Pro</td><td>Offers high-speed boot sequences, secure data management, and professional enterprise features.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Media &amp; Comm.</strong></td><td>5MP Built-in Camera, Dual Mics, 2CH Stereo Speakers, Intel Wi-Fi + Bluetooth</td><td>Fully optimized for remote work, remote learning, and high-quality video conferencing without extra hardware.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity &amp; I/O</strong></td><td>1x Type-C, 3x USB 3.0, 3x USB 2.0, 1x HDMI, 1x DP, RJ45 Gigabit LAN</td><td>Extensive ports allow effortless dual-monitor expansion, peripheral connections, and high-speed networking.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Peripherals &amp; Power</strong></td><td>Value-Top Wireless Keyboard &amp; Mouse, 120W External Power Adapter</td><td>Complete, out-of-the-box desk solution minimizing wire clutter with power-efficient delivery.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Desktop, All In One PC', 66000.00, 66000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/5PBF4uwINwrz6aMvwwbDmYOkrv84x5h3yKgd8Xcn.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 12:47:12', '2026-06-12 12:47:12', 'Intel Core i3-1215U 27-inch All-in-One PC | 16GB RAM 256GB SSD AIO Desktop', 'Buy Intel Core i3-1215U All-in-One Desktop PC with 27-inch FHD IPS display, 16GB RAM, 256GB NVMe SSD, WiFi & Bluetooth. Ideal for office, study, and home use with clean space-saving design.', 'Buy Intel Core i3-1215U All-in-One Desktop PC with 27-inch FHD IPS display, 16GB RAM, 256GB NVMe SSD, WiFi & Bluetooth. Ideal for office, study, and home use with clean space-saving design.', NULL, 18, NULL, NULL),
(460, 'Value-Top GS70HB-i31215U Core i3 12th Gen 27\" FHD All-in-One PC', 'The International Office Solution 27\" All-in-One PC in sleek black delivers an expansive, clutter-free workspace for modern professionals. Powered by a 12th Gen Intel Core i3-1215U processor, 16GB of DDR4 RAM, and a rapid 256GB NVMe SSD, it effortlessly manages daily productivity tasks and office applications. Complete with a stunning 27-inch FHD IPS display, integrated stereo speakers, Windows 11 Pro, and a wireless keyboard and mouse combo, it is a highly capable, ready-to-use desktop system.', 'value-top-gs70hb-i31215u-core-i3-12th-gen-27-fhd-all-in-one-pc-1781268652', '<p>Expand your digital workspace with the <strong>International Office Solution</strong> 27-inch All-in-One Desktop PC. Designed with a sophisticated black finish, this system is engineered to eliminate tower PC clutter while maximizing your screen real estate and productivity. Under the hood, it boasts a reliable 12th Gen Intel Core i3-1215U processor (capable of up to 4.40 GHz) paired with a high-capacity 16GB DDR4 RAM, ensuring seamless navigation between heavy spreadsheets, web applications, and multitasking workflows. The 256GB M.2 NVMe SSD guarantees lightning-fast boot times and highly responsive file access.</p><p>The system\'s standout feature is its massive 27-inch Full HD (1920x1080) IPS display, which offers an ultra-wide 178° viewing angle and vibrant 73% NTSC color accuracy. This expansive screen is perfect for detailed data analysis, presentation drafting, and media viewing, complemented by built-in 2CH stereo speakers. Equipped with enterprise-ready Windows 11 Pro, robust Wi-Fi and Bluetooth connectivity, and an included premium wireless keyboard and mouse set, this All-in-One PC provides a clean, highly efficient workstation right out of the box.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Performance &amp; OS</strong></td><td>Intel Core i3-1215U (Up to 4.40 GHz), 16GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM, 256GB M.2 NVMe SSD, Windows 11 Pro</td><td>Delivers high-speed processing, rapid application loading, and robust enterprise-grade software capabilities for demanding daily workflows.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display &amp; Audio</strong></td><td>27-inch FHD (1920x1080) IPS Panel, 60Hz, 73% NTSC Gamut, 1000:1 Contrast, 2CH Stereo Speakers (4Ω 3W)</td><td>Provides a massive, color-accurate visual workspace with integrated audio, reducing eye strain and enhancing detailed spreadsheet or media tasks.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity &amp; Input</strong></td><td>Wi-Fi + Bluetooth (Intel AC9265NGW), 1x Type-C, 6x USB-A (3.0/2.0), HDMI, DP, Value-Top Wireless KB &amp; Mouse</td><td>Ensures a clean, wire-free desk environment with versatile port options for easy multi-monitor expansion and fast networking.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Desktop, All In One PC', 66000.00, 66000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/ArYfWb8HK3COrKLhYNb56sG9tHVmoI5tbNdcfXSc.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 12:50:52', '2026-06-12 12:50:52', 'International Office Solution 27\" Core i3 12th Gen All-in-One PC - Black', 'Upgrade your workspace with the International Office Solution 27\" Black All-in-One PC. Featuring an Intel i3-1215U, 16GB RAM, 256GB SSD, and Windows 11 Pro.', 'International Office Solution AIO, 27 inch All in One PC, Intel Core i3-1215U desktop, black 27\" AIO computer, 16GB RAM desktop, Windows 11 Pro PC, business all in one, wireless keyboard mouse combo', NULL, 18, NULL, NULL),
(461, 'Value-Top GL40GB-i512450H Core i5 12th Gen 24\" FHD All-in-One PC With Webcam', 'Short Description\r\nThe International Office Solution 23.8\" Core i5 All-in-One PC (Black) is a powerhouse desktop designed to maximize both performance and desk space. Driven by a high-performance 12th Gen Intel Core i5-12450H processor, 16GB DDR4 RAM, and a spacious 512GB NVMe SSD, it effortlessly tackles demanding professional workloads and complex multitasking. Complete with a vibrant 23.8-inch FHD IPS display, integrated 5MP webcam, enterprise-ready Windows 11 Pro, and a wireless keyboard and mouse, it is the ultimate comprehensive workstation for modern professionals.', 'value-top-gl40gb-i512450h-core-i5-12th-gen-24-fhd-all-in-one-pc-with-webcam-1781268774', '<p>Transform your professional environment with the highly sophisticated <strong>International Office Solution</strong> 23.8-inch All-in-One Desktop PC, presented in a sleek, professional black chassis. Engineered for users who require serious computing power without the bulky footprint of a traditional desktop tower, this system redefines workspace efficiency. At its core lies the formidable 12th Generation Intel Core i5-12450H processor. Featuring a substantial 12MB cache and clock speeds reaching up to 4.40 GHz, this H-series CPU delivers laptop-defying, high-tier performance. When paired with 16GB of rapid 3200MHz DDR4 RAM, the system guarantees buttery-smooth transitions between resource-heavy applications, expansive data spreadsheets, and complex browser sessions. Furthermore, the upgraded 512GB M.2 NVMe SSD offers a massive vault for your crucial files while providing near-instantaneous boot sequences and ultra-fast application loading times.</p><p>The visual experience is anchored by a stunning 23.8-inch Full HD (1920x1080) IPS display. Designed for prolonged professional use, the panel features a wide 178-degree viewing angle and an accurate 73% NTSC color gamut, ensuring that presentations, graphics, and video content are rendered with vivid, true-to-life clarity. The 1000:1 contrast ratio and 250-nit brightness actively work to reduce eye fatigue during extended work shifts.</p><p>Beyond its processing and visual prowess, this All-in-One PC is a fully optimized communication hub. It features a high-definition 5MP built-in camera, an advanced dual-microphone array, and 2CH stereo speakers, allowing you to seamlessly join virtual meetings and video conferences without the need to purchase or cable up external peripherals. The inclusion of an ultra-fast internal Wi-Fi and Bluetooth module (Intel AC9265NGW) ensures you remain connected to your network and wireless devices effortlessly. Shipped with robust, security-focused Windows 11 Pro and a premium Value-Top wireless keyboard and mouse combo, this workstation offers a pristine, plug-and-play experience that elevates any modern office or remote work setup.</p><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Computing &amp; Power</strong></td><td>Intel Core i5-12450H (12MB Cache, up to 4.40 GHz), 16GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM</td><td>High-performance H-series processor combined with ample memory ensures flawless execution of heavy multitasking and data-intensive applications.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; OS</strong></td><td>512GB M.2 NVMe SSD, Windows 11 Pro Pre-installed</td><td>Provides expansive storage capacity, rapid system boot times, and advanced enterprise-grade security and networking features.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display &amp; Visuals</strong></td><td>23.8\" FHD (1920x1080) IPS Panel, 60Hz, 73% NTSC Gamut, 178° Ultra-Wide Viewing Angle</td><td>Delivers crisp, color-accurate, and vibrant imagery that reduces eye strain and provides excellent visibility from any angle.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Communication &amp; Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in 5MP Web Camera, Dual Microphone Array, 2CH Stereo Speakers (4Ω 3W)</td><td>Creates a complete, out-of-the-box virtual meeting studio for seamless, high-quality video conferencing without external wires.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity &amp; I/O</strong></td><td>Wi-Fi + Bluetooth (Intel AC9265NGW), RJ45 LAN, 1x Type-C, 3x USB 3.0, 3x USB 2.0, 1x HDMI, 1x DP</td><td>Offers comprehensive versatility for ultra-fast networking, diverse peripheral connections, and effortless multi-monitor expansions.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Input &amp; Aesthetics</strong></td><td>Sleek Black Chassis (630x525x190mm), Value-Top Wireless Keyboard &amp; Mouse</td><td>Maintains a clean, wire-free desk environment while adding a touch of modern, professional elegance to your workspace.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>3 Years System Warranty (1 Year for Peripherals &amp; Adapter)</td><td>Secures your investment with reliable, long-term technical support and comprehensive hardware protection.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'Desktop, All In One PC', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/edViQZls470bDKmgIVm126GdBazkpMHOlgw3Irx3.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 12:52:54', '2026-06-12 12:52:54', 'International Office Solution 23.8\" Core i5-12450H All-in-One PC - Black', 'Maximize productivity with the International Office Solution 23.8\" Black All-in-One PC. Boasting an Intel Core i5-12450H, 16GB RAM, 512GB SSD, 5MP webcam, and Windows 11 Pro.', 'International Office Solution AIO, 23.8 inch All in One PC black, Intel Core i5-12450H desktop, 16GB RAM 512GB SSD AIO, Windows 11 Pro workstation, business desktop PC, wireless keyboard and mouse AIO', NULL, 18, NULL, NULL),
(462, 'Value-Top GL70GB-i512450H Core i5 12th Gen 27\" FHD All-in-One PC With Webcam', 'The International Office Solution 27\" Core i5 All-in-One PC is a premium desktop solution that merges expansive screen real estate with top-tier processing power. Equipped with a high-performance 12th Gen Intel Core i5-12450H processor, 16GB of DDR4 RAM, and a high-capacity 512GB NVMe SSD, it effortlessly handles resource-intensive professional applications and demanding multitasking. Featuring a massive 27-inch FHD IPS display, an integrated 5MP webcam, and pre-installed Windows 11 Pro, it provides a complete, clutter-free workstation for modern corporate and remote environments.', 'value-top-gl70gb-i512450h-core-i5-12th-gen-27-fhd-all-in-one-pc-with-webcam-1781268901', '<p>Elevate your professional workspace with the <strong>International Office Solution</strong> 27-inch All-in-One Desktop PC. Meticulously engineered for users who demand both robust computing power and a visually expansive digital environment, this system eliminates the cumbersome bulk of traditional tower PCs while maximizing your daily productivity. At its foundation is the formidable 12th Generation Intel Core i5-12450H processor. Featuring a 12MB cache and blazing-fast clock speeds reaching up to 4.40 GHz, this H-series CPU is built to deliver exceptional performance, easily handling everything from heavy data processing to complex software suites. When coupled with 16GB of rapid 3200MHz DDR4 memory, the system ensures seamless, lag-free transitions between extensive multitasking sessions. Furthermore, the massive 512GB M.2 NVMe SSD offers abundant vault-like storage for your critical business files, while guaranteeing near-instantaneous system boot sequences and highly responsive application load times.</p><p>The visual centerpiece of this workstation is its sprawling 27-inch Full HD (1920x1080) IPS display. Designed for prolonged analytical, administrative, and creative use, this panel boasts an ultra-wide 178-degree viewing angle and a vibrant 73% NTSC color gamut. This ensures that every presentation, graphic, and spreadsheet is rendered with striking clarity and precise color accuracy, while the 250-nit brightness actively mitigates eye fatigue.</p><p>Beyond its processing and visual capabilities, this All-in-One PC is engineered as a fully integrated communication hub for the modern professional. It features a high-definition 5MP built-in web camera, an advanced dual-microphone array, and robust 2CH stereo speakers, allowing you to conduct virtual meetings and video conferences with crystal-clear audio and video without relying on external, wire-heavy peripherals. Shipped with the highly secure, enterprise-ready Windows 11 Pro and arriving with a premium Value-Top wireless keyboard and mouse combination, this system delivers a pristine, out-of-the-box experience that immediately enhances the aesthetics and operational efficiency of any modern office setup.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Computing &amp; Power</strong></td><td>Intel Core i5-12450H (12MB Cache, up to 4.40 GHz), 16GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM</td><td>The high-wattage H-series processor and large memory pool guarantee flawlessly smooth performance for heavy professional multitasking and data-intensive applications.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Platform</strong></td><td>512GB M.2 NVMe SSD, Windows 11 Pro Pre-installed</td><td>Delivers expansive, lightning-fast storage for rapid file retrieval, paired with robust, enterprise-grade operating system security and networking capabilities.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display &amp; Visuals</strong></td><td>27\" FHD (1920x1080) IPS Panel, 60Hz, 73% NTSC Gamut, 178° Viewing Angle</td><td>Provides a massive, color-accurate digital canvas that maximizes workflow visibility, reduces eye strain, and ensures excellent clarity from any desk angle.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Communication &amp; Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in 5MP Web Camera, Dual Microphone Array, 2CH Stereo Speakers (4Ω 3W)</td><td>Creates an instant, high-quality virtual meeting environment for seamless video conferencing without the clutter of external webcams or speakers.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity &amp; I/O</strong></td><td>Wi-Fi + Bluetooth (Intel AC9265NGW), RJ45 LAN, 1x Type-C, 3x USB 3.0, 3x USB 2.0, HDMI, DP</td><td>Offers highly versatile connection options for ultra-fast wireless networking, extensive peripheral integration, and easy multi-monitor expansions.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Peripherals &amp; Support</strong></td><td>Value-Top Wireless Keyboard &amp; Mouse, 3-Year System Warranty (1-Year on Peripherals)</td><td>Ensures a clean, completely wire-free desktop aesthetic while securing your long-term investment with comprehensive, reliable hardware protection.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Desktop, All In One PC', 80000.00, 80000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/2THsQgFAnfPy1kksStXtoTvWRgCWFW7mtVx3xniw.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 12:55:01', '2026-06-12 12:55:01', 'International Office Solution 27\" Core i5-12450H All-in-One PC', 'Transform your workflow with the International Office Solution 27\" All-in-One PC. Featuring a powerful Intel Core i5-12450H, 16GB RAM, 512GB SSD, 5MP webcam, and Windows 11 Pro.', 'International Office Solution AIO, 27 inch All in One PC, Intel Core i5-12450H desktop, 16GB RAM 512GB SSD AIO, Windows 11 Pro computer, large screen office desktop, wireless keyboard mouse AIO combo', NULL, 18, NULL, NULL),
(463, 'Smart FlaireSuite AIO Core i3 12th Gen 23.8\" All in One PC', 'The International Office Solution 23.8\" All-in-One PC is a highly versatile and space-saving desktop engineered for everyday business reliability. Powered by a desktop-grade 12th Gen Intel Core i3-12100 processor, 8GB of DDR4 RAM, and a fast 512GB PCIe NVMe SSD, it provides responsive performance for data entry, document management, and web-based applications. Featuring a stunning micro-edge 23.8-inch FHD IPS display, a built-in 5MP webcam, and shipping with FreeDOS for ultimate operating system flexibility, it is the perfect customizable workstation for growing enterprises and academic institutions.', 'smart-flairesuite-aio-core-i3-12th-gen-238-all-in-one-pc-1781269017', '<p>Maximize your desk space without sacrificing desktop-level performance with the <strong>International Office Solution</strong> 23.8-inch All-in-One PC. Carefully designed to meet the rigorous demands of modern office environments, remote workstations, and educational computer labs, this system completely eliminates the clutter of traditional computer towers. At the heart of this machine is the robust 12th Generation Intel Core i3-12100 processor. Unlike standard mobile processors, this desktop-class CPU features a 12MB cache and clock speeds up to 4.30 GHz, delivering sustained, high-tier performance for uninterrupted daily workflows. Paired with 8GB of rapid 3200MHz DDR4 memory and a spacious 512GB PCIe NVMe M.2 SSD, this system ensures quick boot times, ultra-fast file transfers, and smooth multitasking across various office applications.</p><p>The visual experience is spectacular, centered around a 23.8-inch Full HD (1920x1080) IPS panel. The modern micro-edge bezel design maximizes screen real estate, creating a near-borderless viewing experience that is perfect for multi-monitor setups. With a 72% NTSC color gamut and 250 nits of brightness, the screen produces vibrant, color-accurate visuals while reducing eye strain during long, data-heavy shifts. Because it ships with FreeDOS, IT departments and network administrators have the total freedom to deploy their own custom operating systems, ensuring the machines perfectly align with existing corporate network security protocols and enterprise software licenses.</p><p>Furthermore, this system is a ready-to-use communication powerhouse. It features an integrated 5MP high-resolution webcam and robust dual 3W horn speakers, providing a pristine audio-visual experience for virtual meetings, client pitches, and remote learning without the need for cumbersome external peripherals. Supported by fast 802.11ac Wi-Fi and Bluetooth connectivity, and arriving out-of-the-box with a sleek wireless keyboard and mouse, the <strong>International Office Solution</strong> AIO provides a remarkably clean, efficient, and highly customizable desktop experience backed by a solid 2-year warranty.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Computing Engine</strong></td><td>Intel Core i3-12100 (12MB Cache, Up to 4.30 GHz), 8GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM</td><td>Desktop-grade processing power provides sustained, reliable performance for essential multitasking and intensive administrative applications.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Platform</strong></td><td>512GB PCIe NVMe M.2 SSD, FreeDOS Operating System</td><td>Offers blazing-fast data access and gives IT professionals the flexibility to install custom, enterprise-specific operating systems.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display &amp; Visuals</strong></td><td>23.8” FHD (1920x1080) IPS, Micro-edge Bezels, 250 nits, 72% NTSC Gamut</td><td>A near-borderless, anti-glare screen that delivers crisp, color-accurate imagery while maximizing your digital workspace.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Media &amp; Comm.</strong></td><td>Integrated 5MP Webcam, Built-in Dual 3W Horn Speakers</td><td>Delivers crystal-clear video and robust audio for professional-grade video conferencing without the need for external devices.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Networking &amp; I/O</strong></td><td>Wi-Fi 802.11b/g/n/ac + Bluetooth, DC19V Power Adapter</td><td>Ensures stable, high-speed wireless connectivity for cloud computing and seamless pairing with wireless office peripherals.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Accessories &amp; Support</strong></td><td>Wireless Keyboard, Wireless Mouse, 2-Year System Warranty</td><td>Creates a minimalist, cable-free desk environment while protecting your hardware investment with reliable long-term support.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Desktop, All In One PC', 56000.00, 56000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/gI1MkbwL9SdxWtGY5uNrVaNnkrOHy8vNyAhSz35a.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 12:56:57', '2026-06-12 12:57:55', 'International Office Solution 23.8\" Core i3-12100 All-in-One PC', 'IDiscover the International Office Solution 23.8\" AIO PC. Featuring a desktop-grade Intel i3-12100, 8GB RAM, 512GB SSD, 5MP Webcam, and FreeDOS for custom enterprise setups.', 'International Office Solution AIO, 23.8 inch All in One PC, Intel Core i3-12100 desktop, 8GB RAM 512GB SSD AIO, FreeDOS office computer, micro-edge desktop monitor, wireless keyboard mouse PC, business AIO computer', NULL, 19, NULL, NULL),
(464, 'Smart FlaireSuite AIO Core i5 12th Gen 23.8\" All in One PC', 'The International Office Solution 23.8\" All-in-One PC is a premium, space-saving desktop workstation built around the highly efficient 12th Gen Intel Core i5-1235U 10-core processor. Paired with 8GB of DDR4 RAM and a lightning-fast 512GB PCIe NVMe SSD, it effortlessly handles administrative workloads, heavy web browsing, and daily multitasking. Featuring a brilliant 23.8-inch FHD IPS micro-edge display, an integrated 5MP webcam, wireless peripherals, and shipping with FreeDOS for maximum OS deployment flexibility, it is the ideal customizable solution for modern corporate and remote environments.', 'smart-flairesuite-aio-core-i5-12th-gen-238-all-in-one-pc-1781269181', '<p>Redefine your workspace capabilities with the <strong>International Office Solution</strong> 23.8-inch All-in-One Desktop PC. Engineered specifically for professionals, educators, and enterprise users who require powerful computing without the restrictive footprint of a traditional desktop tower, this sleek workstation delivers exceptional performance and aesthetic elegance. At its core is the advanced 12th Generation Intel Core i5-1235U processor. Featuring a cutting-edge hybrid architecture with 10 cores (2 Performance cores and 8 Efficient cores) and 12 threads, this processor reaches clock speeds up to 4.40GHz. This ensures optimal power distribution—delivering high-octane performance for demanding software while maintaining energy efficiency during lighter tasks. Accompanied by 8GB of rapid 3200MHz DDR4 memory and a generous 512GB PCIe NVMe M.2 SSD, the system guarantees near-instant boot sequences, lightning-fast file transfers, and incredibly smooth transitions between multiple intensive applications.</p><p>The visual centerpiece of this AIO is its stunning 23.8-inch Full HD (1920x1080) IPS panel. Meticulously designed with micro-edge bezels, it maximizes your digital real estate and creates a virtually seamless experience if integrated into a multi-monitor setup. Outputting 250 nits of brightness and covering a 72% NTSC color gamut, the display renders presentations, data analysis, and media with vibrant, true-to-life color accuracy. Furthermore, by shipping with FreeDOS, this system offers ultimate administrative flexibility. IT departments can bypass pre-installed bloatware and directly deploy custom, network-specific operating systems that align flawlessly with existing enterprise security protocols.</p><p>Beyond its core computing power, this system is a fully equipped communication and multimedia hub. It features a top-mounted, high-resolution 5MP webcam paired with dual 3W built-in horn speakers, providing crystal-clear video and robust audio for virtual meetings, remote learning, and client presentations. Supported by fast 802.11ac Wi-Fi and Bluetooth connectivity, and arriving out-of-the-box with a sleek wireless keyboard and mouse combination, this All-in-One PC creates a pristine, cable-free desk environment while ensuring reliable, long-term operation backed by a comprehensive 2-year warranty.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Computing Engine</strong></td><td>Intel Core i5-1235U (10 Core, 12 Thread, Up to 4.40GHz, 12MB Cache)</td><td>Hybrid core architecture intelligently balances high-end performance and power efficiency for complex, multi-threaded workloads.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory &amp; Storage</strong></td><td>8GB DDR4-3200 MHz RAM, 512GB PCIe NVMe M.2 SSD</td><td>Ensures rapid data retrieval, fast application loading, and smooth multitasking across various office software suites.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display &amp; Visuals</strong></td><td>23.8” FHD (1920x1080) IPS, Micro-edge Bezels, 250 nits, 72% NTSC</td><td>Provides a near-borderless, high-clarity workspace with excellent color accuracy and wide viewing angles to reduce eye fatigue.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Media &amp; Comm.</strong></td><td>Integrated 5MP Webcam, Dual 4Ω/3W Horn Speakers</td><td>Delivers professional-grade audio and high-definition video out-of-the-box for seamless virtual collaboration and conferencing.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Networking &amp; OS</strong></td><td>Wi-Fi 802.11ac + Bluetooth, FreeDOS</td><td>Guarantees stable wireless connectivity and gives IT professionals total freedom to install custom enterprise operating systems.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Peripherals &amp; Support</strong></td><td>Wireless Keyboard, Wireless Mouse, 2-Year Warranty</td><td>Minimizes desk clutter with wire-free peripherals while securing your hardware investment with reliable, long-term manufacturer support.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Desktop, All In One PC', 75000.00, 75000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/ZvndjiEnOTL36Yw2BTo1kBjbBW6u2BfGnInKXhty.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 12:59:41', '2026-06-12 12:59:41', 'International Office Solution 23.8\" Core i5-1235U All-in-One PC', 'Upgrade to the International Office Solution 23.8\" AIO PC. Powered by a 10-core Intel i5-1235U, 8GB RAM, 512GB NVMe SSD, and 5MP webcam. FreeDOS ready.', 'International Office Solution AIO, 23.8 inch All in One PC, Intel Core i5-1235U desktop, 10-core AIO computer, 8GB RAM 512GB SSD desktop, micro-edge monitor PC, FreeDOS office computer, wireless keyboard mouse AIO combo', NULL, 19, NULL, NULL),
(465, 'Asus Nuc 14 Essential Core 3 N355 Portable Mini Pc', 'The International Office Solution Ultra-Compact Mini PC is a highly versatile, energy-efficient barebone system designed for modern enterprises, digital signage, and minimalist workspaces. Powered by the incredibly efficient Intel Core 3-N355 processor (15W TDP) and featuring future-proof support for blazing-fast DDR5 Laptop RAM and high-speed NVMe storage, this customizable powerhouse allows you to build a system tailored exactly to your professional needs. Outfitted with next-generation Wi-Fi 6E, a 2.5G Gigabit LAN port, and extensive multi-display I/O connectivity, it delivers full-sized desktop performance in a sleek 470g black chassis that easily fits in the palm of your hand.', 'asus-nuc-14-essential-core-3-n355-portable-mini-pc-1781269381', '<p>Maximize your spatial efficiency and operational customization with the <strong>International Office Solution</strong> Core 3-N355 Ultra-Compact Mini PC. Engineered specifically for IT professionals, corporate deployments, and point-of-sale systems that demand robust performance without the bulk of a traditional tower, this barebone desktop redefines what is possible in a miniature form factor. At the heart of this system is the exceptionally energy-efficient Intel Core 3-N355 processor. Operating at a remarkably low 15W Thermal Design Power (TDP), it ensures whisper-quiet operation and significantly reduced energy costs while delivering more than enough computing muscle for administrative applications, cloud-based workflows, and media streaming. Because it arrives as a customizable barebone unit, IT administrators have the ultimate flexibility to equip it with the exact capacity of cutting-edge DDR5 SO-DIMM RAM and lightning-fast M.2 NVMe SSD storage required for their specific network environment.</p><p>Despite measuring a mere 135mm x 115mm x 36mm and weighing only 470 grams, this mini PC offers a connectivity suite that rivals full-sized, high-end desktop workstations. The networking capabilities are truly next-generation, featuring an advanced Intel Wi-Fi 6E AX211 module for ultra-low latency, interference-free wireless connections, alongside a blazing-fast Realtek 2.5G Ethernet controller for high-bandwidth wired networking. Whether you are transferring massive datasets across a corporate server or managing high-definition video conferencing, the networking hardware ensures zero bottlenecks.</p><p>Furthermore, the external I/O configuration is meticulously designed to support complex, multi-tasking setups. The front and side panels offer quick access to high-speed USB 3.2 Gen2 Type-C and Type-A ports, alongside a 3.5mm headset jack for immediate peripheral connections. The rear panel is an expansion marvel, boasting a USB 3.2 Gen2 Type-C port with DisplayPort 1.4 capabilities, a dedicated HDMI 2.1 port, and a standard DisplayPort 1.4. This allows for seamless integration into multi-monitor arrays, high-resolution digital signage, or complex trading desks. Backed by a comprehensive 3-year warranty, this <strong>International Office Solution</strong> Mini PC guarantees long-term reliability and adaptable performance in an elegantly discreet black chassis.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Computing &amp; Power</strong></td><td>Intel Core 3-N355 Processor, Ultra-low 15W TDP</td><td>Delivers smooth, reliable everyday computing performance while drastically reducing power consumption and thermal output for quiet operation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory &amp; Storage</strong></td><td>Supports Next-Gen DDR5 Laptop RAM &amp; PCIe NVMe SSDs</td><td>Barebone architecture allows ultimate customizability; DDR5 and NVMe compatibility ensures ultra-fast data retrieval and future-proof upgradeability.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Network &amp; Wireless</strong></td><td>Intel Wi-Fi 6E AX211 (Gig+), Bluetooth 5.3, Realtek 2.5G LAN</td><td>Provides enterprise-grade, high-bandwidth internet connectivity with dramatically reduced latency for flawless cloud computing and large file transfers.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Capabilities</strong></td><td>1x HDMI 2.1, 1x DisplayPort 1.4, 1x Type-C (w/ DP 1.4 Support)</td><td>Empowers professionals to effortlessly drive multiple high-resolution displays simultaneously, perfect for complex spreadsheets or digital signage.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Extensive I/O Ports</strong></td><td>2x USB-C (3.2 Gen2), 4x USB-A (3.2 Gen2/2.0), Audio Jack, RJ45</td><td>Offers massive peripheral versatility, allowing high-speed data transfers and clean cable management despite the machine\'s tiny footprint.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design &amp; Security</strong></td><td>135x115x36mm Dimensions, 470g Weight, Kensington Lock Slot</td><td>An incredibly lightweight, palm-sized chassis that can be easily hidden or mounted, complete with hardware security to prevent physical theft in public spaces.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>3 Years Comprehensive Warranty</td><td>Secures your corporate hardware investment with reliable, long-term manufacturer support and technical assistance.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'Portable  Mini PC', 32000.00, 32000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/uXhuysok9fMDhbGiqMw121OObQbB4v9GwWDinFSO.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 13:03:01', '2026-06-12 13:03:33', 'nternational Office Solution Core 3-N355 Barebone Mini PC', 'International Office Solution Mini PC, Intel Core 3-N355 barebone, DDR5 mini computer, customizable mini desktop, ultra-compact office PC, Wi-Fi 6E mini PC, 2.5G LAN tiny computer, energy efficient desktop', 'Build your ideal workstation with the International Office Solution Core 3-N355 Mini PC. Features DDR5 & NVMe support, Wi-Fi 6E, dual display ports, and a 3-year warranty.', NULL, 85, NULL, NULL),
(466, 'Asus NUC 13 Pro Core i3 13th Gen Portable Mini Pc', 'The International Office Solution 13th Gen Core i3 Ultra-Compact Mini PC is a remarkably powerful barebone workstation designed for high-end professional versatility. Driven by the modern Intel Core i3-1315U processor with an energy-efficient 20W cTDP, it provides a highly customizable foundation with support for 3200MHz DDR4 RAM and high-speed NVMe SSDs. Despite weighing only 502g, it delivers desktop-class connectivity, featuring revolutionary dual Thunderbolt 4 ports, dual HDMI 2.1 outputs, next-generation Wi-Fi 6E, and ultra-fast 2.5G LAN, making it the perfect solution for multi-monitor setups and enterprise digital signage.', 'asus-nuc-13-pro-core-i3-13th-gen-portable-mini-pc-1781269506', '<p>Unlock next-level desktop performance without sacrificing valuable desk space with the <strong>International Office Solution</strong> Core i3-1315U Barebone Mini PC. Meticulously engineered for enterprise deployments, advanced point-of-sale systems, and high-productivity remote workstations, this ultra-compact unit redefines connectivity and efficiency. At the core of this system lies the 13th Generation Intel Core i3-1315U processor. Operating efficiently at a 20W configurable Thermal Design Power (cTDP), it ensures robust processing speeds for complex administrative software and heavy web-based applications while maintaining whisper-quiet thermals. As a barebone system, it grants IT administrators total freedom to tailor the exact amount of 3200MHz DDR4 memory and rapid NVMe M.2 solid-state storage required to meet specific corporate network demands and budgetary parameters.</p><p>What truly sets this miniature powerhouse apart is its astonishing I/O and display capabilities. Measuring just 117 x 112 x 37 mm, the back panel is engineered with cutting-edge technology, most notably featuring two independent Thunderbolt 4 (Type-C) ports with DisplayPort 1.4 support. Combined with two dedicated HDMI 2.1 ports, this mini PC gives professionals the extraordinary ability to drive up to four high-resolution displays simultaneously—perfect for financial trading desks, complex data analysis, or expansive digital signage arrays.</p><p>Furthermore, networking and peripheral connectivity are strictly enterprise-grade. The system is equipped with the latest Intel Wi-Fi 6E module and Bluetooth 5.2, ensuring incredibly low latency and stable wireless connections even in densely populated office networks. For wired environments, the Intel I226-V/LM 2.5G Ethernet controller offers massive bandwidth for rapid data migration and lag-free cloud computing. Housed in a sleek, discreet black chassis that includes a Kensington Lock for physical security in public spaces, and backed by a 3-year warranty, the <strong>International Office Solution</strong> Mini PC is a forward-thinking investment for modern business infrastructures.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Computing &amp; Power</strong></td><td>Intel Core i3-1315U Processor, 20W cTDP</td><td>13th Gen architecture delivers rapid processing for daily business applications while minimizing heat output and energy consumption.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory &amp; Storage</strong></td><td>Supports 3200MHz DDR4 Laptop RAM, NVMe SSD</td><td>Barebone configuration allows IT departments to customize memory and storage capacities to perfectly match user workflow requirements.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display &amp; Graphics</strong></td><td>2x Thunderbolt 4 (Type-C w/ DP 1.4), 2x HDMI 2.1, Intel UHD Graphics</td><td>Unprecedented quad-display potential from a micro chassis, perfect for command centers, trading floors, and visual data analysis.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Network &amp; Wireless</strong></td><td>Intel Wi-Fi 6E (Gig+), Bluetooth 5.2, Intel 2.5G LAN (I226-V/LM)</td><td>Next-generation wireless and wired networking provides massive bandwidth for flawless server access and heavy cloud computing.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Extensive I/O Ports</strong></td><td>Front: 2x USB-A (3.2 Gen2), Audio Jack. Back: 2x TB4, 1x USB-A (3.2 Gen2), 1x USB-A (2.0)</td><td>Offers lightning-fast data transfer speeds and versatile peripheral connectivity while maintaining clean, organized cable management.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design &amp; Security</strong></td><td>117 x 112 x 37 mm, 502g Weight, Kensington Lock Slot</td><td>An ultra-portable, palm-sized chassis that can be easily VESA-mounted or secured against physical theft in retail or office environments.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>3-Year System Warranty</td><td>Secures your company\'s hardware investment with guaranteed, long-term technical support and hardware protection.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Portable  Mini PC', 40000.00, 40000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/83achjDO4L5Ccz7vzp0H9LsOJS8H0g0n64xChe1d.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 13:05:06', '2026-06-12 13:05:37', 'International Office Solution Core i3-1315U Barebone Mini PC with Thunderbolt 4', 'Maximize productivity with the International Office Solution Core i3-1315U Mini PC. Features dual Thunderbolt 4, quad-display support, Wi-Fi 6E, and custom DDR4/NVMe loadouts.', 'International Office Solution Mini PC, Intel Core i3-1315U barebone, Thunderbolt 4 mini computer, quad display mini PC, ultra-compact desktop barebone, Wi-Fi 6E mini PC, 2.5G LAN tiny computer, business mini desktop', NULL, 85, NULL, NULL),
(467, 'Asus NUC 13 Pro Core i3 13th Gen Portable Mini PC With RAM & SSD', 'The International Office Solution 13th Gen Core i3 Ultra-Compact Mini PC is a fully equipped, space-saving desktop workstation designed for high-end professional versatility. Powered by the modern Intel Core i3-1315U processor and pre-configured with 8GB of fast 3200MHz DDR4 RAM and a rapid 256GB NVMe SSD, it provides immediate, out-of-the-box responsiveness for administrative workflows and media management. Despite weighing a mere 502g, it delivers desktop-class connectivity featuring revolutionary dual Thunderbolt 4 ports, dual HDMI 2.1 outputs, next-generation Wi-Fi 6E, and ultra-fast 2.5G LAN, making it the perfect compact solution for multi-monitor setups and enterprise environments.', 'asus-nuc-13-pro-core-i3-13th-gen-portable-mini-pc-with-ram-ssd-1781269667', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>International Office Solution</strong> 13th Gen Core i3 Ultra-Compact Mini PC is a fully equipped, space-saving desktop workstation designed for high-end professional versatility. Powered by the modern Intel Core i3-1315U processor and pre-configured with 8GB of fast 3200MHz DDR4 RAM and a rapid 256GB NVMe SSD, it provides immediate, out-of-the-box responsiveness for administrative workflows and media management. Despite weighing a mere 502g, it delivers desktop-class connectivity featuring revolutionary dual Thunderbolt 4 ports, dual HDMI 2.1 outputs, next-generation Wi-Fi 6E, and ultra-fast 2.5G LAN, making it the perfect compact solution for multi-monitor setups and enterprise environments.</p><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Computing &amp; Power</strong></td><td>Intel Core i3-1315U Processor, 20W cTDP</td><td>13th Gen architecture delivers rapid, reliable processing for daily business applications while minimizing heat output and maximizing energy efficiency.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory &amp; Storage</strong></td><td>8GB 3200MHz DDR4 RAM, 256GB NVMe SSD</td><td>Pre-configured for immediate use; ensures smooth multitasking, instant application launches, and ultra-fast file transfers right out of the box.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display &amp; Graphics</strong></td><td>2x Thunderbolt 4 (Type-C w/ DP 1.4), 2x HDMI 2.1</td><td>Unprecedented quad-display potential from a micro chassis, perfect for command centers, trading floors, and comprehensive visual data analysis.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Network &amp; Wireless</strong></td><td>Intel Wi-Fi 6E (Gig+), Bluetooth 5.2, Intel 2.5G LAN (I226-V/LM)</td><td>Next-generation wireless and wired networking provides massive, reliable bandwidth for flawless server access and heavy cloud-based workflows.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Extensive I/O Ports</strong></td><td>Front: 2x USB-A (3.2 Gen2), Audio Jack. Back: 2x TB4, 1x USB-A (3.2 Gen2), 1x USB-A (2.0)</td><td>Offers lightning-fast external storage transfer speeds and highly versatile peripheral connectivity while maintaining clean, organized cable management.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design &amp; Security</strong></td><td>117 x 112 x 37 mm, 502g Weight, Kensington Lock Slot</td><td>An ultra-portable, palm-sized chassis that can be discreetly VESA-mounted or secured against physical theft in retail or open-office environments.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>3-Year System Warranty</td><td>Secures your company\'s hardware investment with guaranteed, long-term technical support and comprehensive hardware protection.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 57000.00, 57000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/lZfmpxa39dLpXPjlF28wSqvLAlamJ0vHhegLoX2J.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 13:07:47', '2026-06-12 13:07:47', 'International Office Solution Core i3-1315U Mini PC | 8GB RAM 256GB SSD', 'Maximize productivity with the International Office Solution Core i3-1315U Mini PC. Features 8GB RAM, 256GB NVMe SSD, dual Thunderbolt 4, Wi-Fi 6E, and quad-display support.', 'International Office Solution Mini PC, Intel Core i3-1315U desktop, 8GB RAM 256GB SSD mini computer, Thunderbolt 4 mini PC, quad display mini PC, ultra-compact desktop PC, Wi-Fi 6E mini PC, 2.5G LAN tiny computer, business mini desktop', NULL, 85, NULL, NULL);
