(468, 'Asus ExpertCenter PN64 Core i5 12th Gen Portable Mini PC', 'The International Office Solution Core i5-12500H Barebone Mini PC is an exceptionally powerful, ultra-compact desktop engineered for heavy-duty professional environments. Driven by a 12-core 12th Gen Intel Core i5 processor and featuring future-proof support for ultra-fast DDR5 RAM (up to 7200MHz) and dual-drive storage, it delivers true workstation-tier performance in a tiny 0.9-liter chassis. Equipped with next-generation 2.5G LAN, Wi-Fi 6, and staggering quad-display capabilities (HDMI, DisplayPort++, and Type-C), this barebone system provides ultimate customization for command centers, advanced digital signage, and elite corporate workstations.', 'asus-expertcenter-pn64-core-i5-12th-gen-portable-mini-pc-1781269811', '<p>Experience uncompromising desktop performance without the massive footprint with the <strong>International Office Solution</strong> Core i5-12500H Barebone Mini PC. Meticulously designed for IT professionals, developers, and enterprise deployments requiring extreme computing power, this miniature powerhouse completely redefines small-form-factor capabilities. At the heart of this 0.9-liter system is the formidable 12th Generation Intel Core i5-12500H processor. Utilizing Intel’s revolutionary hybrid architecture, it combines 4 Performance cores (up to 4.50 GHz) and 8 Efficient cores (up to 3.30 GHz) operating at a highly optimized 35W TDP. This 12-core, 16-thread configuration effortlessly tears through intensive multi-threaded workloads, data compilation, complex administrative software, and heavy multimedia tasks with remarkable thermal efficiency.</p><p>Because this system is built as a highly customizable barebone platform, it grants IT administrators and tech enthusiasts the ultimate freedom to build their perfect machine. It supports next-generation DDR5 memory with blazing-fast speeds ranging from 4800MHz up to an incredible 7200MHz, ensuring absolute zero latency during heavy multitasking. Storage versatility is equally impressive, offering a dual-drive architecture: you can install a lightning-fast M.2 2280 PCIe Gen3 NVMe SSD (up to 1TB) for your operating system and core applications, alongside a secondary 2.5-inch SATA drive for massive local data archiving. Furthermore, with support for Windows 11 (64-bit and Pro) as well as Linux, it easily adapts to any corporate network or development environment.</p><p>What elevates this Mini PC to workstation status is its unprecedented connectivity and display engineering. Powered by Intel Iris Xe Graphics, the rear and front I/O panels are loaded with high-speed ports, including three USB 3.2 Gen2 ports and dual Type-C ports. Crucially, the rear Type-C port supports both DisplayPort output and Power Delivery (PD) input, meaning you can power the entire PC directly from a compatible monitor with a single cable—virtually eliminating desk clutter. Combined with two HDMI 2.0 ports and a configurable DisplayPort++, professionals can drive up to four independent, high-resolution monitors simultaneously. Backed by enterprise-grade networking (Intel Wi-Fi 6, ultra-fast 2.5G LAN) and advanced BIOS features like Wake on LAN and Auto Power On, this <strong>International Office Solution</strong> Mini PC guarantees unparalleled reliability, versatility, and sheer power.Experience uncompromising desktop performance without the massive footprint with the <strong>International Office Solution</strong> Core i5-12500H Barebone Mini PC. Meticulously designed for IT professionals, developers, and enterprise deployments requiring extreme computing power, this miniature powerhouse completely redefines small-form-factor capabilities. At the heart of this 0.9-liter system is the formidable 12th Generation Intel Core i5-12500H processor. Utilizing Intel’s revolutionary hybrid architecture, it combines 4 Performance cores (up to 4.50 GHz) and 8 Efficient cores (up to 3.30 GHz) operating at a highly optimized 35W TDP. This 12-core, 16-thread configuration effortlessly tears through intensive multi-threaded workloads, data compilation, complex administrative software, and heavy multimedia tasks with remarkable thermal efficiency.</p><p>Because this system is built as a highly customizable barebone platform, it grants IT administrators and tech enthusiasts the ultimate freedom to build their perfect machine. It supports next-generation DDR5 memory with blazing-fast speeds ranging from 4800MHz up to an incredible 7200MHz, ensuring absolute zero latency during heavy multitasking. Storage versatility is equally impressive, offering a dual-drive architecture: you can install a lightning-fast M.2 2280 PCIe Gen3 NVMe SSD (up to 1TB) for your operating system and core applications, alongside a secondary 2.5-inch SATA drive for massive local data archiving. Furthermore, with support for Windows 11 (64-bit and Pro) as well as Linux, it easily adapts to any corporate network or development environment.</p><p>What elevates this Mini PC to workstation status is its unprecedented connectivity and display engineering. Powered by Intel Iris Xe Graphics, the rear and front I/O panels are loaded with high-speed ports, including three USB 3.2 Gen2 ports and dual Type-C ports. Crucially, the rear Type-C port supports both DisplayPort output and Power Delivery (PD) input, meaning you can power the entire PC directly from a compatible monitor with a single cable—virtually eliminating desk clutter. Combined with two HDMI 2.0 ports and a configurable DisplayPort++, professionals can drive up to four independent, high-resolution monitors simultaneously. Backed by enterprise-grade networking (Intel Wi-Fi 6, ultra-fast 2.5G LAN) and advanced BIOS features like Wake on LAN and Auto Power On, this <strong>International Office Solution</strong> Mini PC guarantees unparalleled reliability, versatility, and sheer power.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Processing Engine</strong></td><td>Intel Core i5-12500H (12 Cores: 4 P-cores up to 4.50 GHz, 8 E-cores up to 3.30GHz, 35W)</td><td>Hybrid 12-core architecture provides workstation-level processing power for intensive applications while optimizing energy efficiency and thermals.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory &amp; Storage Architecture</strong></td><td>Supports 2x DDR5 (4800MHz - 7200MHz), 1x M.2 PCIe Gen3 NVMe Slot, 1x 2.5\" SATA 6Gb/s</td><td>Next-generation DDR5 support ensures ultra-fast data handling, while dual-drive capabilities allow for massive, customizable, and high-speed storage configurations.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display &amp; Graphics</strong></td><td>Intel Iris Xe Graphics, 1x DP (Type-C), 2x HDMI 2.0, 1x DP++</td><td>Unprecedented quad-display potential from a micro chassis, ideal for financial trading floors, control rooms, and immersive multi-monitor workstations.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Networking &amp; Enterprise Tools</strong></td><td>2.5G LAN, Intel Wi-Fi 6 (802.11ax), Wake on LAN, PXE, Auto Power On</td><td>Guarantees massive bandwidth for server access and cloud computing, complete with robust remote management tools tailored for IT administrators.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Extensive I/O Connectivity</strong></td><td>3x USB 3.2 Gen2 (Type-A), 2x USB 3.2 Gen2 (Type-C, including 1x with DP output &amp; PD power input)</td><td>Offers lightning-fast peripheral data transfers and the incredibly convenient ability to power the PC via a single Type-C cable connected to a monitor.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor &amp; Support</strong></td><td>120 x 130 x 58 mm (0.9L Volume), 0.75kg, 3-Year Warranty</td><td>An elegantly discreet, incredibly lightweight black chassis that minimizes desk footprint while securing your investment with reliable, long-term support.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'Portable  Mini PC', 58000.00, 58000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/DzO4OESOp4PdbjDLFnLrYPMJPLcJbogyuJVeUPLe.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 13:10:11', '2026-06-12 13:10:11', 'International Office Solution Core i5-12500H Barebone Mini PC | DDR5 Ready', 'Unleash workstation performance with the International Office Solution Core i5-12500H Mini PC. Features DDR5 support, Quad-Display, 2.5G LAN, and Wi-Fi 6.', 'nternational Office Solution Mini PC, Intel Core i5-12500H barebone, DDR5 mini computer, customizable mini desktop, quad display mini PC, Iris Xe graphics desktop, 2.5G LAN tiny computer, Type-C PD mini PC', NULL, 85, NULL, NULL),
(469, 'Asus NUC 13 Pro Core i5 13th Gen Portable Mini Pc', 'The International Office Solution 13th Gen Core i5 Ultra-Compact Mini PC is a remarkably potent barebone workstation designed for high-end professional versatility and maximum desk space optimization. Driven by the powerful Intel Core i5-13420H processor operating at a robust 45W cTDP, it provides a highly customizable foundation with support for 3200MHz DDR4 RAM and ultra-fast NVMe SSDs. Despite its tiny 502g footprint, it delivers workstation-class connectivity, featuring revolutionary dual Thunderbolt 4 ports, dual HDMI 2.1 outputs, next-generation Wi-Fi 6E, and ultra-fast 2.5G LAN, making it the definitive solution for multi-monitor command centers and advanced enterprise setups.', 'asus-nuc-13-pro-core-i5-13th-gen-portable-mini-pc-1781269928', '<p>Maximize your computational power without sacrificing your valuable workspace with the <strong>International Office Solution</strong> Core i5-13420H Barebone Mini PC. Meticulously engineered for heavy corporate deployments, advanced point-of-sale systems, and high-productivity remote workstations, this ultra-compact unit fundamentally redefines what a small-form-factor desktop can achieve. At the core of this system lies the formidable 13th Generation Intel Core i5-13420H processor. Operating with a robust 45W configurable Thermal Design Power (cTDP), it ensures lightning-fast processing speeds for demanding administrative software, multi-layered data analysis, and heavy multitasking while maintaining optimized thermals. As a barebone configuration, it grants IT administrators and systems integrators total freedom to specify the exact amount of 3200MHz DDR4 memory and rapid NVMe solid-state storage required to meet precise corporate network demands and budgetary guidelines.</p><p>What truly elevates this miniature powerhouse to workstation status is its astonishing I/O array and quad-display capabilities. Measuring just 117 x 112 x 37 mm, the back panel is an engineering marvel, most notably featuring two independent Thunderbolt 4 (Type-C) ports with DisplayPort 1.4 capabilities. Combined with two dedicated high-bandwidth HDMI 2.1 ports, and backed by Intel Iris Xe Graphics, this mini PC gives professionals the extraordinary ability to drive up to four high-resolution displays simultaneously. This makes it an unparalleled choice for financial trading desks, complex data visualization, expansive digital signage arrays, or simply spreading your daily workflow across multiple screens for maximum efficiency.</p><p>Furthermore, networking and peripheral connectivity are strictly enterprise-grade. The system is equipped with the latest Intel Wi-Fi 6E module and Bluetooth 5.2, ensuring incredibly low latency and stable wireless connections even in densely populated corporate networks burdened with heavy signal interference. For secure wired environments, the Intel I226-V 2.5G Ethernet controller offers massive bandwidth for rapid data migration, heavy cloud computing, and seamless local server access. Housed in a sleek, discreet black chassis that includes a front-facing headset jack and a Kensington Lock for hardware security in public or shared spaces, and backed by a comprehensive 3-year warranty, this <strong>International Office Solution</strong> Mini PC is a forward-thinking, long-term investment for any modern business infrastructure.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Computing Engine</strong></td><td>Intel Core i5-13420H Processor, 45W cTDP</td><td>The high-wattage 13th Gen architecture delivers rapid, reliable processing for heavy business applications and intense multitasking workflows.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory &amp; Storage</strong></td><td>Supports 3200MHz DDR4 Laptop RAM, NVMe SSD</td><td>Barebone flexibility allows IT departments to fully customize memory and high-speed storage capacities to perfectly match user requirements.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display &amp; Graphics</strong></td><td>Intel Iris Xe Graphics, 2x Thunderbolt 4 (w/ DP 1.4), 2x HDMI 2.1</td><td>Unprecedented quad-display potential from a micro chassis, perfect for expansive command centers, trading floors, and visual data analysis.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Network &amp; Wireless</strong></td><td>Intel Wi-Fi 6E (Gig+), Bluetooth 5.2, Intel 2.5G LAN (I226-V)</td><td>Next-generation wireless and wired networking provides massive, reliable bandwidth for flawless server access and heavy cloud-based computing.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Extensive I/O Ports</strong></td><td>Front: 2x USB-A (3.2 Gen2), Audio Jack. Back: 2x TB4, 1x USB-A (3.2 Gen2), 1x USB-A (2.0)</td><td>Offers lightning-fast external storage transfer speeds and highly versatile peripheral connectivity while keeping cables organized.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design &amp; Security</strong></td><td>117 x 112 x 37 mm, 502g Weight, Kensington Lock Slot</td><td>An ultra-portable, palm-sized chassis that can be discreetly mounted or secured against physical theft in retail or open-office environments.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>3-Year System Warranty</td><td>Secures your company\'s hardware investment with guaranteed, long-term technical support and comprehensive manufacturer protection.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Portable  Mini PC', 56000.00, 56000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/0HkdulqgYWml2LC4nzhoWrCsJ86m7ocNF1tJOUSD.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 13:12:08', '2026-06-12 13:12:08', 'International Office Solution Core i5-13420H Barebone Mini PC', 'Maximize productivity with the International Office Solution Core i5-13420H Mini PC. Features dual Thunderbolt 4, Wi-Fi 6E, quad-display support, and barebone customizability.', 'International Office Solution Mini PC, Intel Core i5-13420H barebone, Thunderbolt 4 mini computer, quad display mini PC, ultra-compact desktop PC, Wi-Fi 6E mini PC, 2.5G LAN tiny computer, business barebone desktop', NULL, 85, NULL, NULL),
(470, 'Asus NUC 13 Pro Core i5 13th Gen Mini PC With RAM & SSD', 'The International Office Solution 13th Gen Core i5 Ultra-Compact Mini PC is a fully equipped, high-performance workstation designed to maximize both computing power and desk space. Powered by a robust Intel Core i5-13420H processor (45W cTDP) and pre-configured with 8GB of 3200MHz DDR4 RAM and a fast 256GB NVMe SSD, it delivers immediate out-of-the-box responsiveness for demanding professional environments. Weighing just 502g, this miniature powerhouse offers workstation-tier connectivity, including dual Thunderbolt 4 ports, dual HDMI 2.1 outputs for quad-display setups, Wi-Fi 6E, and 2.5G LAN, making it the ultimate plug-and-play solution for modern enterprises.', 'asus-nuc-13-pro-core-i5-13th-gen-mini-pc-with-ram-ssd-1781270090', '<p>Reclaim your desktop space without compromising on sheer processing power with the <strong>International Office Solution</strong> Core i5-13420H Mini PC. Engineered specifically for corporate infrastructures, dynamic remote workspaces, and advanced multi-screen command centers, this ultra-compact unit arrives fully equipped and ready to deploy. At its core is the formidable 13th Generation Intel Core i5-13420H processor. Operating at a high-performance 45W configurable Thermal Design Power (cTDP), it effortlessly handles intense data processing, heavy multitasking, and complex administrative software. Unlike barebone models, this system comes pre-installed with 8GB of high-speed 3200MHz DDR4 memory and a rapid 256GB NVMe Solid State Drive, ensuring lightning-fast boot sequences, instant application loading, and smooth transitions right out of the box.</p><p>The display and I/O capabilities of this Mini PC are truly groundbreaking for its size. Measuring a mere 117 x 112 x 37 mm, the rear I/O panel is an engineering marvel. It features two revolutionary Thunderbolt 4 (Type-C) ports with DisplayPort 1.4 support, alongside two dedicated, high-bandwidth HDMI 2.1 ports. Powered by integrated Intel Iris Xe Graphics, this configuration empowers professionals to drive up to four independent, high-resolution displays simultaneously. Whether you are managing a financial trading floor, monitoring expansive digital signage, or requiring multiple screens for massive spreadsheet analysis, this Mini PC handles it flawlessly.</p><p>Beyond its visual capabilities, the networking technology is strictly enterprise-grade. The system includes a cutting-edge Intel Wi-Fi 6E module and Bluetooth 5.2 for ultra-low latency and interference-free wireless connectivity, even in dense office environments. For wired setups, the Intel I226-V 2.5G Ethernet controller provides massive bandwidth, guaranteeing rapid data migration and lag-free access to cloud-based servers. Housed in a discreet, elegant black chassis featuring a front-facing headset jack and a Kensington Lock slot for physical security, and backed by a comprehensive 3-year warranty, the <strong>International Office Solution</strong> Mini PC is a secure, long-term investment for optimizing modern business workflows.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Computing Engine</strong></td><td>Intel Core i5-13420H Processor, 45W cTDP</td><td>The high-wattage 13th Gen processor delivers exceptional speed and reliable performance for heavy, multi-threaded business applications.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory &amp; Storage</strong></td><td>8GB 3200MHz DDR4 RAM, 256GB NVMe SSD</td><td>Pre-configured for immediate deployment; guarantees smooth multitasking, rapid file transfers, and instant system boot times.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display &amp; Graphics</strong></td><td>Intel Iris Xe Graphics, 2x Thunderbolt 4 (w/ DP 1.4), 2x HDMI 2.1</td><td>Unprecedented quad-display capability from a micro chassis, perfect for expansive multi-monitor setups and visual data centers.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Network &amp; Wireless</strong></td><td>Intel Wi-Fi 6E (Gig+), Bluetooth 5.2, Intel 2.5G LAN (I226-V)</td><td>Next-generation networking provides massive, stable bandwidth for flawless local server access and heavy cloud-computing workloads.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Extensive I/O Ports</strong></td><td>Front: 2x USB-A (3.2 Gen2), Audio Jack. Back: 2x TB4, 2x USB-A</td><td>Offers lightning-fast external data transfer speeds and versatile peripheral connectivity while maintaining a clean, organized desk.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design &amp; Security</strong></td><td>117 x 112 x 37 mm, 502g Weight, Kensington Lock Slot</td><td>An incredibly portable, palm-sized chassis that can be discreetly mounted or locked down against physical theft in retail environments.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>3-Year System Warranty</td><td>Protects your company\'s hardware investment with guaranteed, long-term technical support and comprehensive manufacturer coverage.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'Portable  Mini PC', 73000.00, 73000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/vQ7D0yyQImwsny64cERPpsvwG6mTYz8vQPJ1VNN3.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 13:14:50', '2026-06-12 13:14:50', 'International Office Solution Core i5-13420H Mini PC | 8GB RAM 256GB SSD', 'Upgrade your workspace with the International Office Solution Core i5-13420H Mini PC. Pre-configured with 8GB RAM, 256GB SSD, Thunderbolt 4, Wi-Fi 6E, and quad-display support.', 'International Office Solution Mini PC, Intel Core i5-13420H desktop, 8GB RAM 256GB SSD mini computer, Thunderbolt 4 mini PC, quad display mini PC, compact desktop PC, Wi-Fi 6E mini PC, 2.5G LAN tiny computer, business mini workstation', NULL, 85, NULL, NULL),
(471, 'Asus NUC 13 Pro Core i7 13th Gen Portable Mini PC', 'The International Office Solution 13th Gen Core i7 Barebone Mini PC is an exceptionally powerful, ultra-compact desktop engineered for elite professional performance and ultimate customizability. Driven by the formidable Intel Core i7-13620H processor operating at a high-performance 45W cTDP, it provides an elite barebone foundation with future-proof support for massive memory configurations (up to 64GB DDR4) and ultra-fast storage (up to 8TB PCIe Gen4x4 NVMe SSD). Weighing just 502g, it delivers workstation-tier quad-display capabilities via revolutionary dual Thunderbolt 4 ports and dual HDMI 2.1 outputs. Complete with next-generation Wi-Fi 6E, ultra-fast 2.5G LAN, and FreeDOS for customized OS deployment, it is the definitive solution for high-end corporate infrastructures and complex data centers.', 'asus-nuc-13-pro-core-i7-13th-gen-portable-mini-pc-1781270190', '<p>Unleash unprecedented computational power without surrendering your valuable desk space with the <strong>International Office Solution</strong> Core i7-13620H Barebone Mini PC. Meticulously engineered for enterprise IT deployments, advanced financial trading floors, heavy software development, and high-productivity remote workstations, this ultra-compact unit fundamentally redefines small-form-factor capabilities. At the heart of this system lies the highly advanced 13th Generation Intel Core i7-13620H processor. Operating with a robust 45W configurable Thermal Design Power (cTDP), this incredibly potent CPU effortlessly tears through intense multi-threaded workloads, multi-layered data analysis, virtualization, and heavy multitasking while maintaining optimized thermals for continuous, whisper-quiet operation.</p><p>Because this system is built as a highly versatile barebone platform, it grants IT administrators and systems integrators total freedom to specify exact hardware configurations to meet precise corporate network demands. It boasts immense expansion capabilities, supporting up to a staggering 64GB of DDR4-3200MHz memory across two SO-DIMM slots, guaranteeing absolute zero latency during the heaviest multi-tasking sessions. Storage potential is equally breathtaking; the system features an M.2 2280 PCIe Gen4x4 slot capable of housing up to an 8TB NVMe SSD, ensuring lightning-fast data retrieval, instantaneous application loading, and massive local archiving capabilities. Furthermore, by shipping with FreeDOS, it allows network administrators to bypass pre-installed bloatware and directly deploy custom, secure enterprise operating systems.</p><p>What truly elevates this miniature powerhouse to elite workstation status is its astonishing I/O array and quad-display engineering. Measuring just 117 x 112 x 37 mm, the back panel is an engineering marvel, featuring two independent, revolutionary Thunderbolt 4 (Type-C) ports with DisplayPort 1.4 support. Combined with two dedicated high-bandwidth HDMI 2.1 ports, and backed by Intel Iris Xe Graphics, this mini PC gives professionals the extraordinary ability to drive up to four 4K high-resolution displays simultaneously.</p><p>Networking and peripheral connectivity remain strictly enterprise-grade. The system is equipped with the latest Intel Wi-Fi 6E module and Bluetooth 5.2, ensuring incredibly low latency and stable wireless connections even in densely populated corporate networks burdened with heavy signal interference. For highly secure wired environments, the Intel I226-V 2.5G Ethernet controller offers massive bandwidth for rapid data migration, heavy cloud computing, and seamless local server access. Housed in a sleek, discreet black chassis that includes a Kensington Lock for hardware security in public or shared spaces, and backed by a comprehensive 3-year warranty, this <strong>International Office Solution</strong> Mini PC is a secure, forward-thinking investment for any high-performance business infrastructure.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Computing Engine</strong></td><td>Intel Core i7-13620H Processor, 45W cTDP</td><td>The high-wattage, 13th Gen i7 processor delivers extreme processing speed and reliable performance for heavy, multi-threaded enterprise applications.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Architecture</strong></td><td>Supports up to 64GB (2x 32GB) DDR4-3200MHz RAM</td><td>Massive dual-channel memory expansion capabilities allow for flawless execution of heavy virtual machines, immense databases, and complex multitasking.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage Architecture</strong></td><td>Supports 1x M.2 2280 PCIe Gen4x4 NVMe SSD (128GB to 8TB)</td><td>Next-generation PCIe Gen4 support guarantees blazing-fast data read/write speeds with enormous capacity potential for critical corporate archiving.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display &amp; Graphics</strong></td><td>Intel Iris Xe Graphics, 2x Thunderbolt 4 (w/ DP 1.4), 2x HDMI 2.1</td><td>Unprecedented quad-display potential from a micro chassis, perfect for expansive command centers, trading floors, and visual data analysis.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Network &amp; Wireless</strong></td><td>Intel Wi-Fi 6E (Gig+), Bluetooth 5.2, Intel 2.5G LAN (I226-V)</td><td>Next-generation wireless and wired networking provides massive, reliable bandwidth for flawless server access and heavy cloud-based computing.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Extensive I/O Ports</strong></td><td>Front: 2x USB-A (3.2 Gen2), Audio Jack. Back: 2x TB4, 1x USB-A (3.2 Gen2), 1x USB-A (2.0)</td><td>Offers lightning-fast external storage transfer speeds via Thunderbolt 4 and highly versatile peripheral connectivity while keeping cables organized.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design, Security &amp; OS</strong></td><td>117 x 112 x 37 mm, 502g Weight, Kensington Lock Slot, FreeDOS</td><td>An ultra-portable, palm-sized chassis that can be secured against theft, allowing complete freedom for custom corporate operating system deployments.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>3-Year System Warranty</td><td>Secures your company\'s hardware investment with guaranteed, long-term technical support and comprehensive manufacturer protection.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Portable  Mini PC', 78000.00, 78000.00, NULL, 3, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 13:16:30', '2026-06-12 13:16:30', 'International Office Solution Core i7-13620H Barebone Mini PC | Gen4 NVMe', 'Build the ultimate workstation with the International Office Solution Core i7-13620H Mini PC. Supports up to 64GB RAM, 8TB Gen4 SSD, quad-display, Thunderbolt 4, and Wi-Fi 6E.', 'nternational Office Solution Mini PC, Intel Core i7-13620H barebone, 64GB RAM mini computer, PCIe Gen4 NVMe mini PC, Thunderbolt 4 mini desktop, quad display mini PC, ultra-compact workstation PC, Wi-Fi 6E mini PC, 2.5G LAN tiny computer, business barebone desktop', NULL, 85, NULL, NULL),
(472, 'Acer Aspire 3 A325-45 Celeron N4500 12GB RAM 15.6\" HD Laptop', 'The International Office Solution 15.6\" HD Laptop (Pure Silver) is a sleek, lightweight, and highly capable portable workstation tailored for students, administrative professionals, and everyday multitaskers. Powered by an efficient Intel Celeron N4500 processor and elevated by a surprisingly robust 12GB of DDR4 RAM and a rapid 512GB NVMe Gen4 SSD, it guarantees smooth navigation through daily office applications, heavy web browsing, and media playback. Weighing just 1.5kg and shipping with Free-DOS for ultimate OS flexibility, it provides a large-screen, on-the-go computing experience at an exceptional value.', 'acer-aspire-3-a325-45-celeron-n4500-12gb-ram-156-hd-laptop-1781270415', '<p>Empower your daily workflow and mobile productivity with the <strong>International Office Solution</strong> 15.6-inch Portable Workstation. Presented in a sophisticated, professional \"Pure Silver\" finish and measuring a remarkably thin 17.7mm, this laptop perfectly bridges the gap between desktop-level screen real estate and everyday portability. Weighing in at a mere 1.5 kg, it is incredibly easy to slip into a backpack or briefcase, making it an ideal daily driver for traveling executives, field researchers, and students who require reliable performance without the physical strain of carrying a heavy machine.</p><p>Under the hood, this system is optimized for responsive, everyday computing. It is driven by the Intel Celeron N4500 dual-core processor, capable of boosting up to 2.80GHz. While engineered for outstanding power efficiency, what truly sets this configuration apart is its generous memory and storage allocation. Outfitted with 12GB of high-speed 3200MHz DDR4 RAM, this laptop completely eliminates the bottleneck typically found in entry-level machines, allowing users to comfortably keep dozens of browser tabs open while simultaneously running text editors and spreadsheet software. Furthermore, the inclusion of a cutting-edge 512GB NVMe Gen4 SSD ensures lightning-fast boot sequences, instantaneous file transfers, and snappy application loading times—with the added future-proofing benefit of supporting storage upgrades up to 1TB.</p><p>The visual and communication suites are designed to keep you connected and productive. The expansive 15.6-inch HD display provides a wide, comfortable canvas for data entry, document formatting, and media consumption. Virtual meetings and remote learning are handled effortlessly thanks to the integrated 720P HD WebCam, built-in dual stereo speakers, and a dedicated microphone array. The full-sized keyboard includes an international layout and a dedicated number pad, which is essential for rapid data entry and accounting tasks.</p><p>Connectivity is incredibly versatile, ensuring you are never caught without the right port. The chassis houses a high-speed USB 3.2 Gen2 Type-C port, a USB 3.2 Gen1 Type-A port, two standard USB 2.0 ports for legacy peripherals, and an HDMI output for immediate presentations on external monitors. Supported by fast 802.11ac Wi-Fi, Bluetooth 5.0, a reliable 38Wh lithium-ion battery, and arriving with Free-DOS to allow IT departments total freedom over enterprise operating system deployment, the <strong>International Office Solution</strong> 15.6\" Laptop is a highly adaptable, cost-effective asset for any modern organization.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Processing &amp; Memory</strong></td><td>Intel Celeron N4500 (Up to 2.80GHz, 4MB Cache), 12GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM</td><td>The high-capacity 12GB memory completely eliminates multitasking lag, ensuring smooth transitions across daily administrative software and heavy web browsing.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage Architecture</strong></td><td>512GB NVMe Gen4 SSD (Upgradeable up to 1TB)</td><td>Next-generation Gen4 solid-state storage provides incredibly fast boot times and file access, with easy upgrade paths for future data expansion.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display &amp; Multimedia</strong></td><td>15.6-inch HD (60Hz) Display, 720P HD WebCam, Dual Stereo Speakers</td><td>Delivers an expansive visual workspace and clear, reliable audio-visual hardware for seamless integration into virtual meetings and remote learning.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Network &amp; Connectivity</strong></td><td>Wi-Fi 802.11ac, Bluetooth 5.0, 1x Type-C (3.2 Gen2), 1x USB-A (3.2 Gen1), 2x USB-A (2.0), 1x HDMI</td><td>Comprehensive, modern I/O options ensure effortless peripheral connections, fast wireless networking, and immediate external monitor expansion.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design, Power &amp; OS</strong></td><td>Pure Silver Chassis, 1.5 Kg Weight, 38Wh Battery, Free-DOS</td><td>An ultra-lightweight, professional design that offers ultimate IT flexibility by allowing custom enterprise OS installations without bloatware.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Input &amp; Security</strong></td><td>Full-Size Keyboard (w/ Numpad &amp; Mic Mute indicator), Precision Touchpad, Kensington Lock Slot</td><td>Maximizes typing speed for data entry while providing physical hardware security options for devices deployed in public or shared workspaces.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Laptop', 42800.00, 42800.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/hGUd7DYLcNwrKUXNlLWa6a4QWIcCyrX3fZkEavqO.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 13:20:15', '2026-06-12 13:20:58', 'International Office Solution 15.6\" Laptop | 12GB RAM & 512GB SSD', 'Maximize productivity on the go with the International Office Solution 15.6\" Laptop. Featuring an Intel N4500, 12GB RAM, 512GB NVMe Gen4 SSD, and Free-DOS.', 'International Office Solution laptop, 15.6 inch HD laptop, Intel Celeron N4500 computer, 12GB RAM laptop, 512GB NVMe Gen4 SSD, Free-DOS portable PC, lightweight office laptop, pure silver business laptop', NULL, 8, NULL, NULL),
(473, 'Acer Aspire 15 AS15-42 Ryzen 3 7330U 8GB 15.6\" FHD Laptop', 'The International Office Solution 15.6\" FHD IPS Laptop (Pure Silver) is a highly capable and visually stunning portable workstation engineered for modern professionals and multitasking students. Driven by the powerful AMD Ryzen 3 7330U 4-core processor, 8GB of DDR4 RAM (upgradeable to 32GB), and a lightning-fast 512GB NVMe PCIe Gen4 SSD, it delivers incredible efficiency for daily workflows and cloud-based applications. Featuring advanced Wi-Fi 6 connectivity, a noise-canceling dual-microphone array, and shipping with Free-DOS for total operating system flexibility, it is an exceptionally well-rounded, future-proof machine packed into a sleek 1.79 kg chassis.', 'acer-aspire-15-as15-42-ryzen-3-7330u-8gb-156-fhd-laptop-1781270570', '<p>Elevate your mobile computing experience with the highly versatile <strong>International Office Solution</strong> 15.6-inch Portable Workstation. Wrapped in an elegant \"Pure Silver\" chassis that measures just 18.9mm thin, this laptop perfectly balances desktop-level productivity with travel-ready portability. At the heart of this machine is the robust AMD Ryzen 3 7330U processor. Featuring a 4-core, 8-thread architecture capable of boosting up to 4.3 GHz, it effortlessly handles complex administrative software, heavy web browsing, and multi-tab multitasking without breaking a sweat. It comes equipped with 8GB of rapid 3200MHz DDR4 memory and a blazing-fast 512GB NVMe PCIe Gen4 SSD. Crucially for growing businesses, this laptop is highly upgradeable—supporting up to a massive 32GB of RAM and up to 1TB of storage—ensuring your hardware can scale right alongside your professional demands.</p><p>The visual and auditory experience is meticulously crafted for the modern era of remote collaboration. The expansive 15.6-inch Full HD (1920x1080) IPS LED display guarantees crisp text, vibrant color accuracy, and wide viewing angles that reduce eye strain during long hours of data analysis or presentation drafting. When it comes to virtual meetings, this laptop truly shines. It features a high-definition 720p webcam paired with an advanced dual-array microphone system equipped with built-in Noise Cancellation. This ensures that your voice comes through with crystal-clear fidelity on Zoom, Teams, or Skype, actively filtering out distracting background office or cafe noise, while the dual 2W stereo speakers provide High-Definition, Original Recording quality audio playback.</p><p>Beyond performance and media, connectivity and endurance are strictly enterprise-grade. The inclusion of next-generation Wi-Fi 6 (802.11ax) and a dedicated Gigabit LAN port ensures you have access to ultra-low latency, high-bandwidth internet whether you are completely wireless or hardwired at your desk. The expansive I/O suite includes a modern USB 3.2 Gen2 Type-C port, multiple high-speed USB-A ports, and HDMI for seamless external monitor expansion. Powered by a high-capacity 54Wh 3-cell battery paired with a rapid 65W AC adapter, and arriving with Free-DOS to grant IT administrators total freedom over custom OS deployments, the <strong>International Office Solution</strong> 15.6\" Ryzen Laptop is a forward-thinking, highly adaptable investment for any dynamic organization.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Computing Engine</strong></td><td>AMD Ryzen 3 7330U (4 Cores, 8 Threads, Up to 4.3 GHz), AMD Radeon Graphics</td><td>The highly efficient multi-core architecture delivers snappy, sustained performance for complex multitasking and data-heavy office applications.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory &amp; Expansion</strong></td><td>8GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM (Upgradable to 32GB), 512GB NVMe Gen4 SSD</td><td>Provides immediate high-speed responsiveness with incredible future-proofing, allowing immense memory expansion as your software needs grow.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display &amp; Visuals</strong></td><td>15.6-inch FHD (1920x1080) IPS LED Panel</td><td>Delivers a massive, crystal-clear digital workspace with ultra-wide viewing angles, reducing eye fatigue during prolonged spreadsheet work.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>A/V &amp; Communication</strong></td><td>720p HD Camera, Dual Array Mics with Noise Cancellation, Dual 2W Speakers</td><td>Creates a professional, studio-quality virtual meeting environment out-of-the-box by actively suppressing distracting background noise.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Network &amp; Wireless</strong></td><td>Wi-Fi 6 (802.11ax), Bluetooth 5.2, Dedicated RJ45 LAN Port</td><td>Next-generation networking technology guarantees massive, stable bandwidth for flawless cloud computing and enormous file transfers.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Extensive I/O Ports</strong></td><td>1x Type-C (3.2 Gen2), 1x USB-A (3.2 Gen1), 2x USB-A (2.0), 1x HDMI</td><td>Comprehensive peripheral integration allows for lightning-fast data transfers and effortless connection to modern external displays.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design, Power &amp; OS</strong></td><td>Pure Silver Chassis (1.79 kg), 54Wh Battery, Free-DOS</td><td>An elegant, highly portable form factor backed by reliable battery life, offering IT departments total freedom over secure OS installations.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'Laptop', 63500.00, 63500.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/LFgarIySufMf86HaqiKFNIsGsyCCF3yPCV2PNv9h.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 13:22:50', '2026-06-12 13:22:50', 'International Office Solution 15.6\" FHD Laptop | Ryzen 3 7330U', 'your workflow with the International Office Solution 15.6\" Laptop. Featuring an AMD Ryzen 3 7330U, 8GB RAM (up to 32GB), 512GB Gen4 SSD, and Wi-Fi 6.', 'International Office Solution laptop, 15.6 inch FHD IPS laptop, AMD Ryzen 3 7330U computer, upgradeable 32GB RAM laptop, 512GB NVMe Gen4 SSD, Wi-Fi 6 business laptop, Free-DOS portable PC, noise cancellation mic laptop', NULL, 8, NULL, NULL),
(474, 'Acer Aspire 3 A325-53 Core i5 13th Gen 15.6\" FHD Silver Laptop iosbd', 'The International Office Solution 15.6\" FHD Laptop (Silver) is a remarkably powerful and highly adaptable portable workstation designed for modern professionals and dynamic enterprise environments. Driven by the advanced 13th Gen Intel Core i5-1334U 10-core processor, 8GB of rapid DDR4 RAM, and a lightning-fast 512GB PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD, it delivers exceptional multitasking performance for heavy administrative software and cloud-based workflows. Featuring robust Wi-Fi 6 networking, immense future-proof upgradeability (up to 32GB RAM), and shipping with Free-DOS for ultimate operating system flexibility, it is a highly reliable, future-ready business asset housed in a sleek 1.75 kg silver chassis.', 'acer-aspire-3-a325-53-core-i5-13th-gen-156-fhd-silver-laptop-iosbd-1784212195', '<p>Maximize your mobile productivity and future-proof your corporate hardware with the <strong>International Office Solution</strong> 15.6-inch Portable Workstation. Wrapped in a professional silver chassis measuring just 19.0mm thin, this laptop perfectly harmonizes desktop-tier processing power with everyday travel readiness. At the absolute core of this machine lies the formidable 13th Generation Intel Core i5-1334U processor. Utilizing Intel’s highly advanced hybrid architecture, it boasts 10 cores (2 Performance cores and 8 Efficient cores) and 12 threads, capable of boosting up to a blazing 4.6GHz. This intelligent core distribution ensures that high-priority, complex applications receive maximum power, while background tasks run efficiently, significantly extending your operational battery life throughout the workday.</p><p>Out of the box, the system is equipped with 8GB of 3200MHz DDR4 memory and a blazing-fast 512GB PCIe Gen4 M.2 NVMe SSD, ensuring near-instantaneous boot sequences and ultra-rapid file transfers. However, what makes this <strong>International Office Solution</strong> laptop truly exceptional for growing businesses is its phenomenal expansion capacity. Unlike many modern ultrabooks with soldered memory, this system features two dedicated soDIMM slots supporting up to a massive 32GB of RAM, alongside storage upgrade capabilities up to 1TB. This ensures your hardware can seamlessly scale right alongside your escalating professional software demands.</p><p>The visual and communication suites are meticulously engineered for the modern era of hybrid work and remote collaboration. The expansive 15.6-inch Full HD (1920x1080) LCD panel provides a wide, comfortable canvas that guarantees crisp text and vibrant clarity, reducing eye strain during long hours of intensive spreadsheet analysis or presentation drafting. When engaging in virtual meetings, the high-definition 720p webcam, integrated dual stereo speakers, and built-in microphone array create a reliable, studio-quality communication environment.</p><p>Beyond performance and media, connectivity is strictly enterprise-grade. The inclusion of next-generation Wi-Fi 6 (802.11ax) and a dedicated Gigabit LAN port ensures you have access to ultra-low latency, high-bandwidth internet whether you are completely wireless in a cafe or hardwired at a corporate desk. The expansive I/O suite includes a modern USB 3.2 Gen2 Type-C port, a high-speed USB 3.2 Gen1 Type-A port, legacy USB 2.0 ports, and HDMI for seamless multi-monitor expansion. Powered by a reliable 54Wh 3-cell battery, and arriving with Free-DOS to grant IT administrators total freedom over custom, secure OS deployments, this laptop is a brilliant, highly adaptable long-term investment.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Computing Engine</strong></td><td>Intel Core i5-1334U (10 Cores [2P, 8E], 12 Threads, Up to 4.6GHz, 12MB Cache)</td><td>Hybrid core architecture intelligently balances high-octane performance for heavy software with supreme energy efficiency for longer battery life.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory &amp; Expansion</strong></td><td>8GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM (Upgradable to 32GB), 512GB PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD</td><td>Provides immediate high-speed responsiveness with incredible future-proofing, allowing immense memory expansion via two dedicated soDIMM slots.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display &amp; Visuals</strong></td><td>15.6-inch FHD (1920x1080) LCD Panel, Intel UHD Graphics</td><td>Delivers a massive, crystal-clear digital workspace that enhances workflow visibility and reduces eye fatigue during prolonged data entry.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>A/V &amp; Communication</strong></td><td>720p HD Video WebCam, Dual Stereo Speakers, Built-in Microphone</td><td>Creates a highly reliable, professional virtual meeting environment out-of-the-box for seamless remote collaboration and conferencing.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Network &amp; Wireless</strong></td><td>Wi-Fi 6 (802.11ax), Bluetooth 5.2, Dedicated RJ45 LAN Port</td><td>Next-generation networking technology guarantees massive, stable bandwidth for flawless cloud computing, server access, and enormous file transfers.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Extensive I/O Ports</strong></td><td>1x Type-C (3.2 Gen2), 1x USB-A (3.2 Gen1), 2x USB-A (2.0), 1x HDMI</td><td>Comprehensive peripheral integration allows for lightning-fast data transfers and effortless connection to modern external displays and projectors.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design, Power &amp; OS</strong></td><td>Silver Chassis (1.75 kg), 54Wh Battery, Free-DOS Operating System</td><td>An elegant, highly portable form factor backed by reliable battery life, offering IT departments total freedom over secure, enterprise-specific OS installations.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Laptop', 69000.00, 69000.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/SM6SBlxYWMXClDFaUFewb1XavpnjWLiDwVTuSKsd.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 13:24:20', '2026-07-16 14:34:30', 'International Office Solution 15.6\" FHD Laptop | Core i5-1334U', 'Supercharge your workflow with the International Office Solution 15.6\" Laptop. Featuring a 13th Gen Intel Core i5-1334U, 8GB RAM, 512GB Gen4 SSD, and Wi-Fi 6.', 'International Office Solution laptop, 15.6 inch FHD laptop, Intel Core i5-1334U computer, upgradeable 32GB RAM laptop, 512GB PCIe Gen4 SSD, Wi-Fi 6 business laptop, Free-DOS portable PC, silver corporate laptop', NULL, 8, NULL, NULL);
