(475, 'Acer Aspire Lite AL15-53 Core i5 1334U 15.6\" FHD Laptop', 'The International Office Solution 15.6\" FHD Laptop (Steel Gray) is an elegant, highly portable workstation built for the demands of the modern enterprise. Powered by a 13th Gen Intel Core i5-1334U 10-core processor, 8GB of upgradeable DDR4 RAM, and a rapid 512GB PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD, it effortlessly powers through administrative workflows and data-heavy applications. Featuring a premium backlit keyboard, robust Wi-Fi 6 networking, and arriving with Free-DOS for ultimate deployment flexibility, this incredibly light 1.59 kg laptop delivers robust performance and aesthetic sophistication.', 'acer-aspire-lite-al15-53-core-i5-1334u-156-fhd-laptop-1781270764', '<p>Elevate your professional capabilities and secure your corporate hardware future with the <strong>International Office Solution</strong> 15.6-inch Portable Workstation. Wrapped in a sophisticated \"Steel Gray\" chassis that exudes modern professionalism, this laptop is meticulously engineered to bridge the gap between heavy desktop-tier processing and effortless mobility. Weighing a remarkably light 1.59 kg and measuring under 20mm in thickness, it is the perfect daily driver for traveling executives, field engineers, and dynamic office workers who require elite performance without being weighed down by bulky, restrictive hardware.</p><p>At the heart of this highly adaptable machine is the formidable 13th Generation Intel Core i5-1334U processor. Utilizing Intel’s groundbreaking hybrid architecture, it features 10 distinct cores (2 high-performance cores and 8 energy-efficient cores) alongside 12 processing threads. This advanced configuration allows the CPU to boost up to an impressive 4.60GHz during intensive tasks like massive data rendering or complex spreadsheet calculations, while seamlessly falling back on the efficient cores during lighter tasks to preserve the 36Wh battery. This intelligent power allocation is expertly paired with 8GB of DDR4 memory and a lightning-fast 512GB PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD, guaranteeing instant application loading and rapid file transfers. Furthermore, this system is exceptionally future-proof: featuring two dedicated soDIMM slots, IT departments can easily upgrade the memory to a massive 32GB, ensuring the hardware scales beautifully as your software demands inevitably grow.</p><p>The visual and ergonomic experiences provided by this laptop are strictly premium. The expansive 15.6-inch Full HD (1920x1080) display provides a vast, crystal-clear digital workspace, actively reducing eye fatigue during marathon work sessions and extensive data entry. Typing is an absolute joy on the integrated backlit keyboard, a crucial, high-end feature for professionals who frequently work in dimly lit environments, overnight flights, or late-night corporate meetings. Virtual collaboration is also fully optimized via the built-in 720p HD webcam, dual stereo speakers, and microphone array. Supported by blazing-fast Wi-Fi 6, comprehensive I/O including high-speed USB Type-C, and Free-DOS for secure, customized enterprise OS deployment, this laptop is a complete, incredibly well-rounded investment.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Computing Engine</strong></td><td>Intel Core i5-1334U (10 Cores [2P, 8E], 12 Threads, Up to 4.60GHz)</td><td>Advanced hybrid architecture intelligently shifts between raw processing power and extreme energy efficiency based on your active workload.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory &amp; Expansion</strong></td><td>8GB DDR4 RAM (Up to 32GB), 512GB Gen4 NVMe SSD (Up to 1TB)</td><td>Dual soDIMM slots provide incredible future-proofing, allowing massive system memory upgrades as corporate workflow demands increase.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display &amp; Ergonomics</strong></td><td>15.6\" FHD (1920x1080) Display, Backlit Keyboard, Multi-gesture Touchpad</td><td>A high-resolution screen paired with illuminated keys ensures peak productivity, high visibility, and typing comfort in any lighting condition.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>A/V &amp; Communication</strong></td><td>720p HD WebCam, Dual Stereo Speakers, Built-in Microphone</td><td>Delivers clear, highly reliable audio and high-definition video for seamless virtual meetings and remote enterprise collaboration.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Network &amp; I/O</strong></td><td>Wi-Fi 6 (802.11ax), Bluetooth 5.2, Gigabit LAN, Type-C, HDMI</td><td>Ensures maximum wireless bandwidth for cloud computing and highly versatile physical connectivity for modern external displays and peripherals.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design, Power &amp; OS</strong></td><td>Steel Gray Chassis (1.59 kg), 36Wh Battery, Free-DOS Operating System</td><td>A highly portable, lightweight frame that offers IT departments complete freedom to deploy custom, highly secure corporate operating systems.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', NULL, 69000.00, 69000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/xUqgmOw7buhlTBISzo3rQGrUxLS0qoU2y9HzGiYQ.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 13:26:04', '2026-07-16 14:38:20', 'International Office Solution 15.6\" FHD Laptop | Core i5-1334U Steel Gray', 'Upgrade your mobility with the International Office Solution 15.6\" Steel Gray Laptop. Features a 13th Gen Intel Core i5, 8GB RAM, 512GB Gen4 SSD, and a backlit keyboard.', 'International Office Solution laptop, 15.6 inch FHD laptop, Intel Core i5-1334U computer, upgradeable 32GB RAM laptop, 512GB NVMe Gen4 SSD, backlit keyboard laptop, Free-DOS portable PC, steel gray business laptop', NULL, 8, NULL, NULL),
(476, 'Acer Aspire 15 AS15-42-R5 Ryzen 5 7430U 15.6\" FHD Laptop iosbd', 'The International Office Solution 15.6\" FHD IPS Laptop (Pure Silver) is a high-performance, enterprise-ready workstation designed to tackle heavy administrative workloads and demanding multitasking. Powered by the robust AMD Ryzen 5 7430U 6-core processor, a generous 16GB of dual-channel DDR4 RAM, and a fast 512GB PCIe Gen3 NVMe SSD, it delivers incredibly smooth, lag-free performance. Complete with a vibrant 15.6-inch IPS display, advanced Wi-Fi 6 networking, dual noise-canceling microphones, and shipping with Free-DOS for total operating system flexibility, it is an exceptionally well-rounded corporate asset housed in a sleek 1.79 kg silver chassis.', 'acer-aspire-15-as15-42-r5-ryzen-5-7430u-156-fhd-laptop-iosbd-1784213053', '<p>Supercharge your daily workflow and streamline your mobile operations with the <strong>International Office Solution</strong> 15.6-inch Portable Workstation. Wrapped in an elegant \"Pure Silver\" chassis that perfectly balances durability with a professional aesthetic, this laptop is meticulously engineered for modern professionals, remote workers, and multitasking students. At the absolute core of this machine lies the formidable AMD Ryzen 5 7430U processor. Featuring a powerful 6-core, 12-thread architecture and a massive 16MB L3 cache, this CPU boosts up to 4.3GHz to effortlessly tear through complex spreadsheets, heavy administrative software, and multi-layered web applications.</p><p>What truly sets this configuration apart for high-end productivity is its memory architecture. Out of the box, it is equipped with 16GB of 3200MHz DDR4 memory running in a dual-channel configuration (8GB x 2). This dual-channel setup completely eliminates multitasking bottlenecks and significantly maximizes the performance of the integrated AMD Radeon Graphics, ensuring fluid rendering for data visualizations and media playback. Paired with a blazing-fast 512GB PCIe Gen3 NVMe SSD, the system guarantees near-instantaneous boot sequences, rapid file transfers, and highly responsive application loading times.</p><p>The visual and communication suites are specifically tailored for the era of hybrid work and high-definition virtual collaboration. The expansive 15.6-inch Full HD (1920x1080) IPS LED display provides a vast, crystal-clear digital workspace. The IPS panel guarantees superior color accuracy and ultra-wide viewing angles, actively reducing eye fatigue during marathon data entry sessions. When it comes to video conferencing, the system excels. It features a 720p HD webcam paired with an advanced dual-array microphone system equipped with built-in Noise Cancellation. This ensures your voice is transmitted with studio-quality clarity on Zoom or Microsoft Teams, actively filtering out distracting background noise, while the dual stereo speakers provide High-Fidelity Original Recording audio playback.</p><p>Beyond computing power and media, the connectivity options are strictly enterprise-grade. The inclusion of next-generation Wi-Fi 6 and a dedicated Gigabit LAN port ensures ultra-low latency and maximum bandwidth whether you are operating wirelessly or hardwired at a corporate desk. The massive I/O suite includes two highly versatile USB 3.2 Gen 1 Type-C ports, three standard USB Type-A ports, and an HDMI output for seamless multi-monitor expansion. Powered by a high-capacity 55Wh 3-cell battery, and arriving with Free-DOS to grant IT administrators total freedom over custom, secure OS deployments, this <strong>International Office Solution</strong> laptop is a brilliant, highly capable long-term investment.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Computing Engine</strong></td><td>AMD Ryzen 5 7430U (6 Cores, 12 Threads, Up to 4.3GHz, 16MB L3 Cache)</td><td>The powerful 6-core architecture delivers immense processing headroom for heavy, multi-threaded enterprise applications and intense multitasking.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Architecture</strong></td><td>16GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM (8GB x 2 Dual-Channel Setup)</td><td>Dual-channel memory vastly improves system responsiveness and maximizes integrated graphics performance for flawless, lag-free operation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage Solution</strong></td><td>512GB PCIe Gen3 NVMe SSD</td><td>Provides blazing-fast data read/write speeds, guaranteeing instantaneous application launches and highly secure local file archiving.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display &amp; Visuals</strong></td><td>15.6-inch FHD (1920x1080) IPS LED Panel</td><td>Delivers a massive, highly color-accurate digital workspace with wide viewing angles, reducing eye strain during prolonged screen time.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>A/V &amp; Communication</strong></td><td>720p HD Camera, Dual Array Mics with Noise Cancellation, Dual Stereo Speakers</td><td>Creates a professional-grade virtual meeting environment out-of-the-box by actively suppressing distracting background office or cafe noise.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Network &amp; Wireless</strong></td><td>Wi-Fi 6 (802.11ax), Bluetooth 5.1, Dedicated RJ45 LAN Port</td><td>Next-generation networking technology guarantees massive, stable bandwidth for flawless cloud computing, server access, and large file transfers.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Extensive I/O Ports</strong></td><td>2x USB-C (3.2 Gen 1), 2x USB-A (3.2 Gen 1), 1x USB-A (3.0), 1x HDMI</td><td>Comprehensive peripheral integration allows for highly versatile data transfers and effortless connection to modern external displays.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design, Power &amp; OS</strong></td><td>Pure Silver Chassis (1.79 kg), 55Wh Battery, Free-DOS Operating System</td><td>An elegant, highly portable form factor backed by reliable battery life, offering IT departments total freedom over secure OS installations.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Laptop', 75500.00, 75500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/acXUEo1XLZ6damvZpktoGlsBt8KmzY3FKkmXCY4C.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 13:27:29', '2026-07-16 14:44:13', 'International Office Solution 15.6\" FHD IPS Laptop | Ryzen 5 7430U', 'upercharge your workflow with the International Office Solution 15.6\" Laptop. Featuring a 6-core AMD Ryzen 5 7430U, 16GB dual-channel RAM, 512GB SSD, and Wi-Fi 6.', 'International Office Solution laptop, 15.6 inch FHD IPS laptop, AMD Ryzen 5 7430U computer, 16GB RAM laptop, dual channel memory laptop, 512GB NVMe Gen3 SSD, Wi-Fi 6 business laptop, Free-DOS portable PC, noise cancellation mic laptop', NULL, 8, NULL, NULL),
(477, 'Acer Aspire Lite AL15-52H Core i5 13th Gen 15.6\" FHD Laptop iosbd', 'The International Office Solution 15.6\" FHD IPS Laptop (Silver) is an elite, high-performance portable workstation engineered to bring desktop-class power to the mobile professional. Driven by the high-wattage 13th Gen Intel Core i5-13420H 10-core processor and featuring cutting-edge 16GB LPDDR5 RAM alongside a lightning-fast 512GB PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD, it effortlessly powers through complex data analytics, intense multitasking, and heavy enterprise software. Boasting a vibrant IPS display, advanced Wi-Fi 6 connectivity, and shipping with Free-DOS for ultimate IT deployment flexibility, it is an immensely capable corporate asset packed into a sleek 1.7 kg chassis.', 'acer-aspire-lite-al15-52h-core-i5-13th-gen-156-fhd-laptop-iosbd-1784213219', '<p>Experience uncompromising processing power without being tethered to a desk with the <strong>International Office Solution</strong> 15.6-inch Portable Workstation. Wrapped in a highly professional, durable silver chassis measuring a mere 18.9mm in thickness, this laptop redefines what is possible in a mobile form factor. At the absolute core of this machine lies the incredibly formidable 13th Generation Intel Core i5-13420H processor. Unlike standard low-voltage mobile chips, this H-series processor is built for heavy lifting. Utilizing Intel’s advanced hybrid architecture, it features 10 distinct cores (2 Performance cores and 8 Efficient cores) and 12 threads. Capable of boosting up to a blazing 4.60GHz, it intelligently shifts immense processing power to your most demanding applications while routing background tasks to the efficient cores, guaranteeing maximum performance when you need it and conserving battery life when you do not.</p><p>What elevates this specific configuration to a true enterprise-grade powerhouse is the integration of next-generation memory architecture. Out of the box, it is equipped with 16GB of ultra-fast LPDDR5 RAM. This massive leap in memory technology provides exponentially higher bandwidth and lower power consumption compared to traditional DDR4, completely eliminating bottlenecks during extreme multitasking and significantly accelerating the performance of the integrated Intel UHD Graphics. This is seamlessly paired with a rapid 512GB PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD, which not only ensures instantaneous boot sequences and rapid file retrieval but also supports storage upgrades up to 1TB, ensuring your hardware scales effortlessly alongside your growing corporate data demands.</p><p>The visual and communication suites are meticulously crafted for the modern era of hybrid work and high-definition remote collaboration. The expansive 15.6-inch Full HD (1920x1080) IPS display provides a massive, crystal-clear digital workspace. The premium IPS panel ensures absolute color accuracy and ultra-wide viewing angles, actively reducing eye strain during marathon spreadsheet analysis or presentation drafting. When engaging in virtual meetings, the 720p HD webcam, integrated dual stereo speakers, and built-in microphone array create a highly reliable, professional-grade communication environment.</p><p>Connectivity and networking are equally robust. The inclusion of next-generation Wi-Fi 6 (802.11ax) and a dedicated Gigabit LAN port ensures you maintain ultra-low latency and maximum bandwidth whether you are operating wirelessly in an airport lounge or hardwired into a secure corporate network. The comprehensive I/O suite features a high-speed USB 3.2 Gen 2 Type-C port, a high-speed USB 3.2 Gen 1 Type-A port, legacy USB 2.0 ports, and HDMI for effortless multi-monitor expansions. Powered by a reliable 54Wh 3-cell battery, and arriving with Free-DOS to grant network administrators total freedom over custom, secure operating system deployments devoid of pre-installed bloatware, this <strong>International Office Solution</strong> laptop represents a forward-thinking, high-yield investment for any modern organization.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Computing Engine</strong></td><td>Intel Core i5-13420H (10 Cores [2P, 8E], 12 Threads, Up to 4.60GHz, 12MB Cache)</td><td>High-wattage H-series architecture delivers desktop-tier processing muscle for incredibly heavy enterprise applications and intense multi-threaded workloads.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Architecture</strong></td><td>16GB LPDDR5 RAM</td><td>Cutting-edge LPDDR5 technology provides massive bandwidth and extreme energy efficiency, guaranteeing flawlessly smooth, lag-free multitasking.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage Solution</strong></td><td>512GB PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD (Upgradeable to 1TB)</td><td>Next-generation Gen4 storage yields blazing-fast data transfer rates, near-instant software launches, and highly secure local file archiving.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display &amp; Visuals</strong></td><td>15.6-inch FHD (1920x1080) IPS Panel</td><td>Delivers a vast, highly color-accurate digital workspace with wide viewing angles, drastically reducing eye fatigue during prolonged screen usage.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>A/V &amp; Communication</strong></td><td>720p HD Webcam, Dual Stereo Speakers, Built-in Microphone</td><td>Creates a fully optimized, professional-grade virtual meeting environment right out of the box for seamless remote collaboration.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Network &amp; Wireless</strong></td><td>Wi-Fi 6 (802.11ax), Bluetooth 5.2, Dedicated RJ45 LAN Port</td><td>Enterprise-grade networking guarantees stable, massive bandwidth for flawless cloud computing, server access, and enormous file transfers.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Extensive I/O Ports</strong></td><td>1x Type-C (3.2 Gen 2), 1x USB-A (3.2 Gen 1), 2x USB-A (2.0), 1x HDMI</td><td>Comprehensive peripheral integration enables highly versatile, high-speed data transfers and effortless connection to modern external displays.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design, Power &amp; OS</strong></td><td>Silver Chassis (1.7 kg), 54Wh Battery, Free-DOS Operating System</td><td>An elegant, highly portable form factor that offers IT departments absolute freedom over secure, custom corporate OS installations.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Laptop', 77000.00, 77000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/Re3QF0TxIoB658E4wC2YiImUfR3ORbteBS2t4hvk.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 13:28:21', '2026-07-16 14:46:59', 'International Office Solution 15.6\" FHD IPS Laptop | Core i5-13420H & 16GB LPDDR5', 'International Office Solution laptop, 15.6 inch FHD IPS laptop, Intel Core i5-13420H computer, 16GB LPDDR5 laptop, 512GB PCIe Gen4 SSD, Wi-Fi 6 business laptop, Free-DOS portable PC, silver corporate workstation', 'Maximize productivity with the International Office Solution 15.6\" Laptop. Features a powerful Core i5-13420H, ultra-fast 16GB LPDDR5 RAM, 512GB Gen4 SSD, and Wi-Fi 6.', NULL, 8, NULL, NULL),
(478, 'Acer Aspire Lite AL15-41 AMD Ryzen 5 7430U 15.6\" FHD Laptop iosbd', 'The International Office Solution 15.6\" FHD Laptop (Steel Gray) is a premium, high-performance workstation uniquely tailored for professionals who demand exceptional visual clarity alongside robust computing power. Driven by a 6-core AMD Ryzen 5 7430U processor, 16GB of dual-channel DDR4 RAM, and a cutting-edge 512GB PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD, it delivers flawless multitasking for heavy administrative and creative workloads. Its standout feature is a breathtaking 400-nit, 100% sRGB LED display, providing studio-grade color accuracy. Complete with Firmware TPM security and shipping with Free-DOS for ultimate IT deployment flexibility, it is an elite, highly upgradeable corporate asset.', 'acer-aspire-lite-al15-41-amd-ryzen-5-7430u-156-fhd-laptop-iosbd-1784211879', '<p>Elevate your visual workspace and supercharge your corporate productivity with the <strong>International Office Solution</strong> 15.6-inch Professional Workstation. Encased in a sophisticated and durable \"Steel Gray\" chassis, this laptop is meticulously engineered for modern professionals, content creators, and executives who require both high-end computing performance and absolute visual precision. At the heart of this machine lies the formidable AMD Ryzen 5 7430U processor. Featuring a highly efficient 6-core, 12-thread architecture with a massive 16MB L3 cache, it boosts up to 4.3GHz to effortlessly execute complex data modeling, massive spreadsheet calculations, and heavy, multi-layered enterprise software without a hint of lag.</p><p>What truly positions this laptop as a high-end corporate asset is its memory and storage configuration. Out of the box, the system is equipped with 16GB of 3200MHz DDR4 memory running in a highly optimized dual-channel configuration (8GB x 2). This eliminates system bottlenecks and maximizes the performance of the integrated AMD Radeon Graphics, ensuring fluid rendering for data visualizations and complex media. Furthermore, the inclusion of a lightning-fast 512GB PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD guarantees near-instantaneous boot sequences and rapid file retrieval. Crucially, this system is exceptionally future-proof, supporting memory expansion up to a massive 32GB and storage upgrades up to 1TB, ensuring your hardware scales effortlessly as your business demands escalate.</p><p>The absolute centerpiece of this workstation is its phenomenal 15.6-inch Full HD display. Unlike standard office laptops, this premium LED-backlit TFT LCD panel boasts a staggering 400 nits of high brightness and covers 100% of the sRGB color gamut. This studio-grade color accuracy and exceptional luminance make it the ultimate tool for marketing professionals, graphic designers, and anyone working in brightly lit corporate environments or outdoor cafes. The wide 170-degree viewing angle ensures that presentations and shared screen collaborations are crystal clear from any perspective.</p><p>Security and connectivity are strictly enterprise-grade. The system includes a Firmware Trusted Platform Module (TPM) to securely encrypt your sensitive corporate data and passwords at the hardware level. Networking is handled by reliable Wi-Fi 5 and Bluetooth 5.1, while the comprehensive I/O suite includes high-speed USB 3.2 Gen 1 and legacy USB 2.0 ports alongside HDMI for effortless multi-monitor expansions. Powered by a 36Wh battery, and arriving with Free-DOS to grant network administrators total freedom over custom, secure operating system deployments devoid of pre-installed bloatware, the <strong>International Office Solution</strong> Steel Gray laptop is a forward-thinking, high-yield investment.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Computing Engine</strong></td><td>AMD Ryzen 5 7430U (6 Cores, 12 Threads, Up to 4.3GHz, 16MB L3 Cache)</td><td>The powerful 6-core architecture delivers massive processing headroom for heavy enterprise applications, large databases, and intense multitasking.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Architecture</strong></td><td>16GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM (Dual-Channel), Upgradable to 32GB</td><td>Dual-channel memory vastly improves system responsiveness, with massive upgrade potential to future-proof your corporate hardware investment.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage Solution</strong></td><td>512GB PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD (Upgradable to 1TB)</td><td>Next-generation Gen4 solid-state technology provides blazing-fast data transfer rates, near-instant software launches, and highly secure archiving.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display &amp; Visuals</strong></td><td>15.6-inch FHD (1920x1080) LED, 400 Nits Brightness, 100% sRGB Gamut</td><td>Delivers a breathtaking, studio-quality visual workspace with pristine color accuracy and extreme brightness, perfect for creative and analytical tasks.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Security &amp; OS</strong></td><td>Firmware Trusted Platform Module (TPM), Free-DOS</td><td>Hardware-level encryption protects sensitive corporate data, while Free-DOS allows IT teams total freedom for custom enterprise OS deployments.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Network &amp; I/O</strong></td><td>Wi-Fi 5, Bluetooth 5.1, 1x USB-A (3.2 Gen1), 2x USB-A (2.0), 1x HDMI</td><td>Provides highly versatile physical connectivity for modern external displays, projectors, and essential office peripherals.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design &amp; Power</strong></td><td>Steel Gray Chassis, Full-Size Keyboard with Numpad, 36Wh Battery</td><td>A sophisticated, highly professional design that maximizes data entry speed and typing comfort during long hours of administrative work.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'Laptop', 77500.00, 77500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/GPlwdjDc9QoOPSUnQhSa63c3Tp90z8J4IG1nsotq.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 13:31:31', '2026-07-16 14:24:39', 'International Office Solution 15.6\" FHD Laptop | 100% sRGB & Ryzen 5', 'Experience premium visuals with the International Office Solution 15.6\" Laptop. Features a 400-nit 100% sRGB display, Ryzen 5 7430U, 16GB RAM, and 512GB Gen4 SSD.', 'nternational Office Solution laptop, 15.6 inch FHD laptop, 100% sRGB laptop, 400 nits display laptop, AMD Ryzen 5 7430U computer, 16GB RAM dual channel, 512GB PCIe Gen4 SSD, TPM security laptop, Free-DOS business PC, steel gray professional laptop', NULL, 8, NULL, NULL),
(479, 'Acer Aspire 15 AS15-42-R7 Ryzen 7 7730U 15.6\" FHD Laptop iosbd', 'The International Office Solution 15.6\" FHD IPS Laptop (Pure Silver) is an elite, high-performance portable workstation engineered for power users, software developers, and executive professionals. Driven by the formidable 8-core AMD Ryzen 7 7730U processor, 16GB of high-speed DDR4 RAM, and a rapid 512GB PCIe Gen3 NVMe SSD, it effortlessly powers through complex data analytics, intense multi-threaded workloads, and heavy enterprise software. Boasting a vibrant IPS display, advanced Wi-Fi 6 connectivity, noise-canceling dual microphones, and shipping with Free-DOS for ultimate IT deployment flexibility, it is an immensely capable corporate powerhouse packed into a sleek 1.79 kg chassis.', 'acer-aspire-15-as15-42-r7-ryzen-7-7730u-156-fhd-laptop-iosbd-1784221851', '<p>Unleash top-tier processing capabilities without being tethered to a traditional desktop with the <strong>International Office Solution</strong> 15.6-inch Portable Workstation. Wrapped in a highly professional, durable \"Pure Silver\" chassis measuring 19.3mm in thickness, this laptop is meticulously designed to bring elite computing power to the mobile professional. At the absolute core of this machine lies the incredibly formidable AMD Ryzen 7 7730U processor. Built on the highly acclaimed Ryzen 7000 Series architecture, it features a massive 8-core, 16-thread configuration alongside a substantial 16MB L3 Cache. Capable of boosting up to a blazing 4.3GHz, it provides unparalleled processing headroom. Whether you are running heavy virtual machines, compiling massive codebases, or analyzing immense financial spreadsheets, this CPU tears through intense, multi-threaded enterprise workloads without a hint of lag.</p><p>What elevates this specific configuration to a true enterprise-grade powerhouse is its robust memory architecture and future-proof upgradeability. Out of the box, it is equipped with 16GB of rapid 3200MHz DDR4 RAM, providing expansive bandwidth for extreme multitasking and heavy cloud-based web applications. Crucially, the system supports memory expansion up to a massive 32GB, ensuring that your hardware can scale effortlessly alongside your growing corporate software demands. This is seamlessly paired with a rapid 512GB PCIe Gen3 NVMe SSD, which ensures near-instantaneous boot sequences, rapid file retrieval, and highly secure local data archiving.</p><p>The visual and communication suites are meticulously crafted for the modern era of hybrid work and high-definition remote collaboration. The expansive 15.6-inch Full HD (1920x1080) IPS display provides a massive, crystal-clear digital workspace. The premium IPS panel ensures absolute color accuracy and ultra-wide viewing angles, actively reducing eye strain during marathon work sessions. When engaging in virtual meetings, the 720p HD webcam, integrated dual stereo speakers, and built-in dual array microphone with advanced Noise Cancellation create a highly reliable, professional-grade communication environment. By actively filtering out distracting background noise, it guarantees High Fidelity Original Recording quality for your Zoom or Teams calls.</p><p>Connectivity and networking are equally robust. The inclusion of next-generation Wi-Fi 6 (802.11ax) and a dedicated Gigabit LAN port ensures you maintain ultra-low latency and maximum bandwidth whether you are operating wirelessly in an airport lounge or hardwired into a secure corporate network. The comprehensive, highly versatile I/O suite features two high-speed USB 3.2 Gen 1 Type-C ports, three standard USB Type-A ports, and HDMI for effortless multi-monitor expansions. Powered by a reliable 55Wh 3-cell battery, and arriving with Free-DOS to grant network administrators total freedom over custom, secure operating system deployments devoid of pre-installed bloatware, this <strong>International Office Solution</strong> laptop represents a forward-thinking, high-yield investment for any modern organization.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Computing Engine</strong></td><td>AMD Ryzen 7 7730U (8 Cores, 16 Threads, Up to 4.3GHz, 16MB L3 Cache)</td><td>Elite 8-core architecture delivers massive desktop-tier processing muscle for heavy enterprise applications and intense multi-threaded workloads.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Architecture</strong></td><td>16GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM (Upgradeable to 32GB)</td><td>High-capacity memory guarantees flawlessly smooth, lag-free multitasking, with incredible expansion potential to future-proof your investment.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage Solution</strong></td><td>512GB PCIe Gen3 NVMe SSD</td><td>Next-generation solid-state storage yields blazing-fast data transfer rates, near-instant software launches, and highly secure local file archiving.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display &amp; Visuals</strong></td><td>15.6-inch FHD (1920x1080) IPS LED Panel</td><td>Delivers a vast, highly color-accurate digital workspace with wide viewing angles, drastically reducing eye fatigue during prolonged screen usage.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>A/V &amp; Communication</strong></td><td>720p HD Webcam, Dual Array Mics with Noise Cancellation, Dual Stereo Speakers</td><td>Creates a fully optimized, professional-grade virtual meeting environment right out of the box by actively eliminating background audio distractions.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Network &amp; Wireless</strong></td><td>Wi-Fi 6 (802.11ax), Bluetooth 5.1, Dedicated RJ45 LAN Port</td><td>Enterprise-grade networking guarantees stable, massive bandwidth for flawless cloud computing, server access, and enormous data migrations.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Extensive I/O Ports</strong></td><td>2x Type-C (3.2 Gen 1), 2x USB-A (3.2 Gen 1), 1x USB-A (3.0), 1x HDMI</td><td>Comprehensive peripheral integration enables highly versatile, high-speed data transfers and effortless connection to modern external displays.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design, Power &amp; OS</strong></td><td>Pure Silver Chassis (1.79 kg), 55Wh Battery, Free-DOS Operating System</td><td>An elegant, highly portable form factor that offers IT departments absolute freedom over secure, custom corporate OS installations.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Laptop', 81500.00, 81500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/vzDokSxudKZ4mp4WAjU4LsdoLY7B72XBzH9bzQMb.webp', 'products/videos/0AcWnn1X2ZX3FEqFTLBBy3S3dJgZKLh4gGlsmRVB.mp4', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 13:33:14', '2026-07-16 17:10:51', 'CategorySpecificationFeatureComputing EngineAMD Ryzen 7 7730U (8 Cores, 16 Threads, Up to 4.3GHz, 16MB L3 Cache)Elite 8-core architecture delivers massive desktop-tier processing muscle for heavy enterprise applications and intense multi-threaded workloads.Memory Architecture16GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM (Upgradeable to 32GB)High-capacity memory guarantees flawlessly smooth, lag-free multitasking, with incredible expansion potential to future-proof your investment.Storage Solution512GB PCIe Gen3 NVMe SSDNext-generation solid-state storage yields blazing-fast data transfer rates, near-instant software launches, and highly secure local file archiving.Display & Visuals15.6-inch FHD (1920x1080) IPS LED PanelDelivers a vast, highly color-accurate digital workspace with wide viewing angles, drastically reducing eye fatigue during prolonged screen usage.A/V & Communication720p HD Webcam, Dual Array Mics with Noise Cancellation, Dual Stereo SpeakersCreates a fully optimized, professional-grade virtual meeting environment right out of the box by actively eliminating background audio distractions.Network & WirelessWi-Fi 6 (802.11ax), Bluetooth 5.1, Dedicated RJ45 LAN PortEnterprise-grade networking guarantees stable, massive bandwidth for flawless cloud computing, server access, and enormous data migrations.Extensive I/O Ports2x Type-C (3.2 Gen 1), 2x USB-A (3.2 Gen 1), 1x USB-A (3.0), 1x HDMIComprehensive peripheral integration enables highly versatile, high-speed data transfers and effortless connection to modern external displays.Design, Power & OSPure Silver Chassis (1.79 kg), 55Wh Battery, Free-DOS Operating SystemAn elegant, highly portable form factor that offers IT departments absolute freedom over secure, custom corporate OS installations.', 'Unleash peak productivity with the International Office Solution 15.6\" Laptop. Features a powerful 8-core Ryzen 7 7730U, 16GB RAM, 512GB SSD, Wi-Fi 6, and a sleek silver chassis.', 'International Office Solution laptop, 15.6 inch FHD IPS laptop, AMD Ryzen 7 7730U computer, 16GB RAM upgradeable laptop, 512GB PCIe Gen3 SSD, Wi-Fi 6 business laptop, Free-DOS portable PC, noise cancellation mic laptop, silver corporate workstation', NULL, 8, NULL, NULL),
(480, 'Acer TravelLite TL14-52M Core i5 13th Gen 8GB RAM 512GB Storage 14\" FHD Laptop iosbd', 'The International Office Solution 14\" FHD Laptop (Gray) is an ultra-portable, highly secure business workstation engineered for executives and professionals on the move. Powered by the 13th Gen Intel Core i5-1335U 10-core processor, 8GB of DDR4 RAM, and a rapid 512GB PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD, it delivers exceptional performance in a remarkably lightweight 1.38 kg chassis. Boasting elite enterprise security features—including a Discrete TPM 2.0 chip, a fingerprint sensor, and a camera privacy shutter—alongside a spill-resistant backlit keyboard and immense upgradeability (up to 64GB RAM), it is the ultimate secure, future-proof asset for modern corporate environments.', 'acer-travellite-tl14-52m-core-i5-13th-gen-8gb-ram-512gb-storage-14-fhd-laptop-iosbd-1784221152', '<p>Maximize your mobility without compromising on enterprise-grade security or processing power with the <strong>International Office Solution</strong> 14-inch Portable Workstation. Wrapped in a sleek, professional gray chassis that weighs an astonishingly light 1.38 kg and measures just 19.90 mm thin, this laptop is the perfect travel companion for field engineers, traveling executives, and hybrid workers. At the absolute core of this highly agile machine lies the 13th Generation Intel Core i5-1335U processor. Utilizing Intel’s advanced hybrid architecture, it features 10 distinct cores (2 Performance cores and 8 Efficient cores) capable of boosting up to 4.60GHz. This intelligent power allocation ensures that you have the raw processing muscle for heavy data analytics when you need it, while preserving battery life during lighter administrative tasks.</p><p>What truly distinguishes this <strong>International Office Solution</strong> laptop as a top-tier corporate investment is its unprecedented upgradeability and robust durability. Out of the box, it is equipped with 8GB of 3200MHz DDR4 memory and a blazing-fast 512GB PCIe Gen4 M.2 NVMe SSD. However, unlike most modern 14-inch ultrabooks that solder their memory to the motherboard, this system features two dedicated RAM slots supporting a massive expansion up to 64GB. This guarantees that your hardware can effortlessly scale to meet the demands of highly intensive future software suites. Furthermore, the inclusion of an A4-size, spill-resistant backlit keyboard ensures that accidental coffee spills during late-night flights or morning meetings do not compromise your critical corporate hardware.</p><p>Security and connectivity are uncompromisingly strict. To protect sensitive corporate data, the system is fortified with a Discrete Trusted Platform Module (TPM) 2.0 chip for hardware-level encryption. It also features a built-in fingerprint sensor for secure, password-free biometric logins, and a physical camera privacy shutter to guarantee absolute confidentiality when virtual meetings conclude. The visual experience is anchored by a 14-inch Full HD (1920x1080) LED-backlit Anti-Glare display, actively reducing eye fatigue under harsh office lighting. Networking is handled by ultra-fast Wi-Fi 6, while the versatile I/O suite includes a Gigabit LAN port, HDMI, and a high-speed USB 3.2 Gen 2 Type-C port that supports DisplayPort output and 60W Power Delivery. Arriving with Free DOS to grant your IT department total control over custom OS deployments, and backed by a comprehensive 3-year warranty, this laptop is a highly secure, incredibly adaptable long-term investment.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Computing Engine</strong></td><td>Intel Core i5-1335U (10 Cores [2P, 8E], 12 Threads, Up to 4.60GHz, 12MB Cache)</td><td>The advanced hybrid 10-core architecture seamlessly shifts between maximum processing speed and extreme energy efficiency based on your workload.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory &amp; Storage</strong></td><td>8GB DDR4 3200MHz (Upgradeable to 64GB), 512GB PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD</td><td>Unprecedented expansion potential for a 14-inch device; massive 64GB RAM support ensures absolute future-proofing for growing enterprise needs.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display &amp; Input</strong></td><td>14-inch FHD (1920x1080) Anti-Glare LCD, Spill-Resistant Backlit Keyboard</td><td>Delivers a crisp, glare-free visual workspace paired with a highly durable, illuminated keyboard designed to withstand minor liquid accidents.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Security &amp; Privacy</strong></td><td>Discrete TPM 2.0, Fingerprint Sensor, Physical Camera Privacy Shutter</td><td>Enterprise-grade hardware encryption and biometric authentication keep sensitive corporate data locked down and strictly confidential.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Network &amp; I/O</strong></td><td>Wi-Fi 6 (802.11ax), Gigabit LAN, 1x Type-C (DP &amp; 60W PD), 1x USB-A (3.2 Gen1)</td><td>Ensures highly stable, massive wireless bandwidth while offering incredibly versatile Type-C connectivity for power delivery and external displays.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design, Power &amp; OS</strong></td><td>Gray Chassis (1.38 kg, 19.90mm thin), 36Wh Battery with 45W Fast Charge, Free DOS</td><td>An ultra-lightweight, travel-ready form factor that provides IT administrators complete freedom to deploy highly secure, custom operating systems.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'Laptop', 83000.00, 83000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/1jcyfzLRLfnPrXIIx8ceX30Cplx3dSYSo8hPuphW.webp', 'products/videos/BNp1HLDe588bk1ciUzU9NXspMf64eIZXwecK7j2U.mp4', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 13:34:48', '2026-07-16 17:03:54', 'International Office Solution 14\" FHD Laptop | Core i5-1335U & TPM 2.0', 'Secure your workflow with the International Office Solution 14\" Laptop. Features an Intel Core i5-1335U, 8GB RAM (up to 64GB), Fingerprint Sensor, TPM 2.0, and Wi-Fi 6.', 'International Office Solution laptop, 14 inch FHD business laptop, Intel Core i5-1335U computer, 64GB RAM upgradeable laptop, 512GB PCIe Gen4 SSD, TPM 2.0 laptop, fingerprint sensor business PC, camera privacy shutter, spill resistant keyboard laptop, lightweight corporate laptop', NULL, 8, NULL, NULL),
(481, 'Acer ALG AL15G-53 Core i5 13420H RTX 3050 6GB Graphics 15.6\" FHD Gaming Laptop iosbd', 'The International Office Solution 15.6\" 144Hz High-Performance Workstation (Steel Gray) is an uncompromising powerhouse engineered for creative professionals, architects, and data analysts. Supercharged by the 13th Gen Intel Core i5-13420H processor and a dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 (6GB GDDR6) graphics card, it delivers desktop-tier rendering and computation capabilities. Featuring a massive 1TB PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD, 16GB of DDR4 RAM (expandable up to an immense 64GB), and a fluid 144Hz FHD display, this 1.99kg workstation effortlessly bridges the gap between high-end graphical performance and professional mobility.', 'acer-alg-al15g-53-core-i5-13420h-rtx-3050-6gb-graphics-156-fhd-gaming-laptop-iosbd-1784220983', '<p>Shatter the limitations of mobile computing with the <strong>International Office Solution</strong> 15.6-inch High-Performance Graphics Workstation. Encased in a durable, professional \"Steel Gray\" chassis, this system is meticulously engineered to disguise gaming-tier hardware inside a sophisticated corporate profile. Weighing 1.99 kg and measuring 22.7 mm thick, it is the ultimate mobile command center for architects running complex CAD software, video editors rendering 4K timelines, data scientists processing massive datasets, and power users who refuse to compromise on speed.</p><p>At the core of this engineering marvel is the formidable 13th Generation Intel Core i5-13420H processor. Operating at a high-wattage configuration, this 8-core, 12-thread CPU boosts up to a blistering 4.60 GHz, intelligently routing immense computational power to your most demanding software. However, the true defining feature of this workstation is the inclusion of a dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 GPU, armed with 6GB of high-speed GDDR6 memory. This discrete graphics card unlocks massive hardware acceleration for industry-standard creative and analytical suites, drastically reducing render times and enabling real-time 3D modeling—capabilities completely absent in standard integrated-graphics office laptops.</p><p>To support this immense processing power, the system features an incredibly robust memory and storage architecture. Out of the box, it is equipped with 16GB of DDR4 RAM and a massive 1TB PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD, providing instantaneous software launches and vast local archiving for massive project files. Crucially, the system offers unprecedented future-proofing: it features dual soDIMM slots supporting up to a staggering 64GB of RAM, and a dual M.2 slot architecture that allows storage expansion up to 2TB. This guarantees that your initial hardware investment will easily scale to meet the exponentially growing demands of your enterprise over the next several years.</p><p>The visual experience is uniquely tailored to provide both absolute clarity and incredibly fluid motion. The 15.6-inch Full HD (1920x1080) display features a blazing-fast 144Hz refresh rate, ensuring that rapidly moving 3D models, complex timeline scrubbing, and even simple UI navigation remain buttery smooth without motion blur. Combined with a backlit keyboard for low-light productivity, next-generation Wi-Fi 6, a massive 150W AC adapter for rapid power delivery to the GPU, and shipping with Free-DOS to allow IT departments total freedom over custom enterprise OS deployments, this <strong>International Office Solution</strong> workstation is an unmatched, high-yield asset for elite professionals.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Computing Engine</strong></td><td>Intel Core i5-13420H (8 Cores, 12 Threads, Up to 4.60 GHz, 12MB Cache)</td><td>High-wattage H-series architecture delivers sustained, desktop-level processing muscle required for extreme multi-threaded enterprise applications.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Graphics Processing</strong></td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 (6GB GDDR6 Dedicated Memory)</td><td>Provides immense hardware acceleration for professional creative suites (Adobe CC, AutoCAD, Blender), enabling real-time rendering and complex data modeling.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Architecture</strong></td><td>16GB DDR4 RAM (Dual soDIMM Slots, Upgradeable to 64GB)</td><td>Pre-configured for heavy multitasking with breathtaking expansion potential, allowing the system to scale to workstation-class 64GB configurations.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage Solution</strong></td><td>1TB NVMe PCIe Gen4 SSD (Dual M.2 Slots, Upgradeable to 2TB)</td><td>Massive out-of-the-box storage with next-gen Gen4 speeds ensures instantaneous access to massive project files, with a secondary slot for easy future expansion.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display &amp; Visuals</strong></td><td>15.6-inch FHD (1920x1080), 144Hz Refresh Rate, 45% NTSC</td><td>The ultra-high 144Hz refresh rate provides unparalleled fluidity for scrolling, timeline scrubbing, and 3D viewport navigation, actively reducing eye fatigue.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>A/V &amp; Input</strong></td><td>1.0M HD Webcam, Stereo Speakers, Backlit Keyboard</td><td>Ensures peak productivity in dimly lit environments while providing highly reliable audio and video hardware for remote enterprise collaboration.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Network &amp; I/O</strong></td><td>Wi-Fi 6 (AX101), Gigabit LAN, 1x Type-C (3.2 Gen 2), 1x USB-A (3.2 Gen 1), 2x USB-A (2.0)</td><td>Enterprise-grade networking ensures stable, massive wireless bandwidth, while comprehensive I/O supports high-speed data transfers and multiple displays.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design, Power &amp; OS</strong></td><td>Steel Gray Chassis (1.99kg), 150W AC Adapter, 54Wh Battery, Free-DOS</td><td>A highly professional aesthetic paired with a massive 150W power supply to feed the dedicated GPU, allowing complete freedom for custom IT OS deployments.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'Laptop', 110000.00, 110000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/lFpvPvHEa20SrnRAfm3ZSrMViEf6rRWGqGehb7lw.webp', 'products/videos/gdRhu9RSRdt95lRayEHpQNxLsUWnKewfOhEllSLR.mp4', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 13:36:16', '2026-07-16 16:56:23', 'International Office Solution 15.6\" 144Hz Workstation | RTX 3050 & Core i5-13420H', 'Unleash creative power with the International Office Solution 15.6\" Workstation. Features an NVIDIA RTX 3050 6GB, Core i5-13420H, 1TB Gen4 SSD, 16GB RAM, and a 144Hz display.', 'International Office Solution workstation, 15.6 inch RTX 3050 laptop, Intel Core i5-13420H computer, 144Hz professional laptop, 1TB NVMe Gen4 SSD, 64GB RAM upgradeable laptop, NVIDIA discrete graphics business laptop, Free-DOS creator PC, steel gray CAD laptop', NULL, 8, NULL, NULL);
