(482, 'Acer ALG AL15G-53 Core 5 210H RTX 3050 6GB Graphics 15.6\" FHD Gaming Laptop iosbd', 'The International Office Solution 15.6\" 144Hz High-Performance Workstation (Steel Gray) is an elite, uncompromising powerhouse engineered for creative professionals, architects, and data analysts. Supercharged by the latest Intel Core 5 210H processor and a dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 (6GB GDDR6) graphics card, it delivers desktop-tier rendering and advanced computation capabilities. Featuring a 512GB PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD, 16GB of DDR4 RAM (with massive expansion potential up to 64GB), a fluid 144Hz FHD display, and a multi-color backlit keyboard, this 1.99kg workstation effortlessly bridges the gap between high-end graphical performance and professional mobility.', 'acer-alg-al15g-53-core-5-210h-rtx-3050-6gb-graphics-156-fhd-gaming-laptop-iosbd-1784220232', '<p>Shatter the limitations of mobile computing with the <strong>International Office Solution</strong> 15.6-inch High-Performance Graphics Workstation. Encased in a durable, professional \"Steel Gray\" chassis, this system is meticulously engineered to disguise workstation-tier hardware inside a sophisticated corporate profile. Weighing 1.99 kg and measuring 22.7 mm thick, it is the ultimate mobile command center for architects running complex CAD software, video editors rendering high-resolution timelines, data scientists processing massive datasets, and power users who refuse to compromise on operational speed or graphical fidelity.</p><p>At the absolute core of this engineering marvel is the formidable Intel Core 5 210H processor. Operating with the latest architecture, this 8-core, 12-thread CPU boosts up to a blistering 4.80 GHz, intelligently routing immense computational power to your most demanding enterprise software. However, the true defining feature of this workstation is the inclusion of a dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 GPU, armed with an upgraded 6GB of high-speed GDDR6 memory. This discrete graphics card unlocks massive hardware acceleration for industry-standard creative and analytical suites, drastically reducing render times and enabling real-time 3D modeling—capabilities that are completely absent in standard integrated-graphics office laptops.</p><p>To support this immense processing power, the system features an incredibly robust memory and storage architecture. Out of the box, it is equipped with 16GB of DDR4 RAM and a rapid 512GB PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD, providing instantaneous software launches and rapid local archiving for massive project files. Crucially, the system offers unprecedented future-proofing: it features dual soDIMM slots supporting up to a staggering 64GB of RAM, and a dual M.2 slot architecture that allows storage expansion up to a massive 2TB. This guarantees that your initial hardware investment will easily scale to meet the exponentially growing data and memory demands of your enterprise over the next several years.</p><p>The visual experience is uniquely tailored to provide both absolute clarity and incredibly fluid motion. The 15.6-inch Full HD (1920x1080) display features a blazing-fast 144Hz refresh rate, ensuring that rapidly moving 3D models, complex timeline scrubbing, and even simple UI navigation remain buttery smooth without motion blur, actively reducing eye fatigue. Combined with a multi-color backlit keyboard for enhanced low-light productivity, next-generation Wi-Fi 6, cutting-edge Bluetooth 5.4, a massive 150W AC adapter for rapid power delivery to the GPU, and shipping with Free-DOS to allow IT departments total freedom over custom enterprise OS deployments, this <strong>International Office Solution</strong> workstation is an unmatched, high-yield asset for elite professionals.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Computing Engine</strong></td><td>Intel Core 5 210H (8 Cores, 12 Threads, Up to 4.80 GHz, 12MB Cache)</td><td>Next-generation processor architecture delivers sustained, desktop-level processing muscle required for extreme multi-threaded enterprise applications.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Graphics Processing</strong></td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 (6GB GDDR6 Dedicated Memory)</td><td>Provides immense hardware acceleration for professional creative suites, enabling real-time rendering, AI-enhanced workflows, and complex data modeling.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Architecture</strong></td><td>16GB DDR4 RAM (Dual soDIMM Slots, Upgradeable to 64GB)</td><td>Pre-configured for heavy multitasking with breathtaking expansion potential, allowing the system to scale to workstation-class 64GB configurations.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage Solution</strong></td><td>512GB NVMe PCIe Gen4 SSD (Dual M.2 Slots, Upgradeable to 2TB)</td><td>High-speed Gen4 storage ensures instantaneous access to large project files, with a secondary M.2 slot for effortless future capacity expansion.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display &amp; Visuals</strong></td><td>15.6-inch FHD (1920x1080), 144Hz Refresh Rate, 45% NTSC</td><td>The ultra-high 144Hz refresh rate provides unparalleled fluidity for scrolling, timeline scrubbing, and 3D viewport navigation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>A/V &amp; Input</strong></td><td>1.0M HD Webcam, Stereo Speakers, Multi-Color Backlit Keyboard</td><td>Ensures peak productivity in dimly lit environments while providing highly reliable audio and video hardware for remote enterprise collaboration.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Network &amp; I/O</strong></td><td>Wi-Fi 6 (AX101), Bluetooth 5.4, Gigabit LAN, 2x Type-C (3.2 Gen 2), Mini DP, HDMI</td><td>Enterprise-grade networking ensures stable wireless bandwidth, while comprehensive I/O supports multiple high-resolution displays and rapid data transfers.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design, Power &amp; OS</strong></td><td>Steel Gray Chassis (1.99kg), 150W AC Adapter, 54Wh Battery, Free-DOS</td><td>A highly professional aesthetic paired with a massive 150W power supply to feed the dedicated GPU, allowing complete freedom for custom IT OS deployments.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Laptop', 122500.00, 122500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/LxNBSIqRi59sQVzcg8y1gslT2BSoKeAJNV5VEDi0.webp', 'products/videos/Oc0LexBf9u1bwMh2uyEUPXkAKTLC8EkMQaVfQ95C.mp4', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 13:38:35', '2026-07-16 16:43:52', 'International Office Solution 15.6\" 144Hz Workstation | RTX 3050 6GB & Core 5', 'Unleash creative power with the International Office Solution 15.6\" Workstation. Features an NVIDIA RTX 3050 6GB, Intel Core 5 210H, 512GB Gen4 SSD, 16GB RAM, and a 144Hz display.', 'International Office Solution workstation, 15.6 inch RTX 3050 laptop, Intel Core 5 210H computer, 144Hz professional laptop, 512GB NVMe Gen4 SSD, 64GB RAM upgradeable laptop, NVIDIA discrete graphics business laptop, Free-DOS creator PC, steel gray CAD laptop', NULL, 8, NULL, NULL),
(483, 'Acer Swift Go 14 SFG14-73 Core Ultra 7 155H 14\" WQXGA+ OLED Laptop iosbd', 'The International Office Solution 14\" Premium OLED Laptop (Pure Silver) is an ultra-thin, elite workstation built for the AI era. Powered by the revolutionary Intel Core Ultra 7 155H 16-core processor with integrated Intel Arc Graphics, 16GB of ultra-fast LPDDR5x RAM, and a massive 1TB PCIe Gen4 SSD, it delivers unparalleled performance for heavy creative and analytical workloads. Featuring a breathtaking 14-inch WQXGA+ (2880x1800) OLED display, bleeding-edge Wi-Fi 7 connectivity, a QHD webcam, and biometric security, this 1.3kg masterpiece is the ultimate future-proof asset for modern executives and power users.', 'acer-swift-go-14-sfg14-73-core-ultra-7-155h-14-wqxga-oled-laptop-iosbd-1784219669', '<p>Step into the future of mobile computing with the <strong>International Office Solution</strong> 14-inch Premium OLED Workstation. Encased in an exquisite, highly durable \"Pure Silver\" chassis that weighs an astonishing 1.3 kg and measures just 14.9 mm thin, this laptop represents the pinnacle of modern engineering. At its core is the groundbreaking Intel Core Ultra 7 155H processor. Featuring a highly advanced 16-core architecture (6 Performance, 6 Efficient, and 2 Low-Power Efficient cores) alongside 22 threads, it is designed to master heavy multitasking, complex data rendering, and advanced AI workloads. This next-generation CPU is perfectly paired with highly capable Intel Arc Graphics, 16GB of soldered, high-bandwidth LPDDR5x memory, and a massive 1TB PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD, ensuring instantaneous application launches and incredibly smooth local archiving.</p><p>The absolute centerpiece of this flagship laptop is its phenomenal display. The 14-inch WQXGA+ (2880 x 1800) OLED panel delivers a visual experience unlike any standard LCD. Producing 400 nits of high brightness and covering 100% of the sRGB color gamut, it provides studio-grade color accuracy, infinite contrast ratios, and true, deep blacks. Whether you are reviewing high-resolution marketing assets, editing video, or analyzing complex financial dashboards, the 16:10 aspect ratio provides expansive vertical screen real estate that drastically improves daily productivity.</p><p>Beyond its processing and visual supremacy, the communication and connectivity suites are strictly state-of-the-art. Virtual meetings are elevated to professional broadcast quality via a stunning QHD (1440p) webcam and a sophisticated dual-microphone array powered by AI Noise Reduction technology to eliminate background distractions. Audio playback is equally immersive, driven by DTS:X Ultra Audio with a smart amplifier. Input is a joy thanks to a moisture-resistant Corning Gorilla Glass lighting touchpad and a crisp backlit keyboard. Networking is future-proofed with the inclusion of revolutionary Wi-Fi 7 and Bluetooth 5.3, ensuring massive wireless bandwidth and ultra-low latency. Complete with a fingerprint sensor for secure, password-free logins, Windows 11 Home, and rapid 100W Power Delivery charging via USB Type-C, this <strong>International Office Solution</strong> laptop is an unparalleled, high-yield investment for the modern professional.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Computing &amp; AI Engine</strong></td><td>Intel Core Ultra 7 155H (16 Cores, 22 Threads, Up to 4.8 GHz, 24MB Cache)</td><td>Revolutionary architecture with built-in AI acceleration delivers extreme performance and unprecedented energy efficiency for heavy workloads.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory &amp; Storage</strong></td><td>16GB LPDDR5x RAM, 1TB NVMe PCIe Gen4 SSD</td><td>Ultra-fast memory bandwidth and massive Gen4 storage guarantee instantaneous software loading and flawlessly smooth multitasking.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display &amp; Visuals</strong></td><td>14-inch WQXGA+ (2880x1800) OLED, 400 Nits, 100% sRGB, 16:10 Ratio</td><td>Breathtaking OLED clarity provides studio-quality color accuracy, infinite contrast, and extra vertical workspace to maximize productivity.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>A/V &amp; Communication</strong></td><td>QHD (1440p) WebCam, DTS:X Ultra Audio, AI Noise Reduction Mics</td><td>Delivers broadcast-quality video and crystal-clear audio, actively filtering out background distractions during crucial virtual meetings.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Network &amp; Connectivity</strong></td><td>Wi-Fi 7 (802.11be), Bluetooth 5.3, 1x Type-C (100W PD), 2x USB-A</td><td>Bleeding-edge Wi-Fi 7 provides massive, ultra-low latency wireless bandwidth, while 100W Type-C charging allows for rapid power delivery.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design, Input &amp; Security</strong></td><td>Pure Silver (1.3 kg), Moisture-Resistant Gorilla Glass Touchpad, Fingerprint Sensor</td><td>An ultra-premium, travel-ready chassis featuring highly tactile, durable inputs and biometric security to keep corporate data locked down.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'Laptop', 146000.00, 146000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/R1Lx3OpZ8WEVMfAkQR3eFtUQLWlMVMZ3pMRU3nF6.webp', 'products/videos/rVwsDK9hKQFZu12TJbx7dD1HwfItrJA0p7FY5Zyu.mp4', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 13:40:02', '2026-07-16 16:34:29', 'International Office Solution 14\" OLED Premium Laptop | Core Ultra 7 155H', 'Experience unparalleled performance with the International Office Solution 14\" OLED Laptop. Featuring an Intel Core Ultra 7, 16GB LPDDR5x, 1TB Gen4 SSD, and Wi-Fi 7.', 'International Office Solution laptop, 14 inch OLED laptop, Intel Core Ultra 7 155H computer, WQXGA+ OLED display, 1TB NVMe Gen4 SSD, Wi-Fi 7 business laptop, QHD webcam laptop, premium corporate ultrabook, ultra-lightweight executive laptop', NULL, 8, NULL, NULL),
(484, 'Acer Predator Helios Neo 16S AI PHN16S-71 Core Ultra 7 255HX RTX 5050 8GB GDDR7 Graphics 16 Inch Gaming Laptop', 'The International Office Solution 16\" 240Hz OLED AI Workstation (Abyssal Black) is an absolute powerhouse engineered for elite creative professionals, AI developers, and hardcore data scientists. Supercharged by the cutting-edge Intel Core Ultra 7 255HX processor with a dedicated 33 TOPS AI NPU, and paired with the next-generation NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5050 boasting 8GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 VRAM, it completely shatters the boundaries of mobile performance. Featuring a breathtaking 16-inch WQXGA OLED 240Hz display, blistering 6400MHz DDR5 memory, and uncompromising Killer networking, this 2.3kg desktop-replacement represents the absolute pinnacle of modern mobile workstations.', 'acer-predator-helios-neo-16s-ai-phn16s-71-core-ultra-7-255hx-rtx-5050-8gb-gddr7-graphics-16-inch-gaming-laptop-1781271709', '<p>Step into the next generation of extreme computational and graphical performance with the <strong>International Office Solution</strong> 16-inch Premium AI Workstation. Encased in a formidable \"Abyssal Black\" chassis, this system is an engineering marvel designed for users who require absolute, uncompromised desktop-tier power on the go. At the very core of this beast lies the revolutionary Intel Core Ultra 7 255HX processor. Boasting a massive 20-core, 20-thread architecture that boosts up to a blistering 5.2 GHz, it is designed to crush the most demanding multi-threaded enterprise applications. Crucially, this processor integrates the Intel AI Boost NPU, delivering 33 TOPS (Tera Operations Per Second) of dedicated artificial intelligence acceleration. This allows professionals to run local AI models, generative workflows, and advanced data analytics with unprecedented efficiency and speed.</p><p>Graphical performance is equally groundbreaking. This workstation is armed with the next-generation NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5050 GPU, featuring 8GB of revolutionary GDDR7 VRAM. This massive leap in memory bandwidth and graphical architecture unlocks unparalleled hardware acceleration for real-time 3D rendering, complex CAD simulations, and high-resolution video editing. To feed these incredibly powerful processors, the system is equipped with 16GB of Dual-Channel DDR5 memory operating at an astonishing 6400MHz, alongside a 1TB PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD. Recognizing the needs of enterprise power users, the system is highly future-proofed, offering dual soDIMM slots supporting up to 64GB of RAM and dual M.2 slots for up to 2TB of high-speed storage.</p><p>The visual experience is nothing short of spectacular. The 16-inch WQXGA (2560 x 1600) OLED display is a masterpiece of modern panel technology. Featuring a blazing 240Hz refresh rate, 100% DCI-P3 color gamut, and True Black HDR 500 certification, it delivers studio-grade color accuracy, infinite contrast, and buttery-smooth motion for both creative work and UI navigation. The 16:10 aspect ratio provides expansive vertical real estate, drastically improving daily productivity for coding and timeline editing.</p><p>Beyond its raw power and visual supremacy, the workstation is loaded with premium enterprise features. Communication is elevated to broadcast quality via a 1080p 60fps IR webcam with Temporal Noise Reduction and dual AI-noise-canceling microphones. Networking is handled by the elite Killer Ethernet E3100G and Killer Wi-Fi 6E 1675i, ensuring zero-latency, maximum-bandwidth connections to corporate servers. Complete with a customizable RGB-backlight keyboard, a moisture-resistant precision touchpad, massive 230W power delivery, and Windows 11 Home, this <strong>International Office Solution</strong> workstation is an unmatched, high-yield asset for elite professionals pushing the limits of technology.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Computing &amp; AI Engine</strong></td><td>Intel Core Ultra 7 255HX (20 Cores, 20 Threads, Up to 5.2GHz), 33 TOPS NPU</td><td>Revolutionary architecture with a dedicated Intel AI Boost NPU delivers extreme multi-threaded performance and massive local AI acceleration.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Graphics Processing</strong></td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5050 (8GB GDDR7 VRAM)</td><td>Next-generation GPU architecture with lightning-fast GDDR7 memory provides immense hardware acceleration for 3D rendering and complex simulations.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Architecture</strong></td><td>16GB Dual-Channel DDR5 6400MHz (Upgradeable to 64GB)</td><td>Blistering 6400MHz memory speeds guarantee flawless execution of heavy virtual machines, with massive expansion potential to future-proof your hardware.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage Solution</strong></td><td>1TB PCIe Gen 4 NVMe SSD (Upgradeable to 2TB)</td><td>High-speed Gen4 storage ensures instantaneous access to large project files, with a secondary slot for effortless future capacity expansion.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display &amp; Visuals</strong></td><td>16-inch WQXGA (2560x1600) OLED, 240Hz, 100% DCI-P3, HDR 500</td><td>Breathtaking OLED clarity combined with a 240Hz refresh rate provides studio-quality color accuracy, deep blacks, and unparalleled fluidity.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>A/V &amp; Input</strong></td><td>1080p 60fps IR WebCam, DTS:X Ultra Audio, RGB Keyboard, Moisture-Resistant Touchpad</td><td>Delivers high-framerate broadcast-quality video and premium inputs designed for supreme comfort and durability during long working hours.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Network &amp; I/O</strong></td><td>Killer Wi-Fi 6E (1675i), Killer 2.5G LAN (E3100G), 1x Type-C (3.2 Gen 2), HDMI</td><td>Elite, gaming-grade networking hardware ensures massive, prioritized bandwidth for flawless cloud computing and enormous data migrations.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design, Power &amp; OS</strong></td><td>Abyssal Black Chassis (2.3kg), 230W AC Adapter, 76Wh Battery</td><td>A formidable, highly professional aesthetic paired with a massive 230W power supply to feed the high-wattage CPU and dedicated GPU.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'Laptop', 285000.00, 285000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/YgWHwi9ERxD5iptanmIQlwqVkS6kfwnrDOaBzKh1.webp', 'products/videos/FZZk8WCoOCYxEgXcGBaEHXZB7QRm9lwmeoV5KpC6.mp4', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 13:41:49', '2026-07-16 16:09:20', 'International Office Solution 16\" OLED AI Workstation | RTX 5050 & Core Ultra 7', 'Shatter performance limits with the International Office Solution 16\" OLED Workstation. Features Intel Core Ultra 7 255HX, RTX 5050 8GB GDDR7, 16GB 6400MHz RAM, and a 240Hz display.', 'International Office Solution workstation, 16 inch OLED laptop, RTX 5050 laptop, GDDR7 VRAM laptop, Intel Core Ultra 7 255HX computer, 240Hz OLED professional laptop, 33 TOPS AI laptop, 64GB RAM upgradeable workstation, Killer Wi-Fi 6E business PC, Abyssal Black laptop', NULL, 8, NULL, NULL),
