(486, 'Acer Predator Helios Neo 16S AI PHN16S-71 Core Ultra 7 255HX RTX 5070 8GB Graphics 16 Inch OLED Gaming Laptop', 'The International Office Solution 16\" 240Hz OLED AI Workstation (Abyssal Black) is an uncompromising, vanguard desktop-replacement engineered for elite creative professionals, AI developers, and demanding enterprise power users. Supercharged by the revolutionary Intel Core Ultra 7 255HX processor with a dedicated 33 TOPS AI NPU, and armed with the next-generation NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 featuring 8GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 VRAM, it redefines the absolute limits of mobile performance. Complete with a breathtaking 16-inch WQXGA OLED 240Hz display, blistering 6400MHz Dual-Channel DDR5 memory, Killer networking, and a broadcast-quality 60fps IR webcam, this formidable 2.3kg workstation provides uncompromised, studio-grade power for the most intensive workflows.', 'acer-predator-helios-neo-16s-ai-phn16s-71-core-ultra-7-255hx-rtx-5070-8gb-graphics-16-inch-oled-gaming-laptop-1781271908', '<p>tep into the future of extreme computational and graphical performance with the <strong>International Office Solution</strong> 16-inch Premium AI Workstation. Encased in a highly durable, sophisticated \"Abyssal Black\" chassis, this system is an engineering marvel designed exclusively for professionals who refuse to compromise on speed, visual fidelity, or hardware acceleration. At the very core of this machine lies the groundbreaking Intel Core Ultra 7 255HX processor. Boasting a massive 20-core, 20-thread architecture that boosts up to a blistering 5.2 GHz, it is purpose-built to crush intense multi-threaded enterprise applications, complex code compilation, and massive database queries. Crucially, this processor integrates the Intel AI Boost NPU, delivering 33 TOPS (Tera Operations Per Second) of dedicated artificial intelligence acceleration. This empowers professionals to run local AI models, generative workflows, and advanced data analytics with unprecedented efficiency, leaving traditional processors far behind.</p><p>Graphical performance is equally revolutionary and built for the most demanding rendering tasks. This workstation is equipped with the next-generation NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 GPU, featuring 8GB of cutting-edge GDDR7 VRAM. This massive leap in memory bandwidth and graphical architecture unlocks unparalleled hardware acceleration for real-time 3D rendering, complex CAD simulations, high-resolution video editing, and immersive architectural walkthroughs. To feed these incredibly powerful processors without any bottlenecks, the system is loaded with 16GB of Dual-Channel DDR5 memory operating at an astonishing 6400MHz, alongside a rapid 1TB PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD. Recognizing the evolving needs of enterprise power users, the system is exceptionally future-proof, offering dual soDIMM slots for a massive upgrade path to 64GB of RAM, and dual M.2 slots to expand high-speed storage up to 2TB.</p><p>The visual experience is nothing short of spectacular. The 16-inch WQXGA (2560 x 1600) CineCrystal OLED display is a true masterpiece of modern panel technology. Featuring a blazing 240Hz refresh rate, 100% DCI-P3 color gamut, and True Black HDR 500 certification, it delivers studio-grade color accuracy, infinite contrast, and buttery-smooth motion for both precise creative work and fluid UI navigation. The 16:10 aspect ratio provides expansive vertical real estate, drastically improving daily productivity for coding, spreadsheet analysis, and timeline editing.</p><p>Beyond its raw power and visual supremacy, the workstation is loaded with premium, uncompromising enterprise features. Virtual communication is elevated to secure, broadcast quality via a 1080p HD IR webcam operating at a silky 60 frames per second with Temporal Noise Reduction, paired with dual built-in microphones featuring AI noise cancellation and DTS X:Ultra Audio. Networking is flawless thanks to the elite Killer Ethernet E3100G and Killer Wi-Fi 6E 1675i, ensuring zero-latency, maximum-bandwidth connections to corporate servers. Complete with a customizable RGB-backlight keyboard, a moisture-resistant precision touchpad, massive 230W power delivery, and Windows 11 Home, this <strong>International Office Solution</strong> workstation is an unmatched, high-yield asset for elite professionals pushing the boundaries of modern technology.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Computing &amp; AI Engine</strong></td><td>Intel Core Ultra 7 255HX (20 Cores, 20 Threads, Up to 5.2GHz), 33 TOPS NPU</td><td>Revolutionary architecture with a dedicated Intel AI Boost NPU delivers extreme multi-threaded performance and massive local AI acceleration.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Graphics Processing</strong></td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 (8GB GDDR7 VRAM)</td><td>Next-generation GPU architecture with lightning-fast GDDR7 memory provides immense hardware acceleration for heavy 3D rendering and complex simulations.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Architecture</strong></td><td>16GB Dual-Channel DDR5 6400MHz (Upgradeable to 64GB)</td><td>Blistering 6400MHz memory speeds guarantee flawless execution of heavy virtual machines, with dual slots allowing workstation-class 64GB expansion.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage Solution</strong></td><td>1TB PCIe NVMe Gen 4 SSD (Upgradeable to 2TB)</td><td>High-speed Gen4 solid-state storage ensures instantaneous access to massive project files, with dual M.2 slots for effortless future capacity scaling.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display &amp; Visuals</strong></td><td>16-inch WQXGA (2560x1600) OLED, 240Hz, 100% DCI-P3, HDR 500</td><td>Breathtaking OLED clarity combined with a 240Hz refresh rate provides studio-quality color accuracy, deep blacks, and unparalleled visual fluidity.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>A/V &amp; Input</strong></td><td>1080p 60fps IR WebCam with TNR, RGB Keyboard, Moisture-Resistant Touchpad</td><td>Delivers high-framerate broadcast-quality video with secure IR login, alongside premium inputs designed for supreme comfort and durability.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Network &amp; I/O</strong></td><td>Killer Wi-Fi 6E (1675i), Killer 2.5G LAN (E3100G), 1x Type-C (3.2 Gen 2), HDMI</td><td>Elite, gaming-grade networking hardware ensures massive, prioritized, and stable bandwidth for flawless cloud computing and enormous data migrations.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design, Power &amp; OS</strong></td><td>Abyssal Black Chassis (2.3kg), 230W AC Adapter, 76Wh Battery</td><td>A formidable, highly professional aesthetic paired with a massive 230W power supply to feed the high-wattage CPU and dedicated RTX 5070 GPU.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'Laptop', 325000.00, 325000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/nf6ySAUr6f6hUKhtxiDVvkOJfeUs9kEITuiJRT5X.webp', 'products/videos/H2lEAyh6Gxcc8Ef8KgIGgKT7t8ZG3ynT17l1FPk6.mp4', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 13:45:08', '2026-07-16 16:08:55', 'International Office Solution 16\" OLED AI Workstation | RTX 5070 & Core Ultra 7', 'Command your professional workflow with the International Office Solution 16\" OLED Workstation. Features Intel Core Ultra 7 255HX, RTX 5070 GDDR7, 16GB 6400MHz RAM, and a 240Hz display', 'International Office Solution workstation, 16 inch OLED laptop, RTX 5070 laptop, GDDR7 VRAM laptop, Intel Core Ultra 7 255HX computer, 240Hz OLED professional laptop, 33 TOPS AI laptop, 64GB RAM upgradeable workstation, Killer Wi-Fi 6E business PC, Abyssal Black AI PC', NULL, 8, NULL, NULL),
(487, 'Acer Predator Helios Neo 16 AI-PH16-73 Core Ultra 9 275HX RTX 5090 24GB Graphics 32GB DDR5 RAM 16 Inch OLED Gaming Laptop iosbd', 'The International Office Solution 16\" 240Hz OLED Flagship AI Workstation (Abyssal Black) is the absolute pinnacle of mobile computing, engineered for elite AI researchers, top-tier creative professionals, and enterprise data scientists. Powered by the monstrous Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX 24-core processor with a 36 TOPS NPU, and armed with the industry-leading NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090 featuring a massive 24GB of GDDR7 VRAM, it completely obliterates traditional performance barriers. Boasting a jaw-dropping 16-inch WQXGA OLED 240Hz display, 32GB of 6400MHz DDR5 RAM, and a revolutionary 2TB Gen5/Gen4 dual-drive storage array, this 2.3kg titan is the ultimate desktop-replacement for those who demand uncompromising supremacy.', 'acer-predator-helios-neo-16-ai-ph16-73-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5090-24gb-graphics-32gb-ddr5-ram-16-inch-oled-gaming-laptop-iosbd-1784218041', '<p>The <strong>International Office Solution</strong> 16\" 240Hz OLED Flagship AI Workstation (Abyssal Black) is the absolute pinnacle of mobile computing, engineered for elite AI researchers, top-tier creative professionals, and enterprise data scientists. Powered by the monstrous Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX 24-core processor with a 36 TOPS NPU, and armed with the industry-leading NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090 featuring a massive 24GB of GDDR7 VRAM, it completely obliterates traditional performance barriers. Boasting a jaw-dropping 16-inch WQXGA OLED 240Hz display, 32GB of 6400MHz DDR5 RAM, and a revolutionary 2TB Gen5/Gen4 dual-drive storage array, this 2.3kg titan is the ultimate desktop-replacement for those who demand uncompromising&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Computing &amp; AI Engine</strong></td><td>Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX (24 Cores, 24 Threads, Up to 5.4GHz), 36 TOPS NPU</td><td>The absolute apex of mobile processing; delivers monstrous multi-threaded performance and massive local AI acceleration capabilities.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Graphics Processing</strong></td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090 (24GB GDDR7 VRAM)</td><td>The flagship GPU architecture with an immense 24GB frame buffer; handles cinematic rendering, deep learning, and 8K video flawlessly.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Architecture</strong></td><td>32GB DDR5 6400MHz (1x 32GB, Upgradeable to 64GB)</td><td>Blistering 6400MHz memory speeds with an open slot perfectly positioned for an immediate, hassle-free upgrade to workstation-class 64GB.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage Solution</strong></td><td>2TB Total Storage (1x PCIe Gen 5 SSD + 1x PCIe Gen 4 SSD)</td><td>Revolutionary Gen 5 storage speeds ensure the fastest possible boot times and data transfers currently available on the market.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display &amp; Visuals</strong></td><td>16-inch WQXGA (2560x1600) OLED, 240Hz, 500 Nits, HDR 500</td><td>Breathtaking OLED clarity combined with a 240Hz refresh rate provides transcendent color accuracy, deep blacks, and hyper-fluid motion.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>A/V &amp; Input</strong></td><td>1080p 60fps IR WebCam with TNR, RGB Keyboard, Moisture-Resistant Touchpad</td><td>Delivers high-framerate broadcast video with secure facial recognition, alongside premium inputs designed for durability.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Network &amp; I/O</strong></td><td>Killer Wi-Fi 6E (1675i), Killer 2.5G LAN (E3100G), 1x Type-C (3.2 Gen 2), HDMI</td><td>Elite, gaming-grade networking hardware ensures massive, prioritized, and stable bandwidth for flawless cloud computing.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design, Power &amp; OS</strong></td><td>Abyssal Black Chassis (2.3kg), 330W AC Adapter, 90Wh Battery</td><td>A formidable, highly professional aesthetic paired with a massive 330W power supply and 90Wh battery to feed flagship-tier hardware.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Laptop', 660000.00, 660000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/BHQGe9YdnpiQNs1D2mCAReNQk43njXEUprG2rLxR.webp', 'products/videos/AKIzx0vjgrHYGgTO9YebDS9TaDgkExG2JubNb2Tv.mp4', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 13:48:50', '2026-07-16 16:07:21', 'nternational Office Solution 16\" Flagship OLED Workstation | RTX 5090 & Core Ultra 9', 'nternational Office Solution 16\" Flagship OLED Workstation | RTX 5090 & Core Ultra 9Command ultimate power with the International Office Solution 16\" OLED Flagship Workstation. Features Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX, RTX 5090 24GB, 32GB RAM, 2TB Gen5 SSD, and a 240Hz display.', 'nternational Office Solution workstation, 16 inch OLED laptop, RTX 5090 laptop, 24GB VRAM laptop, Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX computer, 240Hz OLED professional laptop, 36 TOPS AI laptop, Gen 5 NVMe SSD laptop, Killer Wi-Fi 6E PC, Abyssal Black AI PC', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(489, 'Epson Projector  EB-E10 3600 Lumens XGA 3LCD', 'The Epson EB-E10 is a 3600 lumens XGA 3LCD projector designed for classrooms, training centers, and business presentations. Featuring Epson’s advanced 3LCD technology, XGA resolution, vivid color accuracy, and up to 12,000 hours lamp life in ECO mode, it delivers bright and engaging presentations even in well-lit environments. With HDMI, VGA, and USB connectivity, along with a portable and easy-to-install design, the Epson EB-E10 is a reliable projection solution available from International Office Solution (IOS).', 'epson-projector-eb-e10-3600-lumens-xga-3lcd-1781278746', '<p>The Epson EB-E10 3600 Lumens XGA 3LCD Projector is an ideal projection solution for classrooms, training centers, educational institutions, and business meeting environments. Designed with Epson’s advanced 3LCD technology, this projector delivers outstanding color accuracy and equal Color Brightness and White Brightness, ensuring vibrant and engaging presentations even in well-lit rooms.</p><p>With 3,600 lumens of brightness and XGA (1024 × 768) resolution, the Epson EB-E10 provides clear text, vivid images, and sharp presentation materials that help maintain audience attention and improve learning experiences. Whether displaying educational content, business reports, videos, or training materials, the projector delivers consistent and reliable performance.</p><h2>Brilliant Brightness and Color Accuracy</h2><p>The Epson EB-E10 offers 3,600 lumens of both color and white brightness, producing bright, vivid, and natural-looking images. Epson’s 3LCD technology ensures accurate color reproduction without the rainbow effect commonly associated with other projection technologies, making presentations more impactful and engaging.</p><h2>XGA Resolution for Clear Presentations</h2><p>Featuring native XGA (1024 × 768) resolution, the projector provides sharp text, detailed graphics, and clear visual content. It is perfectly suited for educational lessons, business presentations, spreadsheets, charts, and multimedia applications.</p><h2>Flexible and Portable Design</h2><p>The lightweight and compact design of the Epson EB-E10 allows easy transportation and installation in different classrooms, conference rooms, or training environments. Its flexible setup capabilities help users quickly deploy presentations without additional hassle.</p><h2>Extensive Connectivity Options</h2><p>The projector supports a wide range of modern and legacy devices through multiple connectivity interfaces, including:</p><ul><li>HDMI</li><li>VGA</li><li>USB</li></ul><p>These versatile connections allow seamless integration with laptops, desktop computers, media players, document cameras, and other presentation equipment without requiring additional adapters.</p><h2>Long Lamp Life and Reduced Maintenance</h2><p>The Epson EB-E10 is designed to minimize maintenance costs and maximize operational efficiency.</p><p>Lamp Life Performance:</p><ul><li>Normal Mode: Up to 6,000 Hours</li><li>ECO Mode: Up to 12,000 Hours</li></ul><p>The extended lamp life reduces replacement frequency, lowers operating expenses, and ensures long-term reliability for educational and business users.</p><h2>Reliable Performance for Education and Business</h2><p>Whether used in schools, colleges, universities, offices, or training facilities, the Epson EB-E10 delivers dependable performance with bright visuals and accurate colors. Its user-friendly operation and durable design make it an excellent choice for daily presentations and learning activities.</p><h2>Why Buy from International Office Solution (IOS)?</h2><p>International Office Solution (IOS) offers genuine Epson projectors with competitive pricing, professional consultation, installation support, and reliable after-sales service throughout Bangladesh. The Epson EB-E10 is a cost-effective and dependable projector that delivers excellent image quality, long lamp life, and versatile connectivity for classrooms and professional environments.</p><p>Warranty:</p><ul><li>1 Year Parts &amp; Service Warranty</li><li>Lamp Warranty: 6 Months or 500 Hours</li></ul><p>Contact International Office Solution today for the latest Epson EB-E10 price in Bangladesh and professional support.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>3LCD Technology</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>XGA (1024 × 768)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>Color Brightness: 3600 Lumens, White Brightness: 3600 Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>Tele: 22\" – 259\" (0.87 – 10.34 m), Wide: 30\" – 350\" (0.87 – 10.34 m)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>15,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Video Formats</td><td>Blackboard, Cinema, Dynamic, Presentation, sRGB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Type</td><td>UHE, 210W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Up to 6,000 Hours (Normal), Up to 12,000 Hours (Eco Mode)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>USB 2.0 Type-B, VGA In, HDMI In</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Others</strong></td><td>Power Supply</td><td>100–240V AC ±10%, 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Fan Noise</td><td>37dB (Normal), 28dB (Eco)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Keystone Correction</td><td>Quick Corner</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Cool Down Period</td><td>Instant Off</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Operating Altitude</td><td>0 – 3,048 m (0 – 10,000 ft)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>External Features</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>2.4 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>302 × 77 × 234 mm (W × H × D)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Parts &amp; Service</td><td>1 Year</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Warranty</td><td>6 Months or 500 Hours</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 54000.00, 54000.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/tpKFsFRvIvuEMVkOs1SKDtazmo3Q2yWTkMiVymNf.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 15:39:06', '2026-06-12 15:39:06', 'Epson EB-E10 3600 Lumens XGA 3LCD Projector Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Epson EB-E10 3600 Lumens XGA 3LCD Projector in Bangladesh from International Office Solution (IOS). Features XGA resolution, 3LCD technology, 3600 lumens brightness, HDMI connectivity, and up to 12,000 hours lamp life.', 'Epson EB-E10 Price in Bangladesh, Epson EB-E10 Projector, Epson XGA Projector, Epson 3LCD Projector, 3600 Lumens Projector, Classroom Projector Bangladesh, Education Projector Bangladesh, Business Projector Bangladesh, Epson Projector Price Bangladesh, XGA Projector Bangladesh, Training Room Projector, Meeting Room Projector, Epson Multimedia Projector, Epson Presentation Projector, School Projector Bangladesh, Epson EB-E10 Bangladesh, International Office Solution, IOS Bangladesh, Epson Classroom Projector, Epson Business Projector.', NULL, 3, NULL, NULL);
