(490, 'Epson Projector EB-770Fi 4100 Lumens FHD Business Wireless Laser', 'The Epson EB-770Fi is a 4100 lumens Full HD interactive wireless laser projector featuring ultra-short throw technology, 150-inch display capability, advanced finger-touch and pen-based interactivity, and up to 20,000 hours of maintenance-free laser operation. With built-in wireless connectivity, Miracast, Wi-Fi Direct, split-screen collaboration, and Epson 3LCD technology, it delivers immersive presentations and collaborative learning experiences for classrooms and meeting rooms. Available from International Office Solution (IOS) with genuine warranty and professional support.', 'epson-projector-eb-770fi-4100-lumens-fhd-business-wireless-laser-1781279328', '<p>The <strong>Epson EB-770Fi 4100 Lumens Full HD Interactive Wireless Laser Projector</strong> is a cutting-edge ultra-short throw projection solution designed for modern classrooms, training centers, corporate meeting rooms, and collaborative workspaces. Combining advanced laser projection technology, Full HD image quality, interactive touch functionality, and wireless connectivity, this projector creates immersive learning and presentation experiences while maximizing room space and productivity.</p><p>Powered by Epson’s renowned 3LCD technology, the EB-770Fi delivers exceptional image quality with <strong>4,100 lumens of Color Brightness and White Brightness</strong>, ensuring vibrant, accurate colors and outstanding visibility even in brightly lit environments. Its ultra-short throw design allows users to project large images from a very short distance, minimizing shadows and glare while enhancing audience engagement.</p><h3>Stunning Full HD Interactive Display</h3><p>The Epson EB-770Fi features <strong>Full HD 1080p resolution</strong> and can project image sizes up to <strong>150 inches</strong>, creating a large, immersive display that is over three times larger than a traditional 75-inch flat-panel display. Whether used for educational content, business presentations, video conferencing, or collaborative discussions, the projector delivers sharp text, vivid graphics, and crystal-clear visuals.</p><h3>Ultra-Short Throw Design for Flexible Installation</h3><p>With a throw ratio of <strong>0.25 – 0.35</strong>, the projector can be installed close to the projection surface while producing a massive image. This design eliminates presenter shadows, reduces glare, and makes interactive sessions more comfortable and effective.</p><p>The ultra-short throw capability also helps maximize available classroom and meeting room space by transforming walls into large collaborative displays.</p><h3>Advanced Interactive Touch Technology</h3><p>The Epson EB-770Fi supports advanced interactive functionality with:</p><ul><li>Finger Touch Operation</li><li>Interactive Pen Support</li><li>Multi-User Collaboration</li><li>Real-Time Annotation</li><li>Interactive Whiteboard Features</li></ul><p>Teachers, trainers, and presenters can write, draw, edit, and interact directly on the projected image, creating a more engaging and collaborative environment.</p><h3>Powerful 4,100 Lumens Brightness</h3><p>The projector produces <strong>4,100 lumens of color and white brightness</strong>, ensuring clear visibility in classrooms, conference rooms, and training facilities with ambient lighting. Presentations remain vibrant and readable without requiring room lights to be dimmed.</p><h3>Maintenance-Free Laser Light Source</h3><p>Unlike traditional lamp projectors, the Epson EB-770Fi uses a long-life laser light source that provides up to <strong>20,000 hours of operation</strong> without requiring lamp replacements.</p><p>Benefits include:</p><ul><li>Lower Maintenance Costs</li><li>Reduced Downtime</li><li>Consistent Brightness Performance</li><li>Environmentally Friendly Operation</li></ul><p>This long lifespan significantly reduces the total cost of ownership.</p><h3>Flexible Aspect Ratio Support</h3><p>The projector supports multiple aspect ratios, allowing users to display various types of content effectively:</p><ul><li>16:9</li><li>16:6</li><li>4:3</li><li>16:10</li><li>21:9</li></ul><p>This flexibility makes it suitable for presentations, video conferencing, digital signage, and collaborative workspaces.</p><h3>Wireless Connectivity and Easy Collaboration</h3><p>The Epson EB-770Fi offers comprehensive wireless connectivity, allowing users to share content quickly from multiple devices.</p><p>Supported platforms include:</p><ul><li>Windows PC</li><li>Mac</li><li>Chromebook</li><li>Android Devices</li><li>iPhone and iPad</li></ul><p>Wireless technologies include:</p><ul><li>Wi-Fi Direct</li><li>Wireless LAN (IEEE 802.11a/b/g/n/ac)</li><li>Miracast</li></ul><p>This enables seamless content sharing without complicated cable connections.</p><h3>Split-Screen Collaboration</h3><p>The projector supports displaying up to four content sources simultaneously on a single screen. This feature is ideal for:</p><ul><li>Group Discussions</li><li>Classroom Collaboration</li><li>Team Meetings</li><li>Comparative Analysis</li><li>Interactive Workshops</li></ul><p>Multiple users can contribute content at the same time, improving teamwork and engagement.</p><h3>Comprehensive Connectivity Options</h3><p>The Epson EB-770Fi offers extensive connectivity for modern and legacy devices:</p><ul><li>HDMI × 3</li><li>VGA Input × 2</li><li>VGA Output × 1</li><li>USB Type-A × 2</li><li>USB Type-B × 2</li><li>Ethernet LAN</li><li>RS-232C</li><li>Audio Input × 3</li><li>Audio Output</li><li>Microphone Input</li><li>Composite Video Input</li><li>Miracast</li><li>Optional Multi-Touch Interface</li></ul><p>These versatile connections ensure seamless integration into any educational or business environment.</p><h3>Energy Efficient Performance</h3><p>The projector consumes:</p><ul><li>197W (Normal Mode)</li><li>199W (Eco Mode)</li><li>263W (Peak)</li><li>Less than 0.5W in Standby Mode</li></ul><p>Its energy-efficient design helps reduce operational costs while maintaining exceptional performance.</p><h3>Why Buy from International Office Solution (IOS)?</h3><p><strong>International Office Solution (IOS)</strong> is a trusted supplier of genuine Epson projectors in Bangladesh, offering competitive pricing, expert consultation, installation assistance, and reliable after-sales support. Whether you need an interactive classroom projector, a collaborative meeting room solution, or a professional presentation system, the Epson EB-770Fi delivers industry-leading performance, advanced interactivity, and long-term reliability.</p><p>Contact <strong>International Office Solution (IOS)</strong> today to get the latest price and professional support for the Epson EB-770Fi 4100 Lumens Full HD Interactive Wireless Laser Projector.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Display Technology</td><td>3LCD Technology</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>Full HD 1080p (1920 × 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Brightness</td><td>4,100 Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Throw Ratio</td><td>0.25 – 0.35</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>Over 5,000,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Details</td><td>Lamp Power</td><td>197W</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Details</td><td>Light Source Life</td><td>Up to 20,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB 2.0 Type-A</td><td>2 × USB 2.0 Type-A</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB 2.0 Type-B</td><td>2 × USB 2.0 Type-B (Service Only)</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>RS-232C</td><td>1 × RS-232C</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Ethernet</td><td>100 Base-TX / 10 Base-T LAN</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Wireless LAN</td><td>IEEE 802.11a/b/g/n/ac</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Wi-Fi Direct</td><td>Supported</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>VGA Input</td><td>2 × VGA In</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>VGA Output</td><td>1 × VGA Out</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>HDMI Input</td><td>3 × HDMI In</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Composite Video Input</td><td>1 × Composite In</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Miracast</td><td>Supported</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>1 × Jack Plug Out</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Audio Input</td><td>3 × Jack Plug In</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Microphone Input</td><td>Supported</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Sync In/Out</td><td>Supported</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Multi-Touch Interface</td><td>Optional</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Normal Power Consumption</td><td>197W</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Peak Power Consumption</td><td>263W</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Eco Mode Power Consumption</td><td>199W</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Standby Power Consumption</td><td>0.5W</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Specification</td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Specification</td><td>Weight</td><td>6 kg</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Specification</td><td>Dimensions (W × D × H)</td><td>356 × 395 × 133 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Parts &amp; Service Warranty</td><td>2 Years</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Lamp Warranty</td><td>12 Months or 1000 Hours</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 445000.00, 445000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/faFdpSq2xfSiodVFqmgwSvo2ezR5StLJMVxMjf3q.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 15:48:48', '2026-06-12 15:48:48', 'Epson EB-770Fi 4100 Lumens Full HD Interactive Wireless Laser Projector Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Epson EB-770Fi 4100 Lumens Full HD Interactive Wireless Laser Projector in Bangladesh from International Office Solution (IOS). Features ultra-short throw projection, interactive touch technology, wireless connectivity, 150-inch display, and 20,000-hour laser light source.', 'Epson EB-770Fi Price in Bangladesh, Epson EB-770Fi Projector, Epson Interactive Projector, Epson Wireless Laser Projector, Full HD Interactive Projector, Ultra Short Throw Projector Bangladesh, Classroom Projector Bangladesh, Business Laser Projector, Epson 4100 Lumens Projector, Interactive Whiteboard Projector, Epson Education Projector, Wireless Presentation Projector, Epson Laser Projector Price Bangladesh, Epson FHD Projector, Meeting Room Projector Bangladesh, Epson EB-770Fi Bangladesh, International Office Solution, IOS Bangladesh, Epson Interactive Display Solution, Epson Business Projector.', NULL, 3, NULL, NULL),
(491, 'Eps on Projector EB-L530U 5200 Lumens WUXGA Long-throw Laser', 'The Epson EB-L520U is a professional 5200 lumens WUXGA 3LCD laser projector designed for large classrooms, conference rooms, and corporate environments. Featuring WUXGA (1920 × 1200) resolution, a 2,500,000:1 contrast ratio, projection sizes up to 500 inches, HDBaseT connectivity, and a maintenance-free laser light source with up to 20,000 hours lifespan, it delivers exceptional image quality and reliability. Available from International Office Solution (IOS) with genuine warranty and professional support.', 'eps-on-projector-eb-l530u-5200-lumens-wuxga-long-throw-laser-1781280112', '<p>The <strong>Epson EB-L520U 5200 Lumens WUXGA 3LCD Laser Projector</strong> is a professional-grade laser projection solution designed for large classrooms, conference rooms, auditoriums, training centers, houses of worship, and corporate environments. Combining powerful brightness, WUXGA Full HD resolution, advanced laser technology, and extensive connectivity options, the EB-L520U delivers exceptional image quality and long-term reliability for demanding business and educational applications.</p><p>Powered by Epson’s industry-leading <strong>3LCD technology</strong>, this projector produces equally high White Brightness and Color Brightness, ensuring vibrant and accurate color reproduction without compromising image clarity. With an impressive <strong>5,200 lumens brightness</strong> and <strong>WUXGA (1920 × 1200) resolution</strong>, the projector delivers sharp, detailed, and immersive visuals even in brightly lit environments.</p><h3>Brilliant WUXGA Resolution for Professional Presentations</h3><p>The Epson EB-L520U features native <strong>WUXGA (1920 × 1200)</strong> resolution, offering a higher pixel count than standard Full HD projectors. This enables sharper text, clearer graphics, and greater detail for presentations, spreadsheets, engineering drawings, educational content, and multimedia applications.</p><p>Its <strong>16:10 aspect ratio</strong> provides additional vertical screen space, making it ideal for business presentations and professional applications.</p><h3>Powerful 5,200 Lumens Brightness</h3><p>With <strong>5,200 lumens of Color and White Brightness</strong>, the EB-L520U delivers outstanding visibility in large meeting rooms, lecture halls, classrooms, and conference environments.</p><p>Benefits include:</p><ul><li>Clear presentations in ambient lighting</li><li>Enhanced visibility for large audiences</li><li>Bright and vibrant multimedia content</li><li>Improved readability of detailed information</li></ul><p>The projector ensures content remains impactful without requiring room lights to be dimmed.</p><h3>Advanced Laser Light Source Technology</h3><p>The Epson EB-L520U utilizes a maintenance-free laser light source designed for long-term performance and reliability.</p><p>Key advantages include:</p><ul><li>Up to 20,000 Hours Laser Life</li><li>No Lamp Replacement Required</li><li>Consistent Brightness Over Time</li><li>Reduced Maintenance Costs</li><li>Lower Total Cost of Ownership</li></ul><p>This laser technology ensures years of dependable operation for business and educational environments.</p><h3>Outstanding Contrast and Image Quality</h3><p>Featuring a remarkable <strong>2,500,000:1 contrast ratio</strong>, the projector produces deeper blacks, brighter whites, and enhanced image depth. Presentations, videos, and graphics appear more dynamic and realistic, providing a superior viewing experience.</p><h3>Large Screen Projection up to 500 Inches</h3><p>The Epson EB-L520U supports projection sizes of up to <strong>500 inches</strong>, making it suitable for:</p><ul><li>Large Conference Rooms</li><li>Lecture Theaters</li><li>Training Facilities</li><li>Auditoriums</li><li>Event Venues</li><li>Houses of Worship</li></ul><p>The large display capability ensures every audience member can clearly view content regardless of seating position.</p><h3>Flexible Installation Options</h3><p>Designed for professional installations, the projector offers extensive placement flexibility and supports long projection distances of up to <strong>78.21 feet</strong>.</p><p>Its installation-friendly design allows deployment in:</p><ul><li>Ceiling-mounted configurations</li><li>Large venue installations</li><li>Corporate meeting rooms</li><li>Educational facilities</li><li>Digital signage applications</li></ul><h3>Comprehensive Connectivity Options</h3><p>The Epson EB-L520U provides a wide range of connectivity options for modern AV environments.</p><p>Interfaces include:</p><ul><li>HDMI × 2</li><li>HDMI Output × 1</li><li>VGA Input × 2</li><li>USB Type-A</li><li>USB Type-B</li><li>Ethernet Port</li><li>HDBaseT</li><li>RS-232 Control</li><li>Audio Output</li><li>Wireless LAN Support</li></ul><p>These versatile connectivity options ensure seamless integration with laptops, PCs, media players, conferencing systems, and networked environments.</p><h3>Network and Wireless Collaboration</h3><p>Built-in network functionality and Wireless LAN support allow users to manage and share content efficiently across multiple devices.</p><p>Features include:</p><ul><li>Wireless Presentation Capability</li><li>Network Monitoring and Management</li><li>Remote Administration</li><li>Multi-Device Connectivity</li><li>Content Sharing Solutions</li></ul><p>This makes the projector an ideal solution for modern collaborative workplaces and educational institutions.</p><h3>Built for Business and Education</h3><p>The Epson EB-L520U is engineered to provide reliable performance in professional environments where image quality, uptime, and flexibility are essential. Its laser technology, high brightness, and advanced connectivity make it a powerful projection solution for long-term use.</p><h3>Why Buy from International Office Solution (IOS)?</h3><p><strong>International Office Solution (IOS)</strong> provides genuine Epson projectors with competitive pricing, professional consultation, installation support, and dependable after-sales service throughout Bangladesh. Whether you need a projector for a conference room, classroom, auditorium, or corporate environment, the Epson EB-L520U offers exceptional brightness, laser reliability, and professional-grade performance.</p><p>Contact <strong>International Office Solution (IOS)</strong> today for the latest Epson EB-L520U price in Bangladesh and expert projection solutions.</p>', '<p>Projection Features<br>Display Type<br>3LCD Technology<br>Resolution<br>WUXGA (1920 x 1200)<br>Brightness<br>5200 Lumens<br>Projection Distance<br>78.21 ft<br>Aspect Ratio<br>16:10<br>Contrast Ratio<br>2,500,000 : 1<br>Image Size<br>500 Inch<br>Lamp Details<br>Lamp Power<br>197 W<br>Lamp Life<br>20,000 hours<br>Audio<br>Built-in Speaker<br>Yes<br>Connectivity<br>Interface<br>2 x VGA, with Audio, 2 x HDMI, 1 x HDMI Out, RS-232, USB Type A &amp; B, Ethernet Port, HD-Base-T port , Audio out &amp; Wireless LAN<br>Power<br>100 V - 240 V, 50 Hz - 60 Hz AC<br>External Features<br>Color<br>White<br>Weight<br>8.2 kg<br>Dimension<br>440 x 339 x 136mm<br>Warranty<br>Manufacturing Warranty<br>02 years Parts &amp; Service warranty /Lamp: 12 Months or 1000hrs warrantyCategory&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Feature&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Specification</p>', 'PROJECTOR', 280000.00, 280000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/gnOuMuslfvwpI1jzIB4j4SYSmor1yOvD6FeYfg6P.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 16:01:52', '2026-06-12 16:01:52', 'Epson EB-L520U 5200 Lumens WUXGA 3LCD Laser Projector Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Epson EB-L520U 5200 Lumens WUXGA 3LCD Laser Projector in Bangladesh from International Office Solution (IOS). Features WUXGA resolution, 20,000-hour laser light source, HDBaseT, wireless LAN, 500-inch display, and 5,200 lumens brightness.', 'Epson EB-L520U Price in Bangladesh, Epson EB-L520U Projector, Epson Laser Projector Bangladesh, Epson WUXGA Projector, 5200 Lumens Projector, Epson 3LCD Laser Projector, Conference Room Projector Bangladesh, Business Projector Bangladesh, Epson Professional Projector, HDBaseT Projector, Wireless Presentation Projector, Epson Large Venue Projector, Epson Education Projector, WUXGA Laser Projector Bangladesh, Epson Projector Price Bangladesh, Epson EB-L520U Bangladesh, International Office Solution, IOS Bangladesh, Corporate Projector Solution, Epson Business Laser Projector.', NULL, 3, NULL, NULL),
(492, 'EpsonProjector  EB-2155W 5000 Lumens LCD', 'The Epson EB-2155W 5000 Lumens WXGA 3LCD Projector delivers bright, sharp, and professional-quality visuals with WXGA resolution, 15,000:1 contrast ratio, and 3LCD technology. Featuring a 300W lamp with up to 10,000 hours Eco life, 16W stereo speaker, and extensive connectivity including HDMI, VGA, USB, and wireless LAN, it is ideal for classrooms, offices, and conference rooms. Available from International Office Solution (IOS) with full warranty and support.', 'epsonprojector-eb-2155w-5000-lumens-lcd-1781280573', '<p>The <strong>Epson EB-2155W 5000 Lumens WXGA 3LCD Projector</strong> is a high-performance projection solution designed for corporate presentations, classrooms, training centers, and large meeting environments. Built with Epson’s advanced 3LCD technology, this projector delivers bright, vibrant, and highly accurate color reproduction, ensuring professional-quality visuals in any lighting condition.</p><p>With <strong>5000 lumens of brightness</strong> and <strong>WXGA (1280 × 800) resolution</strong>, the Epson EB-2155W produces sharp, clear, and detailed images, making it ideal for presentations, lectures, business reports, and multimedia content. Its <strong>16:10 aspect ratio</strong> provides extra vertical space, allowing more content to be displayed clearly on screen.</p><h3>Bright and Clear Professional Projection</h3><p>The Epson EB-2155W is engineered to perform exceptionally well in well-lit environments. Its powerful 5000 lumens output ensures that images remain bright and visible even in large conference halls and classrooms without needing to dim the lights.</p><p>The <strong>15,000:1 contrast ratio</strong> enhances image depth by producing deeper blacks and brighter whites, improving readability and visual impact for all types of content including charts, text, and videos.</p><h3>Advanced 3LCD Color Technology</h3><p>Powered by Epson’s <strong>3LCD technology</strong>, the EB-2155W delivers equal White and Color Brightness, ensuring natural and vibrant color reproduction. This eliminates color distortion and rainbow effects, providing consistent image quality for professional presentations and educational use.</p><h3>Flexible Projection Size and Distance</h3><p>The projector supports a wide range of installation possibilities:</p><ul><li>Screen Size: <strong>29 inches to 280 inches</strong></li><li>Projection Distance: <strong>2.95 ft to 28 ft</strong></li></ul><p>This flexibility makes it suitable for small meeting rooms, medium classrooms, and large conference spaces.</p><h3>Powerful 300W Lamp with Long Life</h3><p>Equipped with a durable <strong>300W lamp</strong>, the Epson EB-2155W offers strong brightness performance and long operational life.</p><p>Lamp life performance:</p><ul><li>Normal Mode: Up to 5,000 hours</li><li>Eco Mode: Up to 10,000 hours</li></ul><p>This reduces maintenance frequency and ensures long-term cost efficiency.</p><h3>Built-in 16W Stereo Speaker</h3><p>The projector includes a <strong>16W stereo speaker system</strong>, delivering clear and powerful audio output without the need for external speakers. This makes it convenient for presentations, training sessions, and classroom teaching.</p><h3>Extensive Connectivity Options</h3><p>The Epson EB-2155W offers a wide range of connectivity interfaces for maximum compatibility:</p><ul><li>HDMI × 2</li><li>USB 2.0 Type-A &amp; Type-B</li><li>VGA In/Out</li><li>Composite Video Input</li><li>RGB In/Out</li><li>MHL Support</li><li>RS-232C Control Port</li><li>Audio In/Out</li><li>Wireless LAN Support</li></ul><p>These options allow seamless integration with laptops, PCs, media players, and mobile devices using the Epson Projection App.</p><h3>Compact and Portable Design</h3><p>Despite its powerful performance, the Epson EB-2155W remains compact and easy to install:</p><ul><li>Weight: <strong>4.3 kg</strong></li><li>Dimensions: <strong>377 × 291 × 101 mm</strong></li><li>Color: White</li></ul><p>Its lightweight design makes it suitable for both fixed installation and portable usage.</p><h3>Reliable Performance for Education and Business</h3><p>The Epson EB-2155W is designed to deliver consistent, long-term performance for educators, business professionals, and event organizers. Its brightness, clarity, and flexible connectivity make it a dependable choice for any professional environment.</p><h3>Why Buy from International Office Solution (IOS)?</h3><p><strong>International Office Solution (IOS)</strong> provides genuine Epson projectors in Bangladesh with competitive pricing, expert consultation, installation support, and reliable after-sales service. Whether for classrooms, corporate meetings, or training environments, the Epson EB-2155W ensures high brightness, excellent image quality, and long-lasting performance.</p><p>Contact <strong>International Office Solution (IOS)</strong> today for the best Epson EB-2155W price in Bangladesh and professional support.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Technology</td><td>3LCD</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>WXGA (1280 × 800)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:10</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>15,000:1</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>2.95 ft (Min) – 28 ft (Max)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Image Size</td><td>29\" – 280\"</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Power</td><td>300W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>5,000 hours (Normal) / 10,000 hours (Eco)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>16W Stereo</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>USB</td><td>1 × USB 2.0 Type-A, 1 × USB 2.0 Type-B</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>RS-232C</td><td>1 × Port</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>VGA</td><td>2 × VGA In, 1 × VGA Out</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI</td><td>2 × HDMI In</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Composite Video</td><td>1 × Composite In</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>RGB</td><td>2 × RGB In, 1 × RGB Out</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>MHL</td><td>1 × MHL</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Audio Ports</td><td>2 × Stereo Mini Jack In, 1 × Stereo Mini Jack Out</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Wireless</td><td>Wireless LAN (b/g/n, 2.4GHz), Epson Projection App</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Supply</td><td>100–240V AC ±10%, 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td><td>Weight</td><td>4.3 kg</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td><td>Dimensions (W × D × H)</td><td>377 × 291 × 101 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Parts &amp; Service Warranty</td><td>2 Years</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Lamp Warranty</td><td>12 Months or 1000 Hours</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 242000.00, 242000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/zAUi5qxNqcWFNffTY3SD3LddDgtHPnAguerckCVb.jpg', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 16:09:33', '2026-06-12 16:09:33', 'Epson EB-2155W 5000 Lumens WXGA 3LCD Projector Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'https://chatgpt.com/c/6a2a3357-edd0-83e8-b879-a6e11860f78c#:~:text=Buy%20Epson%20EB%2D2155W%205000%20Lumens%20WXGA%203LCD%20Projector%20in%20Bangladesh%20from%20International%20Office%20Solution%20(IOS).%20Features%20WXGA%20resolution%2C%203LCD%20technology%2C%205000%20lumens%20brightness%2C%20280%2Dinch%20display%2C%20HDMI%2C%20VGA%2C%20USB%2C%20and%20wireless%20LAN%20support.', 'Epson EB-2155W Price in Bangladesh, Epson EB-2155W Projector, Epson WXGA Projector, Epson 3LCD Projector, 5000 Lumens Projector Bangladesh, Classroom Projector Bangladesh, Business Projector Bangladesh, Epson Presentation Projector, Meeting Room Projector, Epson Projector Price Bangladesh, Epson 280 Inch Projector, Wireless Projector Bangladesh, HDMI Projector Bangladesh, Epson Multimedia Projector, Training Room Projector, Epson EB-2155W Bangladesh, International Office Solution, IOS Bangladesh, Epson Professional Projector, Epson Office Projector', NULL, 3, NULL, NULL),
(493, 'Epson Projector EB-2250U 5000 Lumens 3LCD WUXGA', 'The Epson EB-2250U 5000 Lumens WUXGA 3LCD Projector delivers exceptional brightness, sharp WUXGA resolution, and advanced collaboration features including split-screen, multi-PC projection, and gesture control. With dual HDMI, wireless support, and Epson 3LCD technology, it is ideal for business meetings, classrooms, and large presentation environments. Available from International Office Solution (IOS) with official warranty and support.', 'epson-projector-eb-2250u-5000-lumens-3lcd-wuxga-1781280881', '<p>The <strong>Epson EB-2250U 5000 Lumens WUXGA 3LCD Projector</strong> is a high-performance professional projection solution designed for corporate meetings, classrooms, training centers, and large presentation environments. Engineered with Epson’s advanced <strong>3LCD technology</strong>, it delivers outstanding color accuracy, sharp image quality, and reliable performance, ensuring every presentation appears vibrant, clear, and engaging.</p><p>With <strong>5,000 lumens of brightness</strong> and <strong>WUXGA (1920 × 1200) resolution</strong>, the Epson EB-2250U produces crisp Full HD visuals even in brightly lit rooms, making it ideal for conference halls, auditoriums, and educational institutions where clarity and visibility are essential.</p><h3>Brilliant Visual Performance for Professional Use</h3><p>The EB-2250U ensures superior image quality with true-to-life colors and enhanced detail reproduction. Epson’s 3LCD technology eliminates rainbow effects and maintains consistent brightness across all content types, including presentations, videos, spreadsheets, and graphics.</p><p>Its <strong>high brightness output (5000 lumens)</strong> guarantees clear visibility even in well-lit environments, ensuring audiences can easily follow content from any position in the room.</p><h3>WUXGA Resolution for Enhanced Detail</h3><p>With <strong>WUXGA (1920 × 1200) resolution</strong>, the projector offers more screen space and sharper detail compared to standard Full HD projectors. This makes it ideal for:</p><ul><li>Business presentations</li><li>Data visualization</li><li>Engineering drawings</li><li>Educational content</li><li>Multimedia presentations</li></ul><p>The 16:10 aspect ratio also provides additional vertical space for improved productivity.</p><h3>Advanced Collaboration Features</h3><p>The Epson EB-2250U is built for modern collaborative environments, offering powerful features such as:</p><ul><li>Split-Screen Projection (Side-by-Side Display)</li><li>Multi-PC Projection (Up to 50 Devices)</li><li>Screen Mirroring Support</li><li>Gesture Presenter Control</li></ul><p>These features enable multiple users to share content simultaneously, improving teamwork, interaction, and engagement during meetings and classroom sessions.</p><h3>Dual HDMI and Flexible Connectivity</h3><p>This projector supports a wide range of connectivity options, including:</p><ul><li>Dual HDMI Inputs</li><li>Wireless LAN (Optional)</li><li>Screen Mirroring Support</li><li>USB Connectivity</li><li>Network Control Features</li></ul><p>With dual HDMI ports, users can easily switch between multiple devices without interruption, making presentations smoother and more efficient.</p><h3>Easy Setup and User-Friendly Operation</h3><p>The Epson EB-2250U is designed for quick and hassle-free installation with features such as:</p><ul><li>Auto Power-On</li><li>Focus Assistance</li><li>Keystone Correction</li><li>Screen Fit Adjustment</li></ul><p>These smart setup tools ensure fast deployment in any environment, saving time and effort during installation.</p><h3>Long Lamp Life and Low Maintenance</h3><p>Built for long-term reliability, the projector offers:</p><ul><li>Extended Lamp Life</li><li>Easy Filter Access</li><li>Low Maintenance Design</li><li>Reduced Total Cost of Ownership</li></ul><p>This makes it a cost-effective solution for organizations requiring continuous daily usage.</p><h3>Flexible Installation Options</h3><p>The EB-2250U supports multiple installation configurations including:</p><ul><li>Ceiling Mount Installation</li><li>Tabletop Setup</li><li>Portable Usage</li></ul><p>Its versatile design adapts easily to different room layouts and professional environments.</p><h3>Why Buy from International Office Solution (IOS)?</h3><p><strong>International Office Solution (IOS)</strong> offers genuine Epson projectors in Bangladesh with competitive pricing, expert consultation, installation support, and reliable after-sales service. Whether for corporate presentations, classrooms, or training environments, the Epson EB-2250U delivers outstanding brightness, superior image quality, and advanced collaboration features.</p><p>Contact <strong>International Office Solution (IOS)</strong> today to get the best Epson EB-2250U price in Bangladesh and professional support.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Technology</td><td>LCD</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>WXGA (1280 × 800)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Brightness</td><td>5,000 lumens</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>Wide: 1.5 m (50\") – Tele: 9 m (300\")</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:10</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>15,000:1</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Maximum Image Size</td><td>Up to 300 inches</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Power</td><td>300W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>5,000 hours (Normal) / 10,000 hours (Eco Mode)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><