2 16:14:41', 'Epson EB-2250U 5000 Lumens WUXGA 3LCD Projector Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Epson EB-2250U 5000 Lumens WUXGA 3LCD Projector in Bangladesh from International Office Solution (IOS). Features WUXGA resolution, 3LCD technology, dual HDMI, split-screen, multi-PC projection, and high brightness performance.', 'Epson EB-2250U Price in Bangladesh, Epson EB-2250U Projector, Epson WUXGA Projector, Epson 3LCD Projector, 5000 Lumens Projector Bangladesh, Business Projector Bangladesh, Classroom Projector Bangladesh, Epson Presentation Projector, Epson Conference Projector, Split Screen Projector, Multi PC Projection Projector, Epson Dual HDMI Projector, Epson Projector Price Bangladesh, WUXGA Business Projector, Epson Meeting Room Projector, Epson EB-2250U Bangladesh, International Office Solution, IOS Bangladesh, Epson Professional Projector, Corporate Projector Bangladesh', NULL, 3, NULL, NULL),
(494, 'Epson  Projector EB-2065 5500 Lumens 3LCD XGA', 'The Epson EB-2065 5500 Lumens XGA Business Projector delivers ultra-bright projection, XGA clarity, and advanced wireless collaboration features including Multi-PC projection and Epson iProjection support. With 3LCD technology, up to 300-inch display, and 10,000-hour lamp life (Eco mode), it is ideal for meetings, classrooms, and large conference halls.', 'epson-projector-eb-2065-5500-lumens-3lcd-xga-1781281587', '<p>The <strong>Epson EB-2065 5500 Lumens XGA 3LCD Business Projector</strong> is a powerful and versatile projection solution designed for professional meetings, classrooms, training sessions, and large conference environments. With its ultra-bright <strong>5,500 lumens brightness</strong> and <strong>XGA (1024 × 768) resolution</strong>, this projector delivers sharp, vibrant, and highly visible images even in well-lit rooms.</p><p>Built with Epson’s advanced <strong>3LCD technology</strong>, the EB-2065 ensures rich color accuracy and bright, consistent image output. Whether you are presenting business reports, educational materials, or multimedia content, this projector guarantees clear and engaging visuals on screen sizes of up to <strong>300 inches</strong>.</p><h3>Ultra-Bright and Large Screen Performance</h3><p>The Epson EB-2065 is designed for large venues where visibility matters most. Its powerful brightness allows presentations to remain clear even in fully lit environments, while supporting projection sizes up to <strong>300 inches</strong>, making it ideal for auditoriums, conference halls, and large classrooms.</p><p>Even at maximum screen size, <strong>HDMI connectivity ensures sharp and detailed image quality</strong>, maintaining professional presentation standards.</p><h3>Advanced Wireless and Multi-Device Connectivity</h3><p>The EB-2065 offers flexible wireless collaboration features, including:</p><ul><li>Epson iProjection App support</li><li>Multi-PC Projection (up to 50 devices)</li><li>Screen Partition / Split Screen Display</li><li>Wireless LAN Connectivity (optional)</li></ul><p>These features allow multiple users to connect and share content simultaneously, making meetings and classroom sessions more interactive and productive.</p><h3>Smooth Setup and Easy Operation</h3><p>Designed for convenience, the Epson EB-2065 includes smart setup features such as:</p><ul><li>Auto Power-On</li><li>Focus Assistance</li><li>Keystone Correction</li><li>Screen Fit Adjustment</li><li>On-screen Home Menu for quick navigation</li></ul><p>These tools ensure fast installation and smooth operation, saving time during setup and presentations.</p><h3>Enhanced Collaboration Features</h3><p>With built-in <strong>gesture control technology</strong>, users can change slides using hand movements—eliminating the need for a remote control or mouse. This provides a more dynamic and professional presentation experience.</p><p>The <strong>Multi-PC projection feature</strong> allows up to 50 computers to connect at once, enabling split-screen collaboration for group discussions and team presentations.</p><h3>Long Lamp Life and Reliable Performance</h3><p>The Epson EB-2065 is engineered for long-term use with:</p><ul><li>Lamp life up to <strong>10,000 hours (Eco Mode)</strong></li><li>Reduced maintenance requirements</li><li>High operational reliability</li></ul><p>This makes it a cost-effective choice for organizations with frequent usage needs.</p><h3>Professional Connectivity Options</h3><p>This projector includes multiple input options for maximum compatibility:</p><ul><li>Dual HDMI Ports</li><li>Wireless LAN (optional)</li><li>USB Connectivity</li><li>Network Control Features</li></ul><p>These connections allow seamless integration with laptops, PCs, and mobile devices for flexible usage.</p><h3>Why Buy from International Office Solution (IOS)?</h3><p><strong>International Office Solution (IOS)</strong> offers genuine Epson projectors in Bangladesh with competitive pricing, expert consultation, installation support, and reliable after-sales service. The Epson EB-2065 is an excellent choice for organizations looking for brightness, flexibility, and modern wireless collaboration features.</p><p>Contact <strong>International Office Solution (IOS)</strong> today for the best Epson EB-2065 price in Bangladesh.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Technology</td><td>3LCD Technology, RGB liquid crystal shutter</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>XGA (1024 × 768)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Brightness (Colour Light Output)</td><td>5,500 lumens (3,800 lumens Eco) – IDMS15.4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Brightness (White Light Output)</td><td>5,500 lumens (3,800 lumens Eco) – ISO 21118:2012</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>0.8 m (30\") – 8.5 m (300\")</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>4:3 (XGA native)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>15,000:1</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Image Size</td><td>30\" – 300\"</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Power</td><td>300W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>5,000 hours (Normal) / 10,000 hours (Eco Mode)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>16W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>USB</td><td>USB 2.0 Type-A, USB 2.0 Type-B</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>RS-232C</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Network</td><td>Wired LAN, Gigabit Ethernet, Wireless LAN (optional), WiFi 5 (802.11a/b/g/n/ac)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>VGA Input</td><td>2 × VGA In</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>VGA Output</td><td>1 × VGA Out</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Input</td><td>2 × HDMI In</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Composite Video</td><td>1 × Composite In</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>RGB</td><td>2 × RGB In, 1 × RGB Out</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>MHL</td><td>Supported</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Audio Ports</td><td>Stereo Mini Jack In (x2), Out (x1)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Wireless</td><td>Built-in + Optional WiFi</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>425W (Normal), 323W (Eco)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Standby Power</td><td>0.5W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Supply</td><td>AC 220–240V, 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td><td>Weight</td><td>4.4 kg</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td><td>Dimensions (W × D × H)</td><td>377 × 291 × 101 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Parts &amp; Service Warranty</td><td>2 Years</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Lamp Warranty</td><td>12 Months or 1000 Hours</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 210000.00, 210000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/42LXKC8jGcqbpCb9pgRsicZ3tUvxkqRYoWQDtWC4.jpg', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 16:26:27', '2026-06-12 16:34:24', 'Epson EB-2065 5500 Lumens XGA Business Projector Price in Bangladesh | IOS', 'Buy Epson EB-2065 5500 Lumens XGA 3LCD Business Projector in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features wireless connectivity, Multi-PC projection, 300-inch display, and long lamp life.', 'Epson EB-2065 Price in Bangladesh, Epson EB-2065 Projector, Epson XGA Business Projector, 5500 Lumens Projector Bangladesh, Epson 3LCD Projector, Epson Meeting Room Projector, Epson Wireless Projector Bangladesh, Multi PC Projector Epson, Epson iProjection Projector, Epson Conference Projector Bangladesh, Business Projector Price Bangladesh, Classroom Projector Bangladesh, Epson 300 Inch Projector, Epson Professional Projector, Epson Presentation Projector, International Office Solution, IOS Bangladesh, Epson Office Projector, Epson Large Venue Projector', NULL, 3, NULL, NULL);
