(495, 'Epson Projector  EB-L210SW 4000 Lumens WXGA Wireless Short Throw Laser', 'The Epson EB-L210SW 4000 Lumens WXGA Short Throw Laser Projector delivers bright, clear, and color-accurate visuals with 3LCD laser technology. Featuring short throw projection, wireless connectivity, Miracast support, and up to 125-inch display size, it is ideal for classrooms, offices, and training rooms.', 'epson-projector-eb-l210sw-4000-lumens-wxga-wireless-short-throw-laser-1781282432', '<p>The <strong>Epson EB-L210SW 4000 Lumens WXGA Wireless Short Throw Laser Projector</strong> is a modern, high-performance projection solution designed for classrooms, meeting rooms, training spaces, and collaborative environments. Built with Epson’s advanced <strong>3LCD laser technology</strong>, this projector delivers bright, vibrant, and highly accurate images with consistent color performance.</p><p>With <strong>4,000 lumens of brightness (color and white output)</strong>, the EB-L210SW ensures clear and sharp visuals even in well-lit environments. Its <strong>WXGA (1280 × 800) resolution</strong> provides detailed and professional-quality image reproduction, making it suitable for presentations, teaching materials, and multimedia content.</p><h3>Short Throw Design for Maximum Convenience</h3><p>The <strong>short throw lens technology</strong> allows the projector to be placed close to the screen, reducing shadows and glare during presentations. This makes it ideal for small classrooms, offices, and meeting rooms where space is limited.</p><p>It supports a <strong>display size range from 53 inches to 120 inches</strong>, with a maximum projection size of up to <strong>125 inches</strong>, ensuring flexibility for different room sizes and usage scenarios.</p><h3>Bright, Vivid and Reliable 3LCD Laser Performance</h3><p>Powered by Epson’s <strong>3LCD technology</strong>, the EB-L210SW delivers equal color and white brightness, ensuring:</p><ul><li>Bright and vivid visuals</li><li>Accurate color reproduction</li><li>Smooth and natural image quality</li><li>No rainbow effect (common in single-chip projectors)</li></ul><p>This makes it a reliable solution for professional presentations and educational environments.</p><h3>Wireless Connectivity and Smart Features</h3><p>The Epson EB-L210SW offers flexible connectivity options including:</p><ul><li>Wireless LAN support</li><li>Miracast screen mirroring</li><li>HDMI input compatibility</li><li>USB 2A power output for streaming devices</li></ul><p>These features enable seamless content sharing from laptops, smartphones, tablets, and streaming devices without complicated setup.</p><h3>Energy Efficient Laser Technology</h3><p>Designed for long-term use, this projector consumes only <strong>201W of power</strong>, making it energy efficient while maintaining high brightness output. The laser light source also reduces maintenance requirements and ensures long operational life compared to traditional lamp-based projectors.</p><h3>Easy Installation and Portable Design</h3><p>The lightweight and compact design of the EB-L210SW makes it easy to install, move, and adjust as needed. Whether mounted on a wall or placed on a table, it provides flexible installation options for different environments.</p><h3>Ideal for Multiple Applications</h3><p>The Epson EB-L210SW is suitable for:</p><ul><li>Educational classrooms</li><li>Corporate meeting rooms</li><li>Training centers</li><li>Small conference spaces</li><li>Interactive presentations</li></ul><p>Its glare-free projection and short throw capability make it especially effective for interactive teaching and collaborative sessions.</p><h3>Why Buy from International Office Solution (IOS)?</h3><p><strong>International Office Solution (IOS)</strong> offers genuine Epson projectors in Bangladesh with competitive pricing, expert consultation, installation support, and reliable after-sales service. The Epson EB-L210SW is a perfect choice for those seeking a compact, bright, and modern short throw laser projection solution.</p><p>Contact <strong>International Office Solution (IOS)</strong> today for the best Epson EB-L210SW price in Bangladesh.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Technology</td><td>3LCD Technology</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>WXGA (1280 × 800)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Brightness</td><td>4000 Lumens</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:10</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>Over 5,000,000:1</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Lamp Power</td><td>201W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Up to 20,000 hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>USB</td><td>USB 2.0, USB 2.0 Type-B (Service Only)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>RS-232C</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Ethernet</td><td>1000 Base-T / 100 Base-TX / 10 Base-T</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Wireless LAN</td><td>IEEE 802.11a/b/g/n/ac, Wi-Fi Direct</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>VGA Input</td><td>2 × VGA In</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>VGA Output</td><td>1 × VGA Out</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Input</td><td>2 × HDMI In</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Miracast</td><td>Supported</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Audio Ports</td><td>Jack In ×2, Jack Out ×1</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Microphone Input</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Consumption (Normal)</td><td>201W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Consumption (Eco)</td><td>144W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Peak Consumption</td><td>260W (Normal), 191W (Eco)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Standby Power</td><td>0.5W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td><td>Weight</td><td>4.6 kg</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td><td>Dimensions (W × D × H)</td><td>325 × 337 × 90 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Parts &amp; Service Warranty</td><td>2 Years</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Lamp Warranty</td><td>12 Months or 1000 Hours</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 195000.00, 195000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/Amv27GgCO3mifshZhd6LfjxDIj5MqoBVG632hfs0.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 16:40:32', '2026-06-12 16:40:32', 'Epson EB-L210SW 4000 Lumens WXGA Short Throw Laser Projector Price in Bangladesh | IOS', 'Buy Epson EB-L210SW 4000 Lumens WXGA Wireless Short Throw Laser Projector in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features 3LCD laser technology, short throw design, wireless Miracast, and up to 125-inch display.', 'Epson EB-L210SW Price in Bangladesh, Epson EB-L210SW Projector, Epson Short Throw Projector Bangladesh, WXGA Laser Projector, Epson 3LCD Projector, 4000 Lumens Projector Bangladesh, Wireless Projector Bangladesh, Epson Classroom Projector, Epson Meeting Room Projector, Epson Laser Projector Price, Short Throw Laser Projector, Epson Miracast Projector, Epson Business Projector Bangladesh, Epson Training Room Projector, Epson Interactive Projector, Epson EB-L210SW Bangladesh, International Office Solution, IOS Bangladesh, Epson Projector Price, Epson Office Projector', NULL, 3, NULL, NULL),
(496, 'Epson Projector  EB-992F 4000 Lumens Full HD 3LCD', 'The Epson EB-992F 4000 Lumens Full HD 3LCD Projector delivers bright and sharp 1080p visuals with 3LCD technology, 15,000:1 contrast ratio, and flexible connectivity. Featuring a 230W UHE lamp with up to 17,000-hour life, split-screen support, and iProjection wireless sharing, it is ideal for classrooms and business presentations.', 'epson-projector-eb-992f-4000-lumens-full-hd-3lcd-1781282740', '<p>The <strong>Epson EB-992F Full HD 3LCD Projector</strong> is a powerful and reliable projection solution designed for classrooms, offices, and professional presentation environments. Featuring Epson’s advanced <strong>3LCD 3-chip technology</strong>, this projector delivers accurate color reproduction, bright visuals, and smooth image performance for all types of content.</p><p>With <strong>Full HD (1920 × 1080) resolution</strong> and <strong>4,000 lumens of color brightness</strong>, the EB-992F ensures sharp and vibrant visuals even in well-lit environments. Its <strong>15,000:1 contrast ratio</strong> enhances image depth, providing clearer text, richer colors, and improved detail for presentations, videos, and graphics.</p><h3>Sharp Full HD Performance with Eye-Friendly Viewing</h3><p>The Epson EB-992F is designed for comfortable long-duration viewing. Its high-quality projection system ensures eye-friendly visuals with consistent brightness and natural color output.</p><ul><li>Resolution: Full HD 1080p</li><li>Brightness: 4,000 lumens</li><li>Contrast Ratio: 15,000:1</li><li>Screen Size Support: Up to large classroom and meeting room displays</li></ul><p>This makes it ideal for education, training, and business environments where clarity and readability are essential.</p><h3>Advanced Optical and Lens System</h3><p>Equipped with a manual focus lens and flexible optical zoom, the EB-992F allows easy installation and adjustment:</p><ul><li>Focal Length: 18.2 mm – 29.2 mm</li><li>Optical Zoom Ratio: 1.0 – 1.6x</li></ul><p>This ensures flexible positioning in different room sizes while maintaining image clarity and sharpness.</p><h3>Reliable UHE Lamp Technology</h3><p>The projector uses a <strong>230W UHE lamp</strong>, delivering long-lasting performance and consistent brightness:</p><ul><li>Lamp Life: Up to 6,500 hours (Normal Mode)</li><li>Up to 17,000 hours (Eco Mode)</li></ul><p>This reduces maintenance costs and ensures long-term reliability for continuous usage.</p><h3>Smart Connectivity and Collaboration Features</h3><p>The Epson EB-992F supports multiple connectivity options to enhance productivity and collaboration:</p><ul><li>iProjection App support for wireless sharing</li><li>Split-screen functionality for multiple devices</li><li>Moderator preview mode for content control</li><li>PC and smart device connectivity</li></ul><p>These features make it easy to share content and collaborate in meetings or classrooms.</p><h3>Built-in Audio and Easy Setup</h3><p>The projector includes a built-in speaker system for basic audio output, reducing the need for external speakers in small to medium rooms. Setup is simple and user-friendly, making it ideal for quick deployment.</p><h3>Why Buy from International Office Solution (IOS)?</h3><p><strong>International Office Solution (IOS)</strong> provides original Epson projectors in Bangladesh with competitive pricing, expert guidance, installation support, and reliable after-sales service. The Epson EB-992F is a perfect choice for those who need high brightness, Full HD clarity, and professional performance.</p><p>Contact <strong>International Office Solution (IOS)</strong> today for the best Epson EB-992F price in Bangladesh.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Technology</td><td>LCD</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>Full HD (1920 × 1080)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Brightness (Colour Light Output)</td><td>4,000 lumens (2,400 lumens Eco)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Brightness (White Light Output)</td><td>4,000 lumens (2,400 lumens Eco) – ISO 21118:2012</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>4:3</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>16,000:1</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Type</td><td>UHE</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Power</td><td>230W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>6,500 hours (Normal) / 17,000 hours (Eco Mode)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>USB</td><td>USB 2.0 Type-A, USB 2.0 Type-B</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>RS-232C</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Wired Network</td><td>Supported</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>VGA Input</td><td>2 × VGA In</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>VGA Output</td><td>1 × VGA Out</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Input</td><td>2 × HDMI In</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Composite Video</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Audio Ports</td><td>Stereo Mini Jack In (x2), Out (x1), Cinch Audio Out</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Microphone Input</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Wireless</td><td>Wi-Fi (802.11b/g/n), Miracast</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Supply</td><td>220–240V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Consumption (Normal)</td><td>327W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Consumption (Eco)</td><td>225W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td><td>Weight</td><td>3.1 kg</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td><td>Dimensions (W × D × H)</td><td>309 × 282 × 90 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Parts &amp; Service Warranty</td><td>2 Years</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Lamp Warranty</td><td>12 Months or 1000 Hours</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 155000.00, 155000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/BZkkWQpOjlfeKrud5RkUnvlQdMEkK7H1sRYwnzll.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 16:45:40', '2026-06-12 16:45:40', 'Epson EB-992F 4000 Lumens Full HD 3LCD Projector Price in Bangladesh | IOS', 'Buy Epson EB-992F 4000 Lumens Full HD 3LCD Projector in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features Full HD resolution, 3LCD technology, iProjection, split-screen, and long lamp life.', 'Epson EB-992F Price in Bangladesh, Epson EB-992F Projector, Epson Full HD Projector Bangladesh, Epson 3LCD Projector, 4000 Lumens Projector Bangladesh, Epson Business Projector, Epson Classroom Projector, Epson FHD Projector Price, Epson iProjection Projector, Epson Split Screen Projector, Epson Meeting Room Projector, Epson Training Projector Bangladesh, Epson Projector Price Bangladesh, Epson Presentation Projector, Epson 1080p Projector, International Office Solution, IOS Bangladesh, Epson Office Projector, Epson Professional Projector', NULL, 3, NULL, NULL),
(497, 'Epson Projector  EB-FH54 4100 Lumens FHD 3LCD', 'The Epson EB-FH54 4100 Lumens Full HD 3LCD Projector delivers bright and sharp 1080p visuals with 3LCD technology, 16,000:1 contrast, dual HDMI, wireless connectivity, built-in 16W speaker, and long lamp life, making it ideal for offices and classrooms.', 'epson-projector-eb-fh54-4100-lumens-fhd-3lcd-1781283200', '<p>The Epson EB-FH54 is a high-performance Full HD 1080p projector designed for professional environments such as boardrooms, classrooms, huddle spaces, and large meeting rooms. With 4100 lumens of brightness, advanced 3LCD technology, and flexible installation features, it delivers sharp, vibrant, and reliable projection performance for business and education use.</p><h3>Bright 4100 Lumens Full HD Performance</h3><p>With 4100 lumens of color and white brightness, the Epson EB-FH54 produces clear and vivid images even in well-lit environments. It also supports an eco mode offering 2300 lumens for energy-efficient operation while maintaining excellent visibility.</p><h3>Full HD 1080p Resolution</h3><p>The native Full HD 1920 × 1080 resolution ensures sharp image clarity, making it ideal for presentations, videos, spreadsheets, and detailed graphics. It delivers a true high-definition viewing experience suitable for modern professional needs.</p><h3>Advanced 3LCD Technology</h3><p>Epson’s 3LCD technology with RGB liquid crystal shutter ensures accurate and consistent color reproduction without rainbow effects. With support for up to 16.77 million colors, it delivers natural, bright, and balanced visuals for all types of content.</p><h3>High Contrast for Enhanced Detail</h3><p>A 16,000:1 contrast ratio improves image depth by producing deeper blacks and brighter whites, enhancing readability and visual impact in presentations and multimedia content.</p><h3>Flexible Installation &amp; Projection Size</h3><p>The EB-FH54 supports a projection size ranging from 31 inches to 304 inches, making it suitable for both small rooms and large venues. A throw ratio of 1.30–2.09:1 with 1.62x manual zoom allows flexible installation options, while auto vertical keystone correction (±30°) ensures easy alignment.</p><h3>Long Lamp Life for Low Maintenance</h3><p>The projector features a 230W UHE lamp with a lifespan of up to 5,500 hours in normal mode and up to 12,000 hours in eco mode, reducing maintenance costs and ensuring long-term reliability.</p><h3>Wide Connectivity Options</h3><p>The Epson EB-FH54 offers extensive connectivity for modern workplaces:</p><ul><li>2 × HDMI inputs for multiple digital devices</li><li>USB ports for media playback and service</li><li>Wireless LAN support</li><li>Miracast and Apple AirPlay 2 support</li><li>Network protocols including SNMP and IPv6</li></ul><p>These features allow seamless integration with laptops, mobile devices, and enterprise networks.</p><h3>Built-in Audio System</h3><p>A built-in 16W speaker delivers clear and powerful sound, making it suitable for presentations without requiring external audio systems.</p><h3>Smart Features &amp; Ease of Use</h3><p>The projector includes advanced smart tools for convenience and productivity:</p><ul><li>Screen Mirroring support</li><li>Epson iProjection App compatibility</li><li>Web control and remote management</li><li>Scheduling function for automated operation</li><li>Quick setup and auto source detection</li></ul><h3>Quiet Operation &amp; Security</h3><p>Designed for professional environments, the projector operates quietly (down to 28 dB in Eco mode) and includes security features to prevent unauthorized use, making it ideal for shared office and educational spaces.</p><h3>Ideal Applications</h3><ul><li>Corporate Boardrooms</li><li>Educational Classrooms</li><li>Training Centers</li><li>Large Meeting Rooms</li><li>Conference Halls</li><li>Multimedia Presentations</li></ul><h3>Why Buy from International Office Solution (IOS)?</h3><p>International Office Solution (IOS) provides genuine Epson projectors with official warranty, competitive pricing, and reliable after-sales service in Bangladesh. The Epson EB-FH54 is a premium Full HD projector designed for professional clarity, flexibility, and long-term performance.</p>', '<p>Projection Features<br>Display Type<br>3LCD Technology, RGB liquid crystal shutter<br>Resolution<br>1080p<br>Brightness<br>4100 lumens brightness<br>Projection Distance<br>Wide: 0,9 m - 8,9 m<br>Tele: 1,4 m - 14,3 m<br>Wide/Tele: 0,88 m - 14,29 m<br>Aspect Ratio<br>16:9<br>Contrast Ratio<br>16,000 : 1<br>Image Size<br>31 inches - 304 inches<br>Others<br>Other features: A/V mute, AV Mute Slide, Auto Power On, Auto source search, Built-in speaker, Customizable user logo, Direct Power on/off, Document Camera Compatible, Home Screen, JPEG Viewer, Long lamp life, OSD copy function, PC Free, Quick Corner, Schedule Function, Screen Mirroring, Volume control, Web Control, Web Remote, Wireless LAN capable, iProjection App<br>Video Color Modes: Blackboard, Cinema, Dynamic, Presentation, sRGB<br>Lamp Details<br>Lamp Life<br>UHE, 230 W, 5.500 h durability, 12.000 h durability (economy mode)<br>Audio<br>Built-in Speaker<br>16 Watt Loudspeaker<br>Connectivity<br>Interface<br>USB 2.0-A, USB 2.0 Type B (Service Only), Wireless LAN IEEE 802.11a/b/g/n/ac, HDMI in (2x), Miracast, Jack plug out, Apple AirPlay 2<br>External Features<br>Color<br>White<br>Weight<br>3,1 kg<br>Dimension<br>309‎ x 293 x 105 mm (Width x Depth x Height)<br>Warranty<br>Parts Warranty<br>2 years Parts &amp; Service warranty /Lamp: 12 Months or 1000hrs warrantyCategory&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Feature&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Specification</p>', 'PROJECTOR', 120000.00, 120000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/B7Zgo8dLm6fpYHIwR2WhflwZxJngJMBOi0W7bXMo.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 16:53:20', '2026-06-12 16:53:20', 'Epson EB-FH54 4100 Lumens FHD 3LCD Projector Price in Bangladesh | IOS', 'Buy Epson EB-FH54 4100 Lumens Full HD 3LCD Projector from International Office Solution (IOS). Features 1080p resolution, 3LCD technology, dual HDMI, WiFi, AirPlay, Miracast, and 16W speaker for professional use.', 'Epson EB-FH54, Epson EB-FH54 Price Bangladesh, 4100 Lumens Projector, Full HD Projector Bangladesh, 3LCD Projector, Office Projector Bangladesh, Classroom Projector, Epson Projector Bangladesh, Wireless Projector, HDMI Projector, Business Projector, Conference Room Projector, Epson FHD Projector, High Brightness Projector, Smart Projector Bangladesh, AirPlay Projector, Miracast Projector, International Office Solution, IOS Bangladesh, Professional Projector Bangladesh', NULL, 3, NULL, NULL),
(498, 'Epson Projector  EB-982W PowerLite 4200-Lumen WXGA 3LCD', 'The Epson WXGA 4200 Lumens 3LCD Business Projector delivers bright and scalable visuals up to 280 inches with 16,000:1 contrast, flexible installation, 1.6x zoom, long lamp life up to 17,000 hours, and advanced wireless collaboration features.', 'epson-projector-eb-982w-powerlite-4200-lumen-wxga-3lcd-1781283536', '<p>The native WXGA (1280 × 800) resolution ensures crisp presentation quality for business documents, spreadsheets, and multimedia content. It supports scalable projection sizes up to 280 inches, making it suitable for both small rooms and large halls.</p><h3>Flexible Installation with Zoom &amp; Keystone Correction</h3><p>Designed for easy setup in any environment, the projector includes:</p><ul><li>1.6x optical zoom for flexible placement</li><li>Vertical and horizontal keystone correction</li><li>Wide projection distance range (0.9 m – 8.5 m)</li></ul><p>These features ensure quick installation and perfect image alignment in any room layout.</p><h3>Reliable Long-Term Performance</h3><p>This projector is engineered for minimal downtime and long operational life. Its durable lamp system and optimized cooling reduce maintenance requirements, allowing years of reliable usage before lamp replacement is needed.</p><p>Lamp performance:</p><ul><li>6,500 hours (Normal mode)</li><li>Up to 17,000 hours (Eco mode)</li></ul><h3>Advanced Connectivity for Multiple Devices</h3><p>The Epson WXGA projector supports a wide range of connectivity options for seamless collaboration:</p><ul><li>2 × HDMI inputs</li><li>2 × VGA inputs + 1 × VGA output</li><li>Composite video input</li><li>USB Type-A &amp; USB Type-B</li><li>Wired LAN support</li><li>Multiple audio input/output options</li></ul><p>It also supports wireless projection through the iProjection App, allowing easy content sharing from laptops and smart devices.</p><h3>Split Screen &amp; Collaboration Features</h3><p>To enhance teamwork and presentations, the projector includes advanced collaboration tools:</p><ul><li>Split-screen display from multiple devices</li><li>Moderator function for content control before display</li><li>Easy wireless projection via iProjection App</li></ul><p>These features make it ideal for interactive meetings and group presentations.</p><h3>Ideal Applications</h3><ul><li>Corporate Meeting Rooms</li><li>Educational Classrooms</li><li>Training Centers</li><li>Conference Rooms</li><li>Business Presentations</li><li>Large Venue Displays</li></ul><h3>Why Buy from International Office Solution (IOS)?</h3><p>International Office Solution (IOS) provides genuine Epson projectors with official warranty, competitive pricing, and professional support in Bangladesh. This WXGA Epson projector is a reliable and high-performance solution designed for consistent business and educational use.</p>', '<p>Projection Features<br>Display Type<br>3LCD Technology<br>Resolution<br>WXGA, 1280 x 800<br>Brightness<br>4,200 Lumen- 2,600 Lumen (economy)<br>Projection Distance<br>0.9 m - 8.5 m<br>Contrast Ratio<br>16,000 : 1<br>Image Size<br>29 inches - 280 inches<br>Lamp Details<br>Type<br>UHE<br>Lamp Power<br>230 W<br>Lamp Life<br>6,500 h durability<br>17,000 h durability (economy mode)<br>Connectivity<br>Interface<br>USB 2.0 Type A<br>USB 2.0 Type B<br>RS-232C<br>Wired Network<br>VGA in (2x)<br>VGA out<br>HDMI in (2x)<br>Composite in<br>Stereo mini jack audio out<br>Stereo mini jack audio in (2x)<br>Cinch audio in<br>Power<br>Supply Voltage: AC 100 V - 240 V, 50 Hz - 60 Hz<br>Power consumption: 327 Watt, 225 Watt (economy), 0.3 Watt (standby)<br>External Features<br>Color<br>White<br>Weight<br>3.1 Kg<br>Dimension<br>309‎ x 282 x 90 mm<br>Warranty<br>Manufacturing Warranty<br>02 Years Parts &amp; Service Warranty/ Lamp: 12 Months or 1000hrs Warranty Category&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Feature&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Specification</p>', 'PROJECTOR', 94000.00, 94000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/QvxBBfb0P2bdDuGCPe1yq9