(499, 'Epson Projector  EB-972 4100 Lumens XGA 3LCD', 'The Epson EB-972 4100 Lumens XGA 3LCD Projector delivers bright and vivid visuals with 3LCD technology, 15,000:1 contrast ratio, dual HDMI, wireless connectivity, moderator control features, and long lamp life up to 17,000 hours in ECO mode.', 'epson-projector-eb-972-4100-lumens-xga-3lcd-1781283897', '<p>The Epson EB-972 is a high-performance XGA projector designed for classrooms, training centers, and business environments. With 4100 lumens of color and white brightness, advanced 3LCD technology, and long lamp life, it delivers bright, vivid, and reliable projection for professional and educational use.</p><h3>Bright 4100 Lumens Performance</h3><p>With 4100 lumens of both color and white brightness, the Epson EB-972 ensures clear and vibrant visuals even in well-lit rooms. It delivers up to 3x brighter colors compared to many competitive models, making presentations more engaging and effective.</p><h3>XGA Resolution for Clear Presentation Content</h3><p>The native XGA (1024 × 768) resolution provides sharp and readable text, making it ideal for displaying presentations, spreadsheets, charts, and educational materials with clarity.</p><h3>Advanced 3LCD Technology</h3><p>Epson’s 3LCD technology ensures accurate and consistent color reproduction without rainbow effects. This allows smooth, natural visuals with balanced brightness for all types of content.</p><h3>High Contrast for Better Clarity</h3><p>A 15,000:1 contrast ratio enhances image depth by delivering deeper blacks and brighter whites, improving readability and overall visual impact.</p><h3>Long Lamp Life &amp; Low Total Cost of Ownership</h3><p>The EB-972 is designed for cost efficiency and long-term reliability. Its lamp offers:</p><ul><li>Up to 17,000 hours in ECO mode</li><li>Reduced maintenance costs</li><li>Lower total cost of ownership</li></ul><p>This makes it ideal for institutions and organizations with continuous usage needs.</p><h3>Wireless Collaboration &amp; Multi-Device Support</h3><p>The projector supports modern collaboration features, allowing instructors and presenters to share content from multiple devices simultaneously, including:</p><ul><li>Windows PCs</li><li>macOS devices</li><li>iOS devices</li><li>Android devices</li></ul><p>This enhances classroom interaction and meeting productivity.</p><h3>Dual HDMI Connectivity</h3><p>With dual HDMI inputs, the Epson EB-972 allows easy switching between multiple digital devices such as laptops, media players, and streaming devices.</p><h3>Moderator Device Management</h3><p>Advanced moderator software allows instructors or presenters to control shared content before displaying it, ensuring smooth and organized presentations.</p><h3>Ideal Applications</h3><ul><li>Educational Classrooms</li><li>Training Centers</li><li>Corporate Meetings</li><li>Conference Rooms</li><li>Seminar Halls</li><li>Collaborative Learning Environments</li></ul><h3>Why Buy from International Office Solution (IOS)?</h3><p>International Office Solution (IOS) offers genuine Epson projectors with official warranty, competitive pricing, and trusted support in Bangladesh. The Epson EB-972 is a reliable and cost-efficient projector designed for long-term educational and business use.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>3LCD, 3-chip technology</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>1024 × 768 (XGA)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>4100 lumens (Color &amp; White Brightness)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>60” screen: 1.69 – 2.75 m</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>15,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>30” – 300” (Wide: 0.83 – 8.54 m / Tele: 1.36 – 13.86 m)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Type</td><td>UHE</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Power</td><td>230 W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Up to 6,500 hours (Normal) / Up to 17,000 hours (Eco Mode)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>16W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Audio Input</td><td>2 × Stereo Mini Jack</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>1 × Stereo Mini Jack</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Mic Input</td><td>1 × Stereo Mini Jack (Mic I/O)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Computer Input</td><td>2 × VGA (Computer In)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Monitor Output</td><td>1 × VGA</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Video Input</td><td>1 × Composite Video</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>RS-232C</td><td>1 × Control Port</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB</td><td>1 × USB-B</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Voltage</td><td>AC 100–240V, 50–60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>327W (Normal), 225W (Eco), 0.3W (Standby)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Information</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions (W × D × H)</td><td>309 × 282 × 90 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Service Warranty</td><td>2 Years</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Warranty</td><td>12 Months or 1000 Hours</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 87000.00, 87000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/Ej0F3gVt3l26hfbgjl8XVQvMRCL8iIOADaXRJueP.jpg', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 17:04:57', '2026-06-12 17:04:57', 'Epson EB-972 4100 Lumens XGA 3LCD Projector Price in Bangladesh | IOS', 'Buy Epson EB-972 XGA 4100 Lumens 3LCD Projector from International Office Solution (IOS). Features dual HDMI, wireless sharing, moderator control, 3LCD technology, and long lamp life up to 17,000 hours.', 'Epson EB-972, Epson EB-972 Price Bangladesh, 4100 Lumens Projector, XGA Projector Bangladesh, 3LCD Projector, Classroom Projector, Office Projector Bangladesh, Epson Projector Price, Wireless Projector, Dual HDMI Projector, Moderator Control Projector, Education Projector, Business Projector, High Brightness Projector, Long Lamp Life Projector, Epson XGA Projector, International Office Solution, IOS Bangladesh, Professional Projector Bangladesh', NULL, 3, NULL, NULL),
(500, 'Epson Projector  EB-W49 3800 Lumens WXGA 3LCD Multimedia', 'The Epson EB-W49 3800 Lumens WXGA 3LCD Projector offers bright, portable projection with 16,000:1 contrast ratio, up to 320-inch display support, 3LCD color accuracy, flexible keystone correction, and long lamp life up to 17,000 hours.', 'epson-projector-eb-w49-3800-lumens-wxga-3lcd-multimedia-1781284144', '<p>The Epson EB-W49 is a compact and portable WXGA projector designed for business presentations, classrooms, and mobile professionals. With 3800 lumens of brightness, 3LCD technology, and a high contrast ratio, it delivers clear, vivid, and reliable projection performance in both bright and dim environments.</p><h3>Bright 3800 Lumens Performance</h3><p>With 3800 lumens of brightness, the EB-W49 ensures sharp and visible images even in well-lit rooms. Combined with a 16,000:1 contrast ratio, it enhances depth and clarity, making text, charts, and multimedia content easy to view.</p><h3>WXGA Resolution for Clear Content Display</h3><p>The WXGA (1280 × 800) resolution provides a widescreen format that is ideal for presentations, spreadsheets, and video content. It delivers crisp visuals suitable for professional and educational environments.</p><h3>Large Screen Projection Up to 320 Inches</h3><p>The projector supports screen sizes up to 320 inches, enabling impactful large-scale presentations while maintaining clarity and sharpness across the display.</p><h3>3LCD Technology for True-to-Life Colors</h3><p>Epson’s advanced 3LCD technology ensures accurate and consistent color reproduction without rainbow effects. This provides natural-looking visuals for presentations, videos, and graphics.</p><h3>Flexible Installation &amp; Keystone Correction</h3><p>The EB-W49 offers flexible setup options with:</p><ul><li>Automatic vertical keystone correction</li><li>Manual horizontal keystone adjustment</li><li>Wide optical zoom range</li></ul><p>These features allow distortion-free projection in different room layouts and installation positions.</p><h3>Long Lamp Life &amp; Low Maintenance</h3><p>Designed for durability and cost efficiency, the lamp offers:</p><ul><li>Up to 17,000 hours in Eco Mode</li><li>Reduced maintenance requirements</li><li>Long-term reliability for continuous usage</li></ul><h3>Connectivity &amp; Network Support</h3><p>The Epson EB-W49 includes versatile connectivity options:</p><ul><li>RJ45 wired network support</li><li>Optional wireless connectivity (with accessory)</li><li>Multiple input options for laptops and media devices</li></ul><p>This makes it suitable for both standalone and networked environments.</p><h3>Built-in Audio Support</h3><p>A built-in 5W speaker allows basic audio playback without external speakers, making it convenient for meetings and presentations.</p><h3>Ideal Applications</h3><ul><li>Business Meetings</li><li>Classroom Teaching</li><li>Training Sessions</li><li>Portable Presentations</li><li>Small to Medium Conference Rooms</li></ul><h3>Why Buy from International Office Solution (IOS)?</h3><p>International Office Solution (IOS) provides genuine Epson projectors with official warranty, competitive pricing, and reliable after-sales support in Bangladesh. The EB-W49 is a practical and portable projection solution for everyday professional use.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>3LCD (RGB liquid crystal shutter projection system)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>WXGA (1280 × 800)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>3800 lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>16.9 mm – 20.28 mm</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:10</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>16,000:1</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Type</td><td>UHE</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Power</td><td>210 W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>8,000 hours (Normal), 17,000 hours (Eco Mode)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>5W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Input</td><td>Cinch audio in</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>USB</td><td>USB 2.0 Type A, USB 2.0 Type B</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Network</td><td>Wired LAN, Wireless LAN (a/n 5GHz optional)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>VGA</td><td>2 × VGA in, 1 × VGA out</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>HDMI</td><td>2 × HDMI in</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Composite Video</td><td>1 × Composite in</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio</td><td>Stereo mini jack audio in (x2), audio out (x1), Cinch audio in</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Control</td><td>RS-232C</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Supply Voltage</td><td>AC 100–240V, 50–60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>327W (Normal), 225W (Eco), 0.3W (Standby), 286W (JBMS-84)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Information</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>2.7 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions (W × D × H)</td><td>302 × 249 × 87 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Service Warranty</td><td>1 Year</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Warranty</td><td>12 Months or 1000 Hours</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 75000.00, 75000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/7WBGVX0bACZ30XcfiD4Sq9p1iGZXGupmUAsNsZH3.png', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-12 17:09:04', '2026-06-12 17:09:04', 'Epson EB-W49 3800 Lumens WXGA 3LCD Projector Price in Bangladesh | IOS', 'Buy Epson EB-W49 WXGA 3800 Lumens 3LCD Projector from International Office Solution (IOS). Features 320-inch display support, 16,000:1 contrast, long lamp life, RJ45 network, and portable design.', 'Epson EB-W49, Epson EB-W49 Price Bangladesh, 3800 Lumens Projector, WXGA Projector Bangladesh, 3LCD Projector, Portable Projector, Office Projector Bangladesh, Classroom Projector, Epson Projector Price, Network Projector, RJ45 Projector, Long Lamp Life Projector, Business Projector Bangladesh, Epson WXGA Projector, High Brightness Projector, IOS Bangladesh, International Office Solution, Professional Projector Bangladesh', NULL, 3, NULL, NULL),
(501, 'Epson Projector EB-W06 3700 Lumens WXGA 3LCD Office', 'The Epson EB-W06 WXGA 3LCD Projector delivers 3,700 lumens brightness, WXGA resolution, a 16,000:1 contrast ratio, and support for screen sizes up to 320 inches. Featuring advanced 3LCD technology and a long-lasting lamp, it is ideal for business presentations, classrooms, and home entertainment.', 'epson-projector-eb-w06-3700-lumens-wxga-3lcd-office-1781324488', '<p>The Epson EB-W06 3700 Lumens WXGA 3LCD Office Projector is a versatile and high-performance projection solution designed for business presentations, classrooms, training sessions, and home entertainment. Featuring Epson’s advanced 3LCD technology and an impressive 3,700 lumens of both White and Colour Light Output, this projector delivers bright, vibrant, and accurate images even in well-lit environments.</p><p>With WXGA (1280 x 800) resolution and support for large-screen projection up to 320 inches, the Epson EB-W06 is ideal for displaying presentations, spreadsheets, videos, educational content, and multimedia entertainment. Whether you\'re presenting in a conference room or enjoying a movie night at home, this projector provides clear details, vivid colors, and excellent image quality.</p><p>The projector utilizes Epson’s renowned 3LCD technology, which produces up to three times brighter colors compared to many competing projectors. Combined with a 16,000:1 contrast ratio, it delivers deeper blacks, sharper details, and more realistic images, ensuring an engaging viewing experience for every audience.</p><p>Designed with portability in mind, the Epson EB-W06 is lightweight and easy to transport, making it suitable for professionals who frequently move between meeting rooms, offices, classrooms, or event venues. Its simple setup process allows users to start presentations quickly without technical complexity.</p><p>One of the standout features of the Epson EB-W06 is its long lamp life. In Eco Mode, the lamp can provide up to 18 years of usage based on average viewing habits, significantly reducing maintenance costs and ensuring long-term reliability.</p><p>Despite its powerful performance, the projector remains energy-efficient and cost-effective, making it an excellent investment for businesses, educational institutions, and home users seeking a dependable projection solution.</p><p>Whether you\'re delivering important business presentations, conducting training sessions, teaching in classrooms, or enjoying movies and sports on a giant screen, the Epson EB-W06 offers outstanding brightness, image quality, portability, and durability in one compact package.</p><h2>Key Features</h2><ul><li>WXGA (1280 x 800) Resolution</li><li>3,700 Lumens White Light Output</li><li>3,700 Lumens Colour Light Output</li><li>Advanced 3LCD Technology</li><li>Up to 320-inch Display Size</li><li>16,000:1 Contrast Ratio</li><li>Bright and Vivid Color Reproduction</li><li>Deep Blacks and Sharp Image Detail</li><li>Portable and Lightweight Design</li><li>Easy Setup and Operation</li><li>Long Lamp Life (Up to 18 Years in Eco Mode)</li><li>Ideal for Business, Education, and Home Entertainment</li><li>Energy-Efficient Performance</li></ul><h2>Why Buy from International Office Solution?</h2><p>Purchase the original Epson EB-W06 3700 Lumens WXGA 3LCD Office Projector from International Office Solution and enjoy genuine Epson products, competitive pricing, expert consultation, and reliable after-sales support. We provide professional projection solutions for businesses, educational institutions, training centers, and home users across Bangladesh.</p><h2>Warranty Information</h2><ul><li>Projector Warranty: As Per Epson Official Warranty Policy</li><li>Adapter/Power Cable: No Warranty</li><li>Box Mandatory While Claiming Warranty</li></ul>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>3LCD Technology, RGB Liquid Crystal Shutter</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>WXGA (1280 × 800)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>3,700 Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>1.68 m – 2.02 m (60-inch screen)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>16,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>33\" – 320\"</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Type</td><td>UHE</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Power</td><td>210 Watts</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>6,000 Hours (Normal Mode), 12,000 Hours (Eco Mode)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>2W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Input</td><td>Cinch Audio In</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>USB</td><td>USB 2.0 Type-A, USB 2.0 Type-B</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>VGA</td><td>1 × VGA In</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>HDMI</td><td>1 × HDMI In</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Video Input</td><td>1 × Composite In</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Input</td><td>1 × Cinch Audio In</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Supply Voltage</td><td>AC 100V – 240V, 50Hz – 60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>327W (Normal), 225W (Eco), 0.3W (Standby), 286W (JBMS-84 On Mode)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Information</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>2.5 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions (W × D × H)</td><td>302 × 237 × 82 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Service Warranty</td><td>2 Years Parts &amp; Service Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Warranty</td><td>12 Months or 1000 Hours Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 74000.00, 74000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/4qCQ4h1MQEM6hTD8CjnyytsSVeUkJWDiIHNnErjk.jpg', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 04:21:28', '2026-06-13 04:21:28', 'Epson EB-W06 3700 Lumens WXGA 3LCD Office Projector | International Office Solution', 'Buy Epson EB-W06 3700 Lumens WXGA 3LCD Office Projector from International Office Solution. Enjoy bright 3,700-lumen projection, WXGA resolution, 320-inch display support, and long lamp life.', 'Epson EB-W06, Epson WXGA Projector, Epson 3700 Lumens Projector, 3LCD Projector, Office Projector, Business Projector, Classroom Projector, WXGA Projector, Epson Projector Bangladesh, Portable Projector, Presentation Projector', NULL, 3, NULL, NULL);
