(502, 'Epson Projector EB-X49 3600 Lumens XGA 3LCD Multimedia', 'The Epson EB-X49 3600 Lumens XGA 3LCD Projector delivers bright and vibrant presentations with XGA resolution, 3LCD technology, and 3,600 lumens brightness. Featuring a 15,000:1 contrast ratio, built-in 5W speaker, network connectivity, and up to 12,000 hours lamp life, it is an ideal solution for classrooms, offices, and meeting rooms.', 'epson-projector-eb-x49-3600-lumens-xga-3lcd-multimedia-1781325133', '<p>The Epson EB-X49 3600 Lumens XGA 3LCD Projector is a reliable and versatile projection solution designed for classrooms, meeting rooms, training centers, and business environments. Featuring Epson\'s advanced 3LCD technology, the projector delivers vibrant colors, sharp images, and consistent brightness for professional presentations and educational applications.</p><p>With 3,600 lumens of color and white brightness and XGA (1024 x 768) resolution, the Epson EB-X49 produces clear and vivid visuals even in brightly lit rooms. Its impressive 15,000:1 contrast ratio enhances image quality by providing deeper blacks and brighter whites, ensuring excellent readability for text, charts, and multimedia content.</p><h3>Large Screen Projection with Outstanding Clarity</h3><p>The Epson EB-X49 supports screen sizes up to 300 inches, making it ideal for classrooms, conference rooms, and training facilities. Whether displaying presentations, educational content, videos, or business reports, the projector delivers crisp and engaging visuals that capture audience attention.</p><h3>Brilliant Brightness for Well-Lit Rooms</h3><p>Equipped with 3,600 lumens of brightness, the EB-X49 performs exceptionally well in environments with ambient lighting. Presenters can keep room lights on while maintaining clear and visible projected content, improving audience engagement and note-taking.</p><h3>Long Lamp Life and Low Maintenance</h3><p>The Epson EB-X49 is designed to reduce maintenance requirements and operating costs. Its lamp and air filter can last up to 12,000 hours in Eco Mode, allowing years of dependable operation before replacement is required.</p><p><strong>Lamp Life:</strong></p><ul><li>Normal Mode: Up to 6,000 Hours</li><li>Eco Mode: Up to 12,000 Hours</li></ul><h3>Flexible Installation and Easy Setup</h3><p>The projector offers automatic vertical and manual horizontal keystone correction, allowing flexible placement while maintaining perfectly aligned images. A wide optical zoom range further enhances installation flexibility, making it suitable for various room sizes and layouts.</p><h3>Built-in Audio for Convenient Presentations</h3><p>A built-in 5W speaker provides clear audio for presentations and educational content without requiring external speakers, making setup simple and efficient.</p><h3>Network and Wireless Connectivity</h3><p>The Epson EB-X49 supports wired network connectivity through RJ45 and can be upgraded with optional Wi-Fi functionality for wireless device access. This enables convenient content sharing and integration into existing office or school networks.</p><h3>Comprehensive Connectivity Options</h3><p>The projector includes a wide range of input and output interfaces, including HDMI, VGA, USB, Composite Video, Audio In/Out, and LAN connectivity, ensuring compatibility with laptops, desktop computers, document cameras, and media players.</p><h3>Why Buy from International Office Solution (IOS)?</h3><p>International Office Solution (IOS) offers genuine Epson projectors with competitive pricing, professional consultation, installation support, and reliable after-sales service throughout Bangladesh. Whether for education, business presentations, or training applications, the Epson EB-X49 provides dependable performance, excellent image quality, and outstanding value for money.</p>', '<p>Projection Features<br>Display Type<br>3LCD Technology, RGB liquid crystal shutter<br>0.55 inch with C2 Fine<br>Resolution<br>1024 x 768<br>Brightness<br>3,600 Lumen<br>Projection Distance<br>16.9 mm - 20.28 mm<br>Contrast Ratio<br>16,000 : 1<br>Lamp Details<br>Type<br>UHE<br>Lamp Power<br>210 W<br>Lamp Life<br>UHE, 210 W, 6,000 h durability, 12,000 h durability (economy mode)<br>Audio<br>Built-in Speaker<br>5W speaker<br>Connectivity<br>Interface<br>USB 2.0 Type A, USB 2.0 Type B, RS-232C, Wireless LAN IEEE 802.11b/g/n (WiFi 4) (optional), VGA in (2x), VGA out, HDMI in, Composite in, Component in (2x), RGB in (2x), Stereo mini jack audio out, Stereo mini jack audio in (2x), Wired Network<br>Power<br>AC 100 V - 240 V, 50 Hz - 60 Hz<br>309 Watt, 227 Watt (economy), 0.2 Watt (standby)<br>External Features<br>Color<br>White<br>Weight<br>2.7 kg<br>Dimension<br>302‎ x 249 x 87 mm (Width x Depth x Height)<br>Warranty<br>Manufacturing Warranty<br>02 years Parts &amp; Service warranty /Lamp: 12 Months or 1000hrs warranty</p>', 'PROJECTOR', 68000.00, 68000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/vxg8T0B5Qoq3VekCaZAWFenppBARneDCnF8gWWLs.jpg', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 04:32:13', '2026-06-13 04:32:13', 'Epson EB-X49 3600 Lumens XGA 3LCD Projector Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Epson EB-X49 3600 Lumens XGA 3LCD Projector from International Office Solution (IOS). Features XGA resolution, 3LCD technology, 15,000:1 contrast ratio, network connectivity, and up to 12,000 hours lamp life.', 'Epson EB-X49 Price in Bangladesh, Epson EB-X49 Projector, Epson XGA Projector, Epson 3600 Lumens Projector, Epson 3LCD Projector, Epson Classroom Projector, Epson Business Projector Bangladesh, Epson Presentation Projector, Epson HDMI Projector, Epson Office Projector, Epson Wireless Projector, Epson Projector Price BD, Epson Education Projector, Epson Conference Room Projector, Epson Multimedia Projector, International Office Solution, IOS Bangladesh, Epson Projector Supplier Bangladesh, Epson Projector Distributor Bangladesh, Epson EB-X49 Bangladesh', NULL, 3, NULL, NULL),
(503, 'Epson Projector CO-FH02 3000 Lumens 3LCD Full HD Android', 'The Epson CO-FH02 Full HD 1080p Projector delivers a massive up to 391-inch display with 3LCD technology, 3000 lumens brightness, and Android TV support. Ideal for movies, gaming, and presentations, it offers vibrant colors, easy setup, and reliable performance for home and office use.', 'epson-projector-co-fh02-3000-lumens-3lcd-full-hd-android-1781326090', '<p>The <strong>Epson CO-FH02 Full HD 1080p Projector</strong> is a powerful and versatile projection solution designed for home entertainment, business presentations, and educational environments. With its advanced <strong>Full HD 1080p resolution</strong>, it delivers sharp, detailed, and crystal-clear visuals, ensuring an immersive viewing experience whether you are watching movies, playing games, or delivering presentations.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>3LCD technology</strong>, the Epson CO-FH02 produces consistent and vibrant colors with outstanding brightness. With <strong>3,000 lumens of white and color brightness</strong>, it ensures excellent visibility even in well-lit rooms, making it suitable for both daytime and nighttime use.</p><p>This projector supports a massive <strong>screen size ranging from 26 inches to 391 inches</strong>, allowing users to enjoy a cinema-like experience at home or in professional settings. With a projection distance of approximately <strong>1.58 meters</strong> and a digital zoom range of <strong>1.0 – 1.35x</strong>, it provides flexible installation options for different room sizes.</p><p>The Epson CO-FH02 is designed for convenience and ease of use. It features <strong>keystone correction</strong>, allowing users to quickly adjust image alignment for a perfectly rectangular display even when the projector is placed at an angle. The HDMI input ensures seamless connectivity with laptops, gaming consoles, streaming devices, and more.</p><p>One of its standout features is the built-in <strong>Android TV functionality</strong>, which allows users to stream content directly from popular apps without needing external devices. This makes it an all-in-one entertainment solution for modern users.</p><p>Powered by a durable <strong>188W UHE lamp</strong>, the projector offers an impressive lamp life of up to <strong>6,000 hours</strong>, ensuring long-term performance and reduced maintenance costs. Its energy-efficient design and reliable build quality make it a dependable choice for everyday use.</p><p>Now available at <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, the Epson CO-FH02 is the perfect combination of brightness, clarity, smart features, and ease of use—making it ideal for home theaters, offices, classrooms, and gaming setups.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Technology</td><td>LCD</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>Full HD (1920 × 1080)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Brightness</td><td>3,000 Lumens (Normal), 2,000 Lumens (Eco)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>0.9m – 10.4m</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>16,000:1</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Type</td><td>UHE</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Power</td><td>188W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Up to 6,000 Hours (Normal), Up to 12,000 Hours (Eco Mode)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>USB Ports</td><td>USB 2.0-A, USB 2.0, Powered USB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI</td><td>HDMI Input ×1</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Wireless Connectivity</td><td>Wireless LAN IEEE 802.11a/b/g/n/ac</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Consumption (Peak)</td><td>270W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Consumption (Eco)</td><td>214W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Standby Power Consumption</td><td>0.5W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specifications</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specifications</strong></td><td>Weight</td><td>2.6 kg</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specifications</strong></td><td>Dimensions (W × D × H)</td><td>320 × 211 × 87 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Parts &amp; Service Warranty</td><td>2 Years</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Lamp Warranty</td><td>12 Months or 1000 Hours</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 64000.00, 64000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/0SP2N9UJ96NrDTGc3BfIofEeyy2kgi16GAO6PdLj.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 04:48:10', '2026-06-13 04:48:10', 'Epson CO-FH02 Full HD Projector Price in Bangladesh | 3000 Lumens 3LCD | International Office Solution', 'Buy Epson CO-FH02 Full HD 1080p projector with 3000 lumens brightness, 3LCD technology, Android TV, and up to 391-inch display. Best price in Bangladesh at International Office Solution.', 'Epson CO-FH02, Epson projector Bangladesh, Full HD projector BD, 3000 lumens projector, 3LCD projector, home theater projector, Android TV projector, Epson 1080p projector, office projector Bangladesh, International Office Solution projector', NULL, 3, NULL, NULL),
(504, 'Epson Projector CB-X49 3600 Lumens XGA 3LCD Multimedia', 'The Epson 3LCD XGA Projector delivers 3600 lumens brightness, 16,000:1 contrast ratio, and a 30–300 inch projection range. With a 210W UHE lamp, multiple connectivity options, and a built-in 5W speaker, it is ideal for offices, classrooms, and presentations.', 'epson-projector-cb-x49-3600-lumens-xga-3lcd-multimedia-1781326754', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Epson 3LCD XGA Projector</strong> is a reliable and high-quality projection device designed for professional presentations, educational environments, and business meetings. Built with advanced <strong>3LCD technology and RGB liquid crystal shutter system</strong>, it produces bright, sharp, and color-accurate images for a wide range of content.</p><p>With a powerful brightness output of <strong>3,600 lumens</strong>, this projector ensures clear visibility even in well-lit rooms, making it suitable for classrooms, conference halls, and office environments. The <strong>XGA resolution (1024 × 768)</strong> delivers crisp and readable visuals, while the <strong>16,000:1 contrast ratio</strong> enhances image depth and clarity for more impactful presentations.</p><p>It supports a flexible <strong>projection size ranging from 30 inches up to 300 inches</strong>, allowing users to adjust screen size according to room space and usage requirements. The <strong>4:3 aspect ratio</strong> is especially suitable for educational materials, spreadsheets, and standard business presentations.</p><p>Equipped with a durable <strong>210W UHE lamp</strong>, the projector offers up to <strong>6,000 hours of lamp life</strong>, and up to <strong>12,000 hours in economy mode</strong>, ensuring long-term performance and reduced maintenance costs.</p><p>For connectivity, the projector includes multiple interface options such as <strong>HDMI, dual D-Sub, RCA, and stereo audio ports</strong>, allowing seamless connection with laptops, PCs, DVD players, and other multimedia devices.</p><p>The built-in <strong>5W speaker</strong> provides basic audio output for presentations without requiring external speakers. Its lightweight design of <strong>2.7 kg</strong> and compact body make it easy to install and transport.</p><p>Now available at <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, this Epson projector is an excellent choice for users seeking a durable, bright, and cost-effective projection solution for professional and educational use.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Technology</td><td>3LCD RGB Liquid Crystal Shutter</td><td>Projection</td></tr><tr><td>Display Chip</td><td>0.55 inch</td><td>Hardware</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>XGA (1024 × 768)</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>3,600 Lumens</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>4:3</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>16,000:1</td><td>Image Quality</td></tr><tr><td>Image Size</td><td>30 – 300 inches</td><td>Projection</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Type</td><td>210W UHE Lamp</td><td>Hardware</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Life</td><td>6,000 hrs (Up to 12,000 hrs Eco Mode)</td><td>Durability</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>HDMI, D-Sub, RCA, Audio Ports</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>Speaker</td><td>5W Built-in Speaker</td><td>Audio</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>309W (Normal), 227W (Eco), 0.2W (Standby)</td><td>Power</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>2.7 kg</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>302 × 249 × 87 mm</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td><td>Design</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>2 Years + 12 Months/1000hrs Lamp</td><td>Support</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 63000.00, 63000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/YyO4PXOAw5KnZJrx0If3jq9B7fupPZCtcj1Udrt1.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 04:59:14', '2026-06-13 04:59:14', 'Epson 3600 Lumens XGA 3LCD Projector Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Epson XGA 3LCD projector with 3600 lumens brightness, 16,000:1 contrast, 30–300 inch display, HDMI support, and 210W lamp. Best price in Bangladesh at International Office Solution.', 'Epson projector Bangladesh, 3600 lumens projector, XGA projector BD, 3LCD projector Epson, office projector Bangladesh, classroom projector, HDMI projector Epson, 300 inch projector, business projector BD, International Office Solution projector', NULL, 3, NULL, NULL),
(505, 'Epson Projector EB-E12 3600 Lumens XGA 3LCD', 'The Epson XGA 3LCD Projector delivers bright and clear visuals with 3,600 lumens brightness and up to 350–391 inch screen support. Featuring 3LCD technology, HDMI connectivity, and long-lasting 210W UHE lamp, it is ideal for classrooms, offices, and home entertainment with sharp image quality and reliable performance.', 'epson-projector-eb-e12-3600-lumens-xga-3lcd-1781327020', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Epson XGA 3LCD Projector is a powerful and reliable projection solution designed for both professional and personal use. With advanced 3LCD projection technology and a 0.55-inch C2 Fine LCD panel, it delivers vibrant, color-accurate images with a resolution of 1024 × 768 (XGA), ensuring sharp and detailed visuals for presentations, movies, and educational content.</p><p>With a brightness output of up to 3,600 lumens, this projector performs exceptionally well even in well-lit environments, making it suitable for classrooms, offices, conference rooms, and home setups. The high contrast ratio of up to 16,000:1 enhances image depth, providing clearer blacks and more defined highlights for a superior viewing experience.</p><p>The projector supports large screen sizes ranging from 30 inches up to 350–391 inches, allowing flexible installation in different environments. Its zoom and keystone correction features ensure easy setup and perfectly aligned images even in limited spaces.</p><p>Equipped with a durable 210W UHE lamp, the projector offers a long lamp life of up to 12,000 hours in eco mode, reducing maintenance costs and ensuring long-term usability. The built-in speaker adds basic audio support, while HDMI, D-Sub, and RCA connectivity options ensure compatibility with laptops, media players, and gaming devices.</p><p>Designed with energy efficiency in mind, it consumes lower power in eco mode and operates quietly, making it ideal for extended usage in professional environments.</p><p>Offered by <strong>International Office Solution (IOS)</strong>, this Epson projector is a dependable choice for users seeking high brightness, reliable performance, and long-lasting projection technology.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th><th>Category</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Technology</td><td>3LCD RGB liquid crystal shutter</td><td>Projection</td></tr><tr><td>LCD Panel Size</td><td>0.55-inch C2 Fine</td><td>Projection</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>XGA (1024 × 768)</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>3,600 Lumens</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>Up to 16,000:1</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td>Image Size</td><td>30\" – 350/391\"</td><td>Projection</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Distance</td><td>0.87 – 10.34 m</td><td>Projection</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Type</td><td>210W UHE Lamp</td><td>Hardware</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Up to 12,000 hours (Eco Mode)</td><td>Hardware</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Built-in Speaker (2W–5W depending model)</td><td>Audio</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>HDMI, D-Sub, RCA, USB Type-B</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>Power Supply</td><td>AC 100–240V</td><td>Power</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>231W – 332W (mode dependent)</td><td>Power</td></tr><tr><td>Noise Level</td><td>28dB – 37dB</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>Approx. 2.4 – 2.7 kg</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>302 × 234 × 77 mm</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>02 Years Parts &amp; Service Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 56000.00, 56000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/gISaRnk60nusoQdxtJIJnUcdA7fy86XPllGaeQEr.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 05:03:40', '2026-06-13 05:03:40', 'Epson XGA 3LCD Projector 3600 Lumens | IOS Bangladesh', 'Buy Epson XGA 3LCD Projector with 3600 lumens brightness, 210W UHE lamp, HDMI connectivity & up to 350 inch display. Best price in Bangladesh at International Office Solution (IOS).', 'Epson projector, XGA projector Bangladesh, 3LCD projector, 3600 lumens projector, office projector Bangladesh, HDMI projector, Epson 210W lamp projector, classroom projector, IOS projector Bangladesh, International Office Solution projector', NULL, 3, NULL, NULL),
(506, 'Epson Projector EB-W53 4000 Lumens 3LCD WXGA', 'The Epson WXGA 3LCD Projector delivers 4000 lumens brightness with 1280 × 800 WXGA resolution for sharp and vibrant visuals. Featuring 3LCD technology, 16:10 aspect ratio, and up to 375-inch screen support, it is ideal for classrooms, offices, and presentations with reliable performance and easy HDMI connectivity.', 'epson-projector-eb-w53-4000-lumens-3lcd-wxga-1781327264', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Epson WXGA 3LCD Projector is a high-performance projection solution designed for professional presentations, educational environments, and home entertainment. Built with advanced 3LCD RGB liquid crystal shutter technology, it delivers bright, clear, and color-accurate visuals with a WXGA resolution of 1280 × 800.</p><p>With an impressive brightness of 4000 lumens, this projector ensures excellent visibility even in well-lit rooms, making it suitable for classrooms, conference halls, training centers, and office environments. The high contrast ratio of 16,000:1 enhances image depth, producing sharper blacks and more detailed highlights for a more immersive viewing experience.</p><p>The projector supports a large screen size range from 33 inches up to 375 inches, allowing flexible installation for both small meeting rooms and large halls. Its 16:10 aspect ratio is optimized for business and educational content, providing a more natural widescreen display.</p><p>Equipped with a durable 210W UHE lamp, the projector offers up to 6,000 hours of standard lamp life and up to 12,000 hours in eco mode, ensuring long-term reliability and reduced maintenance costs. Keystone correction (±30° vertical and horizontal) and digital zoom features allow easy alignment and flexible setup in any environment.</p><p>For connectivity, it includes dual HDMI inputs and USB Type-B service port, ensuring compatibility with laptops, media devices, and other multimedia sources. A built-in 2W speaker provides basic audio support for presentations witho