(507, 'Epson Projector CO-W01 3000 Lumens 3LCD WXGA', 'The Epson WXGA LCD Projector offers 3000 lumens brightness with 1280×800 resolution for clear and vibrant visuals. With 16:10 aspect ratio, HDMI connectivity, and long-lasting UHE lamp, it is perfect for classrooms, offices, and presentations with reliable performance and energy efficiency.', 'epson-projector-co-w01-3000-lumens-3lcd-wxga-1781327626', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Epson WXGA LCD Projector is a reliable and efficient projection solution designed for educational, business, and home environments. Featuring advanced LCD technology, it delivers bright, clear, and color-accurate visuals with a WXGA resolution of 1280 × 800, ensuring sharp image quality for presentations, videos, and learning content.</p><p>With a brightness output of 3000 lumens (color and white light output), this projector performs well in moderately lit environments, making it suitable for classrooms, meeting rooms, and small office setups. The 16:10 widescreen aspect ratio enhances productivity by providing more display area for documents and presentations.</p><p>Equipped with a durable 188W UHE lamp, the projector offers long-lasting performance with up to 12,000 hours of lamp life in eco mode, reducing maintenance costs and ensuring long-term usability. The built-in speaker provides basic audio output, making it convenient for presentations without external sound systems.</p><p>Connectivity options include HDMI 1.4, USB Type-A, and USB Type-B (service), ensuring compatibility with laptops, media players, and other devices. Its lightweight design (2.4 kg) and compact size make it easy to install and transport across different locations.</p><p>With energy-efficient operation, consuming only 270W in normal mode and as low as 0.5W in standby, this projector is both cost-effective and eco-friendly. Supported by <strong>International Office Solution (IOS)</strong>, it is a dependable choice for users who need consistent performance, portability