(508, 'Epson Projector EB-E01 3LCD XGA 3300 Lumens', 'The Epson XGA LCD Projector delivers 3300 lumens brightness with 1024×768 resolution for clear and stable projection. Featuring 15,000:1 contrast ratio, HDMI/VGA connectivity, and a 210W UHE lamp, it is ideal for classrooms, offices, and presentations with reliable performance and long lamp life.', 'epson-projector-eb-e01-3lcd-xga-3300-lumens-1781327904', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Epson XGA LCD Projector is a dependable and high-performance projection device designed for educational institutions, corporate environments, and home users. Built with advanced LCD projection technology, it delivers sharp and clear visuals at a resolution of 1024 × 768 (XGA), ensuring detailed image quality for presentations, documents, and multimedia content.</p><p>With a brightness output of 3300 lumens, this projector provides excellent visibility in moderately lit environments, making it suitable for classrooms, training centers, and office meeting rooms. The high contrast ratio of 15,000:1 enhances image depth, producing richer blacks and more vibrant colors for a better viewing experience.</p><p>The projector supports a large projection size ranging from 30 inches up to 350 inches, offering flexible installation options for both small and large spaces. A projection distance of approximately 1.76 meters for a 30-inch image ensures easy setup even in compact rooms.</p><p>Equipped with a durable 210W UHE lamp, the projector offers up to 6,000 hours of lamp life in standard mode and up to 12,000 hours in eco mode, reducing maintenance costs and ensuring long-term reliability.</p><p>Connectivity options include HDMI and VGA input along with USB 2.0 Type-B, which also supports USB display and mouse control functionality for enhanced usability. This ensures compatibility with laptops, desktops, and other multimedia devices.</p><p>With energy-efficient operation—327W in normal mode, 225W in eco mode, and ultra-low standby power consumption of 0.3W—this projector is both cost-effective and environmentally friendly.</p><p>Supported by <strong>International Office Solution (IOS)</strong>, this Epson LCD Projector is a strong choice for users who need durability, clarity, and consistent performance in everyday projection tasks.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Projection Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>LCD</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>1024 x 768</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>3,300 Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Distance</td><td>1.76 m</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>15,000 : 1</td></tr><tr><td>Image Size</td><td>30 inches - 350 inches</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>UHE</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Power</td><td>210 W</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Life</td><td>6,000 h durability, 12,000 h durability (economy mode)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connectivity</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>Supply Voltage-<br>AC 100 V - 240 V, 50 Hz - 60 Hz<br>Power consumption-<br>Interfaces: VGA in, HDMI in, USB 2.0 Type B<br>USB Display Function: 2 in 1: Image / Mouse</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>327 Watt, 225 Watt (economy), 0.3 Watt (standby), On mode power consumption as defined in JBMS-84 286 Watt</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>External Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>2.4 kg</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>302‎ x 237 x 82 mm</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>2 Years Parts &amp; Service</td></tr><tr><td>Parts Warranty</td><td>Lamp: 12 Months or 1000hrs</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 43000.00, 42500.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/zhilxBHqQcTsZYkb7McKUUjVIeJNsUmmyYSzbuK5.jpg', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 05:18:24', '2026-06-13 05:18:24', 'Epson XGA 3300 Lumens LCD Projector | IOS Banglades