 lumens brightness, 1280×800 resolution, HDMI/VGA support, RCA input & long 210W lamp life. Best price in Bangladesh from International Office Solution (IOS).', 'Epson WXGA projector, 4000 lumens projector Bangladesh, 3LCD projector BD, Epson 1280x800 projector, office projector Bangladesh, classroom projector Epson, HDMI VGA projector Epson, RCA projector, IOS projector Bangladesh, International Office Solution projector', NULL, 3, NULL, NULL),
(511, 'Epson Projector EB-W55 4000 Lumens 3LCD WXGA', 'The Epson WXGA 3LCD Wireless Projector delivers 4000 lumens brightness with 1280×800 resolution for sharp and vibrant visuals. Featuring built-in WiFi, HDMI dual input, 16:10 aspect ratio, and up to 320-inch display support, it is ideal for classrooms, offices, and presentations.', 'epson-projector-eb-w55-4000-lumens-3lcd-wxga-1781334728', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Epson WXGA 3LCD Wireless Projector is a high-performance projection solution designed for modern classrooms, offices, and professional environments. Powered by advanced 3LCD RGB liquid crystal shutter technology, it delivers bright, sharp, and color-accurate visuals with a WXGA resolution of 1280 × 800.</p><p>With a powerful 4000 lumens brightness output, this projector ensures excellent visibility even in well-lit environments, making it suitable for presentations, training sessions, and educational use. The high contrast ratio of 16,000:1 enhances image clarity by producing deeper blacks and more vivid color reproduction for an immersive viewing experience.</p><p>The projector supports a large projection size ranging from 33 inches up to 320 inches, offering flexible installation options for both small meeting rooms and large halls. Its short projection distance (1.68 m – 2.02 m for 60-inch screen) allows easy setup even in compact spaces.</p><p>Equipped with a durable 210W UHE lamp, it provides up to 6,000 hours of standard life and up to 12,000 hours in eco mode, ensuring long-term reliability and reduced maintenance costs.</p><p>Connectivity is highly versatile with dual HDMI inputs, USB Type-A, USB Type-B (service), and built-in wireless LAN (WiFi 802.11 a/b/g/n), allowing seamless wireless projection from laptops and mobile devices. The manual zoom (1–2x) and keystone correction (±30° vertical &amp; horizontal) ensure flexible installation and perfect image alignment.</p><p>With energy-efficient operation (as low as 0.3W standby power) and multiple power modes, it is both cost-effective and environmentally friendly. The built-in 2W speaker provides basic audio support for presentations.</p><p>Offered by <strong>International Office Solution (IOS)</strong>, this Epson WXGA Wireless Projector is an excellent choice for users who need brightness, flexibility, and modern wireless connectivity in one reliable device.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th><th>Category</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Technology</td><td>3LCD RGB Liquid Crystal Shutter</td><td>Projection</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>WXGA (1280 × 800)</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>4000 Lumens</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:10</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>16,000:1</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td>Image Size</td><td>33\" – 320\"</td><td>Projection</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Distance</td><td>1.68 m – 2.02 m (60\")</td><td>Projection</td></tr><tr><td>Throw Ratio</td><td>1.30 – 1.56:1</td><td>Projection</td></tr><tr><td>Zoom</td><td>Manual (1–2x)</td><td>Projection</td></tr><tr><td>Keystone Correction</td><td>±30° Vertical &amp; Horizontal</td><td>Adjustment</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Type</td><td>210W UHE Lamp</td><td>Hardware</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Life</td><td>6,000 hrs / 12,000 hrs (Eco Mode)</td><td>Hardware</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>2× HDMI, USB-A, USB-B, WiFi (802.11 a/b/g/n)</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Built-in WiFi</td><td>Feature</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Built-in 2W Speaker</td><td>Audio</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>284W (Normal), 181W (Eco), 0.3W Standby</td><td>Power</td></tr><tr><td>Power Supply</td><td>AC 100–240V</td><td>Power</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>2.6 kg</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>302 × 237 × 92 mm</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>2 Years Service, 1 Year Parts, Lamp 12 Months / 1000 Hours</td><td>Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/5ZNhMTEx17SA4aju5oxPjwc09XttIauDlCjAi8by.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 07:12:08', '2026-06-13 07:12:08', 'Epson WXGA 4000 Lumens Wireless 3LCD Projector | IOS Bangladesh', 'Buy Epson WXGA 3LCD Wireless Projector with 4000 lumens brightness, 1280×800 resolution, built-in WiFi, HDMI support & up to 320-inch display. Best price in Bangladesh from International Office Solution (IOS)', 'Epson WXGA projector, 4000 lumens wireless projector, 3LCD projector Bangladesh, Epson WiFi projector, office projector BD, classroom projector Epson, HDMI wireless projector, Epson 1280x800 projector, IOS projector Bangladesh, International Office Solution projector', NULL, 3, NULL, NULL);
