(512, 'Epson Projector EB-X06 XGA 3600 Lumens 3LCD Business Classroom', 'The Epson XGA 3LCD Projector delivers bright and clear 3600-lumen output with 3LCD technology for vivid color accuracy. Featuring XGA (1024×768) resolution and a high 16,000:1 contrast ratio, it ensures sharp presentations and reliable performance. With a long-lasting lamp life of up to 12,000 hours, this projector is designed for classrooms, offices, and professional presentations.', 'epson-projector-eb-x06-xga-3600-lumens-3lcd-business-classroom-1781334982', '<p>The Epson XGA 3LCD Projector is built to deliver dependable performance for business, education, and professional environments. Powered by advanced 3LCD technology, it produces bright and balanced color output with 3600 lumens brightness, ensuring clear visibility even in well-lit rooms.</p><p>With XGA (1024 × 768) resolution, the projector provides sharp and readable visuals for presentations, documents, and multimedia content. Its high 16,000:1 contrast ratio enhances image depth and detail, making text and graphics more defined and professional-looking.</p><p>One of its key advantages is the long-lasting lamp system, offering up to 12,000 hours of usage, reducing maintenance cost and ensuring long-term reliability. The compact white design makes it suitable for portable use as well as fixed installation in classrooms, meeting rooms, and training centers.</p><p>This projector is engineered for consistent performance, energy efficiency, and ease of use, making it a practical choice for users who need a durable and cost-effective projection solution.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th><th>Category</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3LCD Projection System, High Brightness, XGA Resolution, Long Lamp Life, Office &amp; Classroom Use</td><td>Display Type: 3LCD TechnologyResolution: XGA (1024 × 768)Brightness: 3600 LumensContrast Ratio: 16,000:1Lamp Life: 12,000 HoursColor: WhiteWarranty: 2 Years Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>Epson XGA 3LCD Projector</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/nLc85xX88jTQJ5LHUOjuc59Jg3j1QelyzGmacetn.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-13 07:16:22', '2026-06-13 07:16:22', 'Epson XGA 3LCD Projector 3600 Lumens – Long Lamp Life 12000 Hours', 'Buy Epson XGA 3LCD Projector with 3600 lumens brightness, 1024×768 resolution, 16,000:1 contrast ratio, and 12,000-hour lamp life. Ideal for office and classroom use.', 'Epson projector, XGA projector, 3LCD projector, 3600 lumens projector, Epson business projector, classroom projector, office projector, Epson XGA 1024x768 projector, long lamp life projector, 12000 hours projector', NULL, 3, NULL, NULL),
(513, 'EPSON Projector EB-L630U 6200 Lumens 3LCD WUXGA LASER Multimedia', 'The EPSON EB-L630U 6200 Lumens 3LCD WUXGA Laser Projector delivers exceptional brightness and clarity with advanced 3LCD technology. Featuring 2,500,000:1 contrast ratio, WUXGA resolution, and laser light source up to 30,000 hours, it is ideal for professional presentations, large venues, and high-quality visual experiences.', 'epson-projector-eb-l630u-6200-lumens-3lcd-wuxga-laser-multimedia-1781335259', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The EPSON EB-L630U 6200 Lumens 3LCD WUXGA Laser Multimedia Projector is a premium-grade projection solution designed for business, education, and large-scale display environments. Built with advanced 3LCD Technology and RGB liquid crystal shutter system, it delivers highly accurate and vibrant color reproduction with support for up to 1.07 billion colors.</p><p>With WUXGA (1920 × 1200) resolution, this projector ensures ultra-sharp image clarity, making it perfect for detailed presentations, videos, and professional content. Its powerful 6200 lumens brightness (both color and white light output) guarantees excellent visibility even in brightly lit rooms.</p><p>The projector features an industry-leading 2,500,000:1 contrast ratio, producing deep blacks and vivid highlights for a more immersive viewing experience. Its laser light source offers an extended lifespan of up to 20,000 hours in normal mode and up to 30,000 hours in eco mode, significantly reducing maintenance costs.</p><p>Installation flexibility is enhanced with vertical lens shift up to ±50% and horizontal shift up to ±20%, along with manual zoom and keystone correction (±30° vertical/horizontal). It supports screen sizes from 50 inches up to 500 inches, making it suitable for auditoriums, conference halls, classrooms, and events.</p><p>Connectivity is highly versatile, including HDMI (2x), VGA in/out, USB Type-A &amp; B, RS-232C, HDBaseT, Ethernet, Wireless LAN (2.4GHz &amp; 5GHz), Miracast, and audio input/output ports. This ensures seamless integration with modern multimedia systems.</p><p>With energy-efficient performance (345W normal, 258W eco, 0.3W standby) and a compact design (8.4 kg), the EPSON EB-L630U combines power, efficiency, and portability in one professional-grade device.</p><h2><strong>🛒 Buy Now</strong></h2><p>Buy EPSON EB-L630U 6200 Lumens 3LCD WUXGA LASER Multimedia Projector from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>.<br>We offer a wide range of original Epson projectors at the best price in Bangladesh. Order online or visit your nearest store to get yours today.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th><th>Category</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>High Brightness WUXGA 3LCD Projector, Ultra Wide Connectivity, Large Venue Projection, Advanced Lens Shift &amp; Wireless Support</td><td>Display Type: 3LCD Technology (RGB liquid crystal shutter)Resolution: WUXGA (1920 × 1200)Brightness: 6200 Lumens (Color &amp; White)Aspect Ratio: 16:10Contrast Ratio: 2,500,000:1Image Size: 50 – 500 inchesLens Shift: Vertical ±50%, Horizontal ±20%Color Reproduction: Up to 1.07 billion colorsConnectivity: HDMI, VGA, USB, HDBaseT, Ethernet, Wireless LAN, MiracastWeight: 8.4 kgColor: WhiteWarranty: 1 Year Parts &amp; Service (Lamp: 12 Months or 1000 Hours)</td><td>Epson WUXGA 3LCD Large Venue Projector</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/sb3AVfAHt5L9K8RhFxQ24BQ47FkFij94Iw1YeTyD.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-13 07:20:59', '2026-06-13 07:20:59', 'EPSON EB-L630U 6200 Lumens WUXGA 3LCD Laser Projector – 500 Inch Display', 'Buy EPSON EB-L630U 6200 Lumens WUXGA 3LCD Laser Projector with 2,500,000:1 contrast ratio, 500-inch display support, and 30,000-hour laser life. Best for office & large venues.', 'Epson EB-L630U, Epson WUXGA projector, 6200 lumens projector, 3LCD laser projector, Epson business projector, large venue projector, 500 inch projector, Epson laser projector Bangladesh, conference room projector, high brightness projector', NULL, 3, NULL, NULL),
(514, 'Epson Projector EB-1485FI 5000 Lumens Full HD Laser Ultra Short Throw Interactive', 'The Epson Ultra Short Throw Laser Projector delivers 5,000 lumens brightness with advanced 3LCD technology for sharp and vibrant visuals. Featuring a long-lasting laser light source up to 30,000 hours, ultra short throw projection, and interactive classroom support, it is ideal for education, business, and collaborative environments.', 'epson-projector-eb-1485fi-5000-lumens-full-hd-laser-ultra-short-throw-interactive-1781335519', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Epson Ultra Short Throw Laser Projector is a professional-grade display solution designed for modern classrooms, training centers, and corporate environments. Powered by advanced 3LCD technology with a 0.62\" C2Fine LCD system, it delivers highly accurate color reproduction and bright, clear visuals.</p><p>With a powerful 5,000 lumens color and white light output (3,500 lumens in eco mode), this projector ensures excellent visibility even in bright environments. Its ultra-high contrast ratio of over 2,500,000:1 provides deep blacks and sharp detail for immersive presentations and video playback.</p><p>The laser diode light source offers exceptional durability with up to 20,000 hours in normal mode and 30,000 hours in extended mode, significantly reducing maintenance costs and downtime.</p><p>Designed for ultra-short throw installation, it can project large images from just 39.2 cm distance, supporting screen sizes from 61 inches up to 120 inches. This makes it ideal for classrooms and small meeting rooms where space is limited.</p><p>The projector includes a powerful 8W + 8W stereo speaker system for clear audio output, eliminating the need for external speakers in many setups. Connectivity is highly advanced, including HDMI, VGA, RCA, USB Type A &amp; B, LAN (RJ45), RS-232C, and support for wireless LAN via optional module.</p><p>It also supports interactive functionality, making it perfect for digital learning and collaborative presentations. With compact dimensions and a lightweight design, it is easy to install and integrate into any professional environment.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th><th>Category</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Ultra Short Throw Laser Projection, Interactive Support, High Brightness 3LCD System, Professional Classroom Display</td><td>Display Type: 0.62\" C2Fine LCD (3LCD System)Resolution: 1080p (1366 × 768 × 2)Brightness: 5,000 lm (Normal) / 3,500 lm (Eco)Contrast Ratio: Over 2,500,000:1Light Source: Laser DiodeLaser Life: 20,000 / 30,000 hoursThrow Distance: Ultra Short Throw (39.2–61.3 cm)Audio: 8W + 8W StereoConnectivity: HDMI, D-Sub, USB, LAN, RS-232C, Wireless LAN (optional), Interactive portsWeight: 620gColor: WhiteWarranty: 2 Years Parts &amp; Service (Lamp: 12 Months or 1000 Hours)</td><td>Epson Interactive Ultra Short Throw Laser Projector</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/vUTj5dTEHgxgjghIc1QA4pJ7qkH42eWYZ20bnbVg.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-13 07:25:19', '2026-06-13 07:25:19', 'Epson Ultra Short Throw Laser Projector 5000 Lumens 3LCD Interactive Classroom Projector', 'Buy Epson Ultra Short Throw Laser Projector with 5000 lumens brightness, 3LCD technology, 30,000-hour laser life, and interactive support. Ideal for classrooms and offices.', 'Epson ultra short throw projector, Epson laser projector 5000 lumens, interactive classroom projector, Epson 3LCD projector, short throw laser projector, Epson education projector, Epson business projector, Epson interactive projector Bangladesh, ultra short throw Epson projector, 30,000 hour projector', NULL, 3, NULL, NULL),
(515, 'Epson Projector PowerLite L610U 6000-Lumen WUXGA 3LCD Laser', 'The Epson WUXGA Laser Projector delivers 6,000 lumens brightness with advanced 3LCD imaging for sharp, vibrant visuals. Featuring a laser light source with up to 30,000 hours lifespan, 2,500,000:1 contrast ratio, and large screen support up to 500 inches, it is ideal for auditoriums, conference halls, and professional presentations.', 'epson-projector-powerlite-l610u-6000-lumen-wuxga-3lcd-laser-1781335914', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Epson WUXGA Laser Projector is a high-performance projection solution designed for large venues, corporate environments, and educational institutions. Built with advanced LCD (3LCD system) technology, it delivers exceptional color accuracy, brightness, and clarity for professional-grade presentations.</p><p>With a powerful 6,000 lumens brightness output, this projector ensures clear and vivid images even in well-lit environments. The WUXGA (1920 × 1200) resolution provides sharp detail and wide-format display support, making it suitable for data-heavy presentations, videos, and multimedia content.</p><p>Its ultra-high contrast ratio of up to 2,500,000:1 enhances image depth, producing rich blacks and bright highlights for a more immersive visual experience. The laser diode light source offers outstanding durability with up to 20,000 hours in normal mode and up to 30,000 hours in extended mode, significantly reducing maintenance and replacement costs.</p><p>Designed for flexibility, the projector supports screen sizes from 50 inches up to 500 inches with a projection distance range of 1.44 m to 14.76 m. This makes it ideal for auditoriums, training centers, conference halls, and large corporate setups.</p><p>Connectivity is highly advanced, including HDBaseT, dual HDMI (one with MHL support), VGA (D-sub), USB Type A &amp; B, RS-232C control, wired LAN, and built-in wireless LAN support. It also includes multiple audio input and output options for seamless integration into AV systems.</p><p>With a durable build weighing 8.45 kg and energy-efficient operation (370W normal, 0.3W energy-saving standby), this projector combines power, efficiency, and reliability in one professional package.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th><th>Category</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>High Brightness WUXGA Laser Projection, 3LCD Imaging System, Large Venue Display, Advanced Connectivity</td><td>Display Type: LCD (3LCD System)Resolution: WUXGA (1920 × 1200)Brightness: 6,000 LumensContrast Ratio: Up to 2,500,000:1Image Size: 50\"–500\"Light Source: Laser DiodeLaser Life: 20,000 / 30,000 hours (Normal/Extended)Connectivity: HDBaseT, HDMI (2x), D-Sub, USB, LAN, Wireless LAN, RS-232C, Audio In/OutWeight: 8.45 kgColor: WhiteWarranty: 1 Year Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>Epson WUXGA Laser Projector (Large Venue Series)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/xmXmjLwdf7XSeCJkNZTZY1JtezwMiVVKLvvPUUUI.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-13 07:31:54', '2026-06-13 07:31:54', 'Epson WUXGA 6000 Lumens Laser Projector 3LCD Large Venue 500 Inch Display', 'Buy Epson WUXGA Laser Projector with 6000 lumens brightness, 3LCD technology, 2,500,000:1 contrast ratio, and up to 500-inch display. Best for large venues and offices.', 'Epson WUXGA projector, Epson 6000 lumens laser projector, 3LCD large venue projector, Epson business projector, Epson conference projector, 500 inch projector, Epson laser projector Bangladesh, HDBaseT projector, professional Epson projector, high brightness projector\r\n\r\nIf you want next step, I can:\r\n✔ Convert ALL your Epson projector specs into one unified SEO template\r\n✔ Or build a full website category page (Projectors / Epson Series)\r\n✔ Or generate bulk product upload format (CSV/Excel) for eCommerce 👍', NULL, 3, NULL, NULL),
(516, 'Epson Projector EB-695Wi Ultra-Short Throw Interactive WXGA 3LCD', 'The Epson WXGA Ultra Short Throw 3LCD Projector delivers 3,500 lumens brightness with sharp WXGA resolution and 14,000:1 contrast ratio. Designed for classrooms and meeting rooms, it supports ultra-short throw projection from just 0.4 meters, multiple connectivity options, and built-in audio for an all-in-one presentation experience.', 'epson-projector-eb-695wi-ultra-short-throw-interactive-wxga-3lcd-1781337032', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Epson WXGA Ultra Short Throw 3LCD Projector is a powerful display solution designed for educational and professional environments requiring close-range projection with high clarity. Featuring advanced 3LCD technology, it produces bright and accurate color output with up to 3,500 lumens brightness, ensuring clear visibility even in well-lit rooms.</p><p>With WXGA (1280 × 800) resolution and a 14,000:1 contrast ratio, this projector delivers sharp text, detailed images, and smooth video playback, making it ideal for classrooms, training centers, and meeting rooms.</p><p>Its ultra-short throw design allows projection of 60-inch to 100-inch images from just 0.4 m to 0.6 m distance, reducing shadows and glare while enhancing user interaction. This makes it especially suitable for interactive teaching environments.</p><p>The projector includes a 250W lamp system with long durability of up to 10,000 hours in economy mode, ensuring reduced maintenance and long-term reliability. Multiple display modes such as Blackboard, Presentation, Dynamic, sRGB, and Theatre optimize visuals for different usage scenarios.</p><p>Connectivity is highly versatile, featuring 3x HDMI inputs (including MHL support), dual VGA in/out, USB Type-A and B, LAN, RS-232C, composite input, audio in/out, microphone input, and optional wireless LAN support. Built-in speaker and multi-audio input support enhance usability for presentations without external sound systems.</p><p>With a sturdy build weighing 5.8 kg and advanced environmental performance, this projector is engineered for continuous professional use in classrooms, offices, and training environments.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th><th>Category</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Ultra Short Throw 3LCD WXGA Projector, Bright Classroom Display, Multi-Input Connectivity, High Efficiency Lamp System</td><td>Display Type: 3LCD TechnologyResolution: WXGA (1280 × 800)Brightness: 3,500 Lumens (2,900 Eco)Contrast Ratio: 14,000:1Image Size: 60\"–100\"Throw Distance: Ultra Short Throw (0.4 m–0.6 m)Lamp Power: 250WLamp Life: 5,000 / 9,000 / 10,000 hours (Eco modes)Connectivity: HDMI (3x), VGA (2x), USB A/B, LAN, RS-232C, Composite, MHL, Audio &amp; Mic inputSpeaker: Built-inWeight: 5.8 kgColor: WhiteWarranty: 2 Years Parts &amp; Service (Lamp: 12 Months or 1000 Hours)</td><td>Epson WXGA Ultra Short Throw Projector</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/9FIADspwF7wBdpmqUbxUBvfGP8uhAWmMN2icCkdo.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 07:50:32', '2026-06-13 07:50:32', 'Epson Interactive 3LCD Education Projector | Smart Classroom Projector | International Office Solution', 'Buy Epson Interactive 3LCD Education Projector from International Office Solution. Enjoy smart classroom features, dual pen support, split-screen, wireless projection, and long lamp life for interactive learning.', 'Epson Interactive Projector, Epson 3LCD Projector, Smart Classroom Projector, Interactive Education Projector, Epson Split Screen Projector, Dual Pen Projector, Wireless Classroom Projector, Education Projector Bangladesh, Teaching Projector, School Projector, Epson iProjection Projector', NULL, 3, NULL, NULL),
(517, 'Epson  Projector EH-TW5820 3LCD 2700 Lumens Full HD Home Streaming', 'The Epson EH-TW5820 Full HD 1080p projector offers 2700 lumens brightness, Android TV streaming, 70,000:1 contrast ratio, 3LCD vivid color performance, built-in 10W speaker, and screen sizes up to 300 inches.', 'epson-projector-eh-tw5820-3lcd-2700-lumens-full-hd-home-streaming-1781337595', '<h3>The Epson EH-TW5820 is a premium Full HD 1080p home entertainment projector designed for movies, gaming, sports, and streaming. With built-in Android TV support, high brightness, and advanced 3LCD technology, it delivers a true cinematic experience on a large screen of up to 300 inches.</h3><h3>Full HD 1080p Big Screen Experience</h3><p>Enjoy stunning Full HD (1920 × 1080) resolution with sharp detail and smooth motion. The projector supports screen sizes up to 300 inches, allowing you to experience movies and games on a true cinematic scale.</p><h3>Android TV Streaming Built-in</h3><p>With integrated Android TV support, you can easily stream content from popular platforms such as YouTube, Netflix, and more without needing external devices. This makes it a complete smart home entertainment solution.</p><h3>Bright and Vivid 3LCD Technology</h3><p>Epson’s 3LCD technology delivers equally high White and Colour Light Output of 2700 lumens, ensuring bright, vivid, and natural-looking images even in well-lit rooms. It also provides up to 3x brighter colors compared to single-chip DLP projectors.</p><h3>High Contrast for Deep Blacks</h3><p>A 70,000:1 contrast ratio enhances image depth, delivering rich blacks, bright whites, and detailed shadow performance for a cinematic viewing experience.</p><h3>Smooth Gaming &amp; Motion Enhancement</h3><p>Advanced features such as Frame Interpolation and Detail Enhancement provide smoother motion and sharper visuals, making it ideal for fast-paced movies and gaming. It also supports ultra-wide 21:9 gaming formats.</p><h3>Flexible Installation &amp; Easy Setup</h3><p>The EH-TW5820 is designed for convenience with:</p><ul><li>1.6x optical zoom</li><li>Horizontal and vertical keystone correction</li><li>Easy alignment and flexible placement</li></ul><h3>Built-in Audio &amp; Bluetooth Connectivity</h3><p>A built-in 10W speaker provides clear audio output, while Bluetooth connectivity allows pairing with external speakers, soundbars, or headphones for an enhanced sound experience.</p><h3>Ideal Applications</h3><ul><li>Home Cinema</li><li>Movie Watching</li><li>Gaming Setup</li><li>Sports Viewing</li><li>Streaming Entertainment</li></ul><h3>Why Buy from International Office Solution (IOS)?</h3><p>International Office Solution (IOS) offers genuine Epson projectors with official warranty, competitive pricing, and trusted after-sales support in Bangladesh. The EH-TW5820 is a powerful all-in-one home entertainment solution for modern users.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>3D Display</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>Full HD (1920 × 1080), 16:9</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>White: 2700 lm (Normal) / 1780 lm (Eco)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Colour Brightness</td><td>2700 lm</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>80” screen: 2.35 – 3.82 m</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Zoom Range</td><td>Wide: 30”–300” (0.87–8.9 m) / Tele: 30”–300” (1.42–14.5 m)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>70,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>3D Support</td><td>Side-by-side, Top-and-bottom formats</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Type</td><td>UHE (Home Streaming Projector)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Power</td><td>200 W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>4,500 hours (Normal) / 7,500 hours (Eco Mode)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>10W Monaural</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>Stereo Mini Jack</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>USB</td><td>USB 2.0 Type-B (Service only)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>HDMI</td><td>HDMI 1.4</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>Stereo Mini Jack</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Wireless</td><td>Built-in Wi-Fi</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>297W (Normal), 227W (Eco), 0.3W (Standby), 262W (JBMS-84 On Mode)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Information</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>3.8 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions (W × D × H)</td><td>308 × 309 × 107 mm (excluding feet)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Service Warranty</td><td>2 Years Manufacturer Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/ld4484nEN5bK6votcGt1Nxf5bJ9MZAsWS8hLmrfi.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 07:59:55', '2026-06-13 07:59:55', 'Epson EH-TW5820 Full HD 1080p Home Projector Price in Bangladesh | IOS', 'Buy Epson EH-TW5820 1080p Home Streaming 3LCD Projector from International Office Solution (IOS). Features Android TV, 2700 lumens brightness, 70,000:1 contrast, 300-inch display, and Bluetooth audio support.', 'Epson EH-TW5820, Epson EH-TW5820 Price Bangladesh, 1080p Home Projector, Full HD Projector Bangladesh, Home Cinema Projector, Android TV Projector, Epson 3LCD Projector, Bluetooth Projector, Gaming Projector, Movie Projector Bangladesh, 300 Inch Projector, Epson Home Theater Projector, High Contrast Projector, Wireless Projector Bangladesh, Epson Projector Price, IOS Bangladesh, International Office Solution, Smart Projector Bangladesh', NULL, 3, NULL, NULL),
(518, 'Epson Projector EB-536Wi Short Throw Interactive', 'The Epson WXGA 3400 Lumens 3LCD Short Throw Projector offers 3400 lumens brightness, WXGA resolution, short throw projection (0.5m–1.2m), 16,000:1 contrast ratio, 3LCD color accuracy, and multiple connectivity options for classrooms and offices.', 'epson-projector-eb-536wi-short-throw-interactive-1781337946', '<p>The Epson WXGA 3400 Lumens 3LCD projector is designed for classrooms, meeting rooms, and training environments where short-throw projection, high brightness, and flexible installation are essential. With 3LCD technology, wide connectivity options, and a compact design, it delivers clear and stable visuals even in well-lit spaces.</p><h3>Bright 3400 Lumens Performance</h3><p>With 3400 lumens brightness, this Epson projector ensures vivid and readable content in both dark and bright environments. It is suitable for presentations, educational content, and business use where image clarity is critical.</p><h3>WXGA Resolution for Clear Content Display</h3><p>The native WXGA (1280 × 800) resolution delivers sharp text and clear visuals, making it ideal for spreadsheets, presentations, charts, and video playback in professional environments.</p><h3>Short Throw Projection for Flexible Spaces</h3><p>Designed for close-range projection, this model supports:</p><ul><li>Wide projection: 0.5 m (53-inch screen)</li><li>Tele projection: 1.2 m (116-inch screen)</li></ul><p>This makes it perfect for small rooms where space is limited and reduces shadow interference during presentations.</p><h3>3LCD Technology for Accurate Colors</h3><p>Epson’s 3LCD technology ensures balanced White and Colour Light Output with natural color reproduction, eliminating rainbow effects and providing consistent image quality.</p><h3>Multiple Image Modes for Different Environments</h3><p>The projector supports various display modes including:</p><ul><li>Blackboard Mode</li><li>Dynamic Mode</li><li>Presentation Mode</li><li>sRGB Mode</li><li>Theatre Mode</li></ul><p>These modes optimize image quality based on content type and environment.</p><h3>Long Lamp Life &amp; Low Maintenance</h3><p>The 215W lamp provides reliable long-term performance with:</p><ul><li>Up to 5,000 hours (Normal mode)</li><li>Up to 10,000 hours (Eco mode)</li></ul><p>This ensures reduced maintenance costs and extended operational life.</p><h3>Powerful Built-in Audio System</h3><p>A 16W built-in speaker allows direct audio playback without external speakers, making it suitable for classrooms and meeting rooms.</p><h3>Wide Connectivity Options</h3><p>This projector includes extensive connectivity support:</p><ul><li>2 × VGA inputs + 1 × VGA output</li><li>HDMI input</li><li>Composite, S-Video, and component inputs</li><li>USB Type-A and USB Type-B</li><li>Wired LAN support</li><li>RS-232C control</li><li>Microphone input support</li><li>Optional wireless LAN support</li></ul><p>This ensures compatibility with a wide range of devices and systems.</p><h3>Ideal Applications</h3><ul><li>Educational Classrooms</li><li>Corporate Meeting Rooms</li><li>Training Centers</li><li>Short-Throw Presentations</li><li>Small Conference Spaces</li></ul><h3>Why Buy from International Office Solution (IOS)?</h3><p>International Office Solution (IOS) provides genuine Epson projectors with official warranty, competitive pricing, and professional support in Bangladesh. This WXGA short throw projector is a reliable solution for professional and educational environments.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>3LCD Technology</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>WXGA (1280 × 800)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>3,400 Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>Wide: 0.5 m (53” screen) / Tele: 1.2 m (116” screen)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>16,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>53” – 116”</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Video Modes</td><td>Blackboard, Dynamic, Presentation, sRGB, Theatre</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Power</td><td>215 W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>5,000 hours (Normal), 10,000 hours (Eco Mode)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>16W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Input</td><td>Cinch audio in, Microphone input, Stereo mini jack (2x)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>Stereo mini jack audio out</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Sync Ports</td><td>Sync in / Sync out</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>VGA</td><td>VGA in (2x), VGA out</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>HDMI</td><td>HDMI in</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Video Inputs</td><td>S-Video in, Component in (2x), Composite in</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Ports</td><td>Cinch audio in, Mic input, Stereo mini jack audio in/out</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Network</td><td>Wired LAN, Wireless LAN (IEEE 802.11b/g/n optional)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Control</td><td>RS-232C</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB</td><td>USB 2.0 Type-A, USB 2.0 Type-B</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Supply Voltage</td><td>AC 100–240V, 50–60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>298W (Normal), 221W (Eco), 0.28W (Standby)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Environmental</strong></td><td>Operating Temp</td><td>5°C – 35°C</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Storage Temp</td><td>-10°C – 60°C</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Humidity</td><td>20% – 80% (Operating), 10% – 90% (Storage)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Information</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>3.9 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions (W × D × H)</td><td>345 × 315 × 94 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Service Warranty</td><td>2 Years Parts &amp; Service</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Warranty</td><td>12 Months or 1000 Hours</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/XwhXXHMnDYGwXEjQNbX1f6s3apBFeU4goTk7vS10.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 08:05:46', '2026-06-13 08:05:46', 'Epson WXGA 3400 Lumens Short Throw 3LCD Projector Price in Bangladesh | IOS', 'Buy Epson WXGA 3400 Lumens Short Throw 3LCD Projector from International Office Solution (IOS). Features 0.5m short throw, WXGA resolution, 16,000:1 contrast, 16W speaker, and wide connectivity options.', 'Epson WXGA Short Throw Projector, 3400 Lumens Projector Bangladesh, Epson Short Throw Projector, Classroom Projector Bangladesh, 3LCD Projector, Office Projector Bangladesh, Epson Projector Price, Short Distance Projector, 16W Speaker Projector, VGA HDMI Projector, Education Projector Bangladesh, Meeting Room Projector, Epson WXGA Projector, High Brightness Projector, IOS Bangladesh, International Office Solution, Professional Projector Bangladesh', NULL, 3, NULL, NULL),
(519, 'Epson Projector EB-535W Short Throw WXGA 3400 Lumens 3LCD', 'The Epson EB-535W WXGA Short Throw Projector delivers bright 3LCD visuals, short throw projection, 16W speaker, microphone input, Multi-PC support, and up to 10,000 hours lamp life—ideal for classrooms and meeting rooms.', 'epson-projector-eb-535w-short-throw-wxga-3400-lumens-3lcd-1781338240', '<p>The Epson EB-535W WXGA Short Throw 3LCD Projector is a high-performance projection solution designed specifically for classrooms, training centers, and small to medium-sized meeting rooms. Featuring Epson’s advanced 3LCD technology, it delivers bright, vibrant, and highly accurate color reproduction with equally strong White and Colour Light Output, ensuring clear visibility even in well-lit environments.</p><p>With WXGA resolution and a high contrast ratio, the EB-535W produces sharp, detailed images with excellent clarity, making text, diagrams, and multimedia content easy to view. Its short throw lens allows large images to be projected from a very short distance, making it ideal for limited spaces while reducing shadows and glare during presentations.</p><p>Designed for flexibility, the projector can be wall-mounted, ceiling-mounted, or placed on a table close to the wall, helping maximize workspace efficiency. It is especially suitable for educational environments where space optimization is important.</p><p>The Epson EB-535W is equipped with a powerful 16W built-in speaker, allowing audio playback directly from the projector without the need for external speakers. Additionally, the microphone input enables the projector to function as a PA system, ensuring clear communication in classrooms and meeting rooms.</p><p>With up to 10,000 hours lamp life in Eco Mode, the projector provides long-term reliability and reduced maintenance costs. It also features intelligent power-saving functions such as automatic brightness adjustment based on content and A/V mute mode, which dims the lamp by up to 70% to conserve energy when not in use.</p><p>Advanced connectivity and collaboration features include Multi-PC projection software, allowing simultaneous display from up to four devices such as laptops, tablets, and smartphones. This enhances interactive learning and teamwork in professional and educational settings.</p><p>The projector also includes horizontal and vertical keystone correction for perfectly aligned images, even in challenging installation positions. For large deployments, OSD settings can be easily copied across multiple projectors, saving setup time and ensuring consistent configuration.</p><p>The Epson EB-535W is a reliable, efficient, and feature-rich projector designed to improve collaboration, enhance presentations, and deliver superior visual performance in classrooms and business environments.</p><h2>Key Features</h2><ul><li>WXGA Resolution (1280 x 800)</li><li>3LCD Technology for Bright and Accurate Colors</li><li>Short Throw Projection Lens</li><li>High Brightness for Well-Lit Rooms</li><li>16W Built-in Speaker</li><li>Microphone Input (PA System Function)</li><li>Up to 10,000 Hours Lamp Life (Eco Mode)</li><li>Multi-PC Projection (Up to 4 Devices Simultaneously)</li><li>Horizontal &amp; Vertical Keystone Correction</li><li>A/V Mute Energy Saving Mode</li><li>Flexible Installation (Wall, Ceiling, Table)</li><li>Ideal for Classrooms &amp; Meeting Rooms</li><li>OSD Settings Copy for Multi-Unit Setup</li></ul><h2>Why Buy from International Office Solution?</h2><p>Get the original Epson EB-535W WXGA Short Throw Projector from International Office Solution. We provide genuine Epson products, competitive pricing, expert consultation, and reliable after-sales support for schools, colleges, training centers, and corporate offices across Bangladesh.</p><h2>Warranty Information</h2><ul><li>Projector Warranty: As per Epson official warranty policy</li><li>Lamp Warranty: As per manufacturer terms</li><li>Box Mandatory While Claiming Warranty</li></ul>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display</td><td>Display Type</td><td>3LCD</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Resolution</td><td>WXGA (1280 × 800), 16:10</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>16,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Image Size</td><td>53\" (0.5 m wide) – 116\" (1.2 m tele)</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp</td><td>Lamp Type</td><td>Economy Lamp</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp</td><td>Lamp Power</td><td>215 W</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>5,000 hrs (Normal) / 10,000 hrs (Eco)</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>16W Mono</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB</td><td>USB 2.0 Type A, USB 2.0 Type B</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Network</td><td>Wired LAN, RS-232C</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Wireless</td><td>IEEE 802.11b/g/n (WiFi 4) optional</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Input Ports</td><td>HDMI in, VGA in (2x), Composite in, Component in (2x), S-Video in</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Output Ports</td><td>VGA out, Stereo mini jack audio out</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Audio Input</td><td>Stereo mini jack (2x), Microphone input, Cinch audio in</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>298W / 221W (Eco) / 0.28W (Standby)</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Supply Voltage</td><td>AC 100–240V, 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>External</td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>External</td><td>Weight</td><td>3.7 kg</td></tr><tr><td>External</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>344 × 315 × 94 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Coverage</td><td>2 Years Parts &amp; Service / Lamp: 12 Months or 1000 hrs</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/PJcWCH1RHu0ghipoOC1RnfqHurTfcTzaO8MGXwMn.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 08:10:40', '2026-06-13 08:10:40', 'Epson EB-535W WXGA Short Throw 3LCD Projector | International Office Solution', 'Buy Epson EB-535W WXGA Short Throw 3LCD Projector from International Office Solution. Enjoy bright projection, short throw lens, 16W speaker, Multi-PC support, and long lamp life for classrooms and meetings.', 'Epson EB-535W, Epson Short Throw Projector, WXGA Projector, 3LCD Projector, Classroom Projector, Meeting Room Projector, Epson Education Projector, Multi PC Projector, Short Throw Education Projector, Epson Projector Bangladesh, Business Projector', NULL, 3, NULL, NULL),
(520, 'Epson Projector CO-FH01 3000 Lumens 3LCD Full HD', 'The Epson CO-FH01 Full HD 1080p Projector delivers 3,000 lumens brightness, 391-inch display support, 3LCD color accuracy, HDMI connectivity, and up to 12,000 hours lamp life. Lightweight and portable, it is ideal for home, office, and education use.', 'epson-projector-co-fh01-3000-lumens-3lcd-full-hd-1781338679', '<p>The Epson CO-FH01 Full HD 1080p Projector is a powerful and versatile home and office projection solution designed to deliver stunning big-screen entertainment and professional presentations. With Full HD (1920 x 1080) resolution and 3LCD technology, it produces sharp, detailed, and vibrant images with accurate color reproduction, ensuring an immersive viewing experience for movies, games, and business content.</p><p>Offering 3,000 lumens of brightness, the Epson CO-FH01 performs exceptionally well even in well-lit environments. Its ability to project images up to 391 inches makes it ideal for home theaters, classrooms, and office meeting rooms where large display size and clarity are essential.</p><p>The advanced 3LCD RGB liquid crystal shutter system ensures equal White and Color Light Output, resulting in bright and natural-looking visuals without color distortion. This makes every scene more realistic and engaging.</p><p>With a projection range of 0.89m to 10.40m (wide) and 0.91m to 10.41m (tele), along with a standard 60-inch display at just 1.58m distance, the CO-FH01 offers flexible installation options for different room sizes. It also includes a 1.35x digital zoom, manual keystone correction, and Epson’s Quick Corner feature for precise image alignment, even in challenging setups.</p><p>The projector is powered by a long-lasting lamp that offers up to 12,000 hours of usage in Eco Mode, reducing maintenance costs and ensuring long-term reliability. With a low noise level of just 29 dB in Eco Mode, it provides a quiet viewing experience suitable for both home and professional environments.</p><p>For audio, the built-in 5W speaker delivers clear sound output for everyday use without requiring external speakers. Connectivity options include HDMI and USB-A ports, making it easy to connect laptops, gaming consoles, media players, and streaming devices.</p><p>Designed with portability in mind, the Epson CO-FH01 weighs only 2.4 kg and features a compact design (211 x 295 x 82 mm), making it easy to carry and set up anywhere. Whether for home entertainment, business presentations, or educational use, this projector delivers convenience, performance, and reliability in one compact device.</p><h2>Key Features</h2><ul><li>Full HD (1920 x 1080) Resolution</li><li>3,000 Lumens Brightness</li><li>3LCD RGB Liquid Crystal Technology</li><li>Projection Size up to 391 inches</li><li>5W Built-in Speaker</li><li>Lamp Life up to 12,000 Hours (Eco Mode)</li><li>HDMI &amp; USB-A Connectivity</li><li>1.35x Digital Zoom</li><li>Quick Corner &amp; Keystone Correction</li><li>Quiet Operation (29 dB Eco Mode)</li><li>Lightweight Design (2.4 kg)</li><li>Portable and Easy Setup</li><li>Ideal for Home, Office &amp; Education Use</li></ul><h2>Why Buy from International Office Solution?</h2><p>Get the original Epson CO-FH01 Full HD Projector from International Office Solution. We provide genuine Epson products, competitive pricing, expert consultation, and reliable after-sales support for home users, offices, and educational institutions across Bangladesh.</p><h2>Warranty Information</h2><ul><li>Projector Warranty: 02 Years Parts &amp; Service Warranty</li><li>Lamp Warranty: 12 Months or 1000 Hours (Whichever Comes First)</li><li>Box Mandatory While Claiming Warranty</li></ul>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Technology</td><td>LCD</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Resolution</td><td>Full HD (1920 × 1080)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Brightness</td><td>White Light Output: 3,000 lm (Normal) / 2,000 lm (Eco)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Colour Light Output</td><td>3,000 lm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>0.89 m – 10.40 m (Wide / Tele Zoom)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Screen Size</td><td>34” – 391”</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Light Output Mode</td><td>High / Low (Eco)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Type</td><td>UHE</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Power</td><td>188W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Up to 6,000 hours (Normal), Up to 12,000 hours (Eco Mode)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>270W (Normal), 214W (Eco)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Standby Power</td><td>0.5W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Voltage</td><td>100–240V AC ±10%, 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td><td>Weight</td><td>Approx. 2.4 kg</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td><td>Dimensions</td><td>211 × 295 × 82 mm (D × W × H)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Parts &amp; Service</td><td>2 Years</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Lamp Warranty</td><td>12 Months or 1000 Hours</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/YUAyEFfkQHGiwWhwI5BTIqZElROVQFekzKNV7GYo.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 08:17:59', '2026-06-13 08:17:59', 'Epson CO-FH01 Full HD 1080p 3000 Lumens Projector | International Office Solution', 'Buy Epson CO-FH01 Full HD 1080p 3000 Lumens Projector from International Office Solution. Enjoy 3LCD brightness, 391-inch display, HDMI connectivity, and long 12,000-hour lamp life.', 'Epson CO-FH01, Epson Full HD Projector, 3000 Lumens Projector, 3LCD Projector, Home Theater Projector, Office Projector, Education Projector, Epson Projector Bangladesh, Full HD 1080p Projector, Portable Projector, HDMI Projector', NULL, 3, NULL, NULL);
