(521, 'ViewSonic Projector LS740W 5000 Lumens WXGA Laser', 'The ViewSonic LS740W is a high-brightness WXGA laser projector designed for business, education, and large venue applications. Featuring 5,000 ANSI Lumens brightness, advanced 3rd-generation laser phosphor technology, and up to 30,000 hours of maintenance-free operation, it delivers vibrant visuals, exceptional reliability, and flexible installation options. With support for projection sizes up to 300 inches, 1.3x optical zoom, 360° projection, portrait mode, and advanced keystone correction, the LS740W is an ideal solution for conference rooms, classrooms, auditoriums, and public display environments.', 'viewsonic-projector-ls740w-5000-lumens-wxga-laser-1781345970', '<p>The ViewSonic LS740W 5000 Lumens WXGA Laser Projector is a powerful, lamp-free projection solution engineered to meet the demanding needs of modern business, education, and public display environments. As part of ViewSonic\'s renowned Luminous Superior Series, this projector combines exceptional brightness, long-lasting laser technology, and versatile installation features to deliver outstanding visual performance.</p><p>Powered by advanced third-generation laser phosphor technology, the LS740W produces an impressive 5,000 ANSI Lumens of brightness, ensuring crystal-clear images even in brightly lit rooms. Its native WXGA resolution delivers sharp text, detailed graphics, and vibrant presentations, making it ideal for boardrooms, classrooms, lecture halls, and large meeting spaces.</p><p>Unlike traditional lamp-based projectors, the LS740W utilizes a maintenance-free laser light source with a lifespan of up to 30,000 hours. This eliminates the need for frequent lamp replacements, significantly reducing maintenance costs while ensuring consistent brightness and color performance throughout its operational life.</p><p>The projector features a high native contrast ratio powered by a Texas Instruments 0.65-inch DMD chip, delivering deeper blacks, brighter whites, and enhanced image depth. This results in superior readability for presentations, spreadsheets, educational content, and multimedia applications.</p><p>Designed with installation flexibility in mind, the ViewSonic LS740W supports a 1.3x optical zoom, horizontal and vertical keystone correction, four-corner adjustment, portrait mode, and 360-degree projection capabilities. These advanced features allow users to achieve perfectly aligned images in virtually any installation scenario.</p><p>In addition to its impressive performance, the LS740W offers a compact and lightweight design that is approximately 35% smaller and lighter than many comparable projectors, reducing transportation and installation costs while improving deployment flexibility.</p><p>Capable of projecting images up to 300 inches, the ViewSonic LS740W is an excellent choice for organizations seeking a reliable, energy-efficient, and high-performance laser projector that delivers professional-quality visuals with minimal maintenance.</p><h2>Key Features</h2><ul><li>5,000 ANSI Lumens high brightness</li><li>Native WXGA (1280 × 800) resolution</li><li>Advanced 3rd-generation laser phosphor technology</li><li>Up to 30,000 hours laser light source lifespan</li><li>High native contrast ratio for enhanced image quality</li><li>Texas Instruments 0.65\" DMD chip</li><li>Large screen projection up to 300 inches</li><li>1.3x optical zoom for flexible installation</li><li>Horizontal &amp; Vertical Keystone Correction</li><li>4-Corner Adjustment for precise image alignment</li><li>360° Projection capability</li><li>Portrait Mode support</li><li>Compact and lightweight design</li><li>Instant power on/off operation</li><li>Ideal for business, education, and public display applications</li></ul><h2>Why Choose the ViewSonic LS740W?</h2><p>The ViewSonic LS740W offers an excellent combination of brightness, reliability, installation flexibility, and low total cost of ownership. Its laser-powered design eliminates lamp replacement expenses while delivering consistent image quality for years. Whether used in corporate boardrooms, educational institutions, auditoriums, training centers, or public spaces, the LS740W provides professional-grade performance with exceptional durability.</p><h2>Buy ViewSonic LS740W 5000 Lumens WXGA Laser Projector from International Office Solution</h2><p>Purchase the original ViewSonic LS740W 5000 Lumens WXGA Laser Projector from <strong>International Office Solution (IOS)</strong> in Bangladesh. We provide genuine ViewSonic projectors with official warranty support, competitive pricing, and professional consultation for business, education, and commercial display solutions.</p><p>The ViewSonic LS740W Projector comes with <strong>02 Years Parts &amp; Service Warranty and 12 Months or 1000 Hours Lamp Warranty</strong>.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>1280 × 800 (WXGA)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution Support</td><td>VGA (640 × 480) to WUXGA RB (1920 × 1200)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>5000 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>0.77m – 9.98m</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>3,000,000:1</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>15W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI</td><td>HDMI 1.4 / HDCP 1.4</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB Type-A (Power)</td><td>1 × USB Type-A (5V / 1.5A)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Out</td><td>1 × 3.5mm Audio Out</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Supply Input</td><td>100~240V AC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Adapter Output</td><td>19.5V DC / 11.79A</td></tr><tr><td><strong>External Features</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Net Weight</td><td>3.00 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Gross Weight</td><td>4.70 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions (W × D × H)</td><td>286 × 216 × 129 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>02 Years Parts &amp; Service Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Warranty</td><td>12 Months or 1000 Hours</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/iVbb6Dx58WSKCu2IJKtVak0nd55s4PNjcK01HLlz.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-13 10:19:30', '2026-06-13 10:39:32', 'ViewSonic LS740W 5000 Lumens WXGA Laser Projector Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy ViewSonic LS740W 5000 Lumens WXGA Laser Projector from International Office Solution. Features laser phosphor technology, 30,000-hour lifespan, 300-inch projection, 1.3x zoom, and advanced installation flexibility.', 'ViewSonic LS740W, ViewSonic LS740W Projector, ViewSonic Laser Projector, WXGA Laser Projector, 5000 Lumens Projector, Business Projector Bangladesh, Education Projector, Laser Phosphor Projector, ViewSonic Projector Price Bangladesh, Large Venue Projector, Professional Projector, ViewSonic LS740W Price, International Office Solution, IOS Bangladesh, WXGA Business Projector, Conference Room Projector, Classroom Projector, 300 Inch Projector, High Brightness Laser Projector, ViewSonic Bangladesh', NULL, 45, NULL, NULL),
(522, 'ViewSonic  Projector PG707X 4000 ANSI Lumens XGA', 'The ViewSonic PG707X is a high-brightness XGA projector designed for classrooms, training centers, and business meeting rooms. Featuring 4000 ANSI Lumens brightness, a 22,000:1 contrast ratio, 1.3x optical zoom, and up to 20,000 hours lamp life, it delivers clear and vibrant presentations while ensuring cost-effective long-term operation. Advanced keystone correction, 4-corner adjustment, dual HDMI connectivity, and centralized LAN management make it an ideal projection solution for educational and corporate environments.', 'viewsonic-projector-pg707x-4000-ansi-lumens-xga-1781346216', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The ViewSonic PG707X 4000 ANSI Lumens XGA Business and Education Projector is a reliable, high-performance projection solution built to meet the demands of modern classrooms, conference rooms, training facilities, and corporate environments. Combining powerful brightness, flexible installation options, and long-lasting lamp performance, this projector offers exceptional value for organizations seeking professional-quality presentations at an affordable cost.</p><p>With an impressive brightness rating of 4000 ANSI Lumens and a high contrast ratio of 22,000:1, the ViewSonic PG707X produces bright, sharp, and detailed images even in rooms with significant ambient lighting. Its native XGA (1024 × 768) resolution ensures clear text, graphs, spreadsheets, and presentation content, making it perfect for business meetings and educational applications.</p><p>The projector supports image sizes up to 300 inches, providing a large-screen viewing experience at a significantly lower cost-per-inch compared to large-format displays. Whether installed in a classroom, lecture hall, or meeting room, the PG707X delivers impactful visual communication with excellent readability.</p><p>Designed for flexible installation, the ViewSonic PG707X features a versatile throw ratio of 1.51–1.97 and a 1.3x optical zoom lens, allowing users to achieve the desired screen size without relocating existing ceiling mounts or projection screens. Horizontal and vertical keystone correction, combined with 4-corner image adjustment, ensure perfectly aligned projections regardless of installation position.</p><p>ViewSonic’s proprietary SuperColor™ Technology enhances color accuracy and image vibrancy, delivering realistic colors in both bright and dark environments. This ensures engaging presentations, educational content, and multimedia experiences with outstanding visual quality.</p><p>The PG707X is engineered for long-term reliability with an energy-efficient lamp system capable of lasting up to 20,000 hours in SuperEco mode. This significantly reduces maintenance costs and minimizes downtime. Built-in LAN control compatibility with Crestron, AMX, Extron, and ViewSonic vController enables centralized monitoring and management, making it ideal for institutions managing multiple projectors.</p><p>For added convenience, the projector includes a built-in 10W speaker that provides clear audio without requiring external speakers for most presentations and classroom sessions. Dual HDMI inputs and USB power output offer easy connectivity with laptops, media players, and presentation devices.</p><p>Combining exceptional brightness, flexible installation, long lamp life, and professional management features, the ViewSonic PG707X is an excellent choice for organizations seeking a dependable projector for business and education applications.</p><h2><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul><li>4000 ANSI Lumens high brightness</li><li>Native XGA (1024 × 768) resolution</li><li>High 22,000:1 contrast ratio</li><li>Up to 300-inch projection size</li><li>1.3x optical zoom lens</li><li>Throw ratio: 1.51 – 1.97</li><li>Horizontal &amp; Vertical Keystone Correction</li><li>4-Corner Image Adjustment</li><li>ViewSonic SuperColor™ Technology</li><li>Built-in 10W speaker</li><li>Dual HDMI connectivity</li><li>USB Type-A power supply</li><li>LAN-based centralized management</li><li>Compatible with Crestron, AMX, Extron, and ViewSonic vController</li><li>Lamp life up to 20,000 hours</li><li>Eco-friendly and energy-efficient design</li></ul><h2><strong>Why Choose the ViewSonic PG707X?</strong></h2><p>The ViewSonic PG707X offers a perfect balance of brightness, installation flexibility, image quality, and low total cost of ownership. Its large-screen projection capability, long lamp life, advanced image correction features, and network management support make it an ideal solution for educational institutions, training centers, government offices, and corporate meeting environments.</p><h2><strong>Buy ViewSonic PG707X Projector from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>Purchase the original ViewSonic PG707X 4000 ANSI Lumens XGA Business &amp; Education Projector from <strong>International Office Solution (IOS)</strong> in Bangladesh. We offer genuine ViewSonic projectors with official warranty support, competitive pricing, and expert consultation for education, business, and professional projection requirements.</p><p>The ViewSonic PG707X Projector comes with <strong>01 Year Projector Warranty and 01 Year Lamp Warranty</strong>.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>DMD DLP</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>XGA (1024 × 768)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Supported Resolution</td><td>Full HD 1080p (1920 × 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>4000 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>22,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>Supports up to Full HD 1080p content</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Type</td><td>DLP Lamp</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Power</td><td>203W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life (Normal Mode)</td><td>Up to 6,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life (Eco Mode)</td><td>Up to 20,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>Mono Speaker</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Speaker Output</td><td>10W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI</td><td>2 × HDMI (Type-A)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>VGA Input</td><td>1 × VGA (DE-15/DB-15)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>VGA Output</td><td>1 × VGA (DE-15/DB-15)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Composite Video</td><td>1 × RCA Video Input</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Input</td><td>1 × 3.5mm Audio Input</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>1 × 3.5mm Audio Output</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB</td><td>1 × USB 2.0 Type-A</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>LAN</td><td>1 × RJ45 Ethernet</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>RS-232</td><td>1 × RS-232 Control Port</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Input Voltage</td><td>100V – 240V AC, 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption (Medium)</td><td>280W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption (Low Brightness)</td><td>&lt;255W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Standby Power</td><td>&lt;0.5W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>External Features</strong></td><td>Weight</td><td>2.3 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>294 × 110 × 218 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>01 Year</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Warranty</td><td>01 Year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/YOVAfzQ1qbMz58v8tbLw2aqJmjeanpy9WbTJ7MK2.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-13 10:23:36', '2026-06-13 10:39:22', 'ViewSonic PG707X 4000 ANSI Lumens XGA Business Projector Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy ViewSonic PG707X 4000 ANSI Lumens XGA Business & Education Projector from International Office Solution. Features 22,000:1 contrast ratio, 1.3x optical zoom, 300-inch display, dual HDMI, and up to 20,000-hour lamp life.', 'ViewSonic PG707X, ViewSonic PG707X Projector, XGA Projector, 4000 ANSI Lumens Projector, Business Projector Bangladesh, Education Projector, Classroom Projector, Conference Room Projector, ViewSonic Business Projector, ViewSonic Education Projector, Projector Price in Bangladesh, ViewSonic Bangladesh, PG707X Price, DLP Projector, Presentation Projector, Office Projector, Training Room Projector, HDMI Projector, International Office Solution, IOS Bangladesh, ViewSonic PG707X XGA Projector, Large Screen Projector, Professional Projector Bangladesh', NULL, 45, NULL, NULL),
(523, 'ViewSonic Projector PG707W 4000 Lumens WXGA Business DLP', 'The ViewSonic PG707W is a high-brightness WXGA business and education projector designed for meeting rooms, classrooms, and training environments. With 4000 ANSI Lumens brightness, 22,000:1 contrast ratio, 1.3x optical zoom, and support for up to 300-inch screen size, it delivers sharp, vivid, and large-scale presentations. Advanced keystone correction, corner adjustment, SuperColor™ technology, and LAN control make it a reliable and cost-effective projection solution for professional use.', 'viewsonic-projector-pg707w-4000-lumens-wxga-business-dlp-1781346605', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The ViewSonic PG707W 4000 ANSI Lumens WXGA Business and Education Projector is a versatile and reliable projection solution designed for modern classrooms, corporate meeting rooms, and training facilities. It combines powerful brightness, flexible installation features, and long lamp life to deliver professional-quality visuals at a low total cost of ownership.</p><p>With 4000 ANSI Lumens brightness and a high 22,000:1 contrast ratio, the PG707W ensures bright, clear, and detailed images even in well-lit environments. Its native WXGA (1280 × 800) resolution provides sharp text and graphics, making it ideal for presentations, spreadsheets, educational content, and multimedia displays.</p><p>The projector supports screen sizes of up to 300 inches, allowing users to create large, impactful visual experiences that outperform traditional flat-panel displays in terms of cost-per-inch and installation flexibility. With a 1.3x optical zoom and mainstream throw ratio compatibility, it easily adapts to existing ceiling mounts and installation setups without requiring major modifications.</p><p>For image alignment, the PG707W includes horizontal and vertical keystone correction along with corner adjustment features. These tools eliminate image distortion and ensure perfectly proportioned projections regardless of placement angle.</p><p>ViewSonic’s SuperColor™ Technology enhances color accuracy and vibrancy, delivering rich and lifelike visuals across a wide color spectrum. This ensures consistent image quality in both bright and dark environments, making presentations more engaging and visually appealing.</p><p>Designed for long-term use, the projector features an energy-efficient lamp system with a lifespan of up to 20,000 hours in SuperEco mode. This reduces maintenance costs and ensures reliable operation over extended periods. Additionally, LAN control compatibility allows centralized management for multiple devices, making it suitable for institutional deployments.</p><p>The built-in 10W speaker delivers clear and audible sound for presentations, eliminating the need for external audio systems in many scenarios. A convenient top lamp door design also allows easy lamp replacement and maintenance.</p><p>Overall, the ViewSonic PG707W offers an excellent combination of brightness, installation flexibility, image quality, and operational efficiency, making it a strong choice for educational institutions, corporate offices, and training centers.</p><h2><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul><li>4000 ANSI Lumens high brightness</li><li>Native WXGA (1280 × 800) resolution</li><li>22,000:1 high contrast ratio</li><li>Up to 300-inch projection size</li><li>1.3x optical zoom</li><li>Horizontal &amp; Vertical Keystone Correction</li><li>Corner Adjustment for precise alignment</li><li>ViewSonic SuperColor™ Technology</li><li>10W built-in speaker</li><li>LAN network control support</li><li>Lamp life up to 20,000 hours</li><li>Easy lamp maintenance design</li><li>Compatible with existing ceiling installations</li><li>Ideal for business, education, and training environments</li></ul><h2><strong>Buy ViewSonic PG707W Projector from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>Get the original ViewSonic PG707W 4000 ANSI Lumens WXGA Business &amp; Education Projector from <strong>International Office Solution (IOS)</strong> in Bangladesh. We provide genuine ViewSonic projectors with official warranty, competitive pricing, and professional consultation for corporate, educational, and institutional needs.</p><p>The ViewSonic PG707W comes with <strong>02 Years Parts &amp; Service Warranty and 12 Months Lamp Warranty</strong>.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>DMD Type: DC3</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>WXGA (1280 × 800)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>4000 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>0.78m – 10.14m (100\" @ 2.61m)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>22,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>30\" – 300\"</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution Support</td><td>VGA (640 × 480) to Full HD (1920 × 1080)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Type</td><td>DLP Lamp</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Power</td><td>203W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life (Normal Mode)</td><td>Up to 6,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life (SuperEco Mode)</td><td>Up to 20,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>10W Speaker</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Computer Input</td><td>1 × Computer In (Shared with Component)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Composite Input</td><td>1 × Composite Video</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>HDMI</td><td>2 × HDMI 1.4 / HDCP 1.4</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/BWtflBQjpguBjzS1YNKODpLSsvgmVQEw8U8a3MNN.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-13 10:30:05', '2026-06-13 10:39:13', 'ViewSonic PG707W 4000 ANSI Lumens WXGA Projector Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy ViewSonic PG707W 4000 ANSI Lumens WXGA Business & Education Projector from International Office Solution. Features 22,000:1 contrast, 1.3x zoom, SuperColor™ technology, 300-inch display, and LAN control support.', 'ViewSonic PG707W, ViewSonic PG707W Projector, WXGA Projector Bangladesh, 4000 ANSI Lumens Projector, Business Projector Bangladesh, Education Projector, Classroom Projector, Conference Room Projector, ViewSonic Projector Price Bangladesh, PG707W Price, DLP Projector, Presentation Projector, Office Projector, Training Room Projector, SuperColor Projector, LAN Control Projector, HDMI Projector, International Office Solution, IOS Bangladesh, ViewSonic WXGA Projector, Large Screen Projector, Professional Projector Bangladesh', NULL, 45, NULL, NULL),
(524, 'ViewSonic Projector PG603X 3,800 Lumens XGA Business DLP', 'The ViewSonic XGA 3800 ANSI Lumens Projector is a powerful business and education projector designed for clear presentations in bright environments. With 3800 lumens brightness, 22,000:1 contrast ratio, and up to 300-inch projection size, it delivers sharp, vibrant visuals for classrooms, meeting rooms, and training sessions. It also includes HDMI, VGA, USB, and LAN connectivity for flexible usage.', 'viewsonic-projector-pg603x-3800-lumens-xga-business-dlp-1781347082', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The ViewSonic XGA 3800 ANSI Lumens Business Projector is engineered to deliver reliable, high-performance projection for educational institutions, corporate offices, and training environments. Featuring a native XGA resolution (1024×768), it ensures crisp and readable text, making it ideal for PowerPoint presentations, spreadsheets, and video content.</p><p>With a powerful 3800 ANSI lumens brightness, this projector performs exceptionally well even in well-lit rooms. The high 22,000:1 contrast ratio enhances image depth and clarity, allowing users to experience sharper visuals with improved detail in both bright and dark scenes.</p><p>This projector supports screen sizes ranging from 30 inches up to a massive 300 inches, making it suitable for small meeting rooms as well as large halls. Its flexible projection distance of 1 to 11 meters ensures easy installation in different environments.</p><p>Equipped with a 190W lamp, the projector offers a long lamp life of up to 15,000 hours in Eco mode, reducing maintenance cost and ensuring long-term usage. The built-in 10W speaker provides clear audio output, eliminating the need for external sound systems in small setups.</p><p>Connectivity options include HDMI, VGA input/output, USB ports, LAN (RJ45), RS-232 control, and composite video input, making it compatible with a wide range of modern and legacy devices. The projector also supports USB media playback for quick presentations without a PC.</p><p>Designed for efficiency, it consumes only 270W during operation and less than 0.5W in standby mode, making it energy-efficient and cost-effective.</p><p>With its durable build, flexible installation, and strong brightness performance, the ViewSonic 3800 ANSI Lumens XGA Projector is a dependable choice for professional presentations and educational environments.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>DLP</td><td>DC3 Chip</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>Native</td><td>XGA (1024 × 768)</td></tr><tr><td>PC Resolution Support</td><td>Max</td><td>Up to 1920 × 1080</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>3800 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>22,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Image Size</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>30\" – 300\"</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Distance</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>1 – 11 m</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>4:3 (supports widescreen input)</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Power</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>190W</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Normal</td><td>5000 hrs</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Eco / Dynamic Eco</td><td>Up to 15000 hrs</td></tr><tr><td>Speaker</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>10W (1x) Built-in</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>1 Port</td></tr><tr><td>VGA In/Out</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>1 In / 1 Out</td></tr><tr><td>USB</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB 2.0 Type-A x2 + USB Reader</td></tr><tr><td>Audio Ports</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>3.5mm In/Out</td></tr><tr><td>LAN</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>RJ45 Ethernet</td></tr><tr><td>Control</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>RS-232</td></tr><tr><td>Composite</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>RCA Video In</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>270W (Typical), &lt;0.5W Standby</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>3.3 kg</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>294 × 218 × 110 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>&nbsp;