(525, 'ViewSonic Projector PA503SE 4000 Lumens SVGA Business', 'The ViewSonic 4000 ANSI Lumens DC3 DLP Projector delivers bright, clear, and detailed visuals for classrooms, offices, and presentations. With Full HD support, 22,000:1 contrast ratio, and up to 300-inch display size, it ensures sharp performance even in well-lit environments. Lightweight and compact, it is easy to install and ideal for professional use.', 'viewsonic-projector-pa503se-4000-lumens-svga-business-1781347837', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The ViewSonic 4000 ANSI Lumens DC3 DLP Projector is designed to deliver powerful and reliable projection performance for business, education, and training environments. With a native brightness of 4000 ANSI lumens, it ensures clear and vivid visuals even in brightly lit rooms, making it ideal for classrooms, conference rooms, and meeting spaces.</p><p>This projector supports resolutions from VGA up to Full HD (1920×1080), ensuring compatibility with modern laptops, media devices, and presentation systems. Its high 22,000:1 contrast ratio enhances image clarity by producing deeper blacks and brighter whites, allowing text, charts, and images to appear more defined and professional.</p><p>With a large projection range of 30 to 300 inches, the device provides flexible installation options for small rooms and large halls alike. The throw distance of 1.19m to 13.11m makes it adaptable to different environments without compromising image quality.</p><p>The 190W lamp offers long-lasting performance with up to 15,000 hours in Eco mode, reducing maintenance costs and extending usability. A built-in 2W speaker provides basic audio output, making it suitable for simple presentations without external speakers.</p><p>Connectivity options include HDMI input, VGA monitor output, and 3.5mm audio in/out ports, ensuring easy connection with laptops, PCs, and multimedia devices. Its lightweight 2.2 kg design and compact form factor make it highly portable and easy to install.</p><p>Overall, this ViewSonic projector is a cost-effective and efficient solution for users seeking bright visuals, flexible installation, and dependable performance in professional environments.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>DLP</td><td>DC3</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>Supported</td><td>VGA (640×480) to Full HD (1920×1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>4000 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>22,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Distance</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>1.19m – 13.11m (100\" @ 3.98m)</td></tr><tr><td>Image Size</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>30\" – 300\"</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Power</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>190W</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Life</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>5000 hrs / 15000 hrs (Eco/Dynamic Eco)</td></tr><tr><td>Speaker</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>2W Built-in</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>1 (Rear)</td></tr><tr><td>Monitor Out</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>Audio In</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>1 × 3.5mm</td></tr><tr><td>Audio Out</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>1 × 3.5mm</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>260W (Normal)</td></tr><tr><td>Power Supply</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>100–240V AC, 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>2.2 kg</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>294 × 218 × 110 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>1 Year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/ocPA6bTsBWt37SVNPXuYkysCjsso1WUg7FOl8EVg.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-13 10:50:37', '2026-06-13 10:50:37', 'ViewSonic 4000 ANSI Lumens DLP Projector | Full HD Support, 300” Display', 'Buy ViewSonic 4000 ANSI Lumens DLP Projector with Full HD support, 22,000:1 contrast, 300-inch display, HDMI connectivity, and lightweight design for office and classroom