(526, 'ViewSonic Projector M1+_G2 300 Lumens Smart LED Built-in Wi-Fi Portable Android', 'This compact WVGA LED projector delivers 300 LED lumens brightness with a 120,000:1 contrast ratio, making it ideal for portable entertainment, presentations, and home use. With ultra-lightweight design (800g), HDMI, USB-C, and Micro SD support, it offers excellent mobility and convenience.', 'viewsonic-projector-m1-g2-300-lumens-smart-led-built-in-wi-fi-portable-android-1781348162', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Portable WVGA LED Projector is a lightweight and highly portable projection solution designed for home entertainment, mobile presentations, and personal media use. With a native resolution of 854 × 480 (WVGA), it delivers clear visuals suitable for videos, photos, and basic presentations.</p><p>Powered by LED technology, this projector offers 300 LED lumens brightness combined with an impressive 120,000:1 dynamic contrast ratio, ensuring decent image clarity in dark environments. The LED light source provides an exceptional lifespan of up to 30,000 hours, significantly reducing maintenance and replacement costs.</p><p>This projector supports multiple input options including HDMI 1.4, USB Type-A, USB Type-C, and Micro SD card slot, allowing easy connection with laptops, smartphones, flash drives, and media devices. The built-in dual 3W speakers deliver stereo audio output, eliminating the need for external speakers in small setups.</p><p>With ultra-low power consumption of only 55W, this projector is energy-efficient and suitable for portable usage. Its compact size (146 × 40 × 126 mm) and lightweight 800g body make it easy to carry in a bag or backpack, ideal for travel, business trips, or outdoor movie nights.</p><p>Overall, this LED projector is a perfect entry-level solution for users seeking portability, long lamp life, and simple connectivity in a compact design.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>DLP</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>Native</td><td>WVGA (854 × 480)</td></tr><tr><td>PC Resolution Support</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>640 × 480 to 1920 × 1080</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>300 LED Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>120,000:1 (Dynamic)</td></tr><tr><td>Light Source</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Power</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>10W</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Life</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Up to 30,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Speaker</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>3W × 2 Built-in Stereo</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>1 × HDMI 1.4</td></tr><tr><td>USB</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB 2.0 Type-A ×1, USB Type-C ×1</td></tr><tr><td>Micro SD Slot</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>Audio Out</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>3.5mm ×1</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>55W (Typical), &lt;0.5W Standby</td></tr><tr><td>Power Supply</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>100–240V AC</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>800g</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>146 × 40 × 126 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>1 Year (Lamp: 1 Year)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/qEnATt6fleiZPVx9WfN8yBth0ObyOLZ1ylmZ8B2Z.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-13 10:56:02', '2026-06-13 10:56:02', 'Portable LED WVGA Projector 300 Lumens | USB-C, HDMI, 30,000H Lamp Life', 'Buy Portable WVGA LED Projector with 300 lumens brightness, 120,000:1 contrast ratio, HDMI, USB-C, Micro SD support, and 30,000-hour lamp life. Ultra-light 800g design.', 'portable projector, LED projector WVGA, mini projector 300 lumens, HDMI projector portable, USB-C projector, micro SD projector, lightweight projector Bangladesh, home projector LED, mini projector 800g, travel projector', NULL, 45, NULL, NULL),
(527, 'ViewSonic Projector PA503S 3800 Lumens SVGA Multimedia', 'The ViewSonic 3800 ANSI Lumens SVGA Projector delivers bright and clear visuals with 3800 lumens brightness and a 22,000:1 contrast ratio. Designed for classrooms and business presentations, it supports up to 300-inch display size and multiple connectivity options including HDMI and VGA, making it a reliable and cost-effective projection solution.', 'viewsonic-projector-pa503s-3800-lumens-svga-multimedia-1781349097', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The ViewSonic 3800 ANSI Lumens SVGA Projector is a dependable and budget-friendly projection solution designed for educational institutions, small offices, and training environments. With a native resolution of 800×600, it ensures stable and clear visuals for presentations, documents, and basic multimedia content.</p><p>Featuring 3800 ANSI lumens brightness, this projector performs well even in moderately lit rooms, making it suitable for classrooms and meeting spaces. Its high 22,000:1 contrast ratio enhances image sharpness by delivering deeper blacks and brighter whites, improving readability of text and clarity of visuals.</p><p>The projector supports a large projection size ranging from 30 inches to 300 inches, allowing flexible installation for both small and large environments. A projection distance of 1.19m to 13.11m ensures easy setup across different room sizes.</p><p>Equipped with a 190W lamp, it provides up to 5000 hours of usage in normal mode and up to 15,000 hours in SuperEco mode, reducing long-term maintenance costs. The built-in 2W speaker offers basic audio output for simple presentations.</p><p>Connectivity options include HDMI, dual VGA computer inputs, composite video, audio in/out ports, RS232 control, USB mini B, and monitor out, ensuring compatibility with both modern and legacy devices.</p><p>With its lightweight 2.2 kg design and compact structure, the projector is easy to install and transport, making it a practical choice for daily use in educational and business environments.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>DLP</td><td>DC3</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>Native</td><td>SVGA (800 × 600)</td></tr><tr><td>PC Resolution Support</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>VGA (640×480) to Full HD (1920×1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>3800 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>22,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Distance</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>1.19m – 13.11m (100\" @ 3.98m)</td></tr><tr><td>Image Size</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>30\" – 300\"</td></tr><tr><td>Video Formats</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>NTSC, PAL, SECAM</td></tr><tr><td>HDTV Support</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>480i to 1080p</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Power</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>190W</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Normal</td><td>5000 hrs</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>SuperEco</td><td>15000 hrs</td></tr><tr><td>Speaker</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>2W Built-in</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>Computer In</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>2 × VGA (D-Sub)</td></tr><tr><td>Composite Video</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>Audio In</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>1 × 3.5mm</td></tr><tr><td>Audio Out</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>1 × 3.5mm</td></tr><tr><td>Monitor Out</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>RS232 Control</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>USB Mini B</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>260W (Normal), &lt;0.5W Standby</td></tr><tr><td>Power Supply</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>100–240V AC, 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>2.2 kg</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>294 × 218 × 110 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>2 Years (Lamp: 12 Months)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/xEiCZ97JZ9