(528, 'ViewSonic Projector PX747-4K ULTRA HD 3500 Lumens 4K DLP', 'This 4K UHD projector delivers stunning 3840×2160 resolution with 3500 ANSI lumens brightness, making it ideal for home cinema, business presentations, and professional displays. With dual HDMI, strong contrast, and up to 300-inch screen size, it ensures a premium viewing experience.', 'viewsonic-projector-px747-4k-ultra-hd-3500-lumens-4k-dlp-1781349387', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The BenQ 4K UHD 3500 ANSI Lumens Projector is designed to deliver a premium visual experience for both home entertainment and professional use. Featuring a native resolution of 3840×2160 (True 4K UHD), it produces ultra-sharp images with exceptional detail, making it perfect for movies, gaming, presentations, and digital content.</p><p>With 3500 ANSI lumens brightness, this projector performs well in both dark and moderately lit environments, ensuring clear and vibrant visuals at all times. The 12,000:1 contrast ratio enhances depth and realism by producing rich blacks and bright whites, improving overall image quality.</p><p>The projector supports a wide projection range from 30 inches to 300 inches, allowing users to create a true cinematic experience at home or in large venues. Its flexible projection distance (0.97m to 11.69m) makes installation easy and adaptable to different spaces.</p><p>Equipped with a 240W lamp, it offers up to 4000 hours in normal mode and up to 15,000 hours in Eco modes, ensuring long-lasting performance with reduced maintenance costs. The built-in 10W speaker provides decent audio output for everyday use without external speakers.</p><p>Connectivity options include dual HDMI ports (HDMI 2.0/1.4), VGA input, USB Type-A power port, RS232 control, and audio in/out ports, ensuring compatibility with modern and legacy devices.</p><p>With its durable build, high-resolution output, and versatile connectivity, this projector is a strong choice for users seeking a reliable 4K display solution.</p>', '<figure clas