(529, 'ViewSonic Projector PA503XE 4000 Lumens XGA Business', 'The ViewSonic 4000 ANSI Lumens DC3 DLP Projector delivers bright and clear visuals with Full HD support, making it ideal for classrooms, offices, and business presentations. With 4000 lumens brightness, 22,000:1 contrast ratio, and flexible installation range, it ensures reliable performance in various environments.', 'viewsonic-projector-pa503xe-4000-lumens-xga-business-1781349746', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The ViewSonic 4000 ANSI Lumens DC3 DLP Projector is designed for professional, educational, and business environments where brightness, clarity, and reliability are essential. With a powerful 4000 ANSI lumens output, it delivers bright and sharp visuals even in well-lit rooms, making it suitable for classrooms, conference halls, and training centers.</p><p>This projector supports resolutions from VGA (640×480) up to Full HD (1920×1080), ensuring compatibility with modern laptops, PCs, and multimedia devices. Its 22,000:1 contrast ratio enhances image depth, providing better distinction between dark and bright areas for improved readability of text, charts, and videos.</p><p>The projector supports a flexible projection distance from 1.19m to 13.11m, allowing screen sizes up to large-format displays suitable for presentations and seminars. The 190W lamp ensures stable performance with energy-efficient operation and long-lasting usage.</p><p>A built-in 2W speaker provides basic audio output for small presentations, while HDMI, VGA monitor output, and 3.5mm audio ports ensure wide connectivity options for both modern and legacy devices.</p><p>Its lightweight 2.2 kg body and compact design make it easy to install on ceilings or portable stands, offering flexibility for different environments.</p><p>Overall, this ViewSonic projector is a cost-effective and dependable solution for users who need bright visuals, simple connectivity, and long-term reliability.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Cate