(530, 'Viewsonic Projector M1X Smart LED Portable', 'This ultra-portable LED smart projector features 360 lumens brightness, built-in 12000mAh battery, and 100-inch projection support. With WiFi, Bluetooth, HDMI, and USB-C connectivity, it is perfect for travel, home entertainment, and mobile presentations.', 'viewsonic-projector-m1x-smart-led-portable-1781350077', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Portable Smart LED Mini Projector is a compact and lightweight projection device designed for mobility, convenience, and entertainment. With 360 LED lumens brightness and a high 120,000:1 contrast ratio, it delivers clear visuals for movies, presentations, and casual viewing in dark environments.</p><p>Featuring a native resolution of 854×480 (WVGA) with support up to Full HD, this projector is ideal for home use, travel, outdoor movie nights, and portable business presentations. It supports screen sizes from 24 inches up to 100 inches, making it flexible for different viewing needs.</p><p>One of its standout features is the built-in 12000mAh rechargeable battery, offering up to 3 hours of wireless usage. This makes it perfect for outdoor entertainment and situations where power access is limited.</p><p>Connectivity options include HDMI, USB Type-C, USB Type-A, Bluetooth 4.2, and WiFi 5G input, allowing seamless connection with smartphones, laptops, and streaming devices. It also includes 16GB internal storage for offline media playback.</p><p>Dual 3W built-in speakers provide stereo sound, eliminating the need for external audio devices. The ultra-quiet operation (25–26 dB) ensures an immersive viewing experience without noise distraction.</p><p>Weighing only 0.8kg, this projector is extremely portable and easy to carry. Its compact design (166 × 138 × 54 mm) makes it ideal for users who need projection on the go.</p><p>Overall, this mini LED projector is a powerful blend of portability, smart features, and wireless convenience.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>WVGA</td><td>0.2\" DLP</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>Native</td><td>854 × 480</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>360 LED Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>120,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Size</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>24\" – 100\"</td></tr><tr><td>Throw Distance</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>0.64m – 2.66m (38\" @ 1m)</td></tr><tr><td>Keystone</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Horizontal ±40°, Vertical ±40°</td></tr><tr><td>Noise Level</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>25–26 dB (Eco/Normal)</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>16GB (12GB usable)</td></tr><tr><td>Input Lag</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>73 ms</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution Support</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>VGA to Full HD (1920×1080)</td></tr><tr><td>HDTV Support</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>480i to 1080p</td></tr><tr><td>Light Source Life</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Up to 60,000 hours</td></tr><tr><td>Speaker</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>3W × 2 Cube Stereo</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>1 (HDMI 1.4 / HDCP 1.4)</td></tr><tr><td>USB Type-C</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>1 (5V/1.5A)</td></tr><tr><td>USB Type-A</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>1 (USB 2.0 Reader)</td></tr><tr><td>Bluetooth Audio</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Yes (BT 4.2)</td></tr><tr><td>WiFi</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>5G Wireless Input</td></tr><tr><td>Battery</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>12000mAh (Up to 3 hrs usage)</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>35W</td></tr><tr><td>Power Input</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>100–240V AC</td></tr><tr><td>Output</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>19V DC / 3.26A</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>0.8 kg (Ultra Portable)</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>166 × 138 × 54 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>2 Years (1st Year Parts, 2nd Year Service)</td></tr></tbody></tabl