iFi projector, Bluetooth projector, USB C projector, HDMI projector, buy ViewSonic projector, original ViewSonic projector, ViewSonic M1X buy online, projector shop Bangladesh, International Office Solution, portable LED projector, best portable projector Bangladesh', NULL, 45, NULL, NULL),
(531, 'ViewSonic Projector PG603W 3,600 Lumens WXGA Business DLP', 'A high-performance 3600 ANSI Lumens WXGA DLP projector designed for classrooms, meeting rooms, and training environments. It delivers sharp visuals with a 22,000:1 contrast ratio, supports screen sizes up to 300 inches, and offers flexible connectivity including HDMI, VGA, USB, and LAN. With a lamp life of up to 15,000 hours in Eco mode, it ensures long-term reliability and low maintenance costs.', 'viewsonic-projector-pg603w-3600-lumens-wxga-business-dlp-1781351421', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>This WXGA DLP projector is built for professional and educational use, offering a powerful combination of brightness, clarity, and flexibility. With <strong>3,600 ANSI lumens</strong>, it performs well even in moderately lit environments, making it ideal for classrooms, boardrooms, training centers, and presentations.</p><p>The projector supports a native resolution of <strong>1280 × 800 (WXGA)</strong> and is compatible with input resolutions up to Full HD (1920 × 1080), ensuring sharp and detailed visuals. A high <strong>22,000:1 contrast ratio</strong> enhances text readability and image depth, making presentations more engaging and professional.</p><p>Designed for versatility, it supports projection sizes from <strong>30 inches up to 300 inches</strong> with a throw distance range of 1 to 11 meters. Connectivity is extensive, featuring HDMI, VGA input/output, USB ports, LAN (RJ45), RS-232 control, and composite video input, ensuring compatibility with a wide range of devices.</p><p>The built-in <strong>10W speaker</strong> provides clear audio output for small to medium rooms without needing external speakers. Its lamp system delivers up to <strong>5,000 hours in normal mode and 15,000 hours in Eco mode</strong>, reducing maintenance costs significantly.</p><p>With a compact white design and weighing just 3.3 kg, the projector is easy to install and integrate into any environment. It is backed by a <strong>1-year warranty with an additional 1-year lamp warranty</strong>, ensuring peace of mind for business and educational users.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>Technology</td><td>DLP</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>Native</td><td>WXGA (1280 × 800)</td></tr><tr><td>PC Resolution</td><td>Max</td><td>1920 × 1080</td></tr><tr><td>PC Resolution</td><td>Min</td><td>640 × 480</td></tr><tr><td>Mac Resolution</td><td>Max</td><td>1920 × 1080</td></tr><tr><td>Mac Resolution</td><td>Min</td><td>640 × 480</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>Output</td><td>3,600 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Distance</td><td>Range</td><td>1 – 11 meters</td></tr><tr><td>Image Size</td><td>Screen Range</td><td>30 – 300 inches</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>Dynamic</td><td>22,000:1</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/ILJFNblCJfH9lZU8vaweSeOaJ8fjAkhoq2YLaGgK.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 11:50:21', '2026-06-13 11:50:21', 'WXGA 3600 ANSI Lumens DLP Projector | 22,000:1 Contrast, HDMI & LAN Support', 'Buy 3600 ANSI lumens WXGA DLP projector with 22,000:1 contrast ratio, HDMI, VGA, LAN connectivity, and up to 300-inch display. Ideal for classrooms and business presentations.', 'projector, WXGA projector, 3600 ANSI lumens projector, DLP projector, classroom projector, business projector, HDMI projector, VGA projector, LAN projector, 300 inch projector, short throw projector, education projector', NULL, 45, NULL, NULL),
(532, 'ViewSonic Projector PA503X Bright 3800 Lumens XGA Multimedia', 'A 3800 lumens XGA DLP projector designed for classrooms and business presentations, offering sharp image quality with a 22,000:1 contrast ratio, wide connectivity options including HDMI and VGA, and projection sizes up to 300 inches.', 'viewsonic-projector-pa503x-bright-3800-lumens-xga-multimedia-1781351651', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>This XGA DLP projector delivers reliable performance with <strong>3800 ANSI lumens brightness</strong>, making it suitable for classrooms, training centers, and meeting rooms. It supports a native resolution of <strong>1024 × 768 (XGA)</strong> and is compatible with resolutions up to WUXGA, ensuring flexible content display from multiple sources.</p><p>With a high <strong>22,000:1 dynamic contrast ratio</strong>, the projector produces sharp text, clear images, and improved depth, making it ideal for presentations and educational use. It supports a projection size range of <strong>30 to 300 inches</strong>, with a long throw distance of up to 13.11 meters.</p><p>Connectivity options include <strong>HDMI 1.4, dual VGA input, VGA output, RS-232 control, USB Mini-B, audio in/out, and composite video</strong>, ensuring compatibility with legacy and modern devices. The built-in <strong>2W speaker</strong> provides basic audio output for small rooms.</p><p>The lamp system supports up to <strong>5,000 hours in normal mode and 15,000 hours in eco mode</strong>, helping reduce maintenance costs and long-term ownership expenses. With a lightweight design of just <strong>2.2 kg</strong>, installation is easy and flexible in various environments.</p><p>Backed by a <strong>1-year warranty including lamp coverage</strong>, this projector is a practical and cost-effective solution for educational and corporate use.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>Technology</td><td>DLP</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>Native</td><td>XGA (1024 × 768)</td></tr><tr><td>PC Resolution</td><td>Max</td><td>VGA (640 × 480) to WUXGA_RB (1920 × 1200)</td></tr><tr><td>Mac Resolution</td><td>Max</td><td>VGA (640 × 480) to WUXGA_RB (1920 × 1200)</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>Output</td><td>3800 Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Distance</td><td>Range</td><td>1.19 – 13.11 m (3.9 – 43 ft)</td></tr><tr><td>Image Size</td><td>Screen Range</td><td>30 – 300 inches (0.76 – 7.62 m)</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>Dynamic</td><td>22,000:1</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/F3QZDgLIwFZ5DefKa3d9CYfHyKf5oI3B6i8NNCEM.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 11:54:11', '2026-06-13 11:54:11', '3800 Lumens XGA DLP Projector | 22,000:1 Contrast, HDMI, VGA, 300 Inch Display', 'Buy 3800 lumens XGA DLP projector with HDMI, VGA, RS232, and 22,000:1 contrast ratio. Supports up to 300-inch display, ideal for classroom and business use.', 'XGA projector, 3800 lumens projector, DLP projector, classroom projector, business projector, HDMI VGA projector, 300 inch projector, education projector, high contrast projector, 22000:1 projector\r\n\r\nIf you want next step, I can:\r\n\r\nCombine ALL models into a comparison sheet (Best for SEO category page)\r\n\r\nCreate a WooCommerce / Shopify bulk product upload CSV\r\n\r\nOr generate Bangladesh market pricing + SEO landing pages for each brand\r\n\r\nJust tell me 👍', NULL, 45, NULL, NULL),
(533, 'ViewSonic Projector M1 Mini Plus 120 LED Lumens Built-in Wi-Fi Ultra-portable LED Android', 'A compact WVGA LED DLP projector with 120 LED lumens brightness, ultra-portable 0.6 kg design, HDMI connectivity, and up to 30,000 hours LED life, ideal for mobile entertainment and personal use.', 'viewsonic-projector-m1-mini-plus-120-led-lumens-built-in-wi-fi-ultra-portable-led-android-1781352329', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>This compact <strong>WVGA (854 × 480) DLP LED projector</strong> is designed for ultra-portable entertainment and basic projection needs. With a lightweight body of only <strong>0.6 kg</strong>, it is easy to carry and set up anywhere, making it ideal for personal use, travel, or small presentations.</p><p>It features <strong>120 LED lumens brightness</strong>, powered by an RGB LED light source that delivers consistent performance with a long lifespan of up to <strong>30,000 hours</strong>, ensuring minimal maintenance and long-term usability.</p><p>With a <strong>high contrast ratio of 120,000:1</strong>, the projector enhances image depth and clarity despite its compact size. The projection range of <strong>0.6 to 2.7 meters</strong> allows flexible setup in small rooms or limited spaces.</p><p>Connectivity includes <strong>HDMI 1.4 with HDCP support, USB Type-A, and Micro USB</strong>, enabling easy connection with laptops, smartphones, streaming devices, and media players.</p><p>A built-in <strong>2W speaker</strong> provides basic audio output, while its ultra-compact design makes it a convenient solution for on-the-go entertainment or quick projection needs.</p><p>Backed by a <strong>1-year warranty on both projector and lamp</strong>, this device offers reliable performance in a compact form factor.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>Technology</td><td>DLP LED</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>Native</td><td>WVGA (854 × 480)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Distance</td><td>Range</td><td>0.6 – 2.7 m (2.1 – 8.7 ft)</td></tr><tr><td>Image Size</td><td>Display</td><td>WVGA (854 × 480)</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>Dynamic</td><td>120,000:1</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/amnTK8AWC6dx3JB55IrMbwmsZk9BhRlOWMsgMJ5X.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 12:05:29', '2026-06-13 12:05:29', 'Mini WVGA LED Projector | 120 Lumens, HDMI, 30,000H LED Life, Ultra Portable', 'Buy compact WVGA LED projector with 120 lumens brightness, HDMI support, 30,000 hours LED life, and ultra-light 0.6kg design. Perfect portable projector.', 'mini projector, LED projector, WVGA projector, portable projector, HDMI projector, 120 lumens projector, small projector, travel projector, compact projector, 30000 hour projector', NULL, 45, NULL, NULL),
(534, 'ViewSonic Projector LS700HD 3500 Lumens FHD Laser', 'A Full HD 1080p DLP Laser projector with 3,500 ANSI lumens brightness, 3,000,000:1 contrast ratio, dual HDMI ports, and 20,000-hour laser life—ideal for business and education use.', 'viewsonic-projector-ls700hd-3500-lumens-fhd-laser-1781352636', '<p>This <strong>Full HD DLP Laser projector</strong> delivers high-performance visuals with a native resolution of <strong>1920 × 1080 pixels</strong>, making it suitable for professional presentations, classrooms, and corporate environments. With <strong>3,500 ANSI lumens brightness</strong>, it ensures clear and vibrant images even in well-lit rooms.</p><p>The advanced <strong>laser light source</strong> provides a long lifespan of up to <strong>20,000 hours</strong>, significantly reducing maintenance costs and ensuring consistent brightness over time. A powerful <strong>3,000,000:1 contrast ratio</strong> enhances image depth, producing sharper text and more detailed visuals.</p><p>It supports flexible installation with a projection distance range of <strong>1.5 to 8.8 meters</strong>, making it suitable for both small and medium-sized rooms. Connectivity is highly versatile, including <strong>dual HDMI, dual VGA input, VGA output, LAN (RJ45), USB Type-A, Mini USB, audio in/out, RS-232, and composite video</strong>, ensuring compatibility with modern and legacy devices.</p><p>The built-in <strong>2W speaker</strong> provides basic audio output for presentations without external speakers. With a compact design and reliable laser technology, it is ideal for long-term use in professional environments.</p><p>Backed by a <strong>1-year warranty for both projector and lamp</strong>, it ensures dependable performance and peace of mind.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>Technology</td><td>DLP Laser</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>Native</td><td>Full HD (1920 × 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>Output</td><td>3,500 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Distance</td><td>Range</td><td>1.5 – 8.8 m (4.9 – 28.8 ft)</td></tr><tr><td>Image Size</td><td>Max</td><td>Up to 1920 × 1080</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/lpKSdfVv1MHxfuxzcLuLI6Gw3YqybvHkZcP8EoDe.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 12:10:36', '2026-06-13 12:10:36', 'Full HD Laser Projector 3500 ANSI | 3,000,000:1 Contrast, Dual HDMI, 20,000H Life', 'Buy Full HD 1080p DLP laser projector with 3500 ANSI lumens, 3,000,000:1 contrast ratio, dual HDMI, VGA, LAN, and 20,000-hour laser lifespan.', 'laser projector, Full HD projector, 3500 ANSI lumens projector, DLP projector, 1080p projector, business projector, dual HDMI projector, 20,000 hour laser projector, classroom projector, high contrast projector', NULL, 45, NULL, NULL),
(535, 'Acer Aspire Lite AL15-53 Core i5 1334U 16GB IPS 15.6\" FHD Laptop iosbd', 'The International Office Solution 15.6\" FHD Laptop (Steel Gray) is a highly efficient, cost-effective portable workstation designed for everyday administrative tasks and seamless mobile productivity. Powered by the 12th Gen Intel Core i3-1215U hybrid processor, 8GB of DDR4 RAM, and a fast 512GB PCIe Gen3 NVMe SSD, it delivers reliable, snappy performance for daily office applications and web browsing. Weighing just 1.59 kg and featuring exceptional upgradeability (up to 32GB RAM) alongside Free-Dos for total IT deployment flexibility, it is an incredibly practical and adaptable asset for growing businesses and students.', 'acer-aspire-lite-al15-53-core-i5-1334u-16gb-ips-156-fhd-laptop-iosbd-1784211630', '<p>Streamline your daily workflow and equip your workforce with reliable computing power using the <strong>International Office Solution</strong> 15.6-inch Portable Workstation. Encased in a sleek, professional \"Steel Gray\" chassis that weighs a remarkably light 1.59 kg and measures just under 20mm in thickness, this laptop is designed for maximum portability without sacrificing screen real estate. It is the perfect daily driver for administrative professionals, students, and hybrid workers who need a dependable, lightweight machine for data entry, document formatting, and web-based research.</p><p>At the core of this highly efficient machine lies the 12th Generation Intel Core i3-1215U processor. Utilizing Intel’s advanced hybrid architecture, it features 6 cores (2 Performance cores and 4 Efficient cores) capable of boosting up to 4.40 GHz. This intelligent power distribution ensures snappy responsiveness when launching applications, while conserving battery life during lighter background tasks. Out of the box, the system is equipped with 8GB of 3200MHz DDR4 memory and a rapid 512GB PCIe Gen3 NVMe SSD, guaranteeing quick boot times and fast file retrieval. Crucially for budget-conscious IT departments, this laptop is highly future-proof; it features two dedicated RAM slots supporting up to 32GB of memory, and the storage drive is fully upgradeable, ensuring the hardware scales beautifully as your software demands evolve.</p><p>The visual and communication suites are designed to keep you comfortable and connected throughout the workday. The expansive 15.6-inch Full HD (1920x1080) LED-backlit display features Acer ComfyView technology, an anti-glare coating that actively reduces eye strain during long hours of spreadsheet analysis or heavy reading. For remote collaboration, the integrated 720p HD webcam, dual stereo speakers, and built-in microphone provide a reliable, clear communication environment for virtual meetings and online classes.</p><p>Connectivity is highly versatile, ensuring you are never caught without the right port. The comprehensive I/O suite features a high-speed USB 3.2 Gen2 Type-C port, a USB 3.2 Gen1 Type-A port, legacy USB 2.0 ports for older peripherals, an HDMI output for immediate presentations on external monitors, and a dedicated LAN port for secure, hardwired network access. Supported by reliable Wi-Fi and Bluetooth 5.0, and arriving with Free-Dos to grant your IT administrators total freedom over custom, bloatware-free OS deployments, this <strong>International Office Solution</strong> laptop represents a highly practical, high-value investment.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Computing Engine</strong></td><td>Intel Core i3-1215U (6 Cores [2P, 4E], 8 Threads, Up to 4.40 GHz)</td><td>Efficient 12th Gen hybrid architecture delivers snappy daily performance while maximizing battery life during lighter administrative tasks.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Architecture</strong></td><td>8GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM (Upgradeable to 32GB via 2 Slots)</td><td>Provides solid baseline performance for daily multitasking with exceptional, budget-friendly expansion potential for future software needs.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage Solution</strong></td><td>512GB PCIe Gen3 NVMe SSD (Upgradeable)</td><td>High-speed solid-state storage guarantees fast boot sequences, instantaneous application loading, and reliable local document archiving.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display &amp; Visuals</strong></td><td>15.6-inch FHD (1920x1080) LED-backlit TFT LCD, ComfyView</td><td>An expansive, high-resolution workspace featuring an anti-glare coating to reduce eye fatigue under harsh corporate office lighting.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>A/V &amp; Communication</strong></td><td>720p HD Webcam, Dual Stereo Speakers, Built-in Microphone</td><td>Delivers clear, highly reliable audio and high-definition video out-of-the-box for seamless virtual meetings and remote collaboration.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Network &amp; I/O</strong></td><td>Wi-Fi, Bluetooth 5.0, Gigabit LAN, 1x Type-C (3.2 Gen2), HDMI</td><td>Offers highly versatile connectivity options, ensuring seamless integration with modern external displays, networks, and essential peripherals.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design, Power &amp; OS</strong></td><td>Steel Gray Chassis (1.59 kg), 36Wh Battery, Free-Dos</td><td>An ultra-lightweight, professional frame that offers IT departments complete freedom to deploy custom, highly secure corporate operating systems.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Laptop', 74500.00, 74500.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/JPKu75i9FGoDJs11usY13i1w4SwwC3Srq2EZUfdf.webp', 'products/videos/CtjzQpHqw1DSznowxdkWBdrKjsieTZqoZu31i00W.mp4', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 12:20:35', '2026-07-16 15:58:36', 'International Office Solution 15.6\" FHD Laptop | Core i3-1215U', 'Maximize everyday productivity with the International Office Solution 15.6\" Laptop. Featuring a 12th Gen Intel Core i3, 8GB RAM, 512GB SSD, and incredible upgradeability.', 'Maximize everyday productivity with the International Office Solution 15.6\" Laptop. Featuring a 12th Gen Intel Core i3, 8GB RAM, 512GB SSD, and incredible upgradeability.', NULL, 8, NULL, NULL),
(537, 'Acer Aspire 15 AS15-42 Ryzen 3 7330U 15.6\" FHD Laptop iosbd', 'The International Office Solution 15.6\" FHD IPS Laptop (Pure Silver) is a highly capable, multitasking powerhouse engineered for modern professionals and dynamic students. Driven by an AMD Ryzen 3 7330U processor, a generous 16GB of dual-channel DDR4 RAM, and a lightning-fast 512GB NVMe PCIe Gen4 SSD, it delivers incredibly smooth efficiency for daily workflows and cloud-based applications. Featuring advanced Wi-Fi 6 connectivity, a noise-canceling dual-microphone array, and shipping with Free-DOS for total operating system flexibility, it is an exceptionally well-rounded, future-proof machine packed into a sleek 1.79 kg chassis.', 'acer-aspire-15-as15-42-ryzen-3-7330u-156-fhd-laptop-iosbd-1784215670', '<p>Elevate your mobile computing experience and streamline your daily workflow with the highly versatile <strong>International Office Solution</strong> 15.6-inch Portable Workstation. Wrapped in an elegant \"Pure Silver\" chassis that measures just 18.9mm thin, this laptop perfectly balances desktop-level productivity with travel-ready portability. At the heart of this machine is the robust AMD Ryzen 3 7330U processor. Featuring a 4-core, 8-thread architecture capable of boosting up to 4.3 GHz, it effortlessly handles administrative software, heavy web browsing, and document formatting without breaking a sweat.</p><p>What truly sets this configuration apart for everyday productivity is its memory architecture. Out of the box, it is equipped with 16GB of 3200MHz DDR4 memory running in a dual-channel configuration (8GB x 2). This dual-channel setup completely eliminates multitasking bottlenecks and significantly maximizes the performance of the integrated AMD Radeon Graphics, ensuring fluid rendering for data visualizations and media playback. Paired with a blazing-fast 512GB NVMe PCIe Gen4 SSD, the system guarantees near-instantaneous boot sequences and highly responsive application loading times. Crucially, the system supports memory expansion up to a massive 32GB, ensuring your hardware can scale right alongside your professional demands.</p><p>The visual and auditory experience is meticulously crafted for the modern era of remote collaboration. The expansive 15.6-inch Full HD (1920x1080) IPS LED display guarantees crisp text, vibrant color accuracy, and wide viewing angles that actively reduce eye strain during long hours of data analysis. When it comes to virtual meetings, this laptop truly shines. It features a high-definition 720p webcam paired with an advanced dual-array microphone system equipped with built-in Noise Cancellation. This ensures that your voice comes through with crystal-clear fidelity on virtual calls, actively filtering out distracting background noise, while the dual 2W stereo speakers provide High-Fidelity Original Recording quality audio playback.</p><p>Beyond performance and media, connectivity is strictly enterprise-grade. The inclusion of next-generation Wi-Fi 6 (802.11ax) and a dedicated Gigabit LAN port ensures you have access to ultra-low latency, high-bandwidth internet whether you are completely wireless or hardwired at your desk. The expansive I/O suite includes a modern USB 3.2 Gen2 Type-C port, multiple high-speed USB-A ports, and HDMI for seamless external monitor expansion. Powered by a high-capacity 54Wh 3-cell battery paired with a rapid 65W AC adapter, and arriving with Free-DOS to grant IT administrators total freedom over custom OS deployments, this <strong>International Office Solution</strong> laptop is a forward-thinking, highly adaptable investment.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Computing Engine</strong></td><td>AMD Ryzen 3 7330U (4 Cores, 8 Threads, Up to 4.3 GHz, 10MB Cache)</td><td>The highly efficient multi-core architecture delivers snappy, sustained performance for multitasking and daily office applications.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Architecture</strong></td><td>16GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM (8GB x 2 Dual-Channel, Up to 32GB)</td><td>Dual-channel memory vastly improves system responsiveness and maximizes integrated graphics performance for flawless, lag-free operation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage Solution</strong></td><td>512GB NVMe PCIe Gen4 SSD (Upgradeable to 1TB)</td><td>Next-generation Gen4 solid-state storage provides incredibly fast boot times and file access, with an easy upgrade path for future data expansion.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display &amp; Visuals</strong></td><td>15.6-inch FHD (1920x1080) IPS LED Panel</td><td>Delivers a massive, crystal-clear digital workspace with ultra-wide viewing angles, reducing eye fatigue during prolonged spreadsheet work.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>A/V &amp; Communication</strong></td><td>720p HD Camera, Dual Array Mics with Noise Cancellation, Dual 2W Speakers</td><td>Creates a professional, studio-quality virtual meeting environment out-of-the-box by actively suppressing distracting background noise.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Network &amp; Wireless</strong></td><td>Wi-Fi 6 (802.11ax), Bluetooth 5.2, Dedicated RJ45 LAN Port</td><td>Next-generation networking technology guarantees massive, stable bandwidth for flawless cloud computing and large file transfers.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Extensive I/O Ports</strong></td><td>1x Type-C (3.2 Gen2), 1x USB-A (3.2 Gen1), 2x USB-A (2.0), 1x HDMI</td><td>Comprehensive peripheral integration allows for highly versatile data transfers and effortless connection to modern external displays.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design, Power &amp; OS</strong></td><td>Pure Silver Chassis (1.79 kg), 54Wh Battery, Free-DOS</td><td>An elegant, highly portable form factor backed by reliable battery life, offering IT departments total freedom over secure OS installations.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'laptop', 70000.00, 70000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/q3QJy4WCS0x6Iaf1wTo4phnpN7GtCBaLU7Vsprnr.webp', 'products/videos/0jMIB8Hku5H3KlSv7hoBxRhlWhwBgxp0s7EqB82M.mp4', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 12:24:40', '2026-07-16 15:27:50', 'International Office Solution 15.6\" FHD IPS Laptop | Ryzen 3 & 16GB RAM', ': Boost your workflow with the International Office Solution 15.6\" Laptop. Featuring an AMD Ryzen 3 7330U, 16GB dual-channel RAM, 512GB Gen4 SSD, and Wi-Fi 6.', 'International Office Solution laptop, 15.6 inch FHD IPS laptop, AMD Ryzen 3 7330U computer, 16GB RAM laptop, dual channel memory laptop, 512GB NVMe Gen4 SSD, Wi-Fi 6 business laptop, Free-DOS portable PC, noise cancellation mic laptop', NULL, 8, NULL, NULL),
(538, 'Acer Aspire 3 A325-53 Core i5 13th Gen 15.6\" FHD Win11 Laptop iosbd', 'The International Office Solution 15.6\" FHD Laptop (Silver) is a remarkably powerful and highly adaptable portable workstation designed for modern professionals and dynamic enterprise environments. Driven by the advanced 13th Gen Intel Core i5-1334U 10-core processor, 8GB of rapid DDR4 RAM, and a lightning-fast 512GB PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD, it delivers exceptional multitasking performance for heavy administrative software. Featuring robust Wi-Fi 6 networking, immense future-proof upgradeability (up to 32GB RAM), and arriving pre-installed with Windows 11 for immediate out-of-the-box productivity, it is a highly reliable business asset housed in a sleek 1.75 kg silver chassis.', 'acer-aspire-3-a325-53-core-i5-13th-gen-156-fhd-win11-laptop-iosbd-1784210880', '<p>Maximize your mobile productivity and future-proof your corporate hardware with the <strong>International Office Solution</strong> 15.6-inch Portable Workstation. Wrapped in a professional silver chassis measuring just 19.0mm thin, this laptop perfectly harmonizes desktop-tier processing power with everyday travel readiness. At the absolute core of this machine lies the formidable 13th Generation Intel Core i5-1334U processor. Utilizing Intel’s highly advanced hybrid architecture, it boasts 10 cores (2 Performance cores and 8 Efficient cores) and 12 threads, capable of boosting up to a blazing 4.6GHz. This intelligent core distribution ensures that high-priority, complex applications receive maximum power, while background tasks run efficiently, significantly extending your operational battery life throughout the workday.</p><p>Out of the box, the system is equipped with 8GB of 3200MHz DDR4 memory and a blazing-fast 512GB PCIe Gen4 M.2 NVMe SSD, ensuring near-instantaneous boot sequences and ultra-rapid file transfers. However, what makes this <strong>International Office Solution</strong> laptop truly exceptional for growing businesses is its phenomenal expansion capacity. Unlike many modern ultrabooks with soldered memory, this system features two dedicated soDIMM slots supporting up to a massive 32GB of RAM, alongside storage upgrade capabilities up to 1TB. This ensures your hardware can seamlessly scale right alongside your escalating professional software demands.</p><p>The visual and communication suites are meticulously engineered for the modern era of hybrid work and remote collaboration. The expansive 15.6-inch Full HD (1920x1080) LCD panel provides a wide, comfortable canvas that guarantees crisp text and vibrant clarity, reducing eye strain during long hours of intensive spreadsheet analysis or presentation drafting. When engaging in virtual meetings, the high-definition 720p webcam, integrated dual stereo speakers, and built-in microphone array create a reliable, studio-quality communication environment.</p><p>Beyond performance and media, connectivity is strictly enterprise-grade. The inclusion of next-generation Wi-Fi 6 (802.11ax) and a dedicated Gigabit LAN port ensures you have access to ultra-low latency, high-bandwidth internet whether you are completely wireless in a cafe or hardwired at a corporate desk. The expansive I/O suite includes a modern USB 3.2 Gen2 Type-C port, a high-speed USB 3.2 Gen1 Type-A port, legacy USB 2.0 ports, and HDMI for seamless multi-monitor expansion. Powered by a reliable 54Wh 3-cell battery, and arriving with Windows 11 fully installed to provide immediate access to the latest security features and productivity tools, this laptop is a brilliant, highly adaptable long-term investment.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Computing Engine</strong></td><td>Intel Core i5-1334U (10 Cores [2P, 8E], 12 Threads, Up to 4.6GHz, 12MB Cache)</td><td>Hybrid core architecture intelligently balances high-octane performance for heavy software with supreme energy efficiency for longer battery life.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory &amp; Expansion</strong></td><td>8GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM (Upgradable to 32GB), 512GB PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD</td><td>Provides immediate high-speed responsiveness with incredible future-proofing, allowing immense memory expansion via two dedicated soDIMM slots.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display &amp; Visuals</strong></td><td>15.6-inch FHD (1920x1080) LCD Panel, Intel UHD Graphics</td><td>Delivers a massive, crystal-clear digital workspace that enhances workflow visibility and reduces eye fatigue during prolonged data entry.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>A/V &amp; Communication</strong></td><td>720p HD Video WebCam, Dual Stereo Speakers, Built-in Microphone</td><td>Creates a highly reliable, professional virtual meeting environment out-of-the-box for seamless remote collaboration and conferencing.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Network &amp; Wireless</strong></td><td>Wi-Fi 6 (802.11ax), Bluetooth 5.2, Dedicated RJ45 LAN Port</td><td>Next-generation networking technology guarantees massive, stable bandwidth for flawless cloud computing, server access, and enormous file transfers.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Extensive I/O Ports</strong></td><td>1x Type-C (3.2 Gen2), 1x USB-A (3.2 Gen1), 2x USB-A (2.0), 1x HDMI</td><td>Comprehensive peripheral integration allows for lightning-fast data transfers and effortless connection to modern external displays and projectors.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design, Power &amp; OS</strong></td><td>Silver Chassis (1.75 kg), 54Wh Battery, Windows 11 Operating System</td><td>An elegant, highly portable form factor that provides a modern, secure, and intuitive out-of-the-box experience ready for immediate deployment.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Laptop', 69000.00, 69000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/LBdWnA98fAJTaMEmh16CK26MQOPECMSFGX2AZwEY.webp', 'products/videos/TnB2EsyDCbaqAyyxirFINOSxQ4GKQhf6VQKyl7zA.mp4', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 12:26:43', '2026-07-16 15:18:05', 'International Office Solution 15.6\" FHD Laptop | Core i5-1334U & Windows 11', 'Supercharge your workflow with the International Office Solution 15.6\" Laptop. Featuring a 13th Gen Intel Core i5-1334U, 8GB RAM, 512GB Gen4 SSD, Windows 11, and Wi-Fi 6.', 'International Office Solution laptop, 15.6 inch FHD laptop, Intel Core i5-1334U computer, upgradeable 32GB RAM laptop, 512GB PCIe Gen4 SSD, Wi-Fi 6 business laptop, Windows 11 portable PC, silver corporate laptop', NULL, 8, NULL, NULL),
(539, 'Acer Aspire 15 AS15-42 Ryzen 5 7430U 15.6\" FHD Laptop iosbd', 'The International Office Solution 15.6\" FHD IPS Laptop (Pure Silver) is an exceptionally versatile and secure portable workstation engineered for modern professionals. Powered by a highly efficient 6-core AMD Ryzen 5 7430U processor, 8GB of DDR4 RAM, and a rapid 512GB PCIe Gen3 NVMe SSD, it delivers flawless performance for everyday administrative and analytical workloads. Featuring a vibrant IPS display, a premium backlit keyboard, robust Wi-Fi 6 networking, and Firmware TPM for enterprise-grade security, this 1.79 kg machine ships with Free-Dos to provide IT departments with absolute deployment flexibility.', 'acer-aspire-15-as15-42-ryzen-5-7430u-156-fhd-laptop-iosbd-1784214203', '<p>Supercharge your daily workflow and secure your corporate data with the <strong>International Office Solution</strong> 15.6-inch Portable Workstation. Wrapped in a highly professional \"Pure Silver\" chassis measuring 19.3mm thin, this laptop perfectly balances desktop-tier processing capabilities with essential mobile travel readiness. At the core of this highly adaptable machine lies the formidable AMD Ryzen 5 7430U processor. Utilizing an advanced 6-core, 12-thread architecture with a massive 16MB cache, it boosts up to 4.3 GHz. This provides immense processing headroom to effortlessly manage heavy web applications, complex spreadsheets, and seamless multitasking.</p><p>Out of the box, the system is equipped with 8GB of 3200MHz DDR4 memory and a blazing-fast 512GB NVMe PCIe Gen3 SSD, ensuring near-instantaneous boot sequences and ultra-rapid file transfers. However, what makes this <strong>International Office Solution</strong> laptop truly exceptional for growing enterprises is its phenomenal expansion capacity. Unlike many modern ultrabooks, this system features two dedicated RAM slots supporting a massive upgrade to 32GB, alongside storage upgrade capabilities up to 1TB. This ensures your hardware can scale seamlessly right alongside your escalating professional software demands.</p><p>The visual, ergonomic, and communication suites are meticulously engineered for the modern era of hybrid work. The expansive 15.6-inch Full HD (1920x1080) IPS LED panel provides a wide, highly color-accurate canvas that actively reduces eye strain during long hours of intensive data entry. Typing is highly efficient and comfortable thanks to the integrated backlit keyboard, a critical feature for professionals working in low-light environments. When engaging in virtual meetings, the high-definition webcam paired with an advanced dual-array microphone system—featuring built-in Noise Cancellation—creates a reliable, studio-quality communication environment by actively filtering out distracting background office noise.</p><p>Security and connectivity are strictly enterprise-grade. The inclusion of Firmware Trusted Platform Module (TPM) ensures that your sensitive corporate data and passwords are encrypted at the hardware level. Networking is handled by next-generation Wi-Fi 6 (802.11ax), guaranteeing massive, stable bandwidth for cloud computing. The highly versatile I/O suite includes two modern USB 3.2 Gen 1 Type-C ports, three standard USB Type-A ports, a Mini SD card reader, and HDMI for effortless multi-monitor expansions. Powered by a reliable 55Wh 3-cell battery, and arriving with Free-Dos to grant IT administrators total freedom over custom OS deployments, this laptop is a brilliant, highly secure long-term investment.</p><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Computing Engine</strong></td><td>AMD Ryzen 5 7430U (6 Cores, 12 Threads, Up to 4.3 GHz, 16MB Cache)</td><td>The powerful 6-core architecture delivers immense processing headroom for heavy enterprise applications and intense multitasking.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory &amp; Expansion</strong></td><td>8GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM (Upgradable to 32GB), 512GB NVMe Gen3 SSD</td><td>Provides immediate high-speed responsiveness with incredible future-proofing via two dedicated RAM slots for massive memory expansion.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display &amp; Ergonomics</strong></td><td>15.6-inch FHD (1920x1080) IPS LED Panel, Backlit Keyboard</td><td>An IPS panel ensures pristine color accuracy and wide viewing angles, while illuminated keys provide typing comfort in any lighting condition.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>A/V &amp; Communication</strong></td><td>HD WebCam, Dual Array Mics with Noise Cancellation, Dual Stereo Speakers</td><td>Creates a highly reliable, professional virtual meeting environment out-of-the-box by actively suppressing distracting background noise.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Network &amp; I/O</strong></td><td>Wi-Fi 6 (802.11ax), Bluetooth 5.1, 2x Type-C, 3x USB-A, HDMI</td><td>Next-generation wireless networking guarantees massive bandwidth, while comprehensive I/O supports highly versatile peripheral integration.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design, Power &amp; Security</strong></td><td>Pure Silver Chassis (1.79 kg), Firmware TPM, Free-Dos</td><td>Features hardware-level data encryption and provides IT departments total freedom over secure, enterprise-specific OS installations.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'Laptop', 71500.00, 71500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/bbTMvEiXHdBsWW9mFytrog68QlZCxJ6rkLzya8kc.webp', 'products/videos/o51UUY7YCYNLCQgksy4VCcBtHh3wzItjoHyIMave.mp4', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 12:28:30', '2026-07-16 15:03:23', 'International Office Solution 15.6\" FHD IPS Laptop | Ryzen 5 7430U & TPM', 'Secure and supercharge your workflow with the International Office Solution 15.6\" Laptop. Featuring a 6-core Ryzen 5 7430U, 8GB RAM, 512GB SSD, Wi-Fi 6, and a backlit keyboard.', ': International Office Solution laptop, 15.6 inch FHD IPS laptop, AMD Ryzen 5 7430U computer, upgradeable 32GB RAM laptop, 512GB NVMe Gen3 SSD, backlit keyboard laptop, Wi-Fi 6 business laptop, Free-Dos portable PC, TPM security laptop, silver corporate workstation', NULL, 8, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `name`, `short_description`, `slug`, `description`, `specifications_text`, `tags`, `buy_price`, `price`, `discount_price`, `stock`, `thumbnail`, `video`, `is_featured`, `status`, `is_coming_soon`, `is_tba`, `is_call_for_price`, `is_out_of_stock`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`, `meta_keywords`, `meta_image`, `brand_id`, `supplier_id`, `laptop_purpose_id`) VALUES
(540, 'Corsair NAUTILUS 360 RS ARGB 360mm Liquid CPU Cooler', 'The Premium 360mm ARGB Liquid CPU Cooler is a high-performance thermal solution engineered to tame the heat of next-generation processors. Featuring a high-density aluminum radiator, a precision-machined copper cold plate, and digital ARGB fans capable of pushing up to 72.8 CFM at 1700 RPM, it delivers extreme cooling efficiency for overclocked builds. Boasting universal compatibility with the latest Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4) sockets, ultra-durable sleeved tubing, and an industry-leading 5-year warranty, this 2.35 kg cooling powerhouse ensures your system runs at peak performance while maintaining spectacular aesthetics.', 'corsair-nautilus-360-rs-argb-360mm-liquid-cpu-cooler-1781354049', '<p>Push your processor to the absolute limit without thermal throttling using the <strong>Premium 360mm ARGB Liquid CPU Cooler</strong>. Designed for elite gamers, overclockers, and heavy workstation users, this top-tier thermal solution completely redefines system cooling. At the heart of its performance is a premium, precision-machined Copper Cold Plate designed for maximum heat transfer from the CPU. This heat is rapidly cycled through stealthy, black-sleeved low-permeation rubber tubing into a massive 396mm high-density Aluminum Radiator, ensuring optimal thermal dissipation even during marathon rendering sessions or intense gaming loads.</p><p>To actively exhaust this heat, the cooler is equipped with high-performance ARGB fans operating at a maximum speed of 1700 RPM. These digitally controlled fans generate a massive airflow of up to 72.8 CFM and an impressive static pressure of 4.15mm-H2O, easily pushing air through the dense radiator fins. Despite this immense cooling power, the acoustic profile remains highly managed; at low loads, the system whispers at a barely audible 10 dBA, and only reaches 36 dBA under maximum stress, keeping your creative or gaming environment free from distracting noise.</p><p>Beyond its raw cooling metrics, this liquid cooler is a visual centerpiece. The integrated ARGB lighting allows you to synchronize the fans and pump head with your existing motherboard software, creating a stunning, personalized light show within your chassis. Furthermore, it is exceptionally future-proof. Fully supporting the latest processor architectures—including Intel\'s cutting-edge LGA 1851 and 1700 sockets, alongside AMD\'s AM5 and AM4 platforms—it is ready for both current and next-gen builds. Backed by a comprehensive 5-year warranty, this cooler is a highly reliable, long-term investment for any high-end PC enthusiast.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Copper Cold Plate, Aluminum Radiator</td><td>High-quality thermal materials guarantee incredibly rapid heat absorption from the CPU and highly efficient heat dissipation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>1700 RPM, 13.3 - 72.8 CFM Airflow</td><td>Generates massive airflow to rapidly cool the liquid inside the radiator, preventing processor thermal throttling under heavy loads.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Static Pressure &amp; Noise</strong></td><td>0.2 – 4.15mm-H2O, 10 - 36 dBA</td><td>High static pressure easily forces air through dense radiator fins, while maintaining a surprisingly quiet acoustic profile during operation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics &amp; Control</strong></td><td>ARGB Lighting, Digital Fan Control (4-pin)</td><td>Provides a breathtaking, customizable aesthetic that seamlessly synchronizes with standard motherboard lighting software.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Durability &amp; Build</strong></td><td>Black Sleeved Low-Permeation Rubber Tubing</td><td>Premium sleeved tubing drastically reduces liquid evaporation over time, ensuring a longer lifespan and high-end aesthetic.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Socket Compatibility</strong></td><td><p>Intel: 1851, 1700</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>AMD: AM5, AM4</p></td><td>Completely future-proof mounting hardware ensures seamless installation on both current and next-generation motherboard platforms.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>396 (L) x 125 (W) x 125 (H) mm, 2.35 KG</td><td>A massive footprint designed for large chassis, maximizing the surface area available for advanced thermal dissipation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>5 Years</td><td>An industry-leading warranty that provides absolute peace of mind for your premium hardware investment.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 9800.00, 9800.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/gLReBpckxot07AlcFcmQy1YSIuMhbTNluggBW47Z.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 12:34:09', '2026-06-13 12:34:09', 'Premium 360mm ARGB Liquid CPU Cooler | Intel 1851 & AM5 Ready', 'Maximize CPU performance with this Premium ARGB Liquid Cooler. Features a 360mm radiator, 1700 RPM fans, copper cold plate, and support for Intel 1851/1700 & AMD AM5.', 'ARGB liquid CPU cooler, 360mm AIO cooler, Intel LGA 1851 cooler, AMD AM5 liquid cooler, high performance CPU cooler, PC gaming thermal solution, 1700 RPM AIO fans, copper cold plate cooler, ARGB PC cooling', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(541, 'Corsair NAUTILUS 240 RS ARGB 240mm Liquid CPU Cooler', 'The Premium 240mm ARGB Liquid CPU Cooler is an elite thermal solution engineered to tame the intense heat of modern, high-wattage processors. Featuring a high-density aluminum radiator, a precision-machined copper cold plate, and hyper-fast digital ARGB fans capable of reaching 2100 RPM, it delivers exceptional cooling efficiency for demanding builds. Boasting universal compatibility with the latest Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4) sockets, ultra-durable sleeved rubber tubing, and an industry-leading 5-year warranty, this 1.932 kg cooling powerhouse ensures your system maintains peak performance and spectacular aesthetics.', 'corsair-nautilus-240-rs-argb-240mm-liquid-cpu-cooler-1781354250', '<p>Push your processor to its absolute limits without the fear of thermal throttling using the <strong>Premium 240mm ARGB Liquid CPU Cooler</strong>. Designed meticulously for hardcore gamers, professional overclockers, and heavy workstation users, this top-tier thermal solution redefines standard system cooling. At the heart of its performance is a premium, precision-machined Copper Cold Plate engineered for maximum, instantaneous heat transfer from the CPU die. This heat is rapidly cycled through stealthy, black-sleeved low-permeation rubber tubing into a dense 275mm Aluminum Radiator, ensuring optimal thermal dissipation even during marathon 4K video rendering sessions or intense gaming workloads.</p><p>To actively exhaust this heat, the cooler is equipped with high-performance ARGB fans operating at a blistering maximum speed of 2100 RPM. These digitally controlled fans generate a massive airflow of up to 72.8 CFM and a highly impressive static pressure of 4.15 mm-H2O, effortlessly forcing fresh air through the dense radiator fins. Despite this immense cooling power, the acoustic profile remains highly managed; at low loads, the system operates at a whisper-quiet 10 dBA, and only scales to 36 dBA under maximum system stress, keeping your creative or gaming environment free from distracting noise.</p><p>Beyond its raw, uncompromising cooling metrics, this liquid cooler serves as a breathtaking visual centerpiece for your rig. The integrated ARGB lighting allows you to synchronize the fans with your existing motherboard software, creating a stunning, personalized light show within your chassis. Furthermore, it is exceptionally future-proof. Fully supporting the latest processor architectures—including Intel\'s cutting-edge LGA 1851 and 1700 sockets, alongside AMD\'s AM5 and AM4 platforms—it is ready for both current and next-generation motherboard upgrades. Backed by a comprehensive 5-year warranty, this cooler is a highly reliable, long-term investment for any high-end PC enthusiast.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Copper Cold Plate, Aluminum Radiator</td><td>Premium thermal materials guarantee incredibly rapid heat absorption from the CPU and highly efficient heat dissipation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>2100 RPM, 13.3 - 72.8 CFM Airflow</td><td>Ultra-fast fan speeds generate massive airflow to rapidly cool the liquid inside the radiator, preventing processor thermal throttling.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Static Pressure &amp; Noise</strong></td><td>0.2 – 4.15 mm-H2O, 10 - 36 dBA</td><td>High static pressure easily forces air through dense fins, while maintaining a managed, surprisingly quiet acoustic profile.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics &amp; Control</strong></td><td>ARGB Lighting, Digital Fan Control</td><td>Provides a breathtaking, customizable aesthetic that seamlessly synchronizes with standard motherboard RGB software.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Durability &amp; Build</strong></td><td>Black Sleeved Low-Permeation Rubber Tubing</td><td>Premium sleeved tubing drastically reduces liquid evaporation over time, ensuring a longer lifespan and a high-end, stealthy aesthetic.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Socket Compatibility</strong></td><td><p>Intel: 1851, 1700</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>AMD: AM5, AM4</p></td><td>Completely future-proof mounting hardware ensures seamless, secure installation on modern and next-generation motherboard platforms.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>275 (L) x 125 (W) x 125 (H) mm, 1.932 KG</td><td>A compact yet highly efficient 240mm-class footprint designed to fit easily into most mid-tower and full-tower chassis.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>5 Years</td><td>An industry-leading warranty that provides absolute peace of mind and secures your premium hardware investment.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', NULL, 8500.00, 8500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/zi523eEmZt37ZTuKUKlJ8gzRoqDkOsiJ1UNnQEVm.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 12:37:30', '2026-06-13 12:37:30', 'Premium 240mm ARGB Liquid CPU Cooler | Intel 1851 & AM5 Ready', 'Maximize your CPU\'s performance with this Premium ARGB Liquid Cooler. Features a 240mm radiator, 2100 RPM fans, copper cold plate, and support for Intel 1851 & AMD AM5.', 'ARGB liquid CPU cooler, 240mm AIO cooler, Intel LGA 1851 cooler, AMD AM5 liquid cooler, high performance CPU cooler, 2100 RPM AIO fans, copper cold plate cooler, ARGB PC cooling, PC gaming thermal solution', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(542, 'ViewSonic Projector M1 Mini Plus 120 LED Lumens Built-in Wi-Fi Ultra-portable LED Android', 'A compact WVGA DLP LED projector with 120 LED lumens brightness, ultra-portable 0.6kg design, HDMI connectivity, and long-lasting 30,000-hour LED life.', 'viewsonic-projector-m1-mini-plus-120-led-lumens-built-in-wi-fi-ultra-portable-led-android-1781354282', '<p>This <strong>WVGA (854 × 480) DLP LED projector</strong> is designed for ultra-portable entertainment and basic projection needs. Its lightweight design of just <strong>0.6 kg</strong> makes it highly portable and convenient for travel, personal use, and small room setups.</p><p>Powered by an <strong>RGB LED light source</strong>, it delivers <strong>120 LED lumens brightness</strong> with a long lifespan of up to <strong>30,000 hours</strong>, ensuring durability and minimal maintenance over time. The <strong>120,000:1 contrast ratio</strong> enhances image clarity and depth despite its compact size.</p><p>With a projection distance range of <strong>0.6 to 2.7 meters</strong>, it is ideal for small environments such as bedrooms, travel setups, or personal media use.</p><p>Connectivity options include <strong>HDMI 1.4 (HDCP supported), USB Type-A, and Micro USB</strong>, allowing easy connection with laptops, smartphones, and media devices. A built-in <strong>2W speaker</strong> provides basic audio output for casual viewing.</p><p>This projector is backed by a <strong>1-year warranty for both projector and lamp</strong>, making it a reliable entry-level projection solution.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>Technology</td><td>DLP LED</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>Native</td><td>WVGA (854 × 480)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Distance</td><td>Range</td><td>0.6 – 2.7 m (2.1 – 8.7 ft)</td></tr><tr><td>Image Size</td><td>Display</td><td>WVGA (854 × 480)</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>Dynamic</td><td>120,000:1</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/ysaZjLVaCZSpmQA9t1PXmQSMdRTqGIWryvChajdF.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 12:38:02', '2026-06-13 12:38:02', 'WVGA LED Mini Projector | 120 Lumens, HDMI, 30,000H Life, Ultra Portable 0.6kg', 'mini projector, LED projector, WVGA projector, portable projector, HDMI projector, 120 lumens projector, travel projector, compact projector, small projector, 30000 hour LED projector', 'Buy compact WVGA LED projector with 120 lumens brightness, HDMI support, 30,000-hour LED life, and ultra-light 0.6kg design. Perfect portable mini projector.', NULL, 45, NULL, NULL),
(543, 'Corsair NAUTILUS 240 RS ARGB 240mm Liquid CPU Cooler White', 'The Premium 240mm ARGB Liquid CPU Cooler is an elite thermal solution engineered to tame the intense heat of modern, high-wattage processors. Featuring a high-density aluminum radiator, a precision-machined copper cold plate, and hyper-fast digital ARGB fans capable of reaching 2100 RPM, it delivers exceptional cooling efficiency for demanding PC builds. Boasting universal compatibility with the latest Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4) sockets, ultra-durable sleeved rubber tubing, and an industry-leading 5-year warranty, this 1.93 kg cooling powerhouse ensures your system maintains peak performance and spectacular aesthetics.', 'corsair-nautilus-240-rs-argb-240mm-liquid-cpu-cooler-white-1781354342', '<p>Push your processor to its absolute limits without the fear of thermal throttling using the <strong>Premium 240mm ARGB Liquid CPU Cooler</strong>. Designed meticulously for hardcore gamers, professional overclockers, and heavy workstation users, this top-tier thermal solution redefines standard system cooling. At the heart of its performance is a premium, precision-machined Copper Cold Plate engineered for maximum, instantaneous heat transfer directly from the CPU die. This heat is rapidly cycled through stealthy, black-sleeved low-permeation rubber tubing into a dense 275mm Aluminum Radiator, ensuring optimal thermal dissipation even during marathon 4K video rendering sessions or intense gaming workloads.</p><p>To actively exhaust this heat, the cooler is equipped with high-performance ARGB fans operating at a blistering maximum speed of 2100 RPM. These digitally controlled fans generate a massive airflow of up to 72.8 CFM and a highly impressive static pressure of 4.15 mm-H2O, effortlessly forcing fresh air through the dense radiator fins. Despite this immense cooling power, the acoustic profile remains highly managed; at low loads, the system operates at a whisper-quiet 10 dBA, and only sca