on Rubber Tubing</td><td>Premium sleeved tubing drastically reduces liquid evaporation over time, ensuring a longer lifespan and a high-end, stealthy aesthetic.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Socket Compatibility</strong></td><td><p>Intel: 1851, 1700</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>AMD: AM5, AM4</p></td><td>Completely future-proof mounting hardware ensures seamless, secure installation on modern and next-generation motherboard platforms.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>275 (L) x 125 (W) x 125 (H) mm, 1.932 KG</td><td>A compact yet highly efficient 240mm-class footprint designed to fit easily into most mid-tower and full-tower chassis.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>5 Years</td><td>An industry-leading warranty that provides absolute peace of mind and secures your premium hardware investment.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 8500.00, 8500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/lp9BIju9Jce9goTF6G1gouSQ0sX2kTczZTkuNfZZ.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 12:39:02', '2026-06-13 12:39:02', 'Premium 240mm ARGB Liquid CPU Cooler | Intel 1851 & AM5 Ready', 'Maximize your CPU\'s performance with this Premium ARGB Liquid Cooler. Features a 240mm radiator, 2100 RPM fans, copper cold plate, and support for Intel 1851 & AMD AM5.', 'ARGB liquid CPU cooler, 240mm AIO cooler, Intel LGA 1851 cooler, AMD AM5 liquid cooler, high performance CPU cooler, 2100 RPM AIO fans, copper cold plate cooler, ARGB PC cooling, PC gaming thermal solution', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(544, 'Corsair iCUE ELITE CPU Cooler LCD Display Upgrade Kit White', 'The Corsair iCUE ELITE CPU Cooler LCD Display Upgrade Kit (White) is a premium customization module designed to transform any ELITE CAPELLIX AIO cooler into a dynamic visual centerpiece. Featuring a brilliant 2.1-inch IPS LCD screen with a crisp 480x480 resolution and an ultra-bright 600cd/m² backlight, it allows you to showcase real-time system stats, custom animated GIFs, or personal artwork in 16.7 million colors. Surrounded by a halo of 24 individually addressable RGB LEDs and fully integrated with Corsair iCUE software, this kit offers unmatched personalization and synchronized lighting for high-end, aesthetic-focused PC builds.', 'corsair-icue-elite-cpu-cooler-lcd-display-upgrade-kit-white-1781354386', '<p>Elevate the aesthetic of your PC rig and take complete control over your system monitoring with the <strong>Corsair iCUE ELITE CPU Cooler LCD Display Upgrade Kit</strong> in brilliant White. Specifically engineered for seamless compatibility with all Corsair ELITE CAPELLIX AIO CPU coolers, this premium upgrade module replaces your standard pump cap with a fully customizable, highly interactive digital dashboard, adding a massive layer of personalization without requiring a complete cooler replacement.</p><p>At the absolute center of this upgrade kit is a stunning 2.1-inch IPS LCD screen. Boasting a sharp 480x480 pixel resolution and a powerful 600cd/m² brightness level, the display ensures crystal-clear visibility even inside heavily illuminated, glass-panel PC cases. With support for 24-bit true color depth, the screen accurately reproduces over 16.7 million colors, delivering incredibly smooth gradients and vibrant, highly realistic visual presentations. Through the powerful Corsair iCUE software, users are granted total creative freedom. You can effortlessly upload custom animated GIFs, display crucial real-time system statistics like CPU temperatures and fan speeds, or showcase your favorite memes and esports team logos directly on the pump head.</p><p>Enhancing the digital display is an integrated ring of 24 individually addressable RGB LEDs. These ultra-bright lights create deeply immersive, customizable lighting effects around the perimeter of the LCD, adding an extra layer of visual flair to your cooling loop. Because both the LCD dashboard and the RGB lighting are fully managed through Corsair\'s centralized iCUE ecosystem, you can effortlessly synchronize your pump\'s lighting profiles with the rest of your compatible system components, creating a cohesive, breathtaking aesthetic that truly stands out.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>System Compatibility</strong></td><td>Corsair ELITE CAPELLIX AIO Coolers</td><td>Instantly upgrades your existing ELITE CAPELLIX liquid cooler without the need to drain or replace the entire cooling loop.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Specifications</strong></td><td>2.1-inch IPS LCD (480x480 Resolution)</td><td>Provides a remarkably crisp, high-resolution viewing area designed perfectly for detailed system metrics and custom animations.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Visual Fidelity</strong></td><td>600cd/m² Brightness, 16.7M Colors (24-bit)</td><td>Ultra-bright, true-color reproduction ensures that your custom graphics and smooth gradients cut right through ambient case lighting.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Media Customization</strong></td><td>Custom GIFs, Images, System Diagnostics</td><td>Allows users to fully personalize their rig by uploading custom media or actively monitoring crucial, real-time hardware temperatures.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>RGB Illumination</strong></td><td>24 Individually Addressable RGB LEDs</td><td>Creates a brilliant, customizable halo of light around the display that enhances the visual depth of the pump head.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Integration</strong></td><td>Corsair iCUE Software</td><td>Acts as the centralized control hub for synchronizing both the LCD visuals and RGB lighting effects seamlessly across your entire setup.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 9600.00, 9600.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/0YXAYTjfPecD6AGHdgH9mUJFB7xIIYikfXiURlK4.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 12:39:46', '2026-06-13 12:41:17', 'Corsair iCUE ELITE LCD Display Upgrade Kit White | 2.1\" IPS Screen', 'Transform your ELITE CAPELLIX AIO with the Corsair iCUE ELITE LCD Display Upgrade Kit in White. Features a 2.1\" IPS screen for custom GIFs, system stats, and RGB.', 'Transform your ELITE CAPELLIX AIO with the Corsair iCUE ELITE LCD Display Upgrade Kit in White. Features a 2.1\" IPS screen for custom GIFs, system stats, and RGB.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(545, 'Corsair NAUTILUS 360 RS ARGB 360mm Liquid CPU Cooler White', 'The Premium 360mm ARGB Liquid CPU Cooler is an elite, high-performance thermal solution meticulously engineered to tame the heat of next-generation processors. Featuring a massive high-density aluminum radiator, a precision-machined copper cold plate, and digital ARGB fans capable of pushing up to 72.8 CFM at 1700 RPM, it delivers extreme cooling efficiency for overclocked and high-wattage builds. Boasting universal compatibility with the latest Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4) sockets, ultra-durable sleeved tubing, and an industry-leading 5-year warranty, this 2.35 kg cooling powerhouse ensures your system runs at peak performance while maintaining spectacular aesthetics.', 'corsair-nautilus-360-rs-argb-360mm-liquid-cpu-cooler-white-1781354527', '<p>Push your processor to the absolute limit without the threat of thermal throttling using the <strong>Premium 360mm ARGB Liquid CPU Cooler</strong>. Designed for elite gamers, professional overclockers, and heavy workstation users, this top-tier thermal solution completely redefines system cooling. At the heart of its performance is a premium, precision-machined Copper Cold Plate engineered for maximum, instantaneous heat transfer from the CPU die. This heat is rapidly cycled through stealthy, black-sleeved low-permeation rubber tubing into a massive 396mm high-density Aluminum Radiator, ensuring optimal thermal dissipation even during marathon 4K rendering sessions or intense, CPU-bound gaming workloads.</p><p>To actively exhaust this heat, the cooler is equipped with high-performance ARGB fans operating at a maximum speed of 1700 RPM. These digitally controlled fans generate a massive airflow of up to 72.8 CFM and an impressive static pressure of 4.15mm-H2O, effortlessly pushing fresh air through the dense radiator fins. Despite this immense cooling power, the acoustic profile remains highly managed; at low loads, the system whispers at a barely audible 10 dBA, and only reaches 36 dBA under maximum stress, keeping your creative or gaming environment perfectly free from distracting noise.</p><p>Beyond its raw cooling metrics, this liquid cooler serves as a breathtaking visual centerpiece for your rig. The integrated ARGB lighting allows you to synchronize the fans and pump head with your existing motherboard software, creating a stunning, personalized light show within your chassis. Furthermore, it is exceptionally future-proof. Fully supporting the latest processor architectures—including Intel\'s cutting-edge LGA 1851 and 1700 sockets, alongside AMD\'s AM5 and AM4 platforms—it is ready for both current systems and next-generation upgrades. Backed by a comprehensive 5-year warranty, this cooler is a highly reliable, long-term investment for any high-end PC enthusiast.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Copper Cold Plate, Aluminum Radiator</td><td>High-quality thermal materials guarantee incredibly rapid heat absorption from the CPU and highly efficient heat dissipation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>1700 RPM, 13.3 - 72.8 CFM Airflow</td><td>Generates massive airflow to rapidly cool the liquid inside the radiator, preventing processor thermal throttling under heavy loads.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Static Pressure &amp; Noise</strong></td><td>0.2 – 4.15mm-H2O, 10 - 36 dBA</td><td>High static pressure easily forces air through dense radiator fins, while maintaining a surprisingly quiet acoustic profile during operation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics &amp; Control</strong></td><td>ARGB Lighting, Digital Fan Control (4-pin)</td><td>Provides a breathtaking, customizable aesthetic that seamlessly synchronizes with standard motherboard RGB software.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Durability &amp; Build</strong></td><td>Black Sleeved Low-Permeation Rubber Tubing</td><td>Premium sleeved tubing drastically reduces liquid evaporation over time, ensuring a longer lifespan and a high-end, stealthy aesthetic.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Socket Compatibility</strong></td><td><p>Intel: 1851, 1700</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>AMD: AM5, AM4</p></td><td>Completely future-proof mounting hardware ensures seamless, secure installation on both current and next-generation motherboard platforms.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>396 (L) x 125 (W) x 125 (H) mm, 2.35 KG</td><td>A massive footprint designed for large chassis, maximizing the surface area available for advanced thermal dissipation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>5 Years</td><td>An industry-leading warranty that provides absolute peace of mind for your premium hardware investment.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'CPU Cooler', 10000.00, 10000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/OQkV2K5rsQvQBr2E7qg0CDFHsxF8BRHKAUyXxgik.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 12:42:07', '2026-06-13 12:42:48', 'Premium 360mm ARGB Liquid CPU Cooler | Intel 1851 & AM5 Ready', 'Maximize your CPU performance with this Premium ARGB Liquid Cooler. Features a 360mm radiator, 1700 RPM fans, copper cold plate, and support for Intel 1851/1700 & AMD AM5.', 'Maximize your CPU performance with this Premium ARGB Liquid Cooler. Features a 360mm radiator, 1700 RPM fans, copper cold plate, and support for Intel 1851/1700 & AMD AM5.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(546, 'ViewSonic Projector LS700HD 3500 Lumens FHD Laser', 'A Full HD 1080p DLP Laser projector with 3,500 ANSI lumens brightness, 3,000,000:1 contrast ratio, dual HDMI ports, and 20,000-hour laser life—ideal for business and education.', 'viewsonic-projector-ls700hd-3500-lumens-fhd-laser-1781354571', '<p>This <strong>Full HD DLP Laser projector</strong> delivers high-quality visuals with a native resolution of <strong>1920 × 1080 pixels</strong>, making it suitable for professional presentations, classrooms, and business environments. With <strong>3,500 ANSI lumens brightness</strong>, it ensures clear visibility even in moderately lit rooms.</p><p>Its advanced <strong>laser light source</strong> provides up to <strong>20,000 hours of lifespan</strong>, significantly reducing maintenance costs and ensuring consistent brightness over long-term usage. A powerful <strong>3,000,000:1 contrast ratio</strong> enhances image depth, delivering sharper text and vivid visuals.</p><p>The projector supports flexible installation with a projection distance range of <strong>1.5 to 8.8 meters</strong>, making it suitable for various room sizes. Connectivity options include <strong>dual HDMI, dual VGA input, VGA output, LAN (RJ45), USB Type-A, Mini USB, RS-232 control, audio in/out, and composite video</strong>, ensuring compatibility with modern and legacy devices.</p><p>A built-in <strong>2W speaker</strong> provides basic audio output for presentations. The device is backed by a <strong>1-year warranty with 1-year lamp warranty</strong>, ensuring reliability and peace of mind.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>Technology</td><td>DLP Laser</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>Native</td><td>Full HD (1920 × 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>Output</td><td>3,500 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Distance</td><td>Range</td><td>1.5 – 8.8 m (4.9 – 28.8 ft)</td></tr><tr><td>Image Size</td><td>Max</td><td>Up to 1920 × 1080</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/ctzDW1NjEvpjJ6NBqeHKbYHffvPcI105A4nXW1V4.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 12:42:51', '2026-06-13 12:42:51', 'Full HD Laser Projector 3500 ANSI | 3,000,000:1 Contrast, Dual HDMI, 20,000H Life', 'Buy Full HD 1080p DLP laser projector with 3500 ANSI lumens, 3,000,000:1 contrast, dual HDMI, VGA, LAN, and 20,000-hour laser lifespan.', 'laser projector, Full HD projector, 3500 ANSI lumens projector, DLP projector, 1080p projector, business projector, dual HDMI projector, 20,000 hour laser projector, classroom projector, high contrast projector', NULL, 45, NULL, NULL),
(547, 'Corsair iCUE H100i ELITE CAPELLIX XT Liquid CPU Cooler', 'The High-Performance 240mm Liquid CPU Cooler is an elite thermal solution engineered to tame the intense heat of modern, high-wattage processors, including enthusiast-grade Threadripper platforms. Featuring a high-density 240mm aluminum radiator, a generous 56x56mm coldplate, and ultra-fast PWM fans capable of reaching 2100 RPM, it delivers exceptional cooling efficiency for demanding PC builds. Boasting universal compatibility with the latest Intel (LGA 1700/2066) and AMD (AM5/TRX4) sockets, ultra-durable 400mm sleeved rubber tubing, and an industry-leading 5-year warranty, this 2.097 kg cooling powerhouse ensures your system maintains peak performance under heavy loads.', 'corsair-icue-h100i-elite-capellix-xt-liquid-cpu-cooler-1781354669', '<p>Push your processor to its absolute limits without the fear of thermal throttling using the <strong>High-Performance 240mm Liquid CPU Cooler</strong>. Designed meticulously for hardcore gamers, professional overclockers, and heavy workstation users, this top-tier thermal solution redefines standard system cooling. At the heart of its performance is a large 56x56mm coldplate engineered for maximum, instantaneous heat transfer directly from the CPU die. This heat is rapidly cycled through 400mm of stealthy, black-sleeved low-permeation rubber tubing into a dense 277mm Aluminum Radiator, ensuring optimal thermal dissipation even during marathon video rendering sessions or intense gaming workloads.</p><p>To actively exhaust this heat, the cooler is equipped with dual high-performance 120mm fans operating at a blistering maximum speed of 2100 RPM via precise PWM control. These fans generate a massive airflow of up to 65.57 CFM and a highly impressive static pressure of 2.68 mm-H2O, effortlessly forcing fresh air through the dense radiator fins. Because the fans are PWM controlled, the system dynamically scales from a quiet 550 RPM during idle tasks to full power only when your CPU demands it, maintaining a managed and efficient acoustic profile.</p><p>What truly sets this 240mm liquid cooler apart is its incredibly broad hardware compatibility. It is exceptionally future-proof and enthusiast-ready, fully supporting mainstream architectures like Intel\'s LGA 1700 and AMD\'s AM5, while also featuring mounting hardware for massive HEDT (High-End Desktop) processors including AMD Threadripper TR4 and TRX4 sockets. Backed by a comprehensive 5-year warranty, this cooler is a highly reliable, long-term investment for any high-end PC enthusiast seeking uncompromising thermal management.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>56 x 56mm Coldplate, Aluminum Radiator</td><td>A large surface area coldplate combined with a dense radiator guarantees incredibly rapid heat absorption and highly efficient heat dissipation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>550 - 2100 RPM, 13.8 - 65.57 CFM Airflow</td><td>Ultra-fast 120mm PWM fans generate massive airflow to rapidly cool the liquid inside the radiator, preventing processor thermal throttling.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Static Pressure &amp; Control</strong></td><td>0.17 - 2.68 mm-H2O, PWM Fan Control</td><td>High static pressure easily forces air through dense fins, while PWM control allows the motherboard to dynamically adjust speeds based on load.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Durability &amp; Build</strong></td><td>400mm Black Sleeved Low-Permeation Rubber Tubing</td><td>Premium extra-long sleeved tubing drastically reduces liquid evaporation over time, ensuring a longer lifespan and versatile mounting options.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 115x, 1200, 1700, 2011, 2066</td><td>Completely future-proof mounting hardware ensures seamless, secure installation on both mainstream and enthusiast Intel platforms.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM4, AM5, TR4, TRX4</td><td>Comprehensive AMD support, notably including the massive TR4 and TRX4 Threadripper sockets for extreme workstation builds.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>277 (L) x 120 (W) x 27 (H) mm, 2.097 KG</td><td>A highly efficient 240mm-class footprint designed to easily fit into the top or front mounts of most modern mid-tower chassis.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>5 Years</td><td>An industry-leading warranty that provides absolute peace of mind and secures your premium hardware investment.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/Age5H5e1po6Obdm3zV8qU5cArEWozBhU3mjE0mCE.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 12:44:29', '2026-06-13 12:44:29', 'High-Performance 240mm Liquid CPU Cooler | AM5 & TRX4 Ready', 'Maximize your CPU\'s performance with this Premium 240mm Liquid Cooler. Features 2100 RPM PWM fans, a 240mm aluminum radiator, and support for Intel 1700 & AMD TRX4.', '240mm AIO cooler, liquid CPU cooler, Intel LGA 1700 cooler, AMD AM5 liquid cooler, Threadripper TRX4 cooler, high performance CPU cooler, 2100 RPM PWM fans, PC gaming thermal solution, 240mm radiator', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(548, 'Corsair iCUE LINK H100i RGB 240mm ALL-IN-ONE Liquid CPU Cooler', 'The Premium 240mm RGB All-In-One Liquid CPU Cooler is an elite thermal solution meticulously engineered to tame the heat of modern, high-wattage processors. Featuring a high-density aluminum radiator, a precision-machined 56x56mm copper cold plate, and hyper-fast digital RGB fans capable of reaching an incredible 2400 RPM, it delivers exceptional cooling efficiency for demanding PC builds. Boasting universal compatibility with the latest Intel (LGA 1700/1200) and AMD (AM5/AM4) sockets, ultra-durable sleeved rubber tubing, and a massive 6-year warranty, this 2.12 kg cooling powerhouse ensures your system maintains peak performance and spectacular aesthetics.', 'corsair-icue-link-h100i-rgb-240mm-all-in-one-liquid-cpu-cooler-1781354786', '<p>Push your processor to its absolute limits without the fear of thermal throttling using the <strong>Premium 240mm RGB All-In-One Liquid CPU Cooler</strong>. Designed meticulously for hardcore gamers, professional overclockers, and heavy workstation users, this top-tier thermal solution redefines standard system cooling. At the heart of its performance is a premium, large-surface 56x56mm Copper Cold Plate engineered for maximum, instantaneous heat transfer directly from the CPU die. This heat is rapidly cycled through stealthy, black-sleeved low-permeation rubber tubing into a dense 277mm Aluminum Radiator, ensuring optimal thermal dissipation even during marathon 4K video rendering sessions or intense gaming workloads.</p><p>To actively exhaust this heat, the cooler is equipped with dual high-performance 120mm RGB fans operating across a massive digital control range of 480 to 2400 RPM. This wide RPM range ensures that your system remains whisper-quiet during basic administrative tasks, but can instantly scale to generate a massive airflow of up to 63.1 CFM and an impressive static pressure of 3.8 mm-H2O when your processor demands maximum thermal relief.</p><p>Beyond its raw, uncompromising cooling metrics, this liquid cooler serves as a vibrant visual centerpiece for your rig. The integrated RGB lighting creates a stunning, customizable glow to match your system\'s unique aesthetic. Furthermore, it is exceptionally future-proof. Fully supporting the latest processor architectures—including Intel\'s LGA 1700 and 1200 sockets, alongside AMD\'s AM5 and AM4 platforms—it is ready for both current builds and future motherboard upgrades. Backed by a comprehensive, industry-leading 6-year warranty, this cooler is a highly reliable, long-term investment for any high-end PC enthusiast.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>56 x 56mm Copper Cold Plate, Aluminum Radiator</td><td>Premium thermal materials guarantee incredibly rapid heat absorption from the CPU and highly efficient heat dissipation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>480 - 2400 RPM, 16.44 - 63.1 CFM Airflow</td><td>A massive RPM range provides whisper-quiet idle operation while ensuring hurricane-level airflow under heavy system loads.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Static Pressure</strong></td><td>0.17 - 3.8 mm-H2O, Digital Control</td><td>High static pressure easily forces fresh air through dense radiator fins, with digital controls allowing for precise fan curves.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics &amp; Lighting</strong></td><td>Vibrant RGB Illumination</td><td>Provides a breathtaking, customizable aesthetic that enhances the visual depth and style of your internal components.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Durability &amp; Build</strong></td><td>Black Sleeved Low-Permeation Rubber Tubing</td><td>Premium sleeved tubing drastically reduces liquid evaporation over time, ensuring a longer lifespan and a high-end, stealthy aesthetic.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Socket Compatibility</strong></td><td><p>Intel: 1700, 1200, 115x</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>AMD: AM5, AM4</p></td><td>Completely future-proof mounting hardware ensures seamless, secure installation on modern and next-generation motherboard platforms.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>277 (L) x 120 (W) x 27 (H) mm, 2.12 KG</td><td>A highly efficient 240mm-class footprint designed to easily fit into the top or front mounts of most modern mid-tower chassis.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>6 Years</td><td>An industry-leading 6-year warranty that provides absolute peace of mind and secures your premium hardware investment.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'CPU Cooler', 21800.00, 21800.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/iPsvebUICiB0udtXtZZZWNgyvWzp3VsSvnaFKKoV.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 12:46:26', '2026-06-13 12:46:26', 'Premium 240mm RGB AIO Liquid CPU Cooler | AM5 & LGA 1700 Ready', 'Maximize your CPU\'s performance with this Premium 240mm RGB All-In-One Liquid Cooler. Features 2400 RPM fans, a copper cold plate, and an incredible 6-year warranty.', '240mm AIO cooler, RGB liquid CPU cooler, Intel LGA 1700 cooler, AMD AM5 liquid cooler, high performance CPU cooler, 2400 RPM AIO fans, copper cold plate cooler, PC gaming thermal solution, 240mm radiator', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(549, 'Corsair iCUE LINK TITAN 240 RX LCD 240mm RGB Liquid CPU Cooler White', 'The Premium 240mm LCD RGB Liquid CPU Cooler is an elite, high-performance thermal solution that combines uncompromised processor cooling with ultimate system personalization. Featuring a customizable digital LCD display on the pump block, a high-density 240mm aluminum radiator, and dual high-speed 2100 RPM RGB fans, it is engineered to tame the heat of high-wattage CPUs while serving as the visual centerpiece of your rig. Boasting universal compatibility with the latest Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4) platforms, ultra-durable sleeved tubing, and a comprehensive 5-year warranty, this 2.07 kg powerhouse ensures your system runs flawlessly under extreme workloads.', 'corsair-icue-link-titan-240-rx-lcd-240mm-rgb-liquid-cpu-cooler-white-1781354887', '<p>Push your modern, high-tier processor to its absolute limits without the threat of thermal throttling using the <strong>Premium 240mm LCD RGB Liquid CPU Cooler</strong>. Designed meticulously for hardcore gamers, professional overclockers, and PC enthusiasts who demand both extreme performance and breathtaking aesthetics, this top-tier thermal solution completely redefines system cooling. At the absolute center of this cooler is its marquee feature: a brilliant, built-in LCD screen mounted directly on the pump block. This digital display allows you to actively monitor real-time system temperatures, display custom graphics, or showcase animated GIFs, transforming your CPU cooler into a highly interactive dashboard.</p><p>Beneath the LCD screen lies a premium, precision-machined Copper Cold Plate engineered for instantaneous heat transfer from the CPU die. This heat is rapidly cycled through 400mm of stealthy, black-sleeved low-permeation rubber tubing into a dense 277mm Aluminum Radiator, ensuring optimal thermal dissipation even during marathon 4K video rendering sessions or intense, CPU-bound gaming workloads.</p><p>To actively exhaust this heat, the cooler is equipped with dual high-performance 120mm RGB fans operating at a blistering maximum speed of 2100 RPM. These digitally controlled fans generate a massive airflow of up to 73.5 CFM and an incredibly high static pressure of 4.33 mm-H2O, effortlessly forcing fresh air through the dense radiator fins to cool the liquid inside. Furthermore, it is exceptionally future-proof. Fully supporting the latest processor architectures—including Intel\'s cutting-edge LGA 1851 and 1700 sockets, alongside AMD\'s AM5 and AM4 platforms—it is ready for both current builds and next-generation motherboard upgrades. Backed by a comprehensive 5-year warranty, this cooler is a highly reliable, visually stunning investment for any high-end PC setup.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Copper Cold Plate, Aluminum Radiator</td><td>Premium thermal materials guarantee incredibly rapid heat absorption from the CPU and highly efficient heat dissipation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interactive Display</strong></td><td>Built-in LCD Screen</td><td>A dynamic digital dashboard on the pump head allows for real-time system monitoring and custom visual personalization.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>Dual 120mm Fans, 2100 RPM, 10.4 - 73.5 CFM</td><td>Ultra-fast fan speeds generate massive airflow to rapidly cool the liquid inside the radiator, preventing thermal throttling.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Static Pressure</strong></td><td>0.12 - 4.33 mm-H2O</td><td>Exceptionally high static pressure easily forces air through dense radiator fins for maximum cooling efficiency.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Durability &amp; Build</strong></td><td>400mm Black Sleeved Low-Permeation Rubber Tubing</td><td>Extra-long, premium sleeved tubing drastically reduces liquid evaporation over time, ensuring a longer lifespan and versatile mounting.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Socket Compatibility</strong></td><td><p>Intel: 1851, 1700</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>AMD: AM5, AM4</p></td><td>Completely future-proof mounting hardware ensures seamless, secure installation on modern and next-generation motherboard platforms.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>277 (L) x 120 (W) x 27 (H) mm, 2.074 KG</td><td>A highly efficient 240mm-class footprint designed to easily fit into the top or front mounts of most modern mid-tower chassis.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>5 Years</td><td>An industry-leading 5-year warranty that provides absolute peace of mind and secures your premium hardware investment.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 22500.00, 22500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/qIN0uaxtLhaLmLPDet3qlXtXqfOns3s5NJhecXna.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 12:48:07', '2026-06-13 12:48:07', 'Premium 240mm LCD RGB Liquid CPU Cooler | AM5 & LGA 1851 Ready', 'Maximize your CPU\'s performance with this Premium 240mm LCD RGB Liquid Cooler. Features a custom LCD pump display, 2100 RPM fans, and support for Intel 1851 & AMD AM5.', 'LCD liquid CPU cooler, 240mm AIO cooler, CPU cooler with screen, Intel LGA 1851 cooler, AMD AM5 liquid cooler, high performance CPU cooler, 2100 RPM AIO fans, copper cold plate cooler, RGB PC cooling', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL);
