relief.</p><p>Beyond its raw, uncompromising cooling metrics, this liquid cooler serves as a vibrant visual centerpiece for your rig. The integrated RGB lighting creates a stunning, customizable glow to match your system\'s unique aesthetic. Furthermore, it is exceptionally future-proof. Fully supporting the latest processor architectures—including Intel\'s LGA 1700 and 1200 sockets, alongside AMD\'s AM5 and AM4 platforms—it is ready for both current builds and future motherboard upgrades. Backed by a comprehensive, industry-leading 6-year warranty, this cooler is a highly reliable, long-term investment for any high-end PC enthusiast.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>56 x 56mm Copper Cold Plate, Aluminum Radiator</td><td>Premium thermal materials guarantee incredibly rapid heat absorption from the CPU and highly efficient heat dissipation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>480 - 2400 RPM, 16.44 - 63.1 CFM Airflow</td><td>A massive RPM range provides whisper-quiet idle operation while ensuring hurricane-level airflow under heavy system loads.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Static Pressure</strong></td><td>0.17 - 3.8 mm-H2O, Digital Control</td><td>High static pressure easily forces fresh air through dense radiator fins, with digital controls allowing for precise fan curves.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics &amp; Lighting</strong></td><td>Vibrant RGB Illumination</td><td>Provides a breathtaking, customizable aesthetic that enhances the visual depth and style of your internal components.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Durability &amp; Build</strong></td><td>Black Sleeved Low-Permeation Rubber Tubing</td><td>Premium sleeved tubing drastically reduces liquid evaporation over time, ensuring a longer lifespan and a high-end, stealthy aesthetic.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Socket Compatibility</strong></td><td><p>Intel: 1700, 1200, 115x</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>AMD: AM5, AM4</p></td><td>Completely future-proof mounting hardware ensures seamless, secure installation on modern and next-generation motherboard platforms.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>277 (L) x 120 (W) x 27 (H) mm, 2.12 KG</td><td>A highly efficient 240mm-class footprint designed to easily fit into the top or front mounts of most modern mid-tower chassis.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>6 Years</td><td>An industry-leading 6-year warranty that provides absolute peace of mind and secures your premium hardware investment.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 23800.00, 23800.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/vZstUxnqRo4ZYYlKfRgm0BesQrDMQVtK7O9GM9B3.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 12:49:10', '2026-06-13 12:52:13', 'Premium 240mm RGB AIO Liquid CPU Cooler | AM5 & LGA 1700 Ready', 'Maximize your CPU\'s performance with this Premium 240mm RGB All-In-One Liquid Cooler. Features 2400 RPM fans, a copper cold plate, and an incredible 6-year warranty.', '240mm AIO cooler, RGB liquid CPU cooler, Intel LGA 1700 cooler, AMD AM5 liquid cooler, high performance CPU cooler, 2400 RPM AIO fans, copper cold plate cooler, PC gaming thermal solution, 240mm radiator', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(551, 'ViewSonic Projector M2e 1000 Lumens Smart Built-in Wi-Fi 1080p Portable Android Mini', 'A portable Full HD 1080p LED smart projector with 1000 lumens brightness, Harman Kardon dual speakers, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth 4.2, and 30,000-hour LED life for home entertainment.', 'viewsonic-projector-m2e-1000-lumens-smart-built-in-wi-fi-1080p-portable-android-mini-1781355111', '<p>This compact <strong>Full HD 1080p LED smart projector</strong> delivers sharp and vibrant visuals with a native resolution of <strong>1920 × 1080 pixels</strong> and a brightness of <strong>1000 lumens</strong>, making it ideal for home entertainment, portable cinema, and small-room usage.</p><p>Powered by advanced LED technology, it offers an impressive lifespan of up to <strong>30,000 hours</strong>, ensuring long-term durability with minimal maintenance. A high <strong>3,000,000:1 contrast ratio</strong> enhances image depth and clarity for a cinematic viewing experience.</p><p>The projector supports screen sizes from <strong>30 to 100 inches</strong>, with a flexible projection distance of <strong>0.65 to 2.68 meters</strong>, making it highly adaptable for indoor environments.</p><p>Audio performance is enhanced with <strong>dual 3W Harman Kardon stereo speakers</strong>, delivering rich and immersive sound without external speakers. It supports multiple video formats including MP4, MKV, MOV, H.264, and more for versatile playback.</p><p>Connectivity options include <strong>HDMI, USB Type-A, USB Type-C, microSDXC, Bluetooth 4.2, and built-in Wi-Fi</strong>, allowing seamless streaming from smartphones, laptops, and storage devices. With <strong>16GB internal storage</strong>, it can store apps and media directly.</p><p>Lightweight at just <strong>1.0 kg</strong>, this projector is highly portable and easy to carry. It is backed by a <strong>1-year warranty for both projector and lamp</strong>, ensuring reliable performance.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>Technology</td><td>0.23\" DLP</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>Native</td><td>Full HD (1920 × 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>Output</td><td>1000 Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Distance</td><td>Range</td><td>0.65 – 2.68 m (2.13 – 8.79 ft)</td></tr><tr><td>Image Size</td><td>Screen Range</td><td>30 – 100 inches</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>Dynamic</td><td>3,000,000:1</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 77000.00, 77000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/GsR9asogJQEcfocMKwwHAnf6JOuWm6wrnAZeVZdH.jpg', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 12:51:51', '2026-06-13 12:51:51', 'Portable Full HD LED Projector | 1000 Lumens, WiFi, Bluetooth, Harman Kardon Audio', 'Buy portable Full HD 1080p LED projector with 1000 lumens brightness, WiFi, Bluetooth 4.2, 16GB storage, and dual Harman Kardon speakers.', 'portable projector, Full HD projector, LED projector, 1000 lumens projector, smart projector, WiFi projector, Bluetooth projector, Harman Kardon projector, mini home projector, 1080p projector', NULL, 45, NULL, NULL),
(552, 'Corsair H100 RGB 240mm Liquid CPU Cooler', 'The High-Performance RGB Liquid CPU Cooler is a striking and efficient thermal solution engineered to manage the heat output of modern desktop processors. Featuring a precision-machined copper cold plate, a durable aluminum radiator, and quiet 1500 RPM fans, it delivers reliable cooling for daily computing and intensive gaming sessions. Highlighted by a brilliant array of 29 RGB LEDs for ultimate system personalization and boasting universal compatibility with both the latest Intel (LGA 1700/1200) and AMD (AM5/AM4) platforms, this liquid cooler provides an exceptional balance of aesthetics, performance, and peace of mind backed by a 3-year warranty.', 'corsair-h100-rgb-240mm-liquid-cpu-cooler-1781355233', '<p>Ensure your processor maintains optimal temperatures and maximum clock speeds with the <strong>High-Performance RGB Liquid CPU Cooler</strong>. Designed for PC builders who demand both reliability and visual flair, this All-In-One (AIO) thermal solution is built from the ground up for efficient heat dissipation. At the core of the cooler is a high-quality Copper Cold Plate that ensures rapid and immediate heat transfer directly from your CPU die. This thermal energy is then swiftly moved into a high-density Aluminum Radiator, where it is actively dissipated to keep your system from thermal throttling during heavy workloads, gaming, or content creation.</p><p>To exhaust the heat effectively while maintaining a pleasant acoustic environment, the cooler utilizes highly optimized fans operating at a steady 1500 RPM. This tuned fan speed strikes the perfect balance between pushing adequate airflow through the radiator fins and minimizing distracting system noise. However, performance is only half the story. This cooler serves as a vibrant visual centerpiece for your PC build, featuring an impressive array of 29 individually addressable RGB LEDs. This robust lighting system allows you to create dazzling, customized light shows that illuminate your chassis and synchronize with your overall build aesthetic.</p><p>Hardware compatibility is exceptionally broad, making this cooler a versatile choice for almost any modern system. It offers comprehensive mounting hardware for a vast array of sockets, including the latest AMD AM5 and AM4 processors, as well as an extensive list of Intel platforms ranging from legacy LGA 1366 to the modern LGA 1700 and enthusiast 2066 sockets. Backed by a solid 3-year warranty, this RGB liquid cooler is a dependable, stylish, and high-performing upgrade for your desktop computer.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Copper Cold Plate, Aluminum Radiator</td><td>Premium thermal materials guarantee rapid heat absorption from the CPU and highly efficient heat dissipation through the radiator.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>1500 RPM</td><td>Optimized fan speeds deliver reliable, steady airflow to cool the radiator fluid while keeping acoustic noise levels manageable.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics &amp; Lighting</strong></td><td>29 RGB LEDs</td><td>A massive array of integrated LEDs provides brilliant, highly customizable lighting to elevate the visual appeal of your PC build.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 1700, 1200, 115x, 1366, 2011, 2066</td><td>Exceptionally broad Intel support ensures seamless installation on both modern mainstream boards and legacy/enthusiast platforms.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM5, AM4</td><td>Fully supports the latest generation of AMD Ryzen processors alongside the widely popular AM4 platform.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>3 Years</td><td>A dependable 3-year warranty that provides peace of mind and protects your hardware investment against manufacturing defects.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/7u2NKFvL15ndqkvy0thNeHh59zTY3SlMQlev4jqK.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 12:53:53', '2026-06-13 12:53:53', 'High-Performance RGB Liquid CPU Cooler | AM5 & LGA 1700 Ready', ': Keep your CPU cool in style with this High-Performance RGB Liquid Cooler. Features 1500 RPM fans, 29 RGB LEDs, a copper cold plate, and universal socket compatibility.', ': Keep your CPU cool in style with this High-Performance RGB Liquid Cooler. Features 1500 RPM fans, 29 RGB LEDs, a copper cold plate, and universal socket compatibility.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(553, 'Corsair iCUE H100x RGB ELITE 240mm Liquid CPU Cooler', 'The High-Performance RGB Liquid CPU Cooler is an efficient and whisper-quiet thermal solution engineered to tame the heat of modern desktop processors. Featuring a precision-machined copper cold plate, a robust aluminum radiator, and dynamic 1500 RPM PWM fans, it delivers reliable, scaling cooling for both daily computing and intense workloads. Highlighted by customizable RGB LED lighting for system personalization and boasting universal compatibility with the latest Intel (LGA 1700/1200) and AMD (AM5/AM4) platforms, this 1.79 kg cooler provides an exceptional balance of aesthetics and performance backed by a comprehensive 5-year warranty.', 'corsair-icue-h100x-rgb-elite-240mm-liquid-cpu-cooler-1781355383', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Ensure your processor maintains optimal temperatures and maximum clock speeds with the <strong>High-Performance RGB Liquid CPU Cooler</strong>. Designed for PC builders who demand reliability, visual flair, and near-silent operation, this All-In-One (AIO) thermal solution is built from the ground up for highly efficient heat dissipation. At the core of the cooler is a high-quality Copper Cold Plate that ensures rapid, instantaneous heat transfer directly from your CPU die. This thermal energy is then swiftly moved into a high-density Aluminum Radiator, where it is actively dissipated to keep your system from thermal throttling during heavy workloads, gaming, or content creation.</p><p>To exhaust this heat effectively while maintaining an incredibly peaceful acoustic environment, the cooler utilizes highly optimized 120mm fans operating on a precise PWM control curve. Reaching a maximum speed of 1500 RPM, these fans deliver a steady airflow of up to 47.73 CFM. Thanks to the PWM control, the system dynamically scales fan speeds based on your CPU\'s current temperature. This allows the cooler to operate at a virtually inaudible 7 dBA during idle or light tasks, scaling up to a highly manageable 28 dBA only when your system is pushed to its absolute limits.</p><p>Performance and acoustics are only half the story. This cooler serves as a vibrant visual centerpiece for your PC build, featuring integrated RGB lighting that allows you to create dazzling, customized light shows to synchronize with your overall chassis aesthetic. Hardware compatibility is exceptionally broad, making this cooler a versatile choice for almost any modern system. It offers comprehensive mounting hardware for the latest AMD AM5 and AM4 processors, as well as an extensive list of Intel platforms including the modern LGA 1700 and 1200 sockets. Backed by a solid 5-year warranty, this RGB liquid cooler is a dependable, stylish, and high-performing upgrade for your desktop computer.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Copper Cold Plate, Aluminum Radiator</td><td>Premium thermal materials guarantee rapid heat absorption from the CPU and highly efficient heat dissipation through the radiator fins.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>1500 RPM (± 10%), 16.91 - 47.73 CFM Airflow</td><td>Optimized 120mm fans deliver reliable, steady airflow to cool the radiator fluid effectively during intensive processor workloads.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustics &amp; Control</strong></td><td>7 - 28 dBA, PWM Fan Control</td><td>PWM technology allows the motherboard to dynamically adjust speeds, ensuring whisper-quiet operation at low loads.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Static Pressure</strong></td><td>0.28 – 1.46mm-H2O</td><td>Generates sufficient pressure to easily force fresh air through the dense aluminum radiator fins for maximum cooling efficiency.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics &amp; Lighting</strong></td><td>Integrated RGB LEDs</td><td>Brilliant, highly customizable lighting elevates the visual appeal of your PC build and matches your unique aesthetic.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 1700, 1200, 1156, 1155, 1151, 1150</td><td>Broad Intel support ensures seamless, secure installation on both modern mainstream boards and legacy platforms.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM5, AM4</td><td>Fully supports the latest generation of advanced AMD Ryzen processors alongside the widely popular AM4 platform.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Radiator: 280 x 120 x 110mm, 1.79 KG</td><td>A robust footprint designed to fit into standard mid-tower chassis mounts while maximizing thermal dissipation area.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>5 Years</td><td>A dependable 5-year warranty that provides absolute peace of mind and protects your hardware investment.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/0hRf2XcjfZogGkLaMBKbSuzkiLQKg2SHFzCeiP20.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 1, '2026-06-13 12:56:23', '2026-06-13 12:56:23', 'High-Performance RGB Liquid CPU Cooler | AM5 & LGA 1700 Ready', 'Keep your CPU cool and quiet with this High-Performance RGB Liquid Cooler. Features 1500 RPM PWM fans, RGB LEDs, a copper cold plate, and a 5-year warranty.', 'RGB liquid CPU cooler, AM5 liquid cooler, Intel LGA 1700 cooler, 1500 RPM PWM fan cooler, copper cold plate AIO, quiet PC cooler, RGB PC cooling, desktop liquid', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(554, 'ViewSonic Projector LX60HD 630 Lumen Smart LED', 'The ViewSonic LX60HD Smart LED Projector features Full HD 1080p resolution, 630 ANSI lumens brightness, built-in Google TV, and a 20,000-hour LED lifespan. With flexible connectivity and 50\"–140\" projection size, it is ideal for home and office use.', 'viewsonic-projector-lx60hd-630-lumen-smart-led-1781355652', '<p>The ViewSonic LX60HD 630 Lumen Smart LED Projector is engineered to deliver high-quality Full HD visuals with smart functionality, making it an excellent choice for both entertainment and professional use. With its built-in Google TV support, users can access streaming apps, online content, and smart features directly without external devices.</p><p>Its native Full HD 1080p resolution ensures sharp and detailed image output, while 630 ANSI lumens brightness and a 4200:1 contrast ratio enhance color accuracy, depth, and clarity. The LED light source ensures long-lasting performance of up to 20,000 hours, reducing maintenance costs and improving reliability.</p><p>The projector supports screen sizes from 50\" to 140\", offering flexible installation options for different environments. With a throw distance of 1.42m to 3.8m and a 1.2 throw ratio, it adapts easily to small or medium-sized rooms. Digital zoom and ±40° keystone correction (horizontal and vertical) allow precise image adjustment even in complex setups.</p><p>Connectivity is a major strength of the LX60HD, featuring HDMI, AV input, USB Type-A ports, Wi-Fi support, and additional audio output options. This ensures compatibility with laptops, gaming consoles, smartphones, and USB storage devices. The inclusion of 8GB local storage (4GB usable) enables direct app usage and media storage.</p><p>Audio performance is enhanced with dual 5W built-in speakers, delivering clear and balanced sound for movies, presentations, and casual entertainment. Its compact design, energy-efficient 144W power consumption, and wide format compatibility make it suitable for both home and office environments.</p>', '<p>This projector delivers sharp Full HD visuals with a native resolution of <strong>1920 × 1080</strong>, ensuring clear and detailed image quality for presentations, movies, and educational use. It supports resolutions from VGA (640 × 480) up to Full HD (1920 × 1080), making it compatible with a wide range of devices.</p><p>Brightness is rated at <strong>630 ANSI lumens</strong>, providing decent performance for indoor environments with controlled lighting. The projection system uses <strong>1LCD 1080P technology</strong>, producing vibrant visuals with <strong>16.7 million colors</strong> for accurate and rich image reproduction.</p><p>The projector supports an image size range of <strong>50\" to 140\"</strong>, with an optimal throw distance of <strong>1.42m to 3.8m</strong> (100\" screen at 2.28m). It features a contrast ratio of <strong>4200:1</strong>, ensuring better depth, shadow detail, and overall image clarity.</p><p>Additional display features include:</p><ul><li>Aspect Ratio: 1.2</li><li>Projection Offset: 0% ±5%</li><li>Digital Zoom: 0.8x – 1.0x</li><li>Keystone Correction: Horizontal ±40°, Vertical ±40°</li><li>Input Lag: 163ms</li><li>HDTV Compatibility: 480i, 480p, 576i, 576p, 720p, 1080i, 1080p</li><li>Horizontal Frequency: 15K–135KHz</li><li>Vertical Scan Rate: 23–85Hz</li></ul><h2>Lens &amp; Optical System</h2><p>The projector is equipped with a high-quality lens system:</p><ul><li>Lens: F=2.9, f=125mm<br>This ensures stable focus and consistent image sharpness across different projection sizes.</li></ul><h2>Lamp &amp; Light Source</h2><ul><li>Lamp Type: LED</li><li>Lamp Life: Up to 20,000 hours</li></ul><p>The long-lasting LED light source reduces maintenance costs and ensures extended usage for home, office, or educational environments.</p><h2>Audio System</h2><ul><li>Built-in Speakers: 5W Cube × 2</li></ul><p>Dual built-in speakers deliver clear audio output, making it suitable for small rooms without requiring external speakers.</p><h2>Connectivity Options</h2><p>This projector supports multiple input and output options for flexible connectivity:</p><ul><li>AV In (3.5mm): 1</li><li>HDMI: 1 (HDMI 1.4 / HDCP 1.4)</li><li>USB Type-A: 2 (USB 2.0 Reader)</li><li>WiFi Input: 1 (5GHz)</li><li>Audio Out (3.5mm): 1</li><li>Bluetooth Audio Output: 1 (BT 5.0)</li><li>USB Type-A (Power): 2 (5V/1A shared)</li><li>USB Type-A (Service): 2</li></ul><p>These options allow easy connection with laptops, smartphones, media players, and storage devices.</p><h2>Power Specifications</h2><ul><li>Power Supply: 100–240V ±10%, 50/60Hz</li><li>Power Consumption: 144W (Normal)</li><li>Standby Power: &lt;0.5W</li></ul><p>The projector is energy efficient, consuming minimal power in standby mode.</p><h2>Physical Specifications</h2><ul><li>Color: White</li><li>Net Weight: 3.13 kg</li><li>Gross Weight: 4.3 kg</li><li>Dimensions: 315 × 232 × 323 mm</li></ul><h2>Summary</h2><p>This Full HD LED projector offers a balanced combination of clarity, connectivity, and durability. With 1080P resolution, 630 ANSI lumens brightness, 20,000-hour LED life, and flexible wireless/wired connectivity, it is well-suited for home entertainment, office presentations, and classroom use.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', 'PROJECTOR', 75000.00, 75000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/CzuBcOueJEzM2UDyjuZAmLY8O7SjNFhQUBcmnB5S.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 13:00:52', '2026-06-13 13:00:52', 'ViewSonic LX60HD Smart LED Projector Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy ViewSonic LX60HD 630 Lumen Smart LED Projector with Full HD 1080p, Google TV, 20,000-hour LED life, and 50\"–140\" screen support from International Office Solution in Bangladesh.', 'ViewSonic LX60HD, Smart LED Projector, 630 ANSI Lumens Projector, Full HD Projector Bangladesh, ViewSonic Projector Price BD, Google TV Projector, International Office Solution, Home Theater Projector BD, 1080p LED Projector, Portable Projector Bangladesh', NULL, 45, NULL, NULL),
(555, 'Corsair iCUE ELITE CPU Cooler LCD Display Ice Upgrade Kit', 'The Corsair iCUE ELITE CPU Cooler LCD Display Ice Upgrade Kit is an ultra-premium visual modification designed exclusively for CORSAIR iCUE ELITE CAPELLIX liquid coolers. Featuring a brilliant 2.1-inch LCD screen with a crisp 480x480 resolution, it allows users to showcase custom animated GIFs, personal photos, and real-time system data. Surrounded by a vibrant ring of 24 RGB LEDs and utilizing an effortless magnetic mounting system, this upgrade kit transforms your cooler into a dynamic, personalized digital dashboard, all backed by a highly reliable 5-year warranty.', 'corsair-icue-elite-cpu-cooler-lcd-display-ice-upgrade-kit-1781355962', '<p>Elevate the aesthetic of your premium PC rig and take complete control over your system monitoring with the <strong>Corsair iCUE ELITE CPU Cooler LCD Display Ice Upgrade Kit</strong>. Specifically engineered for seamless compatibility with all Corsair iCUE ELITE CAPELLIX Liquid CPU Coolers, this module replaces your standard pump cap with a fully customizable, highly interactive digital dashboard. Installation is remarkably straightforward, utilizing four mounting magnets for a quick, tool-free snap-on process that adds an unprecedented layer of personalization without requiring you to dismantle your entire cooling loop.</p><p>At the absolute center of this upgrade kit is a stunning, ultra-bright 2.1-inch LCD screen. Boasting a sharp 480x480 pixel resolution and 24-bit true-color depth, the display ensures crystal-clear visibility and vibrant graphics even inside heavily illuminated, glass-panel PC cases. Through Corsair\'s powerful customization software, users are granted total creative freedom. You can effortlessly upload your own custom animated GIFs, display crucial real-time system statistics, or select from a wide variety of beautifully pre-installed screens to match your exact build aesthetic.</p><p>Enhancing the central digital display is an integrated ring of 24 individually addressable RGB LEDs. These brilliant lights create deeply immersive, customizable lighting effects around the perimeter of the LCD, adding a massive layer of visual flair to your motherboard. Backed by a comprehensive 5-year warranty, this Ice Upgrade Kit is the ultimate finishing touch for PC enthusiasts who demand uncompromising visual personalization and a truly dynamic desktop dashboard.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>System Compatibility</strong></td><td>CORSAIR iCUE ELITE CAPELLIX Coolers</td><td>Instantly upgrades your existing ELITE CAPELLIX liquid cooler, turning a standard pump head into a vibrant digital hub.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Specifications</strong></td><td>2.1-inch LCD Screen (480x480 Resolution)</td><td>Provides a remarkably crisp, high-resolution viewing area designed perfectly for detailed system metrics and animations.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Visual Fidelity</strong></td><td>24-bit True-Color Depth</td><td>True-color reproduction ensures that your custom graphics and photos are displayed with highly realistic, sparkling clarity.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Media Customization</strong></td><td>Custom GIFs, Photos, System Data</td><td>Allows users to fully personalize their rig by uploading custom media or actively monitoring real-time hardware performance.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>RGB Illumination</strong></td><td>24 Individually Addressable RGB LEDs</td><td>Creates a brilliant, customizable halo of light around the display that enhances the visual depth of the cooler.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Installation Method</strong></td><td>Four Mounting Magnets</td><td>Ensures an incredibly fast, secure, and hassle-free installation process directly onto the existing pump block.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>5 Years</td><td>An industry-leading warranty that provides absolute peace of mind and secures your premium hardware investment.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'CPU Cooler', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/yP5YeFx1NUXxycD0FlBNTCD6JRxevLhcfutsLxo3.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 13:06:02', '2026-06-13 13:06:02', 'Corsair iCUE ELITE LCD Display Ice Upgrade Kit | 2.1\" Custom Screen', 'Transform your ELITE CAPELLIX cooler with the Corsair iCUE ELITE LCD Display Ice Upgrade Kit. Features a 2.1\" screen for custom GIFs, system data, and 24 RGB LEDs.', 'Corsair iCUE ELITE LCD Ice upgrade kit, custom GIF CPU cooler display, ELITE CAPELLIX LCD screen, 2.1 inch CPU display, Corsair PC customization, RGB liquid cooler upgrade, PC hardware aesthetics, magnetic CPU cooler display', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(556, 'ViewSonic Projector PS502X 4000 ANSI Lumens XGA Short Throw', 'The ViewSonic PS502X Short Throw Projector delivers 4000 ANSI lumens brightness, XGA resolution, and a 0.55 short throw lens for large, clear images in small spaces. With up to 300-inch projection, dual HDMI ports, and long lamp life up to 12,000 hours, it is ideal for classrooms, offices, and meeting rooms.', 'viewsonic-projector-ps502x-4000-ansi-lumens-xga-short-throw-1781356074', '<p>The <strong>ViewSonic PS502X Short Throw XGA Projector</strong> is a powerful and versatile projection solution designed for education, business presentations, and professional environments. Featuring a <strong>0.55-inch XGA DLP projection system with 1024×768 native resolution</strong>, it delivers sharp, bright, and highly readable visuals even in well-lit rooms.</p><p>With <strong>4000 ANSI lumens brightness</strong>, the projector ensures vivid and clear images suitable for large audiences. The <strong>15,000:1 contrast ratio (SuperEco Mode)</strong> enhances image depth, while support for <strong>1.07 billion colors</strong> provides accurate and natural color reproduction for presentations, videos, and graphics.</p><h2>🎯 Short Throw Projection Advantage</h2><p>Equipped with a <strong>0.55 short throw ratio</strong>, the PS502X can project large images from a short distance, making it ideal for compact classrooms and meeting rooms. It supports screen sizes up to <strong>300 inches</strong>, with a projection distance ranging from <strong>0.75m to 3.76m</strong>, reducing shadows and improving visibility during presentations.</p><h2>🔋 Long Lamp Life &amp; Efficient Performance</h2><p>The projector uses a <strong>240W UHP lamp</strong> designed for durability and efficiency:</p><ul><li>Normal Mode: up to <strong>4,000 hours</strong></li><li>SuperEco Mode: up to <strong>12,000 hours</strong></li></ul><p>This ensures reduced maintenance costs and long-term operational reliability.</p><h2>🔊 Audio &amp; Silent Operation</h2><p>For an all-in-one experience, the projector includes a <strong>powerful 16W built-in speaker</strong>, delivering clear audio without external systems. It operates quietly with noise levels of:</p><ul><li>34 dB (Normal Mode)</li><li>25 dB (Eco Mode)</li></ul><p>This makes it suitable for distraction-free learning and meetings.</p><h2>🔌 Connectivity &amp; Integration</h2><p>The ViewSonic PS502X offers flexible connectivity options, including:</p><ul><li>Dual HDMI inputs</li><li>VGA input/output</li><li>USB Type-A (Power support)</li><li>Audio in/out ports</li><li>RS232 control for system integration</li></ul><p>These features ensure compatibility with laptops, PCs, media players, and control systems.</p><h2>🛠️ Flexible Installation Features</h2><p>Designed for easy setup, it includes:</p><ul><li>Digital zoom support</li><li>Keystone correction for image alignment</li><li>Short throw lens for space-saving installation</li><li>Projection flexibility for various room sizes</li></ul><h2>⚡ Key Features</h2><ul><li>XGA (1024×768) resolution</li><li>4000 ANSI lumens brightness</li><li>Short throw ratio 0.55</li><li>Up to 300-inch screen support</li><li>1.07 billion colors</li><li>Lamp life up to 12,000 hours (Eco mode)</li><li>Dual HDMI connectivity</li><li>16W built-in speaker</li><li>Low noise operation (25–34 dB)</li></ul>', '<p>This projector is built with <strong>DLP display technology</strong>, delivering sharp image quality and reliable performance for office presentations, classrooms, and large venue usage.</p><p>It features a <strong>native XGA resolution of 1024 × 768</strong>, while also supporting input resolutions from VGA (640 × 480) up to Full HD (1920 × 1080). This ensures compatibility with a wide range of devices including laptops, media players, and presentation systems.</p><p>With <strong>4000 ANSI lumens brightness</strong>, the projector performs well even in moderately lit environments. A <strong>15,000:1 contrast ratio</strong> enhances image depth, improving dark and bright scene separation for clearer visuals.</p><p>Key projection details include:</p><ul><li>Projection Distance: 0.75m – 3.76m</li><li>Image Size: 60\" – 300\"</li><li>Optimal Throw Example: 77\" at 0.96m</li></ul><h2>Display &amp; Optical System</h2><ul><li>Display Type: <strong>DLP</strong></li><li>Resolution: <strong>1024 × 768 (Native)</strong></li><li>Wide compatibility with up to Full HD input support</li></ul><p>DLP technology ensures better color stability, higher contrast, and reduced image distortion compared to standard LCD systems.</p><h2>Lamp &amp; Light Source</h2><ul><li>Lamp Type: <strong>240W UHP Lamp</strong></li><li>Lamp Life (Normal Mode): <strong>Up to 4000 hours</strong></li><li>Lamp Life (SuperEco Mode): <strong>Up to 12000 hours</strong></li></ul><p>The SuperEco mode significantly extends lamp life, reducing maintenance cost over time.</p><h2>Audio System</h2><ul><li>Built-in Speaker: <strong>16W</strong></li></ul><p>The powerful 16W speaker provides clear and loud audio output, making it suitable for medium-sized rooms without external speakers.</p><h2>Connectivity Options</h2><p>This projector offers multiple input/output ports for flexible integration:</p><ul><li>Computer In (Component shared): 1</li><li>HDMI: 2 (HDMI 1.4 / HDCP 1.4)</li><li>Audio In (3.5mm): 1</li><li>Audio Out (3.5mm): 1</li><li>Monitor Out: 1</li><li>USB Type-A (Power): 1 (5V/1.5A)</li><li>USB Type-A (Service): 1</li><li>RS232 (DB9 control port): 1</li></ul><p>These options make it suitable for professional installations, schools, offices, and conference rooms.</p><h2>Power Specifications</h2><ul><li>Power Supply: 100–240V ±10%, 50/60Hz</li><li>Power Consumption: 295W (Normal)</li><li>Standby Power: &lt;0.5W</li></ul><p>Despite high brightness output, the projector maintains efficient standby power usage.</p><h2>Physical Specifications</h2><ul><li>Color: White</li><li>Weight: 2.87 kg</li><li>Dimensions: 309 × 234 × 115 mm</li></ul><p>Compact and lightweight design makes it easy to install and mount.</p><h2>Warranty</h2><ul><li>Manufacturer Warranty: 1 Year</li><li>Parts Warranty: 2 Years (Service)</li><li>Lamp Warranty: 12 Months or 1000 Hours</li></ul><h2>Summary</h2><p>This 4000 ANSI lumens DLP projector is a powerful solution for professional environments such as classrooms, meeting rooms, and auditoriums. With high brightness, flexible installation range (60\"–300\"), strong 16W audio, and multiple connectivity options including HDMI and RS232 control, it delivers reliable performance for large-scale presentations and multimedia use.</p>', 'PROJECTOR', 68000.00, 68000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/yWva1jlbjZUK5BR9D9MlMMAiyDZeqQq0zd9VlF8a.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 13:07:54', '2026-06-13 13:07:54', 'ViewSonic PS502X 4000 ANSI Lumens Short Throw XGA Projector | 300\" Display', 'Buy ViewSonic PS502X Short Throw Projector with 4000 ANSI lumens, XGA resolution, 300-inch display support, dual HDMI, and long lamp life. Ideal for classrooms and offices.', 'ViewSonic PS502X, short throw projector, XGA projector 4000 lumens, classroom projector, office projector, 300 inch projector, ViewSonic projector Bangladesh, business projector, education projector, 0.55 throw ratio projector', NULL, 45, NULL, NULL),
(557, 'Corsair iCUE H100i ELITE LCD Display 240mm Liquid CPU Cooler', 'The Premium 240mm LCD RGB Liquid CPU Cooler is an elite thermal solution that blends extreme processor cooling with unparalleled system personalization. Featuring a customizable 2.1-inch IPS LCD display on the pump block, a high-density 240mm radiator, and hyper-fast 2400 RPM RGB fans pushing an incredible 75 CFM, it is engineered to easily tame high-wattage CPUs. Boasting extensive compatibility with mainstream and enthusiast platforms including Intel (LGA 1700/2066) and AMD Threadripper (STRX4/STR4), a precision copper cold plate, and a comprehensive 5-year warranty, this ultra-light 0.99 kg powerhouse ensures your system runs flawlessly under extreme workloads while serving as a breathtaking visual centerpiece.', 'corsair-icue-h100i-elite-lcd-display-240mm-liquid-cpu-cooler-1781356139', '<p>Push your modern, high-tier processor to its absolute limits without the threat of thermal throttling using the <strong>Premium 240mm LCD RGB Liquid CPU Cooler</strong>. Designed meticulously for hardcore gamers, professional overclockers, and PC enthusiasts who demand both extreme thermal performance and breathtaking aesthetics, this top-tier solution completely redefines system cooling. At the absolute center of this cooler is its marquee feature: a brilliant, built-in 2.1-inch IPS LCD screen mounted directly on the pump block. Boasting a crisp 480x480 resolution, a blazing ultra-bright 600cd/m² backlight, and smooth 30FPS playback in 24-bit true color, this dynamic digital dashboard allows you to actively monitor real-time system temperatures or showcase custom animated graphics, transforming your CPU cooler into a highly interactive centerpiece.</p><p>Beneath the vibrant LCD screen lies a premium, precision-machined 56x56mm Copper Cold Plate engineered for instantaneous heat transfer directly from the CPU die. This thermal energy is rapidly cycled through 380mm of durable tubing into a dense 277mm radiator, ensuring optimal thermal dissipation even during marathon 4K video rendering sessions or intense, CPU-bound gaming workloads.</p><p>To actively exhaust this heat, the cooler is equipped with high-performance 120mm RGB fans operating via precise PWM control at a blistering maximum speed of 2400 RPM. These fans generate a massive airflow of up to 75 CFM and an incredibly high static pressure of 4.2 mm-H2O, effortlessly forcing fresh air through the dense radiator fins. Despite this hurricane-level performance, the acoustic profile remains highly manageable, operating between a whisper-quiet 10 dBA at idle and 37 dBA under peak stress. Fully supporting mainstream and massive enthusiast processor architectures—including Intel\'s LGA 1700 and 2066 sockets, alongside AMD\'s AM4 and immense STRX4/STR4 platforms—it is ready for the most demanding PC builds. Backed by an industry-leading 5-year warranty, this cooler is a highly reliable, visually stunning investment for any high-end desktop setup.</p><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Interactive Display</strong></td><td>Custom 2.1\" IPS LCD Screen</td><td>A high-resolution (480x480), ultra-bright (600cd/m²) 30FPS digital dashboard for system monitoring and custom animations.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>56 x 56mm Copper Cold Plate</td><td>A large, precision-machined copper base guarantees incredibly rapid heat absorption from the CPU die.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>2400 RPM, 75 CFM Airflow</td><td>Ultra-fast fan speeds generate massive, high-volume airflow to rapidly cool the liquid inside the radiator.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Static Pressure &amp; Noise</strong></td><td>4.2 mm-H2O, 10 - 37 dBA</td><td>Exceptionally high static pressure forces air through dense radiator fins, with PWM control keeping noise minimal at lower loads.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics &amp; Lighting</strong></td><td>RGB LEDs &amp; IPS Dashboard</td><td>Provides a breathtaking, highly customizable aesthetic that completely elevates the visual depth of your internal components.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 1700, 1200, 115X, 2066, 2011</td><td>Broad mounting support ensures seamless installation on modern mainstream boards and extreme enthusiast platforms.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM4, STRX4, STR4</td><td>Fully supports highly popular AMD Ryzen systems alongside massive, workstation-grade Threadripper processors.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>277 (L) x 120 (W) x 27 (H) mm, 0.99 KG</td><td>An exceptionally lightweight yet highly efficient 240mm-class footprint designed to easily fit into standard PC chassis mounts.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>5 Years</td><td>An industry-leading 5-year warranty that provides absolute peace of mind and secures your premium hardware investment.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/h6vxWJNvselvPV8YPYIWZHegZLjXIf7Ly5vNuLqB.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 1, '2026-06-13 13:08:59', '2026-06-13 13:08:59', 'Premium 240mm LCD RGB Liquid CPU Cooler | 2.1\" IPS Screen', 'Maximize CPU performance with this Premium LCD RGB Liquid Cooler. Features a custom 2.1\" IPS display, 2400 RPM PWM fans, 75 CFM airflow, and a 5-year warranty.', 'LCD liquid CPU cooler, 2.1 inch IPS CPU display, 240mm AIO cooler, CPU cooler with screen, Intel LGA 1700 cooler, AMD AM4 liquid cooler, Threadripper STRX4 cooler, 2400 RPM AIO fans, RGB PC cooling', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(558, 'Corsair iCUE Link H100i LCD RGB 240mm AIO Liquid CPU Cooler With Display & iCUE LINK System Hub', 'The Premium 240mm RGB AIO Liquid CPU Cooler is a high-end thermal solution designed to effectively manage the heat output of today’s most demanding processors. Featuring a high-density 240mm aluminum radiator, a generous 56x56mm coldplate, and dynamic digital RGB fans capable of scaling from 480 up to 2400 RPM, it provides exceptional, low-noise cooling for intense workloads. Fully compatible with next-generation platforms including Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4), and backed by a massive 6-year warranty, this 2.16 kg cooling powerhouse guarantees reliable peak performance and vibrant aesthetics for your PC build.', 'corsair-icue-link-h100i-lcd-rgb-240mm-aio-liquid-cpu-cooler-with-display-icue-link-system-hub-1781356241', '<p>Push your processor to its absolute limits without the risk of thermal throttling using the <strong>Premium 240mm RGB AIO Liquid CPU Cooler</strong>. Carefully engineered for gamers, content creators, and PC enthusiasts, this All-In-One thermal solution delivers uncompromising cooling efficiency. At the heart of the system is a large 56x56mm coldplate designed for rapid heat absorption directly from the CPU die. This thermal energy is efficiently channeled through 400mm of premium, black-sleeved low-permeation rubber tubing into a dense 277mm Aluminum Radiator, ensuring excellent heat dissipation even during marathon rendering sessions or prolonged gaming.</p><p>To actively exhaust this heat, the cooler is equipped with high-performance 120mm RGB fans managed by highly precise digital controls. These fans feature an incredibly wide RPM range, spanning from a whisper-quiet 480 RPM during idle tasks up to a blistering 2400 RPM under maximum system stress. This allows the fans to push a massive airflow of up to 63.1 CFM and an impressive static pressure of 3.8mm-H2O when needed, all while remaining acoustically optimized to deliver \"Less Fan Noise\" than standard cooling solutions.</p><p>Beyond its raw cooling power, this AIO liquid cooler acts as a stunning visual centerpiece for your rig, featuring vibrant RGB LED lighting to perfectly match your build\'s aesthetic. It is also exceptionally future-proof. Offering comprehensive mounting support for the latest CPU architectures—including Intel\'s new LGA 1851 and 1700 sockets, as well as AMD\'s AM5 and AM4 platforms—it is ready for both current builds and future upgrades. Backed by a highly reassuring 6-year warranty, this cooler is a secure, long-term investment for any performance-focused desktop.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>56 x 56mm Coldplate, Aluminum Radiator</td><td>A large surface area coldplate combined with a dense radiator guarantees rapid heat absorption and efficient dissipation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>480 - 2400 RPM, 16.44 - 63.1 CFM Airflow</td><td>A massive RPM range provides nearly silent idle operation while ensuring hurricane-level airflow under heavy system loads.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Static Pressure &amp; Control</strong></td><td>0.17 - 3.8mm-H2O, Digital Fan Control</td><td>High static pressure easily forces fresh air through dense radiator fins, with digital controls allowing for precise, dynamic fan curves.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics &amp; Lighting</strong></td><td>Integrated RGB LEDs</td><td>Provides a breathtaking, customizable aesthetic that enhances the visual depth and style of your internal PC components.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Durability &amp; Build</strong></td><td>400mm Black Sleeved Low-Permeation Rubber Tubing</td><td>Extra-long, premium sleeved tubing drastically reduces liquid evaporation over time, ensuring a longer lifespan and easy installation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 1851, 1700, 1200, 115x</td><td>Completely future-proof mounting hardware ensures seamless, secure installation on both next-generation and mainstream Intel boards.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM5, AM4</td><td>Fully supports the latest generation of advanced AMD Ryzen processors alongside the widely popular AM4 platform.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>6 Years</td><td>An industry-leading 6-year warranty that provides absolute peace of mind and secures your premium hardware investment.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'CPU Cooler', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/UrjJLYOeeaG7NGfDjhSFSbDg98GQ49hZueOxgKoF.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 13:10:41', '2026-06-13 13:10:41', 'Premium 240mm RGB AIO Liquid CPU Cooler | AM5 & LGA 1851 Ready', 'Maximize CPU performance with this Premium 240mm RGB AIO Liquid Cooler. Features 2400 RPM digital fans, 400mm sleeved tubing, and an incredible 6-year warranty.', '240mm AIO cooler, RGB liquid CPU cooler, Intel LGA 1851 cooler, AMD AM5 liquid cooler, high performance CPU cooler, 2400 RPM AIO fans, PC gaming thermal solution, low noise AIO, 240mm radiator', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL);
