(559, 'Corsair iCUE H100i RGB ELITE 240mm Liquid CPU Cooler', 'The Premium 240mm RGB Liquid CPU Cooler is an incredibly efficient, ultra-quiet thermal solution engineered for modern desktop processors and enthusiast platforms. Featuring a precision-machined 56x56mm copper cold plate, a robust aluminum radiator, and dynamic PWM fans with a wide 400–1850 RPM range, it delivers scaling cooling for intense workloads while operating at a near-silent 5 dBA during idle. Highlighted by customizable RGB lighting and boasting universal compatibility with the latest Intel (LGA 1700/2066) and AMD (AM5/Threadripper sTRX4) sockets, this ultra-lightweight 0.91 kg powerhouse perfectly balances high-end performance, aesthetics, and reliability, backed by a 5-year warranty.', 'corsair-icue-h100i-rgb-elite-240mm-liquid-cpu-cooler-1781356456', '<p>Ensure your high-tier processor maintains optimal temperatures and maximum clock speeds with the <strong>Premium 240mm RGB Liquid CPU Cooler</strong>. Designed for PC builders who demand uncompromising reliability and whisper-quiet operation, this All-In-One (AIO) thermal solution completely redefines system cooling. At the absolute core of the cooler is a large 56x56mm Copper Cold Plate that guarantees rapid, instantaneous heat transfer directly from your CPU die. This thermal energy is swiftly moved through highly durable, black-sleeved low-permeation rubber tubing into a high-density 277mm Aluminum Radiator, ensuring optimal thermal dissipation even during marathon 4K rendering sessions or intense gaming workloads.</p><p>To exhaust this heat effectively while maintaining a remarkably peaceful acoustic environment, the cooler utilizes optimized 120mm RGB fans operating on a precise PWM control curve. With an exceptionally wide RPM range, the fans scale down to just 400 RPM during light administrative tasks, emitting a virtually inaudible 5 dBA. When your processor is pushed to its absolute limits, the system dynamically scales up to 1850 RPM, generating a steady airflow of 59.1 CFM and an acoustic output of only 28.9 dBA. This ensures your creative or gaming environment remains completely free from distracting system noise.</p><p>Performance and acoustics are beautifully complemented by the cooler\'s vibrant integrated RGB lighting, which serves as a highly customizable visual centerpiece for your rig. Furthermore, hardware compatibility is exceptionally broad and enthusiast-ready. It offers comprehensive mounting support for mainstream platforms like Intel\'s LGA 1700 and AMD\'s AM5, while uniquely including hardware for massive High-End Desktop (HEDT) processors like AMD Threadripper (sTRX4/sTR4) and Intel\'s LGA 2066. Weighing a remarkably light 0.91 kg and backed by a comprehensive 5-year warranty, this RGB liquid cooler is a secure, highly adaptable long-term investment.</p><h3><strong>Technical Breakd</strong></h3>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>56 x 56mm Copper Cold Plate, Aluminum Radiator</td><td>Premium thermal materials guarantee rapid heat absorption from the CPU and highly efficient heat dissipation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>400 – 1850 RPM (±10%), 10.9 - 59.1 CFM Airflow</td><td>A massive RPM range ensures reliable, steady airflow to cool the radiator fluid effectively during intensive workloads.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustics &amp; Control</strong></td><td>5 - 28.9 dBA, PWM Fan Control</td><td>PWM technology allows for dynamic speed adjustment, resulting in virtually silent 5 dBA operation at idle.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Durability &amp; Build</strong></td><td>Black Sleeved Low-Permeation Rubber Tubing</td><td>Premium sleeved tubing drastically reduces liquid evaporation over time, ensuring a longer lifespan and sleek aesthetic.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics &amp; Lighting</strong></td><td>Integrated RGB LEDs</td><td>Brilliant, highly customizable lighting elevates the visual appeal of your PC build to match your unique style.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 1700, 1200, 115x, 1366, 2011, 2066</td><td>Broad support ensures seamless installation on both modern mainstream boards and extreme enthusiast platforms.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM5, AM4, sTRX4, sTR4</td><td>Fully supports the latest advanced AMD Ryzen processors alongside massive workstation-grade Threadripper CPUs.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Radiator: 277 x 120 x 27 mm, 0.91 kg</td><td>An ultra-lightweight, efficient 240mm-class footprint designed to fit seamlessly into standard PC chassis mounts.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>5 Years</td><td>A dependable 5-year warranty that provides absolute peace of mind and protects your hardware investment.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/3lTjSsVB0MfPawaK4QluQlj1W2OpUKO804haOtuL.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 13:14:16', '2026-06-13 13:14:16', 'Premium 240mm RGB Liquid CPU Cooler | AM5 & Threadripper Ready', 'eep your PC ultra-cool and quiet with this Premium 240mm RGB Liquid Cooler. Features 1850 RPM PWM fans, near-silent 5 dBA operation, and support for Intel 1700 & AMD sTRX4.', '240mm RGB liquid cooler, quiet CPU cooler, Intel LGA 1700 cooler, AMD Threadripper cooler, sTRX4 liquid cooler, AM5 cooler, 1850 RPM PWM fans, lightweight AIO cooler', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(560, 'Viewsonic Projector  SP7 4800 Lumens Business', 'The 4800 ANSI Lumens WXGA DLP Projector delivers bright, sharp, and detailed visuals for classrooms, offices, and presentations. With 1280×800 resolution, 22000:1 contrast ratio, and 1.1x optical zoom, it ensures flexible installation and professional-quality display performance even in well-lit environments.', 'viewsonic-projector-sp7-4800-lumens-business-1781356504', '<p>The <strong>4800 ANSI Lumens WXGA DLP Projector</strong> is designed for professional environments such as classrooms, conference rooms, training centers, and business presentations. With its high brightness output of <strong>4800 ANSI lumens</strong>, it ensures clear visibility even in bright ambient lighting conditions.</p><p>Equipped with a <strong>native WXGA resolution (1280×800)</strong>, the projector delivers sharp text clarity and vibrant visuals, making it ideal for data presentations, videos, and educational content. The impressive <strong>22000:1 contrast ratio</strong> enhances image depth by producing deeper blacks and brighter whites.</p><p>This projector supports a wide <strong>image size range from 30\" to 300\"</strong>, offering flexible viewing options for small rooms to large halls. The <strong>1.1x optical zoom</strong> and <strong>±40° vertical keystone correction</strong> allow easy installation and alignment in different room setups.</p><p>With a durable <strong>200W lamp system</strong>, the projector offers long operational life of up to <strong>15,000 hours in Eco mode</strong>, reducing maintenance costs and ensuring long-term reliability.</p><p>Connectivity options include HDMI, dual Computer-in ports, Composite input, RS232 control, and USB service port, making it compatible with a wide range of modern and legacy devices.</p><p>The built-in <strong>2W speaker</strong> provides basic audio support for presentations. Its lightweight and compact design (2.2kg) makes it easy to install in classrooms, offices, and meeting environments.</p><p>Backed by <strong>International Office Solution (IOS)</strong> warranty support, this projector is a reliable and cost-effective choice for professional use.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>Projection System</td><td>0.65\" WXGA DLP</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>Native</td><td>1280 × 800</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution Support</td><td>PC / Video</td><td>VGA to Full HD (1920 × 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>Output</td><td>4800 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>Dynamic</td><td>22,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Image Size</td><td>Projection Range</td><td>30\" – 300\"</td></tr><tr><td>Throw Features</td><td>Zoom</td><td>1.1x Optical Zoom</td></tr><tr><td>Keystone</td><td>Correction</td><td>±40° Vertical</td></tr><tr><td>Lens</td><td>Type</td><td>F=2.56–2.68, f=22–24.1 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Light Source</td><td>Lamp Power</td><td>200W</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Normal / Eco</td><td>5000 / 15000 hours</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Speaker</td><td>2W Built-in Speaker</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Inputs</td><td>HDMI ×1, VGA ×2, Composite ×1</td></tr><tr><td>Output</td><td>Ports</td><td>Monitor Out, Audio Out</td></tr><tr><td>Control</td><td>Ports</td><td>RS232, USB Mini B</td></tr><tr><td>Display Colors</td><td>Color Support</td><td>1.07 Billion Colors</td></tr><tr><td>Noise Level</td><td>Eco Mode</td><td>27 dB</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Consumption</td><td>260W (Normal), &lt;0.5W Standby</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>Net Weight</td><td>2.2 kg</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Body</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Service</td><td>2 Years Parts &amp; Service</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 55000.00, 55000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/lRvt854XKGO1NgCIDcg6uKvWCjwlB25Djh653rFB.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 13:15:04', '2026-06-13 13:15:04', '4800 ANSI Lumens WXGA DLP Projector 1280x800 High Brightness Office Projector | IOS', 'Buy 4800 ANSI Lumens WXGA DLP Projector with 1280x800 resolution, 22000:1 contrast, 1.1x zoom and 300-inch display support. Ideal for office and classroom use. Available at International Office Solution.', 'projector, wxga projector, 4800 ansi lumens projector, dlp projector, office projector, classroom projector, 1280x800 projector, high brightness projector, hd projector, ios projector, international office solution projector, business projector, education projector', NULL, 45, NULL, NULL),
(561, 'Corsair iCUE LINK TITAN 240 RX RGB 240mm Liquid CPU Cooler', 'The Premium 240mm RGB Liquid CPU Cooler is an elite, high-performance thermal solution engineered to tame the heat of modern desktop processors. Featuring a precision-machined copper cold plate, a high-density 240mm aluminum radiator, and dual high-speed 2100 RPM RGB fans, it delivers exceptional cooling efficiency for high-wattage CPUs. Boasting universal compatibility with the latest Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4) platforms, ultra-durable 400mm sleeved tubing, and a comprehensive 5-year warranty, this 2.07 kg cooling powerhouse ensures your system runs flawlessly under extreme workloads while elevating your rig\'s aesthetics.', 'corsair-icue-link-titan-240-rx-rgb-240mm-liquid-cpu-cooler-1781356641', '<p>Push your modern, high-tier processor to its absolute limits without the threat of thermal throttling using the <strong>Premium 240mm RGB Liquid CPU Cooler</strong>. Designed meticulously for hardcore gamers, professional overclockers, and PC enthusiasts who demand both extreme performance and breathtaking aesthetics, this top-tier thermal solution completely redefines system cooling. At the core of this cooler lies a premium, precision-machined Copper Cold Plate engineered for instantaneous heat transfer directly from the CPU die. This heat is rapidly cycled through 400mm of stealthy, black-sleeved low-permeation rubber tubing into a dense 277mm Aluminum Radiator, ensuring optimal thermal dissipation even during marathon 4K video rendering sessions or intense, CPU-bound gaming workloads.</p><p>To actively exhaust this heat, the cooler is equipped with dual high-performance 120mm RGB fans operating via digital control at a blistering maximum speed of 2100 RPM. These fans generate a massive airflow of up to 73.5 CFM and an incredibly high static pressure of 4.33 mm-H2O, effortlessly forcing fresh air through the dense radiator fins to cool the liquid inside. Furthermore, the digitally controlled fans can scale down efficiently, ensuring noise levels are managed during lighter administrative tasks.</p><p>Beyond its raw, uncompromising cooling metrics, this liquid cooler serves as a vibrant visual centerpiece for your rig. The integrated RGB lighting allows you to create a stunning, customized light show within your chassis. It is also exceptionally future-proof. Fully supporting the latest processor architectures—including Intel\'s cutting-edge LGA 1851 and 1700 sockets, alongside AMD\'s AM5 and AM4 platforms—it is ready for both current builds and next-generation motherboard upgrades. Backed by a comprehensive 5-year warranty, this cooler is a highly reliable, visually stunning investment for any high-end PC setup.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Copper Cold Plate, Aluminum Radiator</td><td>Premium thermal materials guarantee incredibly rapid heat absorption from the CPU and highly efficient heat dissipation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>Dual 120mm Fans, 2100 RPM, 10.4 - 73.5 CFM</td><td>Ultra-fast fan speeds generate massive airflow to rapidly cool the liquid inside the radiator, preventing thermal throttling.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Static Pressure</strong></td><td>0.12 - 4.33 mm-H2O</td><td>Exceptionally high static pressure easily forces air through dense radiator fins for maximum cooling efficiency.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics &amp; Lighting</strong></td><td>Integrated RGB LEDs</td><td>Provides a breathtaking, customizable aesthetic that seamlessly elevates the visual depth of your internal components.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Durability &amp; Build</strong></td><td>400mm Black Sleeved Low-Permeation Rubber Tubing</td><td>Extra-long, premium sleeved tubing drastically reduces liquid evaporation over time, ensuring a longer lifespan and versatile mounting.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Socket Compatibility</strong></td><td><p>Intel: 1851, 1700</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>AMD: AM5, AM4</p></td><td>Completely future-proof mounting hardware ensures seamless, secure installation on modern and next-generation motherboard platforms.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>277 (L) x 120 (W) x 27 (H) mm, 2.074 KG</td><td>A highly efficient 240mm-class footprint designed to easily fit into the top or front mounts of most modern mid-tower chassis.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>5 Years</td><td>An industry-leading 5-year warranty that provides absolute peace of mind and secures your premium hardware investment.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/H3lz4NkYTEaO7MqrR2pVMM1FrycuMiB1wm7LkTOf.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 1, '2026-06-13 13:17:21', '2026-06-13 13:17:21', 'Premium 240mm RGB Liquid CPU Cooler | AM5 & LGA 1851 Ready', 'Maximize your CPU\'s performance with this Premium 240mm RGB Liquid Cooler. Features 2100 RPM fans, copper cold plate, and support for Intel 1851 & AMD', 'RGB liquid CPU cooler, 240mm AIO cooler, Intel LGA 1851 cooler, AMD AM5 liquid cooler, high performance CPU cooler, 2100 RPM AIO fans, copper cold plate cooler, PC gaming thermal solution, 240mm radiator', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(562, 'Corsair iCUE H100i ELITE CAPELLIX XT Liquid CPU Cooler White', 'The International Office Solution High-Performance 240mm Liquid CPU Cooler is an elite thermal solution engineered to tame the intense heat of modern, high-wattage processors, including enthusiast-grade Threadripper platforms. Featuring a high-density 240mm aluminum radiator, a generous 56x56mm coldplate, and ultra-fast PWM fans capable of reaching 2100 RPM, it delivers exceptional cooling efficiency for demanding PC builds. Boasting universal compatibility with the latest Intel (LGA 1700/2066) and AMD (AM5/TRX4) sockets, ultra-durable 400mm sleeved rubber tubing, and an industry-leading 5-year warranty, this 2.09 kg cooling powerhouse ensures your system maintains peak performance under heavy loads.', 'corsair-icue-h100i-elite-capellix-xt-liquid-cpu-cooler-white-1781356715', '<p>Push your processor to its absolute limits without the fear of thermal throttling using the <strong>International Office Solution</strong> 240mm Liquid CPU Cooler. Designed meticulously for hardcore gamers, professional overclockers, and heavy workstation users, this top-tier thermal solution redefines standard system cooling. At the heart of its performance is a large 56x56mm coldplate engineered for maximum, instantaneous heat transfer directly from the CPU die. This heat is rapidly cycled through 400mm of stealthy, black-sleeved low-permeation rubber tubing into a dense 277mm Aluminum Radiator, ensuring optimal thermal dissipation even during marathon video rendering sessions or intense gaming workloads.</p><p>To actively exhaust this heat, the cooler is equipped with dual high-performance 120mm fans operating at a blistering maximum speed of 2100 RPM via precise PWM control. These fans generate a massive airflow of up to 65.57 CFM and a highly impressive static pressure of 2.68 mm-H2O, effortlessly forcing fresh air through the dense radiator fins. Because the fans are PWM controlled, the system dynamically scales from a quiet 550 RPM during idle tasks to full power only when your CPU demands it, maintaining a managed and highly efficient acoustic profile.</p><p>What truly sets this 240mm liquid cooler apart is its incredibly broad hardware compatibility, making it a versatile offering for any custom build. It is exceptionally future-proof and enthusiast-ready, fully supporting mainstream architectures like Intel\'s LGA 1700 and AMD\'s AM5, while also featuring mounting hardware for massive HEDT (High-End Desktop) processors including AMD Threadripper TR4 and TRX4 sockets. Backed by a comprehensive 5-year warranty, this cooler is a highly reliable, long-term investment for any high-end PC enthusiast seeking uncompromising thermal</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>56 x 56mm Coldplate, Aluminum Radiator</td><td>A large surface area coldplate combined with a dense radiator guarantees incredibly rapid heat absorption and highly efficient heat dissipation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>550 - 2100 RPM, 13.8 - 65.57 CFM Airflow</td><td>Ultra-fast 120mm PWM fans generate massive airflow to rapidly cool the liquid inside the radiator, preventing processor thermal throttling.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Static Pressure &amp; Control</strong></td><td>0.17 - 2.68 mm-H2O, PWM Fan Control</td><td>High static pressure easily forces air through dense fins, while PWM control allows the motherboard to dynamically adjust speeds based on load.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Durability &amp; Build</strong></td><td>400mm Black Sleeved Low-Permeation Rubber Tubing</td><td>Premium extra-long sleeved tubing drastically reduces liquid evaporation over time, ensuring a longer lifespan and versatile mounting options.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 115x, 1200, 1700, 2011, 2066</td><td>Completely future-proof mounting hardware ensures seamless, secure installation on both mainstream and enthusiast Intel platforms.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM4, AM5, TR4, TRX4</td><td>Comprehensive AMD support, notably including the massive TR4 and TRX4 Threadripper sockets for extreme workstation builds.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>277 (L) x 120 (W) x 27 (H) mm, 2.097 KG</td><td>A highly efficient 240mm-class footprint designed to easily fit into the top or front mounts of most modern mid-tower chassis.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>5 Years</td><td>An industry-leading warranty that provides absolute peace of mind and secures your premium hardware investm</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'cpu', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/3v6ZrjDJMwvoYZvz2g7hHfLA03sptGXiva6roXJ4.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 1, '2026-06-13 13:18:35', '2026-06-13 13:19:22', 'International Office Solution 240mm Liquid CPU Cooler | AM5 & TRX4 Ready', 'Maximize your CPU\'s performance with the International Office Solution 240mm Liquid Cooler. Features 2100 RPM PWM fans, a 240mm aluminum radiator, and support for Intel 1700 & AMD TRX4.', 'International Office Solution cooler, iosbd liquid cooler, 240mm AIO cooler, liquid CPU cooler, Intel LGA 1700 cooler, AMD AM5 liquid cooler, Threadripper TRX4 cooler, high performance CPU cooler, 2100 RPM PWM fans, PC gaming thermal solution', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(563, 'MSI MAG COREFROZR AA13 ARGB Air CPU Cooler', 'The High-Performance ARGB Air CPU Cooler is a robust and visually striking thermal solution engineered for modern desktop processors. Featuring a CPU Direct Contact (C.D.C.) base with four 6mm copper heat pipes and a dense 50-fin aluminum stack, it delivers highly efficient heat dissipation for demanding workloads. Equipped with a dynamic 120mm ARGB fan capable of reaching 2070 RPM while maintaining a quiet acoustic profile, and boasting universal compatibility with the latest Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4) sockets, this cooler provides an exceptional balance of reliability, aesthetics, and performance backed by a 3-year warranty.', 'msi-mag-corefrozr-aa13-argb-air-cpu-cooler-1781356896', '<p>Maximize your processor\'s potential and maintain optimal system temperatures with the <strong>High-Performance ARGB Air CPU Cooler</strong>. Designed for PC builders who demand reliable air cooling without compromising on visual flair, this tower cooler is built around a highly efficient thermal engine. At the core of its design is CPU Direct Contact (C.D.C.) technology, where four Φ6mm copper heat pipes rest directly against the CPU die for instantaneous thermal transfer. This heat is then rapidly drawn up into a premium array of 50 high-density aluminum fins (crafted from AL1100, AL6063, and C1020 materials) to ensure a massive surface area for rapid heat dissipation.</p><p>To actively clear this thermal energy, the cooler is equipped with a high-performance 120mm ARGB fan. Built on a durable Rifle Bearing with a massive 40,000-hour life expectancy, this fan operates across a wide speed range of 510 to 2070 RPM. At peak performance, it generates a substantial airflow of 62.6 CFM and a strong static pressure of 2.36 mmH2O, easily forcing fresh air through the dense fin stack. Despite this impressive cooling power, the acoustic profile remains highly manageable, operating at a quiet 30.11 dBA under typical loads and peaking at only 34.1 dBA during maximum system stress.</p><p>Beyond its raw cooling metrics, this air cooler serves as a vibrant visual centerpiece for your rig. The integrated 5V 3-Pin ARGB header allows you to effortlessly synchronize the fan\'s lighting with your motherboard\'s software, creating a stunning, personalized aesthetic. Furthermore, it is exceptionally future-proof. Providing native mounting hardware for the absolute latest CPU architectures—including Intel\'s LGA 1851 and 1700 sockets, as well as AMD\'s AM5 and AM4 platforms—it is ready for both current builds and next-generation upgrades. Backed by a solid 3-year warranty, this cooler is a dependable, high-value investment for any desktop PC.</p><h3><strong>Technical Breakdown</strong></h3>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>C.D.C. Base, 4x Φ6mm Heat Pipes</td><td>Direct contact technology guarantees rapid, immediate heat absorption straight from the CPU surface.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Build</strong></td><td>50 Aluminum Fins (AL1100/AL6063/C1020)</td><td>A dense, premium alloy fin stack maximizes the total surface area available for thermal dissipation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>120mm Fan, 510 - 2070 RPM, 62.6 CFM</td><td>A wide RPM range ensures massive airflow to prevent thermal throttling during intense gaming or rendering sessions.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustics &amp; Pressure</strong></td><td>30.11 dBA (Max 34.1), 2.36 mmH2O</td><td>High static pressure easily forces air through the fins while maintaining a remarkably quiet operating environment.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics &amp; Durability</strong></td><td>5V 3-Pin ARGB, Rifle Bearing</td><td>Features customizable motherboard-synced lighting and a highly durable bearing rated for 40,000 hours of operation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 1851, 1700</td><td>Completely future-proof mounting hardware ensures secure installation on both current and next-generation Intel boards.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM5, AM4</td><td>Fully supports the latest generation of advanced AMD Ryzen processors alongside the widely popular AM4 platform.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Cooler Total: 152 x 121 x 94.5 mm</td><td>A compact yet highly efficient tower footprint designed to ensure excellent RAM and VRM clearance.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>3 Years</td><td>A dependable 3-year warranty that provides absolute peace of mind and protects your hardware investment.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 2700.00, 2700.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/RPTZOKBZWlbukpLrXvhvos9Z7GcvrGnCzEPNXwTk.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 13:21:36', '2026-06-13 13:21:36', 'High-Performance ARGB Air CPU Cooler | AM5 & LGA 1851 Ready', 'Keep your CPU cool in style with this High-Performance ARGB Air Cooler. Features 4 direct-contact heat pipes, a 2070 RPM 120mm fan, and support for Intel 1851 & AMD AM5.', 'ARGB air CPU cooler, 120mm CPU fan, direct contact heat pipes, Intel LGA 1851 cooler, AMD AM5 air cooler, PC gaming thermal solution, 2070 RPM CPU fan, CPU tower cooler', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
