 (crafted from AL1100, AL6063, and C1020 materials) to ensure a massive surface area for rapid heat dissipation.</p><p>To actively clear this thermal energy, the cooler is equipped with a high-performance 120mm ARGB fan. Built on a durable Rifle Bearing with a massive 40,000-hour life expectancy, this fan operates across a wide speed range of 510 to 2070 RPM. At peak performance, it generates a substantial airflow of 62.6 CFM and a strong static pressure of 2.36 mmH2O, easily forcing fresh air through the dense fin stack. Despite this impressive cooling power, the acoustic profile remains highly manageable, operating at a quiet 30.11 dBA under typical loads and peaking at only 34.1 dBA during maximum system stress.</p><p>Beyond its raw cooling metrics, this air cooler serves as a vibrant visual centerpiece for your rig. The integrated 5V 3-Pin ARGB header allows you to effortlessly synchronize the fan\'s lighting with your motherboard\'s software, creating a stunning, personalized aesthetic. Furthermore, it is exceptionally future-proof. Providing native mounting hardware for the absolute latest CPU architectures—including Intel\'s LGA 1851 and 1700 sockets, as well as AMD\'s AM5 and AM4 platforms—it is ready for both current builds and next-generation upgrades.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>C.D.C. Base, 4x Φ6mm Heat Pipes</td><td>Direct contact technology guarantees rapid, immediate heat absorption straight from the CPU surface.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Build</strong></td><td>50 Aluminum Fins (AL1100/AL6063/C1020)</td><td>A dense, premium alloy fin stack maximizes the total surface area available for thermal dissipation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>120mm Fan, 510 - 2070 RPM, 62.6 CFM</td><td>A wide RPM range ensures massive airflow to prevent thermal throttling during intense gaming or rendering sessions.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustics &amp; Pressure</strong></td><td>30.11 dBA (Max 34.1), 2.36 mmH2O</td><td>High static pressure easily forces air through the fins while maintaining a remarkably quiet operating environment.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics &amp; Durability</strong></td><td>5V 3-Pin ARGB, Rifle Bearing</td><td>Features customizable motherboard-synced lighting and a highly durable bearing rated for 40,000 hours of operation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 1851, 1700</td><td>Completely future-proof mounting hardware ensures secure installation on both current and next-generation Intel boards.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM5, AM4</td><td>Fully supports the latest generation of advanced AMD Ryzen processors alongside the widely popular AM4 platform.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Cooler Total: 152 x 121 x 94.5 mm</td><td>A compact yet highly efficient tower footprint designed to ensure excellent RAM a</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 2700.00, 2700.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/nFFpvTIm2C9OF9NWk1UyOBI5wzgAo6DUNao689vU.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 13:23:03', '2026-06-13 13:23:03', 'High-Performance ARGB Air CPU Cooler | AM5 & LGA 1851 Ready', 'Keep your CPU cool in style with this High-Performance ARGB Air Cooler. Features 4 direct-contact heat pipes, a 2070 RPM 120mm fan, and support for Intel 1851 & AMD AM5.', 'ARGB air CPU cooler, 120mm CPU fan, direct contact heat pipes, Intel LGA 1851 cooler, AMD AM5 air cooler, PC gaming thermal solution, 2070 RPM CPU fan, CPU tower cooler', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(565, 'MSI MPG CORELIQUID P13 360 AIO ARGB Liquid CPU Cooler With 2.1\" IPS Display', 'The Premium 360mm AIO ARGB Liquid CPU Cooler is a state-of-the-art thermal solution that seamlessly blends top-tier performance with stunning visual customization. Featuring a brilliant 2.1-inch IPS LCD display, a high-speed 3400 RPM pump, and dynamic ARGB Gen2 fans reaching up to 2050 RPM, it is engineered to easily tame the heat of high-wattage processors while operating at an ultra-quiet 20 dBA. Boasting universal compatibility with the latest Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4) platforms, highly durable EPDM tubing, and a solid 3-year warranty, this cooler is the ultimate interactive centerpiece for any high-end desktop build.', 'msi-mpg-coreliquid-p13-360-aio-argb-liquid-cpu-cooler-with-21-ips-display-1781357080', '<p>Elevate your desktop\'s thermal management and visual aesthetic to new heights with the <strong>Premium 360mm AIO ARGB Liquid CPU Cooler</strong>. Designed meticulously for PC enthusiasts, hardcore gamers, and content creators who refuse to compromise, this cooler completely redefines system monitoring and personalization. Its crowning feature is a custom 2.1-inch IPS LCD screen mounted directly on the pump block. Boasting a razor-sharp 480x480 resolution and an ultra-bright 600-nit panel, this interactive digital dashboard allows you to seamlessly display real-time system diagnostics, custom graphics, or your favorite animations in vivid, high-contrast detail.</p><p>Beneath the vibrant display lies a formidable, highly engineered cooling engine. The system utilizes a high-efficiency pump operating at a blistering 3400 RPM to rapidly cycle coolant through industrial-grade EPDM rubber tubing. This thermal energy is delivered straight to a massive 394mm high-density aluminum radiator, ensuring optimal heat dissipation even during grueling 4K video rendering tasks or prolonged, CPU-bound gaming workloads.</p><p>To actively exhaust this heat, the cooler is equipped with high-performance 120mm fans featuring vibrant ARGB Gen2 lighting and long-lasting Rifle Bearings. These fans feature a highly versatile speed range of 500 to 2050 RPM, generating an impressive 64.89 CFM of airflow to keep temperatures strictly under control. Despite this massive cooling potential, both the fans and the pump are acoustically optimized to operate at a whisper-quiet average of just 20 dBA, ensuring your creative environment remains free from distracting noise. Fully supporting the absolute latest processor architectures—including Intel\'s LGA 1851 and AMD\'s AM5 sockets—and backed by a dependable 3-year warranty, this AIO liquid cooler is a secure, visually breathtaking investment for your rig.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Interactive Display</strong></td><td>2.1\" IPS LCD, 480x480, 600 Nits</td><td>A hyper-bright, high-resolution digital dashboard for actively monitoring system metrics or showcasing custom animations.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>3400 RPM Pump, Aluminum Radiator</td><td>A high-speed pump guarantees rapid fluid circulation, maximizing the heat dissipation capabilities of the dense radiator.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>500 - 2050 RPM, 64.89 CFM Airflow</td><td>A massive RPM range provides nearly silent idle operation while ensuring hurricane-level airflow under heavy system stress.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustics &amp; Build</strong></td><td>20 dBA Average Noise, Rifle Bearings</td><td>Acoustically optimized fans and pump keep system noise incredibly low, while high-quality bearings ensure a 40,000-hour lifespan.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics &amp; Lighting</strong></td><td>ARGB Gen2 Integration</td><td>Provides a breathtaking, highly customizable lighting aesthetic that elevates the visual depth of your internal components.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Durability &amp; Tubing</strong></td><td>Premium EPDM Rubber Tubing</td><td>Industrial-grade EPDM drastically reduces liquid permeation over time, ensuring a longer lifespan and reliable cooling.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Socket Compatibility</strong></td><td><p>Intel: LGA 1851, 1700</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>AMD: AM5, AM4</p></td><td>Completely future-proof mounting hardware ensures seamless, secure installation on both next-generation and mainstream boards.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Radiator: 394 x 119.6 x 27.2 mm</td><td>A massive 360mm-class footprint designed to maximize surface area for extreme thermal dissipation in large chassis.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>3 Years</td><td>A dependable 3-year warranty that provides absolute peace of mind and protects your premium hardware investment.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 23900.00, 23900.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/NezhppcGVYGt4wvuk4qVGeGapuMq2zPngvokz1Ka.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 13:24:40', '2026-06-13 13:24:40', 'Premium 360mm AIO ARGB Liquid CPU Cooler | 2.1\" IPS LCD Screen', 'Maximize your CPU performance with this Premium 360mm AIO ARGB Liquid Cooler. Features a custom 2.1\" IPS display, 3400 RPM pump, ultra-quiet fans, and AM5/LGA 1851 suppor', '360mm AIO cooler, LCD liquid CPU cooler, 2.1 inch IPS CPU display, ARGB Gen2 liquid cooler, Intel LGA 1851 cooler, AMD AM5 liquid cooler, quiet CPU cooler, 3400 RPM pump AIO, PC gaming thermal solution', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(566, 'MSI MAG CORELIQUID I360 AIO ARGB Liquid CPU Cooler White', 'The Premium 360mm ARGB AIO Liquid CPU Cooler is a high-performance thermal solution engineered to tame the intense heat of modern, high-wattage processors. Featuring a blazing-fast 3400 RPM pump, a massive 394mm aluminum radiator, and advanced fans equipped with Loop Dynamic Bearings (LDB) pushing 70.7 CFM of airflow, it delivers exceptional cooling efficiency. Boasting whisper-quiet 20 dBA operation, customizable 5V ARGB lighting, broad compatibility with the latest Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4) sockets, and a dependable 3-year warranty, this cooler is the ultimate blend of power, aesthetics, and reliability.', 'msi-mag-coreliquid-i360-aio-argb-liquid-cpu-cooler-white-1781357264', '<p>Maximize your processor\'s performance and eliminate thermal throttling with the <strong>Premium 360mm ARGB AIO Liquid CPU Cooler</strong>. Designed meticulously for gamers, content creators, and PC enthusiasts, this All-In-One thermal solution is built to handle heavy, sustained workloads with ease. At the core of its cooling engine is a high-speed pump operating at an impressive 3400 RPM, ensuring incredibly rapid fluid circulation. This thermal energy is swiftly delivered to a massive 394mm high-density aluminum radiator, maximizing the surface area available for extreme heat dissipation during marathon rendering sessions or intense gaming.</p><p>To actively exhaust this heat, the cooler utilizes three high-performance 120mm fans featuring innovative Loop Dynamic Bearings (LDB). These premium bearings ensure a highly durable 30,000-hour lifespan while enabling the fans to generate a massive, steady airflow of 70.7 CFM. Despite this immense cooling potential, the system is acoustically optimized to remain remarkably peaceful, operating at a whisper-quiet average noise level of just 20 dBA. This ensures your creative or gaming environment remains completely free from distracting system noise.</p><p>Beyond its raw cooling metrics, this liquid cooler acts as a stunning visual centerpiece for your rig. The integrated 5V 3-Pin ARGB header allows you to effortlessly synchronize the lighting with your motherboard\'s software, creating a personalized, vibrant aesthetic to match your build. Offering comprehensive mounting support for the absolute latest CPU architectures—including Intel\'s new LGA 1851 and 1700 sockets, as well as AMD\'s AM5 and AM4 platforms—it is completely future-proof. Backed by a dependable 3-year warranty, this AIO liquid cooler is a secure, high-value investment for any performance desktop.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>3400 RPM Pump, Aluminum Radiator</td><td>A high-speed pump guarantees rapid fluid circulation, maximizing the heat dissipation capabilities of the dense 360mm-class radiator.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Technology</strong></td><td>Loop Dynamic Bearing (LDB)</td><td>Advanced bearing technology reduces friction, ensuring a quieter acoustic profile and a long 30,000-hour operational lifespan.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>70.7 CFM Airflow</td><td>Generates massive, high-volume airflow to rapidly cool the liquid inside the radiator, preventing processor thermal throttling.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustics</strong></td><td>20 dBA (Average)</td><td>Acoustically optimized components keep system noise incredibly low, resulting in a near-silent operating environment.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics &amp; Control</strong></td><td>5V ARGB 3-PIN Header</td><td>Provides a breathtaking, highly customizable lighting aesthetic that synchronizes easily with standard motherboard RGB software.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 1851, 1700, 1200, 115x</td><td>Completely future-proof mounting hardware ensures seamless, secure installation on both next-generation and mainstream Intel boards.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM5, AM4</td><td>Fully supports the latest generation of advanced AMD Ryzen processors alongside the widely popular AM4 platform.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Radiator: 394 x 120 x 27 mm</td><td>A massive 360mm footprint designed to maximize surface area for extreme thermal dissipation in mid-tower and full-tower chassis.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>3 Years</td><td>A dependable 3-year warranty that provides absolute peace of mind and protects your hardware investment against defects.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/7s9dFLH1OJgIMCNVFomTDp2J0LvG4W2XHE5DInHC.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 13:27:44', '2026-06-13 13:27:44', 'Premium 360mm ARGB AIO Liquid CPU Cooler | AM5 & LGA 1851 Ready', 'Maximize CPU cooling with this Premium 360mm ARGB AIO Cooler. Features a 3400 RPM pump, 70.7 CFM LDB fans, ultra-quiet 20 dBA operation, and support for Intel 1851 & AM5.', '360mm AIO cooler, ARGB liquid CPU cooler, Intel LGA 1851 cooler, AMD AM5 liquid cooler, quiet CPU cooler, Loop Dynamic Bearing fans, 3400 RPM pump AIO, PC gaming thermal solution, 360mm radiator', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(567, 'vMSI MAG CORELIQUID A15 360 AIO ARGB Liquid CPU Cooler', 'The Premium 360mm ARGB Gen2 AIO Liquid CPU Cooler is an elite thermal solution engineered to tame the intense heat of modern, high-wattage processors. Featuring a blazing-fast 3400 RPM pump, a massive 394mm aluminum radiator, and dynamic fans pushing 64.89 CFM of airflow, it delivers exceptional cooling efficiency. Boasting an ultra-quiet 20 dBA maximum noise level, customizable ARGB Gen2 lighting, premium EPDM + IIR tubing, broad compatibility with the latest Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4) sockets, and a dependable 3-year warranty, this cooler is the ultimate blend of high-end power, aesthetics, and reliability.', 'vmsi-mag-coreliquid-a15-360-aio-argb-liquid-cpu-cooler-1781357475', '<p>Maximize your processor\'s performance and eliminate thermal throttling with the <strong>Premium 360mm ARGB Gen2 AIO Liquid CPU Cooler</strong>. Designed meticulously for gamers, content creators, and PC enthusiasts, this All-In-One thermal solution is built to handle heavy, sustained workloads with ease. At the core of its cooling engine is a high-speed pump operating at an impressive 3400 RPM with an exceptional 50,000-hour life expectancy, ensuring incredibly rapid fluid circulation. This thermal energy is swiftly delivered through highly durable, industrial-grade EPDM and IIR rubber tubing to a massive 394mm high-density aluminum radiator, maximizing the surface area available for extreme heat dissipation.</p><p>To actively exhaust this heat, the cooler utilizes three high-performance 120mm fans featuring durable Rifle Bearings. These fans dynamically scale from 500 up to 2050 RPM, generating a steady, high-volume airflow of 64.89 CFM. Despite this immense cooling potential, the entire system is acoustically optimized to remain remarkably peaceful, operating at a whisper-quiet maximum noise level of just 20 dBA. This ensures your creative or gaming environment remains completely free from distracting system noise.</p><p>Beyond its raw cooling metrics, this liquid cooler acts as a stunning visual centerpiece for your rig. The integrated 5V 3-Pin ARGB Gen2 headers on both the pump and fans allow you to effortlessly synchronize the lighting with your motherboard\'s software, creating a personalized, vibrant aesthetic to match your build perfectly. Offering comprehensive mounting support for the absolute latest CPU architectures—including Intel\'s new LGA 1851 and 1700 sockets, as well as AMD\'s AM5 and AM4 platforms—it is completely future-proof. Backed by a dependable 3-year warranty, this AIO liquid cooler is a secure, high-value investment for any performance desktop.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>3400 RPM Pump, Aluminum Radiator</td><td>A high-speed pump guarantees rapid fluid circulation, maximizing the heat dissipation capabilities of the dense 360mm-class radiator.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Technology</strong></td><td>Rifle Bearing</td><td>Proven bearing technology reduces friction, ensuring a quiet acoustic profile and a long 40,000-hour operational lifespan.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>500 - 2050 RPM, 64.89 CFM Airflow</td><td>Generates massive, high-volume airflow to rapidly cool the liquid inside the radiator, preventing processor thermal throttling.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustics</strong></td><td>20 dBA (Maximum)</td><td>Acoustically optimized components keep system noise incredibly low, resulting in a near-silent operating environment even under load.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics &amp; Control</strong></td><td>ARGB Gen2, 5V 3-Pin Headers</td><td>Provides a breathtaking, highly customizable lighting aesthetic that synchronizes easily with standard motherboard RGB software.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Durability &amp; Build</strong></td><td>EPDM + IIR Tubing</td><td>Premium blended rubber tubing drastically reduces liquid permeation over time, ensuring a longer lifespan and reliable cooling.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 1851, 1700</td><td>Completely future-proof mounting hardware ensures seamless, secure installation on both next-generation and mainstream Intel boards.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM5, AM4</td><td>Fully supports the latest generation of advanced AMD Ryzen processors alongside the widely popular AM4 platform.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Radiator: 394 x 119.6 x 27.2 mm</td><td>A massive 360mm footprint designed to maximize surface area for extreme thermal dissipation in mid-tower and full-tower chassis.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>3 Years</td><td>A dependable 3-year warranty that provides absolute peace of mind and protects your hardware investment against defects.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'CPU Cooler', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/GRABI9sE1Duu6j5inb1RwQi2y7gqGPmoMIaPssOi.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 1, '2026-06-13 13:31:15', '2026-06-13 13:31:15', 'Premium 360mm ARGB Gen2 AIO Liquid CPU Cooler | AM5 & LGA 1851 Ready', 'Maximize CPU cooling with this Premium 360mm ARGB Gen2 AIO Cooler. Features a 3400 RPM pump, 64.89 CFM fans, ultra-quiet 20 dBA operation, and EPDM+IIR tubing.', 'v', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL);
