(568, 'Viewsonic Projector SP6 4800 Lumens Business', 'This 4800 ANSI Lumens WXGA projector delivers bright, sharp, and professional-quality visuals with a 25,000:1 contrast ratio and support for up to 300-inch screen size. Ideal for classrooms, offices, and conference rooms with flexible installation and strong performance.', 'viewsonic-projector-sp6-4800-lumens-business-1781357503', '<p>The <strong>4800 ANSI Lumens WXGA Projector</strong> is designed for professional presentations, educational environments, and business meetings where brightness and clarity are essential. With its powerful <strong>4800 ANSI lumens output</strong>, it delivers clear and vivid images even in well-lit rooms.</p><p>Featuring a <strong>native WXGA-compatible resolution (VGA to Full HD support)</strong>, this projector ensures crisp visuals and readable text for presentations, videos, and training materials. The enhanced <strong>25,000:1 contrast ratio</strong> improves image depth by producing sharper blacks and brighter whites for a more engaging viewing experience.</p><p>With a large <strong>projection size range from 30 inches up to 300 inches</strong>, this projector is suitable for both small meeting rooms and large halls. The <strong>±40° vertical keystone correction</strong> allows easy image alignment, while the precision <strong>F=2.56–2.68 lens system</strong> ensures stable and clear projection quality.</p><p>The projector is equipped with a <strong>190W lamp system</strong>, offering up to <strong>15,000 hours of lamp life in Eco mode</strong>, reducing maintenance costs and ensuring long-term reliability for continuous use.</p><p>Connectivity options include <strong>HDMI, dual VGA inputs, VGA output, Mini USB, audio in/out ports</strong>, making it highly compatible with laptops, PCs, and media devices. A built-in <strong>3W speaker</strong> provides basic audio output for presentations without external speakers.</p><p>Compact and lightweight at <strong>2.2kg</strong>, this projector is easy to install and transport. Its durable design and efficient power consumption (260W normal usage) make it a cost-effective solution for long-term professional use.</p><p>This model is offered with reliable service support from <strong>International Office Solution (IOS)</strong>, ensuring trusted performance and after-sales service.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>Projection System</td><td>DLP</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>Supported</td><td>VGA (640×480) to Full HD (1920×1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>Output</td><td>4800 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>Dynamic</td><td>25,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Image Size</td><td>Projection Range</td><td>30\" – 300\"</td></tr><tr><td>Lens</td><td>Type</td><td>F=2.56–2.68, f=22–24.1 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Keystone</td><td>Correction</td><td>±40° Vertical</td></tr><tr><td>Light Source</td><td>Lamp Power</td><td>190W</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Normal / Eco</td><td>5000 / 15000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Speaker</td><td>3W Built-in Speaker</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Input Ports</td><td>HDMI ×1, VGA ×2</td></tr><tr><td>Output</td><td>Ports</td><td>VGA Out, Audio Out</td></tr><tr><td>Control</td><td>Ports</td><td>Mini USB</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Input</td><td>Audio In (3.5mm)</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Supply</td><td>100–240V AC, 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>Usage</td><td>260W (Normal)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>Net Weight</td><td>2.2 kg</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>Size</td><td>294 × 218 × 110 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Body</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Service</td><td>2 Years (Parts &amp; Service)</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Warranty</td><td>Coverage</td><td>12 Months / 1000 Hours</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 55000.00, 55000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/LATUV6E0oCrvEOWLodJTWWiJEFmsI9HHijvjxuTh.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 13:31:43', '2026-06-13 13:31:43', '4800 ANSI Lumens WXGA Projector 25,000:1 Contrast 300 Inch Display | IOS Bangladesh', 'projector, wxga projector, 4800 ansi lumens projector, office projector, classroom projector, hd projector, dlp projector, 300 inch projector, 190w lamp projector, hdmi vga projector, business projector, ios projector, international office solution', 'Buy 4800 ANSI Lumens WXGA projector with 25,000:1 contrast, 190W lamp, HDMI & VGA support, and up to 300-inch display. Ideal for office & classroom use. Available at International Office Solution.', NULL, 45, NULL, NULL),
(569, 'MSI MAG CORELIQUID I360 AIO ARGB Liquid CPU Cooler', 'The Premium 360mm ARGB AIO Liquid CPU Cooler is a high-performance thermal solution engineered to tame the intense heat of modern, high-wattage processors. Featuring a blazing-fast 3400 RPM pump, a massive 394mm aluminum radiator, and advanced fans equipped with Loop Dynamic Bearings (LDB) pushing 70.7 CFM of airflow, it delivers exceptional cooling efficiency. Boasting whisper-quiet 20 dBA operation, customizable 5V ARGB lighting, broad compatibility with the latest Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4) sockets, and a dependable 3-year warranty, this cooler is the ultimate blend of power, aesthetics, and reliability.', 'msi-mag-coreliquid-i360-aio-argb-liquid-cpu-cooler-1781357559', '<p>Maximize your processor\'s performance and eliminate thermal throttling with the <strong>Premium 360mm ARGB AIO Liquid CPU Cooler</strong>. Designed meticulously for gamers, content creators, and PC enthusiasts, this All-In-One thermal solution is built to handle heavy, sustained workloads with ease. At the core of its cooling engine is a high-speed pump operating at an impressive 3400 RPM, ensuring incredibly rapid fluid circulation. This thermal energy is swiftly delivered to a massive 394mm high-density aluminum radiator, maximizing the surface area available for extreme heat dissipation during marathon rendering sessions or intense gaming.</p><p>To actively exhaust this heat, the cooler utilizes three high-performance 120mm fans featuring innovative Loop Dynamic Bearings (LDB). These premium bearings ensure a highly durable 30,000-hour lifespan while enabling the fans to generate a massive, steady airflow of 70.7 CFM. Despite this immense cooling potential, the system is acoustically optimized to remain remarkably peaceful, operating at a whisper-quiet average noise level of just 20 dBA. This ensures your creative or gaming environment remains completely free from distracting system noise.</p><p>Beyond its raw cooling metrics, this liquid cooler acts as a stunning visual centerpiece for your rig. The integrated 5V 3-Pin ARGB header allows you to effortlessly synchronize the lighting with your motherboard\'s software, creating a personalized, vibrant aesthetic to match your build. Offering comprehensive mounting support for the absolute latest CPU architectures—including Intel\'s new LGA 1851 and 1700 sockets, as well as AMD\'s AM5 and AM4 platforms—it is completely future-proof. Backed by a dependable 3-year warranty, this AIO liquid cooler is a secure, high-value investment for any performance desktop.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>3400 RPM Pump, Aluminum Radiator</td><td>A high-speed pump guarantees rapid fluid circulation, maximizing the heat dissipation capabilities of the dense 360mm-class radiator.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Technology</strong></td><td>Loop Dynamic Bearing (LDB)</td><td>Advanced bearing technology reduces friction, ensuring a quieter acoustic profile and a long 30,000-hour operational lifespan.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>70.7 CFM Airflow</td><td>Generates massive, high-volume airflow to rapidly cool the liquid inside the radiator, preventing processor thermal throttling.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustics</strong></td><td>20 dBA (Average)</td><td>Acoustically optimized components keep system noise incredibly low, resulting in a near-silent operating environment.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics &amp; Control</strong></td><td>5V ARGB 3-PIN Header</td><td>Provides a breathtaking, highly customizable lighting aesthetic that synchronizes easily with standard motherboard RGB software.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 1851, 1700, 1200, 115x</td><td>Completely future-proof mounting hardware ensures seamless, secure installation on both next-generation and mainstream Intel boards.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM5, AM4</td><td>Fully supports the latest generation of advanced AMD Ryzen processors alongside the widely popular AM4 platform.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Radiator: 394 x 120 x 27 mm</td><td>A massive 360mm footprint designed to maximize surface area for extreme thermal dissipation in mid-tower and full-tower chassis.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>3 Years</td><td>A dependable 3-year warranty that provides absolute peace of mind and protects your hardware investment against defects.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'CPU Cooler', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/YfsRlqpoB4Od1lTdOmuBIs2dLNZg7xOAVYLNb7fa.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 13:32:39', '2026-06-13 13:32:39', 'Premium 360mm ARGB AIO Liquid CPU Cooler | AM5 & LGA 1851 Ready', 'Maximize CPU cooling with this Premium 360mm ARGB AIO Cooler. Features a 3400 RPM pump, 70.7 CFM LDB fans, ultra-quiet 20 dBA operation, and support for Intel 1851 & AM5.', '360mm AIO cooler, ARGB liquid CPU cooler, Intel LGA 1851 cooler, AMD AM5 liquid cooler, quiet CPU cooler, Loop Dynamic Bearing fans, 3400 RPM pump AIO, PC gaming thermal solution, 360mm radiator', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(570, 'MSI MPG CORELIQUID P22 360 ARGB 360mm Liquid CPU Cooler With Display', 'The Premium 360mm AIO Liquid CPU Cooler is an elite thermal solution that perfectly balances high-end processor cooling with stunning visual customization. Featuring a vibrant 2.1-inch round IPS display, a blazing-fast 3400 RPM pump, and dynamic CycloBlade7 fans pushing 62.6 CFM of airflow, it effortlessly tames the heat of modern high-wattage CPUs. Boasting innovative builder-friendly features like an EZ Cap, a Screwless Copper Base, and a UNI Bracket for universal Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4) compatibility, this premium cooler is backed by a 3-year warranty to ensure your rig runs flawlessly.', 'msi-mpg-coreliquid-p22-360-argb-360mm-liquid-cpu-cooler-with-display-1781357637', '<p>high-tier processor to its absolute limits without the threat of thermal throttling using the <strong>Premium 360mm AIO Liquid CPU Cooler</strong>. Designed meticulously for hardcore gamers, content creators, and PC builders who demand both extreme performance and breathtaking aesthetics, this top-tier thermal solution completely redefines system cooling. At the absolute center of this cooler is its marquee feature: a brilliant 2.1-inch round IPS screen covered in pristine plain glass. This elegant digital dashboard allows you to actively monitor real-time system temperatures or showcase custom graphics, transforming your CPU cooler into a highly interactive centerpiece.</p><p>Beneath the vibrant display lies a formidable cooling engine. The system utilizes a high-efficiency pump operating at a rapid 3400 RPM, paired with an innovative Screwless Copper Base for optimal, uninterrupted thermal transfer directly from the CPU die. This heat is swiftly delivered through highly durable EPDM and IIR blended rubber tubing to a massive 394mm high-density aluminum radiator, maximizing the surface area available for extreme heat dissipation during marathon rendering sessions or intense gaming workloads.</p><p>To actively exhaust this heat, the cooler is equipped with three specialized CycloBlade7 ARGB fans. Operating across a versatile speed range of 500 to 2000 RPM, these fans generate a substantial airflow of 62.6 CFM and a strong static pressure of 2.36 mm-H2O, easily forcing fresh air through the dense radiator fins. Furthermore, installation is completely streamlined thanks to builder-centric innovations like the EZ Cap and UNI Bracket. Fully supporting the absolute latest processor architectures—including Intel\'s LGA 1851 and 1700 sockets, alongside AMD\'s AM5 and AM4 platforms—and backed by a dependable 3-year warranty, this AIO cooler is a secure, highly adaptable investment for your high-end desktop.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Interactive Display</strong></td><td>2.1\" Round IPS Screen</td><td>A crisp, plain-glass digital dashboard designed for active system monitoring and custom visual personalization.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>3400 RPM Pump, Screwless Copper Base</td><td>High-speed fluid circulation and an innovative base design guarantee rapid, uninterrupted heat absorption.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>CycloBlade7, 500-2000 RPM, 62.6 CFM</td><td>Specialized ARGB fans deliver massive, reliable airflow to prevent thermal throttling under heavy CPU loads.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Installation Features</strong></td><td>EZ Cap &amp; UNI Bracket</td><td>Streamlined, builder-friendly hardware ensures an incredibly fast, hassle-free mounting process.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Durability &amp; Build</strong></td><td>EPDM + IIR Tubing</td><td>Premium blended rubber tubing drastically reduces liquid permeation, ensuring a long 50,000-hour pump lifespan.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 1851, 1700</td><td>Completely future-proof mounting hardware ensures secure installation on both next-generation and mainstream Intel boards.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM5, AM4</td><td>Fully supports the latest generation of advanced AMD Ryzen processors alongside the widely popular AM4 platform.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Radiator: 394 x 119.2 x 27.2 mm</td><td>A massive 360mm footprint designed to maximize surface area for extreme thermal dissipation in large chassis.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>3 Years</td><td>A dependable 3-year warranty that provides absolute peace of mind and protects your hardware investment against defects.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/PYvYGO6eLuzuHrPxKMlUErVo36ZaRLYmU8zCHxd1.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 13:33:57', '2026-06-13 13:33:57', 'Premium 360mm AIO Liquid CPU Cooler | 2.1\" Round IPS Screen', 'Maximize CPU performance with this Premium 360mm AIO Cooler. Features a 2.1\" round IPS screen, CycloBlade7 fans, a 3400 RPM pump, and support for Intel 1851 & AM5.', '360mm AIO cooler, round LCD CPU cooler, 2.1 inch IPS display AIO, CycloBlade7 fans, Intel LGA 1851 cooler, AMD AM5 liquid cooler, 3400 RPM pump cooler, PC gaming thermal solution, ARGB liquid cooler', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(571, 'MSI MAG CORELIQUID A15 240 AIO ARGB Liquid CPU Cooler', 'The Premium 240mm ARGB Gen2 AIO Liquid CPU Cooler is an elite thermal solution engineered to manage the intense heat of modern, high-wattage processors. Featuring a blazing-fast 3400 RPM pump, a high-density 240mm aluminum radiator, and dynamic fans pushing 64.89 CFM of airflow, it delivers exceptional and reliable cooling efficiency. Boasting a manageable 28.7 dBA acoustic profile, customizable ARGB Gen2 lighting, highly durable EPDM + IIR tubing, universal compatibility with the latest Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4) sockets, and an industry-leading 5-year warranty, this cooler is the ultimate blend of power, aesthetics, and long-term reliability.', 'msi-mag-coreliquid-a15-240-aio-argb-liquid-cpu-cooler-1781357716', '<p>Maximize your processor\'s performance and confidently eliminate thermal throttling with the <strong>Premium 240mm ARGB Gen2 AIO Liquid CPU Cooler</strong>. Designed meticulously for gamers, content creators, and PC enthusiasts, this All-In-One thermal solution is built to handle sustained, heavy workloads with ease. At the core of its cooling engine is a high-speed pump operating at an impressive 3400 RPM with an exceptional 50,000-hour life expectancy, ensuring incredibly rapid fluid circulation. This thermal energy is swiftly delivered through highly durable, industrial-grade EPDM and IIR blended rubber tubing to a dense 277mm aluminum radiator, maximizing the surface area available for rapid heat dissipation.</p><p>To actively exhaust this heat, the cooler utilizes dual high-performance 120mm fans featuring highly durable Rifle Bearings. These fans dynamically scale from 500 up to 2050 RPM, generating a steady, high-volume airflow of 64.89 CFM. Despite this immense cooling potential, the system is acoustically tuned to operate at a maximum noise level of just 28.7 dBA, ensuring your creative or gaming environment remains free from distracting system noise even under load.</p><p>Beyond its raw cooling metrics, this liquid cooler acts as a stunning visual centerpiece for your rig. The integrated 5V 3-Pin ARGB Gen2 headers on both the pump and fans allow you to effortlessly synchronize the lighting with your motherboard\'s software, creating a personalized, vibrant aesthetic to perfectly match your build. Offering comprehensive mounting support for the absolute latest CPU architectures—including Intel\'s cutting-edge LGA 1851 and 1700 sockets, as well as AMD\'s AM5 and AM4 platforms—it is completely future-proof. Backed by a dependable 5-year warranty, this 240mm AIO liquid cooler is a secure, high-value investment for any performance desktop.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>3400 RPM Pump, Aluminum Radiator</td><td>A high-speed pump guarantees rapid fluid circulation, maximizing the heat dissipation capabilities of the dense 240mm-class radiator.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Technology</strong></td><td>Rifle Bearing</td><td>Proven bearing technology reduces friction, ensuring a balanced acoustic profile and a long 40,000-hour operational lifespan.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>500 - 2050 RPM, 64.89 CFM Airflow</td><td>Generates high-volume airflow to rapidly cool the liquid inside the radiator, preventing processor thermal throttling.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustics</strong></td><td>28.7 dBA</td><td>Acoustically optimized components keep system noise highly manageable, resulting in a focused operating environment.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics &amp; Control</strong></td><td>ARGB Gen2, 5V 3-Pin Headers</td><td>Provides a breathtaking, highly customizable lighting aesthetic that synchronizes easily with standard motherboard RGB software.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Durability &amp; Build</strong></td><td>EPDM + IIR Tubing</td><td>Premium blended rubber tubing drastically reduces liquid permeation over time, ensuring a longer lifespan and reliable cooling.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 1851, 1700</td><td>Completely future-proof mounting hardware ensures seamless, secure installation on both next-generation and mainstream Intel boards.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM5, AM4</td><td>Fully supports the latest generation of advanced AMD Ryzen processors alongside the widely popular AM4 platform.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Radiator: 277 x 119.6 x 27 mm</td><td>A highly efficient 240mm footprint designed to easily fit into the top or front mounts of most modern mid-tower chassis.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>5 Years</td><td>An industry-leading 5-year warranty that provides absolute peace of mind and protects your hardware investment against defects.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/8wspQlBmIN5qBUA2oEjvqHsrqNVOhNCyD88Xr8Iq.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 13:35:16', '2026-06-13 13:35:16', 'Premium 240mm ARGB Gen2 AIO Liquid CPU Cooler | AM5 & LGA 1851 Ready', 'Maximize CPU cooling with this Premium 240mm ARGB Gen2 AIO Cooler. Features a 3400 RPM pump, 64.89 CFM fans, EPDM+IIR tubing, and a 5-year warranty.', '240mm AIO cooler, ARGB Gen2 liquid CPU cooler, Intel LGA 1851 cooler, AMD AM5 liquid cooler, 3400 RPM pump AIO, PC gaming thermal solution, EPDM tubing AIO, Rifle bearing fans, 240mm radiator', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(572, 'Gamdias ST-BOREAS E1-411 SE CPU Air Cooler', 'The High-Performance Dual-Fan CPU Air Cooler is a robust and highly efficient thermal solution engineered to tame modern desktop processors. Built around a thick base plate and four direct-contact copper heat pipes, it rapidly pulls heat into a dense aluminum fin stack. Equipped with dual 120mm PWM fans utilizing durable hydraulic bearings, it delivers a massive 70.2 CFM of airflow while operating between a whisper-quiet 10 to 31 dB(A). Boasting universal compatibility with the latest Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4) sockets, this 155mm tall tower cooler provides an exceptional balance of raw cooling power and acoustics, backed by a 3-year warranty.', 'gamdias-st-boreas-e1-411-se-cpu-air-cooler-1781357848', '<p>Maximize your processor\'s potential and maintain optimal system temperatures with the <strong>High-Performance Dual-Fan CPU Air Cooler</strong>. Designed for PC builders who demand reliable, uncompromising air cooling for heavy workloads and gaming, this tower cooler is built around a highly efficient thermal engine. At the core of its design is Direct Contact Technology, where four premium copper heat pipes rest precisely against a thick base plate for instantaneous thermal transfer straight from the CPU die. This heat is rapidly drawn up into a dense array of aluminum fins to ensure a massive surface area for heat dissipation.</p><p>To actively clear this thermal energy, the cooler features a formidable push-pull configuration using dual high-performance 120mm PWM fans. Built on long-lasting hydraulic bearings, these fans operate across a dynamic speed range of 800 to 2000 RPM. At peak performance, they generate a substantial, high-volume airflow of 70.2 CFM and a strong static pressure of 2.7 mmH20, easily forcing fresh air through the heatsink. Despite this impressive cooling power, the acoustic profile remains highly manageable. Thanks to precise PWM control, the cooler operates at a virtually silent 10 dB(A) during idle tasks and peaks at a highly reasonable 31 dB(A) under maximum system stress.</p><p>Beyond its raw cooling metrics, this air cooler is exceptionally versatile and future-proof. With a total height of 155mm, it fits comfortably inside the vast majority of modern mid-tower chassis. Providing comprehensive mounting hardware for the absolute latest CPU architectures—including Intel\'s new LGA 1851 and 1700 sockets, as well as AMD\'s AM5 and AM4 platforms—it is ready for both current builds and next-generation upgrades. Backed by a solid 3-year warranty, this dual-fan cooler is a dependable, high-value investment for any desktop PC.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Thick Base Plate, 4x Copper Heatpipes</td><td>Direct contact technology guarantees rapid, immediate heat absorption straight from the CPU surface.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Build</strong></td><td>High-Density Aluminum Fins</td><td>A premium alloy fin stack maximizes the total surface area available for thermal dissipation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Technology</strong></td><td>Dual 120mm Fans, Hydraulic Bearing</td><td>A dual-fan setup ensures maximum push-pull cooling efficiency while hydraulic bearings provide a long lifespan.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>800 - 2000 RPM, 70.2 CFM Airflow</td><td>A wide PWM-controlled RPM range ensures massive airflow to prevent thermal throttling during intense sessions.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustics &amp; Pressure</strong></td><td>10 - 31 dB(A), 2.7 mmH20</td><td>High static pressure easily forces air through the fins while maintaining a remarkably quiet operating environment at idle.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 1851, 1700, 1200, 115x</td><td>Completely future-proof mounting hardware ensures secure installation on both current and next-generation Intel boards.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM5, AM4</td><td>Fully supports the latest generation of advanced AMD Ryzen processors alongside the widely popular AM4 platform.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Cooler Total: 127 x 97 x 155 mm</td><td>A highly efficient tower footprint optimized to ensure excellent RAM and VRM clearance within most standard PC cases.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>3 Years</td><td>A dependable 3-year warranty that provides absolute peace of mind and protects your hardware investment.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 2300.00, 2300.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/diHC1pdOqHukJHK0RIjSujZHdWDsgD3lOpAsQgCQ.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 13:37:28', '2026-06-13 13:37:28', 'High-Performance Dual-Fan CPU Air Cooler | AM5 & LGA 1851 Ready', 'Maximize CPU cooling with this Dual-Fan Air Cooler. Features 4 direct-contact copper heatpipes, 2000 RPM PWM fans, and support for Intel 1851 & AMD AM5.', 'dual fan CPU cooler, air CPU cooler, 4 heatpipe cooler, direct contact CPU cooler, Intel LGA 1851 cooler, AMD AM5 air cooler, quiet CPU fan, 2000 RPM PWM cooler, push pull CPU cooler', NULL, 27, NULL, NULL),
(573, 'ViewSonic Projector LS500WHE 3000 Lumens WXGA LED Classroom', 'This 3000 lumens WXGA LED projector delivers sharp visuals with 3000000:1 contrast ratio, 1.07 billion colors, and up to 300-inch display support. Compact, energy-efficient, and ideal for office, classroom, and multimedia use.', 'viewsonic-projector-ls500whe-3000-lumens-wxga-led-classroom-1781357866', '<p>The <strong>3000 Lumens WXGA RGB LED Projector</strong> is designed to deliver vibrant, high-contrast visuals for business presentations, classroom learning, and home entertainment. With <strong>WXGA resolution (1280×800)</strong> and advanced <strong>RGB LED light source technology</strong>, it ensures bright and color-accurate projection performance.</p><p>Featuring an ultra-high <strong>3000000:1 contrast ratio</strong>, this projector produces deep blacks and vivid whites, enhancing image clarity and detail. With support for up to <strong>1.07 billion colors</strong>, it provides rich and realistic visuals suitable for videos, presentations, and multimedia content.</p><p>The projector supports a large <strong>screen size range from 30\" to 300\"</strong>, making it flexible for small rooms as well as large halls. Its <strong>1.55–1.70 throw ratio</strong>, <strong>1.1x optical zoom</strong>, and <strong>0.8x–2.0x digital zoom</strong> allow easy installation and flexible positioning.</p><p>Built with an efficient <strong>RGB LED light source</strong>, this projector ensures long-lasting performance with reduced maintenance and energy consumption compared to traditional lamp-based projectors.</p><p>It supports multiple frequency ranges and operating conditions, making it stable for continuous professional use. The compact design (2.45 kg) and modern white finish make it suitable for portable and fixed installations.</p><p>Backed by <strong>International Office Solution (IOS)</strong>, this projector ensures reliable performance and trusted after-sales support.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>Projection System</td><td>WXGA (1280 × 800)</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>Output</td><td>3000 Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>Dynamic</td><td>3000000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Image Size</td><td>Projection Range</td><td>30\" – 300\"</td></tr><tr><td>Light Source</td><td>Type</td><td>RGB LED</td></tr><tr><td>Display Colors</td><td>Color Depth</td><td>1.07 Billion Colors</td></tr><tr><td>Throw Ratio</td><td>Projection Ratio</td><td>1.55 – 1.70</td></tr><tr><td>Optical Zoom</td><td>Lens Zoom</td><td>1.1x</td></tr><tr><td>Digital Zoom</td><td>Adjustment</td><td>0.8x – 2.0x</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>Horizontal</td><td>15K – 102KHz</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>Vertical</td><td>23 – 120Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Operating Temp</td><td>Environment</td><td>0°C – 40°C</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Input</td><td>100–240V ±10%</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>Net Weight</td><td>2.45 kg</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>Size</td><td>293 × 221 × 115 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Body</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Service</td><td>2 Years Parts &amp; Service</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 55000.00, 55000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/N0Qimso5fc5qz4aoWf3fi0QKjFmgq5oGbMbnJK0k.jpg', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 13:37:46', '2026-06-13 13:37:46', '3000 Lumens WXGA RGB LED Projector 300 Inch Display 3000000:1 Contrast | IOS Bangladesh', 'Buy 3000 lumens WXGA RGB LED projector with 3000000:1 contrast, 1.07B colors, 300” display, optical zoom and energy-efficient performance. Available at IOS.', 'projector, wxga projector, led projector, rgb led projector, 3000 lumens projector, office projector, classroom projector, 300 inch projector, high contrast projector, ios projector, international office solution, multimedia projector', NULL, 45, NULL, NULL),
(574, 'Gamdias BOREAS M2-51D Digital Display Single Tower Air CPU Cooler', 'The Premium Digital Air CPU Cooler is a high-performance, stealthy thermal solution designed to seamlessly manage the heat of modern desktop processors. Featuring an innovative built-in digital monitor for real-time system tracking, a sleek matte black finish, and five direct-contact copper heat pipes, it delivers exceptional cooling power and visual appeal. Equipped with a highly efficient 120mm PWM fan pushing 72.94 CFM of airflow and boasting broad compatibility with the latest Intel (LGA 1700/2066) and AMD (AM5/AM4) platforms, this 159mm-tall cooler offers a perfect blend of raw thermal performance and smart software integration, all backed by a 3-year warranty.', 'gamdias-boreas-m2-51d-digital-display-single-tower-air-cpu-cooler-1781357937', '<p>Elevate your desktop\'s thermal management and monitoring capabilities with the <strong>Premium Digital Air CPU Cooler</strong>. Designed for PC builders who prioritize smart hardware features, stealthy aesthetics, and highly reliable air cooling, this tower cooler completely redefines the standard heatsink. At the core of its design is advanced Direct Contact Technology, utilizing five premium copper heat pipes that rest directly against a thick base plate for instantaneous, uninterrupted thermal transfer from the CPU die. This heat is rapidly drawn up into a dense array of aluminum fins, all beautifully coated in a premium matte black finish that perfectly complements any modern PC chassis.</p><p>What truly sets this cooler apart is its integrated Digital Monitor. Powered by a 9-Pin USB connection and featuring deep integration with ZEUS CAST software, this digital display allows you to track vital system metrics in real-time straight from the top of the heatsink. To actively clear thermal energy, the cooler features a formidable 120mm PWM fan built on a highly durable hydraulic bearing. Operating seamlessly between 800 and 1800 RPM, it generates a massive, high-volume airflow of 72.94 CFM and a strong static pressure of 2.63 mmH2O. Despite this impressive cooling power, the acoustic profile remains excellent, operating at a virtually silent 10 dBA during idle tasks and peaking at just 32 dBA under maximum system stress.</p><p>Beyond its performance and smart features, this air cooler is exceptionally versatile. With an optimized total height of 159mm, it fits comfortably inside the vast majority of modern mid-tower cases. Providing comprehensive mounting hardware for a vast array of processor architectures—including Intel\'s modern LGA 1700 and enthusiast 2066 sockets, as well as AMD\'s AM5 and AM4 platforms—it is ready for both mainstream builds and high-end workstations. Backed by a solid 3-year warranty, this digital air cooler is a dependable, feature-rich investment.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Smart Integration</strong></td><td>Digital Monitor &amp; ZEUS CAST Support</td><td>Features an innovative built-in display powered by a 9-Pin USB header to monitor real-time system metrics.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Thick Base Plate, 5x Copper Heatpipes</td><td>Five direct-contact copper heat pipes guarantee incredibly rapid heat absorption straight from the CPU surface.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Build</strong></td><td>Matte Black Aluminum Fins</td><td>A dense, premium-coated fin stack maximizes thermal dissipation while providing a sleek, stealthy aesthetic.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>120mm Hydraulic Bearing, 800 - 1800 RPM</td><td>A durable PWM fan ensures a long lifespan and scales effectively to prevent thermal throttling during intense workloads.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Airflow &amp; Acoustics</strong></td><td>72.94 CFM Airflow, 10 - 32 dBA Noise</td><td>Delivers massive airflow and strong static pressure (2.63 mmH2O) while maintaining a whisper-quiet operating environment at idle.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 1700, 1200, 115x, 2011, 2066</td><td>Broad mounting support ensures seamless installation on modern mainstream boards and extreme enthusiast platforms.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM5, AM4</td><td>Fully supports the latest generation of advanced AMD Ryzen processors alongside the widely popular AM4 platform.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>120 x 75 x 159 mm</td><td>A highly compatible footprint optimized to easily clear standard RAM heights while fitting inside most mid-tower cases.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>3 Years</td><td>A dependable 3-year warranty that provides absolute peace of mind and protects your hardware investment against defects.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'CPU Cooler', 3626.00, 3626.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/HRK9xAoH8f9XfQEWOLgbvdFpdnSNAcMC45QKMQ0L.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 13:38:57', '2026-06-13 13:38:57', 'Premium Digital Air CPU Cooler | AM5 & LGA 1700 Ready', 'Upgrade your PC with this Premium Digital Air Cooler. Features a real-time digital monitor, 5 direct-contact heat pipes, stealthy matte black finish, and 72.94 CFM fan.', 'digital display CPU cooler, air CPU cooler with screen, 5 heatpipe cooler, direct contact CPU cooler, matte black CPU cooler, Intel LGA 1700 cooler, AMD AM5 air cooler, ZEUS CAST cooler, 1800 RPM PWM cooler', NULL, 27, NULL, NULL),
