0 RPM, it generates a massive, high-volume airflow of 80.83 CFM and a strong static pressure of 2.80 mmH2O. Despite this impressive cooling power, the acoustic profile remains excellent, operating at a virtually silent 10 dBA during idle tasks and peaking at just 32 dBA under maximum system stress.</p><p>Beyond its performance and smart features, this air cooler is exceptionally versatile. With an optimized total height of 158mm, it fits comfortably inside the vast majority of modern mid-tower cases while easily clearing standard RAM heights. Providing comprehensive mounting hardware for a vast array of processor architectures—including Intel\'s next-generation LGA 1851 and 1700 sockets, as well as AMD\'s AM5 and AM4 platforms—it is ready for both mainstream builds and high-end workstations. Backed by a solid 3-year warranty, this digital air cooler is a dependable, feature-rich investment.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Smart Integration</strong></td><td>Digital Monitor &amp; ZEUS CAST Support</td><td>Features an innovative built-in display powered by a 9-Pin USB header to monitor real-time system metrics.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Thick Base Plate, 5x Copper Heatpipes</td><td>Five direct-contact copper heat pipes guarantee incredibly rapid heat absorption straight from the CPU surface.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Build</strong></td><td>Matte Black Aluminum Fins</td><td>A dense, premium-coated fin stack maximizes thermal dissipation while providing a sleek, stealthy aesthetic.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>120mm Hydraulic Bearing, 800 - 2000 RPM</td><td>A durable PWM fan ensures a long lifespan and scales effectively to prevent thermal throttling during intense workloads.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Airflow &amp; Acoustics</strong></td><td>80.83 CFM Airflow, 10 - 32 dBA Noise</td><td>Delivers massive airflow and strong static pressure (2.80 mmH2O) while maintaining a whisper-quiet operating environment at idle.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 1851, 1700, 1200, 115x</td><td>Broad mounting support ensures seamless installation on current mainstream boards and next-generation Intel platforms.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM5, AM4</td><td>Fully supports the latest generation of advanced AMD Ryzen processors alongside the widely popular AM4 platform.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>120 x 72 x 158 mm</td><td>A highly compatible footprint optimized to fit inside most mid-tower cases (designed for up to 159mm clearance).</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>3 Years</td><td>A dependable 3-year warranty that provides absolute peace of mind and protects your hardware investment against defects.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 3700.00, 3700.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/MWt40Sj2Y81gmTSsAnp6KFUmDSipmIetsqep1dTz.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 13:40:11', '2026-06-13 13:40:11', 'Premium Digital Air CPU Cooler | AM5 & LGA 1851 Ready', 'Upgrade your PC with this Premium Digital Air Cooler. Features a real-time digital monitor, 5 direct-contact heat pipes, stealthy matte black finish, and an 80.83 CFM fan.', 'digital display CPU cooler, air CPU cooler with screen, 5 heatpipe cooler, direct contact CPU cooler, matte black CPU cooler, Intel LGA 1851 cooler, AMD AM5 air cooler, ZEUS CAST cooler, 2000 RPM PWM cooler', NULL, 27, NULL, NULL),
(576, 'Gamdias CHIONE P3-240U ARGB 240mm AIO Liquid CPU Cooler', 'The High-Performance 270W TDP Liquid CPU Cooler is a heavy-duty thermal solution engineered to tame the extreme heat of modern enthusiast processors. Featuring a precision-machined copper base plate, highly durable Teflon tubing, and a high-density aluminum radiator, it easily dissipates up to 270W of thermal energy. Equipped with dynamic hydraulic bearing fans capable of 2000 RPM and pushing 69.01 CFM of airflow, it maintains a quiet 10–31 dBA acoustic profile. Boasting massive universal compatibility with everything from legacy sockets to modern Intel (LGA 1700/2066) and AMD (AM5/TR4) platforms, this cooler is an uncompromising powerhouse backed by a 5-year warranty.', 'gamdias-chione-p3-240u-argb-240mm-aio-liquid-cpu-cooler-1781358104', '<p>Push your extreme desktop processor to its absolute limits without the threat of thermal throttling using the <strong>High-Performance 270W TDP Liquid CPU Cooler</strong>. Designed meticulously for hardcore gamers, professional overclockers, and heavy workstation users, this top-tier All-In-One thermal solution is built to handle massive heat loads. At the core of its design is a premium Copper Base Plate that guarantees instantaneous heat transfer directly from the CPU die. This thermal energy is swiftly cycled through industrial-grade Teflon tubing—chosen for its extreme durability and low-permeation properties—into a high-density Aluminum Radiator, ensuring optimal heat dissipation even under the immense strain of a 270W TDP workload.</p><p>To actively exhaust this massive amount of heat, the cooler utilizes high-performance fans built on long-lasting Hydraulic Bearings. Operating across a dynamic speed range of 800 to 2000 RPM, these fans generate a substantial, high-volume airflow of 69.01 CFM and a strong static pressure of 2.37 mmH2O. Despite this immense cooling potential, the system is acoustically optimized. It operates at a virtually silent 10 dBA during idle or administrative tasks and peaks at a highly manageable 31 dBA under absolute maximum system stress.</p><p>What truly sets this liquid cooler apart is its incredibly vast hardware compatibility. It is the ultimate versatile solution, providing mounting hardware for the absolute latest architectures like Intel\'s LGA 1700 and AMD\'s AM5, while natively supporting massive High-End Desktop (HEDT) processors including AMD\'s Threadripper (TR4) and Intel\'s LGA 2066. It even covers a massive array of legacy platforms (AM3+, FM2, LGA 1366, etc.), ensuring it can fit almost any build. Backed by a highly dependable 5-year warranty, this liquid cooler is a secure, heavy-duty investment for any high-performance PC setup.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Power</strong></td><td>270W TDP</td><td>Engineered with massive thermal capacity to easily cool overclocked and enthusiast-grade processors.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Copper Base Plate, Aluminum Radiator</td><td>Premium thermal materials guarantee rapid heat absorption from the CPU and highly efficient heat dissipation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Durability &amp; Tubing</strong></td><td>Teflon Tube</td><td>Industrial-grade Teflon tubing drastically reduces liquid permeation, ensuring a long, maintenance-free lifespan.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>800 - 2000 RPM, 69.01 CFM Airflow</td><td>A wide RPM range ensures reliable, high-volume airflow to prevent thermal throttling during intense rendering or gaming.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustics &amp; Pressure</strong></td><td>10 - 31 dBA, 2.37 mmH2O</td><td>High static pressure easily forces air through dense radiator fins while maintaining a remarkably quiet idle environment.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 1700, 1200, 115x, 1366, 2011, 2066</td><td>Exceptionally broad support ensures seamless installation on modern boards, legacy systems, and extreme enthusiast platforms.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM5, AM4, TR4, legacy AM/FM sockets</td><td>Comprehensive AMD support, notably including the massive TR4 Threadripper socket alongside current Ryzen platforms.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Block: 83 x 59 x 14 mm</td><td>A low-profile water block design ensures maximum clearance for large RAM modules and VRM heatsinks.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>5 Years</td><td>An industry-leading 5-year warranty that provides absolute peace of mind and protects your premium hardware investment.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 16000.00, 16000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/eP0Tlb2Aj1GrySpHlaODakT78d0coO9IAjcxPITb.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 13:41:44', '2026-06-13 13:41:57', 'High-Performance 270W TDP Liquid CPU Cooler | AM5 & TR4 Ready', 'Maximize your PC\'s cooling with this 270W TDP Liquid Cooler. Features highly durable Teflon tubing, 2000 RPM fans, TR4/AM5 support, and a 5-year warranty.', '270W TDP liquid cooler, TR4 liquid CPU cooler, Intel LGA 1700 cooler, AMD AM5 liquid cooler, Teflon tubing AIO, Threadripper cooler, high performance PC cooling, 2000 RPM AIO fans', NULL, 27, NULL, NULL);
