(577, 'ViewSonic Projector LS831WU 4500 Lumens WUXGA Ultra-Short Throw Laser DLP', 'This 4500 ANSI lumens WUXGA laser short throw projector delivers ultra-clear visuals with 3,000,000:1 contrast, 20,000-hour laser life, and HDBaseT connectivity. Ideal for classrooms, auditoriums, and professional installations.', 'viewsonic-projector-ls831wu-4500-lumens-wuxga-ultra-short-throw-laser-dlp-1781358143', '<p>The <strong>4500 ANSI Lumens WUXGA Laser Short Throw Projector</strong> is a powerful professional-grade projection system designed for large-scale presentations, classrooms, training centers, and auditorium environments. With its advanced <strong>laser phosphor light source</strong>, it delivers bright, stable, and maintenance-free performance for up to <strong>20,000 hours</strong>.</p><p>Featuring a <strong>WUXGA (1920×1200) high-resolution display</strong>, this projector produces sharp, detailed visuals suitable for high-definition content, data presentations, and multimedia applications. The ultra-high <strong>3,000,000:1 contrast ratio</strong> ensures deep blacks and vivid brightness for exceptional image clarity.</p><p>Its <strong>short throw capability (0.1m – 0.7m)</strong> allows large image projection from very short distances, making it ideal for tight installation spaces and reducing shadow interference during presentations.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>HDBaseT, HDMI 2.2, VGA, RCA, S-Video, RS232, USB, and network connectivity</strong>, this projector ensures seamless integration with modern AV systems, control systems, and legacy devices.</p><p>The <strong>10W built-in speaker</strong> provides clear audio output, while multiple audio input/output options allow flexible sound system integration.</p><p>Built with durability and professional installation in mind, the projector supports <strong>16:10 aspect ratio</strong>, large screen sizes up to <strong>508 cm</strong>, and flexible mounting options. Its solid construction (9.9 kg) ensures stable ceiling or fixed installation performance.</p><p>Backed by <strong>International Office Solution (IOS)</strong>, this projector guarantees reliable performance and professional after-sales support.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>Projection System</td><td>DLP Lamp</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>Native</td><td>WUXGA (1920 × 1200)</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>Output</td><td>4500 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>Dynamic</td><td>3,000,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Image Size</td><td>Projection Range</td><td>178 cm – 508 cm</td></tr><tr><td>Throw Distance</td><td>Short Throw</td><td>0.1 m – 0.7 m</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>Display Format</td><td>16:10</td></tr><tr><td>Light Source</td><td>Type</td><td>Laser Phosphor</td></tr><tr><td>Laser Life</td><td>Duration</td><td>20,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Power</td><td>Consumption</td><td>67W</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Speaker</td><td>10W Built-in</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Video Inputs</td><td>HDMI ×2, VGA In/Out, Composite, S-Video</td></tr><tr><td>Network</td><td>Control</td><td>HDBaseT, RJ45 LAN</td></tr><tr><td>Control</td><td>Ports</td><td>RS232, USB, 12V Trigger</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Ports</td><td>Audio In (Mini Jack/RCA), Audio Out</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Consumption</td><td>504W (100–240V AC)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>Net Weight</td><td>9.9 kg</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>Size</td><td>15 × 49 × 39 cm</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Body</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Service</td><td>2 Years Parts &amp; Service</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Warranty</td><td>Coverage</td><td>1 Year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/PBKYPwJkZz05jjE4r8RHgltFbNU2lrXQcV5f2GUy.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-06-13 13:42:23', '2026-06-13 13:42:23', '4500 ANSI Lumens WUXGA Laser Short Throw Projector HDBaseT 20,000H Life | IOS Bangladesh', 'Buy 4500 ANSI lumens WUXGA laser short throw projector with 3,000,000:1 contrast, HDBaseT, HDMI 2.2, and 20,000-hour laser life. Best for classrooms & auditoriums.', 'laser projector, wuxga projector, short throw projector, 4500 ansi lumens projector, hdbaseT projector, classroom projector, auditorium projector, professional projector, ios projector, international office solution, high brightness projector, dlp laser projector', NULL, 45, NULL, NULL),
(578, 'Gamdias AURA GL240 V2 WH ARGB Liquid CPU Cooler', 'The Premium 240mm ARGB Liquid CPU Cooler is a sleek, high-performance thermal solution designed for enthusiasts who demand both extreme cooling and a clean, cable-free aesthetic. Featuring a rotatable pump housing with a premium brushed-plating finish, hidden cable routing, and an upgraded copper base powered by a 12-slot 10-pole motor, it effectively manages heat via a new fluid running system. With dual hydraulic PWM fans pushing 73.6 CFM of airflow and universal compatibility across modern Intel (LGA 1700/2066) and AMD (AM5/AM4) platforms, this cooler is the ultimate upgrade for your custom build, backed by a comprehensive 5-year warranty.', 'gamdias-aura-gl240-v2-wh-argb-liquid-cpu-cooler-1781358175', '<p>Transform the visual and thermal performance of your desktop with the <strong>Premium 240mm ARGB Liquid CPU Cooler</strong>. Engineered for PC builders who prioritize a \"clean-build\" aesthetic, this cooler features innovative hidden cable routing and a fully rotatable pump housing with a luxurious brushed-plating finish, allowing you to achieve a perfect orientation and tidy look in any chassis. Beneath its sophisticated exterior lies a high-performance cooling engine driven by a 12-slot 10-pole motor and an upgraded copper base plate, ensuring efficient heat transfer from your CPU to the dense aluminum radiator.</p><p>Cooling is managed by a new fluid running system that enhances thermal dissipation, supported by two high-static-pressure hydraulic PWM fans. Operating between 800 and 1800 RPM, these fans move an impressive 73.6 CFM of air to rapidly clear heat from the radiator fins. The system offers unparalleled lighting versatility, featuring 30 pre-programmed built-in lighting effects right out of the box, with full support for 5V 3-pin addressable motherboard RGB synchronization for deeper system integration.</p><p>Designed for maximum versatility, this AIO cooler offers a universal mounting system that makes installation incredibly simple across nearly every modern and legacy CPU architecture. Whether you are running the latest Intel LGA 1700 or AMD AM5 processors, or even legacy platforms like AM3+ or LGA 115x, this cooler provides the necessary hardware for a secure, fast installation. Backed by a robust 5-year warranty, it is a highly reliable and visually stunning centerpiece for any high-performance PC build.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Advanced Design</strong></td><td>Rotatable Pump, Hidden Cable Routing</td><td>A brushed-plating finish and hidden cables ensure a clean, professional aesthetic that is fully adjustable to your build\'s orientation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>12-slot 10-pole Motor, Copper Base</td><td>Upgraded thermal hardware ensures efficient, rapid heat transfer and long-term operational stability.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fluid Management</strong></td><td>New Fluid Running System</td><td>An optimized liquid flow design significantly improves thermal dissipation rates under heavy load.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>800 - 1800 RPM, 73.6 CFM Airflow</td><td>Hydraulic PWM fans provide a balance of high-volume airflow and quiet, long-lasting performance.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics &amp; Lighting</strong></td><td>30 Built-in Effects, Motherboard ARGB Sync</td><td>Choose from 30 vibrant internal lighting effects or sync perfectly with your motherboard\'s digital RGB ecosystem.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Build Quality</strong></td><td>EPDM Tubing</td><td>Premium EPDM rubber tubing ensures long-term durability and minimal liquid evaporation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 1700, 1200, 115x, 2011, 2066</td><td>Comprehensive support for modern and enthusiast-grade Intel platforms.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM5, AM4, AM3/2, FM2/1</td><td>Universal AMD support for the latest Ryzen processors and a wide range of legacy architectures.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>5 Years</td><td>An industry-leading 5-year warranty provides peace of mind for your high-end PC investment.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/dbzsgMvHb4iorxnfzstlSjImHdQDymAHWZkKYCYV.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 13:42:55', '2026-06-13 13:43:57', 'Premium 240mm ARGB Liquid CPU Cooler | AM5 & LGA 1700 Ready', 'Elevate your build with the Premium 240mm ARGB Liquid Cooler. Features a rotatable pump, hidden cable routing, 30 lighting effects, and a 5-year warranty.', '240mm ARGB liquid cooler, rotatable pump AIO, liquid CPU cooler with screen, Intel LGA 1700 cooler, AMD AM5 liquid cooler, hidden cable AIO, ARGB PC cooling, high performance liquid cooler, EPDM tubing AIOg effects, and a 5-year warranty.', NULL, 27, NULL, NULL),
(579, 'Gamdias AURA GL360 V2 WH ARGB Liquid CPU Cooler', 'The Premium 360mm ARGB Liquid CPU Cooler is a sleek, high-performance thermal solution designed for enthusiasts who demand both extreme cooling and a clean, cable-free aesthetic. Featuring a fully rotatable pump housing with a brushed-plating finish, hidden cable routing, and an upgraded copper base powered by a 12-slot 10-pole motor, it effectively manages heat via a new fluid running system. With triple high-performance hydraulic PWM fans pushing 73.6 CFM of airflow and universal compatibility across modern Intel (LGA 1700/2066) and AMD (AM5/AM4) platforms, this 360mm powerhouse is the ultimate upgrade for your custom build, backed by a comprehensive 5-year warranty.', 'gamdias-aura-gl360-v2-wh-argb-liquid-cpu-cooler-1781358397', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>Transform the visual and thermal performance of your desktop with the <strong>Premium 360mm ARGB Liquid CPU Cooler</strong>. Engineered for PC builders who prioritize a \"clean-build\" aesthetic, this cooler features innovative hidden cable routing and a fully rotatable pump housing with a luxurious brushed-plating finish, allowing you to achieve perfect orientation and a tidy look in any chassis. Beneath its sophisticated exterior lies a high-performance cooling engine driven by a 12-slot 10-pole motor and an upgraded copper base plate, ensuring efficient, rapid heat transfer from your high-wattage CPU to the dense 396mm aluminum radiator.</p><p>Cooling is managed by a new fluid running system that significantly enhances thermal dissipation, supported by three high-static-pressure hydraulic PWM fans. Operating between 800 and 1800 RPM, these fans move an impressive 73.6 CFM of air to rapidly clear heat from the radiator fins. The system offers unparalleled lighting versatility, featuring 30 pre-programmed built-in lighting effects right out of the box, with full support for 5V 3-pin addressable motherboard RGB synchronization for deeper system integration.</p><p>Designed for maximum versatility, this AIO cooler offers a universal mounting system that makes installation incredibly simple across nearly every modern and legacy CPU architecture. Whether you are running the latest Intel LGA 1700 or AMD AM5 processors, or even legacy platforms like AM3+ or LGA 115x, this cooler provides the necessary hardware for a secure, fast installation. Backed by a robust 5-year warranty, it is a highly reliable and visually stunning centerpiece for any high-performance PC build.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Advanced Design</strong></td><td>Rotatable Pump, Hidden Cable Routing</td><td>Brushed-plating finish and hidden cables ensure a clean, professional aesthetic that is fully adjustable to your build\'s orientation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>12-slot 10-pole Motor, Copper Base</td><td>Upgraded thermal hardware ensures efficient, rapid heat transfer and long-term operational stability.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fluid Management</strong></td><td>New Fluid Running System</td><td>An optimized liquid flow design significantly improves thermal dissipation rates under heavy load.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>800 - 1800 RPM, 73.6 CFM Airflow</td><td>Triple hydraulic PWM fans provide a balance of high-volume airflow and quiet, long-lasting performance.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics &amp; Lighting</strong></td><td>30 Built-in Effects, Motherboard ARGB Sync</td><td>Choose from 30 vibrant internal lighting effects or sync perfectly with your motherboard\'s digital RGB ecosystem.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Build Quality</strong></td><td>EPDM Tubing</td><td>Premium EPDM rubber tubing ensures long-term durability and minimal liquid evaporation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 1700, 1200, 115x, 2011, 2066</td><td>Comprehensive support for modern and enthusiast-grade Intel platforms.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM5, AM4, AM3/2, FM2/1</td><td>Universal AMD support for the latest Ryzen processors and a wide range of legacy architectures.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Radiator: 396 x 120 x 27 mm</td><td>A large 360mm footprint designed to maximize surface area for extreme thermal dissipation in mid and full towers.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>5 Years</td><td>An industry-leading 5-year warranty provides peace of mind for your high-end PC investment.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/lq6lyvJlDuGhvhNHVsljAUs78uh5s5jMVOUCExUi.png', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 13:46:37', '2026-06-13 13:46:37', 'Premium 360mm ARGB Liquid CPU Cooler | AM5 & LGA 1700 Ready', 'Elevate your build with the Premium 360mm ARGB Liquid Cooler. Features a rotatable pump, hidden cable routing, 30 lighting effects, and a 5-year warranty.', '360mm ARGB liquid cooler, rotatable pump AIO, liquid CPU cooler, Intel LGA 1700 cooler, AMD AM5 liquid cooler, hidden cable AIO, ARGB PC cooling, high performance liquid cooler, EPDM tubing AIO', NULL, 27, NULL, NULL),
(580, 'Gamdias BOREAS E1L-010 RGB CPU Air Cooler', 'The Compact Performance Air CPU Cooler is a specialized, low-profile thermal solution engineered for space-constrained builds, such as Mini-ITX or HTPC chassis. Measuring just 69mm in height, this cooler features a dense aluminum fin array and a high-performance 137mm PWM fan that balances efficient cooling with whisper-quiet acoustics ranging from 10 to 30 dBA. Offering reliable thermal management for modern Intel (LGA 1700/1200) processors and backed by a 2-year warranty, it provides an essential, space-saving cooling solution for compact desktop systems.', 'gamdias-boreas-e1l-010-rgb-cpu-air-cooler-1781358496', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>For PC builders prioritizing small-form-factor design without sacrificing system stability, the <strong>Compact Performance Air CPU Cooler</strong> is the ideal thermal component. Designed specifically for tighter spaces where standard tower coolers cannot fit, this unit maintains a remarkably slim profile of only 69mm in total height. Despite its compact footprint, it utilizes a high-surface-area aluminum fin stack optimized for rapid heat dissipation in confined airflow environments.</p><p>The cooling system is driven by a large 137mm PWM-controlled fan, which provides a significantly larger surface coverage than standard smaller-profile fans. Operating across a dynamic speed range of 800 to 2000 RPM, the fan generates a capable 39.8 CFM of airflow and a static pressure of 1.63 mmH2O. This ensures your processor remains well-ventilated, even within restricted case volumes. Acoustically, the cooler is highly unobtrusive; thanks to the precision PWM control, it maintains a tranquil 10 dBA during light computing tasks and remains at a well-managed 30 dBA under heavy loads, ensuring your workstation remains a quiet environment.</p><p>Installation is straightforward, with native support for a wide array of Intel sockets, including modern LGA 1700 and the versatile LGA 1200 and 115x series. Backed by a 2-year warranty, this cooler is a reliable, high-value investment for builders looking to maximize their compact PC\'s performance and</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Design Type</strong></td><td>Low-Profile Air Cooler</td><td>An ultra-compact 69mm total height makes this the perfect thermal solution for Mini-ITX and HTPC builds.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Build</strong></td><td>Aluminum Fin Array</td><td>High-density aluminum fin design maximizes the heat dissipation surface area in a constrained footprint.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>137mm Fan, 800 - 2000 RPM</td><td>A larger-than-standard fan size ensures superior airflow coverage over the heatsink compared to traditional small-form-factor coolers.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustics &amp; Airflow</strong></td><td>10 - 30 dBA, 39.8 CFM</td><td>Provides a quiet operating environment (10 dBA at idle) while maintaining necessary airflow for standard system loads.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 1700, 1200, 115x</td><td>Complete mounting support ensures secure, easy installation on modern mainstream Intel platforms.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>137 x 137 x 69 mm</td><td>A minimalist footprint designed specifically for high compatibility with compact motherboard layouts and chassis.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>2 Years</td><td>A dependable 2-year warranty that protects your hardware investment.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'CPU Cooler', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/IszSO2g999msEQLb0bBYTu7lfXjVRYwD5prdktb5.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 13:48:16', '2026-06-13 13:48:16', 'Compact Low-Profile CPU Air Cooler | LGA 1700 Ready', 'Optimize your small-form-factor PC with this Compact Air CPU Cooler. Features a 137mm fan, low 69mm profile, and support for Intel LGA 1700/1200.', 'low profile CPU cooler, Mini-ITX CPU cooler, HTPC air cooler, compact CPU fan, 137mm CPU cooler, Intel LGA 1700 air cooler, quiet CPU cooler, small form factor cooling, 69mm CPU cooler', NULL, 27, NULL, NULL),
(581, 'ViewSonic Projector LS850WU 5000 Lumen WUXGA Laser DLP', 'This 5000 ANSI lumens WUXGA laser projector delivers ultra-bright, high-contrast visuals with 3,000,000:1 contrast ratio, HDBaseT connectivity, and 20,000-hour laser life. Perfect for auditoriums, classrooms, and large venues.', 'viewsonic-projector-ls850wu-5000-lumen-wuxga-laser-dlp-1781358517', '<p>The <strong>5000 ANSI Lumens WUXGA Laser Phosphor Projector</strong> is a premium high-performance projection solution designed for large-scale environments such as auditoriums, lecture halls, training centers, and corporate boardrooms. With its powerful <strong>laser phosphor light source</strong>, it delivers consistent brightness, superior color accuracy, and long-lasting performance without traditional lamp replacement hassles.</p><p>Featuring <strong>WUXGA (1920×1200) native resolution</strong>, this projector ensures sharp, detailed, and professional-quality visuals ideal for presentations, HD videos, and data-intensive content. The ultra-high <strong>3,000,000:1 contrast ratio</strong> enhances depth, producing deeper blacks and brighter whites for an immersive viewing experience.</p><p>Its flexible <strong>projection range from 0.9m to 14.1m</strong> supports both medium and large venue installations. The <strong>16:10 aspect ratio</strong> is optimized for business and educational content, ensuring maximum screen utilization.</p><p>Equipped with a durable <strong>67W laser phosphor light engine</strong>, the projector provides up to <strong>20,000 hours of maintenance-free operation</strong>, significantly reducing long-term ownership costs.</p><p>Connectivity is highly versatile, including <strong>HDMI 1.4 (x2), HDBaseT, VGA In/Out, Composite, S-Video, USB ports, RS232 control, and RJ45 network support</strong>, ensuring seamless integration with modern AV systems and legacy devices.</p><p>A built-in <strong>10W speaker</strong> delivers clear audio output, while multiple audio input/output options allow flexible sound system integration.</p><p>With a compact yet robust design (6.4 kg), this projector is ideal for fixed installation in professional environments requiring reliability, brightness, and performance.</p><p>Backed by <strong>International Office Solution (IOS)</strong>, it ensures trusted service support and long-term reliability.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>Projection System</td><td>DLP Lamp</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>Native</td><td>WUXGA (1920 × 1200)</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>Output</td><td>5000 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>Dynamic</td><td>3,000,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Image Size</td><td>Projection Range</td><td>76 cm – 762 cm</td></tr><tr><td>Throw Distance</td><td>Range</td><td>0.9 m – 14.1 m</td></tr><tr><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>Display Format</td><td>16:10</td></tr><tr><td>Light Source</td><td>Type</td><td>Laser Phosphor</td></tr><tr><td>Laser Life</td><td>Duration</td><td>20,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Power</td><td>Consumption</td><td>67W</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Speaker</td><td>10W Built-in</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Video Inputs</td><td>HDMI ×2, VGA In/Out, Composite, S-Video</td></tr><tr><td>Network</td><td>Control</td><td>HDBaseT, RJ45 LAN</td></tr><tr><td>Control</td><td>Ports</td><td>RS232, USB ×2, 12V Trigger</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Ports</td><td>Audio In (Mini Jack/RCA), Audio Out</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Consumption</td><td>460W (100–240V AC)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>Net Weight</td><td>6.4 kg</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>Size</td><td>14 × 40 × 30 cm</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Body</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Service</td><td>2 Years Parts &amp; Service</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Warranty</td><td>Coverage</td><td>1 Year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/wGw3eE267Q9isOL2x4SVtSU0FoBuxLRDbDbZmU8y.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 13:48:37', '2026-06-23 13:13:34', '5000 ANSI Lumens WUXGA Laser Projector HDBaseT 20,000H Life 3M:1 Contrast | IOS Bangladesh', 'Buy 5000 ANSI lumens WUXGA laser phosphor projector with 3,000,000:1 contrast, HDBaseT, HDMI x2, and 20,000-hour lamp life. Best for auditorium and business use.', 'laser projector, wuxga projector, 5000 ansi lumens projector, hdbaseT projector, auditorium projector, classroom projector, high brightness projector, business projector, ios projector, international office solution, dlp projector, professional projector', NULL, 45, NULL, NULL),
(582, 'Gamdias BOREAS E1-410 MONO CPU Air Cooler', 'The Performance Tower CPU Air Cooler is a robust and highly efficient thermal solution engineered for high-performance desktop processors. Built around a precision-engineered heatsink with copper heat pipes for rapid thermal transfer, it effectively manages heat for demanding gaming and productivity workloads. Equipped with a high-airflow 120mm PWM fan that operates within a quiet 10–31 dBA range, this cooler delivers an exceptional balance of cooling power and acoustic comfort. Boasting massive, near-universal compatibility with a wide range of Intel and AMD platforms, this 154.5mm tall tower cooler is a reliable, high-value choice for any desktop build, backed by a 3-year warranty.', 'gamdias-boreas-e1-410-mono-cpu-air-cooler-1781358630', '<p>Maximize your processor\'s potential and maintain optimal system temperatures with the <strong>Performance Tower CPU Air Cooler</strong>. Designed for PC builders who demand reliable, uncompromising air cooling, this tower cooler is built around a highly efficient thermal engine. At the core of its design is a premium heatsink featuring a dense array of aluminum fins and integrated copper heat pipes, ensuring instantaneous thermal transfer straight from the CPU die and rapid dissipation into the surrounding airflow.</p><p>To actively clear this thermal energy, the cooler is equipped with a high-performance 120mm PWM-controlled fan. Operating across a dynamic speed range of 800 to 2000 RPM, the fan generates a substantial, high-volume airflow of 70.2 CFM and a strong static pressure of 2.7 mmH2O, easily forcing fresh air through the heatsink. Despite this impressive cooling power, the acoustic profile remains highly manageable. Thanks to precise PWM control, the cooler operates at a virtually silent 10 dBA during idle tasks and peaks at a highly reasonable 31 dBA under maximum system stress, ensuring your workspace remains quiet during focus-heavy tasks.</p><p>Beyond its performance, this air cooler is exceptionally versatile. With a total height of 154.5mm, it fits comfortably inside the vast majority of modern mid-tower chassis. Providing comprehensive mounting hardware for a vast array of processor architectures—including mainstream Intel sockets (LGA 1700/1200) and an extensive list of AMD platforms (AM4 and older)—it is ready for both modern builds and hardware legacy upgrades. Backed by a solid 3-year warranty, this performance cooler is a dependable, high-value investment for any desktop PC.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Specification</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Copper Heatpipes, Aluminum Fin Stack</td><td>Premium thermal materials guarantee rapid heat absorption and highly efficient heat dissipation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>120mm Fan, 800 - 2000 RPM, 70.2 CFM</td><td>A wide PWM-controlled RPM range ensures massive airflow to prevent thermal throttling during intense sessions.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustics &amp; Pressure</strong></td><td>10 - 31 dBA, 2.7 mmH2O</td><td>High static pressure easily forces air through the fins while maintaining a remarkably quiet operating environment.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 2066, 1700, 1200, 115x, 1366</td><td>Exceptionally broad mounting support ensures secure installation on modern boards and enthusiast-grade Intel platforms.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM4, AM3, AM2, FM2, FM1</td><td>Universal AMD support for the widely popular AM4 platform and a comprehensive range of legacy architectures.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Cooler Total: 120 x 73.8 x 154.5 mm</td><td>A compact yet highly efficient tower footprint optimized for compatibility with most mid-tower PC cases.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>3 Years</td><td>A dependable 3-year warranty that provides absolute peace of mind and protects your hardware investment.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/vCT18cdNkLle6XzwkQbybsQNjwDyT5GktF4dCvlb.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 13:50:30', '2026-06-13 13:50:30', 'Performance Tower CPU Air Cooler | LGA 1700 & AM4 Ready', 'Maximize CPU cooling with this Performance Tower Air Cooler. Features copper heat pipes, 2000 RPM PWM fan, and broad compatibility for Intel & AMD sockets.', 'tower CPU cooler, air CPU cooler, copper heatpipe cooler, Intel LGA 1700 air cooler, AMD AM4 CPU cooler, quiet CPU fan, 2000 RPM PWM cooler, PC thermal solution', NULL, 27, NULL, NULL),
(583, 'Gamdias BOREAS E1-410 LITE RGB CPU Air Cooler', 'The Performance Tower CPU Air Cooler with Fixed RGB is a high-efficiency thermal solution designed to combine solid cooling performance with vibrant, plug-and-play aesthetics. Featuring a precision-engineered heatsink with copper heat pipes for rapid thermal transfer and a high-airflow 120mm PWM fan, it is perfectly suited for gaming and productivity. With eye-catching fixed RGB lighting and broad, near-universal compatibility across modern Intel and AMD platforms, this 154.5mm tall tower cooler provides an excellent balance of cooling power, ease of use, and visual style, all backed by a 2-year warranty.', 'gamdias-boreas-e1-410-lite-rgb-cpu-air-cooler-1781358710', '<p>Maximize your processor\'s potential and maintain optimal temperatures with the <strong>Performance Tower CPU Air Cooler with Fixed RGB</strong>. Designed for PC builders who want a balance of reliable thermal management and an immediate visual upgrade, this cooler features a high-performance heatsink core built from a dense array of aluminum fins and integrated copper heat pipes. This combination ensures instantaneous thermal transfer from the CPU die, facilitating rapid heat dissipation into the surrounding airflow.</p><p>To actively clear thermal energy, the cooler is equipped with a high-performance 120mm PWM-controlled fan. Operating across a dynamic speed range of 800 to 2000 RPM, the fan generates a substantial 70.2 CFM of airflow and a strong 2.7 mmH2O static pressure, effectively forcing fresh air through the heatsink stack. The fan also features integrated Fixed RGB lighting, providing an instant color boost to your build without the need for complex software or extra controllers. Despite this performance, the cooler maintains a quiet acoustic profile, operating between 10 dBA at idle and a manageable 31 dBA under heavy load.</p><p>Installation is straightforward and versatile, with comprehensive mounting hardware for a vast array of processor architectures—including modern Intel sockets like LGA 1700 and an extensive list of AMD platforms (AM4 and older). With a total height of 154.5mm, it fits comfortably inside most mid-tower cases while providing a high-value cooling solution for your rig. Backed by a 2-year warranty, this cooler is a dependable and stylish choice for any desktop PC.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Copper Heatpipes, Aluminum Fin Stack</td><td>Premium thermal materials guarantee rapid heat absorption and efficient thermal dissipation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>120mm Fan, 800 - 2000 RPM, 70.2 CFM</td><td>A wide PWM-controlled RPM range ensures massive, reliable airflow to prevent thermal throttling.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustics &amp; Pressure</strong></td><td>10 - 31 dBA, 2.7 mmH2O</td><td>High static pressure easily forces air through the fins while maintaining a remarkably quiet operating environment.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics</strong></td><td>Fixed RGB Lighting</td><td>Integrated lighting provides an immediate visual upgrade with no complex software or controller setup required.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 2066, 1700, 1200, 115x, 1366</td><td>Exceptionally broad mounting support ensures secure installation on modern and enthusiast Intel boards.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM4, AM3, AM2, FM2, FM1</td><td>Universal AMD support for the widely popular AM4 platform and a comprehensive range of legacy architectures.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Cooler Total: 120 x 73.8 x 154.5 mm</td><td>A compact yet efficient tower footprint optimized for high compatibility with standard PC cases.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>2 Years</td><td>A dependable 2-year warranty that provides peace of mind and protects your hardware investment.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'CPU Cooler', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/A2bhujeqRRpl0bx925YdDP2p7LYffCSLGDaSeYpr.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 13:51:50', '2026-06-13 13:51:50', 'Performance Tower CPU Air Cooler with Fixed RGB | LGA 1700 & AM4', 'Upgrade your cooling with this Performance Tower Air Cooler. Features fixed RGB lighting, 4 copper heat pipes, 2000 RPM PWM fan, and broad Intel/AMD socket support.', 'tower CPU cooler, fixed RGB CPU cooler, air CPU cooler, copper heatpipe cooler, Intel LGA 1700 air cooler, AMD AM4 CPU cooler, quiet RGB CPU fan, 2000 RPM PWM cooler, budget PC cooling', NULL, 27, NULL, NULL),
(584, 'Gamdias BOREAS E1-410 CPU Air Cooler', 'The Performance Tower ARGB Air CPU Cooler is a robust thermal solution engineered for high-performance desktop processors, blending exceptional cooling efficiency with striking aesthetics. Featuring a precision-engineered heatsink with direct-contact copper heat pipes and a high-performance 120mm PWM fan, it delivers excellent heat dissipation for intense gaming and productivity workloads. With support for 5V 3-pin Addressable RGB motherboard synchronization and a bonus \"Rainbow\" lighting effect, this 154.5mm tall cooler is a visual and thermal standout, backed by a 3-year warranty for long-term peace of mind.The Performance Tower ARGB Air CPU Cooler is a robust thermal solution engineered for high-performance desktop processors, blending exceptional cooling efficiency with striking aesthetics. Featuring a precision-engineered heatsink with direct-contact copper heat pipes and a high-performance 120mm PWM fan, it delivers excellent heat dissipation for intense gaming and productivity workloads. With support for 5V 3-pin Addressable RGB motherboard synchronization and a bonus \"Rainbow\" lighting effect, this 154.5mm tall cooler is a visual and thermal standout, backed by a 3-year warranty for long-term peace of mind.', 'gamdias-boreas-e1-410-cpu-air-cooler-1781358769', '<p>Maximize your processor\'s performance and transform your rig\'s appearance with the <strong>Performance Tower ARGB Air CPU Cooler</strong>. Designed for PC builders who demand both reliable cooling and sophisticated aesthetics, this cooler features a highly efficient thermal engine. At its core, premium copper heat pipes make direct contact with the CPU, ensuring rapid thermal transfer into the dense aluminum fin stack. This design allows for sustained, high-wattage performance without the risk of thermal throttling.</p><p>Cooling is managed by a high-static-pressure 120mm PWM fan. Operating across a wide 800–2000 RPM range, the fan provides \"exceptional PWM airflow regulation,\" scaling dynamically with your system load to maintain the perfect balance between high-volume airflow and acoustic comfort. It remains whisper-quiet at just 10 dBA during idle or light tasks and peaks at a modest 31 dBA during heavy load.</p><p>Aesthetically, the cooler is designed to be a centerpiece. It features a stunning, bonus \"Rainbow\" LED effect right out of the box and supports advanced 5V 3-pin Addressable (Digital) RGB header synchronization, allowing you to match your cooler’s lighting perfectly with your motherboard\'s software ecosystem. With broad compatibility ranging from enthusiast-grade Intel LGA 2066 sockets to legacy AMD FM/AM platforms, this cooler is a versatile choice for both modern high-end builds and older system upgrades.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Copper Heatpipes, Aluminum Fins</td><td>High-thermal-conductivity materials guarantee rapid heat absorption and efficient dissipation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>800 - 2000 RPM, PWM Controlled</td><td>Dynamically adjusts speed to provide massive airflow when needed and near-silent operation when at idle.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustics &amp; Pressure</strong></td><td>10 - 31 dBA, 2.7 mmH2O</td><td>High static pressure easily forces air through the dense fin array to ensure maximum thermal efficiency.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics</strong></td><td>5V 3-pin ARGB &amp; Rainbow LED</td><td>Provides beautiful, customizable lighting that integrates perfectly with modern motherboard RGB ecosystems.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 2066, 1200, 115x, 1366, 775</td><td>Broad support ensures secure installation on almost any Intel platform built over the last decade.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM4, AM3/2, FM2/1</td><td>Universal support for the popular AM4 platform and an extensive list of legacy architectures.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Cooler Total: 120 x 73.8 x 154.5 mm</td><td>A compact tower footprint designed to ensure high compatibility within most standard mid-tower chassis.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>3 Years</td><td>A dependable 3-year warranty that protects your investment against manufacturing defects.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/VbaNYYkrwKIY3ESQJa3z9fHuhs95LoSdsSvPEIxN.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 13:52:49', '2026-06-13 13:52:49', 'Performance Tower ARGB CPU Cooler | LGA 1700 & AM4 Ready', ': Maximize CPU cooling with this Performance Tower ARGB Air Cooler. Features copper heat pipes, 2000 RPM PWM fan, addressable RGB sync, and broad socket support.', 'tower CPU cooler, ARGB air CPU cooler, addressable RGB CPU fan, copper heatpipe cooler, Intel LGA 1200 cooler, AMD AM4 CPU cooler, quiet ARGB fan, 2000 RPM PWM cooler, PC thermal solution', NULL, 27, NULL, NULL),
(585, 'Gamdias BOREAS E1-410 WH CPU Air Cooler', 'The Performance Tower ARGB Air CPU Cooler is a robust thermal solution engineered for high-performance desktop processors, blending efficient cooling with vibrant, customizable aesthetics. Featuring a precision-engineered heatsink with copper heat pipes for rapid thermal transfer and a high-airflow 120mm PWM fan, it effectively manages heat for demanding workloads. With support for 5V 3-pin Addressable RGB motherboard synchronization, this 154.5mm tall cooler is a visual and thermal standout for your custom rig, backed by a 2-year warranty for long-term peace of mind.', 'gamdias-boreas-e1-410-wh-cpu-air-cooler-1781358872', '<p>Maximize your processor\'s performance and transform your rig\'s appearance with the <strong>Performance Tower ARGB Air CPU Cooler</strong>. Designed for PC builders who demand both reliable cooling and sophisticated aesthetics, this cooler features a highly efficient thermal engine. At its core, premium copper heat pipes make direct contact with the CPU, ensuring rapid thermal transfer into the dense aluminum fin stack. This design allows for sustained, high-wattage performance without the risk of thermal throttling.</p><p>Cooling is managed by a high-static-pressure 120mm PWM fan. Operating across a wide 800–2000 RPM range, the fan scales dynamically with your system load to maintain the perfect balance between high-volume airflow and acoustic comfort. It remains whisper-quiet at just 10 dBA during idle or light tasks and peaks at a modest 31 dBA under heavy load.</p><p>Aesthetically, the cooler is designed to be a centerpiece. It supports advanced 5V 3-pin Addressable (Digital) RGB header synchronization, allowing you to match your cooler’s lighting perfectly with your motherboard\'s software ecosystem for a unified look. With broad compatibility ranging from enthusiast-grade Intel LGA 2066 sockets to legacy AMD FM/AM platforms, this cooler is a versatile choice for both modern high-end builds and older system upgrades. Backed by a 2-year warranty, this cooler is a dependable, high-value investment.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Copper Heatpipes, Aluminum Fins</td><td>High-thermal-conductivity materials guarantee rapid heat absorption and efficient dissipation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>800 - 2000 RPM, PWM Controlled</td><td>Dynamically adjusts speed to provide massive airflow when needed and near-silent operation when at idle.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustics &amp; Pressure</strong></td><td>10 - 31 dBA, 2.7 mmH2O</td><td>High static pressure easily forces air through the dense fin array to ensure maximum thermal efficiency.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics</strong></td><td>5V 3-pin ARGB Sync</td><td>Provides beautiful, customizable lighting that integrates perfectly with modern motherboard RGB ecosystems.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 2066, 1200, 115x, 1366</td><td>Broad support ensures secure installation on almost any Intel platform built over the last decade.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM4, AM3/2, FM2/1</td><td>Universal support for the popular AM4 platform and an extensive list of legacy architectures.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Cooler Total: 120 x 73.8 x 154.5 mm</td><td>A compact tower footprint designed to ensure high compatibility within most standard mid-tower chassis.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>2 Years</td><td>A dependable 2-year warranty that protects your investment against manufacturing defects.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/sfz7cjbIXEttzgi1HXDoOLYzHEdnNj9VZz2hl3H3.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 1, '2026-06-13 13:54:32', '2026-06-13 13:54:32', 'Performance Tower ARGB CPU Cooler | LGA 1700 & AM4 Ready', 'Maximize CPU cooling with this Performance Tower ARGB Air Cooler. Features copper heat pipes, 2000 RPM PWM fan, addressable RGB sync, and broad socket support.\r\n\r\nMeta Keywords: tower', 'tower CPU cooler, ARGB air CPU cooler, addressable RGB CPU fan, copper heatpipe cooler, Intel LGA 1200 cooler, AMD AM4 CPU cooler, quiet ARGB fan, 2000 RPM PWM cooler, PC thermal solution', NULL, 27, NULL, NULL),
(586, 'Gamdias ST-BOREAS E1-411 EX ARGB CPU Air Cooler', 'The High-Performance Dual-Fan CPU Air Cooler is a robust and highly efficient thermal solution engineered to tame modern desktop processors. Built around a thick base plate and four direct-contact copper heat pipes, it rapidly pulls heat into a dense aluminum fin stack. Equipped with dual 120mm PWM fans utilizing durable hydraulic bearings, it delivers a massive 70.2 CFM of airflow while operating between a whisper-quiet 10 to 31 dB(A). Boasting universal compatibility with the latest Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4) sockets, this 155mm tall tower cooler provides an exceptional balance of raw cooling power and acoustics, backed by a 3-year warranty.', 'gamdias-st-boreas-e1-411-ex-argb-cpu-air-cooler-1781358946', '<p>Maximize your processor\'s potential and maintain optimal system temperatures with the <strong>High-Performance Dual-Fan CPU Air Cooler</strong>. Designed for PC builders who demand reliable, uncompromising air cooling for heavy workloads and gaming, this tower cooler is built around a highly efficient thermal engine. At the core of its design is Direct Contact Technology, where four premium copper heat pipes rest precisely against a thick base plate for instantaneous thermal transfer straight from the CPU die. This heat is rapidly drawn up into a dense array of aluminum fins to ensure a massive surface area for heat dissipation.</p><p>To actively clear this thermal energy, the cooler features a formidable push-pull configuration using dual high-performance 120mm PWM fans. Built on long-lasting hydraulic bearings, these fans operate across a dynamic speed range of 800 to 2000 RPM. At peak performance, they generate a substantial, high-volume airflow of 70.2 CFM and a strong static pressure of 2.7 mmH20, easily forcing fresh air through the heatsink. Despite this impressive cooling power, the acoustic profile remains highly manageable. Thanks to precise PWM control, the cooler operates at a virtually silent 10 dB(A) during idle tasks and peaks at a highly reasonable 31 dB(A) under maximum system stress, ensuring your workspace remains quiet during focus-heavy tasks.</p><p>Beyond its raw cooling metrics, this air cooler is exceptionally versatile and future-proof. With a total height of 155mm, it fits comfortably inside the vast majority of modern mid-tower chassis. Providing comprehensive mounting hardware for the absolute latest CPU architectures—including Intel\'s new LGA 1851 and 1700 sockets, as well as AMD\'s AM5 and AM4 platforms—it is ready for both current builds and next-generation upgrades. Backed by a solid 3-year warranty, this dual-fan cooler is a dependable, high-value investment for any desktop PC.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Thick Base Plate, 4x Copper Heatpipes</td><td>Direct contact technology guarantees rapid, immediate heat absorption straight from the CPU surface.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Build</strong></td><td>High-Density Aluminum Fins</td><td>A premium alloy fin stack maximizes the total surface area available for thermal dissipation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Technology</strong></td><td>Dual 120mm Fans, Hydraulic Bearing</td><td>A dual-fan setup ensures maximum push-pull cooling efficiency while hydraulic bearings provide a long lifespan.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>800 - 2000 RPM, 70.2 CFM Airflow</td><td>A wide PWM-controlled RPM range ensures massive airflow to prevent thermal throttling during intense sessions.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustics &amp; Pressure</strong></td><td>10 - 31 dB(A), 2.7 mmH20</td><td>High static pressure easily forces air through the fins while maintaining a remarkably quiet operating environment at idle.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 1851, 1700, 1200, 115x</td><td>Completely future-proof mounting hardware ensures secure installation on both current and next-generation Intel boards.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM5, AM4</td><td>Fully supports the latest generation of advanced AMD Ryzen processors alongside the widely popular AM4 platform.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Cooler Total: 127 x 97 x 155 mm</td><td>A highly efficient tower footprint optimized to ensure excellent RAM and VRM clearance within most standard PC cases.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>3 Years</td><td>A dependable 3-year warranty that provides absolute peace of mind and protects your hardware investmen</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/81ja8p5CAAXCQQBQbpRIsPr1TIOtjATCJR7DAAML.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 13:55:46', '2026-06-13 13:55:46', 'High-Performance Dual-Fan CPU Air Cooler | AM5 & LGA 1851 Ready', 'Maximize CPU cooling with this Dual-Fan Air Cooler. Features 4 direct-contact copper heatpipes, 2000 RPM PWM fans, and support for Intel 1851 & AMD AM5.', 'dual fan CPU cooler, air CPU cooler, 4 heatpipe cooler, direct contact CPU cooler, Intel LGA 1851 cooler, AMD AM5 air cooler, quiet CPU fan, 2000 RPM PWM cooler, push pull CPU cooler\r\n\r\nWhat would yo', NULL, 27, NULL, NULL);
