(587, 'Gamdias BOREAS E2-410 Single Tower Air CPU Cooler', 'The Premium Matte Black Air CPU Cooler is a high-performance, stealthy thermal solution designed to seamlessly manage the heat of modern desktop processors while offering a sophisticated visual edge. Featuring a unique Diamond Gradient Top Cover, a sleek matte black finish, and five direct-contact copper heat pipes, it delivers exceptional cooling power and premium build quality. Equipped with a highly efficient 120mm PWM fan pushing 72.94 CFM of airflow and boasting broad compatibility with the latest Intel (LGA 1700/2066) and AMD (AM5/AM4) platforms, this 155mm-tall cooler offers a perfect blend of raw thermal performance and elegant design, all backed by a 3-year warranty.', 'gamdias-boreas-e2-410-single-tower-air-cpu-cooler-1781359031', '<p>Elevate your desktop\'s thermal management with the <strong>Premium Matte Black Air CPU Cooler</strong>. Designed for PC builders who prioritize stealthy aesthetics and highly reliable air cooling, this tower cooler provides a refined look for any high-performance build. At the core of its design is advanced Direct Contact Technology, utilizing five premium copper heat pipes that rest directly against a thick base plate for instantaneous, uninterrupted thermal transfer from the CPU die. This heat is rapidly drawn up into a dense array of aluminum fins, all beautifully coated in a premium matte black finish.</p><p>The standout feature of this cooler is its <strong>Diamond Gradient Top Cover</strong>, which adds a touch of modern, geometric flair to your system\'s interior, distinguishing it from standard black heatsinks. To actively clear thermal energy, the cooler features a formidable 120mm PWM fan built on a highly durable hydraulic bearing. Operating seamlessly between 800 and 1800 RPM, it generates a massive, high-volume airflow of 72.94 CFM and a strong static pressure of 2.63 mmH2O. Despite this impressive cooling power, the acoustic profile remains excellent, operating at a virtually silent 10 dBA during idle tasks and peaking at just 32 dBA under maximum system stress.</p><p>Beyond its performance and visual appeal, this air cooler is exceptionally versatile. With an optimized total height of 155mm, it fits comfortably inside the vast majority of modern mid-tower cases. Providing comprehensive mounting hardware for a vast array of processor architectures—including Intel\'s modern LGA 1700 and enthusiast 2066 sockets, as well as AMD\'s AM5 and AM4 platforms—it is ready for both mainstream builds and high-end workstations. Backed by a solid 3-year warranty, this matte black cooler is a dependable, high-value investment.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Aesthetic Design</strong></td><td>Diamond Gradient Top Cover</td><td>A sophisticated top-cover finish that adds unique visual depth to your PC build\'s interior.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Thick Base Plate, 5x Copper Heatpipes</td><td>Five direct-contact copper heat pipes guarantee incredibly rapid heat absorption straight from the CPU surface.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Build</strong></td><td>Matte Black Aluminum Fins</td><td>A dense, premium-coated fin stack maximizes thermal dissipation while providing a sleek, stealthy aesthetic.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>120mm Hydraulic Bearing, 800 - 1800 RPM</td><td>A durable PWM fan ensures a long lifespan and scales effectively to prevent thermal throttling during intense workloads.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Airflow &amp; Acoustics</strong></td><td>72.94 CFM Airflow, 10 - 32 dBA Noise</td><td>Delivers massive airflow and strong static pressure (2.63 mmH2O) while maintaining a whisper-quiet operating environment at idle.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 1700, 1200, 115x, 2011, 2066</td><td>Broad mounting support ensures seamless installation on modern mainstream boards and extreme enthusiast platforms.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM5, AM4</td><td>Fully supports the latest generation of advanced AMD Ryzen processors alongside the widely popular AM4 platform.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>120 x 73 x 155 mm</td><td>A highly compatible footprint optimized to easily clear standard RAM heights while fitting inside most mid-tower cases.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>3 Years</td><td>A dependable 3-year warranty that provides absolute peace of mind and protects your hardware investment against defects.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/Q6k4VJ8mMOarIkgzdFZn6RdWmAnRF7tJWTI5Fx3e.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 13:57:11', '2026-06-13 13:57:11', ': Premium Matte Black CPU Air Cooler | AM5 & LGA 1700 Ready', 'Upgrade your PC with this Premium Matte Black Air Cooler. Features a Diamond Gradient top cover, 5 direct-contact heat pipes, and a high-performance 72.94 CFM fan.', 'matte black CPU cooler, diamond gradient cooler, 5 heatpipe cooler, direct contact CPU cooler, Intel LGA 1700 cooler, AMD AM5 air cooler, quiet CPU fan, 1800 RPM PWM cooler, stealth PC cooling', NULL, 27, NULL, NULL),
(588, 'ViewSonic Projector PX748-4K 4000 ANSI Lumens 4K UHD Home', 'This 4000 ANSI lumens 4K UHD projector delivers ultra-clear 3840×2160 resolution with HDR-ready support, 12000:1 contrast, and up to 300-inch display size. Ideal for home theater, office presentations, and professional use.', 'viewsonic-projector-px748-4k-4000-ansi-lumens-4k-uhd-home-1781359061', '<p>The <strong>4000 ANSI Lumens 4K UHD Projector</strong> is designed for users who demand ultra-high-definition visuals combined with professional performance. With a true <strong>3840×2160 resolution</strong>, it delivers sharp, detailed, and cinematic-quality images suitable for both entertainment and business environments.</p><p>Featuring a brightness level of <strong>4000 ANSI lumens</strong>, this projector performs well in moderately lit environments, making it suitable for offices, meeting rooms, classrooms, and home theaters. The <strong>12000:1 contrast ratio</strong> enhances image depth by producing richer blacks and brighter whites.</p><p>The projector supports a wide <strong>screen size range from 30 inches up to 300 inches</strong>, offering flexible installation for small rooms and large venues. With a <strong>projection distance range of 0.75m to 9.76m</strong>, it ensures easy setup in different environments.</p><p>Equipped with a durable <strong>240W lamp system</strong>, it offers up to <strong>20,000 hours of life in SuperEco mode</strong>, reducing maintenance costs and increasing long-term reliability.</p><p>Advanced connectivity options include <strong>dual HDMI 2.0b ports (HDCP 2.2), USB Type-C, USB-A power output, 12V trigger, RS232 control, and RJ45 LAN</strong>, making it highly compatible with modern devices and professional AV systems.</p><p>A built-in <strong>10W speaker</strong> provides clear audio output, while low noise levels (33dB normal / 28dB eco) ensure quiet operation during presentations or movie viewing.</p><p>Compact and lightweight at <strong>2.8 kg</strong>, this projector is easy to install and suitable for ceiling mounting or portable use.</p><p>Backed by <strong>International Office Solution (IOS)</strong>, it ensures reliable performance and trusted after-sales support.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>Projection System</td><td>DLP</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>Native</td><td>3840 × 2160 (4K UHD)</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>Output</td><td>4000 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>Dynamic</td><td>12,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Image Size</td><td>Projection Range</td><td>30\" – 300\"</td></tr><tr><td>Throw Distance</td><td>Range</td><td>0.75 m – 9.76 m</td></tr><tr><td>Light Source</td><td>Type</td><td>Lamp</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Power</td><td>Consumption</td><td>240W</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Normal / Eco</td><td>4000 / 20000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Speaker</td><td>10W Built-in</td></tr><tr><td>Noise Level</td><td>Operation</td><td>33dB / 28dB</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Inputs</td><td>HDMI ×2 (2.0b), USB-C</td></tr><tr><td>Output</td><td>Ports</td><td>Audio Out (3.5mm), USB-A Power</td></tr><tr><td>Control</td><td>Ports</td><td>RS232, RJ45 LAN, 12V Trigger</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Consumption</td><td>310W (Normal), &lt;0.5W Standby</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>Net Weight</td><td>2.8 kg</td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>Size</td><td>312 × 222 × 108 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Body</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Service</td><td>1 Year</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Warranty</td><td>Coverage</td><td>1 Year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 192000.00, 192000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/KvwU8lm2lmwUQbDoETIJxnT6WOpleKwxbzWSejlF.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 13:57:41', '2026-06-13 13:57:41', '4000 ANSI Lumens 4K UHD Projector 3840x2160 HDMI 2.0b Home Theater & Office | IOS Bangladesh', 'Buy 4000 ANSI lumens 4K UHD projector with 3840×2160 resolution, HDMI 2.0b, USB-C, 12000:1 contrast, and 300” display support. Best for office & home use.', '4k projector, uhd projector, 4000 ansi lumens projector, home theater projector, office projector, hdmi 2.0b projector, usb c projector, ios projector, international office solution, high resolution projector, dlp projector, business projector', NULL, 45, NULL, NULL),
(589, 'Gamdias Boreas M1-610 ARGB CPU Cooler', 'The High-Performance ARGB Tower Air Cooler is a premium thermal solution designed for enthusiasts seeking both aggressive cooling capacity and sophisticated lighting control. Featuring an high-speed 2600 RPM fan that generates an impressive 3.9 mmH2O of static pressure and 74 CFM of airflow, it effectively handles high-wattage processors while remaining whisper-quiet under load (10–32 dBA). With full support for 5V 3-pin Addressable (Digital) RGB motherboard synchronization and broad compatibility across a vast range of Intel and AMD sockets, this 162.9mm tall tower cooler offers an exceptional balance of raw thermal power and modern aesthetic appeal, backed by a 2-year warranty.', 'gamdias-boreas-m1-610-argb-cpu-cooler-1781359087', '<p>Maximize your system\'s thermal overhead with the <strong>High-Performance ARGB Tower Air Cooler</strong>. Built for PC builders who refuse to compromise between cooling efficiency and a clean, vibrant aesthetic, this tower cooler is engineered to tackle intensive computing tasks, from professional rendering to enthusiast-level gaming. Its high-efficiency aluminum heatsink is paired with a powerful 120mm PWM fan that operates across a wide 800–2600 RPM range, providing the extreme airflow (74 CFM) and static pressure (3.9 mmH2O) necessary to force air through dense fin stacks and dissipate heat rapidly.</p><p>Acoustic balance is central to this design; the cooler utilizes precise PWM regulation to ensure that your system remains nearly silent at 10 dBA during idle periods while maintaining control under peak stress. Beyond performance, the cooler is a visual centerpiece. Featuring support for 5V 3-pin Addressable (Digital) RGB headers, it allows for seamless synchronization with your motherboard’s lighting software, enabling you to create a unified and immersive lighting ecosystem throughout your rig.</p><p>Versatility is a hallmark of this air cooler. Its mounting system provides comprehensive hardware for virtually every modern and legacy CPU architecture, covering everything from Intel’s LGA 2066 enthusiast platform to AMD’s widespread AM4 socket and older legacy formats. Standing at 162.9mm, it offers excellent cooling performance that fits comfortably within most mid-tower and full-tower chassis. Backed by a dependable 2-year warranty, this ARGB tower cooler is a secure and stylish investment for your next high-performance build.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>High-Efficiency Aluminum Heatsink</td><td>Optimized fin structure provides a massive surface area for rapid heat dissipation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>800 - 2600 RPM, 74 CFM Airflow</td><td>A highly dynamic RPM range ensures the cooling capacity scales perfectly with your CPU load.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustics &amp; Pressure</strong></td><td>10 - 32 dBA, 3.9 mmH2O</td><td>Exceptional static pressure capability makes this cooler ideal for performance setups while remaining quiet at idle.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics</strong></td><td>5V 3-pin Addressable (Digital) RGB</td><td>Enables advanced, per-LED customization and full synchronization with major motherboard RGB ecosystems.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 2066, 1200, 115x, 1366, 775</td><td>Extensive mounting support for both current and classic Intel processor architectures.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM4, AM3/2, FM2/1</td><td>Universal support for a massive range of AMD platforms, including popular AM4 and legacy FM/AM systems.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>123.9 x 76.1 x 162.9 mm</td><td>A high-performance tower footprint designed to maximize heat dissipation in most standard desktop chassis.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>2 Years</td><td>A reliable 2-year warranty that protects your hardware investment against manufacturing defects.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/EiNLLmtAXDUxpXZ0YGsTnZHyzLBPCLskCXdOWttb.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 13:58:07', '2026-06-13 13:58:07', 'High-Performance ARGB Tower Air Cooler | LGA 2066 & AM4 Ready', 'aximize CPU performance with this High-Performance ARGB Tower Air Cooler. Features 2600 RPM PWM fan, 3.9 mmH2O pressure, and 5V 3-pin ARGB sync s', 'tower CPU cooler, ARGB air CPU cooler, 2600 RPM fan, addressable RGB CPU cooler, high static pressure cooler, Intel LGA 1200 cooler, AMD AM4 CPU cooler, quiet ARGB fan, PC thermal solution', NULL, 27, NULL, NULL),
(590, 'Thermaltake UX400 Air CPU Cooler', NULL, 'thermaltake-ux400-air-cpu-cooler-1781359587', '<h3>&nbsp;</h3><p>Maximize your system\'s performance and ensure long-term stability with the <strong>Heavy-Duty 240W TDP Air CPU Cooler</strong>. Designed for PC builders who prioritize reliable, high-end thermal management, this tower cooler is built to tame processors with high heat loads, offering a substantial 240W TDP cooling capability. At its core, the design features four premium 6mm copper heat pipes that ensure rapid, efficient heat transfer away from the CPU surface into an expansive array of aluminum fins, maximizing the surface area available for dissipation.</p><p>To maintain optimal temperatures, the cooler features a high-performance 120mm PWM fan engineered for durability, boasting a 30,000-hour operational lifespan. Operating with sophisticated PWM regulation, the fan adjusts dynamically between 700 and 1800 RPM. This allows the system to remain whisper-quiet at just 25 dBA during standard workloads, while still providing the necessary 62.72 CFM of airflow when your CPU is under intense stress, such as during gaming or creative rendering.</p><p>Versatility is a core pillar of this design. The cooler includes comprehensive mounting hardware for an extensive list of processor architectures, ensuring future-proof support for the absolute latest Intel LGA 1851 and 1700 sockets, as well as the complete range of AMD platforms from the modern AM5 down to legacy FM and AM2 systems. With a dependable 5-year warranty, this cooler is a secure, high-value investment that promises consistent cooling performance for years to come.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Power</strong></td><td>240W TDP</td><td>Engineered with high thermal overhead to easily cool modern high-wattage processors under load.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>4x 6mm Copper Heatpipes</td><td>Multiple direct-contact-style heat pipes provide efficient thermal pathing from the CPU to the radiator fins.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>700 - 1800 RPM, 62.72 CFM</td><td>PWM regulation ensures the perfect balance of massive airflow and quiet operation depending on your specific needs.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustics</strong></td><td>25 dBA</td><td>Acoustically optimized components ensure a distraction-free environment even when the system is working hard.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Durability</strong></td><td>30,000-hour Fan Lifespan</td><td>High-quality internal components ensure long-term, trouble-free operation for your PC.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 1851, 1700, 1200, 115x</td><td>Complete support for the latest Intel architectures and older, widely used mainstream sockets.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM5, AM4, AM3/2, FM2/1</td><td>Universal support for the latest AMD Ryzen processors and a vast array of legacy AMD platforms.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>5 Years</td><td>An industry-leading 5-year warranty provides total peace of mind for your hardware investment.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 1950.00, 1950.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/FY11KLZpqnHkMfLg1nbcwtqX035o3IJaUWHsI0Km.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 14:06:27', '2026-06-13 17:38:17', 'Heavy-Duty 240W TDP Air CPU Cooler | AM5 & LGA 1851 Ready', 'Maximize CPU cooling with this 240W TDP Air Cooler. Features 4 copper heat pipes, 1800 RPM PWM fan, and support for Intel 1851 & AMD AM5.', '240W TDP air cooler, tower CPU cooler, copper heatpipe cooler, Intel LGA 1851 cooler, AMD AM5 air cooler, quiet CPU cooler, high performance CPU fan, 5 year warranty CPU cooler', NULL, 35, NULL, NULL),
(591, 'Thermaltake UX400 ARGB Sync AIR CPU Cooler', 'The Premium 240W TDP ARGB Air CPU Cooler is a high-performance thermal solution engineered to manage the heat of modern high-wattage processors while providing a vibrant visual upgrade. Featuring a robust 240W TDP cooling capacity, this cooler utilizes four high-efficiency 6mm copper heat pipes and a dense aluminum fin stack to rapidly dissipate thermal energy. Equipped with an addressable RGB (5V ARGB) PWM fan operating between 700 and 1800 RPM, it delivers a steady 62.72 CFM of airflow while maintaining a quiet 25 dBA acoustic profile. Backed by a comprehensive 5-year warranty and universal compatibility with the latest Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4) platforms, it is an exceptionally reliable and stylish choice for any custom PC build.', 'thermaltake-ux400-argb-sync-air-cpu-cooler-1781359681', '<p>Maximize your system\'s performance and aesthetic appeal with the <strong>Premium 240W TDP ARGB Air CPU Cooler</strong>. Designed for PC builders who prioritize both reliable thermal management and a stunning, customizable lighting ecosystem, this tower cooler is built to handle intensive gaming and creative workloads. Its thermal engine centers on four premium 6mm copper heat pipes that ensure rapid, efficient heat transfer away from the CPU die into an expansive aluminum fin array, providing the high-capacity heat dissipation needed for a 240W TDP rating.</p><p>Acoustic and thermal precision are at the heart of this cooler’s design. The included 120mm PWM fan is built for durability, boasting a 30,000-hour operational lifespan, and features an integrated 5V ARGB header for seamless synchronization with your motherboard\'s lighting software. Sophisticated PWM regulation allows the fan to adjust dynamically between 700 and 1800 RPM; this ensures your system remains whisper-quiet at just 25 dBA during standard tasks, while still delivering 62.72 CFM of airflow to keep temperatures low under heavy system stress.</p><p>Versatility is a core pillar of this design. The cooler includes universal mounting hardware for an extensive list of architectures, ensuring future-proof support for the latest Intel LGA 1851 and 1700 sockets, as well as the complete range of AMD platforms from the modern AM5 down to legacy FM and AM2 systems. With an industry-leading 5-year warranty, this cooler is a secure, high-value investment that promises consistent, high-performance cooling for years to come.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Power</strong></td><td>240W TDP</td><td>High thermal overhead ensures stable performance for overclocked and high-wattage modern processors.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>4x 6mm Copper Heatpipes</td><td>Advanced heat pipe design provides an efficient thermal path from the CPU to the radiator fins.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>700 - 1800 RPM, 62.72 CFM</td><td>PWM control offers the perfect balance of massive airflow and quiet operation based on current demand.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustics</strong></td><td>25 dBA</td><td>Acoustically optimized components ensure a distraction-free gaming or working environment.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics</strong></td><td>5V ARGB Header</td><td>Full motherboard synchronization allows for vibrant, immersive, and fully customizable lighting effects.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Durability</strong></td><td>30,000-hour Fan Lifespan</td><td>High-quality bearings and materials ensure long-term, trouble-free operation for your PC.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 1851, 1700, 1200, 115x</td><td>Complete support for the latest Intel architectures and older, widely used mainstream sockets.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM5, AM4, AM3/2, FM2/1</td><td>Universal support for the latest AMD Ryzen processors and a vast array of legacy AMD platforms.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>5 Years</td><td>An industry-leading 5-year warranty provides total peace of mind for your hardware investment.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 2200.00, 2200.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/aKHL0KvKjT73DUH9Ghfuqz6v8vuTKYVSqFGhSnry.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 14:08:01', '2026-06-13 14:08:01', 'Premium 240W TDP ARGB Air CPU Cooler | AM5 & LGA 1851 Ready', 'Maximize CPU cooling with this 240W TDP ARGB Air Cooler. Features 4 copper heat pipes, 1800 RPM PWM fan, motherboard sync, and a 5-year warranty', 'Maximize CPU cooling with this 240W TDP ARGB Air Cooler. Features 4 copper heat pipes, 1800 RPM PWM fan, motherboard sync, and a 5-year warranty', NULL, 35, NULL, NULL),
(592, 'ViewSonic Projector LS740HD 5000 Lumens Full HD Laser', 'The 4K UHD DLP Projector delivers stunning ultra-high-definition visuals with 4000 ANSI lumens brightness and a 12,000:1 contrast ratio. Supporting screen sizes up to 300 inches, it ensures immersive viewing for business, education, and home theater use. With dual HDMI 2.0, USB-C, LAN control, and a 10W built-in speaker, this projector offers flexible connectivity and reliable performance. Its long lamp life of up to 20,000 hours in eco mode reduces maintenance costs, making it a smart long-term investment.', 'viewsonic-projector-ls740hd-5000-lumens-full-hd-laser-1781359711', '<p>This advanced <strong>4K UHD DLP projector</strong> is designed to deliver exceptional image clarity, brightness, and flexibility for professional environments. With a powerful 4000 ANSI lumens output, it produces sharp and vivid visuals even in well-lit rooms, making it ideal for conference halls, classrooms, training centers, and home cinema setups.</p><p>The projector supports ultra-large screen projection ranging from 30 inches up to 300 inches, allowing users to scale presentations and entertainment experiences effortlessly. Its high contrast ratio of 12,000:1 enhances depth, detail, and color accuracy for more engaging visuals.</p><p>Equipped with dual HDMI 2.0 ports, USB Type-C, LAN control (RJ45), and RS232 connectivity, it ensures seamless integration with modern devices and professional AV systems. The built-in 10W speaker provides clear audio output without requiring external speakers for basic use.</p><p>With lamp life extending up to 20,000 hours in Eco mode, this projector ensures long-term durability and reduced maintenance costs. Compact yet powerful, it combines performance, reliability, and convenience in one professional-grade solution.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Display Type</td><td>DLP</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>3840 × 2160 (4K UHD)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>4000 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>0.75m – 9.76m (100\" @ 2.50m)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>12,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>30\" – 300\"</td></tr><tr><td>Video Support</td><td>Resolution Support</td><td>VGA (640×480) to 4K (3840×2160)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>HDTV Compatibility</td><td>480i, 480p, 576i, 720p, 1080i/p, 2160p</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Details</td><td>Type</td><td>Lamp</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Power</td><td>240W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>4000 hrs (Normal) / 20000 hrs (Eco Mode)</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>Yes (10W)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Noise Level</td><td>33 dB (Normal) / 28 dB (Eco)</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>HDMI</td><td>2 × HDMI (HDMI 2.0b, HDCP 1.4/2.2)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB</td><td>1 × USB Type-C, 1 × USB Type-A</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Out</td><td>1 × 3.5mm</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Control</td><td>RS232, RJ45 LAN</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Consumption</td><td>310W (Normal), &lt;0.5W (Standby)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Voltage</td><td>100–240V AC</td></tr><tr><td>External Features</td><td>Weight</td><td>2.8 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimension</td><td>312 × 222 × 108 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Coverage</td><td>1 Year Warranty (Lamp: 1 Year)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 120000.00, 120000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/RbToJR04qugHzOwRfJV5XrXWkPZTNLi1fS59rf9e.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 14:08:31', '2026-06-13 14:08:31', '4K UHD DLP Projector 4000 ANSI Lumens | Ultra Bright Home & Business Projector', 'Buy 4K UHD DLP Projector with 4000 ANSI lumens, 300\" display, HDMI 2.0, USB-C, LAN control & 20,000-hour lamp life. Ideal for business & home theater.', '4K projector, UHD projector, 4000 ANSI projector, DLP projector, business projector, home theater projector, HDMI projector, USB-C projector, long lamp life projector, 300 inch projector', NULL, 45, NULL, NULL),
(593, 'Thermaltake UX400 ARGB Sync AIR CPU Cooler White', 'The Premium 240W TDP ARGB Air CPU Cooler is a high-performance thermal solution engineered to manage the heat of modern high-wattage processors while providing a vibrant visual upgrade. Featuring a robust 240W TDP cooling capacity, this cooler utilizes four high-efficiency 6mm copper heat pipes and a dense aluminum fin stack to rapidly dissipate thermal energy. Equipped with an addressable RGB (5V ARGB) PWM fan operating between 700 and 1800 RPM, it delivers a steady 62.72 CFM of airflow while maintaining a quiet 25 dBA acoustic profile. Backed by a comprehensive 5-year warranty and universal compatibility with the latest Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4) platforms, it is an exceptionally reliable and stylish choice for any custom PC build.', 'thermaltake-ux400-argb-sync-air-cpu-cooler-white-1781359825', '<p>The <strong>Premium 240W TDP ARGB Air CPU Cooler</strong> is a high-performance thermal solution engineered to manage the heat of modern high-wattage processors while providing a vibrant visual upgrade. Featuring a robust 240W TDP cooling capacity, this cooler utilizes four high-efficiency 6mm copper heat pipes and a dense aluminum fin stack to rapidly dissipate thermal energy. Equipped with an addressable RGB (5V ARGB) PWM fan operating between 700 and 1800 RPM, it delivers a steady 62.72 CFM of airflow while maintaining a quiet 25 dBA acoustic profile. Backed by a comprehensive 5-year warranty and universal compatibility with the latest Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4) platforms, it is an exceptionally reliable and stylish choice for any custom PC build.</p><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Power</strong></td><td>240W TDP</td><td>High thermal overhead ensures stable performance for overclocked and high-wattage modern processors.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>4x 6mm Copper Heatpipes</td><td>Advanced heat pipe design provides an efficient thermal path from the CPU to the radiator fins.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>700 - 1800 RPM, 62.72 CFM</td><td>PWM control offers the perfect balance of massive airflow and quiet operation based on current demand.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustics</strong></td><td>25 dBA</td><td>Acoustically optimized components ensure a distraction-free gaming or working environment.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics</strong></td><td>5V ARGB Header</td><td>Full motherboard synchronization allows for vibrant, immersive, and fully customizable lighting effects.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Durability</strong></td><td>30,000-hour Fan Lifespan</td><td>High-quality bearings and materials ensure long-term, trouble-free operation for your PC.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 1851, 1700, 1200, 115x</td><td>Complete support for the latest Intel architectures and older, widely used mainstream sockets.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM5, AM4, AM3/2, FM2/1</td><td>Universal support for the latest AMD Ryzen processors and a vast array of legacy AMD platforms.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>5 Years</td><td>An industry-leading 5-year warranty provides total peace of mind for your hardware investment.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'CPU Cooler', 2400.00, 2400.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/XRp2lQJhqfWfRtu1fyvy7dxaSPuO1YpfcrzQNZzB.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 14:10:25', '2026-06-13 14:10:25', 'CategorySpecificationFeatureCooling Power240W TDPHigh thermal overhead ensures stable performance for overclocked and high-wattage modern processors.Cooling Engine4x 6mm Copper HeatpipesAdvanced heat pipe design provides an efficient thermal path from the CPU to the radiator fins.Fan Performance700 - 1800 RPM, 62.72 CFMPWM control offers the perfect balance of massive airflow and quiet operation based on current demand.Acoustics25 dBAAcoustically optimized components ensure a distraction-free gaming or working environment.Aesthetics5V ARGB HeaderFull motherboard synchronization allows for vibrant, immersive, and fully customizable lighting effects.Durability30,000-hour Fan LifespanHigh-quality bearings and materials ensure long-term, trouble-free operation for your PC.Intel CompatibilityLGA 1851, 1700, 1200, 115xComplete support for the latest Intel architectures and older, widely used mainstream sockets.AMD CompatibilityAM5, AM4, AM3/2, FM2/1Universal support for the latest AMD Ryzen processors and a vast array of legacy AMD platforms.Warranty & Support5 YearsAn industry-leading 5-year warranty provides total peace of mind for your hardware investment.', 'Maximize CPU cooling with this 240W TDP ARGB Air Cooler. Features 4 copper heat pipes, 1800 RPM PWM fan, motherboard sync, and a 5-year warranty.', 'Maximize CPU cooling with this 240W TDP ARGB Air Cooler. Features 4 copper heat pipes, 1800 RPM PWM fan, motherboard sync, and a 5-year warranty.', NULL, 35, NULL, NULL),
(594, 'Thermaltake UX200 SE ARGB Lighting AIR CPU Cooler', 'The Performance 170W TDP ARGB Air CPU Cooler is a reliable, high-efficiency thermal solution designed for mainstream gaming and productivity builds. Featuring a 170W TDP cooling capacity, this tower cooler utilizes four high-efficiency 6mm copper heat pipes and a dense aluminum fin stack for rapid heat dissipation. Equipped with a 120mm PWM fan that features integrated 5V ARGB lighting, it provides a balanced airflow of 62.72 CFM while maintaining a quiet 25 dBA noise level. With universal support for the latest Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4) platforms and an impressive 5-year warranty, this cooler is a stable, stylish, and long-lasting choice for any custom PC.', 'thermaltake-ux200-se-argb-lighting-air-cpu-cooler-1781359935', '<p>Elevate your desktop\'s cooling performance with the <strong>Performance 170W TDP ARGB Air CPU Cooler</strong>. Perfectly suited for mid-range to high-performance systems, this cooler is engineered to keep your CPU temperatures stable under load, featuring a 170W TDP rating that easily handles modern multi-core processors. At its core, the design includes four premium 6mm copper heat pipes that ensure efficient thermal conduction from the CPU die into the aluminum heatsink, maximizing the surface area available for cooling.</p><p>The integrated 120mm PWM fan is built for longevity, boasting a 30,000-hour operational lifespan. With intelligent PWM regulation, the fan adjusts speed between 800 and 1800 RPM based on your system\'s real-time thermal demand. This allows the cooler to stay nearly silent at 25 dBA during light usage, while delivering 62.72 CFM of airflow when needed for intensive tasks. The fan also includes vibrant 5V ARGB lighting, providing a customizable visual flair that syncs perfectly with your motherboard’s lighting control software.</p><p>Versatility and longevity are at the forefront of this design. It includes universal mounting kits compatible with nearly all modern and legacy Intel and AMD sockets, ensuring that your investment remains compatible even if you upgrade your CPU in the future. With a robust 5-year warranty, this cooler offers exceptional peace of mind, proving to be a durable and high-value addition</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Power</strong></td><td>170W TDP</td><td>Ample thermal headroom for a variety of modern processors in gaming and productivity rigs.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>4x 6mm Copper Heatpipes</td><td>Multiple direct-contact-style heat pipes provide an efficient thermal path from the CPU to the aluminum fins.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>800 - 1800 RPM, 62.72 CFM</td><td>PWM regulation balances high airflow requirements with quiet acoustic operation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustics</strong></td><td>25 dBA</td><td>Acoustically optimized to ensure a distraction-free environment during both gaming and office work.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics</strong></td><td>5V ARGB Header</td><td>Seamless motherboard synchronization for fully customizable and immersive lighting effects.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Durability</strong></td><td>30,000-hour Fan Lifespan</td><td>High-quality bearings ensure long-term, reliable performance for years of daily use.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 1851, 1700, 1200, 115x</td><td>Comprehensive support for the absolute latest Intel architectures and popular legacy sockets.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM5, AM4, AM3/2, FM2/1</td><td>Universal support for the latest AMD Ryzen processors and a vast array of legacy AMD platforms.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>5 Years</td><td>An industry-leading 5-year warranty provides absolute peace of mind for your hardware investment.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'CPU Cooler', 3700.00, 3700.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/ejzTuf0NCu6PmZNT7ffYheuDjIgeofce2x31p6Bi.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 14:12:15', '2026-06-13 14:12:15', 'Performance 170W TDP ARGB Air CPU Cooler | AM5 & LGA 1851 Ready', 'Maximize CPU cooling with this 170W TDP ARGB Air Cooler. Features 4 copper heat pipes, 1800 RPM PWM fan, motherboard sync, and a 5-year warranty.', '170W TDP air cooler, ARGB CPU cooler, tower CPU cooler, copper heatpipe cooler, Intel LGA 1851 cooler, AMD AM5 air cooler, quiet ARGB CPU cooler, high performance CPU fan, 5 year warranty CPU cooler', NULL, 35, NULL, NULL),
(595, 'Thermaltake UX200 SE ARGB Lighting AIR CPU Cooler White', 'The Performance 170W TDP ARGB Air CPU Cooler in White is a high-efficiency, stylish thermal solution designed to complement modern white-themed PC builds. Featuring a 170W TDP cooling capacity, this tower cooler utilizes four high-efficiency 6mm copper heat pipes and a dense aluminum fin stack to rapidly dissipate thermal energy. Equipped with a 120mm PWM fan that features integrated 5V ARGB lighting, it provides a balanced airflow of 62.72 CFM while maintaining a quiet 25 dBA noise level. With universal support for the latest Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4) platforms and an impressive 5-year warranty, this cooler is a stable, visually striking, and long-lasting choice for any custom PC.', 'thermaltake-ux200-se-argb-lighting-air-cpu-cooler-white-1781360007', '<p>Elevate your desktop\'s cooling performance and aesthetic with the <strong>Performance 170W TDP ARGB Air CPU Cooler (White)</strong>. Perfectly suited for enthusiasts and builders aiming for a clean, minimalist white-themed rig, this cooler is engineered to keep your CPU temperatures stable under load, featuring a 170W TDP rating that easily handles modern multi-core processors. At its core, the design includes four premium 6mm copper heat pipes that ensure efficient thermal conduction from the CPU die into the aluminum heatsink, maximizing the surface area available for cooling.</p><p>The integrated 120mm PWM fan is built for longevity, boasting a 30,000-hour operational lifespan. With intelligent PWM regulation, the fan adjusts speed between 800 and 1800 RPM based on your system\'s real-time thermal demand. This allows the cooler to stay nearly silent at 25 dBA during light usage, while delivering 62.72 CFM of airflow when needed for intensive tasks. The fan also includes vibrant 5V ARGB lighting, providing a customizable visual flair that syncs perfectly with your motherboard’s lighting control software to bring your white build to life.</p><p>Versatility and longevity are at the forefront of this design. It includes universal mounting kits compatible with nearly all modern and legacy Intel and AMD sockets, ensuring that your investment remains compatible even if you upgrade your CPU in the future. With a robust 5-year warranty, this cooler offers exceptional peace of mind, proving to be a durable and high-value addition to any custom PC configuration.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Power</strong></td><td>170W TDP</td><td>Ample thermal headroom for a variety of modern processors in gaming and productivity rigs.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>4x 6mm Copper Heatpipes</td><td>Multiple direct-contact-style heat pipes provide an efficient thermal path from the CPU to the aluminum fins.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>800 - 1800 RPM, 62.72 CFM</td><td>PWM regulation balances high airflow requirements with quiet acoustic operation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustics</strong></td><td>25 dBA</td><td>Acoustically optimized to ensure a distraction-free environment during both gaming and office work.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics</strong></td><td>5V ARGB Header (White Theme)</td><td>Seamless motherboard synchronization for fully customizable lighting; perfect for white PC builds.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Durability</strong></td><td>30,000-hour Fan Lifespan</td><td>High-quality bearings ensure long-term, reliable performance for years of daily use.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 1851, 1700, 1200, 115x</td><td>Comprehensive support for the absolute latest Intel architectures and popular legacy sockets.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM5, AM4, AM3/2, FM2/1</td><td>Universal support for the latest AMD Ryzen processors and a vast array of legacy AMD platforms.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>5 Years</td><td>An industry-leading 5-year warranty provides absolute peace of mind for your hardware investment.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 3500.00, 3500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/1FXxJFxZJCsmRsZRSIzJQ9xs6xpDUK6YWbPRP5ne.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 14:13:27', '2026-06-13 14:13:27', 'White 170W TDP ARGB Air CPU Cooler | AM5 & LGA 1851 Ready', 'Maximize CPU cooling with this 170W TDP ARGB Air Cooler in White. Features 4 copper heat pipes, 1800 RPM PWM fan, motherboard sync, and a 5-year warranty.', 'white CPU cooler, 170W TDP air cooler, ARGB CPU cooler, tower CPU cooler, copper heatpipe cooler, Intel LGA 1851 cooler, AMD AM5 air cooler, quiet ARGB CPU cooler, 5 year warranty CPU cooler', NULL, 35, NULL, NULL),
(596, 'Thermaltake TOUGHAIR 510 Turquoise Air CPU Cooler', 'The Performance 180W TDP Air CPU Cooler is a reliable, high-efficiency thermal solution built for mainstream gaming and demanding productivity workloads. With a substantial 180W TDP cooling capacity, this tower cooler utilizes four precision-engineered 6mm copper heat pipes and a high-density aluminum fin stack to ensure rapid heat dissipation. It features a high-performance 120mm PWM fan that provides an airflow of 58.35 CFM per fan while maintaining a quiet acoustic profile of 23.6 dBA. With universal support for the latest Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4) sockets and a robust 5-year warranty, this cooler is a stable and long-lasting centerpiece for any custom PC build.', 'thermaltake-toughair-510-turquoise-air-cpu-cooler-1781360112', '<p>Elevate your desktop\'s thermal stability with the <strong>Performance 180W TDP Air CPU Cooler</strong>. Engineered for PC builders who prioritize dependable, no-nonsense cooling performance, this tower cooler is designed to handle the thermal demands of modern multi-core processors. Its cooling engine features four premium 6mm copper heat pipes that establish an efficient thermal path from the CPU directly into an expansive aluminum fin array, maximizing the surface area available for rapid dissipation.</p><p>Efficiency and longevity are central to the cooler’s design. The included 120mm PWM fan is built for durability, featuring an impressive 40,000-hour operational lifespan. With intelligent PWM regulation, the fan adjusts dynamically between 500 and 2000 RPM, allowing the system to operate at a whisper-quiet 23.6 dBA during standard tasks while delivering 58.35 CFM of airflow when required for intensive gaming or creative rendering.</p><p>Versatility and future-proofing are core strengths of this cooler. It includes universal mounting hardware for a vast range of architectures, ensuring compatibility with the latest Intel LGA 1851 and 1700 sockets, as well as an extensive list of legacy Intel and AMD platforms. Standing at 159.5mm, it is optimized to fit comfortably within most standard mid-tower chassis. Backed by a generous 5-year warranty, this cooler is a high-value, secure investment that promises consistent cooling performance for years to come.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Power</strong></td><td>180W TDP</td><td>High thermal headroom ideal for gaming rigs and high-performance workstation builds.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>4x 6mm Copper Heatpipes</td><td>Advanced heat pipe design provides a rapid thermal path from the CPU to the aluminum heatsink.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>500 - 2000 RPM, 58.35 CFM</td><td>PWM regulation allows for near-silent idle operation and strong airflow under heavy stress.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustics</strong></td><td>23.6 dBA</td><td>Acoustically optimized components ensure a quiet and distraction-free computing environment.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Durability</strong></td><td>40,000-hour Fan Lifespan</td><td>High-quality bearings ensure long-term, reliable performance for years of daily use.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 1851, 1700, 1200, 115x</td><td>Complete support for the latest Intel architectures and popular mainstream sockets.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM5, AM4, AM3/2, FM2/1</td><td>Universal support for the latest AMD Ryzen processors and a vast array of legacy AMD platforms.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>5 Years</td><td>An industry-leading 5-year warranty provides absolute peace of mind for your hardware investment.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 6350.00, 6350.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/Nj4n9HVm6LvwKvdHUUk4w4fahASCxV66L3p2UTTF.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 14:15:12', '2026-06-13 14:15:12', 'Performance 180W TDP Air CPU Cooler | AM5 & LGA 1851 Ready', 'Maximize CPU cooling with this 180W TDP Air Cooler. Features 4 copper heat pipes, 2000 RPM PWM fan, quiet 23.6 dBA operation, and a 5-year warranty.', '180W TDP air cooler, tower CPU cooler, copper heatpipe cooler, Intel LGA 1851 cooler, AMD AM5 air cooler, quiet CPU cooler, high performance CPU fan, 5 year warranty CPU cooler', NULL, 35, NULL, NULL);
