(597, 'Thermaltake ASTRIA 600 ARGB Lighting Air CPU Cooler', 'The Extreme-Performance 265W TDP ARGB Air CPU Cooler is a top-tier thermal solution engineered for high-wattage desktop processors. Featuring a massive 265W TDP cooling capacity, it utilizes six high-efficiency 6mm copper heat pipes and a dense aluminum fin array to rapidly dissipate extreme thermal energy. The cooler includes a high-static-pressure 120mm PWM fan that delivers 65.0 CFM of airflow at a manageable 26.8 dBA. With dual-zone 5V ARGB lighting synchronization for the fan and housing, universal support for the latest Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4) platforms, and a reliable 5-year warranty, this cooler is the ultimate choice for enthusiasts demanding peak thermal performance and vibrant custom aesthetics.', 'thermaltake-astria-600-argb-lighting-air-cpu-cooler-1781360222', '<h3><strong>Long Description</strong></h3><p>Push your high-end processor to its absolute limits with the <strong>Extreme-Performance 265W TDP ARGB Air CPU Cooler</strong>. Designed for hardcore gamers, professional workstation users, and overclocking enthusiasts, this tower cooler provides the thermal headroom necessary for modern, power-hungry CPUs. Its sophisticated cooling engine features six premium 6mm copper heat pipes that ensure rapid, efficient heat transfer from the CPU die into a high-density aluminum fin stack, providing the high-capacity dissipation required for a 265W TDP rating.</p><p>Acoustic and thermal precision are key to this cooler’s design. The high-performance 120mm PWM fan is built for longevity, boasting a 40,000-hour operational lifespan, and features advanced 5V ARGB synchronization for both the fan and the cooler\'s top-housing. Sophisticated PWM regulation allows the fan to adjust dynamically between 500 and 1800 RPM; this ensures your system remains quiet during standard tasks while delivering a powerful 65.0 CFM of airflow and 2.56 mm-H2O of static pressure to keep temperatures low under heavy system stress.</p><p>Versatility and longevity are pillars of this design. It includes universal mounting hardware for an extensive list of architectures, ensuring future-proof support for the latest Intel LGA 1851 and 1700 sockets, as well as the complete range of AMD platforms from the modern AM5 down to legacy FM and AM2 systems. With an industry-leading 5-year warranty, this cooler is a secure, high-value investment that promises consistent, high-performance cooling for your most demanding projects.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Power</strong></td><td>265W TDP</td><td>Massive thermal capacity designed for overclocked CPUs and high-performance workstations.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>6x 6mm Copper Heatpipes</td><td>Six premium heat pipes provide a superior thermal path for rapid heat dissipation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>500 - 1800 RPM, 65.0 CFM</td><td>PWM control offers the perfect balance of high-volume airflow and quiet operation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustics</strong></td><td>26.8 dBA</td><td>Expertly balanced acoustics ensure a distraction-free environment during peak performance.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics</strong></td><td>Dual-Zone 5V ARGB Sync</td><td>Integrated lighting on both the fan and housing allows for stunning, synchronized visual effects.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Durability</strong></td><td>40,000-hour Fan Lifespan</td><td>High-quality bearings ensure long-term, reliable performance for years of heavy usage.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 1851, 1700, 1200, 115x</td><td>Complete support for the latest Intel architectures and popular mainstream sockets.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM5, AM4, AM3/2, FM2/1</td><td>Universal support for the latest AMD Ryzen processors and a vast array of legacy AMD platforms.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>5 Years</td><td>An industry-leading 5-year warranty provides total peace of mind for your hardware investment.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'CPU Cooler', 8000.00, 8000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/v8KJLeNmXn5BpeHTHxCBuW7GN5MEatlL09KW9MFE.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 14:17:02', '2026-06-13 14:17:02', 'Extreme-Performance 265W TDP ARGB Air CPU Cooler | AM5 & LGA 1851 Ready', 'Maximize CPU cooling with this 265W TDP ARGB Air Cooler. Features 6 copper heat pipes, 1800 RPM PWM fan, dual-zone motherboard sync, and a 5-year warranty.', '265W TDP air cooler, ARGB CPU cooler, tower CPU cooler, 6 heatpipe cooler, Intel LGA 1851 cooler, AMD AM5 air cooler, quiet ARGB CPU cooler, high performance CPU fan, 5 year warranty CPU cooler', NULL, 35, NULL, NULL),
(598, 'Thermaltake ASTRIA 600 ARGB Lighting AIR CPU Cooler White', 'The Extreme-Performance 265W TDP Dual-Fan ARGB CPU Cooler is a flagship thermal solution engineered for high-wattage desktop processors. Featuring a massive 265W TDP cooling capacity, this unit utilizes six high-efficiency 6mm copper heat pipes and a dense aluminum fin stack to dissipate intense heat rapidly. It is equipped with two high-static-pressure 120mm PWM fans that deliver a combined 65.0 CFM of airflow per fan while maintaining a controlled acoustic profile of 26.8 dBA. With dual-zone 5V ARGB lighting synchronization and broad compatibility with the latest Intel (LGA 1851/1700/2066) and AMD (AM5/AM4) platforms, this cooler is the ultimate choice for enthusiasts demanding peak thermal performance and vibrant custom aesthetics.', 'thermaltake-astria-600-argb-lighting-air-cpu-cooler-white-1781360319', '<h3>&nbsp;</h3><p>Push your high-end processor to its absolute limits with the <strong>Extreme-Performance 265W TDP Dual-Fan ARGB CPU Cooler</strong>. Designed for hardcore gamers, professional workstation users, and overclocking enthusiasts, this dual-fan tower cooler provides the thermal headroom necessary for modern, power-hungry CPUs. Its sophisticated cooling engine features six premium 6mm copper heat pipes that ensure rapid, efficient heat transfer from the CPU die into a high-density aluminum fin stack, providing the high-capacity dissipation required for a 265W TDP rating.</p><p>Acoustic and thermal precision are key to this cooler’s design. The dual 120mm PWM fans are built for longevity, boasting a 40,000-hour operational lifespan, and feature advanced 5V ARGB synchronization for both the fans and the cooler\'s overall aesthetic. Sophisticated PWM regulation allows the fans to adjust dynamically between 500 and 1800 RPM; this ensures your system remains quiet during standard tasks while delivering a powerful 65.0 CFM of airflow and 2.56 mm-H2O of static pressure per fan to keep temperatures low under heavy system stress.</p><p>Versatility and longevity are pillars of this design. It includes universal mounting hardware for an extensive list of architectures, ensuring future-proof support for the latest Intel LGA 1851, 1700, and 2066 sockets, as well as modern AMD AM5 and AM4 platforms. This cooler is a secure, high-value investment that promises consistent, high-performance cooling for your most demanding projects.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Power</strong></td><td>265W TDP</td><td>Massive thermal capacity designed for overclocked CPUs and high-performance workstations.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>6x 6mm Copper Heatpipes</td><td>Six premium heat pipes provide a superior thermal path for rapid heat dissipation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Configuration</strong></td><td>Dual 120mm PWM Fans</td><td>Dual-fan \"push-pull\" setup optimizes airflow through the dense fin stack.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>500 - 1800 RPM, 65.0 CFM</td><td>PWM control offers the perfect balance of high-volume airflow and quiet operation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustics</strong></td><td>26.8 dBA</td><td>Expertly balanced acoustics ensure a distraction-free environment during peak performance.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics</strong></td><td>Dual-Zone 5V ARGB Sync</td><td>Integrated lighting on both the fans and housing allows for stunning, synchronized visual effects.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Durability</strong></td><td>40,000-hour Fan Lifespan</td><td>High-quality bearings ensure long-term, reliable performance for years of heavy usage.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 1851, 1700, 2066, 1200, 115x</td><td>Complete support for the latest Intel architectures and popular mainstream sockets.</td></tr><tr><td><