ockets.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM5, AM4</td><td>Universal support for the latest AMD Ryzen processors.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 8500.00, 8500.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/PsRJrozvCo402RFLmkuJ3JDT54glmb0WA4aQ5j1l.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 14:20:23', '2026-06-13 14:20:23', 'Extreme-Performance 265W Dual-Fan ARGB CPU Cooler | AM5 & LGA 1851 Ready', 'Maximize CPU cooling with this 265W TDP Dual-Fan ARGB Air Cooler. Features 6 copper heat pipes, 1800 RPM PWM fans, and dual-zone motherboard sync.', '65W TDP air cooler, ARGB CPU cooler, dual fan tower cooler, 6 heatpipe cooler, Intel LGA 1851 cooler, AMD AM5 air cooler, quiet ARGB CPU cooler, high performance CPU fan', NULL, 35, NULL, NULL),
(600, 'Thermaltake LA240 ARGB Sync 240mm AIO Liquid CPU Cooler', 'The 240mm ARGB All-in-One (AIO) Liquid CPU Cooler is a high-performance thermal solution designed for enthusiasts seeking superior cooling efficiency and a clean, aesthetic look. Featuring a 277mm aluminum radiator and high-speed PWM fans (up to 2500 RPM), this AIO delivers massive thermal dissipation capacity of 79.3 CFM per fan, making it ideal for overclocked CPUs and heavy-load workstations. The copper water block ensures rapid heat transfer, while the integrated 5V ARGB lighting on both the pump and fans provides a fully customizable, synchronized visual experience. With wide support for the latest Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4) platforms and a comprehensive 5-year warranty, this liquid cooler offers a perfect blend of silent operation, extreme performance, and long-term reliability.', 'thermaltake-la240-argb-sync-240mm-aio-liquid-cpu-cooler-1781360523', '<p>ake your system\'s cooling to the next level with the <strong>240mm ARGB All-in-One Liquid CPU Cooler</strong>. Engineered for PC builders who demand the best thermal headroom for modern, multi-core processors, this AIO system simplifies complex builds while providing the efficiency of a high-end liquid cooling loop. At the heart of the system is a precision-machined copper water block that ensures optimal contact with your CPU, while the 277mm aluminum radiator provides a vast surface area for rapid heat dissipation.</p><p>The system is powered by dual high-static-pressure 120mm PWM fans, which operate dynamically between 600 and 2500 RPM. This allows the system to remain highly efficient during heavy-duty rendering, gaming, or multitasking, while the PWM pump control (1500–2500 RPM) ensures that liquid circulation is always optimized for your current workload. Beyond raw performance, the AIO features vibrant 5V ARGB lighting on both the fans and the water block, allowing you to synchronize your cooler with your motherboard’s ecosystem for a truly immersive and custom aesthetic.</p><p>Durability and ease of use are paramount. The system utilizes premium rubber tubing for flexibility and leak resistance, paired with a reliable pump motor designed for continuous, high-performance operation. Including universal mounting brackets for the latest Intel architectures—including the new LGA 1851—and AMD’s popular AM5/AM4 platforms, this cooler is a future-proof thermal foundation for any enthusiast build. Backed by an industry-leading 5-year warranty, this AIO is an investment in both your system\'s longevity and peak performance.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Radiator</strong></td><td>240mm Aluminum</td><td>Provides optimal surface area for rapid heat exchange in standard mid-tower cases.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Water Block</strong></td><td>Copper Base</td><td>High-thermal-conductivity copper ensures immediate heat absorption from the processor.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>600 - 2500 RPM, 79.3 CFM</td><td>A high-RPM range provides the flexibility for massive airflow under extreme load.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pump Performance</strong></td><td>1500 - 2500 RPM (PWM)</td><td>Dynamically controlled motor speed ensures quiet, consistent cooling performance.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustics &amp; Pressure</strong></td><td>38.35 dBA, 3.45 mm-H2O</td><td>High static pressure is perfect for driving airflow through the dense radiator fins.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics</strong></td><td>Dual-Zone 5V ARGB Sync</td><td>Motherboard-synchronized lighting on the pump and fans for a seamless, professional look.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 1851, 1700, 2066, 1200, 115x</td><td>Full support for modern enthusiast and mainstream Intel platforms.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM5, AM4, AM3/2</td><td>Universal mounting for all modern Ryzen architectures.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>5 Years</td><td>An industry-leading 5-year warranty ensures complete protection for your hardware.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 8700.00, 8700.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/8lUoM3P9t4mk1QksbKwqSePMUgvDddrETAi0VDOo.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 14:22:03', '2026-06-13 14:22:03', '240mm ARGB AIO Liquid CPU Cooler | AM5 & LGA 1851 Ready', 'Maximize CPU cooling with this 240mm ARGB AIO Liquid Cooler. Features a copper water block, dual 2500 RPM PWM fans, and 5-year wa', '40mm AIO liquid cooler, ARGB liquid cooling, CPU liquid cooler, Intel LGA 1851 liquid cooler, AMD AM5 AIO, high performance AIO, 240mm radiator cooling, quiet AIO cooler, 5 year warranty liquid cooler', NULL, 35, NULL, NULL),
(601, 'Thermaltake LB360-S ARGB Sync Snow Edition 360mm AIO Liquid CPU Cooler With Display', 'The 360mm ARGB AIO Liquid CPU Cooler with LCD Display is a flagship thermal solution designed for enthusiasts who demand elite cooling performance and high-end aesthetics. Featuring a massive 397mm aluminum radiator and triple high-performance PWM fans (up to 1900 RPM), this AIO delivers a combined 76.8 CFM of airflow per fan, perfect for handling overclocked processors and intense workstation loads. The integrated Segment Code LCD Display on the water block provides real-time system monitoring, while the copper base ensures rapid heat transfer. With full 5V ARGB motherboard synchronization, broad compatibility with the latest Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4) platforms, and a 5-year warranty, this cooler offers a premium, future-proof thermal foundation for any enthusiast build.', 'thermaltake-lb360-s-argb-sync-snow-edition-360mm-aio-liquid-cpu-cooler-with-display-1781360607', '<p>Upgrade your system to elite-tier cooling with the <strong>360mm ARGB AIO Liquid CPU Cooler with LCD Display</strong>. Engineered for power users and visual enthusiasts, this 360mm AIO simplifies complex cooling loops while providing superior thermal management. The standout <strong>Segment Code LCD Display</strong> sits atop the pump head, offering an immediate, clear readout of critical system data, giving your rig a sophisticated, professional edge.</p><p>Cooling is handled by a high-capacity 397mm aluminum radiator paired with three high-static-pressure 120mm PWM fans. With a wide operating range of 700 to 1900 RPM and an impressive 3.04 mm-H2O of air pressure per fan, the system effortlessly pushes heat away from your components. The internal pump is equally robust, operating at an aggressive 2000–2900 RPM to maintain consistent liquid circulation, even under maximum stress.</p><p>Beyond its raw thermal power, this cooler serves as a vibrant visual centerpiece. The pump and fans feature integrated 5V ARGB lighting, allowing for total synchronization with your motherboard’s software ecosystem. With universal mounting hardware for the latest Intel architectures—including the new LGA 1851—and AMD’s popular AM5/AM4 platforms, this AIO is ready for the next generation of PC hardware. Backed by a comprehensive 5-year warranty, it is the ultimate investment in your system’s performance and aesthetics.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Radiator</strong></td><td>360mm Aluminum</td><td>Massive surface area provides superior heat dissipation for high-TDP processors.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Water Block</strong></td><td>Copper Base, LCD Display</td><td>High-conductivity copper base with an integrated segment-code LCD for real-time monitoring.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>700 - 1900 RPM, 76.8 CFM</td><td>High-airflow fans ensure the radiator stays cool during intense gaming and productivity.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pump Performance</strong></td><td>2000 - 2900 RPM (PWM)</td><td>A high-speed, dynamic pump ensures consistent, efficient liquid flow for peak cooling.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustics &amp; Pressure</strong></td><td>33.8 dBA, 3.04 mm-H2O</td><td>High-static pressure design effectively pushes air through the dense radiator fins.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics</strong></td><td>Dual-Zone 5V ARGB Sync</td><td>Motherboard-synchronized lighting on the pump housing and fans for a cohesive look.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 1851, 1700, 2066, 1200, 115x</td><td>Complete support for current enthusiast and mainstream Intel platforms.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM5, AM4, AM3</td><td>Universal mounting for all modern Ryzen architectures.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>5 Years</td><td>An industry-leading 5-year warranty provides complete protection for your hardware.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 9000.00, 9000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/oZ5PhzuGWUAhXI9hDo0uZcIB1zI8vPdungUt2kFi.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 14:23:27', '2026-06-13 14:23:27', '360mm ARGB AIO Liquid Cooler with LCD Display | AM5 & LGA 1851 Ready', 'Maximize CPU cooling with this 360mm ARGB AIO Liquid Cooler. Features an LCD monitor, copper water block, triple 1900 RPM PWM fans, and a 5-year warranty.', '360mm AIO liquid cooler, LCD liquid cooler, ARGB AIO, Intel LGA 1851 liquid cooler, AMD AM5 AIO, high performance AIO, 360mm radiator cooling, LCD screen CPU cooler, 5 year warranty AIO', NULL, 35, NULL, NULL),
(602, 'Thermaltake LA240-S ARGB Sync 240mm AIO Liquid CPU Cooler With Display', 'The 240mm ARGB AIO Liquid CPU Cooler with Display is a premium thermal solution designed for enthusiasts who demand elite cooling performance and advanced system monitoring. Featuring a 277mm aluminum radiator and high-speed PWM fans (up to 2500 RPM), this AIO delivers a massive 79.3 CFM of airflow per fan, perfect for high-wattage CPUs. The integrated display support, compatible with Windows 10/11 via a USB 2.0 interface, allows for real-time monitoring of your rig. With vibrant 5V ARGB lighting, universal support for the latest Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4) platforms, and a comprehensive 5-year warranty, this liquid cooler offers a perfect blend of silent operation, extreme performance, and future-proof reliability.', 'thermaltake-la240-s-argb-sync-240mm-aio-liquid-cpu-cooler-with-display-1781360699', '<p>Elevate your desktop\'s performance with the <strong>240mm ARGB AIO Liquid CPU Cooler with Display</strong>. Engineered for power users, gamers, and content creators, this AIO system simplifies complex cooling builds while providing the efficiency of a high-end liquid loop. At its heart, a precision-machined copper water block ensures optimal thermal transfer, while the 277mm aluminum radiator provides a vast surface area for rapid heat dissipation.</p><p>The system is powered by dual high-static-pressure 120mm PWM fans that operate dynamically between 600 and 2500 RPM. This wide range allows the system to remain highly efficient during heavy-duty rendering, while the PWM pump control (1500–2500 RPM) ensures consistent liquid circulation tailored to your current load. The standout feature is the dedicated display interface, which connects via a 9-pin USB 2.0 header, providing critical system telemetry directly to your screen for enhanced monitoring.</p><p>Durability and ease of integration are paramount. The system utilizes premium rubber tubing for flexibility and leak resistance, paired with a reliable, long-life pump motor. Including universal mounting hardware for the latest Intel architectures—including the new LGA 1851—and AMD’s popular AM5/AM4 platforms, this cooler is a robust, future-proof thermal foundation. Backed by a 5-year warranty, this AIO is a secure investment in your system\'s performance, stability, and visual appeal.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Radiator</strong></td><td>240mm Aluminum</td><td>Optimizes surface area for rapid heat exchange in standard mid-tower chassis configurations.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Water Block</strong></td><td>Copper Base</td><td>High-thermal-conductivity copper ensures immediate heat absorption from the processor.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>600 - 2500 RPM, 79.3 CFM</td><td>A high-RPM range provides extreme flexibility for massive airflow under high system stress.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pump Performance</strong></td><td>1500 - 2500 RPM (PWM)</td><td>Dynamically controlled motor speed ensures quiet, consistent cooling performance.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Monitoring</strong></td><td>USB 2.0 Display Interface</td><td>Enables real-time system monitoring on Windows 10/11 to track your rig\'s vitals.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics</strong></td><td>ARGB Lighting</td><td>Motherboard-synchronized lighting on the pump and fans for a seamless, professional aesthetic.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 1851, 1700, 2066, 1200, 115x</td><td>Complete support for modern enthusiast and mainstream Intel platforms.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM5, AM4, AM3/2</td><td>Universal mounting for all modern Ryzen architectures.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>5 Years</td><td>An industry-leading 5-year warranty provides complete protection for your hardware investment.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 9800.00, 9800.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/QuPMvp04VrktG2fC1OxepTSPWHfsDOkNNAd1EBRt.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 14:24:59', '2026-06-13 14:24:59', '40mm ARGB AIO Liquid Cooler with Display | AM5 & LGA 1851 Ready', 'Maximize CPU cooling with this 240mm ARGB AIO Liquid Cooler. Features display support, copper water block, dual 2500 RPM PWM fans, and 5-year warranty.', '240mm AIO liquid cooler, display AIO cooler, ARGB liquid cooling, CPU liquid cooler, Intel LGA 1851 liquid cooler, AMD AM5 AIO, high performance AIO, 240mm radiator, 5 year warranty AIO', NULL, 35, NULL, NULL),
(603, 'Vivitek Projector BS570 4200 Lumens SVGA', 'The 4200 ANSI Lumens SVGA DLP Projector is a reliable and cost-effective projection solution designed for classrooms, meeting rooms, and training environments. Featuring TI DLP technology, 4,200 lumens brightness, and a high 25,000:1 contrast ratio, it delivers bright and clear presentations even in well-lit spaces. With support for resolutions up to WUXGA (1920×1200), dual HDMI connectivity, and a lamp life of up to 10,000 hours in Dynamic Eco mode, this projector offers excellent performance and long-term value.', 'vivitek-projector-bs570-4200-lumens-svga-1781365199', '<p>The <strong>4200 ANSI Lumens DLP Projector</strong> is engineered to provide exceptional visual performance for educational institutions, corporate meeting rooms, and training facilities. Its powerful 4,200 ANSI lumens brightness ensures crisp and vivid images, allowing presentations to remain visible even in rooms with ambient lighting.</p><h2>Advanced DLP Technology</h2><p>Powered by <strong>Texas Instruments Single-Chip 0.55\" DLP Technology</strong>, the projector delivers sharp image quality, accurate colors, and reliable long-term performance. The native SVGA (800 × 600) resolution is ideal for presentations and educational content, while support for resolutions up to WUXGA (1920 × 1200) ensures compatibility with modern devices and media sources.</p><h2>High Contrast for Better Image Clarity</h2><p>Featuring a <strong>25,000:1 contrast ratio</strong>, the projector produces deeper blacks and brighter whites, enhancing readability for text, charts, and multimedia presentations. This results in improved visual detail and a more engaging viewing experience.</p><h2>Flexible Installation Options</h2><p>With a projection distance ranging from <strong>1.6 to 12 meters</strong> and screen sizes from <strong>40 to 240 inches</strong>, the projector adapts easily to various room sizes and installation requirements. Whether mounted on the ceiling or placed on a table, it offers flexibility for different environments.</p><h2>Comprehensive Connectivity</h2><p>The projector comes equipped with a wide range of connectivity options, including:</p><ul><li>2 × HDMI v1.4b</li><li>2 × VGA Inputs</li><li>VGA Output</li><li>Composite Video</li><li>S-Video</li><li>Audio Input and Output</li><li>RS232 Control Port</li></ul><p>These versatile ports ensure seamless integration with computers, laptops, media players, and AV control systems.</p><h2>Long Lamp Life and Energy Efficiency</h2><p>The 210W lamp delivers dependable performance with up to:</p><ul><li><strong>5,000 Hours (Normal Mode)</strong></li><li><strong>7,000 Hours (Eco Mode)</strong></li><li><strong>10,000 Hours (Dynamic Eco Mode)</strong></li></ul><p>This extended lamp life helps reduce maintenance costs and maximize operational efficiency over time.</p><h2>Built for Everyday Use</h2><p>Compact, lightweight, and easy to install, this projector weighs only <strong>2.6 kg</strong> and features a durable design suitable for daily business and educational applications. The integrated 2W speaker provides convenient audio support for presentations and multimedia content.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Display Type</td><td>Single Chip 0.55\" DLP Technology by TI</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>SVGA (800 × 600)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Maximum Resolution</td><td>WUXGA (1920 × 1200)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>4,200 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>1.6m – 12m (3.6’ – 40’)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>25,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>40\" – 240\"</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Details</td><td>Lamp Power</td><td>210W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>5,000 / 7,000 / 10,000 Hours (Normal / Eco / Dynamic Eco)</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>2W Mono Speaker</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>HDMI</td><td>2 × HDMI v1.4b</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>VGA-In</td><td>2 × VGA-In</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>VGA-Out</td><td>1 × VGA-Out</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Video Input</td><td>Composite Video, S-Video</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio</td><td>Audio-In (Mini Jack), Audio-Out (Mini Jack)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Control</td><td>RS232</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Supply</td><td>AC 100-240V, 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>240W (Normal), 203W (Eco), &lt;0.5W (Standby)</td></tr><tr><td>External Features</td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>2.6 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimension</td><td>331 × 244 × 105 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Projector Warranty</td><td>02 Years Parts &amp; Service Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Warranty</td><td>12 Months or 1000 Hours</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 50000.00, 50000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/vS8zQqPlvwbD22T0FCr5UemMwWq5L15yp7Vc5ECX.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 15:39:59', '2026-06-13 15:39:59', '4200 ANSI Lumens SVGA DLP Projector with Dual HDMI | Business & Education Projector', 'Buy 4200 ANSI Lumens SVGA DLP Projector with TI DLP technology, 25,000:1 contrast ratio, dual HDMI ports, up to 10,000-hour lamp life, and WUXGA support. Ideal for classrooms, training rooms, and business presentations.', '4200 ANSI Lumens projector, SVGA projector, DLP projector, business projector, classroom projector, education projector, dual HDMI projector, TI DLP projector, presentation projector, high brightness projector, conference room projector, WUXGA compatible projector, long lamp life projector, training room projector, multimedia projector.', NULL, 308, NULL, NULL),
(604, 'Vivitek Projector DW2650Z 4200 Lumens WXGA DLP', 'The 4200 Lumens WUXGA Laser DLP Projector delivers exceptional image quality with native WUXGA (1920×1200) resolution, 4,200 lumens brightness, and a 30,000:1 contrast ratio. Featuring a long-lasting laser light source with up to 30,000 hours of operation, this projector is ideal for corporate meeting rooms, educational institutions, training centers, and professional presentation environments. Its maintenance-free laser technology, 16:10 widescreen format, and 10W built-in speaker ensure reliable performance and immersive viewing experiences.', 'vivitek-projector-dw2650z-4200-lumens-wxga-dlp-1781365534', '<p>The <strong>4200 Lumens WUXGA Laser Projector</strong> is designed to deliver outstanding image quality, long-term reliability, and low maintenance costs for business, education, and commercial applications. Combining advanced DLP projection technology with a laser light source, it provides vibrant visuals, exceptional detail, and consistent performance throughout its lifespan.</p><h2>Crystal-Clear WUXGA Resolution</h2><p>With a native <strong>WUXGA (1920 × 1200)</strong> resolution and a 16:10 aspect ratio, the projector delivers sharp text, detailed graphics, and high-definition multimedia content. The widescreen format offers additional vertical workspace, making it ideal for presentations, spreadsheets, educational materials, and video content.</p><h2>Bright and Vivid Images</h2><p>Producing <strong>4,200 lumens of brightness</strong>, this projector ensures clear and vibrant images even in rooms with ambient lighting. Whether used in conference rooms, lecture halls, training facilities, or classrooms, presentations remain visible and impactful.</p><h2>Long-Life Laser Technology</h2><p>The advanced laser light source eliminates the need for traditional lamp replacements and provides up to <strong>30,000 hours of operation</strong>. This significantly reduces maintenance requirements and lowers total cost of ownership, making it a dependable solution for continuous daily use.</p><h2>Enhanced Contrast for Superior Detail</h2><p>A <strong>30,000:1 contrast ratio</strong> delivers deeper blacks and brighter whites, resulting in greater image depth and improved readability. Detailed charts, documents, and multimedia presentations appear more dynamic and professional.</p><h2>Integrated Audio Performance</h2><p>The built-in <strong>10W speaker</strong> provides clear and powerful sound suitable for presentations, training sessions, and multimedia playback without requiring external audio equipment in smaller venues.</p><h2>Efficient and Quiet Operation</h2><p>Designed for professional environments, the projector operates at low noise levels of only <strong>33dB in Normal Mode</strong> and <strong>31dB in Eco Mode</strong>, ensuring minimal distraction during meetings, lectures, and presentations.</p><h2>Flexible Connectivity and Control</h2><p>The projector includes essential connectivity and management options, including:</p><ul><li>USB Type-A (Power Output 5V/1.5A)</li><li>Mini-B Service Port</li><li>Audio Input and Output (Mini-Jack)</li><li>RS-232 Control Interface</li></ul><p>These options provide convenient integration with external devices and centralized AV control systems.</p><h2>Built for Business and Education</h2><p>With its durable construction, laser light source, energy-efficient operation, and professional-grade image quality, this projector is an excellent solution for organizations seeking a reliable display system for long-term use.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Display Type</td><td>DLP</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>WUXGA (1920 × 1200)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>4200 Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>4.29 ft. – 33.49 ft.</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:10</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>30,000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Details</td><td>Light Source Type</td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Light Source Life</td><td>Up to 30,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>10W Speaker</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB</td><td>1 × USB 2.0 Type-A (Power 5V/1.5A), 1 × Mini-B (Service)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Ports</td><td>1 × Audio-In (Mini-Jack), 1 × Audio-Out (Mini-Jack)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Control Port</td><td>1 × RS-232</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Supply</td><td>AC 100-240V, 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>Approx. 230W</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Noise Level</td><td>33dB (Normal), 31dB (Eco)</td></tr><tr><td>External Features</td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>4.8 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>353 × 290 × 144 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Service Warranty</td><td>3 Years Parts &amp; Service Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 107000.00, 107000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/1IIUYOIqReEb7AiaXHqRJsGyfpwA1QKsnmCoaF1W.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 15:45:34', '2026-06-13 15:45:34', '4200 Lumens WUXGA Laser Projector | 30,000 Hour Laser Light Source', 'Buy a 4200 Lumens WUXGA Laser DLP Projector with 1920×1200 resolution, 30,000:1 contrast ratio, 10W speaker, and up to 30,000-hour laser light source. Perfect for business, education, and professional presentations.', '4200 lumens projector, WUXGA projector, laser projector, DLP laser projector, business projector, education projector, conference room projector, professional projector, 1920x1200 projector, laser light source projector, high brightness projector, presentation projector, long life laser projector, widescreen projector, office projector, meeting room projector.', NULL, 308, NULL, NULL),
(605, 'Vivitek Projecto rDW351 4500 Lumens WXGA DLP', 'The 4500 Lumens WXGA DLP Projector is a powerful and versatile projection solution designed for business presentations, classrooms, meeting rooms, and training environments. Featuring WXGA (1280×800) resolution, 4,500 lumens brightness, and a high 30,000:1 contrast ratio, it delivers bright, sharp, and detailed visuals even in well-lit spaces. Equipped with a 10W built-in speaker, HDMI connectivity, and an extended lamp life of up to 15,000 hours in Long Eco mode, this projector offers reliable performance and low maintenance costs.', 'vivitek-projecto-rdw351-4500-lumens-wxga-dlp-1781365808', '<p>The <strong>4500 Lumens WXGA DLP Projector</strong> is engineered to provide outstanding image quality and dependable performance for professional environments. Its powerful 4,500 lumens brightness ensures presentations remain clear and vibrant, even in rooms with significant ambient lighting.</p><h2>WXGA Resolution for Enhanced Detail</h2><p>Featuring a native <strong>WXGA (1280 × 800)</strong> resolution and a widescreen aspect ratio, the projector delivers crisp text, detailed graphics, and high-quality multimedia content. It is ideal for displaying spreadsheets, presentations, educational materials, and videos with excellent clarity.</p><h2>Exceptional Contrast and Image Quality</h2><p>With a <strong>30,000:1 Full On/Off contrast ratio</strong>, the projector produces deeper blacks and brighter whites, enhancing overall image depth and improving readability for professional presentations and classroom instruction.</p><h2>Powerful Audio Performance</h2><p>The integrated <strong>10W speaker</strong> provides clear and powerful sound, reducing the need for external audio equipment during meetings, lectures, and multimedia presentations.</p><h2>Long Lamp Life for Lower Ownership Costs</h2><p>Powered by a high-performance UHP lamp, the projector offers multiple lamp modes to maximize lifespan:</p><ul><li><strong>4,000 Hours in Normal Mode</strong></li><li><strong>5,000 Hours in Eco Mode</strong></li><li><strong>15,000 Hours in Long Eco Mode</strong></li></ul><p>The extended lamp life helps minimize maintenance costs and ensures long-term reliability.</p><h2>Flexible Connectivity Options</h2><p>The projector includes a variety of input and control interfaces for seamless integration with modern devices:</p><ul><li>HDMI v1.4b</li><li>VGA Input</li><li>Composite Video Input</li><li>Audio Input and Output</li><li>USB Power/Service Port (5V/1.5A)</li><li>RS232 Control Port</li></ul><p>These connectivity options make it compatible with laptops, desktop computers, media players, document cameras, and AV control systems.</p><h2>Compact and Easy to Install</h2><p>With a lightweight design of only <strong>2.9 kg</strong> and compact dimensions, the projector is easy to transport, install, and maintain. It is suitable for classrooms, conference rooms, training centers, houses of worship, and business environments.</p><h2>Reliable Everyday Performance</h2><p>Combining high brightness, excellent contrast, flexible connectivity, and long lamp life, this projector delivers a dependable projection solution for organizations seeking professional-quality visuals at an affordable operating cost.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Display Type</td><td>DLP</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>WXGA (1280 × 800)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>4,500 Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>30,000:1 (Full On/Off)</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Details</td><td>Lamp Type</td><td>UHP</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>4,000 Hours (Normal), 5,000 Hours (Eco), 15,000 Hours (Long Eco)</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>10W Speaker</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>HDMI</td><td>1 × HDMI v1.4b</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>VGA-In</td><td>1 × VGA-In</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Video Input</td><td>Composite Video</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Ports</td><td>Audio-In (Mini-Jack), Audio-Out (Mini-Jack)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB</td><td>USB 5V/1.5A (Power &amp; Service)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Control</td><td>RS232</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Supply</td><td>AC 100-240V, 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>250W (Normal), 210W (Eco), &lt;0.5W (Standby)</td></tr><tr><td>External Features</td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>2.9 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>313 × 236 × 120 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Projector Warranty</td><td>02 Years Parts &amp; Service Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Warranty</td><td>12 Months or 1000 Hours</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 73500.00, 73500.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/EY2vkQyBNZBFOBpXbWrORSCUjguQHAB4OhLZ6eIe.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 15:50:08', '2026-06-13 15:50:08', '4500 Lumens WXGA DLP Projector | High Brightness Business & Education Projector', 'Buy a 4500 Lumens WXGA DLP Projector with 30,000:1 contrast ratio, 10W speaker, HDMI connectivity, and up to 15,000-hour lamp life. Ideal for classrooms, meeting rooms, training centers, and business presentations.', '4500 lumens projector, WXGA projector, DLP projector, business projector, education projector, classroom projector, meeting room projector, HDMI projector, high brightness projector, presentation projector, training room projector, widescreen projector, multimedia projector, office projector, professional projector, long lamp life projector.', NULL, 308, NULL, NULL);
