(606, 'Vivitek  Projector DX331 4500 Lumens XGA DLP', 'The 4500 Lumens XGA DLP Laser Projector is designed to deliver bright, reliable, and high-quality presentations for classrooms, meeting rooms, training centers, and business environments. Featuring XGA (1024×768) resolution, 4,500 lumens brightness, and a high 30,000:1 contrast ratio, it ensures sharp visuals and excellent readability. Equipped with dual HDMI inputs, a powerful 10W speaker, and an energy-efficient laser light source with up to 15,000 hours of lifespan, this projector provides outstanding performance with minimal maintenance.', 'vivitek-projector-dx331-4500-lumens-xga-dlp-1781368556', '<p>The <strong>4500 Lumens XGA DLP Laser Projector</strong> is a versatile projection solution built for educational institutions, corporate offices, conference rooms, and training facilities. With its high brightness output and advanced DLP technology, it delivers clear, vibrant, and detailed images even in environments with ambient lighting.</p><h2>High-Brightness XGA Resolution</h2><p>Featuring a native <strong>XGA (1024 × 768)</strong> resolution, the projector provides crisp text, charts, presentations, and educational content. Its <strong>4,500 lumens brightness</strong> ensures excellent visibility, making it ideal for classrooms and business presentations where room lighting cannot always be controlled.</p><h2>Superior Contrast for Enhanced Clarity</h2><p>A <strong>30,000:1 Full On/Off contrast ratio</strong> helps produce deeper blacks and brighter whites, resulting in improved image depth and better readability for documents, spreadsheets, and multimedia content.</p><h2>Laser Light Source Technology</h2><p>The projector utilizes an advanced laser light source designed for dependable long-term performance and reduced maintenance requirements. Multiple operating modes allow users to maximize efficiency and extend operating life:</p><ul><li><strong>4,000 Hours (Normal Mode)</strong></li><li><strong>5,000 Hours (Eco Mode)</strong></li><li><strong>15,000 Hours (Long Eco Mode)</strong></li></ul><p>This helps reduce overall operating costs while ensuring consistent image quality over time.</p><h2>Powerful Built-in Audio</h2><p>The integrated <strong>10W speaker</strong> delivers clear audio for presentations, lectures, training sessions, and multimedia playback, reducing the need for external speakers in many applications.</p><h2>Flexible Connectivity</h2><p>The projector is equipped with a comprehensive range of connectivity options for seamless integration with laptops, PCs, media players, and AV systems:</p><ul><li>2 × HDMI 1.4a Inputs</li><li>D-Sub Input and Output</li><li>RS-232 Control Port</li><li>USB Type-A Power Output (5V/1.5A)</li></ul><p>These connections provide flexibility for both modern and legacy devices.</p><h2>Energy-Efficient Operation</h2><p>Operating at only <strong>240W in Normal Mode</strong> and <strong>200W in Eco Mode</strong>, the projector delivers excellent performance while maintaining energy efficiency. Standby power consumption remains below <strong>0.5W</strong>, helping reduce electricity usage.</p><h2>Compact and Easy to Deploy</h2><p>Weighing only <strong>2.9 kg</strong>, the projector is lightweight and easy to install in classrooms, offices, conference rooms, training centers, and other professional environments. Its compact design allows for convenient transportation and flexible placement.</p><h2>Key Features</h2><ul><li>XGA (1024 × 768) Native Resolution</li><li>4,500 Lumens High Brightness</li><li>DLP Projection Technology</li><li>30,000:1 Contrast Ratio</li><li>Laser Light Source</li><li>Up to 15,000 Hours Light Source Life</li><li>Dual HDMI 1.4a Inputs</li><li>Built-in 10W Speaker</li><li>D-Sub Input &amp; Output</li><li>RS-232 Control Support</li><li>Lightweight 2.9 kg Design</li></ul>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Display Type</td><td>DLP</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>XGA (1024 × 768)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>4,500 Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>30,000:1 (Full On/Off)</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Details</td><td>Light Source Type</td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Light Source Life</td><td>4,000 Hours (Normal), 5,000 Hours (Eco), 15,000 Hours (Long Eco)</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>10W Speaker</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>HDMI</td><td>2 × HDMI 1.4a</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>D-Sub</td><td>1 × Input, 1 × Output</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>RS-232</td><td>1 × Input</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB</td><td>1 × USB Type-A (Power Only, 5V/1.5A)</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Supply</td><td>AC 100-240V, 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>240W (Normal), 200W (Eco), &lt;0.5W (Standby)</td></tr><tr><td>External Features</td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>2.9 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>313 × 236 × 120 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Projector Warranty</td><td>02 Years Parts &amp; Service Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Warranty</td><td>12 Months or 1000 Hours</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 65000.00, 65000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/YYjbnuOnxRmRe11zcFCmgTYToPy0i5QTyc73nkOQ.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 16:35:56', '2026-06-13 16:35:56', '4500 Lumens XGA DLP Laser Projector | High Brightness Business & Education Projector', 'Buy the 4500 Lumens XGA DLP Laser Projector featuring 30,000:1 contrast ratio, dual HDMI ports, 10W speaker, and up to 15,000-hour laser light source life. Perfect for classrooms, meeting rooms, and business presentations.', '4500 lumens projector, XGA projector, laser projector, DLP laser projector, business projector, classroom projector, education projector, conference room projector, high brightness projector, HDMI projector, presentation projector, office projector, training room projector, professional projector, laser light source projector, multimedia projector.', NULL, 308, NULL, NULL),
(607, 'Vivitek Projector  DW350 4000 Lumens WXGA DLP', 'The 4000 Lumens WXGA DLP Projector is a high-performance display solution designed for classrooms, offices, meeting rooms, and training facilities. Featuring WXGA (1280×800) resolution, 4,000 lumens brightness, and a 30,000:1 contrast ratio, it delivers sharp, vibrant visuals even in bright environments. Dual HDMI connectivity, a powerful 10W speaker, and an extended lamp life of up to 15,000 hours make it a reliable and cost-effective projector for professional use.', 'vivitek-projector-dw350-4000-lumens-wxga-dlp-1781368886', '<p>The <strong>4000 Lumens WXGA DLP Projector</strong> combines powerful brightness, reliable performance, and versatile connectivity to meet the demands of modern classrooms, conference rooms, and training environments. Its WXGA resolution and widescreen format provide clear, detailed visuals that enhance presentations, educational content, and multimedia applications.</p><h2>WXGA Resolution with Brilliant Image Quality</h2><p>Featuring a native <strong>WXGA (1280 × 800)</strong> resolution, the projector offers excellent image clarity for presentations, spreadsheets, videos, and instructional content. The widescreen 16:10 format provides additional viewing area, making it ideal for professional and educational applications.</p><h2>4,000 Lumens High Brightness</h2><p>With <strong>4,000 lumens brightness</strong>, the projector delivers vibrant and readable images even in rooms with ambient lighting. Presentations remain clear and impactful without the need to completely darken the room.</p><h2>High Contrast for Enhanced Detail</h2><p>The impressive <strong>30,000:1 contrast ratio</strong> produces deeper blacks and brighter whites, improving image depth and ensuring text, charts, and graphics remain crisp and easy to read.</p><h2>Long Lamp Life and Low Maintenance</h2><p>Designed for long-term operation, the projector offers multiple lamp modes:</p><ul><li><strong>5,000 Hours (Normal Mode)</strong></li><li><strong>6,000 Hours (Eco Mode)</strong></li><li><strong>15,000 Hours (Long Eco Mode)</strong></li></ul><p>The extended lamp lifespan helps reduce maintenance requirements and lowers total operating costs.</p><h2>Powerful Built-in Audio</h2><p>A built-in <strong>10W speaker</strong> delivers clear sound for presentations, training sessions, and video content without requiring external speakers in smaller meeting spaces.</p><h2>Flexible Connectivity</h2><p>The projector includes a wide range of connectivity options to support modern and legacy devices:</p><ul><li>2 × HDMI 1.4a Inputs</li><li>1 × D-Sub (VGA) Input</li><li>1 × RS-232 Control Port</li><li>USB Type-A Power Port (5V/1.5A)</li><li>Audio Input and Audio Output</li></ul><p>These interfaces provide seamless integration with laptops, desktop computers, media players, and AV control systems.</p><h2>Quiet and Energy-Efficient Operation</h2><p>Operating at only <strong>34dB in Normal Mode</strong> and <strong>27dB in Eco Mode</strong>, the projector minimizes distractions during meetings and lectures. Its energy-efficient design also reduces power consumption while maintaining excellent performance.</p><h2>Compact and Easy Installation</h2><p>With a lightweight design of only <strong>2.9 kg</strong> and compact dimensions, the projector is easy to install, relocate, and maintain. The <strong>112% image offset</strong> offers greater installation flexibility for ceiling-mounted or tabletop setups.</p><h2>Key Features</h2><ul><li>WXGA (1280 × 800) Native Resolution</li><li>4,000 Lumens Brightness</li><li>DLP Projection Technology</li><li>30,000:1 Contrast Ratio</li><li>Dual HDMI 1.4a Inputs</li><li>Built-in 10W Speaker</li><li>Up to 15,000 Hours Lamp Life</li><li>112% Image Offset</li><li>RS-232 Control Support</li><li>Low Noise Operation (27dB Eco Mode)</li><li>Lightweight 2.9 kg Design</li></ul>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Display Type</td><td>DLP</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>WXGA (1280 × 800)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>4,000 Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>30,000:1 (Full On/Off)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Offset</td><td>112% (Full Image Width)</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Details</td><td>Light Source Type</td><td>Fixed Lamp</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>5,000 Hours (Normal), 6,000 Hours (Eco), 15,000 Hours (Long Eco)</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>10W Speaker</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>HDMI</td><td>2 × HDMI 1.4a</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>D-Sub</td><td>1 × VGA Input</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>RS-232</td><td>1 × RS-232 Input</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB</td><td>1 × USB Type-A (Power Only, 5V/1.5A)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio</td><td>1 × Audio-In (Mini Jack), 1 × Audio-Out (Mini Jack)</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Supply</td><td>AC 100-240V, 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>240W (Normal), 200W (Eco), &lt;0.5W (Standby)</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Noise Level</td><td>34dB (Normal), 27dB (Eco)</td></tr><tr><td>External Features</td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>2.9 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>313 × 236 × 120 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Projector Warranty</td><td>02 Years Parts &amp; Service Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Warranty</td><td>12 Months or 1000 Hours</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 56000.00, 56000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/k21HcYFuJEUzfpG5de7tDO2moUpo0gUt6nDhgraA.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 16:41:26', '2026-06-13 16:41:26', '4000 Lumens WXGA DLP Projector | Dual HDMI Business & Education Projector', 'Buy the 4000 Lumens WXGA DLP Projector with 30,000:1 contrast ratio, dual HDMI ports, 10W speaker, and up to 15,000-hour lamp life. Ideal for classrooms, offices, conference rooms, and training environments.', '4000 lumens projector, WXGA projector, DLP projector, business projector, classroom projector, education projector, conference room projector, presentation projector, dual HDMI projector, office projector, multimedia projector, training room projector, high brightness projector, professional projector, long lamp life projector.', NULL, 308, NULL, NULL),
(608, 'Vivitek  Projector DW350BD 4200 Lumens WXGA DLP', 'The 4200 Lumens WXGA DLP Projector delivers bright and vibrant widescreen presentations with WXGA (1280×800) resolution, 4,200 lumens brightness, and a high 30,000:1 contrast ratio. Designed for classrooms, meeting rooms, and business environments, it supports screen sizes up to 300 inches and offers an impressive lamp life of up to 20,000 hours in Long Eco Mode. With HDMI connectivity, a built-in 10W speaker, and flexible installation options, it provides reliable performance for everyday professional use.', 'vivitek-projector-dw350bd-4200-lumens-wxga-dlp-1781369177', '<p>The <strong>4200 Lumens WXGA DLP Projector</strong> is designed to provide exceptional image quality, reliable performance, and long-term value for business presentations, educational institutions, training centers, and conference rooms. Its high brightness output ensures excellent visibility even in environments with ambient lighting.</p><h2>Sharp WXGA Resolution</h2><p>Featuring a native <strong>WXGA (1280 × 800)</strong> resolution and support for signals up to <strong>WUXGA (1920 × 1200)</strong>, the projector delivers crisp text, detailed graphics, and vibrant multimedia content. The widescreen format provides additional viewing space, making presentations more engaging and productive.</p><h2>Powerful Brightness and Contrast</h2><p>With <strong>4,200 lumens brightness</strong> and a <strong>30,000:1 contrast ratio</strong>, the projector produces vivid colors, deeper blacks, and brighter whites. This combination enhances readability and image clarity, making it ideal for displaying presentations, spreadsheets, educational content, and videos.</p><h2>Large Screen Projection</h2><p>The projector supports screen sizes ranging from <strong>40 inches to 300 inches</strong>, allowing users to create immersive viewing experiences in small meeting rooms or large lecture halls without compromising image quality.</p><h2>Extended Lamp Life</h2><p>Equipped with a high-performance <strong>210W UHP lamp</strong>, the projector offers multiple operating modes to maximize lamp longevity:</p><ul><li><strong>5,500 Hours in Normal Mode</strong></li><li><strong>6,000 Hours in Eco Mode</strong></li><li><strong>Up to 20,000 Hours in Long Eco Mode</strong></li></ul><p>This extended lifespan significantly reduces maintenance costs and minimizes downtime.</p><h2>Built-in 10W Speaker</h2><p>A powerful <strong>10W integrated speaker</strong> provides clear audio output for presentations, training sessions, and multimedia playback, reducing the need for external audio systems in many applications.</p><h2>Flexible Connectivity</h2><p>The projector includes a range of essential connectivity options:</p><ul><li>HDMI v1.4b</li><li>VGA Input</li><li>Composite Video Input</li><li>Audio Input and Output</li><li>RS232 Control Port</li><li>USB Power &amp; Service Port (5V/1.5A)</li></ul><p>These interfaces ensure compatibility with laptops, PCs, media players, document cameras, and AV control systems.</p><h2>Energy-Efficient and Easy to Maintain</h2><p>With low standby power consumption of less than <strong>0.5W</strong>, the projector helps reduce energy costs while maintaining professional-grade performance. Its compact and lightweight design also simplifies installation and transportation.</p><h2>Ideal Applications</h2><ul><li>Business Presentations</li><li>Conference Rooms</li><li>Classrooms &amp; Educational Institutions</li><li>Training Centers</li><li>Meeting Rooms</li><li>Seminar Halls</li><li>Multimedia Presentations</li></ul><h2>Key Features</h2><ul><li>WXGA (1280 × 800) Native Resolution</li><li>Supports WUXGA (1920 × 1200)</li><li>4,200 Lumens Brightness</li><li>30,000:1 Contrast Ratio</li><li>DLP Projection Technology</li><li>Screen Size up to 300 Inches</li><li>10W Built-in Speaker</li><li>HDMI, VGA, Composite Video Connectivity</li><li>Up to 20,000 Hours Lamp Life</li><li>Compact 2.6 kg Design</li></ul>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Display Type</td><td>DLP</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>WXGA (1280 × 800)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Maximum Resolution</td><td>WUXGA (1920 × 1200)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>4,200 Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>30,000:1 (Full On/Off)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>40\" – 300\"</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Details</td><td>Lamp Type</td><td>UHP</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Power</td><td>210W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>5,500 Hours (Normal), 6,000 Hours (Eco), Up to 20,000 Hours (Long Eco Mode)</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>10W Speaker</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>HDMI</td><td>1 × HDMI v1.4b</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>VGA Input</td><td>1 × VGA-In</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Video Input</td><td>Composite Video</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Ports</td><td>Audio-In (Mini-Jack), Audio-Out (Mini-Jack)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB</td><td>USB 5V/1.5A (Power &amp; Service)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Control</td><td>RS232</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Supply</td><td>AC 100-240V, 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>250W (Normal), 210W (Eco), &lt;0.5W (Standby)</td></tr><tr><td>External Features</td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>2.6 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>313 × 236 × 120 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Projector Warranty</td><td>02 Years Parts &amp; Service Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Warranty</td><td>12 Months or 1000 Hours</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 53000.00, 53000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/a63bOcSIIOMLTqLR2yoHFRHF24w21YmygUPBd9eM.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 16:46:17', '2026-06-13 16:46:17', '4200 Lumens WXGA DLP Projector | High Brightness Business & Education Projector', 'Buy the 4200 Lumens WXGA DLP Projector with 1280×800 resolution, 30,000:1 contrast ratio, 10W speaker, HDMI connectivity, and up to 20,000-hour lamp life. Perfect for classrooms, offices, conference rooms, and professional presentations.', '4200 lumens projector, WXGA projector, DLP projector, business projector, education projector, classroom projector, conference room projector, meeting room projector, HDMI projector, presentation projector, multimedia projector, office projector, training room projector, high brightness projector, long lamp life projector, widescreen projector.', NULL, 308, NULL, NULL),
(609, 'Vivitek Projector DX330 4000 Lumens XGA DLP', 'The Vivitek DX330 is a 4,000-lumen XGA DLP projector featuring a 30,000:1 contrast ratio, support for resolutions up to WUXGA (1920 x 1200), a built-in 10W speaker, and lamp life of up to 15,000 hours. It is an excellent choice for classrooms, meeting rooms, and business presentations requiring bright and reliable projection performance.', 'vivitek-projector-dx330-4000-lumens-xga-dlp-1781369511', '<p>The <strong>Vivitek DX330 4000 Lumens XGA DLP Projector</strong> is a reliable and high-performance projection solution designed for classrooms, meeting rooms, training centers, and business environments. Powered by advanced <strong>DLP technology</strong> and a <strong>0.55-inch DLP chip from Texas Instruments</strong>, the DX330 delivers bright, sharp, and vibrant images with <strong>4,000 ANSI lumens brightness</strong> and a <strong>30,000:1 contrast ratio</strong>. Whether you\'re presenting business reports, educational content, or multimedia presentations, this projector ensures excellent image quality even in well-lit rooms.</p><p>With its native <strong>XGA (1024 x 768)</strong> resolution and support for resolutions up to <strong>WUXGA (1920 x 1200)</strong>, the Vivitek DX330 provides clear text, detailed graphics, and accurate colors. Its long-lasting lamp life of up to <strong>15,000 hours in Long Eco Mode</strong> significantly reduces maintenance costs, making it an economical choice for daily professional use.</p><h2>Key Features of Vivitek DX330</h2><h3>Bright 4,000 Lumens Projection</h3><p>The Vivitek DX330 delivers <strong>4,000 lumens of brightness</strong>, ensuring clear and vivid images even in environments with ambient lighting. This makes it ideal for classrooms, conference rooms, and training facilities.</p><h3>XGA Resolution with WUXGA Support</h3><p>Featuring a native <strong>1024 x 768 XGA resolution</strong>, the projector offers sharp visuals and supports resolutions up to <strong>1920 x 1200 WUXGA</strong> for enhanced compatibility with modern devices and content sources.</p><h3>High 30,000:1 Contrast Ratio</h3><p>A powerful <strong>30,000:1 contrast ratio</strong> provides deeper blacks, brighter whites, and improved image depth, ensuring presentations and videos appear more engaging and professional.</p><h3>Long Lamp Life</h3><p>The projector\'s efficient lamp system offers:</p><ul><li><strong>5,000 Hours</strong> in Normal Mode</li><li><strong>6,000 Hours</strong> in Eco Mode</li><li><strong>15,000 Hours</strong> in Long Eco Mode</li></ul><p>This extended lifespan reduces maintenance requirements and lowers total ownership costs.</p><h3>Flexible Projection Size</h3><p>The DX330 can project screen sizes ranging from approximately <strong>28 inches to over 300 inches</strong>, making it suitable for both small meeting spaces and large presentation venues.</p><h3>Built-in 10W Speaker</h3><p>An integrated <strong>10W speaker</strong> provides clear audio performance for presentations and multimedia playback without requiring external speakers.</p><h3>Multiple Connectivity Options</h3><p>The projector supports a wide range of devices through:</p><ul><li>HDMI v1.4b</li><li>VGA-In</li><li>Composite Video</li><li>Audio In/Out</li><li>RS232 Control Port</li><li>USB Power &amp; Service Port</li></ul><h3>Compact and Lightweight Design</h3><p>With a weight of only <strong>2.6 kg</strong>, the Vivitek DX330 is easy to install, transport, and manage in various environments.</p><h2>Why Choose the Vivitek DX330 Projector?</h2><p>The Vivitek DX330 combines high brightness, excellent image quality, long lamp life, and versatile connectivity in a compact design. It is an ideal choice for educational institutions, corporate meeting rooms, training centers, and professional presentation environments that require dependable performance and low operating costs.</p><h2>Buy Vivitek DX330 4000 Lumens XGA DLP Projector from International Office Solution (IOS)</h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the <strong>original Vivitek DX330 4000 Lumens XGA DLP Projector</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution (IOS)</strong>. We offer genuine Vivitek projectors at competitive prices, backed by reliable after-sales support and warranty services.</p><p>Order online or contact <strong>International Office Solution (IOS)</strong> to get the latest price and availability of the Vivitek DX330 projector.</p><h3>Warranty Information</h3><ul><li><strong>Projector Warranty:</strong> 02 Years Parts &amp; Service Warranty</li><li><strong>Lamp Warranty:</strong> 12 Months or 1000 Hours (Whichever Comes First)</li></ul>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>DLP</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>XGA (1024 x 768)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Maximum Resolution</td><td>WUXGA (1920 x 1200)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>4,000 Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>4:3</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>30,000:1 (Full On/Off)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Light Source</strong></td><td>Type</td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>5,000 hrs (Normal), 6,000 hrs (Eco), 15,000 hrs (Long Eco)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>10W Speaker</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI</td><td>HDMI v1.4b x1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>VGA-In</td><td>1 x VGA-In</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Composite Video</td><td>1 x Composite Video</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio-In</td><td>1 x Mini-Jack</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio-Out</td><td>1 x Mini-Jack</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>RS232</td><td>1 x RS232</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB</td><td>USB 5V/1.5A (Power &amp; Service)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Supply</td><td>AC 100-240V, 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>240W (Normal), 200W (Eco), &lt;0.5W (Standby)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance</strong></td><td>Noise Level</td><td>31dB (Normal), 27dB (Eco)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>External Features</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>2.6kg (5.7 lbs)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>313 x 236 x 120mm (12.3\" x 9.3\" x 4.7\")</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Parts &amp; Service</td><td>02 Years Parts &amp; Service Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Warranty</td><td>12 Months or 1000 Hours Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 44500.00, 44500.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/xTDWUBthB4kd7ka6CZt6bCJYndlaf6bXrf8wPV3a.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 16:51:51', '2026-06-13 16:51:51', 'Vivitek DX330 4000 Lumens XGA DLP Projector Price in Bangladesh | IOS', 'Buy the Vivitek DX330 4000 Lumens XGA DLP Projector in Bangladesh from International Office Solution (IOS). Features XGA resolution, 30,000:1 contrast ratio, 10W speaker, and up to 15,000 hours lamp life.', 'Vivitek DX330, Vivitek DX330 Projector, Vivitek XGA Projector, 4000 Lumens Projector, DLP Projector Bangladesh, Business Projector, Classroom Projector, Vivitek Projector Price Bangladesh, XGA Projector, Conference Room Projector, Vivitek DX330 Price, International Office Solution, IOS Bangladesh, Multimedia Projector, Presentation Projector, Office Projector, Education Projector, Vivitek Bangladesh, Projector Price in Bangladesh, DLP Presentation Projector', NULL, 308, NULL, NULL),
(610, 'Arctic Alpine 23 CO Compact AMD CPU Cooler', 'The Arctic Alpine 23 CO (Continuous Operation) Compact AMD CPU Cooler is a specialized, high-durability cooling solution engineered specifically for AMD AM4 sockets. Designed for reliability in demanding, 24/7 operating environments, the \"CO\" model features a robust dual-ball bearing fan that significantly extends the lifespan of the cooler compared to standard sleeve-bearing fans. Its extremely compact footprint and pre-applied high-performance MX-2 thermal compound make it an ideal choice for SFF (Small Form Factor) builds, industrial PCs, or home servers where space is limited and long-term maintenance-free operation is a priority.', 'arctic-alpine-23-co-compact-amd-cpu-cooler-1781372595', '<p>When uptime is mission-critical, the <strong>Arctic Alpine 23 CO</strong> provides the thermal peace of mind you need. Unlike standard air coolers that may degrade under continuous, heavy-duty usage, the \"CO\" (Continuous Operation) designation indicates that this cooler is equipped with a high-grade dual-ball bearing fan. This specific bearing type is engineered to resist heat and wear, ensuring the fan maintains its performance and acoustic profile over an exceptionally long service life, making it the perfect choice for servers, office workstations, or any system that never sleeps.</p><p>Despite its rugged nature, the Alpine 23 CO remains incredibly efficient in its space utilization. Its optimized heatsink design maximizes surface area while keeping the total height low, ensuring compatibility with even the tightest ITX and SFF cases. Installation is a \"no-tool\" experience; the cooler utilizes a simple clip-on system for AMD AM4 sockets, and because it comes with high-grade ARCTIC MX-2 thermal paste pre-applied, you can complete the installation in seconds without the mess of manual application. It is a no-nonsense, high-reliability solution for builders who value longevity and efficiency above all else.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Durability</strong></td><td>Dual-Ball Bearing</td><td>Engineered for \"Continuous Operation,\" ensuring extreme resistance to heat and extended fan longevity.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Footprint</strong></td><td>Ultra-Compact Design</td><td>An optimized, low-profile form factor designed specifically for SFF (Small Form Factor) and ITX cases.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Optimized Extruded Heatsink</td><td>A high-quality aluminum heatsink provides efficient heat dissipation for standard TDP processors.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Installation</strong></td><td>Tool-Free Clip-on System</td><td>A simplified mounting mechanism for AMD AM4 sockets ensures rapid, secure installation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pre-applied Paste</strong></td><td>MX-2 Thermal Compound</td><td>Factory-applied high-performance thermal paste ensures optimal thermal conductivity out of the box.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Socket Support</strong></td><td>AMD AM4</td><td>Designed specifically for broad compatibility with the AM4 socket architecture.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustics</strong></td><td>Quiet Fan Profile</td><td>Operates with a focus on low-noise output, suitable for office and quiet server environments.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 850.00, 850.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/GtD2d4trDTzejjfux0FsnIWoKjlY0MSkTwik0RYA.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 17:43:15', '2026-06-13 17:43:15', 'Arctic Alpine 23 CO CPU Cooler | AM4 Continuous Operation', 'Reliable cooling for your AMD AM4 system. The Arctic Alpine 23 CO features a durable dual-ball bearing for continuous, 24/7 operation. Perfect for SFF builds.', 'Arctic Alpine 23 CO, AMD AM4 cooler, continuous operation CPU cooler, SFF CPU cooler, ITX air cooler, dual ball bearing fan, durable AM4 cooler, silent SFF cooling, Arctic cooling solution', NULL, 28, NULL, NULL),
(611, 'Arctic Alpine 17 CO Low Profile Intel CPU Cooler', 'The Ultra-Compact Performance Air CPU Cooler is a specialized thermal solution engineered for space-constrained builds and industrial applications demanding high reliability. Featuring an ultra-compact 95mm footprint and a total height of just 77mm, it offers unlimited RAM clearance, making it ideal for SFF (Small Form Factor) and ITX systems. Equipped with a robust dual-ball bearing fan that scales dynamically from 250 to 2700 RPM, it provides efficient cooling while maintaining an exceptionally low acoustic profile of just 0.5 Sone. With pre-applied high-performance MX-4 thermal compound and a massive 6-year warranty, this cooler is a premier choice for longevity, ease of installation, and consistent performance on modern Intel LGA 1851 and 1700 platforms.', 'arctic-alpine-17-co-low-profile-intel-cpu-cooler-1781373081', '<p><strong>rformance Air CPU Cooler</strong> delivers an uncompromising solution. Designed to fit where larger tower coolers cannot, its 95mm x 95mm footprint ensures that your RAM slots and motherboard components remain entirely unobstructed, providing the unlimited clearance necessary for complex builds.</p><p>Performance is managed by a high-grade dual-ball bearing fan, which is engineered for extreme durability and reduced friction, ensuring reliable operation in ambient temperatures up to 40 °C. The fan’s PWM control allows it to operate as slowly as 250 RPM for near-silent operation during light tasks, while scaling up to a powerful 2700 RPM to handle thermal loads effectively. With 0.5 Sone of acoustic output, the cooler is designed to be whisper-quiet, perfect for professional workstations, media centers, or quiet office environments.</p><p>The installation process is streamlined to minimize downtime. The cooler arrives with premium Arctic MX-4 thermal compound pre-applied, ensuring optimal heat transfer directly out of the box without the mess or guesswork of manual application. Built for the latest Intel architectures—including the high-performance LGA 1851 and 1700 sockets—and backed by an industry-leading 6-year warranty, this cooler is a long-term, high-value investment for any desktop PC.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>95 x 95 x 77 mm</td><td>An ultra-compact tower footprint that guarantees 100% RAM clearance for any motherboard.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustics</strong></td><td>0.5 Sone</td><td>Expertly balanced for near-silent operation in quiet home or office environments.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>250 - 2700 RPM</td><td>PWM regulation allows for incredibly low idle speeds and high-airflow peaks under load.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Durability</strong></td><td>Dual Ball Bearing</td><td>High-quality bearing design ensures minimal wear and a longer lifespan than standard fans.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Reliability</strong></td><td>0–40 °C Ambient Rating</td><td>Engineered to maintain consistent performance in a variety of real-world operating environments.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ease of Use</strong></td><td>Pre-applied MX-4 Compound</td><td>Industry-standard thermal paste is factory-applied for immediate, mess-free installation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 1851, 1700</td><td>Dedicated mounting support for the most recent and powerful Intel processor sockets.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>6 Years</td><td>An industry-leading 6-year warranty provides absolute confidence in your hardware investment.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 1100.00, 1100.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/JqYx1GN9CkztUnlfyVOMe6qfoqvfyrOSezqRjq9a.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 17:51:21', '2026-06-13 17:51:21', 'Ultra-Compact Air CPU Cooler | LGA 1851 & 1700 Compatible', 'Maximize space with this Ultra-Compact Air Cooler. Features 2700 RPM PWM fan, 0.5 Sone noise, unlimited RAM clearance, and a 6-year warranty.', 'compact CPU cooler, SFF air cooler, ITX CPU fan, Intel LGA 1851 cooler, LGA 1700 air cooler, quiet CPU cooler, dual ball bearing cooler, low profile CPU fan, 6 year warranty cooler', NULL, 28, NULL, NULL),
(612, 'Arctic Freezer 8A AMD Air CPU Cooler', 'The Ultra-Compact High-Efficiency AMD CPU Cooler is a performance-driven thermal solution designed specifically for the AMD AM5 and AM4 platforms. Measuring just 136mm in height with an 83mm footprint, it is an ideal choice for space-constrained SFF (Small Form Factor) or ITX builds. Despite its small size, it features two 6mm direct-touch copper heatpipes and 46 high-density aluminum fins for rapid heat dissipation. Equipped with a whisper-quiet Fluid Dynamic Bearing (FDB) fan that features a 0-RPM idle mode and PWM control up to 2300 RPM, it offers an excellent balance of cooling and silence. Complete with pre-applied premium MX-6 thermal paste and a robust 6-year warranty, it is a future-proof, low-maintenance thermal foundation for any AMD-based system.', 'arctic-freezer-8a-amd-air-cpu-cooler-1781373164', '<p><strong>High-Efficiency AMD CPU Cooler</strong>. Designed for enthusiasts who demand reliable cooling in compact chassis, this cooler optimizes airflow through 46 precision-engineered aluminum fins, ensuring that even under heavy workloads, thermal energy is moved away from the processor efficiently. Its direct-touch heatpipe technology utilizes two 6mm copper pipes to draw heat directly from the CPU die, providing rapid and reliable heat transfer.</p><p>Performance is managed by a sophisticated PWM-controlled fan featuring a long-life Fluid Dynamic Bearing (FDB). This fan is designed for complete silence at idle, utilizing a 0-RPM mode whenever the PWM signal is below 5%, ensuring your system remains distraction-free during light tasks. Under load, it scales smoothly up to 2300 RPM to provide the necessary airflow to keep your AMD processor within optimal thermal limits.</p><p>The cooler is engineered for a seamless user experience. It arrives with industry-leading ARCTIC MX-6 thermal paste pre-applied, ensuring that your installation is clean, fast, and thermally optimized right out of the box. With its compact 136mm height, it easily fits into most standard and small-form-factor cases, while the 6-year warranty provides unmatched peace of mind. This is the ideal thermal solution for builders who value engineering precision, longevity, and a hassle-free setup.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>2x 6mm Copper Heatpipes</td><td>Direct-touch design ensures immediate, high-efficiency heat absorption from the CPU surface.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Build</strong></td><td>46x 0.4mm Aluminum Fins</td><td>A dense, high-surface-area fin stack maximizes dissipation capacity within a compact tower footprint.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Technology</strong></td><td>Fluid Dynamic Bearing (FDB)</td><td>Advanced bearing design ensures near-silent operation and an exceptionally long service life.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustics &amp; Control</strong></td><td>0 - 2300 RPM, PWM</td><td>0-RPM idle mode ensures absolute silence when the system is not under load.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AMD Compatibility</strong></td><td>AM5, AM4</td><td>Specifically optimized mounting for the latest and most popular AMD Ryzen processor architectures.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ease of Use</strong></td><td>Pre-applied MX-6 Compound</td><td>High-performance thermal paste is factory-applied for a perfect, mess-free installation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>83 x 108 x 136 mm</td><td>A highly compatible footprint ideal for SFF, ITX, and standard mid-tower case configurations.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>6 Years</td><td>An industry-leading 6-year warranty ensures long-term reliability and protection for your investment.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 1800.00, 1800.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/kyQn4XGeAM5xLynIEulD8CQuaYkt8aydpOWTp1Ym.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 17:52:44', '2026-06-13 17:52:44', 'Compact AMD CPU Cooler | AM5 & AM4 High-Efficiency Cooling', 'Maximize space with this Compact AMD CPU Cooler. Features 2 heatpipes, 2300 RPM PWM fan with 0-RPM mode, pre-applied MX-6, and a 6-year warranty.', 'AMD CPU cooler, AM5 air cooler, AM4 CPU fan, compact CPU cooler, ITX cooling solution, 2 heatpipe cooler, direct touch CPU cooler, quiet AMD fan, 6 year warranty', NULL, 28, NULL, NULL),
(613, 'Arctic Freezer 8i Air CPU Cooler', 'The Ultra-Compact High-Performance Intel CPU Cooler is a specialized thermal solution engineered specifically for modern Intel LGA 1851 and 1700 platforms. Featuring a highly efficient 136mm tower design with an 83mm footprint, it is an ideal choice for space-constrained SFF (Small Form Factor) or ITX builds. Despite its compact profile, it utilizes two 6mm direct-touch copper heatpipes and 46 high-density aluminum fins to deliver rapid, reliable heat dissipation. Equipped with a whisper-quiet 100mm PWM-controlled fan featuring a long-life Fluid Dynamic Bearing, it provides an excellent balance of thermal capacity and near-silent operation. With a robust 6-year warranty, this cooler is a durable, future-proof thermal foundation for any compact Intel-based workstation or gaming rig.', 'arctic-freezer-8i-air-cpu-cooler-1781373252', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>Maximize your Intel build\'s thermal efficiency without sacrificing chassis space with the <strong>Ultra-Compact High-Performance Intel CPU Cooler</strong>. Designed for enthusiasts who demand reliable cooling in tight environments, this cooler optimizes airflow through 46 precision-engineered aluminum fins, ensuring that thermal energy is moved away from the processor rapidly. Its direct-touch heatpipe technology uses two 6mm copper pipes to draw heat directly from the CPU surface, providing highly efficient thermal conduction.</p><p>Performance is governed by a sophisticated 100mm PWM-controlled fan featuring a premium Fluid Dynamic Bearing (FDB). This bearing design is engineered for both stability and an exceptionally long service life, ensuring that your cooling solution remains consistent even after years of operation. With a wide operational range up to 2300 RPM, the fan scales dynamically to meet the needs of your system, ensuring that the cooler remains whisper-quiet during light productivity tasks while providing the necessary airflow to keep your LGA 1851 or 1700 processor well within its thermal limits during intensive workloads.</p><p>The cooler is engineered for a seamless user experience and long-term reliability. Its compact 136mm height ensures compatibility with the vast majority of standard and small-form-factor cases, while the industry-leading 6-year warranty provides unmatched peace of mind. For builders who value engineering precision, longevity, and a hassle-free setup, this cooler represents the ideal thermal investment.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Specification</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>2x 6mm Copper Heatpipes</td><td>Direct-touch design ensures immediate, high-efficiency heat absorption from the CPU surface.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Build</strong></td><td>46x 0.4mm Aluminum Fins</td><td>A dense, high-surface-area fin stack maximizes dissipation capacity within a compact tower footprint.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Technology</strong></td><td>Fluid Dynamic Bearing (FDB)</td><td>Advanced bearing design ensures near-silent operation and an exceptionally long service life.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustics &amp; Control</strong></td><td>200 - 2300 RPM, PWM</td><td>Wide PWM range allows for near-silent idle operation and strong airflow under heavy stress.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intel Compatibility</strong></td><td>LGA 1851, 1700</td><td>Specifically optimized mounting for the latest and most powerful Intel processor architectures.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Specs</strong></td><td>0—40 °C Ambient</td><td>Engineered to maintain consistent performance across a variety of real-world operating environments.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>83 x 108 x 136 mm</td><td>A highly compatible footprint ideal for SFF, ITX, and standard mid-tower case configurations.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>6 Years</td><td>An industry-leading 6-year warranty ensures long-term reliability and protection for your investment.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 1700.00, 1700.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/wOzKEfB8lhc1IUh2gVPJrnB1pBuqtvAFOXFUyXIX.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 17:54:12', '2026-06-13 17:54:12', 'Compact Intel CPU Cooler | LGA 1851 & 1700 High-Performance', 'Maximize space with this Compact Intel CPU Cooler. Features 2 heatpipes, 2300 RPM PWM fan, Fluid Dynamic Bearing, and a 6-year warranty.', 'Intel CPU cooler, LGA 1851 air cooler, LGA 1700 CPU fan, compact CPU cooler, ITX cooling solution, 2 heatpipe cooler, direct touch CPU cooler, quiet Intel fan, 6 year warranty cooler', NULL, 28, NULL, NULL),
(614, 'Arctic Freezer 8i CO Intel Air CPU Cooler', 'The Arctic Freezer 8i CO is a specialized, high-durability tower air cooler designed for 24/7 reliability on Intel LGA 1851 and 1700 sockets. Featuring a high-end twin-ball bearing fan, it is engineered for continuous operation, resisting heat and wear better than traditional designs. With its direct-touch copper heat pipe technology and pre-applied MX-6 thermal paste, it delivers efficient, maintenance-free thermal management in a compact footprint.', 'arctic-freezer-8i-co-intel-air-cpu-cooler-1781373472', '<h3><strong>Short Description</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Arctic Freezer 8i CO</strong> is a specialized, high-durability tower air cooler designed for 24/7 reliability on Intel LGA 1851 and 1700 sockets. Featuring a high-end twin-ball bearing fan, it is engineered for continuous operation, resisting heat and wear better than traditional designs. With its direct-touch copper heat pipe technology and pre-applied MX-6 thermal paste, it delivers efficient, maintenance-free thermal management in a compact footprint.</p><h3><strong>Long Description</strong></h3><p>Engineered for mission-critical stability in demanding environments, the <strong>Arctic Freezer 8i CO</strong> represents the pinnacle of compact thermal engineering. The \"CO\" designation stands for \"Continuous Operation,\" a professional-grade standard indicating that this cooler is equipped with a high-end twin-ball bearing fan rather than a standard sleeve bearing. This precision bearing design is specifically hardened to withstand the rigors of non-stop usage, significantly reducing friction, resisting heat-induced degradation, and extending the operational lifespan of the fan far beyond conventional consumer-grade models. This makes the Freezer 8i CO an impeccable choice for home servers, high-uptime workstations, and industrial PC builds that simply cannot afford downtime.</p><p>Despite its rugged, industrial-grade construction, the cooler maintains a sophisticated and space-efficient tower profile. Standing at a modest 136mm in height, it is engineered to maximize compatibility across a wide spectrum of chassis, including small-form-factor (SFF) and ITX cases where physical clearance is at a premium. The thermal engine is driven by two 6mm copper heat pipes that utilize a \"direct-touch\" architecture, allowing them to draw heat away from the processor die with near-zero thermal resistance. This energy is then dissipated through a dense array of 46 aluminum fins, which have been geometrically optimized to promote high-velocity airflow even at lower fan speeds.</p><p>The user experience is defined by efficiency and simplicity. The cooling unit features an intelligent PWM-controlled 100mm fan that includes a \"0-RPM\" mode—when the motherboard PWM signal drops below 5%, the fan stops entirely, providing absolute silence during idle states or low-intensity computing tasks. Furthermore, Arctic’s commitment to eco-friendly design is reflected in the dedicated Intel-only mounting frame, which removes the need for universal, multi-socket hardware, thereby reducing packaging waste. To ensure a perfect thermal bond from the very first boot, the cooler arrives with Arctic’s flagship MX-6 thermal compound pre-applied, eliminating the mess and potential for error associated with manual paste application. Backed by an industry-leading 6-year warranty, the Freezer 8i CO is more than just a cooler; it is a long-term, maintenance-free investment in the stability and longevity of your Intel-based system.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Thermal Management</td><td>2x 6mm Copper Heatpipes (Direct Touch) with 46 Aluminum Fins</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Dynamics</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>100mm Twin-Ball Bearing PWM Fan (200–2300 RPM)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Dedicated Intel LGA 1851 &amp; 1700 Socket Mounting</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 2100.00, 2100.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/YtIEFkHBomN6cG0JMvxdde2JhYmc0aAFrCcAHC5Y.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 17:57:52', '2026-06-13 17:57:52', 'Arctic Freezer 8i CO | Intel LGA 1851/1700 CPU Cooler', 'Reliable 24/7 cooling for Intel LGA 1851/1700. The Arctic Freezer 8i CO features a twin-ball bearing fan, 6-year warranty, and compact design.', 'Arctic Freezer 8i CO, Intel LGA 1851 cooler, LGA 1700 air cooler, twin-ball bearing CPU fan, compact Intel cooler, continuous operation cooler, 6 year warranty CPU fan, quiet Intel cooling, high-reliability air cooler', NULL, 28, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `name`, `short_description`, `slug`, `description`, `specifications_text`, `tags`, `buy_price`, `price`, `discount_price`, `stock`, `thumbnail`, `video`, `is_featured`, `status`, `is_coming_soon`, `is_tba`, `is_call_for_price`, `is_out_of_stock`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`, `meta_keywords`, `meta_image`, `brand_id`, `supplier_id`, `laptop_purpose_id`) VALUES
(615, 'Arctic Freezer 7 X Multi-Compatible Air CPU Cooler', 'The Ultra-Slim Performance Air Cooler is a versatile, low-profile cooling solution engineered to deliver reliable thermal management without compromising on space. Featuring a compact 74.3mm depth and an optimized 132.5mm height, it provides excellent RAM and PCIe clearance for crowded ITX or SFF (Small Form Factor) motherboard layouts. With a whisper-quiet 2000 RPM PWM fan rated at a mere 0.3 Sone, it ensures silent operation even under load, while the factory-applied MX-4 thermal compound guarantees a clean and efficient installation for a wide range of modern Intel and AMD platforms.', 'arctic-freezer-7-x-multi-compatible-air-cpu-cooler-1781373574', '<p>Designed for enthusiasts who demand a blend of form and function, the <strong>Ultra-Slim Performance Air Cooler</strong> offers a sophisticated thermal solution for constrained PC environments. The cooler’s geometry is specifically tailored for dense builds, where the ultra-slim profile ensures that memory modules and graphics card slots remain fully accessible and unobstructed. Despite its modest footprint, the heatsink is engineered for high heat-density dissipation, providing the sustained thermal performance required for stable gaming, media creation, and home-office productivity.</p><p>The cooling experience is centered around a precision-engineered 2000 RPM PWM fan that utilizes advanced acoustic dampening technology to maintain a virtually silent 0.3 Sone output. This allows the fan to scale its speed intelligently based on CPU temperature, effectively balancing airflow with an exceptionally quiet noise floor. Furthermore, the inclusion of pre-applied high-performance MX-4 thermal paste removes the complexity of manual application, ensuring that the thermal interface material is perfectly distributed for maximum heat conductivity the moment you secure the unit to your motherboard.</p><p>This cooler stands out for its broad, future-proof socket compatibility, supporting an extensive array of both Intel and AMD architectures, including recent additions like the Intel 1700 and AMD AM5 platforms. Whether you are upgrading an existing office PC, building a compact gaming rig, or constructing a high-reliability server, this unit is built to provide consistent, maintenance-free performance. Its durable construction and optimized design ensure that your components remain cool, stable, and protected under a variety of operating conditions.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Thermal Management</td><td>High-density Aluminum Fin Stack with PWM-controlled airflow</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Dynamics</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>300–2000 RPM PWM Fan with 0.3 Sone acoustic rating</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Universal mounting for Intel (LGA 1700/1200/115x) and AMD (AM5/AM4/AM3/FMx)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Bearing Type</strong></td><td>Durability</td><td>Fluid Dynamic Bearing (FDB) for extended longevity and lower noise</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Interface</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>Pre-applied Arctic MX-4 thermal compound for optimal heat transfer</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Specs</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Compatible with standard 12V DC power inputs</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'CPU Cooler', 2550.00, 2550.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/R7LIjH9bu6nwssIhI2YdiV6sG3NSaHxybPewgyKe.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 17:59:34', '2026-06-13 17:59:34', 'Ultra-Slim Air CPU Cooler | Silent & Universal Compatibility', 'Maximize space with this Ultra-Slim Air Cooler. Features 2000 RPM PWM fan, 0.3 Sone silence, universal socket support, and pre-applied MX-4 paste.', 'slim CPU cooler, low profile air cooler, ITX CPU fan, Intel 1700 air cooler, AMD AM5 air cooler, silent CPU cooler, 0.3 Sone fan, universal CPU cooling, compact PC cooler', NULL, 28, NULL, NULL),
(616, 'Arctic Freezer 36 Multi Compatible Tower CPU Cooler', 'The Arctic Freezer 36 is a robust, high-performance tower CPU cooler engineered for universal compatibility across the latest Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4) platforms. With a superior cooling capacity—boasting a 250 Performance Index—this cooler utilizes four direct-touch copper heat pipes and a high-density 59-fin aluminum stack to manage thermal output efficiently. Featuring dual P12 PWM fans with fluid dynamic bearings and a 0-RPM idle mode, it delivers whisper-quiet operation during light tasks while providing powerful cooling under heavy loads, all backed by a comprehensive 6-year warranty.', 'arctic-freezer-36-multi-compatible-tower-cpu-cooler-1781373604', '<p>Designed for power users who demand both thermal headroom and acoustic precision, the <strong>Arctic Freezer 36</strong> sets a new standard for air-cooling versatility. At its core, the cooling engine leverages four high-precision 6mm copper heat pipes that establish a rapid thermal bridge between the CPU and the massive 59-fin aluminum stack. This architecture ensures that even modern, multi-core processors remain well within their operating limits during intensive gaming, rendering, or multitasking sessions.</p><p>Beyond its raw cooling potential, the Freezer 36 is distinguished by its acoustic engineering. It comes equipped with dual P12 PWM fans that utilize high-end fluid dynamic bearings, minimizing friction and wear to ensure an exceptionally long service life. The PWM control logic is highly sophisticated, allowing the fans to drop to 0 RPM when the duty cycle falls below 5%, effectively eliminating fan noise during web browsing or office work. The inclusion of an integrated splitter cable simplifies cable management, allowing for clean, unobstructed airflow within the chassis.</p><p>Installation is refined for maximum efficiency; the cooler ships with Arctic’s premium MX-6 thermal paste factory-applied, ensuring that the thermal interface is perfectly optimized the moment it is mounted. By consolidating support for Intel LGA 1851/1700 and AMD AM5/AM4 into a single, cohesive unit, the Freezer 36 serves as a future-proof thermal solution for evolving hardware needs. Built to thrive in environments ranging from 0–40 °C and protected by a robust 6-year warranty, this cooler is a long-term investment in system stability and performance.</p><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Thermal Dynamics</td><td>4x 6mm Copper Heatpipes + 59x 0.4mm Aluminum Fins</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Dynamics</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>Dual P12 PWM PST Fans (200–1800 RPM)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Intel LGA 1851/1700; AMD AM5/AM4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Bearing Type</strong></td><td>Longevity</td><td>Fluid Dynamic Bearing (FDB) for reduced friction and noise</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Interface</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>Pre-applied Arctic MX-6 Thermal Compound (0.8g)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Index</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>234 Normalized Noise Performance Index (NNPI)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Range</strong></td><td>Environment</td><td>0—40 °C Ambient Operating Temperature</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 3500.00, 3500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/PKmtZeg6og0ETRhJCxdIt67B2QwbY6OxgGn69vOs.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 18:00:04', '2026-06-13 18:01:01', 'Arctic Freezer 36 Multi-Compatible CPU Cooler | Intel & AMD Ready', 'High-performance Arctic Freezer 36 tower cooler. Features 4 heatpipes, dual P12 PWM fans, 0-RPM mode, and 6-year warranty. Intel & AMD compatible.', 'Arctic Freezer 36, tower CPU cooler, Intel LGA 1851 cooler, AMD AM5 air cooler, quiet CPU cooler, high performance air cooling, 0-RPM fan, Fluid Dynamic Bearing, 6 year warranty cooler', NULL, 28, NULL, NULL),
(617, 'Arctic Freezer 36 Black Multi Compatible Tower CPU Cooler', 'The Arctic Freezer 36 Black is a high-performance, aesthetically striking tower air cooler engineered for universal compatibility with modern Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4) platforms. Featuring a stealthy all-black finish, this cooler utilizes four high-efficiency 6mm copper heat pipes and a dense 59-fin aluminum stack to provide elite-tier thermal dissipation. Driven by dual P12 PWM PST fans with fluid dynamic bearings and a 0-RPM silent mode, the Freezer 36 Black delivers an optimal balance of cooling power and acoustic stealth, all secured by a robust 6-year warranty.', 'arctic-freezer-36-black-multi-compatible-tower-cpu-cooler-1781373819', '<p>For enthusiasts who demand both aggressive thermal management and a refined, professional look, the <strong>Arctic Freezer 36 Black</strong> serves as a top-tier cooling foundation. Its sleek, black-coated finish integrates seamlessly into high-end gaming rigs and professional workstations, providing a sophisticated aesthetic that complements any modern build. Beyond its visual appeal, the cooler is a masterclass in thermal engineering; it employs four precision-bent copper heat pipes that establish an instantaneous thermal link with the CPU, rapidly transferring heat into a substantial 59-fin aluminum tower for maximum air-surface interaction.</p><p>Acoustic control is handled by dual P12 PWM PST fans, renowned for their consistent airflow and longevity. These fans utilize advanced fluid dynamic bearings to minimize operational friction, ensuring a longer service life and lower noise floor compared to standard options. The inclusion of a 0-RPM mode—where the fans remain completely stationary when the PWM signal is below 5%—ensures your PC remains silent during browsing, streaming, or light administrative tasks. With an integrated splitter cable and pre-applied Arctic MX-6 thermal paste, the Freezer 36 Black is designed for a frictionless installation process, allowing users to move from unboxing to peak performance in minutes. Optimized for a 0–40 °C ambient temperature range, this cooler is an exceptionally reliable and long-term solution for maintaining peak system stability.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Thermal Dynamics</td><td>4x 6mm Copper Heatpipes + 59x 0.4mm Aluminum Fins</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Dynamics</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>Dual P12 PWM PST Fans (200–1800 RPM)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Intel LGA 1851/1700; AMD AM5/AM4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Bearing Type</strong></td><td>Longevity</td><td>Fluid Dynamic Bearing (FDB) for reduced friction and noise</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Interface</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>Pre-applied Arctic MX-6 Thermal Compound (0.8g)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Index</strong></td><td>Capacity</td><td>250 PI (Performance Index) / 234 NNPI</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Range</strong></td><td>Environment</td><td>0—40 °C Ambient Operating Temperature</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 3999.00, 3999.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/nDPgKQkMRue9RmgomqiRFkiWEELUcRqqowIIhoY4.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 18:03:39', '2026-06-13 18:03:39', 'Arctic Freezer 36 Black | High-Performance Tower CPU Cooler', 'Elevate your cooling with the Arctic Freezer 36 Black. Features all-black design, dual P12 PWM fans, 0-RPM mode, and a 6-year warranty. Buy in Bangladesh.', 'Arctic Freezer 36 Black, black tower CPU cooler, Intel LGA 1851 cooling, AMD AM5 air cooler, quiet CPU cooler, high performance air cooling, 0-RPM fan, Fluid Dynamic Bearing, 6 year warranty cooler, Arctic CPU cooler Bangladesh', NULL, 28, NULL, NULL),
(618, 'Arctic Freezer 36 CO Air CPU Cooler', 'The Arctic Freezer 36 CO (Continuous Operation) is a high-performance tower cooler built for absolute durability, making it the perfect match for workstations, servers, and gaming rigs that demand 24/7 reliability. Featuring a robust push-pull dual-fan configuration with long-life dual ball bearings, this cooler excels in thermal management for Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4) platforms. With its optimized open-side heatsink design and included premium MX-6 thermal paste, the Freezer 36 CO delivers consistent, maintenance-free performance supported by an industry-leading 6-year warranty.', 'arctic-freezer-36-co-air-cpu-cooler-1781373917', '<p>Engineered for those who value longevity as much as thermal efficiency, the <strong>Arctic Freezer 36 CO</strong> is purpose-built for continuous, heavy-duty operation. The \"CO\" designation signifies that this model is equipped with industrial-grade dual ball bearings, providing significantly greater resistance to dust, heat, and mechanical wear compared to standard fan designs. This ensures that the cooling system maintains its acoustic and thermal performance over years of non-stop use, making it an ideal investment for professional rendering machines, home media servers, or enthusiast systems that run around the clock.</p><p>The cooling engine is a marvel of efficiency, utilizing four direct-touch copper heat pipes to draw thermal energy into a high-density, 59-fin aluminum stack. A unique feature of this model is the open-side heatsink architecture, which allows for increased cool air intake, effectively bypassing airflow resistance and enhancing overall ventilation for surrounding motherboard components. The push-pull fan configuration—powered by two P12 PWM PST CO fans—creates a high-pressure airflow environment that keeps even the latest multi-core processors, including upcoming Intel Arrow Lake chips, comfortably within their thermal limits.</p><p>Installation is equally optimized; an innovative click-based system replaces traditional, finicky fan clips, allowing for a secure, tool-free setup. Furthermore, the inclusion of an Intel LGA 1851/1700 contact frame ensures uniform mounting pressure, which prevents CPU deformation and guarantees optimal contact between the processor and the heatsink. Wrapped in an elegant aluminum top plate and pre-loaded with high-conductivity MX-6 thermal paste, the Freezer 36 CO offers a sophisticated, premium-tier cooling experience that is as easy to install as it is powerful to operate.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Thermal Dynamics</td><td>4x 6mm Copper Heatpipes + 59x 0.4mm Aluminum Fins</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Dynamics</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>Dual P12 PWM PST CO Fans (200–1800 RPM)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Bearing Type</strong></td><td>Durability</td><td>Dual Ball Bearing for 24/7 Continuous Operation</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Intel LGA 1851/1700; AMD AM5/AM4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Interface</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>Pre-applied Arctic MX-6 Thermal Compound (0.8g)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Index</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>36.9 dB(A)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Range</strong></td><td>Environment</td><td>0—40 °C Ambient Operating Temperature</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 3900.00, 3900.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/Fl2IeNEP9vLj4PRCxQIXv7Sy41Lu80QFS9Cz4JvZ.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 18:05:17', '2026-06-13 18:05:17', 'Arctic Freezer 36 CO | 24/7 Reliable Tower CPU Cooler', 'Arctic Freezer 36 CO cooler for 24/7 performance. Dual ball bearing fans, Intel/AMD compatibility, and 6-year warranty. Best for servers and gaming PCs', 'Arctic Freezer 36 CO, dual ball bearing CPU cooler, 24/7 operation CPU fan, Intel LGA 1851 cooler, AMD AM5 air cooler, quiet high-durability cooling, push-pull CPU fan, Arctic cooling Bangladesh, 6 year warranty tower cooler', NULL, 28, NULL, NULL),
(619, 'Arctic Freezer 36 ARGB Air CPU Cooler', 'The Arctic Freezer 36 ARGB is a premium tower air cooler that blends elite thermal performance with a vibrant, customizable aesthetic. Featuring a dual-fan push-pull configuration and high-density 59-fin aluminum stack, this cooler provides exceptional heat dissipation for modern Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4) processors. Equipped with fluid dynamic bearing fans that include a 0-RPM silent mode and integrated addressable RGB lighting, it offers a perfect balance of cooling efficiency, silent operation, and visual flair for any high-end PC build.', 'arctic-freezer-36-argb-air-cpu-cooler-1781374034', '<p>Elevate your desktop\'s cooling and visual impact with the <strong>Arctic Freezer 36 ARGB</strong>, a flagship air cooling solution engineered for performance enthusiasts. This cooler is built to handle intense workloads—from competitive gaming to heavy-duty multitasking—by utilizing a precision-engineered architecture that pairs four 6mm copper heat pipes with a substantial 59-fin aluminum tower. The resulting airflow efficiency ensures your CPU remains within optimal thermal parameters even under sustained stress.</p><p>Beyond raw power, the Freezer 36 ARGB serves as a stunning visual centerpiece. The two included 120mm P12 PWM PST A-RGB fans offer a wide range of lighting sequences and color patterns, allowing for full synchronization with your system’s existing aesthetic. Despite this visual focus, Arctic has maintained a strict commitment to low-noise operation; the fans utilize high-grade fluid dynamic bearings to minimize mechanical friction and can scale down to absolute silence (0-RPM) when the PWM signal is below 5%.</p><p>Installation is streamlined for maximum convenience, featuring a mounting system that ensures high-pressure contact for optimal heat transfer while simplifying the setup process across various Intel and AMD sockets. With a robust 6-year warranty and high-quality construction designed to thrive in ambient temperatures up to 40 °C, the Freezer 36 ARGB is an essential, reliable, and stylish upgrade for any modern system.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Thermal Dynamics</td><td>4x 6mm Copper Heatpipes + 59x 0.4mm Aluminum Fins</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Dynamics</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>Dual P12 PWM PST A-RGB Fans (200–2000 RPM)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Intel LGA 1851/1700; AMD AM5/AM4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Bearing Type</strong></td><td>Longevity</td><td>Fluid Dynamic Bearing (FDB) for reduced friction</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Index</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>36.9 dB(A)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Visuals</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Integrated A-RGB lighting for system synchronization</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Range</strong></td><td>Environment</td><td>0—40 °C Ambient Operating Temperature</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'CPU Cooler', 4150.00, 4150.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/csphNMM0bYKRCKQW0gdahhV4jPzJA4wLvoCL9Dt6.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 18:07:14', '2026-06-13 18:07:14', 'Arctic Freezer 36 ARGB | High-Performance Tower CPU Cooler', 'Enhance your build with the Arctic Freezer 36 ARGB. Features dual A-RGB fans, 0-RPM mode, Intel/AMD support, and a 6-year warranty. Available at International Office Solution.', 'Arctic Freezer 36 ARGB, ARGB CPU cooler, tower air cooler, Intel LGA 1851 cooler, AMD AM5 ARGB fan, quiet high-performance cooler, fluid dynamic bearing CPU fan, Arctic cooling Bangladesh, International Office Solution, 6 year warranty cooler', NULL, 28, NULL, NULL),
(620, 'Arctic Freezer 36 ARGB White Air CPU Cooler', 'The Arctic Freezer 36 ARGB White is a high-performance tower air cooler that combines elite thermal dissipation with a stunning, all-white aesthetic. Featuring a push-pull dual-fan configuration and 12 integrated addressable RGB LEDs per fan, it provides exceptional cooling for modern Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4) processors. With its Fluid Dynamic Bearing fans, 0-RPM silent mode, and premium aluminum construction, this cooler offers a perfect fusion of style, silence, and cooling reliability for any enthusiast build.', 'arctic-freezer-36-argb-white-air-cpu-cooler-1781374119', '<p>For builders who prioritize both a pristine visual setup and uncompromising thermal performance, the <strong>Arctic Freezer 36 ARGB White</strong> delivers an unparalleled cooling experience. The cooler’s white-themed design is complemented by advanced addressable RGB lighting, allowing for vibrant, customizable effects that stand out in any chassis. Beneath its sleek exterior lies a powerful thermal engine: four precision-engineered 6mm copper heat pipes and a high-density, 59-fin aluminum stack work in unison to rapidly dissipate heat from high-performance CPUs.</p><p>Performance is governed by two P12 PWM PST A-RGB fans that operate within a wide, dynamic speed range of 200–2000 RPM. These fans are built with long-life fluid dynamic bearings, ensuring minimal friction and superior acoustic performance. For users who value a quiet environment during light tasks, the cooler features an intelligent \"0-RPM\" mode—the fans remain completely stationary when the PWM signal is below 5%, allowing for total silence. Installation is designed to be as clean as the cooler’s appearance, utilizing a simplified, robust mounting system compatible with current Intel and AMD sockets. Backed by a 6-year warranty, the Freezer 36 ARGB White is a long-term, high-value investment for gamers and content creators alike.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Thermal Engine</strong></td><td>Heat Dissipation</td><td>4x 6mm Copper Heatpipes + 59x 0.4mm Aluminum Fins</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Technology</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>Dual P12 PWM PST A-RGB (200–2000 RPM)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustics</strong></td><td>Silent Mode</td><td>0-RPM idle mode (&lt; 5% PWM signal)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Intel LGA 1851/1700; AMD AM5/AM4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Illumination</strong></td><td>Visuals</td><td>12x Addressable RGB LEDs per fan (3-Pin A-RGB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Durability</strong></td><td>Longevity</td><td>Fluid Dynamic Bearing (FDB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Availability</strong></td><td>Local Market</td><td>Available at International Office Solution for 4,400৳</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 4400.00, 4400.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/vg4ZgWmYkEmrDnTdZacPLwnVYeycW9DC9LLUKzjB.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 18:08:39', '2026-06-14 15:35:02', 'Arctic Freezer 36 ARGB White | Premium White CPU Cooler', 'Enhance your PC with the Arctic Freezer 36 ARGB White. High-performance cooling, customizable A-RGB, 0-RPM silent mode, and 6-year warranty. Available at International Office Solution.', 'Arctic Freezer 36 ARGB White, white CPU cooler, ARGB air cooler, Intel LGA 1851 cooling, AMD AM5 white cooler, quiet tower cooler, 2000 RPM A-RGB fan, Arctic cooling Bangladesh, International Office Solution, 4400 Taka', NULL, 28, NULL, NULL),
(622, 'Arctic Freezer 34 eSports DUO Air CPU Cooler Grey', 'The Performance Tower Air Cooler is a high-efficiency thermal solution designed to balance extreme cooling performance with a whisper-quiet acoustic profile. Featuring a robust 157mm tower height and a precision-engineered aluminum fin stack, this cooler provides excellent heat dissipation for high-TDP processors. With an intelligent PWM-controlled fan capable of scaling up to 2100 RPM while maintaining a near-silent 0.5 Sone, it is the ideal choice for performance-oriented workstations and gaming builds. Pre-loaded with Arctic MX-4 thermal compound and backed by a comprehensive 6-year warranty, it offers a reliable, long-term thermal foundation for a wide range of modern Intel and AMD platforms.', 'arctic-freezer-34-esports-duo-air-cpu-cooler-grey-1781374168', '<p>For users seeking a dependable and high-performance cooling solution, the <strong>Performance Tower Air Cooler</strong> delivers professional-grade results. This cooler is built around a dense aluminum fin stack that maximizes surface area for thermal exchange, ensuring that your CPU stays within optimal temperature ranges even during sustained, intensive workloads like 4K video rendering or high-framerate gaming. Its compact 157mm height ensures compatibility with most mid-tower cases while providing enough thermal headroom to support overclocked systems.</p><p>The acoustic experience is defined by the unit\'s sophisticated 2100 RPM fan, which utilizes a low-noise design to keep sound output at an industry-leading 0.5 Sone. This allows the system to remain virtually silent during everyday office tasks and light media consumption, while automatically ramping up speed only when thermal demand increases. To simplify the setup, the cooler includes Arctic MX-4 thermal paste, ensuring that the thermal interface material—a critical component of heat transfer—is perfectly applied for maximum efficiency out of the box.</p><p>Designed for broad versatility, this cooler supports a vast array of legacy and modern sockets, including Intel\'s LGA 1700/1200 series and AMD\'s AM5/AM4 architectures. Its durable construction is verified by an extensive 6-year warranty, reflecting a build quality designed to withstand years of continuous operation. By combining refined acoustic dampening, broad socket support, and efficient thermal transfer, this tower cooler provides a premium, hassle-free solution for any serious PC builder.</p><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Thermal Engine</strong></td><td>Heat Dissipation</td><td>High-density Aluminum Fin Stack with optimized air-flow channels</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>PWM Control</td><td>200–2100 RPM Fan with 0.5 Sone acoustic rating</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Universal mounting for Intel (LGA 1700/1200/115x/20xx) and AMD (AM5/AM4)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Interface</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>Included Arctic MX-4 (0.8 g) thermal compound</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Form Factor</td><td>103 x 124 x 157 mm tower design</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Durability</strong></td><td>Longevity</td><td>Premium build quality backed by a 6-year warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'CPU Cooler', 4950.00, 4950.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/EvKLYjMCy4l7ZPeWLXt5ejAbD6kyaDZsS3Dn7Xpu.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 18:09:28', '2026-06-13 18:10:21', 'Performance Tower CPU Cooler | Silent 2100 RPM Cooling', 'Maximize CPU performance with this Performance Tower Air Cooler. Features 2100 RPM PWM fan, 0.5 Sone silence, universal socket support, and a 6-year warranty.', 'tower CPU cooler, performance air cooler, silent CPU fan, Intel LGA 1700 cooler, AMD AM5 air cooler, high performance cooling, 0.5 Sone CPU cooler, 2100 RPM air fan, universal CPU cooler, 6 year warranty cooler', NULL, 28, NULL, NULL),
(623, 'Arctic Freezer 4U-M Air CPU Cooler', 'The Enterprise-Grade Workstation Air Cooler is a high-performance thermal solution engineered specifically for professional server and workstation platforms. Supporting advanced socket architectures including Intel LGA 4189/4677 and AMD SP6/sTR5/TR4, this cooler is designed to handle the high TDP of multi-core server processors. Featuring a heavy-duty 1275g construction and a high-static-pressure PWM fan that scales up to 2300 RPM, it provides the sustained cooling reliability required for 24/7 enterprise operations, all protected by a robust 6-year warranty.', 'arctic-freezer-4u-m-air-cpu-cooler-1781374299', '<p>Built to meet the rigorous demands of enterprise environments, the <strong>Enterprise-Grade Workstation Air Cooler</strong> offers uncompromising thermal stability for high-end computing. Its massive, precision-machined aluminum heatsink is designed for maximum thermal mass and airflow penetration, ensuring that even under extreme, multi-threaded workloads—such as AI training, scientific simulation, or high-end rendering—the processor remains thermally throttled-free.</p><p>The cooling engine is driven by a powerful PWM-controlled fan that operates within a dynamic range of 400 to 2300 RPM. This wide control window allows the cooler to react intelligently to fluctuating thermal loads, providing silence during background tasks and aggressive, high-static-pressure cooling when under full processor load. With a sturdy, high-weight design that reinforces structural integrity, this cooler is built to endure the vibration and thermal demands of high-density server rack and workstation chassis.</p><p>Compatibility is the cornerstone of this solution, covering a comprehensive list of server-grade sockets, including Intel’s LGA 4189/4677 and AMD’s extensive Threadripper and EPYC socket ecosystem (SP6, SP3, sTR5, TR4, sTRX4, SWRX8). The installation is optimized for secure, high-pressure mounting, essential for protecting sensitive workstation hardware. Backed by a 6-year warranty, this cooler is a long-term, low-maintenance thermal infrastructure component designed for enterprise users who demand the highest reliability.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Thermal Engine</strong></td><td>Heat Dissipation</td><td>High-mass Aluminum Fin Stack optimized for server airflow</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>PWM Control</td><td>400–2300 RPM high-static-pressure fan</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Enterprise-grade sockets (Intel LGA 4189/4677; AMD SP6/SP3/sTR5/TR4/sTRX4/SWRX8)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Durability</strong></td><td>Build Quality</td><td>1275g heavy-duty construction for enterprise stability</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustics</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>40 dBA max output under high-load conditions</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>Longevity</td><td>Comprehensive 6-year manufacturer warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'CPU Cooler', 7500.00, 7500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/cbNqDrjtBiAeg8HFjhl0WJcC1YB91iKm0YY5qyBF.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 18:11:39', '2026-06-13 18:11:39', 'Enterprise Workstation CPU Cooler | LGA 4677 & sTR5 Support', 'Enterprise Workstation CPU Cooler | LGA 4677 & sTR5 Support', 'workstation CPU cooler, server air cooler, Intel LGA 4677 cooler, AMD sTR5 air cooler, enterprise CPU fan, high TDP air cooling, LGA 4189 cooler, server grade heatsink, 2300 RPM server fan, 6 year warranty workstation cooler', NULL, 28, NULL, NULL),
(624, 'Arctic Liquid Freezer III 280MM ARGB Liquid CPU Cooler', 'The 280mm A-RGB Liquid Cooler is a high-performance thermal solution engineered to deliver superior cooling efficiency for demanding multi-core processors. Featuring a 38mm-thick radiator and dual high-airflow fans, it maximizes heat dissipation while maintaining a sleek, customizable aesthetic with 12 addressable RGB LEDs. With a copper micro-skived fin cold plate and pre-applied premium MX-6 thermal compound, this liquid cooler provides an immediate, maintenance-free thermal upgrade for modern Intel LGA 1700 and AMD AM5/AM4 platforms, all backed by an industry-leading 6-year warranty.', 'arctic-liquid-freezer-iii-280mm-argb-liquid-cpu-cooler-1781374394', '<p>For enthusiasts who demand top-tier thermal headroom and a sophisticated, modern aesthetic, the <strong>280mm A-RGB Liquid Cooler</strong> offers a comprehensive solution. The cooling system is built around a heavy-duty, 38mm-thick radiator that provides increased coolant volume and surface area compared to standard-profile units, ensuring effective temperature management for high-TDP CPUs under heavy gaming or productivity loads. At the heart of the system, a high-efficiency copper cold plate featuring precision micro-skived fins rapidly absorbs heat directly from the processor, transferring it into the closed-loop liquid circuit with minimal thermal resistance.</p><p>Customization and performance are perfectly balanced in this design. The dual 140mm-class fans, capable of scaling from 200 to 1900 RPM, deliver an impressive 69.90 CFM of airflow, ensuring that your radiator stays cool even when your system is pushed to its limits. To elevate the visual appeal of your build, each fan features 12 addressable RGB LEDs, offering vibrant, synchronized lighting effects that are fully compatible with modern motherboard RGB headers.</p><p>Installation is refined to be as straightforward as possible. The system arrives pre-loaded with Arctic’s flagship MX-6 thermal compound, eliminating the need for messy manual application and ensuring optimal thermal contact from the moment you power on your machine. With its broad compatibility for the latest Intel and AMD sockets and an extensive 6-year warranty, this liquid cooler is a future-proof investment in both the longevity and the performance of your desktop build.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Radiator</strong></td><td>Thermal Dynamics</td><td>317 x 138 x 38 mm High-capacity aluminum radiator</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cold Plate</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>Copper base with micro-skived fin architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Dynamics</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>200–1900 RPM PWM-controlled fans (69.90 CFM)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Intel LGA 1700; AMD AM5/AM4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Interface</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>Pre-applied Arctic MX-6 thermal compound (0.8g)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Illumination</strong></td><td>Visuals</td><td>12x Addressable RGB LEDs per fan</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Durability</strong></td><td>Longevity</td><td>Premium build quality backed by a 6-year warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 7500.00, 7500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/Y8tJf9iTGJ6NMZZWUucwWGSUYYq7jnDTA5tel6yU.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 18:13:14', '2026-06-13 18:13:14', '280mm A-RGB Liquid Cooler | High-Performance All-in-One', 'Maximize thermal cooling with this 280mm A-RGB Liquid Cooler. Features a 38mm thick radiator, 1900 RPM PWM fans, and 6-year warranty.', '280mm liquid cooler, A-RGB AIO cooler, liquid CPU cooling, Intel LGA 1700 liquid cooler, AMD AM5 liquid cooler, high performance AIO, 280mm AIO, liquid cooling system, 6 year warranty liquid cooler\r\n\r\nWhat would you like to do next', NULL, 28, NULL, NULL),
(625, 'Arctic Liquid Freezer III 280MM ARGB Liquid CPU Cooler White', 'The 280mm A-RGB Liquid Cooler is a high-performance thermal solution engineered to deliver superior cooling efficiency for demanding multi-core processors. Featuring a robust 38mm-thick radiator and dual high-airflow fans, it maximizes heat dissipation while maintaining a sleek, customizable aesthetic with 12 integrated addressable RGB LEDs. With a copper micro-skived fin cold plate and pre-applied premium MX-6 thermal compound, this liquid cooler provides an immediate, maintenance-free thermal upgrade for modern Intel LGA 1700 and AMD AM5/AM4 platforms, all backed by an industry-leading 6-year warranty.', 'arctic-liquid-freezer-iii-280mm-argb-liquid-cpu-cooler-white-1781374503', '<p>For enthusiasts who demand top-tier thermal headroom and a sophisticated, modern aesthetic, the <strong>280mm A-RGB Liquid Cooler</strong> offers a comprehensive cooling solution. The system is built around a heavy-duty, 38mm-thick radiator that provides increased coolant volume and surface area compared to standard-profile units, ensuring effective temperature management for high-TDP CPUs under heavy gaming or productivity loads. At the heart of the system, a high-efficiency copper cold plate featuring precision micro-skived fins rapidly absorbs heat directly from the processor, transferring it into the closed-loop liquid circuit with minimal thermal resistance.</p><p>Customization and performance are perfectly balanced in this design. The dual 140mm-class fans, capable of scaling from 200 to 1900 RPM, deliver an impressive 69.90 CFM of airflow at 2.0 mmH2O of air pressure, ensuring that your radiator stays cool even when your system is pushed to its limits. To elevate the visual appeal of your build, each fan features 12 addressable RGB LEDs, offering vibrant, synchronized lighting effects that are fully compatible with modern motherboard RGB headers.</p><p>Installation is refined to be as straightforward as possible. The system arrives pre-loaded with Arctic’s flagship MX-6 thermal compound, eliminating the need for messy manual application and ensuring optimal thermal contact from the moment you power on your machine. With its broad compatibility for the latest Intel and AMD sockets and an extensive 6-year warranty, this liquid cooler is a future-proof investment in both the longevity and the performance of your desktop build.</p><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Radiator</strong></td><td>Thermal Dynamics</td><td>317 x 138 x 38 mm High-capacity aluminum radiator</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cold Plate</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>Copper base with micro-skived fin architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Dynamics</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>200–1900 RPM PWM-controlled fans (69.90 CFM)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Intel LGA 1700; AMD AM5/AM4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Interface</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>Pre-applied Arctic MX-6 thermal compound (0.8g)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Illumination</strong></td><td>Visuals</td><td>12x Addressable RGB LEDs per fan</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Durability</strong></td><td>Longevity</td><td>Premium build quality backed by a 6-year warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 7500.00, 7500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/txRsvhJpsutZG1PPWm1zlqlkGUw4zBPO8ci9bTgY.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 18:15:03', '2026-06-13 18:15:03', '280mm A-RGB Liquid Cooler | High-Performance All-in-One', 'Maximize thermal cooling with this 280mm A-RGB Liquid Cooler. Features a 38mm thick radiator, 1900 RPM PWM fans, and 6-year warranty.', '280mm liquid cooler, A-RGB AIO cooler, liquid CPU cooling, Intel LGA 1700 liquid cooler, AMD AM5 liquid cooler, high performance AIO, 280mm AIO, liquid cooling system, 6 year warranty liquid cooler', NULL, 28, NULL, NULL),
(626, 'Arctic Liquid Freezer III Pro 240 ARGB CPU Cooler', 'The 240mm Multi-Compatible A-RGB AIO Liquid Cooler is an elite thermal solution designed for high-performance Intel (LGA 1700/1851) and AMD (AM5/AM4) systems. Featuring a high-density 38mm-thick radiator and two premium P12 Pro A-RGB fans capable of reaching 3000 RPM, it delivers extreme cooling capacity with a massive 6.9 mmH2O of static pressure. With its precision-engineered copper micro-skived fin cold plate and vibrant, addressable Gen2 RGB lighting, this cooler combines professional-grade thermal management with a striking visual profile, all backed by a 6-year warranty.', 'arctic-liquid-freezer-iii-pro-240-argb-cpu-cooler-1781374594', '<p>For users demanding the absolute best in thermal headroom for their overclocked or multi-core processors, the <strong>240mm Multi-Compatible A-RGB Liquid Cooler</strong> offers an uncompromising cooling environment. The cooling loop is centered on a robust 38mm-thick radiator—significantly thicker than industry standards—providing the increased coolant volume and surface area required to dissipate heat from the most power-hungry CPUs. The cold plate utilizes a high-conductivity copper base with micro-skived fins, ensuring that thermal energy is extracted from the processor die and moved into the liquid circuit with maximum efficiency.</p><p>Airflow is managed by dual P12 Pro A-RGB fans that redefine performance expectations. Scaling dynamically up to 3000 RPM, these fans generate an immense 77 CFM of airflow and a high-static pressure of 6.9 mmH2O, effortlessly pushing air through the dense radiator fins. The inclusion of Fluid Dynamic Bearings guarantees a quiet, reliable, and smooth operational lifecycle, even under continuous high-load usage. Visual customization is equally impressive, with 12 Gen2 A-RGB LEDs per fan providing crisp, nuanced lighting effects that are fully controllable via standard 3-pin headers.</p><p>Durability and reliability are the cornerstones of this design. The cooler\'s sturdy 1665g construction reflects the premium materials used throughout, ensuring long-term structural integrity in any workstation or gaming rig. With native support for the latest Intel and AMD sockets and a 6-year warranty, this liquid cooler is an essential investment for builders who refuse to compromise on thermal stability or build aesthetics.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Radiator</strong></td><td>Thermal Dynamics</td><td>277 x 120 x 38 mm High-capacity radiator</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>Airflow &amp; Pressure</td><td>Dual P12 Pro A-RGB Fans (600–3000 RPM); 77 CFM; 6.9 mmH2O</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Intel LGA 1700/1851; AMD AM5/AM4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cold Plate</strong></td><td>Thermal Efficiency</td><td>Copper base with precision micro-skived fin architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Illumination</strong></td><td>Visuals</td><td>12x Gen2 Addressable RGB LEDs (3-Pin A-RGB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Bearing Type</strong></td><td>Durability</td><td>Fluid Dynamic Bearing (FDB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Weight</strong></td><td>Build Quality</td><td>1665g heavy-duty construction</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>6-year manufacturer warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 12700.00, 12700.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/Ar8B4U8kKRC5Aa6Mlm4lwT9HQ8KIaZT3XMzmJBkN.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 18:16:34', '2026-06-13 18:16:34', '240mm Multi-Compatible A-RGB Liquid Cooler | Extreme Cooling', 'Unleash performance with our 240mm A-RGB AIO Cooler. Features 3000 RPM fans, 6.9 mmH2O pressure, and Gen2 A-RGB LEDs. Intel/AMD supported.', '240mm AIO cooler, A-RGB liquid cooler, Intel LGA 1851 AIO, AMD AM5 liquid cooling, high static pressure fan, 3000 RPM AIO, liquid CPU cooling, P12 Pro A-RGB, 240mm liquid cooler 6 year warranty', NULL, 28, NULL, NULL),
(627, 'Arctic Liquid Freezer II 420 A-RGB All-in-One Liquid CPU Cooler', 'The 420mm High-Performance A-RGB Liquid Cooler is a massive thermal solution designed for enthusiasts who demand elite cooling headroom. Featuring an oversized 458mm radiator with a 38mm-thick profile, this AIO provides exceptional heat dissipation for the most demanding multi-core processors. Equipped with a whisper-quiet 0.3 Sone fan array, 12 A-RGB LEDs per fan for immersive lighting, and a precision-engineered micro-skived copper cold plate, this cooler combines extreme thermal capacity with silent operation and striking aesthetics, all secured by a robust 6-year warranty.', 'arctic-liquid-freezer-ii-420-a-rgb-all-in-one-liquid-cpu-cooler-1781374683', '<h3><strong>Long Description</strong></h3><p>For users tackling extreme overclocking, workstation-grade rendering, or high-TDP gaming setups, the <strong>420mm A-RGB Liquid Cooler</strong> represents the pinnacle of All-in-One thermal management. Its expansive 420mm radiator provides a massive surface area for heat exchange, significantly outperforming smaller liquid loops and traditional air coolers. The 38mm thickness ensures a larger coolant volume, which enhances heat absorption efficiency, while the copper micro-skived cold plate guarantees rapid energy transfer directly from the CPU die.</p><p>Acoustic excellence is achieved through intelligent engineering. The high-airflow fans operate with a PWM-controlled range of 200–1900 RPM, featuring a \"0-RPM\" mode that stops the fans entirely when the PWM signal is below 5%, ensuring absolute silence during desktop idling or low-intensity tasks. Despite the high performance, the system maintains an incredibly low noise output of just 0.3 Sone, proving that extreme thermal power does not need to come at the cost of peace and quiet.</p><p>Designed for long-term reliability and ease of installation, the system features a 450mm reinforced tube length, facilitating flexible mounting options in large tower cases. It comes factory-filled and ready to install, complete with pre-applied MX-5 thermal paste for optimal conductivity out of the box. With its extensive support for high-end Intel and AMD sockets and a 6-year manufacturer warranty, this cooler is a permanent, future-proof solution for builders who refuse to settle for anything less than maximum thermal performance.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Radiator</strong></td><td>Thermal Dynamics</td><td>458 x 138 x 38 mm High-capacity aluminum radiator</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cold Plate</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>Copper base with micro-skived fin architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>PWM Control</td><td>200–1900 RPM; 68.9 CFM; 2.0 mmH2O pressure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustics</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>0.3 Sone (max) with 0-RPM idle capability</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Intel LGA 1700/1200/115x/20xx; AMD AM5/AM4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Interface</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>Included Arctic MX-5 thermal compound (0.8g)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Illumination</strong></td><td>Visuals</td><td>12x A-RGB LEDs per fan (Addressable)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Durability</strong></td><td>Longevity</td><td>Premium build quality backed by a 6-year warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'CPU Cooler', 13400.00, 13400.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/TmzRLyBRXt4Dhllamcc8Ra3bDX6RZg0x7unrDatg.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 18:18:03', '2026-06-13 18:18:03', '420mm A-RGB Liquid Cooler | Extreme Performance AIO', 'Experience extreme cooling with our 420mm A-RGB Liquid Cooler. Features a 38mm-thick radiator, 0.3 Sone silence, and 6-year warranty.', '420mm liquid cooler, A-RGB AIO, extreme CPU cooler, Intel LGA 1700 AIO, AMD AM5 liquid cooler, high performance liquid cooling, quiet AIO cooler, 420mm radiator, 6 year warranty liquid cooler', NULL, 28, NULL, NULL);
