(628, 'Arctic Liquid Freezer III Pro 360mm AIO Liquid CPU Cooler', 'The 420mm High-Performance AIO Liquid Cooler is a heavy-duty thermal solution engineered for extreme cooling demands. Featuring a 38mm-thick radiator and dual high-speed fans that reach 3000 RPM, it delivers a massive 6.9 mmH2O of static pressure. With an integrated VRM fan to cool motherboard power components, a precision-engineered micro-skived copper cold plate, and robust 450mm tubing, this cooler ensures peak stability for overclocked Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4) processors, supported by a 6-year warranty.', 'arctic-liquid-freezer-iii-pro-360mm-aio-liquid-cpu-cooler-1781374791', '<p>Designed for power users who demand the ultimate in thermal headroom, the <strong>420mm AIO Liquid Cooler</strong> redefines the performance limits of all-in-one thermal solutions. At the heart of the system is a radiator with a 38mm-thick profile, providing an expansive surface area and increased coolant capacity to handle the high heat density of modern multi-core processors. A high-efficiency pump, operating between 800 and 2800 RPM, maintains constant flow, while the copper cold plate—featuring micro-skived fins—maximizes energy transfer from the CPU to the liquid loop.</p><p>One of the standout features of this cooler is its holistic approach to system stability. Beyond cooling the CPU, it includes a dedicated, high-speed VRM fan (400–2500 RPM) specifically designed to cool the motherboard\'s power delivery components, effectively reducing thermal throttling and enhancing system longevity. The P12 Pro-grade fans, utilizing fluid dynamic bearings, provide reliable, smooth motion across a vast 600–3000 RPM range, delivering 77 CFM of airflow to guarantee optimal performance under any workload.</p><p>Built for professional environments and enthusiast rigs alike, the cooler features reinforced 450mm tubing for flexible, clean cable routing in large chassis. With native support for the latest Intel and AMD platforms and a structural weight of 2020g, this unit is a substantial, long-term thermal investment. Backed by a 6-year manufacturer warranty and rated for reliable operation in ambient temperatures between 0–40 °C, it remains the gold standard for users who refuse to compromise on thermal engineering.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Radiator</strong></td><td>Thermal Dynamics</td><td>398 x 120 x 38 mm High-capacity aluminum radiator</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>Copper base with micro-skived fin architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>Airflow &amp; Pressure</td><td>600–3000 RPM PWM fans; 77 CFM; 6.9 mmH2O pressure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>System Cooling</strong></td><td>VRM Management</td><td>Integrated 400–2500 RPM fan for motherboard power phases</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Intel LGA 1851/1700; AMD AM5/AM4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Bearing Type</strong></td><td>Longevity</td><td>Fluid Dynamic Bearing (FDB) for pumps and fans</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Durability</strong></td><td>Build Quality</td><td>2020g heavy-duty construction with 450mm tubing</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>6-year manufacturer warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 14100.00, 14100.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/mV39u1Gn2TRW1n693E5Q4qOYIjxpoeQFFHAvwIC3.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 18:19:51', '2026-06-13 18:19:51', '420mm Performance AIO Liquid Cooler | VRM Cooling Support', 'Unleash extreme performance with this 420mm AIO. Features 3000 RPM fans, integrated VRM cooling, 6.9 mmH2O pressure, and 6-year warranty.', '420mm AIO cooler, liquid CPU cooler, Intel LGA 1851 AIO, AMD AM5 liquid cooling, VRM fan AIO, high static pressure fan, 3000 RPM AIO, liquid cooling system, 420mm liquid cooler 6 year warranty', NULL, 28, NULL, NULL),
(629, 'Arctic Liquid Freezer III 420MM ARGB Liquid CPU Cooler', 'The 420mm High-Performance Liquid Cooler is a professional-grade thermal solution designed to maximize heat dissipation for modern high-TDP processors. With its expansive 458mm radiator and 38mm thickness, it offers superior coolant capacity compared to standard AIOs. Engineered for efficiency, it features a micro-skived copper cold plate, high-airflow PWM fans, and premium pre-applied MX-6 thermal paste. Providing native support for Intel LGA 1700 and AMD AM5/AM4, this cooler is a reliable, future-proof investment backed by an industry-leading 6-year warranty.', 'arctic-liquid-freezer-iii-420mm-argb-liquid-cpu-cooler-1781374893', '<p>For users seeking the ultimate thermal ceiling, the <strong>420mm High-Performance Liquid Cooler</strong> provides an unmatched cooling environment. The radiator’s massive footprint allows for significant surface area, which, paired with the 38mm-thick design, enables the system to handle the heat output of today’s most demanding multi-core CPUs with ease. The cooling loop is powered by a high-efficiency copper cold plate, utilizing intricate micro-skived fins to draw thermal energy away from the CPU die into the closed-loop system with extreme precision.</p><p>Performance is managed by high-static-pressure fans that scale from 200 to 1900 RPM, delivering up to 69.90 CFM of airflow to maintain optimal temperatures during intense gaming, rendering, or productivity workloads. The system is designed with professional-grade plumbing; the 450mm reinforced tubes provide exceptional flexibility for easy installation in full-tower chassis while maintaining high flow rates through their optimized 6mm inner diameter.</p><p>Installation is refined to eliminate guesswork, as the cooler arrives pre-loaded with Arctic’s flagship MX-6 thermal compound, ensuring a perfect interface between the CPU and the cold plate right out of the box. By streamlining compatibility for the latest Intel and AMD sockets, this AIO liquid cooler offers a seamless transition to high-end cooling. With a robust 6-year warranty, it serves as a cornerstone for any high-reliability workstation or enthusiast rig, ensuring your components remain cool and performant for years to come.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Radiator</strong></td><td>Thermal Dynamics</td><td>458 x 138 x 38 mm High-capacity aluminum radiator</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cold Plate</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>Copper base with precision micro-skived fin architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Dynamics</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>200–1900 RPM PWM-controlled fans (69.90 CFM)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Intel LGA 1700; AMD AM5/AM4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Plumbing</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>450mm length (12.4mm outer / 6.0mm inner diameter)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Interface</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>Pre-applied Arctic MX-6 thermal compound (0.8g)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>6-year manufacturer warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 12300.00, 12300.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/zQ6dpPjnIo1G9xD1osS4S1gYxov3yUk25bQrRr6G.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 18:21:33', '2026-06-13 18:21:33', '420mm High-Performance Liquid Cooler | Thermal Excellence', 'Achieve peak performance with our 420mm Liquid Cooler. Features a 38mm-thick radiator, 1900 RPM fans, and a 6-year warranty. Best for high-TDP CPUs.', '420mm liquid cooler, AIO CPU cooler, Intel LGA 1700 liquid cooling, AMD AM5 liquid cooler, high performance liquid cooling, 420mm radiator, thermal management system, 6 year warranty liquid cooler', NULL, 28, NULL, NULL),
(630, 'Arctic Liquid Freezer III 420MM ARGB Liquid CPU Cooler White', 'The 420mm High-Performance Liquid Cooler is a professional-grade thermal solution designed to maximize heat dissipation for modern high-TDP processors. With its expansive 458mm radiator and 38mm thickness, it offers superior coolant capacity compared to standard AIOs. Engineered for efficiency, it features a micro-skived copper cold plate, high-airflow PWM fans, and premium pre-applied MX-6 thermal paste. Providing native support for Intel LGA 1700 and AMD AM5/AM4, this cooler is a reliable, future-proof investment backed by an industry-leading 6-year warranty.', 'arctic-liquid-freezer-iii-420mm-argb-liquid-cpu-cooler-white-1781374991', '<p>For users seeking the ultimate thermal ceiling, the <strong>420mm High-Performance Liquid Cooler</strong> provides an unmatched cooling environment. The radiator’s massive footprint allows for significant surface area, which, paired with the 38mm-thick design, enables the system to handle the heat output of today’s most demanding multi-core CPUs with ease. The cooling loop is powered by a high-efficiency copper cold plate, utilizing intricate micro-skived fins to draw thermal energy away from the CPU die into the closed-loop system with extreme precision.</p><p>Performance is managed by high-static-pressure fans that scale from 200 to 1900 RPM, delivering up to 69.90 CFM of airflow to maintain optimal temperatures during intense gaming, rendering, or productivity workloads. The system is designed with professional-grade plumbing; the 450mm reinforced tubes provide exceptional flexibility for easy installation in full-tower chassis while maintaining high flow rates through their optimized 6mm inner diameter.</p><p>Installation is refined to eliminate guesswork, as the cooler arrives pre-loaded with Arctic’s flagship MX-6 thermal compound, ensuring a perfect interface between the CPU and the cold plate right out of the box. By streamlining compatibility for the latest Intel and AMD sockets, this AIO liquid cooler offers a seamless transition to high-end cooling. With a robust 6-year warranty, it serves as a cornerstone for any high-reliability workstation or enthusiast rig, ensuring your components remain cool and performant for years to come.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Radiator</strong></td><td>Thermal Dynamics</td><td>458 x 138 x 38 mm High-capacity aluminum radiator</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cold Plate</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>Copper base with precision micro-skived fin architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Dynamics</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>200–1900 RPM PWM-controlled fans (69.90 CFM)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Intel LGA 1700; AMD AM5/AM4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Plumbing</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>450mm length (12.4mm outer / 6.0mm inner diameter)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Interface</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>Pre-applied Arctic MX-6 thermal compound (0.8g)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>6-year manufacturer warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 11500.00, 11500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/9psojJHV065959r5KRjUluWfR2aFmzs8O8zdBMQk.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 18:23:11', '2026-06-13 18:23:11', '420mm High-Performance Liquid Cooler | Thermal Excellence', 'Achieve peak performance with our 420mm Liquid Cooler. Features a 38mm-thick radiator, 1900 RPM fans, and a 6-year warranty. Best for high-TDP CPUs.', ': 420mm liquid cooler, AIO CPU cooler, Intel LGA 1700 liquid cooling, AMD AM5 liquid cooler, high performance liquid cooling, 420mm radiator, thermal management system, 6 year warranty liquid cooler', NULL, 28, NULL, NULL),
(631, 'Arctic Liquid Freezer III Pro 360 ARGB CPU Cooler', 'The 360mm High-Performance A-RGB Liquid Cooler is a heavy-duty thermal solution engineered for extreme cooling demands. Featuring a 38mm-thick radiator and a trio of P12 Pro A-RGB fans that reach 3000 RPM, it delivers a massive 6.9 mmH2O of static pressure. With an integrated VRM fan to cool motherboard power components, a precision-engineered micro-skived copper cold plate, and robust 450mm tubing, this cooler ensures peak stability for overclocked Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4) processors, all backed by a 6-year warranty.', 'arctic-liquid-freezer-iii-pro-360-argb-cpu-cooler-1781375077', '<p>Designed for power users who demand the ultimate in thermal headroom, the <strong>360mm A-RGB Liquid Cooler</strong> redefines the performance limits of all-in-one thermal solutions. At the heart of the system is a radiator with a 38mm-thick profile, providing an expansive surface area and increased coolant capacity to handle the high heat density of modern multi-core processors. A high-efficiency pump, operating between 800 and 2800 RPM, maintains constant flow, while the copper cold plate—featuring micro-skived fins—maximizes energy transfer from the CPU to the liquid loop.</p><p>One of the standout features of this cooler is its holistic approach to system stability. Beyond cooling the CPU, it includes a dedicated, high-speed VRM fan (400–2500 RPM) specifically designed to cool the motherboard\'s power delivery components, effectively reducing thermal throttling and enhancing system longevity. The three P12 Pro-grade A-RGB fans, utilizing fluid dynamic bearings, provide reliable, smooth motion across a vast 600–3000 RPM range, delivering 77 CFM of airflow to guarantee optimal performance under any workload, accented by 12 vibrant Gen2 A-RGB LEDs per fan.</p><p>Built for professional environments and enthusiast rigs alike, the cooler features reinforced 450mm tubing for flexible, clean cable routing in large chassis. With native support for the latest Intel and AMD platforms and a structural weight of 2005g, this unit is a substantial, long-term thermal investment. Backed by a 6-year manufacturer warranty and rated for reliable operation in ambient temperatures between 0–40 °C, it remains the gold standard for u</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Radiator</strong></td><td>Thermal Dynamics</td><td>398 x 120 x 38 mm High-capacity aluminum radiator</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>Copper base with micro-skived fin architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>Airflow &amp; Pressure</td><td>Triple P12 Pro A-RGB (600–3000 RPM); 77 CFM; 6.9 mmH2O</td></tr><tr><td><strong>System Cooling</strong></td><td>VRM Management</td><td>Integrated 400–2500 RPM fan for motherboard power phases</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Intel LGA 1851/1700; AMD AM5/AM4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Illumination</strong></td><td>Visuals</td><td>12x Gen2 Addressable RGB LEDs per fan</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Bearing Type</strong></td><td>Longevity</td><td>Fluid Dynamic Bearing (FDB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>6-year manufacturer warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 15100.00, 15100.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/GOxaJqR6Ub4B8zUc5nyYtCgffG8CVf0D5BA138O8.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 18:24:37', '2026-06-13 18:24:37', '360mm Performance A-RGB Liquid Cooler | VRM Cooling Support', 'Unleash extreme performance with this 360mm A-RGB AIO. Features 3000 RPM fans, integrated VRM cooling, Gen2 LEDs, and 6-year warranty.', '360mm AIO cooler, liquid CPU cooler, Intel LGA 1851 AIO, AMD AM5 liquid cooling, VRM fan AIO, high static pressure fan, 3000 RPM AIO, Gen2 A-RGB, 360mm liquid cooler 6 year warranty', NULL, 28, NULL, NULL),
(632, 'Arctic Liquid Freezer III Pro 360 ARGB AIO CPU Cooler White', 'The 360mm High-Performance A-RGB Liquid Cooler is a heavy-duty thermal solution engineered for extreme cooling demands. Featuring a 38mm-thick radiator and a trio of P12 Pro A-RGB fans that reach 3000 RPM, it delivers a massive 6.9 mmH2O of static pressure. With an integrated VRM fan to cool motherboard power components, a precision-engineered micro-skived copper cold plate, and robust 450mm tubing, this cooler ensures peak stability for overclocked Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4) processors, all backed by a 6-year warranty.', 'arctic-liquid-freezer-iii-pro-360-argb-aio-cpu-cooler-white-1781375167', '<p>Designed for power users who demand the ultimate in thermal headroom, the <strong>360mm A-RGB Liquid Cooler</strong> redefines the performance limits of all-in-one thermal solutions. At the heart of the system is a radiator with a 38mm-thick profile, providing an expansive surface area and increased coolant capacity to handle the high heat density of modern multi-core processors. A high-efficiency pump, operating between 800 and 2800 RPM, maintains constant flow, while the copper cold plate—featuring micro-skived fins—maximizes energy transfer from the CPU to the liquid loop.</p><p>One of the standout features of this cooler is its holistic approach to system stability. Beyond cooling the CPU, it includes a dedicated, high-speed VRM fan (400–2500 RPM) specifically designed to cool the motherboard\'s power delivery components, effectively reducing thermal throttling and enhancing system longevity. The three P12 Pro-grade A-RGB fans, utilizing fluid dynamic bearings, provide reliable, smooth motion across a vast 600–3000 RPM range, delivering 77 CFM of airflow to guarantee optimal performance under any workload, accented by 12 vibrant Gen2 A-RGB LEDs per fan.</p><p>Built for professional environments and enthusiast rigs alike, the cooler features reinforced 450mm tubing for flexible, clean cable routing in large chassis. With native support for the latest Intel and AMD platforms and a structural weight of 2005g, this unit is a substantial, long-term thermal investment. Backed by a 6-year manufacturer warranty and rated for reliable operation in ambient temperatures between 0–40 °C, it remains the gold standard for users who refuse to compromise on thermal engineering or aesthetics.</p>', '<ul><li><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Radiator</strong></td><td>Thermal Dynamics</td><td>398 x 120 x 38 mm High-capacity aluminum radiator</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>Copper base with micro-skived fin architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>Airflow &amp; Pressure</td><td>Triple P12 Pro A-RGB (600–3000 RPM); 77 CFM; 6.9 mmH2O</td></tr><tr><td><strong>System Cooling</strong></td><td>VRM Management</td><td>Integrated 400–2500 RPM fan for motherboard power phases</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Intel LGA 1851/1700; AMD AM5/AM4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Illumination</strong></td><td>Visuals</td><td>12x Gen2 Addressable RGB LEDs per fan</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Bearing Type</strong></td><td>Longevity</td><td>Fluid Dynamic Bearing (FDB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>6-year manufacturer warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure></li></ul>', 'CPU Cooler', 16700.00, 16700.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/rw9kzz8ZWuQ97ktPIJZj65WoFNCLxqLUWo3gbJ1f.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 18:26:07', '2026-06-13 18:26:07', '360mm Performance A-RGB Liquid Cooler | VRM Cooling Support', ': Unleash extreme performance with this 360mm A-RGB AIO. Features 3000 RPM fans, integrated VRM cooling, Gen2 LEDs, and 6-year warranty.', '360mm AIO cooler, liquid CPU cooler, Intel LGA 1851 AIO, AMD AM5 liquid cooling, VRM fan AIO, high static pressure fan, 3000 RPM AIO, Gen2 A-RGB, 360mm liquid cooler 6 year warranty', NULL, 28, NULL, NULL),
(633, 'Arctic Liquid Freezer III 280MM Liquid CPU Cooler', 'The 280mm High-Performance Liquid Cooler is a professional-grade thermal solution engineered to maximize heat dissipation for modern high-TDP processors. Featuring a robust 317mm radiator with an increased 38mm-thick profile, it provides superior coolant capacity and surface area for elite thermal management. Engineered for efficiency, it features a precision micro-skived copper cold plate, high-static-pressure fans, and premium pre-applied MX-6 thermal paste. Providing native support for Intel LGA 1700 and AMD AM5/AM4, this cooler is a reliable, future-proof investment backed by an industry-leading 6-year warranty.', 'arctic-liquid-freezer-iii-280mm-liquid-cpu-cooler-1781375248', '<p>For users seeking the ultimate thermal ceiling, the <strong>280mm High-Performance Liquid Cooler</strong> provides an unmatched cooling environment. The radiator’s optimized footprint allows for significant surface area, which, paired with the 38mm-thick design, enables the system to handle the heat output of today’s most demanding multi-core CPUs with ease. The cooling loop is powered by a high-efficiency copper cold plate, utilizing intricate micro-skived fins to draw thermal energy away from the CPU die into the closed-loop system with extreme precision.</p><p>Performance is managed by high-static-pressure fans that scale from 200 to 1700 RPM, delivering up to 72.80 CFM of airflow at 2.40 mmH2O of pressure to maintain optimal temperatures during intense gaming, rendering, or productivity workloads. The system is designed with professional-grade plumbing; the 450mm reinforced tubes provide exceptional flexibility for easy installation in full-tower chassis while maintaining high flow rates through their optimized 6mm inner diameter.</p><p>Installation is refined to eliminate guesswork, as the cooler arrives pre-loaded with Arctic’s flagship MX-6 thermal compound, ensuring a perfect interface between the CPU and the cold plate right out of the box. By streamlining compatibility for the latest Intel and AMD sockets, this AIO liquid cooler offers a seamless transition to high-end cooling. With a robust 6-year warranty, it serves as a cornerstone for any high-reliability workstation or enthusiast rig, ensuring your components remain cool and performant for years to come.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Radiator</strong></td><td>Thermal Dynamics</td><td>317 x 138 x 38 mm High-capacity aluminum radiator</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cold Plate</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>Copper base with precision micro-skived fin architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Dynamics</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>200–1700 RPM PWM-controlled fans (72.80 CFM)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Intel LGA 1700; AMD AM5/AM4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Plumbing</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>450mm length (12.4mm outer / 6.0mm inner diameter)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Interface</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>Pre-applied Arctic MX-6 thermal compound (0.8g)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>6-year manufacturer warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/CJvCraEFxT2tZKwR93fOJV71eGnrh45KfsIdSjXE.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 18:27:28', '2026-06-13 18:27:28', '280mm High-Performance Liquid Cooler | Thermal Excellence', 'Achieve peak performance with our 280mm Liquid Cooler. Features a 38mm-thick radiator, 1700 RPM fans, and a 6-year warranty. Best for high-TDP CPUs.', '280mm liquid cooler, AIO CPU cooler, Intel LGA 1700 liquid cooling, AMD AM5 liquid cooler, high performance liquid cooling, 280mm radiator, thermal management system, 6 year warranty liquid cooler', NULL, 28, NULL, NULL),
(634, 'Arctic Liquid Freezer III 420MM Liquid CPU Cooler', 'The 420mm High-Performance Liquid Cooler is a professional-grade thermal solution designed to maximize heat dissipation for modern high-TDP processors. With its expansive 458mm radiator and 38mm thickness, it offers superior coolant capacity compared to standard AIOs. Engineered for efficiency, it features a micro-skived copper cold plate, high-static-pressure PWM fans, and premium pre-applied MX-6 thermal paste. Providing native support for Intel LGA 1700 and AMD AM5/AM4, this cooler is a reliable, future-proof investment built for sustained performance.', 'arctic-liquid-freezer-iii-420mm-liquid-cpu-cooler-1781375328', '<p>or users seeking the ultimate thermal ceiling, the <strong>420mm High-Performance Liquid Cooler</strong> provides an unmatched cooling environment. The radiator’s massive footprint allows for significant surface area, which, paired with the 38mm-thick design, enables the system to handle the heat output of today’s most demanding multi-core CPUs with ease. The cooling loop is powered by a high-efficiency copper cold plate, utilizing intricate micro-skived fins to draw thermal energy away from the CPU die into the closed-loop system with extreme precision.</p><p>Performance is managed by high-static-pressure fans that scale from 200 to 1700 RPM, delivering up to 72.80 CFM of airflow at 2.40 mmH2O of pressure to maintain optimal temperatures during intense gaming, rendering, or productivity workloads. The system is designed with professional-grade plumbing; the 450mm reinforced tubes provide exceptional flexibility for easy installation in full-tower chassis while maintaining high flow rates through their optimized 6mm inner diameter.</p><p>Installation is refined to eliminate guesswork, as the cooler arrives pre-loaded with Arctic’s flagship MX-6 thermal compound, ensuring a perfect interface between the CPU and the cold plate right out of the box. By streamlining compatibility for the latest Intel and AMD sockets, this AIO liquid cooler offers a seamless transition to high-end cooling. It serves as a cornerstone for any high-reliability workstation or enthusiast rig, ensuring your components remain cool and performant.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Radiator</strong></td><td>Thermal Dynamics</td><td>458 x 130 x 38 mm High-capacity aluminum radiator</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cold Plate</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>Copper base with precision micro-skived fin architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Dynamics</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>200–1700 RPM PWM-controlled fans (72.80 CFM)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Intel LGA 1700; AMD AM5/AM4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Plumbing</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>450mm length (12.4mm outer / 6.0mm inner diameter)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Interface</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>Pre-applied Arctic MX-6 thermal compound (0.8g)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/dNR9VS3Bo6m4Rultaj5gE8nzKQMg1QkVuDW9i6Wp.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 18:28:48', '2026-06-13 18:28:48', '420mm High-Performance Liquid Cooler | Thermal Excellence', 'Achieve peak performance with our 420mm Liquid Cooler. Features a 38mm-thick radiator, 1700 RPM fans, and high-pressure airflow. Best for high-TDP CPUs.', '420mm liquid cooler, AIO CPU cooler, Intel LGA 1700 liquid cooling, AMD AM5 liquid cooler, high performance liquid cooling, 420mm radiator, thermal management system', NULL, 28, NULL, NULL),
(635, 'Arctic Freezer 8A CO AMD Air CPU Cooler', 'The Compact Performance Air Cooler is a specialized, space-saving cooling solution optimized for AMD AM5 and AM4 socket architectures. Featuring a highly efficient design with two 6mm direct-touch copper heat pipes and a high-density 46-fin aluminum stack, it delivers reliable thermal management in a small 136mm-tall form factor. Equipped with a durable dual ball bearing fan that supports 0-RPM idle mode and pre-applied high-performance MX-6 thermal paste, this cooler is an excellent choice for compact systems, SFF (Small Form Factor) builds, or space-constrained workstations, all backed by a 6-year warranty.', 'arctic-freezer-8a-co-amd-air-cpu-cooler-1781375427', '<p>Engineered for builds where space is at a premium but thermal integrity is non-negotiable, the <strong>Compact Performance Air Cooler</strong> offers a precise balance of size and cooling power. Its architecture is specifically tailored for AMD\'s modern platforms, utilizing a dual-heatpipe direct-touch design that accelerates thermal transfer from the processor to the 46-fin aluminum stack, ensuring that your CPU stays within safe operating temperatures during intensive gaming, media playback, or multitasking.</p><p>Acoustic versatility is a core strength of this cooler. The fan operates within a dynamic 200–2300 RPM range, providing powerful airflow under load while remaining whisper-quiet during everyday tasks thanks to its integrated 0-RPM silent mode (active below 5% PWM). The use of dual ball bearings ensures an exceptionally long operational lifespan and resistance to heat and vibration, making it a dependable choice for 24/7 reliability.</p><p>Installation is streamlined for maximum efficiency; the cooler arrives with Arctic’s premium MX-6 thermal paste factory-applied, guaranteeing an optimal thermal interface from the first boot. With a lightweight 415g design and a compact 83 x 108 x 136 mm footprint, this cooler fits comfortably in a wide variety of chassis while leaving ample room for surrounding components. Protected by a 6-year manufacturer warranty, this unit provides long-term peace of mind for builders who demand a high-value, robust cooling solution for their AMD-based PC.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>eature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Thermal Dynamics</td><td>2x 6mm Copper Heatpipes (Direct Touch) + 46x 0.4mm Aluminum Fins</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Dynamics</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>200–2300 RPM PWM Fan with 0-RPM Idle Mode</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>AMD AM5 and AM4 Socket Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Bearing Type</strong></td><td>Durability</td><td>Dual Ball Bearing for extended longevity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Interface</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>Pre-applied Arctic MX-6 Thermal Compound</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Physical</td><td>Compact 83 x 108 x 136 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>6-year manufacturer warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/vT4uATgpZyCw6qxA39pLwxy9fmpZXrHZ0QLn2pX0.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 18:30:27', '2026-06-13 18:30:27', ': Compact Performance Air Cooler for AMD AM5/AM4', 'High-efficiency compact air cooler for AMD AM5/AM4. Features 2300 RPM PWM fan, dual ball bearings, 0-RPM mode, and pre-applied MX-6 paste. 6-year warranty.', 'compact air cooler, AMD AM5 CPU cooler, AMD AM4 air cooler, SFF CPU cooler, silent AMD cooler, dual ball bearing fan, 2300 RPM CPU fan, Arctic cooling style, 6 year warranty cooler', NULL, 28, NULL, NULL),
(636, 'Arctic Freezer 34 eSports DUO Air CPU Cooler Red', 'The Performance Tower Air Cooler is a high-efficiency thermal solution designed to balance extreme cooling performance with a whisper-quiet acoustic profile. Featuring a robust 157mm tower height and a precision-engineered aluminum fin stack, this cooler provides excellent heat dissipation for high-TDP processors. With an intelligent PWM-controlled fan capable of scaling up to 2100 RPM while maintaining a near-silent 0.5 Sone, it is the ideal choice for performance-oriented workstations and gaming builds. Pre-loaded with Arctic MX-4 thermal compound and backed by a comprehensive 6-year warranty, it offers a reliable, long-term thermal foundation for a wide range of modern Intel and AMD platforms.', 'arctic-freezer-34-esports-duo-air-cpu-cooler-red-1781375505', '<p>For users seeking a dependable and high-performance cooling solution, the <strong>Performance Tower Air Cooler</strong> delivers professional-grade results. This cooler is built around a dense aluminum fin stack that maximizes surface area for thermal exchange, ensuring that your CPU stays within optimal temperature ranges even during sustained, intensive workloads like 4K video rendering or high-framerate gaming. Its compact 157mm height ensures compatibility with most mid-tower cases while providing enough thermal headroom to support overclocked systems.</p><p>The acoustic experience is defined by the unit\'s sophisticated 2100 RPM fan, which utilizes a low-noise design to keep sound output at an industry-leading 0.5 Sone. This allows the system to remain virtually silent during everyday office tasks and light media consumption, while automatically ramping up speed only when thermal demand increases. To simplify the setup, the cooler includes Arctic MX-4 thermal paste, ensuring that the thermal interface material—a critical component of heat transfer—is perfectly applied for maximum efficiency out of the box.</p><p>Designed for broad versatility, this cooler supports a vast array of legacy and modern sockets, including Intel\'s LGA 1700/1200 series and AMD\'s AM5/AM4 architectures. Its durable construction is verified by an extensive 6-year warranty, reflecting a build quality designed to withstand years of continuous operation. By combining refined acoustic dampening, broad socket support, and efficient thermal transfer, this tower cooler provides a premium, hassle-free solution for any serious PC builder.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Thermal Engine</strong></td><td>Heat Dissipation</td><td>High-density Aluminum Fin Stack with optimized air-flow channels</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>PWM Control</td><td>200–2100 RPM Fan with 0.5 Sone acoustic rating</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Universal mounting for Intel (LGA 1700/1200/115x/20xx) and AMD (AM5/AM4)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Interface</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>Included Arctic MX-4 (0.8 g) thermal compound</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Form Factor</td><td>103 x 124 x 157 mm tower design</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Durability</strong></td><td>Longevity</td><td>Premium build quality backed by a 6-year warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'CPU Cooler', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/owykcqzicn58gDroR29IsiiyV2oPCmtXQnb7befU.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 18:31:45', '2026-06-13 18:31:45', NULL, 'aximize CPU performance with this Performance Tower Air Cooler. Features 2100 RPM PWM fan, 0.5 Sone silence, universal socket support, and a 6-year warranty', 'tower CPU cooler, performance air cooler, silent CPU fan, Intel LGA 1700 cooler, AMD AM5 air cooler, high performance cooling, 0.5 Sone CPU cooler, 2100 RPM air fan, universal CPU cooler, 6 year warranty cooler', NULL, 28, NULL, NULL),
