ity, this cooler supports a vast array of legacy and modern sockets, including Intel\'s LGA 1700/1200 series and AMD\'s AM5/AM4 architectures. Its durable construction is verified by an extensive 6-year warranty, reflecting a build quality designed to withstand years of continuous operation. By combining refined acoustic dampening, broad socket support, and efficient thermal transfer, this tower cooler provides a premium, hassle-free solution for any serious PC builder.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Thermal Engine</strong></td><td>Heat Dissipation</td><td>High-density Aluminum Fin Stack with optimized air-flow channels</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>PWM Control</td><td>200–2100 RPM Fan with 0.5 Sone acoustic rating</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Universal mounting for Intel (LGA 1700/1200/115x/20xx) and AMD (AM5/AM4)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Interface</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>Included Arctic MX-4 (0.8 g) thermal compound</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Form Factor</td><td>103 x 124 x 157 mm tower design</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Durability</strong></td><td>Longevity</td><td>Premium build quality backed by a 6-year warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/iXyif4cdRdyTP6HuEjvpgkdyOJvMBkWfkegVD9A3.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 18:33:21', '2026-06-13 18:35:26', 'Performance Tower CPU Cooler | Silent 2100 RPM Cooling', 'Maximize CPU performance with this Performance Tower Air Cooler. Features 2100 RPM PWM fan, 0.5 Sone silence, universal socket support, and a 6-year warranty.', 'tower CPU cooler, performance air cooler, silent CPU fan, Intel LGA 1700 cooler, AMD AM5 air cooler, high performance cooling, 0.5 Sone CPU cooler, 2100 R