(638, 'Arctic Freezer 34 eSports DUO Air CPU Cooler White & Grey', 'The Performance Tower Air Cooler is a high-efficiency thermal solution designed to balance extreme cooling performance with a whisper-quiet acoustic profile. Featuring a robust 157mm tower height and a precision-engineered aluminum fin stack, this cooler provides excellent heat dissipation for high-TDP processors. With an intelligent PWM-controlled fan capable of scaling up to 2100 RPM while maintaining a near-silent 0.5 Sone, it is the ideal choice for performance-oriented workstations and gaming builds. Pre-loaded with Arctic MX-4 thermal compound and backed by a comprehensive 6-year warranty, it offers a reliable, long-term thermal foundation for a wide range of modern Intel and AMD platforms.', 'arctic-freezer-34-esports-duo-air-cpu-cooler-white-grey-1781375657', '<p>For users seeking a dependable and high-performance cooling solution, the <strong>Performance Tower Air Cooler</strong> delivers professional-grade results. This cooler is built around a dense aluminum fin stack that maximizes surface area for thermal exchange, ensuring that your CPU stays within optimal temperature ranges even during sustained, intensive workloads like 4K video rendering or high-framerate gaming. Its compact 157mm height ensures compatibility with most mid-tower cases while providing enough thermal headroom to support overclocked systems.</p><p>The acoustic experience is defined by the unit\'s sophisticated 2100 RPM fan, which utilizes a low-noise design to keep sound output at an industry-leading 0.5 Sone. This allows the system to remain virtually silent during everyday office tasks and light media consumption, while automatically ramping up speed only when thermal demand increases. To simplify the setup, the cooler includes Arctic MX-4 thermal paste, ensuring that the thermal interface material—a critical component of heat transfer—is perfectly applied for maximum efficiency out of the box.</p><p>Designed for broad versatility, this cooler supports a vast array of legacy and modern sockets, including Intel\'s LGA 1700/1200 series and AMD\'s AM5/AM4 architectures. Its durable construction is verified by an extensive 6-year warranty, reflecting a build quality designed to withstand years of continuous operation. By combining refined acoustic dampening, broad socket support, and efficient thermal transfer, this tower cooler provides a premium, hassle-free solution for any serious PC builder.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Thermal Engine</strong></td><td>Heat Dissipation</td><td>High-density Aluminum Fin Stack with optimized air-flow channels</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>PWM Control</td><td>200–2100 RPM Fan with 0.5 Sone acoustic rating</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Universal mounting for Intel (LGA 1700/1200/115x/20xx) and AMD (AM5/AM4)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Interface</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>Included Arctic MX-4 (0.8 g) thermal compound</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Form Factor</td><td>103 x 124 x 157 mm tower design</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Durability</strong></td><td>Longevity</td><td>Premium build quality backed by a 6-year warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'CPU Cooler', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/r9MztgPgKLKjnmdUDhcHNLaYJzFcf4sMorq2A2fi.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 18:34:17', '2026-06-13 18:34:59', 'Performance Tower CPU Cooler | Silent 2100 RPM Cooling', 'Maximize CPU performance with this Performance Tower Air Cooler. Features 2100 RPM PWM fan, 0.5 Sone silence, universal socket support, and a 6-year warranty.', 'tower CPU cooler, performance air cooler, silent CPU fan, Intel LGA 1700 cooler, AMD AM5 air cooler, high performance cooling, 0.5 Sone CPU cooler, 2100 RPM air fan, universal CPU cooler, 6 year warranty cooler', NULL, 28, NULL, NULL),
(639, 'Arctic Liquid Freezer III 240MM RGB Liquid CPU Cooler', 'The 240mm A-RGB Liquid Cooler is a performance-focused thermal solution designed to deliver exceptional heat dissipation in a compact, efficient form factor. Featuring a robust 38mm-thick radiator and dual high-airflow PWM fans, this AIO ensures stable operation for high-TDP processors. With its precision-engineered micro-skived copper cold plate, addressable RGB lighting, and pre-applied premium MX-6 thermal compound, it provides a seamless and high-value cooling upgrade for modern Intel LGA 1700 and AMD AM5/AM4 systems, all protected by a 6-year warranty.', 'arctic-liquid-freezer-iii-240mm-rgb-liquid-cpu-cooler-1781375972', '<p>For enthusiasts who require reliable thermal headroom within a 240mm chassis footprint, the <strong>240mm A-RGB Liquid Cooler</strong> offers an ideal balance of power and efficiency. The radiator is engineered with a 38mm-thick profile, providing an increased coolant volume and surface area compared to standard-thickness units, which is essential for managing the heat output of today’s high-performance CPUs. At the base, a copper cold plate utilizes micro-skived fins to maximize thermal transfer from the processor, ensuring that your system remains responsive even under heavy gaming or multi-threaded productivity loads.</p><p>Performance is governed by dual PWM-controlled fans capable of scaling from 200 to 1800 RPM, delivering an impressive 56.30 CFM of airflow at 2.20 mmH2O of air pressure. This provides the perfect combination of aggressive cooling when needed and quiet operation during lighter tasks. Visual customization is easily handled by the integrated A-RGB lighting, which is fully compatible with standard 3-pin motherboard headers, allowing for vibrant, synchronized color schemes.</p><p>Reliability is built into every component, from the reinforced 450mm tubing with optimized 6mm inner diameter to the inclusion of Arctic’s flagship MX-6 thermal paste for a perfect interface. Whether you are building a new gaming rig or upgrading an existing workstation, this cooler offers a simplified, long-term solution. With broad socket compatibility and an extensive 6-year manufacturer warranty, the 240mm A-RGB Liquid Cooler is a high-reliability investment for any modern desktop configuration.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Radiator</strong></td><td>Thermal Dynamics</td><td>317 x 138 x 38 mm High-capacity radiator</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cold Plate</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>Copper base with micro-skived fin architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Dynamics</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>200–1800 RPM PWM-controlled fans (56.30 CFM)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Intel LGA 1700; AMD AM5/AM4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Plumbing</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>450mm reinforced tubing (12.4mm OD / 6.0mm ID)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Interface</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>Pre-applied Arctic MX-6 thermal compound</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>6-year manufacturer warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/kJZ7AkzIaPvGbRkXVcqRO7RJOzPCUOCuWCGSlz20.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 18:39:32', '2026-06-13 18:39:32', '240mm A-RGB Liquid Cooler | High-Efficiency AIO Cooling', '240mm A-RGB Liquid Cooler | High-Efficiency AIO Cooling', 'v240mm A-RGB Liquid Cooler | High-Efficiency AIO Cooling', NULL, 28, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `name`, `short_description`, `slug`, `description`, `specifications_text`, `tags`, `buy_price`, `price`, `discount_price`, `stock`, `thumbnail`, `video`, `is_featured`, `status`, `is_coming_soon`, `is_tba`, `is_call_for_price`, `is_out_of_stock`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`, `meta_keywords`, `meta_image`, `brand_id`, `supplier_id`, `laptop_purpose_id`) VALUES
(640, 'Arctic Liquid Freezer III 240MM Liquid CPU Cooler', 'The 240mm Performance Liquid Cooler is a robust thermal solution engineered for high-efficiency heat dissipation in compact builds. Featuring a 38mm-thick radiator and high-airflow PWM fans, it offers superior cooling capacity compared to standard-profile AIOs. With a precision-engineered micro-skived copper cold plate and Arctic’s premium MX-6 thermal compound, it provides a dependable, maintenance-free thermal upgrade for modern Intel LGA 1700 and AMD AM5/AM4 platforms, backed by a 6-year warranty.', 'arctic-liquid-freezer-iii-240mm-liquid-cpu-cooler-1781376053', '<p>For users requiring significant thermal headroom within a 240mm form factor, the <strong>240mm Performance Liquid Cooler</strong> delivers a professional-grade cooling environment. The radiator’s 38mm-thick design provides the extra coolant volume and surface area necessary to manage the thermal demands of high-performance multi-core processors. The cooling loop is centered on a high-conductivity copper cold plate with micro-skived fins, ensuring efficient energy transfer from the CPU die into the system.</p><p>Performance is governed by PWM-controlled fans that operate within a dynamic range of 200–1800 RPM, producing 56.30 CFM of airflow at 2.20 mmH2O of pressure. This balance ensures aggressive cooling when the system is under load, while maintaining quiet operation during everyday tasks. The system utilizes reinforced 450mm tubing with an optimized 6mm inner diameter to facilitate easy, clean routing in various chassis sizes while maintaining high liquid flow rates.</p><p>Installation is refined and reliable; the cooler arrives with Arctic’s flagship MX-6 thermal compound pre-applied, ensuring an optimal thermal interface from the first boot. With broad support for the latest Intel and AMD sockets and a comprehensive 6-year manufacturer warranty, this cooler is a long-term, high-value investment for builders who prioritize thermal stability and build longevity.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Radiator</strong></td><td>Thermal Dynamics</td><td>317 x 138 x 38 mm High-capacity radiator</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cold Plate</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>Copper base with micro-skived fin architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Dynamics</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>200–1800 RPM PWM-controlled fans (56.30 CFM)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Intel LGA 1700; AMD AM5/AM4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Plumbing</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>450mm length (12.4mm outer / 6.0mm inner diameter)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Interface</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>Pre-applied Arctic MX-6 thermal compound</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>6-year manufacturer warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/2oe487kggbZUGt6UGHFX4x3gw0qzvfikCWxlCdI9.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 18:40:53', '2026-06-13 18:40:53', '240mm Performance Liquid Cooler | High-Efficiency AIO', 'Maximize CPU cooling with this 240mm Performance Liquid Cooler. Features 38mm-thick radiator, 1800 RPM PWM fans, and a 6-year warranty.', '240mm liquid cooler, AIO CPU cooler, Intel LGA 1700 liquid cooling, AMD AM5 liquid cooler, high-efficiency AIO, 240mm radiator, thermal management, 6 year warranty cooler', NULL, 28, NULL, NULL),
(641, 'Arctic Liquid Freezer II 240 A-RGB Multi-Compatible All-in-One CPU Cooler', 'The 240mm A-RGB All-in-One Liquid Cooler is a high-performance thermal solution engineered for silent, efficient operation. Featuring a substantial 38mm-thick radiator and a whisper-quiet 0.3 Sone fan profile, this AIO delivers superior cooling capacity for demanding multi-core processors. Equipped with a micro-skived copper cold plate, fluid-dynamic fan technology, and full A-RGB integration with a convenient Y-splitter, it combines professional-grade reliability with aesthetic versatility. Backed by a 6-year warranty and including high-conductivity MX-5 thermal paste, it is the ultimate cooling upgrade for modern Intel and AMD systems.', 'arctic-liquid-freezer-ii-240-a-rgb-multi-compatible-all-in-one-cpu-cooler-1781376178', '<p>The <strong>240mm A-RGB All-in-One Liquid Cooler</strong> represents a masterclass in thermal engineering, designed specifically for enthusiasts who prioritize both silent operation and maximum performance. The centerpiece of this system is the 38mm-thick radiator—a design choice that significantly increases coolant volume and heat dissipation area compared to standard 240mm AIOs. This allows the cooler to maintain lower CPU temperatures under heavy loads, such as high-framerate gaming, workstation rendering, or intensive multi-threaded tasks, without requiring high-speed, noisy fan operation.</p><p>Acoustic excellence is achieved through intelligent PWM control, which allows the fan speed to scale from 200 to 1800 RPM. Notably, the fans feature a 0-RPM mode, meaning they remain completely still when the PWM signal is below 5%—providing absolute silence during desktop idle or light background tasks. Despite this whisper-quiet performance (rated at just 0.3 Sone), the fans generate 48.80 CFM of airflow, ensuring effective heat extraction through the radiator’s dense fin stack. The copper cold plate, precision-crafted with micro-skived fins, ensures rapid thermal energy transfer from the CPU to the liquid, maximizing efficiency.</p><p>Durability is at the forefront of the design, with 450mm reinforced tubing providing flexibility for easy installation in a wide range of tower cases. The unit is factory-filled and ready for immediate deployment, featuring pre-applied premium MX-5 thermal compound to guarantee the best possible thermal contact from the first boot. With support for a broad range of Intel and AMD sockets and a generous 6-year manufacturer warranty, this cooler is a future-proof thermal infrastructure component for any professional-grade PC build.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Radiator Specs</strong></td><td>Thermal Dynamics</td><td>277 x 120 x 38 mm High-density Aluminum stack</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pump Design</strong></td><td>Circulation</td><td>High-efficiency pump (78 x 53 x 98 mm) with micro-skived copper base</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>PWM Control</td><td>200–1800 RPM; 48.80 CFM; 1.85 mmH2O pressure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Profile</strong></td><td>Silent Tech</td><td>0.3 Sone rating with 0-RPM idle capability (below 5% PWM)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Illumination</strong></td><td>Visuals</td><td>Integrated ARGB with 3-Pin 5V connector and included Y-splitter</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Plumbing</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>450mm length; 12.4mm outer / 6.0mm inner diameter</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Interface</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>Pre-applied Arctic MX-5 (0.8 g) thermal compound</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Intel (1700/1200/115X/20XX); AMD (AM5/AM4/AM3+)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Weight</strong></td><td>Build Quality</td><td>1213g total system weight for stability and durability</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>6-year comprehensive manufacturer warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'CPU Cooler', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/NbY9ZycnQ8TJutdGUsVkIZBvGEiK4nUOR8dNd7tq.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 18:42:58', '2026-06-13 18:42:58', '240mm A-RGB Liquid Cooler | Silent Performance AIO', 'xperience silent, efficient cooling with our 240mm A-RGB AIO. Features 38mm-thick radiator, 0.3 Sone silence, and 6-year warranty. Universal Intel/AMD support.', '240mm liquid cooler, A-RGB AIO, silent liquid CPU cooler, 0.3 Sone AIO, Intel 1700 AIO, AMD AM5 liquid cooling, performance liquid cooler, 6 year warranty AIO', NULL, 28, NULL, NULL),
(642, 'Arctic Liquid Freezer II 280 Multi-Compatible All-in-One CPU Cooler', 'The 280mm High-Performance Liquid Cooler is a professional-grade thermal solution engineered for silent, efficient operation. Featuring a substantial 38mm-thick radiator and a whisper-quiet 0.3 Sone fan profile, this AIO delivers superior cooling capacity for demanding multi-core processors. Equipped with a precision-engineered micro-skived copper cold plate, fluid-dynamic fan technology, and an intelligent 0-RPM idle mode, it combines professional-grade reliability with advanced thermal engineering. Backed by a 6-year warranty and including high-conductivity MX-5 thermal paste, it is the ultimate cooling upgrade for modern high-end Intel and AMD desktop systems.', 'arctic-liquid-freezer-ii-280-multi-compatible-all-in-one-cpu-cooler-1781376256', '<p>The <strong>280mm High-Performance Liquid Cooler</strong> represents a pinnacle of thermal design, crafted specifically for enthusiasts who prioritize silent operation alongside maximum cooling headroom. The centerpiece of this system is the 38mm-thick radiator—a specialized architectural choice that provides increased coolant volume and significantly expanded surface area for heat exchange compared to standard 280mm AIO solutions. This design enables the cooler to manage the intense thermal output of overclocked, high-TDP CPUs under heavy gaming or productivity workloads while operating at near-inaudible levels.</p><p>Acoustic perfection is achieved through sophisticated PWM control, allowing fan speeds to dynamically scale from 200 to 1700 RPM. Notably, the system incorporates a 0-RPM mode that stops fan rotation entirely when the PWM signal is below 5%, ensuring absolute silence during desktop idle or light background tasks. Despite its whisper-quiet performance (rated at an industry-leading 0.3 Sone), the fans generate an impressive 72.84 CFM of airflow at 2.4 mmH2O of pressure, ensuring effective, rapid heat extraction. The copper cold plate, meticulously crafted with micro-skived fins, bridges the gap between the processor die and the liquid loop, guaranteeing efficient and immediate thermal energy transfer.</p><p>Durability and reliability are core pillars of this cooler’s construction. The 450mm reinforced tubing provides excellent flexibility for versatile mounting options in various chassis sizes, while maintaining an optimized 6mm internal diameter for consistent flow. The unit is factory-filled and ready for immediate deployment, arriving with premium MX-5 thermal paste pre-applied for a perfect, mess-free installation. Protected by an extensive 6-year manufacturer warranty, this liquid cooler stands as a future-proof thermal infrastructure component for any serious professional or gaming rig.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Radiator Specs</strong></td><td>Thermal Dynamics</td><td>317 x 138 x 38 mm High-capacity aluminum radiator stack</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pump Architecture</strong></td><td>Circulation</td><td>High-performance pump (78 x 53 x 98 mm) with micro-skived copper base</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>PWM Control</td><td>200–1700 RPM; 72.84 CFM; 2.4 mmH2O static pressure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Profile</strong></td><td>Silent Tech</td><td>0.3 Sone rating with 0-RPM idle capability (below 5% PWM)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Interface</strong></td><td>Conductivity</td><td>Pre-applied Arctic MX-5 (0.8 g) premium thermal compound</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Plumbing</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>450mm length; 12.4mm outer / 6.0mm inner diameter</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Intel (1700/1200/115X/20XX); AMD (AM5/AM4)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Weight</strong></td><td>Build Quality</td><td>1572g total system weight (Fan, Radiator, Pump, Tubes)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>6-year comprehensive manufacturer warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/ywcbEp7dJfhseyzOL9pHyL2i3btdJ1srpWEOvKgK.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 18:44:16', '2026-06-13 18:44:16', '280mm High-Performance Liquid Cooler | Silent AIO', 'Experience silent, elite cooling with our 280mm AIO liquid cooler. Features 38mm-thick radiator, 0.3 Sone silence, and 6-year warranty. Universal support.', '280mm liquid cooler, silent AIO, 280mm liquid CPU cooling, high-performance liquid cooler, 0.3 Sone cooler, Intel 1700 AIO, AMD AM5 liquid cooling, 6 year warranty liquid cooler', NULL, 28, NULL, NULL),
(643, 'Arctic Liquid Freezer II 240 Multi-Compatible All-in-One CPU Cooler', 'The 240mm Performance Liquid Cooler is a high-efficiency thermal solution engineered for silent, superior heat dissipation. Featuring a robust 38mm-thick radiator and a whisper-quiet 0.3 Sone fan profile, this AIO delivers excellent cooling capacity for modern multi-core processors. Equipped with a precision-engineered micro-skived copper cold plate, intelligent 0-RPM fan technology, and pre-applied MX-5 thermal paste, it combines professional-grade reliability with an exceptionally low acoustic footprint. Backed by a 6-year warranty, it is an ideal, future-proof upgrade for high-performance Intel and AMD desktop systems.', 'arctic-liquid-freezer-ii-240-multi-compatible-all-in-one-cpu-cooler-1781376366', '<p>The <strong>240mm Performance Liquid Cooler</strong> is crafted for enthusiasts who demand a perfect equilibrium between extreme thermal performance and near-silent operation. The system utilizes a specialized 38mm-thick radiator, which offers greater coolant volume and a significantly expanded surface area for heat exchange compared to standard-profile 240mm units. This allows for effective heat management of high-TDP CPUs under heavy gaming or productivity workloads while maintaining remarkably low noise levels.</p><p>Acoustic excellence is a hallmark of this design, featuring PWM-controlled fans with a dynamic speed range of 200–1800 RPM. For absolute silence during idle or low-intensity tasks, the fans feature an intelligent 0-RPM mode that halts rotation entirely when the PWM signal is below 5%. Despite this silent operation, the system produces a strong 56.33 CFM of airflow at 2.2 mmH2O of pressure, ensuring that your core components stay cool and stable. The high-conductivity copper cold plate, utilizing an intricate micro-skived fin architecture, optimizes heat extraction from the processor die into the liquid circuit with minimal resistance.</p><p>Durability is built into the foundation of this cooler, featuring reinforced 450mm tubing that provides both the flexibility for diverse chassis mounting and the high-flow consistency required for 24/7 reliability. The unit arrives factory-filled and ready for installation, including pre-applied Arctic MX-5 thermal compound to guarantee an optimal thermal interface from the first boot. With comprehensive support for the latest Intel and AMD sockets and a 6-year manufacturer warranty, this cooler is a long-term, high-value investment in your system’s longevity and performance.</p><h3><strong>Technical Breakdown</strong></h3>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Radiator Specs</strong></td><td>Thermal Dynamics</td><td>277 x 120 x 38 mm High-density Aluminum stack</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pump Architecture</strong></td><td>Circulation</td><td>High-performance pump (98 x 78 x 53 mm) with micro-skived copper base</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>PWM Control</td><td>200–1800 RPM; 56.33 CFM; 2.2 mmH2O static pressure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Profile</strong></td><td>Silent Tech</td><td>0.3 Sone rating with 0-RPM idle capability (below 5% PWM)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Interface</strong></td><td>Conductivity</td><td>Pre-applied Arctic MX-5 (0.8 g) premium thermal compound</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Plumbing</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>450mm length; 12.4mm outer / 6.0mm inner diameter</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Intel (1700/1200/115X/20XX); AMD (AM5/AM4/AM3+)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Weight</strong></td><td>Build Quality</td><td>1191g total system weight (Fan, Radiator, Pump, Tubes)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>6-year comprehensive manufacturer warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'CPU Cooler', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/3vztTVS9jgLNF7VzEfcKURktxZ279sGNt7cV6eiB.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 18:46:06', '2026-06-13 18:46:06', '240mm Performance Liquid Cooler | Silent AIO', 'xperience silent, elite cooling with our 240mm AIO liquid cooler. Features 38mm-thick radiator, 0.3 Sone silence, and 6-year warranty. Universal support.', '240mm liquid cooler, silent AIO, 240mm liquid CPU cooling, high-performance liquid cooler, 0.3 Sone cooler, Intel 1700 AIO, AMD AM5 liquid cooling, 6 year warranty liquid cooler', NULL, 28, NULL, NULL),
(644, 'Arctic Liquid Freezer III 360MM Liquid CPU Cooler', 'The 360mm High-Performance Liquid Cooler is a professional-grade thermal solution engineered to maximize heat dissipation for modern high-TDP processors. With its expansive 398mm radiator and 38mm thickness, it offers superior coolant capacity compared to standard-profile AIOs. Engineered for efficiency, it features a precision-machined micro-skived copper cold plate, high-static-pressure PWM fans, and premium pre-applied MX-6 thermal paste. Providing native support for Intel LGA 1700 and AMD AM5/AM4, this cooler is a reliable, future-proof investment built for sustained performance in high-end workstations and gaming rigs.', 'arctic-liquid-freezer-iii-360mm-liquid-cpu-cooler-1781376453', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>For users seeking the ultimate thermal ceiling, the <strong>360mm High-Performance Liquid Cooler</strong> provides an unmatched cooling environment. The radiator’s massive footprint allows for significant surface area, which, paired with the 38mm-thick design, enables the system to handle the heat output of today’s most demanding multi-core CPUs with ease. The cooling loop is powered by a high-efficiency copper cold plate, utilizing intricate micro-skived fins to draw thermal energy away from the CPU die into the closed-loop system with extreme precision.</p><p>Performance is managed by high-static-pressure fans that scale from 200 to 1800 RPM, delivering up to 56.30 CFM of airflow at 2.20 mmH2O of pressure to maintain optimal temperatures during intense gaming, rendering, or productivity workloads. The system is designed with professional-grade plumbing; the 450mm reinforced tubes provide exceptional flexibility for easy installation in various chassis sizes while maintaining high flow rates through their optimized 6mm inner diameter.</p><p>Installation is refined to eliminate guesswork, as the cooler arrives pre-loaded with Arctic’s flagship MX-6 thermal compound, ensuring a perfect interface between the CPU and the cold plate right out of the box. By streamlining compatibility for the latest Intel and AMD sockets, this AIO liquid cooler offers a seamless transition to high-end cooling. It serves as a cornerstone for any high-reliability workstation or enthusiast rig, ensuring your components remain cool and performan</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th><th>Specification Details</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Radiator Specs</strong></td><td>Thermal Dynamics</td><td>398 x 120 x 38 mm High-capacity Aluminum radiator</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>Copper base with precision micro-skived fin architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Dynamics</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>200–1800 RPM PWM-controlled fans (56.30 CFM)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Intel LGA 1700; AMD AM5/AM4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Plumbing</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>450mm reinforced length (12.4mm outer / 6.0mm inner diameter)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Interface</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>Pre-applied Arctic MX-6 (0.8g) thermal compound</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>6-year comprehensive manufacturer warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/ofhLDvkMpvekSjemd8rMviOGLzBvxqVnFPOMsA4x.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-13 18:47:33', '2026-06-13 18:47:33', '360mm High-Performance Liquid Cooler | Thermal Excellence', ': Achieve peak performance with our 360mm Liquid Cooler. Features a 38mm-thick radiator, 1800 RPM fans, and high-pressure airflow. Best for high-TDP CPUs.\r\n\r\nMeta Keywords: 360mm liquid cooler, AIO CPU cooler, Intel LGA 1700 liquid cooling, AMD AM', '360mm liquid cooler, AIO CPU cooler, Intel LGA 1700 liquid cooling, AMD AM5 liquid cooler, high performance liquid cooling, 360mm radiator, thermal management system', NULL, 28, NULL, NULL),
(645, 'Boxlight Projector ALX502 5000 Lumens XGA Standard Throw', 'The Boxlight ALX502 5000 Lumens XGA Standard Throw Projector is a powerful and reliable projection solution designed for classrooms, meeting rooms, and business presentations. Featuring 5000 lumens brightness, XGA (1024 × 768) resolution, advanced LCD technology, and up to 20,000 hours lamp life in ECO mode, it delivers bright, vivid, and long-lasting performance for professional and educational environments.', 'boxlight-projector-alx502-5000-lumens-xga-standard-throw-1781413617', '<p>The Boxlight ALX502 5000 Lumens XGA Standard Throw Projector is engineered to provide exceptional visual performance for educational institutions, conference rooms, training centers, and corporate environments. Equipped with a high-quality 3LCD projection system featuring three 0.63-inch LCD panels, the projector delivers bright, accurate, and vibrant images with native XGA (1024 × 768) resolution.</p><p>With an impressive brightness rating of 5000 lumens, the Boxlight ALX502 ensures clear and vivid presentations even in brightly lit rooms. Whether displaying spreadsheets, presentations, videos, or educational content, the projector maintains excellent image quality and color consistency without requiring complete darkness.</p><h3>High Brightness and Rich Color Performance</h3><p>The advanced 3LCD technology provides outstanding color accuracy and brightness, producing natural-looking images with vibrant colors and sharp details. Unlike conventional projection technologies, the ALX502 maintains high color brightness, making it ideal for classrooms, boardrooms, and lecture halls where visibility is critical.</p><h3>Long-Lasting Lamp Technology</h3><p>Designed for continuous operation and reduced maintenance costs, the Boxlight ALX502 offers up to 10,000 hours of lamp life in Normal Mode and an impressive 20,000 hours in ECO Mode. This extended lifespan significantly reduces replacement frequency and lowers the total cost of ownership, making it a cost-effective solution for organizations and institutions.</p><h3>Advanced Keystone Correction</h3><p>The projector features automatic and manual vertical keystone correction up to ±30 degrees, along with manual horizontal keystone adjustment. This functionality allows users to quickly correct image distortion and achieve perfectly aligned projections even when the projector is positioned off-center.</p><h3>Versatile Connectivity</h3><p>The Boxlight ALX502 supports a wide range of connectivity options, including VGA, HDMI, USB, Audio, Video, and RJ45 network connectivity. These interfaces ensure seamless integration with laptops, desktop computers, media players, document cameras, and network-based presentation systems.</p><h3>Enhanced Security and Reliability</h3><p>Built with user convenience in mind, the projector includes password protection, a built-in speaker, and an integrated dust filter system. These features improve security, simplify operation, and help maintain long-term performance in demanding environments.</p><p>Combining high brightness, flexible installation, long lamp life, and versatile connectivity, the Boxlight ALX502 5000 Lumens XGA Standard Throw Projector is an excellent choice for schools, universities, training centers, and corporate meeting spaces.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul><li>5000 Lumens high-brightness projection</li><li>Native XGA (1024 × 768) resolution</li><li>Advanced 3LCD projection technology</li><li>Up to 20,000 hours lamp life in ECO mode</li><li>Automatic and manual keystone correction</li><li>HDMI, VGA, USB, Audio, Video, and RJ45 connectivity</li><li>Built-in speaker for multimedia presentations</li><li>Integrated dust filter system</li><li>Password protection for enhanced security</li><li>Ideal for education and business environments</li></ul><h3>Buy Boxlight ALX502 5000 Lumens XGA Standard Throw Projector from International Office Solution</h3><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original Boxlight ALX502 5000 Lumens XGA Standard Throw Projector from <strong>International Office Solution (IOS)</strong>. We offer a comprehensive range of genuine Boxlight projectors for educational institutions, corporate offices, conference rooms, and training facilities. Contact International Office Solution today for the latest price, availability, and professional installation services.</p><p>The Boxlight ALX502 Projector comes with <strong>2 Years Parts &amp; Service Warranty</strong> and <strong>12 Months or 1000 Hours Lamp Warranty</strong>.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>LCD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>XGA (1024 × 768)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>5000 Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>4:3</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>25,000:1 (with IRIS)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>10,000 Hours (Normal), 20,000 Hours (ECO)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>1 × 16W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity &amp; Power</strong></td><td>Power Requirements</td><td>100~240V AC, 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>340W (Normal), 150W (ECO)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>ECO Standby Power Consumption</td><td>&lt; 0.5W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Security &amp; Features</strong></td><td>Security Functions</td><td>Password Protection, Control Panel Lock, Kensington Lock</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Maintenance</td><td>Dust Filter</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specifications</strong></td><td>Weight</td><td>3.3 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions (W × H × D)</td><td>345 × 261 × 99 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Parts &amp; Service Warranty</td><td>2 Years</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Warranty</td><td>12 Months or 1000 Hours</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 108000.00, 108000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/SzSeIJy1tCciURRCxqmmdjBLJA65PJFsaQRwfTci.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 05:06:57', '2026-06-14 10:46:13', 'Boxlight ALX502 5000 Lumens XGA Standard Throw Projector Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Boxlight ALX502 5000 Lumens XGA Standard Throw Projector in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features XGA resolution, 3LCD technology, 20,000-hour lamp life, keystone correction, and versatile connectivity options.', 'Boxlight ALX502, Boxlight ALX502 Projector, Boxlight Projector Bangladesh, XGA Projector Price in Bangladesh, 5000 Lumens Projector, 3LCD Projector, Business Projector Bangladesh, Classroom Projector, Conference Room Projector, Boxlight Standard Throw Projector, Educational Projector, HDMI Projector, International Office Solution, IOS Bangladesh, Boxlight ALX502 Price BD.', NULL, 262, NULL, NULL),
(646, 'Boxlight Projector ALX402 4000 Lumes XGA Standard Throw', 'The **Boxlight ALX402 4000 ANSI Lumens XGA LCD Projector** delivers bright and clear presentations with XGA resolution, LCD display technology, and up to 20,000 hours of lamp life in ECO mode. Featuring advanced keystone correction, wireless projection capability, RJ45 and USB connectivity, and an intelligent dust-proof design, it is an ideal projector for classrooms, offices, and meeting rooms.', 'boxlight-projector-alx402-4000-lumes-xga-standard-throw-1781414359', '<p>The <strong>Boxlight ALX402 4000 ANSI Lumens XGA LCD Projector</strong> is a powerful and versatile projection solution designed for classrooms, conference rooms, training centers, and business environments. Featuring <strong>XGA (1024 × 768) resolution</strong> and <strong>4000 ANSI lumens brightness</strong>, this projector delivers bright, sharp, and vivid visuals even in well-lit rooms. Its advanced LCD technology ensures excellent color accuracy and image clarity, making presentations, educational content, and multimedia displays more engaging and professional.</p><p>Built with a long-lasting lamp system, the Boxlight ALX402 offers up to <strong>20,000 hours of lamp life in ECO mode</strong>, significantly reducing maintenance requirements and lowering operating costs. The projector supports a wide range of connectivity options, including <strong>RJ45 and USB interfaces</strong>, allowing seamless integration with computers, media devices, and network environments.</p><p>One of the standout features of the Boxlight ALX402 is its advanced image correction capability. It supports <strong>automatic and manual vertical keystone correction</strong>, manual horizontal correction, Corner Keystone adjustment, and Pincushion/Barrel Correction, ensuring perfectly aligned images even when projecting from challenging angles or onto uneven surfaces.</p><p>The projector is also designed with a <strong>high-efficiency dust-proof filtration system</strong>, helping maintain image quality while extending the lifespan of internal components. Its intelligent filter monitoring technology automatically detects airflow issues and alerts users when cleaning is required, providing greater reliability and reduced maintenance downtime.</p><p>For enhanced flexibility, the Boxlight ALX402 supports <strong>wireless projection</strong> through an optional Wi-Fi adapter. Users can wirelessly mirror content from Windows PCs, Android devices, and iOS devices without requiring HDMI, VGA, or network cables, making presentations more convenient and clutter-free.</p><p>Combining high brightness, long lamp life, intelligent correction features, and wireless presentation capabilities, the Boxlight ALX402 is an excellent choice for educational institutions, corporate meeting rooms, and professional presentation environments.</p><h2>Key Features</h2><ul><li>4000 ANSI Lumens brightness</li><li>XGA (1024 × 768) native resolution</li><li>LCD display technology</li><li>Up to 20,000 hours lamp life in ECO mode</li><li>Automatic and manual keystone correction</li><li>Corner Keystone and Pincushion/Barrel image adjustment</li><li>High-efficiency dust-proof filter system</li><li>RJ45 and USB connectivity</li><li>Wireless projection support (optional adapter required)</li><li>Supports Android and iOS wireless screen sharing</li><li>Easy installation and maintenance</li><li>Ideal for education and business applications</li></ul><h2>Buy Boxlight ALX402 4000 ANSI Lumens XGA LCD Projector from International Office Solution</h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original <strong>Boxlight ALX402 4000 ANSI Lumens XGA LCD Projector</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>. We offer a comprehensive range of genuine Boxlight projectors for educational institutions, businesses, conference rooms, and professional presentation environments. Contact International Office Solution today for the best price, expert consultation, and reliable after-sales support.</p><p>The <strong>Boxlight ALX402 Projector</strong> comes with a <strong>02-Year Manufacturer Warranty</strong>.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>Liquid Crystal Display (LCD)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>XGA (1024 × 768)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>4000 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>20,000:1</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>10,000 Hours (Normal), 20,000 Hours (ECO)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>1 × 10W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Requirements</td><td>100~240V AC, 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>310W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>ECO Standby Power Consumption</td><td>&lt; 0.5W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specifications</strong></td><td>Net Weight</td><td>3.06 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions (W × H × D)</td><td>345 × 261 × 99 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>02 Years</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 80000.00, 80000.00, NULL, 6, 'products/thumbnails/0wT10smqyOfiyHQRY9jOHCPjQIUHZMMBSXJwCYCG.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 05:19:19', '2026-06-14 10:45:53', 'Boxlight ALX402 4000 ANSI Lumens XGA LCD Projector Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Boxlight ALX402 4000 ANSI Lumens XGA LCD Projector in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features XGA resolution, LCD technology, wireless projection support, advanced keystone correction, and up to 20,000 hours lamp life.', 'Boxlight ALX402, Boxlight ALX402 Projector, Boxlight ALX402 Price in Bangladesh, Boxlight XGA Projector, 4000 ANSI Lumens Projector, LCD Projector Bangladesh, Wireless Projector, Business Projector, Classroom Projector, Conference Room Projector, Boxlight Projector Price, XGA LCD Projector, International Office Solution, Educational Projector, Presentation Projector, Wireless Presentation Projector', NULL, 262, NULL, NULL),
(647, 'Boxlight Projector ALX352 3500 Lumens XGA LCD Standard Throw', 'The **Boxlight ALX352 3500 Lumens XGA LCD Standard Throw Projector** delivers bright and vibrant presentations with 3500 ANSI lumens brightness, XGA resolution, and LCD display technology. Featuring a 15,000:1 contrast ratio, flexible standard throw lens, HDMI and VGA connectivity, and up to 20,000 hours lamp life in ECO mode, it is an excellent choice for classrooms, offices, and professional presentation environments.', 'boxlight-projector-alx352-3500-lumens-xga-lcd-standard-throw-1781414816', '<p>The <strong>Boxlight ALX352 3500 Lumens XGA LCD Standard Throw Projector</strong> is a reliable and versatile projection solution designed for classrooms, training centers, meeting rooms, and business environments. Featuring <strong>3500 ANSI lumens brightness</strong> and a native <strong>XGA (1024 × 768) resolution</strong>, this projector delivers sharp text, vivid colors, and clear images, even in rooms with ambient lighting.</p><p>Powered by advanced <strong>Liquid Crystal Display (LCD) technology</strong>, the Boxlight ALX352 ensures consistent color performance and enhanced image quality for presentations, educational content, and multimedia applications. The projector offers a high <strong>15,000:1 contrast ratio with IRIS technology</strong>, producing deeper blacks and brighter whites for improved visual clarity and image depth.</p><p>The Boxlight ALX352 is equipped with a long-lasting lamp system that provides up to <strong>10,000 hours of operation in Normal Mode</strong> and up to <strong>20,000 hours in ECO Mode</strong>, helping reduce maintenance requirements and overall operating costs. Its standard throw lens features a <strong>1.48–1.78:1 throw ratio</strong> with manual zoom and focus controls, allowing users to easily adjust image size and positioning according to room requirements.</p><p>Connectivity options include <strong>HDMI, VGA, Video, Audio In/Out, RS232, and USB-B</strong>, ensuring seamless compatibility with laptops, desktop PCs, media players, document cameras, and other presentation devices. Additional features such as <strong>keystone correction, multiple image modes, closed caption support, security lock functions, and easy maintenance access</strong> make this projector highly practical for daily professional use.</p><p>Designed with portability and durability in mind, the Boxlight ALX352 features a compact form factor that makes installation and transportation easy. Whether for educational institutions, corporate boardrooms, training facilities, or conference halls, this projector offers dependable performance and exceptional value.</p><h2>Key Features</h2><ul><li>3500 ANSI Lumens brightness</li><li>Native XGA (1024 × 768) resolution</li><li>Advanced LCD display technology</li><li>High 15,000:1 contrast ratio with IRIS</li><li>Standard throw projection lens</li><li>Manual zoom and focus adjustment</li><li>Lamp life up to 20,000 hours in ECO mode</li><li>HDMI, VGA, USB-B, Video and Audio connectivity</li><li>Keystone correction for image alignment</li><li>Security lock and control panel lock support</li><li>Compact and lightweight design</li><li>Ideal for classrooms, offices, and conference rooms</li></ul><h2>Buy Boxlight ALX352 3500 Lumens XGA LCD Standard Throw Projector from International Office Solution</h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original <strong>Boxlight ALX352 3500 Lumens XGA LCD Standard Throw Projector</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>. We offer a comprehensive collection of genuine Boxlight projectors for educational institutions, businesses, training centers, and conference rooms. Contact International Office Solution today to get the best price, professional consultation, and dependable after-sales support.</p><p>The <strong>Boxlight ALX352 Projector</strong> comes with <strong>2 Years Parts &amp; Service Warranty and 12 Months or 1000 Hours Lamp Warranty</strong>.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>Liquid Crystal Display (LCD)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>XGA (1024 × 768) Display</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>3500 Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>4:3 (Standard) / 16:9 (Compatible)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>15,000:1 (with IRIS)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>0.887 ~ 10.899 m (30\" ~ 300\")</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>10,000 Hours (Normal), 20,000 Hours (ECO)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>10W × 1</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>USB-B, VGA, HDMI</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Requirements</td><td>100~240V AC, 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>290W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>ECO Standby Power Consumption</td><td>&lt; 0.5W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specifications</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>3.06 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions (W × H × D)</td><td>345 × 261 × 99 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Parts &amp; Service Warranty</td><td>02 Years</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Warranty</td><td>12 Months or 1000 Hours</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 55000.00, 55000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/2U2ygz0D4W2tnnKQcagapU7ZgCoPaLHheKEYTEHP.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 05:26:56', '2026-06-14 10:45:36', 'Boxlight ALX352 3500 Lumens XGA LCD Standard Throw Projector Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Boxlight ALX352 3500 Lumens XGA LCD Standard Throw Projector in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features XGA resolution, LCD technology, 15,000:1 contrast ratio, HDMI connectivity, and up to 20,000 hours lamp life.', 'Boxlight ALX352, Boxlight ALX352 Projector, Boxlight ALX352 Price in Bangladesh, Boxlight XGA Projector, 3500 Lumens Projector, LCD Projector Bangladesh, Standard Throw Projector, Business Projector, Classroom Projector, Conference Room Projector, HDMI Projector, Educational Projector, Presentation Projector, Boxlight Projector Price, International Office Solution', NULL, 262, NULL, NULL),
(648, 'Boxligh Projectort ALX462 4600 Lumes XGA Standard Throw', 'The **Boxlight ALX462 4600 ANSI Lumens XGA LCD Projector** delivers bright and clear visuals with XGA resolution and advanced LCD technology. Featuring up to 20,000 hours lamp life, RJ45 and USB connectivity, advanced keystone correction, and optional wireless projection support, it is ideal for classrooms, offices, and professional presentations.', 'boxligh-projectort-alx462-4600-lumes-xga-standard-throw-1781415234', '<p>The <strong>Boxlight ALX462 4600 ANSI Lumens XGA LCD Projector</strong> is a high-performance projection solution designed for classrooms, conference rooms, training centers, and professional business environments. With a powerful <strong>4600 ANSI lumens brightness</strong>, this projector delivers bright, vivid, and clear visuals even in well-lit indoor spaces, ensuring an engaging presentation experience at all times.</p><p>Featuring advanced <strong>Liquid Crystal Display (LCD) technology</strong> and native <strong>XGA (1024 × 768) resolution</strong>, the Boxlight ALX462 produces sharp images with accurate color reproduction and excellent detail clarity. Its high-performance optical system ensures consistent brightness and color balance for both text-based presentations and multimedia content.</p><p>With an impressive <strong>20,000-hour lamp life in ECO mode</strong>, the ALX462 significantly reduces maintenance costs and operational downtime, making it a cost-effective long-term investment for institutions and businesses.</p><p>The projector also includes <strong>RJ45 and USB connectivity</strong>, allowing flexible integration with multiple input sources. The USB port supports data reading and wireless projection functionality, enabling seamless content sharing across devices.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Advanced Image Correction &amp; Installation Flexibility</h2><p>The Boxlight ALX462 is designed for maximum installation flexibility with advanced correction features, including:</p><ul><li>Automatic and manual vertical keystone correction</li><li>Manual horizontal keystone adjustment</li><li>Corner Keystone correction</li><li>Pincushion and Barrel distortion correction</li></ul><p>These features ensure perfectly aligned images even when the projector is placed at difficult angles or uneven surfaces.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Dust-Proof and Durable Design</h2><p>Built with a <strong>high-efficiency ESD dust filter system</strong>, the Boxlight ALX462 is engineered for long-lasting performance. The built-in intelligent airflow detection system continuously monitors internal air circulation and alerts users when filter cleaning is required. This helps maintain image quality while extending the lifespan of internal components and reducing maintenance needs.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Wireless Projection Capability</h2><p>The Boxlight ALX462 supports <strong>optional wireless projection functionality</strong>, allowing users to display content from Windows PCs and mobile devices without HDMI, VGA, or RJ45 cables. With the optional wireless adapter, users can effortlessly project from:</p><ul><li>Windows laptops</li><li>Android smartphones and tablets</li><li>iOS devices (iPhone and iPad)</li></ul><p>This ensures a clutter-free, flexible, and modern presentation experience.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Key Features</h2><ul><li>4600 ANSI Lumens high brightness</li><li>XGA (1024 × 768) native resolution</li><li>LCD display technology</li><li>Up to 20,000 hours lamp life (ECO mode)</li><li>RJ45 and USB connectivity</li><li>Wireless projection support (optional adapter)</li><li>Advanced keystone correction (vertical, horizontal, corner)</li><li>Pincushion and barrel correction support</li><li>Dust-proof ESD filter system</li><li>Intelligent airflow monitoring with filter alert</li><li>Suitable for classrooms and corporate environments</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Buy Boxlight ALX462 4600 ANSI Lumens XGA LCD Projector from International Office Solution</h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original <strong>Boxlight ALX462 4600 ANSI Lumens XGA LCD Projector</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>. We provide a wide range of genuine Boxlight projectors suitable for educational institutions, corporate offices, training centers, and conference rooms. Contact International Office Solution for the best price, expert guidance, and reliable after-sales support.</p><p>The <strong>Boxlight ALX462 Projector</strong> comes with a <strong>02-Year Manufacturer Warranty</strong>.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>Liquid Crystal Display (LCD)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>XGA (1024 × 768)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>4600 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>20,000:1</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>10,000 Hours (Normal), 20,000 Hours (ECO)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>1 × 10W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Requirements</td><td>100~240V AC, 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>310W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>ECO Standby Power Consumption</td><td>&lt; 0.5W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specifications</strong></td><td>Net Weight</td><td>3.06 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions (W × H × D)</td><td>345 × 261 × 99 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>02 Years</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 85000.00, 84500.00, NULL, 6, 'products/thumbnails/X9EZ1fklk8Y18fPPdp0xrLnDUU5kWhZSoXaVye5D.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 05:33:54', '2026-06-14 10:45:20', 'Boxlight ALX462 4600 ANSI Lumens XGA LCD Projector Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy Boxlight ALX462 4600 ANSI Lumens XGA LCD Projector in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features XGA resolution, LCD technology, wireless projection support, keystone correction, and up to 20,000 hours lamp life.', 'Boxlight ALX462, Boxlight ALX462 Projector, Boxlight ALX462 Price in Bangladesh, XGA Projector, 4600 Lumens Projector, LCD Projector Bangladesh, Business Projector, Classroom Projector, Wireless Projector, RJ45 Projector, HDMI Projector, Presentation Projector, International Office Solution, Conference Room Projector, Educational Projector', NULL, 262, NULL, NULL);
