(649, 'Boxlight Projector ALX330 3300 Lumens XGA Standard Throw', 'The Boxlight ALX330 3300 Lumens XGA LCD Projector delivers bright, clear, and reliable visuals for classrooms and offices. Featuring 3300 ANSI lumens brightness, 3000:1 contrast ratio, XGA resolution, and multiple connectivity options including HDMI and VGA, it ensures smooth presentations and excellent image quality in any environment.', 'boxlight-projector-alx330-3300-lumens-xga-standard-throw-1781415744', '<p>The <strong>Boxlight ALX330 3300 Lumens XGA LCD Standard Throw Projector</strong> delivers a powerful and immersive visual experience for classrooms, meeting rooms, and multimedia presentations. Designed for reliability and performance, this projector ensures clear, bright, and detailed image output even in well-lit environments, making it an excellent choice for educational and business use.</p><p>With a brightness level of <strong>3300 ANSI lumens</strong>, the ALX330 produces vivid and vibrant visuals that maintain clarity in both dark and bright spaces. Its <strong>3000:1 contrast ratio</strong> enhances image depth by clearly separating dark and light tones, ensuring more engaging and professional-looking presentations.</p><p>The projector features a native <strong>XGA (1024 × 768) resolution</strong>, which provides sharp text clarity and well-defined visuals for slides, charts, documents, and videos. Combined with <strong>LCD (Liquid Crystal Display) technology</strong>, it delivers accurate color reproduction and consistent image quality across all types of content.</p><p>Engineered for flexibility, the Boxlight ALX330 supports multiple connectivity options including <strong>HDMI, VGA, USB-B, and audio interfaces</strong>, allowing seamless connection with laptops, PCs, media players, and other devices. This versatility makes it suitable for both modern and legacy systems.</p><p>The projector is designed with energy efficiency in mind, consuming approximately <strong>290W of power</strong> during operation. Its <strong>ECO mode</strong> reduces power consumption and fan noise, ensuring quieter performance and lower operating costs during extended use.</p><p>Built with a <strong>3 × 0.63-inch LCD panel system</strong>, the ALX330 ensures stable image processing and consistent brightness. It supports a flexible projection size range of <strong>0.887 to 10.899 meters</strong>, allowing it to adapt easily to different room sizes and audience requirements.</p><p>For long-term durability, the projector is optimized for stable operation within a temperature range of <strong>0°C to 40°C (35°C in ECO mode)</strong>, ensuring reliable performance in various environments.</p><p>Overall, the Boxlight ALX330 is a dependable and cost-effective projection solution that combines brightness, clarity, and flexibility—ideal for schools, offices, and training centers.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>Liquid Crystal Display (LCD)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>XGA (1024 × 768) Display</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>3300 Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>3000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>4:3</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Screen Size</td><td>0.887 ~ 10.899 m</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>10,000 Hours (Normal), 20,000 Hours (ECO)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>USB-B, VGA, HDMI</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>290W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Other Features</strong></td><td>Display Panel</td><td>3 × 0.63\"</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Noise Level</td><td>ECO: Max 31 dB, Normal: 38 dB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Operating Temperature</td><td>0°C ~ 40°C</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specifications</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>3.06 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions (W × H × D)</td><td>345 × 261 × 99 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Parts &amp; Service Warranty</td><td>02 Years</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Warranty</td><td>12 Months or 1,000 Hours</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 51000.00, 51000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/zDNi0bixkxodGPDQ0nIUOlr4VYnFDbIwqhwMzfnt.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 05:42:24', '2026-06-14 10:45:04', 'Boxlight ALX330 3300 Lumens XGA Projector – LCD Standard Throw', 'Buy Boxlight ALX330 3300 Lumens XGA LCD Projector with 3000:1 contrast ratio, HDMI/VGA connectivity, ECO mode, and bright clear visuals for classrooms and offices.', 'Boxlight ALX330, Boxlight projector XGA, 3300 lumens projector, LCD projector Boxlight, standard throw projector, classroom projector Bangladesh, office projector XGA, HDMI VGA projector, Boxlight ALX330 price Bangladesh, International Office Solution projector, business projector XGA', NULL, 262, NULL, NULL),
(650, 'Boxlight Projector ALX320 3200 Lumens XGA Standard Throw', 'The Boxlight ALX320 3200 Lumens XGA Projector offers bright and clear visuals with long-lasting performance. Featuring 3200 ANSI lumens brightness, XGA resolution, 20,000-hour ECO lamp life, HDMI connectivity, and an intelligent air filter detection system, it is ideal for classrooms and corporate use.', 'boxlight-projector-alx320-3200-lumens-xga-standard-throw-1781416157', '<p>The <strong>Boxlight ALX320 3200 Lumens XGA Standard Throw Projector</strong> delivers bright, clear, and reliable performance, making it an excellent choice for both educational and corporate environments. Designed to provide vivid image quality and long-lasting durability, this projector ensures an engaging viewing experience for presentations, lectures, and business meetings.</p><p>With a brightness output of <strong>3200 ANSI lumens</strong>, the ALX320 produces sharp and vibrant visuals that remain clear even in well-lit indoor environments. Its advanced projection system ensures accurate color reproduction, allowing users to enjoy true-to-life image quality with consistent brightness and clarity.</p><p>The projector is equipped with <strong>XGA (1024 × 768) resolution</strong>, which is ideal for displaying presentations, documents, charts, and multimedia content with fine detail and readability. Combined with <strong>LCD projection technology</strong>, it delivers stable color performance and smooth image output for everyday professional use.</p><p>Designed for long-term reliability, the Boxlight ALX320 features a <strong>lamp life of up to 20,000 hours in ECO mode</strong>, significantly reducing maintenance requirements and operational costs. This makes it a cost-effective solution for institutions and organizations that require frequent and extended usage.</p><p>For ease of connectivity, the projector includes a built-in <strong>HDMI input port</strong>, allowing seamless transmission of high-quality video and audio signals from laptops, media players, and other digital devices using a single cable connection.</p><p>To enhance durability and performance, the ALX320 is equipped with an <strong>automatic air filter detection system</strong>. This intelligent feature continuously monitors airflow and detects blockages, providing alerts when cleaning is required. This helps maintain optimal cooling efficiency, protects internal components, and extends the overall lifespan of the projector.</p><p>With its user-friendly design, reliable performance, and efficient maintenance features, the Boxlight ALX320 is well-suited for classrooms, training centers, and office environments where consistent and high-quality projection is essential.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>Liquid Crystal Display (LCD)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>XGA (1024 × 768) Display</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>3200 Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>3000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>4:3</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Screen Size</td><td>0.887 ~ 10.899 m</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>10,000 Hours (Normal), 20,000 Hours (ECO)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>USB-B, VGA, HDMI</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>290W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Other Features</strong></td><td>Display Panel</td><td>3 × 0.63\" LCD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Noise Level</td><td>ECO: Max 31 dB, Normal: 38 dB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Operating Temperature</td><td>0°C ~ 40°C</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specifications</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>3.06 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions (W × H × D)</td><td>345 × 261 × 99 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Parts &amp; Service Warranty</td><td>02 Years</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Warranty</td><td>12 Months or 1,000 Hours</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 46490.00, 46490.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/8Qbt63wi1WJWlXItBG7qTJ68z9973yryKBGi3BCq.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 05:49:17', '2026-06-14 10:44:50', 'Boxlight ALX320 3200 Lumens XGA Projector – Long Life Lamp HDMI', 'Buy Boxlight ALX320 3200 Lumens XGA Standard Throw Projector with 20,000-hour lamp life, HDMI connectivity, and auto filter detection. Best for education and office use.', 'Boxlight ALX320, 3200 lumens projector, XGA projector Boxlight, classroom projector Bangladesh, office projector XGA, HDMI projector, long life lamp projector, LCD projector Boxlight ALX320, education projector Bangladesh, International Office Solution projector', NULL, 262, NULL, NULL),
(651, 'Xiaomi Projector Wanbo T6R Max 650 ANSI Lumens Android Smart Portable', 'The Xiaomi Wanbo T6R Max Smart Projector combines Full HD 1080p resolution, 650 ANSI lumens brightness, and intelligent AI-powered auto focus and keystone correction to deliver an exceptional home entertainment experience. Featuring Android 9.0, dual-band Wi-Fi, Bluetooth 5.0, Dolby & DTS audio support, and a projection size of up to 200 inches, this portable projector is ideal for movies, gaming, and streaming.', 'xiaomi-projector-wanbo-t6r-max-650-ansi-lumens-android-smart-portable-1781433856', '<p>The <strong>Xiaomi Wanbo T6R Max 650 ANSI Lumens Portable Smart Projector</strong> is designed to transform any room into a cinematic entertainment space. Featuring native <strong>Full HD 1920 × 1080 resolution</strong> and a powerful LED light source with <strong>650 ANSI lumens brightness</strong>, the projector delivers vibrant colors, sharp details, and immersive visuals for movies, gaming, presentations, and online streaming.</p><p>Powered by the advanced <strong>MTK9255 Smart TV chipset</strong>, coupled with <strong>1GB DDR4 RAM</strong> and <strong>8GB eMMC storage</strong>, the Wanbo T6R Max offers smooth navigation, responsive performance, and seamless multitasking. Its built-in <strong>Android 9.0 operating system</strong> provides direct access to popular streaming apps including Netflix, Prime Video, Hulu, YouTube, and thousands of other applications without requiring additional devices.</p><h3><strong>AI Auto Focus &amp; Smart Auto Keystone Correction</strong></h3><p>The projector features advanced <strong>TOF (Time-of-Flight) Auto Focus</strong> technology and <strong>Automatic Keystone Correction</strong>, allowing it to instantly optimize image clarity and alignment. Additional features such as <strong>automatic screen adaptation</strong>, electronic 4-point keystone correction, and digital zoom ensure hassle-free setup in any environment.</p><h3><strong>Premium Visual Performance</strong></h3><p>Equipped with a high-performance <strong>4-point LED light engine</strong>, the Wanbo T6R Max produces bright and vivid images with enhanced HDR support. The advanced image processing technology improves contrast, sharpness, and color accuracy, creating a realistic viewing experience for both dark and bright scenes.</p><p>The projector also incorporates <strong>Glass Lens Technology</strong>, which optimizes image quality frame by frame, delivering deeper blacks, richer colors, and enhanced detail reproduction. Support for <strong>HDR10</strong> and <strong>Hybrid Log-Gamma (HLG)</strong> further improves dynamic range and visual realism.</p><h3><strong>Immersive Audio Experience</strong></h3><p>For powerful sound performance, the projector includes <strong>dual 5W full-range high-fidelity speakers</strong> with <strong>Dolby Audio</strong> and <strong>DTS decoding</strong> support. This creates clear dialogue, rich bass, and immersive surround-like audio without the need for external speakers.</p><h3><strong>Fast Wireless Connectivity</strong></h3><p>With support for <strong>dual-band 2.4GHz and 5GHz Wi-Fi</strong>, the Wanbo T6R Max ensures stable and high-speed wireless streaming. The built-in <strong>Bluetooth 5.0</strong> allows users to connect wireless headphones, speakers, game controllers, and other compatible devices effortlessly.</p><h3><strong>Large-Screen Home Cinema</strong></h3><p>The projector supports a massive screen size ranging from <strong>40 inches to 200 inches</strong>, delivering a true big-screen entertainment experience. Its elegant and compact design complements modern home and office environments while remaining easy to transport and install.</p><p>Whether you\'re enjoying movies, gaming, streaming online content, or delivering presentations, the <strong>Xiaomi Wanbo T6R Max Smart Projector</strong> offers premium performance, intelligent features, and versatile connectivity in a portable package.</p><h2><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul><li>Native Full HD 1080p (1920 × 1080) Resolution</li><li>650 ANSI Lumens Brightness</li><li>Android 9.0 Smart Operating System</li><li>AI Auto Focus Technology</li><li>Automatic Keystone Correction</li><li>HDR10 &amp; HLG Support</li><li>MTK9255 Smart TV Processor</li><li>1GB DDR4 RAM + 8GB eMMC Storage</li><li>Dual 5W Speakers with Dolby &amp; DTS Audio</li><li>Bluetooth 5.0 Connectivity</li><li>Dual-Band 2.4GHz &amp; 5GHz Wi-Fi</li><li>Screen Size Support: 40\" – 200\"</li><li>Automatic Screen Adaptation</li><li>Portable and Lightweight Design</li></ul><h2><strong>Buy Xiaomi Wanbo T6R Max Projector from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original <strong>Xiaomi Wanbo T6R Max 650 ANSI Lumens Full HD Smart Portable Projector</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution (IOS)</strong>. We offer a wide collection of the latest smart projectors for home entertainment, office presentations, and educational purposes at competitive prices.</p><p>Order online or contact <strong>International Office Solution</strong> to get genuine products with reliable after-sales support.</p><p><strong>Warranty:</strong> 01 Year Service Warranty.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>LCD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>Full HD 1080p (1920 × 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>650 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>1.2 – 5 m</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>3001:1 – 4000:1</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Light Source Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>5W × 2</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>AV × 1, Headphone × 1, USB × 2, HDMI × 1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Bluetooth 5.0</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Wi-Fi</td><td>2.4GHz &amp; 5GHz Dual-Band Wi-Fi</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>65W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specifications</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>2.0 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions (W × H × D)</td><td>137 × 195 × 201 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Service Warranty</td><td>01 Year Service Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 31000.00, 31000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/NxOjqazveA23XAhZx2zFeP9ebjq5x3yM4hPHLTrf.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 10:44:16', '2026-06-14 10:44:16', 'Xiaomi Wanbo T6R Max Smart Projector 650 ANSI Lumens Full HD Android', 'Buy Xiaomi Wanbo T6R Max Smart Projector with Full HD 1080p resolution, 650 ANSI lumens brightness, Android 9.0, Dolby Audio, Bluetooth 5.0, and dual-band Wi-Fi for premium home entertainment.', 'Xiaomi Wanbo T6R Max, Wanbo T6R Max projector, 650 ANSI lumens projector, Full HD smart projector, Android projector, Bluetooth projector, WiFi projector, portable projector, Dolby Audio projector, HDR10 projector, home theater projector, Wanbo projector Bangladesh, smart projector 1080p, International Office Solution.', NULL, 52, NULL, NULL),
(652, 'Xiaomi  Projector Wanbo T6 Max 550 Lumens Smart Android Portable LED', 'The Wanbo T6 Max Smart Projector offers a premium home entertainment experience with Full HD 1080p resolution, 550 ANSI lumens brightness, and a large projection size capability. Featuring dual-band Wi-Fi, Bluetooth 5.0, dual 5W speakers, and a long-lasting LED light source, it delivers clear visuals and immersive audio for movies, gaming, and streaming.', 'xiaomi-projector-wanbo-t6-max-550-lumens-smart-android-portable-led-1781434453', '<p>The <strong>Wanbo T6 Max 550 ANSI Lumens Full HD Smart Projector</strong> is a versatile and portable projection solution designed for home entertainment, office presentations, and multimedia viewing. With its native <strong>1920 × 1080 Full HD resolution</strong>, the projector delivers sharp details, vibrant colors, and a cinematic viewing experience on a large screen.</p><p>Featuring <strong>550 ANSI lumens high brightness</strong>, the Wanbo T6 Max produces clear and vivid images, making it suitable for use in dark and moderately lit environments. Its projection ratio of <strong>1.35:1</strong> allows flexible installation, while support for both <strong>16:9 and 4:3 aspect ratios</strong> ensures compatibility with a wide range of content formats.</p><p>The projector supports a projection distance from <strong>4.5 feet to 26.6 feet</strong>, enabling users to create a large-screen display for movies, gaming, sports, and presentations. Whether placed in a bedroom, living room, office, or classroom, it offers excellent image quality and viewing flexibility.</p><p>Equipped with an advanced <strong>LED light source</strong>, the Wanbo T6 Max provides up to <strong>20,000 hours of lamp life</strong>, reducing maintenance requirements and ensuring long-term reliability.</p><p>For audio performance, the projector features <strong>dual 5W built-in stereo speakers</strong> that deliver clear and immersive sound. It also supports <strong>Bluetooth 5.0</strong>, allowing users to connect wireless headphones, speakers, and other compatible devices for enhanced audio experiences.</p><p>Connectivity options include <strong>HDMI, USB, AV, and headphone ports</strong>, making it easy to connect laptops, gaming consoles, streaming devices, smartphones, and USB storage devices. The integrated <strong>2.4GHz and 5GHz dual-band Wi-Fi</strong> provides stable wireless streaming and smooth screen mirroring.</p><p>With its elegant white finish, compact design, and lightweight construction of only <strong>1.945 kg</strong>, the Wanbo T6 Max is easy to move, install, and use in different environments.</p><p>Combining Full HD clarity, smart connectivity, powerful sound, and long-lasting performance, the <strong>Wanbo T6 Max Smart Projector</strong> is an excellent choice for users seeking an affordable and feature-rich home theater solution.</p><h2><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul><li>Native Full HD 1080p (1920 × 1080) Resolution</li><li>550 ANSI Lumens High Brightness</li><li>LED Light Source Technology</li><li>Up to 20,000 Hours Lamp Life</li><li>Projection Distance: 4.5ft – 26.6ft</li><li>Projection Ratio: 1.35:1</li><li>Supports 16:9 and 4:3 Aspect Ratios</li><li>Dual 5W Built-in Stereo Speakers</li><li>Bluetooth 5.0 Connectivity</li><li>Dual-Band 2.4GHz &amp; 5GHz Wi-Fi</li><li>HDMI, USB, AV, and Headphone Ports</li><li>Lightweight and Portable Design</li></ul>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Technology</td><td>LCD</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>Full HD 1080p (1920 × 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>550 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Distance</td><td>4.5ft – 26.6ft</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Ratio</td><td>1.35:1</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Scale</td><td>16:9 &amp; 4:3</td></tr><tr><td>Light Source</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Up to 20,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Speaker</td><td>5W × 2</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>HDMI ×1, USB ×2, AV ×1, Headphone ×1</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Bluetooth 5.0, Dual-Band Wi-Fi</td></tr><tr><td>Power Input</td><td>19V 3A</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>1.945 kg</td></tr><tr><td>Dimensions</td><td>195 × 137 × 201 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 26500.00, 26500.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/8DYSUmMXwmkrlryKoPxAIMv6JlDTgqKOoTtv2dG6.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 10:54:13', '2026-06-14 10:54:13', 'Wanbo T6 Max Full HD Smart Projector 550 ANSI Lumens WiFi Bluetooth', 'Buy Wanbo T6 Max Smart Projector with Full HD 1080p resolution, 550 ANSI lumens brightness, Bluetooth 5.0, dual-band Wi-Fi, dual 5W speakers, and 20,000-hour LED life.', 'Wanbo T6 Max, Wanbo projector, Full HD projector, 550 ANSI lumens projector, smart projector, WiFi projector, Bluetooth projector, LED projector, portable projector, home theater projector, Wanbo T6 Max Bangladesh, wireless projec', NULL, 52, NULL, NULL);
