(653, 'Xiaomi Projector Wanbo T4 450 ANSI Lumens Auto Focus Android Portable', 'The Xiaomi Wanbo T4 Projector is a Full HD 1080P smart projector featuring Android 9.0 OS, Wi-Fi 6, Bluetooth 5.0, auto focus, auto keystone correction, and dual 5W Dolby speakers. With 450 ANSI lumens brightness and a sealed dust-proof optical engine, it is ideal for portable home entertainment and streaming in dark environments.', 'xiaomi-projector-wanbo-t4-450-ansi-lumens-auto-focus-android-portable-1781435421', '<p>The BenQ GP520 Projector is a premium 4K UHD DLP projector that sets a new standard in home entertainment with its remarkable 3840 x 2160 resolution and powerful 2600 ANSI lumens brightness. As a leading BenQ GP520 DLP Projector, it delivers vivid, crisp visuals enhanced by BenQ’s CinematicColor™ technology, offering 98% Rec.709 color accuracy and 30-bit color depth, which translates to over 1.07 billion vibrant colors for lifelike image quality. This BenQ GP520 4K Projector features a long-lasting 4-LED light source with up to 30,000 hours of lamp life, ensuring years of consistent performance with minimal maintenance. With an outstanding 200,000:1 contrast ratio and advanced MEMC technology, fast-moving scenes appear fluid and blur-free, perfect for movies, sports, and gaming. Installation is hassle-free thanks to smart auto keystone correction, autofocus, and digital zoom, allowing flexible placement with projection sizes ranging from 50 to 180 inches. Connectivity options include dual HDMI 2.1 ports, USB-C for audio, video, and power, USB-A ports, and a 3.5mm audio output, making the BenQ GP520 2600 ANSI Lumens Projector highly versatile for any setup. Its built-in 12W x2 stereo speakers with Dolby Audio support deliver immersive sound without external equipment. Furthermore, this projector comes with integrated Google TV, offering seamless access to popular streaming services like Netflix, Prime Video, Disney+, and YouTube, enhanced by Google Assistant voice control. 