ive lifespan of up to 30,000 hours, significantly reducing maintenance requirements while maintaining consistent brightness and color performance throughout its lifetime. Its outstanding 200,000:1 contrast ratio enhances dark scenes and highlights fine details, creating deeper blacks and brighter whites for superior image quality.</p><p>For smooth and fluid motion, the projector incorporates MEMC (Motion Estimation and Motion Compensation) technology, minimizing blur and motion artifacts during fast-paced action scenes, sports broadcasts, and gaming sessions. Intelligent installation features such as Auto Focus, Auto Keystone Correction, Screen Fit, Obstacle Avoidance, and Digital Zoom make setup effortless, allowing users to enjoy the perfect image from virtually any location.</p><p>The BenQ GP520 supports projection sizes ranging from 50 inches to an immersive 180 inches, making it suitable for both compact rooms and large entertainment areas. Connectivity options include dual HDMI 2.1 ports, USB-C with audio, video, and power delivery support, USB-A ports, and a 3.5mm audio output, ensuring seamless compatibility with gaming consoles, laptops, streaming devices, and external audio systems.</p><p>Audio performance is equally impressive with built-in dual 12W stereo speakers enhanced by Dolby Audio technology, delivering powerful and immersive sound without requiring external speakers. The integrated Google TV platform provides direct access to popular streaming services such as Netflix, Prime Video, Disney+, YouTube, and more. With built-in Google Assistant, users can easily search content, control playback, and manage smart home devices using voice commands.</p><p>One of the projector’s standout features is its Intelligent Ambient Adaptation technology, which automatically adjusts brightness, color balance, and image settings according to room lighting conditions and wall colors. This ensures optimal picture quality without the need for manual calibration.</p><p>