>28 kg (Without Lens)</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Specification</td><td>Dimensions (W × H × D)</td><td>500 × 211 × 583 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty Coverage</td><td>3 Years Parts &amp; Service Warranty</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Light Source Warranty</td><td>Included with Manufacturer Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>Key Highlights</h3><ul><li><strong>8000 ANSI Lumens</strong> high-brightness projection for large venues.</li><li><strong>WUXGA (1920 × 1200)</strong> native resolution with wide compatibility.</li><li><strong>3,000,000:1 contrast ratio</strong> for enhanced image depth.</li><li><strong>Laser light source lifespan up to 85,000 hours</strong> in Custom 50% mode.</li><li><strong>Professional connectivity</strong> including HDMI, DisplayPort, DVI-D, 3G-SDI, and HDBaseT.</li><li><strong>28kg installation-grade projector</strong> suitable for auditoriums, conference halls, museums, simulation environments, and large-scale commercial applications.</li><li><strong>3-year manufacturer warranty</strong> for long-term reliability.</li></ul><p>BenQ LU9715 Laser Projector comes with BlueCore DLP high brightness laser technology, where large venue applications. Combining high brightness, excellent image quality, installation flexibility and a maintenance-free laser light source, BenQ BlueCore Laser Projectors enable immersive public displays and innovative visual communication in ways never before possible. In this projector, BlueCore laser significantly achieve laser-precise RGBY color by eliminating the white segment of a conventional color wheel. Through an ideal mixture of the red, green, blue and yellow color segments, BenQ laser projectors produce brilliant color and a wider color gamut than conventional lamp-based projectors. And also, it can directly control light output for faster response and strikingly clear images at a super-high contrast ratio of 3,000,000:1. Additionally there are automatic brightness adjustments to retain clarity and subtle details in dark scenes and balance in bright scenes. The projector featured with an impressive WUXGA (1920 x 1200) native resolution that far exceeds Full HD 1080p, BenQâ€™s LU9715 BlueCore laser projector offers greater detail and stunning clarity image when high resolution images are projected. It deliver 20,000 hours of superior image quality and performance. The laser light source resists color decay over time, making BenQ laser projectors ideal for multiple blending projections without concern for adjacent projectors generating different levels of brightness after a period of operation. This new exclusive BenQ laser projectors support continuous 24/7 operation and are suitable for applications in museums or public exhibitions. This BenQ projector featured with absolute reliability of 1chip DLP design with the highly durable DLP chip is rated to last over 100,000 hours without degradation, ensuring true-to-life colors and pristinely legible text for countless uses. It is also designed with sealed laser modules and enclosed light engines to protect the DMD chip, color wheel sensor, laser bank and other optical components. After constant operation in ambient temperatures up to 40Â°C (104Â°F). The innovative liquid cooling system operates by heat extraction, producing a smooth, comfortable sound without the harsh noises of fan-based projectors. Here, BlueCore laser technology provides reliable projection from any angle. Dynamic installation options such as 360Â° rotation and portrait applications, allows projection onto ceiling, walls, floors or angled signage. This projector is compatible with eight various lenses. These all-glass optics, made in Japan, eliminate chromatic aberration and color flare for utmost image quality. Maximize installation options and projection layout with a quick one-button release. Changing lenses is now simple and secure. In this projector, Groundbreaking HDBaseT connectivity combines video, audio and device control signals from multiple sources including: PCs, laptops, document cameras, Blu-ray and DVDs onto a single CAT5 cable. This ensures seamless transmissions up to 100 meters. This latest BenQ LU9715 8000 ANSI Lumens WUXGA Large-Venue BlueCore Laser Projector has 3 years Parts &amp; Service warranty and Lamp</p><p>নিচে <strong>BenQ LU9715 8000 ANSI Lumens WUXGA Large Venue BlueCore Laser Projector</strong>-এর জন্য <strong>International Office Solution (IOS)</strong> ব্র্যান্ডিংসহ SEO-অপ্টিমাইজড <strong>Long Description, Short Description, Meta Title, Meta Description এবং Meta Keywords</strong> দেওয়া হলো।</p><h3>Long Description</h3><p>BenQ LU9715 8000 ANSI Lumens WUXGA Large Venue BlueCore Laser Projector</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>BenQ LU9715 8000 ANSI Lumens WUXGA Large Venue BlueCore Laser Projector</h2><p>The BenQ LU9715 is a professional-grade large venue laser projector engineered to deliver exceptional brightness, outstanding image quality, and unmatched installation flexibility for demanding commercial and professional applications. Powered by BenQ’s advanced BlueCore Laser Technology, this high-performance projector provides 8000 ANSI lumens of brightness and WUXGA (1920 × 1200) native resolution, making it an ideal solution for auditoriums, conference halls, museums, educational institutions, houses of worship, simulation environments, and large-scale public displays.</p><p>At the heart of the LU9715 is BenQ\'s revolutionary BlueCore Laser Light Source, which utilizes dual-color laser systems to generate highly accurate RGBY color reproduction. By eliminating the white segment found in conventional color wheels, the projector delivers richer colors, higher brightness efficiency, and a significantly wider color gamut than traditional lamp-based projectors. This advanced laser technology ensures stunning image performance with vibrant colors, enhanced visual depth, and exceptional clarity.</p><p>The projector features an ultra-high contrast ratio of 3,000,000:1, allowing it to reproduce deep blacks and bright highlights with incredible precision. Automatic brightness adjustment technology intelligently optimizes image output, preserving subtle details in darker scenes while maintaining balance and visibility in brighter environments. Whether displaying presentations, videos, digital signage, or immersive visual experiences, the LU9715 consistently delivers sharp and realistic visuals.</p><p>With a native WUXGA resolution of 1920 × 1200, the BenQ LU9715 offers greater detail and image sharpness than standard Full HD projectors. The additional screen real estate provided by the 16:10 aspect ratio makes it especially suitable for business presentations, engineering applications, and professional content creation.</p><p>Designed for long-term reliability, the BlueCore laser light source offers up to 20,000 hours of maintenance-free operation while maintaining consistent brightness and color accuracy throughout its lifespan. Unlike traditional lamp projectors that experience gradual brightness degradation, the laser light source resists color decay over time, making it ideal for multi-projector blending and edge-blending installations where image consistency is critical.</p><p>The LU9715 supports continuous 24/7 operation, making it perfectly suited for museums, public exhibitions, command centers, digital signage networks, and mission-critical installations. BenQ’s renowned single-chip DLP architecture ensures superior reliability, with the DLP chip rated for over 100,000 hours of operation without image degradation. This guarantees long-lasting color accuracy, crisp text rendering, and dependable performance.</p><p>To ensure maximum durability, the projector incorporates sealed laser modules and an enclosed optical engine that protect sensitive internal components, including the DMD chip, color wheel sensor, and laser bank, from dust contamination and environmental factors. An advanced liquid cooling system efficiently dissipat