d>127 × 150 × 185 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Service Warranty</td><td>01 Year Service Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 21600.00, 21600.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/YhK3R7PYQDIW70kZznmzZUWULfhWval6o6I8gicU.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 11:10:21', '2026-06-14 11:10:21', 'Xiaomi Wanbo T4 Full HD Smart Projector Price in Bangladesh | Android 9.0 WiFi 6 Projector', 'Buy Xiaomi Wanbo T4 Projector in Bangladesh. Features Full HD 1080P resolution, Android 9.0 OS, WiFi 6, Bluetooth 5.0, auto focus, auto keystone, and Dolby audio. Best portable home projector with 450 ANSI lumens.', 'Xiaomi Wanbo T4, Wanbo T4 Projector, Xiaomi Projector Bangladesh, 1080P Smart Projector, Android Projector, WiFi 6 Projector, Bluetooth Projector, Portable Home Projector, Full HD Projector Price Bangladesh, Wanbo T4 Price, Home Theater Projector, Smart Projector Android, Mini Projector Bangladesh, Dolby Projector, Auto Keystone Projector', NULL, 52, NULL, NULL);
