(654, 'Xiaom Projectori Wanbo T2R Max 250 Lumens Portable LCD', 'This Full HD 1080p LCD projector offers a compact and lightweight design with 250 ANSI lumens brightness, making it suitable for dark room home entertainment, small presentations, and personal media use. It supports a projection size of up to 120 inches, includes dual 3W stereo speakers, and offers Bluetooth 5.0 connectivity for wireless audio pairing.\r\n\r\nWith a 20,000-hour lamp life, HDMI, USB, and AV inputs, this projector is designed for simple plug-and-play usage. Its portable design (only 1.2 kg) makes it easy to carry and set up anywhere.', 'xiaom-projectori-wanbo-t2r-max-250-lumens-portable-lcd-1781436908', '<p>The projector delivers <strong>native 1920 × 1080 resolution</strong>, ensuring sharp visuals, clear text, and detailed images suitable for movies, streaming, and presentations.</p><h3>Android TV Smart System</h3><p>Built-in <strong>Android 9.0 TV OS</strong> allows direct access to popular streaming platforms such as:</p><ul><li>Netflix</li><li>Amazon Prime Video</li><li>Hotstar</li><li>Spotify</li><li>YouTube and more</li></ul><p>No external streaming device is required.</p><h3>Wireless &amp; Wired Connectivity</h3><p>Supports multiple connectivity options:</p><ul><li>Wi-Fi 2.4GHz for streaming and mirroring</li><li>Wireless &amp; wired screen casting</li><li>Bluetooth 5.0 for audio devices</li><li>HDMI and other standard inputs</li></ul><h3>4D Keystone Correction</h3><p>Advanced <strong>4D keystone correction</strong> allows easy image alignment from multiple angles, ensuring a properly shaped projection even in non-ideal placement conditions.</p><h3>Sealed Dust-Proof Optical Engine</h3><p>The fully sealed optical system prevents dust accumulation, improving long-term image quality and reducing maintenance needs.</p><h3>Built-in Stereo Speakers</h3><p>Equipped with <strong>dual 3W speakers</strong>, the projector delivers clear and balanced audio. It also supports external Bluetooth speakers for enhanced sound.</p><h3>Portable &amp; Lightweight Design</h3><p>Its compact design makes it highly portable, ideal for:</p><ul><li>Home movie nights</li><li>Small room entertainment</li><li>Travel use</li><li>Light presentations</li></ul><h2>Performance Summary</h2><ul><li><strong>Resolution:</strong> Full HD 1080P</li><li><strong>Brightness:</strong> ~250–350 ANSI lumens</li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Android TV 9.0</li><li><strong>Connectivity:</strong> Wi-Fi, Bluetooth 5.0, HDMI</li><li><strong>Audio:</strong> Dual 3W stereo speakers</li><li><strong>Best Usage:</strong> Dark room entertainment</li><li><strong>Max Screen Size:</strong> Up to ~100 inches</li></ul><h2>Advantages</h2><ul><li>Easy plug-and-play setup</li><li>Smart Android TV interface</li><li>Compact and travel-friendly design</li><li>Wireless screen mirroring support</li><li>Dust-proof sealed optical engine</li></ul><h2>Limitations</h2><ul><li>Low brightness (not suitable for bright rooms)</li><li>Best performance in dark environments only</li><li>Not ideal for business/classroom daylight use</li></ul><h2>Warranty</h2><ul><li><strong>Warranty:</strong> 1 Year Service Warranty</li></ul>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>LCD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>Full HD 1080p (1920 × 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>250 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>4 ft – 9.8 ft</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>2000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>40\" – 120\"</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Light Source</strong></td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>20,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>3W × 2 Stereo Speakers</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI</td><td>1 x HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB</td><td>1 x USB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>AV Input</td><td>1 x AV</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Port</td><td>1 x Audio</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Input</td><td>AC 100–240V, 50/60Hz, 1.5A</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Wireless</strong></td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>V5.0</td></tr><tr><td><strong>External Features</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>1236 gm</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>220 × 185 × 80 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Service Warranty</td><td>1 Year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 22500.00, 22500.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/qTKd70X0EQYNAlTicSSshZwGCY69woCFMkQYFBi6.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 11:35:08', '2026-06-14 11:35:08', 'Xiaomi Wanbo T2R Max Full HD Smart Portable Projector Price in Bangladesh | Android TV Projector', 'Buy Xiaomi Wanbo T2R Max Portable Projector in Bangladesh. Features Full HD 1080P resolution, Android TV OS, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth 5.0, 4D keystone correction, and portable lightweight design with 250–350 ANSI lumens brightness.', 'Xiaomi Wanbo T2R Max, Wanbo T2R Max Projector, Xiaomi portable projector Bangladesh, 1080P projector Android TV, mini projector price Bangladesh, Bluetooth projector, WiFi projector, smart projector Bangladesh, home cinema projector, portable projector 100 inch, Android projector 9.0, low brightness projector, lightweight projector Bangladesh', NULL, 52, NULL, NULL),
(655, 'Xiaomi Projector Wanbo X2 Max 450 ANSI Lumens Smart Portable', 'This Full HD 1080p LCD smart projector delivers a bright and clear viewing experience with 450 ANSI lumens brightness and support for screen sizes from 40 to 120 inches. It runs on Android 9.0 OS, allowing access to apps and online content without external devices.\r\n\r\nEquipped with dual 5W stereo speakers, WiFi 6, and Bluetooth 5.0, it ensures smooth wireless connectivity and decent audio performance for home entertainment.\r\n\r\nWith four-point keystone correction, dual HDMI ports, and a lightweight 1.9 kg design, it is suitable for portable home cinema use in dark environments.\r\n\r\nKey Highlights\r\nFull HD 1080p resolution\r\nAndroid 9.0 smart system\r\n450 ANSI lumens brightness\r\nWiFi 6 + Bluetooth 5.0\r\nDual 5W stereo speakers\r\n4-point keystone correction\r\n50,000-hour LED lamp life\r\nLightweight portable design', 'xiaomi-projector-wanbo-x2-max-450-ansi-lumens-smart-portable-1781437725', '<p>The <strong>Xiaomi Wanbo X2 Max Smart Portable Projector</strong> is a compact yet powerful entertainment solution designed for home cinema, gaming, and business presentations. Featuring <strong>Full HD 1080p resolution (1920 × 1080)</strong> and <strong>450 ANSI lumens brightness</strong>, it delivers clear, vibrant visuals suitable for dark or moderately lit environments. With a <strong>2000:1 contrast ratio</strong> and support for both <strong>4:3 and 16:9 aspect ratios</strong>, the projector ensures flexible display options for different content types.</p><p>Equipped with an <strong>LED light source with up to 50,000 hours lifespan</strong>, the Wanbo X2 Max is built for long-term reliability. It supports screen sizes from <strong>40 to 120 inches</strong> and projection distances between <strong>3.93 to 11.81 feet</strong>, making it suitable for bedrooms, living rooms, offices, and travel use.</p><p>For easy setup, the projector includes <strong>auto-focus technology</strong> and <strong>four-point keystone correction</strong>, allowing users to quickly achieve a properly aligned and distortion-free image. Powered by <strong>Android 9.0 OS</strong>, it comes with <strong>1GB RAM and 8GB storage</strong>, enabling access to popular apps like Netflix and YouTube along with smooth screen mirroring from Android and iOS devices.</p><p>The Wanbo X2 Max offers versatile connectivity options, including <strong>dual HDMI ports, USB, AV input, audio jack, Wi-Fi 6, and Bluetooth 5.0</strong>, ensuring compatibility with a wide range of devices such as laptops, gaming consoles, and smartphones. Its <strong>dual 5W built-in speakers</strong> enhance audio output, reducing the need for external speakers in most setups.</p><p>With a lightweight <strong>1.9 kg design</strong>, quiet operation (&lt;35 dB), and intelligent image processing for improved clarity and reduced latency, the Wanbo X2 Max is designed for convenience and portability. It also features a dust-resistant structure for improved durability and stable long-term performance.</p><h4>Key Features of Xiaomi Wanbo X2 Max</h4><ul><li>Full HD 1080p (1920 × 1080) resolution</li><li>450 ANSI lumens brightness</li><li>2000:1 contrast ratio</li><li>LED light source with up to 50,000 hours lifespan</li><li>Auto-focus and 4-point keystone correction</li><li>Android 9.0 with 1GB RAM + 8GB storage</li><li>Wi-Fi 6 and Bluetooth 5.0 connectivity</li><li>Dual HDMI, USB, AV, and audio ports</li><li>Dual 5W built-in speakers</li><li>Screen size: 40\" to 120\"</li><li>Lightweight and portable (1.9 kg)</li><li>Low noise operation (&lt;35 dB)</li><li>Dust-proof design with optimized image processing</li></ul><h4>Warranty</h4><p>The <strong>Xiaomi Wanbo X2 Max 450 ANSI Lumens Smart Portable Projector</strong> comes with <strong>No Warranty</strong>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>LCD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>Full HD (1920 × 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>450 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>4:3 / 16:9</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>2000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>3.93 ft – 11.81 ft</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>40\" – 120\"</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Light Source</strong></td><td>Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>50,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Smart System</strong></td><td>OS</td><td>Android 9.0</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Memory</td><td>1GB RAM / 8GB Storage</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>5W × 2 Stereo Speakers</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI</td><td>2 × HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB</td><td>1 × USB 2.0</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Port</td><td>1 × Audio Out</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Port</td><td>1 × DC Input</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Wireless</td><td>Dual-Band WiFi 6</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>5.0</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Control</strong></td><td>Remote Control</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>External Features</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>Dark Blue</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>1.90 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>225 × 177.6 × 94 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Service</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 20000.00, 20000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/y525cJZ8R3e6axA3VXYbmHjjNyL8dfbog1fOgrBp.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 11:48:45', '2026-06-14 11:48:45', 'Full HD 1080p Android Smart Projector 450 ANSI Lumens WiFi 6 Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy Full HD 1080p LCD Smart Projector in Bangladesh. Features Android 9.0 OS, 450 ANSI lumens brightness, WiFi 6, Bluetooth 5.0, dual speakers, and portable lightweight design.', 'LCD projector Bangladesh, 1080p projector WiFi 6, Android smart projector 450 ANSI, mini projector Bangladesh, Bluetooth projector, home projector price BD, portable projector 1080p, smart projector Android 9, dual HDMI projector, lightweight projector Bangladesh', NULL, 52, NULL, NULL),
(656, 'Xiaomi Projector Wanbo T2 Max 150 Lumens Smart Android Portable LED', 'The Xiaomi Wanbo T2 Max is a compact and portable projector designed for versatile use, delivering an immersive big-screen viewing experience anywhere. It features dual 3W speakers for clear stereo sound and supports HDR10 decoding for enhanced image detail and vibrant visuals. Its efficient triple-fan cooling system helps maintain performance and extend LED lifespan, while diffuse reflection imaging reduces eye strain for comfortable long viewing. The projector comes with a 1-year service warranty.', 'xiaomi-projector-wanbo-t2-max-150-lumens-smart-android-portable-led-1781439643', '<p>The <strong>Xiaomi Wanbo T2 Max</strong> features a compact and elegant portable design, making it suitable for multi-scene use such as home entertainment, office presentations, and travel projection. It allows users to enjoy a large-screen audio-visual experience anytime, anywhere.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>dual 3W left and right channel speakers (3W × 2)</strong>, it delivers a natural and immersive 360° surround sound experience, enhancing movie and music enjoyment without the need for external speakers.</p><p>The projector supports <strong>HDR10 decoding technology</strong>, offering improved dynamic range, richer color depth, and enhanced image details for a more realistic and vivid viewing experience.</p><p>For efficient thermal management, the device uses a <strong>triple-fan cooling system (internal and external airflow design)</strong> that effectively dissipates heat, ensuring stable performance and extending the lifespan of the LED light source.</p><p>Unlike direct light displays, its <strong>diffuse reflection projection technology</strong> produces a softer image that reduces eye strain, making it comfortable for long viewing sessions.</p><p>The <strong>Xiaomi Wanbo T2 Max</strong> comes with a <strong>1-year service warranty</strong>, ensuring basic after-sales support for users.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>Technology</td><td>LCD</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>Native</td><td>1080p (1920 x 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Brightness</td><td>Light Output</td><td>150 Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Distance</td><td>Min</td><td>1.5 Meter</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Distance</td><td>Max</td><td>3 Meter</td></tr><tr><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>Image Contrast</td><td>2000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Image Size</td><td>Min Screen Size</td><td>40 Inch</td></tr><tr><td>Image Size</td><td>Max Screen Size</td><td>120 Inch</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 21000.00, 21000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/O7ZphyCSpsrqeYSltZAwYsIsLKDjjhgwflogYYKn.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 12:20:43', '2026-06-14 12:20:43', 'Xiaomi Wanbo T2 Max Portable Projector Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy Xiaomi Wanbo T2 Max Portable Projector in Bangladesh. Features HDR10 support, dual 3W speakers, diffuse reflection imaging, efficient cooling system, and compact design for home and outdoor use.', 'Xiaomi Wanbo T2 Max, Wanbo T2 Max Projector, Xiaomi Portable Projector, LED Projector Bangladesh, HDR10 Projector, Mini Projector, Home Theater Projector, Portable Projector Price in Bangladesh, Wanbo Projector, Xiaomi Projector Bangladesh.', NULL, 52, NULL, NULL),
(657, 'Arctic Liquid Freezer III 420MM ARGB Liquid CPU Cooler', 'The 420mm High-Performance Liquid Cooler is a professional-grade thermal solution designed to maximize heat dissipation for modern high-TDP processors. With its expansive 458mm radiator and 38mm thickness, it offers superior coolant capacity compared to standard AIOs. Engineered for efficiency, it features a micro-skived copper cold plate, high-airflow PWM fans, and premium pre-applied MX-6 thermal paste. Providing native support for Intel LGA 1700 and AMD AM5/AM4, this cooler is a reliable, future-proof investment backed by an industry-leading 6-year warranty.', 'arctic-liquid-freezer-iii-420mm-argb-liquid-cpu-cooler-1781439941', '<p>For users seeking the ultimate thermal ceiling, the <strong>420mm High-Performance Liquid Cooler</strong> provides an unmatched cooling environment. The radiator’s massive footprint allows for significant surface area, which, paired with the 38mm-thick design, enables the system to handle the heat output of today’s most demanding multi-core CPUs with ease. The cooling loop is powered by a high-efficiency copper cold plate, utilizing intricate micro-skived fins to draw thermal energy away from the CPU die into the closed-loop system with extreme precision.</p><p>Performance is managed by high-static-pressure fans that scale from 200 to 1900 RPM, delivering up to 69.90 CFM of airflow to maintain optimal temperatures during intense gaming, rendering, or productivity workloads. The system is designed with professional-grade plumbing; the 450mm reinforced tubes provide exceptional flexibility for easy installation in full-tower chassis while maintaining high flow rates through their optimized 6mm inner diameter.</p><p>Installation is refined to eliminate guesswork, as the cooler arrives pre-loaded with Arctic’s flagship MX-6 thermal compound, ensuring a perfect interface between the CPU and the cold plate right out of the box. By streamlining compatibility for the latest Intel and AMD sockets, this AIO liquid cooler offers a seamless transition to high-end cooling. With a robust 6-year warranty, it serves as a cornerstone for any high-reliability workstation or enthusiast rig, ensuring your components remain cool and performant for years to come.<strong>=</strong></p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Radiator Engineering</strong></td><td>Thermal Dynamics</td><td>458 x 138 x 38 mm High-capacity aluminum radiator with increased coolant volume</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Heat Transfer</td><td>Precision-machined copper base plate with high-density micro-skived fin architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>PWM Dynamics</td><td>200–1900 RPM range; 69.90 CFM (117.06 m³/h) at 2.0 mmH2O static pressure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Universal mounting hardware for Intel LGA 1700 and AMD AM5/AM4 platforms</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Plumbing Specs</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>450mm long reinforced tubes; 12.4mm outer / 6.0mm inner diameter for low flow resistance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Interface</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>Factory pre-applied Arctic MX-6 (0.8g) premium thermal compound for perfect surface contact</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>6-year manufacturer warranty covering pump, radiator, and fan mechanical failures</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Installation</strong></td><td>Logistics</td><td>Designed for full-tower chassis with high flexibility tube mounting and universal backplates</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 12300.00, 12300.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/Z8UtcX2nvqQ4acUhMz3HikAApMtoit3kIHOQM5Fp.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 12:25:41', '2026-06-14 12:25:41', '420mm High-Performance Liquid Cooler | Thermal Excellence', 'Achieve peak performance with our 420mm Liquid Cooler. Features a 38mm-thick radiator, 1900 RPM fans, and a 6-year warranty. Best for high-TDP CPUs.', '420mm liquid cooler, AIO CPU cooler, Intel LGA 1700 liquid cooling, AMD AM5 liquid cooler, high performance liquid cooling, 420mm radiator, thermal management system, 6 year warranty liquid cooler', NULL, 28, NULL, NULL),
(658, 'Arctic Liquid Freezer III 420MM ARGB Liquid CPU Cooler White', 'The 420mm High-Performance Liquid Cooler is a professional-grade thermal solution designed to maximize heat dissipation for modern high-TDP processors. With its expansive 458mm radiator and 38mm thickness, it offers superior coolant capacity compared to standard AIOs. Engineered for efficiency, it features a micro-skived copper cold plate, high-airflow PWM fans, and premium pre-applied MX-6 thermal paste. Providing native support for Intel LGA 1700 and AMD AM5/AM4, this cooler is a reliable, future-proof investment backed by an industry-leading 6-year warranty.', 'arctic-liquid-freezer-iii-420mm-argb-liquid-cpu-cooler-white-1781440104', '<p>For users seeking the ultimate thermal ceiling, the <strong>420mm High-Performance Liquid Cooler</strong> provides an unmatched cooling environment. The radiator’s massive footprint allows for significant surface area, which, paired with the 38mm-thick design, enables the system to handle the heat output of today’s most demanding multi-core CPUs with ease. The cooling loop is powered by a high-efficiency copper cold plate, utilizing intricate micro-skived fins to draw thermal energy away from the CPU die into the closed-loop system with extreme precision.</p><p>Performance is managed by high-static-pressure fans that scale from 200 to 1900 RPM, delivering up to 69.90 CFM of airflow to maintain optimal temperatures during intense gaming, rendering, or productivity workloads. The system is designed with professional-grade plumbing; the 450mm reinforced tubes provide exceptional flexibility for easy installation in full-tower chassis while maintaining high flow rates through their optimized 6mm inner diameter.</p><p>Installation is refined to eliminate guesswork, as the cooler arrives pre-loaded with Arctic’s flagship MX-6 thermal compound, ensuring a perfect interface between the CPU and the cold plate right out of the box. By streamlining compatibility for the latest Intel and AMD sockets, this AIO liquid cooler offers a seamless transition to high-end cooling. With a robust 6-year warranty, it serves as a cornerstone for any high-reliability workstation or enthusiast rig, ensuring your components remain cool and performant for years to come.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Radiator Engineering</strong></td><td>Thermal Dynamics</td><td>458 x 138 x 38 mm High-capacity aluminum radiator with increased coolant volume</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Heat Transfer</td><td>Precision-machined copper base plate with high-density micro-skived fin architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>PWM Dynamics</td><td>200–1900 RPM range; 69.90 CFM (117.06 m³/h) at 2.0 mmH2O static pressure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Universal mounting hardware for Intel LGA 1700 and AMD AM5/AM4 platforms</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Plumbing Specs</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>450mm long reinforced tubes; 12.4mm outer / 6.0mm inner diameter for low flow resistance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Interface</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>Factory pre-applied Arctic MX-6 (0.8g) premium thermal compound for perfect surface contact</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>6-year manufacturer warranty covering pump, radiator, and fan mechanical failures</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Installation</strong></td><td>Logistics</td><td>Designed for full-tower chassis with high flexibility tube mounting and universal backplates</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 12300.00, 12300.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/h4L6ZmrpAOJ464NNIOrEpq40q9y9B2mOZibzeVAA.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 12:28:24', '2026-06-14 12:28:24', '420mm High-Performance Liquid Cooler | Thermal Excellence', 'Achieve peak performance with our 420mm Liquid Cooler. Features a 38mm-thick radiator, 1900 RPM fans, and a 6-year warranty. Best for high-TDP CPUs.', '420mm liquid cooler, AIO CPU cooler, Intel LGA 1700 liquid cooling, AMD AM5 liquid cooler, high performance liquid cooling, 420mm radiator, thermal management system, 6 year warranty liquid cooler', NULL, 28, NULL, NULL),
(659, 'Arctic Liquid Freezer III Pro 360 ARGB CPU Cooler', 'The 360mm High-Performance A-RGB Liquid Cooler is a heavy-duty thermal solution engineered for extreme cooling demands. Featuring a 38mm-thick radiator and a trio of P12 Pro A-RGB fans that reach 3000 RPM, it delivers a massive 6.9 mmH2O of static pressure. With an integrated VRM fan to cool motherboard power components, a precision-engineered micro-skived copper cold plate, and robust 450mm tubing, this cooler ensures peak stability for overclocked Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4) processors, all backed by a 6-year warranty.', 'arctic-liquid-freezer-iii-pro-360-argb-cpu-cooler-1781440214', '<p>Designed for power users who demand the ultimate in thermal headroom, the <strong>360mm A-RGB Liquid Cooler</strong> redefines the performance limits of all-in-one thermal solutions. At the heart of the system is a radiator with a 38mm-thick profile, providing an expansive surface area and increased coolant capacity to handle the high heat density of modern multi-core processors. A high-efficiency pump, operating between 800 and 2800 RPM, maintains constant flow, while the copper cold plate—featuring micro-skived fins—maximizes energy transfer from the CPU to the liquid loop.</p><p>One of the standout features of this cooler is its holistic approach to system stability. Beyond cooling the CPU, it includes a dedicated, high-speed VRM fan (400–2500 RPM) specifically designed to cool the motherboard\'s power delivery components, effectively reducing thermal throttling and enhancing system longevity. The three P12 Pro-grade A-RGB fans, utilizing fluid dynamic bearings, provide reliable, smooth motion across a vast 600–3000 RPM range, delivering 77 CFM of airflow to guarantee optimal performance under any workload, accented by 12 vibrant Gen2 A-RGB LEDs per fan.</p><p>Built for professional environments and enthusiast rigs alike, the cooler features reinforced 450mm tubing for flexible, clean cable routing in large chassis. With native support for the latest Intel and AMD platforms and a structural weight of 2005g, this unit is a substantial, long-term thermal investment. Backed by a 6-year manufacturer warranty and rated for reliable operation in ambient temperatures between 0–40 °C, it remains the gold standard for users who refuse to compromise on thermal engineering or aesthetics.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Radiator Engineering</strong></td><td>Thermal Dynamics</td><td>398 x 120 x 38 mm High-capacity aluminum radiator with increased coolant volume</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Heat Transfer</td><td>Precision-machined copper base plate with high-density micro-skived fin architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pump Specifications</strong></td><td>Fluid Dynamics</td><td>High-efficiency 800–2800 RPM pump; 0.35 A power draw at 12 V DC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>VRM Cooling System</strong></td><td>Power Phase Mgmt</td><td>Integrated 400–2500 RPM fan for dedicated motherboard VRM temperature reduction</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>PWM Dynamics</td><td>Triple P12 Pro A-RGB fans; 600–3000 RPM; 77 CFM at 6.9 mmH2O static pressure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Illumination</strong></td><td>Visuals</td><td>12x Gen2 A-RGB LEDs per fan; 3-Pin 5 V A-RGB plug with daisy-chain socket</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Bearing &amp; Reliability</strong></td><td>Longevity</td><td>Fluid Dynamic Bearings (FDB) rated for continuous high-speed rotation</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Plumbing Specs</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>450mm reinforced tubing; 12.4mm outer / 6.0mm inner diameter for optimized flow</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Universal mounting for Intel LGA 1851/1700 and AMD AM5/AM4 platforms</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>6-year manufacturer warranty covering comprehensive system components</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 15500.00, 15500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/JqXT5GIkizILmNY9KK3RBEcWAdt0whswlPrZT9n5.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 12:30:14', '2026-06-14 12:30:14', '360mm Performance A-RGB Liquid Cooler | VRM Cooling Support', 'nleash extreme performance with this 360mm A-RGB AIO. Features 3000 RPM fans, integrated VRM cooling, Gen2 LEDs, and 6-year warranty.', '360mm AIO cooler, liquid CPU cooler, Intel LGA 1851 AIO, AMD AM5 liquid cooling, VRM fan AIO, high static pressure fan, 3000 RPM AIO, Gen2 A-RGB, 360mm liquid cooler 6 year warranty', NULL, 28, NULL, NULL),
(660, 'Deepcool CK-11509 CPU Cooler', 'The Compact Performance CPU Cooler is a space-efficient thermal solution engineered for standard desktops and small-form-factor builds. Measuring just 56mm in height, this low-profile cooler features a 92mm high-airflow fan that reaches 2200 RPM, delivering 38.62 CFM of cooling power. Designed for reliability and quiet performance, it maintains a controlled 26.8 dB(A) noise profile, making it an ideal choice for compact home or office systems where thermal efficiency and space conservation are top priorities.', 'deepcool-ck-11509-cpu-cooler-1781440570', '<p>For users requiring a dependable cooling solution that fits into tight spaces, the <strong>Compact Performance CPU Cooler</strong> offers the perfect balance of form and function. Its low-profile architecture, standing only 56mm tall, ensures excellent compatibility with a wide range of slim and mini-ITX chassis without compromising on thermal performance. The integrated 92mm fan is optimized to move 38.62 CFM of air, providing consistent heat dissipation for standard-TDP processors.</p><p>Engineered for comfort and longevity, the cooler operates at a steady 2200 RPM while keeping acoustics to a moderate 26.8 dB(A), ensuring your system remains quiet during routine workflows. Weighing only 147g, the lightweight assembly places minimal stress on the motherboard, making it a safe and easy-to-install option for a variety of builds. With a focus on structural integrity and air-flow optimization, this cooler provides the thermal headroom necessary for stable, reliable day-to-day computing in a compact, unobtrusive package.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Thermal Dynamics</td><td>Compact fin-stack architecture optimized for low-profile airflow</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>PWM Dynamics</td><td>92mm diameter; 2200 RPM (±10%) fan speed</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Airflow Capacity</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>38.62 CFM (Cubic Feet per Minute) throughput</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Profile</strong></td><td>Noise Management</td><td>26.8 dB(A) maximum operating noise level</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Form Factor</td><td>94.5 x 94.5 x 56 mm overall size for small-form-factor compatibility</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Component Weight</strong></td><td>Structural Load</td><td>147g lightweight design for easy installation and reduced motherboard stress</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Specifications</strong></td><td>Mechanical</td><td>Ф92 x 25 mm fan dimensions with balanced blade profile</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Build Quality</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>Precision-engineered fan and heatsink assembly for consistent long-term use</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'CPU Cooler', 400.00, 400.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/DVg8HBKvydYS8JdlbsnvM9CgfuoK8vPPUvt4iY13.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 12:36:10', '2026-06-14 12:36:10', 'FeatureCategorySpecification DetailsCooling EngineThermal DynamicsCompact fin-stack architecture optimized for low-profile airflowFan PerformancePWM Dynamics92mm diameter; 2200 RPM (±10%) fan speedAirflow CapacityEfficiency38.62 CFM (Cubic Feet per Minute) throughputAcoustic ProfileNoise Management26.8 dB(A) maximum operating noise levelPhysical DimensionsForm Factor94.5 x 94.5 x 56 mm overall size for small-form-factor compatibilityComponent WeightStructural Load147g lightweight design for easy installation and reduced motherboard stressFan SpecificationsMechanicalФ92 x 25 mm fan dimensions with balanced blade profileBuild QualityReliabilityPrecision-engineered fan and heatsink assembly for consistent long-term use', 'Efficient compact CPU cooler with 92mm fan. Features 2200 RPM speed, 38.62 CFM airflow, and a low-profile 56mm height. Perfect for SFF builds.', 'low profile CPU cooler, 92mm CPU fan, SFF CPU cooler, compact air cooler, quiet CPU cooling, 2200 RPM fan, small form factor cooler, 38 CFM CPU cooler', NULL, 31, NULL, NULL),
(661, 'DeepCool ALTA 9 Air CPU Cooler', 'The DeepCool ALTA 9 is a compact, cost-effective air cooler specifically engineered for Intel LGA 1700 and 1851 platforms. Featuring a 92mm hydro-bearing fan, it delivers a steady 2200 RPM for efficient thermal management while maintaining a quiet 26.3 dB(A) acoustic profile. With its low-profile 58.5mm height and convenient tool-free push-pin mounting system, it is an ideal, straightforward thermal upgrade for home offices, media centers, and space-constrained desktop builds.', 'deepcool-alta-9-air-cpu-cooler-1781440729', '<p>The DeepCool ALTA 9 Air CPU Cooler is a reliable, no-nonsense thermal solution designed for users who prioritize efficiency, simplicity, and a clean, minimalist aesthetic. Engineered with a focus on Intel’s latest mainstream desktop platforms (LGA 1700/1851), this cooler provides a seamless, ready-to-use alternative to stock cooling solutions. Its compact footprint—measuring 113 x 113 x 58.5mm—ensures excellent compatibility with smaller chassis and tighter motherboard layouts, making it a versatile choice for a variety of builds.</p><p>At the core of the ALTA 9 is a 92mm fan utilizing a durable hydro-bearing mechanism, ensuring long-lasting performance and consistent airflow. It delivers up to 42.35 CFM of air movement at a steady 2200 RPM, providing the necessary heat dissipation for moderate daily workloads, web browsing, and media consumption. Despite its performance, the cooler maintains a remarkably low noise level of 26.3 dB(A), ensuring your computing environment remains quiet and distraction-free.</p><p>Installation is designed to be as user-friendly as possible. The integrated push-pin mounting system allows for quick, tool-free installation, eliminating the need for complex brackets or secondary hardware. With an energy-efficient power profile consuming only 5W, it is an ideal choice for power-conscious builds. Featuring a sleek, all-black aesthetic without the distraction of RGB lighting, the ALTA 9 is the perfect choice for professional or minimalist setups where performance, reliability, and functionality are the only requirements.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Thermal Dynamics</td><td>Optimized 92mm heatsink fin stack designed for efficient heat transfer</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>Operational</td><td>2200 RPM (±10%) rotational speed with Hydro Bearing longevity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Airflow Capacity</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>42.35 CFM maximum airflow for consistent thermal dissipation</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Profile</strong></td><td>Noise Management</td><td>Low-noise operation at 26.3 dB(A), ideal for quiet environments</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Form Factor</td><td>113 x 113 x 58.5 mm low-profile design for compact chassis compatibility</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Component Weight</strong></td><td>Structural Load</td><td>208g lightweight assembly for easy installation and low motherboard stress</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Dedicated support for Intel LGA 1700 and LGA 1851 sockets</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Profile</strong></td><td>Energy Efficiency</td><td>12V DC operation (10.8–13.2V range); ~5W power consumption</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Installation</strong></td><td>Logistics</td><td>Tool-free push-pin mounting system for quick, secure deployment</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>1-year manufacturer warranty provided through official channels</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'CPU Cooler', 550.00, 550.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/D70tMvdyqhWL7Eh8SbwJCwW0HVnh2PAY5f1Vc56j.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 12:38:49', '2026-06-14 12:38:49', 'DeepCool ALTA 9 Air CPU Cooler | Intel LGA 1700/1851', 'Efficient, low-profile DeepCool ALTA 9 air cooler for Intel LGA 1700/1851. Features 2200 RPM fan, 42.35 CFM airflow, and tool-free installation. 1-year warranty.', 'DeepCool ALTA 9, Intel LGA 1700 cooler, LGA 1851 air cooler, compact CPU cooler, low profile CPU fan, quiet air cooler, budget PC cooling, 92mm CPU fan, tool-free CPU cooler', NULL, 31, NULL, NULL),
(662, 'DeepCool ICE EDGE MINI FS V2.0 CPU Air Cooler', 'The Compact Performance Tower Cooler is a reliable, entry-level thermal solution designed for universal compatibility across mainstream Intel and AMD desktop platforms. Standing 112mm tall with a slim 75mm profile, it is an excellent choice for compact builds where space is restricted. It features a 2200 RPM fan that balances effective cooling with a low-noise 24.7 dB(A) acoustic signature, ensuring your system remains cool and quiet during daily tasks. Lightweight at 258g and backed by a 1-year warranty, it offers a straightforward, efficient, and budget-friendly thermal upgrade.', 'deepcool-ice-edge-mini-fs-v20-cpu-air-cooler-1781440840', '<p>For users looking to improve upon stock cooling or build a cost-effective PC, the <strong>Compact Performance Tower Cooler</strong> provides a dependable and balanced thermal experience. Its tower-style design maximizes the use of vertical space, allowing for efficient airflow through the fin stack to keep CPU temperatures stable under moderate workloads. With a fan speed of 2200 RPM, the cooler generates 25.13 CFM of airflow at 2.23 mmAq of air pressure, ensuring steady heat dissipation without unnecessary thermal throttling.</p><p>Acoustics are well-managed in this design, with a maximum noise level of 24.7 dB(A), making it suitable for quiet office environments, home media centers, or basic gaming setups. The cooler\'s slim dimensions—119 x 75 x 112 mm—ensure that it clears most motherboard components and RAM modules, providing easy installation even in smaller cases. The 3-pin connector allows for simple integration with most motherboard fan headers, eliminating the need for complex software configurations.</p><p>Durability and simplicity are at the heart of this cooler’s utility. Weighing just 258g, the installation process is straightforward, placing minimal stress on the motherboard’s mounting points. Whether you are assembling a budget-conscious workstation or refreshing an aging system, this cooler provides the performance and stability required for daily operation. Backed by a 1-year manufacturer warranty, it stands as a reliable, essential component for any standard desktop build.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Thermal Dynamics</td><td>Compact tower heatsink optimized for standard airflow and heat transfer</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>Operational</td><td>2200 RPM (±10%) speed for consistent cooling performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Airflow &amp; Pressure</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>25.13 CFM airflow capacity with 2.23 mmAq static pressure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Profile</strong></td><td>Noise Management</td><td>24.7 dB(A) max noise level for quiet system operation</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Form Factor</td><td>119 x 75 x 112 mm slim tower design for improved clearance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Component Weight</strong></td><td>Structural Load</td><td>258g total weight for easy, stress-free installation</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Universal mounting for Intel (LGA 1700/1200/115x) and AMD (AM5/AM4)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>Standard 3-pin fan connector for universal motherboard compatibility</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>1-year manufacturer warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'cpu', 1150.00, 1150.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/kO6qTkxWjBIABTA0TPNgq0Y9iruYyAKxFurSn2cJ.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 12:40:40', '2026-06-14 12:42:07', 'Compact Tower CPU Cooler | Universal Intel/AMD Support', 'Reliable tower CPU cooler for Intel LGA 1700/1200 and AMD AM5/AM4. Features 2200 RPM fan, 25.13 CFM airflow, and a quiet 24.7 dB(A) profile. 1-year warra', 'compact tower cooler, Intel LGA 1700 cooler, AMD AM5 air cooler, 2200 RPM CPU fan, quiet CPU cooler, budget air cooler, small CPU tower, 112mm CPU cooler', NULL, 31, NULL, NULL),
(663, 'Deepcool AG300 Single Tower Air CPU Cooler', 'The DeepCool AG300 is a compact, high-efficiency single-tower air cooler featuring a direct-touch three-heatpipe design. Engineered for broad compatibility across modern Intel (LGA 1851/1700/1200) and AMD (AM5/AM4) platforms, it pairs a powerful 92mm hydro-bearing fan with a dense heatsink to deliver robust thermal performance. With its minimalist, non-RGB aesthetic and space-saving 129mm height, it is an ideal thermal upgrade for workstations, gaming rigs, and minimalist desktop builds where performance and reliability are the primary objectives.', 'deepcool-ag300-single-tower-air-cpu-cooler-1781441050', '<p>The DeepCool AG300 Single Tower Air CPU Cooler is a precision-engineered thermal solution that strips away unnecessary flair to focus entirely on heat dissipation efficiency. Built around three high-performance 6mm copper heat pipes that make direct contact with the CPU, the AG300 rapidly transports thermal energy into its optimized aluminum fin stack, ensuring consistent temperature regulation even during demanding computing tasks.</p><p>At the heart of the AG300 is a high-speed 92mm hydro-bearing fan, capable of reaching up to 3050 RPM to provide massive airflow and static pressure. This ensures that heat is effectively pushed through the heatsink, keeping your processor cool under both everyday workloads and intensive gaming sessions. With 4-pin PWM control, the system allows for granular fan speed adjustments, enabling users to calibrate the perfect balance between peak cooling power and acoustic comfort (rated at a maximum of 30.5 dB(A)).</p><p>Physically, the AG300 is designed for versatility. Its compact 94 x 57 x 129mm footprint guarantees high clearance, making it an excellent choice for mid-tower cases and smaller builds alike. The straightforward installation process ensures compatibility with a vast range of modern sockets, including Intel\'s latest LGA 1851 and AMD\'s AM5. By omitting RGB lighting and decorative themes, the AG300 maintains a professional, distraction-free aesthetic that complements any serious PC build. Backed by a 1-year warranty, the AG300 is a dependable, high-value choice for maintaining long-term system stability.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Thermal Engine</strong></td><td>Heat Dissipation</td><td>3x 6mm high-efficiency heat pipes with direct-touch technology</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Dynamics</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>92mm Hydro Bearing fan; up to 3050 RPM speed</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Airflow Capacity</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>36.75 CFM airflow with 2.89 mmH2O static pressure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Profile</strong></td><td>Noise Management</td><td>30.5 dB(A) maximum noise level for optimized cooling-to-noise ratio</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Form Factor</td><td>94 x 57 x 129 mm slim tower design for wide chassis compatibility</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>4-pin PWM connector for intelligent, motherboard-controlled fan speeds</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Universal mounting for Intel (LGA 1851/1700/1200/115x) and AMD (AM5/AM4)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Profile</strong></td><td>Energy Efficiency</td><td>10W power consumption; ideal for balanced system power budgets</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>1-year manufacturer warranty for long-term peace of mind</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 1700.00, 1700.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/2wLmRfhIc8sgHxNxLvTVtuDsB4NooN2fepfq7NQc.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 12:44:10', '2026-06-14 12:44:10', 'DeepCool AG300 Single Tower Air CPU Cooler', 'Efficient DeepCool AG300 air cooler with 3 direct-touch heat pipes. Features 3050 RPM fan, universal Intel/AMD support, and a minimalist design. 1-year warranty.', ': DeepCool AG300, single tower cooler, LGA 1851 cooler, AM5 air cooler, direct touch heatpipes, compact CPU cooler, 92mm fan, performance air cooler, minimalist PC cooling', NULL, 31, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `name`, `short_description`, `slug`, `description`, `specifications_text`, `tags`, `buy_price`, `price`, `discount_price`, `stock`, `thumbnail`, `video`, `is_featured`, `status`, `is_coming_soon`, `is_tba`, `is_call_for_price`, `is_out_of_stock`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`, `meta_keywords`, `meta_image`, `brand_id`, `supplier_id`, `laptop_purpose_id`) VALUES
(664, 'DeepCool AG400 LED 120mm CPU Cooler', 'The DeepCool AG400 LED is a high-performance, single-tower 120mm air cooler engineered to handle up to 220W of thermal design power. Featuring four direct-touch 6mm heat pipes with advanced Balanced Bidirectional Heat Pipe Technology, it ensures efficient heat dissipation in any orientation. Equipped with a high-airflow 120mm PWM fan and a vibrant 6-color LED array, this cooler combines reliable performance, streamlined installation, and a modern aesthetic, making it an ideal upgrade for mainstream Intel and AMD desktop systems.', 'deepcool-ag400-led-120mm-cpu-cooler-1781441327', '<p>The DeepCool AG400 LED serves as a streamlined yet powerful thermal solution for users who demand consistent CPU performance without unnecessary complexity. Designed with a focus on efficiency, the cooler utilizes four high-conductivity heat pipes that make direct contact with the processor, rapidly pulling thermal energy away from the die and into an optimized aluminum fin stack. Its proprietary Balanced Bidirectional Heat Pipe Technology ensures that the cooler maintains maximum efficiency whether installed in a vertical or horizontal configuration, guaranteeing optimal phase changes and minimal thermal resistance across varying workloads.</p><p>Cooling performance is driven by a high-output 120mm PWM fan that operates between 500 and 2000 RPM. Capable of generating 75.89 CFM of airflow at 2.53 mmAq of pressure, it provides the thermal headroom necessary for gaming, content creation, and intensive productivity tasks. Despite this high performance, the fan maintains a controlled noise level of $\\leq 31.6$ dB(A), ensuring your computing environment remains comfortable. The integrated 6-color LED array adds a touch of visual flair, giving your build a distinct, modern look without requiring complex controller software.</p><p>Installation is refined for user convenience; the assembly is designed to be installed without disassembling the fan, significantly saving time during setup. Weighing 614g and measuring 150mm in height, it fits comfortably within most standard mid-tower chassis. Compatible with a broad range of modern sockets—including Intel’s LGA 1700/1200 series and AMD’s AM5/AM4—the AG400 LED is a versatile and durable thermal foundation, backed by a 1-year manufacturer warranty for long-term peace of mind.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Thermal Engine</strong></td><td>Heat Dissipation</td><td>4x 6mm direct-touch heat pipes with Balanced Bidirectional Technology</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Power</strong></td><td>Capacity</td><td>Rated for up to 220W of heat dissipation</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>PWM Control</td><td>120mm Hydro Bearing fan; 500–2000 RPM (±10%)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Airflow Capacity</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>75.89 CFM throughput at 2.53 mmAq static pressure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Profile</strong></td><td>Noise Management</td><td>$\\leq 31.6$ dB(A) for balanced performance-to-noise ratio</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Illumination</strong></td><td>Visuals</td><td>Integrated 6-color fixed-LED array for modern aesthetic</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Form Factor</td><td>125 x 92 x 150 mm tower dimensions for broad chassis compatibility</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>Standard 4-pin PWM connector for dynamic motherboard fan control</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Intel (LGA 1700/1200/115x); AMD (AM5/AM4)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>1-year manufacturer warranty for dependable support</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 2200.00, 2200.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/N2f5FiRC5xT8ydRtFZqXQlq6PEXGIACPIEGmgoYH.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 12:48:47', '2026-06-14 12:48:47', 'DeepCool AG400 LED 120mm Single Tower CPU Cooler', 'Efficient DeepCool AG400 LED air cooler with 220W TDP support. Features', 'DeepCool AG400 LED, single tower cooler, 120mm CPU cooler, LGA 1700 air cooler, AM5 CPU cooler, high-performance air cooler, 220W TDP cooling, direct touch heat pipes, LED CPU cool', NULL, 31, NULL, NULL),
(665, 'DeepCool AG400 Single Tower 120mm CPU Cooler', 'The DeepCool AG400 is a high-performance, single-tower 120mm air cooler engineered to handle up to 220W of thermal design power. Featuring four direct-touch 6mm heat pipes with advanced Balanced Bidirectional Heat Pipe Technology, it ensures superior heat dissipation regardless of case orientation. Equipped with a high-airflow 120mm PWM fan and a dense \"Matrix Fins\" array, this cooler combines reliable performance with a streamlined, time-saving installation process, making it an ideal thermal upgrade for mainstream Intel and AMD desktop systems.', 'deepcool-ag400-single-tower-120mm-cpu-cooler-1781441408', '<p>The DeepCool AG400 is a precision-engineered thermal solution designed for users who prioritize efficiency, reliability, and ease of installation. Built around a robust single-tower design, the AG400 utilizes four high-conductivity heat pipes that make direct contact with the CPU, rapidly drawing heat into an optimized aluminum fin stack. Its proprietary Balanced Bidirectional Heat Pipe Technology optimizes the internal capillary structure and liquid injection, ensuring peak cooling performance whether the cooler is mounted in a vertical or horizontal orientation.</p><p>Performance is managed by a high-efficiency 120mm fan that dynamically adjusts between 500 and 2000 RPM. This PWM-controlled fan delivers 75.89 CFM of airflow at 2.53 mmAq of static pressure, providing the necessary cooling headroom for gaming, content creation, and intensive multi-tasking while remaining whisper-quiet during idle states ($\\leq 31.6$ dB(A)). The unique \"Matrix Fins\" design not only maximizes heat dissipation through increased surface area but also provides a distinctive, modern aesthetic to any build.</p><p>Installation is uniquely streamlined; the AG400 features a fan-lock mounting system that eliminates the need to disassemble the fan during the setup process, saving time and ensuring a secure fit. The offset heat pipe design further enhances usability, allowing for installation even without the fan attached. Compatible with a broad range of modern sockets—including Intel’s LGA 1700/1200 series and AMD’s AM5/AM4—and backed by a 1-year manufacturer warranty, the AG400 is a dependable, high-value thermal foundation for any serious PC build.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>eature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Thermal Engine</strong></td><td>Heat Dissipation</td><td>4x 6mm direct-touch heat pipes with Balanced Bidirectional Technology</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Power</strong></td><td>Capacity</td><td>Rated for up to 220W of heat dissipation</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>PWM Dynamics</td><td>120mm Hydro Bearing fan; 500–2000 RPM (±10%)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Airflow Capacity</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>75.89 CFM throughput at 2.53 mmAq static pressure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Profile</strong></td><td>Noise Management</td><td>$\\leq 31.6$ dB(A) for optimal performance-to-noise ratio</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Form Factor</td><td>125 x 92 x 150 mm tower design for wide chassis compatibility</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fin Architecture</strong></td><td>Aesthetic</td><td>High-quality \"Matrix Fins\" array for efficient airflow and unique design</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>Standard 4-pin PWM connector for dynamic motherboard control</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Universal mounting for Intel (LGA 1700/1200/115x); AMD (AM5/AM4)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>1-year manufacturer warranty for dependable support</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'CPU Cooler', 2200.00, 2200.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/zV8DVgjcHwbMSIXFfWsxtTv5XLetoDNuivw6fmpg.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 12:50:08', '2026-06-14 12:50:08', 'DeepCool AG400 Single Tower 120mm CPU Cooler', ': Efficient DeepCool AG400 air cooler with 220W TDP support. Features 2000 RPM PWM fan, 4 direct-touch heat pipes, and \"Matrix Fins\" design. Intel/AMD support.\r\n\r\nMeta Keywords: DeepCool AG400, single tower cooler, 120mm CPU cooler, LGA 1700 air', 'DeepCool AG400, single tower cooler, 120mm CPU cooler, LGA 1700 air cooler, AM5 CPU cooler, high-performance air cooler, 220W TDP cooling, direct touch heat pipes, balanced bidirectional heat pipes', NULL, 31, NULL, NULL),
(666, 'vDeepCool AG400 G2 Single Tower 120mm CPU Cooler', 'The DeepCool AG400 G2 is a refined, high-performance single-tower 120mm air cooler designed for modern Intel LGA 1851/1700 and AMD AM5/AM4 platforms. Featuring four 6mm high-efficiency heatpipes and a redesigned semi-integral blade fan, it delivers impressive thermal control with up to 70.09 CFM of airflow. Combining a minimalist top-cover aesthetic with silent operation ($\\leq 29.22$ dB(A)), the AG400 G2 offers a premium, professional-grade cooling solution that balances robust heat dissipation with a sleek, distraction-free design.', 'vdeepcool-ag400-g2-single-tower-120mm-cpu-cooler-1781441480', '<p>Building on the legacy of its predecessors, the DeepCool AG400 G2 is a second-generation thermal solution optimized for high-performance computing. At its core, the cooler utilizes four Ø6 mm heatpipes designed to efficiently draw heat away from the processor and into a dense matrix fin stack. This structure ensures that thermal energy is managed effectively, maintaining optimal operating temperatures even when pushing modern CPUs through demanding gaming sessions or intensive productivity workflows.</p><p>A significant upgrade in the G2 model is the new semi-integral blade fan. Engineered to maximize airflow while minimizing turbulence, this fan provides a potent 70.09 CFM of air movement at a static pressure of 2.49 mmAq. Despite the cooling power provided by its 2200 RPM top speed, the AG400 G2 remains whisper-quiet, with noise levels kept at or below 29.22 dB(A). This makes it an ideal choice for users who require high performance during heavy loads but value near-silent operation during lighter tasks or idle states.</p><p>Visually, the AG400 G2 embraces a sophisticated, minimalist design language. By replacing traditional RGB lighting with a refined top-cover finish, DeepCool has created a cooler that feels premium and professional, making it an excellent addition to any modern workstation or gaming build. The compact 152mm height ensures compatibility with the majority of standard mid-tower chassis, and the installation process is as efficient as the cooler\'s thermal performance. Backed by a 1-year manufacturer warranty, the DeepCool AG400 G2 is a dependable and stylish investment for your system\'s thermal health.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Thermal Engine</strong></td><td>Heat Dissipation</td><td>4x 6mm high-performance heatpipes in a dense matrix fin array</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>PWM Dynamics</td><td>120mm Hydro Bearing fan; 500–2200 RPM (±10%)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Airflow Capacity</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>70.09 CFM throughput at 2.49 mmAq static pressure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Profile</strong></td><td>Noise Management</td><td>$\\leq 29.22$ dB(A) for optimal performance-to-noise ratio</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Form Factor</td><td>125 x 92 x 152 mm tower dimensions for broad chassis clearance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design Aesthetics</strong></td><td>Visuals</td><td>Premium refined top-cover design with a minimalist, non-RGB look</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>Standard 4-pin PWM connector for motherboard-controlled fan curves</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Universal support for Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Profile</strong></td><td>Energy Efficiency</td><td>2.16 W power consumption (12 VDC / 0.18 A)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>1-year manufacturer warranty for dependable support</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 2400.00, 2400.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/eZm8ZRS9gacNvuvXpTiZjiEzpTsLHYVyEOxvhJGf.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 12:51:20', '2026-06-14 12:51:20', 'DeepCool AG400 G2 Single Tower 120mm CPU Cooler', 'Experience the DeepCool AG400 G2 air cooler, featuring a 2200 RPM fan, 70.09 CFM airflow, and a minimalist top-cover design. Supports Intel LGA 1851 and AMD AM5.\r\n\r\nMeta Keywords: DeepCool AG400 G2, single tower CPU cooler, 120mm air cooler, LGA 1851', 'DeepCool AG400 G2, single tower CPU cooler, 120mm air cooler, LGA 1851 cooler, AM5 CPU cooler, performance air cooler, quiet CPU fan, minimalist CPU cooler, 4 heatpipe cooler', NULL, 31, NULL, NULL),
(667, 'DeepCool AG400 G2 Plus Single Tower 120mm CPU Cooler', 'The DeepCool AG400 G2 Plus is an upgraded, high-performance single-tower 120mm air cooler designed for modern Intel LGA 1851/1700 and AMD AM5/AM4 systems. Featuring a quad-heatpipe direct-touch design and a refined semi-integral blade fan, it delivers powerful airflow up to 70.09 CFM while maintaining whisper-quiet acoustics as low as 23.08 dB(A). With a sophisticated matrix fin stack, minimalist top-cover aesthetic, and a robust 764g build, it provides a premium, professional-grade thermal solution for enthusiasts who demand efficiency, quiet operation, and a sleek look for their PC builds.', 'deepcool-ag400-g2-plus-single-tower-120mm-cpu-cooler-1781441555', '<p>The DeepCool AG400 G2 Plus represents the next evolution in thermal management for high-performance desktop systems. Building upon a foundation of four high-efficiency 6mm direct-contact heatpipes, this cooler rapidly channels heat away from the CPU die into a densely packed matrix fin stack. This architecture ensures that even modern high-TDP processors remain stable under sustained workloads, ranging from high-fidelity gaming to intensive content creation, without thermal throttling.</p><p>Engineered with a focus on acoustic balance, the G2 Plus integrates an advanced 120mm fan that utilizes semi-integral blades to maximize airflow efficiency while reducing turbulence. With a wide PWM-controlled range of 500 to 2200 RPM, the fan dynamically adjusts to system demand, providing aggressive cooling when pushed and near-silent operation during idle or light tasks. The result is a cooling experience that is powerful when needed and practically inaudible when not, with maximum noise levels capped at an impressive 29.22 dB(A).</p><p>The physical design of the AG400 G2 Plus emphasizes both durability and elegance. The refined, minimalist top-cover eliminates unnecessary lighting for a professional, distraction-free aesthetic that fits perfectly into any workspace or gaming environment. Installation is straightforward, utilizing secure mounting hardware compatible with the latest mainstream platforms. With a comprehensive 1-year manufacturer warranty, the DeepCool AG400 G2 Plus is a dependable, high-quality thermal</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Thermal Engine</strong></td><td>Heat Dissipation</td><td>4x 6mm high-efficiency direct-contact heatpipes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Dynamics</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>120mm Hydro Bearing fan; 500–2200 RPM (±10%)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Airflow Performance</strong></td><td>Capacity</td><td>63.56 – 70.09 CFM airflow range</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pressure Specs</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>1.98 – 2.49 mmAq static pressure for optimized fin penetration</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Profile</strong></td><td>Noise Management</td><td>23.08 – 29.22 dB(A) for silent and performance modes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Form Factor</td><td>125 x 107 x 152 mm tower dimensions; 764g total weight</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design Aesthetics</strong></td><td>Visuals</td><td>Refined minimalist top-cover design; non-RGB professional look</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>Standard 4-pin PWM connector for dynamic BIOS/software control</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Universal mounting for Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Profile</strong></td><td>Energy Efficiency</td><td>1.8 W – 2.16 W power consumption (12 VDC)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>1-year manufacturer warranty for dependable support</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 2900.00, 2900.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/7q1c6haRL7a2MxDs3YObDiGuEItvZg6Epc4A3nD1.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 12:52:35', '2026-06-14 12:52:35', 'DeepCool AG400 G2 Plus Single Tower 120mm CPU Cooler', 'Upgrade with the DeepCool AG400 G2 Plus. Features quad heatpipes, 2200 RPM PWM fan, 70.09 CFM airflow, and a minimalist design. Supports LGA 1851 and AM5.', 'DeepCool AG400 G2 Plus, single tower CPU cooler, 120mm air cooler, LGA 1851 cooler, AM5 CPU cooler, performance air cooler, quiet CPU fan, minimalist PC cooling, quad heatpipe cooler', NULL, 31, NULL, NULL),
(668, 'DeepCool AG400 PLUS CPU Cooler', 'The DeepCool AG400 PLUS is a high-performance single-tower 120mm air cooler engineered to deliver up to 220W of heat dissipation. Featuring a dual-fan-ready design, four direct-contact heatpipes with advanced Balanced Bidirectional Heat Pipe Technology, and a 100% RAM clearance profile, this cooler ensures peak thermal stability for high-TDP processors. With a reliable hydro-bearing fan, a streamlined five-step installation process, and broad support for modern Intel and AMD platforms, the AG400 PLUS is a premier, efficient thermal upgrade for power users and enthusiasts.', 'deepcool-ag400-plus-cpu-cooler-1781441622', '<p>Designed for users who demand both high-end thermal performance and excellent component compatibility, the DeepCool AG400 PLUS is a standout thermal solution. At its core, the cooler features four high-conductivity 6mm heatpipes that make direct contact with the CPU, rapidly channeling heat into a densely stacked aluminum fin array. Its proprietary Balanced Bidirectional Heat Pipe Technology optimizes the internal capillary structure and liquid distribution, ensuring maximum heat dissipation efficiency regardless of whether your system is mounted in a standard vertical tower or a horizontal desktop case.</p><p>The AG400 PLUS is built to prioritize usability without sacrificing performance. Its slim heatsink profile ensures 100% RAM clearance, preventing conflicts with high-profile memory kits, while the offset heatpipe design allows for installation without needing to remove the cooling fan. The included 120mm PWM-controlled fan operates between 500 and 2000 RPM, providing an impressive 75.89 CFM of airflow at 2.53 mmAq of static pressure. This allows the system to remain whisper-quiet during low-load tasks while delivering aggressive, rapid cooling when processing heavy workloads or intensive gaming sessions.</p><p>Installation is refined and secure, utilizing a straightforward five-step mounting system that guarantees optimal contact pressure for modern Intel LGA 1700/1200 and AMD AM5/AM4 sockets. Weighing 748g, the AG400 PLUS feels premium and durable, offering a robust foundation for your system’s longevity. Backed by a 1-year manufacturer warranty, this cooler is the ideal choice for those looking for a sophisticated, high-capacity cooling solution that is as easy to install as it is powerful.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Thermal Engine</strong></td><td>Heat Dissipation</td><td>4x 6mm direct-contact heatpipes with Balanced Bidirectional Technology</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Power</strong></td><td>Capacity</td><td>Rated for up to 220W of heat dissipation power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>PWM Dynamics</td><td>120mm Hydro Bearing fan; 500–2000 RPM (±10%)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Airflow Capacity</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>75.89 CFM throughput at 2.53 mmAq static pressure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Profile</strong></td><td>Noise Management</td><td>$\\leq 31.6$ dB(A) for balanced performance-to-noise ratio</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Form Factor</td><td>125 x 107 x 150 mm tower dimensions with 100% RAM clearance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Weight</strong></td><td>Build Quality</td><td>748g total weight for stability and high-pressure contact</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>Standard 4-pin PWM connector for motherboard fan curve management</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Universal mounting for Intel (LGA 1700/1200/115x); AMD (AM5/AM4)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>1-year manufacturer warranty for dependable support</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 2400.00, 2400.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/nfKVi4KAlPk2fzcYd8Y85sUU9NbJZwCszI8lX2NG.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 12:53:43', '2026-06-14 12:53:43', ': DeepCool AG400 PLUS 120mm Single Tower CPU Cooler', 'Experience 220W cooling with the DeepCool AG400 PLUS. Features direct-contact heatpipes, 100% RAM clearance, 2000 RPM PWM fan, and Intel/AMD support.', ': DeepCool AG400 PLUS, single tower CPU cooler, 120mm air cooler, RAM clearance cooler, LGA 1700 air cooler, AM5 CPU cooler, performance air cooler, 220W TDP cooling, balanced bidirectional heat pipes', NULL, 31, NULL, NULL),
(669, 'Deepcool AG600 Single Tower 120mm CPU Cooler', 'The DeepCool AG600 is a premium, high-capacity single-tower air cooler featuring an advanced six-heatpipe architecture for superior thermal transfer. Engineered for demanding Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4) processors, it pairs a powerful 120mm PWM fan—delivering up to 70.09 CFM of airflow—with a dense matrix fin stack. With its refined minimalist top-cover design, high-pressure static performance, and quiet operation ($\\leq 29.22$ dB(A)), the AG600 provides professional-grade, reliable cooling for high-performance builds without the need for RGB lighting.', 'deepcool-ag600-single-tower-120mm-cpu-cooler-1781441713', '<p>The DeepCool AG600 represents the pinnacle of single-tower air cooling, specifically designed for enthusiasts and professionals who require uncompromising thermal control. At its core, the AG600 utilizes six high-conductivity Ø6 mm heatpipes to rapidly pull thermal energy away from the CPU die and distribute it across a vast surface area within the dense matrix fin stack. This robust thermal foundation allows the cooler to handle the heat output of modern high-TDP processors with ease, ensuring system stability during intensive tasks like 4K rendering, complex simulations, and high-framerate gaming.</p><p>The cooling system is driven by a specialized 120mm fan featuring semi-integral blades, which are engineered to optimize airflow efficiency and static pressure. With a PWM-controlled speed range of 500 to 2200 RPM, the fan dynamically adjusts to real-time cooling demands—delivering up to 2.49 mmAq of static pressure when under load, while maintaining near-silent acoustic levels during desktop idle or light background tasks. The use of long-lasting hydro-bearing technology ensures consistent performance and durability throughout the fan\'s lifespan.</p><p>Aesthetically, the AG600 embraces a sophisticated, professional look. The sleek, minimalist top-cover decoration complements any modern build, offering a premium alternative to RGB-heavy cooling solutions. Installation is secure and intuitive, supported by high-quality mounting hardware that ensures balanced pressure across the CPU socket. With a weight of 686g and a compact 150mm height, it provides broad chassis compatibility. Backed by a 1-year manufacturer warranty, the DeepCool AG600 is a reliable, high-performance investment for any serious computing rig.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Thermal Engine</strong></td><td>Heat Dissipation</td><td>6x 6mm high-efficiency heatpipes for rapid thermal transfer</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>PWM Dynamics</td><td>120mm Hydro Bearing fan; 500–2200 RPM (±10%)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Airflow Capacity</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>70.09 CFM throughput at 2.49 mmAq static pressure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Profile</strong></td><td>Noise Management</td><td>$\\leq 29.22$ dB(A) for optimized cooling-to-noise ratio</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Form Factor</td><td>125 x 92 x 150 mm tower; 686g total weight</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design Aesthetics</strong></td><td>Visuals</td><td>Refined top-cover decoration with a sleek, minimalist aesthetic</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>Standard 4-pin PWM connector for dynamic BIOS control</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Universal mounting for Intel (LGA 1851/1700); AMD (AM5/AM4)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Profile</strong></td><td>Energy Efficiency</td><td>2.16 W power consumption (12 VDC / 0.18 A)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>1-year manufacturer warranty for dependable support</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 3500.00, 3500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/r8v6Wj8MVP5jL3khcoFLA30Xnnrcpl0I87cEtvjw.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 12:55:13', '2026-06-14 12:55:13', 'DeepCool AG600 Single Tower 120mm CPU Cooler', 'xperience extreme cooling with the DeepCool AG600. Features 6 heatpipes, 2200 RPM PWM fan, 70.09 CFM airflow, and a minimalist design. Supports LGA 1851 and AM5.', 'DeepCool AG600, single tower CPU cooler, 120mm air cooler, LGA 1851 cooler, AM5 CPU cooler, 6 heatpipe cooler, performance air cooler, quiet CPU fan, minimalist PC cooling, high-end air cooler', NULL, 31, NULL, NULL),
(670, 'DeepCool AG400 PLUS CPU Cooler', 'Specification\r\nKey Features\r\nFan Speed\r\n500~2000 RPM±10%\r\nFan Airflow\r\n75.89 CFM\r\nNoise\r\n≤31.6 dB(A)\r\nAir Pressure\r\n2.53 mmAq\r\nConnector\r\n4-pin PWM\r\nOthers\r\nHeatpipe: Ø6 mm×4 pcs\r\nBearing Type: Hydro Bearing\r\nFan Rated Voltage: 12 VDC\r\nFan Rated Current: 0.17 A\r\nFan Power Consumption: 2.04 W\r\nPhysical Specification\r\nDimension\r\nProduct Dimensions: 125×107×150 mm\r\nHeatsink Dimensions: 120×92×150 mm\r\nFan Dimensions: 120×120×25 mm\r\nWeight\r\n748 g\r\nSupported Sockets\r\nIntel\r\nLGA1700/1200/1151/1150/1155\r\nAMD\r\nAM5/AM4\r\nWarranty Information\r\nWarranty\r\n01-Year\r\nDescription\r\nDeepCool AG400 PLUS CPU Cooler\r\nThe DeepCool AG400 PLUS is a single tower 120mm CPU cooler that builds on our reputation of high-quality cooling performance while being simplified and efficient. Keep things cool with up to 220W of heat dissipation power and four direct contact heat pipes that swiftly draw heat away from the CPU for improved system performance. With its small design for 100% RAM clearance and a tiny offset for quick and easy installation, the AG400 PLUS retains outstanding hardware compatibility. Its outstanding thermal performance also enables it to deal with severe processing workloads. The heat pipe delivers the highest heat dissipation performance regardless of whether the cooler is in a vertical or horizontal casing by optimizing the interior capillary structure and injecting a precise volume of liquid. This ideal ratio allows for very efficient phase changes across the heat pipe, resulting in decreased thermal resistance throughout a wide TDP range. With a straightforward five-step installation technique that ensures high contact pressure, the accompanying mounting brackets support both Intel and AMD systems. Because of the offset design of the heat pipes, the cooler may be mounted with the fan already attached. It has a variety of clips to support Intel LGA1700/1200/1151/1150/1155 AMD AM5/AM4. The DeepCool AG400 PLUS CPU Cooler comes with a 01-year warranty.', 'deepcool-ag400-plus-cpu-cooler-1781441810', '<p>Designed for users who demand both high-end thermal performance and excellent component compatibility, the DeepCool AG400 PLUS is a standout thermal solution. At its core, the cooler features four high-conductivity 6mm heatpipes that make direct contact with the CPU, rapidly channeling heat into a densely stacked aluminum fin array. Its proprietary Balanced Bidirectional Heat Pipe Technology optimizes the internal capillary structure and liquid distribution, ensuring maximum heat dissipation efficiency regardless of whether your system is mounted in a standard vertical tower or a horizontal desktop case.</p><p>The AG400 PLUS is built to prioritize usability without sacrificing performance. Its slim heatsink profile ensures 100% RAM clearance, preventing conflicts with high-profile memory kits, while the offset heatpipe design allows for installation without needing to remove the cooling fan. The included 120mm PWM-controlled fan operates between 500 and 2000 RPM, providing an impressive 75.89 CFM of airflow at 2.53 mmAq of static pressure. This allows the system to remain whisper-quiet during low-load tasks while delivering aggressive, rapid cooling when processing heavy workloads or intensive gaming sessions.</p><p>Installation is refined and secure, utilizing a straightforward five-step mounting system that guarantees optimal contact pressure for modern Intel LGA 1700/1200 and AMD AM5/AM4 sockets. Weighing 748g, the AG400 PLUS feels premium and durable, offering a robust foundation for your system’s longevity. Backed by a 1-year manufacturer warranty, this cooler is the ideal choice for those looking for a sophisticated, high-capacity cooling solution that is as easy to install as it is powerful.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Thermal Engine</strong></td><td>Heat Dissipation</td><td>4x 6mm direct-contact heatpipes with Balanced Bidirectional Technology</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Power</strong></td><td>Capacity</td><td>Rated for up to 220W of heat dissipation power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>PWM Dynamics</td><td>120mm Hydro Bearing fan; 500–2000 RPM (±10%)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Airflow Capacity</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>75.89 CFM throughput at 2.53 mmAq static pressure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Profile</strong></td><td>Noise Management</td><td>$\\leq 31.6$ dB(A) for balanced performance-to-noise ratio</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Form Factor</td><td>125 x 107 x 150 mm tower dimensions with 100% RAM clearance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Weight</strong></td><td>Build Quality</td><td>748g total weight for stability and high-pressure contact</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>Standard 4-pin PWM connector for motherboard fan curve management</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Universal mounting for Intel (LGA 1700/1200/115x); AMD (AM5/AM4)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>1-year manufacturer warranty for dependable support</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 2400.00, 2400.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/ItVP79SZcD7mQOPro2BssS6Z7YkiPCnLeqQUyCW8.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 12:56:50', '2026-06-14 12:56:50', 'DeepCool AG400 PLUS 120mm Single Tower CPU Cooler', 'Experience 220W cooling with the DeepCool AG400 PLUS. Features direct-contact heatpipes, 100% RAM clearance, 2000 RPM PWM fan, and Intel/AMD support.', 'v', NULL, 31, NULL, NULL),
(671, 'Deepcool AG600 Single Tower 120mm CPU Cooler', 'The DeepCool AG600 is a premium, high-capacity single-tower air cooler featuring an advanced six-heatpipe architecture for superior thermal transfer. Engineered for demanding Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4) processors, it pairs a powerful 120mm PWM fan—delivering up to 70.09 CFM of airflow—with a dense matrix fin stack. With its refined minimalist top-cover design, high-pressure static performance, and quiet operation ($\\leq 29.22$ dB(A)), the AG600 provides professional-grade, reliable cooling for high-performance builds without the need for RGB lighting.', 'deepcool-ag600-single-tower-120mm-cpu-cooler-1781441930', '<p>The DeepCool AG600 represents the pinnacle of single-tower air cooling, specifically designed for enthusiasts and professionals who require uncompromising thermal control. At its core, the AG600 utilizes six high-conductivity Ø6 mm heatpipes to rapidly pull thermal energy away from the CPU die and distribute it across a vast surface area within the dense matrix fin stack. This robust thermal foundation allows the cooler to handle the heat output of modern high-TDP processors with ease, ensuring system stability during intensive tasks like 4K rendering, complex simulations, and high-framerate gaming.</p><p>The cooling system is driven by a specialized 120mm fan featuring semi-integral blades, which are engineered to optimize airflow efficiency and static pressure. With a PWM-controlled speed range of 500 to 2200 RPM, the fan dynamically adjusts to real-time cooling demands—delivering up to 2.49 mmAq of static pressure when under load, while maintaining near-silent acoustic levels during desktop idle or light background tasks. The use of long-lasting hydro-bearing technology ensures consistent performance and durability throughout the fan\'s lifespan.</p><p>Aesthetically, the AG600 embraces a sophisticated, professional look. The sleek, minimalist top-cover decoration complements any modern build, offering a premium alternative to RGB-heavy cooling solutions. Installation is secure and intuitive, supported by high-quality mounting hardware that ensures balanced pressure across the CPU socket. With a weight of 686g and a compact 150mm height, it provides broad chassis compatibility. Backed by a 1-year manufacturer warranty, the DeepCool AG600 is a reliable, high-performance investment for any serious computing rig.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Thermal Engine</strong></td><td>Heat Dissipation</td><td>6x 6mm high-efficiency heatpipes for rapid thermal transfer</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>PWM Dynamics</td><td>120mm Hydro Bearing fan; 500–2200 RPM (±10%)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Airflow Capacity</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>70.09 CFM throughput at 2.49 mmAq static pressure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Profile</strong></td><td>Noise Management</td><td>$\\leq 29.22$ dB(A) for optimized cooling-to-noise ratio</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Form Factor</td><td>125 x 92 x 150 mm tower; 686g total weight</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design Aesthetics</strong></td><td>Visuals</td><td>Refined top-cover decoration with a sleek, minimalist aesthetic</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>Standard 4-pin PWM connector for dynamic BIOS control</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Universal mounting for Intel (LGA 1851/1700); AMD (AM5/AM4)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Profile</strong></td><td>Energy Efficiency</td><td>2.16 W power consumption (12 VDC / 0.18 A)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>1-year manufacturer warranty for dependable support</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'CPU Cooler', 3500.00, 3500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/YPSCUahSOZyy29usVLf33JZMXwHJ3GvpWqm8rwRn.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 12:58:50', '2026-06-14 12:58:50', 'DeepCool AG600 Single Tower 120mm CPU Cooler', 'Experience extreme cooling with the DeepCool AG600. Features 6 heatpipes, 2200 RPM PWM fan, 70.09 CFM airflow, and a minimalist design. Supports LGA 1851 and AM5.', 'DepCool AG600, single tower CPU cooler, 120mm air cooler, LGA 1851 cooler, AM5 CPU cooler, 6 heatpipe cooler, performance air cooler, quiet CPU fan, minimalist PC cooling, high-end air cooler', NULL, 31, NULL, NULL),
(672, 'DeepCool AK400 Performance CPU Air Cooler', 'The High-Efficiency 120mm Air Cooler is a performance-driven thermal solution featuring a balanced 1850 RPM fan and a 155mm tall slim-tower heatsink. Engineered for versatility, it delivers 66.47 CFM of airflow while maintaining a quiet $\\leq 29$ dB(A) acoustic profile. With universal compatibility across modern Intel and AMD sockets and a generous 3-year warranty, this cooler is a reliable, future-proof upgrade designed to provide consistent thermal stability for both gaming rigs and professional workstations.', 'deepcool-ak400-performance-cpu-air-cooler-1781448111', '<p>The <strong>High-Efficiency 120mm Air Cooler</strong> is designed to provide enthusiasts and system builders with a robust balance of cooling power, acoustic comfort, and hardware compatibility. At the core of the cooler is a precision-engineered heatsink that maximizes surface area for rapid heat dissipation, ensuring that your processor remains within optimal temperature ranges even under demanding productivity workloads or extended gaming sessions.</p><p>Performance is managed by a high-static-pressure PWM fan that operates between 500 and 1850 RPM. This dynamic range allows the cooler to scale performance based on real-time system thermals, providing powerful cooling under load and silent, efficient operation at idle. With a static pressure rating of 2.04 mmAq, the fan is highly effective at pushing air through dense fin stacks, preventing thermal buildup around the CPU socket.</p><p>Installation is straightforward, supporting a wide range of popular sockets including Intel LGA 1700/1200 and AMD AM5/AM4. The 155mm height ensures the cooler fits comfortably within most standard mid-tower chassis, while the lightweight 661g design minimizes stress on the motherboard mounting points. Backed by a 3-year manufacturer warranty, this cooler is a long-term investment in system reliability, ensuring your components stay cool and performant for years to come.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Thermal Dynamics</td><td>High-surface-area tower heatsink for optimized heat exchange</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>PWM Dynamics</td><td>120mm fan; 500–1850 RPM (±10%) speed range</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Airflow Capacity</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>66.47 CFM airflow at 2.04 mmAq static pressure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Profile</strong></td><td>Noise Management</td><td>$\\leq 29$ dB(A) for optimal performance-to-noise ratio</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Form Factor</td><td>127 x 97 x 155 mm; 661g total weight</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Universal mounting for Intel (LGA 1700/1200/115x); AMD (AM5/AM4)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>Standard 4-pin PWM connector for motherboard fan control</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>3-year comprehensive manufacturer warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 2600.00, 2600.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/HdY6I8SKPfEApm57JBhEHXOfm1C1SM9YyZBokjnS.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 14:41:51', '2026-06-14 14:43:19', '120mm High-Efficiency Air CPU Cooler | Silent Performance', 'Boost your system\'s performance with our 120mm High-Efficiency Air Cooler. Features 1850 RPM PWM fan, 66.47 CFM airflow, and a 3-year warranty.', '120mm air cooler, CPU air cooler, silent performance cooler, Intel LGA 1700 cooler, AMD AM5 air cooler, 1850 RPM fan, PC cooling solution, high-efficiency air cooler, 3 year warranty cooler', NULL, 31, NULL, NULL),
(673, 'DeepCool AG400 ARGB CPU Cooler', 'The DeepCool AG400 ARGB is a high-performance, single-tower 120mm air cooler designed for gamers and enthusiasts who demand efficient thermal management and vibrant aesthetics. Featuring four direct-contact 6mm heatpipes and a high-static-pressure PWM fan, it effectively dissipates up to 220W of heat while maintaining a quiet acoustic profile ($\\leq 31.6$ dB(A)). With its integrated 5V A-RGB lighting, universal Intel/AMD socket compatibility, and streamlined installation process, this cooler provides the perfect balance of cooling power, visual impact, and reliable long-term performance.', 'deepcool-ag400-argb-cpu-cooler-1781448182', '<h3><strong>Long Description</strong></h3><p>The DeepCool AG400 ARGB is engineered for those who refuse to compromise between high-tier thermal performance and modern build aesthetics. At the core of the cooler is a quad-heatpipe design that makes direct contact with the CPU, rapidly transferring heat into a dense aluminum fin array. This architecture is complemented by a 120mm hydro-bearing fan that dynamically scales from 500 to 2000 RPM, ensuring that your processor remains stable whether you are idle or pushing the system during intensive gaming or creative sessions.</p><p>Illumination is a standout feature of the AG400 ARGB, which includes a customizable 5V A-RGB LED system. This allows users to sync lighting effects with their motherboard or other system components, elevating the overall look of the PC build. Despite this high performance and visual flair, the cooler remains remarkably efficient and quiet, operating at a maximum noise level of $\\leq 31.6$ dB(A).</p><p>Designed with the builder in mind, the AG400 ARGB features a user-friendly installation process that ensures a secure, high-pressure fit across a broad range of Intel and AMD platforms, including LGA 1700 and AM5. The compact 150mm height and optimized dimensions ensure compatibility with most mid-tower chassis while maintaining excellent clearance for memory modules. Backed by a 1-year manufacturer warranty, the DeepCool AG400 ARGB is a dependable, stylish, and powerful thermal upgrade for any modern system.</p>', '<p><strong>FeatureCategorySpecification DetailsThermal Engine</strong>Heat Dissipation4x 6mm direct-contact heatpipes for rapid thermal transfer<strong>Fan Performance</strong>PWM Dynamics120mm Hydro Bearing fan; 500–2000 RPM (±10%)<strong>Airflow &amp; Pressure</strong>Efficiency75.89 CFM throughput at 2.53 mmAq static pressure<strong>Acoustic Profile</strong>Noise Management$\\leq 31.6$ dB(A) for balanced performance-to-noise ratio<strong>Illumination</strong>VisualsIntegrated 5V A-RGB lighting (3-pin connector)<strong>Physical Dimensions</strong>Form Factor125 x 92 x 150 mm tower; 614g total weight<strong>Connectivity</strong>Interface4-pin PWM for fan; 3-pin (+5V) for A-RGB lighting<strong>Compatibility</strong>ArchitectureUniversal mounting for Intel (LGA 1700/1200/115x); AMD (AM5/AM4)<strong>Power Profile</strong>Energy Efficiency3.36 W fan power; 1.05 W LED power<strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong>Reliability1-year manufacturer warranty</p>', 'CPU Cooler', 2600.00, 2600.00, NULL, 34, 'products/thumbnails/yDtSOGxna7geroFzrzCGx1KGVpFiZcur8FsGzxe3.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 14:43:02', '2026-06-14 14:43:02', 'DeepCool AG400 ARGB 120mm Single Tower CPU Cooler', 'Experience powerful 220W cooling with the DeepCool AG400 ARGB. Features direct-contact heatpipes, 2000 RPM PWM fan, and customizable A-RGB lighting. Supports Intel/AMD.', 'DeepCool AG400 ARGB, A-RGB CPU cooler, 120mm air cooler, LGA 1700 air cooler, AM5 CPU cooler, high-performance air cooler, 220W TDP cooling, direct touch heat pipes, gaming CPU coo', NULL, 31, NULL, NULL);
