(674, 'DeepCool GAMMAXX AG400 WH ARGB 120mm CPU Cooler', 'The DeepCool AG400 ARGB is a high-performance, single-tower 120mm air cooler designed for gamers and enthusiasts who demand efficient thermal management and vibrant aesthetics. Featuring four direct-contact 6mm heatpipes and a high-static-pressure PWM fan, it effectively dissipates up to 220W of heat while maintaining a quiet acoustic profile ($\\leq 31.6$ dB(A)). With its integrated 5V A-RGB lighting, universal Intel/AMD socket compatibility, and streamlined installation process, this cooler provides the perfect balance of cooling power, visual impact, and reliable long-term performance.', 'deepcool-gammaxx-ag400-wh-argb-120mm-cpu-cooler-1781448261', '<p>The DeepCool AG400 ARGB is engineered for those who refuse to compromise between high-tier thermal performance and modern build aesthetics. At the core of the cooler is a quad-heatpipe design that makes direct contact with the CPU, rapidly transferring heat into a dense aluminum fin array. This architecture is complemented by a 120mm hydro-bearing fan that dynamically scales from 500 to 2000 RPM, ensuring that your processor remains stable whether you are idle or pushing the system during intensive gaming or creative sessions.</p><p>Illumination is a standout feature of the AG400 ARGB, which includes a customizable 5V A-RGB LED system. This allows users to sync lighting effects with their motherboard or other system components, elevating the overall look of the PC build. Despite this high performance and visual flair, the cooler remains remarkably efficient and quiet, operating at a maximum noise level of $\\leq 31.6$ dB(A).</p><p>Designed with the builder in mind, the AG400 ARGB features a user-friendly installation process that ensures a secure, high-pressure fit across a broad range of Intel and AMD platforms, including LGA 1700 and AM5. The compact 150mm height and optimized dimensions ensure compatibility with most mid-tower chassis while maintaining excellent clearance for memory modules. Backed by a 1-year manufacturer warranty, the DeepCool AG400 ARGB is a dependable, stylish, and powerful thermal upgrade for any modern system.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Thermal Engine</strong></td><td>Heat Dissipation</td><td>4x 6mm direct-contact heatpipes for rapid thermal transfer</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>PWM Dynamics</td><td>120mm Hydro Bearing fan; 500–2000 RPM (±10%)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Airflow &amp; Pressure</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>75.89 CFM throughput at 2.53 mmAq static pressure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Profile</strong></td><td>Noise Management</td><td>$\\leq 31.6$ dB(A) for balanced performance-to-noise ratio</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Illumination</strong></td><td>Visuals</td><td>Integrated 5V A-RGB lighting (3-pin connector)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Form Factor</td><td>125 x 92 x 150 mm tower; 614g total weight</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>4-pin PWM for fan; 3-pin (+5V) for A-RGB lighting</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Universal mounting for Intel (LGA 1700/1200/115x); AMD (AM5/AM4)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Profile</strong></td><td>Energy Efficiency</td><td>2.04 W fan power; 1.05 W LED power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>1-year manufacturer warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'CPU Cooler', 3000.00, 3000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/a3QRws2fXfWvzsjNJ6F66PeKV5CG1NjBOZ8bypKb.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 14:44:21', '2026-06-14 14:44:34', 'DeepCool AG400 ARGB 120mm Single Tower CPU Cooler', 'Experience powerful cooling with the DeepCool AG400 ARGB. Features direct-contact heatpipes, 2000 RPM PWM fan, and customizable A-RGB lighting. Supports Intel/AMD.', ': DeepCool AG400 ARGB, A-RGB CPU cooler, 120mm air cooler, LGA 1700 air cooler, AM5 CPU cooler, high-performance air cooler, direct touch heat pipes, gaming CPU cooler', NULL, 31, NULL, NULL),
(675, 'DeepCool AG500 120mm Single Tower CPU Cooler', 'The High-Performance 5-Heatpipe Tower Cooler is a professional-grade air cooling solution engineered for stability and thermal efficiency. Featuring a robust five-heatpipe architecture (Ø6 mm each) and a high-static-pressure 120mm PWM fan, it effectively manages heat for mainstream high-TDP processors. With an optimized 155mm height, 100% RAM compatibility, and a quiet operating threshold of $\\leq 29.4$ dB(A), this cooler offers a reliable, balanced thermal upgrade for both high-end gaming rigs and professional workstations.', 'deepcool-ag500-120mm-single-tower-cpu-cooler-1781448360', '<p><strong>Cooler</strong> delivers exceptional heat dissipation capability. By integrating five high-conductivity heatpipes into its design, the cooler ensures rapid thermal transfer from the CPU die to a large-surface-area fin stack. This dense array allows the system to remain cool under sustained loads, such as heavy multi-tasking, 3D rendering, or high-framerate gaming, while maintaining structural integrity with its solid 861g build.</p><p>The cooling system is powered by a high-efficiency 120mm hydro-bearing fan, operating within a PWM-controlled range of 300 to 1850 RPM. This versatility allows the cooler to deliver up to 67.88 CFM of airflow when performance is needed, while reverting to near-silent operation (max $\\leq 29.4$ dB(A)) during idle periods or light tasks. The 2.04 mmAq of static pressure ensures that airflow is pushed effectively through the fin stack, preventing heat soak even in compact chassis.</p><p>Designed for broad compatibility and ease of use, this cooler supports the latest Intel (LGA 1700/1200/115x) and AMD (AM5/AM4) platforms. Its dimensions—125 x 95 x 155 mm—are optimized for wide chassis compatibility, and the sturdy mounting hardware ensures secure contact pressure. Backed by a 1-year manufacturer warranty, this cooler is a focused, high-value choice for any modern desktop build that demands efficiency, longevity, and professional performance.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Thermal Engine</strong></td><td>Heat Dissipation</td><td>5x 6mm high-efficiency heatpipes for superior thermal transfer</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>PWM Dynamics</td><td>120mm Hydro Bearing fan; 300–1850 RPM (±10%)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Airflow Capacity</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>67.88 CFM airflow with 2.04 mmAq static pressure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Profile</strong></td><td>Noise Management</td><td>$\\leq 29.4$ dB(A) for balanced performance-to-noise ratio</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Form Factor</td><td>125 x 95 x 155 mm tower; 861g total weight</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>Standard 4-pin PWM connector for motherboard-controlled fan curves</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Universal mounting for Intel (LGA 1700/1200/115x); AMD (AM5/AM4)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>1-year manufacturer warranty for dependable support</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 2500.00, 2500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/fddZQCNd7oLipRe2xY4pcXbgdOxJ8QA0BuVsBVuY.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 14:46:00', '2026-06-14 14:46:00', 'High-Performance 5-Heatpipe Tower CPU Cooler', 'Maximize your CPU performance with our 5-heatpipe tower cooler. Features 1850 RPM PWM fan, 67.88 CFM airflow, and Intel/AMD socket support.', '5-heatpipe CPU cooler, tower air cooler, 120mm CPU fan, LGA 1700 cooler, AM5 air cooler, high-performance air cooler, quiet PC cooling, CPU heat management, 1850 RPM cooler', NULL, 31, NULL, NULL),
(676, 'DeepCool AK400 WH Performance CPU Air Cooler', 'The DeepCool AK400 WH is a high-performance, white-themed single-tower CPU cooler engineered for efficiency and broad compatibility. Featuring four direct-contact copper heatpipes and a specialized matrix fin stack, it effectively dissipates up to 220W of heat. Equipped with a high-performance Fluid Dynamic Bearing (FDB) fan, it offers a sophisticated balance of powerful 66.47 CFM airflow and whisper-quiet operation ($\\leq 29$ dB(A)), making it an ideal choice for clean, minimalist builds requiring reliable thermal management for modern Intel and AMD processors.', 'deepcool-ak400-wh-performance-cpu-air-cooler-1781448449', '<p>The DeepCool AK400 WH is a precision-engineered thermal solution that combines professional-grade performance with a sleek, all-white aesthetic. At its core, the cooler utilizes four high-conductivity copper heatpipes that make direct contact with the CPU, rapidly drawing thermal energy away from the processor and into its advanced matrix-array fin stack. This unique architecture maximizes surface area for improved heat exchange, ensuring your system remains cool and stable even during sustained workloads.</p><p>Performance is managed by a high-efficiency FDB fan that dynamically adjusts its speed between 500 and 1850 RPM based on real-time thermal demands. This allows the AK400 WH to provide aggressive cooling when under load while maintaining silent, energy-efficient operation during idle or light tasks. With an acoustic profile limited to just $\\leq 29$ dB(A), it ensures that your workspace remains distraction-free.</p><p>Designed with builder convenience in mind, the AK400 WH features a robust mounting system that supports a wide range of modern Intel (LGA 1700/1200/115x) and AMD (AM5/AM4) platforms. Its 155mm height and compact tower profile ensure excellent clearance for RAM and other motherboard components, making it versatile enough for mid-tower and compact builds alike. Backed by an industry-leading 3-year warranty, the DeepCool AK400 WH is a dependable, high-value thermal foundation for any system builder focusing on performance and clean, modern aesthetics.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Thermal Engine</strong></td><td>Heat Dissipation</td><td>4x Direct-contact copper heatpipes with matrix fin architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Power</strong></td><td>Capacity</td><td>Rated for up to 220W of heat dissipation</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>PWM Dynamics</td><td>120mm Fluid Dynamic Bearing (FDB) fan; 500–1850 RPM (±10%)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Airflow Capacity</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>66.47 CFM throughput at 2.04 mmAq static pressure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Profile</strong></td><td>Noise Management</td><td>$\\leq 29$ dB(A) for optimal silent-performance ratio</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Form Factor</td><td>127 x 97 x 155 mm tower dimensions for broad clearance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Weight</strong></td><td>Build Quality</td><td>661g total weight for stability and high-pressure contact</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>Standard 4-pin PWM connector for motherboard-controlled curves</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Universal mounting for Intel (LGA 1700/1200/115x); AMD (AM5/AM4)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>3-year manufacturer warranty for long-term peace of mind</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 3100.00, 3100.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/iABWlTnhhYN3osc53h6FgcpV8T0yTbJU2YMFEr9y.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 14:47:29', '2026-06-14 14:47:47', 'DeepCool AK400 WH Performance CPU Air Cooler | White Edition', 'Cool your system with the DeepCool AK400 WH. Features a matrix fin stack, 4 direct-contact heatpipes, and a silent FDB fan. Supports Intel LGA 1700 and AMD AM5. 3-year warranty.', 'DeepCool AK400 WH, white CPU cooler, AK400 white, 120mm air cooler, LGA 1700 air cooler, AM5 CPU cooler, high-performance air cooler, FDB fan cooler, silent CPU cooler, 220W TDP cooling', NULL, 31, NULL, NULL),
(677, 'Deepcool AG400 DIGITAL CPU Cooler', 'The DeepCool AG400 DIGITAL is a next-generation single-tower air cooler featuring an integrated crystal-clear digital status display for real-time CPU temperature and usage monitoring. Built upon the robust thermal performance of the AG400, it utilizes four direct-touch copper heatpipes and a high-performance 120mm PWM fan to dissipate heat efficiently while operating at a quiet $\\leq 31.6$ dB(A). With a dedicated high-temperature warning system, broad socket compatibility (including Intel LGA 1700 and AMD AM5), and a sleek matrix fin design, the AG400 DIGITAL combines essential system monitoring with powerful cooling, making it a perfect upgrade for performance-driven builds.', 'deepcool-ag400-digital-cpu-cooler-1781448547', '<p>The DeepCool AG400 DIGITAL elevates standard air cooling by blending exceptional thermal engineering with vital system telemetry. At its heart, a low-profile digital display provides instant, accurate feedback on your CPU’s performance, offering peace of mind with a built-in high-temperature warning system. This intuitive feature, managed via a simple USB 2.0 header connection, allows users to keep a close eye on their system\'s thermal health without the need for intrusive third-party software.</p><p>Thermal management is handled by a dense matrix fin tower coupled with four direct-touch copper heatpipes, which aggressively pull heat away from the processor to maintain stability under heavy workloads. The cooling power is delivered by a robust 120mm hydro-bearing fan, capable of reaching 2100 RPM to generate 75.89 CFM of airflow. Despite its impressive performance, the fan is tuned for efficiency, ensuring that high-load cooling remains within a comfortable 31.6 dB(A) noise threshold.</p><p>Durability and compatibility are foundational to the AG400 DIGITAL. With support for a vast array of modern Intel and AMD platforms—including LGA 2066/1700 and AM5/AM4—it is an ideal solution for both the latest flagship gaming rigs and reliable workstation upgrades. Weighing 1040g, the cooler provides a solid, premium feel, and its design maximizes surface area for optimized heat dissipation. Backed by a 1-year manufacturer warranty, this cooler is not just a thermal component; it is an essential diagnostic and performance tool for the modern enthusiast.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Digital Interface</strong></td><td>Monitoring</td><td>Integrated digital status display for real-time CPU temp/usage</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Safety Features</strong></td><td>Protection</td><td>High-temperature warning system integrated into digital screen</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Engine</strong></td><td>Heat Dissipation</td><td>4x 6mm direct-touch heatpipes with matrix-array fin stack</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>PWM Dynamics</td><td>120mm Hydro Bearing fan; 500–2100 RPM (±10%)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Airflow Capacity</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>75.89 CFM throughput at 2.53 mmAq static pressure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Profile</strong></td><td>Noise Management</td><td>$\\leq 31.6$ dB(A) for optimal performance-to-noise ratio</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Form Factor</td><td>127 x 117 x 158 mm; 1040g robust build</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>4-pin PWM for fan; USB 2.0 header for digital display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Intel (LGA 2066/2011/1700/1200/115x); AMD (AM5/AM4)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>1-year manufacturer warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'CPU Cooler', 3200.00, 3200.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/1zYSdgonUTIojtBRuSh0aiH8cbtoWyJk843xQenn.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 14:49:07', '2026-06-14 14:49:07', 'DeepCool AG400 DIGITAL CPU Cooler | Digital Display Air Cooler', 'Monitor your system with the DeepCool AG400 DIGITAL. Features a real-time temp display, 2100 RPM PWM fan, and 4-heatpipe performance. Supports Intel/AMD.\r\n\r\nMeta Keywords: DeepCool AG400 DIGITAL, CPU cooler with display, digital CPU cooler, LGA', 'DeepCool AG400 DIGITAL, CPU cooler with display, digital CPU cooler, LGA 1700 air cooler, AM5 CPU cooler, performance air cooler, real-time temp monitoring, 120mm air cooler, gaming CPU cooling', NULL, 31, NULL, NULL),
(678, 'DeepCool AG400 BK ARGB V2 120mm CPU Air Cooler', 'The DeepCool AG400 BK ARGB V2 is a refined, high-performance single-tower 120mm air cooler featuring a sleek black finish and vibrant Addressable RGB (A-RGB) lighting. Engineered for modern Intel (LGA 1851/1700/1200) and AMD (AM5/AM4) platforms, it utilizes four 6mm direct-contact heatpipes to deliver robust thermal management for high-TDP gaming and productivity systems. With a dynamic 2100 RPM PWM fan, a balanced noise profile ($\\leq 31.6$ dB(A)), and a compact 154mm height, it provides a powerful, aesthetically striking, and reliable cooling upgrade for enthusiasts demanding both style and substance.', 'deepcool-ag400-bk-argb-v2-120mm-cpu-air-cooler-1781448633', '<p>Building on the success of the AG400 series, the <strong>DeepCool AG400 BK ARGB V2</strong> introduces enhanced performance and aesthetic refinements for today’s PC builders. Designed with a striking all-black theme, this cooler features a dense matrix fin stack and four high-conductivity heatpipes that efficiently pull heat away from the processor to ensure peak thermal stability. Whether you are gaming, content creating, or multitasking, the AG400 BK ARGB V2 maintains consistent performance even under heavy loads.</p><p>The cooling system is powered by a high-output 120mm PWM fan that scales from 500 up to 2100 RPM, capable of producing 75.89 CFM of airflow at 2.53 mmAq of static pressure. This ensures rapid heat dissipation through the fin stack while maintaining a manageable acoustic output of $\\leq 31.6$ dB(A), providing an ideal environment for focused work or immersive gaming. The integrated 5V A-RGB lighting system—controllable via your motherboard’s 3-pin (+5V-D-G) header—allows for fully customizable, synchronized lighting effects, transforming your PC into a centerpiece.</p><p>Designed for broad versatility, the AG400 BK ARGB V2 supports the latest Intel sockets, including the new LGA 1851, alongside traditional Intel and AMD platforms. Its compact 125 x 92 x 154 mm dimensions provide wide chassis compatibility and excellent RAM clearance, preventing component interference. Weighing 643g and backed by a 1-year manufacturer warranty, this cooler is a dependable, stylish, and high-value foundation for any modern desktop build.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Thermal Engine</strong></td><td>Heat Dissipation</td><td>4x 6mm direct-contact heatpipes with optimized fin architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>PWM Dynamics</td><td>120mm fan; 500–2100 RPM (±10%) speed range</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Airflow Capacity</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>75.89 CFM throughput at 2.53 mmAq static pressure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Profile</strong></td><td>Noise Management</td><td>$\\leq 31.6$ dB(A) for balanced performance-to-noise ratio</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Illumination</strong></td><td>Visuals</td><td>Integrated 5V A-RGB lighting with 3-pin motherboard sync</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Form Factor</td><td>125 x 92 x 154 mm tower; 643g total weight</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>4-pin PWM for fan control; 3-pin (+5V) for A-RGB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Intel (LGA 1851/1700/1200/115x); AMD (AM5/AM4)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>1-year manufacturer warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'CPU Cooler', 3000.00, 3000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/qqs9YzjAGFZaRZis8LpY0kKyVPI0HLtTpGT0YDev.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 14:50:33', '2026-06-14 14:50:33', 'DeepCool AG400 BK ARGB V2 CPU Air Cooler', 'Upgrade your build with the DeepCool AG400 BK ARGB V2. Features a 2100 RPM PWM fan, 75.89 CFM airflow, A-RGB lighting, and LGA 1851 support.', 'DeepCool AG400 BK ARGB V2, black CPU cooler, A-RGB air cooler, LGA 1851 CPU cooler, AM5 air cooler, 2100 RPM fan, performance PC cooling, 120mm air cooler, gaming CPU fan', NULL, 31, NULL, NULL),
(679, 'DeepCool AG400 WH ARGB V2 120mm CPU Air Cooler', 'The DeepCool AG400 WH ARGB V2 is a high-performance, single-tower 120mm air cooler featuring a clean, white-themed aesthetic and vibrant Addressable RGB (A-RGB) lighting. Engineered for versatility, it supports the latest Intel (LGA 1851/1700/1200) and AMD (AM5/AM4) platforms. With four 6mm direct-contact heatpipes, a dynamic 2100 RPM PWM fan, and a compact 154mm height, it delivers robust thermal management for high-TDP processors while maintaining whisper-quiet operation ($\\leq 31.6$ dB(A)), making it an ideal choice for stylish, high-performance PC builds.', 'deepcool-ag400-wh-argb-v2-120mm-cpu-air-cooler-1781448729', '<p>The DeepCool AG400 WH ARGB V2 represents a refined evolution in thermal cooling, blending professional-grade performance with a crisp, minimalist white design. Optimized for gaming rigs and productivity workstations, the cooler utilizes four high-conductivity heatpipes that make direct contact with the CPU, ensuring rapid thermal transfer into the dense matrix fin stack. This architecture provides the necessary thermal headroom for sustained heavy workloads, ensuring your system remains stable and responsive.</p><p>Cooling is driven by a high-efficiency 120mm PWM fan that scales from 500 to 2100 RPM, producing an impressive 75.89 CFM of airflow at 2.53 mmAq static pressure. The fan is meticulously balanced to provide aggressive cooling when under load while minimizing noise to a comfortable ≤31.6 dB(A) during lighter tasks. The integrated 5V A-RGB lighting system adds a visually stunning element to your build, easily synchronized with your motherboard via a standard 3-pin (+5V-D-G) header for fully customizable light effects.</p><p>Designed for builder-friendly installation, the AG400 WH ARGB V2 offers broad socket support, including the cutting-edge Intel LGA 1851 platform. Its compact 125 x 92 x 154 mm dimensions ensure excellent compatibility with most mid-tower chassis and offer superior RAM clearance. Weighing just 643g, it is both lightweight and durable, providing a secure, high-pressure mount for long-term reliability. Backed by a 1-year manufacturer warranty, this cooler is a top-tier choice for enthusiasts who demand high-end efficiency and a standout white-themed aesthetic.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Thermal Engine</strong></td><td>Heat Dissipation</td><td>4x 6mm direct-contact heatpipes with matrix fin architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>PWM Dynamics</td><td>120mm fan; 500–2100 RPM (±10%) speed range</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Airflow Capacity</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>75.89 CFM throughput at 2.53 mmAq static pressure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Profile</strong></td><td>Noise Management</td><td>$\\leq 31.6$ dB(A) for balanced performance-to-noise ratio</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Illumination</strong></td><td>Visuals</td><td>Integrated 5V A-RGB lighting (3-pin motherboard sync)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Form Factor</td><td>125 x 92 x 154 mm tower; 643g total weight</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>4-pin PWM (fan); 3-pin +5V (A-RGB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Intel (LGA 1851/1700/1200/115x); AMD (AM5/AM4)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>1-year manufacturer warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 3100.00, 3100.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/28tdn3iz0VHJVUTZMwXstakbdJAcklVQmaqey3Vr.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 14:52:09', '2026-06-14 14:52:09', 'DeepCool AG400 WH ARGB V2 White CPU Air Cooler', 'ool your white PC build with the DeepCool AG400 WH ARGB V2. Features a 2100 RPM PWM fan, 75.89 CFM airflow, and A-RGB lighting. Supports LGA 1851 and AM5.', ': DeepCool AG400 WH ARGB V2, white CPU cooler, A-RGB air cooler, LGA 1851 CPU cooler, AM5 air cooler, performance PC cooling, 2100 RPM fan, 120mm white air cooler, gaming CPU fan', NULL, 31, NULL, NULL),
(680, 'DeepCool AK400 ZERO DARK CPU Cooler', 'The DeepCool AK400 ZERO DARK is a stealthy, high-performance CPU air cooler featuring an all-black design that provides a premium, minimalist look for any PC build. Built with a high-efficiency 120mm Fluid Dynamic Bearing (FDB) fan and a robust tower heatsink, it delivers exceptional thermal management with up to 66.47 CFM of airflow. Operating at a near-silent noise level of $\\leq 29$ dB(A), it offers the perfect balance of cooling power and acoustic comfort for modern Intel and AMD platforms, backed by a generous 3-year warranty for long-term peace of mind.', 'deepcool-ak400-zero-dark-cpu-cooler-1781448826', '<p>The DeepCool AK400 ZERO DARK is a specialized thermal solution for users who value both superior cooling performance and a clean, monochromatic aesthetic. Finished in a deep, all-black coating, this cooler is designed to blend seamlessly into \"blackout\" PC builds while providing the reliability expected of the AK series. At its core, the heatsink is optimized for maximum heat transfer, ensuring your CPU maintains stable temperatures even during intensive gaming or creative workflows.</p><p>Thermal performance is managed by a high-quality 120mm FDB fan, which operates with precision between 500 and 1850 RPM. This wide PWM-controlled range allows the system to remain whisper-quiet during everyday tasks while ramping up to provide aggressive cooling when the system is pushed to its limits. The Fluid Dynamic Bearing technology significantly extends the fan\'s lifespan and minimizes operational vibration, ensuring a smooth and quiet computing experience.</p><p>Designed with versatility in mind, the AK400 ZERO DARK supports a wide array of modern CPU sockets, including Intel\'s LGA 1700/1200 series and AMD\'s AM5/AM4 platforms. Its 155mm height and compact tower profile make it highly compatible with the majority of mid-tower chassis, providing ample clearance for RAM modules and other motherboard components. Backed by a 3-year manufacturer warranty, the DeepCool AK400 ZERO DARK stands as a durable, stylish, and high-value thermal foundation for any serious desktop build.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Thermal Engine</strong></td><td>Heat Dissipation</td><td>High-performance tower heatsink optimized for air-flow dynamics</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>PWM Dynamics</td><td>120mm FDB fan; 500–1850 RPM (±10%) speed range</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Airflow Capacity</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>66.47 CFM throughput at 2.04 mmAq static pressure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Profile</strong></td><td>Noise Management</td><td>$\\leq 29$ dB(A) for optimal performance-to-noise ratio</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Form Factor</td><td>127 x 97 x 155 mm tower; 661g total weight</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design Aesthetics</strong></td><td>Visuals</td><td>All-black \"ZERO DARK\" finish for stealthy, professional builds</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>Standard 4-pin PWM connector for dynamic motherboard control</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Universal mounting for Intel (LGA 1700/1200/115x); AMD (AM5/AM4)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>3-year manufacturer warranty for long-term coverage</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 3500.00, 3500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/TwuawZaJfbY7xGXjMstQbkm0QePwKsyS45ZtKcp4.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 14:53:46', '2026-06-14 14:53:46', 'DeepCool AK400 ZERO DARK CPU Cooler | Black Performance Air Cooler', 'chieve stealthy cooling with the DeepCool AK400 ZERO DARK. Features an all-black design, 1850 RPM PWM fan, 66.47 CFM airflow, and a 3-year warra', 'DeepCool AK400 ZERO DARK, black CPU cooler, AK400 dark, 120mm air cooler, LGA 1700 air cooler, AM5 CPU cooler, performance air cooler, silent CPU cooler, stealth PC build, 3 year warranty cooler', NULL, 31, NULL, NULL),
(681, 'DeepCool AK400 ZERO DARK PLUS CPU Cooler', 'The DeepCool AK400 ZERO DARK PLUS is a premium, all-black dual-fan CPU cooler designed for high-performance thermal management and a sleek, stealthy aesthetic. Equipped with four 6mm direct-touch copper heatpipes and dual Fluid Dynamic Bearing (FDB) fans, it provides up to 220W of heat dissipation capacity while maintaining a whisper-quiet acoustic profile of $\\leq 28$ dB(A). With its 100% RAM compatibility, simplified five-step installation, and universal support for modern Intel and AMD platforms, this cooler is an elite thermal upgrade for systems demanding both silent efficiency and a refined, professional look.', 'deepcool-ak400-zero-dark-plus-cpu-cooler-1781448953', '<p>The DeepCool AK400 ZERO DARK PLUS is a high-capacity thermal solution that marries robust engineering with an aggressive, all-black finish. Every surface, from the dense matrix-array fin stack to the dual high-performance fans, is finished in a premium matte black, making it the perfect choice for \"blackout\" PC builds. Beneath its striking exterior, the cooler utilizes four direct-touch copper heatpipes that rapidly channel heat away from the CPU die, ensuring reliable temperature control for today\'s mainstream processors.</p><p>The dual-fan configuration is the heart of the AK400 ZERO DARK PLUS’s performance. The two FDB fans operate dynamically between 500 and 1650 RPM, allowing for impressive airflow (59.46 CFM) under heavy computational loads while intelligently ramping down to near-silent levels during idle states. The Fluid Dynamic Bearing design ensures long-term operational stability and minimizes mechanical vibration, further enhancing the cooler\'s quiet acoustic signature.</p><p>Designed for builder efficiency, the AK400 ZERO DARK PLUS utilizes a robust, all-metal mounting bracket system that facilitates a secure, high-pressure fit across a wide range of platforms, including Intel LGA 1700/1200 and AMD AM5/AM4. Its compact 155mm height and optimized tower dimensions offer excellent hardware clearance, ensuring compatibility with most mid-tower cases and high-profile memory kits. Backed by a 3-year manufacturer warranty, this cooler is a sophisticated, high-performance thermal foundation designed to protect your components and maintain peak system stability for years to come.</p><h3><strong>Technical Breakdown</strong></h3>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Thermal Engine</strong></td><td>Heat Dissipation</td><td>4x 6mm direct-touch copper heatpipes with matrix fin architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Power</strong></td><td>Capacity</td><td>Rated for up to 220W of heat dissipation</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>PWM Dynamics</td><td>Dual 120mm FDB fans; 500–1650 RPM (±10%)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Airflow Capacity</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>59.46 CFM throughput at 1.62 mmAq static pressure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Profile</strong></td><td>Noise Management</td><td>$\\leq 28$ dB(A) for elite silent-performance ratio</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Form Factor</td><td>127 x 123 x 155 mm tower; 802g total weight</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>Standard 4-pin PWM connector for motherboard control</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Universal mounting for Intel (LGA 1700/1200/115x); AMD (AM5/AM4)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>3-year manufacturer warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 3900.00, 3900.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/EiDWpsmGrKZPtT4n12VCkL4lDR2tUFYNu9iT6CdW.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 14:55:53', '2026-06-14 15:33:52', 'DeepCool AK400 ZERO DARK PLUS Dual-Fan CPU Cooler', 'xperience stealthy 220W cooling with the DeepCool AK400 ZERO DARK PLUS. Features dual FDB fans, all-black design, and 3-year warranty. Supports Intel/AMD.', 'DeepCool AK400 ZERO DARK PLUS, dual fan CPU cooler, all-black CPU cooler, 120mm air cooler, LGA 1700 air cooler, AM5 CPU cooler, performance air cooler, silent CPU cooling, FDB fan cooler, 220W TDP cooling', NULL, 31, NULL, NULL),
(682, 'Deepcool GAMMAXX L120 V2 RGB Liquid CPU Cooler', 'The RGB 120mm Liquid CPU Cooler is an efficient all-in-one (AIO) thermal solution designed to provide reliable cooling for modern high-performance processors. Featuring a 120mm aluminum radiator, a high-pressure 1800 RPM hydro-bearing fan, and a dedicated RGB-illuminated pump, it offers excellent heat dissipation for both gaming and workstation builds. With ultra-quiet pump operation ($\\leq 17.8$ dB(A)), extensive socket support (including Intel LGA 1700 and AMD AM5), and a solid 3-year warranty, this liquid cooler is a dependable, stylish upgrade for those seeking a compact yet powerful thermal management system.', 'deepcool-gammaxx-l120-v2-rgb-liquid-cpu-cooler-1781449064', '<p>The <strong>RGB 120mm Liquid CPU Cooler</strong> is engineered to provide superior heat management in a compact form factor, making it an ideal choice for systems where space is at a premium but thermal performance cannot be sacrificed. At its heart, a high-efficiency water block with an integrated RGB-illuminated pump ensures rapid heat extraction from the CPU, while the 120mm aluminum radiator offers a large surface area for heat dispersion, keeping your components stable even during intensive computing sessions.</p><p>Designed with silence in mind, the pump operates at an incredibly low 17.8 dB(A), ensuring that your system remains whisper-quiet. The included 120mm PWM fan features an optimized blade design to push 69.34 CFM of airflow at 2.42 mmAq of static pressure, providing the necessary cooling force to keep your processor cool under load. The fluid dynamic (hydro) bearing technology employed in both the pump and fan guarantees a long, quiet, and reliable lifespan.</p><p>Installation is versatile and secure, featuring broad compatibility with current Intel and AMD platforms, including Intel’s latest LGA 1700 and AMD’s AM5 sockets. The classic RGB lighting, controlled via a standard 4-pin 12V header, integrates seamlessly with most motherboard lighting ecosystems, allowing you to synchronize your build’s aesthetic. Backed by a 3-year manufacturer warranty, this liquid cooler offers a perfect blend of high-end cooling performance, whisper-quiet acoustics, and modern visual style for your desktop PC.</p>', '<ol><li><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Thermal Dynamics</td><td>AIO Liquid cooler with aluminum 120mm radiator</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>PWM Dynamics</td><td>120mm Hydro Bearing fan; 500–1800 RPM (±10%)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Airflow Capacity</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>69.34 CFM throughput at 2.42 mmAq static pressure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Profile</strong></td><td>Noise Management</td><td>Pump: 17.8 dB(A); Fan: $\\leq 30$ dB(A)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Illumination</strong></td><td>Visuals</td><td>Integrated RGB lighting (4-pin +12V connector)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Radiator: 159 x 120 x 27 mm; Pump: 91 x 79 x 47 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>3-pin (Pump), 4-pin PWM (Fan), 4-pin +12V (RGB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Universal mounting for Intel (LGA 2066/1700/1200/115x); AMD (AM5/AM4)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>3-year manufacturer warranty for long-term coverage</td></tr></tbody></table></figure></li></ol>', 'CPU Cooler', 4100.00, 4100.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/iQU529TKg8HbS0vowalqHSC7jJnFeYLFRlL0l0GM.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 14:57:44', '2026-06-14 14:57:44', '120mm RGB Liquid CPU Cooler | AIO Thermal Solution', 'Efficient 120mm RGB liquid CPU cooler with 1800 RPM PWM fan, ultra-quiet pump, and broad Intel/AMD socket support. 3-year warranty included.', '120mm liquid cooler, AIO CPU cooler, RGB liquid cooling, Intel LGA 1700 liquid cooler, AMD AM5 liquid cooler, quiet AIO cooler, CPU thermal management, 1800 RPM fan, 3 year warranty liquid cooler', NULL, 31, NULL, NULL),
(683, 'DeepCool AK400 G2 Wood Grain Air CPU Cooler', 'The High-Static Pressure Tower Cooler is a robust thermal solution engineered for high-demand Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4) processors. Featuring four 6mm heatpipes and a high-performance PWM fan capable of 3.33 mmAq static pressure, it is specifically designed to excel in dense, high-resistance fin stacks. With a balanced 31.45 dB(A) noise profile, a sturdy 950g build, and a 3-year manufacturer warranty, this cooler provides the reliable, heavy-duty cooling performance required for demanding gaming rigs and professional content creation systems.', 'deepcool-ak400-g2-wood-grain-air-cpu-cooler-1781449142', '<p>Engineered for stability and extreme thermal efficiency, the <strong>High-Static Pressure Tower Cooler</strong> stands out as a performance-oriented upgrade for modern desktop builds. By utilizing four Ø6 mm heatpipes to provide rapid heat extraction from the CPU, the cooler ensures that thermal energy is evenly distributed across a large-surface-area heatsink. Its advanced fan architecture, reaching speeds up to 2200 RPM, generates a substantial 3.33 mmAq of static pressure—crucial for maintaining airflow efficiency through densely packed fins and chassis obstructions.</p><p>Despite its powerful cooling capacity, the system remains controlled and acoustically balanced, with a maximum noise output of $\\leq 31.45$ dB(A). The PWM-controlled fan allows for granular speed adjustments, ensuring the system remains quiet during everyday productivity while ramping up instantly to meet the cooling demands of intense rendering, overclocking, or gaming sessions.</p><p>Built with durability in mind, the cooler boasts a substantial 950g weight, signaling a robust construction that facilitates optimal contact pressure between the cold plate and the CPU IHS. Compatibility is comprehensive, supporting the latest Intel LGA 1851 and AMD AM5 platforms alongside legacy sockets. This thermal solution is backed by a 3-year warranty, reflecting a commitment to long-term reliability and ensuring that your PC’s hardware remains cool, stable, and protected under the most rigorous conditions.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Thermal Engine</strong></td><td>Heat Dissipation</td><td>4x 6mm direct-touch heatpipes for rapid thermal transfer</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Dynamics</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>120mm PWM fan; up to 2200 RPM (±10%)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Airflow Capacity</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>63.4 CFM throughput with 3.33 mmAq static pressure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Profile</strong></td><td>Noise Management</td><td>$\\leq 31.45$ dB(A) for balanced performance-to-noise ratio</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Form Factor</td><td>132 x 92 x 156 mm tower; 950g total weight</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>Standard 4-pin PWM connector for motherboard fan control</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Intel (LGA 1851/1700/1200/115x); AMD (AM5/AM4)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>3-year manufacturer warranty for long-term support</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'CPU Cooler', 3700.00, 3700.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/XXaRKKmnyjr89s76atpt0CdcRVbRZ6RyLJ7rNApn.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 14:59:02', '2026-06-14 14:59:02', 'High-Static Pressure 120mm CPU Tower Cooler', 'High-Static Pressure 120mm CPU TowExperience extreme cooling with our 4-heatpipe tower cooler. Features 2200 RPM fan, 3.33 mmAq static pressure, and LGA 1851/AM5 support. 3-year warranty.er Cooler', 'Experience extreme cooling with our 4-heatpipe tower cooler. Features 2200 RPM fan, 3.33 mmAq static pressure, and LGA 1851/AM5 support. 3-year warranty.', NULL, 31, NULL, NULL),
(684, 'DeepCool AK400 G2 WH Wood Grain Air CPU Cooler', 'The DeepCool AK400 G2 WH Wood Grain is a distinctive, second-generation single-tower air cooler that merges high-efficiency thermal management with a unique, premium aesthetic. Featuring a clean white finish accented by a sophisticated wood grain pattern, this cooler utilizes four 6mm copper heatpipes and a powerful 2200 RPM hydro-bearing fan to provide robust cooling for modern Intel (LGA 1851/1700) and AMD (AM5/AM4) processors. Combining 63.4 CFM of high-static-pressure airflow with a balanced 31.45 dB(A) noise profile, it offers a perfect fusion of performance, reliability, and artistic design for enthusiasts seeking a standout look for their PC builds.', 'deepcool-ak400-g2-wh-wood-grain-air-cpu-cooler-1781449238', '<p>The DeepCool AK400 G2 WH Wood Grain redefines the visual identity of PC cooling. As part of the highly acclaimed AK400 G2 lineup, this second-generation cooler is designed for users who prioritize both thermal excellence and a bespoke, premium appearance. The stark white chassis, complemented by the refined wood grain top-cover, transforms the cooler from a standard component into a centerpiece for any gaming rig or creative workstation.</p><p>Beneath the artistic exterior lies a formidable cooling engine. Four high-efficiency copper heatpipes make direct contact with the CPU, ensuring rapid thermal extraction into a dense matrix fin stack. This is paired with a high-performance 120mm hydro-bearing fan capable of reaching 2200 RPM. Engineered for high-resistance environments, the fan generates an impressive 3.33 mmAq of static pressure, guaranteeing consistent airflow even in compact cases with limited intake.</p><p>Ease of integration is a hallmark of the G2 series. The AK400 G2 WH provides universal mounting support for the latest Intel platforms, including the LGA 1851 socket, alongside AMD’s AM5/AM4 infrastructure. Its optimized 156mm height ensures high compatibility with standard mid-tower cases, while the 950g build quality speaks to its robust, long-term durability. Backed by a 3-year manufacturer warranty, this cooler is not only a functional asset for cooling high-TDP CPUs but also a long-term investment in a unique, high-value build aesthetic.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th><th>Specification Details</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Thermal Engine</strong></td><td>Heat Dissipation</td><td>4x 6mm copper heatpipes with matrix fin stack architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>PWM Dynamics</td><td>120mm Hydro Bearing fan; 2200 RPM (±10%) speed range</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Airflow Capacity</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>63.4 CFM throughput at 3.33 mmAq static pressure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Profile</strong></td><td>Noise Management</td><td>≤31.45 dB(A) for balanced performance-to-noise ratio</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Form Factor</td><td>132 x 92 x 156 mm tower; 950g total weight</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design Aesthetics</strong></td><td>Visuals</td><td>White finish with unique wood grain top-cover pattern</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>Standard 4-pin PWM connector for motherboard control</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Universal mounting for Intel (LGA 1851/1700/1200/115x); AMD (AM5/AM4)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>3-year manufacturer warranty for long-term coverage</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 3900.00, 3900.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/XSFuHJy4ZwRKxvjgFx2g8uCv3W6Nl6DUDVpV2MaM.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 15:00:38', '2026-06-14 15:00:38', 'DeepCool AK400 G2 WH Wood Grain CPU Cooler | White Performance Air Cooler', 'tand out with the DeepCool AK400 G2 WH Wood Grain cooler. Features a unique wood design, 2200 RPM fan, 63.4 CFM airflow, and LGA 1851 support. 3-year warranty.', 'DeepCool AK400 G2 WH, wood grain CPU cooler, white CPU cooler, AK400 G2 white, LGA 1851 air cooler, AM5 CPU cooler, performance air cooler, 2200 RPM fan, unique PC cooling, 3 year warranty cooler', NULL, 31, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `name`, `short_description`, `slug`, `description`, `specifications_text`, `tags`, `buy_price`, `price`, `discount_price`, `stock`, `thumbnail`, `video`, `is_featured`, `status`, `is_coming_soon`, `is_tba`, `is_call_for_price`, `is_out_of_stock`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`, `meta_keywords`, `meta_image`, `brand_id`, `supplier_id`, `laptop_purpose_id`) VALUES
(685, 'Deepcool AK400 DIGITAL WH CPU Cooler', 'The DeepCool AK400 DIGITAL WH is a high-performance single-tower air cooler that combines cutting-edge thermal management with a modern, white-themed aesthetic. Featuring an integrated real-time digital status display for monitoring CPU temperatures, it offers both vital telemetry and a sleek, contemporary look. Engineered with four high-efficiency 6mm heatpipes and a whisper-quiet 120mm Fluid Dynamic Bearing (FDB) fan (68.99 CFM), it delivers robust cooling performance for modern Intel and AMD platforms. With a generous 3-year warranty, it is an ideal choice for enthusiasts who demand reliable thermal stability and a premium, clean visual appeal for their desktop build.', 'deepcool-ak400-digital-wh-cpu-cooler-1781449323', '<p>The DeepCool AK400 DIGITAL WH is a sophisticated thermal solution designed for users who want to blend performance, monitoring capabilities, and refined style. At its core, the cooler features a high-surface-area matrix fin stack and four direct-contact copper heatpipes, ensuring rapid heat dissipation even during intensive gaming or creative sessions. The standout feature is its integrated, crystal-clear digital display, which provides instant, real-time feedback on your processor’s thermal status, allowing you to monitor your system’s health at a glance without the need for additional software.</p><p>Cooling is handled by a premium 120mm FDB fan, engineered for longevity and near-silent operation. The PWM-controlled fan runs from 500 to 1850 RPM, delivering an impressive 68.99 CFM of airflow while keeping noise levels at or below 28 dB(A). The fluid dynamic bearing technology ensures consistent performance over time, reducing mechanical vibration and operational noise to keep your workspace distraction-free.</p><p>Beyond its technical capabilities, the AK400 DIGITAL WH serves as a striking visual centerpiece. Its crisp white finish and minimalist tower profile add a contemporary, polished look to any system. Installation is both intuitive and secure, providing broad compatibility across Intel LGA 1700/1200 and AMD AM5/AM4 socket architectures. With its combination of intelligent monitoring, efficient cooling, and a 3-year manufacturer warranty, the DeepCool AK400 DIGITAL WH stands as a highly dependable and stylish foundation for your next high-performance PC.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Digital Monitoring</strong></td><td>Telemetry</td><td>Integrated digital screen for real-time CPU thermal status</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Engine</strong></td><td>Heat Dissipation</td><td>4x 6mm copper heatpipes with high-density fin array</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>PWM Dynamics</td><td>120mm FDB fan; 500–1850 RPM (±10%)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Airflow Capacity</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>68.99 CFM throughput at 2.19 mmAq static pressure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Profile</strong></td><td>Noise Management</td><td>$\\leq 28$ dB(A) for silent, efficient operation</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Form Factor</td><td>126 x 97 x 156 mm tower; 695g total weight</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>4-pin PWM for fan; USB 2.0 header for digital display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Universal mounting for Intel (LGA 1700/1200/115x); AMD (AM5/AM4)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>3-year manufacturer warranty for dependable coverage</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 4200.00, 4200.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/GOykUF9uKSKoAKOChycMd60p07MUI6R7b3kAfoD6.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 15:02:03', '2026-06-14 15:02:03', 'DeepCool AK400 DIGITAL WH White CPU Air Cooler', 'Experience the DeepCool AK400 DIGITAL WH. Features a real-time digital', 'DeepCool AK400 DIGITAL WH, white CPU cooler, digital CPU cooler, AK400 digital white, 120mm air cooler, LGA 1700 air cooler, AM5 CPU cooler, performance air cooler, real-time temp monitoring, 3 year warranty cooler', NULL, 31, NULL, NULL),
(686, 'DeepCool AK400 DIGITAL SE WH ARGB Single Tower Air CPU Cooler', 'The DeepCool AK400 DIGITAL SE WH ARGB is a premium, high-performance single-tower air cooler that merges exceptional thermal efficiency with a striking white aesthetic and real-time system monitoring. Featuring an integrated crystal-clear digital display for instant CPU temperature and usage tracking, it utilizes CTT2.0 enhanced technology, four high-efficiency 6mm heatpipes, and a specialized matrix fin array to handle demanding workloads. With a quiet 120mm FDB fan (68.99 CFM) and customizable A-RGB lighting, this cooler provides both the intelligence and visual impact required for modern, high-end white PC builds, all backed by a 3-year warranty.', 'deepcool-ak400-digital-se-wh-argb-single-tower-air-cpu-cooler-1781449403', '<p>The DeepCool AK400 DIGITAL SE WH ARGB elevates standard air cooling by integrating critical system telemetry directly into your build. The centerpiece of this cooler is its low-profile, crystal-clear digital screen, which provides accurate, real-time feedback on your CPU’s performance metrics. This enables users to keep a constant watch on their system\'s thermal health without the clutter of secondary software, making it an essential tool for enthusiasts and gamers alike.</p><p>Thermal performance is managed by the CTT2.0 enhanced technology, which utilizes four high-conductivity copper heatpipes in a direct-touch base to rapidly extract heat from the CPU die. This thermal energy is channeled into a dense, innovative matrix fin stack designed to maximize surface area and airflow efficiency. The cooling process is driven by a high-performance 120mm Fluid Dynamic Bearing (FDB) fan, which is whisper-quiet, operating at a maximum noise level of only 28 dB(A) while still delivering an impressive 68.99 CFM of airflow.</p><p>Aesthetically, the AK400 DIGITAL SE WH is a masterclass in modern design. Its crisp white finish perfectly complements all-white or light-themed PC builds, while the integrated A-RGB lighting allows for seamless synchronization with your motherboard\'s software ecosystem. Installation is engineered for compatibility and security, supporting a vast array of mainstream sockets, including the cutting-edge Intel LGA 1851 and AMD AM5 platforms. With a 3-year manufacturer warranty, this cooler is a reliable, intelligent, and visually stunning foundation for your next high-performance computing rig.</p>', '<p><strong>FeatureCategorySpecification DetailsDigital Interface</strong>MonitoringIntegrated digital display for real-time CPU thermal/usage data<strong>Thermal Engine</strong>Heat DissipationCTT2.0 technology with 4x 6mm copper heatpipes<strong>Fan Performance</strong>PWM Dynamics120mm Fluid Dynamic Bearing (FDB) fan; 500–1850 RPM (±10%)<strong>Airflow Capacity</strong>Efficiency68.99 CFM throughput at 2.19 mmAq static pressure<strong>Acoustic Profile</strong>Noise Management$\\leq 28$ dB(A) for elite silent-performance ratio<strong>Illumination</strong>VisualsIntegrated A-RGB lighting (3-pin +5V connector)<strong>Physical Dimensions</strong>Form Factor125 x 97 x 157 mm tower; 812g total weight<strong>Connectivity</strong>Interface4-pin PWM (fan), 3-pin +5V (A-RGB), 9-pin USB 2.0 (display)<strong>Compatibility</strong>ArchitectureIntel (LGA 1851/1700/1200/115x); AMD (AM5/AM4)<strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong>Reliability3-year manufacturer warranty for long-term support</p>', 'CPU Cooler', 4200.00, 4200.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/kxGPvw21FuHwL5dFyc0YeUoPRbQlbbbi74KL7Mr7.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 15:03:23', '2026-06-14 15:03:23', 'DeepCool AK400 DIGITAL SE WH ARGB CPU Cooler | White', 'Experience the DeepCool AK400 DIGITAL SE WH. Features a digital temp display, white A-RGB design, 1850 RPM FDB fan, and LGA 1851 support. 3-year warranty.', 'DeepCool AK400 DIGITAL SE WH, white CPU cooler with display, A-RGB air cooler, AK400 digital white, 120mm air cooler, LGA 1851 air cooler, AM5 CPU cooler, performance air cooler, real-time temp monitoring, 3 year warranty cooler', NULL, 31, NULL, NULL),
(687, 'DeepCool AK400 DIGITAL CPU Cooler', 'The DeepCool AK400 DIGITAL is a high-performance single-tower air cooler featuring an integrated, crystal-clear digital status display for real-time CPU temperature and usage monitoring. Engineered for efficiency, it utilizes four high-conductivity 6mm heatpipes and a dense matrix fin stack to provide robust thermal management. Equipped with a whisper-quiet 120mm Fluid Dynamic Bearing (FDB) fan that delivers 68.99 CFM of airflow, it balances powerful cooling with acoustic comfort ($\\leq 28$ dB(A)). With broad support for modern Intel and AMD platforms and a durable 3-year warranty, the AK400 DIGITAL is an intelligent, high-value upgrade for enthusiasts seeking both performance and essential system telemetry.', 'deepcool-ak400-digital-cpu-cooler-1781449477', '<p>The DeepCool AK400 DIGITAL elevates standard air cooling by merging professional-grade thermal engineering with intelligent system diagnostics. At the forefront of its design is a low-profile digital screen that provides accurate, real-time feedback on your processor’s thermal health. This allows users to stay informed about their CPU’s status at a glance, removing the need for secondary monitoring software and adding a futuristic, sophisticated touch to any desktop build.</p><p>Thermal management is achieved through a precision-engineered matrix fin array coupled with four 6mm direct-contact heatpipes. This robust architecture ensures rapid, effective heat extraction from the CPU, maintaining system stability even under sustained high-load conditions such as rendering, simulations, or competitive gaming. The cooling process is powered by a high-efficiency 120mm FDB fan, which dynamically adjusts its speed from 500 to 1850 RPM to match the thermal load of your system.</p><p>Beyond its performance, the AK400 DIGITAL is built for longevity and broad compatibility. It supports a wide array of sockets, including the popular Intel LGA 1700/1200 and AMD AM5/AM4 platforms, ensuring it fits perfectly into both new and existing builds. Weighing 695g with a compact 156mm height, it offers an ideal balance of structural integrity and case compatibility. Backed by a 3-year manufacturer warranty, the DeepCool AK400 DIGITAL stands as a reliable, data-driven thermal solution designed to protect your components and enhance your computing experience.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Digital Monitoring</strong></td><td>Telemetry</td><td>Integrated digital screen for real-time CPU thermal/usage data</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Engine</strong></td><td>Heat Dissipation</td><td>4x 6mm copper heatpipes with high-density matrix fin stack</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>PWM Dynamics</td><td>120mm Fluid Dynamic Bearing (FDB) fan; 500–1850 RPM (±10%)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Airflow Capacity</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>68.99 CFM throughput at 2.19 mmAq static pressure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Profile</strong></td><td>Noise Management</td><td>$\\leq 28$ dB(A) for optimal silent-performance ratio</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Form Factor</td><td>126 x 97 x 156 mm tower; 695g total weight</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>4-pin PWM (fan), internal USB 2.0 (display)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Universal mounting for Intel (LGA 1700/1200/115x); AMD (AM5/AM4)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>3-year manufacturer warranty for dependable support</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'CPU Cooler', 4500.00, 4500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/MBH0BPL4bnYr4kU17WGSyXsyEiHwax6RiX0HFDrr.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 15:04:37', '2026-06-14 15:04:37', 'DeepCool AK400 DIGITAL CPU Air Cooler | Real-Time Temp Display', 'Monitor your CPU with the DeepCool AK400 DIGITAL. Features a real-time digital display, 1850 RPM FDB fan, 68.99 CFM airflow, and Intel/AMD support. 3-year warranty.', 'DeepCool AK400 DIGITAL, CPU cooler with display, digital air cooler, AK400 digital, 120mm air cooler, LGA 1700 air cooler, AM5 CPU cooler, performance air cooler, real-time temp monitoring, 3 year warranty cooler', NULL, 31, NULL, NULL),
(689, 'DeepCool AG620 Dual-Tower 120mm CPU Air Cooler', 'The DeepCool AG620 is a high-performance dual-tower 120mm air cooler engineered to deliver an impressive 260W of heat dissipation power. Featuring a refined dual-tower design and optimized heatpipe architecture with precise liquid injection for superior phase-change efficiency, it ensures peak system stability for demanding workloads. With a dual-fan setup utilizing PWM-controlled, whisper-quiet fans ($\\leq 29.4$ dB(A)), this cooler offers a perfect balance of raw cooling power and acoustic efficiency. Complete with broad support for modern Intel and AMD platforms, the AG620 is a powerful, reliable solution for high-end gaming and professional workstation builds.', 'deepcool-ag620-dual-tower-120mm-cpu-air-cooler-1781449765', '<p>The DeepCool AG620 represents a significant leap in air cooling technology, specifically designed for users who require uncompromising thermal management. Its massive 260W dissipation capacity allows it to handle the heat output of high-TDP processors with ease, ensuring your system remains at full operational efficiency even during extended heavy-duty tasks like 4K video editing, 3D rendering, or competitive gaming.</p><p>At the core of the AG620 is a precision-crafted heatpipe system. By optimizing the internal capillary structure and ensuring a precise volume of liquid injection, the cooler maximizes thermal transfer across a wide range of TDP requirements. This \"balanced\" heat pipe design ensures that performance remains consistent regardless of the case orientation, whether mounted vertically in a tower or horizontally in a desktop chassis.</p><p>The AG620 utilizes two 120mm PWM fans that intelligently adjust to real-time cooling demands. When the system is idle or performing light tasks, the fans operate with silent efficiency; when the CPU is under heavy load, they ramp up to deliver high airflow (67.88 CFM) and static pressure (2.04 mmAq). This dynamic control ensures your system is only as loud as it needs to be, striking the ideal balance between raw performance and user comfort. Backed by a 1-year manufacturer warranty, the DeepCool AG620 is an essential upgrade for any power user seeking a robust, efficient, and long-lasting cooling foundation.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Power</strong></td><td>Capacity</td><td>260W heat dissipation power for high-TDP processors</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Engine</strong></td><td>Design</td><td>Dual-tower configuration with optimized heatpipe capillary structure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>PWM Dynamics</td><td>120mm PWM fans; 300–1850 RPM (±10%)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Airflow Capacity</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>67.88 CFM throughput at 2.04 mmAq static pressure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Profile</strong></td><td>Noise Management</td><td>$\\leq 29.4$ dB(A) for elite silent-performance ratio</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Form Factor</td><td>129 x 136 x 157 mm; 1300g robust build</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>Standard 4-pin PWM connector for dynamic motherboard control</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Universal mounting for Intel (LGA 2066/1700/1200/115x); AMD (AM5/AM4)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>1-year manufacturer warranty for dependable support</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'CPU Cooler', 4700.00, 4700.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/nCjOoideQIRrGUxh852pgPR5EinjeTJtir0E5029.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 15:09:25', '2026-06-14 15:09:25', 'DeepCool AG620 Dual-Tower 120mm CPU Air CooleDeepCool AG620 Dual-Tower 120mm CPU Air Coole', 'Experience 260W cooling with the DeepCool AG620. Features dual-tower design, PWM-controlled fans, and support for Intel/AMD sockets. 1-year warranty.', 'DeepCool AG620, dual tower CPU cooler, 120mm air cooler, LGA 1700 cooler, AM5 CPU cooler, performance air cooler, 260W TDP cooling, high-end PC cooling, silent CPU fan, AG620 dual tower', NULL, 31, NULL, NULL),
(690, 'Deepcool AN600 Low Profile CPU Cooler', 'The DeepCool AN600 is a premium, low-profile CPU cooler engineered specifically for Small Form Factor (SFF) and compact PC builds. Despite its minimal 67mm height, it packs robust thermal performance, featuring a high-airflow 120mm Fluid Dynamic Bearing (FDB) fan and a wide-fin heatsink design that provides excellent clearance. Delivering 61.56 CFM of airflow at a whisper-quiet $\\leq 24.4$ dB(A), the AN600 ensures effective heat dissipation without compromising on silence. With universal support for modern Intel and AMD sockets and a clean white LED aesthetic, it is an ideal, high-reliability cooling upgrade for space-constrained systems.', 'deepcool-an600-low-profile-cpu-cooler-1781449855', '<p>The DeepCool AN600 is the ultimate thermal solution for users who demand high performance within the tight confines of compact computer cases. Its low-profile design—measuring just 67mm in height—is specifically crafted to overcome the clearance challenges found in SFF builds, while its optimized layout ensures it maintains high-efficiency heat dissipation. The cooler’s broad heatsink design maximizes surface area for rapid heat extraction, allowing it to keep your CPU temperatures well within safe limits during both demanding productivity tasks and gaming sessions.</p><p>At the heart of the AN600 is a specialized 120mm PWM fan that balances power and acoustics. By utilizing Fluid Dynamic Bearing (FDB) technology, the fan provides smooth, consistent rotation while significantly reducing mechanical noise to a maximum of 24.4 dB(A). The PWM-controlled speed range of 500 to 1850 RPM allows the cooler to adapt dynamically to your system\'s temperature, ramping up when cooling needs are high and settling into near-silent operation when idle.</p><p>Durability and ease of integration are foundational to the AN600 experience. It supports a wide array of current platforms, including Intel LGA 1700/1200 and AMD AM5/AM4, ensuring compatibility with the latest hardware. Finished with a clean white LED accent, the AN600 not only keeps your system cool but also provides a refined look to your build. Backed by a 3-year manufacturer warranty, this cooler is a dependable, space-saving asset designed for enthusiasts who refuse to trade performance for compact size.</p><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Thermal Dynamics</td><td>Low-profile heatsink optimized for compact chassis airflow</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>PWM Dynamics</td><td>120mm FDB fan; 500–1850 RPM (±10%)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Airflow Capacity</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>61.56 CFM throughput at 1.97 mmAq static pressure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Profile</strong></td><td>Noise Management</td><td>$\\leq 24.4$ dB(A) for elite silent operation</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Form Factor</td><td>122 x 120 x 67 mm; 628g total weight</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Visuals</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>White LED illumination for a clean, professional look</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>Standard 4-pin PWM connector for dynamic motherboard control</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Universal mounting for Intel (LGA 1700/1200/115x); AMD (AM5/AM4)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>3-year manufacturer warranty for long-term support</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', 'CPU Cooler', 4500.00, 4500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/ViYRtOONID4xUtopCbSCn9VK3hJTDv09tcvIK97r.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 15:10:55', '2026-06-14 15:10:55', 'DeepCool AN600 Low Profile CPU Cooler | Compact Thermal Solution', 'Cool your small form factor PC with the DeepCool AN600. Features a 67mm low-profile design, silent FDB fan, 61.56 CFM airflow, and a 3-year warranty.', 'DeepCool AN600, low profile CPU cooler, SFF CPU cooler, compact PC cooling, 120mm air cooler, LGA 1700 low profile cooler, AM5 SFF cooler, silent CPU fan, 3 year warranty cooler', NULL, 31, NULL, NULL),
