 form factor PC with the DeepCool AN600. Features a 67mm low-profile design, silent FDB fan, 61.56 CFM airflow, and a 3-year warranty.', 'DeepCool AN600, low profile CPU cooler, SFF CPU cooler, compact PC cooling, 120mm air cooler, LGA 1700 low profile cooler, AM5 SFF cooler, silent CPU fan, 3 year warranty cooler', NULL, 31, NULL, NULL),
(693, 'DeepCool AG620 ARGB Dual Tower CPU Air Cooler', 'The DeepCool AG620 ARGB is a powerhouse dual-tower air cooler engineered for enthusiasts who demand extreme thermal performance and vibrant visual aesthetics. Capable of dissipating up to 260W of heat, it utilizes Core Touch Technology 2.0 with six high-efficiency heatpipes to ensure maximum thermal conductivity. Equipped with dual 120mm PWM fans, it offers a sophisticated balance of high-pressure cooling (67.88 CFM) and quiet acoustics ($\\leq 29.4$ dB(A)). With customizable ARGB lighting, universal socket support for modern Intel and AMD platforms, and a robust 1300g build, the AG620 ARGB is the premier choice for cooling high-TDP processors in elite gaming and workstation builds.', 'deepcool-ag620-argb-dual-tower-cpu-air-cooler-1781449944', '<p>The DeepCool AG620 ARGB stands as a testament to efficient, high-capacity cooling. Designed to handle the thermal demands of today\'s most powerful CPUs, this dual-tower cooler provides a massive 260W dissipation capacity, ensuring system stability during 4K rendering, complex simulations, or competitive gaming. Its advanced heatpipe architecture, featuring nickel-plated construction and Core Touch Technology 2.0, provides a premium, corrosion-resistant surface that guarantees superior contact and heat transfer from the processor die.</p><p>Performance is managed by a dual-fan array that provides both redundancy and massive airflow. The 120mm PWM fans feature fluid-dynamic performance, scaling from 300 to 1850 RPM to provide exactly the amount of cooling required. When idle, the system remains whisper-quiet; under heavy load, the fans ramp up to move 67.88 CFM of air, maintaining optimal temperatures even under sustained thermal stress.</p><p>Beyond its performance, the AG620 ARGB is a visual masterpiece. The integrated Addressable RGB (ARGB) lighting can be fully synchronized with your motherboard’s ecosystem, allowing you to tailor the cooler\'s appearance to match any color scheme. Installation is secure and professional, thanks to a high-quality all-metal mounting bracket compatible with a wide range of sockets, including LGA 2066/1700 and AM5. Backed by a 1-year manufacturer warranty, the DeepCool AG620 ARGB is a high-performance investment for any serious PC builder looking to elevate their build’s cooling efficiency and visual impact.</p>', '<ol><li><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Thermal Engine</strong></td><td>Heat Dissipation</td><td>6x 6mm heatpipes with Core Touch Technology 2.0</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Power</strong></td><td>Capacity</td><td>260W TDP dissipation capability</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Performance</strong></td><td>PWM Dynamics</td><td>Dual 120mm PWM fans; 300–1850 RPM (±10%)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Airflow Capacity</strong></td><td>Efficiency</td><td>67.88 CFM throughput at 2.04 mmAq static pressure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Profile</strong></td><td>Noise Management</td><td>$\\leq 29.4$ dB(A) for balanced silent operation</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Illumination</strong></td><td>Visuals</td><td>Integrated ARGB lighting (motherboard sync compatible)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Form Factor</td><td>129 x 136 x 157 mm dual-tower; 1300g total weight</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>4-pin PWM for fans; ARGB header for lighting</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Architecture</td><td>Intel (LGA 2066/2011/1700/1200/115x); AMD (AM5/AM4)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Support</strong></td><td>Reliability</td><td>1-year manufacturer warranty for dependable support</td></tr></tbody></table></figure></li></ol>', 'CPU Cooler', 4500.00, 4500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/eVNZ7SSj2twO5ISGpfYgt4povJw3eJdQjSC9vGIt.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-14 15:12:24', '2026-06-14 15:12:53', 'FeatureCategorySpecification DetailsThermal EngineHeat Dissipation6x 6mm heatpipes with Core Touch Technology 2.0Cooling PowerCapacity260W TDP dissipation capabilityFan PerformancePWM DynamicsDual 120mm PWM fans; 300–1850 RPM (±10%)Airflow CapacityEfficiency67.88 CFM throughput at 2.04 mmAq static pressureAcoustic ProfileNoise Management$\\leq 29.4$ dB(A) for balanced silent operationIlluminationVisualsIntegrated ARGB lighting (motherboard sync compatible)Physical DimensionsForm Factor129 x 136 x 157 mm dual-tower; 1300g total weightConnectivityInterface4-pin PWM for fans; ARGB header for lightingCompatibilityArchitectureIntel (LGA 2066/2011/1700/1200/115x); AMD (AM5/AM4)Warranty & SupportReliability1-year manufacturer warranty for dependable support', 'Maximize performance with the DeepCool AG620 ARGB. Features 260W dissipation, dual 120mm PWM fans, ARGB lighting, and Core Touch Technology 2.0. Supports LGA 1700/AM5.', 'DeepCool AG620 ARGB, dual tower CPU cooler, ARGB air cooler, 260W TDP cooler, LGA 1700 air cooler, AM5 CPU cooler, high-performance air cooler, Core Touch Technology, gaming PC cooling, 120mm dual fan cooler', NULL, 31, NULL, NULL),
(694, 'Xiaomi Projector Wanbo T2 Free 150 Lumens Smart Portable LED', 'The Xiaomi Wanbo T2 Free is a compact Full HD portable projector featuring native 1080P resolution, HDR10 decoding, and dual 3W stereo speakers for an immersive viewing experience. Its eye-friendly diffuse reflection imaging reduces eye strain during extended use, while the advanced triple-fan cooling system helps extend LED lifespan. With HDMI and USB connectivity, the Wanbo T2 Free easily connects to laptops, TV boxes, gaming consoles, and streaming devices, making it an ideal choice for home entertainment and portable projection needs.', 'xiaomi-projector-wanbo-t2-free-150-lumens-smart-portable-led-1781499782', '<p>The Xiaomi Wanbo T2 Free is a compact and portable Full HD projector designed to provide an immersive big-screen entertainment experience wherever you go. Combining a stylish design, Full HD resolution, HDR10 support, stereo sound, and versatile connectivity options, this projector is ideal for movies, TV shows, gaming, and multimedia presentations.</p><p>With its lightweight construction and user-friendly features, the Wanbo T2 Free offers excellent portability while delivering clear visuals and enjoyable audio performance for home and mobile entertainment.</p><h2>Native Full HD 1080P Resolution</h2><p>The Wanbo T2 Free features a native Full HD (1920 × 1080) resolution, producing sharp images with rich detail and vibrant colors. It supports multiple video resolutions, including 480p, 576p, 720p, and 1080p formats, ensuring compatibility with a wide range of content sources.</p><h2>HDR10 Enhanced Visual Experience</h2><p>HDR10 decoding technology improves dynamic range and image detail, delivering brighter highlights, deeper shadows, and more realistic colors. This results in a more immersive viewing experience for movies, streaming content, and games.</p><h2>Immersive Stereo Audio</h2><p>Equipped with dual 3W stereo speakers, the projector provides balanced left and right channel audio output. The integrated 360° sound effect technology enhances sound dispersion, creating a more engaging entertainment experience without the need for external speakers.</p><h2>Efficient Cooling System</h2><p>The Xiaomi Wanbo T2 Free utilizes a triple-fan cooling design that effectively dissipates heat from both internal and external components. This advanced cooling system helps maintain stable performance and extends the lifespan of the LED light source.</p><h2>Eye-Friendly Diffuse Reflection Imaging</h2><p>Unlike direct light displays, the projector uses diffuse reflection imaging technology that produces softer light. This helps reduce eye fatigue during extended viewing sessions, making it more comfortable for watching movies, series, and videos for long periods.</p><h2>Flexible Connectivity Options</h2><p>The Wanbo T2 Free offers multiple connectivity ports, allowing users to connect various devices with ease. The built-in HDMI and USB ports support streaming devices, laptops, gaming consoles, Android TV boxes, Chromecast, external hard drives, and more.</p><h2>Key Features of Xiaomi Wanbo T2 Free</h2><ul><li>Native Full HD 1080P (1920 × 1080) resolution</li><li>HDR10 decoding technology</li><li>Dual 3W stereo speakers with 360° sound effects</li><li>Supports multiple video formats and resolutions</li><li>Triple-fan cooling system</li><li>Eye-friendly diffuse reflection imaging</li><li>HDMI and USB connectivity</li><li>Compact and portable design</li><li>Long-lasting LED light source</li><li>Suitable for home entertainment and portable use</li></ul><h2>Warranty</h2><p>The Xiaomi Wanbo T2 Free Full HD Portable Projector comes with no official warranty.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>LCD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>Full HD (1920 × 1080p)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>150 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>2000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Supported Video Formats</td><td>1080p, 720p, AVC, MPEG-2, MPEG-4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Light Source Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Up to 20,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>3W × 2</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>1 × DC In, 1 × USB 2.0, 1 × HDMI, 1 × 3.5mm Audio Jack</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Input</td><td>19V / 3A</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specifications</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>900 g</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions (W × D × H)</td><td>150 × 140 × 110 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 14800.00, 14800.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/hpce0gFdQ6v600HrCDeW8fm2vpGFalGYk8OvV9Y3.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-15 05:03:02', '2026-06-15 05:03:02', 'Xiaomi Wanbo T2 Free Full HD Portable Projector Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy Xiaomi Wanbo T2 Free Full HD Portable Projector in Bangladesh. Features native 1080P resolution, HDR10 support, dual 3W speakers, HDMI and USB connectivity, diffuse reflection imaging, and portable design.', 'Xiaomi Wanbo T2 Free, Wanbo T2 Free Projector, Xiaomi Portable Projector, Full HD Projector, 1080P Projector, HDR10 Projector, LED Projector, Home Theater Projector, Mini Projector Bangladesh, Xiaomi Projector Price in Bangladesh, Portable LED Projector, Wanbo T2 Free Bangladesh.', NULL, 52, NULL, NULL),
(695, 'Xiaomi Projector Wanbo X1 Pro 300 Lumens Smart Android Portable LED', 'The Xiaomi Wanbo X1 Pro Portable LED Projector features 300 ANSI lumens brightness, a high-quality glass lens, and advanced electric focus technology for sharp and clear visuals. With 4-direction keystone correction, AI voice control, wireless and wired screen mirroring, and 2.4GHz Wi-Fi connectivity, it delivers a convenient and immersive viewing experience. Its fully enclosed dust-proof optical engine enhances durability and heat dissipation, making the Wanbo X1 Pro an excellent choice for home entertainment and portable projection.', 'xiaomi-projector-wanbo-x1-pro-300-lumens-smart-android-portable-led-1781500122', '<p>The Xiaomi Wanbo X1 Pro Portable LED Projector combines stylish design, smart features, and reliable performance to deliver an enjoyable home entertainment experience. Featuring a premium compact body, 300 ANSI lumens brightness, wireless screen mirroring, and AI voice control, the X1 Pro is an excellent choice for movies, streaming, gaming, and everyday multimedia use.</p><p>Its portable design and advanced projection features make it ideal for use in bedrooms, living rooms, offices, and outdoor settings.</p><h2>Premium and Elegant Design</h2><p>The Wanbo X1 Pro features a modern round-edged design with chrome-lined decorative accents that provide a refined and premium appearance. Its compact form factor allows for easy portability and convenient placement in various environments.</p><h2>Bright and Clear Projection</h2><p>Powered by a high-performance 4-point LED light source, the projector delivers up to 300 ANSI lumens of brightness for clear and vibrant visuals. The pure glass lens enhances image sharpness and clarity, ensuring a better viewing experience.</p><h2>Advanced Keystone Correction</h2><p>The projector supports side projection and features 4-direction keystone correction, allowing users to quickly adjust image alignment and achieve a perfectly rectangular display even when the projector is positioned off-center.</p><h2>Electric Focus System</h2><p>Equipped with a highly precise electric motor, the Wanbo X1 Pro offers improved focusing accuracy, making it easy to achieve sharp and detailed images with minimal effort.</p><h2>Wireless Connectivity and Screen Mirroring</h2><p>The built-in 2.4GHz Wi-Fi connection supports both wireless and wired screen mirroring, enabling seamless content sharing from smartphones, tablets, laptops, and other compatible devices.</p><h2>AI Voice Control</h2><p>The Xiaomi Wanbo X1 Pro supports intelligent voice commands, allowing users to control projector functions conveniently through voice interaction for a smarter user experience.</p><h2>Dust-Proof Optical Engine</h2><p>The projector features a fully enclosed dust-proof optical engine with an integrated metal-molded structure. This design improves heat dissipation, reduces LED light degradation, minimizes dust intrusion, and significantly extends the projector\'s operational lifespan.</p><h2>Built-in Stereo Speaker</h2><p>A built-in 3W speaker delivers clear and balanced audio for everyday entertainment, eliminating the need for external speakers in most situations.</p><h2>Key Features of Xiaomi Wanbo X1 Pro</h2><ul><li>300 ANSI lumens brightness</li><li>HD projection with clear image quality</li><li>4-direction keystone correction</li><li>Electric focus adjustment</li><li>AI voice control support</li><li>Wireless and wired screen mirroring</li><li>2.4GHz Wi-Fi connectivity</li><li>Pure glass optical lens</li><li>Dust-proof sealed optical engine</li><li>Built-in 3W speaker</li><li>Compact and portable design</li></ul><h2>Warranty</h2><p>The Xiaomi Wanbo X1 Pro Portable LED Projector comes with no parts warranty.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>LCD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>HD (1280 × 720P)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>300 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>1.2 ~ 3 m</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Ratio</td><td>1.35:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Scale</td><td>16:9 &amp; 4:3</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Light Source Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Up to 20,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>3W × 1</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>AV × 1, Headphone × 1, USB × 1, HDMI × 1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Bluetooth 5.0</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Wi-Fi</td><td>2.4GHz Wi-Fi</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Input</td><td>19V / 3A</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specifications</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Parts Warranty</td><td>No Parts Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 13500.00, 13500.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/bZHNMOdUpsFOpvEnMpyCQ7JrexwEz8xPoboRhinA.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-15 05:08:42', '2026-06-15 05:08:42', 'Xiaomi Wanbo X1 Pro Portable LED Projector Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy Xiaomi Wanbo X1 Pro Portable LED Projector in Bangladesh. Features 300 ANSI lumens brightness, electric focus, AI voice control, Wi-Fi connectivity, wireless screen mirroring, and 4-point keystone correction.', 'Xiaomi Wanbo X1 Pro, Wanbo X1 Pro Projector, Portable LED Projector, Xiaomi Projector, Smart Projector Bangladesh, WiFi Projector, Mini Projector, Home Theater Projector, AI Voice Control Projector, Wanbo Projector Price in Bangladesh, Portable Projector Bangladesh.', NULL, 52, NULL, NULL),
(696, 'Xiaomi Projector Mi Smart Projector 2 Portable Android Smart Laser', 'The Xiaomi Mi Smart Projector 2 is a compact Full HD smart projector featuring 1920 × 1080 resolution, 500 ANSI lumens brightness, and HDR10 decoding for vibrant and detailed visuals. Powered by Android TV, it provides access to popular streaming apps and supports Google Assistant voice control for hands-free operation. With automatic multi-angle keystone correction, Dolby Audio-enhanced stereo speakers, Bluetooth connectivity, and HDMI 2.0 support, the Mi Smart Projector 2 delivers an immersive home theater experience in a portable design.', 'xiaomi-projector-mi-smart-projector-2-portable-android-smart-laser-1781501525', '<p>The Xiaomi Mi Smart Projector 2 is a compact and intelligent home entertainment projector that combines Full HD image quality, Android TV integration, smart voice control, and immersive audio performance. Designed for modern home theaters, it delivers vibrant visuals, rich sound, and convenient smart features in a stylish and portable form factor.</p><p>With 1080p Full HD resolution, 500 ANSI lumens brightness, HDR10 support, and automatic keystone correction, the Mi Smart Projector 2 provides an effortless and enjoyable viewing experience for movies, TV shows, gaming, and streaming content.</p><h2>Full HD Resolution with Brilliant Visuals</h2><p>The projector features native Full HD 1920 × 1080 resolution, delivering sharp images, fine details, and excellent picture clarity. Its advanced LED projection system produces vivid colors and enhanced contrast, making entertainment more immersive and realistic.</p><h2>Automatic Multi-Angle Keystone Correction</h2><p>The Xiaomi Mi Smart Projector 2 includes automatic multi-angle keystone correction across 3 axes and 6 directions. This intelligent feature automatically adjusts the projected image into a perfect rectangle, eliminating the need for time-consuming manual alignment.</p><h2>Android TV Smart Entertainment Platform</h2><p>Built-in Android TV provides instant access to thousands of applications, including popular streaming services, entertainment platforms, games, and media apps. Users can enjoy a complete smart TV experience directly from the projector without requiring additional devices.</p><h2>Google Assistant Voice Control</h2><p>The integrated Google Assistant allows users to control the projector using voice commands. Simply press the Assistant button on the remote control to search content, launch apps, adjust settings, or manage compatible smart home devices quickly and conveniently.</p><h2>HDR10 Decoding and Enhanced Color Performance</h2><p>Supporting HDR10 decoding technology, the Mi Smart Projector 2 delivers improved contrast, deeper blacks, and brighter highlights. Its advanced 4-channel LED light source expands the Rec.709 color gamut coverage, producing more vivid, accurate, and lifelike colors compared to conventional projection systems.</p><h2>Powerful Dolby Audio Sound System</h2><p>The projector incorporates a large acoustic chamber and an extended sound conduction design to deliver rich, detailed audio with deep bass response. Dual-channel digital surround sound and Dolby Audio support create an immersive cinematic audio experience without the need for external speakers.</p><h2>Bluetooth Speaker Functionality</h2><p>Thanks to built-in Bluetooth connectivity, the Mi Smart Projector 2 can also function as a standalone wireless speaker. Users can easily connect smartphones, tablets, and other Bluetooth-enabled devices to enjoy music and audio content.</p><h2>Flexible Connectivity</h2><p>The projector includes multiple connectivity options, making it easy to connect media players, gaming consoles, laptops, streaming devices, and external audio systems.</p><h3>Key Features of Xiaomi Mi Smart Projector 2</h3><ul><li>Native Full HD 1080P (1920 × 1080) resolution</li><li>500 ANSI lumens brightness</li><li>Android TV smart operating system</li><li>Google Assistant voice control</li><li>Automatic multi-angle keystone correction</li><li>HDR10 decoding support</li><li>Advanced 4-channel LED light source</li><li>Dolby Audio compatible sound system</li><li>Bluetooth speaker functionality</li><li>HDMI 2.0 with 4K input support</li><li>USB 2.0 and 3.5mm audio connectivity</li><li>Compact and portable design</li></ul><h2>Warranty</h2><p>The Xiaomi Mi Smart Projector 2 comes with no official warranty.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>DLP</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>Full HD (1920 × 1080p)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>500 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Recommended Projection Size</td><td>60\" ~ 120\"</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Ratio</td><td>1.2:1</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Light Source Type</td><td>LED Light</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Audio Format</td><td>Dolby Audio</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>2 × 5W Wide-Range Stereo Speakers</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>1 × USB 2.0, 1 × HDMI 2.0, 1 × 3.5mm Audio Jack</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Bluetooth 5.0 / BLE</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Wi-Fi</td><td>IEEE 802.11a/b/g/n (2.4GHz &amp; 5GHz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>65W (Maximum), 0.5W (Standby)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Input</td><td>19V – 3.42A</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specifications</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>Grey / White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>1.3 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions (W × H × D)</td><td>115 × 150 × 150 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 54500.00, 54500.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/b86vQ9tnhKv4s4SCPBOTdJFGb3ReaYpeD4Buz8Cd.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-15 05:32:05', '2026-06-15 05:32:05', 'Xiaomi Mi Smart Projector 2 Full HD Android TV Projector Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy Xiaomi Mi Smart Projector 2 in Bangladesh. Features Full HD 1080P resolution, 500 ANSI lumens brightness, Android TV, Google Assistant, HDR10 decoding, Dolby Audio, Bluetooth connectivity, and automatic keystone correction.', 'Xiaomi Mi Smart Projector 2, Xiaomi Smart Projector, Android TV Projector, Full HD Projector, 1080P Projector, HDR10 Projector, Dolby Audio Projector, Google Assistant Projector, Bluetooth Projector, Home Theater Projector, Xiaomi Projector Bangladesh, Smart Projector Price in Bangladesh, Portable Projector.', NULL, 52, NULL, NULL);
