(697, 'Xiaomi Projector Wanbo Mozart 1 Pro 1200 Lumens Smart Android Portable LED', 'The Xiaomi Wanbo Mozart 1 Pro is a smart Android 11.0 portable projector offering native Full HD 1080P resolution and 1200 ANSI lumens brightness for clear and vibrant visuals. With Netflix certification (DRM L1), built-in Google Assistant, and access to Android TV apps, it delivers a complete entertainment experience. Features like autofocus, keystone correction, and advanced image processing ensure easy setup and sharp projection, while HDMI and USB connectivity provide wide device compatibility for home and portable use.', 'xiaomi-projector-wanbo-mozart-1-pro-1200-lumens-smart-android-portable-led-1781502232', '<p>The Xiaomi Wanbo Mozart 1 Pro is a powerful smart portable projector designed to deliver a premium home entertainment experience. Featuring Android TV 11.0, native Full HD resolution, and advanced smart features, it brings movies, TV shows, games, and streaming apps directly to your screen with exceptional clarity and convenience.</p><p>With 1200 ANSI lumens brightness, built-in Google Assistant, and official Netflix certification, the Mozart 1 Pro ensures smooth, high-quality streaming and an intuitive user experience. Its compact and stylish design makes it suitable for any room setup, whether at home or on the go.</p><h2>Android TV 11.0 Smart Experience</h2><p>Powered by Android TV 11.0, the Wanbo Mozart 1 Pro provides direct access to thousands of apps, games, and streaming platforms. The user-friendly interface allows easy navigation, while built-in Google Assistant enables voice control for searching content, adjusting settings, and managing the device hands-free.</p><h2>Full HD Native Resolution with Certified Streaming</h2><p>The projector delivers crisp and detailed visuals with native 1920 × 1080 Full HD resolution. With DRM L1 support and Netflix certification, users can enjoy secure and high-quality streaming from major platforms without compromise.</p><h2>Bright and Vivid 1200 ANSI Lumens Output</h2><p>With 1200 ANSI lumens brightness, the Mozart 1 Pro produces clear and vibrant images even in moderately lit environments. Advanced image processing enhances color accuracy and contrast, ensuring a cinematic viewing experience for movies, gaming, and multimedia content.</p><h2>Smart Auto Image Adjustment</h2><p>The projector is equipped with intelligent features such as autofocus, keystone correction, and advanced image optimization. These technologies ensure quick setup and automatically adjust the image for perfect alignment and sharpness.</p><h2>Powerful Audio and Immersive Sound</h2><p>Designed to complement its visual performance, the Wanbo Mozart 1 Pro delivers immersive sound output, making it ideal for home theater use without the need for external speakers.</p><h2>Compact and Portable Design</h2><p>The sleek and compact design of the projector allows easy placement in any environment, including living rooms, bedrooms, and home theater setups. Its portability ensures flexibility for entertainment anywhere.</p><h2>Wide Connectivity Options</h2><p>The projector includes multiple connectivity options such as HDMI and USB ports, allowing seamless connection with gaming consoles, laptops, streaming devices, Blu-ray players, and more.</p><h2>Key Features of Xiaomi Wanbo Mozart 1 Pro</h2><ul><li>Native Full HD 1080P resolution</li><li>1200 ANSI lumens brightness</li><li>Android TV 11.0 operating system</li><li>Built-in Google Assistant voice control</li><li>Netflix certified with DRM L1 support</li><li>Autofocus and keystone correction</li><li>Smart image optimization technology</li><li>HDMI and USB connectivity</li><li>Portable and compact design</li></ul><h2>Warranty</h2><p>The Xiaomi Wanbo Mozart 1 Pro comes with no official warranty.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>LCD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>Full HD (1920 × 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Compatible Resolution</td><td>2K, 4K</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>1200 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>3000:1</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>10W × 2</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio System</td><td>External bass unit with sound wave vibrational magnetic levitation</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>1 × HDMI 1.4, 2 × USB 2.0, 1 × 3.5mm Audio Jack</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Bluetooth 5.0</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Smart Features</strong></td><td>OS</td><td>Android 11.0</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>RAM</td><td>2GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>ROM</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Voice Assistant</td><td>Built-in Google Assistant</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specifications</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>Dark Blue</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>3.5 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions (W × H × D)</td><td>176 × 209 × 223 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 42000.00, 42000.00, NULL, 7, 'products/thumbnails/oJaimplnu4o2EcNG1VWSB1ye4Z2fM6rAh3epPB4s.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-15 05:43:52', '2026-06-15 05:43:52', 'Xiaomi Wanbo Mozart 1 Pro 1200 ANSI Lumens Smart Android Projector Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy Xiaomi Wanbo Mozart 1 Pro Smart Android Projector in Bangladesh. Features 1200 ANSI lumens brightness, Full HD 1080P resolution, Android TV 11.0, Netflix certification, Google Assistant, autofocus, and keystone correction.', 'Xiaomi Wanbo Mozart 1 Pro, Wanbo Mozart 1 Pro Projector, Smart Android Projector, Full HD Projector, 1200 ANSI Lumens Projector, Netflix Certified Projector, Android TV Projector, Home Theater Projector, Xiaomi Projector Bangladesh, Portable LED Projector, Smart Projector Price in Bangladesh.', NULL, 52, NULL, NULL),
(698, 'Xiaomi  Projector Wanbo Mozart 1 900 Lumens Smart Android Portable LED', 'Enjoy stunning Full HD entertainment with the Xiaomi Wanbo Mozart 1 Smart Portable LED Projector. Featuring 900 ANSI lumens brightness, Android 9.0, auto-focus, auto-keystone correction, Wi-Fi 6, Bluetooth 5.0, and immersive audio with dual bass units, it delivers a seamless big-screen viewing experience anywhere.', 'xiaomi-projector-wanbo-mozart-1-900-lumens-smart-android-portable-led-1781584522', '<p>The Xiaomi Wanbo Mozart 1 Smart Portable LED Projector delivers an immersive home entertainment experience with its native Full HD (1920×1080) resolution and support for 2K and 4K video decoding. Powered by advanced PixelPro 5.0 Full Closed Optical technology, it produces bright and vivid visuals with 900 ANSI lumens of brightness, ensuring excellent image quality for movies, gaming, and presentations.</p><p>Designed for convenience, the projector features auto-focus, full auto-keystone correction, screen alignment, and auto obstacle avoidance, allowing quick and hassle-free setup. Its sophisticated optical system with five high-precision lenses enhances image sharpness and color accuracy, while the 1.2:1 throw ratio provides flexible projection options for various room sizes.</p><p>Running on Android 9.0 with 2GB RAM and 32GB internal storage, the Wanbo Mozart 1 offers smooth access to streaming apps and smart entertainment features. The projector also delivers impressive audio performance through an 8W built-in speaker and dual external bass units, creating rich and immersive sound while maintaining a low operating noise level of less than 35dB.</p><p>For connectivity, the projector includes HDMI 1.4, dual USB 2.0 ports, a 3.5mm audio jack, Bluetooth 5.0, and Dual-Band Wi-Fi 6 support, making it easy to connect with smartphones, laptops, gaming consoles, and other multimedia devices. Combining smart features, high-quality visuals, and powerful audio, the Xiaomi Wanbo Mozart 1 is an excellent choice for modern home entertainment and portable projection needs.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul><li>Native Full HD (1920×1080) resolution with 2K/4K decoding support</li><li>900 ANSI lumens brightness with PixelPro 5.0 optical technology</li><li>Auto-focus and full auto-keystone correction</li><li>Auto screen alignment and obstacle avoidance</li><li>Android 9.0 OS with 2GB RAM and 32GB storage</li><li>8W speaker with dual external bass units</li><li>Dual-Band Wi-Fi 6 and Bluetooth 5.0 connectivity</li><li>HDMI 1.4, USB 2.0, and 3.5mm audio output</li><li>Low noise operation below 35dB</li><li>Compact and portable design for home and office use</li></ul>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>LCD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>FHD (1920 × 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Compatible Resolution</td><td>2K, 4K</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>900 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>8W × 1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Sound System</td><td>External bass unit with sound wave vibrational magnetic levitation</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI</td><td>1 × HDMI 1.4</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB</td><td>2 × USB 2.0</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>1 × 3.5mm Audio Jack</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Bluetooth 5.0</td></tr><tr><td><strong>System Configuration</strong></td><td>RAM</td><td>2GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Storage (ROM)</td><td>32GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Operating System</td><td>Android 9.0</td></tr><tr><td><strong>External Features</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>3.5 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>176 × 209 × 223 mm (W × H × D)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 35000.00, 35000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/4AmAq2TyktNQvBtJJ9ulIRu7E2I2FPYDWwxUXrBb.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-16 04:35:22', '2026-06-16 04:35:22', 'Xiaomi Wanbo Mozart 1 Smart Portable LED Projector Price in Bangladesh\r\nXiaomi Wanbo Mozart 1 900 ANSI Lumens Android LED Projector\r\nXiaomi Wanbo Mozart 1 FHD Smart Portable Projector with Wi-Fi 6\r\nXiaomi Wanbo Mozart 1 1080P Android Projector Price in BD\r\nXiaomi Wanbo Mozart 1 Smart LED Projector with Auto Focus\r\n\r\nSEO Recommended Meta Title (60 Characters):\r\nXiaomi Wanbo Mozart 1 Smart Portable LED Projector Price in BD', 'Buy the Xiaomi Wanbo Mozart 1 Smart Portable LED Projector in Bangladesh. Features 900 ANSI lumens brightness, Full HD 1080p resolution, Android 9.0, Wi-Fi 6, Bluetooth 5.0, auto focus, auto keystone correction, and 4K decoding support for an immersive home entertainment experience. (159 characters)', 'Xiaomi Wanbo Mozart 1, Wanbo Mozart 1 projector, Xiaomi projector Bangladesh, smart LED projector, portable projector, Android projector, Full HD projector, 1080p projector, 900 ANSI lumens projector, WiFi 6 projector, Bluetooth 5.0 projector, home theater projector, smart projector, portable LED projector, Xiaomi Wanbo projector, auto focus projector, auto keystone projector, multimedia projector, wireless projector, 4K supported projector, projector price in Bangladesh, Xiaomi Mozart 1 price in BD, FHD smart projector, Android 9.0 projector, home entertainment projector.', NULL, 52, NULL, NULL),
(699, 'Xiaomi Projector Wanbo X5 Pro 1100 Lumens FHD LCD', 'The Xiaomi Wanbo X5 Pro Smart Projector features Full HD 1080p resolution, 1100 ANSI lumens brightness, auto-focus, auto-keystone correction, dual-band Wi-Fi, Android OS, and dual 5W stereo speakers, delivering a premium home theater experience with support for up to 140-inch projection.', 'xiaomi-projector-wanbo-x5-pro-1100-lumens-fhd-lcd-1781585259', '<p>The Xiaomi Wanbo X5 Pro is a powerful smart projector designed to deliver an immersive big-screen entertainment experience. Featuring advanced projection technology with a native Full HD (1920×1080) resolution and support for 4K content decoding, it produces sharp, detailed, and vibrant visuals suitable for movies, gaming, presentations, and streaming.</p><p>With an impressive brightness of 1100 ANSI lumens and a 3000:1 contrast ratio, the Wanbo X5 Pro ensures clear image quality with enhanced depth and color performance. The projector supports screen sizes ranging from 40 to 140 inches, allowing users to create a cinematic viewing environment in various room sizes.</p><p>For effortless setup, the projector comes equipped with intelligent auto-focus and full auto-keystone correction, automatically optimizing image alignment and sharpness. Its flexible projection modes support front, rear, and ceiling installation, making it suitable for different home and office environments.</p><p>Powered by the Android operating system, the Xiaomi Wanbo X5 Pro features 1GB RAM and 16GB internal storage, enabling smooth access to apps, streaming services, and multimedia content. Dual-band Wi-Fi (2.4GHz and 5GHz) provides stable wireless connectivity, while multiple ports—including HDMI, USB, and a 3.5mm audio jack—ensure compatibility with a wide range of devices.</p><p>The projector also delivers immersive sound through dual 5W stereo surround speakers, eliminating the need for external speakers in many situations. Combining bright visuals, smart features, and versatile connectivity, the Xiaomi Wanbo X5 Pro is an excellent choice for home entertainment and everyday projection needs.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul><li>Native Full HD (1920×1080) resolution</li><li>Supports 4K UHD content playback</li><li>Bright 1100 ANSI lumens output</li><li>3000:1 contrast ratio for enhanced image depth</li><li>Auto-focus and auto-keystone correction</li><li>Projection size from 40\" to 140\"</li><li>Android OS with 1GB RAM and 16GB storage</li><li>Dual-band Wi-Fi (2.4GHz &amp; 5GHz)</li><li>Dual 5W stereo surround speakers</li><li>HDMI, USB, and 3.5mm audio connectivity</li><li>20,000+ hours LED light source lifespan</li><li>Supports front, rear, and ceiling projection</li></ul>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>DLP</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Display Resolution</td><td>1920 × 1080 (Full HD)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Max. Supported Resolution</td><td>3840 × 2160 (4K)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>1100 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>3000:1</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Image Size</strong></td><td>Minimum Screen Size</td><td>40 Inch</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Maximum Screen Size</td><td>140 Inch</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>20,000+ Hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>5W × 2 Stereo Surround Speakers</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI</td><td>1 × HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB</td><td>2 × USB Type-A</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>1 × Audio Jack</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Wireless Connectivity</td><td>Dual-Band Wi-Fi (2.4GHz + 5GHz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>System Configuration</strong></td><td>RAM</td><td>1GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Storage (ROM)</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>External Features</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>6 Months Service Warranty Only</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 35000.00, 35000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/R4u4LGhqggerKIZ6xUN833pHUBzUyflHYVpjX5KC.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-16 04:47:39', '2026-06-16 04:47:39', 'Xiaomi Wanbo X5 Pro 1100 ANSI Lumens Full HD Projector Price in BD\r\n\r\n\r\nXiaomi Wanbo X5 Pro Smart Full HD Projector with Android\r\n\r\n\r\nXiaomi Wanbo X5 Pro 1080P Projector Price in Bangladesh\r\n\r\n\r\nXiaomi Wanbo X5 Pro Smart Projector with Auto Focus & Wi-Fi\r\n\r\n\r\nXiaomi Wanbo X5 Pro Full HD LCD Projector with 1100 ANSI Lumens\r\n\r\n\r\nSEO Recommended Meta Title (60–65 Characters):\r\nXiaomi Wanbo X5 Pro 1100 ANSI Lumens Full HD Projector Price in BD', 'Buy the Xiaomi Wanbo X5 Pro Full HD Smart Projector in Bangladesh. Features 1100 ANSI lumens brightness, 1080p resolution, Android OS, auto focus, auto keystone correction, dual-band Wi-Fi, stereo speakers, and 4K content support for an immersive viewing experience. (160 characters)', 'Xiaomi Wanbo X5 Pro, Wanbo X5 Pro projector, Xiaomi projector Bangladesh, Full HD projector, 1080p projector, smart projector, Android projector, LCD projector, 1100 ANSI lumens projector, home theater projector, portable projector, WiFi projector, dual band WiFi projector, auto focus projector, auto keystone projector, 4K supported projector, Xiaomi smart projector, multimedia projector, LED projector, wireless projector, Xiaomi Wanbo projector, projector price in Bangladesh, Wanbo X5 Pro price in BD, entertainment projector, business projector.', NULL, 52, NULL, NULL),
(700, 'Xiaomi Projector Wanbo DaVinci 1 Pro 650 ANSI Lumens', 'Experience cinematic entertainment with the Xiaomi Wanbo DaVinci 1 Pro Smart Projector. Featuring 1080P Full HD resolution, PixelPro 5.0 optical engine, auto focus, auto keystone correction, obstacle avoidance, Android 11 OS, dual 8W HiFi speakers, and dual-band WiFi, it delivers a smooth and immersive home theater experience.', 'xiaomi-projector-wanbo-davinci-1-pro-650-ansi-lumens-1781586617', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Xiaomi Wanbo DaVinci 1 Pro is a high-performance smart projector designed to elevate your home entertainment experience. With native Full HD 1080P resolution and a projection size range of 40 to 180 inches, it delivers sharp, vibrant, and immersive visuals ideal for movies, gaming, and presentations.</p><p>Powered by PixelPro 5.0 full closed optical engine and advanced LCD projection technology, the DaVinci 1 Pro enhances image clarity while minimizing dust interference for long-lasting performance. With a brightness of 650 ANSI lumens and a 1.33:1 throw ratio, it ensures bright and detailed visuals even in moderately lit environments.</p><p>For effortless setup, the projector includes advanced smart features such as auto focus, auto keystone correction, 4D keystone adjustment, obstacle avoidance, and auto screen fit, ensuring perfect alignment in any space. Running on Android 11 with 2GB RAM and 8GB storage, it provides direct access to apps and streaming platforms via Google Play Store.</p><p>The device supports wireless screen mirroring for both Android and iOS, along with dual-band WiFi and Bluetooth 5.0 for seamless connectivity. Multiple input options including HDMI, dual USB ports, and a headphone jack ensure wide compatibility with external devices.</p><p>Audio performance is enhanced by dual 8W HiFi stereo speakers, delivering rich and powerful sound without the need for external speakers. Combining smart automation, strong audio-visual performance, and modern connectivity, the Xiaomi Wanbo DaVinci 1 Pro is an excellent choice for a premium home cinema experience.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>LCD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>Native 1080p Full HD (supports 4K content)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>650 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>1.2 – 5.0 meters</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9 / 4:3</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Image Size</strong></td><td>Screen Size</td><td>40 – 180 inches</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Image Adjustment</strong></td><td>Keystone Correction</td><td>Automatic (±30° vertical &amp; horizontal)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Focus &amp; Obstacle Avoidance</td><td>Fully automatic</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Zoom</td><td>100% – 50% scaling</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Smart Features</strong></td><td>Casting</td><td>Chromecast support</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>App Access</td><td>Google Play Store supported</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>DRM</td><td>Widevine L1 support</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Noise Level</td><td>&lt;32 dB (quiet operation)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>8W × 2 HiFi stereo speakers</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI</td><td>1 × HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB</td><td>2 × USB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>1 × Audio Jack</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Bluetooth 5.0</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Wireless</td><td>Dual-Band Wi-Fi</td></tr><tr><td><strong>External Features</strong></td><td>Weight</td><td>2.8 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>222 × 196 × 175 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 30000.00, 30000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/tVtNwEGWPXGWPfRkKgeQd9ejIEdvFUFISmngtOPt.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-16 05:10:17', '2026-06-16 05:10:17', 'Xiaomi Wanbo DaVinci 1 Pro 650 ANSI Lumens Full HD Projector Price in BD', 'Buy Xiaomi Wanbo DaVinci 1 Pro Smart Projector in Bangladesh. Features 1080P Full HD resolution, 650 ANSI lumens brightness, Android 11, PixelPro 5.0 optical engine, auto focus, auto keystone correction, obstacle avoidance, dual 8W speakers, WiFi & Bluetooth connectivity for a premium home cinema experience. (160 characters)', 'Xiaomi Wanbo DaVinci 1 Pro, DaVinci 1 Pro projector, Xiaomi projector Bangladesh, smart projector, Full HD projector, 1080p projector, 650 ANSI lumens projector, LCD projector, home theater projector, Android 11 projector, PixelPro 5.0 projector, auto focus projector, auto keystone projector, 4D keystone projector, obstacle avoidance projector, WiFi projector, Bluetooth 5.0 projector, dual 8W speakers projector, portable projector, multimedia projector, gaming projector, projector price in Bangladesh, Wanbo projector BD.', NULL, 52, NULL, NULL),
(701, 'Xiaomi Projector Wanbo Vali 1 900 ANSI Lumens Android Portable', 'The Xiaomi Wanbo Vali 1 Portable Projector delivers a premium home cinema experience with 900 ANSI lumens brightness, Full HD 1080P resolution, Android TV 11, and Netflix-ready streaming. Featuring 200° gimbal projection, auto focus, auto keystone correction, and Chromecast built-in, it offers flexible and immersive entertainment anywhere.', 'xiaomi-projector-wanbo-vali-1-900-ansi-lumens-android-portable-1781587125', '<p>The Xiaomi Wanbo Vali 1 Portable Projector is a premium smart entertainment device designed to deliver a true cinematic experience anywhere. With 900 ANSI lumens brightness and Full HD 1920×1080 TFT LCD resolution, it produces sharp, vibrant, and highly detailed visuals suitable for movies, gaming, and presentations.</p><p>Its advanced 3-piece aspherical pure glass lens ensures distortion-free image clarity, while the innovative 200° gimbal projection system allows flexible positioning for any environment. Supporting projection sizes from 40 to 130 inches and a 1.35:1 throw ratio, it delivers an immersive big-screen experience even in compact spaces.</p><p>Powered by Android TV 11, the Vali 1 offers smooth access to streaming platforms including Netflix, along with DRM L1 certification and built-in Chromecast for seamless content sharing. The ASA 3.0 smart system integrates auto focus, auto keystone correction, screen alignment, and obstacle avoidance, enabling effortless setup and perfect image alignment.</p><p>Connectivity is highly versatile with dual-band Wi-Fi (2.4GHz/5GHz), Bluetooth 5.0, HDMI, USB, and AUX support. Dual 6W speakers with dual-bass diaphragms provide rich and cinematic audio, eliminating the need for external sound systems in most setups.</p><p>With ultra-quiet operation at ≤28dB, compact 2.8kg design, and thoughtful features like remote storage groove and lens protection cover, the Xiaomi Wanbo Vali 1 is ideal for home theater, gaming, and portable entertainment use.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>TFT LCD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>1920 × 1080 (Full HD)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>900 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>1.2 – 3.9 m</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9 (HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Image Size</strong></td><td>Projection Size</td><td>40 – 130 inches (102 cm – 330 cm)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Optical &amp; Image Control</strong></td><td>Zoom Function</td><td>50% – 100%</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Keystone Correction</td><td>Auto</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Focus Adjustment</td><td>Auto</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Obstacle Avoidance</td><td>Auto</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Screen Alignment</td><td>Auto</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Ratio</td><td>1.35:1</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Smart Features</strong></td><td>DRM</td><td>Widevine L1 Certification</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Operating System</td><td>Android TV 11 (Netflix Ready)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Chromecast</td><td>Built-in</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Gaming Mode</td><td>Supported</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Special Features</td><td>ASA 3.0 (AF + Keystone + Screen Fit + Obstacle Avoidance), 200° Gimbal Projection</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Noise Level</strong></td><td>Operating Noise</td><td>≤ 28 dB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lens System</strong></td><td>Lens Type</td><td>3 pcs Aspherical Pure Glass Lens</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>6W × 2</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Sound Features</td><td>Dual-bass diaphragms, high-volume cinema-quality sound</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI</td><td>1 × HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB</td><td>1 × USB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Jack</td><td>1 × AUX</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Bluetooth 5.0</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Wi-Fi</td><td>Dual-band 2.4GHz / 5GHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>External Features</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>2.8 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>254 × 188.8 × 227.6 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 28500.00, 28500.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/yHZGnIKsAb8CKoLZbMNCePyy8Osi4CX5AGDkoj7v.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-16 05:18:45', '2026-06-16 05:18:45', 'Xiaomi Wanbo Vali 1 900 ANSI Lumens Android Portable Projector Price in BD', 'Buy Xiaomi Wanbo Vali 1 Portable Projector in Bangladesh. Features 900 ANSI lumens brightness, Full HD 1080P resolution, Android TV 11, Netflix support, 200° gimbal projection, auto focus, auto keystone correction, Chromecast built-in, and dual 6W speakers for a premium cinematic experience. (160 characters)', 'Xiaomi Wanbo Vali 1, Wanbo Vali 1 projector, Xiaomi projector Bangladesh, portable projector, smart projector, Android TV projector, Full HD projector, 1080p projector, 900 ANSI lumens projector, TFT LCD projector, home theater projector, gaming projector, 200° gimbal projector, auto focus projector, auto keystone projector, ASA 3.0 projector, Chromecast projector, Netflix ready projector, dual band WiFi projector, Bluetooth 5.0 projector, 6W speaker projector, portable cinema projector, projector price in Bangladesh, Xiaomi Wanbo projector BD, Vali 1 projector price.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(702, 'Xiaomi  Projector Wanbo TT 650 Lumens Netflix Certified', 'The Xiaomi Wanbo TT 650 ANSI Lumens Projector delivers Full HD 1080P visuals with Netflix certification, Dolby Audio, and HDR10 support. Featuring auto focus, 4D/4P keystone correction, dual 5W stereo speakers, and Android smart apps, it offers a premium home cinema experience.', 'xiaomi-projector-wanbo-tt-650-lumens-netflix-certified-1781587699', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Xiaomi Wanbo TT 650 Lumens Auto Focus Projector is a Netflix-certified smart projector designed for an immersive home entertainment experience. With Full HD 1080P (1920×1080) resolution and 650 ANSI lumens brightness, it delivers sharp, colorful, and detailed visuals suitable for movies, gaming, and streaming.</p><p>Equipped with a self-developed AI auto-focus system powered by nine-direction gyros, the projector ensures instant and precise focus adjustment while maintaining crystal-clear image quality. The advanced 4D/4P keystone correction allows flexible side projection and angle adjustments up to ±30°, making setup easy in any environment.</p><p>Supporting HDR10 technology, the Wanbo TT enhances contrast and color accuracy for a more realistic viewing experience. The zoom function (50%–100%) allows screen resizing without moving the projector, offering added convenience in tight spaces.</p><p>For audio, it features dual 5W stereo speakers with Dolby Audio and 360° surround sound, delivering a rich and immersive sound experience without external speakers.</p><p>Running on a smart Android-based system with built-in apps like Netflix, Prime Video, and YouTube, it provides direct access to streaming content. Connectivity options include HDMI, USB, dual-band Wi-Fi (2.4GHz &amp; 5GHz), and Bluetooth 5.1, enabling seamless connection with smartphones, laptops, gaming consoles, and external audio devices.</p><p>With its compact design and powerful performance, the Xiaomi Wanbo TT is an excellent choice for home theater, entertainment, and portable projection needs.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>LCD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>1080P Full HD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>650 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>1.1 – 3.3 m</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9 / 4:3</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>3000:1</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Image Size</strong></td><td>Screen Size</td><td>40 – 120 inches</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>20,000 hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>5W × 2</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB</td><td>USB 2.0</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Jack</td><td>3.5 mm</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Wi-Fi</td><td>Dual-band 2.4GHz + 5GHz</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Bluetooth 5.1</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Input</td><td>19V 6.31A</td></tr><tr><td><strong>External Features</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>900 g</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>150 × 140 × 110 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>No Parts Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 26500.00, 26500.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/etAHs1VivSKaQtFmfKKjStuU609wJJhGHInqDtAT.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-16 05:28:19', '2026-06-16 05:28:19', 'Xiaomi Wanbo TT 650 ANSI Lumens Netflix Certified Projector Price in BD', 'Buy Xiaomi Wanbo TT 650 ANSI Lumens Projector in Bangladesh. Features Full HD 1080P resolution, Netflix certification, HDR10, Dolby Audio, auto focus, 4D/4P keystone correction, dual 5W speakers, and smart streaming apps for a premium home cinema experience. (160 characters)', 'Xiaomi Wanbo TT, Wanbo TT projector, Xiaomi projector Bangladesh, Netflix certified projector, 650 ANSI lumens projector, Full HD projector, 1080p projector, smart projector, Dolby Audio projector, HDR10 projector, auto focus projector, AI focus projector, 4D keystone projector, 4P keystone projector, home theater projector, Android projector, dual 5W speaker projector, Dolby Atmos projector, WiFi projector, Bluetooth 5.1 projector, portable projector, gaming projector, streaming projector, projector price in Bangladesh, Xiaomi Wanbo projector BD, TT projector price.', NULL, 52, NULL, NULL),
(703, 'Xiaomi Projector Wanbo Vali 1 900 ANSI Lumens Android Portable', 'The Wanbo X5 Pro Smart Projector delivers a premium home entertainment experience with 900 ANSI Lumens brightness and Full HD 1080p resolution, ensuring sharp and vibrant visuals even in moderately lit environments. Featuring a 200° adjustable gimbal design, ASA 3.0 intelligent image adjustment system (Auto Focus, Auto Keystone, Auto Screen Fit, and Obstacle Avoidance), and a 50%-100% zoom function, it provides effortless setup and flexible projection from 40 to 130 inches. Running on Android TV 11 with Netflix Ready, DRM L1 Certification, and Built-in Chromecast, the projector offers seamless streaming of your favorite content. Its dual 6W stereo speakers with dual-bass diaphragms deliver powerful, cinema-quality audio, while Dual-Band Wi-Fi, Bluetooth 5.0, HDMI, and USB connectivity ensure versatile multimedia support.', 'xiaomi-projector-wanbo-vali-1-900-ansi-lumens-android-portable-1781609072', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Xiaomi Wanbo Vali 1 Portable Projector</strong> is a premium smart entertainment device designed to bring a true cinematic experience to your home, office, or any space you choose. Combining advanced projection technology, intelligent automation, and a sleek portable design, the Vali 1 delivers stunning visuals, immersive audio, and seamless streaming capabilities in a compact form factor.</p><p>Featuring <strong>900 ANSI Lumens brightness</strong> and <strong>Full HD 1920 × 1080 resolution</strong>, the projector produces bright, sharp, and vibrant images with impressive clarity and color accuracy. Powered by a high-quality <strong>TFT LCD display</strong> and a <strong>3-piece aspherical pure glass lens</strong>, it ensures distortion-free projection with enhanced detail and excellent light transmission. Whether you\'re watching movies, streaming content, gaming, or giving presentations, the Vali 1 provides a premium viewing experience on screens ranging from <strong>40 to 130 inches</strong>.</p><h3><strong>Brilliant Full HD Projection</strong></h3><p>The Wanbo Vali 1 delivers crisp and lifelike visuals with its native Full HD resolution and advanced optical system. With a <strong>projection ratio of 1.35:1</strong> and a projection distance of <strong>1.2 to 3.9 meters</strong>, users can enjoy a large-screen experience even in compact rooms. The built-in <strong>50%–100% zoom function</strong> allows convenient screen size adjustment without physically moving the projector.</p><h3><strong>Intelligent ASA 3.0 Auto-Adjustment Technology</strong></h3><p>Setting up the projector is effortless thanks to Wanbo’s intelligent <strong>ASA 3.0 image optimization system</strong>, which includes:</p><ul><li><strong>Auto Focus (AF)</strong> for instant image sharpness</li><li><strong>Auto Keystone Correction (KS)</strong> for accurate image alignment</li><li><strong>Auto Screen Fit</strong> for perfect screen adaptation</li><li><strong>Auto Obstacle Avoidance</strong> to intelligently avoid objects within the projection area</li></ul><p>These smart features automatically optimize the projected image within seconds, ensuring a hassle-free viewing experience every time.</p><h3><strong>Flexible 200° Gimbal Projection Design</strong></h3><p>The innovative <strong>200° adjustable gimbal stand</strong> offers exceptional flexibility for projecting onto walls, ceilings, or angled surfaces. Whether you\'re relaxing in bed, hosting a movie night, or creating ambient room displays, the adjustable design allows you to position the projector exactly where you need it.</p><h3><strong>Android TV 11 with Netflix Ready Streaming</strong></h3><p>Powered by <strong>Android TV 11</strong>, the Wanbo Vali 1 provides direct access to a vast ecosystem of streaming applications and entertainment services. With <strong>Netflix Ready support</strong>, users can enjoy their favorite Netflix content without requiring additional streaming devices. The intuitive interface ensures smooth navigation, app installation, and content discovery.</p><h3><strong>Built-in Chromecast and DRM L1 Certification</strong></h3><p>The projector features <strong>Built-in Chromecast</strong>, allowing wireless casting from smartphones, tablets, and laptops with ease. Additionally, <strong>DRM L1 Certification</strong> enables high-quality streaming from supported premium content platforms, ensuring a superior entertainment experience.</p><h3><strong>Powerful Cinema-Quality Audio</strong></h3><p>The Wanbo Vali 1 is equipped with <strong>dual 6W stereo speakers</strong> enhanced by <strong>dual-bass diaphragm technology</strong> and a large <strong>500CC acoustic cavity</strong>. This audio system delivers rich bass, clear vocals, and immersive sound performance, creating a theater-like atmosphere without requiring external speakers.</p><h3><strong>Optimized for Gaming and Multimedia</strong></h3><p>With its dedicated <strong>Game Mode</strong>, the projector offers smoother performance and enhanced responsiveness for gaming sessions. Combined with Full HD resolution and bright projection output, it provides a highly engaging experience for both casual and competitive gamers.</p><h3><strong>Comprehensive Connectivity Options</strong></h3><p>The projector offers versatile connectivity for various devices and entertainment sources:</p><ul><li><strong>1 × HDMI Port</strong> for laptops, gaming consoles, and media players</li><li><strong>1 × USB Port</strong> for direct multimedia playback</li><li><strong>1 × AUX Audio Output</strong> for external sound systems</li><li><strong>Bluetooth 5.0</strong> for wireless audio connectivity</li><li><strong>Dual-Band Wi-Fi (2.4GHz &amp; 5GHz)</strong> for stable streaming and screen mirroring</li></ul><p>These connectivity options make the projector suitable for home entertainment, gaming, education, and business presentations.</p><h3><strong>Quiet Operation and Premium Design</strong></h3><p>Engineered for comfort, the Wanbo Vali 1 operates at a remarkably low noise level of <strong>≤28dB</strong>, ensuring minimal distraction during movies, meetings, or gaming sessions. Its elegant white finish, integrated <strong>lens protection cover</strong>, and practical <strong>remote control storage groove</strong> add both style and convenience. Weighing only <strong>2.8kg</strong>, it remains highly portable and easy to move between rooms or travel destinations.</p><h3><strong>Key Features of Xiaomi Wanbo Vali 1</strong></h3><ul><li>900 ANSI Lumens High Brightness</li><li>Native Full HD 1080p Resolution</li><li>Android TV 11 Smart Operating System</li><li>Netflix Ready Streaming Support</li><li>Built-in Chromecast</li><li>DRM L1 Certified Content Playback</li><li>ASA 3.0 Smart Auto Adjustment Technology</li><li>Auto Focus and Auto Keystone Correction</li><li>Auto Screen Fit and Obstacle Avoidance</li><li>200° Adjustable Gimbal Projection</li><li>Dual 6W Stereo Speakers with Bass Enhancement</li><li>40–130 Inch Projection Size</li><li>Bluetooth 5.0 and Dual-Band Wi-Fi</li><li>HDMI, USB, and AUX Connectivity</li><li>Quiet ≤28dB Operation</li><li>Compact and Portable 2.8kg Design</li></ul><p>The <strong>Xiaomi Wanbo Vali 1 900 ANSI Lumens Android Portable Projector</strong> is an ideal choice for users seeking a powerful, smart, and portable projection solution. With its combination of high brightness, intelligent image adjustment, immersive sound, and advanced streaming capabilities, it delivers an outstanding entertainment experience wherever you go.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>TFT LCD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>1920 × 1080 (Full HD)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>900 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>1.2m – 3.9m</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Size</td><td>40 – 130 Inches</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>102cm – 330cm</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Ratio</td><td>1.35:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Zoom Function</td><td>50% – 100%</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Keystone Correction</td><td>Auto</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Focus Adjustment</td><td>Auto</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Obstacle Avoidance</td><td>Auto</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Screen Alignment</td><td>Auto</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Noise Level</td><td>≤28dB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lens</td><td>3-Piece Aspherical Pure Glass Lens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Special Features</td><td>200° Gimbal Projection, ASA 3.0 (AF+KS+Screen Fit+Obstacle Avoidance), DRM L1 Certification, Built-in Chromecast, Game Mode, Artistic Ambient Wall Mode, Remote Control Storage Groove, Lens Protection Cover</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>6W × 2 Stereo Speakers</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Features</td><td>Dual-Bass Diaphragms, Cinema-Quality Sound</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating System</strong></td><td>OS</td><td>Android TV 11</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Streaming Support</td><td>Netflix Ready</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI</td><td>1 × HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB</td><td>1 × USB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>1 × AUX Jack</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Bluetooth 5.0</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Wi-Fi</td><td>Dual-Band 2.4GHz / 5GHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>External Features</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>2.8 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>254 × 188.8 × 227.6 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 28500.00, 28500.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/9nbrfsy8CoTQndNS0kvVvstDT7YA4PU2J21fx0SW.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-16 11:24:32', '2026-06-16 11:24:32', 'Xiaomi Wanbo Vali 1 900 ANSI Lumens Android Portable Projector Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy the Xiaomi Wanbo Vali 1 900 ANSI Lumens Android Portable Projector in Bangladesh. Enjoy Full HD 1080p resolution, Android TV 11, Netflix Ready streaming, Built-in Chromecast, Auto Focus, Auto Keystone Correction, Dual 6W Speakers, Bluetooth 5.0, and Dual-Band Wi-Fi for an immersive home theater experience.', 'Xiaomi Wanbo Vali 1, Wanbo Vali 1 Projector, Xiaomi Projector Bangladesh, Android Portable Projector, 900 ANSI Lumens Projector, Full HD Projector, Netflix Ready Projector, Android TV 11 Projector, Smart Projector, Portable Home Theater Projector, Chromecast Built-in Projector, Bluetooth Projector, WiFi Projector, Wanbo Vali 1 Price in Bangladesh', NULL, 52, NULL, NULL);
