(704, 'Xiaomi Projector Wanbo T6 Max 650 Lumens Smart Android Portable LED', 'The Xiaomi Wanbo T6 Max Portable LED Projector delivers stunning Full HD 1080p resolution with 650 ANSI Lumens brightness and advanced HDR10+ technology for vibrant, detailed visuals. Powered by a 64-bit Amlogic T972 processor, 2GB RAM, and 16GB storage, it ensures smooth streaming and multimedia performance. Featuring electric auto focus, 4-point keystone correction, AI voice control, dual-band Wi-Fi, wireless screen mirroring, and dual 5W stereo speakers, the Wanbo T6 Max offers a premium cinematic experience in a stylish and portable design. Its dust-proof optical engine and efficient cooling system enhance durability and long-term performance, making it ideal for home entertainment, gaming, and presentations.', 'xiaomi-projector-wanbo-t6-max-650-lumens-smart-android-portable-led-1781609416', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Xiaomi Wanbo T6 Max Portable LED Projector</strong> is a premium smart projector designed to deliver an exceptional home theater experience with stunning visuals, intelligent features, and powerful performance. Combining elegant aesthetics with advanced projection technology, the T6 Max is ideal for movies, gaming, streaming, business presentations, and everyday entertainment.</p><h2><strong>Brilliant Full HD Projection with HDR10+</strong></h2><p>The Wanbo T6 Max features <strong>Full HD 1920 × 1080 resolution</strong> and a powerful <strong>650 ANSI Lumens LED light source</strong>, providing sharp, vibrant, and detailed images. Enhanced with <strong>HDR10+ technology</strong>, the projector optimizes brightness, contrast, and color reproduction frame by frame, delivering deeper blacks, brighter highlights, and more realistic visuals. Whether you\'re watching blockbuster movies or playing games, you can enjoy an immersive viewing experience with impressive clarity.</p><h2><strong>Premium Design with Flexible Projection</strong></h2><p>Designed with a sophisticated rounded-edge body and chrome-plated decorative accents, the projector offers a modern and elegant appearance. The T6 Max supports <strong>side projection</strong>, allowing greater installation flexibility in various room layouts. Its <strong>4-point keystone correction</strong> technology ensures perfectly aligned rectangular images even when the projector is placed at an angle.</p><h2><strong>High-Performance Hardware</strong></h2><p>Powered by a <strong>64-bit Amlogic T972 processor</strong>, the Wanbo T6 Max delivers fast and responsive performance for multimedia playback and smart applications. The combination of <strong>2GB RAM</strong> and <strong>16GB internal storage</strong> provides smooth multitasking, quick app launches, and sufficient space for apps and content.</p><h2><strong>Intelligent Electric Focus System</strong></h2><p>The projector is equipped with a highly precise <strong>electric focusing motor</strong> that automatically adjusts image sharpness for optimal clarity. This intelligent focus system ensures that projected content remains crisp and detailed, eliminating the need for frequent manual adjustments.</p><h2><strong>AI Voice Control for Smart Convenience</strong></h2><p>With built-in <strong>AI voice control</strong>, users can operate the projector using simple voice commands. Search content, adjust settings, and control various functions effortlessly without needing to navigate through menus manually.</p><h2><strong>Pure Glass Lens for Superior Image Quality</strong></h2><p>The Wanbo T6 Max utilizes a premium <strong>pure glass optical lens</strong>, providing excellent light transmission and enhanced image precision. This high-quality lens helps maintain sharp focus, accurate colors, and long-lasting visual performance over time.</p><h2><strong>Seamless Wireless Connectivity</strong></h2><p>Supporting <strong>dual-band 2.4GHz and 5GHz Wi-Fi</strong>, the projector ensures stable internet connectivity for streaming and online content. It also features both <strong>wireless and wired screen mirroring</strong>, enabling easy content sharing from smartphones, tablets, and laptops to a large screen.</p><h2><strong>Immersive Stereo Audio</strong></h2><p>The projector comes equipped with <strong>dual 5W stereo speakers</strong> that deliver clear dialogue, rich sound effects, and balanced audio performance. The built-in speaker system provides an enjoyable entertainment experience without requiring external speakers for everyday use.</p><h2><strong>Advanced Dust-Proof and Cooling System</strong></h2><p>To enhance durability and maintain image quality, the Wanbo T6 Max incorporates a <strong>fully enclosed dust-proof optical engine</strong> that minimizes dust intrusion. The projector also features a large <strong>8025 cooling fan</strong> and integrated metal optical structure that improve heat dissipation efficiency, reduce LED light attenuation, and significantly extend the lifespan of internal components.</p><h2><strong>Perfect for Home Entertainment</strong></h2><p>Whether you\'re creating a home theater, enjoying sports, streaming online content, gaming, or delivering presentations, the Wanbo T6 Max offers a versatile and reliable solution. Its combination of Full HD resolution, HDR10+ enhancement, intelligent image adjustment, and smart connectivity makes it an excellent choice for users seeking premium portable projection.</p><h2><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul><li>Full HD 1920 × 1080 Native Resolution</li><li>650 ANSI Lumens Brightness</li><li>HDR10+ Image Enhancement Technology</li><li>64-bit Amlogic T972 Processor</li><li>2GB RAM and 16GB Internal Storage</li><li>Electric Auto Focus System</li><li>4-Point Keystone Correction</li><li>Side Projection Support</li><li>AI Voice Control</li><li>Dual-Band 2.4GHz &amp; 5GHz Wi-Fi</li><li>Wireless and Wired Screen Mirroring</li><li>Premium Pure Glass Lens</li><li>Dual 5W Stereo Speakers</li><li>Fully Enclosed Dust-Proof Optical Engine</li><li>Advanced Cooling System with Large 8025 Fan</li><li>Elegant and Portable Design</li></ul><p>The <strong>Xiaomi Wanbo T6 Max Portable LED Projector</strong> combines powerful hardware, intelligent features, and premium image quality to deliver a complete entertainment solution. With HDR10+ visuals, smart voice control, flexible projection capabilities, and immersive audio, it brings the big-screen experience to any environment with ease.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Display Type</td><td>LCD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>1920 × 1080 (Full HD)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>650 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>1.5m – 3m</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Ratio</td><td>1.35:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9, 4:3</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Video Formats</td><td>1080p, 720p, AVC, MPEG-2, MPEG-4</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Details</td><td>Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>20,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>5W × 2</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Formats</td><td>ACC, FLAC, MP2, MP3, WAV, OGG</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>HDMI</td><td>1 × HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB</td><td>2 × USB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>AV Input</td><td>1 × AV</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Headphone Jack</td><td>1 × Headphone</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Bluetooth 5.0</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Wi-Fi</td><td>Dual-Band 2.4GHz / 5GHz</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power</td><td>19V 3A</td></tr><tr><td>External Features</td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>900g</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>110 × 140 × 150 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 26500.00, 26500.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/kWVAcLxvHjeRQ1NiEfPbg7DrPfEhDGTl7LanngD0.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-16 11:30:16', '2026-06-16 11:30:16', 'Xiaomi Wanbo T6 Max 650 ANSI Lumens Android Portable Projector Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy the Xiaomi Wanbo T6 Max 650 ANSI Lumens Android Portable Projector in Bangladesh. Featuring Full HD 1080p resolution, HDR10+ technology, Amlogic T972 processor, AI voice control, electric focus, 4-point keystone correction, dual-band Wi-Fi, screen mirroring, and dual 5W stereo speakers for an immersive home theater experience.', 'Xiaomi Wanbo T6 Max, Wanbo T6 Max Projector, Xiaomi Projector Bangladesh, Android Projector, Full HD Projector, 650 ANSI Lumens Projector, HDR10 Plus Projector, Smart Portable Projector, AI Voice Control Projector, Home Theater Projector, WiFi Projector, Bluetooth Projector, Wanbo T6 Max Price in Bangladesh', NULL, 52, NULL, NULL),
(705, 'Xiaomi Projector Wanbo T2 Ultra 500 ANSI Lumens Android Portable', 'The Wanbo DaVinci 1 Pro Smart Portable Projector delivers a premium home entertainment experience with Full HD 1080p resolution, 500 ANSI Lumens brightness, and a flexible 120° rotating projection design. Equipped with ASA 3.0 intelligent image adjustment (Auto Focus, Auto Keystone, Auto Screen Fit, and Obstacle Avoidance), it ensures a perfectly aligned picture within seconds. The projector supports 45-140 inch screen sizes, features DRM L1 certification for high-quality streaming, and includes dual 5W stereo speakers with dual-bass diaphragms for immersive audio. With dual-band Wi‑Fi, Bluetooth 5.0, HDMI, USB, and AUX connectivity, the DaVinci 1 Pro is ideal for movies, gaming, streaming, and portable home theater setups.', 'xiaomi-projector-wanbo-t2-ultra-500-ansi-lumens-android-portable-1781609677', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Wanbo DaVinci 1 Pro Smart Portable Projector</strong> combines smart automation, compact portability, and impressive audiovisual performance in a sleek modern design. Whether you\'re watching movies, streaming content, gaming, or giving presentations, this projector delivers a large-screen experience with minimal setup effort.</p><h3><strong>Crisp Full HD Projection</strong></h3><p>Featuring a native <strong>1920 × 1080 Full HD resolution</strong>, the DaVinci 1 Pro produces sharp images with excellent detail and natural color reproduction. The <strong>500 ANSI Lumens brightness</strong> provides clear visuals for both daytime and nighttime viewing, while the <strong>3-piece aspherical pure glass lens</strong> enhances clarity and reduces distortion.</p><p>With a projection distance of <strong>1.2m to 3.8m</strong>, users can enjoy screen sizes from <strong>45 inches up to 140 inches</strong>. Support for both <strong>16:9 and 4:3 aspect ratios</strong> ensures compatibility with movies, TV shows, presentations, and classic content.</p><h3><strong>ASA 3.0 Intelligent Image Adjustment</strong></h3><p>Setup is effortless thanks to <strong>ASA 3.0 (AF + KS + Screen Fit + Obstacle Avoidance)</strong> technology. The projector automatically:</p><ol><li><strong>Focuses the image</strong> for maximum sharpness.</li><li><strong>Corrects keystone distortion</strong> to create a perfectly rectangular picture.</li><li><strong>Fits the image</strong> to the available screen area.</li><li><strong>Detects and avoids obstacles</strong> that might interfere with the projection.</li></ol><p>These intelligent adjustments happen within seconds, eliminating the need for manual calibration.</p><h3><strong>Innovative 120° Rotating Projection</strong></h3><p>The projector\'s <strong>120° rotating stand</strong> allows flexible projection angles, making it easy to project onto walls, ceilings, or angled surfaces. This design is especially convenient for bedroom viewing, compact apartments, and portable entertainment setups.</p><h3><strong>Immersive Audio Performance</strong></h3><p>For a richer entertainment experience, the DaVinci 1 Pro features <strong>dual 5W stereo speakers</strong> with <strong>dual-bass diaphragm technology</strong> and a <strong>370CC acoustic cavity</strong>. The result is clearer vocals, deeper bass, and more room-filling sound without requiring external speakers.</p><h3><strong>Smart Streaming and Connectivity</strong></h3><p>The projector includes <strong>DRM L1 certification</strong>, enabling high-quality playback from supported streaming services. Connectivity options include:</p><ul><li><strong>Dual-band 2.4GHz &amp; 5GHz Wi‑Fi</strong> for stable streaming and screen mirroring.</li><li><strong>Bluetooth 5.0</strong> for wireless audio devices and accessories.</li><li><strong>1 × HDMI</strong> for laptops, gaming consoles, and media players.</li><li><strong>1 × USB</strong> for direct media playback.</li><li><strong>1 × 3.5mm AUX output</strong> for external sound systems.</li></ul><h3><strong>Quiet and Portable Design</strong></h3><p>Despite its powerful performance, the projector operates at <strong>≤30 dB</strong>, keeping fan noise to a minimum during movies and presentations. Weighing only <strong>1.5 kg</strong> and measuring <strong>145 × 142 × 219 mm</strong>, it is easy to move between rooms or take on trips.</p><p>The elegant white finish and compact footprint make it a stylish addition to modern living spaces.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li>Native <strong>Full HD 1080p (1920 × 1080)</strong> resolution.</li><li><strong>500 ANSI Lumens</strong> brightness.</li><li><strong>ASA 3.0</strong> intelligent auto adjustment.</li><li><strong>Auto Focus</strong> and <strong>Auto Keystone Correction</strong>.</li><li><strong>Auto Screen Fit</strong> and <strong>Obstacle Avoidance</strong>.</li><li><strong>120° rotating projection</strong> design.</li><li><strong>45-140 inch</strong> projection size.</li><li><strong>Dual 5W stereo speakers</strong> with dual-bass diaphragms.</li><li><strong>DRM L1 certified</strong> streaming support.</li><li><strong>Dual-band Wi‑Fi</strong> and <strong>Bluetooth 5.0</strong>.</li><li>HDMI, USB, and 3.5mm AUX connectivity.</li><li><strong>≤30 dB</strong> ultra-low-noise operation.</li><li><strong>1.5 kg</strong> lightweight portable design.</li></ul>', '<p>Category</p><p>Details</p><p>Display</p><p>Display Type</p><p>LCD</p><p>Resolution</p><p>1920 × 1080 (Full HD)</p><p>Brightness</p><p>500 ANSI Lumens</p><p>Aspect Ratio</p><p>16:9 / 4:3</p><p>Projection</p><p>Projection Distance</p><p>1.2m – 3.8m</p><p>Image Size</p><p>45 – 140 Inches</p><p>Lens</p><p>3-piece aspherical pure glass lens</p><p>Smart Features</p><p>Auto Focus</p><p>Yes</p><p>Auto Keystone Correction</p><p>Yes</p><p>Auto Screen Fit</p>', 'PROJECTOR', 24500.00, 24500.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/oRmtq8M5QISlZQwMk355tSFvn012aSvuxND6bH7U.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-16 11:34:37', '2026-06-16 11:34:37', 'Wanbo DaVinci 1 Pro Smart Portable Projector Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy the Wanbo DaVinci 1 Pro Smart Portable Projector in Bangladesh. Enjoy Full HD 1080p resolution, 500 ANSI Lumens brightness, auto focus, auto keystone correction, obstacle avoidance, DRM L1 certification, dual 5W speakers, Bluetooth 5.0, dual-band Wi‑Fi, and a flexible 120° rotating design for immersive home entertainment.', 'Wanbo DaVinci 1 Pro, DaVinci 1 Pro Projector, Wanbo Projector Bangladesh, Full HD Smart Projector, 500 ANSI Lumens Projector, Auto Focus Projector, Auto Keystone Projector, Portable Home Theater Projector, DRM L1 Projector, Bluetooth 5.0 Projector, Wi‑Fi Projector', NULL, 52, NULL, NULL),
(706, 'Xiaomi Projector Wanbo Cube 2 Pro 500 ANSI Lumens Android Portable', 'The Wanbo T2 Ultra Smart Portable Projector is a compact yet powerful entertainment solution featuring Full HD 1080p resolution, 500 ANSI Lumens brightness, and an innovative 230° adjustable stand for flexible projection on walls, ceilings, or desks. Powered by Android TV 11, it provides direct access to Netflix, Prime Video, YouTube, and other popular streaming platforms. With ToF Auto-Focus and Auto Keystone Correction, quiet 28dB operation, an integrated 8W speaker, dual-band Wi-Fi, Bluetooth 5.0, and a durable lens protection design, the Wanbo T2 Ultra delivers an effortless and immersive home theater experience anywhere.', 'xiaomi-projector-wanbo-cube-2-pro-500-ansi-lumens-android-portable-1781609907', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Wanbo T2 Ultra Smart Portable Projector</strong> is designed for users who want premium entertainment in a highly portable package. Combining Full HD image quality, intelligent automation, built-in smart TV functionality, and a unique adjustable projection design, the T2 Ultra transforms any space into a personal cinema.</p><h2><strong>Crystal-Clear Full HD Projection</strong></h2><p>Equipped with a native <strong>1920 × 1080 Full HD resolution</strong>, the Wanbo T2 Ultra produces sharp, detailed, and vibrant images for movies, TV shows, gaming, and presentations. Its <strong>500 ANSI Lumens brightness</strong> ensures bright and clear visuals, while the projection distance range of <strong>1.2m to 3.5m</strong> supports screen sizes from <strong>40 to 130 inches</strong>, allowing users to enjoy a true big-screen experience even in smaller rooms.</p><h2><strong>Flexible 230° Adjustable Projection Stand</strong></h2><p>One of the standout features of the T2 Ultra is its innovative <strong>230° adjustable stand</strong>, allowing projection onto walls, ceilings, tabletops, and various angles with ease. Whether you\'re watching movies in bed, hosting a movie night, or creating a portable entertainment setup, the flexible design provides exceptional convenience.</p><h2><strong>Advanced ToF Auto-Focus &amp; Auto Keystone</strong></h2><p>The projector utilizes advanced <strong>Time-of-Flight (ToF) Auto-Focus technology</strong> combined with <strong>Auto Keystone Correction</strong> to instantly optimize image clarity and alignment. The system can adjust the picture in as little as <strong>0.1 seconds</strong>, ensuring a perfectly focused and rectangular image even when the projector is moved.</p><h2><strong>Android TV 11 Smart Entertainment</strong></h2><p>Powered by <strong>Android TV 11</strong>, the Wanbo T2 Ultra gives users direct access to thousands of apps and streaming services. Popular platforms such as:</p><ul><li>Netflix</li><li>Prime Video</li><li>YouTube</li><li>Disney+</li><li>Google Play Apps</li></ul><p>can be accessed directly without requiring an external streaming device. The intuitive Android TV interface makes navigation simple and enjoyable.</p><h2><strong>Powerful Audio Performance</strong></h2><p>The built-in <strong>8W speaker</strong> delivers clear dialogue and immersive sound quality, providing an enjoyable entertainment experience without requiring external audio equipment. Whether you\'re watching movies, listening to music, or streaming online content, the integrated audio system enhances every moment.</p><h2><strong>Quiet and Efficient Operation</strong></h2><p>Engineered for distraction-free entertainment, the Wanbo T2 Ultra operates at only <strong>28dB</strong>, making it one of the quieter projectors in its class. This low-noise operation ensures that fan sound never interferes with movies, presentations, or gaming sessions.</p><h2><strong>Durable Lens Protection Design</strong></h2><p>The projector features an intelligent <strong>lens protection mechanism</strong> that automatically protects the lens when closed, helping prevent dust accumulation and improving long-term durability. This design helps maintain image quality while reducing maintenance requirements.</p><h2><strong>Reliable Wireless Connectivity</strong></h2><p>The Wanbo T2 Ultra supports modern wireless technologies, including:</p><ul><li><strong>Dual-Band Wi-Fi (2.4GHz &amp; 5GHz)</strong> for stable streaming and screen casting</li><li><strong>Bluetooth 5.0</strong> for connecting speakers, headphones, and accessories</li></ul><p>These features provide seamless connectivity for entertainment and productivity applications.</p><h2><strong>Multiple Connectivity Options</strong></h2><p>The projector includes a variety of ports for connecting external devices:</p><ul><li><strong>1 × HDMI</strong> for laptops, gaming consoles, and media players</li><li><strong>1 × USB</strong> for direct multimedia playback</li><li><strong>1 × AUX 3.5mm</strong> audio output for external sound systems</li></ul><p>This versatile connectivity ensures compatibility with a wide range of devices.</p><h2><strong>Compact and Portable Design</strong></h2><p>With dimensions of just <strong>113 × 111 × 212 mm</strong> and a lightweight body weighing only <strong>1.4 kg</strong>, the Wanbo T2 Ultra is easy to carry and install anywhere. Its stylish <strong>Deep Night</strong> finish adds a premium appearance that complements modern interiors.</p><h2><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul><li>Native Full HD 1080p Resolution</li><li>500 ANSI Lumens Brightness</li><li>Android TV 11 Built-In</li><li>Netflix, Prime Video, and YouTube Support</li><li>230° Adjustable Projection Stand</li><li>ToF Auto-Focus Technology</li><li>Auto Keystone Correction</li><li>Quiet 28dB Operation</li><li>Built-In 8W Speaker</li><li>Dual-Band Wi-Fi (2.4GHz &amp; 5GHz)</li><li>Bluetooth 5.0 Connectivity</li><li>HDMI, USB, and AUX Ports</li><li>Lens Protection Design</li><li>LED Light Source with 20,000+ Hour Lifespan</li><li>Lightweight 1.4kg Portable Design</li></ul>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Display Type</td><td>LCD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>Full HD 1080p (1920 × 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>500 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>1.2m – 3.5m</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>40 – 130 Inches</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Special Features</td><td>230° Adjustable Stand, ToF Auto-Focus, Auto Keystone Correction, Android TV 11</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Details</td><td>Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>More than 20,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>8W Speaker</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>HDMI</td><td>1 × HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB</td><td>1 × USB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>AUX</td><td>1 × 3.5mm Audio Out</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Bluetooth 5.0</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Wi-Fi</td><td>Dual-Band 2.4GHz &amp; 5GHz</td></tr><tr><td>External Features</td><td>Color</td><td>Deep Night</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>1.4 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>113 × 111 × 212 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>1 Year Service Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 21500.00, 21500.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/ud7O70M1V7GxXHkoWf2TLrF3gu926hDxPwIpp4S1.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-16 11:38:27', '2026-06-16 11:38:27', 'Wanbo T2 Ultra Smart Portable Projector Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy the Wanbo T2 Ultra Smart Portable Projector in Bangladesh. Featuring Full HD 1080p resolution, 500 ANSI Lumens brightness, Android TV 11, Netflix support, 230° adjustable stand, ToF Auto-Focus, Auto Keystone Correction, Bluetooth 5.0, dual-band Wi-Fi, and an 8W speaker for an immersive home theater experience.', 'Wanbo T2 Ultra, Wanbo T2 Ultra Projector, Android TV Projector, Full HD Projector Bangladesh, 500 ANSI Lumens Projector, Smart Portable Projector, Auto Focus Projector, Netflix Projector, Bluetooth Projector, Wi-Fi Projector, Home Theater Projector, Wanbo Projector Price in Bangladesh', NULL, 52, NULL, NULL),
(707, 'Xiaomi Projector Wanbo T2 Max 450 ANSI Lumens Smart Android Portable LED', 'The International Office Solution Portable LCD Projector delivers crisp Full HD 1080p visuals with 450 ANSI lumens brightness. Designed for home entertainment, office presentations, and portable use, it supports up to 120-inch screen size with powerful dual speakers and multiple multimedia formats.', 'xiaomi-projector-wanbo-t2-max-450-ansi-lumens-smart-android-portable-led-1781620166', '<p>The <strong>International Office Solution Portable LCD Projector</strong> is a compact yet powerful projection solution designed for both entertainment and professional use. Featuring Full HD 1080p resolution (1920 x 1080), it delivers sharp and vibrant visuals suitable for movies, presentations, gaming, and educational purposes.</p><p>With <strong>450 ANSI Lumens brightness</strong> and a <strong>2000:1 contrast ratio</strong>, the projector ensures clear image quality in controlled lighting environments. It supports a projection size ranging from <strong>40 inches to 120 inches</strong>, with an optimal projection distance between <strong>1.5 to 3 meters</strong>, making it ideal for small to medium-sized rooms.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>dual 3W built-in stereo speakers</strong>, it provides balanced audio output for an immersive viewing experience without needing external speakers. The projector supports multiple video formats including 1080p, 720p, AVC, MPEG-2, and MPEG-4, ensuring wide compatibility with different media sources.</p><p>For connectivity, it includes a <strong>USB 2.0 interface</strong>, allowing easy plug-and-play access to multimedia devices. The LED lamp offers a long lifespan of up to <strong>20,000 hours</strong>, ensuring durability and long-term usage.</p><p>Its lightweight design of only <strong>900g</strong> and compact dimensions (110 x 140 x 150mm) make it highly portable. Finished in an elegant white color, it fits perfectly into any modern setup.</p><p>Backed by a <strong>1-year service warranty from International Office Solution</strong>, this projector is a reliable and cost-effective choice for both personal and professional use.</p><h2>⚙️ Key Specifications</h2><ul><li>Display Type: LCD</li><li>Resolution: Full HD 1080p (1920 x 1080)</li><li>Brightness: 450 ANSI Lumens</li><li>Contrast Ratio: 2000:1</li><li>Projection Size: 40 – 120 inches</li><li>Projection Distance: 1.5 – 3 meters</li><li>Lamp Type: LED</li><li>Lamp Life: 20,000 hours</li><li>Speakers: 3W x 2 Built-in Stereo</li><li>Video Formats: 1080p, 720p, AVC, MPEG-2, MPEG-4</li><li>Audio Formats: MP3, WAV, FLAC, OGG, AAC, MP2</li><li>Interface: USB 2.0</li><li>Power: 19V 3A</li><li>Weight: 900g</li><li>Dimension: 110 x 140 x 150mm</li><li>Color: White</li><li>Warranty: 1 Year Service Warranty (International Office Solution)</li></ul>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Display Type</td><td>LCD</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Resolution</td><td>1080p (1920 x 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Brightness</td><td>450 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>Min: 1.5 Meter / Max: 3 Meter</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>2000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Image Size</td><td>Min: 40 Inch / Max: 120 Inch</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Video Formats</td><td>1080p, 720p, AVC, MPEG-2, MPEG-4</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Details</td><td>Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Details</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>20,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Audio Formats</td><td>AAC, FLAC, MP2, MP3, WAV, OGG</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>3W x 2 Stereo Speakers</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Interface</td><td>USB 2.0</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Supply</td><td>19V 3A</td></tr><tr><td>External Features</td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>External Features</td><td>Weight</td><td>900 gm</td></tr><tr><td>External Features</td><td>Dimension</td><td>110 x 140 x 150 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td><td>1 Year Service Warranty (Manufacturing Warranty)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 19500.00, 19500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/303Po6M5lkHD9DQLdAHT9dFbIwBgU9HYRLlV3bLX.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-16 14:29:26', '2026-06-16 14:36:42', 'International Office Solution LCD Projector 1080p | 450 ANSI Lumens Portable Mini Projector', 'Buy International Office Solution LCD Projector with Full HD 1080p resolution, 450 ANSI lumens brightness, 120-inch display support, dual speakers, and 20,000-hour lamp life. Ideal for home and office use.', 'International Office Solution projector, LCD projector 1080p, mini projector 450 ANSI lumens, portable home projector, office presentation projector, USB projector 1080p, HD LED projector, 120 inch projector, lightweight projector Bangladesh, IOS projector', NULL, 52, NULL, NULL),
(708, 'Xiaomi Projector Wanbo Mini Pro 250 Lumens Portable', 'The Xiaomi Wanbo Mini Pro is a lightweight portable projector featuring 250 ANSI lumens brightness, HD resolution (supporting Full HD input), built-in Wi-Fi, Android OS, and 40–88 inch projection size. Perfect for movies, gaming, and presentations on the go.', 'xiaomi-projector-wanbo-mini-pro-250-lumens-portable-1781621080', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Xiaomi Wanbo Mini Pro Portable Projector</strong> is designed for users who want a compact yet powerful projection solution for entertainment and work. Featuring LCD display technology with native <strong>1280 × 720 HD resolution</strong> and support for Full HD 1080p input, it delivers sharp and colorful visuals suitable for movies, presentations, and gaming.</p><p>With <strong>250 ANSI lumens brightness</strong>, the projector performs best in dim or dark environments, making it ideal for bedrooms, small meeting rooms, or travel setups. It offers a flexible projection size ranging from <strong>40 inches to 88 inches</strong>, with a throw distance between <strong>3.2 ft and 8.5 ft</strong>, ensuring adaptability in different spaces.</p><p>The device comes with <strong>built-in Wi-Fi, Android OS, HDMI, USB, and 3.5mm audio port</strong>, allowing seamless connectivity with smartphones, laptops, gaming consoles, and streaming apps. The included remote control enhances usability, making navigation simple and convenient.</p><p>For audio, the projector includes a <strong>built-in 3W speaker</strong>, providing clear sound for casual viewing without requiring external speakers. Its lightweight and portable design makes it easy to carry, set up, and enjoy entertainment anywhere.</p><p>Whether for home cinema, business presentations, or travel use, the Xiaomi Wanbo Mini Pro delivers a reliable and smart projection experience in a compact form factor.</p><h2><strong>⚙️ Key Features</strong></h2><ul><li>Native HD LCD Display (1280 × 720)</li><li>Supports Full HD 1080p Input</li><li>250 ANSI Lumens Brightness</li><li>40–88 Inch Projection Size</li><li>3.2 ft – 8.5 ft Projection Distance</li><li>Built-in Android Operating System</li><li>Wi-Fi Wireless Connectivity</li><li>HDMI, USB, 3.5mm Audio Port</li><li>Built-in 3W Speaker</li><li>Remote Control Included</li><li>Portable &amp; Lightweight Design</li></ul><h2><strong>🛒 Buy Now (Rewritten)</strong></h2><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original <strong>Xiaomi Wanbo Mini Pro Portable Projector</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>. We offer a wide range of authentic Xiaomi projectors at competitive prices. Order online or visit your nearest International Office Solution outlet to get yours today.</p><p>This product comes with a <strong>6-month service warranty</strong>.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Display Type</td><td>LCD</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Resolution</td><td>1920 x 1080 (Full HD)</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Brightness</td><td>250 Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>8.5 ft</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Image Size</td><td>88 Inch</td></tr><tr><td>Projection Features</td><td>Operating System</td><td>Android 9.0</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp Details</td><td>Type</td><td>Lamp</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>1 × 3W Speaker</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>HDMI Port</td><td>1x HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB Port</td><td>1x USB</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Audio Jack</td><td>1x 3.5mm</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Wireless</td><td>Wi-Fi / Wireless LAN</td></tr><tr><td>Others</td><td>Remote Control</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>External Features</td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>External Features</td><td>Weight</td><td>0.64 kg</td></tr><tr><td>External Features</td><td>Dimension</td><td>165 × 122 × 86 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Service Warranty</td><td>6 Months Service Only</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 14500.00, 14400.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/0D8dwZTM86u5Qi4y7GAY4HoxX1l0YavIvUc6BfAH.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-16 14:44:40', '2026-06-16 14:44:40', 'Xiaomi Wanbo Mini Pro Portable Projector 250 ANSI Lumens | Android Smart Mini Projector', 'Buy Xiaomi Wanbo Mini Pro Portable Projector with 250 ANSI lumens, HD resolution, Android OS, Wi-Fi, and 40–88 inch display support. Best compact projector for home and travel use in Bangladesh.', 'Xiaomi Wanbo Mini Pro, portable projector Bangladesh, 250 ANSI lumens projector, mini HD projector, Android smart projector, Xiaomi projector price BD, WiFi projector, home theater projector, small portable projector, International Office Solution projector', NULL, 52, NULL, NULL),
(709, 'AUN Projector U001 1000 ANSI Lumens 4K Android', 'This 1000 ANSI Lumens Full HD projector delivers bright and sharp visuals with native 1080p resolution and support for 4K local playback. Featuring a large 50–300-inch projection size, dual-band WiFi, Bluetooth 5.0, dual 5W speakers, and a long-lasting 30,000-hour LED light source, it is ideal for home entertainment, office presentations, and multimedia viewing. Its versatile connectivity options, including HDMI, USB, AV input, and 3.5mm audio output, ensure seamless compatibility with a wide range of devices.', 'aun-projector-u001-1000-ansi-lumens-4k-android-1781672207', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The AUN U001 Portable Android Projector delivers an immersive big-screen viewing experience with native Full HD 1080p resolution and support for 4K local playback via built-in apps and USB media sources. Its HDMI input supports up to 4K video signals, making it compatible with laptops, gaming consoles, TV boxes, and streaming devices. With a brightness of 1000 ANSI lumens and a 2500:1 contrast ratio, the projector produces clear, vibrant visuals with enhanced detail in various lighting conditions.</p><p>Powered by the Android 13.0 operating system, the AUN U001 features an ARM Quad-Core 64-bit Cortex-A35 processor, 2GB RAM, and 16GB internal storage, enabling smooth access to streaming apps and multimedia content. The projector supports dual-band Wi-Fi (2.4GHz/5GHz), Bluetooth 5.0, AirPlay, and Miracast for seamless wireless connectivity and screen mirroring.</p><p>Designed for flexible installation, the projector offers automatic keystone correction, automatic focus, and electronic lens correction for quick and accurate image alignment. It supports projection distances from 1.6 to 9.8 meters and can create screen sizes ranging from 50 to 300 inches. The 1.47:1 throw ratio and support for both 4:3 and 16:9 aspect ratios make it suitable for a wide range of viewing environments. Additionally, red-blue 3D playback support provides a more immersive home cinema experience.</p><p>For audio, the projector includes dual 5W built-in speakers and a 3.5mm audio output for connecting external sound systems. Connectivity options include two USB ports, one HDMI port with ARC support, AV input, Bluetooth 5.0, and dual-band Wi-Fi. The long-life LED light source offers up to 30,000 hours of operation, ensuring years of reliable performance.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li>Native Full HD 1080p resolution</li><li>Supports 4K local playback and 4K HDMI input</li><li>1000 ANSI lumens brightness</li><li>Android 13.0 operating system</li><li>ARM Quad-Core 64-bit Cortex-A35 processor</li><li>2GB RAM and 16GB internal storage</li><li>Auto focus and auto keystone correction</li><li>Dual-band Wi-Fi and Bluetooth 5.0</li><li>AirPlay and Miracast screen mirroring</li><li>50–300-inch projection size</li><li>Red-blue 3D playback support</li><li>Dual 5W built-in speakers</li><li>Up to 30,000 hours LED lamp life</li><li>HDMI ARC, USB, AV, and 3.5mm audio output</li></ul>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>5.7-inch LCD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>Native 1080p (1920×1080), 4K Local Playback (Built-in Apps/USB), HDMI Input up to 4K</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>1000 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>1.6 – 9.8m</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>4:3 / 16:9</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>2500:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>50 – 300 inches</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Up to 30,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>4Ω 5W × 2</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>USB</td><td>USB ×2</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>HDMI</td><td>HDMI ×1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>AV Input</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>3.5mm Audio Out</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Bluetooth 5.0</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>WiFi</td><td>Dual-Band WiFi (2.4GHz / 5GHz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Input Voltage</td><td>AC 100~240V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>73W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specifications</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>2.75 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>27 × 27.3 × 11.4 cm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>1 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 32900.00, 32900.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/UHMDX4jDabWt1l4kYVjKVesxpGlSDLRJtTwJ3ch3.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 04:56:47', '2026-06-17 04:56:47', 'AUN U001 1000 ANSI Lumens 4K Portable Android Projector Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy the AUN U001 4K Portable Android Projector in Bangladesh. Features native 1080p resolution, 1000 ANSI lumens brightness, Android 13 OS, 4K playback support, auto keystone correction, dual-band Wi-Fi, Bluetooth 5.0, and up to 300-inch projection size for an immersive viewing experience.', 'AUN U001 Projector, AUN U001 4K Portable Android Projector, AUN U001 Price in Bangladesh, Android 13 Projector, 1000 ANSI Lumens Projector, Native 1080p Projector, 4K Playback Projector, Portable Smart Projector, Bluetooth WiFi Projector, Home Theater Projector, AUN Android Projector, 300 Inch Projector', NULL, 263, NULL, NULL),
(710, 'AUN Projector U002 850 ANSI Lumens FHD Portable Android', 'The AUN U003 Android Projector offers native Full HD 1080p resolution, 850 ANSI lumens brightness, and support for 4K local playback. Equipped with dual-band Wi-Fi, Bluetooth 5.0, dual 5W speakers, and a long-lasting 30,000-hour LED light source, it delivers an immersive viewing experience with screen sizes ranging from 50 to 200 inches. Ideal for home theaters, gaming, and office presentations.', 'aun-projector-u002-850-ansi-lumens-fhd-portable-android-1781672603', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The AUN U003 Android Projector is designed to deliver an immersive home entertainment experience with sharp visuals, smart connectivity, and versatile projection capabilities. Featuring a native Full HD 1080p resolution and support for 4K local playback through built-in applications and USB media sources, the projector provides clear and detailed images for movies, TV shows, gaming, and presentations. Its HDMI port supports video input up to 1080p, ensuring stable connectivity with laptops, gaming consoles, TV boxes, and other multimedia devices.</p><h3><strong>Bright and Vivid Full HD Projection</strong></h3><p>Equipped with a 5-inch LCD display panel, the AUN U003 offers a native resolution of 1920 × 1080 pixels and a brightness level of 850 ANSI lumens. Combined with a 2000:1 contrast ratio, the projector delivers vibrant colors, improved image depth, and enhanced detail in both bright and dark scenes. Whether you are watching movies, streaming content, or displaying presentations, the projector produces a comfortable and enjoyable viewing experience.</p><h3><strong>Large Screen Experience for Any Room</strong></h3><p>The AUN U003 supports projection distances ranging from 1.4 to 5.7 meters, allowing flexible installation in various environments. It can project screen sizes from 50 inches up to 200 inches, creating a true cinematic experience at home or in the office. The projector supports both 4:3 and 16:9 aspect ratios, making it suitable for a wide variety of content formats.</p><h3><strong>Smart Wireless Connectivity</strong></h3><p>Designed for modern entertainment needs, the AUN U003 features dual-band Wi-Fi (2.4GHz and 5GHz) for stable internet connectivity and smooth streaming performance. Bluetooth 5.0 support allows users to connect wireless speakers, headphones, keyboards, and other compatible devices. These wireless features make the projector a convenient solution for cable-free entertainment and multimedia sharing.</p><h3><strong>Powerful Audio Performance</strong></h3><p>The projector comes equipped with dual 5W built-in speakers that deliver clear and balanced audio for everyday viewing. For users seeking a more immersive sound experience, the 3.5mm audio output enables easy connection to external speakers, soundbars, or home theater systems.</p><h3><strong>Long-Lasting LED Light Source</strong></h3><p>The AUN U003 uses an advanced LED projection system with an impressive lamp life of up to 30,000 hours. This long lifespan minimizes maintenance requirements and provides years of reliable operation, making it an excellent investment for regular home entertainment and professional use.</p><h3><strong>Flexible Connectivity Options</strong></h3><p>The projector includes a range of connectivity options to support different devices and media sources. It features one USB port for multimedia playback, one HDMI port for video input, Bluetooth 5.0 connectivity, dual-band Wi-Fi support, and a 3.5mm audio output for external audio devices. These options ensure seamless compatibility with laptops, smartphones, streaming devices, gaming consoles, and USB storage drives.</p><h3><strong>Compact and Practical Design</strong></h3><p>With its stylish black finish and compact form factor, the AUN U003 blends easily into any home or office environment. Measuring 28 × 27.6 × 11.5 cm and weighing approximately 3 kg, it remains portable enough to move between rooms while providing a stable projection setup.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li>Native Full HD 1080p (1920 × 1080) resolution</li><li>Supports 4K local playback via built-in apps and USB</li><li>850 ANSI lumens brightness</li><li>2000:1 contrast ratio</li><li>50 to 200-inch projection size</li><li>1.4 to 5.7-meter projection distance</li><li>Dual-band Wi-Fi (2.4GHz / 5GHz)</li><li>Bluetooth 5.0 wireless connectivity</li><li>Dual 5W built-in speakers</li><li>HDMI input and USB media playback</li><li>3.5mm audio output for external sound systems</li><li>Long-lasting LED light source with up to 30,000 hours lifespan</li><li>Compact and modern design suitable for home and office use</li></ul><p>The AUN U003 850 ANSI Lumens Full HD Android Projector combines high-definition image quality, wireless connectivity, and a large-screen viewing experience in a practical and affordable package. It is an excellent choice for users seeking a versatile projector for home theaters, online streaming, gaming, education, and business presentations.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>5-inch LCD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>Native Full HD 1080p (1920 × 1080), 4K Local Playback (Built-in Apps/USB), HDMI Input up to 1080p</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>850 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>1.4 – 5.7m</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>4:3 / 16:9</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>2000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>50 – 200 Inches</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Up to 30,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>4Ω 5W × 2</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>USB</td><td>1 × USB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>HDMI</td><td>1 × HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>3.5mm Audio Out</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Bluetooth 5.0</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Wi-Fi</td><td>Dual-Band Wi-Fi (2.4GHz / 5GHz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Input Voltage</td><td>AC 100V – 240V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>73W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specifications</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>3 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>28 × 27.6 × 11.5 cm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>1 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 25900.00, 25900.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/qXSJPlVYESUkscBT7u0t0zGWsAbmKjLxy8ZqAZXg.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 05:03:23', '2026-06-17 05:03:23', 'AUN U003 850 ANSI Lumens Full HD Android Projector Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy the AUN U003 Full HD Android Projector in Bangladesh. Featuring native 1080p resolution, 850 ANSI lumens brightness, 4K local playback, dual-band Wi-Fi, Bluetooth 5.0, dual 5W speakers, and a projection size of up to 200 inches. Perfect for home entertainment, streaming, and presentations.', 'AUN U003 Projector, AUN U003 Android Projector, AUN U003 Price in Bangladesh, 850 ANSI Lumens Projector, Full HD Projector, Native 1080p Projector, Android Smart Projector, WiFi Bluetooth Projector, Portable Home Theater Projector, AUN Projector Bangladesh, 200 Inch Projector, LED Projector', NULL, 263, NULL, NULL);
