(711, 'AUN Projector AKEY9S 850 ANSI Lumens FHD Android', 'The AUN AKEY9S FHD Android Projector features native 1080p Full HD resolution, 850 ANSI lumens brightness, and support for 4K local playback. Powered by Android 9.0 with 2GB RAM and 64GB storage, it offers dual-band Wi-Fi, Bluetooth 5.1, auto focus, auto keystone correction, and a projection size of up to 300 inches. With dual HDMI ports, LAN connectivity, built-in streaming apps, and dual 5W speakers, it is ideal for home entertainment, gaming, and presentations.', 'aun-projector-akey9s-850-ansi-lumens-fhd-android-1781673013', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The AUN AKEY9S FHD Android Projector is designed to deliver an immersive home entertainment experience with Full HD clarity, smart connectivity, and large-screen projection capabilities. Featuring a 5.7-inch LCD display panel and native 1080p resolution, this projector produces sharp and detailed visuals for movies, sports, gaming, and business presentations. It also supports 4K local playback through built-in applications and USB storage devices, while HDMI inputs support video signals up to 4K for enhanced compatibility with modern multimedia devices.</p><h2><strong>Bright Full HD Visual Performance</strong></h2><p>Equipped with 850 ANSI lumens brightness and a 2000:1 contrast ratio, the AUN AKEY9S delivers vivid colors, balanced contrast, and clear image quality in various viewing environments. The projector operates at a smooth 60Hz refresh rate, ensuring fluid playback for streaming content, videos, and presentations.</p><h2><strong>Auto Focus and Keystone Correction</strong></h2><p>The projector features electronic and automatic lens correction technology for fast image optimization. Automatic keystone correction helps maintain a perfectly aligned rectangular image even when the projector is positioned at different angles, reducing setup time and improving convenience.</p><h2><strong>Massive Screen Projection</strong></h2><p>The AUN AKEY9S supports projection distances from 1.6 to 9.8 meters and can create screen sizes ranging from 50 to 300 inches. With a 1.47:1 throw ratio and support for both 4:3 and 16:9 aspect ratios, users can easily adapt the projector to different room sizes and viewing requirements.</p><h2><strong>Smart Android Entertainment System</strong></h2><p>Powered by Android 9.0 and the MTK9255 64-bit processor, the projector provides a smooth smart entertainment experience. With 2GB RAM and 64GB internal storage, users can install applications, store media files, and access popular streaming platforms directly from the projector.</p><p>Built-in applications include:</p><ul><li>Netflix</li><li>YouTube</li><li>Prime Video</li></ul><p>The system also supports multiple language options for enhanced usability.</p><h2><strong>Wireless Streaming and Screen Mirroring</strong></h2><p>The AUN AKEY9S comes equipped with dual-band Wi-Fi (2.4GHz and 5GHz) and Bluetooth 5.1 for stable wireless connectivity. AirPlay and Miracast support enable effortless screen mirroring from compatible smartphones, tablets, and laptops, allowing users to share content without cables.</p><h2><strong>Rich Audio and Flexible Connectivity</strong></h2><p>For audio performance, the projector features dual 4Ω 5W built-in speakers that provide clear and balanced sound. Users can also connect external audio systems through the 3.5mm audio output for a more immersive experience.</p><p>Connectivity options include:</p><ul><li>2 × USB ports</li><li>2 × HDMI ports</li><li>AV input</li><li>LAN (Ethernet) port</li><li>3.5mm audio output</li><li>Bluetooth 5.1</li><li>Dual-band Wi-Fi</li></ul><p>These versatile interfaces make the projector compatible with gaming consoles, PCs, streaming devices, media players, and external storage devices.</p><h2><strong>Long-Lasting LED Light Source</strong></h2><p>The advanced LED light source offers up to 30,000 hours of operating life, ensuring years of reliable use with minimal maintenance. The projector also supports red-blue 3D playback for users who enjoy immersive 3D entertainment.</p><h2><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul><li>Native Full HD 1080p resolution</li><li>4K local playback support</li><li>HDMI input supports up to 4K signals</li><li>850 ANSI lumens brightness</li><li>2000:1 contrast ratio</li><li>Android 9.0 operating system</li><li>MTK9255 64-bit processor</li><li>2GB RAM and 64GB internal storage</li><li>Automatic focus and keystone correction</li><li>Dual-band Wi-Fi (2.4GHz/5GHz)</li><li>Bluetooth 5.1 connectivity</li><li>AirPlay and Miracast screen mirroring</li><li>50–300-inch projection size</li><li>Red-blue 3D playback support</li><li>Dual 5W built-in speakers</li><li>Dual HDMI, USB, AV, and LAN connectivity</li><li>Up to 30,000-hour LED lamp life</li></ul><p>The AUN AKEY9S FHD Android Projector is an excellent solution for users looking for a smart projector with Full HD image quality, large-screen projection, wireless connectivity, and built-in streaming capabilities for home entertainment and professional applications.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>5.7-inch LCD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>Native Full HD 1080p (1920 × 1080), 4K Local Playback (Built-in Apps/USB), HDMI Input up to 4K</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>850 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>1.6 – 9.8m</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>4:3 / 16:9</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>2000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>50 – 300 Inches</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Up to 30,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>4Ω 5W × 2</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>USB</td><td>2 × USB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>HDMI</td><td>2 × HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>AV Input</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>LAN Port</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>3.5mm Audio Out</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Bluetooth 5.1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Wi-Fi</td><td>Dual-Band Wi-Fi (2.4GHz / 5GHz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Input Voltage</td><td>AC 90V – 260V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>160W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specifications</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>2.70 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>29 × 27 × 12 cm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>1 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 22900.00, 22900.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/pmoJrYLpm4QvogpQCIlp5xNkLQctEPxL6Oaag3iZ.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 05:10:13', '2026-06-17 05:10:13', 'AUN AKEY9S FHD Android Projector Price in Bangladesh | 850 ANSI Lumens', 'Buy the AUN AKEY9S FHD Android Projector in Bangladesh. Features native 1080p resolution, 850 ANSI lumens brightness, Android 9.0 OS, 4K playback support, auto focus, auto keystone correction, Bluetooth 5.1, dual-band Wi-Fi, and up to 300-inch screen projection for immersive entertainment.', 'AUN AKEY9S Projector, AUN AKEY9S FHD Android Projector, AUN AKEY9S Price in Bangladesh, Android Projector, Full HD Projector, 850 ANSI Lumens Projector, 4K Playback Projector, Smart Projector, WiFi Bluetooth Projector, Home Theater Projector, AUN Projector Bangladesh, 300 Inch Projector, Android 9.0 Projector', NULL, 263, NULL, NULL),
(712, 'AUN Projector A45 FHD Home Cinema Android', 'The AUN A45 FHD Home Cinema Android Projector delivers native Full HD 1080p resolution with 400 ANSI lumens brightness for clear and vibrant visuals. Powered by Android 9 with dual-band Wi-Fi and Bluetooth 5.3, it supports wireless screen mirroring and 4K local playback. With a 10W HiFi speaker and up to 150-inch projection size, it is perfect for home entertainment, movies, and gaming.', 'aun-projector-a45-fhd-home-cinema-android-1781673517', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The AUN A45 FHD Home Cinema Android Projector is a compact and affordable smart projector designed to bring a true cinematic experience to your home. Featuring a native Full HD 1080p resolution and a 4-inch LCD display panel, it delivers sharp images, vibrant colors, and impressive detail for movies, TV shows, gaming, and presentations. With support for 4K local playback via built-in applications and USB media sources, the projector ensures a versatile and enjoyable viewing experience.</p><h2><strong>Full HD Visuals with Large-Screen Entertainment</strong></h2><p>Equipped with a native resolution of 1920 × 1080 pixels, the AUN A45 produces crisp and detailed images for everyday entertainment. Its 400 ANSI lumens brightness and 2000:1 contrast ratio provide balanced picture quality, making it ideal for use in dark or low-light environments. The projector supports screen sizes ranging from 47 to 150 inches, allowing users to enjoy a theater-like viewing experience from the comfort of their home.</p><h2><strong>Smart Android 9 Operating System</strong></h2><p>Powered by Android 9, the AUN A45 offers a user-friendly smart interface that allows easy access to streaming services, media applications, and online content. The projector comes with 1GB RAM and 8GB internal storage, providing sufficient performance for streaming videos, installing essential apps, and managing everyday entertainment tasks.</p><h2><strong>Smooth Wireless Connectivity</strong></h2><p>The projector supports dual-band Wi-Fi (2.4GHz and 5GHz), ensuring stable internet connectivity and smooth content streaming. Wireless screen mirroring allows users to share content directly from smartphones, tablets, and laptops without requiring additional cables. Bluetooth 5.3 support makes it easy to connect wireless speakers, headphones, keyboards, and other compatible devices.</p><h2><strong>Powerful Built-In Audio</strong></h2><p>The AUN A45 features a powerful 10W HiFi speaker that delivers clear, immersive audio for movies, music, and gaming. The enhanced audio performance reduces the need for external speakers in small and medium-sized rooms. For users who prefer a larger sound system, the projector also includes a 3.5mm audio output for connecting external speakers or soundbars.</p><h2><strong>Flexible Projection Capabilities</strong></h2><p>With a projection distance ranging from 1.39 to 4.45 meters, the projector can create images from 47 inches up to 150 inches. Support for both 4:3 and 16:9 aspect ratios ensures compatibility with various content formats, while the compact design makes it suitable for bedrooms, living rooms, classrooms, and office spaces.</p><h2><strong>Wide Device Compatibility</strong></h2><p>The AUN A45 offers multiple connectivity options, making it compatible with a wide range of devices. Users can easily connect PCs, laptops, TV boxes, gaming consoles such as PS4, PS5, and Xbox, streaming devices like Fire TV Stick, smartphones, and USB storage devices.</p><h3><strong>Connectivity Options</strong></h3><ul><li>1 × HDMI Port</li><li>1 × USB Port</li><li>AV Input</li><li>3.5mm Audio Output</li><li>Dual-Band Wi-Fi (2.4GHz / 5GHz)</li><li>Bluetooth 5.3</li></ul><h2><strong>Long-Lasting LED Light Source</strong></h2><p>The advanced LED lamp system provides up to 30,000 hours of operating life, ensuring years of reliable performance with minimal maintenance requirements.</p><h2><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul><li>Native Full HD 1080p resolution</li><li>4-inch LCD display technology</li><li>Supports 4K local playback</li><li>400 ANSI lumens brightness</li><li>2000:1 contrast ratio</li><li>Android 9 operating system</li><li>1GB RAM and 8GB internal storage</li><li>Dual-band Wi-Fi connectivity</li><li>Bluetooth 5.3 support</li><li>Wireless screen mirroring</li><li>10W HiFi built-in speaker</li><li>Projection size up to 150 inches</li><li>HDMI, USB, AV, and audio output connectivity</li><li>Up to 30,000-hour LED lamp life</li><li>Compact and lightweight design</li></ul><p>The AUN A45 FHD Home Cinema Android Projector is an excellent choice for users seeking an affordable smart projector with Full HD image quality, wireless connectivity, built-in Android features, and versatile compatibility for home entertainment, streaming, gaming, and presentations.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>4-inch LCD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>Native Full HD 1080p (1920 × 1080), 4K Local Playback (Built-in Apps/USB), HDMI Input up to 1080p</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>400 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>1.39 – 4.45m</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>4:3 / 16:9</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>2000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>47 – 150 Inches</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Up to 30,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>4Ω 10W Speaker</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>USB</td><td>1 × USB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>HDMI</td><td>1 × HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>AV Input</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>3.5mm Audio Out</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Bluetooth 5.3</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Wi-Fi</td><td>Dual-Band Wi-Fi (2.4GHz / 5GHz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Input Voltage</td><td>AC 100V – 240V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>65W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specifications</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>1.5 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>22.3 × 19.8 × 9.7 cm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>1 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 13500.00, 13500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/zxoBazmqVosBjZkJS026DT2H9wLk7ObVpb5VXBwn.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 05:18:37', '2026-06-17 05:18:37', 'AUN A45 FHD Home Cinema Android Projector Price in Bangladesh | 400 ANSI Lumens', 'Buy the AUN A45 FHD Home Cinema Android Projector in Bangladesh. It features native Full HD 1080p resolution, 400 ANSI lumens brightness, Android 9 OS, 4K local playback support, dual-band Wi-Fi, Bluetooth 5.3, and a powerful 10W HiFi speaker. Enjoy up to 150-inch big-screen entertainment for movies, gaming, and streaming.', 'AUN A45 Projector, AUN A45 Android Projector, AUN A45 Price in Bangladesh, FHD Home Cinema Projector, 400 ANSI Lumens Projector, Native 1080p Projector, Android 9 Projector, Smart WiFi Projector, Bluetooth 5.3 Projector, Home Theater Projector, Portable Projector Bangladesh, 150 Inch Projector, AUN Projector Bangladesh', NULL, 263, NULL, NULL),
(713, 'AUN Projector A005 Pro Short Throw FHD Android', 'The AUN A005 Pro Short Throw FHD Android Projector features native Full HD 1080p resolution and 400 ANSI lumens brightness for clear and vibrant visuals in low-light environments. Powered by Android 14 with 2GB RAM and 32GB storage, it offers smooth performance, built-in streaming apps, and short-throw projection for large images in small spaces. Ideal for home entertainment, gaming, and streaming.', 'aun-projector-a005-pro-short-throw-fhd-android-1781673960', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The AUN A005 Pro Short Throw FHD Android Projector is a compact and modern home entertainment device designed to deliver a cinematic viewing experience even in limited spaces. With native Full HD 1080p resolution (1920 × 1080 pixels), it produces sharp, detailed, and vibrant visuals, making it suitable for movies, gaming, online streaming, and presentations.</p><h2><strong>Full HD Visual Experience</strong></h2><p>Featuring 400 ANSI lumens brightness, the AUN A005 Pro performs best in dim or low-light environments, ensuring clear and comfortable viewing. Its Full HD LCD projection technology enhances color accuracy and image clarity, delivering an immersive large-screen experience for everyday entertainment.</p><h2><strong>Smart Android 14 System</strong></h2><p>Powered by the latest Android 14 operating system, this projector offers a smooth and intuitive smart interface. Users can easily access popular streaming platforms, install applications, browse content, and enjoy online entertainment directly from the device. With 2GB RAM and 32GB internal storage, it provides stable performance and sufficient space for apps and media files.</p><h2><strong>Short Throw Projection Advantage</strong></h2><p>One of the key highlights of the AUN A005 Pro is its short-throw capability, which allows users to project a large screen from a short distance. This makes it ideal for bedrooms, small living rooms, dorms, and compact spaces where traditional long-throw projectors may not be practical.</p><h2><strong>Flexible Connectivity Options</strong></h2><p>The projector includes essential connectivity ports for versatile usage:</p><ul><li>HDMI input for laptops, gaming consoles, and TV boxes</li><li>USB port for media playback</li><li>3.5mm audio output for external speakers or headphones</li></ul><p>These options ensure seamless compatibility with a wide range of devices.</p><h2><strong>Compact and User-Friendly Design</strong></h2><p>Designed with portability and convenience in mind, the AUN A005 Pro is easy to set up and operate. Its compact form factor allows flexible placement, while the Android-based interface ensures effortless navigation and content access.</p><h2><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul><li>Native Full HD 1080p resolution</li><li>400 ANSI lumens brightness</li><li>Android 14 operating system</li><li>2GB RAM and 32GB storage</li><li>Short-throw projection for small spaces</li><li>HDMI, USB, and 3.5mm audio output</li><li>Built-in smart apps and streaming support</li><li>Compact and portable design</li><li>Ideal for home entertainment and gaming</li></ul><p>The AUN A005 Pro Short Throw FHD Android Projector is an excellent choice for users seeking an affordable smart projector with modern Android features, Full HD image quality, and space-saving short-throw projection capability.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>3.5-inch LCD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>Native Full HD 1080p (1920 × 1080), 4K Local Playback (Built-in Apps/USB), H.265 8K@24fps Decoding, HDMI Input up to 1080p</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>400 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>1.6 – 9.8m</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>1.16 – 3.5m <i>(as provided)</i></td></tr><tr><td>&n