gladesh, Home Theater Projector, Portable Android Projector', NULL, 263, NULL, NULL),
(714, 'AUNProjector A005 350 ANSI Lumens FHD Android', 'The AUN A005 FHD Android Projector features native Full HD 1080p resolution with 350 ANSI lumens brightness for clear and balanced visuals in low-light environments. Powered by Android 11 with 1GB RAM and 8GB storage, it supports dual-band Wi-Fi, Bluetooth 5.0, AirPlay, and Miracast. With 4K local playback, auto keystone correction, and up to 150-inch projection, it is ideal for home entertainment and streaming.', 'aunprojector-a005-350-ansi-lumens-fhd-android-1781674339', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The AUN A005 FHD Android Projector is a compact and versatile home entertainment device designed to deliver an immersive viewing experience with native Full HD 1080p resolution. Built with a 3.5-inch LCD panel, it ensures detailed visuals, stable color reproduction, and consistent image quality for movies, gaming, streaming, and presentations.</p><h2><strong>Full HD Projection with Balanced Brightness</strong></h2><p>The projector supports native 1080p resolution while also allowing 4K local playback through built-in apps and USB media sources. With 350 ANSI lumens brightness and a 2500:1 contrast ratio, it delivers clear and well-balanced visuals in dark or low-light environments, making it suitable for indoor entertainment setups.</p><h2><strong>Smooth Performance and Smart Features</strong></h2><p>Powered by the Allwinner H713 processor, the AUN A005 runs on Android 11.0, offering a user-friendly smart interface. It comes with 1GB RAM and 8GB internal storage, allowing users to install apps and access popular streaming platforms such as YouTube, Netflix, and Prime Video.</p><p>The projector also supports AirPlay and Miracast screen mirroring, enabling wireless content sharing from smartphones, tablets, and laptops with ease.</p><h2><strong>Flexible Projection Setup</strong></h2><p>The AUN A005 supports projection distances from 1.16 to 3.5 meters and can display screen sizes ranging from 50 to 150 inches. With support for both 4:3 and 16:9 aspect ratios and a 1.05:1 throw ratio, it provides flexible installation options for different room sizes.</p><p>Automatic electronic lens correction and keystone correction help users quickly align and adjust the projection for a perfectly shaped image without manual effort.</p><h2><strong>Wireless Connectivity and Multimedia Support</strong></h2><p>The projector features dual-band Wi-Fi (2.4GHz/5GHz) and Bluetooth 5.0 for stable wireless performance. Users can easily connect external devices, stream content, or pair wireless accessories such as speakers and headphones.</p><h3><strong>Connectivity Options:</strong></h3><ul><li>1 × HDMI port (up to 1080p input)</li><li>1 × USB port</li><li>3.5mm audio output</li></ul><h2><strong>Audio and Entertainment Experience</strong></h2><p>The built-in 4Ω 3W speaker provides basic audio output for casual viewing. For a more immersive experience, users can connect external speakers or sound systems via the audio output port.</p><h2><strong>Durable LED Lighting System</strong></h2><p>Equipped with an LED light source rated for up to 30,000 hours, the AUN A005 ensures long-lasting performance with minimal maintenance, making it a reliable choice for regular home entertainment use.</p><h2><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul><li>Native Full HD 1080p resolution</li><li>350 ANSI lumens brightness</li><li>Android 11 operating system</li><li>Allwinner H713 processor</li><li>1GB RAM and 8GB storage</li><li>4K local playback support</li><li>Auto keystone correction</li><li>Dual-band Wi-Fi and Bluetooth 5.0</li><li>AirPlay and Miracast support</li><li>50–150 inch projection size</li><li>Built-in apps: YouTube, Netflix, Prime Video</li><li>30,000-hour LED lamp life</li></ul><p>The AUN A005 350 ANSI Lumens FHD Android Projector is a budget-friendly smart projector designed for users who want Full HD entertainment, wireless connectivity, and built-in streaming apps in a compact and easy-to-use device.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>3.5-inch LCD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>Native Full HD 1080p (1920 × 1080), 4K Local Playback (Built-in Apps/USB), HDMI Input up to 1080p</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>350 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>1.16 – 3.5m</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>4:3 / 16:9</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>2500:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>50 – 150 Inches</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Up to 30,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>4Ω 3W Speaker</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>USB</td><td>1 × USB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>HDMI</td><td>1 × HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>3.5mm Audio Out</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Bluetooth 5.0</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Wi-Fi</td><td>Dual-Band Wi-Fi (2.4GHz / 5GHz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Input Voltage</td><td>AC 100V – 240V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>73W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specifications</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>0.90 kg (Without Bracket) / 1.35 kg (With Bracket)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>6.5 × 17.5 × 18 cm (Without Bracket)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>1 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 9990.00, 9990.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/cyZX9K7FDU6fYo7BSkMH1U6NF3IyeBY4GsJZyZid.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 05:32:19', '2026-06-17 05:41:37', 'AUN A005 FHD Android Projector Price in Bangladesh | 350 ANSI Lumens Smart Projector', 'Buy the AUN A005 FHD Android Projector in Bangladesh. It features native 1080p resolution, 350 ANSI lumens brightness, Android 11 OS, 1GB RAM, 8GB storage, 4K playback support, auto keystone correction, and wireless connectivity with WiFi and Bluetooth. Perfect for home movies, gaming, and streaming.', 'AUN A005 Projector, AUN A005 Android Projector, AUN A005 Price in Bangladesh, 350 ANSI Lumens Projector, FHD Android Projector, Native 1080p Projector, Android 11 Projector, Smart Projector Bangladesh, Mini Home Theater Projector, WiFi Bluetooth Projector, AUN Projector Price BD, Portable Android Projector, 150 Inch Projector', NULL, 263, NULL, NULL),
(715, 'AUN Projector A45 Pro FHD Home Cinema Android TV', 'The AUN A45 Pro FHD Home Cinema Android Projector delivers native 1080p Full HD resolution with 400 ANSI lumens brightness for clear and vibrant visuals. Powered by Android TV 11.0, it supports Netflix, Prime Video, dual-band Wi-Fi, and Bluetooth 5.0. With 4K playback support, 150-inch projection size, and a 10W built-in speaker, it is ideal for immersive home entertainment.', 'aun-projector-a45-pro-fhd-home-cinema-android-tv-1781674746', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The AUN A45 Pro FHD Home Cinema Android Projector is a powerful and compact entertainment solution designed for modern home users. Featuring native Full HD 1080p resolution and support for 4K playback, it delivers sharp visuals, rich colors, and an immersive viewing experience suitable for movies, gaming, streaming, and presentations.</p><h2><strong>Full HD Visual Performance</strong></h2><p>With a 4-inch LCD display panel, the AUN A45 Pro produces crisp and detailed images. Its 400 ANSI lumens brightness and 2000:1 contrast ratio ensure balanced visuals in moderately lit environments. The projector supports screen sizes up to 150 inches, transforming any wall into a cinematic display.</p><h2><strong>Smart Android TV Experience</strong></h2><p>Powered by Android TV 11.0, the AUN A45 Pro provides seamless access to popular streaming platforms including Netflix and Prime Video. The system comes with 1GB RAM and 8GB internal storage, ensuring smooth performance for everyday entertainment use.</p><p>Built-in wireless connectivity includes:</p><ul><li>Dual-band Wi-Fi (2.4GHz / 5GHz)</li><li>Bluetooth 5.0</li><li>AirPlay and Miracast screen mirroring</li></ul><p>These features allow effortless content sharing from smartphones, tablets, and laptops.</p><h2><strong>Flexible Projection Setup</strong></h2><p>The projector offers a projection distance of 1.39 to 4.45 meters with a throw ratio of 1.33:1, making it suitable for various room sizes. Electronic keystone correction and lens adjustment help ensure a properly aligned image, even when placed at different angles.</p><h2><strong>Strong Audio Performance</strong></h2><p>Equipped with a built-in 10W speaker, the AUN A45 Pro delivers clear and immersive sound for movies and music. This reduces the need for external speakers in small to medium-sized rooms while still offering solid audio performance.</p><h2><strong>Portable and Practical Design</strong></h2><p>Weighing only 1.5 kg and measuring 22.3 × 19.8 × 9.7 cm, this projector is highly portable and easy to set up anywhere. Its compact design makes it suitable for bedrooms, living rooms, dorms, and small office spaces.</p><h2><strong>Connectivity Options</strong></h2><p>The AUN A45 Pro supports multiple input methods for versatile usage:</p><ul><li>HDMI input</li><li>USB port</li><li>AV input</li><li>3.5mm audio output</li></ul><p>This ensures compatibility with gaming consoles, laptops, TV boxes, USB drives, and external speakers.</p><h2><strong>Durable LED Technology</strong></h2><p>With a long-lasting LED lamp life of up to 30,000 hours, the projector ensures years of reliable performance with minimal maintenance.</p><h2><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul><li>Native Full HD 1080p resolution</li><li>4K playback support</li><li>Android TV 11.0 system</li><li>400 ANSI lumens brightness</li><li>150-inch projection size</li><li>4-inch LCD display</li><li>1GB RAM + 8GB ROM</li><li>Dual-band Wi-Fi &amp; Bluetooth 5.0</li><li>Netflix &amp; Prime Video pre-installed</li><li>10W built-in speaker</li><li>Electronic keystone correction</li><li>30,000-hour LED lamp life</li><li>Lightweight portable design (1.5 kg)</li></ul><p>The AUN A45 Pro FHD Home Cinema Android Projector is an excellent choice for users seeking a smart, portable, and feature-rich projector for home entertainment, streaming, gaming, and everyday multimedia use.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>4-inch LCD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>Native Full HD 1080p (1920 × 1080), 4K Local Playback (Built-in Apps/USB), HDMI Input up to 1080p</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>400 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>1.39 – 4.45 m</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>4:3 / 16:9</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>2000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>47 – 150 Inches</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Up to 30,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>4Ω 10W Speaker</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>USB</td><td>1 × USB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>HDMI</td><td>1 × HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>AV Input</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>3.5mm Audio Out</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Bluetooth 5.0</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Wi-Fi</td><td>Dual-Band Wi-Fi (2.4GHz / 5GHz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Input Voltage</td><td>AC 100V – 240V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>65W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specifications</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>1.5 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>22.3 × 19.8 × 9.7 cm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>1 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 14500.00, 14500.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/Z4wXTmmdsQ6ZuQPf2XhEBggMqZ5tyzTyQlexpVTV.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 05:39:06', '2026-06-17 05:39:06', 'AUN A45 Pro FHD Android Home Cinema Projector Price in Bangladesh | 400 ANSI Lumens', 'Buy the AUN A45 Pro FHD Home Cinema Android Projector in Bangladesh. It features native 1080p resolution, 400 ANSI lumens brightness, Android TV 11.0, 4K playback support, Netflix and Prime Video, dual-band Wi-Fi, Bluetooth 5.0, and up to 150-inch screen size for immersive home entertainment.', 'AUN A45 Pro Projector, AUN A45 Android Projector, AUN A45 Price in Bangladesh, FHD Home Cinema Projector, 400 ANSI Lumens Projector, Android TV 11 Projector, Native 1080p Projector, Smart Projector Bangladesh, Netflix Projector, WiFi Bluetooth Projector, Mini Home Theater Projector, Portable Android Projector, 150 Inch Projector', NULL, 263, NULL, NULL),
(716, 'AUN Projector U001 Pro 1000 ANSI Lumens 4K Android', 'The AUN U001 Pro 1000 ANSI Lumens 4K Android Projector delivers a premium home cinema experience with native Full HD 1080p resolution and 4K support. Powered by Android TV 14, it features 2GB RAM, 32GB storage, dual-band Wi-Fi, Bluetooth 5.0, and TOF laser auto focus. With 1000 ANSI lumens brightness and up to 300-inch screen size, it is ideal for movies, gaming, and presentations.', 'aun-projector-u001-pro-1000-ansi-lumens-4k-android-1781675359', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The AUN U001 Pro 1000 ANSI Lumens 4K Android Projector is a high-performance smart projector designed to deliver a true cinematic experience at home or in professional environments. With native Full HD 1080p resolution and 4K support, it produces sharp, detailed, and vibrant visuals suitable for movies, gaming, streaming, and presentations.</p><h2><strong>Bright and Immersive Visual Performance</strong></h2><p>With 1000 ANSI lumens brightness and a 2500:1 contrast ratio, the AUN U001 Pro delivers bright and well-balanced images even in moderately lit rooms. The 5.7-inch LCD projection system ensures consistent color reproduction and clarity across large screen sizes ranging from 50 to 300 inches.</p><h2><strong>Smart Android TV 14 Experience</strong></h2><p>Powered by Genuine Android TV 14, this projector provides a smooth and modern smart interface with access to popular streaming platforms including Netflix, YouTube, and Prime Video. With 2GB RAM and 32GB internal storage, it ensures stable performance for apps, media, and multitasking.</p><p>The system also supports:</p><ul><li>Dual-band Wi-Fi (2.4GHz / 5GHz)</li><li>Bluetooth 5.0</li><li>AirPlay and Miracast screen mirroring</li></ul><h2><strong>Advanced Auto Focus and Keystone Correction</strong></h2><p>The AUN U001 Pro features TOF laser auto focus technology and automatic keystone correction, allowing instant image alignment and sharp focus without manual adjustment. This ensures a hassle-free setup experience in any room.</p><h2><strong>Flexible Projection Setup</strong></h2><p>The projector supports multiple installation environments with flexible projection sizes from 50 to 300 inches. It also supports HDMI input up to 4K resolution, making it compatible with gaming consoles, laptops, and streaming devices.</p><h2><strong>Strong Audio and Connectivity Options</strong></h2><p>Equipped with dual 5W built-in speakers, the projector delivers clear and immersive audio for everyday entertainment. For enhanced sound systems, users can connect external speakers via the 3.5mm audio output.</p><h3><strong>Connectivity options include:</strong></h3><ul><li>HDMI (with ARC and CEC support)</li><li>USB port</li><li>AV input</li><li>3.5mm audio output</li><li>Bluetooth 5.0</li><li>Dual-band Wi-Fi</li></ul><h2><strong>Durable and Reliable Design</strong></h2><p>The AUN U001 Pro is built for long-term performance with an LED lamp life of up to 30,000 hours. It also includes a removable dust filter for easier maintenance and extended durability.</p><h2><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul><li>Native Full HD 1080p resolution</li><li>4K playback and 4K HDMI input support</li><li>1000 ANSI lumens brightness</li><li>Android TV 14 operating system</li><li>2GB RAM and 32GB storage</li><li>TOF laser auto focus and auto keystone correction</li><li>5.7-inch LCD display system</li><li>50–300 inch projection size</li><li>Dual-band Wi-Fi and Bluetooth 5.0</li><li>AirPlay and Miracast support</li><li>Dual 5W built-in speakers</li><li>HDMI ARC &amp; CEC support</li><li>30,000-hour LED lamp life</li></ul><p>The AUN U001 Pro 4K Android Projector is an excellent choice for users seeking a premium smart projector with high brightness, advanced autofocus technology, and modern Android features for home entertainment and professional use.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>5.7-inch LCD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>Native Full HD 1080p (1920 × 1080), 4K Local Playback (Built-in Apps/USB), HDMI Input up to 4K</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>1000 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>1.6 – 9.8m</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>4:3 / 16:9</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>2500:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>50 – 300 Inches</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Up to 30,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>4Ω 5W × 2</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>USB</td><td>2 × USB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>HDMI</td><td>1 × HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>AV Input</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>3.5mm Audio Out</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Bluetooth 5.0</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Wi-Fi</td><td>Dual-Band Wi-Fi (2.4GHz / 5GHz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Input Voltage</td><td>AC 100V – 240V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>180W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specifications</strong></td><td>Weight</td><td>2.75 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>27 × 27.3 × 11.4 cm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>1 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 14500.00, 14500.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/OOuj473Rr9h7ckNWSWPOAD469Lu0RsY8zoYMWVYm.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 05:49:19', '2026-06-17 05:49:19', 'AUN U001 Pro 1000 ANSI Lumens 4K Android Projector Price in Bangladesh | Android TV 14', 'Buy the AUN U001 Pro 1000 ANSI Lumens 4K Android Projector in Bangladesh. It features native 1080p resolution, Android TV 14, 2GB RAM, 32GB storage, TOF laser auto focus, auto keystone correction, dual-band Wi-Fi, Bluetooth 5.0, and up to 300-inch screen size for a premium home cinema experience.', 'AUN U001 Pro Projector, AUN U001 Pro Android Projector, 1000 ANSI Lumens Projector, 4K Android Projector Bangladesh, Native 1080p Projector, Android TV 14 Projector, Smart Home Projector, TOF Auto Focus Projector, WiFi Bluetooth Projector, Home Theater Projector, AUN Projector Price BD, 300 Inch Projector, Streaming Projector', NULL, 263, NULL, NULL),
(717, 'AUN Projector A004 Pro 350 ANSI Lumens FHD Android', 'The AUN A004 Pro FHD Android Projector features native 1080p resolution with 350 ANSI lumens brightness for clear and balanced visuals. It supports 4K local playback, Android 9.0 OS, dual-band Wi-Fi, Bluetooth 5.0, and wireless screen mirroring via AirPlay and Miracast. With up to 150-inch projection size and 30,000-hour LED life, it is ideal for home entertainment and streaming.', 'aun-projector-a004-pro-350-ansi-lumens-fhd-android-1781675908', '<p>The AUN A004 Pro FHD Android Projector is a compact and versatile home entertainment device designed to deliver a smooth and immersive viewing experience. With native Full HD 1080p resolution and support for 4K local playback through built-in apps and USB media, it provides sharp visuals, vibrant colors, and reliable performance for movies, gaming, sports, and presentations.</p><h2>Clear Full HD Visual Performance</h2><p>With 350 ANSI lumens brightness and a 2000:1 contrast ratio, the AUN A004 Pro delivers balanced brightness and improved image clarity in dark or low-light environments. Its LCD projection system ensures consistent color reproduction and stable visual output for everyday entertainment use.</p><h2>Smart Android 9.0 Experience</h2><p>Powered by Android 9.0 and a HiSilicon 352 processor, the projector offers a simple and responsive smart interface. With 1GB RAM and 8GB internal storage, users can run essential apps and access popular streaming platforms such as YouTube, Netflix, and Prime Video.</p><p>It also supports:</p><ul><li>Dual-band Wi-Fi (2.4GHz / 5GHz)</li><li>Bluetooth 5.0</li><li>AirPlay and Miracast screen mirroring</li></ul><h2>Flexible Projection Setup</h2><p>The AUN A004 Pro supports projection distances from 1.39 to 4.45 meters and screen sizes ranging from 47 to 150 inches. With a 1.33:1 throw ratio and support for both 4:3 and 16:9 aspect ratios, it offers flexible installation options for different room sizes.</p><p>Automatic electronic lens correction and keystone correction help ensure quick image alignment and a properly shaped display from various angles.</p><h2>Connectivity and Compatibility</h2><p>The projector includes multiple input options for wide device compatibility:</p><ul><li>1 × HDMI (up to 1080p input)</li><li>1 × USB port</li><li>AV input</li><li>3.5mm audio output</li></ul><p>It easily connects with laptops, gaming consoles, TV boxes, and USB drives.</p><h2>Audio and Entertainment Experience</h2><p>A built-in 4Ω 5W speaker provides basic audio output for casual viewing. Users can also connect external speakers or headphones via the 3.5mm audio output for a more immersive sound experience.</p><h2>Durable LED Light Source</h2><p>The LED lamp offers up to 30,000 hours of lifespan, ensuring long-term usage with minimal maintenance requirements. The projector also supports red-blue 3D playback for compatible content.</p><h2>Key Features</h2><ul><li>Native Full HD 1080p resolution</li><li>350 ANSI lumens brightness</li><li>Android 9.0 operating system</li><li>HiSilicon 352 processor</li><li>1GB RAM and 8GB storage</li><li>4K local playback support</li><li>Auto lens and keystone correction</li><li>Dual-band Wi-Fi and Bluetooth 5.0</li><li>AirPlay and Miracast support</li><li>47–150 inch projection size</li><li>HDMI, USB, AV connectivity</li><li>30,000-hour LED lamp life</li><li>Compact and lightweight design</li></ul><p>The AUN A004 Pro FHD Android Projector is a budget-friendly smart projector offering Full HD clarity, wireless connectivity, and flexible multimedia support for home entertainment, streaming, and everyday use.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>4-inch LCD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>Native Full HD 1080p (1920 × 1080), 4K Local Playback (Built-in Apps/USB), HDMI Input up to 1080p</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>350 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>1.39 – 4.45 m</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>4:3 / 16:9</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>2000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>47 – 150 Inches</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Up to 30,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>4Ω 5W Speaker</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>USB</td><td>1 × USB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>HDMI</td><td>1 × HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>AV Input</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>3.5mm Audio Out</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Bluetooth 5.0</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Wi-Fi</td><td>Dual-Band Wi-Fi (2.4GHz / 5GHz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Input Voltage</td><td>AC 100V – 240V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>65W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specifications</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>1.7 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>24.2 × 21 × 9.8 cm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>1 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 12900.00, 12900.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/0gFgIRGAK44LND5co2gYyjZRvBMyKjmtrLQ71h3g.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 05:58:28', '2026-06-17 05:58:28', 'AUN A004 Pro FHD Android Projector Price in Bangladesh | 350 ANSI Lumens', 'Buy the AUN A004 Pro FHD Android Projector in Bangladesh. It features native 1080p resolution, 350 ANSI lumens brightness, Android 9.0 OS, 4K playback support, dual-band Wi-Fi, Bluetooth 5.0, and wireless screen mirroring. Perfect for movies, gaming, and home entertainment.', 'AUN A004 Pro Projector, AUN A004 Android Projector, A004 Pro Price in Bangladesh, 350 ANSI Lumens Projector, FHD Android Projector, Native 1080p Projector, Smart Projector Bangladesh, Android 9 Projector, WiFi Bluetooth Projector, Home Theater Projector, Mini Projector Bangladesh, 150 Inch Projector, Portable Android Projector', NULL, 263, NULL, NULL);
