(718, 'AUNProjector A32 Pro 150 ANSI Lumens HD Portable Android', 'The AUN A32 Pro HD Portable Android Projector features native 720p resolution with 150 ANSI lumens brightness for compact and efficient entertainment. Powered by Android 13 with 1GB RAM and 8GB storage, it supports 1080p playback, dual-band Wi-Fi, Bluetooth 5.0, AirPlay, and Miracast. With up to 100-inch projection and lightweight design, it is ideal for movies, streaming, and portable use.', 'aunprojector-a32-pro-150-ansi-lumens-hd-portable-android-1781677708', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The AUN A32 Pro Portable Android Projector is a compact and lightweight home entertainment device designed for users who want an affordable and portable cinematic experience. It uses advanced LCD projection technology with a 2.7-inch LCD panel to deliver stable, clear, and consistent visual output for movies, streaming, gaming, and presentations.</p><h2><strong>HD Visual Performance with Smart Playback</strong></h2><p>The projector supports native 720p HD resolution while also enabling 1080p local playback through built-in apps and USB media sources. With 150 ANSI lumens brightness and a 2000:1 contrast ratio, it delivers balanced image clarity that performs best in dark environments, making it ideal for small indoor setups.</p><h2><strong>Smooth Android 13 Smart System</strong></h2><p>Powered by Android 13.0 and the HiSilicon 920 processor, the AUN A32 Pro offers a modern and responsive smart interface. With 1GB RAM and 8GB internal storage, users can install apps and enjoy seamless streaming from platforms such as YouTube, Netflix, and Prime Video.</p><p>It also supports:</p><ul><li>Dual-band Wi-Fi (2.4GHz / 5GHz)</li><li>Bluetooth 5.0</li><li>AirPlay and Miracast wireless screen mirroring</li></ul><h2><strong>Flexible Projection Experience</strong></h2><p>The AUN A32 Pro supports projection distances from 0.5 to 4.6 meters and screen sizes ranging from 17 to 100 inches. With support for both 4:3 and 16:9 aspect ratios, it provides flexible viewing options for different types of content.</p><p>Automatic vertical keystone correction and electronic lens adjustment ensure quick and easy setup with properly aligned images from different angles.</p><h2><strong>Wide Connectivity Options</strong></h2><p>This projector offers multiple connectivity options for versatile usage:</p><ul><li>HDMI input (up to 1080p)</li><li>USB port for media playback</li><li>3.5mm audio output for external speakers or headphones</li></ul><p>It is compatible with laptops, gaming consoles, TV boxes, smartphones, and USB storage devices.</p><h2><strong>Audio and Entertainment Experience</strong></h2><p>A built-in 4Ω 3W speaker delivers basic audio output for casual viewing. For a more immersive experience, users can connect external speakers or sound systems through the audio output port.</p><h2><strong>Portable and Energy-Efficient Design</strong></h2><p>With a compact build and only 30W power consumption, the AUN A32 Pro is highly energy-efficient and easy to carry. Its LED lamp provides up to 30,000 hours of usage, ensuring long-term reliability with minimal maintenance.</p><h2><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul><li>Native 720p HD resolution</li><li>150 ANSI lumens brightness</li><li>Android 13 operating system</li><li>HiSilicon 920 processor</li><li>1GB RAM and 8GB storage</li><li>1080p local playback support</li><li>Dual-band Wi-Fi and Bluetooth 5.0</li><li>AirPlay and Miracast support</li><li>17–100 inch projection size</li><li>Auto vertical keystone correction</li><li>HDMI, USB, and audio output ports</li><li>30,000-hour LED lamp life</li><li>Low 30W power consumption</li><li>Ultra-portable compact design</li></ul><p>The AUN A32 Pro HD Portable Android Projector is an excellent entry-level smart projector designed for users seeking an affordable, compact, and easy-to-use solution for home entertainment, streaming, and portable viewing.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>2.7-inch LCD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>Native 720p (1280 × 720), 1080p Local Playback (Built-in Apps/USB), HDMI Input up to 1080p</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>150 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>0.5 – 4.6 m</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>4:3 / 16:9</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>2000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>17 – 100 Inches</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Up to 30,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>4Ω 3W Speaker</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>USB</td><td>1 × USB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>HDMI</td><td>1 × HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>3.5mm Audio Out</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Bluetooth 5.0</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Wi-Fi</td><td>Dual-Band Wi-Fi (2.4GHz / 5GHz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Input Voltage</td><td>AC 100V – 240V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>73W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specifications</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>0.58 kg (Without Bracket) / 0.71 kg (With Bracket)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>16.3 × 12 × 7.3 cm (Without Bracket)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>1 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 7590.00, 7590.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/NPoSDTP34khejg9idaMn2VF6PxJwnr4RRyKAXcVC.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 06:28:28', '2026-06-17 06:28:28', 'AUN A32 Pro HD Portable Android Projector Price in Bangladesh | 150 ANSI Lumens', 'Buy the AUN A32 Pro HD Portable Android Projector in Bangladesh. It features native 720p resolution, 150 ANSI lumens brightness, Android 13 OS, 1GB RAM, 8GB storage, dual-band Wi-Fi, Bluetooth 5.0, and 1080p playback support. Perfect for portable home entertainment, movies, and streaming.', 'AUN A32 Pro Projector, AUN A32 Pro Android Projector, HD Portable Projector Bangladesh, 150 ANSI Lumens Projector, 720p Android Projector, Mini Projector Bangladesh, Smart Portable Projector, Android 13 Projector, WiFi Bluetooth Projector, Home Theater Mini Projector, AUN Projector Price BD, Portable Movie Projector, 100 Inch Projector', NULL, 263, NULL, NULL),
(719, 'Philips  Projector NeoPix Easy 2600 Lumen WVGA LCD', 'The Philips NeoPix Easy 2600 Lumen WVGA LCD Projector delivers bright and clear visuals with up to 2600 lumens brightness and a 3000:1 contrast ratio. It supports WVGA native resolution with up to 1080p input and projects images up to 80 inches. With HDMI, VGA, USB, and microSD support, it is ideal for movies, presentations, and home entertainment.', 'philips-projector-neopix-easy-2600-lumen-wvga-lcd-1781678382', '<p>The Philips NeoPix Easy 2600 Lumen WVGA LCD Projector is a compact and versatile home entertainment solution designed to deliver bright, colorful, and immersive visuals. With its LCD projection technology and native WVGA (800 × 480) resolution, it provides a clear viewing experience for movies, photos, presentations, and casual multimedia use.</p><h2>Bright and Clear Visual Performance</h2><p>Featuring up to 2600 lumens brightness and a 3000:1 contrast ratio, the Philips NeoPix Easy ensures improved sharpness, clarity, and vibrant color reproduction. It supports input resolutions up to Full HD 1080p, allowing users to enjoy high-quality content from modern devices while maintaining stable image output.</p><h2>Flexible Projection Setup</h2><p>The projector can display images up to 80 inches diagonally, making it suitable for small to medium-sized rooms. With manual focus and keystone correction, users can easily adjust the image for optimal viewing from different angles and positions.</p><h2>Multiple Connectivity Options</h2><p>The Philips NeoPix Easy offers wide compatibility with various devices through multiple input options:</p><ul><li>HDMI input for laptops, streaming devices, and gaming consoles</li><li>VGA input for older PCs and devices</li><li>USB Type-A for multimedia playback</li><li>MicroSD card slot for direct media access</li><li>3.5mm audio/video input and headphone output</li></ul><p>The built-in media player allows direct playback of videos, music, and photos without needing external devices.</p><h2>Advanced LED Technology</h2><p>Equipped with a long-lasting LED light source, the projector offers up to 20,000 hours of lamp life. This ensures reliable long-term performance while consuming less power compared to traditional lamp-based projectors, making it an energy-efficient solution for everyday use.</p><h2>Easy Control and Usability</h2><p>The projector comes with an included remote control for convenient operation. Users can easily navigate settings, adjust focus, and switch inputs without needing to access the device directly.</p><h2>Key Features</h2><ul><li>2600 lumens brightness</li><li>WVGA native resolution (800 × 480)</li><li>Supports up to 1080p input</li><li>3000:1 contrast ratio</li><li>Projection size up to 80 inches</li><li>HDMI, VGA, USB, and microSD support</li><li>Built-in media player</li><li>Manual focus and keystone correction</li><li>Long-lasting LED light source (20,000 hours)</li><li>Energy-efficient design</li><li>Remote control included</li></ul><p>The Philips NeoPix Easy 2600 Lumen WVGA LCD Projector is a reliable and budget-friendly choice for users seeking a simple, bright, and versatile projector for home entertainment, education, and multimedia playback.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>LCD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>800 × 480 (WVGA)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Supported Resolution</td><td>Up to Full HD 1080p (1920 × 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>2600 Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>80 cm – 200 cm (24\" – 60\")</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>3000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>Up to 65\" (165 cm)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Power</td><td>210W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Up to 20,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>Dual 2W Speakers</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI</td><td>1 × HDMI (Audio/Video Input)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>VGA</td><td>1 × VGA (DE-15/DB-15)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>AV Input</td><td>1 × 3.5mm Mini Audio/Video Input</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>1 × 3.5mm Headphone Output</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB</td><td>1 × USB 2.0</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Input Power</td><td>AC 100–240V, 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>DC Input</td><td>12V DC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>42W (Medium Brightness)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Standby Power</td><td>&lt; 0.5W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specifications</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>857 g</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>207 × 84.5 × 150 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>1 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 19000.00, 19000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/31jbRtNkbPncQpFiImHKUJV2mNPb3yYQT7blGbXe.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 06:39:42', '2026-06-17 06:39:42', 'Philips NeoPix Easy 2600 Lumen WVGA LCD Projector Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy Philips NeoPix Easy 2600 Lumen WVGA LCD Projector in Bangladesh. It features 2600 lumens brightness, WVGA resolution, 3000:1 contrast ratio, up to 80-inch display, HDMI/VGA/USB/microSD support, and a long-lasting LED light source for home entertainment and presentations.', 'Philips NeoPix Easy Projector, Philips NeoPix Projector Bangladesh, 2600 Lumen Projector, WVGA LCD Projector, Mini Home Projector, Philips Projector Price BD, HDMI VGA Projector, Portable Projector Bangladesh, LED Projector 80 Inch, Multimedia Projector, Budget Projector Bangladesh', NULL, 43, NULL, NULL),
(720, 'PhilipsProjector NeoPix Prime 2 HD LCD', 'The Philips NeoPix Prime 2 HD LCD Projector delivers native 720p HD resolution with support up to 1080p input for sharp and clear visuals. Featuring built-in Philips OS, dual-band Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, and preloaded apps like Netflix and YouTube, it offers a smart entertainment experience. With auto keystone, 4-corner correction, and up to 80-inch projection, it is ideal for home cinema use.', 'philipsprojector-neopix-prime-2-hd-lcd-1781678831', '<p>The Philips NeoPix Prime 2 HD LCD Projector is a compact and smart home entertainment device designed to deliver high-quality visuals and seamless streaming experiences. With native HD 720p resolution and support for Full HD 1080p input, it produces sharp images, clear text, and vibrant colors for movies, gaming, and presentations.</p><h2>Clear HD Visual Performance</h2><p>With a resolution of 1280 × 720 pixels, the NeoPix Prime 2 ensures crisp and detailed projection suitable for everyday entertainment. It supports up to 1080p input resolution, allowing compatibility with modern devices such as streaming sticks, gaming consoles, and laptops.</p><h2>Smart Built-in Philips OS</h2><p>This projector comes with Philips OS pre-installed, offering direct access to popular apps like Netflix and YouTube. The built-in multimedia player allows users to enjoy videos, music, and photos without needing external devices.</p><p>Connectivity features include:</p><ul><li>Dual-band Wi-Fi for stable streaming</li><li>Bluetooth for wireless audio devices</li><li>Integrated app support for online content</li></ul><h2>Flexible Setup and Easy Adjustment</h2><p>The Philips NeoPix Prime 2 is designed for effortless setup with:</p><ul><li>Auto keystone correction</li><li>4-corner adjustment</li><li>Digital zoom support</li></ul><p>These features ensure a properly aligned image even when the projector is placed at different angles or distances.</p><h2>Wide Device Compatibility</h2><p>The projector supports multiple input options for maximum flexibility:</p><ul><li>HDMI for laptops, consoles, and streaming devices</li><li>USB for media playback</li><li>MicroSD card slot for direct file access</li><li>3.5mm audio output for headphones or external speakers</li></ul><p>It is compatible with devices such as PCs, Macs, Fire TV Stick, Apple TV, and gaming consoles.</p><h2>Immersive Projection Experience</h2><p>The projector can display images up to 80 inches (200 cm) from a distance of less than 2 meters, making it ideal for small to medium-sized rooms. Its LED light source ensures bright and consistent performance for long-term use.</p><h2>Audio and Multimedia Features</h2><p>With a built-in 3.5mm audio jack, users can connect external speakers or headphones for enhanced sound quality. The integrated multimedia player supports various file formats for convenient playback.</p><h2>Key Features</h2><ul><li>Native HD 720p resolution</li><li>Supports up to 1080p input</li><li>Built-in Philips OS with apps</li><li>Netflix and YouTube supported</li><li>Dual-band Wi-Fi and Bluetooth</li><li>Auto keystone and 4-corner correction</li><li>Digital zoom function</li><li>Projection size up to 80 inches</li><li>HDMI, USB, MicroSD connectivity</li><li>Built-in multimedia player</li><li>Compact and portable design</li></ul><p>The Philips NeoPix Prime 2 HD LCD Projector is an excellent choice for users seeking a smart, easy-to-use, and compact projector for home entertainment, streaming, and casual viewing.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>LCD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>Native 1280 × 720 (HD)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Supported Resolution</td><td>Up to 1920 × 1080 (Full HD)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>80 cm – 200 cm (24\" – 60\")</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>3000:1</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Up to 30,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>2 × 5W Stereo Speakers</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>USB</td><td>1 × USB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>HDMI</td><td>2 × HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Micro SD</td><td>1 × Micro SD Slot</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>VGA</td><td>1 × VGA Port</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Out</td><td>3.5 mm Jack</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>AV In</td><td>3.5 mm Jack</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>DC-In</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Wireless</td><td>Bluetooth + Wireless Screen Mirroring</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Input Power</td><td>DC 24V, 4A (AC 100–240V adapter)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>100W (Operation), &lt;0.5W (Standby)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specifications</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>1.2 kg (2.69 lbs)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>220 × 170 × 90 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>1 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 29000.00, 29000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/RQd5mPKxOmP4T9H0wi3bDliWSTNxnWjFPFhjpQVx.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 06:47:11', '2026-06-17 06:47:11', 'Philips NeoPix Prime 2 HD LCD Projector Price in Bangladesh | Smart Home Projector', 'Buy Philips NeoPix Prime 2 HD LCD Projector in Bangladesh. It features native 720p resolution, smart Philips OS, Netflix and YouTube support, dual-band Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, auto keystone correction, and up to 80-inch projection for home entertainment and streaming.', 'Philips NeoPix Prime 2, Philips Projector Bangladesh, HD LCD Projector, 720p Smart Projector, Netflix Projector, YouTube Projector, Mini Home Projector, Philips NeoPix Price BD, WiFi Bluetooth Projector, Portable Smart Projector, Home Theater Projector, HDMI Projector Bangladesh', NULL, 43, NULL, NULL),
(721, 'Anker Projector Nebula Apollo Android Portable', 'The Anker Nebula Apollo Android Portable Projector features 200 ANSI lumens DLP projection with up to 100-inch display for clear and immersive viewing. It runs built-in Android apps like Netflix and YouTube, supports wireless streaming, and offers up to 4 hours of battery backup. With touch controls and compact design, it is ideal for portable home entertainment.', 'anker-projector-nebula-apollo-android-portable-1781679523', '<p>The Anker Nebula Apollo Portable Projector is a compact and smart entertainment device designed for users who want a truly portable cinema experience. With DLP projection technology and 200 ANSI lumens brightness, it delivers clear visuals and supports screen sizes up to 100 inches, making it suitable for movies, gaming, and streaming on the go.</p><h2>Bright and Immersive Viewing Experience</h2><p>The Nebula Apollo provides a spacious and immersive viewing experience with support for up to 100-inch projection. Its DLP light engine ensures stable brightness and decent clarity for indoor entertainment, especially in low-light environments.</p><h2>Built-in Android Smart System</h2><p>This projector runs a built-in Android-based system that allows direct access to popular streaming platforms such as:</p><ul><li>Netflix</li><li>YouTube</li><li>Hulu</li><li>Other streaming apps</li></ul><p>Users can stream content directly without needing external devices, making it highly convenient for travel and casual use.</p><h2>Portable Design with Long Battery Life</h2><p>One of the key highlights of the Nebula Apollo is its built-in battery, offering up to 4 hours of video playback on a single charge. This makes it ideal for watching movies or shows without needing constant power access.</p><h2>Smart Touch Control System</h2><p>The projector features advanced touch controls on the top panel, allowing users to easily navigate menus and adjust settings. It also supports smartphone-based control for added convenience.</p><h2>Flexible Connectivity and Streaming</h2><p>With wireless connectivity support, the Nebula Apollo allows users to stream content directly from mobile devices. It eliminates the need for multiple external devices and cables, offering a clean and simple setup.</p><h2>Compact and Travel-Friendly Build</h2><p>Designed for portability, the Anker Nebula Apollo is lightweight and easy to carry. Its compact design makes it suitable for bedrooms, outdoor use, travel, and small entertainment spaces.</p><h2>Key Features</h2><ul><li>200 ANSI lumens DLP projection</li><li>Up to 100-inch screen size</li><li>Built-in Android streaming system</li><li>Netflix, YouTube, Hulu support</li><li>Up to 4 hours battery backup</li><li>Touch control interface</li><li>Wireless streaming support</li><li>Compact and portable design</li><li>Easy smartphone control</li><li>Ideal for travel and home use</li></ul><p>The Anker Nebula Apollo Android Portable Projector is a great choice for users looking for a compact, smart, and battery-powered projector for entertainment anywhere, anytime.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>WVGA RGB LED</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>WVGA (854 × 480)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>200 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>0.58 m – 3.08 m</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Throw Ratio</td><td>1.3:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>20\" – 100\" (approx. 50.8 cm – 254 cm)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Power</td><td>200 LED Lumens</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>1 × Mixed Channel Speaker</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>USB</td><td>1 × USB 2.0</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>HDMI</td><td>1 × HDMI (Type-A, 19-pin)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Bluetooth 4.2</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Smart Features</strong></td><td>Operating System</td><td>Android 7.1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>RAM</td><td>1 GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Internal Storage</td><td>8 GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Processor</td><td>Quad-Core CPU</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Extra Mode</td><td>Bluetooth Speaker Mode</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specifications</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>579 g</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>6.5 × 6.5 × 13.1 cm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>18 Months Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 31000.00, 31000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/wf4HBC22ZFrynGSBaqHGHwAjJygDosW4vMy7ttV0.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 06:58:43', '2026-06-17 06:58:43', 'Anker Nebula Apollo Portable Projector Price in Bangladesh | Android Smart Projector', 'Buy Anker Nebula Apollo Android Portable Projector in Bangladesh. It features 200 ANSI lumens DLP projection, built-in Android apps like Netflix and YouTube, up to 100-inch display, 4-hour battery backup, touch controls, and wireless streaming support for portable entertainment.', 'Anker Nebula Apollo, Nebula Apollo Projector, Anker Portable Projector Bangladesh, 200 ANSI Lumens Projector, Smart Android Projector, Mini Portable Projector, Netflix Projector, Battery Projector, DLP Projector Bangladesh, Wireless Projector, Travel Projector, Home Theater Portable Projector', NULL, 309, NULL, NULL),
(722, 'Havit Projector  PJ219 PRO Smart with Android TV 9.0', 'The Havit PJ219 PRO Smart Projector with Android TV 9.0 delivers native 1080p Full HD resolution with 4K support for sharp and vibrant visuals. Featuring 350 ANSI lumens brightness, auto keystone correction, and electric focus, it ensures easy setup and clear projection. With Android TV 9.0, dual HDMI, USB ports, and up to 280-inch display support, it is ideal for home cinema and presentations.', 'havit-projector-pj219-pro-smart-with-android-tv-90-1781684395', '<p>The Havit PJ219 PRO Smart Projector is a versatile home entertainment and professional projection device designed to deliver high-quality visuals with smart functionality. Powered by Android TV 9.0, it provides access to streaming apps and smooth multimedia performance for movies, gaming, and presentations.</p><h2>Full HD Visual Performance with 4K Support</h2><p>Featuring a 4-inch LCD display and native 1080p resolution (1920 × 1080), the projector delivers crisp and detailed visuals. It also supports 4K video playback, ensuring compatibility with modern high-resolution content. With 350 ANSI lumens brightness and a 1500:1 contrast ratio, it produces balanced and vibrant images suitable for indoor viewing.</p><h2>Smart Android TV Experience</h2><p>The Havit PJ219 PRO runs on Android TV 9.0, offering access to entertainment apps and streaming platforms. With support for 23 languages, including English, Japanese, and Chinese, it ensures user-friendly operation for a global audience.</p><h2>Flexible Projection Range</h2><p>This projector supports a wide projection range from 0.89 to 7 meters, with screen sizes from 34 to 280 inches. This makes it suitable for both small rooms and large spaces, whether for home cinema or professional use.</p><h2>Auto Focus and Keystone Correction</h2><p>Equipped with electric focus and auto keystone correction, the projector automatically adjusts image sharpness and alignment. This ensures a perfectly shaped display without manual setup, even when the projector is placed at an angle.</p><h2>Strong Connectivity Options</h2><p>The Havit PJ219 PRO offers multiple connectivity options for maximum compatibility:</p><ul><li>2 × HDMI-compatible ports</li><li>2 × USB ports</li><li>AV input</li><li>3.5mm audio output</li><li>Bluetooth speaker mode</li></ul><p>It easily connects with laptops, gaming consoles, TV boxes, and streaming devices.</p><h2>Audio and Entertainment Experience</h2><p>A built-in 4Ω 5W speaker provides clear and powerful sound for everyday use. Bluetooth speaker functionality also allows wireless audio playback for added convenience.</p><h2>Durable and Energy Efficient Design</h2><p>The LED light source offers an impressive lifespan of up to 40,000 hours, reducing maintenance costs and ensuring long-term reliability. With only 66W power consumption, it is energy efficient and suitable for continuous use.</p><h2>Key Features</h2><ul><li>Native Full HD 1080p resolution</li><li>4K video support</li><li>Android TV 9.0 system</li><li>350 ANSI lumens brightness</li><li>Auto keystone correction</li><li>Electric focus adjustment</li><li>34–280 inch projection size</li><li>Dual HDMI and USB ports</li><li>Bluetooth speaker mode</li><li>40,000-hour LED lamp life</li><li>Lightweight and portable design</li><li>Multi-language support</li></ul><p>The Havit PJ219 PRO Smart Projector with Android TV 9.0 is an excellent choice for users seeking a smart, powerful, and versatile projector for home entertainment, gaming, and professional presentations.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>4\" LCD Display</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>1920 × 1080 (Full HD), supports 4K input</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>9000 lumens (350 ANSI lumens)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>0.89 – 7 meters</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Screen Size</td><td>34 – 280 inches</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1500:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Special Features</td><td>Autofocus, Auto Keystone</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Language Support</td><td>23 languages (English, Japanese, Chinese, etc.)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Operating System</td><td>Android 9.0</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>RAM / Storage</td><td>1GB RAM + 16GB ROM</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Up to 40,000 hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>4Ω 5W Speaker</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>USB</td><td>2 × USB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>HDMI</td><td>2 × HDMI-compatible</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>AV Input</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>3.5mm jack</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Yes (Bluetooth Speaker Mode supported)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Input Voltage</td><td>AC 100V–240V, 50/60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>66W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specifications</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>1.75 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>246 × 106.5 × 108 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>1 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 26000.00, 26000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/1yeYeuVSeTNTXEJpf3xhgc8bwakuaNnmKCqBfpKR.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 08:19:55', '2026-06-17 08:19:55', 'Havit PJ219 PRO Android TV Projector Price in Bangladesh | 1080p Smart Projector', 'Buy Havit PJ219 PRO Smart Projector with Android TV 9.0 in Bangladesh. It features native 1080p resolution, 350 ANSI 