(723, 'Havit Projector PJ209 Pro 350 ANSI Lumens Android Portable', 'The Havit PJ209 Pro Android Portable Projector features native 1080p resolution with 4K support for sharp and detailed visuals. With 350 ANSI lumens brightness, 4.41-inch LCD display, and up to 220-inch projection size, it delivers a cinematic experience. Equipped with dual HDMI, USB ports, and powerful 43W speakers, it is ideal for home and portable entertainment.', 'havit-projector-pj209-pro-350-ansi-lumens-android-portable-1781684710', '<p>The Havit PJ209 Pro Android Portable Projector features native 1080p resolution with 4K support for sharp and detailed visuals. With 350 ANSI lumens brightness, 4.41-inch LCD display, and up to 220-inch projection size, it delivers a cinematic experience. Equipped with dual HDMI, USB ports, and powerful 43W speakers, it is ideal for home and portable entertainment.</p><h2>Havit PJ209 Pro 350 ANSI Lumens Android Portable Projector</h2><p>The Havit PJ209 Pro Android Portable Projector is a high-performance multimedia device designed to deliver an immersive home cinema experience. With advanced LCD projection technology and a large 4.41-inch display panel, it produces sharp, vibrant, and detailed visuals suitable for movies, gaming, presentations, and outdoor entertainment.</p><h2>Full HD Visual Performance with 4K Support</h2><p>The projector supports native 1080p (1920 × 1080) resolution and 4K video playback, ensuring crystal-clear image quality. With 350 ANSI lumens brightness and an 8500-lumen output rating, it delivers bright and well-balanced visuals with rich color reproduction.</p><h2>Large Screen Viewing Experience</h2><p>With a projection range of 1.5 to 6.9 meters, the Havit PJ209 Pro can display screen sizes from 43 inches up to 220 inches. This makes it suitable for both small rooms and large open spaces, offering flexible viewing options for different environments.</p><h2>Wide Connectivity Options</h2><p>The projector offers multiple input options for seamless device compatibility:</p><ul><li>2 × HDMI ports</li><li>2 × USB ports</li><li>AV input</li><li>3.5mm audio output</li></ul><p>It easily connects with laptops, gaming consoles, TV boxes, and streaming devices for versatile usage.</p><h2>Powerful Audio Performance</h2><p>Equipped with dual 43W built-in speakers, the projector delivers loud, clear, and immersive sound without the need for external speakers, enhancing the overall entertainment experience.</p><h2>Efficient and Quiet Operation</h2><p>The Havit PJ209 Pro consumes only 85W power and operates at a low noise level (≤30dB), ensuring energy efficiency and quiet performance during use.</p><h2>Compact and Portable Design</h2><p>Designed with portability in mind, the projector features a compact body measuring 245.87 × 203 × 95.7 mm. Its lightweight design makes it easy to carry and set up for both indoor and outdoor entertainment.</p><h2>Key Features</h2><ul><li>Native Full HD 1080p resolution</li><li>4K video support</li><li>350 ANSI lumens brightness</li><li>4.41-inch LCD display</li><li>43–220 inch projection size</li><li>Dual HDMI and USB ports</li><li>AV and 3.5mm audio support</li><li>Dual 43W built-in speakers</li><li>Low noise operation (≤30dB)</li><li>Energy-efficient 85W power usage</li><li>Portable and compact design</li></ul><p>The Havit PJ209 Pro Android Portable Projector is an excellent choice for users seeking a powerful, feature-rich, and portable projector for home cinema, gaming, and outdoor entertainment.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>4.41\" LCD Display</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>1920 × 1080 (Full HD), supports 4K input</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>8500 lumens (350 ANSI lumens)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>1.5 – 6.9 meters</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Screen Size</td><td>43 – 220 inches</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9 / 4:3</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>43W × 2 Stereo Speakers</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>USB</td><td>2 × USB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>HDMI</td><td>2 × HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>AV Input</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>3.5mm Jack</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>85W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specifications</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>245.87 × 203 × 95.7 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>1 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 26000.00, 26000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/TJJQeFuN2DNPGHCn849yLt9V9rXPrRpEoDQAiUBS.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 08:25:10', '2026-06-17 08:25:10', 'Havit PJ209 Pro Android Portable Projector Price in Bangladesh | 350 ANSI Lumens 4K Support', 'Buy Havit PJ209 Pro Android Portable Projector in Bangladesh. It features native 1080p resolution, 4K support, 350 ANSI lumens brightness, 4.41-inch LCD display, up to 220-inch screen size, dual HDMI/USB ports, and powerful 43W speakers for immersive home entertainment.', 'Havit PJ209 Pro Projector, Havit Android Projector Bangladesh, 350 ANSI Lumens Projector, 4K Support Projector, 1080p Portable Projector, Home Theater Projector BD, Havit Projector Price Bangladesh, Smart Portable Projector, Dual HDMI Projector, Android Projector BD, Mini Home Cinema Projector', NULL, 229, NULL, NULL),
(724, 'Havit Projector PJ205 Pro 200 Lumens Full HD 1080p Portable', 'The Havit PJ205 Pro Portable Projector features 200 ANSI lumens brightness with Full HD 1080p support and a 3.97-inch LCD display for clear visuals. Powered by Android 9.0, it supports apps like Netflix, YouTube, and Prime Video. With HDMI, USB, and AV connectivity, portable rope design, and up to 16:9 projection, it is ideal for home and travel entertainment.', 'havit-projector-pj205-pro-200-lumens-full-hd-1080p-portable-1781684951', '<p>The Havit PJ205 Pro Portable Projector is a compact and stylish home entertainment device designed for portability and convenience. Featuring a 3.97-inch LCD projection system, it delivers sharp and colorful visuals suitable for movies, streaming, gaming, and presentations.</p><h2>Full HD Visual Performance</h2><p>With support for Full HD 1080p resolution and 200 ANSI lumens brightness, the PJ205 Pro provides clear and detailed image output in dark environments. Its 8000-lumen brightness rating ensures enhanced visual clarity, color accuracy, and sharpness for everyday entertainment use.</p><h2>Smart Android 9.0 System</h2><p>The projector runs on a customized Android 9.0 operating system, allowing users to access online content and install popular apps such as:</p><ul><li>Netflix</li><li>YouTube</li><li>Prime Video</li></ul><p>It enables smooth browsing, streaming, and app usage for a complete smart entertainment experience.</p><h2>Portable and Stylish Design</h2><p>Designed for mobility, the Havit PJ205 Pro includes a built-in hand rope for easy carrying. Its matte-finished shell with cloth covering gives it a premium, metal-like texture while maintaining a lightweight and portable build.</p><h2>Flexible Connectivity Options</h2><p>The projector supports wide device compatibility with multiple input options:</p><ul><li>HDMI</li><li>USB</li><li>AV input</li><li>3.5mm audio output</li></ul><p>It works seamlessly with smartphones, laptops, PCs, TV boxes, gaming consoles (PS4), DVD players, and USB drives.</p><h2>Easy Control and Usage</h2><p>The projector supports both wired mouse input and remote control functionality. When browsing the web, the remote can also function as a wireless mouse for easier navigation.</p><h2>Immersive Viewing Experience</h2><p>With 16:9 and 4:3 aspect ratio support, the PJ205 Pro adapts to different content formats. It is ideal for creating a mini home theater experience in compact spaces.</p><h2>Key Features</h2><ul><li>200 ANSI lumens brightness</li><li>Full HD 1080p support</li><li>3.97-inch LCD display</li><li>Android 9.0 OS</li><li>Netflix, YouTube, Prime Video support</li><li>Portable rope design</li><li>HDMI, USB, AV connectivity</li><li>16:9 / 4:3 aspect ratio</li><li>Lightweight and travel-friendly design</li><li>Remote + wired mouse support</li></ul><p>The Havit PJ205 Pro Portable Projector is a great choice for users looking for a budget-friendly, portable, and smart projector for home entertainment and travel use.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>3.97\" LCD Display</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>1920 × 1080 (Full HD)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>8000 lumens (200 ANSI lumens)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9 / 4:3</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>4Ω 5W × 2 Stereo Speakers</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>USB</td><td>1 × USB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>HDMI</td><td>2 × HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>AV Input</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>3.5mm Jack</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>56W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specifications</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>1.39 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>14.9 × 16.7 × 17.9 cm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>1 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 21000.00, 21000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/zDPeiuhJChsIw2a9972mB27wMN44lzYXIwRJYGRS.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 08:29:11', '2026-06-17 08:29:11', 'Havit PJ205 Pro Portable Projector Price in Bangladesh | 200 ANSI Lumens 1080p', 'Buy Havit PJ205 Pro Portable Projector in Bangladesh. It features 200 ANSI lumens brightness, Full HD 1080p support, Android 9.0 system, 3.97-inch LCD display, Netflix/YouTube support, HDMI/USB/AV connectivity, and portable design for home and travel entertainment.', 'Havit PJ205 Pro Projector, Havit Portable Projector Bangladesh, 200 ANSI Lumens Projector, Full HD 1080p Projector, Android 9 Projector, Mini Portable Projector BD, Home Theater Projector, Havit Projector Price Bangladesh, Netflix Projector, Smart Portable Projector, HDMI USB Projector', NULL, 229, NULL, NULL),
(725, 'Havit Projector PJ206 Pro 350 Lumens Full HD Android Wi-Fi Screen Mirroring Portable', 'The Havit PJ206 Pro is a compact Full HD 1080p portable projector featuring 350 ANSI lumens brightness, Android TV 9.0, and dual-band WiFi (2.4G/5G). With a 4.41-inch LCD display engine and support for 4K input, it delivers clear, vibrant visuals for home, office, and entertainment use.', 'havit-projector-pj206-pro-350-lumens-full-hd-android-wi-fi-screen-mirroring-portable-1781685209', '<p>The <strong>Havit PJ206 Pro 350 Lumens Full HD 1080p Portable Projector</strong> is designed to deliver a high-quality viewing experience in a compact and stylish body. Equipped with <strong>350 ANSI lumens brightness</strong> and <strong>4.41-inch LCD display projection technology</strong>, it ensures clear and vivid images even in moderately lit environments.</p><p>With support for <strong>Full HD 1080p resolution</strong> and <strong>4K input compatibility</strong>, this projector enhances your movie, gaming, and presentation experience with sharp details and rich colors. Its <strong>16:9 / 4:3 aspect ratio support</strong> provides flexible viewing options for different content formats.</p><p>The built-in <strong>Android TV 9.0 system</strong> allows direct access to popular apps through the Google Play Store, eliminating the need for external streaming devices. You can easily enjoy Netflix, YouTube, Prime Video, and more.</p><p>Thanks to <strong>dual-band WiFi (2.4G + 5G)</strong>, streaming becomes smooth and stable with reduced buffering. The compact and elegant design makes it suitable for both home entertainment and office presentations.</p><p>Whether you\'re watching movies, enjoying TV shows, or giving presentations, the Havit PJ206 Pro ensures a convenient and immersive experience.</p><p><strong>Warranty:</strong> 1 Year Manufacturing Warranty</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display</td><td>Display Type</td><td>4.41\" LCD Display</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Resolution</td><td>1920 × 1080 (Full HD)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Brightness</td><td>~8500 lumens (350 ANSI lumens)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9 / 4:3</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Speaker</td><td>Built-in 4Ω 3W</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Ports</td><td>AV / VGA / USB ×2 / HDMI ×2 / 3.5mm Audio Out</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Consumption</td><td>90W</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 22500.00, 22500.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/7aLkuroYHc47eRWiibJOpkdv8bCmhglOncKznbS0.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 08:33:29', '2026-06-17 08:33:29', 'Havit PJ206 Pro 350 ANSI Lumens Full HD 1080p Portable Projector | Android TV 9.0, 4K Support', 'Buy Havit PJ206 Pro Portable Projector with 350 ANSI lumens, Full HD 1080p resolution, Android TV 9.0, and 4K support. Features dual-band WiFi, built-in apps, and compact design for home and office use.', 'Havit PJ206 Pro, Havit projector, 350 ANSI lumens projector, Full HD portable projector, Android TV projector, 1080p projector, 4K support projector, dual band WiFi projector, home theater projector, mini portable projector', NULL, 229, NULL, NULL),
(726, 'Havit Projector PJ201 120 Lumens HD 720p Portable', 'The Havit PJ201 is a compact HD 720p portable projector featuring 120 ANSI lumens brightness, 3.97-inch LCD display technology, and a projection range up to 200 inches. It supports WiFi screen mirroring for iOS and Android, making it ideal for home cinema use in low-light environments.', 'havit-projector-pj201-120-lumens-hd-720p-portable-1781686342', '<p>The <strong>Havit PJ201 120 Lumens HD 720p Portable Projector</strong> is designed for users seeking an affordable and space-saving home cinema solution. It features <strong>HD 720p resolution support</strong> and a <strong>3.97-inch LCD display projection system</strong>, delivering clear visuals for movies, videos, and presentations.</p><p>With a projection range of <strong>1.12 to 6 meters (33 to 200 inches)</strong>, the PJ201 allows you to enjoy a large-screen viewing experience in compact spaces. Its <strong>16:9 / 4:3 aspect ratio support</strong> ensures compatibility with various media formats.</p><p>This projector comes with <strong>WiFi smart screen mirroring technology</strong>, enabling seamless connection with both <strong>iOS and Android devices</strong> without requiring extra cables or adapters. You can easily stream content directly from your smartphone.</p><p>It also features <strong>HiFi stereo sound</strong>, <strong>low-noise cooling system (below 25dB)</strong>, and a <strong>new air duct design</strong> that reduces fan noise for a quieter viewing experience. Additional features include <strong>image flip support</strong>, <strong>front and rear projection compatibility</strong>, and <strong>ceiling mounting support</strong>, making it highly flexible for different setups.</p><p>With long lamp life and efficient performance, the Havit PJ201 is a practical choice for home entertainment in dark environments.</p><p><strong>Warranty:</strong> 1 Year Manufacturing Warranty</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display</td><td>Display Type</td><td>3.97\" LCD Display</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Resolution</td><td>1280 × 720 (Supports 1080p input)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Brightness</td><td>~3000 lumens (120 ANSI lumens)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>1.12 – 6 meters (33 – 200 inches)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9 / 4:3</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Speaker</td><td>Built-in 4Ω 3W</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 14500.00, 14500.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/oK1CA9C669W9SY6QMaTPihOL26qf3MGLspxnCa9q.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 08:52:22', '2026-06-17 08:52:22', 'Havit PJ201 120 ANSI Lumens HD 720p Portable Projector | WiFi Screen Mirroring, 200 Inch Display', 'Buy Havit PJ201 Portable Projector with 120 ANSI lumens brightness, HD 720p support, WiFi screen mirroring, and up to 200-inch projection. Ideal for home cinema, compact spaces, and smartphone connectivity.', 'Havit PJ201, 120 ANSI lumens projector, HD 720p projector, portable mini projector, WiFi screen mirroring projector, home cinema projector, 200 inch projector, LCD projector 3.97 inch, Android iOS projector, low noise projector, budget projector Havit', NULL, 229, NULL, NULL);
