(727, 'Havit Projector PJ220 PRO 250 ANSI Android Mini Portable', 'The Havit PJ220 PRO is a smart Android 13 portable projector featuring Full HD 1080p native resolution, 250 ANSI lumens brightness, and 4K support. With auto focus, dual-band WiFi, and built-in apps, it delivers a smooth and modern home entertainment experience.', 'havit-projector-pj220-pro-250-ansi-android-mini-portable-1781687111', '<p>The <strong>Havit PJ220 PRO Android Mini Portable Projector</strong> is a feature-rich smart projector designed for modern entertainment, business, and gaming needs. It offers <strong>native Full HD 1920×1080 resolution</strong> with <strong>4K video support</strong>, ensuring sharp, detailed, and vibrant visuals for movies, presentations, and streaming content.</p><p>Powered by <strong>Android 13.0</strong>, the PJ220 PRO allows users to directly access apps, stream videos, and enjoy online content without requiring external devices. Its <strong>250 ANSI lumens brightness</strong> combined with <strong>6500 lumens (manufacturer rating)</strong> ensures clear viewing in indoor environments.</p><p>The projector features <strong>advanced auto focus technology</strong>, which instantly adjusts image clarity for a sharp and hassle-free viewing experience. With <strong>2.4G/5G dual-band WiFi</strong>, users can enjoy smooth streaming, fast screen mirroring, and stable online connectivity.</p><p>Connectivity is highly flexible, including <strong>AV, USB, HDMI-compatible input, 3.5mm audio output, and Type-C charging support</strong>, making it compatible with a wide range of devices such as smartphones, laptops, and gaming consoles.</p><p>For audio, the PJ220 PRO includes <strong>dual 4Ω 5W speakers</strong>, delivering clear and balanced sound suitable for casual home entertainment and presentations without needing external speakers.</p><p>Its compact and lightweight design makes it highly portable, perfect for <strong>home theaters, office meetings, gaming setups, and travel use</strong>. With <strong>55W low power consumption</strong>, it ensures energy-efficient performance even during long usage sessions.</p><p>Overall, the Havit PJ220 PRO combines smart Android functionality, Full HD clarity, wireless connectivity, and portability for a complete modern projection experience.</p><p><strong>Warranty:</strong> 1 Year Manufacturing Warranty</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display</td><td>Display Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Resolution</td><td>Native 1920 × 1080 (Supports 4K input)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Brightness</td><td>6500 lumens (250 ANSI lumens)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Auto Feature</td><td>Auto Focus</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp</td><td>Type</td><td>LED</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 21000.00, 21000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/P1eYGhW9KVA3TkdbduTZZhS35FA86m1OlXbGWXYy.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 09:05:11', '2026-06-17 09:05:11', 'Havit PJ220 PRO Android 13 Portable Projector | 250 ANSI Lumens, Full HD 1080p, 4K Support', 'Buy Havit PJ220 PRO Android 13 Portable Projector with 250 ANSI lumens, Full HD 1080p native resolution, 4K support, auto focus, and dual-band WiFi. Ideal for home, office, gaming, and streaming entertainment.', 'Havit PJ220 PRO, Android projector 13, 250 ANSI lumens projector, Full HD portable projector, 4K support projector, smart mini projector, WiFi projector dual band, auto focus projector, portable home projector, Havit smart projector Bangladesh', NULL, 229, NULL, NULL),
(728, 'Havit Projector PJ221 Smart', 'The Havit PJ221 Smart Projector is a compact and lightweight portable projector featuring native HD 720P resolution, 120 ANSI lumens brightness, Wi-Fi screen mirroring, and Bluetooth connectivity. With support for up to 140-inch projection and multiple connectivity options, it is ideal for home entertainment, travel, and casual gaming.', 'havit-projector-pj221-smart-1781692096', '<p>The <strong>Havit PJ221 Smart Projector</strong> is a portable and user-friendly projection solution designed for home entertainment, casual gaming, online streaming, and small presentations. Its compact design and lightweight construction make it easy to carry, allowing you to enjoy a large-screen viewing experience wherever you go.</p><p>Featuring <strong>native HD 720P resolution</strong> with support for <strong>1080P video input</strong>, the PJ221 delivers sharp visuals and vibrant colors for movies, TV shows, games, and presentations. It supports projection sizes up to <strong>140 inches</strong>, creating an immersive viewing experience in bedrooms, living rooms, dormitories, or outdoor settings.</p><p>With <strong>120 ANSI lumens brightness</strong> and a <strong>1000:1 contrast ratio</strong>, the projector performs best in dark or low-light environments, providing clear and enjoyable image quality. Built-in <strong>Wi-Fi screen mirroring</strong> allows you to wirelessly display content from compatible smartphones, tablets, and laptops, while <strong>Bluetooth connectivity</strong> makes it easy to connect wireless speakers, headphones, and other accessories.</p><p>The Havit PJ221 comes equipped with multiple connectivity options, including <strong>HDMI, USB, USB-C, and a 3.5mm audio output</strong>, ensuring compatibility with a wide range of devices such as gaming consoles, streaming devices, laptops, and media players.</p><p>Its integrated speaker eliminates the need for external audio equipment in casual viewing situations, while its low power consumption helps maintain energy-efficient operation. Weighing only around <strong>407g</strong>, the PJ221 is perfect for travel, outdoor movie nights, and portable entertainment setups.</p><p>Whether you\'re looking for a budget-friendly projector for movies, gaming, presentations, or streaming content, the Havit PJ221 Smart Projector offers an excellent balance of portability, convenience, and value.</p><p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul><li>Native HD 720P Resolution</li><li>Supports Full HD 1080P Input</li><li>Up to 140-Inch Projection Size</li><li>120 ANSI Lumens Brightness</li><li>1000:1 Contrast Ratio</li><li>Wi-Fi Screen Mirroring</li><li>Bluetooth Connectivity</li><li>HDMI, USB, USB-C &amp; 3.5mm Audio Ports</li><li>Compact and Lightweight Design</li><li>Built-in Speaker</li><li>Low Power Consumption</li><li>1-Year Manufacturing Warranty</li></ul>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display</td><td>Display Type</td><td>2\" LCD Display</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Resolution</td><td>1280 × 720 (Supports 1080P Input)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Brightness</td><td>3800 Lumens (120 ANSI Lumens)</td></tr><tr><td>Lamp</td><td>Type</td><td>LED</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 10499.00, 10499.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/w1TaKN2jKk7n4dGsY8rQyAI564s4qYNz7MMBwQQK.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 10:28:16', '2026-06-17 10:28:16', 'Havit PJ221 Smart Projector | HD 720P Portable Mini Projector with Wi-Fi & Bluetooth', 'Buy the Havit PJ221 Smart Projector with HD 720P resolution, 120 ANSI lumens brightness, Wi-Fi screen mirroring, Bluetooth connectivity, and up to 140-inch display support. Compact, lightweight, and perfect for home entertainment, travel, gaming, and streaming.', 'Havit PJ221, Havit Smart Projector, HD projector, 720P projector, portable projector, mini projector, WiFi projector, Bluetooth projector, Havit projector Bangladesh, home entertainment projector, travel projector, budget projector, wireless screen mirroring projector', NULL, 229, NULL, NULL),
(729, 'Havit Projector PJ300 Plus Google Licensed', 'The Havit PJ300 Plus Google Licensed Projector features native Full HD 1080p resolution, 550 ANSI lumens brightness, 4K video support, auto focus, and auto keystone correction. Equipped with Google-licensed smart functionality, dual 10W speakers, and projection sizes up to 220 inches, it delivers an immersive home theater and business presentation experience.', 'havit-projector-pj300-plus-google-licensed-1781692461', '<p>The <strong>Havit PJ300 Plus Google Licensed Projector</strong> is a premium smart projector designed to provide stunning visuals, intelligent features, and reliable performance for home entertainment, gaming, and professional presentations. Featuring a <strong>4.45-inch LCD display</strong> with <strong>native Full HD 1920×1080 resolution</strong> and <strong>4K video support</strong>, it delivers sharp images, vibrant colors, and exceptional clarity.</p><p>With <strong>550 ANSI lumens brightness</strong> and a <strong>1500:1 contrast ratio</strong>, the PJ300 Plus produces bright and detailed visuals across various lighting conditions. Its flexible projection range of <strong>1.3 to 6.2 meters</strong> supports screen sizes from <strong>40 to 220 inches</strong>, making it suitable for both compact rooms and large viewing spaces.</p><p>The projector is equipped with <strong>auto focus</strong> and <strong>auto keystone correction</strong>, allowing quick setup and perfectly aligned images without manual adjustments. Its <strong>Google Licensed smart platform</strong> provides seamless access to streaming apps, online content, and smart entertainment features for a convenient user experience.</p><p>The <strong>fully sealed optical engine</strong> protects internal components from dust, helping maintain image quality while extending projector lifespan. Enhanced cooling and efficient heat dissipation reduce the risk of image degradation and black spots, ensuring long-term reliability.</p><p>For audio performance, the PJ300 Plus includes <strong>dual 4Ω 10W stereo speakers</strong>, delivering powerful and clear sound for movies, games, and presentations. Additional features such as <strong>ambient LED lighting</strong> create an engaging entertainment atmosphere.</p><p>Connectivity options include <strong>AV, USB, dual HDMI-compatible ports, and a 3.5mm audio output</strong>, enabling easy connection with gaming consoles, laptops, streaming devices, and media players. With a lamp life of up to <strong>40,000 hours</strong>, low noise operation (≤34dB), and universal AC power support, this projector offers dependable performance for years to come.</p><p>Whether for home cinema, business presentations, online streaming, or gaming, the Havit PJ300 Plus combines smart features, high brightness, and impressive image quality in a stylish and portable design.</p><p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul><li>Native Full HD 1920×1080 Resolution</li><li>Supports 4K Video Playback</li><li>550 ANSI Lumens Brightness</li><li>Auto Focus &amp; Auto Keystone Correction</li><li>Google Licensed Smart Platform</li><li>Projection Size Up to 220 Inches</li><li>Fully Sealed Dustproof Optical Engine</li><li>Dual 10W Stereo Speakers</li><li>Ambient LED Lighting Effects</li><li>Dual HDMI Connectivity</li><li>Up to 40,000 Hours LED Lamp Life</li><li>Low Noise Operation (≤34dB)</li><li>1-Year Manufacturing Warranty</li></ul>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display</td><td>Display Type</td><td>4.45\" LCD Screen</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Resolution</td><td>Native 1920 × 1080p (Supports 4K Input)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Brightness</td><td>14,000 Lumens (550 ANSI Lumens)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>1.3 – 3.7m (40 – 120 Inch)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1500:1</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Focus &amp; Keystone</td><td>Auto Focus, Auto Keystone</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Languages</td><td>English, Japanese, Chinese + Total 23 Languages</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Operating Voltage</td><td>AC 100V–240V, 50Hz–60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Special Features</td><td>Dynamic RGB Lighting, Ambient LED Light</td></tr><tr><td>System</td><td>Operating System</td><td>Android OS</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 38800.00, 38500.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/tbK7wzvMt9xkCXQEZ6GYwXDIGaCzoMDdEcDRGNUP.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 10:34:21', '2026-06-17 10:34:21', 'Havit PJ300 Plus Google Licensed Projector | 550 ANSI Lumens Full HD 1080p Smart Projector', 'Buy the Havit PJ300 Plus Google Licensed Projector with native Full HD 1080p resolution, 550 ANSI lumens brightness, 4K support, auto focus, auto keystone correction, dual 10W speakers, and projection sizes up to 220 inches. Perfect for home entertainment, gaming, and business presentations.', 'Havit PJ300 Plus, Google Licensed Projector, Havit Smart Projector, 550 ANSI projector, Full HD projector, 1080p projector, 4K supported projector, Android TV projector, auto focus projector, auto keystone projector, home theater projector, gaming projector, Havit projector Bangladesh', NULL, 229, NULL, NULL),
(730, 'Havit Projector PJ218 Pro 180 ANSI Lumens FHD Wi-Fi Portable', 'The Havit PJ218 Pro is a compact and portable smart projector featuring 180 ANSI lumens brightness, DLP display technology, Android 9.0, and support for Full HD 1080P and 4K content. Equipped with dual-band Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, an 8000mAh battery, and auto keystone correction, it is ideal for home entertainment, travel, and business presentations.', 'havit-projector-pj218-pro-180-ansi-lumens-fhd-wi-fi-portable-1781693620', '<p>The <strong>Havit PJ218 Pro 180 ANSI Lumens FHD Wi-Fi Portable Projector</strong> is a versatile and portable projection solution designed for entertainment, gaming, and professional presentations. Combining smart features, wireless connectivity, and compact portability, it delivers an immersive viewing experience wherever you go.</p><p>Powered by advanced <strong>DLP display technology</strong>, the projector offers a native resolution of <strong>960×540P</strong> while supporting <strong>Full HD 1080P and 4K video input</strong>. With <strong>180 ANSI lumens brightness</strong> and a <strong>1000:1 contrast ratio</strong>, it produces clear and vibrant visuals in low-light environments, making it ideal for movies, streaming content, and presentations.</p><p>The projector runs on <strong>Android 9.0</strong> and is equipped with <strong>2GB RAM and 32GB internal storage</strong>, providing smooth performance and direct access to apps and multimedia content without requiring external devices. Its powerful <strong>MT9269 processor</strong> ensures reliable operation and responsive navigation.</p><p>For seamless connectivity, the PJ218 Pro supports <strong>dual-band Wi-Fi (2.4GHz/5GHz)</strong> and <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, allowing users to stream content wirelessly and connect speakers, headphones, or other compatible devices. Additional connectivity options include <strong>HDMI, USB, SD card slot, and 3.5mm audio output</strong>, ensuring compatibility with laptops, gaming consoles, smartphones, and media players.</p><p>An integrated <strong>8000mAh rechargeable battery</strong> provides up to <strong>2–4 hours of continuous playback</strong>, making it perfect for outdoor entertainment, travel, and business use. The projector can be fully recharged in approximately <strong>3 hours</strong> for quick reuse.</p><p>The <strong>auto vertical keystone correction (±40°)</strong> feature automatically adjusts image alignment for a properly positioned display, while the ultra-quiet operation of <strong>≤15dB</strong> ensures a distraction-free viewing experience.</p><p>Weighing only <strong>0.48kg</strong>, the Havit PJ218 Pro is easy to carry and store, making it a convenient companion for home, office, travel, and outdoor activities. With a durable LED light source rated for up to <strong>30,000 hours</strong>, it offers years of dependable performance.</p><p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul><li>DLP Projection Technology</li><li>Native 960×540P Resolution</li><li>Supports Full HD 1080P &amp; 4K Input</li><li>180 ANSI Lumens Brightness</li><li>Android 9.0 Smart Operating System</li><li>2GB RAM + 32GB Storage</li><li>Dual-Band Wi-Fi &amp; Bluetooth Connectivity</li><li>8000mAh Built-in Rechargeable Battery</li><li>Auto Vertical Keystone Correction (±40°)</li><li>Dual Stereo Speakers</li><li>Ultra-Quiet Operation (≤15dB)</li><li>Up to 30,000 Hours LED Lifespan</li><li>Lightweight &amp; Portable Design</li><li>1-Year Manufacturing Warranty</li></ul>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display</td><td>Display Type</td><td>DLP Display</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Resolution</td><td>960 × 540 (Supports 1080P &amp; 4K Input)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Brightness</td><td>180 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>4:3 / 16:9</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1000:1</td></tr><tr><td>System</td><td>Operating System</td><td>Android 9.0</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>RAM &amp; Storage</td><td>2GB RAM + 32GB ROM</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>CPU</td><td>MT9269</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Image Correction</td><td>Auto Vertical Keystone ±40°, 0° Horizontal</td></tr><tr><td>Battery</td><td>Capacity</td><td>8000mAh</td></tr><tr><td>Battery</td><td>Charging Time</td><td>Approximately 3 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Battery</td><td>Working Time</td><td>2–4 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Noise Level</td><td>≤15dB</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 36500.00, 36500.00, NULL, 6, 'products/thumbnails/sT2nRNKxyMNKjMalBaoFYOJLNmUcjgfMUzYt7GO8.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 10:53:40', '2026-06-17 10:53:40', 'Havit PJ218 Pro Portable Projector | 180 ANSI Lumens DLP Android Wi-Fi Projector', 'Buy the Havit PJ218 Pro Portable Projector with 180 ANSI lumens brightness, DLP display technology, Android 9.0, dual-band Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, and an 8000mAh battery. Supports Full HD 1080P and 4K input for home entertainment, travel, and business presentations.', 'Havit PJ218 Pro, Havit portable projector, DLP projector, Android projector, 180 ANSI projector, WiFi projector, Bluetooth projector, mini projector, rechargeable projector, 4K supported projector, portable home theater projector, Havit projector Bangladesh, smart projector', NULL, 229, NULL, NULL),
(731, 'Havit Projector PJ202 PRO 300 ANSI Lumens FHD Wi-Fi Portable', 'The Havit PJ202 PRO Android Projector features 300 ANSI lumens brightness, native Full HD 1080p resolution, and Wi-Fi screen mirroring for seamless connectivity. With support for up to a 200-inch display, stereo speakers, multiple projection modes, and versatile connectivity options, it delivers an immersive home entertainment experience.', 'havit-projector-pj202-pro-300-ansi-lumens-fhd-wi-fi-portable-1781693947', '<p>The <strong>Havit PJ202 PRO 300 ANSI Lumens FHD Wi-Fi Portable Projector</strong> is designed to provide high-quality visuals, smart connectivity, and flexible installation options for home entertainment, presentations, and multimedia applications. Featuring <strong>native Full HD 1920×1080 resolution</strong> and <strong>300 ANSI lumens brightness</strong>, it produces sharp, detailed images with vibrant colors and excellent clarity.</p><p>With a <strong>1500:1 contrast ratio</strong> and support for screen sizes up to <strong>200 inches</strong>, the PJ202 PRO creates a cinematic viewing experience suitable for movies, sports, gaming, and presentations. Its powerful projection capabilities allow users to enjoy large-screen entertainment from the comfort of their home or outdoor setup.</p><p>The projector supports <strong>Wi-Fi screen mirroring</strong>, enabling seamless wireless connection with compatible Android and iOS devices. Stream videos, display photos, or share presentations directly from your smartphone or tablet without additional adapters.</p><p>For enhanced image alignment, the projector includes <strong>±15° vertical keystone correction</strong>, helping users achieve a properly adjusted image in different installation environments. It supports multiple projection modes, including <strong>front projection, rear projection, ceiling front, and ceiling rear</strong>, providing flexibility for various room layouts and mounting preferences.</p><p>Built-in <strong>stereo speakers</strong> deliver clear and immersive sound, reducing the need for external audio systems during everyday use. An advanced cooling system keeps operational noise below <strong>35dB</strong>, ensuring a quieter and more enjoyable viewing experience.</p><p>The Havit PJ202 PRO offers broad connectivity options, including <strong>HDMI, USB, AV, SD card support, and wireless screen mirroring</strong>, making it compatible with laptops, gaming consoles, media players, smartphones, and streaming devices. With support for <strong>23 languages</strong>, it provides a user-friendly experience for a wide range of users.</p><p>Its lightweight <strong>1.36kg portable design</strong> makes transportation and setup easy, whether for home use, office presentations, or outdoor movie nights.</p><p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul><li>Native Full HD 1920×1080 Resolution</li><li>300 ANSI Lumens Brightness</li><li>Up to 200-Inch Projection Size</li><li>Wi-Fi Screen Mirroring Support</li><li>1500:1 Contrast Ratio</li><li>±15° Vertical Keystone Correction</li><li>Front, Rear &amp; Ceiling Projection Modes</li><li>Built-in Stereo Speakers</li><li>Low Noise Operation (&lt;35dB)</li><li>HDMI, USB, AV &amp; SD Card Connectivity</li><li>Support for 23 Languages</li><li>Compact and Portable Design</li><li>1-Year Manufacturing Warranty</li></ul>', '<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display</td><td>Display Type</td><td>4.41\" LCD Display</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Resolution</td><td>Native 1920 × 1080 (Full HD)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Brightness</td><td>8500 Lumens (300 ANSI Lumens)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>1.7 – 6.2 Meters (54 – 200 Inches)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9 / 4:3</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1500:1</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>', 'PROJECTOR', 19500.00, 19000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/X6Ic69EOC6Lv0sSHme8yLNk2B6uYu8URtQqbrMsJ.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 10:59:07', '2026-06-17 11:32:22', 'Havit PJ202 PRO Android Projector | 300 ANSI Lumens Full HD 1080P Wi-Fi Portable Projector', 'Buy the Havit PJ202 PRO Android Projector with 300 ANSI lumens brightness, native Full HD 1080p resolution, Wi-Fi screen mirroring, stereo speakers, and up to 200-inch display support. Ideal for home entertainment, gaming, presentations, and portable multimedia use.', 'Havit PJ202 PRO, Havit Android projector, 300 ANSI projector, Full HD projector, 1080p portable projector, WiFi projector, smart projector, home theater projector, portable projector Bangladesh, 200 inch projector, screen mirroring projector, multimedia projector', NULL, 229, NULL, NULL),
(732, 'Havit Projector PJ215 Pro Prime Jasper Smart Portable', 'The Havit PJ215 Pro Prime Jasper Smart Portable Projector features Android TV 9.0, native HD 720P resolution with 4K support, 250 ANSI lumens brightness, auto focus, and auto keystone correction. With RGB lighting, Wi-Fi streaming, and multiple connectivity options, it delivers a compact yet powerful home entertainment experience.', 'havit-projector-pj215-pro-prime-jasper-smart-portable-1781694179', '<p>The <strong>Havit PJ215 Pro Prime Jasper Smart Portable Projector</strong> is a compact and feature-rich entertainment device designed for home cinema, streaming, and multimedia use. It comes with a <strong>2.69-inch LCD display</strong> featuring <strong>native 1280×720 HD resolution</strong> and support for <strong>4K video playback</strong>, ensuring sharp, bright, and detailed visuals.</p><p>With <strong>250 ANSI lumens brightness (6000 lumens rated output)</strong> and a <strong>1500:1 contrast ratio</strong>, the projector delivers clear images in low to moderate lighting conditions. Its projection range of <strong>0.83 to 3 meters</strong> supports screen sizes from <strong>20 to 150 inches</strong>, making it suitable for bedrooms, living rooms, and compact entertainment spaces.</p><p>The projector runs on <strong>Android TV 9.0</strong>, allowing direct access to streaming apps, online content, and smart entertainment without external devices. Built-in <strong>Wi-Fi connectivity</strong> ensures smooth streaming and screen mirroring from smartphones, tablets, and laptops.</p><p>Advanced <strong>auto focus and auto keystone correction</strong> features automatically adjust image sharpness and alignment, providing a hassle-free setup experience. The projector also supports <strong>multiple projection modes</strong>, including front and rear projection, making it flexible for different room setups.</p><p>For audio, it includes a <strong>built-in 4Ω 5W speaker</strong>, delivering clear sound for movies, gaming, and presentations. The addition of <strong>dynamic RGB lighting</strong> enhances the visual experience and creates a stylish ambient atmosphere.</p><p>Connectivity options include <strong>AV, USB, HDMI-compatible port, 3.5mm audio output, and Type-C input</strong>, ensuring compatibility with a wide range of devices. With support for <strong>23 languages</strong>, it is designed for global usability.</p><p>The PJ215 Pro is powered by a <strong>low 55W energy-efficient system</strong>, operates within <strong>AC 100V–240V</strong>, and ensures long-term durability with a <strong>40,000-hour LED lamp life</strong>. Its compact size and lightweight design (<strong>1.16kg</strong>) make it highly portable for both home and travel use.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul><li>Native HD 1280×720 Resolution (Supports 4K Playback)</li><li>Android TV 9.0 Smart System</li><li>250 ANSI Lumens Brightness</li><li>1500:1 Contrast Ratio</li><li>Auto Focus &amp; Auto Keystone Correction</li><li>Projection Size 20\"–150\"</li><li>RGB Ambient Lighting</li><li>Wi-Fi Screen Mirroring Support</li><li>Multiple Connectivity Options (HDMI, USB, AV, Type-C)</li><li>40,000 Hours LED Lamp Life</li><li>Compact &amp; Portable Design (1.16kg)</li><li>1-Year Manufacturing Warranty</li></ul>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display</td><td>Display Type</td><td>2.69\" LCD Display</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Resolution</td><td>1280 × 720 (Supports 4K Input)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Brightness</td><td>6000 Lumens (250 ANSI Lumens)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>0.83 – 3 meters (20 – 150 inches)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9 / 4:3</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1500:1</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Focus &amp; Keystone</td><td>Auto Focus, Auto Keystone</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Languages</td><td>English, Japanese, Chinese (Total 23 Languages)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Operating Voltage</td><td>AC 100V–240V, 50Hz–60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Special Features</td><td>Dynamic RGB Lighting</td></tr><tr><td>System</td><td>OS</td><td>Android TV 9.0 (1GB RAM + 32GB ROM Supported)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 18500.00, 18500.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/1z77mdr3sXoZgg5tT962STh81jM3hwKV6J2Vu2UF.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 11:02:59', '2026-06-17 11:02:59', 'Havit PJ215 Pro Smart Portable Projector | Android TV 9.0 250 ANSI Lumens 4K Support', 'Buy Havit PJ215 Pro Prime Jasper Smart Portable Projector with Android TV 9.0, 250 ANSI lumens brightness, HD 720P resolution, 4K support, auto focus, RGB lighting, and Wi-Fi streaming. Perfect for home entertainment, movies, gaming, and travel use.', 'Havit PJ215 Pro, Havit Jasper projector, Android TV projector, 250 ANSI projector, HD 720P projector, 4K supported projector, smart portable projector, mini projector Bangladesh, WiFi projector, RGB projector, home theater projector, portable projector', NULL, 229, NULL, NULL),
(733, 'Havit  Projector PJ202 300 ANSI Lumens Full HD Wi-Fi Screen Mirroring Portable', 'The Havit PJ202 300 ANSI Lumens FHD Portable Projector delivers Full HD 1080P resolution with 300 ANSI lumens brightness and a 1500:1 contrast ratio. Featuring large screen projection up to 200 inches, HiFi stereo speakers, multiple mounting options, and wide device compatibility, it is ideal for home cinema and entertainment.', 'havit-projector-pj202-300-ansi-lumens-full-hd-wi-fi-screen-mirroring-portable-1781694450', '<p>The <strong>Havit PJ202 300 ANSI Lumens FHD Portable Projector</strong> is designed to deliver an immersive home entertainment experience with sharp visuals, reliable performance, and flexible installation options. With <strong>Full HD 1920×1080 resolution support</strong>, <strong>300 ANSI lumens brightness</strong>, and a <strong>1500:1 contrast ratio</strong>, it produces clear and vibrant images suitable for movies, gaming, and presentations.</p><p>It supports a <strong>projection distance of 1.7 to 6.2 meters</strong>, allowing screen sizes from <strong>54 to 200 inches</strong>, creating a true cinema-like experience at home or in the office. The projector supports <strong>16:9 and 4:3 aspect ratios</strong>, ensuring compatibility with different media formats.</p><p>For audio, the PJ202 is equipped with <strong>HiFi stereo surround speakers</strong>, delivering clear and immersive sound without requiring external speakers. The built-in cooling system and optimized air duct design help reduce noise levels to below <strong>35dB</strong>, ensuring quiet operation during use.</p><p>This projector offers flexible installation options, including <strong>tripod mounting, ceiling mounting, and table placement</strong>, making it adaptable to different environments and setups.</p><p>Connectivity is highly versatile, with support for <strong>HDMI, USB, AV, VGA, and 3.5mm audio output</strong>, allowing compatibility with smartphones, laptops, PCs, gaming consoles (PS4), TV boxes, USB drives, and DVD players.</p><p>Designed for convenience and durability, the Havit PJ202 is an excellent choice for home cinema, gaming, and professional use, backed by a <strong>1-year manufacturing warranty</strong>.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul><li>Full HD 1920×1080 Resolution Support</li><li>300 ANSI Lumens Brightness</li><li>Projection Size Up to 200 Inches</li><li>1500:1 Contrast Ratio</li><li>HiFi Stereo Surround Speakers</li><li>Low Noise Operation (&lt;35dB)</li><li>Multiple Mounting Options (Tripod, Ceiling, Table)</li><li>Wide Connectivity (HDMI, USB, VGA, AV)</li><li>Compatible with Multiple Devices</li><li>Home Theater Optimized Design</li><li>1-Year Warranty</li></ul>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display</td><td>Display Type</td><td>4.41\" LCD Display</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Resolution</td><td>Full HD (1920 × 1080)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Brightness</td><td>8500 Lumens (300 ANSI Lumens)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>1.7 – 6.2 Meters (54 – 200 Inches)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9 / 4:3</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1500:1</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 18500.00, 18000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/u40ZloXjCBSnBrIJyUqvNl7fgLMFY6MmvfaemS8O.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 11:07:30', '2026-06-17 11:07:30', 'Havit PJ202 300 ANSI Lumens Full HD Portable Projector | 1080P Home Cinema Projector', 'Buy Havit PJ202 300 ANSI Lumens Full HD Portable Projector with 1080P support, 200-inch display, HiFi stereo speakers, multiple mounting options, and wide device compatibility. Perfect for home cinema, gaming, and entertainment use.', 'Havit PJ202, Havit projector, 300 ANSI lumens projector, Full HD projector, 1080P projector, home cinema projector, portable projector Bangladesh, 200 inch projector, HiFi speaker projector, gaming projector, HDMI USB VGA projector', NULL, 229, NULL, NULL),
(734, 'Havit Projector PJ212 270 ANSI FHD Portable', 'The Havit PJ212 270 ANSI FHD Portable Projector features native Full HD 1080P resolution, 12000 lumens (270 ANSI) brightness, and a 4\" LCD display. With dual-band WiFi screen mirroring, Bluetooth output, dual HDMI/USB ports, and 200-inch projection support, it is ideal for home cinema and presentations.', 'havit-projector-pj212-270-ansi-fhd-portable-1781694795', '<p>The <strong>Havit PJ212 270 ANSI FHD Portable Projector</strong> is a powerful and compact entertainment solution designed for home theater, gaming, and professional presentations. It features a <strong>native 1920×1080 Full HD resolution</strong> with a <strong>4-inch LCD display</strong>, delivering sharp, vibrant, and detailed visuals.</p><p>With <strong>12000 lumens brightness (270 ANSI lumens)</strong> and a <strong>1500:1 contrast ratio</strong>, the PJ212 ensures clear image quality in both dim and moderately lit environments. It supports a <strong>projection size of 33 to 200 inches</strong>, with a throw distance ranging from <strong>1.12 to 6 meters</strong>, making it suitable for a wide variety of room sizes.</p><p>The projector supports <strong>2.4G + 5G dual-band WiFi screen mirroring</strong>, enabling smooth and lag-free wireless streaming from smartphones, tablets, and laptops. Additionally, <strong>Bluetooth output</strong> allows users to connect external speakers for enhanced audio performance.</p><p>For connectivity, the PJ212 includes <strong>dual HDMI ports, dual USB ports, AV input, and a 3.5mm audio jack</strong>, ensuring compatibility with gaming consoles, PCs, TV boxes, and other multimedia devices. It also supports multiple projection modes and a multilingual interface with <strong>23 language options</strong>.</p><p>The built-in <strong>4Ω 5W speaker</strong> provides clear and balanced sound for casual viewing, while the advanced cooling system keeps noise levels under <strong>28dB</strong>, ensuring a quiet viewing experience.</p><p>Designed for portability, the PJ212 weighs only <strong>1.35kg</strong> and features a compact body that is easy to carry and set up. With <strong>low power consumption of 68W</strong> and a long-lasting <strong>40,000-hour LED lamp life</strong>, it offers efficient and durable performance.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul><li>Native Full HD 1920×1080 Resolution</li><li>270 ANSI Lumens Brightness (12000 Lumens Rated)</li><li>4\" LCD Display Technology</li><li>Projection Size Up to 200 Inches</li><li>Dual-Band WiFi (2.4G + 5G) Screen Mirroring</li><li>Bluetooth Audio Output Support</li><li>Dual HDMI + Dual USB + AV Connectivity</li><li>1500:1 Contrast Ratio</li><li>Low Noise Operation (&lt;28dB)</li><li>40,000 Hours LED Lamp Life</li><li>Compact &amp; Portable Design (1.35kg)</li><li>1-Year Warranty</li></ul>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display</td><td>Display Type</td><td>4\" LCD Display</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Resolution</td><td>1080P</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Brightness</td><td>12000 Lumens (270 ANSI Lumens)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>1.12 – 6 meters (33 – 200 inches)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9 / 4:3</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1500:1</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 18000.00, 18000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/Mjkag8iVkXsKRjq4Ezbgyyszhbzn1xqwICDR8mqN.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 11:13:15', '2026-06-17 11:13:15', 'Havit PJ212 270 ANSI FHD Portable Projector | Full HD 1080P WiFi Bluetooth Home Projector', 'Buy Havit PJ212 270 ANSI FHD Portable Projector with Full HD 1080P resolution, WiFi screen mirroring, Bluetooth output, dual HDMI/USB ports, and up to 200-inch display support. Ideal for home cinema, gaming, and presentations.', 'Havit PJ212, Havit projector, 270 ANSI projector, Full HD projector, 1080P portable projector, WiFi projector, Bluetooth projector, home cinema projector, 200 inch projector, dual HDMI projector, portable projector Bangladesh', NULL, 229, NULL, NULL),
(735, 'Havit Projector PJ207 160 Lumens HD 720p Wi-Fi Screen Mirroring Portable', 'The Havit PJ207 160 Lumens HD 720p Portable Projector features a 2.69\" LCD display, HD 720P native resolution with 1080P support, and 160 ANSI lumens brightness. With WiFi screen mirroring, HiFi stereo sound, and ultra-compact 460g design, it is ideal for portable home entertainment.', 'havit-projector-pj207-160-lumens-hd-720p-wi-fi-screen-mirroring-portable-1781695042', '<p>The <strong>Havit PJ207 160 Lumens HD 720p Portable Projector</strong> is a compact and lightweight entertainment device designed for personal movie viewing, casual gaming, and portable multimedia use. It comes with a <strong>2.69-inch LCD display</strong> and supports <strong>native 1280×720 HD resolution with 1080P playback support</strong>, delivering clear and detailed visuals for everyday use.</p><p>With <strong>160 ANSI lumens brightness (6000 lumens rated output)</strong> and a <strong>1500:1 contrast ratio</strong>, the PJ207 performs best in dark environments, offering decent clarity for movies, cartoons, and presentations. It supports a <strong>projection range of 0.83 to 3 meters</strong>, allowing screen sizes from <strong>20 to 140 inches</strong>, making it suitable for bedrooms, small rooms, and travel use.</p><p>The projector includes <strong>WiFi screen mirroring technology</strong>, enabling seamless wireless connection with smartphones for quick content sharing. It also features <strong>image correction adjustment</strong>, allowing users to align and resize the projection easily for better viewing.</p><p>For audio, the PJ207 is equipped with <strong>HiFi stereo sound</strong>, providing clear and balanced audio output for movies and videos without needing external speakers. Its low-noise design ensures a quieter viewing experience during operation.</p><p>The projector is designed with portability in mind, weighing only <strong>460.4g</strong>, making it easy to carry and use anywhere. Its compact design makes it ideal for travel, camping, and small indoor setups.</p><p>Connectivity options include standard <strong>HDMI, USB, AV, and 3.5mm audio output</strong>, ensuring compatibility with laptops, gaming consoles, TV boxes, and mobile devices.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul><li>HD 1280×720 Native Resolution (Supports 1080P Playback)</li><li>160 ANSI Lumens Brightness</li><li>2.69\" LCD Display Technology</li><li>Projection Size Up to 140 Inches</li><li>WiFi Screen Mirroring Support</li><li>HiFi Stereo Sound</li><li>Image Correction Support</li><li>Ultra Lightweight (460g) Portable Design</li><li>HDMI, USB, AV Connectivity</li><li>Low Noise Operation</li><li>1-Year Warranty</li></ul>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display</td><td>Display Type</td><td>2.69\" LCD Display</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Resolution</td><td>1280 × 720 (Supports 1080P Input)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Brightness</td><td>160 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>0.83 – 3 meters (20 – 140 inches)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9 / 4:3</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1500:1</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 12300.00, 12300.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/ciTfdA4My9EGqecod0XcBYGeLOLcmsL0TfyRs2Dd.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 11:17:22', '2026-06-17 11:17:22', 'Havit PJ207 160 ANSI Lumens Portable Projector | HD 720P WiFi Mini Projector', 'Buy Havit PJ207 160 Lumens HD 720p Portable Projector with WiFi screen mirroring, HiFi stereo sound, 2.69\" LCD display, and ultra-lightweight 460g design. Ideal for home entertainment, travel, and portable movie viewing.', 'Havit PJ207, Havit mini projector, 160 ANSI projector, HD 720P projector, portable projector Bangladesh, WiFi projector, 1080P supported projector, mini home projector, lightweight projector, bedroom projector, travel projector', NULL, 229, NULL, NULL),
(736, 'XINJI Projector PX1 100 ANSI Lumens LCD Portable Android OS', 'The XINJI PX1 is a compact and portable LCD projector with 720P HD resolution and 100 ANSI lumens brightness. It delivers clear, vibrant visuals, voice control convenience, and multiple connectivity options including HDMI and USB—perfect for home entertainment, presentations, and travel use.', 'xinji-projector-px1-100-ansi-lumens-lcd-portable-android-os-1781696593', '<p>The <strong>XINJI PX1 100 ANSI Lumens LCD Portable Projector</strong> is designed for users who need a lightweight, versatile, and travel-friendly projection solution. Its ultra-compact body makes it easy to carry anywhere, making it ideal for business presentations, home entertainment, or outdoor movie sessions.</p><p>With <strong>720P HD resolution</strong>, the PX1 ensures sharp and detailed image quality, while its <strong>100 ANSI lumens brightness</strong> delivers clear visuals in indoor and moderately lit environments. The projector also features <strong>voice control functionality</strong>, allowing users to operate and navigate menus more conveniently.</p><p>Built with a <strong>dual dust-proof structure</strong>, the PX1 maintains long-term image clarity by protecting internal components from dust accumulation. Its <strong>eye-protection technology</strong> reduces strain during extended viewing sessions, ensuring comfortable usage for both kids and adults.</p><p>Connectivity is simple and flexible with <strong>HDMI and USB ports</strong>, enabling seamless compatibility with laptops, TV boxes, gaming consoles, and media drives. The sleek black finish enhances its modern aesthetic, making it suitable for any environment.</p><p>Powered by reliable engineering and distributed by Contrivance Distributions, the XINJI PX1 guarantees authenticity and dependable performance for everyday multimedia needs.</p>', '<p><strong>Display</strong></p><ul><li>Display Type: LCD</li><li>Resolution: 720P (1280 × 720)</li><li>Aspect Ratio: 16:9</li><li>Contrast Ratio: 1000:1</li></ul><p><strong>Brightness &amp; Projection</strong></p><ul><li>Brightness: 100 ANSI Lumens</li><li>Projection Distance: 30\" – 100\"</li></ul><p><strong>Lamp</strong></p><ul><li>Lamp Life: 10,000 Hours</li></ul><p><strong>Audio</strong></p><ul><li>Built-in Speaker: Yes</li></ul><p><strong>Connectivity</strong></p><ul><li>HDMI: 1</li><li>USB: 1</li><li>Audio Jack: 1</li><li>Bluetooth: Yes</li><li>Wi-Fi: 2.4GHz</li></ul><p><strong>System</strong></p><ul><li>Memory: 512MB</li><li>Storage: 4GB Flash</li></ul><p><strong>Power</strong></p><ul><li>Input: AC 100–240V ~ 50/60Hz, 1.5A</li></ul><p><strong>Physical</strong></p><ul><li>Color: Black</li><li>Weight: 1236g</li><li>Dimensions: 220 × 185 × 80 mm</li></ul><p><strong>Warranty</strong></p><ul><li>1 Year Service Warranty</li></ul>', 'PROJECTOR', 8000.00, 8000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/8YQYamgUHPIOdCXEkF0UDVxHklSTo2EfadHBNgeh.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 11:43:13', '2026-06-17 11:43:13', 'XINJI PX1 100 ANSI Lumens Portable LCD Projector | 720P HD Mini Projector with Voice Control', 'Buy XINJI PX1 Portable LCD Projector with 720P HD resolution and 100 ANSI lumens brightness. Compact design, voice control, HDMI & USB connectivity—perfect for home, office, and travel use.', 'XINJI PX1 projector, 100 ANSI lumens projector, portable LCD projector 720P, mini home projector, HDMI USB projector, voice control projector, small portable projector, HD projector Bangladesh', NULL, 264, NULL, NULL),
(737, 'Blisbond Projector Mirror 4K Gimbal', 'The Blisbond Mirror 4K Gimbal Projector delivers premium home entertainment with 4K support, 350 ANSI lumens brightness, and Android 9 smart features. With WiFi 6, Bluetooth 4.0, and 32GB storage, it ensures smooth streaming, gaming, and presentations in a compact, stylish design.', 'blisbond-projector-mirror-4k-gimbal-1781697143', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Blisbond Mirror 4K Gimbal Projector</strong> is a powerful smart projector designed to elevate your home cinema and professional presentations. Combining modern design with advanced projection technology, it delivers stunning visuals and smooth performance for movies, gaming, and business use.</p><p>With <strong>4K support and Full HD LCD+LED display technology</strong>, it produces sharp, vibrant, and detailed images. The <strong>350 ANSI lumens brightness</strong> ensures clear viewing in moderate lighting, while the <strong>2000:1 contrast ratio</strong> enhances depth with rich blacks and bright highlights.</p><p>Powered by the <strong>HI352 chipset</strong> and <strong>Android 9 OS</strong>, the projector provides stable performance and easy access to apps and streaming platforms. Its <strong>1GB RAM and 32GB ROM</strong> offer sufficient storage for applications and media content.</p><p>Connectivity is highly versatile with <strong>WiFi 6, 5G, 2.4G, Bluetooth 4.0, HDMI, USB, AV, and audio output</strong>, supporting both wired and wireless screen sharing for seamless device integration.</p><p>The <strong>electronic focus and keystone correction</strong> ensure perfectly aligned, distortion-free visuals, while the <strong>gimbal design</strong> allows flexible positioning. A built-in <strong>8W speaker</strong> delivers immersive audio without requiring external speakers.</p><p>With a long-lasting <strong>42W LED lamp (30,000 hours lifespan)</strong>, the projector ensures years of reliable usage. Compact, portable, and easy to operate with IR remote control, it is suitable for home theaters, offices, and gaming setups.</p>', '<p><strong>Display</strong></p><ul><li>Display Type: LCD + LED</li><li>Resolution: Full HD (1920 × 1080P)</li><li>4K Support: Yes</li><li>Aspect Ratio: 16:9 / 4:3</li><li>Contrast Ratio: 2000:1</li></ul><p><strong>Brightness &amp; Projection</strong></p><ul><li>Brightness: 350 ANSI Lumens</li><li>Projection Distance: 100” @ 2.95m</li></ul><p><strong>System</strong></p><ul><li>Chip: HI352</li><li>Operating System: Android 9</li><li>RAM: 1GB</li><li>ROM: 32GB</li><li>Languages: Multiple Language Support</li></ul><p><strong>Focus &amp; Correction</strong></p><ul><li>Focus: Electronic Focus</li><li>Keystone Correction: Electronic Keystone</li></ul><p><strong>Lamp</strong></p><ul><li>Power: 42W</li><li>Lamp Life: 30,000 Hours</li></ul><p><strong>Audio</strong></p><ul><li>Built-in Speaker: 8W × 1</li><li>Audio Output: 1 × Jack</li></ul><p><strong>Connectivity</strong></p><ul><li>HDMI: 1</li><li>USB: 1</li><li>AV: 1</li><li>Wi-Fi: WiFi 6 / 5G / 2.4G</li><li>Bluetooth: BT 4.0</li><li>Screen Sharing: Wired &amp; Wireless Support</li></ul><p><strong>Power</strong></p><ul><li>Input: DC 22V / 2.3A</li><li>Power Consumption: 60W</li></ul><p><strong>Physical</strong></p><ul><li>Color: White</li><li>Weight: 2.45 kg</li><li>Dimensions: 295 × 180 × 190 mm</li></ul><p><strong>Warranty</strong></p><ul><li>1-Year Brand Warranty</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p>', 'PROJECTOR', 22690.00, 22690.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/O4EZKqkJQYsl5prec4a99qPonfiJ6Q4q2fQ7OAir.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 11:52:23', '2026-06-17 11:52:23', 'Blisbond Mirror 4K Gimbal Projector | 350 ANSI Smart Android WiFi 6 Projector', 'Buy Blisbond Mirror 4K Gimbal Projector with 350 ANSI brightness, Android 9, WiFi 6, Bluetooth, and 4K support. Ideal smart projector for home cinema, gaming, and presentations.', 'Blisbond Mirror projector, 4K gimbal projector, 350 ANSI projector, Android 9 projector, WiFi 6 projector Bangladesh, smart home pro