(738, 'Cheerlux Projector C9 Android Wifi Full HD 3600 Lumens LED TV Port', 'The Cheerlux C9 Android WiFi Full HD Projector offers 3600 lumens brightness, vibrant LED projection, and built-in Android OS for direct streaming. With multiple connectivity options and Full HD support, it is perfect for home cinema, gaming, and professional presentations', 'cheerlux-projector-c9-android-wifi-full-hd-3600-lumens-led-tv-port-1781697693', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Cheerlux C9 Android WiFi Full HD 3600 Lumens LED Projector</strong> is a powerful all-in-one entertainment solution designed for both home and office use. With its bright <strong>3600 lumens LED light source</strong>, it delivers sharp, colorful, and high-contrast visuals even in moderately lit environments.</p><p>Supporting <strong>Full HD resolution</strong>, the projector ensures clear and detailed image quality for movies, gaming, and presentations. Its built-in <strong>Android operating system</strong> allows direct access to apps and streaming platforms without requiring external devices, making entertainment more convenient and seamless.</p><p>The Cheerlux C9 supports <strong>WiFi connectivity</strong>, enabling smooth wireless streaming and online browsing. In addition, it offers multiple input options including <strong>HDMI and VGA</strong>, allowing easy connection with laptops, gaming consoles, TV boxes, and smartphones.</p><p>Designed for versatility, the projector features a <strong>compact and portable body</strong>, making it easy to carry and set up anywhere. The intuitive interface and remote control enhance user convenience, while the anti-glare projection ensures comfortable viewing for long sessions.</p><p>Whether for home cinema, gaming, or business presentations, the Cheerlux C9 delivers reliable performance with strong brightness, smart functionality, and flexible connectivity.</p>', '<p><strong>Display &amp; Projection</strong></p><ul><li>Native Resolution: 1280 × 720 (HD)</li><li>Supported Resolution: Up to 1080P</li><li>Brightness: 3600 Lumens</li><li>Projection Distance: 1 – 3 m</li><li>Image Size: 50 – 120 inch</li><li>Contrast Ratio: 2000:1</li></ul><p><strong>Lamp</strong></p><ul><li>Type: LED Lamp</li><li>Lamp Life: 50,000 Hours</li></ul><p><strong>Audio</strong></p><ul><li>Built-in Speaker: Yes</li><li>Supported Audio Formats: AVI, TS, DAT, VOB, WAV, MKV, MP3, MP4, M4A</li></ul><p><strong>Media Support</strong></p><ul><li>Picture Formats: JPG, PNG, BMP</li><li>Video Formats: DAT, TS, MP4, MPG, MPEG, AVI, MKV, MOV, WMV, ASF, FLV, 3GP, 3GPP, TP, TRP</li></ul><p><strong>Connectivity</strong></p><ul><li>HDMI: Yes</li><li>USB: Yes</li><li>AV: Yes</li><li>VGA: Yes</li><li>Audio Jack: 3.5mm</li></ul><p><strong>Power</strong></p><ul><li>Input: 90–240V / 50–60Hz</li></ul><p><strong>Wireless</strong></p><ul><li>Bluetooth: Not Supported</li></ul><p><strong>Physical</strong></p><ul><li>Weight: 1.5 kg</li><li>Dimensions: 222 × 165 × 87 mm</li></ul><p><strong>Warranty</strong></p><ul><li>1 Year Service Warranty</li></ul>', 'PROJECTOR', 15500.00, 15499.98, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/mxRx7GL5nWS1ZpRFx4NsItg0sVrcy8DUO4CK0RNf.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 12:01:33', '2026-06-22 15:09:16', 'Cheerlux C9 Android WiFi Full HD Projector 3600 Lumens | Smart LED Home Projector', 'Buy Cheerlux C9 Android WiFi Full HD Projector with 3600 lumens brightness, built-in Android OS, and multiple connectivity options. Ideal for home entertainment, gaming, and office use.', 'Cheerlux C9 projector, Android WiFi projector, 3600 lumens projector, Full HD LED projector, home theater projector Bangladesh, smart projector with apps, HDMI VGA projector, portable movie projector', NULL, 269, NULL, NULL),
(739, 'Cheerlux Projector C58 6000 Lumens LCD Multimedia', 'The Cheerlux C58 Android Multimedia Projector delivers Full HD 1080p resolution with 6000 lumens brightness for clear and vibrant visuals. Powered by Android 9.0 with built-in apps, Auto Focus, and 4D Keystone Correction, it is ideal for home cinema, gaming, and professional presentations.', 'cheerlux-projector-c58-6000-lumens-lcd-multimedia-1781698180', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Cheerlux C58 Android Multimedia Projector</strong> is a powerful and versatile projection solution designed for both home entertainment and professional use. Featuring a <strong>native Full HD 1080p resolution</strong> and a bright <strong>6000-lumen LED lamp</strong>, it produces sharp, colorful, and detailed images even in well-lit environments.</p><p>Running on <strong>Android 9.0 OS</strong>, the projector allows direct access to popular streaming apps like YouTube and Netflix without requiring external devices. With <strong>1GB RAM and 8GB internal storage</strong>, it ensures smooth performance and app installation via Wi-Fi connectivity.</p><p>The <strong>Auto Focus system</strong> provides quick and precise image clarity, while <strong>4D Keystone Correction</strong> enables flexible installation and perfect screen alignment from multiple angles. This makes it highly suitable for home theaters, classrooms, and office presentations.</p><p>Connectivity is highly flexible, offering <strong>HDMI, USB, AV, and VGA ports</strong>, ensuring compatibility with laptops, gaming consoles, and media players. Its compact and modern design enhances portability and easy setup in any environment.</p><p>Whether for movies, gaming, education, or business presentations, the Cheerlux C58 delivers reliable performance, strong brightness, and smart Android functionality for a complete multimedia experience.</p>', '<p><strong>Display &amp; Projection</strong></p><ul><li>Display Type: LCD</li><li>Resolution: Full HD (1920 × 1080)</li><li>Brightness: 6000 Lumens</li><li>Projection Distance: 1.5 – 4.8 m</li><li>Image Size: 40 – 200 inch</li><li>Contrast Ratio: 1000:1</li><li>Aspect Ratio: 16:9</li><li>Throw Ratio: 1.35:1</li></ul><p><strong>System</strong></p><ul><li>Operating System: Android 9</li><li>RAM / ROM: 1GB / 8GB</li><li>4D Electronic Keystone (Auto Keystone Supported)</li><li>Electronic Focus (Auto Focus Supported)</li></ul><p><strong>Lamp</strong></p><ul><li>Type: LED Lamp</li><li>Lamp Life: Up to 50,000 Hours</li></ul><p><strong>Connectivity</strong></p><ul><li>HDMI</li><li>USB</li><li>AV</li><li>LAN</li><li>3.5mm Audio Jack</li><li>Wi-Fi: Dual Band (2.4GHz / 5GHz)</li></ul><p><strong>Power</strong></p><ul><li>Operating Power: 165W ± 5W</li><li>Standby Power: 1W</li></ul><p><strong>Warranty</strong></p><ul><li>1 Year Service Warranty</li></ul>', 'PROJECTOR', 27500.00, 27000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/J9CW4eAaOjPT2Y8egaEaDmDzGVywg6wiXjaG28Vy.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 12:09:40', '2026-06-17 12:09:40', 'Cheerlux C58 Android Multimedia Projector 6000 Lumens Full HD 1080p | Smart Home Projector', 'Buy Cheerlux C58 Android Multimedia Projector with 6000 lumens brightness, Full HD 1080p resolution, Android 9 OS, Auto Focus, and 4D Keystone. Perfect for home, office, and entertainment use.', 'Cheerlux C58 projector, Android multimedia projector, 6000 lumens projector, Full HD 1080p projector, smart projector Bangladesh, home theater projector, Auto Focus projector, 4D keystone projector, WiFi Android projector', NULL, 269, NULL, NULL),
(740, 'Cheerlux Projector C16 4000 Lumens Full HD Android Multimedia', 'The Cheerlux C16 Android Multimedia Projector delivers Full HD 1080p resolution with 4000 lumens brightness for clear and vibrant visuals. Powered by Android 9.0, it supports app installation, WiFi connectivity, and multiple input options, making it ideal for home entertainment and presentations.', 'cheerlux-projector-c16-4000-lumens-full-hd-android-multimedia-1781699293', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Cheerlux C16 4000 Lumens Full HD Android Multimedia Projector</strong> is a smart and versatile projection device designed for home, office, and educational use. With a bright <strong>4000-lumen LED light source</strong> and <strong>Full HD 1080p resolution (1920 × 1080)</strong>, it delivers sharp, colorful, and detailed images even in moderately lit environments.</p><p>Running on <strong>Android 9.0 OS</strong>, the projector allows users to install apps directly, providing access to streaming platforms and online content without external devices. Its <strong>2500:1 contrast ratio</strong> ensures deeper blacks and brighter whites for a more immersive viewing experience.</p><p>The projector supports an optimal projection distance of <strong>1.5 to 4.5 meters</strong>, producing screen sizes from <strong>50 to 170 inches</strong>, making it suitable for both small and large spaces. Built-in <strong>WiFi screen mirroring</strong> enables easy wireless casting from smartphones, tablets, and laptops.</p><p>Connectivity is highly flexible with <strong>HDMI, USB, AV, and 3.5mm audio ports</strong>, ensuring compatibility with a wide range of devices including gaming consoles and media players. The LED lamp offers a long lifespan of up to <strong>50,000 hours</strong>, ensuring years of reliable usage.</p><p>With a modern design, intuitive controls, and eye-friendly LED projection, the Cheerlux C16 is perfect for movies, gaming, business presentations, and educational purposes.</p>', '<p><strong>Display &amp; Projection</strong></p><ul><li>Display Type: LCD</li><li>Resolution: Full HD (1920 × 1080)</li><li>Brightness: 4000 Lumens</li><li>Projection Distance: 1.5 – 4.5 m</li><li>Image Size: 50 – 170 inch</li><li>Aspect Ratio: 16:9 / 4:3</li><li>Contrast Ratio: 2500:1</li></ul><p><strong>Lamp</strong></p><ul><li>Type: LED</li><li>Lamp Life: 50,000 Hours</li></ul><p><strong>Audio</strong></p><ul><li>Built-in Speaker: Yes</li></ul><p><strong>Physical</strong></p><ul><li>Color: White</li></ul><p><strong>Warranty</strong></p><ul><li>1 Year Service Warranty</li></ul>', 'PROJECTOR', 23800.00, 23800.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/Mff3VE8CsSCnlWV8qepdGjjBKr7UL3eBeiOocO0K.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-17 12:28:13', '2026-06-17 12:28:13', 'Cheerlux C16 Android Full HD Projector 4000 Lumens WiFi Smart LED Projector', 'Buy Cheerlux C16 Android Multimedia Projector with 4000 lumens brightness, Full HD 1080p resolution, Android 9.0 OS, WiFi support, and multiple connectivity options. Perfect for home and office use.', 'Cheerlux C16 projector, Android Full HD projector, 4000 lumens projector, smart WiFi projector Bangladesh, LED home projector, 1080p multimedia projector, Cheerlux Android projector, home theater projector, portable projector Android', NULL, 269, NULL, NULL),
(741, 'Cheerlux Projector CL770 4000 Lumens Full HD With Built-In TV Card Multimedia', 'The Cheerlux CL770 Multimedia Projector offers Full HD 1080p resolution, 4000 lumens brightness, and a built-in TV card for direct television viewing. With multiple projection modes and long lamp life, it is ideal for home cinema and entertainment use.', 'cheerlux-projector-cl770-4000-lumens-full-hd-with-built-in-tv-card-multimedia-1781699908', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Cheerlux CL770 4000 Lumens Full HD Multimedia Projector</strong> is a feature-rich entertainment device designed for home, office, and multimedia use. Equipped with a <strong>built-in TV card</strong>, it allows users to watch television channels directly without requiring external devices.</p><p>It delivers a sharp and detailed viewing experience with <strong>Full HD 1920 × 1080P native resolution</strong> and <strong>4000 lumens brightness</strong>, ensuring clear visuals even in moderately lit environments. The <strong>2500:1 contrast ratio</strong> enhances image depth, producing richer blacks and brighter highlights.</p><p>With a flexible <strong>projection distance of 2 to 5 meters</strong> and a display size range of <strong>50 to 120 inches</strong>, the CL770 adapts easily to different room sizes. It also supports multiple installation modes, including <strong>front, rear, ceiling, and tabletop projection</strong>, making it highly versatile.</p><p>The built-in <strong>speaker system</strong> delivers clear audio output, while support for <strong>3D and DVD playback</strong> enhances entertainment options. The projector’s <strong>LED lamp offers up to 50,000 hours of lifespan</strong>, ensuring long-term reliability.</p><p>Designed with a compact and practical body, the Cheerlux CL770 is suitable for movies, TV viewing, gaming, and presentations, making it a complete multimedia solution.</p>', '<p><strong>Display &amp; Projection</strong></p><ul><li>Display Type: LCD Panel + LED Lamp</li><li>Native Res