(742, 'Cheerlux Projector C26A 3200 Lumens LCD Multimedia', 'The Cheerlux C26A Multimedia Projector delivers Full HD 1080p resolution with 3200 lumens brightness for sharp and vibrant visuals. Powered by Android 9.0 with built-in WiFi and Bluetooth, it offers auto-focus, keystone correction, and multiple connectivity options for home, education, and business use.', 'cheerlux-projector-c26a-3200-lumens-lcd-multimedia-1781700409', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Cheerlux C26A 3200 Lumens LCD Multimedia Projector</strong> is a smart and versatile projection solution designed for home entertainment, classrooms, and professional presentations. Featuring a <strong>native Full HD 1920 × 1080P resolution</strong> and <strong>3200 lumens brightness</strong>, it produces clear, detailed, and colorful visuals even in moderately lit environments.</p><p>Running on <strong>Android 9.0 OS</strong>, the projector allows direct access to streaming apps, games, and online content without requiring external devices. Built-in <strong>WiFi and Bluetooth connectivity</strong> ensure smooth wireless streaming and device pairing.</p><p>With <strong>auto-focus and automatic keystone correction</strong>, setup is quick and effortless, delivering perfectly aligned images in seconds. The projector supports multiple input options including <strong>HDMI, USB, AV, and RJ45</strong>, making it compatible with laptops, gaming consoles, TV boxes, and more.</p><p>Its compact and lightweight design (around 1.8 kg) makes it highly portable and easy to install in different environments. The LCD display technology ensures accurate color reproduction and long-lasting performance, making it suitable for movies, business presentations, and educational use.</p><p>Whether for home cinema, office meetings, or classroom learning, the Cheerlux C26A offers smart functionality, strong brightness, and reliable performance in a modern design.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Display &amp; Projection</strong></p><ul><li>D