(743, 'Cheerlux Projector C50 3800 Lumens Wi-Fi Mini LED', 'The Cheerlux C50 Wi-Fi Mini LED Projector offers Full HD 1080p native resolution with 3800 lumens brightness and 4K support. With wireless screen mirroring, Bluetooth 5.0, and digital keystone correction, it delivers a flexible and immersive home entertainment experience.', 'cheerlux-projector-c50-3800-lumens-wi-fi-mini-led-1781703436', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Cheerlux C50 3800 Lumens Wi-Fi Mini LED Projector</strong> is a compact yet powerful home entertainment device designed for movies, gaming, and multimedia use. With a <strong>native Full HD 1080p resolution</strong> and support for <strong>up to 4K input</strong>, it delivers sharp, vibrant, and detailed visuals suitable for modern viewing needs.</p><p>Its <strong>3800 lumens brightness</strong> ensures clear projection with rich colors, making it ideal for indoor environments. The projector supports <strong>wireless screen mirroring</strong>, allowing users to easily connect smartphones and other devices over the same Wi-Fi network. It also supports <strong>5GHz Wi-Fi connectivity</strong>, providing faster and more stable streaming performance.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>Bluetooth 5.0</strong>, the Cheerlux C50 allows seamless pairing with external speakers or headphones for enhanced audio output. It can also function as a <strong>Bluetooth speaker receiver</strong>, adding extra versatility to your entertainment setup.</p><p>The <strong>digital keystone correction</strong> feature ensures perfectly aligned images even when the projector is placed at different angles, making installation simple and flexible. Its mini and portable design makes it easy to carry and set up anywhere.</p><p>Overall, the Cheerlux C50 is a smart, compact, and feature-rich projector ideal for home cinema, streaming, and casual gaming.</p>', '<p><strong>Display &amp; Projection</strong></p><ul><li>Display Type: LCD</li><li>Resolution: Full HD (1920 × 1080)</li><li>Brig