(744, 'Cheerlux Projector C55 4000 Lumens Wi-Fi LED', 'The Cheerlux C55 Wi-Fi LED Projector delivers Full HD 1080p resolution with 4000 lumens brightness for clear and vibrant visuals. Powered by Android 9.0 with built-in apps, dual-band WiFi, and Bluetooth support, it is perfect for home entertainment, gaming, and streaming.', 'cheerlux-projector-c55-4000-lumens-wi-fi-led-1781703714', '<p>The <strong>Cheerlux C55 4000 Lumens Wi-Fi LED Projector</strong> is a smart and versatile entertainment device designed for home cinema, gaming, and multimedia use. With its <strong>native Full HD 1920 × 1080 resolution</strong> and bright <strong>4000 lumens LED output</strong>, it produces sharp, colorful, and immersive visuals suitable for both dark and moderately lit environments.</p><p>Powered by <strong>Android 9.0 OS</strong>, the projector functions as a standalone smart device, allowing users to install and stream apps like YouTube, Netflix, and more directly without external devices. Its <strong>dual-band WiFi (2.4G/5G)</strong> ensures smooth and stable wireless streaming and screen mirroring from smartphones and tablets.</p><p>The <strong>LED lamp technology</strong> offers a long lifespan of up to <strong>50,000 hours</strong>, ensuring durability and low maintenance. The projector supports multiple connectivity options including <strong>HDMI, USB, AV, and 3.5mm audio jack</strong>, making it compatible with laptops, gaming consoles, and external speakers.</p><p>With <strong>4-point keystone correction</strong> and manual focus adjustment, users can easily achieve a properly aligned and sharp image from different angles. A built-in speaker provides basic audio output, while Bluetooth support allows connection to external sound systems for a more immersive experience.</p><p>Compact, portable, and feature-rich, the Cheerlux C55 is ideal for both indoor and outdoor entertainment setups.</p>', '<p><strong>Display &amp; Projection</strong></p><ul><li>Display Type: LCD</li