(745, 'Cheerlux  Projector C50B 3800 Lumens Wi-Fi LED', 'The Cheerlux C50B Wi-Fi LED Projector delivers Full HD 1080p resolution with 3800 lumens brightness for clear and vibrant visuals. With Android OS, WiFi, Bluetooth 5.0, and multiple connectivity options, it is perfect for home cinema, office presentations, and classroom use.', 'cheerlux-projector-c50b-3800-lumens-wi-fi-led-1781704527', '<p>The <strong>Cheerlux C50B 3800 Lumens Wi-Fi LED Projector</strong> is a powerful and versatile multimedia device designed for home entertainment, education, and professional presentations. With its <strong>Full HD 1920 × 1080p native resolution</strong> and bright <strong>3800 lumens LED lamp</strong>, it produces sharp, vivid, and detailed images even in moderately lit environments.</p><p>Running on <strong>Android OS</strong>, the projector allows direct access to apps, streaming platforms, and online content without requiring external devices. Built-in <strong>WiFi and Bluetooth 5.0</strong> enable seamless wireless screen mirroring and audio connectivity, offering a smart TV-like experience.</p><p>The projector supports multiple input options including <strong>dual HDMI, dual USB, AV, and audio ports</strong>, ensuring compatibility with laptops, gaming consoles, and media players. A built-in <strong>4Ω 3W speaker</strong> provides decent audio output, while external speakers can be connected for enhanced sound performance.</p><p>With a <strong>contrast ratio of 2500:1</strong>, the C50B delivers deeper blacks and more vibrant colors, improving overall picture quality. Its LED lamp offers an impressive lifespan of up to <strong>50,000 hours</strong>, ensuring long-term reliability and reduced maintenance.</p><p>Compact and lightweight at <strong>1.95 kg</strong>, the Cheerlux C50B is easy to carry and install in different environments, making it suitable for movies, business presentations, and classroom teaching.</p>', '<p><strong>Display &amp; Projection</strong></p><ul