(746, 'Cheerlux C9 2800 Lumens Android Wi-Fi Mini LED', 'The Cheerlux C9 Android Wi-Fi Mini LED Projector offers 2800 lumens brightness with 720P native resolution and 1080P support. With built-in TV card, multiple projection modes, and long lamp life, it is ideal for home cinema and everyday multimedia use.', 'cheerlux-c9-2800-lumens-android-wi-fi-mini-led-1781708767', '<p>The <strong>Cheerlux C9 2800 Lumens Android Wi-Fi Mini LED Projector</strong> is a compact and versatile home entertainment device designed for movies, presentations, and casual gaming. It features a <strong>native 720P resolution with support for 1080P content</strong>, delivering clear and detailed visuals for everyday viewing needs.</p><p>With <strong>2800 lumens brightness</strong> and a <strong>2000:1 contrast ratio</strong>, the projector provides decent image clarity and vibrant colors in indoor environments. Its projection size ranges from <strong>50 to 120 inches</strong>, with an optimal projection distance of <strong>1 to 3 meters</strong>, making it suitable for small to medium rooms.</p><p>The projector supports multiple installation methods, including <strong>front, rear, ceiling mount, and tabletop projection</strong>, offering flexible setup options. Manual focus adjustment and <strong>trapezoidal (keystone) correction up to ±20°</strong> ensure a properly aligned and clear display.</p><p>Equipped with a <strong>built-in speaker</strong>, the Cheerlux C9 delivers convenient audio output without requiring external speakers. The LED lamp offers an impressive lifespan of up to <strong>50,000 hours</strong>, ensuring long-term durability and eye-friendly viewing.</p><p>With its compact design and user-friendly functionality, the Cheerlux C9 is an excellent choice for home theater, educational use, and portable entertainment.</p>', '<p><strong>Display &amp; Projection</strong></p><ul><li>Display Type: LCD</li><li>Native Resolution: 1280 × 720 (HD)</li><li>Resolution Support: 1080P</li>