(747, 'Cheerlux Projector C8 1800 Lumens Wi-Fi Mini LED', 'The Cheerlux C8 1800 Lumens Wi-Fi Mini LED Projector is a compact home entertainment solution featuring native HD 1280 × 720 resolution with Full HD 1080P support. Equipped with built-in Wi-Fi, 1800 lumens brightness, a 2000:1 contrast ratio, and a projection size of 50–100 inches, it delivers clear and immersive visuals. The projector includes keystone correction, manual focus adjustment, 360° image flip, and multiple connectivity options including HDMI, USB, VGA, AV, and 3.5mm audio output. Its LED lamp offers up to 50,000 hours of lifespan, making it ideal for movies, gaming, and presentations.', 'cheerlux-projector-c8-1800-lumens-wi-fi-mini-led-1781759685', '<p>The Cheerlux C8 1800 Lumens Wi-Fi Mini LED Projector is designed to provide an enjoyable big-screen viewing experience in a compact and portable form factor. Featuring a native resolution of 1280 × 720 pixels and support for Full HD 1080P content, it delivers sharp images with vibrant colors and enhanced clarity.</p><p>With a brightness level of 1800 lumens and a 2000:1 contrast ratio, the projector produces clear visuals suitable for home theaters, entertainment rooms, classrooms, and office presentations. Its projection distance ranges from 1 to 3 meters, allowing users to create a screen size between 50 and 100 inches.</p><p>The built-in Wi-Fi functionality enables wireless connectivity, making it easy to stream content from compatible devices. Advanced features such as manual focus adjustment, keystone correction, horizontal and vertical image flip, image zoom, and 360-degree projection rotation help achieve the perfect viewing angle and image alignment.</p><p>For multimedia compatibility, the Cheerlux C8 supports a wide range of picture, video, and audio formats, ensuring smooth playback from USB drives and external devices. The built-in 2W speaker provides clear audio output, while the low-noise design keeps operating sound below 32dB for a quieter viewing experience.</p><p>Connectivity options include HDMI, USB, VGA, AV input, and a 3.5mm audio output, making the projector compatible with laptops, PCs, gaming consoles, TV boxes, DVD players, and other multimedia devices. Powered by a durable LED lamp with up to 50,000 hours of lifespan, the Cheerlux C8 offers long-term reliability and low maintenance.</p><p>Certified by CE, FCC, ROHS, and SAA standards, the projector ensures safety and quality performance. It comes with a 1-year service warranty for added peace of mind.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>LCD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>1280 × 720 (HD)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Supported Resolution</td><td>Full HD 1080P</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>1800 Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>1 – 3 m</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>2000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>50 – 100 Inch</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Picture Formats</td><td>JPG, PNG, BMP</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Video Formats</td><td>DAT, TS, MP4, MPG, MPEG, AVI, MKV, MOV, WMV, ASF, FLV, 3GP, 3GPP, TP, TRP</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Up to 50,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Audio Formats</td><td>AVI, TS, DAT, VOB, WAV, MKV, MP3, MP4, M4A</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interfaces</td><td>HDMI, USB, VGA, AV, 3.5mm Audio Out</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Input Voltage</td><td>AC 90-240V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Information</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>1.4 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>197 × 152 × 72 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>1 Year Service Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 9000.00, 9000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/yemwoRQMNLrXFlpC6VMNS0nCISqNPiRtZSCEIoRD.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-18 05:14:45', '2026-06-18 05:14:45', 'Cheerlux C8 1800 Lumens Wi-Fi Mini LED Projector Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy the Cheerlux C8 1800 Lumens Wi-Fi Mini LED Projector with native HD 720P resolution, 1080P support, built-in Wi-Fi, 50-100 inch projection size, 2000:1 contrast ratio, HDMI/USB/VGA connectivity, and up to 50,000 hours LED lamp life. Ideal for home entertainment and presentations.', 'Cheerlux C8 Projector, Cheerlux C8 WiFi Projector, Cheerlux C8 Mini LED Projector, 1800 Lumens Projector, HD Projector Bangladesh, WiFi Home Theater Projector, 720P LED Projector, Cheerlux Projector Price BD, Mini Projector with HDMI USB VGA, Portable Projector Bangladesh', NULL, 269, NULL, NULL),
(748, 'Cheerlux Projector C10 2600 Lumens FHD LED WiFi', 'The Cheerlux C10 2600 Lumens FHD LED WiFi Projector delivers bright and immersive visuals with a native 1280 × 720 resolution and Full HD 1080P support. Featuring 2600 lumens brightness, a 1500:1 contrast ratio, built-in 2.4GHz WiFi connectivity, and a projection size of up to 120 inches, it is ideal for home entertainment, presentations, and multimedia use. Equipped with HDMI, USB, AV, and 3.5mm audio ports, the projector ensures seamless connectivity with various devices while its LED lamp provides up to 50,000 hours of lifespan.', 'cheerlux-projector-c10-2600-lumens-fhd-led-wifi-1781759999', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Cheerlux C10 2600 Lumens FHD LED WiFi Projector is designed to provide a versatile and enjoyable big-screen viewing experience for both home entertainment and professional presentations. Powered by advanced LCD projection technology, it delivers clear and vibrant visuals with a native resolution of 1280 × 720 pixels and support for Full HD 1080P content.</p><p>With a brightness rating of 2600 lumens and a 1500:1 contrast ratio, the projector produces sharp images with enhanced detail and color reproduction. It supports projection sizes ranging from 50 to 120 inches and offers flexible installation with a projection distance of 1 to 5 meters. Users can choose between 16:9 and 4:3 aspect ratios to suit different content types and viewing preferences.</p><p>The built-in 2.4GHz WiFi connectivity enables convenient wireless screen sharing and content streaming from compatible devices, reducing the need for additional cables. Multiple connectivity options, including HDMI, USB, AV, and a 3.5mm audio output, ensure compatibility with laptops, desktops, gaming consoles, media players, TV boxes, and other multimedia devices.</p><p>The projector utilizes a durable LED light source with an impressive lifespan of up to 50,000 hours, providing years of reliable operation while minimizing maintenance costs. Constructed from high-quality ABS material, the Cheerlux C10 combines durability with a compact and practical design suitable for various environments.</p><p>Whether you\'re watching movies, streaming content, gaming, or delivering presentations, the Cheerlux C10 offers a cost-effective and dependable projection solution with wireless convenience and large-screen entertainment capabilities.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>LCD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>Full HD 1080p</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>2600 Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>1m – 5m</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9 / 4:3</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1500:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>50 – 120 Inches</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Video Formats</td><td>DAT, TS, MP4, MPG, MPEG, AVI, MKV, MOV, WMV, ASF, FLV, 3GP, 3GPP, TP, TRP</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Up to 50,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Audio Formats</td><td>AVI, TS, DAT, VOB, WAV, MKV, MP3, MP4, M4A</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interfaces</td><td>HDMI, USB, AV, 3.5mm Audio</td></tr><tr><td><strong>External Features</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 9500.00, 9500.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/wTzetkxIhJLbKXwMJUXjxrRfaKl8wJIzKiYHidUU.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-18 05:19:59', '2026-06-18 05:19:59', 'Cheerlux C10 2600 Lumens FHD LED WiFi Projector Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy the Cheerlux C10 2600 Lumens FHD LED WiFi Projector featuring native 1280×720 resolution, 1080P support, 2600 lumens brightness, built-in WiFi, 50-120 inch projection size, HDMI/USB/AV connectivity, and a long-lasting 50,000-hour LED lamp. Perfect for home entertainment and presentations.', 'Cheerlux C10 Projector, Cheerlux C10 WiFi Projector, Cheerlux C10 FHD Projector, 2600 Lumens Projector, LED WiFi Projector Bangladesh, HD Projector Price BD, Home Theater Projector, Wireless Projector, Portable LED Projector, Cheerlux Projector Bangladesh', NULL, 269, NULL, NULL),
(749, 'Cheerlux Projector C9 2800 Lumens Mini Built-in TV Card', 'The Cheerlux C9 2800 Lumens Mini Projector with Built-in TV Card delivers an immersive home entertainment experience with native 720P resolution and Full HD 1080P support. Featuring 2800 lumens brightness, a 2000:1 contrast ratio, and a projection size of up to 120 inches, it provides clear and vibrant visuals for movies, gaming, and presentations. With manual focus adjustment, trapezoidal correction, built-in speakers, and a long-lasting 50,000-hour LED lamp, the projector offers convenient operation and reliable performance for everyday use.', 'cheerlux-projector-c9-2800-lumens-mini-built-in-tv-card-1781760383', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Cheerlux C9 2800 Lumens Mini Projector with Built-in TV Card is designed to bring big-screen entertainment to your home in a compact and user-friendly package. Equipped with a native 720P (1280 × 720) resolution and support for Full HD 1080P content, it delivers sharp and detailed visuals suitable for movies, TV shows, gaming, and presentations.</p><p>With a brightness level of 2800 lumens and a 2000:1 contrast ratio, the projector produces vibrant images with enhanced color depth and clarity. It supports projection sizes ranging from 50 to 120 inches and operates effectively at projection distances between 1 and 3 meters, making it ideal for bedrooms, living rooms, classrooms, and office environments.</p><p>The built-in TV card expands entertainment options, allowing users to enjoy television content directly through the projector. Manual focus adjustment enables precise image tuning, while manual trapezoidal (keystone) correction with ±20° flexibility helps achieve a properly aligned image even when the projector is placed at an angle.</p><p>Designed for versatile installation, the Cheerlux C9 supports multiple projection methods, including front projection, rear projection, ceiling mounting, and tabletop placement. The integrated speaker provides convenient audio output, eliminating the need for external speakers in many situations.</p><p>Its energy-efficient LED lamp offers an impressive lifespan of up to 50,000 hours, ensuring years of reliable operation while reducing maintenance costs. The eye-friendly LED light source delivers comfortable viewing for extended periods, making it a practical choice for home entertainment and professional presentations alike.</p><p>Backed by a 1-year service warranty, the Cheerlux C9 is a dependable projector that combines performance, flexibility, and affordability.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>LCD Panel + LED Lamp</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Resolution</td><td>Native 720P (1280 × 720), Supports 1080P</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>2800 Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>1 – 3 m</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>2000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>50 – 120 Inches</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Picture Formats</td><td>JPG, PNG, BMP</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Video Formats</td><td>DAT, TS, MP4, MPG, MPEG, AVI, MKV, MOV, WMV, ASF, FLV, 3GP, 3GPP, TP, TRP</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Type</td><td>LED Lamp</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Up to 50,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Audio Formats</td><td>AVI, TS, DAT, VOB, WAV, MKV, MP3, MP4, M4A</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI</td><td>2 × HDMI Ports</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB</td><td>2 × USB Ports</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>VGA</td><td>1 × VGA (PC) Port</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>AV Input</td><td>Composite AV</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>3.5mm Headphone Jack</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Input Voltage</td><td>AC 90-240V, 50-60Hz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Information</strong></td><td>Weight</td><td>1.5 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>222 × 165 × 87 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Warranty Type</td><td>1 Year Service Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 15500.00, 15500.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/q8SwcKhwmMxMZ6YZCykErhZiG3jGiqiYERyYw9AM.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-18 05:26:23', '2026-06-22 15:07:19', 'Cheerlux C9 2800 Lumens Mini Projector with Built-in TV Card Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy the Cheerlux C9 2800 Lumens Mini Projector with Built-in TV Card featuring native 720P resolution, Full HD 1080P support, 2800 lumens brightness, 2000:1 contrast ratio, 50-120 inch display size, manual keystone correction, built-in speaker, and a 50,000-hour LED lamp. Ideal for home entertainment and presentations.', 'Cheerlux C9 Projector, Cheerlux C9 Mini Projector, 2800 Lumens Projector, Built-in TV Card Projector, HD Projector Bangladesh, 720P Projector, 1080P Supported Projector, Home Theater Projector, LED Mini Projector, Cheerlux Projector Price BD', NULL, 269, NULL, NULL);
