(750, 'Cheerlux Projector C8 2200 Lumens Wi-Fi Mini LED', 'The Cheerlux C8 2200 Lumens Wi-Fi Mini LED Projector is a compact and versatile home entertainment solution featuring native HD 1280 × 720 resolution with Full HD 1080P support. With 2200 lumens brightness, a 2000:1 contrast ratio, built-in Wi-Fi, and an integrated TV card, it delivers clear visuals and convenient multimedia access. The projector supports screen sizes from 50 to 100 inches, offers multiple connectivity options, and features a long-lasting 50,000-hour LED lamp, making it ideal for movies, gaming, presentations, and everyday entertainment.', 'cheerlux-projector-c8-2200-lumens-wi-fi-mini-led-1781760746', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Cheerlux C8 2200 Lumens Wi-Fi Mini LED Projector is designed to bring immersive big-screen entertainment to your home while maintaining a compact and portable design. Equipped with a native HD resolution of 1280 × 720 pixels and support for Full HD 1080P content, it delivers sharp, detailed, and vibrant visuals suitable for movies, TV shows, gaming, and presentations.</p><p>Featuring a brightness level of 2200 lumens and a 2000:1 contrast ratio, the projector provides balanced image quality with enhanced color depth and detail. It supports projection sizes ranging from 50 to 100 inches and offers a projection distance of 1 to 3 meters, making it suitable for bedrooms, living rooms, classrooms, and small meeting spaces.</p><p>The built-in Wi-Fi functionality enables convenient wireless connectivity, allowing users to stream content and connect compatible devices without additional cables. An integrated TV card further enhances entertainment options by providing direct access to television channels.</p><p>Designed for long-term reliability, the projector utilizes an energy-efficient LED light source with a lifespan of up to 50,000 hours, significantly reducing maintenance and replacement costs. It supports a wide range of multimedia formats, including JPG, PNG, BMP image files and MP4, AVI, MKV, MOV, and other popular video formats, ensuring broad compatibility for content playback.</p><p>The built-in speaker delivers convenient audio output for casual viewing, while multiple connectivity options including HDMI, USB, VGA, AV input, and a 3.5mm audio port allow seamless integration with laptops, desktop computers, gaming consoles, media players, TV boxes, and USB storage devices.</p><p>With universal AC 90-240V power compatibility, compact dimensions, and lightweight construction, the Cheerlux C8 is an excellent choice for users seeking a portable projector that combines functionality, performance, and convenience.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>LCD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>1280 × 720 (HD)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Supported Resolution</td><td>Full HD 1080P</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>2200 Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>1 – 3 m</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>2000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>50 – 100 Inches</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Picture Formats</td><td>JPG, PNG, BMP</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Video Formats</td><td>DAT, TS, MP4, MPG, MPEG, AVI, MKV, MOV, WMV, ASF, FLV, 3GP, 3GPP, TP, TRP</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Up to 50,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Audio Formats</td><td>AVI, TS, DAT, VOB, WAV, MKV, MP3, MP4, M4A</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interfaces</td><td>HDMI, USB, VGA, AV, 3.5mm Audio Output</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Input Voltage</td><td>AC 90-240V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Information</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>1.4 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>197 × 152 × 72 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>1 Year Service Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 12000.00, 12000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/bh24IhBy1KDFdBlHIG4k45jeHJ3Fz6cEjSn2aoPw.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-18 05:32:26', '2026-06-18 05:32:26', 'Cheerlux C8 2200 Lumens Wi-Fi Mini LED Projector Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy the Cheerlux C8 2200 Lumens Wi-Fi Mini LED Projector featuring native HD 720P resolution, Full HD 1080P support, 2200 lumens brightness, built-in Wi-Fi, integrated TV card, 50-100 inch projection size, HDMI/USB/VGA connectivity, built-in speaker, and a 50,000-hour LED lamp. Perfect for home entertainment and presentations.', 'Cheerlux C8 Projector, Cheerlux C8 WiFi Projector, 2200 Lumens Projector, Mini LED Projector, HD Projector Bangladesh, 720P Projector, 1080P Supported Projector, Built-in TV Card Projector, Home Theater Projector, Cheerlux Projector Price BD', NULL, 269, NULL, NULL),
(751, 'Cheerlux Projector C8 1800 Lumens Mini LCD', 'The Cheerlux C8 1800 Lumens Mini LCD Projector is a compact home entertainment device designed for movies, gaming, and presentations. It features a native 800 × 480 resolution with support for 1080P content, delivering clear visuals on a 50–120 inch projection size. With 1500 lumens brightness, multiple connectivity options, built-in speaker, and a quiet operation design under 32dB, it ensures a smooth viewing experience. The LED lamp offers up to 20,000 hours of lifespan, making it suitable for regular home use.', 'cheerlux-projector-c8-1800-lumens-mini-lcd-1781761056', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Cheerlux C8 1800 Lumens Mini LCD Projector is designed to bring affordable big-screen entertainment into your home. With LCD projection technology and a native resolution of 800 × 480 pixels, it supports 1080P input to enhance viewing quality for movies, videos, and presentations.</p><p>It delivers 1500 lumens brightness and a 1200:1 contrast ratio, producing decent image clarity in dark environments. The projector supports a screen size ranging from 50 to 120 inches and operates within a projection distance of 1 to 3 meters, making it ideal for bedrooms, small living rooms, and casual viewing setups.</p><p>The Cheerlux C8 includes multiple interface options for versatile connectivity, allowing users to connect laptops, gaming consoles, USB drives, and media players easily. It supports a wide range of multimedia formats including JPG, PNG, BMP for images, MP4, AVI, MKV, MOV, and more for videos, and MP3, AAC, AC3, and other audio formats.</p><p>A built-in speaker provides basic audio output for convenience, while its low-noise design (under 32dB) ensures a quieter viewing experience. The projector uses an LED lamp with a lifespan of up to 20,000 hours, offering reliable performance for everyday entertainment.</p><p>With a 16:9 and 4:3 aspect ratio support, manual focus, and a throw ratio of 1.38:1, it provides flexible setup options. The included remote control (powered by two AAA batteries) adds ease of operation. Backed by a 1-year service warranty, the Cheerlux C8 is a budget-friendly option for home entertainment needs.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>LCD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>1280 × 720 (HD)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Supported Resolution</td><td>Full HD 1080P</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>1800 Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>1 – 3 m</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>2000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>50 – 100 Inches</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Picture Formats</td><td>JPG, PNG, BMP</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Video Formats</td><td>DAT, TS, MP4, MPG, MPEG, AVI, MKV, MOV, WMV, ASF, FLV, 3GP, 3GPP, TP, TRP</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Lamp Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Up to 50,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Audio Formats</td><td>AVI, TS, DAT, VOB, WAV, MKV, MP3, MP4, M4A</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interfaces</td><td>HDMI, USB, VGA, AV, 3.5mm Audio Output</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Input Voltage</td><td>AC 90-240V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Information</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>1.1 kg</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>19.7 × 15.2 × 7.2 cm (7.76 × 5.98 × 2.83 inches)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>1 Year Service Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 9000.00, 9000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/Re8xx3xASfLXXiIq6RhTPu1eZ0TXPw32oI