(752, 'P30 1080P Mini Home 4K Projector Dual WiFi and Bluetooth Portable Projector', 'The P30 1080P Mini Home 4K Projector is a compact and portable smart projector designed for immersive home entertainment. Featuring native Full HD 1080P resolution, 4K video support, dual-band WiFi, and Bluetooth connectivity, it delivers a seamless viewing experience. With wireless screen mirroring, automatic keystone correction, and multiple connectivity options, the P30 projector is perfect for movies, gaming, presentations, and outdoor entertainment.', 'p30-1080p-mini-home-4k-projector-dual-wifi-and-bluetooth-portable-projector-1781794154', '<p>Experience big-screen entertainment anywhere with the Mini Projector 4K 1080P Support Smart Portable Projector. Designed for modern lifestyles, this compact projector combines smart features, wireless connectivity, and flexible installation options to deliver a seamless viewing experience at home or on the go.</p><p>Powered by Android 11, the projector allows direct access to compatible streaming apps and online content without requiring an external media player. Built-in WiFi 6 technology ensures faster and more stable wireless connections, while Bluetooth 5.4 enables easy pairing with speakers, headphones, keyboards, and other Bluetooth-enabled devices.</p><p>The innovative 180-degree rotatable design allows projection onto walls, ceilings, or other surfaces, providing maximum flexibility for comfortable viewing from any position. Automatic horizontal keystone correction helps align images quickly and accurately, ensuring a properly adjusted picture with minimal setup effort.</p><p>Supporting Full HD 1080P video decoding and 4K content playback compatibility, the projector delivers sharp visuals and vibrant colors for movies, TV shows, sports, gaming, and presentations. Wireless screen mirroring support makes it easy to display content directly from smartphones, tablets, and laptops.</p><p>Its lightweight and portable design makes it p