r><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Light Source</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Long-Life LED Technology</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Information</strong></td><td>Portability</td><td>Compact and Lightweight Design</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 8200.00, 8200.00, NULL, 10, 'products/thumbnails/WWtQl6z68xevvGi3LqagZZOAAiA3K8kKL3MgYXOF.png', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-18 14:49:14', '2026-06-22 15:04:56', 'Mini Projector 4K with Android 11, WiFi 6 & Bluetooth 5.4 Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy the Mini Projector 4K with 1080P support featuring Android 11, WiFi 6, Bluetooth 5.4, auto keystone correction, and a 180° rotatable design. Compatible with smartphones, laptops, and gaming consoles, making it perfect for home entertainment and outdoor movie nights.', 'Mini Projector 4K, Smart Projector Android 11, WiFi 6 Projector, Bluetooth 5.4 Projector, Portable Projector Bangladesh, Outdoor Movie Projector, 1080P Support Projector, Rotatable Projector, Wireless Projector, Android Projector BD', NULL, 310, NULL, NULL),
(753, 'Magcubic Projector L018 650 ANSI Android 14 Portable', '* 650 ANSI Lumens High Brightness\r\n* Native Full HD 1080P Resolution\r\n* Supports 4K Video Decoding\r\n* Android 14 Smart Operating System\r\n* Wi-Fi 6 Dual-Band & Bluetooth 5.4\r\n* Auto Keystone Correction & Auto Focus\r\n* 20,000:1 High Dynamic Contrast Ratio\r\n* Built-in Hi-Fi Stereo Speakers\r\n* HDMI, USB & Audio Connectivity\r\n* LED Light Source with Up to 50,000 Hours Lifespan', 'magcubic-projector-l018-650-ansi-android-14-portable-1781930823', '<p>The Magcubic L018 650 ANSI Android 14 Portable Projector is a powerful smart projector designed for home entertainment, office presentations, and multimedia streaming. Featuring an impressive 650 ANSI lumens brightness, it delivers bright, vivid, and clear images even in moderately lit environments.</p><p>Equipped with a native Full HD 1080P (1920 × 1080) resolution and support for 4K video decoding, the projector ensures sharp visuals, detailed imagery, and smooth playback for movies, games, and presentations. Its 20,000:1 high dynamic contrast ratio enhances image depth by producing richer blacks and brighter highlights for a more immersive viewing experience.</p><p>Running on the latest Android 14 operating system, the Magcubic L018 allows users to access streaming apps directly without requiring external devices. With built-in Wi-Fi 6 dual-band connectivity and Bluetooth 5.4 support, users can enjoy faster wireless streaming, seamless screen mirroring, and easy connection to speakers, headphones, and other compatible devices.</p><p>The projector comes with intelligent auto keystone correction and auto/manual focus adjustment, enabling quick setup and perfectly aligned projections in various environments. Integrated Hi-Fi stereo speakers deliver clear and balanced sound, reducing the need for external audio systems for everyday use.</p><p>Built with advanced LED technology, the Magcubic L018 offers an extended lamp life of up to 50,000 hours, ensuring long-term reliability and low maintenance costs. Multiple connectivity options, including HDMI, USB, and Audio ports, provide excellent compatibility with laptops, gaming consoles, TV boxes, and media players.</p><p>Whether you\'re creating a home theater, conducting business presentations, or enjoying outdoor movie nights, the Magcubic L018 Android Portable Projector delivers exceptional performance, smart features, and outstanding value.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>LCD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>1080P (Full HD)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Supported Video Decoding</td><td>Up to 4K</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>650 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>20,000:1 High Dynamic Contrast</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Light Source</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Up to 50,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>Hi-Fi Stereo Speaker</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Port</td><td>1 × HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB Port</td><td>1 × USB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Output</td><td>1 × Audio Port</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Bluetooth 5.4</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Wi-Fi</td><td>Wi-Fi 6 Dual-Band (2.4GHz / 5GHz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Input Voltage</td><td>110V – 220V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>External Features</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 15000.00, 15000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/vEn7faK3KmPtjtOxpNzJwT02xF2ym6AZwnhlwZKQ.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-20 04:47:03', 