(754, 'Magcubic Projector HY320 Pro 400 ANSI FHD Android Portable', 'Native 1080P Full HD LED projector with 400 ANSI lumens brightness, 8K video decoding support, Wi-Fi 6, Bluetooth 5.4, auto/manual keystone correction, built-in 5W speaker, and projection sizes up to 135 inches. Perfect for home entertainment, gaming, and presentations.', 'magcubic-projector-hy320-pro-400-ansi-fhd-android-portable-1781931569', '<p>Enjoy an immersive big-screen experience with this advanced Smart LED Projector, designed for home entertainment, gaming, online streaming, and business presentations. Featuring a native Full HD 1080P resolution and support for up to 8K video decoding, it delivers sharp details, vibrant colors, and smooth video playback for an enhanced viewing experience.</p><p>With 400 ANSI lumens brightness, the projector produces clear and vivid images in dark and moderately lit environments. Its 16:9 aspect ratio and 2000:1 contrast ratio help create balanced colors and improved image depth, making movies, sports, and presentations more engaging.</p><p>The projector supports projection sizes ranging from 35 to 135 inches and offers a projection distance of 0.6 to 2.5 meters, allowing users to enjoy a large-screen experience even in compact spaces. Built-in Auto and Manual Keystone Correction ensures accurate image alignment and quick setup on different surfaces.</p><p>Equipped with WiFi 6 technology, the projector provides faster and more stable wireless connectivity for streaming content and screen mirroring from compatible devices. Bluetooth 5.4 support allows seamless pairing with wireless speakers, headphones, and other Bluetooth-enabled accessories.</p><p>For audio performance, the projector includes a built-in 5W speaker that delivers clear sound for everyday entertainment without requiring external speakers. Multiple connectivity options, including HDMI, USB, and Audio ports, ensure compatibility with laptops, gaming consoles, TV boxes, smartphones, and media players.</p><p>Built with energy-efficient LED technology, this projector offers reliable performance, low power consumption, and long-lasting durability. Its compact design and smart wireless features make it an excellent choice for home theaters, classrooms, offices, and outdoor movie nights.</p><h3>Key Features:</h3><ul><li>Native Full HD 1080P Resolution</li><li>Supports Up to 8K Video Decoding</li><li>400 ANSI Lumens Brightness</li><li>WiFi 6 Wireless Connectivity</li><li>Bluetooth 5.4 Support</li><li>Auto &amp; Manual Keystone Correction</li><li>Built-in 5W Speaker</li><li>35-135 Inch Projection Size</li><li>HDMI, USB &amp; Audio Connectivity</li><li>Compact and Portable Design</li></ul>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>1080P Full HD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Supported Video Decoding</td><td>Up to 8K</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>400 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Distance</td><td>0.6 – 2.5 M</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>2000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>35 – 135 Inches</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Keystone Correction</td><td>Auto &amp; Manual Correction</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>5W Speaker</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Port</td><td>1 × HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB Port</td><td>1 × USB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Port</td><td>1 × Audio Output</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Wi-Fi</td><td>Wi-Fi 6</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Bluetooth 5.4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Input Power</td><td>High Voltage (50-1000V DC, 75-1000V AC)</td></tr><tr><td><stro