(755, 'Magcubic Projector HY450 Max 1100 ANSI Android 14 Portable', 'Experience stunning Full HD entertainment with this smart LCD projector featuring native 1080P resolution, 1100 ANSI lumens brightness, 8K video decoding support, dual 12W HiFi stereo speakers, WiFi 6 dual-band connectivity, Bluetooth 5.4, and a long-lasting LED light source for home theater, gaming, and business presentations.', 'magcubic-projector-hy450-max-1100-ansi-android-14-portable-1781932124', '<p>Upgrade your home entertainment and presentation experience with this high-performance Smart LCD Projector. Featuring a native Full HD 1080P resolution and support for up to 8K video decoding, it delivers exceptional image clarity, vibrant colors, and smooth video playback for movies, gaming, streaming, and professional presentations.</p><p>With an impressive brightness of 1100 ANSI lumens, the projector produces bright and detailed visuals even in rooms with moderate ambient lighting. The advanced LCD display technology enhances color accuracy and image quality, ensuring a more immersive viewing experience for both entertainment and business applications.</p><p>Powered by a durable LED light source, this projector offers reliable performance and long-lasting operation while maintaining energy efficiency. The native 1080P resolution ensures sharp text, crisp graphics, and clear video content, making it suitable for home theaters, classrooms, offices, and conference rooms.</p><p>For superior sound performance, the projector is equipped with dual 12W HiFi stereo speakers that deliver powerful, rich, and balanced audio. Whether you\'re watching movies, listening to music, or presenting content, the built-in speaker system provides an enjoyable audio experience without requiring external speakers.</p><p>The projector features the latest WiFi 6 dual-band connectivity (2.4GHz and 5GHz), enabling faster wireless streaming, smoother screen mirroring, and more stable network performance. Bluetooth 5.4 supp