(756, 'Magcubic Projector X7 1000 ANSI Android 14 Home Theater', 'Experience sharp and vibrant visuals with this 1080P native LCD projector featuring 1000 ANSI lumens brightness, 10,000:1 high contrast ratio, 8K video decoding support, WiFi 6 dual-band connectivity, Bluetooth 5.4, and a built-in 5W HiFi speaker—perfect for home entertainment, gaming, and presentations.', 'magcubic-projector-x7-1000-ansi-android-14-home-theater-1781933216', '<p>Enjoy a premium big-screen experience with this powerful Smart LCD Projector designed for home entertainment, gaming, streaming, and professional presentations. Featuring a native Full HD 1080P resolution with support for up to 8K video decoding, it delivers sharp details, vibrant colors, and smooth video playback for an immersive viewing experience.</p><p>With 1000 ANSI lumens brightness and a 10,000:1 high contrast ratio, this projector ensures clear and vivid visuals even in moderately lit environments. The enhanced contrast improves image depth by producing richer blacks and brighter highlights, making movies, sports, and games more engaging and realistic.</p><p>The projector supports an image size ranging from 40 to 130 inches (recommended), allowing users to enjoy a cinematic experience in bedrooms, living rooms, offices, or small conference spaces. Its compact design and flexible projection capability make it suitable for both indoor and portable use.</p><p>Built with energy-efficient LED technology, the projector offers long-lasting performance and reliable operation while maintaining low power consumption. The native 1080P resolution ensures crisp text, detailed graphics, and smooth video output for both entertainment and productivity needs.</p><p>For audio performance, the projector includes a built-in 5W HiFi speaker that delivers clear and balanced sound for everyday viewing. It is suitable for movies, presentations, and casual music playback without requiring external speakers.</p><p>Modern connectivity is ensured with WiFi 6 dual-band support (2.4GHz and 5GHz), offering faster wireless streaming, smoother screen mirroring, and stable internet performance. Bluetooth 5.4 enables seamless connection with wireless speakers, headphones, keyboards, and other smart devices for a flexible multimedia experience.</p><p>Multiple connectivity options, including HDMI, USB, and power input, allow easy connection with laptops, gaming consoles, TV boxes, USB drives, and other multimedia devices. The projector supports universal 110V–220V input, making it suitable for various locations and setups.</p><p>Combining high brightness, advanced wireless features, and native Full HD clarity, this projector is an excellent choice for home theaters, gaming setups, classrooms, offices, and entertainment spaces.</p><h3>Key Features:</h3><ul><li>Native Full HD 1080P Resolution</li><li>Supports Up to 8K Video Decoding</li><li>1000 ANSI Lumens Brightness</li><li>10,000:1 High Contrast Ratio</li><li>40–130 Inch Projection Size</li><li>WiFi 6 Dual-Band Connectivity</li><li>Bluetooth 5.4 Support</li><li>Built-in 5W HiFi Speaker</li><li>HDMI &amp; USB Connectivity</li><li>Energy-Efficient LED Light Source</li></ul>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>LCD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>1080P Full HD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Supported Video Decoding</td><td>Up to 8K</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>1000 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>10,000:1 High Contrast</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>40 – 130 Inches (Recommended)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Light Source</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>5W HiFi Speaker</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Port</td