(757, 'Magcubic Projector HY350Max 900 ANSI Android 14 Portable', '* 900 ANSI Lumens High Brightness\r\n* Native Full HD 1080P Resolution (1920×1080)\r\n* Supports Up to 8K Video Decoding\r\n* Smooth 60Hz Refresh Rate\r\n* Android 14 Smart OS Built-in\r\n* WiFi 6 Dual-Band & Bluetooth 5.4\r\n* Auto Focus & Auto Keystone Correction\r\n* Auto Screen Fit & Obstacle Avoidance\r\n* Powerful 15W HiFi Stereo Speakers\r\n* Up to 130-Inch Large Screen Projection', 'magcubic-projector-hy350max-900-ansi-android-14-portable-1781933716', '<p>The Magcubic HY350Max 900 ANSI Android 14 Portable Projector is a powerful smart projector designed for home cinema, gaming, streaming, and professional presentations. With native Full HD 1920×1080 resolution and advanced 8K decoding support, it delivers sharp details, vibrant colors, and smooth visual performance across all types of content.</p><p>Equipped with a 60Hz refresh rate, the projector ensures fluid motion handling, making it ideal for movies, sports, and gaming. With a projection size of up to 130 inches, it transforms any room into a cinematic environment, delivering an immersive big-screen experience.</p><p>Powered by the Allwinner H726 processor with a quad-core ARM Cortex-A53 CPU and Mali-G31 GPU, the device runs Android 14 smoothly. Users can directly access streaming apps, online content, and smart features without needing external devices.</p><p>With 900 ANSI lumens brightness and an optimized optical system, the projector ensures clear and comfortable viewing while reducing noise by up to 60% compared to conventional models, providing a quieter and more enjoyable viewing experience.</p><p>Advanced smart features such as auto focus, auto keystone correction, auto screen fit, and auto obstacle avoidance make setup effortless and ensure perfectly aligned projection in any environment. Its 1.0:1 throw ratio and recommended viewing distance of 1.35 meters make it ideal for small to medium-sized rooms.</p><p>For audio, the built-in 15W HiFi stereo speakers deliver powerful and immersive sound, eliminating the need for external speakers in most use cases. Connectivity is fast and stable with WiFi 6 dual-band support and Bluetooth 5.4, allowing seamless wireless streaming and device pairing.</p><p>Multiple connectivity options, including HDMI and USB ports, ensure compatibility with laptops, gaming consoles, TV boxes, and other multimedia devices.</p><p>Overall, the Magcubic HY350Max combines strong performance, smart automation, and premium audio-visual quality, making it an excellent choice for modern home entertainment and professional use.</p><h3>Key Features:</h3><ul><li>Native Full HD 1080P (1920×1080) Resolution</li><li>900 ANSI Lumens Brightness</li><li>Supports Up to 8K Video Decoding</li><li>Smooth 60Hz Refresh Rate</li><li>Android 14 Smart Operating System</li><li>Auto Focus &amp; Auto Keystone Correction</li><li>Auto Screen Fit &amp; Obstacle Avoidance</li><li>WiFi 6 Dual-Band Connectivity</li><li>Bluetooth 5.4 Support</li><li>Powerful 15W HiFi Speakers</li><li>Up to 130-Inch Projection Size</li></ul>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>LCD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>1080P Full HD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Supported Video Decoding</td><td>Up to 8K</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>900 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>20,000:1 High Dynamic Contrast</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>Up to 130 Inches</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Light Source</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Up to 50,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>15W Speaker System</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Port</td><td>1 × HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB Port</td><td>1 × USB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Port</td><td>1 × Audio Output</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Wi-Fi</td><td>WiFi 6 Dual-Band (2.4GHz / 5GHz)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Bluetooth 5.4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Input Voltage</td><td>110V – 220V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>External Features</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 16890.00, 16800.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/0gmbM7SyLTxnsMW8SJsBFPnjLPWmi6VaKMcAzuE3.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-20 05:35:16', '2026-06-20 05:35:16', 'Magcubic HY350Max 900 ANSI Android 14 Smart Projector Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy Magcubic HY350Max 900 ANSI Android 14 Portable Projector in Bangladesh. Features 1080P native resolution, 8K support, 60Hz refresh rate, WiFi 6, Bluetooth 5.4, auto focus, auto keystone, and powerful 15W HiFi speakers for premium home entertainment.', 'Magcubic HY350Max, 900 ANSI Projector, Android 14 Projector, Smart Projector Bangladesh, 1080P Native Projector, 8K Supported Projector, WiFi 6 Projector, Bluetooth 5.4 Projector, Home Theater Projector, Portable Projector, 15W Speaker Projector, Auto Focus Projector, Gaming Projector, Movie Projector, Full HD Projector', NULL, 266, NULL, NULL),
(758, 'Magcubic Projector HY320 390 ANSI Android 11 Portable', 'Magcubic HY320 Android 11 Portable Projector with 390 ANSI Lumens brightness, Native Full HD 1080P resolution, 4K decoding support, WiFi 6, Bluetooth 5.0, auto keystone correction, 180° adjustable projection, and up to 150-inch display.', 'magcubic-projector-hy320-390-ansi-android-11-portable-1781949075', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Magcubic HY320 390 ANSI Android 11 Portable Projector is a smart entertainment solution designed for home cinema, gaming, and presentations. Powered by the Allwinner H713 quad-core ARM Cortex-A53 processor and Mali-G31 GPU, it delivers smooth performance and direct access to Android 11 apps, streaming platforms, and smart features without requiring external devices.</p><p>Featuring a native Full HD 1920 × 1080P resolution and support for 4K video decoding, the HY320 produces sharp images with vibrant colors and impressive clarity. Its 390 ANSI lumens brightness and 1500:1 contrast ratio ensure enjoyable viewing experiences in various environments, while support for both 16:9 and 4:3 aspect ratios provides compatibility with different content formats.</p><p>The projector can display images up to 150 inches, creating an immersive viewing experience for movies, sports, and gaming. With its 180-degree adjustable projection angle, users can easily project onto walls, ceilings, or other surfaces. Auto keystone correction automatically aligns the image for hassle-free setup.</p><p>For audio performance, the HY320 includes a built-in 5W Hi-Fi speaker that delivers clear and immersive sound. Connectivity options include WiFi 6 dual-band support for stable streaming and Bluetooth 5.0 for connecting wireless speakers, headphones, and other compatible devices. Screen mirroring support further enhances convenience for mobile and laptop users.</p><p>Designed for long-term use, the projector features an LED light source with a lifespan of up to 50,000 hours and operates quietly at less than 25dB. Combining smart functionality, Full HD visuals, wireless connectivity, and portable design, the Magcubic HY320 is an excellent choice for modern entertainment and professional applications.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>LCD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>1920 × 1080P (Full HD)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>4K Decoding</td><td>Supported (Output at 1080P)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>390 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>16:9 / 4:3</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>1500:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>Up to 150 Inches</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Picture Formats</td><td>JPG, BMP, PNG</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Video Formats</td><td>HEVC, VP9, AVS2, AVC 4K@60fps, MPEG1/2, AV1 1080p@60fps, etc.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Light Source</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Up to 50,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>5W Hi-Fi Speaker</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Port</td><td>1 × HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB Port</td><td>1 × USB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Audio Port</td><td>1 × Audio Output</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Bluetooth 5.0</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>WiFi</td><td>WiFi 6 Dual-Band (2.4GHz / 5GHz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Input Voltage</td><td>110V – 220V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>External Features</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 9500.00, 9500.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/xJOzeby9IqdfzRa8zUdfmAFBbGCbCaZa9rFOTBJL.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-20 09:51:15', '2026-06-20 09:51:15', 'Magcubic HY320 390 ANSI Android 11 Portable Projector Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy the Magcubic HY320 390 ANSI Android 11 Portable Projector in Bangladesh. Features Native Full HD 1080P resolution, 4K decoding, WiFi 6, Bluetooth 5.0, auto keystone correction, 180° adjustable projection, and up to 150-inch display.', 'Magcubic HY320, Magcubic HY320 Projector, Android 11 Projector, Full HD Projector, 390 ANSI Lumens Projector, WiFi 6 Projector, Bluetooth 5.0 Projector, Portable Projector Bangladesh, Smart Projector, 1080P Projector', NULL, 266, NULL, NULL);
