(759, 'Magcubic Projector HY300Max 400 ANSI Android 14 Portable', 'Magcubic HY300Max Android 14 Portable Projector with 400 ANSI Lumens brightness, native 720P resolution, 8K video decoding support, auto focus, WiFi 6, Bluetooth 5.4, auto keystone correction, and up to 150-inch projection size.', 'magcubic-projector-hy300max-400-ansi-android-14-portable-1781951441', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Magcubic HY300Max 400 ANSI Android 14 Portable Projector is a compact and feature-rich smart projector designed for home entertainment, presentations, and portable use. Powered by the advanced Allwinner H726 chipset and running the latest Android 14 operating system, it offers smooth performance and direct access to popular streaming apps, smart controls, and multimedia content without requiring additional devices.</p><p>Featuring a native 720P resolution and 400 ANSI lumens brightness, the HY300Max delivers clear and vibrant visuals suitable for movies, TV shows, presentations, and casual gaming. Its 2000:1 contrast ratio enhances image depth and detail, while over 150% color coverage ensures rich, vivid, and lifelike colors for an immersive viewing experience.</p><p>The projector supports video decoding up to 8K, allowing smooth playback of high-quality content while optimizing output for its display capabilities. With a maximum projection size of up to 150 inches, users can enjoy a large-screen cinematic experience in virtually any room.</p><p>For hassle-free setup, the Magcubic HY300Max comes equipped with auto focus technology that instantly sharpens the image. Auto vertical keystone correction and manual horizontal keystone adjustment help maintain a properly aligned picture even when the projector is placed at different angles.</p><p>Audio performance is handled by a built-in 5W speaker that delivers clear and balanced sound for everyday entertainment. Connectivity options include dual-band WiFi 6 (2.4GHz and 5GHz) for fast and stable streaming, along with Bluetooth 5.4 for connecting wireless speakers, headphones, and other compatible devices.</p><p>Built with portability in mind, the HY300Max is lightweight and easy to carry, making it suitable for home theaters, office presentations, travel, and outdoor movie nights. Its long-lasting LED light source offers up to 50,000 hours of operational life, ensuring reliable performance for years to come.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>LCD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>720P</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Video Decoding</td><td>Supports up to 8K</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>400 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>2000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Image Size</td><td>Up to 150 Inches</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Light Source</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Up to 50,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>5W Speaker</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Port</td><td>1 × HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB Port</td><td>1 × USB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Bluetooth 5.4</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>WiFi</td><td>WiFi 6 Dual-Band (2.4GHz / 5GHz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Input Voltage</td><td>110V – 220V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>External Features</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 10890.00, 10800.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/TF2yryiBvp1jPvEP5SFWbH9ChfBKanQY90bm71Ng.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-20 10:30:41', '2026-06-20 10:30:41', 'Magcubic HY300Max 400 ANSI Android 14 Portable Projector Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy the Magcubic HY300Max 400 ANSI Android 14 Portable Projector in Bangladesh. Features Android 14, 400 ANSI lumens brightness, native 720P resolution, 8K video decoding, auto focus, WiFi 6, Bluetooth 5.4, built-in speaker, and up to 150-inch projection size.', 'Magcubic HY300Max, Magcubic HY300Max Projector, Android 14 Projector, Portable Projector, 400 ANSI Lumens Projector, WiFi 6 Projector, Bluetooth 5.4 Projector, Smart Projector Bangladesh, 8K Decoding Projector, Home Theater Projector', NULL, 266, NULL, NULL),
(760, 'Magcubic Projector HY450GT 1200 Lumens Portable Google TV', 'Magcubic HY450GT Portable Projector with Google TV features 1200 lumens brightness, native Full HD 1080P resolution, Android 14, auto focus, auto keystone correction, 15W speaker, dual-band WiFi, Bluetooth 5.1, and support for up to 140-inch projection.', 'magcubic-projector-hy450gt-1200-lumens-portable-google-tv-1781952038', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Magcubic HY450GT 1200 Lumens Portable Projector with Google TV is a powerful smart projector designed to deliver an immersive viewing experience for home entertainment, gaming, presentations, and multimedia applications. Combining advanced projection technology with smart features, this projector offers outstanding image quality, convenient connectivity, and easy operation in a compact portable design.</p><p>Powered by the efficient Amlogic S905Y4-B Quad-Core processor and Android 14 operating system with built-in Google TV, the HY450GT provides direct access to popular streaming platforms, apps, and smart entertainment features. Users can enjoy seamless content streaming, personalized recommendations, and voice-enabled controls without requiring additional devices.</p><p>Featuring a native Full HD 1920 × 1080 resolution and up to 1200 lumens brightness, the projector delivers sharp details, vivid colors, and enhanced clarity for movies, TV shows, sports, and presentations. Its 2000:1 contrast ratio improves image depth and color accuracy, creating a more realistic viewing experience. The projector supports screen sizes from 40 to 140 inches, allowing users to transform any room into a personal cinema.</p><p>The Magcubic HY450GT is equipped with intelligent auto focus and auto keystone correction technologies that automatically optimize image sharpness and alignment for hassle-free setup. Multiple projection modes, including front projection, ceiling projection, and rear projection, offer greater installation flexibility for different environments.</p><p>For audio performance, the built-in 15W speaker provides clear, powerful sound that enhances entertainment without requiring external speakers. Connectivity options include dual-band WiFi, Bluetooth 5.1, HDMI input, USB connectivity, and wireless screen mirroring support, ensuring compatibility with smartphones, tablets, laptops, gaming consoles, and streaming devices.</p><p>Built with durable LCD projection technology and an energy-efficient LED light source, the HY450GT delivers reliable performance while maintaining a compact and portable form factor. Whether for home theaters, office presentations, educational purposes, or outdoor movie nights, the Magcubic HY450GT offers an excellent combination of smart functionality, image quality, and portability.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Projection Features</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>LCD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>1080P Full HD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Video Decoding</td><td>Supports Up to 4K</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness</td><td>1200 ANSI Lumens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Projection Size</td><td>40 – 140 Inches</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>2000:1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Operating System</td><td>Android 14</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lamp Details</strong></td><td>Light Source</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lamp Life</td><td>Up to 30,000 Hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Port</td><td>1 × HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB Port</td><td>1 × USB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>AC Input</td><td>1 × AC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Bluetooth 5.1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>WiFi</td><td>Dual-Band WiFi (2.4GHz &amp; 5GHz)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Screen Mirroring</td><td>Android &amp; iOS Wireless Screen Mirroring</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Other Features</td><td>Low-Latency HDMI Input</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Input Voltage</td><td>110V – 220V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>External Features</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 29000.00, 29000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/Pf9vmtXAIRsXFOgZxfMASDgSflUZeoYfpbyiatLV.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-20 10:40:38', '2026-06-20 10:40:38', 'Magcubic HY450GT 1200 Lumens Portable Projector with Google TV Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy the Magcubic HY450GT 1200 Lumens Portable Projector with Google TV in Bangladesh. Features native Full HD 1080P resolution, Android 14, Google TV, auto focus, auto keystone correction, 15W speaker, Bluetooth 5.1, dual-band WiFi, and up to 140-inch projection size.', 'Magcubic HY450GT, Magcubic HY450GT Projector, Google TV Projector, Android 14 Projector, Full HD Projector, 1200 Lumens Projector, Portable Projector Bangladesh, Smart Projector, Auto Focus Projector, Home Theater Projector', NULL, 266, NULL, NULL),
(761, 'Apollo 96\"x96\" TripodProjection Screen', 'Apollo 96\" × 96\" Tripod Projection Screen with a durable white viewing surface, black borders, lightweight portable design, washable material, and stable tripod stand. Ideal for home theaters, offices, classrooms, training sessions, and presentations.', 'apollo-96x96-tripodprojection-screen-1781952451', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Apollo 96\" × 96\" Tripod Projection Screen is a practical and versatile projection solution designed for professional presentations, educational environments, and home entertainment. Featuring a large 96-inch by 96-inch viewing area, this screen delivers clear and vibrant image projection, making it suitable for meetings, classrooms, seminars, training sessions, and movie viewing.</p><p>Constructed with a high-quality white projection surface and black borders, the screen enhances image clarity, contrast, and focus while reducing distractions around the viewing area. The matte white surface ensures uniform light distribution and accurate color reproduction, providing an enjoyable viewing experience from different angles.</p><p>The sturdy tripod stand offers excellent stability during use and allows quick setup and adjustment without requiring wall or ceiling installation. Its lightweight design makes transportation and storage convenient, making it an excellent choice for users who frequently move between locations.</p><p>Designed for long-term durability, the screen material is washable and easy to maintain, ensuring a clean and professional appearance even after extended use. Whether for office presentations, classroom lectures, business meetings, training programs, or home theater setups, the Apollo 96\" × 96\" Tripod Projection Screen delivers reliable performance and portability.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Screen Features</strong></td><td>Screen Size</td><td>96\" × 96\"</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Screen Type</td><td>Tripod Projection Screen</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Viewing Surface</td><td>Matte White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Border Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>1:1</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Material</strong></td><td>Surface Material</td><td>Washable Projection Fabric</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Construction</td><td>Lightweight and Durable</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Stand</strong></td><td>Support Type</td><td>Tripod Stand</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Stability</td><td>High Stability Design</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Applications</strong></td><td>Suitable For</td><td>Home Theater, Office Presentations, Classrooms, Training Sessions, Conferences</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Portability</strong></td><td>Design</td><td>Foldable and Portable</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Features</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White Screen with Black Borders</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>Not Specified</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 10000.00, 10000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/Dme3u98JZzRaVzMHhFFSQOVs1pa81fUllnQUq0IG.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-20 10:47:31', '2026-06-20 10:49:16', 'Apollo 96\"x96\" Tripod Projection Screen Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy the Apollo 96\" × 96\" Tripod Projection Screen in Bangladesh. Features a large white viewing surface with black borders, durable tripod stand, washable material, lightweight portable design, and easy setup for home, office, and educational use.', 'Apollo 96x96 Projection Screen, Apollo Tripod Screen, 96 Inch Projection Screen, Portable Projection Screen, Tripod Projector Screen, Apollo Screen Bangladesh, Presentation Screen, Home Theater Screen, Office Projector Screen', NULL, 267, NULL, NULL),
(762, 'Projection Scree Apollo 84\"x84\" Electric', 'Apollo 84\" × 84\" Electric Projection Screen featuring a high-gain matte white display surface, retractable motorized design, flame-retardant and mildew-resistant material, easy maintenance, and bright, vivid image reproduction for home theaters, classrooms, and professional presentations.', 'projection-scree-apollo-84x84-electric-1781953028', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Apollo 84\" × 84\" Electric Projection Screen is designed to deliver a superior viewing experience for business presentations, educational environments, and home entertainment setups. With its large 84-inch by 84-inch viewing area, this projection screen provides ample space for displaying presentations, videos, movies, and multimedia content with exceptional clarity.</p><p>Featuring a matte white ultra-reflective high-gain screen surface, the Apollo Electric Projection Screen delivers up to 50% more brightness than conventional projection screens. This enhanced reflectivity helps produce sharper images, richer colors, and improved visibility even in environments with moderate ambient lighting.</p><p>The motorized retractable design offers convenient operation and a clean, professional appearance. When not in use, the screen retracts smoothly into its housing, helping to save space and protect the screen surface from dust and damage. Its user-friendly design makes installation and everyday operation simple and efficient.</p><p>Built for durability, the screen material is flame-retardant and mildew-resistant, ensuring reliable long-term performance in various environments. The washable surface can be easily cleaned using mild soap and water, making maintenance quick and hassle-free.</p><p>Whether used for conference rooms, classrooms, training centers, auditoriums, or home theater systems, the Apollo 84\" × 84\" Electric Projection Screen provides bright, vivid, and high-quality image projection, making it an excellent solution for professional and perso