(763, 'Projection Screen MediaView 96\"x96\" Wall', 'MediaView 96\" × 96\" Wall Projection Screen with matte white anti-glare surface, 1-inch black border, smooth wall-hanging pull-down mechanism, wrinkle-free display, and wide compatibility for home, office, and classroom use.', 'projection-screen-mediaview-96x96-wall-1781953259', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The MediaView 96\" × 96\" Wall Projection Screen is a reliable and space-saving projection solution designed for home theaters, classrooms, offices, and professional presentation environments. With its large 96-inch by 96-inch viewing area, it delivers a clear and immersive display experience suitable for movies, training sessions, meetings, and multimedia presentations.</p><p>Featuring a high-quality matte white surface, the screen enhances brightness, color accuracy, and uniform light distribution while reducing glare for comfortable viewing from multiple angles. This ensures consistent and sharp image quality regardless of audience position.</p><p>The 1-inch black border around the screen helps define the projection area, improving contrast and making visuals appear sharper and more focused. This enhances overall presentation quality, especially in professional settings.</p><p>Designed with a wall-hanging pull-down mechanism, the screen offers smooth, quiet, and convenient operation. It can be easily retracted when not in use, helping to maintain a clean and organized environment. The wrinkle-free tension design ensures a flat and stable projection surface for optimal viewing performance.</p><p>With its compact and versatile installation options, the MediaView Projection Screen can be mounted on both walls and ceilings, making it suitable for a wide range of environments including classrooms, conference rooms, and home entertainment setups.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Screen Features</strong></td><td>Screen S