(765, 'Cheerlux Projector Screen  120 inch Diagonal Roll Up Wall', 'Cheerlux 120-inch Diagonal Wall Projector Screen featuring a matte white anti-glare surface, 1-inch black border, easy wall-mount installation, and wide compatibility for home theater, classroom, and office presentation use.', 'cheerlux-projector-screen-120-inch-diagonal-roll-up-wall-1781954176', '<p>The Cheerlux 120-inch Diagonal Wall Projector Screen is a premium large-format display solution designed to deliver an immersive viewing experience for home theaters, classrooms, meeting rooms, and professional presentation spaces. With its 120-inch diagonal size, it provides a wide and cinematic viewing area suitable for movies, videos, gaming, and presentations.</p><p>This projector screen features a high-quality matte white surface that ensures even light distribution across the entire display area. It eliminates hotspots and glare while enhancing brightness, color accuracy, and contrast for a smooth and visually balanced viewing experience. The surface is compatible with LED, LCD, DLP, and laser projectors, making it highly versatile.</p><p>The screen is designed for direct wall mounting, offering a secure and space-saving installation. Once installed, it remains stable and fixed in position, ensuring consistent performance without the need for floor stands or additional support structures.</p><p>A 1-inch black border surrounds the projection area, helping to define the image frame clearly and improve perceived contrast. This border also reduces light interference around the edges, keeping viewers focused on the displayed content and enhancing overall visual clarity.</p><p>With its large viewing size, durable build, and easy installation, the Cheerlux 120-inch Wall Projector Screen is an excellent choice for users seeking a reliable and professional-quality projection surface.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody>