esh', 'Buy Cheerlux 120-inch Diagonal Wall Projector Screen in Bangladesh. Features matte white anti-glare surface, 1-inch black border, easy wall mounting system, and wide compatibility for home theater, office presentations, and classroom use.', 'Cheerlux 120 inch projector screen, wall projector screen Bangladesh, 120 inch projection screen, matte white projector screen, home theater screen, office presentation screen, classroom projector screen, Cheerlux screen price, fixed wall projector screen', NULL, 269, NULL, NULL),
(766, 'Dopah Projection Screen 60 x 60 Inch Wall', 'Dopah 60\" × 60\" Electric Wall Projection Screen with motorized remote control operation, matte white high-gain surface, black border for enhanced contrast, flame-retardant and mildew-resistant material, and compact wall-mounted design for home and office use.', 'dopah-projection-screen-60-x-60-inch-wall-1781954630', '<p>The Dopah 60\" × 60\" Electric Wall Projection Screen is a compact and convenient projection solution designed for home theaters, offices, classrooms, and professional presentation environments. With its electric motorized system, the screen can be smoothly deployed and retracted using a remote control, offering effortless operation and a clean, modern setup.</p><p>The screen features a 60-inch by 60-inch matte white high-gain surface that enhances brightness, clarity, and color accuracy. It delivers sharp and vibrant images even in varying lighting conditions, making it suitable for both dark and moderately lit environments.</p><p>A black border around the display area improves contrast and helps define the projection frame, ensuring a more focused and professional viewing experience. This design is especially useful for presentations, movies, and multimedia content where image clarity is important.</p><p>Built with durability in mind, the screen surface is flame-retardant and mildew-resistant, ensuring long-lasting performance and easy maintenance. The material can be kept clean and in good condition with minimal effort.</p><p>The compact wall-mounted design allows easy installation without occupying floor space. Its included protective carrying case adds portability and storage convenience, making it suitable for both fixed and mobile setups.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Screen Features</strong></td><td>Screen Size</td><td>60\" × 60\"</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Screen Type</td><td>Electric (Motorized) Wall Projection Screen</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Viewing Surface</td><td>Matte White High-Gain</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Border</td><td>Black Border</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>1:1</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operation</strong></td><td>Control System</td><td>Electric Remote-Controlled Motor</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Deployment</td><td>Smooth automatic roll-up / roll-down</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Material</strong></td><td>Screen Surface</td><td>Matte White Reflective Fabric</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Safety Features</td><td>Flame-Retardant, Mildew-Resistant</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Image Performance</strong></td><td>Brightness Enhancement</td><td>High Gain for brighter projection</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Contrast Improvement</td><td>Black border improves focus and clarity</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Color Quality</td><td>Enhanced brightness and color accuracy</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Installation</strong></td><td>Mounting Type</td><td>Wall Mount</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Design</td><td>Compact and space-saving</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Portability</strong></td><td>Storage</td><td>Includes carrying case</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Applications</strong></td><td>Suitable For</td><td>Home Theater, Office, Classroom, Training Rooms, Presentations</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Features</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White Screen with Black Border</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 3500.00, 3500.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/DBe2Bj4vvNmF6Y7n5RlK9XFY2CFH1ZZknSG3vmEy.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-20 11:23:51', '2026-06-20 11:23:51', 'Dopah 60x60 Inch Electric Wall Projection Screen Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy Dopah 60\" × 60\" Electric Wall Projection Screen in Bangladesh. Features motorized remote control operation, matte white high-gain surface, black border for contrast,