(767, 'Projection Screen Dopah 60\"x60\" Electric', 'Dopah 60\" × 60\" Electric Projection Screen with high-gain matte white surface, motorized smooth operation, flame-retardant and mildew-resistant material, portable retractable design, and clear vivid display for home, office, and classroom use.', 'projection-screen-dopah-60x60-electric-1781954876', '<p>The Dopah 60\" × 60\" Electric Projection Screen is a compact and efficient projection solution designed for home theaters, classrooms, offices, and conference environments. It delivers a professional-quality viewing experience with its motorized electric mechanism and high-performance screen surface.</p><p>Featuring a matte white ultra-reflective high-gain display surface, this screen enhances brightness and clarity, offering up to 50% more brightness compared to conventional screens. It ensures sharp, vibrant, and color-accurate visuals even in well-lit environments, making it suitable for a wide range of multimedia applications.</p><p>The electric motorized system allows smooth and effortless operation, enabling users to deploy or retract the screen easily. When not in use, the screen rolls neatly into its protective casing, keeping it safe from dust and damage while maintaining a clean setup.</p><p>Designed for durability, the screen material is flame-retardant and mildew-resistant, ensuring long-lasting performance. It is also easy to clean using mild soap and water, making maintenance simple and convenient for regular use.</p><p>With its compact size and portable design, the Dopah 60\" × 60\" Electric Projection Screen is ideal for spaces where flexibility and efficiency are important. It delivers consistent performance and vivid image quality, making it suitable for both professional and personal entertainment needs.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Screen Features</strong></td><td>Screen Size</td><td>60\" × 60\"</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Screen Type</td><td>Electric Projection Screen</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Viewing Surface</td><td>Matte White High-Gain</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brightness Gain</td><td>Up to 50% brighter than conventional screens</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>1:1</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operation</strong></td><td>Mechanism</td><td>Motorized Electric System</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Control</td><td>Remote-controlled smooth deployment &amp; retraction</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Material</strong></td><td>Screen Surface</td><td>Matte White Reflective Fabric</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Durability</td><td>Flame-Retardant, Mildew-Resistant</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Maintenance</td><td>Easy to clean with mild soap and water</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance</strong></td><td>Image Quality</td><td>Bright, vivid, and high-contrast display</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Viewing Experience</td><td>Clear visuals in both dim and well-lit environments</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Installation</strong></td><td>Mounting Type</td><td>Wall-mounted (fixed installation)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Storage</td><td>Retracts into protective casing</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Portability</strong></td><td>Design</td><td>Compact and easy to manage</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Applications</strong></td><td>Suitable For</td><td>Home Theater, Office Presentations, Classrooms, Meetings, Conference Rooms</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Features</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White Screen with Black Border (if applicable)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 7300.00, 7300.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/BsFmIFpl5zwwiABh6LPDbvRzioGOj5Gum9FRnaeL.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-20 11:27:56', '2026-06-20 11:27:56', 'Dopah 60\"x60\" Electric Projection Screen Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy Dopah 60\" × 60\" Electric Projection Screen in Bangladesh. Features high-gain matte white surface, motorized electric operation, flame-retardant durable material, easy maintenance, and vivid bright display ideal for home, office, and classroom use.', 'Dopah 60x60 Electric Projection Screen, motorized projector screen Bangladesh, electric projection screen 60 inch, home theater screen, classroom projector screen, conference room screen, high gain projection screen, Dopah screen price, wall mounted projector screen', NULL, 267, NULL, NULL),
(768, 'Ceiling Mount Kit 2 Feet Projector', 'Projector Ceiling Mount Kit 2 Feet featuring a sturdy metal wall bracket, adjustable extendable arm, and universal projector mounting plate. Easy installation with Allen key assembly, ideal for secure ceiling or wall projector setup.', 'ceiling-mount-kit-2-feet-projector-1781955100', '<p>The Projector Ceiling Mount Kit 2 Feet is a durable and practical mounting solution designed to securely install projectors in homes, offices, classrooms, and conference rooms. It includes three main components: a strong wall/ceiling bracket, an extendable arm, and a universal projector mounting plate.</p><p>All components are designed for easy and secure assembly using simple Allen key pins, allowing quick installation without complex tools. The adjustable extendable arm provides flexible positioning, helping users achieve the perfect projection angle and distance for optimal viewing quality.</p><p>Constructed from high-strength metal materials, the mount ensures stability and safety for your projector while reducing vibration and movement during use. Its compact and space-saving design keeps the projector neatly positioned on the ceiling or wall, improving room organization and presentation setup.</p><p>This ceiling mount kit is compatible with most standard projectors, making it a versatile choice for both personal and professional environments.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Product Type</strong></td><td>Mount Type</td><td>Projector Ceiling Mount Kit</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Installation Type</td><td>Ceiling / Wall Mount</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Components</strong></td><td>Main Parts</td><td>Wall Bracket, Extendable Arm, Projector Mount Plate</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Assembly System</td><td>Allen key pin-based assembly</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Material</strong></td><td>Build Material</td><td>High-strength metal construction</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Finish</td><td>Durable protective coating</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design</strong></td><td>Arm Type</td><td>2 Feet Extendable Adjustable Arm</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Adjustability</td><td>Flexible positioning for angle and distance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Projector Support</td><td>Universal compatibility with most projectors</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Installation</strong></td><td>Setup</td><td>Easy installation with basic tools</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Stability</td><td>Secure and vibration-resistant mounting</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance</strong></td><td>Safety</td><td>Strong load-bearing support for stable projection</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Application</strong></td><td>Suitable For</td><td>Home Theater, Office, Classroom, Conference Room, Business Setup</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Features</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White / Silver (varies by model)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 1500.00, 1500.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/HTsPfl1gKfPWJ8Ow4R0W3GRz4RYeYD8Huvmjtl3F.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-20 11:31:40', '2026-06-20 11:31:40', 'Projector Ceiling Mount Kit 2 Feet Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy Projector Ceiling Mount Kit 2 Feet in Bangladesh. Features sturdy metal bracket, adjustable extendable arm, and universal projector plate with easy Allen key installation. Ideal for secure and stable ceiling or wall projector setup for home, office, and classroom use.', 'Projector ceiling mount kit, 2 feet projector mount, projector wall bracket, ceiling projector stand Bangladesh, universal projector mount, adjustable projector bracket, projector installation kit, projector holder stand, projector mount price', NULL, 268, NULL, NULL);
