(769, 'Ceiling Mount Kit 3 Feet Projector', 'Projector Ceiling Mount Kit 3 Feet Universal adjustable mount with 2–3 feet extendable drop pole, strong steel construction, cable management design, and wide compatibility with major projector brands for safe and stable installation.', 'ceiling-mount-kit-3-feet-projector-1781957319', '<p>The Projector Ceiling Mount Kit 3 Feet is a universal mounting solution designed to securely install projectors in homes, offices, classrooms, and conference rooms. With its adjustable drop pole ranging from 2 to 3 feet, it allows flexible positioning to achieve the ideal projection height and angle for a clear and stable display.</p><p>Constructed from high-quality steel, this ceiling mount ensures strong load-bearing support and long-lasting durability. It provides a safe and stable mounting solution that holds the projector securely in place, reducing vibration and ensuring consistent projection performance.</p><p>One of the key advantages of this mount is its cable management design, which helps keep wires hidden and organized. This not only improves the overall appearance of the installation but also eliminates tripping hazards caused by exposed cables, resulting in a cleaner and safer environment.</p><p>The mount is designed for universal compatibility and works with a wide range of projector brands including Sony, Samsung, Sanyo, Dell, Hitachi, Mitashi, BenQ, Epson, 3M, ASUS, Optoma, LG, ViewSonic, InFocus, Acer, and many more, making it a versatile choice for different setups.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Product Type</strong></td><td>Mount Type</td><td>Universal Projector Ceiling Mount Kit</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Installation Type</td><td>Ceiling Mount</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Adjustability</strong></td><td>Drop Pole Length</td><td>Adjustable 2–3 Feet</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Flexibility</td><td>Height adjustable for optimal projection positioning</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Material</strong></td><td>Build Material</td><td>High-strength Steel</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Durability</td><td>Heavy-duty, long-lasting construction</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Structure</td><td>Strong tubular support with mounting plate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Safety Features</strong></td><td>Load Support</td><td>Designed to safely hold standard projectors</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Stability</td><td>Anti-vibration and secure locking system</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cable Management</strong></td><td>Wiring System</td><td>Hidden cable routing for clean installation</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Safety Benefit</td><td>Reduces cable clutter and tripping hazards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Supported Brands</td><td>Sony, Samsung, Sanyo, Dell, Hitachi, BenQ, Epson, 3M, ASUS, Optoma, LG, ViewSonic, InFocus, Acer &amp; others</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Installation</strong></td><td>Setup Type</td><td>Ceiling installation with standard tools</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Ease of Installation</td><td>Simple and secure mounting system</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Applications</strong></td><td>Suitable For</td><td>Home Theater, Office, Classroom, Conference Room, Training Centers</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 2000.00, 2000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/K9O4F2SH6GxrFzZuPLLUG35dQb2kT1hqbqOHT39J.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-20 12:08:39', '2026-06-20 12:08:39', 'Projector Ceiling Mount Kit 3 Feet Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy Projector Ceiling Mount Kit 3 Feet in Bangladesh. Features 2–3 feet adjustable drop pole, strong steel construction, cable management system, and universal compatibility with major projector brands for safe and stable installation in home, office, and classroom use.', 'Projector ceiling mount kit, 3 feet projector mount, adjustable projector ceiling bracket, universal projector mount Bangladesh, projector stand steel mount, projector installation kit, BenQ Epson projector mount, ceiling projector holder, projector bracket price', NULL, 268, NULL, NULL),
(770, 'Lexin PM02 Ceiling Mount Kit 3 Feet  Projector', 'Lexin PM02 3 Feet Projector Ceiling Mount Kit with adjustable 500–1000mm length, 360° swivel rotation, ±15° tilt support, heavy-duty steel construction, and universal compatibility for secure projector installation.', 'lexin-pm02-ceiling-mount-kit-3-feet-projector-1781958163', '<p>The Lexin PM02 Projector Ceiling Mount Kit 3 Feet is a durable and versatile mounting solution designed for secure projector installation in homes, offices, classrooms, and conference rooms. Built with heavy-duty steel, it ensures strong support and long-lasting performance while maintaining stability during use.</p><p>This universal ceiling mount features an adjustable length ranging from 500mm to 1000mm (2–3 feet), allowing users to set the ideal projection height and positioning for optimal viewing quality. Its flexible design makes it compatible with a wide range of projector models.</p><p>For enhanced viewing adjustment, the Lexin PM02 supports 360-degree swivel rotation and up to ±15 degrees tilt, enabling precise angle control for accurate image alignment. This ensures a properly centered and distortion-free projection experience in various installation environments.</p><p>The mount also includes a cable management design that helps hide and organize wires, reducing clutter and eliminating tripping hazards for a clean and professional setup. Its strong steel construction ensures safe load-bearing capacity, providing peace of mind when securely installed.</p><p>The Lexin PM02 is widely compatible with major projector brands including Sony, Samsung, Sanyo, Dell, Hitachi, Mitashi, BenQ, Epson, 3M, ASUS, Optoma, LG, ViewSonic, InFocus, Acer, and many others, making it a reliable universal solution for different setups.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Product Type</strong></td><td>Mount Type</td><td>Projector Ceiling Mount Kit</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Model</td><td>Lexin PM02</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Installation Type</td><td>Ceiling Mount</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Total Length</td><td>3 Feet (Approx.)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Adjustable Range</td><td>500mm – 1000mm (2–3 Feet)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Material</strong></td><td>Build Material</td><td>Heavy-Duty Steel</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Durability</td><td>Strong, long-lasting construction</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Structure</td><td>Adjustable pole with mounting plate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Adjustability</strong></td><td>Rotation</td><td>360° Swivel Rotation</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tilt Angle</td><td>±15° Adjustable Tilt</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Positioning</td><td>Flexible angle and height adjustment</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Load Capacity</strong></td><td>Maximum Load</td><td>Up to 15 kg</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cable Management</strong></td><td>Wiring System</td><td>Internal cable routing support</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Benefit</td><td>Clean installation, reduced cable clutter</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Supported Brands</td><td>Sony, Samsung, Sanyo, Dell, Hitachi, Mitashi, BenQ, Epson, 3M, ASUS, Optoma, LG, ViewSonic, InFocus, Acer &amp; others</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Installation</strong></td><td>Setup Type</td><td>Ceiling installation with standard tools</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Ease of Use</td><td>Simple and secure mounting system</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Applications</strong></td><td>Suitable For</td><td>Home Theater, Office, Classroom, Conference Room, Training Centers</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 3000.00, 3000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/ZrY8d9Izlvs1NMQZuM1mlcd04J6drc2zMSWxiNak.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-20 12:22:43', '2026-06-20 12:22:43', 'Lexin PM02 3 Feet Projector Ceiling Mount Kit Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy Lexin PM02 3 Feet Projector Ceiling Mount Kit in Bangladesh. Features adjustable 500–1000mm length, 360° swivel rotation, ±15° tilt, heavy-duty steel build, and universal compatibility for secure and flexible projector installation.', 'Lexin PM02, projector ceiling mount kit 3 feet, adjustable projector mount Bangladesh, 360 degree projector mount, universal ceiling bracket, projector stand steel mount, Epson BenQ projector mount, adjustable drop pole projector holder, Lexin projector bracket', NULL, 268, NULL, NULL),
(771, 'Dopah Projector DTT-04 Portable Multimedia  Tripod Trolley', 'Dopah DTT-04 Portable Multimedia Projector Tripod Trolley with adjustable height (550–1380mm), 360° rotation, 16kg load capacity, foam-padded top plate, and sturdy tripod design compatible with projectors and DVD players.', 'dopah-projector-dtt-04-portable-multimedia-tripod-trolley-1781960252', '<p>The Dopah DTT-04 Portable Multimedia Projector Tripod Trolley is a durable and versatile stand designed for projectors, DVD players, and other multimedia equipment. It is ideal for use in classrooms, offices, training centers, conference rooms, and home entertainment setups.</p><p>This tripod trolley features a strong and stable structure with an adjustable height range from 550mm (minimum) to 1380mm (maximum), allowing users to set the perfect viewing position based on their environment. The 1.5m (5 feet) adjustable tripod base ensures excellent stability during operation.</p><p>The top plate measures 290 × 390mm and is covered with high-quality foam padding to protect your projector from scratches and vibrations. With a maximum load capacity of up to 16kg, it safely supports most standard projectors and multimedia devices.</p><p>For added flexibility, the trolley supports 360-degree rotation, making it easy to adjust the viewing angle for presentations and media playback. Its tube diameter of up to 32.8mm ensures strong structural support and long-term durability.</p><p>Overall, the Dopah DTT-04 is a reliable and portable solution for professional and personal multimedia setups, offering convenience, safety, and flexible positioning.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Product Type</strong></td><td>Model</td><td>Dopah DTT-04</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Projector Tripod Trolley</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Projector, DVD Player, Multimedia Devices</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Top Plate Size</td><td>290 × 390 mm</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Base Length</td><td>1.5 m / 5 Feet (Adjustable Tripod Base)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Height Adjustment</strong></td><td>Range</td><td>550 mm (Min) – 1380 mm (Max)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Build &amp; Structure</strong></td><td>Material</td><td>Heavy-duty metal construction</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tube Diameter</td><td>Up to 32.8 mm</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Stability</td><td>Strong tripod base design</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Load Capacity</strong></td><td>Maximum Load</td><td>Up to 16 kg</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Rotation</strong></td><td>Swivel</td><td>360° Rotation Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Protection</strong></td><td>Top Plate Surface</td><td>Foam-padded protective layer</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Functionality</strong></td><td>Adjustment Type</td><td>Height adjustable and rotatable</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Portability</strong></td><td>Design</td><td>Portable and easy to move</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Applications</strong></td><td>Suitable For</td><td>Home Theater, Office, Classroom, Training Rooms, Conference Presentations</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Safety Features</strong></td><td>Protection</td><td>Anti-slip, vibration-reducing foam top</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 5000.00, 5000.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/762OwIa8tv1CetRGA53hPyHdj2M0wBGe9cv34XeT.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-20 12:57:32', '2026-06-20 12:57:32', 'Dopah DTT-04 Projector Tripod Trolley Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy Dopah DTT-04 Portable Multimedia Projector Tripod Trolley in Bangladesh. Features adjustable height 550–1380mm, 360° rotation, 16kg load capacity, foam-padded top plate, and sturdy portable design for projectors and multimedia devices.', 'Dopah DTT-04, projector tripod trolley, projector stand Bangladesh, multimedia trolley stand, adjustable projector stand, portable projector cart, 360 degree projector stand, 16kg projector trolley, Dopah projector stand price', NULL, 268, NULL, NULL),
(772, 'Dopah Projector  DTT-05 Multimedia Trolley', 'Dopah DTT-05 Multimedia Projector Trolley with dual platform design for projector and laptop, height adjustable frame, tilt-adjustable tray, anti-slip surface, and smooth caster wheels for easy mobility and stable professional use.', 'dopah-projector-dtt-05-multimedia-trolley-1781960696', '<p>The Dopah DTT-05 Universal Flexible Projector Table / Laptop Trolley is a multifunctional and ergonomic solution designed for offices, classrooms, training centers, conferences, and home entertainment setups. Built with a strong metal frame, it ensures long-lasting durability and stable performance in daily use.</p><p>This trolley features a dual-platform layout, allowing users to place both a projector and a laptop simultaneously, making presentations and multimedia operations more efficient. The height-adjustable structure provides flexible positioning, enabling comfortable use whether sitting or standing.</p><p>The main tray is tilt-adjustable, allowing precise projector alignment for optimal viewing angles. Its anti-slip surface ensures that devices remain securely in place during operation, reducing the risk of movement or damage.</p><p>For mobility, the Dopah DTT-05 is equipped with four smooth-rolling caster wheels, making it easy to move across different spaces. The wheels also include locking functionality to keep the trolley stable when needed.</p><p>With its universal compatibility, compact design, and strong build quality, this trolley is suitable for most projectors, laptops, and multimedia devices. It is an ideal choice for users seeking a flexible, portable, and professional AV workstation.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Product Type</strong></td><td>Model</td><td>Dopah DTT-05</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Multimedia Projector / Laptop Trolley</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Usage</td><td>