(793, 'HP 44A Black Original Laser Toner', 'The HP Black Original LaserJet Toner Cartridge for HP M15, M16, M28, and M29 series printers delivers sharp black text and reliable everyday printing performance. With a yield of approximately 1,000 pages, this genuine HP toner ensures consistent quality, smooth operation, and professional results. Available from International Office Solution, it is an ideal compact printing solution for home and small office users.', 'hp-44a-black-original-laser-toner-1782112185', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The HP Black Original LaserJet Toner Cartridge is designed to deliver consistent, high-quality printing performance for compact HP LaserJet printers including the M15, M16, M28, and M29 series. This genuine HP toner cartridge produces sharp black text, clear graphics, and reliable output for everyday printing needs.</p><p>With a page yield of approximately 1,000 pages, this toner cartridge is ideal for home users, students, and small office environments that require efficient and cost-effective printing. It is well-suited for printing documents such as assignments, reports, invoices, letters, and daily paperwork.</p><p>Built with HP’s advanced laser printing technology, this cartridge ensures stable and consistent performance from the first page to the last. It is engineered for seamless compatibility with supported HP printers, helping reduce printing errors and ensuring smooth operation.</p><p>Before purchasing, users should carefully verify that their printer model matches the supported cartridge specifications to ensure proper compatibility and optimal performance.</p><p>This toner cartridge is compact, easy to install, and designed for hassle-free replacement, allowing users to resume printing quickly with minimal downtime.</p><p>Available from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, this genuine HP toner cartridge ensures authentic quality, reliable performance, and long-lasting value for everyday printing.</p><h3><strong>Key Featu