(794, 'HP 117A Black Original Laser Toner', 'This Black Laser Toner Cartridge is designed for use with HP Color Laser 150a, 150nw, MFP 178nw, and MFP 179fnw printers. It delivers sharp black prints with an approximate yield of 1,000 pages, making it suitable for home and office printing needs.', 'hp-117a-black-original-laser-toner-1782123690', '<p>The Black Laser Toner Cartridge is a reliable and cost-effective printing solution for users seeking consistent print quality and dependable performance. Engineered for compatibility with HP Color Laser 150a, HP Color Laser 150nw, HP Color Laser MFP 178nw, and HP Color Laser MFP 179fnw printers, this toner cartridge ensures seamless installation and efficient operation.</p><p>Utilizing advanced laser printing technology, the cartridge delivers sharp black text, clear graphics, and professional-looking documents with every print. Whether you are printing reports, invoices, contracts, presentations, or everyday office documents, this toner helps maintain high print standards while minimizing interruptions.</p><p>With an approximate page yield of 1,000 pages, the cartridge supports regular printing needs and helps improve productivity in home offices, small businesses, educational institutions, and corporate environments. Its dependable performance reduces the need for frequent cartridge replacements, offering excellent value and convenience.</p><p>At <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, we understand the importance of maintaining consistent printing performance. This toner cartridge is carefully selected to provide reliable output quality and smooth printer operation, helping businesses and professionals achieve optimal printing results. Before purchasing, users are advised to verify that their printer model and existing toner model match the compatibility specifications to ensure proper functionality.</p><p>Choose this Black Laser Toner Cartridge for a dependable printing experience, professional-quality output, and efficient page coverage that meets your everyday printing demands.</p><h2>Why Buy from International Office Solution?</h2><ul><li>Genuine and quality-tested printing supplies</li><li>Competitive pricing for businesses and individuals</li><li>Reliable customer support</li><li>Fast delivery and professional service</li><li>Suitable solutions for office and commercial printing needs</li></ul>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Basic Information</td><td>Printing Technology</td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td>Basic Information</td><td>Printing Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>Supported Printers</td><td>HP Color Laser 150a, HP Color Laser 150nw, HP Color Laser MFP 178nw, HP Color Laser MFP 179fnw</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>Compatibility Note</td><td>Please ensure your existing toner/cartridge model matches before purchasing</td></tr><tr><td>Performance</td><td>Page Yield</td><td>Approximately 1,000 Pages</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Toner', 7500.00, 7500.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/vqrysrN0Fhl4Nga7qIhQLjw0zweIGoRTxl57Psl2.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-22 10:21:31', '2026-06-22 10:21:31', 'Black Laser Toner Cartridge for HP Color Laser 150a, 150nw, 178nw & 179fnw | International Office Solution', 'Buy a high-quality Black Laser Toner Cartridge compatible with HP Color Laser 150a, 150nw, MFP 178nw, and MFP 179fnw printers from International Office Solution. Enjoy sharp print quality, reliable performance, and up to 1,000-page yield for home and office printing.', 'Black Laser Toner Cartridge, HP Color Laser 150a Toner, HP Color Laser 150nw Toner, HP MFP 178nw Toner, HP MFP 179fnw Toner, HP Compatible Toner Cartridge, Laser Printer Toner, Black Toner Cartridge, Office Printing Supplies, International Office Solution, HP Printer Consumables, 1000 Page Yield Toner, Business Printing Solution, Professional Print Quality, Laser Toner Bangladesh', NULL, 1, NULL, NULL),
(795, 'TEV TA-680D 220W Portable PA System (1 Hand Mic)', 'TEV TA-680D 220W Portable PA System with an 8-inch full-range speaker, Bluetooth 5.0 connectivity, rechargeable lithium battery, wireless handheld microphone, echo and reverb effects, and up to 10 hours of standby time for presentations, events, and public speaking.', 'tev-ta-680d-220w-portable-pa-system-1-hand-mic-1782215951', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The TEV TA-680D 220W Portable PA System is a powerful and versatile audio solution designed for public speaking, classrooms, training sessions, religious gatherings, outdoor events, and professional presentations. Combining high-performance sound output with portable convenience, this PA system delivers clear and reliable audio wherever it is needed.</p><p>Powered by an advanced Class D amplifier, the TEV TA-680D provides a maximum output power of 220W while maintaining low distortion levels of less than 0.5% THD. Its high-efficiency design ensures strong, clean sound performance suitable for both indoor and outdoor applications.</p><p>The system features an 8-inch full-range speaker paired with a 1-inch tweeter horn, delivering balanced audio with crisp highs and rich mids across a wide frequency response range of 60Hz to 20KHz. This ensures excellent speech intelligibility and enjoyable music playback.</p><p>For added flexibility, the TEV TA-680D includes Bluetooth 5.0 connectivity, allowing users to stream music wirelessly from smartphones, tablets, laptops, and other Bluetooth-enabled devices. Adjustable echo and reverb controls further enhance vocal performance, making it ideal for announcements, karaoke, teaching, and live presentations.</p><p>The portable PA system is powered by a built-in rechargeable 21.6V/4.9Ah lithium battery, offering dependable operation with up to 10 hours of standby time on a full charge. The battery can be fully recharged in approximately 5 hours, ensuring readiness for extended use.</p><p>The TEV TA-680D supports multiple microphone options, including the included wireless handheld microphone, wireless lavalier microphones, wireless headset microphones, and wired microphones. This flexibility makes it suitable for a wide range of professional and personal audio applications.</p><p>Its compact and portable design allows for easy transportation and setup, making it an excellent choice for users who require powerful sound performance in a mobile format.</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Audio Performance</strong></td><td>Output Power</td><td>Max 220W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Amplifier Type</td><td>Class D Amplifier</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Total Harmonic Distortion (THD)</td><td>Less than 0.5%</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Frequency Response</td><td>60Hz – 20KHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Speaker</strong></td><td>Woofer</td><td>8-inch Full-Range Speaker</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tweeter</td><td>1-inch Tweeter Horn</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Microphone Support</strong></td><td>Included Microphone</td><td>1 x Wireless Handheld Microphone</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Compatible Microphones</td><td>Wireless Handheld, Lavalier, Headset &amp; Wired Microphones</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Wireless Connectivity</strong></td><td>Bluetooth Version</td><td>Bluetooth 5.0</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Wireless Audio Streaming</td><td>Supported</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sound Effects</strong></td><td>Echo Control</td><td>Adjustable</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Reverb Control</td><td>Adjustable</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Battery</strong></td><td>Battery Type</td><td>Rechargeable Lithium Battery</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Battery Capacity</td><td>21.6V / 4.9Ah</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Charging Time</td><td>Approximately 5 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Standby Time</td><td>Up to 10 Hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Source</td><td>Rechargeable Battery</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design</strong></td><td>Portability</td><td>Portable PA System</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Application</td><td>Public Speaking, Training, Classrooms, Events, Presentations, Religious Gatherings</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Warranty</td><td>1 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 79000.00, 80000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/tQ8poxuoHS03XYTjrV7Wb6TJm3wSDpYC4ahL6JYW.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-23 11:59:11', '2026-06-23 11:59:11', 'TEV TA-680D 220W Portable PA System with 1 Hand Mic Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the TEV TA-680D 220W Portable PA System with 1 Hand Mic in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features Bluetooth 5.0, 8-inch speaker, rechargeable lithium battery, wireless microphone support, echo and reverb controls, and powerful 220W audio output with a 1-year warranty.', 'TEV TA-680D, TEV TA-680D PA System, Portable PA System Bangladesh, 220W PA Speaker, Wireless Microphone Speaker, Bluetooth PA System, TEV Portable Speaker, Rechargeable PA System, Public Address System, TEV Audio System', NULL, 326, NULL, NULL),
(796, 'TEV TA-380 80W Portable PA System (2 Hand )', 'TEV TA-380 80W Portable PA System with 1 wireless handheld microphone and 1 wireless headset microphone, featuring an 80W Class D amplifier, 6.5-inch full-range speaker, UHF wireless technology, rechargeable lithium battery, and up to 10 hours of standby time for presentations, training, and public speaking.', 'tev-ta-380-80w-portable-pa-system-2-hand-1782216442', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The TEV TA-380 80W Portable PA System is a compact, powerful, and versatile audio solution designed for educators, trainers, presenters, tour guides, event organizers, and public speakers. Its lightweight hand-carry design and reliable wireless performance make it ideal for both indoor and outdoor applications.</p><p>Powered by an advanced Class D amplifier, the TEV TA-380 delivers 80W RMS output power with a peak power capability of up to 125W, ensuring clear and dynamic sound projection. With a total harmonic distortion (THD) of less than 0.1%, the system produces clean and accurate audio suitable for speech and music applications.</p><p>The system features a high-performance 6.5-inch full-range speaker that delivers balanced sound reproduction across a wide frequency response range of 60Hz to 20KHz ±3dB. This allows users to enjoy clear vocals, detailed audio, and excellent coverage in classrooms, conference rooms, training centers, and outdoor gatherings.</p><p>The TEV TA-380 comes equipped with one wireless handheld microphone and one wireless headset microphone, providing flexibility for different presentation and communication needs. Its PLL synthesized UHF receiver technology ensures stable wireless transmission with minimal interference, offering either 100-channel or 16-channel wireless operation depending on the receiver configuration.</p><p>For extended portability, the PA system incorporates a rechargeable 14.8V/3.5Ah lithium battery that can provide approximately 10 hours of standby time after a full 4-hour charge. This makes it an ideal choice for mobile presentations and events where access to power outlets may be limited.</p><p>The TEV TA-380 supports multiple audio input and output options, including a 6.3mm microphone input for wired microphones, RCA audio input, RCA audio output, and speaker output connections. These connectivity options provide greater flexibility for integrating external audio sources and sound systems.</p><p>Combining portability, reliable wireless performance, excellent sound quality, and long battery life, the TEV TA-380 Portable PA System is a dependable solution for professional and educational audio applications.</p><p><strong>Buy TEV TA-380 80W Portable PA System from International Office Solution</strong></p><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original TEV TA-380 80W Portable PA System (1 Hand Mic + 1 Head Mic) from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>. We offer a complete range of professional PA systems, wireless microphone solutions, and audio equipment at competitive prices. Contact <strong>International Office Solution</strong> today to get genuine TEV audio products with reliable service and support. The TEV TA-380 Portable PA System comes with a <strong>1-Year Warranty</strong>.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Audio Performance</strong></td><td>Output Power</td><td>80W RMS (125W Peak)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Amplifier Type</td><td>Class D Amplifier</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Total Harmonic Distortion (THD)</td><td>Less than 0.1%</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Frequency Response</td><td>60Hz – 20KHz ±3dB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Speaker</strong></td><td>Driver Size</td><td>6.5-inch Full-Range Speaker</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Microphone System</strong></td><td>Included Microphones</td><td>1 Wireless Handheld Mic + 1 Wireless Headset Mic</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Wireless Technology</td><td>UHF PLL Synthesized Receiver</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Wireless Channels</td><td>Up to 100 Channels / 16 Channels (Model Dependent)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio Inputs</strong></td><td>Microphone Input</td><td>6.3mm Jack (Dynamic Mic)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Line Input</td><td>RCA Audio Input</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio Outputs</strong></td><td>Audio Output</td><td>RCA Output</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Speaker Output</td><td>Supported</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Battery</strong></td><td>Battery Type</td><td>Rechargeable Lithium Battery</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Battery Capacity</td><td>14.8V / 3.5Ah</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Charging Time</td><td>Approximately 4 Hours</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Standby Time</td><td>Up to 10 Hours</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Supply</strong></td><td>Adapter Type</td><td>Switching Power Adapter</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design</strong></td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Hand Carry Portable PA System</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Applications</strong></td><td>Suitable For</td><td>Presentations, Training, Classrooms, Events, Public Speaking, Religious Gatherings</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Warranty</td><td>1 Year Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PA System', 60000.00, 60000.00, NULL, 9, 'products/thumbnails/LFMKlmOCwIDLpgMHyjUVhHMVUWG7eLDFV4UCyzwK.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-23 12:07:22', '2026-06-23 12:07:22', 'TEV TA-380 80W Portable PA System with Hand Mic & Head Mic Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the TEV TA-380 80W Portable PA System with 1 Hand Mic and 1 Head Mic in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features 80W output power, UHF wireless microphones, 6.5-inch speaker, rechargeable lithium battery, multiple audio inputs, and a 1-year warranty.', 'TEV TA-380, TEV TA-380 PA System, Portable PA System Bangladesh, Wireless PA Speaker, Hand Carry PA System, UHF Wireless Microphone System, TEV Portable Speaker, Classroom PA System, Rechargeable PA System, Public Address System', NULL, 326, NULL, NULL);
