(797, 'TEV TA-780D 300W Portable PA System (3 W 1 Hand Mic)', 'TEV TA-780D 300W Portable PA System with a 10-inch full-range speaker, wireless handheld microphone, Bluetooth 5.0 connectivity, rechargeable lithium battery, adjustable echo and reverb effects, and powerful audio output for events, presentations, and public speaking.', 'tev-ta-780d-300w-portable-pa-system-3-w-1-hand-mic-1782216999', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The TEV TA-780D 300W Portable PA System is a professional-grade portable sound solution designed to deliver powerful, clear, and reliable audio performance for a wide range of applications. Whether used for public speaking, educational institutions, religious gatherings, corporate events, training sessions, outdoor programs, or entertainment purposes, this portable PA system offers exceptional sound quality and user-friendly functionality.</p><p>Built around an advanced Class D amplifier design, the TEV TA-780D delivers high-efficiency audio amplification while maintaining low power consumption and minimal distortion. With total harmonic distortion (THD) below 0.5%, the system produces clean, natural sound reproduction for both voice and music applications.</p><p>The TEV TA-780D features a powerful 10-inch full-range speaker combined with a high-performance tweeter horn that delivers balanced audio across a wide frequency response range of 60Hz to 20KHz. This combination ensures rich bass, detailed midrange frequencies, and crisp high-frequency reproduction, providing excellent sound coverage for both indoor and outdoor environments.</p><p>For enhanced versatility, the system includes Bluetooth 5.0 technology, allowing users to stream audio wirelessly from smartphones, tablets, laptops, and other Bluetooth-enabled devices. Adjustable echo and reverb controls further improve vocal presentations, making the PA system ideal for speeches, teaching, karaoke, announcements, and live performances.</p><p>The TEV TA-780D comes with one wireless handheld microphone and supports additional microphone options, including wireless headset microphones, wireless lavalier microphones, and wired microphones. This flexibility enables users to adapt the system to various professional and educational requirements.</p><p>Powering the system is a built-in rechargeable 21.6V/4.9Ah lithium battery that offers up to 10 hours of standby operation on a full charge. The battery requires approximately 5 hours to recharge, ensuring dependable performance for extended events and mobile applications.</p><p>Designed for portability and convenience, the TEV TA-780D combines powerful audio output, wireless connectivity, long battery life, and flexible microphone support in a compact and durable enclosure, making it an excellent choice for users who require professional sound reinforcement on the go</p><p><strong>Buy TEV TA-780D 300W Portable PA System from International Office Solution</strong></p><p>In Bangladesh, you can purchase the original TEV TA-780D 300W Portable PA System (1 Hand Mic) from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>. We offer a complete range of professional PA systems, wireless microphone solutions, and portable audio equipment at competitive prices. Contact <strong>International Office Solution</strong> today to get genuine TEV audio products with reliable service and support. The TEV TA-780D Portable PA System comes with a <strong>1-Year Warranty</strong>.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Audio Performance</strong></td><td>Output Power</td><td>300W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Amplifier Type</td><td>Class D Amplifier</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Total Harmonic Distortion (THD)</td><td>Less than 0.5%</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Frequency Response</td><td>60Hz – 20KHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Speaker</strong></td><td>Woofer</td><td>10-inch Full-Range Speaker</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tweeter</td><td>High-