 is designed to operate reliably under various environmental conditions, with an operating temperature range of 10°C to 32.5°C (50°F to 90.5°F) and a storage temperature range of -20°C to 40°C (-4°F to 104°F). Additionally, it supports a non-operating humidity range of 10% to 90% RH, ensuring dependable performance and long-term durability.</p><p>By choosing Original HP Toner cartridges, users benefit from superior print quality, dependable performance, and the assurance of genuine HP products. The HP 207A Yellow Original LaserJet Toner helps maintain the longevity and efficiency of your printer while delivering professional results for every printing task.</p><h2>Buy HP 207A Yellow Original LaserJet Toner from International Office Solution</h2><p>Purchase the genuine HP 207A Yellow Original LaserJet Toner from International Office Solution, a trusted supplier of original printing solutions in Bangladesh. We offer a wide range of HP toner cartridges and printer accessories to meet the needs of businesses, organizations, and individual users. Order online or contact International Office Solution to get authentic HP toner products at competitive prices with professional customer support. The HP 207A Yellow Original LaserJet Toner comes with no manufacturer warranty.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Printing Technology</td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Printing Color</td><td>Yellow</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Supported Printer</td><td>HP Color LaserJet Pro M255dw (7KW64A), HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP M282nw (7KW72A), HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP M283fdn (7KW74A), HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP M283fdw (7KW75A)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Page Yield</td><td>Up to 1,250 Pages</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Toner', 10500.00