(806, 'Pantum TL-410H Toner Black', 'Pantum TL-410H Black Toner Cartridge is a high-performance genuine toner cartridge designed for Pantum laser printers. It delivers crisp black text and professional-quality prints with an approximate yield of 3,000 pages (based on ISO 19752 standards). Compatible with the DL-410 Series Drum Unit, it offers a cost-effective printing solution by allowing separate replacement of the toner and drum. Available at International Office Solution.', 'pantum-tl-410h-toner-black-1782409678', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Pantum TL-410H Black Toner Cartridge</strong></h2><p>The <strong>Pantum TL-410H Black Toner Cartridge</strong> is a reliable and efficient printing solution designed to meet the needs of offices, businesses, educational institutions, and home users who require consistent print quality and dependable performance. Available through <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, this genuine Pantum toner cartridge delivers sharp black text, clear graphics, and professional-looking documents for everyday printing tasks.</p><p>With a page yield of approximately <strong>3,000 pages</strong> at 5% coverage based on <strong>ISO 19752</strong> standards, the TL-410H toner helps reduce printing interruptions and improve productivity. Whether you are printing reports, invoices, contracts, presentations, or other business documents, this toner ensures excellent print clarity from the first page to the last.</p><p>One of the key advantages of the Pantum TL-410H is its compatibility with the <strong>DL-410 Series Drum Unit</strong>, which is sold separately. The independent toner-and-drum design allows users to replace only the component that has reached the end of its life, resulting in lower maintenance costs and greater long-term savings.</p><p>Manufactured to Pantum\'s quality standards, the TL-410H toner cartridge is engineered to provide smooth printer operation, minimize toner waste, and maintain consistent print performance throughout its lifecycle. It is an ideal choice for organizations seeking dependable printing solutions without compromising on quality.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li>Genuine Pantum toner cartridge</li><li>High-quality black printing output</li><li>Approximate yield of up to 3,000 pages</li><li>ISO 19752 certified page yield standard</li><li>Compatible with DL-410 Series Drum Unit</li><li>Cost-effective separate toner and drum system</li><li>Reliable and consistent print performance</li><li>Suitable for office, business, and home use</li></ul><h3><strong>Compatible Printer Models</strong></h3><ul><li>Pantum P3010 Series</li><li>Pantum P3300 Series</li><li>Pantum M6700 Series</li><li>Pantum M6800 Series</li><li>Pantum M7100 Series</li><li>Pantum M7200 Series</li><li>Why Buy from International Office Solution? International Office Solution provides genuine printing supplies and office equipment with professional customer support and competitive pricing. By choosing authentic Pantum consumables, customers can ensure optimal printer performance, better print quality, and longer printer life.</li><li>For businesses looking for a dependable toner solution, the Pantum TL-410H Black Toner Cartridge offers an excellent combination of quality, efficiency, and value.</li></ul>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Specification</th><th>Details</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Product Name</td><td>Pantum TL-410H Toner Cartridge</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>Page Yield</td><td>Up to 3,000 Pages</td></tr><tr><td>Yield Standard</td><td>ISO 19752</td></tr><tr><td>Compatible Drum</td><td>DL-410 Series</td></tr><tr><td>Cartridge Type</td><td>Laser Toner Cartridge</td></tr><tr><td>Brand</td><td>Pantum</td></tr><tr><td>Availability</td><td>International Office Solution</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Toner', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/xwhcY6d1Zme58wkFEYz8uNZkcjrN7FRKk82WNDKg.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 1, '2026-06-25 17:47:58', '2026-06-25 17:54:38', 'Pantum TL-410H Black Toner Cartridge Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the genuine Pantum TL-410H Black Toner Cartridge from International Office Solution. Delivers up to 3,000 pages, compatible with DL-410 drum unit and selected Pantum laser printers for reliable, high-quality printing.', 'Pantum TL-410H Toner, Pantum TL-410H Black Toner, Pantum Toner Cartridge Bangladesh, Pantum Printer Toner, Pantum DL-410 Drum Unit, Pantum P3010 Toner, Pantum M7100 Toner, Pantum M7200 Toner, International Office Solution, Genuine Pantum Toner', NULL, 259, NULL, NULL),
