(809, 'Pantum TL-5130XT Black Toner', 'The Pantum TL-5130XT Black Toner is a genuine high-capacity laser toner cartridge designed for Pantum 5120, 5130, and 5140 series printers. Delivering up to 15,000 pages, it produces sharp black text, consistent print quality, and reliable performance for home, office, and commercial printing. Its low-waste toner technology improves efficiency while reducing operating costs.', 'pantum-tl-5130xt-black-toner-1782471303', '<p>The <strong>Pantum TL-5130XT Black Toner</strong> is a premium high-yield laser toner cartridge engineered to deliver exceptional print quality, outstanding reliability, and consistent performance for demanding printing environments. Designed for businesses, corporate offices, educational institutions, and home users with high-volume printing requirements, this original Pantum toner ensures every page is produced with sharp black text, crisp lines, and professional-grade clarity.</p><p>With an impressive page yield of <strong>up to 15,000 pages</strong> (based on ISO/IEC standards), the Pantum TL-5130XT minimizes downtime by reducing the frequency of cartridge replacements. Its high-capacity design helps improve productivity while lowering the overall cost per page, making it an economical solution for organizations that print large volumes of documents daily.</p><p>Manufactured using advanced laser printing technology and high-quality toner powder, the cartridge delivers consistent print density from the first page to the last. Whether you\'re printing business reports, contracts, invoices, presentations, forms, or other important office documents, the Pantum TL-5130XT produces professional-quality output with deep black tones and clean, readable text.</p><p>The toner features low-waste powder technology, which optimizes toner consumption while reducing excess waste. This efficient design not only maximizes cartridge performance but also contributes to a more environmentally responsible printing process.</p>