(811, 'Pantum DL-5120 Drum Unit', 'The Pantum DL-5120 Drum Unit is an original imaging drum designed for Pantum BP5100DN, BP5100DW, and BM5100FDW laser printers. Featuring a durable OPC drum, separate drum and toner design, easy installation, and consistent high-quality printing, it provides reliable performance while reducing overall printing costs.', 'pantum-dl-5120-drum-unit-1782472896', '<p>The <strong>Pantum DL-5120 Drum Unit</strong> is an original imaging drum designed to deliver exceptional print quality, long-lasting performance, and reliable operation for compatible Pantum monochrome laser printers. Built with a durable OPC (Organic Photoconductor) drum, it ensures crisp text, sharp graphics, and consistent print quality throughout its service life, making it an ideal choice for offices, businesses, and professional printing environments.</p><p>Designed for seamless compatibility with the <strong>Pantum BP5100DN, BP5100DW, and BM5100FDW</strong> laser printers, the DL-5120 Drum Unit works together with genuine Pantum toner cartridges to produce professional-quality documents with every print. Its precision-engineered construction helps maintain stable printer performance while reducing maintenance requirements and minimizing downtime.</p><p>The Pantum DL-5120 features a <strong>separate drum and toner cartridge design</strong>, allowing users to replace only the component that reaches the end of its life. This lowers printing costs, reduces consumable waste, and provides a more economical printing solution compared to integrated cartridge systems. In addition, the drum unit utilizes low-waste technology for cleaner, odor-free printing and supports environmentally responsible operation.</p><p>Engineered for easy installation and replacement, the Pantum DL-5120 Drum Unit helps maintain optimal printer performance with minimal effort. Its lifespan is calculated based on standard printing conditions (three A4/Letter-size pages per print job with approximately 5% page coverage). Actual drum life may vary depending on print volume, document coverage, operating environment, and user printing habits.</p><p>Whether you are printing business reports, contracts, invoices, or everyday office documents, the genuine Pantum DL-5120 Drum Unit delivers reliable, high-quality results that keep your printer operating at peak performance.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Buy Pantum DL-5120 Drum Unit from International Office Solution</h2><p>Purchase the <strong>original Pantum DL-5120 Drum Unit</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted supplier of genuine Pantum printer consumables in Bangladesh. We offer authentic drum units that ensure outstanding print quality, reliable printer performance, and long service life. Whether for home, office, or commercial printing, International Office Solution provides competitive pricing, genuine products, and professional customer support. Contact our sales team or order online to get the best value on original Pantum printer supplies. The Pantum DL-5120 Drum Unit comes with <strong>no manufacturer warranty</strong>.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Basic Information</td><td>Product Type</td><td>Drum Unit</td></tr><tr><td>Basic Information</td><td>Printing Technology</td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td>Basic Information</td><td>Printing Color</td><td>Black (Monochrome)</td></tr><tr><td>Basic Information</td><td>Compatible Toner</td><td>Pantum TL-5120 Series Toner Cartridges</td></tr><tr><td>Basic Information</td><td>Supported Printer</td><td>Pantum BP5100DN, BP5100DW, BM5100FDW</td></tr><tr><td>Performance</td><td>Drum Type</td><td>Organic Photoconductor (OPC) Drum</td></tr><tr><td>Performance</td><td>Print Quality</td><td>Sharp text and consistent monochrome output</td></tr><tr><td>Performance</td><td>Drum &amp; Toner System</td><td>Sepa