(819, 'Pantum DL-410 Drum Unit', 'The Pantum DL-410 Drum Unit is an original imaging drum with a 12,000-page yield, compatible with Pantum P3010, P3300, M6700, M6800, M7100, M7200, and M7300 series laser printers. It features a durable OPC drum that delivers consistent, high-quality prints and reliable performance.', 'pantum-dl-410-drum-unit-1782483319', '<p>The <strong>Pantum DL-410 Drum Unit</strong> is an original imaging drum designed to deliver exceptional print quality, long-lasting durability, and reliable performance for compatible Pantum monochrome laser printers. Built with a premium <strong>OPC (Organic Photoconductor) drum</strong>, it produces sharp text, crisp graphics, and consistent print quality throughout its lifespan, making it an excellent choice for home users, offices, educational institutions, and commercial printing environments.</p><p>Designed to work seamlessly with compatible Pantum toner cartridges, the Pantum DL-410 Drum Unit helps maintain optimal printer performance while ensuring professional-quality output on every page. With an impressive drum life of <strong>up to 12,000 pages</strong> (based on ISO/IEC 19752 standards at approximately 5% page coverage), it minimizes maintenance and replacement frequency, helping reduce overall printing costs.</p><p>The DL-410 Drum Unit is compatible with a wide range of Pantum laser printers, including <strong>Pantum P3010D, P3010DW, P3300DN, P3300DW, M6700D, M6700DW, M6800FDW, M6802FDW, M7100DN, M7100DW, M7200FD, M7200FDN, M7200FDW, M7300FDN, and M7300FDW</strong>. Its precision-engineered design ensures quick installation, seamless integration, and dependable operation for uninterrupted productivity.</p><p>Featuring a durable OPC imaging drum, the DL-410 consistently delivers clean, professional-quality documents with outstanding print clarity from the first page to the last. Whether you\'re printing reports, invoices, contracts, business documents, or everyday paperwork, this genuine Pantum dru