(824, 'APOLLO 650VA 300W UPS', 'The APOLLO 650VA 300W UPS is a dependable offline UPS designed to provide uninterrupted power backup for desktop PCs, routers, CCTV systems, and other essential electronics. Featuring a 650VA / 300W capacity, 12V 7Ah battery, built-in Automatic Voltage Regulator (AVR), and a 2ms transfer time, it protects your devices from power outages and voltage fluctuations. Compact, lightweight, and easy to use, it\'s an ideal backup solution for both home and office environments. Buy the genuine APOLLO 650VA 300W UPS from International Office Solution for competitive pricing, reliable customer support, and trusted after-sales service.', 'apollo-650va-300w-ups-1782533927', '<p>The <strong>APOLLO 650VA 300W UPS</strong> is a dependable offline Uninterruptible Power Supply (UPS) designed to safeguard your valuable electronic devices from unexpected power failures, voltage fluctuations, and electrical disturbances. Whether you are working from home, managing a business office, or protecting networking equipment, this UPS delivers reliable backup power to keep your essential devices running and allows sufficient time to save important files and safely shut down your system during outages.</p><p>With a <strong>650VA / 300W power capacity</strong>, the APOLLO UPS is ideal for desktop computers, monitors, routers, modems, POS systems, CCTV equipment, and other low-power electronic devices. It is equipped with a high-quality <strong>12V 7Ah sealed lead-acid battery</strong> that provides dependable backup performance and quick recovery after charging.</p><h2>Reliable Voltage Protection</h2><p>One of the key advantages of the APOLLO 650VA UPS is its <strong>built-in Automatic Voltage Regulator (AVR)</strong>. The AVR automatically stabilizes incoming voltage by correcting both high and low voltage conditions without switching to battery power unnecessarily. This not only protects connected equipment but also helps extend battery life by reducing frequent battery usage.</p><h2>Fast Backup Response</h2><p>The UPS features an ultra-fast <strong>2ms transfer time</strong>, allowing connected devices to switch from utility power to battery backup almost instantly during power interruptions. This rapid response minimizes downtime and helps prevent data loss or unexpected system shutdowns.</p><h2>Compact and User-Friendly Design</h2><p>Designed for convenience, the APOLLO 650VA UPS offers a compact and lightweight construction, weighing approximately <strong>4kg</strong>, making it easy to install in homes, offices, retail stores, educational institutions, and small businesses. Its space-saving design fits comfortably on or under a desk while providing reliable daily performance.</p><h2>Stable Performance</h2><p>Operating with an <strong>input voltage of 240V AC</strong> and <strong>output voltage of 240V AC</strong> at <strong>60Hz frequency</strong>, the APOLLO UPS delivers consistent and stable power for sensitive electronic equipment. Its durable internal components are engineered for dependable operation in everyday working environments.</p><h2>Key Features</h2><ul><li>650VA / 300W power capacity</li><li>Offline UPS technology</li><li>Built-in Automatic Voltage Regulator (AVR)</li><li>12V 7Ah sealed lead-acid battery</li><li>Approximately 2ms transfer time</li><li>240V AC input and output</li><li>60Hz operating frequency</li><li>Compact and lightweight 4kg design</li><li>Ideal for desktops, routers, CCTV systems, POS machines, and office equipment</li><li>Provides protection against power outages, voltage fluctuations, and electrical disturbances</li></ul><h2>Warranty Information</h2><p>The APOLLO 650VA 300W UPS includes a <strong>1-Year Warranty</strong>.</p><h3>Warranty Exclusions</h3><p>The warranty does not cover damages resulting from:</p><ul><li>Lightning strikes, abnormal overload, insects, fire, or similar external causes.</li><li>Operating the UPS outside the recommended <strong>20°C to 26°C</strong> temperature range without proper humidity control.</li><li>Installation in excessively dusty, damp, or humid environments.</li><li>Improper battery charging caused by unsuitable power conditions or lack of proper generator connectivity.</li><li>Battery swelling or overcharging resulting from incorrect UPS voltage configuration or improper usage.</li></ul><h2>Why Buy from International Office Solution?</h2><p>When you purchase the <strong>APOLLO 650VA 300W UPS</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, you receive a genuine product backed by dependable customer service and professional after-sales support. International Office Solution is committed to providing authentic IT products, competitive pricing, prompt delivery, and reliable technical assistance, making it a trusted destination for businesses, educational institutions, and home users alike. Choose International Office Solution for quality products and a hassle-free buying experience.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Input Features</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>650VA</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Output Voltage</td><td>240V ac</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency (Battery Mode)</td><td>60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>60Hz</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Output Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Voltage Range</td><td>240V</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ups', 3750.00, 3750.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/kUqk0QbblIcuTLGC4J2fEcZeHzW9v0IEpWT6ouvQ.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-27 04:18:47', '2026-06-27 04:18:47', 'APOLLO 650VA 300W UPS with Built-in Stabilizer Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the APOLLO 650VA 300W UPS with Built-in Stabilizer at the best price in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features 650VA/300W capacity, 12V 7Ah battery, AVR, 2ms transfer time, and a 1-year warranty. Ideal for desktops, routers, CCTV systems, and office equipment.', 'APOLLO 650VA UPS, APOLLO 300W UPS, APOLLO UPS Bangladesh, APOLLO UPS Price in Bangladesh, Offline UPS, 650VA UPS, 300W UPS, UPS with AVR, Built-in Stabilizer UPS, Desktop UPS, Computer UPS, Router UPS, CCTV UPS, Power Backup UPS, 12V 7Ah UPS Battery, Office UPS, Home UPS, Best UPS Bangladesh, APOLLO UPS Price, International Office Solution', NULL, 68, NULL, NULL);
