(825, 'APOLLO 1120F/1120 1200VA Offline UPS', 'The APOLLO 1120F/1120 1200VA Offline UPS is a dependable power backup solution designed to protect desktop computers, networking devices, CCTV systems, and other essential electronics from unexpected power interruptions and voltage fluctuations. Featuring a 1200VA capacity, dual 12V 7Ah batteries, a built-in Automatic Voltage Regulator (AVR), and an ultra-fast 2ms transfer time, it delivers stable and uninterrupted performance for both home and office environments. Its wide input voltage support ensures reliable operation even in areas with unstable electricity. Purchase the genuine APOLLO 1120F/1120 1200VA Offline UPS from International Office Solution to enjoy competitive pricing, authentic products, and reliable after-sales service.', 'apollo-1120f1120-1200va-offline-ups-1782533975', '<p>The APOLLO 1120F/1120 1200VA Offline UPS is engineered to provide reliable backup power and comprehensive protection for your valuable electronic equipment. Whether you\'re working from home, running a business, or managing essential networking devices, this UPS helps prevent data loss and hardware damage caused by sudden power outages, voltage fluctuations, and electrical disturbances. With a robust 1200VA capacity and dual 12V 7Ah sealed lead-acid batteries, it offers longer backup time and dependable performance for desktop computers, routers, CCTV systems, POS terminals, and other office equipment. Its built-in Automatic Voltage Regulator (AVR) continuously stabilizes incoming voltage by correcting high and low voltage conditions without frequently switching to battery power, helping extend battery life while ensuring uninterrupted operation. The fast 2ms transfer time allows connected devices to transition almost instantly to battery mode during power failures, minimizing downtime and protecting sensitive electronics from unexpected shutdowns. Supporting a wide input voltage range from 100V to 240V AC and delivering a stable 240V output at 60Hz, the APOLLO 1120F/1120 is well-suited for locations where power quality is inconsistent. Its compact and durable design makes installation easy in homes, offices, educational institutions, and retail environments. Backed by a one-year warranty, this UPS offers peace of mind and dependable performance for everyday use. For genuine products, competitive prices, fast delivery, and trusted customer support, choose <strong>International Office Solution</strong> as your reliable source for the APOLLO 1120F/1120 1200VA Offline UPS.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Main Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Capacity</td><td>1200VA</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency (Battery Mode)</td><td>60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Noise Level</td><td>EMI/RFI full time suppression</td></tr><tr><td>Battery</td><td>2 PCS Lead-Acid maintenance-free</td></tr><tr><td>Alarm</td><td>On Battery, Battery Low and Overload</td></tr><tr><td>Indications</td><td>AC Normal: Green LED Steadily; Backup: Yellow LED intermittently</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Input Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>50Hz or 60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Voltage Range</td><td>100/110/120/220/230/240VAC Nominal -25%+25%</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Output Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Backup Time</td><td>10-30 minutes depending on load connected</td></tr><tr><td>Type of Wave</td><td>PWM Simulated Sine wave</td></tr><tr><td>Transfer Time</td><td>2ms typical; 5ms maximum</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacture Warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 Year<br>Under the following conditions, the warranty would not be provided:<br>• UPS burning due to thunder, abnormal overload, insect entrance and others.<br>• If ambient temperature should not be maintained at 20 to 26 degrees Celsius with proper dehumidification. (24/7)<br>• If the product is placed in a dusty and damp place.<br>• In the absence of Generator connectivity Without proper battery charge, the warranty will be void.<br>• Battery swelling and overcharging due to the wrong system voltage setting of the UPS.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ups', 7200.00, 7200.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/70VIiEnM7A7u7telzBoDljKqxfFkIjtcTe2jA27O.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-27 04:19:35', '2026-06-27 04:22:07', 'APOLLO 1120F/1120 1200VA Offline UPS Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the APOLLO 1120F/1120 1200VA Offline UPS at the best price in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features dual 12V 7Ah batteries, built-in AVR, fast 2ms transfer time, stable power protection, and a 1-year warranty.', 'APOLLO 1120F UPS, APOLLO 1120 UPS, APOLLO 1200VA UPS, APOLLO Offline UPS, APOLLO UPS Price in Bangladesh, 1200VA UPS, Offline UPS Bangladesh, UPS with AVR, Computer UPS, Desktop UPS, Router UPS, CCTV UPS, Office UPS, Power Backup UPS, Dual Battery UPS, APOLLO UPS Bangladesh, Best UPS Price Bangladesh, International Office Solution', NULL, 68, NULL, NULL),
(826, 'Apollo 2000VA Offline UPS', 'The Apollo 2000VA Offline UPS is a high-performance power backup solution designed to keep your critical electronic devices running during unexpected power failures and voltage fluctuations. With a robust 2000VA output capacity, four maintenance-free 12V/7.2Ah batteries, and an ultra-fast less than 2ms transfer time, this UPS provides reliable protection for desktop computers, servers, PABX systems, printers, networking devices, CCTV systems, and office equipment. Its built-in surge protection, EMI/RFI noise filtering, and advanced safety features ensure stable power delivery and enhanced equipment protection. Ideal for both home and commercial environments, the Apollo 2000VA Offline UPS offers dependable performance and peace of mind. Purchase the genuine product from International Office Solution for competitive pricing, authentic products, and professional after-sales support.', 'apollo-2000va-offline-ups-1782534220', '<p>The <strong>Apollo 2000VA Offline UPS</strong> is engineered to deliver dependable backup power and comprehensive protection for valuable electronic equipment in homes, offices, educational institutions, and commercial environments. Designed with a powerful <strong>2000VA capacity</strong>, this offline UPS ensures uninterrupted operation during sudden power outages, voltage fluctuations, and electrical disturbances, helping prevent data loss and protecting sensitive hardware from unexpected shutdowns. Whether you need reliable backup for desktop computers, networking equipment, PABX systems, intercoms, printers, fax machines, CCTV systems, or other essential electronics, the Apollo 2000VA Offline UPS provides consistent performance you can trust.</p><p>Operating with an input voltage of <strong>220VAC</strong> and supporting both <strong>50Hz and 60Hz</strong> frequencies, this UPS delivers a stable <strong>220VAC output</strong> using PWM simulated sine wave technology for smooth and reliable power distribution. Its exceptionally fast <strong>transfer time of less than 2 milliseconds</strong> allows connected devices to switch almost instantly from utility power to battery backup, minimizing interruptions and ensuring continuous productivity. Depending on the connected load, the UPS offers approximately <strong>15 to 30 minutes of backup time</strong>, allowing users enough time to save important work and safely power down equipment during extended outages.</p><p>The Apollo 2000VA Offline UPS is equipped with <strong>four maintenance-free 12V/7.2Ah sealed lead-acid batteries</strong>, providing dependable backup performance and long-lasting reliability. The batteries recharge to approximately 90% capacity within <strong>8 hours</strong>, ensuring the UPS is quickly ready for the next power interruption. Its intelligent battery management system helps maximize battery life while maintaining efficient charging performance.</p><p>Designed with advanced protection features, the UPS safeguards connected equipment against over-voltage, under-voltage, overload, short circuits, low battery conditions, and sudden power surges. Built-in <strong>EMI/RFI filtering</strong> reduces electrical noise for cleaner power output, while surge protection meeting <strong>IEEE standards</strong> provides an additional layer of security for sensitive electronics. Audible alarms and LED status indicators clearly display operating conditions, including AC power, battery mode, overload, low battery, and fault notifications, allowing users to monitor system status with ease.</p><p>For added flexibility, the Apollo 2000VA Offline UPS supports optional <strong>USB and DB9 communication interfaces</strong> for software monitoring and management. It also features <strong>cold start capability</strong>, allowing the UPS to power connected devices directly from the battery even when utility power is unavailable. Operating efficiently within temperatures ranging from <strong>0°C to 40°C</strong> and humidity levels of up to <strong>90% non-condensing</strong>, this UPS is built for dependable performance across a wide range of environments.</p><p>The Apollo 2000VA Offline UPS combines reliable backup power, intelligent protection features, durable battery performance, and user-friendly operation, making it an excellent investment for professionals and businesses seeking uninterrupted power for their critical equipment. Purchase the genuine <strong>Apollo 2000VA Offline UPS</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> to enjoy competitive pricing, authentic products, fast nationwide delivery, and dependable after-sales support from a trusted IT solutions provider.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Main Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Capacity</td><td>2000VA</td></tr><tr><td>Load Capacity</td><td>900W</td></tr><tr><td>Input Voltage</td><td>220VAC ± 20~35% (Customizable)</td></tr><tr><td>Output Voltage</td><td>220VAC ± 3~8%</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency (Battery Mode)</td><td>50 Hz or 60Hz ± 1Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Noise Level</td><td>EMI/RFI full time suppression</td></tr><tr><td>Battery</td><td>Types: Lead-Acid maintenance-free<br>DC Bus: 12V/7.2A<br>Number: 4 PCS<br>Recharge Time: Typically 8 hours to 90% Charged<br>Backup Time: 15~30 Minutes Depending on load connected (Long Backup Optional)</td></tr><tr><td>Alarm</td><td>Beeping Alarm</td></tr><tr><td>Indications</td><td>AC Mode: Green lighting<br>Battery Mode: Red lighting<br>Over Load: Yellow lighting</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Input Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>50Hz or 60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Voltage Range</td><td>220VAC ± 20~35% (Customizable)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Output Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Backup Time</td><td>15~30 Minutes Depending on load connected (Long Backup Optional)</td></tr><tr><td>Voltage Range</td><td>220VAC ± 3~8%</td></tr><tr><td>Transfer Time</td><td>2ms</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Specification</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Dimension</td><td>165x228x483mm</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacture Warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year<br>Under the following conditions, the warranty would not be provided:<br>• UPS burning due to thunder, abnormal overload, insect entrance and others.<br>• If ambient temperature should not be maintained at 20 to 26 degrees Celsius with proper dehumidification. (24/7)<br>• If the product is placed in a dusty and damp place.<br>• In the absence of Generator connectivity Without proper battery charge, the warranty will be void.<br>• Battery swelling and overcharging due to the wrong system voltage setting of the UPS.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ups', 15700.00, 15700.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/pR0r3NP1xQmXvoebDxjnPz6Ftc0Rwea0hycKReL0.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-27 04:23:40', '2026-06-27 04:23:40', 'Apollo 2000VA Offline UPS Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Apollo 2000VA Offline UPS at the best price in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features 2000VA capacity, four 12V/7.2Ah batteries, fast transfer time, advanced protection, and a 1-year warranty.', 'Apollo 2000VA UPS, Apollo Offline UPS, Apollo UPS Bangladesh, 2000VA UPS Price Bangladesh, Offline UPS, Computer UPS, Office UPS, Desktop UPS, Server UPS, PABX UPS, CCTV UPS, Network UPS, UPS with Surge Protection, UPS with EMI RFI Filter, 2000VA Backup UPS, Power Backup Solution, Apollo UPS Price, International Office SolutionApollo 2000VA UPS, Apollo Offline UPS, Apollo UPS Bangladesh, 2000VA UPS Price Bangladesh, Offline UPS, Computer UPS, Office UPS, Desktop UPS, Server UPS, PABX UPS, CCTV UPS, Network UPS, UPS with Surge Protection, UPS with EMI RFI Filter, 2000VA Backup UPS, Power Backup Solution, Apollo UPS Price, International Office SolutionApollo 2000VA UPS, Apollo Offline UPS, Apollo UPS Bangladesh, 2000VA UPS Price Bang