(828, 'Apollo 1240 2000VA Offline UPS with Metal Body', 'The Apollo 1240 2000VA Offline UPS with Metal Body is a powerful and durable backup power solution designed to keep your critical devices protected during power outages and voltage fluctuations. Featuring a 2000VA capacity, four maintenance-free lead-acid batteries, a rugged metal body, and a built-in Automatic Voltage Regulator (AVR), this UPS delivers stable and reliable power for desktop computers, servers, networking equipment, CCTV systems, and office electronics. With a fast 2–4ms transfer time, pure sine wave output, LCD display, and backup time of up to 35–40 minutes depending on the load, it ensures uninterrupted productivity. Buy the genuine Apollo 1240 2000VA Offline UPS from International Office Solution for authentic products, competitive prices, and dependable after-sales support.', 'apollo-1240-2000va-offline-ups-with-metal-body-1782534403', '<p>The <strong>Apollo 1240 2000VA Offline UPS with Metal Body</strong> is a premium power backup solution engineered to provide dependable protection for sensitive electronic equipment in homes, offices, educational institutions, and commercial environments. Built with a robust <strong>2000VA capacity</strong>, this offline UPS ensures uninterrupted operation during sudden power failures, voltage fluctuations, and electrical disturbances, helping protect valuable devices from unexpected shutdowns and potential damage. Its rugged <strong>metal body construction</strong> enhances durability, making it an excellent choice for users who require a long-lasting and reliable UPS for daily operation.</p><p>Designed with advanced power management technology, the Apollo 1240 features a built-in <strong>Automatic Voltage Regulator (AVR)</strong> that automatically stabilizes incoming voltage by correcting both high and low voltage conditions without constantly switching to battery mode. This intelligent voltage regulation helps protect connected devices while extending battery life by reducing unnecessary battery usage. The UPS supports an <strong>input voltage range of 175V to 275VAC</strong> and delivers a stable <strong>220V/230VAC output</strong>, ensuring reliable performance even in areas with inconsistent power supply.</p><p>The Apollo 1240 utilizes <strong>pure sine wave output</strong>, making it suitable for powering sensitive electronics such as desktop computers, workstations, servers, networking equipment, CCTV systems, POS machines, communication devices, and other office equipment. Its rapid <strong>2–4 millisecond transfer time</strong> ensures an almost seamless transition from utility power to battery backup during outages, minimizing downtime and preventing data loss.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>four maintenance-free sealed lead-acid batteries</strong>, the UPS provides an impressive <strong>35 to 40 minutes of backup time</strong>, depending on the connected load. The batteries recharge to approximately <strong>90% capacity within six hours</strong>, allowing the UPS to recover quickly and remain prepared for future power interruptions. This combination of long backup duration and efficient charging makes it a dependable solution for business continuity and home office productivity.</p><p>For user convenience, the Apollo 1240 features both an <strong>LED indicator</strong> and an <strong>LCD display</strong>, allowing users to monitor important operating information such as input voltage, output voltage, battery status, and system performance in real time. The UPS also includes comprehensive protection features against overload, short circuits, high voltage, and low voltage, helping ensure the safety of both the UPS and connected equipment.</p><p>Designed to operate efficiently in demanding environments, the Apollo 1240 combines reliable performance, intelligent voltage regulation, durable construction, and advanced protection features in a compact and professional design. Whether you need reliable backup power for critical office equipment or protection for valuable electronics at home, this UPS offers exceptional performance and peace of mind.</p><p>The Apollo 1240 2000VA Offline UPS is backed by a <strong>1-year warranty</strong>, although the warranty does not cover damage caused by lightning, abnormal overload, insect infestation, improper operating temperatures, dusty or damp environments, incorrect generator connectivity, or battery damage resulting from improper voltage settings.</p><p>Purchase the genuine <strong>Apollo 1240 2000VA Offline UPS with Metal Body</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> to receive an authentic product, competitive pricing, fast delivery, and trusted after-sales support. International Office Solution is committed to providing reliable power backup solutions and professional customer service for businesses and individual users across Bangladesh.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Main Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Load Capacity</td><td>900W</td></tr><tr><td>Input Voltage</td><td>175-275 VAC</td></tr><tr><td>Output Voltage</td><td>220/230 VAC +/-10%</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency (Battery Mode)</td><td>50/60Hz +/-5%</td></tr><tr><td>Noise Level</td><td>Less than 40dB</td></tr><tr><td>Battery</td><td>2 Pcs with 12V &amp; 9Ah</td></tr><tr><td>Alarm</td><td>Beeping Alarm</td></tr><tr><td>Indications</td><td>AC Mode: Green lighting<br>Battery Mode: Red lighting<br>Over Load: Yellow lighting</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Input Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>50/60Hz +/-1 Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Voltage Range</td><td>220-240V</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Output Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Backup Time</td><td>Back up time(Full load): 10 - 15 Minutes<br>Back up time (Half load): 25 - 30 Minutes</td></tr><tr><td>Type of Wave</td><td>Simulated Sine Wave</td></tr><tr><td>Transfer Time</td><td>2-6 ms typical</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ups', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/f4vwTVQFwKJXaw5YRDcvZvRPT6PhUJ7W8gm6Uwen.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-27 04:26:43', '2026-06-27 04:26:43', 'Apollo 1240 2000VA Offline UPS with Metal Body Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Apollo 1240 2000VA Offline UPS with Metal Body at the best price in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features pure sine wave output, AVR, LCD display, 35–40 minutes backup, and a 1-year warranty.', 'Apollo 1240 UPS, Apollo 1240 2000VA UPS, Apollo 2000VA Offline UPS, Metal Body UPS, Apollo UPS Bangladesh, 2000VA UPS Price Bangladesh, Offline UPS, Pure Sine Wave UPS, UPS with AVR, LCD Display UPS, Computer UPS, Server UPS, CCTV UPS, Office UPS, Network UPS, Long Backup UPS, Power Backup Solution, International Office Solution', NULL, 68, NULL, NULL),
(829, 'MaxGreen MG-LI-KSP 850VA Offline UPS', 'The MaxGreen MG-LI-KSP 850VA Offline UPS is a reliable and compact power backup solution designed to protect desktop computers, routers, networking equipment, CCTV systems, and other essential electronics from unexpected power outages and voltage fluctuations. With an 850VA capacity and 480W load capacity, this UPS features a maintenance-free 12V/9Ah battery, simulated sine wave output, and an input voltage range of 140–290VAC for stable performance in varying power conditions. It provides up to 30 minutes of backup time, depending on the connected load, while operating quietly at less than 40dB. Purchase the genuine MaxGreen MG-LI-KSP 850VA Offline UPS from International Office Solution for authentic products, competitive pricing, and dependable after-sales support.', 'maxgreen-mg-li-ksp-850va-offline-ups-1782534643', '<p>The <strong>MaxGreen MG-LI-KSP 850VA Offline UPS</strong> is an efficient and dependable uninterruptible power supply designed to provide continuous power protection for homes, offices, and small businesses. Built with an <strong>850VA capacity</strong> and <strong>480W output</strong>, this offline UPS safeguards valuable electronic devices from sudden power failures, voltage fluctuations, surges, and electrical disturbances. Whether you need reliable backup for desktop computers, Wi-Fi routers, modems, CCTV systems, networking equipment, POS terminals, or other office electronics, the MaxGreen MG-LI-KSP ensures uninterrupted performance and helps prevent data loss or hardware damage during unexpected power interruptions.</p><p>Designed to perform reliably even in unstable power environments, the UPS supports a wide <strong>input voltage range of 140VAC to 290VAC</strong>, allowing it to automatically regulate varying utility voltages while maintaining a stable power supply. During battery operation, it delivers a consistent <strong>220VAC output</strong> with a <strong>50Hz ±1Hz frequency</strong>, ensuring connected devices continue operating smoothly until utility power is restored. The UPS utilizes a <strong>simulated sine wave output</strong>, making it suitable for most personal computers, networking equipment, security systems, and general office electronics.</p><p>The MaxGreen MG-LI-KSP is powered by a high-quality <strong>12V/9Ah maintenance-free sealed lead-acid battery</strong>, providing dependable backup power whenever outages occur. Depending on the connected load, the UPS can deliver up to <strong>30 minutes of backup time</strong>, allowing users enough time to save important work, shut down equipment safely, or continue operating essential devices during short-term power interruptions. Its intelligent charging system helps maintain battery performance and extends battery life for long-term reliability.</p><p>Operating at a <strong>noise level below 40dB</strong>, this UPS is ideal for environments where quiet operation is important, such as home offices, study rooms, clinics, retail stores, and corporate workspaces. Multiple audible alarms and visual indicators provide clear notifications for battery mode, low battery, overload conditions, battery replacement requirements, and system faults, allowing users to monitor the UPS status easily and respond promptly when necessary.</p><p>Built with user convenience and equipment protection in mind, the MaxGreen MG-LI-KSP incorporates advanced safety features that help guard against overload, short circuits, voltage instability, and power surges. Its compact design allows for easy installation without occupying excessive space, making it a practical backup power solution for both residential and commercial environments.</p><p>The <strong>MaxGreen MG-LI-KSP 850VA Offline UPS</strong> comes with a <strong>1-year warranty</strong>, although the warranty does not cover damage caused by lightning, abnormal overload, insect infestation, improper operating temperatures, dusty or damp environments, lack of proper generator connectivity, or battery swelling due to incorrect voltage settings.</p><p>For guaranteed authenticity, competitive pricing, and reliable customer service, purchase the <strong>MaxGreen MG-LI-KSP 850VA Offline UPS</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>. As a trusted supplier of IT products and power backup solutions, International Office Solution offers genuine products, fast nationwide delivery, and professional after-sales support, making it the ideal destination for your power protection needs.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Main Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Capacity</td><td>850VA</td></tr><tr><td>Load Capacity</td><td>480W</td></tr><tr><td>Input Voltage</td><td>220Vac</td></tr><tr><td>Output Voltage</td><td>220Vac</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency (Battery Mode)</td><td>50Hz ± 1Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Noise Level</td><td>Less than 40dB</td></tr><tr><td>Battery</td><td>Internal maintenance-free lead-acid (12V/9Ah*1)</td></tr><tr><td>Alarm</td><td>Battery mode- Sounding every 10 seconds<br>Low battery- Sounding every 10 seconds<br>Overload -Sounding every 10 seconds<br>Battery Replacement -Alarm Sounding every 10 seconds<br>Fault- Continuously sounding</td></tr><tr><td>Indications</td><td>Line Mode Green lighting, Battery Mode Yellow Lighting, Fault Red Lighting</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Input Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>50 Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Power Factor</td><td>Up to 30 Minutes</td></tr><tr><td>Voltage Range</td><td>140-290VAC</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Output Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Voltage Range</td><td>140-290VAC</td></tr><tr><td>Type of Wave</td><td>Simulated Sine Wave (Bat Mode)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacture Warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year<br>Under the following conditions, the warranty would not be provided:<br>• UPS burning due to thunder, abnormal overload, insect entrance and others.<br>• If ambient temperature should not be maintained at 20 to 26 degrees Celsius with proper dehumidification. (24/7)<br>• If the product is placed in a dusty and damp place.<br>• In the absence of Generator connectivity Without proper battery charge, the warranty will be void.<br>• Battery swelling and overcharging due to the wrong system voltage setting of the UPS.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ups', 5200.00, 5200.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/HgVuuTrCNal9UvwVloczUmUJBzhZBAiEYE3po1Vw.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-27 04:30:43', '2026-06-27 04:30:43', 'MaxGreen MG-LI-KSP 850VA Offline UPS Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the MaxGreen MG-LI-KSP 850VA Offline UPS at the best price in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features 850VA capacity, 480W output, 12V/9Ah battery, up to 30 minutes backup, and a 1-year warranty.', 'Buy the MaxGreen MG-LI-KSP 850VA Offline UPS at the best price in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features 850VA capacity, 480W output, 12V/9Ah battery, up to 30 minutes backup, and a 1-year warranty.', NULL, 68, NULL, NULL);
