(830, 'MaxGreen MG-LI-KSP 650VA Offline UPS', 'The MaxGreen MG-LI-KSP 650VA Offline UPS is a compact and efficient power backup solution designed to protect desktop computers, routers, networking equipment, CCTV systems, and other sensitive electronic devices from power outages and voltage fluctuations. With a 650VA capacity and 390W load capacity, it delivers stable 220VAC output and utilizes a maintenance-free 12V/7Ah battery that provides up to 15 minutes of backup time under typical loads. Built-in overcharge and over-discharge protection help extend battery life, while intelligent LED indicators make system monitoring simple and convenient. Purchase the genuine MaxGreen MG-LI-KSP 650VA Offline UPS from International Office Solution for competitive pricing, authentic products, and reliable after-sales support.', 'maxgreen-mg-li-ksp-650va-offline-ups-1782534779', '<p>The <strong>MaxGreen MG-LI-KSP 650VA Offline UPS</strong> is a dependable and cost-effective backup power solution designed to keep your essential electronic devices running safely during unexpected power interruptions and voltage fluctuations. Built for both home and office environments, this UPS delivers a reliable <strong>650VA capacity</strong> with a <strong>390W load capacity</strong>, making it an ideal choice for desktop computers, Wi-Fi routers, networking equipment, CCTV systems, POS terminals, and other sensitive electronics that require stable power for uninterrupted operation.</p><p>Engineered to provide consistent performance, the MaxGreen MG-LI-KSP operates with a <strong>220VAC input and output voltage</strong>, ensuring clean and stable power delivery that helps reduce the risk of equipment damage, unexpected shutdowns, and data loss. Whether you\'re working on important projects, managing business operations, or protecting security devices, this UPS provides the confidence that your equipment remains protected when utility power becomes unstable or unavailable.</p><p>The UPS is powe