u receive a genuine product backed by competitive pricing, professional customer service, fast delivery, and dependable after-sales support. International Office Solution is committed to providing authentic IT equipment and reliable power backup solutions, making it the trusted choice for customers seeking quality products and long-term value.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Main Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Capacity</td><td>650VA</td></tr><tr><td>Display Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>Load Capacity</td><td>390W</td></tr><tr><td>Input Voltage</td><td>220Vac</td></tr><tr><td>Output Voltage</td><td>220Vac</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency (Battery Mode)</td><td>50Hz + - 1Hz (Output), 50 Hz (Input)</td></tr><tr><td>Noise Level</td><td>&lt;40dB</td></tr><tr><td>Battery</td><td>1 x 12V &amp; 7Ah</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Input Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>50/60 Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Voltage Range</td><td>220Vac</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Output Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Voltage Range</td><td>220Vac</td></tr><tr><td>Type of Wave</td><td>Simulated Sine Wave (Bat Mode)</td></tr><tr><td>Transfer Time</td><td>2-6ms Typical</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacture Warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01 Year Warranty<br>Under the following conditions, the warranty would not be provided:<br>• UPS burning due to thunder, abnormal overload, insect entrance and others.<br>• If ambient temperature should not be maintained at 20 to 26 degrees Celsius with proper dehumidification. (24/7)<br>• If the product is placed in a dusty and damp place.<br>• In the absence of Generator connectivity Without proper battery charge, the warranty will be void.<br>• Battery swelling and overcharging due to the wrong system voltage setting of the UPS.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'ups', 3600.00, 3600.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/oPoNDATeQKVWcEZ30Sq1yJFpN9cKy6GJ6Lv9dGSM.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-27 04:32:59', '2026-06-27 04:32:59', 'MaxGreen MG-LI-KSP 650VA Offline UPS Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the MaxGreen MG-LI-KSP 650VA Offline UPS at the best price in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features 650VA capacity, 390W output, 12V/7Ah battery, LED status indicators, and a 1-year warranty.', 'MaxGreen MG-LI-KSP 650VA UPS, MaxGreen 650VA UPS, MaxGreen Offline UPS, MaxGreen UPS Bangladesh, 650VA UPS Price Bangladesh, Offline UPS, Computer UPS, Desktop UPS, Router UPS, CCTV UPS, Office UPS, 390W UPS, 12V 7Ah UPS Battery, Power Backup UPS, LED Indicator UPS, Best UPS Bangladesh, International Office Solution', NULL, 7, NULL, NULL),
