(832, 'KSTAR 650VA Offline UPS', 'The KSTAR 650VA Offline UPS is a reliable and efficient power backup solution designed to protect desktop computers, networking equipment, CCTV systems, and other essential electronic devices from unexpected power outages and voltage fluctuations. Featuring a 650VA capacity, 230V input and output voltage, intelligent battery charging and discharging management, and overload protection, this UPS delivers stable and uninterrupted power when you need it most. With a fast 4–8ms transfer time (13ms maximum), generator compatibility, and a durable 24V battery system, it ensures dependable performance for both home and office environments. Purchase the genuine KSTAR 650VA Offline UPS from International Office Solution for authentic products, competitive pricing, and reliable after-sales support.', 'kstar-650va-offline-ups-1782535058', '<p>The <strong>KSTAR 650VA Offline UPS</strong> is a dependable backup power solution designed to provide continuous protection for computers, networking equipment, security systems, and other sensitive electronic devices. Built for home users, offices, educational institutions, and small businesses, this UPS delivers reliable backup power during unexpected outages while protecting connected equipment from voltage fluctuations, surges, and electrical disturbances. With its <strong>650VA capacity</strong>, intelligent battery management, and fast switching performance, the KSTAR 650VA Offline UPS ensures that your essential devices remain safe and operational when utility power becomes unstable.</p><p>Operating with a <strong>230V input voltage</strong> and delivering a stable <strong>230V (±10%) output voltage</strong> at <strong>50Hz</strong>, the UPS provides consistent power for desktop computers, Wi-Fi routers, switches, CCTV systems, POS machines, and other critical electronic equipment. Its rapid <strong>4–8 millisecond transfer time</strong>, with a maximum of <strong>13 milliseconds</strong>, enables