(833, 'MaxGreen MG-LI-EAP-650VA 650VA Offline UPS', 'The MaxGreen MG-LI-EAP-650VA Offline UPS is a compact and dependable power backup solution designed to protect desktop computers, networking equipment, routers, CCTV systems, and other essential electronic devices from power outages and voltage fluctuations. Featuring a 650VA capacity, a 220VAC output, and a maintenance-free 12V/9Ah battery, this UPS delivers stable performance with a fast 2–6ms transfer time and simulated sine wave output. Built-in surge protection, overload protection, short circuit protection, and intelligent battery management ensure reliable operation and long-lasting performance. Purchase the genuine MaxGreen MG-LI-EAP-650VA Offline UPS from International Office Solution for competitive pricing, authentic products, and trusted after-sales support.', 'maxgreen-mg-li-eap-650va-650va-offline-ups-1782535171', '<p>The <strong>MaxGreen MG-LI-EAP-650VA Offline UPS</strong> is a reliable and efficient uninterruptible power supply designed to provide continuous backup power and advanced protection for computers, networking devices, CCTV systems, and other sensitive electronics. With a <strong>650VA capacity</strong>, this offline UPS is an excellent solution for home users, small offices, retail stores, and educational environments where uninterrupted power is essential for maintaining productivity and protecting valuable equipment from sudden power failures and voltage instability.</p><p>Designed to operate efficiently in varying electrical conditions, the UPS supports an <strong>input voltage range of 140VAC to 290VAC</strong> while delivering a stable <strong>220VAC output voltage</strong>. During battery operation, it maintains <strong>±10% AC voltage regulation</strong> with a <strong>50Hz ±1Hz frequency</strong>, ensuring consistent power delivery that minimizes the risk of hardware damage, unexpected shutdowns, and data loss. The fast <strong>2–6 millisecond transfer time</strong> allows conne