ty and damp place.<br>• In the absence of Generator connectivity Without proper battery charge, the warranty will be void.<br>• Battery swelling and overcharging due to the wrong system voltage setting of the UPS.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ups', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/OkycM5eDsKjbyKSl5IfF23oZD9kWlTRyLnxxG8Ng.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-27 04:39:31', '2026-06-27 04:39:31', 'MaxGreen MG-LI-EAP-650VA Offline UPS Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the MaxGreen MG-LI-EAP-650VA Offline UPS at the best price in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features 650VA capacity, 12V/9Ah battery, 2–6ms transfer time, surge protection, and a 1-year warranty.', 'MaxGreen MG-LI-EAP-650VA UPS, MaxGreen 650VA UPS, MaxGreen Offline UPS, MaxGreen UPS Bangladesh, 650VA UPS Price Bangladesh, Offline UPS, Computer UPS, Desktop UPS, Router UPS, CCTV UPS, Office UPS, 12V 9Ah UPS, Simulated Sine Wave UPS, Surge Protection UPS, Power Backup UPS, Best UPS Bangladesh, International Office Solution', NULL, 7, NULL, NULL),
