age, unexpected shutdowns, or valuable data loss. This reliable voltage regulation helps maintain uninterrupted productivity while safeguarding expensive electronic equipment.</p><p>The UPS is powered by <strong>two maintenance-free 12V/7Ah sealed lead-acid batteries</strong>, providing approximately <strong>30 minutes of backup time</strong> under normal operating conditions, depending on the connected load. This backup duration gives users sufficient time to save important files, safely shut down equipment, or continue operating critical devices during temporary power interruptions. Built-in <strong>overcharge and over-discharge protection</strong> intelligently manages battery performance, extending battery lifespan while ensuring dependable backup whenever required.</p><p>For convenient operation, the MaxGreen MG-LI-KSP 1500VA features an easy-to-read indicator system that clearly displays important operating conditions, including <strong>AC Normal, Battery Mode, Fault, Battery Failure, and Overload</strong> status. These visual indicators allow users to monitor UPS performance in real time and quickly identify any operational issues, making system management simple and efficient.</p><p>Its advanced protection system safeguards connected equipment against overloads, battery faults, and voltage instability, delivering enhanced safety and long-term reliability. The durable construction, combined with efficient battery management and dependable backup performance, makes this UPS an excellent choice for users seeking reliable power protection for everyday computing and office applications.</p><p>The <strong>MaxGreen MG-LI-KSP 1500VA Offline UPS</strong> is backed by a <strong>1-year warranty</strong>. However, the warranty does not cover damage caused by lightning strikes, abnormal overload, insect infestation, operation in dusty or damp environments, failure to maintain the recommended operating temperature, improper generator connectivity, or battery swelling resu