.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ups', 10900.00, 10900.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/zgse7pLM0cSPju2v87IHLhtpGKX2uVnnLr0LZrHA.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-27 04:44:46', '2026-06-27 04:44:46', 'MaxGreen MG-LI-KSP 1500VA Offline UPS Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the MaxGreen MG-LI-KSP 1500VA Offline UPS at the best price in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features 1500VA capacity, 900W output, dual 12V/7Ah batteries, up to 30 minutes backup, and a 1-year warranty.', 'MaxGreen MG-LI-KSP 1500VA UPS, MaxGreen 1500VA UPS, MaxGreen Offline UPS, MaxGreen UPS Bangladesh, 1500VA UPS Price Bangladesh, 900W UPS, Offline UPS, Computer UPS, Desktop UPS, Router UPS, CCTV UPS, Office UPS, Dual Battery UPS, 12V 7Ah UPS Battery, Power Backup UPS, Best UPS Bangladesh, International Office Solution', NULL, 7, NULL, NULL),
