(838, 'MaxGreen MG-LI-EAP-2000VA 2000VA UPS', 'The 2000VA Offline UPS is a powerful and reliable backup power solution designed to protect desktop computers, servers, networking equipment, CCTV systems, and other critical electronic devices from unexpected power interruptions. Featuring a 2000VA capacity, 1230W load capacity, dual 12V/9Ah maintenance-free batteries, and a fast 2–6ms transfer time, this UPS delivers stable performance for both home and business environments. Its LED status indicators, simulated sine wave output, and multiple protection features ensure continuous operation and enhanced equipment safety. Buy the genuine 2000VA Offline UPS from International Office Solution for competitive pricing, authentic products, and dependable after-sales service.', 'maxgreen-mg-li-eap-2000va-2000va-ups-1782536173', '<p>The <strong>2000VA Offline UPS</strong> is a high-performance uninterruptible power supply designed to provide dependable backup power and comprehensive protection for desktop PCs, servers, networking equipment, security systems, POS terminals, routers, switches, and other sensitive electronic devices. With a <strong>2000VA capacity</strong> and <strong>1230W load capacity</strong>, it delivers reliable performance for homes, offices, educational institutions, and commercial environments where uninterrupted power is essential.</p><p>Operating with an <strong>input voltage of 220VAC</strong> and an <strong>input voltage range of 162–268VAC</strong>, the UPS helps stabilize power fluctuations while protecting connected equipment from voltage drops and unexpected outages. During battery operation, it provides a consistent <strong>220VAC output</strong> with a <strong>50Hz ±1Hz frequency</strong>, ensuring safe and stable operation for connected devices. The simulated sine wave output makes it suitable for a wide range of office and home electronics.</p><p>The UPS is powered by <strong>two internal 12V/9Ah maintenance-free sealed lead-acid batteries</strong>, providing approximately <strong>15 to 30 minutes of backup time</strong>, depending on the connected load. Intelligent battery charging enhances battery life while minimizing maintenance requirements. With a <strong>typical transfer time of only 2–6 milliseconds</strong>, the UPS quickly switches to battery mode during power failures, reducing the risk of data loss and system interruptions.</p><p>For convenient monitoring, the UPS features intuitive <strong>LED status indicators</strong>, including <strong>Green</strong> for Line Mode, <strong>Yellow</strong> for Battery Mode, and <strong>Red</strong> for Fault status. It also includes a comprehensive audible alarm system that notifies users of operating conditions, including battery mode, low battery, overload, battery replacement requirements, and system faults, allowing timely action to protect connected equipment.</p><p>Designed with reliable protection features, the UPS safeguards connected devices against overloads, battery issues, and unstable power conditions while maintaining a <strong>noise level below 40dB</strong> for quiet operation in office and home environments. Its compact design and dependable performance make it an excellent backup solution for professional workstations, business systems, and essential electronic equipment.</p><p>The <strong>2000VA Offline UPS</strong> is backed by a <strong>1-year manufacturer warranty</strong>, providing added confidence and peace of mind. For guaranteed authenticity, competitive pricing, and reliable after-sales support, purchase the <strong>2000VA Offline UPS</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted source for quality UPS systems and IT products in Bangladesh.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Main Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Capacity</td><td>2000VA</td></tr><tr><td>Load Capacity</td><td>1230W</td></tr><tr><td>Input Voltage</td><td>220Vac</td></tr><tr><td>Output Voltage</td><td>220Vac</td></tr><tr><td>Frequency (Battery Mode)</td><td>50Hz ± 1Hz&nbsp;(Bat Mode)</td></tr><tr><td>Noise Level</td><td>Less than 40dB</td></tr><tr><td>Battery</td><td>Internal maintenance-free lead-acid battery (12V/9Ah*2)<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Alarm</td><td>Battery mode Sounding every 10 seconds<br>Low battery Sounding every second<br>Overload Sounding every 0.5 seconds<br>Battery Replacement Alarm Sounding every 2 seconds<br>Fault Continuously sounding<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Indications</td><td>Line Mode - Green lighting, Battery Mode - Yellow Lighting,Fault - Red Lighting.<br>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Input Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Frequency</td><td>50 Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Power Factor</td><td>0.6</td></tr><tr><td>Voltage Range</td><td>162-268 VAC</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Output Features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Backup Time</td><td>15-30 Minutes</td></tr><tr><td>Voltage Range</td><td>162-268 VAC</td></tr><tr><td>Power Factor</td><td>0.6</td></tr><tr><td>Type of Wave</td><td>Simulated Sine Wave (Bat Mode)</td></tr><tr><td>Transfer Time</td><td>Typical 2-6ms</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacture Warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01 year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ups', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/bNUvOp68gAvet6G1rgWDkPagqc9wfXcr2qkfJ5eM.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-06-27 04:56:13', '2026-06-27 04:56:13', '2000VA Offline UPS Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the 2000VA Offline UPS at the best price in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features 1230W load capacity, dual 12V/9Ah batteries, 15–30 minutes backup, LED indicators, and a 1-year warranty.', '2000VA Offline UPS, 2000VA UPS Bangladesh, Offline UPS Price Bangladesh, 1230W UPS, Computer UPS, Office UPS, Server UPS, CCTV UPS, Dual Battery UPS, 12V 9Ah UPS, Simulated Sine Wave UPS, Power Backup UPS, UPS for PC, Best UPS Bangladesh, International Office Solution', NULL, 7, NULL, NULL),
(839, 'MaxGreen MG-LI-KSP 2000VA Offline UPS', 'The 2000VA Offline UPS is a dependable power backup solution designed to protect desktop computers, servers, networking devices, CCTV systems, and other critical electronics from power outages and voltage fluctuations. With a 2000VA capacity, 1200W load capacity, dual 12V/7.5Ah maintenance-free batteries, and an input voltage range of 140VAC–300VAC, it delivers stable and uninterrupted power for home and office use. Its fast switching capability and reliable battery backup help prevent data loss while ensuring continuous operation of connected equipment. Purchase the genuine 2000VA Offline UPS from International Office Solution for authentic products, competitive prices, and trusted after-sales support.', 'maxgreen-mg-li-ksp-2000va-offline-ups-1782536235', '<p>The <strong>2000VA Offline UPS</strong> is a high-capacity uninterruptible power supply designed to provide reliable backup power and advanced protection for desktop computers, servers, networking equipment, CCTV systems, POS machines, routers, switches, and other sensitive electronic devices. With a robust <strong>2000VA capacity</strong> and <strong>1200W load capacity</strong>, this UPS is ideal for homes, offices, educational institutions, and commercial environments where uninterrupted power is essential for maintaining productivity and protecting valuable equipment.</p><p>Designed to handle unstable power conditions, the UPS supports a wide <strong>input voltage range of 140VAC to 300VAC</strong>, allowing it to operate efficiently even in areas with frequent voltage fluctuations. It delivers a stable <strong>220VAC–230VAC output</strong>, ensuring connected devices receive consistent and reliable power while minimizing the risk of hardware damage, unexpected shutdowns, and data loss.</p><p>The UPS is equipped with <strong>two 12V/7.5Ah maintenance-free sealed lead-acid batteries</strong>, providing dependable backup power during electricity failures. Intelligent battery management helps optimize charging performance, extend battery life, and ensure reliable operation whenever backup power is required. The maintenance-free battery design reduces servicing requirements, making it a practical solution for everyday use.</p><p>Built for dependable performance, the <strong>2000VA Offline UPS</strong> features fast transfer technology that quickly switches to battery mode during power interruptions, allowing connected equipment to continue operating with minimal disruption. Its durable construction and stable output make it suitable for protecting computers, office workstations, security systems, communication devices, and other mission-critical electronics.</p><p>The UPS is backed by a <strong>1-year manufacturer warranty</strong> for added peace of mind. However, the warranty does not cover damage caused by lightning strikes, abnormal overload, insect infestation, operation in dusty or damp environments, failure to maintain the recommended operating temperature of <strong>20°C to 26°C</strong> with proper dehumidification, lack of proper generator connectivity, or battery swelling caused by incorrect UPS voltage settings.</p><p>Purchase the genuine <strong>2000VA Offline UPS</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> to receive authentic products, competitive pricing, nationwide delivery, and professional after-sales support. International Office Solution is committed to providing reliable power backup solutions and high-quality IT products for customers across Bangladesh.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Main Feature</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Capacity</td><td>2000 VA</td></tr><tr><td>Load Capacity</td><td>1200W</td></tr><tr><td>Input Voltage</td><td>140vac-300vac</td></tr><tr><td>Output Voltage</td><td>220vac-230vac</td></tr><tr><td>Battery</td><td>12V /7.5 AH ×2pc</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Manufacture Warranty</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>01 Year Warranty<br>Under the following conditions, the warranty would not be provided:<br>• UPS burning due to thunder, abnormal overload, insect entrance and others.<br>• If ambient temperature should not be maintained at 20 to 26 degrees Celsius with proper dehumidification. (24/7)<br>• If the product is placed in a dusty and damp place.<br>• In the absence of Generator connectivity Without proper battery charge, the warranty will be void.<br>• Battery swelling and overcharging due to the wrong system voltage setting of the UPS.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ups', 14500.00, 14500.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/K14nPJ0A1EqzBXr4LyvaSSEfPOALqImoZMJvXLg2.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-27 04:57:15', '2026-06-27 04:58:27', '2000VA Offline UPS 1200W Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the 2000VA Offline UPS with 1200W load capacity at the best price in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features dual 12V/7.5Ah batteries, 140–300VAC input range, stable output, and a 1-year warranty.', '2000VA Offline UPS, 2000VA UPS Bangladesh, 1200W UPS, Offline UPS Price Bangladesh, Computer UPS, Office UPS, Server UPS, CCTV UPS, Power Backup UPS, Dual Battery UPS, 12V 7.5Ah UPS, Home Office UPS, Best UPS Bangladesh, International Office Solution', NULL, 7, NULL, NULL),
(840, 'TP-Link TL-WR850N WiFi Router', 'The TP-Link TL-WR850N 300Mbps Wireless N Speed Router offers reliable wireless speeds of up to 300Mbps for browsing, streaming, online meetings, and everyday internet use. Featuring Agile Config, IPTV support, IPv6 compatibility, Parental Controls, Guest Network, and advanced wireless security, it is an excellent networking solution for homes and small offices. Buy the genuine TP-Link TL-WR850N from International Office Solution at a competitive price in Bangladesh.', 'tp-link-tl-wr850n-wifi-router-1782563397', '<p>The TP-Link TL-WR850N 300Mbps Wireless N Speed Router is built to provide fast, reliable, and secure wireless networking for everyday internet usage. Whether you\'re working from home, attending online meetings, streaming HD videos, or browsing social media, this router offers consistent performance with wireless speeds of up to 300Mbps.</p><p>Powered by Wireless N technology, the TL-WR850N provides wider wireless coverage and improved signal stability compared to older wireless standards. It supports multiple connected devices simultaneously, making it ideal for small families, home users, and small business environments.</p><p>One of its standout features is Agile Config, enabling Internet Service Providers (ISPs) to configure default settings efficiently. This feature simplifies deployment and management for service providers while ensuring a seamless user experience.</p><p>The router also includes Parental Controls, allowing administrators to schedule internet access and restrict websites for individual devices. This helps families create a safer online environment for children.</p><p>For users who enjoy IPTV services, the router supports IGMP Proxy and IGMP Snooping, ensuring smoother and more reliable video streaming with reduced network congestion.</p><p>As internet technology continues to evolve, the TL-WR850N remains future-ready with full IPv6 compatibility, enabling support for modern networking standards.</p><p>Security is another major advantage of this router. It supports WPA/WPA2 wireless encryption, helping safeguard your network against unauthorized access. The integrated Guest Network feature lets visitors access the internet without exposing your personal devices or private files.</p><p>Its compact and elegant design fits perfectly into any home or office environment, while the intuitive setup wizard allows users to configure the router within minutes.</p><p>Purchase the TP-Link TL-WR850N 300Mbps Wireless N Speed Router from International Office Solution for genuine products, competitive pricing, and dependable customer service.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>General</td><td>Brand</td><td>TP-Link</td></tr><tr><td>General</td><td>Model</td><td>TL-WR850N</td></tr><tr><td>General</td><td>Device Type</td><td>Wireless N Speed Router</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Wireless Standard</td><td>IEEE 802.11b/g/n</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Wireless Speed</td><td>Up to 300Mbps</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Frequency Band</td><td>2.4GHz</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Coverage</td><td>Suitable for Home &amp; Small Office</td></tr><tr><td>Network</td><td>WAN Port</td><td>1 × 10/100Mbps WAN Port</td></tr><tr><td>Network</td><td>LAN Ports</td><td>4 × 10/100Mbps LAN Ports</td></tr><tr><td>Features</td><td>Agile Config</td><td>Supported</td></tr><tr><td>Features</td><td>IPTV</td><td>IGMP Proxy &amp; IGMP Snooping</td></tr><tr><td>Features</td><td>Guest Network</td><td>Supported</td></tr><tr><td>Features</td><td>Parental Control</td><td>Supported</td></tr><tr><td>Features</td><td>IPv6</td><td>Supported</td></tr><tr><td>Security</td><td>Wireless Security</td><td>WPA/WPA2, WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK Encryption</td></tr><tr><td>Management</td><td>Setup</td><td>Easy Web-Based Configuration</td></tr><tr><td>Management</td><td>Administration</td><td>Web Management Interface</td></tr><tr><td>Antenna</td><td>Antenna Type</td><td>2 × Fixed External Antennas</td></tr><tr><td>Performance</td><td>Application</td><td>HD Streaming, Web Browsing, Online Classes, Video Calls, Casual Gaming</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Supply</td><td>External Power Adapter</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Finish</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Manufacturer Warranty (As Per TP-Link Policy)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'router', 1550.00, 1550.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/Vd5N4ARExOL0eJT3aWvfgiERIWyTcFYV4KpA5bOt.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-27 12:29:57', '2026-06-27 12:29:57', 'TP-Link TL-WR850N 300Mbps Wireless N Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'TP-Link TL-WR850N, TP-Link TL-WR850N Price in Bangladesh, TP-Link Router Bangladesh, 300Mbps Wireless Router, Wireless N Router, TP-Link WiFi Router, Home WiFi Router, Office Router, IPv6 Router, IPTV Router, Guest Network Router, TP-Link TL-WR850N BD, Buy TP-Link Router Bangladesh, International Office Solution, Networking Router Bangladesh', 'Buy the TP-Link TL-WR850N 300Mbps Wireless N Speed Router in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features 300Mbps Wi-Fi, IPTV support, IPv6, Guest Network, Parental Controls, and secure wireless connectivity for home and office use.', NULL, 206, NULL, NULL),
(841, 'MSI H310M PRO-VDH Intel 9th Gen Motherboard', 'The MSI H310M PRO-VDH Intel 9th Gen Motherboard is a dependable Micro-ATX motherboard designed for Intel 8th and 9th Generation processors. Built on the Intel H310 chipset, it supports up to 32GB DDR4 memory, PCIe 3.0 graphics, SATA III storage, and multiple display outputs including HDMI, DVI-D, and VGA. With Gigabit LAN, Realtek 7.1-channel HD Audio, Core Boost technology, and MSI\'s durable design, this motherboard is an excellent choice for home, office, and entry-level gaming PCs. Buy the genuine MSI H310M PRO-VDH Motherboard from International Office Solution for competitive pricing, authentic products, and reliable after-sales support.', 'msi-h310m-pro-vdh-intel-9th-gen-motherboard-1782567934', '<p>The <strong>MSI H310M PRO-VDH Intel 9th Gen Motherboard</strong> is a reliable and cost-effective motherboard designed for users who need stable performance for office computing, home use, educational applications, and entry-level gaming. Powered by the <strong>Intel H310 chipset</strong>, it supports <strong>8th and 9th Generation Intel Core, Pentium Gold, and Celeron processors</strong> using the <strong>LGA 1151 socket</strong>, making it an ideal foundation for building a dependable desktop PC.</p><p>Designed in a compact <strong>Micro-ATX form factor</strong>, the motherboard fits easily into most PC cases while offering excellent expandability. It supports up to <strong>32GB of DDR4 memory</strong> through two DIMM slots, with memory speeds up to <strong>2666MHz</strong>, ensuring smooth multitasking, responsive system performance, and efficient everyday computing.</p><p>For graphics and expansion, the motherboard includes <strong>one PCI Express 3.0 x16 slot</strong> for dedicated graphics cards and <strong>two PCI Express 2.0 x1 slots</strong> for additional expansion cards. Storage connectivity is provided through <strong>four SATA III 6Gb/s ports</strong>, allowing users to connect SSDs and HDDs for fast data access and flexible storage configurations.</p><p>The MSI H310M PRO-VDH offers versatile display connectivity with <strong>HDMI, DVI-D, and VGA outputs</strong>, making it compatible with both modern and legacy monitors. Integrated <strong>Realtek 7.1-channel HD Audio</strong> delivers clear and immersive sound for multimedia, online meetings, and entertainment, while the built-in <strong>Gigabit LAN</strong> provides fast and stable wired network connectivity for work, gaming, and streaming.</p><p>MSI enhances the motherboard with several exclusive technologies, including <strong>Core Boost</strong> for optimized CPU power delivery, <strong>Audio Boost</strong> for improved audio quality, <strong>EZ Debug LED</strong> for simplified troubleshooting during installation, and <strong>Steel Armor PCIe protection</strong> to reinforce the graphics card slot for added durability. Users can also add wireless networking through a compatible Wi-Fi adapter if required.</p><p>Whether you\'re building a reliable office PC, an educational workstation, or an affordable gaming system, the <strong>MSI H310M PRO-VDH Intel 9th Gen Motherboard</strong> delivers excellent stability, essential connectivity, and dependable performance at an affordable price.</p><p>Purchase the genuine <strong>MSI H310M PRO-VDH Intel 9th Gen Motherboard</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> to enjoy authentic MSI products, competitive prices, nationwide delivery, and professional after-sales support. Every motherboard is backed by a <strong>3-year manufacturer warranty</strong>, ensuring long-term reliability and peace of mind.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Basic Information</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Supported CPU</td><td>Supports 9th / 8th Gen Intel Core / Pentium Gold / Celeron processors for LGA 1151 socket</td></tr><tr><td>Chipset</td><td>Intel H310 Chipset</td></tr><tr><td>Form Fact