(842, 'MSI PRO H610M-E DDR4 mATX Motherboard', 'The MSI PRO H610M-E DDR4 mATX Motherboard is a reliable and high-performance motherboard designed for 12th, 13th, and 14th Generation Intel processors. Built on the Intel H610 chipset with the LGA 1700 socket, it supports DDR4 memory up to 3200MHz, PCIe 4.0 connectivity, and advanced MSI technologies including Core Boost, Memory Boost, Audio Boost, and Steel Armor. Its Micro-ATX form factor makes it ideal for office PCs, home computers, and gaming systems. Buy the genuine MSI PRO H610M-E DDR4 Motherboard from International Office Solution for competitive pricing, authentic products, and reliable after-sales support.', 'msi-pro-h610m-e-ddr4-matx-motherboard-1782568160', '<p>The <strong>MSI PRO H610M-E DDR4 mATX Motherboard</strong> is a dependable and feature-rich motherboard designed to support the latest <strong>12th, 13th, and 14th Generation Intel Core, Pentium Gold, and Celeron processors</strong> using the <strong>LGA 1700 socket</strong>. Built on the Intel H610 chipset, this motherboard offers an excellent balance of performance, stability, and affordability, making it an ideal choice for home users, office workstations, students, content creators, and entry-level gaming enthusiasts.</p><p>Designed in a compact <strong>Micro-ATX form factor</strong>, the motherboard fits easily into a wide range of PC cases while providing all the essential connectivity and expansion options required for modern computing. It supports <strong>DDR4 memory</strong> with speeds of up to <strong>3200MHz (maximum)</strong>, allowing users to enjoy responsive multitasking, faster application loading, and improved overall system performance.</p><p>The MSI PRO H610M-E DDR4 features <strong>PCI Express 4.0</strong> support, delivering significantly higher bandwidth for modern graphics cards and high-speed expansion devices. This ensures improved gaming performance, faster data transfers, and better compatibility with the latest hardware components. MSI\'s exclusive <strong>Core Boost</strong> technology utilizes an optimized power design and premium PCB layout to provide stable CPU power delivery, helping processors perform efficiently under demanding workloads.</p><p>To maximize memory performance, <strong>Memory Boost</strong> technology delivers clean and stable data signals, improving compatibility, stability, and overall system reliability. The motherboard also incorporates <strong>Audio Boost</strong> technology, providing high-quality sound with enhanced clarity for gaming, entertainment, video conferencing, and multimedia applications.</p><p>For additional durability, MSI integrates <strong>Steel Armor</strong> protection on the PCIe slot, reinforcing it against bending while reducing electromagnetic interference (EMI) to improve stability and long-term reliability. The motherboard\'s premium components and quality engineering ensure dependable operation for everyday computing as well as more demanding applications.</p><p>Whether you\'re building a new desktop for productivity, upgrading an office PC, or assembling an affordable gaming system, the <strong>MSI PRO H610M-E DDR4 mATX Motherboard</strong> offers excellent compatibility, modern features, and reliable performance at an outstanding value.</p><p>Purchase the genuine <strong>MSI PRO H610M-E DDR4 mATX Motherboard</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> to enjoy authentic MSI products, competitive pricing, nationwide delivery, and professional after-sales support. The motherboard is backed by a <strong>3-year manufacturer warranty</strong>, providing long-term confidence and peace of mind with your purchase.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Basic Information</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Supported CPU</td><td>Supports 14th/13th/12th Gen Intel Core Processors, Pentium Gold and Celeron Processors<br>LGA 1700</td></tr><tr><td>Chipset</td>