(844, 'MSI PRO H610M-E mATX Motherboard', 'The MSI PRO H610M-E mATX Motherboard is a dependable Intel LGA 1700 motherboard designed to support 14th, 13th, and 12th Gen Intel Core, Pentium Gold, and Celeron processors. It features high-speed DDR5 memory support up to 5600MHz, PCIe 4.0 connectivity, Core Boost technology, Memory Boost, Audio Boost, and Steel Armor protection, making it an excellent choice for office PCs, home desktops, and entry-level gaming systems. Backed by a 3-year warranty, it offers outstanding stability, performance, and future-ready connectivity.', 'msi-pro-h610m-e-matx-motherboard-1782568397', '<p>he <strong>MSI PRO H610M-E mATX Motherboard</strong> is an excellent choice for users looking to build a reliable, high-performance Intel desktop system with modern features and long-term stability. Built on the Intel H610 chipset, this motherboard supports <strong>14th, 13th, and 12th Generation Intel Core, Pentium Gold, and Celeron processors</strong> using the <strong>LGA 1700 socket</strong>, making it suitable for home, office, business, and entry-level gaming PCs.</p><p>Designed with support for <strong>DDR5 memory up to 5600MHz</strong>, the motherboard delivers significantly faster data transfer speeds, improved responsiveness, and enhanced multitasking performance compared to previous memory generations. Whether you\'re running productivity software, creating content, or handling everyday computing tasks, the MSI PRO H610M-E ensures smooth and efficient performance.</p><p>The motherboard is equipped with <strong>PCIe 4.0</strong>, providing ultra-fast bandwidth for modern graphics cards and high-speed storage devices. MSI\'s <strong>Core Boost</strong> technology delivers stable power to the CPU for improved processing performance, while <strong>Memory Boost</strong> enhances signal integrity for better compatibility and reliable system operation.</p><p>For an immersive multimedia experience, the motherboard includes <strong>Audio Boost</strong> technology, delivering clear, high-quality sound for entertainment, gaming, and professional applications. The reinforced <strong>Steel Armor PCIe slot</strong> protects heavy graphics cards from bending while reducing electromagnetic interference, improving durability and system stability.</p><p>Its compact <strong>Micro-ATX form factor</strong> makes installation easy in a wide variety of PC cases while still providing essential connectivity for modern computing. Whether you\'re assembling a business workstation, upgrading your home PC, or building an affordable gaming setup, the MSI PRO H610M-E offers dependable performance, excellent compatibility, and long-lasting reliability.</p><p>Purchase the <strong>MSI PRO H610M-E mATX Motherboard</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted source for genuine MSI motherboards in Bangladesh. International Office Solution offers competitive pricing, authentic products, professional customer support, and fast nationwide delivery. Buy with confidence and enjoy the official <strong>3-year manufacturer warranty</strong>.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Basic Information</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Supported CPU</td><td>Support Intel Core 14th/ 13th/ 12th Gen Processors, Intel Pentium Gold and Celeron Processors<br>LGA 1700</td></tr><tr><td>Chipset</td><td>Intel H610 Chipset</td></tr><tr><td>Form Factor</td><td>mATX<br>200mmx236.16mm</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Realtek ALC897 Codec<br>7.1-Channel High Definition Audio</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Expansion Slots</strong></td></tr><tr><td>PCI</td><td>1x PCI-E x16 slot<br>1x PCI-E x1 slot<br>PCI_E1 Gen PCIe 4.0 supports up to (From CPU)<br>PCI_E2 Gen PCIe 3.0 supports up to (From Chipset)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Memory</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td>Slots</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>Supported Memory</td><td>Memory Support DDR5 5600 MHz (by JEDEC &amp; POR)<br>Supports Intel XMP 3.0 OC<br>Supports Dual-Controller Dual-Channel mode<br>Supports non-ECC, un-buffered memory</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum Memory</td><td>96GB</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Graphics</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Graphics</td><td>Support HDMI 1.4 with HDR, maximum resolution of 4K 30Hz<br>Support VGA, maximum resolution of 2048x1536 50Hz, 2048x1280 60Hz, 1920x1200 60Hz<br>Available only on processors featuring integrated graphics. Graphics specifications may vary depending on the CPU installed.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connector &amp; Ports</strong></td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>1x HDMI 1.4 with HDR port</td></tr><tr><td>VGA (s)</td><td>1x VGA</td></tr><tr><td>USB (s)</td><td>4x USB 2.0 (Rear)<br>4x USB 2.0 (Front)<br>2x USB 3.2 Gen1 Type A (Rear)<br>2x USB 3.2 Gen1 Type A (Front)</td></tr><tr><td>LAN Port (s)</td><td>Realtek RTL8111H Gigabit LAN</td></tr><tr><td>Supported Storage</td><td>1x M.2<br>M.2_1 Source (From Chipset) supports up to PCIe 3.0 x4 / SATA mode, supports 2280/2260/2242 devices<br>4x SATA 6G<br>SATA5 will be unavailable when installing M.2 SATA SSD in the M2_1 slot.</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>1x Front panel audio connector</td></tr><tr><td>Internal I/O Ports</td><td>1x Power Connector(ATX_PWR)<br>1x Power Connector(CPU_PWR)<br>1x CPU Fan<br>2x System Fan<br>2x Front Panel (JFP)<br>1x Chassis Intrusion (JCI)<br>1x Front Audio (JAUD)<br>1x Com Port (JCOM)<br>1x RGB LED connector(JRGB)<br>4x USB 2.0 ports<br>2x USB 3.2 Gen1 Type A ports</td></tr><tr><td>TPM (Trusted Platform Module )</td><td>1x TPM pin header(Support TPM 2.0)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Others</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Special Features</td><td>1x 4-pin RGB LED connector<br>4x EZ Debug LED</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>3 years</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 10700.00, 10700.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/Z12taBsmS