(845, 'MSI PRO H610M-G DDR4 Micro-ATX Motherboard', 'vThe MSI PRO H610M-G DDR4 Micro-ATX Motherboard is a dependable and feature-rich motherboard designed for Intel 14th, 13th, and 12th Generation processors using the LGA 1700 socket. Supporting dual-channel DDR4 memory, PCIe 4.0, Realtek Gigabit LAN, and advanced power delivery, this motherboard delivers reliable performance for office work, business applications, content creation, and entry-level gaming. With HDMI and D-Sub display outputs, Smart Fan 6 cooling technology, and a durable Steel Armor PCIe slot, the MSI PRO H610M-G DDR4 offers excellent stability and long-lasting performance for modern PC builds.', 'msi-pro-h610m-g-ddr4-micro-atx-motherboard-1782568540', '<p>The <strong>MSI PRO H610M-G DDR4 Micro-ATX Motherboard</strong> is built to deliver dependable performance, excellent stability, and modern connectivity for users building a powerful Intel desktop system. Featuring the <strong>Intel H610 chipset</strong> and <strong>LGA 1700 socket</strong>, this motherboard supports <strong>14th, 13th, and 12th Generation Intel Core, Pentium Gold, and Celeron processors</strong>, making it an ideal solution for home users, professionals, students, and entry-level gamers.</p><p>Designed with <strong>dual-channel DDR4 memory support</strong> through two DIMM slots, the MSI PRO H610M-G provides fast and efficient multitasking while ensuring smooth performance for daily computing, office applications, and entertainment. Its <strong>6+1+1 Hybrid Digital VRM Design</strong> and premium solid capacitors deliver stable power to the processor, improving system reliability and maintaining consistent performance even under heavy workloads.</p><p>The motherboard features <strong>PCIe 4.0 technology</strong>, offering data transfer speeds up to <strong>64GB/s</strong>, allowing users to install the latest graphics cards and high-speed expansion devices with maximum bandwidth. The reinforced <strong>Steel Armor PCIe slot</strong> protects heavy graphics cards from bending while improving durability and minimizing electromagnetic interference for enhanced system stability.</p><p>For networking, the MSI PRO H610M-G is equipped with <strong>Realtek 8118 Gigabit LAN</strong>, which intelligently prioritizes network traffic to provide stable, low-latency internet connectivity for gaming, streaming, video conferencing, and everyday online activities. The motherboard also includes <strong>HDMI and D-Sub display outputs</strong>, making it compatible with a wide range of monitors for flexible display options.</p><p>To ensure efficient thermal performance, MSI integrates <strong>Smart Fan 6 technology</strong>, featuring multiple temperature sensors, hybrid fan headers, and FAN STOP functionality that automatically adjusts cooling performance while reducing unnecessary noise. The durable <strong>8-pin ATX CPU power connector</strong> further enhances power stability during demanding workloads.</p><p>Whether you\'re building a business workstation, educational computer, home desktop, or affordable gaming PC, the <strong>MSI PRO H610M-G DDR4 Micro-ATX Motherboard</strong> delivers reliable performance, modern features, and outstanding value. Purchase the genuine <strong>MSI PRO H610M-G DDR4 Motherboard</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, where you\'ll receive authentic MSI products, competitive pricing, professional customer support, fast nationwide delivery, and the official <strong>3-year manufacturer warranty</strong>.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Basic Information</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Supported CPU</td><td>Supports 14th/13th/12th Gen Intel Core Processors, Pentium Gold and Celeron Processors<br>LGA 1700<br>Processor socket LGA1700</td></tr><tr><td>Chipset</td><td>Intel H610 Chipset</td></tr><tr><td>Form Factor</td><td>mATX Form Factor<br>9.29 x 7.95 in. (23.6 cm x 20.2 cm)</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Realtek ALC892/ ALC897 Codec<br>7.1-Channel High Definition Audio</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Expansion Slots</strong></td></tr><tr><td>PCI</td><td>1x PCIe x16 slot (From CPU)<br>Supports up to PCIe 4.0 x16<br>1x PCIe x1 slot<br>Supports PCIe 3.0 x1<br>1x M.2 slot with E-key for PCIe WiFi module only (M2_ WIFI1)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Memory</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td>Slots</td><td>2x DDR4 memory slots</td></tr><tr><td>Supported Memory</td><td>Supports 1R 2133/ 2666/ 2933/ 3200 MHz (by JEDEC &amp; POR)<br>Supports Dual-Channel mode<br>Supports non-ECC, un-buffered memory</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum Memory</td><td>Support up to 64GB</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Graphics</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Graphics</td><td>1x HDMI 2.1 with HDR port, supports a maximum resolution of 4K 60Hz<br>1x VGA port, supports a maximum resolution of 2048x1536 50Hz, 2048x1280 60Hz, 1920x1200 60Hz<br>x DisplayPort 1.4 port, supports a maximum resolution of 4K 60Hz</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connector &amp; Ports</strong></td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>1x HDMI 2.1</td></tr><tr><td>Display Port (s)</td><td>1x DisplayPort</td></tr><tr><td>VGA (s)</td><td>1x VGA port</td></tr><tr><td>USB (s)</td><td>Intel H610 Chipset:<br>4x USB 3.2 Gen 1 5Gbps ports (2 Type-A ports on the back panel, 2 ports available through the internal USB connector)<br>6x USB 2.0 ports (4 Type-A ports on the back panel(hub-GL850G), 2 ports available through the internal USB 2.0 connector)</td></tr><tr><td>LAN Port (s)</td><td>1x Intel I219V 1Gbps LAN controller</td></tr><tr><td>Supported Storage</td><td>4x SATA 6Gb/s ports<br>1x M.2 slot (Key M, from chipset)<br>Supports up to PCIe 3.0 x4<br>Supports up to SATA 6Gb/s<br>Supports 2242/ 2260/ 2280 storage devices<br>Supports Intel Smart Response Technology for Intel Core processors</td></tr><tr><td>Internal I/O Ports</td><td>POWER CONNECTORS:<br>1x 24-pin ATX main power connector<br>1x 8-pin ATX 12V power connector<br><br>FAN CONNECTORS:<br>1x 4-pin CPU fan connector<br>1x 4-pin system fan connector<br><br>SYSTEM CONNECTORS:<br>1x Front panel audio connector<br>2x System panel connectors<br>1x Chassis Intrusion connector<br><br>JUMPERS:<br>1x Clear CMOS jumper<br><br>LED FEATURES:<br>1x 4-pin RGB LED connector<br>2x 3-pin RAINBOW LED connectors<br>4x EZ Debug LED</td></tr><tr><td>TPM (Trusted Platform Module )</td><td>1x TPM module connector</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>3 years</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 10600.00, 10600.00, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-27 13:55:40', '2026-06-27 13:55:40', 'MSI PRO H610M-G DDR4 Micro-ATX Motherboard Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the genuine MSI PRO H610M-G DDR4 Micro-ATX Motherboard in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Supports Intel 14th, 13th & 12th Gen processors, DDR4 memory, PCIe 4.0, Gigabit LAN, Smart Fan 6, Steel Armor, and includes a 3-year warranty.', 'MSI PRO H610M-G DDR4, MSI H610M-G Motherboard, MSI DDR4 Motherboard, Intel LGA1700 Motherboard, MSI H610 Motherboard Bangladesh, MSI 14th Gen Motherboard, MSI 13th Gen Motherboard, MSI 12th Gen Motherboard, PCIe 4.0 Motherboard, Micro ATX Motherboard, MSI Motherboard Price in Bangladesh, Buy MSI Motherboard, International Office Solution', NULL, 116, NULL, NULL),
(846, 'MSI PRO H610M-G DDR5 mATX Motherboard', 'The MSI PRO H610M-G DDR5 mATX Motherboard is a reliable and high-performance motherboard built for Intel 14th, 13th, and 12th Generation processors using the LGA 1700 socket. Featuring support for high-speed DDR5 memory up to 5600MHz, PCIe 4.0, Core Boost, Memory Boost, Audio Boost, and Steel Armor technology, this motherboard delivers excellent stability and performance for gaming, office work, content creation, and everyday computing. Its Micro-ATX form factor makes it an ideal choice for compact yet powerful desktop PC builds.', 'msi-pro-h610m-g-ddr5-matx-motherboard-1782568632', '<p>The <strong>MSI PRO H610M-G DDR5 mATX Motherboard</strong> is designed to provide outstanding performance, stability, and next-generation technology for users building modern Intel desktop systems. Powered by the <strong>Intel H610 chipset</strong> and featuring the <strong>LGA 1700 socket</strong>, this motherboard supports <strong>14th, 13th, and 12th Generation Intel Core processors</strong>, along with <strong>Intel Pentium Gold</strong> and <strong>Intel Celeron processors</strong>, offering excellent compatibility for a wide range of home, office, business, and gaming applications.</p><p>One of the standout features of the MSI PRO H610M-G is its support for <strong>DDR5 memory</strong>, allowing memory speeds of up to <strong>5600MHz</strong>. This next-generation memory technology delivers higher bandwidth, improved efficiency, and faster system responsiveness, making multitasking, gaming, and professional workloads smoother than ever.</p><p>MSI\'s advanced <strong>Core Boost</strong> technology utilizes a premium PCB layout and digital power design to deliver stable and efficient power to the processor, maximizing CPU performance during demanding tasks. Complementing this is <strong>Memory Boost</strong>, which ensures clean data signals for enhanced memory stability, better compatibility, and reliable overall system performance.</p><p>For users seeking maximum expansion performance, the motherboard includes <strong>PCIe 4.0</strong> support, enabling significantly faster communication between the processor, graphics card, and NVMe SSDs. This high-bandwidth interface improves loading times, gaming performance, and data transfer speeds, making the system ready for modern hardware upgrades.</p><p>The motherboard also features <strong>Audio Boost</strong> technology, delivering high-quality, studio-grade audio for gaming, multimedia, video editing, and entertainment. The reinforced <strong>Steel Armor PCIe slot</strong> provides additional strength to support heavy graphics cards while protecting against bending and electromagnetic interference (EMI), ensuring long-term durability and reliable performance.</p><p>With its compact <strong>Micro-ATX form factor</strong>, modern connectivity, premium components, and dependable MSI engineering, the <strong>MSI PRO H610M-G DDR5 mATX Motherboard</strong> is an excellent choice for professionals, students, content creators, and gamers looking to build a future-ready desktop PC.</p><p>Purchase the genuine <strong>MSI PRO H610M-G DDR5 mATX Motherboard</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted destination for authentic MSI products in Bangladesh. International Office Solution offers competitive pricing, genuine products, professional customer support, fast nationwide delivery, and the official <strong>3-year manufacturer warranty</strong> for complete peace of mind.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Basic Information</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Supported CPU</td><td>Support Intel Core 14th/ 13th/ 12th Gen Processors, Intel Pentium Gold and Celeron Processors<br>LGA 1700</td></tr><tr><td>Chipset</td><td>Intel H610 Chipset</td></tr><tr><td>Form Factor</td><td>mATX<br>211mmx243.84mm</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Realtek ALC897 Codec<br>7.1-Channel High Definition Audio</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Expansion Slots</strong></td></tr><tr><td>PCI</td><td>1x PCI-E x16 slot<br>1x PCI-E x1 slot<br>PCI_E1 Gen PCIe 4.0 supports up to x16 (From CPU)<br>PCI_E2 Gen PCIe 3.0 supports up to x1 (From Chipset)<br>1x M.2 slot with E-key for PCIe WiFi module only</td></tr><tr><td>M.2 Socket</td><td>1x M.2</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Memory</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td>Slots</td><td>2x DDR5 memory slots</td></tr><tr><td>Supported Memory</td><td>Memory Support DDR5 5600 MHz (by JEDEC &amp; POR)<br>Supports Intel XMP 3.0 OC<br>Supports Dual-Controller Dual-Channel mode<br>Supports non-ECC, un-buffered memory</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum Memory</td><td>Support up to 96GB</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Graphics</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Graphics</td><td>1x HDMI<br>Support HDMI 2.1, maximum resolution of 4K 60Hz<br>1x DisplayPort<br>Support DP 1.4, maximum resolution of 4K 60Hz<br>1x VGA<br>Support VGA, maximum resolution of 2048x1536 50Hz, 2048x1280 60Hz, 1920x1200 60Hz</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connector &amp; Ports</strong></td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>1x HDMI 2.1</td></tr><tr><td>Display Port (s)</td><td>1x DisplayPort</td></tr><tr><td>VGA (s)</td><td>1x VGA port</td></tr><tr><td>USB (s)</td><td>4x USB 2.0 (Rear)<br>2x USB 2.0 (Front)<br>2x USB 3.2 Gen1 Type A (Rear)<br>2x USB 3.2 Gen1 Type A (Front)</td></tr><tr><td>LAN Port (s)</td><td>Intel I219V 1Gbps LAN controller</td></tr><tr><td>Supported Storage</td><td>1x M.2<br>M.2_1 Source (From Chipset) supports up to PCIe 3.0 x4 / SATA mode, supports 2280/2260/2242 devices<br>4x SATA 6G</td></tr><tr><td>Internal I/O Ports</td><td>1x Power Connector(ATX_PWR)<br>1x Power Connector(CPU_PWR)<br>1x CPU Fan<br>1x System Fan<br>2x Front Panel (JFP)<br>1x Chassis Intrusion (JCI)<br>1x Front Audio (JAUD)<br>1x Com Port (JCOM)<br>2x Addressable RGB LED connector(JRAINBOW)<br>1x RGB LED connector(JRGB)<br>2x USB 2.0 ports<br>2x USB 3.2 Gen1 Type A ports</td></tr><tr><td>TPM (Trusted Platform Module )</td><td>1x TPM pin header(Support TPM 2.0)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Others</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Special Features</td><td>LED FEATURE: 4x EZ Debug LED</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>3 years</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'MotherBoard', 11000.00, 11000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/K80XpARHT2HuFeggCcivYR8PUVC7DGfEFiQxaysj.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-27 13:57:12', '2026-06-27 13:57:12', 'MSI PRO H610M-G DDR5 mATX Motherboard Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the genuine MSI PRO H610M-G DDR5 mATX Motherboard in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Supports Intel 14th, 13th & 12th Gen processors, DDR5 up to 5600MHz, PCIe 4.0, Audio Boost, Steel Armor, and includes a 3-year warranty.', 'MSI PRO H610M-G DDR5, MSI H610M-G DDR5 Motherboard, MSI DDR5 Motherboard, Intel LGA 1700 Motherboard, MSI H610 Motherboard Bangladesh, MSI 14th Gen Motherboard, MSI 13th Gen Motherboard, MSI 12th Gen Motherboard, DDR5 mATX Motherboard, PCIe 4.0 Motherboard, MSI Motherboard Price in Bangladesh, Buy MSI Motherboard, International Office Solution', NULL, 116, NULL, NULL),
(847, 'MSI PRO B760M-E DDR4 mATX Motherboard', 'The MSI PRO B760M-E DDR4 mATX Motherboard is a reliable and high-performance motherboard designed for Intel 14th, 13th, and 12th Generation processors using the LGA 1700 socket. It supports high-speed DDR4 memory up to 4800MHz (OC), PCIe 4.0, Lightning Gen4 M.2 storage, Core Boost, Memory Boost, Audio Boost, and Steel Armor technology, making it an excellent choice for gaming, content creation, office work, and professional desktop builds. Its Micro-ATX design delivers powerful features while maintaining compatibility with compact PC cases.', 'msi-pro-b760m-e-ddr4-matx-motherboard-1782568749', '<p>The <strong>MSI PRO B760M-E DDR4 mATX Motherboard</strong> is engineered to deliver exceptional performance, stability, and expandability for modern Intel desktop systems. Powered by the <strong>Intel B760 chipset</strong>, this motherboard supports <strong>14th, 13th, and 12th Generation Intel Core processors</strong> through the <strong>LGA 1700 socket</strong>, making it an ideal platform for gamers, professionals, content creators, and everyday PC users seeking dependable performance and future-ready features.</p><p>Designed with <strong>dual-channel DDR4 memory support</strong>, the motherboard accommodates memory speeds of up to <strong>4800MHz (OC)</strong>, providing faster data processing, smoother multitasking, and improved system responsiveness. Whether you\'re editing videos, running business applications, or enjoying the latest games, the MSI PRO B760M-E delivers reliable and efficient performance.</p><p>MSI\'s advanced <strong>Core Boost</strong> technology combines a premium PCB layout with a digital power design to provide stable power delivery, allowing Intel processors to perform at their full potential. <strong>Memory Boost</strong> further enhances memory signal integrity, improving stability, compatibility, and overall system reliability during intensive workloads.</p><p>For high-speed storage and expansion, the motherboard features <strong>PCIe 4.0</strong> and a <strong>Lightning Gen4 x4 M.2 slot</strong>, enabling ultra-fast SSD performance, quicker boot times, faster application loading, and improved data transfer speeds. This ensures the system is well-equipped for demanding gaming, professional software, and modern storage solutions.</p><p>The integrated <strong>Audio Boost</strong> technology delivers premium-quality audio with enhanced clarity for gaming, streaming, entertainment, and multimedia production. Additionally, the reinforced <strong>Steel Armor PCIe slot</strong> protects heavy graphics cards from bending while reducing electromagnetic interference, ensuring long-lasting durability and stable graphics performance.</p><p>Its compact <strong>Micro-ATX form factor</strong> offers excellent flexibility for a wide variety of PC cases without sacrificing essential features or expansion capabilities. Whether you\'re building a productivity workstation, a home computer, or a budget-friendly gaming system, the <strong>MSI PRO B760M-E DDR4 mATX Motherboard</strong> provides outstanding performance, dependable reliability, and excellent value.</p><p>Purchase the genuine <strong>MSI PRO B760M-E DDR4 mATX Motherboard</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted source for authentic MSI motherboards in Bangladesh. International Office Solution offers competitive pricing, genuine MSI products, professional customer support, fast nationwide delivery, and the official <strong>3-year manufacturer warranty</strong> for complete peace of mind.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Basic Information</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Supported CPU</td><td>Supports 14th/13th/12th Gen Intel Core Processors, Pentium Gold and Celeron Processors<br>LGA 1700</td></tr><tr><td>Chipset</td><td>INTEL B760</td></tr><tr><td>Form Factor</td><td>mATX<br>200mmx236.16mm</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Realtek ALC