(848, 'MSI PRO H810M-B DDR5 LGA1851 mATX Motherboard', 'The MSI PRO H810M-B DDR5 LGA1851 mATX Motherboard is a next-generation Intel motherboard built for Intel Core Ultra (Series 2) processors using the LGA 1851 socket. Featuring dual-channel DDR5 memory support, PCIe 5.0, Lightning Gen4 M.2 storage, 2.5G LAN, Core Boost, Memory Boost, Audio Boost, and versatile display connectivity, this Micro-ATX motherboard delivers outstanding performance for AI-powered PCs, business workstations, home desktops, and professional computing. Its compact design and advanced features make it an excellent foundation for modern Intel systems.', 'msi-pro-h810m-b-ddr5-lga1851-matx-motherboard-1782576606', '<p>The <strong>MSI PRO H810M-B DDR5 LGA1851 mATX Motherboard</strong> is engineered to deliver next-generation performance, exceptional stability, and advanced connectivity for modern Intel desktop systems. Built around the latest <strong>Intel H810 chipset</strong> and featuring the <strong>LGA 1851 socket</strong>, this motherboard fully supports <strong>Intel Core Ultra (Series 2) processors</strong>, making it an ideal platform for AI-powered computing, business productivity, professional workloads, and everyday home use.</p><p>Designed in a compact <strong>Micro-ATX form factor</strong>, the MSI PRO H810M-B offers an excellent balance of performance and space efficiency, making it suitable for compact desktop builds without sacrificing essential features. It supports <strong>dual-channel DDR5 memory</strong>, providing higher bandwidth, lower power consumption, and significantly improved system responsiveness for multitasking, content creation, and demanding business applications.</p><p>MSI integrates its renowned <strong>Core Boost</strong> and <strong>Memory Boost</strong> technologies to ensure stable power delivery and optimized memory signal integrity. These advanced technologies improve processor efficiency, maximize memory compatibility, and deliver consistent system stability even during intensive workloads.</p><p>For future-ready expansion, the motherboard features <strong>PCIe 5.0</strong>, allowing users to take advantage of next-generation graphics cards and high-bandwidth expansion devices. The inclusion of a <strong>Lightning Gen4 M.2 slot</strong> enables ultra-fast NVMe SSD performance, reducing boot times and dramatically improving application loading and file transfer speeds.</p><p>Networking is enhanced with an integrated <strong>2.5 Gigabit LAN</strong>, providing faster and more reliable wired internet connectivity for cloud computing, online collaboration, large file transfers, streaming, and gaming. The motherboard also offers extensive display connectivity through <strong>HDMI, DisplayPort, and VGA outputs</strong>, making it compatible with a wide range of modern and legacy monitors.</p><p>To simplify installation and upgrades, MSI includes the <strong>EZ PCIe Clip II</strong>, allowing quick and convenient graphics card installation and removal. The motherboard also features <strong>Audio Boost</strong> technology, delivering high-quality, immersive audio for multimedia, business communication, entertainment, and gaming. Its elegant silver design gives the system a clean and professional appearance while maintaining MSI\'s reputation for long-term durability and dependable performance.</p><p>Whether you\'re building an AI-ready workstation, a business desktop, a professional office PC, or a modern home computer, the <strong>MSI PRO H810M-B DDR5 LGA1851 mATX Motherboard</strong> offers cutting-edge technology, reliable performance, and outstanding value.</p><p>Purchase the genuine <strong>MSI PRO H810M-B DDR5 LGA1851 mATX Motherboard</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted destination for authentic MSI products in Bangladesh. International Office Solution offers competitive pricing, genuine products, expert customer support, fast nationwide delivery, and the official <strong>3-year manufacturer warranty</strong> for complete confidence with every purchase.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Basic Information</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Supported CPU</td><td>Intel Core Ultra Processors (Series 2)</td></tr><tr><td>Chipset</td><td>Intel H810</td></tr><tr><td>BIOS</td><td>Flash BIOS Button</td></tr><tr><td>Form Factor</td><td>Micro-ATX</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Realtek ALC897 Code</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Expansion Slots</strong></td></tr><tr><td>PCI</td><td>1 x PCIe x16 slot supports up to PCIe 5.0 x16, 2 x PCIe x1 slots support up to PCIe 4.0 x1</td></tr><tr><td>M.2 Socket</td><td>1x M.2</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Memory</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td>Slots</td><td>2 x UDIMM</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum Memory</td><td>128GB</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Graphics</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Graphics</td><td>1x HDMI<br>1 x DP</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connector &amp; Ports</strong></td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>1x HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>Display Port (s)</td><td>1 x DP</td></tr><tr><td>USB (s)</td><td>4 x USB 2.0 Type-A,<br>2 x USB 5Gbps Type-A</td></tr><tr><td>LAN Port (s)</td><td>Realtek RTL8125D 2.5G LAN</td></tr><tr><td>Supported Storage</td><td>1 x M.2 slot (Key M) type s 2260/2280 Supports up to PCIe 4.0 x4<br>SATA Inteface 6.0Gb/s</td></tr><tr><td>TPM (Trusted Platform Module )</td><td>1x TPM pin header(Support TPM 2.0)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Others</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Special Features</td><td>LED FEATURE: 4x EZ Debug LED</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>3 Years Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'MotherBoard', 16700.00, 16700.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/5iGdzSvuWXXp89ZK3UVgn2rJBGmpEWHeUWibPAeS.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-27 16:10:07', '2026-06-27 16:10:07', 'MSI PRO H810M-B DDR5 