(849, 'MSI PRO H810I WIFI LGA 1851 Mini-ITX Motherboard', 'The MSI PRO H810I WIFI LGA 1851 Mini-ITX Motherboard is a compact, high-performance motherboard designed for Intel Core Ultra (Series 2) processors. Built with the Intel H810 chipset, it supports DDR5 memory up to 128GB, PCIe 5.0, PCIe 4.0 M.2 storage, integrated Wi-Fi 7, Bluetooth 5.4, and 2.5GbE LAN. Featuring MSI Core Boost, Memory Boost, Frozr Guard cooling, and extensive USB connectivity, this Mini-ITX motherboard is an ideal solution for small form factor gaming PCs, business workstations, AI-powered desktops, and high-performance home systems.', 'msi-pro-h810i-wifi-lga-1851-mini-itx-motherboard-1782576724', '<p>The <strong>MSI PRO H810I WIFI LGA 1851 Mini-ITX Motherboard</strong> is a premium compact motherboard designed to deliver exceptional performance, advanced connectivity, and reliable stability for next-generation Intel desktop systems. Powered by the latest <strong>Intel H810 chipset</strong>, this Mini-ITX motherboard supports <strong>Intel Core Ultra (Series 2) processors</strong> through the <strong>LGA 1851 socket</strong>, making it an excellent choice for AI-powered computing, professional workstations, compact gaming PCs, and modern home desktop builds.</p><p>Despite its compact <strong>Mini-ITX form factor</strong>, the MSI PRO H810I WIFI offers powerful features that rival larger motherboards. It supports <strong>dual-channel DDR5 memory</strong> with capacities up to <strong>128GB</strong> and speeds reaching <strong>6400 MT/s</strong>, allowing users to enjoy faster application performance, smoother multitasking, and improved system responsiveness. Support for <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> enables effortless memory optimization for maximum performance.</p><p>MSI\'s advanced <strong>Core Boost</strong> and <strong>Memory Boost</strong> technologies ensure stable processor power delivery and clean memory signal transmission, enhancing overall system reliability during demanding workloads. To maintain excellent thermal performance, the motherboard incorporates <strong>Frozr Guard cooling</strong>, including an enlarged heatsink, <strong>M.2 Shield Frozr</strong>, and premium <strong>7W/mK MOSFET thermal pads</strong>, helping keep system temperatures under control even during extended periods of heavy usage.</p><p>For expansion and storage, the motherboard features a full-speed <strong>PCIe 5.0 x16 slot</strong>, providing maximum bandwidth for the latest graphics cards, while a <strong>PCIe 4.0 x4 M.2 slot</strong> and <strong>two SATA 6Gb/s ports</strong> deliver flexible, high-speed storage options for modern SSDs and traditional drives.</p><p>Networking capabilities are equally impressive, featuring <strong>Intel I226 2.5 Gigabit Ethernet</strong>, integrated <strong>Wi-Fi 7</strong>, and <strong>Bluetooth 5.4</strong>, ensuring ultra-fast wired and wireless connectivity for gaming, streaming, cloud computing, video conferencing, and large file transfers. Users can also connect multiple displays using the integrated <strong>HDMI 2.1</strong> and <strong>DisplayPort 1.4</strong> outputs, supporting up to <strong>4K resolution at 60Hz</strong> with compatible Intel processors.</p><p>The motherboard delivers high-quality audio through the <strong>Realtek ALC897 codec</strong>, providing immersive <strong>7.1-channel HD Audio</strong> for entertainment, gaming, and multimedia production. Connectivity is further enhanced with a comprehensive selection of USB ports, including <strong>USB 20Gbps Type-C</strong>, <strong>USB 10Gbps Type-C</strong>, USB 5Gbps, and USB 2.0 ports for maximum peripheral compatibility.</p><p>MSI also includes several builder-friendly features such as <strong>EZ PCIe Clip II</strong>, <strong>EZ Debug LEDs</strong>, <strong>EZ Memory Detection</strong>, and customizable <strong>RGB headers</strong>, making installation, troubleshooting, and system personalization simple and convenient.</p><p>Whether you\'re building a premium small form factor gaming PC, an AI-ready workstation, a professional office computer, or a high-performance multimedia system, the <strong>MSI PRO H810I WIFI LGA 1851 Mini-ITX Motherboard</strong> provides cutting-edge technology, exceptional efficiency, and dependable performance in a compact design.</p><p>Purchase the genuine <strong>MSI PRO H810I WIFI LGA 1851 Mini-ITX Motherboard</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted source for authentic MSI products in Bangladesh. International Office Solution offers competitive pricing, genuine MSI hardware, professional customer support, fast nationwide delivery, and the official <strong>3-year manufacturer warranty</strong> for complete peace of mind.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Basic Information</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Supported CPU</td><td>Supports Intel Core Ultra Processors (Series 2)<br>LGA 1851</td></tr><tr><td>Chipset</td><td>INTEL H810</td></tr><tr><td>Form Factor</td><td>Mini-ITX<br>170mmx170mm</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Realtek ALC897 Codec<br>7.1-Channel High Definition Audio</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Expansion Slots</strong></td></tr><tr><td>PCI</td><td>1x PCI-E x16 slot<br>PCI_E1 Gen PCIe 5.0 supports up to x16 (From CPU)</td></tr><tr><td>M.2 Socket</td><td>1x M.2<br>M.2_1 Source (From Chipset) supports up to PCIe 4.0 x4 , supports 2280 devices</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Memory</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td>Slots</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>Supported Memory</td><td>Support 9200 - 6400 (OC) MT/s / 6400 - 4800 (JEDEC) MT/s<br>Max. overclocking frequency:<br>• 1DPC 1R Max speed up to 9200+ MT/s<br>• 1DPC 2R Max speed up to 7200+ MT/s<br>• 2DPC 1R Max speed up to 4800+ MT/s<br>• 2DPC 2R Max speed up to 4800+ MT/s</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum Memory</td><td>128GB</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Graphics</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Graphics</td><td>1x HDM