(850, 'MSI B760M BOMBER WIFI mATX Motherboard', 'The MSI B760M BOMBER WIFI mATX Motherboard is a powerful Intel LGA 1700 motherboard designed for 14th, 13th, and 12th Gen Intel processors. It supports high-speed DDR5 memory up to 6400+MHz (OC), PCIe 4.0, Lightning Gen4 M.2, Wi-Fi 6E, and 2.5G LAN for fast connectivity and reliable performance. With its 12+1 Duet Rail Power System, advanced cooling design, Audio Boost, and durable 6-layer PCB, this motherboard is an excellent choice for gaming, content creation, and everyday high-performance computing.', 'msi-b760m-bomber-wifi-matx-motherboard-1782576839', '<p>The <strong>MSI B760M BOMBER WIFI mATX Motherboard</strong> is built to deliver exceptional performance, stability, and connectivity for gamers, professionals, and PC enthusiasts. Powered by the Intel B760 chipset, it supports <strong>14th, 13th, and 12th Gen Intel Core, Pentium Gold, and Celeron processors</strong> using the <strong>LGA 1700 socket</strong>, providing a reliable platform for modern desktop builds. The motherboard features <strong>dual-channel DDR5 memory support</strong> with speeds of up to <strong>6400+MHz (OC)</strong>, ensuring faster data processing, smoother multitasking, and improved overall system responsiveness.</p><p>Designed with a <strong>12+1 Duet Rail Power System</strong>, P-PAK power stages, and dual <strong>8-pin + 4-pin CPU power connectors</strong>, the MSI B760M BOMBER WIFI delivers stable power even under heavy workloads. MSI\'s <strong>Core Boost</strong> and <strong>Memory Boost</strong> technologies further enhance CPU and memory performance, while the extended heatsink, premium MOSFET thermal pads, and additional choke thermal pads provide efficient cooling for long-term stability during gaming or demanding applications.</p><p>For storage and expansion, the motherboard includes a <strong>PCIe 4.0 x16 slot</strong> for high-performance graphics cards and a <strong>Lightning Gen4 x4 M.2 slot</strong> with <strong>M.2 Shield Frozr</strong>, allowing ultra-fast NVMe SSD performance while maintaining optimal temperatures. High-speed <strong>USB 3.2 Gen 2 10Gbps</strong> connectivity ensures rapid data transfer for external devices and peripherals.</p><p>Networking is another standout feature of the MSI B760M BOMBER WIFI, offering <strong>2.5 Gigabit LAN</strong> alongside <strong>Wi-Fi 6E</strong>, delivering faster wireless speeds, lower latency, and more reliable connections for online gaming, streaming, and professional workloads. The motherboard is built using a premium <strong>6-layer PCB with 2oz thickened copper</strong>, improving signal quality, durability, and power efficiency.</p><p>To complete the experience, MSI\'s <strong>Audio Boost</strong> technology provides high-quality, immersive sound for gaming, entertainment, and multimedia applications. Combining advanced performance, robust power delivery, modern connectivity, and efficient cooling, the MSI B760M BOMBER WIFI mATX Motherboard is an excellent choice for users looking to build a future-ready gaming or productivity PC.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Basic Information</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Supported CPU</td><td>Supports 14th/13th/12th Gen Intel Core Processors, Pentium Gold and Celeron Processors<br>LGA1700</td></tr><tr><td>Chipset</td><td>INTEL B760</td></tr><tr><td>Form Factor</td><td>mATX<br>220mmx243.84mm</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Realtek ALC897 Codec<br>7.1-Channel High Definition Audio<br>Supports S/PDIF output</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Expansion Slots</strong></td></tr><tr><td>PCI</td><td>5x PCI-E x16 slot<br>PCI_E1 Gen PCIe 4.0 supports up to x16 (From CPU)<br>PCI_E2 Gen PCIe 3.0 supports up to x1 (From Chipset)<br>PCI_E3 Gen PCIe 4.0 supports up to x4 (From Chipset)<br>PCI_E4 Gen PCIe 3.0 supports up to x1 (From Chipset)<br>PCI_E5 Gen PCIe 3.0 supports up to x1 (From Chipset)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Memory</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td>Slots</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>Supported Memory</td><td>Memory Support DDR5 6400+(OC)/ 6200(OC)/ 6000(OC)/ 5800(OC)/ 5600(JEDEC)/ 5400(JEDEC)/ 5200(JEDEC)/ 5000(JEDEC)/ 4800(JEDEC)<br>Max. overclocking frequency:<br>• 1DPC 1R Max speed up to 6400+ MHz<br>• 1DPC 2R Max speed up to 5600+ MHz<br><br>Supports Intel® XMP 3.0 OC<br>Supports Dual-Controller Dual-Channel mode<br>Supports non-ECC, un-buffered memory</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum Memory</td><td>96GB</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Graphics</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Graphics</td><td>1x HDMI<br>Support HDMI 2.1 with HDR, maximum resolution of 4K 60Hz<br>1x DisplayPort<br>Support DP 1.4, maximum resolution of 4K 60Hz<br>1x D-Sub<br>Support VGA, maximum resolution of 2048x1536 50Hz, 2048x1280 60Hz, 1920x1200 60Hz</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connector &amp; Ports</strong></td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>1x HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>Display Port (s)</td><td>1x DisplayPort</td></tr><tr><td>D-Sub (s)</td><td>1x D-Sub</td></tr><tr><td>USB (s)</td><td>2x USB 2.0 (Rear)<br>4x USB 2.0 (Front)<br>4x USB 3.2 Gen1 Type A (Rear)<br>2x USB 3.2 Gen1 Type A (Front)</td></tr><tr><td>LAN Port (s)</td><td>Realtek RTL8125B 2.5Gbps LAN</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless Communication module</td><td>Intel Wi-Fi 6E<br>The Wireless module is pre-installed in the M.2 (Key-E) slot<br>Supports MU-MIMO TX/RX, 2.4GHz / 5GHz / 6GHz* (160MHz) up to 2.4Gbps<br>Supports 802.11 a/ b/ g/ n/ ac/ ax<br><br>Supports Bluetooth 5.3, FIPS, FISMA</td></tr><tr><td>Supported Storage</td><td>2x M.2<br>M.2_1 Source (From CPU) supports up to PCIe 4.0 x4 , supports 22110/2280/2260/2242 devices<br>M.2_2 Source (From Chipset) supports up to PCIe 4.0 x4 / SATA mode, supports 2280/2260/2242 devices<br>4x SATA 6G</td></tr><tr><td>RAID</td><td>Supports RAID 0, RAID 1, RAID 5 and RAID 10 for SATA storage devices</td></tr><tr><td>Internal I/O Ports</td><td>1x Power Connector(ATX_PWR)<br>2x Power Connector(CPU_PWR)<br>1x CPU Fan<br>1x Pump Fan<br>5x System Fan<br>2x Front Panel (JFP)<br>1x Chassis Intrusion (JCI)<br>1x Front Audio (JAUD)<br>1x Printer Port (JLPT)<br>1x Com Port (JCOM)<br>1x TBT connector (JTBT, supports RTD3)<br>2x Addressable V2 RGB LED connector (JARGB_V2)<br>1x RGB LED connector(JRGB)<br>4x USB 2.0 ports<br>2x USB 3.2 Gen1 Type A ports<br>1x USB 3.2 Gen1 Type C ports</td></tr><tr><td>TPM (Trusted Platform Module )</td><td>1x TPM pin header(Support TPM 2.0)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Others</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Special Features</td><td>4x EZ Debug LED</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>3 years</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'MotherBoard', 18500.00, 18500.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/PbYTJNExsYF9NkSAsDHV1QJgkywNmlpJKaebDDy1.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-27 16:13:59', '2026-06-27 16:13:59', 'MSI B760M BOMBER WIFI mATX Motherboard Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy the MSI B760M BOMBER WIFI mATX Motherboard in Bangladesh. Supports Intel 14th, 13th & 12th Gen processors, DDR5 6400+MHz, PCIe 4.0, Wi-Fi 6E, 2.5G LAN, Lightning Gen4 M.2, and Audio Boost with a 3-year warranty.', 'MSI B760M BOMBER WIFI, MSI B760M BOMBER WIFI Price in Bangladesh, MSI B760 Motherboard, MSI DDR5 Motherboard, Intel LGA 1700 Motherboard, B760 DDR5 Motherboard, WiFi 6E Motherboard, Gaming Motherboard, MSI mATX Motherboard, PCIe 4.0 Motherboard, MSI Motherboard BD, Intel 14th Gen Motherboard', NULL, 116, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `name`, `short_description`, `slug`, `description`, `specifications_text`, `tags`, `buy_price`, `price`, `discount_price`, `stock`, `thumbnail`, `video`, `is_featured`, `status`, `is_coming_soon`, `is_tba`, `is_call_for_price`, `is_out_of_stock`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`, `meta_keywords`, `meta_image`, `brand_id`, `supplier_id`, `laptop_purpose_id`) VALUES
(851, 'MSI H810M GAMING WIFI6E LGA 1851 mATX Motherboard', 'The MSI H810M GAMING WIFI6E LGA 1851 mATX Motherboard is a high-performance motherboard designed for Intel Core Ultra (Series 2) processors. Built on the Intel H810 chipset, it supports up to 128GB DDR5 memory, PCIe 5.0 graphics, PCIe 4.0 M.2 storage, Wi-Fi 6E, 5GbE LAN, and Bluetooth 5.3 for ultra-fast connectivity. Featuring MSI Core Boost, Memory Boost, Frozr Guard cooling, and Audio Boost, this motherboard delivers reliable performance for gaming, content creation, and everyday computing.', 'msi-h810m-gaming-wifi6e-lga-1851-matx-motherboard-1782577209', '<p>The <strong>MSI H810M GAMING WIFI6E LGA 1851 mATX Motherboard</strong> is a feature-rich gaming motherboard engineered to deliver exceptional performance, stability, and connectivity for modern desktop PCs. Powered by the <strong>Intel H810 chipset</strong>, it supports the latest <strong>Intel Core Ultra (Series 2) processors</strong> on the <strong>LGA 1851 socket</strong>, making it an excellent foundation for next-generation gaming, content creation, and professional workloads. Its compact <strong>micro-ATX form factor</strong> offers an ideal balance of expandability and space efficiency for a wide range of PC builds.</p><p>The motherboard supports <strong>dual-channel DDR5 memory</strong> with capacities up to <strong>128GB</strong> and overclocked speeds exceeding <strong>6400 MT/s</strong>, ensuring faster data transfer, improved multitasking, and enhanced application performance. With <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong>, users can easily optimize memory settings for maximum speed. MSI\'s <strong>Core Boost</strong> and <strong>Memory Boost</strong> technologies, combined with a durable <strong>6-layer server-grade PCB</strong> and <strong>6 P-PAK power system</strong>, provide stable power delivery and reliable system operation under demanding workloads.</p><p>To maintain optimal thermal performance, the MSI H810M GAMING WIFI6E features the advanced <strong>Frozr Guard cooling system</strong>, including an extended heatsink, <strong>7W/mK MOSFET thermal pads</strong>, additional choke thermal pads, and <strong>M.2 Shield Frozr</strong> for improved SSD cooling. Expansion options include a <strong>PCIe 5.0 x16 slot</strong> for the latest graphics cards, a <strong>PCIe 4.0 x4 M.2 slot</strong> for ultra-fast NVMe SSDs, and <strong>four SATA 6Gb/s ports</strong> for additional storage devices.</p><p>For high-speed networking, the motherboard is equipped with <strong>Realtek 5GbE LAN</strong>, <strong>Wi-Fi 6E</strong>, and <strong>Bluetooth 5.3</strong>, providing fast, stable, and low-latency connectivity for online gaming, streaming, and professional applications. Display connectivity includes <strong>HDMI 2.1</strong> and <strong>DisplayPort 1.4</strong>, supporting up to <strong>4K resolution at 60Hz</strong> with compatible processors. MSI\'s <strong>Audio Boost</strong>, powered by the <strong>Realtek ALC897 codec</strong>, delivers immersive <strong>7.1-channel HD audio</strong> for an enhanced gaming and entertainment experience.</p><p>The rear I/O panel includes a <strong>USB 20Gbps Type-C port</strong>, multiple <strong>USB 5Gbps</strong> and <strong>USB 2.0 ports</strong>, while the front panel supports an additional <strong>USB 10Gbps Type-C connector</strong>. DIY-friendly features such as <strong>EZ M.2 Clip II</strong>, <strong>EZ PCIe Clip II</strong>, <strong>EZ Antenna</strong>, <strong>EZ Debug LEDs</strong>, and <strong>EZ Memory Detection LEDs</strong> simplify installation and troubleshooting. With RGB lighting support, Windows 11 compatibility, premium build quality, and next-generation connectivity, the <strong>MSI H810M GAMING WIFI6E LGA 1851 mATX Motherboard</strong> is an outstanding choice for gamers and PC enthusiasts looking for a powerful and future-ready platform.</p><h3>Meta Title</h3>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Basic Information</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Supported CPU</td><td>Supports Intel Core Ultra Processors (Series 2)<br>LGA 1851</td></tr><tr><td>Chipset</td><td>INTEL H810</td></tr><tr><td>Form Factor</td><td>mATX<br>220mmx243.84mm</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Realtek ALC897 Codec<br>7.1-Channel High Definition Audio</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Expansion Slots</strong></td></tr><tr><td>PCI</td><td>1x PCI-E x16 slot<br>2x PCI-E x1 slot<br>PCI_E1 Gen PCIe 5.0 supports up to x16 (From CPU)<br>PCI_E2 Gen PCIe 4.0 supports up to x1 (From Chipset)<br>PCI_E3 Gen PCIe 4.0 supports up to x1 (From Chipset)</td></tr><tr><td>M.2 Socket</td><td>1x M.2<br>M.2_1 Source (From Chipset) supports up to PCIe 4.0 x4 , supports 2280/2260/2242 devices</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Memory</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td>Slots</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>Supported Memory</td><td>Memory Support DDR5 6400+(OC)/ 6200(OC)/ 6000(OC)/ 5800(OC)/ 5600(OC)/ 5400(OC)/ 5200(OC)/ 5000(OC)/ 4800(JEDEC) MT/s<br>Max. overclocking frequency:<br>• 1DPC 1R Max speed up to 6400+ MT/s<br>• 1DPC 2R Max speed up to 6400+ MT/s<br>Supports Intel POR Speed and JEDEC Speed<br>Supports Memory Overclocking and Intel XMP 3.0<br>Supports Dual-Controller Dual-Channel mode<br>Supports Non-ECC, Un-buffered memory<br>Supports CUDIMM</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum Memory</td><td>128GB</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Graphics</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Graphics</td><td>1x HDMI<br>Support HDMI 2.1, maximum resolution of 4K 60Hz<br>1x DisplayPort<br>Support DisplayPort 1.4, maximum resolution of 4K 60Hz</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connector &amp; Ports</strong></td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>1x HDMI 2.1</td></tr><tr><td>Display Port (s)</td><td>1x DisplayPort 1.4</td></tr><tr><td>USB (s)</td><td>4x USB 2.0 (Rear)<br>4x USB 2.0 (Front)<br>2x USB 5Gbps Type A (Rear)<br>2x USB 5Gbps Type A (Front)<br>1x USB 10Gbps Type C (Front)<br>1x USB 20Gbps Type C (Rear)</td></tr><tr><td>LAN Port (s)</td><td>Realtek 8126 5Gbps LAN</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless Communication module</td><td>Wi-Fi 6E module<br>The Wireless module is pre-installed in the M.2 (Key-E) slot<br>Supports MU-MIMO TX/RX, 2.4GHz / 5GHz / 6GHz (160MHz) up to 2.4Gbps<br>Supports 802.11 a/ b/ g/ n/ ac/ ax<br>Supports Bluetooth 5.3, FIPS, FISMA</td></tr><tr><td>Supported Storage</td><td>1x M.2<br>M.2_1 Source (From Chipset) supports up to PCIe 4.0 x4 , supports 2280/2260/2242 devices<br>4x SATA 6G</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>1x Front Audio (JAUD)</td></tr><tr><td>Internal I/O Ports</td><td>1x Power Connector(ATX_PWR)<br>1x Power Connector(CPU_PWR)<br>1x CPU Fan<br>2x System Fan<br>2x Front Panel (JFP)<br>1x Chassis Intrusion (JCI)<br>1x Front Audio (JAUD)<br>1x Tuning Controller connector(JDASH)<br>3x Addressable V2 RGB LED connector (JARGB_V2)<br>1x RGB LED connector(JRGB)<br>1x TPM pin header(Support TPM 2.0)<br>4x USB 2.0 ports<br>2x USB 5Gbps Type A ports<br>1x USB 10Gbps Type C ports</td></tr><tr><td>TPM (Trusted Platform Module )</td><td>1x TPM pin header(Support TPM 2.0)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Others</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Special Features</td><td>4x EZ Debug LED<br>1x EZ Memory Detection LED</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>3 Year warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'MotherBoard', 19900.00, 19900.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/Av5opqq6YdmUdSwv14jE5B13O8n49SAKvgIQ0FaO.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-27 16:20:09', '2026-06-27 16:20:09', 'MSI H810M GAMING WIFI6E LGA 1851 mATX Motherboard Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy the MSI H810M GAMING WIFI6E LGA 1851 mATX Motherboard in Bangladesh. Supports Intel Core Ultra Series 2 processors, DDR5 6400+MT/s, PCIe 5.0, Wi-Fi 6E, 5GbE LAN, PCIe 4.0 M.2, and Audio Boost. Includes a 3-year warranty.', 'MSI H810M GAMING WIFI6E, MSI H810M GAMING WIFI6E Price in Bangladesh, MSI H810 Motherboard, LGA 1851 Motherboard, Intel Core Ultra Motherboard, DDR5 Gaming Motherboard, MSI Gaming Motherboard, PCIe 5.0 Motherboard, WiFi 6E Motherboard, 5GbE LAN Motherboard, MSI mATX Motherboard, Intel H810 Motherboard, MSI Motherboard BD', NULL, 116, NULL, NULL),
(852, 'MSI B760 GAMING PLUS WIFI ATX Motherboard', 'The MSI B760 ATX DDR5 WiFi 6E Motherboard is a feature-packed desktop motherboard engineered for users who demand powerful performance, advanced connectivity, and excellent expandability. Powered by the Intel B760 chipset, it supports 14th, 13th, and 12th Gen Intel Core, Pentium Gold, and Celeron processors using the LGA 1700 socket, making it an ideal platform for gaming PCs, professional workstations, and high-performance desktop systems.', 'msi-b760-gaming-plus-wifi-atx-motherboard-1782577436', '<p>Built in the <strong>ATX form factor</strong>, the motherboard offers outstanding expansion capabilities with <strong>five PCIe slots</strong>, including a full-speed <strong>PCIe 4.0 x16 slot</strong> for modern graphics cards and an additional <strong>PCIe 4.0 x4 slot</strong> for high-bandwidth expansion devices. It supports up to <strong>192GB of dual-channel DDR5 memory</strong> across four DIMM slots, with memory overclocking speeds reaching <strong>6800+MHz</strong>, while <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> enables easy memory tuning for enhanced system performance.</p><p>For storage, the motherboard includes <strong>two PCIe 4.0 M.2 slots</strong> for ultra-fast NVMe SSDs and <strong>four SATA 6Gb/s ports</strong> supporting <strong>RAID 0, RAID 1, RAID 5, and RAID 10</strong>, providing flexible storage configurations for speed, redundancy, or increased capacity. High-speed networking is powered by <strong>Realtek 2.5 Gigabit LAN</strong>, while integrated <strong>Intel Wi-Fi 6E</strong> and <strong>Bluetooth 5.3</strong> ensure reliable wireless connectivity with lower latency and faster transfer speeds.</p><p>The motherboard features <strong>HDMI 2.1</strong> and <strong>DisplayPort 1.4</strong> outputs capable of delivering <strong>4K resolution at 60Hz</strong> with compatible Intel processors. Premium <strong>Realtek ALC897 7.1-channel High Definition Audio</strong> with S/PDIF output delivers immersive sound quality for gaming, entertainment, and multimedia applications.</p><p>Connectivity is further enhanced with a comprehensive selection of USB ports, including <strong>USB 3.2 Gen2 Type-C</strong>, <strong>USB 3.2 Gen2 Type-A</strong>, multiple USB 3.2 Gen1 ports, and USB 2.0 connections for modern peripherals. Internal headers support front-panel USB Type-C, RGB lighting, addressable ARGB devices, multiple cooling fans, TPM 2.0, Thunderbolt expansion, COM, and LPT ports, making the motherboard suitable for both modern and legacy applications.</p><p>Designed with system builders in mind, the motherboard includes <strong>four EZ Debug LEDs</strong> for simplified troubleshooting, robust cooling support with dedicated CPU, pump, and five system fan headers, and durable construction for long-term reliability. Combining DDR5 performance, PCIe 4.0 technology, Wi-Fi 6E, high-speed networking, and versatile expansion options, the <strong>MSI B760 ATX DDR5 WiFi 6E Motherboard</strong> is an excellent choice for users building a powerful and future-ready PC.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Basic Information</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Supported CPU</td><td>Supports 14th/13th/12th Gen Intel Core Processors, Pentium Gold and Celeron Processors<br>LGA1700</td></tr><tr><td>Chipset</td><td>INTEL B760</td></tr><tr><td>Form Factor</td><td>ATX<br>243.84mmx304.8mm</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Realtek ALC897 Codec<br>7.1-Channel High Definition Audio<br>Supports S/PDIF output</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Expansion Slots</strong></td></tr><tr><td>PCI</td><td>5x PCI-E x16 slot<br>PCI_E1 Gen PCIe 4.0 supports up to x16 (From CPU)<br>PCI_E2 Gen PCIe 3.0 supports up to x1 (From Chipset)<br>PCI_E3 Gen PCIe 4.0 supports up to x4 (From Chipset)<br>PCI_E4 Gen PCIe 3.0 supports up to x1 (From Chipset)<br>PCI_E5 Gen PCIe 3.0 supports up to x1 (From Chipset)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Memory</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td>Slots</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>Supported Memory</td><td>Memory Support DDR5 6800+(OC)/ 6600(OC)/ 6400(OC)/ 6200(OC)/ 6000(OC)/ 5800(OC)/ 5600(JEDEC)/ 5400(JEDEC)/ 5200(JEDEC)/ 5000(JEDEC)/ 4800(JEDEC) MHz<br>Max. overclocking frequency:<br>• 1DPC 1R Max speed up to 6800+ MHz<br>• 1DPC 2R Max speed up to 6400+ MHz<br>• 2DPC 1R Max speed up to 6000+ MHz<br>• 2DPC 2R Max speed up to 5600+ MHz<br><br>Supports Intel XMP 3.0 OC<br>Supports Dual-Controller Dual-Channel mode<br>Supports non-ECC, un-buffered memory</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum Memory</td><td>192GB</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Graphics</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Graphics</td><td>1x HDMI<br>Support HDMI 2.1 with HDR, maximum resolution of 4K 60Hz<br>1x DisplayPort<br>Support DP 1.4, maximum resolution of 4K 60Hz</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connector &amp; Ports</strong></td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>1x HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>Display Port (s)</td><td>1x DisplayPort</td></tr><tr><td>USB (s)</td><td>4x USB 2.0 (Rear)<br>4x USB 2.0 (Front)<br>2x USB 3.2 Gen1 Type A (Front)<br>1x USB 3.2 Gen1 Type C (Front)<br>2x USB 3.2 Gen2 Type A (Rear)<br>1x USB 3.2 Gen2 Type C (Rear)</td></tr><tr><td>LAN Port (s)</td><td>Realtek RTL8125BG 2.5G LAN</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless Communication module</td><td>Intel Wi-Fi 6E<br>The Wireless module is pre-installed in the M.2 (Key-E) slot<br>Supports MU-MIMO TX/RX, 2.4GHz / 5GHz / 6GHz* (160MHz) up to 2.4Gbps<br>Supports 802.11 a/ b/ g/ n/ ac/ ax<br><br>Supports Bluetooth 5.3, FIPS, FISMA</td></tr><tr><td>Supported Storage</td><td>2x M.2<br>M.2_1 Source (From CPU) supports up to PCIe 4.0 x4 , supports 22110/2280/2260/2242 devices<br>M.2_2 Source (From Chipset) supports up to PCIe 4.0 x4 / SATA mode, supports 2280/2260/2242 devices<br>4x SATA 6G</td></tr><tr><td>RAID</td><td>Supports RAID 0, RAID 1, RAID 5 and RAID 10 for SATA storage devices</td></tr><tr><td>Internal I/O Ports</td><td>1x Power Connector(ATX_PWR)<br>2x Power Connector(CPU_PWR)<br>1x CPU Fan<br>1x Pump Fan<br>5x System Fan<br>2x Front Panel (JFP)<br>1x Chassis Intrusion (JCI)<br>1x Front Audio (JAUD)<br>1x Printer Port (JLPT)<br>1x Com Port (JCOM)<br>1x TBT connector (JTBT, supports RTD3)<br>2x Addressable V2 RGB LED connector (JARGB_V2)<br>1x RGB LED connector(JRGB)<br>4x USB 2.0 ports<br>2x USB 3.2 Gen1 Type A ports<br>1x USB 3.2 Gen1 Type C ports</td></tr><tr><td>TPM (Trusted Platform Module )</td><td>1x TPM pin header(Support TPM 2.0)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Others</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Special Features</td><td>4x EZ Debug LED</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>3 years</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'MotherBoard', 22500.00, 22500.00, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-27 16:23:56', '2026-06-27 16:23:56', 'MSI B760 ATX DDR5 WiFi 6E Motherboard Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy the MSI B760 ATX DDR5 WiFi 6E Motherboard in Bangladesh. Supports Intel 14th, 13th & 12th Gen processors, DDR5 6800+MHz OC, PCIe 4.0, dual M.2, 2.5G LAN, Wi-Fi 6E, Bluetooth 5.3, and 192GB RAM with a 3-year warranty.', 'MSI B760 ATX Motherboard, MSI B760 DDR5 Motherboard, MSI B760 WiFi 6E, MSI B760 Motherboard Price in Bangladesh, Intel B760 Motherboard, LGA 1700 Motherboard, DDR5 Gaming Motherboard, MSI ATX Motherboard, PCIe 4.0 Motherboard, 2.5G LAN Motherboard, WiFi 6E Motherboard, Intel 14th Gen Motherboard, MSI Motherboard BD', NULL, 116, NULL, NULL),
(853, 'MSI PRO B860-P LGA 1851 ATX Motherboard', 'The MSI B860 ATX DDR5 Motherboard is a next-generation Intel motherboard designed for Intel Core Ultra (Series 2) processors. Featuring the Intel B860 chipset, it supports up to 256GB DDR5 memory at speeds of 8800+ MT/s (OC), PCIe 5.0 graphics, three M.2 slots, 5GbE LAN, Thunderbolt 4, and advanced USB connectivity. With premium power delivery, RAID support, and high-speed expansion, it is an excellent choice for gaming, AI computing, and professional workloads.', 'msi-pro-b860-p-lga-1851-atx-motherboard-1782577684', '<p>The <strong>MSI B860 ATX DDR5 Motherboard</strong> is a premium desktop motherboard built to unlock the full potential of <strong>Intel Core Ultra (Series 2) processors</strong>. Powered by the latest <strong>Intel B860 chipset</strong> and featuring a full-size <strong>ATX form factor</strong>, it provides outstanding performance, next-generation connectivity, and extensive expansion capabilities for gamers, content creators, AI developers, and professional users.</p><p>The motherboard supports up to <strong>256GB of dual-channel DDR5 memory</strong> across four DIMM slots, with overclocking speeds reaching an impressive <strong>8800+ MT/s</strong>. It is fully compatible with Intel XMP memory profiles, enabling users to maximize memory performance for faster multitasking, gaming, video editing, and demanding productivity applications.</p><p>For graphics and expansion, the MSI B860 features a <strong>PCIe 5.0 x16 slot</strong> for the latest high-performance graphics cards, along with additional PCIe 4.0 expansion slots for capture cards, storage controllers, and other peripherals. Storage performance is equally impressive with <strong>three M.2 slots</strong>, including a <strong>PCIe 5.0 x4 M.2 slot</strong> for ultra-fast next-generation NVMe SSDs, two PCIe 4.0 M.2 slots, and four SATA 6Gb/s ports. The motherboard also supports <strong>RAID 0, RAID 1, RAID 5, and RAID 10</strong> for both SATA and NVMe storage devices, offering flexible storage configurations.</p><p>Networking is powered by a <strong>Realtek 5Gb Ethernet controller</strong>, delivering ultra-fast wired connectivity for gaming, large file transfers, and professional workloads. Display options include <strong>HDMI 2.1</strong>, <strong>DisplayPort 1.4</strong>, and a <strong>Thunderbolt 4 USB Type-C port</strong> supporting <strong>DisplayPort 2.1</strong>, allowing resolutions up to <strong>4K at 120Hz</strong> or <strong>8K at 60Hz</strong> with compatible Intel processors.</p><p>The motherboard offers a comprehensive range of USB connectivity, including <strong>USB 10Gbps Type-C</strong>, multiple <strong>USB 10Gbps Type-A</strong>, <strong>USB 5Gbps</strong>, and USB 2.0 ports to accommodate modern peripherals and external storage devices. Internal connectors include a <strong>Thunderbolt 5 expansion header</strong>, TPM 2.0 support, multiple RGB and ARGB headers, dedicated CPU and system fan headers, PCIe power connector, and front-panel USB Type-C for enhanced system customization and future expansion.</p><p>Premium onboard audio is provided by the <strong>Realtek ALC897 7.1-Channel High Definition Audio codec</strong>, delivering clear and immersive sound for gaming, entertainment, and multimedia applications. The motherboard is also equipped with comprehensive cooling support, advanced power delivery, and durable components to ensure reliable performance during intensive workloads.</p><p>Combining <strong>PCIe 5.0</strong>, ultra-fast <strong>DDR5 memory</strong>, <strong>Thunderbolt 4</strong>, <strong>5Gb Ethernet</strong>, extensive storage options, and future-ready connectivity, the <strong>MSI B860 ATX DDR5 Motherboard</strong> is an ideal platform for building a powerful next-generation gaming PC, AI workstation, or high-performance desktop system.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Basic Information</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Supported CPU</td><td>Supports Intel Core Ultra Processors (Series 2)</td></tr><tr><td>Chipset</td><td>INTEL B860</td></tr><tr><td>Form Factor</td><td>ATX (243.84mmx304.8mm)</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Realtek® ALC897 Codec<br>7.1-Channel High Definition Audio</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Expansion Slots</strong></td></tr><tr><td>PCI</td><td>4x PCI-E x16 slot<br>PCI_E1 Gen PCIe 5.0 supports up to x16 (From CPU)<br>PCI_E2 Gen PCIe 4.0 supports up to x1 (From Chipset)<br>PCI_E3 Gen PCIe 4.0 supports up to x4 (From Chipset)<br>PCI_E4 Gen PCIe 4.0 supports up to x1 (From Chipset)</td></tr><tr><td>M.2 Socket</td><td>3x M.2</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Memory</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td>Slots</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>Supported Memory</td><td>4x DDR5 UDIMM,<br>Memory Support 8800 - 6400 (OC) MT/s / 6400 - 4800 (JEDEC) MT/s<br>Max. overclocking frequency:<br>• 1DPC 1R Max speed up to 8800+ MT/s<br>• 1DPC 2R Max speed up to 7200+ MT/s<br>• 2DPC 1R Max speed up to 6400+ MT/s<br>• 2DPC 2R Max speed up to 5600+ MT/s</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum Memory</td><td>Maximum Memory Capacity 256GB</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Graphics</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Graphics</td><td>1x HDMI<br>Support HDMI 2.1, maximum resolution of 4K 60Hz*<br>1x DisplayPort<br>Support DisplayPort 1.4, maximum resolution of 4K 60Hz*<br>1x Type-C DisplayPort<br>Thunderbolt 4 port, supporting DisplayPort 2.1 with UHBR20 over USB Type-C, with a maximum resolution of 4K@120Hz / 8K@60Hz*</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connector &amp; Ports</strong></td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>1x HDMI 2.1</td></tr><tr><td>Display Port (s)</td><td>1x DisplayPort<br>1x Type-C DisplayPort<br>Thunderbolt 4 port, supporting DisplayPort 1.4 over USB Type-C, with a maximum resolution of 4K 120Hz / 8K 60Hz*</td></tr><tr><td>USB (s)</td><td>4x USB 2.0 (Rear)<br>4x USB 2.0 (Front)<br>2x USB 5Gbps Type A (Rear)<br>4x USB 5Gbps Type A (Front)<br>2x USB 10Gbps Type A (Rear)<br>1x USB 10Gbps Type C (Front)</td></tr><tr><td>LAN Port (s)</td><td>Realtek 8126 5Gbps LAN</td></tr><tr><td>Supported Storage</td><td>3x M.2<br>M.2_1 Source (From CPU) supports up to PCIe 5.0 x4 , supports 2280/2260 devices<br>M.2_2 Source (From Chipset) supports up to PCIe 4.0 x4 , supports 2280/2260/2242 devices<br>M.2_3 Source (From Chipset) supports up to PCIe 4.0 x2 , supports 2280/2260 devices<br>4x SATA 6G</td></tr><tr><td>RAID</td><td>Supports RAID 0, RAID 1, RAID 5 and RAID 10 for SATA storage devices<br>Supports RAID 0, RAID 1, RAID 5 and RAID 10 for M.2 NVMe storage devices</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>1x Front Audio (JAUD)</td></tr><tr><td>Internal I/O Ports</td><td>1x Thunderbolt5 card connector(JTBT5, support RTD3)<br>1x Power Connector(ATX_PWR)<br>2x Power Connector(CPU_PWR)<br>1x Power Connector(PCIE_PWR 8pin)<br>1x CPU Fan<br>1x Combo Fan (Pump_Sys Fan)<br>4x System Fan<br>2x Front Panel (JFP)<br>1x Chassis Intrusion (JCI)<br>1x Front Audio (JAUD)<br>1x Com Port (JCOM)<br>1x Tuning Controller connector(JDASH)<br>2x Addressable V2 RGB LED connector (JARGB_V2)<br>1x RGB LED connector(JRGB)<br>4x USB 2.0 ports<br>4x USB 5Gbps Type A ports<br>1x USB 10Gbps Type C ports</td></tr><tr><td>TPM (Trusted Platform Module )</td><td>1x TPM pin header(Support TPM 2.0)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>3 Year warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'MotherBoard', 25400.00, 25400.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/q1JtAVzbUUd1tnI1FIxkmNv00RFUOVOLNS4PEqaa.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-27 16:28:04', '2026-06-27 16:28:04', 'MSI B860 ATX DDR5 Motherboard Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy the MSI B860 ATX DDR5 Motherboard in Bangladesh. Supports Intel Core Ultra Series 2 processors, DDR5 8800+ MT/s OC, PCIe 5.0, 3x M.2, Thunderbolt 4, 5GbE LAN, RAID support, and 256GB RAM with a 3-year warranty.', 'MSI B860 ATX Motherboard, MSI B860 DDR5 Motherboard, MSI B860 Price in Bangladesh, Intel B860 Motherboard, Intel Core Ultra Motherboard, LGA 1851 Motherboard, DDR5 Gaming Motherboard, PCIe 5.0 Motherboard, Thunderbolt 4 Motherboard, 5GbE LAN Motherboard, MSI Motherboard BD, MSI ATX Motherboard, AI PC Motherboard, Intel Series 2 Motherboard', NULL, 116, NULL, NULL),
(854, 'MSI PRO B860-P WIFI LGA 1851 ATX Motherboard', 'The MSI PRO B860-P WIFI LGA 1851 ATX Motherboard is a premium motherboard built for Intel Core Ultra (Series 2) processors. Powered by the Intel B860 chipset, it supports DDR5 memory up to 8600+ MT/s (OC), PCIe 5.0, Thunderbolt 4, 5GbE LAN, Wi-Fi, and advanced cooling technologies. Featuring a robust 12+1+1+1 digital power design, MSI AI Engine, Mystic Light, and EZ DIY features, it is an ideal choice for gaming, content creation, and professional desktop systems.', 'msi-pro-b860-p-wifi-lga-1851-atx-motherboard-1782578073', '<p>The <strong>MSI PRO B860-P WIFI LGA 1851 ATX Motherboard</strong> is a high-performance desktop motherboard engineered to meet the demands of gamers, content creators, AI developers, and professional users. Based on the latest <strong>Intel B860 chipset</strong>, it supports <strong>Intel Core Ultra (Series 2) processors</strong> on the <strong>LGA 1851 socket</strong>, delivering outstanding computing power and efficiency for next-generation desktop platforms.</p><p>Designed in the <strong>ATX form factor</strong>, the motherboard offers exceptional expandability and supports <strong>dual-channel DDR5 memory</strong> with overclocking speeds of up to <strong>8600+ MT/s</strong>, providing outstanding bandwidth for multitasking, gaming, video editing, AI applications, and intensive workloads. Its <strong>12+1+1+1 digital power delivery system</strong> ensures stable and efficient power distribution, allowing high-end Intel processors to perform at their full potential while maintaining excellent system stability.</p><p>For next-generation expansion, the motherboard features <strong>PCIe 5.0 support</strong> for the latest graphics cards and ultra-fast storage devices. Integrated <strong>Thunderbolt 4</strong> connectivity enables blazing-fast data transfer, high-resolution display output, and support for advanced peripherals through a single USB Type-C connection. High-speed networking is powered by <strong>5 Gigabit Ethernet</strong> and integrated <strong>Wi-Fi</strong>, providing fast, stable, and low-latency internet connectivity for gaming, streaming, cloud computing, and professional applications.</p><p>The MSI PRO B860-P WIFI is equipped with advanced thermal solutions, including <strong>Extended Heatsinks</strong> and <strong>M.2 Shield Frozr II</strong>, ensuring efficient heat dissipation for the VRM and high-speed NVMe SSDs during demanding workloads. MSI\'s intelligent features such as the <strong>AI Engine</strong> automatically optimize system performance based on user workloads, while <strong>Mystic Light</strong> allows complete RGB lighting customization for a personalized system appearance.</p><p>Building and upgrading the system is easier with MSI\'s <strong>EZ DIY</strong> design, including the <strong>EZ M.2 Shield Frozr II</strong>, which simplifies SSD installation and maintenance. Combined with premium build quality, future-ready connectivity, advanced cooling, and intelligent performance optimization, the <strong>MSI PRO B860-P WIFI LGA 1851 ATX Motherboard</strong> is an excellent platform for users seeking a reliable, high-performance motherboard capable of handling modern gaming, professional productivity, and AI computing tasks.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\"><strong>Basic Information</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Supported CPU</td><td>Supports Intel Core Ultra Processors (Series 2)</td></tr><tr><td>Chipset</td><td>INTEL B860</td></tr><tr><td>Form Factor</td><td>ATX (243.84mmx304.8mm)</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Realtek® ALC897 Codec<br>7.1-Channel High Definition Audio</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Expansion Slots</strong></td></tr><tr><td>PCI</td><td>4x PCI-E x16 slot<br>PCI_E1 Gen PCIe 5.0 supports up to x16 (From CPU)<br>PCI_E2 Gen PCIe 4.0 supports up to x1 (From Chipset)<br>PCI_E3 Gen PCIe 4.0 supports up to x4 (From Chipset)<br>PCI_E4 Gen PCIe 4.0 supports up to x1 (From Chipset)</td></tr><tr><td>M.2 Socket</td><td>3x M.2</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Memory</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td>Slots</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>Supported Memory</td><td>4x DDR5 UDIMM,<br>Memory Support 8800 - 6400 (OC) MT/s / 6400 - 4800 (JEDEC) MT/s<br>Max. overclocking frequency:<br>• 1DPC 1R Max speed up to 8800+ MT/s<br>• 1DPC 2R Max speed up to 7200+ MT/s<br>• 2DPC 1R Max speed up to 6400+ MT/s<br>• 2DPC 2R Max speed up to 5600+ MT/s</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum Memory</td><td>Maximum Memory Capacity 256GB</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Graphics</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Graphics</td><td>1x HDMI<br>Support HDMI 2.1, maximum resolution of 4K 60Hz*<br>1x DisplayPort<br>Support DisplayPort 1.4, maximum resolution of 4K 60Hz*<br>1x Type-C DisplayPort<br>Thunderbolt 4 port, supporting DisplayPort 2.1 with UHBR20 over USB Type-C, with a maximum resolution of 4K@120Hz / 8K@60Hz*</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Connector &amp; Ports</strong></td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>1x HDMI 2.1</td></tr><tr><td>Display Port (s)</td><td>1x DisplayPort<br>1x Type-C DisplayPort<br>Thunderbolt 4 port, supporting DisplayPort 1.4 over USB Type-C, with a maximum resolution of 4K 120Hz / 8K 60Hz*</td></tr><tr><td>USB (s)</td><td>4x USB 2.0 (Rear)<br>4x USB 2.0 (Front)<br>2x USB 5Gbps Type A (Rear)<br>4x USB 5Gbps Type A (Front)<br>2x USB 10Gbps Type A (Rear)<br>1x USB 10Gbps Type C (Front)</td></tr><tr><td>LAN Port (s)</td><td>Realtek 8126 5Gbps LAN</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless Communication module</td><td>Intel Wi-Fi 7<br>The Wireless module is pre-installed in the M.2 (Key-E) slot<br>Supports MU-MIMO TX/RX, 2.4GHz / 5GHz / 6GHz* (320MHz) up to 5.8Gbps<br>Supports 802.11 a/ b/ g/ n/ ac/ ax/ be<br><br>Supports Bluetooth 5.4**, MLO, 4KQAM</td></tr><tr><td>Supported Storage</td><td>3x M.2<br>M.2_1 Source (From CPU) supports up to PCIe 5.0 x4 , supports 2280/2260 devices<br>M.2_2 Source (From Chipset) supports up to PCIe 4.0 x4 , supports 2280/2260/2242 devices<br>M.2_3 Source (From Chipset) supports up to PCIe 4.0 x2 , supports 2280/2260 devices<br>4x SATA 6G</td></tr><tr><td>RAID</td><td>Supports RAID 0, RAID 1, RAID 5 and RAID 10 for SATA storage devices<br>Supports RAID 0, RAID 1, RAID 5 and RAID 10 for M.2 NVMe storage devices</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>1x Front Audio (JAUD)</td></tr><tr><td>Internal I/O Ports</td><td>1x Thunderbolt5 card connector(JTBT5, support RTD3)<br>1x Power Connector(ATX_PWR)<br>2x Power Connector(CPU_PWR)<br>1x Power Connector(PCIE_PWR 8pin)<br>1x CPU Fan<br>1x Combo Fan (Pump_Sys Fan)<br>4x System Fan<br>2x Front Panel (JFP)<br>1x Chassis Intrusion (JCI)<br>1x Front Audio (JAUD)<br>1x Com Port (JCOM)<br>1x Tuning Controller connector(JDASH)<br>2x Addressable V2 RGB LED connector (JARGB_V2)<br>1x RGB LED connector(JRGB)<br>4x USB 2.0 ports<br>4x USB 5Gbps Type A ports<br>1x USB 10Gbps Type C ports</td></tr><tr><td>TPM (Trusted Platform Module )</td><td>1x TPM pin header(Support TPM 2.0)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Warranty Information</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>3 Year warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'MotherBoard', 27800.00, 27800.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/z4C7CZ9IFMsB4QfQaVwpOWPp5fR4d58pd2ocgw5O.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-27 16:34:33', '2026-06-27 16:34:33', 'MSI PRO B860-P WIFI LGA 1851 ATX Motherboard Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy the MSI PRO B860-P WIFI LGA 1851 ATX Motherboard in Bangladesh. Supports Intel Core Ultra Series 2 processors, DDR5 8600+ MT/s OC, PCIe 5.0, Thunderbolt 4, 5GbE LAN, Wi-Fi, AI Engine, and Mystic Light with a 3-year warranty.', 'MSI PRO B860-P WIFI, MSI PRO B860-P WIFI Price in Bangladesh, MSI B860 Motherboard, Intel B860 Motherboard, LGA 1851 Motherboard, Intel Core Ultra Motherboard, DDR5 ATX Motherboard, PCIe 5.0 Motherboard, Thunderbolt 4 Motherboard, WiFi Motherboard, 5GbE LAN Motherboard, MSI ATX Motherboard, MSI Motherboard BD, Gaming Motherboard, AI PC Motherboard', NULL, 116, NULL, NULL),
(855, 'Pantum CTL-2100K Black Toner', 'The Pantum CTL-2100K Black Toner Cartridge delivers sharp black text and consistent laser printing for offices and home users. Featuring a page yield of up to 1,500 pages, it is compatible with Pantum CP2100D, CP2100DN, CP2100DW, CM2100DN, CM2100DW, CM2100ADN, and CM2100ADW printers. Purchase the genuine Pantum CTL-2100K Black Toner from International Office Solution for reliable performance and professional-quality prints.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\nGenuine Pantum Black Laser Toner Cartridge\r\nLaser Printing Technology\r\nSharp, bold, and professional black output\r\nUp to 1,500-page yield\r\nConsistent print quality throughout cartridge life\r\nEasy installation and reliable performance\r\nIdeal for office, business, and home printing\r\nCompatible with Pantum CP2100 Series and CM2100 Series printers', 'pantum-ctl-2100k-black-toner-1782706816', '<p>The <strong>Pantum CTL-2100K Black Toner Cartridge</strong> is designed to deliver outstanding laser printing performance for businesses, offices, educational institutions, and home users. Built with advanced laser printing technology, this genuine Pantum toner produces crisp black text, sharp graphics, and consistent print quality from the first page to the last. Whether you are printing contracts, reports, invoices, presentations, or everyday office documents, the CTL-2100K ensures professional-quality output with reliable performance.</p><p>With an impressive <strong>page yield of up to 1,500 pages</strong>, this toner cartridge helps reduce replacement frequency while maintaining excellent print consistency. Its precision-engineered toner formulation minimizes smudging and fading, providing clean, bold prints suitable for professional environments.</p><p>The Pantum CTL-2100K Black Toner is fully compatible with <strong>Pantum CP2100D, CP2100DN, CP2100DW, CM2100DN, CM2100DW, CM2100ADN, and CM2100ADW</strong> laser printers, ensuring seamless installation and dependable operation. As an original Pantum consumable, it helps protect your printer while delivering optimum performance and print quality.</p><p>Choose the <strong>Pantum CTL-2100K Black Toner Cartridge from International Office Solution</strong> for dependable printing, consistent output quality, and excellent value for your daily business and office printing requirements.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Printing Technology</td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Printing Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Supported Printer</td><td>Pantum CP2100D, Pantum CP2100DN, Pantum CP2100DW, Pantum CM2100DN, Pantum CM2100DW, Pantum CM2100ADN, Pantum CM2100ADW</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Page Yield</td><td>Up to 1,500 Pages (Coverage may vary depending on print content and usage)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Toner', 5700.00, 5800.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/maSv92rrUtq5yaFNoPNJnUDFKCLBfYworFgfix9X.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-06-29 04:20:16', '2026-06-29 04:20:16', 'Pantum CTL-2100K Black Toner Cartridge for CP2100 & CM2100 | International Office Solution', 'Buy the genuine Pantum CTL-2100K Black Toner Cartridge from International Office Solution. Compatible with Pantum CP2100 and CM2100 series printers, delivering up to 1,500 pages of sharp, professional laser printing.', 'Pantum CTL-2100K, Pantum CTL-2100K Black Toner, Pantum Black Toner, Pantum CP2100 Toner, Pantum CM2100 Toner, Pantum Laser Toner Cartridge, Pantum Printer Toner Bangladesh, Genuine Pantum Toner, Pantum 1500 Page Toner, International Office Solution, Pantum CP2100D Toner, Pantum CP2100DN Toner, Pantum CP2100DW Toner, Pantum CM2100DN Toner, Pantum CM2100DW Toner, Pantum CM2100ADN Toner, Pantum CM2