(867, 'EPON XPON ONU 1GE Wi-Fi Router', 'The EPON XPON ONU 1GE Wi-Fi Optical Network Unit is a reliable FTTH solution featuring 1.25Gbps EPON transmission, Gigabit Ethernet, built-in 2.4GHz Wi-Fi, and advanced remote management through TR-069, OMCI, OAM, WEB, and TELNET. With low power consumption, stable fiber connectivity, and easy installation, it is an ideal choice for homes, offices, and Internet Service Providers. Buy the genuine EPON ONU from International Office Solution at the best price in Bangladesh.', 'epon-xpon-onu-1ge-wi-fi-router-1782964261', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>EPON XPON ONU 1GE Wi-Fi Optical Network Unit</strong> is engineered to provide stable, high-speed fiber internet connectivity for modern homes and business environments. Designed for <strong>Fiber-to-the-Home (FTTH)</strong> applications, this ONU offers reliable performance with <strong>1.25Gbps upstream and downstream transmission</strong>, ensuring smooth internet access for streaming, video conferencing, online gaming, cloud applications, and everyday browsing.</p><p>Equipped with a <strong>10/100/1000Mbps Gigabit Ethernet port</strong>, the ONU allows users to connect high-speed wired devices such as desktop computers, IPTV boxes, switches, or wireless routers. The integrated <strong>2.4GHz Wi-Fi</strong> provides convenient wireless connectivity for smartphones, laptops, tablets, and smart home devices.</p><p>The device supports <strong>automatic negotiation</strong>, <strong>full/half duplex operation</strong>, and <strong>Auto MDI/MDI-X</strong>, ensuring seamless compatibility with various networking devices while eliminating the need for crossover cables.</p><p>For Internet Service Providers, the ONU offers comprehensive remote management through <strong>TR-069</strong>, <strong>OMCI</strong>, <strong>OAM</strong>, <strong>WEB</strong>, and <strong>TELNET</strong> interfaces. These management options simplify device configuration, firmware updates, monitoring, and troubleshooting.</p><p>Its optical performance is optimized with a <strong>transmitting optical power of 0 to +4dBm</strong> and an <strong>optical receiver sensitivity of -7dBm to -27dBm</strong>, providing stable communication over fiber networks.</p><p>The compact housing measures <strong>105 × 85 × 25 mm</strong>, making installation easy even in limited spaces. The ONU also features a durable design capable of operating in temperatures ranging from <strong>0°C to 60°C</strong>, while supporting storage temperatures from <strong>-40°C to 80°C</strong>.</p><p>The front panel includes intuitive <strong>LED indicators</strong> for Power, PON, LOS, LAN, and Wi-Fi status, enabling users and technicians to quickly identify network conditions and troubleshoot connectivity issues.</p><p>Operating on <strong>12V DC</strong> with a maximum power consumption of only <strong>5W</strong>, the device offers excellent energy efficiency without compromising performance.</p><p>Whether you\'re an ISP deploying fiber services or a home user looking for dependable fiber internet equipment, the <strong>EPON XPON ONU 1GE Wi-Fi Optical Network Unit</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> delivers stable performance, easy management, and long-term reliability.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>General</td><td>Product Type</td><td>EPON XPON ONU</td></tr><tr><td>General</td><td>Application</td><td>FTTH Optical Network Unit</td></tr><tr><td>Optical</td><td>EPON Speed</td><td>Upstream 1.25Gbps / Downstream 1.25Gbps</td></tr><tr><td>Optical</td><td>Transmitting Optical Power</td><td>0 ~ +4dBm</td></tr><tr><td>Optical</td><td>Receiver Sensitivity</td><td>≥ -7 ~ -27dBm</td></tr><tr><td>Ethernet</td><td>LAN Port</td><td>1 × 10/100/1000Mbps RJ45</td></tr><tr><td>Ethernet</td><td>Duplex Mode</td><td>Full/Half Duplex</td></tr><tr><td>Ethernet</td><td>Auto Negotiation</td><td>Supported</td></tr><tr><td>Ethernet</td><td>Auto MDI/MDI-X</td><td>Supported</td></tr><tr><td>Ethernet</td><td>Maximum Cable Distance</td><td>100m</td></tr><tr><td>Wireless</td><td>Wi-Fi</td><td>Built-in 2.4GHz Wireless</td></tr><tr><td>Management</td><td>Management Interface</td><td>WEB, TELNET, TR-069, OMCI, OAM</td></tr><tr><td>LED Indicator</td><td>Power</td><td>Power Status</td></tr><tr><td>LED Indicator</td><td>PON</td><td>ONU Registration Status</td></tr><tr><td>LED Indicator</td><td>LOS</td><td>Optical Link Status</td></tr><tr><td>LED Indicator</td><td>LAN</td><td>Ethernet Activity</td></tr><tr><td>LED Indicator</td><td>Wi-Fi</td><td>Wireless Activity</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Input Voltage</td><td>DC 12V / 0.5A</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>≤5W</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Connector</td><td>2.1mm × 5.5mm</td></tr><tr><td>Physical</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>105 × 85 × 25 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Environment</td><td>Operating Temperature</td><td>0°C ~ 60°C</td></tr><tr><td>Environment</td><td>Operating Humidity</td><td>10% ~ 85% (Non-condensing)</td></tr><tr><td>Environment</td><td>Storage Temperature</td><td>-40°C ~ 80°C</td></tr><tr><td>Environment</td><td>Storage Humidity</td><td>5% ~ 95% (Non-condensing)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'router', 1800.00, 1800.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/MXnJXvoPl0Q94FYQA3Qj9Ph5wWrjOoxXQCM0qBYi.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-02 03:51:01', '2026-07-02 03:51:01', 'EPON XPON ONU 1GE Wi-Fi Router Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the EPON XPON ONU 1GE Wi-Fi Optical Network Unit at the best price in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features 1.25Gbps EPON speed, Gigabit LAN, 2.4GHz Wi-Fi, TR-069, OMCI, WEB, and TELNET management for reliable FTTH internet connectivity.', 'EPON ONU price in Bangladesh\r\nXPON ONU price BD\r\nONU router price in Bangladesh\r\nFiber ONU Bangladesh\r\nEPON WiFi ONU\r\nGig