peration throughout its life cycle, making it an ideal solution for users who value productivity and consistent print quality. By using original HP toner, you also help protect your printer while ensuring every document reflects a professional standard.</p><p>Purchase the <strong>HP 05A Black Toner Cartridge (CE505A)</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> for genuine HP products, competitive pricing, and trusted customer support across Bangladesh.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li>Genuine HP Original LaserJet Toner Cartridge</li><li>Model: <strong>HP 05A (CE505A)</strong></li><li>Produces sharp black text and clear graphics</li><li>Prints up to <strong>2,300 pages</strong> at 5% page coverage</li><li>Consistent, reliable print quality</li><li>Easy to install and replace</li><li>Designed for smooth and efficient printer performance</li><li>Ideal for offices, businesses, educational institutions, and home users</li><li>Reduces the risk of print defects commonly associated with non-genuine cartridges</li></ul>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Printing Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Supported Printer</td><td>HP LaserJet P2035, HP LaserJet P2035n, HP LaserJet P2055dn, HP LaserJet P2055x</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Page Yield</td><td>Up to 2,300 Pages</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Toner', 12800.00, 12800.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/YrFjPMlZkXgFBxcPr8iKkqZNDzMVq6PFJuNrFcbC.png', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-02 05:18:53', '2026-07-02 05:18:53', 'HP 05A Black Toner Cartridge (CE505A) for HP LaserJet P2035 & P2055 Series | International Office Solution', 'Buy the original HP 05A Black Toner Cartridge (CE505A) from International Office Solution in Bangladesh. Compatible with HP LaserJet P2035, P2035n, P2055dn, an