(870, 'HP 416A Black LaserJet Toner Cartridge (Bundle With Full Set) -IOSBD', 'The HP 416A Black Original LaserJet Toner Cartridge (W2040A) is designed to deliver sharp black text, crisp graphics, and reliable printing for business and professional environments. Compatible with HP Color LaserJet Pro M454 and HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP M479 series printers, this genuine HP toner provides a page yield of up to 2,400 pages while maintaining consistent print quality throughout the cartridge\'s life. Equipped with HP JetIntelligence technology, anti-fraud protection, and Page Maximizer technology, the HP 416A ensures efficient performance and easy installation. Purchase the original HP 416A toner from International Office Solution for authentic HP quality and dependable printing.', 'hp-416a-black-laserjet-toner-cartridge-bundle-with-full-set-iosbd-1783007939', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>HP 416A Black Original LaserJet Toner Cartridge (W2040A)</strong> is a genuine HP toner cartridge developed to meet the demands of modern offices and businesses that require consistent, professional-quality printing. Designed specifically for the <strong>HP Color LaserJet Pro M454</strong> and <strong>HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP M479</strong> printer series, this cartridge delivers crisp black text, rich graphics, and dependable performance for everyday business printing.</p><p>With a page yield of <strong>up to 2,400 pages</strong>, the HP 416A Black Toner is ideal for printing reports, contracts, invoices, presentations, marketing materials, and other business documents. HP\'s advanced toner formulation ensures that every page maintains sharp detail and consistent print density from the first print to the last.</p><p>The HP 416A cartridge features <strong>HP JetIntelligence Technology</strong>, which enhances printer performance while helping users maximize toner efficiency. It also includes <strong>Page Maximizer Technology</strong>, enabling more printed pages with fewer cartridge replacements, helping improve productivity in busy office environments.</p><p>For added security, HP integrates <strong>Anti-Fraud Technology</strong> to help verify that you\'re using a genuine HP toner cartridge. The built-in <strong>Print Gauge Technology</strong> accurately monitors toner levels, allowing users to plan cartridge replacements before productivity is interrupted.</p><p>Installation is quick and hassle-free thanks to the <strong>Auto Seal Removal</strong> feature, allowing users to simply install the cartridge and begin printing without additional preparation.</p><p>HP has also designed the HP 416A with environmental responsibility in mind. The cartridge uses <strong>EcoSmart toner technology</strong>, reducing energy consumption during printing while maintaining excellent print quality. Original HP toner cartridges are also recyclable through HP\'s recycling program, helping reduce waste and support sustainable printing practices.</p><p>Unlike many compatible or remanufactured cartridges, the genuine HP 416A toner minimizes common printing problems such as streaking, faded output, toner leakage, and inconsistent print quality, helping extend printer life while lowering maintenance costs.</p><p>Whether you\'re operating a corporate office, educational institution, government organization, or home office, the <strong>HP 416A Black Original LaserJet Toner Cartridge (W2040A)</strong> delivers the reliability, efficiency, and professional results expected from an original HP product.</p><p>Buy with confidence from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted supplier of genuine HP printer consumables in Bangladesh.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Printing Technology</td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Printing Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><t