(874, 'HP 410A Yellow Original LaserJet Toner Cartridge-IOSBD', 'The HP 410A Original LaserJet Toner Cartridge delivers reliable, high-quality laser printing for professional offices and businesses. With a page yield of approximately 2,300 pages, this genuine HP toner produces sharp black text, vibrant graphics, and consistent print quality. Designed specifically for HP Color LaserJet Pro M452, M377, and M477 series printers, it ensures dependable performance and smooth printer operation.', 'hp-410a-yellow-original-laserjet-toner-cartridge-iosbd-1783073247', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>HP 410A Original LaserJet Toner Cartridge</strong> is designed to provide professional-quality printing with dependable performance for everyday business and office environments. Engineered by HP, this genuine toner cartridge produces crisp black text, sharp lines, and consistent print quality that makes reports, presentations, invoices, contracts, and marketing materials look professional every time.</p><p>With an approximate page yield of <strong>2,300 pages</strong> (based on ISO/IEC standards), the HP 410A toner is an excellent choice for businesses that require reliable printing without compromising on quality. The cartridge is carefully formulated to work seamlessly with compatible HP Color LaserJet Pro printers, helping maintain printer efficiency while reducing maintenance and unexpected interruptions.</p><p>Original HP toner cartridges are designed to deliver <strong>up to 71% more usable pages</strong> compared to many non-HP compatible cartridges, providing better value, consistent performance, and dependable print quality throughout the cartridge\'s lifespan. Using genuine HP toner also helps protect your printer from common issues associated with third-party consumables, ensuring smooth operation and longer printer life.</p><p>The HP 410A toner is fully compatible with the following HP printers:</p><ul><li>HP Color LaserJet Pro M452dn</li><li>HP Color LaserJet Pro M452dw</li><li>HP Color LaserJet Pro M452nw</li><li>HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP M377dw</li><li>HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP M477fdn</li><li>HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP M477fdw</li><li>HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP M477fnw</li></ul><p>Whether you are printing business documents, office correspondence, presentations, or daily reports, the HP 410A Original LaserJet Toner Cartridge consistently delivers professional-quality output while maximizing printer performance.</p><p>Purchase the genuine <strong>HP 410A Original LaserJet Toner Cartridge</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> for authentic HP printing supplies, competitive prices, and trusted customer service. We provide reliable printing solutions for businesses, educational institutions, and individual users across Bangladesh.</p><p><strong>Warranty:</strong> Manufacturing Warranty: <strong>No Warranty</strong></p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Product Type</td><td>Original LaserJet Toner Cartridge</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Model</td><td>HP 410A (CF410A)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Printing Technology</td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Printing Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Page Yield</td><td>Up to 2,300 Pages (Approx.)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Supported Printers</td><td>HP Color LaserJet Pro M452dn, M452dw, M452nw, HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP M377dw, HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP M477fdn, M477fdw, M477fnw</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance</strong></td><td>Print Quality</td><td>Sharp black text and consistent, professional-quality prints</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Reliability</td><td>Designed to deliver reliable performance with compatible HP printers</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Original HP Advantage</td><td>Produces an average of up to 71%