(876, 'Huion H430P Graphics Tablet-iosbd', 'The Huion H430P Graphics Tablet features a battery-free pen, detachable USB cable, lightweight portable design, and broad compatibility with Windows, macOS, and major creative software. Perfect for digital drawing, online teaching, photo editing, digital signatures, and OSU! gaming, it is an excellent graphics tablet for beginners and professionals alike. Available from International Office Solution with a 1-year official warranty.', 'huion-h430p-graphics-tablet-iosbd-1783075855', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Huion H430P Graphics Tablet</strong> is a versatile entry-level pen tablet that combines portability, accuracy, and convenience for digital creators and professionals. Whether you\'re sketching artwork, editing photos, teaching online, signing digital documents, or playing rhythm games like <strong>OSU!</strong>, the H430P delivers responsive and reliable performance.</p><p>One of its biggest advantages is the <strong>battery-free digital pen</strong>, eliminating the need for charging or replacing batteries. This allows uninterrupted creativity and productivity, ensuring your pen is always ready whenever inspiration strikes or work demands it.</p><p>The tablet also features a <strong>detachable USB cable</strong>, making transportation easier while extending the cable\'s lifespan. If the cable becomes damaged, you can simply replace it without replacing the entire device, making maintenance simple and cost-effective.</p><p>Designed with portability in mind, the Huion H430P measures only <strong>186.6 × 139.2 mm</strong> and weighs just <strong>135 grams</strong>. Its compact size allows users to carry it effortlessly inside a backpack or laptop bag, making it perfect for students, remote workers, and traveling professionals.</p><p>The H430P offers multiple applications beyond digital drawing. It serves as an excellent <strong>mouse replacement</strong> for precise cursor control, supports <strong>film and video editing</strong>, enables <strong>digital signature input</strong>, and is widely appreciated by OSU! players for its accuracy and responsiveness.</p><p>Compatibility is another major strength. The tablet supports <strong>Windows 7 or later</strong> and <strong>macOS 10.11 or later</strong>, while working seamlessly with popular creative applications such as Adobe Photoshop, Illustrator, Clip Studio Paint, Krita, Corel Painter, MediBang Paint, Paint Tool SAI, and many other digital art programs.</p><p>Whether you\'re just starting your digital art journey or looking for a reliable everyday graphics tablet, the <strong>Huion H430P Graphics Tablet</strong> offers outstanding value, portability, and dependable performance.</p><p>Purchase the genuine <strong>Huion H430P Graphics Tablet</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> for competitive pricing, authentic products, and trusted after-sales support.</p><h2><strong>Why Buy from International Office Solution?</strong></h2><ul><li>100% Genuine Huion Products</li><li>Best Price in Bangladesh</li><li>Fast Nationwide Delivery</li><li>Trusted IT &amp; Graphics Tablet Supplier</li><li>Professional Customer Support</li><li>Reliable After-Sales Service</li></ul>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>General</td><td>Brand</td><td>Huion</td></tr><tr><td>General</td><td>Model</td><td>H430P</td></tr><tr><td>General</td><td>Product Type</td><td>Graphics Drawing Tablet</td></tr><tr><td>Pen</td><td>Pen Type</td><td>Battery-Free Digital Pen</td></tr><tr><td>Pen</td><td>Charging</td><td>No Charging Required</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Interface</td><td>USB</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB Cable</td><td>Detachable USB Cable</td></tr><tr><td>Design</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>186.6 × 139.2 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Design</td><td>Weight</td><td>135g</td></tr><tr><td>Compat