(877, 'Huion Inspiroy RTE-100 Graphics Drawing Tablet-iosbd', 'The Huion Inspiroy RTE-100 Graphics Drawing Tablet features an ultra-slim 6.3mm design, battery-free digital pen, 8192 levels of pressure sensitivity, 300 PPS report rate, and four customizable shortcut keys. Compatible with Windows, macOS, ChromeOS, and Android, it is ideal for digital drawing, graphic design, online teaching, photo editing, and creative work. Available from International Office Solution with a 1-year official warranty.', 'huion-inspiroy-rte-100-graphics-drawing-tablet-iosbd-1783076418', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Huion Inspiroy RTE-100 Graphics Drawing Tablet</strong> is a modern pen tablet built for creators who demand portability, precision, and reliability. Its elegant full-covered surface and ultra-slim <strong>6.3mm</strong> profile make it comfortable to use while remaining easy to carry in a backpack or laptop bag, making it perfect for both office and remote work environments.</p><p>The included <strong>battery-free digital pen</strong> eliminates the need for charging or battery replacement, allowing uninterrupted creativity whenever inspiration strikes. The pen delivers a natural writing experience that closely resembles drawing on paper while providing exceptional accuracy for digital artwork, note-taking, and professional design work.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>8192 levels of pressure sensitivity</strong>, the RTE-100 accurately detects subtle changes in pen pressure, enabling artists to create smooth line transitions, detailed shading, and expressive brush strokes. Combined with a <strong>300 PPS report rate</strong>, the tablet ensures minimal latency, allowing every stroke to appear almost instantly for a highly responsive drawing experience.</p><p>To improve productivity, the tablet includes <strong>four customizable express keys</strong> that can be assigned to frequently used shortcuts such as Undo, Zoom, Brush Size, Copy, Paste, or other application-specific commands. This helps users streamline their workflow without relying heavily on keyboard shortcuts.</p><p>The Huion Inspiroy RTE-100 is suitable for a wide variety of applications, including digital illustration, graphic design, animation, photo editing, online teaching, handwritten note-taking, digital signatures, and remote collaboration. Whether you\'re a beginner learning digital art or a professional working on creative projects, the tablet delivers dependable performance.</p><p>Compatibility is another major strength of the RTE-100. It works seamlessly with <strong>Windows</strong>, <strong>macOS</strong>, <strong>ChromeOS</strong>, and <strong>Android</strong> devices, while supporting leading creative software such as Adobe Photoshop, Illustrator, Clip Studio Paint, Krita, Corel Painter, MediBang Paint, Paint Tool SAI, and many more.</p><p>With its combination of portability, professional-level pen performance, customizable controls, and broad compatibility, the <strong>Huion Inspiroy RTE-100 Graphics Drawing Tablet</strong> is an excellent investment for artists, designers, students, and educators.</p><p>Buy the genuine <strong>Huion Inspiroy RTE-100 Graphics Drawing Tablet</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> and enjoy competitive pricing, authentic products, and reliable after-sales support.</p><h2><strong>Huion Inspiroy RTE-100 Graphics Drawing Tablet</strong></h2><h2><strong>Huion Inspiroy RTE-100 Graphics Drawing Tablet Price in Bangladesh</strong></h2><p>The <strong>Huion Inspiroy RTE-100 Graphics Drawing Tablet</strong> is a slim, lightweight, and high-performance drawing tablet designed for digital artists, designers, students, educators, and creative professionals. Featuring a <strong>battery-free pen</strong>, <strong>8192 levels of pressure sensitivity</strong>, <strong>300 PPS report rate</strong>, and <strong>four customizable shortcut keys</strong>, the RTE-100 delivers a smooth and responsive drawing experience. With suppor