.5°C</strong> and an operating humidity range of <strong>20% to 80% RH</strong>, ensuring dependable performance in standard office environments.</p><p>For safe storage, the cartridge supports temperatures between <strong>-20°C and 40°C</strong> and can withstand non-operating humidity levels of <strong>10% to 90% RH</strong>, preserving toner quality until installation.</p><p>Whether you\'re printing colorful marketing materials, business presentations, detailed reports, or high-volume office documents, the <strong>HP 648A Original LaserJet Toner Cartridge</strong> provides outstanding performance, vivid print quality, and dependable results every time.</p><p>Purchase the genuine <strong>HP 648A Original LaserJet Toner Cartridge</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> to receive authentic HP products, competitive pricing, and trusted customer support across Bangladesh.</p><p><strong>Manufacturing Warranty:</strong> No Warranty.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Product Type</td><td>Original HP LaserJet Toner Cartridge</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Model</td><td>HP 648A</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Printing Technology</td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Printing Color</td><td>Color (Varies by cartridge model)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Page Yield</td><td>Up to 11,000 Pages (Approx.)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance</strong></td><td>Print Quality</td><td>Delivers vibrant colors, sharp text, and professional-quality prints</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Reliability</td><td>Designed for consistent, high-volume printing performance with HP LaserJet printers</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Environmental Specifications</strong></td><td>Recycled Material Content</td><td>13% Recycled Material</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Operating Temperature</