(907, 'HP 147A Black Original LaserJet Toner-IOSBD', 'The HP 147A Black Original LaserJet Toner Cartridge is designed to deliver consistent, professional-quality black prints for business and office environments. Featuring advanced HP Laser printing technology, this genuine toner cartridge offers a page yield of up to 10,500 pages, making it ideal for high-volume printing tasks. It is compatible with HP LaserJet Enterprise M610, M611, M612, MFP M634, M635, and M636 series printers. With easy cartridge installation, energy-efficient performance, and dependable print quality, the HP 147A toner is an excellent choice for maximizing productivity. Buy the genuine HP 147A Black Toner from International Office Solution for reliable performance and authentic HP quality.', 'hp-147a-black-original-laserjet-toner-iosbd-1783157858', '<p>The <strong>HP 147A Black Original LaserJet Toner Cartridge</strong> is engineered to meet the demanding printing needs of modern businesses, corporate offices, and professional workspaces. Designed specifically for HP LaserJet Enterprise printers, this genuine HP toner delivers crisp black text, sharp graphics, and consistent print quality from the first page to the last.</p><p>With an impressive page yield of <strong>up to 10,500 pages</strong>, the HP 147A toner cartridge is ideal for organizations that require high-volume, reliable printing while minimizing cartridge replacements and reducing operational downtime. HP\'s precision black toner technology ensures professional-quality documents, making it suitable for reports, invoices, contracts, presentations, and everyday office printing.</p><p>The HP 147A toner also supports energy-efficient printing by helping HP LaserJet printers operate with lower energy consumption compared to many conventional toner solutions. Additionally, HP promotes environmental sustainability through its cartridge recycling program, allowing used Original HP toner cartridges to be recycled responsibly.</p><p>Design