rts, or marketing documents, this original HP toner ensures rich cyan colors, smooth gradients, and outstanding print clarity.</p><p>Unlike many third-party toner cartridges, the HP 645A is engineered specifically for HP printers, ensuring seamless compatibility, dependable operation, and reduced maintenance. Genuine HP toner helps minimize print defects such as streaking, color inconsistency, and toner leakage while protecting the long-term performance of your printer.</p><p>The cartridge is compatible with a wide range of HP Color LaserJet 5500 and 5550 series printers, including <strong>HP Color LaserJet 5500, 5500n, 5500dn, 5500dtn, 5500hdn, 5550, 5550n, 5550dn, 5550dtn, and 5550hdn</strong>. Before purchasing, users should verify that their existing cartridge model is <strong>HP 645A (C9731A)</strong> to ensure full compatibility.</p><p>Purchase the genuine <strong>HP 645A Cyan Original LaserJet Toner Cartridge</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> to enjoy authentic HP quality, competitive pricing, professional customer support, and fast nationwide delivery throughout Bangladesh.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Product Name</td><td>HP 645A Cyan Original LaserJet Toner Cartridge</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Model</td><td>645A (C9731A)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Printing Technology</td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Printing Color</td><td>Cyan</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance</strong></td><td>Page Yield</td><td>Up to <strong>12,000 Color Pages</strong></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Yield Standard</td><td>Approximate yield based on <strong>5% average page coverage</strong>. Actual page yield may vary depending on printed content and usage conditions.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Supported Printers</td><td>HP Color LaserJet 5500, 5500n, 5500dn, 5500dtn, 5500hdn, 5550, 5550n, 5550dn, 5550dtn, 5550hdn</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Package Information</strong></td><td>Compatibility Note</td><td>Please verify that your existing toner cartridge model is <strong>HP 645A (C9731A)</strong> before purchasing to ensure compatibility.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Toner', 33000.00, 33500.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/EptchReoN0S0715MaS7pLxEbuVs9Wai5v9f4YpCW.png', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-04 14:30:29', '2026-07-04 14:30:29', 'HP 645A Cyan Original LaserJet Toner Cartridge (C9731A) for HP Color LaserJet 5500 & 5550 Series | International Office Solution', 'Buy the HP 645A Cyan Original LaserJet Toner Cartridge (C9731A) from International Office Solution. Print up to 12,000 vibrant color pages with genuine HP quality. Compatible with HP Color LaserJet 5500 and 5550 series printers.', 'HP 645A Cyan Toner, HP C9731A Toner, HP 645A Original Toner, HP Cyan LaserJet Toner, HP Color LaserJet 5500 Toner, HP 5500 Toner Cartridge, HP 5500dn Toner, HP 5500n Toner, HP 5500dtn Toner, HP 5550 Toner Cartridge, HP 5550dn Toner, HP 5550n Toner, HP 5550dtn Toner, Genuine HP Toner Bangladesh, Original HP Toner Cartridge, HP Color Printer Toner, HP Toner Price Bangladesh, Buy HP 645A Toner, HP C9731A Price, International Office Solution', NULL, 1, NULL, NULL),
(919, 'Anker A8742H11 1.8M 8K HDMI Cable', 'The Anker A8742H11 1.8M 8K HDMI Cable is a premium HDMI 2.1 cable designed for ultra-high-definition entertainment and professional applications. Supporting 8K@60Hz, 4K@120Hz, and 48Gbps bandwidth, it delivers crystal-clear video, smooth gameplay, and immersive audio. Dynamic HDR support enhances picture quality, while its durable construction withstands over 1,000 bends for long-lasting reliability. Official HDMI Forum certification ensures broad compatibility with modern TVs, gaming consoles, monitors, projectors, and laptops. Its 1.8-meter length provides convenient connectivity for home, office, and gaming setups.', 'anker-a8742h11-18m-8k-hdmi-cable-1783176955', '<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Experience Next-Generation Audio &amp; Video Performance</strong></h2><p>The <strong>Anker A8742H11 1.8M 8K HDMI Cable</strong> is designed to meet the growing demands of today\'s high-resolution displays and high-performance entertainment systems. Built on the latest <strong>HDMI 2.1 technology</strong>, this cable delivers outstanding speed, stability, and image quality for users who require uncompromised performance.</p><p>Supporting <strong>48Gbps bandwidth</strong>, it enables uncompressed transmission of ultra-high-definition video and multi-channel digital audio without lag, flickering, or signal degradation. Whether you\'re watching blockbuster movies, editing high-resolution content, or playing competitive games, this cable provides a consistently smooth experience.</p><h2><strong>Stunning 8K Resolution</strong></h2><p>Enjoy breathtaking image clarity with support for <strong>8K resolution at 60Hz</strong>. Every detail appears sharper, colors become more vibrant, and visuals feel more lifelike than ever before. For gamers and high-refresh-rate monitor users, support for <strong>4K at 120Hz</strong> delivers exceptionally fluid gameplay with reduced motion blur and improved responsiveness.</p><h2><strong>Dynamic HDR Technology</strong></h2><p>Dynamic HDR optimizes every frame individually, improving brightness, contrast, and color depth scene by scene. The result is richer blacks, brighter highlights, and more accurate colors that create an immersive viewing experience for movies, games, and multimedia content.</p><h2><strong>Built for Gaming</strong></h2><p>The Anker A8742H11 is an excellent choice for gamers using <strong>PlayStation 5</strong>, <strong>Xbox Series X/S</strong>, and high-performance gaming PCs. High bandwidth and high refresh rate support help minimize input lag while delivering ultra-smooth gameplay and responsive performance.</p><h2><strong>Exceptional Durability</strong></h2><p>Unlike ordinary HDMI cables, the Anker A8742H11 is constructed using premium materials designed for everyday reliability. It has been tested to endure <strong>over 1,000 bend cycles</strong>, ensuring dependable performance even after years of regular use.</p><h2><strong>Wide Compatibility</strong></h2><p>Compatible with virtually every HDMI-enabled device, including:</p><ul><li>8K &amp; 4K Smart TVs</li><li>Gaming Consoles</li><li>Desktop Computers</li><li>Laptops</li><li>Gaming Monitors</li><li>Projectors</li><li>AV Receivers</li><li>Blu-ray Players</li><li>Streaming Devices</li><li>Graphics Cards</li></ul><h2><strong>HDMI Forum Certified</strong></h2><p>Official HDMI Forum certification guarantees full compliance with HDMI 2.1 specifications, providing confidence in performance, compatibility, and long-term reliability.</p><h2><strong>Why Buy from International Office Solution?</strong></h2><p>At <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, we provide 100% genuine Anker products backed by an official warranty. Our commitment to authentic products, competitive pricing, expert customer support, and fast nationwide delivery makes us a trusted source for premium IT accessories in Bangladesh. Whether you\'re upgrading your gaming setup, building a home theater, or equipping a professional workspace, the Anker A8742H11 HDMI Cable is an excellent investment for superior connectivity.</p><p><strong>Warranty:</strong> 18 Months Official Warranty.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>General</td><td>Brand</td><td>Anker</td></tr><tr><td>General</td><td>Model</td><td>A8742H11</td></tr><tr><td>General</td><td>Product Type</td><td>HDMI Cable</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>HDMI Version</td><td>HDMI 2.1</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Connector Type</td><td>HDMI Male to HDMI Male</td></tr><tr><td>Performance</td><td>Maximum Resolution</td><td>8K (7680 × 4320) @ 60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Performance</td><td>Supported Resolution</td><td>4K (3840 × 2160) @ 120Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Performance</td><td>Bandwidth</td><td>48Gbps</td></tr><tr><td>Performance</td><td>HDR Support</td><td>Dynamic HDR</td></tr><tr><td>Performance</td><td>Audio Support</td><td>High-Definition Digital Audio</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>Compatible Devices</td><td>8K/4K TVs, Monitors, Gaming Consoles, Laptops, PCs, Projectors, AV Receivers, Blu-ray Players, Streaming Devices</td></tr><tr><td>Build Quality</td><td>Durability</td><td>Tested for 1,000+ Bend Cycles</td></tr><tr><td>Certification</td><td>Certification</td><td>Official HDMI Forum Certified</td></tr><tr><td>Physical</td><td>Cable Length</td><td>1.8M (6 Feet)</td></tr><tr><td>Physical</td><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td><td>18 Months</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Cable', 650.00, 640.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/d4v7NW5WrDG6T7CKKifHx3Y7OObkfwV1SLqKLNx0.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-04 14:55:55', '2026-07-04 14:55:55', 'Anker A8742H11 1.8M 8K HDMI 2.1 Cable Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the original Anker A8742H11 1.8M 8K HDMI 2.1 Cable from International Office Solution in Bangladesh. Supports 8K@60Hz, 4K@120Hz, 48Gbps bandwidth, Dynamic HDR, and HDMI Forum certification with an 18-month warranty.', 'Anker A8742H11, Anker HDMI Cable, Anker 8K HDMI Cable, HDMI 2.1 Cable Bangladesh, 8K HDMI Cable Price in Bangladesh, 4K 120Hz HDMI Cable, 48Gbps HDMI Cable, Original Anker Cable, HDMI Cable for PS5, HDMI Cable for Xbox Series X, HDMI Cable for Gaming, HDMI Cable for 4K TV, HDMI Cable for Monitor, HDMI Cable for Projector, HDMI Cable BD, Anker Accessories Bangladesh, International Office Solution, HDMI Cable Price BD', NULL, 309, NULL, NULL),
(920, 'Vention AACBF 1Meter High-Speed HDMI Cable', 'The Vention AACBF 1 Meter High-Speed HDMI Cable delivers reliable 4K Ultra HD performance with 18Gbps bandwidth, supporting 4K@60Hz, HDR, Dolby TrueHD 7.1 audio, ARC, and HDMI Ethernet Channel. Designed with 24K gold-plated connectors, triple shielding, and a durable TPE jacket, it ensures stable signal transmission and long-lasting durability. Ideal for TVs, monitors, projectors, gaming consoles, laptops, and desktop computers, it provides outstanding picture and sound quality for both home and professional use.', 'vention-aacbf-1meter-high-speed-hdmi-cable-1783177429', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Vention AACBF 1 Meter High-Speed HDMI Cable</strong> is engineered for users who demand high-quality digital audio and video performance. With a maximum transmission bandwidth of <strong>18Gbps</strong>, it easily handles Ultra HD content while maintaining stable and uninterrupted signal quality.</p><p>Supporting <strong>4K resolution at 60Hz</strong>, this cable delivers incredibly sharp visuals, smooth frame rates, and vibrant color reproduction, making it perfect for streaming, gaming, presentations, and multimedia applications.</p><h2><strong>HDR for More Realistic Images</strong></h2><p>High Dynamic Range (HDR) technology significantly improves image quality by increasing brightness, contrast, and color accuracy. Every scene appears more detailed and lifelike, enhancing movies, games, and video content on compatible displays.</p><h2><strong>Immersive Surround Sound</strong></h2><p>The cable supports <strong>Dolby TrueHD 7.1-channel audio</strong>, providing rich, cinematic sound quality that complements Ultra HD video. Whether you\'re watching movies or playing games, you\'ll experience immersive, high-definition audio without compression.</p><h2><strong>Mirror &amp; Extended Display Modes</strong></h2><p>The Vention AACBF offers both <strong>Mirror Mode</strong> and <strong>Extended Mode</strong>, allowing flexible display configurations.</p><ul><li><strong>Mirror Mode</strong> duplicates your laptop or desktop screen onto a larger display, making it ideal for presentations, home theaters, and media streaming.</li><li><strong>Extended Mode</strong> creates an additional workspace by treating each display independently, improving multitasking and productivity.</li></ul><h2><strong>Built for Long-Term Reliability</strong></h2><p>Designed for everyday use, the cable features a durable <strong>TPE outer jacket</strong> tested to withstand over <strong>3,000 90-degree bend cycles</strong>. The <strong>24K gold-plated connectors</strong> resist corrosion while ensuring stable signal transmission over time.</p><p>Triple-layer shielding protects against electromagnetic interference (EMI), reducing signal loss and maintaining superior picture and sound quality.</p><h2><strong>Wide Device Compatibility</strong></h2><p>Compatible with a wide range of HDMI-enabled devices, including:</p><ul><li>Smart TVs</li><li>4K Monitors</li><li>Projectors</li><li>Desktop Computers</li><li>Laptops</li><li>PlayStation</li><li>Xbox</li><li>Blu-ray Players</li><li>AV Receivers</li><li>Streaming Devices</li><li>Graphics Cards</li></ul><h2><strong>Why Buy from International Office Solution?</strong></h2><p>At <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, we supply only genuine Vention products at competitive prices in Bangladesh. Our customers benefit from authentic products, reliable after-sales service, fast nationwide delivery, and dedicated customer support. Whether you\'re upgrading your home entertainment system or building a professional workstation, the Vention AACBF HDMI Cable offers dependable performance you can trust.</p><p><strong>Warranty:</strong> <strong>1 Year Official Warranty</strong></p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>General</td><td>Brand</td><td>Vention</td></tr><tr><td>General</td><td>Model</td><td>AACBF</td></tr><tr><td>General</td><td>Product Type</td><td>High-Speed HDMI Cable</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>HDMI Version</td><td>HDMI 2.0</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Connector Type</td><td>HDMI Male to HDMI Male</td></tr><tr><td>Performance</td><td>Maximum Resolution</td><td>3840 × 2160 (4K) @ 60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Performance</td><td>Bandwidth</td><td>18Gbps</td></tr><tr><td>Performance</td><td>HDR Support</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Performance</td><td>3D Support</td><td>Up to 1080p @ 120Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Audio Format</td><td>Dolby TrueHD 7.1</td></tr><tr><td>Features</td><td>ARC</td><td>Supported</td></tr><tr><td>Features</td><td>HDMI Ethernet Channel (HEC)</td><td>Supported</td></tr><tr><td>Features</td><td>Display Modes</td><td>Mirror Mode, Extended Mode</td></tr><tr><td>Build Quality</td><td>Connector</td><td>24K Gold-Plated</td></tr><tr><td>Build Quality</td><td>Shielding</td><td>Triple Shielding</td></tr><tr><td>Build Quality</td><td>Jacket Material</td><td>TPE</td></tr><tr><td>Durability</td><td>Bend Lifespan</td><td>3,000+ Bend Cycles</td></tr><tr><td>Physical</td><td>Cable Length</td><td>1 Meter</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td><td>1 Year Official Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Cable', 240.00, 230.00, NULL, 6, 'products/thumbnails/yzWyqLLKQcvk0dzDqUPT3Jv93HaBsMtbqAzXSLjG.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-04 15:03:49', '2026-07-04 15:03:49', 'Vention AACBF 1 Meter High-Speed HDMI Cable Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the original Vention AACBF 1 Meter High-Speed HDMI Cable from International Office Solution in Bangladesh. Supports 4K@60Hz, 18Gbps bandwidth, HDR, ARC, HDMI Ethernet, Dolby TrueHD, and gold-plated connectors with a 1-year warranty.', 'Vention AACBF, Vention HDMI Cable, Vention 1 Meter HDMI Cable, HDMI Cable Bangladesh, 4K HDMI Cable Price in Bangladesh, High Speed HDMI Cable, HDMI 2.0 Cable, 18Gbps HDMI Cable, HDR HDMI Cable, Gold Plated HDMI Cable, HDMI Cable for TV, HDMI Cable for Monitor, HDMI Cable for Projector, HDMI Cable for PS5, HDMI Cable for Xbox, Original Vention Cable, Vention Accessories Bangladesh, International Office Solution', NULL, 478, NULL, NULL);
