(921, 'Dtech DT-H003 1.5M HDMI To HDMI Cable', 'The Dtech DT-H003 1.5M HDMI to HDMI Cable is a high-performance HDMI 2.0 cable that supports 4K Ultra HD resolution, 18Gbps bandwidth, HDCP 2.2, CEC, EDID, and 3D video. Featuring gold-plated connectors and premium shielding, it ensures stable signal transmission with excellent audio and video quality. Its durable 1.5-meter design makes it ideal for connecting TVs, monitors, projectors, gaming consoles, laptops, and desktop computers.', 'dtech-dt-h003-15m-hdmi-to-hdmi-cable-1783178013', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Dtech DT-H003 1.5M HDMI to HDMI Cable</strong> is built to deliver outstanding digital audio and video performance for today\'s high-definition entertainment and professional display systems. Supporting the HDMI 2.0 standard, it offers fast, stable transmission with a maximum bandwidth of <strong>18Gbps</strong>, making it an excellent choice for Ultra HD content and high-performance multimedia applications.</p><p>Whether you\'re watching 4K movies, delivering business presentations, gaming, or connecting multiple display devices, this cable provides consistent performance with minimal signal loss.</p><h2><strong>Ultra HD 4K Resolution Support</strong></h2><p>Enjoy stunning picture quality with support for <strong>4K Ultra HD resolution (4096 × 2160)</strong>. The cable delivers sharp images, vibrant colors, and smooth motion, making it perfect for large-screen televisions, gaming monitors, projectors, and multimedia displays.</p><h2><strong>Superior Audio &amp; Video Performance</strong></h2><p>Designed to carry both high-definition video and multi-channel digital audio through a single cable, the Dtech DT-H003 simplifies your setup while maintaining excellent sound and image quality. Support for <strong>HDCP 2.2</strong>, <strong>CEC</strong>, <strong>EDID</strong>, and <strong>3D video</strong> ensures broad compatibility with modern entertainment systems.</p><h2><strong>Premium Build Quality</strong></h2