(922, 'HP 645A Magenta Original LaserJet Toner Cartridge-IOSBD', 'The HP 645A Magenta Original LaserJet Toner Cartridge (C9733A) is designed to produce vibrant magenta prints with exceptional color accuracy and reliable performance. Delivering a page yield of up to 12,000 pages at 5% average coverage, this genuine HP toner cartridge is ideal for high-volume office printing, business presentations, brochures, and professional marketing materials. Designed for HP Color LaserJet 5500 and 5550 series printers, it provides consistent print quality, smooth operation, and dependable performance. Buy the genuine HP 645A Magenta Toner from International Office Solution for authentic HP products, competitive prices, and fast nationwide delivery across Bangladesh.', 'hp-645a-magenta-original-laserjet-toner-cartridge-iosbd-1783178132', '<p>The <strong>HP 645A Magenta Original LaserJet Toner Cartridge (C9733A)</strong> is a genuine HP toner cartridge engineered to deliver outstanding magenta color reproduction, professional print quality, and reliable performance for demanding business environments. Designed specifically for HP Color LaserJet 5500 and 5550 series printers, this cartridge consistently produces rich magenta colors, sharp graphics, and smooth color gradients that enhance every printed document.</p><p>With a <strong>high page yield of approximately 12,000 pages</strong> based on 5% average page coverage, the HP 645A Magenta Toner is an excellent solution for organizations with high-volume printing requirements. Its high-capacity design reduces the need for frequent cartridge replacements, helping businesses improve productivity while lowering printing interruptions.</p><p>HP\'s advanced Laser printing technology ensures that every page is produced with exceptional color consistency and professional-quality output. Whether you\'re printing business proposals, reports, presentations, brochures, flyers, catalogs, promotional materials, or colorful graphics, the HP 645A