(923, 'Onten OTN-8310 0.006M 4K HDMI Cable', 'The Onten OTN-8310 4K HDMI Adapter is a compact and high-performance HDMI male-to-female adapter designed to provide seamless connectivity between HDMI-enabled devices. Supporting resolutions up to 4K Ultra HD (3840 × 2160), this adapter delivers sharp visuals and stable audio transmission, making it ideal for home entertainment, office presentations, gaming setups, and professional display applications.', 'onten-otn-8310-0006m-4k-hdmi-cable-1783178259', '<h2>Compact 4K HDMI Extension Solution</h2><p>The <strong>Onten OTN-8310 4K HDMI Adapter</strong> is designed for users who need a reliable and space-efficient HDMI extension solution. Featuring an <strong>HDMI male connector</strong> on one side and an <strong>HDMI female connector</strong> on the other, this adapter allows you to extend or reposition your HDMI connection without sacrificing signal quality.</p><p>Its compact size makes it particularly useful in confined spaces where standard HDMI cables may place unnecessary stress on device ports.</p><h2>Crisp 4K Ultra HD Video</h2><p>Supporting <strong>4K Ultra HD resolution (3840 × 2160)</strong>, the OTN-8310 delivers outstanding image quality with sharp details, vivid colors, and smooth video playback. It is suitable for watching Ultra HD movies, gaming, business presentations, and professional multimedia applications.</p><h2>Reliable Audio &amp; Video Transmission</h2><p>Engineered with premium internal components, the adapter provides stable digital signal transmission for both video and audio. Whether connected to a television, monitor, projector, or AV receiver, users can enjoy clear visuals and high-quality sound without noticeable signal loss.</p><h2>Space-Saving Design</h2><p>The ultra-compact form factor helps organize HDMI connections while reducing cable clutter. It also minimizes strain on HDMI ports, helping to protect devices from damage caused by heavy or tightly bent cables.</p><p>This makes it idea