(926, 'Yuanxin YHX-002 HDMI Male to Male 1.5 Meter Cable-iosbd', 'The Yuanxin YHX-002 HDMI Male to Male 1.5 Meter Cable is a high-quality HDMI 2.0 cable that supports 4K Ultra HD resolution, 3D video, and synchronized digital audio transmission. Built with gold-plated connectors and a durable PVC jacket, it delivers stable, low-latency performance for TVs, monitors, projectors, laptops, gaming consoles, and other HDMI-enabled devices. Its reinforced construction ensures long-lasting durability, making it an ideal choice for home, office, and multimedia applications.', 'yuanxin-yhx-002-hdmi-male-to-male-15-meter-cable-iosbd-1783187849', '<h2>Premium 4K HDMI Connectivity</h2><p>The <strong>Yuanxin YHX-002 HDMI Male to Male 1.5 Meter Cable</strong> is engineered to provide reliable, high-speed digital connectivity for today\'s entertainment systems and professional display environments. Built to the <strong>HDMI 2.0 standard</strong>, this cable supports <strong>4K Ultra HD resolution (3840 × 2160)</strong>, delivering sharp images, vivid colors, and smooth video playback.</p><p>Whether you\'re streaming movies, gaming, conducting presentations, or connecting multimedia devices, the Yuanxin YHX-002 ensures dependable performance with excellent picture and sound quality.</p><h2>Crystal-Clear 4K &amp; 3D Video</h2><p>Supporting <strong>4K UHD</strong> and <strong>3D Full HD</strong> content, the cable offers an immersive viewing experience with detailed visuals and vibrant colors. It is suitable for modern 4K televisions, computer monitors, projectors, and professional display systems.</p><h2>Synchronized Audio &amp; Video Transmission</h2><p>The cable is designed to transmit high-definition digital audio and video simultaneously, ensuring synchronized playback without noticeable delay or signal interruption. This makes it ideal for watching movies, gaming, business presentations, and multimedia applications where timing and quality are essential.</p><h2>Durable Construc