(929, 'Vention VAA-B06-B300 HDMI Male to Female 3M Extension Cable', 'The Vention VAA-B06-B300 HDMI Male to Female 3M Extension Cable is a high-speed HDMI 2.0 extension cable designed to extend HDMI connections while maintaining excellent audio and video quality. Supporting 4K Ultra HD resolution and 18Gbps bandwidth, it features gold-plated connectors for reliable signal transmission and long-term durability. Its 3-meter length makes it ideal for TVs, monitors, projectors, gaming consoles, laptops, and desktop computers in both home and professional environments.', 'vention-vaa-b06-b300-hdmi-male-to-female-3m-extension-cable-1783178767', '<h2>Extend Your HDMI Connection with Confidence</h2><p>The <strong>Vention VAA-B06-B300 HDMI Male to Female 3M Extension Cable</strong> offers a practical and reliable way to increase the reach of your existing HDMI cable while preserving outstanding audio and video performance. Built according to the <strong>HDMI 2.0 standard</strong>, it supports high-speed data transmission of up to <strong>18Gbps</strong>, making it suitable for demanding multimedia applications.</p><p>Whether you\'re extending the connection between a television and media player, connecting a projector in a conference room, or creating a more flexible gaming setup, this extension cable provides dependable performance with minimal signal loss.</p><h2>Crystal-Clear 4K Ultra HD Video</h2><p>Supporting <strong>4K Ultra HD resolution</strong>, the VAA-B06-B300 delivers sharp images, vivid colors, and smooth video playback. It is an excellent choice for streaming Ultra HD content, watching movies, gaming, and professional presentations.</p><p>The cable also supports simultaneous digital audio transmission, allowing both high-definition video and high-quality sound to travel through a single connection.</p><h2>Premium Gold-Plated Connectors</h2><p>The extension cable features <strong>gold-plated HDMI connectors</strong> that improve conductivity while resisting corrosion and oxidation. This helps maintain a stable connection and reduces signal degradation over extended periods of use.</p><p>The durable connector design also provides a secure fit, minimizing accidental disconnections during operation.</p><h2>Durable and Flexible Design</h2><p>Constructed using high-quality materials, the Vention VAA-B06-B300 combines durability with flexibility for everyday use. The strong cable jacket protects against bending and wear, while its flexible design makes routing and installation simple in home entertainment systems, office workstations, classrooms, and meeting rooms.</p><p>The <strong>3-meter length</strong> provides additional installation flexibility without sacrificing signal quality.</p><h2>Wide Compatibility</h2><p>The Vention VAA-B06-B300 is compatible with virtually all HDMI-enabled devices, including:</p><ul><li>Smart TVs</li><li>LED &amp; OLED Televisions</li><li>Computer Monitors</li><li>Projectors</li><li>Desktop Computers</li><li>Laptops</li><li>PlayStation Consoles</li><li>Xbox Consoles</li><li>Blu-ray Players</li><li>Streaming Devices</li><li>AV Receivers</li><li>Media Players</li></ul><p>It is particularly useful for extending existing HDMI cables when devices are located farther apart or when easier cable access is needed.</p><h2>Why Buy from International Office Solution?</h2><p>At <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, we provide only genuine Vention accessories at competitive prices throughout Bangladesh. Our customers benefit from authentic products, reliable customer service, and fast nationwide delivery. Whether you\'re upgrading your home entertainment system, improving your office setup, or extending your HDMI connections, the <strong>Vention VAA-B06-B300 HDMI Extension Cable</strong> delivers dependable performance and excellent value.</p><p><strong>Warranty:</strong> <strong>1 Year Official Warranty</strong></p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>General</td><td>Brand</td><td>Vention</td></tr><tr><td>General</td><td>Model</td><td>VAA-B06-B300</td></tr><tr><td>General</td><td>Product Type</td><td>HDMI Male to Female Extension Cable</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Input Interface</td><td>HDMI Male</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Output Interface</td><td>HDMI Female</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>HDMI Version</td><td>HDMI 2.0</td></tr><tr><td>Performance</td><td>Transmission Rate</td><td>18Gbps</td></tr><tr><td>Performance</td><td>Maximum Resolution</td><td>4K Ultra HD</td></tr><tr><td>Performance</td><td>Audio &amp; Video Support</td><td>Simultaneous Digital Audio &amp; Video</td></tr><tr><td>Features</td><td>HDMI Ethernet Support</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Features</td><td>Plug &amp; Play</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Build Quality</td><td>Connector Material</td><td>Gold-Plated</td></tr><tr><td>Build Quality</td><td>Cable Construction</td><td>Strong &amp; Flexible</td></tr><tr><td>Physical</td><td>Cable Length</td><td>3 Meters</td></tr><tr><td>Physical</td><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>Compatible Devices</td><td>TVs, Monitors, Projectors, Laptops, Desktop PCs, Gaming Consoles, Blu-ray Players, AV Receivers</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td><td>1 Year Official Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'cab', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/93Ajup8K5ZxcBvXpuGbT71zSO9jeJcYkFrs2tdyM.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-04 15:26:07', '2026-07-04 17:11:31', 'Buy the original Vention VAA-B06-B300 HDMI Male to Female 3M Extension Cable from International Office Solution in Bangladesh. Supports 4K UHD, 18Gbps bandwidth, gold-plated connectors, and stable HDMI signal extension with a 1-year warranty.', 'Buy the original Vention VAA-B06-B300 HDMI Male to Female 3M Extension Cable from International Office Solution in Bangladesh. Supports 4K UHD, 