(930, 'Onten OTN-8318 3M 4K HDMI Cable', 'The Onten OTN-8318 3M 4K HDMI Cable is a high-performance HDMI 2.0 cable designed for reliable Ultra HD connectivity. Supporting 4K resolution at 60Hz, it delivers smooth video, vibrant colors, and high-quality digital audio for home theaters, gaming systems, office presentations, and multimedia applications. Its lightweight, flexible design ensures easy installation while maintaining stable signal transmission over longer distances. Backed by a 2-year replacement warranty, it is a dependable choice for all HDMI-enabled devices.', 'onten-otn-8318-3m-4k-hdmi-cable-1783178837', '<h2>Enjoy Stunning 4K Ultra HD Entertainment</h2><p>The <strong>Onten OTN-8318 3M 4K HDMI Cable</strong> is engineered to provide exceptional digital audio and video performance for today\'s advanced entertainment systems and professional display environments. Designed to support <strong>4K Ultra HD resolution at 60Hz</strong>, it delivers incredibly sharp visuals, smooth motion, and vivid colors for an immersive viewing experience.</p><p>Whether you\'re streaming Ultra HD content, gaming on the latest consoles, or delivering presentations in meeting rooms and classrooms, this cable provides dependable performance without compromising signal quality.</p><h2>Reliable High-Speed Signal Transmission</h2><p>Using advanced signal transmission technology, the OTN-8318 maintains stable audio and video performance across its <strong>3-meter length</strong>, reducing signal degradation that can occur with lower-quality HDMI cables. This makes it ideal for installations where devices require greater separation while maintaining consistent performance.</p><p>The cable supports simultaneous digital audio and video transmission through a single HDMI connection, eliminating cable clutter while delivering exceptional multimedia quality.</p><h2>Flexible &amp; Durable Construction</h2><p>Unlike bulky traditional cables, the OTN-8318 features a thinner, lighter, and mor