(932, 'Yuanxin YHX-003 Male to Male 3 Meter HDMI Cable', 'The Yuanxin YHX-003 Male to Male 3 Meter HDMI Cable is a high-quality HDMI cable designed for stable and reliable 4K Ultra HD audio and video transmission. Featuring premium oxygen-free copper conductors, it minimizes signal loss while delivering sharp visuals and clear digital audio. Its 3-meter length offers flexible installation for TVs, monitors, projectors, laptops, gaming consoles, and other HDMI-enabled devices, making it an excellent choice for home, office, and professional use.', 'yuanxin-yhx-003-male-to-male-3-meter-hdmi-cable-1783179098', '<h2>High-Performance HDMI Connectivity</h2><p>The <strong>Yuanxin YHX-003 Male to Male 3 Meter HDMI Cable</strong> is engineered to provide dependable high-definition connectivity for modern entertainment systems and professional display environments. Whether you\'re watching 4K movies, playing games, streaming multimedia, or delivering business presentations, this cable delivers smooth, uninterrupted audio and video performance.</p><p>Its generous <strong>3-meter length</strong> makes it suitable for installations where devices require extra reach while maintaining excellent signal quality.</p><h2>Stunning 4K Ultra HD Resolution</h2><p>Supporting <strong>4K Ultra HD resolution (3840 × 2160)</strong>, the Yuanxin YHX-003 produces crisp images, vibrant colors, and exceptional clarity. It is an excellent solution for connecting Ultra HD televisions, computer monitors, projectors, and multimedia systems that demand high-resolution output.</p><p>The cable is also backward compatible with Full HD and HD displays, ensuring compatibility with both modern and older HDMI devices.</p><h2>Premium Oxygen-Free Copper Construction</h2><p>Unlike standard HDMI cables, the Yuanxin YHX-003 is built with <strong>high-quality oxygen-free copper (OFC) conductors</strong>, which improve signal integrity by reducing resistance, interference, and transmission loss.</p><p>This premium c