(933, 'UGREEN HD104 (10114) HDMI Cable - 30M', 'The UGREEN HD104 (10114) 30M HDMI Cable is a professional-grade long-distance HDMI cable designed for reliable Full HD multimedia transmission. Featuring a built-in IC signal amplifier, gold-plated connectors, tin-plated copper conductors, and triple shielding, it delivers stable 1080p video, digital audio, 3D content, ARC, and HDMI Ethernet support. Its 30-meter length makes it ideal for conference rooms, classrooms, home theaters, digital signage, and commercial AV installations.', 'ugreen-hd104-10114-hdmi-cable-30m-1783179731', '<h2>Professional Long-Distance HDMI Solution</h2><p>The <strong>UGREEN HD104 (10114) 30M HDMI Cable</strong> is engineered to provide dependable HDMI connectivity where extended cable lengths are required. Unlike standard HDMI cables, this model incorporates an <strong>active IC signal amplifier</strong> that helps maintain stable signal quality across its full 30-meter length.</p><p>It is an excellent solution for conference rooms, educational institutions, digital signage, exhibition displays, security monitoring systems, auditoriums, and home theater installations.</p><h2>Stable Audio &amp; Video Transmission</h2><p>The cable supports:</p><ul><li><strong>Full HD 1080p @ 60Hz</strong></li><li><strong>3D Video</strong></li><li><strong>Audio Return Channel (ARC)</strong></li><li><strong>HDMI Ethernet Channel (HEC)</strong></li><li><strong>48-Bit Deep Color</strong></li></ul><p>These features allow users to enjoy clear visuals, synchronized digital audio, and smooth multimedia playback for professional and entertainment applications.</p><h2>Active IC Signal Amplifier</h2><p>One of the standout features of the UGREEN HD104 is its integrated <strong>IC signal amplifier</strong>, specifically designed for long-distance HDMI transmission.</p><p>The built-in amplifier helps:</p><ul><li>Reduce signal degradation</li><li>Maintain image clarity</li><li>Improve transmission stability</li><li>Deliver reliable performance across extended cable runs</li></ul><p>This makes the cable especially suitable for installations where standard HDMI cables may experience signal loss.</p><h2>Premium Construction</h2><p>The cable is manufactured using high-quality materials to ensure long-lasting reliability.</p><p>Premium construction includes:</p><ul><li><strong>Tin-plated copper conductors</strong> for efficient signal transmission</li><li><strong>Triple-layer shielding</strong> consisting of aluminum foil, braided shielding, and ground wire to minimize electromagnetic interference (EMI)</li><li><strong>Gold-plated HDMI connectors</strong> that resist corrosion while improving conductivity</li><li>Durable outer jacket designed for frequent installation and professional use</li></ul><p>Together, these components provide excellent durability and dependable performance.</p><h2>Wide Compatibility</h2><p>The UGREEN HD104 is compatible with virtually all HDMI-enabled devices, including:</p><ul><li>Smart TVs</li><li>LED &amp; OLED TVs</li><li>Computer Monitors</li><li>Projectors</li><li>Desktop PCs</li><li>Laptops</li><li>Blu-ray Players</li><li>AV Receivers</li><li>PlayStation Consoles</li><li>Xbox Consoles</li><li>Nintendo Switch</li><li>Roku</li><li>Streaming Devices</li><li>Digital Signage Systems</li></ul><p>Its <strong>30-meter cable length</strong> makes it ideal for environments where source devices and displays are installed far apart.</p><h2>Why Buy from International Office Solution?</h2><p>At <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, we supply only genuine UGREEN accessories at competitive prices across Bangladesh. Customers benefit from authentic products, dependable customer support, and fast nationwide delivery. Whether you\'re installing a conference room display, building a home theater, or deploying commercial AV equipment, the <strong>UGREEN HD104 (10114) 30M HDMI Cable</strong> offers exceptional reliability and performance.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</