(934, 'UGREEN 10140 HDMI 2.0 Male to Female 0.5 Meter, Black Extension Cable # 10140 (4K)', 'The UGREEN 10140 HDMI 2.0 Male to Female 0.5 Meter Extension Cable is designed to extend your existing HDMI connection while protecting your device\'s HDMI port from frequent plugging and unplugging. Supporting 4K Ultra HD resolution at 60Hz, high-speed data transmission, and gold-plated connectors, it delivers crystal-clear video and stable audio performance. Ideal for TVs, monitors, projectors, gaming consoles, laptops, and other HDMI-enabled devices.', 'ugreen-10140-hdmi-20-male-to-female-05-meter-black-extension-cable-10140-4k-1783180102', '<h3>GREEN 10140 HDMI 2.0 Male to Female 0.5 Meter 4K Extension Cable</h3><p>The <strong>UGREEN 10140 HDMI 2.0 Male to Female Extension Cable</strong> is a reliable solution for extending the reach of your HDMI connection without compromising signal quality. With a convenient <strong>0.5-meter cable length</strong>, it allows you to connect HDMI-enabled devices more easily while reducing wear and tear on your device\'s HDMI port.</p><p>Built to the <strong>HDMI 2.0 standard</strong>, this extension cable supports <strong>4K Ultra HD resolution (3840 × 2160) at 60Hz</strong>, delivering sharp images, vibrant colors, and smooth video playback. Whether you\'re watching movies, giving presentations, gaming, or streaming content, the cable ensures stable and high-quality audio and video transmission.</p><p>The cable features <strong>gold-plated HDMI connectors</strong> that resist corrosion and improve conductivity for consistent performance. High-quality copper conductors and multiple layers of shielding minimize electromagnetic interference (EMI) and signal loss, providing a dependable connection even during extended use.</p><p>Compatible with a wide range of HDMI devices, including <strong>TVs, monitors, projectors, laptops, desktop computers, gaming consoles, Blu-ray players, streaming devices, and TV boxes</strong>, the UGREEN 10140 extension cable is an excellent accessory for both home entertainment and professional applications.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul><li>HDMI 2.0 Male to Female Extension Cable</li><li>Supports 4K Ultra HD (3840 × 2160) at 60Hz</li><li>High-speed bandwidth up to 10.2 Gbps</li><li>Gold-plated connectors for superior signal quality</li><li>Premium copper conductor with multiple shielding layers</li><li>Supports 3D video, ARC, HDCP, and HDMI Ethernet Channel</li><li>Protects HDMI ports from frequent plugging and unplugging</li><li>Durable PVC jacket for long-lasting performance</li><li>Compatible with TVs, monitors, projectors, laptops, PCs, gaming consoles, Blu-ray players, and more</li><li>Plug-and-play design with no driver installation required</li></ul>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Brand</strong></td><td>UGREEN</td><td>Genuine UGREEN Product</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Model</strong></td><td>HD107</td><td>Part No: 10140</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Product Type</strong></td><td>HDMI Extension Cable</td><td>Male to Female</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connector 1</strong></td><td>HDMI Male</td><td>Gold-plated connector</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connector 2</strong></td><td>HDMI Female</td><td>Gold-plated connector</td></tr><tr><td><strong>HDMI Version</strong></td><td>HDMI 2.0</td><td>Supports high-speed audio &amp; video</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cable Length</strong></td><td>0.5 Meter</td><td>50 cm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Maximum Resolution</strong></td><td>4K UHD</td><td>Up to 3840 × 2160 @ 60Hz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Bandwidth</strong></td><td>Up to 10.2 Gbps</td><td>High-speed transmission</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Supported Features</strong></td><td>3D, HDCP, ARC, HDMI Ethernet Channel</td><td>Smooth video and audio transmission</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Shielding</strong></td><td>Braided Shielding</td><td>Reduces EMI/RFI interference</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Conductor</strong></td><td>High-quality Copper</td><td>Stable signal transmission</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Jacket Material</strong></td><td>PVC</td><td>Durable and flexible</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Color</strong></td><td>Black</td><td>Premium finish</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatible Devices</strong></td><td>TV, Monitor, Projector, Laptop, Desktop PC, Gaming Console, Blu-ray Player, TV Box</td><td>Universal HDMI compatibility</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Package Contents</strong></td><td>1 × HDMI Extension Cable</td><td>Ready to use</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Country of Origin</strong></td><td>China</td><td>Manufactured by UGREEN</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>1 Year</td><td>Brand warranty (seller dependent)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Cable', 400.00, 400.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/k6SXr0H3r1nGaDu5zEZLSD3K5bwlCNMvxa7QNpIp.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-04 15:48:22', '2026-07-08 17:27:07', 'UGREEN 10140 HDMI 2.0 Male to Female 0.5M 4K Extension Cable | Buy Online', 'Buy the UGREEN 10140 HDMI 2.0 Male to Female 0.5 Meter Extension Cable with 4K@60Hz support, gold-plated connectors, and high-speed performance. Ideal for TVs, monitors, laptops, projectors, gaming consoles, and other HDMI devices.', 'UGREEN 10140, UGREEN HDMI Extension Cable, HDMI 2.0 Extension Cable, HDMI Male to Female Cable, 4K HDMI Extension Cable, 0.5 Meter HDMI Cable, HDMI Extender Cable, HDMI 4K 60Hz Cable, UGREEN 4K HDMI Cable, Gold Plated HDMI Extension, HDMI Cable for TV, Monitor HDMI Extension, Projector HDMI Cable, Gaming HDMI Extension, High Speed HDMI Cable, HDMI Extension Bangladesh', NULL, 102, NULL, NULL),
(935, 'UGREEN CM841 11-in-1 USB-C Docking Station for Mac mini M4/ M4 Pro #65487', 'The UGREEN CM841 11-in-1 USB-C Docking Station is purpose-built for the Mac Mini M4 and Mac Mini M4 Pro, offering expanded connectivity, ultra-fast 10Gbps data transfer, dual 4K HDMI output, UHS-II SD/TF card readers, Gigabit Ethernet, and an 8TB NVMe SSD expansion slot. Featuring a premium aluminum design that perfectly complements the Mac Mini, this docking station is ideal for professionals, creators, and power users seeking a clean, high-performance workspace.', 'ugreen-cm841-11-in-1-usb-c-docking-station-for-mac-mini-m4-m4-pro-65487-1783180261', '<p>The <strong>UGREEN CM841 11-in-1 USB-C Docking Station</strong> is a premium expansion hub engineered specifically for the <strong>Mac Mini M4</strong> and <strong>Mac Mini M4 Pro</strong>. Combining elegant design with powerful functionality, it transforms your Mac Mini into a complete desktop workstation by adding multiple high-speed ports, display outputs, storage expansion, and networking options in a compact aluminum enclosure.</p><p>Designed to match the Mac Mini\'s silver finish, the CM841 integrates seamlessly with your setup while maximizing productivity. It features <strong>USB 3.2 Gen2 ports</strong> capable of <strong>10Gbps</strong> data transfer, allowing lightning-fast access to external SSDs, flash drives, and other high-speed peripherals. Additional USB 3.0 ports support everyday accessories such as keyboards, mice, and printers.</p><p>For photographers and content creators, the built-in <strong>UHS-II SD and microSD (TF) card readers</strong> provide transfer speeds of up to <strong>170MB/s</strong>, making it easy to import large photo and video files. The docking station also includes an <strong>M.2 NVMe SSD expansion slot</strong> supporting <strong>2230, 2242, 2260, and 2280</strong> SSDs with capacities up to <strong>8TB</strong>, giving users a convenient way to expand storage without external enclosures.</p><p>The CM841 supports <strong>dual 4K UHD displays at 60Hz</strong>, making multitasking, video editing, programming, and professional workflows more efficient. A <strong>Gigabit Ethernet</strong> port delivers stable wired network connectivity, while <strong>100W USB-C Power Delivery</strong> ensures reliable power for connected devices.</p><p>Constructed from precision-machined aluminum, the docking station offers excellent heat dissipation and durability. Conductive shielding helps reduce <strong>5GHz Wi-Fi interference</strong>, while anti-slip silicone pads keep the dock securely in place and protect your desk. A convenient bottom power-button groove allows easy access to the Mac Mini\'s power button without lifting the device, and the included <strong>4cm USB-C cable</strong> keeps your workspace clean and organized.</p><p>Whether you\'re a creative professional, software developer, office user, or multimedia enthusiast, the UGREEN CM841 delivers exceptional performance, premium build quality, and the connectivity needed for demanding workflows.</p><h2>Key Features</h2><ul><li>Designed exclusively for Mac Mini M4 and Mac Mini M4 Pro</li><li>11-in-1 multifunction USB-C docking station</li><li>USB 3.2 Gen2 ports with up to 10Gbps transfer speed</li><li>Dual 4K Ultra HD display support at 60Hz</li><li>UHS-II SD and microSD card readers with speeds up to 170MB/s</li><li>Built-in M.2 NVMe SSD enclosure supporting up to 8TB storage</li><li>Compatible with 2230, 2242, 2260, and 2280 NVMe SSDs</li><li>Gigabit Ethernet for stable wired networking</li><li>100W USB-C Power Delivery support</li><li>Precision aluminum body matching the Mac Mini design</li><li>Conductive shielding minimizes 5GHz Wi-Fi interference</li><li>Anti-slip silicone base for added stability</li><li>Bottom access groove for convenient Mac Mini power button operation</li><li>Plug-and-play installation with no driver required</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2>', '<h2>UGREEN CM841 11-in-1 USB-C Docking Station Specifications</h2><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Brand</strong></td><td>UGREEN</td><td>Genuine UGREEN Product</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Model</strong></td><td>CM841</td><td>Part No: 65487</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Product Type</strong></td><td>USB-C Docking Station</td><td>11-in-1 Dock for Mac Mini</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Supported Devices</td><td>Mac Mini M4, Mac Mini M4 Pro</td></tr><tr><td><strong>USB Ports</strong></td><td>USB-A 3.2 Gen2</td><td>3 × USB-A (10Gbps)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB-A 3.0</td><td>2 × USB-A (5Gbps)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>USB-C 3.2 Gen2</td><td>2 × USB-C (10Gbps)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Output</strong></td><td>HDMI</td><td>Dual HDMI, Up to 4K@60Hz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Network</strong></td><td>Ethernet</td><td>1 × RJ45 Gigabit Ethernet Port</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Card Slots</strong></td><td>SD Card Reader</td><td>UHS-II, Up to 170MB/s</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>microSD (TF) Card Reader</td><td>UHS-II, Up to 170MB/s</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage Expansion</strong></td><td>SSD Type</td><td>M.2 NVMe SSD</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>SSD Sizes Supported</td><td>2230 / 2242 / 2260 / 2280</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Maximum Capacity</td><td>Up to 8TB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>SSD Included</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Data Transfer Speed</strong></td><td>Maximum Speed</td><td>Up to 10Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Delivery</strong></td><td>USB-C PD</td><td>Supports Up to 100W Power Delivery</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Input</strong></td><td>Input Source</td><td>Mac Mini Power Draw or External Power Adapter (Recommended for Multiple Devices)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Wireless Optimization</strong></td><td>Shielding</td><td>Conductive Paint Shielding Reduces 5GHz Wi-Fi Interference</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Special Features</strong></td><td>Design</td><td>Plug-and-Play, Anti-Slip Silicone Base</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Button Access</td><td>Bottom Groove for Easy Mac Mini Power Button Operation</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Cable</td><td>4cm Built-in USB-C Connection Cable</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Material</strong></td><td>Body</td><td>Precision-Machined Aluminum</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Color</strong></td><td>Finish</td><td>Silver (Matches Mac Mini)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Use Cases</strong></td><td>Applications</td><td>4K Video Editing, Content Creation, Large File Transfer, Backup, Office Work, Multitasking</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Warranty</td><td>1 Year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Cable', 6500.00, 6500.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/fG8VZJHOGdpF8WU9Il0Lv1El1susLgaTGtdY8BvA.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-04 15:51:01', '2026-07-04 16:23:16', 'UGREEN CM841 11-in-1 USB-C Docking Station for Mac Mini M4/M4 Pro | 8TB NVMe SSD Expansion', 'Upgrade your Mac Mini with the UGREEN CM841 11-in-1 USB-C Docking Station featuring 10Gbps USB ports, dual 4K HDMI, Gigabit Ethernet, UHS-II SD/TF readers, and up to 8TB NVMe SSD expansion for maximum productivity.', 'UGREEN CM841, UGREEN 65487, UGREEN Docking Station, Mac Mini Dock, Mac Mini M4 Dock, Mac Mini M4 Pro Dock, USB-C Docking Station, 11 in 1 Dock, USB-C Hub for Mac Mini, NVMe SSD Dock, 8TB SSD Expansion, Dual 4K HDMI Dock, 10Gbps USB Hub, UHS-II SD Card Reader, Gigabit Ethernet Dock, USB-C Hub Bangladesh, UGREEN Mac Mini Dock', NULL, 102, NULL, NULL);
