(939, 'Apollo 70 Inch x 70 Inch Wall Projector Screen', 'The Apollo 70 x 70 Inch Manual Wall Projector Screen is designed to deliver bright, sharp, and clear projections for home theaters, classrooms, boardrooms, and offices. Featuring a matte white viewing surface, manual pull-down mechanism, and durable white metal casing, it offers smooth operation, excellent image quality, and long-lasting performance for both professional presentations and entertainment.', 'apollo-70-inch-x-70-inch-wall-projector-screen-1783181143', '<h2>Apollo 70 x 70 Inch Manual Wall Mount Projector Screen</h2><p>The <strong>Apollo 70 x 70 Inch Manual Wall Projector Screen</strong> is a dependable projection solution for home entertainment, business presentations, educational environments, and conference rooms. Its high-quality <strong>matte white screen surface</strong> provides excellent color accuracy, brightness, and uniform light distribution, ensuring a comfortable viewing experience from multiple angles.</p><p>Designed with a <strong>manual pull-down and retractable mechanism</strong>, the screen operates smoothly and stores neatly inside a durable <strong>white metal housing</strong> when not in use. The enclosed casing protects the screen from dust and damage while maintaining a clean and professional appearance.</p><p>The screen features a <strong>black border</strong> that enhances image contrast and improves viewing focus, making presentations and videos appear more vivid. Its <strong>70 x 70-inch</strong> viewing area is ideal for small to medium-sized rooms, offering a balanced screen size for classrooms, meeting rooms, training centers, offices, and home theater setups.</p><p>Manufactured from <strong>flame-retardant</strong> and <strong>mildew-resistant</strong> screen material, the Apollo projector screen is built for long-term reliability and safe operation. The wall-mount design allows for quick installation while maximizing available floor space.</p><p>Whether you\'re delivering presentations, watching movies, conducting training sessions, or enjoying multimedia content, the Apollo 70 x 70 Inch Projector Screen provides a practical and cost-effective projection solution.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul><li>Manual pull-down wall-mounted projector screen</li><li>70 × 70-inch viewing area</li><li>Premium matte white projection surface</li><li>Black border enhances image contrast</li><li>Smooth pull-down and retractable mechanism</li><li>Heavy-duty white metal protective casing</li><li>Flame-retardant and mildew-resistant screen material</li><li>Ideal for boardrooms, classrooms, offices, training rooms, and home theaters</li><li>Space-saving wall-mounted installation</li><li>Durable construction for long-lasting performance</li></ul>', '<h2>Apollo 70 x 70 Inch Manual Wall Projector Screen Specifications</h2><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Brand</td><td>Apollo</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Model</td><td>70 Inch × 70 Inch</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Product Type</td><td>Manual Wall Projector Screen</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Screen Information</strong></td><td>Screen Type</td><td>Manual Pull-Down</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Mount Type</td><td>Wall Mount</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Screen Size</td><td>70 × 70 Inch (H × W)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Screen Surface</td><td>Matte White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>Widescreen Compatible</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Border</td><td>1-Inch Black Border for Improved Contrast</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Build &amp; Design</strong></td><td>Housing Material</td><td>Heavy-Duty White Metal Case</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Screen Material</td><td>Flame-Retardant and Mildew-Resistant Matte White Fabric</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Retraction Mechanism</td><td>Smooth Pull-Down &amp; Retractable</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Color</td><td>Matte White</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tripod Included</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Applications</strong></td><td>Recommended Use</td><td>Home Theater, Boardroom, Classroom, Office, Training Room, Conference Room</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Package Contents</strong></td><td>Included Items</td><td>1 × Apollo 70 × 70 Inch Manual Wall Projector Screen</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'projector screen', 3500.00, 3400.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/nt3DLUmYdFffHhO689xUp8PNbwa6gWzWpvQnyc7e.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-04 16:05:43', '2026-07-05 14:29:37', 'Apollo 70 x 70 Inch Manual Wall Mount Projector Screen | Matte White', 'Buy the Apollo 70 x 70 Inch Manual Wall Mount Projector Screen featuring a matte white viewing surface, smooth pull-down mechanism, heavy-duty metal casing, black border, and wall-mounted design for home theaters, classrooms, and offices.', 'Apollo Projector Screen, Apollo 70 x 70 Screen, Manual Projector Screen, Wall Mount Projector Screen, 70 Inch Projector Screen, Matte White Projection Screen, Pull Down Projector Screen, Classroom Projector Screen, Office Projector Screen, Home Theater Screen, Projection Screen Bangladesh, Manual Screen, Apollo Screen', NULL, 68, NULL, NULL),
(940, 'Apollo 70 Inch x 70 Inch Tripod Projector Screen', 'A durable and portable 70x70 inch manual tripod projector screen. Featuring a flame-retardant, matte white surface and built-in keystone control, it is the perfect solution for mobile corporate, educational, and home theater setups.', 'apollo-70-inch-x-70-inch-tripod-projector-screen-1783181467', '<p>The Apollo 70x70 Inch Tripod Projector Screen is a versatile and reliable choice for professionals who require high-quality visuals on the go. Engineered for convenience, its manual pull-down mechanism and lightweight, integrated tripod allow for rapid deployment in any meeting room, classroom, or event space.</p><p>The screen’s matte white surface is specifically designed to provide uniform light diffusion, ensuring bright and sharp images. Built with practicality in mind, the unit includes essential features such as keystone control for image alignment and tension control to keep the screen flat. The fabric is both flame-retardant and mildew-resistant, guaranteeing durability even in varying environmental conditions. Whether for business presentations or movie nights, the Apollo 70x70 tripod screen offers the stability and professional performance you need.</p><p><strong>Would you like me to draft this into a formal quotation template for you to send to one of your clients?</strong></p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Attribute</strong></th><th><strong>Description</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Product Basics</strong></td><td>Brand</td><td>Apollo</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Model</td><td>70 Inch x 70 Inch</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Tripod Projector Screen</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Build</strong></td><td>Dimensions</td><td>70 x 70 Inch (1.8m x 1.8m)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Mount Type</td><td>Portable Tripod</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Surface Finish</td><td>Matte White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Features &amp; Tech</strong></td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>1:1 (Square Format)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Mechanism</td><td>Manual Pull-Down</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Special Controls</td><td>Keystone &amp; Tension Control</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Build Quality</td><td>Flame Retardant &amp; Mildew Resistan</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'projector screen', 3600.00, 3400.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/k1wMKNDKP7FXsiQJTHT2GLDG7mHogeQ3UVt0JYjM.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-04 16:11:07', '2026-07-05 14:32:38', 'pollo 70x70 Inch Tripod Projector Screen | Portable Presentation Solu', 'Enhance your presentations with the Apollo 70x70 inch tripod projector screen. Features manual pull-down, matte white finish, and keystone control. Durable and portable.', 'Apollo Projector Screen, 70x70 Tripod Screen, Portable Projector SApollo Projector Screen, 70x70 Tripod Screen, Portable Projector Screen, Office Equipment BD, International Office Solution.creen, Office Equipment BD, International Office Solution.', NULL, 68, NULL, NULL),
(941, 'Apollo 96 Inch x 96 Inch Wall Mount Projector Screen iosbd', 'The Apollo 96 x 96 Inch Manual Wall Mount Projector Screen is a high-quality projection screen designed for home theaters, classrooms, offices, and conference rooms. Featuring a 96 × 96-inch matte white viewing surface, smooth manual pull-down operation, and durable wall-mounted design, it delivers bright, sharp, and professional-quality projections for presentations and entertainment.', 'apollo-96-inch-x-96-inch-wall-mount-projector-screen-iosbd-1783181669', '<p>The <strong>Apollo 96 x 96 Inch Manual Wall Mount Projector Screen</strong> is an ideal projection solution for users who require a large viewing area with reliable performance. Designed for home entertainment, business presentations, educational institutions, and training environments, this projector screen provides a clear and immersive viewing experience with excellent image quality.</p><p>Its <strong>96 × 96-inch matte white projection surface</strong> evenly reflects light to produce bright colors, sharp details, and enhanced contrast. The screen is compatible with most LCD, LED, and DLP projectors, making it suitable for movies, presentations, training sessions, and classroom lectures.</p><p>The manual pull-down mechanism allows the screen to extend and retract smoothly whenever needed, while the sturdy wall-mounted design keeps the screen securely in place and helps save valuable floor space. When not in use, the screen retracts neatly into its protective housing, maintaining a clean and professional appearance.</p><p>Constructed with durable materials, the Apollo projector screen is built for long-term performance and consistent projection quality. Its widescreen compatibility makes it suitable for modern multimedia content, ensuring an enjoyable viewing experience in both professional and personal environments.</p><p>Whether you\'re presenting business reports, teaching a class, hosting meetings, or creating a home theater, the Apollo 96 x 96 Inch Wall Projector Screen offers dependable performance and outstanding value.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Attribute</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Product Basics</strong></td><td>Brand</td><td>Apollo</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Model</td><td>96 x 96 Inch Manual Wall Mount</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Manual Wall/Ceiling Mount Screen</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Build</strong></td><td>Dimensions</td><td>96 x 96 Inch (approx. 2.44m x 2.44m)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Case Material</td><td>Heavy-duty White Metal Case</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Surface Finish</td><td>Matte White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Features &amp; Tech</strong></td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>1:1 (Square/Audio-Visual)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Mechanism</td><td>Manual Pull-Down &amp; Retract</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tensioning</td><td>Integrated Tension Bar</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Build Quality</td><td>Flame Retardant &amp; Mildew Resistant</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'projector screen', 7900.00, 7800.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/ckyPf6bROoIVDIGhXr6Z4zrPhk9Ty9J1QCUffEJo.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-04 16:14:29', '2026-07-05 14:28:38', 'Apollo 96 x 96 Inch Manual Wall Mount Projector Screen', 'Buy the Apollo 96 x 96 Inch Manual Wall Mount Projector Screen with a premium matte white projection surface, smooth pull-down mechanism, widescreen support, and durable wall-mounted design. Ideal for classrooms, offices, conference rooms, and home theaters.', 'Apollo Projector Screen, Apollo 96 x 96 Screen, Manual Projector Screen, Wall Mount Projector Screen, 96 Inch Projector Screen, Matte White Projection Screen, Pull Down Projector Screen, Home Theater Screen, Classroom Projector Screen, Office Projection Screen, Conference Room Screen, Projection Screen Bangladesh', NULL, 68, NULL, NULL),
(942, 'Apollo 70 Inch x 70 Inch Wall Electric Remote Projector Screen', 'The Apollo 70 x 70 Inch Electric Wall Mount Projector Screen is a premium motorized projection screen designed for home theaters, classrooms, offices, and conference rooms. Featuring a 70 × 70-inch viewing area, electric motorized operation, wireless remote control, and a durable wall-mounted design, it provides convenient operation and a professional viewing experience.', 'apollo-70-inch-x-70-inch-wall-electric-remote-projector-screen-1783181889', '<p>The <strong>Apollo 70 x 70 Inch Electric Wall Mount Projector Screen</strong> is designed to deliver a convenient and professional projection experience for home entertainment, business presentations, educational institutions, and conference rooms. Equipped with a built-in electric motor, the screen can be raised or lowered effortlessly using the included remote control, eliminating the need for manual operation.</p><p>Its <strong>70 × 70-inch viewing surface</strong> provides bright, sharp, and clear image projection, making it suitable for movies, presentations, training sessions, and classroom lessons. The wall-mounted design helps save floor space while providing a clean and organized installation.</p><p>Built with durable materials, the Apollo electric projector screen offers smooth and reliable operation for everyday use. The motorized mechanism ensures quiet performance, while the sturdy housing protects the screen when retracted. The widescreen-compatible design makes it suitable for use with most LCD, LED, and DLP projectors.</p><p>Whether you\'re creating a home cinema, upgrading your office meeting room, or equipping a classroom, the Apollo Electric Projector Screen delivers convenience, reliability, and excellent projection quality.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul><li>Electric motorized wall-mounted projector screen</li><li>70 × 70-inch viewing area</li><li>Wireless remote control included</li><li>Smooth and quiet motorized operation</li><li>Space-saving wall-mounted installation</li><li>Bright and clear projection surface</li><li>Widescreen compatible</li><li>Durable protective housing</li><li>Ideal for home theaters, classrooms, offices, conference rooms, and training centers</li><li>Compatible with most LCD, LED, and DLP projectors</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2>', '<h2>Apollo 70 × 70 Inch Electric Wall Projector Screen Specifications</h2><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Brand</td><td>Apollo</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Model</td><td>70 Inch × 70 Inch</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Product Type</td><td>Electric Wall Projector Screen</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Screen Information</strong></td><td>Screen Type</td><td>Electric</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Mount Type</td><td>Wall Mount</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Screen Size</td><td>70 × 70 Inch (H × W)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Widescreen Support</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Build &amp; Design</strong></td><td>Operation</td><td>Motorized Electric</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Remote Control</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tripod Included</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Additional Features</strong></td><td>Special Feature</td><td>Wall Electric Remote Projector Screen</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Country Information</strong></td><td>Country of Origin</td><td>China</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Manufactured In</td><td>China</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Applications</strong></td><td>Recommended Use</td><td>Home Theater, Classroom, Office, Conference Room, Meeting Room, Training Center</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Package Contents</strong></td><td>Included Items</td><td>1 × Apollo 70 × 70 Inch Electric Wall Projector Screen, 1 × Remote Control</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'projector screen', 8000.00, 7899.98, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/WFDq8qhHranXkji7O14yUhGkcxEIA3Tro9OkEaZQ.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-04 16:18:09', '2026-07-05 14:27:54', 'Apollo 70 x 70 Inch Electric Wall Mount Projector Screen with Remote Control', 'Buy the Apollo 70 x 70 Inch Electric Wall Mount Projector Screen featuring a motorized operation, wireless remote control, wall-mounted design, and widescreen support. Ideal for home theaters, classrooms, offices, and conference rooms.', 'Apollo Electric Projector Screen, Apollo 70 x 70 Screen, Motorized Projector Screen, Electric Wall Projector Screen, Remote Control Projector Screen, Wall Mount Projection Screen, Home Theater Screen, Office Projector Screen, Classroom Projection Screen, Conference Room Screen, Electric Projection Screen Bangladesh', NULL, 68, NULL, NULL),
(943, 'Apollo 96 Inch x 96 Inch Tripod Projector Screen', 'The Apollo 96 x 96 Inch Manual Tripod Projector Screen is a portable projection screen designed for classrooms, offices, conference rooms, and home theaters. Featuring a 96 × 96-inch matte white viewing surface, manual pull-up operation, and a sturdy tripod stand, it delivers bright, clear images and convenient portability for presentations, training sessions, and entertainment.', 'apollo-96-inch-x-96-inch-tripod-projector-screen-1783182143', '<p>The <strong>Apollo 96 x 96 Inch Manual Tripod Projector Screen</strong> is a reliable and portable projection solution for business presentations, educational institutions, training sessions, and home entertainment. Its large <strong>96 × 96-inch viewing area</strong> provides an immersive viewing experience, making it ideal for medium to large rooms.</p><p>The premium <strong>matte white projection surface</strong> evenly distributes projected light, producing bright colors, sharp details, and excellent image clarity. The manual pull-up mechanism allows the screen to extend and retract smoothly, while the durable tripod stand provides outstanding stability on almost any flat surface.</p><p>Designed for portability, the lightweight tripod frame makes transportation and setup quick and convenient. The screen can be assembled within minutes, making it suitable for users who frequently move between classrooms, meeting rooms, or event venues.</p><p>The screen also features black borders that improve image focus and perceived contrast, helping presentations and videos appear more vibrant. Compatible with most LCD, LED, and DLP projectors, the Apollo 96 × 96 Inch Tripod Projector Screen is an excellent choice for schools, offices, conference rooms, training centers, and home theater applications.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul><li>Portable manual tripod projector screen</li><li>Large 96 × 96-inch viewing area</li><li>Premium matte white projection surface</li><li>Smooth manu