(944, 'Apollo 84 Inch x 84 Inch Electric Motorized Projector Screen with Remote', 'The Apollo 84 x 84 Inch Electric Motorized Projector Screen is a premium wall-mounted projection screen designed for home theaters, conference rooms, classrooms, and offices. Featuring an 84 × 84-inch matte white viewing surface, quiet electric motor, and wireless remote control, it delivers smooth operation, sharp image quality, and a professional viewing experience.', 'apollo-84-inch-x-84-inch-electric-motorized-projector-screen-with-remote-1783182338', '<p>The <strong>Apollo 84 x 84 Inch Electric Motorized Projector Screen</strong> is designed to provide a seamless projection experience for home entertainment, business presentations, classrooms, training centers, and conference rooms. Powered by a built-in electric motor, the screen can be raised or lowered effortlessly using the included remote control, offering maximum convenience and professional operation.</p><p>Its <strong>84 × 84-inch viewing area</strong> provides an excellent balance between screen size and viewing comfort, making it suitable for medium to large rooms. The premium <strong>matte white projection surface</strong> evenly reflects light to deliver bright colors, sharp details, and clear images with wide viewing angles.</p><p>The durable wall-mounted housing protects the screen when retracted while maintaining a clean and organized appearance. The quiet motor ensures smooth and reliable operation, making it ideal for professional environments where minimal noise is essential.</p><p>Compatible with most LCD, LED, and DLP projectors, the Apollo Electric Projector Screen is suitable for presentations, educational sessions, gaming, movie nights, and multimedia applications. Whether installed in an office, classroom, boardroom, or home theater, it provides dependable performance and long-lasting durability.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul><li>Electric motorized wall-mounted projector screen</li><li>84 × 84-inch viewing a