oth motorized operation</li><li>Bright, sharp, and high-contrast image quality</li><li>Space-saving wall-mounted installation</li><li>Widescreen compatible</li><li>Durable protective housing</li><li>Ideal for home theaters, offices, classrooms, conference rooms, and training centers</li></ul>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Product Basics</strong></td><td>Brand</td><td>Apollo</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Model</td><td>96 Inch x 96 Inch</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Electric Motorized (Wall/Ceiling Mount)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Build</strong></td><td>Dimensions</td><td>96 x 96 Inch (2.44m x 2.44m)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Mounting</td><td>Wall or Ceiling</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Surface Finish</td><td>Matte White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Features &amp; Tech</strong></td><td>Aspect Ratio</td><td>1:1 (Square Format)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Operation</td><td>Electric Motor with Remote Control</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Build Quality</td><td>Flame Retardant &amp; Mildew Resistant</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Housing</td><td>Heavy-Duty White Metal Case</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'projector screen', 11500.00, 11200.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/75lvwkRSoJ9nPxTX14e8vQYE1crZUooiDvcEAfhL.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-04 16:27:46', '2026-07-05 14:22:05', 'Apollo 84 x 84 Inch Electric Motorized Projector Screen with Remote', 'Buy the Apollo 84 x 84 Inch Electric Motorized Projector Screen with wireless remote control, matte white viewing surface, smooth motorized operation, and wall-mounted design. Perfect for home theaters, offices, classrooms, and conference rooms.', 'Apollo Projector Screen, Apollo 84 x 84 Screen, Electric Projector Screen, Motorized Projector Sc