(946, 'UGREEN HD103 (10172) HDMI 1.4 Male to Male, 1 Meter, Black Cable #10172 (4K)- iosbd', 'The UGREEN HD103 Right Angle 90° HDMI Cable (2 Meter) is a high-speed HDMI 1.4 cable designed for convenient installation behind wall-mounted TVs and displays. It supports 4K Ultra HD (3840 × 2160) at 30Hz, 1080p 3D, 10.2Gbps bandwidth, Audio Return Channel (ARC), and HDMI Ethernet Channel (HEC) for seamless audio and video transmission. Compatible with TVs, monitors, projectors, gaming consoles, laptops, Blu-ray players, and AV receivers, it provides reliable performance while reducing cable strain with its practical 90-degree connector.', 'ugreen-hd103-10172-hdmi-14-male-to-male-1-meter-black-cable-10172-4k-iosbd-1783186637', '<p>The <strong>UGREEN HD103 Right Angle 90° HDMI Cable (2 Meter)</strong> is designed for users who need a reliable, high-speed HDMI connection while dealing with limited installation space. Its specially engineered <strong>90-degree right-angle connector</strong> allows the cable to fit comfortably behind wall-mounted televisions, monitors, projectors, and entertainment systems without placing unnecessary pressure on the HDMI port. This practical design helps protect both the cable and your devices while creating a cleaner and more organized setup.</p><p>Supporting <strong>4K Ultra HD resolution (3840 × 2160) at 30Hz</strong>, the cable delivers crisp image quality, rich colors, and smooth video playback for movies, presentations, gaming, and streaming. It also supports <strong>1080p Full HD 3D</strong>, providing an immersive viewing experience with compatible displays and content.</p><p>With a <strong>10.2Gbps transmission bandwidth</strong>, the UGREEN HD103 ensures fast and stable transfer of both high-definition video and multi-channel digital audio through a single cable. Whether you\'re watching Blu-ray movies, connecting a gaming console, or extending your desktop display, you can enjoy uninterrupted performance with minimal signal loss. The cable is fully backward compatible with previous HDMI standards, making it suitable for both newer and older HDMI-enabled devices.</p><p>One of the standout features of this HDMI cable is its support for <strong>HDMI Ethernet Channel (HEC)</strong>, allowing compatible devices to share an internet connection without requiring additional Ethernet cables. It also features <strong>Audio Return Channel (ARC)</strong> technology, enabling audio to travel from your television to a compatible soundbar or AV receiver through the same HDMI cable. This significantly reduces cable clutter and simplifies home theater installations.</p><p>Manufactured using high-quality materials, the UGREEN HD103 is built for long-lasting durability and dependable performance. It complies with <strong>HDCP</strong>, ensuring secure transmission of protected digital content, while meeting <strong>HDMI Authority</strong> specifications for compatibility and reliability. Additionally, its <strong>RoHS-compliant</strong> construction reflects environmentally responsible manufacturing standards.</p><p>The cable is compatible with a wide variety of HDMI-enabled devices, including <strong>Smart TVs, LED TVs, OLED TVs, computer monitors, projectors, desktop computers, laptops, Blu-ray players, TV boxes, PlayStation consoles, Xbox consoles, AV receivers, home theater systems, and multimedia devices</strong>. Its thoughtful right-angle design makes it especially useful for installations where space behind the display is limited.</p><p>Whether you\'re upgrading your home entertainment system, setting up a conference room, installing a digital signage display, or building a professional multimedia environment, the <strong>UGREEN HD103 Right Angle 90° HDMI Cable</strong> offers dependable performance, excellent durability, and convenient installation for everyday use.</p><h2><strong>Buy UGREEN HD103 Right Angle 90° HDMI Cable (2 Meter) from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>Looking for an original <strong>UGREEN HD103 Right Angle 90° HDMI Cable (2 Meter)</strong> in Bangladesh? <strong>International Office Solution</strong> offers genuine UGREEN products at competitive prices with reliable customer service and nationwide delivery.</p><p>Whether you need a high-speed HDMI cable for your <strong>wall-mounted TV, gaming console, projector, laptop, monitor, or home theater system</strong>, the UGREEN HD103 is an excellent choice for stable 4K video and crystal-clear digital audio transmission. Order online or contact <strong>International Office Solution</strong> to get authentic UGREEN products backed by dependable after-sales support.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>General</td><td>Brand</td><td>UGREEN</td></tr><tr><td>General</td><td>Model</td><td>HD103</td></tr><tr><td>General</td><td>Product Type</td><td>Right Angle HDMI Cable</td></tr><tr><td>Cable</td><td>Cable Length</td><td>2 Meter</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>Connector Type</td><td>HDMI Male to HDMI Male (90° Right Angle)</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>HDMI Version</td><td>HDMI 1.4</td></tr><tr><td>Video</td><td>Maximum Resolution</td><td>4K Ultra HD (3840 × 2160) @ 30Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Video</td><td>3D Support</td><td>Yes (1080p Full HD 3D)</td></tr><tr><td>Performance</td><td>Bandwidth</td><td>Up to 10.2Gbps</td></tr><tr><td>Performance</td><td>Audio Support</td><td>Multi-Channel Digital Audio</td></tr><tr><td>Performance</td><td>HDMI Ethernet Channel (HEC)</td><td>Supported</td></tr><tr><td>Performance</td><td>Audio Return Channel (ARC)</td><td>Supported</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>HDCP</td><td>Supported</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>HDMI Standards</td><td>HDMI Authority Compliant</td></tr><tr><td>Compliance</td><td>Environmental Standard</td><td>RoHS Compliant</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>Supported Devices</td><td>TVs, Monitors, Projectors, Blu-ray Players, TV Boxes, Desktop PCs, Laptops, PS4, Xbox, Home Theater Systems</td></tr><tr><td>Application</td><td>Suitable For</td><td>Wall-Mounted TVs, Home Theater, Gaming, Office, Multimedia Installations</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Cable', 500.00, 500.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/fBMy1ZJ2oy6KYJSrAdOdX8Xa8Jo4THHeIBdxRM8m.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-04 17:37:17', '2026-07-04 17:48:14', 'UGREEN HD103 Right Angle 90° HDMI Cable 2 Meter Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the UGREEN HD103 Right Angle 90° HDMI Cable (2 Meter) in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Supports 4K@30Hz, 10.2Gbps high-speed transmission, ARC, HDMI Ethernet, and 90° angled connector for wall-mounted TVs, gaming consoles, projectors, laptops, and home theater systems.', 'UGREEN HD103, UGREEN HD103 HDMI Cable, UGREEN Right Angle HDMI Cable, HDMI Cable 2 Meter, 90 Degree HDMI Cable, Right Angle HDMI Cable, 4K HDMI Cable, HDMI 1.4 Cable, HDMI Cable Price in Bangladesh, UGREEN HDMI Cable Price, HDMI Cable for TV, HDMI Cable for Projector, HDMI Cable for Monitor, HDMI Cable for PS4, HDMI Cable for Xbox, HDMI Cable for Laptop, HDMI Cable for PC, High Speed HDMI Cable, HDMI ARC Cable, HDMI Ethernet Cable, Wall Mount TV HDMI Cable, HDMI Cable Bangladesh, UGREEN Bangladesh, International Office Solution', NULL, 102, NULL, NULL),
(947, 'UGREEN HD119 2 Meter 4K HDMI Cable #40101-iosbdd', 'The UGREEN HD119 2 Meter 4K HDMI 2.0 Cable #40101 is a premium high-speed HDMI cable that supports 4K Ultra HD (3840 × 2160) at 60Hz with 18Gbps bandwidth for crystal-clear video and high-quality digital audio. Featuring HDR, 3D, Audio Return Channel (ARC), HDMI Ethernet Channel (HEC), gold-plated connectors, and a durable braided jacket, it delivers stable and reliable performance for TVs, monitors, projectors, gaming consoles, laptops, Blu-ray players, and home theater systems. It is an ideal solution for home entertainment, gaming, and professional AV installations.', 'ugreen-hd119-2-meter-4k-hdmi-cable-40101-iosbdd-1783187169', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>UGREEN HD119 2 Meter 4K HDMI 2.0 Cable #40101</strong> is a premium high-speed HDMI cable designed to deliver exceptional audio and video performance for home entertainment, gaming, office, and professional multimedia applications. Built with HDMI 2.0 technology, it offers reliable, high-bandwidth connectivity for today\'s Ultra HD devices while maintaining outstanding durability for long-term everyday use.</p><p>Supporting <strong>4K Ultra HD (3840 × 2160) resolution at 60Hz</strong>, the cable delivers crystal-clear visuals, vibrant colors, and smooth motion for movies, gaming, sports, presentations, and streaming content. Whether you\'re connecting a Smart TV, gaming console, projector, or monitor, the HD119 ensures an immersive viewing experience with impressive image quality.</p><p>With a <strong>maximum bandwidth of 18Gbps</strong>, this HDMI cable transfers uncompressed high-definition video and multi-channel digital audio quickly and efficiently. It supports <strong>HDR (High Dynamic Range)</strong> technology, providing deeper contrast, brighter highlights, and more realistic colors for compatible displays. The cable also supports <strong>3D video</strong>, making it suitable for immersive entertainment systems.</p><p>The <strong>gold-plated HDMI connectors</strong> improve signal conductivity while resisting corrosion and oxidation, ensuring stable performance over extended periods. Inside, the cable features <strong>multiple shielding layers</strong> that effectively minimize electromagnetic interference (EMI) and signal loss, delivering a clean and uninterrupted audio-video experience even in environments with multiple electronic devices.</p><p>Designed with a <strong>durable braided outer jacket</strong>, the UGREEN HD119 offers excellent flexibility and enhanced protection against bending, twisting, and daily wear. Its robust construction makes it ideal for both home installations and professional environments where reliability is essential.</p><p>In addition to high-definition video transmission, the cable supports <strong>Audio Return Channel (ARC)</strong>, allowing audio to travel from a compatible television back to a soundbar or AV receiver using the same HDMI cable. It also supports the <strong>HDMI Ethernet Channel (HEC)</strong>, enabling compatible HDMI devices to share a network connection without requiring an additional Ethernet cable.</p><p>The UGREEN HD119 is fully compatible with a broad range of HDMI-enabled devices, including <strong>Smart TVs, LED TVs, OLED TVs, QLED TVs, computer monitors, projectors, desktop PCs, laptops, PlayStation 5, PlayStation 4, Xbox Series X/S, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch, Blu-ray players, Apple TV, Chromecast, Roku, AV receivers, and home theater systems</strong>.</p><p>Whether you\'re creating a premium home theater, upgrading your gaming setup, connecting office presentation equipment, or building a professional multimedia workstation, the <strong>UGREEN HD119 2 Meter 4K HDMI 2.0 Cable</strong> delivers dependable performance, premium build quality, and outstanding compatibility.</p><h2><strong>Buy UGREEN HD119 2 Meter 4K HDMI 2.0 Cable #40101 from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>Purchase the original <strong>UGREEN HD119 2 Meter 4K HDMI 2.0 Cable #40101</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted source for genuine UGREEN products in Bangladesh. We offer authentic products at competitive prices along with reliable customer support and nationwide delivery.</p><p>Whether you need a high-speed HDMI cable for your <strong>TV, monitor, projector, gaming console, laptop, desktop PC, or home theater system</strong>, the UGREEN HD119 provides outstanding 4K performance, stable signal transmission, and long-lasting durability. Contact <strong>International Office Solution</strong> today or order online to experience reliable HDMI connectivity for all your multimedia needs.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>General</td><td>Brand</td><td>UGREEN</td></tr><tr><td>General</td><td>Model</td><td>HD119 (#40101)</td></tr><tr><td>General</td><td>Product Type</td><td>HDMI 2.0 Male to Male Cable</td></tr><tr><td>Cable</td><td>Cable Length</td><td>2 Meter</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>Connector Type</td><td>HDMI Male to HDMI Male</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>HDMI Version</td><td>HDMI 2.0</td></tr><tr><td>Video</td><td>Maximum Resolution</td><td>4K Ultra HD (3840 × 2160) @ 60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Video</td><td>HDR Support</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Video</td><td>3D Support</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Performance</td><td>Bandwidth</td><td>Up to 18Gbps</td></tr><tr><td>Performance</td><td>Audio Support</td><td>Stereo &amp; Multi-Channel Digital Audio</td></tr><tr><td>Performance</td><td>Audio Return Channel (ARC)</td><td>Supported</td></tr><tr><td>Performance</td><td>HDMI Ethernet Channel (HEC)</td><td>Supported</td></tr><tr><td>Performance</td><td>Signal Transmission</td><td>High-Speed, Stable Audio &amp; Video Transmission</td></tr><tr><td>Connector</td><td>Connector Finish</td><td>Gold-Plated</td></tr><tr><td>Shielding</td><td>EMI Protection</td><td>Multiple Shielding Layers</td></tr><tr><td>Construction</td><td>Cable Jacket</td><td>Braided Jacket</td></tr><tr><td>Construction</td><td>Durability</td><td>Flexible, Wear-Resistant &amp; Long-Lasting</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>Supported Devices</td><td>Smart TVs, LED/OLED/QLED TVs, Monitors, Projectors, Desktop PCs, Laptops, PS5, PS4, Xbox Series X/S, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch, Blu-ray Players, Apple TV, Chromecast, Roku, AV Receivers, Home Theater Systems</td></tr><tr><td>Application</td><td>Suitable For</td><td>Home Entertainment, Gaming, Office, Conference Room, Multimedia &amp; Professional AV Installations</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td><td>1 Year</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Cable', 550.00, 540.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/c7ar48zI51O9Zd60o21lCSf5CzvFqtSRKeUxxpQx.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-04 17:46:09', '2026-07-05 14:08:20', 'UGREEN HD119 2 Meter 4K HDMI 2.0 Cable #40101 Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the UGREEN HD119 2 Meter 4K HDMI 2.0 Cable #40101 in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Supports 4K@60Hz, 18Gbps bandwidth, HDR, ARC, Ethernet, 3D, and gold-plated connectors for TVs, monitors, projectors, gaming consoles, and laptops.', 'UGREEN HD119, UGREEN HD119 2 Meter HDMI Cable, UGREEN HDMI Cable, UGREEN HDMI 2.0 Cable, HDMI Cable 2 Meter, 4K HDMI Cable, 18Gbps HDMI Cable, HDR HDMI Cable, HDMI Cable Price in Bangladesh, UGREEN Cable Bangladesh, HDMI Cable for TV, HDMI Cable for Monitor, HDMI Cable for Projector, HDMI Cable for Laptop, HDMI Cable for PC, HDMI Cable for PS5, HDMI Cable for PS4, HDMI Cable for Xbox, HDMI Cable for Nintendo Switch, HDMI Cable for Apple TV, HDMI Cable for Chromecast, Gold Plated HDMI Cable, Braided HDMI Cable, High Speed HDMI Cable, HDMI ARC Cable, HDMI Ethernet Cable, International Office Solution', NULL, 102, NULL, NULL),
(948, 'MSI PAG PANO M110A Micro-ATX Mid Tower Gaming Casing', 'The MSI PAG PANO M110A is a compact Micro-ATX mid-tower gaming chassis featuring a 270-degree panoramic tempered glass display. Pre-installed with three Auto-RGB fans, this case provides excellent airflow, stunning aesthetics, and broad compatibility for high-performance components in a space-efficient design.', 'msi-pag-pano-m110a-micro-atx-mid-tower-gaming-casing-1783236556', '<p>Elevate your gaming setup with the <strong>MSI PAG PANO M110A</strong>, a stylish and functional Micro-ATX mid-tower casing designed for enthusiasts who demand both performance and visual flair. Its signature \"pillarless\" 270-degree panoramic tempered glass design provides an unobstructed view of your internal hardware, making it the perfect showcase for RGB-lit builds.</p><p>Despite its compact dimensions, the M110A is engineered for maximum efficiency. It comes equipped with three high-quality 120mm Auto-RGB fans—two positioned at the top and one at the rear—delivering optimal cooling straight out of the box. The chassis supports a wide variety of hardware, including Micro-ATX and Mini-ITX motherboards, graphics cards up to 330mm, and CPU coolers up to 160mm in height. With support for up to eight system fans and 240mm liquid cooling radiators, your system will stay cool even during intense gaming sessions. Maintenance is kept simple with a convenient top-mounted magnetic dust filter, ensuring your PC stays clean and dust-free.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><strong>Model &amp; Type</strong></td><td>MSI PAG PANO M110A Black Mid Tower</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><strong>Motherboard Support</strong></td><td>Micro-ATX, Mini-ITX</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><strong>Dimensions (DxWxH)</strong></td><td>369 x 210 x 448 mm</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td><strong>Panel Design</strong></td><td>Front &amp; Side 270° Panoramic Tempered Glass</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td><strong>Pre-installed Fans</strong></td><td>3 x 120mm Auto RGB (2 Top, 1 Rear)</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td><strong>Hardware Clearance</strong></td><td>Max GPU: 330 mm / Max CPU Cooler: 160 mm</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td><strong>Cooling &amp; Power Support</strong></td><td>Top Radiator: up to 240 mm / Max ATX PSU: 160 mm</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td><strong>Bays &amp; I/O Ports</strong></td><td>1x 2.5\", 2x 3.5\" / 1x USB 5Gbps, 1x USB Type-A, Audio</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Casing', 3500.00, 4070.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/EufGMYjGQGQi0P3uuy2s1WnqB3PdGvqqUH0JlkE9.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-05 07:29:16', '2026-07-05 07:29:16', 'MSI PAG PANO M110A Micro-ATX Panoramic Gaming Casing | Black', 'Shop the MSI PAG PANO M110A Micro-ATX gaming case. Features 270° panoramic tempered glass, 3x pre-installed Auto-RGB fans, and support for high-performance builds.', 'MSI PAG PANO M110A, Micro-ATX Gaming Case, Panoramic PC Case, Tempered Glass Gaming Casing, MSI RGB Case, Mid Tower Gaming PC, High-Airflow PC Case, Compact Gaming Chassis.', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL);
