(949, 'MSI MAG VAMPIRIC 300R Mid-Tower Gaming Case', 'The MSI MAG VAMPIRIC 300R is a premium mid-tower gaming case featuring an eye-catching front ARGB light strip, a 3mm hinged tempered glass side panel, and a built-in VGA support bracket. It offers extensive cooling options, including support for up to 360mm radiators and high-speed USB 3.2 Gen 2x2 Type-C connectivity.', 'msi-mag-vampiric-300r-mid-tower-gaming-case-1783237213', '<p>The MSI MAG VAMPIRIC 300R combines durability with stunning visual appeal. The front panel is highlighted by an customizable LED light strip, fully compatible with MSI Mystic Light for seamless ARGB synchronization. Designed for heavy-duty hardware, the case includes a sturdy VGA support bracket to prevent GPU sag and accommodates graphics cards up to 380mm in length.</p><p>Thermal management is a priority for the VAMPIRIC 300R; it supports up to seven fans and dual 360mm radiators (front and top), ensuring your system remains cool under intense gaming loads. The chassis also features a user-friendly 3mm hinged swinging tempered glass door for easy access to your components. With support for ATX, Micro-ATX, and Mini-ITX motherboards, along with modern I/O connectivity including USB Type-C (20Gbps), it is an ideal choice for a professional-grade gaming build.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>#</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><strong>Model</strong></td><td>MSI MAG VAMPIRIC 300R</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><strong>Motherboard Support</strong></td><td>ATX, Micro-ATX, Mini-ITX</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><strong>Dimensions (DxWxH)</strong></td><td>471 x 231 x 497 mm</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td><strong>Side Panel</strong></td><td>3mm Hinged Tempered Glass</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td><strong>Cooling Support</strong></td><td>Front/Top: Up to 360mm Radiator</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td><strong>Max Hardware Space</strong></td><td>GPU: 380 mm / CPU Cooler: 175 mm</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td><strong>I/O Connectivity</strong></td><td>2x USB 3.2 Gen 1, 1x USB 3.2 Gen 2x2 Type-C</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td><strong>Storage &amp; Warranty</strong></td><td>2x 2.5\" or 2x 3.5\" Bays / No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Casing', 9999.00, 11220.00, NULL, 7, 'products/thumbnails/kCKplwBgFBo9bd80LoEj7Gs7HiSAnvwIKRSyzQOu.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-05 07:40:13', '2026-07-05 07:40:13', 'MSI MAG VAMPIRIC 300R Mid-Tower Gaming Case | ARGB & Tempered Glass', 'Elevate your PC build with the MSI MAG VAMPIRIC 300R. Features ARGB lighting, hinged tempered glass, 360mm radiator support, and a built-in VGA bracket.', 'MSI MAG VAMPIRIC 300R, MSI Gaming Case, Mid Tower Case, ARGB Gaming PC, Tempered Glass Casing, PC Case with USB-C, 360mm Radiator Support, MSI Mystic Light.', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(950, 'HP 645A Yellow Original LaserJet Toner Cartridge-IOSBD', 'The HP 645A Yellow Original LaserJet Toner Cartridge is designed to deliver bright, vibrant yellow prints with consistent quality from the first page to the last. With an approximate yield of 12,000 pages, it is an excellent choice for offices, businesses, and professional printing environments. Compatible with HP Color LaserJet 5500 and 5550 series printers, this genuine HP toner ensures reliable performance, sharp color reproduction, and minimal printer maintenance. Purchase from International Office Solution for authentic HP toner cartridges and dependable customer support.', 'hp-645a-yellow-original-laserjet-toner-cartridge-iosbd-1783240344', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>HP 645A Yellow Original LaserJet Toner Cartridge</strong> is engineered to produce vibrant color output and dependable printing performance for professional environments. Designed specifically for HP Color LaserJet 5500 and 5550 series printers, this genuine HP toner cartridge helps maintain consistent print quality while reducing printer downtime.</p><p>With an impressive <strong>page yield of approximately 12,000 pages</strong> (based on 5% average page coverage), the HP 645A Yellow Toner is ideal for businesses, corporate offices, educational institutions, print shops, and organizations with demanding printing requirements. Whether you\'re printing colorful presentations, brochures, marketing materials, reports, or graphics, this toner produces crisp text and rich yellow tones on every page.</p><p>Original HP toner cartridges are manufactured to work seamlessly with compatible HP printers, helping protect your printer while delivering reliable, high-quality results. Genuine HP toner also minimizes toner leakage and helps extend printer life compared to many third-party alternatives.</p><p>The HP 645A Yellow Toner Cartridge installs quickly and operates efficiently, allowing users to maintain productivity without frequent cartridge replacements. Its high-capacity design makes it a cost-effective solution for medium to high-volume printing environments.</p><p><strong>International Office Solution</strong> supplies genuine HP toner cartridges to ensure customers receive authentic products with reliable performance. Whether you\'re replacing an existing cartridge or stocking office supplies, the HP 645A Yellow Original LaserJet Toner Cartridge offers dependable printing quality and long-lasting value.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Product Name</td><td>HP 645A Yellow Original LaserJet Toner Cartridge</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Toner Model</td><td>HP 645A</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Printing Color</td><td>Yellow</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Print Technology</td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Cartridge Type</td><td>Original LaserJet Toner Cartridge</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Page Yield</strong></td><td>Yield</td><td>Approximately 12,000 Pages</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Yield Standard</td><td>Approximate yield based on 5% average page coverage. Actual yield may vary depending on printed content and usage.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Supported Printers</td><td>HP Color LaserJet 5500, 5500n, 5500dn, 5500dtn, 5500hdn, 5550, 5550n, 5550dn, 5550dtn, 5550hdn</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance</strong></td><td>Print Quality</td><td>Sharp yellow color output with consistent, professional-quality printing</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Usage</td><td>Suitable for office documents, graphics, marketing materials, and business printing</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Package Information</strong></td><td>Package Contents</td><td>1 × HP 645A Yellow Original LaserJet Toner Cartridge</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>No Warra