(958, 'HP 81A Black Original LaserJet Toner-IOSBD', 'The HP 81A Black Original LaserJet Toner Cartridge (CF281A) offers reliable, high-quality black printing with a page yield of up to 10,500 pages. It is designed for HP LaserJet Enterprise M604, M605, M606, and M630 series printers, delivering sharp text, professional-quality documents, and dependable performance. Buy the genuine HP 81A toner from International Office Solution for authentic products and competitive pricing in Bangladesh.', 'hp-81a-black-original-laserjet-toner-iosbd-1783313047', '<p>The <strong>HP 81A Black Original LaserJet Toner Cartridge (CF281A)</strong> is a genuine HP printing solution designed to deliver exceptional print quality, dependable performance, and high page yields for demanding business environments. Built specifically for HP LaserJet Enterprise printers, this original toner cartridge produces crisp black text, sharp graphics, and professional-looking documents with every print. Whether you are printing reports, invoices, contracts, presentations, or everyday office documents, the HP 81A ensures consistent, reliable results from the first page to the last.</p><p>With an impressive <strong>page yield of up to 10,500 pages</strong> (actual yield may vary depending on page coverage and printing conditions), the HP 81A toner is an ideal choice for medium to high-volume offices. Its high-capacity design helps reduce cartridge replacement frequency, improving productivity while lowering overall printing costs. Businesses that require uninterrupted printing can rely on this toner for consistent output and dependable performance.</p><p>The HP 81A Black Original LaserJet Toner utilizes advanced HP laser printing technology to deliver deep black output, excellent text clarity, and clean graphics. Unlike non-genuine or refilled cartridges, original HP toner is engineered to work seamlessly with compatible HP LaserJet Enterprise printers, reducing the risk of print defects, toner leaks, and unnecessary printer maintenance. This ensures optimal printer performance and helps extend the lifespan of your printing equipment.</p><p>Installation is quick and hassle-free, allowing users to replace the cartridge easily and resume printing with minimal downtime. Each genuine HP toner cartridge is manufactured to strict quality standards, ensuring reliable operation and consistent performance throughout its lifecycle.</p><p>The HP 81A (CF281A) is compatible with a wide range of HP LaserJet Enterprise printers, including the <strong>HP LaserJet Enterprise M604n, M604dn, M605n, M605dn, M605x, M605dh, M606dn, M606x, MFP M630dn, MFP M630f, MFP M630h, Flow MFP M630h, Flow MFP M630z, Flow Refurbished MFP M630z, and Refurbished MFP M630f</strong>. This broad compatibility makes it an excellent solution for businesses operating multiple HP Enterprise printer models.</p><p>Choosing the <strong>HP 81A Black Original LaserJet Toner Cartridge</strong> means investing in genuine HP quality, dependable performance, and long-lasting value. It provides consistently sharp prints, excellent reliability, and outstanding efficiency for everyday business printing requirements.</p><p>Order the <strong>HP 81A Black Original LaserJet Toner Cartridge (CF281A)</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted supplier of genuine HP printing products in Bangladesh. We provide authentic HP toner cartridges at competitive prices, ensuring your office receives reliable printing solutions backed by professional customer service.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Printing Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Print Technology</td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Supported Printer</td><td>HP LaserJet Enterprise MFP M630f, M605dn, Flow Refurbished MFP M630z, MFP