(1010, 'Brother TN-B028 Black Toner Cartridge-IOSBD', 'The Brother TN-B028 Black Toner Cartridge delivers crisp, professional-quality black prints for home and office environments. Designed for reliable laser printing, it offers an approximate yield of 2,600 pages and is compatible with Brother HL-B2100D, HL-B2150W, HL-B2180DW, DCP-B7620DW, DCP-B7640DW, and MFC-B7810DW printers. Its genuine Brother quality ensures consistent performance, sharp text, and long-lasting prints while helping maintain your printer\'s efficiency.', 'brother-tn-b028-black-toner-cartridge-iosbd-1783484725', '<p>The <strong>Brother TN-B028 Black Original Toner Cartridge</strong> is engineered to deliver outstanding print quality, consistent performance, and dependable reliability for everyday business and personal printing. Whether you\'re printing office documents, invoices, reports, contracts, or educational materials, this genuine Brother toner produces sharp black text and professional-looking documents from the first page to the last.</p><p>Designed using Brother\'s advanced laser printing technology, the TN-B028 minimizes toner waste while maximizing print efficiency. With an approximate page yield of <strong>2,600 pages</strong> (based on standard 5% page coverage), it provides excellent value for businesses, educational institutions, and home offices that require frequent printing.</p><p>The original Brother toner cartridge helps protect your printer from unnecessary wear while maintaining optimal print quality. Unlike many compatible cartridges, genuine Brother toner reduces the chances of print defects, toner leakage, and premature printer maintenance.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Product Type</td><td>Toner Cartridge</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brand</td><td>Brother</td></tr><tr><td>&n