(1020, 'Brother TN-2455 Toner-IOSBD', 'The Brother TN-2455 Black Original Toner Cartridge is a genuine Brother laser toner designed to produce sharp, professional-quality black prints. With a page yield of up to 3,000 pages, it is an excellent choice for home users, offices, and businesses that require reliable, high-volume printing. Compatible with the Brother HL-L2335D, HL-L2370DN, and DCP-L2535D laser printers, this toner delivers consistent performance from the first page to the last.', 'brother-tn-2455-toner-iosbd-1783504903', '<p>The <strong>Brother TN-2455 Black Original Toner Cartridge</strong> is engineered to deliver outstanding print quality, dependable performance, and long-lasting reliability for Brother monochrome laser printers. Designed using Brother\'s advanced laser printing technology, this genuine toner cartridge produces crisp black text, sharp graphics, and professional-quality documents, making it ideal for everyday office work, business reports, contracts, invoices, and educational materials.</p><p>Offering a page yield of <strong>up to 3,000 pages</strong> (based on standard 5% page coverage), the Brother TN-2455 helps reduce printing costs while maintaining consistent output throughout the cartridge\'s lifespan. Whether you print frequently in an office environment or occasionally at home, this toner provides smooth operation, minimal maintenance, and excellent printing efficiency.</p><p>The Brother TN-2455 is specifically designed to work seamlessly with compatible Brother laser printers, ensuring optimal performance while helping protect your printer from unnecessary wear. Genuine Brother toner cartridges also reduce the risk of print defects and provide consistent, high-quality results that compatible or refilled cartridges may not always achieve.</p><p>This toner cartridge is compatible with the following Brother laser printer models:</p><ul><li>Brother HL-L2335D</li><li>Brother HL-L2370DN</li><li>Brother DCP-L2535D</li></ul><p>If you\'