(1021, 'Brother TN-3607 Black Toner Cartridge-IOSBD', 'The Brother TN-3607 Black Original Toner Cartridge is a genuine Brother laser toner designed to deliver sharp black text and consistent print quality for home and office use. With a page yield of up to 3,000 pages, it offers reliable performance and cost-effective printing. Compatible with Brother HL-L5210DN, HL-L5210DW, HL-L6210DW, HL-L6410DN, DCP-L5510DN, DCP-L5510DW, MFC-L5710DW, MFC-L6710DW, and MFC-L6910DN printers.', 'brother-tn-3607-black-toner-cartridge-iosbd-1783505213', '<p>The <strong>Brother TN-3607 Black Original Toner Cartridge</strong> is engineered to provide exceptional print quality, reliable performance, and long-lasting durability for Brother monochrome laser printers. Whether you\'re printing business documents, reports, contracts, invoices, or everyday office paperwork, this genuine Brother toner consistently delivers crisp black text and sharp graphics from the first page to the last.</p><p>Designed with Brother\'s advanced laser printing technology, the TN-3607 ensures smooth printer operation while helping maintain the performance and longevity of your Brother printer. Genuine Brother toner cartridges are manufactured to meet strict quality standards, minimizing print defects and ensuring dependable results that compatible or refilled cartridges often cannot match.</p><p>The Brother TN-3607 offers a page yield of <strong>up to 3,000 pages</strong> (based on ISO/IEC standard 5% page coverage), making it an economical choice for businesses, corporate offices, educational institutions, and home users with regular printing needs. Its high-capacity performance reduces the frequency of cartridge replacements, improving productivity while lowering overall printing costs.</p><p>The Brother TN-3607 Black Toner Cartridge is compatible with the following Brother laser printer models:</p><ul><li>Brother HL-L5210DN</li><li>Brother HL-L5210DW</li><li>Brother HL-L6210DW</li><li>Brother HL-L6410DN</li><