educed operating costs, and consistent print quality for high-volume office environments. Buy the genuine Brother TN-3607XXL toner from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> for authentic Brother products, competitive prices, fast delivery, and trusted customer service across Bangladesh.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Printing Technology</td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Printing Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Supported Printer</td><td>Brother HL-L5210DN, HL-L5210DW, HL-L6210DW, HL-L6410DN, DCP-L5510DN, DCP-L5510DW, MFC-L5710DW, MFC-L5715DW, MFC-L6710DW, MFC-L6910DN</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Page Yield</td><td>Up to 11,000 Pages</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Toner', 14000.00, 14300.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/jEjwV2sxgDwAlcOAFx5JcYnFGStVjQO3uPhk3yDT.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-08 11:13:06', '2026-07-08 11:13:06', 'Brother TN-3607XXL Black Original Toner Cartridge 11,000 Pages | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Brother TN-3607XXL Black Original Toner Cartridge from International Office Solution in Bangladesh. High-yield 11,000-page toner compatible with Brother HL-L5210DN, HL-L6210DW, HL-L6410DN, DCP-L5510DN, and MFC-L6910DN series printers.', 'Brother TN-3607XXL toner, Brother TN3607XXL black toner, Brother toner price Bangladesh, TN3607XXL cartridge, Brother HL-L5210DN toner, HL-L6410DN toner, MFC-L5710DW toner, MFC-L6910DN toner, original Brother toner', NULL, 258, NULL, NULL),
(1033, 'Toshiba T-2323C e-studio Compatible Toner-IOSBD', 'The Toshiba T-2323C e-Studio Black Toner Cartridge is a genuine laser toner designed to deliver sharp black prints and dependable performance for Toshiba multifunction photocopiers. With a page yield of up to 15,000 pages, it is an ideal choice for offices, businesses, educational institutions, and commercial printing environments. Compatible with Toshiba e-Studio 2523A, 2523AD, 2323AM, 2823AM, 2329A, and 2829A models.', 'toshiba-t-2323c-e-studio-compatible-toner-iosbd-1783515826', '<p>The <strong>Toshiba T-2323C e-Studio Black Toner Cartridge</strong> is a high-performance printing solution developed to provide exceptional print quality, reliable performance, and long-lasting durability for Toshiba e-Studio multifunction photocopiers. Manufactured to Toshiba\'s quality standards, this toner cartridge consistently delivers sharp black text, clean graphics, and professional-quality documents, making it an excellent choice for offices, businesses, schools, banks, and government organizations.</p><p>Built with advanced <strong>laser printing technology</strong>, the Toshiba T-2323C ensures smooth printer operation and consistent output from the first page to the last. Whether you\'re printing reports, contracts, invoices, forms, presentations, or daily office documents, this toner produces crisp, smudge-free prints with excellent clarity and detail.</p><p>With a high page yield of <strong>up to 15,000 pages</strong> (based on standard 5% page coverage), the Toshiba T-2323C helps reduce toner replacement frequency, improving office productivity while lowering the overall cost per page. Its high-capacity design makes it ideal for medium to high-volume printing environments where efficiency and reliability are essential.</p><p>The Toshiba T-2323C Black Toner Cartridge is compatible with the following Toshiba e-Studio photocopier models:</p><ul><li>Toshiba e-Studio 2523A</li><li>Toshiba e-Studio 2523AD</li><li>Toshiba e-Studio 2323AM</li><li>Toshiba e-Studio 2823AM</li><li>Toshiba e-Studio 2329A</li><li>Toshiba e-Studio 2829A</li></ul><p>Whether you manage a busy office or require dependable printing for daily operations, the Toshiba T-2323C delivers consistent print quality and reliable performance throughout the life of the cartridge.</p><p>Purchase the genuine <strong>Toshiba T-2323C e-Studio Black Toner Cartridge</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted supplier of original Toshiba printer and photocopier consumables in Bangladesh. We offer genuine products, competitive prices, fast nationwide delivery, and dedicated customer support to keep your business printing without interruption.</p><h2>Key Features</h2><ul><li>Genuine Toshiba T-2323C e-Studio Black Toner Cartridge</li><li>Advanced laser printing technology</li><li>Sharp black text and professional-quality output</li><li>High page yield of up to <strong>15,000 pages</strong></li><li>Reliable and consistent printing performance</li><li>Compatible with Toshiba e-Studio 2523A, 2523AD, 2323AM, 2823AM, 2329A, and 2829A</li><li>Ideal for offices, businesses, and commercial printing</li><li>Easy installation and dependable operation</li><li>Helps maximize photocopier performance and productivity</li><li>Available from <strong>International Office Solution</strong></li></ul><h2>Product Overview</h2><p>The <strong>Toshiba T-2323C e-Studio Black Toner Cartridge</strong> is a genuine high-yield laser toner designed for Toshiba e-Studio multifunction photocopiers. Delivering up to <strong>15,000 pages</strong>, it provides crisp black text, reliable performance, and professional-quality printing for everyday office use. Compatible with Toshiba e-Studio 2523A, 2523AD, 2323AM, 2823AM, 2329A, and 2829A models, this toner is the ideal solution for businesses seeking dependable, cost-effective printing. Purchase from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> for authentic Toshiba products, competitive pricing, and trusted service throughout Bangladesh.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Printing Technology</td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Printing Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Supported Printer</td><td>Toshiba e-Studio 2523A, e-Studio 2523AD, e-Studio 2323AM, e-Studio 2823AM, e-Studio 2329A, e-Studio 2829A</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Page Yield</td><td>Up to 15,000 Pages</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Toner', 3500.00, 3700.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/BqFl6PrIsizBeveNAqcgqc55LV7OqywjsxSWG03y.jpg', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-08 13:03:46', '2026-07-08 17:23:20', 'Toshiba T-2323C e-Studio Black Toner Cartridge for 2523A, 2323AM & 2823AM | International Office Solution', 'Buy the original Toshiba T-2323C e-Studio Black Toner Cartridge from International Office Solution in Bangladesh. Prints up to 15,000 pages and is compatible with Toshiba e-Studio 2523A, 2523AD, 2323AM, 2823AM, 2329A, and 2829A photocopiers.', 'Toshiba T-2323C toner, Toshiba T2323C toner, Toshiba e-Studio toner, Toshiba toner Bangladesh, Toshiba 2523A toner, Toshiba 2523AD toner, Toshiba 2323AM toner, Toshiba 2823AM toner, Toshiba 2829A toner, original Toshiba toner', NULL, 160, NULL, NULL),
(1034, 'MSI EdgeXpert MS-C931 Personal AI Supercomputer On NVIDIA DGX Spark Platform iosbd', 'The MSI EdgeXpert MS-C931 Personal AI Supercomputer is a compact AI workstation powered by the NVIDIA DGX Spark Platform and Grace Blackwell architecture. Featuring a 20-core Arm CPU, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU with up to 1 PetaFLOP AI performance, 128GB LPDDR5x unified memory, 4TB encrypted NVMe SSD, Wi-Fi 7, 10GbE networking, and NVIDIA DGX OS, it is designed for AI development, machine learning, deep learning, scientific computing, and enterprise workloads. Available from International Office Solution with a 3-year official warranty.', 'msi-edgexpert-ms-c931-personal-ai-supercomputer-on-nvidia-dgx-spark-platform-iosbd-1783532374', '<p>The <strong>MSI EdgeXpert MS-C931 Personal AI Supercomputer</strong> is an advanced desktop AI computing platform engineered for professionals who require exceptional AI processing power in a compact form factor. Built on the <strong>NVIDIA DGX Spark Platform</strong>, it enables developers and organizations to accelerate artificial intelligence projects without relying entirely on cloud infrastructure.</p><p>At the heart of the system is a powerful <strong>20-core Arm-based processor</strong>, featuring <strong>10 Cortex-X925 performance cores</strong> and <strong>10 Cortex-A725 efficiency cores</strong>. This hybrid architecture delivers outstanding multitasking performance while maintaining excellent energy efficiency for AI development, software engineering, simulation, and research workloads.</p><p>Graphics processing is powered by the latest <strong>NVIDIA Blackwell GPU</strong>, delivering up to <strong>1 PetaFLOP (FP4 Sparse)</strong> of AI performance. This computing capability allows users to train, fine-tune, and deploy advanced AI models, including Large Language Models (LLMs), computer vision applications, natural language processing, robotics, and generative AI workloads.</p><p>To support memory-intensive AI applications, the EdgeXpert MS-C931 includes <strong>128GB of LPDDR5x unified memory</strong> with an impressive <strong>273GB/s memory bandwidth</strong>. The unified memory architecture enables rapid communication between CPU and GPU, significantly improving performance when processing large datasets and complex neural networks.</p><p>Storage is equally impressive, featuring a <strong>4TB NVMe M.2 SSD</strong> with <strong>self-encryption technology</strong>, providing enterprise-grade security while delivering ultra-fast application loading, dataset access, and project storage.</p><p>Connectivity has been designed for demanding professional environments. The system includes <strong>10 Gigabit Ethernet</strong>, <strong>NVIDIA ConnectX-7 Smart NIC</strong>, <strong>Wi-Fi 7</strong>, <strong>Bluetooth 5.3</strong>, and <strong>QSFP support</strong>, ensuring high-speed networking for AI clusters, enterprise networks, and cloud integration.</p><p>The four <strong>USB 3.2 Gen2 Type-C ports</strong> support data transfer speeds up to <strong>20Gbps</strong> while enabling connection to multiple high-resolution displays. Users can simultaneously drive up to <strong>four external monitors</strong> using <strong>DisplayPort 1.4a</strong> and <strong>HDMI 2.1</strong> over USB-C, creating an efficient multi-display workstation.</p><p>For media professionals and AI developers working with video, integrated <strong>NVIDIA NVENC</strong> and <strong>NVDEC</strong> hardware acceleration enables faster video encoding, decoding, AI-assisted rendering, and multimedia processing.</p><p>Running on <strong>NVIDIA DGX OS</strong>, the system provides a professional software environment optimized for AI frameworks, CUDA development, deep learning libraries, containerized applications, and scientific computing.</p><p>Despite its workstation-class performance, the EdgeXpert MS-C931 weighs only <strong>1.2kg</strong>, making it one of the most portable AI supercomputers available. Powered by a <strong>240W USB-C external power adapter</strong>, it combines mobility with enterprise-grade performance for research labs, universities, AI startups, and corporate innovation teams.</p><p>Whether you\'re developing AI applications, training machine learning models, performing scientific simulations, or accelerating enterprise AI projects, the <strong>MSI EdgeXpert MS-C931 Personal AI Supercomputer</strong> delivers exceptional performance in a compact and energy-efficient platform.</p><p>Purchase the genuine <strong>MSI EdgeXpert MS-C931 Personal AI Supercomputer</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> for competitive pricing, authentic MSI products, and professional after-sales support.</p><p>Why Buy from International Office Solution? 100% Genuine MSI Products</p><p>Competitive Enterprise Pricing</p><p>Nationwide Delivery Across Bangladesh</p><p>Expert Technical Consultation</p><p>Professional After-Sales Support</p><p>Trusted Supplier for AI, Enterprise &amp; IT Infrastructure</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>General</td><td>Brand</td><td>MSI</td></tr><tr><td>General</td><td>Model</td><td>EdgeXpert MS-C931</td></tr><tr><td>General</td><td>Product Type</td><td>Personal AI Supercomputer</td></tr><tr><td>Platform</td><td>AI Platform</td><td>NVIDIA DGX Spark Platform</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>CPU</td><td>20-Core Arm Processor</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>CPU Architecture</td><td>10× Cortex-X925 + 10× Cortex-A725</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell GPU</td></tr><tr><td>AI Performance</td><td>AI Compute</td><td>Up to 1 PetaFLOP (FP4 Sparse)</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>Capacity</td><td>128GB LPDDR5x Unified Memory</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>Interface</td><td>256-bit</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>Bandwidth</td><td>Up to 273GB/s</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>SSD</td><td>4TB NVMe M.2 Self-Encrypting SSD</td></tr><tr><td>Networking</td><td>Ethernet</td><td>10GbE</td></tr><tr><td>Networking</td><td>Smart NIC</td><td>NVIDIA ConnectX-7</td></tr><tr><td>Networking</td><td>Wireless</td><td>Wi-Fi 7</td></tr><tr><td>Networking</td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Bluetooth 5.3</td></tr><tr><td>Networking</td><td>QSFP</td><td>Supported</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>USB</td><td>4 × USB 3.2 Gen2 Type-C (20Gbps)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>External Displays</td><td>Up to 4 Displays</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Video Output</td><td>HDMI 2.1 &amp; DisplayPort 1.4a (via USB-C)</td></tr><tr><td>Multimedia</td><td>Video Engine</td><td>NVIDIA NVENC &amp; NVDEC</td></tr><tr><td>Operating System</td><td>AI Platform OS</td><td>NVIDIA DGX OS</td></tr><tr><td>Expansion</td><td>Storage Expansion</td><td>M.2 Slot</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>HDMI Audio</td><td>Multi-Channel Audio</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Adapter</td><td>240W USB-C External Adapter</td></tr><tr><td>Physical</td><td>Weight</td><td>Approximately 1.2kg</td></tr><tr><td>Target Users</td><td>Suitable For</td><td>AI Developers, Data Scientists, Researchers, Engineers, Enterprises</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Official Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 699999.00, 689999.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/qGVwfHrHk0AftTLpVEwm5hZQYErpELBklJZspna0.webp', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-08 17:39:34', '2026-07-08 17:39:34', 'MSI EdgeXpert MS-C931 Personal AI Supercomputer Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the MSI EdgeXpert MS-C931 Personal AI Supercomputer in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Powered by the NVIDIA DGX Spark Platform, it features a 20-core Arm CPU, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, 128GB LPDDR5x memory, 4TB SSD, Wi-Fi 7, 10GbE networking, and a 3-year official warranty.', 'MSI EdgeXpert MS-C931 price in Bangladesh\r\nMSI EdgeXpert MS-C931 BD\r\nMSI AI PC price in Bangladesh\r\nMSI AI workstatio