(1051, 'Sharp MX-61AT-BA Black Toner', 'The Sharp MX-61AT-BA Black Original Toner is a genuine laser toner cartridge designed for the Sharp MX-3561 multifunction photocopier. It delivers crisp black text, sharp graphics, and reliable, consistent print quality for everyday office and commercial printing. Buy the original Sharp MX-61AT-BA toner from International Office Solution in Bangladesh for dependable performance and professional results.', 'sharp-mx-61at-ba-black-toner-1783601055', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Sharp MX-61AT-BA Black Original Toner</strong> is a genuine Sharp toner cartridge designed to deliver exceptional print quality, reliable performance, and long-lasting durability for Sharp multifunction photocopiers. Manufactured to Sharp\'s original specifications, this toner produces crisp black text, sharp graphics, and consistent print results while ensuring the smooth operation of your photocopier.</p><p>Designed specifically for the <strong>Sharp MX-3561</strong> multifunction photocopier, the MX-61AT-BA toner is ideal for offices, businesses, educational institutions, and commercial environments that require professional-quality monochrome printing. Whether you\'re printing reports, contracts, invoices, business documents, or presentations, this original toner delivers outstanding clarity and consistent results.</p><p>Sharp\'s advanced laser printing technology transfers toner to paper through an electrostatically charged drum unit and permanently fuses it using heated rollers, ensuring durable prints with sharp text and excellent image quality. By using genuine Sharp toner, you can reduce the risk of print defects, minimize maintenance requirements, and extend the lifespan of your photocopier.</p><p>The Sharp MX-61AT-BA toner is designed for dependable, high-volume office printing, helping improve productivity while reducing the need for costly reprints. Every page maintains the same high level of quality, making it a trusted solution for demandin