(1057, 'Sharp MX-315AT Toner-iosbd', 'The Sharp MX-315AT Original Black Toner Cartridge is designed to deliver outstanding print quality and consistent performance for Sharp multifunction photocopiers. Compatible with Sharp MX-M265NV, MX-M315NV, and MX-M356NV, this genuine toner produces sharp black text, professional-quality documents, and a high page yield of approximately 28,000–30,000 copies. Purchase the Sharp MX-315AT Toner from International Office Solution for reliable printing performance at a competitive price in Bangladesh.', 'sharp-mx-315at-toner-iosbd-1783603227', '<p>The <strong>Sharp MX-315AT Original Black Toner Cartridge</strong> is a premium-quality genuine toner designed to provide reliable, high-volume printing for Sharp multifunction photocopiers. Manufactured to Sharp\'s quality standards, this toner delivers crisp black text, sharp graphics, and consistent print quality from the first page to the last.</p><p>Compatible with <strong>Sharp MX-M265NV, MX-M315NV, and MX-M356NV</strong> photocopiers, the MX-315AT toner is ideal for offices, businesses, educational institutions, and organizations that require dependable daily printing. Its high-capacity design provides an impressive page yield of approximately <strong>28,000–30,000 copies</strong> (actual yield may vary depending on print coverage and usage), helping reduce toner replacement frequency and improve workplace productivity.</p><p>The Sharp MX-315AT toner is engineered to work seamlessly with your Sharp photocopier, minimizing print defects while ensuring smooth operation and professional-quality results. Whether you\'re printing reports, invoices, contracts, presentations, or everyday office documents, this toner delivers clear, dark prints with excellent consistency.</p><p>Choose the <strong>Sharp MX-315AT Original Toner</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> to enjoy authentic Sharp printing performance, dependable quality, and excellent value for your business printing needs.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Basic Information</td><td>Brand</td><td>Sharp</td></tr><tr><td>Basic Information</td><td>Model</td><td>MX-315AT</td></tr><tr><td>Basic Information</td><td>Product Type</td><td>Original Toner Cartridge</td></tr><tr><td>Printing</td><td>Printing Technology</td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td>Printing</td><td>Printing Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>Performance</td><td>Page Yield</td><td>Up to 28,000–30,000 Copies (Approx.)</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>Supported Photocopier</td><td>Sharp MX-M265NV</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>Supported Photocopier</td><td>Sharp MX-M315NV</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>Supported Photocopier</td><td>Sharp MX-M356NV</td></tr><tr><td>Quality</td><td>Print Output</td><td>Sharp, Clear &amp; Consistent Black Prints</td></tr><tr><td>Usage</td><td>Application</td><td>Office, Business &amp; Commercial Printing</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Photo Coper Toner', 11000.00, 10400.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/zEt93ksOuK9jH65yihmslUeOn8xGdElITCDoayT4.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-09 13:20:27', '2026-07-09 13:20:27', 'Sharp MX-315AT Original Black Toner for MX-M265NV, MX-M315NV | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Sharp MX-315AT Original Black Toner Cartridge from International Office Solution. Compatible with Sharp MX-M265NV, MX-M315NV, and MX-M356NV photocopiers with a high yield of up to 30,000 copies and reliable print quality.', 'Sharp MX-315AT toner, Sharp MX-315AT original toner, Sharp MX-315AT price in Bangladesh, Sharp MX-315AT cartridge, Sharp MX-M265NV toner, MX-M315NV toner, MX-M356NV toner, Sharp photocopier toner, original Sharp toner, Sharp toner BD', NULL, 316, NULL, NULL),
(1058, 'Sharp MX-B45AT Toner -iosbd', 'The Sharp MX-B45AT Original Black Toner Cartridge is designed to deliver exceptional print quality and reliable performance for the Sharp MX-B350Z photocopier. This genuine laser toner produces sharp black text, consistent print results, and a high page yield of approximately 28,000–30,000 copies, making it ideal for offices and businesses with high-volume printing needs. Buy the Sharp MX-B45AT Toner from International Office Solution for authentic quality and dependable printing performance in Bangladesh.', 'sharp-mx-b45at-toner-iosbd-1783603507', '<p>The <strong>Sharp MX-B45AT Original Black Toner Cartridge</strong> is a genuine Sharp consumable engineered to provide professional-quality printing, dependable performance, and long-lasting reliability. Designed specifically for the <strong>Sharp MX-B350Z</strong> multifunction photocopier, this toner ensures crisp black text, smooth graphics, and consistent output from the first page to the last.</p><p>With an impressive page yield of approximately <strong>28,000–30,000 copies</strong> (actual yield may vary depending on print coverage and usage), the Sharp MX-B45AT toner is an excellent choice for businesses, corporate offices, educational institutions, and organizations that require high-volume document printing. Its high-capacity design reduces toner replacement frequency, helping improve productivity while lowering overall printing costs.</p><p>Manufactured to Sharp\'s strict quality standards, the MX-B45AT toner works seamlessly with your Sharp photocopier. During the printing process, the toner is efficiently transferred onto paper and fused using heated rollers, producing durable, sharp, and professional-quality prints every time. Whether you\'re printing reports, invoices, contracts, or everyday office documents, this original toner delivers reliable performance and outstanding print clarity.</p><p>Purchase the <strong>Sharp MX-B45AT Original Toner Cartridge</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> to ensure genuine Sharp quality, maximum printer performance, and consistent printing results for your business.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Basic Information</td><td>Brand</td><td>Sharp</td></tr><tr><td>Basic Information</td><td>Model</td><td>MX-B45AT</td></tr><tr><td>Basic Information</td><td>Product Type</td><td>Original Toner Cartridge</td></tr><tr><td>Printing</td><td>Printing Technology</td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td>Printing</td><td>Printing Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>Performance</td><td>Page Yield</td><td>Approximately 28,000–30,000 Copies</td></tr><tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>Supported Photocopier</td><td>Sharp MX-B350Z</td></tr><tr><td>Print Quality</td><td>Output Quality</td><td>Sharp, Clear &amp; Consistent Black Prints</td></tr><tr><td>Usage</td><td>Recommended Use</td><td>Office, Business &amp; Commercial Printing</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Photo Coper Toner', 12000.00, 12200.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/D8Mj4x4FFSAF2VbC2WD9za7xmhII9zw5C2UsywF2.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-09 13:25:07', '2026-07-09 13:25:07', 'Sharp MX-B45AT Original Black Toner for MX-B350Z | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Sharp MX-B45AT Original Black Toner Cartridge from International Office Solution. Compatible with Sharp MX-B350Z photocopier, delivering up to 30,000 copies with consistent, professional-quality printing.', 'Sharp MX-B45AT toner, Sharp MX-B45AT original toner, Sharp MX-B45AT price in Bangladesh, Sharp MX-B45AT cartridge, Sharp MX-B350Z toner, Sharp MX-B350Z cartridge, Sharp photocopier toner, original Sharp toner, Sharp toner BD, MX-B45AT toner Bangladesh', NULL, 316, NULL, NULL),
(1059, 'Xtrike Me GC-905 Gaming Chair ios', 'The Xtrike Me GC-905 Gaming Chair is designed to deliver superior comfort, durability, and ergonomic support for gamers, professionals, and content creators. Featuring premium PU leather, a sturdy nylon base, adjustable height, 180° reclining backrest, 360° swivel, and removable lumbar and neck support pillows, it provides exceptional comfort during long gaming or working sessions.', 'xtrike-me-gc-905-gaming-chair-ios-1783662160', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>Upgrade your gaming or office setup with the <strong>Xtrike Me GC-905 Gaming Chair</strong>, an ergonomic chair designed for maximum comfort and long-lasting durability. Whether you\'re gaming for hours, working from home, streaming, or studying, this chair provides the support you need to stay comfortable and focused throughout the day.</p><p>The chair features a premium PU and PVC synthetic leather finish that offers a stylish appearance while being easy to clean and resistant to everyday wear. Its high-density foam cushioning provides excellent comfort, making long sitting sessions less tiring.</p><p>The Xtrike Me GC-905 comes equipped with a <strong>100mm Class Gas Lift</strong> that allows smooth seat height adjustment to match different desk heights and user preferences. The strong <strong>350mm nylon base</strong> ensures excellent stability and durability, while the smooth-rolling caster wheels allow effortless movement across different floor surfaces.</p><p>One of the standout features of this gaming chair is its <strong>Butterfly Adjustment Mechanism</strong>, allowing users to lock or adjust their preferred seating position easily. The chair also offers <strong>180° reclining functionality</strong>, making it suitable for gaming, working, watching movies, or simply relaxing. Its <strong>360-degree swivel</strong> design allows unrestricted movement, improving convenience and productivity.</p><p>For enhanced ergonomic support, the chair includes <strong>detachable lumbar support and headrest pillows</strong> that help reduce pressure on the neck, shoulders, and lower back during extended gaming or work sessions. The comfortable PVC armrests provide additional arm support, minimizing fatigue while using a keyboard and mouse.</p><p>Combining modern aesthetics with ergonomic engineering, the <strong>Xtrike Me GC-905 Gaming Chair</strong> is an excellent choice for gamers, office professionals, students, streamers, and anyone seeking a comfortable and stylish seating solution.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li>Premium PU &amp; PVC synthetic leather upholstery</li><li>High-density foam padding for superior comfort</li><li>100mm gas lift for easy height adjustment</li><li>180° reclining backrest</li><li>Butterfly tilt adjustment mechanism</li><li>360° smooth swivel rotation</li><li>Durable 350mm nylon base</li><li>Comfortable PVC armrests</li><li>Detachable headrest cushion</li><li>Removable lumbar support pillow</li><li>Smooth caster wheels for effortless movement</li><li>Ideal for gaming, office work, streaming, and study</li></ul><h2><strong>Buy Xtrike Me GC-905 Gaming Chair from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>Purchase the <strong>original Xtrike Me GC-905 Gaming Chair</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, one of Bangladesh\'s trusted suppliers of gaming chairs, office furniture, computer accessories, and IT products.</p><p>We offer genuine products at competitive prices, ensuring excellent customer service and reliable after-sales support. Whether you\'re upgrading your gaming setup, furnishing your office, or creating a productive workspace, International Office Solution provides the right solution to meet your needs.</p><p>Order online or contact <strong>International Office Solution</strong> for the latest price, product availability, and nationwide delivery across Bangladesh.</p><p><strong>Warranty:</strong> No Warranty.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>General</td><td>Product Name</td><td>Xtrike Me GC-905 Gaming Chair</td></tr><tr><td>General</td><td>Brand</td><td>Xtrike Me</td></tr><tr><td>General</td><td>Type</td><td>Gaming Chair</td></tr><tr><td>Material</td><td>Upholstery</td><td>Premium PU &amp; PVC Synthetic Leather</td></tr><tr><td>Material</td><td>Frame</td><td>Durable Metal Frame</td></tr><tr><td>Cushion</td><td>Seat Filling</td><td>High-Density Foam</td></tr><tr><td>Gas Lift</td><td>Height Adjustment</td><td>100mm Gas Lift</td></tr><tr><td>Base</td><td>Base Material</td><td>350mm Nylon Base</td></tr><tr><td>Armrest</td><td>Type</td><td>PVC Fixed Armrests</td></tr><tr><td>Mechanism</td><td>Adjustment Mechanism</td><td>Butterfly Mechanism</td></tr><tr><td>Recline</td><td>Backrest Tilt</td><td>Up to 180° Reclining</td></tr><tr><td>Rotation</td><td>Swivel</td><td>360° Rotation</td></tr><tr><td>Support</td><td>Head Pillow</td><td>Detachable</td></tr><tr><td>Support</td><td>Lumbar Pillow</td><td>Detachable Lower Back Support</td></tr><tr><td>Wheels</td><td>Casters</td><td>Smooth Rolling Caster Wheels</td></tr><tr><td>Comfort</td><td>Ergonomic Design</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Usage</td><td>Recommended For</td><td>Gaming, Office, Study, Streaming, Home Use</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Available Color</td><td>Black (May vary depending on stock)</td></tr><tr><td>Weight Capacity</td><td>Maximum Load</td><td>Up to 120 kg (Approx.)</td></tr><tr><td>Assembly</td><td>Installation</td><td>Self Assembly Required</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Xtrike Me GC-905 Gaming Chair', 19000.00, 19000.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/XEA0CleYbpNCTrPyMWCvY0nar2ivOoOJrE67ynPP.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 05:42:40', '2026-07-10 06:13:04', 'Xtrike Me GC-905 Gaming Chair Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the original Xtrike Me GC-905 Gaming Chair in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features ergonomic design, 180° reclining backrest, adjustable height, lumbar & head pillows, 360° swivel, and durable PU leather. Best price with fast delivery.', 'Xtrike Me GC-905 Gaming Chair, Xtrike Me GC-905 price in Bangladesh, gaming chair price in BD, best gaming chair Bangladesh, ergonomic gaming chair, gaming chair with lumbar support, gaming chair with footrest, Xtrike Me gaming chair BD, gaming chair for PC setup, office gaming chair, adjustable gaming chair, recliner gaming chair, PU leather gaming chair, gaming chair Dhaka, gaming chair Chittagong, buy gaming chair online Bangladesh, computer gaming chair, gaming setup chair, RGB gaming accessories Bangladesh, International Office Solution', NULL, 225, NULL, NULL);
