(1061, 'Xtrike Me GC-905 Gaming Chair Blue ios', 'The Xtrike Me GC-905 Gaming Chair Blue combines ergonomic comfort, durability, and modern style. It features a 100mm gas lift, 180° reclining backrest, Butterfly adjustment mechanism, 360° swivel rotation, PVC armrests, removable headrest, lumbar cushion, and premium PU/PVC leather upholstery. Perfect for gaming, office work, studying, and long sitting sessions.', 'xtrike-me-gc-905-gaming-chair-blue-ios-1783664522', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Xtrike Me GC-905 Gaming Chair Blue</strong> is designed to provide exceptional comfort, ergonomic support, and long-lasting durability for gamers, office professionals, streamers, and content creators. Whether you\'re working long office hours or enjoying extended gaming sessions, this premium gaming chair helps maintain a comfortable sitting posture while reducing fatigue.</p><p>Featuring a <strong>100mm Class Gas Lift</strong>, the chair allows smooth height adjustment, enabling users to find their ideal seating position with ease. The strong <strong>350mm nylon base</strong> offers excellent stability and supports daily heavy use, while the durable caster wheels provide effortless 360-degree movement across different floor surfaces.</p><p>Constructed with high-quality <strong>PU and PVC synthetic leather</strong>, the GC-905 delivers a stylish racing-inspired appearance while being easy to clean and maintain. The premium upholstery is wear-resistant and designed for everyday use.</p><p>Its advanced <strong>Butterfly Mechanism</strong> allows users to lock and adjust the chair\'s recline angle according to their comfort. The <strong>180° reclining backrest</strong> lets you sit upright while working or fully recline when relaxing between gaming sessions.</p><p>The ergonomic <strong>PVC armrests</strong>, detachable <strong>headrest cushion</strong>, and <strong>lumbar support pillow</strong> provide excellent neck and lower back support, helping reduce strain during prolonge