(1062, 'Colorful GeForce RTX 3050 6GB V4-V GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The Colorful GeForce RTX 3050 6GB V4-V GDDR6 Graphics Card delivers powerful gaming and creative performance with 2304 CUDA cores, 6GB GDDR6 memory, NVIDIA DLSS, 2nd Generation Ray Tracing Cores, and support for up to three displays. Its efficient cooling system and low power consumption make it an excellent choice for modern gaming PCs and content creation workstations.', 'colorful-geforce-rtx-3050-6gb-v4-v-gddr6-graphics-card-1783664637', '<h2>Colorful GeForce RTX 3050 6GB V4-V GDDR6 Graphics Card</h2><p>The <strong>Colorful GeForce RTX 3050 6GB V4-V GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong> is a high-performance graphics solution designed for gamers, streamers, and creative professionals who want advanced NVIDIA RTX technology at an affordable price. Powered by the NVIDIA GA107 GPU architecture, it combines excellent gaming performance with AI-powered graphics enhancements and real-time ray tracing capabilities.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>2304 CUDA Cores</strong> and operating at a <strong>1042MHz base clock</strong> with a <strong>1470MHz boost clock</strong>, the RTX 3050 V4-V delivers responsive performance for modern AAA games, esports titles, video editing, and 3D rendering. Its <strong>6GB of GDDR6 memory</strong> running at <strong>14Gbps</strong> over a <strong>96-bit memory interface</strong> provides fast data transfer and smooth gameplay at Full HD resolution.</p><p>The graphics card supports advanced NVIDIA technologies including <strong>NVIDIA DLSS</strong>, <strong>NVIDIA G-SYNC</strong>, and <strong>2nd Generation Ray Tracing Cores</strong>, enabling AI-powered frame generation, reduced screen tearing, and realistic lighting, reflections, and shadows for a truly immersive gaming experience.</p><p>Designed with a reliable dual-slot cooling solution featuring <strong>Auto Stop Technology</strong>, the fans automatically stop during low workloads to minimize noise and extend fan lifespan. The card includes <strong>HDMI, DisplayPort, and DVI outputs</strong>, allowing connection to up to <strong>three displays</strong> for gaming, productivity, or content creation.</p><p>Supporting <strong>DirectX 12 Ultimate</strong> and <strong>OpenGL 4.6</strong>, the Colorful RTX 3050 V4-V is fully compatible with the latest games and graphics applications. With a recommended <strong>450W power supply</strong>, it offers excellent performance while maintaining efficient power consumption.</p><p>International Office Solution provides the <strong>Colorful GeForce RTX 3050 6GB V4-V GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong> with genuine manufacturer warranty and competitive pricing across Bangladesh.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Model</td><td>Product</td><td>Colorful GeForce RTX 3050 6GB V4-V</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>GPU Architecture</td><td>Architecture</td><td>NVIDIA GA107</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory</td><td>6GB</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Memory Type</td><td>Memory</td><td>GDDR6</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Base Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>1042MHz</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Boost Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>1470MHz</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td><td>14Gbps</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Memory Bus</td><td>Memory</td><td>96-bit</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class