(1063, 'Colorful GeForce RTX 3050 NB DUO V2-V 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The Colorful GeForce RTX 3050 NB DUO V2-V 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card delivers outstanding gaming and content creation performance with 2560 CUDA cores, 8GB GDDR6 memory, NVIDIA DLSS, 2nd Generation Ray Tracing Cores, and support for up to four displays. Featuring an advanced dual-fan cooling system with Auto Stop Technology, it provides reliable performance for modern gaming and creative workloads.', 'colorful-geforce-rtx-3050-nb-duo-v2-v-8gb-gddr6-graphics-card-1783665024', '<h2>Colorful GeForce RTX 3050 NB DUO V2-V 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card</h2><p>The <strong>Colorful GeForce RTX 3050 NB DUO V2-V 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong> is a powerful graphics solution built for gamers, streamers, designers, and content creators seeking smooth performance and realistic visuals. Based on NVIDIA\'s advanced <strong>8nm architecture</strong>, the card combines efficient power consumption with impressive graphics capabilities for modern games and creative applications.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>2560 CUDA Cores</strong>, the graphics card operates at a <strong>1552MHz base clock</strong> and boosts up to <strong>1777MHz</strong>, ensuring responsive gameplay and accelerated rendering performance. Its <strong>8GB GDDR6 memory</strong> runs at <strong>14Gbps</strong> on a <strong>128-bit memory interface</strong>, delivering a memory bandwidth of <strong>224GB/s</strong> for fast texture loading, smooth gameplay, and efficient multitasking.</p><p>The RTX 3050 NB DUO V2-V supports <strong>NVIDIA DLSS</strong>, <strong>NVIDIA G-SYNC</strong>, and <strong>2nd Generation Ray Tracing Cores</strong>, providing AI-enhanced frame rates, tear-free gaming, and realistic lighting, reflections, and shadows. These technologies help deliver immersive gaming experiences while maintaining excellent performance.</p><p>Designed with a <strong>dual-fan cooling system</strong> and <strong>two 6mm heat pipes</strong>, the graphics card efficiently dissipates heat during demanding workloads. <strong>Auto Stop Technology</strong> automatically stops the fans during light usage, reducing noise and extending fan lifespan.</p><p>The card offers versatile connectivity with <strong>DisplayPort, HDMI, and Dual-Link DVI outputs</strong>, supporting up to <strong>four displays</strong> simultaneously. It also supports a maximum digital resolution of <strong>7680 × 4320</strong>, making it suitable for high-resolution gaming, professional content creation, and multi-monitor productivity.</p><p>Supporting <strong>DirectX 12 Ultimate</strong> and <strong>OpenGL 4.6</strong>, the Colorful RTX 3050 NB DUO V2-V is fully compatible with the latest games and graphics software. With a <strong>125W TDP</strong>, a <strong>6-pin power connector</strong>, and a recommended <strong>550W or higher power supply</strong>, it delivers dependable performance for a wide range of desktop PC builds.</p><p>International Office Solution offers the <strong>Colorful GeForce RTX 3050 NB DUO V2-V 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong> with genuine manufacturer warranty, competitive pricing, and reliable customer support throughout Bangladesh.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Model</td><td>Product</td><td>Colorful GeForce RTX 3050 NB DUO V2-V</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050</td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturing Process</td><td>Architecture</td><td>8nm</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Type</td><td>Memory</td><td>GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum Resolution</td><td>Display</td><td>7680 × 4320</td></tr><tr><td>Base Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>1552MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Boost Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>1777MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td><td>14Gbps</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Bus</td><td>Memory</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Bandwidth</td><td>Memory</td><td>224 GB/s</td></tr><tr><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Processing</td><td>2560</td></tr><tr><td>NVIDIA Technologies</td><td>Features</td><td>NVIDIA DLSS, NVIDIA G-SYNC, 2nd Gen Ray Tracing Cores</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling System</td><td>Cooling</td><td>Dual-Fan Cooling</td></tr><tr><td>Heat Pipes</td><td>Cooling</td><td>2 × 6mm Heat Pipes</td></tr><tr><td>Auto Stop Technology</td><td>Cooling</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>TDP</td><td>Power</td><td>125W</td></tr><tr><td>Power Connector</td><td>Power</td><td>6-Pin</td></tr><tr><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Power</td><td>550W or Higher</td></tr><tr><td>DisplayPort</td><td>Display Output</td><td>1 × DisplayPort</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>Display Output</td><td>1 × HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>DVI</td><td>Display Output</td><td>1 × Dual-Link DVI</td></tr><tr><td>Multi-Display Support</td><td>Display</td><td>Up to 4 Displays</td></tr><tr><td>DirectX Support</td><td>API</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>API</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td>Expansion Slot</td><td>Physical</td><td>Dual Slot (2-Slot Design)</td></tr><tr><td>Dimensions</td><td>Physical</td><td>255 × 130 × 41.3 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Manufacturer Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 35500.00, 35500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/wKd63xMVAXrb37duzksJlRbjlud93jB0SpRmCnzs.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 06:30:24', '2026-07-10 06:30:24', 'Colorful GeForce RTX 3050 NB DUO V2-V 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card | International Office Solution Bangladesh', 'Buy the Colorful GeForce RTX 3050 NB DUO V2-V 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card from International Office Solution Bangladesh. Featuring 2560 CUDA cores, NVIDIA DLSS, Ray Tracing, 8GB GDDR6 memory, DirectX 12 Ultimate, and support for up to four displays.', 'Colorful RTX 3050 8GB, Colorful RTX 3050 NB DUO V2-V, RTX 3050 8GB Bangladesh, NVIDIA RTX 3050 Graphics Card, GDDR6 Graphics Card, Gaming GPU Bangla