(1064, 'Xtrike Me GC-905 Gaming Chair Green iosbd', 'The Xtrike Me GC-905 Gaming Chair Green is a premium ergonomic gaming chair featuring a 100mm gas lift, 180° reclining backrest, Butterfly adjustment mechanism, 360° swivel, 350mm nylon base, PU & PVC leather upholstery, headrest pillow, and lumbar support cushion. Its spacious seat and durable construction make it ideal for gaming, office work, studying, and long sitting sessions.', 'xtrike-me-gc-905-gaming-chair-green-iosbd-1783665072', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Xtrike Me GC-905 Gaming Chair Green</strong> is a premium ergonomic gaming chair designed to provide superior comfort, durability, and support for gamers, professionals, streamers, and remote workers. Combining a modern racing-inspired design with high-quality materials, this chair delivers an exceptional seating experience during long gaming sessions, office work, or study hours.</p><p>Built with a sturdy metal frame and a <strong>350mm nylon base</strong>, the GC-905 offers excellent stability and long-lasting durability. The chair features a <strong>100mm gas lift system</strong>, allowing smooth height adjustment to match different desk heights and user preferences. Its adjustable overall height ranges from <strong>125cm to 135cm</strong>, while the seat height can be adjusted between <strong>44cm and 54cm</strong> for personalized comfort.</p><p>The chair is upholstered in premium <strong>PU and PVC synthetic leather</strong>, providing a soft, luxurious feel while remaining easy to clean and resistant to daily wear. The ergonomic backrest measures <strong>57cm wide and 85cm high</strong>, offering outstanding support for your spine and shoulders. The spacious <strong>53cm wide and 50cm deep seat</strong> provides excellent comfort and proper thigh support during extended periods of sitting.</p><p>The <strong>Butterfly adjustment mechanism</strong> enables smooth reclining adjustments, while the <strong>180° reclining backrest</strong> allows you to sit upright, relax, or even lie back between gaming sessions. The <strong>360° swivel function</strong> offers unrestricted movement, making multitasking effortless.</p><p>For enhanced ergonomic support, the chair includes <strong>fixed PVC armrests</strong>, a <strong>detachable headrest pillow</strong>, and a <strong>removable lumbar support cushion</strong> to reduce neck and lower back strain. Its vibrant <strong>green racing-style design</strong> adds a bold and energetic look to any gaming setup, home office, or workspace.</p><p>Whether you\'re a competitive gamer, content creator, student, or office professional, the <strong>Xtrike Me GC-905 Gaming Chair Green</strong> combines comfort, style, and durability to help you stay productive and comfortable throughout the day.</p><h2><strong>Buy Xtrike Me GC-905 Gaming Chair Green from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>Purchase the <strong>original Xtrike Me GC-905 Gaming Chair Green</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted destination for genuine gaming chairs, office furniture, and workplace solutions in Bangladesh.</p><p>We offer authentic Xtrike Me products at competitive prices with reliable customer support and nationwide delivery. Order online or contact <strong>International Office Solution</strong> for the latest price, availability, and delivery information.</p><p><strong>Warranty:</strong> No Warranty</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>General</td><td>Brand</td><td>Xtrike Me</td></tr><tr><td>General</td><td>Model</td><td>GC-905</td></tr><tr><td>General</td><td>Product Type</td><td>Gaming Chair</td></tr><tr><td>General</td><td>Color</td><td>Green</td></tr><tr><td>Design</td><td>Style</td><td>Racing Style Ergonomic Gaming Chair</td></tr><tr><td>Material</td><td>Upholstery</td><td>Premium PU &amp; PVC Synthetic Leather</td></tr><tr><td>Material</td><td>Frame</td><td>Heavy-Duty Metal Frame</td></tr><tr><td>Material</td><td>Base</td><td>350mm Nylon Base</td></tr><tr><td>Material</td><td>Armrests</td><td>Fixed PVC Armrests</td></tr><tr><td>Comfort</td><td>Head Support</td><td>Detachable Headrest Pillow</td></tr><tr><td>Comfort</td><td>Lumbar Support</td><td>Detachable Lumbar Cushion</td></tr><tr><td>Adjustment</td><td>Height Adjustment</td><td>100mm Gas Lift</td></tr><tr><td>Adjustment</td><td>Overall Height</td><td>125–135 cm</td></tr><tr><td>Adjustment</td><td>Seat Height</td><td>44–54 cm</td></tr><tr><td>Adjustment</td><td>Reclining Angle</td><td>Up to 180°</td></tr><tr><td>Adjustment</td><td>Tilt Mechanism</td><td>Butterfly Mechanism</td></tr><tr><td>Mobility</td><td>Swivel</td><td>360° Rotation</td></tr><tr><td>Dimensions</td><td>Backrest Size</td><td>57 × 85 cm</td></tr><tr><td>Dimensions</td><td>Seat Size</td><td>53 × 50 cm</td></tr><tr><td>Dimensions</td><td>Armrest Height</td><td>15 cm</td></tr><tr><td>Mobility</td><td>Casters</td><td>Smooth Rolling Wheels</td></tr><tr><td>Usage</td><td>Recommended For</td><td>Gaming, Office, Home Office, Study, Streaming</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 19000.00, 19000.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/PIuXNCV5Dkc9SLJSQLMOBiZXNwOXpM4yCr5wNKXq.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 06:31:12', '2026-07-10 06:31:12', 'Xtrike Me GC-905 Gaming Chair Green Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the original Xtrike Me GC-905 Gaming Chair Green in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features ergonomic design, 180° recline, PU leather, adjustable height, lumbar support, and durable construction for gaming and office use.', 'Xtrike Me GC-905 Gaming Chair Green\r\nXtrike Me GC-905 Green\r\nXtrike Me Gaming Chair Green\r\nGaming Chair Green Bangladesh\r\nGaming Chair Price in Bangladesh\r\nGaming Chair BD\r\nGreen Gaming Chair\r\nErgonomic Gaming Chair\r\nGaming Chair with Lumbar Support\r\nGaming Chair with Headrest\r\nGaming Chair for PC\r\nGaming Chair for Office\r\nGaming Chair for Home Office\r\nGaming Chair Online Bangladesh\r\nGaming Chair Dhaka\r\nGaming Chair Chattogram\r\nProfessional Gaming Chair\r\nComfortable Gaming Chair\r\nAdjustable Gaming Chair\r\n180 Degree Reclining Gaming Chair\r\nGaming Chair with Gas Lift\r\nPU Leather Gaming Chair\r\nOffice Gaming Chair\r\nComputer Gaming Chair\r\nBest Gaming Chair Bangladesh\r\nStudy Chair Bangladesh\r\nGaming Furniture Bangladesh\r\nOffice Chair Bangladesh\r\nOriginal Xtrike Me Chair\r\nXtrike Me Chair Price\r\nInternational Office Solution', NULL, 225, NULL, NULL),
(1065, 'Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 3050 Ultra W DUO OC V2-V 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 3050 Ultra W DUO OC V2-V 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card is built for high-performance gaming and content creation. Featuring 2560 CUDA cores, One-Key OC technology, 8GB GDDR6 memory, real-time Ray Tracing, and support for up to four displays, it delivers smooth gameplay and exceptional graphics performance.', 'colorful-igame-geforce-rtx-3050-ultra-w-duo-oc-v2-v-8gb-gddr6-graphics-card-1783665132', '<p>The <strong>Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 3050 Ultra W DUO OC V2-V 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong> is designed for gamers, streamers, and creative professionals who demand reliable performance and advanced graphics technologies. Powered by NVIDIA RTX architecture, this graphics card combines powerful processing capabilities with efficient cooling and factory overclocking for an enhanced gaming experience.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>2560 CUDA Cores</strong> and <strong>8GB of GDDR6 memory</strong>, the RTX 3050 Ultra W DUO OC V2-V delivers outstanding performance in modern AAA games, video editing, 3D rendering, and graphics-intensive applications. The GPU operates at a <strong>1552MHz base clock</strong> and <strong>1777MHz boost clock</strong>, while <strong>One-Key OC</strong> increases the boost frequency up to <strong>1822MHz</strong> for additional performance with a single button press.</p><p>The <strong>14Gbps GDDR6 memory</strong> connected through a <strong>128-bit memory interface</strong> ensures fast data transfer, smooth gameplay, and efficient multitasking. Supporting NVIDIA technologies such as <strong>real-time Ray Tracing</strong>, <strong>GPU Boost</strong>, and <strong>VR Ready</strong>, the graphics card delivers realistic lighting effects, improved frame rates, and immersive virtual reality experiences.</p><p>Its advanced <strong>dual-fan cooling system</strong> efficiently dissipates heat during heavy gaming sessions, helping maintain stable performance while reducing operating temperatures. The card occupies just over two expansion slots, making it suitable for a wide variety of gaming desktop builds.</p><p>Connectivity options include <strong>DisplayPort, HDMI, and Dual-Link DVI</strong>, supporting up to <strong>four simultaneous displays</strong> for gaming, streaming, productivity, or professional content creation. It also supports a maximum digital resolution of <strong>7680 × 4320</strong>, providing stunning image quality for high-resolution displays.</p><p>Compatible with <strong>DirectX 12 Ultimate</strong> and <strong>OpenGL 4.6</strong>, the Colorful iGame RTX 3050 Ultra W DUO OC V2-V is ready for the latest games and graphics applications. With a power consumption of only <strong>115W</strong> and a recommended <strong>550W or higher power supply</strong>, it offers an excellent balance between performance and efficiency.</p><p>International Office Solution supplies the <strong>Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 3050 Ultra W DUO OC V2-V 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong> with genuine manufacturer warranty, competitive pricing, and dependable after-sales support across Bangladesh.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Model</td><td>Product</td><td>Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 3050 Ultra W DUO OC V2-V</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Type</td><td>Memory</td><td>GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Processing</td><td>2560</td></tr><tr><td>Base Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>1552MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Boost Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>1777MHz</td></tr><tr><td>One-Key OC Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>Base 1552MHz / Boost 1822MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td><td>14Gbps</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Interface</td><td>Memory</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td>DisplayPort</td><td>Display Output</td><td>1 × DisplayPort</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>Display Output</td><td>1 × HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>DVI</td><td>Display Output</td><td>1 × Dual-Link DVI</td></tr><tr><td>Multi-Display Support</td><td>Display</td><td>Up to 4 Displays</td></tr><tr><td>Power Connector</td><td>Power</td><td>6-Pin</td></tr><tr><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Power</td><td>550W or Higher</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>Power</td><td>115W</td></tr><tr><td>DirectX Support</td><td>API</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>API</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling System</td><td>Cooling</td><td>Dual-Fan Cooling</td></tr><tr><td>Expansion Slot</td><td>Physical</td><td>Over 2-Slot Design</td></tr><tr><td>Dimensions</td><td>Physical</td><td>249.1 × 130.1 × 45 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>Physical</td><td>0.74 kg</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td><td>2 Years Manufacturer Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 35900.00, 35900.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/VS1A4vdsayTFLB3uyWSX935rhcAHAl4lPnPESENe.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 06:32:12', '2026-07-10 06:32:12', 'Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 3050 Ultra W DUO OC V2-V 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card | International Office Solution Bangladesh', 'Buy the Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 3050 Ultra W DUO OC V2-V 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card from International Office Solution Bangladesh. Featuring 2560 CUDA cores, One-Key OC, Ray Tracing, GDDR6 memory, DirectX 12 Ultimate, and support for up to four displays.', 'Colorful iGame RTX 3050 Ultra W DUO OC V2-V, RTX 3050 8GB Bangladesh, Colorful RTX 3050 OC, iGame Graphics Card, NVIDIA RTX 3050 8GB, Gaming Graphics Card Bangladesh, Ray Tracing GPU, DLSS Graphics Card, RTX 3050 Price Bangladesh, International Office Solution', NULL, 140, NULL, NULL),
(1066, 'Colorful GeForce RTX 5050 Battle AX DUO 8GB-V GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The Colorful GeForce RTX 5050 Battle AX DUO 8GB-V GDDR6 Graphics Card is a next-generation gaming GPU built for high-performance gaming and creative workloads. Featuring 8GB GDDR6 memory, DLSS 4, NVIDIA Reflex, RGB lighting, advanced Axe Cooling System, and support for 8K resolution, it delivers exceptional speed, efficiency, and immersive visuals.', 'colorful-geforce-rtx-5050-battle-ax-duo-8gb-v-gddr6-graphics-card-1783665219', '<h2>Colorful GeForce RTX 5050 Battle AX DUO 8GB-V GDDR6 Graphics Card</h2><p>The <strong>Colorful GeForce RTX 5050 Battle AX DUO 8GB-V GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong> is designed for gamers, streamers, and content creators looking for outstanding graphics performance powered by NVIDIA\'s latest RTX architecture. Combining advanced AI technologies with efficient cooling and premium design, this graphics card delivers smooth gameplay, accelerated creative workflows, and realistic visual effects.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>8GB of high-speed GDDR6 memory</strong> on a <strong>128-bit memory interface</strong>, the RTX 5050 Battle AX DUO operates with a <strong>2500MHz memory clock (20Gbps effective)</strong> for rapid data transfer and responsive gaming performance. The GPU runs at a <strong>2317MHz base clock</strong> and boosts up to <strong>2572MHz</strong>, providing the processing power needed for modern AAA games and professional creative applications.</p><p>Supporting <strong>NVIDIA DLSS 4</strong>, <strong>NVIDIA Reflex</strong>, and <strong>NVIDIA Studio</strong>, this graphics card leverages AI-enhanced rendering to improve frame rates, reduce system latency, and optimize performance for creators and professionals. It also supports <strong>DirectX 12 Ultimate</strong>, enabling advanced graphics technologies such as ray tracing for realistic lighting, reflections, and shadows.</p><p>The <strong>Axe Cooling System</strong> with <strong>ring-shaped dual fans</strong> provides efficient heat dissipation while <strong>Auto Stop Technology</strong> automatically stops the fans during light workloads for quieter operation. A stylish <strong>red and black color contrast design</strong>, <strong>metallic hollow backplate</strong>, and customizable <strong>RGB side lighting</strong> give the graphics card a premium appearance suitable for modern gaming builds.</p><p>Connectivity includes <strong>three DisplayPort 2.1b outputs</strong> and <strong>one HDMI 2.1b port</strong>, supporting up to <strong>four displays</strong> simultaneously and a maximum digital resolution of <strong>7680 × 4320 (8K)</strong>. The graphics card uses a <strong>PCI Express x8 interface</strong>, requires a single <strong>8-pin power connector</strong>, and is recommended for systems with a <strong>550W power supply</strong>.</p><p>International Office Solution offers the <strong>Colorful GeForce RTX 5050 Battle AX DUO 8GB-V GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong> with genuine manufacturer warranty, competitive pricing, and reliable nationwide support across Bangladesh.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Model</td><td>Product</td><td>Colorful GeForce RTX 5050 Battle AX DUO 8GB-V</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5050</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Type</td><td>Memory</td><td>GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum Resolution</td><td>Display</td><td>7680 × 4320</td></tr><tr><td>Base Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>2317 MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Boost Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>2572 MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td><td>2500 MHz (20Gbps Effective)</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Interface</td><td>Memory</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td>DisplayPort</td><td>Display Output</td><td>3 × DisplayPort 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>Display Output</td><td>1 × HDMI 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td>Multi-Display Support</td><td>Display</td><td>Up to 4 Displays</td></tr><tr><td>NVIDIA Technologies</td><td>Features</td><td>NVIDIA DLSS 4, NVIDIA Reflex, NVIDIA Studio</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling System</td><td>Cooling</td><td>Axe Cooling System with Ring-Shaped Fans</td></tr><tr><td>Auto Stop Technology</td><td>Cooling</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>RGB Lighting</td><td>Design</td><td>RGB Side Lighting</td></tr><tr><td>Backplate</td><td>Design</td><td>Metallic Hollow Backplate</td></tr><tr><td>Color Design</td><td>Design</td><td>Red and Black Contrast Design</td></tr><tr><td>Power Connector</td><td>Power</td><td>1 × 8-Pin</td></tr><tr><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Power</td><td>550W</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>Bus Interface</td><td>PCI Express x8</td></tr><tr><td>DirectX Support</td><td>API</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>API</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td>Dimensions</td><td>Physical</td><td>32.5 × 15 × 0.1 cm</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>Physical</td><td>2 kg</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Manufacturer Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 38900.00, 38900.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/uJJPv6oZ3SEPctXAfxCcYze1lVbhA9IqZYrzwkWg.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 06:33:39', '2026-07-10 06:33:39', 'Colorful GeForce RTX 5050 Battle AX DUO 8GB-V GDDR6 Graphics Card | International Office Solution Bangladesh', 'Buy the Colorful GeForce RTX 5050 Battle AX DUO 8GB-V GDDR6 Graphics Card from International Office Solution Bangladesh. Featuring 8GB GDDR6 memory, DLSS 4, NVIDIA Reflex, RGB lighting, PCIe x8, and support for up to four displays.', 'Colorful RTX 5050 Battle AX DUO, RTX 5050 8GB Bangladesh, Colorful GeForce RTX 5050, RTX 5050 Graphics Card Price Bangladesh, NVIDIA RTX 5050 GDDR6, Gaming Graphics Card, DLSS 4 GPU, RTX 5050 Battle AX DUO 8GB-V, Colorful Graphics Card, International Office Solution', NULL, 140, NULL, NULL);
