(1067, 'Xtrike Me GC-905 Gaming Chair Green iosbd', 'The Xtrike Me GC-905 Gaming Chair Green is a stylish ergonomic gaming chair featuring a 100mm gas lift, 180° reclining backrest, Butterfly tilt mechanism, 360° swivel, 350mm nylon base, premium PU & PVC leather upholstery, detachable headrest, and lumbar support cushion. Ideal for gaming, office work, streaming, studying, and long hours of comfortable sitting.', 'xtrike-me-gc-905-gaming-chair-green-iosbd-1783665320', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Xtrike Me GC-905 Gaming Chair Green</strong> is a premium ergonomic gaming chair designed for gamers, professionals, students, and content creators who demand superior comfort and long-lasting durability. With its racing-inspired design and ergonomic construction, this gaming chair provides excellent support during extended gaming sessions, office work, online classes, or everyday computer use.</p><p>Equipped with a <strong>100mm gas lift system</strong>, the chair offers smooth and effortless height adjustment, allowing users to find the perfect seating position. The overall height is adjustable from <strong>125cm to 135cm</strong>, while the seat height ranges from <strong>44cm to 54cm</strong>, making it suitable for users of different heights and various desk setups.</p><p>The GC-905 features premium <strong>PU and PVC synthetic leather upholstery</strong> that provides a luxurious appearance while being durable, wear-resistant, and easy to clean. Built on a strong <strong>350mm nylon base</strong>, the chair delivers excellent stability and supports everyday use with confidence. Smooth-rolling caster wheels and a <strong>360° swivel</strong> design allow easy movement around your gaming or work area.</p><p>Its spacious <strong>53cm wide and 50cm deep seat</strong> offers exceptional sitting comfort, while the <strong>57cm wide and 85cm high backrest</strong> supports your spine and shoulders to reduce fatigue during long hours of use. The ergonomic design is further enhanced with <strong>PVC armrests</strong>, a detachable <strong>headrest pillow</strong>, and a removable <strong>lumbar support cushion</strong> that help maintain proper posture and reduce pressure on the neck and lower back.</p><p>The advanced <strong>Butterfly tilt mechanism</strong> and <strong>180° reclining backrest</strong> let you adjust the chair to your preferred angle, whether you\'re gaming, working, watching movies, or simply relaxing. Finished in a vibrant <strong>Green</strong> color, the Xtrike Me GC-905 adds a modern and energetic look to any gaming room, office, or home workspace.</p><p>Combining comfort, adjustability, durability, and stylish design, the <strong>Xtrike Me GC-905 Gaming Chair Green</strong> is an excellent choice for anyone looking to upgrade their gaming or office setup.</p><h2><strong>Buy Xtrike Me GC-905 Gaming Chair Green from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>Purchase the <strong>original Xtrike Me GC-905 Gaming Chair Green</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, a trusted supplier of genuine gaming chairs, office furniture, and IT accessories in Bangladesh.</p><p>We provide authentic Xtrike Me products at competitive prices with dependable customer support and nationwide delivery. Order online or contact <strong>International Office Solution</strong> to get the latest price, product availability, and delivery information.</p><p><strong>Warranty:</strong> No Warranty</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>General</td><td>Brand</td><td>Xtrike Me</td></tr><tr><td>General</td><td>Model</td><td>GC-905</td></tr><tr><td>General</td><td>Product Type</td><td>Gaming Chair</td></tr><tr><td>General</td><td>Color</td><td>Green</td></tr><tr><td>Design</td><td>Style</td><td>Ergonomic Racing Style</td></tr><tr><td>Material</td><td>Upholstery</td><td>Premium PU &amp