(1068, 'Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 5050 Ultra W DUO OC 8GB-V GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 5050 Ultra W DUO OC 8GB-V GDDR6 Graphics Card is a high-performance gaming GPU featuring 2560 CUDA cores, One-Key OC technology, 8GB GDDR6 memory, NVIDIA DLSS 4, NVIDIA Reflex, and NVIDIA Studio support. Designed with efficient dual-fan cooling, it delivers exceptional gaming and creative performance for next-generation PCs.', 'colorful-igame-geforce-rtx-5050-ultra-w-duo-oc-8gb-v-gddr6-graphics-card-1783665333', '<h2>Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 5050 Ultra W DUO OC 8GB-V GDDR6 Graphics Card</h2><p>The <strong>Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 5050 Ultra W DUO OC 8GB-V GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong> is built for gamers, content creators, and professionals who demand outstanding graphics performance with the latest NVIDIA technologies. Combining powerful processing capabilities, AI-enhanced graphics, and factory overclocking, this graphics card delivers smooth gameplay, accelerated creative workflows, and exceptional visual quality.</p><p>Powered by <strong>2560 CUDA Cores</strong>, the GPU operates at a <strong>2317MHz base clock</strong> and <strong>2572MHz boost clock</strong>. With the built-in <strong>One-Key OC</strong> feature, users can instantly increase the boost frequency up to <strong>2647MHz</strong>, providing extra performance for demanding games and professional applications.</p><p>The graphics card is equipped with <strong>8GB of GDDR6 memory</strong> running at an ultra-fast <strong>20Gbps</strong> over a <strong>128-bit memory interface</strong>, delivering an impressive <strong>320GB/s memory bandwidth</strong>. This ensures fast texture loading, high frame rates, and smooth multitasking in modern AAA games and creative software.</p><p>Supporting <strong>NVIDIA DLSS 4</strong>, <strong>NVIDIA Reflex</strong>, and <strong>NVIDIA Studio</strong>, the RTX 5050 Ultra W DUO OC leverages AI technology to enhance gaming performance, reduce latency, and optimize workflows for video editing, 3D rendering, and digital content creation. It also supports <strong>DirectX 12 Ultimate</strong> and <strong>OpenGL 4.6</strong>, enabling advanced graphics features such as real-time ray tracing, variable rate shading, and realistic lighting effects.</p><p>The advanced <strong>dual-fan cooling system</strong> with <strong>Auto Stop Technology</strong> keeps temperatures under control while minimizing noise during low workloads by automatically stopping the fans when cooling isn\'t required.</p><p>For display connectivity, the graphics card features <strong>three DisplayPort 2.1b outputs</strong> and <strong>one HDMI 2.1b port</strong>, supporting up to <strong>four displays</strong> simultaneously with high refresh rates and ultra-high-resolution output.</p><p>With a <strong>130W power consumption</strong>, a <strong>single 8-pin power connector</strong>, and a recommended <strong>500W power supply</strong>, the RTX 5050 Ultra W DUO OC provides excellent power efficiency without compromising performance.</p><p>International Office Solution offers the <strong>Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 5050 Ultra W DUO OC 8GB-V GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong> with genuine manufacturer warranty, competitive pricing, and reliable customer support throughout Bangladesh.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Model</td><td>Product</td><td>Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 5050 Ultra W DUO OC 8GB-V</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5050</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Type</td><td>Memory</td><td>GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Processing</td><td>2560</td></tr><tr><td>Base Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>2317MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Boost Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>2572MHz</td></tr><tr><td>One-Key OC Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>Base 2317MHz / Boost 2647MHz</td