(1069, 'Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 5060 Ultra W DUO OC 8GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 5060 Ultra W DUO OC 8GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card is a next-generation gaming GPU featuring 3840 CUDA cores, 8GB ultra-fast GDDR7 memory, One-Key OC technology, NVIDIA DLSS 4, NVIDIA Reflex, and NVIDIA Studio support. With premium cooling, RGB lighting, and high-speed display connectivity, it delivers exceptional gaming and creative performance.', 'colorful-igame-geforce-rtx-5060-ultra-w-duo-oc-8gb-v-gddr7-graphics-card-1783665438', '<h2>Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 5060 Ultra W DUO OC 8GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card</h2><p>The <strong>Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 5060 Ultra W DUO OC 8GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> is engineered for gamers, streamers, and creative professionals who demand cutting-edge graphics performance and premium aesthetics. Combining NVIDIA\'s latest GPU architecture with ultra-fast GDDR7 memory, factory overclocking, and AI-powered technologies, this graphics card is built to handle demanding games and professional workloads with ease.</p><p>Powered by <strong>3840 CUDA Cores</strong>, the graphics card operates at a <strong>2280MHz base clock</strong> and <strong>2497MHz boost clock</strong>. Its integrated <strong>One-Key OC</strong> feature instantly increases the boost clock up to <strong>2580MHz</strong>, delivering additional performance for intensive gaming and rendering applications without manual tuning.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>8GB of next-generation GDDR7 memory</strong>, running at <strong>28Gbps</strong> over a <strong>128-bit memory interface</strong>, the RTX 5060 Ultra W DUO OC offers an impressive <strong>448GB/s memory bandwidth</strong>. This enables lightning-fast texture loading, higher frame rates, and smoother gameplay at high resolutions.</p><p>The graphics card supports the latest NVIDIA technologies, including <strong>NVIDIA DLSS 4</strong>, <strong>NVIDIA Reflex</strong>, and <strong>NVIDIA Studio</strong>, providing AI-powered performance enhancements, ultra-low system latency, and optimized drivers for professional content creation. It also supports <strong>DirectX 12 Ultimate</strong> and <strong>OpenGL 4.6</strong>, enabling advanced graphics features such as real-time ray tracing, variable rate shading, and enhanced rendering quality.</p><p>Designed with a distinctive <strong>white and pink color theme</strong>, the card features the signature <strong>iGame ULTRA</strong> styling, a <strong>hip-hop-inspired hollow backplate</strong>, and vibrant <strong>RGB lighting effects</strong> that enhance the appearance of modern gaming systems. Its advanced <strong>Ultra Cooling System</strong> utilizes dual ring-shaped fans with <strong>Auto Stop Technology</strong>, ensuring efficient heat dissipation while maintaining quiet operation during low workloads.</p><p>For display connectivity, the graphics card includes <strong>three DisplayPort 2.1b outputs</strong> and <strong>one HDMI 2.1b port</strong>, supporting up to <strong>four displays</strong> simultaneously, including high-refresh-rate and up to <strong>8K resolution</strong> monitors.</p><p>With a <strong>145W TDP</strong>, <strong>single 8-pin power connector</strong>, and a recommended <strong>550W power supply</strong>, the RTX 5060 Ultra W DUO OC provides excellent power efficiency while delivering next-generation gaming performance.</p><p>International Office Solution offers the <strong>Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 5060 Ultra W DUO OC 8GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> with genuine manufacturer warranty, competitive pricing, and reliable after-sales support throughout Bangladesh.</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Model</td><td>Product</td><td>Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 5060 Ultra W DUO OC 8GB-V</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</