(1070, 'Colorful GeForce RTX 5060 Gaming DUO 8GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The Colorful GeForce RTX 5060 Gaming DUO 8GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card delivers next-generation gaming and creative performance with 3840 CUDA cores, ultra-fast 8GB GDDR7 memory, NVIDIA DLSS 4, NVIDIA Reflex, and support for up to four displays. Its compact dual-slot design and efficient cooling make it an excellent choice for modern gaming PCs.', 'colorful-geforce-rtx-5060-gaming-duo-8gb-v-gddr7-graphics-card-1783665519', '<h2>Colorful GeForce RTX 5060 Gaming DUO 8GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card</h2><p>The <strong>Colorful GeForce RTX 5060 Gaming DUO 8GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> is designed to provide exceptional gaming performance, AI-powered graphics, and creative acceleration for enthusiasts and professionals alike. Built on NVIDIA\'s latest RTX architecture, it combines high-speed GDDR7 memory with advanced rendering technologies to deliver smooth gameplay and impressive visual quality.</p><p>Featuring <strong>3840 CUDA Cores</strong>, the graphics card operates at a <strong>2280MHz base clock</strong> with a <strong>2497MHz boost clock</strong>, providing the performance required for modern AAA gaming, streaming, video editing, and 3D content creation.</p><p>The <strong>8GB GDDR7 memory</strong> operates at an impressive <strong>28Gbps</strong> across a <strong>128-bit memory interface</strong>, delivering <strong>448GB/s memory bandwidth</strong> for rapid data transfer, faster texture loading, and smoother gameplay at high resolutions.</p><p>The RTX 5060 Gaming DUO supports the latest NVIDIA technologies, including <strong>NVIDIA DLSS 4</strong>, <strong>NVIDIA Reflex</strong>, and <strong>NVIDIA Studio</strong>, offering AI-powered performance improvements, reduced latency for competitive gaming, and optimized drivers for professional creative applications. It also supports <strong>DirectX 12 Ultimate</strong> and <strong>OpenGL 4.6</strong>, enabling advanced graphics features such as ray tracing, variable rate shading, and realistic lighting effects.</p><p>Designed with an efficient <strong>dual-fan cooling system</strong>, the graphics card maintains stable operating temperatures while keeping noise levels under control during intensive gaming sessions. Its compact <strong>dual-slot form factor</strong> makes it compatible with a wide range of desktop PC builds.</p><p>For connectivity, the graphics card includes <strong>three DisplayPort 2.1b outputs</strong> and <strong>one HDMI 2.1b port</strong>, allowing users to connect up to <strong>four displays</strong> simultaneously and enjoy ultra-high-resolution output, including <strong>8K displays</strong>.</p><p>With a <strong>145W power consumption</strong>, a <strong>single 8-pin power connector</strong>, and a recommended <strong>550W power supply</strong>, the RTX 5060 Gaming DUO provides an excellent balance of performance, efficiency, and reliability.</p><p>International Office Solution supplies the <strong>Colorful GeForce RTX 5060 Gaming DUO 8GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> with genuine manufacturer warranty, competitive pricing, and dependable customer support across Bangladesh.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Model</td><td>Product</td><td>Colorful GeForce RTX 5060 Gaming DUO 8GB-V</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Type</td><td>Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Processing</td><td>3840</td></tr><tr><td>Base Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>2280MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Boost Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>2497MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td><td>28Gbps</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Interface</td><td>Memory</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Bandwidth</td><td>Memory</td><td>448GB/s</td></tr><tr><td>NVIDIA Technologies</td><td>F