(1071, 'Colorful GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Gaming DUO 8GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The Colorful GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Gaming DUO 8GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card delivers exceptional gaming and creative performance with 4608 CUDA cores, 8GB GDDR7 memory, NVIDIA DLSS 4, NVIDIA Reflex, and DirectX 12 Ultimate support. Its efficient dual-fan cooling system and compact dual-slot design make it an excellent choice for modern gaming PCs.', 'colorful-geforce-rtx-5060-ti-gaming-duo-8gb-v-gddr7-graphics-card-1783665614', '<h2>Colorful GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Gaming DUO 8GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card</h2><p>The <strong>Colorful GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Gaming DUO 8GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> is a next-generation graphics solution powered by NVIDIA\'s advanced RTX architecture. Designed for gamers, streamers, content creators, and professionals, it combines cutting-edge AI technologies with ultra-fast GDDR7 memory to deliver smooth gameplay, accelerated creative workflows, and stunning visual quality.</p><p>Powered by <strong>4608 CUDA Cores</strong>, the graphics card operates at a <strong>2407MHz base clock</strong> and boosts up to <strong>2572MHz</strong>, providing outstanding performance for AAA gaming, live streaming, 3D rendering, and professional content creation.</p><p>The card features <strong>8GB of next-generation GDDR7 memory</strong> running at <strong>28Gbps</strong> over a <strong>128-bit memory interface</strong>, delivering an impressive <strong>448GB/s memory bandwidth</strong>. This high-speed memory architecture ensures fast texture loading, improved responsiveness, and seamless multitasking for demanding applications.</p><p>The RTX 5060 Ti Gaming DUO supports the latest NVIDIA technologies, including <strong>NVIDIA DLSS 4</strong>, <strong>NVIDIA Reflex</strong>, and <strong>NVIDIA Studio</strong>, enabling AI-powered frame generation, ultra-low gaming latency, and optimized performance for creative applications. It also supports <strong>DirectX 12 Ultimate</strong> and <strong>OpenGL 4.6</strong>, unlocking advanced graphics features such as real-time ray tracing, variable rate shading, and enhanced rendering quality.</p><p>The graphics card utilizes an efficient <strong>dual-fan cooling system</strong> to maintain optimal temperatures during extended gaming sessions while ensuring stable and reliable performance. Its stylish gaming-inspired design complements modern desktop builds without compromising cooling efficiency.</p><p>For display connectivity, the card includes <strong>three DisplayPort 2.1b outputs</strong> and <strong>one HDMI 2.1b port</strong>, supporting up to <strong>four displays</strong> simultaneously with high refresh rates and ultra-high-resolution output, including <strong>8K displays</strong>.</p><p>With a <strong>180W power consumption</strong>, a <strong>single 8-pin power connector</strong>, and a recommended <strong>600W power supply</strong>, the RTX 5060 Ti Gaming DUO offers an excellent balance of performance and efficiency for next-generation gaming systems.</p><p>International Office Solution offers the <strong>Colorful GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Gaming DUO 8GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> with genuine manufacturer warranty, competitive pricing, and dependable customer support throughout Bangladesh.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Model</td><td>Product</td><td>Colorful GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Gaming DUO 8GB-V</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 Ti</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Type</td><td>Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Processing</td><td>4608</td></tr><tr><td>Base Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>2407MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Boost Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>2572MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td><td>28Gbps</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Interface</td><td>Memory</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Bandwidth</td><td>Memory</td><td>448GB/s</td></tr><tr><td>NVIDIA Technologies</td><td>Features</td><td>NVIDIA DLSS 4, NVIDIA Reflex, NVIDIA Studio</td></tr><tr><td>DisplayPort</td><td>Display Output</td><td>3 × DisplayPort 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>Display Output</td><td>1 × HDMI 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td>Multi-Display Support</td><td>Display</td><td>Up to 4 Displays</td></tr><tr><td>Power Connector</td><td>Power</td><td>1 × 8-Pin</td></tr><tr><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Power</td><td>600W</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>Power</td><td>180W</td></tr><tr><td>DirectX Support</td><td>API</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>API</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling System</td><td>Cooling</td><td>Dual-Fan Cooling System</td></tr><tr><td>Dimensions</td><td>Physical</td><td>200 × 120 × 40 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Expansion Slot</td><td>Physical</td><td>Dual Slot (2-Slot Design)</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Manufacturer Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 58500.00, 58500.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/dVAE8mGjWttSJWsmd9qjQSrUMy6xb1SNGP60zzuJ.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 06:40:14', '2026-07-10 06:40:14', 'Colorful GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Gaming DUO 8GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card | International Office Solution Bangladesh', 'Buy the Colorful GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Gaming DUO 8GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card from International Office Solution Bangladesh. Featuring 4608 CUDA cores, 8GB GDDR7 memory, DLSS 4, NVIDIA Reflex, DirectX 12 Ultimate, and support for up to four displays.', 'Colorful RTX 5060 Ti Gaming DUO, RTX 5060 Ti 8GB Bangladesh, Colorful GeForce RTX 5060 Ti, NVIDIA RTX 5060 Ti Graphics Card, GDDR7 Graphics Card, Gaming GPU Bangladesh, DLSS 4 Graphics Card, RTX 5060 Ti Price Bangladesh, Colorful Graphics Card, International Office Solution', NULL, 140, NULL, NULL),
(1072, 'Xtrike Me GC-907 RGB Gaming Chair iosbd', 'The Xtrike Me GC-907 RGB Gaming Chair combines ergonomic comfort with modern RGB lighting. It features a 100mm gas lift, 180° reclining backrest, 3D adjustable armrests, RGB LED backlight, 350mm nylon base, PU & PVC leather upholstery, 360° swivel, detachable headrest, lumbar support cushion, and supports up to 150kg. Perfect for gaming, streaming, office work, and long sitting sessions.', 'xtrike-me-gc-907-rgb-gaming-chair-iosbd-1783665650', '<p>The Xtrike Me GC-907 RGB Gaming Chair is a premium ergonomic gaming chair designed for gamers, streamers, content creators, and professionals who demand maximum comfort and modern aesthetics. Featuring customizable RGB backlighting, an ergonomic racing-style design, and premium construction, the GC-907 enhances both your gaming setup and overall seating experience.</p><p>Built with a durable metal frame and upholstered in high-quality PU and PVC synthetic leather, the chair offers a luxurious feel while remaining easy to clean and resistant to everyday wear. Its sturdy 350mm nylon base provides excellent stability, while smooth-rolling caster wheels and 360° swivel rotation ensure effortless mobility around your gaming or workspace.</p><p>The chair features a 100mm gas lift system, allowing users to adjust the seat height smoothly between 43cm and 53cm for optimal desk compatibility and ergonomic positioning. Its spacious 57cm wide and 48cm deep seat offers excellent support, while the generously sized 58cm wide and 82cm high backrest promotes proper posture during extended gaming or work sessions.</p><p>One of the standout features of the Xtrike Me GC-907 RGB Gaming Chair is its vibrant RGB LED backlighting, adding a stylish and immersive atmosphere to your gaming room or streaming setup. The chair also includes 3D adjustable armrests, allowing users to customize arm support for improved wrist and shoulder comfort.</p><p>The advanced Butterfly tilt mechanism and 180° reclining backrest allow users to switch effortlessly between working, gaming, relaxing, or taking a quick break. A detachable headrest pillow and lumbar support cushion provide additional ergonomic support, helping reduce neck and lower back fatigue during long hours of sitting.</p><p>With a maximum load capacity of 150kg, the Xtrike Me GC-907 is built to accommodate a wide range of users while maintaining excellent durability and stability. Whether you\'re a competitive gamer, office professional, student, or content creator, the GC-907 RGB Gaming Chair delivers premium comfort, modern design, and reliable performance.</p><p>Buy Xtrike Me GC-907 RGB Gaming Chair from International Office Solution Purchase the original Xtrike Me GC-907 RGB Gaming Chair from International Office Solution, your trusted source for genuine gaming chairs, office furniture, and IT accessories in Bangladesh.</p><p>We offer authentic Xtrike Me gaming chairs at competitive prices with dependable customer service and nationwide delivery. Order online or contact International Office Solution to get the latest price, product availability, and delivery information.</p><p>Warranty: No Warranty</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>General</td><td>Brand</td><td>Xtrike Me</td></tr><tr><td>General</td><td>Model</td><td>GC-907 RGB</td></tr><tr><td>General</td><td>Product Type</td><td>RGB Gaming Chair</td></tr><tr><td>General</td><td>Color</td><td>Black (RGB Lighting)</td></tr><tr><td>Design</td><td>Style</td><td>Ergonomic Racing Style</td></tr><tr><td>Lighting</td><td>RGB</td><td>RGB LED Backlight</td></tr><tr><td>Material</td><td>Upholstery</td><td>Premium PU &amp; PVC Synthetic Leather</td></tr><tr><td>Material</td><td>Frame</td><td>Heavy-Duty Metal Frame</td></tr><tr><td>Material</td><td>Base</td><td>350mm Nylon Base</td></tr><tr><td>Material</td><td>Armrests</td><td>3D Adjustable Armrests</td></tr><tr><td>Comfort</td><td>Head Support</td><td>Detachable Headrest Pillow</td></tr><tr><td>Comfort</td><td>Lumbar Support</td><td>Detachable Lumbar Cushion</td></tr><tr><td>Adjustment</td><td>Gas Lift</td><td>100mm</td></tr><tr><td>Adjustment</td><td>Seat Height</td><td>43–53 cm</td></tr><tr><td>Adjustment</td><td>Reclining Angle</td><td>Up to 180°</td></tr><tr><td>Adjustment</td><td>Tilt Mechanism</td><td>Butterfly Mechanism</td></tr><tr><td>Mobility</td><td>Swivel</td><td>360° Rotation</td></tr><tr><td>Dimensions</td><td>Seat Size</td><td>57 × 48 cm</td></tr><tr><td>Dimensions</td><td>Backrest Size</td><td>58 × 82 cm</td></tr><tr><td>Load Capacity</td><td>Maximum Weight</td><td>Up to 150 kg</td></tr><tr><td>Usage</td><td>Recommended For</td><td>Gaming, Office, Home Office, Streaming, Study</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Chair', 23500.00, 23000.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/m1MaWFENw3PPVudymV1bdTDjwlTyZ9V1XzEbMCYy.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 06:40:50', '2026-07-10 06:41:06', 'Xtrike Me GC-907 RGB Gaming Chair Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the original Xtrike Me GC-907 RGB Gaming Chair in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features RGB lighting, ergonomic design, 180° recline, 3D armrests, PU leather, adjustable height, and 150kg capacity.', 'Xtrike Me GC-907 RGB Gaming Chair,\r\nXtrike Me GC-907,\r\nXtrike Me RGB Gaming Chair,\r\nGaming Chair RGB,\r\nRGB Gaming Chair Bangladesh,\r\nGaming Chair Price in Bangladesh,\r\nGaming Chair BD,\r\nRGB Gaming Chair Price,\r\nGaming Chair with RGB Lights,\r\nGaming Chair with LED Lights,\r\nErgonomic Gaming Chair,\r\nGaming Chair with 3D Armrest,\r\nGaming Chair with Lumbar Support,\r\nGaming Chair with Headrest,\r\nGaming Chair for PC,\r\nGaming Chair for Office,\r\nGaming Chair Online Bangladesh,\r\nGaming Chair Dhaka,\r\nGaming Chair Chattogram,\r\n180 Degree Reclining Gaming Chair,\r\nGaming Chair with Gas Lift,\r\nGaming Chair 150kg,\r\nProfessional Gaming Chair,\r\nPU Leather Gaming Chair,\r\nOffice Gaming Chair,\r\nComputer Gaming Chair,\r\nGaming Furniture Bangladesh,\r\nOffice Chair Bangladesh,\r\nOriginal Xtrike Me Chair,\r\nInternational Office Solution', NULL, 225, NULL, NULL),
(1073, 'Colorful GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Battle AX DUO 8GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The Colorful GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Battle AX DUO 8GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card is a premium gaming GPU designed for high-performance gaming and creative workloads. Equipped with 4608 CUDA cores, 8GB GDDR7 memory, NVIDIA DLSS 4, NVIDIA Reflex, RGB lighting, and the advanced Axe Cooling System, it delivers outstanding speed, efficiency, and stunning visuals.', 'colorful-geforce-rtx-5060-ti-battle-ax-duo-8gb-v-gddr7-graphics-card-1783665717', '<h2>Colorful GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Battle AX DUO 8GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card</h2><p>The <strong>Colorful GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Battle AX DUO 8GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> is engineered for gamers, streamers, and content creators seeking next-generation graphics performance with an eye-catching design. Powered by NVIDIA\'s latest RTX architecture, this graphics card combines ultra-fast GDDR7 memory, AI-powered technologies, and advanced cooling to provide exceptional gaming and creative performance.</p><p>Featuring <strong>4608 CUDA Cores</strong>, the GPU operates at a <strong>2407MHz base clock</strong> and boosts up to <strong>2572MHz</strong>, delivering smooth gameplay, accelerated rendering, and responsive performance for modern AAA games and demanding professional applications.</p><p>The card includes <strong>8GB of GDDR7 memory</strong> operating at <strong>28Gbps</strong> across a <strong>128-bit memory interface</strong>, providing an impressive <strong>448GB/s memory bandwidth</strong>. This enables rapid data transfer, faster texture loading, and seamless multitasking at high resolutions.</p><p>Supporting <strong>NVIDIA DLSS 4</strong>, <strong>NVIDIA Reflex</strong>, and <strong>NVIDIA Studio</strong>, the RTX 5060 Ti Battle AX DUO enhances gaming performance with AI-powered frame generation, reduces input latency for competitive gaming, and delivers optimized performance for creative applications. It also supports <strong>DirectX 12 Ultimate</strong> and <strong>OpenGL 4.6</strong>, enabling advanced graphics technologies such as real-time ray tracing and enhanced rendering quality.</p><p>Designed with a bold <strong>red and black color scheme</strong>, the graphics card features a <strong>metallic hollow backplate</strong>, stylish <strong>RGB side lighting</strong>, and the advanced <strong>Axe Cooling System</strong> with <strong>ring-shaped dual fans</strong>. <strong>Auto Stop Technology</strong> automatically halts the fans during low workloads, reducing noise while maintaining efficient cooling under heavy loads.</p><p>For display connectivity, the card offers <strong>three DisplayPort 2.1b outputs</strong> and <strong>one HDMI 2.1b port</strong>, supporting up to <strong>four displays</strong> simultaneously with resolutions up to <strong>7680 × 4320 (8K)</strong>, making it ideal for gaming, streaming, and professional multi-monitor setups.</p><p>With a <strong>180W TDP</strong>, <strong>single 8-pin power connector</strong>, and a recommended <strong>600W power supply</strong>, the RTX 5060 Ti Battle AX DUO provides reliable power efficiency and stable operation for modern desktop systems.</p><p>International Office Solution supplies the <strong>Colorful GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Battle AX DUO 8GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> with genuine manufacturer warranty, competitive pricing, and dependable customer support throughout Bangladesh.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Model</td><td>Product</td><td>Colorful GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Battle AX DUO 8GB-V</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 Ti</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Type</td><td>Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum Resolution</td><td>Display</td><td>7680 × 4320</td></tr><tr><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Processing</td><td>4608</td></tr><tr><td>Base Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>2407MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Boost Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>2572MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td><td>28Gbps</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Interface</td><td>Memory</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Bandwidth</td><td>Memory</td><td>448GB/s</td></tr><tr><td>NVIDIA Technologies</td><td>Features</td><td>NVIDIA DLSS 4, NVIDIA Reflex, NVIDIA Studio</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling System</td><td>Cooling</td><td>Axe Cooling System with Ring-Shaped Fans</td></tr><tr><td>Auto Stop Technology</td><td>Cooling</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>RGB Lighting</td><td>Design</td><td>RGB Side Lighting</td></tr><tr><td>Backplate</td><td>Design</td><td>Metallic Hollow Backplate</td></tr><tr><td>Design Theme</td><td>Design</td><td>Red &amp; Black Gaming Design</td></tr><tr><td>DisplayPort</td><td>Display Output</td><td>3 × DisplayPort 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>Display Output</td><td>1 × HDMI 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td>Multi-Display Support</td><td>Display</td><td>Up to 4 Displays</td></tr><tr><td>Power Connector</td><td>Power</td><td>1 × 8-Pin</td></tr><tr><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Power</td><td>600W</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>Power</td><td>180W</td></tr><tr><td>DirectX Support</td><td>API</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>API</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td>Dimensions</td><td>Physical</td><td>231 × 120 × 48.9 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Expansion Slot</td><td>Physical</td><td>Dual Slot (2-Slot Design)</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Manufacturer Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/6TUYsYetro2MBmDNNQciuSPbXXHTBhz20EUGyw4F.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 06:41:57', '2026-07-10 06:41:57', 'Buy the Colorful GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Battle AX DUO 8GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card from International Office Solution Bangladesh. Featuring 4608 CUDA cores, 8GB GDDR7 memory, DLSS 4, NVIDIA Reflex, RGB lighting, Axe Cooling System, and support for up to four displays.', 'Buy the Colorful GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Battle AX DUO 8GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card from International Office Solution Bangladesh. Featuring 4608 CUDA cores, 8GB GDDR7 memory, DLSS 4, NVIDIA Reflex, RGB lighting, Axe Cooling System, and support for up to four displays.', 'Colorful RTX 5060 Ti Battle AX DUO, RTX 5060 Ti 8GB Bangladesh, Colorful GeForce RTX 5060 Ti, NVIDIA RTX 5060 Ti Graphics Card, GDDR7 Graphics Card, Gaming Graphics Card Bangladesh, DLSS 4 GPU, RTX 5060 Ti Price Bangladesh, Colorful Battle AX DUO, International Office Solution', NULL, 140, NULL, NULL);
