(1074, 'Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Ultra W DUO OC 8GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Ultra W DUO OC 8GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card delivers outstanding gaming and creative performance with 4608 CUDA cores, 8GB GDDR7 memory, One-Key OC technology, NVIDIA DLSS 4, NVIDIA Reflex, NVIDIA Studio support, and advanced dual-fan cooling in a premium RGB design.', 'colorful-igame-geforce-rtx-5060-ti-ultra-w-duo-oc-8gb-v-gddr7-graphics-card-1783665934', '<h2>Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Ultra W DUO OC 8GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card</h2><p>The <strong>Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Ultra W DUO OC 8GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> is engineered for gamers, streamers, and content creators who demand premium performance, stylish aesthetics, and advanced cooling. Built on NVIDIA\'s latest RTX architecture, this graphics card combines cutting-edge AI technologies, ultra-fast GDDR7 memory, and factory overclocking to deliver exceptional gaming and creative performance.</p><p>Powered by <strong>4608 CUDA Cores</strong>, the GPU operates at a <strong>2407MHz base clock</strong> and <strong>2572MHz boost clock</strong>. The integrated <strong>One-Key OC</strong> feature instantly increases the boost clock up to <strong>2632MHz</strong>, allowing users to unlock additional performance for demanding games and professional applications with a single press.</p><p>The graphics card features <strong>8GB of next-generation GDDR7 memory</strong> operating at <strong>28Gbps</strong> over a <strong>128-bit memory interface</strong>, providing an impressive <strong>448GB/s memory bandwidth</strong>. This enables ultra-fast data transfer, smooth gameplay, faster rendering, and efficient multitasking across gaming and creative workloads.</p><p>Supporting <strong>NVIDIA DLSS 4</strong>, <strong>NVIDIA Reflex</strong>, and <strong>NVIDIA Studio</strong>, the RTX 5060 Ti Ultra W DUO OC utilizes AI-powered rendering to improve frame rates, reduce input latency, and optimize creative workflows. It also supports <strong>DirectX 12 Ultimate</strong> and <strong>OpenGL 4.6</strong>, enabling advanced graphics technologies including real-time ray tracing, variable rate shading, and realistic lighting effects.</p><p>The premium <strong>Ultra Cooling System</strong> features <strong>dual ring-shaped fans</strong> that efficiently dissipate heat while <strong>Auto Stop Technology</strong> automatically stops the fans during low workloads for quieter operation. The signature <strong>white and pink iGame ULTRA design</strong>, <strong>hip-hop-inspired hollow backplate</strong>, and vibrant <strong>RGB lighting effects</strong> create a distinctive appearance that stands out in modern gaming builds.</p><p>Connectivity includes <strong>three DisplayPort 2.1b outputs</strong> and <strong>one HDMI 2.1b port</strong>, supporting up to <strong>four displays</strong> simultaneously with resolutions up to <strong>7680 × 4320 (8K)</strong> and high refresh rates for immersive gaming and professional productivity.</p><p>With a <strong>180W TDP</strong>, <strong>single 8-pin power connector</strong>, and a recommended <strong>600W power supply</strong>, the RTX 5060 Ti Ultra W DUO OC delivers reliable power efficiency and stable operation under heavy workloads.</p><p>International Office Solution offers the <strong>Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Ultra W DUO OC 8GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> with genuine manufacturer warranty, competitive pricing, and dependable customer support across Bangladesh.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Model</td><td>Product</td><td>Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Ultra W DUO OC 8GB-V</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 Ti</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Type</td><td>Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td>CUDA Cores</td