(1075, 'Colorful GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Gaming DUO 16GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The Colorful GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Gaming DUO 16GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card delivers exceptional gaming and creative performance with 4608 CUDA cores, 16GB GDDR7 memory, NVIDIA DLSS 4, NVIDIA Reflex, and advanced dual-fan cooling. Designed for modern gaming, AI workloads, and professional content creation.The Colorful GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Gaming DUO 16GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card delivers exceptional gaming and creative performance with 4608 CUDA cores, 16GB GDDR7 memory, NVIDIA DLSS 4, NVIDIA Reflex, and advanced dual-fan cooling. Designed for modern gaming, AI workloads, and professional content creation.', 'colorful-geforce-rtx-5060-ti-gaming-duo-16gb-v-gddr7-graphics-card-1783666037', '<h2>Colorful GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Gaming DUO 16GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card</h2><p>The <strong>Colorful GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Gaming DUO 16GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> is a next-generation graphics solution built for gamers, content creators, AI developers, and professionals who require exceptional graphics performance and large memory capacity. Powered by NVIDIA\'s latest RTX architecture, this graphics card combines cutting-edge AI technologies with <strong>16GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory</strong> to deliver smooth gameplay, accelerated creative workflows, and outstanding multitasking capabilities.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>4608 CUDA Cores</strong>, the GPU operates at a <strong>2407MHz base clock</strong> and boosts up to <strong>2572MHz</strong>, providing excellent performance for AAA gaming, live streaming, 3D rendering, video editing, AI acceleration, and other demanding workloads.</p><p>The graphics card features <strong>16GB of GDDR7 memory</strong> running at <strong>28Gbps</strong> across a <strong>128-bit memory interface</strong>, delivering an impressive <strong>448GB/s memory bandwidth</strong>. The larger VRAM capacity makes it ideal for high-resolution gaming, complex 3D projects, AI applications, and professional content creation.</p><p>Supporting <strong>NVIDIA DLSS 4</strong>, <strong>NVIDIA Reflex</strong>, and <strong>NVIDIA Studio</strong>, the RTX 5060 Ti Gaming DUO enhances gaming performance through AI-powered frame generation, reduces system latency for competitive gaming, and delivers optimized drivers for professional creative software. It also supports <strong>DirectX 12 Ultimate</strong> and <strong>OpenGL 4.6</strong>, enabling advanced graphics technologies such as real-time ray tracing, mesh shaders, and variable rate shading.</p><p>The card is equipped with an efficient <strong>dual-fan cooling system</strong> that provides reliable thermal performance while maintaining quiet operation during intensive workloads. Its compact dual-slot design makes it compatible with a wide variety of desktop PC builds.</p><p>For display connectivity, the graphics card includes <strong>three DisplayPort 2.1b outputs</strong> and <strong>one HDMI 2.1b port</strong>, allowing connection of up to <strong>four displays</strong> simultaneously with support for ultra-high resolutions and high refresh rates, including <strong>8K displays</strong>.</p><p>Operating with a <strong>180W power consumption</strong>, the RTX 5060 Ti Gaming DUO requires a <strong>single 8-pin PCIe power connector</strong> and a recommended <strong>600W power supply</strong>, delivering excellent efficiency and stable performance for modern gaming systems.</p><p>International Office Solution offers the <strong>Colorful GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Gaming DUO 16GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> with genuine manufacturer warranty, competitive pricing, and reliable customer support throughout Bangladesh.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Model</td><td>Product</td><td>Colorful GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Gaming DUO 16GB-V</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 Ti</td></tr><t