(1076, 'Phantom Edge Vortex CH25BB Gaming Chair iosbd', 'The Phantom Edge Vortex CH25BB Gaming Chair is a premium ergonomic gaming chair featuring top-grade PU leather, 3D adjustable armrests, tilt lock with tension adjustment, lumbar support cushion, headrest pillow, 360° swivel, and a sturdy frame supporting up to 140kg. Perfect for gaming, office work, streaming, and long hours of comfortable seating.', 'phantom-edge-vortex-ch25bb-gaming-chair-iosbd-1783666049', '<p>The Phantom Edge Vortex CH25BB Gaming Chair is a premium ergonomic gaming chair built for gamers, professionals, streamers, and remote workers who demand superior comfort, durability, and modern style. Designed with a sleek racing-inspired appearance, this gaming chair combines high-quality materials with advanced ergonomic features to provide exceptional support during extended gaming sessions, office work, or study hours.</p><p>Crafted with top-grade PU leather, the Phantom Edge Vortex CH25BB offers a luxurious look and feel while remaining resistant to daily wear and easy to maintain. The durable upholstery ensures long-lasting performance, making it an excellent choice for both home and professional workspaces.</p><p>Its ergonomic design includes a detachable lumbar support cushion and a comfortable headrest pillow, helping maintain proper posture and reducing pressure on the neck, shoulders, and lower back during long periods of sitting. Whether you\'re gaming, attending virtual meetings, or working on important projects, the chair is designed to minimize fatigue and maximize comfort.</p><p>The 3D adjustable armrests allow users to customize the height, depth, and angle of the armrests, providing optimal wrist and elbow support while gaming, typing, or relaxing. The advanced tilt mechanism includes both a tilt lock and tension adjustment, allowing you to recline smoothly and lock the chair at your preferred angle for personalized comfort.</p><p>Built with a heavy-duty frame and strong base, the P