(1077, 'Colorful GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Gaming 16GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The Colorful GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Gaming 16GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card is built for demanding gamers and creators, offering 16GB GDDR7 memory, 4606 CUDA cores, NVIDIA DLSS 4, NVIDIA Reflex, RGB lighting, and advanced cooling for smooth gaming and professional workloads.', 'colorful-geforce-rtx-5060-ti-gaming-16gb-v-gddr7-graphics-card-1783666215', '<h2>Colorful GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Gaming 16GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card</h2><p>The <strong>Colorful GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Gaming 16GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> delivers next-generation graphics performance for gaming, streaming, AI applications, and professional content creation. Built on NVIDIA\'s latest RTX architecture, this powerful graphics card combines ultra-fast GDDR7 memory, advanced AI technologies, and an efficient cooling system to handle today\'s most demanding workloads.</p><p>Powered by <strong>4606 CUDA cores</strong>, the GPU operates at a <strong>2407MHz base clock</strong> and <strong>2572MHz boost clock</strong>, delivering exceptional processing power for modern AAA games, 3D rendering, video editing, and creative applications.</p><p>Featuring <strong>16GB of high-speed GDDR7 memory</strong> running at <strong>28Gbps</strong> across a <strong>128-bit memory interface</strong>, the graphics card provides an impressive <strong>448GB/s memory bandwidth</strong>, enabling faster texture loading, smooth multitasking, and excellent performance at high resolutions.</p><p>The RTX 5060 Ti Gaming supports <strong>NVIDIA DLSS 4</strong>, <strong>NVIDIA Reflex</strong>, and <strong>NVIDIA Studio</strong>, utilizing AI-powered technologies to improve frame rates, reduce input latency, and accelerate creative workflows. It also supports <strong>DirectX 12 Ultimate</strong> and <strong>OpenGL 4.6</strong>, delivering advanced graphics features including real-time ray tracing, mesh shaders, and variable rate shading.</p><p>Designed with gamers in min