(1079, 'Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 5070 Ultra W OC 12GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 5070 Ultra W OC 12GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card is a premium gaming GPU featuring 6144 CUDA cores, 12GB GDDR7 memory, One-Key OC, NVIDIA DLSS 4, NVIDIA Reflex, NVIDIA Studio, and an advanced triple-fan cooling system for exceptional gaming and creative performance.', 'colorful-igame-geforce-rtx-5070-ultra-w-oc-12gb-v-gddr7-graphics-card-1783666309', '<h2>Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 5070 Ultra W OC 12GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card</h2><p>The <strong>Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 5070 Ultra W OC 12GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> is built for enthusiasts, competitive gamers, AI developers, and creative professionals who demand exceptional graphics performance and cutting-edge technology. Powered by NVIDIA\'s latest RTX architecture, this graphics card delivers outstanding gaming experiences, accelerated AI processing, and professional-grade content creation capabilities.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>6144 CUDA Cores</strong>, the RTX 5070 provides powerful parallel processing for modern AAA games, 3D rendering, video editing, live streaming, and AI-powered applications. The GPU operates at a <strong>2325MHz base clock</strong> and <strong>2512MHz boost clock</strong>, while the integrated <strong>One-Key OC</strong> feature increases the boost frequency to <strong>2557MHz</strong> for additional performance with a single press.</p><p>The graphics card comes with <strong>12GB of next-generation GDDR7 memory</strong> running at an ultra-fast <strong>28Gbps</strong> over a <strong>192-bit memory interface</strong>, delivering an impressive <strong>672GB/s memory bandwidth</strong>. This enables smooth gameplay, faster rendering, and efficient multitasking even when working with high-resolution textures, large creative projects, and AI workloads.</p><p>Supporting <strong>NVIDIA DLSS 4</strong>, <strong>NVIDIA Reflex</strong>, and <strong>NVIDIA Studio</strong>, the RTX 5070 Ultra W OC utilizes AI-powered rendering to increase frame rates, reduce gaming latency, and optimize professional creative software. It also supports <strong>DirectX 12 Ultimate</strong> and <strong>OpenGL 4.6</strong>, unlocking advanced graphics technologies including real-time ray tracing, mesh shaders, and realistic lighting effects.</p><p>The graphics card features an advanced <strong>triple-fan cooling system</strong> with <strong>Auto Stop Technology</strong>, allowing the fans to stop during light workloads for quieter operation while providing excellent thermal performance during demanding gaming sessions. Its signature <strong>iGame Ultra</strong> styling enhances the appearance of high-end gaming PCs.</p><p>For display connectivity, the RTX 5070 Ultra W OC includes <strong>three DisplayPort 2.1b outputs</strong> and <strong>one HDMI 2.1b port</strong>, supporting up to <strong>four displays</strong> with resolutions up to <strong>7680 × 4320 (8K)</strong> and high refresh rates for immersive gaming and professional productivity.</p><p>Powered through a <strong>16-pin PCIe power connector</strong>, the graphics card is designed for stable operation with a recommended <strong>650W power supply</strong>, making it an excellent choice for high-performance desktop systems.</p><p>International Office Solution offers the <strong>Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 5070 Ultra W OC 12GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> with genuine manufacturer warranty, competitive pricing, and dependable customer support across Bangladesh.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Model</td><td>Product</td><td>Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 5070 Ultra W OC 12GB-V</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory</td><td>12GB</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Type</td><td>Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Processing</td><td>6144</td></tr><tr><td>Base Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>2325MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Boost Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>2512MHz</td></tr><tr><td>One-Key OC Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>Base 2325MHz / Boost 2557MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum Resolution</td><td>Display</td><td>7680 × 4320</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td><td>28Gbps</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Interface</td><td>Memory</td><td>192-bit</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Bandwidth</td><td>Memory</td><td>672GB/s</td></tr><tr><td>NVIDIA Technologies</td><td>Features</td><td>NVIDIA DLSS 4, NVIDIA Reflex, NVIDIA Studio</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling System</td><td>Cooling</td><td>Triple-Fan Cooling System with Auto Stop Technology</td></tr><tr><td>DisplayPort</td><td>Display Output</td><td>3 × DisplayPort 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>Display Output</td><td>1 × HDMI 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td>Multi-Display Support</td><td>Display</td><td>Up to 4 Displays</td></tr><tr><td>Power Connector</td><td>Power</td><td>1 × 16-Pin</td></tr><tr><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Power</td><td>650W</td></tr><tr><td>DirectX Support</td><td>API</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>API</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td>Dimensions</td><td>Physical</td><td>300.5 × 120 × 50 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Manufacturer Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 104900.00, 104900.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/X8vcYJMcx0iXJA4Rv7JXoP9db9sYwqAGJZggoP0l.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 06:51:49', '2026-07-10 06:53:23', 'Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 5070 Ultra W OC 12GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card | International Office Solution Bangladesh', 'Buy the Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 5070 Ultra W OC 12GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card from International Office Solution Bangladesh. Featuring 6144 CUDA cores, 12GB GDDR7 memory, One-Key OC, DLSS 4, NVIDIA Reflex, NVIDIA Studio, and triple-fan cooling.', 'Colorful iGame RTX 5070 Ultra W OC, RTX 5070 12GB GDDR7 Banglad