(1080, 'Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 5080 Neptune OC 16GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The Colorful GeForce GT710-2GD3-V 2GB Graphics Card is a reliable entry-level graphics solution designed for office work, multimedia playback, and everyday computing. Equipped with 2GB GDDR3 memory, 192 CUDA cores, HDMI, DVI, and VGA outputs, it supports up to three displays simultaneously while delivering improved graphics performance over integrated graphics.', 'colorful-igame-geforce-rtx-5080-neptune-oc-16gb-v-gddr7-graphics-card-1783666559', '<h2>Colorful GeForce GT710-2GD3-V 2GB GDDR3 Graphics Card</h2><p>The <strong>Colorful GeForce GT710-2GD3-V 2GB GDDR3 Graphics Card</strong> is an affordable and dependable graphics solution for users who need enhanced display performance for office applications, multimedia entertainment, web browsing, and light creative workloads. Built with NVIDIA\'s GT710 GPU, it provides smoother graphics performance than integrated graphics while maintaining low power consumption.</p><p>Featuring <strong>2GB of GDDR3 memory</strong>, a <strong>954MHz core clock</strong>, <strong>192 CUDA cores</strong>, and a <strong>64-bit memory interface</strong>, this graphics card delivers reliable performance for daily computing tasks. Its efficient cooling system with a large fan ensures stable operation and effective heat dissipation during extended use.</p><p>The card supports <strong>HDMI, DVI, and VGA outputs</strong>, allowing users to connect up to <strong>three displays simultaneously</strong>, making it an excellent choice for office productivity, digital signage, and multitasking environments.</p><p>Supporting <strong>DirectX 12</strong> and <strong>OpenGL 4.4</strong>, the GT710 is compatible with a wide range of Windows applications and multimedia software. With an ultra-low <strong>19W power consumption</strong>, it requires only a <strong>300W recommended power supply</strong>, making it suitable for upgrading older desktop PCs without replacing the PSU.