eatures 192 CUDA cores, HDMI, DVI, VGA support, DirectX 12, OpenGL 4.4, and multi-display capability.', 'Colorful GT710 2GB, Colorful GeForce GT710 Bangladesh, GT710 Graphics Card Price Bangladesh, NVIDIA GT710 2GB GDDR3, Colorful Graphics Card, Budget Graphics Card, HDMI Graphics Card, Office Graphics Card, Multi Display GPU, International Office Solution, Graphics Card Bangladesh', NULL, 140, NULL, NULL),
(1081, 'Phantom Edge Vortex CH25BG Gaming Chair iosbd', 'The Phantom Edge Vortex CH25BG Gaming Chair features premium PU leather upholstery, 3D adjustable armrests, tilt lock with tension adjustment, lumbar support cushion, headrest pillow, 360° swivel, and a heavy-duty frame supporting up to 140kg. Its ergonomic Black and Grey design makes it ideal for gaming, office work, streaming, and extended sitting sessions.', 'phantom-edge-vortex-ch25bg-gaming-chair-iosbd-1783666616', '<p>The Phantom Edge Vortex CH25BG Gaming Chair is a premium ergonomic gaming chair designed for gamers, streamers, remote workers, and professionals who spend long hours at their desks. Combining modern aesthetics with ergonomic comfort, this chair offers excellent support, durability, and adjustability for gaming, office work, studying, and content creation.</p><p>Crafted with high-quality PU leather upholstery, the Phantom Edge Vortex CH25BG features a stylish Black and Grey finish that complements modern gaming setups, home offices, and professional workspaces. The premium upholstery is soft, durable, wear-resistant, and easy to clean, ensuring long-lasting performance and a sophisticated appearance.</p><p>The ergonomic design includes a detachable lumbar support cushion and a headrest pillow, providing excellent support for the lower back and neck. These features help promote proper posture, reduce muscle fatigue, and improve overall comfort during extended gaming sessions or long working hours.</p><p>Equipped with an advanced tilt mechanism featuring a tilt lock and tension adjustment, the chair allows users to recline smoothly and securely lock the backrest at their preferred angle. Whether you\'re focused on work, immersed in gaming, or relaxing between sessions, the adjustable reclining function provides personalized comfort and stability.</p><p>The 3D adjustable armrests can be customized for height, depth, and angle, offering optimal support for the wrists, elbows, and shoulders. Thi