(1082, 'Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 5080 Advanced OC 16GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 5080 Advanced OC 16GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card is an ultra-high-performance graphics card built for 4K/8K gaming, AI computing, and professional content creation. Featuring 10752 CUDA cores, 16GB GDDR7 memory, One-Key OC, DLSS 4, and an advanced Vortex Cooling System, it delivers exceptional speed and reliability.', 'colorful-igame-geforce-rtx-5080-advanced-oc-16gb-v-gddr7-graphics-card-1783666659', '<h2>Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 5080 Advanced OC 16GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card</h2><p>The <strong>Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 5080 Advanced OC 16GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> is designed for enthusiasts, professional creators, and competitive gamers seeking flagship-level graphics performance. Powered by NVIDIA\'s latest RTX architecture, it combines cutting-edge AI technologies, factory overclocking, premium cooling, and advanced engineering to deliver exceptional performance for gaming, rendering, AI development, and creative workloads.</p><p>Featuring <strong>10752 CUDA Cores</strong>, the graphics card delivers outstanding parallel processing power for demanding applications. It operates at a <strong>2295MHz base clock</strong> with a <strong>2617MHz boost clock</strong>, while the integrated <strong>One-Key OC</strong> feature increases the boost frequency to <strong>2670MHz</strong>, providing instant performance gains for intensive gaming and productivity tasks.</p><p>The GPU is equipped with <strong>16GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory</strong> running at <strong>30Gbps</strong> across a <strong>256-bit memory interface</strong>, delivering an incredible <strong>960GB/s memory bandwidth</strong>. This high-speed memory subsystem ensures smooth gameplay, rapid rendering, AI acceleration, and effortless multitasking with large creative projects and high-resolution assets.</p><p>Supporting <strong>NVIDIA DLSS 4</strong>, <strong>NVIDIA Reflex</strong>, and <strong>NVIDIA Studio</strong>, the RTX 5080 Advanced OC uses AI-powered technologies to maximize frame rates, reduce latency, and accelerate professional creative workflows. It also supports <strong>DirectX 12 Ultimate</strong> and <strong>OpenGL 4.6</strong>, enabling advanced rendering technologies including real-time ray tracing, mesh shaders, and realistic lighting effects.</p><p>The graphics card features an advanced <strong>Vortex Cooling System</strong> with <strong>Scythe Axial Fans</strong>, an <strong>alloy die-casting frame</strong>, and a <strong>hollow backplate</strong> for superior heat dissipation and structural durability. Its <strong>creative black translucent design</strong>, <strong>visible internal fan frame</strong>, and <strong>Starlight RGB lighting effects</strong> create a premium aesthetic that complements high-end gaming systems.</p><p>Connectivity includes <strong>three DisplayPort 2.1b outputs</strong> and <strong>two HDMI 2.1b ports</strong>, providing flexible multi-display support with resolutions up to <strong>7680 × 4320 (8K)</strong> and ultra-high refresh rates for gaming, streaming, and professional workflows.</p><p>With a <strong>390W TDP</strong>, <strong>16-pin PCIe power connector</strong>, and a recommended <strong>850W power supply</strong>, the RTX 5080 Advanced OC is engineered to deliver stable performance under the most demanding workloads.</p><p>International Office Solution offers the <strong>Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 5080 Advanced OC 16GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> with genuine manufacturer warranty, competitive pricing, and reliable customer support throughout Bangladesh.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Model</td><td>Product</td><td>Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 5080 Advanced OC 16GB-V</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5080</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Type</td><td>Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Processing</td><td>10752</td></tr><tr><td>Base Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>2295MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Boost Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>2617MHz</td></tr><tr><td>One-Key OC Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>Base 2295MHz / Boost 2670MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum Resolution</td><td>Display</td><td>7680 × 4320</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td><td>30Gbps</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Interface</td><td>Memory</td><td>256-bit</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Bandwidth</td><td>Memory</td><td>960GB/s</td></tr><tr><td>NVIDIA Technologies</td><td>Features</td><td>NVIDIA DLSS 4, NVIDIA Reflex, NVIDIA Studio</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling System</td><td>Cooling</td><td>Advanced Vortex Cooling System with Scythe Axial Fans</td></tr><tr><td>Design</td><td>Build</td><td>Creative Black Translucent Design</td></tr><tr><td>RGB Lighting</td><td>Lighting</td><td>Starlight RGB Lighting Effects</td></tr><tr><td>Backplate</td><td>Build</td><td>Hollowed Metal Backplate</td></tr><tr><td>Frame</td><td>Build</td><td>Alloy Die-Casting Frame</td></tr><tr><td>DisplayPort</td><td>Display Output</td><td>3 × DisplayPort 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>Display Output</td><td>2 × HDMI 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td>Multi-Display Support</td><td>Display</td><td>Up to 4 Displays</td></tr><tr><td>Power Connector</td><td>Power</td><td>1 × 16-Pin</td></tr><tr><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Power</td><td>850W</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>Power</td><td>390W</td></tr><tr><td>DirectX Support</td><td>API</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>API</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td>Dimensions</td><td>Physical</td><td>355 × 144.7 × 68.8 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Manufacturer Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/IuYzcQdoAOwm3FNoX2ZoUwat2DSuvbzeigqmscIq.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 06:57:39', '2026-07-10 06:57:39', 'Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 5080 Advanced OC 16GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card | International Office Solution Bangladesh', 'Buy the Colorful iGame GeForce RTX 5080 Advanced OC 16GB-V GDDR7 Graphics Card from International Office Solution Bangladesh. Featuring 10752 CUDA cores, 16GB GDDR7 memory, One-Key OC, DLSS 4, NVIDIA Reflex, RGB lighting, and advanced Vortex Cooling System.', 'Colorful RTX 5080 Advanced OC, RTX 5080 16GB GDDR7 Bangladesh, Colorful iGame RTX 5080, NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5080 Graphics Card, RTX 5080 Price Bangladesh, DLSS 4 Graphics Card, Gaming GPU Bangladesh, GDDR7 Graphics Card, Colorful iGame Graphics Card, International Office Solution', NULL, 140, NULL, NULL),
(1083, 'Colorful GeForce GT1030 V3 2GB Graphics Card', 'The Colorful GeForce GT1030 2GB V3 Graphics Card is an affordable graphics solution for home, office, multimedia, and entry-level gaming PCs. Featuring 384 CUDA cores, 2GB GDDR5 memory, DirectX 12 support, and low 30W power consumption, it offers smooth everyday graphics performance without requiring external power.', 'colorful-geforce-gt1030-v3-2gb-graphics-card-1783666757', '<h2>Colorful GeForce GT1030 2GB V3 GDDR5 Graphics Card</h2><p>The <strong>Colorful GeForce GT1030 2GB V3 Graphics Card</strong> is an excellent entry-level GPU designed to enhance desktop performance for everyday computing, multimedia entertainment, light gaming, and office productivity. Powered by NVIDIA\'s GeForce GT 1030 GPU, it offers reliable graphics acceleration while maintaining exceptional power efficiency.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>384 CUDA cores</strong>, the GT1030 delivers improved graphics processing for HD video playback, photo editing, office applications, and casual gaming. The GPU operates at a <strong>1227MHz base clock</strong> and boosts up to <strong>1468MHz</strong>, ensuring smooth and responsive performance across a variety of everyday tasks.</p><p>The graphics card features <strong>2GB of GDDR5 memory</strong> connected through a <strong>64-bit memory interface</strong>, delivering faster graphics performance compared to integrated graphics solutions. Its high-speed memory helps improve application responsiveness and provides a better experience for multimedia playback and entry-level gaming.</p><p>Designed for energy efficiency, the Colorful GT1030 consumes only <strong>30W of power</strong>, eliminating the need for additional PCIe power connectors. A <strong>300W power supply</strong> is sufficient, making it an excellent upgrade for compact desktops and office computers.</p><p>The graphics card utilizes a durable <strong>all-solid-state capacitor design</strong>, providing enhanced stability and long-term reliability. Its custom cooling system features a large <strong>90mm cooling fan</strong>, aluminum heatsink, and stylish black-and-red shroud, delivering efficient cooling while maintaining quiet operation.</p><p>Supporting <strong>DirectX 12</strong> and <strong>OpenGL 4.5</strong>, the GT1030 ensures compatibility with modern operating systems, multimedia applications, and a wide range of PC games. The <strong>HDMI output</strong> supports high-definition displays, making it ideal for home entertainment, digital signage, and office environments.</p><p>International Office Solution offers the <strong>Colorful GeForce GT1030 2GB V3 Graphics Card</strong> with genuine manufacturer warranty, competitive pricing, and dependable customer support throughout Bangladesh.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Model</td><td>Product</td><td>Colorful GeForce GT1030 2GB V3</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce GT 1030</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory</td><td>2GB</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Type</td><td>Memory</td><td>GDDR5</td></tr><tr><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Processing</td><td>384</td></tr><tr><td>Base Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>1227MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Boost Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>1468MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Clock</td><td>Memory</td><td>1500MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Interface</td><td>Memory</td><td>64-bit</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI Port</td><td>Display Output</td><td>1 × HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Power</td><td>300W</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>Power</td><td>30W</td></tr><tr><td>DirectX Support</td><td>API</td><td>DirectX 12</td></tr><tr><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>API</td><td>OpenGL 4.5</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling System</td><td>Cooling</td><td>Aluminum Heatsink with 90mm Cooling Fan</td></tr><tr><td>Dimensions</td><td>Physical</td><td>167 × 120 × 26 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td><td>2 Years Manufacturer Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/eanfZEHn33rL180KcCmsRev7Hf1yG2bHKhsGbMTG.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 06:59:17', '2026-07-10 06:59:17', 'Colorful GeForce GT1030 2GB V3 GDDR5 Graphics Card | International Office Solution Bangladesh', 'Buy the Colorful GeForce GT1030 2GB V3 GDDR5 Graphics Card from International Office Solution Bangladesh. Featuring 384 CUDA cores, 2GB GDDR5 memory, HDMI output, low 30W power consumption, and DirectX 12 support.', 'Colorful GT1030 2GB V3, Colorful GT 1030 Bangladesh, GT1030 Graphics Card Price Bangladesh, Colorful 2GB GDDR5 Graphics Card, NVIDIA GT1030 GPU, Budget Graphics Card Bangladesh, Desktop Graphics Card, Colorful Graphics Card, International Office Solution', NULL, 140, NULL, NULL),
(1084, 'Gamemax GCR07 Gaming Chair Blue iosbd', 'The GameMax GCR07 Gaming Chair Blue features extra-thick cold foam cushioning, 100% vegan PU leather upholstery, Class 4 80mm gas lift, 15° rocking mechanism, fixed padded armrests, 350mm nylon base, and 50mm caster wheels. Its ergonomic design and premium finish make it ideal for gaming, office work, studying, and long sitting sessions.', 'gamemax-gcr07-gaming-chair-blue-iosbd-1783666869', '<p>The GameMax GCR07 Gaming Chair Blue is a stylish and ergonomic gaming chair designed to provide exceptional comfort and support for gamers, professionals, students, and content creators. With its racing-inspired design, premium materials, and durable construction, this chair is an excellent choice for long gaming sessions, office work, online learning, and everyday computer use.</p><p>The chair is upholstered with 100% vegan PU synthetic leather and features extra-thick cold foam cushioning, delivering outstanding comfort while maintaining its shape over time. The soft yet durable upholstery is easy to clean, wear-resistant, and designed for everyday use, making it a reliable seating solution for both home and office environments.</p><p>One of the standout design elements is the carbon-fiber look backrest, giving the chair a modern and premium appearance that perfectly complements gaming setups and professional workspaces. The elegant Blue and Black color combination adds a vibrant and stylish touch to any room.</p><p>The GameMax GCR07 features fixed armrests with extra-soft padding, providing comfortable support for your arms and reducing fatigue during extended gaming or working hours. Its ergonomic backrest promotes a healthy sitting posture while helping reduce strain on the neck, shoulders, and lower back.</p><p>Equipped with a reliable Class 4 gas lift (80mm), the chair offers smooth and secure height adjustment to accommodate different users and desk heights. The advanced rocking mechanism allows the chair to recline with a rocking angle of up to 15°, providing additional comfort when relaxing between gaming sessions or taking short breaks.</p><p>Built on a durable 350mm nylon base with smooth 50mm caster wheels, the GameMax GCR07 delivers excellent stability and effortless mobility across various floor surfaces. The sturdy construction ensures reliable everyday performance while maintaining comfort and durability.</p><p>Whether you\'re a competitive gamer, remote worker, student, or office professional, the GameMax GCR07 Gaming Chair Blue offers the perfect combination of ergonomic support, premium comfort, and modern style to enhance your daily seating experience.</p><p>Buy GameMax GCR07 Gaming Chair Blue from International Office Solution Purchase the original GameMax GCR07 Gaming Chair Blue from International Office Solution, your trusted destination for genuine gaming chairs, office furniture, and IT accessories in Bangladesh.</p><p>We offer authentic GameMax products at competitive prices with reliable customer service and nationwide delivery. Order online or contact International Office Solution for the latest price, product availability, and delivery information.</p><p>Warranty: No Warranty</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Brand</td><td>GameMax</td></tr><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Model</td><td>GCR07</td></tr><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Product Type</td><td>Gaming Chair</td></tr><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>Blue &amp; Black</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design</strong></td><td>Style</td><td>Ergonomic Racing Style</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Material</strong></td><td>Upholstery</td><td>100% Vegan PU Synthetic Leather</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Material</strong></td><td>Cushion</td><td>Extra-Thick Cold Foam Padding</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Material</stron