ladesh,\r\nGaming Chair Dhaka,\r\nGaming Chair Chattogram,\r\nOffice Gaming Chair,\r\nComputer Gaming Chair,\r\nGaming Furniture Bangladesh,\r\nOffice Chair Bangladesh,\r\nOriginal GameMax Chair,\r\nInternational Office Solution', NULL, 494, NULL, NULL),
(1085, 'Colorful Geforce RTX 3050 NB Duo 6GB-V GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The Colorful GeForce RTX 3050 NB DUO 6GB-V GDDR6 Graphics Card is a powerful mid-range GPU designed for modern gaming and content creation. Featuring 2304 CUDA cores, 6GB GDDR6 memory, NVIDIA DLSS, 2nd Gen Ray Tracing Cores, and dual-fan cooling, it delivers smooth gameplay and reliable performance.', 'colorful-geforce-rtx-3050-nb-duo-6gb-v-gddr6-graphics-card-1783666912', '<h2>Colorful GeForce RTX 3050 NB DUO 6GB-V GDDR6 Graphics Card</h2><p>The <strong>Colorful GeForce RTX 3050 NB DUO 6GB-V GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong> is engineered to provide an outstanding balance of gaming performance, creative capability, and power efficiency. Powered by NVIDIA\'s Ampere architecture, this graphics card is an excellent choice for gamers, streamers, and content creators looking for advanced graphics technologies at an affordable price.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>2304 CUDA cores</strong>, the RTX 3050 NB DUO delivers powerful parallel processing for modern games, video editing, 3D rendering, and everyday creative workloads. The GPU operates at a <strong>1042MHz base clock</strong> and boosts up to <strong>1470MHz</strong>, ensuring responsive performance during demanding gaming sessions and productivity tasks.</p><p>The graphics card features <strong>6GB of high-speed GDDR6 memory</strong> running at <strong>14Gbps</strong> over a <strong>96-bit memory interface</strong>, delivering <strong>168GB/s memory bandwidth</strong> for smooth gameplay, fast texture loading, and efficient multitasking.</p><p>Built with NVIDIA\'s latest gaming technologies, the RTX 3050 NB DUO supports <strong>NVIDIA DLSS</strong>, <strong>NVIDIA G-SYNC</strong>, and <strong>2nd Generation Ray Tracing Cores</strong>, providing AI-enhanced frame rates, tear-free gameplay, realistic lighting, reflections, and shadows. Support for <strong>DirectX 12 Ultimate</strong> and <strong>OpenGL 4.6</strong> ensures compatibility with the latest games and professional graphics applications.</p><p>The dual-fan cooling system with <strong>Auto Stop Technology</strong> provides efficient heat dissipation while maintaining quiet operation during light workloads. Its compact <strong>2-slot design</strong> makes installation easy in a wide variety of desktop PC cases.</p><p>For display connectivity, the graphics card includes <strong>1 DisplayPort</strong>, <strong>1 HDMI</strong>, and <strong>1 DVI</strong> output, allowing flexible multi-monitor configurations and support for high-resolution displays.</p><p>With a low <strong>70W power consumption</strong> and a recommended <strong>450W power supply</strong>, the RTX 3050 NB DUO offers excellent performance while maintaining energy efficiency.</p><p>International Office Solution offers the <strong>Colorful GeForce RTX 3050 NB DUO 6GB-V GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong> with genuine manufacturer warranty, competitive pricing, and dependable customer support across Bangladesh.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Model</td><td>Product</td><td>Colorful GeForce RTX 3050 NB DUO 6GB-V</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 (Ampere)</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory</td><td>6GB</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Type</td><td>Memory</td><td>GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Processing</td><td>2304</td></tr><tr><td>Base Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>1042MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Boost Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>1470MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td><td>14Gbps</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Interface</td><td>Memory</td><td>96-bit</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Bandwidth</td><td>Memory</td><td>168GB/s</td></tr><tr><td>NVIDIA Technologies</td><td>Features</td><td>NVIDIA DLSS, NVIDIA G-SYNC, 2nd Gen Ray Tracing Cores</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling System</td><td>Cooling</td><td>Dual-Fan Cooling with Auto Stop Technology</td></tr><tr><td>DisplayPort</td><td>Display Output</td><td>1 × DisplayPort</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>Display Output</td><td>1 × HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>DVI</td><td>Display Output</td><td>1 × DVI</td></tr><tr><td>Multi-Display Support</td><td>Display</td><td>Up to 4 Displays</td></tr><tr><td>Power Connector</td><td>Power</td><td>3+1 Phase Power Design</td></tr><tr><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Power</td><td>450W</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>Power</td><td>70W</td></tr><tr><td>DirectX Support</td><td>API</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>API</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td>Slot Size</td><td>Physical</td><td>2-Slot Design</td></tr><tr><td>Dimensions</td><td>Physical</td><td>242.2 × 115 × 39.8 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Manufacturer Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/i4l5SN1evLdSLHBJguNP289Ag5BFIVwKtux2lXBd.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 07:01:52', '2026-07-10 07:01:52', 'Colorful GeForce RTX 3050 NB DUO 6GB-V GDDR6 Graphics Card | International Office Solution Bangladesh', 'Buy the Colorful GeForce RTX 3050 NB DUO 6GB-V GDDR6 Graphics Card from International Office Solution Bangladesh. Features 2304 CUDA cores, 6GB GDDR6 memory, NVIDIA DLSS, Ray Tracing, G-SYNC, dual-fan cooling, and DirectX 12 Ultimate.', 'Colorful RTX 3050 NB DUO 6GB, RTX 3050 6GB Bangladesh, Colorful GeForce RTX 3050, NVIDIA RTX 3050 Graphics Card, RTX 3050 Price Bangladesh, GDDR6 Graphics Card, DLSS Graphics Card, Ray Tracing GPU, Gaming Graphics Card, International Office Solution', NULL, 140, NULL, NULL),
(1086, 'Colorful GeForce RTX 3050 6GB-V GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The Colorful GeForce RTX 3050 6GB-V GDDR6 Graphics Card is a reliable graphics solution for gamers and creators, featuring 2304 CUDA cores, 6GB GDDR6 memory, NVIDIA DLSS, 2nd Gen Ray Tracing Cores, and Auto Stop Technology for efficient cooling and smooth 1080p gaming performance.', 'colorful-geforce-rtx-3050-6gb-v-gddr6-graphics-card-1783667002', '<h2>Colorful GeForce RTX 3050 6GB-V GDDR6 Graphics Card</h2><p>The <strong>Colorful GeForce RTX 3050 6GB-V GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong> is designed to deliver dependable gaming performance, advanced graphics technologies, and excellent power efficiency for modern desktop PCs. Powered by NVIDIA\'s Ampere architecture, this graphics card is an ideal choice for gamers, streamers, and content creators looking for smooth Full HD gaming and accelerated creative workflows.</p><p>Featuring <strong>2304 CUDA cores</strong>, the RTX 3050 6GB-V provides outstanding graphics processing power for today\'s games, video editing, 3D rendering, and multimedia applications. The GPU operates at a <strong>1042MHz base clock</strong> and boosts up to <strong>1470MHz</strong>, ensuring responsive performance across demanding gaming and productivity tasks.</p><p>The card is equipped with <strong>6GB of high-speed GDDR6 memory</strong> running at <strong>14Gbps</strong> on a <strong>96-bit memory interface</strong>, delivering a memory bandwidth of <strong>168GB/s</strong>. This high-speed memory enables faster texture loading, smoother gameplay, and efficient handling of graphics-intensive applications.</p><p>Built with NVIDIA\'s latest technologies, the graphics card supports <strong>NVIDIA DLSS</strong>, <strong>NVIDIA G-SYNC</strong>, and <strong>2nd Generation Ray Tracing Cores</strong>, providing AI-enhanced performance, ultra-realistic lighting effects, reduced latency, and smooth tear-free gameplay. Compatibility with <strong>DirectX 12 Ultimate</strong> and <strong>OpenGL 4.6</strong> ensures support for the latest gaming titles and professional graphics software.</p><p>The <strong>Auto Stop Technology</strong> intelligently stops the cooling fans during low GPU workloads, reducing noise while extending fan lifespan. Its <strong>dual-slot design</strong> offers excellent compatibility with most desktop PC cases while maintaining effective cooling performance.</p><p>For display connectivity, the graphics card includes <strong>1 DisplayPort</strong>, <strong>1 HDMI</strong>, and <strong>1 DVI</strong> output, supporting up to <strong>three displays</strong> simultaneously for gaming, productivity, and multi-monitor workstations.</p><p>With a recommended <strong>450W power supply</strong> and efficient <strong>3+1 phase power design</strong>, the RTX 3050 6GB-V delivers reliable performance while maintaining low power consumption.</p><p>International Office Solution offers the <strong>Colorful GeForce RTX 3050 6GB-V GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong> with genuine manufacturer warranty, competitive pricing, and dependable customer support throughout Bangladesh.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Model</td><td>Product</td><td>Colorful GeForce RTX 3050 6GB-V</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 (Ampere)</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory</td><td>6GB</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Type</td><td>Memory</td><td>GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Processing</td><td>2304</td></tr><tr><td>Base Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>1042MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Boost Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>1470MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td><td>14Gbps</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Interface</td><td>Memory</td><td>96-bit</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Bandwidth</td><td>Memory</td><td>168GB/s</td></tr><tr><td>NVIDIA Technologies</td><td>Features</td><td>NVIDIA DLSS, NVIDIA G-SYNC, 2nd Gen Ray Tracing Cores</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling Technology</td><td>Cooling</td><td>Auto Stop Technology</td></tr><tr><td>Slot Design</td><td>Physical</td><td>2-Slot</td></tr><tr><td>DisplayPort</td><td>Display Output</td><td>1 × DisplayPort</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>Display Output</td><td>1 × HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>DVI</td><td>Display Output</td><td>1 × DVI</td></tr><tr><td>Multi-Display Support</td><td>Display</td><td>Up to 3 Displays</td></tr><tr><td>Power Design</td><td>Power</td><td>3+1 Phase</td></tr><tr><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Power</td><td>450W</td></tr><tr><td>DirectX Support</td><td>API</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>API</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td>Dimensions</td><td>Physical</td><td>239.1 × 114.4 × 39 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Manufacturer Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/5YLCIFcSWx5506HknfcK8bACOJ9jAwQMf6JYKZML.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 07:03:22', '2026-07-10 07:03:22', 'Colorful GeForce RTX 3050 6GB-V GDDR6 Graphics Card | International Office Solution Bangladesh', 'Buy the Colorful GeForce RTX 3050 6GB-V GDDR6 Graphics Card from International Office Solution Bangladesh. Featuring 2304 CUDA cores, 6GB GDDR6 memory, NVIDIA DLSS, Ray Tracing, G-SYNC, and dual-slot cooling for smooth 1080p gaming.', 'Colorful GeForce RTX 3050 6GB-V, RTX 3050 6GB Bangladesh, Colorful RTX 3050 Graphics Card, NVIDIA RTX 3050 GPU, RTX 3050 Price Bangladesh, 6GB GDDR6 Graphics Card, DLSS Graphics Card, Ray Tracing GPU, Gaming Graphics Card, International Office Solution', NULL, 140, NULL, NULL),
(1087, 'Colorful Geforce RTX 3060 NB Duo 12G V2 LV GDDR6 Graphic Card', 'The Colorful GeForce RTX 3060 NB DUO 12G V2 LV GDDR6 Graphics Card is a powerful gaming and content creation GPU featuring 3584 CUDA cores, 12GB GDDR6 memory, dual-fan cooling, ray tracing support, and high-performance graphics for modern AAA games and creative applications.', 'colorful-geforce-rtx-3060-nb-duo-12g-v2-lv-gddr6-graphic-card-1783667088', '<h2>Colorful GeForce RTX 3060 NB DUO 12G V2 LV GDDR6 Graphics Card</h2><p>The <strong>Colorful GeForce RTX 3060 NB DUO 12G V2 LV GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong> is designed for gamers, streamers, and creative professionals who require excellent graphics performance and advanced NVIDIA technologies. Built on NVIDIA\'s RTX architecture, this graphics card delivers outstanding gaming experiences, accelerated creative workflows, and smooth multitasking for modern desktop PCs.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>3584 CUDA cores</strong>, the RTX 3060 NB DUO provides exceptional processing power for demanding games, video editing, 3D rendering, streaming, and AI-accelerated applications. It operates at a <strong>1320MHz base clock</strong> with a <strong>1777MHz boost clock</strong>, delivering responsive performance and smooth frame rates across the latest gaming titles.</p><p>The graphics card features <strong>12GB of high-speed GDDR6 memory</strong> running at <strong>15Gbps</strong> on a <strong>192-bit memory interface</strong>, providing the bandwidth required for high-resolution gaming, complex textures, and professional creative workloads. With support for resolutions up to <strong>7680 × 4320 (8K)</strong>, it is well suited for both immersive gaming and advanced content creation.</p><p>Designed with an efficient <strong>dual-fan cooling system</strong>, the RTX 3060 NB DUO delivers reliable thermal performance while maintaining stable operation during extended gaming sessions. Advanced <strong>DrMOS power delivery</strong> enhances power efficiency, minimizes heat generation, and improves overall system stability.</p><p>Supporting <strong>DirectX 12 Ultimate</strong> and <strong>OpenGL 4.6</strong>, the graphics card enables advanced graphics technologies including real-time ray tracing for realistic lighting, reflections, and shadows. It also supports NVIDIA technologies that enhance gaming, streaming, and virtual reality experiences.</p><p>For display connectivity, the card includes <strong>three DisplayPort outputs</strong> and <strong>one HDMI port</strong>, allowing users to connect up to <strong>four displays</strong> for gaming, multitasking, or professional workflows.</p><p>Powered through a single <strong>8-pin PCIe power connector</strong>, the RTX 3060 NB DUO is recommended for systems with a <strong>550W or higher power supply</strong>, ensuring stable performance under heavy workloads.</p><p>International Office Solution offers the <strong>Colorful GeForce RTX 3060 NB DUO 12G V2 LV GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong> with genuine manufacturer warranty, competitive pricing, and reliable customer support throughout Bangladesh.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Model</td><td>Product</td><td>Colorful GeForce RTX 3060 NB DUO 12G V2 LV</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory</td><td>12GB</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Type</td><td>Memory</td><td>GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Processing</td><td>3584</td></tr><tr><td>Base Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>1320MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Boost Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>1777MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td><td>15Gbps</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Interface</td><td>Memory</td><td>192-bit</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum Resolution</td><td>Display</td><td>7680 × 4320</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling System</td><td>Cooling</td><td>Dual-Fan Cooling</td></tr><tr><td>Power Delivery</td><td>Power Design</td><td>DrMOS Power Design</td></tr><tr><td>DisplayPort</td><td>Display Output</td><td>3 × DisplayPort</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>Display Output</td><td>1 × HDMI</td></tr><tr><td>Multi-Display Support</td><td>Display</td><td>Up to 4 Displays</td></tr><tr><td>Power Connector</td><td>Power</td><td>1 × 8-Pin</td></tr><tr><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Power</td><td>550W or Above</td></tr><tr><td>DirectX Support</td><td>API</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>API</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td>Slot Size</td><td>Physical</td><td>2-Slot Design</td></tr><tr><td>Dimensions</td><td>Physical</td><td>253.4 × 132.5 × 41 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td><td>2 Years Manufacturer Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/sYTzcNzE6WLj6nH95TE2FAD0SQrp1ZhCNbpnAD1y.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 07:04:48', '2026-07-10 07:04:48', 'Colorful GeForce RTX 3060 NB DUO 12G V2 LV GDDR6 Graphics Card | International Office Solution Bangladesh', 'Buy the Colorful GeForce RTX 3060 NB DUO 12G V2 LV GDDR6 Graphics Card from International Office Solution Bangladesh. Featuring 3584 CUDA cores, 12GB GDDR6 memory, Ray Tracing, NVIDIA technologies, dual-fan cooling, and support for up to 4 displays.', 'Colorful RTX 3060 NB DUO 12GB, RTX 3060 12GB Bangladesh, Colorful GeForce RTX 3060, NVIDIA RTX 3060 Graphics Card, RTX 3060 Price Bangladesh, 12GB GDDR6 Graphics Card, Gaming GPU Bangladesh, Ray Tracing Graphics Card, Colorful Graphics Card, International Office Solution', NULL, 140, NULL, NULL),
(1088, 'Gamemax GCR07 Gaming Chair Green iosbd', 'The GameMax GCR07 Gaming Chair Green features a heavy-duty steel frame, extra-thick cold foam cushioning, 100% vegan PU leather upholstery, 80mm Class 4 gas lift, 15° rocking mechanism, fixed padded armrests, 50mm PU-coated caster wheels, and supports up to 125kg. Its ergonomic Black and Green design makes it perfect for gaming, office work, streaming, and long hours of comfortable seating.', 'gamemax-gcr07-gaming-chair-green-iosbd-1783667130', '<p>The GameMax GCR07 Gaming Chair Green is a premium ergonomic gaming chair designed for gamers, streamers, office professionals, and content creators who demand superior comfort, durability, and modern style. Combining a racing-inspired design with high-quality materials, this chair provides exceptional support for long gaming sessions, office work, studying, and everyday computer use.</p><p>Built around a heavy-duty steel frame and a durable five-star nylon base, the GameMax GCR07 offers excellent structural strength and long-lasting stability. It supports users weighing up to 125kg, making it a reliable seating solution for daily use in gaming rooms, home offices, and professional workspaces.</p><p>The chair features extra-thick cold foam padding that conforms to the body\'s natural shape, providing outstanding comfort while reducing fatigue during extended periods of sitting. Upholstered with 100% vegan PU synthetic leather, the GCR07 delivers a premium appearance while being resistant to wear, easy to clean, and simple to maintain.</p><p>Its striking Black and Green color combination, complemented by a stylish carbon-look PVC back panel, gives the chair a modern racing-inspired aesthetic that enhances any gaming setup or workstation.</p><p>The fixed armrests with soft cushioning provide comfortable arm support, while the advanced rocking mechanism allows users to recline up to 15°, making it easy to relax between gaming sessions or work tasks. An 80mm Class 4 gas lift enables smooth seat height adjustment from 47cm to 54cm, allowing users to find their ideal seating position.</p><p>The ergonomic backrest measures 79cm in height, offering excellent support for the spine and shoulders, while the overall chair height adjusts between 114cm and 122cm to accommodate users of different heights. Equipped with 50mm PU-coated caster wheels, the chair glides smoothly across various floor surfaces while helping protect floors from scratches.</p><p>Whether you\'re building a professional gaming station, upgrading your streaming setup, or creating a comfortable home office, the GameMax GCR07 Gaming Chair Green delivers the perfect combination of ergonomic support, premium comfort, durable construction, and eye-catching design.</p><p>Buy GameMax GCR07 Gaming Chair Green from International Office Solution Purchase the original GameMax GCR07 Gaming Chair Green from International Office Solution, your trusted supplier of genuine gaming chairs, office furniture, and workplace solutions in Bangladesh.</p><p>We offer authentic GameMax gaming chairs at competitive prices with reliable customer support and nationwide delivery. Order online or contact International Office Solution for the latest price, product availability, and delivery information.</p><p>Warranty: No Warranty</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Brand</td><td>GameMax</td></tr><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Model</td><td>GCR07</td></tr><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Product Type</td><td>Gaming Chair</td></tr><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>Black &amp; Green</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design</strong></td><td>Style</td><td>Ergonomic Racing Style</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Material</strong></td><td>Upholstery</td><td>100% Vegan PU Synthetic Leather</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Mate