(1089, 'Gamemax GCR07 Gaming Chair Black iosbd', 'The GameMax GCR07 Gaming Chair Black features extra-thick cold foam cushioning, 100% vegan PU leather upholstery, 80mm Class 4 gas lift, 15° rocking mechanism, tilt lock, fixed padded armrests, 350mm nylon base, and 50mm caster wheels. Its ergonomic all-black design is ideal for gaming, office work, streaming, and extended sitting sessions.', 'gamemax-gcr07-gaming-chair-black-iosbd-1783667281', '<p>The GameMax GCR07 Gaming Chair Black is a premium ergonomic gaming chair designed for gamers, professionals, streamers, and remote workers who need exceptional comfort and long-lasting durability. Featuring a sleek all-black racing-inspired design, this gaming chair blends modern aesthetics with ergonomic functionality, making it an ideal choice for gaming setups, home offices, and professional workspaces.</p><p>Built with a durable frame and a sturdy 350mm nylon five-star base, the GameMax GCR07 provides excellent stability and dependable performance for everyday use. The chair is upholstered with 100% vegan PU synthetic leather, delivering a premium appearance while offering excellent durability, wear resistance, and easy maintenance.</p><p>The seat and backrest are padded with extra-thick cold foam cushioning, which contours naturally to the body and provides superior comfort during extended gaming sessions or long working hours. The ergonomic backrest helps support the spine and promotes proper posture, reducing fatigue throughout the day.</p><p>A stylish carbon-look rear back panel enhances the chair\'s premium appearance, giving it a sporty racing-inspired finish that complements modern gaming environments and office interiors.</p><p>The fixed armrests feature extra-soft padding to provide comfortable arm support while gaming, typing, or working. The advanced rocking mechanism allows users to recline up to 15°, while the integrated tilt locking mechanism lets you secure the chair in your preferred position for added comfort.</p><p>Equipped with a reliable 80mm Class 4 gas lift, the chair offers smooth and secure height adjustment to suit different desk heights and user preferences. The 50mm smooth-rolling caster wheels provide excellent mobility across a variety of floor surfaces, while the dust-covered gas lift helps improve durability and maintain a clean appearance.</p><p>Whether you\'re gaming competitively, working remotely, studying, or creating content, the GameMax GCR07 Gaming Chair Black delivers an outstanding combination of ergonomic support, premium comfort, durable construction, and stylish design.</p><p>Buy GameMax GCR07 Gaming Chair Black from International Office Solution Purchase the original GameMax GCR07 Gaming Chair Black from International Office Solution, your trusted supplier of genuine gaming chairs, office furniture, and workplace solutions in Bangladesh.</p><p>We offer authentic GameMax gaming chairs at competitive prices with reliable customer service and nationwide delivery. Order online or contact International Office Solution to get the latest price, product availability, and delivery information.</p><p>Warranty: No Warranty</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Brand</td><td>GameMax</td></tr><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Model</td><td>GCR07</td></tr><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Product Type</td><td>Gaming Chair</td></tr><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design</strong></td><td>Style</td><td>Ergonomic Racing Style</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Material</strong></td><td>Upholstery</td><td>100% Vegan PU Synthetic Leather</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Material</strong></td><td>Cushion</td><td>Extra-Thick Cold Foam Padding</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Material</strong></td><td>Base</td><td>350mm Nylon Base</td></tr><t