(1090, 'Colorful GeForce RTX 5050 NB Battle AX DUO 8GB-V GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The Colorful GeForce RTX 5050 NB Battle AX DUO 8GB-V GDDR6 Graphics Card delivers reliable next-generation gaming performance with 2560 CUDA cores, 8GB GDDR6 memory, 20Gbps memory speed, DLSS 4, NVIDIA Reflex, RGB lighting, and an advanced Axe Cooling System for smooth gameplay and creative workloads.', 'colorful-geforce-rtx-5050-nb-battle-ax-duo-8gb-v-gddr6-graphics-card-1783667308', '<h2>Colorful GeForce RTX 5050 NB Battle AX DUO 8GB-V GDDR6 Graphics Card</h2><p>The <strong>Colorful GeForce RTX 5050 NB Battle AX DUO 8GB-V GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong> is engineered for gamers, creators, and PC enthusiasts looking for dependable next-generation graphics performance in a stylish and efficient package. Built with NVIDIA\'s latest graphics technologies, this GPU offers excellent gaming, streaming, and creative capabilities while maintaining efficient power consumption.</p><p>Powered by <strong>2560 CUDA cores</strong>, the RTX 5050 NB Battle AX DUO operates at a <strong>2317MHz base clock</strong> and boosts up to <strong>2572MHz</strong>, delivering smooth frame rates and responsive performance for modern AAA games, esports titles, content creation, and multimedia applications.</p><p>The graphics card features <strong>8GB of high-speed GDDR6 memory</strong> running at an effective <strong>20Gbps</strong> over a <strong>128-bit memory interface</strong>, providing fast data transfer and responsive graphics performance. With support for resolutions up to <strong>7680 × 4320 (8K)</strong>, it is well suited for high-resolution gaming, streaming, and professional creative workflows.</p><p>Supporting <strong>NVIDIA DLSS 4</strong>, <strong>NVIDIA Reflex</strong>, and <strong>NVIDIA Studio</strong>, the RTX 5050 NB Battle AX DUO leverages AI-enhanced rendering for improved frame rates, reduced latency, and optimized performance in creative software. It also supports <strong>DirectX 12 Ultimate</strong> and <strong>OpenGL 4.6</strong>, ensuring compatibility with the latest games and graphics-intensive applications.</p><p>Designed with a bold <strong>red-and-black color scheme</strong>, the graphics card features a <strong>metallic hollowed backboard</strong>, stylish <strong>RGB side lighting</strong>, and Colorful\'s advanced <strong>Axe Cooling System</strong> with <strong>ring-shaped fans</strong>. <strong>Auto Stop Technology</strong> automatically stops the fans during low workloads for quieter operation while extending fan lifespan.</p><p>For display connectivity, the GPU includes <strong>three DisplayPort 2.1b outputs</strong> and <strong>one HDMI 2.1b port</strong>, supporting up to <strong>four displays</strong> with ultra-high refresh rates and resolutions up to <strong>8K</strong>.</p><p>Powered through a single <strong>8-pin PCIe connector</strong>, the graphics card has a <strong>130W power consumption</strong> and is recommended for systems with a <strong>550W power supply</strong>, making it an excellent upgrade for modern gaming PCs.</p><p>International Office Solution offers the <strong>Colorful GeForce RTX 5050 NB Battle AX DUO 8GB-V GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong> with genuine manufacturer warranty, competitive pricing, and dependable customer support across Bangladesh.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Model</td><td>Product</td><td>Colorful GeForce RTX 5050 NB Battle AX DUO 8GB-V</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5050</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Type</td><td>Memory</td><td>GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Processing</td><td>2560</td></tr><tr><td>Base Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>2317MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Boost Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>2572MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td><td>20Gbps (2500MHz Effective)</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Interface</td><td>Memory</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum Resolution</td><td>Display</td><td>7680 × 4320</td></tr><tr><td>NVIDIA Technologies</td><td>Features</td><td>NVIDIA DLSS 4, NVIDIA Reflex, NVIDIA Studio</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling System</td><td>Cooling</td><td>Axe Cooling System with Ring-Shaped Fans</td></tr><tr><td>Auto Stop Technology</td><td>Cooling</td><td>Supported</td></tr><tr><td>Design</td><td>Build</td><td>Red &amp; Black Color Contrast Design</td></tr><tr><td>Backplate</td><td>Build</td><td>Metallic Hollowed Backboard</td></tr><tr><td>RGB Lighting</td><td>Lighting</td><td>Side RGB Lighting Effect</td></tr><tr><td>DisplayPort</td><td>Display Output</td><td>3 × DisplayPort 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>Display Output</td><td>1 × HDMI 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td>Multi-Display Support</td><td>Display</td><td>Up to 4 Displays</td></tr><tr><td>Power Connector</td><td>Power</td><td>1 × 8-Pin</td></tr><tr><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Power</td><td>550W</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>Power</td><td>130W</td></tr><tr><td>DirectX Support</td><td>API</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>API</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td>Dimensions</td><td>Physical</td><td>231 × 120 × 48.9 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Manufacturer Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/JJV7lQV1Qtiy9wYU0dBnMT2O8jDyIozKvdM1shhO.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 07:08:28', '2026-07-10 07:18:27', 'Colorful GeForce RTX 5050 NB Battle AX DUO 8GB-V GDDR6 Graphics Card | International Office Solution Bangladesh', 'Buy the Colorful GeForce RTX 5050 NB Battle AX DUO 8GB-V GDDR6 Graphics Card from International Office Solution Bangladesh. Featuring 2560 CUDA cores, 8GB GDDR6 memory, DLSS 4, NVIDIA Reflex, RGB lighting, Axe Cooling System, and 20Gbps memory speed.', 'Colorful RTX 5050 NB Battle AX DUO, RTX 5050 8GB Bangladesh, Colorful GeForce RTX 5050, NVIDIA RTX 5050 Graphics Card, RTX 5050 Price Bangladesh, GDDR6 Graphics Card, DLSS 4 Graphics Card, Gaming GPU Bangladesh, Colorful Graphics Card, International Office Solution', NULL, 140, NULL, NULL),
(1091, 'GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 3050 WINDFORCE OC V2 6GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 3050 WINDFORCE OC V2 6GB GDDR6 Graphics Card delivers reliable 1080p gaming performance with 2304 CUDA cores, a 1477MHz boost clock, WINDFORCE dual-fan cooling, PCIe 4.0 support, and advanced NVIDIA technologies including Ray Tracing and DLSS.', 'gigabyte-geforce-rtx-3050-windforce-oc-v2-6gb-gddr6-graphics-card-1783667476', '<p>The <strong>GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 3050 WINDFORCE OC V2 6GB GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong> is designed for gamers, creators, and PC enthusiasts looking for dependable graphics performance, efficient cooling, and modern NVIDIA technologies. Built on the NVIDIA GeForce RTX architecture, it features <strong>2304 CUDA cores</strong> and an overclocked <strong>1477MHz boost clock</strong>, delivering smooth gameplay and responsive performance in today\'s most popular games and creative applications.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>6GB of high-speed GDDR6 memory</strong> running at <strong>14,000MHz</strong> over a <strong>96-bit memory interface</strong>, the RTX 3050 WINDFORCE OC V2 provides fast data transfer for seamless gaming, content creation, video editing, and multitasking. Support for <strong>DirectX 12 Ultimate</strong>, <strong>OpenGL 4.6</strong>, <strong>Real-Time Ray Tracing</strong>, and <strong>NVIDIA DLSS</strong> enhances image quality, lighting effects, and gaming performance while maintaining excellent frame rates.</p><p>The advanced <strong>WINDFORCE cooling system</strong> features dual optimized cooling fans that efficiently dissipate heat, ensuring stable operation during extended gaming sessions while keeping noise levels low. Its compact <strong>191 × 111 × 36 mm</strong> design makes it an ideal choice for small and mid-sized PC builds without compromising performance.</p><p>For display connectivity, the graphics card includes <strong>2 x HDMI 2.1</strong> and <strong>2 x DisplayPort 1.4a</strong> outputs, supporting resolutions up to <strong>7680 × 4320 (8K)</strong> and allowing connection of up to <strong>four displays</strong> simultaneously. Built on the <strong>PCI Express 4.0</strong> interface and powered by a single <strong>8-pin power connector</strong>, the card operates efficiently with a recommended <strong>300W power supply</strong>.</p><p>Whether you\'re upgrading an existing gaming PC or building a new system, the <strong>GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 3050 WINDFORCE OC V2 6GB GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong> offers an excellent balance of gaming performance, energy efficiency, and advanced graphics technologies for modern workloads.</p><h2>Buy GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 3050 WINDFORCE OC V2 6GB GDDR6 Graphics Card from International Office Solution</h2><p>Purchase the <strong>GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 3050 WINDFORCE OC V2 6GB GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> and enjoy genuine products, competitive pricing, and reliable customer service. We offer a wide range of original GIGABYTE graphics cards for gaming, content creation, and professional computing. Order online or visit <strong>International Office Solution</strong> to get the best deal. The graphics card comes with a <strong>3-year manufacturing warranty</strong>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Type</td><td>GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Size</td><td>6GB</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>Maximum Resolution</td><td>7680 × 4320</td></tr><tr><td>GPU</td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>2304</td></tr><tr><td>GPU</td><td>Core Clock</td><td>1477 MHz (Reference Card: 1470 MHz)</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>Memory Clock</td><td>14000 MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>Bus Type</td><td>96-bit</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>PCI Express</td><td>PCI-E 4.0</td></tr><tr><td>Display Output</td><td>DisplayPort</td><td>2 × DisplayPort 1.4a</td></tr><tr><td>Display Output</td><td>HDMI</td><td>2 × HDMI 2.1</td></tr><tr><td>Display Support</td><td>Multi-Display</td><td>Up to 4 Displays</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Connector</td><td>1 × 8-pin</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>300W</td></tr><tr><td>API Support</td><td>DirectX</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td>API Support</td><td>OpenGL</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td>Physical</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>191 × 111 × 36 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Manufacturing Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 29500.00, 29500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/4QRz12tV2oIr5h3fHm1AO7LWzCltNYYk4A7jj0jD.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 07:11:16', '2026-07-10 07:12:10', 'GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 3050 WINDFORCE OC V2 6GB GDDR6 Graphics Card Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy the GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 3050 WINDFORCE OC V2 6GB GDDR6 Graphics Card in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features 2304 CUDA cores, 1477MHz boost clock, WINDFORCE cooling, PCIe 4.0, Ray Tracing, DLSS, and 3-year warranty.', 'GIGABYTE RTX 3050 WINDFORCE OC V2 6GB, GIGABYTE RTX 3050 6GB Price in Bangladesh, RTX 3050 Graphics Card, GIGABYTE Graphics Card BD, NVIDIA RTX 3050, WINDFORCE OC V2, Gaming GPU, International Office Solution', NULL, 15, NULL, NULL),
(1092, 'Gamemax GCR07 Gaming Chair Red iosbd', 'The GameMax GCR07 Gaming Chair Red features extra-thick cold foam cushioning, 100% vegan PU leather upholstery, 80mm Class 4 gas lift, 15° rocking mechanism, tilt lock, fixed padded armrests, 350mm nylon base, and 50mm caster wheels. Its ergonomic Black and Red design is ideal for gaming, office work, streaming, and extended sitting sessions.', 'gamemax-gcr07-gaming-chair-red-iosbd-1783667541', '<p>The GameMax GCR07 Gaming Chair Red is a premium ergonomic gaming chair designed to provide superior comfort, durability, and style for gamers, streamers, office professionals, and content creators. Featuring a bold Black and Red racing-inspired design, this chair enhances any gaming setup or workspace while delivering outstanding ergonomic support for long hours of gaming or work.</p><p>Constructed with a durable frame and a 350mm nylon five-star base, the GameMax GCR07 offers excellent stability and long-lasting reliability. The chair is upholstered in 100% vegan PU synthetic leather, providing a premium appearance that is soft to the touch, easy to clean, and highly resistant to daily wear.</p><p>The seat and backrest are filled with extra-thick cold foam cushioning, offering exceptional comfort by evenly distributing body weight and reducing fatigue during extended sitting sessions. Its ergonomic backrest promotes proper posture and provides reliable support for the spine, making it ideal for gaming marathons, office work, studying, and streaming.</p><p>A distinctive carbon-look rear back panel adds a modern racing-inspired finish that gives the chair a premium and stylish appearance. The eye-catching Red and Black color combination makes it a perfect centerpiece for gaming rooms and modern workstations.</p><p>The fixed armrests feature extra-soft padding to provide comfortable arm support while typing, gaming, or working. The advanced rocking mechanism allows users to enjoy a smooth rocking motion of up to 15°, helping reduce stress during breaks. An integrated tilt lock mechanism lets you secure the chair in your preferred position for additional comfort and stability.</p><p>The chair is equipped with a reliable 80mm Class 4 gas lift that enables smooth and secure seat height adjustment to suit different desk heights and user preferences. Its 50mm smooth-rolling caster wheels ensure effortless movement across various floor surfaces, while the protective dust cover enhances the durability of the gas lift system.</p><p>Whether you\'re building a professional gaming station, upgrading your home office, or looking for a stylish ergonomic chair, the GameMax GCR07 Gaming Chair Red offers the perfect combination of comfort, durability, and premium design.</p><p>Buy GameMax GCR07 Gaming Chair Red from International Office Solution Purchase the original GameMax GCR07 Gaming Chair Red from International Office Solution, your trusted supplier of genuine gaming chairs, office furniture, and IT accessories in Bangladesh.</p><p>We provide authentic GameMax gaming chairs at competitive prices with reliable customer support and nationwide delivery. Order online or contact International Office Solution to get the latest price, product availability, and delivery information.</p><p>Warranty: No Warranty</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Brand</td><td>GameMax</td></tr><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Model</td><td>GCR07</td></tr><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Product Type</td><td>Gaming Chair</td></tr><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>Black &amp; Red</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design</strong></td><td>Style</td><td>Ergonomic Racing Style</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Material</strong></td><td>Upholstery</td><td>100% Vegan PU Synthetic Leather</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Material</strong></td><t