\r\nGaming Chair for Office,\r\nGaming Chair for PC,\r\nGaming Chair for Home Office,\r\nComfortable Gaming Chair,\r\nProfessional Gaming Chair,\r\nGaming Chair Online Bangladesh,\r\nGaming Chair Dhaka,\r\nGaming Chair Chattogram,\r\nOffice Gaming Chair,\r\nComputer Gaming Chair,\r\nGaming Furniture Bangladesh,\r\nOffice Chair Bangladesh,\r\nOriginal GameMax Chair,\r\nInternational Office Solution', NULL, 494, NULL, NULL),
(1093, 'GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5050 OC Low Profile 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5050 OC Low Profile 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card delivers powerful gaming and content creation performance in a compact low-profile design. Featuring NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, DLSS 4, 2560 CUDA cores, PCIe 5.0, and advanced cooling technologies, it is ideal for compact desktop PC builds.', 'gigabyte-geforce-rtx-5050-oc-low-profile-8gb-gddr6-graphics-card-1783667644', '<h2>GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5050 OC Low Profile 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card</h2><p>The <strong>GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5050 OC Low Profile 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong> is engineered for gamers, creators, and professionals who need high-end graphics performance in a compact form factor. Built on the latest <strong>NVIDIA Blackwell architecture</strong>, this graphics card combines next-generation performance with AI-powered technologies like <strong>DLSS 4</strong>, delivering smoother gameplay, improved image quality, and enhanced productivity for demanding applications.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>2560 CUDA cores</strong> and an overclocked <strong>2587 MHz core clock</strong>, the RTX 5050 OC Low Profile offers excellent performance for modern games, creative software, and AI-accelerated workloads. Its <strong>8GB of GDDR6 memory</strong> running at <strong>20 Gbps</strong> across a <strong>128-bit memory interface</strong> ensures fast data transfer, smooth multitasking, and responsive graphics performance even during intensive workloads.</p><p>Designed specifically for compact desktop systems, the card features a <strong>low-profile 182mm design</strong>, making it an excellent choice for small form factor (SFF) PCs, HTPCs, and workstation builds. Despite its compact size, GIGABYTE incorporates premium cooling technologies including <strong>server-grade thermal conductive gel</strong> and <strong>Graphene Nano Lubricant</strong>, providing efficient heat dissipation, lower operating temperatures, quieter performance, and improved long-term durability.</p><p>The graphics card supports <strong>PCI Express 5.0</strong>, offering maximum bandwidth for the latest desktop platforms. For display connectivity, it includes <strong>1× DisplayPort 2.1b, 1× DisplayPort 1.4a, and 2× HDMI 2.1b</strong>, supporting up to <strong>four displays simultaneously</strong> with a maximum resolution of <strong>7680 × 4320 (8K)</strong>. Compatibility with <strong>DirectX 12 API</strong> and <strong>OpenGL 4.6</strong> ensures excellent support for modern games, professional applications, and graphics-intensive workflows.</p><p>Requiring only a <strong>single 8-pin power connector</strong> and a <strong>recommended 550W power supply</strong>, the <strong>GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5050 OC Low Profile 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong> provides an outstanding combination of compact design, energy efficiency, advanced graphics technologies, and reliable performance for today\'s gaming and creative computing needs.</p><h2>Buy GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5050 OC Low Profile 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card from International Office Solution</h2><p>Purchase the <strong>GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5050 OC Low Profile 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> and enjoy genuine GIGABYTE products, competitive pricing, and reliable after-sales support. We offer a wide range of original GIGABYTE graphics cards for gaming, content creation, AI workloads, and professional applications. Order online or visit <strong>International Office Solution</strong> to get the best deal. This graphics card is backed by a <strong>3-year manufacturing warranty</strong>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Type</td><td>GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Size</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td>Resolution</td><td>Maximum Resolution</td><td>7680 × 4320</td></tr><tr><td>GPU</td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>2560</td></tr><tr><td>GPU</td><td>Core Clock</td><td>2587 MHz (Reference Card: 2572 MHz)</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>Memory Clock</td><td>20 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>Bus Type</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>PCI Express</td><td>PCI-E 5.0</td></tr><tr><td>Display Output</td><td>DisplayPort</td><td>1 × DisplayPort 2.1b, 1 × DisplayPort 1.4a</td></tr><tr><td>Display Output</td><td>HDMI</td><td>2 × HDMI 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td>Display Support</td><td>Multi-Display</td><td>Supports Up to 4 Displays</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Connector</td><td>1 × 8-Pin</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>550W</td></tr><tr><td>API Support</td><td>DirectX</td><td>DirectX 12 API</td></tr><tr><td>API Support</td><td>OpenGL</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling &amp; Features</td><td>Architecture</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell Architecture with DLSS 4</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling &amp; Features</td><td>Cooling Technology</td><td>Server-Grade Thermal Conductive Gel, Graphene Nano Lubricant</td></tr><tr><td>Design</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Low Profile</td></tr><tr><td>Design</td><td>PCB Form</td><td>ATX</td></tr><tr><td>Physical</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>182 × 69 × 36 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>3 Years</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 41800.00, 41800.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/mfcPZIAoKes86jBVo5fbLasqWihvOd9CvVvzzRhd.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 07:14:04', '2026-07-10 07:18:17', 'GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5050 OC Low Profile 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy the GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5050 OC Low Profile 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, DLSS 4, 2560 CUDA cores, PCIe 5.0, low-profile design, and 3-year warranty.', 'GIGABYTE RTX 5050 OC Low Profile 8GB, GIGABYTE RTX 5050 Price in Bangladesh, RTX 5050 Graphics Card, GIGABYTE