(1094, 'GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5060 EAGLE OC ICE 8G GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5060 EAGLE OC ICE 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card delivers exceptional gaming and creative performance with NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 3840 CUDA cores, ultra-fast GDDR7 memory, WINDFORCE cooling, and a stylish white ICE design for modern gaming PCs.', 'gigabyte-geforce-rtx-5060-eagle-oc-ice-8g-gddr7-graphics-card-1783667737', '<h2>GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5060 EAGLE OC ICE 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card</h2><p>The <strong>GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5060 EAGLE OC ICE 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> is a powerful next-generation graphics solution built for gamers, creators, and PC enthusiasts seeking high performance, advanced AI technologies, and an eye-catching white design. Powered by the latest <strong>NVIDIA Blackwell architecture</strong>, this graphics card delivers outstanding graphics performance for modern AAA games, content creation, AI applications, and professional workloads.</p><p>Featuring <strong>3840 CUDA cores</strong> and a factory-overclocked <strong>2550 MHz boost clock</strong>, the RTX 5060 EAGLE OC ICE provides smooth gameplay, fast rendering, and responsive multitasking. Its <strong>8GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory</strong> running at <strong>28 Gbps</strong> over a <strong>128-bit memory interface</strong> offers excellent bandwidth for demanding games, high-resolution textures, and creative applications.</p><p>Built on the latest <strong>PCI Express 5.0 x16</strong> interface, the graphics card supports cutting-edge technologies including <strong>DLSS 4</strong>, <strong>NVIDIA Reflex 2</strong>, <strong>NVIDIA Studio</strong>, <strong>DirectX 12 Ultimate</strong>, and <strong>OpenGL 4.6</strong>. These features provide AI-powered frame generation, ultra-low latency, realistic ray tracing, and optimized performance for gaming, streaming, video editing, 3D rendering, and AI-assisted creative workflows.</p><p>The advanced <strong>WINDFORCE Cooling System</strong> features dual alternate-spinning Hawk fans, composite copper heat pipes, a large heatsink, and <strong>3D Active Fan Technology</strong>, ensuring efficient heat dissipation and quiet operation even during heavy gaming sessions. The elegant <strong>ICE white finish</strong> and futuristic EAGLE design make this graphics card an ideal choice for white-themed gaming PCs and premium custom builds.</p><p>For connectivity, the card includes <strong>3 × DisplayPort 2.1b</strong> and <strong>1 × HDMI 2.1b</strong>, supporting up to <strong>four displays</strong> simultaneously with a maximum resolution of <strong>7680 × 4320 (8K)</strong>. Measuring just <strong>208 × 120 × 40 mm</strong>, its compact dual-slot design fits comfortably into most modern desktop cases. Powered through a <strong>single 8-pin connector</strong>, it requires a <strong>550W power supply</strong>, making it suitable for a wide range of gaming systems.</p><p>Whether you\'re building a stylish white gaming PC, upgrading your workstation, or creating content with AI-accelerated applications, the <strong>GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5060 EAGLE OC ICE 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> offers the perfect combination of speed, efficiency, advanced graphics technologies, and premium design.</p><h2>Buy GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5060 EAGLE OC ICE 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card from International Office Solution</h2><p>Purchase the <strong>GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5060 EAGLE OC ICE 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> and enjoy genuine GIGABYTE products, competitive pricing, and dependable customer support. We offer a wide selection of authentic GIGABYTE graphics cards for gaming, professional content creation, AI workloads, and workstation applications. Order online or visit <strong>International Office Solution</strong> to get the best deal. The graphics card comes with a <strong>3-year manufacturing warranty</strong>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feat