ngth, it fits easily into most modern cases. It requires a single 8-pin power connector and a minimum 550W power supply, making it accessible for a wide range of system configurations. Supporting the latest technologies like DLSS 4, NVIDIA Reflex 2, DirectX 12 Ultimate, and NVIDIA Studio, the Gigabyte RTX 5060 EAGLE OC ICE delivers cutting-edge graphics, ultra-low latency, and accelerated creative tools. Whether you\'re upgrading your gaming rig or building a stylish, high-performance workstation, the GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5060 EAGLE OC ICE 8G GDDR7 Graphics Card offers a perfect blend of power, efficiency, and futuristic design.\r\n\r\nBuy GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5060 EAGLE OC ICE 8G GDDR7 Graphics Card from Star Tech\r\nIn Bangladesh, you can get original GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5060 EAGLE OC ICE 8G GDDR7 Graphics Card From Star Tech. We have a large collection of latest GIGABYTE Graphics Card to purchase for your Desktop PC. Order Online Or Visit your Nearest Star Tech Shop to get yours at lowest price. The GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5060 EAGLE OC ICE 8G GDDR7 Graphics Card comes with 3 years warranty.', 'GIGABYTE RTX 5060 EAGLE OC ICE 8GB, GIGABYTE RTX 5060 Price in Bangladesh, RTX 5060 GDDR7 Graphics Card, GIGABYTE Graphics Card BD, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, DLSS 4 Graphics Card, RTX 5060 White GPU, PCIe 5.0 Graphics Card, International Office Solution', NULL, 15, NULL, NULL),
(1095, 'GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5060 EAGLE OC 8G GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5060 EAGLE OC 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card combines NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 3840 CUDA cores, ultra-fast GDDR7 memory, PCIe 5.0 support, and WINDFORCE cooling to deliver exceptional gaming and content creation performance.', 'gigabyte-geforce-rtx-5060-eagle-oc-8g-gddr7-graphics-card-1783667831', '<h2>GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5060 EAGLE OC 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card</h2><p>The <strong>GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5060 EAGLE OC 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> is built for gamers, creators, and professionals seeking next-generation graphics performance with excellent efficiency and reliability. Powered by the latest <strong>NVIDIA Blackwell architecture</strong>, this graphics card delivers advanced AI acceleration, real-time ray tracing, and exceptional gaming performance for modern AAA titles and demanding creative workloads.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>3840 CUDA cores</strong> and a <strong>2550 MHz factory-overclocked core clock</strong>, the RTX 5060 EAGLE OC provides smooth gameplay, fast rendering, and responsive multitasking. Its <strong>8GB of GDDR7 memory</strong> running at <strong>28 Gbps</strong> over a <strong>128-bit memory interface</strong> ensures outstanding bandwidth for high-resolution gaming, video editing, 3D rendering, AI applications, and professional content creation.</p><p>Built on the latest <strong>PCI Express 5.0</strong> interface, the graphics card delivers high-speed communication between the GPU and motherboard for maximum system performance. It also supports the latest NVIDIA technologies including <strong>DLSS 4</strong>, <strong>NVIDIA Reflex 2</strong>, and <strong>NVIDIA Studio</strong>, providing AI-powered frame generation, ultra-low latency, enhanced graphics quality, and optimized performance for creative software.</p><p>The advanced <strong>GIGABYTE WINDFORCE dual-fan cooling system</strong> efficiently dissipates heat while maintaining low noise