(1096, 'Razer Enki X Gaming Chair iosbd', 'The Razer Enki X Gaming Chair features a 21-inch ultra-wide seat, 110° shoulder arches, built-in lumbar support, 152° reclining backrest, 2D adjustable armrests, dual-textured synthetic leather, and a steel-reinforced frame supporting up to 136kg. Designed for gamers, professionals, and creators who demand lasting ergonomic comfort.', 'razer-enki-x-gaming-chair-iosbd-1783667866', '<p>The Razer Enki X Gaming Chair is a premium ergonomic gaming chair engineered to provide exceptional all-day comfort, support, and durability for gamers, streamers, content creators, and professionals. Designed with Razer\'s signature ergonomic philosophy, the Enki X combines premium materials, intelligent weight distribution, and essential adjustment features to keep you comfortable during long gaming sessions, workdays, or entertainment.</p><p>One of the standout features of the Razer Enki X is its 21-inch ultra-wide seat base, which evenly distributes body weight and provides ample seating space for maximum comfort. Combined with 110° extended shoulder arches, the chair encourages a natural sitting posture while offering excellent upper body support, reducing fatigue during extended use.</p><p>The chair incorporates a built-in lumbar arch that follows the natural curve of the lower spine, providing continuous lumbar support without requiring an additional cushion. This ergonomic design helps maintain proper posture and minimizes lower back strain during long hours of sitting.</p><p>Unlike conventional gaming chairs, the Enki X features optimized cushion density, offering a plush seat base for superior comfort while maintaining a firmer backrest that provides excellent spinal support. This balanced cushioning ensures lasting comfort without sacrificing ergonomic stability.</p><p>The chair is upholstered in dual-textured synthetic leather, combining soft textured materials in key contact areas for enhanced comfort with smooth synthetic leather around the edges for improved durability and easier maintenance. The premium finish offers a sleek appearance while resisting everyday wear.</p><p>The 152° adjustable reclining backrest allows users to transition effortlessly between focused gaming, productive work, movie watching, or relaxing. The 2D adjustable armrests can be customized for height and rotation, helping reduce strain on the shoulders, elbows, and wrists during prolonged gaming or typing.</p><p>Constructed with a steel-reinforced frame and durable base, the Razer Enki X delivers outstanding structural stability and long-lasting reliability. It supports users weighing up to 136kg (299 lbs) and is recommended for users with heights ranging from 156.5cm to 194cm, making it suitable for a wide variety of body types.</p><p>With its premium ergonomics, durable construction, and elegant minimalist design, the Razer Enki X Gaming Chair is an excellent investment for anyone seeking premium comfort and reliable performance without unnecessary complexity.</p><p>Buy Razer Enki X Gaming Chair from International Office Solution Purchase the original Razer Enki X Gaming Chair from International Office Solution, your trusted supplier of genuine gaming chairs, office furniture, and premium workspace solutions in Bangladesh.</p><p>We offer authentic Razer products at competitive prices with dependable customer support and nationwide delivery. Order online or contact International Office Solution for the latest price, product availability, and delivery information.</p><p>Warranty: Please contact International Office Solution for warranty details.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Brand</td><td>Razer</td></tr><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Model</td><td>Enki X</td></tr><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Product Type</td><td>