(1097, 'Razer Enki X EDGE Special Edition Gaming Chair iosbd', 'The Razer Enki X EDGE Special Edition Gaming Chair features a 21-inch ultra-wide seat, 110° shoulder arches, built-in lumbar support, 152° reclining backrest, 2D adjustable armrests, high-density foam, dual-textured EPU synthetic leather, steel-reinforced frame, and 60mm PU-coated caster wheels. Supporting up to 136kg, it\'s perfect for gaming, streaming, office work, and long hours of comfortable seating.', 'razer-enki-x-edge-special-edition-gaming-chair-iosbd-1783668212', '<p>The Razer Enki X EDGE Special Edition Gaming Chair is a premium ergonomic gaming chair that combines Razer\'s renowned comfort with exclusive EDGE Special Edition styling. Designed for gamers, streamers, esports enthusiasts, and professionals, this chair delivers exceptional support, durability, and a bold gaming aesthetic that enhances any gaming room or workspace.</p><p>Built around Razer\'s ergonomic seating philosophy, the chair features a 21-inch ultra-wide seat base and 110° extended shoulder arches, providing balanced weight distribution and natural body support during long gaming sessions or workdays. The wide seat allows greater freedom of movement while maintaining excellent posture and comfort.</p><p>The chair includes a built-in lumbar arch that follows the natural curve of your lower back, promoting a healthy sitting posture and reducing fatigue without requiring a separate lumbar cushion. Combined with high-density molded foam cushions, the Enki X EDGE offers a soft yet supportive seating experience that maintains its shape even after years of regular use.</p><p>Wrapped in dual-textured EPU synthetic leather, the chair delivers a premium look and feel while offering excellent durability, resistance to wear, and easy maintenance. The breathable inner seating surface enhances comfort, while the reinforced outer panels improve long-term durability.</p><p>The 152° adjustable reclining backrest allows users to switch effortlessly between focused gaming, productive work, relaxing, or watching movies. The 2D adjustable armrests provide customizable height and angle adjustments to reduce wrist, elbow, and shoulder strain during extended gaming or office use.</p><p>Constructed with a steel-reinforced frame, the chair offers outstanding structural strength and supports users weighing up to 136kg (299 lbs). Smooth 60mm PU-coated caster wheels ensure quiet movement and excellent floor protection while allowing effortless mobility across different surfaces.</p><p>Exclusive to the EDGE Special Edition, this model features a striking Black and Red color scheme accented by the iconic Razer triple-headed snake logo and exclusive EDGE branding, creating a premium esports-inspired appearance that stands out in any gaming environment.</p><p>Whether you\'re climbing the competitive ranks, streaming to your audience, or working from home, the Razer Enki X EDGE Special Edition Gaming Chair delivers premium comfort, ergonomic support, and signature Razer style without compromise.</p><p>Buy Razer Enki X EDGE Special Edition Gaming Chair from International Office Solution Purchase the original Razer Enki X EDGE Special Edition Gaming Chair from International Office Solution, a trusted supplier of genuine gaming chairs, premium office furniture, and IT accessories in Bangladesh.</p><p>We offer authentic Razer products at competitive prices with reliable customer service and nationwide delivery. Order online or contact International Office Solution for the latest price, product availability, and delivery information across Bangladesh.</p><p>Warranty: No Warranty</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Brand</td><td>Razer</td></tr><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Model</td><td>Enki X EDGE Special Edition</td></tr><tr><td><st