nal Razer Enki X EDGE Special Edition Gaming Chair in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features ergonomic design, built-in lumbar support, 152° recline, 2D armrests, EPU leather, and 136kg capacity.', 'Razer Enki X EDGE Special Edition Gaming Chair,\r\nRazer Enki X EDGE,\r\nRazer Enki X Special Edition,\r\nRazer Gaming Chair Bangladesh,\r\nRazer Gaming Chair Price,\r\nRazer Chair Bangladesh,\r\nGaming Chair Price in Bangladesh,\r\nGaming Chair BD,\r\nPremium Gaming Chair,\r\nErgonomic Gaming Chair,\r\nGaming Chair with Lumbar Support,\r\nGaming Chair with 152 Degree Recline,\r\nGaming Chair with 2D Armrests,\r\nGaming Chair with EPU Leather,\r\nGaming Chair with Steel Frame,\r\nGaming Chair 136kg,\r\nGaming Chair for PC,\r\nGaming Chair for Office,\r\nGaming Chair for Streamers,\r\nLuxury Gaming Chair,\r\nEsports Gaming Chair,\r\nGaming Furniture Bangladesh,\r\nOffice Chair Bangladesh,\r\nGaming Chair Online Bangladesh,\r\nOriginal Razer Gaming Chair,\r\nInternational Office Solution', NULL, 226, NULL, NULL),
(1098, 'GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5060 Ti EAGLE OC 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5060 Ti EAGLE OC 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card is powered by NVIDIA\'s Blackwell architecture with 4608 CUDA cores and a 2617MHz factory overclocked boost clock. Equipped with 8GB GDDR7 memory running at 28Gbps, PCIe 5.0 support, and the WINDFORCE cooling system, it delivers outstanding performance for 1080p and 1440p gaming, AI applications, content creation, and ray tracing. The card also supports DLSS 4, NVIDIA Reflex 2, DirectX 12 Ultimate, and 8K display output.', 'gigabyte-geforce-rtx-5060-ti-eagle-oc-8gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783668252', '<p>The <strong>GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5060 Ti EAGLE OC 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> is designed to deliver exceptional gaming and creative performance using NVIDIA\'s latest Blackwell architecture. Featuring <strong>4608 CUDA cores</strong>, a factory-overclocked <strong>2617MHz boost clock</strong>, and <strong>8GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory</strong> operating at <strong>28Gbps</strong>, this graphics card provides outstanding speed and responsiveness for modern AAA games, AI workloads, video editing, 3D rendering, and streaming.</p><p>Built on the <strong>PCI Express 5.0 x16</strong> interface, the RTX 5060 Ti EAGLE OC offers a memory bandwidth of <strong>448GB/s</strong>, ensuring smooth gameplay and fast data processing. The advanced <strong>WINDFORCE dual-fan cooling system</strong>, composite copper heat pipes, and server-grade thermal conductive gel keep temperatures under control while maintaining quiet operation.</p><p>Supporting <strong>NVIDIA DLSS 4</strong>, <strong>NVIDIA Reflex 2</strong>, <strong>NVIDIA Studio</strong>, <strong>DirectX 12 Ultimate</strong>, and <strong>OpenGL 4.6</strong>, the card enhances gaming visuals, reduces latency, and accelerates creative workflows. It features <strong>3 DisplayPort 2.1b</strong>, <strong>1 HDMI 2.1b</strong>, supports up to <strong>8K (7680×4320) resolution</strong>, and can drive <strong>four displays simultaneously</strong>. Compact, efficient, and future-ready, the GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5060 Ti EAGLE OC 8GB is an excellent choice for gamers, creators, and PC enthusiasts.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Specification</th><th>Details</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 Ti</td></tr><tr><td>Architecture</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>4608</td></tr><tr><td>Core Clock</td><td>2617 MHz (OC Edition)</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>8GB GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Speed</td><td>28 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Bus</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Interface</td><td>PCI Express 5.0 x16</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Bandwidth</td><td>448 GB/s</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum Resolution</td><td>7680 × 4320</td></tr><tr><td>DisplayPort</td><td>3 × DisplayPort 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>1 × HDMI 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td>Multi-Display Support</td><td>Up to 4 Displays</td></tr><tr><td>Power Connector</td><td>1 × 8-pin</td></tr><tr><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>650W</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling System</td><td>WINDFORCE Dual-Fan Cooling</td></tr><tr><td>DirectX</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td>OpenGL</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td>AI Technologies</td><td>NVIDIA DLSS 4, NVIDIA Reflex 2, NVIDIA Studio</td></tr><tr><td>Dimensions</td><td>215 × 122 × 40 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Form Factor</td><td>ATX</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p>', 'Graphics Card', 67000.00, 67000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/6C4in2JK3YG8Nomna5N2brAAswATW8QEAz8XraNm.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 07:24:12', '2026-07-10 07:24:12', 'GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5060 Ti EAGLE OC 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'Buy the GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5060 Ti EAGLE OC 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card featuring 4608 CUDA cores, 2617MHz boost clock, 8GB GDDR7 memory, PCIe 5.0, WINDFORCE cooling, DLSS 4, NVIDIA Reflex 2, and 3-year warranty.', 'The GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5060 Ti EAGLE OC 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card is designed to deliver exceptional gaming and creative performance using NVIDIA\'s latest Blackwell architecture. Featuring 4608 CUDA cores, a factory-overclocked 2617MHz boost clock, and 8GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory operating at 28Gbps, this graphics card provides outstanding speed and responsiveness for modern AAA games, AI workloads, video editing, 3D rendering, and streaming.\r\n\r\nBuilt on the PCI Express 5.0 x16 interface, the RTX 5060 Ti EAGLE OC offers a memory bandwidth of 448GB/s, ensuring smooth gameplay and fast data processing. The advanced WINDFORCE dual-fan cooling system, composite copper heat pipes, and server-grade thermal conductive gel keep temperatures under control while maintaining quiet operation.\r\n\r\nSupporting NVIDIA DLSS 4, NVIDIA Reflex 2, NVIDIA Studio, DirectX 12 Ultimate, and OpenGL 4.6, the card enhances gaming visuals, reduces latency, and accelerates creative workflows. It features 3 DisplayPort 2.1b, 1 HDMI 2.1b, supports up to 8K (7680×4320) resolution, and can drive four displays simultaneously. Compact, efficient, and future-ready, the GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5060 Ti EAGLE OC 8GB is an excellent choice for gamers, creators, and PC enthusiasts.', NULL, 15, NULL, NULL),
(1099, 'GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5060 Ti WINDFORCE OC 8G GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5060 Ti WINDFORCE OC 8G GDDR7 Graphics Card is built for gamers and creators seeking powerful next-generation performance. Powered by the NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, it features 4608 CUDA cores, 8GB GDDR7 memory, a 2587MHz boost clock, and PCIe 5.0 support for exceptional gaming and content creation performance. The advanced WINDFORCE cooling system ensures stable temperatures during heavy workloads, while support for DLSS 4, Ray Tracing, NVIDIA Reflex, and DirectX 12 Ultimate delivers immersive visuals and ultra-low latency. With DisplayPort 2.1b, HDMI 2.1b, and support for 8K displays, this GPU is an excellent choice for modern gaming systems.', 'gigabyte-geforce-rtx-5060-ti-windforce-oc-8g-gddr7-graphics-card-1783668346', '<p>The <strong>GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5060 Ti WINDFORCE OC 8G GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> delivers cutting-edge gaming and creative performance powered by NVIDIA\'s latest <strong>Blackwell architecture</strong>. Designed for enthusiasts who demand smooth gameplay, AI acceleration, and efficient cooling, this graphics card combines premium components with advanced technologies to handle today\'s most demanding applications.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>4608 CUDA cores</strong> and an overclocked <strong>2587MHz boost frequency</strong>, the RTX 5060 Ti offers impressive performance for modern AAA games, esports titles, AI workloads, video editing, and 3D rendering. The <strong>8GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory</strong> running at <strong>28Gbps</strong> over a <strong>128-bit interface</strong> provides the bandwidth required for high-resolution textures, real-time rendering, and seamless multitasking.</p><p>Built on the <strong>PCI Express 5.0</strong> interface, the card ensures maximum bandwidth for future-ready systems. NVIDIA technologies including <strong>DLSS 4</strong>, <strong>Ray Tracing</strong>, <strong>Reflex</strong>, and <strong>Studio Drivers</strong> deliver AI-enhanced graphics, realistic lighting, lower system latency, and accelerated productivity for creators.</p><p>Thermal performance is handled by GIGABYTE\'s renowned <strong>WINDFORCE cooling system</strong>, featuring dual alternate-spinning fans, composite copper heat pipes, optimized heatsinks, and premium thermal materials. This cooling solution maintains lower temperatures while minimizing noise, ensuring reliable performance during extended gaming sessions.</p><p>For display connectivity, the graphics card offers <strong>three DisplayPort 2.1b outputs</strong> and <strong>one HDMI 2.1b port</strong>, supporting up to <strong>four displays</strong> simultaneously with a maximum digital resolution of <strong>7680 × 4320 (8K)</strong>. The compact <strong>208mm dual-slot design</strong> makes installation easy in most ATX and mid-tower PC cases.</p><p>Whether you\'re building a high-performance gaming PC, a streaming setup, or a professional content creation workstation, the <strong>GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5060 Ti WINDFORCE OC 8G</strong> delivers outstanding performance, AI-powered features, efficient cooling, and long-term reliability backed by a <strong>3-year manufacturer warranty</strong>.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Model</strong></td><td>GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5060 Ti WINDFORCE OC 8G</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Graphics Processing Unit</strong></td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 Ti (Blackwell Architecture)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Video Memory</strong></td><td>8GB GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>4608</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock</strong></td><td>2587 MHz (OC Edition)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Reference Boost Clock</strong></td><td>2572 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock</strong></td><td>28 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Interface</strong></td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Bus Interface</strong></td><td>PCI Express 5.0</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Maximum Resolution</strong></td><td>7680 × 4320 (8K)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>3 × DisplayPort 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td><strong>HDMI</strong></td><td>1 × HDMI 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Maximum Displays</strong></td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connector</strong></td><td>1 × 8-pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</strong></td><td>650W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling System</strong></td><td>WINDFORCE Dual Fan Cooling</td></tr><tr><td><strong>DirectX Support</strong></td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OpenGL Support</strong></td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AI Technologies</strong></td><td>NVIDIA DLSS 4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Gaming Technologies</strong></td><td>NVIDIA Reflex, Ray Tracing</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Creator Features</strong></td><td>NVIDIA Studio</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Card Dimensions</strong></td><td>208 × 120 × 40 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>ATX</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>3 Years Manufacturer Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 62500.00, 62500.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/46Eo1eMnhWl1w5CmeQvmztjFFYspJVNRtiL5kSEA.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 07:25:46', '2026-07-10 07:25:46', 'GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5060 Ti WINDFORCE OC 8G GDDR7 Graphics Card Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy the GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5060 Ti WINDFORCE OC 8G GDDR7 Graphics Card in Bangladesh at the best price. Features 8GB GDDR7 memory, 4608 CUDA cores, WINDFORCE cooling, PCIe 5.0, DLSS 4, Ray Tracing, and 3-year warranty.', 'GIGABYTE RTX 5060 Ti WINDFORCE OC 8G, RTX 5060 Ti 8GB Price in Bangladesh, Gigabyte RTX 5060 Ti, RTX 5060 Ti GDDR7, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, RTX 5060 Ti Graphics Card BD, Gigabyte Graphics Card, RTX 5060 Ti DLSS 4, PCIe 5.0 Graphics Card, Gaming GPU Bangladesh, RTX 5060 Ti WINDFORCE, RTX 5060 Ti OC, Best GPU for 1440p Gaming, AI Graphics Card, Ray Tracing Graphics Card, Gigabyte RTX 5060 Ti Price BD, RTX 5060 Ti 8GB GDDR7, Creator Graphics Card, NVIDIA RTX 50 Series, Gaming Graphics Card Bangladesh', NULL, 15, NULL, NULL),
(1100, 'GIGABYTE Radeon RX 9060 XT GAMING OC 16G GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The GIGABYTE Radeon RX 9060 XT GAMING OC 16G GDDR6 Graphics Card is a powerful next-generation GPU built for high-performance gaming and creative workloads. Featuring 2048 Stream Processors, 16GB GDDR6 memory, a boost clock up to 3320MHz, and PCIe 5.0 x16 support, it delivers exceptional performance for modern AAA games, content creation, and multitasking. Supporting DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6, and 8K resolution, the card also includes GIGABYTE\'s advanced cooling solution for reliable and quiet operation during demanding workloads.', 'gigabyte-radeon-rx-9060-xt-gaming-oc-16g-gddr6-graphics-card-1783668545', '<p>The <strong>GIGABYTE Radeon RX 9060 XT GAMING OC 16G GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong> is engineered to deliver outstanding gaming performance, advanced graphics technologies, and reliable cooling for gamers, streamers, and content creators. Powered by AMD\'s latest <strong>Radeon RX 9060 XT GPU</strong>, this graphics card combines high clock speeds, generous memory capacity, and PCIe 5.0 connectivity to provide smooth gameplay and accelerated creative performance.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>2048 Stream Processors</strong>, the graphics card reaches an impressive <strong>boost clock of up to 3320MHz</strong> and a <strong>game clock of up to 2780MHz</strong>, providing fast rendering speeds and responsive performance in modern games and professional applications. The <strong>16GB GDDR6 memory</strong> running at <strong>20Gbps</strong> on a <strong>128-bit memory interface</strong> delivers fast data throughput, making it ideal for high-resolution gaming, video editing, 3D modeling, and multitasking.</p><p>Built on the <strong>PCI-Express 5.0 x16 interface</strong>, the RX 9060 XT GAMING OC ensures maximum bandwidth for today\'s latest desktop platforms while remaining future-ready. Support for <strong>DirectX 12 Ultimate</strong> and <strong>OpenGL 4.6</strong> enables advanced graphics rendering, realistic visual effects, and excellent compatibility with modern gaming engines and professional software.</p><p>The graphics card supports an impressive maximum resolution of <strong>7680 × 4320 (8K)</strong> and can drive up to <strong>three displays</strong> simultaneously through <strong>two DisplayPort 2.1a</strong> outputs and <strong>one HDMI 2.1b</strong> port. This makes it an excellent choice for immersive gaming, productivity, streaming, and multi-monitor workstations.</p><p>GIGABYTE\'s premium cooling solution keeps temperatures under control during extended gaming sessions while maintaining low noise levels. Despite its powerful performance, the card remains energy efficient with a single <strong>8-pin power connector</strong> and a recommended <strong>450W power supply</strong>, simplifying system upgrades.</p><p>Whether you\'re building a high-end gaming PC or a professional content creation workstation, the <strong>GIGABYTE Radeon RX 9060 XT GAMING OC 16G</strong> offers an excellent combination of speed, efficiency, advanced features, and long-term reliability backed by a <strong>3-year manufacturer warranty</strong>.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Model</strong></td><td>GIGABYTE Radeon RX 9060 XT GAMING OC 16G</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Graphics Processing Unit</strong></td><td>AMD Radeon RX 9060 XT</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Architecture</strong></td><td>AMD RDNA 4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Video Memory</strong></td><td>16GB GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Stream Processors</strong></td><td>2048</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Boost Clock</strong></td><td>Up to 3320 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Game Clock</strong></td><td>Up to 2780 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock</strong></td><td>20 Gbps Effective</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus</strong></td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Interface</strong></td><td>PCI-Express 5.0 x16</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Maximum Resolution</strong></td><td>7680 × 4320 (8K)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>2 × DisplayPort 2.1a</td></tr><tr><td><strong>HDMI</strong></td><td>1 × HDMI 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Maximum Displays</strong></td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connector</strong></td><td>1 × 8-pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</strong></td><td>450W Minimum</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Solution</strong></td><td>GIGABYTE GAMING OC Cooling System</td></tr><tr><td><strong>DirectX Support</strong></td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OpenGL Support</strong></td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Bus Interface</strong></td><td>PCIe 5.0 x16</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Card Dimensions</strong></td><td>281 × 118 × 40 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>ATX</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ideal For</strong></td><td>1440p &amp; 4K Gaming, Streaming, Content Creation, Video Editing, 3D Rendering</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>3 Years Manufacturer Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 68900.00, 68900.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/s7iQftWoowW5vRghvgRW3qinw3p884MWNFhmVtVQ.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 07:29:05', '2026-07-10 07:29:05', 'GIGABYTE Radeon RX 9060 XT GAMING OC 16G GDDR6 Graphics Card Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy the GIGABYTE Radeon RX 9060 XT GAMING OC 16G Graphics Card in Bangladesh at the best price. Features 16GB GDDR6 memory, 2048 Stream Processors, PCIe 5.0, Gaming OC cooling, up to 3320MHz boost clock, and 3-year warranty.', 'GIGABYTE Radeon RX 9060 XT GAMING OC 16G, RX 9060 XT 16GB Price in Bangladesh, Radeon RX 9060 XT, AMD RX 9060 XT Graphics Card, Gigabyte RX 9060 XT, RX 9060 XT Gaming OC, RX 9060 XT 16GB GDDR6, AMD RDNA 4 Graphics Card, PCIe 5.0 Graphics Card, Gaming GPU Bangladesh, RX 9060 XT OC Edition, 16GB Graphics Card, Best AMD GPU for Gaming, Gigabyte Graphics Card BD, RX 9060 XT 8K Graphics Card, Creator Graphics Card, AMD Radeon Graphics Card, RX 9060 XT Bangladesh Price, Gaming Graphics Card Bangladesh, AMD GPU 16GB', NULL, 15, NULL, NULL),
(1101, 'GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5060 Ti WINDFORCE MAX OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5060 Ti WINDFORCE MAX OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card delivers exceptional gaming and creative performance with NVIDIA\'s Blackwell architecture. Featuring 4608 CUDA cores, 16GB GDDR7 memory, a 2587MHz boost clock, and PCIe 5.0 support, this GPU is built for high-refresh-rate gaming, AI-powered applications, and professional content creation. Equipped with the advanced WINDFORCE cooling system, DLSS 4, Ray Tracing, and support for 8K displays, it provides reliable performance and immersive visuals for modern PC builds.', 'gigabyte-geforce-rtx-5060-ti-windforce-max-oc-16gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783668637', '<p>The <strong>GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5060 Ti WINDFORCE MAX OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> is engineered to deliver next-generation graphics performance for gamers, content creators, streamers, and AI enthusiasts. Powered by NVIDIA\'s latest <strong>Blackwell architecture</strong>, this graphics card combines AI-enhanced rendering, ultra-fast memory, and advanced cooling technology to provide outstanding performance across modern games and professional creative applications.</p><p>At the heart of the GPU are <strong>4608 CUDA cores</strong> operating at a factory-overclocked <strong>2587MHz boost frequency</strong>, offering fast rendering, responsive gameplay, and accelerated computing performance. The card is equipped with <strong>16GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory</strong> running at <strong>28Gbps</strong> over a <strong>128-bit memory interface</strong>, delivering excellent bandwidth for demanding AAA games, 3D rendering, video editing, AI workloads, and multitasking.</p><p>Built on the latest <strong>PCI Express 5.0</strong> interface, the RTX 5060 Ti WINDFORCE MAX OC offers increased bandwidth and future-ready compatibility with modern desktop platforms. NVIDIA\'s latest technologies including <strong>DLSS 4</strong>, <strong>Ray Tracing</strong>, <strong>NVIDIA Reflex</strong>, and <strong>Studio Drivers</strong> provide AI-powered image enhancement, realistic lighting, ultra-low latency gaming, and optimized performance for professional content creation.</p><p>The card features GIGABYTE\'s advanced <strong>WINDFORCE cooling system</strong>, incorporating Hawk fans, premium thermal conductive gel, optimized heatsinks, and reinforced construction to maintain low operating temperatures and quiet performance during extended gaming or rendering sessions.</p><p>Supporting a maximum digital resolution of <strong>7680 × 4320 (8K)</strong>, the graphics card includes <strong>three DisplayPort 2.1b</strong> outputs and <strong>one HDMI 2.1b</strong> port, allowing users to connect up to <strong>four displays</strong> simultaneously for immersive gaming, streaming, productivity, and professional workflows.</p><p>Despite its powerful capabilities, the graphics card requires only a <strong>single 8-pin power connector</strong> with a recommended <strong>650W power supply</strong>, making it compatible with a wide range of modern gaming systems. The compact <strong>208mm dual-slot ATX design</strong> also ensures broad compatibility with most mid-tower and full-tower PC cases.</p><p>Whether you\'re upgrading your gaming setup, building a powerful AI workstation, or creating a professional content creation PC, the <strong>GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5060 Ti WINDFORCE MAX OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> delivers outstanding performance, advanced AI technologies, efficient cooling, and long-term reliability backed by a <strong>3-y</strong></p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Model</strong></td><td>GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5060 Ti WINDFORCE MAX OC 16GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Graphics Processing Unit</strong></td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 Ti (Blackwell Architecture)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Video Memory</strong></td><td>