 GDDR7 Graphics Card in Bangladesh at the best price. Features 16GB GDDR7 memory, 4608 CUDA cores, PCIe 5.0, WINDFORCE cooling, DLSS 4, Ray Tracing, AI acceleration, and a 3-year warranty.', 'GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5060 Ti WINDFORCE MAX OC 16GB, RTX 5060 Ti 16GB Price in Bangladesh, Gigabyte RTX 5060 Ti 16GB, RTX 5060 Ti WINDFORCE MAX OC, NVIDIA RTX 5060 Ti GDDR7, RTX 5060 Ti DLSS 4, RTX 5060 Ti Blackwell GPU, Gigabyte Graphics Card BD, RTX 5060 Ti 16GB GDDR7, PCIe 5.0 Graphics Card, AI Graphics Card, Ray Tracing Graphics Card, Gaming GPU Bangladesh, RTX 5060 Ti OC Edition, NVIDIA Studio Graphics Card, Creator GPU, 8K Graphics Card, Best GPU for 1440p Gaming, RTX 5060 Ti Bangladesh, GIGABYTE RTX 5060 Ti WINDFORCE', NULL, 15, NULL, NULL),
(1102, 'Corsair TC100 RELAXED Fabric Gaming Chair iosbd', 'The Corsair TC100 RELAXED Fabric Gaming Chair features breathable plush fabric upholstery, perforated cooling panels, 100mm Class 4 gas lift, 90°–160° reclining backrest, 2D adjustable armrests, and a wide relaxed seat design. Ideal for gaming, office work, streaming, and extended sitting with exceptional comfort and ergonomic support.', 'corsair-tc100-relaxed-fabric-gaming-chair-iosbd-1783668699', '<p>The Corsair TC100 RELAXED Fabric Gaming Chair is a premium ergonomic gaming and office chair designed for gamers, streamers, professionals, and content creators who demand superior comfort during long hours of work or gaming. Featuring a relaxed seating profile, breathable fabric upholstery, and a wide range of ergonomic adjustments, the TC100 RELAXED delivers exceptional support for every session.</p><p>Unlike traditional gaming chairs, the Corsair TC100 RELAXED is upholstered in plush soft fabric with strategically placed perforated fabric panels that improve airflow and help keep you cool during extended gaming marathons or workdays. The breathable fabric surface provides a soft, comfortable feel while maintaining excellent durability and resistance to daily wear.</p><p>Designed with Corsair\'s RELAXED seating profile, the chair features a wider seat base and broader contact points, allowing users to sit comfortably in multiple positions without feeling restricted. Whether you\'re focused on competitive gaming, attending virtual meetings, or relaxing with a movie, the chair provides outstanding support throughout the day.</p><p>The chair is equipped with a premium Class 4 gas lift offering 100mm of height adjustment, making it easy to find the perfect seating position for users of different heights and desk configurations. This ergonomic adjustment promotes better posture by allowing your feet to remain flat on the floor for maximum comfort and stability.</p><p>The 2D adjustable armrests can be moved up, down, inward, and outward, enabling personalized support for your wrists, elbows, and shoulders. This helps reduce strain during prolonged gaming, typing, or office work.</p><p>One of the standout features of the Corsair TC100 RELAXED Fabric Gaming Chair is its 90°–160° reclining backrest, allowing users to transition effortlessly between upright productivity, relaxed gaming, or nearly flat reclining for breaks. Whether you\'re working long hours or taking a well-deserved rest, the adjustable recline provides exceptional flexibility.</p><p>Built on a sturdy frame with a durable five-star base and smooth-rolling caster wheels, the chair offers excellent stability and effortless mobility. Every component is engineered to provide long-lasting durability while maintaining Corsair\'s premium build quality.</p><p>With its breathable fabric finish, ergonomic design, customizable adjustments, and spacious seating, the Corsair TC100 RELAXED Fabric Gaming Chair is the ideal choice for gamers, remote workers, office professionals, and anyone seeking premium comfort throughout the day.</p><p>Buy Corsair TC100 RELAXED Fabric Gaming Chair from International Office Solution Purchase the original Corsair TC100 RELAXED Fabric Gaming Chair from International Office Solution, your trusted supplier of genuine gaming chairs, office furniture, and premium workspace solutions in Bangladesh.</p><p>We offer authentic Corsair products at competitive prices with reliable customer support and nationwide delivery. Order online or contact International Office Solution for the latest price, product availability, and delivery information across Bangladesh.</p><p>Warranty: No Warranty</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Brand</td><td>Corsair</td></tr><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Model</td><td>TC100 RELAXED Fabri