(1103, 'GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5070 EAGLE OC ICE SFF 12GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5070 EAGLE OC ICE SFF 12GB GDDR7 Graphics Card is built on NVIDIA\'s latest Blackwell architecture, delivering exceptional gaming, AI, and content creation performance. Equipped with 6144 CUDA cores, 12GB GDDR7 memory, DLSS 4, and 4th Generation Ray Tracing Cores, it provides smooth 1440p and 4K gaming with realistic visuals. The advanced WINDFORCE cooling system, Hawk fan design, reinforced structure, and compact SFF-ready form factor make it an excellent choice for powerful small-form-factor gaming PCs.', 'gigabyte-geforce-rtx-5070-eagle-oc-ice-sff-12gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783668743', '<p>The <strong>GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5070 EAGLE OC ICE SFF 12GB GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> combines cutting-edge NVIDIA Blackwell architecture with advanced cooling technology to deliver outstanding gaming, AI acceleration, and professional content creation performance. Featuring <strong>6144 CUDA cores</strong> and <strong>12GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory</strong> operating at <strong>28 Gbps</strong> over a <strong>192-bit memory interface</strong>, this graphics card delivers exceptional frame rates, faster rendering, and superior multitasking for modern workloads.</p><p>Running at an impressive <strong>2587 MHz boost clock</strong>, the RTX 5070 EAGLE OC ICE SFF outperforms the reference specification while maintaining excellent thermal efficiency. NVIDIA\'s <strong>Fifth-Generation Tensor Cores</strong> with <strong>DLSS 4</strong> dramatically improve AI-powered frame generation and image quality, while the <strong>Fourth-Generation Ray Tracing Cores</strong> produce highly realistic lighting, reflections, and shadows for immersive gameplay.</p><p>Designed with a compact <strong>NVIDIA SFF-ready</strong> layout, the card easily fits into smaller PC builds without sacrificing performance. The renowned <strong>WINDFORCE cooling system</strong>, featuring a Hawk fan, server-grade thermal conductive gel, reinforced PCB structure, and optimized airflow, keeps temperatures under control during demanding gaming sessions and intensive creative workloads.</p><p>Supporting <strong>PCI Express 5.0</strong>, the graphics card offers maximum bandwidth for next-generation systems. It can drive up to <strong>four displays</strong> simultaneously through <strong>three DisplayPort 2.1b</strong> outputs and <strong>one HDMI 2.1b</strong> port, supporting resolutions up to <strong>7680×4320 (8K)</strong>. Compatibility with <strong>DirectX 12 Ultimate</strong>, <strong>OpenGL 4.6</strong>, NVIDIA Studio, Reflex, and advanced AI technologies ensures smooth performance across the latest games, creative applications, streaming, video editing, and 3D rendering software.</p><p>Whether you\'re building a premium gaming PC, AI workstation, or professional content creation setup, the <strong>GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5070 EAGLE OC ICE SFF 12GB GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> delivers outstanding efficiency, excellent thermal performance, and future-ready graphics capabilities backed by a <strong>3-year manufacturer warranty</strong>.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Video Memory &amp; GPU</strong></th><th><strong>Display &amp; Connectivity</strong></th><th><strong>Power &amp; Physical</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 (Blackwell Architecture)</td><td><strong>Max Resolution:</strong> 7680 × 4320 (8K)</td><td><strong>Power Connector:</strong> 1 × 16-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type:</strong> GDDR7</td><td><strong>DisplayPort:</strong> 3 × DisplayPort 2.1b</td><td><strong>Recommended PSU:</strong> 750W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Capacity:</strong> 12GB</td><td><strong>HDMI:</strong> 1 × HDMI 2.1b</td><td><strong>PCB Form:</strong> ATX</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Speed:</strong> 28 Gbps</td><td><strong>Multi-Display Support:</strong> Up to 4 Displays</td><td><strong>Dimensions:</strong> 290 × 120 × 50 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus:</strong> 192-bit</td><td><strong>Interface:</strong> PCI Express 5.0</td><td><strong>Cooling:</strong> WINDFORCE Cooling System</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores:</strong> 6144</td><td><strong>DirectX:</strong> DirectX 12 API</td><td><strong>Fan Design:</strong> Hawk Fan</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Boost Clock:</strong> 2587 MHz</td><td><strong>OpenGL:</strong> 4.6</td><td><strong>Thermal Solution:</strong> Server-Grade Thermal Conductive Gel</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Reference Boost Clock:</strong> 2512 MHz</td><td><strong>Display Outputs:</strong> 3× DP 2.1b + 1× HDMI 2.1b</td><td><strong>RGB Lighting:</strong> Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Architecture:</strong> NVIDIA Blackwell</td><td><strong>AI Features:</strong> DLSS 4</td><td><strong>Reinforced Structure:</strong> Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tensor Cores:</strong> 5th Generation</td><td><strong>Ray Tracing:</strong> 4th Generation RT Cores</td><td><strong>NVIDIA SFF-Ready:</strong> Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Streaming Multiprocessors:</strong> New Generation</td><td><strong>Neural Shader Optimization:</strong> Yes</td><td><strong>Warranty:</strong> 3 Years</td></tr><tr><td><strong>FP4 AI Performance:</strong> Supported</td><td><strong>Mega Geometry Support:</strong> Yes</td><td><strong>Ideal For:</strong> 1440p Gaming, 4K Gaming, AI, Streaming &amp; Content Creation</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 114000.00, 114000.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/kohxVaB2aKu9JpZ0Zi5ZW2z9EwuqETqO15TZdtzy.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 07:32:23', '2026-07-10 07:34:38', 'GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5070 EAGLE OC ICE SFF 12GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'Buy the GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5070 EAGLE OC ICE SFF 12GB GDDR7 Graphics Card featuring NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 6144 CUDA cores, DLSS 4, WINDFORCE cooling, PCIe 5.0, and 12GB GDDR7 memory. Get the best price in Bangladesh with a 3-year warranty.', 'GIGABYTE RTX 5070 EAGLE OC ICE SFF 12G