(1104, 'Corsair TC100 RELAXED Fabric Gaming Chair Grey iobd', 'The Corsair TC100 RELAXED Fabric Gaming Chair Grey features plush breathable fabric upholstery, perforated cooling panels, 100mm Class 4 gas lift, 90°–160° reclining backrest, 2D adjustable armrests, and a wide ergonomic seat. Its modern Grey finish makes it ideal for gaming, office work, streaming, and long hours of comfortable seating.', 'corsair-tc100-relaxed-fabric-gaming-chair-grey-iobd-1783669021', '<p>The Corsair TC100 RELAXED Fabric Gaming Chair Grey is a premium ergonomic gaming and office chair designed for gamers, streamers, professionals, and remote workers who require exceptional comfort throughout long hours of sitting. Combining Corsair\'s signature RELAXED seating design, breathable fabric upholstery, and ergonomic adjustability, this chair offers an outstanding seating experience for gaming, working, studying, and content creation.</p><p>Upholstered with plush soft fabric, the TC100 RELAXED provides a luxurious seating surface that feels comfortable even during extended sessions. The chair also features perforated breathable fabric panels, improving airflow to help keep you cool and comfortable throughout the day. The premium fabric finish is soft, durable, and easy to maintain, making it ideal for everyday use.</p><p>Designed with a wide RELAXED seat profile, the chair offers additional seating space and broader contact points that evenly distribute body weight. This ergonomic design allows users to sit comfortably in different positions while reducing pressure on the hips and thighs during long gaming sessions or office work.</p><p>The chair features a premium 100mm Class 4 gas lift, providing smooth and reliable height adjustment to accommodate users of different heights and desk configurations. Finding the ideal seating height helps improve posture by keeping your feet flat on the floor and maintaining proper ergonomic alignment.</p><p>For personalized arm support, the 2D adjustable armrests can be moved up, down, inward, and outward, allowing users to reduce strain on the wrists, elbows, and shoulders whether gaming, typing, or working.</p><p>One of the standout features of the Corsair TC100 RELAXED Fabric Gaming Chair Grey is its 90°–160° reclining backrest, allowing users to switch effortlessly between focused work, immersive gaming, relaxing, or watching movies. The reclining function provides maximum flexibility and comfort throughout the day.</p><p>Built with a durable steel frame, reinforced base, and smooth-rolling caster wheels, the TC100 RELAXED delivers long-lasting stability and effortless mobility across different floor surfaces. The elegant Grey color adds a clean, modern appearance that complements gaming setups, home offices, and professional workstations.</p><p>Whether you\'re competing in esports, working remotely, editing videos, or simply relaxing after a long day, the Corsair TC100 RELAXED Fabric Gaming Chair Grey delivers premium comfort, ergonomic support, and long-lasting performance.</p><p>Buy Corsair TC100 RELAXED Fabric Gaming Chair Grey from International Office Solution Purchase the original Corsair TC100 RELAXED Fabric Gaming Chair Grey from International Office Solution, your trusted supplier of genuine gaming chairs, office furniture, and premium workspace solutions in Bangladesh.</p><p>We offer authentic Corsair gaming chairs at competitive prices with reliable customer support and nationwide delivery. Order online or contact International Office Solution for the latest price, product availability, and delivery information.</p><p>Warranty: No Warranty</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Brand</td><td>Corsair</td></tr><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Model</td><td>TC100 RELAXED Fabric</td></tr><tr><td><strong>General</strong></t