(1105, 'GIGABYTE GeForce RTX­­ 5070 GAMING OC 12G GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5070 GAMING OC 12GB GDDR7 Graphics Card is designed for high-performance gaming, AI-powered workloads, and professional content creation. Powered by the latest NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, it features 6144 CUDA cores, 12GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory, PCIe 5.0 support, and factory overclocked performance with a 2625MHz boost clock. The WINDFORCE cooling system ensures stable operation during intensive gaming sessions, while HDMI 2.1b and DisplayPort 2.1b outputs support up to 8K resolution across four displays.', 'gigabyte-geforce-rtx-5070-gaming-oc-12g-gddr7-graphics-card-1783669128', '<p>The <strong>GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5070 GAMING OC 12GB GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> delivers exceptional gaming and creative performance with the latest NVIDIA Blackwell architecture. Equipped with <strong>12GB of high-speed GDDR7 memory</strong> and <strong>6144 CUDA cores</strong>, it is capable of handling demanding AAA games, 3D rendering, AI acceleration, and professional content creation with outstanding efficiency.</p><p>Factory overclocked to <strong>2625MHz</strong>, the RTX 5070 GAMING OC offers faster performance than the reference model while maintaining excellent stability through GIGABYTE\'s advanced WINDFORCE cooling solution. Support for <strong>DLSS 4</strong>, advanced ray tracing, and AI-powered rendering enhances frame rates and visual quality, delivering a smoother and more immersive gaming experience.</p><p>The graphics card supports <strong>PCI Express 5.0</strong>, ensuring maximum bandwidth for modern gaming systems. With <strong>three DisplayPort 2.1b outputs and one HDMI 2.1b port</strong>, users can connect up to four displays and enjoy resolutions up to <strong>7680 × 4320 (8K)</strong>.</p><p>Its premium metal backplate, reinforced PCB, RGB lighting, and durable ATX design make it an excellent choice for enthusiasts seeking both performance and aesthetics. Whether you\'re building a next-generation gaming PC or a professional workstation, the GIGABYTE RTX 5070 GAMING OC provides outstanding reliability, cooling, and long-term performance.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Type</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Capacity</td><td>12GB</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Maximum Resolution</td><td>7680 × 4320</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Core Clock</td><td>2625 MHz (Reference: 2512 MHz)</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>28 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Bus</td><td>192-bit</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Interface</td><td>PCI Express 5.0</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>6144</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>DisplayPort</td><td>3 × DisplayPort 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>HDMI</td><td>1 × HDMI 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td>Display Support</td><td>Maximum Displays</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Connector</td><td>1 × 16-Pin</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>750W</td></tr><tr><td>API Support</td><td>DirectX</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td>API Support</td><td>OpenGL</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td>Physical</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>327 × 132 × 56 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Physical</td><td>PCB Form</td><td>ATX</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Manufacturer Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 115500.00, 115500.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/O1bzXRYhUaYxAwxH4v1NpsZykOnS7uF0713MDxPT.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 07:38:48', '2026-07-10 07:38:48', 'GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5070 GAMING OC 12GB GDDR7 Graphics Card Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy the GIGABYTE GeForce RTX 5070 GAMING OC 12GB GDDR7 Graphics Card in Bangladesh at the best price. Features 12GB GDDR7 memory, 6144 CUDA cores, PCIe 5.0, DLSS 4, HDMI 2.1b, DisplayPort 2.1b, and a 3-year warranty.', 'GIGABYTE RTX 5070 GAMING OC, RTX 5070 12GB GDDR7, Gigabyte Graphics Card, NVIDIA RTX 5070, RTX 5070 Price in Bangladesh, PCIe 5.0 Graphics Card, Gaming GPU, 12GB GDDR7 GPU, DLSS 4 Graphics Card, Gigabyte RTX 5070 OC, RTX 5070 Bangladesh, Desktop Graphics Card', NULL, 15, NULL, NULL),
(1106, 'Gigabyte GeForce RTX 5080 GAMING OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The Gigabyte GeForce RTX 5080 GAMING OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card delivers exceptional gaming and creative performance with NVIDIA\'s latest Blackwell architecture. Featuring 16GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory, PCIe 5.0 connectivity, DLSS 4, WINDFORCE cooling, RGB Halo lighting, Dual BIOS, and support for up to 8K resolution, this graphics card is built for enthusiasts, gamers, and professional creators seeking maximum performance and reliability.', 'gigabyte-geforce-rtx-5080-gaming-oc-16gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783669200', '<p>he <strong>Gigabyte GeForce RTX 5080 GAMING OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> is engineered to provide next-generation graphics performance for high-end gaming, AI workloads, content creation, and professional applications. Built on the powerful <strong>NVIDIA Blackwell architecture</strong>, it combines cutting-edge ray tracing, AI-powered DLSS 4 technology, and advanced cooling to deliver exceptional speed, efficiency, and visual realism.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>16GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory</strong> running at <strong>30 Gbps</strong> over a <strong>256-bit memory interface</strong>, the RTX 5080 offers outstanding bandwidth for demanding AAA games, 3D rendering, video editing, and AI-based workflows. Its <strong>PCI Express 5.0</strong> interface ensures maximum data throughput for modern desktop platforms.</p><p>The advanced <strong>WINDFORCE cooling system</strong> features <strong>Hawk Fans</strong>, <strong>server-grade thermal conductive gel</strong>, and a reinforced cooling design that maintains low temperatures even under heavy workloads. Users can switch between <strong>Performance Mode</strong> and <strong>Silent Mode</strong> using the integrated <strong>Dual BIOS</strong>, providing the perfect balance between cooling efficiency and quiet operation.</p><p>For display connectivity, the graphics card includes <strong>three DisplayPort 2.1a ports</strong> and <strong>two HDMI 2.1b ports</strong>, supporting up to <strong>four displays</strong> with a maximum digital resolution of <strong>7680 × 4320 (8K)</strong>. RGB Halo lighting adds customizable aesthetics to gaming builds, while the reinforced structure enhances durability for long-term use.</p><p>Whether you\'re building a premium gaming PC or a professional workstation, the Gigabyte RTX 5080 GAMING OC delivers exceptional graphics performance, efficient cooling, AI acceleration, and future-ready connectivity backed by a <strong>3-year manufacturer warranty</strong>.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Type</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Capacity</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Maximum Resolution</td><td>7680 × 4320</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>30 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Interface</td><td>256-bit</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Bus Interface</td><td>PCI Express 5.0</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>GPU Architecture</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>DLSS Support</td><td>DLSS 4</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling</td><td>Cooling System</td><td>WINDFORCE Cooling</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling</td><td>Fan Design</td><td>Hawk Fan</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling</td><td>Thermal Material</td><td>Server-grade Thermal Conductive Gel</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling</td><td>BIOS</td><td>Dual BIOS (Performance / Silent)</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling</td><td>Lighting</td><td>RGB Halo</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling</td><td>Structure</td><td>Reinforced Design</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>DisplayPort</td><td>3 × DisplayPort 2.1a</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>HDMI</td><td>2 × HDMI 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td>Display Support</td><td>Maximum Displays</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Connector</td><td>1 × 16-pin</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>850W</td></tr><tr><td>API Support</td><td>DirectX</td><td>DirectX 12 API</td></tr><tr><td>API Support</td><td>OpenGL</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td>Physical</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>340 × 140 × 70 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Manufacturer Warranty</td><td>3 Years</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 212000.00, 212000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/n7FcpHhIGOxF9VSNQECmbbK0iUv7vwYGUmaOo6ci.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 07:40:00', '2026-07-10 07:40:19', 'Gigabyte GeForce RTX 5080 GAMING OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy the Gigabyte GeForce RTX 5080 GAMING OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card in Bangladesh at the best price. Powered by NVIDIA Blackwell architecture with 16GB GDDR7 memory, PCIe 5.0, DLSS 4, WINDFORCE cooling, RGB Halo, Dual BIOS, and 3-year warranty.', 'Gigabyte RTX 5080 GAMING OC, RTX 5080 16GB GDDR7, Gigabyte Graphics Card, NVIDIA RTX 5080, RTX 5080 Price in Bangladesh, RTX 5080 OC, Gaming GPU, PCIe 5.0 Graphics Card, Blackwell GPU, DLSS 4 Graphics Card, Gigabyte RTX 5080 Bangladesh, 16GB GDDR7 GPU', NULL, 15, NULL, NULL),
(1107, 'MSI GT 710 2GD3H LP 2GB DDR3 Gaming Graphic Card', 'The MSI GT 710 2GD3H LP 2GB DDR3 Graphics Card is an affordable graphics solution designed for everyday computing, HD multimedia, and multi-display support. Equipped with 2GB DDR3 memory, a low-profile form factor, HDMI and Dual-Link DVI outputs, and efficient passive cooling, it is ideal for compact desktop PCs, home offices, and HTPC builds.', 'msi-gt-710-2gd3h-lp-2gb-ddr3-gaming-graphic-card-1783669393', '<p>The <strong>MSI GT 710 2GD3H LP 2GB DDR3 Graphics Card</strong> is a reliable entry-level GPU designed to enhance everyday computing, multimedia playback, and light graphics workloads. Powered by the NVIDIA GeForce GT 710 GPU, it features <strong>2GB of DDR3 memory</strong> with a <strong>64-bit memory interface</strong>, delivering smooth performance for office applications, web browsing, HD video playback, and casual gaming.</p><p>Designed with a <strong>low-profile form factor</strong>, this graphics card is an excellent choice for compact desktop systems and home theater PCs (HTPCs). Its large passive heatsink efficiently dissipates heat while operating silently, ensuring dependable performance without additional fan noise. MSI\'s high-quality components are engineered for long-term reliability and energy efficiency.</p><p>The GT 710 supports <strong>HDMI 1.4a</strong>, <strong>Dual-Link DVI-D</strong>, and <strong>VGA (D-Sub)</strong> outputs, allowing users to connect up to <strong>two displays</strong> simultaneously. It delivers a maximum HDMI resolution of <strong>4096 × 2160 at 24Hz</strong>, making it suitable for Ultra HD media playback, while the DVI output supports resolutions up to <strong>2560 × 1600 at 60Hz</strong>.</p><p>With support for <strong>DirectX 12 API</strong> and <strong>OpenGL 4.5</strong>, the MSI GT 710 offers compatibility with modern applications and operating systems. Requiring only a <strong>300W power supply</strong> and consuming just <strong>19W</strong>, it is an energy-efficient upgrade for older or entry-level PCs. Backed by a <strong>3-year manufacturer warranty</strong>, it provides dependable graphics performance at an affordable price.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR3</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Capacity</td><td>2GB</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Core Clock</td><td>954 MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>1600 MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Bus</td><td>64-bit</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Bus Interface</td><td>PCI Express 2.0 x16</td></tr><tr><td>Display Resolution</td><td>HDMI Resolution</td><td>4096 × 2160 @ 24Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Display Resolution</td><td>DVI Resolution</td><td>2560 × 1600 @ 60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>HDMI</td><td>1 × HDMI 1.4a</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>DVI</td><td>1 × Dual-Link DVI-D</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>VGA</td><td>1 × D-Sub (VGA)</td></tr><tr><td>Display Support</td><td>Maximum Displays</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>300W</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>19W</td></tr><tr><td>API Support</td><td>DirectX</td><td>DirectX 12 API</td></tr><tr><td>API Support</td><td>OpenGL</td><td>OpenGL 4.5</td></tr><tr><td>Physical</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>146 × 69 × 19 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Physical</td><td>Weight</td><td>178 g</td></tr><tr><td>Design</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Low Profile</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling</td><td>Cooling Solution</td><td>Large Passive Heatsink</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Manufacturer Warranty</td><td>3 Years</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 5800.00, 5800.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/JIHwPKwjP0S8xEs8uYhu6gBvwCzS2yQj3ppSlZtj.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 07:43:13', '2026-07-10 07:43:13', 'MSI GT 710 2GD3H LP 2GB DDR3 Graphics Card Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy the MSI GT 710 2GD3H LP 2GB DDR3 Graphics Card in Bangladesh at the best price. Features 2GB DDR3 memory, low-profile design, HDMI and DVI outputs, PCI Express 2.0 x16 interface, low power consumption, and a 3-year warranty.', 'MSI GT 710 2GB DDR3, MSI GT 710 LP, GT 710 Graphics Card, MSI Graphics Card, GT 710 Price in Bangladesh, 2GB DDR3 GPU, Low Profile Graphics Card, PCI Express 2.0 Graphics Card, MSI GT710, Budget Graphics Card, HDMI Graphics Card, MSI GT 710 Bangladesh', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(1108, 'MSI GeForce GT 730 4GB DDR3 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce GT 730 4GB DDR3 Graphics Card is a budget-friendly GPU designed for everyday computing, HD multimedia, and casual gaming. Featuring 4GB DDR3 memory, a 128-bit memory interface, multiple display outputs including HDMI, DisplayPort, DVI, and VGA, it provides reliable graphics performance for home, office, and entry-level multimedia PCs.', 'msi-geforce-gt-730-4gb-ddr3-graphics-card-1783669469', '<p>The <strong>MSI GeForce GT 730 4GB DDR3 Graphics Card</strong> is an excellent entry-level graphics solution for users looking to upgrade their desktop with improved multimedia performance and light gaming capabilities. Equipped with <strong>4GB of DDR3 memory</strong> and a <strong>128-bit memory interface</strong>, it delivers smooth performance for everyday applications, HD video playback, office productivity, and casual games.</p><p>Operating at a <strong>700 MHz core clock</strong>, the GT 730 provides dependable graphics acceleration while maintaining low power consumption of just <strong>49W</strong>, making it an ideal upgrade for older systems that require an efficient graphics solution. The card uses the <strong>PCI Express 2.0</strong> interface for broad compatibility with a wide range of desktop motherboards.</p><p>The MSI GT 730 offers versatile connectivity with <strong>DisplayPort 1.4a</strong>, <strong>HDMI 1.4a</strong>, <strong>Dual-Link DVI</strong>, and <strong>VGA (D-Sub)</strong> outputs, allowing users to connect modern and legacy displays. It supports up to <strong>two simultaneous displays</strong>, making it suitable for office multitasking and home entertainment setups. The HDMI output supports Full HD resolution of <strong>1920 × 1080 @ 60Hz</strong>, while the DVI port supports resolutions up to <strong>2560 × 1600 @ 60Hz</strong> for enhanced image clarity.</p><p>Supporting <strong>DirectX 12 API</strong> and <strong>OpenGL 4.4</strong>, the graphics card ensures compatibility with modern operating systems and multimedia applications. Requiring only a <strong>300W power supply</strong>, it is an energy-efficient solution for budget desktop PCs. Backed by a <strong>3-year manufacturer warranty</strong>, the MSI GeForce GT 730 delivers reliable performance and excellent value for everyday users.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR3</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Capacity</td><td>4GB</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Core Clock</td><td>700 MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Bus</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Bus Interface</td><td>PCI Express 2.0</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>DisplayPort</td><td>1 × DisplayPort 1.4a</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>HDMI</td><td>1 × HDMI 1.4a</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>HDMI Resolution</td><td>1920 × 1080 @ 60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>DVI</td><td>1 × DVI</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>DVI Resolution</td><td>2560 × 1600 @ 60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>VGA</td><td>1 × D-Sub (VGA)</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>HDCP</td><td>Supported</td></tr><tr><td>Display Support</td><td>Maximum Displays</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>300W</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>49W</td></tr><tr><td>API Support</td><td>DirectX</td><td>DirectX 12 API</td></tr><tr><td>API Support</td><td>OpenGL</td><td>OpenGL 4.4</td></tr><tr><td>Physical</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>145 × 106 × 30 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Manufacturer Warranty</td><td>3 Years</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 8500.00, 8500.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/DgUwVQXeotpV8oimhwYrmeAW0CZvR6MKfEPgrJnh.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 07:44:29', '2026-07-10 07:44:29', 'MSI GeForce GT 730 4GB DDR3 Graphics Card Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy the MSI GeForce GT 730 4GB DDR3 Graphics Card in Bangladesh at the best price. Features 4GB DDR3 memory, 128-bit memory bus, PCI Express 2.0, HDMI, DVI, VGA, DisplayPort connectivity, low power consumption, and a 3-year warranty.', 'MSI GT 730 4GB DDR3, MSI GeForce GT 730, GT 730 Graphics Card, MSI Graphics Card, GT 730 Price in Bangladesh, 4GB DDR3 GPU, Budget Graphics Card, PCI Express 2.0 Graphics Card, MSI GT730, HDMI Graphics Card, DisplayPort Graphics Card, Desktop Graphics Card', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(1110, 'MSI GeForce RTX 3050 VENTUS 2X 6G OC GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 3050 VENTUS 2X 6G OC GDDR6 Graphics Card is built for smooth 1080p gaming, content creation, and AI-enhanced graphics performance. Powered by the NVIDIA Ampere architecture, it features 6GB GDDR6 memory, 2304 CUDA cores, dedicated Ray Tracing and Tensor Cores, PCIe Gen 4.0, and an advanced dual-fan cooling system for reliable performance under demanding workloads.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-3050-ventus-2x-6g-oc-gddr6-graphics-card-1783669565', '<p>The <strong>MSI GeForce RTX 3050 VENTUS 2X 6G OC GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong> is a powerful mid-range GPU designed for gamers, streamers, and content creators seeking reliable performance with advanced graphics technologies. Built on the <strong>NVIDIA Ampere architecture</strong>, it features dedicated <strong>Ray Tracing Cores</strong> and <strong>Tensor Cores</strong> to deliver realistic lighting effects, AI-powered rendering, and improved gaming performance with <strong>NVIDIA DLSS</strong> technology.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>6GB of GDDR6 memory</strong>, a <strong>96-bit memory interface</strong>, and <strong>2304 CUDA cores</strong>, the RTX 3050 offers excellent performance for modern AAA games, esports titles, video editing, and creative applications. Its <strong>1492 MHz boost clock</strong> and <strong>14 Gbps memory speed</strong> ensure smooth gameplay and responsive performance across demanding workloads.</p><p>The <strong>VENTUS 2X thermal design</strong> features dual TORX fans and a large heatsink that efficiently dissipate heat while maintaining quiet operation, allowing the GPU to perform consistently during extended gaming sessions. MSI Center software provides real-time system monitoring and optimization, while <strong>MSI Afterburner</strong> enables easy overclocking, hardware monitoring, and in-game performance tracking.</p><p>For display connectivity, the graphics card includes <strong>one DisplayPort 1.4a</strong> and <strong>two HDMI 2.1 ports</strong>, supporting up to <strong>four displays</strong> with a maximum digital resolution of <strong>7680 × 4320 (8K)</strong>. HDMI 2.1 support allows <strong>4K gaming at 120Hz</strong>, making it ideal for modern gaming monitors and high-end TVs.</p><p>With <strong>PCI Express Gen 4.0 x8</strong> connectivity, low power consumption of <strong>130W</strong>, and a recommended <strong>550W power supply</strong>, the MSI RTX 3050 VENTUS 2X 6G OC is an excellent choice for upgrading gaming systems or building a high-performance desktop backed by a <strong>3-year manufacturer warranty</strong>.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Type</td><td>GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Capacity</td><td>6GB</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>2304</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Core Clock</td><td>Boost: 1492 MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>14 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Bus</td><td>96-bit</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Bus Interface</td><td>PCI Express Gen 4.0 x8</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Maximum Resolution</td><td>7680 × 4320</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>DisplayPort</td><td>1 × DisplayPort 1.4a</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>HDMI</td><td>2 × HDMI 2.1</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>HDMI Features</td><td>Supports 4K @ 120Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>HDCP</td><td>Supported</td></tr><tr><td>Display Support</td><td>Maximum Displays</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Connector</td><td>1 × 8-pin</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>550W</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>130W</td></tr><tr><td>API Support</td><td>DirectX</td><td>DirectX 12 API</td></tr><tr><td>API Support</td><td>OpenGL</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td>Physical</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>235 × 124 × 42 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Physical</td><td>Weight</td><td>661 g</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Manufacturer Warranty</td><td>3 Years</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 29999.00, 29999.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/WuOrEnhVTLJVDW3hQM0vg0vDG4PM2x9ycf8x0XVW.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 07:46:05', '2026-07-10 07:46:05', 'MSI GeForce RTX 3050 VENTUS 2X 6G OC GDDR6 Graphics Card Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy the MSI GeForce RTX 3050 VENTUS 2X 6G OC Graphics Card in Bangladesh at the best price. Features 6GB GDDR6 memory, NVIDIA Ampere architecture, 2304 CUDA cores, PCIe Gen 4.0, HDMI 2.1, DisplayPort 1.4a, efficient dual-fan cooling, and a 3-year warranty.', 'MSI RTX 3050 VENTUS 2X 6G OC, MSI RTX 3050 6GB, RTX 3050 Graphics Card, NVIDIA RTX 3050, MSI Graphics Card, RTX 3050 Price in Bangladesh, 6GB GDDR6 GPU, PCIe Gen 4.0 Graphics Card, Ampere Graphics Card, Gaming GPU, RTX 3050 OC, MSI RTX 3050 Bangladesh', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(1111, 'MSI GeForce RTX 3050 VENTUS 2X E 6G OC GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 3050 VENTUS 2X E 6G OC GDDR6 Graphics Card is a compact and efficient gaming GPU built on NVIDIA Ampere architecture. Equipped with 6GB GDDR6 memory, 2304 CUDA cores, PCIe Gen 4.0 x8 connectivity, and MSI\'s dual-fan VENTUS cooling system, it delivers smooth 1080p gaming, AI-enhanced graphics, and reliable performance for gaming, streaming, and content creation.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-3050-ventus-2x-e-6g-oc-gddr6-graphics-card-1783669794', '<p>The <strong>MSI GeForce RTX 3050 VENTUS 2X E 6G OC GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong> is designed to deliver reliable gaming performance and advanced graphics technologies in a compact form factor. Powered by the <strong>NVIDIA Ampere architecture</strong>, it combines dedicated <strong>2nd Generation Ray Tracing Cores</strong> and <strong>3rd Generation Tensor Cores</strong> to provide realistic lighting, AI-enhanced rendering, and improved gaming performance through NVIDIA DLSS technology.</p><p>Featuring <strong>6GB of high-speed GDDR6 memory</strong>, a <strong>96-bit memory interface</strong>, and <strong>2304 CUDA cores</strong>, the RTX 3050 VENTUS 2X E OC is ideal for modern 1080p gaming, esports titles, livestreaming, and creative workloads. Its <strong>1492 MHz boost clock</strong> and <strong>14 Gbps memory speed</strong> ensure responsive gameplay and smooth graphics performance across demanding applications.</p><p>MSI\'s <strong>VENTUS dual-fan cooling system</strong> provides excellent thermal efficiency while maintaining low noise levels during extended gaming sessions. The compact design makes the card an ideal choice for mid-tower and space-saving desktop builds without compromising cooling performance.</p><p>For display connectivity, the graphics card features <strong>one DisplayPort 1.4a</strong> and <strong>two HDMI 2.1 ports</strong>, supporting up to <strong>four displays</strong> and a maximum digital resolution of <strong>7680 × 4320 (8K)</strong>. HDMI 2.1 support enables <strong>4K gaming at 120Hz</strong>, ensuring compatibility with the latest gaming monitors and high-end TVs.</p><p>With <strong>PCI Express Gen 4.0 x8</strong> support, <strong>130W power consumption</strong>, and a recommended <strong>550W power supply</strong>, the MSI GeForce RTX 3050 VENTUS 2X E 6G OC is an excellent upgrade for gamers seeking dependable performance, efficient cooling, and next-generation graphics technologies at an affordable price. It is backed by a <strong>3-year manufacturer warranty</strong>.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Type</td><td>GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Capacity</td><td>6GB</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>2304 Units</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Core Clock</td><td>Boost: 1492 MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>14 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Bus</td><td>96-bit</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Bus Interface</td><td>PCI Express Gen 4.0 x8</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Maximum Resolution</td><td>7680 × 4320</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>DisplayPort</td><td>1 × DisplayPort 1.4a</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>HDMI</td><td>2 × HDMI 2.1</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>HDMI Features</td><td>Supports 4K @ 120Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>HDCP</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Display Support</td><td>Maximum Displays</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Connector</td><td>Not Required</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>550W</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>130W</td></tr><tr><td>API Support</td><td>DirectX</td><td>DirectX 12 API</td></tr><tr><td>API Support</td><td>OpenGL</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td>Physical</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>235 × 124 × 42 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Physical</td><td>Weight</td><td>661 g</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Manufacturer Warranty</td><td>3 Years</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 25500.00, 25500.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/KmZRqROHOoruLC8LvxbdSM6jXaVuWGpOTYzfiAEx.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 07:49:54', '2026-07-10 07:49:54', 'MSI GeForce RTX 3050 VENTUS 2X E 6G OC GDDR6 Graphics Card Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy the MSI GeForce RTX 3050 VENTUS 2X E 6G OC GDDR6 Graphics Card in Bangladesh at the best price. Featuring 6GB GDDR6 memory, NVIDIA Ampere architecture, 2304 CUDA cores, PCIe Gen 4.0 x8, HDMI 2.1, DisplayPort 1.4a, dual-fan cooling, and a 3-year warranty.', 'MSI RTX 3050 VENTUS 2X E 6G OC, MSI RTX 3050 E 6GB, RTX 3050 6GB GDDR6, MSI Graphics Card, NVIDIA RTX 3050, RTX 3050 Price in Bangladesh, Ampere Graphics Card, Gaming GPU, PCIe Gen 4.0 Graphics Card, RTX 3050 OC, MSI RTX 3050 Bangladesh, DLSS Graphics Card', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(1112, 'MSI GeForce RTX 3050 VENTUS 2X XS 8GB OC GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 3050 VENTUS 2X XS 8GB OC GDDR6 Graphics Card is a compact, factory-overclocked gaming GPU built on NVIDIA Ampere architecture. Equipped with 8GB of GDDR6 memory, 2560 CUDA cores, PCI Express Gen 4.0 x8, and MSI\'s VENTUS dual-fan cooling solution, it delivers excellent 1080p gaming performance, AI-enhanced graphics, and efficient cooling for gamers and content creators.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-3050-ventus-2x-xs-8gb-oc-gddr6-graphics-card-1783669865', '<p>The <strong>MSI GeForce RTX 3050 VENTUS 2X XS 8GB OC GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong> is designed for gamers looking for dependable 1080p gaming performance in a compact form factor. Powered by the <strong>NVIDIA Ampere architecture</strong>, it features dedicated <strong>2nd Generation Ray Tracing Cores</strong> and <strong>3rd Generation Tensor Cores</strong>, enabling realistic lighting effects, AI-powered rendering, and smoother gameplay through NVIDIA DLSS technology.</p><p>With <strong>8GB of high-speed GDDR6 memory</strong>, a <strong>128-bit memory interface</strong>, and <strong>2560 CUDA cores</strong>, the RTX 3050 XS OC delivers the performance needed for modern AAA games, esports titles, video editing, livestreaming, and creative applications. Its factory-overclocked <strong>1807 MHz boost clock</strong> and <strong>14 Gbps memory speed</strong> provide responsive performance and improved frame rates.</p><p>The <strong>VENTUS 2X XS</strong> cooling system features a compact dual-fan design that efficiently dissipates heat while maintaining quiet operation during extended gaming sessions. Its shorter PCB and reduced dimensions make it an excellent choice for compact ATX and Micro-ATX builds.</p><p>For connectivity, the graphics card includes <strong>1× DisplayPort 1.4a</strong>, <strong>1× HDMI 2.1</strong>, and <strong>1× Dual-Link DVI-D</strong>, supporting up to <strong>three displays</strong> with a maximum digital resolution of <strong>7680 × 4320 (8K)</strong>. HDMI 2.1 allows support for <strong>4K gaming at 120Hz</strong>, ensuring compatibility with modern gaming monitors and TVs.</p><p>Requiring only a <strong>6-pin PCIe power connector</strong>, consuming <strong>115W</strong>, and recommending a <strong>500W power supply</strong>, the MSI GeForce RTX 3050 VENTUS 2X XS 8GB OC is an excellent upgrade for mainstream gaming PCs, delivering modern graphics technologies, efficient cooling, and reliable performance backed by a <strong>3-year manufacturer warranty</strong>.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Type</td><td>GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Capacity</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>2560 Units</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Core Clock</td><td>Boost: 1807 MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>14 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Bus</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Bus Interface</td><td>PCI Express Gen 4.0 x8</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Maximum Resolution</td><td>7680 × 4320</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>DisplayPort</td><td>1 × DisplayPort 1.4a</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>HDMI</td><td>1 × HDMI 2.1 (Supports 4K @ 120Hz)</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>DVI</td><td>1 × Dual-Link DVI-D</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>HDCP</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Display Support</td><td>Maximum Displays</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Connector</td><td>1 × 6-pin</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>500W</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>115W</td></tr><tr><td>API Support</td><td>DirectX</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td>API Support</td><td>OpenGL</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td>Physical</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>205 × 112 × 45 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Physical</td><td>Weight</td><td>570 g</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling</td><td>Cooling System</td><td>Dual-Fan VENTUS XS Cooling</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Manufacturer Warranty</td><td>3 Years</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 38200.00, 38200.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/L6zmVFt0m3i7Z2lNz0um3JxOUrQjPMCrPhm6CG9N.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 07:51:05', '2026-07-10 07:51:05', 'MSI GeForce RTX 3050 VENTUS 2X XS 8GB OC GDDR6 Graphics Card Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy the MSI GeForce RTX 3050 VENTUS 2X XS 8GB OC GDDR6 Graphics Card in Bangladesh at the best price. Features 8GB GDDR6 memory, NVIDIA Ampere architecture, 2560 CUDA cores, PCIe Gen 4.0 x8, dual-fan cooling, HDMI 2.1, DisplayPort 1.4a, and a 3-year warranty.', 'MSI RTX 3050 VENTUS 2X XS 8GB OC, MSI RTX 3050 8GB, RTX 3050 XS OC, MSI Graphics Card, NVIDIA RTX 3050, RTX 3050 Price in Bangladesh, 8GB GDDR6 GPU, Gaming Graphics Card, PCIe Gen 4.0 Graphics Card, MSI RTX 3050 Bangladesh, RTX 3050 OC, Ampere GPU', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(1113, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5050 8G SHADOW 2X OC 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5050 8G SHADOW 2X OC 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card delivers powerful 1080p gaming and AI-enhanced graphics performance with NVIDIA Blackwell architecture. Featuring 8GB GDDR6 memory, 2560 CUDA cores, DLSS 4, PCI Express Gen 5.0, and MSI\'s advanced TORX Fan 5.0 cooling system, it offers reliable performance, efficient cooling, and next-generation gaming technologies for modern PC builds.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5050-8g-shadow-2x-oc-8gb-gddr6-graphics-card-1783669972', '<p>The <strong>MSI GeForce RTX 5050 8G SHADOW 2X OC 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong> is built for gamers and creators seeking excellent performance, advanced AI technologies, and efficient cooling in a compact dual-fan design. Powered by the latest <strong>NVIDIA Blackwell architecture</strong>, it supports <strong>DLSS 4</strong>, advanced ray tracing, and AI-powered rendering to deliver smoother gameplay and enhanced visual quality in modern games.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>2560 CUDA cores</strong>, <strong>8GB of GDDR6 memory</strong>, a <strong>128-bit memory interface</strong>, and <strong>20 Gbps memory speed</strong>, the RTX 5050 SHADOW 2X OC provides outstanding performance for AAA gaming, esports titles, video editing, 3D rendering, and AI-assisted creative workloads. The card features an <strong>Extreme Performance Clock of 2617 MHz</strong> through MSI Center and a <strong>2602 MHz Boost Clock</strong>, ensuring responsive performance during demanding tasks.</p><p>MSI\'s <strong>TORX Fan 5.0</strong> cooling technology delivers optimized airflow and superior heat dissipation through linked fan blades, high-performance heat pipes, and a reinforced backplate with an airflow vent. The result is quieter operation and stable GPU temperatures even during extended gaming sessions. MSI Center and Afterburner software provide advanced monitoring, performance tuning, and overclocking capabilities for enthusiasts.</p><p>For connectivity, the graphics card includes <strong>three DisplayPort 2.1b outputs</strong> and <strong>one HDMI 2.1b port</strong>, supporting up to <strong>four displays</strong> with a maximum digital resolution of <strong>7680 × 4320 (8K)</strong>. HDMI 2.1b enables <strong>4K gaming at 480Hz</strong> or <strong>8K at 120Hz</strong> with DSC, HDR, and Variable Refresh Rate (VRR), making it ready for the latest high-refresh-rate gaming displays.</p><p>With <strong>PCI Express Gen 5.0 x16 (operating at x8)</strong>, <strong>130W power consumption</strong>, a single <strong>8-pin PCIe connector</strong>, and a recommended <strong>550W power supply</strong>, the MSI RTX 5050 SHADOW 2X OC is an ideal upgrade for gamers looking to experience next-generation graphics performance with dependable cooling and long-term reliability. It is backed by a <strong>3-year manufacturer warranty</strong>.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Type</td><td>GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Capacity</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>2560 Units</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Core Clock</td><td>Extreme Performance: 2617 MHz (MSI Center), Boost: 2602 MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>20 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Bus</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Bus Interface</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5.0 x16 (uses x8)</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Maximum Resolution</td><td>7680 × 4320</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>GPU Architecture</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>AI Technology</td><td>NVIDIA DLSS 4</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling</td><td>Cooling System</td><td>TORX Fan 5.0</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>DisplayPort</td><td>3 × DisplayPort 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>HDMI</td><td>1 × HDMI 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>HDMI Features</td><td>Up to 4K @ 480Hz or 8K @ 120Hz with DSC, HDR &amp; VRR</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>HDCP</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Display Support</td><td>Maximum Displays</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Connector</td><td>1 × 8-pin</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>550W</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>130W</td></tr><tr><td>API Support</td><td>DirectX</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td>API Support</td><td>OpenGL</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td>Physical</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>197 × 120 × 40 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Manufacturer Warranty</td><td>3 Years</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 37900.00, 37900.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/if8ney2ii3SRPcX7LQEaSbOYEXTptv4ZmmulD3wc.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 07:52:52', '2026-07-10 07:52:52', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5050 8G SHADOW 2X OC 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy the MSI GeForce RTX 5050 8G SHADOW 2X OC 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card in Bangladesh at the best price. Featuring NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 8GB GDDR6 memory, 2560 CUDA cores, PCIe Gen 5.0, DLSS 4, TORX Fan 5.0 cooling, HDMI 2.1b, DisplayPort 2.1b, and a 3-year warranty.', 'MSI RTX 5050 SHADOW 2X OC, MSI RTX 5050 8GB, RTX 5050 8GB GDDR6, MSI Graphics Card, NVIDIA RTX 5050, RTX 5050 Price in Bangladesh, Blackwell Graphics Card, DLSS 4 GPU, Gaming Graphics Card, PCIe Gen 5.0 Graphics Card, MSI RTX 5050 Bangladesh, RTX 5050 OC', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `name`, `short_description`, `slug`, `description`, `specifications_text`, `tags`, `buy_price`, `price`, `discount_price`, `stock`, `thumbnail`, `video`, `is_featured`, `status`, `is_coming_soon`, `is_tba`, `is_call_for_price`, `is_out_of_stock`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`, `meta_keywords`, `meta_image`, `brand_id`, `supplier_id`, `laptop_purpose_id`) VALUES
(1114, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5050 8G SHADOW 2X OC 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5050 8G SHADOW 2X OC 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card is designed for gamers and creators seeking powerful 1080p and entry-level 1440p performance. Built on the latest NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, it features 8GB GDDR6 memory, 2560 CUDA cores, DLSS 4, PCIe 5.0, and MSI\'s TORX Fan 5.0 cooling system for excellent gaming performance, AI acceleration, and efficient thermal management.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5050-8g-shadow-2x-oc-8gb-gddr6-graphics-card-1783670051', '<p>The <strong>MSI GeForce RTX 5050 8G SHADOW 2X OC 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong> combines NVIDIA\'s latest <strong>Blackwell architecture</strong> with MSI\'s renowned cooling technology to deliver outstanding gaming, streaming, and content creation performance. Designed for modern gamers, it supports advanced <strong>Ray Tracing</strong>, <strong>NVIDIA DLSS 4</strong>, and AI-powered rendering technologies that significantly improve image quality and frame rates in supported titles.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>2560 CUDA cores</strong>, <strong>8GB of GDDR6 memory</strong>, a <strong>128-bit memory interface</strong>, and <strong>20 Gbps memory speed</strong>, the RTX 5050 SHADOW 2X OC handles today\'s demanding games, creative applications, and AI workloads with ease. The graphics card features an <strong>Extreme Performance Clock of up to 2617 MHz</strong> via MSI Center and a <strong>Boost Clock of 2602 MHz</strong>, delivering smooth and responsive gameplay.</p><p>MSI\'s <strong>SHADOW 2X thermal solution</strong> features the advanced <strong>TORX Fan 5.0</strong> cooling system, precision-engineered heat pipes, and an optimized heatsink to maintain low temperatures while minimizing noise. The reinforced backplate improves durability while also enhancing airflow for more efficient cooling during extended gaming sessions.</p><p>For display connectivity, the card offers <strong>three DisplayPort 2.1b outputs</strong> and <strong>one HDMI 2.1b port</strong>, supporting up to <strong>four displays</strong> simultaneously with a maximum digital resolution of <strong>7680 × 4320 (8K)</strong>. HDMI 2.1b enables support for <strong>4K gaming at up to 480Hz</strong> or <strong>8K at 120Hz</strong> with Display Stream Compression (DSC), HDR, and Variable Refresh Rate (VRR).</p><p>Supporting <strong>PCI Express 5.0 x16 (operating in x8 mode)</strong>, requiring only a single <strong>8-pin PCIe power connector</strong>, and recommending a <strong>550W power supply</strong>, the MSI RTX 5050 SHADOW 2X OC is an excellent choice for building a future-ready gaming PC. It is backed by MSI\'s <strong>3-year manufacturer warranty</strong> for added peace of mind.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Type</td><td>GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Capacity</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>GPU Architecture</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>2560</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Core Clock</td><td>Extreme Performance: 2617 MHz (MSI Center), Boost: 2602 MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>20 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Bus</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Bus Interface</td><td>PCI Express 5.0 x16 (operates at x8)</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Maximum Resolution</td><td>7680 × 4320</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>AI Technology</td><td>NVIDIA DLSS 4</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling</td><td>Cooling System</td><td>SHADOW 2X with TORX Fan 5.0</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>DisplayPort</td><td>3 × DisplayPort 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>HDMI</td><td>1 × HDMI 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>HDMI Features</td><td>Supports up to 4K @ 480Hz or 8K @ 120Hz (DSC, HDR, VRR)</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>HDCP</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Display Support</td><td>Maximum Displays</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Connector</td><td>1 × 8-pin PCIe</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>550W</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>130W</td></tr><tr><td>API Support</td><td>DirectX</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td>API Support</td><td>OpenGL</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td>Physical</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>197 × 120 × 40 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Manufacturer Warranty</td><td>3 Years</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 37900.00, 37900.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/JpUUWHRlMxMRZHHX3vHRgXNa4hmbZeHoCvWLrvNG.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 07:54:11', '2026-07-10 07:54:11', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5050 8G SHADOW 2X OC 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy the MSI GeForce RTX 5050 8G SHADOW 2X OC 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card in Bangladesh at the best price. Powered by NVIDIA Blackwell architecture with 8GB GDDR6 memory, DLSS 4, PCIe 5.0, TORX Fan 5.0 cooling, DisplayPort 2.1b, HDMI 2.1b, and a 3-year warranty.', 'MSI RTX 5050 SHADOW 2X OC, MSI RTX 5050 8GB, RTX 5050 Graphics Card, MSI Graphics Card, NVIDIA RTX 5050, RTX 5050 Price in Bangladesh, Blackwell GPU, 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card, DLSS 4 Graphics Card, PCIe 5.0 Graphics Card, Gaming GPU, MSI RTX 5050 Bangladesh', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(1115, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5050 8G VENTUS 2X OC 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5050 8G VENTUS 2X OC 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card is a next-generation gaming GPU designed for smooth 1080p and entry-level 1440p gaming. Built on NVIDIA\'s Blackwell architecture, it combines 8GB GDDR6 memory, 2560 CUDA cores, DLSS 4, and MSI\'s TORX Fan 5.0 cooling system to deliver exceptional gaming performance, AI acceleration, and efficient thermal management.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5050-8g-ventus-2x-oc-8gb-gddr6-graphics-card-1783670126', '<p>The <strong>MSI GeForce RTX 5050 8G VENTUS 2X OC 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong> is engineered to provide gamers and creators with excellent performance, efficient cooling, and the latest AI-powered graphics technologies. Built on the <strong>NVIDIA Blackwell architecture</strong>, it supports <strong>NVIDIA DLSS 4</strong>, advanced ray tracing, and AI-enhanced rendering for smoother gameplay and stunning visual quality.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>2560 CUDA cores</strong>, <strong>8GB of GDDR6 memory</strong>, a <strong>128-bit memory interface</strong>, and <strong>20 Gbps memory speed</strong>, the RTX 5050 VENTUS 2X OC delivers fast and responsive performance for modern AAA games, esports titles, streaming, video editing, and creative applications. The GPU features an <strong>Extreme Performance Clock of up to 2617 MHz</strong> through MSI Center and a <strong>Boost Clock of 2602 MHz</strong>, ensuring stable high frame rates under demanding workloads.</p><p>The card utilizes MSI\'s <strong>VENTUS 2X thermal solution</strong> featuring <strong>TORX Fan 5.0</strong>, precision heat pipes, and a reinforced backplate with an airflow vent for superior heat dissipation. This cooling system keeps temperatures under control while maintaining quiet operation during extended gaming sessions. MSI Center and MSI Afterburner software allow users to monitor, optimize, and overclock the graphics card with ease.</p><p>For display connectivity, the graphics card includes <strong>three DisplayPort 2.1b outputs</strong> and <strong>one HDMI 2.1b port</strong>, supporting up to <strong>four displays</strong> with a maximum digital resolution of <strong>7680 × 4320 (8K)</strong>. HDMI 2.1b supports <strong>4K gaming at up to 480Hz</strong> or <strong>8K at 120Hz</strong> with Display Stream Compression (DSC), HDR, and Variable Refresh Rate (VRR), making it ideal for next-generation gaming monitors.</p><p>With <strong>PCI Express Gen 5.0 x16 (operating at x8)</strong>, <strong>130W power consumption</strong>, a single <strong>8-pin PCIe power connector</strong>, and a recommended <strong>550W power supply</strong>, the MSI RTX 5050 VENTUS 2X OC is an excellent upgrade for modern gaming systems. It comes backed by a <strong>3-year manufacturer warranty</strong> for dependable long-term performance.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Type</td><td>GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Capacity</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>GPU Architecture</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>2560 Units</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Core Clock</td><td>Extreme Performance: 2617 MHz (MSI Center), Boost: 2602 MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>20 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Bus</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Bus Interface</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5.0 x16 (uses x8)</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Maximum Resolution</td><td>7680 × 4320</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>AI Technology</td><td>NVIDIA DLSS 4</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling</td><td>Cooling System</td><td>VENTUS 2X with TORX Fan 5.0</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>DisplayPort</td><td>3 × DisplayPort 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>HDMI</td><td>1 × HDMI 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>HDMI Features</td><td>Up to 4K @ 480Hz or 8K @ 120Hz with DSC, HDR &amp; VRR</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>HDCP</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Display Support</td><td>Maximum Displays</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Connector</td><td>1 × 8-pin</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>550W</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>130W</td></tr><tr><td>API Support</td><td>DirectX</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td>API Support</td><td>OpenGL</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td>Physical</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>197 × 120 × 41 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Manufacturer Warranty</td><td>3 Years</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 38500.00, 38500.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/AHDlJOjrw9yKS7nluCoaBFrISdIVTWaTEIb9cbJZ.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 07:55:26', '2026-07-10 07:55:26', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5050 8G VENTUS 2X OC 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy the MSI GeForce RTX 5050 8G VENTUS 2X OC 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card in Bangladesh at the best price. Powered by NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, it features 8GB GDDR6 memory, DLSS 4, PCIe 5.0, TORX Fan 5.0 cooling, DisplayPort 2.1b, HDMI 2.1b, and a 3-year warranty.', 'MSI RTX 5050 VENTUS 2X OC, MSI RTX 5050 8GB, RTX 5050 Graphics Card, MSI Graphics Card, NVIDIA RTX 5050, RTX 5050 Price in Bangladesh, Blackwell GPU, 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card, DLSS 4 Graphics Card, PCIe 5.0 Graphics Card, Gaming GPU, MSI RTX 5050 Bangladesh', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(1116, 'Corsair T3 RUSH Gaming Chair Charcol iosbd', 'The Corsair T3 RUSH 2023 Gaming Chair Charcoal features breathable soft fabric upholstery, solid steel frame, 4D adjustable armrests, 100mm Class 4 gas lift, 90°–160° reclining backrest, adjustable lumbar and neck pillows, 65mm caster wheels, and supports up to 120kg. Perfect for gaming, office work, streaming, and extended sitting sessions.', 'corsair-t3-rush-gaming-chair-charcol-iosbd-1783670147', '<p>The Corsair T3 RUSH 2023 Gaming Chair Charcoal is a premium ergonomic gaming chair designed for gamers, streamers, creators, and professionals who spend long hours at their desks. Combining breathable fabric upholstery, a durable steel frame, and advanced ergonomic adjustments, this chair delivers outstanding comfort, stability, and performance for gaming, office work, and content creation.</p><p>Inspired by high-performance motorsport seating, the Corsair T3 RUSH 2023 features breathable soft fabric upholstery that promotes airflow and minimizes heat buildup, keeping you cool and comfortable throughout extended gaming sessions or workdays. The elegant Charcoal finish gives the chair a clean, modern appearance that fits seamlessly into gaming rooms, streaming studios, and professional office environments.</p><p>Built around a solid steel frame, the chair provides exceptional structural strength and long-term durability. The high-density PU foam cushioning (50±5 kg/m³) offers the ideal balance of softness and firm support, maintaining its shape over years of daily use while helping reduce fatigue.</p><p>The spacious seat measures 49cm deep and 54cm wide, providing excellent comfort for users of various body types. Equipped with a premium 100mm Class 4 gas lift, the seat height can be adjusted smoothly from 48cm to 58cm, allowing users to achieve the ideal ergonomic seating position.</p><p>The Corsair T3 RUSH 2023 Gaming Chair Charcoal includes both an adjustable lumbar pillow and an adjustable neck pillow, offering personalized support for the lower back and neck to encourage healthy posture and reduce strain during long gaming or working sessions.</p><p>Its 4D adjustable armrests allow movement in four directions—height, width, depth, and swivel—so you can customize arm positioning for maximum comfort while gaming, typing, or editing content. The armrest height adjusts between 64.5cm and 72.5cm, while the generously sized armrest pads provide excellent forearm support.</p><p>The chair features a 90°–160° reclining backrest, allowing effortless transitions between focused gaming, productive work, relaxing, or taking a break. The integrated tilt lock mechanism and 0°–10° adjustable rocking function add even greater flexibility for personalized seating comfort.</p><p>A durable nylon five-star base paired with 65mm heavy-duty caster wheels provides excellent stability and smooth movement across various floor surfaces. Supporting users weighing up to 120kg (264 lbs), the T3 RUSH is built to deliver reliable performance every day.</p><p>Whether you\'re building a professional gaming setup, upgrading your streaming station, or improving your home office, the Corsair T3 RUSH 2023 Gaming Chair Charcoal offers the perfect combination of breathable comfort, premium ergonomics, and durable construction.</p><p>Buy Corsair T3 RUSH 2023 Gaming Chair Charcoal from International Office Solution Purchase the original Corsair T3 RUSH 2023 Gaming Chair Charcoal from International Office Solution, your trusted supplier of genuine gaming chairs, office furniture, and premium workspace solutions in Bangladesh.</p><p>We provide authentic Corsair gaming chairs at competitive prices with dependable customer support and nationwide delivery. Order online or contact International Office Solution for the latest price, product availability, and delivery information.</p><p>Warranty: No Warranty</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Brand</td><td>Corsair</td></tr><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Model</td><td>T3 RUSH 2023</td></tr><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Product Type</td><td>Gaming Chair</td></tr><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>Charcoal</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design</strong></td><td>Style</td><td>Ergonomic Motorsport-Inspired Gaming Chair</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Material</strong></td><td>Upholstery</td><td>Breathable Soft Fabric</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Material</strong></td><td>Cushion</td><td>High-Density PU Foam (50±5 kg/m³)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Material</strong></td><td>Frame</td><td>Solid Steel Frame</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Material</strong></td><td>Base</td><td>Heavy-Duty Nylon Five-Star Base</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Comfort</strong></td><td>Lumbar Support</td><td>Adjustable Lumbar Pillow</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Comfort</strong></td><td>Neck Support</td><td>Adjustable Neck Pillow</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Armrests</strong></td><td>Type</td><td>4D Adjustable Armrests</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Adjustment</strong></td><td>Gas Lift</td><td>100mm Class 4 Gas Lift</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Adjustment</strong></td><td>Seat Height</td><td>48–58 cm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Adjustment</strong></td><td>Reclining Angle</td><td>90°–160° Adjustable Recline</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Adjustment</strong></td><td>Tilt</td><td>0°–10° Adjustable Tilt with Tilt Lock</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Seat Size</td><td>49 × 54 cm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Backrest Height</td><td>85 cm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Shoulder Width</td><td>54 cm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Armrest Height</td><td>64.5–72.5 cm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Mobility</strong></td><td>Casters</td><td>65mm Heavy-Duty Wheels</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Mobility</strong></td><td>Swivel</td><td>360° Rotation</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Load Capacity</strong></td><td>Maximum Weight</td><td>Up to 120 kg (264 lbs)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Usage</strong></td><td>Recommended For</td><td>Gaming, Office, Home Office, Streaming, Content Creation</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Chair', 28700.00, 28500.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/eTWIDLXXYXKslO2ibYY8PslRno1tAW88Ht0YqjfP.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 07:55:47', '2026-07-10 08:11:18', 'Corsair T3 RUSH 2023 Gaming Chair Charcoal Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the original Corsair T3 RUSH 2023 Gaming Chair Charcoal in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features breathable fabric, 4D armrests, 160° recline, lumbar support, and Class 4 gas lift.', 'Corsair T3 RUSH 2023 Gaming Chair Charcoal,\r\nCorsair T3 RUSH Charcoal,\r\nCorsair T3 RUSH Gaming Chair,\r\nCorsair Gaming Chair Bangladesh,\r\nCorsair Chair Price in Bangladesh,\r\nGaming Chair Price in Bangladesh,\r\nGaming Chair Bangladesh,\r\nGaming Chair BD,\r\nCharcoal Gaming Chair,\r\nFabric Gaming Chair,\r\nBreathable Gaming Chair,\r\nErgonomic Gaming Chair,\r\nGaming Chair with 4D Armrests,\r\nGaming Chair with Lumbar Pillow,\r\nGaming Chair with Neck Pillow,\r\nGaming Chair with 160 Degree Recline,\r\nGaming Chair with Class 4 Gas Lift,\r\nGaming Chair for Office,\r\nGaming Chair for Home Office,\r\nGaming Chair for Streamers,\r\nPremium Gaming Chair,\r\nGaming Furniture Bangladesh,\r\nOffice Chair Bangladesh,\r\nOriginal Corsair Gaming Chair,\r\nInternational Office Solution', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1117, 'MSI GeForce RTX 3060 VENTUS 2X OC 12GB Graphics Card iosbd', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 3060 VENTUS 2X OC 12GB Graphics Card is built for high-performance 1080p and 1440p gaming. Powered by NVIDIA Ampere architecture, it features 12GB GDDR6 memory, 3584 CUDA cores, Ray Tracing, NVIDIA DLSS, PCIe 4.0 support, and MSI\'s dual TORX Fan cooling system for efficient thermal performance and reliable gaming.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-3060-ventus-2x-oc-12gb-graphics-card-iosbd-1783848817', '<p>The <strong>MSI GeForce RTX 3060 VENTUS 2X OC 12GB Graphics Card</strong> is a powerful graphics solution designed for gamers, streamers, and creative professionals. Based on the <strong>NVIDIA Ampere architecture</strong>, it delivers next-generation gaming performance with dedicated <strong>2nd Generation Ray Tracing Cores</strong> and <strong>3rd Generation Tensor Cores</strong>, enabling realistic lighting, AI-enhanced graphics, and accelerated performance through <strong>NVIDIA DLSS</strong> technology.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>12GB of high-speed GDDR6 memory</strong>, a <strong>192-bit memory interface</strong>, and <strong>3584 CUDA cores</strong>, the RTX 3060 handles modern AAA games, video editing, 3D rendering, and AI-assisted workloads with ease. The factory-overclocked <strong>Boost Clock of up to 1807 MHz</strong> ensures smooth gameplay and responsive performance in demanding applications.</p><p>MSI\'s <strong>VENTUS 2X cooling system</strong> utilizes dual <strong>TORX Fan 3.0</strong> technology with a large aluminum heatsink and precision-machined heat pipes to maximize airflow and efficiently dissipate heat. The durable metal backplate adds rigidity while improving overall cooling performance, making the card reliable during long gaming sessions.</p><p>The graphics card features <strong>three DisplayPort 1.4a outputs</strong> and <strong>one HDMI 2.1 port</strong>, allowing support for up to <strong>four displays</strong> simultaneously with a maximum digital resolution of <strong>7680 × 4320 (8K)</strong>. HDMI 2.1 enables support for high-refresh-rate 4K gaming and advanced display technologies.</p><p>Built on the <strong>PCI Express 4.0 x16</strong> interface, the RTX 3060 offers high bandwidth for modern desktop platforms. With a <strong>170W power consumption</strong>, <strong>one 8-pin PCIe power connector</strong>, and a recommended <strong>550W power supply</strong>, the MSI RTX 3060 VENTUS 2X OC is an excellent choice for gamers looking to upgrade to a powerful and reliable graphics card. It comes backed by a <strong>3-year manufacturer warranty</strong>.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Type</td><td>GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Capacity</td><td>12GB</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>GPU Architecture</td><td>NVIDIA Ampere</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>3584</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Core Clock</td><td>Boost: 1807 MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>15 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Bus</td><td>192-bit</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Bus Interface</td><td>PCI Express 4.0 x16</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Maximum Resolution</td><td>7680 × 4320</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>DisplayPort</td><td>3 × DisplayPort 1.4a</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>HDMI</td><td>1 × HDMI 2.1</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>HDCP</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Display Support</td><td>Maximum Displays</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Connector</td><td>1 × 8-pin</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>550W</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Graphics Card Power</td><td>170W</td></tr><tr><td>API Support</td><td>DirectX</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td>API Support</td><td>OpenGL</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling</td><td>Cooling System</td><td>Dual TORX Fan 3.0 Cooling</td></tr><tr><td>Physical</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>235 × 124 × 42 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Physical</td><td>Slot Size</td><td>Dual Slot</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Manufacturer Warranty</td><td>3 Years</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 46000.00, 45000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/cn1ZMyRlmImG3HhUuRz44SPhnRMAxt9nVrhTSaiJ.jpg', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 07:56:36', '2026-07-12 09:33:37', 'MSI GeForce RTX 3060 VENTUS 2X OC 12GB GDDR6 Graphics Card Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy the MSI GeForce RTX 3060 VENTUS 2X OC 12GB Graphics Card in Bangladesh at the best price. Featuring NVIDIA Ampere architecture, 12GB GDDR6 memory, 3584 CUDA cores, PCIe 4.0, Ray Tracing, DLSS, dual TORX Fan cooling, HDMI 2.1, DisplayPort 1.4a, and a 3-year warranty.', 'MSI RTX 3060 VENTUS 2X OC, MSI RTX 3060 12GB, RTX 3060 Graphics Card, MSI Graphics Card, NVIDIA RTX 3060, RTX 3060 Price in Bangladesh, 12GB GDDR6 Graphics Card, Gaming GPU, PCIe 4.0 Graphics Card, DLSS Graphics Card, Ampere GPU, MSI RTX 3060 Bangladesh', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(1118, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5050 8G Gaming OC 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5050 8G GAMING OC 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card is a premium gaming GPU built on the latest NVIDIA Blackwell architecture. Featuring 8GB GDDR6 memory, 2560 CUDA cores, DLSS 4, PCI Express 5.0, and MSI\'s advanced TWIN FROZR 10 cooling with STORMFORCE fans, it delivers exceptional gaming performance, efficient cooling, and AI-powered graphics for modern gamers and creators.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5050-8g-gaming-oc-8gb-gddr6-graphics-card-1783670269', '<p>The <strong>MSI GeForce RTX 5050 8G GAMING OC 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong> is engineered to deliver high-performance gaming, AI-enhanced graphics, and superior cooling for today\'s demanding PC users. Powered by the latest <strong>NVIDIA Blackwell architecture</strong>, it introduces advanced <strong>Ray Tracing</strong>, <strong>NVIDIA DLSS 4</strong>, and AI-powered rendering technologies that provide higher frame rates, lower latency, and stunning visual quality in supported games.</p><p>Featuring <strong>2560 CUDA cores</strong>, <strong>8GB of GDDR6 memory</strong>, a <strong>128-bit memory interface</strong>, and <strong>20 Gbps memory speed</strong>, the RTX 5050 GAMING OC provides excellent performance for AAA gaming, esports, streaming, video editing, and creative workloads. The graphics card comes factory overclocked with an <strong>Extreme Performance Clock of up to 2647 MHz</strong> through MSI Center and a <strong>Boost Clock of 2632 MHz</strong>, ensuring smooth gameplay and responsive performance.</p><p>MSI\'s renowned <strong>TWIN FROZR 10 thermal design</strong> incorporates the latest <strong>STORMFORCE Fans</strong>, nickel-plated copper baseplate, precision-machined core pipes, airflow control fins, and a reinforced metal backplate to maximize cooling efficiency while maintaining quiet operation. The advanced cooling solution keeps GPU temperatures low even during prolonged gaming sessions.</p><p>For display connectivity, the graphics card includes <strong>three DisplayPort 2.1b outputs</strong> and <strong>one HDMI 2.1b port</strong>, supporting up to <strong>four displays</strong> simultaneously with a maximum digital resolution of <strong>7680 × 4320 (8K)</strong>. HDMI 2.1b supports <strong>4K gaming at up to 480Hz</strong> and <strong>8K at 120Hz</strong> with Display Stream Compression (DSC), HDR, and Variable Refresh Rate (VRR), making it ideal for high-end gaming monitors.</p><p>Supporting <strong>PCI Express 5.0 x16 (operating at x8)</strong>, requiring a single <strong>8-pin PCIe power connector</strong>, and recommending a <strong>550W power supply</strong>, the MSI RTX 5050 GAMING OC offers a perfect balance of performance, efficiency, and premium build quality. It is backed by MSI\'s <strong>3-year manufacturer warranty</strong> for long-term reliability.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Type</td><td>GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Capacity</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>GPU Architecture</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>2560 Units</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Core Clock</td><td>Extreme Performance: 2647 MHz (MSI Center), Boost: 2632 MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>20 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory Bus</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Bus Interface</td><td>PCI Express 5.0 x16 (operates at x8)</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Maximum Resolution</td><td>7680 × 4320</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>AI Technology</td><td>NVIDIA DLSS 4</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling</td><td>Cooling System</td><td>TWIN FROZR 10</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling</td><td>Fan Design</td><td>STORMFORCE Fans</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling</td><td>Baseplate</td><td>Nickel-Plated Copper Baseplate</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling</td><td>Heat Pipes</td><td>Core Pipes</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling</td><td>Backplate</td><td>Reinforced Metal Backplate</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>DisplayPort</td><td>3 × DisplayPort 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>HDMI</td><td>1 × HDMI 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>HDMI Features</td><td>Up to 4K @ 480Hz or 8K @ 120Hz (DSC, HDR &amp; VRR)</td></tr><tr><td>Display Interface</td><td>HDCP</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Display Support</td><td>Maximum Displays</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Connector</td><td>1 × 8-pin PCIe</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>550W</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Graphics Card Power</td><td>130W</td></tr><tr><td>API Support</td><td>DirectX</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td>API Support</td><td>OpenGL</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td>Physical</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>248 × 135 × 41 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Physical</td><td>Slot Size</td><td>Dual Slot</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Manufacturer Warranty</td><td>3 Years</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 40500.00, 40500.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/Cegw7YTj2384JCydl0ipuSA6EIibU2JudO14G43v.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 07:57:49', '2026-07-10 07:57:49', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5050 8G GAMING OC 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy the MSI GeForce RTX 5050 8G GAMING OC 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card in Bangladesh at the best price. Powered by NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, it features 8GB GDDR6 memory, DLSS 4, PCIe 5.0, TWIN FROZR 10 cooling, STORMFORCE fans, DisplayPort 2.1b, HDMI 2.1b, and a 3-year warranty.', 'MSI RTX 5050 GAMING OC, MSI RTX 5050 8GB, RTX 5050 Gaming OC, MSI Gaming Graphics Card, NVIDIA RTX 5050, RTX 5050 Price in Bangladesh, Blackwell GPU, DLSS 4 Graphics Card, PCIe 5.0 Graphics Card, 8GB GDDR6 GPU, MSI RTX 5050 Bangladesh, Gaming OC Graphics Card', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(1119, 'Corsair T3 RUSH Gaming Chair Grey Charcol', 'The Corsair T3 RUSH 2023 Gaming Chair Grey Charcoal features breathable soft fabric upholstery, solid steel frame, 4D adjustable armrests, 100mm Class 4 gas lift, 90°–160° reclining backrest, adjustable lumbar and neck pillows, 65mm dual-wheel caster wheels, and supports up to 120kg. Designed for gaming, office work, streaming, and all-day ergonomic comfort.', 'corsair-t3-rush-gaming-chair-grey-charcol-1783670896', '<p>The Corsair T3 RUSH 2023 Gaming Chair Grey Charcoal is a premium ergonomic gaming chair built for gamers, streamers, content creators, and professionals who need superior comfort and support during extended gaming or work sessions. Inspired by high-performance motorsport seats, this chair combines breathable fabric upholstery, premium ergonomic features, and a durable construction to deliver an exceptional seating experience.</p><p>The chair is upholstered in soft breathable fabric that promotes airflow and minimizes heat buildup, ensuring you stay cool and comfortable even during marathon gaming sessions or long workdays. The sophisticated Grey Charcoal finish gives the chair a modern, professional appearance that complements gaming setups, streaming studios, and office environments alike.</p><p>Constructed with a heavy-duty solid steel frame, the Corsair T3 RUSH 2023 offers outstanding structural strength and long-lasting durability. Its premium Class 4 gas lift provides 100mm of height adjustment, allowing the seat height to be adjusted smoothly between 48cm and 58cm for the perfect ergonomic seating position.</p><p>The spacious 49cm × 54cm seat base comfortably accommodates a wide variety of users while supporting up to 120kg (264 lbs). High-density foam cushioning provides the ideal balance between softness and support, helping reduce fatigue during extended periods of sitting.</p><p>For enhanced ergonomic support, the chair includes an adjustable lumbar support pillow and a microfiber neck pillow, allowing users to customize their seating position and maintain proper posture throughout the day.</p><p>The 4D adjustable armrests offer complete flexibility by allowing movement in four directions—height, width, depth, and swivel—helping reduce strain on the wrists, elbows, and shoulders whether gaming, working, or creating content.</p><p>The 90°–160° reclining backrest lets users transition effortlessly between focused productivity, immersive gaming, and complete relaxation. The integrated tilt lock mechanism and 0°–10° adjustable rocking function provide additional flexibility, allowing you to fine-tune your preferred seating position.</p><p>Built on a reinforced nylon five-star base with 65mm dual-wheel caster wheels, the chair glides smoothly across various floor surfaces while providing excellent stability and mobility.</p><p>Whether you\'re upgrading your gaming room, home office, or professional workspace, the Corsair T3 RUSH 2023 Gaming Chair Grey Charcoal offers the perfect combination of breathable comfort, premium ergonomics, durable construction, and stylish design.</p><p>Buy Corsair T3 RUSH 2023 Gaming Chair Grey Charcoal from International Office Solution Purchase the original Corsair T3 RUSH 2023 Gaming Chair Grey Charcoal from International Office Solution, your trusted supplier of genuine gaming chairs, office furniture, and premium workspace solutions in Bangladesh.</p><p>We offer authentic Corsair gaming chairs at competitive prices with reliable customer support and nationwide delivery. Order online or contact International Office Solution for the latest price, product availability, and delivery information.</p><p>Warranty: No Warranty</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Brand</td><td>Corsair</td></tr><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Model</td><td>T3 RUSH