7qslNtZc04cQtd4IVsYrK.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 08:08:16', '2026-07-10 08:08:16', 'Corsair T3 RUSH 2023 Gaming Chair Grey Charcoal Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the original Corsair T3 RUSH 2023 Gaming Chair Grey Charcoal in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features breathable fabric, 4D armrests, lumbar support, 160° recline, and Class 4 gas lift.', 'Corsair T3 RUSH 2023 Gaming Chair Grey Charcoal,\r\nCorsair T3 RUSH Grey Charcoal,\r\nCorsair T3 RUSH Gaming Chair,\r\nCorsair Gaming Chair Bangladesh,\r\nCorsair Chair Price in Bangladesh,\r\nGaming Chair Price in Bangladesh,\r\nGaming Chair Bangladesh,\r\nGaming Chair BD,\r\nGrey Charcoal Gaming Chair,\r\nFabric Gaming Chair,\r\nBreathable Gaming Chair,\r\nErgonomic Gaming Chair,\r\nGaming Chair with 4D Armrests,\r\nGaming Chair with Lumbar Support,\r\nGaming Chair with Neck Pillow,\r\nGaming Chair with 160 Degree Recline,\r\nGaming Chair with Class 4 Gas Lift,\r\nGaming Chair for Office,\r\nGaming Chair for Home Office,\r\nGaming Chair for Streamers,\r\nGaming Chair for Content Creators,\r\nPremium Gaming Chair,\r\nGaming Furniture Bangladesh,\r\nOffice Chair Bangladesh,\r\nOriginal Corsair Gaming Chair,\r\nInternational Office Solution', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1120, 'Corsair TC500 LUXE Gaming Chair Frost iosbd', 'The Corsair TC500 LUXE Gaming Chair Frost features premium breathable fabric upholstery, wide flat seat, 4-way adjustable lumbar support, OmniFlex 4D armrests, memory foam neck pillow, 90°–160° reclining backrest, Class 4 gas lift, and 65mm dual-wheel casters. Designed for gamers, professionals, and creators seeking premium ergonomic comfort.', 'corsair-tc500-luxe-gaming-chair-frost-iosbd-1783671425', '<p>The Corsair TC500 LUXE Gaming Chair Frost is a flagship ergonomic gaming chair designed for gamers, streamers, creators, and professionals who demand exceptional comfort, premium craftsmanship, and advanced ergonomic support. Finished in an elegant Frost fabric, this gaming chair combines sophisticated aesthetics with high-performance features, making it an excellent addition to modern gaming rooms, streaming studios, and professional workspaces.</p><p>Built around a heavy-duty steel seat frame and a durable black metal base, the Corsair TC500 LUXE delivers outstanding structural strength and long-term reliability. Engineered for daily use, it offers exceptional stability while maintaining the premium build quality Corsair is known for.</p><p>The chair features a wide, flat seat design that accommodates a variety of body types and sitting positions. High-density foam cushioning provides the ideal balance between plush comfort and ergonomic support, helping reduce fatigue during extended gaming sessions, office work, or content creation.</p><p>Upholstered in premium breathable fabric, the TC500 LUXE Frost promotes airflow to keep you cool and comfortable throughout the day. The refined Frost finish adds a clean, contemporary look that blends seamlessly into gaming setups and modern office environments.</p><p>For personalized ergonomic support, the chair includes a detachable memory foam neck pillow with adjustable height, providing customized support for the neck and upper shoulders. A premium four-way adjustable lumbar support system allows users to precisely position the lumbar support using convenient side adjustment knobs, reducing lower back strain and promoting healthier posture during long hours of sitting.</p><p>The innovative OmniFlex 4D adjustable armrests provide complete customization with height, width, depth, and rotational adjustments, allowing users to maintain natural arm positioning whether gaming, typing, editing, or streaming.</p><p>The 90°–160° reclining backrest lets users switch effortlessly between upright productivity, immersive gaming, and comfortable relaxation. Whether you\'re competing online, attending virtual meetings, or watching your favorite content, the chair adapts easily to your preferred seating position.</p><p>A premium Class 4 gas lift provides smooth and reliable height adjustment, while 65mm dual-wheel caster wheels offer effortless mobility across various floor surfaces without compromising stability.</p><p>Combining premium materials, advanced ergonomics, and a modern Frost color scheme, the Corsair TC500 LUXE Gaming Chair Frost delivers an exceptional seating experience built for long-term comfort, productivity, and performance.</p><p>Buy Corsair TC500 LUXE Gaming Chair Frost from International Office Solution Purchase the original Corsair TC500 LUXE Gaming Chair Frost from International Office Solution, your trusted supplier of genuine gaming chairs, premium office furniture, and workspace solutions in Bangladesh.</p><p>We provide authentic Corsair gaming chairs at competitive prices with dependable customer support and nationwide delivery. Order online or contact International Office Solution for the latest price, product availability, and delivery information.</p><p>Warranty: No Warranty</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Brand</td><td>Corsair</td>