ir Frost in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features breathable fabric, 4-way lumbar support, OmniFlex 4D armrests, memory foam pillow, and 160° recline.', 'Corsair TC500 LUXE Gaming Chair Frost,\r\nCorsair TC500 LUXE Frost,\r\nCorsair TC500 Gaming Chair,\r\nCorsair Gaming Chair Bangladesh,\r\nCorsair Chair Price Bangladesh,\r\nGaming Chair Price in Bangladesh,\r\nGaming Chair Bangladesh,\r\nGaming Chair BD,\r\nFrost Gaming Chair,\r\nPremium Gaming Chair,\r\nFabric Gaming Chair,\r\nErgonomic Gaming Chair,\r\nGaming Chair with 4D Armrests,\r\nGaming Chair with Adjustable Lumbar Support,\r\nGaming Chair with Memory Foam Pillow,\r\nGaming Chair with 160 Degree Recline,\r\nGaming Chair with Class 4 Gas Lift,\r\nGaming Chair for Office,\r\nGaming Chair for Home Office,\r\nGaming Chair for Streamers,\r\nGaming Chair for Content Creators,\r\nLuxury Gaming Chair,\r\nGaming Furniture Bangladesh,\r\nOffice Chair Bangladesh,\r\nOriginal Corsair Gaming Chair,\r\nInternational Office Solution', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL);
