(1121, 'Corsair TC500 LUXE Gaming Chair Shadow iosbd', 'The Corsair TC500 LUXE Gaming Chair Shadow features breathable soft-touch fabric, high-density PU foam, 5D adjustable armrests, integrated lumbar support, magnetic memory foam neck pillow, 90°–155° reclining backrest, Class 4 gas lift, and 65mm nylon caster wheels. Designed for gamers and professionals seeking premium ergonomic comfort and durability.', 'corsair-tc500-luxe-gaming-chair-shadow-iosbd-1783671635', '<p>The Corsair TC500 LUXE Gaming Chair Shadow is a premium ergonomic gaming chair designed for gamers, streamers, content creators, and professionals who demand outstanding comfort, advanced adjustability, and long-lasting durability. With its sophisticated Shadow finish, premium soft-touch fabric upholstery, and professional-grade ergonomic features, this chair is built to deliver exceptional performance during extended gaming sessions and demanding workdays.</p><p>Crafted with a heavy-duty steel seat frame, the Corsair TC500 LUXE provides superior structural strength and long-term reliability. The durable steel construction ensures excellent stability while supporting users weighing up to 120kg (264 lbs), making it suitable for a wide range of users.</p><p>The chair features soft-touch breathable fabric upholstery that promotes airflow while minimizing heat buildup during extended use. The sweat-resistant fabric provides lasting comfort while maintaining a clean, premium appearance that complements modern gaming setups, streaming studios, and professional office environments.</p><p>Its generously sized 49cm × 59cm seat is padded with high-density PU foam (55kg/m³), delivering exceptional cushioning and maintaining its shape over years of daily use. The 80cm high backrest and 55cm shoulder width provide excellent support for the entire back, shoulders, and neck, encouraging proper posture throughout long gaming or working sessions.</p><p>For superior ergonomic comfort, the chair includes a magnetic memory foam neck pillow that provides adjustable head and neck support. The integrated built-in lumbar support system allows users to maintain healthy spinal alignment without requiring an external cushion, reducing fatigue and lower back strain.</p><p>One of the standout features of the Corsair TC500 LUXE Gaming Chair Shadow is its innovative 5D adjustable armrests. Users can adjust the armrests in height, width, depth, swivel angle, and reverse orientation, allowing complete customization for optimal wrist, elbow, and shoulder support while gaming, typing, or editing.</p><p>The 90°–155° reclining backrest provides flexible seating positions ranging from upright productivity to relaxed lounging. An adjustable 0°–10° tilt mechanism with tilt lock allows users to fine-tune their preferred seating angle for maximum comfort.</p><p>A premium Class 4 gas lift offers 10cm (100mm) of smooth height adjustment, allowing the seat height to be adjusted between 48cm and 58cm. The durable steel base combined with 65mm nylon caster wheels delivers excellent stability and effortless movement across different floor surfaces.</p><p>Whether you\'re competing in esports tournaments, streaming live content, working remotely, or spending long hours at your desk, the Corsair TC500 LUXE Gaming Chair Shadow delivers premium comfort, advanced ergonomics, and exceptional build quality for years of reliable performance.</p><p>Buy Corsair TC500 LUXE Gaming Chair Shadow from International Office Solution Purchase the original Corsair TC500 LUXE Gaming Chair Shadow from International Office Solution, your trusted supplier of genuine gaming chairs, office furniture, and premium workspace solutions in Bangladesh.</p><p>We offer authentic Corsair gaming chairs at competitive prices with reliable customer support and nationwide delivery. Order online or contact International Office Solution for the latest price, product availability, and delivery information.</p><p>Warranty: No Warranty</p>', '<figure 