o remain comfortable for hours.</p><p>The adjustable armrests can be customized in both height and forward/backward position, allowing users to achieve the ideal arm placement while reducing strain on the wrists, elbows, and shoulders during gaming, typing, or content creation.</p><p>The chair also features a hydraulic seat height adjustment system, enabling users to easily find their preferred seating height for optimal ergonomic positioning. Combined with its ergonomic backrest and supportive seat design, the chair promotes healthy posture throughout the day.</p><p>Its durable nylon-covered caster wheels glide smoothly and quietly across most floor surfaces while maintaining excellent stability and protecting flooring from scratches.</p><p>Whether you\'re building a gaming battlestation, upgrading your home office, or creating a comfortable workspace, the Thermaltake U Fit Black-Red Gaming Chair delivers premium comfort, ergonomic support, and reliable durability for everyday use.</p><p>Buy Thermaltake U Fit Black-Red Gaming Chair from International Office Solution Purchase the original Thermaltake U Fit Black-Red Gaming Chair from International Office Solution, your trusted supplier of genuine gaming chairs, premium office furniture, and IT accessories in Bangladesh.</p><p>We provide authentic Thermaltake gaming chairs at competitive prices with reliable customer support and nationwide delivery. Order online or contact International Office Solution for the latest price, product availability, and delivery information.</p><p>Warranty: No Warranty</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Brand</td><td>Thermaltake</td></tr><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Model</td><td>U Fit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Product Type</td><td>Gaming Chair</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Gener