(1126, 'Thermaltake V Comfort Black-Red Gaming Chair iosbd', 'The Thermaltake V Comfort Black-Red Gaming Chair features premium PVC leather upholstery, high-density molded foam, 90°–135° reclining backrest, 2D adjustable armrests, adjustable lumbar and headrest cushions, 5-star aluminum base, and supports up to 150kg. Ideal for gaming, streaming, office work, and extended sitting sessions.', 'thermaltake-v-comfort-black-red-gaming-chair-iosbd-1783673396', '<p>Thermaltake V Comfort Black-Red Gaming Chair The Thermaltake V Comfort Black-Red Gaming Chair is designed for gamers who value comfort, style, and adjustability. It features a high-density mould shaping foam that provides firm yet comfortable support during long gaming or working hours. The chair is built with a strong metal frame finished in sleek black, paired with a stylish black and red PVC cover that adds a bold gaming aesthetic to any setup.This Thermaltake V Comfort gaming chair supports a weight capacity of up to 150 kg (330.6 lb) and is ideal for users with a height range of 5\'3\" to 6\'3\" (160 to 192 cm). Its high-back seat design supports your spine and shoulders for better posture. The adjustable backrest reclines between 90° and 135°, offering a relaxing tilt for rest or focus. The tilt angle ranges from 3° to 15°, with both tilt lock and tilt angle lock functions for stability.The 2D adjustable armrests slide forward/backward and adjust in height. The armrest pad size is spacious at 9.84 inches by 3.54 inches (25 x 9 cm), ensuring ample arm support. The chair seat is generously sized at 20.47\" (front) x 11.22\" (back) x 18.5\" depth, supporting a balanced seating position. The seat height is adjustable from 19.29 inches to 22.44 inches (49–57 cm), allowing users to find the most comfortable level.Comfort is further enhanced by the adjustable lumbar cushion and headrest pillow, which reduce lower back and neck strain. The 5-star aluminum base adds strength and durability. 60mm nylon casters ensure smooth mobility on most flooring surfaces. The chair requires assembly, and it ships in a compact package measuring 89 x 70 x 39 cm with a gross weight of 24.5 kg.With its solid build, premium comfort features, and gamer-focused design, the Thermaltake V Comfort Black-Red Gaming Chair is perfect for competitive gaming, streaming, or professional setups.</p><p>Buy Thermaltake V Comfort Black-Red Gaming Chair From Star Tech In Bangladesh, you can get original Thermaltake V Comfort Black-Red Gaming Chair From Star Tech. We have a large collection of latest Thermaltake Gaming Chair to purchase. Order Online Or Visit your Nearest Star Tech Shop to get yours at lowest price. The Thermaltake V Comfort Black-Red Gaming Chair comes with no warranty.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Brand</td><td>Thermaltake</td></tr><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Model</td><td>V Comfort</td></tr><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Product Type</td><td>Gaming Chair</td></tr><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>Black-Red</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design</strong></td><td>Style</td><td>Ergonomic Racing-Style Gaming Chair</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Material</strong></td><td>Upholstery</td><td>Premium PVC Leather</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Material</strong></td><td>Frame</td><td>Heavy-Duty Metal Frame</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Material</strong></td><td>Cushion</td><td>High-Density Molded Shaping Foam</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Material</strong></td><td>Base</td><td>5-Star Aluminum Base</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Comfort</strong></td><td>Head Support</td><td>Adjustable Headrest Pillow</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Comfort</strong></td><td>Lumbar Support</td><td>Adjustable Lumbar Cushion</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Comfort</strong></td><td>Seat Design</td><td>High-Back Ergonomic Seat</td></tr><tr><td><