(1127, 'Thermaltake V Comfort Blue-White Gaming Chair iosbd', 'The Thermaltake V Comfort Blue-White Gaming Chair features premium PVC leather upholstery, high-density molded foam, 90°–135° reclining backrest, 2D adjustable armrests, adjustable lumbar and headrest cushions, Class 4 gas lift, 5-star aluminum base, and supports up to 150kg. Perfect for gaming, streaming, office work, and long sitting sessions.', 'thermaltake-v-comfort-blue-white-gaming-chair-iosbd-1783673581', '<p>The Thermaltake V Comfort Blue-White Gaming Chair is a premium ergonomic gaming chair designed for gamers, streamers, content creators, and professionals who demand exceptional comfort, reliable support, and modern aesthetics. Featuring an elegant Blue-White color combination, this racing-inspired gaming chair combines premium materials with ergonomic engineering to deliver superior comfort during extended gaming sessions, office work, and content creation.</p><p>Built around a heavy-duty steel frame, the Thermaltake V Comfort Blue-White Gaming Chair offers outstanding durability and long-term stability. The premium PVC leather upholstery provides a stylish appearance while being easy to clean, wear-resistant, and suitable for everyday use.</p><p>The chair is equipped with high-density molded shaping foam that offers firm yet comfortable support while maintaining its shape over years of continuous use. Its ergonomic high-back design supports the neck, shoulders, and spine, helping maintain proper posture and reducing fatigue during long hours of sitting.</p><p>Designed to accommodate a wide range of users, the chair supports a maximum weight of 150kg (330.6 lbs) and is recommended for users between 160cm and 192cm (5\'3\"–6\'3\") tall. The spacious seat provides excellent comfort while allowing natural movement during gaming or work.</p><p>The 90°–135° adjustable reclining backrest enables users to switch effortlessly between focused gaming, productive work, and relaxing breaks. The chair also features a 3°–15° adjustable tilt mechanism with both tilt lock and tilt angle lock, allowing users to customize their seating position for maximum comfort and stability.</p><p>Its 2D adjustable armrests can be customized in both height and forward/backward movement, helping reduce pressure on the wrists, elbows, and shoulders during gaming, typing, or editing. The generously sized armrest pads provide excellent support for extended use.</p><p>For enhanced ergonomic support, the chair includes an adjustable headrest pillow and a removable lumbar support cushion that help reduce strain on the neck and lower back while promoting a healthy sitting posture.</p><p>A premium Class 4 gas lift provides smooth seat height adjustment between 49cm and 57cm, allowing users to find their ideal ergonomic seating position. The chair is supported by a durable 5-star aluminum base, while 60mm nylon caster wheels ensure smooth, quiet movement across various floor surfaces.</p><p>Whether you\'re building a gaming battlestation, streaming setup, or modern home office, the Thermaltake V Comfort Blue-White Gaming Chair offers an outstanding combination of ergonomic comfort, premium durability, and stylish design for every session.</p><p>Buy Thermaltake V Comfort Blue-White Gaming Chair from International Office Solution Purchase the original Thermaltake V Comfort Blue-White Gaming Chair from International Office Solution, your trusted supplier of genuine gaming chairs, premium office furniture, and IT accessories in Bangladesh.</p><p>We offer authentic Thermaltake gaming chairs at competitive prices with dependable customer support and nationwide delivery. Order online or contact International Office Solution for the latest price, product availability, and delivery information.</p><p>Warranty: No Warranty</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>