(1128, 'Thermaltake CyberChair E500 Black Gaming Chair iosbd', 'The Thermaltake CyberChair E500 Black Gaming Chair features a breathable mesh backrest, premium aluminum frame, 4D adjustable armrests, adjustable headrest, 90°–117° reclining backrest, Class 4 gas lift, 75mm PU caster wheels, and supports up to 150kg. Ideal for gaming, office work, streaming, and professional use.', 'thermaltake-cyberchair-e500-black-gaming-chair-iosbd-1783673760', '<p>The Thermaltake CyberChair E500 Black Gaming Chair is a premium ergonomic gaming and office chair designed for gamers, professionals, streamers, and content creators who demand exceptional comfort, advanced adjustability, and modern aesthetics. Featuring a sophisticated Black and Silver design with breathable mesh construction, this high-end chair delivers outstanding ergonomic support for extended gaming, working, or creative sessions.</p><p>Built with a premium aluminum frame, the Thermaltake CyberChair E500 offers remarkable structural strength, long-lasting durability, and a refined appearance that complements both gaming setups and professional workspaces. Its breathable mesh backrest enhances airflow, helping users stay cool and comfortable throughout long hours of use while maintaining proper posture.</p><p>Designed with ergonomics at its core, the chair features a high-back design that provides comprehensive support for the spine, shoulders, and neck. The adjustable headrest further enhances comfort by supporting the natural curve of the neck, reducing fatigue during prolonged sitting.</p><p>The 4D adjustable armrests allow users to personalize their seating position with height adjustment, left/right lateral movement, forward/backward positioning, and clockwise/anticlockwise rotation. This advanced flexibility minimizes pressure on the wrists, elbows, and shoulders while promoting healthier posture during gaming, typing, or office work.</p><p>The chair utilizes a wire-control adjustment mechanism combined with a premium Class 4 gas lift, allowing effortless seat height adjustment and smooth backrest positioning. The 90°–117° reclining backrest lets users transition easily from focused productivity to relaxed seating while maintaining ergonomic support.</p><p>Supporting up to 150kg (331 lbs), the Thermaltake CyberChair E500 Black Gaming Chair is recommended for users between 165cm and 190cm (5\'5\"–6\'2\"), making it suitable for a wide variety of body types. Its spacious seat and ergonomic contours ensure balanced weight distribution and lasting comfort throughout the day.</p><p>The chair is supported by a heavy-duty 5-star aluminum base, providing outstanding stability and durability. Smooth and quiet 75mm PU caster wheels glide effortlessly across various floor surfaces, ensuring easy mobility while protecting flooring from scratches.</p><p>Whether you\'re competing in esports, streaming content, attending virtual meetings, or working from home, the Thermaltake CyberChair E500 Black Gaming Chair delivers a premium seating experience with professional-grade ergonomics, superior adjustability, and exceptional build quality.</p><p>Buy Thermaltake CyberChair E500 Black Gaming Chair from International Office Solution Purchase the original Thermaltake CyberChair E500 Black Gaming Chair from International Office Solution, your trusted destination for genuine gaming chairs, premium office furniture, and workspace solutions in Bangladesh.</p><p>We offer authentic Thermaltake gaming chairs at competitive prices with dependable customer support and nationwide delivery. Order online or contact International Office Solution for the latest price, product availability, and delivery information.</p><p>Warranty: No Warranty</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Brand</td><td>Thermaltake</td></tr><tr><td><strong>G