(1129, 'Cougar Stryder Gaming Chair White iosbd', 'The Cougar Stryder Gaming Chair White features breathable fabric upholstery, high-density foam cushioning, 103°–122° reclining backrest, Top Gun swing mechanism, foldable armrests, Class 4 gas lift, steel frame, 60mm rubber caster wheels, and supports up to 120kg. Perfect for gaming, office work, and home use.', 'cougar-stryder-gaming-chair-white-iosbd-1783674205', '<p>The Cougar Stryder Gaming Chair White (CGR-STD-ASW) is a stylish and ergonomic gaming chair designed for gamers, professionals, streamers, and content creators who value comfort, durability, and modern aesthetics. Combining a minimalist white finish with premium materials and practical ergonomic features, this gaming chair is an excellent choice for gaming rooms, home offices, and professional workspaces.</p><p>Built with a full steel crosspiece frame and base, the Cougar Stryder Gaming Chair delivers outstanding durability and stability for everyday use. Designed to support users weighing up to 120kg, its sturdy construction ensures reliable performance during long gaming sessions or extended work hours.</p><p>The chair is upholstered in soft, breathable textile fabric that provides superior airflow compared to traditional leather chairs, helping users stay cool and comfortable throughout the day. The seat and backrest are filled with high-density polyurethane foam, offering balanced cushioning that maintains its shape even after prolonged use.</p><p>Its ergonomic high-back design supports the natural curvature of the spine while the integrated headrest provides additional neck support, reducing fatigue during long hours of gaming, streaming, studying, or office work.</p><p>The 103°–122° adjustable reclining backrest allows users to easily switch between focused work, gaming, and relaxed seating positions. The built-in Top Gun swing mechanism with adjustable swing tension enables smooth rocking motion while allowing users to customize the chair\'s resistance according to personal preference.</p><p>For personalized seating comfort, the chair is equipped with a Class 4 gas lift, allowing smooth seat height adjustment from 470mm to 570mm. The foldable armrests provide flexible arm support and can be folded upward when additional desk clearance or movement is required.</p><p>The 60mm rubberized caster wheels glide quietly and smoothly across various floor surfaces while protecting floors from scratches. Combined with the durable steel base, these premium casters provide excellent stability and effortless mobility.</p><p>Finished in an elegant all-white color scheme, including matching plastic components, the Cougar Stryder Gaming Chair White complements modern gaming setups, minimalist workstations, and contemporary office environments with its clean and sophisticated appearance.</p><p>Whether you\'re gaming competitively, working remotely, attending online meetings, or creating content, the Cougar Stryder Gaming Chair White delivers exceptional comfort, ergonomic support, and long-lasting durability in a sleek, modern design.</p><p>Buy Cougar Stryder Gaming Chair White from International Office Solution Purchase the original Cougar Stryder Gaming Chair White from International Office Solution, your trusted supplier of genuine gaming chairs, premium office furniture, and ergonomic workspace solutions in Bangladesh.</p><p>We offer authentic Cougar gaming chairs at competitive prices with dependable customer support and nationwide delivery. Order online or contact International Office Solution for the latest price, product availability, and delivery information.</p><p>Warranty: No Warranty</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Brand</td><td>Cougar</td></tr><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Model</td><td>Stryder White (CGR-STD-ASW)</td>