(1130, 'Cougar Stryder Gaming Chair Black iosbd', 'The Cougar Stryder Gaming Chair Black features breathable woven fabric upholstery, multi-density foam cushioning, 103°–122° reclining backrest, 2D adjustable armrests, headrest and lumbar cushions, Class 4 gas lift, steel frame, and supports up to 120kg. Ideal for gaming, streaming, office work, and long sitting sessions.', 'cougar-stryder-gaming-chair-black-iosbd-1783674393', '<p>The Cougar Stryder Gaming Chair Black is a premium ergonomic gaming chair designed for gamers, streamers, professionals, and content creators who demand superior comfort, durability, and modern style. With its sleek all-black finish, breathable upholstery, and ergonomic design, this chair is an excellent addition to any gaming setup, home office, or professional workspace.</p><p>Built with a heavy-duty full steel frame and steel base, the Cougar Stryder Gaming Chair offers exceptional structural strength and long-lasting durability. Designed to support users weighing up to 120kg, it provides outstanding stability for everyday gaming, office work, and extended sitting sessions.</p><p>The chair is upholstered in breathable woven textile fabric with high-quality polyurethane foam cushioning, providing excellent airflow and long-lasting comfort. The premium multi-density foam evenly distributes body weight to reduce pressure points, helping users stay comfortable throughout long gaming marathons or productive workdays.</p><p>Its ergonomic high-back racing-style design provides excellent support for the neck, shoulders, and spine. The included adjustable headrest pillow and lumbar support cushion help promote proper posture while minimizing neck and lower back fatigue during prolonged use.</p><p>The 103°–122° reclining backrest allows users to switch effortlessly between upright gaming, focused work, and relaxed seating positions. Combined with the tilt lock mechanism, users can securely lock their preferred seating angle for maximum comfort.</