(1131, 'Cougar DEFENSOR S ARMY GREEN F Gaming Chair iosbd', 'The Cougar DEFENSOR S Army Green F Gaming Chair features PushBack™ lumbar support, magnetic memory foam neck pillow, high-density molded foam, 4D foldable armrests, 90°–155° reclining backrest, breathable leather-like upholstery, Class 4 gas lift, and a steel alloy 5-star base. Designed for premium gaming, streaming, and professional use.', 'cougar-defensor-s-army-green-f-gaming-chair-iosbd-1783674882', '<p>The Cougar DEFENSOR S Army Green F Gaming Chair is a premium ergonomic gaming chair built for competitive gamers, streamers, professionals, and content creators who demand exceptional comfort, durability, and performance. Featuring an exclusive Army Green finish with a modern tactical design, this chair combines advanced ergonomic technology with premium materials to deliver superior support during extended gaming and work sessions.</p><p>At the heart of the Cougar DEFENSOR S is the innovative PushBack™ Advanced Lumbar Support System, engineered to maintain the natural curve of your spine and encourage healthy posture. Unlike traditional lumbar cushions, this integrated support system dynamically adapts to your lower back, helping reduce fatigue and discomfort during long hours of gaming or office work.</p><p>For personalized comfort, the chair includes a magnetic memory foam neck pillow that can be positioned precisely where additional support is needed. The premium memory foam conforms to the natural shape of your neck and head, relieving pressure and enhancing comfort throughout the day.</p><p>The seat and backrest are constructed using high-density molded foam, offering firm yet responsive support that maintains its shape over time. This premium cushioning evenly distributes body weight while reducing pressure points, making the chair ideal for marathon gaming sessions or long workdays.</p><p>The Cougar DEFENSOR S Army Green F Gaming Chair features 4D foldable armrests, originally developed for the COUGAR x VCT 2024 Esports Chair. These advanced armrests provide comprehensive adjustment with height, forward/backward movement, left/right positioning, and rotation while also folding away when greater freedom of movement is required.</p><p>Covered in premium breathable leather-like fabric, the chair combines the luxurious appearance of leather with improved breathability and excellent wear resistance. The material provides a comfortable seating experience while remaining durable and easy to maintain.</p><p>Its extra-wide and deeper seat offers enhanced weight distribution and accommodates various sitting positions, allowing users to remain comfortable during prolonged use.</p><p>The 90°–155° adjustable reclining backrest enables effortless transitions between competitive gaming, productive work, and complete relaxation. Combined with the adjustable tilt tension control, users can customize the rocking resistance for a personalized seating experience.</p><p>Built for long-term durability, the chair features a TÜV-certified Class 4 gas lift, a heavy-duty steel alloy 5-star base, and extra-large caster wheels that deliver exceptional stability, smooth mobility, and reliable performance across different floor surfaces.</p><p>An integrated rear storage pocket provides convenient space for storing accessories such as controllers, cables, or small personal items, keeping your gaming area neat and organized.</p><p>Whether you\'re competing in esports tournaments, streaming live, editing content, or working from home, the Cougar DEFENSOR S Army Green F Gaming Chair delivers premium ergonomics, advanced adjustability, and exceptional build quality to maximize comfort and performance.</p><p>Buy Cougar DEFENSOR S Army Green F Gaming Chair from International Office Solution Purchase the original Cougar DEFENSOR S Army Green F Gaming Chair from International Office Solution, your trusted supplier of genuine Cougar gaming chairs, ergonomic office furniture, and premium workspac