(1132, 'Cougar DEFENSOR S JET GRAY F Gaming Chair iosbd', 'The Cougar DEFENSOR S Jet Gray F Gaming Chair features PushBack™ lumbar support, magnetic memory foam neck pillow, high-density molded foam, 4D foldable armrests, 90°–155° reclining backrest, breathable leather-like upholstery, Class 4 gas lift, and a reinforced steel alloy base. Perfect for gaming, streaming, office work, and professional use.', 'cougar-defensor-s-jet-gray-f-gaming-chair-iosbd-1783675168', '<p>The Cougar DEFENSOR S Jet Gray F Gaming Chair is a premium ergonomic gaming chair designed for competitive gamers, streamers, content creators, and professionals who demand exceptional comfort, durability, and advanced ergonomic support. Finished in an elegant Jet Gray color, this high-performance gaming chair blends modern aesthetics with innovative seating technology to deliver outstanding comfort during extended gaming sessions and professional work.</p><p>At the core of the Cougar DEFENSOR S Jet Gray F is the innovative PushBack™ Advanced Lumbar Support System, designed to maintain the natural curvature of your spine while encouraging healthy posture. Unlike traditional lumbar cushions, this integrated system dynamically supports the lower back, reducing fatigue and helping users remain comfortable during long hours of gaming, streaming, or office work.</p><p>For enhanced upper-body comfort, the chair includes a magnetic memory foam neck pillow that can be easily positioned to provide personalized neck and head support. The premium memory foam naturally conforms to your body shape, relieving pressure while maintaining proper neck alignment.</p><p>The seat and backrest are constructed using high-density molded foam, delivering firm yet responsive cushioning that maintains its shape over years of continuous use. This premium foam distributes body weight evenly, reducing pressure points while providing long-lasting support.</p><p>One of the standout features of the Cougar DEFENSOR S Jet Gray F Gaming Chair is its reengineered extra-wide and deeper seat, which provides greater stability and improved weight distribution. This spacious seating area comfortably accommodates various body types while supporting multiple sitting positions during gaming or work.</p><p>The chair features 4D foldable armrests, originally developed for the COUGAR x VCT 2024 Esports Chair, allowing complete adjustment for height, forward/backward movement, left/right positioning, and rotation. Users can also fold the armrests away for unrestricted movement whenever needed.</p><p>The premium breathable leather-like upholstery offers a luxurious appearance while providing enhanced durability, wear resistance, and improved airflow for lasting comfort.</p><p>For maximum flexibility, the 90°–155° reclining backrest allows users to move seamlessly between competitive gaming, focused work, and complete relaxation. The adjustable tilt tension mechanism enables personalized rocking resistance for a customized seating experience.</p><p>Built to professional standards, the chair includes a TÜV-certified Class 4 gas lift, a reinforced steel alloy 5-star base, and extra-large caster wheels that deliver exceptional stability, smooth movement, and long-term reliability across various floor surfaces.</p><p>A convenient rear storage pocket is integrated into the backrest, providing space to store accessories such as controllers, cables, documents, or other small essentials while keeping your workspace organized.</p><p>Whether you\'re competing in esports tournaments, streaming live, editing content, or working from home, the Cougar DEFENSOR S Jet Gray F Gaming Chair offers premium ergonomic engineering, advanced adjustability, and exceptional comfort to maximize both performance and productivity.</p><p>Buy Cougar DEFENSOR S Jet Gray F Gaming Chair from International Office Solution Purchase the original Cougar DEFENSOR S Jet Gray F Gaming Chair from International Office Solution, your trusted supplier of genuine Cougar gaming chairs, premium office furniture, and ergonomic workspace solutions in Bangladesh.</p><p>We provide authentic Cougar gaming chairs at competitive prices with dependable customer support and nationwide delivery. Order online or contact International Office Solution for the latest price, product availability, and delivery information.</p><p>Warranty: No Warranty</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Brand</td><td>Cougar</td></tr><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Model</td><td>DEFENSOR S Jet Gray F</td></tr><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Product Type</td><td>Premium Ergonomic Gaming Chair</td></tr><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Color</td><td>Jet Gray</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design</strong></td><td>Style</td><td>Ergonomic High-Back Gaming Chair</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Material</strong></td><td>Upholstery</td><td>Premium Breathable Leather-Like Fabric</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Material</strong></td><td>Cushion</td><td>High-Density Molded Foam</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Material</strong></td><td>Frame</td><td>Heavy-Duty Steel Frame</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Material</strong></td><td>Base</td><td>Reinforced Steel Alloy 5-Star Base</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Comfort</strong></td><td>Lumbar Support</td><td>PushBack™ Advanced Lumbar Support System</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Comfort</strong></td><td>Head Support</td><td>Magnetic Memory Foam Neck Pillow</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Comfort</strong></td><td>Seat Design</td><td>Extra-Wide &amp; Deep Ergonomic Seat</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Armrests</strong></td><td>Type</td><td>4D Foldable Adjustable Armrests</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Adjustment</strong></td><td>Reclining Angle</td><td>90°–155°</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Adjustment</strong></td><td>Tilt Mechanism</td><td>Adjustable Tilt with Tension Control</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Adjustment</strong></td><td>Gas Lift</td><td>TÜV-Certified Class 4 Gas Lift</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Mobility</strong></td><td>Casters</td><td>Extra-Large Smooth-Rolling Wheels</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Mobility</strong></td><td>Swivel</td><td>360° Rotation</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Additional Features</strong></td><td>Storage Pocket</td><td>Integrated Rear Backrest Pocket</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Usage</strong></td><td>Recommended For</td><td>Gaming, Streaming, Office, Home Office, Content Creation</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Chair', 60000.00, 60000.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/rCc5n5Zqwuwro7VADGUsEbXiEaB5teHImVcn84l2.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 09:19:28', '2026-07-10 09:19:28', 'Cougar DEFENSOR S Jet Gray F Gaming Chair Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the original Cougar DEFENSOR S Jet Gray F Gaming Chair in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features PushBack lumbar support, magnetic memory foam pillow, 4D armrests, 155° recline, and premium ergonomic comfort.', 'Cougar DEFENSOR S Jet Gray F,\r\nCougar DEFENSOR S Gaming Chair,\r\nCougar DEFENSOR S Jet Gray,\r\nCougar DEFENSOR S Chair,\r\nCougar Gaming Chair,\r\nCougar Gaming Chair Bangladesh,\r\nCougar Chair Price Bangladesh,\r\nGaming Chair Price in Bangladesh,\r\nGaming Chair Bangladesh,\r\nGaming Chair BD,\r\nJet Gray Gaming Chair,\r\nPremium Gaming Chair,\r\nErgonomic Gaming Chair,\r\nGaming Chair with PushBack Lumbar Support,\r\nGaming Chair with Memory Foam Neck Pillow,\r\nGaming Chair with Magnetic Head Pillow,\r\nGaming Chair with High Density Foam,\r\nGaming Chair with 4D Foldable Armrests,\r\nGaming Chair with 155 Degree Recline,\r\nGaming Chair with Class 4 Gas Lift,\r\nGaming Chair with Steel Alloy Base,\r\nGaming Chair with Leather Like Fabric,\r\nGaming Chair for Streamers,\r\nGaming Chair for Content Creators,\r\nGaming Chair for Office,\r\nGa