(1133, 'Cougar SPEEDER ONE Ergonomic Gaming Chair iosbd', 'The Cougar SPEEDER ONE Ergonomic Gaming Chair features breathable mesh upholstery, adjustable lumbar support, adjustable seat depth, an ergonomic headrest, 2D foldable armrests, and a durable Y-frame design, delivering premium comfort for gaming, office work, and professional use.', 'cougar-speeder-one-ergonomic-gaming-chair-iosbd-1783675371', '<p>The Cougar SPEEDER ONE Ergonomic Gaming Chair is a premium ergonomic chair designed for gamers, professionals, streamers, and creators who require exceptional comfort, support, and adjustability throughout long working or gaming sessions. Inspired by high-performance motorsports, this chair combines a sleek racing-inspired design with advanced ergonomic engineering, making it an excellent addition to any gaming setup, office, or workstation.</p><p>Built with a high-strength Y-frame support structure, the Cougar SPEEDER ONE offers excellent stability, durability, and modern aesthetics. Its lightweight yet sturdy construction is engineered to provide reliable support during extended hours of gaming, work, or content creation.</p><p>The chair features premium breathable mesh upholstery, allowing maximum airflow to keep you cool and comfortable throughout the day. Unlike traditional leather gaming chairs, the high-quality mesh fabric promotes ventilation, minimizes heat buildup, and provides long-lasting durability while maintaining excellent seating comfort.</p><p>Designed with ergonomics in mind, the Cougar SPEEDER ONE offers fully adjustable lumbar support that can be precisely positioned to maintain the natural curve of your spine. This helps improve posture, reduce lower back fatigue, and provide continuous support during prolonged sitting.</p><p>For enhanced customization, the chair includes adjustable seat depth, allowing users to position the seat according to their leg length for improved circulation and superior thigh support. This feature ensures optimal comfort for users of various heights and body types.</p><p>The 2D foldable armrests provide flexible adjustment for height and positioning while allowing users to fold them away when greater movement or desk clearance is required. Whether gaming, typing, or relaxing, the armrests help reduce pressure on the shoulders and wrists.</p><p>An adjustable headrest offers personalized neck and head support, helping minimize strain during extended sessions. Together with the lumbar support system, it promotes a healthier seating posture and greater overall comfort.</p><p>The Cougar SPEEDER ONE Ergonomic Gaming Chair is designed to deliver smooth mobility and dependable performance with its durable base and high-quality caster wheels, allowing effortless movement across different floor surfaces.</p><p>Whether you\'re competing in esports tournaments, streaming live, attending online meetings, or working long office hours, the Cougar SPEEDER ONE Ergonomic Gaming Chair provides the perfect combination of ergonomic support, breathable comfort, and modern design to keep you productive and comfortable all day long.</p><p>Buy Cougar SPEEDER ONE Ergonomic Gaming Chair from International Office Solution Purchase the original Cougar SPEEDER ONE Ergonomic Gaming Chair from International Office Solution, your trusted destination for genuine Cougar gaming chairs and premium ergonomic office furniture in Bangladesh.</p><p>We offer authentic Cougar gaming chairs at competitive prices with dependable customer support and nationwide delivery. Order online or contact International Office Solution for the latest price, product availability, and delivery information.</p><p>Warranty: No Warranty</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Brand</td><td>Cougar</td></tr><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Model</td><td>SPEEDER ONE</td></tr><tr><td><strong>General</strong></td><td>Product Type</td><td>Ergonomic Gaming Chair</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design</strong></td><td>Style</td><td>Racing-Inspired Ergonomic Design</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Material</strong></td><td>Upholstery</td><td>Premium Breathable Mesh Fabric</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frame</strong></td><td>Structure</td><td>High-Strength Y-Frame Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Comfort</strong></td><td>Lumbar Support</td><td>Fully Adjustable Lumbar Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Comfort</strong></td><td>Headrest</td><td>Adjustable Headrest</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Comfort</strong></td><td>Seat Depth</td><td>Adjustable</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Armrests</strong></td><td>Type</td><td>2D Foldable Adjustable Armrests</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Mobility</strong></td><td>Casters</td><td>Smooth-Rolling Durable Wheels</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Mobility</strong></td><td>Swivel</td><td>360° Rotation</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Usage</strong></td><td>Recommended For</td><td>Gaming, Office, Home Office, Streaming, Professional Work</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Color</strong></td><td>Finish</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Chair', 34000.00, 34000.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/EdecIMy5EoudmQGhcfpAIW95BvMXqYO0l6UD72Wo.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 09:22:51', '2026-07-10 09:22:51', 'Cougar SPEEDER ONE Ergonomic Gaming Chair Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the original Cougar SPEEDER ONE Ergonomic Gaming Chair in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features breathable mesh, adjustable lumbar support, seat depth adjustment, ergonomic headrest, and 2D folding armrests.', 'Cougar SPEEDER ONE,\r\nCougar SPEEDER ONE Gaming Chair,\r\nCougar SPEEDER ONE Ergonomic Gaming Chair,\r\nCougar SPEEDER Gaming Chair,\r\nCougar Gaming Chair,\r\nCougar Gaming Chair Bangladesh,\r\nCougar Chair Price Bangladesh,\r\nGaming Chair Price in Bangladesh,\r\nGaming Chair Bangladesh,\r\nGaming Chair BD,\r\nErgonomic Gaming Chair,\r\nMesh Gaming Chair,\r\nBreathable Mesh Gaming Chair,\r\nGaming Chair with Lumbar Support,\r\nGaming Chair with Adjustable Seat Depth,\r\nGaming Chair with Adjustable Headrest,\r\nGaming Chair with 2D Folding Armrests,\r\nGaming Chair for Office,\r\nGaming Chair for Home Office,\r\nGaming Chair for Streamers,\r\nGaming Chair for Professionals,\r\nGaming Chair for Content Creators,\r\nOffice Ergonomic Chair,\r\nProfessional Gaming Chair,\r\nCougar Ergonomic Chair,\r\nOriginal Cougar Gaming Chair,\r\nInternational Office Solution', NULL, 36, NULL, NULL),
(1134, 'Power Print TN-85 HP 85A /36A/35A/78A Toner-IOSBD', 'The Power Print TN-85 HP 85A / 36A / 35A / 78A Compatible Toner Cartridge is designed to deliver clear, sharp, and professional-quality black prints for both home and office use. Compatible with a wide range of HP LaserJet and Canon LBP printers, this toner provides reliable performance, consistent output, and easy installation. Equipped with a universal chip, it ensures seamless printer recognition while helping reduce printing costs. Available at International Office Solution, it is an excellent replacement toner for everyday printing needs.', 'power-print-tn-85-hp-85a-36a35a78a-toner-iosbd-1783678758', '<p>The <strong>Power Print TN-85 HP 85A / 36A / 35A / 78A Compatible Toner Cartridge</strong> is a high-quality replacement toner designed for users who need dependable printing performance at an affordable cost. Whether you\'re printing office documents, business reports, invoices, educational materials, or personal files, this toner consistently produces crisp black text and sharp graphics.</p><p>Manufactured using premium toner powder containing fine plastic particles, carbon, and high-quality coloring agents, the cartridge ensures smooth toner distribution for clean and professional print results. The built-in universal chip allows quick installation and immediate printer recognition without complicated setup.</p><p>This toner is an ideal choice for businesses, educational institutions, government offices, and home users who require reliable daily printing while reducing overall printing expenses. It delivers consistent page quality from the first print to the last, minimizing streaks, smudges, and fading.</p><p>The Power Print TN-85 toner supports numerous HP LaserJet and Canon LBP printer models, making it a versatile solution for users operating multiple printer series. Its durable construction and dependable performance help maximize printer efficiency while maintaining excellent print quality.</p><p>Purchase the genuine <strong>Power Print TN-85 HP 85A / 36A / 35A / 78A Compatible Toner Cartridge</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> to enjoy competitive pricing, authentic products, and dependable customer service throughout Bangladesh.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Brand</td><td>Power Print</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Product Name</td><td>Power Print TN-85 Compatible Toner Cartridge</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Product Type</td><td>Compatible Toner Cartridge</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Compatible Toner Models</td><td>HP 85A (CE285A), HP 36A (CB436A), HP 35A (CB435A), HP 78A (CE278A)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Printing</strong></td><td>Printing Technology</td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Printing Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Print Quality</td><td>Sharp Text &amp; Professional Black Output</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Page Yield</td><td>Up to 1,500–2,100 Pages (Varies by toner model and 5% page coverage)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>HP Printers</td><td>HP LaserJet P1005, P1006, P1505, M1522N, M1522NF, M1120, P1566, P1560, P1606dn, P1600f, P1100, P1102, P1102W, M1132, M1134, M1136, M1137, M1138, M1139, M1218nfs</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Canon Printers</td><td>Canon LBP 6000, LBP 6030, LBP 3050, LBP 3150, LBP 3010, LBP 3100, LBP 3108, LBP 3018, LBP 6200, LBP 6230</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware</strong></td><td>Chip Type</td><td>Universal Chip</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Usage</strong></td><td>Installation</td><td>Easy Plug-and-Print Installation</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Recommended Use</td><td>Home, Office, School &amp; Business Printing</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Package</strong></td><td>Package Contents</td><td>1 × Power Print TN-85 Compatible Toner Cartridg