(1135, 'Power Print TN-B028 Toner-IOSBD', 'The Power Print TN-B028 Compatible Toner Cartridge is designed to deliver sharp, clear, and professional-quality black prints for Brother laser printers. With an approximate yield of 2,600 pages, this toner is ideal for home users, offices, schools, and businesses that require reliable, high-volume printing. Compatible with several Brother HL, DCP, and MFC series printers, it offers consistent print quality, easy installation, and excellent value. Available at International Office Solution, this compatible toner is a cost-effective alternative for everyday printing.', 'power-print-tn-b028-toner-iosbd-1783679265', '<p>The <strong>Power Print TN-B028 Compatible Toner Cartridge</strong> is a premium-quality replacement toner engineered to provide reliable printing performance for Brother monochrome laser printers. Designed to meet high printing standards, this toner consistently produces crisp black text, sharp graphics, and professional-quality documents from the first page to the last.</p><p>With an approximate page yield of <strong>2,600 pages</strong> (based on 5% page coverage), the TN-B028 toner is an excellent choice for businesses, educational institutions, government offices, and home users who print regularly. Its high-capacity design helps reduce replacement frequency, saving both time and operating costs.</p><p>Manufactured with premium toner powder and advanced printing technology, the Power Print TN-B028 ensures smooth toner distribution, minimizes smudging, and provides uniform print density throughout the cartridge\'s life. The cartridge is easy to install and works seamlessly with supported Brother laser printers, allowing users to resume printing without complicated setup.</p><p>Whether you need to print invoices, office documents, reports, study materials, contracts, or business correspondence, the Power Print TN-B028 delivers dependable performance and excellent print clarity. It offers an economical alternative to original Brother toner cartridges without compromising print quality.</p><p>Purchase the <strong>Power Print TN-B028 Compatible Toner Cartridge</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> and enjoy genuine products, competitive prices, and trusted customer service across Bangladesh.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Printing Technology</td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Printing Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Supported Printer</td><td>Brother HL-B2100D, HL-B2150W, HL-B2180DW, DCP-B7620DW, DCP-B7640DW, MFC-B7810DW</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Page Yield</td><td>Approximately 2,600 Pages</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Toner', 600.00, 650.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/RIF6WB7STKnywsjoXZAFT0c1m8ECTfDjN9w0qKFL.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 10:27:45', '2026-07-10 10:27:45', 'Power Print TN-B028 Toner Cartridge Price in Bangladesh | Brother Compatible Toner | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Power Print TN-B028 Compatible Toner Cartridge at the best price in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Compatible with Brother HL-B2100D, HL-B2150W, HL-B2180DW, DCP-B7620DW, DCP-B7640DW, and MFC-B7810DW printers. Delivers sharp black prints with up to 2,600-page yield.', 'Power Print TN-B028 Toner, Brother TN-B028 Toner, Brother toner price Bangladesh, TN-B028 cartridge, Brother HL-B2100D toner, Brother DCP-B7620DW toner, Brother MFC-B7810DW toner, compatible Brother toner, International Office Solution', NULL, 311, NULL, NULL),
