(1148, 'Power Print TN-216 Black Toner With Chip-IOSBD', 'The Power Print TN-216 Black Toner with Chip is a high-quality compatible toner cartridge designed for Pantum laser printers. Featuring a built-in smart chip, it ensures quick printer recognition, consistent print quality, and an impressive page yield of up to 1,600 pages. Compatible with Pantum P2506, P2506W, M6506N, and M6556NW printers, it is an excellent choice for home, office, and business users looking for affordable and dependable printing. Available from International Office Solution.', 'power-print-tn-216-black-toner-with-chip-iosbd-1783683753', '<p>The <strong>Power Print TN-216 Black Toner with Chip</strong> is a premium-quality compatible toner cartridge designed to deliver outstanding print quality and reliable performance for Pantum laser printers. Manufactured with advanced laser printing technology and premium toner powder, this toner produces sharp black text, rich graphics, and professional-looking documents with every print.</p><p>Designed for users who demand consistent performance, the TN-216 toner offers an approximate <strong>page yield of up to 1,600 pages</strong> (based on 5% page coverage). Its high-capacity design helps reduce printing costs and minimizes cartridge replacement, making it a practical choice for busy offices, educational institutions, businesses, and home users.</p><p>The built-in <strong>smart chip</strong> allows the toner cartridge to communicate directly with the printer, enabling automatic toner recognition, accurate toner level monitoring, and hassle-free installation. Simply install the cartridge and start printing without additional setup.</p><p>The Power Print TN-216 is fully compatible with <strong>Pantum P2506, Pantum P2506W, Pantum M6506N, and Pantum M6556NW</strong> laser printers. Whether you\'re printing invoices, reports, contracts, office documents, school assignments, or business correspondence, this toner consistently produces bold, smudge-free prints from the first page to the last.</p><p>Built for durability and dependable operation, the Power Print TN-216 serves as a cost-effective alternative to original Pantum toner cartridges while maintaining excellent print quality and reliable printer performance.</p><p>Purchase the <strong>Power Print TN-216 Black Toner with Chip</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, one of Bangladesh\'s trusted suppliers of printers, toner cartridges, and office equipment. Enjoy competitive pricing, genuine compatible products, and dependable customer support.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Printing Technology</td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Printing Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Supported Printer</td><td>Pantum P2506, Pantum P2506W, Pantum M6506N, Pantum M6556NW</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Page Yield</td><td>Up to 1,600 Pages</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Others</strong></td><td>Chip</td><td>With Chip</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td><strong>Manufacturing Warranty</strong></td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Toner', 1200.00, 1250.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/yxcOBFlA7tarqEj5yQX9yasyPah4SmP8fcEAq4XQ.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 11:42:33', '2026-07-10 11:42:33', 'Power Print TN-216 Black Toner with Chip Price in Bangladesh | Pantum Compatible Toner | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Power Print TN-216 Black Toner with Chip at the best price in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Compatible with Pantum P2506, P2506W, M6506N, and M6556NW printers. Prints up to 1,600 pages with sharp black output and reliable performance.', 'Power Print TN-216 Toner, TN-216 toner price BD, Pantum TN-216 toner, Pantum P2506 toner, Pantum P2506W toner, Pantum M6506N toner, Pantum M6556NW toner, Pantum compatible toner, black laser toner, International Office Solution', NULL, 311, NULL, NULL),
(1149, 'Power Print TN-107A Toner With Chip-IOSBD', 'The Power Print TN-107A Toner with Chip is a premium compatible toner cartridge designed for HP LaserJet 107 and 135 series printers. Equipped with a built-in smart chip, it offers automatic printer recognition, consistent print quality, and a page yield of up to 1,000 pages. Ideal for home, office, and small business printing, this toner delivers crisp black text and professional-quality documents at an affordable price. Available from International Office Solution.', 'power-print-tn-107a-toner-with-chip-iosbd-1783683990', '<p>The <strong>Power Print TN-107A Toner with Chip</strong> is a premium compatible toner cartridge engineered to provide reliable, high-quality printing for HP LaserJet monochrome printers. Built with advanced laser printing technology and high-grade toner powder, it produces crisp black text, sharp graphics, and clean, professional documents suitable for business, educational, and personal use.</p><p>Designed for users who demand dependable performance, the TN-107A toner offers an approximate <strong>page yield of up to 1,000 pages</strong> (based on 5% page coverage). Its efficient design makes it a cost-effective printing solution for homes, offices, schools, and small businesses while reducing the frequency of cartridge replacements.</p><p>The toner cartridge features a <strong>built-in smart chip</strong>, allowing automatic printer recognition, accurate toner level monitoring, and quick plug-and-play installation. Unlike chipless cartridges, there is no need to transfer an existing chip or perform manual resets, making installation simple and convenient.</p><p>The Power Print TN-107A is fully compatible with <strong>HP LaserJet 107a, HP LaserJet 107w, HP LaserJet 135a, and HP LaserJet 135w</strong> printers. Whether you\'re printing reports, invoices, office documents, contracts, school assignments, or business correspondence, this toner consistently delivers bold, smudge-free prints with excellent clarity.</p><p>Manufactured as a cost-effective alternative to original HP toner cartridges, the Power Print TN-107A provides dependable performance without compromising print quality. It is an excellent choice for users seeking affordable printing with professional results.</p><p>Purchase the <strong>Power Print TN-107A Toner with Chip</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, a trusted supplier of printers, toner cartridges, and office equipment in Bangladesh. We offer competitive pricing, genuine compatible products, and dependable customer support for all your printing needs.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Printing Technology</td><td>Laser</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Printing Color</td><td>Black</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Supported Printer</td><td>HP LaserJet 107a, HP LaserJet 107w, HP LaserJet 135a, HP LaserJet 135w</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Page Yield</td><td>Up to 1,000+ Pages</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td><strong>Manufacturing Warranty</strong></td><td>No Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Toner', 1300.00, 1350.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/nAdvR60Oi4HXRCD3gXAfoprvR0V6ta6nePgtgxhb.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 11:46:30', '2026-07-10 11:46:30', 'Power Print TN-107A Toner with Chip Price in Bangladesh | HP LaserJet Compatible Toner | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Power Print TN-107A Toner with Chip at the best price in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Compatible with HP LaserJet 107a, 107w, 135a, and 135w printers. Delivers sharp black prints with up to 1,000-page yield and built-in smart chip.', 'Power Print TN-107A Toner, HP 107A toner, HP W1107A toner, HP LaserJet 107a toner, HP LaserJet 107w toner, HP LaserJet 135a toner, HP LaserJet 135w toner,