(1151, 'Power Print TN-136A Black Toner Without Chip-IOSBD', 'The Power Print TN-136A Black Toner Without Chip is a premium compatible toner cartridge designed for HP LaserJet M211, M232, M233, M234, and M236 series printers. It delivers crisp black text, sharp graphics, and reliable print quality with an approximate page yield of up to 1,500 pages. Designed without a chip, it is ideal for users who can transfer the original chip, making it a cost-effective solution for home, office, and business printing. Available from International Office Solution.', 'power-print-tn-136a-black-toner-without-chip-iosbd-1783684479', '<p>The <strong>Power Print TN-136A Black Toner Without Chip</strong> is a high-quality compatible toner cartridge engineered to deliver professional-quality printing for HP LaserJet printers. Manufactured using premium toner powder and advanced laser printing technology, it produces crisp black text, sharp graphics, and clean documents with consistent performance from the first page to the last.</p><p>Offering an approximate <strong>page yield of up to 1,500 pages</strong> (based on 5% page coverage), the TN-136A is an economical solution for users who require dependable everyday printing. Whether you\'re printing office documents, invoices, contracts, reports, school assignments, or business correspondence, this toner provides reliable, smudge-free output while helping reduce printing costs.</p><p>The Power Print TN-136A is fully compatible with a wide range of <strong>HP LaserJet M211, M232, M233, M234, and M236</strong> series printers. This version is supplied <strong>without a chip</strong>, allowing users to transfer the chip from their original toner cartridge where required. This approach lowers replacement costs while maintaining excellent print quality and printer performance.</p><p>Easy to install and built for dependable operation, the Power Print TN-136A is a practical alternative to original HP toner cartridges. It delivers professional p