(1167, 'Xiaomi Wanbo ToGo Pro 500 ANSI 1080p Android Portable Projector(Rechargeable) iosbd', 'The Xiaomi Wanbo ToGo Pro Portable Projector features 500 ANSI Lumens, Native Full HD 1080p resolution, Google TV (Android 14), 2GB RAM, 32GB storage, 99Wh rechargeable battery, Auto Focus, Auto Keystone Correction, Chromecast, Dual-Band Wi-Fi, Bluetooth 5.0, and a 360° adjustable stand for premium portable entertainment.', 'xiaomi-wanbo-togo-pro-500-ansi-1080p-android-portable-projectorrechargeable-iosbd-1783840649', '<p>The Xiaomi Wanbo ToGo Pro 500 ANSI 1080p Android Portable Projector is a premium smart projector designed to deliver an exceptional entertainment experience anytime and anywhere. Combining portability, advanced imaging technology, and intelligent smart features, this projector is perfect for home entertainment, outdoor movie nights, business presentations, gaming, and travel.</p><p>Powered by Google TV based on Android 14, the Wanbo ToGo Pro provides access to thousands of popular streaming apps directly from the projector. With 2GB RAM and 32GB internal storage, users can enjoy smooth multitasking, fast app launching, and seamless navigation. Popular streaming platforms such as Netflix, YouTube, Prime Video, Disney+, and many more are readily available through Google TV, eliminating the need for additional streaming devices.</p><p>The projector features a Native Full HD (1920 × 1080) resolution with support for high-definition content, delivering crisp details, rich colors, and outstanding picture quality. Its 500 ANSI Lumens brightness ensures clear and vibrant visuals in dimly lit rooms and provides an enjoyable viewing experience for indoor and outdoor entertainment.</p><p>One of the standout features of the Xiaomi Wanbo ToGo Pro is its 99Wh built-in rechargeable battery, capable of providing up to 3.5 hours of continuous playback in Eco Mode. This allows users to watch full-length movies, deliver presentations, or enjoy gaming sessions without requiring an external power source, making it an ideal companion for camping trips, outdoor gatherings, vacations, and mobile entertainment.</p><p>For effortless setup, the projector comes equipped with Auto Focus and Automatic Keystone Correction, instantly producing a perfectly focused and aligned image with minimal user intervention. Its innovative 360° adjustable stand allows flexible projection angles, making it easy to project onto walls, ceilings, or projection screens.</p><p>The Built-in Chromecast feature enables wireless casting directly from Android smartphones, tablets, laptops, and other compatible devices. Additionally, Dual-Band Wi-Fi (2.4GHz &amp; 5GHz) provides stable and high-speed wireless connectivity for smooth streaming, while Bluetooth 5.0 allows effortless pairing with wireless speakers, headphones, game controllers, and other Bluetooth accessories.</p><p>Recognized with the prestigious Red Dot Design Award 2026, the Wanbo ToGo Pro combines elegant aesthetics with premium build quality and outstanding functionality. Its compact size, lightweight construction, and sophisticated design make it one of the most stylish and portable smart projectors available.</p><p>Whether you\'re creating a home cinema, hosting outdoor movie nights, giving professional presentations, or enjoying entertainment while traveling, the Xiaomi Wanbo ToGo Pro 500 ANSI Portable Projector offers an outstanding combination of portability, smart features, and premium image quality.</p><p>Buy Xiaomi Wanbo ToGo Pro 500 ANSI Portable Projector from International Office Solution Purchase the original Xiaomi Wanbo ToGo Pro 500 ANSI 1080p Android Portable Projector from International Office Solution, your trusted source for genuine Xiaomi projectors, office equipment, and smart electronics in Bangladesh.</p><p>We offer competitive pricing, reliable customer support, and nationwide delivery. Contact International Office Solution for the latest price, availability, and exclusive offers.<