(1170, 'Transtec TEG-43KN1S EVO 43\" FHD Google TV iosbd', 'The Transtec TEG-43KN1S EVO 43\" FHD Google TV features a 43-inch Full HD DLED display, Android 14 Google TV, ARM Cortex-A55 Quad-Core Processor, Mali G31 MP2 GPU, 1GB RAM, 8GB storage, 20W stereo speakers, Bluetooth 5.1, Dual-Band Wi-Fi, RJ45 LAN, 2 HDMI, and 2 USB ports for an outstanding smart entertainment experience.', 'transtec-teg-43kn1s-evo-43-fhd-google-tv-iosbd-1783848717', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Transtec TEG-43KN1S EVO 43\" FHD Google TV</strong> is a premium smart television that combines stunning Full HD picture quality, powerful performance, and the latest Google TV platform to deliver an exceptional home entertainment experience. Designed for modern households, offices, hotels, and educational environments, this 43-inch smart TV offers vibrant visuals, immersive audio, and seamless connectivity for movies, gaming, sports, and streaming.</p><p>Featuring a <strong>43-inch DLED display</strong> with <strong>Full HD (1920 × 1080) resolution</strong>, the Transtec TEG-43KN1S EVO produces crisp images, vibrant colors, and remarkable clarity. Its <strong>1200:1 contrast ratio</strong> enhances image depth, while <strong>180cd/m² minimum</strong> and <strong>200cd/m² typical brightness</strong> ensure comfortable viewing in various lighting conditions. The <strong>178° ultra-wide viewing angle</strong> provides consistent picture quality from almost any seat in the room, while the <strong>8ms response time</strong> minimizes motion blur during fast-paced sports, gaming, and action scenes.</p><p>Powered by an <strong>ARM Cortex-A55 Quad-Core processor</strong> paired with a <strong>Mali G31 MP2 Dual-Core GPU</strong>, this Google TV delivers smooth performance for streaming, multitasking, and everyday entertainment. Running on <strong>Android 14 with Google TV</strong>, users can access thousands of apps from the Google Play Store, enjoy personalized recommendations, and stream content from popu