(1171, 'Haier H32S80GFX 32\" QLED FHD Android Google TV iosbd', 'The Haier H32S80GFX 32\" QLED FHD Google TV features a 32-inch Full HD QLED display, Google TV OS, ARM Quad-Core processor, 1GB RAM, 8GB storage, Dolby Audio, 24W stereo speakers, Google Assistant, Chromecast Built-in, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, 3 HDMI, and 2 USB ports for a premium smart entertainment experience.', 'haier-h32s80gfx-32-qled-fhd-android-google-tv-iosbd-1783849442', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Haier H32S80GFX 32\" QLED FHD Google TV</strong> is a premium smart television designed to deliver exceptional picture quality, immersive sound, and seamless smart entertainment. Featuring advanced <strong>QLED display technology</strong>, <strong>Google TV</strong>, and powerful hardware, this 32-inch television is an ideal choice for bedrooms, apartments, offices, hotels, and modern living spaces.</p><p>Equipped with a <strong>32-inch QLED panel</strong> and <strong>Full HD (1920 × 1080) resolution</strong>, the Haier H32S80GFX produces crystal-clear images with vibrant colors and remarkable detail. Its <strong>4000:1 contrast ratio</strong> delivers deeper blacks and brighter highlights, while the <strong>280 cd/m² brightness</strong> ensures comfortable viewing in different lighting conditions. With a <strong>178° ultra-wide viewing angle</strong>, everyone can enjoy consistent picture quality from virtually any seat. The <strong>60Hz refresh rate</strong> and <strong>6.5ms response time</strong> provide smooth motion for sports, action movies, and gaming.</p><p>Powered by an <strong>ARM Cortex Advanced Quad-Core Processor</strong>, along with <strong>1GB DDR3 RAM</strong> and <strong>8GB Flash Storage</strong>, this Google TV offers responsive performance for streaming, browsing, and multitasking. Running on the latest <strong>Google TV operating system</strong>, users can easily access thousands of apps and enjoy personalized recommendations from popular streaming platforms including <strong>Netflix, YouTube, Amazon Prime Video, Disney+, Google Play</strong>, and many more.</p><p>The <strong>Haier H32S80GFX</strong> also features <strong>Google Chromecast Built-in</strong>, allowing users to wirelessly cast videos, photos, and presentations directly from compatible smartphones, tablets, and laptops. Built-in <strong>Google Voice Assistant</strong> enables hands-free voice control for searching content, launching apps, checking weather, controlling smart home devices, and more.</p><p>For an immersive audio experience, the television is equipped with <strong>dual 12W stereo speakers</strong> delivering a total output of <strong>24W</strong>. Combined with <strong>Dolby Audio</strong>, <strong>Dolby Digital Decoding</strong>, Surround Sound, Auto Volume Leveling, and multiple sound modes including Movie, Music, Sports, News, and Standard, the TV delivers rich, balanced, and clear sound for every type of entertainment.</p><p>Connectivity options include <strong>3 HDMI ports</strong>, <strong>2 USB ports</strong>, <strong>Built-in Wi-Fi</strong>, <strong>Ethernet (LAN)</strong>, and <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, making it easy to connect gaming consoles, soundbars, streaming devices, USB drives, keyboards, and other accessories.</p><p>Designed with a <strong>modern slim bezel</strong>, lightweight construction, and elegant finish, the Haier H32S80GFX complements any home or office décor while maximizing the viewing area for a more immersive entertainment experience.</p><p>Whether you\'re watching movies, streaming TV shows, attending online classes, gaming, or browsing your favorite apps, the <strong>Haier H32S80GFX 32\" QLED FHD Google TV</strong> offers premium picture quality, intelligent features, and dependable performance in one stylish package.</p><h2><strong>Brilliant QLED Display</strong></h2><p>Experience richer colors and enhanced clarity with the <strong>QLED Full HD display</strong>. The <strong>4000:1 contrast ratio</strong>, <strong>280 cd/m² brightness</strong>, <strong>16.7 million colors</strong>, and <strong>Digital Noise Reduction</strong> technology work together to deliver lifelike visuals. Multiple picture modes including <strong>Standard, Vivid, Movie, Sport, and User</strong> allow you to customize the viewing experience according to your preferences.</p><h2><strong>Immersive Dolby Audio</strong></h2><p>Enjoy powerful and cinematic sound with <strong>24W stereo speakers</strong>, <strong>Dolby Audio</strong>, <strong>Dolby Digital Decoding</strong>, and Surround Sound technology. Multiple audio modes ensure optimized sound whether you\'re watching sports, movies, listening to music, or following the news.</p><h2><strong>Smart Entertainment with Google TV</strong></h2><p>The <strong>Google TV</strong> platform gives you instant access to thousands of apps, personalized recommendations, Google Play Store, and your favorite streaming services. Built-in <strong>Google Chromecast</strong> and <strong>Google Voice Assistant</strong> make entertainment more convenient and enjoyable.</p><h2><strong>Buy Haier H32S80GFX 32\" QLED FHD Google TV from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>Purchase the <strong>original Haier H32S80GFX 32\" QLED FHD Google TV</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted supplier of genuine Haier televisions and consumer electronics in Bangladesh.</p><p>We offer competitive pricing, genuine products, nationwide delivery, and professional customer support. Contact <strong>International Office Solution</strong> today for the latest price, availability, and exclusive offers.</p><p><strong>Warranty:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>4 Years Panel Warranty</strong></li><li><strong>2 Years Parts Warranty</strong></li><li><strong>2 Years Service Warranty</strong></li></ul><p><i>(Warranty provided by Haier Bangladesh. Warranty card must be retained for warranty claims. Installation charges are applicable.)</i></p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>