or home theater systems for enhanced sound quality.</p><p>The Smart SEL-32B24K provides flexible connectivity with <strong>2 HDMI ports</strong>, enabling users to connect gaming consoles, laptops, set-top boxes, media players, and streaming devices simultaneously. A <strong>USB port</strong> allows convenient playback of movies, music, and photos directly from USB flash drives. It also features <strong>AV input</strong> for compatibility with older multimedia devices and traditional entertainment systems.</p><p>With support for <strong>multiple on-screen display languages</strong>, this television is suitable for a wide range of users. Measuring <strong>731 × 433 × 68 mm (without stand)</strong> and weighing only <strong>3.9 kg</strong>, the Smart SEL-32B24K is compact, lightweight, and easy to install or relocate whenever needed.</p><p>Whether you\'re watching live television, enjoying your favorite movies, connecting a gaming console, or viewing multimedia content from USB storage, the <strong>Smart SEL-32B24K 32\" HD Basic LED TV</strong> offers dependable performance, quality sound, and essential features at an affordable price.</p><h2><strong>Clear HD Picture Quality</strong></h2><p>Enjoy crisp and vibrant visuals with the <strong>32-inch HD LED display</strong> featuring <strong>1360 × 768 resolution</strong>. Multiple picture modes allow you to personalize your viewing experience for movies, sports, gaming, and everyday television.</p><h2><strong>Powerful 20W Stereo Sound</strong></h2><p>The <strong>dual 10W stereo speakers</strong> provide balanced and clear audio. Choose from <strong>Music, Movie, User, and Standard</strong> sound modes to enhance your entertainment experience according to the content you\'re watching.</p><h2><strong>Multiple Connectivity Options</strong></h2><p>Connect your favorite devices effortlessly with <strong>2 HDMI ports</strong>, <strong>1 USB port</strong>, <strong>AV input</strong>, and <strong>Audio Line-Out</strong>. Whether 