(1173, 'Smart SEL-32A24K 32\" HD Android TV iosbd', 'The Smart SEL-32A24K 32\" HD Android TV features a 32-inch HD Ready LED display, Android 14 OS, 1GB RAM, 8GB storage, 20W stereo speakers, Wi-Fi, LAN, 2 HDMI, 2 USB, and built-in apps including YouTube, Netflix, Prime Video, Facebook, and Toffee for complete smart home entertainment.', 'smart-sel-32a24k-32-hd-android-tv-iosbd-1783850456', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Smart SEL-32A24K 32\" HD Android TV</strong> is an affordable smart television designed to deliver reliable performance, vibrant picture quality, and seamless access to your favorite entertainment apps. Built with the latest <strong>Android 14 operating system</strong>, this 32-inch Smart TV is ideal for homes, bedrooms, offices, hostels, hotels, and classrooms, offering a complete entertainment solution at an excellent value.</p><p>Featuring a <strong>32-inch LED display</strong> with <strong>HD Ready resolution (1280 × 720)</strong>, the Smart SEL-32A24K produces bright, clear, and detailed visuals for everyday viewing. Whether you\'re watching TV channels, streaming movies, browsing YouTube, or playing casual games, the display delivers enjoyable picture quality. Multiple picture modes including <strong>Bright, Standard, Soft, and User</strong> allow you to customize the viewing experience according to your environment and personal preferences.</p><p>Powered by <strong>Android 14</strong>, the Smart SEL-32A24K provides a smooth, user-friendly interface with quick access to thousands of applications through the <strong>Google Play Store</strong>. Popular streaming platforms including <strong>YouTube, Netflix, Prime Video, Facebook, Toffee</strong>, and many other apps come pre-installed or are easily downloadable, giving you unlimited entertainment without the need for additional streaming devices.</p><p>The TV is equipped with <strong>1GB RAM</strong> and <strong>8GB internal storage</strong>, providing responsive performance for everyday streaming, browsing, and app usage. Its optimized Android platform ensures smooth navigation between applications while delivering reliable performance for daily entertainment.</p><p>For immersive sound, the Smart SEL-32A24K features <strong>dual 10W stereo speakers</strong> with a combined <strong>20W audio output</strong>. Multiple sound modes including <strong>Standard, User, News, Music, and Movie</strong> optimize the audio experience for different content, delivering clear dialogue and balanced sound for movies, television shows, music, and live broadcasts.</p><p>Connectivity options include <strong>Built-in Wi-Fi</strong>, <strong>LAN (Ethernet)</strong>, <strong>2 HDMI ports</strong>, <strong>2 USB ports</strong>, <strong>AV input</strong>, and <strong>Audio Line-Out</strong>, allowing users to connect gaming consoles, laptops, set-top boxes, USB drives, home theater systems, and other multimedia devices with ease.</p><p>The television also supports <strong>multiple on-screen display languages</strong> and includes <strong>energy-saving features</strong>, making it an excellent choice for users seeking both convenience and efficiency.</p><p>Whether you\'re streaming movies, watching live television, attending online classes, browsing YouTube, or enjoying family entertainment, the <strong>Smart SEL-32A24K 32\" HD Android TV</strong> delivers dependable performance, smart functionality, and excellent value for everyday use.</p><h2><strong>Smart Entertainment with Android 14</strong></h2><p>Running on the latest <strong>Android 14</strong>, the Smart SEL-32A24K offers fast navigation and access to thousands of applications via the Google Play Store. Enjoy popular streaming services including <strong>Netflix, YouTube, Prime Video, Facebook, Toffee</strong>, and many more directly from your television.</p><h2><strong>Clear HD Picture &amp; Powerful Audio</strong></h2><p>The <strong>32-inch HD Ready LED display</strong> delivers crisp visuals with multiple picture modes for personalized viewing. Combined with <strong>20W stereo speakers</strong> and multiple audio modes, the TV provides balanced sound for movies, sports, music, and everyday entertainment.</p><h2><strong>Flexible Connectivity</strong></h2><p>Connect all your favorite devices using <strong>2 HDMI ports</strong>, <strong>2 USB ports</strong>, <strong>Wi-Fi</strong>, <strong>LAN</strong>, <strong>AV input</strong>, and <strong>Audio Line-Out</strong>. Whether it\'s a gaming console, laptop, USB drive, or external speaker, the Smart SEL-32A24K is ready for your entertainment needs.</p><h2><strong>Buy Smart SEL-32A24K 32\" HD Android TV from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>Purchase the <strong>original Smart SEL-32A24K 32\" HD Android TV</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted source for genuine Smart televisions and consumer electronics in Bangladesh.</p><p>We provide competitive pricing, genuine products, nationwide delivery, and dependable customer support. Contact <strong>International Office Solution</strong> today for the latest price, availability, and special offers.</p><p><strong>Warranty:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>3 Years Panel Warranty</strong></li><li><strong>2 Years Parts Warranty</strong></li><li><strong>5 Years Service Warranty</strong></li></ul><p><i>(Warranty provided by Smart. Please retain the warranty card for future warranty claims.)</i></p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>General</td><td>Brand</td><td>Smart</td></tr><tr><td>General</td><td>Model</td><td>SEL-32A24K</td></tr><tr><td>General</td><td>Product Type</td><td>Android Smart TV</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Screen Size</td><td>32 Inch</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Panel Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Resolution</td><td>HD Ready (1280 × 720)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Pic