(1174, 'Realview L32D01 32\" HD LED Android Smart TV iosbd', 'The Realview L32D01 32\" HD LED Android Smart TV features a 32-inch HD (1366×768) display with Android 14 for smooth access to popular streaming apps and smart entertainment. It offers a 60Hz refresh rate, 3000:1 contrast ratio, 300 cd/m² brightness, built-in stereo speakers, and multiple connectivity options including HDMI, USB, HDMI ARC, RJ45 LAN, AV, and Optical Coaxial. With a wide 178° viewing angle, DVB-T/T2 & DVB-S2 support, and VESA wall-mount compatibility, it is an excellent choice for homes, offices, and commercial spaces. It comes with a 3-year panel and parts warranty from Realview.', 'realview-l32d01-32-hd-led-android-smart-tv-iosbd-1783851898', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>The <strong>Realview L32D01 32\" HD LED Android Smart TV</strong> is an excellent choice for users looking for an affordable smart television with modern features and reliable performance. Featuring a <strong>32-inch HD display</strong> with <strong>1366 × 768 resolution</strong>, this TV delivers sharp visuals, vibrant colors, and clear picture quality for movies, TV channels, sports, and everyday entertainment.</p><p>Running on <strong>Android 14</strong>, the Realview L32D01 offers a smooth and user-friendly smart TV experience with easy access to popular streaming platforms, apps, and online content. Its <strong>60Hz refresh rate</strong> and <strong>5ms response time</strong> ensure smooth video playback, while the <strong>3000:1 contrast ratio</strong>, <strong>300 cd/m² brightness</strong>, and support for <strong>66.8 million colors</strong> provide bright, detailed, and lifelike images from virtually any angle thanks to its <strong>178° wide viewing angle</strong>.</p><p>For audio, the TV comes equipped with built-in <strong>stereo speakers</strong> that deliver balanced and immersive sound for movies, music, sports, and everyday television viewing.</p><p>The <strong>Realview L32D01 Android TV</strong> offers extensive connectivity options, including <strong>2× HDMI</strong>, <strong>HDMI ARC</strong>, <strong>USB 2.0</strong>, <strong>RJ45 LAN</strong>, <strong>AV input</strong>, <strong>Earphone jack</strong>, <strong>YPbPr</strong>, and <strong>Optical Coaxial output</strong>, making it easy to connect gaming consoles, streaming devices, laptops, sound systems, and external storage devices. It also supports <strong>DVB-T/T2</strong> and <strong>DVB-S2</strong> digital broadcasting standards for convenient access to terrestrial and satellite TV channels.</p><p>Designed with versatility in mind, the TV supports <strong>VESA 200×100mm wall mounting</strong>, making it suitable for living rooms, bedrooms, offices, shops, classrooms, and other entertainment spaces.</p><h3><strong>Buy Realview L32D01 32\" HD LED Android Smart TV from International Office Solution</strong></h3><p>Purchase the <strong>original Realview L32D01 32\" HD LED Android Smart TV</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted destination for genuine televisions and smart home entertainment products in Bangladesh. We offer competitive pricing, authentic products, and reliable customer service to ensure the best shopping experience.</p><p>The <strong>Realview L32D01 32\" HD LED Android Smart TV</strong> comes with a <strong>3-year panel and parts warranty provided by Realview</strong>. Please keep the original warranty card for any warranty claims. <strong>Installation charges may apply.</strong></p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Display</td><td>Screen Size</td><td>32 Inch</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Display Type</td><td>LED</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Resolution</td><td>HD (1366 × 768)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Response Time</td><td>5ms</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td