ladesh, 32 inch Android TV, HD LED Smart TV, Android 14 TV, Realview TV, Smart TV Bangladesh, LED television, 32 inch LED TV, Realview L32D01 price, affordable Android TV, home entertainment TV, HD Smart LED TV, Realview television, buy Realview TV Bangladesh, Android LED TV, Realview 32 inch TV', NULL, 441, NULL, NULL),
(1175, 'Haier H32K85GX 32\" DLED HD Google TV iosbd', 'The Haier H32K85GX 32\" DLED HD Google TV features a 32-inch HD DLED display with HDR10, Google TV, Chromecast Built-in, and Google Assistant. Powered by a Quad-Core processor with 1GB RAM and 8GB storage, it delivers smooth performance for streaming and entertainment. Equipped with Dolby Audio, Wi-Fi, 3 HDMI, 2 USB, Bluetooth Remote, and 12W dual speakers, it offers an immersive viewing experience backed by 4-year panel and 2-year parts & service warranty.', 'haier-h32k85gx-32-dled-hd-google-tv-iosbd-1783853059', '<p>The Haier H32K85GX 32\" DLED HD Google TV is a modern smart television that combines excellent picture quality, intelligent features, and reliable performance to create an enjoyable home entertainment experience. Whether you\'re streaming movies, watching live sports, attending online classes, or playing games, this TV delivers smooth performance with the power of Google TV.</p><p>Featuring a 32-inch DLED display with HD resolution (1366 × 768) and HDR10 support, the Haier H32K85GX produces bright colors, deeper contrast, and sharp image quality. Its 3000:1 contrast ratio, 250 cd/m² brightness, 60Hz refresh rate, and 6.5ms response time ensure smooth motion and clear visuals for everyday entertainment. The 178° ultra-wide viewing angle allows everyone in the room to enjoy the same vibrant picture quality from almost any position.</p><p>Powered by an ARM Cortex Advanced Quad-Core processor and ARM Mali graphics, the TV provides fast navigation and responsive performance. It comes with 1GB DDR3 RAM and 8GB internal storage, allowing you to install and run your favorite applications smoothly.</p><p>Running on the latest Google TV platform, the Haier H32K85GX gives you access to thousands of entertainment apps through Google Play. Popular streaming services like Netflix, YouTube, Amazon Prime Video, and many more come ready to use. Built-in Google Assistant lets you control your TV using voice commands, search for movies, open apps, or control compatible smart home devices effortlessly.</p><p>With Chromecast Built-in, you can instantly cast photos, videos, presentations, or mobile games from your Android or iPhone directly to the television without additional accessories.</p><p>The audio experience is equally impressive. Dual 12W stereo speakers combined with Dolby Audio and Dolby Digital decoding provide rich, balanced, and immersive sound for movies, music, sports, and gaming.</p><p>For connectivity, the TV includes:</p><p>3 HDMI Ports</p><p>2 USB Ports</p><p>Wi-Fi</p><p>Ethernet (LAN)</p><p>RF Input</p><p>Composite AV Input</p><p>These options make it easy to connect gaming consoles, laptops, soundbars, streaming devices, USB drives, and other multimedia equipment.</p><p>The TV also includes practical features such as Bluetooth Remote, Digital Noise Reduction, Comb Filter, Child Lock, Auto Timer, Auto Volume Leveling (AVL), and support for DVB-T/C/T2 digital broadcasting standards.</p><p>Its elegant slim-bezel design complements modern living rooms, bedrooms, offices, restaurants, hotels, and conference rooms while offering reliable everyday performance.</p><p>If you\'re searching for a dependable 32-inch Google TV with official warranty, premium picture quality, HDR support, Dolby Audio, and Google\'s smart ecosystem, the Haier H32K85GX is an outstanding choice.</p><p>Buy Haier H32K85GX 32\" DLED HD Google TV from International Office Solution Buy the original Haier H32K85GX 32\" DLED HD Google TV from International Office Solution, your trusted destination for genuine Haier televisions and smart home entertainment products in Bangladesh. We offer competitive prices, authentic products, reliable after-sales support, and fast nationwide delivery.</p><p>The Haier H32K85GX 32\" DLED HD Google TV comes with an official 4-year panel warranty and 2-year parts &amp; service warranty provided by Haier. Please keep the original warranty card for future warranty claims. Installation charges are applicable.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Display</strong></td><td>Screen Size</td><td>32 Inch</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display</strong></td><td>Display Type</td><td>DLED</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display</strong></td><td>Resolution</td><td>HD (1366 × 768)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display</strong></td><td>HDR Support</td><td>HDR10</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display</strong></td><td>Refresh Rate</td><td>60Hz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display</strong></td><td>Brightness</td><td>250 cd/m²</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display</strong></td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>3000:1</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display</strong></td><td>Response Time</td><td>6.5ms</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display</strong></td><td>Viewing Angle</td><td>178° (H/V)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Processor</strong></td><td>CPU</td><td>ARM Cortex Advanced Quad-Core</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Processor</strong></td><td>GPU</td><td>ARM Mali Graphics</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating System</strong></td><td>OS</td><td>Google TV</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory</strong></td><td>RAM</td><td>1GB DDR3</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory</strong></td><td>Storage</td><td>8GB Flash Storage</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Smart Features</strong></td><td>Google Assistant</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Smart Features</strong></td><td>Chromecast Built-in</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Smart Features</strong></td><td>Google Play Store</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Smart Features</strong></td><td>Netflix</td><td>Pre-installed</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Smart Features</strong></td><td>YouTube</td><td>Pre-installed</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Smart Features</strong></td><td>Amazon Prime Video</td><td>Supported</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>Speaker Output</td><td>12W + 12W Stereo Speakers</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Audio</strong></td><td>