rnational Office Solution in Bangladesh. Enjoy HDR10, Google TV, Chromecast, Dolby Audio, 32-inch HD display, Wi-Fi, 3 HDMI ports, and official Haier warranty at the best price.', 'Haier H32K85GX price in Bangladesh, Haier 32 inch Google TV price in Bangladesh, Haier 32 inch smart TV, Haier HD Google TV, Haier H32K85GX, Haier TV price BD, Google TV 32 inch Bangladesh, 32 inch Google TV price, Haier LED TV Bangladesh, Android TV Haier, Haier HDR10 TV, Haier TV with Chromecast, Haier TV with Google Assistant, best 32 inch smart TV in Bangladesh, WiFi smart TV Bangladesh, Haier television price, Haier official TV Bangladesh, buy Haier TV online Bangladesh, International Office Solution, 32 inch LED TV Bangladesh', NULL, 376, NULL, NULL),
(1176, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5050 8G Gaming OC 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'Experience next-generation gaming with the MSI GeForce RTX 5050 8G GAMING OC Graphics Card. Powered by NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, equipped with 8GB GDDR6 memory, DLSS 4 AI technology, and advanced TWIN FROZR 10 cooling, it delivers smooth gaming, fast rendering, and reliable performance for gamers, streamers, and content creators.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5050-8g-gaming-oc-8gb-gddr6-graphics-card-1783854599', '<p>The <strong>MSI GeForce RTX 5050 8G GAMING OC 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong> combines cutting-edge NVIDIA Blackwell architecture with MSI\'s premium cooling technology to deliver exceptional gaming and creative performance. Equipped with <strong>2560 CUDA cores</strong>, the GPU accelerates modern games, AI workloads, video editing, and 3D rendering with impressive efficiency.</p><p>Its <strong>8GB GDDR6 memory</strong> running at <strong>20 Gbps</strong> provides the bandwidth required for modern AAA games and professional creative applications. NVIDIA\'s latest <strong>DLSS 4</strong> technology uses artificial intelligence to boost frame rates while maintaining exceptional image quality, making gameplay smoother even at higher resolutions.</p><p>Thermal performance is handled by MSI\'s renowned <strong>TWIN FROZR 10 cooling system</strong>, featuring advanced <strong>STORMFORCE fans</strong>, precision heat pipes, and a reinforced airflow backplate. This cooling solution keeps temperatures under control while minimizing fan noise during heavy gaming sessions.</p><p>The graphics card offers versatile connectivity with <strong>three DisplayPort 2.1b outputs</strong> and <strong>one HDMI 2.1b port</strong>, supporting up to <strong>8K 120Hz</strong> or <strong>4K 480Hz</strong> with DSC, HDR, and Variable Refresh Rate technologies. Support for <strong>DirectX 12 Ultimate</strong>, <strong>OpenGL 4.6</strong>, and NVIDIA G-SYNC ensures compatibility with the latest gaming technologies.</p><p>Using <strong>MSI Center</strong>, users can monitor hardware, optimize performance, and switch between different operating modes. Enthusiasts can unlock additional performance safely through <strong>MSI Afterburner</strong>, the industry\'s most trusted GPU overclocking utility.</p><p>Whether you\'re building a high-performance gaming PC, a professional editing workstation, or a powerful AI development system, the MSI RTX 5050 GAMING OC delivers dependable performance, excellent cooling, and long-term reliability.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>raphics Engine</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5050</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Architecture</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Processing</td><td>2560 Units</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory</td><td>8GB GDDR6</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td><td>20 Gbps</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Memory Bus</td><td>Memory</td><td>128-bit</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Interface</td><td>Expansion</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5 x16 (Uses x8)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Boost Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>2632 MHz</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Extreme Performance Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>2647 MHz (MSI Center)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Maximum Resolution</td><td>Display</td><td>7680 × 4320</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>DisplayPort</td><td>Display Output</td><td>3 × DisplayPort 2.1b</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>Display Output</td><td>1 × HDMI 2.1b</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>HDMI Support</td><td>Display</td><td>Up to 4K 480Hz / 8K 120Hz (DSC, HDR, VRR)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Multi Display</td><td>Display</td><td>Up to 4 Displays</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>HDCP</td><td>Features</td><td>Yes</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>DirectX Support</td><td>API</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>API</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Cooling</td><td>Cooling</td><td>TWIN FROZR 10</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Fan Technology</td><td>Cooling</td><td>STORMFORCE Fan</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Heatpipe</td><td>Cooling</td><td>Precision Heat Pipe</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Backplate</td><td>Cooling</td><td>Reinforced Metal Backplate with Airflow Vent</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Software</td><td>Software</td><td>MSI Center</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Overclocking</td><td>Software</td><td>MSI Afterburner</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Power Connector</td><td>Power</td><td>1 × 8-Pin</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Power</td><td>550W</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>Power</td><td>130W</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Dimensions</td><td>Physical</td><td>202 × 120 × 41 mm</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Manufacturer Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Grapgics Card', 40500.00, 40500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/8Y68xd5E7DT0AZNDLBwlhCt4TrkD4fZFMwY8P27G.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 11:09:59', '2026-07-12 11:09:59', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5050 8G GAMING OC 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the original MSI GeForce RTX 5050 8G GAMING OC 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card from International Office Solution in Bangladesh. Features NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 2560 CUDA Cores, DLSS 4, TWIN FROZR 10 cooling, 8GB GDDR6 memory, official 3-year warranty, competitive price, and fast nationwide delivery.', 'Buy the original MSI GeForce RTX 5050 8G GAMING OC 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card from International Office Solution in Bangladesh. Features NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 2560 CUDA Cores, DLSS 4, TWIN FROZR 10 cooling, 8GB GDDR6 memory, official 3-year warranty, competitive price, and fast nationwide delivery.', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(1177, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 8G VENTUS 2X OC 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5060 8G VENTUS 2X OC is a powerful graphics card featuring NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 8GB GDDR7 memory, DLSS 4, advanced ray tracing, and an efficient dual-fan cooling system. It is an excellent choice for high-refresh-rate gaming, content creation, and AI-powered applications.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5060-8g-ventus-2x-oc-8gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783854712', '<p>The <strong>MSI GeForce RTX 5060 8G VENTUS 2X OC 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> is engineered for gamers and creators seeking next-generation performance and efficiency. Powered by NVIDIA\'s latest <strong>Blackwell architecture</strong>, it offers exceptional graphics performance while maintaining excellent power efficiency.</p><p>The <strong>8GB GDDR7 memory</strong> provides significantly higher bandwidth than previous-generation memory, enabling smoother gameplay, faster rendering, and improved responsiveness in demanding applications. Combined with <strong>DLSS 4 AI technology</strong>, the RTX 5060 delivers higher frame rates and enhanced image quality in supported games.</p><p>MSI\'s <strong>VENTUS 2X cooling system</strong> features dual high-performance fans and a robust heatsink that efficiently dissipates heat while maintaining low noise levels during extended gaming sessions. The reinforced metal backplate improves structural durability and contributes to better cooling performance.</p><p>With support for <strong>DirectX 12 Ultimate</strong>, real-time ray tracing, AI acceleration, and modern display standards including <strong>DisplayPort 2.1b</strong> and <strong>HDMI 2.1b</strong>, this graphics card is ready for immersive gaming, professional content creation, streaming, and AI workloads.</p><p>Whether you\'re upgrading your gaming PC or building a new workstation, the MSI RTX 5060 VENTUS 2X OC offers an ideal balance of performance, efficiency, and reliability.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th><th>Specs</th></tr></thead></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Graphics Engine</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Architecture</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory</td><td>8GB GDDR7</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Factory Overclock</td><td>Performance</td><td>Yes</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Interface</td><td>Expansion</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5 x16</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>AI Technology</td><td>Features</td><td>NVIDIA DLSS 4</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Ray Tracing</td><td>Features</td><td>4th Generation Ray Tracing</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Cooling</td><td>Cooling</td><td>MSI VENTUS 2X Dual-Fan Cooling</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Backplate</td><td>Cooling</td><td>Reinforced Metal Backplate</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>DisplayPort</td><td>Display Output</td><td>3 × DisplayPort 2.1b</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>Display Output</td><td>1 × HDMI 2.1b</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Maximum Resolution</td><td>Display</td><td>Up to 7680 × 4320 (8K)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Multi Display</td><td>Display</td><td>Up to 4 Displays</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>DirectX</td><td>API</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>OpenGL</td><td>API</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Software</td><td>Software</td><td>MSI Center &amp; MSI Afterburner</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Manufacturer Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 56900.00, 56900.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/8a6vy4iaOz8lyD0EPxpHQ90f1N4VNk2hQjlYVSnB.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 11:11:52', '2026-07-12 11:11:52', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 8G VENTUS 2X OC 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the MSI GeForce RTX 5060 8G VENTUS 2X OC 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card from International Office Solution. Featuring NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, DLSS 4, advanced ray tracing, VENTUS 2X cooling, official warranty, and competitive prices in Bangladesh.', 'MSI RTX 5060, MSI GeForce RTX 5060, RTX 5060 8GB GDDR7, MSI VENTUS 2X OC, RTX 5060 Price in Bangladesh, MSI Graphics Card Bangladesh, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, DLSS 4 Graphics Card, Gaming Graphics Card BD, MSI RTX 5060 OC, International Office Solution, GDDR7 Graphics Card, MSI GPU Bangladesh, RTX 5060 Bangladesh', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL);
