(1178, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G SHADOW 2X OC PLUS 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G SHADOW 2X OC PLUS delivers outstanding gaming and content creation performance with NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 8GB GDDR7 memory, 4608 CUDA cores, DLSS 4, and an efficient dual-fan cooling system. It\'s an excellent choice for high-refresh-rate 1080p and 1440p gaming, AI-powered applications, and professional creative workloads.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5060-ti-8g-shadow-2x-oc-plus-8gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783854808', '<p>The <strong>MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G SHADOW 2X OC PLUS 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> is engineered for gamers, streamers, creators, and professionals who demand reliable performance and efficient cooling. Built on the latest <strong>NVIDIA Blackwell architecture</strong>, it combines advanced AI capabilities, ray tracing, and ultra-fast GDDR7 memory to deliver an outstanding gaming and computing experience.</p><p>Featuring <strong>4608 CUDA cores</strong> and <strong>8GB of GDDR7 memory running at 28 Gbps</strong>, the RTX 5060 Ti offers impressive graphics performance for modern AAA games, video editing, 3D rendering, AI workloads, and creative applications. NVIDIA <strong>DLSS 4</strong> utilizes artificial intelligence to significantly improve frame rates while maintaining outstanding image quality, allowing you to enjoy smoother gameplay at higher settings.</p><p>MSI\'s <strong>SHADOW 2X cooling system</strong> incorporates <strong>STORMFORCE fans</strong>, precision heat pipes, and a reinforced metal backplate with an airflow vent to maximize cooling efficiency while keeping noise levels low. This advanced thermal design ensures stable performance even during extended gaming sessions or demanding workloads.</p><p>Connectivity includes <strong>three DisplayPort 2.1b outputs</strong> and <strong>one HDMI 2.1b port</strong>, supporting resolutions up to <strong>8K 120Hz</strong> or <strong>4K 480Hz</strong> with DSC, HDR, and Variable Refresh Rate technologies. Support for <strong>DirectX 12 Ultimate</strong>, <strong>OpenGL 4.6</strong>, and NVIDIA G-SYNC ensures compatibility with the latest games and display technologies.</p><p>With <strong>MSI Center</strong>, users can monitor hardware performance, optimize settings, and customize GPU operation in real time, while <strong>MSI Afterburner</strong> provides industry-leading overclocking and monitoring tools for enthusiasts seeking additional performance.</p><p>Whether you\'re building a powerful gaming PC or a professional workstation, the MSI RTX 5060 Ti SHADOW 2X OC PLUS delivers excellent performance, efficient cooling, and dependable reliability.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th><th>Specs</th></tr></thead></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Graphics Engine</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 Ti</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Architecture</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Processing</td><td>4608 Units</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory</td><td>8GB GDDR7</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td><td>28 Gbps</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Memory Bus</td><td>Memory</td><td>128-bit</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Interface</td><td>Expansion</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5 x16 (uses x8)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Extreme Performance Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>2617 MHz (MSI Center)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Boost Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>2602 MHz</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Maximum Resolution</td><td>Display</td><td>7680 × 4320</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>DisplayPort</td><td>Display Output</td><td>3 × DisplayPort 2.1b</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>Display Output</td><td>1 × HDMI 2.1b</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>HDMI Features</td><td>Display</td><td>Up to 4K 480Hz or 8K 120Hz with DSC, HDR &amp; VRR</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Maximum Displays</td><td>Display</td><td>4</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>HDCP Support</td><td>Features</td><td>Yes</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>G-SYNC</td><td>Features</td><td>Supported</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>DirectX Support</td><td>API</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>API</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Cooling System</td><td>Cooling</td><td>SHADOW 2X Dual-Fan Cooling</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Fan Technology</td><td>Cooling</td><td>STORMFORCE Fan</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Heat Pipes</td><td>Cooling</td><td>Precision Heat Pipe</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Backplate</td><td>Cooling</td><td>Reinforced Backplate with Airflow Vent</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Software</td><td>Utility</td><td>MSI Center</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Overclocking Utility</td><td>Utility</td><td>MSI Afterburner</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>Power</td><td>180W</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Power Connector</td><td>Power</td><td>1 × 8-Pin</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Power</td><td>600W</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Card Dimensions</td><td>Physical</td><td>226 × 126 × 41 mm</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Manufacturer Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 58900.00, 58900.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/uS9jxmle0lMl66bJXW2FF9byQ7VDAabJzpMsb2Um.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 11:13:28', '2026-07-12 11:13:28', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G SHADOW 2X OC PLUS 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G SHADOW 2X OC PLUS 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card from International Office Solution. Featuring NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 4608 CUDA Cores, DLSS 4, SHADOW 2X cooling, official 3-year warranty, and competitive prices in Bangladesh.', 'MSI RTX 5060 Ti, MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti, RTX 5060 Ti 8GB, MSI SHADOW 2X OC PLUS, RTX 5060 Ti Price in Bangladesh, MSI Graphics Card Bangladesh, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, GDDR7 Graphics Card, DLSS 4 Graphics Card, Gaming Graphics Card BD, MSI GPU Bangladesh, RTX 5060 Ti OC, International Office Solution, AI Graphics Card, PCIe Gen5 Graphics Card', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(1179, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G VENTUS 2X OC PLUS 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G VENTUS 2X OC PLUS combines NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 4608 CUDA cores, 8GB GDDR7 memory, DLSS 4, and an efficient VENTUS 2X cooling system to deliver outstanding gaming, AI processing, and creative performance. It is ideal for high-refresh-rate 1080p and 1440p gaming as well as demanding professional applications.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5060-ti-8g-ventus-2x-oc-plus-8gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783854925', '<p>The <strong>MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G VENTUS 2X OC PLUS 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> is engineered for gamers, creators, and professionals seeking high-performance graphics with outstanding efficiency. Powered by NVIDIA\'s latest <strong>Blackwell architecture</strong>, this GPU brings advanced AI acceleration, realistic ray tracing, and improved power efficiency for next-generation gaming and productivity.</p><p>Featuring <strong>4608 CUDA Cores</strong> and <strong>8GB of GDDR7 memory</strong> running at <strong>28 Gbps</strong>, the RTX 5060 Ti delivers exceptional performance for modern AAA games, streaming, 3D rendering, video editing, and AI-enhanced applications. NVIDIA <strong>DLSS 4</strong> leverages AI-powered frame generation to increase frame rates while maintaining excellent visual quality, ensuring smoother gameplay even at demanding settings.</p><p>MSI\'s <strong>VENTUS 2X cooling system</strong> utilizes dual high-performance fans, an optimized heatsink, and a reinforced metal backplate to maintain excellent thermal performance while minimizing noise. The durable design ensures reliable operation during extended gaming sessions and intensive workloads.</p><p>The graphics card includes <strong>three DisplayPort 2.1b ports</strong> and <strong>one HDMI 2.1b output</strong>, supporting resolutions up to <strong>8K 120Hz</strong> or <strong>4K 480Hz</strong> with Display Stream Compression (DSC), HDR, and Variable Refresh Rate (VRR). It a