(1180, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G VENTUS 2X OC PLUS 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G VENTUS 2X OC PLUS combines NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 4608 CUDA Cores, 8GB GDDR7 memory, DLSS 4 AI technology, and an advanced dual-fan cooling system to deliver outstanding gaming performance, AI acceleration, and creative productivity. Designed for gamers and creators, it provides excellent efficiency, stable temperatures, and smooth gameplay at 1080p and 1440p resolutions.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5060-ti-8g-ventus-2x-oc-plus-8gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783855098', '<p>The <strong>MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G VENTUS 2X OC PLUS 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> is a high-performance graphics solution built for gamers, content creators, streamers, and AI enthusiasts. Powered by NVIDIA\'s latest <strong>Blackwell architecture</strong>, it introduces enhanced ray tracing capabilities, improved AI processing, and greater power efficiency to meet the demands of today\'s most advanced games and creative applications.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>4608 CUDA Cores</strong> and <strong>8GB of next-generation GDDR7 memory</strong> running at <strong>28 Gbps</strong>, the RTX 5060 Ti delivers outstanding performance for AAA gaming, video editing, 3D modeling, animation, streaming, and AI-assisted workflows. NVIDIA <strong>DLSS 4</strong> leverages advanced AI frame generation to significantly boost frame rates while maintaining crisp image quality, allowing users to enjoy smooth gameplay with higher graphics settings.</p><p>MSI\'s <strong>VENTUS 2X cooling system</strong> is designed to maximize airflow while keeping noise levels low. Featuring <strong>TORX Fan 5.0 technology</strong>, a large heatsink, precision heat pipes, and a reinforced metal backplate, the graphics card maintains stable operating temperatures during intensive gaming sessions and demanding workloads.</p><p>Connectivity options include <strong>three DisplayPort 2.1b outputs</strong> and <strong>one HDMI 2.1b port</strong>, supporting resolutions up to <strong>8K 120Hz</strong> or <strong>4K 480Hz</strong> with Display Stream Compression (DSC), High Dynamic Range (HDR), and Variable Refresh Rate (VRR). Full support for <strong>DirectX 12 Ultimate</strong>, <strong>OpenGL 4.6</strong>, and NVIDIA G-SYNC ensures compatibility with the latest games and high-refresh gaming monitors.</p><p>Users can optimize performance through <strong>MSI Center</strong>, which provides real-time hardware monitoring and customization tools, while <strong>MSI Afterburner</strong> offers advanced overclocking capabilities for enthusiasts looking to maximize GPU performance.</p><p>Whether you\'re building a powerful gaming PC, a professional editing workstation, or an AI-ready desktop, the MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti VENTUS 2X OC PLUS offers exceptional speed, reliable cooling, and long-lasting performance.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th><th>Specs</th></tr></thead></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Graphics Engine</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 Ti</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>GPU Architecture</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Processing</td><td>4608 Units</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory</td><td>8GB GDDR7</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td><td>28 Gbps</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Memory Bus</td><td>Memory</td><td>128-bit</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Interface</td><td>Expansion</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5 x16 (uses x8)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Extreme Pe