(1182, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G VENTUS 2X PLUS 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G VENTUS 2X PLUS delivers next-generation gaming and creative performance with NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 4608 CUDA Cores, 8GB GDDR7 memory, DLSS 4 AI technology, and an advanced dual-fan cooling system. Designed for gamers and creators, it offers smooth gameplay, efficient cooling, and dependable performance for modern applications.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5060-ti-8g-ventus-2x-plus-8gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783855434', '<p>The <strong>MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G VENTUS 2X PLUS 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> is designed for enthusiasts who demand powerful graphics performance without compromising efficiency or reliability. Built on the latest <strong>NVIDIA Blackwell architecture</strong>, it delivers advanced AI capabilities, improved ray tracing performance, and excellent energy efficiency for today\'s most demanding games and creative applications.</p><p>Featuring <strong>4608 CUDA Cores</strong> and <strong>8GB of high-speed GDDR7 memory</strong> running at <strong>28 Gbps</strong>, this graphics card provides the processing power needed for AAA gaming, video editing, live streaming, 3D rendering, AI-assisted workflows, and professional content creation. NVIDIA <strong>DLSS 4</strong> uses AI-powered frame generation and image enhancement to deliver higher frame rates while maintaining stunning visual quality.</p><p>MSI\'s <strong>VENTUS 2X PLUS cooling system</strong> utilizes dual <strong>TORX Fan 5.0</strong> technology, a premium heatsink, and a reinforced metal backplate to maximize airflow and maintain stable operating temperatures. The efficient cooling solution ensures quiet operation even during extended gaming sessions and intensive workloads.</p><p>The card offers versatile connectivity with <strong>three DisplayPort 2.1b outputs</strong> and <strong>one HDMI 2.1b port</strong>, supporting up to <strong>8K 120Hz</strong> or <strong>4K 480Hz</strong> with Display Stream Compression (DSC), HDR, and Variable Refresh Rate (VRR). Support for <strong>DirectX 12 Ultimate</strong>, <strong>OpenGL 4.6</strong>, and NVIDIA G-SYNC ensures compatibility with the latest gaming technologies and high-refresh displays.</p><p>Using <strong>MSI Center</strong>, users can monitor system performance, customize settings, and optimize GPU operation in real time. <strong>MSI Afterburner</strong> provides industry-leading overclocking, hardware monitoring, and fan control for enthusiasts looking to maximize performance.</p><p>Whether you\'re building a powerful gaming PC, upgrading your workstation, or creating an AI-ready desktop, the MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G VENTUS 2X PLUS delivers outstanding speed, advanced features, and long-term reliability.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th><th>Specs</th></tr></thead></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Graphics Engine</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 Ti</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>GPU Architecture</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Processing</td><td>4608 Units</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory</td><td>8GB GDDR7</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td><td>28 Gbps</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Memory Bus</td><td>Memory</td><td>128-bit</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Interface</td><td>Expansion</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5 x16 (uses x8)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Boost Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>Up to 2572 MHz</td></tr></tbody></table>