(1183, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G VENTUS 2X OC WHITE PLUS 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G VENTUS 2X PLUS delivers next-generation gaming and creative performance with NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 4608 CUDA Cores, 8GB GDDR7 memory, DLSS 4 AI technology, and an advanced dual-fan cooling system. Designed for gamers and creators, it offers smooth gameplay, efficient cooling, and dependable performance for modern applications.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5060-ti-8g-ventus-2x-oc-white-plus-8gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783855566', '<p>The <strong>MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G VENTUS 2X PLUS 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> is designed for enthusiasts who demand powerful graphics performance without compromising efficiency or reliability. Built on the latest <strong>NVIDIA Blackwell architecture</strong>, it delivers advanced AI capabilities, improved ray tracing performance, and excellent energy efficiency for today\'s most demanding games and creative applications.</p><p>Featuring <strong>4608 CUDA Cores</strong> and <strong>8GB of high-speed GDDR7 memory</strong> running at <strong>28 Gbps</strong>, this graphics card provides the processing power needed for AAA gaming, video editing, live streaming, 3D rendering, AI-assisted workflows, and professional content creation. NVIDIA <strong>DLSS 4</strong> uses AI-powered frame generation and image enhancement to deliver higher frame rates while maintaining stunning visual quality.</p><p>MSI\'s <strong>VENTUS 2X PLUS cooling system</strong> utilizes dual <strong>TORX Fan 5.0</strong> technology, a premium heatsink, and a reinforced metal backplate to maximize airflow and maintain stable operating temperatures. The efficient cooling solution ensures quiet operation even during extended gaming sessions and intensive workloads.</p><p>The card offers versatile connectivity with <strong>three DisplayPort 2.1b outputs</strong> and <strong>one HDMI 2.1b port</strong>, supporting up to <strong>8K 120Hz</strong> or <strong>4K 480Hz</strong> with Display Stream Compression (DSC), HDR, and Variable Refresh Rate (VRR). Support for <strong>DirectX 12 Ultimate</strong>, <strong>OpenGL 4.6</strong>, and NVIDIA G-SYNC ensures compatibility with the latest gaming technologies and high-refresh displays.</p><p>Using <strong>MSI Center</strong>, users can monitor system performance, customize settings, and optimize GPU operation in real time. <strong>MSI Afterburner</strong> provides industry-leading overclocking, hardware monitoring, and fan control for enthusiasts looking to maximize performance.</p><p>Whether you\'re building a powerful gaming PC, upgrading your workstation, or creating an AI-ready desktop, the MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G VENTUS 2X PLUS delivers outstanding speed, advanced features, and long-term reliability.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th><th>Specs</th></tr></thead></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Graphics Engine</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 Ti</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>GPU Architecture</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Processing</td><td>4608 Units</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory</td><td>8GB GDDR7</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td><td>28 Gbps</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Memory Bus</td><td>Memory</td><td>128-bit</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Interface</td><td>Expansion</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5 x16 (uses x8)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Extreme Performance Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>Up to 2617 MHz (MSI Center)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Boost Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>Up to 2602 MHz</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Maximum Digital Resolution</td><td>Display</td><td>7680 × 4320</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>DisplayPort</td><td>Display Output</td><td>3 × DisplayPort 2.1b</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>Display Output</td><td>1 × HDMI 2.1b</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>HDMI Support</td><td>Display</td><td>Up to 4K 480Hz / 8K 120Hz with DSC, HDR &amp; VRR</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Maximum Displays</td><td>Display</td><td>4</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>HDCP Support</td><td>Features</td><td>Yes</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>DirectX Support</td><td>API</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>API</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Cooling Solution</td><td>Cooling</td><td>VENTUS 2X OC WHITE PLUS Dual-Fan Cooling</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Fan Technology</td><td>Cooling</td><td>TORX Fan 5.0</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Heat Pipe</td><td>Cooling</td><td>Precision Heat Pipe</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Backplate</td><td>Cooling</td><td>Reinforced White Metal Backplate</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Software</td><td>Utility</td><td>MSI Center</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Overclocking Utility</td><td>Utility</td><td>MSI Afterburner</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>Power</td><td>180W</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Power Connector</td><td>Power</td><td>1 × 8-Pin</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Power</td><td>600W</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Card Dimensions</td><td>Physical</td><td>227 × 127 × 41 mm</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Color</td><td>Design</td><td>White</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Manufacturer Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 64900.00, 64900.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/q1B5JZLaJnxHvP7dmuXExp2CMDPid5xKKvpVBt3G.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 11:26:06', '2026-07-12 11:26:06', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G VENTUS 2X OC WHITE PLUS 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the original MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G VENTUS 2X OC WHITE PLUS 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card from International Office Solution. Featuring NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 4608 CUDA Cores, DLSS 4, VENTUS 2X OC WHITE PLUS cooling, premium white design, official 3-year warranty, and competitive prices in Bangladesh.', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G VENTUS 2X OC WHITE PLUS, MSI RTX 5060 Ti White, RTX 5060 Ti 8GB GDDR7, MSI White Graphics Card, RTX 5060 Ti Price in Bangladesh, MSI Graphics Card Bangladesh, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, DLSS 4 Graphics Card, White Gaming GPU, AI Graphics Card, PCIe Gen5 Graphics Card, MSI GPU BD, International Office Solution, White PC Build GPU, Best Graphics Card for Gaming', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL);
