(1184, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G INSPIRE 2X OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G INSPIRE 2X OC delivers powerful next-generation graphics performance with NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 4608 CUDA Cores, 16GB GDDR7 memory, DLSS 4 AI technology, and an efficient dual-fan cooling system. With double the memory capacity of standard models, it is ideal for high-resolution gaming, AI applications, content creation, and professional workloads.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5060-ti-16g-inspire-2x-oc-16gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783855681', '<p>The <strong>MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G INSPIRE 2X OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> is a high-performance GPU designed for users who demand exceptional graphics power, advanced AI features, and long-term reliability. Built on NVIDIA\'s latest <strong>Blackwell architecture</strong>, this graphics card delivers improved efficiency, enhanced ray tracing, and AI-powered performance improvements for modern gaming and creative workflows.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>4608 CUDA Cores</strong> and <strong>16GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory running at 28 Gbps</strong>, the RTX 5060 Ti 16GB provides excellent performance for demanding applications. The larger memory capacity allows users to handle high-resolution textures, complex 3D projects, AI models, large video files, and professional creative workloads with greater efficiency.</p><p>NVIDIA <strong>DLSS 4 technology</strong> uses advanced AI frame generation and image enhancement to increase performance while maintaining excellent visual quality. Combined with advanced ray tracing capabilities, it delivers realistic lighting, shadows, and reflections for immersive gaming experiences.</p><p>The <strong>INSPIRE 2X OC cooling system</strong> features dual <strong>STORMFORCE fans</strong>, optimized airflow design, precision heat pipes, and a reinforced metal backplate to maintain stable temperatures during extended gaming sessions and heavy workloads. Its compact design makes it suitable for a wide range of PC builds while delivering powerful performance.</p><p>Connectivity includes <strong>three DisplayPort 2.1b outputs</strong> and <strong>one HDMI 2.1b port</strong>, supporting resolutions up to <strong>8K 120Hz</strong> and <strong>4K 480Hz</strong> with DSC, HDR, and Variable Refresh Rate technology. Support for <strong>DirectX 12 Ultimate</strong>, <strong>OpenGL 4.6</strong>, and NVIDIA G-SYNC ensures compatibility with the latest gaming platforms and professional displays.</p><p>With <strong>MSI Center</strong>, users can monitor hardware performance, customize settings, and optimize GPU operation. <strong>MSI Afterburner</strong> provides advanced overclocking, monitoring, and tuning capabilities for enthusiasts who want maximum performance.</p><p>Whether you are building a high-end gaming PC, a professional workstation, or an AI-powered system, the MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G INSPIRE 2X OC provides powerful performance, efficient cooling, and future-ready graphics capability.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th><th>Specs</th></tr></thead></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Graphics Engine</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 Ti</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>GPU Architecture</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Processing</td><td>4608 Units</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory</td><td>16GB GDDR7</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td><td>28 Gbps</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Memory Bus</td><td>Memory</td><td>128-bit</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Interface</td><td>Expansion</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5 x16 (uses x8)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Boost Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>Up to 2602 MHz</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Extreme Performance Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>Up to 2617 MHz (MSI Center)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Maximum Digital Resolution</td><td>Display</td><td>7680 × 4320</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>DisplayPort</td><td>Display Output</td><td>3 × DisplayPort 2.1b</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>Display Output</td><td>1 × HDMI 2.1b</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>HDMI Support</td><td>Display</td><td>Up to 4K 480Hz / 8K 120Hz with DSC, HDR &amp; VRR</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Maximum Displays</td><td>Display</td><td>4</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>HDCP Support</td><td>Features</td><td>Yes</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>G-SYNC Support</td><td>Features</td><td>Yes</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>DirectX Support</td><td>API</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>API</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Cooling System</td><td>Cooling</td><td>INSPIRE 2X OC Dual-Fan Cooling</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Fan Technology</td><td>Cooling</td><td>STORMFORCE Fan Design</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Heat Pipe</td><td>Cooling</td><td>Precision Heat Pipe</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Backplate</td><td>Cooling</td><td>Reinforced Metal Backplate</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Software</td><td>Utility</td><td>MSI Center</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Overclocking Utility</td><td>Utility</td><td>MSI Afterburner</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>Power</td><td>180W</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Power Connector</td><td>Power</td><td>1 × 8-Pin</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Power</td><td>600W</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Card Dimensions</td><td>Physical</td><td>204 × 120 × 42 mm</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Manufacturer Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 79500.00, 79500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/9fW60avV5gjKnivVutOo6bOl6wlixQAPau8OgX6f.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 11:28:01', '2026-07-12 11:28:01', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G INSPIRE 2X OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G INSPIRE 2X OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card from International Office Solution. Featuring NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 4608 CUDA Cores, DLSS 4, 16GB GDDR7 memory, advanced cooling, official 3-year warranty, and competitive price in Bangladesh.', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16GB, MSI RTX 5060 Ti INSPIRE 2X OC, RTX 5060 Ti 16G GDDR7, MSI Graphics Card Bangladesh, RTX 5060 Ti Price in Bangladesh, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, DLSS 4 Graphics Card, 16GB Gaming GPU, MSI INSPIRE Graphics Card, AI Graphics Card, PCIe Gen5 Graphics Card, MSI GPU BD, International Office Solution, High Performance Graphics Card, Gaming GPU Bangladesh', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(1185, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5070 12G SHADOW 2X OC 12GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5070 12G SHADOW 2X OC delivers powerful gaming and professional performance with NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 6144 CUDA Cores, 12GB GDDR7 memory, DLSS 4 AI technology, and advanced SHADOW 2X cooling. It is designed for high-performance 1440p and 4K gaming, content creation, AI workloads, and demanding applications.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5070-12g-shadow-2x-oc-12gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783855767', '<p>The <strong>MSI GeForce RTX 5070 12G SHADOW 2X OC 12GB GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> is built for enthusiasts who demand exceptional graphics performance, advanced AI features, and reliable cooling. Powered by the latest <strong>NVIDIA Blackwell architecture</strong>, it delivers improved efficiency, enhanced ray tracing capabilities, and powerful AI acceleration for next-generation gaming and professional workloads.</p><p>Featuring <strong>6144 CUDA Cores</strong> and <strong>12GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory</strong> with a <strong>192-bit memory interface</strong>, the RTX 5070 provides outstanding performance for modern AAA games, high-resolution gaming, streaming, 3D rendering, video editing, and AI-powered applications. The increased memory bandwidth allows smoother performance when handling demanding textures, large creative projects, and advanced workloads.</p><p>NVIDIA <strong>DLSS 4 technology</strong> uses AI-powered frame generation and image enhancement to significantly increase performance while maintaining excellent image quality. Combined with advanced ray tracing technology, it delivers realistic lighting, shadows, reflections, and immersive visuals in supported games.</p><p>The <strong>SHADOW 2X OC cooling system</strong> features dual <strong>STORMFORCE fans</strong>, optimized airflow, precision heat pipes, and a reinforced metal backplate to maintain excellent thermal performance during extended gaming sessions. The efficient cooling design ensures stable operation with reduced noise levels.</p><p>Connectivity includes <strong>three DisplayPort 2.1b outputs</strong> and <strong>one HDMI 2.1b port</strong>, supporting up to <strong>8K 120Hz</strong> and <strong>4K 480Hz</strong> displays with DSC, HDR, and Variable Refresh Rate technology. Support for <strong>DirectX 12 Ultimate</strong>, <strong>OpenGL 4.6</strong>, and NVIDIA G-SYNC ensures compatibility with modern gaming displays and applications.</p><p>Through <strong>MSI Center</strong>, users can monitor performance, customize settings, and optimize their graphics card, while <strong>MSI Afterburner</strong> provides advanced overclocking and hardware monitoring features for enthusiasts.</p><p>Whether you are building a premium gaming PC, professional workstation, or AI-powered system, the MSI GeForce RTX 5070 12G SHADOW 2X OC provides exceptional performance, advanced features, and dependable reliability.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th><th>Specs</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Graphics Engine</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070</td></tr><tr><td>GPU Architecture</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Processing</td><td>6144 Units</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory</td><td>12GB GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td><td>28 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Interface</td><td>Memory</td><td>192-bit</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>Expansion</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5 x16</td></tr><tr><td>Boost Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>Up to 2542 MHz</td></tr><tr><td>Extreme Performance Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>Up to 2557 MHz (MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum Digital Resolution</td><td>Display</td><td>7680 × 4320</td></tr><tr><td>DisplayPort</td><td>Display Output</td><td>3 × DisplayPort 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI</td><td>Display Output</td><td>1 × HDMI 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI Support</td><td>Display</td><td>Up to 4K 480Hz / 8K 120Hz with DSC, HDR &amp; VRR</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum Displays</td><td>Display</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>HDCP Support</td><td>Features</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>G-SYNC Support</td><td>Features</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>DirectX Support</td><td>API</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>API</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling System</td><td>Cooling</td><td>SHADOW 2X OC Dual-Fan Cooling</td></tr><tr><td>Fan Technology</td><td>Cooling</td><td>STORMFORCE Fan Design</td></tr><tr><td>Heat Pipe</td><td>Cooling</td><td>Precision Heat Pipe</td></tr><tr><td>Backplate</td><td>Cooling</td><td>Reinforced Metal Backplate</td></tr><tr><td>Software</td><td>Utility</td><td>MSI Center</td></tr><tr><td>Overclocking Utility</td><td>Utility</td><td>MSI Afterburner</td></tr><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>Power</td><td>250W</td></tr><tr><td>Power Connector</td><td>Power</td><td>1 × 16-Pin (12V-2x6)</td></tr><tr><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Power</td><td>650W</td></tr><tr><td>Card Dimensions</td><td>Physical</td><td>236 × 126 × 50 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Manufacturer Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2>', 'Graphics Card', 90500.00, 90500.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/oT4PeUnW6IbahfQKA6FGSafdjJ1Oa4L8t3dFuymI.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 11:29:27', '2026-07-12 11:29:27', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5070 12G SHADOW 2X OC 12GB GDDR7 Graphics Card Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy MSI GeForce RTX 5070 12G SHADOW 2X OC 12GB GDDR7 Graphics Card from International Office Solution. Featuring NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 6144 CUDA Cores, DLSS 4, SHADOW 2X cooling, 12GB GDDR7 memory, official warranty, and competitive price in Bangladesh.', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5070, MSI RTX 5070 12GB, RTX 5070 GDDR7 Graphics Card, MSI SHADOW 2X OC, RTX 5070 Price in Bangladesh, MSI Graphics Card Bangladesh, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, DLSS 4 Graphics Card, 12GB Gaming GPU, AI Graphics Card, PCIe Gen5 Graphics Card, MSI GPU BD, International Office Solution, 4K Gaming Graphics Card, High Performance GPU Bangladesh', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(1186, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5070 12G World of Warcraft MIDNIGHT VOID EDITION OC Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5070 12G World of Warcraft MIDNIGHT VOID EDITION OC Graphics Card combines NVIDIA Blackwell performance with an exclusive World of Warcraft-inspired design. Featuring 12GB GDDR7 memory, 6144 CUDA Cores, DLSS 4, advanced ray tracing, and premium cooling, it is perfect for gamers, collectors, and enthusiasts seeking both performance and style.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5070-12g-world-of-warcraft-midnight-void-edition-oc-graphics-card-1783855848', '<p>he <strong>MSI GeForce RTX 5070 12G World of Warcraft MIDNIGHT VOID EDITION OC Graphics Card</strong> is a premium graphics solution designed for gamers who want powerful performance combined with a unique collector-focused design. Inspired by the dark and mysterious world of <strong>World of Warcraft: Midnight</strong>, this special edition graphics card brings a distinctive visual identity to high-end gaming setups.</p><p>Powered by the advanced <strong>NVIDIA Blackwell architecture</strong>, the RTX 5070 delivers exceptional gaming performance, AI acceleration, and improved efficiency. With <strong>6144 CUDA Cores</strong> and <strong>12GB of high-speed GDDR7 memory</strong>, it provides the performance needed for modern AAA gaming, high-resolution gameplay, content creation, streaming, 3D rendering, and AI-powered applications.</p><p>NVIDIA <strong>DLSS 4 technology</strong> enhances gaming performance through AI-powered frame generation and image optimization, allowing users to enjoy higher frame rates while maintaining excellent visual quality. Advanced ray tracing technology provides realistic lighting, reflections, and shadows for a more immersive gaming experience.</p><p>The custom cooling design from MSI ensures efficient heat management during demanding gaming sessions. Premium fans, optimized airflow, and a reinforced backplate work together to maintain stable performance while reducing operating noise.</p><p>With support for <strong>DisplayPort 2.1b</strong> and <strong>HDMI 2.1b</strong>, the graphics card supports high-resolution displays including <strong>8K 120Hz</strong> and <strong>4K 480Hz</strong> configurations with DSC, HDR, and Variable Refresh Rate technology. Compatibility with <strong>DirectX 12 Ultimate</strong>, <strong>OpenGL 4.6</strong>, and NVIDIA G-SYNC ensures smooth performance across modern gaming platforms.</p><p>MSI Center provides real-time monitoring and customization options, while MSI Afterburner allows enthusiasts to fine-tune performance through advanced overclocking controls.</p><p>Whether you are a World of Warcraft fan, a collector, or a gamer looking for premium GPU performance, the MSI RTX 5070 World of Warcraft MIDNIGHT VOID EDITION OC offers a perfect combination of power, style, and next-generation technology.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th><th>Specs</th></tr></thead></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Graphics Engine</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>GPU Architecture</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Processing</td><td>6144 Units</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory</td><td>12GB GDDR7</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td><td>28 Gbps</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Memory Interface</td><td>Memory</td><td>192-bit</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Interface</td><td>Expansion</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5 x16</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Boost Clock</td><t