(1187, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16G INSPIRE 3X OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16G INSPIRE 3X OC delivers next-level gaming and professional performance with NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 8960 CUDA Cores, 16GB GDDR7 memory, DLSS 4 AI technology, and advanced triple-fan cooling. It is ideal for 4K gaming, AI workloads, professional content creation, and high-performance PC builds.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5070-ti-16g-inspire-3x-oc-16gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783855929', '<p>The <strong>MSI GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16G INSPIRE 3X OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> is engineered for users who require powerful performance, advanced features, and reliable cooling for demanding applications. Built on the latest <strong>NVIDIA Blackwell architecture</strong>, it delivers significant improvements in AI acceleration, ray tracing performance, and overall efficiency.</p><p>With <strong>8960 CUDA Cores</strong> and <strong>16GB of next-generation GDDR7 memory</strong> featuring a wide <strong>256-bit memory interface</strong>, the RTX 5070 Ti provides outstanding bandwidth and processing power for modern AAA gaming, professional rendering, AI development, video editing, and advanced creative workloads.</p><p>NVIDIA <strong>DLSS 4 technology</strong> enhances performance using AI-powered frame generation and image optimization, allowing gamers to experience higher frame rates with excellent visual quality. Advanced ray tracing technology delivers realistic lighting, reflections, and shadows for immersive gaming experiences.</p><p>The <strong>INSPIRE 3X OC cooling system</strong> features three high-performance fans, optimized airflow, precision heat pipes, and a reinforced metal backplate to provide excellent thermal management. This advanced cooling solution ensures stable performance during long gaming sessions and heavy professional workloads while maintaining efficient noise levels.</p><p>The graphics card supports modern connectivity standards with <strong>three DisplayPort 2.1b outputs</strong> and <strong>one HDMI 2.1b port</strong>, enabling high-resolution displays up to <strong>8K 120Hz</strong> and <strong>4K 480Hz</strong> with DSC, HDR, and Variable Refresh Rate technology.</p><p>Through <strong>MSI Center</strong>, users can monitor system performance, customize settings, and optimize their GPU experience. <strong>MSI Afterburner</strong> provides advanced overclocking and monitoring features for enthusiasts who want additional performance control.</p><p>Whether you are building a premium gaming workstation, a professional content creation system, or an AI-powered PC, the MSI GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16G INSPIRE 3X OC delivers exceptional performance, advanced technology, and dependable reliability.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th><th>Specs</th></tr></thead></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Graphics Engine</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 Ti</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>GPU Architecture</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Processing</td><td>8960 Units</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory</td><td>16GB GDDR7</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td><td>28 Gbps</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Memory Interface</td><td>Memory</td><td>256-bit</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Interface</td><td>Expansion</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5 x16</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Boost Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>Up to 2497 MHz</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Extreme 