(1188, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16G SHADOW 3X OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16G SHADOW 3X OC delivers outstanding 4K gaming and professional performance with NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 8960 CUDA Cores, 16GB GDDR7 memory, DLSS 4 AI technology, and a powerful triple-fan cooling system. It is built for gamers, creators, and professionals who need high-end graphics performance.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5070-ti-16g-shadow-3x-oc-16gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783856034', '<p>The <strong>MSI GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16G SHADOW 3X OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> is designed for enthusiasts who require extreme graphics power, advanced AI features, and reliable cooling performance. Built on the latest <strong>NVIDIA Blackwell architecture</strong>, this GPU delivers improved efficiency, enhanced ray tracing, and next-generation AI acceleration for demanding gaming and professional applications.</p><p>Featuring <strong>8960 CUDA Cores</strong> and <strong>16GB of high-speed GDDR7 memory</strong> with a <strong>256-bit memory interface</strong>, the RTX 5070 Ti provides exceptional bandwidth and processing capability. It is optimized for modern AAA games, ultra-high-resolution gaming, professional video editing, 3D modeling, animation, AI workloads, and creative production environments.</p><p>NVIDIA <strong>DLSS 4 technology</strong> enhances performance using AI-powered frame generation and intelligent image processing. This allows users to enjoy higher frame rates, smoother gameplay, and improved visual quality while taking advantage of advanced ray tracing features for realistic lighting, reflections, and shadows.</p><p>The <strong>SHADOW 3X OC cooling system</strong> features three high-performance fans, optimized airflow, precision heat pipes, and a reinforced metal backplate to efficiently manage heat during extended workloads. This advanced thermal design ensures stable performance while maintaining reliable and quiet operation.</p><p>With <strong>three DisplayPort 2.1b outputs</strong> and <strong>one HDMI 2.1b port</strong>, the graphics card supports next-generation displays including <strong>8K 120Hz</strong> and <strong>4K 480Hz</strong> configurations with DSC, HDR, and Variable Refresh Rate technology. Compatibility with <strong>DirectX 12 Ultimate</strong>, <strong>OpenGL 4.6</strong>, and NVIDIA G-SYNC ensures smooth performance across modern gaming and professional applications.</p><p>MSI Center provides users with real-time monitoring, performance optimization, and customization options, while MSI Afterburner offers advanced overclocking and hardware control features.</p><p>Whether you are building a high-end gaming PC, professional workstation, or AI-powered system, the MSI GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16G SHADOW 3X OC delivers exceptional performance, advanced features, and long-term reliability.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>eature</th><th>Category</th><th>Specs</th></tr></thead></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Graphics Engine</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 Ti</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>GPU Architecture</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Processing</td><td>8960 Units</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory</td><td>16GB GDDR7</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td><td>28 Gbps</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Memory Interface</td><td>Memory</td><td>256-bit</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Interface</td><td>Expansion</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5 x16</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Boost Clock</td><td>Performance</td><