ure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Software</td><td>Utility</td><td>MSI Center</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Overclocking Utility</td><td>Utility</td><td>MSI Afterburner</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>Power</td><td>300W</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Power Connector</td><td>Power</td><td>1 × 16-Pin (12V-2x6)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Power</td><td>750W</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Card Dimensions</td><td>Physical</td><td>338 × 140 × 51 mm</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Manufacturer Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 153900.00, 153900.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/VTLZaDScak1vMqeHvWCxqidXMz29r3zgwJbI0tyO.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 11:33:54', '2026-07-12 11:33:54', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16G SHADOW 3X OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy MSI GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16G SHADOW 3X OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card from International Office Solution. Featuring NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 8960 CUDA Cores, 16GB GDDR7 memory, DLSS 4, SHADOW 3X cooling, official warranty, and competitive price in Bangladesh.', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5070 Ti, MSI RTX 5070 Ti 16GB, RTX 5070 Ti GDDR7 Graphics Card, MSI SHADOW 3X OC, RTX 5070 Ti Price in Bangladesh, MSI Graphics Card Bangladesh, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, DLSS 4 Graphics Card, 16GB Gaming GPU, AI Graphics Card, PCIe Gen5 Graphics Card, MSI GPU BD, International Office Solution, 4K Gaming GPU Bangladesh, High Performance Graphics Card', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(1189, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16G VENTUS 3X OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16G VENTUS 3X OC delivers powerful 4K gaming and professional performance with NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 8960 CUDA Cores, 16GB GDDR7 memory, DLSS 4 AI technology, and an advanced triple-fan cooling system. It is ideal for gamers, creators, and professionals seeking high-end graphics performance.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5070-ti-16g-ventus-3x-oc-16gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783856118', '<p>The <strong>MSI GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16G VENTUS 3X OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> is engineered for users who demand premium performance, advanced graphics technology, and dependable cooling. Built on the latest <strong>NVIDIA Blackwell architecture</strong>, this graphics card delivers significant improvements in AI processing, ray tracing performance, and overall efficiency for modern gaming and professional applications.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>8960 CUDA Cores</strong> and <strong>16GB of next-generation GDDR7 memory</strong> with a wide <strong>256-bit memory interface</strong>, the RTX 5070 Ti provides exceptional bandwidth for high-resolution gaming, advanced content creation, AI workloads, 3D design, and professional rendering tasks.</p><p>NVIDIA <strong>DLSS 4 technology</strong> enhances performance through AI-powered frame generation and intelligent image processing. This allows users to experience higher frame rates, smoother gameplay, and improved visual quality while enjoying realistic ray-traced lighting, reflections, and shadows.</p><p>The <strong>VENTUS 3X OC cooling system</strong> features three high-performance fans, optimized airflow channels, precision heat pipes, and a reinforced metal backplate to maintain excellent thermal performance. The advanced cooling design ensures reliable operation during long gaming sessions and intensive workloads while keeping noise levels controlled.</p><p>The graphics card supports modern connectivity through <strong>three DisplayPort 2.1b outputs</strong> and <strong>one HDMI 2.1b port</strong>, allowing high-refresh-rate gaming displays and professional monitors with support for up to <strong>8K 120Hz</strong> and <strong>4K 480Hz</strong> with DSC, HDR, and Variable Refresh Rate technology.</p><p>With <strong>MSI Center</strong>, users can monitor GPU performance, adjust settings, and optimize system operation. <strong>MSI Afterburner</strong> provides advanced overclocking, fan control, and real-time hardware monitoring for enthusiasts who want maximum control.</p><p>Whether you are building a premium gaming PC, creative workstation, or AI-powered system, the MSI GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16G VENTUS 3X OC offers outstanding performance, efficient cooling, and future-ready graphics capabilities.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th><th>Specs</th></tr></thead></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Graphics Engine</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 Ti</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>GPU Architecture</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Processing</td><td>8960 Units</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory</td><td>16GB GDDR7</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td><td>28 Gbps</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Memory Interface</td><td>Memory</td><td>256-bit</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Interface</td><td>Expansion</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5 x16</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Boost Clock</td><td>Performance</td><td>Up to 2497 MHz</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><tab