(1190, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16G EXPERT OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16G EXPERT OC delivers premium next-generation graphics performance with NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 8960 CUDA Cores, 16GB GDDR7 memory, DLSS 4 AI technology, and a professional-grade cooling design. It is perfect for high-end gaming, AI workloads, 3D rendering, and professional content creation.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5070-ti-16g-expert-oc-16gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783856237', '<p>The <strong>MSI GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16G EXPERT OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong> represents the perfect combination of professional design, advanced technology, and extreme graphics performance. Powered by the latest <strong>NVIDIA Blackwell architecture</strong>, this GPU is engineered to handle demanding gaming experiences, creative applications, artificial intelligence workloads, and professional computing tasks.</p><p>With <strong>8960 CUDA Cores</strong> and <strong>16GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory</strong> featuring a <strong>256-bit memory interface</strong>, the RTX 5070 Ti provides exceptional bandwidth and processing capability for modern high-performance systems. It delivers smooth performance in AAA gaming, 4K resolution gameplay, video editing, 3D modeling, animation, AI development, and advanced rendering applications.</p><p>NVIDIA <strong>DLSS 4 technology</strong> uses AI-powered frame generation and intelligent image processing to increase performance while maintaining excellent visual quality. Combined with advanced ray tracing technology, users can experience realistic lighting, reflections, shadows, and cinematic graphics in supported games.</p><p>The <strong>EXPERT OC cooling design</strong> features optimized airflow engineering, premium thermal components, precision heat pipes, and durable metal construction to provide excellent heat dissipation. The professional-inspired design not only improves cooling efficiency but also adds a premium appearance to high-end PC builds.</p><p>Connectivity includes <strong>three DisplayPort 2.1b outputs</strong> and <strong>one HDMI 2.1b port</strong>, supporting high-resolution displays up to <strong>8K 120Hz</strong> and <strong>4K 480Hz</strong> with DSC, HDR, and Variable Refresh Rate technology. Compatibility with <strong>DirectX 12 Ultimate</strong>, <strong>OpenGL 4.6</strong>, and NVIDIA G-SYNC ensures smooth performance across gaming and professional applications.</p><p>Using <strong>MSI Center</strong>, users can monitor performance, customize settings, and optimize GPU operation. <strong>MSI Afterburner</strong> provides advanced overclocking, fan control, and hardware monitoring features for enthusiasts who want maximum control.</p><p>Whether you are building a premium gaming setup, professional workstation, or AI-powered PC, the MSI GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16G EXPERT OC delivers exceptional performance, advanced features, and reliable long-term operation.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th><th>Specs</th></tr></thead></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Graphics Engine</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 Ti</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>GPU Architecture</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Processing</td><td>8960 Units</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>Memory</td><td>16GB GDDR7</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td><td>28 Gbps</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Memory Interface</td><td>Memory</td><td>256-bit</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Interface</td><td>Expansion</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5 x16</td></tr></tbody></table></figur