Cooling</td><td>Reinforced Metal Backplate</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Software</td><td>Utility</td><td>MSI Center</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Overclocking Utility</td><td>Utility</td><td>MSI Afterburner</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Power Consumption</td><td>Power</td><td>300W</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Power Connector</td><td>Power</td><td>1 × 16-Pin (12V-2x6)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Power</td><td>750W</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Card Dimensions</td><td>Physical</td><td>312 × 141 × 61 mm</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Manufacturer Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 154900.00, 154900.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/3zTG9CtixypQiyiHU9dlQkZU9r6gHqTczb4e0o16.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 11:37:17', '2026-07-12 11:37:17', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16G EXPERT OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy MSI GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16G EXPERT OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card from International Office Solution. Featuring NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 8960 CUDA Cores, 16GB GDDR7 memory, DLSS 4, premium cooling design, official warranty, and competitive price in Bangladesh.', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5070 Ti, MSI RTX 5070 Ti 16GB, RTX 5070 Ti GDDR7 Graphics Card, MSI EXPERT OC Graphics Card, RTX 5070 Ti Price in Bangladesh, MSI Graphics Card Bangladesh, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, DLSS 4 Graphics Card, 16GB Gaming GPU, AI Graphics Card, PCIe Gen5 Graphics Card, MSI GPU BD, International Office Solution, Professional Graphics Card Bangladesh, 4K Gaming GPU', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(1191, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5080 16G SHADOW 3X OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5080 16G SHADOW 3X OC features NVIDIA\'s cutting-edge Blackwell architecture, packing 10,752 CUDA cores and 16GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory on a 256-bit bus. Equipped with an aggressive factory overclock and the advanced TORX Fan 5.0 triple-fan thermal setup, it delivers exceptional 4K/8K gaming performance and AI-accelerated creative power while remaining remarkably cool and quiet.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5080-16g-shadow-3x-oc-16gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783856514', '<p>Take your gaming and pro-tier creative pipelines into the next generation with the MSI GeForce RTX 5080 16G SHADOW 3X OC Graphics Card. Built on NVIDIA\'s revolutionary Blackwell architecture, this absolute powerhouse unleashes 10,752 CUDA cores working alongside 16GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory. Operating on a 256-bit interface at an effective 30 Gbps, it generates massive bandwidth to smooth out dense 3D rendering environments, heavy AI workflows, and ultra-high-resolution gaming.</p><p>As a signature entry in the SHADOW 3X OC lineup, this card comes factory overclocked right out of the box to maximize stability and push core speeds up to an extreme 2655 MHz via MSI Center. Taming this raw hardware is an elite thermal design anchored by three TORX Fan 5.0 units, meticulously angled to maximize focused airflow over the custom heatsink structure. Complete with modern DisplayPort 2.1b and HDMI 2.1b connectivity, support for up to 4 concurrent displays, and full compatibility with NVIDIA DLSS 4 neural rendering, it stands as a future-proof cornerstone for any enthusiast desktop build.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the MSI GeForce RTX 5080 16G SHADOW 3X OC Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>210,900৳</strong>. You can purchase this premium card at the absolute best rate directly from the International Office Solution website, or by visiting any of our official physical showroo