(1192, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5080 16G VENTUS 3X OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5080 16G VENTUS 3X OC features NVIDIA\'s groundbreaking Blackwell architecture, packed with 10,752 CUDA cores and 16GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory. Dominated by a robust triple-fan thermal setup utilizing TORX Fan 5.0 and precision-engineered square core heatpipes, this SFF-ready enthusiast graphics card delivers exceptional 4K/8K gaming performance and heavy AI workflow handling with maximum cooling efficiency.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5080-16g-ventus-3x-oc-16gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783856600', '<p>Unleash next-generation desktop performance with the MSI GeForce RTX 5080 16G VENTUS 3X OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card. Engineered on NVIDIA\'s high-efficiency Blackwell architecture, this elite GPU combines a staggering 10,752 CUDA cores with ultra-fast GDDR7 VRAM running on a high-bandwidth 256-bit interface at 30 Gbps. It provides massive processing capabilities for seamless ray-traced rendering, professional 3D editing environments, competitive gaming frames, and intensive local AI development.</p><p>Built as a staple of the iconic VENTUS series, this variant comes with a factory-tuned overclock that pushes frequencies up to 2655 MHz via MSI Center software adjustments. To manage the raw energy of this setup, the integrated VENTUS 3X thermal array uses customized TORX Fan 5.0 blade rings to channel high-pressure airflow directly across a solid nickel-plated copper baseplate. The architectural layout incorporates flattened square core heatpipes for maximum structural contact area against the silicon. Housed with a structurally reinforced metal backplate that utilizes optimized exhaust vents, it guarantees exceptional heat dissipation, ultimate stability, and silent zero-RPM operations under light computing loads.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the MSI GeForce RTX 5080 16G VENTUS 3X OC Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>212,900৳</strong>. You can purchase this powerful graphics card at the best price from the International Office Solution website, or by visiting any of our official showrooms.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>10,752 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Base / Boost Clock</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2482 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2655 MHz (via MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>30 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>256-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Type</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5.0</td></tr><tr><td><strong>DisplayPort</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td><strong>HDMI Port</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>1 x HDMI 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Support</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Up to 4 displays simultaneously</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>360W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>1 x 16-pin PCIe</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>850W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>Software</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>303 x 121 x 49 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor / PCB</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>ATX Form (SFF-Ready Design)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Weight</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Gross Weight: 1084 g (Card Only)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Technology</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>VENTUS 3X Setup, TORX Fan 5.0, Zero Frozr technology</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>After-sales</td><td>3 Years Manufacturing Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/5aJPRcsmYt85FzLMkCgICiPsycSx8KCiT8t2a0qg.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 11:43:20', '2026-07-12 11:43:20', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5080 16G VENTUS 3X OC Price in BD | International Office Solution', 'Buy the original MSI GeForce RTX 5080 16G VENTUS 3X OC 16GB GDDR7 graphics card in Bangladesh. Enjoy NVIDIA Blackwell architecture and premium cooling at International Office Solution', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5080 16G VENTUS 3X OC, RTX 5080 Ventus price in Bangladesh, 16GB GDDR7 graphics card BD, MSI Blackwell GPU, International Office Solution.', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(1193, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G SUPRIM SOC 32GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G SUPRIM SOC represents the pinnacle of graphic processing, engineered with NVIDIA\'s ultimate Blackwell architecture. Outfitted with an incredible 21,760 CUDA cores, a colossal 32GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory on a massive 512-bit bus, and the advanced HYPER FROZR triple-fan cooling array, this flagship card handles complex 8K neural rendering, extreme gaming configurations, and massive local AI models with effortless authority.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5090-32g-suprim-soc-32gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783856686', '<p>Dominate the absolute limits of desktop computing with the MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G SUPRIM SOC 32GB GDDR7 Graphics Card. Purpose-built for top-tier gamers, elite digital creators, and data scientists, this powerhouse is forged on NVIDIA\'s revolutionary Blackwell architecture. Packed with a breathtaking 21,760 CUDA cores and paired alongside 32GB of state-of-the-art GDDR7 memory operating across an ultra-wide 512-bit bus interface at 28 Gbps, it generates massive structural memory bandwidth to crunch through heavy real-time path tracing, heavy machine learning data sheets, and dense 3D visual effects development.</p><p>As a premium flagship of the SUPRIM series, it features an expertly tuned factory overclock providing an Extreme Performance clock speed up to 2580 MHz via the MSI Center console. The underlying hardware relies on the signature HYPER FROZR thermal system to maintain peak thermodynamic efficiency. It utilizes advanced STORMFORCE fans with uniquely curved, claw-textured blade rings to pull deep airflow into a micro-machined copper vapor chamber baseplate. Complete with specialized square core pipes, Air Antegrade Fin 2.0 arrays, an armored aluminum alloy support frame, and an intelligent Dual BIOS toggle, it ensures relentless high-load execution with exceptionally hushed acoustic levels.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G SUPRIM SOC Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>513,000৳</strong>. You can order this ultra-high-end flagship GPU online from the International Office Solution website, or get expert consultation by visiting one of our local corporate showrooms.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>21,760 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clocks (Gaming Mode)</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2565 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2580 MHz (via MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clocks (Silent Mode)</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2512 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2527 MHz (via MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>32GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>28 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>512-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5.0 x16</td></tr><tr><td><strong>DisplayPort</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td><strong>HDMI Port</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>1 x HDMI 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Up to 15360 x 8460 @ 60Hz (Dual 8K outputs supported)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Quad Display (Up to 4 concurrent monitors)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>575W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>1 x 16-pin (12V-2x6 / PCIe 5.0)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>1000W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>Software</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>HYPER FROZR Layout: STORMFORCE Fans, Vapor Chamber &amp; Core Pipes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Optimization</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Zero Frozr (Fans stop under low load) &amp; Dual BIOS Hardware Switch</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Reinforcement</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Solid Aluminum Alloy Central Frame &amp; Ventilated Metal Backplate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>359 x 149 x 70 mm (Large Multi-Slot Footprint)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>After-sales</td><td>3 Years Manufacturing Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 599900.00, 599900.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/Bcm5wZp2JfBAdtisDveq6FrNCGIcqG8lQZiZXlOF.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 11:44:46', '2026-07-12 11:44:46', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G SUPRIM SOC Price in BD | International Office Solution', 'Get the ultimate performance with the MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G SUPRIM SOC 32GB GDDR7 graphics card in Bangladesh. Discover top-tier cooling and unmatched AI power at International Office Solution.\r\n\r\nKeywords: MSI G', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G SUPRIM SOC, RTX 5090 Suprim price in Bangladesh, 32GB GDDR7 GPU BD, NVIDIA Blackwell flagship, International Office Solution.', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(1194, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G LIGHTNING Z GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G LIGHTNING Z is the ultimate ultra-flagship graphics card, engineered on NVIDIA\'s Blackwell architecture with a breathtaking 21,760 CUDA cores and 32GB of 512-bit GDDR7 memory. Featuring a revolutionary custom-engineered 360mm AIO liquid cooling system, a world-first integrated 8-inch LCD command center display, and a dual-mode BIOS capable of sustaining a jaw-dropping 1000W extreme power limit, this limited-run masterpiece is built entirely for elite record-breaking overclockers and enthusiasts who demand absolute perfection.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5090-32g-lightning-z-gddr7-graphics-card-1783856761', '<p>Witness the return of an absolute legend with the MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G LIGHTNING Z GDDR7 Graphics Card—a defining showcase of compromise-free engineering produced in highly limited numbers worldwide. Forged to smash benchmarking records and redefine the limits of desktop graphics computing, this hyper-premium powerhouse is built on NVIDIA\'s foundational Blackwell architecture. Outfitted with an unprecedented 21,760 CUDA cores and combined with a massive 32GB of next-generation GDDR7 VRAM across a wide 512-bit bus interface, it provides a massive 1.79 TB/s of bandwidth to effortlessly drive hardware-accelerated path tracing, real-time AI neural rendering, and heavy local machine learning operations.</p><p>To tame the massive thermal constraints of a custom PCB reinforced with 3oz copper layers, MSI has deployed a completely reimagined closed-loop liquid cooling system. A full-coverage copper cold plate directly absorbs heat from the GPU core, VRAM, and massive 40-phase VRM layout, cycling fluid via a high-pressure pump to a massive 394mm hybrid-fin radiator cooled by three Liquid Crystal Polymer (LCP) aerodynamic fans. The centerpiece of this striking carbon-fiber accented shroud is a brilliant, fully customizable 8-inch integrated LCD status screen to display real-time statistics or personal media via software tuning. Supported by an onboard V-Check Point array for manual voltage probing and a hardware switch that toggles up to an insane 1000W Extreme Mode, it provides unmatched power headroom for extreme overclocking enthusiasts.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G LIGHTNING Z Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>994,500৳</strong>. As this is an extremely rare, enthusiast-tier flagship product, you can secure your unit by ordering directly via the International Office Solution website, or by getting in touch with our corporate showroom team for dedicated purchase assistance.</p><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell (GB202 Chipset)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>21,760 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clocks</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2730 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2775 MHz (via MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>32GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>28 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>512-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5.0 x16</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 2.1b, 1 x HDMI 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dedicated Data Port</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>1 x USB Type-C (Reserved solely for the 8-inch LCD panel interface)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Quad Display (Up to 4 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>800W (OC Mode) / Up to 1000W (Extreme Hardware Mode)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>2 x 16-pin PCIe 5.0 (12V-2x6 Native Inputs; standard dongles not supported)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>1400W to 1500W or higher</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>Software</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Integrated Display</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>World\'s first integrated 8-inch full-color LCD status command center screen</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Card Dimensions</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>260 x 151 x 61 mm (Triple-Slot Profile)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Radiator Dimensions</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>394 x 120 x 56 mm (Requires 360mm liquid cooling chassis space)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Liquid Cooled AIO: Full-Cover Copper Waterways, High-Pressure Pump, LCP Fans</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Customization</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Dual BIOS Physical Switch, Onboard V-Check Points for direct voltage tracking</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>After-sales</td><td>3 Years Manufacturing Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p>', 'Graphics Card', 994500.00, 994500.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/gD8Ozyuwwjl7bq22PEORDa8y1RBY9Wag4UmmxcXH.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 11:46:01', '2026-07-12 11:46:01', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G LIGHTNING Z Price in BD | International Office Solution', 'Get the ultimate extreme performance with the limited-edition MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G LIGHTNING Z 32GB GDDR7 graphics card in Bangladesh. Purchase yours today from International Office Solution.', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G LIGHTNING Z, RTX 5090 Lightning Z price in Bangladesh, 32GB GDDR7 flagship GPU BD, NVIDIA Blackwell extreme overclocking, International Office Solution.', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(1195, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G SHADOW 2X OC 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G SHADOW 2X OC features NVIDIA\'s power-efficient Blackwell architecture, delivering 4,608 CUDA cores and 8GB of cutting-edge GDDR7 memory. Outfitted with an out-of-the-box factory overclock and the dual STORMFORCE fan thermal system, it offers exceptional 1080p and 1440p gaming framing rates alongside advanced local AI capabilities in a highly compact, case-friendly footprint.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5060-ti-8g-shadow-2x-oc-8gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783856840', '<p>Step into next-generation high-fidelity gaming and seamless content creation with the MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G SHADOW 2X OC 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card. Purpose-engineered on NVIDIA\'s high-efficiency Blackwell architecture, this graphic accelerator leverages 4,608 capable CUDA cores alongside 8GB of lightning-fast GDDR7 VRAM. Running on a fast 28 Gbps speed interface across a 128-bit bus, it delivers the high-speed memory bandwidth needed to smoothly run modern titles with intense ray tracing, handle complex video editing workflows, and accelerate modern local AI workloads.</p><p>As a core part of the highly dependable SHADOW 2X OC lineup, this card comes optimized with an aggressive factory boost clock reaching up to 2617 MHz via MSI Center integration. The custom PCB layout features a dual STORMFORCE cooling solution built with optimized claw-textured fan blades to channel higher air pressure directly through the compact radiator block. Supported by continuous zero-RPM silent operation under light usage, a structurally protective metal backplate, and full compatibility with the latest NVIDIA DLSS 4.5 neural frame generation technology, it represents a brilliant premium upgrade for space-restricted mid-tower configurations.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G SHADOW 2X OC Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>49,900৳</strong>. You can order this high-value mainstream GPU online from the official International Office Solution website, or drop by any of our local physical showrooms to pick up yours.</p><h3>Technical Specifications</h3>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>4,608 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2602 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2617 MHz (via MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>28 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5.0 (runs at x8 mode)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 2.1b, 1 x HDMI 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Up to 4 displays simultaneously</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>180W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>1 x 8-pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>600W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>Software</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Dual-Fan Layout with STORMFORCE Fans &amp; Zero Frozr tech</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Form Factor</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>ATX Form Design (Compact Dual-Slot footway)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>226 x 126 x 41 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>After-sales</td><td>3 Years Manufacturing Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/tImrki8mAeAJqwWZj563fcA5rUjhPe9SpMMROzjd.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 11:47:20', '2026-07-12 11:47:20', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G SHADOW 2X OC Price in BD | International Office Solution', ': Get the best price on the MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G SHADOW 2X OC 8GB GDDR7 graphics card in Bangladesh. Enjoy next-gen Blackwell architecture at International Office Solution.', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G SHADOW 2X OC, RTX 5060 Ti Shadow price in Bangladesh, 8GB GDDR7 GPU BD, MSI Blackwell graphics card, International Office Solution.', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(1196, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G SHADOW 2X OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G SHADOW 2X OC pairs NVIDIA\'s power-efficient Blackwell architecture with an expanded 16GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory. Featuring a 128-bit bus, an out-of-the-box factory overclock, and a high-efficiency dual STORMFORCE fan setup, it offers incredible memory headroom for 1440p gaming, texture-heavy content creation, and advanced local AI applications within a compact dual-slot design.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5060-ti-16g-shadow-2x-oc-16gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783856923', '<p>Empower your desktop with extended memory headroom and modern architecture using the MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G SHADOW 2X OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card. Engineered on NVIDIA\'s high-efficiency Blackwell architecture, this graphics card features 4,608 capable CUDA cores and doubles the high-speed VRAM buffer to a massive 16GB of next-generation GDDR7 memory. Operating at 28 Gbps on a 128-bit bus, it easily alleviates memory bottlenecks in modern AAA gaming titles, dense 4K video rendering timelines, and large parameter local AI modeling workflows.</p><p>Built as a staple of the reliable SHADOW 2X OC lineup, this card comes optimized with a factory boost clock reaching an extreme 2617 MHz via MSI Center software adjustments. To manage the thermal constraints under full workloads, the integrated dual-fan cooling layout features custom STORMFORCE fan blades. These claw-textured blades are engineered to maximize concentrated air pressure through the heatsink while maintaining exceptionally quiet acoustics. Complete with solid zero-RPM Zero Frozr technology for silent idling, a structural aluminum-accented backplate with airflow vents, and full acceleration support for NVIDIA DLSS 4.5 neural frame generation, it stands as an outstanding future-proof upgrade for modern space-restricted builds.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G SHADOW 2X OC Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>77,000৳</strong>. You can order this high-capacity mainstream GPU online via the International Office Solution website, or get expert assistance by visiting any of our local physical showrooms.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>4,608 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2602 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2617 MHz (via MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>28 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5.0 x16 (runs at x8 mode)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 2.1b, 1 x HDMI 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Up to 4 displays simultaneously</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>180W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>1 x 8-pin PCIe</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>600W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>Software</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><