(1197, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 TI 16G VENTUS 2X OC WHITE 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G VENTUS 2X OC WHITE blends striking clean aesthetics with next-generation power, utilizing NVIDIA\'s high-efficiency Blackwell architecture. Featuring a generous 16GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory and a dual-fan STORMFORCE cooling system encased in a premium all-white shroud, it offers exceptional 1440p gaming framing rates, massive VRAM headroom for content creation, and local AI acceleration in a compact dual-slot design.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5060-ti-16g-ventus-2x-oc-white-16gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783857008', '<p>Elevate both your desktop aesthetics and computing power with the MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G VENTUS 2X OC WHITE 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card. Purpose-engineered on NVIDIA\'s foundational Blackwell architecture, this graphics card combines 4,608 performance-driven CUDA cores with a massive 16GB buffer of state-of-the-art GDDR7 memory. Operating across a 128-bit bus interface at an effective speed of 28 Gbps, it easily eliminates memory bottlenecks in heavy modern AAA gaming titles, deep 4K video editing timelines, and large parameter local AI training tasks.</p><p>Wrapped in a beautiful pristine white enclosure with a matching protective metal backplate, this VENTUS 2X OC variant comes factory-optimized to reach clock speeds up to an extreme 2617 MHz via the MSI Center management application. Cooling efficiency is handled by an advanced dual STORMFORCE fan array, featuring customized claw-textured blades built to maximize concentrated static air pressure through the heatsink assembly while keeping noise levels exceptionally low. Further enhanced with zero-RPM Zero Frozr silent operational technology and full support for NVIDIA DLSS 4.5 neural frame generation, it stands as the ideal future-proof centerpiece for clean, space-conscious white-themed PC configurations.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G VENTUS 2X OC WHITE Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>79,900৳</strong>. You can secure this stunning white enthusiast GPU online through the official International Office Solution website, or by getting in touch with our showroom teams for dedicated ordering support.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>4,608 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2602 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2617 MHz (via MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>28 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5.0 x16 (runs at x8 mode)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 2.1b, 1 x HDMI 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Quad Display (Up to 4 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>180W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>1 x 8-pin PCIe</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>600W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>Software</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Dual STORMFORCE Fans with Zero Frozr zero-RPM technology</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Body Theme &amp; Aesthetics</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Premium All-White Shroud and matching White Metal Backplate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>227 x 127 x 41 mm (Compact Dual-Slot Layout)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCB Form Factor</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>ATX Form</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>After-sales</td><td>3 Years Manufacturing Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/UVkNMaTPvSCsyJk59t9Icz7oNreKJzYjaPBqmndt.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 11:50:08', '2026-07-12 11:50:08', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G VENTUS 2X OC WHITE Price in BD | International Office Solution', 'Buy the original MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G VENTUS 2X OC WHITE 16GB GDDR7 graphics card in Bangladesh. Enjoy next-gen Blackwell power and a sleek white design at International Office Solution.', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G VENTUS 2X OC WHITE, RTX 5060 Ti White price in Bangladesh, 16GB GDDR7 white GPU BD, MSI Blackwell graphics card, International Office Solution.', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL);
