(1198, 'MSI GeForce RTX 4070 Ti SUPER 16G AERO GDDR6X Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 4070 Ti SUPER 16G AERO features NVIDIA\'s power-optimized Ada Lovelace architecture, packing 8,448 CUDA cores and 16GB of premium GDDR6X memory on a 256-bit bus. Outfitted with an efficient single-fan blower configuration optimized for multi-GPU setups, a solid structural backplate, and an out-of-the-box factory boost clock of 2610 MHz, it offers exceptional 4K gaming frames and high-density local AI or compute power.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-4070-ti-super-16g-aero-gddr6x-graphics-card-1783857088', '<p>Empower your high-performance desktop or multi-GPU workstation with the specialized design of the MSI GeForce RTX 4070 Ti SUPER 16G AERO GDDR6X Graphics Card. Masterfully built on NVIDIA\'s foundational Ada Lovelace architecture, this graphic accelerator leverages a massive 8,448 processing CUDA cores alongside a spacious 16GB buffer of premium GDDR6X memory. Running at an effective speed of 21 Gbps across a 256-bit bus interface, it unleashes massive bandwidth to comfortably drive heavy real-time path tracing, high-resolution textures, complex 3D rendering pipelines, and dense local AI modeling environments.</p><p>Distinguished by its professional blower-style cooling configuration, the AERO series is purposefully engineered to direct hot exhaust air straight out of the rear chassis bracket. This layout makes it exceptionally ideal for tightly packed multi-card configurations or compact server enclosures. Boosted factory clocks push core operations safely up to 2610 MHz right out of the box. Complete with structural protection via a solid layout backplate, modern DisplayPort 1.4a and HDMI 2.1a connectivity options, and full support for DLSS 3 neural frame generation, it delivers specialized computing authority with rock-solid system stability.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the MSI GeForce RTX 4070 Ti SUPER 16G AERO Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>138,500৳</strong>. You can order this specialized workstation GPU online via the official International Office Solution website, or get direct corporate assistance by reaching out to our physical showrooms.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Ada Lovelace</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>8,448 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2610 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR6X</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>21 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>256-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express Gen 4.0</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 1.4a, 1 x HDMI 2.1a</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Quad Display (Up to 4 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>285W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>1 x 16-pin (12VHPWR)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>700W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>Software</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Single-Fan Blower Setup (Ideal for Multi-GPU configurations)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Form Factor</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Standard ATX PCB Layout</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>263 x 111 x 42 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>After-sales</td><td>3 Years Manufacturing Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/ArAHquMamJtwKKYbBbftUvYO05iDBtsAinMTOBZN.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 11:51:28', '2026-07-12 11:51:28', 'MSI GeForce RTX 4070 Ti SUPER 16G AERO Price in BD | International Office Solution', 'Get the best deals on the MSI GeForce RTX 4070 Ti SUPER 16G AERO 16GB GDDR6X graphics card in Bangladesh. Enjoy ultimate workstation performance at International Office Solution.', 'MSI GeForce RTX 4070 Ti SUPER 16G AERO, RTX 4070 Ti Super Aero price in Bangladesh, 16GB GDDR6X blower GPU BD, MSI Ada Lovelace graphics card, International Office Solution.', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(1199, 'MSI GeForce RTX 3060 Ti GAMING X TRIO 8GB Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 3060 Ti GAMING X TRIO features NVIDIA\'s power-optimized Ampere architecture, packing 4,864 CUDA cores and 8GB of premium GDDR6 memory on a wide 256-bit bus. Outfitted with the elite TRI FROZR 2 triple-fan thermal system utilizing TORX Fan 4.0 blades, customizable RGB Mystic Light, and an out-of-the-box factory boost clock of 1830 MHz, it delivers exceptional high-framerate 1080p and 1440p gaming performance.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-3060-ti-gaming-x-trio-8gb-graphics-card-1783857166', '<p>Elevate your mid-tier gaming configuration or graphics workstation with the exceptional thermal headroom of the MSI GeForce RTX 3060 Ti GAMING X TRIO 8GB Graphics Card. Masterfully built on NVIDIA\'s foundational Ampere architecture (2nd generation RTX), this graphic accelerator leverages 4,864 processing CUDA cores alongside an agile 8GB buffer of high-speed GDDR6 memory. Operating over a wide 256-bit bus interface at an effective memory clock of 14 Gbps, it generates massive systemic bandwidth to drive rich real-time ray tracing, advanced AI features via DLSS, and smooth multimedia rendering pipelines.</p><p>Distinguished by its high-end physical presence, the GAMING X TRIO series incorporates the signature TRI FROZR 2 thermal cooling array. This system relies on three synchronized TORX Fan 4.0 units, meticulously built with outer ring-bound blades to focus high-pressure static airflow directly onto precision-crafted Core Pipe heatsinks. The custom multi-layered PCB is structural reinforced with a rigid metal anti-bending strap and a solid matte-finish metal backplate that uses thermal padding for passive structural cooling. Complete with vivid RGB Mystic Light integration, an out-of-the-box factory boost clock reaching 1830 MHz, and specialized zero-RPM Zero Frozr acoustic control for silent desktop idling, it provides premium build stability alongside whispering-quiet execution.</p><h3>Product Pri