API, OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>TRI FROZR 2 System: 3 x TORX Fan 4.0 &amp; Core Pipe tech</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic &amp; Lighting</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Zero Frozr (Silent Fan Idle) &amp; RGB Mystic Light Control</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>323 x 140 x 56 mm (Large Triple-Slot Footprint)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Card Weight</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>1452 g (Card Only) / 2300 g (Gross Package)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>After-sales</td><td>3 Years Manufacturing Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/OgEhd2UfdHGcEPBX23pp7RQKDiEVHHxalOny8VhK.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 11:52:46', '2026-07-12 11:52:46', 'MSI GeForce RTX 3060 Ti GAMING X TRIO 8GB Price in BD | International Office Solution', 'Get the best deals on the MSI GeForce RTX 3060 Ti GAMING X TRIO 8GB GDDR6 graphics card in Bangladesh. Enjoy premium TRI FROZR 2 cooling at International Office Solution.', 'MSI GeForce RTX 3060 Ti GAMING X TRIO, RTX 3060 Ti Gaming X Trio price in Bangladesh, 8GB GDDR6 GPU BD, MSI Ampere graphics card, International Office Solution.', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(1200, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16G VENTUS 3X PZ GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16G VENTUS 3X PZ features NVIDIA\'s power-efficient Blackwell architecture, delivering 8,960 CUDA cores and 16GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory on a 256-bit bus. Outfitted with an innovative Zero-Trace Power Path for hidden cables, a metal magnetic backplate, and a high-pressure triple TORX Fan 5.0 system, this SFF-ready enthusiast card provides dominant 4K gaming performance and high-performance local AI capabilities with a completely clean aesthetic.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5070-ti-16g-ventus-3x-pz-gddr7-graphics-card-1783857240', '<p>Redefine the neatness and power of your desktop configuration with the MSI GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16G VENTUS 3X PZ 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card. Purpose-engineered on NVIDIA\'s high-efficiency Blackwell architecture, this high-performance graphics card pairs 8,960 performance-driven CUDA cores with 16GB of cutting-edge GDDR7 memory. Operating across a wide 256-bit bus interface at 28 Gbps, it generates massive systemic bandwidth to deliver fluid path-traced rendering, high-refresh-rate 4K gaming, and seamless performance across demanding AI-assisted pipelines.</p><p>What completely sets this VENTUS 3X PZ variant apart is its innovative Zero-Trace Power Path design, which smartly tucks the standard 16-pin power connections out of sight for a seamless, cable-free aesthetic. The hardware is backed by a robust metal magnetic backplate that simplifies physical chassis assembly while providing supreme structural stability. For cooling management under maximum gaming or rendering loads, it utilizes a custom triple-fan thermal array anchored by ring-bound TORX Fan 5.0 blades and flattened core heat pipes that tightly contact a nickel-plated copper baseplate. Supported by zero-RPM Zero Frozr technology for silent acoustics and full compatibility with NVIDIA DLSS 4.5 frame generation, it represents the absolute pinnacle of high-efficiency performance and ultra-clean modern PC layout design.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the MSI GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16G VENTUS 3X PZ Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>151,900৳</strong>. You can purchase this premium, clean-aesthetic Blackwell GPU online via the official International Office Solution website, or get direct assistance by visiting any of our local physical</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>8,960 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2452 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2467 MHz (via MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>28 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>256-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5.0 x16</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 2.1b, 1 x HDMI 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Quad Display (Up to 4 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>300W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>1 x 16-pin (Zero-Trace Power Path design for hidden cabling)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</