(1201, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G VANGUARD SOC LAUNCH EDITION 32GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G VANGUARD SOC LAUNCH EDITION is the definitive flagship graphics card built on NVIDIA’s cutting-edge Blackwell architecture. Packing an incredible 21,760 CUDA cores, a massive 32GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory on a 512-bit bus, and the advanced HYPER FROZR thermal design with STORMFORCE fans, this exclusive launch edition delivers unparalleled 8K neural rendering, extreme gaming performance, and supreme AI computation.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5090-32g-vanguard-soc-launch-edition-32gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783857333', '<p>Step into the future of elite desktop computing with the limited-tier MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G VANGUARD SOC LAUNCH EDITION 32GB GDDR7 Graphics Card. Forged on NVIDIA\'s revolutionary Blackwell architecture, this absolute monster coordinates a mind-boggling 21,760 CUDA cores with a massive 32GB buffer of next-generation GDDR7 memory. Operating across a colossal 512-bit bus interface at an effective 28 Gbps, it unlocks unprecedented memory bandwidth to effortlessly process heavy real-time path tracing, hyper-realistic 8K virtual environments, and massive local AI or deep learning modeling datasets.</p><p>As an exclusive release, the Vanguard Launch Edition features a factory-tuned overclock that pushes extreme performance clock speeds up to 2527 MHz via the MSI Center console. It houses a state-of-the-art HYPER FROZR thermal array utilizing customized seven-blade, claw-textured STORMFORCE fans and flattened square core pipes mapped directly over an advanced vapor chamber cold plate. The hardware package is wrapped in an aerodynamic, sci-fi-inspired metal backplate layout with an expansive flow tunnel for efficient airflow dissipation. Complete with modern DisplayPort 2.1b connectivity, intelligent Dual BIOS adjustments, and high-efficiency carbonyl inductors (HCI) for stable heavy-load filtering, it sets an unmatched benchmark for structural longevity and extreme gaming supremacy.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G VANGUARD SOC LAUNCH EDITION Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>388,000৳</strong>. You can order this top-tier flagship GPU online via the official International Office Solution website, or get in touch with our expert sales team by visiting any of our corporate showrooms.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>21,760 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2512 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2527 MHz (via MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>32GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>28 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>512-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5.0 x16</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 2.1b, 1 x HDMI 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Quad Display (Up to 4 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>575W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>1 x 16-pin (ATX 3.1 PSU recommended)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</