(1202, 'MSI GeForce GT 730 2GB DDR3 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce GT 730 2GB DDR3 graphics card offers a reliable, low-profile computing solution tailored for compact HTPCs and everyday office workstations. Powered by NVIDIA’s Kepler framework with 2GB of DDR3 memory, it provides smooth HD multimedia streaming, multi-monitor multitasking, and entry-level graphics processing in an incredibly power-efficient, space-saving design.', 'msi-geforce-gt-730-2gb-ddr3-graphics-card-1783857425', '<p>Breathe new life into your essential business workspace or compact entertainment setup with the MSI GeForce GT 730 2GB DDR3 Graphics Card. Intelligently engineered on NVIDIA\'s high-efficiency GPU architecture, this entry-tier component pairs a 902 MHz core engine with a 2GB DDR3 video frame buffer. Operating across a space-efficient 64-bit bus interface, it delivers highly dependable stability for essential daily tasks such as fluid high-definition video playback, home video processing, spreadsheet navigation, and multiple application workflows.</p><p>Designed specifically to fit tightly constrained hardware environments, the signature low-profile layout easily fits inside slim system builds and Small Form Factor (SFF) chassis layouts. It runs completely cool with a power footprint of only 23 watts, eliminating the need for bulky custom power routing. Equipped with highly flexible visual pathways including HDMI 1.4a, Dual-link DVI-D, and classic D-Sub outputs, it lets you seamlessly drive multi-monitor productivity panels. Built using premium long-lasting solid capacitors and fully compatible with MSI Afterburner management utilities, it stands as an exceptional, highly affordable system enhancement for everyday operational stability.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the MSI GeForce GT 730 2GB DDR3 Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>7,000৳</strong>. You can purchase this reliable, budget-friendly low-profile GPU online through the official International Office Solution website, or get direct installation advice by dropping by any of our physical corporate showrooms.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Kepler</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>902 MHz (Boost)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>384 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>2GB (2048 MB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>DDR3</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>1600 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>64-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express 2.0 x16</td></tr><tr><td><strong>HDMI Port</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>1 x HDMI (version 1.4a) - Max 4096x2160 @24 Hz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>DVI Port</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>1 x Dual-link DVI-D - Max 2560 x 1600 @60 Hz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>D-Sub (VGA) Port</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>1 x D-Sub Output</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Up to 3 displays concurrently</td></tr><tr><td><strong>HDCP Support</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>23W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>300W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>Software</td><td>DirectX 12 API, OpenGL 4.4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>146 x 69 x 38 mm</td></tr><tr><td