(1203, 'MSI GeForce GT 1030 4GD4 LP OC 4GB Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce GT 1030 4GD4 LP OC graphics card offers an extremely compact, low-profile multimedia and computing upgrade driven by NVIDIA’s Pascal architecture. Packed with 384 CUDA cores, an expanded 4GB of DDR4 memory, and a space-saving single-slot fan design, it delivers smooth HD acceleration, dual-monitor multitasking, and reliable daily operation in small form factor (SFF) systems.', 'msi-geforce-gt-1030-4gd4-lp-oc-4gb-graphics-card-1783857525', '<p>Accelerate your compact home office setup or multimedia workspace with the sleek efficiency of the MSI GeForce GT 1030 4GD4 LP OC 4GB Graphics Card. Expertly built on NVIDIA\'s foundational Pascal architecture, this entry-tier graphic accelerator combines 384 responsive CUDA cores with an expanded 4GB of DDR4 frame buffer. Operating across a power-saving 64-bit bus interface at an effective memory clock of 2100 MHz, it provides highly dependable, stutter-free performance for daily operations such as high-definition video rendering, casual web browsing, and multi-application administrative processing.</p><p>Tailor-made for space-constrained computing environments, the signature Low-Profile (LP) blueprint measures a minimal 150mm in length, enabling it to seamlessly slide into slim office PCs and micro-chassis configurations. It operates with a highly efficient thermal footprint, pulling just 20 watts of total power to keep system temperatures low without demanding upgraded power setups. Outfitted with dual modern video pathways including one DisplayPort 1.4a and an HDMI 2.0b port supporting full 4K visual playback, this factory-overclocked card relies on premium solid capacitors to guarantee superior long-term stability and rock-solid corporate longevity.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the MSI GeForce GT 1030 4GD4 LP OC 4GB Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>10,300৳</strong>. You can order this reliable, low-profile office GPU online via the official International Office Solution website, or get configuration assistance by visiting any of our local physical showrooms.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Pascal</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>384 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Base: 1189 MHz / Boost: 1430 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>4GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>2100 MHz (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>64-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express 3.0 x16 (runs at x4 mode)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>1 x DisplayPort 2.1b / v1.4a, 1 x HDMI (Supports 4K@60Hz via HDMI 2.0b)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD via DisplayPort)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Dual Display (Up to 2 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>HDCP Support</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Yes, Version 2.2</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>20W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>None (Draws power directly from the PCIe slot)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>300W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>Software