(1204, 'MSI GeForce RTX 3060 VENTUS 2X OC 8GB Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 3060 VENTUS 2X OC features NVIDIA\'s power-efficient Ampere architecture, packing 3,584 CUDA cores and 8GB of premium GDDR6 memory on a 128-bit bus. Outfitted with an out-of-the-box factory boost clock of 1807 MHz and a reliable dual-fan cooling system utilizing TORX Fan 3.0 blades, it delivers smooth high-framerate 1080p gaming and efficient multimedia processing.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-3060-ventus-2x-oc-8gb-graphics-card-1783857717', '<p>Step into high-performance 1080p gaming and reliable content creation with the MSI GeForce RTX 3060 VENTUS 2X OC 8GB Graphics Card. Purpose-engineered on NVIDIA\'s foundational Ampere architecture (2nd generation RTX), this capable graphic accelerator leverages 3,584 streaming CUDA cores alongside an agile 8GB buffer of high-speed GDDR6 memory. Operating over a 128-bit bus interface at an effective memory clock speed of 15 Gbps, it generates the necessary bandwidth to smoothly run modern titles with immersive ray tracing, advanced AI processing via DLSS, and smooth streaming workflows.</p><p>Distinguished by its performance-focused, clean industrial aesthetic, the VENTUS 2X series incorporates a highly dependable dual-fan cooling system. This thermal arrangement features two TORX Fan 3.0 units, built with alternating traditional and dispersion blades to maximize downward air pressure onto the custom heatsink below. The compact physical layout easily fits into standard mid-tower and small form factor setups, backed structurally by a clean-finish reinforcing backplate. Complete with modern DisplayPort 1.4a and HDMI 2.1 outputs, zero-RPM Zero Frozr technology for dead-silent desktop idling, and simple software tweaking via MSI Center, it provides an outstanding balance of longevity, cooling performance, and value.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the MSI GeForce RTX 3060 VENTUS 2X OC 8GB Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>39,500৳</strong>. You can purchase this dependable mainstream GPU online through the official International Office Solution website, or get configuration assistance by visiting any of our local physical showrooms.</p><h3>Technical Specifications</h3>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Ampere</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>3,584 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 1807 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>15 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express Gen 4.0 x16</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 1.4a, 1 x HDMI 2.1 (Supports 4K@120Hz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Quad Display (Up to 4 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>170W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>1 x 8-pin PCIe</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>550W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>Software</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooler Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Dual-Fan Design with TORX Fan 3.0 technology</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Optimization</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Zero Frozr technology (Fans stop under light loads)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>235 x 124 x 42 mm (Compact Dual-Slot Footprint)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Weight</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Card Weight: 675 g / Gross Package Weight: 1030 g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>After-sales</td><td>3 Years Manufacturing Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 12:01:57', '2026-07-12 12:01:57', 'MSI GeForce RTX 3060 VENTUS 2X OC 8GB Price in BD | International Office Solution', 'Get the best deals on the MSI GeForce RTX 3060 VENTUS 2X OC 8GB GDDR6 graphics card in Bangladesh. Enjoy reliable dual-fan cooling and Ray Tracing performance at International Office Solution.', 'MSI GeForce RTX 3060 VENTUS 2X OC 8GB, RTX 3060 8GB price in Bangladesh, 8GB GDDR6 GPU BD, MSI Ampere graphics card, International Office Solution.', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(1205, 'MSI GeForce RTX 4060 VENTUS 2X WHITE 8G OC GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 4060 VENTUS 2X WHITE 8G OC features NVIDIA\'s power-efficient Ada Lovelace architecture, packing 3,072 CUDA cores and 8GB of high-speed GDDR6 memory. Outfitted with a clean, all-white shroud, an out-of-the-box factory overclock pushing up to 2505 MHz, and a high-pressure dual TORX Fan 4.0 thermal design, it delivers excellent high-framerate 1080p gaming and AI-accelerated creative workflow support.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-4060-ventus-2x-white-8g-oc-gddr6-graphics-card-1783857808', '<p>Bring a stunning, pristine aesthetic and modern performance to your custom gaming desktop with the MSI GeForce RTX 4060 VENTUS 2X WHITE 8G OC 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card. Built on NVIDIA\'s revolutionary Ada Lovelace architecture, this power-efficient GPU delivers 3,072 processing CUDA cores alongside a fast 8GB buffer of GDDR6 video memory. Operating at a 17 Gbps memory speed across a 128-bit bus interface, it supplies smooth rendering bandwidth for high-fidelity esports titles, intense creative workflows, and everyday streaming acceleration.</p><p>Dressed in a striking, all-white enclosure with a clean structural reinforcing backplate, this VENTUS 2X OC variant comes factory-optimized to touch an Extreme Performance boost clock of 2505 MHz using the MSI Center console. Thermal management is sustained by a dual TORX Fan 4.0 configuration, featuring paired fan blades bound with an outer ring link to drive concentrated static air pressure through the underlying cooling stack. Complete with zero-RPM Zero Frozr technology for silent desktop operations, one HDMI 2.1a port, and three DisplayPort 1.4a outputs, it offers standard support for up to 4 concurrent monitors and revolutionary DLSS 3 neural frame generation, making it the perfect future-proof choice for compact, white-themed PC builds.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the MSI GeForce RTX 4060 VENTUS 2X WHITE 8G OC Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>39,500৳</strong>. You can purchase this stunning all-white GPU online through the official International Office Solution website, or get configuration assistance by visiting any of our local physical showrooms.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Ada Lovelace</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>3,072 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2490 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2505 MHz (via MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>17 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express Gen 4.0 x16 (runs at x8 mode)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 1.4a, 1 x HDMI 2.1a (Supports 4K@120Hz &amp; 8K@60Hz HDR)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Quad Display (Up to 4 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>115W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>1 x 8-pin PCIe</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>550W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>Software</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooler Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Dual-Fan Setup with TORX Fan 4.0 technology</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Management</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Zero Frozr technology (Fans completely stop under low loads)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Body Theme &amp; Shroud</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Premium All-White Cover Shroud with White Reinforcing Backplate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>199 x 120 x 41 mm (Compact Dual-Slot Layout)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Weight</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Net Card Weight: 546 g / Gross Package Weight: 783 g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>After-sales</td><td>3 Years Manufacturing Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/bWOlPLlHcevnNVc1Prr4fCZFLj2Li9bAMwTvw8Yc.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 12:03:28', '2026-07-12 12:03:28', 'MSI GeForce RTX 4060 VENTUS 2X WHITE 8G OC Price in BD | International Office Solution', 'Get the original MSI GeForce RTX 4060 VENTUS 2X WHITE 8G OC 8GB GDDR6 graphics card at the best price in Bangladesh. Perfect for custom white builds at International Office Solution.', 'MSI GeForce RTX 4060 VENTUS 2X WHITE 8G OC, RTX 4060 White price in Bangladesh, 8GB GDDR6 white GPU BD, Ada Lovelace graphics card, International Office Solution.', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(1206, 'MSI GeForce RTX 4060 GAMING X 8G MLG GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 4060 GAMING X 8G MLG pairs NVIDIA’s highly efficient Ada Lovelace architecture with a striking, limited-edition red aesthetics layout. Packed with 3,072 CUDA cores and 8GB of high-speed GDDR6 memory, this exclusive graphics card features the elite TWIN FROZR 9 dual-fan thermal setup with TORX Fan 5.0 technology, delivering outstanding 1080p gaming frame rates and AI-accelerated rendering inside an eye-catching collector\'s design.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-4060-gaming-x-8g-mlg-gddr6-graphics-card-1783857904', '<p>The MSI GeForce RTX 4060 GAMING X 8G MLG pairs NVIDIA’s highly efficient Ada Lovelace architecture with a striking, limited-edition red aesthetics layout. Packed with 3,072 CUDA cores and 8GB of high-speed GDDR6 memory, this exclusive graphics card features the elite TWIN FROZR 9 dual-fan thermal setup with TORX Fan 5.0 technology, delivering outstanding 1080p gaming frame rates and AI-accelerated rendering inside an eye-catching collector\'s design.</p><h4>Long Description</h4><p>Inject bold, enthusiast-tier styling and cutting-edge gaming power into your system configuration with the MSI GeForce RTX 4060 GAMING X 8G MLG 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card. Engineered on NVIDIA\'s foundational Ada Lovelace architecture, this striking special-edition GPU unleashes 3,072 capable CUDA cores working alongside an agile 8GB buffer of GDDR6 video memory. Operating at a fast 17 Gbps memory speed across a 128-bit bus interface, it provides smooth processing bandwidth for immersive ray-traced graphics, high-framerate competitive gaming, and local AI or content creation workloads.</p><p>Setting itself completely apart from standard desktop hardware, this MLG variant showcases an exclusive, vibrant red shroud design complete with a custom matching backplate structure. An factory-optimized boost clock pushes core speeds up to an extreme 2610 MHz via the MSI Center console. Cooling management is perfec