terface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Quad Display (Up to 4 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>115W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>1 x 8-pin PCIe</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>550W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>Software</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooler Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>TWIN FROZR 9 Setup with TORX Fan 5.0 technology</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Optimization</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Zero Frozr technology (Fans stop completely under low load)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Special Design Theme</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Limited MLG Edition Vibrant Red Shroud &amp; Matching Backplate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>247 x 130 x 41 mm (Dual-Slot Footprint)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Weight</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Net Card Weight: 627 g / Gross Package Weight: 1126 g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>After-sales</td><td>3 Years Manufacturing Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/DdUSbubIMdUvJ8rsiLuq52MoJW4zesdY5yu38bkE.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 12:05:04', '2026-07-12 12:05:04', 'MSI GeForce RTX 4060 GAMING X 8G MLG Price in BD | International Office Solution', 'Get the official MSI GeForce RTX 4060 GAMING X 8G MLG 8GB GDDR6 graphics card at the best price in Bangladesh. Enjoy stunning MLG special-edition styling and TWIN FROZR 9 cooling at International Office Solution.', 'MSI GeForce RTX 4060 GAMING X 8G MLG, RTX 4060 MLG price in Bangladesh, 8GB GDDR6 gaming GPU BD, Ada Lovelace special edition card, International 