(1207, 'MSI GeForce RTX 4060 VENTUS 2X BLACK 8GB OC GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 4060 VENTUS 2X BLACK 8GB OC delivers excellent next-generation gaming and creative performance powered by NVIDIA\'s highly efficient Ada Lovelace architecture. Outfitted with 3,072 CUDA cores, 8GB of high-speed GDDR6 memory, and an aggressive factory overclock, this compact graphics card features a stealthy all-black shroud and dual high-pressure TORX Fan 4.0 units for superior thermal management in space-conscious builds.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-4060-ventus-2x-black-8gb-oc-gddr6-graphics-card-1783858037', '<p>Introduce a sleek, stealthy aesthetic and exceptional processing power to your gaming configuration with the MSI GeForce RTX 4060 VENTUS 2X BLACK 8GB OC GDDR6 Graphics Card. Masterfully built on NVIDIA\'s foundational Ada Lovelace architecture, this power-optimized GPU coordinates 3,072 streaming CUDA cores with an agile 8GB buffer of GDDR6 video memory. Operating at a fast 17 Gbps memory speed across a 128-bit bus interface, it provides smooth rendering bandwidth for immersive ray-traced visuals, competitive high-framerate multiplayer gaming, and efficient local AI application hosting.</p><p>Dressed in a clean, minimalist all-black enclosure with a matching structural reinforcing backplate, this VENTUS 2X BLACK variant comes factory-optimized to touch an Extreme Performance clock speed of 2505 MHz using the MSI Center management application. Cooling efficiency is handled by an advanced dual TORX Fan 4.0 configuration, featuring paired blades bound with an outer ring link to drive focused static air pressure deep through the custom heatsink block. Complete with zero-RPM Zero Frozr technology for silent desktop idling, three DisplayPort 1.4a outputs, and one HDMI 2.1a port, it offers standard acceleration for revolutionary DLSS 3 neural frame generation, making it the perfect future-proof choice for compact, subtle desktop PC builds.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the MSI GeForce RTX 4060 VENTUS 2X BLACK 8GB OC Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>43,500৳</strong>. You can purchase this dependable all-black GPU online through the official International Office Solution website, or get configuration assistance by visiting any of our physical corporate showrooms.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Ada Lovelace</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>3,072 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2490 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2505 MHz (via MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>17 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express Gen 4.0 x16 (runs at x8 mode)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 1.4a, 1 x HDMI 2.1a (Supports 4K@120Hz &amp; 8K@60Hz HDR)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Quad Display (Up to 4 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>115W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>1 x 8-pin PCIe</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>550W</td