(1208, 'MSI GeForce RTX 4060 GAMING X 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 4060 GAMING X 8GB features NVIDIA’s highly efficient Ada Lovelace architecture, packing 3,072 processing CUDA cores and 8GB of high-speed GDDR6 memory on a 128-bit bus. Outfitted with the elite TWIN FROZR 9 dual-fan thermal setup utilizing ring-bound TORX Fan 5.0 blades, customized Mystic Light RGB accents, and a factory-overclocked boost clock touching an extreme 2610 MHz, it delivers exceptional high-framerate 1080p gaming alongside premium system stability.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-4060-gaming-x-8gb-gddr6-graphics-card-1783858111', '<p>Inject iconic styling and next-generation architectural efficiency into your desktop build with the MSI GeForce RTX 4060 GAMING X 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card. Masterfully engineered on NVIDIA\'s advanced Ada Lovelace architecture, this performance-segment GPU brings 3,072 capable CUDA cores to work in unison with an agile 8GB buffer of high-speed GDDR6 video memory. Operating at a fast 17 Gbps memory speed across a 128-bit bus interface, it provides smooth processing bandwidth for immersive real-time ray tracing, competitive high-framerate multiplayer gaming, and efficient local AI or content creation acceleration.</p><p>Built as a staple of the legendary MSI GAMING series, this variant comes factory-optimized right out of the box to reach an Extreme Performance boost clock of 2610 MHz via the MSI Center management utility. Thermodynamic efficiency is perfectly managed by the advanced TWIN FROZR 9 cooling system. This setup coordinates customized TORX Fan 5.0 ring blades with a solid nickel-plated copper baseplate and direct-contact precision core heatpipes to channel high-pressure airflow directly across the custom heatsink block. Complete with zero-RPM Zero Frozr technology for silent desktop idling, a rigid metal anti-bending backplate layout, and full hardware acceleration for revolutionary DLSS 3 neural frame generation, it stands as the ideal future-pr