(1209, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 8G SHADOW 2X OC 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5060 8G SHADOW 2X OC brings NVIDIA\'s high-efficiency Blackwell architecture to mainstream setups, packing 3,840 CUDA cores and 8GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory. Outfitted with a power-saving dual-fan array featuring ring-bound TORX Fan 5.0 blades, an out-of-the-box factory overclock, and a highly compact dual-slot form factor, it delivers dominant 1080p and 1440p gaming framing rates alongside advanced local AI processing capabilities.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5060-8g-shadow-2x-oc-8gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783858182', '<p>Empower your space-conscious gaming setup or modern editing machine with the exceptional value and next-generation power of the MSI GeForce RTX 5060 8G SHADOW 2X OC 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card. Purpose-engineered on NVIDIA\'s advanced Blackwell architecture, this mainstream graphic accelerator leverages 3,840 streaming CUDA cores alongside a fast 8GB buffer of cutting-edge GDDR7 video memory. Operating at an effective memory clock speed of 28 Gbps across a 128-bit bus interface, it supplies the necessary high-speed bandwidth to smoothly run modern AAA titles with immersive ray tracing, complex rendering timelines, and local AI workflows.</p><p>Built as a highly dependable staple of the SHADOW 2X OC lineup, this variant comes factory-optimized right out of the box to reach an Extreme Performance boost clock of 2535 MHz via the MSI Center console. Thermodynamic efficiency is perfectly managed by a custom dual-fan cooling system featuring ring-bound TORX Fan 5.0 blades. These linked blade structures focus high-pressure static airflow directly across custom copper heat pipes and a dense radiator layout. Supported by zero-RPM Zero Frozr technology for silent desktop idling, a structurally rigid reinforcing backplate with a flow-through ventilation vent, and next-gen DisplayPort 2.1b connectivity, it delivers premium, future-proof desktop graphics stability with an extremely 