(1210, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 8G VENTUS 2X OC WHITE 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5060 8G VENTUS 2X OC WHITE pairs NVIDIA’s groundbreaking Blackwell architecture with a stunning all-white enclosure. Outfitted with 3,840 CUDA cores and 8GB of next-generation GDDR7 memory operating on a 128-bit bus, this compact, factory-overclocked graphics card relies on a high-pressure dual TORX Fan 5.0 system to deliver premium 1080p/1440p gaming framing rates and AI-accelerated workflows.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5060-8g-ventus-2x-oc-white-8gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783858260', '<p>Bring crisp, high-end aesthetics and next-generation processing performance to your desktop configuration with the MSI GeForce RTX 5060 8G VENTUS 2X OC WHITE 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card. Purpose-engineered on NVIDIA\'s foundational Blackwell architecture, this mainstream graphics processing unit brings a powerful 3,840 streaming CUDA cores to work alongside 8GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 video memory. Operating at a blistering speed of 28 Gbps across a 128-bit bus interface, it unleashes massive bandwidth to ensure fluid path-traced ray tracing, smooth competitive esports frames, and exceptional processing speed for local AI modeling or media creation tasks.</p><p>Dressed completely in a striking, pristine white shroud assembly with a matching flow-through structural backplate, this custom VENTUS 2X variant comes factory-optimized to touch an Extreme Performance boost clock of 2535 MHz via the MSI Center platform. The integrated thermal solution utilizes advanced, ring-linked TORX Fan 5.0 blade rings to focus high-pressure static airflow directly onto flat-profile core pipes and a solid nickel-plated copper baseplate. Complete with zero-RPM Zero Frozr technology for silent desktop operations, high-efficiency DrMOS power stages, next-gen DisplayPort 2.1b connections, and full hardware acceleration for NVIDIA DLSS 4.5 frame generation, it serves as the ultimate center-piece configuration for compact, white-