(1211, 'MSI GeForce RTX 4060 Ti 8G VENTUS 2X BLACK E1 OC 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 4060 Ti 8G VENTUS 2X BLACK E1 OC features NVIDIA\'s highly efficient Ada Lovelace architecture, packing 4,352 processing CUDA cores and 8GB of premium GDDR6 memory on a 128-bit bus. Outfitted with an optimized dual-fan array utilizing TORX Fan 4.0 technology, a reinforced stealth-black backplate, and a factory-overclocked boost clock reaching up to 2580 MHz, it delivers exceptional high-framerate 1080p and 1440p gaming framing rates alongside advanced local AI capabilities.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-4060-ti-8g-ventus-2x-black-e1-oc-8gb-gddr6-graphics-card-1783858317', '<p>Inject sleek, stealthy aesthetics and powerful architecture into your desktop configuration with the MSI GeForce RTX 4060 Ti 8G VENTUS 2X BLACK E1 OC 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card. Built on NVIDIA\'s foundational Ada Lovelace architecture, this power-optimized GPU coordinates 4,352 streaming CUDA cores with an agile 8GB buffer of high-speed GDDR6 video memory. Operating at a fast 18 Gbps memory speed across a 128-bit bus interface, it supplies smooth rendering bandwidth for immersive ray-traced visuals, competitive high-framerate multiplayer gaming, and efficient local AI application hosting.</p><p>Dressed in a clean, minimalist all-black enclosure with a matching structural reinforcing backplate, this VENTUS 2X BLACK E1 revision variant comes factory-optimized to touch an Extreme Performance clock speed of 2580 MHz using the MSI Center management application. Cooling efficiency is handled by an advanced dual-fan configuration featuring paired TORX Fan 4.0 blades, bound with an outer ring link to drive focused static air pressure deep through the custom heatsink block. Complete with zero-RPM Zero Frozr technology for silent desktop idling, three DisplayPort 1.4a outputs, and one HDMI 2.1a port, it offers standard support for up to 4 concurrent monitors and revolutionary DLSS 3 neural frame generation, making it the perfect choice for compact, subtle desktop PC builds.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the MSI GeForce RTX 4060 Ti 8G VENTUS 2X BLACK E1 OC Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>55,800৳</strong>. You can purchase this dependable all-black GPU online through the official International Office Solution website, or get configuration assistance by visiting any of our physical corporate showrooms.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>eature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Ada Lovelace</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>4,352 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2565 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2580 MHz (via MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>18 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express Gen 4.0 x16 (runs at x8 mode)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 1.4a, 1 x HDMI 2.1a (Supports 4K@120Hz &amp; 8K@60Hz HDR)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Quad Display (Up to 4 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>165W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><