(1212, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 8G GAMING TRIO OC 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5060 8G GAMING TRIO OC packs NVIDIA’s next-generation Blackwell architecture into an elite triple-fan design, delivering 3,840 CUDA cores and 8GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory. Featuring a high-end factory overclock hitting 2640 MHz via MSI Center and the advanced TRI FROZR 4 cooling system with STORMFORCE fans, it offers exceptional 1080p and 1440p gaming framing rates alongside top-tier local AI acceleration.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5060-8g-gaming-trio-oc-8gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783858394', '<p>Dominate mid-tier gaming and high-fidelity content creation setups with the premium engineering of the MSI GeForce RTX 5060 8G GAMING TRIO OC 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card. Forged on NVIDIA\'s cutting-edge Blackwell architecture, this high-performance graphics card coordinates 3,840 streaming CUDA cores with an agile 8GB buffer of next-generation GDDR7 video memory. Operating at a blistering speed of 28 Gbps across a 128-bit bus interface, it unlocks massive data bandwidth to drive real-time path-traced ray tracing, fluid high-refresh esports frames, and fast rendering workflows across heavy AI pipelines.</p><p>Stepping into the spotlight as part of the iconic GAMING TRIO series, this variant comes meticulously factory-tuned to touch an Extreme Performance boost clock of 2640 MHz using the MSI Center application. The underlying hardware relies on the signature TRI FROZR 4 thermal cooling design for whisper-quiet thermal efficiency. This array integrates three claw-textured STORMFORCE fans and precision-crafted square core heat pipes mapped over a solid nickel-plated copper baseplate. Reinforced structurally with a custom metal backplate with flow-through ventilation vents and highlighted by vibrant Mystic Light RGB accents, it brings supreme operational stability and future-proof DisplayPort 2.1b connectivity to any high-end gaming desktop chassis.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the MSI GeForce RTX 5060 8G GAMING TRIO OC Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>56,900৳</strong>. You can purchase this premium triple-fan Blackwell GPU online via the official International Office Solution website, or get configuration assistance by visiting any of our local physical showrooms.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>3,840 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2625 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2640 MHz (via MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>28 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5 x16 (runs at x8 mode)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 2.1b, 1 x HDMI 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Quad Display (Up to 4 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>155W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>1 x 8-pin PCIe</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>550W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>Software</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooler Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>TRI FROZR 4 Layout: 3 x STORMFORCE Fans &amp; Nickel-plated Copper Baseplate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic &amp; Lighting</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Zero Frozr technology (Fans stop completely at low load) &amp; Mystic Light RGB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Reinforcement</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Solid Metal Backplate with Airflow Ventilation Openings</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>300 x 125 x 44 mm (Triple-Fan Form Factor)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Weight</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Net Card Weight: 797 g / Gross Package Weight: 1206 g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>After-sales</td><td>3 Years Manufacturing Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/yq1RrGU3O15M0vkr04WQYE9JS6Q8GCZfki94VbgG.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 12:13:14', '2026-07-12 12:14:38', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 8G GAMING TRIO OC Price in BD | International Office Solution', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 8G GAMING TRIO OC Price in BD | International Office Solution', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 8G GAMING TRIO OC, RTX 5060 Gaming Trio price in Bangladesh, 8GB GDDR7 gaming GPU BD, Blackwell desktop graphics card, International Office Solution.', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(1213, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 8G INSPIRE 2X OC 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5060 8G INSPIRE 2X OC delivers next-generation gaming performance powered by NVIDIA\'s high-efficiency Blackwell architecture. Outfitted with 3,840 CUDA cores, 8GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory, and a clean white shroud design, this compact graphics card features dual claw-textured STORMFORCE fans and a ventilated metal backplate to deliver exceptional 1080p and 1440p framing rates in a case-friendly footprint.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5060-8g-inspire-2x-oc-8gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783858457', '<p>Elevate your computing build with next-generation architectural speed and striking styling using the MSI GeForce RTX 5060 8G INSPIRE 2X OC 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card. Purpose-engineered on NVIDIA\'s foundational Blackwell architecture, this mainstream graphics card leverages 3,840 streaming CUDA cores working alongside a fast 8GB buffer of cutting-edge GDDR7 memory. Operating at a blistering speed of 28 Gbps across a 128-bit bus interface, it supplies the massive data bandwidth required to smoothly handle modern AAA titles with immersive path tracing, dense rendering timelines, and local AI workflows.</p><p>Wrapped in a beautiful pristine white enclosure with a matching protective metal backplate, this INSPIRE 2X OC variant comes factory-optimized to reach an Extreme Performance boost clock of 2550 MHz via the MSI Center console. The integrated cooling solution utilizes advanced dual STORMFORCE fans, featuring seven claw-textured blades built to maximize concentrated static air pressure through the heatsink assembly while keeping noise levels exceptionally low. Further enhanced with zero-RPM Zero Frozr technology for silent desktop idling, a rigid metal backplate with flow-through exhaust vents, and next-gen DisplayPort 2.1b connectivity, it serves as the ultimate future-proof upgrade for modern space-restricted, white-themed configurations.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the MSI GeForce RTX 5060 8G INSPIRE 2X OC Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>48,000৳</strong>. You can secure this stunning white Blackwell GPU online via the official International Office Solution website, or get dedicated technical assistance by visiting any of our physical corporate showrooms.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>3,840 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2535 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2550 MHz (via MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>28 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5 x16 (runs at x8 mode)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 2.1b, 1 x HDMI 2.1b (Supports 4K@480Hz / 8K@120Hz with DSC)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Quad Display (Up to 4 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>145W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>1 x 8-pin PCIe</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>550W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>Software</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooler Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Dual-Fan Setup with STORMFORCE Fans (Seven claw-textured blades)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Management</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Zero Frozr technology (Fans completely stop under low loads)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Body Theme &amp; Aesthetics</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Premium All-White Cover Shroud with White Flow-Through Metal Backplate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>204 x 117 x 41 mm (Compact Dual-Slot Footprint)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Weight</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Net Card Weight: 529 g / Gross Package Weight: 839 g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>After-sales</td><td>3 Years Manufacturing Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/O8f5teMWhW9kuXaNLBSha95XI9mfkXQkntZGTGuM.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 12:14:17', '2026-07-12 12:14:34', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 8G INSPIRE 2X OC 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'Get the official MSI GeForce RTX 5060 8G INSPIRE 2X OC 8GB GDDR7 graphics card at the best price in Bangladesh. Enjoy next-gen Blackwell architecture and a sleek white design at International Office Solution.', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 8G INSPIRE 2X OC, RTX 5060 Inspire White price in Bangladesh, 8GB GDDR7 white GPU BD, Blackwell graphics card, International Office Solution.', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(1214, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 8G GAMING OC 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5060 8G GAMING OC combines NVIDIA’s next-generation Blackwell architecture with a dual-fan setup, delivering 3,840 CUDA cores and 8GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory. Outfitted with a high-end factory overclock reaching 2640 MHz via MSI Center and the advanced TWIN FROZR 10 thermal configuration with claw-textured STORMFORCE fans, it offers dominant 1080p and 1440p framing rates alongside premium system stability.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5060-8g-gaming-oc-8gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783858559', '<p>Inject iconic styling and next-generation architectural efficiency into your gaming computer with the MSI GeForce RTX 5060 8G GAMING OC 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card. Masterfully engineered on NVIDIA\'s advanced Blackwell architecture, this mainstream performance GPU brings 3,840 capable CUDA cores to work in unison with an agile 8GB buffer of cutting-edge GDDR7 video memory. Operating at an effective memory clock speed of 28 Gbps across a 128-bit bus interface, it provides massive data bandwidth to handle fluid real-time ray tracing, competitive high-framerate multiplayer gaming, and high-performance local AI or creation pipelines.</p><p>Built as a definitive staple of the legendary MSI GAMING series, this variant comes factory-optimized right out of the box to touch an Extreme Performance boost clock of 2640 MHz using the MSI Center management application. Thermodynamic efficiency is perfectly managed by the advanced TWIN FROZR 10 cooling system. This system utilizes advanced STORMFORCE fans featuring seven claw-textured blades and a circular arc layout designed for optimal airflow with minimal noise. The cooling block incorporates a solid nickel-plated copper baseplate and square core heat pipes that maximize structural contact over the GPU die. Reinforced with a rigid metal backplate containing airflow vents and synchronized with signature Mystic Light RGB accents, it delivers superior structural longevity and next-gen DisplayPort 2.1b connectivity.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the MSI GeForce RTX 5060 8G GAMING OC Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>49,500৳</strong>. You can order this high-performance gaming GPU online through the official International Office Solution website, or get dedicated technical advice by dropping by any of our local physical showrooms.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>3,840 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2625 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2640 MHz (via MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>28 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5 x16 (runs at x8 mode)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 2.1b, 1 x HDMI 2.1b (Supports 4K@480Hz / 8K@120Hz HDR)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Quad Display (Up to 4 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>155W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>1 x 8-pin PCIe</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>550W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>Software</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooler Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>TWIN FROZR 10 Setup: Dual STORMFORCE Fans &amp; Square Core Pipes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Enhancements</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Nickel-plated Copper Baseplate &amp; Wave Curved 3.0 fin updates</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic &amp; Lighting</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Zero Frozr technology (Fans stop during low load) &amp; Mystic Light RGB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>248 x 135 x 41 mm (Compact Dual-Fan Footprint)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Weight</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Net Card Weight: 649 g / Gross Package Weight: 966 g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>After-sales</td><td>3 Years Manufacturing Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/aex9PQ18PAkdKBwvIEUtRoREx526C0x8qtHNiWhw.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 12:15:59', '2026-07-12 12:15:59', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 8G GAMING OC Price in BD | International Office Solution', 'Get the official MSI GeForce RTX 5060 8G GAMING OC 8GB GDDR7 graphics card at the best price in Bangladesh. Enjoy cutting-edge Blackwell architecture and custom TWIN FROZR 10 cooling at International Office Solution.', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 8G GAMING OC, RTX 5060 Gaming OC price in Bangladesh, 8GB GDDR7 gaming GPU BD, Blackwell desktop graphics card, International Office Solution.', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL);
