(1216, 'MSI GeForce RTX 4060 Ti GAMING X 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 4060 Ti GAMING X 8GB features NVIDIA’s highly efficient Ada Lovelace architecture, packing 4,352 capable CUDA cores and 8GB of premium GDDR6 memory on a 128-bit bus. Outfitted with the elite TWIN FROZR 9 dual-fan thermal setup utilizing ring-bound TORX Fan 5.0 blades, customized Mystic Light RGB illumination, and a factory-overclocked boost clock touching an extreme 2655 MHz, it delivers exceptional high-framerate 1080p and 1440p gaming performance alongside premium structural stability.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-4060-ti-gaming-x-8gb-gddr6-graphics-card-1783858705', '<p>Inject iconic styling and next-generation architectural efficiency into your gaming computer with the MSI GeForce RTX 4060 Ti GAMING X 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card. Masterfully engineered on NVIDIA\'s advanced Ada Lovelace architecture, this performance-segment GPU brings 4,352 capable CUDA cores to work in unison with an agile 8GB buffer of high-speed GDDR6 video memory. Operating at a fast 18 Gbps memory speed across a 128-bit bus interface, it provides massive data bandwidth for fluid real-time ray tracing, competitive high-framerate multiplayer gaming, and efficient local AI or content creation acceleration.</p><p>Built as a definitive staple of the legendary MSI GAMING series, this variant comes factory-optimized right out of the box to reach an Extreme Performance boost clock of 2655 MHz via the MSI Center management application. Thermodynamic efficiency is perfectly managed by the advanced TWIN FROZR 9 cooling system. This system utilizes advanced TORX Fan 5.0 ring blades featuring linked outer structures designed for optimal focused airflow with minimal operational noise. The cooling block incorporates a solid nickel-plated copper baseplate and square core heat pipes that maximize structural contact over the GPU die. Reinforced with a rigid metal backplate containing airflow vents and synchronized with signature Mystic Light RGB accents, it delivers superior structural longevity and premium system stability.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the MSI GeForce RTX 4060 Ti GAMING X 8GB Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>57,500৳</strong>. You can order this high-performance gaming GPU online through the official International Office Solution website, or get dedicated technical advice by dropping by any of our local physical showrooms.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Ada Lovelace</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>4,352 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2640 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2655 MHz (via MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>18 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express Gen 4.0 x16 (runs at x8 mode)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 1.4a, 1 x HDMI 2.1a (Supports 4K@120Hz &amp; 8K@60Hz HDR)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Quad Display (Up to 4 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>160W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td