(1217, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G VENTUS 3X OC 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G VENTUS 3X OC unleashes the power of NVIDIA\'s high-efficiency Blackwell architecture, packing 4,608 processing CUDA cores and 8GB of next-generation GDDR7 memory. Featuring a factory overclock that reaches 2617 MHz via MSI Center and a heavy-duty triple-fan layout optimized with TORX Fan 5.0 technology, it delivers dominant 1440p gaming framing rates and accelerated local AI workload processing.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5060-ti-8g-ventus-3x-oc-8gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783858769', '<p>Take your custom gaming desktop or heavy AI creation setup to next-generation heights with the premium mainstream engineering of the MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G VENTUS 3X OC 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card. Masterfully forged on NVIDIA\'s advanced Blackwell architecture, this high-performance graphics card coordinates 4,608 streaming CUDA cores with an agile 8GB buffer of next-generation GDDR7 video memory. Operating at a blistering speed of 28 Gbps across a 128-bit bus interface, it unlocks massive data bandwidth to drive real-time path-traced ray tracing, fluid high-refresh esports frames, and fast rendering workflows across heavy AI application pipelines.</p><p>Dressed in a clean, minimalist black and grey industrial enclosure, this VENTUS 3X OC variant comes factory-optimized right out of the box to reach an Extreme Performance boost clock of 2617 MHz using the MSI Center management utility. Thermodynamic efficiency is perfectly managed by the advanced triple-fan cooling system. This setup incorporates three TORX Fan 5.0 units featuring linked outer ring structures designed for optimal focused airflow with minimal operational noise. The cooling block integrates a solid copper baseplate and direct-contact precision core heat pipes that maximize structural contact over the GPU die. Reinforced with a rigid metal backplate containing flow-through ventilation vents and supported by next-gen DisplayPort 2.1b connectivity, it delivers superior structural longevity and premium system stability.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G VENTUS 3X OC Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>63,900৳</strong>. You can purchase this premium triple-fan Blackwell GPU online via the official International Office Solution website, or get configuration assistance by visiting any of our physical corporate showrooms.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>4,608 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2602 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2617 MHz (via MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>28 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5 x16 (runs at x8 mode)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 2.1b, 1 x HDMI 2.1b (Supports 4K@480Hz / 8K@120Hz HDR)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Quad Display (Up to 4 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>180W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></t