(1218, 'MSI GeForce RTX 4060 Ti VENTUS 2X BLACK 16GB OC GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 4060 Ti VENTUS 2X BLACK 16GB OC supercharges NVIDIA\'s highly efficient Ada Lovelace architecture with a massive 16GB of premium GDDR6 memory on a 128-bit bus. Outfitted with 4,352 CUDA cores, a factory-overclocked boost clock reaching up to 2625 MHz, and an optimized dual-fan array utilizing TORX Fan 4.0 technology, it delivers exceptional 1440p gaming framing rates and eliminates memory bottlenecks for heavy video rendering and local AI modeling.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-4060-ti-ventus-2x-black-16gb-oc-gddr6-graphics-card-1783858853', '<p>Inject sleek, stealthy aesthetics and massive processing headroom into your desktop configuration with the MSI GeForce RTX 4060 Ti VENTUS 2X BLACK 16GB OC GDDR6 Graphics Card. Built on NVIDIA\'s foundational Ada Lovelace architecture, this power-optimized GPU coordinates 4,352 streaming CUDA cores with an expanded 16GB buffer of high-speed GDDR6 video memory. Operating at a fast 18 Gbps memory speed, this doubled VRAM capacity provides the immense rendering bandwidth required for loading ultra-high-resolution gaming textures, handling complex 3D rendering timelines, and supporting dense local AI workflows without stuttering.</p><p>Dressed in a clean, minimalist all-black enclosure with a matching structural reinforcing backplate, this 16GB VENTUS 2X BLACK variant comes factory-optimized to touch an Extreme Performance clock speed of 2625 MHz using the MSI Center management application. Cooling efficiency is handled by an advanced dual-fan configuration featuring paired TORX Fan 4.0 blades, bound with an outer ring link to drive focused static air pressure deep through the custom heatsink block. Complete with zero-RPM Zero Frozr technology for silent desktop idling, three DisplayPort 1.4a outputs, one HDMI 2.1a port, and revolutionary DLSS 3 neural frame generation, it stands as the ultimate compact, future-proof choice for hybrid gaming and creator setups.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the MSI GeForce RTX 4060 Ti VENTUS 2X BLACK 16GB OC Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>65,500৳</strong>. You can purchase this dependable, high-VRAM all-black GPU online through the official International Office Solution website, or get configuration assistance by visiting any of our physical corporate showrooms.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Ada Lovelace</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>4,352 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2610 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2625 MHz (via MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>18 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express Gen 4.0 x16 (runs at x8 mode)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 1.4a, 1 x HDMI 2.1a (Supports 4K@120Hz &amp; 8K@60Hz HDR)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Quad Display (Up to 4 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>165W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>1 x 8-pin PCIe</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>550W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>Software</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooler Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Dual-Fan Setup with TORX Fan 4.0 technology</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Management</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Zero Frozr technology (Fans stop completely under low loads)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Body Theme &amp; Shroud</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Premium Matte-Black Shroud with Reinforcing Backplate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>199 x 120 x 42 mm (Compact Dual-Slot Footprint)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Weight</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Net Card Weight: 595 g / Gross Package Weight: 832 g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>After-sales</td><td>3 Years Manufacturing Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/oRXFZpD46M5dYF00ktsGBPozD7CtQyoKGPvLznxv.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 12:20:53', '2026-07-12 12:20:53', 'MSI GeForce RTX 4060 Ti VENTUS 2X BLACK 16GB OC Price in BD | International Office Solution', 'MSI GeForce RTX 4060 Ti VENTUS 2X BLACK 16GB OC Price in BD | International Office Solution', 'MSI GeForce RTX 4060 Ti VENTUS 2X BLACK 16GB OC, RTX 4060 Ti 16GB Ventus Black price in Bangladesh, 16GB GDDR6 GPU BD, Ada Lovelace desktop graphics card, International Office Solution.', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(1219, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G VENTUS 2X PLUS 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G VENTUS 2X PLUS packs NVIDIA’s high-efficiency Blackwell architecture into a compact dual-fan design, delivering a massive 16GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory. Featuring a factory-overclocked boost clock touching an extreme 2617 MHz via MSI Center and dual high-pressure STORMFORCE fans, it offers dominant 1440p gaming framing rates and eliminates memory limits for heavy 4K editing and local AI workflow generation.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5060-ti-16g-ventus-2x-plus-16gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783858916', '<p>Empower your space-conscious gaming rig or high-tier creative workstation with the premium next-generation engineering of the MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G VENTUS 2X PLUS 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card. Forged on NVIDIA\'s revolutionary Blackwell architecture, this high-performance graphics card coordinates 4,608 streaming CUDA cores with a massive 16GB buffer of next-generation GDDR7 video memory. Operating at an effective memory clock speed of 28 Gbps across a 128-bit bus interface, it unlocks immense processing bandwidth to easily manage real-time path-traced ray tracing, heavy texture packs in competitive titles, and fast rendering speeds across deep local AI pipelines.</p><p>Stepping into the spotlight as part of the performance-focused VENTUS series, this PLUS edition layout is factory-optimized right out of the box to reach an Extreme Performance boost clock of 2617 MHz using the MSI Center console. Thermal dissipation is handled by an advanced dual-fan cooling layout that incorporates claw-textured STORMFORCE fans and precision-crafted direct-contact core heat pipes. Reinforced structurally with a heavy-duty metal backplate containing dedicated thermal pads and flow-through ventilation slots, this card runs cool and stable under heavy computational loads. Complete with zero-RPM Zero Frozr technology for silent desktop operations, enhanced custom PCB safety fuses, and next-gen DisplayPort 2.1b connectivity, it ensures elite structural longevity for high-end setups.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G VENTUS 2X PLUS Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>75,000৳</strong>. You can purchase this premium, high-VRAM Blackwell GPU online via the official International Office Solution website, or get configuration assistance by visiting any of our physical corporate showrooms.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>4,608 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2602 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2617 MHz (via MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>28 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5 x16 (runs at x8 mode)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 2.1b, 1 x HDMI 2.1b (Supports 4K@480Hz / 8K@120Hz HDR)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Quad Display (Up to 4 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>180W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>1 x 8-pin PCIe</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>600W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>Software</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooler Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Dual-Fan Setup with STORMFORCE Fans (Claw-textured blades)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Protection</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Premium Vented Metal Backplate with Dedicated Thermal Pads</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Optimization</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Zero Frozr technology (Fans completely stop under low loads)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>227 x 127 x 41 mm (Compact Dual-Slot Footprint)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Weight</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Net Card Weight: 600 g / Gross Package Weight: 945 g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>After-sales</td><td>3 Years Manufacturing Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/WHYhX9NMzStOPSbKj6QZ5lgz7RlrlH1WWAa6b9SI.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 12:21:56', '2026-07-12 12:21:56', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G VENTUS 2X PLUS Price in BD | International Office Solution', 'Get the official MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G VENTUS 2X PLUS 16GB GDDR7 graphics card at the best price in Bangladesh. Enjoy next-gen Blackwell power and 16GB buffer headroom at International Office Solution.', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G VENTUS 2X PLUS, RTX 5060 Ti 16GB price in Bangladesh, 16GB GDDR7 gaming GPU BD, Blackwell desktop graphics card, International Office Solution.', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(1220, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G GAMING OC 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G GAMING OC unleashes NVIDIA\'s cutting-edge Blackwell architecture, integrating 4,608 processing CUDA cores with 8GB of ultra-fast next-generation GDDR7 memory. Outfitted with an aggressive factory overclock pushing up to 2662 MHz via MSI Center and the signature TWIN FROZR 10 thermal design utilizing high-pressure STORMFORCE fans, it delivers ultimate 1080p and 1440p gaming frame rates alongside elite local AI acceleration.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5060-ti-8g-gaming-oc-8gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783859014', '<p>Bring iconic styling, next-generation structural longevity, and bleeding-edge computing speed to your desktop setup with the premium engineering of the MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G GAMING OC 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card. Meticulously built on NVIDIA\'s advanced Blackwell architecture, this high-performance graphics card coordinates 4,608 streaming CUDA cores with an agile 8GB buffer of next-generation GDDR7 video memory. Operating at a blistering memory speed of 28 Gbps across a 128-bit bus interface, it supplies massive data bandwidth to drive real-time path-traced ray tracing, fluid high-refresh esports frames, and fast rendering speeds across deep local AI pipelines.</p><p>Standing as a definitive staple of the legendary MSI GAMING series, this variant comes factory-optimized right out of the box to reach an Extreme Performance boost clock of 2662 MHz via the MSI Center management application. Thermodynamic efficiency is perfectly managed by the advanced TWIN FROZR 10 cooling system. This system incorporates dual STORMFORCE fans, utilizing seven claw-textured blades and a circular arc layout engineered to maximize concentrated static air pressure through the heatsink assembly while keeping noise levels exceptionally low. Further enhanced with a solid nickel-plated copper baseplate, square core heat pipes that maximize physical contact over the GPU die, zero-RPM Zero Frozr technology for silent desktop idling, a rigid metal backplate with dedicated thermal ventilation openings, and future-proof DisplayPort 2.1b connectivity, it ensures elite structural stability for high-end gaming computers.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>4,608 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2647 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2662 MHz (via MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>28 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5 x16 (runs at x8 mode)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 2.1b, 1 x HDMI 2.1b (Supports 4K@480Hz / 8K@120Hz HDR)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Quad Display (Up to 4 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>180W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>1 x 16-pin (ATX 3.1 PSU recommended)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>600W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>Software</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooler Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>TWIN FROZR 10 Setup: Dual STORMFORCE Fans &amp; Square Core Pipes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Enhancements</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Nickel-plated Copper Baseplate &amp; Wave Curved 3.0 fin design</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic &amp; Lighting</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Zero Frozr technology (Fans stop during low load) &amp; Mystic Light RGB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>247 x 135 x 51 mm (Compact Dual-Fan Profile)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Weight</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Net Card Weight: 768 g / Gross Package Weight: 1219 g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>After-sales</td><td>3 Years Manufacturing Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/tg4e5KAATaXKxPepwXAk7ApmLMRzdz6iXvoVP8pv.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 12:23:34', '2026-07-12 12:23:34', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G GAMING OC Price in BD | International Office Solution', 'Get the official MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G GAMING OC 8GB GDDR7 graphics card at the best price in Bangladesh. Experience elite Blackwell architecture and advanced TWIN FROZR 10 cooling at International Office Solution.', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8G GAMING OC, RTX 5060 Ti Gaming OC price in Bangladesh, 8GB GDDR7 gaming GPU BD, Blackwell desktop graphics card, International Office Solution.', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(1221, 'MSI GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER 12G VENTUS 2X OC GDDR6X Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER 12G VENTUS 2X OC unleashes high-tier performance powered by NVIDIA\'s advanced Ada Lovelace architecture, packing 7,168 processing CUDA cores and 12GB of ultra-fast GDDR6X memory. Outfitted with a factory-overclocked boost clock reaching up to 2520 MHz, dual high-pressure TORX Fan 4.0 cooling units, and a space-saving dual-slot footprint, it delivers dominant 1440p and entry-level 4K gaming frame rates alongside revolutionary DLSS 3 neural frame generation.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-4070-super-12g-ventus-2x-oc-gddr6x-graphics-card-1783859081', '<p>The MSI GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER 12G VENTUS 2X OC unleashes high-tier performance powered by NVIDIA\'s advanced Ada Lovelace architecture, packing 7,168 processing CUDA cores and 12GB of ultra-fast GDDR6X memory. Outfitted with a factory-overclocked boost clock reaching up to 2520 MHz, dual high-pressure TORX Fan 4.0 cooling units, and a space-saving dual-slot footprint, it delivers dominant 1440p and entry-level 4K gaming frame rates alongside revolutionary DLSS 3 neural frame generation.&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Ada Lovelace</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>7,168 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2505 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2520 MHz (via MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>12GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR6X</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>21 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>192-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express Gen 4.0 x16</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 1.4a, 1 x HDMI 2.1a (Supports 4K@120Hz &amp; 8K@60Hz HDR)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Quad Display (Up to 4 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>220W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>1 x 16-pin (12VHPWR)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>650W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>Software</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooler Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Dual-Fan Design with TORX Fan 4.0 technology</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Enhancements</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Precision Core Heatpipes &amp; Zero Frozr acoustic control</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Reinforcement</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Solid Reinforcing Backplate with Compact Dual-Slot Profile</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>242 x 125 x 43 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Weight</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Net Card Weight: 680 g / Gross Package Weight: 998 g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>After-sales</td><td>3 Years Manufacturing Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/djRHAxHDpDhqCrPkRbhTaDRfF2Iq24wH7T5E1mAa.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 12:24:41', '2026-07-12 12:24:41', 'MSI GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER 12G VENTUS 2X OC Price in BD | International Office Solution', 'Get the original MSI GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER 12G VENTUS 2X OC GDDR6X graphics card at the best price in Bangladesh. Enjoy powerful Ada Lovelace performance and TORX Fan 4.0 cooling at International Office Solution.', 'MSI GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER 12G VENTUS 2X OC, RTX 4070 Super Ventus price in Bangladesh, 12GB GDDR6X gaming GPU BD, Ada Lovelace desktop graphics card, International Office Solution.', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(1222, 'MSI GeForce RTX 4070 VENTUS 2X E 12G OC GDDR6X Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 4070 VENTUS 2X E 12G OC features NVIDIA\'s highly efficient Ada Lovelace architecture, packing 5,888 processing CUDA cores and 12GB of ultra-fast GDDR6X memory on a 192-bit bus. Outfitted with an optimized dual-fan array utilizing TORX Fan 4.0 technology, a reinforced structural backplate, and a factory-overclocked boost clock touching 2520 MHz, it delivers exceptional 1440p and entry-level 4K gaming frame rates along with advanced DLSS 3 frame generation.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-4070-ventus-2x-e-12g-oc-gddr6x-graphics-card-1783859152', '<p>Bring crisp high-end performance and exceptional power efficiency to your desktop setup with the MSI GeForce RTX 4070 VENTUS 2X E 12G OC 12GB GDDR6X Graphics Card. Developed on NVIDIA\'s cutting-edge Ada Lovelace architecture, this mid-to-high tier graphics card coordinates 5,888 streaming CUDA cores with an agile 12GB buffer of high-speed GDDR6X video memory. Operating at a blistering memory speed of 21 Gbps over a 192-bit bus interface, it supplies massive data bandwidth to seamlessly handle immersive ray-traced visuals, high-refresh competitive gameplay, and heavy local AI rendering workloads.</p><p>Dressed in a clean, minimalist black and grey industrial shroud with a matching structural reinforcing backplate, this specialized \"E\" revision variant comes factory-optimized to touch an Extreme Performance boost clock of 2520 MHz via the MSI Center console. The integrated cooling solution utilizes two high-pressure TORX Fan 4.0 units, featuring paired fan blades bound with an outer ring link to focus static airflow directly down onto flat-profile core pipes and a solid copper baseplate. Complete with an efficient single 8-pin power connector layout, zero-RPM Zero Frozr technology for silent desktop idling, additional built-in PCB safety fuses, and next-generation DLSS 3 neural frame generation, it offers premium stability inside a compact dual-slot footprint.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the MSI GeForce RTX 4070 VENTUS 2X E 12G OC Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>79,500৳</strong>. You can secure this dependable, high-performance Ada Lovelace GPU online through the official International Office Solution website, or get dedicated configuration assistance by visiting any of our local physical corporate showrooms.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Ada Lovelace</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>5,888 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2505 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2520 MHz (via MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>12GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR6X</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>21 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>192-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express Gen 4.0 x16</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 1.4a, 1 x HDMI 2.1a (Supports 4K@120Hz &amp; 8K@60Hz HDR)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Quad Display (Up to 4 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>200W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>1 x 8-pin PCIe</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>650W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>Software</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooler Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Dual-Fan Setup with TORX Fan 4.0 technology</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Enhancements</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Solid Copper Baseplate, Precision Core Heatpipes &amp; DrMOS Power Stages</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Optimization</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Zero Frozr technology (Fans completely stop under low loads)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>242 x 125 x 43 mm (Compact Dual-Slot Footprint)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Weight</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Net Card Weight: 663 g / Gross Package Weight: 943 g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>After-sales</td><td>3 Years Manufacturing Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/Y5tnTNXQsahSYHEH8YJFLDtZKRiYtE380NLXVus0.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 12:25:52', '2026-07-12 12:25:52', 'MSI GeForce RTX 4070 VENTUS 2X E 12G OC Price in BD | International Office Solution', 'Get the original MSI GeForce RTX 4070 VENTUS 2X E 12G OC 12GB GDDR6X graphics card at the best price in Bangladesh. Enjoy powerful Ada Lovelace engineering and TORX Fan 4.0 cooling at International Office Solution.', 'MSI GeForce RTX 4070 VENTUS 2X E 12G OC, RTX 4070 Ventus 2X E price in Bangladesh, 12GB GDDR6X gaming GPU BD, Ada Lovelace graphics card, International Office Solution.', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL);
