(1223, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G VANGUARD SOC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G VANGUARD SOC commands elite-tier status, integrating NVIDIA’s next-generation Blackwell architecture with a massive 16GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory. Featuring a premium, heavy-duty factory overclock hitting a blistering 2707 MHz via MSI Center and the state-of-the-art HYPER FROZR triple-fan cooling array with an advanced vapor chamber, it eliminates all memory bottlenecks for flawless high-framerate 1440p/4K gaming, pro-tier streaming, and heavy local AI model generation.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5060-ti-16g-vanguard-soc-16gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783859213', '<p>flagship engineering of the MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G VANGUARD SOC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card. Forged on NVIDIA\'s cutting-edge Blackwell architecture, this elite-level graphic accelerator coordinates 4,608 powerhouse streaming CUDA cores with a massive 16GB buffer of next-generation GDDR7 video memory. Operating at a blistering memory speed of 28 Gbps across a 128-bit bus interface, it unlocks immense high-speed data bandwidth to seamlessly handle real-time path-traced ray tracing, fluid ultra-refresh competitive frames, complex 3D rendering timelines, and deep local AI learning pipelines without a hint of micro-stuttering.</p><p>Standing out as a supreme centerpiece option, the VANGUARD SOC series represents rugged structural longevity and aggressive overclocking stability, coming factory-tuned right out of the box to reach an Extreme Performance boost clock of 2707 MHz via the MSI Center console. The underlying thermodynamics are meticulously sustained by the advanced HYPER FROZR thermal design. This triple-slot system integrates high-static-pressure STORMFORCE fans, an advanced liquid-filled vapor chamber, and direct-contact precision core pipes mapped onto Wave Curved 4.0 fins and an Air Antegrade Fin 2.0 layout. Reinforced structurally with a heavy-duty protective metal backplate, a Dual BIOS configuration for easy performance swapping, and future-proof DisplayPort 2.1b connectivity, it delivers massive structural reliability for premium system builds.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G VANGUARD SOC Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>86,500৳</strong>. You can purchase this premium, high-VRAM triple-fan Blackwell GPU online via the official International Office Solution website, or get configuration assistance by visiting any of our local physical corporate showrooms.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>4,608 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2692 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2707 MHz (via MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>28 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5.0 x16 (runs at x8 mode)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 2.1b, 1 x HDMI 2.1b (Supports 4K@480Hz / 8K@120Hz with DSC)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Quad Display (Up to 4 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>180W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>1 x 16-pin (ATX 3.1 PSU recommended) or adapter</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>600W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>Software</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooler Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>HYPER FROZR Layout: 3 x STORMFORCE Fans &amp; Advanced Vapor Chamber</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Optimizations</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Wave Curved 4.0, Filled Fins &amp; Air Antegrade Fin 2.0 system updates</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic &amp; System control</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Zero Frozr technology (Fans stop during low load) &amp; Dual BIOS profile switch</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>337 x 140 x 61 mm (Premium Triple-Slot Form Factor)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Weight</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Net Card Weight: 1278 g / Gross Package Weight: 2050 g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>After-sales</td><td>3 Years Manufacturing Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/7LD9Z68HUsKQkPYE5YPm1s6Rn6NO90H1hZwyOLwL.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 12:26:53', '2026-07-12 12:26:53', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G VANGUARD SOC Price in BD | International Office Solution', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G VANGUARD SOC Price in BD | International Office Solution', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G VANGUARD SOC, RTX 5060 Ti Vanguard price in Bangladesh, 16GB GDDR7 gaming GPU BD, Blackwell flagship desktop graphics card, International Office Solution.', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(1224, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5070 12G VANGUARD SOC GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5070 12G VANGUARD SOC stands as an elite-tier powerhouse, uniting NVIDIA\'s next-generation Blackwell architecture with 12GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory. Outfitted with 6,144 processing CUDA cores, a premium factory overclock reaching a blistering 2655 MHz via MSI Center, and the state-of-the-art HYPER FROZR triple-fan cooling array with an advanced vapor chamber, it delivers flawless high-framerate 4K gaming, pro-tier streaming, and massive local AI acceleration.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5070-12g-vanguard-soc-gddr7-graphics-card-1783859387', '<p>Unleash bleeding-edge computing speed and high-fidelity graphics processing with the flagship engineering of the MSI GeForce RTX 5070 12G VANGUARD SOC 12GB GDDR7 Graphics Card. Forged on NVIDIA\'s cutting-edge Blackwell architecture, this premium graphic accelerator coordinates 6,144 powerhouse streaming CUDA cores with a fast 12GB buffer of next-generation GDDR7 video memory. Operating at a blistering memory speed of 28 Gbps across a wider 192-bit bus interface, it unlocks massive high-speed data bandwidth (up to 672 GB/s) to seamlessly handle real-time path-traced ray tracing, fluid ultra-refresh competitive frames, complex 3D rendering timelines, and deep local AI learning pipelines without micro-stuttering.</p><p>Standing out as a supreme centerpiece option, the VANGUARD SOC series represents rugged structural longevity and aggressive overclocking stability, coming factory-tuned right out of the box to reach an Extreme Performance boost clock of 2655 MHz via the MSI Center console. The underlying thermodynamics are meticulously sustained by the advanced HYPER FROZR thermal design. This triple-slot system integrates claw-textured STORMFORCE fans, an advanced liquid-filled vapor chamber, and direct-contact precision square core pipes mapped onto Wave Curved 4.0 fins and an Air Antegrade Fin 2.0 layout. Reinforced structurally with a futuristic metal backplate, high-efficiency DrMOS power stages, and future-proof DisplayPort 2.1b connectivity, it ensures massive structural reliability and next-gen DLSS 4.5 capabilities for premium system builds.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the MSI GeForce RTX 5070 12G VANGUARD SOC Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>115,000৳</strong>. You can purchase this premium triple-fan Blackwell GPU online via the official International Office Solution website, or get configuration assistance by visiting any of our local physical corporate showrooms.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>6,144 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2640 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2655 MHz (via MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>12GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>28 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>192-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5.0 x16</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 2.1b, 1 x HDMI 2.1b (Supports 4K@480Hz / 8K@120Hz with DSC)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Quad Display (Up to 4 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consum