(1225, 'MSI GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER 12G VENTUS 3X OC GDDR6X Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER 12G VENTUS 3X OC unleashes elite performance powered by NVIDIA\'s advanced Ada Lovelace architecture, packing 7,168 processing CUDA cores and 12GB of ultra-fast GDDR6X memory. Outfitted with a heavy-duty triple-fan layout utilizing TORX Fan 4.0 technology, a factory-overclocked boost clock hitting 2520 MHz, and a sleek industrial design, it delivers dominant 1440p and smooth entry-level 4K gaming frame rates along with revolutionary DLSS 3 neural frame generation.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-4070-super-12g-ventus-3x-oc-gddr6x-graphics-card-1783859463', '<p>The MSI GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER 12G VENTUS 3X OC unleashes elite performance powered by NVIDIA\'s advanced Ada Lovelace architecture, packing 7,168 processing CUDA cores and 12GB of ultra-fast GDDR6X memory. Outfitted with a heavy-duty triple-fan layout utilizing TORX Fan 4.0 technology, a factory-overclocked boost clock hitting 2520 MHz, and a sleek industrial design, it delivers dominant 1440p and smooth entry-level 4K gaming frame rates along with revolutionary DLSS 3 neural frame generation. Supercharge your custom gaming rig and modern content creation workstations with the premium mainstream engineering of the MSI GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER 12G VENTUS 3X OC GDDR6X Graphics Card. Masterfully built on NVIDIA\'s foundational Ada Lovelace architecture, this high-end graphics accelerator coordinates 7,168 streaming CUDA cores with an agile 12GB buffer of premium GDDR6X video memory. Operating at a blistering memory speed of 21 Gbps across a 192-bit bus interface, it supplies massive data bandwidth to handle immersive path-traced ray tracing, competitive high-refresh esports gameplay, and complex AI rendering operations with absolute ease.</p><p>Dressed in a clean, minimalist black and silver industrial enclosure with a matching structural reinforcing backplate, this VENTUS 3X OC variant comes factory-optimized right out of the box to reach an Extreme Performance boost clock of 2520 MHz using the MSI Center console. Thermodynamic efficiency is perfectly managed by the advanced triple-fan cooling system. This setup incorporates three TORX Fan 4.0 units featuring paired blades bound with an outer ring link designed for optimal focused airflow with minimal operational noise. Further enhanced with precision-crafted direct-contact core heat pipes, zero-RPM Zero Frozr technology for dead-silent desktop idling, and a sturdy flow-through anti-bending backplate configuration, it delivers elite structural longevity and premium system stability for standard mid-tower and full-tower configurations.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the MSI GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER 12G VENTUS 3X OC Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>85,500৳</strong>. You can order this high-performance Ada Lovelace GPU online through the official International Office Solution website, or get dedicated technical advice by dropping by any of our local physical showrooms.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Ada Lovelace</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>7,168 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2505 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2520 MHz (via MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>12GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR6X</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>21 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>192-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express Ge