(1226, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5070 12G VENTUS 2X OC 12GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5070 12G VENTUS 2X OC brings NVIDIA’s next-generation Blackwell architecture into a highly compatible dual-fan design, packing 6,144 streaming CUDA cores and 12GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory. Featuring a robust factory overclock reaching an extreme 2557 MHz via MSI Center, premium PCIe 5.0 capabilities, and future-proof DisplayPort 2.1b connections, it delivers flawless high-framerate 4K gaming, local AI model running, and complex content creation acceleration.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5070-12g-ventus-2x-oc-12gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783859543', '<p>Bring immense visual computing speed and next-generation architectural power to your desktop ecosystem with the premium engineering of the MSI GeForce RTX 5070 12G VENTUS 2X OC 12GB GDDR7 Graphics Card. Purpose-built on NVIDIA\'s revolutionary Blackwell architecture, this elite mainstream graphic accelerator coordinates 6,144 powerhouse streaming CUDA cores with a fast 12GB buffer of next-generation GDDR7 video memory. Operating at a blistering memory speed of 28 Gbps across a 192-bit bus interface, it unleashes massive data transfer bandwidth up to 672 GB/s to seamlessly support real-time path-traced ray tracing, fluid ultra-refresh competitive frames, complex 3D rendering timelines, and deep local AI learning workloads without micro-stuttering.</p><p>Designed with a clean, minimalist black and silver industrial enclosure, this specialized VENTUS 2X OC variant comes factory-optimized right out of the box to reach an Extreme Performance boost clock of 2557 MHz via the MSI Center console. The integrated thermal solution utilizes advanced, ring-linked TORX Fan 5.0 blade configurations to focus high-pressure static airflow directly down onto flat-profile core pipes and a solid nickel-plated copper baseplate. Complete with zero-RPM Zero Frozr technology for silent desktop idling, a structurally rigid reinforcing metal backplate with flow-through exhaust vents, efficient DrMOS power stages, and next-generation DLSS 4.5 capabilities, it serves as the ultimate future-proof centerpiece inside a compact SFF-ready dual-slot footprint.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the MSI GeForce RTX 5070 12G VENTUS 2X OC Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>89,900৳</strong>. You can secure this next-generation Blackwell GPU online through the official International Office Solution website, or get dedicated technical assistance by visiting any of our local physical corporate showrooms.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>6,144 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2542 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2557 MHz (via MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>12GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>28 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>192-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5.0 x16</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 2.1b, 1 x HDMI 2.1b (Supports 4K@480Hz / 8K@120Hz with DSC)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Quad Display (Up to 4 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)