(1227, 'MSI GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER 12G GAMING X SLIM WHITE GDDR6X Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER 12G GAMING X SLIM WHITE delivers elite-tier performance packed into a space-saving, all-white form factor. Built on NVIDIA\'s advanced Ada Lovelace architecture, it coordinates 7,168 streaming CUDA cores and 12GB of high-speed GDDR6X memory. Outfitted with a premium factory overclock reaching 2655 MHz via MSI Center and the advanced TRI FROZR 3 cooling system with ring-bound TORX Fan 5.0 units, it ensures dominant 1440p and 4K gaming frames with a compact, case-friendly footprint.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-4070-super-12g-gaming-x-slim-white-gddr6x-graphics-card-1783859620', '<p>Inject sleek, pristine styling and next-generation architectural efficiency into your custom desktop configuration with the MSI GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER 12G GAMING X SLIM WHITE GDDR6X Graphics Card. Masterfully engineered on NVIDIA\'s foundational Ada Lovelace architecture, this high-performance graphics card coordinates 7,168 powerhouse streaming CUDA cores with an agile 12GB buffer of premium GDDR6X video memory. Operating at a blistering memory clock speed of 21 Gbps across a 192-bit bus interface, it supplies massive data bandwidth to seamlessly handle fluid real-time ray tracing, competitive high-refresh esports gameplay, and local AI or content creation pipelines.</p><p>Dressed completely in a striking, compact all-white cover shroud with a matching flow-through white structural backplate, this specialized GAMING X SLIM variant is engineered for hassle-free compatibility in space-constrained mid-tower builds. Thermal management is masterfully sustained by the premium TRI FROZR 3 design, integrating three advanced TORX Fan 5.0 units with linked outer ring blades to maximize concentrated static air pressure. Backed by a solid nickel-plated copper baseplate, precision squared core heat pipes, zero-RPM Zero Frozr technology for absolute silence during idling, and customizable Mystic Light RGB accents, it brings supreme operational longevity and next-gen AI DLSS 3 frame acceleration to your white-out custom PC setup.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the MSI GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER 12G GAMING X SLIM WHITE Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>96,500৳</strong>. You can purchase this premium, high-end white Ada Lovelace GPU online through the official International Office Solution website, or get dedicated configuration assembly advice by visiting any of our local physical corporate showrooms.</p><h3>Technical Specifications</h3>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Ada Lovelace</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>7,168 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2640 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2655 MHz (via MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>12GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR6X</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>21 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>192-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express Gen 4.0 x16</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 1.4a, 1 x HDMI 2.1a (Supports 4K@120Hz &amp; 8K@60Hz HDR)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Quad Display (Up to 4 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>245W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>1 x 16-pin (12VHPWR)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>650W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>Software</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooler Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>TRI FROZR 3 Layout: 3 x TORX Fan 5.0 Thermal Assembly</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Protection</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Nickel-plated Copper Baseplate &amp; Precision Squared Core Pipes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic &amp; Lighting</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Zero Frozr technology (Fans stop completely under low loads) &amp; Mystic Light RGB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Body Theme &amp; Profile</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Premium All-White Shroud Slim Profile with Ventilated White Backplate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>307 x 125 x 46 mm (Compact Triple-Fan Footprint)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Weight</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Net Card Weight: 972 g / Gross Package Weight: 1585 g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>After-sales</td><td>3 Years Manufacturing Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/WocFIbOUurtgQMJfRqWCAqOvadx4N3pJRxVxPRoV.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 12:33:40', '2026-07-12 12:33:40', 'MSI GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER 12G GAMING X SLIM WHITE Price in BD | International Office Solution', 'Get the official MSI GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER 12G GAMING X SLIM WHITE GDDR6X graphics card at the best price in Bangladesh. Enjoy ultimate Ada Lovelace architecture and premium white styling at International Office Solution.', 'MSI GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER 12G GAMING X SLIM WHITE, RTX 4070 Super Gaming X Slim White price in Bangladesh, 12GB GDDR6X white GPU BD, Ada Lovelace desk