(1229, 'MSI GeForce RTX 4070 VENTUS 3X E1 12G OC GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 4070 VENTUS 3X E1 12G OC balances exceptional value with high-tier rendering performance, built directly on NVIDIA\'s efficient Ada Lovelace architecture. Outfitted with 5,888 streaming CUDA cores and a 12GB GDDR6 memory configuration over a 192-bit bus, this factory-overclocked card uses a heavy-duty triple TORX Fan 4.0 cooling setup to deliver elite high-refresh 1440p gaming framing rates and advanced local AI processing.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-4070-ventus-3x-e1-12g-oc-gddr6-graphics-card-1783859777', '<p>The MSI GeForce RTX 4070 VENTUS 3X E1 12G OC balances exceptional value with high-tier rendering performance, built directly on NVIDIA\'s efficient Ada Lovelace architecture. Outfitted with 5,888 streaming CUDA cores and a 12GB GDDR6 memory configuration over a 192-bit bus, this factory-overclocked card uses a heavy-duty triple TORX Fan 4.0 cooling setup to deliver elite high-refresh 1440p gaming framing rates and advanced local AI processing. Dressed in a clean, minimalist black and silver industrial cover shroud with a reinforced structural backplate, this updated \"E1\" revision variant comes factory-optimized right out of the box to touch an Extreme Performance boost clock of 2520 MHz via the MSI Center console. The integrated thermal solution utilizes an advanced triple-fan layout featuring ring-bound TORX Fan 4.0 blades that focus concentrated static air pressure directly into a massive heatsink assembly. Backed by precision-crafted direct-contact core heat pipes, a solid nickel-plated copper baseplate, and zero-RPM Zero Frozr technology for dead-silent desktop idling, it delivers superior structural longevity and premium system stability while drawing power from a standard, highly compatible 8-pin PCIe connection.&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></