p under low loads)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>308 x 120 x 43 mm (Triple-Fan Footprint)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Weight</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Net Card Weight: 822 g / Gross Package Weight: 1123 g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>After-sales</td><td>3 Years Manufacturing Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/icfWVky0mfq0q3Phu2qel7UMzieUcjGJIRYLJ6fS.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 12:36:17', '2026-07-12 12:40:15', 'MSI GeForce RTX 4070 VENTUS 3X E1 12G OC Price in BD | International Office Solution', 'MSI GeForce RTX 4070 VENTUS 3X E1 12G OC Price in BD | International Office Solution', 'MSI GeForce RTX 4070 VENTUS 3X E1 12G OC, RTX 4070 Ventus 3X E1 price in Bangladesh, 12GB GDDR6 gaming GPU BD, Ada Lovelace desktop graphics card, International Office Solution.', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(1230, 'MSI GeForce RTX 4070 Ti VENTUS 3X E1 12G OC GDDR6X Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 4070 Ti VENTUS 3X E1 12G OC delivers elite tier performance powered by NVIDIA\'s high-efficiency Ada Lovelace architecture, packing 7,680 processing CUDA cores and 12GB of premium GDDR6X memory. Outfitted with a heavy-duty triple TORX Fan 4.0 thermal design, a factory-overclocked boost clock touching 2655 MHz via MSI Center, and a reinforced structural backplate, it supplies dominant high-refresh 1440p and fluid 4K gaming frame rates alongside accelerated local AI processing.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-4070-ti-ventus-3x-e1-12g-oc-gddr6x-graphics-card-1783859850', '<p>The MSI GeForce RTX 4070 Ti VENTUS 3X E1 12G OC delivers elite tier performance powered by NVIDIA\'s high-efficiency Ada Lovelace architecture, packing 7,680 processing CUDA cores and 12GB of premium GDDR6X memory. Outfitted with a heavy-duty triple TORX Fan 4.0 thermal design, a factory-overclocked boost clock touching 2655 MHz via MSI Center, and a reinforced structural backplate, it supplies dominant high-refresh 1440p and fluid 4K gaming frame rates alongside accelerated local AI processing. The latest price of the MSI GeForce RTX 4070 Ti VENTUS 3X E1 12G OC Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>102,000৳</strong>. You can purchase this dependable, triple-fan Ada Lovelace GPU online through the official International Office Solution website, or get dedicated technical advice by dropping by any of our local physical showrooms.</p><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Ada Lovelace</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>7,680 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2640 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2655 MHz (vi