es</td><td>3 Years Manufacturing Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/5dH7fGSj1kpUBB8RSpfPJVbo4Y71AcxeGAS2fSWf.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 12:37:30', '2026-07-12 12:40:07', 'MSI GeForce RTX 4070 Ti VENTUS 3X E1 12G OC Price in BD | International Office Solution', 'Get the original MSI GeForce RTX 4070 Ti VENTUS 3X E1 12G OC 12GB GDDR6X graphics card at the best price in Bangladesh. Enjoy robust Ada Lovelace engineering and triple TORX Fan 4.0 cooling at International Office Solution.', 'MSI GeForce RTX 4070 Ti VENTUS 3X E1 12G OC, RTX 4070 Ti Ventus 3X E1 price in Bangladesh, 12GB GDDR6X gaming GPU BD, Ada Lovelace desktop graphics card, International Office Solution.', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL);
