(1231, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5070 12G SHADOW 3X OC GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5070 12G SHADOW 3X OC delivers elite next-generation performance powered by NVIDIA\'s advanced Blackwell architecture, packing 6,144 processing CUDA cores and 12GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory. Outfitted with a factory-overclocked boost clock touching an extreme 2557 MHz via MSI Center, premium PCIe 5.0 lanes, and a high-efficiency triple TORX Fan 5.0 system, it ensures flawless high-framerate 4K gaming and high-tier local AI acceleration.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5070-12g-shadow-3x-oc-gddr7-graphics-card-1783859976', '<p>The MSI GeForce RTX 5070 12G SHADOW 3X OC delivers elite next-generation performance powered by NVIDIA\'s advanced Blackwell architecture, packing 6,144 processing CUDA cores and 12GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory. Outfitted with a factory-overclocked boost clock touching an extreme 2557 MHz via MSI Center, premium PCIe 5.0 lanes, and a high-efficiency triple TORX Fan 5.0 system, it ensures flawless high-framerate 4K gaming and high-tier local AI acceleration. Bring immense visual computing speed and sleek industrial stealth aesthetics to your desktop configuration with the premium engineering of the MSI GeForce RTX 5070 12G SHADOW 3X OC 12GB GDDR7 Graphics Card. Built on NVIDIA\'s revolutionary Blackwell architecture, this high-performance graphics card coordinates 6,144 powerhouse streaming CUDA cores alongside a fast 12GB buffer of next-generation GDDR7 video memory. Operating at a blistering memory speed of 28 Gbps across a 192-bit bus interface, it supplies a massive data bandwidth of up to 672 GB/s to seamlessly support fluid path-traced ray tracing, competitive high-refresh esports gameplay, and deep local AI or creation pipelines without a hint of micro-stuttering.</p><p>Dressed in a clean, minimalist matte black enclosure with a matching structural reinforcing backplate, this SHADOW 3X OC variant is engineered to maintain low thermal profiles under sustained execution limits. Thermal dissipation is masterfully handled by an advanced triple-fan array utilizing TORX Fan 5.0 units, which feature ring-bound blade arcs designed to focus high-pressure static airflow directly down into the custom heatsink block. Backed by a solid nickel-plated copper baseplate, precision squared core heat pipes, zero-RPM Zero Frozr technology for silent desktop idling, high-efficiency DrMOS power stages, and future-proof DisplayPort 2.1b connectivity, it delivers superior structural longevity and premium system stability for standard mid-tower and full-tower configurations.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the MSI GeForce RTX 5070 12G SHADOW 3X OC Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>105,000৳</strong>. You can purchase this premium, triple-fan Blackwell GPU online through the official International Office Solution website, or get dedicated technical assembly advice by visiting any of our local physical showrooms.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>6,144 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2542 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2557 MHz (via MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>12GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>28 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>192-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5.0</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 2.1b, 1 x HDMI 2.1b (Supports 4K@480Hz / 8K@120Hz with DSC)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Quad Display (Up to 4 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>250W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>1 x 16-pin (ATX 3.1 PSU recommended)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>650W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>Software</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooler Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Triple-Fan Setup with TORX Fan 5.0 technology</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Protection</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Solid Nickel-plated Copper Baseplate &amp; Square Core Pipes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Management</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Zero Frozr technology (Fans completely stop under low loads)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>303 x 121 x 49 mm (Triple-Fan Footprint)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Weight</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Net Card Weight: 982 g / Gross Package Weight: 1406 g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>After-sales</td><td>3 Years Manufacturing Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/TSZrTI7ruwTSN4thW9yeSj5dT0U6V6lTGleQOHT4.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 12:39:36', '2026-07-12 12:39:36', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5070 12G SHADOW 3X OC Price in BD | International Office Solution', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5070 12G SHADOW 3X OC Price in BD | International Office Solution', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5070 12G SHADOW 3X OC, RTX 5070 Shadow 3X price in Bangladesh, 12GB GDDR7 gaming GPU 