(1232, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5070 12G VENTUS 3X OC GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5070 12G VENTUS 3X OC brings NVIDIA’s next-generation Blackwell architecture into a heavy-duty triple-fan layout, packing 6,144 streaming CUDA cores and 12GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory. Featuring a robust factory overclock reaching an extreme 2557 MHz via MSI Center, premium PCIe 5.0 capabilities, and future-proof DisplayPort 2.1b connections, it delivers flawless high-framerate 4K gaming, local AI model running, and complex content creation acceleration.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5070-12g-ventus-3x-oc-gddr7-graphics-card-1783860440', '<p>The MSI GeForce RTX 5070 12G VENTUS 3X OC brings NVIDIA’s next-generation Blackwell architecture into a heavy-duty triple-fan layout, packing 6,144 streaming CUDA cores and 12GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory. Featuring a robust factory overclock reaching an extreme 2557 MHz via MSI Center, premium PCIe 5.0 capabilities, and future-proof DisplayPort 2.1b connections, it delivers flawless high-framerate 4K gaming, local AI model running, and complex content creation acceleration.&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>6,144 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2542 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2557 MHz (via MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>12GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>28 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>192-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td