(1233, 'MSI GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER 12G GAMING SLIM World of Warcraft EDITION GDDR6X Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER 12G Gaming Slim World of Warcraft Edition pairs NVIDIA\'s Ada Lovelace-powered RTX 4070 SUPER with an exclusive design built to celebrate WoW\'s 20th anniversary. It ships with 12GB of GDDR6X memory, 7168 CUDA cores, and swappable magnetic backplates inspired by the game\'s expansions — bringing together serious 1440p/4K gaming performance and standout collector-grade style.\r\nThe MSI GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER 12G Gaming Slim World of Warcraft Edition pairs NVIDIA\'s Ada Lovelace-powered RTX 4070 SUPER with an exclusive design built to celebrate WoW\'s 20th anniversary. It ships with 12GB of GDDR6X memory, 7168 CUDA cores, and swappable magnetic backplates inspired by the game\'s expansions — bringing together serious 1440p/4K gaming performance and standout collector-grade style.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-4070-super-12g-gaming-slim-world-of-warcraft-edition-gddr6x-graphics-card-1783860796', '<p>Built in collaboration with Blizzard Entertainment, this limited edition graphics card celebrates the 20th anniversary of World of Warcraft and the release of The War Within expansion. It\'s finished in the game\'s signature Mystic Blue and Glorious Gold color scheme, and includes a set of magnetic backplates inspired by WoW\'s ten expansions, which owners can swap out to match their personal style. <a href=\"https://www.alktech.co/articles/review-msi-geforce-rtx-4070-super-12g-gaming-slim-world-of-warcraft-edition\">Alktech + 2</a></p><p>Under the hood, the card runs on NVIDIA\'s GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER GPU with 7168 CUDA cores, 12GB of GDDR6X memory on a 192-bit bus running at 21 Gbps, and boost clocks up to 2475 MHz (2490 MHz in MSI Center\'s Extreme Performance mode). That translates to a memory bandwidth of roughly 504 GB/s, giving it plenty of headroom for high-refresh 1440p gaming and demanding 4K workloads. <a href=\"https://www.msi.com/Graphics-Card/GeForce-RTX-4070-SUPER-12G-GAMING-SLIM-World-of-Warcraft-EDITION/Specification\">MSI</a><a href=\"https://www.gpu-monkey.com/en/gpu-msi_geforce_rtx_4070_super_12g_gaming_slim_world_of_warcraft_edition\">GPU Monkey</a></p><p>Built on NVIDIA\'s Ada Lovelace architecture, the card supports third-gen ray tracing, fourth-gen Tensor Cores, and DLSS 3 frame generation for smoother, more responsive gameplay, plus NVIDIA Reflex for reduced input latency. MSI\'s cooling design features TORX Fan 5.0 blades linked by ring arcs with a fan cowl to stabilize and maintain high-pressure airflow, a copper baseplate to capture heat from the GPU and memory, square-shaped core heat pipes for maximum GPU contact, and staggered heatsink fin sections to reduce airflow noise. An illuminated dragon logo adds a signature MSI touch, and the whole card ships in a themed carry case with a WoW 20th-anniversary motif, along with a thank-you card and the full set of expansion backplates. <a href=\"https://shwetacomputers.com/products/msi-geforce-rtx-4070-super-12g-gaming-slim-world-of-warcraft%C2%AE-edition\">Shweta Computers</a><a href=\"https://www.alktech.co/articles/review-msi-geforce-rtx-4070-super-12g-gaming-slim-world-of-warcraft-edition\">Alktech</a></p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Core</strong></td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER (AD104)</td></tr><tr><td>Core</td><td>Architecture</td><td>Ada Lovelace, 4nm process</td></tr><tr><td>Core</td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>7168 Units</td></tr><tr><td>Core</td><td>Ray Tracing Cores</td><td>56 (3rd Gen)</td></tr><tr><td>Core</td><td>Tensor Cores</td><td>224 (4th Gen)</td></tr><tr><td>Core</td><td>Boost Clock</td><td>2475 MHz (up to 2490 MHz in Extreme Performance / MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>12GB GDDR6X</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>Memory Bus</td><td>192-bit</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>21 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>Memory Bandwidth</td><td>~504 GB/s</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>PCI Express Gen 4</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Display Outputs</td><td>3x DisplayPort (v1.4a), 1x HDMI (2.1a — 4K@120Hz HDR, 8K@60Hz HDR, VRR)</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>HDCP Support</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Max Displays</td><td>4 simultaneous</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Connector</td><td>1x 16-pin (12VHPWR)</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Included Adapter</td><td>2x 8-pin to 1x 16-pin adapter cable</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>650W and above</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling &amp; Design</strong></td><td>Cooling System</td><td>TORX Fan 5.0, copper baseplate, square core heat pipes, airflow-control fin design</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling &amp; Design</td><td>Special Edition</td><td>Swappable magnetic backplates (10 WoW expansion designs)</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling &amp; Design</td><td>Lighting</td><td>Illuminated MSI dragon logo</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling &amp; Design</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>307mm x 125mm x 46mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software &amp; Tech</strong></td><td>DLSS</td><td>DLSS 3 (AI frame generation)</td></tr><tr><td>Software &amp; Tech</td><td>Latency Tech</td><td>NVIDIA Reflex</td></tr><tr><td>Software &amp; Tech</td><td>Software Suite</td><td>MSI Center (monitoring, tuning, RGB control)</td></tr><tr><td>Software &amp; Tech</td><td>G-SYNC Support</td><td>Yes</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/TBd8N4y24D9MTij2rUtgbmksj6HStFCyXRCL5HRA.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 12:53:16', '2026-07-12 12:53:16', 'MSI RTX 4070 SUPER 12G Gaming Slim WoW Edition | 12GB GDDR6X GPU', 'Shop the MSI GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER 12G Gaming Slim World of Warcraft Edition — 12GB GDDR6X, 7168 CUDA cores, DLSS 3, swappable WoW-inspired backplates. Buy now!', 'MSI RTX 4070 SUPER, RTX 4070 Super World of Warcraft Edition, MSI Gaming Slim GPU, 12GB GDDR6X graphics card, WoW 20th anniversary GPU, DLSS 3 graphics card, Ada Lovelace GPU, RTX 4070 Super price, MSI RTX 4070 Super specs, gaming graphics card 2026', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
