tact, and Airflow Control fin sections that reduce turbulence and noise. The card is managed through MSI Center for real-time monitoring and tuning, with MSI Afterburner available for more advanced overclocking control, and MSI Mystic Light for customizable RGB lighting synced with other MSI and compatible third-party components.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Core</strong></td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER (AD104)</td></tr><tr><td>Core</td><td>Architecture</td><td>Ada Lovelace, 4nm process</td></tr><tr><td>Core</td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>7168 Units</td></tr><tr><td>Core</td><td>Ray Tracing Cores</td><td>56 (3rd Gen)</td></tr><tr><td>Core</td><td>Tensor Cores</td><td>224 (4th Gen)</td></tr><tr><td>Core</td><td>Boost Clock</td><td>2640 MHz (up to 2655 MHz in Extreme Performance / MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>12GB GDDR6X</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>Memory Bus</td><td>192-bit</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>21 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>Memory Bandwidth</td><td>~504 GB/s</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>PCI Express Gen 4</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Display Outputs</td><td>3x DisplayPort (v1.4a), 1x HDMI (2.1a — 4K@120Hz HDR, 8K@60Hz HDR, VRR)</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Max Digital Resolution</td><td>7680 x 4320 @ 60Hz</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>HDCP Support</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Connector</td><td>1x 16-pin (12VHPWR)</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>~245 W</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>650W and above</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling &amp; Design</strong></td><td>Cooling System</td><td>TRI FROZR 3 with triple TORX Fan 5.0, copper baseplate, core pipes, Airflow Control</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling &amp; De