aphics card 2026</p><h3><strong>Short Description</strong></h3><p>The MSI GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER 12G Gaming X Slim delivers premium 1440p and 4K gaming performance in a compact, SFF-friendly design. Built on NVIDIA\'s Ada Lovelace architecture with 12GB of GDDR6X memory, 7168 CUDA cores, and boost clocks up to 2640 MHz, it\'s cooled by MSI\'s TRI FROZR 3 thermal design with triple TORX Fan 5.0 blades — combining strong performance, quiet operation, and a slimmer footprint than standard Gaming X cards.</p><h3><strong>Long Description</strong></h3><p>The MSI GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER 12G Gaming X Slim is built around the NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER GPU, offering 7168 CUDA cores — 20% more than the standard RTX 4070 — along with 12GB of GDDR6X memory across a 192-bit bus at 21 Gbps. Boost clocks reach 2640 MHz out of the box, with MSI Center\'s Extreme Performance mode pushing that to 2655 MHz, giving this card the muscle for high-frame-rate 1440p gaming and demanding 4K workloads alike.</p><p>Powered by NVIDIA\'s Ada Lovelace architecture, the card supports third-generation RT Cores for fast, realistic ray tracing, fourth-generation Tensor Cores paired with an Optical Flow Accelerator for AI-driven DLSS 3 frame generation, and NVIDIA Reflex to minimize system latency for competitive gaming. As part of the \"Gaming Slim\" line, it\'s designed as a thinner variant of the standard Gaming series while still maintaining high performance and an aggressive look, making it a strong fit for small form factor builds. <a href=\"https://www.msi.com/Graphics-Card/GeForce-RTX-4070-SUPER-12G-GAMING-X-SLIM-MLG\">MSI</a></p><p>Cooling comes from MSI\'s TRI FROZR 3 thermal design, featuring TORX Fan 5.0 blades linked by ring arcs and a fan cowl to stabilize and concentrate airflow, a copper baseplate that pulls heat away from the GPU and memory modules, square-shaped core heat pipes for maximum GPU contact, and Airflow Control fin sections that reduce turbulence and noise. The card is m