iption</strong></h3><p>The MSI GeForce RTX 5070 12G Inspire 3X OC is powered by the NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 GPU, built on NVIDIA\'s Blackwell architecture. It packs 6144 CUDA cores, 12GB of next-gen GDDR7 memory on a 192-bit bus running at 28 Gbps, and a factory-overclocked boost clock of 2542 MHz in Gaming/Silent mode, reaching up to 2557 MHz in MSI Center\'s Extreme Performance mode. This marks a generational leap over GDDR6X-based predecessors, delivering higher memory bandwidth for smoother 1440p and 4K gaming.</p><p>Blackwell brings DLSS 4 support to the table, along with updated ray tracing and Tensor Core hardware for AI-accelerated rendering and content creation. Display output has also been upgraded, with DisplayPort 2.1b and HDMI 2.1b connectors supporting resolutions and refresh rates up to 4K at 480Hz or 8K at 120Hz with DSC, Gaming VRR, and HDR. <a href=\"https://us-store.msi.com/RTX-5070\">MSI</a></p><p>True to its name, the INSPIRE series pairs a small form factor with strong performance, making it a natural fit for compact builds and creative workstations. Cooling comes from a triple-fan design using seven-blade STORMFORCE fans with claw texturing for optimal airflow and reduced noise, paired with a nickel-plated copper baseplate that captures and transfers heat from the GPU and memory, square-profile core pipes for maximum thermal contact, and WAVE-CURVED 3.0 fin optimization to fine-tune airflow efficiency around the fan motor. A metal backplate with vents and thermal pads rounds out the cooling package. The card is managed through MSI Center, which offers both a Gaming mode for maximum performance and a Silent mode for quieter operation, plus MSI Afterburner for advanced overclocking control. <a href=\"https://us-store.msi.com/RTX-5070\">MSI</a><a href=\"https://videocardz.net/msi-geforce-rtx-5070-12gb-inspire-3x-oc\">VideoCardz</a></p>', '<p>MSI GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER 12G GAMING SLIM World of Warcraft EDITION GDDR6X Graphics Card give me meta ttl