(1239, 'MSI GeForce RTX 4070 Ti SUPER 16G GAMING X SLIM STALKER 2 EDITION 16GB GDDR6X Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 4070 Ti SUPER 16G Gaming Slim STALKER 2 Edition is a co-branded graphics card created with S.T.A.L.K.E.R. 2: Heart of Chornobyl, featuring the game\'s distinctive color scheme. Built on NVIDIA\'s Ada Lovelace architecture, it offers 16GB of GDDR6X memory, 8448 CUDA cores, and boost clocks up to 2625 MHz, cooled by MSI\'s TRI FROZR 3 thermal design — a standout pick for gamers who want performance and personality in one package.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-4070-ti-super-16g-gaming-x-slim-stalker-2-edition-16gb-gddr6x-graphics-card-1783861256', '<p>Created through a partnership between MSI and GSC Game World, this special edition graphics card carries the unique green-and-orange color scheme of the S.T.A.L.K.E.R. universe, giving fans of the franchise a way to bring that aesthetic straight into their build. It\'s based on the NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 Ti SUPER, featuring the AD103 GPU with 8448 CUDA cores, 66 ray tracing cores, and 264 Tensor cores, paired with 16GB of GDDR6X memory on a 256-bit bus running at 21 Gbps for roughly 672 GB/s of memory bandwidth. Boost clocks reach 2625 MHz (2610 MHz standard boost), giving it strong performance for high-refresh 1440p and demanding 4K gaming.</p><p>Built on NVIDIA\'s Ada Lovelace architecture, the card supports third-gen RT Cores for fast, realistic ray tracing and fourth-gen Tensor Cores with an Optical Flow Accelerator for DLSS 3 frame generation, alongside NVIDIA Reflex for reduced system latency. As part of the Gaming Slim family, it keeps a thinner profile than MSI\'s standard Gaming line while maintaining strong cooling and performance headroom.</p><p>Cooling comes from MSI\'s TRI FROZR 3 thermal design, with TORX Fan 5.0 blades linked by ring arcs and a fan cowl for stabilized, high-pressure airflow, a nickel-plated copper baseplate to quickly pull heat from the GPU and memory, square-shaped core heat pipes for maximum GPU contact, and Airflow Control fin sections to direct air where it\'s needed most. The card also includes MSI\'s ZERO FROZR feature, which stops the fans entirely at low temperatures for silent idle operation. Many retail bundles pair this card with a download code for S.T.A.L.K.E.R. 2: Heart of Chornobyl Deluxe Edition, letting buyers jump straight into the game the card was designed around.</p>', '<p>MSI GeForce RTX 5070 12G GAMING TRIO OC WHITE GDDR7 Graphics Card</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Searched the web</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Searched the web</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I have solid data. Here\'s the complete SEO and product listing content for the <strong>MSI GeForce RTX 5070 12G GAMING TRIO OC WHITE</strong>:</p><h3><strong>Meta Title</strong></h3><p>MSI RTX 5070 12G Gaming Trio OC White | 12GB GDDR7 Graphics Card</p><h3><strong>Meta Description</strong></h3><p>Shop the MSI GeForce RTX 5070 12G Gaming Trio OC White — 12GB GDDR7, TRI FROZR 4 cooling, DLSS 4, up to 2610 MHz boost clock, sleek white design. Buy now!</p><h3><strong>Meta Keywords</strong></h3><p>MSI RTX 5070 Gaming Trio OC White, RTX 5070 white graphics card, RTX 5070 12GB GDDR7, MSI RTX 5070 price, TRI FROZR 4 GPU, DLSS 4 graphics card, Blackwell architecture GPU, white gaming GPU, RTX 5070 specs, MSI graphics card 2026</p><h3><strong>Short Description</strong></h3><p>The MSI GeForce RTX 5070 12G Gaming Trio OC White brings NVIDIA\'s Blackwell architecture and DLSS 4 to a bold, all-white aesthetic built for style-matched builds. It features 12GB of GDDR7 memory, 6144 CUDA cores, and factory-overclocked boost speeds up to 2610 MHz, backed by MSI\'s TRI FROZR 4 thermal design with triple STORMFORCE fans for powerful, quiet cooling.</p><h3><strong>Long Description</strong></h3><p>The MSI GeForce RTX 5070 12G Gaming Trio OC White is built around the NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 GPU on NVIDIA\'s Blackwell architecture, delivering 6144 CUDA cores alongside 12GB of GDDR7 memory across a 192-bit bus at 28 Gbps. The card ships factory-overclocked with a 2610 MHz boost clock in Gaming/Silent mode, climbing to 2625 MHz in MSI Center\'s Extreme Performance mode — putting it a notch above the standard Inspire and Ventus variants in the RTX 5070 lineup.</p><p>Blackwell brings fourth-gen RT Cores and fifth-gen Tensor Cores to the table, enabling DLSS 4 with Multi Frame Generation, enhanced Ray Reconstruction, and Super Resolution for major gains in frame rate and image quality. NVIDIA Reflex 2 with Frame Warp further reduces input latency for competitive play, while support for the 50-series\' upgraded encode/decode engine benefits creators working in Adobe Premiere Pro, DaVinci Resolve, and similar applications. Display connectivity is upgraded to DisplayPort 2.1b and HDMI 2.1b, supporting up to 4K at 480Hz or 8K at 120Hz with DSC, VRR, and HDR.</p><p>Part of MSI\'s flagship Gaming Trio line, this card carries an aggressive design accented with diffused LED lighting and a dragon totem motif, finished here in a clean white colorway for style-matched builds. Cooling comes from MSI\'s TRI FROZR 4 thermal design, featuring triple STORMFORCE fans with seven claw-textured blades for high airflow and low noise, a nickel-plated copper baseplate for fast heat capture, square-profile core pipes for maximum GPU contact, Wave Curved 4.0 fin geometry, and Air Antegrade Fin 2.0 V-cut fins to reduce turbulence. A reinforcing metal backplate with vents and thermal pads rounds out the cooling package, while MSI Center and MSI Afterburner provide real-time monitoring, tuning, and overclocking control.</p><h3><strong>Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Core</strong></td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 (GB205-300)</td></tr><tr><td>Core</td><td>Architecture</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td>Core</