ard also includes a reinforced backplate and a bundled support bracket to guard against GPU sag, and is managed through MSI Center and MSI Afterburner for real-time monitoring, tuning, and overclocking.</p>', '<p>MSI GeForce RTX 4070 Ti SUPER 16G GAMING X SLIM STALKER 2 EDITION 16GB GDDR6X Graphics Card</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Searched the web</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Searched the web</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Excellent data on this one. Here\'s the complete SEO and product listing content for the <strong>MSI GeForce RTX 4070 Ti SUPER 16G GAMING X SLIM STALKER 2 EDITION</strong>:</p><h3><strong>Meta Title</strong></h3><p>MSI RTX 4070 Ti SUPER 16G Gaming Slim STALKER 2 Edition GPU</p><h3><strong>Meta Description</strong></h3><p>Shop the MSI GeForce RTX 4070 Ti SUPER 16G Gaming Slim STALKER 2 Edition — 16GB GDDR6X, 8448 CUDA cores, DLSS 3, unique S.T.A.L.K.E.R. universe design. Buy now!</p><h3><strong>Meta Keywords</strong></h3><p>MSI RTX 4070 Ti Super STALKER 2, STALKER 2 graphics card, RTX 4070 Ti Super 16GB, MSI RTX 4070 Ti Super price, S.T.A.L.K.E.R. 2 GPU edition, TRI FROZR 3 graphics card, DLSS 3 graphics card, Ada Lovelace GPU, RTX 4070 Ti Super specs, MSI graphics card 2026</p><h3><strong>Short Description</strong></h3><p>The MSI GeForce RTX 4070 Ti SUPER 16G Gaming Slim STALKER 2 Edition is a co-branded graphics card created with S.T.A.L.K.E.R. 2: Heart of Chornobyl, featuring the game\'s distinctive color scheme. Built on NVIDIA\'s Ada Lovelace architecture, it offers 16GB of GDDR6X memory, 8448 CUDA cores, and boost clocks up to 2625 MHz, cooled by MSI\'s TRI FROZR 3 thermal design — a standout pick for gamers who want performance and personality in one package.</p><h3><strong>Long Description</strong></h3><p>Created through a partnership between MSI and GSC Game World, this special edition graphics card carries the unique green-and-orange color scheme of the S.T.A.L.K.E.R. universe, giving fans of the franchise a way to bring that aesthetic straight into their build. It\'s based on the NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 Ti SUPER, featuring the AD103 GPU with 8448 CUDA cores, 66 ray tracing cores, and 264 Tensor cores, paired with 16GB of GDDR6X memory on a 256-bit bus running at 21 Gbps for roughly 672 GB/s of memory bandwidth. Boost clocks reach 2625 MHz (2610 MHz standard boost), giving it strong performance for high-refresh 1440p and demanding 4K gaming.</p><p>Built on NVIDIA\'s Ada Lovelace architecture, the card supports third-gen RT Cores for fast, realistic ray tracing and fourth-gen Tensor Cores with an Optical Flow Accelerator for DLSS 3 frame generation, alongside NVIDIA Reflex for reduced system latency. As part of the Gaming Slim family, it keeps a thinner profile than MSI\'s standard Gaming line while maintaining strong cooling and performance headroom.</p><p>Cooling comes from MSI\'s TRI FROZR 3 thermal design, with TORX Fan 5.0 blades linked by ring arcs and a fan cowl for stabilized, high-pressure airflow, a nickel-plated copper baseplate to quickly pull heat from the GPU and memory, square-shaped core heat pipes for maximum GPU contact, and Airflow Control fin sections to direct air where it\'s needed most. The card also includes MSI\'s ZERO FROZR feature, which stops the fans entirely at low temperatures for silent idle operation. Many retail bundles pair this card with a download code for S.T.A.L.K.E.R. 2: Heart of Chornobyl Deluxe Edition, letting buyers jump straight into the game the card was designed around.</p><h3><strong>Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Core</strong></td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 Ti SUPER (AD103-275)</td></tr><tr><td>Core</td><td>Architecture</td><td>Ada Lovelace, 4nm process (TSMC 4N)</td></tr><tr><td>Core</td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>8448 Units</td></tr><tr><td>Core</td><td>Ray Tracing Cores</td><td>66 (3rd Gen)</td></tr><tr><td>Core</td><td>Tensor Cores</td><td>264 (4th Gen)</td></tr><tr><td>Core</td><td>Boost Clock</td><td>2610 MHz (up to 2625 MHz Extreme Performance / MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB GDDR6X</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>Memory Bus</td><td>256-bit</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>21 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>Memory Bandwidth</td><td>~672 GB/s</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>PCI Express Gen 4</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Display Outputs</td><td>3x DisplayPort (v1.4a), 1x HDMI (2.1a — 4K@120Hz HDR, 8K@60Hz HDR, VRR)</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Max Digital Resolution</td><td>7680 x 4320</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Max Displays</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>HDCP Support</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>G-SYNC Support</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Connector</td><td>1x 16-pin (12VHPWR)</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>285 W</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>700W and above</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical</strong></td><td>Card Dimensions</td><td>307 mm length, 2.6-slot</td></tr><tr><td>Physical</td><td>Weight</td><td>~1094 g</td></tr><tr><td>Physical</td><td>Color Scheme</td><td>Green / Orange (S.T.A.L.K.E.R. themed)</td></tr><tr><td>Physical</td><td>Fans</td><td>3x TORX Fan 5.0</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling &amp; Design</strong></td><td>Cooling System</td><td>TRI FROZR 3, nickel-plated copper baseplate, square core heat pipes, Airflow Control, ZERO FROZR</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling &amp; Design</td><td>Special Edition</td><td>Co-branded S.T.A.L.K.E.R. 2 design; select bundles include game download code</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software &amp; Tech</strong></td><td>DLSS</td><td>DLSS 3 (AI frame generation)</td></tr><tr><td>Software &amp; Tech</td><td>Latency Tech</td><td>NVIDIA Reflex