(1255, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5080 16G GAMING TRIO OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5080 16G Gaming Trio OC brings flagship-tier performance and MSI\'s fierce Gaming Trio design together, powered by NVIDIA\'s Blackwell architecture and DLSS 4. It features 16GB of GDDR7 memory, 10752 CUDA cores, and a factory-overclocked boost speed up to 2715 MHz, backed by MSI\'s TWIN FROZR 10 thermal design with triple STORMFORCE fans for serious 4K gaming and content creation performance.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5080-16g-gaming-trio-oc-16gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783863379', '<p>The MSI GeForce RTX 5080 16G Gaming Trio OC is powered by the NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5080 GPU on NVIDIA\'s Blackwell architecture, delivering 10752 CUDA cores alongside 16GB of GDDR7 memory across a 256-bit bus at 30 Gbps. The card ships factory-overclocked with a 2700 MHz boost clock in Gaming/Silent mode, climbing to 2715 MHz in MSI Center\'s Extreme Performance mode — a notable step up from the standard Gaming Trio\'s 2617 MHz boost clock.</p><p>Blackwell brings fourth-gen RT Cores and fifth-gen Tensor Cores to the table, enabling DLSS 4 with Multi Frame Generation, enhanced Ray Reconstruction, and Super Resolution for major gains in frame rate and image quality. The RTX 50-series\' upgraded encode/decode engine also benefits creators, supporting 4:2:2 pro-grade color, Multiview-HEVC for 3D and VR video, and AV1 Ultra High Quality mode — useful for editing high-resolution footage smoothly in Adobe Premiere Pro, DaVinci Resolve, and similar applications. Display connectivity includes DisplayPort 2.1b and HDMI 2.1b, supporting up to 8K resolution at 7680 x 4320.</p><p>As MSI\'s flagship Gaming line, this card carries a fierce, sharp-edged design built for gamers and creators who want top-tier performance with real visual presence. Cooling comes from MSI\'s newest TWIN FROZR 10 thermal design, featuring triple STORMFORCE fans with seven claw-textured blades for high airflow and low noise, a nickel-plated copper baseplate for fast heat capture, square-profile core pipes for maximum GPU contact, and Wave-Curved 3.0 fin geometry to optimize airflow in low-flow zones. A reinforcing metal backplate with vents and thermal pads rounds out the cooling package. The card includes Dual BIOS, letting users choose between a full-performance Gaming mode or a quieter Silent mode, and is managed through MSI Center and MSI Afterburner for real-time monitoring, tuning, and overclocking control.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Core</strong></td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5080</td></tr><tr><td>Core</td><td>Architecture</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td>Core</td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>10752 Units</td></tr><tr><td>Core</td><td>Boost Clock</td><td>2700 MHz (Gaming/Silent Mode), up to 2715 MHz Extreme Performance (MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>Memory Bus</td><td>256-bit</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>30 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Display Outputs</td><td>3x DisplayPort (v2.1b), 1x HDMI (2.1b — up to 4K@480Hz or 8K@120Hz with DSC, VRR, HDR)</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Max Digital Resolution</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K)</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Max Displays</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>HDCP Support</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>G-SYNC Support</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Connector</td><td>1x 16-pin (12VHPWR)</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>360 W</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>750W and above</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical</strong></td><td>Card Dimensions</td><td>338 mm length</td></tr><tr><td>Physical</td><td>Color</td><td>Black / Silver</td></tr><tr><td>Physical</td><td>Fans</td><td>3x STORMFORCE fans</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling &amp; Design</strong></td><td>Cooling System</td><td>TWIN FROZR 10, nickel-plated copper baseplate, square core pipes, Wave-Curved 3.0</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling &amp; Design</td><td>Backplate</td><td>Reinforcing metal backplate with vents and thermal pads</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling &amp; Design</td><td>Special Features</td><td>Dual BIOS (Gaming/Silent mode)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software &amp; Tech</strong></td><td>DLSS</td><td>DLSS 4 (Multi Frame Generation, Ray Reconstruction, Super Resolution)</td></tr><tr><td>Software &amp; Tech</td><td>Latency Tech</td><td>NVIDIA Reflex 2</td></tr><tr><td>Software &amp; Tech</td><td>Software Suite</td><td>MSI Center (Gaming/Silent mode), MSI Afterburner</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/hX44d4QuVufLYA0MSG23se9w52wkuypUVkpZhUVU.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 13:36:19', '2026-07-12 13:36:19', 'MSI RTX 5080 16G Gaming Trio OC | 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'Buy the MSI GeForce RTX 5080 16G Gaming Trio OC — 16GB GDDR7, TWIN FROZR 10 cooling, DLSS 4, up to 2715 MHz boost clock, bold RGB design. Shop now!', 'MSI RTX 5080 Gaming Trio OC, RTX 5080 16GB GDDR7, MSI RTX 5080 price, TWIN FROZR 10 graphics card, DLSS 4 graphics card, Blackwell architecture GPU, STORMFORCE fan GPU, RTX 5080 specs, MSI graphics card 2026, PCIe 5.0 graphics card', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL);
