orway for builds that favor a brighter aesthetic. Cooling comes from MSI\'s newest TWIN FROZR 10 thermal design, featuring triple STORMFORCE fans with seven claw-textured blades for high airflow and low noise, a nickel-plated copper baseplate for fast heat capture, square-profile core pipes for maximum GPU contact, and Wave-Curved 3.0 fin geometry to optimize airflow in low-flow zones. A reinforcing metal backplate with vents and thermal pads rounds out the cooling package. The card includes Dual BIOS, letting users choose between a full-performance Gaming mode or a quieter Silent mode, and is managed through MSI Center and MSI Afterburner for real-time monitoring, tuning, and overclocking control.</p><h3><strong>Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Core</strong></td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5080</td></tr><tr><td>Core</td><td>Architecture</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td>Core</td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>10752 Units</td></tr><tr><td>Core</td><td>Boost Clock</td><td>2700 MHz (Gaming/Silent Mode), up to 2715 MHz Extreme Performance (MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>Memory Bus</td><td>256-bit</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>30 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Display Outputs</td><td>3x DisplayPort (v2.1b), 1x HDMI (2.1b — up to 4K@480Hz or 8K@120Hz with DSC, VRR, HDR)</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Max Digital Resolution</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K)</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Max Displays</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>HDCP Support</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>G-SYNC Support</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</st