\" figurines — MSI\'s dragon mascot — including a rare secret design, tied to MSI\'s launch campaign for the new Vanguard line.</p><p>MSI\'s Vanguard series sits between its halo-tier Suprim series and its more mainstream Gaming X line, effectively serving as the successor to the retired Gaming Z series. Design-wise, it borrows titanium-gray metal alloy accents and a brushed-aluminum backplate from Suprim, alongside carbon fiber surfacing and acrylic RGB LED diffusers reminiscent of Gaming X — resulting in a distinctive, premium look with generous RGB lighting.</p><p>Blackwell\'s display engine implements DisplayPort 2.1b with UHBR20 on all ports, enabling 8K high-refresh-rate output over a single cable when paired with DSC, and dual NVDEC/NVENC video accelerators support 4:2:2 color formats for both AV1 and HEVC encoding. DLSS 4 brings Multi Frame Generation, enhanced Ray Reconstruction, and Super Resolution, all accelerated by fifth-gen Tensor Cores, alongside NVIDIA Reflex 2 for reduced input latency.</p><p>Cooling comes from MSI\'s Hyper Frozr thermal design, borrowing cooling innovations from the Suprim series: a vapor chamber plate makes direct contact with the GPU and memory, transferring heat to a cluster of flattened, cuboidal heat pipes for maximum contact, then spreading it across a large aluminum fin stack with wavy edges designed to increase turbulence for better heat dissipation. Triple STORMFORCE fans with double ball bearings handle airflow — the same fans found on MSI\'s flagship Suprim RTX 5080. Dual BIOS lets users choose between full-performance Gaming mode and a quieter Silent mode, and the card is managed through MSI Center and MSI Afterburner for real-time monitoring, tuning, and overclocking control.</p><h3><strong>Specifications</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Core</strong></td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5080 (GB203, fully unlocked)</td></tr><tr><td>Core</td><td>Architecture</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td>Core</td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>10752 Units</td></tr><tr><td>Core</td><td>Tensor Cores</td><td>336</td></tr><tr><td>Core</td><td>Ray Tracing Cores</td><td>84</td></tr><tr><td>Core</td><td>Boost Clock</td><td>2730 MHz (Gaming/Silent Mode SOC), up to 2745 MHz Extreme Performance (MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>Memory Bus</td><td>256-bit</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>30 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>Memory Bandwidth</td><td>960 GB/s</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Display Outputs</td><td>3x DisplayPort (v2.1b, UHBR20), 1x HDMI (2.1b — up to 4K@480Hz or 8K@120Hz with DSC, VRR, HDR)</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Max Digital Resolution</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K)</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Max Displays</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>HDCP Support</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>G-SYNC Support</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Connector</td><td>1x 16-pin (12VHPWR)</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Consumption</td><td>360 W</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>850W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical</strong></td><td>Card Dimensions</td><td>357 x 151 x 66 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Physical</td><td>Color</td><td>Black / Silver with RGB accents</td></tr><tr><td>Physical</td><td>Fans</td><td>3x STORMFORCE fans (double ball bearing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling &amp; Design</strong></td><td>Cooling System</td><td>Hyper Frozr — vapor chamber, cuboidal heat pipes, wavy-edge aluminum fin stack</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling &amp; Design</td><td>Design Language</td><td>Titanium-gray metal alloy accents, carbon fiber surfacing, RGB LED diffusers</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling &amp; Design</td><td>Special Edition</td><td>Launch Edition packaging + Lucky figurine blind box (1 of 10 designs, incl. secret edition)</td></tr><tr><td>Cooling &amp; Design</td><td>Special Features</td><td>Dual BIOS (Gaming/Silent mode)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software &amp; Tech</strong></td><td>DLSS</td><td>DLSS 4 (Multi Frame Generation, Ray Reconstruction, Super Resolution)</td></tr><tr><td>Software &amp; Tech</td><td>Latency Tech</td><td>NVIDIA Reflex 2</td></tr><tr><td>Software &amp; Tech</td><td>Software Suite</td><td>MSI Center (Gaming/Silent mode), MSI Afterburner</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/xBBefmTgpkyGzMmO9nQ2F24XchNdOJ3QGAoDKRQk.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 13:41:10', '2026-07-12 13:41:10', 'MSI RTX 5080 16G Vanguard SOC Launch Edition | 16GB GDDR7 GPU', 'Get the MSI GeForce RTX 5080 16G Vanguard SOC Launch Edition — 16GB GDDR7, Hyper Frozr vapor chamber cooling, DLSS 4, up to 2745 MHz boost, includes Lucky figurine. Buy now!', 'MSI RTX 5080 Vanguard SOC Launch Edition, Vanguard Launch Edition GPU, RTX 5080 16GB GDDR7, MSI RTX 5080 price, Hyper Frozr cooling, DLSS 4 graphics card, Blackwell architecture GPU, Lucky figurine GPU, RTX 5080 specs, MSI graphics card 2026', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(1260, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5080 16G VENTUS 3X OC WHITE 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5080 16G VENTUS 3X OC WHITE unleashes enthusiast-tier visual computing power driven by NVIDIA’s advanced Blackwell architecture, packaged in a premium, clean all-white shroud. Packing 10,752 processing CUDA cores and 16GB of ultra-fast next-gen GDDR7 memory, it features a factory overclock reaching 2655 MHz via MSI Center, premium PCIe 5.0 lanes, and an optimized triple TORX Fan 5.0 array to deliver dominant 4K gaming frames and elite local AI acceleratio', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5080-16g-ventus-3x-oc-white-16gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783873683', '<p>Take your custom gaming rig or high-tier creative workstation to next-generation heights with the flawless aesthetics and premium engineering of the MSI GeForce RTX 5080 16G VENTUS 3X OC WHITE 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card. Forged on NVIDIA\'s revolutionary Blackwell architecture, this elite-performance graphics accelerator coordinates a massive 10,752 powerhouse streaming CUDA cores with an agile 16GB buffer of next-generation GDDR7 video memory. Operating at a blistering memory speed of 30 Gbps across a wide 256-bit bus interface, it supplies colossal data transfer bandwidth to effortlessly support ultra-smooth path-traced ray tracing, fluid high-refresh 4K gaming environments, and deep local AI training or complex 3D rendering timelines.</p><p>Dressed completely in a striking, pristine white cover shroud with a matching flow-through white structural backplate, this custom VENTUS 3X OC variant is engineered to maintain low thermal profiles under sustained execution limits. Thermal management is masterfully handled by an advanced triple-fan layout featuring ring-bound TORX Fan 5.0 units, engineered to focus concentrated high-pressure static airflow directly down into the underlying cooling stack. Backed by a solid nickel-plated copper baseplate, precision squared core heat pipes, zero-RPM Zero Frozr technology for silent desktop idling, high-efficiency DrMOS power stages, and future-proof DisplayPort 2.1b connectivity, it serves as the ultimate future-proof centerpiece for themed enthusiast PC builds.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the MSI GeForce RTX 5080 16G VENTUS 3X OC WHITE Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>222,900৳</strong>. You can secure this stunning white enthusiast Blackwell GPU online via the official International Office Solution website, or get dedicated technical configuration advice by visiting any of our local physical showrooms.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>10,752 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2640 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2655 MHz (via MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>30 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>256-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5.0 x16</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 2.1b, 1 x HDMI 2.1b (Supports 4K@480Hz / 8K@120Hz with DSC)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Quad Display (Up to 4 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>360W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>1 x 16-pin (ATX 3.1 PSU recommended)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>850W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>Software</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooler Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Triple-Fan Setup with TORX Fan 5.0 technology</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Protection</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Solid Nickel-plated Copper Baseplate &amp; Square Core Pipes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Management</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Zero Frozr technology (Fans completely stop under low loads)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Body Theme &amp; Profile</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Premium All-White Shroud Slim Profile with Ventilated White Backplate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>303 x 121 x 49 mm (Compact SFF-Ready Design)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Weight</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Net Card Weight: 1105 g / Gross Package Weight: 1618 g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>After-sales</td><td>3 Years Manufacturing Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/scNPDKVRkKXieYYSZ24xp633UZHt7KhHA2vSWwkA.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 16:28:04', '2026-07-12 16:28:04', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5080 16G VENTUS 3X OC WHITE Price in BD | International Office Solution', 'Get the official MSI GeForce RTX 5080 16G VENTUS 3X OC WHITE 16GB GDDR7 graphics card at the best price in Bangladesh. Enjoy enthusiast-tier Blackwell architecture and pristine all-white aesthetics at International Office Solution.', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5080 16G VENTUS 3X OC WHITE, RTX 5080 Ventus 3X White price in Bangladesh, 16GB GDDR7 white GPU BD, Blackwell enthusiast desktop graphics card, International Office Solution.',