(1261, 'Apollo S500 Portable Smart Projector iosbd', 'The Apollo S500 Portable Smart Projector is a premium portable projector designed for both business professionals and home entertainment enthusiasts. Featuring a built-in 15,000mAh rechargeable battery, Android 13 operating system, Full HD 1080P native resolution, 4K input support, automatic focus, and intelligent keystone correction, it delivers a hassle-free viewing experience wherever you go. Whether you\'re presenting in the office or enjoying movies outdoors, the Apollo S500 provides outstanding performance without requiring a constant power connection.', 'apollo-s500-portable-smart-projector-iosbd-1783873824', '<p>The Apollo S500 Portable Smart Projector is an advanced smart projection solution that combines portability, powerful hardware, and intelligent automation into an ultra-slim design. Available at International Office Solution, this projector is ideal for business meetings, classrooms, office presentations, home entertainment, gaming, and outdoor movie nights.</p><p>Designed with a sleek 30mm ultra-thin body, the Apollo S500 easily fits into backpacks, travel bags, or office briefcases. Its powerful 15,000mAh built-in rechargeable battery provides approximately 2 to 3 hours of cordless operation, allowing users to enjoy complete freedom without searching for a power outlet.</p><p>Powered by the efficient Amlogic T972 Quad-Core processor and the latest Android 13 operating system, the Apollo S500 offers fast navigation, smoother multitasking, and access to popular streaming applications. Users can watch movies, stream videos, browse content, or deliver presentations directly from the projector without requiring additional devices.</p><p>The projector features Native Full HD 1920 × 1080 resolution with 4K Ultra HD input compatibility, ensuring exceptionally detailed images with vibrant colors and sharp text. Combined with its impressive 5000:1 contrast ratio, it delivers deeper blacks, brighter highlights, and excellent image clarity for both movies and presentations.</p><p>Setup is effortless thanks to the projector\'s intelligent Auto Focus and Automatic Keystone Correction technology. Within seconds, the Apollo S500 automatically adjusts image sharpness and alignment, eliminating the need for manual adjustments.</p><p>With an impressive projection range from 0.25 meters to 7.3 meters, the projector can create screen sizes of up to 200 inches, transforming any room into a cinematic viewing experience. Whether used in a conference room, classroom, living room, or outdoor environment, the Apollo S500 provides immersive large-screen entertainment.</p><p>Its wireless connectivity and smart operating system make it easy to stream content from smartphones, tablets, laptops, and other compatible devices. The lightweight construction and rechargeable battery make it one of the most convenient portable smart projectors available in Bangladesh.</p><p>If you are searching for a premium portable projector with rechargeable battery, Android operating system, Full HD quality, and intelligent auto setup, the Apollo S500 Portable Smart Projector is an excellent choice for both professional and personal use.</p><p>Choose International Office Solution for genuine products, competitive pricing, professional support, and reliable after-sales service throughout Bangladesh.</p><p>Key Features Ultra-slim 30mm portable design</p><p>Built-in 15,000mAh rechargeable battery</p><p>Up to 2–3 hours wireless operation</p><p>Android 13 Smart Operating System</p><p>High-performance Amlogic T972 processor</p><p>Native Full HD 1080P resolution</p><p>Supports 4K Ultra HD input</p><p>5000:1 high contrast ratio</p><p>Intelligent Auto Focus</p><p>Automatic Keystone Correction</p><p>Projection size up to 200 inches</p><p>Projection distance from 0.25m to 7.3m</p><p>Ideal for office presentations, education, business meetings, home theater, gaming, and outdoor entertainment</p><p>Why Buy from International Office Solution? 100% Genuine Product</p><p>Competitive Price in Bangladesh</p><p>Professional Customer Support</p><p>Fast Nationwide Delivery</p><p>Corporate Sales Available</p><p>Business &amp; Educational Project Solutions</p><p>Reliable After-Sales Service</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>General</td><td>Model</td><td>Apollo S500</td></tr><tr><td>General</td><td>Product Type</td><td>Portable Smart Projector</td></tr><tr><td>General</td><td>Brand</td><td>Apollo</td></tr><tr><td>Design</td><td>Body Design</td><td>Ultra-Slim 30mm Portable Design</td></tr><tr><td>Design</td><td>Portability</td><td>Lightweight &amp; Travel-Friendly</td></tr><tr><td>Battery</td><td>Battery Capacity</td><td>Built-in 15,000mAh Rechargeable Battery</td></tr><tr><td>Battery</td><td>Playback Time</td><td>Up to 2–3 Hours (Cord-Free Operation)</td></tr><tr><td>Operating System</td><td>OS</td><td>Android 13</td></tr><tr><td>Processor</td><td>Chipset</td><td>Amlogic T972 High-Performance Processor</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Native Resolution</td><td>Full HD 1920 × 1080 (1080P)</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>4K Support</td><td>Supports 4K Ultra HD Input</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Contrast Ratio</td><td>5000:1</td></tr><tr><td>Display</td><td>Projection Size</td><td>Up to 200 Inches</td></tr><tr><td>Projection</td><td>Throw Distance</td><td>0.25m – 7.3m</td></tr><tr><td>Image Adjustment</td><td>Auto Focus</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Image Adjustment</td><td>Keystone Correction</td><td>Automatic Digital Keystone Correction</td></tr><tr><td>Smart Features</td><td>Streaming</td><td>Built-in Smart Android Apps Support</td></tr><tr><td>Smart Features</td><td>Wireless Connectivity</td><td>Supports Wireless Screen Casting <i>(Compatible Devices)</i></td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Built-in Speaker</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>HDMI</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>USB</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Wi-Fi</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Bluetooth</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Multimedia</td><td>Video Playback</td><td>Supports Local &amp; Online Media Playback</td></tr><tr><td>Usage</td><td>Business</td><td>Office Meetings &amp; Presentations</td></tr><tr><td>Usage</td><td>Education</td><td>Classroom &amp; Training</td></tr><tr><td>Usage</td><td>Entertainment</td><td>Home Theater, Gaming &amp; Outdoor Movies</td></tr><tr><td>Installation</td><td>Setup</td><td>Intelligent Automatic Calibration</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Operation</td><td>Rechargeable Battery &amp; AC Power</td></tr><tr><td>Color</td><td>Finish</td><td>Premium Modern Design</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Official Warranty (As Per International Office Solution Policy)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'PROJECTOR', 59000.00, 59000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/ucDEyX5HZYATsVVWb0Oyg4gJiZ3Szu9Fmz38aPJL.jpg', 'products/videos/TbM8EpLPPBECeeAtzue9KcqNoq8RMK5jqWEAxm4Y.mp4', 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 16:30:24', '2026-07-19 05:29:01', 'Apollo S500 Portable Smart Projector Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the Apollo S500 Portable Smart Projector in Bangladesh from International Office Solution. Features a built-in 15000mAh rechargeable battery, Android 13, Full HD 1080P resolution, 4K input support, auto focus, auto keystone correction, and a projection size up to 200 inches.', 'Apollo S500 projector, Apollo portable projector Bangladesh, rechargeable projector price in Bangladesh, smart projector with battery, Android 13 projector, Full HD portable projector, 1080P projector BD, 4K supported projector, home theater projector Bangladesh, wireless projector, office presentation projector, mini projector rechargeable, portable projector for business, projector for classroom, projector for meeting room, smart LED projector, auto focus projector, auto keystone projector, Apollo projector price, International Office Solution\r\nApollo S500 Portable Smart Projector\r\nApollo S500 Rechargeable Smart Projector\r\nApollo S500 Android 13 Projector\r\nApollo S500 Full HD Projector\r\nPortable Projector Price in Bangladesh\r\nApollo S500 4K Supported Projector\r\nSmart Portable Projector Bangladesh\r\nInternational Office Solution Apollo Projector', NULL, 68, NULL, NULL);
