(1262, 'MSI GeForce RTX 4090 GAMING X SLIM 24GB GDDR6X Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 4090 GAMING X SLIM 24GB GDDR6X delivers the absolute apex of graphic processing engineering wrapped inside a thinner, case-friendly space-saving form factor. Built on NVIDIA\'s high-efficiency Ada Lovelace architecture, it unleashes an incredible 16,384 streaming CUDA cores and a massive 24GB frame buffer of ultra-fast GDDR6X memory. Outfitted with a factory-overclocked boost clock touching 2610 MHz via MSI Center and the elite TRI FROZR 3 triple TORX Fan 5.0 cooling array, it dominates 4K/8K gaming, heavy local AI LLM deployment, and high-tier professional rendering pipelines.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-4090-gaming-x-slim-24gb-gddr6x-graphics-card-1783873836', '<p>Unleash the supreme pinnacle of visual computing and real-time ray-traced rendering with the masterful engineering of the MSI GeForce RTX 4090 GAMING X SLIM 24GB GDDR6X Graphics Card. Forged directly on NVIDIA\'s flagship Ada Lovelace architecture, this absolute titan of a graphic accelerator coordinates 16,384 powerhouse streaming CUDA cores alongside a massive 24GB buffer of top-tier GDDR6X video memory. Operating at an effective memory clock speed of 21 Gbps across a colossal 384-bit memory bus width, it supplies a massive data bandwidth up to 1008 GB/s to seamlessly handle unmatched high-refresh 4K and 8K gaming resolutions, multi-million polygon 3D environment builds, and dense local AI modeling or deep learning pipelines without a single hint of stuttering.</p><p>Stepping forward as a specialized enthusiast solution, this GAMING X SLIM variant stands out by condensing the traditionally massive footprint of standard 4090 GPUs into a svelte 62 mm, 3-slot chassis—making it significantly more compatible with a wide range of custom mid-tower and full-tower PC enclosures. The card comes factory-tuned right out of the box to reach a blistering Extreme Performance boost clock of 2610 MHz via the MSI Center configuration console. Under sustained computational limits, thermodynamics are flawlessly managed by the premium TRI FROZR 3 cooling architecture. This system integrates three ring-bound TORX Fan 5.0 units engineered to maximize concentrated static air pressure, a solid nickel-plated copper baseplate, and precision squared core heat pipes. Complete with customizable Mystic Light RGB accents, zero-RPM Zero Frozr technology for absolute quiet during low-load desktop usage, dual HDMI 2.1a and DisplayPort 1.4a configurations, and elite DLSS 3 neural frame generation, it serves as the ultimate uncompromising weapon for hardcore gamers, creators, and AI engineers.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Ada Lovelace</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>16,384 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2595 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2610 MHz (via MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>24GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR6X</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>21 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>384-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express Gen 4.0 x16</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>2 x DisplayPort 1.4a, 2 x HDMI 2.1a (Supports 4K@120Hz &amp; 8K@60Hz HDR &amp; VRR)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Quad Display (Up to 4 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>450W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>1 x 16-pin (12VHPWR PCIe 5.0 connector)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>850W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>Software</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooler Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>TRI FROZR 3 Layout: 3 x TORX Fan 5.0 Thermal Assembly</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Protection</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Solid Nickel-plated Copper Baseplate &amp; Precision Squared Core Pipes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic &amp; Lighting</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Zero Frozr technology (Fans stop during low loads) &amp; Mystic Light RGB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Body Theme &amp; Profile</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Premium Slim Profile Cover Shroud with Flow-Through Ventilated Backplate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>322 x 136 x 62 mm (Case-Friendly 3-Slot Footprint)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Weight</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Net Card Weight: 1777 g / Gross Package Weight: 2652 g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>After-sales</td><td>3 Years Manufacturing Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/PXRSlSRxd9EfrSYVy1YjAgqgVaYbMPrYHb5pxHxa.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 16:30:36', '2026-07-12 16:30:36', 'MSI GeForce RTX 4090 GAMING X SLIM 24GB GDDR6X Price in BD | International Office Solution', 'Get the ultimate MSI GeForce RTX 4090 GAMING X SLIM 24GB GDDR6X graphics card at the best price in Bangladesh. Enjoy flagship Ada Lovelace performance and a case-friendly slim profile at International Office Solution.', 'MSI GeForce RTX 4090 GAMING X SLIM 24G, RTX 4090 Gaming X Slim price in Bangladesh, 24GB GDDR6X monster GPU BD, Ada Lovelace flagship desktop graphics card, International Office Solution.', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(1263, 'MSI GeForce RTX 4090 SUPRIM X 24G GDDR6X Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 4090 SUPRIM X 24G represents the absolute zenith of luxury engineering and extreme graphic processing performance. Powered by NVIDIA’s flagship Ada Lovelace architecture, it unleashes 16,384 streaming CUDA cores and a massive 24GB frame buffer of ultra-fast GDDR6X memory. Outfitted with a premium factory overclock reaching 2640 MHz via MSI Center and the state-of-the-art TRI FROZR 3S thermal assembly with a vapor chamber, it dominates 4K/8K enthusiast gaming, heavy local AI LLM fine-tuning, and high-tier cinematic rendering.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-4090-suprim-x-24g-gddr6x-graphics-card-1783873918', '<p>Turn your desktop workstation or enthusiast gaming configuration into a high-end masterpiece with the prestigious engineering of the MSI GeForce RTX 4090 SUPRIM X 24G GDDR6X Graphics Card. Forged directly on NVIDIA\'s flagship Ada Lovelace architecture, this absolute titan of a graphic accelerator coordinates 16,384 powerhouse streaming CUDA cores alongside a massive 24GB buffer of top-tier GDDR6X video memory. Operating at an effective memory clock speed of 21 Gbps across a colossal 384-bit memory bus width, it supplies a massive data bandwidth up to 1008 GB/s to seamlessly handle unmatched high-refresh 4K and 8K gaming resolutions, multi-million polygon 3D environment builds, and dense local AI modeling or deep learning pipelines without a single hint of micro-stuttering.</p><p>Designed with a breathtaking brushed metal shroud, geometric lines, and customizable light-strip styling, the SUPRIM X variant stands out as a true elite centerpiece option. The card comes factory-tuned right out of the box to reach a blistering Extreme Performance boost clock of 2640 MHz via the MSI Center configuration console. Under sustained computational limits, thermodynamics are flawlessly managed by the premium TRI FROZR 3S cooling architecture. This system integrates a massive liquid-filled vapor chamber mapped onto precision core heat pipes and three ring-linked TORX Fan 5.0 units engineered to maximize concentrated static air pressure. Complete with a robust Dual BIOS toggle switch for quick performance adjustments, zero-RPM Zero Frozr technology for silent desktop idling, three DisplayPort 1.4a outputs, one HDMI 2.1a port, and elite DLSS 3 neural frame generation, it serves as the ultimate uncompromising weapon for hardcore gamers, creators, and AI engineers.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the MSI GeForce RTX 4090 SUPRIM X 24G Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>288,900৳</strong>. You can secure this ultimate, high-end Ada Lovelace flagship GPU online through the official International Office Solution website, or get dedicated technical system integration advice by visiting any of our local physical corporate showrooms.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Ada Lovelace</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>16,384 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2625 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2640 MHz (via MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>24GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR6X</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>21 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>384-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express Gen 4.0 x16</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 1.4a, 1 x HDMI 2.1a (Supports 4K@120Hz &amp; 8K@60Hz HDR &amp; VRR)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Quad Display (Up to 4 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>450W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>1 x 16-pin (12VHPWR PCIe 5.0 connector)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>1000W (Min. 850W)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>Software</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooler Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>TRI FROZR 3S Layout: 3 x TORX Fan 5.0 &amp; Vapor Chamber</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Protection</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Premium Vented Metal Backplate with Dedicated Thermal Pads &amp; Dual BIOS</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic &amp; Lighting</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Zero Frozr technology (Fans stop during low loads) &amp; Mystic Light RGB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>336 x 142 x 78 mm (Premium Quad-Slot Footprint)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Weight</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Net Card Weight: 2413 g / Gross Package Weight: 3850 g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>After-sales</td><td>3 Years Manufacturing Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/VWkzziP2amGOm9e3nlE4u3Z89kg15Ro0fxAsPhrk.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 16:31:58', '2026-07-12 16:31:58', 'MSI GeForce RTX 4090 SUPRIM X 24G Price in BD | International Office Solution', 'MSI GeForce RTX 4090 SUPRIM X 24G, RTX 4090 Suprim X price in Bangladesh, 24GB GDDR6X flagship GPU BD, luxury desktop graphics card, International Office Solution.', 'Get the premium MSI GeForce RTX 4090 SUPRIM X