(1264, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G VANGUARD SOC 32GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G VANGUARD SOC stands as the ultimate graphic processing titan, uniting NVIDIA’s groundbreaking Blackwell architecture with a staggering 32GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory. Featuring a colossal 512-bit bus interface, 21,760 processing CUDA cores, and an Extreme Performance factory overclock touching 2527 MHz via MSI Center, this absolute powerhouse leverages a quad-slot HYPER FROZR triple-fan array to obliterate all computational boundaries across extreme 8K gaming, complex 3D rendering pipelines, and deep local AI LLM fine-tuning.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5090-32g-vanguard-soc-32gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783873999', '<p>Unleash the supreme apex of modern visual computing and hyper-realistic rendering loops with the flagship engineering of the MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G VANGUARD SOC 32GB GDDR7 Graphics Card. Forged directly on NVIDIA\'s foundational Blackwell architecture, this absolute monster of a graphic accelerator coordinates an unprecedented 21,760 streaming CUDA cores alongside a massive 32GB frame buffer of next-generation GDDR7 video memory. Operating at a blistering memory speed of 28 Gbps across a colossal 512-bit memory interface, it supplies an unmatched data bandwidth up to 1792 GB/s, completely dissolving memory barriers to effortlessly handle real-time path-traced ray tracing, fluid ultra-refresh competitive frames, massive data-parallel simulations, and massive local AI training pipelines without a hint of latency.</p><p>Standing proud as the ultimate premium centerpiece for elite desktop computers, the VANGUARD SOC series represents rugged structural luxury and extreme overclocking stability, coming factory-tuned right out of the box to reach a boosted Extreme Performance clock of 2527 MHz via the MSI Center console. The enormous thermodynamic output is flawlessly managed by the state-of-the-art HYPER FROZR thermal assembly. This massive quad-slot structure integrates a liquid-filled advanced vapor chamber, direct-contact square core heat pipes, Wave Curved 4.0 heatsink matrices, and an Air Antegrade Fin 2.0 system driven by three high-static-pressure claw-textured STORMFORCE fans. Complete with a robust Dual BIOS performance toggle switch, zero-RPM Zero Frozr technology for silent desktop operations, premium carbon fiber styling with ambient RGB accents, next-generation DisplayPort 2.1b connectivity, and elite hardware acceleration for DLSS 4.5 frame generation, it serves as the definitive tool for hardcore enthusiasts, corporate engineers, and data scientists.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G VANGUARD SOC Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>388,000৳</strong>. You can secure this ultimate flagship Blackwell GPU online through the official International Office Solution website, or get dedicated technical system integration advice by visiting any of our physical corporate showrooms.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>21,760 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2512 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2527 MHz (via MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>32GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>28 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>512-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5.0 x16</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 2.1b, 1 x HDMI 2.1b (Supports 4K@480Hz / 8K@120Hz with DSC)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Quad Display (Up to 4 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>575W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>1 x 16-pin (ATX 3.1 PSU highly recommended)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>1000W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>Software</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooler Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>HYPER FROZR Design: 3 x STORMFORCE Fans &amp; Advanced Vapor Chamber</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Protection</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Core Pipes, Filled Fins, Wave Curved 4.0 &amp; Air Antegrade Fin 2.0</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic &amp; System Control</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Zero Frozr acoustic control &amp; Hardware Dual BIOS Switch</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Body Theme &amp; Profile</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Sci-Fi Spaceship Contoured Shroud with Futuristic Vented Metal Backplate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>357 x 151 x 76 mm (Premium Quad-Slot Footprint)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Weight</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Net Card Weight: 2407 g / Gross Package Weight: 3302 g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>After-sales</td><td>3 Years Manufacturing Warranty (No Warranty for Mining)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/SmDxQUdb9fekrOgqbed3nQBQrjGThesP3ywPtkXr.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 16:33:19', '2026-07-12 16:33:19', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G VANGUARD SOC Price in BD | International Office Solution', 'Get the absolute pinnacle of GPU performance with the MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G VANGUARD SOC 32GB GDDR7 graphics card at the best price in Bangladesh. Uncompromising Blackwell architecture and flagship HYPER FROZR cooling at International Office Solution.', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G VANGUARD SOC, RTX 5090 Vanguard price in Bangladesh, 32GB GDDR7 desktop GPU BD, Blackwell flagship graphics card, International Office Solution.', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(1265, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G SUPRIM LIQUID SOC 32GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G SUPRIM LIQUID SOC reigns as the definitive masterpiece of graphic computing, fusing NVIDIA’s flagship Blackwell architecture with a premium closed-loop hybrid liquid cooling system. Weaponized with a massive 32GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 VRAM across a 512-bit bus, 21,760 processing CUDA cores, and a factory-overclocked boost touching a blistering 2580 MHz via MSI Center, this elite dual-slot card pairs with a 360mm aluminum radiator to deliver unmatched cooling efficiency for extreme 8K gaming, heavy machine learning, and cinematic rendering.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5090-32g-suprim-liquid-soc-32gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783874110', '<p>Unleash the absolute apex of desktop computing power and thermal engineering with the prestigious MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G SUPRIM LIQUID SOC 32GB GDDR7 Graphics Card. Forged directly on NVIDIA\'s revolutionary Blackwell architecture, this flagship graphic titan coordinates an unprecedented 21,760 powerhouse streaming CUDA cores with a massive 32GB frame buffer of next-generation GDDR7 video memory. Operating at a blistering memory speed of 28 Gbps across a colossal 512-bit bus interface, it supplies a massive, unrestricted data bandwidth of up to 1792 GB/s to seamlessly handle deep local AI training pipelines, multi-million polygon 3D environment builds, and hyper-realistic path-traced gaming workloads without a single hint of micro-stuttering.</p><p>Dressed in a luxury brushed-metal enclosure with mirror-polished beveled diamond facets and geometric lines, the SUPRIM LIQUID SOC stands apart by replacing traditional bulky air fins with a streamlined, space-conscious 2.5-slot profile. Underneath, a patented water block design redirects heat from the GPU and VRAM through a high-performance automotive-grade pump loop out to a massive 360 mm aluminum radiator assembly, cooled silently by low-noise, claw-textured STORMFORCE fans. Complete with a hardware Dual BIOS toggle switch for quick performance tuning, zero-RPM Zero Frozr technology for absolute quiet during low loads, premium DrMOS power stages, future-proof DisplayPort 2.1b connectivity, and elite DLSS 4.5 frame generation, it serves as the ultimate uncompromising tool for enthusiast PC configurations.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G SUPRIM LIQUID SOC Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>398,000৳</strong>. You can secure this ultimate hybrid-cooled flagship Blackwell GPU online through the official International Office Solution website, or get dedicated technical system integration advice by visiting any of our local physical showroo</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>21,760 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2565 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2580 MHz (via MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>32GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>28 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>512-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5.0 x16</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 2.1b, 1 x HDMI 2.1b (Supports 4K@480Hz / 8K@120Hz with DSC)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Quad Display (Up to 4 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>600W (Gaming Mode) / 575W (Silent Mode)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>1 x 16-pin (ATX 3.1 PSU highly recommended)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>1000W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>Software</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooler Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Next-Gen Hybrid System: Closed-Loop Water Block + On-Card Air Fan</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Radiator Assembly</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>360mm Aluminum Radiator with High-Pressure STORMFORCE Fans</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Optimization</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Micro-fin Copper Base, Automotive-grade pump, Scratch-proof Braided Tubes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic &amp; System Control</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Zero Frozr technology &amp; Hardware Dual BIOS Switch</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Card Dimensions</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Card: 280 x 148 x 51 mm (Space-saving 2.5-Slot Profile)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Radiator Dimensions</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Radiator: 394 x 121 x 55 mm (Tube length: 450mm)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Weight</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Net Card Weight: 2969 g / Gross Package Weight: 4273 g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>After-sales</td><td>3 Years Manufacturing Warranty (No Warranty for Mining)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/SuBqRW6d4Ij6zVcmwLevH5b15XXba9U7S7E5A68a.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 16:35:10', '2026-07-12 16:35:10', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G SUPRIM LIQUID SOC Price in BD | International Office Solution', 'Get the absolute pinnacle of GPU performance with the MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G SUPRIM LIQUID SOC 32GB GDDR7 graphics card at the best price in Bangladesh. Uncompromising Blackwell architecture and elite hybrid liquid cooling at International Office Solution.', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G SUPRIM LIQUID SOC, RTX 5090 Suprim Liquid price in Bangladesh, 32GB GDDR7 water cooled GPU BD, Blackwell flagship graphics card, International Office Solution.', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(1266, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G VENTUS 3X OC 32GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G VENTUS 3X OC reigns as a graphic processing titan, bringing NVIDIA’s next-generation Blackwell architecture into a highly resilient triple-fan ecosystem. Weaponized with a staggering 32GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory over a colossal 512-bit bus, 21,760 processing CUDA cores, and a factory overclock hitting 2452 MHz via MSI Center, it leverages a heavy-duty TORX Fan 5.0 cooling array to deliver flawless high-framerate 8K rendering, complex local AI acceleration, and uncompromised enthusiast gaming.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5090-32g-ventus-3x-oc-32gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783874168', '<p>Unleash the supreme pinnacle of digital computing speeds and bleeding-edge graphic processing with the mainstream flagship engineering of the MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G VENTUS 3X OC 32GB GDDR7 Graphics Card. Purpose-engineered on NVIDIA\'s revolutionary Blackwell architecture, this absolute powerhouse coordinates an unprecedented 21,760 streaming CUDA cores with a massive 32GB buffer of next-generation GDDR7 video memory. Operating at an effective memory clock speed of 28 Gbps across a colossal 512-bit bus interface, it supplies a massive, unrestricted data bandwidth up to 1792 GB/s to seamlessly support immersive real-time path-traced ray tracing, competitive ultra-refresh frames, and deep local generative AI learning workloads without a hint of micro-stuttering.</p><p>Designed with a clean, professional black and silver industrial enclosure, this specialized VENTUS 3X OC variant focuses strictly on the performance essentials while coming factory-tuned right out of the box to reach a boosted Extreme Performance clock of 2452 MHz via the MSI Center console. Enormous thermodynamic output is perfectly sustained by an advanced triple-fan array utilizing TORX Fan 5.0 units, which feature ring-bound blade arcs designed to focus high-pressure static airflow directly down into the custom heatsink block. Enhanced further with a solid nickel-plated copper baseplate, precision squared core heat pipes, Air Antegrade Fin 2.0 thermal arrays, and zero-RPM Zero Frozr technology for silent desktop idling, it delivers superior structural longevity and premium system stability while drawing power from a single, future-proof 16-pin power connection.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G VENTUS 3X OC Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>365,000৳</strong>. You can check genuine stock availability or place an order online through the official International Office Solution website, or get dedicated technical assembly advice by visiting any of our local physical corporate showrooms.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>21,760 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2437 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2452 MHz (via MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>32GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>28 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>512-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5.0 x16</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 2.1b, 1 x HDMI 2.1b (Supports 4K@480Hz / 8K@120Hz with DSC)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><str