(1267, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G GAMING TRIO OC 32GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G GAMING TRIO OC stands as the ultimate graphic processing titan, uniting NVIDIA’s groundbreaking Blackwell architecture with a staggering 32GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory. Featuring a colossal 512-bit bus interface, 21,760 processing CUDA cores, and an Extreme Performance factory overclock touching 2497 MHz via MSI Center, this absolute powerhouse leverages a triple-fan TRI FROZR 4 cooling array with a nickel-plated copper baseplate to obliterate all computational boundaries across extreme 8K gaming, heavy local AI LLM fine-tuning, and professional 3D rendering.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5090-32g-gaming-trio-oc-32gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783874239', '<p>he flagship engineering of the MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G GAMING TRIO OC 32GB GDDR7 Graphics Card. Forged directly on NVIDIA\'s foundational Blackwell architecture, this absolute monster of a graphic accelerator coordinates an unprecedented 21,760 powerhouse streaming CUDA cores alongside a massive 32GB frame buffer of next-generation GDDR7 video memory. Operating at a blistering memory speed of 28 Gbps across a colossal 512-bit memory interface, it supplies an unmatched data bandwidth up to 1792 GB/s, completely dissolving memory barriers to effortlessly handle real-time path-traced ray tracing, fluid ultra-refresh competitive frames, massive data-parallel simulations, and heavy generative AI model training pipelines without a hint of latency.</p><p>Standing proud as the ultimate premium centerpiece for elite desktop computers, the GAMING TRIO OC series represents rugged structural luxury and extreme overclocking stability, coming factory-tuned right out of the box to reach a boosted Extreme Performance clock of 2497 MHz via the MSI Center console. The enormous thermodynamic output is flawlessly managed by the state-of-the-art TRI FROZR 4 thermal assembly. This massive 3.5-slot structure integrates a liquid-filled advanced vapor chamber, direct-contact square core heat pipes, Wave Curved 4.0 heatsink matrices, and an Air Antegrade Fin 2.0 system driven by three high-static-pressure claw-textured STORMFORCE fans. Complete with a hardware Dual BIOS performance toggle switch, zero-RPM Zero Frozr technology for silent desktop operations, premium contoured shroud styling with ambient RGB accents, next-generation DisplayPort 2.1b connectivity, and elite hardware acceleration for DLSS 4.5 frame generation, it serves as the definitive tool for hardcore enthusiasts, corporate engineers, and data scientists.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G GAMING TRIO OC Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>495,000৳</strong>. You can secure this ultimate flagship Blackwell GPU online through the official International Office Solution website, or get dedicated technical system integration advice by visiting any of our physical corporate showrooms.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>21,760 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2482 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2497 MHz (via MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>32GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>28 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>512-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5.0 x16</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &