 TRIO OC 32GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'Get the absolute pinnacle of GPU performance with the MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G GAMING TRIO OC 32GB GDDR7 graphics card at the best price in Bangladesh. Uncompromising Blackwell architecture and flagship TRI FROZR 4 cooling at International Office Solution.', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5090 32G GAMING TRIO OC, RTX 5090 Gaming Trio OC price in Bangladesh, 32GB GDDR7 gaming GPU BD, Blackwell flagship graphics card, International Office Solution.', NULL, 14, NULL, NULL),
(1268, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G SHADOW 2X OC PLUS 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G SHADOW 2X OC PLUS delivers an elite balance of next-generation speed and compact architecture, powered directly by NVIDIA\'s advanced Blackwell architecture. Outfitted with 4,608 processing CUDA cores, a factory overclock reaching an extreme 2617 MHz via MSI Center, and a massive 16GB buffer of ultra-fast GDDR7 video memory, this agile dual-fan card eliminates memory bottlenecks to ensure seamless high-refresh 1440p gaming, pro-tier streaming, and smooth local AI generation.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5060-ti-16g-shadow-2x-oc-plus-16gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783874383', '<p>Bring immense visual computing speeds and highly efficient thermal design to your custom desktop layout with the premium engineering of the MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G SHADOW 2X OC PLUS 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card. Precision-built on NVIDIA\'s cutting-edge Blackwell architecture, this mainstream graphic accelerator coordinates 4,608 powerhouse streaming CUDA cores with a generous 16GB frame buffer of next-generation GDDR7 video memory. Operating at a blistering memory speed of 28 Gbps across a 128-bit bus interface, it unlocks massive high-speed data bandwidth to handle real-time path-traced ray tracing, smooth competitive esports frames, complex multimedia creation timelines, and deep local generative AI pipelines without a hint of stuttering.</p><p>Designed with a clean, stealthy matte black enclosure, this specialized SHADOW 2X OC PLUS variant comes factory-optimized right out of the box to touch an Extreme Performance boost clock of 2617 MHz via the MSI Center console. The integrated thermal solution utilizes a highly compact dual-fan configuration equipped with advanced STORMFORCE fans. These units feature seven uniquely claw-textured blades bound by a circular arc to focus high-pressure static airflow directly down onto flat-profile core pipes and an optimized heatsink block. Enhanced with zero-RPM Zero Frozr technology for dead-silent desktop idling, high-efficiency DrMOS power stages, future-proof DisplayPort 2.1b connections, and a ventilated structural metal backplate, it provides immense build compatibility and structural longevity inside a space-conscious dual-slot footprint.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G SHADOW 2X OC PLUS Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>68,500৳</strong>. You can secure this dependable, compact dual-fan Blackwell GPU online via the official International Office Solution website, or get dedicated technical system integration advice by visiting any of our physical corporate showrooms.</p><h3>Technical Specifications</h3>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>4,608 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2602 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2617 MHz (via MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>28 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5.0 x16 (runs at x8 mode)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 2.1b, 1 x HDMI 2.1b (Supports 4K@480Hz / 8K@120Hz with DSC)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Quad Display (Up to 4 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>180W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>1 x 8-pin PCIe</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>600W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>Software</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooler Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>SHADOW 2X Setup: Dual Fan Layout with STORMFORCE technology</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Protection</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Precision Core Heatpipes, Premium Clay-Based Thermal Pads &amp; DrMOS</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Management</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Zero Frozr technology (Fans completely stop under low loads)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Body Theme &amp; Profile</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Stealth Matte Black Cover Shroud with Flow-Through Ventilated Metal Backplate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>226 x 126 x 41 mm (Compact Dual-Slot Footprint)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Weight</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Net Card Weight: 578 g / Gross Package Weight: 851 g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>After-sales</td><td>3 Years Manufacturing Warranty (No Warranty for Mining)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/Xj0yDspUYmwnxmh1MFMy6A7qg1eFFxhWLjZF0Bkx.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 16:39:43', '2026-07-12 16:39:43', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G SHADOW 2X OC PLUS 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'Get the official MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G SHADOW 2X OC PLUS 16GB GDDR7 graphics card at the best price in Bangladesh. Experience next-gen Blackwell power and compact dual-fan efficiency at International Office Solution