(1269, 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G VENTUS 3X OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G VENTUS 3X OC perfectly balances elite next-generation architecture with full-sized thermal efficiency, driven by NVIDIA\'s advanced Blackwell architecture. Armed with 4,608 processing CUDA cores, a generous 16GB buffer of ultra-fast GDDR7 video memory, and a factory overclock hitting an extreme 2617 MHz via MSI Center, this triple-fan card completely removes memory limitations to guarantee smooth high-refresh 1440p gaming, multi-display productivity, and seamless local AI processing.', 'msi-geforce-rtx-5060-ti-16g-ventus-3x-oc-16gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783874897', '<p>Inject immense visual processing speeds and dependable industrial styling into your custom desktop configuration with the premium mainstream engineering of the MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G VENTUS 3X OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card. Engineered on NVIDIA\'s cutting-edge Blackwell architecture, this high-performance graphics accelerator coordinates 4,608 powerhouse streaming CUDA cores with an expansive 16GB buffer of next-generation GDDR7 video memory. Operating at a blistering memory speed of 28 Gbps across a 128-bit bus interface, it supplies a massive data bandwidth to seamlessly support fluid path-traced ray tracing, competitive high-refresh esports gameplay, complex video rendering timelines, and deep local generative AI pipelines without micro-stuttering.</p><p>Dressed in a clean, minimalist black and grey industrial cover shroud with a reinforced flow-through metal backplate, this custom VENTUS 3X OC variant is factory-tuned right out of the box to touch an Extreme Performance boost clock of 2617 MHz via the MSI Center console. The integrated thermal solution utilizes a heavy-duty triple-fan cooling array equipped with advanced TORX Fan 5.0 units. These fans feature paired outer ring arcs designed to focus high-pressure static airflow directly down into flat-profile core pipes and a solid copper baseplate. Complete with zero-RPM Zero Frozr technology for silent desktop idling, efficient power stages running off a standard 8-pin PCIe connector, and future-proof DisplayPort 2.1b connectivity supporting elite DLSS 4.5 frame generation, it serves as the ultimate future-ready centerpiece for standard mid-tower configurations.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G VENTUS 3X OC Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>86,000৳</strong>. You can check genuine stock availability or place an order online through the official International Office Solution website, or get dedicated technical assembly advice by visiting any of our local physical showrooms.</p>', '<h3>Technical Specifications</h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>4,608 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 2602 MHz / Extreme Performance: 2617 MHz (via MSI Center)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>28 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express Gen 5.0 x16 (runs at x8 mode)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 2.1b, 1 x HDMI 2.1b (Supports 4K@480Hz / 8K@120Hz with DSC)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Quad Display (Up to 4 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>180W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>1 x 8-pin PCIe</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>600W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>Software</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooler Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>VENTUS 3X Setup: Triple TORX Fan 5.0 Thermal Assembly</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Protection</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Solid Copper Baseplate &amp; Precision Flat Core Heatpipes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Management</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Zero Frozr technology (Fans completely stop under low loads)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Body Theme &amp; Profile</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Black &amp; Grey Industrial Cover Shroud with Flow-Through Ventilated Backplate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>306 x 121 x 44 mm (Enthusiast Triple-Fan Footprint)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Weight</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Net Card Weight: 860 g / Gross Package Weight: 1229 g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>After-sales</td><td>3 Years Manufacturing Warranty (No Warranty for Mining)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/Ca7gdMQpzBorKyWNulab1LHE3zkmNZ8yWWxkq5rH.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 16:48:17', '2026-07-12 16:48:17', 'MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G VENTUS 3X OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'Get the official MSI GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16G VENTUS 3X OC 16GB GDDR7 graphics card at the best price in Bangladesh. Experience next-gen Blackwell power and premium triple TORX Fan 5.0 efficiency at International Office 