(1270, 'ASUS GeForce GT 710 2GB GDDR5 EVO Low-profile Graphics Card', 'The ASUS GeForce GT 710 2GB GDDR5 EVO Low-profile graphics card provides a silent, cost-effective multimedia upgrade for small form factor systems and quiet home theater setups. Engineered with true 0dB passive cooling and premium Auto-Extreme automated manufacturing, this ultra-compact card includes HDMI, DVI-D, and D-Sub outputs to drive up to three multi-monitor workspaces efficiently without adding fan noise or excessive power draw.', 'asus-geforce-gt-710-2gb-gddr5-evo-low-profile-graphics-card-1783875129', '<h4>Long Description</h4><p>Enhance your compact workplace setups, home theater PCs (HTPC), and multi-monitor productivity workflows with the silent operations of the ASUS GeForce GT 710 2GB GDDR5 EVO Low-profile Graphics Card. Purpose-built to offer a highly reliable and power-efficient alternative to entry-level integrated processors, this low-profile hardware component houses 192 streaming CUDA cores combined with a dedicated 2GB layout of fast GDDR5 video memory. Operating at a clock speed of 5012 MHz over a standard 64-bit bus interface, the inclusion of GDDR5 architecture supplies noticeably smoother rendering timelines, responsive UI navigation, and faster HD media streaming playback than traditional older DDR3 variants.</p><p>Dressed in a robust, compact dual-slot frame with an industrial gray finish, this EVO variant stands out by utilizing a large passive heatsink structure that completely removes mechanical cooling fans to achieve absolute 0dB quiet. Built via automated Auto-Extreme Technology to reduce thermal strain and maximize component longevity, it features high-grade stainless steel IO brackets and full compatibility with the intuitive ASUS GPU Tweak III utility for clean system status monitoring. Outfitted natively with individual HDMI 1.4b, DVI-D, and old-school D-Sub (VGA) connectors, it drives up to three separate independent displays concurrently, rendering it the ultimate space-saving asset for small form factor desktop shells and compact workstations.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the ASUS GeForce GT 710 2GB GDDR5 EVO Low-profile Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>7,500৳</strong>. You can easily purchase this ultra-quiet, energy-efficient multi-display GPU online via the official International Office Solution website, or get dedicated compatibility advice by visiting any of our local physical showrooms.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce GT 710</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>192 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Engine Core Clock</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>954 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>2GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>5012 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>64-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express 2.0 x16</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>1 x Native HDMI 1.4b, 1 x Native DVI-D, 1 x D-Sub (VGA)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>3840 x 2160 (4K UHD via HDMI)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Triple Display (Up to 3 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>~19W to 25W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>None (Fully bus-powered)</t