(1275, 'ASUS Dual Radeon RX 6500 XT V2 OC Edition 4GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The ASUS Dual Radeon RX 6500 XT V2 OC Edition 4GB GDDR6 graphics card delivers reliable 1080p eSports performance packed into a case-friendly, 2-slot footprint. Engineered on AMD\'s efficient RDNA 2 architecture, it features 1,024 stream processors and a factory-overclocked boost clock touching 2820 MHz. Outfitted with dual high-static-pressure Axial-tech fans, premium Auto-Extreme automated manufacturing, and a protective rigid backplate, it supplies fantastic budget-friendly thermal durability for space-conscious setups.', 'asus-dual-radeon-rx-6500-xt-v2-oc-edition-4gb-gddr6-graphics-card-1783876798', '<p>ring crisp high-definition visuals and structural longevity to your mid-tier desktop ecosystem with the streamlined engineering of the ASUS Dual Radeon RX 6500 XT V2 OC Edition 4GB GDDR6 Graphics Card. Purpose-built on AMD\'s high-efficiency RDNA 2 architecture, this dependable graphics accelerator coordinates 1,024 processing stream processors alongside a dedicated 4GB buffer of high-speed GDDR6 video memory. Operating over a 64-bit bus interface at an effective memory clock speed of 18 Gbps, it utilizes high-bandwidth AMD Infinity Cache technology to ensure smooth, high-refresh 1080p frames, fluid UI workflows, and steady performance across mainstream competitive eSports titles without overheating.</p><p>Dressed in a clean, minimalist black and dark gray cover shroud, this V2 OC variant stands out by condensing immense cooling power into a compact, space-saving 2-slot profile that leaves ample breathing room for micro-ATX and mini-ITX motherboard layouts. Thermodynamic dissipation is masterfully handled by an advanced dual-fan configuration utilizing premium Axial-tech fan blades. These units integrate a smaller hub assembly for elongated blades alongside an outer barrier ring designed to focus concentrated air pressure directly into the aluminum heatsink fins. Complete with zero-decibel 0dB technology that completely halts the fans during low-load desktop idling, an automated Auto-Extreme manufacturing workflow to minimize structural stress points, and native dual display configurations through HDMI 2.1 and DisplayPort 1.4a outputs, it serves as the ultimate, power-efficient upgrade for home workstations and budget gaming rigs alike.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the ASUS Dual Radeon RX 6500 XT V2 OC Edition 4GB GDDR6 Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>25,500৳</strong>. You can secure this dependable, dual-fan RDNA 2 GPU online via the official International Office Solution website, or drop by any of our local physical corporate showrooms for dedicated configuration support.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>AMD RDNA 2</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Stream Processors</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>1,024 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td><p>OC Mode: Up to 2820 MHz (Boost) / 2670 MHz (Game Clock)</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>Gaming Mode: Up to 2820 MHz (Boost) / 2650 MHz (Game Clock)</p></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>4GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>18 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>64-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express 4.0 x16</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>1 x Native HDMI 2.1, 1 x Native DisplayPort 1.4a (HDCP 2.3 Support)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Dual Display (Up to 2 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>~107W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>1 x 6-pin PCIe</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>500W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>Software</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooler Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Dual-Fan Setup with High-Efficiency Axial-tech Blades</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Management</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>0dB Technology (Fans completely stop below 50°C)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Structural Protection</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Solid Rigid Backplate &amp; High-Strength Stainless Steel IO Bracket</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>201 x 128 x 40 mm (Compact 2-Slot Footprint)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>System Software</strong></td><td>Management</td><td>ASUS GPU Tweak III &amp; Dedicated Radeon Software Drivers</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>After-sales</td><td>3 Years Manufacturing Replacement Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 25500.00, 25500.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/DpRbVP3pYjqeVFqgecJytmAsSe1A0MgqIkIsNjW8.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 17:19:58', '2026-07-12 17:19:58', 'ASUS Dual Radeon RX 6500 XT V2 OC Edition 4GB Price in BD | International Office Solution', 'ASUS Dual Radeon RX 6500 XT V2 OC Edition 4GB Price in BD | International Office Solution', 'ASUS Dual Radeon RX 6500 XT V2 OC, RX 6500 XT V2 price in Bangladesh, 4GB GDDR6 budget gaming GPU BD, AMD RDNA 2 desktop graphics card, International Office Solution.', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1276, 'ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 3050 6GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 3050 6GB GDDR6 graphics card brings reliable entry-level ray tracing and high-efficiency 1080p gaming performance to space-conscious setups. Engineered on NVIDIA\'s Ampere architecture with 2,304 CUDA cores, it features an optimized 6GB buffer of GDDR6 memory that runs entirely bus-powered without requiring external PCIe power connectors. Fitted with dual IP5X dust-resistant fans and a compact 2-slot shroud, it provides exceptional thermal durability for mini-ITX and small form factor desktop systems.', 'asus-dual-geforce-rtx-3050-6gb-gddr6-graphics-card-1783876909', '<p>Bring highly efficient visual computing power and space-saving layout convenience to your custom desktop configuration with the streamlined engineering of the ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 3050 6GB GDDR6 Graphics Card. Built directly on NVIDIA\'s power-optimized Ampere architecture, this agile graphics accelerator coordinates 2,304 powerhouse streaming CUDA cores with a dedicated 6GB buffer of GDDR6 video memory. Operating over a 96-bit memory interface at an effective memory clock speed of 14 Gbps, it leverages 2nd Generation RT Cores and 3rd Generation Tensor Cores to unlock fluid real-time ray tracing and advanced AI-accelerated performance via DLSS neural frame upscale matrices—perfect for smooth 1080p eSports gaming and fast multimedia creation timelines.</p><p>Dressed in a clean, minimalist black cover shroud, this specialized Dual variant stands out by operating at an ultra-low 70W thermal design profile ($TDP$), meaning it pulls all necessary operating current directly from the motherboard\'s PCIe slot with zero need for extra 6-pin or 8-pin power cabling from your PSU. The integrated thermal solution utilizes a compact 2-slot design packed with dual high-static-pressure fans boasting IP5X dust resistance, ensuring particle protection and long-term spin stability. Complete with automated Auto-Extreme manufacturing to reduce environmental strain on the PCB, a rigid stainless steel IO bracket, and versatile legacy video output configurations including native HDMI 2.1, DisplayPort 1.4a, and DVI-D, it serves as the ultimate hassle-free, power-efficient upgrade for entry-level gaming rigs and compact office workstations.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 3050 6GB GDDR6 Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>30,000৳</strong>. You can check genuine stock availability or place an order online through the official International Office Solution website, or get dedicated technical system integration advice by visiting any of our local physical showrooms.</p>', '<h3>Technical Specifications</h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Ampere</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>2,304 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost: 1507 MHz / OC Mode Boost: 1537 MHz (via GPU Tweak III)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>6GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>14 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>96-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express 4.0 x8</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>1 x Native HDMI 2.1, 1 x Native DisplayPort 1.4a, 1 x Native DVI-D</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Triple Display (Up to 3 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>70W (Ultra-low power draw)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>None (Fully bus-powered via motherboard PCIe slot)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>450W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>Software</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooler Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Dual-Fan Setup with IP5X Dust Resistance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Management</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Silent Desktop Profile (Fans adjust intelligently to thermal load)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Manufacturing Build</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Auto-Extreme Technology Fully Automated Production &amp; Rigid Structure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCB Form Factor</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Compact 2-Slot Compatible Shroud</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>201 x 120 x 37 mm (Compact Mid/Small Chassis Footprint)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>System Software</strong></td><td>Management</td><td>ASUS GPU Tweak III &amp; NVIDIA GeForce Game Ready Drivers</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>After-sales</td><td>3 Years Manufacturing Replacement Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 32900.00, 32900.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/YIqkm4dn1HzvDVwne34IwjAOzoOLgXOe8dDVCNIB.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 17:21:49', '2026-07-12 17:21:49', 'ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 3050 6GB GDDR6 Price in BD | International Office Solution', 'Get the authentic ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 3050 6GB GDDR6 graphics card at the best price in Bangladesh. Enjoy power-efficient 1080p gaming with NVIDIA Ampere architecture and dual IP5X fans at International Office Solution.', 'ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 3050 6GB, RTX 3050 6GB price in Bangladesh, 6GB GDDR6 budget gaming GPU BD, Ampere desktop graphics card, International Office Solution.', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL);
