(1277, 'ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 3050 OC Edition 6GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 3050 OC Edition 6GB GDDR6 graphics card brings enhanced, factory-overclocked speeds to a power-efficient 1080p workspace ecosystem. Built on NVIDIA\'s high-efficiency Ampere architecture with 2,304 processing CUDA cores, this specialized OC edition runs entirely bus-powered without requiring external PSU cable connections. Featuring an optimized 6GB buffer of GDDR6 memory, an aggressive 1537 MHz boost clock via GPU Tweak III, and dual IP5X dust-resistant fans, it supplies premium thermal durability inside a space-saving 2-slot design.', 'asus-dual-geforce-rtx-3050-oc-edition-6gb-gddr6-graphics-card-1783876984', '<h4>Long Description</h4><p>Unlock fluid entry-level ray tracing, high-refresh eSports gaming, and efficient multimedia creation workflows with the factory-tuned engineering of the ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 3050 OC Edition 6GB GDDR6 Graphics Card. Meticulously constructed on NVIDIA\'s power-optimized Ampere architecture, this agile graphics accelerator coordinates 2,304 powerhouse streaming CUDA cores alongside a dedicated 6GB buffer of GDDR6 video memory. Operating over a tight 96-bit memory interface at a memory clock speed of 14 Gbps, it utilizes 2nd Gen RT Cores and 3rd Gen Tensor Cores to comfortably unleash fluid real-time ray-traced lighting effects and advanced AI-powered scaling through DLSS neural frame generation—rendering modern titles smoothly at 1080p resolution.</p><p>Dressed in a clean, professional black cover shroud, this specialized OC Edition stands out by coming pre-optimized right out of the box to achieve a blistering 1537 MHz boost clock in OC mode. Operating at a highly efficient 70W thermal design footprint ($TDP$), it draws all necessary operating current directly from the motherboard\'s motherboard PCIe slot, eliminating the need for extra 6-pin or 8-pin power cables. Thermodynamics are masterfully sustained by a compact 2-slot cooling assembly packed with dual high-static-pressure fans carrying IP5X dust resistance to secure internal spinner longevity against particle accumulation. Complete with premium Auto-Extreme automated manufacturing for long-term structural reliability, a rigid stainless steel IO bracket, and versatile legacy video output configurations including native HDMI 2.1, DisplayPort 1.4a, and DVI-D, it represents the ultimate hassle-free choice for small form factor (SFF) desktop shells and office systems.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 3050 OC Edition 6GB GDDR6 Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>31,500৳</strong>. You can easily check genuine stock availability or place an order online via the official International Office Solution website, or get dedicated technical system configuration advice by visiting any of our local physical showrooms.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Ampere</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>2,304 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>OC Mode Boost: 1537 MHz / Default Mode Boost: 1507 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>6GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>14 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>96-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express 4.0 x8</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>1 x Native HDMI 2.1, 1 x Native DisplayPort 1.4a, 1 x Native DVI-D</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Triple Display (Up to 3 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>70W (Highly power-efficient setup)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>None (Fully bus-powered via PCIe slot)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>450W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>Software</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooler Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Dual-Fan Setup with IP5X Dust Resistance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Management</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Intelligent Fan Profile (Fans scale down under minimal loads)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Manufacturing Build</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Auto-Extreme Technology Fully Automated Production &amp; Rigid Architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCB Form Factor</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Compact 2-Slot Space-Saving Shroud</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>201 x 120 x 37 mm (Compact Mid/Small Chassis Footprint)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>System Software</strong></td><td>Management</td><td>ASUS GPU Tweak III &amp; NVIDIA GeForce Game Ready Drivers</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>After-sales</td><td>3 Years Manufacturing Replacement Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 32500.00, 32500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/3Yo0Jno8EaCmpT468KDdcXrPVzpriltopk0QjzIi.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 17:23:04', '2026-07-12 17:23:04', 'ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 3050 OC Edition 6GB GDDR6 Price in BD | International Office Solution', 'Get the authentic ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 3050 OC Edition 6GB GDDR6 graphics card at the best price in Bangladesh. Enjoy power-efficient 1080p performance with Ampere architecture, factory overclocking, and dual IP5X fans at International Office Solution.', 'ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 3050 OC 6GB, RTX 3050 6GB OC price in Bangladesh, 6GB GDDR6 budget gaming GPU BD, Ampere factory overclocked graphics card, International Office Solution.', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1278, 'ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 3050 V2 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 3050 V2 8GB GDDR6 graphics card brings balanced 1080p gaming and efficient multitasking workflows to mainstream desktop ecosystems. Engineered on NVIDIA\'s high-efficiency Ampere architecture, it features 2,560 CUDA cores and a full 8GB buffer of GDDR6 memory to easily eliminate asset bottlenecks. Outfitted with dual high-static-pressure Axial-tech fans, a space-saving 2-slot design, and an efficient 1x 6-pin power setup, it delivers exceptional structural and thermal durability for compact gaming configurations.', 'asus-dual-geforce-rtx-3050-v2-8gb-gddr6-graphics-card-1783877070', '<p>Bring highly stable visual processing speeds, ample video memory capacity, and reliable cooling performance to your custom workspace with the specialized engineering of the ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 3050 V2 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card. Purpose-built on NVIDIA\'s power-optimized Ampere architecture, this agile graphics accelerator coordinates 2,560 processing CUDA cores alongside an expansive 8GB buffer of GDDR6 video memory. Operating over a 128-bit memory interface at an effective memory clock speed of 14 Gbps, its dedicated 8GB frame buffer supplies noticeably smoother textures, responsive high-refresh UI navigation, and fast web browsing timelines across multiple window layouts. It fully leverages 2nd Gen RT Cores and 3rd Gen Tensor Cores to unlock fluid real-time ray-traced lighting and advanced AI upscale matrix performance via NVIDIA DLSS.</p><p>Dressed in a clean, minimalist black industrial cover shroud, this V2 variant stands out by refining its layout footprint into a compact 2-slot frame that fits comfortably into micro-ATX and mini-ITX small form factor enclosures. Thermodynamic stability is masterfully sustained by an advanced dual-fan cooling layout featuring premium Axial-tech fans. These units utilize a smaller hub assembly for longer blades and a specialized outer barrier ring to focus high-pressure static airflow directly down into the aluminum heatsink gills. Complete with zero-RPM 0dB technology that completely halts the fans during low-load desktop idling, premium Auto-Extreme automated production to eliminate PCB stress points, a rigid stainless steel IO bracket, and versatile output configurations including native HDMI 2.1, DisplayPort 1.4a, and DVI-D, it represents a hassle-free, dependable choice for everyday productivity and competitive eSports.</p><h3>Product Pricing &amp; Availability</h3><p>The latest price of the ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 3050 V2 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card in Bangladesh is <strong>36,500৳</strong>. You can check genuine stock availability or place an order online through the official International Office Solution website, or get dedicated technical system integration advice by visiting any of our local physical showrooms</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Ampere</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>2,560 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost Clock: 1777 MHz / OC Mode Boost: 1807 MHz (via GPU Tweak III)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>14 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express 4.0 x8</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>1 x Native HDMI 2.1, 1 x Native DisplayPort 1.4a, 1 x Native DVI-D</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Triple Display (Up to 3 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>~130W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>1 x 6-pin PCIe</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>450W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>Software</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooler Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Dual-Fan Setup with High-Efficiency Axial-tech Blades</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Management</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>0dB Technology (Fans completely stop below 50°C)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Manufacturing Build</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Auto-Extreme Technology Fully Automated Production &amp; Rigid Protective Backplate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCB Form Factor</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Compact 2-Slot Space-Saving Shroud Layout</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>200 x 123 x 38 mm (Compact Mid/Small Chassis Footprint)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>System Software</strong></td><td>Management</td><td>ASUS GPU Tweak III &amp; NVIDIA GeForce Game Ready Drivers</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>After-sales</td><td>3 Years Manufacturing Replacement Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 37000.00, 37000.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/ZvSkw6ZHpNPnA5Mwk6U7Va3AxYFnK1pjngMZ5xt1.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 17:24:30', '2026-07-12 17:24:30', 'ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 3050 V2 8GB GDDR6 Price in BD | International Office Solution', 'Get the authentic ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 3050 V2 8GB GDDR6 graphics card at the best price in Bangladesh. Enjoy power-efficient 1080p gaming with Ampere architecture, 8GB VRAM, and dual Axial-tech fans at International Office Solution.', 'ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 3050 V2, RTX 3050 V2 8GB price in Bangladesh, 8GB GDDR6 budget gaming GPU BD, Ampere desktop graphics card, International Office Solution.', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1279, 'ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 5050 8GB GDDR6 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'The ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 5050 8GB GDDR6 OC Edition delivers an elite entry point into next-generation visual computing, driven by NVIDIA\'s high-efficiency Blackwell architecture. Weaponized with 2,560 streaming CUDA cores, an enhanced factory overclock reaching 2677 MHz via OC mode, and 8GB of responsive GDDR6 video memory, this compact dual-fan graphics accelerator easily anchors modern 1080p gaming systems, local AI assistance pipelines, and fluid creative workflows.', 'asus-dual-geforce-rtx-5050-8gb-gddr6-oc-edition-graphics-card-1783877273', '<p>Bring advanced neural shaders, high-frame-rate 1080p environments, and dependable thermal longevity to your space-saving desktop build with the premium engineering of the ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 5050 8GB GDDR6 OC Edition Graphics Card. Forged directly on NVIDIA\'s revolutionary Blackwell architecture, this agile entry-level titan coordinates 2,560 powerhouse streaming CUDA cores with a dedicated 8GB frame buffer of high-speed GDDR6 video memory.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>NVIDIA Ampere</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>2,560 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Core Clock Speeds</strong></td><td>Core Engine</td><td>Boost Clock: 1777 MHz / OC Mode Boost: 1807 MHz (via GPU Tweak III)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>14 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Standard</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>PCI Express 4.0 x8</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Outputs</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>1 x Native HDMI 2.1, 1 x Native DisplayPort 1.4a, 1 x Native DVI-D</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Option</strong></td><td>Interface &amp; Display</td><td>Triple Display (Up to 3 monitors concurrently)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>~130W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Connectors</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>1 x 6-pin PCIe</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended PSU</strong></td><td>Power Specs</td><td>450W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>Software</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooler Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>Dual-Fan Setup with High-Efficiency Axial-tech Blades</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Acoustic Management</strong></td><td>Thermal Specs</td><td>0dB Technology (Fans completely stop below 50°C)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Manufacturing Build</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Auto-Extreme Technology Fully Automated Production &amp; Rigid Protective Backplate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCB Form Factor</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>Compact 2-Slot Space-Saving Shroud Layout</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Physical Specs</td><td>200 x 123 x 38 mm (Compact Mid/Small Chassis Footprint)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>System Software</strong></td><td>Management</td><td>ASUS GPU Tweak III &amp; NVIDIA GeForce Game Ready Drivers</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>After-sales</td><td>3 Years Manufacturing Replacement Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 47500.00, 47500.00, NULL, 3, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 17:27:53', '2026-07-12 17:27:53', 'ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 5050 8GB GDDR6 OC Edition Price in BD | International Office Solution