(1280, 'ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 5060 8GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'The ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 5060 8GB GDDR7 OC Edition is a compact yet powerful graphics card built for smooth gaming, fast creative work, and modern display support. It features 3840 CUDA cores, 28 Gbps GDDR7 memory, PCIe 5.0 support, and up to 623 AI TOPS for responsive performance.', 'asus-dual-geforce-rtx-5060-8gb-gddr7-oc-edition-graphics-card-1783877468', '<p>The ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 5060 8GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card is designed for users who want strong performance, efficient cooling, and broad compatibility in one package. It comes with 8GB of next-generation GDDR7 memory, a 128-bit memory interface, and a 28 Gbps memory speed, making it well suited for modern gaming and demanding creative tasks.asus+1</p><p>With 3840 CUDA cores and an OC boost clock of up to 2565 MHz, this GPU delivers excellent speed for high-resolution gaming, content creation, and AI-assisted workloads. It also supports a digital maximum resolution of 7680 x 4320 and can run up to 4 displays, making it a great choice for multi-monitor setups and immersive visual experiences.asus</p><p>The card includes 1 native HDMI 2.1b port and 3 native DisplayPort 2.1b outputs, along with HDCP 2.3 support for protected content playback. Its 2.5-slot design, single 8-pin power connector, and recommended 550W PSU make it a practical option for many desktop builds.asus</p><p>Built with ASUS’s Dual cooling design and modern Blackwell-era features, this graphics card balances power, efficiency, and thermal control for gamers and creators who want reliable performance in a compact form factor.asus+1</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specs</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Graphics Card</td><td>Model</td><td>ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 5060 8GB GDDR7 OC Edition asus</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Card</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 asus</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>VRAM</td><td>8GB GDDR7 asus</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>Memory Interface</td><td>128-bit asus</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>28 Gbps asus</td></tr><tr><td>Performance</td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>3840 asus</td></tr><tr><td>Performance</td><td>AI Performance</td><td>623 TOPS asus+1</td></tr><tr><td>Clock Speed</td><td>Default Mode</td><td>2535 MHz Boost Clock asus</td></tr><tr><td>Clock Speed</td><td>OC Mode</td><td>2565 MHz asus</td></tr><tr><td>Interface</td><td>Bus Type</td><td>PCI Express 5.0 asus</td></tr><tr><td>Output</td><td>Max Resolution</td><td>7680 x 4320 asus</td></tr><tr><td>Output</td><td>Display Support</td><td>Up to 4 displays asus</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>HDMI</td><td>1 x Native HDMI 2.1b asus</td></tr><tr><td>Ports</td><td>DisplayPort</td><td>3 x Native DisplayPort 2.1b asus</td></tr><tr><td>Security</td><td>HDCP</td><td>HDCP 2.3 asus</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Power Connector</td><td>1 x 8-pin asus</td></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>550W asus</td></tr><tr><td>Form Factor</td><td>Slot Size</td><td>2.5 Slot asus</td></tr><tr><td>Physical</td><td>Dimensions</td><td>228 x 123 x 50 mm asus</td></tr><tr><td>Software</td><td>API Support</td><td>OpenGL 4.6 asus</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years startech</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/lobVtC4qD5wXOfhVRdS2fG8FhYtdJfBC8Ma1XAi5.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 17:31:08', '2026-07-12 17:51:24', 'ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 5060 8GB GDDR7 OC Edition Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 5060 8GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card in Bangladesh. 8GB GDDR7, 3840 CUDA cores, 28 Gbps, PCIe 5.0, 623 AI TOPS, 3 years warranty.', 'ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 5060, RTX 5060 8GB GDDR7, ASUS RTX 5060 OC Edition, RTX 5060 price Bangladesh, ASUS graphics card, GDDR7 GPU, PCIe 5.0 graphics card, 8GB gaming GPU, ASUS Dual RTX 5060 Bang