(1281, 'ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 5060 White OC Edition 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'A white-themed ASUS RTX 5060 graphics card built for modern gaming, content creation, and efficient cooling. It combines 8GB GDDR7 memory, 3840 CUDA cores, and OC tuning for strong everyday performance.', 'asus-dual-geforce-rtx-5060-white-oc-edition-8gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783878282', '<p>The ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 5060 White OC Edition 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card is designed for users who want next-generation performance in a clean white build. It features NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 graphics, 8GB of fast GDDR7 memory, a 128-bit memory interface, and a 28 Gbps memory speed for smooth gaming anWith 3840 CUDA cores and an OC edition design, this graphics card is suited for high-performance gaming, advanced visual effects, and AI-accelerated tasks. Its white finish also makes it an excellent choice for themed PC builds where appearance matters as much as performance.d creative workloads.</p><p>This model supports modern connectivity and reliable cooling, and ASUS backs it with a 3-year warranty in Bangladesh. If you want a stylish GPU that balances power, efficiency, and a premium look, this card is a strong option.startech+1</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specs</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Graphics Card</td><td>Model</td><td>ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 5060 White OC Edition 8GB GDDR7 globalbrand</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Card</td><td>GPU</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 globalbrand</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>VRAM</td><td>8GB GDDR7 globalbrand</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>Memory Interface</td><td>128-bit globalbrand</td></tr><tr><td>Memory</td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>28 Gbps globalbrand</td></tr><tr><td>Performance</td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>3840 globalbrand</td></tr><tr><td>Performance</td><td>Warranty</td><td>3 Years Replacement Warranty globalbrand</td></tr><tr><td>Price</td><td>Bangladesh Price</td><td>57,000৳ startech</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 57000.00, 57000.00, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 17:44:42', '2026-07-12 17:44:42', 'ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 5060 White OC Edition 8GB GDDR7 Price in Bangladesh', 'Buy ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 5060 White OC Edition 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card in Bangladesh. 8GB GDDR7, 3840 CUDA cores, 28 Gbps, OC edition, 3-year warranty.', 'ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 5060 White OC Edition, RTX 5060 White, ASUS RTX 5060 White price Bangladesh, 8GB GDDR7 graphics card, ASUS graphics card BD, white gaming GPU, RTX 5060 OC Edition', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1282, 'ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 4060 Ti EVO OC Edition 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 4060 Ti EVO OC Edition 8GB is a compact, dual-fan graphics card built for smooth 1080p and 1440p gaming, with efficient cooling, DLSS 3 support, and wide case compatibility.', 'asus-dual-geforce-rtx-4060-ti-evo-oc-edition-8gb-gddr6-graphics-card-1783878864', '<p>The ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 4060 Ti EVO OC Edition 8GB GDDR6 is designed for gamers and creators who want strong performance in a space-saving build. It features two Axial-tech fans, a 2.5-slot design, and ASUS cooling features that help keep temperatures under control while maintaining quiet operation.asus+2</p><p>Powered by NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Ti architecture, this card supports DLSS 3, ray tracing, and AI-accelerated workloads, making it a solid choice for modern games and creative applications. It comes with 8GB GDDR6 memory, a 128-bit memory interface, PCIe 4.0 support, and outputs for multiple displays, including HDMI 2.1a and DisplayPort 1.4a.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Specs</th><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>GeForce RTX 4060 Ti</td><td>NVIDIA Ada Lovelace GPU</td><td>Graphics Engine</td></tr><tr><td>8GB</td><td>GDDR6 memory</td><td>Video Memory</td></tr><tr><td>128-bit</td><td>High-speed memory interface</td><td>Memory Interface</td></tr><tr><td>18 Gbps</td><td>Fast memory speed</td><td>Memory Speed</td></tr><tr><td>2595 MHz</td><td>OC boost clock</td><td>Engine Clock</td></tr><tr><td>3072 / 4352*</td><td>CUDA cores / shader count reference varies by listing</td><td>Processing</td></tr><tr><td>PCI Express 4.0</td><td>Modern platform support</td><td>Bus Standard</td></tr><tr><td>1 x HDMI 2.1a, 3 x DisplayPort 1.4a</td><td>Multi-display connectivity</td><td>Display Outputs</td></tr><tr><td>Up to 4 displays</td><td>Multiple monitor support</td><td>Display Support</td></tr><tr><td>7680 x 4320</td><td>8K maximum digital resolution</td><td>Resolution</td></tr><tr><td>1 x 8-pin</td><td>Power connector</td><td>Power</td></tr><tr><td>650W recommended</td><td>PSU recommendation</td><td>Power Requirement</td></tr><tr><td>2.5-slot</td><td>Compact dual-fan design</td><td>Physical Design</td></tr><tr><td>227.2 x 123.24 x 49.6 mm</td><td>Card dimensions</td><td>Physical Specification</td></tr><tr><td>DLSS 3, ray tracing, AI acceleration</td><td>Performance and visual enhancement</td><td>Features</td></tr><tr><td>Axial-tech fans, 0dB technology</td><td>Cooling and quiet operation</td><td>Cooling</td></tr><tr><td>Yes</td><td>HDCP 2.3 support</td><td>Protection</td></tr><tr><td>Yes</td><td>VR ready</td><td>Gaming</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 55500.00, 55500.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/N4yjF8p8hbHeP6HRwBHDB2sqQvWgAMXbFCEMDdT0.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 17:54:24', '2026-07-12 17:55:29', 'ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 4060 Ti EVO OC Edition 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'Buy the ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 4060 Ti EVO OC Edition 8GB GDDR6 graphics card with dual Axial-tech fans, DLSS 3 support, compact 2.5-slot design, and smooth 1440p gaming performance.', 'ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 4060 Ti EVO OC Edition 8GB, RTX 4060 Ti graphics card, ASUS RTX 4060 Ti EVO OC, 8GB GDDR6 GPU, NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Ti, gaming graphics card, DLSS 3 graphics card, 1440p GPU, PCIe 4.0 graphics card, dual fan GPU', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1283, 'ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 5060 White OC Edition 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'A compact white GPU with dual Axial-tech fans, 8GB GDDR7 memory, and strong 1080p/1440p gaming performance.', 'asus-dual-geforce-rtx-5060-white-oc-edition-8gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783879043', '<p>The ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 5060 White OC Edition 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card combines a clean white design with solid next-gen performance for gamers and creators. Built on NVIDIA’s RTX 5060 platform, it offers 3840 CUDA cores, a boost clock up to 2565 MHz in OC mode, and 8GB of GDDR7 memory running at 28 Gbps over a 128-bit interface.startech+2</p><p>Its dual Axial-tech fans, 2.5-slot form factor, and vented backplate are designed to improve airflow and keep temperatures under control in smaller or mid-size systems. The card also supports DLSS 4, ray tracing, PCIe 5.0, HDMI 2.1b, and DisplayPort 2.1b, making it a strong choice for smooth gameplay and modern display setups.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Specs</th><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060</td><td>Latest RTX 50-series GPU</td><td>Graphics Engine</td></tr><tr><td>8GB</td><td>GDDR7 memory</td><td>Video Memory</td></tr><tr><td>3840</td><td>CUDA cores</td><td>Processing</td></tr><tr><td>2565 MHz</td><td>OC boost clock</td><td>Engine Clock</td></tr><tr><td>2535 MHz</td><td>Default boost clock</td><td>Engine Clock</td></tr><tr><td>28 Gbps</td><td>Memory speed</td><td>Memory Speed</td></tr><tr><td>128-bit</td><td>Memory interface</td><td>Memory Interface</td></tr><tr><td>PCI Express 5.0</td><td>Next-gen bus standard</td><td>Bus Standard</td></tr><tr><td>1 x HDMI 2.1b</td><td>Display output</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>3 x DisplayPort 2.1b</td><td>Display output</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>Up to 4 displays</td><td>Multi-monitor support</td><td>Display Support</td></tr><tr><td>7680 x 4320</td><td>Maximum digital resolution</td><td>Resolution</td></tr><tr><td>1 x 8-pin</td><td>Power connector</td><td>Power</td></tr><tr><td>550W</td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Power Requirement</td></tr><tr><td>2.5-slot</td><td>Compact cooler design</td><td>Physical Design</td></tr><tr><td>Dual Axial-tech fans</td><td>Efficient cooling</td><td>Cooling</td></tr><tr><td>0dB technology</td><td>Quiet operation at low load</td><td>Cooling Feature</td></tr><tr><td>DLSS 4</td><td>AI upscaling and smoother gameplay</td><td>Gaming Feature</td></tr><tr><td>Ray tracing</td><td>Realistic lighting effects</td><td>Gaming Feature</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/0IRXubkTlKiyZKHTI9dCgiWB1mgmwlLFDyvtC7qx.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 17:57:23', '2026-07-12 17:57:23', 'ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 5060 White OC Edition 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'Buy the ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 5060 White OC Edition 8GB GDDR7 graphics card with dual Axial-tech fans, DLSS 4 support, PCIe 5.0, and compact white design for modern gaming.', 'ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 5060 White OC Edition 8GB GDDR7, RTX 5060 White GPU, ASUS RTX 5060 White OC, 8GB GDDR7 graphics card, NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060, white gaming graphics card, DLSS 4 GPU, PCIe 5.0 graphics card, dual fan GPU, 1440p gaming card', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
