(1286, 'ASUS Dual Radeon RX 9060 XT 16GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'A compact dual-fan AMD graphics card with 16GB GDDR6 memory, efficient cooling, and strong support for modern gaming and creative workloads.', 'asus-dual-radeon-rx-9060-xt-16gb-gddr6-graphics-card-1783879463', '<p>The ASUS Dual Radeon RX 9060 XT 16GB GDDR6 Graphics Card is built for gamers and creators who want strong performance in a space-saving design. Based on AMD Radeon RX 9060 XT and RDNA 4 architecture, it includes 2048 stream processors, 16GB of GDDR6 memory, and a 128-bit memory interface for smooth performance in modern titles and demanding workloads.techpowerup+2</p><p>This model uses dual Axial-tech fans and a 2.5-slot cooler to improve airflow and maintain stable temperatures during heavy use. It also supports PCIe 5.0, DisplayPort 2.1a, HDMI 2.1b, ray tracing, FSR 4, and up to three displays, making it a practical choice for high-refresh gaming and multi-monitor setups.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Specs</th><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>AMD Radeon RX 9060 XT</td><td>RDNA 4 graphics processor</td><td>Graphics Engine</td></tr><tr><td>16GB</td><td>GDDR6 memory</td><td>Video Memory</td></tr><tr><td>2048</td><td>Stream processors</td><td>Processing</td></tr><tr><td>Up to 3250 MHz</td><td>OC boost clock</td><td>Engine Clock</td></tr><tr><td>Up to 3230 MHz</td><td>Default boost clock</td><td>Engine Clock</td></tr><tr><td>20 Gbps</td><td>Memory speed</td><td>Memory Speed</td></tr><tr><td>128-bit</td><td>Memory interface</td><td>Memory Interface</td></tr><tr><td>PCI Express 5.0 x16</td><td>Next-gen bus support</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>1 x HDMI 2.1b</td><td>Display output</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>2 x DisplayPort 2.1a</td><td>Display output</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>Up to 3 displays</td><td>Multi-monitor support</td><td>Display Support</td></tr><tr><td>7680 x 4320</td><td>Maximum digital resolution</td><td>Resolution</td></tr><tr><td>1 x 8-pin</td><td>Power connector</td><td>Power</td></tr><tr><td>550W</td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Power Requirement</td></tr><tr><td>2.5-slot</td><td>Compact card design</td><td>Physical Design</td></tr><tr><td>Dual Axial-tech fans</td><td>Efficient cooling</td><td>Cooling</td></tr><tr><td>0dB technology</td><td>Quiet low-load operation</td><td>Cooling Feature</td></tr><tr><td>FSR 4</td><td>AI-driven upscaling</td><td>Gaming Feature</td></tr><tr><td>Ray tracing</td><td>Realistic lighting</td><td>Gaming Feature</td></tr><tr><td>HDCP support</td><td>Protected content playback</td><td>Video Feature</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 69900.00, 69900.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/JOJhia6ENHgG4WRTtckUnYpAluZzh5wXWXj4xAOr.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 18:04:23', '2026-07-12 18:04:23', 'ASUS Dual Radeon RX 9060 XT 16GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'Buy the ASUS Dual Radeon RX 9060 XT 16GB GDDR6 graphics card with dual Axial-tech fans, PCIe 5.0 support, RDNA 4 performance, and a compact 2.5-slot design.', 'ASUS Dual Radeon RX 9060 XT 16GB, RX 9060 XT graphics card, ASUS RX 9060 XT, 16GB GDDR6 GPU, AMD Radeon RX 9060 XT, RDNA 4 graphics card, FSR 4 GPU, PCIe 5.0 graphics card, dual fan GPU, gaming graphics card', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1287, 'ASUS Dual Radeon RX 9060 XT 16GB GDDR6 White Edition Graphics Card', 'A white dual-fan AMD graphics card with 16GB GDDR6 memory, compact 2.5-slot design, and strong performance for gaming and content creation.', 'asus-dual-radeon-rx-9060-xt-16gb-gddr6-white-edition-graphics-card-1783879541', '<p>The ASUS Dual Radeon RX 9060 XT 16GB GDDR6 White Edition Graphics Card is designed for users who want modern AMD performance in a clean white build. It uses the Radeon RX 9060 XT GPU with 2048 stream processors, 16GB of GDDR6 memory, and a 128-bit memory interface to deliver smooth gameplay and reliable multitasking.asus+1</p><p>This card features dual Axial-tech fans and a 2.5-slot cooler for efficient thermal management and broad case compatibility. It also supports PCI Express 5.0, AMD Smart Access Memory, DisplayPort 2.1a, HDMI 2.1b, ray tracing, and up to three displays, making it a practical choice for high-resolution gaming and productivity setups.asus+2</p><h2>Meta title</h2>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Specs</th><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>AMD Radeon RX 9060 XT</td><td>RDNA 4 graphics processor</td><td>Graphics Engine</td></tr><tr><td>16GB</td><td>GDDR6 memory</td><td>Video Memory</td></tr><tr><td>2048</td><td>Stream processors</td><td>Processing</td></tr><tr><td>Up to 3250 MHz</td><td>OC boost clock</td><td>Engine Clock</td></tr><tr><td>Up to 3230 MHz</td><td>Default boost clock</td><td>Engine Clock</td></tr><tr><td>20 Gbps</td><td>Memory speed</td><td>Memory Speed</td></tr><tr><td>128-bit</td><td>Memory interface</td><td>Memory Interface</td></tr><tr><td>PCI Express 5.0 x16</td><td>Next-gen bus support</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>1 x HDMI 2.1b</td><td>Display output</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>2 x DisplayPort 2.1a</td><td>Display output</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>Up to 3 displays</td><td>Multi-monitor support</td><td>Display Support</td></tr><tr><td>7680 x 4320</td><td>Maximum digital resolution</td><td>Resolution</td></tr><tr><td>1 x 8-pin</td><td>Power connector</td><td>Power</td></tr><tr><td>550W</td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Power Requirement</td></tr><tr><td>2.5-slot</td><td>Compact card design</td><td>Physical Design</td></tr><tr><td>Dual Axial-tech fans</td><td>Efficient airflow cooling</td><td>Cooling</td></tr><tr><td>0dB technology</td><td>Quiet low-load operation</td><td>Cooling Feature</td></tr><tr><td>AMD Smart Access Memory</td><td>Better platform performance</td><td>Gaming Feature</td></tr><tr><td>Ray tracing</td><td>Realistic lighting</td><td>Gaming Feature</td></tr><tr><td>HDCP 2.3</td><td>Protected content support</td><td>Video Feature</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 69500.00, 69500.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/De88fajiiML24GMcVRvKnwpVSlUc3hrl4MywpLq0.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 18:05:41', '2026-07-12 18:05:41', 'ASUS Dual Radeon RX 9060 XT 16GB GDDR6 White Edition Graphics Card', 'Buy the ASUS Dual Radeon RX 9060 XT 16GB GDDR6 White Edition graphics card with dual Axial-tech fans, PCIe 5.0 support, 16GB VRAM, and a compact 2.5-slot white design.', 'ASUS Dual Radeon RX 9060 XT White Edition, RX 9060 XT White GPU, ASUS RX 9060 XT 16GB, 16GB GDDR6 graphics card, AMD Radeon RX 9060 XT, white gaming graphics card, PCIe 5.0 GPU, dual fan GPU, AMD graphics card, RDNA 4 GPU', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
