(1289, 'ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'A compact SFF-ready NVIDIA graphics card with 8GB GDDR7 memory, triple-fan cooling, and factory overclocking for smooth modern gaming.', 'asus-prime-geforce-rtx-5060-ti-8gb-gddr7-oc-edition-graphics-card-1783879733', '<p>The ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8GB GDDR7 OC Edition is built for users who want strong performance in a space-saving, broad-compatibility design. It uses the NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 Ti GPU, 8GB of GDDR7 memory, a 128-bit interface, and boost clocks up to 2647 MHz in OC mode for responsive gaming and creative workloads.asus+2</p><p>This card features three Axial-tech fans, a 2.5-slot cooler, and support for PCIe 5.0, helping it stay cool while fitting a wide range of modern PC builds. It also includes DLSS support, ray tracing, HDMI 2.1b, DisplayPort 2.1b, and up to four display outputs, making it a practical choice for gaming, streaming, and productivity.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Specs</th><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 Ti</td><td>Blackwell GPU</td><td>Graphics Engine</td></tr><tr><td>8GB</td><td>GDDR7 memory</td><td>Video Memory</td></tr><tr><td>4608</td><td>CUDA cores</td><td>Processing</td></tr><tr><td>2647 MHz</td><td>OC mode boost clock</td><td>Engine Clock</td></tr><tr><td>2617 MHz</td><td>Default boost clock</td><td>Engine Clock</td></tr><tr><td>28 Gbps</td><td>Memory speed</td><td>Memory Speed</td></tr><tr><td>128-bit</td><td>Memory interface</td><td>Memory Interface</td></tr><tr><td>PCI Express 5.0</td><td>Next-gen bus support</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>1 x HDMI 2.1b</td><td>Display output</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>3 x DisplayPort 2.1b</td><td>Display output</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>Up to 4 displays</td><td>Multi-monitor support</td><td>Display Support</td></tr><tr><td>7680 x 4320</td><td>Maximum digital resolution</td><td>Resolution</td></tr><tr><td>1 x 8-pin</td><td>Power connector</td><td>Power</td></tr><tr><td>550W</td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Power Requirement</td></tr><tr><td>2.5-slot</td><td>Compact card design</td><td>Physical Design</td></tr><tr><td>Triple Axial-tech fans</td><td>Strong cooling airflow</td><td>Cooling</td></tr><tr><td>0dB technology</td><td>Quiet operation at low load</td><td>Cooling Feature</td></tr><tr><td>Dual BIOS</td><td>Quiet and performance profiles</td><td>Feature</td></tr><tr><td>DLSS</td><td>AI upscaling</td><td>Gaming Feature</td></tr><tr><td>Ray tracing</td><td>Realistic lighting</td><td>Gaming Feature</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 59999.00, 59999.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/aUSQOGRksJAgPlCXtYFLzL953aeAL0ESIWRccsZW.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 18:08:53', '2026-07-12 18:08:53', 'ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'Buy the ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8GB GDDR7 OC Edition graphics card with triple-fan cooling, PCIe 5.0 support, DLSS, ray tracing, and compact 2.5-slot design.', 'ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8GB GDDR7 OC Edition, RTX 5060 Ti PRIME, ASUS RTX 5060 Ti, 8GB GDDR7 graphics card, NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 Ti, gaming GPU, DLSS graphics card, PCIe 5.0 GPU, triple fan graphics card, SFF-ready graphics card', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1290, 'ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'A compact dual-fan NVIDIA graphics card with 16GB GDDR7 memory, factory overclocking, and efficient cooling for modern gaming and creative work.', 'asus-dual-geforce-rtx-5060-ti-16gb-gddr7-oc-edition-graphics-card-1783879858', '<p>The ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card is built for gamers and creators who want strong next-generation performance in a compact form factor. It uses the NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 Ti GPU with 16GB of GDDR7 memory, a 128-bit interface, and boost clocks up to 2632 MHz in OC mode for fast, responsive gameplay and smooth multitasking.asus+2</p><p>This model features dual Axial-tech fans, 0dB technology, a 2.5-slot design, and support for PCIe 5.0 to balance cooling, quiet operation, and broad compatibility. It also supports DLSS 4, ray tracing, HDMI 2.1b, DisplayPort 2.1b, and up to four displays, making it a versatile choice for gaming, streaming, and productivity.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Specs</th><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 Ti</td><td>Blackwell GPU</td><td>Graphics Engine</td></tr><tr><td>16GB</td><td>GDDR7 memory</td><td>Video Memory</td></tr><tr><td>4608</td><td>CUDA cores</td><td>Processing</td></tr><tr><td>2632 MHz</td><td>OC mode boost clock</td><td>Engine Clock</td></tr><tr><td>2602 MHz</td><td>Default boost clock</td><td>Engine Clock</td></tr><tr><td>28 Gbps</td><td>Memory speed</td><td>Memory Speed</td></tr><tr><td>128-bit</td><td>Memory interface</td><td>Memory Interface</td></tr><tr><td>PCI Express 5.0</td><td>Next-gen bus support</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>1 x HDMI 2.1b</td><td>Display output</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>3 x DisplayPort 2.1b</td><td>Display output</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>Up to 4 displays</td><td>Multi-monitor support</td><td>Display Support</td></tr><tr><td>7680 x 4320</td><td>Maximum digital resolution</td><td>Resolution</td></tr><tr><td>1 x 8-pin</td><td>Power connector</td><td>Power</td></tr><tr><td>550W</td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Power Requirement</td></tr><tr><td>2.5-slot</td><td>Compact card design</td><td>Physical Design</td></tr><tr><td>Dual Axial-tech fans</td><td>Efficient airflow cooling</td><td>Cooling</td></tr><tr><td>0dB technology</td><td>Quiet operation at low load</td><td>Cooling Feature</td></tr><tr><td>Dual BIOS</td><td>Quiet and performance profiles</td><td>Feature</td></tr><tr><td>DLSS 4</td><td>AI upscaling</td><td>Gaming Feature</td></tr><tr><td>Ray tracing</td><td>Realistic lighting</td><td>Gaming Feature</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 88500.00, 88500.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/r5PYMdESl7uvfJWsBf8E5wLG0usFMq1ZkfIYEk9C.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 18:10:58', '2026-07-12 18:10:58', 'ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'Buy the ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition graphics card with dual Axial-tech fans, DLSS 4 support, PCIe 5.0, and compact 2.5-slot cooling.', 'ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition, RTX 5060 Ti 16GB graphics card, ASUS RTX 5060 Ti OC, 16GB GDDR7 GPU, NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 Ti, gaming graphics card, DLSS 4 GPU, PCIe 5.0 graphics card, dual fan GPU, 1440p gaming GPU', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1291, 'ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 5070 12GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'A compact dual-fan NVIDIA graphics card with 12GB GDDR7 memory, factory overclocking, and efficient cooling for smooth modern gaming.', 'asus-dual-geforce-rtx-5070-12gb-gddr7-oc-edition-graphics-card-1783879916', '<p>The ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 5070 12GB GDDR7 OC Edition is designed for gamers and creators who want strong next-generation performance in a broad-compatibility form factor. It uses the NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 GPU with 12GB of GDDR7 memory, a 192-bit memory interface, 6144 CUDA cores, and boost clocks up to 2572 MHz in OC mode for fast, responsive performance.asus+2</p><p>This card features two Axial-tech fans, 0dB technology, and a 2.53-slot design to balance cooling, quiet operation, and compact system compatibility. It also supports PCIe 5.0, DLSS 4, HDMI 2.1b, DisplayPort 2.1b, and up to four displays, making it a versatile choice for high-refresh gaming, streaming, and productivity.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Specs</th><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070</td><td>Blackwell GPU</td><td>Graphics Engine</td></tr><tr><td>12GB</td><td>GDDR7 memory</td><td>Video Memory</td></tr><tr><td>6144</td><td>CUDA cores</td><td>Processing</td></tr><tr><td>2572 MHz</td><td>OC mode boost clock</td><td>Engine Clock</td></tr><tr><td>2542 MHz</td><td>Default boost clock</td><td>Engine Clock</td></tr><tr><td>28 Gbps</td><td>Memory speed</td><td>Memory Speed</td></tr><tr><td>192-bit</td><td>Memory interface</td><td>Memory Interface</td></tr><tr><td>PCI Express 5.0</td><td>Next-gen bus support</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>1 x HDMI 2.1b</td><td>Display output</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>3 x DisplayPort 2.1b</td><td>Display output</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>Up to 4 displays</td><td>Multi-monitor support</td><td>Display Support</td></tr><tr><td>7680 x 4320</td><td>Maximum digital resolution</td><td>Resolution</td></tr><tr><td>1 x 16-pin</td><td>Power connector</td><td>Power</td></tr><tr><td>750W</td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Power Requirement</td></tr><tr><td>2.53-slot</td><td>Compact card design</td><td>Physical Design</td></tr><tr><td>Dual Axial-tech fans</td><td>Efficient airflow cooling</td><td>Cooling</td></tr><tr><td>0dB technology</td><td>Quiet operation at low load</td><td>Cooling Feature</td></tr><tr><td>Dual BIOS</td><td>Quiet and performance profiles</td><td>Feature</td></tr><tr><td>DLSS 4</td><td>AI upscaling</td><td>Gaming Feature</td></tr><tr><td>Ray tracing</td><td>Realistic lighting</td><td>Gaming Feature</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/8NEdPGtWmo6cSP7SGtV1UnLHLHjrLy1bsuH8F5ae.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 18:11:56', '2026-07-12 18:11:56', 'ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 5070 12GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'Buy the ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 5070 12GB GDDR7 OC Edition graphics card with dual Axial-tech fans, DLSS 4 support, PCIe 5.0, and compact 2.53-slot cooling.', 'ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 5070 12GB GDDR7 OC Edition, RTX 5070 dual OC, ASUS RTX 5070, 12GB GDDR7 graphics card, NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070, gaming graphics card, DLSS 4 GPU, PCIe 5.0 graphics card, dual fan GPU, 1440p gaming GPU', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1292, 'ASUS Prime Radeon RX 9070 XT 16GB GDDR6 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'A high-performance AMD graphics card with 16GB GDDR6 memory, triple-fan cooling, and factory overclocking for smooth 4K gaming.', 'asus-prime-radeon-rx-9070-xt-16gb-gddr6-oc-edition-graphics-card-1783880021', '<p>The ASUS Prime Radeon RX 9070 XT 16GB GDDR6 OC Edition is built for gamers and creators who need strong performance in a versatile, modern design. Powered by AMD Radeon RX 9070 XT and RDNA 4 architecture, it includes 4096 stream processors, 16GB of GDDR6 memory, a 256-bit memory interface, and boost clocks up to 3030 MHz in OC mode for responsive gameplay and demanding workloads.</p><p>This card uses a triple Axial-tech fan cooler, a 2.5-slot design, and support for PCIe 5.0 to improve thermal performance while maintaining compatibility with many PC cases. It also supports HDMI 2.1b, DisplayPort 2.1a, up to four displays, ray tracing, and a 750W recommended PSU, making it a solid choice for high-resolution gaming and productivity setups.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Specs</th><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>AMD Radeon RX 9070 XT</td><td>RDNA 4 GPU</td><td>Graphics Engine</td></tr><tr><td>16GB</td><td>GDDR6 memory</td><td>Video Memory</td></tr><tr><td>4096</td><td>Stream processors</td><td>Processing</td></tr><tr><td>Up to 3030 MHz</td><td>OC mode boost clock</td><td>Engine Clock</td></tr><tr><td>Up to 3010 MHz</td><td>Default boost clock</td><td>Engine Clock</td></tr><tr><td>20 Gbps</td><td>Memory speed</td><td>Memory Speed</td></tr><tr><td>256-bit</td><td>Memory interface</td><td>Memory Interface</td></tr><tr><td>PCI Express 5.0</td><td>Next-gen bus support</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>1 x HDMI 2.1b</td><td>Display output</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>3 x DisplayPort 2.1a</td><td>Display output</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td>Up to 4 displays</td><td>Multi-monitor support</td><td>Display Support</td></tr><tr><td>7680 x 4320</td><td>Maximum digital resolution</td><td>Resolution</td></tr><tr><td>3 x 8-pin</td><td>Power connectors</td><td>Power</td></tr><tr><td>750W</td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Power Requirement</td></tr><tr><td>2.5-slot</td><td>Compact card design</td><td>Physical Design</td></tr><tr><td>Triple Axial-tech fans</td><td>Strong cooling airflow</td><td>Cooling</td></tr><tr><td>0dB technology</td><td>Quiet operation at low load</td><td>Cooling Feature</td></tr><tr><td>Dual BIOS</td><td>Quiet and performance profiles</td><td>Feature</td></tr><tr><td>Ray tracing</td><td>Realistic lighting</td><td>Gaming Feature</td></tr><tr><td>HDCP 2.3</td><td>Protected content support</td><td>Video Feature</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 104900.00, 104900.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/AWjoSAAjgJPrTafdlpYpNfn1RyK93omTDiT0QIJm.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 18:13:41', '2026-07-12 18:13:41', 'ASUS Prime Radeon RX 9070 XT 16GB GDDR6 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'Buy the ASUS Prime Radeon RX 9070 XT 16GB GDDR6 OC Edition graphics card with triple-fan cooling, PCIe 5.0 support, 4K-ready performance, and a compact 2.5-slot design.', 'ASUS Prime Radeon RX 9070 XT, RX 9070 XT 16GB graphics card, ASUS RX 9070 XT OC, 16GB GDDR6 GPU, AMD Radeon RX 9070 XT, RDNA 4 graphics card, 4K gaming GPU, PCIe 5.0 graphics card, triple fan GPU, AMD gaming graphics card', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1293, 'ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5070 12GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5070 12GB GDDR7 OC Edition is a high-performance graphics card built for modern gaming, content creation, and AI-enhanced workloads. It features 12GB GDDR7 memory, a 2587MHz OC mode boost clock, PCIe 5.0 support, and a compact 2.5-slot SFF-ready design for broad case compatibility.', 'asus-prime-geforce-rtx-5070-12gb-gddr7-oc-edition-graphics-card-1783880160', '<p>The <strong>ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5070 12GB GDDR7 OC Edition</strong> is designed to deliver powerful performance for gamers and creators who want next-generation speed, efficient cooling, and reliable compatibility. Powered by the <strong>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 GPU</strong>, this card comes equipped with <strong>6144 CUDA cores</strong> and <strong>12GB of high-speed GDDR7 memory</strong> on a <strong>192-bit memory interface</strong>, helping handle demanding games, creative applications, and AI-driven tasks with ease.</p><p><br>With an <strong>OC mode boost clock of up to 2587MHz</strong> and a <strong>default boost clock of 2557MHz</strong>, it offers enhanced performance right out of the box. The card supports <strong>PCI Express 5.0</strong>, making it ready for modern systems, while its <strong>2.5-slot design</strong> and <strong>SFF-ready compatibility</strong> make it a strong choice for compact and mainstream PC builds alike.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For display connectivity, it includes <strong>1 x HDMI 2.1b</strong> and <strong>3 x DisplayPort 2.1b</strong> outputs, supporting up to <strong>4 displays</strong> and a maximum digital resolution of <strong>7680 x 4320</strong>. The <strong>304 x 126 x 50 mm</strong> form factor, <strong>16-pin power connector</strong>, and <strong>750W recommended power supply</strong> make it suitable for users building a balanced high-performance system with current-generation standards.<br>&nbsp;</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Specs</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Model</td><td>PRIME-RTX5070-O12G</td><td>General</td></tr><tr><td>Graphics Engine</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070</td><td>GPU</td></tr><tr><td>AI Performance</td><td>988 TOPs</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>6144</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>OC Mode Clock</td><td>2587MHz</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>Default Boost Clock</td><td>2557MHz</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td>Video Memory</td><td>12GB GDDR7</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Speed</td><td>28 Gbps</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td>Memory Interface</td><td>192-bit</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td>Bus Standard</td><td>PCI Express 5.0</td><td>Interface</td></tr><tr><td>OpenGL</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td><td>API</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum Digital Resolution</td><td>7680 x 4320</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td>HDMI Outputs</td><td>1 x HDMI 2.1b</td><td>Display Output</td></tr><tr><td>DisplayPort Outputs</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 2.1b</td><td>Display Output</td></tr><tr><td>HDCP Support</td><td>2.3</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum Display Support</td><td>4</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td>NVLink / CrossFire Support</td><td>No</td><td>Multi-GPU</td></tr><tr><td>Power Connector</td><td>1 x 16-pin</td><td>Power</td></tr><tr><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>750W</td><td>Power</td></tr><tr><td>Slot Size</td><td>2.5 Slot</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td>SFF Ready</td><td>Compatible</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td>Dimensions</td><td>304 x 126 x 50 mm</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td>Software Support</td><td>ASUS GPU Tweak III, MuseTree, GeForce Game Ready Driver, Studio Driver</td><td>Software</td></tr><tr><td>Accessories</td><td>Speedsetup Manual, ASUS Velcro Hook &amp; Loop, Thank You Card, Adapter Cable (1 to 2)</td><td>In the Box</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 103000.00, 103000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/5RIaCpPVM1jNH7stUkavePPtpJlpUaU8BavuXOMA.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 18:16:00', '2026-07-12 18:16:57', 'ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5070 OC Edition 12GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'A small correction worth noting: you asked for the ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5070 12GB GDDR7 OC Edition, and the correct model from the specs is PRIME-RTX5070-O12G, not the non-OC version. The ASUS specs list the OC model with a 2587MHz OC clock and 2557MHz default boost clock.', 'asus-prime-geforce-rtx-5070-12gb-gddr7-oc-edition-graphics-card', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1294, 'ASUS Prime Radeon RX 9070 XT 16GB GDDR6 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'The ASUS Prime Radeon RX 9070 XT 16GB GDDR6 OC Edition brings high-performance RDNA 4 architecture to a sleek, compact 2.5-slot design. Engineered for smooth 1440p and 4K gaming, it features a factory overclock, triple Axial-tech fans, and a phase-change thermal pad for whisper-quiet cooling without the RGB clutter.', 'asus-prime-radeon-rx-9070-xt-16gb-gddr6-oc-edition-graphics-card-1783880495', '<p>The <strong>ASUS Prime Radeon RX 9070 XT 16GB GDDR6 OC Edition</strong> is meticulously engineered for gamers and content creators who demand premium performance paired with a clean, minimalist aesthetic. Built on the revolutionary next-generation AMD RDNA 4 architecture and powered by 4,096 stream processors, this card delivers uncompromising frame rates at 1440p and 4K resolutions. With a massive 16GB of high-speed GDDR6 VRAM running on a wide 256-bit bus, it effortlessly handles high-resolution texture packs, intensive AAA workloads, and real-time ray tracing.</p><p>To sustain its factory overclock of up to 3030 MHz, ASUS utilizes a space-conscious 2.5-slot cooling solution equipped with three alternate-spinning Axial-tech fans and a high-end phase-change GPU thermal pad. The card incorporates 0dB technology, dropping to dead silence during light workflows, while dual-ball fan bearings ensure long-term mechanical reliability. With a solid, vented metal backplate for structural rigidity and state-of-the-art PCI Express 5.0 connectivity, the ASUS Prime delivers optimal modern compatibility for small-form-factor and mid-tower builds alike.</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Specs</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>AMD Radeon RX 9070 XT</strong></td><td>Graphics Engine</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Navi 48 (RDNA 4)</strong></td><td>GPU Architecture</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>4096 Units</strong></td><td>Stream Processors</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Up to 3030 MHz</strong></td><td>Boost Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Up to 2480 MHz</strong></td><td>Game Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>16GB GDDR6</strong></td><td>Video Memory Capacity</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>256-bit</strong></td><td>Memory Interface</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>20 Gbps</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCI Express 5.0 x16</strong></td><td>Bus Standard</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1 x HDMI 2.1b, 3 x DisplayPort 2.1a</strong></td><td>Native Display Outputs</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>7680 x 4320 (8K)</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Up to 4 Displays</strong></td><td>Multi-Monitor Support</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Triple Axial-tech Fans</strong></td><td>Cooling System</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Phase-Change Thermal Pad</strong></td><td>GPU Thermal Interface</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>0dB Technology</strong></td><td>Silent Low-Load Operation</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>3 x 8-pin PCIe</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>750W or higher</strong></td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>312 x 130 x 50 mm</strong></td><td>Card Dimensions</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2.5 Slot</strong></td><td>Form Factor Width</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td><strong>ASUS GPU Tweak III</strong></td><td>Companion Tuning Utility</td><td>Software</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 104900.00, 104900.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/U0atuepMAmoP775dcHVoh80jDjhSe3YEHAz4i3zs.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 18:21:35', '2026-07-12 18:21:35', 'ASUS Prime Radeon RX 9070 XT 16GB GDDR6 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Buy the ASUS Prime Radeon RX 9070 XT 16GB OC Edition graphics card. Features AMD RDNA 4 architecture, 16GB GDDR6 memory, triple Axial-tech fans, and PCIe 5.0 support.', 'Meta Keywords: ASUS Prime Radeon RX 9070 XT, RX 9070 XT OC, 16GB GDDR6 graphics card, AMD RDNA 4 GPU, triple fan graphics card, PCIe 5.0 GPU, 4k gaming card, ASUS PRIME-RX9070XT-O16G', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1295, 'ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5070 12GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'The ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5070 12GB GDDR7 OC Edition delivers next-generation gaming performance in a sleek, compact 2.5-slot design. Powered by the groundbreaking NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, it features 12GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory, a factory-overclocked core, and a triple Axial-tech fan configuration that makes it completely SFF-ready (Small Form Factor) without compromising on thermal management.', 'asus-prime-geforce-rtx-5070-12gb-gddr7-oc-edition-graphics-card-1783880555', '<p>The <strong>ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5070 12GB GDDR7 OC Edition</strong> is meticulously crafted for PC enthusiasts, competitive gamers, and creators seeking high-end performance in space-conscious configurations. Built on the cutting-edge NVIDIA Blackwell architecture and loaded with 6,144 CUDA cores, this graphics card pushes frame rates to new heights at 1440p and 4K resolutions. With 12GB of next-gen GDDR7 VRAM running at an effective 28 Gbps on a 192-bit bus, it provides immense bandwidth for intensive AI generation, advanced ray tracing workloads, and heavy AAA texture rendering.</p><p>To ensure stable thermal performance during intense workloads, the PRIME card utilizes a 2.5-slot cooler alongside three alternate-spinning Axial-tech fans. The cooling loop features a MaxContact heat spreader for expanded contact area and an advanced phase-change GPU thermal pad for highly efficient thermal conductivity. Combined with a robust vented metal backplate, 0dB low-noise mechanics, a Dual BIOS switch, and modern PCI Express 5.0 lanes, the ASUS PRIME brings advanced AI computing capabilities and reliable architectural engineering directly to your rig.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Specs</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070</strong></td><td>Graphics Engine</td><td>Core Chipset</td><