></tr><tr><td><strong>ASUS GPU Tweak III &amp; MuseTree</strong></td><td>Companion Tuning Software</td><td>Software</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/FzHPXv2dFTgI5qvCAcnKsIszL0cqjnYCs156ncUz.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 18:22:35', '2026-07-12 18:22:49', 'ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5070 12GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Buy the ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5070 12GB GDDR7 OC Edition. Features NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, DLSS 4, 6144 CUDA cores, and triple Axial-tech fans.', 'Meta Keywords: ASUS PRIME RTX 5070 OC, GeForce RTX 5070 12GB, NVIDIA Blackwell graphics card, GDDR7 GPU, SFF ready graphics card, PCIe 5.0 graphics card, DLSS 4 GPU, PRIME-RTX5070-O12G', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1296, 'ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'The ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition delivers massive next-generation performance in an elegant, space-conscious 2.5-slot footprint. Engineered with the revolutionary NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, it combines a factory-overclocked core, a substantial 16GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory on a 256-bit bus, and an advanced triple Axial-tech cooling setup that is fully SFF-ready (Small Form Factor).', 'asus-prime-geforce-rtx-5070-ti-16gb-gddr7-oc-edition-graphics-card-1783880638', '<p>The <strong>ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition</strong> is meticulously optimized for enthusiast-grade gaming, highly intensive generative AI, and professional 3D content creation workflows. Powered by the groundbreaking NVIDIA Blackwell architecture and packed with 8,960 CUDA cores, this graphics card pushes the boundaries of ultra-smooth 4K rendering and full neural ray tracing. With 16GB of next-gen GDDR7 VRAM operating at a blistering 28 Gbps on a wide 256-bit bus, it eliminates raw bandwidth bottlenecks for seamless processing of ultra-high-resolution asset packs and complex LLM workloads.</p><p>To maintain maximum stability during extended peak loads, the PRIME iteration relies on an ultra-compact triple-fan layout featuring alternate-spinning Axial-tech fans and premium dual-ball bearings. A high-conductivity phase-change GPU thermal pad replaces traditional paste to accelerate heat transfer out through the dense fin arrays. Completed by a structural vented metal backplate, an onboard Dual BIOS switch for quick acoustic toggles, native DisplayPort 2.1b connectivity, and clean SFF compatibility guidelines, t</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Specs</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 Ti</strong></td><td>Graphics Engine</td><td>Core Chipset</td></