 GPU Tweak III &amp; MuseTree</strong></td><td>Tuning &amp; Creator Software</td><td>Software</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 159000.00, 159000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/pC4EvGQVLbIr4QpyFlPkUs5IGIgnl0NroHheOINs.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 18:23:58', '2026-07-12 18:23:58', 'Meta Title: ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Shop the ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition. Features NVIDIA Blackwell, 8960 CUDA cores, 256-bit memory bus, and SFF-ready triple-fan cooling.', 'Meta Keywords: ASUS PRIME RTX 5070 Ti OC, GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16GB, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, GDDR7 graphics card, SFF ready 5070 Ti, PCIe 5.0 GPU, DLSS 4 graphics card, PRIME-RTX5070TI-O16G', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1297, 'ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 4070 Ti SUPER BTF White OC Edition 16GB GDDR6X Graphics Card', 'The ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 4070 Ti SUPER BTF White OC Edition features an innovative hidden-connector (BTF) design that eliminates traditional external power cables for a flawless, cable-free aesthetic. Powered by the NVIDIA Ada Lovelace architecture, it features a pristine all-white metal exoskeleton, 16GB of GDDR6X memory, and a rugged 3.25-slot cooler built for ultimate thermal performance.', 'asus-tuf-gaming-geforce-rtx-4070-ti-super-btf-white-oc-edition-16gb-gddr6x-graphics-card-1783880722', '<p>The <strong>ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 4070 Ti SUPER BTF White OC Edition</strong> redefines desktop PC aesthetics and engineering. As a cornerstone of the ASUS BTF (Back-To-the-Future) ecosystem, this card completely removes standard 16-pin power cables, routing power directly from a compatible BTF motherboard via a high-power PCIe Gold Finger connector. Built using NVIDIA\'s Ada Lovelace architecture and 8,448 CUDA cores, it provides exceptional 4K gaming, full ray tracing, and AI-accelerated rendering pushing up to 714 AI TOPs. The 16GB of high-speed GDDR6X VRAM on a 256-bit bus easily handles large textures and demanding content-creation workloads.</p><p>Engineered with legendary TUF durability, the card features military-grade 20K capacitors, an alternate-spinning triple Axial-tech fan configuration for 21% more airflow, and an oversized 3.25-slot heatsink. A vented aluminum backplate provides massive thermal relief while preventing PCB sag. Complete with Aura Sync ARGB lighting, an internal Dual BIOS switch, and a robust factory overclock up to 2670 MHz, this card is the crown jewel for any enthusiast building a clean, all-white, ultra-modern gaming rig.</p>', '<p>\\</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Specs</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 Ti SUPER</strong></td><td>Graphics Engine</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ada Lovelace (AD103)</strong></td><td>GPU Architecture</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>8448 Units</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2670 MHz</strong></td><td>Boost Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2640 MHz</strong></td><td>Boost Clock (Default Mode)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>714 TOPs</strong></td><td>AI Computing Performance</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>16GB GDDR6X</strong></td><td>Video Memory Capacity</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>256-bit</strong></td><td>Memory Interface</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>21 Gbps</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCI Express 4.0</strong></td><td>Bus Standard</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Graphics Card High-Power (GC-HPWR) Gold Finger</strong></td><td>Motherboard Power Delivery</td><td>Power &amp; Connection</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2 x HDMI 2.1a, 3 x DisplayPort 1.4a</strong></td><td>Display Output Ports</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>7680 x 4320 (8K)</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Up to 4 Displays</strong></td><td>Multi-Monitor Support</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Triple Axial-tech Fans (21% Airflow Upgrade)</strong></td><td>Cooling System</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>0dB Technology</strong></td><td>Silent Low-Load Operation</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Military-Grade 20K Hours at 105°C</strong></td><td>Capacitor Durability Rating</td><td>Components</td></tr><tr><td><strong>750W (Requires ASUS BTF Ecosystem Motherboard)</strong></td><td>Power Requirements</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>305 x 138 x 65 mm (12 x 5.43 x 2.55 inches)</strong></td><td>Card Dimensions</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td><strong>3.25 Slot</strong></td><td>Form Factor Width</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td><strong>ASUS GPU Tweak III</strong></td><td>System Utility Software</td><td>Software</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 151000.00, 151000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/JVkUEzS78yJae9PAVZDnMqjcpimei9Lm83AItNF5.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 18:25:22', '2026-07-12 18:25:22', 'Meta Title: ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 4070 Ti SUPER BTF White OC Edition', 'Meta Description: Shop the cable-free ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 4070 Ti SUPER BTF White OC Edition. Features 16GB GDDR6X, hidden-connector tech, and triple-fan cooling.', 'Meta Keywords: ASUS TUF RTX 4070 Ti SUPER BTF, White 4070 Ti SUPER OC, BTF graphics card, hidden connector GPU, 16GB GDDR6X white graphics card, cableless GPU build, TUF-RTX4070TIS-O16G-BTF-WHITE', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1298, 'ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'The ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition combines legendary TUF durability with next-generation architectural power. Driven by the NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, it features a generous 16GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory on a wide 256-bit bus, a factory-overclocked core, and a heavy-duty 3.125-slot cooler optimized to keep performance high and thermals low during intensive AAA gaming and AI workloads.', 'asus-tuf-gaming-geforce-rtx-5070-ti-16gb-gddr7-oc-edition-graphics-card-1783880790', '<p>The <strong>ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition</strong> is a high-end powerhouse engineered for flawless native 4K gaming, advanced real-time ray tracing, and intensive creative workloads. Powered by the next-generation NVIDIA Blackwell architecture and packed with 8,960 CUDA cores, this graphics card pushes exceptional visual fidelity and features DLSS 4 with Multi Frame Generation. Equipping users with a massive 16GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 video memory operating at 28 Gbps on a 256-bit bus, it unleashes up to 896 GB/s of peak bandwidth to eliminate bottlenecks in memory-heavy AI rendering and complex modern engine environments.</p><p>True to the TUF Gaming lineage, the card is wrapped in a rugged, vented metal exoskeleton housing an expansive 3.125-slot cooling array. Three alternate-spinning Axial-tech fans provide superior airflow through the heatsink, working in tandem with a MaxContact heat spreader and a phase-change GPU thermal pad for premier heat dissipation. Backed by military-grade 20K capacitors, a structural aluminum backplate to prevent PCB flex, a flexible Dual BIOS switch, and clean ARGB Aura Sync lighting, this card deli</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Specs</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 Ti</strong></td><td>Graphics Engine</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Blackwell (GB203)</strong></td><td>GPU Architecture</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>8960 Units</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2610 MHz</strong></td><td>Boost Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2588 MHz</strong></td><td>Boost Clock (Default Mode)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1484 TOPs</strong></td><td>AI Computing Performance</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>16GB GDDR7</strong></td><td>Video Memory Capacity</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>256-bit</strong></td><td>Memory Interface</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>28 Gbps</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>896 GB/s</strong></td><td>Peak Memory Bandwidth</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCI Express 5.0 x16</strong></td><td>Bus Standard</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2 x HDMI 2.1b, 3 x DisplayPort 2.1b</strong></td><td>Native Display Outputs</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>7680 x 4320 (8K)</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Up to 4 Displays</strong></td><td>Multi-Monitor Support</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Triple Axial-tech Fans (Alternate Spinning)</strong></td><td>Cooling System</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>MaxContact Spreader &amp; Phase-Change Pad</strong></td><td>GPU Thermal Interfaces</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Military-Grade 20K Hours at 105°C</strong></td><td>Component Durability</td><td>Components</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1 x 16-pin (12V-2x6 / 12VHPWR)</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>850W or higher</strong></td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>329 x 140 x 62.5 mm (12.95 x 5.51 x 2.46 in)</strong></td><td>Card Dimensions</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td><strong>3.125 Slot</strong></td><td>Form Factor Width</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td><strong>ASUS GPU Tweak III &amp; MuseTree</strong></td><td>Performance &amp; Creator Software</td><td>Software</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 175000.00, 175000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/g7iXQVd9lm2TM2soeWnXWIrPtZKZeqVvqyaiG7jM.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 18:26:30', '2026-07-12 18:26:30', 'Meta Title: ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Buy the ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition. Features NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 8960 CUDA cores, and triple Axial-tech cooling.', 'Meta Keywords: ASUS TUF RTX 5070 Ti OC, GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16GB, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, GDDR7 graphics card, TUF Gaming 5070 Ti, PCIe 5.0 graphics card, DLSS 4 GPU, TUF-RTX5070TI-O16G-GAMING', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1299, 'ASUS ROG Strix GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'The ASUS ROG Strix GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition is the ultimate expression of next-generation gaming performance and elite thermal engineering. Built on the revolutionary NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, it features a massive factory overclock, 16GB of ultra-high-speed GDDR7 memory, and a dominant 3.2-slot cooling array armed with massive Axial-tech fans and a custom vapor chamber.', 'asus-rog-strix-geforce-rtx-5070-ti-16gb-gddr7-oc-edition-graphics-card-1783880881', '<h3>Long Description</h3><p>The <strong>ASUS ROG Strix GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition</strong> represents a masterclass in graphics engineering, purpose-built for competitive esports, native 4K gaming, and intensive generative AI workflows. Powered by the cutting-edge NVIDIA Blackwell architecture and 8,960 CUDA cores, this card delivers relentless visual computing performance pushing up to 1,406 AI TOPs. Equipped with 16GB of next-gen GDDR7 VRAM running at a blistering 28 Gbps on a wide 256-bit bus, it unleashes 896 GB/s of peak memory bandwidth to effortlessly process highly complex ray-traced lighting models and immense high-resolution texture arrays.</p><p>To sustain its massive factory boost clock of up to 2625 MHz, the ROG Strix incorporates an aggressive 3.2-slot cooling solution. A high-efficiency MaxContact vapor chamber directly mates with the GPU die, while a phase-change thermal pad rapidly channels heat out to the expansive fin arrays. Airflow is driven by three scaled-up Axial-tech fans that propel 31% more air volume through the chassis while maintaining near-silent operation via 0dB technology under lighter loads. Completed with a full structural metal exoskeleton, an onboard Dual BIOS switch, premium 15K digital power capacitors, and vibrant Aura Sync ARGB lighting, this card</p>', '<h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2>&nbsp;</h2><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Specs</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 Ti</strong></td><td>Graphics Engine</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Blackwell (GB203)</strong></td><td>GPU Architecture</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>8960 Units</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2625 MHz</strong></td><td>Boost Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2602 MHz</strong></td><td>Boost Clock (Default Mode)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1406 TOPs</strong></td><td>AI Computing Performance</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>16GB GDDR7</strong></td><td>Video Memory Capacity</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>256-bit</strong></td><td>Memory Interface</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>28 Gbps</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>896 GB/s</strong></td><td>Peak Memory Bandwidth</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCI Express 5.0 x16</strong></td><td>Bus Standard</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2 x HDMI 2.1b, 3 x DisplayPort 2.1b</strong></td><td>Native Display Outputs</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>7680 x 4320 (8K)</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Up to 4 Displays</strong></td><td>Multi-Monitor Support</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Triple Axial-tech Fans (+31% Airflow)</strong></td><td>Cooling System</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>MaxContact Vapor Chamber &amp; Phase-Change Pad</strong></td><td>GPU Thermal Interface</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Premium 15K Digital Capacitors</strong></td><td>Power Component Durability</td><td>Components</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1 x 16-pin (12V-2x6 / 12VHPWR)</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>850W or higher</strong></td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>332 x 147.3 x 64 mm (13.07 x 5.79 x 2.52 in)</strong></td><td>Card Dimensions</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td><strong>3.2 Slot</strong></td><td>Form Factor Width</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td><strong>ASUS GPU Tweak III &amp; MuseTree</strong></td><td>Performance &amp; Creator Software</td><td>Software</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 207500.00, 207500.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/YtJ1UnIxTOI4fREmSBBSq2R1vPTFtGwIRCZ6fzVK.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 18:28:01', '2026-07-12 18:28:01', 'Meta Title: ASUS ROG Strix GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Buy the ASUS ROG Strix GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition. Features NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, vapor chamber cooling, DLSS 4, and ARGB Aura Sync.', 'Meta Keywords: ASUS ROG Strix RTX 5070 Ti OC, GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16GB, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, GDDR7 graphics card, ROG Strix 5070 Ti, PCIe 5.0 GPU, DLSS 4 card, ROG-STRIX-RTX5070TI-O16G-GAMING', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `name`, `short_description`, `slug`, `description`, `specifications_text`, `tags`, `buy_price`, `price`, `discount_price`, `stock`, `thumbnail`, `video`, `is_featured`, `status`, `is_coming_soon`, `is_tba`, `is_call_for_price`, `is_out_of_stock`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`, `meta_keywords`, `meta_image`, `brand_id`, `supplier_id`, `laptop_purpose_id`) VALUES
(1300, 'ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5080 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'The ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5080 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition delivers enthusiast-tier power in a highly compatible, SFF-ready 2.5-slot design. Built on the revolutionary NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, it features a massive 16GB of next-gen GDDR7 memory, an advanced vapor chamber cooling setup, and dual-ball bearing triple Axial-tech fans optimized for clean, compact builds.', 'asus-prime-geforce-rtx-5080-16gb-gddr7-oc-edition-graphics-card-1783880950', '<h3>Long Description</h3><p>The <strong>ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5080 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition</strong> is meticulously engineered to bring elite, top-tier graphic computation and AI capabilities into a remarkably compact footprint. Driven by the groundbreaking NVIDIA Blackwell architecture and armed with 10,752 CUDA cores, this card delivers uncompromising native 4K performance, hyper-realistic neural ray tracing, and up to 1827 AI TOPs of computing power. Backed by 16GB of next-generation GDDR7 VRAM running at a blistering 30 Gbps on a 256-bit bus, it easily handles ultra-dense texture packs, complex asset generation, and intensive AAA gaming engines.</p><p>To control thermal production within its space-saving 2.5-slot layout, the PRIME card relies on premium thermal solutions usually reserved for larger cards. A high-efficiency internal vapor chamber directly bridges the gap between the GPU die and the heatsink, combined with a specialized phase-change thermal pad. Airflow is generated by three scaled-up alternate-spinning Axial-tech fans using ultra-durable dual-ball bearings. Complete with an onboard Dual BIOS toggle, 0dB silent operation under light workloads, a structural vented metal backplate, and an ASUS GPU Guard reinforced bracket, this graphics card stands out as a p</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Specs</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5080</strong></td><td>Graphics Engine</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Blackwell (GB203-400)</strong></td><td>GPU Architecture</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>10752 Units</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2685 MHz</strong></td><td>Boost Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2655 MHz</strong></td><td>Boost Clock (Default Mode)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1827 TOPs</strong></td><td>AI Computing Performance</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>16GB GDDR7</strong></td><td>Video Memory Capacity</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>256-bit</strong></td><td>Memory Interface</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>30 Gbps</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>960 GB/s</strong></td><td>Peak Memory Bandwidth</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCI Express 5.0 x16</strong></td><td>Bus Standard</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1 x HDMI 2.1b, 3 x DisplayPort 2.1b</strong></td><td>Native Display Outputs</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>7680 x 4320 (8K)</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Up to 4 Displays</strong></td><td>Multi-Monitor Support</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Triple Axial-tech Fans (Alternate Spinning)</strong></td><td>Cooling System</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Vapor Chamber &amp; Phase-Change Pad</strong></td><td>GPU Thermal Interfaces</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance &amp; Quiet (Dual BIOS)</strong></td><td>Acoustic Profile Switching</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1 x 16-pin (12V-2x6 / 12VHPWR)</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>850W or higher</strong></td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>304 x 126 x 50 mm (12 x 5 x 2 in)</strong></td><td>Card Dimensions</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2.5 Slot (SFF-Ready)</strong></td><td>Form Factor Width</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td><strong>ASUS GPU Tweak III &amp; MuseTree</strong></td><td>Performance &amp; Creator Software</td><td>Software</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 220000.00, 220000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/RuAA5iBdDB8Jizr6o9orNjA88Et9RXepwhuthLmb.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 18:29:10', '2026-07-12 18:29:10', 'Meta Title: ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5080 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Shop the compact ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5080 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition. Features NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, vapor chamber cooling, and SFF-ready 2.5-slot design.', 'Meta Keywords: ASUS PRIME RTX 5080 OC, GeForce RTX 5080 16GB, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, GDDR7 graphics card, SFF ready 5080, PCIe 5.0 graphics card, DLSS 4 card, PRIME-RTX5080-O16G', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1301, 'ASUS ProArt GeForce RTX 5080 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'The ASUS ProArt GeForce RTX 5080 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition blends elite creative performance with a compact, SFF-ready 2.5-slot profile. Powered by the next-generation NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, it features a massive 16GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory, an integrated vapor chamber cooling system, and native USB Type-C output, wrapped in a sophisticated, minimalist black-and-gold aesthetic.', 'asus-proart-geforce-rtx-5080-16gb-gddr7-oc-edition-graphics-card-1783881017', '<p>The <strong>ASUS ProArt GeForce RTX 5080 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition</strong> is meticulously optimized for digital creators, 3D artists, AI developers, and hardware enthusiasts who require ultimate visual computing power without a bulky, flashing chassis. Driven by the groundbreaking NVIDIA Blackwell architecture and configured with 10,752 CUDA cores, this professional-grade powerhouse delivers up to 1,801 AI TOPs for complex generative AI pipelines, real-time neural rendering, and heavy cinematic texturing. The massive 16GB of next-gen GDDR7 VRAM operates on a 256-bit bus at 30 Gbps, clearing any processing bottlenecks for immense 8K video timelines and detailed 3D assets.</p><p>To maintain perfect structural and thermal stability in smaller mid-tower and small-form-factor setups, the ProArt iteration integrates premium thermal engineering into a compact 2.5-slot enclosure. A high-conductivity vapor chamber and specialized phase-change thermal pad run directly against the GPU die, while three alternate-spinning Axial-tech fans push heat efficiently through the massive vented backplate. Featuring a minimalist design accented by wood-patterned laminate trim, a native USB-C display connection, Auto-Extreme automated manufacturing reliability, and a dedicated ProArt sag-prevention holder, this graphics card seamlessly fuses professional engineering with a timeless layout.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Specs</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5080</strong></td><td>Graphics Engine</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Blackwell (GB203-400)</strong></td><td>GPU Architecture</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>10752 Units</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2730 MHz</strong></td><td>Boost Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2700 MHz</strong></td><td>Boost Clock (Default Mode)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1801 TOPs</strong></td><td>AI Computing Performance</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>16GB GDDR7</strong></td><td>Video Memory Capacity</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>256-bit</strong></td><td>Memory Interface</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>30 Gbps</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>960 GB/s</strong></td><td>Peak Memory Bandwidth</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCI Express 5.0 x16</strong></td><td>Bus Standard</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1 x HDMI 2.1b, 2 x DisplayPort 2.1b, 1 x USB Type-C</strong></td><td>Native Display Outputs</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>7680 x 4320 (8K)</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Up to 4 Displays</strong></td><td>Multi-Monitor Support</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Triple Axial-tech Fans (Reverse Turbulence)</strong></td><td>Cooling System</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Vapor Chamber &amp; Phase-Change Pad</strong></td><td>GPU Thermal Interfaces</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance &amp; Quiet (Dual BIOS)</strong></td><td>Acoustic Profile Switching</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1 x 16-pin (12V-2x6 / 12VHPWR)</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>850W or higher</strong></td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>304 x 126 x 50 mm (12 x 5 x 2 in)</strong></td><td>Card Dimensions</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2.5 Slot (SFF-Ready)</strong></td><td>Form Factor Width</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td><strong>ASUS GPU Tweak III &amp; MuseTree</strong></td><td>Performance &amp; Creator Software</td><td>Software</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 226000.00, 226000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/ah3GCMNHy2fsYEwSJQLwgjH4v2kOGLmXtJkeh2qM.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 18:30:17', '2026-07-12 18:30:17', 'Meta Title: ASUS ProArt GeForce RTX 5080 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'vMeta Description: Buy the ASUS ProArt GeForce RTX 5080 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition. Features NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 1801 AI TOPs, USB Type-C, and SFF-ready design.', 'vMeta Keywords: ASUS ProArt RTX 5080 OC, GeForce RTX 5080 16GB, NVIDIA Blackwell creator GPU, GDDR7 graphics card, ProArt 5080, USB-C graphics card, PCIe 5.0 GPU, PROART-RTX5080-O16G', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1302, 'ASUS ROG Astral GeForce RTX 5080 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'The ASUS ROG Astral GeForce RTX 5080 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition represents a massive leap in premium GPU design, serving as ROG\'s first-ever quad-fan graphics card. Powered by the next-generation NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, it features 16GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory, a colossal 3.8-slot thermal array with a patented vapor chamber, and striking indirect Aura Sync ARGB lighting inspired by the wonders of the cosmos.', 'asus-rog-astral-geforce-rtx-5080-16gb-gddr7-oc-edition-graphics-card-1783881103', '<h3>Long Description</h3><p>The <strong>ASUS ROG Astral GeForce RTX 5080 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition</strong> is a visual and computational masterpiece designed for hardware purists, elite competitive gamers, and heavy AI developers. Built upon the revolutionary NVIDIA Blackwell architecture and packing 10,752 CUDA cores, this top-tier card pushes native 4K gaming and neural ray tracing to unprecedented levels. Outfitted with 16GB of next-gen GDDR7 VRAM operating at a blistering 30 Gbps on a 256-bit bus, it unleashes up to 960 GB/s of peak bandwidth, removing all limits from dense generative AI workloads, high-resolution texture streaming, and complex virtual engine physics.</p><p>To sustain its soaring factory overclock, the ROG Astral introduces a massive 3.8-slot cooling ecosystem driven by Quad-Fan Force technology. Four alternate-spinning Axial-tech fans establish a highly focused vertical airflow channel that elevates air pressure by up to 20%. Underneath the fans sits a patented vapor chamber featuring milled pathways that allow heatpipes to seat directly without flattening, combined with an advanced phase-change thermal pad. Backed by a high-end power delivery system utilizing 80-amp MOSFETs for 35% more overclocking headroom, a protective moisture-resistant PCB coating, and custom indirect Aura Sync lighting, the ROG Astral stands as a dominant flagship for elite desktop builds.</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Specs</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5080</strong></td><td>Graphics Engine</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Blackwell (GB203)</strong></td><td>GPU Architecture</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>10752 Units</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2790 MHz</strong></td><td>Boost Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2760 MHz</strong></td><td>Boost Clock (Default Mode)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1801 TOPs</strong></td><td>AI Computing Performance</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>16GB GDDR7</strong></td><td>Video Memory Capacity</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>256-bit</strong></td><td>Memory Interface</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>30 Gbps</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>960 GB/s</strong></td><td>Peak Memory Bandwidth</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCI Express 5.0 x16</strong></td><td>Bus Standard</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2 x HDMI 2.1b, 3 x DisplayPort 2.1a</strong></td><td>Native Display Outputs</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>7680 x 4320 (8K)</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Up to 4 Displays</strong></td><td>Multi-Monitor Support</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Quad-Fan Force (4 x Axial-tech Fans)</strong></td><td>Cooling System</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Patented Vapor Chamber &amp; Phase-Change Pad</strong></td><td>GPU Thermal Interfaces</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Premium Power Delivery (80A MOSFETs)</strong></td><td>Power Phase Componentry</td><td>Components</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1 x 16-pin (12V-2x6 / 12VHPWR)</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>850W or higher</strong></td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>357.6 x 149.3 x 76 mm (14.1 x 5.9 x 3 in)</strong></td><td>Card Dimensions</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td><strong>3.8 Slot</strong></td><td>Form Factor Width</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td><strong>ASUS GPU Tweak III &amp; MuseTree</strong></td><td>Performance &amp; Creator Software</td><td>Software</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 275000.00, 275000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/BNJGxPHmbBpwcWQG8ZgHkVd249dNvZ3qygnOV4qz.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 18:31:43', '2026-07-12 18:31:43', 'Meta Title: ASUS ROG Astral GeForce RTX 5080 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Experience next-gen cooling with the quad-fan ASUS ROG Astral GeForce RTX 5080 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition. Features Blackwell architecture, DLSS 4, and 3.8-slot vapor chamber thermal array.', 'Meta Keywords: ASUS ROG Astral RTX 5080, ROG Astral 5080 OC, quad fan graphics card, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, 16GB GDDR7 graphics card, PCIe 5.0 GPU, DLSS 4 card, ROG-ASTRAL-RTX5080-O16G-GAMING', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1303, 'ASUS ROG Astral GeForce RTX 5080 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card White', 'The ASUS ROG Astral GeForce RTX 5080 16GB GDDR7 White OC Edition brings flagship performance to premium, all-white desktop setups. As ROG\'s premier quad-fan graphics card, it pairs the revolutionary NVIDIA Blackwell architecture and 16GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory with a striking, pure-white metal exoskeleton, a patented vapor chamber, and subtle indirect cosmic-themed Aura Sync ARGB lighting.', 'asus-rog-astral-geforce-rtx-5080-16gb-gddr7-oc-edition-graphics-card-white-1783881259', '<p>The <strong>ASUS ROG Astral GeForce RTX 5080 16GB GDDR7 White OC Edition</strong> is an elite visual and computational masterpiece, meticulously tailored for hardware purists, high-end content creators, and competitive gamers building clean, light-themed showpieces. Leveraging the next-generation NVIDIA Blackwell architecture alongside 10,752 CUDA cores, this card delivers world-class native 4K gaming and full neural ray tracing accelerated up to 1,899 AI TOPs. Equipped with a massive 16GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 VRAM operating at a blistering 30 Gbps on a 256-bit bus, it completely strips away memory bandwidth bottlenecks to process complex generative AI, dense texture loads, and massive virtual rendering engines seamlessly.</p><p>To support its aggressive factory overclock out of the box, the White Edition utilizes a colossal 3.8-slot cooling system driven by Quad-Fan Force technology. Four alternate-spinning white Axial-tech fans establish a powerful vertical airflow channel that elevates static pressure by up to 20%. Underneath, an exclusive MaxContact vapor chamber with milled pathways directly mounts to the GPU die without flattening the heatpipes, working in tandem with a premium phase-change thermal pad. Completed with a high-end 50-amp power delivery system providing 25% more overclocking headroom, a protective moisture-resistant PCB coating, and bundled white premium accessories (including an anti-sag holder), this graphics card stands as the ultimate centerpiece for luxury showcase systems.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Specs</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5080</strong></td><td>Graphics Engine</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Blackwell (GB203)</strong></td><td>GPU Architecture</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>10752 Units</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2790 MHz</strong></td><td>Boost Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2760 MHz</strong></td><td>Boost Clock (Default Mode)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1899 TOPs</strong></td><td>AI Computing Performance</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>16GB GDDR7</strong></td><td>Video Memory Capacity</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>256-bit</strong></td><td>Memory Interface</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>30 Gbps</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>960 GB/s</strong></td><td>Peak Memory Bandwidth</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCI Express 5.0 x16</strong></td><td>Bus Standard</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2 x Native HDMI 2.1b, 3 x Native DisplayPort 2.1a</strong></td><td>Display Output Ports</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>7680 x 4320 (8K)</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Up to 4 Displays</strong></td><td>Multi-Monitor Support</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Quad-Fan Force (4 x White Axial-tech Fans)</strong></td><td>Cooling System</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Patented Vapor Chamber &amp; Phase-Change Pad</strong></td><td>GPU Thermal Interfaces</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Premium Power Delivery (50A MOSFETs)</strong></td><td>Power Phase Componentry</td><td>Components</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1 x 16-pin (12V-2x6 / 12VHPWR)</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>850W or higher</strong></td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>357.6 x 149.3 x 76 mm (14.1 x 5.9 x 3 in)</strong></td><td>Card Dimensions</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td><strong>3.8 Slot</strong></td><td>Form Factor Width</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td><strong>ASUS GPU Tweak III &amp; MuseTree</strong></td><td>Performance &amp; Creator Software</td><td>Software</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 298000.00, 298000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/a1xUBMA7QYJ4PhJEXxWAR3uC33eTqM5GsF8LKYGa.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 18:34:19', '2026-07-12 18:34:19', 'Meta Title: ASUS ROG Astral GeForce RTX 5080 16GB GDDR7 White OC Edition Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Shop the stunning quad-fan ASUS ROG Astral GeForce RTX 5080 16GB GDDR7 White OC Edition. Features NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 3.8-slot vapor chamber cooling, and a pristine white design.', 'Meta Keywords: ASUS ROG Astral RTX 5080 White, ROG Astral 5080 White OC, white graphics card, quad fan GPU, NVIDIA Blackwell graphics card, 16GB GDDR7 white GPU, white PC build graphics card, ROG-ASTRAL-RTX5080-O16G-WHITE', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1304, 'ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 5090 32GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'The ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 5090 32GB GDDR7 OC Edition stands at the absolute pinnacle of graphics engineering. Powered by the groundbreaking NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, it features a massive 32GB of next-gen GDDR7 memory on an ultra-wide 512-bit bus, a reinforced military-grade frame, and a massive 3.6-slot cooling system built to dominate demanding 4K/8K gaming, heavy 3D rendering, and enterprise-level AI workloads.', 'asus-tuf-gaming-geforce-rtx-5090-32gb-gddr7-oc-edition-graphics-card-1783881331', '<h3>Long Description</h3><p>The <strong>ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 5090 32GB GDDR7 OC Edition</strong> is a massive leap in processing power, meticulously designed for extreme PC enthusiasts, modern content creators, and AI engineers who demand uncompromising hardware limits. Driven by the revolutionary NVIDIA Blackwell architecture and containing an incredible 21,760 CUDA cores, this graphics card easily manages full neural ray tracing, mega-geometry physics engines, and complex workflows pushing up to 3,551 AI TOPs. Armed with a historic 32GB of high-speed GDDR7 VRAM running across a massive 512-bit memory interface at 28 Gbps, it delivers an unprecedented 1.79 TB/s of peak memory bandwidth to effortlessly strip away computing bottlenecks.</p><p>Engineered for structural security and extreme thermal control, the card features a rugged diecast metal exoskeleton housing an industrial-grade heatsink with 12 heatpipes and a massive vapor chamber. Airflow is driven by three scaled-up Axial-tech fans spinning on dual-ball bearings to push 23% more air volume while using an alternate-spinning layout to minimize turbulence. Backed by specialized phase-change thermal pads, military-grade TUF 5K black metallic capacitors, a protective moisture-resistant PCB coating, and dual HDMI 2.1b connections, this absolute powerhouse delivers rock-solid electrical stability and reliable gaming performance.</p><h2>SEO Metadata</h2>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Specs</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090</strong></td><td>Graphics Engine</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Blackwell (GB202)</strong></td><td>GPU Architecture</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>21760 Units</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2580 MHz</strong></td><td>Boost Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2550 MHz</strong></td><td>Boost Clock (Default Mode)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>3551 TOPs</strong></td><td>AI Computing Performance</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>32GB GDDR7</strong></td><td>Video Memory Capacity</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>512-bit</strong></td><td>Memory Interface</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>28 Gbps</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1792 GB/s (1.79 TB/s)</strong></td><td>Peak Memory Bandwidth</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCI Express 5.0 x16</strong></td><td>Bus Standard</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2 x HDMI 2.1b, 3 x DisplayPort 2.1a</strong></td><td>Native Display Outputs</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>7680 x 4320 (8K)</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Up to 4 Displays</strong></td><td>Multi-Monitor Support</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Triple Axial-tech Fans (+23% Airflow Upgrade)</strong></td><td>Cooling System</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Vapor Chamber &amp; 12 Heatpipes</strong></td><td>Internal Thermal Solution</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>TUF 5K Black Metallic Capacitors</strong></td><td>Component Durability</td><td>Components</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1 x 16-pin (12V-2x6 / 12VHPWR)</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1000W or higher</strong></td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>348 x 146 x 72 mm (13.7 x 5.7 x 2.8 in)</strong></td><td>Card Dimensions</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td><strong>3.6 Slot</strong></td><td>Form Factor Width</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td><strong>ASUS GPU Tweak III &amp; MuseTree</strong></td><td>Performance &amp; Creator Software</td><td>Software</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 540000.00, 540000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/0F1e94jjdn6QHplxjan9Q3SpeBHVyjjG1vJSIj48.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 18:35:31', '2026-07-12 18:35:31', 'Meta Title: ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 5090 32GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Buy the flagship ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 5090 32GB GDDR7 OC Edition. Features NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 21760 CUDA cores, 512-bit bus, and 12-heatpipe vapor chamber cooling.', 'Meta Keywords: ASUS TUF RTX 5090 OC, GeForce RTX 5090 32GB, NVIDIA Blackwell flagship GPU, GDDR7 graphics card, TUF Gaming 5090, 512-bit graphics card, DLSS 4 GPU, TUF-RTX5090-O32G-GAMING', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1305, 'ASUS ROG Astral GeForce RTX 5090 32GB GDDR7 WHITE OC Edition Graphics Card', 'The ASUS ROG Astral GeForce RTX 5090 32GB GDDR7 WHITE OC Edition stands as the definitive crown jewel of PC hardware, custom-tailored for elite all-white showcase systems. Featuring ROG\'s groundbreaking quad-fan architecture and powered by the NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, it combines an incredible 32GB of GDDR7 memory on a massive 512-bit bus with a striking pure-white metal shroud and cosmic-inspired indirect Aura Sync ARGB lighting.', 'asus-rog-astral-geforce-rtx-5090-32gb-gddr7-white-oc-edition-graphics-card-1783881424', '<p>The <strong>ASUS ROG Astral GeForce RTX 5090 32GB GDDR7 WHITE OC Edition</strong> represents a masterclass in extreme visual computing and elite hardware design, meticulously crafted for hardware purists, professional AI engineers, and enthusiasts building luxury, light-themed rigs. Driven by the revolutionary NVIDIA Blackwell architecture and packed with a historic 21,760 CUDA cores, this flagship powerhouse effortlessly dominates full neural ray tracing, massive physics simulations, and dense generative workflows pushing up to 3,593 AI TOPs. Outfitted with an unprecedented 32GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 VRAM operating at 28 Gbps on a wide 512-bit interface, it unleashes a blistering 1.79 TB/s of peak memory bandwidth to dissolve all computational bottlenecks.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>implements a colossal 3.8-slot cooling array utilizing Quad-Fan Force technology. Four alternate-spinning white Axial-tech fans establish a highly directed vertical airflow channel that elevates static pressure by up to 20% over traditional layouts. Beneath the dense, optimized fin arrays sits a patented vapor chamber engineered with milled pathways that allow heatpipes to seat directly without flattening. Backed by a high-end 24-phase power delivery system running 80-amp MOSFETs for 35% more overclocking headroom, a protective moisture-resistant PCB coating, and a suite of matching premium white ROG accessori</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Specs</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090</strong></td><td>Graphics Engine</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Blackwell (GB202)</strong></td><td>GPU Architecture</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>21,760 Units</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2610 MHz</strong></td><td>Boost Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2580 MHz</strong></td><td>Boost Clock (Default Mode)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>3593 TOPs</strong></td><td>AI Computing Performance</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>32GB GDDR7</strong></td><td>Video Memory Capacity</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>512-bit</strong></td><td>Memory Interface</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>28 Gbps</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1792 GB/s (1.79 TB/s)</strong></td><td>Peak Memory Bandwidth</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCI Express 5.0 x16</strong></td><td>Bus Standard</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2 x Native HDMI 2.1b, 3 x Native DisplayPort 2.1b</strong></td><td>Display Output Ports</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>7680 x 4320 (8K)</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Up to 4 Displays</strong></td><td>Multi-Monitor Support</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Quad-Fan Force (4 x White Axial-tech Fans)</strong></td><td>Cooling System</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Patented Vapor Chamber &amp; Phase-Change Pad</strong></td><td>GPU Thermal Interfaces</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Premium Power Delivery (80A MOSFETs, 24-Phase)</strong></td><td>Power Phase Componentry</td><td>Components</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1 x 16-pin (12V-2x6 / 12VHPWR)</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1000W or higher</strong></td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>357.6 x 149.3 x 76 mm (14.1 x 5.9 x 3 in)</strong></td><td>Card Dimensions</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td><strong>3.8 Slot</strong></td><td>Form Factor Width</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td><strong>ASUS GPU Tweak III &amp; MuseTree</strong></td><td>Performance &amp; Creator Software</td><td>Software</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 675900.00, 675900.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/PQHhQ7dpXzRM7dHiFQLQXwIZqsUHtSRr2chi8Yba.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 18:37:04', '2026-07-12 18:37:04', 'Meta Title: ASUS ROG Astral GeForce RTX 5090 32GB GDDR7 WHITE OC Edition Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Experience the absolute pinnacle of PC gaming with the quad-fan ASUS ROG Astral GeForce RTX 5090 32GB GDDR7 White OC Edition. Features NVIDIA Blackwell, 512-bit bus, and elite 3.8-slot cooling.', 'Meta Keywords: ASUS ROG Astral RTX 5090 White, ROG Astral 5090 White OC, white graphics card, quad fan RTX 5090, 32GB GDDR7 white GPU, NVIDIA Blackwell flagship, white PC build graphics card, ROG-ASTRAL-RTX5090-O32G-WHITE', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1306, 'ASUS ROG Astral GeForce RTX 5090 32GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'The ASUS ROG Astral GeForce RTX 5090 32GB GDDR7 OC Edition represents the absolute pinnacle of graphics engineering and extreme performance. Featuring ROG\'s groundbreaking quad-fan design and powered by the cutting-edge NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, it combines a historic 32GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory on a massive 512-bit bus with a patented vapor chamber and customizable indirect Aura Sync ARGB lighting.', 'asus-rog-astral-geforce-rtx-5090-32gb-gddr7-oc-edition-graphics-card-1783881600', '<p>The <strong>ASUS ROG Astral GeForce RTX 5090 32GB GDDR7 OC Edition</strong> is a visual and computational masterpiece, meticulously engineered for hardware purists, elite competitive gamers, and professional AI developers who demand the absolute limits of desktop hardware. Driven by the revolutionary NVIDIA Blackwell architecture and loaded with an incredible 21,760 CUDA cores, this top-tier card delivers relentless rendering speeds, massive physics simulations, and advanced generative pipelines pushing up to 3352 AI TOPs. Equipped with a historic 32GB of next-gen GDDR7 VRAM operating at 28 Gbps on a wide 512-bit bus, it unleashes a blistering 1.79 TB/s of peak memory bandwidth to instantly strip away processing bottlenecks.</p><p>To sustain its aggressive factory overclock, the ROG Astral introduces a colossal 3.8-slot cooling ecosystem powered by Quad-Fan Force technology. Four alternate-spinning Axial-tech fans establish a highly directed vertical airflow channel that elevates static pressure by up to 20% over standard layouts. Beneath the dense, optimized fin arrays sits a patented vapor chamber designed with milled pathways that allow heatpipes to seat directly without flattening, working in tandem with a premium phase-change GPU thermal pad and a MaxContact heat spreader. Backed by an ultra-premium power delivery system utilizing 80-amp MOSFETs for 35% more overclocking headroom, a protective moisture-resistant PCB coating, and standard/BTF motherboard compatibility via a detachable GC-HPWR power design, this card stands as the ultimate centerpiece for luxury showcase systems.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Specs</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090</strong></td><td>Graphics Engine</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Blackwell (GB202)</strong></td><td>GPU Architecture</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>21760 Units</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2610 MHz</strong></td><td>Boost Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2580 MHz</strong></td><td>Boost Clock (Default Mode)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>3352 TOPs</strong></td><td>AI Computing Performance</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>32GB GDDR7</strong></td><td>Video Memory Capacity</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>512-bit</strong></td><td>Memory Interface</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>28 Gbps</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1792 GB/s (1.79 TB/s)</strong></td><td>Peak Memory Bandwidth</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCI Express 5.0 x16</strong></td><td>Bus Standard</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2 x Native HDMI 2.1b, 3 x Native DisplayPort 2.1b</strong></td><td>Display Output Ports</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>7680 x 4320 (8K)</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Up to 4 Displays</strong></td><td>Multi-Monitor Support</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Quad-Fan Force (4 x Alternate-Spinning Fans)</strong></td><td>Cooling System</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Patented Vapor Chamber &amp; Phase-Change Pad</strong></td><td>GPU Thermal Interfaces</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Premium Power Delivery (80A MOSFETs)</strong></td><td>Power Phase Componentry</td><td>Components</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1 x 16-pin / Detachable GC-HPWR Gold Finger</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1000W or higher</strong></td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>357.6 x 149.3 x 76 mm (14.1 x 5.9 x 3 in)</strong></td><td>Card Dimensions</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td><strong>3.8 Slot</strong></td><td>Form Factor Width</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td><strong>ASUS GPU Tweak III &amp; MuseTree</strong></td><td>Performance &amp; Creator Software</td><td>Software</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 670000.00, 670000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/tIunYvBBNY5GsukCvoNp0qfcpfR3C4s39NnfCJJy.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 18:40:00', '2026-07-12 18:40:00', 'Meta Title: ASUS ROG Astral GeForce RTX 5090 32GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'Meta Title: ASUS ROG Astral GeForce RTX 5090 32GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'Meta Keywords: ASUS ROG Astral RTX 5090, ROG Astral 5090 OC, quad fan graphics card, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, 32GB GDDR7 graphics card, PCIe 5.0 GPU, DLSS 4 card, ROG-ASTRAL-RTX5090-O32G-GAMING', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1307, 'ASUS ROG Astral GeForce RTX 5090 32GB GDDR7 BTF OC Edition Graphics Card', 'The ASUS ROG Astral GeForce RTX 5090 32GB GDDR7 BTF OC Edition represents the absolute pinnacle of graphics engineering and cableless PC design. Powered by the groundbreaking NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, it combines a historic 32GB of GDDR7 memory on a massive 512-bit bus with ROG’s advanced quad-fan system and a detachable GC-HPWR adapter that eliminates messy external cables when paired with a BTF motherboard.', 'asus-rog-astral-geforce-rtx-5090-32gb-gddr7-btf-oc-edition-graphics-card-1783881858', '<p>computational masterpiece, meticulously engineered for hardware purists, elite competitive gamers, and professional AI developers. As a cornerstone of the premium ASUS BTF (Back-To-the-Future) clean-build ecosystem, this graphics card features a high-power GC-HPWR gold finger connector that routes up to 1,000 watts of power directly through the motherboard, eliminating traditional external 16-pin power cables for a pristine aesthetic. Driven by the revolutionary NVIDIA Blackwell architecture and configured with an incredible 21,760 CUDA cores, it easily manages full neural ray tracing, mega-geometry physics engines, and complex workflows pushing up to 3,352 AI TOPs. Armed with 32GB of high-speed GDDR7 VRAM running across an ultra-wide 512-bit memory interface, it delivers 1.79 TB/s of peak memory bandwidth to instantly dissolve computing bottlenecks.</p><p>To control thermal production within its massive 3.8-slot layout, the ROG Astral introduces a revolutionary Quad-Fan Force thermal design. Four alternate-spinning Axial-tech fans establish a highly focused vertical airflow channel that elevates static pressure by up to 20%. Underneath the fans sits an exclusive vapor chamber designed with milled pathways that allow heatpipes to seat directly without flattening, working in tandem with a premium phase-change GPU thermal pad and a MaxContact heat spreader. Backed by a high-end power delivery system utilizing 80-amp MOSFETs for 35% more overclocking headroom, a protective moisture-resistant PCB coating, two FanConnect II headers, and vibrant indirect Aura Sync ARGB lighting, this card stands out as the definitive centerpiece for luxury showcase systems.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Specs</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090</strong></td><td>Graphics Engine</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Blackwell (GB202)</strong></td><td>GPU Architecture</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>21760 Units</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2610 MHz</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2580 MHz</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Default Mode / Boost)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>3352 TOPs</strong></td><td>AI Computing Performance</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>32GB GDDR7</strong></td><td>Video Memory Capacity</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>512-bit</strong></td><td>Memory Interface</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>28 Gbps</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1792 GB/s (1.79 TB/s)</strong></td><td>Peak Memory Bandwidth</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCI Express 5.0 x16</strong></td><td>Bus Standard</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Graphics Card High-Power (GC-HPWR) Gold Finger</strong></td><td>Motherboard Power Connector Type</td><td>Power &amp; Connection</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2 x Native HDMI 2.1b, 3 x Native DisplayPort 2.1b</strong></td><td>Display Output Ports</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>7680 x 4320 (8K)</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Up to 4 Displays</strong></td><td>Multi-Monitor Support</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Quad-Fan Force (4 x Alternate-Spinning Fans)</strong></td><td>Cooling System</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Patented Vapor Chamber &amp; Phase-Change Pad</strong></td><td>GPU Thermal Interfaces</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Premium Power Delivery (80A MOSFETs, 35% Overclocking Headroom)</strong></td><td>Power Phase Componentry</td><td>Components</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1 x 16-pin (via Detachable Adapter for standard boards)</strong></td><td>Alternative External Power Connection</td><td>Power &amp; Connection</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1000W or higher</strong></td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>357.6 x 149.3 x 76 mm (14.1 x 5.9 x 3 in)</strong></td><td>Card Dimensions</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td><strong>3.8 Slot</strong></td><td>Form Factor Width</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td><strong>ASUS GPU Tweak III &amp; MuseTree</strong></td><td>Performance &amp; Creator Software</td><td>Software</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 785000.00, 785000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/YA8IRfD1weLP1gvB8yU55YR8NLQWwJrhOBrTokDS.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 18:44:18', '2026-07-12 18:44:18', 'Meta Title: ASUS ROG Astral GeForce RTX 5090 32GB GDDR7 BTF OC Edition Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Buy the cable-free ASUS ROG Astral GeForce RTX 5090 32GB GDDR7 BTF OC Edition. Features NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, quad-fan force cooling, and GC-HPWR connection.', 'Meta Keywords: ASUS ROG Astral RTX 5090 BTF, ROG Astral 5090 BTF OC, cableless graphics card, quad fan RTX 5090, 32GB GDDR7 graphics card, NVIDIA Blackwell flagship, GC-HPWR GPU, ROG-ASTRAL-RTX5090-O32G-BTF-GAMING', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1308, 'ASUS KO NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Ti OC Edition 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The ASUS KO NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Ti OC Edition 8GB GDDR6 blends striking customized styling with elite mainstream gaming performance. Built on the high-efficiency NVIDIA Ampere architecture, it features twin alternate-spinning Axial-tech fans, premium enduring components, a factory overclock, and unique gold and silver faceplates illuminated by fully customizable ARGB accents.', 'asus-ko-nvidia-geforce-rtx-3060-ti-oc-edition-8gb-gddr6-graphics-card-1783881971', '<p>The <strong>ASUS KO NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Ti OC Edition 8GB GDDR6</strong> is engineered to deliver heavy-duty performance with an unmistakable touch of flair. Powered by the revolutionary NVIDIA Ampere architecture and packed with 4,864 CUDA cores, this graphics card handles modern AAA titles with smooth frame rates at 1080p and 1440p resolutions. Outfitted with 8GB of high-speed GDDR6 VRAM running on a wide 256-bit memory bus, it utilizes dedicated 2nd Generation RT Cores and 3rd Generation Tensor Cores to unlock hyper-realistic real-time ray tracing and AI-accelerated performance boosts via NVIDIA DLSS.</p><p>Built for long-term mechanical endurance, the card utilizes ASUS Auto-Extreme precision automated assembly to reduce thermal strain on core circuits during manufacturing. Its specialized 2.7-slot cooling system uses twin dual-ball bearing Axial-tech fans featuring smaller hubs for longer blades and structural barrier rings to multiply downward air pressure. Supported by space-grade lubricants, a protective vented metal backplate, an onboard Dual BIOS switch for direct profile control, and extra native HDMI 2.1 outputs, the KO Edition stands out as a reliable and visually stunning upgrade for any performance-focused custom rig.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Specs</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Ti</strong></td><td>Graphics Engine</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ampere (GA104)</strong></td><td>GPU Architecture</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>4864 Units</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1785 MHz</strong></td><td>Boost Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1755 MHz</strong></td><td>Boost Clock (Gaming/Default Mode)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>8GB GDDR6</strong></td><td>Video Memory Capacity</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>256-bit</strong></td><td>Memory Interface</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>14 Gbps</strong></td><td>Memory Clock Speed</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>448 GB/s</strong></td><td>Peak Memory Bandwidth</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCI Express 4.0</strong></td><td>Bus Standard</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2 x Native HDMI 2.1, 3 x Native DisplayPort 1.4a</strong></td><td>Native Display Outputs</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>7680 x 4320 (8K)</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Up to 4 Displays</strong></td><td>Multi-Monitor Support</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Twin Axial-tech Fans (Dual-Ball Bearings)</strong></td><td>Cooling System</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>0dB Technology &amp; Space-Grade Lubricant</strong></td><td>Acoustic &amp; Thermal Features</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Enduring Capacitors &amp; Auto-Extreme Tech</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Component Durability</td><td>Components</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1 x 8-pin PCIe</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>750W or higher</strong></td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>275 x 135 x 54 mm (10.83 x 5.31 x 2.13 in)</strong></td><td>Card Dimensions</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2.7 Slot</strong></td><td>Form Factor Width</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td><strong>ASUS GPU Tweak III</strong></td><td>System Utility Tuning Software</td><td>Software</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/8GtClVksU2HMM7jadZjVfxdXFbZa695utTfj30XZ.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 18:46:11', '2026-07-12 18:46:11', 'Meta Title: ASUS KO NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Ti OC Edition 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Buy the ASUS KO NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Ti OC Edition 8GB. Features NVIDIA Ampere architecture, twin Axial-tech fans, dual HDMI 2.1 ports, and customizable ARGB lighting.', 'Meta Keywords: ASUS KO RTX 3060 Ti, GeForce RTX 3060 Ti OC, 8GB GDDR6 graphics card, NVIDIA Ampere GPU, dual fan 3060 Ti, ARGB graphics card, PCIe 4.0 GPU, KO-RTX3060TI-O8G-GAMING', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL);
