(1309, 'ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 3060 OC Edition 12GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 3060 OC Edition 12GB GDDR6 pairs rugged, military-grade durability with excellent mid-tier 1080p and 1440p gaming performance. Built on the highly efficient NVIDIA Ampere architecture, it features a massive 12GB frame buffer, a protective all-aluminum shroud, and three optimized Axial-tech fans designed for rock-solid reliability and low temperatures.', 'asus-tuf-gaming-geforce-rtx-3060-oc-edition-12gb-gddr6-graphics-card-1783882054', '<p>he <strong>ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 3060 OC Edition 12GB GDDR6</strong> is built like a tank to deliver sustained, rock-solid gaming performance. Powered by the NVIDIA Ampere architecture and equipped with 3,584 CUDA cores, this graphics card handles demanding modern titles smoothly. Featuring a generous 12GB of high-speed GDDR6 VRAM on a 192-bit bus, it eliminates memory capacity restrictions, making it an ideal choice for complex gaming setups, streaming, and entry-level 3D design workloads.</p><p>To maintain strict thermal control, the card utilizes a 2.7-slot footprint packed with an expansive heatsink and a MaxContact heat spreader that maximizes surface contact with the GPU die. Airflow is driven by three scaled-up alternate-spinning Axial-tech fans with dual-ball bearings that last up to twice as long as traditional sleeve bearing designs. Built with signature TUF components—including military-grade capacitors and a rigid vented metal backplate to prevent PCB flex—this factory-overclocked card delivers reliable longevity, complete with customizable Aura Sync ARGB top-side lighting.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Specs</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060</strong></td><td>Graphics Engine</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ampere (GA106)</strong></td><td>GPU Architecture</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>3584 Units</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1882 MHz</strong></td><td>Boost Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1852 MHz</strong></td><td>Boost Clock (Gaming/Default Mode)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>12GB GDDR6</strong></td><td>Video Memory Capacity</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>192-bit</strong></td><td>Memory Interface</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>15 Gbps</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>360 GB/s</strong></td><td>Peak Memory Bandwidth</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCI Express 4.0 x16</strong></td><td>Bus Standard</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2 x Native HDMI 2.1, 3 x Native DisplayPort 1.4a</strong></td><td>Display Output Ports</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>7680 x 4320 (8K)</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Up to 4 Displays</strong></td><td>Multi-Monitor Support</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Triple Axial-tech Fans (Alternate Spinning)</strong></td><td>Cooling System</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>0dB Technology (Fans stop under 50°C)</strong></td><td>Acoustic Management</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Military-Grade Certification &amp; Auto-Extreme</strong></td><td>Reliability Standards</td><td>Components</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1 x 8-pin PCIe</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>650W or higher</strong></td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>301 x 143 x 54 mm (11.81 x 5.63 x 2.13 in)</strong></td><td>Card Dimensions</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2.7 Slot</strong></td><td>Form Factor Width</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td><strong>ASUS GPU Tweak III</strong></td><td>System Performance Software</td><td>Software</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/rp7LfO8MVeFbsnKbc1OFRxUNNqCsQ1TnDm7TBJpz.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 18:47:34', '2026-07-12 18:47:34', 'Meta Title: ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 3060 OC Edition 12GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Buy the durable ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 3060 OC Edition. Features 12GB GDDR6 VRAM, NVIDIA Ampere architecture, and triple Axial-tech fans.', 'Meta Keywords: ASUS TUF RTX 3060 OC, GeForce RTX 3060 12GB, NVIDIA Ampere graphics card, TUF Gaming 3060, triple fan graphics card, PCIe 4.0 GPU, TUF-RTX3060-O12G-GAMING', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1310, 'Asus ROG Strix GeForce RTX 3060 OC Edition 12GB GDDR6 Gaming Graphics Card', 'The ASUS ROG Strix GeForce RTX 3060 OC Edition 12GB GDDR6 brings elite enthusiast-grade cooling and premium aesthetics to mainstream gaming builds. Powered by the NVIDIA Ampere architecture, it features a generous 12GB frame buffer, aggressive factory overclocking, and a massive triple Axial-tech fan configuration that keeps temperatures low and framerates high.', 'asus-rog-strix-geforce-rtx-3060-oc-edition-12gb-gddr6-gaming-graphics-card-1783882114', '<p>Here is the complete product copy, SEO metadata, and three-column specification table for the graphics card:</p><h2>Descriptions</h2><h3>Short Description</h3><p>The <strong>ASUS ROG Strix GeForce RTX 3060 OC Edition 12GB GDDR6</strong> brings elite enthusiast-grade cooling and premium aesthetics to mainstream gaming builds. Powered by the NVIDIA Ampere architecture, it features a generous 12GB frame buffer, aggressive factory overclocking, and a massive triple Axial-tech fan configuration that keeps temperatures low and framerates high.</p><h3>Long Description</h3><p>The <strong>ASUS ROG Strix GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition</strong> represents a masterclass in graphics engineering, purpose-built for smooth high-framerate 1080p and WQHD (1440p) competitive gaming. Driven by the high-efficiency NVIDIA Ampere architecture and loaded with 3,584 CUDA cores, this card handles demanding AAA titles while bringing advanced 2nd Generation RT Cores and 3rd Generation Tensor Cores to bear for immersive ray-traced visuals and AI-driven DLSS performance. Outfitted with an expansive 12GB of high-speed GDDR6 VRAM running on a 192-bit interface, it provides ample memory overhead for complex creative software, streaming setups, and large high-resolution asset pools.</p><p>To unleash its aggressive out-of-the-box factory boost clock of up to 1912 MHz, the ROG Strix incorporates an over-engineered 2.7-slot cooling ecosystem. A highly polished MaxContact heat spreader expands thermal contact with the GPU die, channeling heat into a massive fin stack. Airflow is driven by three tuned Axial-tech fans featuring a reversed central fan direction to significantly reduce turbulence and noise. Completed with a rigid structural metal exoskeleton, an onboard Dual BIOS switch for quick acoustic toggles, premium Super Alloy Power II componentry, dual FanConnect II headers, and vibrant Aura Sync ARGB lighting accents, this graphics card stands as the definitive choice for high-end showcase systems.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Specs</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060</strong></td><td>Graphics Engine</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ampere (GA106)</strong></td><td>GPU Architecture</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>3584 Units</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1912 MHz</strong></td><td>Boost Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1882 MHz</strong></td><td>Boost Clock (Gaming/Default Mode)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>12GB GDDR6</strong></td><td>Video Memory Capacity</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>192-bit</strong></td><td>Memory Interface</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>15 Gbps</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>360 GB/s</strong></td><td>Peak Memory Bandwidth</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCI Express 4.0 x16</strong></td><td>Bus Standard</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2 x Native HDMI 2.1, 3 x Native DisplayPort 1.4a</strong></td><td>Display Output Ports</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>7680 x 4320 (8K)</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Up to 4 Displays</strong></td><td>Multi-Monitor Support</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Triple Axial-tech Fans (Reversed Center Fan)</strong></td><td>Cooling System</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>MaxContact Heat Spreader &amp; 0dB Tech</strong></td><td>GPU Thermal Interfaces</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Super Alloy Power II (Premium Chokes &amp; Capacitors)</strong></td><td>Component Durability</td><td>Components</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2 x FanConnect II (PWM Headers)</strong></td><td>Chassis Fan System Tuning</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1 x 8-pin PCIe</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>650W or higher</strong></td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>300 x 133.6 x 53.5 mm (11.81 x 5.26 x 2.11 in)</strong></td><td>Card Dimensions</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2.7 Slot</strong></td><td>Form Factor Width</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td><strong>ASUS GPU Tweak III &amp; Armoury Crate</strong></td><td>Performance &amp; Aura RGB Software</td><td>Software</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/suOqBbWVNECzCjOrvnnYeuWqQMl8jysTiTDEcQwp.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 18:48:34', '2026-07-12 18:48:57', 'Meta Title: ASUS ROG Strix GeForce RTX 3060 OC Edition 12GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Buy the premium ASUS ROG Strix GeForce RTX 3060 OC Edition 12GB GDDR6. Features NVIDIA Ampere architecture, triple Axial-tech cooling, DLSS, and ARGB lighting.', 'Meta Keywords: ASUS ROG Strix RTX 3060 OC, GeForce RTX 3060 12GB, NVIDIA Ampere GPU, GDDR6 graphics card, ROG Strix 3060, PCIe 4.0 card, triple fan 3060, ROG-STRIX-RTX3060-O12G-GAMING', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1311, 'Asus KO GeForce RTX 3060 TI V2 OC Edition 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The ASUS KO GeForce RTX 3060 Ti V2 OC Edition 8GB GDDR6 balances a distinct gold and silver customized style with incredible mainstream gaming performance. Driven by the NVIDIA Ampere architecture and updated with LHR (Lite Hash Rate) technology, it features twin alternate-spinning Axial-tech fans, premium enduring components, a factory overclock, and fully customizable ARGB accents.', 'asus-ko-geforce-rtx-3060-ti-v2-oc-edition-8gb-gddr6-graphics-card-1783882252', '<p>The <strong>ASUS KO GeForce RTX 3060 Ti V2 OC Edition 8GB GDDR6</strong> is meticulously engineered to provide competitive frame rates and heavy-duty thermal performance with an unmistakable touch of flair. Powered by the high-efficiency NVIDIA Ampere architecture and packed with 4,864 CUDA cores, this graphics card handles modern AAA titles smoothly at 1080p and 1440p resolutions. Outfitted with 8GB of high-speed GDDR6 VRAM running on a wide 256-bit memory bus, it relies on dedicated 2nd Gen RT Cores and 3rd Gen Tensor Cores to unlock hyper-realistic real-time ray tracing and AI-accelerated performance boosts via NVIDIA DLSS.</p><p>Built for long-term reliability, the V2 edition utilizes ASUS Auto-Extreme precision automated assembly to reduce thermal strain on core circuits during manufacturing. Its specialized 2.7-slot cooling system uses twin dual-ball bearing Axial-tech fans featuring smaller hubs for longer blades and structural barrier rings to multiply downward air pressure. Supported by space-grade lubricants, enduring capacitors that last up to 2.5 times longer than standard alternatives, a protective vented metal backplate, an onboard Dual BIOS switch, and extra native HDMI 2.1 outputs, this card brings unique aesthetics and excellent longevity to your build.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Specs</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Ti</strong></td><td>Graphics Engine</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ampere (GA104)</strong></td><td>GPU Architecture</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>4864 Units</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1785 MHz</strong></td><td>Boost Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1755 MHz</strong></td><td>Boost Clock (Gaming/Default Mode)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1410 MHz</strong></td><td>Base Clock speed</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>8GB GDDR6</strong></td><td>Video Memory Capacity</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>256-bit</strong></td><td>Memory Interface</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>14 Gbps</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>448 GB/s</strong></td><td>Peak Memory Bandwidth</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCI Express 4.0</strong></td><td>Bus Standard</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2 x Native HDMI 2.1, 3 x Native DisplayPort 1.4a</strong></td><td>Display Output Ports</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>7680 x 4320 (8K)</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Up to 4 Displays</strong></td><td>Multi-Monitor Support</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Twin Axial-tech Fans (Dual-Ball Bearings)</strong></td><td>Cooling System</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>0dB Technology &amp; Space-Grade Lubricants</strong></td><td>Acoustic &amp; Thermal Features</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Enduring 2.5X Longer Capacitors &amp; Auto-Extreme</strong></td><td>Reliability Standards</td><td>Components</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1 x 8-pin PCIe</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>750W or higher</strong></td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>275 x 135 x 54 mm (10.83 x 5.31 x 2.13 in)</strong></td><td>Card Dimensions</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2.7 Slot</strong></td><td>Form Factor Width</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td><strong>ASUS GPU Tweak III &amp; Armoury Crate</strong></td><td>Performance &amp; ARGB Control Software</td><td>Software</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/Ipf15ICpDWxCPRjEo1NIidwbnG82XN8zKrfm0Nt1.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 18:50:52', '2026-07-12 18:50:52', 'Meta Title: ASUS KO GeForce RTX 3060 Ti V2 OC Edition 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Shop the unique ASUS KO GeForce RTX 3060 Ti V2 OC Edition 8GB GDDR6 LHR. Features NVIDIA Ampere architecture, twin Axial-tech fans, and customizable ARGB lighting.', 'Meta Keywords: ASUS KO RTX 3060 Ti V2, GeForce RTX 3060 Ti V2 OC, 8GB GDDR6 graphics card, NVIDIA Ampere GPU, dual fan 3060 Ti V2, LHR graphics card, PCIe 4.0 GPU, KO-RTX3060TI-O8G-V2-GAMING', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1312, 'ASUS GeForce GT 1030 2GB GDDR5 low Profile Graphics Card', 'The ASUS GeForce GT 1030 2GB GDDR5 Low Profile Graphics Card delivers efficient, silent multimedia acceleration in a space-conscious package. Featuring a highly advanced 0dB fanless passive thermal structure, it fits seamlessly into compact small-form-factor (SFF) setups and Home Theater PCs (HTPCs), providing a major performance leap over basic integrated graphics.', 'asus-geforce-gt-1030-2gb-gddr5-low-profile-graphics-card-1783882435', '<p>The <strong>ASUS GeForce GT 1030 2GB GDDR5 Low Profile Graphics Card</strong> delivers efficient, silent multimedia acceleration in a space-conscious package. Featuring a highly advanced 0dB fanless passive thermal structure, it fits seamlessly into compact small-form-factor (SFF) setups and Home Theater PCs (HTPCs), providing a major performance leap over basic integrated graphics.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Specs</th><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>NVIDIA GeForce GT 1030</strong></td><td>Graphics Engine</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pascal (GP108)</strong></td><td>GPU Architecture</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>384 Units</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1506 MHz</strong></td><td>Boost Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1468 MHz</strong></td><td>Boost Clock (Gaming / Default Mode)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1266 MHz</strong></td><td>Base Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2GB GDDR5</strong></td><td>Video Memory Capacity</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>64-bit</strong></td><td>Memory Interface</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>6008 MHz</strong></td><td>Effective Memory Clock</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCI Express 3.0</strong></td><td>Bus Standard</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1 x Native HDMI 2.0b, 1 x Single-Link DVI-D</strong></td><td>Native Display Outputs</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>4096 x 2160 (Digital Max)</strong></td><td>Max Hardware Resolution</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Up to 2 Displays</strong></td><td>Multi-Monitor Support</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>0dB Passive Heatsink (Fanless)</strong></td><td>Cooling System</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Auto-Extreme Automated Manufacturing</strong></td><td>Production Quality Standard</td><td>Components</td></tr><tr><td><strong>No Connectors Required (Slot Powered)</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>30 Watts</strong></td><td>Maximum Power Consumption</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>300W or higher</strong></td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>173 x 69 x 40 mm (6.8 x 2.7 x 1.5 inches)</strong></td><td>Card Dimensions</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Low Profile (Bracket Included)</strong></td><td>Form Factor / Expansion</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td><strong>ASUS GPU Tweak II &amp; Drivers</strong></td><td>Control &amp; Tuning Software</td><td>Software</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/aosHBM1aEjF7WYZqZBmfR42U6gSaSuoukWYHicTV.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 18:53:55', '2026-07-12 18:53:55', 'Meta Title: ASUS GeForce GT 1030 2GB GDDR5 Low Profile Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Buy the silent ASUS GeForce GT 1030 2GB GDDR5 Low Profile graphics card. Features NVIDIA Pascal architecture, 0dB passive cooling, and HTPC readiness.  Meta Keywords: ASUS GT 1030 Low Profile, GeForce GT 1030 2GB, 0dB silent graphics card, GDDR5 GT 1030, fanless graphics card, HTPC video card, GT1030-SL-2G-BRK', 'Meta Keywords: ASUS GT 1030 Low Profile, GeForce GT 1030 2GB, 0dB silent graphics card, GDDR5 GT 1030, fanless graphics card, HTPC video card, GT1030-SL-2G-BRK', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1313, 'ASUS Phoenix Radeon RX 550 4GB DDR5 Evo Graphics Card', 'The ASUS Phoenix Radeon RX 550 4GB GDDR5 Evo Graphics Card provides dependable multimedia performance and entry-level gaming in an ultra-compact dual-slot design. Equipped with a high-durability dual ball bearing fan and IP5X dust resistance, this space-saving card fits easily into smaller chassis configurations without requiring external power connectors.', 'asus-phoenix-radeon-rx-550-4gb-ddr5-evo-graphics-card-1783882499', '<p>The <strong>ASUS Phoenix Radeon RX 550 4GB GDDR5 Evo Graphics Card</strong> is a compact and highly compatible hardware upgrade engineered for small-form-factor builds, home theater PCs, and everyday budget gaming rigs. Driven by the efficient AMD Radeon GCN architecture with 512 stream processors, it delivers a notable performance boost over integrated graphics solutions. Outfitted with 4GB of dedicated GDDR5 video memory running on a 128-bit memory bus, it effortlessly accelerates light gaming titles, high-definition video streaming, and basic photo or video editing tasks.</p><p>Built using ASUS Auto-Extreme technology—a fully automated single-pass manufacturing process that enhances component reliability—this card is structured for long-lasting stability. Its single-fan configuration features a dual-ball bearing assembly that runs up to twice as long as standard sleeve bearings, protected by an IP5X-certified dust-resistant frame to prevent particle ingress. Backed by native HDMI 2.0b and DisplayPort 1.4 video outputs, a strict 144-hour stress validation phase, and full compatibility with AMD Radeon FreeSync technology, it brings</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Specs</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>AMD Radeon RX 550</strong></td><td>Graphics Engine</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GCN 4.0 (Polaris / Baffin)</strong></td><td>GPU Architecture</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>512 Units</strong></td><td>Stream Processors</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1183 MHz</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Boost / Default)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>4GB GDDR5</strong></td><td>Video Memory Capacity</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>128-bit</strong></td><td>Memory Interface</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>6000 MHz</strong></td><td>Memory Clock Speed</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>96 GB/s</strong></td><td>Peak Memory Bandwidth</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCI Express 3.0</strong></td><td>Bus Standard</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1 x Native HDMI 2.0b, 1 x Native DisplayPort 1.4, 1 x Native DVI-D</strong></td><td>Display Output Ports</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>5120 x 2880 (Digital Max)</strong></td><td>Max Digital Hardware Resolution</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Up to 3 Displays</strong></td><td>Multi-Monitor Support</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Single Fan (Dual Ball Bearings)</strong></td><td>Cooling System</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>IP5X Dust Resistance Certification</strong></td><td>Acoustic &amp; Fan Durability</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Auto-Extreme Automation &amp; 144-Hour Stability Test</strong></td><td>Reliability Standards</td><td>Components</td></tr><tr><td><strong>No Connectors Required (Slot Powered)</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>350W or higher</strong></td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>192 x 115 x 39 mm (7.6 x 4.5 x 1.5 inches)</strong></td><td>Card Dimensions</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2 Slot</strong></td><td>Form Factor Width</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td><strong>ASUS GPU Tweak III &amp; AMD Software</strong></td><td>Control &amp; Tuning Utilities</td><td>Software</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/RI0sXseGCMNBzDlDxfVrotR4f2gO11758szyfe2I.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 18:54:59', '2026-07-12 18:54:59', 'Meta Title: ASUS Phoenix Radeon RX 550 4GB GDDR5 Evo Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Shop the compact ASUS Phoenix Radeon RX 550 4GB GDDR5 Evo graphics card. Features an IP5X dust-resistant dual ball bearing fan and Auto-Extreme reliability.', 'Meta Keywords: ASUS Phoenix RX 550 Evo, Radeon RX 550 4GB, GDDR5 graphics card, compact AMD GPU, IP5X graphics card, slot powered video card, HTPC graphics card, PH-RX550-4G-EVO', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1314, 'ASUS Dual Radeon RX 7600 V2 OC Edition 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The ASUS Dual Radeon RX 7600 V2 OC Edition 8GB GDDR6 packs next-generation AMD RDNA 3 gaming architecture into a highly compatible, compact 2.5-slot design. Equipped with twin Axial-tech fans, dual ball fan bearings, and a factory overclock, this dual-fan card delivers optimal thermal performance for fluid 1080p gaming in small-form-factor and mid-tower builds alike.', 'asus-dual-radeon-rx-7600-v2-oc-edition-8gb-gddr6-graphics-card-1783882571', '<p>The <strong>ASUS Dual Radeon RX 7600 V2 OC Edition 8GB GDDR6</strong> is engineered to deliver substance over style, bringing exceptional mainstream gaming efficiency and reliability to balanced PC setups. Powered by the advanced AMD RDNA 3 architecture and equipped with 2,048 stream processors, this graphics card provides high refresh rate performance tailored perfectly for smooth 1080p and entry-level 1440p gaming configurations. Its 8GB of high-speed GDDR6 video memory operates on a 128-bit memory bus, delivering the fast throughput required to accelerate modern AAA titles, high-definition streaming, and content creation pipelines.</p><p>Compared to its predecessor, the updated V2 iteration features a restructured, space-conscious layout that enhances chassis compatibility while retaining excellent cooling dynamics. Two proven Axial-tech fans incorporate smaller hubs to accommodate longer blades, expanding downward static pressure across the heatsink fin stack. Backed by an alternate-spinning fan mechanism to minimize turbulence, an intelligent 0dB mode for silent lower-load operation, a protective aluminum backplate, and a corrosion-resistant 304 stainless steel mounting bracket, the ASUS Dual V2 stands out as a durable, power-efficient addition to any custom computer build.</p>', '<ul><li><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Specs</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>AMD Radeon RX 7600</strong></td><td>Graphics Engine</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>RDNA 3 (Navi 33 XL)</strong></td><td>GPU Architecture</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2048 Units</strong></td><td>Stream Processors</td><td>Core Chipset</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Up to 2715 MHz</strong></td><td>Boost Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Up to 2300 MHz</strong></td><td>Game Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Performance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>8GB GDDR6</strong></td><td>Video Memory Capacity</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>128-bit</strong></td><td>Memory Interface</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>18 Gbps</strong></td><td>Memory Speed / Effective Clock</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>288 GB/s</strong></td><td>Peak Memory Bandwidth</td><td>Memory</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCI Express 4.0 x8</strong></td><td>Bus Standard / Expansion Interface</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1 x Native HDMI 2.1, 3 x Native DisplayPort 1.4a</strong></td><td>Display Output Ports</td><td>Connectivity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>7680 x 4320 (8K)</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Up to 4 Displays</strong></td><td>Multi-Monitor Support</td><td>Display</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Twin Axial-tech Fans (Alternate Spinning)</strong></td><td>Cooling System</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dual Ball Fan Bearings</strong></td><td>Fan Mechanical Durability</td><td>Components</td></tr><tr><td><strong>0dB Technology (Fans Stop Below 55°C)</strong></td><td>Acoustic Control</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Protective Aluminum Backplate &amp; 304 Stainless Steel Bracket</strong></td><td>Structural Rigidity Standards</td><td>Components</td></tr><tr><td><strong>1 x 8-pin PCIe</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>550W or higher</strong></td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>Thermal &amp; Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>205 x 128 x 49 mm (8.1 x 5.0 x 1.9 inches)</strong></td><td>Card Dimensions</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2.5 Slot</strong></td><td>Form Factor Width</td><td>Physical</td></tr><tr><td><strong>ASUS GPU Tweak III &amp; AMD Software: Adrenalin Edition</strong></td><td>System Tuning &amp; Driver Utility</td><td>Software</td></tr></tbody></table></figure></li></ul>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/pKvBF4XIQeq0O01XqyU7dZXltb7wOZIGOSm43qqn.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 18:56:11', '2026-07-12 18:56:11', 'Meta Title: ASUS Dual Radeon RX 7600 V2 OC Edition 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Buy the compact ASUS Dual Radeon RX 7600 V2 OC Edition 8GB. Features AMD RDNA 3 architecture, twin Axial-tech fans, 2.5-slot cooling, and PCIe 4.0.', 'Meta Keywords: ASUS Dual RX 7600 V2, Radeon RX 7600 V2 OC, 8GB GDDR6 graphics card, AMD RDNA 3 GPU, twin fan RX 7600, compact gaming graphics card, DUAL-RX7600-O8G-V2', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1315, 'ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 4060 White OC Edition 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 4060 White OC Edition 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card\r\nExperience high-performance gaming and creative work with the ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 4060 White OC Edition. Featuring 8GB of GDDR6 memory, a sleek white design, and advanced cooling with dual fans, this GPU delivers stunning visuals, real-time ray tracing, and AI-enhanced graphics for immersive experiences.', 'asus-dual-geforce-rtx-4060-white-oc-edition-8gb-gddr6-graphics-card-1783883002', '<p>The ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 4060 White OC Edition is designed for gamers and creators who demand excellence. Built with the latest NVIDIA Ampere architecture, it offers remarkable performance with real-time ray tracing and DLSS 3.0 technology. The elegant white finish complements modern builds, while the dual-fan cooling system ensures optimal thermal performance during intense gaming sessions or demanding workloads. Its factory overclocked settings provide extra power for smooth, lag-free gameplay. With multiple connectivity options, including HDMI and DisplayPort, it supports multiple monitors for an expansive visual experience. Durable and reliable, this graphics card is perfect for elevating your gaming setup to the next level.<br>&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Category<br>Feature<br>Specifications</p><p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 (AD107)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>3,072</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Default Mode)</td><td>Boost Clock: 2505 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Boost Clock: 2535 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>AI Performance</td><td>246 AI TOPS</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>8GB GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>17 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Interface</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Bandwidth</td><td>272 GB/s</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>$7680 \\times 4320$ (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Maximum Displays</td><td>Quad Display Support (Up to 4 screens)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>HDCP Support</td><td>Yes (Version 2.3)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Interface</td><td>1x Native HDMI 2.1a</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>DisplayPort Interface</td><td>3x Native DisplayPort 1.4a</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Power Consumption (TDP)</td><td>~115W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>550W (Based on fully configured rigs)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Power Connectors</td><td>1x 8-pin PCIe cable</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>DirectX Support</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Card Dimensions</td><td>227.2 x 123.24 x 49.6 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Slot Width</td><td>2.5 Slot Design</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Cooling Solution</td><td>Dual Axial-tech Fans with 0dB Technology</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Aesthetics / Color</td><td>All-White Shroud and Backplate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Warranty</td><td>3 Years Limited Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/PNLmQvChMjsAyG1Q184U7pdG5KBQYDJQbwiChtnR.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 19:03:22', '2026-07-12 19:03:22', 'Meta Title: ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 4060 White OC Edition 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Buy the ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 4060 White OC Edition 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card featuring Axial-tech cooling, DLSS 3, and 246 AI TOPS. Perfect for pristine all-white 1080p and 1440p gaming rigs.', 'Keywords: ASUS Dual RTX 4060 White OC, White Graphics Card, RTX 4060 8GB GDDR6, White PC Build GPU, NVIDIA DLSS 3 Graphics Card, ASUS DUAL-RTX4060-O8G-WHITE price in BD', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1316, 'ASUS Dual Radeon RX 6600 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The ASUS Dual Radeon RX 6600 8GB GDDR6 delivers a pure AMD RDNA 2 architecture gaming experience in its most refined form. Merging dynamic thermal performance with wide PC chassis compatibility, this dual-fan card is optimized to push high frame rates at 1080p resolutions. It comes equipped with twin flagship Axial-tech fans featuring dual ball bearings, a protective structural backplate, and 0dB technology for entirely silent operations under lighter system tasks.', 'asus-dual-radeon-rx-6600-8gb-gddr6-graphics-card-1783883131', '<p>The ASUS Dual Radeon RX 6600 8GB GDDR6 stands as a premier choice for mainstream PC builders looking for highly competitive framerates without drawing massive amounts of power. Built on the breakthrough AMD RDNA 2 framework, it introduces next-generation computing units alongside a massive 32MB of AMD Infinity Cache to easily eliminate memory bandwidth bottlenecks at Full HD resolutions. Out of the box, its dual clock profiles push up to 2491 MHz in OC Mode to extract maximum compute performance during heavy gameplay.</p><p>To sustain long-term thermal stability, ASUS deploys an advanced twin Axial-tech fan system. These fans incorporate a scaled-down hub design to accommodate longer blades, alongside an outer barrier ring that effectively channels high-pressure downward airflow through the cooling fins. Produced via the automated Auto-Extreme manufacturing process, all soldering points are completed in a single pass to minimize structural thermal strain. A clean, matte protective backplate adds structural rigidity to eliminate PCB sag, making it a reliable, long-lasting anchor for your everyday gaming setup.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>AMD Radeon RX 