(1317, 'ASUS Dual Radeon RX 6600 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The ASUS Dual Radeon RX 6600 8GB GDDR6 blends uncompromising cooling efficiency with exceptional mainstream performance. Engineered on the cutting-edge AMD RDNA 2 architecture, it delivers lightning-fast frame rates at ultra-smooth 1080p resolutions. Equipped with twin premium Axial-tech fans, an armor-grade aluminum structural backplate, and an intelligent 0dB silent system, this compact 2.5-slot card easily drops into mid-tower and small-form-factor builds alike.', 'asus-dual-radeon-rx-6600-8gb-gddr6-graphics-card-1783883234', '<p>The ASUS Dual Radeon RX 6600 8GB GDDR6 delivers next-generation AMD RDNA 2 gaming architecture in its purest, most performance-focused design. Tailored to achieve elite-tier framerates in contemporary competitive and AAA titles at Full HD resolutions, this card features 1,792 stream processors integrated alongside 32MB of groundbreaking AMD Infinity Cache. This specialized high-density cache significantly balances memory bandwidth bottlenecks while operating at lower power configurations, enabling an ultra-efficient total boBuilt to handle intensive, sustained workloads, the GPU utilizes two specialized Axial-tech fans constructed with scaled-down structural hubs to extend blade length, combined with an engineered outer barrier ring that maximizes high-pressure downward airflow through the cooling arrays. Manufactured using Auto-Extreme automated assembly, every connection point is flawlessly finished in a single thermal pass to reduce structural strain and maximize component longevity. Complete with a robust metal protective backplate to completely eliminate PCB sag and an intuitive physical BIOS toggle to switch between high-speed cooling or ultra-quiet acoustics, it stands as a reliable foundation for any high-performance workstation or desktop configuration. ard power profile.&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><stron