(1318, 'ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 5060 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 5060 White OC Edition 8GB GDDR7 ushers in a new era of mainstream gaming and AI computing wrapped in a pristine all-white aesthetic. Powered by NVIDIA’s ground-breaking Blackwell architecture, this graphics card pairs next-generation GDDR7 memory with a massive 623 AI TOPS of processing headroom. Outfitted with twin premium Axial-tech fans, a structural vented backplate, and an efficient 2.5-slot profile, it delivers cutting-edge DLSS 4 performance and silent 0dB operation to any modern small-form-factor or mid-tower setup.', 'asus-dual-geforce-rtx-5060-8gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783883285', '<p>performance by combining elite thermal design with state-of-the-art computational hardware. Anchored by the highly efficient 5nm NVIDIA Blackwell (GB206) architecture, this card scales beyond traditional boundaries by incorporating 5th Generation Tensor Cores and 4th Generation Ray Tracing Cores. These advancements allow builders to harness revolutionary neural rendering technologies like NVIDIA DLSS 4 with Multi Frame Generation and latency-slashing Reflex 2 with Frame Warp, transforming the latest heavy AAA titles into fluid, highly realistic cinematic experiences.</p><p>To easily sustain its factory-overclocked boost clock of 2565 MHz, ASUS equips this model with heavy-duty thermal architecture. Twin specialized Axial-tech cooling fans operate on durable dual ball bearings to push high-pressure downward airflow cleanly through the dense heatsink network. For everyday productivity or casual media consumption, the integrated 0dB technology fully disengages the fans under a 50°C threshold for total silence. Completed with a rigid aluminum structural backplate to combat PCB warping, an a</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engi