(1319, 'ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 4060 V2 OC Edition 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 4060 V2 OC Edition 8GB GDDR6 fuses high-efficiency gaming performance with maximum system compatibility. Re-engineered into a highly compact 20.2 cm long, true 2-slot footprint, this card is custom-built to easily drop into small-form-factor (SFF) and mini-ITX setups. Powered by the NVIDIA Ada Lovelace architecture, it delivers exceptional 1080p and 1440p gaming with DLSS 3 frame generation, AI acceleration, twin premium Axial-tech fans, and near-silent 0dB operational cooling modes.', 'asus-dual-geforce-rtx-4060-v2-oc-edition-8gb-gddr6-graphics-card-1783883364', '<p>The ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 4060 V2 OC Edition 8GB GDDR6 packs heavyweight graphics power into an ultra-streamlined physical layout. Anchored by the highly efficient 5nm NVIDIA Ada Lovelace architecture, this graphics accelerator leverages 4th Generation Tensor Cores to scale framerates up to 4x using DLSS 3 neural rendering, alongside 3rd Generation RT Cores that deliver breathtaking real-time ray-traced visuals. Factory-overclocked right out of the box, it hits a boosted clock speed of up to 2535 MHz in OC Mode to yield exceptionally fluid frame rates across competitive multiplayer and demanding AAA titles.</p><p>What sets the V2 variant apart is its complete layout refinement. By packing advanced cooling technologies into a tighter 2-slot chassis design under 21 cm in length, it effortlessly minimizes clearance issues inside cramped PC cases while maximizing ambient cross-ventilation. Cooling is driven by twin flagship Axial-tech fans built with scaled-down hubs for longer blades, combined with an integrated barrier ring to forcefully push air through the heavy-duty heatsink array. Built with Auto-Extreme automated assembly for flawless structural integrity and reinforced with a rigid protective backplate and a rugged 304 stainless steel mounting bracket, this mini powerhouse guarantees premium operational reliability for any gaming or content creation workstation.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>3,072 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Default Mode)</td><td>Boost Clock: 2505 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Boost Clock: 2535 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>AI Performance Headroom</td><td>246 AI TOPS</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Video Memory Configuration</td><td>8GB GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Clock Speed</td><td>17 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Interface Width</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Architecture</td><td>PCI Express 4.0 x8</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>$7680 \\times 4320$ (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Maximum Display Outputs</td><td>Quad Display (Supports up to 4 concurrent monitors)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>HDCP Compliant</td><td>Yes (Version 2.3)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Interface</td><td>1x Native HDMI 2.1a</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>DisplayPort Interface</td><td>3x Native DisplayPort 1.4a</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Power Consumption (TDP)</td><td>~115W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Recommended System PSU</td><td>550W or higher</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>1x 8-pin PCIe Power Cable</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>DirectX Support</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>202.2 x 120.3 x 40.1 mm (7.96 x 4.73 x 1.57 inches)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Form Factor Slot Profile</td><td>True 2-Slot Width (Highly compact)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>System Cooling</td><td>Dual Axial-tech Fans with Dual Ball Bearings &amp; 0dB Tech</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Product Warranty</td><td>3 Years Limited Replacement Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/jWtGFvi7ImQl7qdsNCuyKL4CtVQctYp4SPXjbBAw.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 19:09:24', '2026-07-12 19:09:24', 'Meta Title: ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 4060 V2 OC Edition 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Buy the ultra-compact ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 4060 V2 OC Edition 8GB GDDR6. Features a space-saving 2-slot design, dual Axial-tech fans, DLSS 3, and 246 AI TOPS.', 'Keywords: ASUS Dual RTX 4060 V2 OC, DUAL-RTX4060-O8G-V2 price, compact RTX 4060 8GB, NVIDIA Ada Lovelace GPU, DLSS 3 graphics card, 2-slot mini PC graphics card', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1320, 'ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5060 8GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'The ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5060 8GB GDDR7 OC Edition is a high-performance graphics card built for mainstream gamers, streamers, and creative professionals. Powered by the ultra-efficient NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, it pairs 8GB of next-generation GDDR7 memory with a powerful triple-fan array. Featuring a 2.5-slot footprint, physical Dual BIOS, and 0dB silent computing tech, it delivers exceptional thermal management alongside cutting-edge AI features like DLSS 4 frame generation and 630 AI TOPs of neural processing power.', 'asus-prime-geforce-rtx-5060-8gb-gddr7-oc-edition-graphics-card-1783883419', '<h3>Long Description</h3><p>The ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5060 8GB GDDR7 OC Edition expands the legendary, reliability-focused PRIME eco-system into the realm of high-performance dedicated graphics. Anchored by the 5nm NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, this graphics processor brings massive compute generational updates, incorporating 5th Generation Tensor Cores and 4th Generation Ray Tracing Cores. These upgrades allow the card to output up to 630 AI TOPs of raw neural acceleration, driving advanced AI workflows like real-time upscale rendering in NVIDIA Studio tools, text-to-image creation in ASUS MuseTree, and ultra-fluid gameplay through NVIDIA DLSS 4 Multi Frame Generation. Factory-tuned right out of the box, the card operates up to a boosted 2595 MHz in OC Mode to smoothly manage intense workloads.</p><p>To maintain perfect cooling stability under long computing sessions, the PRIME card implements a premium triple-fan setup inside a highly compatible 26.8 cm layout. Three engineered Axial-tech fans operate on dual ball bearings to deliver up to twice the operational lifespan of traditional sleeve bearings. The fans pull high-pressure downward airflow through a dense heatsink matrix, utilizing side-panel ventilation windows to prevent ambient heat accumulation inside modern desktop cases. Completed with an armor-grade protective backplate, native DisplayPort 2.1b connectivity for future-proof display configurations, and a physical Dual BIOS switch to instantly change from high-performance to ultra-quiet acoustics, it serves as the ultimate system companion for any standard mid-tower or compact PC build.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 (Blackwell GB206)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>3,840 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Default Mode)</td><td>Boost Clock: 2565 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Boost Clock: 2595 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>AI Computing Performance</td><td>630 AI TOPs</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Video Memory Configuration</td><td>8GB GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>28 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Interface Width</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Bandwidth</td><td>448 GB/s</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>$7680 \\times 4320$ (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Maximum Display Connections</td><td>Quad Display Support (Up to 4 concurrent monitors)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>HDCP Version Support</td><td>Yes (Version 2.3)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Interface</td><td>1x Native HDMI 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>DisplayPort Interface</td><td>3x Native DisplayPort 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Estimated Power Draw (TDP)</td><td>~145W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Recommended System PSU</td><td>550W or higher</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>1x 8-pin PCIe Power Cable</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>DirectX Support</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>268.3 x 120 x 50 mm (10.56 x 4.72 x 1.97 inches)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Form Factor Slot Width</td><td>2.5-Slot Profile</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>System Cooling</td><td>Triple Axial-tech Fans with 0dB Technology &amp; Dual BIOS</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Product Warranty</td><td>3 Years Limited Replacement Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/nnBDCqYfB5jgGBpiP131jFGf4j4m8z7Fr7yU3Chx.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 19:10:19', '2026-07-12 19:10:19', 'Meta Title: ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5060 8GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Buy the ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5060 8GB GDDR7 OC Edition. Features NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, triple Axial-tech fans, DLSS 4, and 630 AI TOPs for pro-tier creators and gamers.', 'Keywords: ASUS PRIME RTX 5060 OC, PRIME-RTX5060-O8G price, NVIDIA Blackwell graphics card, RTX 5060 GDDR7, DLSS 4 GPU, triple fan graphics card Bangladesh', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1321, 'ASUS Prime GeForce RTX 4060 Ti OC Edition 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The ASUS Prime GeForce RTX 4060 Ti OC Edition 8GB GDDR6 brings sleek aesthetic design and high-end thermal capabilities to the mainstream market. Purpose-built to match the clean styling of the ASUS Prime ecosystem, this card features a robust triple Axial-tech fan layout packed into a space-efficient 2.5-slot profile. Powered by the ultra-efficient NVIDIA Ada Lovelace architecture, it delivers exceptional 1080p and 1440p high-refresh gaming, blazing-fast DLSS 3 frame generation, and 359 AI TOPS of computational power for creators and productivity professionals alike.', 'asus-prime-geforce-rtx-4060-ti-oc-edition-8gb-gddr6-graphics-card-1783883475', '<p>The ASUS Prime GeForce RTX 4060 Ti OC Edition 8GB GDDR6 seamlessly expands the legendary, productivity-focused PRIME component ecosystem into high-performance graphic acceleration. Driven by NVIDIA\'s 5nm Ada Lovelace architecture, this card introduces massive performance updates, using 4th Generation Tensor Cores to scale frame rates up to 4x via DLSS 3 neural rendering compared to raw brute-force computing. Backed by 3rd Generation Ray Tracing Cores, it delivers stunningly realistic, real-time lighting and reflections across modern AAA titles. Factory-overclocked right out of the box, it reaches a boosted clock speed of up to 2610 MHz in OC Mode to smoothly tackle intense rendering and rendering pipelines.</p><p>To guarantee sustained cooling reliability under multi-hour creative sessions or competitive workloads, the card deploys a sophisticated triple-fan array inside a highly compatible 26.9 cm frame layout. The three premium Axial-tech fans feature a smaller central hub to allow for longer blades, bounded by an integrated outer barrier ring that effectively funnels high-pressure airflow directly through the dense heatsink fins. The fans operate on dual ball bearings, providing double the lifespan of conventional sleeve bearing setups. C