(1322, 'ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 4060 Ti EVO OC Edition 16GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 4060 Ti EVO OC Edition 16GB GDDR6 pairs heavy-duty workstation performance with broad hardware compatibility. Built on NVIDIA\'s highly efficient Ada Lovelace architecture, it delivers a massive 16GB VRAM buffer to easily cruise through hardware-intensive AAA gaming, 3D rendering, and high-resolution video editing. Featuring dual premium Axial-tech fans, a structural protective backplate, and an intelligent 0dB silent profile, this 2.5-slot card drops cleanly into compact and mid-tower chassis setups alike.', 'asus-dual-geforce-rtx-4060-ti-evo-oc-edition-16gb-gddr6-graphics-card-1783883549', '<p>The ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 4060 Ti EVO OC Edition 16GB GDDR6 delivers performance-driven thermal engineering engineered explicitly to break down data barriers for creators and modern gamers. By doubling the baseline video memory to a robust 16GB GDDR6 configuration, this card completely eliminates high-resolution texture bottlenecks, allowing smoother timelines in Premiere Pro, faster complex scene rendering in Blender, and massive headroom for demanding multi-layered workloads. Driven by the 5nm NVIDIA Ada Lovelace architecture, it utilizes 4th Generation Tensor Cores to output 361 AI TOPS of neural acceleration—scaling framing output up to 4x via DLSS 3 Frame Generation compared to traditional brute-force computing.</p><p>To manage its factory-overclocked core speeds up to 2625 MHz, the EVO series deploys an updated, compact structural cooling shroud. Twin flagship Axial-tech fans are engineered with scaled-down center hubs to accommodate longer blades, bounded by an outer barrier ring that actively drives dense, high-pressure downward airflow directly through the aluminum heatsink fins. The implementation of premium dual ball fan bearings effectively doubles operational lifetimes over traditional sleeve bearing variants. Assembled using precision Auto-Extreme automate