(1324, 'ASUS ProArt GeForce RTX 4060 Ti OC Edition 16GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The ASUS ProArt GeForce RTX 4060 Ti OC Edition 16GB GDDR6 is a finely crafted synthesis of brawn and beauty. Designed specifically for creative professionals, this card features a spacious 16GB VRAM buffer, triple Axial-tech cooling, and a sleek 2.5-slot profile. Powered by NVIDIA’s Ada Lovelace architecture, it provides the reliability and performance needed for demanding tasks like 3D rendering, video editing, and complex AI workloads in a minimalist, professional chassis.', 'asus-proart-geforce-rtx-4060-ti-oc-edition-16gb-gddr6-graphics-card-1783883707', '<p>The ProArt GeForce RTX 4060 Ti OC Edition brings professional-grade stability and elegant design to the powerful NVIDIA GeForce RTX 40 Series. By integrating 16GB of GDDR6 memory, this card eliminates the common texture and asset bottlenecks found in high-resolution creative workflows, allowing for seamless multitasking in Adobe Creative Cloud, Blender, and other professional suites. The card is powered by the 5nm Ada Lovelace architecture, utilizing 4th Generation Tensor Cores and 3rd Generation RT Cores to deliver exceptional ray tracing and AI-accelerated rendering performance, outputting 370 AI TOPS.</p><p>Thermal management is handled by a triple-fan Axial-tech array that has been scaled up to push 21% more airflow, all while maintaining a slim 2.5-slot height for excellent case compatibility. The fans are mounted on dual ball bearings for enhanced longevity and include 0dB technology, which halts fan rotation during lighter tasks for near-silent operation. Built with ASUS’s Auto-Extreme automated manufacturing process, the card ensures consistent, long-term reliability. Its stealthy black aesthetic, paired with a reinforced backplate and physical Dual BIOS toggle, makes it the perfect centerpiece for both high-end creator workstations and sleek desktop builds.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine</strong></td><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Ti (AD106)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>4,352</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>2685 MHz (Boost)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Default)</td><td>2655 MHz (Boost)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>16GB GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>18 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory</strong></td><td>Memory Interface</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Display Outputs</td><td>1x HDMI 2.1a, 3x DisplayPort 1.4a</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>Max Displays</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display</strong></td><td>Max Resolution</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Recommended PSU</td><td>650W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power</strong></td><td>Power Connector</td><td>1 x 8-pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>Size (L x W x H)</td><td>300 x 120 x 50 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design</strong></td><td>Slot Width</td><td>2.5-Slot</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Warranty</td><td>3 Years Limited Replacement</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/mlWMIQTeumJUqCYuHmUhQjbCMCn0OLJXw68zpzxm.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 19:15:07', '2026-07-12 19:15:07', 'Meta Title: ASUS ProArt GeForce RTX 4060 Ti OC Edition 16GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Elevate your creative workflow with the ASUS ProArt RTX 4060 Ti 16GB OC Edition. Featuring NVIDIA Ada Lovelace architecture, 16GB VRAM, and a 2.5-slot triple-fan design for professional workstations.', 'Keywords: ASUS 