(1325, 'ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'The ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition combines high-end AI computational power with a sleek, minimalist aesthetic. Driven by NVIDIA’s advanced Blackwell architecture, this card pairs a massive 16GB buffer of next-generation GDDR7 memory with a robust triple Axial-tech fan configuration. Featuring a 2.5-slot profile, a physical Dual BIOS switch, and 772 AI TOPS of neural processing power, it delivers outstanding thermal management alongside cutting-edge DLSS 4 frame generation for premium gaming and creator workloads.', 'asus-prime-geforce-rtx-5060-ti-16gb-gddr7-oc-edition-graphics-card-1783883782', '<p>The ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition marks a major evolutionary step for mainstream PC components, fully integrating into the clean, productivity-driven ASUS PRIME ecosystem. Powered by the 5nm NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, this graphics processor introduces profound generational upgrades, leveraging 5th Generation Tensor Cores and 4th Generation Ray Tracing Cores. These technological pillars generate up to 772 AI TOPS of hardware acceleration, smoothly running high-density generative AI programs, accelerating 3D ray-traced rendering pipelines, and producing ultra-fluid gameplay through AI-driven NVIDIA DLSS 4 with Multi Frame Generation and Reflex 2 with Frame Warp. Factory-overclocked right out of the box, it reaches a boosted core clock of 2647 MHz in OC Mode to process demanding computing tasks seamlessly.</p><p>To reliably handle its upgraded core performance, the card utilizes a specialized triple-fan array engineered into a highly compatible 30.4 cm frame. Three advanced Axial-tech fans run on durable dual ball bearings, delivering up to twice the operational lifespan of traditional sleeve alternatives. These fans draw high-pressure airflow directly through a dense aluminum fin stack, working with the card\'s open structural backplate to leverage case cross-ventilation and prevent hot air build-up. Complete with a physical hardware Dual BIOS toggle for instant performance-to-quiet customization, future-proof native DisplayPort 2.1b connections, and intelligent 0dB ambient silencing technology, it offers an uncompromising foundation for modern workstation arrays.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 Ti (Blackwell GB206)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>4,608 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Default Mode)</td><td>Boost Clock: 2617 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Boost Clock: 2647 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>AI Computing Power</td><td>772 AI TOPS</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Video Memory Configuration</td><td>16GB GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Clock Speed</td><td>28 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Interface Width</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Bus Standard</td><td>PCI Express 5.0 x8</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>$7680 \\times 4320$ (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Maximum Display Connections</td><td>Quad Display Support (Up to 4 concurrent monitors)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>HDCP Version Support</td><td>Yes (Version 2.3)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Interface</td><td>1x Native HDMI 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>DisplayPort Interface</td><td>3x Native DisplayPort 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Maximum Power Draw (TDP)</td><td>~180W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Recommended System PSU</td><td>550W or higher</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>1x 8-pin PCIe Power Cable</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>DirectX Support</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>304 x 120 x 50 mm (11.96 x 4.72 x 1.97 inches)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Form Factor Slot Width</td><td>2.5-Slot Profile</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Cooling Solution</td><td>Triple Axial-tech Fans with Dual BIOS &amp; 0dB Technology</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Product Warranty</td><td>3 Years Limited Replacement Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/zgKGG5Og0sN26aqNwJsdahyCyW7jbQZ02BHzbN2E.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 19:16:22', '2026-07-12 19:16:22', 'ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Buy the ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition. Features NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 16GB GDDR7 memory, triple Axial-tech fans, and 772 AI TOPS.', NULL, NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1326, 'ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'The ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition combines high-end AI computational power with a sleek, minimalist aesthetic. Driven by NVIDIA’s advanced Blackwell architecture, this card pairs a massive 16GB buffer of next-generation GDDR7 memory with a robust triple Axial-tech fan configuration. Featuring a space-optimized 2.5-slot profile, a physical Dual BIOS switch, and an incredible 772 AI TOPS of neural processing power, it delivers outstanding thermal management alongside cutting-edge DLSS 4 frame generation for premium gaming and creator workloads.', 'asus-prime-geforce-rtx-5060-ti-16gb-gddr7-oc-edition-graphics-card-1783883850', '<p>The ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition marks a major evolutionary step for mainstream PC components, fully integrating into the clean, productivity-driven ASUS PRIME ecosystem. Powered by the high-efficiency NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, this graphics processor introduces profound generational upgrades, leveraging 5th Generation Tensor Cores and 4th Generation Ray Tracing Cores. These technological pillars generate up to 772 AI TOPS of hardware acceleration, smoothly running high-density generative AI programs, accelerating 3D ray-traced rendering pipelines, and producing ultra-fluid gameplay through AI-driven NVIDIA DLSS 4 with Multi Frame Generation and Reflex 2 with Frame Warp. Factory-overclocked right out of the box, it reaches a boosted core clock of 2647 MHz in OC Mode to process demanding computing tasks seamlessly.</p><p>To reliably handle its upgraded core performance, the card utilizes a specialized triple-fan array engineered into a highly compatible 30.4 cm frame. Three advanced Axial-tech fans run on durable dual ball bearings, delivering up to twice the operational lifespan of traditional sleeve alternatives. These fans draw high-pressure airflow directly through a dense aluminum fin stack, working with the card\'s open structural backplate to leverage case cross-ventilation and prevent hot air build-up. Complete with a physical hardware Dual BIOS toggle for instant performance-to-quiet customization, future-proof native DisplayPort 2.1b connections, and intelligent 0dB ambient silencing technology, it offers an uncompromising foundation for modern workstation arrays.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 Ti (Blackwell GB206)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>4,608 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Default Mode)</td><td>Boost Clock: 2617 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Boost Clock: 2647 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>AI Computing Performance</td><td>772 AI TOPS</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/D6Zrh1eduZM1oVkAKUc1R3eMABGabzbd640qZ8zH.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 19:17:30', '2026-07-12 19:17:30', 'Meta Title: ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Buy the ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition. Features NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 16GB GDDR7 memory, triple Axial-tech fans, and 772 AI TOPS.', 'Keywords: ASUS PRIME RTX 5060 Ti OC, PRIME-RTX5060TI-O16G price, RTX 5060 Ti 16GB GDDR7, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, DLSS 4 Graphics Card, Triple Fan GPU Bangladesh', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1327, 'ASUS ROG Strix GeForce RTX 4060 Ti 8GB GDDR6 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'The ASUS ROG Strix GeForce RTX 4060 Ti 8GB GDDR6 OC Edition brings flagship thermal engineering and cybernetic aesthetics to the mainstream gaming space. Engineered on NVIDIA\'s high-efficiency Ada Lovelace architecture, it features a massive 3.1-slot footprint cooled by three scaled-up Axial-tech fans. Delivering a high-velocity factory overclock of up to 2715 MHz, full Aura Sync ARGB lighting integration, and 374 AI TOPS of neural performance, it is custom-built for enthusiasts looking to maximize 1080p and 1440p framerates with flawless thermal management.', 'asus-rog-strix-geforce-rtx-4060-ti-8gb-gddr6-oc-edition-graphics-card-1783883937', '<h3>Long Description</h3><p>The ASUS ROG Strix GeForce RTX 4060 Ti 8GB GDDR6 OC Edition stands as an uncompromising, top-tier iteration of the RTX 4060 Ti platform. Powered by the 5nm Ada Lovelace architecture, it brings highly advanced features including 4th Generation Tensor Cores to scale frame rates up to 4x via DLSS 3 Frame Generation, alongside 3rd Generation RT Cores that handle incredibly lifelike real-time ray-traced shadows and ambient reflections. Out of the box, this premium card hits a boosted core speed of up to 2715 MHz in OC Mode, allowing competitive gamers and digital creators to squeeze every ounce of processing headroom from the GPU core.</p><p>What sets this ROG Strix flagship apart is its extreme, chart-topping cooling configuration. The card introduces a heavy-duty 3.1-slot heatsink design coupled with three premium Axial-tech fans operating on dual ball bearings. The two side fans spin counterclockwise to eliminate internal air turbulence and forcefully push clean air directly through the massive cooling fin stack. Integrated 0dB technology fully silences the entire fan array when the GPU core falls under 50°C, providing total acoustic silence during everyday office work. Completed with a rigid aluminum exoskeleton frame to prevent PCB warping, dual PWM FanConnect II headers to synchronize chassis fans directly to the card’s thermal state, and a digital power delivery network featuring ultra-reliable 15K capacitors, it remains a robust foundation for elite, high-performance desktop arrays.</p>', '<ul><li>&nbsp;</li></ul><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Ti (AD106)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>4,352 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Default Mode)</td><td>Boost Clock: 2685 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Boost Clock: 2715 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>AI Computing Performance</td><td>374 AI TOPS</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Video Memory Configuration</td><td>8GB GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>18 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Interface Width</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Bus Architecture</td><td>PCI Express 4.0 x8 (Physical x16 form factor)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>$7680 \\times 4320$ (8K Ultra HD Support)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Multi-Display Capability</td><td>Quad Display (Supports up to 4 concurrent monitors)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>HDCP Compliant</td><td>Yes (Version 2.3)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Interface</td><td>1x Native HDMI 2.1a</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>DisplayPort Interface</td><td>3x Native DisplayPort 1.4a</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Estimated Power Consumption</td><td>~160W TDP</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Recommended System PSU</td><td>650W or higher</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>1x 8-pin PCIe Power Cable</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>DirectX Support</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>311.4 x 133.5 x 61.9 mm (12.26 x 5.26 x 2.44 inches)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Form Factor Slot Width</td><td>3.1-Slot Profile (Requires large chassis clearance)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>System Cooling</td><td>Triple Axial-tech Fans with Reverse Rotation &amp; 0dB Tech</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Extra Engineering</td><td>2x PWM FanConnect II Headers &amp; Aura Sync ARGB Lighting</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Product Warranty</td><td>3 Years Limited Replacement Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/lDISePBlrbF4rRJff4UuGvRLA5Gz8u4dzRE2B89h.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 19:18:57', '2026-07-12 19:18:57', 'Meta Title: ASUS ROG Strix GeForce RTX 4060 Ti 8GB GDDR6 OC Edition', 'Meta Description: Get flagship cooling with the ASUS ROG Strix GeForce RTX 4060 Ti OC Edition. Features a massive 3.1-slot heatsink, triple Axial-tech fans, DLSS 3, and customizable Aura Sync RGB.', 'Keywords: ROG-STRIX-RTX4060TI-O8G-GAMING price, ASUS ROG Strix RTX 4060 Ti 8GB, RTX 4060 Ti OC Edition, premium triple fan GPU, Aura Sync graphics card, NVIDIA Ada Lovelace BD', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL);
