(1329, 'ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 4070 EVO OC Edition 12GB GDDR6X Graphics Card', 'The ASUS ROG Strix GeForce RTX 4060 Ti 8GB GDDR6 OC Edition brings flagship thermal engineering and cybernetic aesthetics to the mainstream gaming space. Engineered on NVIDIA\'s high-efficiency Ada Lovelace architecture, it features a massive 3.1-slot footprint cooled by three scaled-up Axial-tech fans. Delivering a high-velocity factory overclock of up to 2715 MHz, full Aura Sync ARGB lighting integration, and 374 AI TOPS of neural performance, it is custom-built for enthusiasts looking to maximize 1080p and 1440p framerates with flawless thermal management.', 'asus-dual-geforce-rtx-4070-evo-oc-edition-12gb-gddr6x-graphics-card-1783884138', '<h3>ong Description</h3><p>The ASUS ROG Strix GeForce RTX 4060 Ti 8GB GDDR6 OC Edition stands as an uncompromising, top-tier iteration of the RTX 4060 Ti platform. Powered by the 5nm Ada Lovelace architecture, it brings highly advanced features including 4th Generation Tensor Cores to scale frame rates up to 4x via DLSS 3 Frame Generation, alongside 3rd Generation RT Cores that handle incredibly lifelike real-time ray-traced shadows and ambient reflections. Out of the box, this premium card hits a boosted core speed of up to 2715 MHz in OC Mode, allowing competitive gamers and digital creators to squeeze every ounce of processing headroom from the GPU core.</p><p>What sets this ROG Strix flagship apart is its extreme, chart-topping cooling configuration. The card introduces a heavy-duty 3.1-slot heatsink design coupled with three premium Axial-tech fans operating on dual ball bearings. The two side fans spin counterclockwise to eliminate internal air turbulence and forcefully push clean air directly through the massive cooling fin stack. Integrated 0dB technology fully silences the entire fan array when the GPU core falls under 50°C, providing total acoustic silence during everyday office work. Completed with a rigid aluminum exoskeleton frame to prevent PCB warping, dual PWM FanConnect II headers to synchronize chassis fans directly to the card’s thermal state, and a digital power delivery network featuring ultra-reliable 15K capacitors, it remains a robust foundation for elite, high-performance desktop arrays.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Ti (AD106)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>4,352 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Default Mode)</td><td>Boost Clock: 2685 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Boost Clock: 2715 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>AI Computing Performance</td><td>374 AI TOPS</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Video Memory Configuration</td><td>8GB GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>18 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Interface Width</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Bus Architecture</td><td>PCI Express 4.0 x8 (Physical x16 form factor)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>$7680 \\times 4320$ (8K Ultra HD Support)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Multi-Display Capability</td><td>Quad Display (Supports up to 4 concurrent monitors)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>HDCP Compliant</td><td>Yes (Version 2.3)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Interface</td><td>1x Native HDMI 2.1a</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>DisplayPort Interface</td><td>3x Native DisplayPort 1.4a</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Estimated Power Consumption</td><td>~160W TDP</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Recommended System PSU</td><td>650W or higher</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>1x 8-pin PCIe Power Cable</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>DirectX Support</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>311.4 x 133.5 x 61.9 mm (12.26 x 5.26 x 2.44 inches)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Form Factor Slot Width</td><td>3.1-Slot Profile (Requires large chassis clearance)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>System Cooling</td><td>Triple Axial-tech Fans with Reverse Rotation &amp; 0dB Tech</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Extra Engineering</td><td>2x PWM FanConnect II Headers &amp; Aura Sync ARGB Lighting</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Product Warranty</td><td>3 Years Limited Replacement Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/IqkGTkL0v1CJhOSX8hMzeO29aoAsOnt5agxUTCSN.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 19:22:18', '2026-07-12 19:22:18', 'Meta Title: ASUS ROG Strix GeForce RTX 4060 Ti 8GB GDDR6 OC Edition', 'Meta Description: Get flagship cooling with the ASUS ROG Strix GeForce RTX 4060 Ti OC Edition. Features a massive 3.1-slot heatsink, triple Axial-tech fans, DLSS 3, and customizable Aura Sync RGB.', 'Keywords: ROG-STRIX-RTX4060TI-O8G-GAMING price, ASUS ROG Strix RTX 4060 Ti 8GB, RTX 4060 Ti OC Edition, premium triple fan GPU, Aura Sync graphics card, NVIDIA Ada Lovelace BD', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1330, 'ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER EVO OC Edition 12GB GDDR6X Graphics Card', 'The ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER EVO OC Edition 12GB GDDR6X fuses high-end graphics processing with \"SFF-Ready\" case compatibility. Powered by the ultra-efficient NVIDIA Ada Lovelace architecture, it features a space-saving 22.7 cm length and a highly adaptable 2.5-slot profile. Armed with twin flagship Axial-tech fans, an armor-grade structural backplate, a massive 578 AI TOPS of neural performance headroom, and cutting-edge DLSS 3 frame generation, it is custom-built to deliver elite 1440p and entry-tier 4K gaming experiences in smaller desktop layouts.', 'asus-dual-geforce-rtx-4070-super-evo-oc-edition-12gb-gddr6x-graphics-card-1783884321', '<p>The ASUS Dual GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER EVO OC Edition 12GB GDDR6X stands as a masterclass in space-optimized engineering, bringing heavy-duty graphic muscle without the traditional footprint tax. Anchored by the 5nm NVIDIA Ada Lovelace architecture, this card is significantly enhanced over the standard non-SUPER variant, deploying a massive 7,168 CUDA cores paired with high-speed GDDR6X memory running across a 192-bit bus. It utilizes 4th Generation Tensor Cores to output up to 578 AI TOPS, scaling system framerates up to 4x using DLSS 3 neural rendering, alongside 3rd Generation RT Cores that deliver highly realistic real-time ray-traced shadows and environments. Factory-overclocked right out of the box, it reaches a boosted clock speed of up to 2550 MHz in OC Mode to process intense multi-threaded workloads seamlessly.</p><p>To manage its substantial 220W power target while retaining high compatibility inside compact or small-form-factor (SFF) cases, the EVO model implements an advanced dual-fan thermal framework. Twin premium Axial-tech fans feature a smaller central hub to accommodate longer blades, bounded by an integrated outer barrier ring that actively pushes high-pressure downward airflow through the cooling fin stacks. Built using precision Auto-Extreme automated soldering to eliminate structural points of failure, the card is wrapped in a protective backplate that adds exceptional mechanical rigidity. Complete with a hardware Dual BIOS toggle to instantly prioritize icy thermal temperatures or a whisper-quiet noise profile, and intelligent 0dB silencing technology that stops the fans completely during light web navigation or media workloads, it remains a robust foundation for clean, space-conscious desktop configurations.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER (AD104-350)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>7,168 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Default Mode)</td><td>Boost Clock: 2520 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Boost Clock: 2550 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>AI Performance Room</td><td>578 AI TOPS</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Video Memory Configuration</td><td>12GB GDDR6X</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>21 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Interface Width</td><td>192-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Bandwidth</td><td>504.2 GB/s</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>$7680 \\times 4320$ (8K Ultra HD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Maximum Display Outputs</td><td>Quad Display Support (Up to 4 concurrent monitors)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>HDCP Compliant</td><td>Yes (Version 2.3)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Interface</td><td>1x Native HDMI 2.1a</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>DisplayPort Interface</td><td>3x Native DisplayPort 1.4a</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Maximum Board Power (TDP)</td><td>220W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Recommended System PSU</td><td>750W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>1x 16-pin PCIe (12VHPWR) Cable</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>DirectX Support</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>227.2 x 123.24 x 49.6 mm (8.94 x 4.85 x 1.95 inches)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Form Factor Slot Width</td><td>2.5-Slot Profile (SFF-Ready Enthusiast Card)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Cooling Engineering</td><td>Dual Axial-tech Fans with Dual Ball Bearings &amp; 0dB Tech</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Product Warranty</td><td>3 Years Limited Replacement Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;configurations.</p>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/BEs9bUCcosoAa1fL26C9cVeWtTF0Zem6nkYQJVTi.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 19:25:21', '2026-07-12 19:25:21', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1331, 'ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 5070 12GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'The ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 5070 12GB GDDR7 OC Edition represents the pinnacle of mainstream durability and next-generation graphics performance. Powered by the groundbreaking NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, it pairs ultra-fast GDDR7 memory running on a 192-bit bus with a massive 988 AI TOPS of neural processing power. Outfitted with a heavy-duty 3.125-slot diecast exoskeleton, three upgraded Axial-tech fans, and military-grade 5K black metallic capacitors, this factory-overclocked beast delivers ultimate 1440p and 4K gaming stability alongside smooth, high-fidelity AI creator workflows.', 'asus-tuf-gaming-geforce-rtx-5070-12gb-gddr7-oc-edition-graphics-card-1783884437', '<p>The ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 5070 12GB GDDR7 OC Edition fuses industrial-grade component longevity with the cutting edge of modern neural computing. Anchored by the state-of-the-art 5nm NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, this graphics card features 5th Generation Tensor Cores and 4th Generation Ray Tracing Cores. This hardware foundation enables elite processing capabilities, including real-time AI-enhanced graphics via NVIDIA DLSS 4 Multi Frame Generation and ultra-responsive competitive performance using NVIDIA Reflex 2 with Frame Warp. Factory-overclocked right out of the box, it reaches a boosted clock speed of up to 2640 MHz in OC Mode to process demanding computational tasks seamlessly.</p><p>Thermal stability and long-term mechanical reliability are core tenets of the TUF Gaming philosophy. The card implements an extensive 3.125-slot cooling array paired with a specialized phase-change GPU thermal pad that far outlasts traditional thermal paste. Airflow is driven by three scaled-up Axial-tech fans spinning on dual ball bearings, which push up to 31% more air volume through the dense heatsink assembly. The two outer fans rotate counterclockwise to eliminate localized air turbulence, while integrated 0dB ambient silencing technology drops fan speeds to a complete halt whenever the GPU core operates below 50°C. Wrapped in a rugged aluminum vented backplate to stop PCB flex and built using automated Auto-Extreme&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 (Blackwell)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>6,144 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Default Mode)</td><td>Boost Clock: 2610 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Boost Clock: 2640 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>AI Computing Performance</td><td>988 AI TOPS</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Video Memory Configuration</td><td>128GB GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>28 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Interface Width</td><td>192-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Bus Standard / Interface</td><td>PCI Express 5.0</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>$7680 \\times 4320$ (8K Ultra HD Support)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Maximum Display Connections</td><td>Quad Display Support (Up to 4 concurrent monitors)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>HDCP Version Support</td><td>Yes (Version 2.3)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Interface</td><td>2x Native HDMI 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>DisplayPort Interface</td><td>3x Native DisplayPort 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Recommended System PSU</td><td>750W (Based on fully configured rigs)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>1x 16-pin PCIe (12VHPWR / 12V-2x6) Cable</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>DirectX Support</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>329 x 140 x 62.5 mm (12.95 x 5.51 x 2.46 inches)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Form Factor Slot Width</td><td>3.125-Slot Profile (Requires large chassis clearance)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>System Cooling</td><td>3x Axial-tech Fans, MaxContact Tech, Phase-Change Pad</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Structural Enhancements</td><td>Rigid Metal Exoskeleton, Vented Backplate, GPU Guard</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics</strong></td><td>Lighting Ecosystem</td><td>ASUS Aura Sync ARGB Profile Integration</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Product Warranty</td><td>3 Years Limited Replacement Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/vJBqskMKwaXj0pS38o5QtZOxhkZ9eKw5vL8xRJHk.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 19:27:17', '2026-07-12 19:27:17', 'Meta Title: ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 5070 12GB GDDR7 OC Edition', 'Meta Description: Buy the heavy-duty ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 5070 12GB GDDR7 OC Edition. Built on NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, featuring triple Axial-tech fans, DLSS 4, and 988 AI TOPS.', 'Keywords: TUF-RTX5070-O12G-GAMING price, ASUS TUF RTX 5070 OC Edition, GeForce RTX 5070 GDDR7, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, DLSS 4 graphics card, military-grade triple fan GPU Bangladesh', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1332, 'ASUS ROG Strix GeForce RTX 5070 12GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'The ASUS ROG Strix GeForce RTX 5070 12GB GDDR7 OC Edition represents the absolute pinnacle of mainstream graphics performance and thermal engineering. Driven by the groundbreaking NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, it combines ultra-fast GDDR7 memory running at 28 Gbps with a massive 988 AI TOPs of neural processing power. Featuring a flagship 3.2-slot heatsink design, a structural MaxContact vapor chamber, triple upgraded Axial-tech fans, and brilliant Aura Sync ARGB lighting, this factory-overclocked powerhouse delivers uncompromising 1440p and 4K gaming frames with flawless thermal stability.', 'asus-rog-strix-geforce-rtx-5070-12gb-gddr7-oc-edition-graphics-card-1783884518', '<p>The ASUS ROG Strix GeForce RTX 5070 12GB GDDR7 OC Edition stands as an elite, no-compromise enthusiast variant designed to extract maximum processing headroom from the GPU core. Built on the next-generation 5nm NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, it completely revitalizes system workflows by deploying 5th Generation Tensor Cores and 4th Generation Ray Tracing Cores. This foundational upgrade fuels advanced neural frameworks, running real-time cinematic ray tracing via breakthrough neural rendering, delivering ultra-fluid frame updates through NVIDIA DLSS 4 Multi Frame Generation, and slashing system response lag with NVIDIA Reflex 2 Frame Warp. Factory-tuned right out of the box, the card achieves a screaming boosted core clock of up to 2685 MHz in OC Mode to process heavy computational loads seamlessly.</p><p>To reliably handle sustained gaming marathons and creative pipelines, the card implements a massive 33.2 cm triple-fan cooling framework. Central to its cooling capacity is the MaxContact vapor chamber combined with a high-end phase-change GPU thermal pad that directly optimizes structural heat transfer. Airflow is driven by three scaled-up Axial-tech fans that spin on dual ball bearings to deliver up to 31% more air volume. The outer fans utilize reverse-rotation engineering to minimize localized air turbulence, while intelligent 0dB technology fully halts all fan movement whenever the core temperature drops under 50°C for whisper-quiet everyday productivity. Complete with a heavy-duty vented exoskeleton frame, dual PWM FanConnect II headers to slave case airflow directly to the GPU, a protective PCB coating against dust and moisture, and an institutional physical Dual BIOS switch, it serves as the ultimate centerpoint for top-tier desktop environments.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 (Blackwell)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>6,144 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Default Mode)</td><td>Boost Clock: 2655 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Boost Clock: 2685 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>AI Computing Performance</td><td>988 AI TOPs</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Video Memory Configuration</td><td>128GB GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>28 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Interface Width</td><td>192-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Bus Standard / Interface</td><td>PCI Express 5.0</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>$7680 \\times 4320$ (8K Ultra HD Support)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Maximum Display Connections</td><td>Quad Display Support (Up to 4 concurrent monitors)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>HDCP Version Support</td><td>Yes (Version 2.3)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Interface</td><td>2x Native HDMI 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>DisplayPort Interface</td><td>3x Native DisplayPort 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Recommended System PSU</td><td>750W (Based on fully configured rigs)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>1x 16-pin PCIe (12VHPWR / 12V-2x6) Cable</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>DirectX Support</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>332 x 147.3 x 64 mm (13.07 x 5.79 x 2.52 inches)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Form Factor Slot Width</td><td>3.2-Slot Profile (Requires extensive clearance)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Cooling Solution</td><td>Triple Axial-tech Fans, MaxContact Vapor Chamber, Dual BIOS</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Extra Engineering Features</td><td>2x FanConnect II Headers, Protective PCB Coating, Aura Sync</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Product Warranty</td><td>3 Years Limited Replacement Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/K2lKKHI63dxzCNGCfuL086OjIawldsePju6tVxWC.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 19:28:38', '2026-07-12 19:28:38', 'Meta Title: ASUS ROG Strix GeForce RTX 5070 12GB GDDR7 OC Edition', 'Meta Description: Buy the flagship ASUS ROG Strix GeForce RTX 5070 12GB GDDR7 OC Edition. Features NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, triple Axial-tech fans, DLSS 4, and 988 AI TOPs.', 'Keywords: ROG-STRIX-RTX5070-O12G-GAMING price, ASUS ROG Strix RTX 5070 OC, GeForce RTX 5070 GDDR7, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, DLSS 4 graphics card, elite triple fan GPU Bangladesh', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1333, 'ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 4070 Ti 12GB GDDR6X Graphics Card', 'The ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 4070 Ti 12GB GDDR6X pairs military-grade hardware durability with premium high-refresh 1440p and entry-level 4K gaming performance. Powered by the high-efficiency NVIDIA Ada Lovelace architecture, it features a massive 3.25-slot structural design cooled by three scaled-up Axial-tech fans spinning on dual ball bearings. Outfitted with heavy-duty 20K military capacitors, a vented structural aluminum exoskeleton, and 671 AI TOPS of neural processing power, it delivers rock-solid thermal and electric stability for intensive gaming and professional creator rigs.', 'asus-tuf-gaming-geforce-rtx-4070-ti-12gb-gddr6x-graphics-card-1783884538', '<p>he ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 4070 Ti 12GB GDDR6X is built to deliver uncompromising structural endurance and high-end graphical computing. Grounded on the 5nm NVIDIA Ada Lovelace architecture, this graphics card introduces massive performance enhancements by leveraging 4th Generation Tensor Cores to scale frame rates up to 4x via DLSS 3 Frame Generation, alongside 3rd Generation RT Cores that handle incredibly immersive real-time ray-traced lighting and reflections. Backed by 12GB of high-speed GDDR6X VRAM on a 192-bit bus, it provides ample texture buffering headroom to seamlessly manage intensive 3D rendering pipelines in Blender, 4K video editing timelines, and modern heavy AAA titles.</p><p>True to the TUF Gaming lineage, structural integrity and thermal mastery sit at the core of this card’s design. The GPU utilizes a massive 30.5 cm layout containing a deep 3.25-slot heatsink array. Airflow is generated by three specialized Axial-tech fans that have been scaled up to propel 21% more air volume through the dense cooling fins. The two outer fans feature counter-rotational engineering to completely eliminate internal localized air turbulence, while intelligent 0dB technology drops fan speeds to an absolute halt whenever the GPU core drops below 50°C for near-silent everyday multitasking. Assembled via the fully automated Auto-Extreme manufacturing process to ensure clean solder joints, reinforced with a rigid metal frame to entirely eliminate PCB sag, and fitted with premium capacitors rated for 20,000 hours at 105°C, it remains a highly reliable foundation for high-tier workstation environments.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 Ti (AD104)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>7,680 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Default Mode)</td><td>Boost Clock: 2610 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Boost Clock: 2640 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>AI Computing Performance</td><td>671 AI TOPS</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Video Memory Configuration</td><td>12GB GDDR6X</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>21 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Interface Width</td><td>192-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Bus Standard / Interface</td><td>PCI Express 4.0 x16</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>$7680 \\times 4320$ (8K Ultra HD Support)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Maximum Display Connections</td><td>Quad Display Support (Up to 4 concurrent monitors)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>HDCP Version Support</td><td>Yes (Version 2.3)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Interface</td><td>2x Native HDMI 2.1a</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>DisplayPort Interface</td><td>3x Native DisplayPort 1.4a</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Estimated Power Draw (TDP)</td><td>~285W under full load</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Recommended System PSU</td><td>750W (Based on fully configured rigs)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>1x 16-pin PCIe (12VHPWR) Cable</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>DirectX Support</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>305 x 138 x 65 mm (12.0 x 5.4 x 2.6 inches)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Form Factor Slot Width</td><td>3.25-Slot Profile (Requires large chassis clearance)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Cooling Solution</td><td>3x Axial-tech Fans, Dual Ball Bearings, 0dB Quiet Tech</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Structural / Aesthetic</strong></td><td>Rugged Exoskeleton</td><td>Metal Vented Backplate, 20K Component Caps, Aura Sync RGB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Product Warranty</td><td>3 Years Limited Replacement Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'as', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/6Bqg6yn1mJlW7v6y96HVOVACUMLUWEUlfYRt1sbR.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 19:28:58', '2026-07-12 19:30:41', 'Meta Title: ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 4070 Ti 12GB GDDR6X Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Get industrial-grade durability with the ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 4070 Ti 12GB GDDR6X. Features a rigid metal exoskeleton, triple Axial-tech fans, DLSS 3, and 671 AI TOPS.', 'Keywords: TUF-RTX4070TI-12G-GAMING price, ASUS TUF RTX 4070 Ti 12GB, GeForce RTX 4070 Ti GDDR6X, Ada Lovelace GPU, DLSS 3 graphics card, military grade triple fan GPU', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1334, 'Asus ProArt GeForce RTX 4070 Ti OC Edition 12GB GDDR6X Graphics Card', 'The ASUS ProArt GeForce RTX 4070 Ti OC Edition 12GB GDDR6X masterfully blends full-scale gaming performance with a elegant, minimalist style tailored for content creators. Powered by the high-efficiency NVIDIA Ada Lovelace architecture, it packs a robust 12GB GDDR6X frame buffer and a premium triple-fan array into a highly compatible, compact 2.5-slot profile. Custom-built to be \"SFF-Ready\" for small-form-factor builds, this factory-overclocked card provides 671 AI TOPS of neural acceleration to supercharge heavy 3D rendering, video editing, and modern AAA gaming layouts.', 'asus-proart-geforce-rtx-4070-ti-oc-edition-12gb-gddr6x-graphics-card-1783884708', '<p>The ASUS ProArt GeForce RTX 4070 Ti OC Edition 12GB GDDR6X is engineered specifically to eliminate creative boundaries while fitting seamlessly into clean, professional desktop workstations. Driven by the 5nm NVIDIA Ada Lovelace architecture, it leverages 4th Generation Tensor Cores to scale frame rates up to 4x via DLSS 3 neural rendering, alongside 3rd Generation RT Cores that deliver highly detailed real-time ray-traced lighting and reflections. With 12GB of ultra-fast GDDR6X memory running over a 192-bit interface, it offers massive rendering bandwidth to accelerate timeline scrubbacks in Premiere Pro, asset compilation in Unreal Engine, and dense viewport rendering in Blender.</p><p>To maintain perfect cooling performance within a space-saving 30 cm layout, the ProArt card deploys a specialized triple-fan framework. Three advanced Axial-tech fans run on durable dual ball bearings, scaled up to propel 21% more air volume through the compact 2.5-slot heatsink array. The two outer side fans feature reverse-rotation engineering to minimize localized air turbulence, while intelligent 0dB ambient silencing technology drops fan speeds to a complete halt whenever the GPU core falls under 50°C for whisper-quiet everyday productivity. Manufactured using precision Auto-Extreme automated soldering to eliminate thermal weak points and rounded out with a premium digital power delivery matrix using 15K capacitors, it serves as a rock-solid, minimalist anchor for high-tier professional build setups.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 Ti (AD104)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>7,680 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Default Mode)</td><td>Boost Clock: 2730 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Boost Clock: 2760 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>AI Computing Performance</td><td>671 AI TOPS</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Video Memory Configuration</td><td>12GB GDDR6X</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>21 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Interface Width</td><td>192-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Bus Architecture Standard</td><td>PCI Express 4.0 x16</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>$7680 \\times 4320$ (8K Ultra HD Support)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Maximum Display Connections</td><td>Quad Display Support (Up to 4 concurrent monitors)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>HDCP Version Support</td><td>Yes (Version 2.3)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Interface</td><td>1x Native HDMI 2.1a</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>DisplayPort Interface</td><td>3x Native DisplayPort 1.4a</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Estimated Power Draw (TDP)</td><td>~285W under full load</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Recommended System PSU</td><td>750W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>1x 16-pin PCIe (12VHPWR) Cable</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>DirectX Support</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>300 x 120 x 50 mm (11.81 x 4.72 x 1.97 inches)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Form Factor Slot Width</td><td>2.5-Slot Profile (SFF-Ready Enclosure Compatible)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>System Cooling</td><td>Triple Axial-tech Fans, Dual Ball Bearings, 0dB Quiet Tech</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Product Warranty</td><td>3 Years Limited Replacement Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/jBWff9jtTy3IA622ethwbAD9mz3PPQpZVtzCqgyb.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 19:31:48', '2026-07-12 19:31:48', 'Meta Title: ASUS ProArt GeForce RTX 4070 Ti OC Edition 12GB GDDR6X Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Buy the ASUS ProArt GeForce RTX 4070 Ti OC Edition. Features a compact 2.5-slot design, triple Axial-tech fans, 12GB GDDR6X, and 671 AI TOPS for elite content creators.', 'Keywords: PROART-RTX4070TI-O12G price, ASUS ProArt RTX 4070 Ti OC, 12GB GDDR6X creator GPU, NVIDIA Ada Lovelace graphics card, SFF Ready 4070 Ti desktop PC', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1335, 'ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 4070 Ti SUPER 16GB GDDR6X White OC Edition Graphics Card', 'The ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 4070 Ti SUPER 16GB GDDR6X White OC Edition brings elite performance and industrial-grade durability to pristine all-white desktop setups. Powered by the ultra-efficient NVIDIA Ada Lovelace architecture, it pairs an expansive 16GB GDDR6X frame buffer on a 256-bit bus with a massive 714 AI TOPS of neural computing power. Outfitted with three scaled-up Axial-tech fans, 20K military-grade capacitors, and a rigid, white-coated aluminum exoskeleton frame, this factory-overclocked powerhouse guarantees absolute reliability for high-end 1440p and 4K gaming arrays.', 'asus-tuf-gaming-geforce-rtx-4070-ti-super-16gb-gddr6x-white-oc-edition-graphics-card-1783884881', '<p>The ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 4070 Ti SUPER 16GB GDDR6X White OC Edition represents a flawless fusion of high-velocity architectural muscle and specialized aesthetic design. Anchored by the 5nm NVIDIA Ada Lovelace framework, this card features a major computational upgrade over its predecessor, utilizing 4th Generation Tensor Cores to scale system frame rates up to 4x via AI-driven DLSS 3 Frame Generation compared to raw brute-force rendering. Paired with 3rd Generation RT Cores, it executes incredibly realistic real-time ray-traced reflections and lighting. The expansive 16GB GDDR6X memory eliminates high-resolution texture streaming bottlenecks, allowing professional digital creators and gamers to fluidly process intensive generative AI tasks, large 3D model compiling in Blender, and multi-layered 4K video timelines.</p><p>True to the rugged TUF Gaming heritage, the card is wrapped in a snow-white diecast metal shroud and matching aluminum vented backplate to eliminate PCB flex and maximize thermal dissipation. Heat is continuously whisked away by three specialized, scaled-up Axial-tech fans spinning on dual ball bearings, which drive 21% more air volume through the massive 3.25-slot fin stack. The two side fans use reverse-rotational engineering to minimize localized air turbulence, while intelligent 0dB ambient technology drops fan speeds to a complete halt whenever the GPU core drops below 50°C for absolute acoustic silence during light workloads. Built using automated Auto-Extreme manufacturing precision to assure structural integrity and fitted with military-grade 20,000-hour capacitors, it serves as the ultimate premium foundation for heavy-duty, clean white desktop builds.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 Ti SUPER (AD103)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>8,448 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Default Mode)</td><td>Boost Clock: 2640 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Boost Clock: 2670 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>AI Computing Performance</td><td>714 AI TOPS</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Video Memory Configuration</td><td>16GB GDDR6X</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>21 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Interface Width</td><td>256-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Bandwidth</td><td>672.3 GB/s</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>$7680 \\times 4320$ (8K Ultra HD Support)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Maximum Display Connections</td><td>Quad Display Support (Up to 4 concurrent monitors)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>HDCP Version Support</td><td>Yes (Version 2.3)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Interface</td><td>2x Native HDMI 2.1a</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>DisplayPort Interface</td><td>3x Native DisplayPort 1.4a</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Estimated Power Consumption</td><td>~285W TDP</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Recommended System PSU</td><td>750W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>1x 16-pin PCIe (12VHPWR) Cable <i>(Standard Edition)</i></td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>DirectX Support</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>305 x 138 x 65 mm (12.0 x 5.43 x 2.55 inches)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Form Factor Slot Width</td><td>3.25-Slot Profile (Requires large chassis clearance)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Cooling Engineering</td><td>3x Axial-tech Fans, Reverse Rotation, 0dB Silent Tech</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics</strong></td><td>Shroud Style &amp; RGB</td><td>Matte White Coating with Aura Sync ARGB Profile Lighting</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Product Warranty</td><td>3 Years Limited Replacement Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/QWKDSCDb6XTrB8fwYVX24RZjMycZPuIAnxrSzhw7.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 19:34:41', '2026-07-12 19:34:41', 'Meta Title: ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 4070 Ti SUPER 16GB GDDR6X White OC Edition', 'Meta Description: Buy the ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 4070 Ti SUPER White OC Edition. Features an all-white military exoskeleton, 16GB GDDR6X VRAM, triple Axial-tech fans, and 714 AI TOPS.', 'Keywords: TUF-RTX4070TIS-O16G-WHITE-GAMING price, ASUS TUF RTX 4070 Ti SUPER White, White OC Edition GPU, 16GB 