hite graphics card, Ada Lovelace, white theme PC build Bangladesh', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1337, 'Asus ProArt GeForce RTX 5070 Ti OC Edition 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The ASUS ProArt GeForce RTX 5070 Ti OC Edition 16GB GDDR7 seamlessly combines elite next-generation architecture with a refined, minimalist aesthetic designed for creative professionals. Powered by the ultra-efficient NVIDIA Blackwell framework, it maps a massive 16GB of high-speed GDDR7 memory across a wide 256-bit bus. Outfitted with an integrated creator-centric USB Type-C port, premium triple Axial-tech fans, a heavy-duty vapor chamber, and an SFF-Ready 2.5-slot enclosure, it handles intensive 3D rendering pipelines, generative AI networks, and fluid 4K gaming arrays with total silence.', 'asus-proart-geforce-rtx-5070-ti-oc-edition-16gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783885057', '<p>he ASUS ProArt GeForce RTX 5070 Ti OC Edition 16GB GDDR7 is meticulously engineered to eliminate creative boundaries while merging cleanly into minimalist professional workstations. Driven by the groundbreaking NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, this graphics accelerator introduces substantial generation-over-generation upgrades by utilizing 5th Generation Tensor Cores and 4th Generation Ray Tracing Cores. These processing components scale complex computational workloads smoothly, fueling neural pipelines via NVIDIA DLSS 4 Multi Frame Generation and accelerating advanced digital editing environments. With 16GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory hitting an effective 28 Gbps, it delivers exceptional asset bandwidth to accelerate timeline scrubbacks in Premiere Pro, large-scale dataset modeling, and dense viewport compilation in Blender.</p><p>To maintain perfect cooling performance within its compact, space-saving 30.4 cm layout, the ProArt card deploys a state-of-the-art thermal framework. A massive structural MaxContact vapor chamber combined with an industrial phase-change GPU thermal pad optimizes physical heat transfer away from the core components. Airflow is continuously driven by three advanced Axial-tech fans running on durable dual ball bearings, scaled up to maximize downward air pressure through a compact 2.5-slot heatsink stack. An integrated native USB Type-C output provides seamless plug-and-play connectivity for creative drawing tablets and specialized production displays. Completed with automated Auto-Extreme assembly precision and an institutional physical Dual BIOS toggle, it serves as a rock-solid, fut</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 Ti (Blackwell)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>8,960 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Default Mode)</td><td>Boost Clock: 2588 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Boost Clock: 2610 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Architecture Architecture</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell Architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Video Memory Configuration</td><td>16GB GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>28 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Interface Width</td><td>256-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Bus Standard / Interface</td><td>PCI Express 5.0 x16</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>$7680 \\times 4320$ (8K Ultra HD Support)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Maximum Display Connections</td><td>Quad Display Support (Up to 4 concurrent monitors)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>HDCP Version Support</td><td>Yes (Version 2.3)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Interface</td><td>1x Native HDMI 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>DisplayPort Interface</td><td>2x Native DisplayPort 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>USB Type-C Port</td><td>1x Native USB-C Display Output</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Estimated Power Consumption</td><td>~300W TDP</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Recommended System PSU</td><td>850W (Based on fully configured rigs)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>1x 16-pin PCIe (12VHPWR / 12V-2x6) Cable</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>DirectX Support</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>304 x 126 x 50 mm (12.0 x 4.96 x 1.97 inches)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Form Factor Slot Width</td><td>2.5-Slot Profile (SFF-Ready Compatible)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Cooling Engineering</td><td>Triple Axial-tech Fans, Vapor Chamber, Phase-Change Pad</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Product Warranty</td><td>3 Years Limited Replacement Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/oAT6nLbeIPApRosZqidXPtIsHGJpu4u3NlcMzC50.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 19:37:37', '2026-07-12 19:37:37', 'Meta Title: ASUS ProArt GeForce RTX 5070 Ti OC Edition 16GB GDDR7', 'Meta Description: Buy the ASUS ProArt GeForce RTX 5070 Ti OC Edition. Featuring NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 16GB GDDR7 memory, a built-in USB Type-C port, and a sleek 2.5-slot profile for elite creators.', 'Keywords: PROART-RTX5070TI-O16G price, ASUS ProArt RTX 5070 Ti OC, 16GB GDDR7 Creator GPU, NVIDIA Blackwell graphics card, SFF Ready 5070 Ti desktop PC, USB-C graphics card', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1338, 'ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16GB GDDR7 White OC Edition Graphics Card', 'The ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16GB GDDR7 White OC Edition brings elite performance and industrial-grade durability to pristine all-white desktop setups. Powered by the high-efficiency NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, it pairs an expansive 16GB buffer of next-generation GDDR7 memory on a wide 256-bit bus with a massive 1,484 AI TOPS of computational power. Outfitted with three scaled-up Axial-tech fans, 5K black metallic capacitors, a phase-change thermal pad, and a rigid, white-coated structural exoskeleton frame, this factory-overclocked powerhouse delivers ultimate 4K gaming stability and heavy-duty creator workflows.', 'asus-tuf-gaming-geforce-rtx-5070-ti-16gb-gddr7-white-oc-edition-graphics-card-1783885388', '<p>The ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16GB GDDR7 White OC Edition represents a flawless fusion of high-velocity architectural muscle and specialized aesthetic design. Anchored by the next-generation NVIDIA Blackwell framework, this card features a major computational generational upgrade, utilizing 5th Generation Tensor Cores to unlock advanced neural rendering technologies like NVIDIA DLSS 4 with Multi Frame Generation and latency-slashing Reflex 2 with Frame Warp. Backed by 4th Generation Ray Tracing Cores built for Mega Geometry, it drives incredibly immersive real-time ray-traced visuals. The expansive 16GB GDDR7 memory running at an effective 28 Gbps completely eliminates high-resolution texture streaming bottlenecks, allowing digital creators and gamers to fluidly process intensive generative AI tasks, large 3D model compiling, and complex multi-layered rendering pipelines.</p><p>True to the rugged TUF Gaming heritage, the card is wrapped in a snow-white diecast metal shroud and matching aluminum vented backplate to eliminate PCB flex and maximize thermal dissipation. Heat is continuously managed by a deep 3.125-slot heatsink stack and a high-end phase-change GPU thermal pad that directly optimizes structural heat transfer. Airflow is driven by three specialized, scaled-up Axial-tech fans spinning on dual ball bearings, propelling more air volume through the cooling fins. The two side fans use reverse-rotational engineering to minimize localized air turbulence, while intelligent 0dB ambient technology drops fan speeds to a complete halt whenever the GPU core falls below 50°C for absolute acoustic silence during light office work. Fully assembled using automated Auto-Extreme precision and fitted with military-grade 5,000-hour capacitors, it serves as the ultimate premium foundation for heavy-duty, clean white desktop builds.</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 Ti</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>8,960 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Default Mode)</td><td>Boost Clock: 2588 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Boost Clock: 2610 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>AI Computing Performance</td><td>1,484 AI TOPS</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Video Memory Configuration</td><td>16GB GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>28 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Interface Width</td><td>256-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Bandwidth</td><td>896 GB/s</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>$7680 \\times 4320$ (8K Ultra HD Support)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Maximum Display Connections</td><td>Quad Display Support (Up to 4 concurrent monitors)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>HDCP Version Support</td><td>Yes (Version 2.3)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Interface</td><td>2x Native HDMI 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>DisplayPort Interface</td><td>3x Native DisplayPort 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Estimated Power Consumption</td><td>~300W TDP</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Recommended System PSU</td><td>850W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>1x 16-pin PCIe (12VHPWR / 12V-2x6) Cable</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>DirectX Support</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>329 x 140 x 62.5 mm (12.95 x 5.51 x 2.46 inches)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Form Factor Slot Width</td><td>3.125-Slot Profile (Requires large chassis clearance)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Cooling Engineering</td><td>3x Axial-tech Fans, Reverse Rotation, Phase-Change Pad</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Structural / Aesthetic</strong></td><td>Rugged Exoskeleton Features</td><td>White-Coated Metal Vented Backplate, 5K Caps, Aura Sync RGB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Product Warranty</td><td>3 Years Limited Replacement Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/2Zf4VU0zU7PyCXPXZ8hZkZ7YxBAq83sdqAHa187N.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 19:43:08', '2026-07-12 19:43:08', 'Meta Title: ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16GB GDDR7 White OC Edition', 'Meta Description: Buy the premium ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 5070 Ti White OC Edition. Features an industrial white metal exoskeleton, 16GB GDDR7 memory, triple Axial-tech fans, and 1,484 AI TOPS.', 'Keywords: TUF-RTX5070TI-O16G-WHITE-GAMING price, ASUS TUF RTX 5070 Ti White OC, GeForce RTX 5070 Ti GDDR7, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, DLSS 4 graphics card, white theme heavy-duty GPU Bangladesh', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1339, 'ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 4080 SUPER 16GB GDDR6X OC Edition Graphics Card', 'The ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 4080 SUPER 16GB GDDR6X OC Edition balances absolute industrial endurance with top-tier desktop performance. Built on NVIDIA\'s high-efficiency Ada Lovelace architecture, it pairs a massive 16GB buffer of ultra-fast GDDR6X memory on a wide 256-bit bus with 855 AI TOPS of computational power. Outfitted with three scaled-up Axial-tech fans pushing 23% more airflow, premium 20K military-grade capacitors, and a rigid diecast aluminum exoskeleton, this factory-overclocked card easily dominates high-refresh 1440p and competitive 4K gaming arrays.', 'asus-tuf-gaming-geforce-rtx-4080-super-16gb-gddr6x-oc-edition-graphics-card-1783885483', '<p>The <strong>ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 4080 SUPER 16GB GDDR6X OC Edition</strong> balances absolute industrial endurance with top-tier desktop performance. Built on NVIDIA\'s high-efficiency Ada Lovelace architecture, it pairs a massive 16GB buffer of ultra-fast GDDR6X memory on a wide 256-bit bus with 855 AI TOPS of computational power. Outfitted with three scaled-up Axial-tech fans pushing 23% more airflow, premium 20K military-grade capacitors, and a rigid diecast aluminum exoskeleton, this factory-overclocked card easily dominates high-refresh 1440p and competitive 4K gaming arrays.&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4080 SUPER (AD103-400)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>10,240 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Default Mode)</td><td>Boost Clock: 2610 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Boost Clock: 2640 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>AI Computing Performance</td><td>855 AI TOPS</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Video Memory Configuration</td><td>16GB GDDR6X</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>23 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Interface Width</td><td>256-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Bandwidth</td><td>736.3 GB/s</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>$7680 \\times 4320$ (8K Ultra HD Support)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Maximum Display Connections</td><td>Quad Display Support (Up to 4 concurrent monitors)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>HDCP Version Support</td><td>Yes (Version 2.3)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Interface</td><td>2x Native HDMI 2.1a</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>DisplayPort Interface</td><td>3x Native DisplayPort 1.4a</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Estimated Power Consumption</td><td>~320W TDP</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Recommended System PSU</td><td>850W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>1x 16-pin PCIe (12VHPWR) Cable</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>DirectX Support</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>348.2 x 150 x 72.6 mm (13.7 x 5.9 x 2.9 inches)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Form Factor Slot Width</td><td>3.65-Slot Profile (Requires large chassis clearance)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Cooling Engineering</td><td>3x Axial-tech Fans, Reverse Rotation, 0dB Silent Tech</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Structural / Aesthetic</strong></td><td>Rugged Exoskeleton Features</td><td>Metal Vented Backplate, 20K Capacitor Specs, Aura Sync ARGB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Product Warranty</td><td>3 Years Limited Replacement Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/ifzW1EyI1PDlUCs2PEDBS8dFR3WYzjQvY4l9ThZm.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 19:44:43', '2026-07-12 19:44:43', 'Meta Title: ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 4080 SUPER 16GB GDDR6X OC Edition', 'Meta Description: Buy the heavy-duty ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 4080 SUPER OC Edition. Features a rigid metal exoskeleton, 16GB GDDR6X VRAM, triple Axial-tech fans, and 855 AI TOPS.', 'Keywords: TUF-RTX4080S-O16G-GAMING price, ASUS TUF RTX 4080 SUPER OC, 16GB GDDR6X graphics card, Ada Lovelace GPU, flagship 4K gaming, military-grade GPU Bangladesh', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1340, 'Asus ROG Strix GeForce RTX 4080 SUPER 16GB GDDR6X OC Edition Graphics Card', 'The ASUS ROG Strix GeForce RTX 4080 SUPER 16GB GDDR6X OC Edition represents the absolute pinnacle of enthusiast-grade graphics performance and thermal engineering. Driven by NVIDIA\'s high-efficiency Ada Lovelace architecture, it pairs a massive 16GB buffer of ultra-fast GDDR6X memory with a brutal 3.5-slot cooling array. Boasting a screaming factory overclock of up to 2670 MHz, full Aura Sync ARGB lighting, a patented custom vapor chamber, and 865 AI TOPS of neural computing speed, it is custom-built to dominate competitive high-refresh 4K gaming arrays and professional creator workloads alike.', 'asus-rog-strix-geforce-rtx-4080-super-16gb-gddr6x-oc-edition-graphics-card-1783885565', '<p>vLong Description</p><p>The ASUS ROG Strix GeForce RTX 4080 SUPER 16GB GDDR6X OC Edition stands as an uncompromising masterpiece designed to extract every single ounce of processing headroom from the GPU core. Built on the 5nm NVIDIA Ada Lovelace framework, this card features a massive computational core expansion over standard graphics layouts, deploying 10,240 CUDA cores alongside 4th Generation Tensor Cores to scale framerates up to 4x via AI-driven DLSS 3 Frame Generation compared to traditional rendering. Backed by 3rd Generation RT Cores, it delivers stunningly realistic, real-time ray-traced reflections and global lighting. The expansive 16GB GDDR6X frame buffer running over a wide 256-bit bus completely eliminates data transmission bottlenecks, allowing modern digital creators, 3D animators, and data science engineers to fluidly execute massive local generative AI models, dense viewport rendering in Blender, and multi-layered 4K/8K video timelines.</p><p>ROG - ASUS+ 2</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>What elevates this ROG Strix flagship past standard cards is its chart-topping, institutional thermal layout. The card introduces a massive 35.7 cm structural chassis containing an enormous 3.5-slot heatsink matrix. At its baseline sits a patented custom vapor chamber featuring precision-milled pathways that allow heatpipes to sink in cleanly without being pressed flat, reducing core temperatures by up to 5°C under heavy thermal loads. Airflow is forcefully continuously driven by three scaled-up Axial-tech fans spinning on dual ball bearings to push 23% more air volume through the cooling array. The two outer fans feature reverse-rotational engineering to eliminate internal air turbulence, while intelligent 0dB ambient technology drops fan speeds to a complete stop whenever the GPU core falls below 50°C for absolute acoustic silence. Complete with dual PWM FanConnect II headers to synchronize chassis airflow directly to the GPU, a digital power delivery network featuring ultra-reliable 15K metallic capacitors, and an industrial-grade diecast metal exoskeleton frame, it remains the ultimate centerpiece for tier-one custom desktop environments.</p><p>ROG - ASUS</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Technical Specifications Table</h2><p>&nbsp;</p>', '<h3>Long Description</h3><p>The ASUS ROG Strix GeForce RTX 4080 SUPER 16GB GDDR6X OC Edition stands as an uncompromising masterpiece designed to extract every single ounce of processing headroom from the GPU core. Built on the 5nm NVIDIA Ada Lovelace framework, this card features a massive computational core expansion over standard graphics layouts, deploying 10,240 CUDA cores alongside 4th Generation Tensor Cores to scale framerates up to 4x via AI-driven DLSS 3 Frame Generation compared to traditional rendering. Backed by 3rd Generation RT Cores, it delivers stunningly realistic, real-time ray-traced reflections and global lighting. The expansive 16GB GDDR6X frame buffer running over a wide 256-bit bus completely eliminates data transmission bottlenecks, allowing modern digital creators, 3D animators, and data science engineers to fluidly execute massive local generative AI models, dense viewport rendering in Blender, and multi-layered 4K/8K video timelines.</p><p>ROG - ASUS+ 2</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>What elevates this ROG Strix flagship past standard cards is its chart-topping, institutional thermal layout. The card introduces a massive 35.7 cm structural chassis containing an enormous 3.5-slot heatsink matrix. At its baseline sits a patented custom vapor chamber featuring precision-milled pathways that allow heatpipes to sink in cleanly without being pressed flat, reducing core temperatures by up to 5°C under heavy thermal loads. Airflow is forcefully continuously driven by three scaled-up Axial-tech fans spinning on dual ball bearings to push 23% more air volume through the cooling array. The two outer fans feature reverse-rotational engineering to eliminate internal air turbulence, while intelligent 0dB ambient technology drops fan speeds to a complete stop whenever the GPU core falls below 50°C for absolute acoustic silence. Complete with dual PWM FanConnect II headers to synchronize chassis airflow directly to the GPU, a digital power delivery network featuring ultra-reliable 15K metallic capacitors, and an industrial-grade diecast metal exoskeleton frame, it remains the ultimate centerpiece for tier-one custom desktop environments.</p><p>ROG - ASUS</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Technical Specifications Table</h2><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification Details</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4080 SUPER (AD103-400)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>10,240 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Default Mode)</td><td>Boost Clock: 2640 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Boost Clock: 2670 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>AI Computing Performance</td><td>865 AI TOPS</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Video Memory Configuration</td><td>16GB GDDR6X</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>23 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Interface Width</td><td>256-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Bandwidth</td><td>736 GB/s</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>7680×4320 (8K Ultra HD Support)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Maximum Display Connections</td><td>Quad Display Support (Up to 4 concurrent monitors)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>HDCP Version Support</td><td>Yes (Version 2.3)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Interface</td><td>2x Native HDMI 2.1a</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>DisplayPort Interface</td><td>3x Native DisplayPort 1.4a</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Estimated Maximum Power (TDP)</td><td>~320W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Recommended System PSU</td><td>850W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>1x 16-pin PCIe (12VHPWR) Cable</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>DirectX Support</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>357.6 x 149.3 x 70.1 mm (14.07 x 5.87 x 2.75 inches)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Form Factor Slot Width</td><td>3.5-Slot Profile (Requires massive chassis clearance)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Cooling Engineering</td><td>Triple Axial-tech Fans, Patented Vapor Chamber, Reverse Rotation</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Extra Features</strong></td><td>Structural &amp; Customization</td><td>Vented Diecast Exoskeleton, 2x FanConnect II Headers, Aura Sync ARGB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Product Warranty</td><td>3 Years Limited Replacement Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/JkQzEq8nWsyvbBETxMIuPUIOcbQRgmdnxK7TCauM.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 19:46:05', '2026-07-12 19:46:05', 'Meta Title: ASUS ROG Strix GeForce RTX 4080 SUPER 16GB GDDR6X OC Edition', 'Meta Description: Unleash flagship gaming with the ASUS ROG Strix GeForce RTX 4080 SUPER OC Edition. Features a patented vapor chamber, triple Axial-tech fans, DLSS 3, and 865 AI TOPS.', 'Keywords: ROG-STRIX-RTX4080S-O16G-GAMING price, ASUS ROG Strix RTX 4080 SUPER 16GB, RTX 4080 SUPER OC Edition, ultra-premium triple fan GPU, Aura Sync ARGB graphics card, flagship 4K gaming desktop PC Bangladesh', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1341, 'ASUS ROG Strix GeForce RTX 4080 SUPER 16GB GDDR6X White OC Edition Graphics Card', 'The ASUS ROG Strix GeForce RTX 4080 SUPER 16GB GDDR6X White OC Edition brings flagship thermal engineering and an exquisite, snow-white cybernetic aesthetic to the enthusiast desktop space. Powered by NVIDIA\'s high-efficiency Ada Lovelace architecture, it pairs an expansive 16GB VRAM buffer with a massive 3.5-slot cooling array. Boasting a factory overclock of up to 2670 MHz, full Aura Sync ARGB lighting, a patented milled vapor chamber, and 865 AI TOPS of neural computing speed, it is custom-built to anchor elite, high-refresh 4K white-themed setups.', 'asus-rog-strix-geforce-rtx-4080-super-16gb-gddr6x-white-oc-edition-graphics-card-1783885637', '<p>The ASUS ROG Strix GeForce RTX 4080 SUPER 16GB GDDR6X White OC Edition stands as an uncompromising masterpiece designed to extract maximum performance from the GPU core while fulfilling the aesthetic demands of premium all-white builds. Grounded on the 5nm NVIDIA Ada Lovelace framework, this graphics card utilizes 10,240 CUDA cores alongside 4th Generation Tensor Cores to scale frame rates up to 4x via AI-driven DLSS 3 Frame Generation compared to traditional rendering. Backed by 3rd Generation RT Cores, it delivers stunningly realistic, real-time ray-traced lighting and reflections. The large 16GB GDDR6X frame buffer running over a wide 256-bit bus completely eliminates data bottlenecks, allowing modern digital creators, 3D animators, and data engineers to fluidly execute massive local generative AI models, dense viewport rendering in Blender, and multi-layered 4K/8K video timelines.</p><p>What elevates this ROG Strix flagship past standard cards is its chart-topping, institutional thermal layout wrapped in a matte white diecast shroud and structural exoskeleton. The card introduces a massive 35.7 cm long chassis containing an enormous 3.5-slot heatsink matrix. At its base sits a patented custom vapor chamber featuring precision-milled pathways that allow heatpipes to sink in cleanly without being pressed flat, reducing core temperatures by up to 5°C under heavy thermal loads. Airflow is driven by three scaled-up, white Axial-tech fans spinning on dual ball bearings to push 23% more air volume through the cooling array. The two outer fans feature reverse-rotational engineering to eliminate internal air turbulence, while intelligent 0dB ambient technology drops fan speeds to a complete stop whenever the GPU core falls below 50°C for absolute acoustic silence. Complete with dual PWM FanConnect II headers to synchronize chassis airflow directly to the GPU, a digital power delivery network featuring ultra-reliable 15K metallic capacitors, and a matching white structural graphics card holder, it remains the ultimate centerpiece for tier-one desktop environments.The ASUS ROG Strix GeForce RTX 4080 SUPER 16GB GDDR6X White OC Edition stands as an uncompromising masterpiece designed to extract maximum performance from the GPU core while fulfilling the aesthetic demands of premium all-white builds. Grounded on the 5nm NVIDIA Ada Lovelace framework, this graphics card utilizes 10,240 CUDA cores alongside 4th Generation Tensor Cores to scale frame rates up to 4x via AI-driven DLSS 3 Frame Generation compared to traditional rendering. Backed by 3rd Generation RT Cores, it delivers stunningly realistic, real-time ray-traced lighting and reflections. The large 16GB GDDR6X frame buffer running over a wide 256-bit bus completely eliminates data bottlenecks, allowing modern digital creators, 3D animators, and data engineers to fluidly execute massive local generative AI models, dense viewport rendering in Blender, and multi-layered 4K/8K video timelines.</p><p>What elevates this ROG Strix flagship past standard cards is its chart-topping, institutional thermal layout wrapped in a matte white diecast shroud and structural exoskeleton. The card introduces a massive 35.7 cm long chassis containing an enormous 3.5-slot heatsink matrix. At its base sits a patented custom vapor chamber featuring precision-milled pathways that allow heatpipes to sink in cleanly without being pressed flat, reducing core temperatures by up to 5°C under heavy thermal loads. Airflow is driven by three scaled-up, white Axial-tech fans spinning on dual ball bearings to push 23% more air volume through the cooling array. The two outer fans feature reverse-rotational engineering to eliminate internal air turbulence, while intelligent 0dB ambient technology drops fan speeds to a complete stop whenever the GPU core falls below 50°C for absolute acoustic silence. Complete with dual PWM FanConnect II headers to synchronize chassis airflow directly to the GPU, a digital power delivery network featuring ultra-reliable 15K metallic capacitors, and a matching white structural graphics card holder, it remains the ultimate centerpiece for tier-one desktop environments.The <strong>ASUS ROG Strix GeForce RTX 4080 SUPER 16GB GDDR6X White OC Edition</strong> brings flagship thermal engineering and an exquisite, snow-white cybernetic aesthetic to the enthusiast desktop space. Powered by NVIDIA\'s high-efficiency Ada Lovelace architecture, it pairs an expansive 16GB VRAM buffer with a massive 3.5-slot cooling array. Boasting a factory overclock of up to 2670 MHz, full Aura Sync ARGB lighting, a patented milled vapor chamber, and 865 AI TOPS of neural computing speed, it is custom-built to anchor elite, high-refresh 4K white-themed setups.</p><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4080 SUPER (AD103-400)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>10,240 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Default Mode)</td><td>Boost Clock: 2640 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Boost Clock: 2670 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>AI Computing Performance</td><td>865 AI TOPS</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Video Memory Configuration</td><td>16GB GDDR6X</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>23 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Interface Width</td><td>256-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Bandwidth</td><td>736 GB/s</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>$7680 \\times 4320$ (8K Ultra HD Support)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Maximum Display Connections</td><td>Quad Display Support (Up to 4 concurrent monitors)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>HDCP Version Support</td><td>Yes (Version 2.3)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Interface</td><td>2x Native HDMI 2.1a</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>DisplayPort Interface</td><td>3x Native DisplayPort 1.4a</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Estimated Maximum Power (TDP)</td><td>~320W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Recommended System PSU</td><td>850W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>1x 16-pin PCIe (12VHPWR) Cable</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>DirectX Support</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>357.6 x 149.3 x 70.1 mm (14.07 x 5.87 x 2.75 inches)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Form Factor Slot Width</td><td>3.5-Slot Profile (Requires massive chassis clearance)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Cooling Engineering</td><td>Triple White Axial-tech Fans, Patented Vapor Chamber, Reverse Rotation</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Extra Features</strong></td><td>Structural &amp; Customization</td><td>Vented Diecast White Exoskeleton, 2x FanConnect II, Aura Sync ARGB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Product Warranty</td><td>3 Years Limited Replacement Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/qjEYNZObi7c0eIXKLyQA3DYDZ5F7VpH3afFfjl5j.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 19:47:17', '2026-07-12 19:47:17', 'Meta Title: ASUS ROG Strix GeForce RTX 4080 SUPER 16GB White OC Edition', 'Meta Description: Shop the ultra-premium ASUS ROG Strix GeForce RTX 4080 SUPER White OC Edition. Featuring a patented vapor chamber, triple white Axial-tech fans, DLSS 3, and 865 AI TOPS.', 'Keywords: ROG-STRIX-RTX4080S-O16G-WHITE price, ASUS ROG Strix RTX 4080 SUPER White OC, 16GB GDDR6X white GPU, Ada Lovelace architecture, premium white theme PC build Bangladesh', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1342, 'ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 5080 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition Graphics Card', 'The ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 5080 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition represents the absolute cutting edge of industrial-grade durability and enthusiast graphics performance. Driven by the groundbreaking NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, it pairs 16GB of next-generation GDDR7 memory running at a blinding 30 Gbps with an incredible 1,858 AI TOPS of neural processing power. Outfitted with a massive 3.6-slot diecast exoskeleton, three upgraded Axial-tech fans, a heavy-duty vapor chamber, and military-grade 5K black metallic capacitors, this factory-overclocked juggernaut delivers ultimate 4K high-refresh gaming stability and massive computational workloads.', 'asus-tuf-gaming-geforce-rtx-5080-16gb-gddr7-oc-edition-graphics-card-1783885704', '<p>The ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 5080 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition fuses legendary component longevity with the vanguard of modern AI-driven computing. Anchored by the state-of-the-art 5nm NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, this graphics accelerator introduces staggering generational updates by deploying 5th Generation Tensor Cores and 4th Generation Ray Tracing Cores built for Mega Geometry. This architecture unlocks elite capabilities, including cinematic ray tracing via breakthrough neural rendering, real-time AI-enhanced graphics via NVIDIA DLSS 4 with Multi Frame Generation, and ultra-responsive competitive performance using NVIDIA Reflex 2 with Frame Warp. Factory-overclocked right out of the box, the card reaches a screaming boosted clock speed of up to 2730 MHz in OC Mode to smoothly tackle intense creative and local AI development rendering tasks.</p><p>Thermal mastery and permanent mechanical reliability sit at the absolute core of the TUF Gaming philosophy. The card implements an enormous 3.6-slot cooling array utilizing a high-end phase-change GPU thermal pad and a jumbo-sized MaxContact vapor chamber that increases structural surface area contact by 5%. Airflow is forcefully continuously driven by three scaled-up Axial-tech fans spinning on dual ball bearings to push 23% more air volume through the cooling assembly. The two outer fans feature reverse-rotational engineering to completely eliminate internal localized air turbulence, while intelligent 0dB ambient technology drops fan speeds to a complete halt whenever the core falls below 50°C for whisper-quiet desktop tasks. Wrapped in a rugged aluminum vented backplate to eliminate PCB flex and fitted with premium capacitors rated for 2.5X the lifespan of standard alternatives, it stands as an uncompromising foundation for tier-one desktop arrays.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5080 (Blackwell)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>10,752 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Default Mode)</td><td>Boost Clock: 2700 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (OC Mode)</td><td>Boost Clock: 2730 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>AI Computing Performance</td><td>1,858 AI TOPS</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Video Memory Configuration</td><td>16GB GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>30 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Interface Width</td><td>256-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Bus Standard / Interface</td><td>PCI Express 5.0</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>$7680 \\times 4320$ (8K Ultra HD Support)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Maximum Display Connections</td><td>Quad Display Support (Up to 4 concurrent monitors)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>HDCP Version Support</td><td>Yes (Version 2.3)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Interface</td><td>2x Native HDMI 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>DisplayPort Interface</td><td>3x Native DisplayPort 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Estimated Power Draw (TDP)</td><td>~360W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Recommended System PSU</td><td>850W (Based on fully configured rigs)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>1x 16-pin PCIe (12VHPWR / 12V-2x6) Cable</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>DirectX Support</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>348 x 146 x 72 mm (13.7 x 5.7 x 2.8 inches)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Form Factor Slot Width</td><td>3.6-Slot Profile (Requires massive chassis clearance)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Cooling Engineering</td><td>3x Axial-tech Fans, MaxContact Vapor Chamber, Phase-Change Pad</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Structural Features</strong></td><td>Rugged Exoskeleton Specs</td><td>Metal Vented Backplate, 5K Black Metallic Caps, Dual BIOS Switch</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Product Warranty</td><td>3 Years Limited Replacement Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/HUVDk7XMVEn4WesNB7fL5G7EpNziBhLXL1OQXK5S.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 19:48:24', '2026-07-12 19:48:24', 'Meta Title: ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 5080 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition', 'Meta Description: Buy the powerhouse ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 5080 16GB GDDR7 OC Edition. Built on NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, featuring triple Axial-tech fans, DLSS 4, and 1,858 AI TOPS.', 'Keywords: TUF-RTX5080-O16G-GAMING price, ASUS TUF RTX 5080 OC, GeForce RTX 5080 GDDR7, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, DLSS 4 graphics card, military-grade triple fan GPU Bangladesh', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL);
