(1343, 'Zotac GAMING GeForce RTX 3050 Twin Edge OC 6GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The Zotac GAMING GeForce RTX 3050 Twin Edge OC 6GB GDDR6 packs efficient 1080p ray-traced gaming and AI acceleration into an ultra-compact, dual-slot footprint. Powered by the NVIDIA Ampere architecture, it features a 6GB VRAM buffer on a 96-bit bus and operates with a highly efficient 70W power draw. Requiring no external PCIe power connectors and running completely off slot power, its tiny 16.1 cm length ensures a flawless fit in 99% of desktop PC cases, while twin 70mm fans with FREEZE Fan Stop keep your setup whisper-quiet.', 'zotac-gaming-geforce-rtx-3050-twin-edge-oc-6gb-gddr6-graphics-card-1783885982', '<p>The Zotac GAMING GeForce RTX 3050 Twin Edge OC 6GB GDDR6 delivers entry-level enthusiast graphics performance tailored explicitly for small-form-factor setups and energy-conscious system builders. Grounded on the 8nm NVIDIA Ampere architecture, this card introduces next-generation computing efficiency by deploying 2304 CUDA cores, 2nd Generation Ray Tracing Cores, and 3rd Generation Tensor Cores. These processing components allow budget-focused gamers to unlock real-time ray-traced ambient illumination and harness AI-driven resolution scaling via NVIDIA DLSS to significantly boost frame rates at 1080p resolutions.</p><p>What makes this Twin Edge OC variant unique is its incredible space optimization and power profile. Operating at a maximum board consumption of just 70 watts, the GPU is entirely powered by the PCIe slot itself, eliminating the need for extra messy power cables from your power supply. Cooling is managed by a reliable dual 70mm fan configuration paired with a dense aluminum heatsink array. The card incorporates Zotac’s advanced FREEZE Fan Stop technology, which fully halts fan rotation during web browsing or low-demand multimedia playback to completely eliminate operational noise. Completed with a physical dual-slot design measuring just over 16 cm long, it provides easy compatibility with almost any compact case layout.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification Details</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 (6GB Variant)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>2,304 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Boost Mode)</td><td>1477 MHz (Factory Overclocked)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Architecture Framework</td><td>NVIDIA Ampere Architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Video Memory Configuration</td><td>6GB GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Clock Speed</td><td>14.0 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Interface Width</td><td>96-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Bus Standard / Interface</td><td>PCI Express 4.0 x8</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>7680×4320 (8K Ultra HD Support @ 60Hz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Maximum Display Connections</td><td>Quad Display Support (Up to 4 concurrent monitors)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>HDCP Version Support</td><td>Yes (Version 2.3)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Interface</td><td>1x Native HDMI 2.1 (Supports 4K 120Hz / 8K 60Hz HDR)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>DisplayPort Interface</td><td>3x Native DisplayPort 1.4a</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Estimated Power Draw (TDP)</td><td>70W Max Power Consumption</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Recommended System PSU</td><td>450W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>None (Entirely PCIe Bus Powered)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>DirectX Support</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>161.9 x 111.2 x 40.2 mm (6.37 x 4.38 x 1.58 inches)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Form Factor Slot Width</td><td>Dual-Slot Profile (Ultra Compact layout)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Cooling Engineering</td><td>Dual 70mm Fans, Custom Heatsink, FREEZE Fan Stop</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Product Warranty</td><td>3 Years Limited Component Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/9Mg6HZgKRPjCMrC3ix3gsAn17WJ3TvFXiSEa1D57.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 19:53:02', '2026-07-12 19:53:02', 'Meta Title: Zotac GAMING GeForce RTX 3050 Twin Edge OC 6GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Buy the ultra-compact Zotac GAMING GeForce RTX 3050 Twin Edge OC 6GB GDDR6. Features 2304 CUDA cores, a low 70W power draw, PCIe bus power, and FREEZE Fan Stop.', 'Keywords: Zotac RTX 3050 6GB Twin Edge OC, ZT-A30510H-10L price, RTX 3050 6GB GDDR6, NVIDIA Ampere graphics card, PCIe bus powered GPU, budget gaming PC build Bangladesh', NULL, 141, NULL, NULL),
(1344, 'ZOTAC GAMING GEFORCE RTX 3050 ECO 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 3050 ECO 8GB GDDR6 brings efficient, ray-tracing-capable performance to compact and budget-conscious desktop builds. Powered by the NVIDIA Ampere architecture, it features 8GB of GDDR6 memory on a 128-bit bus and operates with a highly efficient 115W power draw. Requiring only a single 6-pin PCIe power connector, its compact dual-slot frame easily fits into standard and small-form-factor builds, while the dual-fan IceStorm 2.0 system with FREEZE Fan Stop provides quiet, reliable cooling.', 'zotac-gaming-geforce-rtx-3050-eco-8gb-gddr6-graphics-card-1783886065', '<h3>Long Description</h3><p>The ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 3050 ECO 8GB GDDR6 delivers entry-level enthusiast graphics performance tailored explicitly for energy-conscious system builders and mainstream gamers. Grounded on the NVIDIA Ampere architecture, this card introduces next-generation computing efficiency by deploying 2560 CUDA cores, 2nd Generation Ray Tracing Cores, and 3rd Generation Tensor Cores. These processing components allow budget-focused users to unlock immersive ray-traced ambient lighting and harness AI-driven resolution scaling via NVIDIA DLSS to significantly boost frame rates at smooth 1080p resolutions.</p><p>What makes this ECO variant stand out is its balance of power optimization and rugged construction. Operating at a reduced maximum board consumption of just 115W, the GPU runs cool while easing requirements on the system\'s power supply. Thermal management is driven by Zotac\'s specialized IceStorm 2.0 cooling system, pairing a dense aluminum fin stack with an integrated copper heatpipe array. The card incorporates advanced FREEZE Fan Stop technology, which fully halts fan rotation during low-load tasks like web browsing or text editing to completely eliminate operational noise. Completed with a rigid, protective wraparound metal backplate to eliminate PCB flex and a physical dual-slot layout, it provides high reliability for everyday computing setups.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>2,560 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Boost Mode)</td><td>1777 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Architecture Framework</td><td>NVIDIA Ampere Architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Video Memory Configuration</td><td>8GB GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Clock Speed</td><td>14.0 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Interface Width</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Bandwidth</td><td>224 GB/s</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Bus Standard / Interface</td><td>PCI Express 4.0 x8</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>$7680 \\times 4320$ (8K Ultra HD Support @ 60Hz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Maximum Display Connections</td><td>Quad Display Support (Up to 4 concurrent monitors)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>HDCP Version Support</td><td>Yes (Version 2.3)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Interface</td><td>1x Native HDMI 2.1 (Supports 4K 120Hz / 8K 60Hz HDR)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>DisplayPort Interface</td><td>3x Native DisplayPort 1.4a</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Estimated Power Draw (TDP)</td><td>115W Max Power Consumption</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Recommended System PSU</td><td>450W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>1x 6-pin PCIe Power Cable</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>DirectX Support</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>222.3 x 116.8 x 41.4 mm (8.8 x 4.6 x 1.6 inches)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Form Factor Slot Width</td><td>Dual-Slot Profile</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Cooling Engineering</td><td>IceStorm 2.0, Active Fan Control, FREEZE Fan Stop</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Structural Enhancements</td><td>Wraparound Metal Backplate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Product Warranty</td><td>3 Years Limited Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 33000.00, 33000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/bJriizK7WOb0MlQQ3gtmWu877yVNy2D9Peit6rzx.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 19:54:25', '2026-07-12 19:54:25', 'Meta Title: ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 3050 ECO 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Buy the efficient ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 3050 ECO 8GB GDDR6 graphics card. Features IceStorm 2.0 cooling, 2560 CUDA cores, DLSS, and a wraparound metal backplate.', 'Keywords: ZOTAC RTX 3050 ECO 8GB, ZT-A30500K-10M price, GeForce RTX 3050 8GB GDDR6, NVIDIA Ampere graphics card, IceStorm 2.0 GPU, budget 1080p gaming PC Bangladesh', NULL, 9, NULL, NULL),
(1345, 'ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5050 Twin Edge OC 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5050 Twin Edge OC 8GB GDDR6 brings next-generation AI-driven performance and thermal efficiency to small-form-factor (SFF) desktop systems. Powered by the groundbreaking NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, it pairs an 8GB GDDR6 frame buffer running at a fast 20 Gbps over a 128-bit bus with native DLSS 4 frame generation support. Featuring an ultra-compact, true 2-slot design measuring just 22 cm long, this factory-overclocked card runs off a single 8-pin power connector and utilizes a specialized dual BladeLink fan configuration backed by a rigid structural metal backplate.', 'zotac-gaming-geforce-rtx-5050-twin-edge-oc-8gb-gddr6-graphics-card-1783886158', NULL, '<p>The ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5050 Twin Edge OC 8GB GDDR6 redefines entry-level enthusiast graphics by packing advanced neural computing capabilities into a highly space-optimized footprint. Grounded on the 5nm NVIDIA Blackwell framework, this card features substantial architecture upgrades, utilizing 5th Generation Tensor Cores and 4th Generation Ray Tracing Cores. These processing components allow budget-conscious gamers and digital creators to unlock real-time cinematic ray tracing, leverage local generative AI workflows, and multiply system frame rates via neural rendering using NVIDIA DLSS 4 with Multi-Frame Generation. Factory-overclocked right out of the box, it hits a boosted clock speed of up to 2602 MHz to deliver fluid, highly responsive framerates at 1080p and entry-tier 1440p resolutions.&nbsp;</p>', 'Graphics Card', 44500.00, 44500.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/VAU3dEmYKkgdEH4ly4FJDaWakyq1TGMYzQP1c23p.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 19:55:58', '2026-07-12 19:55:58', 'Meta Title: ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5050 Twin Edge OC 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'Meta Title: ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5050 Twin Edge OC 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'Keywords: Zotac RTX 5050 Twin Edge OC price, ZT-B50500H-10M, GeForce RTX 5050 8GB GDDR6, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, DLSS 4 graphics card, SFF-Ready budget gaming GPU Bangladesh', NULL, 141, NULL, NULL),
(1346, 'ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5050 Twin Edge 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5050 Twin Edge 8GB GDDR6 brings highly efficient next-generation performance and AI acceleration to compact desktop systems. Driven by NVIDIA\'s groundbreaking Blackwell architecture, it features an 8GB GDDR6 frame buffer operating over a 128-bit bus with native support for DLSS 4 neural frame generation. Operating within a true 2-slot footprint measuring just 22 cm long, this highly compatible card runs off a single 8-pin connector and utilizes high-pressure dual BladeLink fans anchored by a durable structural metal backplate.', 'zotac-gaming-geforce-rtx-5050-twin-edge-8gb-gddr6-graphics-card-1783886260', '<p>The ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5050 Twin Edge 8GB GDDR6 sets a new benchmark for mainstream graphics processing by introducing advanced AI-driven computing to space-optimized desktop builds. Anchored by the 5nm NVIDIA Blackwell framework, this graphics card delivers significant architectural leaps, leveraging 5th Generation Tensor Cores and 4th Generation Ray Tracing Cores. These processing components allow budget-conscious gamers, streamers, and creators to deploy real-time cinematic ray tracing, execute local generative AI models, and multiply game framerates through neural rendering using NVIDIA DLSS 4 with Multi Frame Generation. Operating at a stable boost clock of 2572 MHz, it easily drives smooth, stutter-free performance at 1080p and entry-tier 1440p resolutions.</p><p>Skyland Computer BD+ 3</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Engineered specifically with space optimization in mind, the Twin Edge variant is a certified SFF-Ready card that measures only 22.0 cm in length, making it ideal for mini-ITX and smaller mid-tower setups. It runs at a highly efficient total board power (TDP) of 130W, keeping power supply constraints minimal while maximizing thermal headroom. Heat dissipation is managed by a specialized dual-fan layout featuring custom BladeLink fans that drive focused downward air pressure across a dense aluminum fin stack. The card incorporates advanced FREEZE Fan Stop technology, which fully silences the fan array during light tasks like web surfing or coding to eliminate ambient noise entirely. Complete with a rigid structural metal backplate to avoid PCB flex and next-generation DisplayPort 2.1b connections for future-proof display pairing, it serves as a highly reliable, power-efficient anchor for modern desktop arrays.</p><p>Sell Tech BD+ 3</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification Details</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5050</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>2,560 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Boost Mode)</td><td>2572 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Architecture Framework</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell Architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Video Memory Configuration</td><td>8GB GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>20 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Interface Width</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Bandwidth</td><td>320 GB/s</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Bus Standard / Interface</td><td>PCI Express 5.0 x8</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>7680×4320 (8K Ultra HD Support)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Maximum Display Connections</td><td>Quad Display Support (Up to 4 concurrent monitors)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>HDCP Version Support</td><td>Yes (Version 2.3)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Interface</td><td>1x Native HDMI 2.1b (Supports 4K 120Hz/8K 60Hz HDR &amp; VRR)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>DisplayPort Interface</td><td>3x Native DisplayPort 2.1b with UHBR20</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Estimated Power Draw (TDP)</td><td>130W Max Power Consumption</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Recommended System PSU</td><td>550W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>1x 8-pin PCIe Power Cable</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>DirectX Support</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>220.5 x 120.25 x 41.6 mm (8.7 x 4.7 x 1.6 inches)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Form Factor Slot Width</td><td>True 2-Slot Profile (SFF-Ready)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Cooling Engineering</td><td>Dual BladeLink Fans, Compact Aluminum Heatsink, FREEZE Fan Stop</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Structural Enhancements</td><td>Rigid Protective Metal Backplate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Product Warranty</td><td>3 Years Standard + 2 Years Extended Warranty (Via Online Registration)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 38000.00, 38000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/k8EGjNDHtGlh2GHnN5wpGGIHPkClPKoSFApcnYeW.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 19:57:40', '2026-07-12 19:57:40', 'Meta Title: ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5050 Twin Edge 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Buy the next-gen ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5050 Twin Edge. Features NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 8GB GDDR6 VRAM, DLSS 4, and high-pressure dual BladeLink fans.', 'Keywords: Zotac RTX 5050 Twin Edge price, ZT-B50500E-10M, GeForce RTX 5050 8GB GDDR6, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, DLSS 4 graphics card, SFF-Ready budget gaming GPU Bangladesh', NULL, 141, NULL, NULL),
(1347, 'ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Twin Edge OC 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Twin Edge OC 8GB GDDR7 delivers elite next-generation performance and advanced AI acceleration to compact and small-form-factor (SFF) desktop systems. Powered by the groundbreaking NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, it pairs an 8GB buffer of next-gen GDDR7 memory running at a blinding 28 Gbps over a 128-bit bus with native DLSS 4 frame generation support. Featuring an ultra-compact, true 2-slot design measuring just 22 cm long, this factory-overclocked card runs off a single 8-pin power connector and utilizes a high-efficiency dual BladeLink fan configuration backed by a rigid structural metal backplate.', 'zotac-gaming-geforce-rtx-5060-twin-edge-oc-8gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783886350', '<p>The ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Twin Edge OC 8GB GDDR7 redefines mainstream desktop graphics by packing cutting-edge neural computing and next-gen memory standards into a highly space-optimized footprint. Grounded on the 5nm NVIDIA Blackwell framework, this graphics card introduces massive architectural upgrades over previous generations, deploying 3,840 high-performance CUDA cores along with next-gen Tensor and Ray Tracing Cores. These processing arrays allow gamers and creators to experience incredibly realistic real-time ray-traced visuals, run local generative AI workflows smoothly, and multiply system frame rates via neural rendering using NVIDIA DLSS 4 with Multi Frame Generation. Factory-overclocked out of the box, it hits a boosted clock speed of up to 2527 MHz to deliver fluid, stutter-free performance at 1080p and competitive 1440p resolutions.</p><p>Binary Logic+ 3</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>True to ZOTAC\'s focus on space optimization, the Twin Edge OC is a certified SFF-Ready graphics card measuring a highly compatible 22.0 cm in length, making it a perfect fit for mini-ITX and smaller mid-tower setups. Operating at a highly efficient total board power (TDP) of just 145W, it minimizes power supply and thermal load constraints on the system. Heat dissipation is managed by an advanced dual-fan design utilizing custom BladeLink fans that drive focused downward air pressure across a dense aluminum fin stack. The card incorporates advanced FREEZE Fan Stop technology, which fully silences the fan array during light tasks like web surfing or coding to eliminate ambient noise entirely. Complete with a rigid structural metal backplate to avoid PCB flex and next-generation DisplayPort 2.1b connections for future-proof display pairing, it serves as a highly reliable, power-efficient anchor for modern desktop setups.</p><p>Binary Logic+ 3</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>3,840 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Boost Mode)</td><td>2527 MHz (Factory Overclocked)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Architecture Framework</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell Architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Video Memory Configuration</td><td>8GB GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>28 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Interface Width</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Bandwidth</td><td>448 GB/s</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Bus Standard / Interface</td><td>PCI Express 5.0 x8</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>$7680 \\times 4320$ (8K Ultra HD Support)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Maximum Display Connections</td><td>Quad Display Support (Up to 4 concurrent monitors)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>HDCP Version Support</td><td>Yes (Version 2.3)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Interface</td><td>1x Native HDMI 2.1b (Supports 4K 480Hz HDR / 8K 120Hz HDR with DSC)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>DisplayPort Interface</td><td>3x Native DisplayPort 2.1b with UHBR20 (Up to 4K 480Hz or 8K 165Hz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Estimated Power Draw (TDP)</td><td>145W Max Power Consumption</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Recommended System PSU</td><td>550W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>1x 8-pin PCIe Power Cable</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>DirectX Support</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>220.5 x 120.25 x 41.6 mm (8.7 x 4.7 x 1.6 inches)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Form Factor Slot Width</td><td>True 2-Slot Profile (SFF-Ready Enclosure Compatible)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Cooling Engineering</td><td>Dual BladeLink Fans, Advanced Custom Heatsink, FREEZE Fan Stop</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Structural Enhancements</td><td>Rigid Protective Metal Backplate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Product Warranty</td><td>3 Years Standard + 2 Years Extended Warranty (Via Online Registration)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/2Uj2s8LEf5v6jqeebY5WxEC9QdYs64oZ3GQcuaqR.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 19:59:10', '2026-07-12 19:59:10', 'Meta Title: ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Twin Edge OC 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'Meta Title: ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Twin Edge OC 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Buy the next-gen ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Twin Edge OC. Features NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 8GB GDDR7 VRAM, DLSS 4, and high-pressure dual BladeLink fans.', NULL, 141, NULL, NULL),
(1348, 'ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Twin Edge OC 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Twin Edge OC 8GB GDDR7 brings elite next-generation high-refresh 1080p and fluid 1440p performance to compact desktop systems. Powered by the highly advanced NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, it leverages 8GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory running over a 128-bit bus with native support for DLSS 4 neural frame generation. Featuring a highly compatible true 2-slot SFF-Ready layout measuring just 22 cm in length, this factory-overclocked card operates via a standard 8-pin connector and deploys specialized BladeLink fans backed by an rigid protective metal backplate.', 'zotac-gaming-geforce-rtx-5060-ti-twin-edge-oc-8gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783886433', '<p>The ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Twin Edge OC 8GB GDDR7 redefines the mid-range performance tier by bringing pioneering next-generation memory standards and elite AI processing into a space-optimized footprint. Architected on the 5nm NVIDIA Blackwell framework, this graphics card provides huge generational compute leaps, utilizing 4,608 high-performance CUDA cores alongside 5th Generation Tensor Cores and 4th Generation Ray Tracing Cores built for Mega Geometry. These processing arrays allow gamers, live streamers, and digital designers to witness highly cinematic ray-traced lighting effects, execute localized generative AI workloads, and massively multiply framerates via neural rendering through NVIDIA DLSS 4. Factory-overclocked right out of the box, it pushes a boosted core engine clock of 2602 MHz to guarantee ultra-responsive, competitive frame rates.</p><p>Engineered with meticulous attention to space optimization, the Twin Edge OC is an officially certified SFF-Ready card measuring just 22.0 cm long, making it an ideal choice for mini-ITX and space-conscious mid-tower setups. Operating at a stable maximum board consumption (TDP) of 180W, it balances processing capability with an efficient thermal profile. Heat dissipation is managed by Zotac\'s IceStorm 2.0 cooling array, which combines an optimized aluminum fin stack with specialized BladeLink dual fans that maximize localized downward air pressure. The card features advanced FREEZE Fan Stop technology, which fully silences the entire fan array during low-load tasks like coding or web browsing to completely eliminate ambient noise. Complete with a full wraparound structural metal backplate to ensure mechanical rigidity and next-generation DisplayPort 2.1b connections for future-proofed display pairings, it stands as a robust anchor for modern gaming PCs.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 Ti</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>4,608 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Boost Mode)</td><td>2602 MHz (Factory Overclocked)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Architecture Framework</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell Architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>AI Computing Architecture</td><td>5th Gen Tensor Cores &amp; 4th Gen RT Cores (DLSS 4)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Video Memory Configuration</td><td>8GB GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>28 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Interface Width</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Bandwidth</td><td>448 GB/s</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Bus Standard / Interface</td><td>PCI Express 5.0 x8</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>$7680 \\times 4320$ (8K Ultra HD Support)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Maximum Display Connections</td><td>Quad Display Support (Up to 4 concurrent monitors)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>HDCP Version Support</td><td>Yes (Version 2.3)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Interface</td><td>1x Native HDMI 2.1b (Supports 4K 120Hz HDR)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>DisplayPort Interface</td><td>3x Native DisplayPort 2.1b (Up to 4K 480Hz / 8K 165Hz with DSC)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Estimated Power Draw (TDP)</td><td>180W Max Power Consumption</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Recommended System PSU</td><td>600W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>1x 8-pin PCIe Power Cable</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>DirectX Support</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>220.5 x 120.25 x 41.6 mm (8.7 x 4.7 x 1.6 inches)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Form Factor Slot Width</td><td>True 2-Slot Profile (SFF-Ready Enclosure Friendly)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Cooling Engineering</td><td>IceStorm 2.0, Dual BladeLink Fans, FREEZE Fan Stop</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Structural Enhancements</td><td>Full Wraparound Metal Protective Backplate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Product Warranty</td><td>3 Years Standard + 2 Years Extended Warranty (Upon Online Registration)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 61500.00, 61500.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/PVkQVE6rhW4MbQRLsaCotVaQLNgC5VJ989IbEzRw.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 20:00:33', '2026-07-12 20:00:33', 'Meta Title: ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Twin Edge OC 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Buy the next-gen ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Twin Edge OC. Features NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 8GB GDDR7 memory, DLSS 4, and IceStorm 2.0 cooling.', 'Keywords: Zotac RTX 5060 Ti Twin Edge OC price, ZT-B50610H-10M, GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8GB GDDR7, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, DLSS 4 graphics card, SFF-Ready high-refresh gaming GPU Bangladesh', NULL, 141, NULL, NULL),
