 OC 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Buy the next-gen ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Twin Edge OC. Features NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 8GB GDDR7 memory, DLSS 4, and IceStorm 2.0 cooling.', 'Keywords: Zotac RTX 5060 Ti Twin Edge OC price, ZT-B50610H-10M, GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8GB GDDR7, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, DLSS 4 graphics card, SFF-Ready high-refresh gaming GPU Bangladesh', NULL, 141, NULL, NULL),
(1352, 'ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Twin Edge OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Twin Edge OC 16GB GDDR7 delivers massive VRAM headroom and next-generation AI processing inside an ultra-compact, small-form-factor (SFF) footprint. Powered by the cutting-edge NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, it combines a generous 16GB buffer of next-gen GDDR7 memory running at a blinding 28 Gbps with native DLSS 4 neural rendering. Outfitted with an efficient 2-slot cooling framework measuring just 22 cm long, this factory-overclocked card runs off a single standard 8-pin connector and utilizes high-pressure BladeLink dual fans backed by a rigid structural metal backplate.', 'zotac-gaming-geforce-rtx-5060-ti-twin-edge-oc-16gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783886562', '<p>The <strong>ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Twin Edge OC 16GB GDDR7</strong> delivers massive VRAM headroom and next-generation AI processing inside an ultra-compact, small-form-factor (SFF) footprint. Powered by the cutting-edge NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, it combines a generous 16GB buffer of next-gen GDDR7 memory running at a blinding 28 Gbps with native DLSS 4 neural rendering. Outfitted with an efficient 2-slot cooling framework measuring just 22 cm long, this factory-overclocked card runs off a single standard 8-pin connector and utilizes high-pressure BladeLink dual fans backed by a rigid structural metal backplate.&nbsp;</p>', '<h3>Long Description</h3><p>The ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Twin Edge OC 16GB GDDR7 completely reshapes the mid-range GPU tier, pairing an oversized next-gen memory subsystem with advanced neural computing capabilities. Grounded on the 5nm NVIDIA Blackwell framework, this graphics accelerator introduces immense generational performance upgrades by deploying 4,608 high-performance CUDA cores alongside 5th Generation Tensor Cores and 4th Generation Ray Tracing Cores built for Mega Geometry. These processing arrays allow users to experience incredibly detailed real-time ray-traced lighting, run local large-language models (LLMs), and scale frame rates up to 4x using neural rendering via NVIDIA DLSS 4 with Multi Frame Generation. Factory-overclocked right out of the box, it hits a boosted engine clock speed of up to 2602 MHz to deliver ultra-responsive competitive performance.</p><p>The defining characteristic of this Twin Edge OC variant is the integration of 16GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory operating over a 128-bit bus. This massive VRAM expansion entirely eliminates high-resolution texture streaming bottlenecks, allowing modern digital creators, 3D artists, and AI developers to fluidly process memory-intensive generative AI datasets, complex 3D viewports in Blender, and multi-layered 4K video editing timelines without stutter.</p><p>True to ZOTAC\'s focus on space-optimized engineering, the card is officially certified SFF-Ready, measuring a highly compatible 22.0 cm in length to fit perfectly into mini-ITX and smaller mid-tower enclosures. Operating at a highly efficient total board power (TDP) of just 180W, it keeps power supply headroom requirements minimal while running cool. Heat dissipation is managed by an advanced IceStorm 2.0 dual-fan design utilizing custom 90mm BladeLink fans that maximize focused downward air pressure across a dense aluminum fin stack. The card incorporates advanced FREEZE Fan Stop technology, which fully silences the fan array during light tasks like web surfing or coding to eliminate ambient noise entirely. Complete with a full wraparound structural metal backplate to avoid PCB flex and next-generation DisplayPort 2.1b connections for future-proof display pairing, it serves as an exceptional engine for compact high-performance setups.</p>', NULL, 81500.00, 81500.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/Ds3znW0AZcuWKKCtJdP0kkMrt63k5pP1DK44RqT8.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 20:02:42', '2026-07-12 20:02:42', 'Meta Title: ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Twin Edge OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Buy the ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Twin Edge OC 16GB. Features next-gen NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 16GB GDDR7 VRAM, DLSS 4, and an SFF-Ready dual-slot design.', 'Keywords: Zotac RTX 5060 Ti Twin Edge OC 16GB price, ZT-B50620H-10M, GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16GB GDDR7, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, DLSS 4 graphics card, 16GB VRAM budget AI GPU Bangladesh', NULL, 141, NULL, NULL),
(1353, 'ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5070 Twin Edge 12GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5070 Twin Edge 12GB GDDR7 packs elite next-generation architecture and high-velocity AI processing into an ultra-compact, dual-slot footprint. Powered by the groundbreaking NVIDIA Blackwell framework, it maps a 12GB buffer of cutting-edge GDDR7 memory across a high-bandwidth 192-bit bus. Explicitly certified as an NVIDIA SFF-Ready Enthusiast card measuring just 24.1 cm long, it combines dual high-pressure BladeLink fans, IceStorm 2.0 thermal engineering, a protective metal backplate, and an incredible 988 AI TOPS of computational power to dominate high-refresh 1440p and entry-level 4K gaming arrays.', 'zotac-gaming-geforce-rtx-5070-twin-edge-12gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783886650', '<p>The <strong>ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5070 Twin Edge 12GB GDDR7</strong> packs elite next-generation architecture and high-velocity AI processing into an ultra-compact, dual-slot footprint. Powered by the groundbreaking NVIDIA Blackwell framework, it maps a 12GB buffer of cutting-edge GDDR7 memory across a high-bandwidth 192-bit bus. Explicitly certified as an NVIDIA SFF-Ready Enthusiast card measuring just 24.1 cm long, it combines dual high-pressure BladeLink fans, IceStorm 2.0 thermal engineering, a protective metal backplate, and an incredible 988 AI TOPS of computational power to dominate high-refresh 1440p and entry-level 4K gaming arrays.&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 (Blackwell)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>6,144 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Base Mode)</td><td>2325 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Boost Mode)</td><td>2512 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>AI Computing Performance</td><td>988 AI TOPS</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 89900.00, 89900.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/7voHCXy4FU3F9Dzmn0URefwKXJO7YRv4HPIXPQIA.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 20:04:10', '2026-07-12 20:04:10', 'Meta Title: ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5070 Twin Edge 12GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Shop the compact ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5070 Twin Edge 12GB GDDR7. Powered by NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, featuring IceStorm 2.0, DLSS 4, and 988 AI TOPS.', 'Keywords: Zotac RTX 5070 Twin Edge price, ZT-B50700E-10P, GeForce RTX 5070 12GB GDDR7, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, DLSS 4 graphics card, SFF-Ready dual-fan GPU Bangladesh', NULL, 141, NULL, NULL);
