(1355, 'ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5070 Ti SOLID SFF OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5070 Ti SOLID SFF OC 16GB GDDR7 packs flagship-tier enthusiast performance and next-generation AI processing into an ultra-slim, true 2-slot small form factor footprint. Powered by the groundbreaking NVIDIA Blackwell framework, it features a massive 16GB buffer of cutting-edge GDDR7 memory running across a high-bandwidth 256-bit bus. Certified as an NVIDIA SFF-Ready Enthusiast card, it combines triple high-pressure BladeLink fans, IceStorm 2.0 thermal engineering, a sleek protective metal backplate, and an integrated 12V-2x6 power safety light to dominate high-refresh 4K gaming and complex localized AI workloads within space-constrained case layouts.  \r\nShort Description', 'zotac-gaming-geforce-rtx-5070-ti-solid-sff-oc-16gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783886861', '<p>The ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5070 Ti SOLID SFF OC 16GB GDDR7 redefines enthusiast desktop graphics by compressing premium architecture into a space-optimized layout that effortlessly anchors high-end mini-ITX and compact mid-tower configurations. Grounded on the 5nm NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, this graphics card introduces huge generational milestones, deploying 8,960 high-performance CUDA cores along with 5th Generation Tensor Cores and 4th Generation Ray Tracing Cores built for complex Mega Geometry processing. These hardware blocks fully supercharge neural computing workflows, driving real-time ray-traced ambient lighting via advanced path tracing, multiplying frame outputs through NVIDIA DLSS 4 Multi Frame Generation, and slashing system latency with NVIDIA Reflex 2. Factory-overclocked right out of the box, the card operates at a screaming 2482 MHz boost engine clock to handle intense modern computational workloads seamlessl</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>What makes this SOLID SFF OC variant unique is its flawless compatibility with space-restricted custom setups without sacrificing cooling performance. As an officially certified NVIDIA SFF-Ready Enthusiast card, its low-profile, true 2-slot design (measuring just 41.6mm in thickness) fits effortlessly into popular small form factor enclosures like the Fractal Terra or Louqe Ghost. Thermal dissipation is managed by ZOTAC’s upgraded IceStorm 2.0 cooling matrix, which incorporates an advanced aluminum fin stack driven by a triple BladeLink fan configuration engineered to maximize downward air pressure. The cooling array features intelligent FREEZE Fan Stop technology, which completely silences all fan rotation during low-load operations like web surfing or coding to eliminate ambient noise entirely. Completed with a rigid structural metal backplate to safeguard components from warping, a hardware-level 12V-2x6 Power Safety Light to monitor voltage connection stability, and a premium clean white LED accent lighting profile, it serves as a robust future-proof engine for clean, compact builds. y.&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 Ti</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>8,960 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Boost Mode)</td><td>2482 MHz (Factory Overclocked)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Architecture Framework</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell Architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>AI Computing Architecture</td><td>5th Gen Tensor Cores &amp; 4th Gen RT Cores (DLSS 4 Support)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Video Memory Configuration</td><td>16GB GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>28 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Interface Width</td><td>256-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Bandwidth</td><td>896 GB/s</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Bus Standard / Interface</td><td>PCI Express 5.0 x16</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>$7680 \\times 4320$ (8K Ultra HD Support)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Maximum Display Connections</td><td>Quad Display Support (Up to 4 concurrent monitors)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>HDCP Version Support</td><td>Yes (Version 2.3)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Interface</td><td>1x Native HDMI 2.1b (Supports 4K 480Hz HDR / 8K 120Hz HDR)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>DisplayPort Interface</td><td>3x Native DisplayPort 2.1b with UHBR20 (Up to 4K 480Hz / 8K 165Hz with DSC)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Estimated Power Draw (TDP)</td><td>300W Max Power Consumption</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Recommended System PSU</td><td>750W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>1x 12V-2x6 Power Input Cable</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>DirectX Support</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>304.4 x 115.8 x 41.6 mm (12.0 x 4.6 x 1.6 inches)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Form Factor Slot Width</td><td>True 2-Slot Profile (NVIDIA SFF-Ready Certified)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Cooling Engineering</td><td>IceStorm 2.0, Triple 90mm BladeLink Fans, FREEZE Fan Stop</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Custom Structural &amp; Lighting</td><td>Vented Metal Backplate, 12V-2x6 Safety Light, White LED Accents</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Product Warranty</td><td>3 Years Standard + 2 Years Extended Warranty (Via Online Registration)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 135000.00, 135000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/mhKg1UFPOKEVpmd3Md7gs2aeQcR85wae0eFQdPFG.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 20:07:41', '2026-07-12 20:07:41', 'Meta Title: ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5070 Ti SOLID SFF OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'vMeta Description: Buy the compact ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5070 Ti SOLID SFF OC 16GB GDDR7. Powered by NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, featuring a true 2-slot SFF design, DLSS 4, and 8,960 CUDA cores.', 'Keywords: Zotac RTX 5070 Ti SOLID SFF OC price, ZT-B50710J3-10P, GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16GB GDDR7, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, DLSS 4 graphics card, SFF-Ready enthusiast gaming GPU Bangladesh', NULL, 141, NULL, NULL),
(1356, 'ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5080 SOLID CORE OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'Keywords: Zotac RTX 5080 SOLID CORE OC price, ZT-B50800J2-10P, GeForce RTX 5080 16GB GDDR7, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, DLSS 4 graphics card, flagship 4K gaming GPU Bangladesh', 'zotac-gaming-geforce-rtx-5080-solid-core-oc-16gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783886923', '<p>The ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5080 SOLID CORE OC 16GB GDDR7 fuses pure architectural muscle with a structural design engineered for absolute rigidity and cooling supremacy. Grounded on the 5nm NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, this graphics accelerator introduces huge generational milestones, deploying 10,752 high-performance CUDA cores alongside 5th Generation Tensor Cores and 4th Generation Ray Tracing Cores built for complex Mega Geometry processing. These hardware blocks fully supercharge neural workflows, driving immersive real-time ray-traced ambient path tracing, multiplying frame outputs via NVIDIA DLSS 4 Multi Frame Generation, and slashing system input latency with NVIDIA Reflex 2 with Frame Warp. Factory-overclocked right out of the box to a screaming 2640 MHz boost engine clock, it handles heavy computational processing, 3D viewport tracking in Blender, local large-language models (LLMs), and competitive 4K gaming arrays with exceptional fluid stability.</p><p>What elevates the SOLID CORE OC variant past standard designs is its emphasis on heavy-duty reliability and high-airflow acoustics. The card features a compact, case-friendly 2.5-slot profile that maintains wide chassis compatibility while deploying ZOTAC\'s flagship IceStorm 3.0 advanced cooling matrix. At its center lies an oversized industrial vapor chamber that directly sweeps heat away from the core components into a dense aluminum fin stack. Airflow is forcefully driven by high-pressure BladeLink fans engineered to maximize downward air pressure, while intelligent FREEZE Fan Stop technology completely halts fan rotation during low-load tasks for silent operation. 