(1357, 'ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5080 SOLID CORE OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5080 SOLID CORE OC 16GB GDDR7 represents the cutting edge of raw desktop performance and enthusiast-grade construction. Driven by the groundbreaking NVIDIA Blackwell framework, it maps 16GB of next-generation GDDR7 memory across a high-bandwidth 256-bit bus, delivering a massive 1,801 AI TOPS of neural computing power. Featuring a refined, stealthy industrial aesthetic with structural enhancements like a reinforced metal mid-frame, it deploys the advanced IceStorm 3.0 cooling array—complete with a deep vapor chamber, high-pressure BladeLink fans, a hardware-level 12V-2x6 Power Safety Light, and customizable SPECTRA RGB lighting to easily dominate elite high-refresh 4K environments.', 'zotac-gaming-geforce-rtx-5080-solid-core-oc-16gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783886990', '<p>The ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5080 SOLID CORE OC 16GB GDDR7 fuses pure architectural muscle with a structural design engineered for absolute rigidity and cooling supremacy. Grounded on the 5nm NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, this graphics accelerator introduces huge generational milestones, deploying 10,752 high-performance CUDA cores alongside 5th Generation Tensor Cores and 4th Generation Ray Tracing Cores built for complex Mega Geometry processing. These hardware blocks fully supercharge neural workflows, driving immersive real-time ray-traced ambient path tracing, multiplying frame outputs via NVIDIA DLSS 4 Multi Frame Generation, and slashing system input latency with NVIDIA Reflex 2 with Frame Warp. Factory-overclocked right out of the box to a screaming 2640 MHz boost engine clock, it handles heavy computational processing, 3D viewport tracking in Blender, local large-language models (LLMs), and competitive 4K gaming arrays with exceptional fluid stability.</p><p>What elevates the SOLID CORE OC variant past standard designs is its emphasis on heavy-duty reliability and high-airflow acousti