Fan + Radial Heatsink</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Product Warranty</td><td>3 Years Standard + 2 Years Extended Brand Warranty (Upon Registration)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/3fqXl9EQCFFp3gWOpicX042X2UeQwD9oRPG1bNhi.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 20:15:28', '2026-07-12 20:15:28', 'Meta Title: ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 3050 6GB GDDR6 Solo Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Buy the ultra-compact ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 3050 6GB GDDR6 Solo. Features a single 90mm fan, 70W low power draw, PCIe bus power, and Ampere architecture.', 'Keywords: Zotac RTX 3050 6GB Solo price, ZT-A30510G-10L, GeForce RTX 3050 Solo 6GB, NVIDIA Ampere graphics card, PCIe slot powered GPU, Mini-ITX budget gaming PC build Bangladesh', NULL, 141, NULL, NULL);
