(1362, 'ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 4060 8GB Twin Edge GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 4060 8GB Twin Edge GDDR6 brings highly efficient next-generation 1080p ray-traced gaming and AI acceleration to compact and small-form-factor (SFF) desktop configurations. Driven by NVIDIA\'s high-efficiency Ada Lovelace architecture, it features an 8GB GDDR6 frame buffer running over a 128-bit bus with native DLSS 3 Frame Generation support. Operating within a highly compatible 2-slot footprint measuring just 22.1 cm in length, this card runs off a single standard 8-pin PCIe connector and utilizes a specialized dual-fan thermal assembly backed by Freeze Fan Stop technology and a rigid structural metal backplate.', 'zotac-gaming-geforce-rtx-4060-8gb-twin-edge-gddr6-graphics-card-1783887383', '<p>The <strong>ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 4060 8GB Twin Edge GDDR6</strong> brings highly efficient next-generation 1080p ray-traced gaming and AI acceleration to compact and small-form-factor (SFF) desktop configurations. Driven by NVIDIA\'s high-efficiency Ada Lovelace architecture, it features an 8GB GDDR6 frame buffer running over a 128-bit bus with native DLSS 3 Frame Generation support. Operating within a highly compatible 2-slot footprint measuring just 22.1 cm in length, this card runs off a single standard 8-pin PCIe connector and utilizes a specialized dual-fan thermal assembly backed by Freeze Fan Stop technology and a rigid structural metal backplate.&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>3,072 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Boost Mode)</td><td>2460 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs<