(1363, 'ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5050 SOLO 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5050 SOLO 8GB GDDR6 packs next-generation AI-accelerated performance and modern ray tracing into an ultra-compact, single-fan footprint. Driven by the groundbreaking NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, it features an 8GB GDDR6 frame buffer operating at 20 Gbps over a 128-bit bus with native DLSS 4 support. Running within an ITX-ready, true 2-slot footprint measuring only 16.4 cm in length, this highly efficient 130W card requires just a standard 8-pin PCIe connector and fits into 99% of PC builds, making it the ultimate drop-in upgrade for space-constrained Small Form Factor (SFF) desktop setups.', 'zotac-gaming-geforce-rtx-5050-solo-8gb-gddr6-graphics-card-1783887436', '<p>The <strong>ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5050 SOLO 8GB GDDR6</strong> packs next-generation AI-accelerated performance and modern ray tracing into an ultra-compact, single-fan footprint. Driven by the groundbreaking NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, it features an 8GB GDDR6 frame buffer operating at 20 Gbps over a 128-bit bus with native DLSS 4 support. Running within an ITX-ready, true 2-slot footprint measuring only 16.4 cm in length, this highly efficient 130W card requires just a standard 8-pin PCIe connector and fits into 99% of PC builds, making it the ultimate drop-in upgrade for space-constrained Small Form Factor (SFF) desktop setups.&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5050 (Blackwell GB207)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>2,560 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Boost Mode)</td><td>2572 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Architecture Framework</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell Architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Neural Engine Core Specs</td><td>5th Gen Tensor Cores &amp; 4th Gen RT Cores (DLSS 4 Support)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Video Memory Configuration</td><td>8GB GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>20 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Interface Width</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Bandwidth</td><td>320 GB/s</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Bus Standard / Interface</td><td>PCI Express 5.0 x8</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>Up to 4K 480Hz or 8K 165Hz with DSC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Maximum Display Connections</td><td>Quad Display Support (Up to 4 concurrent monitors)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>HDCP Version Support</td><td>Yes (Version 2.3)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Interface</td><td>1x Native HDMI 2.1b (Supports 4K 120Hz HDR / 8K 60Hz HDR &amp; VRR)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>DisplayPort Interface</td><td>3x Native DisplayPort 2.1b with UHBR20</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Estimated Power Draw (TDP)</td><td>130W Max Power Consumption</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Recommended System PSU</td><td>550W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>1x 8-pin PCIe Power Cable</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>DirectX Support</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>164.5 x 111.2 x 36.4 mm (6.5 x 4.4 x 1.4 inches)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Form Factor Slot Width</td><td>True 2-Slot Profile (ITX-Ready Ultra Compact Layout)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Cooling Engineering</td><td>Single High-Pressure BladeLink Fan + Optimized Radial Heatsink</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Product Warranty</td><td>3 Years Standard + 2 Years Extended Brand Warranty (Upon Registration)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/UCW3bl86TZPojWoSRXemp7kG2z3h5Y7qfT1e64kG.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 20:17:16', '2026-07-12 20:17:16', 'Meta Title: ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5050 SOLO 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Buy the ultra-compact ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5050 SOLO 8GB GDDR6. Features NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, a single BladeLink fan, DLSS 4, and a 130W low power profile.', 'Keywords: Zotac RTX 5050 SOLO price, ZT-B50500G-10L, GeForce RTX 5050 Solo 8GB, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, DLSS 4 graphics card, Mini-ITX SFF PC build Bangladesh', NULL, 141, NULL, NULL),
(1364, 'ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 3060 Twin Edge 12GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 3060 Twin Edge 12GB GDDR6 balances high-capacity VRAM and compact thermal engineering to deliver exceptional 1080p and high-fidelity 1440p desktop gaming. Powered by the efficient NVIDIA Ampere architecture, it features an expansive 12GB GDDR6 frame buffer running over a 192-bit bus. Outfitted with ZOTAC\'s specialized IceStorm 2.0 advanced cooling setup, high-pressure dual fans, and FREEZE Fan Stop technology, this compact dual-slot card easily slides into 99% of computer cases while requiring only a standard single 8-pin power connector.', 'zotac-gaming-geforce-rtx-3060-twin-edge-12gb-gddr6-graphics-card-1783887515', '<p>The <strong>ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 3060 Twin Edge 12GB GDDR6</strong> balances high-capacity VRAM and compact thermal engineering to deliver exceptional 1080p and high-fidelity 1440p desktop gaming. Powered by the efficient NVIDIA Ampere architecture, it features an expansive 12GB GDDR6 frame buffer running over a 192-bit bus. Outfitted with ZOTAC\'s specialized IceStorm 2.0 advanced cooling setup, high-pressure dual fans, and FREEZE Fan Stop technology, this compact dual-slot card easily slides into 99% of computer cases while requiring only a standard single 8-pin power connector.&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>3,584 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Boost Mode)</td><td>1777 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Architecture Framework</td><td>NVIDIA Ampere Architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Core Hardware<