cs</strong></td><td>Cooling Engineering</td><td>IceStorm 2.0, Active Fan Control, FREEZE Fan Stop</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Structural Enhancements</td><td>Rigid Protective Metal Backplate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Product Warranty</td><td>3 Years Standard + 2 Years Extended Warranty (Via Online Registration)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/0EOu8LDlPvsEEJxrAEm7HPB5dIZDW7QbevRys0M4.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 20:18:35', '2026-07-12 20:18:35', 'Meta Title: ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 3060 Twin Edge 12GB GDDR6 Graphics CardMeta Title: ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 3060 Twin Edge 12GB GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Buy the efficient ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 3060 Twin Edge 12GB GDDR6. Features IceStorm 2.0 cooling, 3584 CUDA cores, 12GB VRAM, and a protective metal backplate.', 'Keywords: Zotac RTX 3060 Twin Edge 12GB price, ZT-A30600E-10M, GeForce RTX 3060 12GB GDDR6, NVIDIA Ampere graphics card, IceStorm 2.0 GPU, budget 1080p 1440p gaming PC Bangladesh', NULL, 141, NULL, NULL),
(1365, 'ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 SOLO 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 SOLO 8GB GDDR7 packs next-generation, AI-accelerated mainstream performance into an ultra-compact, single-fan footprint. Driven by the groundbreaking NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, it combines an 8GB buffer of cutting-edge GDDR7 memory running at a fast 28 Gbps over a 128-bit bus with native DLSS 4 neural frame generation. Operating within a highly compatible, true 2-slot footprint measuring only 16.4 cm in length, this efficient 145W card requires just a single standard 8-pin PCIe power connector. Designed to fit into 99% of desktop cases, it serves as the ultimate plug-and-play drop-in upgrade for space-restricted Small Form Factor (SFF) and mini-ITX setups.', 'zotac-gaming-geforce-rtx-5060-solo-8gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783887602', '<p>The ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 SOLO 8GB GDDR7 packs next-generation, AI-accelerated mainstream performance into an ultra-compact, single-fan footprint. Driven by the groundbreaking NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, it combines an 8GB buffer of cutting-edge GDDR7 memory running at a fast 28 Gbps over a 128-bit bus with native DLSS 4 neural frame generation. Operating within a highly compatible, true 2-slot footprint measuring only 16.4 cm in length, this efficient 145W card requires just a single standard 8-pin PCIe power connector. Designed to fit into 99% of desktop cases, it serves as the ultimate plug-and-play drop-in upgrade for space-restricted Small Form Factor (SFF) and mini-ITX setups. &nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>3,840 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Boost Mode)</td><td>2497 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Architecture Framework</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell Architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Neural Engine Core Specs</td><td>5th Gen Tensor Cores &amp; 4th Gen RT Cores (DLSS 4 Support)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Video Memory Configuration</td><td>8GB GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>28 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Interface Width</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Bandwidth</td><td>448 GB/s</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Bus Standard / Interface</td><td>PCI Express 5.0 x8</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>$7680 \\times 4320$ (8K Ultra HD Support)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Maximum Display Connections</td><td>Quad Display Support (Up to 4 concurrent monitors)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>HDCP Version Support</td><td>Yes (Version 2.3)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Interface</td><td>1x Native HDMI 2.1b (Supports 4K 480Hz HDR / 8K 120Hz HDR with DSC)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>DisplayPort Interface</td><td>3x Native DisplayPort 2.1b with UHBR20 (Up to 4K 480Hz / 8K 165Hz with DSC)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Estimated Power Draw (TDP)</td><td>145W Max Power Consumption</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Recommended System PSU</td><td>550W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>1x 8-pin PCIe Power Cable</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>DirectX Support</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>164.5 x 111.2 x 36.4 mm (6.5 x 4.4 x 1.4 inches)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Form Factor Slot Width</td><td>True 2-Slot Profile (ITX-Ready Ultra Compact Layout)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Cooling Engineering</td><td>Single High-Pressure BladeLink Fan + Optimized Heat Dissipation Stack</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Product Warranty</td><td>3 Years Standard + 2 Years Extended Brand Warranty (Upon Online Registration)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/yBj0JqZT7RV5uXc40gbZl1SxSD4f9vDTM4AbVsT3.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 20:20:02', '2026-07-12 20:20:02', 'Meta Title: ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 SOLO 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Buy the ultra-compact ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 SOLO 8GB GDDR7. Features NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, a single BladeLink fan, DLSS 4, and an ITX-ready 145W low-power profile.', NULL, NULL, 141, NULL, NULL),
(1366, 'ZOTAC GeForce RTX 5060 Twin Edge 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Twin Edge 8GB GDDR7 delivers elite next-generation mainstream performance and advanced AI acceleration to compact and small-form-factor (SFF) desktop systems. Powered by the groundbreaking NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, it pairs an 8GB buffer of cutting-edge GDDR7 memory running at a blistering 28 Gbps over a 128-bit bus with native DLSS 4 neural frame generation. Featuring a highly compatible, true 2-slot design measuring just 22 cm in length, this efficient card runs off a single standard 8-pin power connector and utilizes a custom dual BladeLink fan configuration backed by a rigid structural metal backplate.', 'zotac-geforce-rtx-5060-twin-edge-8gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783887705', '<p>The ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Twin Edge 8GB GDDR7 redefines mainstream desktop graphics by introducing premium next-generation memory standards and advanced neural computing frameworks into a space-optimized footprint. Grounded on the 5nm NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, this graphics accelerator introduces massive architectural leaps over previous generations, deploying 3,840 high-performance CUDA cores along with 5th Generation Tensor Cores and 4th Generation Ray Tracing Cores built for complex geometry processing. These processing blocks allow budget-conscious gamers, live streamers, and digital creators to unlock real-time cinematic ray tracing, execute localized generative AI applications, and multiply game frame rates up to 4x via neural rendering using NVIDIA DLSS 4 with Multi Frame Generation. Operating at a highly responsive 2497 MHz engine boost clock, it delivers smooth, fluid frame delivery across competitive 1080p and high-setting 1440p resolutions.</p><p>True to ZOTAC\'s focus on space-optimized engineering, the Twin Edge is an officially certified SFF-Ready graphics card measuring a highly compatible 22.0 cm in length, making it a perfect fit for mini-ITX and smaller mid-tower setups without disrupting vital layout zones. Operating at a highly efficient total board power (TDP) profile of just 145W, it minimizes power supply headroom and thermal load constraints on the system. Heat dissipation is actively managed by a specialized dual-fan layout utilizing custom BladeLink fans that drive focused downward air pressure across a dense aluminum fin stack. The card incorporates advanced FREEZE Fan Stop technology, which fully silences the fan array during light tasks like web surfing, media streaming, or coding to eliminate ambient noise entirely. Completed with a rigid protective metal backplate to safeguard components from warping and future-proof DisplayPort 2.1b connections with UHBR20 support, it serves as an exceptional future-ready engine for clean, compact builds.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>3,840 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Boost Mode)</td><td>2497 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Architecture Framework</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell Architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Neural Engine Core Specs</td><td>5th Gen Tensor Cores &amp; 4th Gen RT Cores (DLSS 4 Support)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Video Memory Configuration</td><td>8GB GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>28 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Interface Width</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Bandwidth</td><td>448 GB/s</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Bus Standard / Interface</td><td>PCI Express 5.0 x8</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>$7680 \\times 4320$ (8K Ultra HD Support)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Maximum Display Connections</td><td>Quad Display Support (Up to 4 concurrent monitors)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>HDCP Version Support</td><td>Yes (Version 2.3)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Interface</td><td>1x Native HDMI 2.1b (Supports 4K 480Hz HDR / 8K 120Hz HDR with DSC)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>DisplayPort Interface</td><td>3x Native DisplayPort 2.1b with UHBR20 (Up to 4K 480Hz / 8K 165Hz with DSC)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Estimated Power Draw (TDP)</td><td>145W Max Power Consumption</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Recommended System PSU</td><td>550W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>1x 8-pin PCIe Power Cable</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>DirectX Support</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>220.5 x 120.25 x 41.6 mm (8.7 x 4.7 x 1.6 inches)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Form Factor Slot Width</td><td>True 2-Slot Profile (SFF-Ready Enclosure Friendly)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Cooling Engineering</td><td>Dual BladeLink Fans, Advanced Air Cooling Stack, FREEZE Fan Stop</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Structural Enhancements</td><td>Rigid Protective Metal Backplate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Product Warranty</td><td>3 Years Standard + 2 Years Extended Brand Warranty (Upon Online Registration)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 52000.00, 52000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/j3pCEi8zJOlEu4sYz297P9TyaoeCELqIDjhocd0O.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 20:21:45', '2026-07-12 20:21:45', 'Meta Title: ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Twin Edge 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Buy the next-gen ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Twin Edge. Features NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 8GB GDDR7 memory, DLSS 4, and high-pressure dual BladeLink fans.', 'Keywords: Zotac RTX 5060 Twin Edge price, ZT-B50600E-10M, GeForce RTX 5060 8GB GDDR7, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, DLSS 4 graphics card, SFF-Ready compact gaming GPU Bangladesh', NULL, 141, NULL, NULL),
(1367, 'ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Twin Edge 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Twin Edge 8GB GDDR7 brings elite next-generation high-refresh 1080p and fluid 1440p gaming performance to space-conscious desktop systems. Driven by the advanced NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, it leverages 8GB of ultra-fast next-gen GDDR7 memory running over a 128-bit bus with native support for DLSS 4 neural frame generation. Featuring an ultra-compact, true 2-slot SFF-Ready profile measuring just 22 cm in length, it balances a 180W power envelope using a standard 8-pin power input and integrates high-pressure dual BladeLink fans anchored by a durable structural metal backplate.', 'zotac-gaming-geforce-rtx-5060-ti-twin-edge-8gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783887763', '<p>he ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Twin Edge 8GB GDDR7 completely redefines the mid-range performance tier by combining pioneering next-generation memory standards and elite neural AI processing into a space-optimized footprint. Architected on the 5nm NVIDIA Blackwell framework, this graphics accelerator provides major generational compute leaps, utilizing 4,608 high-performance CUDA cores alongside 5th Generation Tensor Cores and 4th Generation Ray Tracing Cores built for complex geometry execution. These processing arrays allow competitive gamers, live streamers, and digital designers to witness highly realistic ray-traced lighting effects, execute localized generative AI applications, and multiply game frame rates up to 4x via neural rendering using NVIDIA DLSS 4 with Multi Frame Generation. Operating at a stable boost core engine clock of 2572 MHz, it guarantees ultra-responsive, fluid frame delivery across the latest AAA titles.</p><p>True to ZOTAC’s engineering focus on compact system integration, the Twin Edge variant is an officially certified SFF-Ready card measuring just 22.0 cm in length and sitting at a standard 2-slot thickness. This ensures a flawless drop-in fit for popular mini-ITX layouts and smaller mid-tower enclosures without disrupting vital chassis airflow boundaries or blocking adjacent components. Thermal dissipation is managed by ZOTAC\'s specialized IceStorm 2.0 dual-fan matrix, combining an optimized high-density aluminum fin stack with custom 90mm BladeLink axial fans designed to maximize focused downward air pressure. The cooling array features intelligent FREEZE Fan Stop technology, which completely halts fan rotation during low-load tasks like web browsing or writing to entirely eliminate operational ambient noise. Completed with a rigid protective metal backplate to avoid PCB warping and next-generation DisplayPort 2.1b connections with UHBR20 support for future-proof display pairings, it stands as a robust, highly reliable anchor for modern compact computing setups.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 Ti</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>4,608 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Boost Mode)</td><td>2572 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Architecture Framework</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell Architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Neural Engine Core Specs</td><td>5th Gen Tensor Cores &amp; 4th Gen RT Cores (DLSS 4 Support)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Video Memory Configuration</td><td>8GB GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>28 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Interface Width</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Bandwidth</td><td>448 GB/s</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Bus Standard / Interface</td><td>PCI Express 5.0 x8</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>$7680 \\times 4320$ (8K Ultra HD Support)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Maximum Display Connections</td><td>Quad Display Support (Up to 4 concurrent monitors)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>HDCP Version Support</td><td>Yes (Version 2.3)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Interface</td><td>1x Native HDMI 2.1b (Supports 4K 480Hz HDR / 8K 120Hz HDR with DSC)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>DisplayPort Interface</td><td>3x Native DisplayPort 2.1b with UHBR20 (Up to 4K 480Hz / 8K 165Hz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Estimated Power Draw (TDP)</td><td>180W Max Power Consumption</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Recommended System PSU</td><td>600W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>1x 8-pin PCIe Power Cable</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>DirectX Support</td><td>Microsoft DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>220.5 x 120.25 x 41.6 mm (8.7 x 4.7 x 1.6 inches)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Form Factor Slot Width</td><td>True 2-Slot Profile (SFF-Ready Enclosure Friendly)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Cooling Engineering</td><td>IceStorm 2.0, Dual 90mm BladeLink Fans, FREEZE Fan Stop</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Structural Enhancements</td><td>Rigid Protective Full Metal Backplate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Product Warranty</td><td>3 Years Standard + 2 Years Extended Brand Warranty (Upon Online Registration)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/glODkTnc5GnYCfy4F47nbnNwlvuGBtz6IlnbKGnB.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 20:22:43', '2026-07-12 20:22:43', 'vMeta Title: ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Twin Edge 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Buy the compact ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Ti Twin Edge 8GB. Features NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, next-gen GDDR7 memory, IceStorm 2.0, and DLSS 4 framework.', 'vKeywords: Zotac RTX 5060 Ti Twin Edge price, ZT-B50610E-10M, GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8GB GDDR7, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, DLSS 4 graphics card, SFF-Ready high-refresh gaming GPU Bangladesh', NULL, 141, NULL, NULL),
(1368, 'ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 4060 Ti 8GB Twin Edge GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'The ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 4060 Ti 8GB Twin Edge GDDR6 balances high-efficiency architecture and a compact footprint to deliver exceptional 1080p and high-refresh mainstream 1440p gaming. Driven by the advanced NVIDIA Ada Lovelace architecture, it features an 8GB GDDR6 frame buffer running over a 128-bit bus with native DLSS 3 Frame Generation support. Outfitted with an efficient 2.2-slot cooling framework measuring just 22.5 cm long, this card runs off a single standard 8-pin PCIe connector and utilizes high-pressure dual fans backed by Freeze Fan Stop technology and a structural metal backplate.', 'zotac-gaming-geforce-rtx-4060-ti-8gb-twin-edge-gddr6-graphics-card-1783887838', '<p>The ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 4060 Ti 8GB Twin Edge GDDR6 brings elite neural AI processing and smooth, high-refresh graphic performance to small-form-factor (SFF) enthusiasts, home theater layouts, and space-conscious mid-tower setups. Grounded on the highly efficient 5nm NVIDIA Ada Lovelace architecture framework, this graphics accelerator introduces massive architectural leaps, deploying 4,352 high-performance CUDA cores along with 4th Generation Tensor Cores and 3rd Generation Ray Tracing Cores. These processing components allow gamers, live streamers, and digital creators to unlock immersive ray-traced ambient lighting, run local AI-assisted workflows smoothly, and multiply system frame rates up to 4x via neural rendering using NVIDIA DLSS 3 with Multi Frame Generation. Operating at a responsive 2535 MHz boost engine clock, it delivers uncompromising fluidity across the latest AAA title releases.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>What makes this Twin Edge variant uniquely versatile is its purposeful optimization of physical space balanced with reliable heavy-duty cooling. Measuring a highly compatible 22.5 cm in total length and sitting at a reduced 2.2-slot depth, it slides effortlessly into tight mini-ITX custom builds without blocking adjacent expansion slots or layout zones. Thermal dissipation is managed by ZOTAC’s upgraded IceStorm 2.0 advanced cooling matrix, which pairs a dense aluminum fin stack with composite heatpipes and custom dual axial fans engineered to maximize downward air pressure. The cooling array features intelligent FREEZE Fan Stop technology, which completely silences all fan rotation during low-load operations like web surfing or coding to eliminate ambient noise entirely. Completed with a rigid structural metal backplate to safeguard components from warping, subtle SPECTRA RGB lighting accents, and future-proof DisplayPort 1.4a and HDMI 2.1a connectivity, it serves as a robust future-proof engine for clean, compact builds.&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Ti</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>4,352 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Boost Mode)</td><td>2535 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Architecture Framework</td><td>NVIDIA Ada Lovelace Architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Neural Engine Core Specs</td><td>4th Gen Tensor Cores &amp; 3rd Gen RT Cores (DLSS 3 Support)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Video Memory Configuration</td><td>8GB GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Clock Speed</td><td>18.0 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Interface Width</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Bandwidth</td><td>288 GB/s</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Bus Standard / Interface</td><td>PCI Express 4.0 x8 (Within x16 form factor)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>$7680 \\times 4320$ (8K Ultra HD Support @ 60Hz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Maximum Display Connections</td><td>Quad Display Support (Up to 4 concurrent monitors)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>HDCP Version Support</td><td>Yes (Version 2.3)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Interface</td><td>1x Native HDMI 2.1a (Supports 4K 120Hz/8K 60Hz HDR &amp; VRR)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>DisplayPort Interface</td><td>3x Native DisplayPort 1.4a</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Power Consumption (TDP)</td><td>160W Max Power Consumption</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Recommended System PSU</td><td>500W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>1x 8-pin PCIe Power Cable</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>DirectX Support</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>225.5 x 123.2 x 40.1 mm (8.9 x 4.9 x 1.6 inches)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Form Factor Slot Width</td><td>2.2-Slot Profile (SFF Enclosure Friendly)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Cooling Engineering</td><td>IceStorm 2.0, Active Fan Control, FREEZE Fan Stop</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics / Structural</strong></td><td>Build Enhancements</td><td>Rigid Protective Metal Backplate, SPECTRA RGB Lighting</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Product Warranty</td><td>3 Years Standard + 2 Years Extended Brand Warranty (Upon Online Registration)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/kHa4mT77Harh0qLxjDyws8uk059