ure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Neural Engine Core Specs</td><td>4th Gen Tensor Cores &amp; 3rd Gen RT Cores (DLSS 3 Support)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Video Memory Configuration</td><td>8GB GDDR6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Clock Speed</td><td>18.0 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Interface Width</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Bandwidth</td><td>288 GB/s</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Bus Standard / Interface</td><td>PCI Express 4.0 x8 (Within x16 form factor)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>$7680 \\times 4320$ (8K Ultra HD Support @ 60Hz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Maximum Display Connections</td><td>Quad Display Support (Up to 4 concurrent monitors)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>HDCP Version Support</td><td>Yes (Version 2.3)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Interface</td><td>1x Native HDMI 2.1a (Supports 4K 120Hz/8K 60Hz HDR &amp; VRR)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>DisplayPort Interface</td><td>3x Native DisplayPort 1.4a</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Power Consumption (TDP)</td><td>160W Max Power Consumption</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Recommended System PSU</td><td>500W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>1x 8-pin PCIe Power Cable</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>DirectX Support</td><td>DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>225.5 x 123.2 x 40.1 mm (8.9 x 4.9 x 1.6 inches)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Form Factor Slot Width</td><td>2.2-Slot Profile (SFF Enclosure Friendly)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Cooling Engineering</td><td>IceStorm 2.0, Active Fan Control, FREEZE Fan Stop</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics / Structural</strong></td><td>Build Enhancements</td><td>Rigid Protective Metal Backplate, SPECTRA RGB Lighting</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Product Warranty</td><td>3 Years Standard + 2 Years Extended Brand Warranty (Upon Online Registration)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/1X3xPcwDBLMoeFWEJhMIEPx3ZRM7XnEx5YQnlIWL.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 20:24:42', '2026-07-12 20:24:42', 'Meta Title: ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 4060 Ti 8GB Twin Edge GDDR6 Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Buy the compact ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 4060 Ti 8GB Twin Edge GDDR6. Features NVIDIA Ada Lovelace architecture, DLSS 3, IceStorm 2.0 cooling, and a 2.2-slot design.', 'Keywords: Zotac RTX 4060 Ti Twin Edge price, ZT-D40610E-10M, GeForce RTX 4060 Ti 8GB GDDR6, NVIDIA Ada Lovelace GPU, DLSS 3 graphics card, SFF compact gaming GPU Bangladesh', NULL, 141, NULL, NULL);
