(1370, 'ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Ti AMP 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Ti AMP 16GB GDDR7 unleashes massive memory headroom and premier next-generation AI processing within a space-optimized footprint. Powered by the cutting-edge NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, it combines a generous 16GB buffer of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory running at 28 Gbps with native DLSS 4 neural frame generation. Outfitted with an aggressive premium factory overclock pushing the boost clock to 2632 MHz, this SFF-Ready dual-slot card utilizes an advanced IceStorm 2.0 cooling framework with webbed BladeLink dual fans, striking white LED styling accents, and a structural metal backplate—running efficiently off a single standard 8-pin power connector.', 'zotac-gaming-geforce-rtx-5060-ti-amp-16gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783887999', '<p>The ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Ti AMP 16GB GDDR7 marks the pinnacle of mid-range hardware engineering, packing an oversized next-gen memory subsystem and premium factory tuning into a highly compatible layout. Grounded on the 5nm NVIDIA Blackwell framework, this graphics accelerator introduces immense generational milestones by deploying 4,608 high-performance CUDA cores alongside 5th Generation Tensor Cores and 4th Generation Ray Tracing Cores built for complex Mega Geometry execution. These processing blocks fully supercharge neural workflows, allowing users to experience incredibly detailed path-traced ray tracing, run localized large-language models (LLMs), and scale frame rates up to 4x via neural rendering using NVIDIA DLSS 4 with Multi Frame Generation. Reconfigured under ZOTAC\'s elite AMP design line, it features an aggressive out-of-the-box factory overclock that raises the boost engine clock to a screaming 2632 MHz for maximum competitive responsiveness.</p><p>The defining characteristic of this premium AMP variant is the seamless pairing of huge VRAM headroom with space-restricted custom setups. Armed with 16GB of next-generation GDDR7 memory operating over a 128-bit bus, it entirely eliminates texture streaming boundaries—allowing modern digital creators, 3D artists, and AI developers to fluidly process memory-intensive generative AI datasets, complex 3D viewports in Blender, and multi-layered 4K video editing timelines without stuttering.</p><p>Despite its premium performance profile, the card is officially certified SFF-Ready, measuring a highly compatible 22.0 cm in length and sitting at a true 2-slot thickness to fit perfectly into mini-ITX and compact mid-tower enclosures. Operating at a highly efficient total board power (TDP) profile of just 180W, it utilizes a standard single 8-pin PCIe power connector to simplify power supply management. Thermal dissipation is masterfully controlled by ZOTAC’s upgraded IceStorm 2.0 dual-fan system, incorporating custom 90mm BladeLink fans with webbed impellers to maximize focused downward air pressure across a dense aluminum heatsink layout. The card features advanced FREEZE Fan Stop technology, which completely silences the fan array during low-load tasks like coding or web surfing to eliminate ambient noise entirely. Completed with a full wraparound structural metal backplate to avoid PCB flex, clean white LED accent lighting, and next-generation DisplayPort 2.1b connections with UHBR20 support, it stands as the ultimate future-proof engine for compact high-performance systems.&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 Ti</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>4,608 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Base Mode)</td><td>2407 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Boost Mode)</td><td>2632 MHz (Factory Overclocked AMP Edition)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Architecture Framework</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell Architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Neural Engine Core Specs</td><td>5th Gen Tensor Cores &amp; 4th Gen RT Cores (DLSS 4 Support)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Video Memory Configuration</td><td>16GB GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>28 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Interface Width</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Bandwidth</td><td>448 GB/s</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Bus Standard / Interface</td><td>PCI Express 5.0 x8 (Within mechanical x16 form factor)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>$7680 \\times 4320$ (8K Ultra HD Support)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Maximum Display Connections</td><td>Quad Display Support (Up to 4 concurrent monitors)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>HDCP Version Support</td><td>Yes (Version 2.3)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Interface</td><td>1x Native HDMI 2.1b (Supports 4K 120Hz HDR / 8K 60Hz HDR &amp; VRR)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>DisplayPort Interface</td><td>3x Native DisplayPort 2.1b with UHBR20 (Up to 4K 480Hz / 8K 165Hz with DSC)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Estimated Power Draw (TDP)</td><td>180W Max Power Consumption</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Recommended System PSU</td><td>600W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>1x 8-pin PCIe Power Cable Input</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>DirectX Support</td><td>Microsoft DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>220.5 x 120.25 x 41.6 mm (8.7 x 4.7 x 1.6 inches)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Form Factor Slot Width</td><td>True 2-Slot Profile (NVIDIA SFF-Ready Certified)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Cooling Engineering</td><td>IceStorm 2.0, Dual 90mm Webbed BladeLink Fans, FREEZE Fan Stop</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics / Structural</strong></td><td>Build Enhancements</td><td>Rigid Protective Metal Backplate, Sleek White LED Accent Lighting</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Product Warranty</td><td>3 Years Standard + 2 Years Extended Brand Warranty (Upon Online Registration)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 20:26:39', '2026-07-12 20:26:39', 'Meta Title: ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Ti AMP 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Buy the factory-overclocked ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Ti AMP 16GB. Features NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 16GB GDDR7 VRAM, DLSS 4, and an SFF-Ready footprint.', 'Keywords: Zotac RTX 5060 Ti AMP 16GB price, ZT-B50620F-10M, GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16GB GDDR7, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, DLSS 4 graphics card, 16GB VRAM AI GPU Bangladesh', NULL, 141, NULL, NULL),
(1371, 'ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16GB Twin Edge OC White Edition Graphics Card', 'The ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16GB Twin Edge OC White Edition combines a striking, minimalist all-white aesthetic with massive next-generation VRAM headroom and premium factory-overclocked performance. Powered by the groundbreaking NVIDIA Blackwell framework, it maps an expansive 16GB buffer of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory across a 128-bit bus with native support for DLSS 4 neural frame generation. Certified as an NVIDIA SFF-Ready card measuring just 22 cm in length, it features a premium white shroud, matching white metal backplate, high-pressure dual BladeLink fans, and IceStorm 2.0 thermal engineering—delivering flawless high-refresh 1080p/1440p gaming and localized AI workflows while running off a single standard 8-pin power input.', 'zotac-gaming-geforce-rtx-5060-ti-16gb-twin-edge-oc-white-edition-graphics-card-1783888074', '<p>The <strong>ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 16GB Twin Edge OC White Edition</strong> combines a striking, minimalist all-white aesthetic with massive next-generation VRAM headroom and premium factory-overclocked performance. Powered by the groundbreaking NVIDIA Blackwell framework, it maps an expansive 16GB buffer of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory across a 128-bit bus with native support for DLSS 4 neural frame generation. Certified as an NVIDIA SFF-Ready card measuring just 22 cm in length, it features a premium white shroud, matching white metal backplate, high-pressure dual BladeLink fans, and IceStorm 2.0 thermal engineering—delivering flawless high-refresh 1080p/1440p gaming and localized AI workflows while running off a single standard 8-pin power input.&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 Ti</td><