(1372, 'ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Ti AMP 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Ti AMP 8GB GDDR7 packs elite next-generation high-refresh 1080p and fluid 1440p gaming performance into a compact, factory-overclocked footprint. Driven by the advanced NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, it leverages 8GB of ultra-fast next-gen GDDR7 memory running over a 128-bit bus with native support for DLSS 4 neural frame generation. Featuring an ultra-compact, true 2-slot SFF-Ready design measuring just 22 cm in length, it delivers an aggressive factory boost clock of 2632 MHz while running efficiently off a single standard 8-pin PCIe power input.', 'zotac-gaming-geforce-rtx-5060-ti-amp-8gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783888137', '<p>range performance tier by combining pioneering next-generation memory standards and elite out-of-the-box factory tuning into a space-optimized layout. Architected on the 5nm NVIDIA Blackwell framework, this graphics accelerator provides major generational compute leaps, utilizing 4,608 high-performance CUDA cores alongside 5th Generation Tensor Cores and 4th Generation Ray Tracing Cores built for complex geometry execution. These processing arrays fully supercharge neural workflows, allowing competitive gamers, live streamers, and digital designers to witness highly realistic path-traced ray tracing, run localized AI applications, and multiply game frame rates up to 4x via neural rendering using NVIDIA DLSS 4 with Multi Frame Generation. Reconfigured under ZOTAC\'s premium AMP design lineage, it features a factory overclock pushing the boost engine clock to a screaming 2632 MHz for exceptional competitive responsiveness.</p><p>True to ZOTAC’s engineering focus on compact system integration, the AMP variant is an officially certified SFF-Ready card measuring just 22.0 cm in length and sitting at a standard 2-slot thickness. This ensures a flawless drop-in fit for popular mini-ITX custom setups and smaller mid-tower enclosures without disrupting vital chassis airflow boundaries or blocking adjacent components. Thermal dissipation is masterfully controlled by ZOTAC\'s specialized IceStorm 2.0 cooling system, which combines an optimized high-density aluminum fin stack driven by dual 90mm BladeLink axial fans designed to maximize focused downward air pressure. The cooling array features intelligent FREEZE Fan Stop technology, which completely halts fan rotation during low-load tasks like web surfing or writing to entirely eliminate operational ambient noise. Completed with a rigid protective metal backplate to safeguard components from warping, striking white LED accent lighting, and next-generation DisplayPort 2.1b connections with UHBR20 support, it stands as the ultimate future-proof engine for clean, high-performance compact setups.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Graphics Processor</td><td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 Ti</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>CUDA Cores</td><td>4,608 Units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Base Mode)</td><td>2407 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Engine Clock (Boost Mode)</td><td>2632 MHz (Factory Overclocked AMP Edition)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Architecture Framework</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell Architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GPU Engine Specs</strong></td><td>Neural Engine Core Specs</td><td>5th Gen Tensor Cores &amp; 4th Gen RT Cores (DLSS 4 Support)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Video Memory Configuration</td><td>8GB GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Speed</td><td>28 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Interface Width</td><td>128-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Memory Bandwidth</td><td>448 GB/s</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Specs</strong></td><td>Bus Standard / Interface</td><td>PCI Express 5.0 x8 (Within mechanical x16 form factor)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Digital Max Resolution</td><td>$7680 \\times 4320$ (8K Ultra HD Support)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>Maximum Display Connections</td><td>Quad Display Support (Up to 4 concurrent monitors)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Support</strong></td><td>HDCP Version Support</td><td>Yes (Version 2.3)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>HDMI Interface</td><td>1x Native HDMI 2.1b (Supports 4K 480Hz HDR / 8K 120Hz HDR with DSC)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Connectivity</strong></td><td>DisplayPort Interface</td><td>3x Native DisplayPort 2.1b with UHBR20 (Up to 4K 480Hz / 8K 165Hz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Estimated Power Draw (TDP)</td><td>180W Max Power Consumption</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Recommended System PSU</td><td>600W / 650W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>External Power Connectors</td><td>1x 8-pin PCIe Power Cable Input</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>DirectX Support</td><td>Microsoft DirectX 12 Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Support</strong></td><td>OpenGL Support</td><td>OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>220.5 x 120.25 x 41.6 mm (8.7 x 4.7 x 1.6 inches)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Form Factor Slot Width</td><td>True 2-Slot Profile (NVIDIA SFF-Ready Certified)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Cooling Engineering</td><td>IceStorm 2.0, Dual 90mm BladeLink Fans, FREEZE Fan Stop</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetics / Structural</strong></td><td>Build Enhancements</td><td>Rigid Protective Full Metal Backplate, Sleek White LED Lighting</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Product Warranty</td><td>3 Years Standard + 2 Years Extended Brand Warranty (Upon Online Registration)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/yJwB1ZVUsUaJ7BhbvEvVDh1gk2X9Y8auciQf72vO.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 20:28:57', '2026-07-12 20:28:57', 'Meta Title: ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Ti AMP 8GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Buy the factory-overclocked ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5060 Ti AMP 8GB. Features NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 8GB GDDR7 memory, IceStorm 2.0, and an SFF-Ready layout.', 'Keywords: Zotac RTX 5060 Ti AMP 8GB price, ZT-B50610F-10M, GeForce RTX 5060 Ti 8GB GDDR7, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, DLSS 4 graphics card, compact high-refresh gaming GPU Bangladesh', NULL, 141, NULL, NULL),
(1373, 'ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5070 SOLID 12GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'The ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5070 SOLID 12GB GDDR7 is a high-performance, NVIDIA SFF-Ready enthusiast graphics card engineered for next-generation gaming and creative workloads. Powered by the groundbreaking NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, it features ultra-fast 12GB GDDR7 memory, an advanced IceStorm 2.0 cooling system with triple BladeLink fans, and full support for AI-driven DLSS 4 Multi Frame Generation. Designed with a minimalist, robust aesthetic, this card delivers competitive 4K and 1440p ray-traced gaming performance in a space-optimized footprint.', 'zotac-gaming-geforce-rtx-5070-solid-12gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783892538', '<p><strong>RTX 5070 SOLID 12GB GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong>. Architected around the cutting-edge <strong>NVIDIA Blackwell platform</strong>, this card features 6,144 CUDA cores combined with next-generation <strong>GDDR7 video memory</strong> running across a 192-bit bus. The result is a massive leap in memory bandwidth (up to 672 GB/s) that eliminates data bottlenecks, offering fluid gameplay at higher resolutions and rendering intensive 3D layouts without breaking a sweat.</p><p>The RTX 5070 SOLID brings AI-accelerated features right to your desktop. Exclusive to the Blackwell generation, <strong>DLSS 4 Multi Frame Generation</strong> uses advanced hardware flip-metering to intelligently generate up to three frames for every single rasterized frame, quadrupling frame rates in demanding titles while maintaining flawless visual fidelity. Combined with 4th Gen Ray Tracing Cores, real-time path tracing and photorealistic neural rendering come to life with minimal performance cost.</p><p>Despite its exceptional power, the SOLID series remains exceptionally compact and <strong>NVIDIA SFF-Ready</strong>, making it a perfect anchor for small-form-factor builds. Thermo-regulation is managed by the premium <strong>IceStorm 2.0 advanced cooling setup</strong>, utilizing three