(1374, 'ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5070 AMP White Edition 12GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'Elevate your premium PC build with the ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5070 AMP White Edition 12GB GDDR7. Draped in a striking, pristine white shroud, this graphics card is engineered around NVIDIA\'s revolutionary Blackwell architecture and features a powerful factory overclock out of the box. Armed with 12GB of ultra-fast next-gen GDDR7 memory and an advanced IceStorm 2.0 triple-fan cooling system, it is fully optimized for AI-driven DLSS 4 Multi Frame Generation and photorealistic path tracing. Compact and NVIDIA SFF-Ready, it seamlessly blends high-octane 4K/1440p gaming performance with clean, minimalist aesthetics.', 'zotac-gaming-geforce-rtx-5070-amp-white-edition-12gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783892608', '<p>vTransform both your system\'s look and its performance with the <strong>ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5070 AMP White Edition 12GB GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong>. Meticulously styled for snow-white theme builds, this card drops a heavy-hitting punch beneath its sleek, clean exterior. It is built on the next-generation <strong>NVIDIA Blackwell platform</strong>, driving 6,144 CUDA cores and an aggressive factory-boosted engine clock of <strong>2587 MHz</strong>. Paired with pioneering <strong>GDDR7 video memory</strong> running on a 192-bit bus, it unleashes substantial memory bandwidth at 28 Gbps, eliminating performance bottlenecks in AAA gaming, heavy 3D rendering, and AI local processing.&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>6,144</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Engine Clock (Boost)</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>2587 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Size</strong></