026-07-12 21:43:28', 'Meta Title: ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5070 AMP White Edition 12GB GDDR7', 'Meta Description: Buy ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5070 AMP White Edition 12GB GDDR7 graphics card. Features NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, factory overclocking, IceStorm 2.0, and a stunning all-white aesthetic.', 'Target Keywords: Zotac RTX 5070 AMP White Edition, White RTX 5070 graphics card, 12GB GDDR7 GPU, NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, Zotac 5070 white price, SFF-Ready white graphics card, DLSS 4 gaming card.', NULL, 141, NULL, NULL),
(1375, 'ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5070 Ti SOLID SFF 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'Unleash elite 4K and high-refresh 1440p gaming with the ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5070 Ti SOLID SFF 16GB GDDR7. Engineered around NVIDIA\'s revolutionary Blackwell architecture, this powerhouse packs a massive 16GB of next-gen GDDR7 memory across a wide 256-bit bus. Designed specifically as an NVIDIA SFF-Ready Enthusiast card, its ultra-compact, dual-slot frame easily drops into small-form-factor builds without sacrificing speed. Equipped with IceStorm 2.0 advanced triple-fan cooling and full support for AI-driven DLSS 4 Multi Frame Generation, it delivers uncompromising enthusiast-class performance in a space-saving footprint.', 'zotac-gaming-geforce-rtx-5070-ti-solid-sff-16gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783892787', '<p>Take full control of next-generation visual computing with the <strong>ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5070 Ti SOLID SFF 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong>. Meticulously built on the cutting-edge <strong>NVIDIA Blackwell platform</strong>, this card features a heavy-duty configuration of <strong>8,960 CUDA cores</strong> and a blazing-fast engine boost clock of 2482 MHz. The standout addition is its premium <strong>16GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 VRAM</strong> operating on a wide <strong>256-bit memory interface</strong>, unleashing up to 896 GB/s of raw bandwidth. This massive hardware leap effectively eliminates data bottlenecks, smoothly loading heavy 4K textures, crushing intensive 3D rendering tasks, and running local AI workflows with ease.</p><p>The RTX 5070 Ti SOLID SFF leans heavily into future-proof AI acceleration. Armed with 5th Gen Tensor Cores, it supports the groundbreaking <strong>DLSS 4 Multi Frame Generation</strong> technology, which works in tandem with 4th Gen Ray Tracing Cores to dramatically multiply frame rates while maintaining immaculate, native-like image sharpness during heavy path-traced ray tracing workloads.</p><p>True to its \"SOLID SFF\" designation, ZOTAC has successfully engineered this enthusiast-grade hardware to measure just 304.4mm in length and sit within a strict <strong>2-slot profile</strong>. Thermal management is flawlessly handled by the robust <strong>IceStorm 2.0 Advanced Cooling system</strong>, which utilizes three custom BladeLink fans and a direct-contact heatsink array to quickly disperse heat. With <strong>FREEZE Fan Stop</strong> and Active Fan Control, your system drops to absolute silence during light operations. Complete with a rigid protective metal backplate, a dedicated <strong>12V-2x6 Safety Indicator Light</strong>, clean white LED accent lighting, and future-ready DisplayPort 2.1b connectivity, this card is the ultimate space-saving upgrade.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>8,960</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Engine Clock (Boost)</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>2482 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Video Memory Capacity</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>256-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>28 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Protocol</strong></td><td>Connectivity</td><td>PCI Express 5.0 x16</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Connectors</strong></td><td>Connectivity</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 2.1b (UHBR20), 1 x HDMI 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Output</strong></td><td>Connectivity</td><td>Quad Display (Up to 4 monitors simultaneously)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Connectivity</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K @ 165Hz / 4K @ 480Hz with DSC)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>IceStorm 2.0 (Triple BladeLink Fans)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Profiles</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>FREEZE Fan Stop / Active Fan Control</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor / Dimensions</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>304.4mm x 115.8mm x 41.6mm (Dual-Slot / SFF-Ready)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Body Construction</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Minimalist Shroud with Full Structural Metal Backplate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Premium White LED Lighting</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>300W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended System PSU</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>750W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Input Interface</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1 x 12V-2x6 (16-Pin) with Safety LED Indicator</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Framework Support</strong></td><td>Software / OS</td><td>Microsoft DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Supported Operating System</strong></td><td>Software / OS</td><td>Windows 11 / 10 (64-bit, v1809 or later)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-12 21:46:27', '2026-07-12 21:46:27', 'Meta Title: ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5070 Ti SOLID SFF 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Buy the ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5070 Ti SOLID SFF 16GB GDDR7 graphics card. Featuring NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, DLSS 4 AI, and IceStorm 2.0 dual-slot cooling.', 'Target Keywords: Zotac RTX 5070 Ti Solid SFF, Zotac Gaming 5070 Ti 16GB, 16GB GDDR7 graphics card, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, RTX 5070 Ti SFF-Ready, DLSS 4 gaming card, 256-bit gaming GPU.', NULL, 141, NULL, NULL),
