(1378, 'ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5070 Ti SOLID CORE OC 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'Unleash premium 4K and high-frame-rate 1440p gaming with the ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5070 Ti SOLID SFF 16GB GDDR7. Engineered around NVIDIA\'s cutting-edge Blackwell architecture, this elite graphics card packs a massive 16GB of next-gen GDDR7 memory running on a wide 256-bit bus. Explicitly designed to meet NVIDIA SFF-Ready Enthusiast standards, its space-optimized, strict dual-slot enclosure easily drops into small-form-factor builds without compromising raw computing power. Equipped with an advanced IceStorm 2.0 triple-fan thermal system and full support for AI-driven DLSS 4 Multi Frame Generation, it brings top-tier desktop performance to compact setups.', 'zotac-gaming-geforce-rtx-5070-ti-solid-core-oc-16gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783918959', '<p>Take full control of next-generation visuals and AI-driven workflows with the <strong>ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5070 Ti SOLID SFF 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong>. Meticulously built on the revolutionary <strong>NVIDIA Blackwell platform</strong>, this card features a heavy-duty configuration of <strong>8,960 CUDA cores</strong> paired with a blazing-fast engine boost clock of 2482 MHz. The standout addition is its premium <strong>16GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 VRAM</strong> operating on a wide <strong>256-bit memory interface</strong>, unleashing a colossal 896 GB/s of raw bandwidth. This massive leap in architecture effectively eliminates asset loading bottlenecks, letting you smoothly manipulate heavy 4K textures, accelerate massive 3D rendering projects, and run complex local generative AI tasks with ease.</p><p>The RTX 5070 Ti SOLID SFF is built to maximize advanced neural computing. Armed with 5th Gen Tensor Cores, it natively executes <strong>DLSS 4 Multi Frame Generation</strong>, which works alongside 4th Gen Ray Tracing Cores to dramatically multiply frame rates while maintaining immaculate, native-like image sharpness during heavy path-traced ray tracing workloads.</p><p>True to its \"SOLID SFF\" designation, ZOTAC has successfully engineered this enthusiast-grade hardware to measure just 304.4mm in length and sit within a compact <strong>2-slot profile</strong>. Thermal management is flawlessly handled by the robust <strong>IceStorm 2.0 Advanced Cooling system</strong>, which utilizes three custom BladeLink fans and a direct-contact heatsink array to quickly disperse heat. With <strong>FREEZE Fan Stop</strong> and Active Fan Control, your system drops to absolute silence during light operations. Complete with a rigid protective metal backplate, a dedicated <strong>12V-2x6 Safety Indicator Light</strong>, clean white LED accent lighting, and future-ready DisplayPort 2.1b connectivity, this card is the ultimate space-saving upgrade.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>8,960</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Engine Clock (Boost)</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>2482 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Video Memory Capacity</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>256-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>28 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Protocol</strong></td><td>Connectivity</td><td>PCI Express 5.0 x16</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Connectors</strong></td><td>Connectivity</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 2.1b (UHBR20), 1 x HDMI 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Output</strong></td><td>Connectivity</td><td>Quad Display (Up to 4 monitors simultaneously)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Connectivity</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K @ 165Hz / 4K @ 480Hz with DSC)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>IceStorm 2.0 (Triple BladeLink Fans)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Profiles</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>FREEZE Fan Stop / Active Fan Control</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor / Dimensions</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>304.4mm x 115.8mm x 41.6mm (Dual-Slot / SFF-Ready)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Body Construction</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Minimalist Shroud with Full Structural Metal Backplate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Premium White LED Lighting</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>300W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended System PSU</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>750W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Input Interface</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1 x 12V-2x6 (16-Pin) with Safety LED Indicator</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Framework Support</strong></td><td>Software / OS</td><td>Microsoft DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Supported Operating System</strong></td><td>Software / OS</td><td>Windows 11 / 10 (64-bit, v1809 or later)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/gFO1HmwrsWkRc7t1q4ah1UywiPocAhBaRs2yYPWd.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 05:02:39', '2026-07-13 05:02:39', 'Meta Title: ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5070 Ti SOLID SFF 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Shop the ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5070 Ti SOLID SFF 16GB GDDR7 graphics card. Built on NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, featuring DLSS 4 AI and a compact dual-slot frame.', 'Target Keywords: Zotac RTX 5070 Ti Solid SFF, Zotac Gaming 5070 Ti 16GB, 16GB GDDR7 graphics card, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, RTX 5070 Ti SFF-Ready, DLSS 4 gaming card, compact enthusiast GPU.', NULL