atively executes <strong>DLSS 4 Multi Frame Generation</strong>, which works alongside 4th Gen Ray Tracing Cores to dramatically multiply frame rates while maintaining immaculate, native-like image sharpness during heavy path-traced ray tracing workloads.</p><p>True to its \"SOLID SFF\" designation, ZOTAC has successfully engineered this hardware to measure just 304.4mm in length and sit within a compact <strong>2-slot profile</strong>. Thermal management is flawlessly handled by the robust <strong>IceStorm 2.0 Advanced Cooling system</strong>, which utilizes three custom BladeLink fans and a direct-contact heatsink array to quickly disperse heat. With <strong>FREEZE Fan Stop</strong> and Active Fan Control, your system drops to absolute silence during light operations. Complete with a rigid protective metal backplate, a dedicated <strong>12V-2x6 Safety Indicator Light</strong>, clean white LED accent lighting, and future-ready DisplayPort 2.1b connectivity, this card is the ultimate space-saving upgrade.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>8,960</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Engine Clock (Boost)</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>2452 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Video Memory Capacity</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>256-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>28 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Protocol</strong></td><td>Connectivity</td><td>PCI Express 5.0 x16</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Connectors</strong></td><td>C