al Resolution</strong></td><td>Connectivity</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K @ 165Hz / 4K @ 480Hz with DSC)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>IceStorm 2.0 (Triple BladeLink Fans)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Profiles</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>FREEZE Fan Stop / Active Fan Control</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor / Dimensions</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>304.4mm x 115.8mm x 41.6mm (Dual-Slot / SFF-Ready)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Body Construction</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Minimalist Shroud with Full Structural Metal Backplate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Premium White LED Lighting</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>300W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended System PSU</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>750W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Input Interface</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1 x 12V-2x6 (16-Pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Framework Support</strong></td><td>Software / OS</td><td>Microsoft DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Supported Operating System</strong></td><td>Software / OS</td><td>Windows 11 / 10 (64-bit, v1809 or later)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/5q3VMzfBdngGcW9BQYpc4AVye8kjGSHoyKoI1inG.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 05:06:32', '2026-07-13 05:06:32', 'Meta Title: ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5070 Ti SOLID SFF 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Buy the ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5070 Ti SOLID SFF 16GB GDDR7 graphics card. Built on NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, featuring DLSS 4 AI and a compact dual-slot frame.', 'Target Keywords: Zotac RTX 5070 Ti Solid SFF, Zotac Gaming 5070 Ti 16GB, 16GB GDDR7 graphics card, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, RTX 5070 Ti SFF-Ready, DLSS 4 gaming card, compact enthusiast GPU.', NULL, 141, NULL, NULL),
(1382, 'ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5070 Ti SOLID CORE 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'Elevate your gaming and creative ecosystem to elite status with the ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5070 Ti SOLID CORE 16GB GDDR7. Driven by NVIDIA\'s groundbreaking Blackwell architecture, this high-tier GPU offers a massive 16GB of ultra-fast next-gen GDDR7 memory over a wide 256-bit bus. Outfitted with an expansive IceStorm 3.0 advanced cooling engine featuring a signature vapor chamber and a reinforced structural metal mid-frame, it is meticulously built to deliver sustained, icy-cool thermal performance. With full hardware integration for AI-driven DLSS 4 Multi Frame Generation, it serves as the ultimate high-refresh 4K and 1440p gaming powerhouse.', 'zotac-gaming-geforce-rtx-5070-ti-solid-core-16gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783919269', '<p><strong>ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5070 Ti SOLID CORE 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong>. Architected around the bleeding-edge <strong>NVIDIA Blackwell platform</strong>, this card features a heavy-duty deployment of <strong>8,960 CUDA cores</strong> running at a factory-tuned engine boost clock of 2482 MHz. The true core advantage comes from its premium <strong>16GB of next-gen GDDR7 VRAM</strong> pushing a massive 28 Gbps effective speed on a 256-bit memory width. Offering up to 896 GB/s of absolute memory bandwidth, it completely flattens loading bottlenecks, allowing for real-time manipulation of complex 4K assets, vast open-world draw distances, and intense local machine-learning tasks.</p><p>The SOLID CORE lineup is specifically structurally fortified to handle heavy long-term thermal loads. Rather than a standard frame, it integrates a comprehensive <strong>reinforced metal mid-frame</strong> paired with a dense, direct-contact <strong>vapor chamber</strong> plate. This foundation transfers heat straight into the massive heatsink fin array, where three high-airflow <strong>BladeLink fans</strong> whisk it away. Combined with <strong>FREEZE Fan Stop</strong> technology, the fans switch off completely during low-load workloads for absolute acoustic silence.</p><p>Future-proofed to its limits, the card natively runs <strong>DLSS 4 Multi Frame Generation</strong>, accelerating raw frame rates past traditional constraints by using AI to generate multiple sub-frames with stunning sharpness. Complete with a premium structural metal backplate, customizable <strong>SPECTRA RGB lighting</strong> zones, a dedicated <strong>12V-2x6 Safety Light indicator</strong>, and ultra-high-bandwidth DisplayPort 2.1b connections, the RTX 5070 Ti SOLID CORE is built to last.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>8,960</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Engine Clock (Boost)</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>2482 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Video Memory Capacity</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>256-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>28 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Protocol</strong></td><td>Connectivity</td><td>PCI Express 5.0 x16</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Connectors</strong></td><td>Connectivity</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 2.1b (UHBR20), 1 x HDMI 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Output</strong></td><td>Connectivity</td><td>Quad Display (Up to 4 monitors simultaneously)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Connectivity</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K @ 165Hz / 4K @ 480Hz with DSC)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>IceStorm 3.0 with Integrated Vapor Chamber</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Structural Frame</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Reinforced All-Metal Mid-Frame</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Profiles / Controls</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>FREEZE Fan Stop / Active Fan Control (Triple BladeLink Fans)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor / Slot Size</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>2.5-Slot Design</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Card Dimensions</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>303.5mm x 115.8mm x 55.7mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetic Lighting</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>SPECTRA RGB Lighting</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>300W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended System PSU</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>750W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Input Interface</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1 x 12V-2x6 (16-Pin) with Safety LED</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Framework Support</strong></td><td>Software / OS</td><td>Microsoft DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Supported Operating System</strong></td><td>Software / OS</td><td>Windows 11 / 10 (64-bit)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/EX2T6LPrdTE4fJAUFs2nWusbkqPWhu6mufUVZM5B.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 05:07:49', '2026-07-13 05:07:49', 'Meta Title: ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5070 Ti SOLID CORE 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Buy the ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5070 Ti SOLID CORE 16GB GDDR7 graphics card. Features NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, DLSS 4 AI, and IceStorm 3.0 advanced cooling.', 'Target Keywords: Zotac RTX 5070 Ti Solid Core, Zotac Gaming 5070 Ti 16GB, 16GB GDDR7 graphics card, NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, RTX 5070 Ti Solid Core OC, DLSS 4 gaming card, IceStorm 3.0 GPU.', NULL, 141, NULL, NULL),
(1383, 'ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5080 SOLID CORE 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'Dominate next-generation 4K gaming and intensive AI workloads with the ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5080 SOLID CORE 16GB GDDR7. Driven by NVIDIA\'s groundbreaking Blackwell architecture, this enthusiast-class GPU features a massive 10,752 CUDA cores and 16GB of ultra-fast next-gen GDDR7 memory over a wide 256-bit bus. Outfitted with an advanced IceStorm 3.0 cooling engine featuring a high-efficiency vapor chamber, a reinforced metal mid-frame, and a flexible 2.5-slot footprint, it delivers elite thermal performance without case compatibility headaches. With full integration for AI-driven DLSS 4 Multi Frame Generation, it offers unprecedented high-refresh-rate gaming power.', 'zotac-gaming-geforce-rtx-5080-solid-core-16gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783919372', '<p>Crush hardware-demanding AAA titles, heavy 3D rendering workflows, and local AI model generation with the structurally fortified <strong>ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5080 SOLID CORE 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong>. Architected around the bleeding-edge <strong>NVIDIA Blackwell platform</strong>, this elite card boasts a monumental configuration of <strong>10,752 CUDA cores</strong> running at a factory-boosted clock of 2640 MHz. The true performance pillar is its <strong>16GB of next-gen GDDR7 VRAM</strong> pushing an effective memory bandwidth speed of 30 Gbps on a 256-bit interface. This massive memory evolution completely flattens complex data bottlenecks, allowing for real-time handling of ultra-dense 8K textures, massive simulation rendering, and seamless multitasking.</p><p>The SOLID CORE lineup is built tough with severe structural enhancements to manage heavy long-term thermal loads. Rather than relying on a standard shroud, it integrates a comprehensive <strong>reinforced metal mid-frame</strong> paired with a massive direct-contact <strong>vapor chamber</strong> plate. This structural core pulls heat straight into a dense heatsink fin array, where three high-airflow 90mm <strong>BladeLink fans</strong> rapidly disperse it. The implementation of <strong>FREEZE Fan Stop</strong> and Active Fan Control ensure the system drops into absolute acoustic silence during low-load operations.</p><p>Future-proofed for the next decade of visual computing, the card natively runs <strong>DLSS 4 Multi Frame Generation</strong>, multiplying frame rates beyond traditional physical rasterization limits by using AI to generate multiple sub-frames with crisp image clarity. Complete with a premium structural metal backplate, customizable <strong>SPECTRA RGB lighting</strong>, a dedicated <strong>12V-2x6 Safety Light indicator</strong>, and ultra-high-bandwidth DisplayPort 2.1b connections, the RTX 5080 SOLID CORE is built for pure enthusiast performance.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>10,752</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Engine Clock (Boost)</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>2640 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Video Memory Capacity</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>256-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>30 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Protocol</strong></td><td>Connectivity</td><td>PCI Express 5.0 x16</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Connectors</strong></td><td>Connectivity</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 2.1b (UHBR20), 1 x HDMI 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Output</strong></td><td>Connectivity</td><td>Quad Display (Up to 4 monitors simultaneously)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Connectivity</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K @ 165Hz / 4K @ 480Hz with DSC)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>IceStorm 3.0 with Integrated Vapor Chamber</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Structural Frame</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Reinforced All-Metal Mid-Frame &amp; Die-Cast Metal Backplate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan Profiles / Controls</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>FREEZE Fan Stop / Active Fan Control (Triple 90mm BladeLink Fans)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor / Slot Size</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>2.5-Slot Design (Enhanced Build Flexibility)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Card Dimensions</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>303.5mm x 115.8mm x 55.7mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetic Lighting</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>SPECTRA RGB Lighting</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>360W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended System PSU</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>850W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Input Interface</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1 x 12V-2x6 (16-Pin) with Safety LED Indicator</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Framework Support</strong></td><td>Software / OS</td><td>Microsoft DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6, Vulkan 1.4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Supported Operating System</strong></td><td>Software / OS</td><td>Windows 11 / 10 (64-bit, v1809 or later)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/QZBi0suAFPmOMLR5ikLzkKnRjwC0qHfcwWSzma9A.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 05:09:32', '2026-07-13 05:09:32', 'Meta Title: ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5080 SOLID CORE 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'Meta Description: Buy the ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5080 SOLID CORE 16GB GDDR7 graphics card. Features NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, 10,752 CUDA cores, DLSS 4 AI, and IceStorm 3.0 cooling.', NULL, NULL, 141, NU