(1384, 'ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5080 SOLID 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card', 'Dominate next-generation 4K gaming and intensive AI workloads with the ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5080 SOLID 16GB GDDR7. Driven by NVIDIA\'s groundbreaking Blackwell architecture, this enthusiast-class graphics card features a monumental 10,752 CUDA cores and 16GB of ultra-fast next-gen GDDR7 memory over a wide 256-bit bus. Outfitted with an industrial-grade IceStorm 3.0 cooling engine featuring a massive direct-contact vapor chamber and an ultra-rigid metal mid-frame, it delivers premium, tank-like structural durability and elite thermal performance. Complete with native support for AI-driven DLSS 4 Multi Frame Generation, it offers unprecedented high-refresh-rate desktop gaming power.', 'zotac-gaming-geforce-rtx-5080-solid-16gb-gddr7-graphics-card-1783919479', '<p>Crush hardware-demanding AAA titles, heavy 3D rendering workflows, and local AI model generation with the structurally fortified <strong>ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5080 SOLID 16GB GDDR7 Graphics Card</strong>. Architected around the bleeding-edge <strong>NVIDIA Blackwell platform</strong>, this powerhouse boasts a heavy-duty configuration of <strong>10,752 CUDA cores</strong> running at a factory boost clock of 2617 MHz. The true performance pillar is its <strong>16GB of next-gen GDDR7 VRAM</strong> pushing an effective memory bandwidth speed of 30 Gbps on a 256-bit interface. This massive memory evolution completelyThe SOLID lineup is built tough with severe structural enhancements to manage heavy long-term thermal loads. True to its name, it integrates a comprehensive <strong>reinforced metal mid-frame</strong> paired with a massive direct-contact <strong>vapor chamber</strong> plate and a metal die-cast backplate, giving the card unmatched rigidity. This foundational core pulls heat straight into a dense heatsink fin array, where high-airflow <strong>BladeLink fans</strong> rapidly disperse it. The implementation of <strong>FREEZE Fan Stop</strong> and Active Fan Control ensure the system drops into absolute acoustic silence during low-load operations, while a physical <strong>Dual BIOS</strong> switch lets you easily toggle between Performance and Quiet modes.</p><p>Future-proofed for the next generation of visual computing, the card natively runs <strong>DLSS 4 Multi Frame Generation</strong>, multiplying frame rates beyond traditional physical rasterization limits by using AI to generate multiple sub-frames with crisp image clarity. Complete with customizable <strong>SPECTRA RGB lighting</strong>, a built-in <strong>12V-2x6 Safety Light indicator</strong> that warns you if your power cable isn\'t fully seated, and ultra-high-bandwidth DisplayPort 2.1b connections, the RTX 5080 SOLID is engineered for pure enthusiast performance.</p><h2>Technical Specificationsflattens complex asset-loading bottlenecks, allowing for real-time handling of ultra-dense textures, massive simulation rendering, and seamless multitasking.&nbsp;</h2>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>10,752</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Engine Clock (Boost)</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>2617 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Video Memory Capacity</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>256-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>30 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Protocol</strong></td><td>Connectivity</td><td>PCI Express 5.0 x16</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Connectors</strong></td><td>Connectivit