(1386, 'ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5090 SOLID OC White Edition 32GB GDDR7 Graphics Card iosbd', 'Dominate the absolute pinnacle of visual computing, extreme 8K gaming, and heavy local AI development with the ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5090 SOLID OC White Edition 32GB GDDR7. Draped in a striking, pristine all-white finish with tactile premium textures, this ultimate flagship GPU is powered by NVIDIA\'s revolutionary Blackwell architecture. It boasts a monumental 21,760 CUDA cores, a factory-overclocked boost clock of 2422 MHz, and a massive 32GB of next-gen GDDR7 memory across an ultra-wide 512-bit bus. Outfitted with the elite IceStorm 3.0 thermal engine—featuring a 34% larger vapor chamber—and full support for AI-driven DLSS 4 Multi Frame Generation, it seamlessly blends flawless, elite-tier performance with clean, high-end aesthetics.', 'zotac-gaming-geforce-rtx-5090-solid-oc-white-edition-32gb-gddr7-graphics-card-iosbd-1784210126', '<p>Dominate the absolute pinnacle of visual computing, extreme 8K gaming, and heavy local AI development with the <strong>ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5090 SOLID OC White Edition 32GB GDDR7</strong>. Draped in a striking, pristine all-white finish with tactile premium textures, this ultimate flagship GPU is powered by NVIDIA\'s revolutionary <strong>Blackwell architecture</strong>. It boasts a monumental 21,760 CUDA cores, a factory-overclocked boost clock of 2422 MHz, and a massive 32GB of next-gen GDDR7 memory across an ultra-wide 512-bit bus. Outfitted with the elite <strong>IceStorm 3.0 thermal engine</strong>—featuring a 34% larger vapor chamber—and full support for AI-driven <strong>DLSS 4 Multi Frame Generation</strong>, it seamlessly blends flawless, elite-tier performance with clean, high-enddesigned for premium, snow-white minimalist themes, this card fuses state-of-the-art tech with defining surface tactility that you can both see and feel. It is architected around the flagship <strong>NVIDIA Blackwell platform</strong>, driving an unparalleled <strong>21,760 CUDA cores</strong> with a factory-boosted engine clock of <strong>2422 MHz</strong>. Backed by a historic <strong>32GB of next-generation GDDR7 VRAM</strong> operating on a massive <strong>512-bit memory interface</strong>, it unleashes a staggering 1.79 TB/s of raw memory bandwidth. This extreme powerhouse entirely eliminates asset bottlenecks, smoothly running complex generative AI language models, massive 3D cinematic rendering grids, and fully path-traced ray tracing workloads at native 4K and 8K resolutions.</p><p>The SOLID OC White Edition is fortified from the inside out to handle its immense 575W power profile. It features an integrated <strong>reinforced aluminum mid-frame</strong> coupled with a giant, direct-contact <strong>vapor chamber</strong> plate that is 34% larger than previous generations. This cooling core moves heat directly into a heavy-duty heatsink array, where three specialized high-airflow <strong>BladeLink fans</strong> rapidly push it away. With <strong>FREEZE Fan Stop</strong> and Active Fan Control 2.0, the fans turn completely off during low-load tasks for silent operation, while a physical <strong>Dual BIOS</strong> switch allows you to easily alternate between high-velocity performance and quiet acoustics.</p><p>Engineered for the next generation of neural processing, the card natively runs <strong>DLSS 4 Multi Frame Generation</strong> alongside 5th Gen Tensor Cores and 4th Gen Ray Tracing Cores, multiplying frame rates past traditional physical limits while maintaining immaculate image sha aesthetics.&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>GPU Architecture</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>NVIDIA Blackwell (GB202-300-A1)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CUDA Cores</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>21,760</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Engine Clock (Boost)</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>2422 MHz (Factory Overclocked)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Video Memory Capacity</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>32GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>GDDR7</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Bus Width</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>512-bit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory Clock Speed</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>28 Gbps (Effective)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Raw Memory Bandwidth</strong></td><td>Video Memory</td><td>1.79 TB/s</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Protocol</strong></td><td>Connectivity</td><td>PCI Express 5.0 x16</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Display Connectors</strong></td><td>Connectivity</td><td>3 x DisplayPort 2.1b (UHBR20), 1 x HDMI 2.1b</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Multi-Display Output</strong></td><td>Connectivity</td><td>Quad Display (Up to 4 monitors simultaneously)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Max Digital Resolution</strong></td><td>Connectivity</td><td>7680 x 4320 (8K @ 165Hz / 4K @ 480Hz with DSC)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Engine</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>IceStorm 3.0 with 34% Larger Vapor Chamber</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Structural Integrity</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Reinforced Aluminum Mid-Frame &amp; Metal Backplate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fan &amp; Profile Controls</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>BladeLink Fans / FREEZE Fan Stop / Dual BIOS Switch</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor / Dimensions</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>329.7mm x 137.8mm x 67.8mm (3.5-Slot Design)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Body &amp; Theme Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Premium Textured All-White Shroud &amp; Metal Plate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetic Lighting</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>SPECTRA 2.0 RGB Lighting with SPECTRA LINK Sync Port</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Consumption (TDP)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>575W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recommended System PSU</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1000W</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Input Interface</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1 x 12V-2x6 (16-Pin) with Safety LED Indicator</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API Framework Support</strong></td><td>Software / OS</td><td>Microsoft DirectX 12 Ultimate, OpenGL 4.6, Vulkan 1.4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Supported Operating System</strong></td><td>Software / OS</td><td>Windows 11 / 10 (64-bit, v1809 or later)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Graphics Card', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/IvFJFmG2kSL4SP3KQn3tICAMQKPMGUelzkWcjPRR.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 05:37:20', '2026-07-16 14:00:39', 'Meta Title: ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5090 SOLID OC White Edition 32GB GDDR7', 'Meta Description: Buy ZOTAC GAMING GeForce RTX 5090 SOLID OC White Edition 32GB GDDR7 graphics card. Built on NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, featuring 21,760 CUDA cores and IceStorm 3.0.', 'Target Keywords: Zotac RTX 5090 Solid OC White, Zotac Gaming 5090 White Edition, 32GB GDDR7 graphics card, NVIDIA Blackwell flagship GPU, RTX 5090 White price, DLSS 4 gaming card, IceStorm 3.0 white GPU.', NULL, 141, NULL, NULL),
(1387, 'Colorful Battle-AX DDR4 8GB 3200MHz Desktop RAM', 'Upgrade your system’s responsiveness with the Colorful Battle-AX DDR4 8GB 3200MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered for gamers, office professionals, and casual creators, this high-performance U-DIMM module delivers a fast 3200MHz clock speed to cut through system lag and shorten application load times. Equipped with an integrated, stylish metal heatsink for superior thermal dissipation and operating at an energy-efficient 1.35V, it guarantees rock-solid stability during extended multitasking and gaming marathons.', 'colorful-battle-ax-ddr4-8gb-3200mhz-desktop-ram-1783921422', '<p>Breathe new life into your PC configuration with the <strong>Colorful Battle-AX DDR4 8GB 3200MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Specifically developed to eliminate performance bottlenecks during high-load computing tasks, this module offers an 8GB capacity built on mature, highly reliable DDR4 architecture. Running at a fast 3200MHz frequency, it accelerates data transfer speeds across the motherboard, providing a noticeable jump in system responsiveness, fluid browser navigation, and smoother frame pacing in mainstream gaming titles.</p><p>The Battle-AX lineup prioritizes long-term operational health and component safety. The module features an industrial, low-profile metal heat spreader designed to rapidly wick away heat from the memory ICs, keeping temperatures stable even under sustained workloads. Operating at a balanced 1.35V, it delivers top-tier performance while minimizing power consumption and heat output.</p><p>Built with high compatibility in mind, this standard U-DIMM form factor seamlessly integrates into both modern Intel and AMD desktop motherboards. It supports Intel XMP profiles for hassle-free installation and instant speed configuration right out of the box. Whether you are building a budget-friendly gaming rig, a reliable office workstation, or adding a secondary module for dual-channel memory performance, the Colorful Battle-AX brings a perfect blend of performance, style, and long-term durability backed by a lifetime warranty.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Type</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Desktop)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>3200 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL16-18-18-38 / CL18-20-20-40 (Batch Dependent)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Aluminum Alloy Heat Spreader (Heatsink)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Options</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Classic Black, Pure White, or Sport Blue</td></tr><tr><td><strong>RGB Lighting</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Minimalist Design</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel &amp; AMD DDR4 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Profile Support</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP (Extreme Memory Profile)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pins</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Temperature</strong></td><td>Environmental</td><td>0°C to 85°C</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Duration</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 6700.00, 6700.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/lIncBbCG2l5VpybMo2ODbGAJuH5S3pR0kwiuB9Kx.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 05:43:42', '2026-07-13 05:43:57', 'Meta Title: Colorful Battle-AX DDR4 8GB 3200MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Colorful Battle-AX DDR4 8GB 3200MHz desktop RAM. Features a low-profile heatsink, high-speed multitasking stability, and energy-efficient 1.35V operation.', 'Target Keywords: Colorful Battle-AX DDR4, 8GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM, Colorful desktop memory, budget gaming RAM 8GB, DDR4 U-DIMM 3200MHz, PC memory upgrade kit.', NULL, 140, NULL, NULL),
(1388, 'Colorful Battle-AX DDR4 8GB 3200MHz Desktop RAM White', 'Bring a clean, striking aesthetic and reliable responsiveness to your system with the Colorful Battle-AX DDR4 8GB 3200MHz Desktop RAM White. Specially styled with a pristine white alloy heatsink, this high-performance U-DIMM module delivers a fast 3200MHz clock speed to eliminate system stutter and shorten load times. Operating efficiently at 1.35V with low latency, it guarantees rock-solid stability during long gaming sessions or intense daily multitasking. It is the perfect upgrade for clean, minimalist, or snow-white themed PC builds.', 'colorful-battle-ax-ddr4-8gb-3200mhz-desktop-ram-white-1783921521', '<p>Perfect your custom system design while boosting baseline performance with the <strong>Colorful Battle-AX DDR4 8GB 3200MHz Desktop RAM White</strong>. Engineered to eliminate memory bottlenecks in modern desktop environments, this module offers an 8GB capacity built on reliable, highly compatible DDR4 architecture. Running at a high-speed 3200MHz frequency, it accelerates data transfer pathways between your CPU and motherboard, providing fluid browser navigation, snappy application switching, and stable frame pacing in modern gaming titles.</p><p>Skyland Computer BD+ 1</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The white-themed Battle-AX series heavily prioritizes structural build quality and thermal reliability. The module features an industrial, low-profile white metal heat spreader engineered to rapidly sweep heat away from the underlying memory ICs, maintaining safe temperatures under sustained workloads. Operating at a well-balanced 1.35V, it reduces aggregate power draw and localized thermal generation, directly contributing to long-term motherboard stability.</p><p>PQS+ 1</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Designed for broad compatibility, this standard U-DIMM form factor integrates effortlessly into modern Intel and AMD desktop systems. It supports Intel XMP profiles for seamless, automated speed optimization inside the BIOS right out of the box. Whether you are constructing a budget-conscious gaming rig, a clean office workstation, or pairing it with a matching module for high-bandwidth dual-channel performance, the Colorful Battle-AX White offers an exceptional combination of speed, reliable engineering, and minimalist style.</p><p>PCB Store</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Technical Specifications</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>8GB (Single Module)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>3200 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL16-18-18-38 / CL22-22-22-52 (Batch Dependent)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Solution</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Aluminum Alloy Heat Spreader (Heatsink)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Scheme</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Premium Textured White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Minimalist Profile</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Fully compatible with Intel &amp; AMD DDR4 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Profile Configurations</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Configuration</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Temperature</strong></td><td>Environmental</td><td>0°C to 85°C</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Lifetime Product Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/eylLUDUswY9O7OVq3CuFtgR93DFX8Xllssrb4WtU.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 05:45:21', '2026-07-13 05:45:21', 'Meta Title: Colorful Battle-AX DDR4 8GB 3200MHz Desktop RAM - White Edition', 'Meta Description: Buy the Colorful Battle-AX DDR4 8GB 3200MHz desktop RAM in White. Features a premium white aluminum alloy heatsink, low-voltage stability, and XMP 2.0 support.', 'Target Keywords: Colorful Battle-AX DDR4 White, 8GB DDR4 3200MHz white RAM, Colorful white desktop memory, budget white gaming RAM, DDR4 U-DIMM 3200MHz white, white PC build memory.', NULL, 140, NULL, NULL),
(1389, 'Colorful CVN Guardian 8GB DDR4 3200MHz RGB Desktop RAM', 'Elevate your PC\'s gaming aesthetic and computing agility with the Colorful CVN Guardian 8GB DDR4 3200MHz RGB Desktop RAM. Engineered with high-quality, hand-selected memory ICs, this high-performance U-DIMM module runs at a swift 3200MHz frequency to smooth out gaming frame rates and boost multitasking responsiveness. Wrapped in a futuristic, laser-carved gray aluminum heat spreader and boasting vibrant, fully customizable RGB bars that support 5 major motherboard sync systems, it brings the perfect blend of extreme reliability, thermal efficiency, and dazzling style to your desktop.', 'colorful-cvn-guardian-8gb-ddr4-3200mhz-rgb-desktop-ram-1783921596', '<p>Infuse raw performance and dynamic lighting into your desktop rig with the <strong>Colorful CVN Guardian 8GB DDR4 3200MHz RGB Desktop RAM</strong>. Designed to fulfill the high-bandwidth requirements of modern PC enthusiasts and competitive gamers, this module offers an 8GB capacity built on highly optimized DDR4 architecture. Driving data at a high-speed 3200MHz frequency with a tight latency profile of <strong>CL16-18-18-38</strong>, it maximizes system throughput, drastically lowering application load delays and cutting out background stutter during intense processing loads.</p><p>The flagship CVN Guardian lineup is built around selected high-tier Hynix CJR memory modules, guaranteeing excellent signal stability and superior overclocking headroom. Thermals are easily reined in by a premium, custom-brushed gray aluminum alloy heat spreader. This structural heatsink rapidly pulls heat away from the multi-layer PCB, preserving system stability under sustained, day-long stress. Operating at an energy-conscious 1.35V, it strikes an ideal sweet spot between raw hardware output and safe, energy-efficient operations.</p><p>The defining highlight of the CVN Guardian is its beautifully integrated, diffused lightbar at the top. The module supports seamless <strong>RGB Sync integration across 5 major motherboard ecosystems</strong> (including ASUS Aura Sync, GIGABYTE RGB Fusion, MSI Mystic Light, and ASRock Polychrome Sync), letting you paint your setup in fluid, customized colors. Ready out of the box with Intel XMP profiles for automated one-click optimization, it serves as an excellent upgrade for your standalone rig or as a dual-channel addition to build a bulle</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>8GB (Single Channel Module)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>3200 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL16-18-18-38</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Memory IC Sorting</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>Premium Selected Chips (Hynix CJR / Micron E-Die equivalent)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Futuristic Aluminum Alloy Heat Spreader (Heatsink)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Aesthetics</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Premium Brushed Metallic Grey / Silver</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Top-Mounted Diffused RGB Lightbar</td></tr><tr><td><strong>RGB Compatibility</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Supports 5 Major Brands Motherboard RGB Sync</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel &amp; AMD DDR4 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Profile Configurations</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Temperature</strong></td><td>Environmental</td><td>0°C to 85°C</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/M2WItoHyLFT3GbDRehpttid4O4HqFqzn3PewjLCU.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 05:46:36', '2026-07-13 05:46:36', 'Meta Title: Colorful CVN Guardian 8GB DDR4 3200MHz RGB Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Colorful CVN Guardian 8GB DDR4 3200MHz RGB Desktop RAM. Features a futuristic laser-engraved aluminum heatsink, low-latency CL16 performance, and full 5-brand RGB sync.', 'Target Keywords: Colorful CVN Guardian DDR4, 8GB DDR4 3200MHz RGB RAM, Colorful CVN memory, gaming RGB RAM 8GB, DDR4 U-DIMM 3200MHz RGB, CVN Guardian Hynix CJR memory.', NULL, 140, NULL, NULL),
(1390, 'Colorful Battle-AX 8GB DDR4 3200MHz U-DIMM Desktop RAM', 'Breathe responsive speed into your setup with the Colorful Battle-AX 8GB DDR4 3200MHz U-DIMM Desktop RAM. Specifically engineered for competitive gaming, fast office multitasking, and general daily workloads, this high-performance desktop memory module operates at a swift 3200MHz frequency to cut down application latency. Wrapped in a rugged, low-profile aluminum heat spreader for optimized heat dissipation and running at a balanced 1.35V, it delivers continuous stability and broad compatibility across modern systems.', 'colorful-battle-ax-8gb-ddr4-3200mhz-u-dimm-desktop-ram-1783921644', '<h3>Long Description</h3><p>Eliminate frustrating system lag and expand your desktop\'s capabilities with the <strong>Colorful Battle-AX 8GB DDR4 3200MHz U-DIMM Desktop RAM</strong>. Designed to deliver high-bandwidth data transfers, this 8GB module is built on mature, rock-solid DDR4 architecture. Running at a high-speed 3200MHz frequency, it accelerates communications between your CPU and motherboard, providing fluid browser navigation, faster application startup times, and smoother frame pacing during intensive gaming marathons.</p><p>The Battle-AX lineup places a heavy emphasis on thermal management and hardware health. The module comes equipped with an industrial-grade, low-profile alloy heat spreader that quickly draws heat away from the underlying memory ICs, ensuring stable operations even under multi-hour processing stress. Operating at a power-saving 1.35V, it successfully minimizes localized thermal output while reducing overall power usage.</p><p>Featuring a universal 288-pin U-DIMM form factor, this RAM module fits seamlessly onto modern Intel and AMD DDR4 motherboards without creating physical clearance issues with large CPU coolers. It supports automated Intel XMP profiles for instant, hassle-free configuration inside the BIOS right out of the box. Whether you are assembling a budget-friendly gaming ri