(1391, 'Colorful Battle-AX 8GB DDR4 3200MHz U-DIMM Desktop RAM White', 'Bring a clean, striking aesthetic and reliable responsiveness to your system with the Colorful Battle-AX 8GB DDR4 3200MHz U-DIMM Desktop RAM White. Specially styled with a pristine white alloy heatsink, this high-performance desktop module delivers a fast 3200MHz clock speed to eliminate system stutter and shorten application load times. Operating efficiently at a low voltage with tight CL16 latency, it guarantees rock-solid stability during long gaming sessions or intense daily multitasking. It is the perfect plug-and-play upgrade for clean, minimalist, or snow-white themed PC builds.', 'colorful-battle-ax-8gb-ddr4-3200mhz-u-dimm-desktop-ram-white-1783921699', '<p>Perfect your custom system design while boosting baseline performance with the <strong>Colorful Battle-AX 8GB DDR4 3200MHz U-DIMM Desktop RAM White</strong>. Engineered to eliminate memory bottlenecks in modern desktop environments, this module offers an 8GB capacity built on reliable, highly compatible DDR4 architecture. Running at a high-speed 3200MHz frequency, it accelerates data transfer pathways between your CPU and motherboard, providing fluid browser navigation, snappy application switching, and stable frame pacing in modern gaming titles.</p><p>The white-themed Battle-AX series heavily prioritizes structural build quality and thermal reliability. The module features an industrial, low-profile white metal heat spreader engineered to rapidly sweep heat away from the underlying memory ICs, maintaining safe temperatures under sustained workloads. Operating efficiently at a well-balanced 1.35V, it reduces aggregate power draw and localized thermal generation, directly contributing to long-term motherboard stability.</p><p>Designed for broad compatibility, this standard 288-pin U-DIMM form factor integrates effortlessly into modern Intel and AMD desktop systems without causing clearance issues with large CPU coolers. It supports au