lessly into modern Intel and AMD desktop systems without causing clearance issues with large CPU air coolers or liquid cooling blocks. It supports automated Intel XMP profiles for seamless, automated speed optimization inside the BIOS right out of the box. Whether you are constructing a budget-conscious gaming rig, a clean office workstation, or pairing it with a matching module for high-bandwidth dual-channel performance</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (Single Module)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>3200 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL16-18-18-38</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Solution</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Aluminum Alloy Heat Spreader (Heatsink)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Scheme</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Premium Pure White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Minimalist Profile</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel &amp; AMD DDR4 Desktop Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Profile Configurations</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Configuration</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Temperature</strong></td><td>Environmental</td><td>0°C to 85°C</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><t