(1394, 'Colorful Battle-AX Redline 16GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM', 'Step into next-generation computing speeds with the Colorful Battle-AX Redline 16GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered specifically for hardcore gamers, content creators, and overclocking enthusiasts, this premium DDR5 U-DIMM module delivers a blistering 6000MHz frequency paired with an ultra-low CL30 latency profile. Wrapped in an aggressively styled, precision-forged white and red heat spreader, it features an on-die PMIC and ECC architecture for elite power efficiency and system stability under severe, high-bandwidth workloads.', 'colorful-battle-ax-redline-16gb-ddr5-6000mhz-desktop-ram-1783921938', '<p>Unleash the maximum potential of your next-gen Intel or AMD platform with the <strong>Colorful Battle-AX Redline 16GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Built on highly advanced DDR5 memory architecture, this single 16GB module provides a massive leap forward in memory bandwidth and structural data handling compared to legacy DDR4 standards. Running at a high-speed 6000MHz frequency with a tight <strong>CL30 latency</strong>, it radically reduces data access delays—delivering instantaneous app launching, fluid frame pacing in AAA gaming titles, and swift video processing times.</p><p>The Battle-AX Redline series stands out with its meticulously engineered thermal and mechanical design. The module is encased in a premium, precision-forged aluminum alloy heat spreader sporting a striking, angular white shroud accented by a bold red accent line. Under the hood, an integrated <strong>PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong> gives the module direct control over its own voltage management at a stable 1.35V, while an industrial-grade <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> mechanism actively resolves bit errors in real-time to preserve pure data integrity.</p><p>Designed to eliminate installation complexity, this 288-pin desktop memory module features native, single-click overclocking support for both <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> and <strong>AMD EXPO</strong> ecosystems. Whether you are assembling a pristine, high-end white gaming rig or expanding a heavy-duty workstation to run demanding multi-threaded operations, the Colorful Battle-AX Redline brings an unbeatable combination of blistering speed, advanced hardware stability, and distinct DIY aesthetic appeal.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (Single Channel Module)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>6000 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL30 (CL30-36-36 / Batch Dependent)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>Integrated PMIC (Power Management IC)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Precision-Forged Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Scheme</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Premium White with Aggressive Red Line Accents</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Sleek Angular Profile</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 &amp; AMD EXPO Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel &amp; AMD DDR5 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/rpQ5K9bF8rIunN2nn9xECMowW86VQniarxJUefhx.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 05:52:18', '2026-07-13 05:52:18', 'Meta Title: Colorful Battle-AX Redline 16GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Colorful Battle-AX Redline 16GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM. Features a forged white/red heatsink, ultra-low CL30 latency, and Intel XMP 3.0 & AMD EXPO support.', 'Target Keywords: Colorful Battle-AX Redline DDR5, 16GB DDR5 6000MHz RAM, Colorful Redline desktop memory, low latency CL30 DDR5, high-speed gaming RAM 16GB, Intel XMP 3.0 AMD EXPO RAM.', NULL, 140, NULL, NULL),
(1395, 'Colorful Battle-AX 16GB DDR4 3200MHz U-DIMM Desktop RAM', 'Elevate your PC\'s multitasking capacity and smooth out heavy application workloads with the Colorful Battle-AX 16GB DDR4 3200MHz U-DIMM Desktop RAM. Engineered for demanding modern gaming, high-definition content creation, and intensive daily business operations, this high-capacity 16GB single module operates at a fast 3200MHz frequency with a tight CL16-18-18-38 latency profile. Housed inside a rugged, low-profile aluminum alloy heat spreader that ensures excellent thermal dissipation, it delivers continuous stability and power efficiency at a low 1.35V.', 'colorful-battle-ax-16gb-ddr4-3200mhz-u-dimm-desktop-ram-1783922018', '<p>with the <strong>Colorful Battle-AX 16GB DDR4 3200MHz U-DIMM Desktop RAM</strong>. Purpose-built to handle high-bandwidth computing demands, this generous 16GB single module is engineered using mature, strictly validated DDR4 architecture. Running at a high-speed 3200MHz frequency paired with optimized timings, it rapidly moves data between the processor and storage drives, significantly lowering system load delays, preventing background stutters, and ensuring fluid frame pacing in AAA gaming titles.</p><p>The Battle-AX lineup places hardware longevity and structural endurance at the center of its design. The module comes protected by an industrial, low-profile alloy heat spreader that quickly draws thermal energy away from the underlying high-grade memory ICs. This maintains safe, stable working temperatures during prolonged gaming sessions or intensive video rendering tasks. Operating at an energy-conscious 1.35V, it strikes an ideal sweet spot by maximizing system data throughput while keeping localized power consumption and heat generation to a minimum.</p><p>Featuring a universal 288-pin U-DIMM form factor, this module seamlessly fits into modern Intel and AMD DDR4 motherboards without creating physical clearance conflicts with large aftermarket air coolers or liquid cooling loops. It fully supports automated Intel XMP profiles, allowing for instant, trouble-free configuration to its maximum rated speed inside the BIOS with a single click. Whether you are upgrading an existing workstation, assembling a streamlined budget gaming build, or pairing it with an identical module for high-bandwidth dual-channel performance, the Colorful Battle-AX offers an exceptional blend of speed, physical durability, and understated style.</p><h2>Technical Specifications</h2>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (Single Channel Module)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>3200 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL16-18-18-38 (Batch can vary to CL18-20-20-40)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Aluminum Alloy Heat Spreader (Heatsink)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Options</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Classic Black / Sports Blue / Pure White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Minimalist Profile</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel &amp; AMD DDR4 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Profile Configurations</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Temperature</strong></td><td>Environmental</td><td>0°C to 85°C</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 05:53:38', '2026-07-13 05:53:38', 'Meta Title: Colorful Battle-AX 16GB DDR4 3200MHz U-DIMM Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Colorful Battle-AX 16GB DDR4 3200MHz U-DIMM desktop RAM. Features a low-profile armor heatsink, tight CL16 latency, and stable 1.35V operation.', 'Target Keywords: Colorful Battle-AX DDR4 16GB, 16GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM, Colorful U-DIMM desktop memory, high-capacity gaming RAM, 3200MHz PC memory upgrade, non-RGB desktop RAM heatsink.', NULL, 140, NULL, NULL);
