(1396, 'Colorful Battle-AX 16GB DDR4 3200MHz U-DIMM Desktop RAM White', 'Bring a clean, striking aesthetic and expansive multitasking power to your system with the Colorful Battle-AX 16GB DDR4 3200MHz U-DIMM Desktop RAM White. Specially styled with a pristine white alloy heatsink, this high-capacity 16GB single module operates at a fast 3200MHz frequency to eliminate system stutter and shorten application load times. Operating efficiently at a low voltage with a tight CL16 latency profile, it guarantees rock-solid stability during long gaming sessions or intense production workloads. It is the perfect plug-and-play upgrade for clean, minimalist, or snow-white themed PC builds.', 'colorful-battle-ax-16gb-ddr4-3200mhz-u-dimm-desktop-ram-white-1783922113', '<p>Perfect your custom system design while boosting baseline performance with the <strong>Colorful Battle-AX 16GB DDR4 3200MHz U-DIMM Desktop RAM White</strong>. Engineered to eliminate memory-bound bottlenecks in modern desktop environments, this generous 16GB single module is built on highly reliable, strictly validated DDR4 architecture. Running at a high-speed 3200MHz frequency paired with optimized <strong>CL16-18-18-38 timings</strong>, it accelerates data transfer pathways between your CPU and motherboard, providing fluid browser navigation, snappy application switching, and stable frame pacing in demanding modern gaming titles.</p><p>The white-themed Battle-AX series heavily prioritizes structural build quality and thermal reliability. The module features an industrial, low-profile white metal heat spreader engineered to rapidly sweep heat away from the underlying high-grade memory ICs, maintaining safe temperatures under sustained workloads. Operating efficiently at a well-balanced 1.35V, it reduces aggregate power draw and localized thermal generation, directly contributing to long-term motherboard stability.</p><p>Designed for broad compatibility, this standard 288-pin U-DIMM form factor integrates effortlessly into modern Intel and AMD desktop systems without causing clearance issues with large CPU air coolers or liquid cooling blocks. It supports automated Intel XMP profiles for seamless, automated speed optimization inside the BIOS right out of the box. Whether you are constructing a budget-conscious gaming rig, a clean office workstation, or pairing it with a matching module for high-bandwidth dual-channel performance, the Colorful Battle-AX White offers an exceptional combination of speed, reliable engineering, and minimalist style.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (Single Module)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>3200 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL16-18-18-38 (Batch can vary to CL18-20-20-40)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Solution</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Aluminum Alloy Heat Spreader (Heatsink)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Scheme</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Premium Pure White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Minimalist Profile</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel &amp; AMD DDR4 Desktop Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Profile Configurations</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Configuration</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Temperature</strong></td><td>Environmental</td><td>0°C to 85°C</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Lifetime Product Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/KRduyAx5hkJS2wLdHBe1sOC83nHhiu38ZUQXYm6h.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 05:55:13', '2026-07-13 05:55:13', 'Meta Title: Colorful Battle-AX 16GB DDR4 3200MHz U-DIMM Desktop RAM - White', 'Meta Description: Buy the Colorful Battle-AX 16GB DDR4 3200MHz U-DIMM desktop RAM in White. Features a premium white alloy heatsink, low-latency CL16 performance, and XMP 2.0 stability.', 'Target Keywords: Colorful Battle-AX DDR4 White, 16GB DDR4 3200MHz white RAM, Colorful white U-DIMM desktop memory, high-capacity white gaming RAM, white PC build memory, non-RGB desktop RAM.', NULL, 140, NULL, NULL),
(1397, 'Corsair Vengeance LPX 8GB 3200MHz DDR4 Desktop RAM', 'Maximize your PC\'s responsiveness and stability with the world-renowned Corsair Vengeance LPX 8GB 3200MHz DDR4 Desktop RAM. Purpose-built for high-performance computing, this 8GB U-DIMM module features a low-profile pure aluminum heat spreader engineered for exceptional heat dissipation and broad case compatibility. Operating at a fast 3200MHz with an optimized CL16 latency profile, it delivers reliable data processing speeds and seamless Intel XMP 2.0 automated overclocking for gamers, content creators, and everyday system builders.', 'corsair-vengeance-lpx-8gb-3200mhz-ddr4-desktop-ram-1783922205', '<p>Breathe elite-tier reliability into your custom PC build with the <strong>Corsair Vengeance LPX 8GB 3200MHz DDR4 Desktop RAM</strong>. Designed from the ground up for high-performance enthusiast configurations, this module is built using a custom performance eight-layer PCB and strictly hand-screened memory ICs. Running at a high-speed 3200MHz frequency with a tight <strong>CL16-20-20-38 timing profile</strong>, it eliminates micro-stutters during intensive data loops, shortens system boot times, and stabilizes frame delivery across demanding AAA gaming titles.</p><p>The distinguishing hallmark of the Vengeance LPX lineup is its signature <strong>low-profile thermal design</strong>. Standing at just 34mm tall, its pure aluminum heat spreader rapidly draws thermal buildup away from the memory chips and directly into your chassis\'s airflow system. This ultra-compact footprint completely eliminates physical clearance conflicts, fitting effortlessly underneath massive dual-fan CPU tower coolers or inside tight Small Form Factor (SFF) Mini-ITX systems.</p><p>Built for complete convenience, the module fully supports <strong>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile)</strong> framework. Instead of wrestling with manual voltage adjustments in the BIOS, a single click automatically locks the RAM into its safest, highest performance threshold at 1.35V. Rigorously tested across virtually all major Intel and AMD DDR4 motherboards, the Corsair Vengeance LPX is the definitive gold standard for rock-solid desktop memory upgrades.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>ture</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>8GB (Single Module)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>3200 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL16-20-20-38</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCB Engineering</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>Custom 8-Layer High-Performance PCB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Solution</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Anodized Pure Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>34 mm (Low-Profile Clearance)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Classic Matte Black</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Minimalist Style</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel &amp; AMD DDR4 Desktop Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Configuration</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Duration</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 7500.00, 7500.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/KctqMrzrZemd5htajnwOgsmQAlaCDJW4J58GNGqp.png', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 05:56:45', '2026-07-13 05:56:45', 'Meta Title: Corsair Vengeance LPX 8GB 3200MHz DDR4 Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair Vengeance LPX 8GB 3200MHz DDR4 desktop RAM. Features a low-profile aluminum heat spreader, CL16 latency, and Intel XMP 2.0 support.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance LPX DDR4, 8GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM, Corsair low profile RAM, Vengeance LPX 8GB black, budget gaming memory upgrade, 3200MHz U-DIMM desktop RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1398, 'Corsair Vengeance LPX 16GB DDR4 DRAM 3200MHz RAM', 'Expand your system\'s capabilities and eliminate multitasking bottlenecks with the industry-standard Corsair Vengeance LPX 16GB DDR4 DRAM 3200MHz RAM. Designed for high-performance enthusiast configurations, this high-capacity desktop module delivers a fast 3200MHz clock speed paired with a tight CL16 latency profile. Housed inside a signature low-profile pure aluminum heat spreader standing just 34mm tall, it guarantees broad clearance compatibility and exceptional thermal dissipation for gamers, content creators, and daily power users.', 'corsair-vengeance-lpx-16gb-ddr4-dram-3200mhz-ram-1783922294', '<h3>Long Description</h3><p>Unleash superior system responsiveness and smooth out heavy creative applications with the <strong>Corsair Vengeance LPX 16GB DDR4 DRAM 3200MHz RAM</strong>. Engineered from the ground up to handle high-bandwidth computing demands, this generous 16GB module is built using a custom high-performance eight-layer PCB and strictly hand-screened memory ICs. Running at a high-speed 3200MHz frequency with optimized <strong>CL16-20-20-38 timings</strong>, it dramatically accelerates data transfer channels, eliminating background stutter during intense processing loads and stabilizing frame pacing in modern AAA gaming titles.</p><p>The defining hallmark of the Vengeance LPX lineup is its signature <strong>low-profile thermal design</strong>. Standing at an ultra-compact 34mm height, its pure aluminum heat spreader rapidly wicks heat away from the underlying memory components and into your system’s active airflow path. This compact footprint completely prevents physical clearance conflicts, letting the card fit effortlessly underneath massive dual-fan CPU tower air coolers or inside tight small-form-factor (SFF) Mini-ITX chassis setups.</p><p>Built to simplify system building, this module fully supports the <strong>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile)</strong> framework. Instead of wrestling with manual voltage modifications in your BIOS, a single click automatically locks the RAM into its safest, highest performance threshold at a stable 1.35V. Rigorously tested across virtually all major modern Intel and AMD DDR4 motherboards, the Corsair Vengeance LPX 16GB module provides a bulletproof foundation for sustained system stability and raw computing speed.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (Single Module Configuration)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>3200 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL16-20-20-38</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCB Construction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>Custom 8-Layer High-Performance PCB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Anodized Pure Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height Profile</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>34 mm (Low-Profile Clearance)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Classic Matte Black</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Minimalist Design</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel &amp; AMD DDR4 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Configuration</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Duration</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 12999.00, 12999.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/xyG1jh1QNuYnGgAVy8Ne5GhQuyOhknaQ0roI8isW.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 05:58:14', '2026-07-13 05:58:14', 'Meta Title: Corsair Vengeance LPX 16GB DDR4 DRAM 3200MHz RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy Corsair Vengeance LPX 16GB DDR4 DRAM 3200MHz desktop memory. Features a low-profile aluminum heat spreader, tight CL16 latency, and Intel XMP 2.0.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance LPX 16GB, 16GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM, Corsair low profile 16GB DRAM, Vengeance LPX black desktop memory, high-capacity gaming RAM upgrade, 3200MHz U-DIMM RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
