(1400, 'Corsair VENGEANCE 8GB DDR5 5600MHz CL40 Desktop RAM', 'Step into the next generation of computing speeds with the Corsair VENGEANCE 8GB DDR5 5600MHz CL40 Desktop RAM. Purpose-built for cutting-edge Intel and AMD desktop platforms, this single 8GB DDR5 module delivers blazing-fast 5600MHz frequencies to maximize CPU processing efficiency and fluid system multitasking. Housed in a compact, low-profile solid aluminum heat spreader designed for universal case clearance, it utilizes built-in on-die voltage regulation and Intel XMP 3.0 support to guarantee reliable, rock-solid stability during intensive gaming or everyday workloads.', 'corsair-vengeance-8gb-ddr5-5600mhz-cl40-desktop-ram-1783922435', '<p>Unlock the architectural advantages of modern PC platforms with the <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE 8GB DDR5 5600MHz CL40 Desktop RAM</strong>. Specifically designed to process data faster than legacy memory generations, this high-performance DDR5 U-DIMM module runs at a massive <strong>5600MHz frequency</strong>. By delivering vastly expanded bandwidth to modern multi-core processors, it cuts down application loading times, prevents system bottlenecks, and provides smoother performance during content creation, mainstream gaming, and high-load multitasking.</p><p>The Corsair VENGEANCE series leverages advanced engineering to safeguard long-term system stability. Each module is built with strictly screened high-frequency memory chips and features <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> to detect and resolve digital bit errors in real-time. Power efficiency is tightly governed by an <strong>integrated PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong>, moving voltage control off the motherboard and directly onto the stick for precision delivery.</p><p>Thermally optimized for compact builds, the module is wrapped in a high-grade, low-profile solid aluminum heat spreader that draws away heat efficiently while offering excellent physical clearance underneath large CPU air coolers and liquid cooling radiators. With full <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> optimization, you can comfortably load customized performance profiles inside your BIOS with a single click. Combining sleek design, high-frequency bandwidth, and world-renowned build quality, this Corsair Vengeance DDR5 module is a flawless foundation for modern computing rigs.</p>', '<h2>Technical Specifications</h2><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>8GB (Single Module Configuration)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>5600 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL40-40-40-77</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction Tech</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.25V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>Integrated PMIC (Power Management IC)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Solid Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Profile Height</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Low-Profile Design (Universal Clearance)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Classic Matte Black</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Minimalist Style</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 (Extreme Memory Profile)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel &amp; AMD DDR5 Desktop Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Configuration</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Duration</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 18800.00, 18800.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/1bzBZgwMNs4UiK6TBnIVVHiJVOo6iNDqypex8uWf.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 06:00:35', '2026-07-13 06:00:35', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE 8GB DDR5 5600MHz CL40 Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy Corsair VENGEANCE 8GB DDR5 5600MHz CL40 desktop RAM. Features high-frequency speeds, low-profile solid aluminum heatsink, and Intel XMP 3.0 profile support.', 'vTarget Keywords: Corsair Vengeance DDR5 8GB, 8GB DDR5 5600MHz RAM, Corsair Vengeance 5600MHz CL40, budget DDR5 desktop memory, next-gen PC memory upgrade, non-RGB DDR5 U-DIMM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1401, 'Corsair VENGEANCE 8GB DDR5 5600MHz CL40 Desktop RAM', 'Step into the next generation of computing performance with the Corsair VENGEANCE 8GB DDR5 5600MHz CL40 Desktop RAM. Engineered for modern Intel and AMD platforms, this high-speed DDR5 module delivers blazing-fast data transfer rates to smooth out gaming frame rates and speed up daily multitasking. Wrapped in a clean, low-profile aluminum heat spreader and packed with cutting-edge features like an on-die PMIC and built-in Error-Correcting Code (ECC), it brings enthusiast-class stability and modern efficiency to your desktop configuration.', 'corsair-vengeance-8gb-ddr5-5600mhz-cl40-desktop-ram-1783927875', '<p>Unlock the high-frequency capabilities of modern PC architectures with the <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE 8GB DDR5 5600MHz CL40 Desktop RAM</strong>. Built on highly advanced DDR5 memory architecture, this single 8GB U-DIMM module provides a massive step forward in data processing speeds and bandwidth capacity compared to legacy DDR4 standards. Operating at a fast 5600MHz frequency with a CL40 latency profile, it significantly quickens communications between your processor and system storage—reducing application launch friction, optimizing gaming frame pacing, and smoothing out intensive system rendering tasks.</p><p>The Corsair VENGEANCE DDR5 lineup places heavy emphasis on structural data integrity and optimized power delivery. The module features an <strong>On-die PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong>, which shifts voltage regulation away from the motherboard and onto the RAM itself, ensuring a cleaner, more efficient 1.25V power supply. Additionally, its integrated <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> actively checks and resolves bit errors in real time to ensure uninterrupted system uptime during long gaming sessions or production workloads.</p><p>True to Corsair’s building legacy, the module is encased in a premium, compact solid aluminum heat spreader that draws heat rapidly away from the high-grade memory chips. Standing at a low profile, it prevents physical clearance conflicts with large dual-fan CPU air towers or complex liquid cooling loops. Supporting <strong>Intel XMP 3.0 profiles</strong> for hassle-free, single-click speed configuration inside the BIOS right out of the box, this non-RGB memory module offers an exceptional combination of next-gen speed, compact durability, and understated minimalist style.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>8GB (Single Module)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>5600 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL40-40-40-77</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.25V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Solid Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height Profile</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Low-Profile Broad Clearance Design</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Premium Matte Black</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Minimalist Finish</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel &amp; AMD DDR5 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/bJcL9HStJUGJNl8nTeZ2Rjg5qBtdZndiO6ySIqHe.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 07:31:15', '2026-07-13 07:31:15', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE 8GB DDR5 5600MHz CL40 Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy Corsair VENGEANCE 8GB DDR5 5600MHz CL40 desktop memory. Features next-gen DDR5 speeds, on-die ECC, and Intel XMP 3.0 support for rock-solid stability.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance DDR5 8GB, 8GB DDR5 5600MHz RAM, Corsair Vengeance CL40, next-gen DDR5 desktop memory, Corsair non-RGB DDR5 upgrade, 5600MHz PC memory.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1402, 'Corsair VENGEANCE 8GB DDR5 6000MHz CL36 Desktop RAM', 'Step into the fast lane of next-generation PC computing with the Corsair VENGEANCE 8GB DDR5 6000MHz CL36 Desktop RAM. Built for modern enthusiast hardware platforms, this ultra-fast DDR5 U-DIMM module delivers a blistering 6000MHz frequency optimized with a tight, low-latency CL36 profile. Packed with cutting-edge features including on-die PMIC voltage regulation and built-in Error-Correcting Code (ECC), it sits inside a clean, low-profile aluminum heat spreader to provide elite data throughput, thermal reliability, and minimalist style.', 'corsair-vengeance-8gb-ddr5-6000mhz-cl36-desktop-ram-1783927939', '<p>Unlock top-tier system responsiveness and future-proof your system architecture with the <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE 8GB DDR5 6000MHz CL36 Desktop RAM</strong>. Engineered specifically to extract the maximum capability from modern high-core-count processors, this single 8GB module offers a massive leap in data bandwidth compared to previous memory generations. Running at a high-speed 6000MHz frequency paired with a highly responsive <strong>CL36 latency timing configuration</strong>, it shortens heavy application processing times, smooths out internal game engine communication loops, and minimizes rendering slowdowns.</p><p>The Corsair VENGEANCE DDR5 family is built with an absolute emphasis on structural data security and optimized power distribution. It features an <strong>On-die PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong> that takes over voltage processing directly on the module rather than routing through older motherboard controls, producing an exceptionally stable 1.40V current supply. Alongside it, an integrated <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> system continuously monitors and resolves internal bit errors in real time, defending your computer against sudden lockups and crashes during crucial multitasking sessions.</p><p>True to Corsair’s high structural legacy, the module is wrapped in a sleek, premium solid aluminum heat spreader designed to sweep heat quickly away from the underlying memory ICs. Its compact, low-profile footprint ensures it installs easily without hitting large aftermarket dual-fan CPU air coolers or complex liquid radiator arrays. With complete <strong>Intel XMP 3.0 profile support</strong>, you can unlock automated, single-click rated speeds instantly inside your BIOS right out of the box.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>8GB (Single Module)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>6000 MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL36-44-44-96</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.40V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Solid Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height Profile</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Low-Profile Broad Clearance Design</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Premium Matte Black</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Minimalist Finish</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel &amp; AMD DDR5 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 18800.00, 18800.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/5wfSE9a9aGrJaBdDTVcRQkoiSBdyohTAiPS2lETP.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 07:32:19', '2026-07-13 07:32:19', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE 8GB DDR5 6000MHz CL36 Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE 8GB DDR5 6000MHz CL36 desktop memory. Features next-gen DDR5 speeds, tight CL36 latency, and Intel XMP 3.0 configuration.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance DDR5 8GB, 8GB DDR5 6000MHz RAM, Corsair Vengeance CL36, low-latency DDR5 8GB, Corsair non-RGB DDR5 upgrade, high-speed 6000MHz PC memory.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1403, 'Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL36 Desktop RAM', 'Unlock enthusiast-level responsiveness and eliminate data bottlenecks with the Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL36 Desktop RAM. Built on next-generation DDR5 memory architecture, this high-speed 16GB single module operates at a blistering 6000MHz frequency with an optimized, low-latency CL36 profile. Housed inside an ultra-compact, low-clearance solid aluminum heat spreader for maximum system compatibility, it features onboard PMIC voltage regulation and built-in Error-Correcting Code (ECC) to deliver rock-solid stability and flawless multitasking under demanding workloads.', 'corsair-vengeance-16gb-ddr5-6000mhz-cl36-desktop-ram-1783927997', '<p>Propel your custom desktop rig into the multi-core era with the high-performance <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL36 Desktop RAM</strong>. Engineered specifically to extract maximum performance from modern high-end Intel and AMD processors, this single 16GB U-DIMM module delivers a massive jump in data bandwidth and processing speeds compared to legacy standards. Operating at an ultra-fast 6000MHz frequency paired with sharp <strong>CL36-44-44-96 timings</strong>, it dramatically slashes file access delays—ensuring instantaneous application loading, fluid rendering workflows, and exceptionally stable frame pacing during heavy AAA gaming marathons.</p><p>The Corsair VENGEANCE DDR5 platform is heavily optimized for structural data security and precise power distribution. The module incorporates an <strong>On-board PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong>, which shifts voltage regulation away from older motherboard controls and onto the RAM itself, producing a cleaner, highly efficient 1.35V supply for superior overclocking stability. Alongside it, an integrated <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> mechanism actively monitors and corrects memory bit errors in real time, preventing unexpected system crashes when running complex local AI tasks or multi-layered production projects.</p><p>True to Corsair’s premium build legacy, the module features hand-sorted, tightly-screened memory chips mounted on a custom high-performance PCB. This entire array is encased in a low-profile, dual-tone solid aluminum heat spreader that draws heat away rapidly without adding physical bulk. With a compact form-factor design, it ensures effortless physical clearance under massive aftermarket dual-fan CPU tower coolers or tight liquid radiator setups. Supporting dual performance profiles for <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> and <strong>AMD EXPO</strong>, it lets you activate automated, single-click rated speeds instantly inside your BIOS right out of the box.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (Single Channel Module)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>6000 MHz (6000 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL36-44-44-96 (Batch dependent variant: CL36-36-36-76)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.1V / 4800MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated PMIC (Overclock PMIC)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height Profile</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Low-Profile Compact Clearance Design</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Premium Matte Black / Grey</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Minimalist Finish</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 &amp; AMD EXPO Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel &amp; AMD DDR5 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 26999.00, 26999.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/cRk92SMcOYBQYrmP9klMjql5sHkz5hDhL0Ej13Fj.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 07:33:17', '2026-07-13 07:33:17', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL36 Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL36 desktop memory. Features ultra-fast DDR5 architecture, compact aluminum heat spreader, and Intel XMP 3.0 & AMD EXPO support.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance DDR5 16GB, 16GB DDR5 6000MHz RAM, Corsair Vengeance CL36, 6000MT/s desktop memory, Corsair non-RGB DDR5 upgrade, high-speed PC memory.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1404, 'Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL36 Desktop RAM', 'Illuminate your system while conquering next-generation processing workloads with the Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL36 Desktop RAM. Built on cutting-edge DDR5 architecture, this premium 16GB single module runs at a high-speed 6000MHz frequency with a low-latency CL36 profile to maximize data throughput. It features a striking, individually addressable ten-zone dynamic RGB lightbar fully customizable via Corsair iCUE software. Encased in a solid aluminum heat spreader with onboard PMIC voltage regulation and built-in Error-Correcting Code (ECC), it perfectly marries dazzling visual design with flawless system stability.', 'corsair-vengeance-rgb-16gb-ddr5-6000mhz-cl36-desktop-ram-1783936797', '<p>Take full control of both your PC’s aesthetics and its processing capabilities with the <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL36 Desktop RAM</strong>. Specifically optimized to extract the absolute upper limits of performance from modern multi-core Intel and AMD desktop processors, this single 16GB U-DIMM module delivers elite data bandwidth. Running at a blistering 6000MHz frequency paired with sharp <strong>CL36 timings</strong>, it rapidly handles heavy operational asset queues, drastically lowering file access delays, cutting out application stutters, and smoothing out frame pacing in demanding modern gaming titles.</p><p>The defining visual highlight of the VENGEANCE RGB DDR5 is its top-mounted, panoramic lightbar. It houses a beautifully diffused <strong>ten-zone dynamic RGB lighting system</strong> that is individually addressable. Using the powerful Corsair iCUE software, you can design custom lighting effects, sync colors across your entire iCUE ecosystem, and create real-time, temperature-reactive lighting profiles. Underneath the lighting array sits a premium solid aluminum heat spreader that rapidly pulls thermal energy away from the hand-sorted memory ICs to prevent throttling during multi-hour workloads.</p><p>Engineered for the future of desktop computing, this module incorporates advanced hardware-level protections. An <strong>On-board PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong> handles voltage regulation directly on the PCB rather than relying on legacy motherboard channels, ensuring an incredibly efficient, stable 1.35V power flow during intense overclocking. Alongside it, an <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> engine continuously corrects internal data bit errors to prevent system crashes. Fully supporting both <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> and <strong>AMD EXPO</strong> ecosystems, you can unlock its full rated speeds instantly with a single click inside the BIOS.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (Single Channel Module)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>6000 MHz (6000 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL36-44-44-96</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Individually Addressable 10-Zone Dynamic RGB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Control</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Corsair iCUE Ecosystem Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 &amp; AMD EXPO Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel &amp; AMD DDR5 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 27500.00, 27500.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/Xr4Pq6zRTxGQ05ZwOzHnwJcJCFD25YyqVBQKCHgY.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 09:59:57', '2026-07-13 09:59:57', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL36 Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL36 desktop memory. Features ten-zone dynamic RGB lighting, tight CL36 latency, and Intel XMP 3.0 & AMD EXPO profiles.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance RGB DDR5 16GB, 16GB DDR5 6000MHz RGB RAM, Corsair Vengeance RGB CL36, dynamic ten-zone RGB memory, 6000MT/s desktop RAM, high-performance gaming memory.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL);
