(1405, 'Corsair WS 16GB DDR5 5600MHZ CL40 ECC RDIMM Desktop RAM', 'Deploy ultimate data integrity and professional-grade computing power with the Corsair WS 16GB DDR5 5600MHz CL40 ECC RDIMM Workstation RAM. Specially engineered for high-end enterprise platforms like AMD Threadripper and Intel Xeon, this Registered DIMM (RDIMM) operates at a swift 5600MHz frequency with full sideband Error-Correcting Code (ECC) support. Built with an on-module overclock PMIC to guarantee clean power distribution, it continuously intercepts and fixes memory bit errors to keep intensive 3D modeling, deep simulations, and massive rendering grids running flawlessly.', 'corsair-ws-16gb-ddr5-5600mhz-cl40-ecc-rdimm-desktop-ram-1783936874', '<p><strong>Corsair WS 16GB DDR5 5600MHz CL40 ECC RDIMM Workstation RAM</strong>. Purpose-built to clear away performance constraints in high-end data setups, this 16GB single module leverages advanced <strong>DDR5 Registered memory architecture</strong>. Running at a blistering tested frequency of 5600MHz with tight <strong>CL40-40-40-77 latency timings</strong>, it drastically widens the data pipe between multi-core processors and active workloads—speeding up video editing workflows, high-fidelity engineering simulations, and complex local AI data matrices.</p><p>The foundational pillar of the Corsair WS (Workstation) series is its industrial-grade system defense. Unlike consumer memory, this <strong>Registered ECC DIMM</strong> features dual layers of hardware protection. It utilizes standard internal error correction along with critical sideband data validation to automatically resolve memory bit errors in real time. This directly prevents sudden calculation crashes or file corruption during multi-day background renders. To withstand prolonged stress, it incorporates an advanced <strong>on-board Overclock PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong> that cleanly balances voltage regulation at a stable 1.25V under full performance loads.</p><p>Tailored for absolute motherboard compatibility, this premium 288-pin module fully supports unified single-click profiles for <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> and <strong>AMD EXPO</strong> directly through the BIOS. It is explicitly optimized for top-tier workstation motherboards, including the <i>ASUS Pro WS WRX90E-SAGE SE, ASUS Pro WS TRX50-SAGE WIFI,</i> and <i>Gigabyte TRX50 AERO D</i>. For corporate developers, visual artists, and database engineers who demand complete precision, the Corsair WS RDIMM brings an uncompromising combination of elite speed, strict data stability, and lifetime product warranty coverage.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor / Module Type</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>RDIMM (Registered DIMM / Workstation-Server Form Factor)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (Single Channel Module)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Speed / Frequency</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>5600 MHz (5600 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL40-40-40-77</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction Code</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>Fully Registered ECC (Sideband + On-die Error Correction)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.25V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.1V / 4800MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management Tech</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>Workstation Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aesthetic Design</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Minimalist Black Industrial Design</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Dual Profile Support: Intel XMP 3.0 &amp; AMD EXPO</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Workstation Chipset Support</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>AMD TRX50, AMD WRX90, Intel W790</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Motherboard Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>ASUS Pro WS WRX90E-SAGE SE, ASUS Pro WS TRX50-SAGE WIFI, Gigabyte TRX50 AERO D, ASRock W790 WS</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Configuration</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 46500.00, 46500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/1Nf42zHc2m8h8ZSbVGxcFY5fnUrIFxc1P4bUskaH.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:01:14', '2026-07-13 10:01:14', 'Meta Title: Corsair WS 16GB DDR5 5600MHz CL40 ECC RDIMM Workstation RAM', 'Target Keywords: Corsair WS DDR5 16GB, 16GB DDR5 5600MHz ECC RDIMM, Corsair workstation registered RAM, AMD TRX50 WRX90 memory, Intel W790 server RAM, overclock PMIC RDIMM.', 'Meta Title: Corsair WS 16GB DDR5 5600MHz CL40 ECC RDIMM Workstation RAM', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1406, 'Corsair VENGEANCE 32GB DDR5 5600MHz C40 RAM', 'Step up to high-capacity, next-generation computing performance with the Corsair VENGEANCE 32GB DDR5 5600MHz C40 RAM. Engineered for modern Intel and AMD desktop platforms, this massive 32GB single module delivers blistering data transfer rates to smooth out intense gaming frame rates and effortlessly crush heavy multitasking. Wrapped in a clean, low-profile solid aluminum heat spreader and packed with cutting-edge features like an on-die PMIC and built-in Error-Correcting Code (ECC), it brings enthusiast-class stability and future-proof efficiency to your workstation or gaming rig.', 'corsair-vengeance-32gb-ddr5-5600mhz-c40-ram-1783936927', '<p>Unlock the high-frequency, massive-capacity capabilities of modern PC architectures with the <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE 32GB DDR5 5600MHz C40 Desktop RAM</strong>. Built on highly advanced DDR5 memory architecture, this single 32GB U-DIMM module provides a monumental step forward in data processing speeds and bandwidth capacity compared to legacy standards. Operating at a fast 5600MHz frequency with a stable C40 latency profile, it significantly quickens communications between your processor and system storage—reducing application launch friction, optimizing gaming frame pacing, and eliminating bottlenecks during memory-intensive tasks like 4K video editing, 3D rendering, or virtual machine hosting.</p><p>The Corsair VENGEANCE DDR5 lineup places heavy emphasis on structural data integrity and optimized power delivery. The module features an <strong>On-die PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong>, which shifts voltage regulation away from older motherboard designs and onto the RAM itself, ensuring a cleaner, more efficient 1.25V power supply for superior stability. Additionally, its integrated <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> actively checks and resolves bit errors in real time to ensure uninterrupted system uptime during long gaming sessions or intense production workloads.</p><p>True to Corsair’s building legacy, the module is encased in a premium, compact solid aluminum heat spreader that draws heat rapidly away from the high-grade memory chips. Standing at a low profile, it prevents physical clearance conflicts with large dual-fan CPU air towers or complex liquid cooling loops. Supporting <strong>Intel XMP 3.0 profiles</strong> for hassle-free, single-click speed configuration inside the BIOS right out of the box, this non-RGB memory module offers an exceptional combination of next-gen speed, expansive capacity, and understated minimalist style.</p>', '<h2>Technical Specifications</h2><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>32GB (Single Module Configuration)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>5600 MHz (5600 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL40-40-40-77</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.25V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Solid Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height Profile</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Low-Profile Broad Clearance Design</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Premium Matte Black</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Minimalist Finish</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel &amp; AMD DDR5 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 60000.00, 60000.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/MAo7JFys1mXTkrd8DNi2Qh6zzjszuJQAHrHf98Bm.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:02:07', '2026-07-13 17:39:57', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE 32GB DDR5 5600MHz C40 Desktop RAM', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance DDR5 32GB, 32GB DDR5 5600MHz RAM, Corsair Vengeance C40 32GB, next-gen high-capacity DDR5, Corsair non-RGB DDR5 upgrade, 5600MT/s desktop memory.', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE 32GB DDR5 5600MHz C40 desktop memory. Features high-capacity next-gen DDR5 speeds, on-die ECC, and Intel XMP 3.0 stability.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1407, 'Corsair VENGEANCE 32GB DDR5 6000MHz CL40 Desktop RAM', 'Step into the high-frequency, massive-capacity era of modern computing with the Corsair VENGEANCE 32GB DDR5 6000MHz CL40 Desktop RAM. Engineered to maximize the potential of modern Intel and AMD platforms, this premium 32GB single module operates at a blistering 6000MHz speed to smooth out intense gaming frame rates and speed up massive multitasking queues. Housed inside a low-clearance solid aluminum heat spreader for broad case compatibility, it packs advanced hardware features like an on-die PMIC and built-in Error-Correcting Code (ECC) to deliver elite desktop stability.', 'corsair-vengeance-32gb-ddr5-6000mhz-cl40-desktop-ram-1783936977', '<p>vropel your custom system into the future of data processing with the high-bandwidth <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE 32GB DDR5 6000MHz CL40 Desktop RAM</strong>. Purpose-built to clear away memory bottlenecks in modern multi-core processing systems, this generous 32GB single U-DIMM module provides a colossal leap in data transfer speeds compared to legacy architectures. Operating at an ultra-fast 6000MHz frequency with a stable CL40 latency profile, it drastically quickens communication between your processor and system storage—reducing application launch delays, optimizing active rendering queues, and ensuring fluid performance during heavy workloads like 4K/8K video editing, 3D compilation, or virtual machine hosting.</p><p>The Corsair VENGEANCE DDR5 platform places an uncompromising focus on structural data security and precise power distribution. The module incorporates an <strong>On-board PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong>, which shifts voltage regulation away from older motherboard designs and onto the memory stick itself, delivering a cleaner, more efficient 1.35V current supply for enhanced stability. Alongside it, an integrated <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> engine continuously monitors and corrects internal data bit errors in real time, preventing sudden system crashes or file corruption during long-duration production runs.</p><p>True to Corsair’s high engineering legacy, the module features hand-sorted memory chips mounted on a custom high-performance PCB, all wrapped inside a sleek solid aluminum heat spreader that draws thermal energy away rapidly. Standing at a low profile, it prevents physical clearance conflicts, fitting effortlessly underneath large dual-fan CPU air towers or tight liquid cooling radiator loops. Supporting <strong>Intel XMP 3.0 profiles</strong> for automated, single-click rated speed configuration inside the BIOS right out of the box, this non-RGB memory upgrade brings a flawless combination of next-gen speed, expansive capacity, and clean minimalist style.</p><h2>Technical Specifications</h2>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>32GB (Single Module Configuration)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>6000 MHz (6000 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL40-40-40-77</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.1V / 4800MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height Profile</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Low-Profile Broad Clearance Design</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Premium Matte Black</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Minimalist Finish</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel &amp; AMD DDR5 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/eishpb9GSjhDJema9c24D2YSc9fF1XfEEcoejZwx.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:02:57', '2026-07-13 10:02:57', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE 32GB DDR5 6000MHz CL40 Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE 32GB DDR5 6000MHz CL40 desktop memory. Features high-capacity next-gen DDR5 speeds, on-die ECC, and Intel XMP 3.0 stability.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance DDR5 32GB, 32GB DDR5 6000MHz RAM, Corsair Vengeance CL40 32GB, next-gen high-capacity DDR5, Corsair non-RGB DDR5 upgrade, 6000MT/s desktop memory.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1409, 'Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 32GB DDR5 6000MHz CL40 Desktop RAM', 'Illuminate your custom rig while unlocking elite data-processing boundaries with the Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 32GB DDR5 6000MHz CL40 Desktop RAM. Built on cutting-edge, high-bandwidth DDR5 architecture, this massive 32GB memory kit operates at a blazing 6000MHz frequency to eliminate multitasking lag and smooth out heavy creative applications. It features a striking, individually addressable ten-zone dynamic RGB lightbar that syncs flawlessly via Corsair iCUE software. Encased in a solid dual-tone aluminum heat spreader with onboard PMIC voltage regulation, it perfectly blends high-octane performance with customizable, jaw-dropping style.', 'corsair-vengeance-rgb-32gb-ddr5-6000mhz-cl40-desktop-ram-1783937044', '<h3>Long Description</h3><p>Propel your desktop system into the multi-core era and create a visual masterpiece with the high-performance <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 32GB DDR5 6000MHz CL40 Desktop RAM</strong>. Specifically optimized to extract maximum performance from modern high-end Intel and AMD processors, this generous 32GB kit provides a massive leap forward in memory bandwidth compared to legacy standards. Running at an ultra-fast 6000MHz frequency with a stable CL40 latency profile, it drastically accelerates communication lanes between your CPU and storage drives. This guarantees instantaneous application loading, seamless video timeline scrub speeds, and incredibly steady frame pacing during demanding AAA gaming marathons.</p><p>The defining visual highlight of the VENGEANCE RGB DDR5 is its top-mounted, panoramic lightbar. It houses a beautifully diffused <strong>ten-zone dynamic RGB lighting array</strong> that is individually addressable. Using the powerful Corsair iCUE software ecosystem, you can design fluid custom animations, synchronize illumination with other iCUE-compatible components, and set up real-time, temperature-reactive lighting alerts. Underneath the lighting array sits a premium solid aluminum heat spreader that rapidly wicks heat away from the hand-sorted memory ICs to prevent thermal throttling during heavy multi-hour rendering grids or complex computing pipelines.</p><p>Engineered for absolute reliability, this desktop memory module incorporates advanced hardware-level defenses. An <strong>On-board PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong> handles voltage regulation directly on the PCB rather than relying on legacy motherboard channels, ensuring a cleaner, highly efficient 1.35V power flow for enhanced stability during high-bandwidth usage. Alongside it, an integrated <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> engine continuously checks and corrects internal data bit errors in real time, defending your computer against sudden lockups and blue screens. Fully supporting unified profile configurations for <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> and <strong>AMD EXPO</strong>, it lets you achieve its full rated speeds with a simple, single-click toggle inside the BIOS.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>32GB (Available in 2 x 16GB Kit or Single 32GB Module configurations)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>6000 MHz (6000 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL40-40-40-77 (EXPO Variants can vary to CL40-50-50-96)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.1V / 4800MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Individually Addressable 10-Zone Dynamic RGB Lightbar</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Control</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Corsair iCUE Ecosystem Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Dual Profile Support: Intel XMP 3.0 &amp; AMD EXPO</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel &amp; AMD DDR5 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 62500.00, 62500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/b8sWoQKOQM6XwMWk7p3uvJMPgbnUyf2HS7VomTZb.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:04:04', '2026-07-13 10:04:04', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 32GB DDR5 6000MHz CL40 Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 32GB DDR5 6000MHz CL40 desktop memory. Features ten-zone dynamic RGB lighting, high-capacity next-gen speeds, and Intel XMP 3.0 & AMD EXPO support.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance RGB DDR5 32GB, 32GB DDR5 6000MHz RGB RAM, Corsair Vengeance RGB CL40 32GB, dynamic ten-zone RGB memory, 6000MT/s high-capacity desktop RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1410, 'Corsair VENGEANCE RGB RS 32GB DDR5 6000MHz CL40 Desktop RAM', 'Maximize your platform\'s data bandwidth while maintaining a smart budget with the Corsair VENGEANCE RGB RS 32GB DDR5 6000MHz CL40 Desktop RAM. Perfectly tuned for next-gen setups, this high-capacity 32GB DDR5 kit operates at a swift 6000MHz speed to crush multitasking lag and smooth out gaming frame rates. Encased in a refined gray aluminum heat spreader, it features a panoramic RGB lightbar optimized for native motherboard software synchronization, alongside onboard PMIC voltage regulation and On-die ECC for rock-solid computing stability.', 'corsair-vengeance-rgb-rs-32gb-ddr5-6000mhz-cl40-desktop-ram-1783937096', '<p>Propel your custom desktop rig into the modern multi-core era with the performance-driven <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE RGB RS 32GB DDR5 6000MHz CL40 Desktop RAM</strong>. Specifically developed to bring enthusiast-class DDR5 bandwidth to a wider, value-conscious audience, this generous 32GB kit provides a massive evolutionary leap forward in data-handling capability. Running at an ultra-fast 6000MHz frequency with a stable CL40 latency configuration, it accelerates the core pathways between your high-end processor and system storage—drastically reducing loading delays in complex games and offering a fluid workspace for heavy day-to-day productivity.</p><p>The defining hallmark of the VENGEANCE RGB RS series is its refined, universally compatible lighting system. Outfitted with a beautifully diffused panoramic lightbar, it uses a streamlined array of ultra-bright LEDs that can be controlled natively through your motherboard’s default software (such as ASUS Aura Sync, GIGABYTE RGB Fusion, and MSI Mystic Light), allowing you to keep your system software footprint exceptionally light while still syncing full chassis illumination. Tucked underneath the lighting bar is a premium, custom-brushed gray aluminum heat spreader styled with clean dual-tone accents to rapidly pull heat away from hand-sorted memory chips.</p><p>Engineered to clear out hardware bottlenecks, the module integrates cutting-edge internal safety architectures. An <strong>On-board Overclock PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong> shifts complex voltage regulation directly onto the memory stick for a clean, stable 1.35V current flow, while <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> actively checks and resolves bit errors in real-time to defend against sudden lockups. Fully supporting native <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> and <strong>AMD EXPO</strong> dual-profile frameworks, the Corsair Vengeance RGB RS allows for painless, single-click rated optimization right inside the BIOS.</p>', '<h2>Technical Specifications</h2><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>32GB (Typically 2 x 16GB Dual-Channel Kit)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>6000 MHz (6000 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL40-50-50-96</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.1V / 4800MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Solid Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Scheme</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Refined Matte Gray / Gunmetal</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Architecture</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Diffused Panoramic Lightbar (Motherboard Sync Optimized)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>RGB Ecosystem Control</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Corsair iCUE, ASUS Aura, MSI Mystic Light, GIGABYTE RGB Fusion</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Dual Profile Support: Intel XMP 3.0 &amp; AMD EXPO</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern AMD 600/800 &amp; Intel 600/700/800 Series</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 63000.00, 63000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/FtvVTvsI70SD2IS1vHejAo6YuNxpbHbx3qLWU25T.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:04:56', '2026-07-13 10:04:56', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE RGB RS 32GB DDR5 6000MHz CL40 Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE RGB RS 32GB DDR5 6000MHz CL40 desktop memory. Features value-focused dynamic RGB lighting, gray alloy heatsink, and dual Intel XMP 3.0 & AMD EXPO support.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance RGB RS DDR5 32GB, 32GB DDR5 6000MHz RS RAM, Corsair Vengeance RS CL40 32GB, value gaming DDR5 RAM, 6000MT/s gray desktop RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1411, 'Corsair DOMINATOR PLATINUM RGB 16GB (2x8GB) DDR4 3600MHz C18 RAM Kit', 'Elevate your desktop configuration to the absolute pinnacle of premium performance and aesthetics with the iconic Corsair DOMINATOR PLATINUM RGB 16GB (2x8GB) DDR4 3600MHz C18 RAM Kit. Renowned as the definitive gold standard for enthusiast system builds, this high-performance dual-channel kit features 12 ultra-bright, individually addressable CAPELLIX RGB LEDs and patented DHX cooling technology. Operating at a swift 3600MHz frequency with a hand-screened architecture, it delivers exceptional data responsiveness and unmatched stability under severe computing stress.', 'corsair-dominator-platinum-rgb-16gb-2x8gb-ddr4-3600mhz-c18-ram-kit-1783937136', '<p>Redefine the concept of luxury hardware performance with the meticulously crafted <strong>Corsair DOMINATOR PLATINUM RGB 16GB (2x8GB) DDR4 3600MHz C18 RAM Kit</strong>. The culmination of over 25 years of world-class memory engineering, this dual-channel U-DIMM kit is built using a custom <strong>10-layer high-performance PCB</strong> paired with strictly hand-sorted, tightly screened memory chips. Operating at a high-speed 3200MHz native baseline that easily scales to a blazing <strong>3600MHz rated frequency via Intel XMP 2.0</strong>, it runs with optimized <strong>CL18-19-19-39 timings</strong> at 1.35V—slashing system rendering bottlenecks, ensuring instantaneous application load cycles, and maintaining fluid frame delivery in high-refresh-rate AAA gaming environments.</p><p>What sets the DOMINATOR PLATINUM RGB apart is its uncompromising structural and thermal layout. It is encased in a precision die-cast zinc alloy and anodized aluminum heat shield that utilizes Corsair\'s patented <strong>Dual-Path DHX (Dual-Heat Exchange) cooling technology</strong>. This innovation cools the memory modules simultaneously through both the copper ground plane of the PCB and the external housing, ensuring peak operating efficiency even under intense overclocking. Lining the crown of each module are <strong>12 individually addressable CAPELLIX RGB LEDs</strong>. These next-gen emitters shine significantly brighter, last longer, and draw far less power than conventional surface-mount LEDs.</p><p>Managed through the comprehensive <strong>Corsair iCUE software ecosystem</strong>, you can customize intricate, multi-layered lighting animations, synchronize illumination with other iCUE-compatible hardware components, and track live temperature or frequency readouts in real time. Fit for top-tier modern Intel and AMD DDR4 builds, this premium kit delivers an legendary combination of elite computing speeds, industrial craftsmanship, and timeless, sophisticated styling backed by a limited product lifetime warranty.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Kit Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB Kit (2 x 8GB Dual-Channel Modules)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Speed / Frequency</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>3600 MHz (PC4-28800)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL18-19-19-39</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCB Construction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>Custom 10-Layer High-Performance Signal PCB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.2V / 2133MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Technology</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Patented Dual-Path DHX Cooling System</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Composition</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Precision Die-Cast Zinc Alloy &amp; Anodized Aluminum</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>55 mm (Enthusiast Form-Factor Height)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Architecture</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>12 Individually Addressable Ultra-Bright CAPELLIX LEDs</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Management</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Corsair iCUE Integration (Real-Time Temp Monitors)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profile</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel 300/400/500/600/700/800 &amp; AMD X570/B550 DDR4 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Configuration</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 10500.00, 10500.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/hNLMokVOB8r0X9sPgcEpS6EJB3uLGYUjHG9FlzPw.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:05:36', '2026-07-13 17:43:59', 'Meta Title: Corsair DOMINATOR PLATINUM RGB 16GB (2x8GB) DDR4 3600MHz C18 RAM Kit', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair DOMINATOR PLATINUM RGB 16GB (2x8GB) DDR4 3600MHz C18 desktop RAM kit. Features 12 CAPELLIX RGB LEDs, DHX cooling tech, and XMP 2.0.', 'vTarget Keywords: Corsair Dominator Platinum RGB DDR4, 16GB DDR4 3600MHz dual kit, Corsair Dominator 2x8GB C18, premium gaming desktop memory, Capellix RGB RAM upgrade, 3600MHz high-end PC memory.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1412, 'Corsair VENGEANCE 32GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM', 'Propel your system into the high-frequency era of modern computing with the Corsair VENGEANCE 32GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered to fully unlock the capabilities of modern Intel and AMD platforms, this high-performance 32GB kit operates at a blistering 6000MHz frequency to eliminate multitasking lag and smooth out intensive rendering operations. Wrapped in an ultra-compact, low-profile solid aluminum heat spreader for universal case and cooler clearance, it features onboard PMIC voltage regulation and built-in Error-Correcting Code (ECC) to deliver rock-solid stability.', 'corsair-vengeance-32gb-ddr5-6000mhz-desktop-ram-1783937181', '<h3>Long Description</h3><p>Clear out processing bottlenecks and future-proof your desktop rig with the high-bandwidth <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE 32GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Specifically optimized to feed data-hungry modern multi-core processors, this generous 32GB capacity configuration provides a massive evolutionary leap forward in memory bandwidth compared to legacy architectures. Running at an ultra-fast 6000MHz frequency, it accelerates the core pathways between your high-end processor and system components—slashing application load times, optimizing active rendering queues, and ensuring fluid performance during memory-heavy workloads like 4K/8K video editing, 3D compilation, or streaming while gaming.</p><p>The Corsair VENGEANCE DDR5 platform places an uncompromising focus on structural data security and precise power distribution. The module incorporates an <strong>On-board PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong>, which shifts complex voltage regulation away from older motherboard designs and onto the memory stick itself, delivering a cleaner, more efficient power current supply for enhanced stability during heavy overclocking. Alongside it, an integrated <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> engine continuously monitors and corrects internal data bit errors in real time, defending your computer against sudden system crashes or file corruption during long-duration production runs.</p><p>True to Corsair’s high engineering legacy, this memory features hand-sorted memory chips mounted on a custom high-performance PCB, all wrapped inside a sleek solid aluminum heat spreader that draws thermal energy away rapidly. Standing at a low profile, it prevents physical clearance conflicts, fitting effortlessly underneath large dual-fan CPU air towers or tight liquid cooling radiator loops. Supporting dual performance profiles for <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> and <strong>AMD EXPO</strong>, it lets you achieve its full rated speeds with a simple, single-click toggle inside the BIOS right out of the box.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>32GB (Available in 2 x 16GB Kit or Single 32GB Module configurations)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>6000 MHz (6000 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL40-40-40-77 (Variants can range to CL30 / CL36 based on batch)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V - 1.40V (Profile Dependent)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.1V / 4800MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height Profile</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Low-Profile Compact Clearance Design</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Sleek Minimalist Profile</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Dual Profile Support: Intel XMP 3.0 &amp; AMD EXPO</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel &amp; AMD DDR5 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/PJRX94TCRUCVo9i3vDqdzFqz7DlHIbqDd3vlH4jb.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:06:21', '2026-07-13 10:06:21', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE 32GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE 32GB DDR5 6000MHz desktop memory. Features next-gen speeds, an aluminum heat spreader, and dual Intel XMP 3.0 & AMD EXPO overclocking profiles.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance DDR5 32GB, 32GB DDR5 6000MHz RAM, Corsair Vengeance 6000MT/s, low-profile DDR5 32GB desktop memory, non-RGB Corsair DDR5 upgrade, high-speed PC memory.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1413, 'Corsair Vengeance LPX 4GB (1x4GB) DDR4 DRAM 2400MHz', 'Optimize your day-to-day computing efficiency with the highly reliable Corsair Vengeance LPX 4GB (1x4GB) DDR4 DRAM 2400MHz RAM. Purpose-built for stable performance upgrades and compact system assemblies, this 4GB U-DIMM module features a low-profile pure aluminum heat spreader engineered for excellent thermal dissipation and broad case compatibility. Operating at a steady 2400MHz with an optimized CL16 latency profile, it delivers smooth data handling for essential office applications, light multitasking, and entry-level desktop computing.', 'corsair-vengeance-lpx-4gb-1x4gb-ddr4-dram-2400mhz-1783937223', '<p><strong>Corsair Vengeance LPX 4GB (1x4GB) DDR4 DRAM 2400MHz RAM</strong>. Designed from the ground up to offer premium-tier engineering at an accessible threshold, this module is built using a custom performance eight-layer PCB and strictly hand-screened memory ICs. Running at a reliable 2400MHz frequency with a tight <strong>CL16-16-16-39 timing profile</strong>, it reduces system boot times, smooths out web browsing workflows, and ensures stable operations across daily multi-threaded business tools.</p><p>The distinguishing hallmark of the Vengeance LPX lineup is its signature <strong>low-profile thermal design</strong>. Standing at just 34mm tall, its pure aluminum heat spreader rapidly draws thermal buildup away from the underlying memory components and into your system’s active airflow path. This ultra-compact footprint completely eliminates physical clearance conflicts, letting the module fit effortlessly underneath massive dual-fan CPU tower air coolers or inside tight small-form-factor (SFF) Mini-ITX chassis setups.</p><p>Built to simplify system configuration, this module fully supports the <strong>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile)</strong> framework for hassle-free, automated speed adjustments inside the BIOS. Operating at a power-efficient 1.2V baseline, it minimizes aggregated energy draw and localized heat generation to extend hardware longevity. Rigorously tested across virtually all major Intel and AMD DDR4 motherboards, the Corsair Vengeance LPX 4GB module provides a bulletproof foundation for sustained desktop system stabilit</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>4GB (1 x 4GB Single Module Configuration)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>2400 MHz (PC4-19200)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL16-16-16-39</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCB Construction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>Custom 8-Layer High-Performance PCB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.2V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Solution</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Anodized Pure Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height Profile</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>34 mm (Low-Profile Clearance)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Classic Matte Black</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Minimalist Finish</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel &amp; AMD DDR4 Desktop Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Configuration</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Duration</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/8wx1ThVGEC2latZyNS5IpLBtv5wJr4SV7c2ikWDo.png', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:07:03', '2026-07-13 10:07:17', 'Corsair Vengeance LPX 4GB (1x4GB) DDR4 DRAM 2400MHz', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair Vengeance LPX 4GB DDR4 2400MHz desktop RAM. Features a low-profile aluminum heat spreader, CL16 latency, and Intel XMP 2.0 support.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance LPX 4GB, 4GB DDR4 2400MHz RAM, Corsair low profile 4GB RAM, Vengeance LPX 2400MHz black, budget desktop memory upgrade, standard DDR4 U-DIMM RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1414, 'Corsair Vengeance LPX 8GB DDR4 2400MHz RAM', 'Optimize your day-to-day computing efficiency and smooth out everyday multitasking with the highly reliable Corsair Vengeance LPX 8GB DDR4 2400MHz Desktop RAM. Purpose-built for stable performance upgrades and compact system assemblies, this 8GB U-DIMM module features a low-profile pure aluminum heat spreader engineered for excellent thermal dissipation and broad case compatibility. Operating at a steady 2400MHz with an energy-efficient 1.2V profile, it delivers reliable data processing for essential work applications, web browsing, and entry-level gaming setups.', 'corsair-vengeance-lpx-8gb-ddr4-2400mhz-ram-1783937291', '<p>Breathe rock-solid dependability into your budget gaming build, home media center, or office workstation with the <strong>Corsair Vengeance LPX 8GB DDR4 2400MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Designed from the ground up to offer premium-tier engineering at an accessible performance threshold, this module is built using a custom high-performance eight-layer PCB and strictly hand-screened memory ICs. Running at a reliable 2400MHz frequency with a well-optimized timing profile, it helps reduce system boot times, smooths out web browsing workflows, and ensures stable operations across day-to-day multi-threaded applications.</p><p>The distinguishing hallmark of the Vengeance LPX lineup is its signature <strong>low-profile thermal design</strong>. Standing at just 34mm tall, its pure aluminum heat spreader rapidly draws thermal buildup away from the underlying memory components and directly into your system’s active airflow path. This ultra-compact footprint completely eliminates physical clearance conflicts, letting the module fit effortlessly underneath massive dual-fan CPU tower air coolers or inside tight small-form-factor (SFF) Mini-ITX chassis setups.</p><p>Built to simplify system configuration, this module fully supports the <strong>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile)</strong> framework for hassle-free, automated speed adjustments inside the BIOS. Operating at a highly efficient 1.2V baseline, it minimizes aggregate power draw and localized heat generation to extend hardware longevity. Rigorously tested across virtually all major Intel and AMD DDR4 motherboards, the Corsair Vengeance LPX 8GB module provides a bulletproof foundation for sustained desktop system stability.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>8GB (1 x 8GB Single Module Configuration)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>2400 MHz (PC4-19200)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL16-16-16-39 / CL14-16-16-31 (Batch Dependent)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCB Construction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>Custom 8-Layer High-Performance PCB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.2V (Energy-Efficient Baseline)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Solution</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Anodized Pure Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height Profile</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>34 mm (Low-Profile Clearance)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Classic Matte Black / Dark Grey</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Minimalist Finish</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel &amp; AMD DDR4 Desktop Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Configuration</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Duration</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/ik5tpNatuWsEiRc9FznAYEtwMjC61O2URG5dZdFu.png', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:08:11', '2026-07-13 10:08:11', 'Meta Title: Corsair Vengeance LPX 8GB DDR4 2400MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair Vengeance LPX 8GB DDR4 2400MHz desktop RAM. Features a low-profile aluminum heat spreader, stable 1.2V operation, and Intel XMP 2.0.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance LPX 8GB, 8GB DDR4 2400MHz RAM, Corsair low profile 8GB RAM, Vengeance LPX 2400MHz black, budget desktop memory upgrade, standard DDR4 U-DIMM RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL);
