(1415, 'Corsair DOMINATOR PLATINUM RGB 8GB DDR4 3600MHz C18 RAM', 'Bring elite, enthusiast-class performance and iconic luxury aesthetics to your PC with the Corsair DOMINATOR PLATINUM RGB 8GB DDR4 3600MHz C18 Desktop RAM. Widely recognized as a masterpiece of premium memory engineering, this high-speed 8GB U-DIMM module features 12 individually addressable CAPELLIX RGB LEDs and Corsair\'s patented DHX cooling technology. Operating at a swift 3600MHz with strictly hand-screened memory ICs, it delivers lightning-fast data responsiveness and extreme system stability under heavy computing workloads.', 'corsair-dominator-platinum-rgb-8gb-ddr4-3600mhz-c18-ram-1783937352', '<p>Redefine your system\'s capabilities with the legendary craftsmanship of the <strong>Corsair DOMINATOR PLATINUM RGB 8GB DDR4 3600MHz C18 Desktop RAM</strong>. Built for builders who demand the absolute absolute limits of performance and style, this premium memory module is constructed on a custom <strong>10-layer high-performance signal PCB</strong> paired with strictly hand-sorted, tightly screened memory chips. Running at a high-speed <strong>3600MHz rated frequency via Intel XMP 2.0</strong>, it operates with optimized <strong>CL18-19-19-39 timings</strong> at 1.35V—slashing data bottlenecks, accelerating multi-threaded application performance, and ensuring smooth, stutter-free frame delivery in modern gaming environments.</p><p>What sets the DOMINATOR PLATINUM lineup apart is its premium structural design and advanced thermal management. The module is encased in a precision die-cast zinc alloy and anodized aluminum top bar utilizing Corsair\'s patented <strong>Dual-Path DHX (Dual-Heat Exchange) cooling technology</strong>. This system directly cools the memory modules through both the copper ground plane of the PCB and the external housing, keeping thermal thresholds low even under intense computing stress. Crowning the module are <strong>12 ultra-bright, individually addressable CAPELLIX RGB LEDs</strong>. These next-generation emitters shine significantly brighter, last longer, and consume far less power than conventional surface-mount LEDs.</p><p>Fully controlled via the <strong>Corsair iCUE software ecosystem</strong>, you can customize intricate dynamic lighting profiles, synchronize illumination across all iCUE-compatible components, and monitor live temperatures and frequencies in real time. Perfectly matched for top-tier modern Intel and AMD DDR4 desktop setups, this premium module offers an iconic combination of high-speed reliability, industrial durability, and timeless luxury design.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>8GB (Single Module Configuration)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Speed / Frequency</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>3600 MHz (PC4-28800)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL18-19-19-39</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCB Construction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>Custom 10-Layer High-Performance Signal PCB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.2V / 2133MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Technology</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Patented Dual-Path DHX Cooling System</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Composition</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Precision Die-Cast Zinc Alloy &amp; Anodized Aluminum</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>55 mm (Enthusiast Clearance Profile)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Architecture</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>12 Individually Addressable Ultra-Bright CAPELLIX LEDs</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Management</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Corsair iCUE Integration (With Real-Time Temp Monitors)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profile</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Intel &amp; AMD DDR4 Desktop Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Configuration</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/wenZqTZy0nnBiFeJwWpUFU4cYwMZq3Pz9FqllTHR.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:09:12', '2026-07-13 10:09:12', 'Meta Title: Corsair DOMINATOR PLATINUM RGB 8GB DDR4 3600MHz C18 RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair DOMINATOR PLATINUM RGB 8GB DDR4 3600MHz C18 desktop RAM. Features 12 ultra-bright CAPELLIX RGB LEDs, patented DHX cooling, and XMP 2.0.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Dominator Platinum RGB DDR4, 8GB DDR4 3600MHz RAM, Corsair Dominator 8GB C18, premium desktop memory upgrade, Capellix RGB RAM, 3600MHz high-end PC memory.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1416, 'Corsair VENGEANCE RGB PRO 8GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM White', NULL, 'corsair-vengeance-rgb-pro-8gb-ddr4-3200mhz-desktop-ram-white-1783937390', '<p>Perfect your custom system design while boosting baseline performance with the high-performance <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE RGB PRO 8GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM White</strong>. Engineered to maximize the potential of modern multi-threaded desktop environments, this single 8GB module is built using a custom performance PCB and strictly hand-screened memory ICs. Running at a high-speed 3200MHz frequency paired with an optimized <strong>CL16 timing profile</strong>, it eliminates micro-stutters during intensive data loops, shortens application load times, and ensures smooth, stable frame delivery in demanding AAA gaming titles.</p><p>The defining visual highlight of the VENGEANCE RGB PRO series is its beautiful, top-mounted panoramic lightbar. It houses a vibrant, multi-zone dynamic RGB lighting system that requires no extra wires or cables for a perfectly clean installation. Using the powerful <strong>Corsair iCUE software ecosystem</strong>, you can customize intricate, multi-layered lighting animations, synchronize colors across all your iCUE-compatible components, and set up real-time, temperature-reactive lighting alerts. Underneath the lighting array sits a premium solid aluminum heat spreader finished in a pristine matte white that rapidly wicks heat away from the underlying components to maintain safe temperatures under sustained workloads.</p><p>Built for complete convenience, the module fully supports the <strong>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile)</strong> framework. Instead of dealing with complex manual voltage modifications in your BIOS, a single click automatically locks the RAM into its safest, highest performance threshold at a stable 1.35V. Rigorously tested across virtually all major modern Intel and AMD DDR4 motherboards, the Corsair Vengeance RGB PRO White offers an exceptional combination of next-gen speed, thermal reliability, and jaw-dropping style.</p><h2>Technical Specifications</h2>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>8GB (Single Module Configuration)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>3200 MHz (PC4-25600)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL16-20-20-38</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.2V / 2133MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Scheme</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Premium Matte White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Multi-Zone Dynamic RGB Lightbar</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Management</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Corsair iCUE Ecosystem Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profile</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel &amp; AMD DDR4 Desktop Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Configuration</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/RXmgMVOIoOUIcce7SYgdylJ3xC5B3dakkoM09luu.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:09:50', '2026-07-13 10:09:50', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE RGB PRO 8GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM - White', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE RGB PRO 8GB DDR4 3200MHz desktop RAM in White. Features a stunning dynamic multi-zone RGB lightbar, aluminum heatsink, and XMP 2.0.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance RGB Pro 8GB White, 8GB DDR4 3200MHz white RAM, Corsair Vengeance RGB Pro white, white gaming desktop memory, Corsair iCUE white RAM upgrade, 3200MHz PC memory.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1417, 'CORSAIR VENGEANCE RGB RS 8GB DDR4 3600MHz RAM', 'Elevate your PC\'s aesthetics while optimizing processing data lanes with the high-performance Corsair VENGEANCE RGB RS 8GB DDR4 3600MHz Desktop RAM. Built for modern Intel and AMD platforms, this 8GB U-DIMM module features a beautifully styled black anodized aluminum heat spreader crowned by a vibrant panoramic lightbar with six individually addressable RGB LEDs. Operating at a fast 3600MHz frequency with a stable CL18 profile, it delivers responsive system performance, effortless multitasking, and fluid software customization via Corsair iCUE.', 'corsair-vengeance-rgb-rs-8gb-ddr4-3600mhz-ram-1783937450', '<p>Add a dynamic blast of color and reliable computational speed to your custom system with the <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE RGB RS 8GB DDR4 3600MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Engineered to handle high-bandwidth gaming loops and daily production demands, this single 8GB DDR4 module is built using a custom high-performance PCB and thoroughly screened memory chips. Running at a fast 3600MHz rated speed with optimized <strong>CL18-22-22-42 timings</strong>, it accelerates the core communication channels between your CPU and storage, eliminating background micro-stutters and cutting down application loading times.</p><p>The distinguishing hallmark of the VENGEANCE RGB RS series is its sleek, low-profile physical design paired with brilliant panoramic illumination. The top of the module houses <strong>six individually addressable RGB LEDs</strong> encased inside an unobstructed light pipe, providing uniform color dispersion visible from almost any viewing angle. Fully controlled through the powerful <strong>Corsair iCUE software ecosystem</strong> (as well as native motherboard lighting suites like ASUS Aura Sync), you can easily craft custom multi-layered effects or synchronize lighting across your entire desk setup.</p><p>Tucked underneath the lighting configuration is a modern, clean black anodized aluminum heat spreader. This structural shell rapidly draws localized heat away from the underlying memory components, sustaining safe operational temperatures even under heavy system overclocking. Fully supporting <strong>Intel XMP 2.0 performance profiles</strong> for effortless, single-click speed activation inside the BIOS at 1.35V, this module offers a brilliant balance of high-frequency engineering, low clearance compatibility, and exceptional visual style</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>8GB (1 x 8GB Single Module)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Speed / Frequency</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>3600 MHz (PC4-28800)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL18-22-22-42</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.2V / 2133MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Latency</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>15-15-15-36</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Black Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>6 Individually Addressable LEDs (Dynamic Multi-Zone RGB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ecosystem Integration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Corsair iCUE Ecosystem &amp; Motherboard RGB Software Sync</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel 300/400/500/600 Series &amp; AMD 300/400/500 Series Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Limited Lifetime Product Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/GMWQtvbWP3Xd4ohU00c0bbdYVNDPFWvYW5lU2RC3.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:10:50', '2026-07-13 10:10:50', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE RGB RS 8GB DDR4 3600MHz C18 Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE RGB RS 8GB DDR4 3600MHz desktop memory. Features 6 individually addressable RGB LEDs, a sleek black heatsink, and XMP 2.0 performance.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance RGB RS 8GB, 8GB DDR4 3600MHz RGB RAM, Corsair Vengeance RS CL18, compact RGB desktop memory, 3600MHz gaming RAM upgrade, Corsair iCUE RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1418, 'CORSAIR VENGEANCE LPX 8GB DDR4 3600MHz RAM', 'Maximize your PC\'s responsiveness and eliminate frame-rate stutters with the world-renowned Corsair Vengeance LPX 8GB DDR4 3600MHz Desktop RAM. Purpose-built for high-performance enthusiast configurations, this 8GB U-DIMM module features a pure aluminum low-profile heat spreader engineered for exceptional heat dissipation and broad case compatibility. Operating at a fast 3600MHz with an optimized CL18 latency profile, it delivers high-speed data processing and seamless Intel XMP 2.0 automated overclocking for gamers and system builders alike.', 'corsair-vengeance-lpx-8gb-ddr4-3600mhz-ram-1783937496', '<p>Breathe elite-tier reliability into your custom PC build with the <strong>Corsair Vengeance LPX 8GB DDR4 3600MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Designed from the ground up for high-frequency computing demands, this module is built using a custom high-performance eight-layer PCB and strictly hand-screened memory ICs. Running at a high-speed 3600MHz frequency with a tight <strong>CL18 timing profile</strong>, it eliminates micro-stutters during intensive data loops, shortens system boot times, and stabilizes frame delivery across demanding AAA gaming titles.</p><p>The distinguishing hallmark of the Vengeance LPX lineup is its signature <strong>low-profile thermal design</strong>. Standing at just 34mm tall, its pure aluminum heat spreader rapidly draws thermal buildup away from the memory chips and directly into your chassis\'s active airflow system. This ultra-compact footprint completely eliminates physical clearance conflicts, letting it fit effortlessly underneath massive dual-fan CPU tower air coolers or inside tight Small Form Factor (SFF) Mini-ITX systems.</p><p>Built for complete convenience, the module fully supports the <strong>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile)</strong> framework. Instead of wrestling with manual voltage adjustments in the BIOS, a single click automatically locks the RAM into its safest, highest performance threshold at 1.35V. Rigorously tested across virtually all major modern Intel and AMD DDR4 motherboards, the Corsair Vengeance LPX is the definitive gold standard for rock-solid desktop memory upgrades.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>8GB (Single Module Configuration)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>3600 MHz (PC4-28800)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL18-22-22-42</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCB Engineering</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>Custom 8-Layer High-Performance PCB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Solution</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Anodized Pure Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>34 mm (Low-Profile Clearance)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Classic Matte Black</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Minimalist Style</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel &amp; AMD DDR4 Desktop Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Configuration</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Duration</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/PZ4l6lSmrquQfN9cNgfD4eb0H8MxmrMecKZ2Z7Dd.png', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:11:36', '2026-07-13 10:11:36', 'Meta Title: Corsair Vengeance LPX 8GB DDR4 3600MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair Vengeance LPX 8GB DDR4 3600MHz desktop RAM. Features a low-profile aluminum heat spreader, CL18 latency, and Intel XMP 2.0 support.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance LPX 8GB, 8GB DDR4 3600MHz RAM, Corsair low profile 8GB RAM, Vengeance LPX 3600MHz black, gaming memory upgrade, 3600MHz U-DIMM RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
