heavy system overclocking. Fully supporting <strong>Intel XMP 2.0 performance profiles</strong> for effortless, single-click speed activation inside the BIOS at 1.35V, this module offers a brilliant balance of high-frequency engineering, low clearance compatibility, and exceptional visual style.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>8GB (1 x 8GB Single Module)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Speed / Frequency</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>3200 MHz (PC4-25600)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL16-20-20-38</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.2V / 2133MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Black Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>6 Individually Addressable LEDs (Dynamic Multi-Zone RGB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ecosystem Integration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Corsair iCUE Ecosystem &amp; Motherboard RGB Software Sync</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel 300/400/500/600 Series &amp; AMD 300/400/500 Series Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Limited Lifetime Product Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/vSTA5Mg1Qt6MLJtMjuEGtq8h3uBVbbdt77OQBUrx.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:12:19', '2026-07-13 10:12:19', 'CORSAIR VENGEANCE RGB RS 8GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE RGB RS 8GB DDR4 3200MHz desktop memory. Features 6 vibrant individually addressable RGB LEDs, a compact black heatsink, and Intel XMP 2.0.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance RGB RS 8GB, 8GB DDR4 3200MHz RGB RAM, Corsair Vengeance RS CL16, compact gaming RGB RAM, 3200MHz RAM upgrade, Corsair iCUE desktop memory.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1420, 'Corsair Dominator Platinum RGB 8GB 3200MHz DDR4 RAM', 'Elevate your desktop configuration to the absolute pinnacle of premium performance and aesthetics with the iconic Corsair Dominator Platinum RGB 8GB 3200MHz DDR4 RAM. Renowned as the definitive gold standard for enthusiast system builds, this high-performance U-DIMM module features 12 ultra-bright, individually addressable CAPELLIX RGB LEDs and patented DHX cooling technology. Operating at a swift 3200MHz frequency with a hand-screened architecture, it delivers exceptional data responsiveness and unmatched stability under severe computing stress.', 'corsair-dominator-platinum-rgb-8gb-3200mhz-ddr4-ram-1783937594', '<p>Elevate your desk<strong>Dominator Platinum RGB 8GB 3200MHz DDR4 RAM</strong>. The culmination of world-class memory engineering, this single-channel U-DIMM module is built using a custom <strong>10-layer high-performance PCB</strong> paired with strictly hand-sorted, tightly screened memory chips. Operating at a high-speed <strong>3200MHz rated frequency via Intel XMP 2.0</strong>, it runs with optimized <strong>CL16-18-18-36 timings</strong> at 1.35V—slashing system rendering bottlenecks, ensuring instantaneous application load cycles, and maintaining fluid frame delivery in high-refresh-rate AAA gaming environments.</p><p>What sets the Dominator Platinum RGB apart is its uncompromising structural and thermal layout. It is encased in a precision die-cast zinc alloy and anodized aluminum heat shield that utilizes Corsair\'s patented <strong>Dual-Path DHX (Dual-Heat Exchange) cooling technology</strong>. This innovation cools the memory modules simultaneously through both the copper ground plane of the PCB and the external housing, ensuring peak operating efficiency even under intense overclocking. Lining the crown of the module are <strong>12 individually addressable CAPELLIX RGB LEDs</strong>. These next-gen emitters shine significantly brighter, last longer, and draw far less power than conventional surface-mount LEDs.</p><p>Managed through the comprehensive <strong>Corsair iCUE software ecosystem</strong>, you can customize intricate, multi-layered lighting animations, synchronize illumination with other iCUE-compatible hardware components, and track live temperature or frequency readouts in real time. Fit for top-tier modern Intel and AMD DDR4 builds, this premium module delivers a legendary combination of elite computing speeds, industrial craftsmanship, and timeless, sophisticated styling backed by a limited product lifetime warranty.&nbsp;</p>', '<h2>Technical Specifications</h2><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>8GB (Single Module Configuration)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Speed / Frequency</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>3200 MHz (PC4-25600)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL16-18-18-36 (Variants can range to CL16-20-20-38 based on batch)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCB Construction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>Custom 10-Layer High-Performance Signal PCB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.2V / 2133MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Technology</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Patented Dual-Path DHX Cooling System</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Composition</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Precision Die-Cast Zinc Alloy &amp; Anodized Aluminum</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>55 mm (Enthusiast Form-Factor Height)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Architecture</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>12 Individually Addressable Ultra-Bright CAPELLIX LEDs</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Management</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Corsair iCUE Integration (Real-Time Temp Monitors)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profile</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Intel &amp; AMD DDR4 Desktop Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Configuration</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/hD8N4aAOHgCf6FQwnVLwRyQL5NmqNizLKPcH8ree.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:13:14', '2026-07-13 10:13:14', 'Meta Title: Corsair Dominator Platinum RGB 8GB 3200MHz DDR4 Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair Dominator Platinum RGB 8GB 3200MHz DDR4 desktop RAM. Features 12 ultra-bright CAPELLIX RGB LEDs, patented DHX cooling tech, and XMP 2.0 stability.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Dominator Platinum RGB DDR4, 8GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM, Corsair Dominator 8GB C16, premium gaming desktop memory, Capellix RGB RAM upgrade, 3200MHz high-end PC memory.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1421, 'Corsair VENGEANCE RGB PRO 16GB DDR4 3000MHz Desktop RAM', 'Bring smooth data-processing speeds and a brilliant visual upgrade to your setup with the Corsair VENGEANCE RGB PRO 16GB DDR4 3000MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered for modern Intel and AMD DDR4 systems, this premium 16GB module delivers robust computing performance optimized with a high-bandwidth 3000MHz frequency. Featuring a stunning, top-mounted multi-zone dynamic RGB lightbar that syncs natively via Corsair iCUE software, it provides exceptional multitasking responsiveness wrapped inside a sleek solid aluminum heat spreader.', 'corsair-vengeance-rgb-pro-16gb-ddr4-3000mhz-desktop-ram-1783937639', '<p>vOptimize your system\'s capabilities while creating a beautiful chassis aesthetic with the high-performance <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE RGB PRO 16GB DDR4 3000MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Purpose-built to clear away processing bottlenecks in multi-threaded gaming and content creation setups, this generous 16GB single U-DIMM module is constructed on a custom high-performance PCB paired with strictly hand-sorted memory chips. Running at a high-speed 3000MHz rated frequency with stable timing profiles, it quickens communication lanes between your processor and active applications—ensuring fluid video editing timelines, fast game load cycles, and seamless background multitasking.</p><p>The defining hallmark of the VENGEANCE RGB PRO architecture is its striking panoramic lightbar layout. It houses a brilliant, multi-zone dynamic RGB lighting array that requires absolutely no messy extra wires or cables for installation. Using the comprehensive <strong>Corsair iCUE software ecosystem</strong>, you can customize intricate, multi-layered color animations, sync effects across all your iCUE-compatible gear, and map out real-time, temperature-reactive lighting profiles. Tucked right beneath the lighting bar is a premium, custom-styled aluminum heat spreader that rapidly wicks localized thermal energy away from the memory components to sustain peak efficiency.</p><p>Built to simplify system tuning, this high-end module fully supports the <strong>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile)</strong> framework. Instead of forcing you to guess manual voltage entries inside your system BIOS, a single automated profile toggle safely optimizes the RAM to its highest performance threshold at 1.35V. Rigorously tested across virtually all major modern Intel and AMD DDR4 motherboards, the Corsair Vengeance RGB PRO offers a bulletproof combination of premium speed, thermal durability, and eye-catching custom style.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (Single Channel Module)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Speed / Frequency</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>3000 MHz (PC4-24000)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL15-17-17-35 / CL16-18-18-36 (Batch Dependent)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.2V / 2133MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Solution</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Scheme</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Classic Matte Black</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Individually Addressable Multi-Zone Dynamic RGB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ecosystem Integration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Corsair iCUE &amp; Motherboard RGB Software Sync</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profile</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel &amp; AMD DDR4 Desktop Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Configuration</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Duration</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/9H2JyjUGRgTMjZEykuEYcQNOAbWGrLmgNUqZUYsX.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:13:59', '2026-07-13 10:13:59', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE RGB PRO 16GB DDR4 3000MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE RGB PRO 16GB DDR4 3000MHz desktop memory. Features dynamic multi-zone RGB lighting, high-performance overclocking, and Intel XMP 2.0.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance RGB Pro 16GB, 16GB DDR4 3000MHz RAM, Corsair Vengeance RGB Pro C15, gaming desktop memory upgrade, Corsair iCUE RGB RAM, 3000MHz PC memory.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1422, 'CORSAIR VENGEANCE RGB RS 16GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM', 'Elevate your PC\'s processing speed and visual aesthetics with the high-performance Corsair VENGEANCE RGB RS 16GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered to extract outstanding performance from modern Intel and AMD platforms, this 16GB U-DIMM module features a beautifully styled black anodized aluminum heat spreader crowned by a panoramic lightbar with six individually addressable RGB LEDs. Operating at a high-speed 3200MHz frequency with a tight CL16 latency profile, it delivers snappy system responsiveness, fluid multitasking, and seamless illumination synchronization via Corsair iCUE.', 'corsair-vengeance-rgb-rs-16gb-ddr4-3200mhz-ram-1783937689', '<p>configuration with the <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE RGB RS 16GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Specially designed to handle high-bandwidth gaming loops and daily production demands, this generous 16GB DDR4 module is built using a custom high-performance PCB paired with strictly screened memory chips. Running at a fast 3200MHz rated speed optimized with a sharp <strong>CL16-20-20-38 timing profile</strong>, it accelerates the core communication channels between your CPU and active storage arrays—eliminating background micro-stutters and cutting down application loading times.</p><p>The defining hallmark of the VENGEANCE RGB RS architecture is its sleek, low-profile physical frame paired with brilliant panoramic illumination. The top of the module houses <strong>six individually addressable RGB LEDs</strong> encased inside a beautifully diffused light pipe, providing uniform color dispersion visible from almost any viewing angle inside your chassis. Fully controlled through the comprehensive <strong>Corsair iCUE software ecosystem</strong> (as well as native motherboard lighting suites like ASUS Aura Sync, MSI Mystic Light, and GIGABYTE RGB Fusion), you can easily craft intricate multi-layered color effects or synchronize lighting patterns across your entire desk setup.</p><p>Tucked directly underneath the lighting array is a clean, modern black anodized aluminum heat spreader. This lightweight structural shell rapidly conducts localized thermal energy away from the underlying memory components to maintain safe, cool operational thresholds even during heavy gaming marathons. Fully supporting <strong>Intel XMP 2.0 performance profiles</strong> for effortless, single-click speed activation inside the BIOS at a stable 1.35V, this module offers an exceptional balance of high-frequency engineering, compact clearance compatibility, and timeless style.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (Available in 1 x 16GB Single Module or 2 x 8GB Kit configurations)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Speed / Frequency</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>3200 MHz (PC4-25600)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL16-20-20-38</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.2V / 2133MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Latency</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>15-15-15-36</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Black Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>6 Individually Addressable LEDs (Dynamic Multi-Zone RGB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ecosystem Integration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Corsair iCUE Ecosystem &amp; Motherboard RGB Software Sync</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profile</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel (300/400/500/600 Series) &amp; AMD DDR4 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Limited Lifetime Product Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/N5LS30pCrrYseFGSmJqi81UbhgynSooSNn5HIlnA.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:14:49', '2026-07-13 10:14:49', 'vCORSAIR VENGEANCE RGB RS 16GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE RGB RS 16GB DDR4 3200MHz desktop memory. Features 6 individually addressable RGB LEDs, compact black aluminum heatsink, and Intel XMP 2.0.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance RGB RS 16GB, 16GB DDR4 3200MHz RGB RAM, Corsair Vengeance RS CL16, compact gaming RGB RAM, 16GB 3200MHz RAM upgrade, Corsair iCUE desktop memory.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1423, 'Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 5600MHz RAM White', 'Elevate your desktop\'s performance and aesthetics with the Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 5600MHz RAM White. Designed to complement clean, minimalist, or snow-white themed PC builds, this high-performance 16GB single module operates at a swift 5600MHz frequency to eliminate multitasking lag and smooth out heavy system workloads. Wrapped in an ultra-compact, low-clearance solid aluminum heat spreader for broad case and CPU cooler compatibility, it packs advanced hardware features like an on-board PMIC and built-in Error-Correcting Code (ECC) to deliver rock-solid desktop stability.', 'corsair-vengeance-16gb-ddr5-5600mhz-ram-white-1783937762', '<p>Propel your custom system into the high-frequency era of modern computing with the crisp and clean <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 5600MHz RAM White</strong>. Specifically optimized to feed data-hungry modern multi-core Intel and AMD processors, this 16GB U-DIMM module provides a massive step forward in data processing speeds and memory bandwidth compared to legacy standards. Operating at a fast 5600MHz frequency with a stable CL40 latency profile, it quickens communication lanes between your CPU and storage components—slashing application load times, reducing background micro-stutters, and smoothing out frame delivery during gaming loops.</p><p>The defining hallmark of the VENGEANCE DDR5 platform is its advanced internal defense network and precise power management. The module features an <strong>On-board PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong>, which shifts complex voltage regulation directly onto the memory stick itself rather than relying on older motherboard channels. This delivers a cleaner, highly efficient 1.25V current flow for superior system stability. Alongside it, an integrated <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> engine continuously monitors and corrects data bit errors in real time, defending your computer against sudden application lockups or blue screens.</p><p>True to Corsair’s premium build legacy, this non-RGB memory module is constructed on a custom high-performance PCB paired with tightly screened, hand-sorted memory chips. The entire array is encased in a premium solid aluminum heat spreader finished in a pristine matte white that rapidly conducts heat away without adding physical bulk. Standing at a low profile, it completely prevents clearance conflicts, fitting effortlessly underneath large dual-fan CPU air towers or inside tight small-form-factor (SFF) chassis setups. Supporting <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> and <strong>AMD EXPO</strong> dual performance frameworks, it lets you achieve its full rated speeds instantly with a simple, single-click toggle inside the BIOS.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (Single Module Configuration)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>5600 MHz (5600 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL40-40-40-77 (Batch variants can range to CL36-36-36-76)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.25V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.1V / 4800MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management Tech</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height Profile</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Low-Profile Compact Clearance Design</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Premium Spotless Matte White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Minimalist Finish</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Dual Profile Support: Intel XMP 3.0 &amp; AMD EXPO</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel &amp; AMD DDR5 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Limited Lifetime Product Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/1Gz2H1iGLoaL2FTT1bM25UbHgqNOAV1MJ1jAFE79.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:16:02', '2026-07-13 10:16:02', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Desktop RAM - White', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Desktop RAM - White', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance DDR5 16GB White, 16GB DDR5 5600MHz white RAM, Corsair Vengeance white memory, low-profile white DDR5 RAM, 5600MT/s desktop memory upgrade, non-RGB white PC RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1424, 'Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 5600MHz RAM', 'Propel your custom system into the high-frequency era of modern computing with the Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered to fully unlock the capabilities of modern multi-core Intel and AMD platforms, this high-performance 16GB single module operates at a swift 5600MHz frequency to eliminate multitasking bottlenecks and smooth out resource-heavy operational workloads. Wrapped in an ultra-compact, low-profile solid aluminum heat spreader for broad case and cooler clearance, it features onboard PMIC voltage regulation and built-in Error-Correcting Code (ECC) to deliver rock-solid desktop stability.', 'corsair-vengeance-16gb-ddr5-5600mhz-ram-1783937817', '<p>Propel your custom system into the high-frequency era of modern computing with the <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Engineered to fully unlock the capabilities of modern multi-core Intel and AMD platforms, this high-performance 16GB single module operates at a swift 5600MHz frequency to eliminate multitasking bottlenecks and smooth out resource-heavy operational workloads. Wrapped in an ultra-compact, low-profile solid aluminum heat spreader for broad case and cooler clearance, it features onboard PMIC voltage regulation and built-in Error-Correcting Code (ECC) to deliver rock-solid desktop stability.&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (1 x 16GB Single Module Configuration)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>5600 MHz (5600 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL40-40-40-77 (Batch variants can range to CL40-40-40-70)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.25V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.1V / 4800MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height Profile</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Low-Profile Compact Clearance Design</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Classic Matte Black</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Minimalist Finish</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Dual Profile Support: Intel XMP 3.0 &amp; AMD EXPO</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel &amp; AMD DDR5 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/gjecZUoABuYf2Ts1GqhvJV8XAxRclVDLulTRix4o.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:16:57', '2026-07-13 10:16:57', NULL, 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 5600MHz desktop memory. Features high-speed next-gen DDR5 architectural performance, a low-profile aluminum heat spreader, and dual Intel XMP 3.0 & AMD EXPO support.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance DDR5 16GB, 16GB DDR5 5600MHz RAM, Corsair Vengeance 5600MT/s, low