(1425, 'Corsair VENGEANCE RGB PRO SL 16GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM White', 'Bring breathtaking multi-zone illumination and peak performance to your system configuration without sacrificing clearance using the Corsair VENGEANCE RGB PRO SL 16GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM White. Specially optimized with a slimmed-down, 44mm low-profile form factor, this high-performance 16GB dual-channel kit features a stunning dynamic RGB lightbar that syncs natively via Corsair iCUE. Housed inside a pristine matte white aluminum heat spreader, it runs at a swift 3200MHz frequency with a tight CL16 latency profile, making it the ultimate addition to clean, high-performance, snow-white themed custom PC builds.', 'corsair-vengeance-rgb-pro-sl-16gb-ddr4-3200mhz-ram-white-1783937871', '<p>Bring breathtaking multi-zone illumination and peak performance to your system configuration without sacrificing clearance using the <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE RGB PRO SL 16GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM White</strong>. Specially optimized with a slimmed-down, <strong>44mm low-profile form factor</strong>, this high-performance 16GB dual-channel kit features a stunning dynamic RGB lightbar that syncs natively via Corsair iCUE. Housed inside a pristine matte white aluminum heat spreader, it runs at a swift 3200MHz frequency with a tight CL16 latency profile, making it the ultimate addition to clean, high-performance, snow-white themed custom PC builds.&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Kit Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB Kit (2 x 8GB Dual-Channel Configuration)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Speed / Frequency</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>3200 MHz (PC4-25600)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL16-20-20-38 (Certain batches can scale to CL18-22-22-42)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.2V / 2133MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Latency</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>15-15-15-36</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height Profile</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>44 mm (Compact Slim-Line Height / Broad Cooler Clearance)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Scheme</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Premium Spotless Matte White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>10 Individually Addressable LEDs (Dynamic Multi-Zone RGB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ecosystem Integration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Corsair iCUE Ecosystem &amp; Motherboard RGB Software Sync</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profile</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel (300/400/500/600/700 Series) &amp; AMD DDR4 Setups</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Limited Lifetime Product Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/FPyWwwgnl9qnzinJGBLoEReOE7IMGedCfzvbn7xS.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:17:51', '2026-07-13 10:17:51', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE RGB PRO SL 16GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM - White', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE RGB PRO SL 16GB DDR4 3200MHz desktop memory kit in White. Features a 44mm compact profile, 10-zone dynamic RGB lightbar, and XMP 2.0.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance RGB Pro SL 16GB White, 16GB DDR4 3200MHz white RAM, Corsair Vengeance SL white, compact white gaming RAM, Corsair iCUE SL RAM upgrade, 3200MHz PC memory.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1426, 'CORSAIR VENGEANCE RGB RS 16GB DDR4 3600MHz RAM iosbd', 'Elevate your PC\'s processing speed and aesthetic presentation with the high-performance Corsair VENGEANCE RGB RS 16GB DDR4 3600MHz Desktop RAM. Built to extract outstanding bandwidth from modern Intel and AMD platforms, this 16GB U-DIMM configuration features a beautifully styled black anodized aluminum heat spreader crowned by a vibrant panoramic lightbar with six individually addressable RGB LEDs. Operating at a fast 3600MHz frequency with a stable CL18 profile, it delivers snappy system responsiveness, fluid multitasking, and seamless software customization via Corsair iCUE.', 'corsair-vengeance-rgb-rs-16gb-ddr4-3600mhz-ram-iosbd-1783964223', '<p>Add a dynamic blast of customizable color and rock-solid computational speed to your system configuration with the <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE RGB RS 16GB DDR4 3600MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Specially engineered to handle high-bandwidth gaming loops, intensive content creation, and daily production demands, this generous 16GB memory architecture is built using a custom high-performance PCB paired with strictly screened memory chips. Running at a fast 3600MHz rated speed optimized with a sharp <strong>CL18-22-22-42 timing profile</strong>, it accelerates the core communication channels between your CPU and active storage arrays—eliminating background micro-stutters and cutting down application loading times.</p><p>The defining hallmark of the VENGEANCE RGB RS architecture is its sleek, low-profile physical frame paired with brilliant panoramic illumination. The top of the module houses <strong>six individually addressable RGB LEDs</strong> encased inside an unobstructed light pipe, providing uniform color dispersion visible from almost any viewing angle inside your chassis. Fully controlled through the comprehensive <strong>Corsair iCUE software ecosystem</strong> (as well as native motherboard lighting suites like ASUS Aura Sync, MSI Mystic Light, and GIGABYTE RGB Fusion), you can easily craft intricate multi-layered color effects or synchronize lighting patterns across your entire desktop ecosystem.</p><p>Tucked directly underneath the lighting array is a clean, modern black anodized aluminum heat spreader. This lightweight structural shell rapidly conducts localized thermal energy away from the underlying memory components to maintain safe, cool operational thresholds even during heavy gaming marathons or high-load rendering sequences. Fully supporting <strong>Intel XMP 2.0 performance profiles</strong> for effortless, single-click speed activation inside the BIOS at a stable 1.35V, this module offers an exceptional balance of high-frequency engineering, compact clearance compatibility, and timeless style.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (Available in 1 x 16GB Single Module or 2 x 8GB Kit configurations)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Speed / Frequency</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>3600 MHz (PC4-28800)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL18-22-22-42</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.2V / 2133MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Latency</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>15-15-15-36</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Black Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>6 Individually Addressable LEDs (Dynamic Multi-Zone RGB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ecosystem Integration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Corsair iCUE Ecosystem &amp; Motherboard RGB Software Sync</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profile</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel (300/400/500/600 Series) &amp; AMD DDR4 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Limited Lifetime Product Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 14500.00, 14500.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/9mPPRmAXdavHS8MitIxtoSUgJ2pPEJG3uyKqdX1r.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:19:41', '2026-07-13 17:37:03', 'CORSAIR VENGEANCE RGB RS 16GB DDR4 3600MHz RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE RGB RS 16GB DDR4 3600MHz desktop memory. Features 6 individually addressable RGB LEDs, a sleek black heatsink, and Intel XMP 2.0 overclocking.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance RGB RS 16GB, 16GB DDR4 3600MHz RGB RAM, Corsair Vengeance RS CL18, compact RGB gaming RAM, 3600MHz desktop memory upgrade, Corsair iCUE RAM.', NULL, 2, NULL, NULL),
(1427, 'Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 5200MHz C40 RAM iosbd', 'Propel your desktop system into the high-frequency era of next-generation computing with the Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 5200MHz C40 RAM. Engineered to fully unlock the multi-core processing capabilities of modern Intel and AMD platforms, this high-performance 16GB module delivers a steady 5200MHz frequency to eliminate multitasking lag and smooth out daily computing tasks. Housed inside an ultra-compact, low-profile solid aluminum heat spreader for universal case and cooler clearance, it features onboard PMIC voltage regulation and built-in Error-Correcting Code (ECC) to supply rock-solid desktop stability.', 'corsair-vengeance-16gb-ddr5-5200mhz-c40-ram-iosbd-1783964153', '<p>Clear out processing bottlenecks and future-proof your custom PC build with the high-bandwidth <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 5200MHz C40 RAM</strong>. Specifically optimized to efficiently feed data-hungry modern multi-core processors, this 16GB capacity module provides a massive evolutionary leap forward in data transfer speeds compared to legacy architectures. Running at an ultra-fast 5200MHz frequency with a stable CL40 latency profile, it significantly accelerates the core communication lanes between your CPU and active system storage—slashing application load times, reducing background micro-stutters, and ensuring fluid performance during multitasking, gaming, or content creation workflows.</p><p>The Corsair VENGEANCE DDR5 platform places an uncompromising focus on structural data security and precise power distribution. The module incorporates an <strong>On-board Overclock PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong>, which shifts complex voltage regulation away from older motherboard designs and onto the memory stick itself. This delivers a cleaner, more efficient 1.25V power supply for enhanced stability during heavy operational stress. Alongside it, an integrated <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> engine continuously monitors and corrects internal data bit errors in real time, defending your computer against sudden system crashes or file corruption during long-duration runs.</p><p>True to Corsair’s high engineering legacy, this non-RGB memory features hand-sorted memory chips mounted on a custom high-performance PCB, all wrapped inside a sleek solid aluminum heat spreader that draws thermal energy away rapidly. Standing at a low profile, it completely prevents physical clearance conflicts, fitting effortlessly underneath large dual-fan CPU air towers or inside tight small-form-factor (SFF) Mini-ITX chassis setups. Supporting dual performance profiles for <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> and <strong>AMD EXPO</strong>, it lets you achieve its full rated speeds with a simple, single-click toggle inside the BIOS right out of the box.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (Available in 1 x 16GB Single Module or 2 x 8GB Kit layouts)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>5200 MHz (5200 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL40-40-40-77 (EXPO variants can scale to CL40-40-40-70)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.25V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.1V / 4800MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height Profile</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Low-Profile Compact Clearance Design</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Premium Matte Black / Matte Grey</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Sleek Minimalist Finish</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Dual Profile Support: Intel XMP 3.0 &amp; AMD EXPO</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel &amp; AMD DDR5 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 22500.00, 22500.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/PNCJkMN2ID6Uo2l2KbNHxtnmeppmn35LBjwh7iV4.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:20:20', '2026-07-13 17:35:53', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 5200MHz C40 Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 5200MHz C40 desktop memory. Features next-gen speeds, an aluminum heat spreader, and dual Intel XMP 3.0 & AMD EXPO overclocking support.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance DDR5 16GB, 16GB DDR5 5200MHz RAM, Corsair Vengeance 5200MT/s, low-profile DDR5 16GB desktop memory, non-RGB Corsair DDR5 upgrade, high-speed PC memory.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1428, 'CORSAIR VENGEANCE LPX 16GB DDR4 3600MHz RAM iosbd', 'Maximize your PC\'s responsiveness and eliminate frame-rate stutters with the world-renowned Corsair Vengeance LPX 16GB DDR4 3600MHz Desktop RAM. Purpose-built for high-performance enthusiast configurations and heavy multitasking, this high-capacity U-DIMM module features a pure aluminum low-profile heat spreader engineered for exceptional heat dissipation and broad case compatibility. Operating at a fast 3600MHz with an optimized CL18 latency profile, it delivers high-speed data processing and seamless Intel XMP 2.0 automated overclocking for gamers and system builders alike.', 'corsair-vengeance-lpx-16gb-ddr4-3600mhz-ram-iosbd-1783964081', '<p>Breathe elite-tier reliability into your custom PC build with the <strong>Corsair Vengeance LPX 16GB DDR4 3600MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Designed from the ground up for high-frequency computing demands, this module is built using a custom high-performance eight-layer PCB and strictly hand-screened memory ICs. Running at a high-speed 3600MHz frequency with a tight <strong>CL18 timing profile</strong>, it eliminates micro-stutters during intensive data loops, shortens system boot times, and stabilizes frame delivery across demanding AAA gaming titles and resource-heavy creation software.</p><p>The distinguishing hallmark of the Vengeance LPX lineup is its signature <strong>low-profile thermal design</strong>. Standing at just 34mm tall, its pure aluminum heat spreader rapidly draws thermal buildup away from the memory chips and directly into your chassis\'s active airflow system. This ultra-compact footprint completely eliminates physical clearance conflicts, letting it fit effortlessly underneath massive dual-fan CPU tower air coolers or inside tight Small Form Factor (SFF) Mini-ITX systems where space is at a premium.</p><p>Built for complete convenience, the module fully supports the <strong>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile)</strong> framework. Instead of wrestling with manual voltage adjustments in the BIOS, a single click automatically locks the RAM into its safest, highest performance threshold at 1.35V. Rigorously tested across virtually all major modern Intel and AMD DDR4 motherboards, the Corsair Vengeance LPX is the definitive gold s</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>ature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (Available in 1 x 16GB Single Module or 2 x 8GB Kit configurations)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>3600 MHz (PC4-28800)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL18-22-22-42</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCB Engineering</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>Custom 8-Layer High-Performance PCB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Solution</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Anodized Pure Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>34 mm (Low-Profile Clearance)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Classic Matte Black</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Minimalist Style</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel &amp; AMD DDR4 Desktop Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Configuration</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Duration</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 4200.00, 4200.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/o6YqxJG4jvPubkCwDPOMK3uukupKNqU9A3cm49fu.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:20:58', '2026-07-13 17:34:41', 'Meta Title: Corsair Vengeance LPX 16GB DDR4 3600MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair Vengeance LPX 16GB DDR4 3600MHz desktop memory. Features a low-profile aluminum heat spreader, CL18 latency, and Intel XMP 2.0 support.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance LPX 16GB, 16GB DDR4 3600MHz RAM, Corsair low profile 16GB RAM, Vengeance LPX 3600MHz black, gaming memory upgrade, 3600MHz U-DIMM RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1429, 'Corsair Vengeance 16GB DDR5 DRAM 5600MHz C40 RAM', 'Propel your desktop system into the high-frequency era of next-generation computing with the Corsair Vengeance 16GB DDR5 DRAM 5600MHz C40 RAM. Engineered to fully unlock the capabilities of modern multi-core Intel and AMD platforms, this high-performance 16GB module operates at a swift 5600MHz frequency to eliminate multitasking bottlenecks and smooth out resource-heavy workloads. Wrapped in an ultra-compact, low-profile solid aluminum heat spreader for universal case and cooler clearance, it features onboard PMIC voltage regulation and built-in Error-Correcting Code (ECC) to deliver rock-solid desktop stability.', 'corsair-vengeance-16gb-ddr5-dram-5600mhz-c40-ram-1783938110', '<p>bandwidth <strong>Corsair Vengeance 16GB DDR5 DRAM 5600MHz C40 RAM</strong>. Specifically optimized to efficiently feed data-hungry modern multi-core processors, this 16GB U-DIMM module provides a massive evolutionary leap forward in memory bandwidth compared to legacy standards. Running at a fast 5600MHz frequency with a stable CL40 latency profile, it significantly accelerates the core communication channels between your CPU and active storage components—reducing application launch times, optimizing rendering pipelines, and ensuring fluid performance during memory-heavy tasks like 4K video editing, complex code compilation, or multi-tabbed web workflows.</p><p>The Corsair Vengeance DDR5 platform places an uncompromising focus on structural data security and precise power distribution. The module incorporates an <strong>On-board Overclock PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong>, which shifts complex voltage regulation away from older motherboard designs and onto the memory stick itself. This delivers a cleaner, more efficient 1.25V power supply for enhanced stability during heavy operational stress. Alongside it, an integrated <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> engine continuously monitors and corrects internal data bit errors in real time, defending your computer against sudden system crashes or file corruption during long-duration runs.</p><p>True to Corsair’s high engineering legacy, this non-RGB memory features hand-sorted memory chips mounted on a custom high-performance PCB, all wrapped inside a sleek solid aluminum heat spreader that draws thermal energy away rapidly. Standing at a low profile, it completely prevents physical clearance conflicts, fitting effortlessly underneath large dual-fan CPU air towers or inside tight small-form-factor (SFF) Mini-ITX chassis setups. Supporting dual performance profiles for <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> and <strong>AMD EXPO</strong>, it lets you achieve its full rated speeds with a simple, single-click toggle inside the BIOS right out of the box.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (1 x 16GB Single Module Configuration)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>5600 MHz (5600 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL40-40-40-77</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.25V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.1V / 4800MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height Profile</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Low-Profile Compact Clearance Design</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Classic Matte Black / Matte Grey</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Minimalist Finish</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Dual Profile Support: Intel XMP 3.0 &amp; AMD EXPO</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel &amp; AMD DDR5 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/S2tABWmESi53ts2ttd985rLp1mXBqkov9Casfrzd.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:21:50', '2026-07-13 10:21:50', 'Corsair Vengeance 16GB DDR5 DRAM 5600MHz C40 RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair Vengeance 16GB DDR5 5600MHz C40 desktop memory. Features high-speed DDR5 architectural performance, low-profile aluminum heat spreader, and Intel XMP 3.0 / AMD EXPO support.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance DDR5 16GB, 16GB DDR5 5600MHz RAM, Corsair Vengeance 5600MT/s C40, low-profile DDR5 desktop memory, non-RGB Corsair DDR5 upgrade, high-speed PC memory.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1430, 'Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 5600MHz CL40 Desktop RAM iosbd', 'Illuminate your system with next-generation performance and vibrant style using the Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 5600MHz CL40 Desktop RAM. Engineered to fully unlock the processing power of modern Intel and AMD cutting-edge platforms, this high-performance 16GB U-DIMM module runs at a swift 5600MHz frequency to banish multitasking bottlenecks. It features a stunning panoramic light bar packed with ten individually addressable, ultra-bright RGB LEDs that integrate seamlessly with Corsair iCUE software, alongside onboard PMIC voltage regulation and built-in On-die ECC for rock-solid computing stability.', 'corsair-vengeance-rgb-16gb-ddr5-5600mhz-cl40-desktop-ram-iosbd-1783964013', '<p>Illuminate your system with next-generation performance and vibrant style using the <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 5600MHz CL40 Desktop RAM</strong>. Engineered to fully unlock the processing power of modern Intel and AMD cutting-edge platforms, this high-performance 16GB U-DIMM module runs at a swift 5600MHz frequency to banish multitasking bottlenecks. It features a stunning panoramic light bar packed with <strong>ten individually addressable, ultra-bright RGB LEDs</strong> that integrate seamlessly with Corsair iCUE software, alongside onboard PMIC voltage regulation and built-in On-die ECC for rock-solid computing stability.&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (Available in 1 x 16GB Single Module or 2 x 8GB Kit layouts)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>5600 MHz (5600 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL40-40-40-77 (EXPO/XMP variants can scale to CL40-40-40-70 under load)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.25V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.1V / 4800MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management Tech</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Dual-Tone Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>10 Individually Addressable LEDs (Dynamic Ten-Zone Panoramic RGB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ecosystem Integration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Corsair iCUE Ecosystem &amp; Motherboard RGB Software Sync</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Dual Profile Support: Intel XMP 3.0 &amp; AMD EXPO</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel (600/700/800 Series) &amp; AMD DDR5 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Limited Lifetime Product Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 28000.00, 28000.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/1IAru8KFFBkYGgOrhA2AitIqsxNUGvN4pXjDdnfL.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:22:46', '2026-07-13 17:33:33', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 5600MHz CL40 Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 5600MHz CL40 desktop memory. Features dynamic 10-zone panoramic RGB lighting, onboard PMIC, and Intel XMP 3.0 / AMD EXPO support.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance RGB DDR5 16GB, 16GB DDR5 5600MHz RGB RAM, Corsair Vengeance RGB 5600MT/s, ten-zone RGB DDR5 desktop memory, Corsair iCUE DDR5 upgrade, high-speed gaming RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1431, 'Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM iosb', 'Propel your desktop system into the high-frequency era of next-generation computing with the Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM. Optimized to hit the performance sweet spot for modern Intel and AMD multi-core platforms, this high-speed 16GB single module operates at a blistering 6000MHz to eliminate multitasking bottlenecks. Wrapped inside an ultra-compact, low-profile solid aluminum heat spreader for universal CPU cooler clearance, it features an on-board Overclock PMIC and built-in Error-Correcting Code (ECC) to supply rock-solid desktop stability.', 'corsair-vengeance-16gb-ddr5-6000mhz-desktop-ram-iosb-1783963937', '<p>Clear out processing bottlenecks and future-proof your custom hardware layout with the high-bandwidth <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Specifically optimized to feed data-hungry modern multi-core processors, this 16GB U-DIMM module provides a massive evolutionary leap forward in data transfer speeds compared to older architectures. Running at a blazing-fast 6000MHz frequency with highly optimized latency timings, it significantly accelerates the core communication lanes between your CPU and active storage pipelines—slashing application load times, smoothing out 4K video editing queues, and ensuring fluid, high-frame-rate performance during intense AAA gaming sessions.</p><p>The Corsair VENGEANCE DDR5 platform places an uncompromising focus on structural data security and precise power distribution. The module incorporates an <strong>On-board Overclock PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong>, which shifts complex voltage regulation away from older motherboard designs and onto the memory stick itself. This delivers a cleaner, more efficient 1.35V power supply for enhanced stability during heavy operational stress. Alongside it, an integrated <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> engine continuously monitors and corrects internal data bit errors in real time, defending your computer against sudden application lockups or file corruption.</p><p>True to Corsair’s high engineering legacy, this non-RGB memory features hand-sorted memory chips mounted on a custom high-performance PCB, all wrapped inside a sleek solid aluminum heat spreader that draws thermal energy away rapidly. Standing at a low profile, it completely prevents physical clearance conflicts, fitting effortlessly underneath large dual-fan CPU air towers or inside tight small-form-factor (SFF) Mini-ITX chassis setups. Supporting dual performance profiles for <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> and <strong>AMD EXPO</strong>, it lets you achieve its full rated speeds with a simple, single-click toggle inside the BIOS right out of the box.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (1 x 16GB Single Module Configuration)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>6000 MHz (6000 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL36-44-44-96 / CL40-40-40-77 (Batch Dependent)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V - 1.40V (Profile Dependent)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.1V / 4800MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height Profile</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Low-Profile Compact Clearance Design</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Classic Matte Black / Dark Grey</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Sleek Minimalist Finish</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Dual Profile Support: Intel XMP 3.0 &amp; AMD EXPO</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Intel (600/700/800 Series) &amp; AMD (600/800 Series) Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 26500.00, 26500.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/YEegk6Aa3p8VyzpdV1E2Nfs4a1TeicfVzxDlk606.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:24:04', '2026-07-13 17:32:17', 'Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM', 'vCorsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM\r\nMeta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6000MHz desktop memory. Features next-gen frequencies, low-profile aluminum heat spreaders, and dual XMP 3.0 & AMD EXPO overclocking.', 'Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1432, 'Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL30 Desktop RAM iosbd', 'Propel your system into the absolute sweet spot of next-generation performance with the low-latency Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL30 Desktop RAM. Optimized to hit the peak efficiency threshold for modern multi-core AMD and Intel platforms, this high-speed 16GB module pairs a blazing-fast 6000MHz frequency with an ultra-tight CL30 latency profile to eliminate frame-time stutters. Wrapped inside an ultra-compact, low-profile aluminum heat spreader, it features onboard PMIC voltage regulation and built-in Error-Correcting Code (ECC) for rock-solid computing stability.', 'corsair-vengeance-16gb-ddr5-6000mhz-cl30-desktop-ram-iosbd-1783963848', '<p>latency <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL30 Desktop RAM</strong>. While high frequencies are critical, pairing a blistering <strong>6000MHz speed</strong> with a tight <strong>CL30 timing profile</strong> drastically reduces the physical access latency between your CPU and active storage arrays. This creates immediate data responsiveness across your system, significantly speeding up complex background render queues, shortening game level load cycles, and smoothing out frame delivery during intensive, high-refresh-rate AAA gaming sessions.</p><p>The underlying architecture of the Corsair VENGEANCE DDR5 platform is engineered around precision hardware protection and clean power distribution. The module integrates an <strong>On-board Overclock PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong>, which shifts complex voltage regulation directly onto the RAM stick itself rather than relying on legacy motherboard channels. This enables cleaner, highly stable power deployment under heavy load. Paired with an integrated <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> engine that constantly detects and corrects bit errors in real time, it protects your operating system from sudden application lockups or file corruption during long-duration runs.</p><p>Built for clean aesthetics and maximum structural utility, this non-RGB module features hand-sorted memory chips resting on a high-performance signal PCB. The array is encased in a premium solid aluminum heat spreader that rapidly radiates thermal energy away from the underlying components. Standing at a low profile, it prevents physical component conflicts, letting the memory module slide effortlessly underneath large dual-fan tower air coolers or into cramped small-form-factor (SFF) Mini-ITX chassis setups. Fully supporting both <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> and <strong>AMD EXPO</strong> dual performance frameworks, you can instantly lock in its low-latency, high-frequency profile with a single click inside your BIOS.</p>', '<h2>&nbsp;</h2><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (1 x 16GB Single Module Configuration)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>6000 MHz (6000 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL30-36-36-76</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V - 1.40V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.1V / 4800MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management Tech</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height Profile</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Low-Profile Compact Clearance Design</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Classic Matte Black</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Sleek Minimalist Finish</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Dual Profile Support: Intel XMP 3.0 &amp; AMD EXPO</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel &amp; AMD DDR5 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p>', 'Ram', 9000.00, 9000.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/KfB71wdUdQYAMUlq9clwXjfXJg7kCUZMRN7QA8mJ.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:24:58', '2026-07-13 17:30:48', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL30 Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL30 desktop memory. Features low-latency C30 timing, low-profile aluminum heat spreaders, and dual XMP 3.0 & EXPO support.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance DDR5 16GB CL30, 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL30 RAM, Corsair Vengeance 6000MT/s C30, low-latency DDR5 desktop memory, non-RGB Corsair DDR5 upgrade, high-speed gaming PC RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1433, 'Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6400MHz Desktop RAM iosbd', 'Propel your desktop system into the upper echelons of next-generation performance with the blazing-fast Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6400MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered to extract peak bandwidth from modern multi-core platforms, this elite 16GB single module operates at an incredible 6400MHz frequency to banish processing bottlenecks. Wrapped inside an ultra-compact, low-profile solid aluminum heat spreader for universal CPU cooler clearance, it features an on-board Overclock PMIC and built-in Error-Correcting Code (ECC) to supply rock-solid desktop stability.', 'corsair-vengeance-16gb-ddr5-6400mhz-desktop-ram-iosbd-1783963766', '<p>vClear out processing data bottlenecks and future-proof your custom hardware layout with the high-bandwidth <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6400MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Specifically optimized to feed data-hungry modern multi-core processors, this 16GB U-DIMM module provides a colossal evolutionary leap forward in data transfer rates compared to older memory generations. Running at an extreme 6400MHz frequency with an optimized <strong>CL36 or CL40 latency profile</strong>, it significantly accelerates the core communication lanes between your CPU and active storage pipelines—slashing application load times, smoothing out 4K/8K video editing queues, and ensuring fluid, high-frame-rate performance during intense AAA gaming sessions.</p><p>The Corsair VENGEANCE DDR5 platform places an uncompromising focus on structural data security and precise power distribution. The module incorporates an <strong>On-board Overclock PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong>, which shifts complex voltage regulation away from older motherboard designs and onto the memory stick itself. This delivers a cleaner, more efficient 1.40V power supply for enhanced stability during heavy operational stress. Alongside it, an integrated <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> engine continuously monitors and corrects internal data bit errors in real time, defending your computer against sudden application lockups or file corruption.</p><p>True to Corsair’s high engineering legacy, this non-RGB memory features hand-sorted memory chips mounted on a custom high-performance PCB, all wrapped inside a sleek solid aluminum heat spreader that draws thermal energy away rapidly. Standing at a low profile, it completely prevents physical clearance conflicts, fitting effortlessly underneath large dual-fan CPU air towers or inside tight small-form-factor (SFF) Mini-ITX chassis setups. Supporting the <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> performance profile, it lets you achieve its full rated speeds with a simple, single-click toggle inside the BIOS right out of the box.</p><h2>Technical Specifications</h2>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (1 x 16GB Single Module Configuration)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>6400 MHz (6400 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL36-48-48-104 / CL40-40-40-77 (Batch Dependent)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.40V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.1V / 4800MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height Profile</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Low-Profile Compact Clearance Design</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Classic Matte Black</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Sleek Minimalist Finish</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel (600/700/800 Series) &amp; Compatible DDR5 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 26450.00, 26450.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/iwlb8Aw78Tevydrb2HuDX2SXOE7eELiSavAoqfbH.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:25:51', '2026-07-13 17:29:26', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6400MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6400MHz desktop memory. Features high-speed 6400MT/s frequencies, a low-profile aluminum heat spreader, and Intel XMP 3.0 support.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance DDR5 16GB, 16GB DDR5 6400MHz RAM, Corsair Vengeance 6400MT/s, low-profile DDR5 desktop memory, non-RGB Corsair DDR5 upgrade, high-speed gaming PC RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL);
