(1434, 'Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL36 Desktop RAM White', 'Bring elite, low-latency performance and a breathtaking clean aesthetic to your system with the Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL36 Desktop RAM White. Specially styled with a beautiful matte white aluminum heat spreader, this high-performance 16GB U-DIMM module hits the next-gen performance sweet spot, pairing a blazing-fast 6000MHz frequency with a tight CL36 latency profile. Featuring a top-mounted, panoramic 10-zone dynamic RGB lightbar that syncs natively via Corsair iCUE software, it provides exceptional multitasking responsiveness and rock-solid stability for clean, premium snow-white themed gaming configurations.', 'corsair-vengeance-rgb-16gb-ddr5-6000mhz-cl36-desktop-ram-white-1783938409', '<p>Perfect your custom system architecture while shifting your hardware capabilities into high gear with the <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL36 Desktop RAM White</strong>. Engineered to maximize the data processing limits of modern multi-core Intel and AMD processors, this 16GB DDR5 module delivers a massive evolutionary leap forward in memory bandwidth. By combining an ultra-fast <strong>6000MHz speed</strong> with a tight, low-latency <strong>CL36 timing profile</strong>, it drastically cuts down the communication delay between your CPU and storage components. This translates into immediate application load times, faster background render queues, and incredibly smooth frame delivery during high-refresh-rate AAA gaming or live streaming workloads.</p><p>The defining visual crown jewel of this premium memory module is its striking <strong>dynamic ten-zone RGB lightbar</strong>. Encased inside an unobstructed, panoramic light pipe along the top ridge, the ultra-bright LEDs deliver exceptionally uniform color dispersion visible from virtually any viewing angle inside your chassis. Controlled completely through the powerful <strong>Corsair iCUE software ecosystem</strong>, you can design intricate, multi-layered lighting animations, synchronize colors across all your iCUE-compatible hardware, or set up real-time, temperature-reactive lighting profiles that change color based on system heat.</p><p>Underneath the brilliant illumination sits a premium solid aluminum heat spreader finished in a pristine matte white that rapidly conducts heat away to sustain safe operational thresholds. The VENGEANCE RGB DDR5 platform integrates an <strong>On-board Overclock PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong>, shifting complex voltage regulation directly onto the RAM stick itself rather than relying on legacy motherboard channels for highly refined power distribution. Backed by built-in <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> to identify and fix data bit errors in real time, this memory module supports dual <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> and <strong>AMD EXPO</strong> frameworks, letting you achieve its full performance speeds with a simple single-click BIOS toggle right out of the box.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (Available in 1 x 16GB Single Module or 2 x 8GB Kit layouts)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>6000 MHz (6000 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL36-44-44-96 / CL36-36-36-76 (Batch Dependent)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V - 1.40V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.1V / 4800MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management Tech</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Premium Spotless Matte White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>10 Individually Addressable LEDs (Dynamic Ten-Zone Panoramic RGB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ecosystem Integration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Corsair iCUE Ecosystem &amp; Motherboard RGB Software Sync</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Dual Profile Support: Intel XMP 3.0 &amp; AMD EXPO</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel (600/700/800 Series) &amp; AMD (600/800 Series) DDR5 Setups</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Limited Lifetime Product Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 27500.00, 27500.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/BNkqbZrTrZzn87JNfHVA7pmxUCgPknf5v80Q7znT.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:26:49', '2026-07-13 17:27:18', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL36 Desktop RAM - White', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL36 desktop memory in White. Features a 10-zone panoramic RGB lightbar, onboard PMIC, and Intel XMP 3.0 / AMD EXPO.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance RGB DDR5 16GB White, 16GB DDR5 6000MHz white RAM, Corsair Vengeance RGB 6000MT/s CL36, white gaming DDR5 desktop memory, Corsair iCUE white DDR5 upgrade, high-speed low-latency white RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1435, 'Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 5600MHz RAM', 'Illuminate your system with next-generation performance and vibrant style using the Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered to fully unlock the processing power of modern Intel and AMD cutting-edge platforms, this high-performance 16GB U-DIMM module runs at a swift 5600MHz frequency to banish multitasking bottlenecks. It features a stunning panoramic light bar packed with ten individually addressable, ultra-bright RGB LEDs that integrate seamlessly with Corsair iCUE software, alongside onboard Overclock PMIC voltage regulation and built-in On-die ECC for rock-solid computing stability.', 'corsair-vengeance-rgb-16gb-ddr5-5600mhz-ram-1783938453', '<p>dropping visual layout with the <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Purpose-built to clear away processing bottlenecks in data-hungry multi-core processors, this 16GB DDR5 module provides a massive leap forward in memory bandwidth compared to legacy architectures. Running at a fast 5600MHz frequency with a stable <strong>CL40 or CL36 timing profile</strong> at 1.25V, it slashes application load cycles, accelerates complex data queues, and ensures ultra-smooth frame delivery during heavy AAA gaming, streaming, or content creation workloads.</p><p>The visual crown jewel of this premium memory module is its striking <strong>dynamic ten-zone RGB lighting system</strong>. Encased inside an unobstructed, panoramic light pipe that spans the top ridge of the module, the ultra-bright LEDs deliver exceptionally uniform color dispersion visible from virtually any viewing angle inside your chassis. Controlled completely through the powerful <strong>Corsair iCUE software ecosystem</strong>, you can design intricate, multi-layered lighting animations, synchronize colors across all your iCUE-compatible fans and peripherals, or set up real-time, temperature-reactive lighting alerts that change color based on system heat.</p><p