al</td><td>Dual-Tone Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>10 Individually Addressable LEDs (Dynamic Ten-Zone Panoramic RGB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ecosystem Integration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Corsair iCUE Ecosystem &amp; Motherboard RGB Software Sync</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Dual Profile Support: Intel XMP 3.0 &amp; AMD EXPO</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel (600/700/800 Series) &amp; AMD DDR5 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 28000.00, 28000.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/Cd9f2BQ19SoYlrWrJWhUej7p4HtFT9c9VO4VltHw.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:27:33', '2026-07-13 17:26:13', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 5600MHz desktop memory. Features dynamic 10-zone panoramic RGB lighting, onboard PMIC voltage regulation, and dual Intel XMP 3.0 & AMD EXPO overclocking.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance RGB DDR5 16GB, 16GB DDR5 5600MHz RGB RAM, Corsair Vengeance RGB 5600MT/s, ten-zone RGB DDR5 desktop memory, Corsair iCUE DDR5 upgrade, high-speed gaming RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1436, 'Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz RAM', 'Illuminate your system configuration with next-generation speeds and brilliant style using the high-performance Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered to hit the performance sweet spot for cutting-edge Intel and AMD platforms, this 16GB U-DIMM module runs at a swift 6000MHz frequency to banish multitasking bottlenecks. It features a stunning panoramic light bar packed with ten individually addressable, ultra-bright RGB LEDs that integrate seamlessly with Corsair iCUE software, alongside onboard Overclock PMIC voltage regulation and built-in On-die ECC for rock-solid computing stability.', 'corsair-vengeance-rgb-16gb-ddr5-6000mhz-ram-1783938505', '<p>Propel your desktop rig into the high-frequency era of modern computing while crafting a jaw-dropping visual layout with the <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Purpose-built to clear away processing bottlenecks in data-hungry multi-core processors, this 16GB DDR5 module provides a massive leap forward in memory bandwidth compared to legacy standards. Running at a blazing-fast 6000MHz frequency with highly optimized timing profiles, it slashes application load cycles, accelerates complex data queues, and ensures ultra-smooth frame delivery during heavy AAA gaming, streaming, or content creation workloads.</p><p>The visual crown jewel of this premium memory module is its striking <strong>dynamic ten-zone RGB lighting system</strong>. Encased inside an unobstructed, panoramic light pipe that spans the top ridge of the module, the ultra-bright LEDs deliver exceptionally uniform color dispersion visible from virtually any viewing angle inside your chassis. Controlled completely through the powerful <strong>Corsair iCUE software ecosystem</strong>, you can design intricate, multi-layered lighting animations, synchronize colors across all your iCUE-compatible fans and peripherals, or set up real-time, temperature-reactive lighting alerts that change color based on system heat.</p><p>Underneath the brilliant light bar sits a premium solid aluminum heat spreader that rapidly wicks localized thermal energy away from the underlying components to maintain safe operational thresholds. The VENGEANCE RGB DDR5 platform integrates an <strong>On-board PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong>, shifting complex voltage regulation directly onto the RAM stick for highly refined, stable power distribution under load. Backed by built-in <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> to identify and fix data bit errors in real time, this memory module supports dual <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> and <strong>AMD EXPO</strong> frameworks, letting you achieve its full performance speeds with a single-click BIOS toggle right out of the box.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (Available in 1 x 16GB Single Module or 2 x 8GB Kit layouts)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>6000 MHz (6000 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL36-44-44-96 / CL40-40-40-77 (Batch Dependent)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V - 1.40V (Profile Dependent)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.1V / 4800MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management Tech</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board