(1437, 'Corsair VENGEANCE  DDR516GB 6600MHz Desktop RAM iosbd', 'Push your desktop system to elite boundaries of next-generation performance with the high-speed Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6600MHz Desktop RAM. Tailored for extreme enthusiasts and system tuners leveraging modern multi-core platforms, this single 16GB module handles an incredible 6600MHz frequency to entirely wipe out processing bottlenecks. Encased inside an ultra-compact, low-profile solid aluminum heat spreader for universal CPU tower cooler clearance, it features an on-board Overclock PMIC and built-in Error-Correcting Code (ECC) to supply rock-solid desktop stability.', 'corsair-vengeance-ddr516gb-6600mhz-desktop-ram-iosbd-1783963426', '<p>Clear out processing data bottlenecks and future-proof your custom hardware layout with the extreme-bandwidth <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6600MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Specifically optimized to feed data-hungry modern multi-core processors, this 16GB U-DIMM module provides a colossal evolutionary leap forward in data transfer rates compared to older memory generations. Running at a blistering 6600MHz frequency with highly optimized latency timings, it significantly accelerates the core communication lanes between your CPU and active storage pipelines—slashing application load times, smoothing out 4K/8K video editing queues, and ensuring fluid, high-frame-rate performance during intense AAA gaming sessions or competitive benchmarking runs.</p><p>The Corsair VENGEANCE DDR5 platform places an uncompromising focus on structural data security and precise power distribution. The module incorporates an <strong>On-board Overclock PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong>, which shifts complex voltage regulation away from older motherboard designs and onto the memory stick itself. This delivers a cleaner, more efficient 1.40V power supply for enhanced stability during heavy operational stress. Alongside it, an integrated <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> engine continuously monitors and corrects internal data bit errors in real time, defending your computer against sudden application lockups or file corruption.</p><p>True to Corsair’s high engineering legacy, this non-RGB memory features hand-sorted memory chips mounted on a custom high-performance PCB, all wrapped inside a sleek solid aluminum heat spreader that draws thermal energy away rapidly. Standing at a low profile, it completely prevents physical clearance conflicts, fitting effortlessly underneath large dual-fan CPU air towers or inside tight small-form-factor (SFF) Mini-ITX chassis setups. Supporting the <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> performance profile, it lets you achieve its full rated speeds with a simple, single-click toggle inside the BIOS right out of the box.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (1 x 16GB Single Module Configuration)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>6600 MHz (6600 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL32-39-39-76 / CL34-40-40-77 (Batch Dependent)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.40V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.1V / 4800MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height Profile</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Low-Profile Compact Clearance Design</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Classic Matte Black</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Sleek Minimalist Finish</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel (700/800 Series) &amp; Compatible DDR5 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 20000.00, 20000.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/HHJPThLV3v59xYhRUg9LNXheeYtFjVJ13rinZVQ2.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:29:39', '2026-07-13 17:23:46', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6600MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6600MHz desktop memory. Features extreme 6600MT/s frequencies, a low-profile aluminum heat spreader, and Intel XMP 3.0 overclocking support.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance DDR5 16GB, 16GB DDR5 6600MHz RAM, Corsair Vengeance 6600MT/s, low-profile DDR5 desktop memory, non-RGB Corsair DDR5 upgrade, high-speed enthusiast PC memory.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
