ng animations, synchronize colors across all your iCUE-compatible hardware, or set up real-time, temperature-reactive lighting profiles that change color based on system heat.</p><p>Underneath the brilliant illumination sits a premium solid aluminum heat spreader finished in a spotless matte white that rapidly conducts heat away to sustain safe operational thresholds under load. The VENGEANCE RGB DDR5 platform integrates an <strong>On-board Overclock PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong>, shifting complex voltage regulation directly onto the RAM stick itself rather than relying on legacy motherboard channels for highly refined power distribution. Backed by built-in <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> to identify and fix data bit errors in real time, this memory module supports dual <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> and <strong>AMD EXPO</strong> frameworks, letting you achieve its full performance speeds with a simple single-click BIOS toggle right out of the box.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (Available in 1 x 16GB Single Module or 2 x 8GB Kit layouts)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>6000 MHz (6000 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL36-44-44-96 / CL40-40-40-77 (Batch Dependent)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V - 1.40V (Profile Dependent)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.1V / 4800MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management Tech</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Premium Spotless Matte White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>10 Individually Addressable LEDs (Dynamic Ten-Zone Panoramic RGB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ecosystem Integration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Corsair iCUE Ecosystem &amp; Motherboard RGB Software Sync</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Dual Profile Support: Intel XMP 3.0 &amp; AMD EXPO</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel (600/700/800 Series) &amp; AMD (600/800 Series) DDR5 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 27500.00, 27500.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/8XRj83qxQpyr7FJwAUiERkXRudW4FejbzVgkU87D.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:30:45', '2026-07-13 17:22:06', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM - White', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz desktop memory in White. Features a 10-zone panoramic RGB lightbar, onboard PMIC, and dual XMP 3.0 & AMD EXPO support.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance RGB DDR5 16GB White, 16GB DDR5 6000MHz white RAM, Corsair Vengeance RGB 6000MT/s, white gaming DDR5 desktop memory, Corsair iCUE white DDR5 upgrade, high-speed white PC RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1439, 'Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 7200MHz Desktop RAM iosbd', 'Push your high-end desktop system to the absolute bleeding edge of next-generation speed with the extreme-performance Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 7200MHz Desktop RAM. Purpose-built for hard-core enthusiasts, competitive overclockers, and cutting-edge multi-core platforms, this elite 16GB module handles an incredible 7200MHz frequency to entirely shatter data bottlenecks. Tucked inside an ultra-compact, low-profile solid aluminum heat spreader for universal CPU air tower and liquid radiator clearance, it integrates an on-board Overclock PMIC and built-in On-die ECC to maintain rock-solid computing stability at peak thresholds.', 'corsair-vengeance-16gb-ddr5-7200mhz-desktop-ram-iosbd-1783963220', '<p>Break through past performance ceilings and future-proof your high-end rig with the extreme-bandwidth <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 7200MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Meticulously optimized to feed the massive data appetites of elite modern processors, this 16GB U-DIMM module provides a staggering evolutionary leap forward in memory bandwidth. Operating at a blistering 7200MHz frequency with a tight, ultra-high-performance timing profile, it maximizes the data pipelines connecting your CPU and storage sub-systems—slashing application loading screens to milliseconds, accelerating complex 3D or AI render pipelines, and providing fluid, uncompromised frame delivery during high-refresh-rate competitive gaming sessions.</p><p>The underlying architecture of this premier DDR5 kit places an uncompromising focus on structural data security and highly refined power distribution. The module incorporates an <strong>On-board Overclock PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong>, which shifts complex voltage regulation directly onto the RAM stick itself rather than relying on standard motherboard lanes. This ensures ultra-clean, highly efficient power delivery under heavy operational stress or high voltage tuning. Alongside it, an integrated <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> engine continuously monitors and corrects internal data bit errors in real time, defending your operating system against sudden application crashes or file corruption during intensive runs.</p><p>True to Corsair’s premium build legacy, this non-RGB memory features hand-sorted, tightly screened memory ICs mounted on a custom high-performance signal PCB. The entire array is encased in a sleek, compact solid aluminum heat spreader that draws thermal energy away rapidly without adding bulk. Standing at a low profile, it completely prevents physical layout conflicts, letting it sit easily underneath large dual-fan CPU air towers or inside tight small-form-factor (SFF) Mini-ITX builds. Fully supporting the <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> performance profile framework, it lets you unlock its full enthusiast-grade speeds with a single-click toggle inside your syste</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (1 x 16GB Single Module Configuration)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>7200 MHz (7200 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL34-44-44-96 / CL36-46-46-116 (Batch Dependent)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.40V - 1.45V (Profile Dependent)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.1V / 4800MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height Profile</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Low-Profile Compact Clearance Design</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Classic Matte Black</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Sleek Minimalist Finish</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel Enthusiast Platforms (700/800 Series &amp; Compatible Motherboards)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 8500.00, 8500.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/OznY9yKFLAT9ZK8jdEIxasix553DypgQOztW001H.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:31:30', '2026-07-13 17:20:20', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 7200MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 7200MHz desktop memory. Features elite 7200MT/s frequencies, a low-profile aluminum heat spreader, and Intel XMP 3.0 overclocking support.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance DDR5 16GB, 16GB DDR5 7200MHz RAM, Corsair Vengeance 7200MT/s, low-profile DDR5 desktop memory, non-RGB Corsair DDR5 upgrade, extreme enthusiast PC memory.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1440, 'Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 5600MHz CL40 Desktop RAM iosbd', 'Propel your desktop system into the high-frequency era of next-generation computing with the Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 5600MHz CL40 Desktop RAM. Engineered to fully unlock the multi-core processing capabilities of modern Intel and AMD platforms, this high-performance 16GB module delivers a steady 5600MHz frequency to eliminate multitasking lag and smooth out heavy workloads. Housed inside an ultra-compact, low-profile solid aluminum heat spreader for universal case and cooler clearance, it features onboard PMIC voltage regulation and built-in Error-Correcting Code (ECC) to supply rock-solid desktop stability.', 'corsair-vengeance-16gb-ddr5-5600mhz-cl40-desktop-ram-iosbd-1783963147', '<p>Clear out processing bottlenecks and future-proof your custom PC build with the high-bandwidth <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 5600MHz CL40 Desktop RAM</strong>. Specifically optimized to efficiently feed data-hungry modern multi-core processors, this 16GB capacity module provides a massive evolutionary leap forward in data transfer speeds compared to legacy architectures. Running at an ultra-fast 5600MHz frequency with a stable CL40 latency profile, it significantly accelerates the core communication lanes between your CPU and active system storage—slashing application load times, reducing background micro-stutters, and ensuring fluid performance during multitasking, gaming, or content creation workflows.</p><p>The Corsair VENGEANCE DDR5 platform places an uncompromising focus on structural data security and precise power distribution. The module incorporates an <strong>On-board Overclock PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong>, which shifts complex voltage regulation away from older motherboard designs and onto the memory stick itself. This delivers a cleaner, more efficient 1.25V power supply for enhanced stability during heavy operational stress. Alongside it, an integrated <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> engine continuously monitors and corrects internal data bit errors in real time, defending your computer against sudden system crashes or file corruption during long-duration runs.</p><p>True to Corsair’s high engineering legacy, this non-RGB memory features hand-sorted memory chips mounted on a custom high-performance PCB, all wrapped inside a sleek solid aluminum heat spreader that draws thermal energy away rapidly. Standing at a low profile, it completely prevents physical clearance conflicts, fitting effortlessly underneath large dual-fan CPU air towers or inside tight small-form-factor (SFF) Mini-ITX chassis setups. Supporting dual performance profiles for <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> and <strong>AMD EXPO</strong>, it lets you achieve its full rated speeds with a simple, single-click toggle inside the BIOS right out of the box.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (1 x 16GB Single Module Configuration)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>5600 MHz (5600 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL40-40-40-77</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.25V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.1V / 4800MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height Profile</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Low-Profile Compact Clearance Design</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Classic Matte Black / Dark Grey</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Sleek Minimalist Finish</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Dual Profile Support: Intel XMP 3.0 &amp; AMD EXPO</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel &amp; AMD DDR5 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 28000.00, 28000.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/UnEJ1NuzamtGWwbSBVgRVfd93Pprq2nCm9iHYouG.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:32:29', '2026-07-13 17:19:07', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 5600MHz CL40 Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 5600MHz CL40 desktop memory. Features next-gen speeds, low-profile aluminum heat spreaders, and dual XMP 3.0 & EXPO support.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance DDR5 16GB, 16GB DDR5 5600MHz RAM, Corsair Vengeance 5600MT/s C40, low-profile DDR5 desktop memory, non-RGB Corsair DDR5 upgrade, high-speed gaming PC RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1441, 'Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6800MHz Desktop RAM iosbd', 'Push your desktop system to elite boundaries of next-generation performance with the high-speed Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6800MHz Desktop RAM. Tailored for high-end gaming rigs, workstation setups, and PC builders leveraging modern multi-core platforms, this single 16GB module handles an incredible 6800MHz frequency to entirely wipe out processing bottlenecks. Encased inside an ultra-compact, low-profile solid aluminum heat spreader for universal CPU tower cooler clearance, it features an on-board Overclock PMIC and built-in Error-Correcting Code (ECC) to supply rock-solid desktop stability.', 'corsair-vengeance-16gb-ddr5-6800mhz-desktop-ram-iosbd-1783963087', '<p>Clear out processing data bottlenecks and future-proof your custom hardware layout with the extreme-bandwidth <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6800MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Specifically optimized to feed data-hungry modern multi-core processors, this 16GB U-DIMM module provides a colossal evolutionary leap forward in data transfer rates compared to older memory standards. Running at a blistering 6800MHz frequency with highly optimized latency timings, it significantly accelerates the core communication lanes between your CPU and active storage pipelines—slashing application load times, smoothing out 4K/8K video editing queues, and ensuring fluid, high-frame-rate performance during intense AAA gaming sessions or competitive benchmarking runs.</p><p>The Corsair VENGEANCE DDR5 platform places an uncompromising focus on structural data security and precise power distribution. The module incorporates an <strong>On-board Overclock PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong>, which shifts complex voltage regulation away from older motherboard designs and onto the memory stick itself. This delivers a cleaner, more efficient 1.40V power supply for enhanced stability during heavy operational stress. Alongside it, an integrated <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> engine continuously monitors and corrects internal data bit errors in real time, defending your computer against sudden application lockups or file corruption.</p><p>True to Corsair’s high engineering legacy, this non-RGB memory features hand-sorted memory chips mounted on a custom high-performance PCB, all wrapped inside a sleek solid aluminum heat spreader that draws thermal energy away rapidly. Standing at a low profile, it completely prevents physical clearance conflicts, fitting effortlessly underneath large dual-fan CPU air towers or inside tight small-form-factor (SFF) Mini-ITX chassis setups. Supporting the <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> performance profile, it lets you achieve its full rated speeds with a simple, single-click toggle inside the BIOS right out of the box.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (1 x 16GB Single Module Configuration)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>6800 MHz (6800 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL34-46-46-105 / CL40-40-40-77 (Batch Dependent)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.40V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.1V / 4800MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height Profile</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Low-Profile Compact Clearance Design</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Classic Matte Black</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Sleek Minimalist Finish</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel (700/800 Series) &amp; Compatible DDR5 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 26500.00, 26500.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/2S3lmLcCybIWJFNcDO8T6hof5ci0GHvewdghBil5.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:33:16', '2026-07-13 17:18:07', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6800MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6800MHz desktop memory. Features extreme 6800MT/s speeds, a low-profile aluminum heat spreader, and Intel XMP 3.0 support.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance DDR5 16GB, 16GB DDR5 6800MHz RAM, Corsair Vengeance 6800MT/s, low-profile DDR5 desktop memory, non-RGB Corsair DDR5 upgrade, high-speed enthusiast PC memory.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL);
