(1442, 'Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6200MHz RAM iosbd', 'Illuminate your system configuration with next-generation speeds and brilliant style using the high-performance Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6200MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered to extract exceptional bandwidth from cutting-edge Intel and AMD platforms, this 16GB U-DIMM module runs at a swift 6200MHz frequency to banish multitasking bottlenecks. It features a stunning panoramic light bar packed with ten individually addressable, ultra-bright RGB LEDs that integrate seamlessly with Corsair iCUE software, alongside onboard Overclock PMIC voltage regulation and built-in On-die ECC for rock-solid computing stability.', 'corsair-vengeance-rgb-16gb-ddr5-6200mhz-ram-iosbd-1783962718', '<p>Propel your desktop rig into the high-frequency era of modern computing while crafting a jaw-dropping visual layout with the <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6200MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Purpose-built to clear away processing bottlenecks in data-hungry multi-core processors, this 16GB DDR5 module provides a massive leap forward in memory bandwidth compared to legacy standards. Running at a blazing-fast 6200MHz frequency with highly optimized timing profiles, it slashes application load cycles, accelerates complex data queues, and ensures ultra-smooth frame delivery during heavy AAA gaming, streaming, or content creation workloads.</p><p>The visual crown jewel of this premium memory module is its striking <strong>dynamic ten-zone RGB lighting system</strong>. Encased inside an unobstructed, panoramic light pipe that spans the top ridge of the module, the ultra-bright LEDs deliver exceptionally uniform color dispersion visible from virtually any viewing angle inside your chassis. Controlled completely through the powerful <strong>Corsair iCUE software ecosystem</strong>, you can design intricate, multi-layered lighting animations, synchronize colors across all your iCUE-compatible fans and peripherals, or set up real-time, temperature-reactive lighting alerts that change color based on system heat.</p><p>Underneath the brilliant light bar sits a premium solid aluminum heat spreader that rapidly wicks localized thermal energy away from the underlying components to maintain safe operational thresholds. The VENGEANCE RGB DDR5 platform integrates an <strong>On-board PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong>, shifting complex voltage regulation directly onto the RAM stick for highly refined, stable power distribution under load. Backed by built-in <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> to identify and fix data bit errors in real time, this memory module supports the <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> framework, letting you achieve its full performance speeds with a single-click BIOS toggle right out of the box.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (Available in 1 x 16GB Single Module or 2 x 8GB Kit layouts)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>6200 MHz (6200 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL36-46-46-100 / CL36-39-39-76 (Batch Dependent)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.40V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.1V / 4800MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management Tech</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Dual-Tone Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>10 Individually Addressable LEDs (Dynamic Ten-Zone Panoramic RGB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ecosystem Integration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Corsair iCUE Ecosystem &amp; Motherboard RGB Software Sync</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel (600/700/800 Series) &amp; Compatible DDR5 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 22000.00, 22000.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/tGXCCfYuVdbaf5LUbNQGOH5MCj7KL5VA92CdeR8M.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:33:54', '2026-07-13 17:11:58', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6200MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6200MHz desktop memory. Features dynamic 10-zone panoramic RGB lighting, onboard PMIC voltage regulation, and Intel XMP 3.0 support.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance RGB DDR5 16GB, 16GB DDR5 6200MHz RGB RAM, Corsair Vengeance RGB 6200MT/s, ten-zone RGB DDR5 desktop memory, Corsair iCUE DDR5 upgrade, high-speed gaming RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1443, 'Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL28 Desktop RAM iosbd', 'Ignite your system configuration with top-tier low-latency performance and spectacular lighting using the Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL28 Desktop RAM. Tuned for pure efficiency on next-generation Intel and AMD platforms, this elite 16GB U-DIMM module hits the performance sweet spot by pairing a swift 6000MHz frequency with an ultra-tight CL28 latency profile to eliminate system stutters. Featuring a panoramic 10-zone dynamic RGB lightbar controlled by Corsair iCUE software, it pairs stunning high-fidelity aesthetics with an onboard Overclock PMIC and On-die ECC for competitive computing stability.', 'corsair-vengeance-rgb-16gb-ddr5-6000mhz-cl28-desktop-ram-iosbd-1783963015', '<p>Extract maximum computational response out of your high-end multi-core processor with the ultra-low latency <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL28 Desktop RAM</strong>. While high frequencies are critical for data throughput, dropping the access latency down to a tight <strong>CL28 timing profile</strong> at a blistering <strong>6000MHz speed</strong> significantly slashes data transmission delays between your CPU and active system memory. This yields a massive competitive edge for system performance—greatly smoothing out micro-stutters during high-refresh-rate AAA gaming, speeding up heavy multitasking workloads, and accelerating demanding content creation tasks like real-time video rendering or code compiling.</p><p>The defining visual highlight of this high-performance module is its striking <strong>dynamic ten-zone RGB lightbar</strong>. Positioned inside an unobstructed, panoramic light pipe stretching across the top ridge of the stick, the ultra-bright LEDs deliver exceptionally vibrant and uniform color gradients visible from any angle inside your case window. Fully managed by the powerful <strong>Corsair iCUE software ecosystem</strong>, you can create complex, custom multi-layered lighting animations, sync themes across your entire collection of iCUE-compatible fans or liquid coolers, or assign real-time temperature alerts that dynamically shift colors based on hardware heat.</p><p>Beneath the radiant illumination sits a premium solid aluminum heat spreader designed to rapidly conduct thermal energy away from the underlying components, protecting hardware health during prolonged operational loads. The VENGEANCE RGB DDR5 architecture integrates an advanced <strong>On-board PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong>, shifting complex voltage regulation off the motherboard and onto the module itself for highly stable power deployment. Backed by built-in <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> to identify and repair bit errors in real time, this premium module supports dual <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> and <strong>AMD EXPO</strong> frameworks, letting you unlock its extreme low-latency limits with a single-click BIOS toggle right out of the box.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (Available in 1 x 16GB Single Module or 2 x 8GB Kit layouts)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>6000 MHz (6000 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL28-36-36-76 / CL28-38-38-80 (Batch Dependent)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V - 1.40V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.1V / 4800MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management Tech</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Dual-Tone Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>10 Individually Addressable LEDs (Dynamic Ten-Zone Panoramic RGB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ecosystem Integration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Corsair iCUE Ecosystem &amp; Motherboard RGB Software Sync</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Dual Profile Support: Intel XMP 3.0 &amp; AMD EXPO</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel (600/700/800 Series) &amp; AMD (600/800 Series) DDR5 Setups</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 32500.00, 32500.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/e090LmMWqAg9RUqbkMMblQyx3gHrlagWDH8DFxva.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:34:49', '2026-07-13 17:16:55', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL28 Desktop RAM', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL28 Desktop RAM', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance RGB DDR5 16GB CL28, 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL28 RAM, Corsair Vengeance RGB 6000MT/s C28, ultra low latency DDR5 desktop memory, Corsair iCUE DDR5 upgrade, high-speed gaming RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1444, 'Corsair VENGEANCE RGB PRO SL 16GB (2x8GB) DDR4 3200MHz C16 RAM Kit iosbd', 'Bring breathtaking multi-zone illumination and peak dual-channel performance to your system configuration without sacrificing hardware clearance using the Corsair VENGEANCE RGB PRO SL 16GB (2x8GB) DDR4 3200MHz C16 RAM Kit. Specially optimized with a slimmed-down, 44mm low-profile form factor, this high-performance matching 2x8GB desktop memory kit features a stunning dynamic RGB lightbar that syncs natively via Corsair iCUE. Housed inside a premium anodized aluminum heat spreader, it runs at a swift 3200MHz frequency with a tight CL16 latency profile, making it the ultimate addition to clean, high-performance custom gaming PC builds.', 'corsair-vengeance-rgb-pro-sl-16gb-2x8gb-ddr4-3200mhz-c16-ram-kit-iosbd-1783962913', '<p>erfect your custom system architecture and resolve physical layout conflicts with the optimized <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE RGB PRO SL 16GB (2x8GB) DDR4 3200MHz C16 RAM Kit</strong>. The \"SL\" (Slim Line) series is specifically engineered to retain the iconic aesthetics of enthusiast memory while lowering the overall physical module height. Built as a matched pair of two 8GB modules running in dual-channel configuration, this kit is constructed on a custom high-performance signal PCB paired with thoroughly screened, hand-selected memory chips. Operating at a high-speed <strong>3200MHz frequency via Intel XMP 2.0</strong> with optimized <strong>CL16-20-20-38 timings</strong> at 1.35V, it shortens active application loading cycles, stabilizes modern frame delivery during gaming setups, and eliminates multitasking bottlenecks.</p><p>The standout mechanical feature of this premium memory kit is its broad physical compatibility. Standing at a compact <strong>44mm module height</strong>, it effortlessly clears massive dual-fan tower CPU air coolers and fits easily into tight small-form-factor (SFF) Mini-ITX chassis frames where standard tall RGB modules would collide with hardware elements. Crowning each stick is a beautiful panoramic light pipe holding <strong>ten individually addressable, ultra-bright RGB LEDs</strong> that require no extra cables for installation.</p><p>Fully integrated into the comprehensive <strong>Corsair iCUE software suite</strong>, you can custom-design complex multi-layered color presets, synchronize lighting across all your iCUE-compatible fans, coolers, and peripherals, or set up real-time temperature-reactive visual alerts. Wrapped inside an anodized aluminum heat spreader for superior passive cooling under load, this dual-channel memory kit delivers a perfect blend of high-speed reliability, wide system compatibility, and flawless premium style.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Kit Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB Kit (2 x 8GB Dual-Channel Layout)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Speed / Frequency</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>3200 MHz (PC4-25600)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL16-20-20-38</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.2V / 2133MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Latency</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>15-15-15-36</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height Profile</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>44 mm (Compact Slim-Line Height / Broad Cooler Clearance)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Scheme</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Premium Stealth Black / Matte White (Variant Dependent)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>10 Individually Addressable LEDs (Dynamic Multi-Zone RGB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ecosystem Integration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Corsair iCUE Ecosystem &amp; Motherboard RGB Software Sync</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profile</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel (300/400/500/600/700 Series) &amp; AMD DDR4 Setups</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Limited Lifetime Product Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 17000.00, 17000.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/hvWMZfLrA1eKPQTB57RBV3OPuoSLVcK8VsI8M9Hj.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:35:59', '2026-07-13 17:15:13', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE RGB PRO SL 16GB (2x8GB) DDR4 3200MHz C16 RAM Kit', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE RGB PRO SL 16GB (2x8GB) DDR4 3200MHz C16 desktop memory kit. Features a compact 44mm profile, 10-zone RGB lightbar, and Intel XMP 2.0.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance RGB Pro SL 16GB, 2x8GB DDR4 3200MHz C16 RAM, Corsair Vengeance SL 16GB kit, compact RGB gaming RAM, Corsair iCUE SL dual channel, 3200MHz CL16 PC memory.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1445, 'Corsair DOMINATOR PLATINUM RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz RAM iosbd', 'Bring breathtaking multi-zone illumination and peak dual-channel performance to your system configuration without sacrificing hardware clearance using the Corsair VENGEANCE RGB PRO SL 16GB (2x8GB) DDR4 3200MHz C16 RAM Kit. Specially optimized with a slimmed-down, 44mm low-profile form factor, this high-performance matching 2x8GB desktop memory kit features a stunning dynamic RGB lightbar that syncs natively via Corsair iCUE. Housed inside a premium anodized aluminum heat spreader, it runs at a swift 3200MHz frequency with a tight CL16 latency profile, making it the ultimate addition to clean, high-performance custom gaming PC builds.', 'corsair-dominator-platinum-rgb-16gb-ddr5-6000mhz-ram-iosbd-1783962849', '<p>Experience the absolute pinnacle of luxury engineering and high-frequency performance with the <strong>Corsair DOMINATOR PLATINUM RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. As Corsair\'s premiere flagship memory line, DOMINATOR PLATINUM DDR5 is built exclusively with hand-sorted, tightly screened high-frequency memory ICs resting on a custom high-performance signal PCB. Operating at a blistering <strong>6000MHz sweet-spot speed</strong>, it vastly widens the processing pipelines connecting your CPU and storage array—reducing background micro-stutters, slashing file compression times, and unlocking flawless frame pacing during top-tier AAA gaming or rendering workloads.</p><p>What truly isolates the DOMINATOR PLATINUM platform from standard memory kits is its legendary, heavy-duty mechanical cooling architecture. It features patented <strong>DHX (Dual-Path Heat Exchange) Cooling technology</strong>, which embeds the heat sink directly into the custom PCB layers alongside a robust die-cast aluminum top bar. This design pulls damaging thermal energy away from both the front face of the memory chips and the internal circuit traces simultaneously, ensuring the module maintains maximum stability even under intense, long-duration voltage tuning.</p><p>The aesthetic presentation is equally elite. The top configuration features an array of <strong>12 individually addressable CAPELLIX RGB LEDs</strong>. These specialized emitters are physically smaller and vastly brighter than conventional standard LEDs while consuming significantly less power. Controlled natively via the advanced <strong>Corsair iCUE software ecosystem</strong>, you can orchestrate stunning multi-layered lighting arrays or coordinate real-time, temperature-reactive lighting patterns. Complete with an <strong>On-board Overclock PMIC</strong> for highly refined power delivery and automated <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> profile tracking, this premium module stands as the definitive gold standard for enthusiast system builds.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (Available in 1 x 16GB Single Module or 2 x 8GB Kit layouts)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>6000 MHz (6000 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL36-38-38-76 / CL40-40-40-77 (Batch Dependent)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Technology</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Patented DHX (Dual-Path Heat Exchange) Cooling System</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Construction</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Precision Die-Cast Aluminum Structural Shell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management Tech</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>12 Individually Addressable Ultra-Bright CAPELLIX LEDs</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ecosystem Integration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Corsair iCUE Ecosystem &amp; Motherboard RGB Sync</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Premium Intel (600/700/800 Series) &amp; Compatible DDR5 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 14000.00, 14000.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/ePFjF6ufa0ilC4cNyW1RKFxhWwdlSuqWIdJkT77V.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:37:04', '2026-07-13 17:14:09', 'Meta Title: Corsair DOMINATOR PLATINUM RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the elite Corsair DOMINATOR PLATINUM RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz desktop memory. Features DHX cooling system, 12 Capellix RGB LEDs, and Intel XMP 3.0.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Dominator Platinum DDR5 16GB, 16GB DDR5 6000MHz Dominator, Corsair 6000MT/s premium RAM, Capellix RGB DDR5 desktop memory, Corsair iCUE Dominator upgrade, enthusiast gaming PC RAM.', NULL, 157, NULL, NULL),
(1446, 'Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6000MHz RAM White iosbd', 'Propel your desktop system into the high-frequency era of next-generation computing while curating a pristine aesthetic with the Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6000MHz RAM White. Engineered to hit the performance sweet spot for modern multi-core AMD and Intel platforms, this high-speed 16GB module operates at a blistering 6000MHz to eliminate processing lag. Wrapped inside an ultra-compact, low-profile solid aluminum heat spreader finished in spotless white, it features onboard PMIC voltage regulation and built-in Error-Correcting Code (ECC) to supply rock-solid desktop stability.', 'corsair-vengeance-16gb-ddr5-6000mhz-ram-white-iosbd-1783962783', '<p>Clear out processing bottlenecks and perfect your clean, snow-white custom PC layout with the high-bandwidth <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6000MHz RAM White</strong>. Specifically optimized to efficiently feed the data-heavy pipelines of modern multi-core processors, this 16GB U-DIMM module provides a massive evolutionary leap forward in data transfer speeds compared to legacy standards. Running at an ultra-fast 6000MHz frequency with a low-latency CL36 or CL40 timing profile, it significantly accelerates the core communication lanes between your CPU and active system arrays—slashing application load times, reducing background micro-stutters, and ensuring fluid, high-frame-rate performance during intense gaming, content creation, or multi-tabbed web workflows.</p><p>The Corsair VENGEANCE DDR5 platform places an uncompromising focus on structural data security and precise power distribution. The module incorporates an <strong>On-board Overclock PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong>, which shifts complex voltage regulation away from older motherboard designs and onto the memory stick itself. This delivers a cleaner, more efficient 1.35V - 1.40V power supply for enhanced stability during heavy operational stress. Alongside it, an integrated <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> engine continuously monitors and corrects internal data bit errors in real time, defending your computer against sudden system crashes or file corruption during long-duration runs.</p><p>True to Corsair’s high engineering legacy, this non-RGB memory features hand-sorted memory chips mounted on a custom high-performance PCB, all wrapped inside a sleek solid aluminum heat spreader finished in premium white that draws thermal energy away rapidly. Standing at a low profile, it completely prevents physical clearance conflicts, fitting effortlessly underneath large dual-fan CPU air towers or inside tight small-form-factor (SFF) Mini-ITX chassis setups. Supporting dual performance profiles for <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> and <strong>AMD EXPO</strong>, it lets you achieve its full rated speeds with a simple, single-click toggle inside the BIOS right out of the box.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (1 x 16GB Single Module Configuration)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>6000 MHz (6000 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL36-44-44-96 / CL40-40-40-77 (Batch Dependent)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V - 1.40V (Profile Dependent)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.1V / 4800MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height Profile</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Low-Profile Compact Clearance Design</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Premium Spotless Matte White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Sleek Minimalist Finish</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Dual Profile Support: Intel XMP 3.0 &amp; AMD EXPO</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Intel (600/700/800 Series) &amp; AMD (600/800 Series) Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 7800.00, 7800.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/6oYrSm1ve1qL0kZIzl2kTUeYQGTSf3NUAxflYMF4.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:37:44', '2026-07-13 17:13:03', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM - White', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6000MHz desktop memory in White. Features next-gen speeds, an ultra-clean low-profile white aluminum heat spreader, and Intel XMP 3.0 / AMD EXPO support.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance DDR5 16GB White, 16GB DDR5 6000MHz white RAM, Corsair Vengeance 6000MT/s white, low-profile white DDR5 desktop memory, non-RGB white Corsair memory upgrade, high-speed gaming PC RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1447, 'Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL36 RAM White', 'Propel your desktop system into the high-frequency era of next-generation computing while styling a pristine build with the Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL36 RAM White. Optimized to hit the definitive performance sweet spot for modern multi-core Intel and AMD platforms, this high-speed 16GB U-DIMM module pairs a swift 6000MHz frequency with a tight CL36 low-latency profile to eliminate frame-rate stutters. Wrapped inside an ultra-compact, low-profile solid aluminum heat spreader finished in spotless matte white, it features onboard PMIC voltage regulation and built-in On-die ECC to supply rock-solid desktop stability.', 'corsair-vengeance-16gb-ddr5-6000mhz-cl36-ram-white-1783939105', '<p>Clear out processing data bottlenecks and perfect your clean, snow-white custom hardware layout with the low-latency <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL36 RAM White</strong>. Specifically engineered to efficiently feed data-hungry modern processors, this 16GB capacity module provides a massive evolutionary leap forward in data transfer rates. By combining an ultra-fast <strong>6000MHz speed</strong> with a tight, performance-tuned <strong>CL36-44-44-96 timing profile</strong>, it drastically cuts down the communication delay between your CPU and active storage pipelines. This yields immediate application load times, faster background render queues, and incredibly fluid frame pacing during heavy multitasking or intensive gaming sessions.</p><p>The underlying architecture of the Corsair VENGEANCE DDR5 platform places an uncompromising focus on structural data security and precise power distribution. The module incorporates an advanced <strong>On-board Overclock PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong>, which shifts complex voltage regulation away from older motherboard designs and onto the memory stick itself. This delivers a cleaner, more efficient 1.35V power supply for enhanced stability during heavy operational stress. Alongside it, an integrated <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> engine continuously monitors and corrects internal data bit errors in real time, defending your operating system against sudden application lockups or file corruption.</p><p>True to Corsair’s high engineering legacy, this non-RGB memory features hand-sorted memory chips mounted on a custom high-performance PCB, all wrapped inside a sleek solid aluminum heat spreader finished in premium white that draws thermal energy away rapidly. Standing at a low profile, it completely prevents physical clearance conflicts, fitting effortlessly underneath large dual-fan CPU air towers or inside tight small-form-factor (SFF) Mini-ITX chassis setups. Supporting dual performance profiles for <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> and <strong>AMD EXPO</strong>, it lets you achieve its full rated low-latency speeds with a simple, single-click toggle inside the BIOS right out of the box.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (1 x 16GB Single Module Configuration)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>6000 MHz (6000 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL36-44-44-96</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.1V / 4800MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Latency</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>40-40-40-77</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height Profile</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Low-Profile Compact Clearance Design</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Premium Spotless Matte White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Sleek Minimalist Finish</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Dual Profile Support: Intel XMP 3.0 &amp; AMD EXPO</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel (600/700/800 Series) &amp; AMD (600/800 Series) Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/jiTti5EKmFVdbAp5gLr8VSLOedlGUuR6qWexTBLy.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:38:25', '2026-07-13 10:38:25', 'Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL36 RAM White', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL36 desktop memory in White. Features a low-profile white aluminum heat spreader, tight C36 timing, and XMP 3.0 / AMD EXPO.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance DDR5 16GB White CL36, 16GB DDR5 6000MHz white RAM, Corsair Vengeance 6000MT/s CL36, low-profile white DDR5 memory, non-RGB white Corsair memory upgrade, high-speed low-latency PC RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1448, 'Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6400MHz RAM', 'Propel your desktop system into the upper echelons of next-generation performance with the blazing-fast Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6400MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered to extract peak bandwidth from modern multi-core platforms, this high-performance 16GB U-DIMM module operates at an incredible 6400MHz frequency to banish processing bottlenecks. It features a stunning panoramic light bar packed with ten individually addressable, ultra-bright RGB LEDs that integrate seamlessly with Corsair iCUE software, alongside onboard Overclock PMIC voltage regulation and built-in On-die ECC for rock-solid computing stability.', 'corsair-vengeance-rgb-16gb-ddr5-6400mhz-ram-1783939205', '<p>Clear out processing data bottlenecks and future-proof your custom hardware layout while crafting a jaw-dropping visual display with the high-bandwidth <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6400MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Specifically optimized to feed data-hungry modern multi-core processors, this 16GB DDR5 module provides a colossal evolutionary leap forward in data transfer rates compared to older memory generations. Running at an extreme 6400MHz frequency with highly optimized timing profiles at 1.40V, it significantly accelerates the core communication lanes between your CPU and active storage pipelines—slashing application load times, smoothing out 4K/8K video editing queues, and ensuring fluid, high-frame-rate performance during intense AAA gaming or live streaming sessions.</p><p>The visual crown jewel of this premium memory module is its striking <strong>dynamic ten-zone RGB lighting system</strong>. Encased inside an unobstructed, panoramic light pipe that spans the top ridge of the module, the ultra-bright LEDs deliver exceptionally uniform color dispersion visible from virtually any viewing angle inside your chassis. Controlled completely through the powerful <strong>Corsair iCUE software ecosystem</strong>, you can design intricate, multi-layered lighting animations, synchronize colors across all your iCUE-compatible fans and peripherals, or set up real-time, temperature-reactive lighting alerts that change color based on system heat.</p><p>Underneath the brilliant light bar sits a premium solid aluminum heat spreader that rapidly wicks localized thermal energy away from the underlying components to maintain safe operational thresholds. The VENGEANCE RGB DDR5 platform integrates an <strong>On-board PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong>, shifting complex voltage regulation directly onto the RAM stick for highly refined, stable power distribution under load. Backed by built-in <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> to identify and fix data bit errors in real time, this memory module supports the <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> framework, letting you achieve its full performance speeds with a single-click BIOS toggle right out of the box.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (Available in 1 x 16GB Single Module or 2 x 8GB Kit layouts)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>6400 MHz (6400 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL32-40-40-84 / CL36-48-48-104 / CL40-40-40-77 (Batch Dependent)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.40V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.1V / 4800MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management Tech</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Dual-Tone Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>10 Individually Addressable LEDs (Dynamic Ten-Zone Panoramic RGB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ecosystem Integration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Corsair iCUE Ecosystem &amp; Motherboard RGB Software Sync</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel (600/700/800 Series) &amp; Compatible DDR5 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/3xWIQd2iByclpwAIz3y0awuoz66V0gfGV2ZeIHXb.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:40:05', '2026-07-13 10:40:05', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6400MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6400MHz desktop memory. Features extreme 6400MT/s speeds, dynamic 10-zone panoramic RGB lighting, onboard PMIC, and Intel XMP 3.0.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance RGB DDR5 16GB, 16GB DDR5 6400MHz RGB RAM, Corsair Vengeance RGB 6400MT/s, ten-zone RGB DDR5 desktop memory, Corsair iCUE DDR5 upgrade, high-speed gaming RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
