iCUE software ecosystem</strong>, you can design intricate, multi-layered lighting animations, synchronize colors across all your iCUE-compatible fans and peripherals, or set up real-time, temperature-reactive lighting alerts that change color based on system heat.</p><p>Underneath the brilliant light bar sits a premium solid aluminum heat spreader that rapidly wicks localized thermal energy away from the underlying components to maintain safe operational thresholds. The VENGEANCE RGB DDR5 platform integrates an <strong>On-board PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong>, shifting complex voltage regulation directly onto the RAM stick for highly refined, stable power distribution under load. Backed by built-in <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> to identify and fix data bit errors in real time, this memory module supports the <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> framework, letting you achieve its full performance speeds with a single-click BIOS toggle right out of the box.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (Available in 1 x 16GB Single Module or 2 x 8GB Kit layouts)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>6600 MHz (6600 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL32-39-39-76 / CL34-40-40-77 / CL40-40-40-77 (Batch Dependent)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.40V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.1V / 4800MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management Tech</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Dual-Tone Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>10 Individually Addressable LEDs (Dynamic Ten-Zone Panoramic RGB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ecosystem Integration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Corsair iCUE Ecosystem &amp; Motherboard RGB Software Sync</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel (700/800 Series) &amp; Compatible DDR5 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/uC2S2x4aHCXjGxLfEmoU4T19X3U5OVMUKhUuJnEF.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:40:42', '2026-07-13 10:40:42', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6600MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6600MHz desktop memory. Features extreme 6600MT/s speeds, dynamic 10-zone panoramic RGB lighting, onboard PMIC, and Intel XMP 3.0.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance RGB DDR5 16GB, 16GB DDR5 6600MHz RGB RAM, Corsair Vengeance RGB 6600MT/s, ten-zone RGB DDR5 desktop memory, Corsair iCUE DDR5 upgrade, extreme high-speed gaming RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL);
