(1450, 'Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6800MHz RAM', 'Push your desktop system to elite boundaries of next-generation performance and vibrant style with the high-speed Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6800MHz Desktop RAM. Tailored for extreme enthusiasts, high-end gamers, and system tuners leveraging modern multi-core platforms, this high-performance 16GB U-DIMM module operates at an incredible 6800MHz frequency to entirely wipe out processing bottlenecks. It features a stunning panoramic light bar packed with ten individually addressable, ultra-bright RGB LEDs that integrate seamlessly with Corsair iCUE software, alongside onboard Overclock PMIC voltage regulation and built-in On-die ECC for rock-solid computing stability.', 'corsair-vengeance-rgb-16gb-ddr5-6800mhz-ram-1783939294', '<p>Clear out processing data bottlenecks and future-proof your custom hardware layout while crafting a jaw-dropping visual display with the extreme-bandwidth <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6800MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Specifically optimized to feed data-hungry modern multi-core processors, this 16GB DDR5 module provides a colossal evolutionary leap forward in data transfer rates compared to older memory generations. Running at a blistering 6800MHz frequency with highly optimized timing profiles at 1.40V, it drastically cuts down the communication delay between your CPU and active storage pipelines—slashing application load times, smoothing out 4K/8K video editing queues, and ensuring fluid, high-frame-rate performance during intense AAA gaming, streaming, or competitive benchmarking runs.</p><p>The visual crown jewel of this premium memory module is its striking <strong>dynamic ten-zone RGB lighting system</strong>. Encased inside an unobstructed, panoramic light pipe that spans the top ridge of the module, the ultra-bright LEDs deliver exceptionally uniform color dispersion visible from virtually any viewing angle inside your chassis. Controlled completely through the powerful <strong>Corsair iCUE software ecosystem</strong>, you can design intricate, multi-layered lighting animations, synchronize colors across all your iCUE-compatible fans and peripherals, or set up real-time, temperature-reactive lighting alerts that change color based on system heat.</p><p>Underneath the brilliant light bar sits a premium solid aluminum heat spreader that rapidly wicks localized thermal energy away from the underlying components to maintain safe operational thresholds. The VENGEANCE RGB DDR5 platform integrates an <strong>On-board PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong>, shifting complex voltage regulation directly onto the RAM stick for highly refined, stable power distribution under load. Backed by built-in <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> to identify and fix data bit errors in real time, this memory module supports the <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> framework, letting you achieve its full performance speeds with a single-click BIOS toggle right out of the box.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (Available in 1 x 16GB Single Module or 2 x 8GB Kit layouts)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>6800 MHz (6800 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL32-48-48-98 / CL34-46-46-105 / CL40-40-40-77 (Batch Dependent)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.40V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.1V / 4800MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management Tech</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Dual-Tone Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>10 Individually Addressable LEDs (Dynamic Ten-Zone Panoramic RGB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ecosystem Integration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Corsair iCUE Ecosystem &amp; Motherboard RGB Software Sync</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel (700/800 Series) &amp; Compatible DDR5 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/1vgx9HyxANrFkXFsSNwIeCCeykljpfzkvOfjYny6.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:41:34', '2026-07-13 10:41:34', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6800MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6800MHz desktop memory. Features extreme 6800MT/s speeds, dynamic 10-zone panoramic RGB lighting, onboard PMIC, and Intel XMP 3.0.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance RGB DDR5 16GB, 16GB DDR5 6800MHz RGB RAM, Corsair Vengeance RGB 6800MT/s, ten-zone RGB DDR5 desktop memory, Corsair iCUE DDR5 upgrade, extreme high-speed gaming RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1451, 'Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL30 Desktop RAM', 'Ignite your system configuration with top-tier low-latency performance and spectacular lighting using the Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL30 Desktop RAM. Tuned for pure efficiency on next-generation Intel and AMD platforms, this elite 16GB U-DIMM module hits the performance sweet spot by pairing a swift 6000MHz frequency with an ultra-tight CL30 latency profile to eliminate frame-time stutters. Featuring a stunning panoramic 10-zone dynamic RGB lightbar controlled by Corsair iCUE software, it pairs exceptional high-fidelity aesthetics with an onboard Overclock PMIC and On-die ECC for competitive computing stability.', 'corsair-vengeance-rgb-16gb-ddr5-6000mhz-cl30-desktop-ram-1783939352', '<p>Extract maximum computational response out of your high-end multi-core processor with the ultra-low latency <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL30 Desktop RAM</strong>. While high frequencies are critical for raw data throughput, dropping the access latency down to a tight <strong>CL30 timing profile</strong> at a blistering <strong>6000MHz speed</strong> significantly slashes data transmission delays between your CPU and active system memory. This yields a massive edge for system performance—greatly smoothing out micro-stutters during high-refresh-rate AAA gaming, speeding up heavy multitasking workloads, and accelerating demanding content creation tasks like real-time video rendering or code compiling.</p><p>The defining visual highlight of this high-performance module is its striking <strong>dynamic ten-zone RGB lightbar</strong>. Positioned inside an unobstructed, panoramic light pipe stretching across the top ridge of the stick, the ultra-bright LEDs deliver exceptionally vibrant and uniform color gradients visible from any angle inside your case window. Fully managed by the powerful <strong>Corsair iCUE software ecosystem</strong>, you can create complex, custom multi-layered lighting animations, sync themes across your entire collection of iCUE-compatible fans or liquid coolers, or assign real-time temperature alerts that dynamically shift colors based on hardware heat.</p><p>Beneath the radiant illumination sits a premium solid aluminum heat spreader designed to rapidly conduct thermal energy away from the underlying components, protecting hardware health during prolonged operational loads. The VENGEANCE RGB DDR5 architecture integrates an advanced <strong>On-board PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong>, shifting complex voltage regulation off the motherboard and onto the module itself for highly stable power deployment. Backed by built-in <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> to identify and repair bit errors in real time, this premium module supports dual <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> and <strong>AMD EXPO</strong> frameworks, letting you unlock its extreme low-latency limits with a single-click BIOS toggle right out of the box.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (Available in 1 x 16GB Single Module or 2 x 8GB Kit layouts)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>6000 MHz (6000 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL30-36-36-76</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V - 1.40V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.1V / 4800MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management Tech</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Dual-Tone Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>10 Individually Addressable LEDs (Dynamic Ten-Zone Panoramic RGB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ecosystem Integration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Corsair iCUE Ecosystem &amp; Motherboard RGB Software Sync</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Dual Profile Support: Intel XMP 3.0 &amp; AMD EXPO</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel (600/700/800 Series) &amp; AMD (600/800 Series) DDR5 Setups</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/9cRhjTZ2h4IX3U9pIeN2Jj3WjCmHhEpbdbh4xY1W.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:42:32', '2026-07-13 10:42:32', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL30 Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz desktop memory. Features ultra-low latency CL30 timing, dynamic 10-zone RGB lighting, and dual XMP 3.0 & AMD EXPO.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance RGB DDR5 16GB CL30, 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL30 RAM, Corsair Vengeance RGB 6000MT/s C30, low latency RGB DDR5 desktop memory, Corsair iCUE DDR5 upgrade, high-speed gaming PC RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
