(1453, 'Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6200MHz Desktop RAM', 'Propel your desktop configuration into the high-frequency era of next-generation computing with the Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6200MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered to fully unlock the multi-core processing capabilities of modern platforms, this high-performance 16GB U-DIMM module runs at a swift 6200MHz frequency to banish data bottlenecks. Housed inside an ultra-compact, low-profile solid aluminum heat spreader for universal case and cooler clearance, it integrates onboard PMIC voltage regulation and built-in Error-Correcting Code (ECC) to supply rock-solid desktop stability.', 'corsair-vengeance-16gb-ddr5-6200mhz-desktop-ram-1783939438', '<p>Clear out processing bottlenecks and future-proof your custom PC build with the high-bandwidth <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6200MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Specifically optimized to efficiently feed the data-heavy pipelines of modern multi-core processors, this 16GB capacity module provides a massive evolutionary leap forward in data transfer rates compared to legacy standards. Running at an ultra-fast 6200MHz frequency with highly stable timing profiles, it significantly accelerates the core communication lanes between your CPU and active storage pipelines—slashing application load times, reducing background micro-stutters, and ensuring fluid, high-frame-rate performance during intense gaming, streaming, or professional content creation workloads.</p><p>Ultra Technology</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Corsair VENGEANCE DDR5 platform places an uncompromising focus on structural data integrity and precise power distribution. The module incorporates an advanced <strong>On-board Overclock PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong>, which shifts complex voltage regulation away from older motherboard designs and onto the memory stick itself. This delivers a cleaner, more efficient 1.25V - 1.40V power supply for enhanced stability during heavy operational stress. Alongside it, an integrated <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> engine continuously monitors and corrects internal data bit errors in real time, defending your operating system against sudden application lockups or file corruption.</p><p>Ryans Computers</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>True to Corsair’s high engineering legacy, this non-RGB memory features hand-sorted memory chips mounted on a custom high-performance PCB, all wrapped inside a sleek solid aluminum heat spreader that draws thermal energy away rapidly. Standing at a low profile, it completely prevents physical layout conflicts, fitting effortlessly underneath large dual-fan CPU air towers or inside tight small-form-factor (SFF) Mini-ITX chassis setups. Supporting the <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> performance profile framework, it lets you achieve its full rated speeds with a simple, single-click toggle inside the BIOS right out of the box.</p><p>Corsair+ 2</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Technical Specifications</h2><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Category</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (Available in 1 x 16GB Single Module or 2 x 8GB Kit layouts)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>6200 MHz (6200 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL36-46-46-100 / CL40-40-40-77 (Batch Dependent)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.25V - 1.40V (Profile Dependent)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.1V / 4800MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management Tech</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height Profile</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Low-Profile Compact Clearance Design</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Classic Matte Black / Dark Grey</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Sleek Minimalist Finish</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel (600/700/800 Series) &amp; Compatible DDR5 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (Available in 1 x 16GB Single Module or 2 x 8GB Kit layouts)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>6200 MHz (6200 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL36-46-46-100 / CL40-40-40-77 (Batch Dependent)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.25V - 1.40V (Profile Dependent)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.1V / 4800MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management Tech</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height Profile</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Low-Profile Compact Clearance Design</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Classic Matte Black / Dark Grey</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Sleek Minimalist Finish</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel (600/700/800 Series) &amp; Compatible DDR5 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/9rEOprhyYoqiB3tm0nyN9L2PDh11thWumIQGmjL6.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:43:58', '2026-07-13 10:43:58', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6200MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6200MHz desktop memory. Features next-gen 6200MT/s frequencies, a low-profile anodized aluminum heat spreader, and Intel XMP 3.0.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance DDR5 16GB, 16GB DDR5 6200MHz RAM, Corsair Vengeance 6200MT/s, low-profile DDR5 desktop memory, non-RGB Corsair DDR5 upgrade, high-speed gaming PC RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1454, 'Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 7200MHz Desktop RAM', 'Push your desktop system to the absolute bleeding edge of next-generation performance and style with the high-speed Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 7200MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered to extract elite bandwidth from modern multi-core platforms, this high-performance 16GB U-DIMM module runs at a staggering 7200MHz frequency to entirely wipe out processing bottlenecks. It features a beautiful panoramic light bar packed with ten individually addressable, ultra-bright RGB LEDs that integrate seamlessly with Corsair iCUE software, alongside onboard Overclock PMIC voltage regulation and built-in On-die ECC for rock-solid computing stability.', 'corsair-vengeance-rgb-16gb-ddr5-7200mhz-desktop-ram-1783939487', '<p>Break through past performance ceilings and future-proof your high-end custom hardware layout while crafting a jaw-dropping visual display with the extreme-bandwidth <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 7200MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Specifically optimized to efficiently feed the massive data appetites of elite modern processors, this 16GB DDR5 module provides a colossal evolutionary leap forward in memory bandwidth compared to standard frequencies. Operating at a blistering 7200MHz frequency with a tight, performance-tuned <strong>CL34 latency profile</strong>, it maximizes the data pipelines connecting your CPU and storage sub-systems—slashing application loading screens to milliseconds, accelerating complex 3D render queues, and ensuring fluid, high-frame-rate performance during intense AAA gaming, streaming, or competitive benchmarking runs.</p><p>The visual crown jewel of this premium memory module is its striking <strong>dynamic ten-zone RGB lighting system</strong>. Encased inside an unobstructed, panoramic light pipe that spans the top ridge of the module, the ultra-bright LEDs deliver exceptionally uniform color dispersion visible from virtually any viewing angle inside your chassis window. Controlled completely through the powerful <strong>Corsair iCUE software ecosystem</strong>, you can design intricate, multi-layered lighting animations, synchronize colors across all your iCUE-Underneath the brilliant light bar sits a premium solid aluminum heat spreader that rapidly wicks localized thermal energy away from the underlying components to maintain safe operational thresholds. The VENGEANCE RGB DDR5 platform integrates an advanced <strong>On-board PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong>, shifting complex voltage regulation off the motherboard and directly onto the RAM stick for highly refined, stable power distribution under load at 1.45V. Backed by built-in <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> to identify and fix data bit errors in real time, this memory module supports the <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> performance profile framework, letting you achieve its full enthusiast-grade speeds with a single-click BIOS toggle right out of the box. compatible fans and peripherals, or set up real-time, temperature-reactive lighting alerts that change color based on system heat.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (Available in 1 x 16GB Single Module or 2 x 8GB Kit layouts)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>7200 MHz (7200 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL34-44-44-96</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.45V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.1V / 4800MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Latency</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>40-40-40-77</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management Tech</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Dual-Tone Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>10 Individually Addressable LEDs (Dynamic Ten-Zone Panoramic RGB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ecosystem Integration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Corsair iCUE Ecosystem &amp; Motherboard RGB Software Sync</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel (700/800 Series) &amp; Compatible DDR5 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/R9MAac4UMolxrq72GIiBZmCTUdPBxlHU6wQIwyLY.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:44:47', '2026-07-13 10:44:47', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 7200MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 7200MHz Desktop RAM', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance RGB DDR5 16GB, 16GB DDR5 7200MHz RGB RAM, Corsair Vengeance RGB 7200MT/s, ten-zone RGB DDR5 desktop memory, Corsair iCUE DDR5 upgrade, high-speed gaming RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1455, 'Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 7200MHz Desktop RAM', 'Push your desktop system to the absolute bleeding edge of next-generation performance and vibrant style with the extreme-speed Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 7200MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered to extract elite bandwidth from modern multi-core platforms, this high-performance 16GB U-DIMM module operates at a staggering 7200MHz frequency to entirely wipe out processing bottlenecks. It features a beautiful panoramic light bar packed with ten individually addressable, ultra-bright RGB LEDs that integrate seamlessly with Corsair iCUE software, alongside tight CL34 low-latency timing, onboard Overclock PMIC voltage regulation, and built-in On-die ECC for rock-solid computing stability.', 'corsair-vengeance-rgb-16gb-ddr5-7200mhz-desktop-ram-1783939542', '<p>Break through past performance ceilings and future-proof your high-end custom hardware layout while crafting a jaw-dropping visual display with the extreme-bandwidth <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 7200MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Specifically optimized to efficiently feed the massive data appetites of elite modern processors, this 16GB DDR5 module provides a colossal evolutionary leap forward in memory bandwidth compared to standard frequencies. Operating at a blistering 7200MHz frequency with a tight, performance-tuned <strong>CL34-44-44-96 timing profile</strong>, it maximizes the data pipelines connecting your CPU and storage sub-systems—slashing application loading screens to milliseconds, accelerating complex 3D or AI render queues, and ensuring fluid, high-frame-rate performance during intense AAA gaming, streaming, or competitive benchmarking runs.</p><p>The visual crown jewel of this premium memory module is its striking <strong>dynamic ten-zone RGB lighting system</strong>. Encased inside an unobstructed, panoramic light pipe that spans the top ridge of the module, the ultra-bright LEDs deliver exceptionally uniform color dispersion visible from virtually any viewing angle inside your chassis window. Controlled completely through the powerful <strong>Corsair iCUE software ecosystem</strong>, you can design intricate, multi-layered lighting animations, synchronize colors across all your iCUE-compatible fans and peripherals, or set up real-time, temperature-reactive lighting alerts that change color based on system heat.</p><p>Underneath the brilliant light bar sits a premium solid aluminum heat spreader that rapidly wicks localized thermal energy away from the underlying components to maintain safe operational thresholds. The VENGEANCE RGB DDR5 platform integrates an advanced <strong>On-board PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong>, shifting complex voltage regulation off the motherboard and directly onto the RAM stick for highly refined, stable power distribution under load at 1.45V. Backed by built-in <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> to identify and fix data bit errors in real time, this memory module supports the <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> performance profile framework, letting you achieve its full enthusiast-grade speeds with a single-click BIOS toggle right out of the box.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (Available in 1 x 16GB Single Module or 2 x 8GB Kit layouts)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>7200 MHz (7200 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL34-44-44-96</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.45V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.1V / 4800MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Latency</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>40-40-40-77</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management Tech</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Dual-Tone Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>44 mm (1.73 inches)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>10 Individually Addressable LEDs (Dynamic Ten-Zone Panoramic RGB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ecosystem Integration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Corsair iCUE Ecosystem &amp; Motherboard RGB Software Sync</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel (700/800 Series) &amp; Compatible DDR5 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/dtuRofsZ0kgUhv67DuUlkPL54MbORgn75CnXwln2.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:45:42', '2026-07-13 10:45:42', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 16GB DDR5 7200MHz Desktop RAM', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance RGB DDR5 16GB, 16GB DDR5 7200MHz RGB RAM, Corsair Vengeance RGB 7200MT/s, ten-zone RGB DDR5 desktop memory, Corsair iCUE DDR5 upgrade, extreme speed gaming RAM.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance RGB DDR5 16GB, 16GB DDR5 7200MHz RGB RAM, Corsair Vengeance RGB 7200MT/s, ten-zone RGB DDR5 desktop memory, Corsair iCUE DDR5 upgrade, extreme speed gaming RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1456, 'Corsair DOMINATOR PLATINUM RGB 16GB DDR5 6200MHz RAM White', 'Push the boundaries of premium luxury performance and curate a flawless, clean design aesthetic with the flagship Corsair DOMINATOR PLATINUM RGB 16GB DDR5 6200MHz Desktop RAM White. Purpose-built for elite PC layouts, this high-performance module pairs a swift 6200MHz sweet-spot speed with Corsair’s iconic precision-die-cast aluminum construction finished in stunning matte white. Crowned by 12 ultra-bright, power-efficient CAPELLIX RGB LEDs, it features patented DHX cooling technology that chills both the PCB and memory chips directly, delivering unmatched, rock-solid enthusiast stability.', 'corsair-dominator-platinum-rgb-16gb-ddr5-6200mhz-ram-white-1783939586', '<p>Push the boundaries of premium luxury performance and curate a flawless, clean design aesthetic with the flagship <strong>Corsair DOMINATOR PLATINUM RGB 16GB DDR5 6200MHz Desktop RAM White</strong>. Purpose-built for elite PC layouts, this high-performance module pairs a swift 6200MHz sweet-spot speed with Corsair’s iconic precision-die-cast aluminum construction finished in stunning matte white. Crowned by <strong>12 ultra-bright, power-efficient CAPELLIX RGB LEDs</strong>, it features patented DHX cooling technology that chills both the PCB and memory chips directly, delivering unmatched, rock-solid enthusiast stability.&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (Available in 1 x 16GB Single Module or 2 x 16GB Kit layouts)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>6200 MHz (6200 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL36-39-39-76</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Technology</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Patented DHX (Dual-Path Heat Exchange) Cooling System</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Construction</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Precision Die-Cast Forged Aluminum Structural Shell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height Profile</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>56 mm (Enthusiast Clearance Profile)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.30V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management Tech</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Extreme OC PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Speed / Voltage</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>4800MHz / 1.1V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Latency</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>40-40-40-77</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>12 Individually Addressable Ultra-Bright CAPELLIX LEDs</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ecosystem Integration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Corsair iCUE Ecosystem &amp; Motherboard RGB Sync Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Premium Intel (600/700/800 Series) &amp; Compatible DDR5 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/EWDhIIGz3DfG6iMjVHzbFL7atB8G15YypkmfON2g.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:46:26', '2026-07-13 10:46:26', 'Corsair DOMINATOR PLATINUM RGB 16GB DDR5 6200MHz RAM White', 'Meta Description: Buy the premium Corsair DOMINATOR PLATINUM RGB 16GB DDR5 6200MHz desktop memory in White. Features a die-cast aluminum DHX cooling shield, 12 Capellix RGB LEDs, and Intel XMP 3.0.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Dominator Platinum DDR5 16GB White, 16GB DDR5 6200MHz Dominator White, Corsair 6200MT/s white RAM, Capellix RGB white DDR5, Corsair iCUE white gaming RAM, enthusiast white PC build.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1457, 'Corsair VENGEANCE 32GB DDR5 5200MHz C40 RAM', 'Expand your system\'s data horizons and step into next-generation high-capacity computing with the Corsair VENGEANCE 32GB DDR5 5200MHz C40 Desktop RAM. Engineered to handle intensive multitasking, high-end gaming, and large data workloads on modern multi-core platforms, this massive 32GB module runs at a swift 5200MHz frequency to eliminate lag. Housed inside an ultra-compact, low-profile solid aluminum heat spreader for universal case and cooler clearance, it integrates onboard PMIC voltage regulation and built-in Error-Correcting Code (ECC) for rock-solid computing stability.', 'corsair-vengeance-32gb-ddr5-5200mhz-c40-ram-1783939642', '<p>Eliminate memory bottlenecks and future-proof your desktop rig for heavy workloads with the high-capacity <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE 32GB DDR5 5200MHz C40 Desktop RAM</strong>. Specially optimized to feed the multi-threaded demands of elite modern processors, this 32GB capacity U-DIMM module delivers a massive evolutionary leap in memory bandwidth and structural capacity. Running at an ultra-fast 5200MHz frequency with a stable CL40 latency profile, it ensures your system has the breathing room required to handle demanding tasks seamlessly—drastically reducing load times, smoothing out massive 4K video editing timelines, and preventing system stutters during extreme multi-tab browsing or gaming sessions.</p><p>The underlying architecture of this premier memory module places an uncompromising focus on structural data security and highly refined power distribution. The module incorporates an advanced <strong>On-board Overclock PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong>, which shifts complex voltage regulation directly onto the RAM stick rather than relying on legacy motherboard lanes. Operating efficiently at 1.25V, it guarantees ultra-clean power distribution under load. Alongside it, an integrated <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> engine continuously monitors and corrects internal data bit errors in real time, defending your operating system against sudden application crashes or file corruption.</p><p>True to Corsair’s premium build legacy, this non-RGB memory features hand-sorted, tightly screened memory ICs mounted on a custom high-performance signal PCB. The entire array is encased in a sleek, compact solid aluminum heat spreader that draws thermal energy away rapidly without adding bulk. Standing at a low profile, it completely prevents physical layout conflicts, letting it sit easily underneath large dual-fan CPU air towers or inside tight small-form-factor (SFF) Mini-ITX builds. Fully supporting the <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> performance profile framework, it lets you unlock its full rated speeds with a simple single-click toggle inside your system BIOS.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>32GB (Available in 1 x 32GB Single Module or 2 x 16GB Kit layouts)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>5200 MHz (5200 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL40-40-40-77</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.25V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.1V / 4800MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management Tech</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height Profile</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Low-Profile Compact Clearance Design</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Classic Matte Black / Dark Grey</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Sleek Minimalist Finish</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel (600/700/800 Series) &amp; Compatible DDR5 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/aJcpGLRqgHZ3bJeY0YlBBNcWxputk5s7DMY62OpS.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:47:22', '2026-07-13 10:47:22', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE 32GB DDR5 5200MHz C40 Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE 32GB DDR5 5200MHz C40 desktop memory. Features massive 32GB capacity, a low-profile aluminum heat spreader, and Intel XMP 3.0 support.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance DDR5 32GB, 32GB DDR5 5200MHz RAM, Corsair Vengeance 5200MT/s C40, low-profile 32GB DDR5 memory, non-RGB Corsair DDR5 upgrade, high-capacity gaming PC RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL);
