(1458, 'Corsair DOMINATOR TITANIUM RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM', 'Redefine the boundaries of luxury hardware performance and customized style with the next-generation Corsair DOMINATOR TITANIUM RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM. Precision-engineered from premium forged aluminum, this elite 16GB module hits the absolute sweet spot of modern computing by combining a fast 6000MHz frequency with an ultra-low CL30 latency profile. Featuring 11 vibrant, individually addressable RGB LEDs beneath a fully customizable and swappable top bar design, it utilizes patented DHX cooling technology alongside an onboard Overclock PMIC to deliver bleeding-edge desktop stability for enthusiasts who refuse to compromise.', 'corsair-dominator-titanium-rgb-16gb-ddr5-6000mhz-desktop-ram-1783939700', '<p>Experience a monumental shift in enthusiast hardware design and raw computing power with the <strong>Corsair DOMINATOR TITANIUM RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Positioned as Corsair\'s ultimate flagship memory line, the DOMINATOR TITANIUM series pairs breathtaking luxury styling with relentless performance. Built around hand-sorted, tightly screened high-frequency memory chips sitting on a custom high-signal PCB, this module operates at a blistering <strong>6000MHz frequency</strong> coupled with an ultra-tight, performance-tuned <strong>CL30-36-36-76 timing profile</strong>. By slashing internal data access delays, it maximizes your processor\'s pipelines—rendering micro-stutters obsolete, accelerating complex render queues, and providing uncompromised frametime consistency during heavy AAA gaming sessions or extensive multi-layered production tasks.</p><p>Corsair+ 1</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The mechanical defining feature of the DOMINATOR TITANIUM platform is its unprecedented level of physical customization. The forged aluminum heat spreader features a unique modular design with an elegant <strong>swappable top bar system</strong>. Whether you want to leverage the stock lightbar, switch to official non-RGB cooling fins, or design entirely unique 3D-printed top caps, this RAM allows you to curate an aesthetic that perfectly matches your premium custom build. Flooding the module with brilliant light are <strong>11 ultra-bright, individually addressable RGB LEDs</strong> managed effortlessly through the comprehensive <strong>Corsair iCUE software ecosystem</strong>. Through iCUE, you can build intricate multi-layered lighting animations, monitor real-time module temperatures, or program color alerts that react instantly to system heat.</p><p>Corsair</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thermal regulation on this luxury kit is governed by Corsair\'s patented <strong>DHX (Dual-Path Heat Exchange) Cooling technology</strong>. By actively pulling thermal energy out through both the front face of the memory chips and the dedicated copper ground plane of the custom PCB itself, it ensures the module handles continuous high-voltage tuning without breaking a sweat. Completed with a sophisticated <strong>On-board Overclock PMIC</strong> for precise power distribution at 1.40V and dual-profile support for <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> and <strong>AMD EXPO</strong>, this RAM represents the definitive gold standard for elite system configurations.</p><p>Corsair+ 1</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (Available in 1 x 16GB Single Module or 2 x 16GB Kit layouts)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>6000 MHz (6000 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL30-36-36-76</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Patented DHX (Dual-Path Heat Exchange) Cooling System</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Construction</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Forged Die-Cast Premium Aluminum Shield</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Customization Feature</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Modular Top Bar (Swappable / Custom 3D Printable Architecture)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.40V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Speed / Voltage</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>4800MHz / 1.1V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management Tech</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Extreme Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>11 Individually Addressable Ultra-Bright LEDs</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ecosystem Integration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Corsair iCUE Customization &amp; Performance Dashboard Sync</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Dual Profile Support: Intel XMP 3.0 &amp; AMD EXPO Frameworks</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel (600/700/800 Series) &amp; AMD (600/800 Series) DDR5 Setups</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/7d4rW3zOUrTZ8c66Qdbl5aGpLo0qrnR4zHc2tdYw.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:48:20', '2026-07-13 10:48:20', 'Meta Title: Corsair DOMINATOR TITANIUM RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the ultra-premium Corsair DOMINATOR TITANIUM RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz memory. Features low-latency CL30 timing, patented DHX cooling, and swappable top bars.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Dominator Titanium DDR5 16GB, 16GB DDR5 6000MHz Titanium, Corsair 6000MT/s premium RAM, Dominator Titanium CL30, swappable top bar DDR5, extreme enthusiast gaming PC RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1459, 'Corsair DOMINATOR PLATINUM RGB 16GB DDR5 5600MHz C36 RAM', 'Step into the high-frequency era of premium computing with the flagship Corsair DOMINATOR PLATINUM RGB 16GB DDR5 5600MHz C36 Desktop RAM. Meticulously crafted for elite PC builds, this 16GB U-DIMM module pairs a high-bandwidth 5600MHz frequency with a tight CL36 low-latency profile to eliminate system bottlenecks. Crowned by 12 ultra-bright, power-efficient CAPELLIX RGB LEDs, it features patented DHX cooling technology that chills both the PCB and memory chips directly, alongside onboard PMIC voltage regulation for unmatched, rock-solid enthusiast stability.', 'corsair-dominator-platinum-rgb-16gb-ddr5-5600mhz-c36-ram-1783939746', '<p>Experience the absolute pinnacle of luxury engineering and high-frequency performance with the low-latency <strong>Corsair DOMINATOR PLATINUM RGB 16GB DDR5 5600MHz C36 Desktop RAM</strong>. As Corsair\'s premiere flagship memory line, DOMINATOR PLATINUM DDR5 is built exclusively with hand-sorted, tightly screened high-frequency memory ICs resting on a custom high-performance signal PCB. Operating at a fast <strong>5600MHz frequency</strong> coupled with an optimized, tight <strong>CL36 timing profile</strong>, it vastly widens the processing pipelines connecting your CPU and storage array—reducing background micro-stutters, slashing file compression times, and unlocking flawless frame pacing during top-tier AAA gaming or rendering workloads.</p><p>What truly isolates the DOMINATOR PLATINUM platform from standard memory kits is its legendary, heavy-duty mechanical cooling architecture. It features patented <strong>DHX (Dual-Path Heat Exchange) Cooling technology</strong>, which embeds the heat sink directly into the custom PCB layers alongside a robust die-cast aluminum top bar. This design pulls damaging thermal energy away from both the front face of the memory chips and the internal circuit traces simultaneously, ensuring the module maintains maximum stability even under intense, long-duration voltage tuning at 1.25V.</p><p>The aesthetic presentation is equally elite. The top configuration features an array of <strong>12 individually addressable CAPELLIX RGB LEDs</strong>. These specialized emitters are physically smaller and vastly brighter than conventional standard LEDs while consuming significantly less power. Controlled natively via the advanced <strong>Corsair iCUE software ecosystem</strong>, you can orchestrate stunning multi-layered lighting arrays or coordinate real-time, temperature-reactive lighting patterns. Complete with an <strong>On-board Overclock PMIC</strong> for highly refined power delivery and automated <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> profile tracking, this premium module stands as the definitive gold standard for enthusiast system builds.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (Available in 1 x 16GB Single Module or 2 x 8GB Kit layouts)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>5600 MHz (5600 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL36-36-36-76</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Technology</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Patented DHX (Dual-Path Heat Exchange) Cooling System</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Construction</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Precision Die-Cast Aluminum Structural Shell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height Profile</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>56 mm (Enthusiast Clearance Profile)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.25V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management Tech</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Speed / Voltage</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>4800MHz / 1.1V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Latency</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>40-40-40-77</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>12 Individually Addressable Ultra-Bright CAPELLIX LEDs</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ecosystem Integration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Corsair iCUE Ecosystem &amp; Motherboard RGB Sync</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Premium Intel (600/700/800 Series) &amp; Compatible DDR5 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/aba9A68HpY0xvIFJ9ujCDoOaW0DExudqMNyCLpD0.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:49:06', '2026-07-13 10:49:06', 'Meta Title: Corsair DOMINATOR PLATINUM RGB 16GB DDR5 5600MHz C36 Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the elite Corsair DOMINATOR PLATINUM RGB 16GB DDR5 5600MHz desktop memory. Features low-latency CL36 timing, patented DHX cooling, and 12 Capellix RGB LEDs.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Dominator Platinum DDR5 16GB, 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Dominator, Corsair 5600MT/s C36 RAM, Capellix RGB DDR5 desktop memory, Corsair iCUE Dominator upgrade, low-latency enthusiast gaming RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
