(1461, 'Corsair DOMINATOR PLATINUM RGB 16GB DDR5 7200MHz Desktop RAM', 'Push your desktop hardware to the absolute limits of luxury and extreme high-frequency performance with the flagship Corsair DOMINATOR PLATINUM RGB 16GB DDR5 7200MHz Desktop RAM. Precision-engineered for ultimate enthusiast PC builds, this 16GB module runs at a staggering 7200MHz frequency to entirely banish memory bottlenecks. Crowned by 12 ultra-bright, power-efficient CAPELLIX RGB LEDs, it pairs iconic forged aluminum styling with patented DHX cooling technology that directly chills the internal circuits, ensuring rock-solid stability at boundary-pushing speeds.', 'corsair-dominator-platinum-rgb-16gb-ddr5-7200mhz-desktop-ram-1783939887', '<p>Experience a new dawn of computing velocity and elite system tuning with the hyper-fast <strong>Corsair DOMINATOR PLATINUM RGB 16GB DDR5 7200MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. As Corsair’s premiere luxury performance memory family, the DOMINATOR PLATINUM series is built exclusively around hand-sorted, tightly screened high-frequency memory ICs mounted on a custom high-signal-integrity PCB. Operating at a blistering <strong>7200MHz frequency</strong> paired with a tight, high-performance <strong>CL34 latency profile</strong>, it dramatically widens the processing lanes connecting your elite multi-core CPU and active storage arrays. This results in ultra-fluid frame delivery during heavy AAA gaming, instant loading times for massive data archives, and unparalleled responsiveness during intense rendering or content creation queues.</p><p>What truly isolates the DOMINATOR PLATINUM framework from standard memory configurations is its massive focus on structural thermal control. The module utilizes patented <strong>DHX (Dual-Path Heat Exchange) Cooling technology</strong>, which embeds the custom heat sink directly into the PCB layer traces alongside a heavy-duty forged aluminum top block. This dual-path thermal pathway rapidly extracts localized heat from both the front face of the memory chips and the internal circuit layers simultaneously, allowing the stick to maintain extreme computational stability even during continuous high-voltage operational tuning at 1.45V.</p><p>The aesthetic presentation matches its uncompromising hardware pedigree. The top housing architecture showcases <strong>12 individually addressable CAPELLIX RGB LEDs</strong>. These advanced emitters are significantly smaller and vastly brighter than conventional standard LEDs while consuming noticeably less power. Fully integrated with the <strong>Corsair iCUE software ecosystem</strong>, you can craft intricate, multi-layered color animations, monitor real-time module temperatures, or assign color cues that react immediately to system hardware temperatures. Complete with an <strong>On-board Overclock PMIC</strong> for highly refined voltage control and automated <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> tracking, this premium RAM sets the absolute gold standard for enthusiast desktop architecture.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (Available in 1 x 16GB Single Module or 2 x 16GB Kit layouts)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>7200 MHz (7200 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL34-44-44-96</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Technology</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Patented DHX (Dual-Path Heat Exchange) Cooling System</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Construction</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Precision Forged Aluminum Structural Shell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height Profile</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>56 mm (Enthusiast Clearance Profile)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.45V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management Tech</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Extreme Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Speed / Voltage</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>4800MHz / 1.1V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Latency</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>40-40-40-77</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>12 Individually Addressable Ultra-Bright CAPELLIX LEDs</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ecosystem Integration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Corsair iCUE Ecosystem &amp; Motherboard RGB Sync Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Premium Intel (700/800 Series) &amp; Compatible DDR5 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/YcSfPVcz5V31u3S08ZaN7cuXz4tVr2ULTCKKPHW7.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:51:27', '2026-07-13 10:51:27', 'Corsair DOMINATOR PLATINUM RGB 16GB DDR5 7200MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the elite Corsair DOMINATOR PLATINUM RGB 16GB DDR5 7200MHz desktop memory. Features extreme 7200MT/s speeds, patented DHX cooling, and 12 Capellix RGB LEDs.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Dominator Platinum DDR5 16GB, 16GB DDR5 7200MHz Dominator, Corsair 7200MT/s enthusiast RAM, Capellix RGB DDR5 memory, Corsair iCUE Dominator upgrade, bleeding edge gaming PC RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1462, 'Corsair VENGEANCE LPX 32GB (2 x 16GB) DDR4 3600MHz C18 RAM Kit Black', 'Maximize your system\'s processing capabilities without compromising on spatial layout using the hyper-reliable Corsair VENGEANCE LPX 32GB (2 x 16GB) DDR4 3600MHz C18 RAM Kit Black. Built as a matched pair of two 16GB modules for high-bandwidth dual-channel performance, this kit features an ultra-low-profile solid aluminum heat spreader designed to clear large CPU coolers effortlessly. Operating at a swift 3600MHz frequency with a stable C18 latency timing, it provides massive data headroom for intensive multitasking, smooth AAA gaming, and heavy computing workloads.', 'corsair-vengeance-lpx-32gb-2-x-16gb-ddr4-3600mhz-c18-ram-kit-black-1783939929', '<p><strong>3600MHz C18 RAM Kit Black</strong>. The VENGEANCE LPX family is specifically engineered for high-performance enthusiast overclocking, utilizing a custom eight-layer signal PCB paired with thoroughly screened, hand-selected memory ICs. Running at a high-speed <strong>3600MHz frequency via Intel XMP 2.0</strong> with optimized <strong>C18 timings</strong> at 1.35V, this 32GB kit significantly accelerates the core communication channels between your CPU and active storage pipelines—slashing application load times, reducing micro-stutters during high-refresh gaming, and providing fluid multitasking breathing room.</p><p>The hallmark design element of the VENGEANCE LPX architecture is its ultra-compact physical footprint. Standing at a mere <strong>34mm module height</strong>, these modules easily slide beneath massive dual-fan tower CPU air coolers and fit perfectly into cramped small-form-factor (SFF) Mini-ITX cases where bulky RGB modules would cause hardware clearance conflicts. The pure aluminum heat spreader features a low-profile, finned design that maximizes surface area exposure to rapidly draw thermal energy away from the underlying components, protecting hardware health during prolonged operational stress.</p><p>Wrapped in a stealthy classic matte black coating, this kit ditches complex lighting arrays in favor of pure performance, efficiency, and clean, minimalist aesthetics. Fully optimized for maximum hardware compatibility with modern AMD and Intel DDR4 motherboards, it features single-click <strong>Intel XMP 2.0</strong> automation. This enables the module to safely adjust to its top-tier rated performance limits right out of the box, offering a seamless and rock-solid system upgrade.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Kit Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>32GB Kit (2 x 16GB Dual-Channel Layout)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Speed / Frequency</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>3600 MHz (PC4-28800)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL18-22-22-42</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.2V / 2133MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Latency</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>15-15-15-36</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Solid Pure Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height Profile</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>34 mm (Ultra-Low Profile / High Cooler Clearance)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Classic Matte Black / Stealth Dark</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Sleek Minimalist Finish</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profile</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Intel &amp; AMD DDR4 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Limited Lifetime Product Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/T88YL4W8sgLjGdIgda1rjYvwwDbUg9wkFhQl14X0.png', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:52:09', '2026-07-13 10:52:09', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE LPX 32GB (2 x 16GB) DDR4 3600MHz C18 RAM Kit - Black', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE LPX 32GB (2x16GB) DDR4 3600MHz C18 desktop memory kit. Features an ultra-low profile black aluminum heat spreader and Intel XMP 2.0.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance LPX 32GB DDR4, 2x16GB DDR4 3600MHz C18 RAM, Corsair LPX 32GB black kit, low-profile gaming PC memory, non-RGB Corsair DDR4 upgrade, high-capacity high-speed desktop RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1463, 'Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 32GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM White', 'Elevate your desktop architecture into the next generation of high-frequency, high-capacity computing with the beautiful Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 32GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM White. Specially engineered to hit the performance sweet spot for modern multi-core platforms, this massive 32GB module runs at a swift 6000MHz to eliminate multitasking lag. Housed in a clean, pristine white solid aluminum heat spreader and crowned by a stunning panoramic 10-zone dynamic RGB lightbar controlled via Corsair iCUE, it blends premium enthusiast styling with onboard PMIC voltage regulation and On-die ECC for rock-solid computing stability.', 'corsair-vengeance-rgb-32gb-ddr5-6000mhz-desktop-ram-white-1783940005', '<p>Clear out performance bottlenecks and perfect your clean, snow-white custom hardware layout with the high-bandwidth <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 32GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM White</strong>. Engineered to easily satisfy the data-heavy appetites of cutting-edge multi-core processors, this massive 32GB capacity module delivers a colossal evolutionary leap forward in data transfer rates. Running at an ultra-fast <strong>6000MHz speed</strong> with optimized timing profiles, it drastically expands the communication lanes between your CPU and active storage arrays—slashing load times, ensuring incredibly fluid frame pacing during heavy AAA gaming, and providing massive breathing room for intense content creation workloads like 4K/8K video editing or 3D rendering.</p><p>The visual crown jewel of this high-performance module is its striking <strong>dynamic ten-zone RGB lighting system</strong>. Encased inside an unobstructed, panoramic light pipe stretching across the top ridge of the module, the ultra-bright LEDs deliver exceptionally uniform color dispersion visible from virtually any viewing angle inside your case window. Controlled completely through the powerful <strong>Corsair iCUE software ecosystem</strong>, you can design intricate, multi-layered lighting animations, synchronize colors across all your iCUE-compatible fans and liquid coolers, or set up real-time, temperature-reactive lighting alerts that change color based on system heat.</p><p>Underneath the brilliant light bar sits a premium solid aluminum heat spreader finished in spotless white that rapidly conducts thermal energy away from the underlying components to maintain safe operational thresholds. The VENGEANCE RGB DDR5 platform integrates an advanced <strong>On-board PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong>, shifting complex voltage regulation off the motherboard and directly onto the RAM stick for highly refined, stable power distribution under load at 1.35V - 1.40V. Backed by built-in <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> to identify and fix data bit errors in real time, this memory module supports performance profile frameworks like <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> and <strong>AMD EXPO</strong>, letting you achieve its full rated speeds with a simple, single-click toggle inside the BIOS right out of the box.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>32GB (Available in 1 x 32GB Single Module or 2 x 16GB Kit layouts)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>6000 MHz (6000 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL30-36-36-76 / CL36-44-44-96 / CL40-40-40-77 (Batch Dependent)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V - 1.40V (Profile Dependent)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.1V / 4800MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management Tech</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height Profile</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>44 mm (Compact Height / High Hardware Clearance)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Premium Spotless Matte White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>10 Individually Addressable LEDs (Dynamic Ten-Zone Panoramic RGB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ecosystem Integration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Corsair iCUE Ecosystem &amp; Motherboard RGB Software Sync</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Single-Click Profile Support: Intel XMP 3.0 &amp; AMD EXPO</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel (600/700/800 Series) &amp; AMD (600/800 Series) DDR5 Setups</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/sWPyzHbaQ8wPfAgovbSTadV8tY7T8QJMus4U0Znx.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:53:25', '2026-07-13 10:53:25', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 32GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM - White', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 32GB DDR5 6000MHz desktop memory in White. Features a high-capacity 32GB profile, dynamic 10-zone RGB lighting, and Intel XMP 3.0 / AMD EXPO.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance RGB DDR5 32GB White, 32GB DDR5 6000MHz white RAM, Corsair Vengeance RGB 6000MT/s white, ten-zone RGB white DDR5 memory, Corsair iCUE white RAM upgrade, high-speed high-capacity gaming RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1464, 'Corsair DOMINATOR PLATINUM RGB 32GB DDR5 5600MHz CL40 RAM White', 'Push the boundaries of elite high-capacity performance and curate a flawless, clean design aesthetic with the flagship Corsair DOMINATOR PLATINUM RGB 32GB DDR5 5600MHz CL40 Desktop RAM White. Purpose-built for top-tier PC builds requiring substantial memory headroom, this high-performance 32GB module pairs a fast 5600MHz frequency with Corsair’s iconic precision-die-cast aluminum construction finished in stunning matte white. Crowned by 12 ultra-bright, power-efficient CAPELLIX RGB LEDs, it features patented DHX cooling technology that chills both the PCB and memory chips directly, delivering unmatched, rock-solid enthusiast stability.', 'corsair-dominator-platinum-rgb-32gb-ddr5-5600mhz-cl40-ram-white-1783940057', '<p>Experience the absolute pinnacle of high-bandwidth engineering and luxury aesthetics with the pristine <strong>Corsair DOMINATOR PLATINUM RGB 32GB DDR5 5600MHz CL40 Desktop RAM White</strong>. As Corsair\'s premiere flagship memory line, DOMINATOR PLATINUM DDR5 is built exclusively with hand-sorted, tightly screened high-frequency memory ICs resting on a custom high-performance signal PCB. Operating at a blistering <strong>5600MHz speed</strong> with a generous <strong>32GB layout</strong>, it vastly widens the processing pipelines connecting your CPU and storage array. This gives your system the massive breathing room required to effortlessly handle demanding tasks—rendering micro-stutters obsolete, slashing file compression times, and unlocking flawless frame pacing during top-tier AAA gaming, 4K/8K video editing, or complex multi-layered production workloads.</p><p>What truly isolates the DOMINATOR PLATINUM platform from standard memory kits is its legendary, heavy-duty mechanical cooling architecture. Finished in an elegant matte white with premium accents, it features patented <strong>DHX (Dual-Path Heat Exchange) Cooling technology</strong>, which embeds the heat sink directly into the custom PCB layers alongside a robust die-cast aluminum top bar. This design pulls damaging thermal energy away from both the front face of the memory chips and the internal circuit traces simultaneously, ensuring the module maintains maximum stability even under intense, long-duration voltage tuning at 1.25V.</p><p>The aesthetic presentation is equally elite. The top design architecture features an array of <strong>12 individually addressable CAPELLIX RGB LEDs</strong>. These specialized emitters are physically smaller and vastly brighter than conventional standard LEDs while consuming significantly less power. Controlled natively via the advanced <strong>Corsair iCUE software ecosystem</strong>, you can orchestrate stunning multi-layered lighting arrays or coordinate real-time, temperature-reactive lighting patterns that perfectly complement snow-white custom rigs. Complete with an <strong>On-board Overclock PMIC</strong> for highly refined power delivery and automated <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> profile tracking, this premium module stands as the definitive gold standard for enthusiast system builds.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>32GB (Available in 1 x 32GB Single Module or 2 x 16GB Kit layouts)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>5600 MHz (5600 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL40-40-40-77</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Technology</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Patented DHX (Dual-Path Heat Exchange) Cooling System</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Construction</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Precision Die-Cast Forged Aluminum Structural Shell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height Profile</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>56 mm (Enthusiast Clearance Profile)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.25V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management Tech</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Extreme OC PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Speed / Voltage</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>4800MHz / 1.1V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>12 Individually Addressable Ultra-Bright CAPELLIX LEDs</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ecosystem Integration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Corsair iCUE Ecosystem &amp; Motherboard RGB Sync Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Premium Intel (600/700/800 Series) &amp; Compatible DDR5 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/9yCFaYZGJQT2o0sgN7CDporfUd1Hsnh5Yqvk9oqt.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:54:17', '2026-07-13 10:54:17', 'Meta Title: Corsair DOMINATOR PLATINUM RGB 32GB DDR5 5600MHz CL40 Desktop RAM - White', 'Meta Description: Buy the premium Corsair DOMINATOR PLATINUM RGB 32GB DDR5 5600MHz CL40 memory in White. Features a high-capacity 32GB profile, patented DHX cooling, and 12 Capellix RGB LEDs.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Dominator Platinum DDR5 32GB White, 32GB DDR5 5600MHz Dominator White, Corsair 5600MT/s CL40 white RAM, Capellix RGB white DDR5, Corsair iCUE white gaming RAM, enthusiast high-capacity white PC build.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1465, 'Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 32GB (16x2) DDR5 7200MHz RAM', 'Push your high-end desktop system to the absolute edge of performance and style with the blistering Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 32GB (2 x 16GB) DDR5 7200MHz Desktop RAM. Built as a precision-matched dual-channel kit to maximize bandwidth on modern multi-core platforms, these extreme-speed modules run at a staggering 7200MHz frequency to obliterate processing bottlenecks. Crowned by a vibrant panoramic 10-zone dynamic RGB lightbar controlled via Corsair iCUE software, the kit incorporates onboard Overclock PMIC voltage regulation and built-in On-die ECC for uncompromised, enthusiast-tier system stability.', 'corsair-vengeance-rgb-32gb-16x2-ddr5-7200mhz-ram-1783940100', '<p>Break through past computational ceilings and future-proof your custom gaming rig or workstation with the high-capacity, extreme-bandwidth <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 32GB (2 x 16GB) DDR5 7200MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Optimized specifically to feed the data-heavy pipelines of high-end, multi-core processors, this 32GB kit provides an evolutionary leap forward in memory throughput. Running at a blistering <strong>7200MHz frequency with a tight, performance-tuned CL34 latency profile</strong>, it maximizes the data communication lanes between your CPU and active storage arrays. This ensures instantaneous application load times, faster background render queues, and incredibly fluid frame pacing during competitive AAA gaming, streaming, or heavy multitasking.</p><p>The visual centerpiece of these premium modules is the striking <strong>dynamic ten-zone RGB lighting system</strong>. Encased inside an unobstructed, panoramic light pipe spanning the top ridge of each module, the ultra-bright LEDs deliver exceptionally uniform color dispersion visible from virtually any viewing angle inside your chassis. Controlled completely through the powerful <strong>Corsair iCUE software ecosystem</strong>, you can design complex, multi-layered lighting animations, synchronize colors across all your iCUE-compatible components, or program real-time, temperature-reactive lighting alerts that shift colors dynamically based on hardware heat.</p><p>Beneath the radiant illumination sits a high-performance solid aluminum heat spreader that rapidly wicks localized thermal energy away from the underlying components to maintain safe operational thresholds. The VENGEANCE RGB DDR5 architecture integrates an advanced <strong>On-board PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong>, shifting complex voltage regulation off the motherboard and directly onto the RAM stick for highly refined, stable power distribution under load at 1.45V. Backed by built-in <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> to identify and repair bit errors in real time, this premium kit supports the <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> framework, letting you unlock its extreme limits with a single-click BIOS toggle right out of the box.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Kit Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>32GB Kit (2 x 16GB Dual-Channel Layout)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>7200 MHz (7200 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL34-44-44-96</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.45V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.1V / 4800MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Latency</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>40-40-40-77</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management Tech</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Dual-Tone Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height Profile</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>44 mm (Compact Height / Universal Clearance)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>10 Individually Addressable LEDs per module (Dynamic Panoramic RGB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ecosystem Integration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Corsair iCUE Ecosystem &amp; Motherboard RGB Software Sync</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel (700/800 Series) &amp; Compatible DDR5 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/tQzpWvdYgn00K0d2DbWWcfOkpD5G01hTbB3PB8ru.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:55:00', '2026-07-13 10:55:00', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 32GB (2x16GB) DDR5 7200MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 32GB (2x16GB) DDR5 7200MHz desktop memory kit. Features extreme 7200MT/s speeds, dynamic 10-zone RGB lighting, and Intel XMP 3.0.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance RGB DDR5 32GB 7200MHz, 32GB DDR5 7200MHz dual channel kit, Corsair Vengeance RGB 7200MT/s 2x16GB, 10-zone RGB DDR5 gaming memory, Corsair iCUE DDR5 upgrade, high-speed low-latency PC RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL);
