(1466, 'Corsair DOMINATOR TITANIUM RGB 32GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM iosbd', 'Redefine the boundaries of luxury hardware performance and customized style with the next-generation Corsair DOMINATOR TITANIUM RGB 32GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM. Precision-engineered from premium forged aluminum, this elite 32GB dual-channel kit hits the absolute sweet spot of modern computing by combining a fast 6000MHz frequency with an ultra-low CL30 latency profile. Featuring 11 vibrant, individually addressable RGB LEDs beneath a fully customizable and swappable top bar design, it utilizes patented DHX cooling technology alongside an onboard Overclock PMIC to deliver bleeding-edge desktop stability for enthusiasts who refuse to compromise.', 'corsair-dominator-titanium-rgb-32gb-ddr5-6000mhz-desktop-ram-iosbd-1783962630', '<p>Experience a monumental shift in enthusiast hardware design and raw computing power with the high-capacity <strong>Corsair DOMINATOR TITANIUM RGB 32GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Positioned as Corsair\'s ultimate flagship memory line, the DOMINATOR TITANIUM series pairs breathtaking luxury styling with relentless performance. Built around hand-sorted, tightly screened high-frequency memory chips sitting on a custom high-signal PCB, this matched 32GB dual-channel configuration operates at a blistering <strong>6000MHz frequency</strong> coupled with an ultra-tight, performance-tuned <strong>CL30-36-36-76 timing profile</strong>. By slashing internal data access delays, it maximizes your processor\'s pipelines—rendering micro-stutters obsolete, accelerating complex 3D or AI render queues, and providing uncompromised frametime consistency during heavy AAA gaming sessions or extensive multi-layered production tasks.</p><p>The mechanical defining feature of the DOMINATOR TITANIUM platform is its unprecedented level of physical customization. The forged aluminum heat spreader features a unique modular design with an elegant <strong>swappable top bar system</strong>. Whether you want to leverage the stock lightbar, switch to official non-RGB cooling fins, or design entirely unique 3D-printed top caps, this RAM allows you to curate an aesthetic that perfectly matches your premium custom build. Flooding the module with brilliant light are <strong>11 ultra-bright, individually addressable RGB LEDs</strong> managed effortlessly through the comprehensive <strong>Corsair iCUE software ecosystem</strong>. Through iCUE, you can build intricate multi-layered lighting animations, monitor real-time module temperatures, or program color alerts that react instantly to system heat.</p><p>Thermal regulation on this luxury kit is governed by Corsair\'s patented <strong>DHX (Dual-Path Heat Exchange) Cooling technology</strong>. By actively pulling thermal energy out through both the front face of the memory chips and the dedicated copper ground plane of the custom PCB itself, it ensures the module handles continuous high-voltage tuning without breaking a sweat. Completed with a sophisticated <strong>On-board Overclock PMIC</strong> for precise power distribution at 1.40V and dual-profile support for <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> and <strong>AMD EXPO</strong>, this RAM represents the definitive gold standard for elite system configurations.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>32GB Kit (2 x 16GB Dual-Channel Layout)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>6000 MHz (6000 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL30-36-36-76</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Patented DHX (Dual-Path Heat Exchange) Cooling System</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Construction</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Forged Die-Cast Premium Aluminum Shield</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Customization Feature</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Modular Top Bar (Swappable / Custom 3D Printable Architecture)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.40V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Speed / Voltage</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>4800MHz / 1.1V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Latency</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>40-40-40-77</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management Tech</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Extreme Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>11 Individually Addressable Ultra-Bright LEDs</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ecosystem Integration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Corsair iCUE Customization &amp; Performance Dashboard Sync</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Dual Profile Support: Intel XMP 3.0 &amp; AMD EXPO Frameworks</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel (600/700/800 Series) &amp; AMD (600/800 Series) DDR5 Setups</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 19000.00, 19000.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/x2TrQQ36L9BgTrcLNMfjwsPTwxOQVMAJLCik5mqS.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:55:48', '2026-07-13 17:10:30', 'Meta Title: Corsair DOMINATOR TITANIUM RGB 32GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the ultra-premium Corsair DOMINATOR TITANIUM RGB 32GB DDR5 6000MHz memory. Features low-latency CL30 timing, patented DHX cooling, and swappable top bars.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Dominator Titanium DDR5 32GB, 32GB DDR5 6000MHz Titanium, Corsair 6000MT/s premium RAM, Dominator Titanium CL30 32GB, swappable top bar DDR5, extreme enthusiast gaming PC RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1467, 'Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL28 Desktop RAM iosbd', 'Ignite your system configuration with world-class low-latency performance using the Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL28 Desktop RAM. Tuned for maximum data efficiency on cutting-edge Intel and AMD platforms, this high-performance 16GB U-DIMM module achieves elite responsiveness by pairing a rapid 6000MHz frequency with a hyper-tight CL28 timing profile to completely eliminate processing bottlenecks. Housed inside an ultra-compact, low-profile solid aluminum heat spreader for universal case and cooler clearance, it integrates an onboard Overclock PMIC and On-die ECC for rock-solid computing stability.', 'corsair-vengeance-16gb-ddr5-6000mhz-cl28-desktop-ram-iosbd-1783962459', '<p>Ignite your system configuration with world-class low-latency performance using the <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL28 Desktop RAM</strong>. Tuned for maximum data efficiency on cutting-edge Intel and AMD platforms, this high-performance 16GB U-DIMM module achieves elite responsiveness by pairing a rapid 6000MHz frequency with a hyper-tight <strong>CL28 timing profile</strong> to completely eliminate processing bottlenecks. Housed inside an ultra-compact, low-profile solid aluminum heat spreader for universal case and cooler clearance, it integrates an onboard Overclock PMIC and On-die ECC for rock-solid computing stability.</p><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (Available in 1 x 16GB Single Module or 2 x 8GB Kit layouts)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</stron