Features ultra-low latency CL28 timing, a compact low-profile aluminum heat spreader, and dual XMP 3.0 & AMD EXPO.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance DDR5 16GB CL28, 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL28 RAM, Corsair Vengeance 6000MT/s C28, ultra-low latency DDR5 desktop memory, non-RGB Corsair DDR5 upgrade, high-speed gaming PC RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1468, 'Corsair WS 32GB DDR5 5600MHZ CL40 ECC RDIMM Desktop RAM iosbd', 'Deploy enterprise-grade stability and next-generation processing velocity to your professional architecture with the server-class Corsair WS 32GB DDR5 5600MHz CL40 ECC RDIMM Workstation RAM. Specially engineered for elite modern workstation environments leveraging multi-core AMD Threadripper and Intel Xeon processors, this high-performance 32GB Registered DIMM (RDIMM) module operates at a swift 5600MHz frequency. Featuring full sideband Error-Correcting Code (ECC) to eliminate data corruption alongside an integrated PMIC, it delivers uncompromised 24/7 reliability for deep learning, 3D rendering, and massive data computations.', 'corsair-ws-32gb-ddr5-5600mhz-cl40-ecc-rdimm-desktop-ram-iosbd-1783962402', '<p>grade <strong>Corsair WS 32GB DDR5 5600MHz CL40 ECC RDIMM Workstation RAM</strong>. Purpose-built to clear away severe memory bandwidth limits under continuous creative and analytical pressure, this 32GB workstation module represents a fundamental leap forward in memory architecture. Running at an advanced <strong>5600MHz frequency</strong>, it feeds massive data pipelines directly into high-core-count processors, significantly accelerating heavy machine learning passes, complex CAD/3D animations, massive code compilation chains, and multi-layered mathematical simulations.</p><p>As a dedicated <strong>Registered DIMM (RDIMM)</strong>, this module features an onboard register chip that buffers command signals between the system memory controller and the memory chips. This specialized architecture stabilizes the electrical load, enabling workstation motherboards to support massive system memory arrays without signal degradation. To guarantee total structural reliability, the module implements full <strong>Sideband ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong>. Unlike standard consumer RAM, it continuously detects and corrects multi-bit errors in real time, preventing unexpected system crashes, data degradation, or fatal blue-screen interruptions during crucial multi-day project queues.</p><p>Built to rigorous industrial standards, this non-RGB enterprise memory incorporates an advanced <strong>Workstation PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong>. This component shifts precision voltage handling directly onto the module stick at an efficient 1.25V, ensuring highly predictable power deployment and lowering total thermal emission. The high-quality components are shielded by a sleek, low-profile heat spreader that efficiently conducts heat away without introducing physical layout clearance interference. Supporting automated <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> and <strong>AMD EXPO</strong> workstation profile structures, it allows professionals to activate complete stable operating limits with a quick toggle inside the system BIOS.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>RDIMM (Registered DIMM / Server &amp; Workstation Class)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>32GB (Single Module Layout)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>5600 MHz (5600 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL40-40-40-77</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction (ECC)</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>Full Sideband ECC (Registered Protection)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.25V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.1V / 4800MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management Tech</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Workstation PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Low-Profile Minimalist Structural Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Style finish</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Classic Matte Black Workstation Styling</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Sleek Functional Finish</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 &amp; AMD EXPO Workstation Profile Frameworks</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for AMD Ryzen Threadripper Pro (7000/9000 Series) &amp; Intel Xeon DDR5 Workstations</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin Registered</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 46400.00, 46400.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/PhysQ6SO7ecCLUr9FzjDpJR0YcpyLIh6O63yCBTM.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:57:32', '2026-07-13 17:06:42', 'Meta Title: Corsair WS 32GB DDR5 5600MHz CL40 ECC RDIMM Workstation RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair WS 32GB DDR5 5600MHz ECC Registered DIMM memory. Engineered for high-end AMD Threadripper and Intel Xeon workstation platforms.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair WS DDR5 32GB, 32GB DDR5 5600MHz RDIMM, Corsair Workstation ECC RAM, Registered DIMM DDR5 5600MT/s, AMD Threadripper Pro DDR5 memory, Intel Xeon enterprise workstation RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1469, 'Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 32GB DDR5 6000MHz CL30 Desktop RAM iosbd', 'Ignite your system configuration with top-tier low-latency performance and spectacular lighting using the Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 32GB DDR5 6000MHz CL30 Desktop RAM. Tuned for pure efficiency on next-generation Intel and AMD platforms, this massive 32GB U-DIMM module hits the performance sweet spot by pairing a swift 6000MHz frequency with an ultra-tight CL30 latency profile to eliminate frame-time stutters. Featuring a stunning panoramic 10-zone dynamic RGB lightbar controlled by Corsair iCUE software, it pairs exceptional high-fidelity aesthetics with an onboard Overclock PMIC and On-die ECC for competitive computing stability.', 'corsair-vengeance-rgb-32gb-ddr5-6000mhz-cl30-desktop-ram-iosbd-1783962331', '<p>Extract maximum computational response out of your high-end multi-core processor with the high-capacity, ultra-low latency <strong>Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 32GB DDR5 6000MHz CL30 Desktop RAM</strong>. While high frequencies are critical for raw data throughput, dropping the access latency down to a tight <strong>CL30 timing profile</strong> at a blistering <strong>6000MHz speed</strong> significantly slashes data transmission delays between your CPU and active system memory. This yields a massive edge for system performance—greatly smoothing out micro-stutters during high-refresh-rate AAA gaming, speeding up heavy multitasking workloads, and accelerating demanding content creation tasks like real-time video rendering, AI workloads, or code compiling.</p><p>The defining visual highlight of this high-performance module is its striking <strong>dynamic ten-zone RGB lightbar</strong>. Positioned inside an unobstructed, panoramic light pipe stretching across the top ridge of the stick, the ultra-bright LEDs deliver exceptionally vibrant and uniform color gradients visible from any angle inside your case window. Fully managed by the powerful <strong>Corsair iCUE software ecosystem</strong>, you can create complex, custom multi-layered lighting animations, sync themes across your entire collection of iCUE-compatible fans or liquid coolers, or assign real-time temperature alerts that dynamically shift colors based on hardware heat.</p><p>Beneath the radiant illumination sits a premium solid aluminum heat spreader designed to rapidly conduct thermal energy away from the underlying components, protecting hardware health during prolonged operational loads. The VENGEANCE RGB DDR5 architecture integrates an advanced <strong>On-board PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</strong>, shifting complex voltage regulation off the motherboard and onto the module itself for highly stable power deployment. Backed by built-in <strong>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</strong> to identify and repair bit errors in real time, this premium module supports dual <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> and <strong>AMD EXPO</strong> frameworks, letting you unlock its extreme low-latency limits with a simple, single-click BIOS toggle right out of the box.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>32GB (Available in 1 x 32GB Single Module or 2 x 16GB Kit layouts)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>6000 MHz (6000 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL30-36-36-76</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V - 1.40V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Voltage / Speed</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.1V / 4800MHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management Tech</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Dual-Tone Solid Anodized Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>10 Individually Addressable LEDs (Dynamic Ten-Zone Panoramic RGB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ecosystem Integration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Corsair iCUE Ecosystem &amp; Motherboard RGB Software Sync</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profiles</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Dual Profile Support: Intel XMP 3.0 &amp; AMD EXPO</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel (600/700/800 Series) &amp; AMD (600/800 Series) DDR5 Setups</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 63000.00, 63000.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/7yd0c5CIyETTADiqGtg5DpI3oTt66jWf1kWnxYwh.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 10:58:32', '2026-07-13 17:05:31', 'Meta Title: Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 32GB DDR5 6000MHz CL30 Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the Corsair VENGEANCE RGB 32GB DDR5 6000MHz desktop memory. Features ultra-low latency CL30 timing, dynamic 10-zone RGB lighting, and dual XMP 3.0 & AMD EXPO.', 'Target Keywords: Corsair Vengeance RGB DDR5 32GB CL30, 32GB DDR5 6000MHz CL30 RAM, Corsair Vengeance RGB 6000MT/s C30, low latency 32GB RGB DDR5, Corsair iCUE DDR5 upgrade, high-speed gaming PC RAM.', NULL, 30, NULL, NULL),
(1470, 'Gigabyte 8GB DDR4 2666MHz Heatsink Desktop Ram iosbd', 'Upgrade your daily desktop performance and ensure smooth computing reliability with the Gigabyte 8GB DDR4 2666MHz Heatsink Desktop RAM. Designed as an efficient, budget-friendly memory solution for standard office setups and entry-level gaming configurations, this 8GB U-DIMM module runs at a stable 2666MHz frequency. Wrapped in a sleek, high-quality gray aluminum heat spreader, it keeps thermal levels low while offering hassle-free single-click overclocking through Intel XMP 2.0 support.', 'gigabyte-8gb-ddr4-2666mhz-heatsink-desktop-ram-iosbd-1783962259', '<p>Breathe new life into your everyday desktop build and eliminate multitasking lag with the highly reliable <strong>Gigabyte 8GB DDR4 2666MHz Heatsink Desktop RAM</strong>. Built with rigorously tested, high-quality memory ICs resting on a multi-layer performance PCB, this module serves as a perfect cost-to-performance sweet spot for users looking to build a dependable system or add essential memory overhead to their current setup. Operating at a proven <strong>2666MHz frequency</strong>, it accelerates internal data lanes to streamline your everyday computing workflows—ensuring snappy application loading, fluid web browsing across multiple tabs, and stable entry-level gaming performance.</p><p>Unlike standard bare-PCB budget memory sticks, this Gigabyte DDR4 module comes equipped with a custom-engineered <strong>classic gray aluminum heatsink</strong>. The sleek heat spreader is designed to maximize surface area, drawing localized thermal energy away from the underlying memory components to maintain excellent hardware health and cool operational thresholds during prolonged work sessions. Its low-profile, compact engineering guarantees universal physical clearance, allowing the module to sit comfortably beneath large CPU air towers or inside tight, space-constrained micro-ATX and Mini-ITX PC cases without running into layout conflicts.</p><p>Engineered for broad compatibility, this RAM module seamlessly interfaces with modern Intel and AMD DDR4 motherboard ecosystems. It features full automated integration for <strong>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile)</strong>, letting you easily activate its rated high-speed performance through a quick profile toggle in the system BIOS. Operating at a highly energy-efficient 1.2V baseline, it delivers a cool, power-conscious, and rock-solid performance profile that handles day-to-day productivity demands with absolute peace of m</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>8GB (Single Module Layout)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>2666 MHz (PC4-21300)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL16-16-16-35</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.2V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Speed / Voltage</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>2666MHz / 1.2V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Latency</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>19-19-19-43</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>High-Efficiency Classic Aluminum Heatsink</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height Profile</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Low-Profile Compact Clearance Design (32 mm)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Classic Matte Gray / Silver Accents</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Sleek Minimalist Finish</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profile</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Broadly Optimized for Intel &amp; AMD DDR4 Motherboard Platforms</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Product Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 6500.00, 6500.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/uAiodHl2f2vnsCTMSfYO9OjaIbyGfu2orDvKR4X9.png', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 11:02:22', '2026-07-13 17:04:19', 'Meta Title: Gigabyte 8GB DDR4 2666MHz Desktop RAM with Heatsink', 'Meta Description: Buy the reliable Gigabyte 8GB DDR4 2666MHz desktop memory. Features a high-efficiency aluminum heatsink, stable 2666MT/s speed, and Intel XMP 2.0 support.', 'Target Keywords: Gigabyte 8GB DDR4 RAM, Gigabyte 2666MHz desktop RAM, 8GB DDR4 memory with heatsink, Gigabyte classic DDR4 upgrade, budget gaming PC RAM, stable desktop DDR4 memory.', NULL, 15, NULL, NULL),
(1471, 'Gigabyte AORUS RGB 8GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM iosbd', 'Infuse your gaming setup with signature enthusiast performance and brilliant synchronized lighting using the Gigabyte AORUS RGB 8GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered to bring elite stability and jaw-dropping aesthetics to modern Intel and AMD DDR4 platforms, this premium 8GB U-DIMM module clocks in at a fast 3200MHz frequency with a tight CL16 low-latency profile. Wrapped in an aggressive, high-efficiency forged aluminum heat spreader featuring the iconic AORUS falcon motif, it integrates seamlessly with RGB Fusion 2.0 and supports single-click Intel XMP 2.0 for effortless performance tuning.', 'gigabyte-aorus-rgb-8gb-ddr4-3200mhz-desktop-ram-iosbd-1783962183', '<h3>Long Description</h3><p>Take command of your PC\'s responsiveness and build a visually cohesive gaming rig with the enthusiast-grade <strong>Gigabyte AORUS RGB 8GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Designed specifically for gamers and custom system builders who refuse to compromise on either aesthetics or processing stability, this 8GB DDR4 module is built on a custom <strong>10-layer sophisticatedly engineered PCB</strong>. By utilizing premium, 100% hand-sorted memory ICs, it easily maintains a blistering <strong>3200MHz frequency</strong> paired with a tight <strong>CL16-18-18-38 timing profile</strong>. This high-speed architecture slashes internal data transmission bottlenecks, ensuring snappy application launches, seamless asset loading in AAA gaming titles, and smooth multi-threaded workflows.</p><p>The visual centerpiece of the AORUS memory series is its luxurious, asymmetrical anodized aluminum heat spreader, available in a striking AORUS Gray or Silver glossy finish. The geometric laser-cut patterns resemble a diving falcon, mirroring the brand\'s focus on speed and agility. Spanning the top ridge is an un-obstructed light diffuser that houses brilliant, multi-zone LEDs. Fully compatible with the <strong>Gigabyte RGB Fusion 2.0 software ecosystem</strong>, the module grants you access to 12 distinct lighting profiles—including 5 DDR-exclusive modes like Cascade and Droplet—allowing you to synchronize complex illumination layers across compatible motherboards, graphics cards, and case fans with a single click.</p><p>Thermal management is handled flawlessly by the thick-walled alloy shield, which rapidly pulls damaging heat away from the underlying memory components to maintain absolute operational safety during intensive workloads. Furthermore, if you pair this module with a select GIGABYTE AORUS motherboard, you can activate the exclusive <strong>AORUS Memory Boost</strong> toggle in the BIOS to safely bump read/write performance by up to 4% beyond standard thresholds. Operating at an optimized 1.35V when <strong>Intel XMP 2.0</strong> is enabled, this module balances aggressive styling with rock-solid system reliability, backed by a limited lifetime warranty for long-term peace of mind.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>8GB (Single Module Layout / Also available in Dual-Channel Kits)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>3200 MHz (PC4-25600)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL16-18-18-38 (XMP Enabled)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Enhancement</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>Supports AORUS Memory Boost (Up to 3333MHz on selected AORUS Motherboards)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCB Architecture</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>High-Signal 10-Layer Sophisticated PCB Construction</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default JEDEC Speed / Volt</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>2133MHz / 1.2V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>High-Efficiency Asymmetric Forged Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>133 mm x 39 mm x 8.3 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Premium AORUS Gray / Silver Glossy Finish</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Multi-Zone Diffused RGB LED Strip</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ecosystem Integration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>RGB Fusion 2.0 Sync (Supports 12 Custom Lighting Modes)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profile</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Broadly Optimized for Intel &amp; AMD DDR4 Motherboard Architectures</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 9500.00, 9500.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/HKfMXJTKRYDV3sQ7lyA27UMmKatP4wCUGUfu2eS2.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 11:03:00', '2026-07-13 17:03:03', 'Meta Title: Gigabyte AORUS RGB 8GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the premium Gigabyte AORUS RGB 8GB DDR4 3200MHz desktop memory. Features performance-tuned CL16 latency, high-efficiency AORUS heatsinks, and RGB Fusion 2.0.', 'Target Keywords: Gigabyte AORUS RGB DDR4 8GB, 8GB DDR4 3200MHz AORUS RAM, Gigabyte AORUS 3200MT/s desktop memory, AORUS Falcon RGB DDR4, RGB Fusion gaming RAM, budget enthusiast DDR4 upgrade.', NULL, 15, NULL, NULL)