(1472, 'Gigabyte AORUS RGB 8GB DDR4 3733MHz Desktop RAM iosbd', 'Unlock elite high-frequency performance and elevate your system aesthetics with the Gigabyte AORUS RGB 8GB DDR4 3733MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered to supply extreme processing speeds to modern Intel and AMD DDR4 systems, this premium 8GB U-DIMM module runs at a blistering 3733MHz frequency. Encased in a high-efficiency forged aluminum heat spreader with a refined AORUS Gray finish, it offers full integration with RGB Fusion 2.0 and single-click Intel XMP 2.0 for rock-solid enthusiast overclocking.', 'gigabyte-aorus-rgb-8gb-ddr4-3733mhz-desktop-ram-iosbd-1783962112', '<h3>Long Description</h3><p>Push past standard performance limitations and establish absolute processing stability with the high-speed <strong>Gigabyte AORUS RGB 8GB DDR4 3733MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Purpose-built for gamers, content creators, and hardware enthusiasts who demand exceptional bandwidth, this 8GB module is constructed on a <strong>sophisticatedly engineered 10-layer PCB</strong>. By mounting 100% hand-sorted, rigorously screened high-frequency memory ICs, it easily maintains an aggressive <strong>3733MHz frequency</strong> at 1.4V. This ultra-fast data transmission lane reduces internal communication bottlenecks, ensuring snappy application loading times, seamless asset rendering in demanding software, and highly consistent frame pacing during competitive gaming.</p><p>The visual hallmark of the AORUS memory series is its luxurious, heavy-duty anodized aluminum heat spreader, coated in a sleek <strong>AORUS Gray finish</strong>. This structure features geometric laser-cut accents designed to optimize airflow while wicking localized thermal energy rapidly away from the internal circuittraces. Crowning the top block is a fluid light diffuser that hosts brilliant, multi-zone LEDs. Fully manageable via the <strong>Gigabyte RGB Fusion 2.0 software ecosystem</strong>, the module grants you access to 12 distinct lighting profiles—including 5 DDR-exclusive modes like Cascade, Droplet, and Color Strobe—allowing you to sync intricate illumination layers across your compatible hardware components with a single click.</p><p>Platform optimization is handled seamlessly by the module\'s tailored timing profiles. It triggers a tight <strong>CL18-22-22-42 profile on Intel Z490</strong> setups and <strong>CL20-26-26-46 on AMD X570</strong> environments under XMP automation. Furthermore, when deployed on selected GIGABYTE AORUS motherboards, you can activate the exclusive <strong>AORUS Memory Boost</strong> toggle in the BIOS to safely bump read/write performance by an extra 2% up to 3800MHz without risking total system stability. Complete with full <strong>Intel XMP 2.0</strong> support and a limited lifetime warranty, this module is the definitive choice for premium desktop architecture.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>8GB (Single Module Layout / Also available in 16GB Dual-Channel Kits)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>3733 MHz (3733 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td><p>Intel Z490: CL18-22-22-42</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>AMD X570: CL20-26-26-46</p></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Enhancement</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>Supports AORUS Memory Boost (Up to 3800MHz on selected AORUS Motherboards)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCB Architecture</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>High-Signal 10-Layer Sophisticated PCB Construction</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.4V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default JEDEC Speed / Volt</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>2666MHz / 1.2V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Latency</strong></td><td>Power</td><td><p>Intel: 19-19-19-43</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>AMD Ryzen: 20-19-19-43</p></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>High-Efficiency Forged Aluminum Heat Spreaders</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Premium Matte AORUS Gray</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Multi-Zone Diffused RGB LED Strip</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ecosystem Integration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>RGB Fusion 2.0 Sync (Supports 12 Custom Lighting Modes / 5 DDR Exclusive)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profile</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Fully Tested &amp; Optimized for Intel &amp; AMD DDR4 Motherboard Platforms</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 4200.00, 4200.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/jaGUvnSPH2v73XqQOHHidJUaB1dza8WJg02MyDmd.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 11:03:57', '2026-07-13 17:01:52', 'Meta Title: Gigabyte AORUS RGB 8GB DDR4 3733MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the premium Gigabyte AORUS RGB 8GB DDR4 3733MHz desktop memory. Features performance-tuned CL18 low latency, high-efficiency AORUS heatsinks, and RGB Fusion 2.0.', 'Target Keywords: Gigabyte AORUS RGB DDR4 8GB, 8GB DDR4 3733MHz AORUS RAM, Gigabyte AORUS 3733MT/s desktop memory, AORUS high-speed DDR4, RGB Fusion gaming RAM, enthusiast DDR4 RAM upgrade.', NULL, 15, NULL, NULL),
(1473, 'Gigabyte AORUS 8GB 3200MHz RGB RAM iosbd', 'Infuse your gaming setup with signature enthusiast performance and brilliant synchronized lighting using the Gigabyte AORUS 8GB 3200MHz RGB Desktop RAM. Engineered to bring elite stability and jaw-dropping aesthetics to modern Intel and AMD DDR4 platforms, this premium 8GB U-DIMM module clocks in at a fast 3200MHz frequency with a tight CL16 low-latency profile. Wrapped in an aggressive, high-efficiency forged aluminum heat spreader featuring the iconic AORUS falcon motif, it integrates seamlessly with RGB Fusion 2.0 and supports single-click Intel XMP 2.0 for effortless performance tuning.', 'gigabyte-aorus-8gb-3200mhz-rgb-ram-iosbd-1783962008', '<p>Take command of your PC\'s responsiveness and build a visually cohesive gaming rig with the enthusiast-grade <strong>Gigabyte AORUS 8GB 3200MHz RGB Desktop RAM</strong>. Designed specifically for gamers and custom system builders who refuse to compromise on either aesthetics or processing stability, this 8GB DDR4 module is built on a custom <strong>10-layer sophisticatedly engineered PCB</strong>. By utilizing premium, 100% hand-sorted memory ICs, it easily maintains a blistering <strong>3200MHz frequency</strong> paired with a tight <strong>CL16-18-18-38 timing profile</strong>. This high-speed architecture slashes internal data transmission bottlenecks, ensuring snappy application launches, seamless asset loading in AAA gaming titles, and smooth multi-threaded workflows.</p><p>The visual centerpiece of the AORUS memory series is its luxurious, asymmetrical anodized aluminum heat spreader, available in a striking polished gray finish. The geometric laser-cut patterns mirror the brand\'s focus on speed, agility, and premium structural cooling. Spanning the top ridge is an unobstructed light diffuser that houses brilliant, multi-zone LEDs. Fully compatible with the <strong>Gigabyte RGB Fusion 2.0 software ecosystem</strong>, the module grants you access to 12 distinct lighting profiles—including 5 DDR-exclusive modes like Cascade and Droplet—allowing you to synchronize complex illumination layers across compatible motherboards, graphics cards, and case fans with a single click.</p><p>Thermal management is handled flawlessly by the thick-walled alloy shield, which rapidly pulls damaging heat away from the underlying memory components to maintain absolute operational safety during intensive workloads. Furthermore, if you pair this module with a select GIGABYTE AORUS motherboard, you can activate the exclusive <strong>AORUS Memory Boost</strong> toggle in the BIOS to safely bump read/write performance beyond standard thresholds. Operating at an optimized 1.35V when <strong>Intel XMP 2.0</strong> is enabled, this module balances aggressive styling with rock-solid system reliability, backed by a limited lifetime warranty for long-term peace of mind.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>8GB (Single Module Layout / Often available in Dual-Channel Kits with Demo Modules)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>3200 MHz (PC4-25600)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL16-18-18-38 (XMP Enabled)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Enhancement</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>Supports AORUS Memory Boost (Up to 3333MHz on selected AORUS Motherboards)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCB Architecture</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>High-Signal 10-Layer Sophisticated PCB Construction</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default JEDEC Speed / Volt</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>2133MHz / 1.2V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>High-Efficiency Asymmetric Forged Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>133 mm x 39 mm x 8.3 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Premium AORUS Polished Gray / Silver Accents</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Multi-Zone Diffused RGB LED Strip</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ecosystem Integration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>RGB Fusion 2.0 Sync (Supports 12 Custom Lighting Modes)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profile</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Broadly Optimized for Intel &amp; AMD DDR4 Motherboard Architectures</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 9500.00, 9500.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/YsfwJhmwEHpuZozlEuyKNjed403SV2XnbKSYXcRo.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 11:05:10', '2026-07-13 17:00:08', 'Meta Title: Gigabyte AORUS 8GB 3200MHz RGB DDR4 Desktop RAM', 'vMeta Description: Buy the premium Gigabyte AORUS 8GB 3200MHz RGB desktop memory. Features performance-tuned CL16 latency, high-efficiency AORUS heatsinks, and RGB Fusion 2.0.', 'Target Keywords: Gigabyte AORUS RGB DDR4 8GB, 8GB DDR4 3200MHz AORUS RAM, Gigabyte AORUS 3200MT/s desktop memory, AORUS Falcon RGB DDR4, RGB Fusion gaming RAM, budget enthusiast DDR4 upgrade.', NULL, 15, NULL, NULL);
