heat spreader, coated in a sleek <strong>AORUS Gray finish</strong>. This structure features geometric laser-cut accents designed to optimize airflow while wicking localized thermal energy rapidly away from the internal circuit traces. Crowning the top block is a fluid light diffuser that hosts brilliant, multi-zone LEDs. Fully manageable via the <strong>Gigabyte RGB Fusion 2.0 software ecosystem</strong>, the module grants you access to 12 distinct lighting profiles—including 5 DDR-exclusive modes like Cascade, Droplet, and Color Strobe—allowing you to sync intricate illumination layers across your compatible hardware components with a single click.</p><p>Platform optimization is handled seamlessly by the module\'s tailored timing profiles. It triggers a tight <strong>CL18-19-19-39 profile</strong> under XMP automation. Furthermore, when deployed on selected GIGABYTE AORUS motherboards, you can activate the exclusive <strong>AORUS Memory Boost</strong> toggle in the BIOS to safely bump read/write performance beyond standard thresholds without risking total system stability. Complete with full <strong>Intel XMP 2.0</strong> support and a limited lifetime warranty, this module is the definitive choice for premium desktop architecture.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>8GB (Single Module Layout / Also available in 16GB Dual-Channel Kits)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>3600 MHz (3600 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL18-19-19-39 (XMP Enabled)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Enhancement</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>Supports AORUS Memory Boost on selected AORUS Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCB Architecture</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>High-Signal 10-Layer Sophisticated PCB Construction</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default JEDEC Speed / Volt</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>2666MHz / 1.2V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Latency</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>19-19-19-43</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>High-Efficiency Forged Aluminum Heat Spreaders</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Premium Matte AORUS Gray</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Multi-Zone Diffused RGB LED Strip</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ecosystem Integration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>RGB Fusion 2.0 Sync (Supports 12 Custom Lighting Modes / 5 DDR Exclusive)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profile</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Fully Tested &amp; Optimized for Intel &amp; AMD DDR4 Motherboard Platforms</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 5200.00, 5200.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/BF6eFjuEvrCB3PWlrUMMTpEqZ4klhrbgz4fov7aZ.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 11:06:10', '2026-07-13 16:58:39', 'Meta Title: Gigabyte AORUS RGB 8GB DDR4 3600MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the premium Gigabyte AORUS RGB 8GB DDR4 3600MHz desktop memory. Features performance-tuned CL18 low latency, high-efficiency AORUS heatsinks, and RGB Fusion 2.0.', 'Target Keywords: Gigabyte AORUS RGB DDR4 8GB, 8GB DDR4 3600MHz AORUS RAM, Gigabyte AORUS 3600MT/s desktop memory, AORUS high-speed DDR4, RGB Fusion gaming RAM, enthusiast DDR4 RAM upgrade.', NULL, 15, NULL, NULL),
(1475, 'Gigabyte AORUS RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM', 'Step into the next generation of high-frequency desktop performance and sleek gaming aesthetics with the Gigabyte AORUS RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM. Precision-engineered to satisfy modern multi-core processors, this premium 16GB U-DIMM module delivers a blistering 6000MHz frequency. Encased in an innovative copper-aluminum composite heat spreader coated in a thermal-enhancing NanoCarbon layer, it features dynamic multi-zone diffused lighting fully integrated with RGB Fusion 2.0 and supports single-click Intel XMP 3.0 and AMD EXPO for effortless performance optimization.', 'gigabyte-aorus-rgb-16gb-ddr5-6000mhz-desktop-ram-1783940826', '<p>Unleash the full computing potential of your high-end desktop rig with the enthusiast-grade <strong>Gigabyte AORUS RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Specifically developed to break past conventional bandwidth limitations, this 16GB DDR5 module utilizes premium, strictly sorted high-quality memory ICs resting on a highly stable multi-layer PCB layout. Operating at a lightning-fast <strong>6000MHz frequency</strong>, it drastically expands the communication lanes connecting your CPU and system storage array—slashing data-heavy application load times, fluidly pacing frames during high-refresh AAA gaming, and accelerating heavy rendering queues.</p><p>The defining architectural feature of the AORUS DDR5 platform is its revolutionary approach to thermal management. The memory is wrapped in a high-density, <strong>copper-aluminum composite heat spreader</strong> that combines the exceptionally rapid heat conduction of copper with the massive heat dissipation properties of aluminum. The entire structure is then finished in a matte <strong>AORUS Gray NanoCarbon coating</strong>. This cutting-edge layer ensures that internal memory temperatures remain comfortably under 70°C even under severe high-voltage overclocking strains, effectively safeguarding hardware health and protecting your operating system against unexpected crashes or blue-screen interruptions.</p><p>The visual implementation is equally striking. Crowning the top block is an exclusive diffused light strip that showcases sharp multi-zone lighting. Managed completely via the <strong>Gigabyte RGB Fusion 2.0 software ecosystem</strong>, the RAM gives you access to specialized DDR-exclusive lighting behaviors like Cascade, Droplet, and Color Strobe, allowing you to seamlessly tie your components together into a unified theme. Completed with an <strong>On-board Power Management Integrated Circuit (PMIC)</strong> for highly efficient 1.35V power delivery, a built-in <strong>On-die ECC engine</strong> for self-correcting structural data security, and full support for customizable <strong>Intel XMP 3.0</strong> and <strong>AMD EXPO</strong> frameworks, this premium memory module represents the definitive choice for modern computing layouts.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (Available in 1 x 16GB Single Module or 32GB Dual-Channel Kit layouts)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>6000 MHz (6000 MT/s / PC5-48000)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL40-40-40-76 / CL40-40-40-77</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Correction</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>On-die ECC (Error-Correcting Code)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCB Architecture</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>High-Signal Multi-Layer Quality PCB Layout</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default JEDEC Speed / Volt</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>4800MHz / 1.1V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management Tech</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>On-board Integrated Overclock PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Copper-Aluminum Composite Heat Spreader with NanoCarbon Coating</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal Limit Protection</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Engineered to maintain operation below 70°C</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Premium Textured AORUS Gray</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Multi-Zone Diffused RGB LED Strip with AORUS Patterns</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ecosystem Integration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>RGB Fusion 2.0 Sync (Supports DDR-Exclusive Lighting Modes)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profile</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Dual Profile Frameworks: Intel XMP 3.0 &amp; AMD EXPO (Rev. 1.1)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Optimized for Modern Intel (600/700 series) &amp; AMD (600 series) DDR5 Setups</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 7500.00, 7500.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/pBQLR2VIFNKXE6UJOOKQYy0VdeDGAjNohxBZum00.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 11:07:06', '2026-07-13 16:57:27', 'Meta Title: Gigabyte AORUS RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the premium Gigabyte AORUS RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz desktop memory. Features advanced copper-aluminum NanoCarbon cooling, XMP 3.0, and RGB Fusion 2.0.', 'Target Keywords: Gigabyte AORUS RGB DDR5 16GB, 16GB DDR5 6000MHz AORUS RAM, Gigabyte AORUS 6000MT/s desktop memory, AORUS Gray DDR5 RAM, RGB Fusion 2.0 gaming RAM, enthusiast DDR5 upgrade.', NULL, 15, NULL, NULL),
(1476, 'G.SKILL Aegis 8GB DDR4 3200Mhz Desktop RAM', 'Boost your desktop system’s responsiveness and unlock dependable processing speeds with the entry-tier powerhouse G.SKILL Aegis 8GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM. Named after the legendary shield of the Greek gods to symbolize structural strength and security, this high-performance 8GB U-DIMM module runs at a fast 3200MHz frequency. Tuned with a tight, low-latency CL16 profile, it strips away system bottlenecks during daily multitasking and gaming. Wrapped in a sleek, ultra-low-profile black and red thermal sleeve, it guarantees absolute physical clearance under large CPU coolers and offers seamless single-click overclocking via Intel XMP 2.0.', 'gskill-aegis-8gb-ddr4-3200mhz-desktop-ram-1783942917', '<h3>ong Description</h3><p>Give your PC a cost-effective performance injection and ensure stable frame delivery under load with the reliable <strong>G.SKILL Aegis 8GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Developed as the ultimate choice for budget-conscious gamers, builders, and everyday multitaskers, the Aegis DDR4 family is built using hand-selected, rigorously screened memory ICs mounted on a high-quality performance PCB. Operating at a proven <strong>3200MHz frequency</strong> coupled with a tight <strong>CL16-18-18-38 timing profile</strong>, it dramatically optimizes the internal data pipelines connecting your processor and active storage arrays—slashing application load times, reducing stutter in popular esports titles, and smoothiong Description</p><p>Give your PC a cost-effective performance injection and ensure stable frame delivery under load with the reliable <strong>G.SKILL Aegis 8GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Developed as the ultimate choice for budget-conscious gamers, builders, and everyday multitaskers, the Aegis DDR4 family is built using hand-selected, rigorously screened memory ICs mounted on a high-quality performance PCB. Operating at a proven <strong>3200MHz frequency</strong> coupled with a tight <strong>CL16-18-18-38 timing profile</strong>, it dramatically optimizes the internal data pipelines connecting your processor and active storage arrays—slashing application load times, reducing stutter in popular esports titles, and smoothing out multi-tab web browsing.</p><p>The defining physical characteristic of the Aegis framework is its uncompromised focus on space-saving efficiency and system compatibility. Instead of thick, bulky aluminum heat blocks that risk running into hardware clearance issues, this module utilizes a specialized, hyper-thin <strong>low-profile thermal heat spreader sleeve</strong>. Standing at an incredibly compact height, it fits perfectly inside space-constrained micro-ATX layouts or small-form-factor (SFF) Mini-ITX chassis setups, sliding easily underneath large dual-fan tower CPU air coolers without causing physical layout friction.</p><p>Engineered to integrate seamlessly with both modern Intel Core and AMD Ryzen platforms, this non-RGB memory stick focuses entirely on raw stability, cost-efficiency, and clean, industrial aesthetics. It features full automated support for <strong>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile)</strong>, letting you instantly activate its maximum rated performance limit with a single profile toggle inside the system BIOS—completely removing the need for stressful manual voltage or timing guesswork. Operating at an efficient 1.35V when fully configured, it maintains cool, rock-solid processing stability backed by G.SKILL\'s trusted limited lifetime warranty.ng out multi-tab web browsing.</p><p>The defining physical characteristic of the Aegis framework is its uncompromised focus on space-saving efficiency and system compatibility. Instead of thick, bulky aluminum heat blocks that risk running into hardware clearance issues, this module utilizes a specialized, hyper-thin <strong>low-profile thermal heat spreader sleeve</strong>. Standing at an incredibly compact height, it fits perfectly inside space-constrained micro-ATX layouts or small-form-factor (SFF) Mini-ITX chassis setups, sliding easily underneath large dual-fan tower CPU air coolers without causing physical layout friction.</p><p>Engineered to integrate seamlessly with both modern Intel Core and AMD Ryzen platforms, this non-RGB memory stick focuses entirely on raw stability, cost-efficiency, and clean, industrial aesthetics. It features full automated support for <strong>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile)</strong>, letting you instantly activate its maximum rated performance limit with a single profile toggle inside the system BIOS—completely removing the need for stressful manual voltage or timing guesswork. Operating at an efficient 1.35V when fully configured, it maintains cool, rock-solid processing stability backed by G.SKILL\'s trusted limited lifetime warranty.</p>', '<h2>Technical Specifications</h2><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>8GB (Single Module Layout / Ideal for Dual-Channel Upgrades)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>3200 MHz (PC4-25600)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL16-18-18-38 (XMP Enabled)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Checking</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>Non-ECC (Unbuffered Protection)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default JEDEC Speed / Volt</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>2133MHz / 1.20V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</t