(1477, 'G.Skill RIPJAWS-V 8GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM', 'Elevate your desktop\'s processing capabilities and guarantee rock-solid system stability with the classic G.Skill RIPJAWS-V 8GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM. Built as the newest evolutionary step in a legendary lineage of enthusiast hardware, this high-performance 8GB U-DIMM module hits the absolute sweet spot for mid-tier gaming and daily productivity. Running at a fast 3200MHz frequency with a tight CL16 low-latency profile, it utilizes an aggressive, sleek aluminum heat spreader to manage heat seamlessly while offering single-click overclocking performance via Intel XMP 2.0.', 'gskill-ripjaws-v-8gb-ddr4-3200mhz-desktop-ram-1783942977', '<p>configuration with the legendary <strong>G.Skill RIPJAWS-V 8GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Developed specifically to provide maximum hardware compatibility and cutting-edge responsiveness, the Ripjaws V series is constructed with strictly screened, hand-selected memory ICs mounted on a high-grade performance PCB. Operating at a blistering <strong>3200MHz frequency</strong> coupled with a tight <strong>CL16-18-18-38 timing profile</strong>, it dramatically expands internal communication bandwidth—slashing application loading screens, reducing system micro-stutters during intense gaming sessions, and providing smooth, lag-free environments for everyday multitasking.</p><p>The physical design of the Ripjaws V series centers around heavy-duty thermal defense and clean aesthetics. The module is wrapped in a high-efficiency <strong>forged aluminum heatsink</strong>—available in iconic finishes like Classic Black and Blazing Red—which features an aggressive jagged edge structure optimized to maximize surface area contact. This allows the stick to rapidly wick heat away from the sensitive underlying components, maintaining peak computing safety under heavy workloads. Standing at a well-planned <strong>42mm module height</strong>, it effortlessly accommodates the vast majority of oversized aftermarket CPU tower air coolers and liquid cooling radiators without triggering hardware clearance friction.</p><p>Engineered to achieve seamless hardware synergy across modern Intel Core and AMD Ryzen platforms, this non-RGB memory stick undergoes G.Skill\'s incredibly strict validation testing across all major motherboard brands to ensure best-in-class reliability. It comes fully programmed with the latest <strong>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile)</strong> framework, enabling you to instantly lock in its peak rated speeds at 1.35V with a single setting in your system BIOS. Backed by G.Skill’s trusted limited lifetime warranty, this module repre</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>8GB (Single Module Layout / Perfect for Dual-Channel Upgrades)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>3200 MHz (PC4-25600)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL16-18-18-38</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Checking</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>Non-ECC (Unbuffered Protection)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default JEDEC Speed / Volt</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>2133MHz / 1.20V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>High-Efficiency Forged Aluminum Heat Spreader</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Physical Height</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>42 mm / 1.65 inches (High CPU Cooler Clearance)</td></tr><tr><td><