(1478, 'G.Skill Ripjaws V DDR4 3200MHz Technical Specifications', 'Unleash premium enthusiast performance and striking dual-tone styling with the award-winning G.Skill Trident Z 8GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered as a flagship choice for extreme gamers and hardware overclockers, this high-performance 8GB U-DIMM module runs at a fast 3200MHz frequency. Pairing an ultra-low CL16 latency profile with a luxurious hair-line finish aluminum heat spreader, it provides excellent thermal control and effortlessly achieves peak performance through automated Intel XMP 2.0 profile support.', 'gskill-ripjaws-v-ddr4-3200mhz-technical-specifications-1783943121', '<p><strong>DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Renowned globally for breaking multiple world overclocking records, the Trident Z series represents the absolute pinnacle of high-bandwidth engineering for DDR4 ecosystems. Built on a premium signal PCB layered with 100% hand-screened, strictly qualified memory ICs, this 8GB module maintains a blistering <strong>3200MHz frequency</strong> paired with a tight <strong>CL16-18-18-38 timing profile</strong> at 1.35V. This performance-focused pipeline drastically widens data transfer rates between your CPU and active storage arrays—slashing program loading times, optimizing video render queues, and offering buttery-smooth frame pacing during intensive AAA gaming loops.</p><p>The defining architectural achievement of the Trident Z family is its legendary, award-winning structural cooling system. The module features heavy-duty <strong>forged aluminum heat spreaders</strong> styled in a luxurious hair-line finish with an aggressive, asymmetric top fin layout. This design maximizes structural airflow exposure to pull harmful thermal energy rapidly away from the sensitive internal circuitry, guaranteeing rock-solid operating safety even under long-duration computing duress. Standing at an imposing enthusiast height, it makes a bold visual statement in clear-windowed PC cases, eliminating complex RGB cables in favor of clean, structural hardware beauty.</p><p>Rigorously validated across all major motherboard brands, this high-performance non-RGB memory stick delivers seamless plug-and-play synergy with modern Intel Core and AMD Ryzen platforms. It comes pre-programmed with official <strong>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile)</strong> automation, allowing you to bypass stressful manual voltage adjustments and instantly lock in rated high-speed configurations with a single setting in your system BIOS. Backed by an industry-trusted limited lifetime warranty, this high-value upgrade represents the gold standard for high-performance desktop custom builds.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>8GB (Single Module Layout / Engineered for Dual-Channel Scaling)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>3200 MHz (PC4-25600)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL16-18-18-38 (XMP Enabled)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Checking</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>Non-ECC (Unbuffered Protection)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default JEDEC Speed / Volt</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>2133MHz / 1.20V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default JEDEC Latency</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>15-15-15-36</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Dual-Tone Premium Aluminum Heat Spreaders with Aggressive Fins</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Texture Finish</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Luxurious Hair-Line Brushed Finish</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Classic Black &amp; Red / Black &amp; White (Batch Dependent)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB High-End Performance Aesthetic</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profile</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Ready</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Validated Across Leading Intel &amp; AMD DDR4 Motherboard Platforms</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 7500.00, 7500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/kWoxBEJlGRcN6TF7ZnnzRGs8i3Gbv8oR8jpZuZJ9.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 11:45:21', '2026-07-13 11:45:21', 'Meta Title: G.Skill Trident Z 8GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the premium G.Skill Trident Z 8GB DDR4 3200MHz desktop memory. Features performance-tuned CL16 low latency, an award-winning aluminum heat spreader, and Intel XMP 2.0.', 'Target Keywords: G.Skill Trident Z 8GB DDR4, 8GB DDR4 3200MHz Trident Z, G.Skill 3200MT/s desktop RAM, Trident Z non-RGB gaming memory, high-performance DDR4 upgrade, enthusiast PC RAM overclocking.', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1479, 'G.SKILL Value 8GB DDR4 2666Mhz Desktop RAM', 'Optimize your everyday computing efficiency and ensure stable system performance with the cost-effective G.SKILL Value 8GB DDR4 2666MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered specifically as a highly compatible, budget-friendly memory solution for standard office setups and home workstations, this 8GB U-DIMM module runs at a reliable 2666MHz frequency. Featuring a clean, low-profile, heatsink-free construction, it guarantees absolute physical clearance underneath any CPU cooler and provides energy-efficient 1.2V operation for dependable 24/7 productivity.', 'gskill-value-8gb-ddr4-2666mhz-desktop-ram-1783943185', '<p>stutter with the highly reliable <strong>G.SKILL Value 8GB DDR4 2666MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Developed as an uncompromising choice for budget-conscious system builders, corporate workstations, and everyday office setups, the G.SKILL Value series utilizes strictly qualified, extensively tested memory ICs built onto a high-grade performance PCB. Operating at a proven <strong>2666MHz frequency</strong> with a stable <strong>CL19-19-19-43 timing profile</strong>, it broadens the fundamental data pathways between your processor and system storage array—streamlining multi-tab web browsing, accelerating data entry workflows, and maintaining smooth operation in standard application tasks.</p><p>The defining mechanical feature of the G.SKILL Value framework is its minimalist, <strong>heatsink-free architecture</strong>. By stripping away bulky, decorative aluminum thermal blocks, this module presents an ultra-sleek, clean black PCB profile that eliminates any risk of hardware layout conflicts. Standing at the standard compact JEDEC height, it delivers universal clearance that fits effortlessly beneath massive dual-fan tower CPU air coolers and inside tightly packed small-form-factor (SFF) Mini-ITX cases where layout space is at a premium.</p><p>Engineered for broad compatibility across multiple generations of modern Intel Core and AMD Ryzen setups, this non-RGB memory stick undergoes rigorous validation testing across all major motherboard ecosystems to ensure exceptional long-term stability. Operating at a standard <strong>energy-efficient 1.2V baseline</strong>, it reduces power draw by up to 20% compared to legacy DDR3 hardware, lowering total system heat and power management overhead. Plug-and-play ready and backed by a limited lifetime warranty, this high-value module provides rock-solid computing peace of mind right out of the box.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>8GB (Single Module Layout / 8GB x 1)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>2666 MHz (PC4-21300)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL19-19-19-43</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Checking</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>Non-ECC (Unbuffered Protection)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default SPD Speed / Volt</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>2666MHz / 1.20V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Standard Airflow Dissipation (Heatsink-Free / Bare PCB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height Profile</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Low-Profile Compact JEDEC Footprint (Universal CPU Cooler Clearance)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PCB Color Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Classic Matte Black Profile</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Pure Functional Finish</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profile</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Plug-and-Play JEDEC Standard Automated Profile</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Broadly Optimized for Intel &amp; AMD DDR4 Motherboard Architectures</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 7000.00, 7000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/Wy61NjbS7aIk8nTwksr7VQlRwgY4qy0AAnk4qkWI.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 11:46:25', '2026-07-13 11:46:25', 'Meta Title: G.SKILL Value 8GB DDR4 2666MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the reliable G.SKILL Value 8GB DDR4 2666MHz desktop memory. Features an ultra-compatible heatsink-free layout, efficient 1.2V operation, and lifetime warranty.', 'Target Keywords: G.SKILL Value 8GB DDR4, 8GB DDR4 2666MHz G.SKILL RAM, G.SKILL Value 2666MT/s desktop memory, F4-2666C19S-8GNT upgrade, budget desktop PC RAM, low-profile non-heatsink DDR4 memory.', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1480, 'G.Skill Trident Z RGB 8GB DDR4 3200MHz Gaming Desktop RAM', NULL, 'gskill-trident-z-rgb-8gb-ddr4-3200mhz-gaming-desktop-ram-1783943284', '<p>Introduce high-performance processing velocity and jaw-dropping customized optics to your battle station with the iconic <strong>G.Skill Trident Z RGB 8GB DDR4 3200MHz Gaming Desktop RAM</strong>. Widely celebrated as a masterpiece of enthusiast engineering, this 8GB memory stick is constructed utilizing high-grade, ten-layer signal routing PCBs paired with 100% hand-screened components. Clocked at a fast <strong>3200MHz speed</strong> with a highly efficient <strong>CL16-18-18-38 timing profile</strong> at 1.35V, it significantly reduces data-handling delays to optimize system responsiveness—delivering crisp frames in competitive AAA titles, shortening project loading times, and ensuring fluid multitasking across system utilities.</p><p>The hallmark innovation of this gaming memory is its fully exposed, panoramic <strong>RGB lightbar</strong>. Designed to provide completely fluid, wave-like lighting without requiring extra internal power cables, the default profile cycles through a beautiful full-spectrum rainbow wave. Using G.Skill\'s downloadable control dashboard or syncing natively through major motherboard suites like ASUS Aura Sync, Gigabyte RGB Fusion 2.0, MSI Mystic Light Sync, and ASRock Polychrome RGB, you can orchestrate personalized lighting patterns that match your exact layout styling.</p><p>Beneath the radiant illumination bar sits an elite dual-tone <strong>brushed aluminum heat spreader</strong>. Featuring a high-contrast matte black and sleek silver finish with aggressive top-tier cooling fins, it pulls localized thermal energy rapidly away from the delicate internal circuitry to ensure absolute system stability under heavy operational strains. Rigorously tested across a vast array of modern AMD Ryzen and Intel Core platforms, it incorporates full <strong>Intel XMP 2.0</strong> automated profile capabilities, enabling you to secure your maximum rated performance levels with a quick toggle in the BIOS right out of the box.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>8GB (Single Module Layout / Seamlessly Scalable to Multi-Channel Setup)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>3200 MHz (PC4-25600)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL16-18-18-38 (XMP Enabled)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Checking</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>Non-ECC (Unbuffered Protection)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default JEDEC Speed / Volt</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>2133MHz / 1.20V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Dual-Tone Forged Aluminum Heat Spreaders with Asymmetric Cooling Fins</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Texture Finish</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Premium Hair-Line Brushed Finish</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Exposed Full-Range Panoramic Multi-Zone RGB Lightbar</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Synchronization</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>G.Skill RGB Software / ASUS Aura / Gigabyte RGB Fusion / MSI Mystic Light / ASRock Polychrome</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profile</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Ready</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Rigorously Validated Across Mainstream Intel &amp; AMD DDR4 Motherboards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 7700.00, 7700.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/OeF3zfxl2EiFGcpYasRqrNTUFyfPzIRam2XcMSd2.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 11:48:04', '2026-07-13 17:09:25', 'Meta Title: G.Skill Trident Z RGB 8GB DDR4 3200MHz Gaming Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the G.Skill Trident Z RGB 8GB DDR4 3200MHz gaming memory. Features an award-winning aluminum heat spreader, a vibrant full-range RGB lightbar, and Intel XMP 2.0.', 'Target Keywords: G.Skill Trident Z RGB 8GB DDR4, 8GB DDR4 3200MHz Trident Z RGB, G.Skill 3200MT/s RGB gaming RAM, Trident Z RGB CL16 memory, desktop DDR4 RGB upgrade, enthusiast gaming PC RAM.', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1481, 'G.SKILL Aegis 16GB DDR4 3200Mhz Desktop RAM', 'Boost your desktop system’s responsiveness and unlock dependable processing speeds with the high-value powerhouse G.SKILL Aegis 16GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM. Named after the legendary shield of the Greek gods to symbolize structural strength and security, this high-performance 16GB U-DIMM module runs at a fast 3200MHz frequency. Tuned with a tight, low-latency CL16 profile, it strips away system bottlenecks during daily multitasking and heavy gaming loops. Wrapped in a sleek, ultra-low-profile black and red thermal sleeve, it guarantees absolute physical clearance under large CPU coolers and offers seamless single-click overclocking via Intel XMP 2.0.', 'gskill-aegis-16gb-ddr4-3200mhz-desktop-ram-1783943351', '<p>v</p><p><img src=\"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcTKtLCjmkwYU1aHDShvv39dIWBZgWBqvbVYrqHM0uWBwqWHXw876tQo3lM&amp;s=10\" alt=\"G.SKILL Aegis DDR4 Desktop Memory Module, AI generated\" width=\"316\" height=\"316\"></p><p>G.SKILL Aegis DDR4 Desktop Memory Module. Source: Star Tech</p><p>Give your PC a cost-effective performance injection and ensure stable frame delivery under load with the reliable <strong>G.SKILL Aegis 16GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Developed as the ultimate choice for budget-conscious gamers, builders, and everyday multitaskers needing a massive memory cushion, the Aegis DDR4 family is built using hand-selected, rigorously screened memory ICs mounted on a high-quality performance PCB. Operating at a proven <strong>3200MHz frequency</strong> coupled with a tight <strong>CL16-18-18-38 timing profile</strong>, it dramatically optimizes the internal data pipelines connecting your processor and active storage arrays—slashing application load times, reducing stutter in popular esports titles, and smoothing out multi-tab web browsing.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The defining physical characteristic of the Aegis framework is its uncompromised focus on space-saving efficiency and system compatibility. Instead of thick, bulky aluminum heat blocks that risk running into hardware clearance issues, this module utilizes a specialized, hyper-thin <strong>low-profile thermal heat spreader sleeve</strong>. Standing at an incredibly compact height, it fits perfectly inside space-constrained micro-ATX layouts or small-form-factor (SFF) Mini-ITX chassis setups, sliding easily underneath large dual-fan tower CPU air coolers without causing physical layout friction.</p><p>Engineered to integrate seamlessly with both modern Intel Core and AMD Ryzen platforms, this non-RGB memory stick focuses entirely on raw stability, cost-efficiency, and clean, industrial aesthetics. It features full automated support for <strong>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile)</strong>, letting you instantly activate its maximum rated performance limit with a single profile toggle inside the system BIOS—completely removing the need for stressful manual voltage or timing guesswork. Operating at an efficient 1.35V when fully configured, it maintains cool, rock-solid processing stability backed by G.SKILL\'s trusted limited lifetime warranty.</p>', NULL, NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/pE0kO6aSic1lIJdhmy5uSR3VFT9VPJbCG3NUAONn.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 11:49:11', '2026-07-13 11:49:11', 'Meta Title: G.SKILL Aegis 16GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the G.SKILL Aegis 16GB DDR4 3200MHz desktop memory. Features performance-tuned CL16 latency, a low-profile stealth design, and Intel XMP 2.0 support.', 'Target Keywords: G.SKILL Aegis 16GB DDR4, 16GB DDR4 3200MHz G.SKILL RAM, G.SKILL Aegis 3200MT/s desktop memory, Aegis F4-3200C16S-16GIS, budget gaming PC RAM, low-profile non-RGB DDR4 upgrade.', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL);
