(1482, 'G.Skill Ripjaws V 16GB DDR4 2666MHz C19 RAM', 'Expand your system\'s multitasking capabilities and ensure rock-solid stability with the G.Skill Ripjaws V 16GB DDR4 2666MHz CL19 Desktop RAM. Designed as a perfect upgrade for daily productivity, content creation, and mainstream computing, this high-performance 16GB U-DIMM module runs at a stable 2666MHz frequency. Housed inside an aggressive, sleek aluminum heat spreader that keeps operational temperatures low, it delivers hassle-free, highly compatible plug-and-play installation operating at an energy-efficient 1.2V baseline.', 'gskill-ripjaws-v-16gb-ddr4-2666mhz-c19-ram-1783943663', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcTKtLCjmkwYU1aHDShvv39dIWBZgWBqvbVYrqHM0uWBwqWHXw876tQo3lM&amp;s=10\" alt=\"G.SKILL Aegis DDR4 Desktop Memory Module, AI generated\" width=\"316\" height=\"316\"></p><p>G.SKILL Aegis DDR4 Desktop Memory Module. Source: Star Tech</p><p>Give your PC a cost-effective performance injection and ensure stable frame delivery under load with the reliable <strong>G.SKILL Aegis 16GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Developed as the ultimate choice for budget-conscious gamers, builders, and everyday multitaskers needing a massive memory cushion, the Aegis DDR4 family is built using hand-selected, rigorously screened memory ICs mounted on a high-quality performance PCB. Operating at a proven <strong>3200MHz frequency</strong> coupled with a tight <strong>CL16-18-18-38 timing profile</strong>, it dramatically optimizes the internal data pipelines connecting your processor and active storage arrays—slashing application load times, reducing stutter in popular esports titles, and smoothing out multi-tab web browsing.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The defining physical characteristic of the Aegis framework is its uncompromised focus on space-saving efficiency and system compatibility. Instead of thick, bulky aluminum heat blocks that risk running into hardware clearance issues, this module utilizes a specialized, hyper-thin <strong>low-profile thermal heat spreader sleeve</strong>. Standing at an incredibly compact height, it fits perfectly inside space-constrained micro-ATX layouts or small-form-factor (SFF) Mini-ITX chassis setups, sliding easily underneath large dual-fan tower CPU air coolers without causing physical layout friction.</p><p>Engineered to integrate seamlessly with both modern Intel Core and AMD Ryzen platforms, this non-RGB memory stick focuses entirely on raw stability, cost-efficiency, and clean, industrial aesthetics. It features full automated support for <strong>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile)</strong>, letting you instantly activate its maximum rated performance limit with a single profile toggle inside the system BIOS—completely removing the need for stressful manual voltage or timing guesswork. Operating at an efficient 1.35V when fully configured, it maintains cool, rock-solid processing stability backed by G.SKILL\'s trusted limited lifetime warranty.</p><h2>Technical Specifications</h2>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (Single Module Layout / Ideal for Multi-Channel Expansion)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>3200 MHz (PC4-25600)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL16-18-18-38 (XMP Enabled)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Checking</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>Non-ECC (Unbuffered Protection)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default JEDEC Speed / Volt</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>2133MHz / 1.20V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Ultra-Thin High-Efficiency Low-Profile Thermal Sleeve</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height Clearance</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Low-Profile Compact Footprint (Universal CPU Cooler Clearance)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Stealth Black with Signature Red Aegis Shield Accents</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB Sleek Functional Finish</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profile</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Ready</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Fully Optimized for Intel &amp; AMD DDR4 Motherboard Architectures</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 13700.00, 13700.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/qXf0Af7pIuFl69wzKY6oDkhCtncimJoBOIvYCdhS.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 11:54:23', '2026-07-13 11:54:23', 'G.Skill Ripjaws V 16GB DDR4 2666MHz C19 RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the reliable G.Skill Ripjaws V 16GB DDR4 2666MHz desktop memory. Features an aggressive aluminum heat spreader, stable 2666MT/s speed, and Plug-and-Play installation.', 'Target Keywords: G.Skill Ripjaws V 16GB DDR4, 16GB DDR4 2666MHz Ripjaws V, G.Skill 2666MT/s desktop RAM, Ripjaws V CL19 memory, non-RGB classic DDR4 upgrade, stable workstation PC RAM.', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1483, 'G.Skill Trident Z 16GB DDR4 3200MHz Heatsink Desktop RAM iosbd', 'Unleash premium enthusiast performance and striking dual-tone styling with the award-winning G.Skill Trident Z 16GB DDR4 3200MHz Heatsink Desktop RAM. Engineered as a flagship choice for extreme gamers, professional content creators, and hardware overclockers, this high-performance 16GB U-DIMM module runs at a fast 3200MHz frequency. Pairing an ultra-low CL16 latency profile with a luxurious hair-line finish aluminum heat spreader, it provides excellent thermal control and effortlessly achieves peak performance through automated Intel XMP 2.0 profile support.', 'gskill-trident-z-16gb-ddr4-3200mhz-heatsink-desktop-ram-iosbd-1783961661', '<p>Take your system\'s responsiveness and multitasking buffer to a professional level with the iconic <strong>G.Skill Trident Z 16GB DDR4 3200MHz Heatsink Desktop RAM</strong>. Renowned globally for breaking multiple world overclocking records, the Trident Z series represents the absolute pinnacle of high-bandwidth engineering for DDR4 ecosystems. Built on a premium signal PCB layered with 100% hand-screened, strictly qualified memory ICs, this 16GB module maintains a blistering <strong>3200MHz frequency</strong> paired with a tight <strong>CL16-18-18-38 timing profile</strong> at 1.35V. This performance-focused pipeline drastically widens data transfer rates between your CPU and active storage arrays—slashing program loading times, optimizing video render queues, and offering buttery-smooth frame pacing during intensive AAA gaming loops.</p><p>The defining architectural achievement of the Trident Z family is its legendary, award-winning structural cooling system. The module features heavy-duty <strong>forged aluminum heat spreaders</strong> styled in a luxurious hair-line brushed finish with an aggressive, asymmetric top fin layout. This design maximizes structural airflow exposure to pull harmful thermal energy rapidly away from the sensitive internal circuitry, guaranteeing rock-solid operating safety even under long-duration computing duress. Standing at an imposing enthusiast height, it makes a bold visual statement in clear-windowed PC cases, eliminating complex RGB cables in favor of clean, structural hardware beauty.</p><p>Rigorously validated across all major motherboard brands, this high-performance non-RGB memory stick delivers seamless plug-and-play synergy with modern Intel Core and AMD Ryzen platforms. It comes pre-programmed with official <strong>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile)</strong> automation, allowing you to bypass stressful manual voltage adjustments and instantly lock in rated high-speed configurations with a single setting in your system BIOS. Backed by an industry-trusted limited lifetime warranty, this high-value upgrade represents the gold standard for high-performance desktop custom builds.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (Available in 1 x 16GB Single Module or 32GB Dual-Channel Kit layouts)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>3200 MHz (PC4-25600)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL16-18-18-38 (XMP Enabled)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Checking</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>Non-ECC (Unbuffered Protection)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default JEDEC Speed / Volt</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>2133MHz / 1.20V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default JEDEC Latency</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>15-15-15-36</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Dual-Tone Premium Aluminum Heat Spreaders with Aggressive Fins</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Texture Finish</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Luxurious Hair-Line Brushed Finish</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Heatsink Color Styling</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Classic Gray &amp; Red / Brushed Black &amp; Silver (Batch Dependent)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lighting Configuration</strong></td><td>Aesthetics</td><td>Non-RGB High-End Performance Aesthetic</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Overclocking Profile</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile) Ready</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platform Compatibility</strong></td><td>Compatibility</td><td>Validated Across Leading Intel &amp; AMD DDR4 Motherboard Platforms</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pin Layout</strong></td><td>Connection</td><td>288-Pin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Coverage</strong></td><td>Policy</td><td>Product Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 19500.00, 19500.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/mJixZzVzzAVt4qaOfUv1h4MFDZgPVOjZZsn31CGS.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 11:55:29', '2026-07-13 16:54:21', 'Meta Title: G.Skill Trident Z 16GB DDR4 3200MHz Heatsink Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy the premium G.Skill Trident Z 16GB DDR4 3200MHz desktop memory. Features an award-winning aluminum heat spreader, low-latency CL16 timing, and Intel XMP 2.0.', 'Target Keywords: G.Skill Trident Z 16GB DDR4, 16GB DDR4 3200MHz Trident Z, G.Skill 3200MT/s desktop RAM, Trident Z non-RGB gaming memory, high-performance DDR4 heatsink upgrade, enthusiast PC RAM.', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1484, 'G.SKILL Aegis 16GB DDR4 3200Mhz Desktop RAM', 'Instantly upgrade your system\'s data-handling capacity and gaming responsiveness with the high-value powerhouse G.SKILL Aegis 16GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM. Named after the legendary shield of the Greek gods to symbolize armor-clad reliability, this 16GB U-DIMM module delivers a fast 3200MHz frequency. Tuned with a tight, low-latency CL16 profile, it strips away system bottlenecks during daily multi-tasking and competitive gaming loops. Wrapped in a specialized, hyper-thin thermal sleeve, it guarantees absolute layout clearance under massive CPU coolers while supporting seamless single-click overclocking via Intel XMP 2.0.', 'gskill-aegis-16gb-ddr4-3200mhz-desktop-ram-1783944070', '<p>operational loads with the reliable <strong>G.SKILL Aegis 16GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Developed specifically as an uncompromised choice for budget-conscious gamers, productivity professionals, and custom PC builders who need expansive memory capacity without the high premium cost, the Aegis DDR4 family is built using hand-selected, rigorously screened memory ICs mounted on a high-grade performance PCB. Operating at a proven <strong>3200MHz frequency</strong> coupled with a tight <strong>CL16-18-18-38 timing profile</strong>, it broadens the fundamental data pathways between your processor and active storage arrays—slashing application load times, reducing stutter in popular esports titles, and providing smooth environments for heavy multi-tasking workloads.</p><p>The defining physical characteristic of the Aegis framework is its focus on space-saving efficiency and broad layout compatibility. Instead of thick, decorative aluminum thermal blocks that can block large hardware components, this module utilizes a specialized, hyper-thin <strong>low-profile thermal heat spreader sleeve</strong>. Standing at standard JEDEC height, it fits perfectly inside space-constrained micro-ATX layouts or small-form-factor (SFF) Mini-ITX chassis setups, sliding easily underneath large dual-fan tower CPU air coolers without causing physical layout friction.</p><p>Engineered to integrate seamlessly with both modern Intel Core and AMD Ryzen platforms, this non-RGB memory stick focuses entirely on raw stability, cost-efficiency, and clean, industrial aesthetics. It features full automated support for <strong>Intel XMP 2.0 (Extreme Memory Profile)</strong>, letting you instantly activate its maximum rated performance limit with a single profile toggle inside the system BIOS—completely removing the need for stressful manual voltage or timing guesswork. Operating at an efficient 1.35V when fully configured, it maintains cool, rock-solid processing stability backed by G.SKILL\'s trusted limited lifetime warra</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Generation</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td><td>Chipset &amp; Core</td><td>U-DIMM (Standard Desktop Memory)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity Configuration</strong></td><td>Memory Size</td><td>16GB (Single Module Layout / 16GB x 1)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frequency / Bus Speed</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>3200 MHz (PC4-25600)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tested Latency Timings</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>CL16-18-18-38 (XMP Enabled)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Error Checking</strong></td><td>Performance</td><td>Non-ECC (Unbuffered Protection)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Operating Voltage (Tested)</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default JEDEC Speed / Volt</strong></td><td>Power</td><td>2133MHz / 1.20V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cooling Architecture</strong></td><td>Thermal &amp; Physical</td><td>Ultra-Thin High-Efficiency Low-Profile Thermal Sleeve</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Module Height Clearance</strong></td