(1487, 'G-Skill Ripjaws S5 16GB DDR5 5600MHz CL30 Desktop RAM', 'Unlock explosive next-gen processing speed and exceptional low-latency performance with the G.Skill Ripjaws S5 16GB DDR5 5600MHz CL30 Desktop RAM. Tailored for high-end gaming rigs and space-conscious enthusiast configurations, this premium 16GB U-DIMM module delivers a fast 5600MHz frequency coupled with an ultra-tight, optimized CL30 low-latency profile. Encased in a minimal, compact 33mm aluminum heat spreader featuring classic racing-stripe aesthetics, it guarantees ultimate CPU cooler clearance and seamless single-click overclocking through Intel XMP 3.0.', 'g-skill-ripjaws-s5-16gb-ddr5-5600mhz-cl30-desktop-ram-1783944527', '<p>Take your PC build\'s speed, responsiveness, and multitasking capabilities to the next level with the <strong>G.Skill Ripjaws S5 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Specifically developed and optimized for the latest multi-core processors and cutting-edge motherboard chipsets, the Ripjaws S5 marks an extreme evolution from legacy DDR4. By doubling the bank groups and implementing an onboard Power Management Integrated Circuit (PMIC), it offers granular power control and flawless signal integrity at high-frequency workloads.</p><p>Whether you are rendering complex animations, jumping into AAA gaming, or handling resource-heavy multitasking, its lightning-fast 5600MT/s speed combined with an ultra-tight CL30 timing ensures minimal lag and maximum throughput. The sleek design is inspired by classic racing stripes and grills, featuring a premium matte aluminum finish that seamlessly complements modern setups. Backed by G.Skill’s rigorous validation testing and a limited lifetime warranty, it represents the ultimate trinity of speed, style, and rock-solid reli</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>5600 MHz (5600 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL30-36-36-89</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.25V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Speed</td><td>4800 MHz (4800 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Voltage</td><td>1.10V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Multi-Channel Kit</td><td>Supports Dual-Channel Architecture</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Profile Support</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 Ready</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>Non-ECC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Unbuffered</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Power</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader</td><td>Aluminum (Matte Finish)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Module Height</td><td>33 mm</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Control</td><td>Onboard PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F5-5600J3036D16GX2-RS5K</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 30500.00, 30500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/gPnm339PesAz2eu4J2UMAPPjYeh771O52gJYOoj5.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 12:08:47', '2026-07-13 12:08:47', 'Meta Title: G.Skill Ripjaws S5 16GB DDR5 5600MHz CL30 Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Buy G.Skill Ripjaws S5 16GB DDR5 5600MHz desktop memory. Features ultra-low latency CL30 timings, low-profile 33mm aluminum heatsink, and Intel XMP 3.0.', 'Target Keywords: G.Skill Ripjaws S5 DDR5 16GB, 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Ripjaws S5, G.Skill 5600MT/s CL30 RAM, Ripjaws S5 low profile DDR5, non-RGB compact DDR5 upgrade, enthusiast low latency PC RAM.', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1490, 'G.Skill Ripjaws V 16GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM (Black)', 'Designed to deliver maximum performance and compatibility, the G.Skill Ripjaws V 16GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM is the perfect upgrade for mainstream PC builders and gamers. Operating at a reliable CL16-20-20-40 latency profile at 1.35V, this module features an aggressive, sleek aluminum heat spreader that keeps temperatures low while fitting beautifully into any stealth build. Fully compatible with both Intel and AMD platforms, it supports Intel XMP 2.0 for hassle-free, one-click overclocking.', 'gskill-ripjaws-v-16gb-ddr4-3200mhz-desktop-ram-black-1783944910', '<p>The <strong>G.Skill Ripjaws V 16GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM</strong> is the classic choice for building a balanced, high-performance system. As a standout entry in the legendary Ripjaws family, this DDR4 module is purpose-built for smooth multitasking, competitive gaming, and heavy computing tasks. Operating at 3200MHz, it provides the ideal sweet spot for modern multi-core processors, eliminating system bottlenecks without drawing unnecessary excess power.</p><p>Every single Ripjaws V module is built with rigorously hand-screened ICs and undergoes G.Skill’s punishing validation testing on major motherboard brands to guarantee unmatched reliability across systems. The module stands at a manageable 42mm in height, engineered to provide adequate space for most mid-to-large CPU air coolers. Its sleek, texturized matte black aluminum heat spreader not only radiates heat efficiently but also adds a sharp, aggressive look to your rig. With full Intel XMP 2.0 profile support, achieving peak rated performance is as simple as flipping a switch in your BIOS.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>3200 MHz (3200 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL16-20-20-40</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Speed</td><td>2133 MHz (2133 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Multi-Channel Kit</td><td>Single Module (Dual-Channel compatible)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Profile Support</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 Ready</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>Non-ECC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Unbuffered</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Power</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader</td><td>Aluminum (Classic Black Finish)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Module Height</td><td>42 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F4-3200C16S-16GVK / F4-3200C16D-16GVK (Kit)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 15700.00, 15700.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/RYGFmOUu28K72Yj6pAKSAeQDR14sTN495luVxUmi.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 12:15:10', '2026-07-13 12:15:10', 'Meta Title: G.Skill Ripjaws V 16GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM (Black)', 'Meta Description: Enhance your PC\'s speed with the G.Skill Ripjaws V 16GB DDR4 3200MHz desktop memory. Features an aggressive black aluminum heat spreader and Intel XMP 2.0.', 'Keywords: G.Skill Ripjaws V DDR4, 16GB DDR4 3200MHz, Black Desktop RAM 16GB, F4-3200C16S-16GVK, Gaming Desktop Memory, Intel XMP 2.0 RAM', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1491, 'G.Skill Trident Z5 16GB DDR5 5600MHz CL36 Desktop RAM Silver', 'Bring flagship-tier performance and premium style to your setup with the G.Skill Trident Z5 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered for elite enthusiasts and gamers, this module boasts an optimized CL36-36-36-89 timing profile running at 1.20V. It features a stunning, hyper-modern metallic silver and matte black aluminum heat spreader designed to provide exceptional thermal cooling while instantly elevating your PC\'s aesthetic.', 'gskill-trident-z5-16gb-ddr5-5600mhz-cl36-desktop-ram-silver-1783944968', '<p>The <strong>G.Skill Trident Z5 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Desktop RAM</strong> represents the pinnacle of next-generation memory architecture. Specifically built to crush data bottlenecks on elite multi-core processors, this DDR5 module pushes boundaries with a blistering 5600MT/s data transfer rate. By incorporating an onboard Power Management Integrated Circuit (PMIC) and dual 32-bit subchannels, it delivers unparalleled power efficiency and signal stability under intense multi-threaded workloads like heavy gaming, content creation, and software development.</p><p>Every single Trident Z5 module is assembled using hand-selected, high-grade ICs that undergo G.Skill\'s legendary multi-stage validation process across top-tier motherboards. The exterior features a sleek hypercar-inspired look, pairing a brushed aluminum silver body with a contrast-heavy black center strip. Fully compatible with Intel XMP 3.0 profiles, unlocking rated speeds is effortless via a quick selection in the BIOS. Combining unmatched engineering with clean,</p>', '<h3>Technical Specifications</h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>5600 MHz (5600 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL36-36-36-89</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Speed</td><td>4800 MHz (4800 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Voltage</td><td>1.10V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Multi-Channel Kit</td><td>Supports Dual-Channel Architecture</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Profile Support</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 Ready</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>On-Die ECC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Unbuffered</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Power</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader</td><td>Brushed Aluminum (Metallic Silver / Black)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Height Profile</td><td>44 mm</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Architecture</td><td>Onboard PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F5-5600J3636C16GX2-TZ5S</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 30500.00, 30500.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/oj1uE7kft9LvoArt8FS5Eu0nHx11FnMgImy3EACy.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 12:16:08', '2026-07-13 12:16:27', 'Meta Title: G.Skill Trident Z5 16GB DDR5 5600MHz CL36 Desktop RAM - Silver', 'Meta Description: Experience flagship performance with G.Skill Trident Z5 16GB DDR5 RAM. Features ultra-fast 5600MHz speeds, CL36 latency, and a premium silver aluminum heat spreader.', 'Keywords: G.Skill Trident Z5 DDR5, 16GB DDR5 5600MHz, Silver DDR5 Desktop RAM, CL36 DDR5 Memory, High-Performance Gaming RAM, Intel XMP 3.0 DDR5', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1492, 'G-Skill Ripjaws S5 16GB DDR5 5600MHz CL30 Desktop RAM iosbd', 'Unlock next-generation performance with the G.Skill Ripjaws S5 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered with hand-screened ICs and programmed with Intel XMP 3.0 profiles, this module delivers an ultra-low latency of CL30-36-36-89 at a low 1.25V. Its minimalistic, 33mm low-profile aluminum heat spreader ensures a perfect fit under massive CPU coolers and in compact Mini-ITX builds while keeping your system cool under pressure.', 'g-skill-ripjaws-s5-16gb-ddr5-5600mhz-cl30-desktop-ram-iosbd-1783961100', '<h4>Long Description</h4><p>Take your PC build\'s speed, responsiveness, and multitasking capabilities to the next level with the <strong>G.Skill Ripjaws S5 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Specifically developed and optimized for the latest multi-core processors and cutting-edge motherboard chipsets, the Ripjaws S5 marks an extreme evolution from legacy DDR4. By doubling the bank groups and implementing an onboard Power Management Integrated Circuit (PMIC), it offers granular power control and flawless signal integrity at high-frequency workloads.</p><p>Whether you are rendering complex animations, jumping into AAA gaming, or handling resource-heavy multitasking, its lightning-fast 5600MT/s speed combined with an ultra-tight CL30 timing ensures minimal lag and maximum throughput. The sleek design is inspired by classic racing stripes and grills, featuring a premium matte aluminum finish that seamlessly complements modern setups. Backed by G.Skill’s rigorous validation testing and a limited lifetime warranty, it represents the ultimate trinity of speed, style, and rock-solid reliability.</p><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>5600 MHz (5600 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL30-36-36-89</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.25V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Speed</td><td>4800 MHz (4800 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Voltage</td><td>1.10V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Multi-Channel Kit</td><td>Supports Dual-Channel Architecture</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Profile Support</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 Ready</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>Non-ECC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Unbuffered</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Power</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader</td><td>Aluminum (Matte Finish)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Module Height</td><td>33 mm</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Control</td><td>Onboard PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F5-5600J3036D16GX2-RS5K</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 30500.00, 30500.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/7uapxOcks39cLOwci23278ftuHF7SS64mkTOUDKW.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 12:17:33', '2026-07-13 16:45:00', 'Meta Title: G.Skill Ripjaws S5 16GB DDR5 5600MHz CL30 Desktop RAM', 'Keywords: G.Skill Ripjaws S5 DDR5, 16GB DDR5 5600MHz, CL30 DDR5 RAM, Low-profile DDR5 Desktop RAM, Gaming RAM 16GB DDR5, F5-5600J3036D16GX2-RS5K', 'Meta Description: Upgrade to next-gen speed with G.Skill Ripjaws S5 16GB DDR5 RAM. Features ultra-low CL30 latency, 5600MHz speed, and a sleek, low-profile 33mm heat spreader.', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1493, 'G-Skill Flare X5 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Desktop RAM', 'Designed explicitly for DDR5-enabled AMD AM5 platforms, the G.Skill Flare X5 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Desktop RAM brings high-speed efficiency to your next-gen build. It features an optimized CL36-36-36-89 latency profile operating at a power-efficient 1.20V. Built with hand-screened ICs and fully integrated with AMD EXPO overclocking profiles, this unbuffered, low-profile 33mm module delivers effortless performance boosts while clearing massive CPU coolers with room to spare.', 'g-skill-flare-x5-16gb-ddr5-5600mhz-desktop-ram-1783945099', '<p>Unleash the full computing potential of your AMD Ryzen processor with the <strong>G.Skill Flare X5 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Engineered specifically for the demands of the AM5 ecosystem, the Flare X5 series bridges the gap between raw hardware capabilities and reliable everyday execution. With a data transfer speed hitting 5600MT/s, this module easily handles resource-heavy workloads, including competitive AAA gaming, 4K rendering, and multi-layered media creation.</p><p>The Flare X5 stands out with its smart integration of AMD EXPO (Extended Profiles for Overclocking), letting you unlock rated speeds instantly through a simple one-step BIOS activation. Visually, it boasts an anodized matte black aluminum heat spreader featuring classic racing stripes and thermal ventilation grills. Its compact 33mm height guarantees zero physical interference with large aftermarket air coolers or tight Mini-ITX chassis configurations. Every single module goes through G.Skill\'s uncompromising multi-stage validation testing, ensuring rock-solid data integrity and lasting endurance, completely backed by a limited lifetime warranty.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>5600 MHz (5600 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL36-36-36-89</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Speed</td><td>4800 MHz (4800 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Voltage</td><td>1.10V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Profile Support</td><td>AMD EXPO Ready (Also supports XMP)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Architecture Optimization</td><td>Optimized for AMD AM5 Ryzen Platforms</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>Non-ECC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Unbuffered</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Power</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader</td><td>Anodized Aluminum (Matte Black)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Module Height</td><td>33 mm (Low-Profile clearance)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Management</td><td>Onboard PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F5-5600J3636C16GX2-FX5 / F5-5600J3636C16GX1-FX5</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 30500.00, 30500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/a9dG2ctcQfZtonL8yFslJoV7xwrguCLKT0EhJisb.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 12:18:19', '2026-07-13 16:50:43', 'Meta Title: G.Skill Flare X5 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Desktop RAM (AMD EXPO)', 'Meta Description: Maximize your AMD Ryzen setup with the G.Skill Flare X5 16GB DDR5 RAM. Engineered for AM5 platforms, featuring 5600MHz speed, CL36 latency, and AMD EXPO support.', 'Keywords: G.Skill Flare X5 DDR5, 16GB DDR5 5600MHz, AMD EXPO DDR5 RAM, Low-profile AM5 Desktop RAM, F5-5600J3636C16GX2-FX5, High-performance AMD Memory', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1494, 'G.SKILL Trident Z5 RGB 16GB DDR5 5600MHz CL30 1.25V Desktop RAM', 'Experience the perfect fusion of extreme performance and brilliant aesthetics with the G.SKILL Trident Z5 RGB 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered with hand-screened ICs and supporting Intel XMP 3.0 overclocking profiles, this high-tier module boasts an ultra-low latency timing of CL30-36-36-89 operating at just 1.25V. It features a sleek, hypercar-inspired aluminum heat spreader topped with a customizable translucent RGB light bar for breathtaking, synchronized illumination.', 'gskill-trident-z5-rgb-16gb-ddr5-5600mhz-cl30-125v-desktop-ram-1783945193', '<p>Take your custom PC build into the next generation of computing power with the <strong>G.SKILL Trident Z5 RGB 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Specifically developed to maximize performance on the latest multi-core desktop processors and advanced chipsets, the Trident Z5 RGB breaks past traditional DDR4 limitations. Operating at a roaring 5600MT/s with an exceptionally tight CL30 latency, this module minimizes response lag to ensure buttery-smooth frames in AAA gaming, instantaneous rendering in creative apps, and effortless multi-tasking.</p><p>The Trident Z5 RGB showcases a premium dual-texture aluminum heat spreader, integrating a sleek brushed metallic body with a matte black middle band. On top sits a streamlined, translucent light bar optimized for smooth, seamless RGB dispersion. The lighting can be easily customized and synchronized using G.SKILL lighting control software or major motherboard utilities like ASUS Aura Sync, Gigabyte RGB Fusion, MSI Mystic Light, or ASRock Polychrome Sync. Equipped with an onboard Power Management Integrated Circuit (PMIC) and On-Die ECC (Error Correction Code), it guarantees rock-solid stability under intensive overclocking workloads. Backed by G.SKILL\'s stringent multi-platform validation and a limited lifetime warranty, it represents the absolute pinnacle of speed, reliability, and style.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>5600 MHz (5600 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL30-36-36-89</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.25V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Speed</td><td>4800 MHz (4800 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Voltage</td><td>1.10V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Profile Support</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 Ready</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Optimization</td><td>Onboard PMIC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>On-Die ECC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Unbuffered</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Lighting</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader</td><td>Brushed Aluminum (Black / Silver variants)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lighting Type</td><td>Customizable LED RGB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Software Sync</td><td>ASUS Aura, Gigabyte RGB Fusion, MSI Mystic Light, ASRock Polychrome</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Module Height</td><td>44 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F5-5600J3036D16GX2-TZ5RK / F5-5600J3036D16G-TZ5RK</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 31500.00, 31500.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/1IQOh3O3PM9Jcrz2i9lZAYzoOw8MWIx2vTxqz2Tt.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 12:19:53', '2026-07-13 12:19:53', 'Meta Title: G.SKILL Trident Z5 RGB 16GB DDR5 5600MHz CL30 Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Elevate your gaming PC with G.SKILL Trident Z5 RGB 16GB DDR5 RAM. Features lightning-fast 5600MHz speed, ultra-low CL30 latency, and customizable RGB lighting.', 'Keywords: G.SKILL Trident Z5 RGB DDR5, 16GB DDR5 5600MHz CL30, Trident Z5 RGB 1.25V, High-Performance RGB DDR5 RAM, Intel XMP 3.0 Gaming Memory, F5-5600J3036D16GX2-TZ5RK', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1495, 'G.Skill Trident Z5 RGB 16GB DDR5 5600MHz CL30 Desktop RAM', 'Experience the perfect fusion of extreme performance and brilliant aesthetics with the G.Skill Trident Z5 RGB 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered with hand-screened ICs and supporting Intel XMP 3.0 overclocking profiles, this high-tier module boasts an ultra-low latency timing of CL30-36-36-89 operating at 1.25V. It features a sleek, hypercar-inspired aluminum heat spreader topped with a customizable translucent RGB light bar for breathtaking, synchronized illumination.', 'gskill-trident-z5-rgb-16gb-ddr5-5600mhz-cl30-desktop-ram-1783945250', '<p>Take your custom PC build into the next generation of computing power with the <strong>G.Skill Trident Z5 RGB 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Specifically developed to maximize performance on the latest multi-core desktop processors and advanced chipsets, the Trident Z5 RGB breaks past traditional DDR4 limitations. Operating at a roaring 5600MT/s with an exceptionally tight CL30 latency, this module minimizes response lag to ensure buttery-smooth frames in AAA gaming, instantaneous rendering in creative apps, and effortless multi-tasking.</p><p>The Trident Z5 RGB showcases a premium dual-texture aluminum heat spreader, integrating a sleek brushed metallic body with a matte black middle band. On top sits a streamlined, translucent light bar optimized for smooth, seamless RGB dispersion. The lighting can be easily customized and synchronized using G.Skill lighting control software or major motherboard utilities like ASUS Aura Sync, Gigabyte RGB Fusion, MSI Mystic Light, or ASRock Polychrome Sync. Equipped with an onboard Power Management Integrated Circuit (PMIC) and On-Die ECC (Error Correction Code), it guarantees rock-solid stability under intensive overclocking workloads. Backed by G.Skill\'s stringent multi-platform validation and a limited lifetime warranty, it represents the absolute pinnacle of speed, reliability, and style.</p>', '<figu