.Skill Trident Z5 RGB 16GB DDR5 RAM. Features lightning-fast 5600MHz speed, ultra-low CL30 latency, and customizable RGB lighting.', 'Keywords: G.Skill Trident Z5 RGB DDR5, 16GB DDR5 5600MHz CL30, High-Performance RGB DDR5 RAM, Intel XMP 3.0 Gaming Memory, F5-5600J3036D16GX2-TZ5RK, Trident Z5 RGB Silver', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1496, 'G-Skill Ripjaws S5 16GB DDR5 6000Mhz CL32 Desktop RAM', 'Push your system limits with the G.Skill Ripjaws S5 16GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM. Built using premium hand-screened ICs and supporting Intel XMP 3.0, this performance module delivers an exceptionally fast 6000MHz frequency paired with a tight CL32-38-38-96 timing profile at 1.35V. Its compact, 33mm low-profile matte aluminum heat spreader provides massive clearance for large CPU coolers while fitting smoothly into sleek, space-constrained builds.', 'g-skill-ripjaws-s5-16gb-ddr5-6000mhz-cl32-desktop-ram-1783945311', '<p>Step up to elite system speed and responsiveness with the <strong>G.Skill Ripjaws S5 16GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Engineered precisely for the latest multi-core processors and next-generation motherboard architectures, the Ripjaws S5 series strips away performance bottlenecks. Boasting a high-speed data transfer rate of 6000MT/s and low CL32 latency, it provides the optimal throughput needed for competitive gaming, rendering high-resolution media, and extreme multi-tasking setups.</p><p>The Ripjaws S5 stands out with a minimalist design language inspired by classic racing stripes and thermal ventilation grills. The premium matte aluminum heat spreader radiates heat quickly away from vital components, maintaining rock-solid system stability under sustained loads. Thanks to an integrated Power Management Integrated Circuit (PMIC) and On-Die ECC (Error Correction Code), the module handles granular power distribution effortlessly while protecting data integrity. Complete with Intel XMP 3.0 support for simple one-click BIOS overclocking, it offers an incredible mix of high-frequency power, low physical clearance, and long-term reliability.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>6000 MHz (6000 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL32-38-38-96</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Speed</td><td>4800 MHz (4800 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Voltage</td><td>1.10V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Profile Support</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 Ready</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Management</td><td>Onboard PMIC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>On-Die ECC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Unbuffered</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Design</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader</td><td>Aluminum (Matte Finish)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Module Height</td><td>33 mm (Low-Profile clearance)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F5-6000J3238F16GX2-RS5K / F5-6000J3238F16G-RS5K</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 32000.00, 32000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/B2FZrGCM2Vk1BSEG9Ih5ZpYd3j4IHNQuIeR3o6xM.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 12:21:51', '2026-07-13 12:21:51', 'Meta Title: G.Skill Ripjaws S5 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL32 Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Unleash high-speed performance with G.Skill Ripjaws S5 16GB DDR5 RAM. Features a fast 6000MHz clock speed, tight CL32 latency, and a low-profile 33mm design.', 'Keywords: G.Skill Ripjaws S5 DDR5, 16GB DDR5 6000MHz, CL32 DDR5 RAM, Low-profile DDR5 Desktop RAM, F5-6000J3238F16GX2-RS5K, Gaming RAM 16GB DDR5', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL);
