(1497, 'G.Skill Trident Z5 Neo RGB 16GB DDR5 6000Mhz CL36 Desktop RAM', 'Engineered specifically for DDR5-enabled AMD AM5 platforms, the G.Skill Trident Z5 Neo RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM brings raw, high-speed efficiency to your next-gen build. It features an optimized CL36-36-36-96 latency profile operating at a stable 1.35V. Built with premium hand-screened ICs and fully integrated with AMD EXPO overclocking profiles, this unbuffered module combines a stunning hypercar-inspired aluminum heat spreader with a customizable, translucent RGB light bar.', 'gskill-trident-z5-neo-rgb-16gb-ddr5-6000mhz-cl36-desktop-ram-1783945405', '<p>eash the true potential of your AMD Ryzen system with the <strong>G.Skill Trident Z5 Neo RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Purpose-built for high-frequency execution within the AM5 ecosystem, this memory module delivers a blazing-fast 6000MT/s transfer speed, completely smoothing out processing bottlenecks for AAA gaming, heavy software compilation, and complex 4K content rendering.</p><p>The Trident Z5 Neo RGB series stands out with its seamless integration of AMD EXPO (Extended Profiles for Overclocking), ensuring that achieving optimal rated performance requires nothing more than a simple, single-click activation in your system BIOS. On the visual front, the module captures elite automotive design cues, matching a sleek black brushed-aluminum inlay into a matte black body with precise CNC highlight stripes. The translucent upper light bar delivers brilliant, uniform RGB flow that easily syncs using G.Skill\'s proprietary lighting software or popular motherboard apps like ASUS Aura Sync, Gigabyte RGB Fusion, MSI Mystic Light, and ASRock Polychrome. Outfitted with an onboard Power Management Integrated Circuit (PMIC) and On-Die ECC for real-time error protection, it guarantees massive overclocking stability alongside rock-solid everyday performance.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>6000 MHz (6000 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL36-36-36-96</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Speed</td><td>4800 MHz (4800 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Voltage</td><td>1.10V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Profile Support</td><td>AMD EXPO Ready / Intel XMP 3.0</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>System Optimization</td><td>Tailored for AMD AM5 Ryzen Platforms</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>On-Die ECC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Unbuffered / Non-ECC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Lighting</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader</td><td>Aluminum (Matte Black / Brushed Inlay)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lighting Type</td><td>Customizable LED RGB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Height Profile</td><td>44 mm</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Management</td><td>Onboard PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F5-6000J3636F16GX2-TZ5NR / F5-6000J3636F16G-TZ5NR</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 33000.00, 33000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/VnGKrKEVNm8NWFX6gjdIFS5UBQ3oQ4JRperX6y0J.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 12:23:25', '2026-07-13 12:23:25', 'Meta Title: G.Skill Trident Z5 Neo RGB 16GB DDR5 6000MHz CL36 Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Maximize your AMD Ryzen setup with the G.Skill Trident Z5 Neo RGB 16GB DDR5 RAM. Features sleek hypercar styling, customizable RGB, and AMD EXPO optimization.', 'Keywords: G.Skill Trident Z5 Neo RGB, 16GB DDR5 6000MHz, CL36 DDR5 RAM, AMD EXPO Gaming Memory, F5-6000J3636F16GX2-TZ5NR, RGB Desktop RAM DDR5', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1498, 'G.Skill Trident Z5 RGB 32GB DDR5 5600MHz Desktop RAM', 'Maximize your desktop\'s capabilities with the flagship G.Skill Trident Z5 RGB 32GB DDR5 5600MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered with hand-screened high-grade ICs and optimized for the latest Intel Core processors, this premium 32GB (2x16GB) dual-channel kit operates at a smooth CL36-36-36-89 timing profile at 1.20V. Encased in a hypercar-inspired aluminum heat spreader with an integrated translucent RGB light bar, it delivers elite speed and spectacular visual flair.', 'gskill-trident-z5-rgb-32gb-ddr5-5600mhz-desktop-ram-1783945456', '<p>Engineered for hardware enthusiasts, competitive gamers, and heavy content creators, the <strong>G.Skill Trident Z5 RGB 32GB DDR5 5600MHz Desktop RAM</strong> brings extreme data bandwidth straight to your motherboard. Transitioning past standard DDR4 limits, this dual-channel kit utilizes a blistering 5600MT/s transfer speed to easily handle multi-layered workflows, massive 4K video editing assets, and heavy modern AAA gaming instances without breaking a sweat.</p><p>The Trident Z5 RGB features a premium dual-texture heat spreader crafted from black anodized aluminum with a polished brushed-aluminum inlay. Resting along the top edge is a streamlined, translucent light bar built for vibrant, uniform RGB diffusion. You can easily control and sync the colors through G.Skill\'s proprietary software or standard motherboard apps like ASUS Aura Sync, Gigabyte RGB Fusion, MSI Mystic Light, and ASRock Polychrome Sync. Under the hood, an integrated Power Management Integrated Circuit (PMIC) ensures stable voltages, while On-Die ECC (Error Correction Code) performs real-time data adjustments. Fully prepared with Intel XMP 3.0 profiles, one quick change in your system BIOS launches this kit to its peak rated performance instantly.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>32GB (16GB x 2)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>5600 MHz (5600 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL36-36-36-89</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Speed</td><td>4800 MHz (4800 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Voltage</td><td>1.10V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Multi-Channel Kit</td><td>Dual-Channel Kit</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Profile Support</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 Ready</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Optimization</td><td>Onboard PMIC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>On-Die ECC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Unbuffered / Non-ECC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Lighting</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader</td><td>Brushed Aluminum (Black / Silver variants)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lighting Type</td><td>Customizable LED RGB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Height Profile</td><td>44 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F5-5600J3636D16GX2-TZ5RK / F5-5600J3636D16G-TZ5RK</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 59500.00, 59500.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/4Th9R2MJh84GJtLfJ3scE8INobjidVRMHjENTxLC.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 12:24:16', '2026-07-13 12:24:16', 'Meta Title: G.Skill Trident Z5 RGB 32GB DDR5 5600MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Boost your PC\'s power with G.Skill Trident Z5 RGB 32GB DDR5 RAM. Offers high-speed 5600MHz performance, customizable RGB lighting, and advanced Intel XMP 3.0 support.', 'Keywords: G.Skill Trident Z5 RGB 32GB, 32GB DDR5 5600MHz, Trident Z5 RGB Black, High-Performance Gaming Memory, Intel XMP 3.0 DDR5 RAM, F5-5600J3636D16GX2-TZ5RK', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1499, 'G.Skill Trident Z5 Neo RGB 32GB DDR5 6000Mhz CL36 Desktop RAM', 'Max out your next-gen AMD setup with the premium G.Skill Trident Z5 Neo RGB 32GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM. This high-performance 32GB (2x16GB) dual-channel kit is custom-engineered for DDR5-enabled AMD AM5 platforms. Operating at a stable CL36-36-36-96 latency profile at 1.35V, it combines an aggressive matte black aluminum heat spreader with a vibrant, translucent RGB light bar. It supports AMD EXPO for one-click overclocking right out of the box.', 'gskill-trident-z5-neo-rgb-32gb-ddr5-6000mhz-cl36-desktop-ram-1783945508', '<h4>Long Description</h4><p>Unlock the complete potential of your high-core-count AMD Ryzen processor with the flagship <strong>G.Skill Trident Z5 Neo RGB 32GB DDR5 6000MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Designed specifically to align with the tight architecture requirements of the AM5 platform, this dual-channel memory kit delivers an optimal sweet-spot frequency of 6000MT/s. It easily clears away performance bottlenecks, allowing you to breeze through intensive workloads like 4K video rendering, heavy streaming setups, 3D compilation, and intensive competitive AAA gaming.</p><p>The Trident Z5 Neo RGB stands out with its hypercar-inspired design, featuring a premium sleek matte black anodized aluminum body accented by a brushed aluminum middle inlay and sharp CNC highlight lines. The top edge holds a streamlined translucent light bar, providing a smooth, uniform RGB glow across your system. You can easily manage and sync lighting zones through G.Skill\'s software or major motherboard utilities like ASUS Aura Sync, Gigabyte RGB Fusion, MSI Mystic Light, and ASRock Polychrome Sync. With an onboard PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit) managing precise voltage control and On-Die ECC maintaining data integrity in real time, it delivers uncompromising system stability during extreme computing sessions.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>32GB (16GB x 2)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>6000 MHz (6000 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL36-36-36-96</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Speed</td><td>4800 MHz (4800 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Voltage</td><td>1.10V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Multi-Channel Kit</td><td>Dual-Channel Kit</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Profile Support</td><td>AMD EXPO Ready / Intel XMP 3.0</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Platform Optimization</td><td>Tailored for AMD AM5 Ryzen Processors</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>On-Die ECC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Unbuffered / Non-ECC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Lighting</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader</td><td>Anodized Aluminum (Matte Black / Brushed Inlay)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lighting Type</td><td>Customizable LED RGB Light Bar</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Height Profile</td><td>44 mm</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Infrastructure</td><td>Onboard PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F5-6000J3636F16GX2-TZ5NR / F5-6000J3636F16G-TZ5NR</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 64000.00, 64000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/UEU47o1BAlqUA2YeNuSTVy4s1qYmabj5qwmnnwYv.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 12:25:08', '2026-07-13 12:25:08', 'Meta Title: G.Skill Trident Z5 Neo RGB 32GB DDR5 6000MHz CL36 Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Unleash peak AMD Ryzen performance with G.Skill Trident Z5 Neo RGB 32GB DDR5 RAM. Features 6000MHz speed, AMD EXPO support, and customizable RGB lighting.', 'Keywords: G.Skill Trident Z5 Neo RGB 32GB, 32GB DDR5 6000MHz, AMD EXPO DDR5 RAM, CL36 Gaming Memory, F5-6000J3636F16GX2-TZ5NR, RGB Desktop RAM DDR5', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1500, 'G.Skill Trident Z5 16GB DDR5 5600MHz CL36 Desktop RAM  iosbd', 'Bring elite performance and sleek styling to your stealth PC setup with the G.Skill Trident Z5 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered for hardware enthusiasts and gamers, this non-RGB module operates at an optimized CL36-36-36-89 timing profile at 1.20V. Encased in a hypercar-inspired matte black aluminum heat spreader with a piano-black brushed texture strip, it delivers high-frequency speeds without extra visual noise.', 'gskill-trident-z5-16gb-ddr5-5600mhz-cl36-desktop-ram-iosbd-1783961038', '<p>The <strong>G.Skill Trident Z5 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Desktop RAM</strong> represents the pinnacle of next-generation memory engineering. Specifically built to clear away processing bottlenecks on modern multi-core processors, this DDR5 module pushes hardware bounds with a blistering 5600MT/s data transfer rate. By incorporating an onboard Power Management Integrated Circuit (PMIC) and dual 32-bit subchannels, it ensures incredible power efficiency and flawless signal stability under demanding multi-threaded workloads like gaming, heavy code compilation, and data processing.</p><p>Every single Trident Z5 module is assembled using hand-selected, high-grade ICs that undergo G.Skill\'s strict multi-stage validation process across top-tier motherboard brands. The exterior features an elegant, streamlined look, matching a texturized matte black body with a premium piano-black brushed aluminum center strip. Completely free of RGB lighting, it is ideal for minimalist, productivity-focused workstations or clean, dark gaming builds. Fully compatible with Intel XMP 3.0 profiles, achieving rated speeds is effortless via a quick selection in y</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>5600 MHz (5600 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL36-36-36-89</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Speed</td><td>4800 MHz (4800 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Voltage</td><td>1.10V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Multi-Channel Kit</td><td>Supports Dual-Channel Architecture</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Profile Support</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 Ready</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>On-Die ECC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Unbuffered / Non-ECC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Power</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader</td><td>Aluminum (Matte Black / Piano Black Strip)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Height Profile</td><td>44 mm</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Architecture</td><td>Onboard PMIC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F5-5600J3636C16GX2-TZ5K / F5-5600J3636C16G-TZ5K</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 26000.00, 26000.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/qpfoAxHr3f6Kr3ycs4EM44e9Sa4iTMJYLZgWfw7Q.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 12:32:00', '2026-07-13 16:43:58', 'Meta Title: G.Skill Trident Z5 16GB DDR5 5600MHz CL36 Desktop RAM - Black', 'Meta Description: Experience high-end performance with G.Skill Trident Z5 16GB DDR5 RAM. Features 5600MHz speed, CL36 latency, and a premium matte black aluminum heat spreader.', 'Keywords: G.Skill Trident Z5 DDR5, 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Black, Matte Black DDR5 Desktop RAM, CL36 DDR5 Memory, High-Performance Gaming RAM, Intel XMP 3.0 Memory', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1501, 'G.Skill Trident Z5 16GB 5600MHz DDR5 CL40 Desktop RAM  iosbd', 'Bring flagship-tier engineering and premium aesthetics to your PC build with the G.Skill Trident Z5 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Desktop RAM. Purpose-built for next-generation platforms, this module features a tested speed of 5600MHz operating at an optimized CL40-40-40-76 timing profile at 1.20V. Wrapped in an award-winning, low-profile metallic silver aluminum heat spreader with a piano-black center strip, it delivers massive bandwidth without the added distraction of RGB lighting.', 'gskill-trident-z5-16gb-5600mhz-ddr5-cl40-desktop-ram-iosbd-1783960988', '<p>The <strong>G.Skill Trident Z5 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Desktop RAM</strong> represents a major evolution in high-performance system memory. Designed to maximize throughput on modern multi-core processors and next-generation chipsets, this DDR5 module delivers a blistering 5600MT/s data transfer rate. By implementing an onboard Power Management Integrated Circuit (PMIC) and On-Die ECC (Error Correction Code), it provides fine-grained power delivery and excellent signal stability during heavy, sustained system workloads.</p><p>The Trident Z5 family blends hypercar design elements into its iconic design lines, featuring a dual-texture heat spreader crafted from premium metallic silver aluminum with a textured brushed-aluminum middle strip. Completely free of RGB lighting, this module is perfect for clean, minimalist gaming systems, professional media creation workstations, or quiet productivity rigs. Fully pre-programmed with Intel XMP 3.0 profiles, unlocking the rated performance is as simple as toggling a single selection inside your system BIOS.</p><p>Star Tech+ 1</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>5600 MHz (5600 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL40-40-40-76 (or CL40-40-40-89)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Speed</td><td>4800 MHz (4800 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Voltage</td><td>1.10V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Multi-Channel Kit</td><td>Supports Dual-Channel Architecture</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Profile Support</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 Ready</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Infrastructure</td><td>Onboard PMIC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>On-Die ECC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Unbuffered / Non-ECC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Design</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader</td><td>Aluminum (Metallic Silver / Brushed Black strip)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lighting Type</td><td>Non-RGB (Stealth Profile)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Height Profile</td><td>44 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F5-5600J4040C16GX2-TZ5S / F5-5600J4040C16G-TZ5S</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 28500.00, 28500.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/Y6vUOJFOY8rZvN14KeYBoTx9ztdhZG9A17n10bcY.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 12:32:41', '2026-07-13 16:43:08', 'Meta Title: G.Skill Trident Z5 16GB DDR5 5600MHz CL40 Desktop RAM - Silver', 'Meta Description: Upgrade your system with the premium G.Skill Trident Z5 16GB DDR5 memory. Featuring 5600MHz speeds, CL40 latency, and a sleek silver aluminum heat spreader.', 'Keywords: G.Skill Trident Z5 DDR5, 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Silver, CL40 DDR5 RAM, Intel XMP 3.0 Desktop Memory, F5-5600J4040C16GX2-TZ5S, Non-RGB Performance RAM', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1502, 'G.Skill Trident Z5 16GB 5600MHz DDR5 CL40 Desktop RAM iosbd', 'Bring flagship-tier performance and clean, low-profile aesthetics to your PC build with the G.Skill Trident Z5 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered for next-generation computing platforms, this non-RGB module features a tested speed of 5600MHz operating at an optimized CL40-40-40-76 timing profile at a power-efficient 1.20V. Encased in a hypercar-inspired matte black aluminum heat spreader with a piano-black center strip, it delivers high-speed bandwidth without any extra visual noise.', 'gskill-trident-z5-16gb-5600mhz-ddr5-cl40-desktop-ram-iosbd-1783960928', '<p>The <strong>G.Skill Trident Z5 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Desktop RAM</strong> represents a major technological jump over legacy memory architectures. Designed to maximize throughput on modern multi-core processors and advanced motherboard chipsets, this DDR5 module delivers a blistering 5600MT/s data transfer rate. By implementing an onboard Power Management Integrated Circuit (PMIC) and On-Die ECC (Error Correction Code), it provides fine-grained power delivery and excellent signal stability during heavy, sustained system workloads like gaming, content creation, and data processing.</p><p>The Trident Z5 family blends sleek automotive design elements into its iconic design lines, featuring a dual-texture heat spreader crafted from premium matte black aluminum with a textured brushed-aluminum middle strip. Completely free of RGB lighting, this module is perfect for clean, minimalist gaming systems, professional media creation workstations, or quiet productivity rigs. Fully pre-programmed with Intel XMP 3.0 profiles, unlocking the rated performance is as simple as toggling a single selection inside your system BIOS.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>5600 MHz (5600 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL40-40-40-76 (or CL40-40-40-89)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Speed</td><td>4800 MHz (4800 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Voltage</td><td>1.10V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Multi-Channel Kit</td><td>Supports Dual-Channel Architecture</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Profile Support</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 Ready</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Infrastructure</td><td>Onboard PMIC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>On-Die ECC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Unbuffered / Non-ECC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Design</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader</td><td>Aluminum (Matte Black / Brushed Black strip)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lighting Type</td><td>Non-RGB (Stealth Profile)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Height Profile</td><td>44 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F5-5600J4040C16GX2-TZ5K / F5-5600J4040C16G-TZ5K</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 26000.00, 26000.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/HofrIpe5gfFmAOOtnD7dBTdcZf8dXTcZde4Xlk5j.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 12:33:28', '2026-07-13 16:42:08', 'Meta Title: G.Skill Trident Z5 16GB DDR5 5600MHz CL40 Desktop RAM - Black', 'Meta Description: Upgrade your system with the premium G.Skill Trident Z5 16GB DDR5 memory. Featuring high-speed 5600MHz performance, CL40 latency, and a sleek matte black aluminum heat spreader.', 'Keywords: G.Skill Trident Z5 DDR5, 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Black, CL40 DDR5 RAM, Intel XMP 3.0 Desktop Memory, F5-5600J4040C16GX2-TZ5K, Non-RGB Performance RAM Black', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1503, 'G.Skill Trident Z5 RGB 16GB DDR5 5600MHz CL40 Desktop RAM  iosbd', 'Experience the next generation of performance and style with the G.Skill Trident Z5 RGB 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Desktop RAM. Custom-engineered for enthusiasts and mainstream gamers, this module hits data transfer speeds of 5600MHz at a stable CL40-40-40-76 timing profile running on 1.20V. Wrapped in a striking hypercar-inspired silver aluminum heat spreader with a polished black center stripe, it features a customizable translucent RGB light bar for vibrant system illumination.', 'gskill-trident-z5-rgb-16gb-ddr5-5600mhz-cl40-desktop-ram-iosbd-1783960870', '<p>Take your custom PC build to the next level of high-frequency power with the <strong>G.Skill Trident Z5 RGB 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Purpose-built to optimize data throughput on modern multi-core processors and next-generation motherboard chipsets, this DDR5 module completely outperforms legacy DDR4 configurations. Operating at a roaring 5600MT/s with a reliable CL40 latency, it provides the clean data bandwidth necessary to process modern gaming assets, heavy multitasking loads, and high-resolution rendering workflows.</p><p>The Trident Z5 RGB series stands out with its premier dual-texture heat spreader design, featuring a black brushed-aluminum insert embedded directly into a premium metallic silver aluminum body. Along the top edge sits a more streamlined translucent light bar engineered to disperse smooth, uniform RGB lighting effects throughout your case. The lighting can be managed or synced using G.Skill\'s proprietary control software or standard motherboard applications like ASUS Aura Sync, Gigabyte RGB Fusion, MSI Mystic Light, and ASRock Polychrome. Under the hood, an integrated Power Management Integrated Circuit (PMIC) ensures granular voltage delivery, while On-Die ECC (Error Correction Code) keeps your data streams secure in real time. Prepared entirely for Intel XMP 3.0 profiles, launching rated performance speeds requires nothing more than a simple toggle in your system BIOS.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>5600 MHz (5600 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL40-40-40-76</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Speed</td><td>4800 MHz (4800 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Voltage</td><td>1.10V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Profile Support</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 Ready</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Management</td><td>Onboard PMIC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>On-Die ECC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Unbuffered / Non-ECC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Lighting</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader</td><td>Aluminum (Metallic Silver / Brushed Black strip)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lighting Type</td><td>Customizable LED RGB Light Bar</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Height Profile</td><td>44 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F5-5600U4040C16GX2-TZ5RS / F5-5600U4040C16G-TZ5RS</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 26000.00, 26000.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/rWszFihtkNshsheZ0Ys2unsqf4cHM1029va1dpIw.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 12:34:11', '2026-07-13 16:41:10', 'Meta Title: G.Skill Trident Z5 RGB 16GB DDR5 5600MHz CL40 Desktop RAM - Silver', 'Meta Description: Elevate your PC setup with G.Skill Trident Z5 RGB 16GB DDR5 RAM. Features a premium metallic silver design, customizable RGB light bar, and 5600MHz speed.', 'Keywords: G.Skill Trident Z5 RGB DDR5, 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Silver, CL40 DDR5 RAM, Intel XMP 3.0 Gaming Memory, F5-5600U4040C16GX2-TZ5RS, RGB Desktop RAM Silver', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1504, 'G.Skill Ripjaws S5 16GB DDR5 5200MHz CL40 Desktop RAM White', 'Bring clean styling and next-generation architecture to your PC with the G.Skill Ripjaws S5 16GB DDR5 5200MHz Desktop RAM (White). Engineered with premium hand-screened ICs and programmed with Intel XMP 3.0 profiles, this module delivers a steady 5200MHz speed at a low, power-efficient 1.10V with a CL40-40-40-83 timing profile. Its minimalist, 33mm low-profile matte white aluminum heat spreader makes it an excellent fit for compact Mini-ITX systems and setups with large CPU air coolers.', 'gskill-ripjaws-s5-16gb-ddr5-5200mhz-cl40-desktop-ram-white-1783946096', '<p>Future-proof your custom rig with the <strong>G.Skill Ripjaws S5 16GB DDR5 5200MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Developed specifically to eliminate data bottlenecks on modern multi-core processors, the Ripjaws S5 series delivers a noticeable leap in bandwidth over legacy DDR4. Operating at 5200MT/s, this module easily satisfies the bandwidth demands of modern AAA gaming, resource-heavy multi-tasking, and entry-level content creation.</p><p>The Ripjaws S5 stands out with a refined chromatic aesthetic inspired by classic racing stripes and thermal ventilation grills, finished in a premium matte white coating that beautifully complements modern all-white system themes. Under the hood, it features an onboard Power Management Integrated Circuit (PMIC) for granular power regulation and enhanced signal stability at high speeds. With a low physical height of just 33mm, it ensures zero clearance interference with large premium CPU cooling towers. Passed through G.Skill\'s uncompromising multi-platform validation matrix and backed by a limited lifetime warranty, it brings rock-solid reliability and clean styling directly to your desktop.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>5200 MHz (5200 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL40-40-40-83 (or CL40-40-40-76)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.10V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Speed</td><td>4800 MHz (4800 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Voltage</td><td>1.10V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Profile Support</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 Ready</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Management</td><td>Onboard PMIC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>Non-ECC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Unbuffered</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Design</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader</td><td>Aluminum (Matte White Finish)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Module Height</td><td>33 mm (Low-Profile clearance)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>LED Lighting</td><td>Non-RGB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F5-5200J4040A16GX2-RS5W / F5-5200J4040A16G-RS5W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 30000.00, 30000.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/aZDtGBqzBciRCzPi0DL1gDRiEdkW6Qe6BaQXHcU1.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 12:34:56', '2026-07-13 16:38:21', 'Meta Title: G.Skill Ripjaws S5 16GB DDR5 5200MHz CL40 Desktop RAM - White', 'Meta Title: G.Skill Ripjaws S5 16GB DDR5 5200MHz CL40 Desktop RAM - White', 'Keywords: G.Skill Ripjaws S5 White, 16GB DDR5 5200MHz White, CL40 DDR5 RAM, Low-Profile White DDR5 RAM, F5-5200J4040A16GX2-RS5W, White Gaming Desktop Memory', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1505, 'G.Skill Ripjaws S5 16GB DDR5 5200MHz CL36 Desktop RAM iosbd', 'Bring tight responsiveness and next-generation architecture to your PC with the G.Skill Ripjaws S5 16GB DDR5 5200MHz Desktop RAM (White). Built using premium hand-screened ICs and supporting Intel XMP 3.0, this performance module delivers a snappy CL36-36-36-83 timing profile running at a power-efficient 1.20V. Its minimalist, 33mm low-profile matte white aluminum heat spreader provides vast physical clearance, making it ideal for compact Mini-ITX systems and builds featuring large premium air coolers.', 'gskill-ripjaws-s5-16gb-ddr5-5200mhz-cl36-desktop-ram-iosbd-1783960778', '<p>Future-proof your custom build with the <strong>G.Skill Ripjaws S5 16GB DDR5 5200MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Developed specifically to eliminate data processing bottlenecks on modern multi-core processors, the Ripjaws S5 series delivers a massive leap in system bandwidth over legacy DDR4. Operating at 5200MT/s with a tight CL36 latency profile, this module satisfies the high-speed requirements of modern AAA gaming, resource-heavy multitasking, and digital content creation.</p><p>The Ripjaws S5 captures a clean, classic racing-stripe aesthetic with subtle thermal ventilation grills, finished in a premium matte white layer that perfectly accentuates themed white gaming rigs. Under the hood, it utilizes an onboard Power Management Integrated Circuit (PMIC) for precise power distribution and enhanced signal stability when handling heavy workflows. With a low height profile of just 33mm, it guarantees effortless spacing beneath large custom cooling towers. Subjected to G.Skill\'s uncompromising multi-platform validation matrix and backed by a limited lifetime warranty, it brings rock-solid reliability and premium styling directly to your desktop.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>5200 MHz (5200 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL36-36-36-83</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Speed</td><td>4800 MHz (4800 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Voltage</td><td>1.10V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Profile Support</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 Ready</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Management</td><td>Onboard PMIC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>On-Die ECC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Unbuffered / Non-ECC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Design</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader</td><td>Aluminum (Matte White Finish)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Module Height</td><td>33 mm (Low-Profile clearance)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>LED Lighting</td><td>Non-RGB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F5-5200J3636C16GX2-RS5W / F5-5200J3636C16G-RS5W</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 30000.00, 30000.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/NPiYg3fVTNx5poxsgjBhZ9dd6fhDwSSQIE89t6eW.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 12:38:05', '2026-07-13 16:39:38', 'Meta Title: G.Skill Ripjaws S5 16GB DDR5 5200MHz CL36 Desktop RAM - White', 'Meta Description: Upgrade your setup with the G.Skill Ripjaws S5 16GB DDR5 RAM in matte white. Features low-profile 33mm styling, fast CL36 latency, and Intel XMP 3.0 support.', 'Keywords: G.Skill Ripjaws S5 White, 16GB DDR5 5200MHz CL36, Low-Profile White DDR5 RAM, Intel XMP 3.0 Overclocking Memory, F5-5200J3636C16GX2-RS5W, Gaming Desktop Memory White', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1506, 'G.Skill Ripjaws V 8GB DDR4 3400MHz Desktop RAM iosbd', 'Give your desktop system an instant speed boost with the G.Skill Ripjaws V 8GB DDR4 3400MHz Desktop RAM. Built with hand-selected ICs and supporting Intel XMP 2.0, this high-frequency module delivers a fast 3400MHz frequency with a snappy CL16 timing profile at 1.35V. Its aggressive, mid-profile aluminum heat spreader ensures efficient thermal dissipation while matching seamlessly with modern gaming builds.', 'gskill-ripjaws-v-8gb-ddr4-3400mhz-desktop-ram-iosbd-1783960623', '<p>The <strong>G.Skill Ripjaws V 8GB DDR4 3400MHz Desktop RAM</strong> is a perfect addition to mainstream gaming rigs and high-utilization office workstations. As part of the legendary Ripjaws series, this DDR4 module is engineered to extract maximum data throughput from modern multi-core processors. Pushing past the standard 3200MHz baseline to a faster 3400MT/s, it delivers the necessary bandwidth edge required to reduce system stutter in modern games, speed up compressed file transfers, and provide snappier day-to-day multitasking.</p><p>Every Ripjaws V module is built on a custom multi-layer PCB using rigorously screened memory chips, undergoing G.Skill\'s strict compatibility validation testing across major motherboard brands to ensure maximum hardware uptime. Standing at a manageable 42mm tall, the module\'s textured aluminum heat spreader clears the vast majority of standard aftermarket CPU air coolers. Fully optimized for hassle-free performance, it features complete Intel XMP 2.0 profile support, allowing you to achieve its rated high-speed performance instantly through a single toggle in the BIOS.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>3400 MHz (3400 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL16-18-18-38 (or CL16-22-22-42)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Speed</td><td>2133 MHz (2133 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Multi-Channel Kit</td><td>Single Module (Dual-Channel compatible)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Profile Support</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 Ready</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>Non-ECC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Unbuffered</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Design</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader</td><td>Aluminum (Classic Black Finish)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Module Height</td><td>42 mm</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>LED Lighting</td><td>Non-RGB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F4-3400C16S-8GVK / F4-3400C16D-16GVK (Kit)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Ram', 7300.00, 7300.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/7OJESvRwK8Bymo1q9tohQJZrQAV5ZPGb5HeNc07o.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 12:39:23', '2026-07-13 16:37:03', 'Meta Title: G.Skill Ripjaws V 8GB DDR4 3400MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Boost your PC performance with G.Skill Ripjaws V 8GB DDR4 RAM. Operating at a fast 3400MHz speed with an aggressive aluminum heat spreader and Intel XMP 2.0 support.', 'Keywords: G.Skill Ripjaws V DDR4, 8GB DDR4 3400MHz, G.Skill 8GB Desktop RAM, Gaming RAM DDR4 8GB, Intel XMP 2.0 RAM, F4-3400C16S-8GVK', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1507, 'G.Skill Ripjaws V 4GB DDR4 2666MHz Red Heatsink Desktop RAM iosbd', 'Upgrade your system\'s processing capabilities with the G.Skill Ripjaws V 4GB DDR4 2666MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered with high-quality hand-screened ICs and fully optimized for Intel and AMD platforms, this module operates at a steady 2666MHz frequency with a quick CL15 latency profile at 1.20V. Its striking, aggressive radiant red aluminum heatsink maximizes heat dissipation while adding a bold, high-performance look to your system build.', 'gskill-ripjaws-v-4gb-ddr4-2666mhz-red-heatsink-desktop-ram-iosbd-1783960544', '<p>The <strong>G.Skill Ripjaws V 4GB DDR4 2666MHz Desktop RAM</strong> is the perfect entry-level upgrade or system builder choice for budget-conscious gaming rigs, office computers, and mainstream setups. As a member of G.Skill\'s multi-award-winning Ripjaws line, this DDR4 module focuses on delivering maximum stability and hardware compatibility across major motherboard brands. Operating at 2666MT/s, it offers a great balance of speed and efficiency, making it perfect for smooth multitasking, everyday productivity, and standard media consumption.</p><p>Built with a custom multi-layer PCB and high-grade memory chips, the module undergoes intensive multi-stage validation testing to ensure flawless operation under continuous system workloads. The exterior features a beautifully texturized aluminum heatsink coated in a vivid radiant red finish, providing superior heat dissipation compared to bare-green modules. Standing 42mm high, it easily fits underneath most mainstream CPU air coolers. Complete with Intel XMP 2.0 profile support, unlocking its rated speed requires nothing more than a fast selection inside your system BIOS.</p><h3>Technical Specifications</h3>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>4GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>2666 MHz (2666 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL15-15-15-35 (or CL15-17-17-35)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Speed</td><td>2133 MHz (2133 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Multi-Channel Kit</td><td>Single Module (Dual-Channel compatible)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Profile Support</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 Ready</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>Non-ECC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Unbuffered</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Design</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader</td><td>Aluminum (Radiant Red Finish)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Module Height</td><td>42 mm</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>LED Lighting</td><td>Non-RGB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F4-2666C15S-4GVR / F4-2666C15D-8GVR (Kit)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 2500.00, 2500.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/o5BRL1Gd7YQHS2SHs83jqRqF8y6Geydm2VNWfRVg.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 12:40:21', '2026-07-13 16:35:44', 'Meta Title: G.Skill Ripjaws V 4GB DDR4 2666MHz Red Heatsink Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Speed up your desktop with the G.Skill Ripjaws V 4GB DDR4 2666MHz RAM. Features an aggressive radiant red aluminum heat spreader and Intel XMP 2.0 support.', 'Keywords: G.Skill Ripjaws V DDR4, 4GB DDR4 2666MHz, Red Heatsink Desktop RAM, G.Skill 4GB DDR4, Gaming Memory 4GB, F4-2666C15S-4GVR', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1508, 'G.Skill Ripjaws V 4GB DDR4 2666MHz Red Heatsink Desktop RAM', 'Upgrade your system\'s processing capabilities with the reliable G.Skill Ripjaws V 4GB DDR4 2666MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered with high-quality hand-screened ICs and fully optimized for Intel and AMD platforms, this module operates at a steady 2666MHz frequency with a quick CL15 latency profile at 1.20V. Its striking, aggressive radiant red aluminum heatsink maximizes heat dissipation while adding a bold, high-performance look to your system build.', 'gskill-ripjaws-v-4gb-ddr4-2666mhz-red-heatsink-desktop-ram-1783946471', '<p>The <strong>G.Skill Ripjaws V 4GB DDR4 2666MHz Desktop RAM</strong> is an excellent entry-level upgrade or system builder choice for budget-conscious gaming rigs, office computers, and mainstream setups. As a member of G.Skill\'s multi-award-winning Ripjaws line, this DDR4 module focuses on delivering maximum stability and hardware compatibility across major motherboard brands. Operating at 2666MT/s, it offers a great balance of speed and efficiency, making it perfect for smooth multitasking, everyday productivity, and standard media consumption.</p><p>Built with a custom multi-layer PCB and high-grade memory chips, the module undergoes intensive multi-stage validation testing to ensure flawless operation under continuous system workloads. The exterior features a beautifully texturized aluminum heatsink coated in a vivid radiant red finish, providing superior heat dissipation compared to bare-green modules. Standing 42mm high, it easily fits underneath most mainstream CPU air coolers. Complete with Intel XMP 2.0 profile support, unlocking its rated speed requires nothing more than a fast selection inside your system BIOS.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>4GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>2666 MHz (2666 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL15-15-15-35 (or CL15-17-17-35)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Speed</td><td>2133 MHz (2133 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Multi-Channel Kit</td><td>Single Module (Dual-Channel compatible)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Profile Support</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 Ready</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>Non-ECC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Unbuffered</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Design</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader</td><td>Aluminum (Radiant Red Finish)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Module Height</td><td>42 mm</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>LED Lighting</td><td>Non-RGB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F4-2666C15S-4GVR / F4-2666C15D-8GVR (Kit)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 2000.00, 2000.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/2mw0ulyR7lgVWQwVpbRjC4UOWknzW0zkSeA3uDmV.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 12:41:11', '2026-07-13 16:34:16', 'Meta Title: G.Skill Ripjaws V 4GB DDR4 2666MHz Red Heatsink Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Upgrade your desktop setup with G.Skill Ripjaws V 4GB DDR4 2666MHz RAM. Features a bold radiant red aluminum heat spreader and Intel XMP 2.0 support.', 'Keywords: G.Skill Ripjaws V DDR4, 4GB DDR4 2666MHz, Red Heatsink Desktop RAM, G.Skill 4GB DDR4, Budget Gaming Memory 4GB, F4-2666C15S-4GVR', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL);
