(1509, 'G.SKILL Value 4GB DDR4 2400Mhz CL15 RAM', 'Upgrade your everyday computing experience with the highly reliable G.SKILL Value 4GB DDR4 2400MHz Desktop RAM. Built for standard office rigs, home computers, and budget-friendly builds, this module offers a steady 2400MHz frequency with a snappy CL15-15-15-35 latency profile. Operating at an energy-efficient 1.20V, this standard-height, unbuffered memory stick delivers plug-and-play stability across both Intel and AMD platform configurations.', 'gskill-value-4gb-ddr4-2400mhz-cl15-ram-1783946575', '<p>Upgrade your everyday computing experience with the highly reliable <strong>G.SKILL Value 4GB DDR4 2400MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Built for standard office rigs, home computers, and budget-friendly builds, this module offers a steady 2400MHz frequency with a snappy <strong>CL15-15-15-35</strong> latency profile. Operating at an energy-efficient <strong>1.20V</strong>, this standard-height, unbuffered memory stick delivers plug-and-play stability across both Intel and AMD platform configurations.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>4GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>2400 MHz (2400 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL15-15-15-35</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>SPD Speed</td><td>2400 MHz (2400 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>SPD Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Multi-Channel Kit</td><td>Single Module (Dual-Channel compatible)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>Non-ECC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Unbuffered</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Design</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader</td><td>No (Bare PCB layout)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>PCB Color</td><td>Premium Black</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>LED Lighting</td><td>Non-RGB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F4-2400C15S-4GNT</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 4500.00, 4500.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/00H5v9SrsEkNZd8aiwz8QSXSg6Cenkj77zsUxRuJ.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 12:42:55', '2026-07-13 16:33:19', 'Meta Title: G.SKILL Value 4GB DDR4 2400MHz CL15 Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Enhance system reliability with G.SKILL Value 4GB DDR4 RAM. Operating at 2400MHz with an efficient CL15 latency and 1.20V power standard. Perfect for office and home PCs.', 'Meta Description: Enhance system reliability with G.SKILL Value 4GB DDR4 RAM. Operating at 2400MHz with an efficient CL15 latency and 1.20V power standard. Perfect for office and home PCs.', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1510, 'G.Skill Ripjaws V 4GB DDR4 2400MHz Desktop RAM', 'Boost your system\'s performance and stability with the G.Skill Ripjaws V 4GB DDR4 2400MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered with hand-screened ICs and fully optimized for Intel and AMD systems, this module operates at a reliable 2400MHz frequency with a quick CL15-15-15-35 latency profile at a low 1.20V. Its aggressive aluminum heat spreader maximizes thermal dispersion while giving your custom PC build a sharp, high-performance edge.', 'gskill-ripjaws-v-4gb-ddr4-2400mhz-desktop-ram-1783946648', '<p>The <strong>G.Skill Ripjaws V 4GB DDR4 2400MHz Desktop RAM</strong> is an ideal entry-level upgrade or system builder option for budget-conscious gaming builds, home office PCs, and general computing setups. As a standout entry in the multi-award-winning Ripjaws series, this DDR4 module is purpose-built to extract smooth, dependable responsiveness from modern desktop platforms. Operating at 2400MT/s, it delivers the ideal sweet spot for standard computing, helping eliminate system stutters during daily workflows, web multitasking, and media consumption.</p><p>Every Ripjaws V stick is constructed using strictly validated memory chips placed on a high-grade multi-layer PCB, ensuring extensive system compatibility and long-term hardware endurance. The module features a texturized aluminum heat spreader layout (available in classic finishes like sleek red or stealth black) that radiates heat away from the memory components much faster than bare PCBs. Standing at a manageable 42mm high, it easily clears the majority of mainstream aftermarket CPU air cooling towers. With full Intel XMP 2.0 profile support, achieving peak rated performance requires nothing more than enabling a single setting inside your motherboard\'s BIOS.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>4GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>2400 MHz (2400 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL15-15-15-35</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Speed</td><td>2133 MHz (2133 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Multi-Channel Kit</td><td>Single Module (Dual-Channel compatible)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Profile Support</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 Ready</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>Non-ECC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Unbuffered</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Design</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader</td><td>Stylized Aluminum (Red / Black variants)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Module Height</td><td>42 mm</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>LED Lighting</td><td>Non-RGB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F4-2400C15S-4GVR / F4-2400C15S-4GVB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 5500.00, 5500.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/FH7UX1cLQcm5ZS2fIIMxL1EKhUqzSLHfCdpddR2F.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 12:44:08', '2026-07-13 16:32:25', 'Meta Title: G.Skill Ripjaws V 4GB DDR4 2400MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Enhance system response with the G.Skill Ripjaws V 4GB DDR4 2400MHz desktop memory. Features an aggressive stylized heat spreader and Intel XMP 2.0 support.', 'Keywords: G.Skill Ripjaws V DDR4, 4GB DDR4 2400MHz, G.Skill 4GB Desktop RAM, Ripjaws V Red 4GB, Budget Gaming Memory DDR4, F4-2400C15S-4GVR', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1511, 'G.SKILL Value 4GB DDR3 1600Mhz Desktop RAM', 'Revitalize older systems and dependable office computers with the G.SKILL Value 4GB DDR3 1600MHz Desktop RAM. Built to offer cost-effective stability, this module delivers a standard 1600MHz frequency paired with a reliable CL11-11-11-28 latency profile. Operating at the standard 1.50V memory threshold, this bare-PCB layout provides plug-and-play functionality across older legacy Intel and AMD motherboard configurations.', 'gskill-value-4gb-ddr3-1600mhz-desktop-ram-1783946698', '<p>The <strong>G.SKILL Value 4GB DDR3 1600MHz Desktop RAM</strong> is an excellent, budget-friendly solution for maintaining, repairing, or upgrading older generation desktop setups. Purpose-built for maximum hardware compatibility and daily stability, this Value Series module runs at a 1600MT/s transfer speed to ensure everyday productivity tasks keep running without unnecessary slowdowns. It provides the necessary system memory backbone for basic web browsing, word processing, running light legacy database applications, and point-of-sale systems.</p><p>Every module is put together using rigorously tested memory chips assembled onto a clean, standard-height PCB, meaning it provides 100% physical clearance under any generic or large stock CPU cooler configuration. Free of expensive extra features, flashy heat sinks, or RGB lighting, the G.SKILL Value series focuses entirely on raw stability and hardware uptime. Hand-tested through G.SKILL\'s stringent internal evaluation processes, it brings long-lasting peace of mind to older operational PCs and is fully backed by a limited lifetime warr</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>ture Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR3</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>4GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (240-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>1600 MHz (1600 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL11-11-11-28</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.50V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>SPD Speed</td><td>1600 MHz (1600 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>SPD Voltage</td><td>1.50V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Multi-Channel Kit</td><td>Single Module (Dual-Channel compatible)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>Non-ECC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Unbuffered</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Design</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader</td><td>No (Bare PCB layout)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>PCB Color</td><td>Classic Black / Blue (Depending on batch)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>LED Lighting</td><td>Non-RGB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F3-1600C11S-4GNT</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 2500.00, 2500.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/2hRCMJtWTKfW3jvq2nxG8bVaVLRDIafae3Izwfmn.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 12:44:58', '2026-07-13 16:31:21', 'Meta Title: G.SKILL Value 4GB DDR3 1600MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Restore or upgrade older desktop PCs with G.SKILL Value 4GB DDR3 RAM. Operating at 1600MHz with an efficient CL11 latency at a standard 1.50V.', 'Keywords: G.SKILL Value DDR3, 4GB DDR3 1600MHz, G.SKILL 4GB Desktop RAM, Budget DDR3 Memory, 1600MHz CL11 Desktop RAM, F3-1600C11S-4GNT', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1512, 'G.Skill Trident Z 4GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM', 'Bring flagship-grade engineering and iconic aesthetics to your desktop system with the G.Skill Trident Z 4GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered with hand-screened high-quality ICs, this performance module delivers a fast 3200MHz frequency with a tight CL16 timing profile at 1.35V. It features an award-winning, dual-texture brushed aluminum heat spreader that ensures elite thermal cooling while giving your rig a clean, premium look.', 'gskill-trident-z-4gb-ddr4-3200mhz-desktop-ram-1783947494', '<p>The <strong>G.Skill Trident Z 4GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM</strong> is built to deliver exceptional performance and reliability for hardware enthusiasts, gamers, and performance builders. As part of the legendary Trident Z family, this DDR4 module eliminates system bottlenecks by moving data at a swift 3200MT/s. It provides an immediate speed edge for smooth day-to-day multitasking, media loading, and smooth frame delivery in competitive esports titles.</p><p>Every Trident Z module is built upon a custom ten-layer PCB layout using rigorously verified memory components, ensuring maximum signal integrity and extensive compatibility across major Intel and AMD motherboards. The exterior showcases an iconic, aggressive visual profile made up of a dual-color brushed aluminum fin layout that quickly wicks heat away from critical components. Standing 44mm tall, it provides adequate clearance for most premium custom builds. Complete with full Intel XMP 2.0 profile support, unlocking its rated speed takes nothing more than a simple toggle in your motherboard\'s BIOS setup.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>4GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>3200 MHz (3200 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL16-18-18-38</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Speed</td><td>2133 MHz (2133 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Multi-Channel Kit</td><td>Single Module (Dual-Channel compatible)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Profile Support</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 Ready</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>Non-ECC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Unbuffered</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Design</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader</td><td>Brushed Aluminum (Silver Body / Red Fin accent)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Height Profile</td><td>44 mm</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>LED Lighting</td><td>Non-RGB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F4-3200C16S-4GTZB / F4-3200C16D-8GTZB (Kit)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 2600.00, 2600.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/ba4qYJDV3vOyCqikjDuNJwVzZSvz8j9zHN7jXjeA.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 12:58:14', '2026-07-13 16:30:08', 'G.Skill Trident Z 4GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Upgrade your PC with G.Skill Trident Z 4GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM. Features a high-performance brushed aluminum heat spreader, low latency, and Intel XMP 2.0.', 'Keywords: G.Skill Trident Z DDR4, 4GB DDR4 3200MHz, Trident Z Classic RAM, High-Performance Gaming Memory, Intel XMP 2.0 RAM, F4-3200C16S-4GTZB', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1513, 'G.SKILL Value 8GB DDR3 1600Mhz Desktop RAM', 'Revitalize legacy systems and steady office workstations with the cost-effective G.SKILL Value 8GB DDR3 1600MHz Desktop RAM. Built to offer bulletproof stability, this module delivers a standard 1600MHz speed paired with a reliable CL11-11-11-28 latency profile. Operating at the standard 1.50V baseline, this unbuffered memory stick features a clean, bare-PCB layout that offers simple plug-and-play functionality across older generation Intel and AMD setups.', 'gskill-value-8gb-ddr3-1600mhz-desktop-ram-1783947554', '<p>The <strong>G.SKILL Value 8GB DDR3 1600MHz Desktop RAM</strong> is the perfect cost-effective solution for extending the life of older computing systems, outfitting enterprise office builds, or handling budget-conscious repairs. Stripped of high-cost components like heat spreaders and lighting kits, this module focuses strictly on raw reliability and maximum hardware uptime. Its substantial 8GB capacity provides a significant breathing room edge for smoother web browsing, office multitasking, document processing, and point-of-sale management without system lag.</p><p>Every module is put together using rigorously tested memory chips assembled onto a high-quality multi-layer PCB, ensuring extensive compatibility and physical durability under standard workloads. Thanks to its traditional low-profile design, it guarantees 100% mechanical clearance underneath any generic, stock, or low-clearance CPU air cooler layout. Thoroughly evaluated through G.SKILL\'s stringent internal validation matrices, this budget memory upgrade ensures trouble-free performance and long-term peace of mind, fully backed by a limited lifetime</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR3</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (240-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>1600 MHz (1600 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL11-11-11-28</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.50V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>SPD Speed</td><td>1600 MHz (1600 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>SPD Voltage</td><td>1.50V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Multi-Channel Kit</td><td>Single Module (Dual-Channel compatible)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>Non-ECC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Unbuffered</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Design</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader</td><td>No (Bare PCB layout)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>PCB Color</td><td>Premium Black / Blue (Batch dependent)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>LED Lighting</td><td>Non-RGB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F3-1600C11S-8GNT</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 4500.00, 4500.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/pi1XHEPcXJO7bPH1dEtjT9FWtFy7YBCeXNMUz5hc.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 12:59:14', '2026-07-13 16:29:01', 'Meta Title: G.SKILL Value 8GB DDR3 1600MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Upgrade or restore your desktop PC with the G.SKILL Value 8GB DDR3 memory module. Features 1600MHz speed, reliable CL11 latency, and standard 1.50V efficiency.', 'Keywords: G.SKILL Value DDR3, 8GB DDR3 1600MHz, G.SKILL 8GB Desktop RAM, Budget DDR3 Memory, 1600MHz CL11 Desktop RAM, F3-1600C11S-8GNT', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1514, 'G.SKILL Value 4GB DDR4 2400Mhz Desktop RAM', 'Upgrade your everyday computing experience with the highly reliable G.SKILL Value 4GB DDR4 2400MHz Desktop RAM. Built for standard office rigs, home computers, and budget-friendly setups, this module offers a steady 2400MHz frequency with a snappy CL15-15-15-35 latency profile. Operating at an energy-efficient 1.20V, this standard-height, unbuffered memory stick delivers plug-and-play stability across both Intel and AMD platform configurations.', 'gskill-value-4gb-ddr4-2400mhz-desktop-ram-1783947595', '<p>vThe <strong>G.SKILL Value 4GB DDR4 2400MHz Desktop RAM</strong> is custom-built to provide maximum hardware stability and system uptime without breaking the bank. Designed as a direct upgrade over base speeds, this Value Series module runs at a 2400MT/s transfer speed to keep daily workloads moving seamlessly. It acts as the perfect backbone for system tasks such as web browsing, running productivity applications, handling spreadsheets, and streaming media content without noticeable stuttering.</p><p>Every single G.SKILL Value series stick is constructed using high-quality memory chips laid out on a multi-layer black PCB layout, ensuring excellent thermal tolerances and longevity. Stripped of extra bulk or flashing RGB components, its standard low-profile height offers 100% physical compatibility under any basic, stock, or aftermarket CPU cooling configuration. Fully verified through G.SKILL’s rigid quality validation matrix, this memory module ensures hassle-free boot-ups and complete hardware peace of mind, fully supported by a limited lifetime warranty.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>4GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>2400 MHz (2400 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL15-15-15-35</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>SPD Speed</td><td>2400 MHz (2400 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>SPD Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Multi-Channel Kit</td><td>Single Module (Dual-Channel compatible)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>Non-ECC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Unbuffered</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Design</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader</td><td>No (Bare PCB layout)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>PCB Color</td><td>Premium Black</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>LED Lighting</td><td>Non-RGB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F4-2400C15S-4GNT</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 1600.00, 1600.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/aSmdSfTRZbV6TwZcsyvdPc6gnRVYPcHW7fMQG15X.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 12:59:55', '2026-07-13 16:27:18', 'Meta Title: G.SKILL Value 4GB DDR4 2400MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Enhance system reliability with G.SKILL Value 4GB DDR4 RAM. Operating at 2400MHz with an efficient CL15 latency and 1.20V power standard. Perfect for office and home PCs.', 'Keywords: G.SKILL Value DDR4, 4GB DDR4 2400MHz, G.SKILL 4GB Desktop RAM, Budget DDR4 Memory, CL15 2400MHz RAM, F4-2400C15S-4GNT', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1515, 'G.SKILL Flare X 8GB 2400Mhz DDR4 Desktop RAM', 'Engineered specifically for AMD Ryzen platforms, the G.SKILL Flare X 8GB 2400MHz DDR4 Desktop RAM brings rock-solid reliability and efficiency to your build. Operating at a stable 2400MHz speed with a CL16-16-16-39 latency profile, this unbuffered module runs at a highly energy-efficient 1.20V. Wrapped in an aggressive, distinctively styled aluminum heat spreader, it provides excellent thermal dispersion while giving your custom setup a sharp edge.', 'gskill-flare-x-8gb-2400mhz-ddr4-desktop-ram-1783947642', '<h4>Long Description</h4><p>The <strong>G.SKILL Flare X 8GB 2400MHz DDR4 Desktop RAM</strong> marks the return of G.SKILL\'s legendary Flare series, custom-tailored to provide seamless hardware compatibility and top-tier stability on AMD platforms. Purpose-built for the unique architecture demands of early and mainstream AMD Ryzen processors, this DDR4 module strips away compatibility anxieties. Running at a comfortable 2400MT/s baseline speed, it serves as an excellent upgrade or replacement module to handle everyday workflows, light media production, and popular esports gaming titles without system lag or stutters.</p><p>Every single Flare X stick is constructed using high-quality, hand-screened IC chips built directly onto a custom multi-layer black PCB layout, ensuring superior signal integrity and long-term hardware life. The exterior features an aggressive, muscular aluminum heat spreader configuration that wicks thermal energy away from the memory chips much faster than standard bare PCBs. Standing at a manageable 40mm tall, it fits comfortably underneath the majority of stock and aftermarket CPU air cooling towers. Passed through G.SKILL\'s uncompromising internal testing matrices, it brings reliable performance and plug-and-play ease right out of the box, fully backed by a limited lifetime warranty.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>2400 MHz (2400 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL16-16-16-39</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>SPD Speed</td><td>2400 MHz (2400 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>SPD Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Platform Optimization</td><td>Tailored &amp; Validated for AMD Ryzen Platforms</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Multi-Channel Kit</td><td>Single Module (Dual-Channel compatible)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>Non-ECC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Unbuffered</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Design</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader</td><td>Sculpted Aluminum (Black Finish)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Module Height</td><td>40 mm</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>LED Lighting</td><td>Non-RGB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F4-2400C16S-8GFX / F4-2400C16D-16GFX (Kit)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 8300.00, 8300.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/Pq06ThR1LyBVz0JYaRulhtkV6jzwIY3iottRe6R2.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 13:00:42', '2026-07-13 16:26:24', 'Meta Title: G.SKILL Flare X 8GB 2400MHz DDR4 Desktop RAM (AMD Compatible)', 'Meta Description: Enhance your AMD Ryzen build with the G.SKILL Flare X 8GB DDR4 RAM. Operating at 2400MHz with an efficient 1.20V profile and aggressive aluminum heat spreader.', 'Keywords: G.SKILL Flare X DDR4, 8GB DDR4 2400MHz, G.SKILL AMD Ryzen RAM, Flare X Series DDR4, Budget AMD Gaming Memory, F4-2400C16S-8GFX', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1516, 'G.SKILL Trident Z Royal RGB 8GB DDR4 4266MHz Desktop RAM', 'Experience the crowning achievement of PC luxury and extreme overclocking with the G.SKILL Trident Z Royal RGB 8GB DDR4 4266MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered with hand-screened high-performance ICs and supporting Intel XMP 2.0, this elite module moves data at a blistering 4266MHz with a CL19 timing profile at 1.40V. Its highly polished, mirror-finish aluminum heat spreader features a patent-pending crystalline light bar that scatters dazzling RGB colors inside your showcase chassis.', 'gskill-trident-z-royal-rgb-8gb-ddr4-4266mhz-desktop-ram-1783947695', '<p>The <strong>G.SKILL Trident Z Royal RGB 8GB DDR4 4266MHz Desktop RAM</strong> is custom-designed for premium boutique setups, competitive bench testers, and hardware enthusiasts seeking the outer limits of DDR4 performance. Positioned at the apex of G.SKILL\'s flagship lineup, this luxury module clears away processing bottlenecks with an extreme 4266MT/s data transfer rate. It provides an immediate system edge for high-framerate competitive esports gaming, rapid data rendering, and heavy computation workloads.</p><p>Every single Royal module is constructed on a custom ten-layer PCB using strictly validated Samsung B-die or premium high-frequency ICs, providing incredible signal integrity and massive overclocking headroom. The stunning exterior features a meticulously cut, polished aluminum heat spreader (available in brilliant silver or gold) that acts as a highly efficient mirror, reflecting your system\'s ambient internal aesthetics. Along the top sits a magnificent crystal-like light bar, which splits its 8-zone RGB LED lighting into a beautiful array of fractured light. Fully controllable through G.SKILL control software or motherboard sync utilities like ASUS Aura Sync, Gigabyte RGB Fusion, MSI Mystic Light, and ASRock Polychrome, it delivers unrivaled</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>4266 MHz (4266 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL19-19-19-39 (or CL19-26-26-46)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.40V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Speed</td><td>2133 MHz (2133 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Multi-Channel Kit</td><td>Single Module (Dual/Quad-Channel compatible)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Profile Support</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 Ready</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>IC Configuration</td><td>Hand-Screened High-Frequency ICs</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>Non-ECC / Unbuffered</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Lighting</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader</td><td>Electroplated Aluminum (Mirror Silver / Gold variants)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lighting Design</td><td>Patent-Pending Crystalline Light Bar</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lighting Control</td><td>8-Zone Individual RGB LED Customization</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Module Height</td><td>44 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F4-4266C19S-8GTRS / F4-4266C19D-16GTRS (Kit)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 5800.00, 5800.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/2l6DQoF0Cwc9Zkffk3ohCD3xa2kq4wDMxFlbvtws.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 13:01:35', '2026-07-13 16:25:37', 'Meta Title: G.SKILL Trident Z Royal RGB 8GB DDR4 4266MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Unleash extreme performance with G.SKILL Trident Z Royal 8GB DDR4 RAM. Features an ultra-fast 4266MHz speed, polished heat spreader, and a crystalline RGB light bar.', 'Keywords: G.SKILL Trident Z Royal DDR4, 8GB DDR4 4266MHz, Trident Z Royal Silver Gold, High-Frequency Gaming Memory, Crystalline RGB RAM, F4-4266C19S-8GTRS', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1517, 'G.Skill Ripjaws V 16GB DDR4 2400MHz Desktop RAM', 'Expand your system\'s memory capacity and upgrade multitasking efficiency with the G.Skill Ripjaws V 16GB DDR4 2400MHz Desktop RAM. Built using hand-screened high-grade ICs and supporting Intel XMP 2.0, this high-capacity module delivers a stable 2400MHz frequency with a quick CL15-15-15-35 latency profile at a low 1.20V. Its aggressive sleek aluminum heat spreader keeps temperatures down while giving your custom PC a high-performance look.', 'gskill-ripjaws-v-16gb-ddr4-2400mhz-desktop-ram-1783947743', '<p>The <strong>G.Skill Ripjaws V 16GB DDR4 2400MHz Desktop RAM</strong> is an excellent high-capacity upgrade designed for mainstream gaming builds, production workstations, and everyday multitasking systems. As a key entry in the award-winning Ripjaws series, this DDR4 module provides a substantial 16GB pool of space on a single stick, allowing you to run intensive creative apps, manage dozens of browser tabs, or keep modern game titles running smoothly without encountering system stuttering.</p><p>Every single Ripjaws V module is constructed using rigorously tested memory chips built onto a premium multi-layer PCB, ensuring extensive system compatibility and long-term hardware endurance across major motherboard platforms. The module features an aggressive, texturized aluminum heat spreader configuration (available in classic finishes like striking red or stealth black) that radiates thermal energy away from the components much faster than bare PCBs. Standing 42mm tall, it easily fits beneath the vast majority of aftermarket CPU air cooling towers. With full Intel XMP 2.0 profile support, unlocking its rated performance takes just a single click inside your motherboard\'s BIOS setup.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>2400 MHz (2400 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL15-15-15-35</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Speed</td><td>2133 MHz (2133 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Multi-Channel Kit</td><td>Single Module (Dual-Channel compatible)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Profile Support</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 Ready</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>Non-ECC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Unbuffered</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Design</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader</td><td>Stylized Aluminum (Red / Black variants)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Module Height</td><td>42 mm</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>LED Lighting</td><td>Non-RGB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F4-2400C15S-16GVR / F4-2400C15S-16GVB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 4260.00, 4260.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/vwR9Jxs31GlS1UeyjUXlPQtdPDpWnoOKNbuv2eUf.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 13:02:23', '2026-07-13 16:24:33', 'Meta Title: G.Skill Ripjaws V 16GB DDR4 2400MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Enhance system multitasking with the G.Skill Ripjaws V 16GB DDR4 2400MHz desktop memory. Features a high-quality aluminum heat spreader and Intel XMP 2.0.', 'Keywords: G.Skill Ripjaws V DDR4, 16GB DDR4 2400MHz, G.Skill 16GB Desktop RAM, Ripjaws V Red 16GB, High-Capacity Gaming Memory, F4-2400C15S-16GVR', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1518, 'G.SKILL Flare X 8GB DDR4 2933Mhz Desktop RAM', 'Unlock smooth, reliable performance on your AMD platform with the G.SKILL Flare X 8GB DDR4 2933MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered specifically for compatibility with the AMD Ryzen architecture, this unbuffered module operates at a stable 2933MHz frequency with a tight CL16-18-18-38 latency profile at 1.35V. Encased in a signature, aggressive black aluminum heat spreader, it manages thermals efficiently while lending a bold, mechanical look to your custom setup.', 'gskill-flare-x-8gb-ddr4-2933mhz-desktop-ram-1783947802', '<p>The <strong>G.SKILL Flare X 8GB DDR4 2933MHz Desktop RAM</strong> brings the legendary legacy of the Flare series directly to modern DDR4 computing. Built to resolve the specific hardware compatibility and memory tuning needs of mainstream AMD Ryzen processors, this memory module removes the guesswork from setting up your PC. Operating at a high-speed baseline of 2933MT/s, it delivers an optimal data channel for seamless web multitasking, smooth everyday application processing, and dependable frame rates in esports gaming titles.</p><p>Every Flare X stick is designed using rigorously screened, high-quality memory ICs laid onto a multi-layer black PCB, maximizing signal integrity and hardware longevity. The exterior features a rugged, sculpted aluminum heat spreader that draws heat away from critical components much faster than standard bare memory sticks. Standing at a physical height of 40mm, it fits easily underneath the vast majority of stock and aftermarket CPU air cooling towers. Validated through G.SKILL\'s stringent multi-platform quality testing matrix, it provides simple plug-and-play peace of mind right out of the box, fully backed by a limited lifetime warranty.</p><h3>Technical Specifications</h3>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>2933 MHz (2933 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL16-18-18-38</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Speed</td><td>2133 MHz (2133 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Platform Optimization</td><td>Tailored &amp; Validated for AMD Ryzen Platforms</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Multi-Channel Kit</td><td>Single Module (Dual-Channel compatible)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Profile Support</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 / AMD Profile Ready</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>Non-ECC / Unbuffered</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Design</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader</td><td>Sculpted Aluminum (Black Finish)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Module Height</td><td>40 mm</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>LED Lighting</td><td>Non-RGB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F4-2933C16S-8GFX / F4-2933C16D-16GFX (Kit)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 8000.00, 8000.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/IL5ukrVSacGYuh8tyRNNi6Mb0tFwvqNGsTvPcp7j.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 13:03:22', '2026-07-13 16:23:29', 'Meta Title: G.SKILL Flare X 8GB DDR4 2933MHz Desktop RAM (AMD Optimized)', 'Meta Description: Enhance your AMD Ryzen PC setup with G.SKILL Flare X 8GB DDR4 RAM. Featuring a reliable 2933MHz frequency, CL16 latency, and a sculpted black aluminum heat spreader.', 'Keywords: G.SKILL Flare X 8GB, DDR4 2933MHz Desktop RAM, G.SKILL AMD Ryzen RAM, Flare X Series DDR4, 8GB Gaming Memory, F4-2933C16S-8GFX', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1519, 'G.Skill Ripjaws V 8GB DDR4 3600MHz Desktop RAM', 'Push your system\'s processing capabilities further with the high-frequency G.Skill Ripjaws V 8GB DDR4 3600MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered using hand-selected memory ICs and featuring full Intel XMP 2.0 support, this high-performance module delivers a rapid 3600MHz speed at a tight CL18-22-22-42 latency profile, operating at 1.35V. Its aggressive, mid-profile aluminum heat spreader ensures efficient thermal dissipation while giving your gaming or productivity build a sleek, sharp aesthetic.', 'gskill-ripjaws-v-8gb-ddr4-3600mhz-desktop-ram-1783947909', '<p>The <strong>G.Skill Ripjaws V 8GB DDR4 3600MHz Desktop RAM</strong> is the perfect high-speed upgrade for competitive gamers, content creators, and performance-focused system builders. Positioned in the upper tier of the legendary Ripjaws line, this DDR4 module is engineered to extract maximum data throughput from modern high-core-count processors on both Intel and AMD platforms. By moving past the standard DDR4 baseline to a swift 3600MT/s transfer rate, it provides the necessary bandwidth to reduce system bottlenecking, ensuring smoother framerates in AAA games, faster render times, and snappy day-to-day multitasking.</p><p>Every single Ripjaws V stick is constructed using rigorously screened memory chips placed onto a high-quality multi-layer PCB, undergoing G.Skill\'s uncompromising compatibility validation matrix across major motherboard brands to guarantee system uptime. The exterior features a beautifully texturized aluminum heat spreader that draws thermal energy away from critical components much faster than standard bare PCBs. Standing 42mm tall, it comfortably clears the vast majority of mainstream aftermarket CPU air coolers. Fully optimized for hassle-free overclocking, it features complete Intel XMP 2.0 profile support, allowing you to achieve its rated high-speed performance instantly through a single toggle in your BIOS.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>3600 MHz (3600 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL18-22-22-42</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Speed</td><td>2133 MHz (2133 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Multi-Channel Kit</td><td>Single Module (Dual-Channel compatible)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Profile Support</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 Ready</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>Non-ECC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Unbuffered</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Design</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader</td><td>Stylized Aluminum (Black finish)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Module Height</td><td>42 mm</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>LED Lighting</td><td>Non-RGB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F4-3600C18S-8GVK / F4-3600C18D-16GVK (Kit)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 7300.00, 7300.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/BIAtcNS9gktXfDTDCxe7caV4w1WNVGkXZXFviFRA.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 13:05:09', '2026-07-13 16:22:46', 'Meta Title: G.Skill Ripjaws V 8GB DDR4 3600MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Maximize your rig\'s potential with G.Skill Ripjaws V 8GB DDR4 RAM. Featuring a high-speed 3600MHz frequency, aggressive aluminum heat spreader, and Intel XMP 2.0 support.', 'Keywords: G.Skill Ripjaws V DDR4, 8GB DDR4 3600MHz, G.Skill 8GB Desktop RAM, High-Speed Gaming Memory, Intel XMP 2.0 RAM, F4-3600C18S-8GVK', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1520, 'G.SKILL Flare X 8GB DDR4 3200Mhz Desktop RAM', 'Unlock high-frequency performance and complete hardware stability on your PC with the G.SKILL Flare X 8GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered specifically for compatibility with the AMD Ryzen architecture, this unbuffered module operates at a swift 3200MHz frequency with a quick CL16-18-18-38 latency profile at 1.35V. Encased in a signature, aggressive black aluminum heat spreader, it manages thermals efficiently while lending a bold, mechanical look to your custom setup.', 'gskill-flare-x-8gb-ddr4-3200mhz-desktop-ram-1783947969', '<p>The <strong>G.SKILL Flare X 8GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM</strong> brings the legendary legacy of the Flare series directly to modern DDR4 computing. Built to resolve the specific hardware compatibility and memory tuning needs of mainstream AMD Ryzen processors, this memory module removes the guesswork from setting up your PC. Operating at a high-speed baseline of 3200MT/s, it delivers an optimal data channel for seamless web multitasking, smooth everyday application processing, and dependable frame rates in esports gaming titles.</p><p>Every Flare X stick is designed using rigorously screened, high-quality memory ICs laid onto a multi-layer black PCB, maximizing signal integrity and hardware longevity. The exterior features a rugged, sculpted aluminum heat spreader that draws heat away from critical components much faster than standard bare memory sticks. Standing at a physical height of 40mm, it fits easily underneath the vast majority of stock and aftermarket CPU air cooling towers. Validated through G.SKILL\'s stringent multi-platform quality testing matrix, it provides simple plug-and-play peace of mind right out of the box, fully backed by a limited lifetime warranty.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>3200 MHz (3200 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL16-18-18-38</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Speed</td><td>2133 MHz (2133 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Platform Optimization</td><td>Tailored &amp; Validated for AMD Ryzen Platforms</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Multi-Channel Kit</td><td>Single Module (Dual-Channel compatible)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Profile Support</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 / AMD Profile Ready</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>Non-ECC / Unbuffered</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Design</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader</td><td>Sculpted Aluminum (Black Finish)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Module Height</td><td>40 mm</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>LED Lighting</td><td>Non-RGB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F4-3200C16S-8GFX / F4-3200C16D-16GFX (Kit)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 8300.00, 8300.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/CeLMqXUBc3zSHHEKXrJpZcWOLLeg673vS4FXfi5V.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 13:06:09', '2026-07-13 16:21:57', 'Meta Title: G.SKILL Flare X 8GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM (AMD Optimized)', 'Meta Description: Maximize your PC\'s gaming potential with the G.SKILL Flare X 8GB DDR4 RAM. Features a fast 3200MHz frequency, low latency CL16 profile, and an AMD-optimized design.', 'Keywords: G.SKILL Flare X DDR4, 8GB DDR4 3200MHz, G.SKILL AMD Ryzen RAM, Flare X Series 8GB, High-Performance DDR4 Gaming Memory, F4-3200C16S-8GFX', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `name`, `short_description`, `slug`, `description`, `specifications_text`, `tags`, `buy_price`, `price`, `discount_price`, `stock`, `thumbnail`, `video`, `is_featured`, `status`, `is_coming_soon`, `is_tba`, `is_call_for_price`, `is_out_of_stock`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`, `meta_keywords`, `meta_image`, `brand_id`, `supplier_id`, `laptop_purpose_id`) VALUES
(1521, 'G.Skill Trident Z Royal 8GB DDR4 3600MHz Silver Heatsink Desktop RAM', 'Bring elite computing performance and breathtaking luxury aesthetics together with the G.Skill Trident Z Royal 8GB DDR4 3600MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered with hand-screened ICs and fully optimized for Intel and AMD platforms, this premium module runs at a swift 3600MHz speed with a CL18 latency profile at 1.35V. It features a meticulously electroplated mirror-finish silver aluminum heatsink and a stunning crystalline light bar for a unique, fractured RGB layout.', 'gskill-trident-z-royal-8gb-ddr4-3600mhz-silver-heatsink-desktop-ram-1783948016', '<p>The <strong>G.Skill Trident Z Royal 8GB DDR4 3600MHz Desktop RAM</strong> is the crowning choice for showcase PC builds, high-end workstations, and hardware enthusiasts who refuse to compromise on speed or style. Positioned at the pinnacle of G.Skill’s flagship memory lines, this DDR4 module satisfies the high bandwidth demands of modern AAA gaming titles, complex creative multitasking, and system data rendering.</p><p>Every single Trident Z Royal stick is constructed over a custom ten-layer PCB with strictly screened high-frequency memory chips, ensuring unmatched signal integrity and superior stability under demanding system workloads. The exterior features a beautifully crafted, highly polished aluminum heatsink electroplated in a brilliant silver finish that mimics a pristine mirror surface. Spanning the top edge is a patent-pending crystalline light bar configuration that scatters the integrated 8-zone RGB LED illumination into a brilliant, gem-like glow. Fully customizable via G.Skill\'s downloadable software or standard motherboard applications (including ASUS Aura Sync, Gigabyte RGB Fusion, MSI Mystic Light, and ASRock Polychrome), it delivers world-class speed and unmatched boutique styling, backed by a limited lifetime warranty.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>3600 MHz (3600 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL18-22-22-42</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Speed</td><td>2133 MHz (2133 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Multi-Channel Kit</td><td>Single Module (Dual-Channel compatible)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Profile Support</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 Ready</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>Non-ECC / Unbuffered</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Lighting</strong></td><td>Heatsink Design</td><td>Electroplated Aluminum (Mirror Silver Finish)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lighting Diffuser</td><td>Patent-Pending Crystalline Light Bar</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lighting Zones</td><td>8-Zone Individual RGB LED Control</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Module Height</td><td>44 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F4-3600C18S-8GTRS / F4-3600C18D-16GTRS (Kit)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 5800.00, 5800.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/s46IBOS3ZNnYYPA2BKqrBmeJAb9UPyje3RvuZ0rQ.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 13:06:56', '2026-07-13 16:21:01', 'Meta Title: G.Skill Trident Z Royal RGB 8GB DDR4 3600MHz Silver Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Combine high-speed gaming with museum-grade luxury. Features a 3600MHz clock speed, a polished mirror silver heatsink, and a patent-pending crystalline RGB light bar.', 'Keywords: G.Skill Trident Z Royal Silver, 8GB DDR4 3600MHz, Trident Z Royal RGB 8GB, Premium Silver Gaming RAM, Intel XMP 2.0 Desktop Memory, F4-3600C18S-8GTRS', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1522, 'G.SKILL Trident Z Royal RGB 8GB DDR4 4600MHz Desktop RAM', 'Push past the conventional boundaries of memory speed with the ultra-premium G.SKILL Trident Z Royal RGB 8GB DDR4 4600MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered for elite enthusiasts and benchmark record-chasers, this luxury module moves data at a staggering 4600MHz speed with a high-performance CL18 latency profile running at 1.45V - 1.50V. Its highly polished mirror-finish aluminum heat spreader features a patent-pending crystalline light bar that breaks up and scatters dazzling 8-zone RGB colors across your setup.', 'gskill-trident-z-royal-rgb-8gb-ddr4-4600mhz-desktop-ram-1783948066', '<p>The <strong>G.SKILL Trident Z Royal RGB 8GB DDR4 4600MHz Desktop RAM</strong> represents the apex of high-frequency engineering and luxury aesthetics. Purpose-built for high-end boutique rigs, custom water-cooled showcases, and extreme overclockers, this memory module delivers a blistering 4600MT/s transfer speed to completely wipe out modern system data bottlenecks. It provides unparalleled memory bandwidth, facilitating faster rendering workflows, intense computational processing, and ultra-high frame rate output in competitive gaming applications.</p><p>Every single module is constructed on a custom ten-layer PCB with strictly binned, premium high-frequency ICs (such as legendary Samsung B-die chips), offering elite signal integrity and substantial overclocking headroom for manual tuning. The spectacular exterior features a meticulously crafted aluminum heat spreader electroplated with a brilliant mirror finish (available in striking silver or gold) that matches premium system component builds. Spanning the top edge is a crown-jewel crystalline light bar designed to refract the built-in 8-zone RGB lighting into a magnificent, gem-like glow. Fully customizable using G.SKILL’s downloadable control application or synchronized via major motherboard systems (ASUS Aura Sync, Gigabyte RGB Fusion, MSI Mystic Light, and ASRock Polychrome), this RAM delivers world-class speed and unmatched museum-grade style, fully backed by a limited lifetime warranty.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>4600 MHz (4600 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL18-22-22-42 (or CL18-26-26-46 depending on bin)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.45V - 1.50V (Platform dependent)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Speed</td><td>2133 MHz (2133 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Multi-Channel Kit</td><td>Single Module (Dual-Channel compatible)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Profile Support</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 Ready</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>IC Configuration</td><td>Hand-Bin High-Frequency Overclocking ICs</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>Non-ECC / Unbuffered</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Lighting</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader</td><td>Electroplated Aluminum (Mirror Silver / Gold variants)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lighting Design</td><td>Patent-Pending Crystalline Light Bar</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lighting Control</td><td>8-Zone Individual RGB LED Customization</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Module Height</td><td>44 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F4-4600C18S-8GTRS / F4-4600C18D-16GTRS (Kit)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 6100.00, 6100.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/IpRvrwkzgcTH7kuStxAjxT94td3VNxHKLKAJMjv2.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 13:07:46', '2026-07-13 16:10:19', 'Meta Title: G.SKILL Trident Z Royal RGB 8GB DDR4 4600MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Reach the ultimate limits of DDR4 overclocking with the G.SKILL Trident Z Royal 8GB RAM. Features an extreme 4600MHz speed, mirror silver/gold finish, and crystalline RGB light bar.', 'Keywords: G.SKILL Trident Z Royal 4600MHz, 8GB DDR4 4600MHz RAM, Trident Z Royal Silver 8GB, Extreme Frequency DDR4 Gaming Memory, Crystalline RGB RAM, F4-4600C18S-8GTRS', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1523, 'G.Skill Ripjaws V 8GB DDR4 2666MHz Red Heatsink Desktop RAM', 'Bring dependable responsiveness and a sharp look to your system with the G.Skill Ripjaws V 8GB DDR4 2666MHz Desktop RAM. Built with hand-selected memory chips and fully optimized for both Intel and AMD setups, this 8GB module delivers a steady 2666MHz speed at a quick CL15 timing profile running on an energy-efficient 1.20V. Its aggressive, custom-sculpted radiant red aluminum heat spreader optimizes heat dissipation while adding a bold style to your custom rig.', 'gskill-ripjaws-v-8gb-ddr4-2666mhz-red-heatsink-desktop-ram-1783948111', '<p>The <strong>G.Skill Ripjaws V 8GB DDR4 2666MHz Desktop RAM</strong> is a perfect upgrade or system building choice for mainstream gaming builds, home office environments, and everyday computing setups. As an iconic entry in the multi-award-winning Ripjaws family, this DDR4 module is engineered to eliminate data processing bottlenecks across modern desktop platforms. Operating at 2666MT/s, it delivers the ideal performance sweet spot to ensure smooth multitasking, snappier web browsing, and reliable frame rates in entry-level and competitive esports titles.</p><p>Every single Ripjaws V memory stick is constructed over a custom multi-layer PCB utilizing premium, hand-screened IC chips to maximize signal integrity and ensure long-term hardware life. The exterior is wrapped in a high-grade aluminum heat spreader finished in a vivid radiant red coating, letting it run cooler under continuous system loads compared to standard bare memory modules. Boasting a physical height profile of 42mm, it ensures trouble-free physical clearance beneath the vast majority of standard aftermarket CPU air coolers. Supported by complete Intel XMP 2.0 profile integration, achieving its rated high-speed performance requires nothing more than clicking a toggle inside your motherboard\'s BIOS setup.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>2666 MHz (2666 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL15-15-15-35 (or CL15-17-17-35)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Speed</td><td>2133 MHz (2133 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Multi-Channel Kit</td><td>Single Module (Dual-Channel compatible)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Profile Support</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 Ready</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>Non-ECC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Unbuffered</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Design</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader</td><td>Sculpted Aluminum (Radiant Red Finish)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Module Height</td><td>42 mm</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>LED Lighting</td><td>Non-RGB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F4-2666C15S-8GVR / F4-2666C15D-16GVR (Kit)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 8000.00, 8000.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/nUbsvnCHhgv8SsHQQwKkdIbVoq6FG6Z298v57Nlk.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 13:08:31', '2026-07-13 16:09:23', 'Meta Title: G.Skill Ripjaws V 8GB DDR4 2666MHz Red Heatsink Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Boost your PC\'s responsiveness with G.Skill Ripjaws V 8GB DDR4 RAM. Features an aggressive radiant red aluminum heat spreader and Intel XMP 2.0 support.', 'Keywords: G.Skill Ripjaws V 8GB, DDR4 2666MHz Red RAM, Red Heatsink Desktop RAM, G.Skill Gaming Memory, Intel XMP 2.0 RAM, F4-2666C15S-8GVR', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1524, 'G.Skill Ripjaws V 8GB DDR4 2400MHz Desktop RAM', 'Upgrade your system\'s performance and multitasking responsiveness with the G.Skill Ripjaws V 8GB DDR4 2400MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered with hand-screened ICs and fully optimized for Intel and AMD configurations, this 8GB module operates at a stable 2400MHz frequency with a quick CL15-15-15-35 latency profile at a low 1.20V. Its aggressive aluminum heat spreader optimizes thermal dispersion while giving your custom PC build a sleek, high-performance look.', 'gskill-ripjaws-v-8gb-ddr4-2400mhz-desktop-ram-1783948164', '<p>Upgrade your system\'s performance and multitasking responsiveness with the <strong>G.Skill Ripjaws V 8GB DDR4 2400MHz Desktop RAM</strong>. Engineered with hand-screened ICs and fully optimized for Intel and AMD configurations, this 8GB module operates at a stable 2400MHz frequency with a quick <strong>CL15-15-15-35</strong> latency profile at a low <strong>1.20V</strong>. Its aggressive aluminum heat spreader optimizes thermal dispersion while giving your custom PC build a sleek, high-performance look.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>2400 MHz (2400 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL15-15-15-35</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Speed</td><td>2133 MHz (2133 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Multi-Channel Kit</td><td>Single Module (Dual-Channel compatible)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Profile Support</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 Ready</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>Non-ECC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Unbuffered</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Design</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader</td><td>Stylized Aluminum (Red / Black variants)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Module Height</td><td>42 mm</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>LED Lighting</td><td>Non-RGB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F4-2400C15S-8GVR / F4-2400C15S-8GVB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 8000.00, 8000.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/lVKuQRcH2XnPA7wEjjZdGBtIJlM9wyKIS01y2gVo.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 13:09:24', '2026-07-13 16:47:28', 'Meta Title: G.Skill Ripjaws V 8GB DDR4 2400MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Improve your system\'s efficiency with the G.Skill Ripjaws V 8GB DDR4 2400MHz desktop memory. Features an aggressive aluminum heat spreader and Intel XMP 2.0 support.', 'Keywords: G.Skill Ripjaws V DDR4, 8GB DDR4 2400MHz, G.Skill 8GB Desktop RAM, Ripjaws V Red 8GB, Reliable Gaming Memory DDR4, F4-2400C15S-8GVR', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1525, 'G.Skill Trident Z Royal 16GB DDR4 3600MHz Desktop RAM', 'Bring elite computing performance and breathtaking luxury aesthetics together with the G.Skill Trident Z Royal 16GB DDR4 3600MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered with hand-screened ICs and fully optimized for Intel and AMD platforms, this high-performance 16GB (2x8GB Kit) memory setup runs at a swift 3600MHz speed with a CL18 latency profile at 1.35V. It features a meticulously electroplated mirror-finish aluminum heatsink and a stunning crystalline light bar for a unique, fractured RGB layout.', 'gskill-trident-z-royal-16gb-ddr4-3600mhz-desktop-ram-1783948272', '<p>ase PC builds, high-end creative workstations, and hardware enthusiasts who refuse to compromise on speed or style. Positioned at the pinnacle of G.Skill’s flagship memory lines, this dual-channel DDR4 module kit easily satisfies the high bandwidth demands of modern AAA gaming titles, complex creative multitasking, asset rendering, and heavy programming environments.</p><p>Every single Trident Z Royal stick is constructed over a custom ten-layer PCB with strictly binned high-frequency memory chips, ensuring unmatched signal integrity and superior stability under demanding system workloads. The exterior features a beautifully crafted, highly polished aluminum heatsink electroplated in a brilliant finish (available in mirror silver or pristine gold) that acts as a perfect accent piece reflecting your system\'s internal hardware components. Spanning the top edge is a patent-pending crystalline light bar configuration that scatters the integrated 8-zone RGB LED illumination into a brilliant, gem-like glow. Fully customizable via G.Skill\'s downloadable software or standard motherboard applications (including ASUS Aura Sync, Gigabyte RGB Fusion, MSI Mystic Light, and ASRock Polychrome), it delivers world-class</p>', '<h3>&nbsp;</h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature Category</th><th>Feature</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>16GB (8GB x 2)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>3600 MHz (3600 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL18-22-22-42</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Speed</td><td>2133 MHz (2133 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Multi-Channel Kit</td><td>Dual-Channel Kit</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Profile Support</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 Ready</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>Non-ECC / Unbuffered</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Lighting</strong></td><td>Heatsink Design</td><td>Electroplated Aluminum (Mirror Silver / Gold Finish)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lighting Diffuser</td><td>Patent-Pending Crystalline Light Bar</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lighting Zones</td><td>8-Zone Individual RGB LED Control</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Module Height</td><td>44 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F4-3600C18D-16GTRS / F4-3600C16D-16GTRS (Depending on timing bin)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, 14200.00, 14200.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/TXRgIOCItAn72q8rWUmsTis0Ku2tqvz3Cu3Bwkih.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 13:11:12', '2026-07-13 16:07:30', 'Meta Title: G.Skill Trident Z Royal RGB 16GB DDR4 3600MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Elevate your custom PC with G.Skill Trident Z Royal 16GB DDR4 RAM. Featuring a high-speed 3600MHz frequency, polished mirror heatsink, and a brilliant crystalline RGB light bar.', 'Keywords: G.Skill Trident Z Royal 16GB, DDR4 3600MHz Royal, Trident Z Royal Silver Gold, Luxury Gaming RAM 16GB, Intel XMP 2.0 Desktop Memory, F4-3600C18D-16GTRS', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1526, 'G.Skill Ripjaws V 8GB DDR4 3600MHz CL18 Desktop RAM', 'Push your system\'s processing capabilities further with the high-frequency G.Skill Ripjaws V 8GB DDR4 3600MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered using hand-selected memory ICs and featuring full Intel XMP 2.0 support, this high-performance module delivers a rapid 3600MHz speed at a tight CL18-22-22-42 latency profile, operating at 1.35V. Its aggressive, mid-profile aluminum heat spreader ensures efficient thermal dissipation while giving your gaming or productivity build a sleek, sharp aesthetic.', 'gskill-ripjaws-v-8gb-ddr4-3600mhz-cl18-desktop-ram-1783948313', '<p>The <strong>G.Skill Ripjaws V 8GB DDR4 3600MHz Desktop RAM</strong> is the perfect high-speed upgrade for competitive gamers, content creators, and performance-focused system builders. Positioned in the upper tier of the legendary Ripjaws line, this DDR4 module is engineered to extract maximum data throughput from modern high-core-count processors on both Intel and AMD platforms. By moving past the standard DDR4 baseline to a swift 3600MT/s transfer rate, it provides the necessary bandwidth to reduce system bottlenecking, ensuring smoother framerates in AAA games, faster render times, and snappy day-to-day multitasking.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>3600 MHz (3600 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL18-22-22-42</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Speed</td><td>2133 MHz (2133 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Multi-Channel Kit</td><td>Single Module (Dual-Channel compatible)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Profile Support</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 Ready</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>Non-ECC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Unbuffered</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Design</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader</td><td>Stylized Aluminum (Black finish)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Module Height</td><td>42 mm</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>LED Lighting</td><td>Non-RGB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F4-3600C18S-8GVK / F4-3600C18D-16GVK (Kit)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 7300.00, 7300.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/DFbK9QfFhxjrSUraJ8lhbEJRPWpqTOKR90Rk9wVT.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 13:11:53', '2026-07-13 16:06:26', 'Meta Title: G.Skill Ripjaws V 8GB DDR4 3600MHz CL18 Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Maximize your PC\'s potential with G.Skill Ripjaws V 8GB DDR4 RAM. Featuring a high-speed 3600MHz frequency, aggressive aluminum heat spreader, and Intel XMP 2.0 support.', 'Keywords: G.Skill Ripjaws V DDR4, 8GB DDR4 3600MHz, G.Skill 8GB Desktop RAM, High-Speed Gaming Memory, Intel XMP 2.0 RAM, F4-3600C18S-8GVK', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1527, 'G.Skill Trident Z5 16GB DDR5 5600MHz CL30 Desktop RAM', 'vStep into the future of high-speed desktop performance with the G.Skill Trident Z5 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered with hand-screened high-quality ICs and supporting Intel XMP 3.0, this elite module delivers a rapid 5600MHz frequency with an ultra-low, hyper-responsive CL30-36-36-89 latency profile at 1.25V. Its sleek, dual-texture hypercar-inspired aluminum heat spreader ensures peak thermal management while providing an aggressive, premium look to your next-gen build.', 'gskill-trident-z5-16gb-ddr5-5600mhz-cl30-desktop-ram-1783948357', '<p>The <strong>G.Skill Trident Z5 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Desktop RAM</strong> represents the pinnacle of next-generation memory engineering, custom-built for gamers, content creators, and hardware enthusiasts chasing high-speed computing. Operating on the groundbreaking DDR5 architecture, this 16GB module delivers twice the data burst length and an entirely redesigned power structure compared to legacy DDR4 memory. With a blazing 5600MT/s data transfer rate coupled with a highly sought-after, ultra-tight CL30 latency profile, it effectively eliminates system bottlenecEvery single Trident Z5 module is constructed using premium, hand-screened DDR5 ICs paired with an onboard Power Management Integrated Circuit (PMIC) chip, which shifts voltage regulation directly to the module for more precise power distribution and superior signal stability. The stunning exterior showcases an award-winning, sleek aluminum design featuring a black brushed-aluminum strip inset into a metallic silver or matte black body, topped off with a sharp piano-black top fin. Standing at a manageable 44mm tall, it provides excellent physical clearance for premium custom PC configurations. Fully optimized for hassle-free performance adjustments, it features complete Intel XMP 3.0 profile integration, enabling you to lock in its top-tier rated speed with a single toggle inside your motherboard\'s BIOS setup.</p><h3>ks—ensuring buttery smooth frame delivery in demanding AAA titles, faster timelines in 4K/8K rendering suites, and effortless multitasking across extensive workloads.</h3><p>&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>5600 MHz (5600 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL30-36-36-89</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.25V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Speed</td><td>4800 MHz (4800 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Voltage</td><td>1.10V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Multi-Channel Kit</td><td>Single Module (Dual-Channel compatible)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Profile Support</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 Ready</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Management</td><td>On-board PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>On-Die ECC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Unbuffered</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Design</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader</td><td>Dual-Texture Brushed Aluminum (Silver/Black or Matte Black)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Module Height</td><td>44 mm</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>LED Lighting</td><td>Non-RGB (Trident Z5 Classic layout)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F5-5600J3036D16GX1-TZ5S / F5-5600J3036D16GX2-TZ5S (Kit)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 26000.00, 26000.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/IfCoQhL7EjVsL31M5v2jDytXqL8WFzYbYN5aU2nI.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 13:12:37', '2026-07-13 16:05:34', NULL, 'Meta Description: Upgrade to next-gen speed with G.Skill Trident Z5 16GB DDR5 RAM. Operating at 5600MHz with an ultra-low CL30 latency profile and sleek dual-texture aluminum heat spreader.', 'Keywords: G.Skill Trident Z5 DDR5, 16GB DDR5 5600MHz, Trident Z5 CL30 RAM, High-Performance DDR5 Memory, Intel XMP 3.0 RAM, F5-5600J3036D16GX1-TZ5S', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1528, 'G.Skill Trident Z5 RGB 16GB 5600MHz DDR5 CL36 Desktop RAM iosbd', 'Step into next-generation processing performance with the G.Skill Trident Z5 RGB 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered with hand-screened high-quality ICs and supporting Intel XMP 3.0, this elite module delivers a rapid 5600MHz frequency with a responsive CL36-36-36-89 latency profile at 1.20V / 1.25V. Wrapped in a matte black, dual-texture hypercar-inspired aluminum heat spreader and crowned with a translucent RGB light bar, it delivers brilliant aesthetics alongside cutting-edge speed.', 'gskill-trident-z5-rgb-16gb-5600mhz-ddr5-cl36-desktop-ram-iosbd-1783961219', '<p>The <strong>G.Skill Trident Z5 RGB 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Desktop RAM</strong> represents the pinnacle of high-frequency desktop memory engineering, purpose-built for gamers, creators, and enthusiasts assembling next-gen Intel or AMD rigs. Utilizing the revolutionary DDR5 architecture, this 16GB module handles twice the data burst length of legacy DDR4 kits and features a completely decentralized power topology. Operating at a swift 5600MT/s transfer speed, it effortlessly strips away computing bottlenecks, ensuring buttery smooth frame delivery in demanding AAA gaming, accelerated timeline scrubbing in 4K/8K media suites, and ultra-responsive multitasking across complex system workloads.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>5600 MHz (5600 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL36-36-36-89</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.20V - 1.25V (Batch dependent)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Speed</td><td>4800 MHz (4800 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Voltage</td><td>1.10V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Multi-Channel Kit</td><td>Single Module (Dual-Channel compatible)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Profile Support</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 Ready</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Management</td><td>On-board PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>On-Die ECC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Unbuffered</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Lighting</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader</td><td>Dual-Texture Brushed Aluminum (Matte Black Body)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lighting Design</td><td>Translucent Streamlined RGB Light Bar</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lighting Control</td><td>Multi-Zone Individual RGB LED Customization</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Module Height</td><td>44 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F5-5600J3636C16GX1-TZ5RK / F5-5600J3636C16GX2-TZ5RK (Kit)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 28500.00, 28500.00, NULL, 1, 'products/thumbnails/L4vUsriW6zpBcepnvBJu08ivtGn1rfax24XDzZm2.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 13:13:23', '2026-07-13 16:46:59', 'Meta Title: G.Skill Trident Z5 RGB 16GB DDR5 5600MHz CL36 Desktop RAM - Matte Black', 'Meta Description: Experience next-gen speeds with the G.Skill Trident Z5 RGB 16GB DDR5 memory. Operating at 5600MHz with a sleek black aluminum design and customizable RGB lighting strip.', 'Keywords: G.Skill Trident Z5 RGB DDR5, 16GB DDR5 5600MHz Black, Trident Z5 RGB CL36 RAM, Matte Black Gaming DDR5, Intel XMP 3.0 Desktop Memory, F5-5600J3636C16GX1-TZ5RK', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1529, 'G.Skill Trident Z NEO RGB 8GB 3600MHz Gaming Desktop RAM', 'Bring optimized next-tier performance and signature aesthetics to your setup with the G.Skill Trident Z NEO RGB 8GB DDR4 3600MHz Gaming Desktop RAM. Purpose-built and tuned for maximum compatibility with AMD Ryzen processors, this elite module delivers a rapid 3600MHz speed with a smooth CL18 latency profile at 1.35V. It features a stunning dual-texture heat spreader combining sleek brushed aluminum and matte black styling, capped with a fully customizable, vibrant 8-zone RGB light bar.', 'gskill-trident-z-neo-rgb-8gb-3600mhz-gaming-desktop-ram-1783948456', '<p>The <strong>G.Skill Trident Z NEO RGB 8GB DDR4 3600MHz Gaming Desktop RAM</strong> is specifically engineered to unlock the full processing potential of high-performance gaming systems, with a particular optimization focus on AMD Ryzen platforms. As an award-winning entry in G.Skill\'s premium gaming memory lineup, this DDR4 module effortlessly tackles the steep data bandwidth requirements of contemporary AAA games, intensive multitasking, and streaming applications. Running at a high-speed 3600MT/s transfer rate, it ensures rapid data pathways to minimize system bottlenecks and smooth out frame pacing during demanding gaming sessions.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>8GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>3600 MHz (3600 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL18-22-22-42</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Speed</td><td>2133 MHz (2133 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Platform Optimization</td><td>Fully Tuned &amp; Optimized for AMD Ryzen Platforms</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Multi-Channel Kit</td><td>Single Module (Dual-Channel compatible)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Profile Support</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 / AMD Profile Ready</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>Non-ECC / Unbuffered</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Lighting</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader Design</td><td>Dual-Texture Aluminum (Brushed Silver &amp; Matte Black)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lighting Control</td><td>8-Zone Individual RGB LED Customization</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lighting Sync</td><td>Compatible with all major motherboard RGB software</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Module Height</td><td>44 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F4-3600C18S-8GTZN / F4-3600C18D-16GTZN (Kit)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 7900.00, 7900.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/h8XEbYLt3S9mijebr4GoyrrJV58OzFeVIm3qjmsi.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 13:14:16', '2026-07-13 16:46:05', 'Meta Title: G.Skill Trident Z NEO RGB 8GB DDR4 3600MHz Gaming Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Maximize gaming performance with G.Skill Trident Z NEO 8GB DDR4 RAM. Optimized for AMD Ryzen platforms, featuring 3600MHz speed, dual-texture heatsink, and vibrant RGB lighting.', 'Keywords: G.Skill Trident Z NEO, 8GB DDR4 3600MHz, Trident Z Neo RGB 8GB, AMD Ryzen Gaming RAM, High-Frequency Desktop Memory, F4-3600C18S-8GTZN', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1530, 'G.Skill Trident Z NEO RGB 32GB DDR4 3600MHz Gaming Desktop RAM', 'Unlock uncompromising high-capacity performance and premium style with the G.Skill Trident Z NEO RGB 32GB DDR4 3600MHz Gaming Desktop RAM. Purpose-built and fully optimized for seamless compatibility with AMD Ryzen processors, this massive 32GB module delivers a rapid 3600MHz speed with a smooth CL18 latency profile at 1.35V. The iconic dual-texture heat spreader pairs sleek brushed aluminum with matte black styling, capped off by a fully customizable, vibrant 8-zone RGB light bar.', 'gskill-trident-z-neo-rgb-32gb-ddr4-3600mhz-gaming-desktop-ram-1783948510', '<p>The <strong>G.Skill Trident Z NEO RGB 32GB DDR4 3600MHz Gaming Desktop RAM</strong> is specifically engineered to bring heavy-duty multitasking capacity and elite responsiveness to modern computing rigs, with a dedicated optimization focus on AMD Ryzen platforms. As an award-winning entry in G.Skill\'s premium gaming memory lineup, this high-density DDR4 module effortlessly tackles the steep data bandwidth requirements of contemporary AAA games, 4K video editing suites, heavy 3D rendering projects, and multi-threaded virtualization workflows. Operating at a high-speed 3600MT/s transfer rate with a massive 32GB footprint on a single stick, it keeps data pathways wide open to minimize system bottlenecks and smooth out frame pacing during intensive professional and gaming sessions.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR4</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>32GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>3600 MHz (3600 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL18-22-22-42</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.35V</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Speed</td><td>2133 MHz (2133 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Voltage</td><td>1.20V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Platform Optimization</td><td>Fully Tuned &amp; Optimized for AMD Ryzen Platforms</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Multi-Channel Kit</td><td>Single Module (Dual/Quad-Channel compatible)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Profile Support</td><td>Intel XMP 2.0 / AMD Profile Ready</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>Non-ECC / Unbuffered</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Lighting</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader Design</td><td>Dual-Texture Aluminum (Brushed Silver &amp; Matte Black)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lighting Control</td><td>8-Zone Individual RGB LED Customization</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lighting Sync</td><td>Compatible with all major motherboard RGB software</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Module Height</td><td>44 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F4-3600C18S-32GTZN / F4-3600C18D-64GTZN (Kit)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 35500.00, 35500.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/ftNFcDZo71pq5kRaJNE2TmzNZI7obOhBkhYuhBUZ.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 13:15:10', '2026-07-13 16:00:36', 'Meta Title: G.Skill Trident Z NEO RGB 32GB DDR4 3600MHz Gaming Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Maximize your PC\'s potential with G.Skill Trident Z NEO 32GB DDR4 RAM. Fully optimized for AMD Ryzen, featuring a 3600MHz frequency, dual-texture heatsink, and vibrant RGB lighting.', 'Keywords: G.Skill Trident Z NEO 32GB, DDR4 3600MHz 32GB RAM, Trident Z Neo RGB 32GB, AMD Ryzen Gaming RAM, High-Capacity Desktop Memory, F4-3600C18S-32GTZN', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1532, 'G.Skill Trident Z5 RGB 16GB DDR5 5200MHz Desktop RAM', 'Step into next-generation processing speeds with the high-performance G.Skill Trident Z5 RGB 16GB DDR5 5200MHz Desktop RAM. Engineered with hand-screened high-quality ICs and supporting Intel XMP 3.0, this elite module delivers a rapid 5200MHz frequency with a stable CL40-40-40-83 latency profile at 1.10V / 1.25V. Its stunning hypercar-inspired aluminum heat spreader features a texturized center strip and a translucent RGB light bar for premium aesthetics and cutting-edge data speeds.', 'gskill-trident-z5-rgb-16gb-ddr5-5200mhz-desktop-ram-1783948576', '<p>The <strong>G.Skill Trident Z5 RGB 16GB DDR5 5200MHz Desktop RAM</strong> represents the baseline of flagship next-generation memory engineering, purpose-built for gamers, creators, and enthusiasts assembling premium rigs. Utilizing the revolutionary DDR5 architecture, this 16GB module handles twice the data burst length of legacy DDR4 kits and features an entirely decentralized power topology. Operating at a swift 5200MT/s transfer speed, it effortlessly strips away computing bottlenecks, ensuring smooth frame delivery in demanding AAA gaming, accelerated timeline scrubbing in media suites, and ultra-responsive multitasking across complex system workloads.</p><p>Every individual Trident Z5 RGB stick is built using premium, hand-screened memory chips paired with an onboard Power Management Integrated Circuit (PMIC) chip. The PMIC shifts voltage regulation directly to the module, ensuring highly precise power distribution and robust signal integrity under massive workloads. The exterior features a stunning, award-winning aluminum chassis layout highlighted by a black brushed-aluminum strip inset into a sleek metallic silver or matte black body, capped off with a flowing light bar. Fully customizable through G.Skill\'s downloadable software or standard motherboard sync applications (ASUS Aura Sync, Gigabyte RGB Fusion, MSI Mystic Light, and ASRock Polychrome), it brings elite speed and custom showcase styling to your PC build, backed by a limited lifetime warranty.</p><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basic Information</strong></td><td>Memory Type</td><td>DDR5</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>16GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Form Factor</td><td>Desktop DIMM (288-pin)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Metrics</strong></td><td>Tested Speed</td><td>5200 MHz (5200 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Latency</td><td>CL40-40-40-83 / CL36-36-36-83 (Batch dependent)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tested Voltage</td><td>1.10V - 1.25V (Platform dependent)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Speed</td><td>4800 MHz (4800 MT/s)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Default SPD Voltage</td><td>1.10V</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Technical</strong></td><td>Multi-Channel Kit</td><td>Single Module (Dual-Channel compatible)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Profile Support</td><td>Intel XMP 3.0 Ready</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Power Management</td><td>On-board PMIC (Power Management Integrated Circuit)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Error Checking</td><td>On-Die ECC</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Type</td><td>Unbuffered</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical &amp; Lighting</strong></td><td>Heat Spreader</td><td>Dual-Texture Brushed Aluminum (Silver or Matte Black variants)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lighting Design</td><td>Translucent Streamlined RGB Light Bar</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Lighting Control</td><td>Multi-Zone Individual RGB LED Customization</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Module Height</td><td>44 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty &amp; Codes</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Part Number (MPN)</td><td>F5-5200J4040A16GX1-TZ5RK / F5-5200J4040A16GX2-TZ5RK (Kit)</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Warranty</td><td>Limited Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 31000.00, 31000.00, NULL, 2, 'products/thumbnails/cRdxhseRVJUAe1PRJpV3SJATioDuj8LuPzKsMNXe.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-13 13:16:16', '2026-07-13 15:57:08', 'Meta Title: G.Skill Trident Z5 RGB 16GB DDR5 5200MHz Desktop RAM', 'Meta Description: Transition to high-speed DDR5 performance with the G.Skill Trident Z5 RGB 16GB memory module. Features a 5200MHz frequency, aggressive dual-texture heatsink, and sweeping RGB.', 'Meta Description: Transition to high-speed DDR5 performance with the G.Skill Trident Z5 RGB 16GB memory module. Features a 5200MHz frequency, aggressive dual-texture heatsink, and sweeping RGB.', NULL, 143, NULL, NULL),
(1533, 'Canon 046 Black High Capacity Toner Cartridge iosbd', 'The Canon 046 Black Genuine Toner Cartridge delivers crisp, professional-quality black prints with exceptional reliability. Designed and manufactured by Canon, it offers a page yield of up to 2,200 pages (ISO/IEC standard) and is fully compatible with selected Canon imageCLASS printers.', 'canon-046-black-high-capacity-toner-cartridge-iosbd-1784038413', '<p>The Canon 046 Black Genuine Toner Cartridge is engineered by Canon to ensure outstanding print quality, consistent performance, and maximum printer reliability. Manufactured in Canon\'s own facilities, this genuine toner is built to precise specifications, helping reduce printer wear while producing sharp text and rich black graphics on every page.</p><p>With a page yield of approximately 2,200 pages (based on ISO/IEC standards), this cartridge is an ideal choice for offices, businesses, and home users requiring dependable, high-volume printing.</p><p>Using genuine Canon toner helps maintain optimal printer performance, minimizes maintenance issues, and ensures every print meets Canon\'s high-quality standards.</p><p>Key Features Genuine Canon Original Toner Cartridge</p><p>Rich, deep black output with sharp text</p><p>Approximate Yield: 2,200 Pages (ISO/IEC Standard)</p><p>Consistent, professional-quality printing</p><p>Reliable performance with reduced printer downtime</p><p>Easy installation and hassle-free replacement</p><p>Designed to maximize Canon printer lifespan</p><h3><strong>Compatible Printers</strong></h3><ul><li>Canon imageCLASS MF735Cdw</li><li>Canon imageCLASS MF733Cdw</li><li>Canon imageCLASS MF731Cdw</li><li>Canon imageCLASS LBP654Cdw</li></ul><h3><strong>Why Choose Genuine Canon Toner?</strong></h3><ul><li>Superior print quality</li><li>Consistent page yield</li><li>Protects your printer</li><li>Reliable performance</li><li>Genuine Canon manufacturing standards</li><li>Professional-quality documents every time</li></ul>', '<figure c