(1542, 'Dahua ST2-64-S1 64GB MicroSD Memory Card-IOSBD', 'The Adata Premier 64GB microSDXC Memory Card is a reliable storage solution designed for smartphones, tablets, digital cameras, action cameras, dash cams, and other compatible devices. Built with 3D NAND TLC Flash, it offers read speeds of up to 95MB/s and write speeds of up to 25MB/s for smooth file transfers and Full HD video recording. Backed by a lifetime warranty, it is ideal for everyday storage and multimedia applications.', 'dahua-st2-64-s1-64gb-microsd-memory-card-iosbd-1784435404', '<p>The <strong>Adata Premier 64GB microSDXC Memory Card</strong> is a dependable and high-performance storage solution designed to meet the everyday needs of modern digital devices. Whether you\'re expanding your smartphone\'s storage, capturing memorable moments with a digital camera, recording Full HD videos, or storing important documents, this memory card provides the speed, reliability, and durability you need.</p><p>With a <strong>64GB storage capacity</strong>, the Adata Premier microSDXC card offers ample space for thousands of photos, hours of Full HD videos, music, applications, games, and essential files. It is an excellent choice for Android smartphones, tablets, digital cameras, action cameras, dash cams, drones, portable gaming consoles, and other devices that support microSDXC memory cards.</p><p>Built using advanced <strong>3D NAND TLC Flash</strong> technology, this memory card delivers enhanced durability, improved efficiency, and long-lasting performance compared to traditional flash memory. It provides <strong>read speeds of up to 95MB/s</strong> and <strong>write speeds of up to 25MB/s</strong>, allowing users to transfer files quickly, launch applications faster, and enjoy smooth playback of photos and videos.</p><p>The Adata Premier memory card is optimized for everyday multimedia use, making it suitable for recording Full HD videos, capturing high-resolution images, and storing large files without