(1545, 'TEAM 32GB MicroSDHC/SDXC UHS-I U1 C10 Memory Card with Adapter-IOSBD', 'The Adata 32GB microSDHC UHS-I Memory Card is a reliable and high-speed storage solution designed for smartphones, tablets, digital cameras, action cameras, drones, dash cams, and other compatible devices. With read speeds of up to 100MB/s and write speeds of up to 20MB/s, it supports smooth Full HD video recording, fast file transfers, and dependable everyday performance. It also includes an SD adapter for wider compatibility and comes with a Lifetime Manufacturer Warranty.', 'team-32gb-microsdhcsdxc-uhs-i-u1-c10-memory-card-with-adapter-iosbd-1784436414', '<p>The <strong>Adata 32GB microSDHC UHS-I Memory Card</strong> is designed to provide dependable performance, fast data transfer, and secure storage for a wide range of digital devices. Whether you\'re expanding your smartphone\'s storage, capturing memorable photos, recording Full HD videos, or storing important documents, this memory card delivers the speed and reliability needed for everyday use.</p><p>With a <strong>32GB storage capacity</strong>, the Adata microSDHC card offers sufficient space for thousands of photos, hours of Full HD videos, music, applications, documents, and other essential files. It is compatible with Android smartphones, tablets, digital cameras, action cameras, drones, dash cams, handheld gaming devices, and many other devices that support microSDHC memory cards.</p><p>The card delivers <strong>read speeds of up to 100MB/s</strong> and <strong>write speeds of up to 20MB/s</strong>, allowing users to transfer files quickly and record high-definition videos with stable performance. Its <strong>UHS-I U1</strong> and <strong>Class 10</strong> performance ratings make it suitable for Full HD video recording, continuous photography, and everyday multimedia storage.</p><p>Built for durability, the Adata 32GB microSDHC Memory Card is engineered to withstand demanding environments. It offers reliable protection against <strong>water, shock, extreme temperatures, magnets, and X-rays</strong>, helping keep your important files safe even under challenging conditions.</p><p>Operating efficiently within a temperature range of <strong>0°C to 70°C</strong> and requiring an operating voltage of <strong>2.7V to 3.6V</strong>, this memory card ensures stable performance across various devices. It also includes a convenient <strong>SD adapter</strong>, allowing it to be used with laptops, DSLR cameras, card readers, and other devices that support full-size SD cards.</p><p>Whether you are a student, traveler, photographer, content creator, or professional user, the <strong>Adata 32GB microSDHC UHS-I Memory Card</strong> provides an affordable, dependable, and long-lasting storage solution for your everyday digital needs.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li>32GB storage capacity</li><li>UHS-I U1 and Class 10 performance</li><li>Read speeds of <strong>up to 100MB/s</strong></li><li>Write speeds of <strong>up to 20MB/s</strong></li><li>Ideal for Full HD video recording and photography</li><li>Compatible with smartphones, tablets, cameras, drones, dash cams, and gaming devices</li><li>Includes <strong>SD adapter</strong> for broader compatibility</li><li>Water-resistant, shock-resistant, temperature-resistant, magnetic-resistant, and X-ray-resistant</li><li>Operating temperature: <strong>0°C to 70°C</strong></li><li>Operating voltage: <strong>2.7V to 3.6V</strong></li><li>Backed by a <strong>Lifetime Manufacturer Warranty</strong></li></ul><h2><strong>Buy Adata 32GB microSDHC UHS-I Memory Card from International Office Solution</strong></h2><p>Purchase the <strong>Adata 32GB microSDHC UHS-I Memory Card</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong>, your trusted source for genuine Adata memory cards and storage solutions in Bangladesh. We offer authentic products, competitive prices, fast nationwide delivery, and reliable customer service.</p><p>Order online today