e included SD adapter increases compatibility by allowing the microSD card to be used in DSLR cameras, laptops, desktop computers, and other devices with standard SD card slots. This makes it a versatile storage solution for photographers, students, professionals, content creators, and everyday users.</p><p>Purchase the PNY Elite 64GB Class 10 UHS-I microSD Memory Card with SD Adapter from International Office Solution and enjoy genuine PNY products, competitive pricing, expert customer support, and fast nationwide delivery across Bangladesh.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Main Feature</strong></td><td>Product Type</td><td>microSDXC Memory Card</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>64GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Read Speed</td><td>Up to 100MB/s</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Speed Class</td><td>UHS-I, Class 10 <i>(if applicable)</i></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Ideal For</td><td>Smartphones, Tablets, Digital Cameras, Action Cameras, Drones, and Other Compatible Devices</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance</strong></td><td>Data Transfer</td><td>Fast file transfer for photos, Full HD videos, music, and documents</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Reliability</td><td>Durable design for everyday storage and data protection</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>Lifetime Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'MEMORY CARD', 1200.00, 1200.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/LiDUSW7sN2OUDvrvSl1i2mfMCXv3ZUm7y56eDIZp.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-19 10:31:18', '2026-07-19 10:31:18', 'PNY Elite 64GB Class 10 UHS-I microSD Memory Card with SD Adapter | International Office Solution', 'Buy the PNY Elite 64GB Class 10 UHS-I microSD Memory Card with SD Adapter. Enjoy up to 100MB/s read speed, reliable Full HD recording, and lifetime warranty. Best 