eratures, ensuring your valuable data remains protected wherever you go. Whether you\'re traveling, creating content outdoors, or using it for daily work, this memory card provides dependable performance.</p><p>Compatible with all devices supporting microSDHC and microSDXC formats, the card offers broad compatibility for smartphones, tablets, DSLR cameras, action cameras, drones, laptops, Chromebooks, and other portable devices. It also supports the SanDisk Memory Zone app, allowing users to easily organize, back up, and manage files directly from Android devices.</p><p>Purchase the genuine SanDisk Ultra 128GB microSDXC UHS-I Memory Card from International Office Solution and enjoy authentic SanDisk products, competitive prices, expert customer support, and fast delivery throughout Bangladesh. The card is backed by a Lifetime Limited Warranty (must be claimed with the original box and all accessories), providing long-term confidence and reliable performance.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Main Feature</strong></td><td>Product Type</td><td>microSDXC UHS-I Memory Card</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brand</td><td>SanDisk</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Model</td><td>Ultra 128GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>128GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Read Speed</td><td>Up to 140MB/s</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Speed Class</td><td>Class 10, UHS-I, U1, A1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Minimum Write Speed</td><td>10MB/s</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance</strong></td><td>Video Support</td><td>Full HD Video Recording</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Operating Temperature</td><td>-25°C to 85°C</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Information</strong></td><td>Dimensions</td><td>1.02 × 14.99 × 10.92 mm</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>0.26 g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong