(1566, 'SanDisk Ultra 32GB Class-10 120Mbps Micro SDHC UHS-I Memory Card -IOSBD', 'The SanDisk Ultra 32GB Class 10 UHS-I microSDHC Memory Card is a reliable storage solution for Android smartphones, tablets, cameras, drones, and other compatible devices. With read speeds of up to 120MB/s, UHS-I, Class 10, U1, and A1 performance, it offers fast file transfers, smooth Full HD video recording, and quicker app loading. Buy the genuine SanDisk Ultra 32GB Memory Card from International Office Solution for the best price in Bangladesh with fast nationwide delivery.', 'sandisk-ultra-32gb-class-10-120mbps-micro-sdhc-uhs-i-memory-card-iosbd-1784459569', '<p>The SanDisk Ultra 32GB Class 10 UHS-I microSDHC Memory Card is designed to provide reliable performance, fast data transfer, and dependable storage for smartphones, tablets, cameras, drones, and other compatible digital devices. Whether you\'re capturing memorable moments, storing important documents, or expanding your mobile device\'s storage, this memory card delivers the speed and reliability you need every day.</p><p>With a storage capacity of 32GB, the SanDisk Ultra microSDHC card provides enough space to store thousands of photos, Full HD videos, music, mobile apps, documents, and other essential files. It is an excellent choice for Android smartphones, tablets, action cameras, digital cameras, dash cameras, and portable gaming devices.</p><p>Powered by UHS-I technology with Class 10, U1, and A1 performance ratings, this memory card delivers read speeds of up to 120MB/s, allowing you to transfer files quickly and efficiently. It can move up to 1,000 photos in approximately one minute when used with a compatible card reader, helping save valuable time. The A1 performance rating also enables faster application loading and improved smartphone responsiveness, making it an excellent option for Android users.</p><p>The SanDisk Ultra 32GB Memory Card supports smooth Full HD (1080p) video recording and high-quality photography, ensuring your videos and images are captured without interruption. It is built to withstand challenging environments with water-proof, shock-proof, X-ray-proof, magnet-proof, and temperature-resistant protection, helping safeguard your valuable data wherever you go.</p><p>Compatible with Android smartphones, tablets, digital cameras, drones, Windows laptops, Chromebooks, and other devices supporting the microSDHC format, this card offers broad compatibility for everyday use. It also works with the SanDisk Memory Zone app, allowing users to organize, manage, and back up files conveniently from their Android devices.</p><p>Purchase the genuine SanDisk Ultra 32GB Class 10 UHS-I microSDHC Memory Card from International Office Solution and enjoy authentic SanDisk quality, competitive pricing, professional customer support, and fast delivery across Bangladesh. The memory card is backed by a Lifetime Warranty (must be claimed with the original box and all accessories), giving you complete confidence in your purchase.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Main Feature</strong></td><td>Product Type</td><td>microSDHC UHS-I Memory Card</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brand</td><td>SanDisk</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Model</td><td>Ultra 32GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>32GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Read Speed</td><td>Up to 120MB/s</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Speed Class</td><td>Class 10, UHS-I, U1, A1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Minimum Write Speed</td><td>10MB/s</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance</strong></td><td>Video Support</td><td>Full HD (1080p) Video Recording</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Information</strong></td><td>Dimensions</td><td>1.02 × 14.99 × 10.92 mm</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>Approximately 0.26 g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</stron