(1567, 'Transcend 25H3 1TB USB 3.1 External HDD', 'The Transcend StoreJet 25H3 1TB USB 3.1 External HDD combines supreme, military-grade durability with high-speed data mobility. Enclosed in a ruggedized, slip-resistant silicone sleeve, this 2.5-inch portable drive features an advanced three-stage shock protection system that meets rigorous U.S. military transit drop-test standards. Driven by the fast USB 3.1 Gen 1 connection interface, it supports lightning-quick file transfers up to 5Gbps and includes a hardware One-Touch Auto-Backup button for seamless, instant data protection when paired with the free Transcend Elite software suite.', 'transcend-25h3-1tb-usb-31-external-hdd-1784461430', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Transcend StoreJet 25H3 1TB USB 3.1 External HDD is built to withstand the rigors of heavy daily travel, field work, and demanding commuter schedules without risking your critical data. Grounded in high-endurance manufacturing engineering, this drive features a premium, U.S. Military MIL-STD-810G transit drop-tested design. Data defense is handled by an innovative three-stage physical defense matrix: an outermost anti-slip silicone rubber case that absorbs structural vibrations, a reinforced inner hard plastics enclosure shielding the drive core, and an internal shock-absorbing suspension damper that cradles the mechanical components during accidental desk falls or drops.</p><p>Performance-wise, the StoreJet 25H3 utilizes the SuperSpeed USB 3.1 Gen 1 standard (also recognized as USB 5Gbps), delivering maximum file transfer bandwidth that leaves older USB 2.0 alternatives far behind. Internally, it houses a reliable 2.5-inch 5400 RPM hard drive backed by an 8MB cache layer, making it excellent for archiving huge local photo libraries, system backup images, multi-layered office documents, and personal media archives.</p><p>To maximize user workflow efficiency, the drive is engineered with a multi-functional hardware Quick-Reconnect button. If you safely eject the drive via your operating system, this button allows you to instantly re-initialize the volume on your desktop with a single tap, removing the tedious need to physically unplug and re-insert the cable. The exact same button serves as a One-Touch Auto-Backup trigger when utilizing the complimentary Transcend Elite data management application. Fully compatible across Windows, macOS, and Linux environments, and bundled with the exclusive RecoveRx data recovery utility, it represents the gold standard for reliable, high-security portable storage.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Storage Capacity</td><td>1 TB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Storage Media Type</td><td>2.5-inch Mechanical Hard Disk Drive (HDD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Internal Drive Speed</td><td>5400 RPM</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Internal Buffer / Cache</td><td>8 MB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Connection Interface</td><td>USB 3.1 Gen 1 / USB 5Gbps (Backward compatible with USB 2.0)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Interface Connector Type</td><td>Micro USB to USB Type-A (High-durability 10K plug-tested port)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Data Transfer Rate</td><td>Up to 5 Gbps (Bus Bandwidth)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Features</strong></td><td>Shock Protection Standards</td><td>U.S. Military MIL-STD-810G 516.6 Transit Drop-Test Compliant</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Features</strong></td><td>3-Stage Armor Setup</td><td>Silicone Outer Shell, Suspension Damper, Reinforced Casing</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Features</strong></td><td>Quick-Action Button</td><td>Dual-Function: One-Touch Auto-Backup &amp; Quick Reconnect</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Support</strong></td><td>Bundled Software Utilities</td><td>Transcend Elite (Data Management) &amp; RecoveRx (Data Recovery)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Support</strong></td><td>Security &amp; Encryption</td><td>256-bit AES File &amp; Folder Encryption (Via Transcend Elite)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Microsoft Windows</td><td>Windows 7, 8, 10, 11 or later</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Apple macOS</td><td>macOS 10.10 or later</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Linux Platform</td><td>Linux Kernel 2.6.31 or later</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Operating Voltage</td><td>5V DC (USB Bus Powered)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Power Saving States</td><td>Intelligent Power Saving Mode (Activates after 10 mins idle)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>131.8 mm x 80.8 mm x 16.3 mm (5.19\" x 3.18\" x 0.64\")</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Net Device Weight</td><td>191 grams (6.74 oz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Enclosure Material</td><td>Anti-slip high-texture Industrial Silicone Rubber</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Available Factory Colors</td><td>Navy Blue / Purple</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Environmental</strong></td><td>Operating Temperature</td><td>5°C (41°F) to 55°C (131°F)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Certifications</strong></td><td>Regulatory Compliance</td><td>CE, FCC, BSMI, KC, RCM, EAC, UKCA</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Warranty</td><td>3 Years Limited Brand Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Portable Hard Disk Drive', 13500.00, 13500.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/fQWzcrlaZN025LEzRDE7CAdIgfmWo3trJWx44mAO.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-19 11:43:50', '2026-07-19 11:46:40', 'Meta Title: Transcend StoreJet 25H3 1TB USB 3.1 External Hard Drive', 'Meta Description: Buy the ruggedized Transcend StoreJet 25H3 1TB External HDD. Features military-grade 3-stage shock protection, 5Gbps USB 3.1 Gen 1 speeds, and One-Touch Auto-Backup.', 'Keywords: Transcend 25H3 1TB price, TS1TSJ25H3P, StoreJet 25H3 1TB HDD, military-grade external hard drive, rugged portable storage, Transcend Elite backup', NULL, 147, NULL, NULL),
(1568, 'Transcend StoreJet J25C3N 1TB External Hard Disk Drive (HDD)', 'The Transcend StoreJet J25C3N 1TB External Hard Disk Drive perfectly merges high-end luxury aesthetics with powerful on-the-go data mobility. Housed in a beautifully polished, sandblasted, and anodized aluminum alloy casing, this ultra-slim 2.5-inch portable drive measures a mere 9.95mm in thickness and weighs just 136 grams—making it an exceptionally lightweight companion for corporate professionals and travelers alike. Operating on a high-speed USB 3.1 Gen 1 interface, it offers blazing-fast file transfer rates up to 5Gbps and pairs seamlessly with the Transcend Elite software suite for advanced data encryption, syncing, and cloud backup management.', 'transcend-storejet-j25c3n-1tb-external-hard-disk-drive-hdd-1784461498', '<p>The Transcend StoreJet J25C3N 1TB External HDD is engineered for users who view their tech accessories as a lifestyle statement without compromising on performance. Breaking away from traditional, bulky plastic or rubber external drives, the J25C3N features a highly refined Scandinavian design aesthetic. Its minimalist chassis is crafted from premium aluminum alloy that undergoes precision CNC milling, polishing, sandblasting, and anodizing to achieve a spectacular matte Iron Gray finish that completely resists fingerprint smudges while offering a cool-to-the-touch, luxury feel. Boasting a ultra-thin 9.95mm profile, it effortlessly slides into a vest pocket, briefcase, or slim laptop sleeve, optimizing spatial efficiency.</p><p>Beneath its elegant exterior, the StoreJet J25C3N features a highly reliable 2.5-inch 5400 RPM internal mechanical drive layer. Powered by the SuperSpeed USB 3.1 Gen 1 connection standard (fully backward compatible with legacy USB 2.0 ports), it yields rapid real-world execution speeds, clearing up to 5Gbps of bus bandwidth to make quick work of massive media libraries, raw photo archives, and complex software packages. The interface relies on a robust micro-USB to USB Type-A configuration, with a port factory-certified to withstand 10,000 continuous plug-and-unplug cycles for long-term connector structural stability.</p><p>Data management and security are masterfully simplified through Transcend’s bundled professional utility ecosystem. The drive comes with free access to the Transcend Elite software package, allowing you to execute schedule-based data backups, synchronize local directories, encrypt files with military-grade 256-bit AES protection, and even sync data directly to cloud providers like Google Drive or Dropbox. Furthermore, it includes access to the RecoveRx data recovery software tool, allowing you to scrape the drive sectors to salvage accidentally deleted files or documents. Fully cross-compatible with modern Windows and macOS operating systems, it represents the ultimate convergence of executive style, secure management, and portable data architecture.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Storage Capacity</td><td>1 TB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Storage Media Type</td><td>2.5-inch SATA Mechanical Hard Disk Drive (HDD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Internal Drive Speed</td><td>5400 RPM</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Connection Interface</td><td>USB 3.1 Gen 1 / USB 5Gbps (Backward compatible with USB 2.0)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Interface Connector Type</td><td>Micro USB to USB Type-A Port</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Interface Durability</td><td>Certified up to 10,000 Plug-and-Unplug cycles</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Max Interface Bandwidth</td><td>Up to 5 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Support</strong></td><td>Bundled Software Utilities</td><td>Transcend Elite (Data Management) &amp; RecoveRx (Data Recovery)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Support</strong></td><td>Security &amp; Security Tools</td><td>256-bit AES File &amp; Folder Encryption, Cloud Backup Syncing</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Microsoft Windows</td><td>Windows 7, Windows 8, Windows 10, Windows 11 or later</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Apple macOS</td><td>macOS 10.10 or later (Mac OS X 10.7 supported via legacy configurations)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Linux Platform</td><td>Linux Kernel 2.6.31 or later</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Operating Voltage</td><td>5V DC (USB Bus Powered - No external power adapter required)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>114.5 mm x 78.5 mm x 9.95 mm (4.51\" x 3.09\" x 0.39\")</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Net Device Weight</td><td>136 grams (4.80 oz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Enclosure Material</td><td>Premium CNC Milled Aluminum Alloy</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Finish &amp; Craftsmanship</td><td>Polished, Sandblasted, and Anodized Shell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Available Color</td><td>Iron Gray</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Status Indicator</td><td>Integrated LED Activity / Power Indicator light</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Environmental</strong></td><td>Operating Temperature</td><td>5°C (41°F) to 55°C (131°F)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Certifications</strong></td><td>Regulatory Compliance</td><td>CE, FCC, BSMI, KC, RCM, EAC, UKCA</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Factory Part No.</strong></td><td>Universal Product Code</td><td>TS1TSJ25C3N</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Warranty</td><td>3 Years Limited Brand Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Portable Hard Disk Drive', 13600.00, 13600.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/rxIKiRd1ZGpRvOjOPGlZ8UeeTaZT4U7F2MsHBnhj.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-19 11:44:58', '2026-07-19 11:46:53', 'Meta Title: Transcend StoreJet J25C3N 1TB USB 3.1 Ultra-Slim External Hard Drive', 'Meta Description: Buy the premium, ultra-slim Transcend StoreJet J25C3N 1TB External HDD. Features a polished aluminum casing, 9.95mm thin profile, and USB 3.1 Gen 1 speeds.', 'Keywords: Transcend J25C3N 1TB price, TS1TSJ25C3N, StoreJet 25C3N 1TB HDD, ultra-slim external hard drive, aluminum portable storage, Transcend Elite backup', NULL, 147, NULL, NULL);
