(1569, 'Transcend J25A3K 2TB USB 3.0 Black External HDD', 'The Transcend StoreJet J25C3N 1TB External Hard Disk Drive perfectly merges high-end luxury aesthetics with powerful on-the-go data mobility. Housed in a beautifully polished, sandblasted, and anodized aluminum alloy casing, this ultra-slim 2.5-inch portable drive measures a mere 9.95mm in thickness and weighs just 136 grams—making it an exceptionally lightweight companion for corporate professionals and travelers alike. Operating on a high-speed USB 3.1 Gen 1 interface, it offers blazing-fast file transfer rates up to 5Gbps and pairs seamlessly with the Transcend Elite software suite for advanced data encryption, syncing, and cloud backup management.', 'transcend-j25a3k-2tb-usb-30-black-external-hdd-1784461589', '<p>The <strong>Transcend StoreJet J25C3N 1TB External Hard Disk Drive</strong> perfectly merges high-end luxury aesthetics with powerful on-the-go data mobility. Housed in a beautifully polished, sandblasted, and anodized aluminum alloy casing, this ultra-slim 2.5-inch portable drive measures a mere 9.95mm in thickness and weighs just 136 grams—making it an exceptionally lightweight companion for corporate professionals and travelers alike. Operating on a high-speed USB 3.1 Gen 1 interface, it offers blazing-fast file transfer rates up to 5Gbps and pairs seamlessly with the Transcend Elite software suite for advanced data encryption, syncing, and cloud backup management.</p><h3>Long Description</h3><p>The Transcend StoreJet J25C3N 1TB External HDD is engineered for users who view their tech accessories as a lifestyle statement without compromising on performance. Breaking away from traditional, bulky plastic or rubber external drives, the J25C3N features a highly refined Scandinavian design aesthetic. Its minimalist chassis is crafted from premium aluminum alloy that undergoes precision CNC milling, polishing, sandblasting, and anodizing to achieve a spectacular matte Iron Gray finish that completely resists fingerprint smudges while offering a cool-to-the-touch, luxury feel. Boasting a ultra-thin 9.95mm profile, it effortlessly slides into a vest pocket, briefcase, or slim laptop sleeve, optimizing spatial efficiency.</p><p>Beneath its elegant exterior, the StoreJet J25C3N features a highly reliable 2.5-inch 5400 RPM internal mechanical drive layer. Powered by the SuperSpeed USB 3.1 Gen 1 connection standard (fully backward compatible with legacy USB 2.0 ports), it yields rapid real-world execution speeds, clearing up to 5Gbps of bus bandwidth to make quick work of massive media libraries, raw photo archives, and complex software packages. The interface relies on a robust micro-USB to USB Type-A configuration, with a port factory-certified to withstand 10,000 continuous plug-and-unplug cycles for long-term connector structural stability.</p><p>Data management and security are masterfully simplified through Transcend’s bundled professional utility ecosystem. The drive comes with free access to the Transcend Elite software package, allowing you to execute schedule-based data backups, synchronize local directories, encrypt files with military-grade 256-bit AES protection, and even sync data directly to cloud providers like Google Drive or Dropbox. Furthermore, it includes access to the RecoveRx data recovery software tool, allowing you to scrape the drive sectors to salvage accidentally deleted files or documents. Fully cross-compatible with modern Windows and macOS operating systems, it represents the ultimate convergence of executive style, secure management, and portable data architecture</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Storage Capacity</td><td>1 TB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Storage Media Type</td><td>2.5-inch SATA Mechani