Anodized Shell</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Available Color</td><td>Iron Gray</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Status Indicator</td><td>Integrated LED Activity / Power Indicator light</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Environmental</strong></td><td>Operating Temperature</td><td>5°C (41°F) to 55°C (131°F)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Certifications</strong></td><td>Regulatory Compliance</td><td>CE, FCC, BSMI, KC, RCM, EAC, UKCA</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Factory Part No.</strong></td><td>Universal Product Code</td><td>TS1TSJ25C3N</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Warranty</td><td>3 Years Limited Brand Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Portable Hard Disk Drive', 17500.00, 17500.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/BeRFZQuqL1Mx8ll6nXD8cGGOF5LifojNqGzWiAEe.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-19 11:46:29', '2026-07-19 11:46:29', 'Meta Title: Transcend StoreJet 25A3 2TB USB 3.0 External HDD - Black', 'Meta Description: Buy the sleek, high-durability Transcend StoreJet 25A3 2TB External HDD (TS2TSJ25A3K). Features internal shock absorption, 5Gbps USB 3.0 speeds, and One-Touch Auto-Backup.', 'Keywords: Transcend J25A3K 2TB price, TS2TSJ25A3K specs, StoreJet 25A3 2TB HDD, portable external hard drive, shockproof external storage, Transcend Elite backup', NULL, 147, NULL, NULL),
(1570, 'Transcend J25H3 2TB USB 3.1 Portable Hard Disk', 'The Transcend StoreJet 25H3 2TB USB 3.1 Portable Hard Disk masterfully unifies expansive digital capacity with extreme physical security. Wrapped in a slip-resistant, military-grade silicone sleeve, this 2.5-inch portable drive incorporates a proprietary three-stage shock protection system certified to meet strict U.S. military transit drop-test standards. Operating on a rapid USB 3.1 Gen 1 connectivity pipeline, it supports interface transfer dynamics up to 5Gbps and comes equipped with a hardware One-Touch Auto-Backup button for immediate data duplication.', 'transcend-j25h3-2tb-usb-31-portable-hard-disk-1784461716', '<p>The <strong>Transcend StoreJet 25H3 2TB USB 3.1 Portable Hard Disk</strong> masterfully unifies expansive digital capacity with extreme physical security. Wrapped in a slip-resistant, military-grade silicone sleeve, this 2.5-inch portable drive incorporates a proprietary three-stage shock protection system certified to meet strict U.S. military transit drop-test standards. Operating on a rapid USB 3.1 Gen 1 connectivity pipeline, it supports interface transfer dynamics up to 5Gbps and comes equipped with a hardware One-Touch Auto-Backup button for immediate data duplication.</p><h3>&nbsp;</h3>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Storage Capacity</td><td>2 TB (2,000 GB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Storage Media Type</td><td>2.5-inch SATA Mechanical Hard Disk Drive (HDD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Internal Drive Speed</td><td>5400 RPM</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Data Buffer / Cache</td><td>8 MB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Connection Interface</td><td>USB 3.1 Gen 1 / USB 5Gbps (Backward compatible with USB 2.0)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Interface Connector Type</td><td>Micro USB to USB Type-A Cable Included</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Max Interface Bandwidth</td><td>Up to 5 Gbps</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Features</strong></td><td>Shock Protection Standard</td><td>U.S. Military MIL-STD-810G 516.6 Transit Drop-Test Compliant</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Features</strong></td><td>3-Stage Armor System</td><td>Outer Silicone Cover, Internal Suspension Damper, Reinforced Casing</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Features</strong></td><td>Quick-Action Button</td><td>Dual-Function: One-Touch Auto-Backup &amp; Quick-Reconnect Toggle</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Support</strong></td><td>Bundled Software Utilities</td><td>Transcend Elite (Data Management) &amp; RecoveRx (Data Recovery)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Support</strong></td><td>Security &amp; Security Tools</td><td>256-bit AES File &amp; Folder Encryption (Via Transcend Elite)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Microsoft Windows</td><td>Windows 7, Windows 8, Windows 10, Windows 11 or later</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Apple macOS</td><td>macOS 10.10 or later</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Linux Platform</td><td>Linux Kernel 2.6.31 or later</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Operating Voltage</td><td>5V DC (USB Bus Powered - No AC adapter required)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Power Saving States</td><td>Intelligent Power Saving Mode (Triggers after 10 mins of inactivity)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>131.8 mm x 80.8 mm x 16.3 mm (5.19\" x 3.18\" x 0.64\")</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Net Device Weight</td><td>191 grams (6.74 oz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Enclosure Material</td><td>Slip-Resistant High-Texture Industrial Silicone Rubber</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Available Factory Colors</td><td>Purple (TS2TSJ25H3P) / Navy Blue (TS2TSJ25H3B)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Environmental</strong></td><td>Operating Temperature</td><td>5°C (41°F) to 55°C (131°F)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Certifications</strong></td><td>Regulatory Compliance</td><td>CE, UKCA, FCC, BSMI, KC, EAC, RCM</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Warranty</td><td>3 Years Limited Brand Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Portable Hard Disk Drive', 17700.00, 17700.00, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-19 11:48:36', '2026-07-19 11:48:36', 'Meta Title: Transcend StoreJet 25H3 2TB USB 3.1 External Hard Drive', 'vMeta Description: Buy the ruggedized Transcend StoreJet 25H3 2TB Portable HDD. Features U.S. military-grade 3-stage shock protection, 5Gbps USB 3.1 Gen 1 speeds, and One-Touch Auto-Backup.', 'Meta Details\r\nMeta Title: Transcend StoreJet 25H3 2TB USB 3.1 External Hard Drive\r\n\r\nMeta Description: Buy the ruggedized Transcend StoreJet 25H3 2TB Portable HDD. Features U.S. military-grade 3-stage shock protection, 5Gbps USB 3.1 Gen 1 speeds, and One-Touch Auto-Backup.', NULL, 147, NULL, NULL),
(1571, 'Transcend J25M3 2TB USB 3.1 Portable Hard Disk', 'The Transcend StoreJet 25M3 2TB USB 3.1 Portable Hard Disk fuses supreme, military-grade physical armor with high-speed file transit dynamics. Enclosed in a signature slip-resistant rubberized outer sleeve, this 2.5-inch portable drive incorporates a proprietary three-stage shock protection system rigorously certified to pass U.S. military transit drop-test standards. Powered by the SuperSpeed USB 3.1 Gen 1 interface, it delivers connection bandwidth up to 5Gbps and features a specialized hardware quick-action button that executes One-Touch Auto-Backup operations and instant desktop drive re-connection.', 'transcend-j25m3-2tb-usb-31-portable-hard-disk-1784461783', '<p>The Transcend StoreJet 25M3 2TB External HDD is expertly engineered to safeguard your critical files against the active hazards of daily travel, intense field work, and unpredictable mobile computing environments. The centerpiece of this high-endurance storage solution is its legendary U.S. Military MIL-STD-810G transit drop-tested structural architecture. Physical defense is managed through a comprehensive three-stage impact mitigation grid: an outermost durable silicone rubber case that absorbs extreme surface vibrations and provides an ergonomic, non-slip grip; a reinforced hard mid-frame plastic shell that guards the inner components against crushing forces; and an advanced internal hard drive suspension damper that safely cushions the mechanical drive core during accidental desk drops or heavy travel jars.</p><p>Underneath its rugged protective armor, the StoreJet 25M3 features a high-capacity 2.5-inch SATA hard disk drive running with an integrated 8MB data buffer to optimize read/write efficiency. Utilizing the high-speed USB 3.1 Gen 1 protocol (also classified as USB 3.2 Gen 1) along with native UASP (USB Attached SCSI Protocol) support, the drive delivers up to 5Gbps of raw bus bandwidth—massively reducing data transfer bottlenecks when handling large file packages. The massive 2TB volume provides a spacious physical vault for thousands of high-resolution RAW photo captures, long-duration 4K video clips, operating system deployment images, and exhaustive database backups.</p><p>Workflow fluidness is handled by a dual-purpose hardware quick-action button mounted on the outer casing. If the partition has been safely unmounted within the operating system, a simple press of this button allows users to immediately re-initialize the drive volume on-screen without having to physically unplug and re-insert the USB cable link. When synced with the complimentary Transcend Elite data management software s</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Storage Capacity</td><td>2 TB (2,000 GB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Storage Media Type</td><td>2.5-inch SATA Mechanical Hard Disk Drive (HDD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Internal Drive Speed</td><td>5400 RPM / 5200 RPM class</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Data Buffer / Cache</td><td>8 MB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Connection Interface</td><td>USB 3.1 Gen 1 / USB 3.2 Gen 1 (Fully backward compatible with USB 2.0)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Protocol Optimization</td><td>UASP (USB Attached SCSI Protocol) Enabled</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Interface Connector Type</td><td>Micro USB (Device Side) to USB Type-A (Host Side) Cable Included</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Max Interface Bandwidth</td><td>Up to 5 Gbps (Bus Transfer Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Features</strong></td><td>Shock Protection Standard</td><td>U.S. Military MIL-STD-810G 516.6 Transit Drop-Test Compliant</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Features</strong></td><td>3-Stage Armor Setup</td><td>Outer Silicone Cover, Reinforced Hard Chassis, Internal Suspension Damper</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Features</strong></td><td>Quick-Action Button</td><td>Dual-Function: One-Touch Auto-Backup &amp; Quick-Reconnect Toggle</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Support</strong></td><td>Bundled Software Utilities</td><td>Transcend Elite (Data Management) &amp; RecoveRx (Data Recovery)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Support</strong></td><td>Security &amp; Encryption</td><td>256-bit AES File &amp; Folder Encryption (Configured via Transcend Elite)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Microsoft Windows</td><td>Windows 7, Windows 8, Windows 10, Windows 11 or later</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Apple macOS</td><td>macOS 10.10 / Mac OS X 10.7 or later</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Linux Platform</td><td>Linux Kernel 2.6.31 or later</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Operating Voltage</td><td>5V DC (Direct USB Bus Powered)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Power Saving States</td><td>Intelligent Power Saving Mode (Activates after 10 mins of inactivity)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>129.5 mm x 80.8 mm x 16.1 mm (5.10\" x 3.18\" x 0.63\")</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Net Device Weight</td><td>185 grams (6.53 oz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Enclosure Material</td><td>High-texture Impact-Resistant Industrial Silicone Rubber</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Available Factory Colors</td><td>Military Green (TS2TSJ25M3G) / Iron Gray (TS2TSJ25M3S)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Environmental</strong></td><td>Operating Temperature</td><td>5°C (41°F) to 55°C (131°F)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Certifications</strong></td><td>Regulatory Compliance</td><td>CE, UKCA, FCC, BSMI, KC, EAC, RCM</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Warranty</td><td>3 Years Limited Brand Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'Portable Hard Disk Drive', 17700.00, 17700.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/QMisd0wtgwxwkFGF47lG3BPMTQfjzLsneW96lHjW.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-19 11:49:43', '2026-07-19 11:49:43', 'Meta Title: Transcend StoreJet 25M3 2TB USB 3.1 External Hard Drive', 'Meta Description: Buy the ruggedized Transcend StoreJet 25M3 2TB Portable HDD. Features U.S. military-grade 3-stage shock protection, 5Gbps USB 3.1 Gen 1 transfer speeds, and One-Touch Auto-Backup.', 'Keywords: Transcend J25M3 2TB price, TS2TSJ25M3G specs, StoreJet 25M3 2TB HDD, military-grade external hard drive, rugged portable storage, Transcend 2TB shockproof drive', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1572, 'Transcend TS2TSJ25C3N 2TB USB 3.0 Ultra Slim External HDD', 'The Transcend StoreJet 25C3N 2TB Ultra Slim External Hard Disk Drive masterfully combines expansive digital storage capacity with executive luxury aesthetics. Housed in a beautifully polished, sandblasted, and anodized aluminum alloy casing, this ultra-thin 2.5-inch portable drive measures a mere 9.95mm in thickness and weighs just 136 grams—offering a highly lightweight design for modern mobile professionals. Operating on a high-speed USB 3.1 Gen 1 interface with UASP support, it delivers rapid data transfers up to 5Gbps and works hand-in-hand with the Transcend Elite software package for secure data management, directory synchronization, and one-click cloud backup.', 'transcend-ts2tsj25c3n-2tb-usb-30-ultra-slim-external-hdd-1784461857', '<p>The Transcend StoreJet 25C3N 2TB External HDD (TS2TSJ25C3N) is designed for professionals and creators who treat their hardware as an extension of their personal style without cutting corners on raw capacity. Breaking away from traditional, bulky plastic external drives, the 25C3N features a highly refined minimalist aesthetic. Its premium chassis is crafted from high-grade aluminum alloy that undergoes a meticulous CNC milling, polishing, sandblasting, and anodizing process. This creates a stunning matte Iron Gray finish that completely resists fingerprint smudges while providing a structural shell that runs cool to the touch. Thanks to its ultra-thin 9.95mm profile, it slides effortlessly into a laptop sleeve, pocket, or travel briefcase without adding bulk.</p><p>Beneath its elegant metallic exterior, the drive packs a high-capacity 2.5-inch SATA mechanical drive layer operating at a smooth 5400 RPM with an 8MB cache buffer to maximize file indexing efficiency. Powered entirely via the SuperSpeed USB 3.1 Gen 1 protocol (fully backward compatible with older legacy USB 2.0 ports), the device clears up to 5Gbps of raw bus bandwidth to ensure massive media files, photo archives, and complex codebases transfer quickly. The device relies on a robust Micro-B to USB Type-A configuration, with a connection port factory-certified to withstand 10,000 continuous plug-and-unplug cycles for long-term electrical reliability.</p><p>Data safety and administrative organization are highly streamlined through Transcend’s bundled professional software suite. Users gain full access to the downloadable Transcend Elite software package, allowing for schedule-based automatic local backups, custom folder synchronization, and secure data mapping directly to popular cloud providers like Google Drive or Dropbox. For maximum information protection, it supports deep 256-bit AES file and folder encryption keys. Additionally, the complimentary RecoveRx data recovery utility allows for sector-level drive scanning to help rescue accidentally deleted photographs, music tracks, and working documents. Fully cross-compatible across Windows, Linux, and macOS platforms, the StoreJet 25C3N represents a flawless mix of large capacity, reliable security, and premium style.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>tegory</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Storage Capacity</td><td>2 TB (2,000 GB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Storage Media Type</td><td>2.5-inch SATA Mechanical Hard Disk Drive (HDD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Internal Drive Speed</td><td>5400 RPM</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Data Buffer / Cache</td><td>8 MB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Connection Interface</td><td>USB 3.1 Gen 1 / USB 5Gbps (Backward compatible with USB 3.0 / 2.0)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Protocol Optimization</td><td>UASP (USB Attached SCSI Protocol) Supported</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Interface Connector Type</td><td>Micro USB-B (Device) to USB Type-A (Host) Cable Included</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Interface Port Durability</td><td>Rated up to 10,000 Plug-and-Unplug cycles</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Max Interface Bandwidth</td><td>Up to 5 Gbps (Bus Data Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Support</strong></td><td>Bundled Software Utilities</td><td>Transcend Elite (Data Management) &amp; RecoveRx (Data Recovery)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Support</strong></td><td>Security &amp; Security Tools</td><td>256-bit AES File &amp; Folder Encryption, Cloud Backup Syncing</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Microsoft Windows</td><td>Windows 7, Windows 8, Windows 10, Windows 11 or later</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Apple macOS</td><td>macOS 10.10 or later (Mac OS X 10.7 supported via legacy configurations)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Linux Platform</td><td>Linux Kernel 2.6.31 or later</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Operating Voltage</td><td>5V DC (USB Bus Powered - No external AC adapter needed)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>114.5 mm x 78.5 mm x 9.95 mm (4.51\" x 3.09\" x 0.39\")</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Net Device Weight</td><td>136 grams (4.80 oz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Enclosure Material</td><td>Premium CNC Milled Aluminum Alloy</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Case Craftsmanship</td><td>Polished, Sandblasted, and Anodized Outer Surface</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Available Color</td><td>Iron Gray</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Environmental</strong></td><td>Operating Temperature</td><td>5°C (41°F) to 55°C (131°F)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Certifications</strong></td><td>Regulatory Compliance</td><td>CE, UKCA, FCC, BSMI, KC, EAC, RCM</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Factory Part No.</strong></td><td>Universal Product Code</td><td>TS2TSJ25C3N</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Warranty</td><td>3 Years Limited Brand Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 17800.00, 17800.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/hFa99JHmxBY77bWtCUICskE32tRnCRTVM2MW6B5N.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-19 11:50:57', '2026-07-19 11:50:57', 'Meta Title: Transcend StoreJet 25C3N 2TB Ultra Slim External HDD', 'Meta Description: Buy the premium Transcend StoreJet 25C3N 2TB Ultra Slim External HDD (TS2TSJ25C3N). Features a polished aluminum casing, 9.95mm profile, and USB 3.1 Gen 1 speeds.', 'Keywords: Transcend TS2TSJ25C3N 2TB price, StoreJet 25C3N 2TB HDD, ultra-slim external hard drive, aluminum portable storage, Transcend Elite backup 2TB', NULL, 147, NULL, NULL),
(1573, 'Transcend StoreJet 25H3 4TB USB 3.1 External 2.5\" Portable Hard Disk', 'The Transcend StoreJet 25H3 4TB USB 3.1 External 2.5\" Portable Hard Disk delivers massive backup depth alongside top-tier mechanical security. Engineered to meet strict U.S. military transit drop-test standards, this high-capacity drive features a heavy-duty, slip-resistant silicone outer case backed by a proprietary three-stage shock protection grid. Operating over a fast USB 3.1 Gen 1 framework enhanced with UASP optimization, it supports interface speeds up to 5Gbps and comes equipped with a hardware One-Touch Auto-Backup button for streamlined data redundancy.', 'transcend-storejet-25h3-4tb-usb-31-external-25-portable-hard-disk-1784461934', '<h3>Long Description</h3><p>The Transcend StoreJet 25H3 4TB External HDD is the definitive high-capacity, ruggedized storage solution for system administrators, multimedia creators, and corporate professionals who handle immense data volumes under unpredictable mobile conditions. Built to pass the challenging U.S. Military MIL-STD-810G transit drop tests, the drive features an advanced three-stage structural impact mitigation system. The outermost defense is a durable, high-texture silicone rubber shell designed to absorb severe surface vibrations and resist slips. Underneath the rubber armor rests a reinforced hard plastic mid-frame container, which encloses an internal drive suspension damper engineered to cushion the delicate mechanics of the disk against sudden impacts.</p><p>To accommodate its substantial 4TB storage capacity, this variant employs a thicker 2.5-inch internal form factor. It is driven by a stable 5400 RPM SATA controller working in harmony with the SuperSpeed USB 3.1 Gen 1 bus protocol (fully backward compatible with older legacy USB 2.0 architectures). The device natively supports UASP (USB Attached SCSI Protocol), pushing interface transfer rates up to 5Gbps to drastically trim down waiting periods when shifting multiple gigabytes of 4K cinema assets, heavy VM images, or complete server backups.</p><p>Operational workflow is further optimized via a prominent hardware quick-action button positioned on the corner of the drive casing. This multi-use tool provides a Quick-Reconnect feature, letting users instantly remount a safely ejected volume within the operating system environment without the physical wear-and-tear of unplugging and replugging the USB cable. When combined with the free downloadable Transcend Elite data management platform, the button serves as a physical trigger for instant, scheduled directory synchronization. Backed by an industry-standard 3-year limited warranty, the StoreJet 25H3 4TB stands as a reliable local repository for massive data archives.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Storage Capacity</td><td>4 TB (4,000 GB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Storage Media Type</td><td>2.5-inch SATA Mechanical Hard Disk Drive (HDD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Internal Drive Speed</td><td>5400 RPM</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Internal Controller Buffer</td><td>8 MB / 16 MB Class (Dynamic Allocation)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Connection Interface</td><td>USB 3.1 Gen 1 / USB 5Gbps (Backward compatible with USB 3.0 / 2.0)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Protocol Optimization</td><td>UASP (USB Attached SCSI Protocol) Enabled</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Interface Connector Type</td><td>Micro USB-B (Device Side) to USB Type-A (Host Side) Cable Included</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Max Interface Bandwidth</td><td>Up to 5 Gbps (Bus Transfer Speed)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Features</strong></td><td>Shock Protection Standard</td><td>U.S. Military MIL-STD-810G 516.6 Transit Drop-Test Compliant</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Features</strong></td><td>3-Stage Armor System</td><td>Outer Silicone Cover, Reinforced Hard Frame, Internal Suspension Damper</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Features</strong></td><td>Quick-Action Button</td><td>Dual-Function: One-Touch Auto-Backup &amp; Quick-Reconnect Toggle</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Support</strong></td><td>Bundled Software Utilities</td><td>Transcend Elite (Data Management) &amp; RecoveRx (Data Recovery)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Support</strong></td><td>Security &amp; Security Tools</td><td>256-bit AES File &amp; Folder Encryption, Cloud Backup Syncing</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Microsoft Windows</td><td>Windows 7, Windows 8, Windows 10, Windows 11 or later</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Apple macOS</td><td>macOS 10.10 or later (Mac OS X 10.7 supported via legacy configurations)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Linux Platform</td><td>Linux Kernel 2.6.31 or later</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Operating Voltage</td><td>5V DC (USB Bus Powered - No external AC adapter needed)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Power Saving States</td><td>Intelligent Power Saving Mode (Activates after 10 mins of inactivity)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>131.8 mm x 80.8 mm x 24.5 mm (5.19\" x 3.18\" x 0.96\") <i>(Note: Thicker profile than 1TB/2TB models)</i></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Net Device Weight</td><td>298 grams (10.51 oz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Enclosure Material</td><td>Slip-Resistant High-Texture Industrial Silicone Rubber</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Available Factory Colors</td><td>Purple (TS4TSJ25H3P) / Navy Blue (TS4TSJ25H3B)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Environmental</strong></td><td>Operating Temperature</td><td>5°C (41°F) to 55°C (131°F)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Certifications</strong></td><td>Regulatory Compliance</td><td>CE, UKCA, FCC, BSMI, KC, EAC, RCM</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Warranty</td><td>3 Years Limited Brand Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 30500.00, 30500.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/8Ai3sPZofGgq0oomDq9TOMdMSGw9GnpSt2peY5H2.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-19 11:52:14', '2026-07-19 11:52:14', 'Meta Title: Transcend StoreJet 25H3 4TB USB 3.1 External Hard Drive', 'Meta Description: Buy the heavy-duty Transcend StoreJet 25H3 4TB Portable HDD (TS4TSJ25H3P). Certified U.S. military-grade 3-stage shock protection, 5Gbps USB 3.1 Gen 1 speeds, and 4TB massive capacity.', 'Keywords: Transcend J25H3 4TB price, TS4TSJ25H3P specs, StoreJet 25H3 4TB HDD, military-grade external hard drive, 4TB portable storage, rugged external drive Bangladesh', NULL, 147, NULL, NULL),
(1574, 'Transcend StoreJet 25M3 4TB USB 3.1 Portable Hard Disk', 'The Transcend StoreJet 25M3 4TB USB 3.1 Portable Hard Disk masterfully bridges monumental storage depth with industrial-grade mechanical security. Engineered to meet rigorous U.S. military transit drop-test standards, this 2.5-inch external drive utilizes a proprietary three-stage shock protection system enveloped in a high-grip silicone outer sleeve. Operating over a fast SuperSpeed USB 3.1 Gen 1 interface, it scales file transfer rates up to 5Gbps and features an integrated hardware quick-action button that executes One-Touch Auto-Backup and instant desktop volume re-connection.', 'transcend-storejet-25m3-4tb-usb-31-portable-hard-disk-1784462009', '<p>The Transcend StoreJet 25M3 4TB External HDD (TS4TSJ25M3S) is the definitive mobile deployment drive for power users, developers, and enterprise specialists tasked with securing huge data repositories under active travel conditions. Designed to successfully withstand the challenging U.S. Military MIL-STD-810G transit drop criteria, the drive protects digital architecture through an intricate three-stage impact mitigation structure. An outermost medical-grade silicone rubber shell cushions the shock of hard impacts and prevents slips on smooth workspace surfaces. Beneath this layer lies a structural, reinforced hard-plastic chassis which encapsulates an internal suspension damper mechanism explicitly optimized to isolate the mechanical spindle from destructive drops.</p><p>To easily deliver its massive 4TB storage space, this model leverages a slightly deeper, heavy-duty 2.5-inch SATA internal disk configuration. Powered via the SuperSpeed USB 3.1 Gen 1 interface protocol (fully backward compatible with older legacy USB 2.0 ports), the device delivers unthrottled bus data transfer limits up to 5Gbps—dramatically lessening file synchronization bottlenecks. The vast 4TB payload footprint accommodates massive 4K cinematic assets, continuous system deployment mirrors, exhaustive RAW photographic datasets, and deep database structures without breaking a sweat.</p><p>Operating efficiency is further enhanced by a multi-purpose hardware quick-action button located directly on the chassis. This tool offers a Quick-Reconnect feature, allowing users to instantly remount a safely unmounted partition without experiencing the port wear-and-tear of physically disconnecting and reinserting the USB cable link. When configured alongside the free downloadable Transcend Elite data management application suite, the same interface acts as a physical trigger for instant, automated folder synchronization. Bundled with advanced 256-bit AES file and folder encryption utilities and covered by a comprehensive 3-year brand warranty, the StoreJet 25M3 4TB represents an uncompromising local archive solution.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Storage Capacity</td><td>4 TB (4,000 GB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Storage Media Type</td><td>2.5-inch SATA Mechanical Hard Disk Drive (HDD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Internal Controller Buffer</td><td>8 MB Class</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Connection Interface</td><td>USB 3.1 Gen 1 / USB 3.2 Gen 1 (USB 5Gbps)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Interface Connector Type</td><td>Micro USB-B (Device Side) to USB Type-A (Host Side) Cable Included</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Interface Port Longevity</td><td>Industrial rated up to 10,000 continuous Plug-and-Unplug cycles</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Max Interface Bandwidth</td><td>Up to 5 Gbps (Bus Data Rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Features</strong></td><td>Shock Protection Standard</td><td>U.S. Military MIL-STD-810G 516.6 Transit Drop-Test Compliant</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Features</strong></td><td>3-Stage Armor Setup</td><td>Outer Silicone Cover, Reinforced Hard Chassis, Internal Suspension Damper</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Features</strong></td><td>Quick-Action Button</td><td>Dual-Function: One-Touch Auto-Backup &amp; Quick-Reconnect Toggle</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Support</strong></td><td>Bundled Software Utilities</td><td>Transcend Elite (Data Management) &amp; RecoveRx (Data Recovery)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Support</strong></td><td>Security &amp; Security Tools</td><td>256-bit AES File &amp; Folder Encryption, Cloud Backup Syncing</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Microsoft Windows</td><td>Windows 7, Windows 8, Windows 10, Windows 11 or later</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Apple macOS</td><td>macOS 10.7 / Mac OS X 10.6 or later</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Linux Platform</td><td>Linux Kernel 2.6.31 or later</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Operating Voltage</td><td>5V DC (Direct USB Bus Powered - No AC adapter required)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Power Saving States</td><td>Intelligent Power Saving Mode (Activates after 10 mins of inactivity)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>129.5 mm x 80.8 mm x 24.1 mm (5.10\" x 3.18\" x 0.95\") <i>(Note: Thicker high-capacity profile)</i></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Net Device Weight</td><td>294 grams (10.37 oz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Enclosure Material</td><td>High-texture Shock-Absorbent Industrial Silicone Rubber</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Available Color</td><td>Iron Gray (TS4TSJ25M3S)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Environmental</strong></td><td>Operating Temperature</td><td>5°C (41°F) to 55°C (131°F)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Certifications</strong></td><td>Regulatory Compliance</td><td>CE, FCC, BSMI, KC, EAC, RCM</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Warranty</td><td>3 Years Limited Brand Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 30500.00, 30500.00, NULL, 3, 'products/thumbnails/emitzszwhiSeYJ2ss7bjkkgEjvr8PeZJrQ6G4rnd.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-19 11:53:29', '2026-07-19 11:53:29', 'Meta Title: Transcend StoreJet 25M3 4TB USB 3.1 External Hard Drive', 'Meta Description: Buy the heavy-duty Transcend StoreJet 25M3 4TB Portable HDD (TS4TSJ25M3S). Certified U.S. military-grade 3-stage shock protection, 5Gbps USB 3.1 Gen 1 speeds, and massive 4TB storage.', 'Keywords: Transcend J25M3 4TB price, TS4TSJ25M3S specs, StoreJet 25M3 4TB HDD, military-grade external hard drive, 4TB portable storage, rugged external drive Bangladesh', NULL, 147, NULL, NULL),
(1575, 'Transcend J35T3 8TB USB 3.1 External HDD', 'The Transcend StoreJet 35T3 8TB USB 3.1 Desktop External Hard Disk Drive delivers monumental storage capacity optimized for fixed workstation deployment. Featuring a sleek, vertically-oriented housing that minimizes its desktop footprint, this 3.5-inch desktop drive provides a fanless, low-noise acoustic profile ideal for quiet office environments. Driven by a high-speed USB 3.1 Gen 1 interface running at up to 5Gbps, it incorporates a dedicated physical One-Touch Auto-Backup button to execute immediate data replication when paired with the proprietary Transcend Elite data management ecosystem.', 'transcend-j35t3-8tb-usb-31-external-hdd-1784462073', '<p>The Transcend StoreJet 35T3 8TB External Desktop HDD (TS8TSJ35T3) is the definitive mass-storage solution for creative professionals, database administrators, and small business networks requiring deep local archive repositories. Designed specifically as a high-capacity stationary drive, it transitions away from mobile form factors to leverage a stable 3.5-inch internal hardware layer, creating an expansive 8TB digital vault. This massive payload allocation easily handles long-term preservation of exhaustive 4K cinematic assets, multi-layered design projects, comprehensive system recovery mirrors, and legacy corporate accounting records.</p><p>A key structural advantage of the StoreJet 35T3 is its sophisticated, space-saving architecture. The sleek book-style chassis stands completely upright without needing an external stabilization dock, seamlessly blending into modern workspace aesthetics while freeing up critical desk area. To maintain a distraction-free environment, Transcend engineers implemented a passive, fanless cooling system. Thermal dissipation is managed efficiently through internal airflow dynamics, delivering near-silent operation even during heavy sequential write cycles.</p><p>Data pipeline efficiency is managed by the SuperSpeed USB 3.1 Gen 1 protocol (fully backward compatible with older legacy USB 2.0 ports), clearing up to 5Gbps of raw bus bandwidth to ensure large folder packages move quickly. The front of the drive features a prominent hardware quick-action button. When paired with the free downloadable Transcend Elite software suite, this button operates as a physical trigger for instant, scheduled directory synchronization. Combined with robust 256-bit AES folder-level data encryption tools, an intelligent 10-minute idle power-saving sleep mode, and an industry-standard 3-year warranty, the StoreJet 35T3 provides heavy-duty local storage security.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Storage Capacity</td><td>8 TB (8,000 GB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Storage Media Type</td><td>3.5-inch SATA Mechanical Hard Disk Drive (HDD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Internal Drive Speed</td><td>5400 RPM class</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Data Buffer / Cache</td><td>32 MB</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Connection Interface</td><td>USB 3.1 Gen 1 / USB 3.2 Gen 1 (USB 5Gbps)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Interface Connector Type</td><td>Micro USB-B (Device Side) to USB Type-A (Host Side)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Max Interface Bandwidth</td><td>Up to 5 Gbps (Bus Transfer Speed)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Real-World Performance</td><td>Up to 130 MB/s typical sequential read/write rates</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Features</strong></td><td>Housing Design</td><td>Slim Vertically-Oriented (Space-saving upright profile)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Features</strong></td><td>Cooling System</td><td>Fanless Low-Noise Passive Thermal Dissipation</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Features</strong></td><td>Quick-Action Button</td><td>Hardware One-Touch Auto-Backup Button</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Features</strong></td><td>Status Indicator</td><td>LED Power activity / Data transit light indicator</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Support</strong></td><td>Bundled Software Utilities</td><td>Transcend Elite (Data Management) &amp; RecoveRx (Data Recovery)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Support</strong></td><td>Security &amp; Tools</td><td>256-bit AES File &amp; Folder Encryption, Cloud Backup Mapping</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Microsoft Windows</td><td>Windows 7, Windows 8, Windows 10, Windows 11 or later</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Apple macOS</td><td>macOS 10.10 or later</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Linux Platform</td><td>Linux Kernel 2.6.31 or later</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Power Source</td><td>External AC Power Adapter Included</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Operating Voltage</td><td>AC Input: 100V ~ 240V (50/60Hz); DC Input: 12V / 2A</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Energy Management</td><td>Eco-Friendly Intelligent Power Saving Sleep Mode (10 mins idle)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>172.4 mm x 152.4 mm x 44.8 mm (6.79\" x 6.00\" x 1.76\")</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Net Device Weight</td><td>1,040 grams (36.68 oz / 2.29 lbs)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Enclosure Finish</td><td>Premium High-Gloss Mirror Black Front Panel with Matte Body</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Environmental</strong></td><td>Operating Temperature</td><td>5°C (41°F) to 45°C (113°F)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Certifications</strong></td><td>Regulatory Compliance</td><td>CE, UKCA, FCC, BSMI, KC, EAC, RCM</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Warranty</td><td>3 Years Limited Brand Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 46000.00, 46000.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/B7ykDkmITkh7iYhbc7FThRPVky1uH4tIsbK60w8Z.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-19 11:54:33', '2026-07-19 11:54:33', 'Meta Title: Transcend StoreJet 35T3 8TB USB 3.1 Desktop External HDD', 'vMeta Description: Buy the high-capacity Transcend StoreJet 35T3 8TB External Desktop HDD (TS8TSJ35T3). Features space-saving vertical design, fanless low-noise operation, and One-Touch Auto-Backup.', 'Keywords: Transcend J35T3 8TB price, TS8TSJ35T3 specs, StoreJet 35T3 8TB HDD, 8TB desktop external hard drive, Transcend 8TB backup drive, vertical external HDD', NULL, 147, NULL, NULL);
