(1576, 'Transcend 8TB 2-Bay Storejet Cloud 210', 'The Transcend StoreJet Cloud 210 8TB 2-Bay Personal Cloud Storage NAS frees you from subscription-based public cloud fees by establishing a highly secure, high-capacity private server directly in your home or office. Packed with two pre-installed 4TB NAS-grade 3.5-inch hard disk drives configure-ready for structural data protection, this device runs a fast dual-core 1.1GHz ARM processor backed by a high-speed Gigabit Ethernet pipeline to deliver data transfer boundaries up to 110 MB/s. It natively supports hardware RAID 1 data mirroring for absolute mechanical redundancy, seamless media streaming over DLNA/AirPlay/Chromecast, and anywhere-access via dedicated iOS and Android applications.', 'transcend-8tb-2-bay-storejet-cloud-210-1784462135', '<p>The Transcend StoreJet Cloud 210 8TB Personal Cloud NAS (TS8TSJC210N) represents a fundamental shift in how modern professionals, independent creators, and connected families manage their growing digital footprints. Rather than dividing valuable assets across fragmented external drives or risking data sovereignty to recurring public cloud subscriptions, this centralized network platform provides 8TB of raw, privately-controlled network-attached storage. The system comes fully equipped out of the box with two specialized 4TB 3.5-inch SATA hard drives engineered explicitly for 24/7 continuous server operations.</p><p>At the center of the StoreJet Cloud 210’s compact, vertical chassis is a high-efficiency 1.1 GHz ARM Cortex-A7 dual-core processor mated to a rapid DDR3 memory architecture. Interfacing directly with your primary network router via a 10/100/1000 Mbps Gigabit Ethernet connection, the system sustains stable read and write velocities up to 110 MB/s. For users focused on structural data safety, the dual-bay infrastructure supports hardware RAID 1 mirroring. This configuration mirrors your data across both drives simultaneously; in the rare event of a sudden physical drive failure, your files remain fully intact and immediately accessible from the secondary disk.</p><p>Remote management is incredibly intuitive. The free Transcend StoreJet Cloud app allows for quick, three-step mobile configuration, giving you global access to your personal files from anywhere in the world through a secure web link or application dashboard. The platform supports multi-user management, letting family members or corporate peers establish individualized, private accounts with protected storage directories.</p><p>For home entertainment systems, the unit is DLNA-certified and natively pushes media streams smoothly to smart TVs, streaming sticks, and gaming consoles via AirPlay or Chromecast integrations. It acts as a comprehensive backup solution supporting automated Apple Time Machine schedules for macOS users, dedicated Windows backup mapping, and mobile camera-roll auto-syncing the moment your phone connects to home Wi-Fi. Additionally, the rear panel includes a SuperSpeed USB 3.1 Gen 1 expansion port paired with a physical quick-action button, allowing users to plug in flash drives or card readers and execute an absolute, one-touch data ingestion sweep into the NAS array.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Storage Architecture</strong></td><td>Total Raw Capacity</td><td>8 TB (8,000 GB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage Architecture</strong></td><td>Number of Drive Bays</td><td>2 Bays (Populated out of box)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage Architecture</strong></td><td>Included Media</td><td>2 x 4TB 3.5-inch SATA III 6Gb/s HDDs</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage Architecture</strong></td><td>Drive Type Class</td><td>NAS-Grade (Optimized for 24/7 continuous operation)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage Architecture</strong></td><td>Hardware RAID Modes</td><td>RAID 1 (Data Mirroring for Redundancy) or JBOD / Non-RAID</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Core</strong></td><td>Central Processor Unit</td><td>ARM Cortex-A7 Dual-Core 1.1 GHz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Core</strong></td><td>System Memory (RAM)</td><td>512 MB DDR3 <i>(Note: Certain regional revisions utilize 256MB components)</i></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Networking</strong></td><td>Network Interface Port</td><td>1 x RJ-45 10/100/1000 Mbps Gigabit Ethernet Port</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Networking</strong></td><td>Expansion USB Interface</td><td>1 x USB 3.1 Gen 1 / USB 3.0 Type-A High-Speed Expansion Port</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Networking</strong></td><td>Hardware Copy Button</td><td>One-Touch Direct Auto-Backup Button (Rear mounted)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Matrix</strong></td><td>Maximum Data Transfer</td><td>Up to 110 MB/s Sequential Read / Write Speed</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Matrix</strong></td><td>Media Streaming Tech</td><td>DLNA Certified, iTunes Server, AirPlay, Chromecast</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Ecosystem</strong></td><td>Desktop Ecosystem</td><td>Windows / Mac Web Browser GUI Interface</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Ecosystem</strong></td><td>Mobile Applications</td><td>Transcend StoreJet Cloud App (Free download via Apple App/Google Play)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Backup Utilities</strong></td><td>Computer Backup Support</td><td>Microsoft Windows Backup, Apple Time Machine Compatible</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Backup Utilities</strong></td><td>Mobile Backup Support</td><td>Automatic Photo/Video Syncing via Wi-Fi</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Desktop Clients</td><td>Windows 7 / 8 / 10 / 11 or later, Mac OS X 10.7 or later</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Mobile Environments</td><td>iOS 10.0 or later, Android 5.0 or later</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Supported Web Browsers</td><td>Chrome 31+, Firefox 29+, Safari 9+, Microsoft Edge 41+</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management</strong></td><td>Operating Voltage</td><td>AC Input: 100V ~ 240V (50/60Hz) External Adapter</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management</strong></td><td>Peak Power Consumption</td><td>26.26 Watts (Maximum operational load)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Management</strong></td><td>Eco Sleep Consumption</td><td>0.516 Watts (Intelligent Power Saving Mode active)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Form Dimensions (H x W x D)</td><td>129.4 mm x 87.8 mm x 210.8 mm (5.09\" x 3.46\" x 8.30\")</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Net Chassis Weight</td><td>2,100 grams (4.63 lbs / 2.1 kg) with drives installed</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td><td>Enclosure Aesthetics</td><td>Space-Saving Vertical Tower Chassis - Matte Black Finish</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Environmental Parameters</strong></td><td>Working Temperature</td><td>5°C (41°F) to 35°C (95°F)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Certifications</strong></td><td>Regulatory Compliance</td><td>CE, FCC, BSMI, KC, RCM, UKCA</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty Details</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Warranty</td><td>2 Years Limited Brand Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/jv1bjqmYU8SSGtldWMmhncCJw7jXxlR3kbJeEkPR.png', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-19 11:55:35', '2026-07-19 11:55:35', 'Meta Title: Transcend StoreJet Cloud 210 8TB 2-Bay Personal Cloud Storage NAS', 'Meta Description: Buy the Transcend StoreJet 250 Cloud 210 8TB 2-Bay Personal Cloud Storage NAS (TS8TSJC210N). Features 2 x 4TB NAS-grade drives, RAID 1 data mirroring, 110MB/s speeds, and mobile remote access.', 'Keywords: Transcend StoreJet Cloud 210 8TB price, TS8TSJC210N specs, Transcend 2-Bay NAS 8TB, Personal cloud storage Bangladesh, RAID 1 home network storage', NULL, 147, NULL, NULL),
(1577, 'Transcend TS2TSJM100 StoreJet 100 Portable Hard Drive For Mac 2TB', 'The Transcend TS2TSJM100 StoreJet 100 Portable Hard Drive For Mac 2TB delivers ruggedized, high-capacity local storage tailored specifically for Apple ecosystems. Pre-formatted in the HFS+ file system for instant plug-and-play capability on macOS, this drive fully integrates with Apple Time Machine for seamless system backups. It wraps its expansive 2TB storage platter in a high-durability, slip-resistant silicone outer shell meeting strict U.S. military transit drop-test standards. Operating over a SuperSpeed USB 3.0 interface, it provides fast file transfers alongside a hardware One-Touch Auto-Backup button for simple directory mirroring.', 'transcend-ts2tsjm100-storejet-100-portable-hard-drive-for-mac-2tb-1784462182', '<p>The Transcend StoreJet 100 2TB External HDD (TS2TSJM100) is a dedicated, ruggedized local storage solution designed to complement the aesthetics and workflows of Apple Mac users. Moving away from traditional generic desktop drives, the SJM100 comes pre-formatted in the HFS+ file structure out of the box. This eliminates the hassle of partitioning or configuring file configurations, granting Mac users immediate plug-and-play access while remaining fully compatible with native Apple Time Machine automated system recovery protocols.</p><p>Mechanical preservation is a key feature of the StoreJet 100. Engineered to pass rigorous U.S. Military MIL-STD-810G transit drop tests, the drive utilizes an intricate three-stage impact mitigation grid. The outermost boundary is composed of a light-colored, slip-resistant silicone rubber casing designed to match Apple hardware configurations while absorbing surface vibrations. Underneath this protective armor sits a structural, reinforced hard-plastic mid-frame container that houses an internal suspension damper mechanism. This suspension system actively isolates the delicate 2.5-inch SATA internal disk from sudden structural shocks, drops, and workplace accidents.</p><p>Data pipeline efficiency is managed by a high-efficiency SuperSpeed USB 3.0 bus protocol (fully backward compatible with older legacy USB 2.0 ports), unlocking real-world data speeds up to 120 MB/s to minimize file transit delays. A physical hardware quick-action button is integrated directly into the upper portion of the silicone casing. When configured alongside the downloadable Transcend Elite software package for Mac, this element acts as a physical trigger for instant, scheduled directory synchronization. The drive requires no external AC power brick—operating entirely on 5V DC bus power directly from the host machine’s interface—and features an eco-friendly 10-minute idle sleep mode to conserve laptop battery life. Covered by a 3-year limited brand warranty, the StoreJet 100 represents a reliable local vault for massive media libraries, raw photography portfolios, and active backup assets.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Storage Capacity</td><td>2 TB (2,000 GB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Storage Media Type</td><td>2.5-inch SATA Mechanical Hard Disk Drive (HDD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Internal Data Buffer</td><td>8 MB Hardware Cache Class</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Default File System</td><td>HFS+ (Mac Native Pre-formatted)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Connection Interface</td><td>USB 3.0 / USB 3.1 Gen 1 (Backward compatible with USB 2.0)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Interface Connector</td><td>Micro USB-B (Device Side) to USB Type-A (Host Side) Cable Included</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Interface Bus Bandwidth</td><td>Up to 5 Gbps (Maximum Bus Speed)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Real-World Throughput</td><td>Up to 120 MB/s Maximum Sequential Read / Write Rates</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Features</strong></td><td>Shock Protection Standard</td><td>U.S. Military MIL-STD-810G 516.6 Transit Drop-Test Compliant</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Features</strong></td><td>3-Stage Armor System</td><td>Outer Silicone Shield, Reinforced Hard Inner Casing, Suspension Damper</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Features</strong></td><td>Quick-Action Button</td><td>Hardware One-Touch Auto-Backup Trigger Button</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Features</strong></td><td>Status Indicator</td><td>LED Data Transit &amp; Power Activity Light Indicator</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Apple Integration</strong></td><td>Time Machine Support</td><td>Natively Supported (Instant Plug-and-Play Backup Compatibility)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Support</strong></td><td>Bundled Software Utilities</td><td>Transcend Elite (Data Management) &amp; RecoveRx (Data Recovery)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Apple macOS Ecosystem</td><td>Mac OS X 10.7 or later (Native HFS+ Plug-and-Play)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Microsoft Windows</td><td>Windows 7, 8, 10, 11 (Requires full drive reformatting to exFAT/NTFS)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Operating Voltage</td><td>USB DC 5V (Direct Bus Powered - No AC adapter needed)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Energy Management</td><td>Intelligent Power Saving Sleep Mode (Triggers after 10 mins of idle state)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>129.5 mm x 82.4 mm x 20.4 mm (5.10\" x 3.24\" x 0.80\")</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Net Device Weight</td><td>230 grams (8.11 oz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Enclosure Finish</td><td>Premium Light-Toned Silver-Grey/White Silicone Rubber Enclosure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Environmental</strong></td><td>Operating Temperature</td><td>5°C (41°F) to 55°C (131°F)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Certifications</strong></td><td>Regulatory Compliance</td><td>CE, FCC, BSMI</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Warranty</td><td>3 Years Limited Brand Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/wbHuzkAT6ROhMIqXdJZdM7lMbc6j02pCOkBJp6Ot.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-19 11:56:22', '2026-07-19 11:56:22', 'Meta Title: Transcend StoreJet 100 2TB Portable Hard Drive for Mac (TS2TSJM100)', 'Meta Description: Buy the Transcend StoreJet 100 2TB External HDD for Mac (TS2TSJM100). Pre-formatted HFS+, Apple Time Machine ready, featuring U.S. military-grade 3-stage shock protection.', 'Keywords: Transcend TS2TSJM100 price, StoreJet 100 2TB Mac specs, SJM100 2TB external hard drive, military grade Mac HDD, Apple Time Machine external storage', NULL, 147, NULL, NULL),
(1578, 'Transcend Thunderbolt TS2TSJM300 StoreJet 100 Portable Hard Drive For Mac 2TB', 'The Transcend StoreJet 300 (SJM300) 2TB Portable Hard Drive for Mac seamlessly unites elite high-speed connectivity with Apple-centric premium design. Wrapped in a sturdy, precision-crafted metallic shell that complements your MacBook or iMac aesthetics, this 2.5-inch portable drive features dual-interface engineering equipped with both lightning-fast 10 Gb/s Thunderbolt and SuperSpeed USB 3.0 ports. Natively pre-formatted in HFS+ for immediate plug-and-play operation on macOS, it offers total integration with Apple Time Machine and includes an internal suspension scheme for dynamic mechanical protection.', 'transcend-thunderbolt-ts2tsjm300-storejet-100-portable-hard-drive-for-mac-2tb-1784462229', '<p>The Transcend StoreJet 300 2TB External Desktop/Portable HDD (TS2TSJM300) represents a premium storage tier meticulously optimized for Apple power users, audio-visual editors, and creative directors. Departing from basic plastic external housings, the SJM300 is built within a high-grade, rigid aluminum enclosure featuring a sleek metallic finish that matches Apple\'s signature design language. Beyond its striking appearance, the structural core relies on an advanced internal drive suspension system that cushions the internal 2.5-inch platter from everyday workspace vibrations and minor transit impacts.</p><p>The main performance highlight of the StoreJet 300 is its versatile dual-port layout. By utilizing a dedicated 10 Gb/s Thunderbolt interface loop, the drive ensures responsive, unthrottled communication channels for data-intensive production environments. Alongside the Thunderbolt system, an auxiliary SuperSpeed USB 3.0 port (equipped with UASP support) provides standard cross-platform flexibility, yielding raw sequential read and write speeds up to 120 MB/s. Natively pre-formatted in HFS+, it works instantly with macOS right out of the box, integrating smoothly with automated Apple Time Machine schedules.</p><p>This fully bus-powered configuration extracts its operational current directly from the host system\'s data port—negating the need for a bulky AC wall adapter while you\'re working on the go. When paired with the free downloadable Transcend Elite data management application suite, the drive enables user-defined automated directory management and advanced data security options. Packaged with premium independent Thunderbolt and USB 3.0 cables, a soft protective travel pouch, and backed by a 3-year limited brand warranty, the SJM300 2TB provides a highly efficient and stylish local storage solution.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Storage Capacity</td><td>2 TB (2,000 GB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Storage Media Type</td><td>2.5-inch SATA Mechanical Hard Disk Drive (HDD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>File System Format</td><td>HFS+ (Mac Native Pre-formatted, reformat required for Win)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Protocols</strong></td><td>Dual Connection Ports</td><td>1 x Thunderbolt (10 Gb/s Port) &amp; 1 x Micro-USB 3.0 Type-B</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface Protocols</strong></td><td>Max Bandwidth Capability</td><td>Thunderbolt: Up to 10 Gb/s; USB 3.0: Up to 5 Gb/s</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Matrix</strong></td><td>Maximum Read Speed</td><td>Up to 120 MB/s (Sequential read cap)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance Matrix</strong></td><td>Maximum Write Speed</td><td>Up to 120 MB/s (Sequential write cap)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Protection</strong></td><td>Internal Anti-Shock Tech</td><td>Specialized internal drive suspension damper system</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Apple Integration</strong></td><td>Native Software Support</td><td>Apple Time Machine Automated System Backup ready</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Support</strong></td><td>Bundled Software Utilities</td><td>Transcend Elite (Data Management Suite) &amp; RecoveRx</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Apple macOS Platform</td><td>Mac OS X 10.7 or later (Native HFS+ Plug-and-Play)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Microsoft Windows</td><td>Windows 7, Windows 8, Windows 10, Windows 11 (Requires exFAT/NTFS format)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Power Source Mode</td><td>Direct Port Bus-Powered (Draws current from Thunderbolt or USB link)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Operating Voltage</td><td>5V DC via USB / 15V DC via Thunderbolt</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>125.9 mm x 78.2 mm x 17.2 mm (4.96\" x 3.08\" x 0.68\")</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Net Device Weight</td><td>240 grams (8.47 oz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Chassis Material</td><td>Premium Structural Aluminum Metal Shell Design</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Available Colorway</td><td>Metallic Silver / White</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Accessories Included</strong></td><td>Included Inbox Cables</td><td>1 x Thunderbolt Cable, 1 x USB 3.0 Type-A to Micro-B Cable</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Accessories Included</strong></td><td>Carrying Pouch</td><td>Soft Travel Protection Pouch Included</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Environmental</strong></td><td>Operating Temperature</td><td>5°C (41°F) to 55°C (131°F)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Certifications</strong></td><td>Regulatory Compliance</td><td>CE, FCC, BSMI, RCM, EAC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Warranty</td><td>3 Years Limited Brand Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/FROaCPMxWEqFE5Vjkm9owszzzAhJIwmmXF8V8uOp.png', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-19 11:57:09', '2026-07-19 11:57:09', 'Meta Title: Transcend StoreJet 300 2TB Thunderbolt Portable HDD for Mac', 'Meta Description: Shop the Transcend StoreJet 300 2TB External Hard Drive (TS2TSJM300). Premium aluminum design matching Mac, with dual 10Gbps Thunderbolt & SuperSpeed USB 3.0 ports.', 'Keywords: Transcend TS2TSJM300 price, StoreJet 300 2TB specs, SJM300 Thunderbolt drive, Mac external hard drive 2TB, premium metal external HDD BD', NULL, 147, NULL, NULL),
(1579, 'Transcend J25M3 1TB USB 3.1 Portable Hard Disk', 'The Transcend StoreJet 25M3 1TB USB 3.1 Portable External Hard Disk Drive combines supreme mechanical durability with high-speed data mobility. Engineered to survive demanding travel environments, this 2.5-inch portable drive features an advanced three-stage shock protection system that meets rigorous U.S. military transit drop-test standards. Operating over a SuperSpeed USB 3.1 Gen 1 interface running at up to 5Gbps, it delivers swift file transfers and includes a dedicated hardware One-Touch Auto-Backup button for immediate local directory replication when paired with the Transcend Elite software utility.', 'transcend-j25m3-1tb-usb-31-portable-hard-disk-1784462292', '<p>The Transcend StoreJet 25M3 1TB External Portable HDD (TS1TSJ25M3) is the ideal storage companion for students, mobile professionals, and field photographers who require reliable, high-capacity file security on the go. Unlike standard, fragile external hard drives that risk data loss from minor workplace accidents, the StoreJet 25M3 is built from the inside out for high endurance. It boasts full compliance with strict U.S. Military MIL-STD-810G transit drop-test frameworks, ensuring your critical data remains safe from accidental table drops, impacts, and daily vibrational wear.</p><p>This defense-grade structural integrity is achieved through a state-of-the-art three-stage shock protection system. The drive\'s internal 2.5-inch SATA platter is suspended within a custom shock-absorbing rubber damper. This internal engine is housed inside a reinforced, rigid hard-plastic frame, which is wrapped in a thick, slip-resistant exterior silicone rubber sleeve. This multi-layered design effectively dampens and distributes impact forces, minimizing mechanical stress on the internal components.</p><p>On the performance front, the StoreJet 25M3 leverages a SuperSpeed USB 3.1 Gen 1 bus interface (fully backward compatible with older legacy USB 2.0 architectures). This unlocked protocol supports data interface speeds up to 5Gbps, enabling real-world sequential read and write speeds up to 90-110 MB/s to drastically shorten your backup windows.</p><p>Convenience is reinforced by a front-facing hardware One-Touch Auto-Backup button. When paired with the free downloadable Transcend Elite data management application suite, this physical button lets you instantly mirror pre-designated source folders with a single press. The drive operates entirely on 5V DC USB bus power, completely eliminating the need for a bulky external AC power adapter. It also includes an intelligent 10-minute idle sleep mode to conserve connected laptop battery reserves. Backed by an industry-standard 3-year limited manufacturer warranty, the StoreJet 25M3 1TB offers a highly durable, high-speed vault for your essential digital life.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Storage Capacity</td><td>1 TB (1,000 GB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Storage Media Type</td><td>2.5-inch SATA Mechanical Hard Disk Drive (HDD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Internal Drive Speed</td><td>5400 RPM class</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Data Buffer / Cache</td><td>8 MB Hardware Cache Class</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Connection Interface</td><td>USB 3.1 Gen 1 / USB 3.2 Gen 1 (USB 5Gbps)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Interface Connector Type</td><td>Micro USB-B to USB Type-A Cable Included</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Max Interface Bandwidth</td><td>Up to 5 Gbps (Bus Transfer Speed)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Real-World Performance</td><td>Up to 90 MB/s - 110 MB/s typical sequential read/write rates</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Protection</strong></td><td>Shock Protection Standard</td><td>U.S. Military MIL-STD-810G 516.6 Transit Drop-Test Compliant</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Protection</strong></td><td>3-Stage Armor Infrastructure</td><td>Outer Silicone Case, Hard Mid-Frame, Internal Suspension Damper</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Features</strong></td><td>Quick-Action Button</td><td>Hardware One-Touch Auto-Backup &amp; Reconnect Button</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Features</strong></td><td>Status Indicator</td><td>LED Ring Power activity / Data transit light indicator</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Support</strong></td><td>Bundled Software Utilities</td><td>Transcend Elite (Data Management) &amp; RecoveRx (Data Recovery)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Support</strong></td><td>Security &amp; Tools</td><td>256-bit AES File &amp; Folder Encryption, Disk Locking Functionality</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Microsoft Windows</td><td>Windows 7, Windows 8, Windows 10, Windows 11 or later</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Apple macOS</td><td>macOS 10.10 or later</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Linux Platform</td><td>Linux Kernel 2.6.31 or later</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Power Source</td><td>USB DC 5V Bus Powered (No external AC power adapter required)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Specs</strong></td><td>Energy Management</td><td>Eco-Friendly Intelligent Power Saving Sleep Mode (10 mins idle)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>129.5 mm x 80.8 mm x 16.1 mm (5.10\" x 3.18\" x 0.63\")</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Net Device Weight</td><td>185 grams (6.53 oz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Enclosure Finish</td><td>Durable Matte Non-slip Anti-shock Rubber Casing</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Available Colorways</td><td>Iron Gray (TS1TSJ25M3S) / Military Green (TS1TSJ25M3G)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Environmental</strong></td><td>Operating Temperature</td><td>5°C (41°F) to 55°C (131°F)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Certifications</strong></td><td>Regulatory Compliance</td><td>CE, UKCA, FCC, BSMI, KC, EAC, RCM</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturer Warranty</td><td>3 Years Limited Brand Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 14000.00, 14000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/5TEKplAgAd4o7XZDysO84HuDCKa3WPhtCBhCQVbj.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-19 11:58:12', '2026-07-19 11:58:12', 'Meta Title: Transcend StoreJet 25M3 1TB USB 3.1 Rugged Portable External HDD', 'Meta Description: Buy the Transcend StoreJet 25M3 1TB Portable External HDD (TS1TSJ25M3). Features military-grade 3-stage shock protection, USB 3.1 Gen 1 speed, and One-Touch Auto-Backup.', 'Keywords: Transcend J25M3 1TB price, TS1TSJ25M3S specs, StoreJet 25M3 1TB external hard drive, rugged portable HDD 1TB, military grade external hard disk, Transcend 1TB shockproof drive', NULL, 147, NULL, NULL),
(1580, 'Transcend J25A3K 1TB USB 3.0 Black External HDD', 'The Transcend StoreJet 25A3 1TB Portable External Hard Disk (TS1TSJ25A3K) achieves the perfect balance between high-end aesthetic styling and structural component protection. Housed in a slim, elegant gloss-black enclosure, this 2.5-inch drive features an advanced internal shock-absorbing suspension system that cushions the internal storage media from minor drops and knocks. Running on a SuperSpeed USB 3.0 / USB 3.1 Gen 1 platform, it delivers data transfer speeds up to 5Gbps and includes a convenient hardware One-Touch Auto-Backup button for streamlined local directory synchronization.', 'transcend-j25a3k-1tb-usb-30-black-external-hdd-1784462376', '<p>The Transcend StoreJet 25A3 1TB External HDD (TS1TSJ25A3K) proves that you do not need to sacrifice style to gain dependable, travel-ready storage durability. While rugged external enclosures are traditionally bulky and rubberized, the StoreJet 25A3 features a sleek, classic black patterned finish that looks at home on any executive desk or workspace. Despite its thin 15mm profile, it hides highly resilient mechanical defenses beneath its shell. The core internal 2.5-inch hard drive is encased in a specialized rubber shock-absorbing suspension damper system that dampens impact forces from accidental slips or drops, protecting your digital assets from structural loss.</p><p>For performance, the device features a SuperSpeed USB 3.1 Gen 1 connection protocol (fully backward compatible with standard USB 2.0 legacy slots), supporting system bus transfer bounds up to 5Gbps. This pipeline translates to efficient, real-world drag-and-drop actions for vast media libraries, spreadsheets, and system files.</p><p>An integrated hardware button sits prominently on the drive\'s chassis, serving a dual purpose. When used with the downloadable Transcend Elite software package, this element functions as a physical One-Touch Auto-Backup trigger. When managing an unmounted drive, it acts as a quick re-connect button, letting you remount the storage array without manually unplugging and re-inserting the physical cable. Drawing its power directly from your computer’s USB port, the drive removes the need for bulky AC power bricks while reducing consumption via an energy-efficient idle sleep mode. Backed by a 3-year limited brand warranty, the J25A3K is a highly mobile, reliable vault for your digital life.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Total Storage Capacity</td><td>1 TB (1,000 GB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Hard Drive Class</td><td>2.5-inch SATA Hard Disk Drive (HDD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Internal Media Speed</td><td>5400 RPM</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Hardware Data Cache</td><td>8 MB Buffer Class</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Protocol</strong></td><td>Connection Interface</td><td>USB 3.1 Gen 1 / USB 3.0 (UASP Support built-in)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Protocol</strong></td><td>Bus Interface Speed</td><td>Up to 5 Gbps (Maximum Bus Speed capability)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Protocol</strong></td><td>Device Connection Port</td><td>Micro USB-B to USB Type-A Interface Cable</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Protection</strong></td><td>Shock Mitigation System</td><td>Protective Internal Rubber Shock Absorber Suspension</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Protection</strong></td><td>Hardware Buttons</td><td>One-Touch Auto-Backup &amp; Quick Reconnect Button</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Protection</strong></td><td>Diagnostics</td><td>Integrated Shock Sensor / Status Indicator LED</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Utilities</strong></td><td>Desktop Management Suite</td><td>Transcend Elite (Backup, Restore, 256-bit AES Encryption)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Utilities</strong></td><td>Data Recovery Engine</td><td>RecoveRx Data Recovery Utility Tool (Free Download)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Microsoft Ecosystem</td><td>Windows 7, Windows 8, Windows 10, Windows 11 or later</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Apple Ecosystem</td><td>macOS 10.10 or later (Plug-and-play ready)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Open-Source Systems</td><td>Linux Kernel 2.6.31 or later</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Dynamics</strong></td><td>Operating Voltage</td><td>USB DC 5V Bus-Powered (No external wall adapter required)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Dynamics</strong></td><td>Energy Management</td><td>Intelligent Power Saving Sleep Mode activation</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Attributes</strong></td><td>Physical Dimensions</td><td>130.6 mm x 80.1 mm x 15.0 mm (5.22\" x 3.20\" x 0.60\")</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Attributes</strong></td><td>Product Net Weight</td><td>182 grams (6.41 oz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Attributes</strong></td><td>Chassis Material &amp; Finish</td><td>Toughened Structural Plastic - High-Gloss Pattern Finish</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Attributes</strong></td><td>Standard Color Way</td><td>Classic Matte / Gloss Black (K Designation)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Environmental Parameters</strong></td><td>Operational Range</td><td>5°C (41°F) to 55°C (131°F)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Certifications</strong></td><td>Compliance Standards</td><td>CE, FCC, BSMI, KC, RCM, EAC, UKCA</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty System</strong></td><td>Factory Protection</td><td>3 Years Limited Manufacturer Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/ikB9SaEA8NtjhNovPiIOsL7Cju9hFxDdJCdnohQg.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-19 11:59:36', '2026-07-19 11:59:36', 'Meta Title: Transcend StoreJet 25A3 1TB Portable External HDD - Black', 'Meta Description: Buy the Transcend StoreJet 25A3 1TB External HDD (TS1TSJ25A3K). Featuring a sleek gloss black casing, internal rubber shock-absorbing suspension, and One-Touch auto-backup.', 'Keywords: Transcend J25A3K 1TB price, TS1TSJ25A3K specifications, StoreJet 25A3 1TB external hard drive, slim external HDD 1TB, Transcend black external disk', NULL, 147, NULL, NULL),
(1581, 'Transcend StoreJet 25C3S 1TB USB 3.1 Gen 1 Type-C Silver External HDD', 'The Transcend StoreJet 25C3S 1TB USB 3.1 Gen 1 Type-C Silver External Hard Disk Drive seamlessly blends structural sophistication with flexible data mobility. Housed in a premium, ultra-slim 9.95mm anodized aluminum chassis, this 2.5-inch portable drive delivers generous 1TB expansion space alongside a native high-speed USB Type-C interface supporting up to 5Gbps system bandwidth. Bundled with both USB-C to USB-C and USB-C to USB-A physical interconnect cables, it offers comprehensive plug-and-play adaptability across Windows PCs, MacBooks, tablets, and mobile hardware configurations.', 'transcend-storejet-25c3s-1tb-usb-31-gen-1-type-c-silver-external-hdd-1784462433', '<p>The Transcend StoreJet 25C3S 1TB External Portable HDD (TS1TSJ25C3S) addresses the needs of modern executives and style-conscious creative professionals who demand ultra-portable data archives without settling for thick plastic enclosures. Moving completely away from generic, bulky structural blocks, the StoreJet 25C3S measures just 9.95mm in thickness and weighs a mere 133 grams, making it highly pocketable for daily commutes. The premium silver metallic housing is precision-crafted from a specialized aluminum alloy that undergoes a precise polishing, sandblasting, and anodizing process. This structural approach yields a sleek, non-slip profile that perfectly complements high-end laptops, MacBooks, and mobile workstation architectures.</p><p>Beneath its elegant exterior, the StoreJet 25C3S provides impressive performance and cross-platform flexibility. The core architecture uses a high-efficiency USB 3.1 Gen 1 transmission pipeline (also classified as USB 3.2 Gen 1) featuring a native USB Type-C device port. Able to support total bus-level bandwidth thresholds up to 5Gbps, it ensures quick data synchronization for large documents, high-resolution photo portfolios, and media libraries. The interface has passed a rigorous 10,000-cycle port stress configuration test to guarantee long-term connection durability. To ensure complete out-of-the-box functionality, Transcend packages the drive with two distinct cables: a native USB Type-C to Type-C wire and a standard USB Type-C to Type-A legacy adapter cable.</p><p>Advanced software tools elevate the drive from a simple hard drive to an integrated security system. Compatible with the downloadable Transcend Elite data management framework, it unlocks comprehensive folder scheduling, automated cloud integration, and hardware-level 256-bit AES cryptographic encryption routines to protect sensitive internal assets. Additionally, users gain access to the RecoveRx raw file recovery tool for searching deep into storage partitions to salvage accidentally deleted files. The drive operates purely on 5V DC USB bus power and automatically triggers an eco-friendly sleep mode during prolonged idle periods to conserve host device battery resources. Backed by a dependable 3-year limited brand warranty, the J25C3S 1TB stands as a sleek, highly mobile storage solution.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Storage Capacity</td><td>1 TB (1,000 GB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Drive Form Factor</td><td>2.5-inch Form Factor Class</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Storage Media Type</td><td>Internal SATA Mechanical Hard Disk Drive (HDD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Drive Spindle Speed</td><td>5400 RPM</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Factory File System</td><td>NTFS Pre-formatted (Can be reformatted to HFS+ / exFAT)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Connection Interface</td><td>USB 3.1 Gen 1 / USB 3.2 Gen 1 (USB 5Gbps)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Interface Connector</td><td>Native USB Type-C Female Port (Device side)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Max Bus Interface Bandwidth</td><td>Up to 5 Gbps (System maximum rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Real-World Throughput</td><td>Up to 110 MB/s - 130 MB/s typical sequential read/write rates</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Durability Metric</td><td>Certified up to 10,000 interface plug/unplug cycles</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Chassis &amp; Build</strong></td><td>Enclosure Material</td><td>Premium Sandblasted, Polished, and Anodized Aluminum Alloy</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Chassis &amp; Build</strong></td><td>Device Profile</td><td>Ultra-slim metallic architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Chassis &amp; Build</strong></td><td>Structural Accents</td><td>Chamfered metallic edges, sandblast texture finish</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Support</strong></td><td>Desktop Management Suite</td><td>Transcend Elite (Backup, Restore, Cloud sync, Disk Lock)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Support</strong></td><td>Security Integration</td><td>Secure 256-bit AES File &amp; Folder level Encryption support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Support</strong></td><td>Data Recovery Utilities</td><td>RecoveRx Data Recovery Software (Free Official Download)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Microsoft Windows</td><td>Windows 7, Windows 8, Windows 10, Windows 11 or later</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Apple macOS</td><td>Mac OS X 10.7 or later (Plug-and-play after HFS+/exFAT format)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Alternative Ecosystems</td><td>Linux Kernel 2.6.31 or later, Android mobile platforms</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Dynamics</strong></td><td>Operating Voltage</td><td>DC 5V ± 10% standard USB bus power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Dynamics</strong></td><td>Connection Power Mode</td><td>Fully Bus-Powered (Does not require external AC adapters)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>114.5 mm x 78.5 mm x 9.95 mm (4.51\" x 3.09\" x 0.39\")</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Net Device Weight</td><td>133 grams (4.69 oz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Standard Color Way</td><td>Premium Metallic Silver</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Accessories Included</strong></td><td>Included Inbox Cables</td><td>1 x USB Type-C to USB Type-C, 1 x USB Type-C to USB Type-A</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Environmental Parameters</strong></td><td>Operational Range</td><td>5°C (41°F) to 55°C (131°F)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Certifications</strong></td><td>Regulatory Standards</td><td>CE, FCC, BSMI, KC, RCM, EAC, UKCA</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty System</strong></td><td>Factory Protection</td><td>3 Years Limited Manufacturer Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.01, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/dwPaqJOzfzcSnfHMlyT792hykGfOftCFpJen9GiZ.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-19 12:00:33', '2026-07-19 12:00:33', 'Meta Title: Transcend StoreJet 25C3S 1TB Type-C Slim External HDD - Silver', 'Meta Description: Buy the ultra-slim Transcend StoreJet 25C3S 1TB External HDD (TS1TSJ25C3S). Premium anodized aluminum casing, USB Type-C interface, up to 5Gbps transfer speeds.', 'Keywords: Transcend 25C3S 1TB price, TS1TSJ25C3S specs, StoreJet 25C3S 1TB silver, slim Type-C external hard drive, aluminum external HDD 1TB BD', NULL, 147, NULL, NULL);
