(1582, 'Transcend StoreJet 25C3S 2TB USB 3.1 Gen 1 Type-C Silver External HDD', 'The Transcend StoreJet 25C3S 2TB USB 3.1 Gen 1 Type-C Silver External Hard Disk Drive packs high-capacity data storage into a beautifully minimalist form factor. Enclosed in a premium, ultra-slim 9.95mm aluminum alloy case, this 2.5-inch portable drive delivers an expansive 2TB of storage space alongside a native Type-C port running at up to 5Gbps bandwidth. Supplied with both native USB-C and standard USB-A connection cables, it provides instant high-speed plug-and-play expansion for modern Windows systems, MacBooks, tablets, and gaming consoles.', 'transcend-storejet-25c3s-2tb-usb-31-gen-1-type-c-silver-external-hdd-1784462487', '<p>The Transcend StoreJet 25C3S 2TB External Portable HDD (TS2TSJ25C3S) is engineered for creators, corporate executives, and digital professionals who demand massive data capacity without tolerating heavy, plastic-clad enclosures. Breaking away from traditional, bulky exterior configurations, this drive achieves an incredible 9.95mm thickness profile and weighs only 133 grams—making it one of the slimmest 2TB external drives available. The premium silver chassis is constructed entirely from a specialized aluminum alloy that undergoes a precise polishing, sandblasting, and anodizing process. Finished with precise CNC chamfered edges and an embossed insignia, the drive serves as a stylish extension to modern metallic laptops and ultra-portable workspaces.</p><p>Beneath its sophisticated exterior, the StoreJet 25C3S utilizes a high-efficiency USB 3.1 Gen 1 data transfer interface supporting UASP (USB Attached SCSI Protocol). Capable of delivering interface bandwidth speeds up to 5Gbps, it offers steady sequential read and write speeds up to 120-130 MB/s, vastly accelerating backups for massive 4K footage libraries, complex architectural projects, and personal data backups. To shield the drive against connection fatigue, the Type-C port has been rigorously tested to survive over 10,000 insertion cycles. Out-of-the-box system flexibility is guaranteed, as the package includes both a native USB Type-C to Type-C cable and a legacy USB Type-C to Type-A cable.</p><p>Data management is driven by Transcend\'s professional desktop software utilities. Fully compatible with the downloadable Transcend Elite software ecosystem, users can activate scheduled backups, cloud-drive synchronizations, and hardware-grade 256-bit AES folder encryption to secure highly classified documents. Additionally, the RecoveRx raw file recovery tool helps users effortlessly rescue accidentally deleted digital assets from lost sectors. Operating completely via 5V DC bus power directly from the device connection, it scales down energy draw via an integrated automatic sleep mode. Backed by an industry-leading 3-year</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Storage Capacity</td><td>2 TB (2,000 GB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Drive Form Factor</td><td>2.5-inch Standard Form Factor</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Internal Media Type</td><td>SATA Mechanical Hard Disk Drive (HDD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Spindle Speed</td><td>5400 RPM Class</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Factory File System</td><td>NTFS Pre-formatted (Can be reformatted to exFAT / HFS+)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Connection Interface</td><td>USB 3.1 Gen 1 / USB 3.2 Gen 1 (USB 5Gbps)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Interface Connector</td><td>Native USB Type-C Female Port (Device side)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>UASP Protocol Support</td><td>Fully Supported (USB Attached SCSI Protocol optimization)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Max Bus Interface Bandwidth</td><td>Up to 5 Gbps (System maximum rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Real-World Throughput</td><td>Up to 110 MB/s - 130 MB/s typical sequential read/write rates</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Port Rigidity Metric</td><td>Certified up to 10,000 interface plug/unplug cycles</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Chassis &amp; Build</strong></td><td>Enclosure Material</td><td>Premium Sandblasted, Polished, and Anodized Aluminum Alloy</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Chassis &amp; Build</strong></td><td>Device Profile</td><td>Ultra-slim metallic architecture (9.95mm thick)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Chassis &amp; Build</strong></td><td>Architectural Accents</td><td>CNC-finished chamfered edges, embossed front-face branding</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Support</strong></td><td>Desktop Management Suite</td><td>Transcend Elite (Backup, Restore, Cloud sync, Disk Lock)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Support</strong></td><td>Security Integration</td><td>Secure 256-bit AES File &amp; Folder level Encryption support</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Support</strong></td><td>Data Recovery Utilities</td><td>RecoveRx Data Recovery Software (Free Official Download)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Microsoft Windows</td><td>Windows 7, Windows 8, Windows 10, Windows 11 or later</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Apple macOS</td><td>Mac OS X 10.7 or later (Plug-and-play ready after reformat)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Mobile &amp; Open-Source</td><td>Linux Kernel 2.6.31 or later, Android mobile OS, iOS/iPadOS</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Dynamics</strong></td><td>Operating Voltage</td><td>DC 5V standard USB bus power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Dynamics</strong></td><td>Connection Power Mode</td><td>Fully Bus-Powered (Does not require external AC adapters)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Dynamics</strong></td><td>Energy Management</td><td>Eco-Friendly Power Saving Idle Sleep Mode activation</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>114.5 mm x 78.5 mm x 9.95 mm (4.51\" x 3.09\" x 0.39\")</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Net Device Weight</td><td>133 grams (4.69 oz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Standard Color Way</td><td>Premium Metallic Silver</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Accessories Included</strong></td><td>Included Inbox Cables</td><td>1 x USB Type-C to USB Type-C, 1 x USB Type-C to USB Type-A</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Environmental Parameters</strong></td><td>Operational Range</td><td>5°C (41°F) to 55°C (131°F)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Certifications</strong></td><td>Regulatory Standards</td><td>CE, UKCA, FCC, BSMI, KC, RCM, EAC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty System</strong></td><td>Factory Protection</td><td>3 Years Limited Manufacturer Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/kdLibd5I1SsqJS1FbgG14vRnQYC12nenLyKzKWYd.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-19 12:01:27', '2026-07-19 12:01:27', 'Meta Title: Transcend StoreJet 25C3S 2TB Type-C Slim External HDD - Silver', 'Meta Description: Shop the ultra-slim 2TB Transcend StoreJet 25C3S External HDD (TS2TSJ25C3S). Premium anodized aluminum shell, high-speed USB Type-C interface, up to 5Gbps transfer rates.', 'Keywords: Transcend 25C3S 2TB price, TS2TSJ25C3S specs, StoreJet 25C3S 2TB silver, ultra-slim 2TB external hard drive, Type-C external HDD 2TB BD', NULL, 147, NULL, NULL),
(1583, 'Transcend StoreJet 25M3C 2TB USB 3.1 Type-C Portable Hard Disk', 'The Transcend StoreJet 25M3C 2TB USB 3.1 Type-C Portable External Hard Disk Drive balances premium defense-grade protection with forward-facing modern connectivity. Built with a native, reversible USB Type-C interface supporting up to 5Gbps system speeds, this rugged 2.5-inch drive includes an advanced three-stage shock protection system that meets strict U.S. military transit drop-test guidelines. Supplied with both USB-C and USB-A data cables, it offers effortless, high-end plug-and-play capability across next-generation laptops, MacBooks, tablets, and mobile devices.', 'transcend-storejet-25m3c-2tb-usb-31-type-c-portable-hard-disk-1784462578', '<p>The Transcend StoreJet 25M3C 2TB External Portable HDD (TS2TSJ25M3C) is custom-designed for data-heavy users, field operatives, and creative media teams operating in harsh or unpredictable workplace environments. While traditional high-capacity portable drives run the risk of total data failure from simple daily bumps, the StoreJet 25M3C features a hardened exterior assembly. Fully certified to meet the rigorous U.S. Military MIL-STD-810G transit drop-test protocols, this device shields your operating assets from severe mechanical impact and drop fatigue.</p><p>This defense-ready chassis relies on a carefully planned 3-stage shock protection framework. At its core, the internal 2.5-inch drive platter sits suspended inside a vibration-dampening rubber suspension system. This layer is wrapped inside a structurally rigid hard-plastic containment shield, which is further reinforced by a thick, slip-resistant Iron Gray exterior silicone armor sleeve. This progressive mitigation stack distributes directional stress outward away from the mechanical drive, ensuring safe transport.</p><p>Setting the 25M3C apart from the rest of the 25M3 family is its native integration of a Type-C device connection port. Utilizing a high-efficiency USB 3.1 Gen 1 interface enhanced by UASP (USB Attached SCSI Protocol) acceleration, it manages bus transfer rates up to 5Gbps, sustaining everyday real-world file movement speeds up to 110-130 MB/s. To eliminate peripheral headaches, Transcend ships the drive with two separate factory interconnects: a native USB Type-C to Type-C cable and a standard USB Type-C to Type-A legacy cable.</p><p>Productivity is further streamlined by a quick-action hardware button centered on the top panel. Running alongside the official downloadable Transcend Elite desktop software package, this element functions as a physical One-Touch Auto-Backup trigger. When managing an idle unmounted partition, it acts as a smart quick-reconnect system—allowing you to remount the file table instantly without pulling out the physical interface line. Operating on 5V DC bus power with a 10-minute automated energy sleep timer, it includes a 3-year limited brand warranty.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Storage Capacity</td><td>2 TB (2,000 GB)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Drive Form Factor</td><td>2.5-inch Portable Hard Disk Drive (HDD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Hard Drive Class</td><td>5400 RPM Internals</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Internal Formatting</td><td>NTFS Pre-formatted (Fully reformat-capable for macOS)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Interface Connection</td><td>USB 3.1 Gen 1 / USB 3.2 Gen 1 (USB 5Gbps Architecture)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Physical Device Port</td><td>Native USB Type-C Reversible Female Port</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>UASP Acceleration</td><td>Fully Supported (USB Attached SCSI Protocol)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Real-World Throughput</td><td>Up to 110 MB/s - 130 MB/s typical sequential read/write rates</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Connection Durability</td><td>Rated up to 10,000 interface plug/unplug cycles</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Protection</strong></td><td>Rugged Standard</td><td>U.S. Military MIL-STD-810G 516.6 Transit Drop-Test Compliant</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Protection</strong></td><td>3-Stage Armor Setup</td><td>Slip-Resistant Silicone Shell, Rigid Mid-Frame, Internal Suspension Damper</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Features</strong></td><td>Front Panel Button</td><td>Dual-Function Hardware One-Touch Auto-Backup &amp; Quick-Reconnect</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Features</strong></td><td>Status Indicator</td><td>LED Ring Power Activity / Data Interconnect Light</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Support</strong></td><td>Desktop Management Suite</td><td>Transcend Elite Software (Backup, Restore, Encryption, Cloud Sync)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Support</strong></td><td>Security Protocols</td><td>Secure 256-bit AES File &amp; Folder Level Cryptographic Encryption</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Support</strong></td><td>Recovery Utilities</td><td>RecoveRx Emergency Raw Data Recovery Tool (Free Download)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Microsoft Windows</td><td>Windows 7, Windows 8, Windows 10, Windows 11 or later</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Apple macOS</td><td>macOS 10.10 or later (Instant Mac Compatibility out-of-the-box)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Mobile &amp; Open-Source</td><td>Linux Kernel 2.6.31 or later, Android Mobile, iOS/iPadOS</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Dynamics</strong></td><td>Operating Voltage</td><td>DC 5V ± 10% Standard USB Bus Power</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Dynamics</strong></td><td>Energy Management</td><td>Eco-Friendly Intelligent Power Saving Sleep Mode (10 mins idle)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>129.5 mm x 80.8 mm x 16.1 mm (5.10\" x 3.18\" x 0.63\")</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Net Device Weight</td><td>189 grams (6.67 oz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Color Palette</td><td>Premium Iron Gray (M3C standard)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Accessories Included</strong></td><td>Included Box Cables</td><td>1 x Native USB Type-C to Type-C, 1 x USB Type-C to Type-A</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Environmental Parameters</strong></td><td>Temperature Window</td><td>5°C (41°F) to 55°C (131°F)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Certifications</strong></td><td>Regulatory Standards</td><td>CE, UKCA, FCC, BSMI, KC, EAC, RCM</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty System</strong></td><td>Factory Protection</td><td>3 Years Limited Manufacturer Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/BKgInGl06OTlm8jHFx8uvd6Yp0AcC1bQF6rtsNLP.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-19 12:02:58', '2026-07-19 12:02:58', 'Meta Title: Transcend StoreJet 25M3C 2TB Type-C Rugged External HDD - Iron Gray', 'Meta Description: Buy the Transcend StoreJet 25M3C 2TB Portable External HDD (TS2TSJ25M3C). Features native USB Type-C port, military-grade 3-stage shock armor, and One-Touch backup.', 'Keywords: Transcend 25M3C 2TB price, TS2TSJ25M3C specifications, StoreJet 25M3C 2TB external hard drive, rugged Type-C external HDD 2TB, military grade Type-C disk', NULL, 147, NULL, NULL),
(1584, 'Transcend StoreJet 25M3C 4TB USB 3.1 Type-C Portable Hard Disk', 'The Transcend StoreJet 25M3C 4TB USB 3.1 Type-C Portable External Hard Disk Drive packs massive data archiving capacity into a battle-tested, ultra-rugged architecture. Outfitted with a high-speed reversible USB Type-C interface pushing up to 5Gbps system bandwidth, this 4TB drive utilizes an advanced three-stage shock protection system certified to U.S. military transit drop-test standards. Complete with both native USB-C and standard USB-A connection options, it provides secure, plug-and-play volume expansions for workstation backups, massive multimedia library deposits, and high-security field computing.', 'transcend-storejet-25m3c-4tb-usb-31-type-c-portable-hard-disk-1784462631', '<h3>Long Description</h3><p>The Transcend StoreJet 25M3C 4TB External Portable HDD (TS4TSJ25M3C) is a high-capacity, rugged storage vault tailored for enterprise-level data deployments, content creators, and technical engineers who require deep archive mobility under volatile environmental conditions. Where standard portable hard drives risk catastrophic mechanical damage and physical data loss from simple desk drops, the StoreJet 25M3C is heavily armored. Fully engineered and certified to survive the rigorous U.S. Military MIL-STD-810G transit drop-test metrics, this unit ensures your files survive high-impact force, vibration, and travel stress.</p><p>To safely hold the larger physical multi-platter configuration required for a true 4TB mechanical footprint, the shock armor is scaled to an expanded 24.1mm depth envelope. Protection is driven by a defensive 3-stage shock mitigation design. Inside, the 2.5-inch drive is suspended within a specialized rubber shock-absorbing damper. This frame is sealed in a reinforced rigid plastic enclosure, which is then wrapped in a heavy-duty, anti-slip silicone rubber outer skin finished in professional Iron Gray. This system effectively neutralizes multi-directional impacts.</p><p>Beyond its physical resilience, the 25M3C 4TB variant delivers extensive flexibility and modern interface deployment. The storage bank operates on a high-efficiency USB 3.1 Gen 1 framework featuring native UASP (USB Attached SCSI Protocol) acceleration, reaching total bus speeds up to 5Gbps. This ensures predictable daily sequential file transfer rates hovering around 110-130 MB/s for large 4K raw video projects or legacy machine backups. To simplify device matching across changing corporate setups, Transcend packs the unit with a native USB Type-C to Type-C wire and a USB Type-C to Type-A legacy adapter cable.</p><p>The drive also features a dual-function physical command button on the top face. Paired with the complimentary Transcend Elite data management ecosystem, a single press launches a pre-configured One-Touch Auto-Backup sync routine. If the drive has been safely unmounted via the OS, this button functions as a quick-reconnect command, saving you from physically unplugging and re-inserting the line. Operating purely via 5V DC USB bus power with integrated 256-bit AES cryptographic option scaling, the drive carries</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Storage Capacity</td><td>4 TB (4,000 GB gross capacity)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Drive Form Factor</td><td>2.5-inch High-Density Portable Form Factor</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Internal Hard Drive Class</td><td>5400 RPM Spindle Rotation</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Factory File System</td><td>NTFS Formatted (Can be easily reformatted to exFAT / HFS+)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Connection Interface</td><td>USB 3.1 Gen 1 / USB 3.2 Gen 1 (USB 5Gbps Standard)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Physical Device Port</td><td>Native USB Type-C Reversible Female Port</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Protocol Optimization</td><td>UASP (USB Attached SCSI Protocol) compatibility</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Real-World Performance</td><td>Up to 110 MB/s - 130 MB/s typical sequential read/write rates</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Port Insertion Lifecycle</td><td>Verified up to 10,000 structural plug/unplug cycles</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Protection</strong></td><td>Ruggedization Standard</td><td>Passed U.S. Military MIL-STD-810G 516.6 Transit Drop Tests</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Protection</strong></td><td>3-Stage Armor Assembly</td><td>Anti-Slip Silicone Sleeve, Reinforced Hard Core, Suspension Damper</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Features</strong></td><td>Multifunction Button</td><td>One-Touch Auto-Backup &amp; Immediate Hardware Quick-Reconnect</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hardware Features</strong></td><td>Visual Telemetry</td><td>Integrated LED Status Ring (Power state &amp; data transfer activity)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Support</strong></td><td>Desktop Management Suite</td><td>Transcend Elite Software (Backup, Restore, Folder Lock, Cloud Sync)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Support</strong></td><td>Security Customization</td><td>Optional 256-bit AES File &amp; Folder level Cryptographic Encryption</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Support</strong></td><td>Partition Recovery</td><td>RecoveRx Deep-Scan Raw File Recovery Software Tool (Free Download)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Microsoft Ecosystem</td><td>Windows 7, Windows 8, Windows 10, Windows 11 or later</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Apple Ecosystem</td><td>macOS 10.10 or later (Plug-and-play ready after matching format)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Alternative Kernels</td><td>Linux Kernel 2.6.31 or later, Android mobile platforms, iPadOS</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Dynamics</strong></td><td>Operating Voltage</td><td>DC 5V standard USB bus power injection</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Dynamics</strong></td><td>Connection Power Mode</td><td>Fully Bus-Powered (Does not require external wall power adapters)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Dynamics</strong></td><td>Power Conservation</td><td>Automatic Energy Saving Idle Sleep Mode active after 10 mins</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x H)</td><td>129.5 mm x 80.8 mm x 24.1 mm (5.10\" x 3.18\" x 0.95\")</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Net Device Weight</td><td>294 grams (10.37 oz)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Enclosure Color Way</td><td>Premium Industrial Iron Gray (M3C Standard Line)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Accessories Included</strong></td><td>Inbox Data Cables</td><td>1 x Native USB Type-C to Type-C, 1 x USB Type-C to Type-A</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Environmental Parameters</strong></td><td>Operational Temperature</td><td>5°C (41°F) to 55°C (131°F)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Certifications</strong></td><td>Regulatory Standards</td><td>CE, FCC, BSMI, KC, RCM, EAC, UKCA</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty System</strong></td><td>Factory Protection</td><td>3 Years Limited Manufacturer Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 'products/thumbnails/RIjynCObUgfpXqAwdb6uTtC7nmXMWZfz9kcWCOEw.jpg', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-19 12:03:51', '2026-07-19 12:03:51', 'Meta Title: Transcend StoreJet 25M3C 4TB Type-C Rugged External HDD - Iron Gray', 'Meta Description: Order the high-capacity Transcend StoreJet 25M3C 4TB External HDD (TS4TSJ25M3C). Built with U.S. military-grade 3-stage shock armor, native USB-C port, and One-Touch auto-backup.', 'Meta Title: Transcend StoreJet 25M3C 4TB Type-C Rugged External HDD - Iron Gray\r\n\r\nMeta Description: Order the high-capacity Transcend StoreJet 25M3C 4TB External HDD (TS4TSJ25M3C). Built with U.S. military-grade 3-stage shock armor, native USB-C port, and One-Touch auto-backup.', NULL, 147, NULL, NULL),
(1585, 'Seagate Expansion 8TB External HDD', 'The Seagate Expansion 8TB Desktop External Hard Disk Drive delivers high-capacity, dependable add-on storage for large data archives, creative media vaults, and multi-system backups. Built around a reliable 3.5-inch desktop hard drive and protected by a stylishly textured matte black enclosure, it utilizes a fast USB 3.0 interface to ensure smooth data transmission. Preformatted in exFAT for instant plug-and-play operation across Windows and Mac environments, this AC-powered desktop drive provides a simple, high-volume offline storage solution.', 'seagate-expansion-8tb-external-hdd-1784462720', '<p>The Seagate Expansion 8TB External Desktop HDD (STKP8000400) provides heavy-duty data storage for users facing overflowing computer storage, data managers, and creative professionals handling large media assets. Featuring a massive 8TB native capacity, this drive eliminates the need to delete files by providing enough space to store thousands of high-resolution photos, hours of 4K video, or comprehensive project archives. Housed in a compact, passively cooled black enclosure with a subtle textured stripe pattern, it fits neatly onto any modern workstation or office desk while operating quietly without a loud internal fan.</p><p>Designed for extreme ease of use, the Expansion Desktop drive skips complicated setup routines entirely. It arrives preformatted in the universal exFAT file system, ensuring seamless read and write functionality right out of the box with both Microsoft Windows and Apple macOS ecosystems. The hardware connects using a standard SuperSpeed USB 3.0 (USB 3.2 Gen 1) physical interface, operating smoothly with drag-and-drop file saving. To deliver stable performance across long backup sessions, the internal 3.5-inch drive architecture relies on a dedicated 18W external AC power adapter.</p><p>Beyond basic file storage, this 8TB unit offers valuable data safety features. It includes free access to Seagate Toolkit backup software, enabling customized, automated folder syncing and scheduled file protection protocols. For added security, the drive comes bundled with Seagate\'s official Rescue Data Recovery Services, offering professional recovery assistance in the event of unexpected drive damage or mechanical issues. Backed by a 3-year limited warranty, the Seagate Expansion 8TB is a practical, no-frills storage solution for keeping deep archives safe and accessible.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Storage Capacity</td><td>8 TB (8,000 GB gross capacity)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Drive Form Factor</td><td>3.5-inch Desktop Drive Form Factor</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Media Internals</td><td>Mechanical Hard Disk Drive (HDD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Factory File System</td><td>exFAT Pre-formatted (Universal Windows &amp; Mac support)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Host Interconnect</td><td>USB 3.0 / USB 3.2 Gen 1 (Backwards compatible with USB 2.0)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Physical Port (Device)</td><td>1 x Micro-USB 3.0 Type-B Female Connector</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Max Interface Bandwidth</td><td>Up to 5 Gbps (System maximum pipeline rate)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Real-World Throughput</td><td>Up to 170 MB/s - 180 MB/s typical sequential read/write rates</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Chassis &amp; Build</strong></td><td>Body Enclosure Material</td><td>Premium Toughened Structural Plastic</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Chassis &amp; Build</strong></td><td>Enclosure Design</td><td>Textured diamond/striped finish with hidden passive cooling vents</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Chassis &amp; Build</strong></td><td>Base Stabilization</td><td>Integrated non-slip silicone feet for vertical desk deployment</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software &amp; Security</strong></td><td>Management Tools</td><td>Seagate Toolkit Software Suite (Custom Sync &amp; Automation)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software &amp; Security</strong></td><td>Data Protection</td><td>Included Rescue Data Recovery Services plan</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Microsoft Ecosystem</td><td>Windows 10, Windows 11 or higher (Plug-and-play)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Apple Ecosystem</td><td>macOS 10.12 or higher (Time Machine requires simple reformat)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Dynamics</strong></td><td>Power Source Type</td><td>External AC Power Adapter required</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Dynamics</strong></td><td>Power Rating</td><td>18 Watt (12V / 1.5A) wall power injector</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Dynamics</strong></td><td>Energy Management</td><td>Automatic OS-linked idle spin-down power-saving mode</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (H x W x D)</td><td>178.75 mm x 41.90 mm x 125.0 mm (7.04\" x 1.65\" x 4.92\")</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Net Device Weight</td><td>1.176 kg (2.59 lbs)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Available Colorway</td><td>Matte Industrial Black</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Accessories Included</strong></td><td>Box Package Contents</td><td>1 x Seagate Expansion Drive, 1 x 18-inch USB 3.0 Cable, 1 x 18W AC Adapter, Quick Start Guide</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Certifications</strong></td><td>Regulatory Standards</td><td>CE, FCC, RCM, UKCA, EAC, BSMI, KC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty System</strong></td><td>Factory Protection</td><td>3 Years Limited Manufacturer Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 37000.00, 37000.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/yw1YQuJneW7Ba5v7vxhMldD54wlvuW7FM0eJyfwU.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-19 12:05:20', '2026-07-19 12:05:20', 'Meta Title: Seagate Expansion 8TB Desktop External Hard Drive - Black', 'Meta Description: Buy the Seagate Expansion 8TB Desktop External HDD (STKP8000400). Features massive high-speed USB 3.0 storage, simple drag-and-drop backup, exFAT compatibility, and Rescue Data Recovery Services.', 'Keywords: Seagate Expansion 8TB price, STKP8000400 specs, 8TB desktop external hard drive, Seagate 8TB AC powered HDD, external hard disk 8TB BD', NULL, 162, NULL, NULL),
(1586, 'Seagate One Touch Hub 12TB External Hard Disk Drive', 'The Seagate One Touch Hub 12TB Desktop External Hard Disk Drive is an all-in-one storage vault and charging station designed to clear clutter from your workspace. Housing a fast 7200 RPM class 3.5-inch hard drive, it offers an immense 12TB capacity alongside front-facing USB-C and USB 3.0 ports for seamless file transfers and device recharging. Outfitted with professional 256-bit AES hardware encryption, password protection, and automated backup software, it works right out of the box with both Windows and Mac systems.', 'seagate-one-touch-hub-12tb-external-hard-disk-drive-1784462806', '<p>data command center for creative professionals, data analysts, and home offices dealing with severe data storage limits. A massive 12TB capacity provides plenty of space to consolidate scattered media libraries, secure heavy 4K raw video projects, and store continuous automated system images. Housed in a polished matte black industrial casing, the unit functions as a stylish desktop companion that operates efficiently with passive top and bottom cooling vents.</p><p>What defines the One Touch Hub is its integrated front-facing connectivity panel. Featuring one USB Type-C port and one standard USB 3.0 Type-A port, the hub lets you instantly offload memory cards, plug in digital cameras, or link secondary external drives. These front ports deliver active power delivery, allowing you to charge smartphones, tablets, and wearable accessories even if your host computer is completely powered down. The internal hard drive features a 7200 RPM spindle speed running on a SuperSpeed USB 3.2 Gen 1 host interface, providing smooth transfer speeds up to 5Gbps for large files.</p><p>Security is deeply integrated into the hardware. It features built-in 256-bit AES hardware encryption coupled with password protection to shield private business documentation and sensitive personal files from unauthorized access. The drive comes preformatted in exFAT, enabling effortless, cross-platform performance between Microsoft Windows and Apple macOS setup options without requiring a reformat. Data defense is supported by downloadable Seagate Toolkit backup software for custom folder mirroring and scheduled syncing. Every drive includes Seagate\'s official Rescue Data Recovery Services to defend against unexpected drive errors, alongside a dependable 3-year manufacturer warranty.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Storage Capacity</td><td>12 TB (12,000 GB gross capacity)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Drive Form Factor</td><td>3.5-inch Desktop Form Factor</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Internal Spindle Speed</td><td>7200 RPM Class</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Factory Formatting</td><td>exFAT Pre-formatted (Universal Windows &amp; Mac support)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Host Connectivity</strong></td><td>System Interface</td><td>USB 3.0 / USB 3.2 Gen 1 (Backwards compatible with USB 2.0)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Host Connectivity</strong></td><td>Device Host Port</td><td>1 x Micro-USB 3.0 Type-B Female Connector</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Host Connectivity</strong></td><td>Interface Bandwidth</td><td>Up to 5 Gbps max theoretical pipeline</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Front USB Hub</strong></td><td>USB Type-C Ports</td><td>1 x Front-facing USB-C Charging &amp; Data Passthrough Port</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Front USB Hub</strong></td><td>USB Type-A Ports</td><td>1 x Front-facing USB 3.0 Type-A Charging &amp; Data Port</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Front USB Hub</strong></td><td>Charging Capability</td><td>Active device charging supported while host PC is powered off</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Security &amp; Safety</strong></td><td>Security Integration</td><td>Hardware-based 256-bit AES Cryptographic Encryption</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Security &amp; Safety</strong></td><td>Access Protection</td><td>Password Protection access lock via Seagate Toolkit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Support</strong></td><td>Backup Suite</td><td>Seagate Toolkit Desktop Software (One-click, Schedule, Mirror)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software Support</strong></td><td>Data Recovery Plan</td><td>Included Rescue Data Recovery Services (Official Seagate Plan)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Windows Ecosystem</td><td>Windows 10, Windows 11 or higher (Plug-and-play)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Apple Ecosystem</td><td>macOS 10.12 or higher (Instant cross-platform reading/writing)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Dynamics</strong></td><td>Power Source Type</td><td>External AC Power Adapter required</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Dynamics</strong></td><td>Power Rating</td><td>18 Watt (12V / 1.5A) Wall Power Adapter</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (L x W x D)</td><td>198.5 mm x 129.9 mm x 45.3 mm (7.81\" x 5.11\" x 1.78\")</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Net Device Weight</td><td>1.24 kg (2.73 lbs)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Case Colorway</td><td>Solid Matte Industrial Black</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Accessories Included</strong></td><td>Package Contents</td><td>1 x One Touch Hub Drive, 1 x 18-inch USB 3.0 Cable, 1 x 18W AC Power Adapter, Quick Start Guide</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Certifications</strong></td><td>Regulatory Standards</td><td>CE, FCC, UKCA, RCM, EAC, KC, BSMI</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty System</strong></td><td>Factory Protection</td><td>3 Years Limited Manufacturer Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 51500.00, 51500.00, NULL, 4, 'products/thumbnails/fh1wsvQtMeqAzU9L9ZqM7gkcI9Ea22fLhEVgQuFZ.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-19 12:06:46', '2026-07-19 12:06:46', 'Meta Title: Seagate One Touch Hub 12TB Desktop External HDD - Black', 'Meta Description: Buy the Seagate One Touch Hub 12TB Desktop External HDD (STLC12000400). Features a built-in USB-C/USB 3.0 front hub, 256-bit AES hardware encryption, and Rescue Data Recovery Services.', NULL, NULL, 162, NULL, NULL),
(1587, 'Seagate Expansion 6TB External HDD', 'The Seagate Expansion 6TB Desktop External Hard Disk Drive offers a highly reliable and spacious add-on storage solution to instantly expand your digital library. Built around a high-capacity 3.5-inch internal mechanical drive and housed in a modern, matte black textured casing, it uses a SuperSpeed USB 3.0 interface to achieve efficient data transmission. Preformatted in exFAT for instant cross-platform functionality with both Windows and Mac operating systems out of the box, this AC-powered desktop unit provides simple, secure drag-and-drop storage for deep archiving.', 'seagate-expansion-6tb-external-hdd-1784462869', '<p>The Seagate Expansion 6TB External Desktop HDD (STKP6000400) provides heavy-duty data storage for individuals, home offices, and professionals dealing with severe local storage constraints. Boasting a robust 6TB capacity, it delivers a massive volume extension capable of consolidating expansive media libraries, backing up years of high-resolution photos, or protecting vital operating software system images. The drive features an elegantly understated, passively cooled desktop profile finished with a subtle textured geometric diamond pattern, allowing it to sit quietly and match the style of any modern workstation without drawing unnecessary attention.</p><p>Engineered for seamless user execution, the Expansion Desktop drive bypasses convoluted software installation or setup routines completely. Preformatted under the universal exFAT standard file system, it bridges the gap between ecosystems by enabling immediate read and write functionality across Windows and macOS architectures without requiring an upfront reformat. The drive hooks up to host devices via a standard SuperSpeed USB 3.0 (USB 3.2 Gen 1) interface, maintaining direct, drag-and-drop file configuration for rapid manual backups. To ensure steady drive rotation and high operational stability under heavy write tasks, the architecture runs on a dedicated 18W external AC power adapter.</p><p>Data protection goes far beyond basic mechanical storage blocks. This 6TB device grants access to the complimentary downloadable Seagate Toolkit software package, enabling scheduled automation, customized backups, and precise real-time folder syncing. Furthermore, it includes a safety net via integrated access to Seagate\'s official Rescue Data Recovery Services, ensuring a team of professional recovery experts stands by to protect you from unexpected physical, mechanical, or logical drive damage. Completed by a 3-year factory warranty plan, the Seagate Expansion 6TB drive offers solid, worry-free cold storage.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Storage Capacity</td><td>6 TB (6,000 GB gross capacity)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Drive Form Factor</td><td>3.5-inch Desktop Drive Architecture</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Internal Drive Media</td><td>Mechanical Hard Disk Drive (HDD)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Storage &amp; Media</strong></td><td>Factory Formatting</td><td>exFAT Pre-formatted (Universal Windows &amp; Mac support)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Host Connection Port</td><td>USB 3.0 / USB 3.2 Gen 1 (Fully backward compatible with USB 2.0)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Physical Device Connector</td><td>1 x Micro-USB 3.0 Type-B Female Port</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Data Pipeline Bandwidth</td><td>Up to 5 Gbps max burst system throughput</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interface &amp; Speed</strong></td><td>Real-World Throughput</td><td>Up to 120 MB/s - 140 MB/s typical sequential read/write rates</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Chassis &amp; Build</strong></td><td>Structural Housing</td><td>Premium Toughened Polycarbonate Enclosure</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Chassis &amp; Build</strong></td><td>Aesthetics &amp; Ventilation</td><td>Textured matte black diamond finish with hidden passive layout cooling</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Chassis &amp; Build</strong></td><td>Stabilization Mounting</td><td>Non-slip internal structural elements for steady horizontal desktop use</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software &amp; Services</strong></td><td>Backup Utility Apps</td><td>Seagate Toolkit Suite (Automated Backups, Scheduled Mirroring)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Software &amp; Services</strong></td><td>Critical Data Defense</td><td>Included Rescue Data Recovery Services coverage plan</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Microsoft Platforms</td><td>Windows 10, Windows 11 or newer (Instant plug-and-play)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OS Compatibility</strong></td><td>Apple Platforms</td><td>macOS 10.12 or newer (Universal read/write; reformat for Time Machine)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Dynamics</strong></td><td>Operational Power Source</td><td>External AC Power Adapter required</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Dynamics</strong></td><td>Power Adapter Rating</td><td>18 Watt (12V / 1.5A) Wall Outlet Power Injector</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Power Dynamics</strong></td><td>Efficiency Profile</td><td>Integrated automatic OS sleep/idle spin-down power save</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Dimensions (H x W x D)</td><td>178.75 mm x 41.90 mm x 125.0 mm (7.04\" x 1.65\" x 4.92\")</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Net Drive Weight</td><td>1.176 kg (2.59 lbs)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Specs</strong></td><td>Color Profile</td><td>Matte Industrial Black</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Accessories Included</strong></td><td>Box Contents</td><td>1 x Seagate Expansion Desktop HDD, 1 x 18-inch USB 3.0 Cable, 1 x 18W AC Power Adapter, Quick Start Guide</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Certifications</strong></td><td>Regulatory Framework</td><td>CE, FCC, UKCA, RCM, EAC, BSMI, KC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty System</strong></td><td>Factory Protection</td><td>3 Years Limited Manufacturer Warranty</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 26500.00, 26500.00, 0.00, 4, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-19 12:07:49', '2026-07-19 12:07:49', 'Meta Title: Seagate Expansion 6TB Desktop External Hard Drive - Black', 'Meta Description: Buy the Seagate Expansion 6TB Desktop External HDD (STKP6000400). Features high-speed USB 3.0 interface, seamless drag-and-drop file saving, exFAT compatibility, and Seagate Rescue Data Recovery Services.', 'Keywords: Seagate Expansion 6TB price, STKP6000400 specs, 6TB desktop external hard drive, Seagate 6TB AC powered HDD, external hard disk 6TB BD', NULL, 162, NULL, NULL),
(1588, 'SanDisk Ultra 32GB Class-10 100mbps Micro SDHC UHS-I Memory Card (SDSQUNR-032G-GN3MN)-IOSBD', 'The SanDisk Ultra 32GB Class 10 UHS-I microSDHC Memory Card is a reliable and high-speed storage solution for Android smartphones, tablets, cameras, and other compatible devices. With read speeds of up to 100MB/s, Class 10 UHS-I performance, and A1 app optimization, it delivers fast file transfers, smooth Full HD video recording, and responsive application performance. Buy the genuine SanDisk Ultra 32GB Memory Card from International Office Solution at the best price in Bangladesh.', 'sandisk-ultra-32gb-class-10-100mbps-micro-sdhc-uhs-i-memory-card-sdsqunr-032g-gn3mn-iosbd-1784466028', '<p>The SanDisk Ultra 32GB Class 10 UHS-I microSDHC Memory Card is designed to provide dependable storage, fast transfer speeds, and reliable performance for everyday digital devices. Whether you need additional storage for your Android smartphone, tablet, digital camera, action camera, or drone, this memory card offers the ideal balance of speed, durability, and value.</p><p>With a storage capacity of 32GB, the SanDisk Ultra microSDHC card gives you plenty of room to store thousands of photos, Full HD videos, music, mobile applications, documents, and other essential files. It is an excellent storage upgrade for Android smartphones, tablets, digital cameras, dash cameras, drones, and other compatible devices.</p><p>Powered by UHS-I technology and a Class 10 speed rating, this memory card delivers read speeds of up to 100MB/s, enabling quick file transfers and smooth playback of multimedia content. It can transfer up to 1,000 photos in approximately one minute when paired with a compatible high-speed card reader, helping you save valuable time. The A1 performance rating also allows applications to load faster and improves smartphone responsiveness, providing a better overall user experience.</p><p>The SanDisk Ultra 32GB Memory Card supports uninterrupted Full HD (1080p) video recording and high-quality photography, making it suitable for capturing life\'s important moments. It is engineered to withstand water, shock, X-rays, magnets, and temperature extremes, helping protect your valuable data wherever you go.</p><p>Compatible with Android smartphones, tablets, Windows laptops, Chromebooks, cameras, drones, and other devices supporting the microSDHC format, this card offers broad compatibility for work, entertainment, and content creation. Its reliable performance makes it an excellent choice for everyday storage expansion.</p><p>Purchase the genuine SanDisk Ultra 32GB Class 10 UHS-I microSDHC Memory Card from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> and enjoy authentic SanDisk products, competitive prices, professional customer service, and fast nationwide delivery throughout Bangladesh. The memory card is backed by a <strong>Lifetime Warranty (must be claimed with the original box and all accessories)</strong>, ensuring long-term confidence and peace of mind.</p>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Main Feature</strong></td><td>Product Type</td><td>microSDHC UHS-I Memory Card</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Brand</td><td>SanDisk</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Model</td><td>Ultra 32GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td>32GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Read Speed</td><td>Up to 100MB/s</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Speed Class</td><td>Class 10, UHS-I, U1</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Minimum Write Speed</td><td>10MB/s</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance</strong></td><td>Video Support</td><td>Full HD (1080p) Video Recording</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Information</strong></td><td>Dimensions</td><td>1.02 × 14.99 × 10.92 mm</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Weight</td><td>Approximately 0.26 g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Supported Devices</td><td>Android Smartphones, Tablets, Digital Cameras, Action Cameras, Dash Cameras, Drones, Windows Laptops, Chromebooks, Nintendo Switch, and Other microSDHC Compatible Devices</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Durability</strong></td><td>Protection</td><td>Water Resistant, Shock Resistant, Temperature Resistant, Magnet Resistant, X-Ray Resistant</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td>Manufacturing Warranty</td><td>Lifetime Warranty (Must Claim with Original Box &amp; All Accessories)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'MEMORY CARD', 1500.00, 1550.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/vYxH1Khbb6iIJAkNCNPLTV461ACHYYMXS1dL4Do7.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-19 13:00:28', '2026-07-19 13:00:28', 'SanDisk Ultra 32GB Class 10 UHS-I microSDHC Memory Card 100MB/s | International Office Solution', 'Buy the genuine SanDisk Ultra 32GB Class 10 UHS-I microSDHC Memory Card with up to 100MB/s read speed, A1 app performance, and Lifetime Warranty. Best price in Bangladesh from International Office Solution.', 'SanDisk Ultra 32GB memory card, SanDisk 32GB microSD, SanDisk Ultra microSDHC, 32GB memory card Bangladesh, SanDisk memory card price, Class 10 microSD card, UHS-I memory card, A1 memory card, mobile memory card, International Office Solution', NULL, 164, NULL, NULL);
