(1589, 'SanDisk Ultra 64GB Class-10 100mbps Micro SDXC UHS-I Memory Card (SDSQUNR-064G-GN3MN)-IOSBD', 'The SanDisk Ultra 64GB Class 10 UHS-I microSDXC Memory Card is built for Android smartphones, tablets, digital cameras, drones, and other compatible devices. With read speeds of up to 100MB/s, UHS-I, Class 10, U1, and A1 performance, it delivers fast file transfers, smooth Full HD video recording, and responsive app performance. Buy the original SanDisk Ultra 64GB Memory Card from International Office Solution at the best price in Bangladesh with a Lifetime Limited Warranty.', 'sandisk-ultra-64gb-class-10-100mbps-micro-sdxc-uhs-i-memory-card-sdsqunr-064g-gn3mn-iosbd-1784476630', '<p>The <strong>SanDisk Ultra 64GB Class 10 UHS-I microSDXC Memory Card</strong> is a dependable storage solution designed for users who need fast performance, reliable data protection, and extra storage capacity for their everyday devices. Whether you\'re using an Android smartphone, tablet, digital camera, drone, action camera, or laptop, this memory card delivers the speed and reliability needed for smooth performance.</p><p>With <strong>64GB of storage capacity</strong>, you can store thousands of photos, Full HD videos, music, mobile apps, documents, and other essential files without worrying about running out of space. It is an excellent choice for photographers, students, professionals, travelers, and content creators looking for affordable, high-performance storage.</p><p>Powered by the <strong>UHS-I interface</strong> and featuring <strong>Class 10, U1, and A1</strong> performance ratings, the SanDisk Ultra Memory Card offers <strong>read speeds of up to 100MB/s</strong> for fast file transfers and quick access to your media. The Class 10 speed rating ensures uninterrupted <strong>Full HD (1080p) video recording</strong>, while the A1 rating improves app loading speed and overall smartphone responsiveness.</p><p>Designed for durability, the SanDisk Ultra 64GB microSDXC Memory Card is tested to withstand harsh conditions. It is resistant to <strong>water, shock, X-rays, magnets, and temperature extremes</strong>, helping protect your valuable files wherever your work or travels take you.</p><p>The memory card is compatible with Android smartphones, tablets, digital cameras, action cameras, drones, Windows laptops, Chromebooks, gaming devices, and other products supporting the <strong>microSDXC</strong> standard. Users can also manage, organize, and back up files easily using the <strong>SanDisk Memory Zone</strong> application.</p><p>Purchase the <strong>original SanDisk Ultra 64GB Class 10 UHS-I microSDXC Memory Card</strong> from <strong>International Office Solution</strong> and enjoy genuine SanDisk products, competitive prices, professional customer service, and fast nationwide delivery throughout Bangladesh. This memory card is backed by a <strong>Lifetime Limited Warranty (Must Claim with Original Box &amp; All Accessories)</strong> for complete peace of mind.</p><h2>Key Features</h2><ul><li>Original SanDisk Ultra microSDXC Memory Card</li><li>64GB Storage Capacity</li><li>Up to 100MB/s Read Speed</li><li>UHS-I, Class 10, U1 &amp; A1 Performance</li><li>Smooth Full HD (1080p) Video Recording</li><li>Faster App Loading and Quick File Transfers</li><li>Water, Shock, X-Ray, Magnet &amp; Temperature Resistant</li><li>Compatible with Smartphones, Tablets, Cameras, Drones &amp; Laptops</li><li>Supports SanDisk Memory Zone App</li><li>Lifetime Limited Warranty</li></ul>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Main Feature</strong></td><td>Capacity</td><td>64GB</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Read Speed</td><td>Up to 100MB/s</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Speed Class</td><td>Class 10, UHS-I, U1, A1</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Attribute</strong></td><td>Dimension</td><td>1.02 × 14.99 × 10.92 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Compatibility</strong></td><td>Supported Devices</td><td>Android Smartphones, Tablets, DSLR Cameras, Action Cameras, Drones, Dash Cameras, Windows Laptops, Chromebooks, Nintendo Switch &amp; Other microSDXC Devices</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Durability</strong></td><td>Protection</td><td>Water, Shock, Temperature, Magnet &amp; X-Ray Resistant</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Manufacture Warranty</strong></td><td>Warranty</td><td>Lifetime Limited Warranty (Must Claim With Original Box &amp; All Accessories)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', 'SanDisk, SanDisk Ultra, 64GB Memory Card, 64GB microSD, microSDXC, Class 10 Memory Card, UHS-I Memory Card, 100MB/s Memory Card, Mobile Memory Card, Camera Memory Card, Android Memory Card, SD Card', 1200.00, 1250.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/t2qc8p3Ojvl7J2h5EuTpR5mr5SzgmWxaOumrFN5N.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-19 15:57:10', '2026-07-20 05:28:15', 'SanDisk Ultra 64GB Class 10 UHS-I microSDXC Memory Card 100MB/s Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the original SanDisk Ultra 64GB Class 10 UHS-I microSDXC Memory Card with up to 100MB/s read speed, A1 performance, and Lifetime Limited Warranty at the best price in Bangladesh from International Office Solution.', 'SanDisk Ultra 64GB memory card, SanDisk 64GB microSD card, SanDisk Ultra microSDXC, 64GB memory card price in Bangladesh, SanDisk Class 10 card, UHS-I memory card, mobile memory card, camera memory card, SanDisk Bangladesh, International Office Solution', NULL, 164, NULL, NULL),
(1590, 'SanDisk Ultra 256GB Class-10 100mbps Micro SDXC UHS-I Memory Card (SDSQUNR-256G-GN3MN)-IOSBD', 'The SanDisk Ultra 64GB microSDXC UHS-I U1 A1 Memory Card is a reliable and high-speed storage solution designed for Android smartphones, tablets, action cameras, drones, DSLR cameras, Nintendo Switch, and other compatible devices. Featuring up to 100MB/s read speed, Class 10, UHS-I U1, and A1 performance, it delivers smooth Full HD video recording, faster app loading, and dependable everyday storage. It is backed by a Lifetime Limited Warranty.', 'sandisk-ultra-256gb-class-10-100mbps-micro-sdxc-uhs-i-memory-card-sdsqunr-256g-gn3mn-iosbd-1784526994', '<p>The <strong>SanDisk Ultra 64GB microSDXC UHS-I U1 A1 Memory Card</strong> is a reliable and high-speed storage solution designed for Android smartphones, tablets, action cameras, drones, DSLR cameras, Nintendo Switch, and other compatible devices. Featuring <strong>up to 100MB/s read speed</strong>, <strong>Class 10</strong>, <strong>UHS-I U1</strong>, and <strong>A1</strong> performance, it delivers smooth Full HD video recording, faster app loading, and dependable everyday storage. It is backed by a <strong>Lifetime Limited Warranty</strong>.</p><h2><strong>Full Description</strong></h2><p>The <strong>SanDisk Ultra 64GB microSDXC UHS-I U1 A1 Memory Card</strong> is designed to provide fast, dependable, and expandable storage for your digital devices. Whether you\'re capturing memorable photos, recording Full HD videos, installing mobile applications, or storing important documents, this memory card offers the performance and reliability needed for everyday use.</p><p>With a <strong>64GB storage capacity</strong>, you can store thousands of photos, hours of Full HD videos, music collections, applications, games, and essential files without worrying about running out of space. It is an excellent upgrade for Android smartphones, tablets, digital cameras, action cameras, drones, dash cams, Nintendo Switch, Windows laptops, Chromebooks, and other microSDXC-compatible devices.</p><p>Delivering <strong>read speeds of up to 100MB/s</strong>, the SanDisk Ultra memory card allows you to transfer photos, videos, and large files quickly and efficiently. The <strong>Class 10</strong> and <strong>UHS-I U1</strong> speed ratings ensure smooth Full HD (1080p) video recording and reliable performance for everyday photography and multimedia storage.</p><p>The integrated <strong>A1 Application Performance Class</strong> provides faster application loading and improved mobile performance. This makes the memory card an excellent choice for Android smartphones and tablets where running apps directly from the memory card improves the overall user experience.</p><p>Built for durability, the <strong>SanDisk Ultra 64GB microSDXC Memory Card</strong> is designed to protect your valuable data in challenging environments. It is <strong>water-resistant, shock-resistant, temperature-resistant, magnet-proof, and X-ray-proof</strong>, ensuring reliable performance whether you\'re traveling, working outdoors, or using your device every day.</p><p>Measuring just <strong>1.02 × 14.99 × 10.92 mm</strong>, the card fits easily into compatible devices while delivering dependable storage performance. Whether you\'re a student, traveler, photographer, gamer, or professional user, the <strong>SanDisk Ultra 64GB microSDXC UHS-I U1 A1 Memory Card</strong> offers an ideal combination of speed, reliability, and value.</p><h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3><ul><li>64GB storage capacity</li><li>Read speeds of <strong>up to 100MB/s</strong></li><li>Class 10, <strong>UHS-I U1</strong>, and <strong>A1</strong> performance</li><li>Smooth Full HD (1080p) video recording</li><li>Faster application loading on Android devices</li><li>Compatible with smartphones, tablets, DSLR cameras, action cameras, drones, dash cams, Windows laptops, Chromebooks, Nintendo Switch, and other microSDXC devices</li><li>Water-resistant, shock-resistant, temperature-resistant, magnet-proof, and X-ray-proof</li><li>Compact dimensions: <strong>1.02 × 14.99 × 10.92 mm</strong></li><li>Reliable everyday storage and fast file transfers</li><li>Backed by a <strong>Lifetime Limited Warranty</strong></li></ul>', '<figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Category</strong></th><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th><strong>Specification</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Main Feature</strong></td><td>Brand</td><td>Adata</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Model</td><td>Adata 64GB microSDXC UHS-I U1 A1 Memory Card</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Capacity</td><td><strong>64GB</strong></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Read Speed</td><td><strong>Up to 100 MB/s</strong></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Speed Class</td><td><strong>Class 10, UHS-I, U1, A1</strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Physical Attributes</strong></td><td>Dimensions</td><td><strong>1.02 × 14.99 × 10.92 mm</strong></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Compatibility</td><td><strong>Android Smartphones, Tablets, DSLR Cameras, Action Cameras, Drones, Dash Cameras, Windows Laptops, Chromebooks, Nintendo Switch, and other microSDXC-compatible devices</strong></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Durability</td><td><strong>Water-resistant, Shock-resistant, Temperature-resistant, Magnet-resistant, and X-ray-resistant</strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Warranty</strong></td><td><p>Manufacturing&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Warranty</p></td><td><p><strong>Lifetime Limited Warranty&nbsp;</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>(Warranty claim&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>requires the original box and all accessories)</strong></p></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>', NULL, 3000.00, 3100.00, NULL, 5, 'products/thumbnails/KeMwNXGXwM56AmmQ1qGnB77OzoKIsUrU0jDoN9LV.webp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-07-20 05:56:34', '2026-07-20 05:56:34', 'SanDisk Ultra 64GB microSDXC UHS-I U1 A1 Memory Card Price in Bangladesh | International Office Solution', 'Buy the SanDisk Ultra 64GB microSDXC UHS-I U1 A1 Memory Card from International Office Solution in Bangladesh. Enjoy up to 100MB/s read speed, Class 10 performance, A1 app support, and a Lifetime Limited Warranty.', 'SanDisk Ultra 64GB memory card, SanDisk 64GB microSD card, SanDisk Ultra microSDXC Bangladesh, 64GB memory card price, Class 10 memory card, UHS-I U1 A1 memory card, mobile memory card, camera memory card, International Office Solution', NULL, 164, NULL, NULL);
